"Inspector dock ຈະໃຊ້ຊື່ layer ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ [member ProjectSettings.layer_names/"
"2d_navigation/layer_1].\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [constant PROPERTY_HINT_LAYERS_2D_NAVIGATION].\n"
