msgid ""
"The color's alpha component, typically on the range of 0 to 1. A value of 0 "
"means that the color is fully transparent. A value of 1 means that the color "
"is fully opaque.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The alpha channel is always stored with linear encoding, "
"regardless of the encoding of the other color channels. The [method "
"linear_to_srgb] and [method srgb_to_linear] methods do not affect the alpha "
"channel."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນປະກອບອັນຟາ (ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ) ຂອງສີ, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ 0 ຫາ 1. ຄ່າ 0 "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າສີໂປ່ງໃສທັງໝົດ. ຄ່າ 1 ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າສີທຶບແສງທັງໝົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊ່ອງອັນຟາຈະຖືກຈັດເກັບດ້ວຍການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ linear ສະເໝີ, "
"ບໍ່ວ່າສີອື່ນໆຈະຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບໃດກໍຕາມ. ວິທີ [method linear_to_srgb] ແລະ [method "
"srgb_to_linear] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຊ່ອງອັນຟາ."

msgid "Wrapper for [member a] that uses the range 0 to 255, instead of 0 to 1."
