"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີ [Theme] ທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ທີ່ມີລາຍການຟອນທີ່ມີ [param name] "
"ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a local override for a theme [Font] "
"with the specified [param name] in this [Control] node.\n"
"See [method add_theme_font_override]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີການຂຽນທັບ (override) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບ [Font] ຂອງທີມດ້ວຍ "
"[param name] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໂນດ [Control] ນີ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method add_theme_font_override]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a matching [Theme] in the tree that has "
"a font size item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີ [Theme] ທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ທີ່ມີລາຍການຂະໜາດຟອນທີ່ມີ [param "
"name] ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a local override for a theme font size "
"with the specified [param name] in this [Control] node.\n"
"See [method add_theme_font_size_override]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີການຂຽນທັບ (override) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບຂະໜາດຟອນຂອງທີມດ້ວຍ "
"[param name] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໂນດ [Control] ນີ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method add_theme_font_size_override]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a matching [Theme] in the tree that has "
"an icon item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີ [Theme] ທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ທີ່ມີລາຍການໄອຄອນທີ່ມີ [param name] "
"ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a local override for a theme icon with "
"the specified [param name] in this [Control] node.\n"
