msgid ""
"Adds a new item with text [param label] to the global menu with ID [param "
"menu_root].\n"
"Contrarily to normal binary items, multistate items can have more than two "
"states, as defined by [param max_states]. Each press or activate of the item "
"will increase the state by one. The default value is defined by [param "
"default_state].\n"
"Returns index of the inserted item, it's not guaranteed to be the same as "
"[param index] value.\n"
"An [param accelerator] can optionally be defined, which is a keyboard "
"shortcut that can be pressed to trigger the menu button even if it's not "
"currently open. The [param accelerator] is generally a combination of [enum "
"KeyModifierMask]s and [enum Key]s using bitwise OR such as "
"[code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default, there's no indication of the current item state, it "
"should be changed manually.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param callback] and [param key_callback] Callables need to "
"accept exactly one Variant parameter, the parameter passed to the Callables "
"will be the value passed to [param tag].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS.\n"
"[b]Supported system menu IDs:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"\"_main\" - Main menu (macOS).\n"
"\"_dock\" - Dock popup menu (macOS).\n"
"\"_apple\" - Apple menu (macOS, custom items added before \"Services\").\n"
"\"_window\" - Window menu (macOS, custom items added after \"Bring All to "
"Front\").\n"
"\"_help\" - Help menu (macOS).\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການໃໝ່ທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມ [param label] ເຂົ້າໃນເມນູສາກົນທີ່ມີ ID [param menu_root].\n"
"ກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບລາຍການແບບໄບນາຣີທົ່ວໄປ, ລາຍການແບບຫຼາຍສະຖານະ (multistate) "
"ສາມາດມີຫຼາຍກວ່າສອງສະຖານະ, ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param max_states]. ການກົດ ຫຼື "
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງຈະເພີ່ມສະຖານະຂຶ້ນເທື່ອລະໜຶ່ງ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນກຳນົດໂດຍ [param default_state].\n"
"ສົ່ງຄ່າອິນເດັກຂອງລາຍການທີ່ແຊກເຂົ້າໄປ, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະເປັນຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບ [param index].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param accelerator] ເປັນທາງເລືອກໄດ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນຄີລັດຄີບອດທີ່ສາມາດກົດເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ປຸ່ມເມນູໄດ້ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດຢູ່ກໍຕາມ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ "
"[param accelerator] ແມ່ນການປະສົມປະສານຂອງ [enum KeyModifierMask]s ແລະ [enum "
"Key]s ໂດຍໃຊ້ bitwise OR ເຊັ່ນ [code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/"
"kbd]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈະບໍ່ມີການບົ່ງບອກສະຖານະປະຈຸບັນຂອງລາຍການ, "
"ມັນຄວນຈະຖືກປ່ຽນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param callback] ແລະ [param key_callback] ທີ່ເປັນ Callable "
"ຕ້ອງຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີ Variant ພຽງອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ສົ່ງໃຫ້ Callable ຈະເປັນຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງໄປຫາ "
"[param tag].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ID ຂອງເມນູລະບົບທີ່ຮອງຮັບ:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"\"_main\" - ເມນູຫຼັກ (macOS).\n"
"\"_dock\" - ເມນູປັອບອັບ Dock (macOS).\n"
"\"_apple\" - ເມນູ Apple (macOS, ລາຍການກຳນົດເອງທີ່ເພີ່ມກ່ອນ \"Services\").\n"
"\"_window\" - ເມນູໜ້າຕ່າງ (macOS, ລາຍການກຳນົດເອງທີ່ເພີ່ມຫຼັງ \"Bring All to Front\").\n"
"\"_help\" - ເມນູຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (macOS).\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Adds a new radio-checkable item with text [param label] to the global menu "
"with ID [param menu_root].\n"
"Returns index of the inserted item, it's not guaranteed to be the same as "
"[param index] value.\n"
"An [param accelerator] can optionally be defined, which is a keyboard "
"shortcut that can be pressed to trigger the menu button even if it's not "
"currently open. The [param accelerator] is generally a combination of [enum "
"KeyModifierMask]s and [enum Key]s using bitwise OR such as "
"[code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Radio-checkable items just display a checkmark, but don't have "
"any built-in checking behavior and must be checked/unchecked manually. See "
"[method global_menu_set_item_checked] for more info on how to control it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param callback] and [param key_callback] Callables need to "
"accept exactly one Variant parameter, the parameter passed to the Callables "
"will be the value passed to [param tag].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS.\n"
"[b]Supported system menu IDs:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"\"_main\" - Main menu (macOS).\n"
"\"_dock\" - Dock popup menu (macOS).\n"
"\"_apple\" - Apple menu (macOS, custom items added before \"Services\").\n"
"\"_window\" - Window menu (macOS, custom items added after \"Bring All to "
"Front\").\n"
"\"_help\" - Help menu (macOS).\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການໃໝ່ແບບເລືອກໄດ້ອັນດຽວ (radio-checkable) ທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມ [param label] "
"ເຂົ້າໃນເມນູສາກົນທີ່ມີ ID [param menu_root].\n"
"ສົ່ງຄ່າອິນດັກຂອງລາຍການທີ່ແຊກເຂົ້າໄປ, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະເປັນຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບ [param index].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param accelerator] ເປັນທາງເລືອກໄດ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນຄີລັດຄີບອດທີ່ສາມາດກົດເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ປຸ່ມເມນູໄດ້ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດຢູ່ກໍຕາມ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ "
"[param accelerator] ແມ່ນການປະສົມປະສານຂອງ [enum KeyModifierMask]s ແລະ [enum "
"Key]s ໂດຍໃຊ້ bitwise OR ເຊັ່ນ [code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/"
"kbd]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລາຍການແບບ radio-checkable ຈະສະແດງພຽງເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີພຶດຕິກຳການເລືອກໃນຕົວ ແລະ ຕ້ອງຕິກເລືອກ/ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"global_menu_set_item_checked] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຄວບຄຸມມັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param callback] ແລະ [param key_callback] ທີ່ເປັນ Callable "
"ຕ້ອງຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີ Variant ພຽງອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ສົ່ງໃຫ້ Callable ຈະເປັນຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງໄປຫາ "
"[param tag].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ID ຂອງເມນູລະບົບທີ່ຮອງຮັບ:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"\"_main\" - ເມນູຫຼັກ (macOS).\n"
"\"_dock\" - ເມນູປັອບອັບ Dock (macOS).\n"
"\"_apple\" - ເມນູ Apple (macOS, ລາຍການກຳນົດເອງທີ່ເພີ່ມກ່ອນ \"Services\").\n"
"\"_window\" - ເມນູໜ້າຕ່າງ (macOS, ລາຍການກຳນົດເອງທີ່ເພີ່ມຫຼັງ \"Bring All to Front\").\n"
"\"_help\" - ເມນູຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (macOS).\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Adds a separator between items to the global menu with ID [param menu_root]. "
"Separators also occupy an index.\n"
"Returns index of the inserted item, it's not guaranteed to be the same as "
"[param index] value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS.\n"
"[b]Supported system menu IDs:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"\"_main\" - Main menu (macOS).\n"
"\"_dock\" - Dock popup menu (macOS).\n"
"\"_apple\" - Apple menu (macOS, custom items added before \"Services\").\n"
"\"_window\" - Window menu (macOS, custom items added after \"Bring All to "
"Front\").\n"
"\"_help\" - Help menu (macOS).\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຕົວແຍກລະຫວ່າງລາຍການເຂົ້າໃນເມນູສາກົນທີ່ມີ ID [param menu_root]. ຕົວແຍກກໍໃຊ້ຄ່າອິນເດັກຄືກັນ.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄ່າອິນເດັກຂອງລາຍການທີ່ແຊກເຂົ້າໄປ, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະເປັນຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບ [param index].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ID ຂອງເມນູລະບົບທີ່ຮອງຮັບ:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"\"_main\" - ເມນູຫຼັກ (macOS).\n"
"\"_dock\" - ເມນູປັອບອັບ Dock (macOS).\n"
"\"_apple\" - ເມນູ Apple (macOS, ລາຍການກຳນົດເອງທີ່ເພີ່ມກ່ອນ \"Services\").\n"
"\"_window\" - ເມນູໜ້າຕ່າງ (macOS, ລາຍການກຳນົດເອງທີ່ເພີ່ມຫຼັງ \"Bring All to Front\").\n"
"\"_help\" - ເມນູຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (macOS).\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Adds an item that will act as a submenu of the global menu [param menu_root]. "
"The [param submenu] argument is the ID of the global menu root that will be "
"shown when the item is clicked.\n"
"Returns index of the inserted item, it's not guaranteed to be the same as "
"[param index] value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS.\n"
"[b]Supported system menu IDs:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"\"_main\" - Main menu (macOS).\n"
"\"_dock\" - Dock popup menu (macOS).\n"
"\"_apple\" - Apple menu (macOS, custom items added before \"Services\").\n"
"\"_window\" - Window menu (macOS, custom items added after \"Bring All to "
"Front\").\n"
"\"_help\" - Help menu (macOS).\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການທີ່ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນເມນູຍ່ອຍ (submenu) ຂອງເມນູສາກົນ [param menu_root]. ອາຣກິວເມນ "
"[param submenu] ແມ່ນ ID ຂອງຮາກເມນູສາກົນທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອລາຍການຖືກຄລິກ.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄ່າອິນເດັກຂອງລາຍການທີ່ແຊກເຂົ້າໄປ, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະເປັນຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບ [param index].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ID ຂອງເມນູລະບົບທີ່ຮອງຮັບ:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"\"_main\" - ເມນູຫຼັກ (macOS).\n"
"\"_dock\" - ເມນູປັອບອັບ Dock (macOS).\n"
"\"_apple\" - ເມນູ Apple (macOS, ລາຍການກຳນົດເອງທີ່ເພີ່ມກ່ອນ \"Services\").\n"
"\"_window\" - ເມນູໜ້າຕ່າງ (macOS, ລາຍການກຳນົດເອງທີ່ເພີ່ມຫຼັງ \"Bring All to Front\").\n"
"\"_help\" - ເມນູຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (macOS).\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Removes all items from the global menu with ID [param menu_root].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS.\n"
"[b]Supported system menu IDs:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"\"_main\" - Main menu (macOS).\n"
"\"_dock\" - Dock popup menu (macOS).\n"
"\"_apple\" - Apple menu (macOS, custom items added before \"Services\").\n"
"\"_window\" - Window menu (macOS, custom items added after \"Bring All to "
"Front\").\n"
"\"_help\" - Help menu (macOS).\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ລຶບລາຍການທັງໝົດອອກຈາກເມນູສາກົນທີ່ມີ ID [param menu_root].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ID ຂອງເມນູລະບົບທີ່ຮອງຮັບ:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"\"_main\" - ເມນູຫຼັກ (macOS).\n"
"\"_dock\" - ເມນູປັອບອັບ Dock (macOS).\n"
"\"_apple\" - ເມນູ Apple (macOS, ລາຍການກຳນົດເອງທີ່ເພີ່ມກ່ອນ \"Services\").\n"
"\"_window\" - ເມນູໜ້າຕ່າງ (macOS, ລາຍການກຳນົດເອງທີ່ເພີ່ມຫຼັງ \"Bring All to Front\").\n"
"\"_help\" - ເມນູຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (macOS).\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the accelerator of the item at index [param idx]. Accelerators are "
"special combinations of keys that activate the item, no matter which control "
"is focused.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຕົວເລັ່ງດ່ວນ (accelerator) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx]. "
"ຕົວເລັ່ງດ່ວນແມ່ນການປະສົມປະສານພິເສດຂອງຄີທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ລາຍການ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະໂຟກັດຢູ່ໃນຄອນໂທຣນໃດກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the callback of the item at index [param idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄໍແບັກ (callback) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns number of items in the global menu with ID [param menu_root].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນລາຍການໃນເມນູສາກົນທີ່ມີ ID [param menu_root].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the icon of the item at index [param idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າໄອຄອນຂອງລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the horizontal offset of the item at the given [param idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າໄລຍະຫ່າງລວງນອນ (horizontal offset) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the item with the specified [param tag]. Indices are "
"automatically assigned to each item by the engine, and cannot be set "
"manually.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າອິນເດັກຂອງລາຍການທີ່ມີ [param tag] ທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ຄ່າອິນເດັກຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະລາຍການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍເອນຈິນ, ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the item with the specified [param text]. Indices are "
"automatically assigned to each item by the engine, and cannot be set "
"manually.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າອິນເດັກຂອງລາຍການທີ່ມີ [param text] ທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ຄ່າອິນເດັກຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະລາຍການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍເອນຈິນ, ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the callback of the item accelerator at index [param idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄໍແບັກ (callback) ຂອງຕົວເລັ່ງດ່ວນຂອງລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns number of states of a multistate item. See [method "
"global_menu_add_multistate_item] for details.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນສະຖານະຂອງລາຍການແບບຫຼາຍສະຖານະ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"global_menu_add_multistate_item] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the state of a multistate item. See [method "
"global_menu_add_multistate_item] for details.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າສະຖານະຂອງລາຍການແບບຫຼາຍສະຖານະ. ເບິ່ງ [method global_menu_add_multistate_item] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the submenu ID of the item at index [param idx]. See [method "
"global_menu_add_submenu_item] for more info on how to add a submenu.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ ID ຂອງເມນູຍ່ອຍຂອງລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"global_menu_add_submenu_item] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີເພີ່ມເມນູຍ່ອຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the metadata of the specified item, which might be of any type. You "
"can set it with [method global_menu_set_item_tag], which provides a simple "
"way of assigning context data to items.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເມຕາດາຕາ (metadata) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ລະບຸ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເປັນປະເພດໃດກໍໄດ້. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າມັນດ້ວຍ [method global_menu_set_item_tag], "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນວິທີງ່າຍໆໃນການກຳນົດຂໍ້ມູນບໍລິບົດ (context data) ໃຫ້ກັບລາຍການ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the text of the item at index [param idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the tooltip associated with the specified index [param idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າທູນທິບ (tooltip) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບອິນເດັກ [param idx] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns Dictionary of supported system menu IDs and names.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ Dictionary ຂອງ ID ແລະ ຊື່ຂອງເມນູລະບົບທີ່ຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at index [param idx] is checkable in "
"some way, i.e. if it has a checkbox or radio button.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx] "
"ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນທາງໃດກໍຕາມ, ເຊັ່ນ: ຖ້າມັນມີ ກ່ອງໝາຍ (checkbox) ຫຼື ປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸ (radio "
"button).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at index [param idx] is checked.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx] ຖືກເລືອກຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at index [param idx] is disabled. When "
"it is disabled it can't be selected, or its action invoked.\n"
"See [method global_menu_set_item_disabled] for more info on how to disable an "
"item.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx] ຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ. "
"ເມື່ອມັນຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ ມັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກເລືອກໄດ້ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ການກະທຳຂອງມັນໄດ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method global_menu_set_item_disabled] "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີປິດການໃຊ້ງານລາຍການ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at index [param idx] is hidden.\n"
"See [method global_menu_set_item_hidden] for more info on how to hide an "
"item.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx] ຖືກຊ່ອນໄວ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method global_menu_set_item_hidden] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີຊ່ອນລາຍການ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at index [param idx] has radio button-"
"style checkability.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is purely cosmetic; you must add the logic for checking/"
"unchecking items in radio groups.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx] ມີຮູບແບບການເລືອກແບບປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸ "
"(radio button).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ການສະແດງຜົນເທົ່ານັ້ນ; ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມໂລຈິກສຳລັບການເລືອກ/"
"ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກລາຍການໃນກຸ່ມວິທະຍຸດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Removes the item at index [param idx] from the global menu [param "
"menu_root].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The indices of items after the removed item will be shifted by "
"one.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx] ອອກຈາກເມນູສາກົນ [param menu_root].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອິນເດັກຂອງລາຍການທີ່ຢູ່ຫຼັງລາຍການທີ່ຖືກລຶບຈະຖືກເລື່ອນຂຶ້ນມາໜຶ່ງຕຳແໜ່ງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the accelerator of the item at index [param idx]. [param keycode] can be "
"a single [enum Key], or a combination of [enum KeyModifierMask]s and [enum "
"Key]s using bitwise OR such as [code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl "
"+ A[/kbd]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລັ່ງດ່ວນ (accelerator) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx]. [param keycode] "
"ສາມາດເປັນ [enum Key] ດຽວ, ຫຼື ການປະສົມປະສານຂອງ [enum KeyModifierMask]s ແລະ [enum "
"Key]s ໂດຍໃຊ້ bitwise OR ເຊັ່ນ [code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/"
"kbd]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the callback of the item at index [param idx]. Callback is emitted when "
"an item is pressed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param callback] Callable needs to accept exactly one "
"Variant parameter, the parameter passed to the Callable will be the value "
"passed to the [code]tag[/code] parameter when the menu item was created.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄໍແບັກ (callback) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx]. "
"ຄໍແບັກຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອມີການກົດລາຍການ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param callback] ທີ່ເປັນ Callable ຕ້ອງຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີ Variant "
"ພຽງອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ສົ່ງໃຫ້ Callable ຈະເປັນຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງໃຫ້ພາຣາມິເຕີ [code]tag[/code] "
"ເມື່ອລາຍການເມນູຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets whether the item at index [param idx] has a checkbox. If [code]false[/"
"code], sets the type of the item to plain text.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx] ມີກ່ອງໝາຍ (checkbox) ຫຼື ບໍ່. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/"
"code], ຈະຕັ້ງປະເພດຂອງລາຍການເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the checkstate status of the item at index [param idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຖານະການເລືອກ (checkstate) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Enables/disables the item at index [param idx]. When it is disabled, it can't "
"be selected and its action can't be invoked.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ/ປິດ ການໃຊ້ງານລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx]. ເມື່ອມັນຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ, "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກເລືອກໄດ້ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ການກະທຳຂອງມັນໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Hides/shows the item at index [param idx]. When it is hidden, an item does "
"not appear in a menu and its action cannot be invoked.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອນ/ສະແດງ ລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx]. ເມື່ອມັນຖືກຊ່ອນ, ລາຍການຈະບໍ່ປະກົດຢູ່ໃນເມນູ ແລະ "
"ການກະທຳຂອງມັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the callback of the item at index [param idx]. The callback is emitted "
"when an item is hovered.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param callback] Callable needs to accept exactly one "
"Variant parameter, the parameter passed to the Callable will be the value "
"passed to the [code]tag[/code] parameter when the menu item was created.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄໍແບັກ (callback) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx]. "
"ຄໍແບັກຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອມີການວາງເມົ້າໄວ້ເໜືອ (hover) ລາຍການ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param callback] ທີ່ເປັນ Callable ຕ້ອງຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີ Variant "
"ພຽງອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ສົ່ງໃຫ້ Callable ຈະເປັນຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງໃຫ້ພາຣາມິເຕີ [code]tag[/code] "
"ເມື່ອລາຍການເມນູຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Replaces the [Texture2D] icon of the specified [param idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is not supported by macOS \"_dock\" menu items."
msgstr ""
"ແທນທີ່ໄອຄອນ [Texture2D] ຂອງອິນເດັກ [param idx] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໂດຍລາຍການເມນູ \"_dock\" ຂອງ macOS."

msgid ""
"Sets the horizontal offset of the item at the given [param idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະຫ່າງລວງນອນ (horizontal offset) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the callback of the item at index [param idx]. Callback is emitted when "
"its accelerator is activated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param key_callback] Callable needs to accept exactly one "
"Variant parameter, the parameter passed to the Callable will be the value "
"passed to the [code]tag[/code] parameter when the menu item was created.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄໍແບັກ (callback) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx]. "
"ຄໍແບັກຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອຕົວເລັ່ງດ່ວນຂອງມັນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param key_callback] ທີ່ເປັນ Callable ຕ້ອງຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີ Variant "
"ພຽງອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ສົ່ງໃຫ້ Callable ຈະເປັນຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງໃຫ້ພາຣາມິເຕີ [code]tag[/code] "
"ເມື່ອລາຍການເມນູຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets number of state of a multistate item. See [method "
"global_menu_add_multistate_item] for details.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນສະຖານະຂອງລາຍການແບບຫຼາຍສະຖານະ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"global_menu_add_multistate_item] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the type of the item at the specified index [param idx] to radio button. "
"If [code]false[/code], sets the type of the item to plain text.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is purely cosmetic; you must add the logic for checking/"
"unchecking items in radio groups.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າປະເພດຂອງລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx] ທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ເປັນປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸ (radio button). ຖ້າເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code], ຈະຕັ້ງປະເພດຂອງລາຍການເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ການສະແດງຜົນເທົ່ານັ້ນ; ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມໂລຈິກສຳລັບການເລືອກ/"
"ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກລາຍການໃນກຸ່ມວິທະຍຸດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the state of a multistate item. See [method "
"global_menu_add_multistate_item] for details.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຖານະຂອງລາຍການແບບຫຼາຍສະຖານະ. ເບິ່ງ [method global_menu_add_multistate_item] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the submenu of the item at index [param idx]. The submenu is the ID of a "
"global menu root that would be shown when the item is clicked.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເມນູຍ່ອຍ (submenu) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx]. ເມນູຍ່ອຍແມ່ນ ID "
"ຂອງຮາກເມນູສາກົນທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອລາຍການຖືກຄລິກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the metadata of an item, which may be of any type. You can later get it "
"with [method global_menu_get_item_tag], which provides a simple way of "
"assigning context data to items.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເມຕາດາຕາ (metadata) ຂອງລາຍການ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເປັນປະເພດໃດກໍໄດ້. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດເອົາມັນມາໃຊ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງດ້ວຍ [method global_menu_get_item_tag], "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນວິທີງ່າຍໆໃນການກຳນົດຂໍ້ມູນບໍລິບົດ (context data) ໃຫ້ກັບລາຍການ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the text of the item at index [param idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [String] tooltip of the item at the specified index [param idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [String] ທູນທິບ (tooltip) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param idx] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Registers callables to emit when the menu is respectively about to show or "
"closed. Callback methods should have zero arguments."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນ Callable ເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອເມນູກຳລັງຈະສະແດງ ຫຼື ຖືກປິດ. ວິທີການຄໍແບັກ (Callback) "
"ຄວນຈະບໍ່ມີອາຣກິວເມນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if any additional outputs have been registered via "
"[method register_additional_output]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີເອົາພຸດ (output) ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃດໆ ທີ່ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນຜ່ານ [method "
"register_additional_output]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified [param feature] is supported by "
"the current [DisplayServer], [code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຄຸນສົມບັດ [param feature] ທີ່ລະບຸໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍ "
"[DisplayServer] ປະຈຸບັນ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນແມ່ນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a hardware keyboard is connected.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android and iOS. On other "
"platforms, this method always returns [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຄີບອດຮາດແວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android ແລະ iOS. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[code]true[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Sets native help system search callbacks.\n"
"[param search_callback] has the following arguments: [code]String "
"search_string, int result_limit[/code] and return a [Dictionary] with \"key, "
"display name\" pairs for the search results. Called when the user enters "
"search terms in the [code]Help[/code] menu.\n"
"[param action_callback] has the following arguments: [code]String key[/code]. "
"Called when the user selects a search result in the [code]Help[/code] menu.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄໍແບັກ (callback) ການຄົ້ນຫາຂອງລະບົບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອແບບເນທີບ (native help system).\n"
"[param search_callback] ມີອາຣກິວເມນດັ່ງນີ້: [code]String search_string, int "
"result_limit[/code] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄ່າ [Dictionary] ທີ່ມີຄູ່ \"key, display name\" "
"ສຳລັບຜົນການຄົ້ນຫາ. ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ້ອນຄຳຄົ້ນຫາໃນເມນູ [code]Help[/code].\n"
"[param action_callback] ມີອາຣກິວເມນດັ່ງນີ້: [code]String key[/code]. "
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ເລືອກຜົນການຄົ້ນຫາໃນເມນູ [code]Help[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the text selection in the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Input_method]Input Method Editor[/url] composition string, with the "
"[Vector2i]'s [code]x[/code] component being the caret position and [code]y[/"
"code] being the length of the selection.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າການເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມປະກອບ (composition string) ຂອງ [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Input Method Editor[/url], ໂດຍທີ່ສ່ວນປະກອບ "
"[code]x[/code] ຂອງ [Vector2i] ແມ່ນຕຳແໜ່ງແຄເຣັດ (caret) ແລະ [code]y[/code] "
"ແມ່ນຄວາມຍາວຂອງການເລືອກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the composition string contained within the [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Input Method Editor[/url] window.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມປະກອບ (composition string) ທີ່ບັນຈຸຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Input Method Editor[/url].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if OS is using dark mode.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, macOS, Windows, and "
"Linux (X11/Wayland)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລະບົບປະຕິບັດການກຳລັງໃຊ້ໂໝດມືດ (dark mode).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android, iOS, macOS, Windows, ແລະ Linux (X11/"
"Wayland)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if OS supports dark mode.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, macOS, Windows, and "
"Linux (X11/Wayland)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຮອງຮັບໂໝດມືດ (dark mode).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android, iOS, macOS, Windows, ແລະ Linux (X11/"
"Wayland)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the application is in picture-in-picture mode.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຢູ່ໃນໂໝດພາບຊ້ອນພາບ (picture-in-picture).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if touch events are available (Android or iOS), the "
"capability is detected on the Web platform or if [member "
"ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/emulate_touch_from_mouse] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ງານເຫດການການສຳຜັດ (touch events) ໄດ້ (Android ຫຼື "
"iOS), ຖ້າກວດພົບຄວາມສາມາດໃນແພລັດຟອມ Web ຫຼື ຖ້າ [member "
"ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/emulate_touch_from_mouse] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the window background can be made transparent. "
"This method returns [code]false[/code] if [member ProjectSettings.display/"
"window/per_pixel_transparency/allowed] is set to [code]false[/code], or if "
"transparency is not supported by the renderer or OS compositor."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໂປ່ງໃສໄດ້. ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[code]false[/code] ຖ້າ [member ProjectSettings.display/window/"
"per_pixel_transparency/allowed] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຫຼື "
"ຖ້າຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍ renderer ຫຼື OS compositor."

msgid ""
"Returns active keyboard layout index.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, and "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າອິນເດັກຂອງຜັງຄີບອດ (keyboard layout) ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Returns the current state of mouse buttons (whether each button is pressed) "
"as a bitmask. If multiple mouse buttons are pressed at the same time, the "
"bits are added together. Equivalent to [method Input.get_mouse_button_mask]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າສະຖານະປະຈຸບັນຂອງປຸ່ມເມົ້າ (ວ່າແຕ່ລະປຸ່ມຖືກກົດຫຼືບໍ່) ເປັນບິດມາກ (bitmask). "
"ຖ້າປຸ່ມເມົ້າຫຼາຍປຸ່ມຖືກກົດພ້ອມກັນ, ບິດຈະຖືກບວກເຂົ້າກັນ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [method "
"Input.get_mouse_button_mask]."

msgid "Returns the current mouse mode. See also [method mouse_set_mode]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າໂໝດເມົ້າປະຈຸບັນ. ເບິ່ງ [method mouse_set_mode] ນຳ."

msgid "Returns the mouse cursor's current position in screen coordinates."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງປະຈຸບັນຂອງເຄີເຊີເມົ້າໃນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid "Sets the current mouse mode. See also [method mouse_get_mode]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດເມົ້າປະຈຸບັນ. ເບິ່ງ [method mouse_get_mode] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Enters picture-in-picture mode.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android."
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດພາບຊ້ອນພາບ (picture-in-picture).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android."

msgid ""
"Specifies the aspect ratio for picture-in-picture mode.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບ (aspect ratio) ສຳລັບໂໝດພາບຊ້ອນພາບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android."

msgid ""
"Specifies whether picture-in-picture mode should be entered automatically "
"when the application goes in the background.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸວ່າຄວນເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດພາບຊ້ອນພາບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼືບໍ່ ເມື່ອແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໄປຢູ່ພື້ນຫຼັງ (background).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android."

msgid ""
"Perform window manager processing, including input flushing. See also [method "
"force_process_and_drop_events], [method Input.flush_buffered_events] and "
"[member Input.use_accumulated_input]."
msgstr ""
"ປະມວນຜົນຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງ (window manager), ລວມທັງການລຶບລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນການປ້ອນເຂົ້າ (input "
"flushing). ເບິ່ງ [method force_process_and_drop_events], [method "
"Input.flush_buffered_events] ແລະ [member Input.use_accumulated_input] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Registers an [Object] which represents an additional output that will be "
"rendered too, beyond normal windows. The [Object] is only used as an "
"identifier, which can be later passed to [method "
"unregister_additional_output].\n"
"This can be used to prevent Godot from skipping rendering when no normal "
"windows are visible."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນ [Object] ເຊິ່ງເປັນຕົວແທນຂອງເອົາພຸດ (output) ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈະຖືກເຣນເດີ (render) ນຳ, "
"ນອກເໜືອຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງປົກກະຕິ. [Object] ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນພຽງຕົວລະບຸ (identifier) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດສົ່ງໃຫ້ [method unregister_additional_output] ໃນພາຍຫຼັງໄດ້.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ Godot ຂ້າມການເຣນເດີ ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີໜ້າຕ່າງປົກກະຕິປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the dots per inch density of the specified screen. Returns platform "
"specific default value if [param screen] is invalid.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] One of the following constants can be used as [param screen]: "
"[constant SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW], [constant SCREEN_PRIMARY], [constant "
"SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS], or [constant SCREEN_WITH_KEYBOARD_FOCUS].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, returned value is inaccurate if fractional display "
"scaling mode is used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android devices, the actual screen densities are grouped into "
"six generalized densities:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"   ldpi - 120 dpi\n"
"   mdpi - 160 dpi\n"
"   hdpi - 240 dpi\n"
"  xhdpi - 320 dpi\n"
" xxhdpi - 480 dpi\n"
"xxxhdpi - 640 dpi\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, Linux (X11/Wayland), "
"macOS, Web, and Windows. On other platforms, this method always returns "
"[code]72[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງຈຸດຕໍ່ນິ້ວ (DPI) ຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ລະບຸ. ສົ່ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສະເພາະຂອງແພລັດຟອມ ຖ້າ [param "
"screen] ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເປັນ [param screen]: [constant "
"SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW], [constant SCREEN_PRIMARY], [constant "
"SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS], ຫຼື [constant SCREEN_WITH_KEYBOARD_FOCUS].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ macOS, ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງກັບມາອາດຈະບໍ່ຊັດເຈນ "
"ຖ້າໃຊ້ໂໝດການປັບຂະໜາດຈໍສະແດງຜົນແບບເສດສ່ວນ (fractional scaling).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນອຸປະກອນ Android, ຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງໜ້າຈໍຕົວຈິງຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມເປັນ 6 "
"ຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນທົ່ວໄປ:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"   ldpi - 120 dpi\n"
"   mdpi - 160 dpi\n"
"   hdpi - 240 dpi\n"
"  xhdpi - 320 dpi\n"
" xxhdpi - 480 dpi\n"
"xxxhdpi - 640 dpi\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android, iOS, Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, Web, "
"ແລະ Windows. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]72[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Returns a screenshot of the [param screen]. Returns [code]null[/code] if "
"[param screen] is invalid or the [DisplayServer] fails to capture "
"screenshot.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] One of the following constants can be used as [param screen]: "
"[constant SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW], [constant SCREEN_PRIMARY], [constant "
"SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS], or [constant SCREEN_WITH_KEYBOARD_FOCUS].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux (X11, excluding XWayland), "
"macOS, and Windows. On other platforms, this method always returns "
"[code]null[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, this method requires the \"Screen Recording\" "
"permission. If permission is not granted, this method returns a screenshot "
"that will not include other application windows or OS elements not related to "
"the application."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຮູບຖ່າຍໜ້າຈໍ (screenshot) ຂອງ [param screen]. ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]null[/code] ຖ້າ "
"[param screen] ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື [DisplayServer] ບໍ່ສາມາດຖ່າຍຮູບໜ້າຈໍໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເປັນ [param screen]: [constant "
"SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW], [constant SCREEN_PRIMARY], [constant "
"SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS], ຫຼື [constant SCREEN_WITH_KEYBOARD_FOCUS].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Linux (X11, ບໍ່ລວມ XWayland), macOS, ແລະ Windows. "
"ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]null[/code] ສະເໝີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ macOS, ວິທີການນີ້ຕ້ອງມີການອະນຸຍາດ \"Screen Recording\". "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸຍາດ, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າຮູບຖ່າຍໜ້າຈໍທີ່ຈະບໍ່ລວມເອົາໜ້າຕ່າງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນ ຫຼື ອົງປະກອບຂອງ "
"OS ທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns a screenshot of the screen region defined by [param rect]. Returns "
"[code]null[/code] if [param rect] is outside screen bounds or the "
"[DisplayServer] fails to capture screenshot.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS and Windows. On other "
"platforms, this method always returns [code]null[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, this method requires the \"Screen Recording\" "
"permission. If permission is not granted, this method returns a screenshot "
"that will not include other application windows or OS elements not related to "
"the application."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຮູບຖ່າຍໜ້າຈໍຂອງພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param rect]. ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]null[/code] ຖ້າ [param "
"rect] ຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດໜ້າຈໍ ຫຼື [DisplayServer] ບໍ່ສາມາດຖ່າຍຮູບໜ້າຈໍໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ macOS ແລະ Windows. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[code]null[/code] ສະເໝີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ macOS, ວິທີການນີ້ຕ້ອງມີການອະນຸຍາດ \"Screen Recording\". "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸຍາດ, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າຮູບຖ່າຍໜ້າຈໍທີ່ຈະບໍ່ລວມເອົາໜ້າຕ່າງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນ ຫຼື ອົງປະກອບຂອງ "
"OS ທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [param screen]'s current orientation. See also [method "
"screen_set_orientation]. Returns [constant SCREEN_LANDSCAPE] if [param "
"screen] is invalid.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] One of the following constants can be used as [param screen]: "
"[constant SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW], [constant SCREEN_PRIMARY], [constant "
"SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS], or [constant SCREEN_WITH_KEYBOARD_FOCUS].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android and iOS. On other "
"platforms, this method always returns [constant SCREEN_LANDSCAPE]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າທິດທາງການວາງ (orientation) ປະຈຸບັນຂອງ [param screen]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"screen_set_orientation] ນຳ. ສົ່ງຄ່າ [constant SCREEN_LANDSCAPE] ຖ້າ [param "
"screen] ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເປັນ [param screen]: [constant "
"SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW], [constant SCREEN_PRIMARY], [constant "
"SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS], ຫຼື [constant SCREEN_WITH_KEYBOARD_FOCUS].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android ແລະ iOS. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[constant SCREEN_LANDSCAPE] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the color of the pixel at the given screen [param position]. On multi-"
"monitor setups, the screen position is relative to the virtual desktop area.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux (X11, excluding XWayland), "
"macOS, and Windows. On other platforms, this method always returns "
"[code]Color(0, 0, 0, 1)[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, this method requires the \"Screen Recording\" "
"permission. If permission is not granted, this method returns a color from a "
"screenshot that will not include other application windows or OS elements not "
"related to the application."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າສີຂອງພິກເຊວ (pixel) ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ [param position] ຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ລະບຸ. ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼາຍໜ້າຈໍ, "
"ຕຳແໜ່ງໜ້າຈໍຈະທຽບກັບພື້ນທີ່ເດັສທັອບສະເໝືອນ (virtual desktop area).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Linux (X11, ບໍ່ລວມ XWayland), macOS, ແລະ Windows. "
"ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 1)[/code] ສະເໝີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ macOS, ວິທີການນີ້ຕ້ອງມີການອະນຸຍາດ \"Screen Recording\". "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸຍາດ, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າສີຈາກຮູບຖ່າຍໜ້າຈໍທີ່ຈະບໍ່ລວມເອົາໜ້າຕ່າງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນ ຫຼື "
"ອົງປະກອບຂອງ OS ທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the current refresh rate of the specified screen. When V-Sync is "
"enabled, this returns the maximum framerate the project can effectively "
"reach. Returns [code]-1.0[/code] if [param screen] is invalid or the "
"[DisplayServer] fails to find the refresh rate for the specified screen.\n"
"To fallback to a default refresh rate if the method fails, try:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var refresh_rate = DisplayServer.screen_get_refresh_rate()\n"
"if refresh_rate < 0:\n"
"\trefresh_rate = 60.0\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] One of the following constants can be used as [param screen]: "
"[constant SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW], [constant SCREEN_PRIMARY], [constant "
"SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS], or [constant SCREEN_WITH_KEYBOARD_FOCUS].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, macOS, Linux (X11 "
"and Wayland), and Windows. On other platforms, this method always returns "
"[code]-1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊ (refresh rate) ປະຈຸບັນຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ລະບຸ. ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ V-Sync, "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າເຟຣມເຣດສູງສຸດທີ່ໂປຣເຈັກສາມາດໄປເຖິງໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ. ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]-1.0[/code] "
"ຖ້າ [param screen] ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື [DisplayServer] ບໍ່ສາມາດຫາອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ລະບຸໄດ້.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫາກວິທີການນີ້ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ໃຫ້ລອງ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var refresh_rate = DisplayServer.screen_get_refresh_rate()\n"
"if refresh_rate < 0:\n"
"\trefresh_rate = 60.0\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເປັນ [param screen]: [constant "
"SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW], [constant SCREEN_PRIMARY], [constant "
"SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS], ຫຼື [constant SCREEN_WITH_KEYBOARD_FOCUS].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android, iOS, macOS, Linux (X11 ແລະ Wayland), "
"ແລະ Windows. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]-1.0[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the screen's size in pixels. See also [method screen_get_position] "
"and [method screen_get_usable_rect]. Returns [constant Vector2i.ZERO] if "
"[param screen] is invalid.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] One of the following constants can be used as [param screen]: "
"[constant SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW], [constant SCREEN_PRIMARY], [constant "
"SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS], or [constant SCREEN_WITH_KEYBOARD_FOCUS]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຂະໜາດຂອງໜ້າຈໍເປັນພິກເຊວ. ເບິ່ງ [method screen_get_position] ແລະ [method "
"screen_get_usable_rect] ນຳ. ສົ່ງຄ່າ [constant Vector2i.ZERO] ຖ້າ [param screen] "
"ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເປັນ [param screen]: [constant "
"SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW], [constant SCREEN_PRIMARY], [constant "
"SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS], ຫຼື [constant SCREEN_WITH_KEYBOARD_FOCUS]."

msgid ""
"Returns the portion of the screen that is not obstructed by a status bar in "
"pixels. See also [method screen_get_size].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] One of the following constants can be used as [param screen]: "
"[constant SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW], [constant SCREEN_PRIMARY], [constant "
"SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS], or [constant SCREEN_WITH_KEYBOARD_FOCUS].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux/X11, macOS, and Windows. On "
"other platforms, this method always returns "
"[code]Rect2i(screen_get_position(screen), screen_get_size(screen))[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າສ່ວນຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກບັງໂດຍແຖບສະຖານະ (status bar) ເປັນພິກເຊວ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"screen_get_size] ນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເປັນ [param screen]: [constant "
"SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW], [constant SCREEN_PRIMARY], [constant "
"SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS], ຫຼື [constant SCREEN_WITH_KEYBOARD_FOCUS].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Linux/X11, macOS, ແລະ Windows. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ, "
"ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]Rect2i(screen_get_position(screen), "
"screen_get_size(screen))[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the screen should never be turned off by the "
"operating system's power-saving measures. See also [method "
"screen_set_keep_on]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໜ້າຈໍບໍ່ຄວນຖືກປິດໂດຍມາດຕະການປະຢັດພະລັງງານຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method screen_set_keep_on] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Sets whether the screen should never be turned off by the operating system's "
"power-saving measures. See also [method screen_is_kept_on]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າໜ້າຈໍບໍ່ຄວນຖືກປິດໂດຍມາດຕະການປະຢັດພະລັງງານຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຫຼືບໍ່. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"screen_is_kept_on] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param screen]'s [param orientation]. See also [method "
"screen_get_orientation].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] One of the following constants can be used as [param screen]: "
"[constant SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW], [constant SCREEN_PRIMARY], [constant "
"SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS], or [constant SCREEN_WITH_KEYBOARD_FOCUS].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android and iOS.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On iOS, this method has no effect if [member "
"ProjectSettings.display/window/handheld/orientation] is not set to [constant "
"SCREEN_SENSOR]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າທິດທາງການວາງ (orientation) [param orientation] ຂອງ [param screen]. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method screen_get_orientation] ນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເປັນ [param screen]: [constant "
"SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW], [constant SCREEN_PRIMARY], [constant "
"SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS], ຫຼື [constant SCREEN_WITH_KEYBOARD_FOCUS].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android ແລະ iOS.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ iOS, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ ຖ້າ [member ProjectSettings.display/window/"
"handheld/orientation] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant SCREEN_SENSOR]."

msgid ""
"Sets the callback that should be called when a hardware keyboard is connected "
"or disconnected. [param callable] should accept a single [bool] argument "
"indicating whether the keyboard has been connected ([code]true[/code]) or "
"disconnected ([code]false[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only implemented on Android."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄໍແບັກ (callback) ທີ່ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຫຼື ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຄີບອດຮາດແວ. [param "
"callable] ຄວນຮັບອາຣກິວເມນ [bool] ພຽງອັນດຽວ ເພື່ອບົ່ງບອກວ່າຄີບອດໄດ້ຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ([code]true[/"
"code]) ຫຼື ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ([code]false[/code]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Android ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the application icon and icons of all windows with an [Image]. To use "
"icons in the operating system's native format, use [method set_native_icon] "
"instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Requires support for [constant FEATURE_ICON]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄອຄອນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ແລະ ໄອຄອນຂອງທຸກໜ້າຕ່າງດ້ວຍ [Image]. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໄອຄອນໃນຮູບແບບເນທີບ "
"(native format) ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method set_native_icon] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ້ອງມີການຮອງຮັບ [constant FEATURE_ICON]."

msgid ""
"Sets the window icon (usually displayed in the top-left corner) in the "
"operating system's [i]native[/i] format. The file at [param filename] must be "
"in [code].ico[/code] format on Windows or [code].icns[/code] on macOS. By "
"using specially crafted [code].ico[/code] or [code].icns[/code] icons, "
"[method set_native_icon] allows specifying different icons depending on the "
"size the icon is displayed at. This size is determined by the operating "
"system and user preferences (including the display scale factor). To use "
"icons in other formats, use [method set_icon] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Requires support for [constant FEATURE_NATIVE_ICON]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄອຄອນໜ້າຕ່າງ (ປົກກະຕິຈະສະແດງຢູ່ມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍ) ໃນຮູບແບບເນທີບ (native format) "
"ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ [param filename] ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ [code].ico[/code] ໃນ "
"Windows ຫຼື [code].icns[/code] ໃນ macOS. ໂດຍການໃຊ້ໄອຄອນ [code].ico[/code] ຫຼື "
"[code].icns[/code] ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເປັນພິເສດ, [method set_native_icon] "
"ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດລະບຸໄອຄອນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ຂຶ້ນກັບຂະໜາດທີ່ໄອຄອນຖືກສະແດງ. "
"ຂະໜາດນີ້ແມ່ນກຳນົດໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ຄວາມມັກຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ (ລວມທັງຕົວຄູນການປັບຂະໜາດຈໍສະແດງຜົນ). "
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໄອຄອນໃນຮູບແບບອື່ນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method set_icon] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ້ອງມີການຮອງຮັບ [constant FEATURE_NATIVE_ICON]."

msgid ""
"Sets the callback that should be called when the system's theme settings are "
"changed. [param callable] should accept zero arguments.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, macOS, Windows, and "
"Linux (X11/Wayland)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄໍແບັກ (callback) ທີ່ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີມ (theme settings) "
"ຂອງລະບົບມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. [param callable] ຄວນຈະບໍ່ມີອາຣກິວເມນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android, iOS, macOS, Windows, ແລະ Linux (X11/"
"Wayland)."

msgid ""
"Opens system emoji and symbol picker.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດຕົວເລືອກອີໂມຈິ (emoji) ແລະ ສັນຍະລັກຂອງລະບົບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ macOS ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Returns the rectangle for the given status indicator [param id] in screen "
"coordinates. If the status indicator is not visible, returns an empty "
"[Rect2].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຮູບສີ່ແຈ (rectangle) ສຳລັບຕົວບົ່ງບອກສະຖານະ (status indicator) [param id] "
"ທີ່ລະບຸໃນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍ. ຖ້າຕົວບົ່ງບອກສະຖານະບໍ່ປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [Rect2] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ macOS ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Sets the application status indicator activation callback. [param callback] "
"should take two arguments: [int] mouse button index (one of [enum "
"MouseButton] values) and [Vector2i] click position in screen coordinates.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄໍແບັກ (callback) ການເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວບົ່ງບອກສະຖານະຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. [param callback] "
"ຄວນຮັບສອງອາຣກິວເມນ: [int] ອິນເດັກຂອງປຸ່ມເມົ້າ (ໜຶ່ງໃນຄ່າຂອງ [enum MouseButton]) ແລະ "
"[Vector2i] ຕຳແໜ່ງການຄລິກໃນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ macOS ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Sets the application status indicator icon.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄອຄອນຂອງຕົວບົ່ງບອກສະຖານະແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ macOS ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Sets the application status indicator native popup menu.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, the menu is activated by any mouse button. Its "
"activation callback is [i]not[/i] triggered.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, the menu is activated by the right mouse button, "
"selecting the status icon and pressing [kbd]Shift + F10[/kbd], or the "
"applications key. The menu's activation callback for the other mouse buttons "
"is still triggered.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Native popup is only supported if [NativeMenu] supports the "
"[constant NativeMenu.FEATURE_POPUP_MENU] feature."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເມນູປັອບອັບເນທີບ (native popup menu) ຂອງຕົວບົ່ງບອກສະຖານະແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ macOS, ເມນູຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມເມົ້າໃດກໍໄດ້. ຄໍແບັກການເປີດໃຊ້ຂອງມັນຈະ [i]ບໍ່[/"
"i] ຖືກເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Windows, ເມນູຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມເມົ້າຂວາ, ການເລືອກໄອຄອນສະຖານະແລ້ວກົດ "
"[kbd]Shift + F10[/kbd], ຫຼື ປຸ່ມແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. ຄໍແບັກການເປີດໃຊ້ເມນູສຳລັບປຸ່ມເມົ້າອື່ນໆ "
"ຍັງຄົງຖືກເຮັດວຽກຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປັອບອັບເນທີບຈະໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [NativeMenu] ຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"[constant NativeMenu.FEATURE_POPUP_MENU] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the application status indicator tooltip.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າທູນທິບ (tooltip) ຂອງຕົວບົ່ງບອກສະຖານະແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ macOS ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Returns current active tablet driver name.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on Windows."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຊື່ໄດເວີແທັບເລັດ (tablet driver) ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Windows ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the total number of available tablet drivers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on Windows."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນທັງໝົດຂອງໄດເວີແທັບເລັດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Windows ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the tablet driver name for the given index.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on Windows."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຊື່ໄດເວີແທັບເລັດສຳລັບອິນເດັກທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Windows ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Set active tablet driver name.\n"
"Supported drivers:\n"
"- [code]winink[/code]: Windows Ink API, default.\n"
"- [code]wintab[/code]: Wacom Wintab API (compatible device driver required).\n"
"- [code]dummy[/code]: Dummy driver, tablet input is disabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊື່ໄດເວີແທັບເລັດທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່.\n"
"ໄດເວີທີ່ຮອງຮັບ:\n"
"- [code]winink[/code]: Windows Ink API, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"- [code]wintab[/code]: Wacom Wintab API (ຕ້ອງມີໄດເວີອຸປະກອນທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້).\n"
"- [code]dummy[/code]: ໄດເວີຫຼອກ, ການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນແທັບເລັດຈະຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Windows ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of voice information dictionaries.\n"
"Each [Dictionary] contains two [String] entries:\n"
"- [code]name[/code] is voice name.\n"
"- [code]id[/code] is voice identifier.\n"
"- [code]language[/code] is language code in [code]lang_Variant[/code] format. "
"The [code]lang[/code] part is a 2 or 3-letter code based on the ISO-639 "
"standard, in lowercase. The [code skip-lint]Variant[/code] part is an engine-"
"dependent string describing country, region or/and dialect.\n"
"Note that Godot depends on system libraries for text-to-speech functionality. "
"These libraries are installed by default on Windows and macOS, but not on all "
"Linux distributions. If they are not present, this method will return an "
"empty list. This applies to both Godot users on Linux, as well as end-users "
"on Linux running Godot games that use text-to-speech.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/"
"Wayland), macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [Array] ຂອງ Dictionary ຂໍ້ມູນສຽງເວົ້າ.\n"
"ແຕ່ລະ [Dictionary] ປະກອບມີສາມລາຍການ [String]:\n"
"- [code]name[/code] ແມ່ນຊື່ສຽງເວົ້າ.\n"
"- [code]id[/code] ແມ່ນຕົວລະບຸສຽງເວົ້າ.\n"
"- [code]language[/code] ແມ່ນລະຫັດພາສາໃນຮູບແບບ [code]lang_Variant[/code]. ສ່ວນ "
"[code]lang[/code] ແມ່ນລະຫັດ 2 ຫຼື 3 ຕົວອັກສອນຕາມມາດຕະຖານ ISO-639, ເປັນຕົວພິມນ້ອຍ. ສ່ວນ "
"[code skip-lint]Variant[/code] ແມ່ນສະຕຣິງທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບເອນຈິນ ເຊິ່ງອະທິບາຍເຖິງປະເທດ, ພາກພື້ນ ຫຼື/"
"ແລະ ສຳນຽງທ້ອງຖິ່ນ.\n"
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ Godot ຂຶ້ນກັບໄລບຣາຣີຂອງລະບົບສຳລັບຟັງຊັນການປ່ຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນສຽງເວົ້າ (text-to-"
"speech). ໄລບຣາຣີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນ Windows ແລະ macOS, ແຕ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກເວີຊັນຂອງ "
"Linux. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີໄລບຣາຣີເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າລາຍການຫວ່າງເປົ່າ. ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບທັງຜູ້ໃຊ້ Godot ໃນ "
"Linux ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປໃນ Linux ທີ່ຫຼິ້ນເກມ Godot ທີ່ໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນສຽງເວົ້າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, "
"ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Returns a [PackedStringArray] of voice identifiers for the [param language].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/"
"Wayland), macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [PackedStringArray] ຂອງຕົວລະບຸສຽງເວົ້າສຳລັບ [param language].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, "
"ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the synthesizer is in a paused state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/"
"Wayland), macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເຄື່ອງສັງເຄາະສຽງເວົ້າຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ (paused).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, "
"ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the synthesizer is generating speech, or have "
"utterance waiting in the queue.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/"
"Wayland), macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເຄື່ອງສັງເຄາະສຽງເວົ້າກຳລັງສ້າງສຽງເວົ້າ ຫຼື ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມລໍຖ້າຢູ່ໃນຄິວ "
"(queue).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, "
"ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Puts the synthesizer into a paused state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/"
"Wayland), macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງສັງເຄາະສຽງເວົ້າໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ (paused).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, "
"ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Resumes the synthesizer if it was paused.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/"
"Wayland), macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງສັງເຄາະສຽງເວົ້າເຮັດວຽກຕໍ່ ຫາກມັນຖືກຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, "
"ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Adds a callback, which is called when the utterance has started, finished, "
"canceled or reached a text boundary.\n"
"- [constant TTS_UTTERANCE_STARTED], [constant TTS_UTTERANCE_ENDED], and "
"[constant TTS_UTTERANCE_CANCELED] callable's method should take one [int] "
"parameter, the utterance ID.\n"
"- [constant TTS_UTTERANCE_BOUNDARY] callable's method should take two [int] "
"parameters, the index of the character and the utterance ID.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The granularity of the boundary callbacks is engine dependent.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/"
"Wayland), macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຄໍແບັກ (callback) ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອຂໍ້ຄວາມສຽງເວົ້າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ສິ້ນສຸດ, ຖືກຍົກເລີກ ຫຼື "
"ໄປຮອດຂອບເຂດຂໍ້ຄວາມ (text boundary).\n"
"- ວິທີການຂອງ Callable ສຳລັບ [constant TTS_UTTERANCE_STARTED], [constant "
"TTS_UTTERANCE_ENDED], ແລະ [constant TTS_UTTERANCE_CANCELED] ຄວນຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີ "
"[int] ພຽງອັນດຽວ, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນ ID ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມສຽງເວົ້າ.\n"
"- ວິທີການຂອງ Callable ສຳລັບ [constant TTS_UTTERANCE_BOUNDARY] ຄວນຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີ [int] "
"ສອງອັນ, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນອິນເດັກຂອງຕົວອັກສອນ ແລະ ID ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມສຽງເວົ້າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງຄໍແບັກຂອບເຂດແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບເອນຈິນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, "
"ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Adds an utterance to the queue. If [param interrupt] is [code]true[/code], "
"the queue is cleared first.\n"
"- [param voice] identifier is one of the [code]\"id\"[/code] values returned "
"by [method tts_get_voices] or one of the values returned by [method "
"tts_get_voices_for_language].\n"
"- [param volume] ranges from [code]0[/code] (lowest) to [code]100[/code] "
"(highest).\n"
"- [param pitch] ranges from [code]0.0[/code] (lowest) to [code]2.0[/code] "
"(highest), [code]1.0[/code] is default pitch for the current voice.\n"
"- [param rate] ranges from [code]0.1[/code] (lowest) to [code]10.0[/code] "
"(highest), [code]1.0[/code] is a normal speaking rate. Other values act as a "
"percentage relative.\n"
"- [param utterance_id] is passed as a parameter to the callback functions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows and Linux (X11/Wayland), utterance [param text] can "
"use SSML markup. SSML support is engine and voice dependent. If the engine "
"does not support SSML, you should strip out all XML markup before calling "
"[method tts_speak].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The granularity of pitch, rate, and volume is engine and voice "
"dependent. Values may be truncated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/"
"Wayland), macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມສຽງເວົ້າເຂົ້າໃນຄິວ. ຖ້າ [param interrupt] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຄິວຈະຖືກລຶບລ້າງກ່ອນ.\n"
"- ຕົວລະບຸ [param voice] ແມ່ນໜຶ່ງໃນຄ່າ [code]\"id\"[/code] ທີ່ສົ່ງກັບມາຈາກ [method "
"tts_get_voices] ຫຼື ໜຶ່ງໃນຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງກັບມາຈາກ [method tts_get_voices_for_language].\n"
"- [param volume] ມີຊ່ວງຕັ້ງແຕ່ [code]0[/code] (ຕ່ຳສຸດ) ຫາ [code]100[/code] (ສູງສຸດ).\n"
"- [param pitch] (ລະດັບສຽງ) ມີຊ່ວງຕັ້ງແຕ່ [code]0.0[/code] (ຕ່ຳສຸດ) ຫາ [code]2.0[/"
"code] (ສູງສຸດ), [code]1.0[/code] ແມ່ນລະດັບສຽງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບສຽງເວົ້າປະຈຸບັນ.\n"
"- [param rate] (ອັດຕາຄວາມໄວ) ມີຊ່ວງຕັ້ງແຕ່ [code]0.1[/code] (ຊ້າສຸດ) ຫາ [code]10.0[/"
"code] (ໄວສຸດ), [code]1.0[/code] ແມ່ນຄວາມໄວໃນການເວົ້າປົກກະຕິ. "
"ຄ່າອື່ນໆຈະເປັນສັດສ່ວນເປີເຊັນທຽບໃສ່ຄ່າປົກກະຕິ.\n"
"- [param utterance_id] ຈະຖືກສົ່ງເປັນພາຣາມິເຕີໃຫ້ກັບຟັງຊັນຄໍແບັກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Windows ແລະ Linux (X11/Wayland), [param text] "
"ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມສຽງເວົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ SSML markup ໄດ້. ການຮອງຮັບ SSML ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບເອນຈິນ ແລະ ສຽງເວົ້າ. "
"ຖ້າເອນຈິນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ SSML, ທ່ານຄວນລຶບ XML markup ທັງໝົດອອກກ່ອນເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method tts_speak].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງ pitch, rate, ແລະ volume ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບເອນຈິນ ແລະ ສຽງເວົ້າ. "
"ຄ່າອາດຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, "
"ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Stops synthesis in progress and removes all utterances from the queue.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/"
"Wayland), macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຢຸດການສັງເຄາະສຽງເວົ້າທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ແລະ ລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມສຽງເວົ້າທັງໝົດອອກຈາກຄິວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android, iOS, Web, Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, "
"ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Unregisters an [Object] representing an additional output, that was "
"registered via [method register_additional_output]."
msgstr ""
"ຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນ [Object] ທີ່ເປັນຕົວແທນຂອງເອົາພຸດ (output) ເພີ່ມເຕີມ ທີ່ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນຜ່ານ "
"[method register_additional_output]."

msgid ""
"Returns the on-screen keyboard's height in pixels. Returns [code]0[/code] if "
"there is no keyboard or if it is currently hidden.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android 7 and 8, the keyboard height may return [code]0[/"
"code] the first time the keyboard is opened in non-immersive mode. This "
"behavior does not occur in immersive mode."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄວາມສູງຂອງຄີບອດເທິງໜ້າຈໍເປັນພິກເຊວ. ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]0[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຄີບອດ ຫຼື "
"ຖ້າມັນຖືກຊ່ອນຢູ່ໃນປະຈຸບັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Android 7 ແລະ 8, ຄວາມສູງຂອງຄີບອດອາດຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]0[/code] "
"ໃນຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ເປີດຄີບອດໃນໂໝດທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ immersive. ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ຈະບໍ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນໂໝດ immersive."

msgid "Hides the virtual keyboard if it is shown, does nothing otherwise."
msgstr "ຊ່ອນຄີບອດສະເໝືອນ (virtual keyboard) ຫາກມັນສະແດງຢູ່, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນແມ່ນບໍ່ເຮັດຫຍັງເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"Shows the virtual keyboard if the platform has one.\n"
"[param existing_text] parameter is useful for implementing your own "
"[LineEdit] or [TextEdit], as it tells the virtual keyboard what text has "
"already been typed (the virtual keyboard uses it for auto-correct and "
"predictions).\n"
"[param position] parameter is the screen space [Rect2] of the edited text.\n"
"[param type] parameter allows configuring which type of virtual keyboard to "
"show.\n"
"[param max_length] limits the number of characters that can be entered if "
"different from [code]-1[/code].\n"
"[param cursor_start] can optionally define the current text cursor position "
"if [param cursor_end] is not set.\n"
"[param cursor_start] and [param cursor_end] can optionally define the current "
"text selection.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS and Web."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຄີບອດສະເໝືອນ (virtual keyboard) ຖ້າແພລັດຟອມນັ້ນມີ.\n"
"ພາຣາມິເຕີ [param existing_text] ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ [LineEdit] ຫຼື [TextEdit] "
"ຂອງທ່ານເອງ, ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນບອກຄີບອດສະເໝືອນວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມໃດທີ່ໄດ້ພິມໄປແລ້ວ "
"(ຄີບອດສະເໝືອນໃຊ້ມັນສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ການຄາດເດົາ).\n"
"ພາຣາມິເຕີ [param position] ແມ່ນ [Rect2] ໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"ພາຣາມິເຕີ [param type] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ວ່າຈະສະແດງຄີບອດສະເໝືອນປະເພດໃດ.\n"
"ພາຣາມິເຕີ [param max_length] ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ສາມາດປ້ອນໄດ້ ຖ້າແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ [code]-1[/"
"code].\n"
"ພາຣາມິເຕີ [param cursor_start] ສາມາດກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີຂໍ້ຄວາມປະຈຸບັນໄດ້ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງ [param "
"cursor_end].\n"
"[param cursor_start] ແລະ [param cursor_end] ສາມາດກຳນົດການເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມປະຈຸບັນໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android, iOS ແລະ Web."

msgid ""
"Sets the mouse cursor position to the given [param position] relative to an "
"origin at the upper left corner of the currently focused game Window Manager "
"window.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method warp_mouse] is only supported on Windows, macOS, and "
"Linux (X11/Wayland). It has no effect on Android, iOS, and Web."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີເມົ້າໄປຍັງ [param position] ທີ່ລະບຸ "
"ໂດຍທຽບກັບຈຸດກຳເນີດຢູ່ມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງເກມທີ່ກຳລັງໂຟກັດຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method warp_mouse] ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Windows, macOS, ແລະ "
"Linux (X11/Wayland). ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນ Android, iOS, ແລະ Web."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if anything can be drawn in the window specified by "
"[param window_id], [code]false[/code] otherwise. Using the [code]--disable-"
"render-loop[/code] command line argument or a headless build will return "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສາມາດແຕ້ມຫຍັງລົງໃນໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param window_id] ໄດ້, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນແມ່ນ [code]false[/code]. ການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຄອມມານໄລນ໌ [code]--disable-render-"
"loop[/code] ຫຼື ການໃຊ້ build ແບບ headless ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns ID of the active popup window, or [constant INVALID_WINDOW_ID] if "
"there is none."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ ID ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງປັອບອັບທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່, ຫຼື [constant INVALID_WINDOW_ID] ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [method Object.get_instance_id] of the [Window] the [param "
"window_id] is attached to."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [method Object.get_instance_id] ຂອງ [Window] ທີ່ [param window_id] ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the screen the window specified by [param window_id] is currently "
"positioned on. If the screen overlaps multiple displays, the screen where the "
"window's center is located is returned. See also [method "
"window_set_current_screen]. Returns [constant INVALID_SCREEN] if [param "
"window_id] is invalid.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux/X11, macOS, and Windows. On "
"other platforms, this method always returns [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າໜ້າຈໍທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param window_id] ຕັ້ງຢູ່ປະຈຸບັນ. ຖ້າໜ້າຕ່າງຊ້ອນທັບກັນຫຼາຍຈໍ, "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າໜ້າຈໍທີ່ຈຸດໃຈກາງຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຕັ້ງຢູ່. ເບິ່ງ [method window_set_current_screen] ນຳ. ສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[constant INVALID_SCREEN] ຖ້າ [param window_id] ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Linux/X11, macOS, ແລະ Windows. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ, "
"ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]0[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid "Returns the current value of the given window's [param flag]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າປະຈຸບັນຂອງ [param flag] ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"When [method window_is_hdr_output_enabled] returns [code]true[/code], this "
"returns the current maximum luminance in nits (cd/m²) for HDR output by the "
"window specified by [param window_id]. If the maximum luminance is being "
"automatically adjusted based on the screen's capabilities, this method will "
"return that value. Otherwise, it will return the value set by [method "
"window_set_hdr_output_max_luminance]. This maximum luminance value is used "
"when calculating [method window_get_output_max_linear_value].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This maximum luminance may not match the physical behavior of "
"the screen, but will always be proportionally correct relative to [method "
"window_get_hdr_output_current_reference_luminance]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [method window_is_hdr_output_enabled] ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code], "
"ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດ (maximum luminance) ໃນໜ່ວຍ nits (cd/m²) ສຳລັບເອົາພຸດ "
"HDR ໂດຍໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸດ້ວຍ [param window_id]. "
"ຖ້າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດຖືກປັບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມຄວາມສາມາດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໂດຍ [method window_set_hdr_output_max_luminance]. "
"ຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນການຄຳນວນ [method window_get_output_max_linear_value].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ກົງກັບພຶດຕິກຳທາງກາຍະພາບຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະມີສັດສ່ວນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສະເໝີເມື່ອທຽບກັບ [method "
"window_get_hdr_output_current_reference_luminance]."

msgid ""
"When [method window_is_hdr_output_enabled] returns [code]true[/code], this "
"returns the current reference white luminance in nits (cd/m²) for HDR output "
"by the window specified by [param window_id]. If the reference luminance is "
"being automatically adjusted to match the operating system brightness, this "
"will return that value. Otherwise, it will return the value set by [method "
"window_set_hdr_output_reference_luminance]. This reference luminance value is "
"used when calculating [method window_get_output_max_linear_value].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This reference white luminance may not match the physical "
"behavior of the screen, but will always be proportionally correct relative to "
"[method window_get_hdr_output_current_max_luminance]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [method window_is_hdr_output_enabled] ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code], "
"ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສີຂາວອ້າງອີງ (reference white luminance) ໃນໜ່ວຍ nits (cd/"
"m²) ສຳລັບເອົາພຸດ HDR ໂດຍໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸດ້ວຍ [param window_id]. "
"ຖ້າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງອ້າງອີງຖືກປັບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, "
"ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໂດຍ [method "
"window_set_hdr_output_reference_luminance]. ຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງອ້າງອີງນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນການຄຳນວນ "
"[method window_get_output_max_linear_value].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສີຂາວອ້າງອີງນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ກົງກັບພຶດຕິກຳທາງກາຍະພາບຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະມີສັດສ່ວນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສະເໝີເມື່ອທຽບກັບ [method "
"window_get_hdr_output_current_max_luminance]."

msgid ""
"Returns the maximum luminance in nits (cd/m²) set for HDR output by the "
"window specified by [param window_id]. Negative values indicate that the "
"value is being automatically adjusted based on the screen's capabilities. See "
"also [method window_get_hdr_output_current_max_luminance]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດ (maximum luminance) ໃນໜ່ວຍ nits (cd/m²) ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ສຳລັບເອົາພຸດ HDR "
"ໂດຍໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸດ້ວຍ [param window_id]. "
"ຄ່າລົບໝາຍເຖິງຄ່າທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກປັບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມຄວາມສາມາດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"window_get_hdr_output_current_max_luminance] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Returns the reference white luminance in nits (cd/m²) set for HDR output by "
"the window specified by [param window_id]. Negative values indicate that the "
"value is being automatically adjusted to match the operating system "
"brightness. See also [method "
"window_get_hdr_output_current_reference_luminance]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສີຂາວອ້າງອີງ (reference white luminance) ໃນໜ່ວຍ nits (cd/m²) "
"ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ສຳລັບເອົາພຸດ HDR ໂດຍໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸດ້ວຍ [param window_id]. "
"ຄ່າລົບໝາຍເຖິງຄ່າທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກປັບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method window_get_hdr_output_current_reference_luminance] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Returns the window's maximum size (in pixels). See also [method "
"window_set_max_size]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ (ເປັນພິກເຊວ). ເບິ່ງ [method window_set_max_size] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Returns the window's minimum size (in pixels). See also [method "
"window_set_min_size]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ (ເປັນພິກເຊວ). ເບິ່ງ [method window_set_min_size] ນຳ."

msgid "Returns the mode of the given window."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າໂໝດ (mode) ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns internal structure pointers for use in plugins.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, Linux (X11/Wayland), "
"macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າພອຍເຕີໂຄງສ້າງພາຍໃນ (internal structure pointers) ສຳລັບໃຊ້ໃນປລັກອິນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Android, Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, ແລະ "
"Windows."

msgid ""
"Returns the maximum value for linear color components that can be displayed "
"for the window specified by [param window_id], regardless of SDR or HDR "
"output. Returns [code]1.0[/code] if HDR is not enabled or not supported. When "
"HDR output is enabled, this is calculated based on [method "
"window_get_hdr_output_current_reference_luminance] and [method "
"window_get_hdr_output_current_max_luminance]. The [signal "
"Window.output_max_linear_value_changed] signal will be emitted whenever this "
"value changes. This value is used by tonemapping and other [Environment] "
"effects to ensure that bright colors are presented in the range that can be "
"displayed by this window. Corresponds to [method "
"Window.get_output_max_linear_value]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າສູງສຸດສຳລັບສ່ວນປະກອບສີແບບລີເນຍ (linear color components) "
"ທີ່ສາມາດສະແດງຜົນໄດ້ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸດ້ວຍ [param window_id], ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນເອົາພຸດ SDR ຫຼື HDR. "
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ HDR ຫຼື ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ. ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ເອົາພຸດ HDR, "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຄຳນວນໂດຍອີງຕາມ [method "
"window_get_hdr_output_current_reference_luminance] ແລະ [method "
"window_get_hdr_output_current_max_luminance]. ສັນຍານ [signal "
"Window.output_max_linear_value_changed] ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ຄ່ານີ້ປ່ຽນແປງ. ຄ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ "
"tonemapping ແລະ ເອັບເຟັກ [Environment] ອື່ນໆ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າສີທີ່ສະຫວ່າງຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້ສາມາດສະແດງໄດ້. ກົງກັບ [method "
"Window.get_output_max_linear_value]."

msgid ""
"Returns the bounding box of control, or menu item that was used to open the "
"popup window, in the screen coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຂອບເຂດ (bounding box) ຂອງຄອນໂທຣນ ຫຼື ລາຍການເມນູທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງປັອບອັບ, "
"ໃນລະບົບພິກັດໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"Returns the position of the client area of the given window on the screen."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງພື້ນທີ່ສ່ວນຜູ້ໃຊ້ (client area) ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸເທິງໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"Returns the position of the given window on the screen including the borders "
"drawn by the operating system. See also [method window_get_position]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸເທິງໜ້າຈໍ ລວມທັງຂອບທີ່ແຕ້ມໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"window_get_position] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Returns left margins ([code]x[/code]), right margins ([code]y[/code]) and "
"height ([code]z[/code]) of the title that are safe to use (contains no "
"buttons or other elements) when [constant WINDOW_FLAG_EXTEND_TO_TITLE] flag "
"is set."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຂອບດ້ານຊ້າຍ ([code]x[/code]), ຂອບດ້ານຂວາ ([code]y[/code]) ແລະ ຄວາມສູງ "
"([code]z[/code]) ຂອງຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ປອດໄພທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ງານ (ບໍ່ມີປຸ່ມ ຫຼື ອົງປະກອບອື່ນໆ) ເມື່ອຕັ້ງແຟລັກ [constant "
"WINDOW_FLAG_EXTEND_TO_TITLE]."

msgid ""
"Returns the size of the window specified by [param window_id] (in pixels), "
"excluding the borders drawn by the operating system. This is also called the "
"\"client area\". See also [method window_get_size_with_decorations], [method "
"window_set_size] and [method window_get_position]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຂະໜາດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param window_id] (ເປັນພິກເຊວ), "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ລວມຂອບທີ່ແຕ້ມໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ສ່ວນນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"client area\". ເບິ່ງ [method "
"window_get_size_with_decorations], [method window_set_size] ແລະ [method "
"window_get_position] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Returns the size of the window specified by [param window_id] (in pixels), "
"including the borders drawn by the operating system. See also [method "
"window_get_size]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຂະໜາດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param window_id] (ເປັນພິກເຊວ), "
"ລວມທັງຂອບທີ່ແຕ້ມໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ເບິ່ງ [method window_get_size] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Returns the estimated window title bar size (including text and window "
"buttons) for the window specified by [param window_id] (in pixels). This "
"method does not change the window title.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຂະໜາດທີ່ຄາດຄະເນຂອງແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ໜ້າຕ່າງ (ລວມທັງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ ປຸ່ມໜ້າຕ່າງ) ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ "
"[param window_id] (ເປັນພິກເຊວ). ວິທີການນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງຫົວຂໍ້ໜ້າຕ່າງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ macOS ແລະ Windows."

msgid "Returns the V-Sync mode of the given window."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າໂໝດ V-Sync ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the window specified by [param window_id] is "
"focused."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param window_id] ຖືກໂຟກັດຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if HDR output is currently enabled for the window "
"specified by [param window_id]. The returned value may change dynamically "
"based on system settings, screen capabilities, and which screen the window is "
"currently on."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າປະຈຸບັນເປີດໃຊ້ເອົາພຸດ HDR ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param "
"window_id]. ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງກັບມາອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ, ຄວາມສາມາດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, ແລະ "
"ໜ້າຈໍທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງນັ້ນຕັ້ງຢູ່ປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if HDR output is requested for the window specified "
"by [param window_id]. Corresponds to [member Window.hdr_output_requested]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີການຮ້ອງຂໍເອົາພຸດ HDR ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param "
"window_id]. ກົງກັບ [member Window.hdr_output_requested]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the window specified by [param window_id] "
"supports HDR output. This depends on the platform, screen capabilities, "
"system settings, and the screen the window is currently on."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param window_id] ຮອງຮັບເອົາພຸດ HDR. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຂຶ້ນກັບແພລັດຟອມ, ຄວາມສາມາດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ, ແລະ ໜ້າຈໍທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງນັ້ນຕັ້ງຢູ່ປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given window can be maximized (the maximize "
"button is enabled)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍສູງສຸດໄດ້ (ປຸ່ມຂະຫຍາຍສູງສຸດຖືກເປີດໃຊ້)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if double-clicking on a window's title should "
"maximize it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າການດັບເບິນຄລິກ (double-clicking) "
"ເທິງຫົວຂໍ້ໜ້າຕ່າງຄວນຈະຂະຫຍາຍໜ້າຕ່າງສູງສຸດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if double-clicking on a window's title should "
"minimize it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າການດັບເບິນຄລິກ (double-clicking) "
"ເທິງຫົວຂໍ້ໜ້າຕ່າງຄວນຈະຫຍໍ້ໜ້າຕ່າງລົງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Moves the window specified by [param window_id] to the foreground, so that it "
"is visible over other windows."
msgstr ""
"ຍ້າຍໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param window_id] ມາໄວ້ທາງໜ້າ (foreground), "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນປະກົດຢູ່ເທິງໜ້າຕ່າງອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"Makes the window specified by [param window_id] request attention, which is "
"materialized by the window title and taskbar entry blinking until the window "
"is focused. This usually has no visible effect if the window is currently "
"focused. The exact behavior varies depending on the operating system."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param window_id] ຮ້ອງຂໍຄວາມສົນໃຈ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະສະແດງຜົນໂດຍການກະພິບຂອງຫົວຂໍ້ໜ້າຕ່າງ ແລະ ແຖບວຽກ (taskbar) ຈົນກວ່າໜ້າຕ່າງຈະຖືກໂຟກັດ. "
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງຖ້າໜ້າຕ່າງນັ້ນຖືກໂຟກັດຢູ່ແລ້ວ. "
"ພຶດຕິກຳຕົວຈິງອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

msgid ""
"If [param enable] is [code]true[/code], HDR output is requested for the "
"window specified by [param window_id]. The window will automatically switch "
"between HDR and SDR if it is moved between screens, screen capabilities "
"change, or system settings are modified. This will internally force [member "
"Viewport.use_hdr_2d] to be enabled on the main [Viewport]. All other "
"[SubViewport] of the [Window] must have their [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] "
"property enabled to produce HDR output. Corresponds to [member "
"Window.hdr_output_requested]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param enable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີການຮ້ອງຂໍເອົາພຸດ HDR ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ "
"[param window_id]. ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງ HDR ແລະ SDR ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ຫາກມັນຖືກຍ້າຍລະຫວ່າງໜ້າຈໍ, ຄວາມສາມາດຂອງໜ້າຈໍປ່ຽນແປງ, ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບຖືກແກ້ໄຂ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ "
"[member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານໃນ [Viewport] ຫຼັກໂດຍພາຍໃນ. ທຸກໆ "
"[SubViewport] ຂອງ [Window] ຕ້ອງມີຄຸນສົມບັດ [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] "
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານເພື່ອສ້າງເອົາພຸດ HDR. ກົງກັບ [member Window.hdr_output_requested]."

msgid ""
"Sets the background color of the root window.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on Android."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຮາກ (root window).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Android ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Moves the window specified by [param window_id] to the specified [param "
"screen]. See also [method window_get_current_screen].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] One of the following constants can be used as [param screen]: "
"[constant SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW], [constant SCREEN_PRIMARY], [constant "
"SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS], or [constant SCREEN_WITH_KEYBOARD_FOCUS].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux/X11, macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຍ້າຍໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param window_id] ໄປຍັງ [param screen] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"window_get_current_screen] ນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເປັນ [param screen]: [constant "
"SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW], [constant SCREEN_PRIMARY], [constant "
"SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS], ຫຼື [constant SCREEN_WITH_KEYBOARD_FOCUS].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Linux/X11, macOS, ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], this window will always stay on top of its "
"parent window, parent window will ignore input while this window is opened.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, exclusive windows are confined to the same space "
"(virtual desktop or screen) as the parent window.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້ຈະຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງແມ່ (parent window) ສະເໝີ, "
"ແລະ ໜ້າຕ່າງແມ່ຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນໃນຂະນະທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້ເປີດຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ macOS, ໜ້າຕ່າງແບບ exclusive ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ດຽວກັນ (ເດັສທັອບສະເໝືອນ "
"ຫຼື ໜ້າຈໍ) ກັບໜ້າຕ່າງແມ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ macOS ແລະ Windows."

msgid "Enables or disables the given window's given [param flag]."
msgstr "ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດ ການໃຊ້ງານ [param flag] ທີ່ລະບຸຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the maximum luminance in nits (cd/m²) for HDR output by the window "
"specified by [param window_id]. If [param max_luminance] is negative, the "
"window uses the screen's maximum luminance that is reported by the operating "
"system. By default, this luminance is set to [code]-1.0[/code] for every "
"window. Typically this property should be left at this default value, but may "
"optionally be exposed through in-game settings to allow the player to correct "
"an inaccurate maximum luminance reported by the operating system. See also "
"[method window_get_hdr_output_current_max_luminance] and [method "
"window_get_hdr_output_max_luminance].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only implemented on macOS and Windows. Other "
"platforms will always use the screen's maximum luminance that is reported by "
"the operating system."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດ (maximum luminance) ໃນໜ່ວຍ nits (cd/m²) ສຳລັບເອົາພຸດ HDR "
"ໂດຍໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸດ້ວຍ [param window_id]. ຖ້າ [param max_luminance] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, "
"ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະໃຊ້ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ລາຍງານໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງນີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]-1.0[/code] ສຳລັບທຸກໜ້າຕ່າງ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຄວນປະໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແຕ່ອາດຈະເປີດໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ຜ່ານການຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຍໃນເກມ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດທີ່ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການລາຍງານບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"window_get_hdr_output_current_max_luminance] ແລະ [method "
"window_get_hdr_output_max_luminance] ນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ແລະ Windows ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ "
"ຈະໃຊ້ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ລາຍງານໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Sets the reference white luminance in nits (cd/m²) for HDR output by the "
"window specified by [param window_id]. If [param reference_luminance] is "
"negative, the window automatically adjusts to the brightness set by the "
"operating system. By default, this luminance is set to [code]-1.0[/code] for "
"every window. Typically this property should be left at this default value, "
"but may optionally be exposed as an \"HDR Brightness\" in-game setting to "
"allow the player to adjust the brightness of their game, independently of "
"their device settings. See also [method "
"window_get_hdr_output_current_reference_luminance] and [method "
"window_get_hdr_output_reference_luminance].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only implemented on Windows. Other platforms will "
"always use the reference luminance that is reported by the operating system."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສີຂາວອ້າງອີງ (reference white luminance) ໃນໜ່ວຍ nits (cd/m²) "
"ສຳລັບເອົາພຸດ HDR ໂດຍໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸດ້ວຍ [param window_id]. ຖ້າ [param "
"reference_luminance] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, "
"ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະປັບຕາມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງທີ່ຕັ້ງໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງນີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]-1.0[/code] ສຳລັບທຸກໜ້າຕ່າງ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຄວນປະໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແຕ່ອາດຈະເປີດໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ \"HDR Brightness\" ພາຍໃນເກມ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນສາມາດປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງເກມໄດ້ ໂດຍແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າອຸປະກອນ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"window_get_hdr_output_current_reference_luminance] ແລະ [method "
"window_get_hdr_output_reference_luminance] ນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Windows ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ "
"ຈະໃຊ້ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງອ້າງອີງທີ່ລາຍງານໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Sets the window icon (usually displayed in the top-left corner) for the "
"window specified by [param window_id].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄອຄອນໜ້າຕ່າງ (ປົກກະຕິຈະສະແດງຢູ່ມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍ) ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param window_id].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Linux ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Sets whether [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Input Method "
"Editor[/url] should be enabled for the window specified by [param window_id]. "
"See also [method window_set_ime_position]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Input Method "
"Editor[/url] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param window_id] ຫຼື ບໍ່. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"window_set_ime_position] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Sets the position of the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Input_method]Input Method Editor[/url] popup for the specified [param "
"window_id]. Only effective if [method window_set_ime_active] was set to "
"[code]true[/code] for the specified [param window_id]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງປັອບອັບ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Input "
"Method Editor[/url] ສຳລັບ [param window_id] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [method "
"window_set_ime_active] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ສຳລັບ [param window_id] "
"ນັ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param callback] that should be called when any [InputEvent] is sent "
"to the window specified by [param window_id].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Advanced users only! Adding such a callback to a [Window] "
"node will override its default implementation, which can introduce bugs."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄໍແບັກ [param callback] ທີ່ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີ [InputEvent] ໃດໆ "
"ຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param window_id].\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບສູງເທົ່ານັ້ນ! ການເພີ່ມຄໍແບັກດັ່ງກ່າວໃຫ້ກັບ [Window] node "
"ຈະໄປຂຽນທັບການເຮັດວຽກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງມັນ, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັກໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param callback] that should be called when text is entered using "
"the virtual keyboard to the window specified by [param window_id].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Advanced users only! Adding such a callback to a [Window] "
"node will override its default implementation, which can introduce bugs."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄໍແບັກ [param callback] "
"ທີ່ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີການປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍໃຊ້ຄີບອດສະເໝືອນລົງໃນໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param window_id].\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບສູງເທົ່ານັ້ນ! ການເພີ່ມຄໍແບັກດັ່ງກ່າວໃຫ້ກັບ [Window] node "
"ຈະໄປຂຽນທັບການເຮັດວຽກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງມັນ, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັກໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the maximum size of the window specified by [param window_id] in pixels. "
"Normally, the user will not be able to drag the window to make it larger than "
"the specified size. See also [method window_get_max_size].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It's recommended to change this value using [member "
"Window.max_size] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using third-party tools, it is possible for users to disable "
"window geometry restrictions and therefore bypass this limit."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param window_id] ເປັນພິກເຊວ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, "
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດລາກໜ້າຕ່າງໃຫ້ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຂະໜາດທີ່ລະບຸໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [method window_get_max_size] ນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member Window.max_size] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂດຍການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືຈາກພາຍນອກ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ອາດຈະສາມາດປິດການຈຳກັດຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງ ແລະ "
"ຂ້າມຂໍ້ຈຳກັດນີ້ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the minimum size for the given window to [param min_size] in pixels. "
"Normally, the user will not be able to drag the window to make it smaller "
"than the specified size. See also [method window_get_min_size].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It's recommended to change this value using [member "
"Window.min_size] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default, the main window has a minimum size of "
"[code]Vector2i(64, 64)[/code]. This prevents issues that can arise when the "
"window is resized to a near-zero size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using third-party tools, it is possible for users to disable "
"window geometry restrictions and therefore bypass this limit."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ເປັນ [param min_size] ໃນພິກເຊວ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, "
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດລາກໜ້າຕ່າງໃຫ້ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍກວ່າທີ່ລະບຸໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [method window_get_min_size] "
"ນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member Window.min_size] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກຈະມີຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດແມ່ນ [code]Vector2i(64, 64)[/"
"code]. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບັນຫາທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອໜ້າຕ່າງຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໃຫ້ເກືອບເປັນສູນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂດຍການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືຈາກພາຍນອກ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ອາດຈະສາມາດປິດການຈຳກັດຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງ ແລະ "
"ຂ້າມຂໍ້ຈຳກັດນີ້ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets window mode for the given window to [param mode].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android, setting it to [constant WINDOW_MODE_FULLSCREEN] or "
"[constant WINDOW_MODE_EXCLUSIVE_FULLSCREEN] will enable immersive mode.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting the window to full screen forcibly sets the borderless "
"flag to [code]true[/code], so make sure to set it back to [code]false[/code] "
"when not wanted."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດໜ້າຕ່າງ (window mode) ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ເປັນ [param mode].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Android, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ [constant WINDOW_MODE_FULLSCREEN] ຫຼື "
"[constant WINDOW_MODE_EXCLUSIVE_FULLSCREEN] ຈະເປັນການເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດ immersive.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງໜ້າຕ່າງໃຫ້ເປັນແບບເຕັມຈໍ (full screen) ຈະເປັນການບັງຄັບໃຫ້ຕັ້ງແຟລັກ "
"borderless ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະນັ້ນ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕັ້ງມັນກັບເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ຫາກບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ."

msgid ""
"Sets the bounding box of control, or menu item that was used to open the "
"popup window, in the screen coordinate system. Clicking this area will not "
"auto-close this popup."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອບເຂດ (bounding box) ຂອງຄອນໂທຣນ ຫຼື ລາຍການເມນູທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງປັອບອັບ, "
"ໃນລະບົບພິກັດໜ້າຈໍ. ການຄລິກໃນພື້ນທີ່ນີ້ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ປັອບອັບຖືກປິດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param callback] that will be called when the window specified by "
"[param window_id] is moved or resized.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Advanced users only! Adding such a callback to a [Window] "
"node will override its default implementation, which can introduce bugs."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄໍແບັກ [param callback] ທີ່ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param window_id] ຖືກຍ້າຍ ຫຼື "
"ປັບຂະໜາດ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບສູງເທົ່ານັ້ນ! ການເພີ່ມຄໍແບັກດັ່ງກ່າວໃຫ້ກັບ [Window] node "
"ຈະໄປຂຽນທັບການເຮັດວຽກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງມັນ, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັກໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the size of the given window to [param size] (in pixels). See also "
"[method window_get_size] and [method window_get_position].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It's recommended to change this value using [member Window.size] "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ເປັນ [param size] (ເປັນພິກເຊວ). ເບິ່ງ [method "
"window_get_size] ແລະ [method window_get_position] ນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member Window.size] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the type and state of the progress bar on the taskbar/dock icon of the "
"window specified by [param window_id]. See [enum ProgressState] for possible "
"values and how each mode behaves.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on Windows and macOS.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, the progress bar is displayed only for the main window."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າປະເພດ ແລະ ສະຖານະຂອງແຖບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າ (progress bar) ເທິງໄອຄອນແຖບວຽກ/ດັອກ (taskbar/"
"dock) ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param window_id]. ເບິ່ງ [enum ProgressState] "
"ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ ແລະ ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງແຕ່ລະໂໝດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Windows ແລະ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ macOS, ແຖບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຈະຖືກສະແດງສະເພາະໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Creates a progress bar on the taskbar/dock icon of the window specified by "
"[param window_id] if it does not exist, sets the progress of the icon.\n"
"[param value] acts as a relative percentage value, ranges from [code]0.0[/"
"code] (lowest) to [code]1.0[/code] (highest).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on Windows and macOS.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, the progress bar is displayed only for the main window."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງແຖບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າ (progress bar) ເທິງໄອຄອນແຖບວຽກ/ດັອກ (taskbar/dock) "
"ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param window_id] ຫາກມັນຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີ, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງໄອຄອນ.\n"
"ຄ່າ [param value] ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຄ່າເປີເຊັນທຽບຖານ, ມີຊ່ວງຕັ້ງແຕ່ [code]0.0[/code] (ຕ່ຳສຸດ) "
"ຫາ [code]1.0[/code] (ສູງສຸດ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Windows ແລະ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ macOS, ແຖບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຈະຖືກສະແດງສະເພາະໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the title of the given window to [param title].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It's recommended to change this value using [member "
"Window.title] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Avoid changing the window title every frame, as this can cause "
"performance issues on certain window managers. Try to change the window title "
"only a few times per second at most."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ເປັນ [param title].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member Window.title] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫຼີກເວັ້ນການປ່ຽນຫົວຂໍ້ໜ້າຕ່າງທຸກໆເຟຣມ, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບໃນບາງຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງ. "
"ພະຍາຍາມປ່ຽນຫົວຂໍ້ໜ້າຕ່າງພຽງແຕ່ສອງສາມຄັ້ງຕໍ່ວິນາທີເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets window transient parent. Transient window will be destroyed with its "
"transient parent and will return focus to their parent when closed. The "
"transient window is displayed on top of a non-exclusive full-screen parent "
"window. Transient windows can't enter full-screen mode.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It's recommended to change this value using [member "
"Window.transient] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The behavior might be different depending on the platform."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໜ້າຕ່າງແມ່ຊົ່ວຄາວ (transient parent). ໜ້າຕ່າງຊົ່ວຄາວຈະຖືກທຳລາຍໄປພ້ອມກັບໜ້າຕ່າງແມ່ຂອງມັນ "
"ແລະ ຈະສົ່ງຄືນໂຟກັດໃຫ້ໜ້າຕ່າງແມ່ເມື່ອຖືກປິດ. "
"ໜ້າຕ່າງຊົ່ວຄາວຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງແມ່ແບບເຕັມຈໍທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ exclusive. "
"ໜ້າຕ່າງຊົ່ວຄາວບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດເຕັມຈໍໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member Window.transient] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ພຶດຕິກຳອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມແພລັດຟອມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the V-Sync mode of the given window. See also [member "
"ProjectSettings.display/window/vsync/vsync_mode].\n"
"Depending on the platform and used renderer, the engine will fall back to "
"[constant VSYNC_ENABLED] if the desired mode is not supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] V-Sync modes other than [constant VSYNC_ENABLED] are only "
"supported in the Forward+ and Mobile rendering methods, not Compatibility."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດ V-Sync ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງ [member ProjectSettings.display/window/vsync/"
"vsync_mode] ນຳ.\n"
"ຂຶ້ນກັບແພລັດຟອມ ແລະ renderer ທີ່ໃຊ້, ເອນຈິນຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ [constant VSYNC_ENABLED] "
"ຫາກໂໝດທີ່ຕ້ອງການບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂໝດ V-Sync ອື່ນໆນອກຈາກ [constant VSYNC_ENABLED] "
"ຈະໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ "
"Compatibility."

msgid ""
"When [constant WINDOW_FLAG_EXTEND_TO_TITLE] flag is set, set offset to the "
"center of the first titlebar button.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີການຕັ້ງແຟລັກ [constant WINDOW_FLAG_EXTEND_TO_TITLE], ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) "
"ໄປຫາຈຸດໃຈກາງຂອງປຸ່ມທຳອິດເທິງແຖບຫົວຂໍ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຟລັກນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param callback] that will be called when an event occurs in the "
"window specified by [param window_id].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Advanced users only! Adding such a callback to a [Window] "
"node will override its default implementation, which can introduce bugs."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄໍແບັກ [param callback] ທີ່ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອເກີດເຫດການໃນໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param "
"window_id].\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບສູງເທົ່ານັ້ນ! ການເພີ່ມຄໍແບັກດັ່ງກ່າວໃຫ້ກັບ [Window] node "
"ຈະໄປຂຽນທັບການເຮັດວຽກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງມັນ, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັກໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Starts an interactive drag operation on the window with the given [param "
"window_id], using the current mouse position. Call this method when handling "
"a mouse button being pressed to simulate a pressed event on the window's "
"title bar. Using this method allows the window to participate in space "
"switching, tiling, and other system features.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, and "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການປະຕິບັດການລາກ (drag) ແບບໂຕ້ຕອບຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງດ້ວຍ [param window_id] ທີ່ລະບຸ, "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕຳແໜ່ງເມົ້າປະຈຸບັນ. "
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້ເມື່ອຈັດການກັບການກົດປຸ່ມເມົ້າເພື່ອຈຳລອງເຫດການການກົດເທິງແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ. "
"ການໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໜ້າຕ່າງສາມາດມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມໃນການສະຫຼັບພື້ນທີ່ (space switching), "
"ການຈັດລຽງໜ້າຕ່າງ (tiling), ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດລະບົບອື່ນໆ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Starts an interactive resize operation on the window with the given [param "
"window_id], using the current mouse position. Call this method when handling "
"a mouse button being pressed to simulate a pressed event on the window's "
"edge.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, and "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການປະຕິບັດການປັບຂະໜາດ (resize) ແບບໂຕ້ຕອບຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງດ້ວຍ [param window_id] ທີ່ລະບຸ, "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕຳແໜ່ງເມົ້າປະຈຸບັນ. "
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້ເມື່ອຈັດການກັບການກົດປຸ່ມເມົ້າເພື່ອຈຳລອງເຫດການການກົດເທິງຂອບຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Display server supports global menu. This allows the application to display "
"its menu items in the operating system's top bar. [b]macOS[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບເມນູສາກົນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນສາມາດສະແດງລາຍການເມນູຂອງມັນໃນແຖບດ້ານເທິງຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. "
"[b]macOS[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports multiple windows that can be moved outside of the "
"main window. [b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11)[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ສາມາດຍ້າຍອອກໄປນອກໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກໄດ້. [b]Windows, macOS, "
"Linux (X11)[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports touchscreen input. [b]Windows, Linux (X11/Wayland), "
"Android, iOS, Web[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຜ່ານໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດ. [b]Windows, Linux (X11/Wayland), "
"Android, iOS, Web[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports mouse input. [b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland), "
"Android, Web[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຜ່ານເມົ້າ. [b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland), "
"Android, Web[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports warping mouse coordinates to keep the mouse cursor "
"constrained within an area, but looping when one of the edges is reached. "
"[b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland)[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການບິດເບືອນ (warping) ພິກັດເມົ້າເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຄີເຊີເມົ້າຢູ່ພາຍໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ກຳນົດ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະວົນກັບຄືນເມື່ອຮອດຂອບໃດໜຶ່ງ. [b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland)[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports setting and getting clipboard data. See also "
"[constant FEATURE_CLIPBOARD_PRIMARY]. [b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland), "
"Android, iOS, Web[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ການເອົາຂໍ້ມູນຈາກຄລິບບອດ (clipboard). ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"FEATURE_CLIPBOARD_PRIMARY] ນຳ. [b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland), "
"Android, iOS, Web[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports popping up a virtual keyboard when requested to input "
"text without a physical keyboard. [b]Android, iOS, Web[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການສະແດງຄີບອດສະເໝືອນເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍບໍ່ມີຄີບອດຮາດແວ. "
"[b]Android, iOS, Web[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports setting the mouse cursor shape to be different from "
"the default. [b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland), Android, Web[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບຊົງຂອງເຄີເຊີເມົ້າໃຫ້ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. [b]Windows, "
"macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland), Android, Web[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports setting the mouse cursor shape to a custom image. "
"[b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland), Web[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບຊົງຂອງເຄີເຊີເມົ້າໃຫ້ເປັນຮູບພາບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ. [b]Windows, "
"macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland), Web[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports spawning text dialogs using the operating system's "
"native look-and-feel. See [method dialog_show]. [b]Windows, macOS[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການສ້າງໄດອະັລອກຂໍ້ຄວາມ (text dialogs) "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບເນທີບຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ເບິ່ງ [method dialog_show]. [b]Windows, macOS[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Input "
"Method Editor[/url], which is commonly used for inputting Chinese/Japanese/"
"Korean text. This is handled by the operating system, rather than by Godot. "
"[b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11)[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Input "
"Method Editor[/url], ເຊິ່ງມັກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມພາສາຈີນ/ຍີ່ປຸ່ນ/ເກົາຫຼີ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍ Godot. [b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11)[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports windows can use per-pixel transparency to make "
"windows behind them partially or fully visible. [b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11/"
"Wayland), Android[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສແບບຕໍ່ພິກເຊວ (per-pixel transparency) "
"ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ຢູ່ທາງຫຼັງປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນບາງສ່ວນ ຫຼື ທັງໝົດ. [b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11/"
"Wayland), Android[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports querying the operating system's display scale factor. "
"This allows automatically detecting the hiDPI display [i]reliably[/i], "
"instead of guessing based on the screen resolution and the display's reported "
"DPI (which might be unreliable due to broken monitor EDID). [b]Windows, Linux "
"(Wayland), macOS[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການສອບຖາມຕົວຄູນການປັບຂະໜາດຈໍສະແດງຜົນ (display scale factor) "
"ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດກວດພົບຈໍສະແດງຜົນ hiDPI ໄດ້ຢ່າງ [i]ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື[/i], "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນການຄາດເດົາໂດຍອີງຕາມຄວາມລະອຽດໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ DPI ທີ່ລາຍງານ "
"(ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະບໍ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືເນື່ອງຈາກ EDID ຂອງຈໍພາບຜິດພາດ). [b]Windows, Linux (Wayland), "
"macOS[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports changing the window icon (usually displayed in the "
"top-left corner). [b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland)[/b]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Use on Wayland requires the compositor to implement the "
"[url=https://wayland.app/protocols/xdg-toplevel-icon-"
"v1#xdg_toplevel_icon_v1]xdg_toplevel_icon_v1[/url] protocol, which not all "
"compositors do. See [url=https://wayland.app/protocols/xdg-toplevel-icon-"
"v1#compositor-support]xdg_toplevel_icon_v1#compositor-support[/url] for more "
"information on individual compositor support."
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການປ່ຽນໄອຄອນໜ້າຕ່າງ (ປົກກະຕິຈະສະແດງຢູ່ມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍ). [b]Windows, "
"macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland)[/b]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການໃຊ້ງານເທິງ Wayland ຮຽກຮ້ອງໃຫ້ compositor ນຳໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ "
"[url=https://wayland.app/protocols/xdg-toplevel-icon-"
"v1#xdg_toplevel_icon_v1]xdg_toplevel_icon_v1[/url], ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກ compositor "
"ທີ່ເຮັດໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://wayland.app/protocols/xdg-toplevel-icon-"
"v1#compositor-support]xdg_toplevel_icon_v1#compositor-support[/url] "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຮອງຮັບຂອງແຕ່ລະ compositor."

msgid ""
"Display server supports changing the window icon (usually displayed in the "
"top-left corner). [b]Windows, macOS[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການປ່ຽນໄອຄອນໜ້າຕ່າງ (ປົກກະຕິຈະສະແດງຢູ່ມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍ). [b]Windows, "
"macOS[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports changing the screen orientation. [b]Android, iOS[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການປ່ຽນທິດທາງການວາງ (orientation) ຂອງໜ້າຈໍ. [b]Android, iOS[/"
"b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports V-Sync status can be changed from the default (which "
"is forced to be enabled platforms not supporting this feature). [b]Windows, "
"macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland)[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການປ່ຽນສະຖານະ V-Sync ຈາກຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
"(ເຊິ່ງຖືກບັງຄັບໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ໃນແພລັດຟອມທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້). [b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11/"
"Wayland)[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports Primary clipboard can be used. This is a different "
"clipboard from [constant FEATURE_CLIPBOARD]. [b]Linux (X11/Wayland)[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການໃຊ້ຄລິບບອດຫຼັກ (Primary clipboard). ນີ້ແມ່ນຄລິບບອດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ "
"[constant FEATURE_CLIPBOARD]. [b]Linux (X11/Wayland)[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports text-to-speech. See [code]tts_*[/code] methods. "
"[b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland), Android, iOS, Web[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການປ່ຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນສຽງເວົ້າ (text-to-speech). ເບິ່ງວິທີການ "
"[code]tts_*[/code]. [b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland), Android, iOS, "
"Web[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports expanding window content to the title. See [constant "
"WINDOW_FLAG_EXTEND_TO_TITLE]. [b]macOS[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການຂະຫຍາຍເນື້ອໃນໜ້າຕ່າງໄປຫາແຖບຫົວຂໍ້. ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"WINDOW_FLAG_EXTEND_TO_TITLE]. [b]macOS[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports reading screen pixels. See [method screen_get_pixel]."
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການອ່ານຄ່າພິກເຊວຂອງໜ້າຈໍ. ເບິ່ງ [method screen_get_pixel]."

msgid "Display server supports application status indicators."
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບຕົວບົ່ງບອກສະຖານະຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

msgid ""
"Display server supports native help system search callbacks. See [method "
"help_set_search_callbacks]."
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບຄໍແບັກການຄົ້ນຫາຂອງລະບົບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອແບບເນທີບ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"help_set_search_callbacks]."

msgid ""
"Display server supports spawning text input dialogs using the operating "
"system's native look-and-feel. See [method dialog_input_text]. [b]Windows, "
"macOS[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການສ້າງໄດອະັລອກການປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ (text input dialogs) "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບເນທີບຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ເບິ່ງ [method dialog_input_text]. [b]Windows, "
"macOS[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports spawning dialogs for selecting files or directories "
"using the operating system's native look-and-feel. See [method "
"file_dialog_show]. [b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland), Android[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການສ້າງໄດອະັລອກສຳລັບເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟເດີ "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບເນທີບຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ເບິ່ງ [method file_dialog_show]. [b]Windows, "
"macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland), Android[/b]"

msgid ""
"The display server supports all features of [constant "
"FEATURE_NATIVE_DIALOG_FILE], with the added functionality of Options and "
"native dialog file access to [code]res://[/code] and [code]user://[/code] "
"paths. See [method file_dialog_show] and [method "
"file_dialog_with_options_show]. [b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland)[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດທັງໝົດຂອງ [constant FEATURE_NATIVE_DIALOG_FILE], "
"ພ້ອມທັງເພີ່ມຟັງຊັນຂອງ Options ແລະ ການເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟລ໌ຜ່ານໄດອະັລອກເນທີບສຳລັບເສັ້ນທາງ [code]res://"
"[/code] ແລະ [code]user://[/code]. ເບິ່ງ [method file_dialog_show] ແລະ [method "
"file_dialog_with_options_show]. [b]Windows, macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland)[/b]"

msgid ""
"The display server supports initiating window drag and resize operations on "
"demand. See [method window_start_drag] and [method window_start_resize]."
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການລາກ ແລະ ປັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"window_start_drag] ແລະ [method window_start_resize]."

msgid ""
"Display server supports [constant WINDOW_FLAG_EXCLUDE_FROM_CAPTURE] window "
"flag. [b]Windows, macOS[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບແຟລັກໜ້າຕ່າງ [constant WINDOW_FLAG_EXCLUDE_FROM_CAPTURE]. "
"[b]Windows, macOS[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports embedding a window from another process. [b]Windows, "
"Linux (X11), macOS[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການຝັງໜ້າຕ່າງຈາກໂປຣເຊສ (process) ອື່ນ. [b]Windows, Linux "
"(X11), macOS[/b]"

msgid "Native file selection dialog supports MIME types as filters."
msgstr "ໄດອະັລອກການເລືອກໄຟລ໌ແບບເນທີບຮອງຮັບການໃຊ້ MIME types ເປັນຕົວກອງ."

msgid ""
"Display server supports system emoji and symbol picker. [b]Windows, macOS[/b]"
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບຕົວເລືອກອີໂມຈິ ແລະ ສັນຍະລັກຂອງລະບົບ. [b]Windows, macOS[/b]"

msgid "Display server supports native color picker. [b]Linux (X11/Wayland)[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບຕົວເລືອກສີ (color picker) ແບບເນທີບ. [b]Linux (X11/Wayland)[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server automatically fits popups according to the screen boundaries. "
"Window nodes should not attempt to do that themselves."
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຈະປັບປັອບອັບໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບຂອບເຂດໜ້າຈໍໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. Window nodes "
"ບໍ່ຄວນພະຍາຍາມເຮັດແບບນັ້ນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"Display server supports interaction with screen reader or Braille display. "
"[b]Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, Windows[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການໂຕ້ຕອບກັບຕົວອ່ານໜ້າຈໍ (screen reader) ຫຼື ຈໍສະແດງຜົນອັກສອນເບຣວ "
"(Braille display). [b]Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, Windows[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports HDR output. [b]Linux (Wayland), macOS, iOS, visionOS, "
"Windows[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບເອົາພຸດ HDR. [b]Linux (Wayland), macOS, iOS, visionOS, "
"Windows[/b]"

msgid ""
"Display server supports putting the application in picture-in-picture mode. "
"[b]Android[/b]"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີການສະແດງຜົນຮອງຮັບການຕັ້ງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນໂໝດພາບຊ້ອນພາບ (picture-in-picture). "
"[b]Android[/b]"

msgid "Makes the mouse cursor visible if it is hidden."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ເຄີເຊີເມົ້າປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນ ຫາກມັນຖືກຊ່ອນຢູ່."

msgid "Makes the mouse cursor hidden if it is visible."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ເຄີເຊີເມົ້າຖືກຊ່ອນ ຫາກມັນປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນຢູ່."

msgid "Confines the mouse cursor to the game window, and make it visible."
msgstr "ຈຳກັດເຄີເຊີເມົ້າໃຫ້ຢູ່ພາຍໃນໜ້າຕ່າງເກມ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

msgid "Confines the mouse cursor to the game window, and make it hidden."
msgstr "ຈຳກັດເຄີເຊີເມົ້າໃຫ້ຢູ່ພາຍໃນໜ້າຕ່າງເກມ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນຖືກຊ່ອນ."

msgid "Max value of the [enum MouseMode]."
msgstr "ຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງ [enum MouseMode]."

msgid ""
"The ID that refers to a screen that does not exist. This is returned by some "
"[DisplayServer] methods if no screen matches the requested result."
msgstr ""
"ID ທີ່ອ້າງອີງເຖິງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງກັບມາໂດຍບາງວິທີການຂອງ [DisplayServer] "
"ຫາກບໍ່ມີໜ້າຈໍໃດກົງກັບຜົນທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍ."

msgid ""
"Represents the screen containing the mouse pointer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android, iOS, Web, and Linux (Wayland), this constant always "
"represents the screen at index [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ແທນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມີຕົວຊີ້ເມົ້າຕັ້ງຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Android, iOS, Web, ແລະ Linux (Wayland), "
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ນີ້ຈະແທນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ອິນເດັກ [code]0[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Represents the screen containing the window with the keyboard focus.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android, iOS, Web, and Linux (Wayland), this constant always "
"represents the screen at index [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ແທນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມີໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ຖືກໂຟກັດດ້ວຍຄີບອດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Android, iOS, Web, ແລະ Linux (Wayland), "
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ນີ້ຈະແທນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ອິນເດັກ [code]0[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Represents the primary screen.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android, iOS, Web, and Linux (Wayland), this constant always "
"represents the screen at index [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ແທນໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກ (primary screen).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Android, iOS, Web, ແລະ Linux (Wayland), "
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ນີ້ຈະແທນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ອິນເດັກ [code]0[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Represents the screen where the main window is located. This is usually the "
"default value in functions that allow specifying one of several screens.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android, iOS, Web, and Linux (Wayland), this constant always "
"represents the screen at index [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ແທນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກຕັ້ງຢູ່. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນຟັງຊັນທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລະບຸໜ້າຈໍໃດໜຶ່ງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Android, iOS, Web, ແລະ Linux (Wayland), "
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ນີ້ຈະແທນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ອິນເດັກ [code]0[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"The ID of the main window spawned by the engine, which can be passed to "
"methods expecting a [code]window_id[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ID ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍເອນຈິນ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດສົ່ງໃຫ້ວິທີການທີ່ຕ້ອງການ [code]window_id[/"
"code] ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The ID that refers to a nonexistent window. This is returned by some "
"[DisplayServer] methods if no window matches the requested result."
msgstr ""
"ID ທີ່ອ້າງອີງເຖິງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງກັບມາໂດຍບາງວິທີການຂອງ [DisplayServer] "
"ຫາກບໍ່ມີໜ້າຕ່າງໃດກົງກັບຜົນທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍ."

msgid "The ID that refers to a nonexistent application status indicator."
msgstr "ID ທີ່ອ້າງອີງເຖິງຕົວບົ່ງບອກສະຖານະແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່."

msgid "Default landscape orientation."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການວາງແນວນອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Default portrait orientation."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການວາງແນວຕັ້ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Reverse landscape orientation (upside down)."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການວາງແນວນອນແບບປີ້ນ (ກັບຫົວລົງ)."

msgid "Reverse portrait orientation (upside down)."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການວາງແນວຕັ້ງແບບປີ້ນ (ກັບຫົວລົງ)."

msgid ""
"Automatic landscape orientation (default or reverse depending on sensor)."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການວາງແນວນອນອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫຼື ແບບປີ້ນ ຂຶ້ນກັບເຊັນເຊີ)."

msgid "Automatic portrait orientation (default or reverse depending on sensor)."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການວາງແນວຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫຼື ແບບປີ້ນ ຂຶ້ນກັບເຊັນເຊີ)."

msgid ""
"Automatic landscape or portrait orientation (default or reverse depending on "
"sensor)."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການວາງແນວນອນ ຫຼື ແນວຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫຼື ແບບປີ້ນ ຂຶ້ນກັບເຊັນເຊີ)."

msgid "Default text virtual keyboard."
msgstr "ຄີບອດສະເໝືອນສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທົ່ວໄປ."

msgid "Multiline virtual keyboard."
msgstr "ຄີບອດສະເໝືອນແບບຫຼາຍແຖວ."

msgid "Virtual number keypad, useful for PIN entry."
msgstr "ແຜງປຸ່ມຕົວເລກສະເໝືອນ, ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການປ້ອນລະຫັດ PIN."

msgid "Virtual number keypad, useful for entering fractional numbers."
msgstr "ແຜງປຸ່ມຕົວເລກສະເໝືອນ, ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການປ້ອນຕົວເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ."

msgid "Virtual phone number keypad."
msgstr "ແຜງປຸ່ມໝາຍເລກໂທລະສັບສະເໝືອນ."

msgid ""
"Virtual keyboard with additional keys to assist with typing email addresses."
msgstr "ຄີບອດສະເໝືອນທີ່ມີປຸ່ມເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການພິມທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວ."

msgid ""
"Virtual keyboard for entering a password. On most platforms, this should "
"disable autocomplete and autocapitalization.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is not supported on Web. Instead, this behaves identically "
"to [constant KEYBOARD_TYPE_DEFAULT]."
msgstr ""
"ຄີບອດສະເໝືອນສຳລັບການປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ໃນຫຼາຍແພລັດຟອມ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານການຕື່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ແລະ ການປ່ຽນເປັນຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ Web. ແຕ່ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບ [constant KEYBOARD_TYPE_DEFAULT] "
"ແທນ."

msgid "Virtual keyboard with additional keys to assist with typing URLs."
msgstr "ຄີບອດສະເໝືອນທີ່ມີປຸ່ມເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການພິມ URL."

msgid ""
"Arrow cursor shape. This is the default when not pointing anything that "
"overrides the mouse cursor, such as a [LineEdit] or [TextEdit]."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີຮູບລູກສອນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ຊີ້ໃສ່ສິ່ງໃດທີ່ຂຽນທັບເຄີເຊີເມົ້າ, ເຊັ່ນ [LineEdit] ຫຼື "
"[TextEdit]."

msgid ""
"I-beam cursor shape. This is used by default when hovering a control that "
"accepts text input, such as [LineEdit] or [TextEdit]."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີຮູບຕົວໄອ (I-beam). ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເມື່ອວາງເມົ້າໄວ້ເໜືອຄອນໂທຣນທີ່ຮັບການປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ເຊັ່ນ "
"[LineEdit] ຫຼື [TextEdit]."

msgid ""
"Pointing hand cursor shape. This is used by default when hovering a "
"[LinkButton] or a URL tag in a [RichTextLabel]."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີຮູບມືຊີ້. ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເມື່ອວາງເມົ້າໄວ້ເໜືອ [LinkButton] ຫຼື ແທັກ URL ໃນ "
"[RichTextLabel]."

msgid ""
"Crosshair cursor. This is intended to be displayed when the user needs "
"precise aim over an element, such as a rectangle selection tool or a color "
"picker."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີຮູບເປົ້າເລັງ (Crosshair). ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອສະແດງເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງການຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳໃນການເລືອກອົງປະກອບ, "
"ເຊັ່ນ ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກແບບຮູບສີ່ແຈ ຫຼື ຕົວເລືອກສີ."

msgid ""
"Wait cursor. On most cursor themes, this displays a spinning icon [i]besides[/"
"i] the arrow. Intended to be used for non-blocking operations (when the user "
"can do something else at the moment). See also [constant CURSOR_BUSY]."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີລໍຖ້າ (Wait). ໃນທີມເຄີເຊີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສະແດງໄອຄອນໝຸນ [i]ຂ້າງໆ[/i] ລູກສອນ. "
"ມີໄວ້ສຳລັບການປະຕິບັດການທີ່ບໍ່ຂັດຂວາງການເຮັດວຽກ (ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເຮັດສິ່ງອື່ນໄດ້ໃນເວລານັ້ນ). ເບິ່ງ "
"[constant CURSOR_BUSY] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Wait cursor. On most cursor themes, this [i]replaces[/i] the arrow with a "
"spinning icon. Intended to be used for blocking operations (when the user "
"can't do anything else at the moment). See also [constant CURSOR_WAIT]."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີລໍຖ້າ (Wait). ໃນທີມເຄີເຊີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ [i]ແທນທີ່[/i] ລູກສອນດ້ວຍໄອຄອນໝຸນ. "
"ມີໄວ້ສຳລັບການປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຂັດຂວາງການເຮັດວຽກ (ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດສິ່ງອື່ນໄດ້ໃນເວລານັ້ນ). ເບິ່ງ "
"[constant CURSOR_WAIT] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Dragging hand cursor. This is displayed during drag-and-drop operations. See "
"also [constant CURSOR_CAN_DROP]."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີຮູບມືລາກ. ຈະສະແດງໃນລະຫວ່າງການປະຕິບັດການລາກແລ້ວວາງ (drag-and-drop). ເບິ່ງ "
"[constant CURSOR_CAN_DROP] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"\"Can drop\" cursor. This is displayed during drag-and-drop operations if "
"hovering over a [Control] that can accept the drag-and-drop event. On most "
"cursor themes, this displays a dragging hand with an arrow symbol besides it. "
"See also [constant CURSOR_DRAG]."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີ \"ວາງໄດ້\". ຈະສະແດງໃນລະຫວ່າງການປະຕິບັດການລາກແລ້ວວາງ ຫາກວາງເມົ້າໄວ້ເໜືອ [Control] "
"ທີ່ສາມາດຮັບເຫດການລາກແລ້ວວາງໄດ້. ໃນທີມເຄີເຊີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, "
"ຈະສະແດງຮູບມືລາກພ້ອມກັບສັນຍະລັກລູກສອນຢູ່ຂ້າງໆ. ເບິ່ງ [constant CURSOR_DRAG] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Forbidden cursor. This is displayed during drag-and-drop operations if the "
"hovered [Control] can't accept the drag-and-drop event."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີຕ້ອງຫ້າມ. ຈະສະແດງໃນລະຫວ່າງການປະຕິບັດການລາກແລ້ວວາງ ຫາກ [Control] "
"ທີ່ວາງເມົ້າຢູ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບເຫດການລາກແລ້ວວາງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Vertical resize cursor. Intended to be displayed when the hovered [Control] "
"can be vertically resized using the mouse. See also [constant CURSOR_VSPLIT]."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີປັບຂະໜາດແນວຕັ້ງ. ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອສະແດງເມື່ອ [Control] "
"ທີ່ວາງເມົ້າຢູ່ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໃນແນວຕັ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມົ້າ. ເບິ່ງ [constant CURSOR_VSPLIT] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Horizontal resize cursor. Intended to be displayed when the hovered [Control] "
"can be horizontally resized using the mouse. See also [constant "
"CURSOR_HSPLIT]."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີປັບຂະໜາດແນວນອນ. ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອສະແດງເມື່ອ [Control] "
"ທີ່ວາງເມົ້າຢູ່ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໃນແນວນອນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມົ້າ. ເບິ່ງ [constant CURSOR_HSPLIT] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Secondary diagonal resize cursor (top-right/bottom-left). Intended to be "
"displayed when the hovered [Control] can be resized on both axes at once "
"using the mouse."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີປັບຂະໜາດແນວສະແຢງຮອງ (ເທິງຂວາ/ລຸ່ມຊ້າຍ). ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອສະແດງເມື່ອ [Control] "
"ທີ່ວາງເມົ້າຢູ່ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ທັງສອງແກນພ້ອມກັນໂດຍໃຊ້ເມົ້າ."

msgid ""
"Main diagonal resize cursor (top-left/bottom-right). Intended to be displayed "
"when the hovered [Control] can be resized on both axes at once using the "
"mouse."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີປັບຂະໜາດແນວສະແຢງຫຼັກ (ເທິງຊ້າຍ/ລຸ່ມຂວາ). ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອສະແດງເມື່ອ [Control] "
"ທີ່ວາງເມົ້າຢູ່ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ທັງສອງແກນພ້ອມກັນໂດຍໃຊ້ເມົ້າ."

msgid ""
"Move cursor. Intended to be displayed when the hovered [Control] can be moved "
"using the mouse."
msgstr "ເຄີເຊີຍ້າຍ. ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອສະແດງເມື່ອ [Control] ທີ່ວາງເມົ້າຢູ່ສາມາດຍ້າຍໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມົ້າ."

msgid ""
"Vertical split cursor. This is displayed when hovering a [Control] with "
"splits that can be vertically resized using the mouse, such as "
"[VSplitContainer]. On some cursor themes, this cursor may have the same "
"appearance as [constant CURSOR_VSIZE]."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີແຍກແນວຕັ້ງ. ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອວາງເມົ້າໄວ້ເໜືອ [Control] "
"ທີ່ມີການແຍກເຊິ່ງສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດແນວຕັ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມົ້າ, ເຊັ່ນ [VSplitContainer]. ໃນບາງທີມເຄີເຊີ, "
"ເຄີເຊີນີ້ອາດມີລັກສະນະຄືກັນກັບ [constant CURSOR_VSIZE]."

msgid ""
"Horizontal split cursor. This is displayed when hovering a [Control] with "
"splits that can be horizontally resized using the mouse, such as "
"[HSplitContainer]. On some cursor themes, this cursor may have the same "
"appearance as [constant CURSOR_HSIZE]."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີແຍກຕາມລວງນອນ. ມັນຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເລື່ອນເມົາໄປເທິງ [Control] "
"ທີ່ມີສ່ວນແຍກທີ່ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດຕາມລວງນອນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມົາ, ເຊັ່ນ [HSplitContainer]. ໃນບາງທີມເຄີເຊີ, "
"ເຄີເຊີນີ້ອາດຈະມີລັກສະນະຄືກັນກັບ [constant CURSOR_HSIZE]."

msgid ""
"Help cursor. On most cursor themes, this displays a question mark icon "
"instead of the mouse cursor. Intended to be used when the user has requested "
"help on the next element that will be clicked."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ. ໃນທີມເຄີເຊີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ມັນຈະສະແດງເປັນໄອຄອນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳຖາມແທນເຄີເຊີເມົາ. "
"ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງການຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໃນອົງປະກອບຖັດໄປທີ່ຈະຖືກຄລິກ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum CursorShape] enum."
msgstr "ຕົວແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ [enum CursorShape] enum."

msgid "The native file dialog allows selecting one, and only one file."
msgstr "ໄດອາລັອກໄຟລ໌ຂອງລະບົບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ໄຟລ໌ດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "The native file dialog allows selecting multiple files."
msgstr "ໄດອາລັອກໄຟລ໌ຂອງລະບົບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກໄດ້ຫຼາຍໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"The native file dialog only allows selecting a directory, disallowing the "
"selection of any file."
msgstr ""
"ໄດອາລັອກໄຟລ໌ຂອງລະບົບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກໄດ້ສະເພາະໂຟນເດີເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ໂດຍບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ໃດໆ."

msgid "The native file dialog allows selecting one file or directory."
msgstr "ໄດອາລັອກໄຟລ໌ຂອງລະບົບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກໄດ້ໜຶ່ງໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໜຶ່ງໂຟນເດີ."

msgid "The native file dialog will warn when a file exists."
msgstr "ໄດອາລັອກໄຟລ໌ຂອງລະບົບຈະແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອມີໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Windowed mode, i.e. [Window] doesn't occupy the whole screen (unless set to "
"the size of the screen)."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດໜ້າຕ່າງ, ເຊັ່ນ: [Window] ຈະບໍ່ຄອບຄຸມທົ່ວໜ້າຈໍ (ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເທົ່າກັບຂະໜາດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ)."

msgid ""
"Minimized window mode, i.e. [Window] is not visible and available on window "
"manager's window list. Normally happens when the minimize button is pressed."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດຫຍໍ້ໜ້າຕ່າງ, ເຊັ່ນ: [Window] ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ ແຕ່ຍັງມີລາຍຊື່ຢູ່ໃນລາຍການໜ້າຕ່າງຂອງລະບົບ. "
"ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອປຸ່ມຫຍໍ້ (minimize) ຖືກກົດ."

msgid ""
"Maximized window mode, i.e. [Window] will occupy whole screen area except "
"task bar and still display its borders. Normally happens when the maximize "
"button is pressed."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດຂະຫຍາຍໜ້າຕ່າງໃຫຍ່ສຸດ, ເຊັ່ນ: [Window] ຈະຄອບຄຸມພື້ນທີ່ທັງໝົດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ ຍົກເວັ້ນແຖບວຽກ (task "
"bar) ແລະ ຍັງສະແດງຂອບຂອງມັນຢູ່. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອປຸ່ມຂະຫຍາຍໃຫຍ່ສຸດ (maximize) ຖືກກົດ."

msgid ""
"Full screen mode with full multi-window support.\n"
"Full screen window covers the entire display area of a screen and has no "
"decorations. The display's video mode is not changed.\n"
"[b]On Android:[/b] This enables immersive mode.\n"
"[b]On macOS:[/b] A new desktop is used to display the running project.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Regardless of the platform, enabling full screen will change the "
"window size to match the monitor's size. Therefore, make sure your project "
"supports [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/rendering/"
"multiple_resolutions.html]multiple resolutions[/url] when enabling full "
"screen mode."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດເຕັມຈໍ ພ້ອມຮອງຮັບການເຮັດວຽກແບບຫຼາຍໜ້າຕ່າງຢ່າງເຕັມຮູບແບບ.\n"
"ໜ້າຕ່າງແບບເຕັມຈໍຈະຄອບຄຸມພື້ນທີ່ສະແດງຜົນທັງໝົດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຂອບ ຫຼື ການຕົບແຕ່ງ. "
"ໂໝດວິດີໂອຂອງຈໍສະແດງຜົນຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"[b]ໃນ Android:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂໝດ immersive.\n"
"[b]ໃນ macOS:[/b] ເດັສທັອບໃໝ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນແພລັດຟອມໃດ, "
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານເຕັມຈໍຈະປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງໃຫ້ກົງກັບຂະໜາດຂອງຈໍພາບ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຄວນແນ່ໃຈວ່າໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານຮອງຮັບ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/rendering/"
"multiple_resolutions.html]ຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ[/url] ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂໝດເຕັມຈໍ."

msgid ""
"A single window full screen mode. This mode has less overhead, but only one "
"window can be open on a given screen at a time (opening a child window or "
"application switching will trigger a full screen transition).\n"
"Full screen window covers the entire display area of a screen and has no "
"border or decorations. The display's video mode is not changed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This mode might not work with screen recording software.\n"
"[b]On Android:[/b] This enables immersive mode.\n"
"[b]On Windows:[/b] Depending on video driver, full screen transition might "
"cause screens to go black for a moment.\n"
"[b]On macOS:[/b] A new desktop is used to display the running project. "
"Exclusive full screen mode prevents Dock and Menu from showing up when the "
"mouse pointer is hovering the edge of the screen.\n"
"[b]On Linux (X11):[/b] Exclusive full screen mode bypasses compositor.\n"
"[b]On Linux (Wayland):[/b] Equivalent to [constant WINDOW_MODE_FULLSCREEN].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Regardless of the platform, enabling full screen will change the "
"window size to match the monitor's size. Therefore, make sure your project "
"supports [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/rendering/"
"multiple_resolutions.html]multiple resolutions[/url] when enabling full "
"screen mode."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດເຕັມຈໍແບບໜ້າຕ່າງດຽວ. ໂໝດນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນໜ້ອຍກວ່າ, "
"ແຕ່ສາມາດເປີດໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ໜ້າຕ່າງດຽວໃນແຕ່ລະໜ້າຈໍໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ (ການເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງຍ່ອຍ ຫຼື "
"ການສະຫຼັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການປ່ຽນແປງໜ້າຈໍ).\n"
"ໜ້າຕ່າງເຕັມຈໍຈະຄອບຄຸມພື້ນທີ່ທັງໝົດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຂອບ ຫຼື ການຕົບແຕ່ງ. "
"ໂໝດວິດີໂອຂອງຈໍສະແດງຜົນຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂໝດນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກກັບຊອບແວບັນທຶກວິດີໂອໜ້າຈໍ.\n"
"[b]ໃນ Android:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂໝດ immersive.\n"
"[b]ໃນ Windows:[/b] ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບໄດຣເວີວິດີໂອ, ການປ່ຽນເປັນໂໝດເຕັມຈໍອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໜ້າຈໍດຳໄປໄລຍະໜຶ່ງ.\n"
"[b]ໃນ macOS:[/b] ເດັສທັອບໃໝ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ. ໂໝດເຕັມຈໍແບບພິເສດ "
"(Exclusive) ຈະປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ Dock ແລະ Menu ສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາເມື່ອເລື່ອນເມົາໄປທີ່ຂອບໜ້າຈໍ.\n"
"[b]ໃນ Linux (X11):[/b] ໂໝດເຕັມຈໍແບບພິເສດຈະຂ້າມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ compositor.\n"
"[b]ໃນ Linux (Wayland):[/b] ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [constant WINDOW_MODE_FULLSCREEN].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນແພລັດຟອມໃດ, "
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານເຕັມຈໍຈະປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງໃຫ້ກົງກັບຂະໜາດຂອງຈໍພາບ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຄວນແນ່ໃຈວ່າໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານຮອງຮັບ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/rendering/"
"multiple_resolutions.html]ຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ[/url] ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂໝດເຕັມຈໍ."

msgid "Stops displaying progress and returns the button to its normal state."
msgstr "ຢຸດການສະແດງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າ ແລະ ຄືນຄ່າປຸ່ມກັບສູ່ສະພາບປົກກະຕິ."

msgid ""
"The progress indicator shows an indeterminate progress.\n"
"On Windows, the progress indicator does not grow in size, but cycles "
"repeatedly along the length of the taskbar button by default."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຊີ້ບອກຄວາມຄືບໜ້າສະແດງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້.\n"
"ໃນ Windows, ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຕົວຊີ້ບອກຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຈະບໍ່ເພີ່ມຂະໜາດຂຶ້ນ "
"ແຕ່ຈະສະແດງເປັນຮອບວຽນຊ້ຳໆຕາມລວງຍາວຂອງປຸ່ມເທິງແຖບວຽກ (taskbar)."

msgid "The progress indicator shows progress normally."
msgstr "ຕົວຊີ້ບອກຄວາມຄືບໜ້າສະແດງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຕາມປົກກະຕິ."

msgid ""
"The progress indicator shows that an error has occurred.\n"
"On Windows, the progress indicator turns red by default to show that an error "
"has occurred in one of the windows that is broadcasting progress."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຊີ້ບອກຄວາມຄືບໜ້າສະແດງວ່າເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"ໃນ Windows, ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຕົວຊີ້ບອກຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຈະປ່ຽນເປັນສີແດງ "
"ເພື່ອສະແດງວ່າເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂຶ້ນໃນໜຶ່ງໃນໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ກຳລັງສະແດງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຢູ່."

msgid ""
"The progress indicator shows it was paused.\n"
"On Windows, the progress indicator turns yellow by default to show that "
"progress is currently stopped in one of the windows but can be resumed by the "
"user."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຊີ້ບອກຄວາມຄືບໜ້າສະແດງວ່າຖືກຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ.\n"
"ໃນ Windows, ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຕົວຊີ້ບອກຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຈະປ່ຽນເປັນສີເຫຼືອງ "
"ເພື່ອສະແດງວ່າຄວາມຄືບໜ້າໃນໜຶ່ງໃນໜ້າຕ່າງນັ້ນໄດ້ຢຸດລົງແລ້ວ ແຕ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດສືບຕໍ່ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The window can't be resized by dragging its resize grip. It's still possible "
"to resize the window using [method window_set_size]. This flag is ignored for "
"full screen windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on Linux (X11), macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າຕ່າງບໍ່ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໂດຍການລາກຂອບ. ແຕ່ຍັງຄົງສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"window_set_size]. ແຟລັກ (flag) ນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງແບບເຕັມຈໍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຟລັກນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ Linux (X11), macOS, ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"The window do not have native title bar and other decorations. This flag is "
"ignored for full-screen windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, and "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະບໍ່ມີແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ (title bar) ແລະ ການຕົບແຕ່ງອື່ນໆຂອງລະບົບ. "
"ແຟລັກນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງແບບເຕັມຈໍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຟລັກນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"The window is floating on top of all other windows. This flag is ignored for "
"full-screen windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on Linux (X11), macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະລອຍຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ. ແຟລັກນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງແບບເຕັມຈໍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຟລັກນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ Linux (X11), macOS, ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"The window background can be transparent.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag has no effect if [method "
"is_window_transparency_available] returns [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Transparency support is implemented on Linux (X11/Wayland), "
"macOS, and Windows, but availability might vary depending on GPU driver, "
"display manager, and compositor capabilities.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Transparency support is implemented on Android, but can only be "
"enabled via [member ProjectSettings.display/window/per_pixel_transparency/"
"allowed]. This flag has no effect on Android."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງສາມາດໂປ່ງໃສໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຟລັກນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫາກ [method is_window_transparency_available] "
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຮອງຮັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສມີຢູ່ໃນ Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, ແລະ Windows, "
"ແຕ່ການໃຊ້ງານອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມໄດຣເວີ GPU, ຕົວຈັດການການສະແດງຜົນ ແລະ ຄວາມສາມາດຂອງ "
"compositor.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຮອງຮັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສມີຢູ່ໃນ Android, ແຕ່ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ຜ່ານ [member "
"ProjectSettings.display/window/per_pixel_transparency/allowed] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ແຟລັກນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນ Android."

msgid ""
"The window can't be focused. No-focus window will ignore all input, except "
"mouse clicks.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on Linux (X11), macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າຕ່າງບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບໂຟກັສໄດ້. ໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ບໍ່ມີໂຟກັສຈະລະເວັ້ນການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດ ຍົກເວັ້ນການຄລິກເມົາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຟລັກນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ Linux (X11), macOS, ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Window is part of menu or [OptionButton] dropdown. This flag can't be changed "
"when the window is visible. An active popup window will exclusively receive "
"all input, without stealing focus from its parent. Popup windows are "
"automatically closed when uses click outside it, or when an application is "
"switched. Popup window must have transient parent set (see [method "
"window_set_transient]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, and "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າຕ່າງເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງເມນູ ຫຼື [OptionButton] ແບບດຣັອບດາວ. "
"ແຟລັກນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຖືກສະແດງຢູ່. ໜ້າຕ່າງປັອບອັບ (popup) "
"ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຈະຮັບການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດໂດຍສະເພາະ ໂດຍບໍ່ແຍ່ງໂຟກັສຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກ (parent). "
"ໜ້າຕ່າງປັອບອັບຈະຖືກປິດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄລິກຂ້າງນອກ ຫຼື ເມື່ອມີການສະຫຼັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. "
"ໜ້າຕ່າງປັອບອັບຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ transient parent (ເບິ່ງ [method window_set_transient]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຟລັກນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Window content is expanded to the full size of the window. Unlike borderless "
"window, the frame is left intact and can be used to resize the window, title "
"bar is transparent, but have minimize/maximize/close buttons.\n"
"Use [method window_set_window_buttons_offset] to adjust minimize/maximize/"
"close buttons offset.\n"
"Use [method window_get_safe_title_margins] to determine area under the title "
"bar that is not covered by decorations.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ເນື້ອໃນຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຖືກຂະຫຍາຍໃຫ້ເຕັມຂະໜາດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ. ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ບໍ່ມີຂອບ, "
"ກອບຍັງຄົງຢູ່ແລະສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງໄດ້, ແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ຈະໂປ່ງໃສ ແຕ່ຍັງມີປຸ່ມຫຍໍ້/ຂະຫຍາຍ/ປິດ.\n"
"ໃຊ້ [method window_set_window_buttons_offset] ເພື່ອປັບຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງປຸ່ມຫຍໍ້/ຂະຫຍາຍ/ປິດ.\n"
"ໃຊ້ [method window_get_safe_title_margins] "
"ເພື່ອກວດສອບພື້ນທີ່ໃຕ້ແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຄອບຄຸມໂດຍການຕົບແຕ່ງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຟລັກນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Window style is overridden, forcing sharp corners.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented only on Windows (11)."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ ໂດຍບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີມຸມທີ່ແຫຼມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຟລັກນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Windows (11) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Window is excluded from screenshots taken by [method screen_get_image], "
"[method screen_get_image_rect], and [method screen_get_pixel].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on macOS and Windows (10, 20H1).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this flag will prevent standard screenshot methods from "
"capturing a window image, but does [b]NOT[/b] guarantee that other apps won't "
"be able to capture an image. It should not be used as a DRM or security "
"measure."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການຖ່າຍຮູບໜ້າຈໍດ້ວຍ [method screen_get_image], [method "
"screen_get_image_rect], ແລະ [method screen_get_pixel].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຟລັກນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ macOS ແລະ Windows (10, 20H1).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຟລັກນີ້ຈະປ້ອງກັນວິທີການຖ່າຍຮູບໜ້າຈໍແບບມາດຕະຖານບໍ່ໃຫ້ຈັບພາບໜ້າຕ່າງໄດ້, ແຕ່ "
"[b]ບໍ່[/b] ໄດ້ຮັບປະກັນວ່າແອັບອື່ນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຈັບພາບໄດ້. ມັນບໍ່ຄວນຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນມາດຕະການ DRM ຫຼື "
"ຄວາມປອດໄພ."

msgid ""
"Signals the window manager that this window is supposed to be an "
"implementation-defined \"popup\" (usually a floating, borderless, untileable "
"and immovable child window).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on Linux (Wayland)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານບອກຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງວ່າໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້ຄວນຈະເປັນ \"ປັອບອັບ\" ຕາມການກຳນົດ "
"(ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນໜ້າຕ່າງຍ່ອຍທີ່ລອຍຢູ່, ບໍ່ມີຂອບ, ແລະ ຍ້າຍບໍ່ໄດ້).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຟລັກນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ Linux (Wayland)."

msgid ""
"Window minimize button is disabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on Linux (X11), macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມຫຍໍ້ໜ້າຕ່າງຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຟລັກນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ Linux (X11), macOS, ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Window maximize button is disabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on Linux (X11), macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມຂະຫຍາຍໜ້າຕ່າງຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຟລັກນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ Linux (X11), macOS, ແລະ Windows."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum WindowFlags] enum."
msgstr "ຕົວແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ [enum WindowFlags] enum."

msgid "Sent when the mouse pointer enters the window."
msgstr "ສົ່ງເມື່ອຕົວຊີ້ເມົາເລື່ອນເຂົ້າມາໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ."

msgid "Sent when the mouse pointer exits the window."
msgstr "ສົ່ງເມື່ອຕົວຊີ້ເມົາເລື່ອນອອກຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງ."

msgid "Sent when the window grabs focus."
msgstr "ສົ່ງເມື່ອໜ້າຕ່າງໄດ້ຮັບໂຟກັສ."

msgid "Sent when the window loses focus."
msgstr "ສົ່ງເມື່ອໜ້າຕ່າງເສຍໂຟກັສ."

msgid ""
"Sent when the user has attempted to close the window (e.g. close button is "
"pressed)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ພະຍາຍາມປິດໜ້າຕ່າງ (ເຊັ່ນ: ກົດປຸ່ມປິດ)."

msgid ""
"Sent when the device \"Back\" button is pressed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This event is implemented only on Android."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງເມື່ອປຸ່ມ \"Back\" (ກັບຄືນ) ຂອງອຸປະກອນຖືກກົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເຫດການນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Android ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sent when the window is moved to the display with different DPI, or display "
"DPI is changed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented only on macOS and Linux (Wayland)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງເມື່ອໜ້າຕ່າງຖືກຍ້າຍໄປຍັງຈໍສະແດງຜົນທີ່ມີຄ່າ DPI ຕ່າງກັນ, ຫຼື ຄ່າ DPI ຂອງຈໍສະແດງຜົນມີການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຟລັກນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ macOS ແລະ Linux (Wayland) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sent when the window title bar decoration is changed (e.g. [constant "
"WINDOW_FLAG_EXTEND_TO_TITLE] is set or window entered/exited full screen "
"mode).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງເມື່ອການຕົບແຕ່ງແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ໜ້າຕ່າງມີການປ່ຽນແປງ (ເຊັ່ນ: ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [constant "
"WINDOW_FLAG_EXTEND_TO_TITLE] ຫຼື ໜ້າຕ່າງເຂົ້າ/ອອກຈາກໂໝດເຕັມຈໍ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຟລັກນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sent when the window has been forcibly closed by the display server. The "
"window will immediately hide and clean any internal rendering references.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented only on Linux (Wayland)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງເມື່ອໜ້າຕ່າງຖືກບັງຄັບປິດໂດຍເຊີເວີສະແດງຜົນ. ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງທັນທີ ແລະ "
"ລຶບການອ້າງອີງການເຣັນເດີພາຍໃນທັງໝົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຟລັກນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Linux (Wayland) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sent when the output max linear value returned by [method "
"Window.get_output_max_linear_value] has changed.\n"
"This occurs when HDR output is enabled or disabled and when any HDR output "
"luminance values of the window have changed, such as when the player adjusts "
"their screen brightness setting or moves the window to a different screen."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງເມື່ອຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງ output linear ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນໂດຍ [method "
"Window.get_output_max_linear_value] ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອ output HDR ຖືກເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ເມື່ອຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ HDR "
"ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງມີການປ່ຽນແປງ, ເຊັ່ນ: ເມື່ອຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ ຫຼື ຍ້າຍໜ້າຕ່າງໄປຍັງໜ້າຈໍອື່ນ."

msgid "Top-left edge of a window."
msgstr "ຂອບເທິງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ."

msgid "Top edge of a window."
msgstr "ຂອບເທິງຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ."

msgid "Top-right edge of a window."
msgstr "ຂອບເທິງເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ."

msgid "Left edge of a window."
msgstr "ຂອບເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ."

msgid "Right edge of a window."
msgstr "ຂອບເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ."

msgid "Bottom-left edge of a window."
msgstr "ຂອບລຸ່ມເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ."

msgid "Bottom edge of a window."
msgstr "ຂອບລຸ່ມຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ."

msgid "Bottom-right edge of a window."
msgstr "ຂອບລຸ່ມເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum WindowResizeEdge] enum."
msgstr "ຕົວແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ [enum WindowResizeEdge] enum."

msgid ""
"Default vertical synchronization mode, the image is displayed only on "
"vertical blanking intervals (no tearing is visible). Framerate is limited by "
"the monitor refresh rate (regardless of [member Engine.max_fps])."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການຊິງໂຄໄນແນວຕັ້ງແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຮູບພາບຈະຖືກສະແດງສະເພາະໃນຊ່ວງໄລຍະຫວ່າງແນວຕັ້ງ (vertical "
"blanking intervals) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ຈະບໍ່ເຫັນພາບຂາດ). "
"ອັດຕາເຟຣມຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊຂອງໜ້າຈໍ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member Engine.max_fps] "
"ໄວ້ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ)."

msgid ""
"Behaves like [constant VSYNC_DISABLED] when the framerate drops below the "
"screen's refresh rate to reduce stuttering (tearing may be visible). "
"Otherwise, vertical synchronization is enabled to avoid tearing. Framerate is "
"limited by the monitor refresh rate (regardless of [member Engine.max_fps]). "
"Behaves like [constant VSYNC_ENABLED] when using the Compatibility rendering "
"method."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບ [constant VSYNC_DISABLED] ເມື່ອອັດຕາເຟຣມຫຼຸດລົງຕ່ຳກວ່າອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊຂອງໜ້າຈໍ "
"ເພື່ອຫຼຸດການກະຕຸກ (ອາດຈະເຫັນພາບຂາດ). ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການຊິງໂຄໄນແນວຕັ້ງເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນພາບຂາດ. "
"ອັດຕາເຟຣມຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊຂອງໜ້າຈໍ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member Engine.max_fps] "
"ໄວ້ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ). ຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບ [constant VSYNC_ENABLED] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣັນເດີແບບ "
"Compatibility."

msgid ""
"Display handle:\n"
"- Linux (X11): [code]X11::Display*[/code] for the display.\n"
"- Linux (Wayland): [code]wl_display[/code] for the display.\n"
"- Android: [code]EGLDisplay[/code] for the display."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຈັດການການສະແດງຜົນ (Display handle):\n"
"- Linux (X11): [code]X11::Display*[/code] ສຳລັບຈໍສະແດງຜົນ.\n"
"- Linux (Wayland): [code]wl_display[/code] ສຳລັບຈໍສະແດງຜົນ.\n"
"- Android: [code]EGLDisplay[/code] ສຳລັບຈໍສະແດງຜົນ."

msgid ""
"Window handle:\n"
"- Windows: [code]HWND[/code] for the window.\n"
"- Linux (X11): [code]X11::Window*[/code] for the window.\n"
"- Linux (Wayland): [code]wl_surface[/code] for the window.\n"
"- macOS: [code]NSWindow*[/code] for the window.\n"
"- iOS: [code]UIViewController*[/code] for the view controller.\n"
"- Android: [code]jObject[/code] for the activity."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງ (Window handle):\n"
"- Windows: [code]HWND[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ.\n"
"- Linux (X11): [code]X11::Window*[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ.\n"
"- Linux (Wayland): [code]wl_surface[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ.\n"
"- macOS: [code]NSWindow*[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ.\n"
"- iOS: [code]UIViewController*[/code] ສຳລັບຕົວຄວບຄຸມວິວ.\n"
"- Android: [code]jObject[/code] ສຳລັບກິດຈະກຳ (activity)."

msgid ""
"Window view:\n"
"- Windows: [code]HDC[/code] for the window (only with the Compatibility "
"renderer).\n"
"- macOS: [code]NSView*[/code] for the window main view.\n"
"- iOS: [code]UIView*[/code] for the window main view."
msgstr ""
"ວິວໜ້າຕ່າງ (Window view):\n"
"- Windows: [code]HDC[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ (ສະເພາະກັບ Compatibility renderer "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ).\n"
"- macOS: [code]NSView*[/code] ສຳລັບວິວຫຼັກຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ.\n"
"- iOS: [code]UIView*[/code] ສຳລັບວິວຫຼັກຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ."

msgid ""
"OpenGL context (only with the Compatibility renderer):\n"
"- Windows: [code]HGLRC[/code] for the window (native GL), or "
"[code]EGLContext[/code] for the window (ANGLE).\n"
"- Linux (X11): [code]GLXContext*[/code] for the window.\n"
"- Linux (Wayland): [code]EGLContext[/code] for the window.\n"
"- macOS: [code]NSOpenGLContext*[/code] for the window (native GL), or "
"[code]EGLContext[/code] for the window (ANGLE).\n"
"- Android: [code]EGLContext[/code] for the window."
msgstr ""
"OpenGL context (ສະເພາະກັບ Compatibility renderer ເທົ່ານັ້ນ):\n"
"- Windows: [code]HGLRC[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ (native GL), ຫຼື [code]EGLContext[/"
"code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ (ANGLE).\n"
"- Linux (X11): [code]GLXContext*[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ.\n"
"- Linux (Wayland): [code]EGLContext[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ.\n"
"- macOS: [code]NSOpenGLContext*[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ (native GL), ຫຼື "
"[code]EGLContext[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ (ANGLE).\n"
"- Android: [code]EGLContext[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ."

msgid ""
"- Windows: [code]EGLDisplay[/code] for the window (ANGLE).\n"
"- macOS: [code]EGLDisplay[/code] for the window (ANGLE).\n"
"- Linux (Wayland): [code]EGLDisplay[/code] for the window."
msgstr ""
"- Windows: [code]EGLDisplay[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ (ANGLE).\n"
"- macOS: [code]EGLDisplay[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ (ANGLE).\n"
"- Linux (Wayland): [code]EGLDisplay[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ."

msgid ""
"- Windows: [code]EGLConfig[/code] for the window (ANGLE).\n"
"- macOS: [code]EGLConfig[/code] for the window (ANGLE).\n"
"- Linux (Wayland): [code]EGLConfig[/code] for the window."
msgstr ""
"- Windows: [code]EGLConfig[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ (ANGLE).\n"
"- macOS: [code]EGLConfig[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ (ANGLE).\n"
"- Linux (Wayland): [code]EGLConfig[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ."

msgid ""
"The GLX [code]VisualID[/code] for the window.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only available on Linux when using X11."
msgstr ""
"GLX [code]VisualID[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ Linux ເມື່ອໃຊ້ X11 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The [code]GLXFBConfig[/code] for the window.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only available on Linux when using X11."
msgstr ""
"[code]GLXFBConfig[/code] ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ Linux ເມື່ອໃຊ້ X11 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Utterance has begun to be spoken."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການເວົ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມ (Utterance)."

msgid "Utterance was successfully finished."
msgstr "ເວົ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

msgid "Utterance was canceled, or TTS service was unable to process it."
msgstr "ການເວົ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມຖືກຍົກເລີກ ຫຼື ບໍລິການ TTS ບໍ່ສາມາດປະມວນຜົນໄດ້."

msgid "Utterance reached a word or sentence boundary."
msgstr "ການເວົ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມມາຮອດຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຄຳສັບ ຫຼື ປະໂຫຍກ."

msgid "An automatically scalable [Texture2D] based on an SVG image."
msgstr "[Texture2D] ທີ່ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຮູບພາບ SVG."

msgid ""
"An automatically scalable [Texture2D] based on an SVG image. [DPITexture]s "
"are used to automatically re-rasterize icons and other texture based UI theme "
"elements to match viewport scale and font oversampling. See also [member "
"ProjectSettings.display/window/stretch/mode] (\"canvas_items\" mode) and "
"[member Viewport.oversampling_override]."
msgstr ""
"[Texture2D] ທີ່ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຮູບພາບ SVG. [DPITexture] "
"ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອແປງໄອຄອນ ແລະ ອົງປະກອບທີມ UI ທີ່ອີງໃສ່ເທັກເຈີ (texture) ໃຫ້ເປັນຣັສເຕີ (rasterize) "
"ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບຂະໜາດຂອງ viewport ແລະ ການເຮັດ font oversampling. "
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [member ProjectSettings.display/window/stretch/mode] (ໂໝດ "
"\"canvas_items\") ແລະ [member Viewport.oversampling_override]."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [DPITexture] and initializes it by allocating and setting the "
"SVG data to [param source]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [DPITexture] ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນມັນໂດຍການຈັດສັນ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນ SVG ໄປທີ່ [param source]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [RID] of the texture rasterized to match the oversampling of the "
"currently drawn canvas item."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ຂອງເທັກເຈີທີ່ຖືກແປງເປັນຣັສເຕີ (rasterized) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບ oversampling ຂອງ "
"canvas item ທີ່ກຳລັງແຕ້ມຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Returns this SVG texture's source code."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊອດໂຄ້ດ (source code) ຂອງເທັກເຈີ SVG ນີ້."

msgid "Resizes the texture to the specified dimensions."
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດເທັກເຈີໃຫ້ເປັນໄປຕາມຂະໜາດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid "Sets this SVG texture's source code."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊອດໂຄ້ດ (source code) ຂອງເທັກເຈີ SVG ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Texture scale. [code]1.0[/code] is the original SVG size. Higher values "
"result in a larger image."
msgstr ""
"ມາດຕາສ່ວນເທັກເຈີ. [code]1.0[/code] ແມ່ນຂະໜາດເດີມຂອງ SVG. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບພາບໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "If set, remaps texture colors according to [Color]-[Color] map."
msgstr "ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, ຈະປ່ຽນສີຂອງເທັກເຈີຕາມແຜນຜັງ [Color]-[Color]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], puts pixels of the same surrounding color in transition "
"from transparent to opaque areas. For textures displayed with bilinear "
"filtering, this helps to reduce the outline effect when exporting images from "
"an image editor."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະວາງພິກເຊວທີ່ມີສີດຽວກັນກັບບໍລິເວນອ້ອມຂ້າງໃນຊ່ວງການປ່ຽນຈາກພື້ນທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສໄປຫາພື້ນທີ່ທຶບແສງ. "
"ສຳລັບເທັກເຈີທີ່ສະແດງດ້ວຍ bilinear filtering, "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດເອັບເຟັກເສັ້ນຂອບເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບຈາກໂປຣແກຣມແກ້ໄຂຮູບພາບ."

msgid ""
"An alternative to fixing darkened borders with [member fix_alpha_border] is "
"to use premultiplied alpha. By enabling this option, the texture will be "
"converted to this format. A premultiplied alpha texture requires specific "
"materials to be displayed correctly:\n"
"- In 2D, a [CanvasItemMaterial] will need to be created and configured to use "
"the [constant CanvasItemMaterial.BLEND_MODE_PREMULT_ALPHA] blend mode on "
"[CanvasItem]s that use this texture. In custom [code]canvas_item[/code] "
"shaders, [code]render_mode blend_premul_alpha;[/code] should be used.\n"
"- In 3D, a [BaseMaterial3D] will need to be created and configured to use the "
"[constant BaseMaterial3D.BLEND_MODE_PREMULT_ALPHA] blend mode on materials "
"that use this texture. In custom [code]spatial[/code] shaders, "
"[code]render_mode blend_premul_alpha;[/code] should be used."
msgstr ""
"ທາງເລືອກອື່ນໃນການແກ້ໄຂຂອບທີ່ມືດດ້ວຍ [member fix_alpha_border] ແມ່ນການໃຊ້ premultiplied "
"alpha. ໂດຍການເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ເທັກເຈີຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນຮູບແບບນີ້. ເທັກເຈີແບບ premultiplied "
"alpha ຕ້ອງການວັດສະດຸ (material) ທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະແດງຜົນໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ:\n"
"- ໃນ 2D, ຈະຕ້ອງສ້າງ [CanvasItemMaterial] ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂໝດການຜະສົມ [constant "
"CanvasItemMaterial.BLEND_MODE_PREMULT_ALPHA] ໃນ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີນີ້. ໃນ "
"custom [code]canvas_item[/code] shaders, ຄວນໃຊ້ [code]render_mode "
"blend_premul_alpha;[/code].\n"
"- ໃນ 3D, ຈະຕ້ອງສ້າງ [BaseMaterial3D] ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂໝດການຜະສົມ [constant "
"BaseMaterial3D.BLEND_MODE_PREMULT_ALPHA] ໃນວັດສະດຸທີ່ໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີນີ້. ໃນ custom "
"[code]spatial[/code] shaders, ຄວນໃຊ້ [code]render_mode blend_premul_alpha;[/"
"code]."

msgid "Overrides texture saturation."
msgstr "ຂຽນທັບຄ່າຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ (saturation) ຂອງເທັກເຈີ."

msgid "A 2D texture that supports drawing to itself via Blit calls."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີ 2D ທີ່ຮອງຮັບການແຕ້ມລົງໃນຕົວເອງຜ່ານການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ Blit."

msgid ""
"A 2D texture that can be modified via blit calls, copying from a target "
"texture to itself. Primarily intended to be managed in code, a user must call "
"[method setup] to initialize the state before drawing. Each [method "
"blit_rect] call takes at least a rectangle, the area to draw to, and another "
"texture, what to be drawn. The draw calls use a Texture_Blit Shader to "
"process and calculate the result, pixel by pixel. Users can supply their own "
"ShaderMaterial with custom Texture_Blit shaders for more complex behaviors."
msgstr ""
"ເທັກເຈີ 2D ທີ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ຜ່ານການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ blit, ໂດຍການກັອບປີ້ຈາກເທັກເຈີເປົ້າໝາຍມາໃສ່ຕົວເອງ. "
"ໂດຍຫຼັກແລ້ວມີໄວ້ເພື່ອຈັດການໃນໂຄ້ດ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method setup] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສະຖານະກ່ອນການແຕ້ມ. "
"ແຕ່ລະການເອີ້ນ [method blit_rect] ຈະຮັບເອົາຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກ (rectangle), ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຈະແຕ້ມໃສ່, ແລະ "
"ເທັກເຈີອື່ນທີ່ຈະນຳມາແຕ້ມ. ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ການແຕ້ມຈະໃຊ້ Texture_Blit Shader ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນ ແລະ "
"ຄິດໄລ່ຜົນລັບແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ ShaderMaterial ຂອງຕົນເອງພ້ອມກັບ custom "
"Texture_Blit shaders ເພື່ອການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Draws to given [param rect] on this texture by copying from the given [param "
"source]. A [param modulate] color can be passed in for the shader to use, but "
"defaults to White. The [param mipmap] value can specify a draw to a lower "
"mipmap level. The [param material] parameter can take a ShaderMaterial with a "
"TextureBlit Shader for custom drawing behavior."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມລົງໃນ [param rect] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນເທັກເຈີນີ້ ໂດຍການກັອບປີ້ຈາກ [param source] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. "
"ສາມາດສົ່ງຄ່າສີ [param modulate] ໄປໃຫ້ shader ໃຊ້ໄດ້, ແຕ່ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນສີຂາວ. ຄ່າ [param "
"mipmap] ສາມາດລະບຸການແຕ້ມໄປຍັງລະດັບ mipmap ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າໄດ້. ພາຣາມິເຕີ [param material] "
"ສາມາດຮັບ ShaderMaterial ພ້ອມກັບ TextureBlit Shader ສຳລັບພຶດຕິກຳການແຕ້ມແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"Draws to the given [param rect] on this texture, as well as on up to 3 "
"DrawableTexture [param extra_targets]. All [param extra_targets] must be the "
"same size and DrawableFormat as the original target, otherwise the Shader may "
"fail. Expects up to 4 Texture [param sources], but will replace missing "
"[param sources] with default Black Textures."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມລົງໃນ [param rect] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນເທັກເຈີນີ້, ລວມທັງໃນ DrawableTexture [param "
"extra_targets] ໄດ້ສູງສຸດ 3 ອັນ. ທຸກໆ [param extra_targets] ຕ້ອງມີຂະໜາດ ແລະ "
"DrawableFormat ດຽວກັນກັບເປົ້າໝາຍເດີມ, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ Shader ອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກຜິດພາດ. ຮອງຮັບ Texture "
"[param sources] ສູງສຸດ 4 ອັນ, ແຕ່ຈະປ່ຽນ [param sources] ທີ່ຫາຍໄປດ້ວຍເທັກເຈີສີດຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Re-calculates the mipmaps for this texture on demand."
msgstr "ຄິດໄລ່ mipmaps ໃໝ່ສຳລັບເທັກເຈີນີ້ເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if mipmaps are set to be used on this "
"DrawableTexture."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ mipmaps ໃນ DrawableTexture ນີ້."

msgid "Sets the format of this DrawableTexture."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບແບບ (format) ຂອງ DrawableTexture ນີ້."

msgid "Sets if mipmaps should be used on this DrawableTexture."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຄວນໃຊ້ mipmaps ໃນ DrawableTexture ນີ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Initializes the DrawableTexture to a White texture of the given [param "
"width], [param height], and [param format]."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ DrawableTexture ໃຫ້ເປັນເທັກເຈີສີຂາວຕາມ [param width], [param height], ແລະ "
"[param format] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format RGBA with four components, each with a bitdepth of 8."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບເທັກເຈີ OpenGL ແບບ RGBA ທີ່ມີສີ່ສ່ວນປະກອບ, ແຕ່ລະສ່ວນມີ bitdepth ເທົ່າກັບ 8."

msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format GL_RGBA16F where there are four components, each a 16-"
"bit \"half-precision\" floating-point value."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບເທັກເຈີ OpenGL ແບບ GL_RGBA16F ເຊິ່ງມີສີ່ສ່ວນປະກອບ, ແຕ່ລະສ່ວນເປັນຄ່າ floating-point "
"ແບບ \"half-precision\" ຂະໜາດ 16 ບິດ."

msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format GL_RGBA32F where there are four components, each a 32-"
"bit floating-point value."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບເທັກເຈີ OpenGL ແບບ GL_RGBA32F ເຊິ່ງມີສີ່ສ່ວນປະກອບ, ແຕ່ລະສ່ວນເປັນຄ່າ floating-point "
"ຂະໜາດ 32 ບິດ."

msgid "Helper class to implement a DTLS server."
msgstr "ຄລາສຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອສຳລັບການຈັດການ DTLS ເຊີເວີ."

msgid ""
"This class is used to store the state of a DTLS server. Upon [method setup] "
"it converts connected [PacketPeerUDP] to [PacketPeerDTLS] accepting them via "
"[method take_connection] as DTLS clients. Under the hood, this class is used "
"to store the DTLS state and cookies of the server. The reason of why the "
"state and cookies are needed is outside of the scope of this documentation.\n"
"Below a small example of how to use it:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# server_node.gd\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var dtls = DTLSServer.new()\n"
"var server = UDPServer.new()\n"
"var peers = []\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tserver.listen(4242)\n"
"\tvar key = load(\"key.key\") # Your private key.\n"
"\tvar cert = load(\"cert.crt\") # Your X509 certificate.\n"
"\tdtls.setup(TlsOptions.server(key, cert))\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\twhile server.is_connection_available():\n"
"\t\tvar peer = server.take_connection()\n"
"\t\tvar dtls_peer = dtls.take_connection(peer)\n"
"\t\tif dtls_peer.get_status() != PacketPeerDTLS.STATUS_HANDSHAKING:\n"
"\t\t\tcontinue # It is normal that 50% of the connections fails due to cookie "
"exchange.\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Peer connected!\")\n"
"\t\tpeers.append(dtls_peer)\n"
"\n"
"\tfor p in peers:\n"
"\t\tp.poll() # Must poll to update the state.\n"
"\t\tif p.get_status() == PacketPeerDTLS.STATUS_CONNECTED:\n"
"\t\t\twhile p.get_available_packet_count() > 0:\n"
"\t\t\t\tprint(\"Received message from client: %s\" % "
"p.get_packet().get_string_from_utf8())\n"
"\t\t\t\tp.put_packet(\"Hello DTLS client\".to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// ServerNode.cs\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"public partial class ServerNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate DtlsServer _dtls = new DtlsServer();\n"
"\tprivate UdpServer _server = new UdpServer();\n"
"\tprivate Godot.Collections.Array<PacketPeerDtls> _peers = [];\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_server.Listen(4242);\n"
"\t\tvar key = GD.Load<CryptoKey>(\"key.key\"); // Your private key.\n"
"\t\tvar cert = GD.Load<X509Certificate>(\"cert.crt\"); // Your X509 "
"certificate.\n"
"\t\t_dtls.Setup(TlsOptions.Server(key, cert));\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\twhile (_server.IsConnectionAvailable())\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tPacketPeerUdp peer = _server.TakeConnection();\n"
"\t\t\tPacketPeerDtls dtlsPeer = _dtls.TakeConnection(peer);\n"
"\t\t\tif (dtlsPeer.GetStatus() != PacketPeerDtls.Status.Handshaking)\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tcontinue; // It is normal that 50% of the connections fails due to "
"cookie exchange.\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\tGD.Print(\"Peer connected!\");\n"
"\t\t\t_peers.Add(dtlsPeer);\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\n"
"\t\tforeach (var p in _peers)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tp.Poll(); // Must poll to update the state.\n"
"\t\t\tif (p.GetStatus() == PacketPeerDtls.Status.Connected)\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\twhile (p.GetAvailablePacketCount() > 0)\n"
"\t\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tGD.Print($\"Received Message From Client: "
"{p.GetPacket().GetStringFromUtf8()}\");\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tp.PutPacket(\"Hello DTLS Client\".ToUtf8Buffer());\n"
"\t\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# client_node.gd\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var dtls = PacketPeerDTLS.new()\n"
"var udp = PacketPeerUDP.new()\n"
"var connected = false\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tudp.connect_to_host(\"127.0.0.1\", 4242)\n"
"\tdtls.connect_to_peer(udp, false) # Use true in production for certificate "
"validation!\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\tdtls.poll()\n"
"\tif dtls.get_status() == PacketPeerDTLS.STATUS_CONNECTED:\n"
"\t\tif !connected:\n"
"\t\t\t# Try to contact server\n"
"\t\t\tdtls.put_packet(\"The answer is... 42!\".to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"\t\twhile dtls.get_available_packet_count() > 0:\n"
"\t\t\tprint(\"Connected: %s\" % dtls.get_packet().get_string_from_utf8())\n"
"\t\t\tconnected = true\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// ClientNode.cs\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"using System.Text;\n"
"\n"
"public partial class ClientNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate PacketPeerDtls _dtls = new PacketPeerDtls();\n"
"\tprivate PacketPeerUdp _udp = new PacketPeerUdp();\n"
"\tprivate bool _connected = false;\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_udp.ConnectToHost(\"127.0.0.1\", 4242);\n"
"\t\t_dtls.ConnectToPeer(_udp, validateCerts: false); // Use true in "
"production for certificate validation!\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_dtls.Poll();\n"
"\t\tif (_dtls.GetStatus() == PacketPeerDtls.Status.Connected)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tif (!_connected)\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\t// Try to contact server\n"
"\t\t\t\t_dtls.PutPacket(\"The Answer Is..42!\".ToUtf8Buffer());\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\twhile (_dtls.GetAvailablePacketCount() > 0)\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tGD.Print($\"Connected: {_dtls.GetPacket().GetStringFromUtf8()}\");\n"
"\t\t\t\t_connected = true;\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບຮັກສາສະຖານະຂອງ DTLS ເຊີເວີ. ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method setup], ມັນຈະແປງ "
"[PacketPeerUDP] ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວໃຫ້ເປັນ [PacketPeerDTLS] ໂດຍການຮັບພວກມັນຜ່ານ [method "
"take_connection] ໃນຖານະ DTLS clients. ພາຍໃນລະບົບ, ຄລາສນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບຮັກສາສະຖານະ "
"DTLS ແລະ cookies ຂອງເຊີເວີ. ເຫດຜົນວ່າເປັນຫຍັງຕ້ອງໃຊ້ສະຖານະ ແລະ cookies "
"ແມ່ນຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດຂອງເອກະສານນີ້.\n"
"ດ້ານລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງນ້ອຍໆຂອງວິທີການນຳໃຊ້:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# server_node.gd\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var dtls = DTLSServer.new()\n"
"var server = UDPServer.new()\n"
"var peers = []\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tserver.listen(4242)\n"
"\tvar key = load(\"key.key\") # ຄີສ່ວນຕົວ (private key).\n"
"\tvar cert = load(\"cert.crt\") # ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ X509 (X509 certificate).\n"
"\tdtls.setup(TlsOptions.server(key, cert))\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\twhile server.is_connection_available():\n"
"\t\tvar peer = server.take_connection()\n"
"\t\tvar dtls_peer = dtls.take_connection(peer)\n"
"\t\tif dtls_peer.get_status() != PacketPeerDTLS.STATUS_HANDSHAKING:\n"
"\t\t\tcontinue # ມັນເປັນເລື່ອງປົກກະຕິທີ່ 50% ຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຍ້ອນການແລກປ່ຽນ cookie.\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Peer connected!\")\n"
"\t\tpeers.append(dtls_peer)\n"
"\n"
"\tfor p in peers:\n"
"\t\tp.poll() # ຕ້ອງເອີ້ນ poll ເພື່ອອັບເດດສະຖານະ.\n"
"\t\tif p.get_status() == PacketPeerDTLS.STATUS_CONNECTED:\n"
"\t\t\twhile p.get_available_packet_count() > 0:\n"
"\t\t\t\tprint(\"Received message from client: %s\" % "
"p.get_packet().get_string_from_utf8())\n"
"\t\t\t\tp.put_packet(\"Hello DTLS client\".to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// ServerNode.cs\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"public partial class ServerNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate DtlsServer _dtls = new DtlsServer();\n"
"\tprivate UdpServer _server = new UdpServer();\n"
"\tprivate Godot.Collections.Array<PacketPeerDtls> _peers = [];\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_server.Listen(4242);\n"
"\t\tvar key = GD.Load<CryptoKey>(\"key.key\"); // ຄີສ່ວນຕົວ (private key).\n"
"\t\tvar cert = GD.Load<X509Certificate>(\"cert.crt\"); // ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ X509 (X509 "
"certificate).\n"
"\t\t_dtls.Setup(TlsOptions.Server(key, cert));\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\twhile (_server.IsConnectionAvailable())\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tPacketPeerUdp peer = _server.TakeConnection();\n"
"\t\t\tPacketPeerDtls dtlsPeer = _dtls.TakeConnection(peer);\n"
"\t\t\tif (dtlsPeer.GetStatus() != PacketPeerDtls.Status.Handshaking)\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tcontinue; // ມັນເປັນເລື່ອງປົກກະຕິທີ່ 50% ຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຍ້ອນການແລກປ່ຽນ "
"cookie.\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\tGD.Print(\"Peer connected!\");\n"
"\t\t\t_peers.Add(dtlsPeer);\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\n"
"\t\tforeach (var p in _peers)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tp.Poll(); // ຕ້ອງເອີ້ນ poll ເພື່ອອັບເດດສະຖານະ.\n"
"\t\t\tif (p.GetStatus() == PacketPeerDtls.Status.Connected)\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\twhile (p.GetAvailablePacketCount() > 0)\n"
"\t\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tGD.Print($\"Received Message From Client: "
"{p.GetPacket().GetStringFromUtf8()}\");\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tp.PutPacket(\"Hello DTLS Client\".ToUtf8Buffer());\n"
"\t\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# client_node.gd\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var dtls = PacketPeerDTLS.new()\n"
"var udp = PacketPeerUDP.new()\n"
"var connected = false\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tudp.connect_to_host(\"127.0.0.1\", 4242)\n"
"\tdtls.connect_to_peer(udp, false) # ໃຊ້ true ໃນການໃຊ້ງານຈິງເພື່ອຢັ້ງຢືນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ!\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\tdtls.poll()\n"
"\tif dtls.get_status() == PacketPeerDTLS.STATUS_CONNECTED:\n"
"\t\tif !connected:\n"
"\t\t\t# ພະຍາຍາມຕິດຕໍ່ເຊີເວີ\n"
"\t\t\tdtls.put_packet(\"The answer is... 42!\".to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"\t\twhile dtls.get_available_packet_count() > 0:\n"
"\t\t\tprint(\"Connected: %s\" % dtls.get_packet().get_string_from_utf8())\n"
"\t\t\tconnected = true\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// ClientNode.cs\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"using System.Text;\n"
"\n"
"public partial class ClientNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate PacketPeerDtls _dtls = new PacketPeerDtls();\n"
"\tprivate PacketPeerUdp _udp = new PacketPeerUdp();\n"
"\tprivate bool _connected = false;\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_udp.ConnectToHost(\"127.0.0.1\", 4242);\n"
"\t\t_dtls.ConnectToPeer(_udp, validateCerts: false); // ໃຊ້ true "
"ໃນການໃຊ້ງານຈິງເພື່ອຢັ້ງຢືນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ!\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_dtls.Poll();\n"
"\t\tif (_dtls.GetStatus() == PacketPeerDtls.Status.Connected)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tif (!_connected)\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\t// ພະຍາຍາມຕິດຕໍ່ເຊີເວີ\n"
"\t\t\t\t_dtls.PutPacket(\"The Answer Is..42!\".ToUtf8Buffer());\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\twhile (_dtls.GetAvailablePacketCount() > 0)\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tGD.Print($\"Connected: {_dtls.GetPacket().GetStringFromUtf8()}\");\n"
"\t\t\t\t_connected = true;\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Setup the DTLS server to use the given [param server_options]. See [method "
"TLSOptions.server]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ DTLS ເຊີເວີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [param server_options] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"TLSOptions.server]."

msgid ""
"Try to initiate the DTLS handshake with the given [param udp_peer] which must "
"be already connected (see [method PacketPeerUDP.connect_to_host]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You must check that the state of the return PacketPeerUDP is "
"[constant PacketPeerDTLS.STATUS_HANDSHAKING], as it is normal that 50% of the "
"new connections will be invalid due to cookie exchange."
msgstr ""
"ພະຍາຍາມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການເຮັດ DTLS handshake ດ້ວຍ [param udp_peer] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະຕ້ອງມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ແລ້ວ (ເບິ່ງ [method PacketPeerUDP.connect_to_host]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທ່ານຕ້ອງກວດສອບວ່າສະຖານະຂອງ PacketPeerUDP ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນແມ່ນ [constant "
"PacketPeerDTLS.STATUS_HANDSHAKING], ເນື່ອງຈາກເປັນເລື່ອງປົກກະຕິທີ່ 50% "
"ຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່ຈະໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຍ້ອນການແລກປ່ຽນ cookie."

msgid "Godot editor's command palette."
msgstr "ກ່ອງລວມຄຳສັ່ງ (command palette) ຂອງ Godot editor."

msgid ""
"Object that holds all the available Commands and their shortcuts text. These "
"Commands can be accessed through [b]Editor > Command Palette[/b] menu.\n"
"Command key names use slash delimiters to distinguish sections, for example: "
"[code]\"example/command1\"[/code] then [code]example[/code] will be the "
"section name.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var command_palette = EditorInterface.get_command_palette()\n"
"# external_command is a function that will be called with the command is "
"executed.\n"
"var command_callable = Callable(self, \"external_command\").bind(arguments)\n"
"command_palette.add_command(\"command\", \"test/command\",command_callable)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"EditorCommandPalette commandPalette = "
"EditorInterface.Singleton.GetCommandPalette();\n"
"// ExternalCommand is a function that will be called with the command is "
"executed.\n"
"Callable commandCallable = new Callable(this, MethodName.ExternalCommand);\n"
"commandPalette.AddCommand(\"command\", \"test/command\", commandCallable)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class shouldn't be instantiated directly. Instead, access "
"the singleton using [method EditorInterface.get_command_palette]."
msgstr ""
"ອອບເຈັກທີ່ເກັບຮັກສາຄຳສັ່ງທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມຄີລັດຂອງພວກມັນ. ຄຳສັ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານເມນູ "
"[b]Editor > Command Palette[/b].\n"
"ຊື່ຄີຂອງຄຳສັ່ງຈະໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ slash (/) ເພື່ອແຍກໝວດໝູ່, ຕົວຢ່າງ: [code]\"example/command1\"[/"
"code] ໂດຍ [code]example[/code] ຈະເປັນຊື່ໝວດໝູ່.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var command_palette = EditorInterface.get_command_palette()\n"
"# external_command ແມ່ນຟັງຊັນທີ່ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອຄຳສັ່ງຖືກປະຕິບັດ.\n"
"var command_callable = Callable(self, \"external_command\").bind(arguments)\n"
"command_palette.add_command(\"command\", \"test/command\", command_callable)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"EditorCommandPalette commandPalette = "
"EditorInterface.Singleton.GetCommandPalette();\n"
"// ExternalCommand ແມ່ນຟັງຊັນທີ່ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອຄຳສັ່ງຖືກປະຕິບັດ.\n"
"Callable commandCallable = new Callable(this, MethodName.ExternalCommand);\n"
"commandPalette.AddCommand(\"command\", \"test/command\", commandCallable)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄລາສນີ້ບໍ່ຄວນຖືກສ້າງ Instance ໂດຍກົງ. ແຕ່ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງ singleton ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[method EditorInterface.get_command_palette]."

msgid ""
"Adds a custom command to EditorCommandPalette.\n"
"- [param command_name]: [String] (Name of the [b]Command[/b]. This is "
"displayed to the user.)\n"
"- [param key_name]: [String] (Name of the key for a particular [b]Command[/"
"b]. This is used to uniquely identify the [b]Command[/b].)\n"
"- [param binded_callable]: [Callable] (Callable of the [b]Command[/b]. This "
"will be executed when the [b]Command[/b] is selected.)\n"
"- [param shortcut_text]: [String] (Shortcut text of the [b]Command[/b] if "
"available.)"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຄຳສັ່ງກຳນົດເອງໃສ່ EditorCommandPalette.\n"
"- [param command_name]: [String] (ຊື່ຂອງ [b]ຄຳສັ່ງ[/b]. ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະຖືກສະແດງໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫັນ.)\n"
"- [param key_name]: [String] (ຊື່ຄີຂອງ [b]ຄຳສັ່ງ[/b] ສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຕົວຕົນຂອງ "
"[b]ຄຳສັ່ງ[/b] ບໍ່ໃຫ້ຊ້ຳກັນ.)\n"
"- [param binded_callable]: [Callable] (Callable ຂອງ [b]ຄຳສັ່ງ[/b]. "
"ຈະຖືກເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອ [b]ຄຳສັ່ງ[/b] ຖືກເລືອກ.)\n"
"- [param shortcut_text]: [String] (ຂໍ້ຄວາມປຸ່ມລັດຂອງ [b]ຄຳສັ່ງ[/b] ຖ້າມີ.)"

msgid ""
"Removes the custom command from EditorCommandPalette.\n"
"- [param key_name]: [String] (Name of the key for a particular [b]Command[/"
"b].)"
msgstr ""
"ລຶບຄຳສັ່ງກຳນົດເອງອອກຈາກ EditorCommandPalette.\n"
"- [param key_name]: [String] (ຊື່ຄີຂອງ [b]ຄຳສັ່ງ[/b] ສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ.)"

msgid "Plugin for adding custom context menus in the editor."
msgstr "ປລັກອິນສຳລັບເພີ່ມເມນູບໍລິບົດ (context menus) ກຳນົດເອງໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor)."

msgid "A base class to implement debugger plugins."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບການສ້າງປລັກອິນດີບັກເກີ (debugger plugins)."

msgid ""
"[EditorDebuggerPlugin] provides functions related to the editor side of the "
"debugger.\n"
"To interact with the debugger, an instance of this class must be added to the "
"editor via [method EditorPlugin.add_debugger_plugin].\n"
"Once added, the [method _setup_session] callback will be called for every "
"[EditorDebuggerSession] available to the plugin, and when new ones are "
"created (the sessions may be inactive during this stage).\n"
"You can retrieve the available [EditorDebuggerSession]s via [method "
"get_sessions] or get a specific one via [method get_session].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorPlugin\n"
"\n"
"class ExampleEditorDebugger extends EditorDebuggerPlugin:\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _has_capture(capture):\n"
"\t\t# Return true if you wish to handle messages with the prefix \"my_plugin:"
"\".\n"
"\t\treturn capture == \"my_plugin\"\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _capture(message, data, session_id):\n"
"\t\tif message == \"my_plugin:ping\":\n"
"\t\t\tget_session(session_id).send_message(\"my_plugin:echo\", data)\n"
"\t\t\treturn true\n"
"\t\treturn false\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _setup_session(session_id):\n"
"\t\t# Add a new tab in the debugger session UI containing a label.\n"
"\t\tvar label = Label.new()\n"
"\t\tlabel.name = \"Example plugin\" # Will be used as the tab title.\n"
"\t\tlabel.text = \"Example plugin\"\n"
"\t\tvar session = get_session(session_id)\n"
"\t\t# Listens to the session started and stopped signals.\n"
"\t\tsession.started.connect(func (): print(\"Session started\"))\n"
"\t\tsession.stopped.connect(func (): print(\"Session stopped\"))\n"
"\t\tsession.add_session_tab(label)\n"
"\n"
"var debugger = ExampleEditorDebugger.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\tadd_debugger_plugin(debugger)\n"
"\n"
"func _exit_tree():\n"
"\tremove_debugger_plugin(debugger)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"To connect on the running game side, use the [EngineDebugger] singleton:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tEngineDebugger.register_message_capture(\"my_plugin\", _capture)\n"
"\tEngineDebugger.send_message(\"my_plugin:ping\", [\"test\"])\n"
"\n"
"func _capture(message, data):\n"
"\t# Note that the \"my_plugin:\" prefix is not used here.\n"
"\tif message == \"echo\":\n"
"\t\tprints(\"Echo received:\", data)\n"
"\t\treturn true\n"
"\treturn false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] While the game is running, [method @GlobalScope.print] and "
"similar functions [i]called in the editor[/i] do not print anything, the "
"Output Log prints only game messages."
msgstr ""
"[EditorDebuggerPlugin] ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບສ່ວນຂອງດີບັກເກີ (debugger) "
"ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"ເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກກັບດີບັກເກີ, ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ຂອງຄລາສນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂຜ່ານ [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_debugger_plugin].\n"
"ເມື່ອເພີ່ມແລ້ວ, callback [method _setup_session] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນສຳລັບທຸກໆ "
"[EditorDebuggerSession] ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ກັບປລັກອິນ, ແລະ ເມື່ອມີອັນໃໝ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ "
"(ເຊດຊັນອາດຈະຍັງບໍ່ທັນເຮັດວຽກໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້).\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດດຶງເອົາ [EditorDebuggerSession] ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໄດ້ຜ່ານ [method get_sessions] ຫຼື "
"ດຶງເອົາອັນສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງຜ່ານ [method get_session].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorPlugin\n"
"\n"
"class ExampleEditorDebugger extends EditorDebuggerPlugin:\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _has_capture(capture):\n"
"\t\t# ສົ່ງຄ່າ true ກັບຄືນ ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຄຳນຳໜ້າວ່າ \"my_plugin:\".\n"
"\t\treturn capture == \"my_plugin\"\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _capture(message, data, session_id):\n"
"\t\tif message == \"my_plugin:ping\":\n"
"\t\t\tget_session(session_id).send_message(\"my_plugin:echo\", data)\n"
"\t\t\treturn true\n"
"\t\treturn false\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _setup_session(session_id):\n"
"\t\t# ເພີ່ມແຖບໃໝ່ໃນ UI ຂອງເຊດຊັນດີບັກເກີທີ່ມີເລເບວ (label).\n"
"\t\tvar label = Label.new()\n"
"\t\tlabel.name = \"Example plugin\" # ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຊື່ແຖບ.\n"
"\t\tlabel.text = \"Example plugin\"\n"
"\t\tvar session = get_session(session_id)\n"
"\t\t# ຕິດຕາມສັນຍານການເລີ່ມ ແລະ ຢຸດຂອງເຊດຊັນ.\n"
"\t\tsession.started.connect(func (): print(\"Session started\"))\n"
"\t\tsession.stopped.connect(func (): print(\"Session stopped\"))\n"
"\t\tsession.add_session_tab(label)\n"
"\n"
"var debugger = ExampleEditorDebugger.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\tadd_debugger_plugin(debugger)\n"
"\n"
"func _exit_tree():\n"
"\tremove_debugger_plugin(debugger)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນສ່ວນຂອງເກມທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [EngineDebugger] singleton:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tEngineDebugger.register_message_capture(\"my_plugin\", _capture)\n"
"\tEngineDebugger.send_message(\"my_plugin:ping\", [\"test\"])\n"
"\n"
"func _capture(message, data):\n"
"\t# ສັງເກດວ່າບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຄຳນຳໜ້າ \"my_plugin:\" ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້.\n"
"\tif message == \"echo\":\n"
"\t\tprints(\"Echo received:\", data)\n"
"\t\treturn true\n"
"\treturn false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເກມກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ, [method @GlobalScope.print] ແລະ "
"ຟັງຊັນທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນທີ່ [i]ຖືກເອີ້ນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ[/i] ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຜົນຫຍັງເລີຍ, Output Log "
"ຈະສະແດງສະເພາະຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກເກມເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to be notified when a breakpoint is set in the editor."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບ (override) ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອມີການກຳນົດຈຸດຢຸດ (breakpoint) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to be notified when all breakpoints are cleared in the "
"editor."
msgstr "ຂຽນທັບເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອຈຸດຢຸດທັງໝົດໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂຖືກລ້າງອອກ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to process incoming messages. The [param session_id] is "
"the ID of the [EditorDebuggerSession] that received the [param message]. Use "
"[method get_session] to retrieve the session. This method should return "
"[code]true[/code] if the message is recognized."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເຂົ້າມາ. [param session_id] ແມ່ນ ID ຂອງ "
"[EditorDebuggerSession] ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ [param message]. ໃຊ້ [method get_session] "
"ເພື່ອດຶງເອົາເຊດຊັນ. ເມທອດນີ້ຄວນສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ກັບຄືນ ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມຖືກຮັບຮູ້."

msgid ""
"Override this method to be notified when a breakpoint line has been clicked "
"in the debugger breakpoint panel."
msgstr "ຂຽນທັບເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອແຖວຂອງຈຸດຢຸດຖືກຄລິກໃນແຜງຈຸດຢຸດຂອງດີບັກເກີ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to enable receiving messages from the debugger. If "
"[param capture] is \"my_message\" then messages starting with \"my_message:\" "
"will be passed to the [method _capture] method."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກດີບັກເກີ. ຖ້າ [param capture] ແມ່ນ \"my_message\" "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ \"my_message:\" ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາເມທອດ [method _capture]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to be notified whenever a new [EditorDebuggerSession] is "
"created. Note that the session may be inactive during this stage."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການສ້າງ [EditorDebuggerSession] ໃໝ່. "
"ສັງເກດວ່າເຊດຊັນອາດຈະຍັງບໍ່ທັນເຮັດວຽກໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້."

msgid "Returns the [EditorDebuggerSession] with the given [param id]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [EditorDebuggerSession] ທີ່ມີ [param id] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of [EditorDebuggerSession] currently available to this "
"debugger plugin.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Sessions in the array may be inactive, check their state via "
"[method EditorDebuggerSession.is_active]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າອາເຣຂອງ [EditorDebuggerSession] ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ກັບປລັກອິນດີບັກເກີນີ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເຊດຊັນໃນອາເຣອາດຈະຍັງບໍ່ທັນເຮັດວຽກ, ກວດສອບສະຖານະຂອງພວກມັນຜ່ານ [method "
"EditorDebuggerSession.is_active]."

msgid "A class to interact with the editor debugger."
msgstr "ຄລາສສຳລັບເຮັດວຽກກັບດີບັກເກີຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"This class cannot be directly instantiated and must be retrieved via an "
"[EditorDebuggerPlugin].\n"
"You can add tabs to the session UI via [method add_session_tab], send "
"messages via [method send_message], and toggle [EngineProfiler]s via [method "
"toggle_profiler]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ ແລະ ຕ້ອງຖືກດຶງມາຜ່ານ [EditorDebuggerPlugin].\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມແຖບໃສ່ UI ຂອງເຊດຊັນຜ່ານ [method add_session_tab], ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມຜ່ານ [method "
"send_message], ແລະ ເປີດ/ປິດ [EngineProfiler] ຜ່ານ [method toggle_profiler]."

msgid ""
"Adds the given [param control] to the debug session UI in the debugger bottom "
"panel. The [param control]'s node name will be used as the tab title."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ [param control] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃສ່ໃນ UI ຂອງເຊດຊັນດີບັກໃນແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງດີບັກເກີ. ຊື່ໂນດຂອງ "
"[param control] ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຊື່ແຖບ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the debug session is currently attached to a "
"remote instance."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເຊດຊັນດີບັກກຳລັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທາງໄກ (remote instance) "
"ຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the attached remote instance is currently in the "
"debug loop."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທາງໄກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ກຳລັງຢູ່ໃນລູປການດີບັກ (debug loop) "
"ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the attached remote instance can be debugged."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທາງໄກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ສາມາດດີບັກໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Removes the given [param control] from the debug session UI in the debugger "
"bottom panel."
msgstr "ລຶບ [param control] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ອອກຈາກ UI ຂອງເຊດຊັນດີບັກໃນແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງດີບັກເກີ."

msgid ""
"Sends the given [param message] to the attached remote instance, optionally "
"passing additionally [param data]. See [EngineDebugger] for how to retrieve "
"those messages."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງ [param message] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ໄປຫາອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທາງໄກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່, ສາມາດສົ່ງ [param data] "
"ເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [EngineDebugger] ສຳລັບວິທີການດຶງເອົາຂໍ້ຄວາມເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Enables or disables a specific breakpoint based on [param enabled], updating "
"the Editor Breakpoint Panel accordingly."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດຈຸດຢຸດ (breakpoint) ສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງຕາມ [param enabled], ແລະ "
"ອັບເດດແຜງຈຸດຢຸດຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ."

msgid ""
"Toggle the given [param profiler] on the attached remote instance, optionally "
"passing additionally [param data]. See [EngineProfiler] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ/ປິດ [param profiler] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທາງໄກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່, ສາມາດສົ່ງ [param data] "
"ເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [EngineProfiler] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the attached remote instance enters a break state. If [param "
"can_debug] is [code]true[/code], the remote instance will enter the debug "
"loop."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທາງໄກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ເຂົ້າສູ່ສະຖານະຢຸດ (break state). ຖ້າ [param "
"can_debug] ແມ່ນ [code]true[/code], ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທາງໄກຈະເຂົ້າສູ່ລູປການດີບັກ."

msgid "Emitted when the attached remote instance exits a break state."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທາງໄກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ອອກຈາກສະຖານະຢຸດ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a remote instance is attached to this session (i.e. the session "
"becomes active)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທາງໄກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊດຊັນນີ້ (ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ເຊດຊັນນັ້ນເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ)."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a remote instance is detached from this session (i.e. the "
"session becomes inactive)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທາງໄກຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກເຊດຊັນນີ້ (ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ເຊດຊັນນັ້ນຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ)."

msgid "Dockable container for the editor."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ສາມາດຕິດແຖບ (dockable) ໄດ້ສຳລັບຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"EditorDock is a [Container] node that can be docked in one of the editor's "
"dock slots. Docks are added by plugins to provide space for controls related "
"to an [EditorPlugin]. The editor comes with a few built-in docks, such as the "
"Scene dock, FileSystem dock, etc.\n"
"You can add a dock by using [method EditorPlugin.add_dock]. The dock can be "
"customized by changing its properties.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorPlugin\n"
"\n"
"# Dock reference.\n"
"var dock\n"
"\n"
"# Plugin initialization.\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\tdock = EditorDock.new()\n"
"\tdock.title = \"My Dock\"\n"
"\tdock.dock_icon = preload(\"./dock_icon.png\")\n"
"\tdock.default_slot = EditorDock.DOCK_SLOT_RIGHT_UL\n"
"\tvar dock_content = preload(\"./dock_content.tscn\").instantiate()\n"
"\tdock.add_child(dock_content)\n"
"\tadd_dock(dock)\n"
"\n"
"# Plugin clean-up.\n"
"func _exit_tree():\n"
"\tremove_dock(dock)\n"
"\tdock.queue_free()\n"
"\tdock = null\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"EditorDock ແມ່ນໂນດ [Container] ທີ່ສາມາດນຳໄປຕິດໃນຊ່ອງດັອກ (dock slots) "
"ໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ດັອກຖືກເພີ່ມໂດຍປລັກອິນເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີພື້ນທີ່ສຳລັບສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [EditorPlugin]. "
"ຕົວແກ້ໄຂມາພ້ອມກັບດັອກໃນຕົວຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງ ເຊັ່ນ: ດັອກ Scene, ດັອກ FileSystem, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມດັອກໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ [method EditorPlugin.add_dock]. "
"ດັອກສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງມັນ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorPlugin\n"
"\n"
"# ການອ້າງອີງດັອກ.\n"
"var dock\n"
"\n"
"# ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນປລັກອິນ.\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\tdock = EditorDock.new()\n"
"\tdock.title = \"My Dock\"\n"
"\tdock.dock_icon = preload(\"./dock_icon.png\")\n"
"\tdock.default_slot = EditorDock.DOCK_SLOT_RIGHT_UL\n"
"\tvar dock_content = preload(\"./dock_content.tscn\").instantiate()\n"
"\tdock.add_child(dock_content)\n"
"\tadd_dock(dock)\n"
"\n"
"# ການລ້າງປລັກອິນ.\n"
"func _exit_tree():\n"
"\tremove_dock(dock)\n"
"\tdock.queue_free()\n"
"\tdock = null\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Making plugins"
msgstr "ການສ້າງປລັກອິນ"

msgid ""
"Implement this method to handle loading this dock's layout. It's equivalent "
"to [method EditorPlugin._set_window_layout]. [param section] is a unique "
"section based on [member layout_key]."
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ (implement) ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຈັດການການໂຫຼດຮູບແບບ (layout) ຂອງດັອກນີ້. ມັນທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[method EditorPlugin._set_window_layout]. [param section] "
"ແມ່ນສ່ວນທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນໂດຍອີງຕາມ [member layout_key]."

msgid ""
"Implement this method to handle saving this dock's layout. It's equivalent to "
"[method EditorPlugin._get_window_layout]. [param section] is a unique section "
"based on [member layout_key]."
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຈັດການການບັນທຶກຮູບແບບຂອງດັອກນີ້. ມັນທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [method "
"EditorPlugin._get_window_layout]. [param section] ແມ່ນສ່ວນທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນໂດຍອີງຕາມ "
"[member layout_key]."

msgid ""
"Implement this method to handle the layout switching for this dock. [param "
"layout] is one of the [enum DockLayout] constants.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _update_layout(layout):\n"
"\tbox_container.vertical = (layout == DOCK_LAYOUT_VERTICAL)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຈັດການການສະຫຼັບຮູບແບບສຳລັບດັອກນີ້. [param layout] ແມ່ນໜຶ່ງໃນຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຂອງ [enum "
"DockLayout].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _update_layout(layout):\n"
"\tbox_container.vertical = (layout == DOCK_LAYOUT_VERTICAL)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Closes the dock, making its tab hidden."
msgstr "ປິດດັອກ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ແຖບຂອງມັນຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Focuses the dock's tab (or window if it's floating). If the dock was closed, "
"it will be opened. If it's a bottom dock, makes the bottom panel visible."
msgstr ""
"ໂຟກັສໄປທີ່ແຖບຂອງດັອກ (ຫຼື ວິນໂດ ຖ້າມັນເປັນແບບລອຍ). ຖ້າດັອກຖືກປິດຢູ່, ມັນຈະຖືກເປີດຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຖ້າມັນເປັນດັອກດ້ານລຸ່ມ, ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"Opens the dock. It will appear in the last used dock slot. If the dock has no "
"default slot, it will be opened floating.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does not focus the dock. If you want to open and focus the "
"dock, use [method make_visible]."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດດັອກ. ມັນຈະປະກົດຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງດັອກທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດ. ຖ້າດັອກບໍ່ມີຊ່ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ມັນຈະຖືກເປີດເປັນແບບລອຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ໂຟກັສດັອກ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເປີດ ແລະ ໂຟກັສດັອກ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"make_visible] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The available layouts for this dock, as a bitmask. By default, the dock "
"allows vertical and floating layouts."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບ (layouts) ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບດັອກນີ້, ໃນຮູບແບບບິດມາສ (bitmask). ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ດັອກຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບແນວຕັ້ງ ແລະ ແບບລອຍ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the dock can be closed with the Close button in the "
"context popup. Docks with [member global] enabled are always closable."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ດັອກສາມາດປິດໄດ້ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມ Close ໃນປ໊ອບອັບບໍລິບົດ. ດັອກທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ "
"[member global] ຈະສາມາດປິດໄດ້ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"The default dock slot used when adding the dock with [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_dock].\n"
"After the dock is added, it can be moved to a different slot and the editor "
"will automatically remember its position between sessions. If you remove and "
"re-add the dock, it will be reset to default."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງດັອກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອເພີ່ມດັອກດ້ວຍ [method EditorPlugin.add_dock].\n"
"ຫຼັງຈາກເພີ່ມດັອກແລ້ວ, ມັນສາມາດຍ້າຍໄປຊ່ອງອື່ນໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະຈື່ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງມັນໄວ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດລະຫວ່າງເຊດຊັນ. ຖ້າທ່ານລຶບ ແລະ ເພີ່ມດັອກເຂົ້າໃໝ່, "
"ມັນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າກັບເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The icon for the dock, as a texture. If specified, it will override [member "
"icon_name]."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບດັອກ, ໃນຮູບແບບ texture. ຖ້າກຳນົດໄວ້, ມັນຈະຂຽນທັບ [member icon_name]."

msgid "The shortcut used to open the dock."
msgstr "ປຸ່ມລັດທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປີດດັອກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the dock will always display an icon, regardless of "
"[member EditorSettings.interface/editor/docks/dock_tab_style] or [member "
"EditorSettings.interface/editor/docks/bottom_dock_tab_style]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ດັອກຈະສະແດງໄອຄອນສະເໝີ, ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຄ່າຂອງ [member "
"EditorSettings.interface/editor/docks/dock_tab_style] ຫຼື [member "
"EditorSettings.interface/editor/docks/bottom_dock_tab_style]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the dock appears in the [b]Editor > Editor Docks[/b] "
"menu and can be closed. Non-global docks can still be closed using [method "
"close] or when [member closable] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ດັອກຈະປະກົດຢູ່ໃນເມນູ [b]Editor > Editor Docks[/b] ແລະ "
"ສາມາດປິດໄດ້. ດັອກທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ global ຍັງສາມາດປິດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ [method close] ຫຼື ເມື່ອ [member "
"closable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"The icon for the dock, as a name from the [code]EditorIcons[/code] theme type "
"in the editor theme. You can find the list of available icons [url=https://"
"godot-editor-icons.github.io/]here[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນສຳລັບດັອກ, ໂດຍລະບຸເປັນຊື່ຈາກປະເພດທີມ [code]EditorIcons[/code] ໃນທີມຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍການໄອຄອນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໄດ້ທີ່ [url=https://godot-editor-icons.github.io/]ນີ້[/"
"url]."

msgid ""
"The key representing this dock in the editor's layout file. If empty, the "
"dock's displayed name will be used instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄີທີ່ເປັນຕົວແທນຂອງດັອກນີ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຮູບແບບ (layout) ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ຖ້າວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະໃຊ້ຊື່ທີ່ສະແດງຂອງດັອກແທນ."

msgid ""
"The title of the dock's tab. If empty, the dock's [member Node.name] will be "
"used. If the name is auto-generated (contains [code]@[/code]), the first "
"child's name will be used instead."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງແຖບດັອກ. ຖ້າວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະໃຊ້ [member Node.name] ຂອງດັອກ. ຖ້າຊື່ຖືກສ້າງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"(ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ [code]@[/code]), ຈະໃຊ້ຊື່ຂອງລູກ (child) ໂຕທຳອິດແທນ."

msgid ""
"The color of the dock tab's title. If its alpha is [code]0.0[/code], the "
"default font color will be used."
msgstr "ສີຂອງຫົວຂໍ້ແຖບດັອກ. ຖ້າຄ່າ alpha ຂອງມັນແມ່ນ [code]0.0[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ສີຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the dock is not automatically opened or closed when "
"loading an editor layout, only moved. It also can't be opened using a "
"shortcut. This is meant for docks that are opened and closed in specific "
"cases, such as when selecting a [TileMap] or [AnimationTree] node."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ດັອກຈະບໍ່ຖືກເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອໂຫຼດຮູບແບບຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, "
"ພຽງແຕ່ຖືກຍ້າຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດເປີດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລັດ. ສ່ວນນີ້ແມ່ນມີໄວ້ສຳລັບດັອກທີ່ຖືກເປີດ "
"ແລະ ປິດໃນກໍລະນີສະເພາະ ເຊັ່ນ: ເມື່ອເລືອກໂນດ [TileMap] ຫຼື [AnimationTree]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the dock is opened via the Editor > Editor Docks menu, before "
"it's made visible."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອດັອກຖືກເປີດຜ່ານເມນູ Editor > Editor Docks, ກ່ອນທີ່ມັນຈະປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"Allows placing the dock in the vertical dock slots on either side of the "
"editor."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ວາງດັອກໃນຊ່ອງດັອກແນວຕັ້ງຢູ່ຂ້າງໃດຂ້າງໜຶ່ງຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "Allows placing the dock in the horizontal dock slots at the bottom."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ວາງດັອກໃນຊ່ອງດັອກແນວນອນຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມ."

msgid "Allows making the dock floating (opened as a separate window)."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຮັດດັອກເປັນແບບລອຍ (ເປີດເປັນວິນໂດແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ)."

msgid "The dock is closed."
msgstr "ດັອກຖືກປິດ."

msgid "Dock slot, left side, upper-left (empty in default layout)."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງດັອກ, ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ, ເທິງ-ຊ້າຍ (ວ່າງເປົ່າໃນຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

msgid "Dock slot, left side, bottom-left (empty in default layout)."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງດັອກ, ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ, ລຸ່ມ-ຊ້າຍ (ວ່າງເປົ່າໃນຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"Dock slot, left side, upper-right (in default layout includes Scene and "
"Import docks)."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງດັອກ, ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ, ເທິງ-ຂວາ (ໃນຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນປະກອບມີດັອກ Scene ແລະ Import)."

msgid ""
"Dock slot, left side, bottom-right (in default layout includes FileSystem and "
"History docks)."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງດັອກ, ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ, ລຸ່ມ-ຂວາ (ໃນຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນປະກອບມີດັອກ FileSystem ແລະ History)."

msgid ""
"Dock slot, right side, upper-left (in default layout includes Inspector, "
"Signal, and Group docks)."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງດັອກ, ເບື້ອງຂວາ, ເທິງ-ຊ້າຍ (ໃນຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນປະກອບມີດັອກ Inspector, Signal, ແລະ Group)."

msgid "Dock slot, right side, bottom-left (empty in default layout)."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງດັອກ, ເບື້ອງຂວາ, ລຸ່ມ-ຊ້າຍ (ວ່າງເປົ່າໃນຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

msgid "Dock slot, right side, upper-right (empty in default layout)."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງດັອກ, ເບື້ອງຂວາ, ເທິງ-ຂວາ (ວ່າງເປົ່າໃນຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

msgid "Dock slot, right side, bottom-right (empty in default layout)."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງດັອກ, ເບື້ອງຂວາ, ລຸ່ມ-ຂວາ (ວ່າງເປົ່າໃນຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

msgid "Bottom panel."
msgstr "ແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມ."

msgid "Dock slot at the bottom, below bottom panel, on the left side."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງວາງແຜງຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມ, ຖັດຈາກແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມ, ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ."

msgid "Dock slot at the bottom, below bottom panel, on the right side."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງວາງແຜງຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມ, ຖັດຈາກແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມ, ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum DockSlot] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງ [enum DockSlot] enum."

msgid ""
"Identifies a supported export platform, and internally provides the "
"functionality of exporting to that platform."
msgstr "ລະບຸແພລັດຟອມການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ແລະ ສະໜອງຟັງຊັນການສົ່ງອອກໄປຍັງແພລັດຟອມນັ້ນພາຍໃນ."

msgid ""
"Base resource that provides the functionality of exporting a release build of "
"a project to a platform, from the editor. Stores platform-specific metadata "
"such as the name and supported features of the platform, and performs the "
"exporting of projects, PCK files, and ZIP files. Uses an export template for "
"the platform provided at the time of project exporting.\n"
"Used in scripting by [EditorExportPlugin] to configure platform-specific "
"customization of scenes and resources. See [method "
"EditorExportPlugin._begin_customize_scenes] and [method "
"EditorExportPlugin._begin_customize_resources] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນພື້ນຖານທີ່ສະໜອງຟັງຊັນການສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກເວີຊັນປ່ອຍ (release build) "
"ໄປຍັງແພລັດຟອມຕ່າງໆຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ເກັບກໍາຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາສະເພາະຂອງແພລັດຟອມ ເຊັ່ນ: ຊື່ ແລະ "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ແລະ ດໍາເນີນການສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກ, ໄຟລ໌ PCK ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ ZIP. ນໍາໃຊ້ຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກ "
"(export template) ສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃນເວລາສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກ.\n"
"ຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ໃນການຂຽນສະຄຣິບໂດຍ [EditorExportPlugin] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການປັບແຕ່ງສາກ (scene) ແລະ "
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນສະເພາະແພລັດຟອມ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"EditorExportPlugin._begin_customize_scenes] ແລະ [method "
"EditorExportPlugin._begin_customize_resources] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Adds a message to the export log that will be displayed when exporting ends."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມໃສ່ໃນບັນທຶກການສົ່ງອອກ ເຊິ່ງຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອການສົ່ງອອກສິ້ນສຸດລົງ."

msgid "Clears the export log."
msgstr "ລຶບບັນທຶກການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid "Create a new preset for this platform."
msgstr "ສ້າງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ (preset) ໃໝ່ສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມນີ້."

msgid "Creates a PCK archive at [param path] for the specified [param preset]."
msgstr "ສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ PCK ທີ່ [param path] ສຳລັບ [param preset] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Creates a patch PCK archive at [param path] for the specified [param preset], "
"containing only the files that have changed since the last patch.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param patches] is an optional override of the set of patches "
"defined in the export preset. When empty the patches defined in the export "
"preset will be used instead."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ແພັດ PCK ທີ່ [param path] ສຳລັບ [param preset] ທີ່ລະບຸ, "
"ໂດຍຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ແພັດຫຼ້າສຸດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param patches] ແມ່ນການຂຽນທັບຕົວເລືອກຂອງຊຸດແພັດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນຄ່າການສົ່ງອອກ. "
"ຖ້າປະວ່າງໄວ້, ແພັດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນຄ່າການສົ່ງອອກຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Creates a full project at [param path] for the specified [param preset]. If "
"[param notify] is [code]true[/code], plugins using [method "
"EditorExportPlugin._export_begin] will be called during the process."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກແບບເຕັມທີ່ [param path] ສຳລັບ [param preset] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ຖ້າ [param notify] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code], ປລັກອິນທີ່ໃຊ້ [method EditorExportPlugin._export_begin] "
"ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການ."

msgid "Create a ZIP archive at [param path] for the specified [param preset]."
msgstr "ສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ ZIP ທີ່ [param path] ສຳລັບ [param preset] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Create a patch ZIP archive at [param path] for the specified [param preset], "
"containing only the files that have changed since the last patch.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param patches] is an optional override of the set of patches "
"defined in the export preset. When empty the patches defined in the export "
"preset will be used instead."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ແພັດ ZIP ທີ່ [param path] ສຳລັບ [param preset] ທີ່ລະບຸ, "
"ໂດຍຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ແພັດຫຼ້າສຸດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param patches] ແມ່ນການຂຽນທັບຕົວເລືອກຂອງຊຸດແພັດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນຄ່າການສົ່ງອອກ. "
"ຖ້າປະວ່າງໄວ້, ແພັດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນຄ່າການສົ່ງອອກຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Locates export template for the platform, and returns [Dictionary] with the "
"following keys: [code]path: String[/code] and [code]error: String[/code]. "
"This method is provided for convenience and custom export platforms aren't "
"required to use it or keep export templates stored in the same way official "
"templates are."
msgstr ""
"ຄົ້ນຫາຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມ, ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [Dictionary] ທີ່ມີຄີ (key) ດັ່ງນີ້: "
"[code]path: String[/code] ແລະ [code]error: String[/code]. ວິທີນີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກ "
"ແລະ ແພລັດຟອມການສົ່ງອອກແບບກຳນົດເອງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ ຫຼື "
"ເກັບຮັກສາຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັບຮູບແບບທາງການ."

msgid ""
"Generates array of command line arguments for the default export templates "
"for the debug flags and editor settings."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງອາເຣ (array) ຂອງອາກິວເມນຄຳສັ່ງ (command line arguments) "
"ສຳລັບຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ສຳລັບແຟລັກດີບັກ (debug flags) ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "Returns array of [EditorExportPreset]s for this platform."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງ [EditorExportPreset] ສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns array of core file names that always should be exported regardless of "
"preset config."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຫຼັກທີ່ຄວນຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກສະເໝີ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ preset."

msgid ""
"Returns additional files that should always be exported regardless of preset "
"configuration, and are not part of the project source. The returned "
"[Dictionary] contains filename keys ([String]) and their corresponding raw "
"data ([PackedByteArray])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໄຟລ໌ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຄວນຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກສະເໝີ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ preset, ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຊອດໂຄດ (source) ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ. [Dictionary] ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍຄີຊື່ໄຟລ໌ "
"([String]) ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນດິບ ([PackedByteArray]) ຂອງພວກມັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the message category for the message with the given [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໝວດໝູ່ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີ [param index] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Returns the number of messages in the export log."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນບັນທຶກການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid "Returns the text for the message with the given [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີ [param index] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Returns the type for the message with the given [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນປະເພດຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີ [param index] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the export operating system handled by this "
"[EditorExportPlatform] class, as a friendly string. Possible return values "
"are [code]Windows[/code], [code]Linux[/code], [code]macOS[/code], "
"[code]Android[/code], [code]iOS[/code], and [code]Web[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍຄລາດ [EditorExportPlatform] ນີ້. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ອາດຈະສົ່ງຄືນແມ່ນ [code]Windows[/code], [code]Linux[/code], [code]macOS[/code], "
"[code]Android[/code], [code]iOS[/code], ແລະ [code]Web[/code]."

msgid "Returns most severe message type currently present in the export log."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນປະເພດຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຮຸນແຮງທີ່ສຸດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນບັນທຶກການສົ່ງອອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Saves PCK archive and returns [Dictionary] with the following keys: "
"[code]result: Error[/code], [code]so_files: Array[/code] (array of the shared/"
"static objects which contains dictionaries with the following keys: "
"[code]path: String[/code], [code]tags: PackedStringArray[/code], and "
"[code]target_folder: String[/code]).\n"
"If [param embed] is [code]true[/code], PCK content is appended to the end of "
"[param path] file and return [Dictionary] additionally include following "
"keys: [code]embedded_start: int[/code] (embedded PCK offset) and "
"[code]embedded_size: int[/code] (embedded PCK size)."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ PCK ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [Dictionary] ທີ່ມີຄີດັ່ງນີ້: [code]result: Error[/code], "
"[code]so_files: Array[/code] (ອາເຣຂອງວັດຖຸ shared/static ທີ່ບັນຈຸ dictionary "
"ທີ່ມີຄີດັ່ງນີ້: [code]path: String[/code], [code]tags: PackedStringArray[/code], ແລະ "
"[code]target_folder: String[/code]).\n"
"ຖ້າ [param embed] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເນື້ອໃນ PCK ຈະຖືກຕໍ່ໃສ່ທ້າຍໄຟລ໌ [param path] "
"ແລະ [Dictionary] ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍຄີເພີ່ມເຕີມດັ່ງນີ້: [code]embedded_start: int[/code] "
"(ໄລຍະອອຟເຊັດຂອງ PCK ທີ່ຝັງໄວ້) ແລະ [code]embedded_size: int[/code] (ຂະໜາດຂອງ PCK "
"ທີ່ຝັງໄວ້)."

msgid ""
"Saves patch PCK archive and returns [Dictionary] with the following keys: "
"[code]result: Error[/code], [code]so_files: Array[/code] (array of the shared/"
"static objects which contains dictionaries with the following keys: "
"[code]path: String[/code], [code]tags: PackedStringArray[/code], and "
"[code]target_folder: String[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ແພັດ PCK ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [Dictionary] ທີ່ມີຄີດັ່ງນີ້: [code]result: Error[/"
"code], [code]so_files: Array[/code] (ອາເຣຂອງວັດຖຸ shared/static ທີ່ບັນຈຸ dictionary "
"ທີ່ມີຄີດັ່ງນີ້: [code]path: String[/code], [code]tags: PackedStringArray[/code], ແລະ "
"[code]target_folder: String[/code])."

msgid ""
"Saves ZIP archive and returns [Dictionary] with the following keys: "
"[code]result: Error[/code], [code]so_files: Array[/code] (array of the shared/"
"static objects which contains dictionaries with the following keys: "
"[code]path: String[/code], [code]tags: PackedStringArray[/code], and "
"[code]target_folder: String[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ ZIP ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [Dictionary] ທີ່ມີຄີດັ່ງນີ້: [code]result: Error[/code], "
"[code]so_files: Array[/code] (ອາເຣຂອງວັດຖຸ shared/static ທີ່ບັນຈຸ dictionary "
"ທີ່ມີຄີດັ່ງນີ້: [code]path: String[/code], [code]tags: PackedStringArray[/code], ແລະ "
"[code]target_folder: String[/code])."

msgid ""
"Saves patch ZIP archive and returns [Dictionary] with the following keys: "
"[code]result: Error[/code], [code]so_files: Array[/code] (array of the shared/"
"static objects which contains dictionaries with the following keys: "
"[code]path: String[/code], [code]tags: PackedStringArray[/code], and "
"[code]target_folder: String[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ແພັດ ZIP ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [Dictionary] ທີ່ມີຄີດັ່ງນີ້: [code]result: Error[/"
"code], [code]so_files: Array[/code] (ອາເຣຂອງວັດຖຸ shared/static ທີ່ບັນຈຸ dictionary "
"ທີ່ມີຄີດັ່ງນີ້: [code]path: String[/code], [code]tags: PackedStringArray[/code], ແລະ "
"[code]target_folder: String[/code])."

msgid "Uploads specified file over SCP protocol to the remote host."
msgstr "ອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸຜ່ານໂປຣໂຕຄໍ SCP ໄປຍັງໂຮສ (host) ທາງໄກ."

msgid ""
"Executes specified command on the remote host via SSH protocol and returns "
"command output in the [param output]."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ລະບຸໃນໂຮສທາງໄກຜ່ານໂປຣໂຕຄໍ SSH ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນຜົນລັດຂອງຄຳສັ່ງໃນ [param output]."

msgid ""
"Executes specified command on the remote host via SSH protocol and returns "
"process ID (on the remote host) without waiting for command to finish."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ລະບຸໃນໂຮສທາງໄກຜ່ານໂປຣໂຕຄໍ SSH ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ຂອງໂປຣເຊສ (ໃນໂຮສທາງໄກ) "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງສຳເລັດ."

msgid ""
"Invalid message type used as the default value when no type is specified."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸປະເພດ."

msgid ""
"Message type for informational messages that have no effect on the export."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ຄວາມສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"Message type for warning messages that should be addressed but still allow to "
"complete the export."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ຄວາມສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມເຕືອນທີ່ຄວນໄດ້ຮັບການແກ້ໄຂ ແຕ່ຍັງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ການສົ່ງອອກສຳເລັດ."

msgid ""
"Message type for error messages that must be addressed and fail the export."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ຄວາມສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດທີ່ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ການສົ່ງອອກລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"Flag is set if the remotely debugged project is expected to use the remote "
"file system. If set, [method gen_export_flags] will append [code]--remote-fs[/"
"code] and [code]--remote-fs-password[/code] (if [member "
"EditorSettings.filesystem/file_server/password] is defined) command line "
"arguments to the returned list."
msgstr ""
"ແຟລັກ (Flag) ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຫາກໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ກຳລັງດີບັກທາງໄກຄາດວ່າຈະໃຊ້ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທາງໄກ. ຫາກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, "
"[method gen_export_flags] ຈະເພີ່ມອາກິວເມນຄຳສັ່ງ [code]--remote-fs[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]--remote-fs-password[/code] (ຫາກ [member EditorSettings.filesystem/"
"file_server/password] ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້) ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນ."

msgid ""
"Flag is set if remote debug is enabled. If set, [method gen_export_flags] "
"will append [code]--remote-debug[/code] and [code]--breakpoints[/code] (if "
"breakpoints are selected in the script editor or added by the plugin) command "
"line arguments to the returned list."
msgstr ""
"ແຟລັກຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານການດີບັກທາງໄກ. ຫາກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, [method gen_export_flags] "
"ຈະເພີ່ມອາກິວເມນຄຳສັ່ງ [code]--remote-debug[/code] ແລະ [code]--breakpoints[/code] "
"(ຫາກມີການເລືອກຈຸດຢຸດໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມໂດຍປລັກອິນ) ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນ."

msgid ""
"Flag is set if remotely debugged project is running on the localhost. If set, "
"[method gen_export_flags] will use [code]localhost[/code] instead of [member "
"EditorSettings.network/debug/remote_host] as remote debugger host."
msgstr ""
"ແຟລັກຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຫາກໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ດີບັກທາງໄກກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນ localhost. ຫາກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, [method "
"gen_export_flags] ຈະໃຊ້ [code]localhost[/code] ແທນທີ່ [member "
"EditorSettings.network/debug/remote_host] ເປັນໂຮສດີບັກທາງໄກ."

msgid ""
"Flag is set if the \"Visible Collision Shapes\" remote debug option is "
"enabled. If set, [method gen_export_flags] will append the [code]--debug-"
"collisions[/code] command line argument to the returned list."
msgstr ""
"ແຟລັກຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກດີບັກທາງໄກ \"Visible Collision Shapes\". ຫາກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, "
"[method gen_export_flags] ຈະເພີ່ມອາກິວເມນຄຳສັ່ງ [code]--debug-collisions[/code] "
"ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນ."

msgid ""
"Flag is set if the \"Visible Navigation\" remote debug option is enabled. If "
"set, [method gen_export_flags] will append the [code]--debug-navigation[/"
"code] command line argument to the returned list."
msgstr ""
"ແຟລັກຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກດີບັກທາງໄກ \"Visible Navigation\". ຫາກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, [method "
"gen_export_flags] ຈະເພີ່ມອາກິວເມນຄຳສັ່ງ [code]--debug-navigation[/code] "
"ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນ."

msgid "Exporter for Android."
msgstr "ຕົວສົ່ງອອກສຳລັບ Android."

msgid "Exporting for Android"
msgstr "ການສົ່ງອອກສຳລັບ Android"

msgid "Gradle builds for Android"
msgstr "ການບິວດ້ວຍ Gradle ສຳລັບ Android"

msgid "Android plugins documentation index"
msgstr "ດັດຊະນີເອກະສານປລັກອິນ Android"

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [code]arm64[/code] binaries are included into exported "
"project."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີ [code]arm64[/code] "
"ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [code]arm32[/code] binaries are included into exported "
"project."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີ [code]arm32[/code] "
"ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [code]x86_32[/code] binaries are included into exported "
"project."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີ [code]x86_32[/code] "
"ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [code]x86_64[/code] binaries are included into exported "
"project."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີ [code]x86_64[/code] "
"ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"A list of additional command line arguments, separated by space, which the "
"exported project will receive when started."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການຂອງອາກິວເມນຄຳສັ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ແຍກດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງ, ເຊິ່ງໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຈະໄດ້ຮັບເມື່ອເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"Path to an APK file to use as a custom export template for debug exports. If "
"left empty, default template is used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only used if [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] is disabled."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ APK ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກແບບກຳນົດເອງ ສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກເພື່ອດີບັກ. "
"ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Path to an APK file to use as a custom export template for release exports. "
"If left empty, default template is used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only used if [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] is disabled."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ APK ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກແບບກຳນົດເອງ ສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກເວີຊັນປ່ອຍ. "
"ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [url=https://developer.android.com/design/ui/wear/"
"guides/components/swipe-to-dismiss]Swipe to dismiss[/url] will be enabled.\n"
"This functionality is intended for smartwatches and is generally ignored on "
"standard Android devices. However, some devices may not ignore it. Therefore, "
"it is recommended to keep this feature disabled for standard Android apps to "
"avoid unexpected behavior.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is [code]false[/code] by default. To enable this behavior, "
"[member EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] is "
"required."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], [url=https://developer.android.com/design/ui/wear/"
"guides/components/swipe-to-dismiss]Swipe to dismiss[/url] ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ.\n"
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ມີໄວ້ສຳລັບສະມາດວັອດ (smartwatches) ແລະ ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະຖືກລະເລີຍໃນອຸປະກອນ Android "
"ມາດຕະຖານ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ບາງອຸປະກອນອາດຈະບໍ່ລະເລີຍມັນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຈຶ່ງແນະນຳໃຫ້ປິດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໄວ້ສຳລັບແອັບ Android ມາດຕະຖານ ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ [code]false[/code] ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ "
"[member EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build]."

msgid ""
"Path to a ZIP file holding the source for the export template used in a "
"Gradle build. If left empty, the default template is used."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ ZIP ທີ່ເກັບຊອດໂຄດສຳລັບຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການບິວດ້ວຍ Gradle. "
"ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], native libraries are compressed when performing a "
"Gradle build.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] While enabling compression can reduce the size of the binary, it "
"may result in slower application startup because the native libraries must be "
"extracted before use, rather than being loaded directly.\n"
"If you're distributing your app via the Play Store, it's generally "
"recommended to keep this option [code]false[/code], see [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/build/releases/past-releases/agp-3-6-0-release-"
"notes#extractNativeLibs]official documentation[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໄລບຣາຣີເນທີບ (native libraries) "
"ຈະຖືກບີບອັດເມື່ອເຮັດການບິວດ້ວຍ Gradle.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເຖິງວ່າການບີບອັດຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຂະໜາດຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີໄດ້, "
"ແຕ່ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຊ້າລົງ ເພາະວ່າໄລບຣາຣີເນທີບຕ້ອງຖືກແຍກອອກມາກ່ອນນຳໃຊ້, "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະຖືກໂຫຼດໂດຍກົງ.\n"
"ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງເຜີຍແຜ່ແອັບຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານ Play Store, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code], ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/build/releases/"
"past-releases/agp-3-6-0-release-notes#extractNativeLibs]ເອກະສານທາງການ[/url]."

msgid ""
"A dictionary of custom theme attributes to include in the exported Android "
"project. Each entry defines a theme attribute name and its value, and will be "
"added to the [b]GodotAppMainTheme[/b].\n"
"For example, the key [code]android:windowSwipeToDismiss[/code] with the value "
"[code]false[/code] is resolved to [code]<item "
"name=\"android:windowSwipeToDismiss\">false</item>[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To add a custom attribute to the [b]GodotAppSplashTheme[/b], "
"prefix the attribute name with [code][splash][/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Reserved attributes configured via other export options or "
"project settings cannot be overridden by [code]custom_theme_attributes[/code] "
"and are skipped during export."
msgstr ""
"ດິກຊັນນາຣີຂອງຄຸນລັກສະນະທີມ (theme attributes) ແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອລວມເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກ Android "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ. ແຕ່ລະລາຍການຈະກຳນົດຊື່ຄຸນລັກສະນະທີມ ແລະ ຄ່າຂອງມັນ, ແລະ ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ "
"[b]GodotAppMainTheme[/b].\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຄີ [code]android:windowSwipeToDismiss[/code] ທີ່ມີຄ່າ [code]false[/code] "
"ຈະຖືກແປງເປັນ [code]<item name=\"android:windowSwipeToDismiss\">false</item>[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄຸນລັກສະນະກຳນົດເອງໃສ່ [b]GodotAppSplashTheme[/b], "
"ໃຫ້ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນຊື່ຄຸນລັກສະນະດ້ວຍ [code][splash][/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ຖືກສະຫງວນໄວ້ເຊິ່ງຕັ້ງຄ່າຜ່ານຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງອອກອື່ນໆ ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ "
"ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກຂຽນທັບໂດຍ [code]custom_theme_attributes[/code] ແລະ "
"ຈະຖືກຂ້າມໄປໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"Path to the Gradle build directory. If left empty, then [code]res://android[/"
"code] will be used."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄດເຣັກທໍຣີການບິວຂອງ Gradle. ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະໃຊ້ [code]res://android[/code]."

msgid ""
"Minimum Android API level required for the application to run (used during "
"Gradle build). See [url=https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/"
"uses-sdk-element#uses]android:minSdkVersion[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບ Android API ຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ (ໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການບິວດ້ວຍ "
"Gradle). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/uses-"
"sdk-element#uses]android:minSdkVersion[/url]."

msgid ""
"The Android API level on which the application is designed to run (used "
"during Gradle build). See [url=https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/"
"manifest/uses-sdk-element#uses]android:targetSdkVersion[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບ Android API ທີ່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກ (ໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການບິວດ້ວຍ Gradle). "
"ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/uses-sdk-"
"element#uses]android:targetSdkVersion[/url]."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], Gradle build is used instead of pre-built APK."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ການບິວດ້ວຍ Gradle ແທນ APK ທີ່ບິວໄວ້ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], OpenGL ES debug context will be created (additional "
"runtime checking, validation, and logging)."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄອນເທັກດີບັກ (debug context) ຂອງ OpenGL ES ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ "
"(ມີການກວດສອບການເຮັດວຽກ, ການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ, ແລະ ການບັນທຶກລັອກເພີ່ມເຕີມ)."

msgid ""
"Path of the debug keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_DEBUG_PATH[/code].\n"
"Fallbacks to [code]EditorSettings.export/android/debug_keystore[/code] if "
"empty."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງຂອງໄຟລ໌ debug keystore.\n"
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_DEBUG_PATH[/"
"code].\n"
"ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້ ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ [code]EditorSettings.export/android/debug_keystore[/code]."

msgid ""
"Password for the debug keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_DEBUG_PASSWORD[/code].\n"
"Fallbacks to [code]EditorSettings.export/android/debug_keystore_pass[/code] "
"if both it and [member keystore/debug] are empty."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ debug keystore.\n"
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_DEBUG_PASSWORD[/"
"code].\n"
"ຫາກທັງຕົວມັນເອງ ແລະ [member keystore/debug] ປະວ່າງໄວ້ ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ "
"[code]EditorSettings.export/android/debug_keystore_pass[/code]."

msgid ""
"User name for the debug keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_DEBUG_USER[/code].\n"
"Fallbacks to [code]EditorSettings.export/android/debug_keystore_user[/code] "
"if both it and [member keystore/debug] are empty."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ debug keystore.\n"
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_DEBUG_USER[/"
"code].\n"
"ຫາກທັງຕົວມັນເອງ ແລະ [member keystore/debug] ປະວ່າງໄວ້ ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ "
"[code]EditorSettings.export/android/debug_keystore_user[/code]."

msgid ""
"Path of the release keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_RELEASE_PATH[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງຂອງໄຟລ໌ release keystore.\n"
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_RELEASE_PATH[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Password for the release keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_RELEASE_PASSWORD[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ release keystore.\n"
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_RELEASE_PASSWORD[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"User name for the release keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_RELEASE_USER[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ release keystore.\n"
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_RELEASE_USER[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Background layer of the application adaptive icon file. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/icon_design_adaptive#design-"
"adaptive-icons]Design adaptive icons[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຊັ້ນພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄອຄອນແບບປັບຕົວໄດ້ (adaptive icon). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/icon_design_adaptive#design-"
"adaptive-icons]ການອອກແບບໄອຄອນແບບປັບຕົວໄດ້[/url]."

msgid ""
"Foreground layer of the application adaptive icon file. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/icon_design_adaptive#design-"
"adaptive-icons]Design adaptive icons[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຊັ້ນພື້ນໜ້າຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄອຄອນແບບປັບຕົວໄດ້ (adaptive icon). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/icon_design_adaptive#design-"
"adaptive-icons]ການອອກແບບໄອຄອນແບບປັບຕົວໄດ້[/url]."

msgid ""
"Monochrome layer of the application adaptive icon file. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/icon_design_adaptive#design-"
"adaptive-icons]Design adaptive icons[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຊັ້ນແບບສີດຽວ (monochrome) ຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄອຄອນແບບປັບຕົວໄດ້ (adaptive icon). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/icon_design_adaptive#design-"
"adaptive-icons]ການອອກແບບໄອຄອນແບບປັບຕົວໄດ້[/url]."

msgid ""
"Application icon file. If left empty, it will fallback to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/icon]."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ໄອຄອນຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/icon]."

msgid ""
"Application category for the Google Play Store. Only define this if your "
"application fits one of the categories well. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/application-"
"element#appCategory]android:appCategory[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ໝວດໝູ່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນສຳລັບ Google Play Store. "
"ໃຫ້ກຳນົດສິ່ງນີ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອແອັບຂອງທ່ານກົງກັບໝວດໝູ່ໃດໜຶ່ງຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/application-"
"element#appCategory]android:appCategory[/url]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], task initiated by main activity will be excluded from "
"the list of recently used applications. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/activity-"
"element#exclude]android:excludeFromRecents[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ງານທີ່ເລີ່ມໂດຍກິດຈະກຳຫຼັກ (main activity) "
"ຈະຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກລາຍການແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"guide/topics/manifest/activity-element#exclude]android:excludeFromRecents[/"
"url]."

msgid "Name of the application."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when the user uninstalls an app, a prompt to keep the "
"app's data will be shown. See [url=https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/"
"manifest/application-element#fragileuserdata]android:hasFragileUserData[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງແອັບ, "
"ຈະມີຂໍ້ຄວາມຖາມວ່າຕ້ອງການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງແອັບໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"guide/topics/manifest/application-"
"element#fragileuserdata]android:hasFragileUserData[/url]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the user will be able to set this app as the system "
"launcher in Android preferences."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າແອັບນີ້ເປັນຕົວເປີດລະບົບ (launcher) "
"ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ Android ໄດ້."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], this app will show in Android TV launcher UI."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແອັບນີ້ຈະສະແດງໃນໜ້າຈໍຕົວເປີດຂອງ Android TV."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this app will show in the device's app library.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is [code]true[/code] by default."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແອັບນີ້ຈະສະແດງໃນຄັງແອັບ (app library) ຂອງອຸປະກອນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], package signing is enabled."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການເຊັນຊື່ແພັກເກດ (package signing) ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Unique application identifier in a reverse-DNS format. The reverse DNS format "
"should preferably match a domain name you control, but this is not strictly "
"required. For instance, if you own [code]example.com[/code], your package "
"unique name should preferably be of the form [code]com.example.mygame[/code]. "
"This identifier can only contain lowercase alphanumeric characters ([code]a-"
"z[/code], and [code]0-9[/code]), underscores ([code]_[/code]), and periods "
"([code].[/code]). Each component of the reverse DNS format must start with a "
"letter: for instance, [code]com.example.8game[/code] is not valid.\n"
"If [code]$genname[/code] is present in the value, it will be replaced by the "
"project name converted to lowercase. If there are invalid characters in the "
"project name, they will be stripped. If all characters in the project name "
"are stripped, [code]$genname[/code] is replaced by [code]noname[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing the package name will cause the package to be "
"considered as a new package, with its own installation and data paths. The "
"new package won't be usable to update existing installations.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When publishing to Google Play, the package name must be "
"[i]globally[/i] unique. This means no other apps published on Google Play "
"must be using the same package name as yours. Otherwise, you'll be prevented "
"from publishing your app on Google Play."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວລະບຸແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນໃນຮູບແບບ reverse-DNS. ຮູບແບບ reverse DNS "
"ຄວນຈະກົງກັບຊື່ໂດເມນທີ່ທ່ານຄວບຄຸມ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ບັງຄັບຢ່າງເຂັ້ມງວດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຫາກທ່ານເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງ "
"[code]example.com[/code], ຊື່ແພັກເກດຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ "
"[code]com.example.mygame[/code]. ຕົວລະບຸນີ້ສາມາດປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນພາສາອັງກິດຕົວພິມນ້ອຍ "
"([code]a-z[/code] ແລະ [code]0-9[/code]), ຂີດກ້ອງ ([code]_[/code]), ແລະ ຈຸດ "
"([code].[/code]). ແຕ່ລະສ່ວນຂອງຮູບແບບ reverse DNS ຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນ: ຕົວຢ່າງ "
"[code]com.example.8game[/code] ແມ່ນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"ຫາກມີ [code]$genname[/code] ຢູ່ໃນຄ່າ, ມັນຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍຊື່ໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ຖືກແປງເປັນຕົວພິມນ້ອຍ. "
"ຫາກມີຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນຊື່ໂປຣເຈັກ, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ. ຫາກຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດໃນຊື່ໂປຣເຈັກຖືກຕັດອອກ, "
"[code]$genname[/code] ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍ [code]noname[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນຊື່ແພັກເກດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແພັກເກດນັ້ນຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນແພັກເກດໃໝ່, "
"ເຊິ່ງມີເສັ້ນທາງການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນເປັນຂອງຕົນເອງ. "
"ແພັກເກດໃໝ່ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອອັບເດດການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອເຜີຍແຜ່ໃນ Google Play, ຊື່ແພັກເກດຕ້ອງບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັບໃຜໃນລະດັບໂລກ "
"([i]globally[/i]). ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີແອັບອື່ນທີ່ເຜີຍແຜ່ໃນ Google Play "
"ໃຊ້ຊື່ແພັກເກດດຽວກັບຂອງທ່ານ. ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຈະຖືກຂັດຂວາງບໍ່ໃຫ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ແອັບໃນ Google Play ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Allows read/write access to the \"properties\" table in the checkin database. "
"See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_CHECKIN_PROPERTIES]ACCESS_CHECKIN_PROPERTIES[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງການອ່ານ/ຂຽນ ຕາຕະລາງ \"properties\" ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນການເຊັກອິນ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_CHECKIN_PROPERTIES]ACCESS_CHECKIN_PROPERTIES[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows access to the approximate location information. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION]ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານທີ່ແບບປະມານ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION]ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows access to the precise location information. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION]ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານທີ່ແບບຊັດເຈນ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION]ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows access to the extra location provider commands. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_LOCATION_EXTRA_COMMANDS]ACCESS_LOCATION_EXTRA_COMMANDS[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຄຳສັ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_LOCATION_EXTRA_COMMANDS]ACCESS_LOCATION_EXTRA_COMMANDS[/"
"url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to access any geographic locations persisted in the "
"user's shared collection. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#ACCESS_MEDIA_LOCATION]ACCESS_MEDIA_LOCATION[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເຂົ້າເຖິງຕຳແໜ່ງທາງພູມສາດໃດໆ ທີ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຄັງສະສົມຮ່ວມກັນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_MEDIA_LOCATION]ACCESS_MEDIA_LOCATION[/url]."

msgid "Allows an application to create mock location providers for testing."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນສ້າງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່ຈຳລອງເພື່ອການທົດສອບ."

msgid ""
"Allows access to the information about networks. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE]ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE]ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE[/url]."

msgid "Allows an application to use SurfaceFlinger's low level features."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດລະດັບຕ່ຳຂອງ SurfaceFlinger."

msgid ""
"Allows access to the information about Wi-Fi networks. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_WIFI_STATE]ACCESS_WIFI_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍ Wi-Fi. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#ACCESS_WIFI_STATE]ACCESS_WIFI_STATE[/"
"url]."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to call into AccountAuthenticators. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCOUNT_MANAGER]ACCOUNT_MANAGER[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເອີ້ນໃຊ້ AccountAuthenticators. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCOUNT_MANAGER]ACCOUNT_MANAGER[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to add voicemails into the system. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ADD_VOICEMAIL]ADD_VOICEMAIL[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມສຽງ (voicemail) ເຂົ້າໃນລະບົບ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ADD_VOICEMAIL]ADD_VOICEMAIL[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to act as an AccountAuthenticator for the "
"AccountManager."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ AccountAuthenticator ສຳລັບ AccountManager."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to collect battery statistics. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BATTERY_STATS]BATTERY_STATS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເກັບກຳສະຖິຕິແບັດເຕີຣີ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BATTERY_STATS]BATTERY_STATS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Must be required by an AccessibilityService, to ensure that only the system "
"can bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE]BIND_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍໂດຍ AccessibilityService "
"ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າມີພຽງແຕ່ລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບມັນໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE]BIND_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE[/"
"url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to tell the AppWidget service which application can "
"access AppWidget's data. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#BIND_APPWIDGET]BIND_APPWIDGET[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນແຈ້ງບໍລິການ AppWidget ວ່າແອັບໃດສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ AppWidget ໄດ້. "
"ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_APPWIDGET]BIND_APPWIDGET[/url]."

msgid ""
"Must be required by device administration receiver, to ensure that only the "
"system can interact with it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#BIND_DEVICE_ADMIN]BIND_DEVICE_ADMIN[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍໂດຍຜູ້ຮັບການຈັດການອຸປະກອນ ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າມີພຽງແຕ່ລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດໂຕ້ຕອບກັບມັນໄດ້. "
"ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_DEVICE_ADMIN]BIND_DEVICE_ADMIN[/url]."

msgid ""
"Must be required by an InputMethodService, to ensure that only the system can "
"bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_INPUT_METHOD]BIND_INPUT_METHOD[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍໂດຍ InputMethodService ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າມີພຽງແຕ່ລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບມັນໄດ້. "
"ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_INPUT_METHOD]BIND_INPUT_METHOD[/url]."

msgid ""
"Must be required by a HostApduService or OffHostApduService to ensure that "
"only the system can bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BIND_NFC_SERVICE]BIND_NFC_SERVICE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍໂດຍ HostApduService ຫຼື OffHostApduService "
"ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າມີພຽງແຕ່ລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບມັນໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_NFC_SERVICE]BIND_NFC_SERVICE[/url]."

msgid ""
"Must be required by a NotificationListenerService, to ensure that only the "
"system can bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_NOTIFICATION_LISTENER_SERVICE]BIND_NOTIFICATION_LISTENER_SERVICE[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍໂດຍ NotificationListenerService "
"ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າມີພຽງແຕ່ລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບມັນໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_NOTIFICATION_LISTENER_SERVICE]BIND_NOTIFICATION_LISTENER_SERVICE[/"
"url]."

msgid ""
"Must be required by a PrintService, to ensure that only the system can bind "
"to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_PRINT_SERVICE]BIND_PRINT_SERVICE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍໂດຍ PrintService ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າມີພຽງແຕ່ລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບມັນໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_PRINT_SERVICE]BIND_PRINT_SERVICE[/url]."

msgid ""
"Must be required by a RemoteViewsService, to ensure that only the system can "
"bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_REMOTEVIEWS]BIND_REMOTEVIEWS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍໂດຍ RemoteViewsService ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າມີພຽງແຕ່ລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບມັນໄດ້. "
"ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_REMOTEVIEWS]BIND_REMOTEVIEWS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Must be required by a TextService (e.g. SpellCheckerService) to ensure that "
"only the system can bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BIND_TEXT_SERVICE]BIND_TEXT_SERVICE[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍໂດຍ TextService (ເຊັ່ນ: SpellCheckerService) "
"ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າມີພຽງແຕ່ລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບມັນໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_TEXT_SERVICE]BIND_TEXT_SERVICE[/url]."

msgid ""
"Must be required by a VpnService, to ensure that only the system can bind to "
"it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_VPN_SERVICE]BIND_VPN_SERVICE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍໂດຍ VpnService ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າມີພຽງແຕ່ລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບມັນໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_VPN_SERVICE]BIND_VPN_SERVICE[/url]."

msgid ""
"Must be required by a WallpaperService, to ensure that only the system can "
"bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_WALLPAPER]BIND_WALLPAPER[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍໂດຍ WallpaperService ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າມີພຽງແຕ່ລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບມັນໄດ້. "
"ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_WALLPAPER]BIND_WALLPAPER[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to connect to paired bluetooth devices. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH]BLUETOOTH[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອຸປະກອນບລູທູດ (Bluetooth) ທີ່ຈັບຄູ່ແລ້ວ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH]BLUETOOTH[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to discover and pair bluetooth devices. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH_ADMIN]BLUETOOTH_ADMIN[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ຈັບຄູ່ອຸປະກອນບລູທູດ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH_ADMIN]BLUETOOTH_ADMIN[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to pair bluetooth devices without user interaction, and "
"to allow or disallow phonebook access or message access. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED]BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈັບຄູ່ອຸປະກອນບລູທູດໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໂຕ້ຕອບ, ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດ ຫຼື "
"ປະຕິເສດການເຂົ້າເຖິງສະໝຸດລາຍຊື່ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED]BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED[/url]."

msgid "Required to be able to disable the device (very dangerous!)."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານອຸປະກອນ (ອັນຕະລາຍຫຼາຍ!)."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to broadcast a notification that an application package "
"has been removed. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_PACKAGE_REMOVED]BROADCAST_PACKAGE_REMOVED[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນກະຈາຍການແຈ້ງເຕືອນວ່າແພັກເກດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຖືກລຶບອອກແລ້ວ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_PACKAGE_REMOVED]BROADCAST_PACKAGE_REMOVED[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to broadcast an SMS receipt notification. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_SMS]BROADCAST_SMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນກະຈາຍການແຈ້ງເຕືອນການຮັບ SMS. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_SMS]BROADCAST_SMS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to broadcast sticky intents. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_STICKY]BROADCAST_STICKY[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນກະຈາຍ sticky intents. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_STICKY]BROADCAST_STICKY[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to broadcast a WAP PUSH receipt notification. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_WAP_PUSH]BROADCAST_WAP_PUSH[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນກະຈາຍການແຈ້ງເຕືອນການຮັບ WAP PUSH. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_WAP_PUSH]BROADCAST_WAP_PUSH[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to initiate a phone call without going through the "
"Dialer user interface. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#CALL_PHONE]CALL_PHONE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເລີ່ມການໂທອອກໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຜ່ານໜ້າຈໍໂທລະສັບ (Dialer). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CALL_PHONE]CALL_PHONE[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to call any phone number, including emergency numbers, "
"without going through the Dialer user interface. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CALL_PRIVILEGED]CALL_PRIVILEGED[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໂທຫາເບີໂທລະສັບໃດໆກໍໄດ້, ລວມທັງເບີສຸກເສີນ, ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຜ່ານໜ້າຈໍໂທລະສັບ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CALL_PRIVILEGED]CALL_PRIVILEGED[/url]."

msgid ""
"Required to be able to access the camera device. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#CAMERA]CAMERA[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງກ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#CAMERA]CAMERA[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to capture audio output. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT]CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນບັນທຶກສຽງທີ່ອອກມາ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT]CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT[/url]."

msgid "Allows an application to capture secure video output."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນບັນທຶກວິດີໂອທີ່ອອກມາແບບປອດໄພ."

msgid "Allows an application to capture video output."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນບັນທຶກວິດີໂອທີ່ອອກມາ."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to change whether an application component (other than "
"its own) is enabled or not. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_COMPONENT_ENABLED_STATE]CHANGE_COMPONENT_ENABLED_STATE[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນປ່ຽນສະຖານະການເປີດ/ປິດໃຊ້ງານຂອງສ່ວນປະກອບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນ "
"(ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂອງຕົນເອງ). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_COMPONENT_ENABLED_STATE]CHANGE_COMPONENT_ENABLED_STATE[/"
"url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to modify the current configuration, such as locale. "
"See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_CONFIGURATION]CHANGE_CONFIGURATION[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນ ເຊັ່ນ: ພາສາ (locale). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_CONFIGURATION]CHANGE_CONFIGURATION[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to change network connectivity state. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE]CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນປ່ຽນສະຖານະການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE]CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to enter Wi-Fi Multicast mode. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE]CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດ Wi-Fi Multicast. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE]CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE[/"
"url]."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to change Wi-Fi connectivity state. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_WIFI_STATE]CHANGE_WIFI_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນປ່ຽນສະຖານະການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ Wi-Fi. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_WIFI_STATE]CHANGE_WIFI_STATE[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to clear the caches of all installed applications on "
"the device. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CLEAR_APP_CACHE]CLEAR_APP_CACHE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນລ້າງແຄຊ໌ (cache) ຂອງທຸກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນອຸປະກອນ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CLEAR_APP_CACHE]CLEAR_APP_CACHE[/url]."

msgid "Allows an application to clear user data."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Allows enabling/disabling location update notifications from the radio. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CONTROL_LOCATION_UPDATES]CONTROL_LOCATION_UPDATES[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເປີດ/ປິດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນການອັບເດດສະຖານທີ່ຈາກສັນຍານວິທະຍຸ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CONTROL_LOCATION_UPDATES]CONTROL_LOCATION_UPDATES[/url]."

msgid "Array of custom permission strings."
msgstr "ອາເຣຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມການອະນຸຍາດແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to delete packages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DELETE_PACKAGES]DELETE_PACKAGES[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນລຶບແພັກເກດ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#DELETE_PACKAGES]DELETE_PACKAGES[/url]."

msgid "Allows low-level access to power management."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງການຈັດການພະລັງງານໃນລະດັບຕ່ຳ."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to RW to diagnostic resources. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DIAGNOSTIC]DIAGNOSTIC[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານ/ຂຽນ ຊັບພະຍາກອນການວິນິດໄສ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DIAGNOSTIC]DIAGNOSTIC[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to disable the keyguard if it is not secure. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DISABLE_KEYGUARD]DISABLE_KEYGUARD[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນປິດການລັອກໜ້າຈໍ (keyguard) ຫາກມັນບໍ່ປອດໄພ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DISABLE_KEYGUARD]DISABLE_KEYGUARD[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to retrieve state dump information from system "
"services. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DUMP]DUMP[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການດຳເນີນງານ (state dump) ຈາກບໍລິການລະບົບ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#DUMP]DUMP[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to expand or collapse the status bar. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#EXPAND_STATUS_BAR]EXPAND_STATUS_BAR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື ຫຍໍ້ແຖບສະຖານະ (status bar). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#EXPAND_STATUS_BAR]EXPAND_STATUS_BAR[/url]."

msgid ""
"Run as a manufacturer test application, running as the root user. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#FACTORY_TEST]FACTORY_TEST[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດວຽກເປັນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທົດສອບຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ, ໂດຍເຮັດວຽກໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ root. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#FACTORY_TEST]FACTORY_TEST[/url]."

msgid "Allows access to the flashlight."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟສາຍ."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to force a BACK operation on whatever is the top "
"activity."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນບັງຄັບການເຮັດວຽກ BACK (ກັບຄືນ) ໃນກິດຈະກຳໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ຢູ່ເທິງສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Allows access to the list of accounts in the Accounts Service. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#GET_ACCOUNTS]GET_ACCOUNTS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງລາຍການບັນຊີໃນບໍລິການບັນຊີ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#GET_ACCOUNTS]GET_ACCOUNTS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to find out the space used by any package. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#GET_PACKAGE_SIZE]GET_PACKAGE_SIZE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນກວດສອບພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍແພັກເກດໃດໜຶ່ງ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#GET_PACKAGE_SIZE]GET_PACKAGE_SIZE[/url]."

msgid "Deprecated in API level 21."
msgstr "ຖືກຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານໃນ API ລະດັບ 21."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to retrieve private information about the current top "
"activity."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນດຶງຂໍ້ມູນສ່ວນຕົວ ກ່ຽວກັບກິດຈະກຳທີ່ຢູ່ເທິງສຸດໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Used on content providers to allow the global search system to access their "
"data. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#GLOBAL_SEARCH]GLOBAL_SEARCH[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການເນື້ອໃນ ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລະບົບການຄົ້ນຫາທົ່ວໂລກເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງພວກເຂົາໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#GLOBAL_SEARCH]GLOBAL_SEARCH[/url]."

msgid "Allows access to hardware peripherals."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງອຸປະກອນຕໍ່ພ່ວງຮາດແວ."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to inject user events (keys, touch, trackball) into the "
"event stream and deliver them to ANY window."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນແຊກເຫດການຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ (ການກົດປຸ່ມ, ການສຳຜັດ, ແທຣັກບອນ) ເຂົ້າໃນກະແສເຫດການ "
"ແລະ ສົ່ງພວກມັນໄປຍັງໜ້າຕ່າງໃດໆກໍໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to install a location provider into the Location "
"Manager. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INSTALL_LOCATION_PROVIDER]INSTALL_LOCATION_PROVIDER[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຕິດຕັ້ງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່ເຂົ້າໃນ Location Manager. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INSTALL_LOCATION_PROVIDER]INSTALL_LOCATION_PROVIDER[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to install packages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INSTALL_PACKAGES]INSTALL_PACKAGES[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#INSTALL_PACKAGES]INSTALL_PACKAGES[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to install a shortcut in Launcher. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INSTALL_SHORTCUT]INSTALL_SHORTCUT[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຕິດຕັ້ງທາງລັດ (shortcut) ໃນຕົວເປີດແອັບ (Launcher). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INSTALL_SHORTCUT]INSTALL_SHORTCUT[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to open windows that are for use by parts of the system "
"user interface."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ມີໄວ້ສຳລັບໃຊ້ໂດຍບາງສ່ວນຂອງໜ້າຈໍຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງລະບົບ."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to open network sockets. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INTERNET]INTERNET[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເປີດເນັດເວີກຊັອກເກັດ (network sockets). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INTERNET]INTERNET[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to call "
"ActivityManager.killBackgroundProcesses(String). See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#KILL_BACKGROUND_PROCESSES]KILL_BACKGROUND_PROCESSES[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ActivityManager.killBackgroundProcesses(String). ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#KILL_BACKGROUND_PROCESSES]KILL_BACKGROUND_PROCESSES[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to use location features in hardware, such as the "
"geofencing api. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#LOCATION_HARDWARE]LOCATION_HARDWARE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດສະຖານທີ່ໃນຮາດແວ ເຊັ່ນ geofencing API. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#LOCATION_HARDWARE]LOCATION_HARDWARE[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to manage the list of accounts in the AccountManager."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈັດການລາຍການບັນຊີໃນ AccountManager."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to manage (create, destroy, Z-order) application tokens "
"in the window manager."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈັດການ (ສ້າງ, ທຳລາຍ, ຈັດລຳດັບຊັ້ນ) application tokens ໃນ window "
"manager."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to manage access to documents, usually as part of a "
"document picker. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MANAGE_DOCUMENTS]MANAGE_DOCUMENTS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈັດການການເຂົ້າເຖິງເອກະສານ, "
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງການເລືອກເອກະສານ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MANAGE_DOCUMENTS]MANAGE_DOCUMENTS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application a broad access to external storage in scoped storage. "
"See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE]MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເຂົ້າເຖິງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກໄດ້ຢ່າງກວ້າງຂວາງໃນ scoped storage. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE]MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to modify and delete media files on this device or any "
"connected storage device without user confirmation. Applications must already "
"be granted the [code]READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/code] or "
"[code]MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/code] permissions for this permission to take "
"effect. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MANAGE_MEDIA]MANAGE_MEDIA[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ລຶບໄຟລ໌ມີເດຍໃນອຸປະກອນນີ້ ຫຼື ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃດໆ ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຢືນຢັນ. ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸຍາດ [code]READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/"
"code] ຫຼື [code]MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/code] ກ່ອນແລ້ວ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການອະນຸຍາດນີ້ມີຜົນສັກສິດ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MANAGE_MEDIA]MANAGE_MEDIA[/url]."

msgid ""
"See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MASTER_CLEAR]MASTER_CLEAR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MASTER_CLEAR]MASTER_CLEAR[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to know what content is playing and control its "
"playback. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MEDIA_CONTENT_CONTROL]MEDIA_CONTENT_CONTROL[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຮູ້ວ່າເນື້ອໃນໃດກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່ ແລະ ຄວບຄຸມການຫຼິ້ນນັ້ນໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MEDIA_CONTENT_CONTROL]MEDIA_CONTENT_CONTROL[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to modify global audio settings. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS]MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຽງທົ່ວໂລກ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS]MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows modification of the telephony state - power on, mmi, etc. Does not "
"include placing calls. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#MODIFY_PHONE_STATE]MODIFY_PHONE_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂສະຖານະໂທລະສັບ ເຊັ່ນ: ການເປີດເຄື່ອງ, MMI ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. ບໍ່ລວມເຖິງການໂທອອກ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MODIFY_PHONE_STATE]MODIFY_PHONE_STATE[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows formatting file systems for removable storage. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MOUNT_FORMAT_FILESYSTEMS]MOUNT_FORMAT_FILESYSTEMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຟໍແມັດ (format) ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖອດອອກໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MOUNT_FORMAT_FILESYSTEMS]MOUNT_FORMAT_FILESYSTEMS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows mounting and unmounting file systems for removable storage. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MOUNT_UNMOUNT_FILESYSTEMS]MOUNT_UNMOUNT_FILESYSTEMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ (mount) ແລະ ຖອດການຕິດຕັ້ງ (unmount) ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖອດອອກໄດ້. "
"ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MOUNT_UNMOUNT_FILESYSTEMS]MOUNT_UNMOUNT_FILESYSTEMS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to perform I/O operations over NFC. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#NFC]NFC[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນດຳເນີນການ I/O ຜ່ານ NFC. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#NFC]NFC[/url]."

msgid "Deprecated in API level 15."
msgstr "ຖືກຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານໃນ API ລະດັບ 15."

msgid "Allows an application to make its activities persistent."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເຮັດໃຫ້ກິດຈະກຳຂອງມັນມີຄວາມຄົງຕົວ (persistent)."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to post notifications. Added in API level 33. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/notifications/"
"notification-permission]Notification runtime permission[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ. ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ API ລະດັບ 33. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/notifications/notification-"
"permission]ການອະນຸຍາດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກ[/url]."

msgid "Deprecated in API level 29."
msgstr "ຖືກຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານໃນ API ລະດັບ 29."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to see the number being dialed during an outgoing call "
"with the option to redirect the call to a different number or abort the call "
"altogether. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#PROCESS_OUTGOING_CALLS]PROCESS_OUTGOING_CALLS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເຫັນເບີທີ່ກຳລັງໂທອອກ ໂດຍມີຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງການໂທໄປຫາເບີອື່ນ ຫຼື "
"ຍົກເລີກການໂທທັງໝົດ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#PROCESS_OUTGOING_CALLS]PROCESS_OUTGOING_CALLS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to read the user's calendar data. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_CALENDAR]READ_CALENDAR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນປະຕິທິນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#READ_CALENDAR]READ_CALENDAR[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to read the user's call log. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_CALL_LOG]READ_CALL_LOG[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານປະຫວັດການໂທຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#READ_CALL_LOG]READ_CALL_LOG[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to read the user's contacts data. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_CONTACTS]READ_CONTACTS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#READ_CONTACTS]READ_CONTACTS[/url]."

msgid "Deprecated in API level 33."
msgstr "ຖືກຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານໃນ API ລະດັບ 33."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to read from external storage. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE]READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນຈາກບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE]READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to take screen shots and more generally get access to "
"the frame buffer data."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຖ່າຍພາບໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນເຟຣມບັບເຟີ (frame buffer) ໄດ້ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to read (but not write) the user's browsing history and "
"bookmarks."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານ (ແຕ່ຂຽນບໍ່ໄດ້) ປະຫວັດການທ່ອງເວັບ ແລະ ບຸກມາກ (bookmarks) ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid "Deprecated in API level 16."
msgstr "ຖືກຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານໃນ API ລະດັບ 16."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to read the low-level system log files. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_LOGS]READ_LOGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກລະບົບລະດັບຕ່ຳ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#READ_LOGS]READ_LOGS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to read audio files from external storage. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_AUDIO]READ_MEDIA_AUDIO[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານໄຟລ໌ສຽງຈາກບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_AUDIO]READ_MEDIA_AUDIO[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to read image files from external storage. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_IMAGES]READ_MEDIA_IMAGES[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບຈາກບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_IMAGES]READ_MEDIA_IMAGES[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to read video files from external storage. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_VIDEO]READ_MEDIA_VIDEO[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານໄຟລ໌ວິດີໂອຈາກບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_VIDEO]READ_MEDIA_VIDEO[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to read image or video files from external storage that "
"a user has selected via the permission prompt photo picker. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_VISUAL_USER_SELECTED]READ_MEDIA_VISUAL_USER_SELECTED[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບ ຫຼື "
"ວິດີໂອຈາກບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ເລືອກຜ່ານຕົວເລືອກຮູບພາບ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_VISUAL_USER_SELECTED]READ_MEDIA_VISUAL_USER_SELECTED[/"
"url]."

msgid ""
"Allows read only access to phone state. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_PHONE_STATE]READ_PHONE_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງສະຖານະໂທລະສັບແບບອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_PHONE_STATE]READ_PHONE_STATE[/url]."

msgid "Allows an application to read the user's personal profile data."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສ່ວນຕົວຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to read SMS messages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_SMS]READ_SMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານຂໍ້ຄວາມ SMS. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#READ_SMS]READ_SMS[/url]."

msgid "Allows an application to read from the user's social stream."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນຈາກກະແສສັງຄົມ (social stream) ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to read the sync settings. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_SYNC_SETTINGS]READ_SYNC_SETTINGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຊິ້ງ (sync). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_SYNC_SETTINGS]READ_SYNC_SETTINGS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to read the sync stats. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_SYNC_STATS]READ_SYNC_STATS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານສະຖິຕິການຊິ້ງ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#READ_SYNC_STATS]READ_SYNC_STATS[/url]."

msgid "Allows an application to read the user dictionary."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານວັດຈະນານຸກົມຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Required to be able to reboot the device. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#REBOOT]REBOOT[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີເພື່ອຣີບູດ (reboot) ອຸປະກອນ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#REBOOT]REBOOT[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to receive the Intent.ACTION_BOOT_COMPLETED that is "
"broadcast after the system finishes booting. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED]RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຮັບ Intent.ACTION_BOOT_COMPLETED "
"ເຊິ່ງຖືກກະຈາຍອອກມາຫຼັງຈາກລະບົບບູດສຳເລັດ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED]RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to monitor incoming MMS messages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_MMS]RECEIVE_MMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຕິດຕາມຂໍ້ຄວາມ MMS ທີ່ເຂົ້າມາ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_MMS]RECEIVE_MMS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to receive SMS messages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_SMS]RECEIVE_SMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ SMS. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_SMS]RECEIVE_SMS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to receive WAP push messages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_WAP_PUSH]RECEIVE_WAP_PUSH[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ WAP push. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_WAP_PUSH]RECEIVE_WAP_PUSH[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to record audio. See [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#RECORD_AUDIO]RECORD_AUDIO[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນບັນທຶກສຽງ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#RECORD_AUDIO]RECORD_AUDIO[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to change the Z-order of tasks. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#REORDER_TASKS]REORDER_TASKS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນປ່ຽນ Z-order ຂອງໜ້າວຽກ (tasks). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#REORDER_TASKS]REORDER_TASKS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application (Phone) to send a request to other applications to "
"handle the respond-via-message action during incoming calls. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SEND_RESPOND_VIA_MESSAGE]SEND_RESPOND_VIA_MESSAGE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ (ໂທລະສັບ) "
"ສົ່ງຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍໄປຍັງແອັບອື່ນເພື່ອຈັດການການຕອບກັບຜ່ານຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນລະຫວ່າງທີ່ມີສາຍເຂົ້າມາ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SEND_RESPOND_VIA_MESSAGE]SEND_RESPOND_VIA_MESSAGE[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to send SMS messages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SEND_SMS]SEND_SMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມ SMS. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#SEND_SMS]SEND_SMS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to watch and control how activities are started "
"globally in the system."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເບິ່ງ ແລະ ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການເລີ່ມກິດຈະກຳຕ່າງໆ ໃນທົ່ວລະບົບ."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to broadcast an Intent to set an alarm for the user. "
"See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_ALARM]SET_ALARM[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນກະຈາຍ Intent ເພື່ອຕັ້ງໂມງປຸກໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_ALARM]SET_ALARM[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to control whether activities are immediately finished "
"when put in the background. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#SET_ALWAYS_FINISH]SET_ALWAYS_FINISH[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຄວບຄຸມວ່າກິດຈະກຳຈະຖືກປິດທັນທີຫຼືບໍ່ເມື່ອຖືກຍ້າຍໄປໄວ້ໃນພື້ນຫຼັງ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_ALWAYS_FINISH]SET_ALWAYS_FINISH[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows to modify the global animation scaling factor. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_ANIMATION_SCALE]SET_ANIMATION_SCALE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂຄ່າຕົວຄູນການສະເກລແອນິເມຊັນ (animation scaling) ທົ່ວໂລກ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_ANIMATION_SCALE]SET_ANIMATION_SCALE[/url]."

msgid ""
"Configure an application for debugging. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_DEBUG_APP]SET_DEBUG_APP[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເພື່ອການດີບັກ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#SET_DEBUG_APP]SET_DEBUG_APP[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows low-level access to setting the orientation (actually rotation) of the "
"screen."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທິດທາງ (ໃນທີ່ນີ້ແມ່ນການໝູນ) ຂອງໜ້າຈໍໃນລະດັບຕ່ຳ."

msgid "Allows low-level access to setting the pointer speed."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມໄວຂອງຕົວຊີ້ (pointer speed) ໃນລະດັບຕ່ຳ."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to set the maximum number of (not needed) application "
"processes that can be running. See [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#SET_PROCESS_LIMIT]SET_PROCESS_LIMIT[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງໂປຣເຊສແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ (ທີ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ) ທີ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໄດ້. "
"ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_PROCESS_LIMIT]SET_PROCESS_LIMIT[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to set the system time directly. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_TIME]SET_TIME[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາຂອງລະບົບໂດຍກົງ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#SET_TIME]SET_TIME[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to set the system time zone directly. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_TIME_ZONE]SET_TIME_ZONE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຕັ້ງຄ່າເຂດເວລາ (time zone) ຂອງລະບົບໂດຍກົງ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_TIME_ZONE]SET_TIME_ZONE[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to set the wallpaper. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_WALLPAPER]SET_WALLPAPER[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຕັ້ງຄ່າວໍເປເປີ (wallpaper). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_WALLPAPER]SET_WALLPAPER[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to set the wallpaper hints. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_WALLPAPER_HINTS]SET_WALLPAPER_HINTS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຕັ້ງຄ່າ wallpaper hints. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_WALLPAPER_HINTS]SET_WALLPAPER_HINTS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allow an application to request that a signal be sent to all persistent "
"processes. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SIGNAL_PERSISTENT_PROCESSES]SIGNAL_PERSISTENT_PROCESSES[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ສົ່ງສັນຍານໄປຍັງທຸກໂປຣເຊສທີ່ມີຄວາມຄົງຕົວ (persistent processes). "
"ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SIGNAL_PERSISTENT_PROCESSES]SIGNAL_PERSISTENT_PROCESSES[/"
"url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to open, close, or disable the status bar and its "
"icons. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#STATUS_BAR]STATUS_BAR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເປີດ, ປິດ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານແຖບສະຖານະ ແລະ ໄອຄອນຂອງມັນ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#STATUS_BAR]STATUS_BAR[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to allow access the subscribed feeds ContentProvider."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເຂົ້າເຖິງ ContentProvider ຂອງຟີດ (feeds) ທີ່ສະໝັກໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Allows an app to create windows using the type "
"WindowManager.LayoutParams.TYPE_APPLICATION_OVERLAY, shown on top of all "
"other apps. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW]SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບສ້າງໜ້າຕ່າງໂດຍໃຊ້ປະເພດ "
"WindowManager.LayoutParams.TYPE_APPLICATION_OVERLAY ເຊິ່ງຈະສະແດງຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງທຸກແອັບ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW]SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows using the device's IR transmitter, if available. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#TRANSMIT_IR]TRANSMIT_IR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງສົ່ງສັນຍານອິນຟຣາເຣດ (IR) ຂອງອຸປະກອນ ຫາກມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#TRANSMIT_IR]TRANSMIT_IR[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to update device statistics. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#UPDATE_DEVICE_STATS]UPDATE_DEVICE_STATS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອັບເດດສະຖິຕິຂອງອຸປະກອນ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#UPDATE_DEVICE_STATS]UPDATE_DEVICE_STATS[/url]."

msgid "Allows an application to request authtokens from the AccountManager."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຮ້ອງຂໍ authtokens ຈາກ AccountManager."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to use SIP service. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#USE_SIP]USE_SIP[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃຊ້ບໍລິການ SIP. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#USE_SIP]USE_SIP[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows access to the vibrator. See [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#VIBRATE]VIBRATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງລະບົບສັ່ນ (vibrator). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#VIBRATE]VIBRATE[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows using PowerManager WakeLocks to keep processor from sleeping or screen "
"from dimming. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WAKE_LOCK]WAKE_LOCK[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ PowerManager WakeLocks ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ໜ່ວຍປະມວນຜົນຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ (sleep) ຫຼື "
"ໜ້າຈໍມືດລົງ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WAKE_LOCK]WAKE_LOCK[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to write the apn settings and read sensitive fields of an "
"existing apn settings like user and password. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_APN_SETTINGS]WRITE_APN_SETTINGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ APN ແລະ ອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະອຽດອ່ອນຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ APN ທີ່ມີຢູ່ ເຊັ່ນ "
"ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_APN_SETTINGS]WRITE_APN_SETTINGS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to write the user's calendar data. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_CALENDAR]WRITE_CALENDAR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນປະຕິທິນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#WRITE_CALENDAR]WRITE_CALENDAR[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to write (but not read) the user's call log data. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_CALL_LOG]WRITE_CALL_LOG[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂຽນ (ແຕ່ອ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້) ຂໍ້ມູນປະຫວັດການໂທຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_CALL_LOG]WRITE_CALL_LOG[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to write the user's contacts data. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_CONTACTS]WRITE_CONTACTS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#WRITE_CONTACTS]WRITE_CONTACTS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to write to external storage. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE]WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນລົງໃນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE]WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to modify the Google service map. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_GSERVICES]WRITE_GSERVICES[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນແກ້ໄຂ Google service map. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_GSERVICES]WRITE_GSERVICES[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to write (but not read) the user's browsing history and "
"bookmarks."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂຽນ (ແຕ່ອ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້) ປະຫວັດການທ່ອງເວັບ ແລະ ບຸກມາກ (bookmarks) ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to write (but not read) the user's personal profile "
"data."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂຽນ (ແຕ່ອ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້) ຂໍ້ມູນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສ່ວນຕົວຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to read or write the secure system settings. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS]WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານ ຫຼື ຂຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບທີ່ປອດໄພ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS]WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to read or write the system settings. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_SETTINGS]WRITE_SETTINGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອ່ານ ຫຼື ຂຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#WRITE_SETTINGS]WRITE_SETTINGS[/url]."

msgid "Allows an application to write SMS messages."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມ SMS."

msgid ""
"Allows an application to write (but not read) the user's social stream data."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂຽນ (ແຕ່ອ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້) ຂໍ້ມູນກະແສສັງຄົມ (social stream) ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Allows applications to write the sync settings. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_SYNC_SETTINGS]WRITE_SYNC_SETTINGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຊິ້ງ (sync). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_SYNC_SETTINGS]WRITE_SYNC_SETTINGS[/url]."

msgid "Allows an application to write to the user dictionary."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂຽນລົງໃນວັດຈະນານຸກົມຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"The background color used for the root window. By default it's [constant "
"Color.BLACK]."
msgstr "ສີພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກ (root window). ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [constant Color.BLACK]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this makes the navigation and status bars translucent "
"and allows the application content to extend edge to edge.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You should ensure that none of the application content is "
"occluded by system elements by using the [method "
"DisplayServer.get_display_safe_area] and [method "
"DisplayServer.get_display_cutouts] methods."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແຖບນຳທາງ (navigation) ແລະ ແຖບສະຖານະ "
"ມີຄວາມໂປ່ງແສງ ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເນື້ອໃນຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂະຫຍາຍອອກໄປຈົນສຸດຂອບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທ່ານຄວນໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າບໍ່ມີເນື້ອໃນໃດໆ ຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຖືກບັງໂດຍອົງປະກອບຂອງລະບົບ "
"ໂດຍການໃຊ້ [method DisplayServer.get_display_safe_area] ແລະ [method "
"DisplayServer.get_display_cutouts]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], hides the navigation and status bar. Set [method "
"DisplayServer.window_set_mode] to change this at runtime."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເຊື່ອງແຖບນຳທາງ ແລະ ແຖບສະຖານະ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"DisplayServer.window_set_mode] ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງສິ່ງນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid "Indicates whether the application supports larger screen form-factors."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຮອງຮັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ (larger screen) ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Indicates whether an application supports the \"normal\" screen form-factors."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຮອງຮັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍແບບ \"ປົກກະຕິ\" (normal screen) ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid "Indicates whether the application supports smaller screen form-factors."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຮອງຮັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ (smaller screen) ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Indicates whether the application supports extra large screen form-factors."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຮອງຮັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍແບບໃຫຍ່ພິເສດ (extra large screen) ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shaders will be compiled and embedded in the "
"application. This option is only supported when using the Forward+ or Mobile "
"renderers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When exporting as a dedicated server, the shader baker is always "
"disabled since no rendering is performed."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເຊດເດີ (shaders) ຈະຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ (compile) ແລະ "
"ຝັງໄວ້ໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວເຣັນເດີ (renderer) Forward+ ຫຼື Mobile "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກເປັນເຊີບເວີສະເພາະ (dedicated server), ຕົວອົບເຊດເດີ (shader "
"baker) ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານສະເໝີ ເພາະບໍ່ມີການເຣັນເດີໃດໆ ເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The background color used for the system splash screen window.\n"
"If not set, it will fallback to [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.launcher_icons/adaptive_background_432x432].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only applied if [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ສີພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງສະແດງຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (splash screen) ຂອງລະບົບ.\n"
"ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດ, ມັນຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ [member EditorExportPlatformAndroid.launcher_icons/"
"adaptive_background_432x432].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"System splash screen branding image file. If left empty, no branding image "
"will be used. See [url=https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/"
"splash-screen#dimensions]splash-screen dimensions[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Can be used to set an image to be shown at the bottom of the "
"splash screen."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບແບຣນດິງ (branding) ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງສະແດງຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລະບົບ. ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ຮູບພາບແບຣນດິງ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/"
"launch/splash-screen#dimensions]ຂະໜາດ splash-screen[/url].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຮູບພາບທີ່ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງ splash screen ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], Godot's boot splash will not be shown, and the system "
"boot splash will remain visible for a longer time, until the mainloop starts."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໜ້າຈໍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ Godot ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສະແດງ ແລະ "
"ໜ້າຈໍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລະບົບຈະຍັງຄົງສະແດງຢູ່ດົນຂຶ້ນ ຈົນກ່ວາ mainloop ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"System splash screen icon file. If left empty, it will fall back to [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.launcher_icons/adaptive_foreground_432x432]. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/splash-"
"screen#dimensions]splash-screen dimensions[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You can provide an [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/graphics/drawable/AnimatedVectorDrawable]AnimatedVectorDrawable (AVD)"
"[/url] XML. However, the XML file will only be used if [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] is enabled. If "
"not, it will fall back to [member EditorExportPlatformAndroid.launcher_icons/"
"adaptive_background_432x432]."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ໄອຄອນ splash screen ຂອງລະບົບ. ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.launcher_icons/adaptive_foreground_432x432]. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/splash-"
"screen#dimensions]ຂະໜາດ splash-screen[/url].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ XML ແບບ [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/graphics/drawable/"
"AnimatedVectorDrawable]AnimatedVectorDrawable (AVD)[/url] ໄດ້. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ໄຟລ໌ XML ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/"
"use_gradle_build] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.launcher_icons/adaptive_background_432x432]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows the application to participate in the backup and "
"restore infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເຂົ້າຮ່ວມໃນໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ "
"(backup) ແລະ ການກູ້ຄືນ (restore)."

msgid ""
"Machine-readable application version. This must be incremented for every new "
"release pushed to the Play Store."
msgstr ""
"ເວີຊັນຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ເຄື່ອງສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເພີ່ມຄ່າສຳລັບທຸກໆ ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງ "
"Play Store."

msgid ""
"Application version visible to the user. Falls back to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/version] if left empty."
msgstr ""
"ເວີຊັນຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້. ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/version]."

msgid "The extended reality (XR) mode for this application."
msgstr "ໂໝດ Extended Reality (XR) ສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນນີ້."

msgid "Base class for the Apple embedded platform exporters (iOS and visionOS)."
msgstr "ຄລາດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບຕົວສົ່ງອອກແພລັດຟອມຝັງຕົວຂອງ Apple (iOS ແລະ visionOS)."

msgid ""
"The base class for Apple embedded platform exporters. These include iOS and "
"visionOS, but not macOS. See the classes inheriting from this one for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບຕົວສົ່ງອອກແພລັດຟອມຝັງຕົວຂອງ Apple. ເຊິ່ງລວມເຖິງ iOS ແລະ visionOS "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ລວມເຖິງ macOS. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນຄລາດທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກຄລາດນີ້."

msgid "Exporting for iOS"
msgstr "ການສົ່ງອອກສຳລັບ iOS"

msgid "iOS plugins documentation index"
msgstr "ດັດຊະນີເອກະສານປລັກອິນ iOS"

msgid "Base class for custom [EditorExportPlatform] implementations (plugins)."
msgstr "ຄລາດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບການສ້າງ [EditorExportPlatform] ແບບກຳນົດເອງ (ປລັກອິນ)."

msgid ""
"External [EditorExportPlatform] implementations should inherit from this "
"class.\n"
"To use [EditorExportPlatform], register it using the [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_export_platform] method first."
msgstr ""
"ການສ້າງ [EditorExportPlatform] ຈາກພາຍນອກຄວນສືບທອດຈາກຄລາດນີ້.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ [EditorExportPlatform], ໃຫ້ລົງທະບຽນໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_export_platform] ກ່ອນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified [param preset] is valid and can be "
"exported. Use [method set_config_error] and [method "
"set_config_missing_templates] to set error details.\n"
"Usual implementations call [method _has_valid_export_configuration] and "
"[method _has_valid_project_configuration] to determine if exporting is "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ [param preset] ທີ່ລະບຸຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ສາມາດສົ່ງອອກໄດ້. ໃຊ້ "
"[method set_config_error] ແລະ [method set_config_missing_templates] "
"ເພື່ອກຳນົດລາຍລະອຽດຄວາມຜິດພາດ.\n"
"ການເຮັດວຽກໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method _has_valid_export_configuration] ແລະ [method "
"_has_valid_project_configuration] ເພື່ອຕັດສິນວ່າສາມາດສົ່ງອອກໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Called by the editor before platform is unregistered."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ກ່ອນທີ່ແພລັດຟອມຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນ."

msgid ""
"Creates a PCK archive at [param path] for the specified [param preset].\n"
"This method is called when \"Export PCK/ZIP\" button is pressed in the export "
"dialog, with \"Export as Patch\" disabled, and PCK is selected as a file type."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ PCK ທີ່ [param path] ສຳລັບ [param preset] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"ວິທີນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອກົດປຸ່ມ \"Export PCK/ZIP\" ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ, ໂດຍທີ່ \"Export as "
"Patch\" ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ເລືອກ PCK ເປັນປະເພດໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"Creates a patch PCK archive at [param path] for the specified [param preset], "
"containing only the files that have changed since the last patch.\n"
"This method is called when \"Export PCK/ZIP\" button is pressed in the export "
"dialog, with \"Export as Patch\" enabled, and PCK is selected as a file "
"type.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The patches provided in [param patches] have already been loaded "
"when this method is called and are merely provided as context. When empty the "
"patches defined in the export preset have been loaded instead."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ແພັດ PCK ທີ່ [param path] ສຳລັບ [param preset] ທີ່ລະບຸ, "
"ໂດຍຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ແພັດຫຼ້າສຸດ.\n"
"ວິທີນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອກົດປຸ່ມ \"Export PCK/ZIP\" ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ, ໂດຍທີ່ \"Export as "
"Patch\" ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ເລືອກ PCK ເປັນປະເພດໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແພັດທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [param patches] ຈະຖືກໂຫຼດແລ້ວເມື່ອວິທີນີ້ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ແລະ "
"ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອເປັນຂໍ້ມູນປະກອບເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, ແພັດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນຄ່າການສົ່ງອອກຈະຖືກໂຫຼດແທນ."

msgid ""
"Creates a full project at [param path] for the specified [param preset].\n"
"This method is called when \"Export\" button is pressed in the export "
"dialog.\n"
"This method implementation can call [method EditorExportPlatform.save_pack] "
"or [method EditorExportPlatform.save_zip] to use default PCK/ZIP export "
"process, or calls [method EditorExportPlatform.export_project_files] and "
"implement custom callback for processing each exported file."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກແບບເຕັມທີ່ [param path] ສຳລັບ [param preset] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"ວິທີນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອກົດປຸ່ມ \"Export\" ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ.\n"
"ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງວິທີນີ້ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method EditorExportPlatform.save_pack] ຫຼື [method "
"EditorExportPlatform.save_zip] ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຂະບວນການສົ່ງອອກ PCK/ZIP ມາດຕະຖານ, ຫຼື ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method EditorExportPlatform.export_project_files] ແລະ "
"ສ້າງຄໍແບັກແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອຈັດການກັບແຕ່ລະໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"Create a ZIP archive at [param path] for the specified [param preset].\n"
"This method is called when \"Export PCK/ZIP\" button is pressed in the export "
"dialog, with \"Export as Patch\" disabled, and ZIP is selected as a file type."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ ZIP ທີ່ [param path] ສຳລັບ [param preset] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"ວິທີນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອກົດປຸ່ມ \"Export PCK/ZIP\" ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ, ໂດຍທີ່ \"Export as "
"Patch\" ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ເລືອກ ZIP ເປັນປະເພດໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"Create a ZIP archive at [param path] for the specified [param preset], "
"containing only the files that have changed since the last patch.\n"
"This method is called when \"Export PCK/ZIP\" button is pressed in the export "
"dialog, with \"Export as Patch\" enabled, and ZIP is selected as a file "
"type.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The patches provided in [param patches] have already been loaded "
"when this method is called and are merely provided as context. When empty the "
"patches defined in the export preset have been loaded instead."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ ZIP ທີ່ [param path] ສຳລັບ [param preset] ທີ່ລະບຸ, "
"ໂດຍຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ແພັດຫຼ້າສຸດ.\n"
"ວິທີນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອກົດປຸ່ມ \"Export PCK/ZIP\" ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ, ໂດຍທີ່ \"Export as "
"Patch\" ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ເລືອກ ZIP ເປັນປະເພດໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແພັດທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [param patches] ຈະຖືກໂຫຼດແລ້ວເມື່ອວິທີນີ້ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ແລະ "
"ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອເປັນຂໍ້ມູນປະກອບເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, ແພັດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນຄ່າການສົ່ງອອກຈະຖືກໂຫຼດແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns array of supported binary extensions for the full project export."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີທີ່ຮອງຮັບ ສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກແບບເຕັມ."

msgid ""
"Returns protocol used for remote debugging. Default implementation return "
"[code]tcp://[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໂປຣໂຕຄໍທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການດີບັກທາງໄກ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [code]tcp://[/code]."

msgid ""
"Validates [param option] and returns visibility for the specified [param "
"preset]. Default implementation return [code]true[/code] for all options."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບ [param option] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນການສະແດງຜົນສຳລັບ [param preset] ທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ສຳລັບທຸກຕົວເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"Validates [param option] and returns warning message for the specified [param "
"preset]. Default implementation return empty string for all options."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບ [param option] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມເຕືອນສຳລັບ [param preset] ທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງສຳລັບທຸກຕົວເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"Returns a property list, as an [Array] of dictionaries. Each [Dictionary] "
"must at least contain the [code]name: StringName[/code] and [code]type: "
"Variant.Type[/code] entries.\n"
"Additionally, the following keys are supported:\n"
"- [code]hint: PropertyHint[/code]\n"
"- [code]hint_string: String[/code]\n"
"- [code]usage: PropertyUsageFlags[/code]\n"
"- [code]class_name: StringName[/code]\n"
"- [code]default_value: Variant[/code], default value of the property.\n"
"- [code]update_visibility: bool[/code], if set to [code]true[/code], [method "
"_get_export_option_visibility] is called for each property when this property "
"is changed.\n"
"- [code]required: bool[/code], if set to [code]true[/code], this property "
"warnings are critical, and should be resolved to make export possible. This "
"value is a hint for the [method _has_valid_export_configuration] "
"implementation, and not used by the engine directly.\n"
"See also [method Object._get_property_list]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດ (property list) ໃນຮູບແບບ [Array] ຂອງ dictionary. ແຕ່ລະ "
"[Dictionary] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍຕ້ອງມີ [code]name: StringName[/code] ແລະ [code]type: "
"Variant.Type[/code].\n"
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຍັງຮອງຮັບຄີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"- [code]hint: PropertyHint[/code]\n"
"- [code]hint_string: String[/code]\n"
"- [code]usage: PropertyUsageFlags[/code]\n"
"- [code]class_name: StringName[/code]\n"
"- [code]default_value: Variant[/code], ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດ.\n"
"- [code]update_visibility: bool[/code], ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], [method "
"_get_export_option_visibility] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຄຸນສົມບັດເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"- [code]required: bool[/code], ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ການເຕືອນຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືວ່າສຳຄັນ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດສົ່ງອອກໄດ້. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ເປັນພຽງຄຳແນະນຳສຳລັບ [method _has_valid_export_configuration] ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍເອນຈິນໂດຍກົງ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [method Object._get_property_list]."

msgid ""
"Returns the platform logo displayed in the export dialog. The logo should be "
"32×32 pixels, adjusted for the current editor scale (see [method "
"EditorInterface.get_editor_scale])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໂລໂກ້ແພລັດຟອມທີ່ສະແດງໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ. ໂລໂກ້ຄວນມີຂະໜາດ 32x32 ພິກເຊລ, "
"ປັບຕາມສະເກລຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃນປັດຈຸບັນ (ເບິ່ງ [method EditorInterface.get_editor_scale])."

msgid "Returns export platform name."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ແພລັດຟອມການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid "Returns target OS name."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ (OS) ເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid "Returns array of platform specific features."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດສະເພາະແພລັດຟອມ."

msgid ""
"Returns array of platform specific features for the specified [param preset]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດສະເພາະແພລັດຟອມ ສຳລັບ [param preset] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if export configuration is valid."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າການສົ່ງອອກຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if project configuration is valid."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Initializes the plugin. Called by the editor when platform is registered."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນປລັກອິນ. ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວແກ້ໄຂເມື່ອແພລັດຟອມຖືກລົງທະບຽນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if specified file is a valid executable (native "
"executable or script) for the target platform."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸເປັນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ (native executable ຫຼື "
"script) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if export options list is changed and presets "
"should be updated."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກລາຍການຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງອອກມີການປ່ຽນແປງ ແລະ ຄວນອັບເດດ presets."

msgid ""
"Returns current configuration error message text. This method should be "
"called only from the [method _can_export], [method "
"_has_valid_export_configuration], or [method "
"_has_valid_project_configuration] implementations."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນ. ວິທີນີ້ຄວນຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຈາກພາຍໃນ [method _can_export], "
"[method _has_valid_export_configuration], ຫຼື [method "
"_has_valid_project_configuration] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] is export templates are missing from the current "
"configuration. This method should be called only from the [method "
"_can_export], [method _has_valid_export_configuration], or [method "
"_has_valid_project_configuration] implementations."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກ (export templates) "
"ຫາຍໄປຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນ. ວິທີນີ້ຄວນຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຈາກພາຍໃນ [method _can_export], [method "
"_has_valid_export_configuration], ຫຼື [method _has_valid_project_configuration] "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets current configuration error message text. This method should be called "
"only from the [method _can_export], [method _has_valid_export_configuration], "
"or [method _has_valid_project_configuration] implementations."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນ. ວິທີນີ້ຄວນຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຈາກພາຍໃນ [method _can_export], "
"[method _has_valid_export_configuration], ຫຼື [method "
"_has_valid_project_configuration] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Set to [code]true[/code] is export templates are missing from the current "
"configuration. This method should be called only from the [method "
"_can_export], [method _has_valid_export_configuration], or [method "
"_has_valid_project_configuration] implementations."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກຫາຍໄປຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນ. "
"ວິທີນີ້ຄວນຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຈາກພາຍໃນ [method _can_export], [method "
"_has_valid_export_configuration], ຫຼື [method _has_valid_project_configuration] "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Exporter for iOS."
msgstr "ຕົວສົ່ງອອກສຳລັບ iOS."

msgid ""
"Additional data added to the root [code]<dict>[/code] section of the "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"information_property_list]Info.plist[/url] file. The value should be an XML "
"section with pairs of key-value elements, e.g.:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"<key>key_name</key>\n"
"<string>value</string>\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນສ່ວນ [code]<dict>[/code] ຫຼັກຂອງໄຟລ໌ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"information_property_list]Info.plist[/url]. ຄ່າຄວນເປັນສ່ວນ XML ທີ່ມີຄູ່ຂອງອົງປະກອບ key-"
"value, ຕົວຢ່າງ:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"<key>key_name</key>\n"
"<string>value</string>\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Unique application identifier in a reverse-DNS format, can only contain "
"alphanumeric characters ([code]A-Z[/code], [code]a-z[/code], and [code]0-9[/"
"code]), hyphens ([code]-[/code]), and periods ([code].[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວລະບຸແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນໃນຮູບແບບ reverse-DNS, ສາມາດປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນພາສາອັງກິດ "
"([code]A-Z[/code], [code]a-z[/code]), ຕົວເລກ ([code]0-9[/code]), ຂີດກາງ ([code]-"
"[/code]), ແລະ ຈຸດ ([code].[/code])."

msgid ""
"The \"Full Name\", \"Common Name\", or SHA-1 hash of the signing identity "
"used for debug export."
msgstr ""
"\"ຊື່ເຕັມ\" (Full Name), \"ຊື່ທົ່ວໄປ\" (Common Name), ຫຼື SHA-1 hash ຂອງຕົວຕົນການເຊັນຊື່ "
"(signing identity) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກເພື່ອດີບັກ."

msgid ""
"The \"Full Name\", \"Common Name\", or SHA-1 hash of the signing identity "
"used for release export."
msgstr ""
"\"ຊື່ເຕັມ\" (Full Name), \"ຊື່ທົ່ວໄປ\" (Common Name), ຫຼື SHA-1 hash ຂອງຕົວຕົນການເຊັນຊື່ "
"(signing identity) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກເວີຊັນປ່ອຍ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], existing \"project name\" and \"project "
"name.xcodeproj\" in the export destination directory will be unconditionally "
"deleted during export."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], \"ຊື່ໂປຣເຈັກ\" ແລະ \"ຊື່ໂປຣເຈັກ.xcodeproj\" "
"ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີປາຍທາງການສົ່ງອອກ ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກໂດຍບໍ່ມີເງື່ອນໄຂໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid "Application distribution target (debug export)."
msgstr "ເປົ້າໝາຍການແຈກຢາຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ (ການສົ່ງອອກເພື່ອດີບັກ)."

msgid "Application distribution target (release export)."
msgstr "ເປົ້າໝາຍການແຈກຢາຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ (ການສົ່ງອອກເວີຊັນປ່ອຍ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], exports iOS project files without building an XCArchive "
"or [code].ipa[/code] file. If [code]false[/code], exports iOS project files "
"and builds an XCArchive and [code].ipa[/code] file at the same time. When "
"combining Godot with Fastlane or other build pipelines, you may want to set "
"this to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສົ່ງອອກໄຟລ໌ໂປຣເຈັກ iOS ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງບິວ XCArchive ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ "
"[code].ipa[/code]. ຫາກເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະສົ່ງອອກໄຟລ໌ໂປຣເຈັກ iOS ແລະ ບິວ "
"XCArchive ພ້ອມກັບໄຟລ໌ [code].ipa[/code] ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ. ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ Godot ຮ່ວມກັບ "
"Fastlane ຫຼື build pipelines ອື່ນໆ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid "Interpolation method used to resize application icon."
msgstr "ວິທີການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນ (interpolation) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບຂະໜາດໄອຄອນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

msgid ""
"Minimum version of iOS required for this application to run in the "
"[code]major.minor.patch[/code] or [code]major.minor[/code] format, can only "
"contain numeric characters ([code]0-9[/code]) and periods ([code].[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ເວີຊັນຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງ iOS ທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ ໃນຮູບແບບ "
"[code]major.minor.patch[/code] ຫຼື [code]major.minor[/code], ສາມາດປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວເລກ "
"([code]0-9[/code]) ແລະ ຈຸດ ([code].[/code]) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"UUID of the provisioning profile. If left empty, Xcode will download or "
"create a provisioning profile automatically. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/help/account/manage-profiles/edit-download-or-delete-"
"profiles]Edit, download, or delete provisioning profiles[/url].\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_APPLE_PLATFORM_PROVISIONING_PROFILE_UUID_DEBUG[/code]."
msgstr ""
"UUID ຂອງ provisioning profile. ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, Xcode ຈະດາວໂຫຼດ ຫຼື ສ້າງ provisioning "
"profile ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.apple.com/help/account/manage-"
"profiles/edit-download-or-delete-profiles]ການແກ້ໄຂ, ດາວໂຫຼດ ຫຼື ລຶບ provisioning "
"profiles[/url].\n"
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ "
"[code]GODOT_APPLE_PLATFORM_PROVISIONING_PROFILE_UUID_DEBUG[/code]."

msgid ""
"UUID of the provisioning profile. If left empty, Xcode will download or "
"create a provisioning profile automatically. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/help/account/manage-profiles/edit-download-or-delete-"
"profiles]Edit, download, or delete provisioning profiles[/url].\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_APPLE_PLATFORM_PROVISIONING_PROFILE_UUID_RELEASE[/code]."
msgstr ""
"UUID ຂອງ provisioning profile. ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, Xcode ຈະດາວໂຫຼດ ຫຼື ສ້າງ provisioning "
"profile ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.apple.com/help/account/manage-"
"profiles/edit-download-or-delete-profiles]ການແກ້ໄຂ, ດາວໂຫຼດ ຫຼື ລຶບ provisioning "
"profiles[/url].\n"
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ "
"[code]GODOT_APPLE_PLATFORM_PROVISIONING_PROFILE_UUID_RELEASE[/code]."

msgid ""
"Application version visible to the user. Can only contain numeric characters "
"([code]0-9[/code]) and periods ([code].[/code]). Falls back to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/version] if left empty.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value is used for the [i]Identity > Version[/i] value in "
"the generated Xcode project."
msgstr ""
"ເວີຊັນຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້. ສາມາດປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວເລກ ([code]0-9[/code]) ແລະ ຈຸດ "
"([code].[/code]) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/version].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບຄ່າ [i]Identity > Version[/i] ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ Xcode "
"ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "A four-character creator code that is specific to the bundle. Optional."
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜູ້ສ້າງ 4 ຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງສຳລັບບັນເດິນ (bundle). ເປັນຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "Supported device family."
msgstr "ຄອບຄົວອຸປະກອນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid ""
"Machine-readable application version in the [code]major.minor.patch[/code] "
"format. Can only contain numeric characters ([code]0-9[/code]) and periods "
"([code].[/code]). This must be incremented with every new release pushed to "
"the App Store. Falls back to [member ProjectSettings.application/config/"
"version] if left empty.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value is used for the [i]Identity > Build[/i] value in the "
"generated Xcode project."
msgstr ""
"ເວີຊັນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ເຄື່ອງສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ ໃນຮູບແບບ [code]major.minor.patch[/code]. "
"ສາມາດປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວເລກ ([code]0-9[/code]) ແລະ ຈຸດ ([code].[/code]) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເພີ່ມຄ່າສຳລັບທຸກໆ ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງ App Store. ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ "
"[member ProjectSettings.application/config/version].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບຄ່າ [i]Identity > Build[/i] ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ Xcode ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], networking features related to Wi-Fi access are "
"enabled. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/support/required-device-"
"capabilities/]Required Device Capabilities[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄຸນສົມບັດເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ Wi-Fi ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.apple.com/support/required-device-"
"capabilities/]Required Device Capabilities[/url]."

msgid ""
"Additional data added to the [code]UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities[/code] array "
"of the [code]Info.plist[/code] file."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນອາເຣ [code]UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities[/code] ຂອງໄຟລ໌ "
"[code]Info.plist[/code]."

msgid ""
"Requires the graphics performance and features of the A12 Bionic and later "
"chips (devices supporting all Vulkan renderer features).\n"
"Enabling this option limits supported devices to: iPhone XS, iPhone XR, iPad "
"Mini (5th gen.), iPad Air (3rd gen.), iPad (8th gen), and newer."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງການປະສິດທິພາບກຣາບຟິກ ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຊິບ A12 Bionic ຂຶ້ນໄປ "
"(ອຸປະກອນທີ່ຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຕົວເຣັນເດີ Vulkan ທັງໝົດ).\n"
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະຈຳກັດອຸປະກອນທີ່ຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່: iPhone XS, iPhone XR, iPad Mini (ລຸ້ນທີ "
"5), iPad Air (ລຸ້ນທີ 3), iPad (ລຸ້ນທີ 8) ແລະ ລຸ້ນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Requires the graphics performance and features of the A17 Pro and later "
"chips.\n"
"Enabling this option limits supported devices to: iPhone 15 Pro and newer."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງການປະສິດທິພາບກຣາບຟິກ ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຊິບ A17 Pro ຂຶ້ນໄປ.\n"
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະຈຳກັດອຸປະກອນທີ່ຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່: iPhone 15 Pro ແລະ ລຸ້ນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Path to the custom export template. If left empty, default template is used."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກແບບກຳນົດເອງ. ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Additional data added to the root [code]<dict>[/code] section of the "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"entitlements].entitlements[/url] file. The value should be an XML section "
"with pairs of key-value elements, for example:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"<key>key_name</key>\n"
"<string>value</string>\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນສ່ວນ [code]<dict>[/code] ຫຼັກຂອງໄຟລ໌ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements].entitlements[/"
"url]. ຄ່າຄວນເປັນສ່ວນ XML ທີ່ມີຄູ່ຂອງອົງປະກອບ key-value, ຕົວຢ່າງ:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"<key>key_name</key>\n"
"<string>value</string>\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows access to Game Center features. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_developer_game-center]com.apple.developer.game-center[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]ຈິງ[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ Game Center. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_developer_game-center]com.apple.developer.game-center[/url]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], hints that the app might perform better with a higher "
"memory limit. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_developer_kernel_increased-memory-"
"limit]com.apple.developer.kernel.increased-memory-limit[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]ຈິງ[/code], "
"ເປັນການບອກໃບ້ວ່າແອັບອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍການຈຳກັດໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_developer_kernel_increased-memory-"
"limit]com.apple.developer.kernel.increased-memory-limit[/url]."

msgid ""
"Environment for Apple Push Notification service. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/aps-"
"environment]aps-environment[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຳລັບບໍລິການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ Apple (Apple Push Notification service). ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"aps-environment]aps-environment[/url]."

msgid ""
"App Store application icon file, dark version. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/foundations/app-"
"icons]App icons[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ໄອຄອນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ App Store, ເວີຊັນມືດ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"design/human-interface-guidelines/foundations/app-icons]App icons[/url]."

msgid ""
"App Store application icon file, tinted version. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/foundations/app-"
"icons]App icons[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ໄອຄອນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ App Store, ເວີຊັນຍ້ອມສີ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"design/human-interface-guidelines/foundations/app-icons]App icons[/url]."

msgid ""
"Base application icon used to generate other icons, dark version. See "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/"
"foundations/app-icons]App icons[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນພື້ນຖານທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງໄອຄອນອື່ນໆ, ເວີຊັນມືດ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/foundations/app-"
"icons]App icons[/url]."

msgid ""
"Base application icon used to generate other icons, tinted version. See "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/"
"foundations/app-icons]App icons[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນພື້ນຖານທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງໄອຄອນອື່ນໆ, ເວີຊັນຍ້ອມສີ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/foundations/app-"
"icons]App icons[/url]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [CameraServer] module is added to the exported project."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]ຈິງ[/code], ໂມດູນ [CameraServer] ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"A message displayed when requesting access to the device's camera (in "
"English)."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍການເຂົ້າເຖິງກ້ອງຂອງອຸປະກອນ (ເປັນພາສາອັງກິດ)."

msgid ""
"A message displayed when requesting access to the device's camera (localized)."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍການເຂົ້າເຖິງກ້ອງຂອງອຸປະກອນ (ຕາມພາສາທ້ອງຖິ່ນ)."

msgid "Indicates whether your app collects advertising data."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນການໂຄສະນາຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"The reasons your app collects advertising data. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/privacy_manifest_files/"
"describing_data_use_in_privacy_manifests]Describing data use in privacy "
"manifests[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ເຫດຜົນທີ່ແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນການໂຄສະນາ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/privacy_manifest_files/"
"describing_data_use_in_privacy_manifests]Describing data use in privacy "
"manifests[/url]."

msgid ""
"Indicates whether your app links advertising data to the user's identity."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການເຊື່ອມໂຍງຂໍ້ມູນການໂຄສະນາເຂົ້າກັບຕົວຕົນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Indicates whether your app uses advertising data for tracking."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນການໂຄສະນາເພື່ອການຕິດຕາມຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Indicates whether your app collects audio data."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນສຽງຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"The reasons your app collects audio data. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/privacy_manifest_files/"
"describing_data_use_in_privacy_manifests]Describing data use in privacy "
"manifests[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ເຫດຜົນທີ່ແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນສຽງ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/privacy_manifest_files/"
"describing_data_use_in_privacy_manifests]Describing data use in privacy "
"manifests[/url]."

msgid "Indicates whether your app links audio data to the user's identity."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການເຊື່ອມໂຍງຂໍ້ມູນສຽງເຂົ້າກັບຕົວຕົນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Indicates whether your app uses audio data for tracking."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນສຽງເພື່ອການຕິດຕາມຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Indicates whether your app collects browsing history."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການເກັບກຳປະຫວັດການທ່ອງເວັບຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"The reasons your app collects browsing history. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/privacy_manifest_files/"
"describing_data_use_in_privacy_manifests]Describing data use in privacy "
"manifests[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ເຫດຜົນທີ່ແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການເກັບກຳປະຫວັດການທ່ອງເວັບ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/privacy_manifest_files/"
"describing_data_use_in_privacy_manifests]Describing data use in privacy "
"manifests[/url]."

msgid ""
"Indicates whether your app links browsing history to the user's identity."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການເຊື່ອມໂຍງປະຫວັດການທ່ອງເວັບເຂົ້າກັບຕົວຕົນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Indicates whether your app uses browsing history for tracking."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການໃຊ້ປະຫວັດການທ່ອງເວັບເພື່ອການຕິດຕາມຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Indicates whether your app collects coarse location data."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕັ້ງແບບຄ່າປະມານ (coarse location) ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"The reasons your app collects coarse location data. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/privacy_manifest_files/"
"describing_data_use_in_privacy_manifests]Describing data use in privacy "
"manifests[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ເຫດຜົນທີ່ແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕັ້ງແບບຄ່າປະມານ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/privacy_manifest_files/"
"describing_data_use_in_privacy_manifests]Describing data use in privacy "
"manifests[/url]."

msgid ""
"Indicates whether your app links coarse location data to the user's identity."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການເຊື່ອມໂຍງຂໍ້ມູນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕັ້ງແບບຄ່າປະມານເຂົ້າກັບຕົວຕົນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Indicates whether your app uses coarse location data for tracking."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕັ້ງແບບຄ່າປະມານເພື່ອການຕິດຕາມຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Indicates whether your app collects contacts."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການເກັບກຳລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ (contacts) ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"The reasons your app collects contacts. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/privacy_manifest_files/"
"describing_data_use_in_privacy_manifests]Describing data use in privacy "
"manifests[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ເຫດຜົນທີ່ແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການເກັບກຳລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/privacy_manifest_files/"
"describing_data_use_in_privacy_manifests]Describing data use in privacy "
"manifests[/url]."

msgid "Indicates whether your app links contacts to the user's identity."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການເຊື່ອມໂຍງລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ເຂົ້າກັບຕົວຕົນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Indicates whether your app uses contacts for tracking."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການໃຊ້ລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ເພື່ອການຕິດຕາມຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Indicates whether your app collects crash data."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນການຂັດຂ້ອງ (crash data) ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"The reasons your app collects crash data. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/privacy_manifest_files/"
"describing_data_use_in_privacy_manifests]Describing data use in privacy "
"manifests[/url]."
