msgid ""
"Application executable architecture.\n"
"Supported architectures: [code]x86_32[/code], [code]x86_64[/code], "
"[code]arm64[/code], [code]arm32[/code], [code]rv64[/code], [code]ppc64[/"
"code], and [code]loongarch64[/code].\n"
"Official export templates include [code]x86_32[/code], [code]x86_64[/code], "
"[code]arm32[/code], and [code]arm64[/code] binaries only."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງໄຟລ໌ executable ຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ.\n"
"ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ຮອງຮັບ: [code]x86_32[/code], [code]x86_64[/code], [code]arm64[/"
"code], [code]arm32[/code], [code]rv64[/code], [code]ppc64[/code], ແລະ "
"[code]loongarch64[/code].\n"
"ເທັມເພລດການສົ່ງອອກຢ່າງເປັນທາງການຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ໄຟລ໌ binary ຂອງ [code]x86_32[/code], "
"[code]x86_64[/code], [code]arm32[/code], ແລະ [code]arm64[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], project resources are embedded into the executable."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]ຈິງ[/code], ຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງໂປຣເຈັກຈະຖືກຝັງເຂົ້າໄປໃນໄຟລ໌ executable."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], a console wrapper is exported alongside the main "
"executable, which allows running the project with enabled console output."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]ຈິງ[/code], ຕົວຫຸ້ມຄອນໂຊລ (console wrapper) ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກໄປພ້ອມກັບໄຟລ໌ "
"executable ຫຼັກ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດລັນໂປຣເຈັກໂດຍເປີດການສະແດງຜົນທາງຄອນໂຊລໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Script code to execute on the remote host when app is finished.\n"
"The following variables can be used in the script:\n"
"- [code]{temp_dir}[/code] - Path of temporary folder on the remote, used to "
"upload app and scripts to.\n"
"- [code]{archive_name}[/code] - Name of the ZIP containing uploaded "
"application.\n"
"- [code]{exe_name}[/code] - Name of application executable.\n"
"- [code]{cmd_args}[/code] - Array of the command line argument for the "
"application."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດສະຄຣິບທີ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເທິງໂຮສທາງໄກ (remote host) ເມື່ອແອັບເຮັດວຽກສຳເລັດ.\n"
"ຕົວແປຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນສະຄຣິບ:\n"
"- [code]{temp_dir}[/code] - ເສັ້ນທາງຂອງໂຟນເດີຊົ່ວຄາວເທິງໂຮສທາງໄກ, ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອອັບໂຫຼດແອັບ "
"ແລະ ສະຄຣິບ.\n"
"- [code]{archive_name}[/code] - ຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ ZIP ທີ່ບັນຈຸແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດ.\n"
"- [code]{exe_name}[/code] - ຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ executable ຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ.\n"
"- [code]{cmd_args}[/code] - ອາເຣຂອງ command line argument ສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

msgid "Enables remote deploy using SSH/SCP."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງທາງໄກ (remote deploy) ໂດຍໃຊ້ SSH/SCP."

msgid "Array of the additional command line arguments passed to the SCP."
msgstr "ອາເຣຂອງ command line arguments ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈະສົ່ງໄປໃຫ້ SCP."

msgid "Array of the additional command line arguments passed to the SSH."
msgstr "ອາເຣຂອງ command line arguments ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈະສົ່ງໄປໃຫ້ SSH."

msgid ""
"Remote host SSH user name and address, in [code]user@address[/code] format."
msgstr "ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ SSH ຂອງໂຮສທາງໄກ, ໃນຮູບແບບ [code]user@address[/code]."

msgid "Remote host SSH port number."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລກພອດ SSH ຂອງໂຮສທາງໄກ."

msgid ""
"Script code to execute on the remote host when running the app.\n"
"The following variables can be used in the script:\n"
"- [code]{temp_dir}[/code] - Path of temporary folder on the remote, used to "
"upload app and scripts to.\n"
"- [code]{archive_name}[/code] - Name of the ZIP containing uploaded "
"application.\n"
"- [code]{exe_name}[/code] - Name of application executable.\n"
"- [code]{cmd_args}[/code] - Array of the command line argument for the "
"application."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດສະຄຣິບທີ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເທິງໂຮສທາງໄກໃນຂະນະທີ່ລັນແອັບ.\n"
"ຕົວແປຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນສະຄຣິບ:\n"
"- [code]{temp_dir}[/code] - ເສັ້ນທາງຂອງໂຟນເດີຊົ່ວຄາວເທິງໂຮສທາງໄກ, ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອອັບໂຫຼດແອັບ "
"ແລະ ສະຄຣິບ.\n"
"- [code]{archive_name}[/code] - ຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ ZIP ທີ່ບັນຈຸແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດ.\n"
"- [code]{exe_name}[/code] - ຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ executable ຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ.\n"
"- [code]{cmd_args}[/code] - ອາເຣຂອງ command line argument ສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], project textures are exported in the ETC2/ASTC format."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]ຈິງ[/code], ເທັກເຈີ (texture) ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກໃນຮູບແບບ ETC2/ASTC."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], project textures are exported in the S3TC/BPTC format."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]ຈິງ[/code], ເທັກເຈີ (texture) ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກໃນຮູບແບບ S3TC/BPTC."

msgid "Exporter for macOS."
msgstr "ຕົວສົ່ງອອກສຳລັບ macOS."

msgid "Exporting for macOS"
msgstr "ການສົ່ງອອກສຳລັບ macOS"

msgid "Running Godot apps on macOS"
msgstr "ການລັນແອັບ Godot ເທິງ macOS"

msgid "Application category for the App Store."
msgstr "ໝວດໝູ່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນສຳລັບ App Store."

msgid "Copyright notice for the bundle visible to the user (in English)."
msgstr "ແຈ້ງການລິຂະສິດສຳລັບ bundle ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ (ເປັນພາສາອັງກິດ)."

msgid "Copyright notice for the bundle visible to the user (localized)."
msgstr "ແຈ້ງການລິຂະສິດສຳລັບ bundle ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ (ຕາມພາສາທ້ອງຖິ່ນ)."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]1[/code], ANGLE libraries are exported with the exported "
"application. If set to [code]0[/code], ANGLE libraries are exported only if "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/gl_compatibility/driver] is set to [code]"
"\"opengl3_angle\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]1[/code], ໄລບຣາຣີ ANGLE ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກໄປພ້ອມກັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]0[/code], ໄລບຣາຣີ ANGLE ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"gl_compatibility/driver] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]\"opengl3_angle\"[/code]."

msgid ""
"macOS 26 Liquid Glass icon source file. Use [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"icon-composer/]Icon Composer[/url] to create Liquid Glass icons.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Supported when exporting from macOS only, Xcode 26+ required.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Liquid Glass icons are supported on macOS 26 only, use [member "
"application/icon] to set the icon for older macOS versions."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບໄອຄອນ macOS 26 Liquid Glass. ໃຊ້ [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"icon-composer/]Icon Composer[/url] ເພື່ອສ້າງໄອຄອນ Liquid Glass.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກຈາກ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຕ້ອງການ Xcode 26+.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໄອຄອນ Liquid Glass ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ macOS 26 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ໃຊ້ [member "
"application/icon] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງໄອຄອນສຳລັບ macOS ເວີຊັນທີ່ເກົ່າກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Minimum version of macOS required for this application to run on Apple "
"Silicon Macs, in the [code]major.minor.patch[/code] or [code]major.minor[/"
"code] format, can only contain numeric characters ([code]0-9[/code]) and "
"periods ([code].[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ເວີຊັນຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງ macOS ທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພື່ອລັນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນນີ້ເທິງ Apple Silicon Macs, ໃນຮູບແບບ "
"[code]major.minor.patch[/code] ຫຼື [code]major.minor[/code], ສາມາດມີໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ຕົວເລກ "
"([code]0-9[/code]) ແລະ ຈຸດ ([code].[/code])."

msgid ""
"Minimum version of macOS required for this application to run on Intel Macs, "
"in the [code]major.minor.patch[/code] or [code]major.minor[/code] format, can "
"only contain numeric characters ([code]0-9[/code]) and periods ([code].[/"
"code])."
msgstr ""
"ເວີຊັນຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງ macOS ທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພື່ອລັນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນນີ້ເທິງ Intel Macs, ໃນຮູບແບບ "
"[code]major.minor.patch[/code] ຫຼື [code]major.minor[/code], ສາມາດມີໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ຕົວເລກ "
"([code]0-9[/code]) ແລະ ຈຸດ ([code].[/code])."

msgid ""
"Application executable architecture.\n"
"Supported architectures: [code]x86_64[/code], [code]arm64[/code], and "
"[code]universal[/code] ([code]x86_64 + arm64[/code]).\n"
"Official export templates include [code]universal[/code] binaries only."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງໄຟລ໌ executable ຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ.\n"
"ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ຮອງຮັບ: [code]x86_64[/code], [code]arm64[/code], ແລະ "
"[code]universal[/code] ([code]x86_64 + arm64[/code]).\n"
"ເທັມເພລດການສົ່ງອອກຢ່າງເປັນທາງການຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ໄຟລ໌ binary ແບບ [code]universal[/code] "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"PKCS #12 certificate file used to sign [code].app[/code] bundle.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_CODESIGN_CERTIFICATE_FILE[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ PKCS #12 ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລົງລາຍເຊັນ bundle [code].app[/code].\n"
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [code]GODOT_MACOS_CODESIGN_CERTIFICATE_FILE[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Password for the certificate file used to sign [code].app[/code] bundle.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_CODESIGN_CERTIFICATE_PASSWORD[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລົງລາຍເຊັນ bundle [code].app[/code].\n"
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_CODESIGN_CERTIFICATE_PASSWORD[/code]."

msgid "Tool to use for code signing."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການລົງລາຍເຊັນລະຫັດ (code signing)."

msgid ""
"Array of the additional command line arguments passed to the code signing "
"tool."
msgstr "ອາເຣຂອງ command line arguments ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈະສົ່ງໄປໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງມືລົງລາຍເຊັນລະຫັດ."

msgid ""
"Allows app to use dynamic linker environment variables to inject code. If you "
"are using add-ons with dynamic or self-modifying native code, enable them "
"according to the add-on documentation. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_cs_allow-dyld-"
"environment-variables]com.apple.security.cs.allow-dyld-environment-variables[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບໃຊ້ຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງ dynamic linker ເພື່ອສີດລະຫັດ (inject code). "
"ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ add-ons ທີ່ມີ dynamic code ຫຼື native code ທີ່ແກ້ໄຂຕົວເອງໄດ້, "
"ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ພວກມັນຕາມເອກະສານຂອງ add-on. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_cs_allow-dyld-"
"environment-variables]com.apple.security.cs.allow-dyld-environment-variables[/"
"url]."

msgid ""
"Allows creating writable and executable memory for JIT code. If you are using "
"add-ons with dynamic or self-modifying native code, enable them according to "
"the add-on documentation. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_cs_allow-"
"jit]com.apple.security.cs.allow-jit[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສ້າງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ສາມາດຂຽນ ແລະ ປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ສຳລັບລະຫັດ JIT. ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ add-ons "
"ທີ່ມີ dynamic code ຫຼື native code ທີ່ແກ້ໄຂຕົວເອງໄດ້, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ພວກມັນຕາມເອກະສານຂອງ add-on. "
"ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"entitlements/com_apple_security_cs_allow-jit]com.apple.security.cs.allow-jit[/"
"url]."

msgid ""
"Allows creating writable and executable memory without JIT restrictions. If "
"you are using add-ons with dynamic or self-modifying native code, enable them "
"according to the add-on documentation. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_cs_allow-"
"unsigned-executable-memory]com.apple.security.cs.allow-unsigned-executable-"
"memory[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສ້າງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ສາມາດຂຽນ ແລະ ປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງ JIT. ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ "
"add-ons ທີ່ມີ dynamic code ຫຼື native code ທີ່ແກ້ໄຂຕົວເອງໄດ້, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ພວກມັນຕາມເອກະສານຂອງ "
"add-on. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"entitlements/com_apple_security_cs_allow-unsigned-executable-"
"memory]com.apple.security.cs.allow-unsigned-executable-memory[/url]."

msgid ""
"Enable to allow app to interact with Bluetooth devices. This entitlement is "
"required to use wireless controllers. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_device_bluetooth]com.apple.security.device.bluetooth[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບໂຕ້ຕອບກັບອຸປະກອນ Bluetooth. "
"ສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການໃຊ້ຄອນໂທຣລເລີແບບໄຮ້ສາຍ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_device_bluetooth]com.apple.security.device.bluetooth[/url]."

msgid ""
"Enable to allow app to interact with USB devices. This entitlement is "
"required to use wired controllers. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_device_usb]com.apple.security.device.usb[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບໂຕ້ຕອບກັບອຸປະກອນ USB. "
"ສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການໃຊ້ຄອນໂທຣລເລີແບບມີສາຍ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_device_usb]com.apple.security.device.usb[/url]."

msgid ""
"Enables App Sandbox. The App Sandbox restricts access to user data, "
"networking, and devices. Sandboxed apps can't access most of the file system, "
"can't use custom file dialogs and execute binaries outside the .app bundle. "
"See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/app_sandbox]App "
"Sandbox[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To distribute an app through the App Store, you must enable the "
"App Sandbox."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ App Sandbox. App Sandbox ຈະຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້, ເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ອຸປະກອນ. "
"ແອັບທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ Sandbox ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໄດ້, ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໜ້າຕ່າງເລືອກໄຟລ໌ແບບກຳນົດເອງ "
"ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດລັນໄຟລ໌ binary ທີ່ຢູ່ນອກ bundle .app ໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/security/app_sandbox]App Sandbox[/url].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອແຈກຢາຍແອັບຜ່ານ App Store, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ App Sandbox."

msgid ""
"Allows read or write access to the user's \"Downloads\" folder. See "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_files_downloads_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.downloads.read-write[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ອ່ານ ຫຼື ຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນໃນໂຟນເດີ \"Downloads\" ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_files_downloads_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.downloads.read-write[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows read or write access to the user's \"Movies\" folder. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_assets_movies_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.movies.read-write[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ອ່ານ ຫຼື ຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນໃນໂຟນເດີ \"Movies\" ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_assets_movies_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.movies.read-write[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows read or write access to the user's \"Music\" folder. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_assets_music_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.music.read-write[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ອ່ານ ຫຼື ຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນໃນໂຟນເດີ \"Music\" ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_assets_music_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.music.read-write[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows read or write access to the user's \"Pictures\" folder. See "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_assets_pictures_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.pictures.read-write[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ອ່ານ ຫຼື ຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນໃນໂຟນເດີ \"Pictures\" ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_assets_pictures_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.pictures.read-write[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows read or write access to the locations the user has selected using a "
"native file dialog. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_files_user-selected_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.user-selected.read-write[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ອ່ານ ຫຼື ຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເລືອກໂດຍໃຊ້ໜ້າຕ່າງເລືອກໄຟລ໌ຂອງລະບົບ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_files_user-selected_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.user-selected.read-write[/url]."

msgid ""
"Enable to allow app to establish outgoing network connections. See "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_network_client]com.apple.security.network.client[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍຂາອອກ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_network_client]com.apple.security.network.client[/url]."

msgid ""
"Enable to allow app to listen for incoming network connections. See "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_network_server]com.apple.security.network.server[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບລໍຖ້າຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍຂາເຂົ້າ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_network_server]com.apple.security.network.server[/url]."

msgid ""
"Enable to allow app to send Apple events to other apps. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_automation_apple-"
"events]com.apple.security.automation.apple-events[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບສົ່ງ Apple events ໄປຫາແອັບອື່ນໆ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_automation_apple-"
"events]com.apple.security.automation.apple-events[/url]."

msgid ""
"You can temporarily enable this entitlement to use native debugger (GDB, "
"LLDB) with the exported app. This entitlement should be disabled for "
"production export. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode/"
"embedding-a-helper-tool-in-a-sandboxed-app]Embedding a command-line tool in a "
"sandboxed app[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ສິດນີ້ຊົ່ວຄາວເພື່ອໃຊ້ native debugger (GDB, LLDB) ກັບແອັບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ. "
"ສິດນີ້ຄວນຖືກປິດໄວ້ສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (production). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode/embedding-a-helper-tool-in-a-"
"sandboxed-app]Embedding a command-line tool in a sandboxed app[/url]."

msgid ""
"Allows app to load arbitrary libraries and frameworks (not signed with the "
"same Team ID as the main executable or by Apple). Enable it if you are using "
"GDExtension add-ons or ad-hoc signing, or want to support user-provided "
"external add-ons. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_cs_disable-library-"
"validation]com.apple.security.cs.disable-library-validation[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບໂຫຼດໄລບຣາຣີ ແລະ ເຟຣມເວີກໃດໆກໍໄດ້ (ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ລົງລາຍເຊັນດ້ວຍ Team ID ດຽວກັນກັບໄຟລ໌ "
"executable ຫຼັກ ຫຼື ໂດຍ Apple). ເປີດໃຊ້ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ GDExtension add-ons ຫຼື "
"ການລົງລາຍເຊັນແບບ ad-hoc, ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການຮອງຮັບ add-ons ພາຍນອກທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈັດຫາໃຫ້. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_cs_disable-library-"
"validation]com.apple.security.cs.disable-library-validation[/url]."

msgid ""
"Provisioning profile file downloaded from Apple developer account dashboard. "
"See [url=https://developer.apple.com/help/account/manage-profiles/edit-"
"download-or-delete-profiles]Edit, download, or delete provisioning profiles[/"
"url].\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_CODESIGN_PROVISIONING_PROFILE[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ Provisioning profile ທີ່ດາວໂຫຼດມາຈາກ Apple developer account dashboard. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/help/account/manage-profiles/edit-download-"
"or-delete-profiles]Edit, download, or delete provisioning profiles[/url].\n"
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_CODESIGN_PROVISIONING_PROFILE[/code]."

msgid ""
"If enabled, a wrapper that can be used to run the application with console "
"output is created alongside the exported application."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ຕົວຫຸ້ມ (wrapper) "
"ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລັນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນພ້ອມກັບການສະແດງຜົນທາງຄອນໂຊລຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຄຽງຄູ່ກັບແອັບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the application is rendered at native display "
"resolution, otherwise it is always rendered at loDPI resolution and upscaled "
"by OS when required."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]ຈິງ[/code], ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນທີ່ຄວາມລະອຽດໜ້າຈໍເດີມ, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ "
"ມັນຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນທີ່ຄວາມລະອຽດ loDPI ສະເໝີ ແລະ ຖືກຂະຫຍາຍຂະໜາດ (upscale) "
"ໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການເມື່ອຈຳເປັນ."

msgid "Application distribution target."
msgstr "ເປົ້າໝາຍການແຈກຢາຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

msgid ""
"Apple App Store Connect API issuer key file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_API_KEY[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ຄີຜູ້ອອກ (issuer key) ຂອງ Apple App Store Connect API.\n"
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_API_KEY[/code]."

msgid ""
"Apple App Store Connect API issuer key ID.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_API_KEY_ID[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ໄອດີຄີຜູ້ອອກ (issuer key ID) ຂອງ Apple App Store Connect API.\n"
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_API_KEY_ID[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Apple App Store Connect API issuer UUID.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_API_UUID[/code]."
msgstr ""
"UUID ຜູ້ອອກ (issuer UUID) ຂອງ Apple App Store Connect API.\n"
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_API_UUID[/code]."

msgid ""
"Apple ID account name (email address).\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_APPLE_ID_NAME[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ບັນຊີ Apple ID (ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລ).\n"
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_APPLE_ID_NAME[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Apple ID app-specific password.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_APPLE_ID_PASSWORD[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດຜ່ານສະເພາະແອັບ (app-specific password) ຂອງ Apple ID.\n"
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_NOTARIZATION_APPLE_ID_PASSWORD[/code]."

msgid "Tool to use for notarization."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຮັບຮອງຄວາມປອດໄພ (notarization)."

msgid ""
"A message displayed when requesting access to the user's contacts (in "
"English)."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍການເຂົ້າເຖິງລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ (ເປັນພາສາອັງກິດ)."

msgid ""
"A message displayed when requesting access to the user's contacts (localized)."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍການເຂົ້າເຖິງລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ (ຕາມພາສາທ້ອງຖິ່ນ)."

msgid ""
"A message displayed when requesting access to the user's calendar data (in "
"English)."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນປະຕິທິນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ (ເປັນພາສາອັງກິດ)."

msgid ""
"A message displayed when requesting access to the user's calendar data "
"(localized)."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນປະຕິທິນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ (ຕາມພາສາທ້ອງຖິ່ນ)."

msgid "Indicates whether your app collects physical address."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານມີການເກັບກຳທີ່ຢູ່ທາງກາຍະພາບຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"A message displayed when requesting access to the user's \"Desktop\" folder "
"(in English)."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍການເຂົ້າເຖິງໂຟນເດີ \"Desktop\" ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ (ເປັນພາສາອັງກິດ)."

msgid ""
"A message displayed when requesting access to the user's \"Desktop\" folder "
"(localized)."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍການເຂົ້າເຖິງໂຟນເດີ \"Desktop\" ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ (ຕາມພາສາທ້ອງຖິ່ນ)."

msgid ""
"A message displayed when requesting access to the user's \"Documents\" folder "
"(in English)."
