msgid "Target speed for the motor at the X axis."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບມໍເຕີທີ່ແກນ X."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], a rotating motor at the Y axis is enabled."
