"ແຕ່ລະອັນເປັນຄ່າເລກຈຳນວນເຕັມບວກ 16-bit. ແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບຈະຖືກຈຳກັດລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/code] "
"ແລະ [code]65535[/code] (ລວມທັງສອງຄ່າ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນເຊດເດີ (shader), ເທັກເຈີນີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງແບບ "
"[code]usampler[/code]. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ມັນຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່ການກັ່ນຕອງແບບ nearest-neighbor "
"ພາຍໃຕ້ຕົວສະແດງຜົນແບບ Compatibility.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງໂດຍໃຊ້ [method Image.get_pixel], ຄ່າ [Color] "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງກັບມາຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຫານດ້ວຍ [code]65535[/code] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄ່າສີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_RGBA16UI[/code] where there are four "
"components, each a 16-bit unsigned integer value. Each component is clamped "
"between [code]0[/code] and [code]65535[/code] (inclusive).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When used in a shader, the texture requires usage of "
"[code]usampler[/code] samplers. Additionally, it only supports nearest-"
"neighbor filtering under the Compatibility renderer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When sampling using [method Image.get_pixel], returned [Color]s "
"have to be divided by [code]65535[/code] to get the correct color value."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບເທັກເຈີ OpenGL [code]GL_RGBA16UI[/code] ເຊິ່ງມີສີ່ອົງປະກອບ, "
"ແຕ່ລະອັນເປັນຄ່າເລກຈຳນວນເຕັມບວກ 16-bit. ແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບຈະຖືກຈຳກັດລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/code] "
"ແລະ [code]65535[/code] (ລວມທັງສອງຄ່າ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນເຊດເດີ (shader), ເທັກເຈີນີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງແບບ "
"[code]usampler[/code]. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ມັນຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່ການກັ່ນຕອງແບບ nearest-neighbor "
"ພາຍໃຕ້ຕົວສະແດງຜົນແບບ Compatibility.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງໂດຍໃຊ້ [method Image.get_pixel], ຄ່າ [Color] "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງກັບມາຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຫານດ້ວຍ [code]65535[/code] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄ່າສີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Format] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ [enum Format] ອີນຳ (enum)."

msgid ""
"Performs nearest-neighbor interpolation. If the image is resized, it will be "
"pixelated."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນແບບຈຸດໃກ້ຄຽງທີ່ສຸດ (nearest-neighbor). ຖ້າຮູບພາບຖືກປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ, "
"ມັນຈະເຫັນເປັນເມັດພິກເຊວ."

msgid ""
"Performs bilinear interpolation. If the image is resized, it will be blurry. "
"This mode is faster than [constant INTERPOLATE_CUBIC], but it results in "
"lower quality."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນແບບໄບລີເນຍ (bilinear). ຖ້າຮູບພາບຖືກປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ, ມັນຈະເບີ. ໂໝດນີ້ໄວາກວ່າ "
"[constant INTERPOLATE_CUBIC], ແຕ່ຈະໄດ້ຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Performs cubic interpolation. If the image is resized, it will be blurry. "
"This mode often gives better results compared to [constant "
"INTERPOLATE_BILINEAR], at the cost of being slower."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນແບບຄິວບິກ (cubic). ຖ້າຮູບພາບຖືກປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ, ມັນຈະເບີ. "
"ໂໝດນີ້ມັກຈະໃຫ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ດີກວ່າເມື່ອທຽບກັບ [constant INTERPOLATE_BILINEAR], ແຕ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກຊ້າກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Performs Lanczos interpolation. This is the slowest image resizing mode, but "
"it typically gives the best results, especially when downscaling images."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນແບບລານໂຊສ (Lanczos). ນີ້ແມ່ນໂໝດການປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຮູບພາບທີ່ຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ, "
"ແຕ່ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະໃຫ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ, ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອເຮັດການຫຼຸດຂະໜາດຮູບພາບ."

msgid "Image is fully opaque. It does not store alpha data."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບເປັນແບບທຶບແສງທັງໝົດ. ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນອາລຟາ (alpha)."

msgid ""
"Image stores either fully opaque or fully transparent pixels. Also known as "
"punchthrough alpha."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພິກເຊວແບບທຶບແສງທັງໝົດ ຫຼື ໂປ່ງໃສທັງໝົດ. ທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກກັນໃນຊື່ punchthrough alpha."

msgid ""
"Image stores alpha data with values varying between [code]0.0[/code] and "
"[code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບເກັບຂໍ້ມູນອາລຟາທີ່ມີຄ່າຜັນປ່ຽນລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/code] ແລະ [code]1.0[/code]."

msgid "Use S3TC compression."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການບີບອັດແບບ S3TC."

msgid "Use ETC compression."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການບີບອັດແບບ ETC."

msgid "Use ETC2 compression."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການບີບອັດແບບ ETC2."

msgid "Use BPTC compression."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການບີບອັດແບບ BPTC."

msgid "Use ASTC compression."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການບີບອັດແບບ ASTC."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum CompressMode] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ [enum CompressMode] ອີນຳ (enum)."

msgid "The image only uses one channel for luminance (grayscale)."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ອງດຽວສຳລັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (grayscale)."

msgid "The image uses two channels for luminance and alpha, respectively."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບໃຊ້ສອງຊ່ອງສຳລັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ອາລຟາ ຕາມລຳດັບ."

msgid "The image only uses the red channel."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ອງສີແດງ."

msgid "The image uses two channels for red and green."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບໃຊ້ສອງຊ່ອງສຳລັບສີແດງ ແລະ ສີຂຽວ."

msgid "The image uses three channels for red, green, and blue."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບໃຊ້ສາມຊ່ອງສຳລັບສີແດງ, ສີຂຽວ, ແລະ ສີຟ້າ."

msgid "The image uses four channels for red, green, blue, and alpha."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບໃຊ້ສີ່ຊ່ອງສຳລັບສີແດງ, ສີຂຽວ, ສີຟ້າ, ແລະ ອາລຟາ."

msgid ""
"Source texture (before compression) is a regular texture. Default for all "
"textures."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີຕົ້ນສະບັບ (ກ່ອນການບີບອັດ) ແມ່ນເທັກເຈີປົກກະຕິ. ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບທຸກເທັກເຈີ."

msgid "Source texture (before compression) uses nonlinear sRGB encoding."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີຕົ້ນສະບັບ (ກ່ອນການບີບອັດ) ໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ sRGB ແບບບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່ (nonlinear)."

msgid ""
"Source texture (before compression) is a normal texture (e.g. it can be "
"compressed into two channels)."
msgstr ""
"ເທັກເຈີຕົ້ນສະບັບ (ກ່ອນການບີບອັດ) ແມ່ນ normal texture (ເຊັ່ນ: ມັນສາມາດບີບອັດໃຫ້ເຫຼືອສອງຊ່ອງໄດ້)."

msgid ""
"Hint to indicate that the high quality 4×4 ASTC compression format should be "
"used."
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າຄວນໃຊ້ຮູບແບບການບີບອັດ ASTC 4×4 ຄຸນນະພາບສູງ."

msgid ""
"Hint to indicate that the low quality 8×8 ASTC compression format should be "
"used."
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າຄວນໃຊ້ຮູບແບບການບີບອັດ ASTC 8×8 ຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳ."

msgid "Base class to add support for specific image formats."
msgstr "ຄລາດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບຮູບພາບສະເພາະ."

msgid ""
"The engine supports multiple image formats out of the box (PNG, SVG, JPEG, "
"WebP to name a few), but you can choose to implement support for additional "
"image formats by extending [ImageFormatLoaderExtension]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເອນຈິນຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບຮູບພາບຫຼາຍຢ່າງຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ PNG, SVG, JPEG, WebP), "
"ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກທີ່ຈະສ້າງການຮອງຮັບສຳລັບຮູບແບບຮູບພາບເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ໂດຍການຂະຫຍາຍ "
"[ImageFormatLoaderExtension]."

msgid "Default loading behavior. No processing is applied to the image."
msgstr "ພຶດຕິກຳການໂຫຼດແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຈະບໍ່ມີການປະມວນຜົນໃດໆກັບຮູບພາບ."

msgid "If set, the image is converted from sRGB to linear encoding."
msgstr "ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, ຮູບພາບຈະຖືກປ່ຽນຈາກ sRGB ໄປເປັນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear)."

msgid ""
"If set, a predefined color map is applied to the image. Used when [member "
"ResourceImporterTexture.editor/convert_colors_with_editor_theme] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, ແຜນຜັງສີທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບຮູບພາບ. ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [member "
"ResourceImporterTexture.editor/convert_colors_with_editor_theme] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Base class for creating [ImageFormatLoader] extensions (adding support for "
"extra image formats)."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບການສ້າງສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ [ImageFormatLoader] "
"(ເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບຮູບພາບເພີ່ມເຕີມ)."

msgid ""
"The engine supports multiple image formats out of the box (PNG, SVG, JPEG, "
"WebP to name a few), but you can choose to implement support for additional "
"image formats by extending this class.\n"
"Be sure to respect the documented return types and values. You should create "
"an instance of it, and call [method add_format_loader] to register that "
"loader during the initialization phase."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເອນຈິນຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບຮູບພາບຫຼາຍຢ່າງຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ PNG, SVG, JPEG, WebP), "
"ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກທີ່ຈະສ້າງການຮອງຮັບສຳລັບຮູບແບບຮູບພາບເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ໂດຍການຂະຫຍາຍຄລາດນີ້.\n"
"ກະລຸນາກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ປະເພດການສົ່ງຄ່າ ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້. ທ່ານຄວນສ້າງ instance "
"ຂອງມັນ, ແລະ ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method add_format_loader] ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນ loader ນັ້ນໃນຊ່ວງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
"(initialization)."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of file extensions for this image format. Files with the "
"given extensions will be treated as image file and loaded using this class."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບຮູບແບບຮູບພາບນີ້. ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີນາມສະກຸນທີ່ກຳນົດຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບ ແລະ "
"ຈະຖືກໂຫຼດໂດຍໃຊ້ຄລາດນີ້."

msgid "Loads the content of [param fileaccess] into the provided [param image]."
msgstr "ໂຫຼດເນື້ອໃນຂອງ [param fileaccess] ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ [param image] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Add this format loader to the engine, allowing it to recognize the file "
"extensions returned by [method _get_recognized_extensions]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ format loader ນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນເອນຈິນ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນສາມາດຮັບຮູ້ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາຈາກ [method "
"_get_recognized_extensions]."

msgid "Remove this format loader from the engine."
msgstr "ເອົາ format loader ນີ້ອອກຈາກເອນຈິນ."

msgid "A [Texture2D] based on an [Image]."
msgstr "[Texture2D] ທີ່ອີງຕາມ [Image]."

msgid ""
"A [Texture2D] based on an [Image]. For an image to be displayed, an "
"[ImageTexture] has to be created from it using the [method create_from_image] "
"method:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var image = Image.load_from_file(\"res://icon.svg\")\n"
"var texture = ImageTexture.create_from_image(image)\n"
"$Sprite2D.texture = texture\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"This way, textures can be created at run-time by loading images both from "
"within the editor and externally.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Prefer to load imported textures with [method @GDScript.load] "
"over loading them from within the filesystem dynamically with [method "
"Image.load], as it may not work in exported projects:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var texture = load(\"res://icon.svg\")\n"
"$Sprite2D.texture = texture\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"This is because images have to be imported as a [CompressedTexture2D] first "
"to be loaded with [method @GDScript.load]. If you'd still like to load an "
"image file just like any other [Resource], import it as an [Image] resource "
"instead, and then load it normally using the [method @GDScript.load] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The image can be retrieved from an imported texture using the "
"[method Texture2D.get_image] method, which returns a copy of the image:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var texture = load(\"res://icon.svg\")\n"
"var image = texture.get_image()\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"An [ImageTexture] is not meant to be operated from within the editor "
"interface directly, and is mostly useful for rendering images on screen "
"dynamically via code. If you need to generate images procedurally from within "
"the editor, consider saving and importing images as custom texture resources "
"implementing a new [EditorImportPlugin].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The maximum texture size is 16384×16384 pixels due to graphics "
"hardware limitations."
msgstr ""
"[Texture2D] ທີ່ອີງຕາມ [Image]. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູບພາບສາມາດສະແດງຜົນໄດ້, ຈະຕ້ອງສ້າງ [ImageTexture] "
"ຈາກມັນໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີ [method create_from_image]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var image = Image.load_from_file(\"res://icon.svg\")\n"
"var texture = ImageTexture.create_from_image(image)\n"
"$Sprite2D.texture = texture\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້, ເທັກເຈີສາມາດຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ (run-time) "
"ໂດຍການໂຫຼດຮູບພາບທັງຈາກພາຍໃນ editor ແລະ ຈາກພາຍນອກ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ຄວນເລືອກໂຫຼດເທັກເຈີທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າແລ້ວດ້ວຍ [method @GDScript.load] "
"ແທນການໂຫຼດຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໂດຍກົງດ້ວຍ [method Image.load], ເພາະມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ "
"export ອອກໄປ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var texture = load(\"res://icon.svg\")\n"
"$Sprite2D.texture = texture\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ນີ້ເປັນເພາະວ່າຮູບພາບຕ້ອງຖືກນຳເຂົ້າເປັນ [CompressedTexture2D] ກ່ອນຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດໂຫຼດດ້ວຍ [method "
"@GDScript.load] ໄດ້. ຖ້າທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງການໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບຄືກັບ [Resource] ອື່ນໆ, ໃຫ້ນຳເຂົ້າເປັນ "
"[Image] resource ແທນ, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງໂຫຼດຕາມປົກກະຕິໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີ [method @GDScript.load].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາມາດດຶງຮູບພາບຈາກເທັກເຈີທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີ [method "
"Texture2D.get_image], ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງຄືນສຳເນົາຂອງຮູບພາບນັ້ນ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var texture = load(\"res://icon.svg\")\n"
"var image = texture.get_image()\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[ImageTexture] ບໍ່ໄດ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານໂດຍກົງພາຍໃນ editor interface, "
"ແຕ່ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນຮູບພາບໃນໜ້າຈໍແບບໄດນາມິກຜ່ານ code. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງຮູບພາບຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນ (procedurally) ຈາກພາຍໃນ editor, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາການບັນທຶກ "
"ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບເປັນ custom texture resources ໂດຍການໃຊ້ [EditorImportPlugin] ໃໝ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງເທັກເຈີແມ່ນ 16384×16384 ພິກເຊວ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງຮາດແວກຣາຟິກ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [ImageTexture] and initializes it by allocating and setting the "
"data from an [Image]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [ImageTexture] ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນມັນໂດຍການຈັດສັນພື້ນທີ່ ແລະ ກຳນົດຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ [Image]."

msgid ""
"Replaces the texture's data with a new [Image]. This will re-allocate new "
"memory for the texture.\n"
"If you want to update the image, but don't need to change its parameters "
"(format, size), use [method update] instead for better performance."
msgstr ""
"ແທນທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນຂອງເທັກເຈີດ້ວຍ [Image] ໃໝ່. ນີ້ຈະເຮັດການຈັດສັນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໃໝ່ສຳລັບເທັກເຈີ.\n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການອັບເດດຮູບພາບ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນພາລາມິເຕີຂອງມັນ (ຮູບແບບ, ຂະໜາດ), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"update] ແທນເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ດີກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Replaces the texture's data with a new [Image].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The texture has to be created using [method create_from_image] "
"or initialized first with the [method set_image] method before it can be "
"updated. The new image dimensions, format, and mipmaps configuration should "
"match the existing texture's image configuration.\n"
"Use this method over [method set_image] if you need to update the texture "
"frequently, which is faster than allocating additional memory for a new "
"texture each time."
msgstr ""
"ແທນທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນຂອງເທັກເຈີດ້ວຍ [Image] ໃໝ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເທັກເຈີຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ [method create_from_image] ຫຼື "
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນກ່ອນດ້ວຍວິທີ [method set_image] ຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດອັບເດດໄດ້. ຂະໜາດ, ຮູບແບບ, ແລະ "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າມິບແມັບຂອງຮູບພາບໃໝ່ຄວນຈະກົງກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບພາບຂອງເທັກເຈີທີ່ມີຢູ່.\n"
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ແທນ [method set_image] ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການອັບເດດເທັກເຈີເລື້ອຍໆ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະໄວກວ່າການຈັດສັນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບເທັກເຈີໃໝ່ທຸກຄັ້ງ."

msgid "Texture with 3 dimensions."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີທີ່ມີ 3 ມິຕິ."

msgid ""
"[ImageTexture3D] is a 3-dimensional [ImageTexture] that has a width, height, "
"and depth. See also [ImageTextureLayered].\n"
"3D textures are typically used to store density maps for [FogMaterial], color "
"correction LUTs for [Environment], vector fields for "
"[GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D] and collision maps for "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D]. 3D textures can also be used in custom shaders."
msgstr ""
"[ImageTexture3D] ແມ່ນ [ImageTexture] ແບບ 3 ມິຕິ ທີ່ມີທັງລວງກວ້າງ, ລວງສູງ, ແລະ ຄວາມເລິກ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [ImageTextureLayered] ປະກອບ.\n"
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ເທັກເຈີ 3D ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບແຜນຜັງຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນ (density maps) ສຳລັບ "
"[FogMaterial], ຕາຕະລາງປັບສີ (LUTs) ສຳລັບ [Environment], ສະໜາມເວັກເຕີ (vector "
"fields) ສຳລັບ [GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D] ແລະ ແຜນຜັງການຕຳ (collision "
"maps) ສຳລັບ [GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D]. ເທັກເຈີ 3D ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນ custom shaders "
"ໄດ້ອີກດ້ວຍ."

msgid ""
"Creates the [ImageTexture3D] with specified [param format], [param width], "
"[param height], and [param depth]. If [param use_mipmaps] is [code]true[/"
"code], generates mipmaps for the [ImageTexture3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [ImageTexture3D] ດ້ວຍ [param format], [param width], [param height], ແລະ "
"[param depth] ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຖ້າ [param use_mipmaps] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະສ້າງມິບແມັບສຳລັບ [ImageTexture3D] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Replaces the texture's existing data with the layers specified in [param "
"data]. The size of [param data] must match the parameters that were used for "
"[method create]. In other words, the texture cannot be resized or have its "
"format changed by calling [method update]."
msgstr ""
"ແທນທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງເທັກເຈີດ້ວຍເລເຢີ (layers) ທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [param data]. ຂະໜາດຂອງ [param data] "
"ຕ້ອງກົງກັບພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ [method create]. ເວົ້າງ່າຍໆຄື ເທັກເຈີບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ ຫຼື "
"ປ່ຽນຮູບແບບໄດ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method update]."

msgid ""
"Base class for texture types which contain the data of multiple "
"[ImageTexture]s. Each image is of the same size and format."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບປະເພດເທັກເຈີທີ່ບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ [ImageTexture] ຫຼາຍອັນ. ແຕ່ລະຮູບພາບຈະມີຂະໜາດ ແລະ "
"ຮູບແບບດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"Base class for [Texture2DArray], [Cubemap] and [CubemapArray]. Cannot be used "
"directly, but contains all the functions necessary for accessing the derived "
"resource types. See also [Texture3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບ [Texture2DArray], [Cubemap] ແລະ [CubemapArray]. "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ບັນຈຸຟັງຊັນທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນ (resource "
"types) ທີ່ສືບທອດມາ. ເບິ່ງ [Texture3D] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Creates an [ImageTextureLayered] from an array of [Image]s. See [method "
"Image.create] for the expected data format. The first image decides the "
"width, height, image format and mipmapping setting. The other images [i]must[/"
"i] have the same width, height, image format and mipmapping setting.\n"
"Each [Image] represents one [code]layer[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Fill in an array of Images with different colors.\n"
"var images = []\n"
"const LAYERS = 6\n"
"for i in LAYERS:\n"
"\tvar image = Image.create_empty(128, 128, false, Image.FORMAT_RGB8)\n"
"\tif i % 3 == 0:\n"
"\t\timage.fill(Color.RED)\n"
"\telif i % 3 == 1:\n"
"\t\timage.fill(Color.GREEN)\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\timage.fill(Color.BLUE)\n"
"\timages.push_back(image)\n"
"\n"
"# Create and save a 2D texture array. The array of images must have at least "
"1 Image.\n"
"var texture_2d_array = Texture2DArray.new()\n"
"texture_2d_array.create_from_images(images)\n"
"ResourceSaver.save(texture_2d_array, \"res://texture_2d_array.res\", "
"ResourceSaver.FLAG_COMPRESS)\n"
"\n"
"# Create and save a cubemap. The array of images must have exactly 6 Images.\n"
"# The cubemap's images are specified in this order: X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z-\n"
"# (in Godot's coordinate system, so Y+ is \"up\" and Z- is \"forward\").\n"
"var cubemap = Cubemap.new()\n"
"cubemap.create_from_images(images)\n"
"ResourceSaver.save(cubemap, \"res://cubemap.res\", "
"ResourceSaver.FLAG_COMPRESS)\n"
"\n"
"# Create and save a cubemap array. The array of images must have a multiple "
"of 6 Images.\n"
"# Each cubemap's images are specified in this order: X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z-\n"
"# (in Godot's coordinate system, so Y+ is \"up\" and Z- is \"forward\").\n"
"var cubemap_array = CubemapArray.new()\n"
"cubemap_array.create_from_images(images)\n"
"ResourceSaver.save(cubemap_array, \"res://cubemap_array.res\", "
"ResourceSaver.FLAG_COMPRESS)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [ImageTextureLayered] ຈາກ array ຂອງ [Image] ຫຼາຍອັນ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"Image.create] ສຳລັບຮູບແບບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ຮູບພາບທຳອິດຈະເປັນຕົວ ກຳນົດລວງກວ້າງ, ລວງສູງ, "
"ຮູບແບບຮູບພາບ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າມິບແມັບ. ຮູບພາບອື່ນໆ [i]ຕ້ອງ[/i] ມີລວງກວ້າງ, ລວງສູງ, ຮູບແບບຮູບພາບ "
"ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າມິບແມັບຄືກັນ.\n"
"ແຕ່ລະ [Image] ຈະແທນໜຶ່ງ [code]layer[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# ຕື່ມສີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນລົງໃນ array ຂອງຮູບພາບ.\n"
"var images = []\n"
"const LAYERS = 6\n"
"for i in LAYERS:\n"
"\tvar image = Image.create_empty(128, 128, false, Image.FORMAT_RGB8)\n"
"\tif i % 3 == 0:\n"
"\t\timage.fill(Color.RED)\n"
"\telif i % 3 == 1:\n"
"\t\timage.fill(Color.GREEN)\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\timage.fill(Color.BLUE)\n"
"\timages.push_back(image)\n"
"\n"
"# ສ້າງ ແລະ ບັນທຶກ 2D texture array. array ຂອງຮູບພາບຕ້ອງມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 1 ຮູບ.\n"
"var texture_2d_array = Texture2DArray.new()\n"
"texture_2d_array.create_from_images(images)\n"
"ResourceSaver.save(texture_2d_array, \"res://texture_2d_array.res\", "
"ResourceSaver.FLAG_COMPRESS)\n"
"\n"
"# ສ້າງ ແລະ ບັນທຶກ cubemap. array ຂອງຮູບພາບຕ້ອງມີ 6 ຮູບພໍດີ.\n"
"# ຮູບພາບຂອງ cubemap ຈະຖືກລະບຸຕາມລຳດັບນີ້: X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z-\n"
"# (ໃນລະບົບພິກັດຂອງ Godot, Y+ ຄື \"ຂຶ້ນ\" ແລະ Z- ຄື \"ໄປທາງໜ້າ\").\n"
"var cubemap = Cubemap.new()\n"
"cubemap.create_from_images(images)\n"
"ResourceSaver.save(cubemap, \"res://cubemap.res\", "
"ResourceSaver.FLAG_COMPRESS)\n"
"\n"
"# ສ້າງ ແລະ ບັນທຶກ cubemap array. array ຂອງຮູບພາບຕ້ອງມີຈຳນວນຮູບເປັນທະວີຄູນຂອງ 6.\n"
"# ຮູບພາບຂອງແຕ່ລະ cubemap ຈະຖືກລະບຸຕາມລຳດັບນີ້: X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z-\n"
"# (ໃນລະບົບພິກັດຂອງ Godot, Y+ ຄື \"ຂຶ້ນ\" ແລະ Z- ຄື \"ໄປທາງໜ້າ\").\n"
"var cubemap_array = CubemapArray.new()\n"
"cubemap_array.create_from_images(images)\n"
"ResourceSaver.save(cubemap_array, \"res://cubemap_array.res\", "
"ResourceSaver.FLAG_COMPRESS)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Replaces the existing [Image] data at the given [param layer] with this new "
"image.\n"
"The given [Image] must have the same width, height, image format, and "
"mipmapping flag as the rest of the referenced images.\n"
"If the image format is unsupported, it will be decompressed and converted to "
"a similar and supported [enum Image.Format].\n"
"The update is immediate: it's synchronized with drawing."
msgstr ""
"ແທນທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນ [Image] ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ [param layer] ທີ່ກຳນົດດ້ວຍຮູບພາບໃໝ່ນີ້.\n"
"[Image] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຕ້ອງມີລວງກວ້າງ, ລວງສູງ, ຮູບແບບຮູບພາບ, ແລະ "
"ຄ່າການສ້າງມິບແມັບດຽວກັນກັບຮູບພາບອື່ນໆທີ່ອ້າງອີງ.\n"
"ຖ້າຮູບແບບຮູບພາບບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ, ມັນຈະຖືກຄາຍການບີບອັດ ແລະ ປ່ຽນເປັນ [enum Image.Format] "
"ທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງ ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"ການອັບເດດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນທັນທີ: ມັນຖືກຊິງໂຄໄນຊ໌ (synchronized) ກັບການແຕ້ມຜົນ."

msgid "Mesh optimized for creating geometry manually."
msgstr "ເມຊ (Mesh) ທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງມາສຳລັບການສ້າງເລຂາຄະນິດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"A mesh type optimized for creating geometry manually, similar to OpenGL 1.x "
"immediate mode.\n"
"Here's a sample on how to generate a triangular face:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var mesh = ImmediateMesh.new()\n"
"mesh.surface_begin(Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES)\n"
"mesh.surface_add_vertex(Vector3.LEFT)\n"
"mesh.surface_add_vertex(Vector3.FORWARD)\n"
"mesh.surface_add_vertex(Vector3.ZERO)\n"
"mesh.surface_end()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var mesh = new ImmediateMesh();\n"
"mesh.SurfaceBegin(Mesh.PrimitiveType.Triangles);\n"
"mesh.SurfaceAddVertex(Vector3.Left);\n"
"mesh.SurfaceAddVertex(Vector3.Forward);\n"
"mesh.SurfaceAddVertex(Vector3.Zero);\n"
"mesh.SurfaceEnd();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Generating complex geometries with [ImmediateMesh] is highly "
"inefficient. Instead, it is designed to generate simple geometry that changes "
"often."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຂອງເມຊທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງມາສຳລັບການສ້າງເລຂາຄະນິດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ OpenGL 1.x immediate "
"mode.\n"
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງການສ້າງຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var mesh = ImmediateMesh.new()\n"
"mesh.surface_begin(Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES)\n"
"mesh.surface_add_vertex(Vector3.LEFT)\n"
"mesh.surface_add_vertex(Vector3.FORWARD)\n"
"mesh.surface_add_vertex(Vector3.ZERO)\n"
"mesh.surface_end()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var mesh = new ImmediateMesh();\n"
"mesh.SurfaceBegin(Mesh.PrimitiveType.Triangles);\n"
"mesh.SurfaceAddVertex(Vector3.Left);\n"
"mesh.SurfaceAddVertex(Vector3.Forward);\n"
"mesh.SurfaceAddVertex(Vector3.Zero);\n"
"mesh.SurfaceEnd();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການສ້າງເລຂາຄະນິດທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນດ້ວຍ [ImmediateMesh] ແມ່ນບໍ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍ. "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນແນວນັ້ນ, ມັນຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອສ້າງເລຂາຄະນິດແບບງ່າຍໆທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງເລື້ອຍໆ."

msgid "Using ImmediateMesh"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ ImmediateMesh"

msgid "Clear all surfaces."
msgstr "ລຶບຜິວ (surfaces) ທັງໝົດອອກ."

msgid "Add a 3D vertex using the current attributes previously set."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຈຸດ (vertex) 3D ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຸນລັກສະນະປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

msgid "Add a 2D vertex using the current attributes previously set."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຈຸດ (vertex) 2D ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຸນລັກສະນະປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

msgid "Begin a new surface."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຜິວ (surface) ໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"End and commit current surface. Note that surface being created will not be "
"visible until this function is called."
msgstr ""
"ສິ້ນສຸດ ແລະ ຢືນຢັນຜິວປັດຈຸບັນ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຜິວທີ່ກຳລັງສ້າງຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນຈົນກວ່າຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້."

msgid "Set the color attribute that will be pushed with the next vertex."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄຸນລັກສະນະສີທີ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປພ້ອມກັບຈຸດ (vertex) ຖັດໄປ."

msgid "Set the normal attribute that will be pushed with the next vertex."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄຸນລັກສະນະຄ່ານໍມໍ (normal) ທີ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປພ້ອມກັບຈຸດ (vertex) ຖັດໄປ."

msgid ""
"Set the tangent attribute that will be pushed with the next vertex.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Even though [param tangent] is a [Plane], it does not directly "
"represent the tangent plane. Its [member Plane.x], [member Plane.y], and "
"[member Plane.z] represent the tangent vector and [member Plane.d] should be "
"either [code]-1[/code] or [code]1[/code]. See also [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_TANGENT]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄຸນລັກສະນະແທນເຈນ (tangent) ທີ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປພ້ອມກັບຈຸດ (vertex) ຖັດໄປ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ [param tangent] ຈະເປັນ [Plane], "
"ແຕ່ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ແທນລະນາບແທນເຈນໂດຍກົງ. ຄ່າ [member Plane.x], [member Plane.y], ແລະ "
"[member Plane.z] ຂອງມັນແທນເວັກເຕີແທນເຈນ ແລະ [member Plane.d] ຄວນຈະເປັນ [code]-1[/"
"code] ຫຼື [code]1[/code]. ເບິ່ງ [constant Mesh.ARRAY_TANGENT] ປະກອບ."

msgid "Set the UV attribute that will be pushed with the next vertex."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄຸນລັກສະນະ UV ທີ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປພ້ອມກັບຈຸດ (vertex) ຖັດໄປ."

msgid "Set the UV2 attribute that will be pushed with the next vertex."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄຸນລັກສະນະ UV2 ທີ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປພ້ອມກັບຈຸດ (vertex) ຖັດໄປ."

msgid ""
"A [Resource] that contains vertex array-based geometry during the import "
"process."
msgstr "[Resource] ທີ່ບັນຈຸເລຂາຄະນິດແບບ vertex array ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າ."

msgid ""
"ImporterMesh is a type of [Resource] analogous to [ArrayMesh]. It contains "
"vertex array-based geometry, divided in [i]surfaces[/i]. Each surface "
"contains a completely separate array and a material used to draw it. Design "
"wise, a mesh with multiple surfaces is preferred to a single surface, because "
"objects created in 3D editing software commonly contain multiple materials.\n"
"Unlike its runtime counterpart, [ImporterMesh] contains mesh data before "
"various import steps, such as LOD and shadow mesh generation, have taken "
"place. Modify surface data by calling [method clear], followed by [method "
"add_surface] for each surface."
msgstr ""
"ImporterMesh ແມ່ນປະເພດຂອງ [Resource] ທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [ArrayMesh]. ມັນບັນຈຸເລຂາຄະນິດແບບ "
"vertex array ທີ່ແບ່ງອອກເປັນ [i]ຜິວ (surfaces)[/i]. ແຕ່ລະຜິວປະກອບດ້ວຍ array "
"ທີ່ແຍກຈາກກັນໂດຍສິ້ນເຊີງ ແລະ ວັດສະດຸ (material) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ້ມມັນ. ໃນດ້ານການອອກແບບ, "
"ເມຊທີ່ມີຫຼາຍຜິວແມ່ນດີກວ່າການມີຜິວດຽວ, ເພາະວ່າວັດຖຸທີ່ສ້າງໃນຊອບແວແກ້ໄຂ 3D ສ່ວນຫຼາຍມັກຈະມີຫຼາຍວັດສະດຸ.\n"
"ຕ່າງຈາກ ArrayMesh ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຕອນຣັນໄທມ໌ (runtime), [ImporterMesh] "
"ບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນເມຊກ່ອນຂັ້ນຕອນການນຳເຂົ້າຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ ການສ້າງ LOD ແລະ shadow mesh. "
"ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນຜິວໄດ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method clear], ຕາມດ້ວຍ [method add_surface] "
"ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜິວ."

msgid ""
"Adds name for a blend shape that will be added with [method add_surface]. "
"Must be called before surface is added."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຊື່ສຳລັບ blend shape ທີ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມດ້ວຍ [method add_surface]. ຕ້ອງຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມຜິວ "
"(surface)."

msgid "Removes all surfaces and blend shapes from this [ImporterMesh]."
msgstr "ລຶບຜິວ ແລະ blend shapes ທັງໝົດອອກຈາກ [ImporterMesh] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Converts the given [Mesh] into an [ImporterMesh] by copying all its surfaces, "
"blend shapes, materials, and metadata into a new [ImporterMesh] object."
msgstr ""
"ແປງ [Mesh] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນ [ImporterMesh] ໂດຍການຄັດລອກຜິວ, blend shapes, ວັດສະດຸ ແລະ "
"ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ (metadata) ທັງໝົດເຂົ້າໄປໃນວັດຖຸ [ImporterMesh] ໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Generates all lods for this ImporterMesh.\n"
"[param normal_merge_angle] is in degrees and used in the same way as the "
"importer settings in [code]lods[/code].\n"
"[param normal_split_angle] is not used and only remains for compatibility "
"with older versions of the API.\n"
"The number of generated lods can be accessed using [method "
"get_surface_lod_count], and each LOD is available in [method "
"get_surface_lod_size] and [method get_surface_lod_indices].\n"
"[param bone_transform_array] is an [Array] which can be either empty or "
"contain [Transform3D]s which, for each of the mesh's bone IDs, will apply "
"mesh skinning when generating the LOD mesh variations. This is usually used "
"to account for discrepancies in scale between the mesh itself and its "
"skinning data."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ LOD (levels of detail) ທັງໝົດສຳລັບ ImporterMesh ນີ້.\n"
"[param normal_merge_angle] ແມ່ນຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນອົງສາ ແລະ ໃຊ້ໃນແບບດຽວກັນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່ານຳເຂົ້າໃນ "
"[code]lods[/code].\n"
"[param normal_split_angle] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ ແລະ ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບເວີຊັນເກົ່າຂອງ API "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ຈຳນວນ LOD ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method get_surface_lod_count], ແລະ ແຕ່ລະ "
"LOD ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນ [method get_surface_lod_size] ແລະ [method "
"get_surface_lod_indices].\n"
"[param bone_transform_array] ແມ່ນ [Array] ທີ່ສາມາດວ່າງ ຫຼື ບັນຈຸ [Transform3D] "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະໃຊ້ mesh skinning ໃນຂະນະທີ່ສ້າງ LOD ໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະ bone ID ຂອງເມຊ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ "
"ຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບແກ້ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງຂະໜາດລະຫວ່າງເມຊ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນ skinning ຂອງມັນ."

msgid "Returns the number of blend shapes that the mesh holds."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນ blend shapes ທີ່ເມຊມີຢູ່."

msgid "Returns the blend shape mode for this Mesh."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໂໝດ blend shape ສຳລັບເມຊນີ້."

msgid "Returns the size hint of this mesh for lightmap-unwrapping in UV-space."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄຳແນະນຳຂະໜາດຂອງເມຊນີ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດ lightmap-unwrapping ໃນ UV-space."

msgid ""
"Returns the mesh data represented by this [ImporterMesh] as a usable "
"[ArrayMesh].\n"
"This method caches the returned mesh, and subsequent calls will return the "
"cached data until [method clear] is called.\n"
"If not yet cached and [param base_mesh] is provided, [param base_mesh] will "
"be used and mutated."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນເມຊທີ່ແທນດ້ວຍ [ImporterMesh] ນີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນ [ArrayMesh] ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້.\n"
"ວິທີນີ້ຈະທຳການແຄຊ (cache) ເມຊທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ, ແລະ ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປຈະສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ແຄຊໄວ້ຈົນກວ່າ "
"[method clear] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້.\n"
"ຖ້າຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີການແຄຊ ແລະ ມີການໃຫ້ [param base_mesh] ມາ, [param base_mesh] ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ "
"ແລະ ປ່ຽນແປງຄ່າ."

msgid ""
"Returns the arrays for the vertices, normals, UVs, etc. that make up the "
"requested surface. See [method add_surface]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ array ສຳລັບ vertices, normals, UVs ແລະ ອື່ນໆ ທີ່ປະກອບເປັນຜິວ (surface) ທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method add_surface] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns a single set of blend shape arrays for the requested blend shape "
"index for a surface."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊຸດຂອງ blend shape arrays ສຳລັບອິນເດັກ (index) ຂອງ blend shape ທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍສຳລັບຜິວໜຶ່ງ."

msgid "Returns the number of surfaces that the mesh holds."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຜິວ (surfaces) ທີ່ເມຊມີຢູ່."

msgid "Returns the format of the surface that the mesh holds."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຮູບແບບ (format) ຂອງຜິວທີ່ເມຊມີຢູ່."

msgid "Returns the number of lods that the mesh holds on a given surface."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນ LOD ທີ່ເມຊມີຢູ່ໃນຜິວທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Returns the index buffer of a lod for a surface."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ index buffer ຂອງ LOD ສຳລັບຜິວໜຶ່ງ."

msgid "Returns the screen ratio which activates a lod for a surface."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອັດຕາສ່ວນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ LOD ສຳລັບຜິວໜຶ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Material] in a given surface. Surface is rendered using this "
"material."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Material] ໃນຜິວທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຜິວຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນໂດຍໃຊ້ວັດສະດຸນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the primitive type of the requested surface (see [method "
"add_surface])."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນປະເພດ primitive ຂອງຜິວທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍ (ເບິ່ງ [method add_surface] ປະກອບ)."

msgid ""
"Merges multiple [ImporterMesh]es into a single [ImporterMesh]. Each input "
"mesh is transformed by the corresponding [Transform3D] in the [param "
"relative_transforms] array, which must be the same size as [param "
"importer_meshes]. Negative scales are supported, and the winding order in the "
"mesh data will be corrected to account for this.\n"
"If [param deduplicate_surfaces] is [code]true[/code] and multiple meshes have "
"surfaces with the same names and formats, the surfaces will be merged "
"together when the meshes are merged, and will use the material from the first "
"matching surface. This is useful for reducing the number of surfaces in the "
"resulting mesh, and avoids duplicating materials. Surfaces with bone weights "
"will never be deduplicated. If [param deduplicate_surfaces] is [code]false[/"
"code], the surfaces will always be kept separate, and will be given unique "
"names.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Blend shapes and LODs are not supported and will be "
"discarded. Do not use this function to discard blend shapes and LODs, as "
"support for these may be added in the future."
msgstr ""
"ຮ່ວມ [ImporterMesh] ຫຼາຍອັນເຂົ້າເປັນ [ImporterMesh] ດຽວ. ເມຊແຕ່ລະອັນຈະຖືກປ່ຽນຮູບ "
"(transform) ໂດຍ [Transform3D] ທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ array [param relative_transforms], "
"ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງມີຂະໜາດດຽວກັນກັບ [param importer_meshes]. ຮອງຮັບການປັບຂະໜາດເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ແລະ "
"ລຳດັບການລຽງຕົວ (winding order) ໃນຂໍ້ມູນເມຊຈະຖືກປັບແກ້ໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param deduplicate_surfaces] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ມີຫຼາຍເມຊທີ່ມີຜິວຊື່ດຽວກັນ "
"ແລະ ຮູບແບບດຽວກັນ, ຜິວເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກຮ່ວມເຂົ້າກັນເມື່ອເມຊຖືກຮ່ວມ, ແລະ ຈະໃຊ້ວັດສະດຸຈາກຜິວທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນ. "
"ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຫຼຸດຈຳນວນຜິວໃນເມຊຜົນລັດ ແລະ ຫຼີກລ່ຽງການໃຊ້ວັດສະດຸຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ. ຜິວທີ່ມີຄ່ານ້ຳໜັກກະດູກ "
"(bone weights) ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຮ່ວມເຂົ້າກັນ. ຖ້າ [param deduplicate_surfaces] ເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code], ຜິວຈະຖືກແຍກຈາກກັນສະເໝີ ແລະ ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ Blend shapes ແລະ LODs ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກຖິ້ມໄປ. "
"ຢ່າໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການຖິ້ມ blend shapes ແລະ LODs, "
"ເພາະວ່າການຮອງຮັບອາດຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາໃນອະນາຄົດ."

msgid "Sets the blend shape mode."
msgstr "ກຳນົດໂໝດ blend shape."

msgid "Sets the size hint of this mesh for lightmap-unwrapping in UV-space."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄຳແນະນຳຂະໜາດຂອງເມຊນີ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດ lightmap-unwrapping ໃນ UV-space."

msgid ""
"Sets a [Material] for a given surface. Surface will be rendered using this "
"material."
msgstr "ກຳນົດ [Material] ສຳລັບຜິວທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຜິວຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນໂດຍໃຊ້ວັດສະດຸນີ້."

msgid "A singleton for handling inputs."
msgstr "ຊິງເກີນຕັນ (Singleton) ສຳລັບຈັດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (inputs)."

msgid ""
"The [Input] singleton handles key presses, mouse buttons and movement, "
"gamepads, and input actions. Actions and their events can be set in the "
"[b]Input Map[/b] tab in [b]Project > Project Settings[/b], or with the "
"[InputMap] class.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Input]'s methods reflect the global input state and are not "
"affected by [method Control.accept_event] or [method "
"Viewport.set_input_as_handled], as those methods only deal with the way input "
"is propagated in the [SceneTree]."
msgstr ""
"ຊິງເກີນຕັນ [Input] ຈັດການກັບການກົດປຸ່ມຄີບອດ, ປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ ແລະ ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ, ຈອຍແພັດ (gamepads), "
"ແລະ ການກະທຳການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (input actions). ການກະທຳ ແລະ "
"ເຫດການຂອງພວກມັນສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໃນແຖບ [b]Input Map[/b] ໃນ [b]Project > Project "
"Settings[/b], ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຄລາດ [InputMap].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີຕ່າງໆຂອງ [Input] ຈະສະທ້ອນເຖິງສະຖານະການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທົ່ວໂລກ ແລະ "
"ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ [method Control.accept_event] ຫຼື [method "
"Viewport.set_input_as_handled], ເພາະວິທີເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈັດການພຽງແຕ່ວິທີການສົ່ງຕໍ່ການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນໃນ "
"[SceneTree] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Inputs documentation index"
msgstr "ດັດຊະນີເອກະສານການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ"

msgid ""
"Clears the calibration information for the specified joypad's motion sensors, "
"if it has any and if they were calibrated.\n"
"See [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] for an example on how to "
"use joypad motion sensors and calibration in your games.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and iOS."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນການປັບທຽບ (calibration) ສຳລັບເຊັນເຊີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງຈອຍແພັດທີ່ລະບຸ, ຖ້າມັນມີ ແລະ "
"ຖ້າພວກມັນເຄີຍຖືກປັບທຽບມາກ່ອນ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] "
"ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງວິທີການໃຊ້ເຊັນເຊີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງຈອຍແພັດ ແລະ ການປັບທຽບໃນເກມຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟີເຈີນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Windows, Linux, macOS, ແລະ iOS."

msgid ""
"Returns the acceleration in m/s² of the device's accelerometer sensor, if the "
"device has one. Otherwise, the method returns [constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"Note this method returns an empty [Vector3] when running from the editor even "
"when your device has an accelerometer. You must export your project to a "
"supported device to read values from the accelerometer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works on Android and iOS. On other platforms, "
"it always returns [constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For Android, [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/"
"enable_accelerometer] must be enabled."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຄວາມເລັ່ງເປັນ m/s² ຈາກເຊັນເຊີວັດແທກຄວາມເລັ່ງ (accelerometer) ຂອງອຸປະກອນ, "
"ຖ້າອຸປະກອນນັ້ນມີ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ວິທີນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"ໝາຍເຫດ ວິທີນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [Vector3] ທີ່ວ່າງເປົ່າເມື່ອຣັນຈາກ editor "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານຈະມີເຊັນເຊີກໍຕາມ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງ export "
"ໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານໄປຍັງອຸປະກອນທີ່ຮອງຮັບເພື່ອອ່ານຄ່າຈາກເຊັນເຊີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Android ແລະ iOS. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[constant Vector3.ZERO] ສະເໝີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບ Android, ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [member "
"ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/enable_accelerometer]."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] containing the device IDs of all currently connected "
"joypads.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The order of connected joypads can not be guaranteed to be the "
"same after a project and/or the editor is restarted, because Godot doesn't "
"save the order of joypad connections. Joypads are registered in the order "
"they are discovered by Godot."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Array] ທີ່ບັນຈຸ device IDs ຂອງຈອຍແພັດທັງໝົດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລຳດັບຂອງຈອຍແພັດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບປະກັນໄດ້ວ່າຈະຄືເກົ່າຫຼັງຈາກຣີສະຕາດໂປຣເຈັກ ຫຼື "
"editor, ເພາະວ່າ Godot ບໍ່ໄດ້ບັນທຶກລຳດັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງຈອຍແພັດ. ຈອຍແພັດຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ "
"Godot ກວດພົບ."

msgid "Returns the currently assigned cursor shape."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຮູບຮ່າງຂອງເຄີເຊີ (cursor) ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the gravity in m/s² of the device's accelerometer sensor, if the "
"device has one. Otherwise, the method returns [constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works on Android and iOS. On other platforms, "
"it always returns [constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For Android, [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/"
"enable_gravity] must be enabled."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງເປັນ m/s² ຈາກເຊັນເຊີວັດແທກຄວາມເລັ່ງຂອງອຸປະກອນ, ຖ້າອຸປະກອນນັ້ນມີ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ວິທີນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Android ແລະ iOS. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[constant Vector3.ZERO] ສະເໝີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບ Android, ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [member "
"ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/enable_gravity]."

msgid ""
"Returns the rotation rate in rad/s around a device's X, Y, and Z axes of the "
"gyroscope sensor, if the device has one. Otherwise, the method returns "
"[constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works on Android and iOS. On other platforms, "
"it always returns [constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For Android, [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/"
"enable_gyroscope] must be enabled."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອັດຕາການໝູນເປັນ rad/s ອ້ອມແກນ X, Y, ແລະ Z ຂອງອຸປະກອນຈາກເຊັນເຊີໄຈໂຣສະໂຄບ "
"(gyroscope), ຖ້າອຸປະກອນນັ້ນມີ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ວິທີນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Android ແລະ iOS. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[constant Vector3.ZERO] ສະເໝີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບ Android, ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [member "
"ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/enable_gyroscope]."

msgid "Returns the current value of the joypad axis at index [param axis]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນຂອງແກນຈອຍແພັດທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param axis]."

msgid ""
"Returns the rotation rate in rad/s around a joypad's X, Y, and Z axes of the "
"gyroscope sensor, if the joypad has one and it's currently enabled. "
"Otherwise, the method returns [constant Vector3.ZERO]. See also [method "
"set_joy_motion_sensors_enabled].\n"
"The rotation is positive in the counter-clockwise direction.\n"
"For a joypad held in front of you, the returned axes are defined as follows:\n"
"X: Angular speed around the X axis (pitch);\n"
"Y: Angular speed around the Y axis (yaw);\n"
"Z: Angular speed around the Z axis (roll).\n"
"See [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] for an example on how to "
"use joypad gyroscope and gyroscope calibration in your games.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and iOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອັດຕາການໝູນເປັນ rad/s ອ້ອມແກນ X, Y, ແລະ Z ຂອງຈອຍແພັດຈາກເຊັນເຊີໄຈໂຣສະໂຄບ, "
"ຖ້າຈອຍແພັດນັ້ນມີ ແລະ ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ວິທີນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [constant "
"Vector3.ZERO]. ເບິ່ງ [method set_joy_motion_sensors_enabled] ປະກອບ.\n"
"ການໝູນຈະມີຄ່າເປັນບວກໃນທິດທາງທວນເຂັມໂມງ.\n"
"ສຳລັບຈອຍແພັດທີ່ຖືຢູ່ທາງໜ້າທ່ານ, ແກນທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາຈະຖືກກຳນົດດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"X: ຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມອ້ອມແກນ X (pitch);\n"
"Y: ຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມອ້ອມແກນ Y (yaw);\n"
"Z: ຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມອ້ອມແກນ Z (roll).\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] "
"ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງວິທີການໃຊ້ໄຈໂຣສະໂຄບຂອງຈອຍແພັດ ແລະ ການປັບທຽບໄຈໂຣສະໂຄບໃນເກມຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟີເຈີນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Windows, Linux, macOS, ແລະ iOS."

msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary with extra platform-specific information about the "
"device, e.g. the raw gamepad name from the OS or the Steam Input index.\n"
"On Windows, Linux, macOS, and iOS, the dictionary contains the following "
"fields:\n"
"[code]raw_name[/code]: The name of the controller as it came from the OS, "
"before getting renamed by the controller database.\n"
"[code]vendor_id[/code]: The USB vendor ID of the device.\n"
"[code]product_id[/code]: The USB product ID of the device.\n"
"[code]serial_number[/code]: The serial number of the device. This key won't "
"be present if the serial number is unavailable.\n"
"The dictionary can also include the following fields under selected "
"platforms:\n"
"[code]steam_input_index[/code]: The Steam Input gamepad index (Windows, "
"Linux, and macOS only). If the device is not a Steam Input device this key "
"won't be present.\n"
"[code]xinput_index[/code]: The index of the controller in the XInput system "
"(Windows only). This key won't be present for devices not handled by XInput.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned dictionary is always empty on Android and Web."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ dictionary ພ້ອມຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມສະເພາະແພລັດຟອມກ່ຽວກັບອຸປະກອນ, ເຊັ່ນ ຊື່ gamepad ດິບຈາກ OS "
"ຫຼື Steam Input index.\n"
"ໃນ Windows, Linux, macOS, ແລະ iOS, dictionary ຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍຟິວ (fields) ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[code]raw_name[/code]: ຊື່ຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກ OS, ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນຊື່ໂດຍຖານຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຄວບຄຸມ.\n"
"[code]vendor_id[/code]: USB vendor ID ຂອງອຸປະກອນ.\n"
"[code]product_id[/code]: USB product ID ຂອງອຸປະກອນ.\n"
"[code]serial_number[/code]: ເລກຊີຣຽວ (serial number) ຂອງອຸປະກອນ. ຄີ (key) "
"ນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຖ້າບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງເລກຊີຣຽວໄດ້.\n"
"Dictionary ຍັງອາດຈະລວມເອົາຟິວດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນບາງແພລັດຟອມ:\n"
"[code]steam_input_index[/code]: Steam Input gamepad index (ສະເພາະ Windows, "
"Linux, ແລະ macOS). ຖ້າອຸປະກອນບໍ່ແມ່ນອຸປະກອນ Steam Input, ຄີນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີ.\n"
"[code]xinput_index[/code]: ອິນເດັກຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມໃນລະບົບ XInput (ສະເພາະ Windows). "
"ຄີນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີສຳລັບອຸປະກອນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍ XInput.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] dictionary ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາຈະວ່າງເປົ່າສະເໝີໃນ Android ແລະ Web."

msgid ""
"Returns the calibration information about the specified joypad's motion "
"sensors in the form of a [Dictionary], if it has any and if they have been "
"calibrated, otherwise returns an empty [Dictionary].\n"
"The dictionary contains the following fields:\n"
"[code]gyroscope_offset[/code]: average offset in gyroscope values from "
"[constant Vector2.ZERO] in rad/s.\n"
"See [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] for an example on how to "
"use joypad motion sensors and calibration in your games.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and iOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນການປັບທຽບກ່ຽວກັບເຊັນເຊີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງຈອຍແພັດທີ່ລະບຸໃນຮູບແບບ [Dictionary], ຖ້າມັນມີ "
"ແລະ ຖ້າພວກມັນຖືກປັບທຽບແລ້ວ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [Dictionary] ທີ່ວ່າງເປົ່າ.\n"
"Dictionary ຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍຟິວດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[code]gyroscope_offset[/code]: ຄ່າອັອບເຊັດ (offset) ສະເລ່ຍຂອງຄ່າໄຈໂຣສະໂຄບຈາກ "
"[constant Vector2.ZERO] ເປັນ rad/s.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] "
"ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງວິທີການໃຊ້ເຊັນເຊີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງຈອຍແພັດ ແລະ ການປັບທຽບໃນເກມຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟີເຈີນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Windows, Linux, macOS, ແລະ iOS."

msgid ""
"Returns the joypad's motion sensor rate in Hz, if the joypad has motion "
"sensors and they're currently enabled. See also [method "
"set_joy_motion_sensors_enabled].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and iOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອັດຕາການເຮັດວຽກຂອງເຊັນເຊີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງຈອຍແພັດເປັນ Hz, ຖ້າຈອຍແພັດມີເຊັນເຊີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ "
"ແລະ ພວກມັນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ເບິ່ງ [method set_joy_motion_sensors_enabled] "
"ປະກອບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟີເຈີນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Windows, Linux, macOS, ແລະ iOS."

msgid ""
"Returns the duration of the current vibration effect in seconds.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method returns the same value that was passed to [method "
"start_joy_vibration], and this value does [b]not[/b] change when the joypad's "
"vibration runs out, it only gets reset after a call to [method "
"stop_joy_vibration].\n"
"If you want to check if a joypad is still vibrating, use [method "
"is_joy_vibrating] instead."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໄລຍະເວລາຂອງຜົນກະທົບການສັ່ນປັດຈຸບັນເປັນວິນາທີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າດຽວກັບທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງໄປໃຫ້ [method start_joy_vibration], ແລະ "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະ [b]ບໍ່[/b] ປ່ຽນແປງເມື່ອການສັ່ນຂອງຈອຍແພັດສິ້ນສຸດລົງ, ມັນຈະຖືກຣີເຊັດຫຼັງຈາກການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"stop_joy_vibration] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການກວດສອບວ່າຈອຍແພັດຍັງສັ່ນຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method is_joy_vibrating] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the remaining duration of the current vibration effect in seconds."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງຜົນກະທົບການສັ່ນປັດຈຸບັນເປັນວິນາທີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the strength of the joypad vibration: x is the strength of the weak "
"motor, and y is the strength of the strong motor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method returns the same values that were passed to [method "
"start_joy_vibration], and these values do [b]not[/b] change when the joypad's "
"vibration runs out, they only get reset after a call to [method "
"stop_joy_vibration].\n"
"If you want to check if a joypad is still vibrating, use [method "
"is_joy_vibrating] instead."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມແຮງຂອງການສັ່ນຈອຍແພັດ: x ແມ່ນຄວາມແຮງຂອງມໍເຕີຕົວອ່ອນ, ແລະ y "
"ແມ່ນຄວາມແຮງຂອງມໍເຕີຕົວແຮງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າດຽວກັບທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງໄປໃຫ້ [method start_joy_vibration], ແລະ "
"ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະ [b]ບໍ່[/b] ປ່ຽນແປງເມື່ອການສັ່ນຂອງຈອຍແພັດສິ້ນສຸດລົງ, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກຣີເຊັດຫຼັງຈາກການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method stop_joy_vibration] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການກວດສອບວ່າຈອຍແພັດຍັງສັ່ນຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method is_joy_vibrating] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the last mouse velocity in screen coordinates. To provide a precise "
"and jitter-free velocity, mouse velocity is only calculated every 0.1s. "
"Therefore, mouse velocity will lag mouse movements."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມໄວຂອງເມົາສ໌ຫຼ້າສຸດໃນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄວາມໄວທີ່ຊັດເຈນ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີການກະຕຸກ (jitter-"
"free), ຄວາມໄວເມົາສ໌ຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ທຸກໆ 0.1 ວິນາທີ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຄວາມໄວເມົາສ໌ຈະມີຄວາມຊັກຊ້າ (lag) "
"ກວ່າການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງເມົາສ໌ແທ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the last mouse velocity. To provide a precise and jitter-free "
"velocity, mouse velocity is only calculated every 0.1s. Therefore, mouse "
"velocity will lag mouse movements."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມໄວຂອງເມົາສ໌ຫຼ້າສຸດ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄວາມໄວທີ່ຊັດເຈນ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີການກະຕຸກ (jitter-free), "
"ຄວາມໄວເມົາສ໌ຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ທຸກໆ 0.1 ວິນາທີ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຄວາມໄວເມົາສ໌ຈະມີຄວາມຊັກຊ້າ (lag) "
"ກວ່າການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງເມົາສ໌ແທ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the magnetic field strength in micro-Tesla for all axes of the "
"device's magnetometer sensor, if the device has one. Otherwise, the method "
"returns [constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works on Android and iOS. On other platforms, "
"it always returns [constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For Android, [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/"
"enable_magnetometer] must be enabled."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມແຮງຂອງສະໜາມແມ່ເຫຼັກເປັນ micro-Tesla ສຳລັບທຸກແກນຈາກເຊັນເຊີວັດແທກສະໜາມແມ່ເຫຼັກ "
"(magnetometer) ຂອງອຸປະກອນ, ຖ້າອຸປະກອນນັ້ນມີ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ວິທີນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [constant "
"Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Android ແລະ iOS. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[constant Vector3.ZERO] ສະເໝີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບ Android, ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [member "
"ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/enable_magnetometer]."

msgid ""
"Returns mouse buttons as a bitmask. If multiple mouse buttons are pressed at "
"the same time, the bits are added together. Equivalent to [method "
"DisplayServer.mouse_get_button_state]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສະຖານະປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ເປັນ bitmask. ຖ້າມີຫຼາຍປຸ່ມຖືກກົດພ້ອມກັນ, ຄ່າບິດຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກບວກເຂົ້າກັນ. "
"ເທົ່າກັບການໃຊ້ [method DisplayServer.mouse_get_button_state]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the joypad has an LED light that can change "
"colors and/or brightness. See also [method set_joy_light].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and iOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຈອຍແພັດມີໄຟ LED ທີ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນສີ ຫຼື ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_joy_light] ປະກອບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟີເຈີນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Windows, Linux, macOS, ແລະ iOS."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the joypad supports vibration. See also [method "
"start_joy_vibration].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For macOS, vibration is only supported in macOS 11 and later. "
"When connected via USB, vibration is only supported for major brand "
"controllers (except Xbox One and Xbox Series X/S controllers) due to macOS "
"limitations."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຈອຍແພັດຮອງຮັບການສັ່ນ. ເບິ່ງ [method start_joy_vibration] "
"ປະກອບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບ macOS, ການສັ່ນຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ macOS 11 ຂຶ້ນໄປ. ເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ USB, "
"ການສັ່ນຈະຮອງຮັບສະເພາະກັບຕົວຄວບຄຸມຍີ່ຫໍ້ຫຼັກ (ຍົກເວັ້ນຕົວຄວບຄຸມ Xbox One ແລະ Xbox Series X/S) "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງ macOS."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] when the user has [i]started[/i] pressing the "
"action event in the current frame or physics tick. It will only return "
"[code]true[/code] on the frame or tick that the user pressed down the "
"button.\n"
"This is useful for code that needs to run only once when an action is "
"pressed, instead of every frame while it's pressed.\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Returning [code]true[/code] does not imply that the action is "
"[i]still[/i] pressed. An action can be pressed and released again rapidly, "
"and [code]true[/code] will still be returned so as not to miss input.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to keyboard ghosting, [method is_action_just_pressed] may "
"return [code]false[/code] even if one of the action's keys is pressed. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/input_examples.html#keyboard-events]Input "
"examples[/url] in the documentation for more information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] During input handling (e.g. [method Node._input]), use [method "
"InputEvent.is_action_pressed] instead to query the action state of the "
"current event. See also [method is_action_just_pressed_by_event]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ [i]ເລີ່ມ[/i] ກົດເຫດການການກະທຳ (action event) "
"ໃນເຟຣມ ຫຼື ຟີຊິກທິກ (physics tick) ປັດຈຸບັນ. ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ສະເພາະໃນເຟຣມ "
"ຫຼື ທິກທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກົດປຸ່ມລົງເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບ code ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວເມື່ອການກະທຳຖືກກົດ, "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກທຸກເຟຣມໃນຂະນະທີ່ຖືກກົດຄ້າງໄວ້.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param exact_match] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈຕົວປ່ຽນການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບ [InputEventKey] ແລະ "
"[InputEventMouseButton], ແລະ ທິດທາງສຳລັບ [InputEventJoypadMotion].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການກະທຳນັ້ນ [i]ຍັງຄົງ[/i] "
"ຖືກກົດຢູ່. ການກະທຳສາມາດຖືກກົດ ແລະ ປ່ອຍຢ່າງໄວວາ, ແລະ ມັນຈະຍັງຄົງສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] "
"ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ພາດການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກອາການຄີບອດຄ້າງ (keyboard ghosting), [method "
"is_action_just_pressed] ອາດຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code] "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໜຶ່ງໃນປຸ່ມຂອງການກະທຳນັ້ນຈະຖືກກົດຢູ່ກໍຕາມ. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/"
"input_examples.html#keyboard-events]ຕົວຢ່າງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ[/url] "
"ໃນເອກະສານສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຈັດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (ເຊັ່ນ [method Node._input]), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[method InputEvent.is_action_pressed] "
"ແທນເພື່ອສອບຖາມສະຖານະການກະທຳຂອງເຫດການປັດຈຸບັນ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"is_action_just_pressed_by_event] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] when the user has [i]started[/i] pressing the "
"action event in the current frame or physics tick, and the first event that "
"triggered action press in the current frame/physics tick was [param event]. "
"It will only return [code]true[/code] on the frame or tick that the user "
"pressed down the button.\n"
"This is useful for code that needs to run only once when an action is "
"pressed, and the action is processed during input handling (e.g. [method "
"Node._input]).\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Returning [code]true[/code] does not imply that the action is "
"[i]still[/i] pressed. An action can be pressed and released again rapidly, "
"and [code]true[/code] will still be returned so as not to miss input.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to keyboard ghosting, [method is_action_just_pressed] may "
"return [code]false[/code] even if one of the action's keys is pressed. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/input_examples.html#keyboard-events]Input "
"examples[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ [i]ເລີ່ມ[/i] ກົດເຫດການການກະທຳໃນເຟຣມ ຫຼື ຟີຊິກທິກປັດຈຸບັນ, "
"ແລະ ເຫດການທຳອິດທີ່ກະຕຸ້ນການກົດການກະທຳໃນເຟຣມ/ຟີຊິກທິກປັດຈຸບັນແມ່ນ [param event]. ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]true[/code] ສະເພາະໃນເຟຣມ ຫຼື ທິກທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກົດປຸ່ມລົງເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບ code ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວເມື່ອການກະທຳຖືກກົດ, ແລະ "
"ການກະທຳນັ້ນຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຈັດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (ເຊັ່ນ [method Node._input]).\n"
"ຖ້າ [param exact_match] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈຕົວປ່ຽນການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບ [InputEventKey] ແລະ "
"[InputEventMouseButton], ແລະ ທິດທາງສຳລັບ [InputEventJoypadMotion].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການກະທຳນັ້ນ [i]ຍັງຄົງ[/i] "
"ຖືກກົດຢູ່. ການກະທຳສາມາດຖືກກົດ ແລະ ປ່ອຍຢ່າງໄວວາ, ແລະ ມັນຈະຍັງຄົງສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] "
"ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ພາດການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກອາການຄີບອດຄ້າງ (keyboard ghosting), [method "
"is_action_just_pressed] ອາດຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code] "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໜຶ່ງໃນປຸ່ມຂອງການກະທຳນັ້ນຈະຖືກກົດຢູ່ກໍຕາມ. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/"
"input_examples.html#keyboard-events]ຕົວຢ່າງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ[/url] "
"ໃນເອກະສານສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] when the user [i]stops[/i] pressing the action "
"event in the current frame or physics tick. It will only return [code]true[/"
"code] on the frame or tick that the user releases the button.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Returning [code]true[/code] does not imply that the action is "
"[i]still[/i] not pressed. An action can be released and pressed again "
"rapidly, and [code]true[/code] will still be returned so as not to miss "
"input.\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] During input handling (e.g. [method Node._input]), use [method "
"InputEvent.is_action_released] instead to query the action state of the "
"current event. See also [method is_action_just_released_by_event]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ [i]ຢຸດ[/i] ການກົດເຫດການການກະທຳໃນເຟຣມ ຫຼື "
"ຟີຊິກທິກປັດຈຸບັນ. ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ສະເພາະໃນເຟຣມ ຫຼື ທິກທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ່ອຍປຸ່ມເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການກະທຳນັ້ນ [i]ຍັງຄົງ[/i] "
"ບໍ່ຖືກກົດ. ການກະທຳສາມາດຖືກປ່ອຍ ແລະ ກົດຄືນໃໝ່ຢ່າງໄວວາ, ແລະ ມັນຈະຍັງຄົງສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/"
"code] ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ພາດການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param exact_match] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈຕົວປ່ຽນການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບ [InputEventKey] ແລະ "
"[InputEventMouseButton], ແລະ ທິດທາງສຳລັບ [InputEventJoypadMotion].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຈັດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (ເຊັ່ນ [method Node._input]), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[method InputEvent.is_action_released] "
"ແທນເພື່ອສອບຖາມສະຖານະການກະທຳຂອງເຫດການປັດຈຸບັນ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"is_action_just_released_by_event] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] when the user [i]stops[/i] pressing the action "
"event in the current frame or physics tick, and the first event that "
"triggered action release in the current frame/physics tick was [param event]. "
"It will only return [code]true[/code] on the frame or tick that the user "
"releases the button.\n"
"This is useful when an action is processed during input handling (e.g. "
"[method Node._input]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Returning [code]true[/code] does not imply that the action is "
"[i]still[/i] not pressed. An action can be released and pressed again "
"rapidly, and [code]true[/code] will still be returned so as not to miss "
"input.\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ [i]ຢຸດ[/i] ການກົດເຫດການການກະທຳໃນເຟຣມ ຫຼື "
"ຟີຊິກທິກປັດຈຸບັນ, ແລະ ເຫດການທຳອິດທີ່ກະຕຸ້ນການປ່ອຍການກະທຳໃນເຟຣມ/ຟີຊິກທິກປັດຈຸບັນແມ່ນ [param "
"event]. ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ສະເພາະໃນເຟຣມ ຫຼື ທິກທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ່ອຍປຸ່ມເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອການກະທຳຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຈັດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (ເຊັ່ນ [method "
"Node._input]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການກະທຳນັ້ນ [i]ຍັງຄົງ[/i] "
"ບໍ່ຖືກກົດ. ການກະທຳສາມາດຖືກປ່ອຍ ແລະ ກົດຄືນໃໝ່ຢ່າງໄວວາ, ແລະ ມັນຈະຍັງຄົງສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/"
"code] ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ພາດການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param exact_match] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈຕົວປ່ຽນການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບ [InputEventKey] ແລະ "
"[InputEventMouseButton], ແລະ ທິດທາງສຳລັບ [InputEventJoypadMotion]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if you are pressing the action event.\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to keyboard ghosting, [method is_action_pressed] may return "
"[code]false[/code] even if one of the action's keys is pressed. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/input_examples.html#keyboard-events]Input "
"examples[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງກົດເຫດການການກະທຳນັ້ນ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param exact_match] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈຕົວປ່ຽນການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບ [InputEventKey] ແລະ "
"[InputEventMouseButton], ແລະ ທິດທາງສຳລັບ [InputEventJoypadMotion].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກອາການຄີບອດຄ້າງ (keyboard ghosting), [method "
"is_action_pressed] ອາດຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code] "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໜຶ່ງໃນປຸ່ມຂອງການກະທຳນັ້ນຈະຖືກກົດຢູ່ກໍຕາມ. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/"
"input_examples.html#keyboard-events]ຕົວຢ່າງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ[/url] "
"ໃນເອກະສານສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if any action, key, joypad button, or mouse button "
"is being pressed. This will also return [code]true[/code] if any action is "
"simulated via code by calling [method action_press]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີການກະທຳ, ປຸ່ມຄີບອດ, ປຸ່ມຈອຍແພັດ, ຫຼື ປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ ໃດໜຶ່ງກຳລັງຖືກກົດຢູ່. "
"ນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີການຈຳລອງການກະທຳຜ່ານ code ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"action_press] ດ້ວຍ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if you are pressing the joypad button at index "
"[param button].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to check if a joypad button was just pressed, use "
"Godot's input action system with [method is_action_just_pressed] or use the "
"[method Node._input] method like this instead:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventJoypadButton and event.is_pressed() and "
"event.button_index == JOY_BUTTON_A:\n"
"\t\tpass # Your code here.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventJoypadButton eventButton && eventButton.Pressed && "
"eventButton.ButtonIndex == JoyButton.A)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Your code here.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງກົດປຸ່ມຈອຍແພັດທີ່ອິນເດັກ [param button].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການກວດສອບວ່າປຸ່ມຈອຍແພັດຫາກໍຖືກກົດຫຼືບໍ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບ input action "
"ຂອງ Godot ດ້ວຍ [method is_action_just_pressed] ຫຼື ໃຊ້ວິທີ [method Node._input] "
"ແບບນີ້ແທນ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventJoypadButton and event.is_pressed() and "
"event.button_index == JOY_BUTTON_A:\n"
"\t\tpass # ໃສ່ code ຂອງທ່ານບ່ອນນີ້.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventJoypadButton eventButton && eventButton.Pressed && "
"eventButton.ButtonIndex == JoyButton.A)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// ໃສ່ code ຂອງທ່ານບ່ອນນີ້.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the system knows the specified device. This "
"means that it sets all button and axis indices. Unknown joypads are not "
"expected to match these constants, but you can still retrieve events from "
"them."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລະບົບຮູ້ຈັກອຸປະກອນທີ່ລະບຸ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນໄດ້ກຳນົດອິນເດັກຂອງປຸ່ມ ແລະ "
"ແກນທັງໝົດໄວ້ແລ້ວ. ຈອຍແພັດທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກອາດຈະບໍ່ກົງກັບຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ແຕ່ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຮັບເຫດການ (events) "
"ຈາກພວກມັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the joypad's motion sensors have been "
"calibrated.\n"
"See [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] for an example on how to "
"use joypad motion sensors and calibration in your games.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and iOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເຊັນເຊີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງຈອຍແພັດຖືກປັບທຽບແລ້ວ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] "
"ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງວິທີການໃຊ້ເຊັນເຊີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງຈອຍແພັດ ແລະ ການປັບທຽບໃນເກມຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟີເຈີນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Windows, Linux, macOS, ແລະ iOS."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the joypad is still vibrating after a call to "
"[method start_joy_vibration].\n"
"Unlike [method get_joy_vibration_strength] and [method "
"get_joy_vibration_duration], this method returns [code]false[/code] after the "
"joypad's vibration runs out."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຈອຍແພັດຍັງຄົງສັ່ນຢູ່ຫຼັງຈາກການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"start_joy_vibration].\n"
"ຕ່າງຈາກ [method get_joy_vibration_strength] ແລະ [method "
"get_joy_vibration_duration], ວິທີນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code] "
"ຫຼັງຈາກການສັ່ນຂອງຈອຍແພັດສິ້ນສຸດລົງ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if you are pressing the key with the [param "
"keycode] printed on it. You can pass a [enum Key] constant or any Unicode "
"character code.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to check if a key was just pressed by using its "
"label, use Godot's input action system with [method is_action_just_pressed] "
"or use the [method Node._input] method like this instead:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventKey and not event.is_echo() and event.is_pressed() "
"and event.key_label == KEY_SPACE:\n"
"\t\tpass # Your code here.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventKey eventKey && !eventKey.IsEcho() && "
"eventKey.Pressed && eventKey.KeyLabel == Key.Space)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Your code here.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງກົດປຸ່ມທີ່ມີ [param keycode] ນັ້ນພິມຢູ່ເທິງປຸ່ມ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum Key] ຫຼື ລະຫັດຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ໃດໜຶ່ງກໍໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການກວດສອບວ່າປຸ່ມຄີບອດຫາກໍຖືກກົດຫຼືບໍ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ປ້າຍຊື່ຂອງມັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບ "
"input action ຂອງ Godot ດ້ວຍ [method is_action_just_pressed] ຫຼື ໃຊ້ວິທີ [method "
"Node._input] ແບບນີ້ແທນ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventKey and not event.is_echo() and event.is_pressed() "
"and event.key_label == KEY_SPACE:\n"
"\t\tpass # ໃສ່ code ຂອງທ່ານບ່ອນນີ້.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventKey eventKey && !eventKey.IsEcho() && "
"eventKey.Pressed && eventKey.KeyLabel == Key.Space)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// ໃສ່ code ຂອງທ່ານບ່ອນນີ້.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if you are pressing the Latin key in the current "
"keyboard layout. You can pass a [enum Key] constant.\n"
"[method is_key_pressed] is only recommended over [method "
"is_physical_key_pressed] in non-game applications. This ensures that shortcut "
"keys behave as expected depending on the user's keyboard layout, as keyboard "
"shortcuts are generally dependent on the keyboard layout in non-game "
"applications. If in doubt, use [method is_physical_key_pressed].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to keyboard ghosting, [method is_key_pressed] may return "
"[code]false[/code] even if one of the action's keys is pressed. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/input_examples.html#keyboard-events]Input "
"examples[/url] in the documentation for more information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to check if a key was just pressed by using its "
"keycode, use Godot's input action system with [method is_action_just_pressed] "
"or use the [method Node._input] method like this instead:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventKey and not event.is_echo() and event.is_pressed() "
"and event.keycode == KEY_SPACE:\n"
"\t\tpass # Your code here.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventKey eventKey && !eventKey.IsEcho() && "
"eventKey.Pressed && eventKey.Keycode == Key.Space)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Your code here.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງກົດປຸ່ມພາສາລາຕິນໃນຜັງຄີບອດປັດຈຸບັນ. ທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ "
"[enum Key] ໄດ້.\n"
"[method is_key_pressed] ຖືກແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແທນ [method is_physical_key_pressed] "
"ສະເພາະໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນເກມເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າປຸ່ມລັດ (shortcuts) "
"ເຮັດວຽກຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ໂດຍອີງຕາມຜັງຄີບອດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ໝັ້ນໃຈ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"is_physical_key_pressed].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກອາການຄີບອດຄ້າງ (keyboard ghosting), [method "
"is_key_pressed] ອາດຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code] "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໜຶ່ງໃນປຸ່ມຂອງການກະທຳນັ້ນຈະຖືກກົດຢູ່ກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການກວດສອບວ່າປຸ່ມຄີບອດຫາກໍຖືກກົດຫຼືບໍ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ keycode ຂອງມັນ, "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບ input action ຂອງ Godot ດ້ວຍ [method is_action_just_pressed] ຫຼື ໃຊ້ວິທີ "
"[method Node._input] ແບບນີ້ແທນ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventKey and not event.is_echo() and event.is_pressed() "
"and event.keycode == KEY_SPACE:\n"
"\t\tpass # ໃສ່ code ຂອງທ່ານບ່ອນນີ້.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventKey eventKey && !eventKey.IsEcho() && "
"eventKey.Pressed && eventKey.Keycode == Key.Space)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// ໃສ່ code ຂອງທ່ານບ່ອນນີ້.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if you are pressing the mouse button specified with "
"[enum MouseButton].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to check if a mouse button was just pressed, use "
"Godot's input action system with [method is_action_just_pressed] or use the "
"[method Node._input] method like this instead:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseButton and event.is_pressed() and "
"event.button_index == MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT:\n"
"\t\tpass # Your code here.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseButton eventMouseButton && "
"eventMouseButton.Pressed && eventMouseButton.ButtonIndex == "
"MouseButton.Left)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Your code here.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງກົດປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ທີ່ລະບຸດ້ວຍ [enum MouseButton].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການກວດສອບວ່າປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ຫາກໍຖືກກົດຫຼືບໍ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບ input action ຂອງ "
"Godot ດ້ວຍ [method is_action_just_pressed] ຫຼື ໃຊ້ວິທີ [method Node._input] "
"ແບບນີ້ແທນ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseButton and event.is_pressed() and "
"event.button_index == MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT:\n"
"\t\tpass # ໃສ່ code ຂອງທ່ານບ່ອນນີ້.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseButton eventMouseButton && "
"eventMouseButton.Pressed && eventMouseButton.ButtonIndex == "
"MouseButton.Left)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// ໃສ່ code ຂອງທ່ານບ່ອນນີ້.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if you are pressing the key in the physical "
"location on the 101/102-key US QWERTY keyboard. You can pass a [enum Key] "
"constant.\n"
"[method is_physical_key_pressed] is recommended over [method is_key_pressed] "
"for in-game actions, as it will make [kbd]W[/kbd]/[kbd]A[/kbd]/[kbd]S[/kbd]/"
"[kbd]D[/kbd] layouts work regardless of the user's keyboard layout. [method "
"is_physical_key_pressed] will also ensure that the top row number keys work "
"on any keyboard layout. If in doubt, use [method is_physical_key_pressed].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to keyboard ghosting, [method is_physical_key_pressed] may "
"return [code]false[/code] even if one of the action's keys is pressed. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/input_examples.html#keyboard-events]Input "
"examples[/url] in the documentation for more information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to check if a key was just pressed by using its "
"physical keycode, use Godot's input action system with [method "
"is_action_just_pressed] or use the [method Node._input] method like this "
"instead:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventKey and not event.is_echo() and event.is_pressed() "
"and event.physical_keycode == KEY_SPACE:\n"
"\t\tpass # Your code here.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventKey eventKey && !eventKey.IsEcho() && "
"eventKey.Pressed && eventKey.PhysicalKeycode == Key.Space)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Your code here.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງກົດປຸ່ມໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທາງກາຍະພາບຂອງຄີບອດ 101/102-key US "
"QWERTY. ທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum Key] ໄດ້.\n"
"[method is_physical_key_pressed] ຖືກແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແທນ [method is_key_pressed] "
"ສຳລັບການກະທຳພາຍໃນເກມ, ເພາະມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຜັງປຸ່ມ [kbd]W[/kbd]/[kbd]A[/kbd]/[kbd]S[/kbd]/"
"[kbd]D[/kbd] ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຜັງຄີບອດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. "
"ມັນຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ປຸ່ມຕົວເລກແຖວເທິງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໃນທຸກຜັງຄີບອດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກອາການຄີບອດຄ້າງ (keyboard ghosting), [method "
"is_physical_key_pressed] ອາດຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code] "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໜຶ່ງໃນປຸ່ມຂອງການກະທຳນັ້ນຈະຖືກກົດຢູ່ກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການກວດສອບວ່າປຸ່ມຄີບອດຫາກໍຖືກກົດຫຼືບໍ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ physical keycode "
"ຂອງມັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບ input action ຂອງ Godot ດ້ວຍ [method is_action_just_pressed] ຫຼື "
"ໃຊ້ວິທີ [method Node._input] ແບບນີ້ແທນ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventKey and not event.is_echo() and event.is_pressed() "
"and event.physical_keycode == KEY_SPACE:\n"
"\t\tpass # ໃສ່ code ຂອງທ່ານບ່ອນນີ້.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventKey eventKey && !eventKey.IsEcho() && "
"eventKey.Pressed && eventKey.PhysicalKeycode == Key.Space)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// ໃສ່ code ຂອງທ່ານບ່ອນນີ້.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Feeds an [InputEvent] to the game. Can be used to artificially trigger input "
"events from code. Also generates [method Node._input] calls.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var cancel_event = InputEventAction.new()\n"
"cancel_event.action = \"ui_cancel\"\n"
"cancel_event.pressed = true\n"
"Input.parse_input_event(cancel_event)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var cancelEvent = new InputEventAction();\n"
"cancelEvent.Action = \"ui_cancel\";\n"
"cancelEvent.Pressed = true;\n"
"Input.ParseInputEvent(cancelEvent);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Calling this function has no influence on the operating system. "
"So for example sending an [InputEventMouseMotion] will not move the OS mouse "
"cursor to the specified position (use [method warp_mouse] instead) and "
"sending [kbd]Alt/Cmd + Tab[/kbd] as [InputEventKey] won't toggle between "
"active windows."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງ [InputEvent] ເຂົ້າໄປໃນເກມ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຳລອງເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ code. ແລະ "
"ຍັງເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method Node._input] ອີກດ້ວຍ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var cancel_event = InputEventAction.new()\n"
"cancel_event.action = \"ui_cancel\"\n"
"cancel_event.pressed = true\n"
"Input.parse_input_event(cancel_event)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var cancelEvent = new InputEventAction();\n"
"cancelEvent.Action = \"ui_cancel\";\n"
"cancelEvent.Pressed = true;\n"
"Input.ParseInputEvent(cancelEvent);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການສົ່ງ "
"[InputEventMouseMotion] ຈະບໍ່ຍ້າຍເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ຂອງ OS ໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ລະບຸ (ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"warp_mouse] ແທນ) ແລະ ການສົ່ງ [kbd]Alt/Cmd + Tab[/kbd] ເປັນ [InputEventKey] "
"ຈະບໍ່ສະລັບໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Removes all mappings from the internal database that match the given GUID. "
"All currently connected joypads that use this GUID will become unmapped.\n"
"On Android, Godot will map to an internal fallback mapping."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບແຜນຜັງທັງໝົດຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນທີ່ກົງກັບ GUID ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. ຈອຍແພັດທັງໝົດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ໃຊ້ GUID "
"ນີ້ຈະກາຍເປັນແບບບໍ່ມີແຜນຜັງ.\n"
"ໃນ Android, Godot ຈະກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນແຜນຜັງສຳຮອງພາຍໃນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the acceleration value of the accelerometer sensor. Can be used for "
"debugging on devices without a hardware sensor, for example in an editor on a "
"PC.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value can be immediately overwritten by the hardware sensor "
"value on Android and iOS."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າຄວາມເລັ່ງຂອງເຊັນເຊີວັດແທກຄວາມເລັ່ງ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອການດີບັກ (debugging) "
"ໃນອຸປະກອນທີ່ບໍ່ມີເຊັນເຊີຮາດແວ, ເຊັ່ນ ໃນ editor ເທິງ PC.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ອາດຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ທັນທີໂດຍຄ່າຈາກເຊັນເຊີຮາດແວໃນ Android ແລະ iOS."

msgid ""
"Sets a custom mouse cursor image, which is only visible inside the game "
"window, for the given mouse [param shape]. The hotspot can also be specified. "
"Passing [code]null[/code] to the image parameter resets to the system "
"cursor.\n"
"[param image] can be either [Texture2D] or [Image] and its size must be lower "
"than or equal to 256×256. To avoid rendering issues, sizes lower than or "
"equal to 128×128 are recommended.\n"
"[param hotspot] must be within [param image]'s size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [AnimatedTexture]s aren't supported as custom mouse cursors. If "
"using an [AnimatedTexture], only the first frame will be displayed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [b]Lossless[/b], [b]Lossy[/b] or [b]Uncompressed[/b] "
"compression modes are recommended. The [b]Video RAM[/b] compression mode can "
"be used, but it will be decompressed on the CPU, which means loading times "
"are slowed down and no memory is saved compared to lossless modes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On the web platform, the maximum allowed cursor image size is "
"128×128. Cursor images larger than 32×32 will also only be displayed if the "
"mouse cursor image is entirely located within the page for [url=https://"
"chromestatus.com/feature/5825971391299584]security reasons[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຮູບພາບເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ເຊິ່ງຈະສະແດງສະເພາະພາຍໃນໜ້າຕ່າງເກມເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ສຳລັບ [param "
"shape] ຂອງເມົາສ໌ທີ່ລະບຸ. ສາມາດກຳນົດຈຸດຮັອດສະປອດ (hotspot) ໄດ້ນຳ. ການສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]null[/"
"code] ໃຫ້ກັບພາລາມິເຕີ image ຈະເປັນການຣີເຊັດເປັນເຄີເຊີຂອງລະບົບ.\n"
"[param image] ສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງ [Texture2D] ຫຼື [Image] ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງມັນຕ້ອງນ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື "
"ເທົ່າກັບ 256×256. ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫາການສະແດງຜົນ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ 128×128.\n"
"[param hotspot] ຕ້ອງຢູ່ພາຍໃນຂະໜາດຂອງ [param image].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ [AnimatedTexture] ເປັນເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌. ຖ້າໃຊ້ [AnimatedTexture], "
"ຈະສະແດງພຽງແຕ່ເຟຣມທຳອິດເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂໝດການບີບອັດແບບ [b]Lossless[/b], [b]Lossy[/b] ຫຼື "
"[b]Uncompressed[/b]. ໂໝດ [b]Video RAM[/b] ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້, ແຕ່ມັນຈະຖືກຄາຍການບີບອັດໃນ CPU "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການໂຫຼດຊ້າລົງ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ປະຢັດໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳເມື່ອທຽບກັບໂໝດ lossless.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນແພລັດຟອມເວັບ, ຂະໜາດຮູບພາບເຄີເຊີສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດຄື 128×128. "
"ຮູບພາບເຄີເຊີທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ 32×32 ຈະສະແດງຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຮູບພາບເຄີເຊີທັງໝົດຢູ່ໃນໜ້າເວັບເທົ່ານັ້ນ ຍ້ອນ "
"[url=https://chromestatus.com/feature/5825971391299584]ເຫດຜົນດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ[/"
"url]."

msgid ""
"Sets the default cursor shape to be used in the viewport instead of [constant "
"CURSOR_ARROW].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to change the default cursor shape for [Control]'s "
"nodes, use [member Control.mouse_default_cursor_shape] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method generates an [InputEventMouseMotion] to update "
"cursor immediately."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຮູບຮ່າງເຄີເຊີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ viewport ແທນທີ່ [constant CURSOR_ARROW].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນຮູບຮ່າງເຄີເຊີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໂນດ [Control], ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member "
"Control.mouse_default_cursor_shape] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີນີ້ຈະສ້າງ [InputEventMouseMotion] ເພື່ອອັບເດດເຄີເຊີທັນທີ."

msgid ""
"Sets the gravity value of the accelerometer sensor. Can be used for debugging "
"on devices without a hardware sensor, for example in an editor on a PC.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value can be immediately overwritten by the hardware sensor "
"value on Android and iOS."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງຂອງເຊັນເຊີວັດແທກຄວາມເລັ່ງ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອການດີບັກໃນອຸປະກອນທີ່ບໍ່ມີເຊັນເຊີຮາດແວ, "
"ເຊັ່ນ ໃນ editor ເທິງ PC.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ອາດຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ທັນທີໂດຍຄ່າຈາກເຊັນເຊີຮາດແວໃນ Android ແລະ iOS."

msgid ""
"Sets the value of the rotation rate of the gyroscope sensor. Can be used for "
"debugging on devices without a hardware sensor, for example in an editor on a "
"PC.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value can be immediately overwritten by the hardware sensor "
"value on Android and iOS."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າອັດຕາການໝູນຂອງເຊັນເຊີໄຈໂຣສະໂຄບ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອການດີບັກໃນອຸປະກອນທີ່ບໍ່ມີເຊັນເຊີຮາດແວ, ເຊັ່ນ "
"ໃນ editor ເທິງ PC.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ອາດຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ທັນທີໂດຍຄ່າຈາກເຊັນເຊີຮາດແວໃນ Android ແລະ iOS."

msgid ""
"Sets the joypad's LED light, if available, to the specified color. See also "
"[method has_joy_light].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] There is no way to get the color of the light from a joypad. If "
"you need to know the assigned color, store it separately.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and iOS."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດສີໄຟ LED ຂອງຈອຍແພັດ (ຖ້າມີ) ໃຫ້ເປັນສີທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງ [method has_joy_light] ປະກອບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ມີວິທີການດຶງຄ່າສີຂອງໄຟຈາກຈອຍແພັດ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຮູ້ສີທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້, "
"ໃຫ້ເກັບມັນໄວ້ຕ່າງຫາກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟີເຈີນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Windows, Linux, macOS, ແລະ iOS."

msgid ""
"Sets the specified joypad's calibration information. See also [method "
"get_joy_motion_sensors_calibration].\n"
"See [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] for an example on how to "
"use joypad motion sensors and calibration in your games.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and iOS."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຂໍ້ມູນການປັບທຽບຂອງຈອຍແພັດທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງ [method get_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] "
"ປະກອບ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] "
"ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງວິທີການໃຊ້ເຊັນເຊີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງຈອຍແພັດ ແລະ ການປັບທຽບໃນເກມຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟີເຈີນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Windows, Linux, macOS, ແລະ iOS."

msgid ""
"Sets the value of the magnetic field of the magnetometer sensor. Can be used "
"for debugging on devices without a hardware sensor, for example in an editor "
"on a PC.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value can be immediately overwritten by the hardware sensor "
"value on Android and iOS."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າສະໜາມແມ່ເຫຼັກຂອງເຊັນເຊີວັດແທກສະໜາມແມ່ເຫຼັກ. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອການດີບັກໃນອຸປະກອນທີ່ບໍ່ມີເຊັນເຊີຮາດແວ, ເຊັ່ນ ໃນ editor ເທິງ PC.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ອາດຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ທັນທີໂດຍຄ່າຈາກເຊັນເຊີຮາດແວໃນ Android ແລະ iOS."

msgid ""
"Stops the vibration of the joypad started with [method start_joy_vibration]."
msgstr "ຢຸດການສັ່ນຂອງຈອຍແພັດທີ່ເລີ່ມດ້ວຍ [method start_joy_vibration]."

msgid ""
"Sets the mouse position to the specified vector, provided in pixels and "
"relative to an origin at the upper left corner of the currently focused "
"Window Manager game window.\n"
"Mouse position is clipped to the limits of the screen resolution, or to the "
"limits of the game window if [enum MouseMode] is set to [constant "
"MOUSE_MODE_CONFINED] or [constant MOUSE_MODE_CONFINED_HIDDEN].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method warp_mouse] is only supported on Windows, macOS and "
"Linux. It has no effect on Android, iOS and Web."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງເມົາສ໌ໄປຍັງເວັກເຕີທີ່ລະບຸ, ໂດຍມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນພິກເຊວ ແລະ "
"ອ້າງອີງຈາກມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງເກມທີ່ກຳລັງໂຟກັດຢູ່.\n"
"ຕຳແໜ່ງເມົາສ໌ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດຢູ່ພາຍໃນຂອບເຂດຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, ຫຼື ຂອບເຂດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງເກມຖ້າ [enum "
"MouseMode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant MOUSE_MODE_CONFINED] ຫຼື [constant "
"MOUSE_MODE_CONFINED_HIDDEN].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method warp_mouse] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Windows, macOS ແລະ Linux. "
"ມັນບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນ Android, iOS ແລະ Web."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], sends mouse input events when tapping or swiping on the "
"touchscreen. See also [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_mouse_from_touch]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສົ່ງເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນເມົາສ໌ເມື່ອມີການແຕະ ຫຼື ປັດເທິງໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/emulate_mouse_from_touch] "
"ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], sends touch input events when clicking or dragging the "
"mouse. See also [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_touch_from_mouse]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສົ່ງເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນການສຳຜັດເມື່ອມີການຄລິກ ຫຼື ລາກເມົາສ໌. ເບິ່ງ "
"[member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/emulate_touch_from_mouse] "
"ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], joypad input (including motion sensors) and LED light "
"changes will be ignored and joypad vibration will be stopped when the "
"application is not focused."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຈາກຈອຍແພັດ (ລວມທັງເຊັນເຊີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ) ແລະ "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງໄຟ LED ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ ແລະ ການສັ່ນຂອງຈອຍແພັດຈະຖືກຢຸດເມື່ອແອັບພລິເຄຊັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໂຟກັດ."

msgid "Controls the mouse mode."
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມໂໝດຂອງເມົາສ໌."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], similar input events sent by the operating system are "
"accumulated. When input accumulation is enabled, all input events generated "
"during a frame will be merged and emitted when the frame is done rendering. "
"Therefore, this limits the number of input method calls per second to the "
"rendering FPS.\n"
"Input accumulation can be disabled to get slightly more precise/reactive "
"input at the cost of increased CPU usage. In applications where drawing "
"freehand lines is required, input accumulation should generally be disabled "
"while the user is drawing the line to get results that closely follow the "
"actual input.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Input accumulation is [i]enabled[/i] by default."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນທີ່ສົ່ງມາຈາກລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຈະຖືກສະສົມ "
"(accumulated). ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການສະສົມການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ, "
"ເຫດການທັງໝົດທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງເຟຣມໜຶ່ງຈະຖືກຮ່ວມເຂົ້າກັນ ແລະ ສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອເຟຣມນັ້ນສະແດງຜົນສຳເລັດ. "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ນີ້ຈະຈຳກັດຈຳນວນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຕໍ່ວິນາທີໃຫ້ເທົ່າກັບ FPS ຂອງການສະແດງຜົນ.\n"
"ການສະສົມການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນສາມາດປິດໄດ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊັດເຈນ ຫຼື ຕອບສະໜອງໄວຂຶ້ນ "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບການໃຊ້ CPU ທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ. ໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຕ້ອງມີການແຕ້ມເສັ້ນດ້ວຍມື, "
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຄວນປິດການສະສົມການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນໃນຂະນະທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳລັງແຕ້ມເສັ້ນ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ກົງກັບການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນແທ້ໆ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການສະສົມການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຖືກ [i]ເປີດ[/i] ໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Emitted when a joypad device has been connected or disconnected."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອອຸປະກອນຈອຍແພັດຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຫຼື ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid "Arrow cursor. Standard, default pointing cursor."
msgstr "ເຄີເຊີລູກສອນ. ເຄີເຊີຊີ້ແບບມາດຕະຖານ ແລະ ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"I-beam cursor. Usually used to show where the text cursor will appear when "
"the mouse is clicked."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີຮູບໂຕໄອ (I-beam). ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງບ່ອນທີ່ເຄີເຊີຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຄລິກເມົາສ໌."

msgid ""
"Pointing hand cursor. Usually used to indicate the pointer is over a link or "
"other interactable item."
msgstr "ເຄີເຊີຮູບມືຊີ້. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອບອກວ່າເຄີເຊີຢູ່ເທິງລິ້ງ (link) ຫຼື ປຸ່ມທີ່ສາມາດກົດໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Cross cursor. Typically appears over regions in which a drawing operation can "
"be performed or for selections."
msgstr "ເຄີເຊີຮູບກາກະບາດ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນເທິງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ສາມາດແຕ້ມຮູບໄດ້ ຫຼື ສຳລັບການເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"Wait cursor. Indicates that the application is busy performing an operation, "
"and that it cannot be used during the operation (e.g. something is blocking "
"its main thread)."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີລໍຖ້າ. ບອກວ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນກຳລັງຫຍຸ້ງກັບການເຮັດວຽກບາງຢ່າງ, ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງນັ້ນ "
"(ເຊັ່ນ: ມີບາງຢ່າງກຳລັງບລັອກ main thread)."

msgid ""
"Busy cursor. Indicates that the application is busy performing an operation, "
"and that it is still usable during the operation."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີບໍ່ວ່າງ. ບອກວ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນກຳລັງຫຍຸ້ງກັບການເຮັດວຽກບາງຢ່າງ, "
"ແຕ່ຍັງຄົງສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Drag cursor. Usually displayed when dragging something.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Windows lacks a dragging cursor, so [constant CURSOR_DRAG] is "
"the same as [constant CURSOR_MOVE] for this platform."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີລາກ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະສະແດງເມື່ອກຳລັງລາກບາງຢ່າງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Windows ບໍ່ມີເຄີເຊີສຳລັບການລາກໂດຍສະເພາະ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ [constant "
"CURSOR_DRAG] ຈະຄືກັນກັບ [constant CURSOR_MOVE] ໃນແພລັດຟອມນີ້."

msgid ""
"Can drop cursor. Usually displayed when dragging something to indicate that "
"it can be dropped at the current position."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີວາງໄດ້. "
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະສະແດງເມື່ອກຳລັງລາກບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອບອກວ່າມັນສາມາດວາງລົງໃນຕຳແໜ່ງປັດຈຸບັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Forbidden cursor. Indicates that the current action is forbidden (for "
"example, when dragging something) or that the control at a position is "
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີຫ້າມ. ບອກວ່າການກະທຳປັດຈຸບັນຖືກຫ້າມ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເມື່ອກຳລັງລາກບາງຢ່າງ) ຫຼື "
"ປຸ່ມຄວບຄຸມໃນຕຳແໜ່ງນັ້ນຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Vertical resize mouse cursor. A double-headed vertical arrow. It tells the "
"user they can resize the window or the panel vertically."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີປ່ຽນຂະໜາດແນວຕັ້ງ. ເປັນຮູບລູກສອນສອງຫົວແນວຕັ້ງ. ມັນບອກຜູ້ໃຊ້ວ່າພວກເຂົາສາມາດປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງ ຫຼື "
"ແຖບຄວບຄຸມໃນແນວຕັ້ງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Horizontal resize mouse cursor. A double-headed horizontal arrow. It tells "
"the user they can resize the window or the panel horizontally."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີປ່ຽນຂະໜາດແນວນອນ. ເປັນຮູບລູກສອນສອງຫົວແນວນອນ. ມັນບອກຜູ້ໃຊ້ວ່າພວກເຂົາສາມາດປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງ "
"ຫຼື ແຖບຄວບຄຸມໃນແນວນອນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Window resize mouse cursor. The cursor is a double-headed arrow that goes "
"from the bottom left to the top right. It tells the user they can resize the "
"window or the panel both horizontally and vertically."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີເມົາສຳລັບປັບຂະໜາດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ. ເຄີເຊີເປັນຮູບລູກສອນສອງຫົວທີ່ຊີ້ຈາກລຸ່ມຊ້າຍໄປຫາເທິງຂວາ. "
"ມັນບອກໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮູ້ວ່າພວກເຂົາສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ ຫຼື ແຜງໄດ້ທັງທາງນອນ ແລະ ທາງຕັ້ງ."

msgid ""
"Window resize mouse cursor. The cursor is a double-headed arrow that goes "
"from the top left to the bottom right, the opposite of [constant "
"CURSOR_BDIAGSIZE]. It tells the user they can resize the window or the panel "
"both horizontally and vertically."
msgstr ""
"ເຄີເຊີເມົາສຳລັບປັບຂະໜາດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ. ເຄີເຊີເປັນຮູບລູກສອນສອງຫົວທີ່ຊີ້ຈາກເທິງຊ້າຍໄປຫາລຸ່ມຂວາ, "
"ເຊິ່ງກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ [constant CURSOR_BDIAGSIZE]. "
"ມັນບອກໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮູ້ວ່າພວກເຂົາສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ ຫຼື ແຜງໄດ້ທັງທາງນອນ ແລະ ທາງຕັ້ງ."

msgid "Move cursor. Indicates that something can be moved."
msgstr "ເຄີເຊີຍ້າຍ. ບົ່ງບອກວ່າບາງສິ່ງບາງຢ່າງສາມາດຍ້າຍໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Vertical split mouse cursor. On Windows, it's the same as [constant "
"CURSOR_VSIZE]."
msgstr "ເຄີເຊີເມົາສຳລັບການແຍກທາງຕັ້ງ. ໃນ Windows, ມັນຈະຄືກັນກັບ [constant CURSOR_VSIZE]."

msgid ""
"Horizontal split mouse cursor. On Windows, it's the same as [constant "
"CURSOR_HSIZE]."
msgstr "ເຄີເຊີເມົາສຳລັບການແຍກທາງນອນ. ໃນ Windows, ມັນຈະຄືກັນກັບ [constant CURSOR_HSIZE]."

msgid "Help cursor. Usually a question mark."
msgstr "ເຄີເຊີຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເປັນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳຖາມ."

msgid "Abstract base class for input events."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານນາມມະທຳ (Abstract base class) ສຳລັບເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (input events)."

msgid ""
"Abstract base class of all types of input events. See [method Node._input]."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານນາມມະທຳຂອງທຸກປະເພດເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ. ເບິ່ງ [method Node._input]."

msgid "Using InputEvent"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ InputEvent"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given input event and this input event can "
"be added together (only for events of type [InputEventMouseMotion]).\n"
"The given input event's position, global position and speed will be copied. "
"The resulting [code]relative[/code] is a sum of both events. Both events' "
"modifiers have to be identical."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ ແລະ ເຫດການນີ້ສາມາດລວມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ "
"(ສະເພາະເຫດການປະເພດ [InputEventMouseMotion]).\n"
"ຕຳແໜ່ງ, ຕຳແໜ່ງທົ່ວໂລກ (global position) ແລະ ຄວາມໄວຂອງເຫດການທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຈະຖືກສຳເນົາໄວ້. ຄ່າ "
"[code]relative[/code] ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນຜົນລວມຂອງທັງສອງເຫດການ. ປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນ (modifiers) "
"ຂອງທັງສອງເຫດການຕ້ອງຄືກັນ."

msgid "Returns a [String] representation of the event."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າການສະແດງຜົນຂອງເຫດການໃນຮູບແບບ [String]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this input event matches a pre-defined action of "
"any type.\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ກົງກັບການກະທຳ (action) "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າປະເພດໃດໜຶ່ງ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param exact_match] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບເຫດການ [InputEventKey] ແລະ [InputEventMouseButton], "
"ແລະ ບໍ່ສົນໃຈທິດທາງສຳລັບເຫດການ [InputEventJoypadMotion]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given action matches this event and is being "
"pressed (and is not an echo event for [InputEventKey] events, unless [param "
"allow_echo] is [code]true[/code]). Not relevant for events of type "
"[InputEventMouseMotion] or [InputEventScreenDrag].\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to keyboard ghosting, [method is_action_pressed] may return "
"[code]false[/code] even if one of the action's keys is pressed. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/input_examples.html#keyboard-events]Input "
"examples[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າການກະທຳ (action) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກົງກັບເຫດການນີ້ ແລະ ກຳລັງຖືກກົດຢູ່ "
"(ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນເຫດການສັນຍານຊ້ຳ ຫຼື echo ສຳລັບເຫດການ [InputEventKey], ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ [param "
"allow_echo] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code]). ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເຫດການປະເພດ "
"[InputEventMouseMotion] ຫຼື [InputEventScreenDrag].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param exact_match] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບເຫດການ [InputEventKey] ແລະ [InputEventMouseButton], "
"ແລະ ບໍ່ສົນໃຈທິດທາງສຳລັບເຫດການ [InputEventJoypadMotion].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກບັນຫາ keyboard ghosting, [method is_action_pressed] "
"ອາດຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]false[/code] ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໜຶ່ງໃນປຸ່ມຂອງການກະທຳນັ້ນຈະຖືກກົດຢູ່ກໍຕາມ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/input_examples.html#keyboard-"
"events]ຕົວຢ່າງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ[/url] ໃນເອກະສານສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given action matches this event and is "
"released (i.e. not pressed). Not relevant for events of type "
"[InputEventMouseMotion] or [InputEventScreenDrag].\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າການກະທຳ (action) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກົງກັບເຫດການນີ້ ແລະ ຖືກປ່ອຍແລ້ວ (ຄື "
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກົດ). ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເຫດການປະເພດ [InputEventMouseMotion] ຫຼື "
"[InputEventScreenDrag].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param exact_match] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບເຫດການ [InputEventKey] ແລະ [InputEventMouseButton], "
"ແລະ ບໍ່ສົນໃຈທິດທາງສຳລັບເຫດການ [InputEventJoypadMotion]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this input event's type is one that can be "
"assigned to an input action: [InputEventKey], [InputEventMouseButton], "
"[InputEventJoypadButton], [InputEventJoypadMotion], [InputEventAction]. "
"Returns [code]false[/code] for all other input event types."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າປະເພດຂອງເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ແມ່ນອັນທີ່ສາມາດກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບການກະທຳ "
"(input action) ໄດ້: [InputEventKey], [InputEventMouseButton], "
"[InputEventJoypadButton], [InputEventJoypadMotion], [InputEventAction]. ສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[code]false[/code] ສຳລັບເຫດການປະເພດອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if this input event has been canceled."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຖືກຍົກເລີກ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this input event is an echo event (only for "
"events of type [InputEventKey]). An echo event is a repeated key event sent "
"when the user is holding down the key. Any other event type returns "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The rate at which echo events are sent is typically around 20 "
"events per second (after holding down the key for roughly half a second). "
"However, the key repeat delay/speed can be changed by the user or disabled "
"entirely in the operating system settings. To ensure your project works "
"correctly on all configurations, do not assume the user has a specific key "
"repeat configuration in your project's behavior."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ເປັນເຫດການສັນຍານຊ້ຳ ຫຼື echo "
"(ສະເພາະເຫດການປະເພດ [InputEventKey]). ເຫດການ echo ແມ່ນເຫດການປຸ່ມທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງຊ້ຳໆ "
"ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ກົດປຸ່ມຄ້າງໄວ້. ປະເພດເຫດການອື່ນໆຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອັດຕາການສົ່ງເຫດການ echo ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນປະມານ 20 ເຫດການຕໍ່ວິນາທີ "
"(ຫຼັງຈາກກົດປຸ່ມຄ້າງໄວ້ປະມານເຄິ່ງວິນາທີ). ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຄວາມຊ້າ/"
"ຄວາມໄວໃນການຊ້ຳປຸ່ມສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼື ປິດການໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃນທຸກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, "
"ຫ້າມຄາດເດົາວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຊ້ຳປຸ່ມທີ່ແນ່ນອນໃນພຶດຕິກຳຂອງໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified [param event] matches this event. "
"Only valid for action events, which include key ([InputEventKey]), button "
"([InputEventMouseButton] or [InputEventJoypadButton]), axis "
"[InputEventJoypadMotion], and action ([InputEventAction]) events.\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], the check ignores additional "
"input modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and "
"the direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only considers the event configuration (such as the "
"keyboard key or the joypad axis), not state information like [method "
"is_pressed], [method is_released], [method is_echo], or [method is_canceled]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param event] ທີ່ລະບຸກົງກັບເຫດການນີ້. "
"ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບເຫດການການກະທຳ, ເຊິ່ງລວມມີ ປຸ່ມຄີບອດ ([InputEventKey]), ປຸ່ມເມົາ ຫຼື ປຸ່ມຈອຍເກມ "
"([InputEventMouseButton] ຫຼື [InputEventJoypadButton]), ແກນຈອຍເກມ "
"[InputEventJoypadMotion], ແລະ ເຫດການການກະທຳ ([InputEventAction]).\n"
"ຖ້າ [param exact_match] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ການກວດສອບຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບເຫດການ [InputEventKey] ແລະ "
"[InputEventMouseButton], ແລະ ບໍ່ສົນໃຈທິດທາງສຳລັບເຫດການ [InputEventJoypadMotion].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີນີ້ຈະພິຈາລະນາສະເພາະການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫດການ (ເຊັ່ນ ປຸ່ມຄີບອດ ຫຼື ແກນຈອຍເກມ), "
"ບໍ່ລວມເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະເຊັ່ນ [method is_pressed], [method is_released], [method "
"is_echo], ຫຼື [method is_canceled]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this input event is pressed. Not relevant for "
"events of type [InputEventMouseMotion] or [InputEventScreenDrag].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to keyboard ghosting, [method is_pressed] may return "
"[code]false[/code] even if one of the action's keys is pressed. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/input_examples.html#keyboard-events]Input "
"examples[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຖືກກົດຢູ່. ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເຫດການປະເພດ "
"[InputEventMouseMotion] ຫຼື [InputEventScreenDrag].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກບັນຫາ keyboard ghosting, [method is_pressed] ອາດຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[code]false[/code] ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໜຶ່ງໃນປຸ່ມຂອງການກະທຳນັ້ນຈະຖືກກົດຢູ່ກໍຕາມ. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/inputs/input_examples.html#keyboard-events]ຕົວຢ່າງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ[/url] "
"ໃນເອກະສານສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this input event is released. Not relevant for "
"events of type [InputEventMouseMotion] or [InputEventScreenDrag]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຖືກປ່ອຍແລ້ວ. ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເຫດການປະເພດ "
"[InputEventMouseMotion] ຫຼື [InputEventScreenDrag]."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the given input event which has been offset by [param "
"local_ofs] and transformed by [param xform]. Relevant for events of type "
"[InputEventMouseButton], [InputEventMouseMotion], [InputEventScreenTouch], "
"[InputEventScreenDrag], [InputEventMagnifyGesture] and [InputEventPanGesture]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າສຳເນົາຂອງເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ ເຊິ່ງໄດ້ຖືກຍັບ (offset) ໂດຍ [param local_ofs] "
"ແລະ ປ່ຽນຮູບ (transformed) ໂດຍ [param xform]. ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເຫດການປະເພດ "
"[InputEventMouseButton], [InputEventMouseMotion], [InputEventScreenTouch], "
"[InputEventScreenDrag], [InputEventMagnifyGesture] ແລະ [InputEventPanGesture]."

msgid ""
"The event's device ID.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member device] can be negative for special use cases that don't "
"refer to devices physically present on the system. See [constant "
"DEVICE_ID_EMULATION]."
msgstr ""
"ID ຂອງອຸປະກອນຂອງເຫດການ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member device] "
"ສາມາດມີຄ່າເປັນລົບໄດ້ສຳລັບກໍລະນີການນຳໃຊ້ພິເສດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ອ້າງອີງເຖິງອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈິງໃນລະບົບ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[constant DEVICE_ID_EMULATION]."

msgid ""
"Device ID used for emulated mouse input from a touchscreen, or for emulated "
"touch input from a mouse. This can be used to distinguish emulated mouse "
"input from physical mouse input, or emulated touch input from physical touch "
"input."
msgstr ""
"ID ຂອງອຸປະກອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຈຳລອງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນເມົາຈາກໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດ, ຫຼື "
"ສຳລັບການຈຳລອງການສຳຜັດຈາກເມົາ. ອັນນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຍກຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນເມົາຈຳລອງ "
"ກັບການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນເມົາຕົວຈິງ, ຫຼື ການສຳຜັດຈຳລອງ ກັບການສຳຜັດຕົວຈິງ."

msgid ""
"Device ID used for input from a keyboard. This can be used to distinguish "
"keyboard input events from joypad input events."
msgstr ""
"ID ຂອງອຸປະກອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຈາກຄີບອດ. "
"ອັນນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຍກເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຈາກຄີບອດອອກຈາກເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຈາກຈອຍເກມ."

msgid ""
"Device ID used for input from a mouse. This can be used to distinguish mouse "
"input events from joypad input events."
msgstr ""
"ID ຂອງອຸປະກອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຈາກເມົາ. "
"ອັນນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຍກເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຈາກເມົາອອກຈາກເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຈາກຈອຍເກມ."

msgid "An input event type for actions."
msgstr "ປະເພດເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບການກະທຳ (actions)."

msgid ""
"Contains a generic action which can be targeted from several types of inputs. "
"Actions and their events can be set in the [b]Input Map[/b] tab in [b]Project "
"> Project Settings[/b], or with the [InputMap] class.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike the other [InputEvent] subclasses which map to unique "
"physical events, this virtual one is not emitted by the engine. This class is "
"useful to emit actions manually with [method Input.parse_input_event], which "
"are then received in [method Node._input]. To check if a physical event "
"matches an action from the Input Map, use [method InputEvent.is_action] and "
"[method InputEvent.is_action_pressed]."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຈຸການກະທຳທົ່ວໄປເຊິ່ງສາມາດກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄດ້ຈາກການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຫຼາຍປະເພດ. ການກະທຳ ແລະ "
"ເຫດການຂອງພວກມັນສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໃນແທັບ [b]Input Map[/b] ໃນ [b]Project > Project "
"Settings[/b], ຫຼື ຜ່ານຄລາສ [InputMap].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ່າງຈາກຄລາສຍ່ອຍຂອງ [InputEvent] "
"ອື່ນໆທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບເຫດການທາງກາຍະພາບທີ່ແນ່ນອນ, ເຫດການສະເມືອນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກໂດຍ engine. "
"ຄລາສນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການສົ່ງການກະທຳດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຜ່ານ [method Input.parse_input_event], "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກຮັບໃນ [method Node._input]. ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າເຫດການທາງກາຍະພາບກົງກັບການກະທຳຈາກ "
"Input Map ຫຼື ບໍ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method InputEvent.is_action] ແລະ [method "
"InputEvent.is_action_pressed]."

msgid "Using InputEvent: Actions"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ InputEvent: Actions"

msgid ""
"The action's name. This is usually the name of an existing action in the "
"[InputMap] which you want this custom event to match."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຂອງການກະທຳ (action). ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເປັນຊື່ຂອງການກະທຳທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ [InputMap] "
"ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເຫດການທີ່ກຳນົດເອງນີ້ກົງກັນ."

msgid ""
"The real event index in action this event corresponds to (from events defined "
"for this action in the [InputMap]). If [code]-1[/code], a unique ID will be "
"used and actions pressed with this ID will need to be released with another "
"[InputEventAction]."
msgstr ""
"ລຳດັບ (index) ຂອງເຫດການຕົວຈິງໃນການກະທຳທີ່ເຫດການນີ້ກົງກັນ "
"(ຈາກເຫດການທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສຳລັບການກະທຳນີ້ໃນ [InputMap]). ຖ້າເປັນ [code]-1[/code], ID "
"ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ ແລະ ການກະທຳທີ່ຖືກກົດດ້ວຍ ID ນີ້ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກປ່ອຍດ້ວຍ [InputEventAction] ອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the action's state is pressed. If [code]false[/code], "
"the action's state is released."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະຖານະຂອງການກະທຳແມ່ນຖືກກົດ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ສະຖານະຂອງການກະທຳແມ່ນຖືກປ່ອຍ."

msgid ""
"The action's strength between 0 and 1. This value is considered as equal to 0 "
"if pressed is [code]false[/code]. The event strength allows faking analog "
"joypad motion events, by specifying how strongly the joypad axis is bent or "
"pressed."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງຂອງການກະທຳລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 1. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືວ່າເທົ່າກັບ 0 ຖ້າສະຖານະການກົດເປັນ [code]false[/"
"code]. ຄວາມແຮງຂອງເຫດການຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຈຳລອງເຫດການການເຄື່ອນໄຫວແບບອະນາລັອກຂອງຈອຍເກມໄດ້ "
"ໂດຍການລະບຸວ່າແກນຂອງຈອຍເກມຖືກໂຍກ ຫຼື ຖືກກົດແຮງປານໃດ."

msgid "Abstract base class for [Viewport]-based input events."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານນາມມະທຳສຳລັບເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ອີງຕາມ [Viewport]."

msgid ""
"InputEventFromWindow represents events specifically received by windows. This "
"includes mouse events, keyboard events in focused windows or touch screen "
"actions."
msgstr ""
"InputEventFromWindow ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ເຫດການທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບໂດຍປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ (windows) ໂດຍສະເພາະ. "
"ອັນນີ້ລວມມີເຫດການເມົາ, ເຫດການຄີບອດໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຖືກໂຟກັສ ຫຼື ການກະທຳໃນໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດ."

msgid "The ID of a [Window] that received this event."
msgstr "ID ຂອງ [Window] ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບເຫດການນີ້."

msgid "Abstract base class for touch gestures."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານນາມມະທຳສຳລັບທ່າທາງການສຳຜັດ (touch gestures)."

msgid ""
"InputEventGestures are sent when a user performs a supported gesture on a "
"touch screen. Gestures can't be emulated using mouse, because they typically "
"require multi-touch."
msgstr ""
"InputEventGestures ຈະຖືກສົ່ງເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ປະຕິບັດທ່າທາງທີ່ຮອງຮັບໃນໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດ. "
"ທ່າທາງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດຈຳລອງໄດ້ດ້ວຍເມົາ ເພາະປົກກະຕິແລ້ວພວກມັນຕ້ອງການການສຳຜັດຫຼາຍຈຸດ (multi-"
"touch)."

msgid ""
"The local gesture position relative to the [Viewport]. If used in [method "
"Control._gui_input], the position is relative to the current [Control] that "
"received this gesture."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງທ່າທາງພາຍໃນທີ່ທຽບກັບ [Viewport]. ຖ້າໃຊ້ໃນ [method Control._gui_input], "
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຈະທຽບກັບ [Control] ປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບທ່າທາງນີ້."

msgid "Represents a gamepad button being pressed or released."
msgstr "ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ປຸ່ມຈອຍເກມ (gamepad) ທີ່ຖືກກົດ ຫຼື ຖືກປ່ອຍ."

msgid ""
"Input event type for gamepad buttons. For gamepad analog sticks and "
"joysticks, see [InputEventJoypadMotion]."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບປຸ່ມຈອຍເກມ. ສຳລັບຄັນໂຍກອະນາລັອກ ແລະ ຈອຍສະຕິກ, ເບິ່ງ "
"[InputEventJoypadMotion]."

msgid "Button identifier. One of the [enum JoyButton] button constants."
msgstr "ຕົວລະບຸປຸ່ມ. ແມ່ນໜຶ່ງໃນຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຂອງປຸ່ມ [enum JoyButton]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the button's state is pressed. If [code]false[/code], "
"the button's state is released."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະຖານະຂອງປຸ່ມແມ່ນຖືກກົດ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ສະຖານະຂອງປຸ່ມແມ່ນຖືກປ່ອຍ."

msgid "This property is never set by the engine and is always [code]0[/code]."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ເຄີຍຖືກຕັ້ງໂດຍ engine ແລະ ຈະເປັນ [code]0[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Represents axis motions (such as joystick or analog triggers) from a gamepad."
msgstr "ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຕາມແກນ (ເຊັ່ນ ຈອຍສະຕິກ ຫຼື ປຸ່ມກົດແບບອະນາລັອກ) ຈາກຈອຍເກມ."

msgid ""
"Stores information about joystick motions. One [InputEventJoypadMotion] "
"represents one axis at a time. For gamepad buttons, see "
"[InputEventJoypadButton]."
msgstr ""
"ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງຈອຍສະຕິກ. ໜຶ່ງ [InputEventJoypadMotion] "
"ຈະຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ໜຶ່ງແກນໃນແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ. ສຳລັບປຸ່ມຈອຍເກມ, ເບິ່ງ [InputEventJoypadButton]."

msgid "Axis identifier."
msgstr "ຕົວລະບຸແກນ."

msgid ""
"Current position of the joystick on the given axis. The value ranges from "
"[code]-1.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code]. A value of [code]0[/code] means the "
"axis is in its resting position."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງຈອຍສະຕິກໃນແກນທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ຄ່າຈະຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]-1.0[/code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/"
"code]. ຄ່າເປັນ [code]0[/code] ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແກນຢູ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງພັກ (ປົກກະຕິ)."

msgid "Represents a key on a keyboard being pressed or released."
msgstr "ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ປຸ່ມໃນຄີບອດທີ່ຖືກກົດ ຫຼື ຖືກປ່ອຍ."

msgid ""
"An input event for keys on a keyboard. Supports key presses, key releases and "
"[member echo] events. It can also be received in [method "
"Node._unhandled_key_input].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Events received from the keyboard usually have all properties "
"set. Event mappings should have only one of the [member keycode], [member "
"physical_keycode] or [member unicode] set.\n"
"When events are compared, properties are checked in the following priority - "
"[member keycode], [member physical_keycode] and [member unicode]. Events with "
"the first matching value will be considered equal."
msgstr ""
"ເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບປຸ່ມໃນຄີບອດ. ຮອງຮັບການກົດປຸ່ມ, ການປ່ອຍປຸ່ມ ແລະ ເຫດການ [member echo]. "
"ມັນຍັງສາມາດຮັບໄດ້ໃນ [method Node._unhandled_key_input].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເຫດການທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຈາກຄີບອດປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າທຸກຄຸນສົມບັດໄວ້. ການກຳນົດເຫດການ "
"(mapping) ຄວນມີພຽງແຕ່ຢ່າງໃດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງລະຫວ່າງ [member keycode], [member "
"physical_keycode] ຫຼື [member unicode] ທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້.\n"
"ເມື່ອປຽບທຽບເຫດການ, ຄຸນສົມບັດຈະຖືກກວດສອບຕາມລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນດັ່ງນີ້ - [member keycode], "
"[member physical_keycode] ແລະ [member unicode]. "
"ເຫດການທີ່ມີຄ່າທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເທົ່າກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [String] representation of the event's [member key_label] and "
"modifiers."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າການສະແດງຜົນໃນຮູບແບບ [String] ຂອງ [member key_label] ແລະ ປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນ (modifiers) "
"ຂອງເຫດການ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [String] representation of the event's [member keycode] and "
"modifiers."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າການສະແດງຜົນໃນຮູບແບບ [String] ຂອງ [member keycode] ແລະ ປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນ (modifiers) "
"ຂອງເຫດການ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [String] representation of the event's [member location]. This will "
"be a blank string if the event is not specific to a location."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າການສະແດງຜົນໃນຮູບແບບ [String] ຂອງ [member location] ຂອງເຫດການ. "
"ຈະເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງເປົ່າຖ້າເຫດການນັ້ນບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ແນ່ນອນ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [String] representation of the event's [member physical_keycode] "
"and modifiers."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າການສະແດງຜົນໃນຮູບແບບ [String] ຂອງ [member physical_keycode] ແລະ ປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນ "
"(modifiers) ຂອງເຫດການ."

msgid ""
"Returns the localized key label combined with modifier keys such as "
"[kbd]Shift[/kbd] or [kbd]Alt[/kbd]. See also [InputEventWithModifiers].\n"
"To get a human-readable representation of the [InputEventKey] with modifiers, "
"use [code]OS.get_keycode_string(event.get_key_label_with_modifiers())[/code] "
"where [code]event[/code] is the [InputEventKey]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າປ້າຍຊື່ປຸ່ມ (key label) ທີ່ປັບຕາມພາສາທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ລວມກັບປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນເຊັ່ນ [kbd]Shift[/kbd] ຫຼື "
"[kbd]Alt[/kbd]. ເບິ່ງ [InputEventWithModifiers] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງ [InputEventKey] ພ້ອມປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນທີ່ມະນຸດອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[code]OS.get_keycode_string(event.get_key_label_with_modifiers())[/code] ໂດຍທີ່ "
"[code]event[/code] ແມ່ນ [InputEventKey]."

msgid ""
"Returns the Latin keycode combined with modifier keys such as [kbd]Shift[/"
"kbd] or [kbd]Alt[/kbd]. See also [InputEventWithModifiers].\n"
"To get a human-readable representation of the [InputEventKey] with modifiers, "
"use [code]OS.get_keycode_string(event.get_keycode_with_modifiers())[/code] "
"where [code]event[/code] is the [InputEventKey]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າລະຫັດປຸ່ມ (keycode) ແບບລາແຕັງ ລວມກັບປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນເຊັ່ນ [kbd]Shift[/kbd] ຫຼື [kbd]Alt[/"
"kbd]. ເບິ່ງ [InputEventWithModifiers] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງ [InputEventKey] ພ້ອມປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນທີ່ມະນຸດອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[code]OS.get_keycode_string(event.get_keycode_with_modifiers())[/code] ໂດຍທີ່ "
"[code]event[/code] ແມ່ນ [InputEventKey]."

msgid ""
"Returns the physical keycode combined with modifier keys such as [kbd]Shift[/"
"kbd] or [kbd]Alt[/kbd]. See also [InputEventWithModifiers].\n"
"To get a human-readable representation of the [InputEventKey] with modifiers, "
"use [code]OS.get_keycode_string(event.get_physical_keycode_with_modifiers())[/"
"code] where [code]event[/code] is the [InputEventKey]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າລະຫັດປຸ່ມທາງກາຍະພາບ (physical keycode) ລວມກັບປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນເຊັ່ນ [kbd]Shift[/kbd] ຫຼື "
"[kbd]Alt[/kbd]. ເບິ່ງ [InputEventWithModifiers] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງ [InputEventKey] ພ້ອມປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນທີ່ມະນຸດອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[code]OS.get_keycode_string(event.get_physical_keycode_with_modifiers())[/"
"code] ໂດຍທີ່ [code]event[/code] ແມ່ນ [InputEventKey]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the key was already pressed before this event. An echo "
"event is a repeated key event sent when the user is holding down the key.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The rate at which echo events are sent is typically around 20 "
"events per second (after holding down the key for roughly half a second). "
"However, the key repeat delay/speed can be changed by the user or disabled "
"entirely in the operating system settings. To ensure your project works "
"correctly on all configurations, do not assume the user has a specific key "
"repeat configuration in your project's behavior."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າປຸ່ມຖືກກົດມາກ່ອນເຫດການນີ້ແລ້ວ. ເຫດການ echo "
"ແມ່ນເຫດການປຸ່ມທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງຊ້ຳໆ ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ກົດປຸ່ມຄ້າງໄວ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອັດຕາການສົ່ງເຫດການ echo ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນປະມານ 20 ເຫດການຕໍ່ວິນາທີ "
"(ຫຼັງຈາກກົດປຸ່ມຄ້າງໄວ້ປະມານເຄິ່ງວິນາທີ). ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຄວາມຊ້າ/"
"ຄວາມໄວໃນການຊ້ຳປຸ່ມສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼື ປິດການໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃນທຸກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, "
"ຫ້າມຄາດເດົາວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຊ້ຳປຸ່ມທີ່ແນ່ນອນໃນພຶດຕິກຳຂອງໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານ."

msgid ""
"Represents the location of a key which has both left and right versions, such "
"as [kbd]Shift[/kbd] or [kbd]Alt[/kbd]."
msgstr ""
"ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງປຸ່ມທີ່ມີທັງເວີຊັນຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຂວາ ເຊັ່ນ [kbd]Shift[/kbd] ຫຼື [kbd]Alt[/kbd]."

msgid ""
"Represents the physical location of a key on the 101/102-key US QWERTY "
"keyboard, which corresponds to one of the [enum Key] constants. Physical key "
"codes meant for game input, such as WASD movement, where only the location of "
"the keys is important.\n"
"To get a human-readable representation of the [InputEventKey], use [method "
"OS.get_keycode_string] in combination with [method "
"DisplayServer.keyboard_get_keycode_from_physical] or [method "
"DisplayServer.keyboard_get_label_from_physical]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventKey:\n"
"\t\tvar keycode = "
"DisplayServer.keyboard_get_keycode_from_physical(event.physical_keycode)\n"
"\t\tvar label = "
"DisplayServer.keyboard_get_label_from_physical(event.physical_keycode)\n"
"\t\tprint(OS.get_keycode_string(keycode))\n"
"\t\tprint(OS.get_keycode_string(label))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventKey inputEventKey)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tvar keycode = "
"DisplayServer.KeyboardGetKeycodeFromPhysical(inputEventKey.PhysicalKeycode);\n"
"\t\tvar label = "
"DisplayServer.KeyboardGetLabelFromPhysical(inputEventKey.PhysicalKeycode);\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(OS.GetKeycodeString(keycode));\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(OS.GetKeycodeString(label));\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ຕຳແໜ່ງທາງກາຍະພາບຂອງປຸ່ມໃນຄີບອດ US QWERTY 101/102 ປຸ່ມ, ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບໜຶ່ງໃນຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຂອງ "
"[enum Key]. ລະຫັດປຸ່ມທາງກາຍະພາບ (Physical key codes) ມີໄວ້ສຳລັບການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນໃນເກມ ເຊັ່ນ "
"ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ WASD, ເຊິ່ງມີພຽງແຕ່ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງປຸ່ມເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສຳຄັນ.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງ [InputEventKey] ທີ່ມະນຸດອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"OS.get_keycode_string] ຮ່ວມກັບ [method "
"DisplayServer.keyboard_get_keycode_from_physical] ຫຼື [method "
"DisplayServer.keyboard_get_label_from_physical]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the key's state is pressed. If [code]false[/code], the "
"key's state is released."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະຖານະຂອງປຸ່ມແມ່ນຖືກກົດ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ສະຖານະຂອງປຸ່ມແມ່ນຖືກປ່ອຍ."

msgid ""
"The key Unicode character code (when relevant), shifted by modifier keys. "
"Unicode character codes for composite characters and complex scripts may not "
"be available unless IME input mode is active. See [method "
"Window.set_ime_active] for more information. Unicode character codes are "
"meant for text input.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is set by the engine only for a pressed event. If "
"the event is sent by an IME or a virtual keyboard, no corresponding key "
"released event is sent."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ຂອງປຸ່ມ (ເມື່ອກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ), ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນ. ລະຫັດຕົວອັກສອນ "
"Unicode ສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນປະສົມ ແລະ ອັກສອນທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນອາດຈະບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ໂໝດການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ IME "
"ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ. ເບິ່ງ [method Window.set_ime_active] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ລະຫັດຕົວອັກສອນ "
"Unicode ມີໄວ້ສຳລັບການປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງໂດຍ engine ສະເພາະເຫດການການກົດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ຖ້າເຫດການຖືກສົ່ງໂດຍ IME ຫຼື ຄີບອດສະເມືອນ, ຈະບໍ່ມີການສົ່ງເຫດການການປ່ອຍປຸ່ມທີ່ກົງກັນ."

msgid "Represents a magnifying touch gesture."
msgstr "ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ທ່າທາງການສຳຜັດເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍ (magnifying gesture)."

msgid ""
"Stores the factor of a magnifying touch gesture. This is usually performed "
"when the user pinches the touch screen and used for zooming in/out.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android, this requires the [member "
"ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/android/enable_pan_and_scale_gestures] "
"project setting to be enabled."
msgstr ""
"ເກັບຄ່າປັດໄຈຂອງທ່າທາງການສຳຜັດເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍ. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃຊ້ສອງນິ້ວຈີບເຂົ້າ ຫຼື "
"ຖ່າງອອກໃນໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດ ແລະ ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຊູມເຂົ້າ/ອອກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Android, ອັນນີ້ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/android/enable_pan_and_scale_gestures]."

msgid ""
"The amount (or delta) of the event. This value is closer to [code]1.0[/code] "
"the slower the gesture is performed."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານ (ຫຼື delta) ຂອງເຫດການ. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະໃກ້ຄຽງກັບ [code]1.0[/code] ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ "
"ຖ້າປະຕິບັດທ່າທາງຊ້າລົງ."

msgid ""
"Represents a MIDI message from a MIDI device, such as a musical keyboard."
msgstr "ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມ MIDI ຈາກອຸປະກອນ MIDI ເຊັ່ນ ຄີບອດດົນຕີ."

msgid ""
"InputEventMIDI stores information about messages from [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MIDI]MIDI[/url] (Musical Instrument Digital Interface) "
"devices. These may include musical keyboards, synthesizers, and drum "
"machines.\n"
"MIDI messages can be received over a 5-pin MIDI connector or over USB. If "
"your device supports both be sure to check the settings in the device to see "
"which output it is using.\n"
"By default, Godot does not detect MIDI devices. You need to call [method "
"OS.open_midi_inputs], first. You can check which devices are detected with "
"[method OS.get_connected_midi_inputs], and close the connection with [method "
"OS.close_midi_inputs].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tOS.open_midi_inputs()\n"
"\tprint(OS.get_connected_midi_inputs())\n"
"\n"
"func _input(input_event):\n"
"\tif input_event is InputEventMIDI:\n"
"\t\t_print_midi_info(input_event)\n"
"\n"
"func _print_midi_info(midi_event):\n"
"\tprint(midi_event)\n"
"\tprint(\"Channel \", midi_event.channel)\n"
"\tprint(\"Message \", midi_event.message)\n"
"\tprint(\"Pitch \", midi_event.pitch)\n"
"\tprint(\"Velocity \", midi_event.velocity)\n"
"\tprint(\"Instrument \", midi_event.instrument)\n"
"\tprint(\"Pressure \", midi_event.pressure)\n"
"\tprint(\"Controller number: \", midi_event.controller_number)\n"
"\tprint(\"Controller value: \", midi_event.controller_value)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tOS.OpenMidiInputs();\n"
"\tGD.Print(OS.GetConnectedMidiInputs());\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent inputEvent)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (inputEvent is InputEventMidi midiEvent)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tPrintMIDIInfo(midiEvent);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void PrintMIDIInfo(InputEventMidi midiEvent)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print(midiEvent);\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Channel {midiEvent.Channel}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Message {midiEvent.Message}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Pitch {midiEvent.Pitch}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Velocity {midiEvent.Velocity}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Instrument {midiEvent.Instrument}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Pressure {midiEvent.Pressure}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Controller number: {midiEvent.ControllerNumber}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Controller value: {midiEvent.ControllerValue}\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot does not support MIDI output, so there is no way to emit "
"MIDI messages from Godot. Only MIDI input is supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On the Web platform, using MIDI input requires a browser "
"permission to be granted first. This permission request is performed when "
"calling [method OS.open_midi_inputs]. MIDI input will not work until the user "
"accepts the permission request."
msgstr ""
"InputEventMIDI ເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກອຸປະກອນ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"MIDI]MIDI[/url] (Musical Instrument Digital Interface). ເຊິ່ງອາດລວມມີ ຄີບອດດົນຕີ, "
"ຊິນທິໄຊເຊີ, ແລະ ເຄື່ອງເຮັດຈັງຫວະກອງ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມ MIDI ສາມາດຮັບໄດ້ຜ່ານຕົວເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ MIDI ແບບ 5 ພິນ ຫຼື ຜ່ານ USB. "
"ຖ້າອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານຮອງຮັບທັງສອງຢ່າງ "
"ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນອຸປະກອນເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າກຳລັງໃຊ້ການສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນໃດ.\n"
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ, Godot ຈະບໍ່ກວດຫາອຸປະກອນ MIDI. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"OS.open_midi_inputs] ກ່ອນ. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດເບິ່ງວ່າອຸປະກອນໃດທີ່ຖືກກວດພົບດ້ວຍ [method "
"OS.get_connected_midi_inputs], ແລະ ປິດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດ້ວຍ [method "
"OS.close_midi_inputs].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tOS.open_midi_inputs()\n"
"\tprint(OS.get_connected_midi_inputs())\n"
"\n"
"func _input(input_event):\n"
"\tif input_event is InputEventMIDI:\n"
"\t\t_print_midi_info(input_event)\n"
"\n"
"func _print_midi_info(midi_event):\n"
"\tprint(midi_event)\n"
"\tprint(\"ຊ່ອງ \", midi_event.channel)\n"
"\tprint(\"ຂໍ້ຄວາມ \", midi_event.message)\n"
"\tprint(\"ລະດັບສຽງ \", midi_event.pitch)\n"
"\tprint(\"ຄວາມແຮງ \", midi_event.velocity)\n"
"\tprint(\"ເຄື່ອງດົນຕີ \", midi_event.instrument)\n"
"\tprint(\"ແຮງກົດ \", midi_event.pressure)\n"
"\tprint(\"ໝາຍເລກຄອນໂທຣລເລີ: \", midi_event.controller_number)\n"
"\tprint(\"ຄ່າຄອນໂທຣລເລີ: \", midi_event.controller_value)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tOS.OpenMidiInputs();\n"
"\tGD.Print(OS.GetConnectedMidiInputs());\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent inputEvent)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (inputEvent is InputEventMidi midiEvent)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tPrintMIDIInfo(midiEvent);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void PrintMIDIInfo(InputEventMidi midiEvent)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print(midiEvent);\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"ຊ່ອງ {midiEvent.Channel}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"ຂໍ້ຄວາມ {midiEvent.Message}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"ລະດັບສຽງ {midiEvent.Pitch}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"ຄວາມແຮງ {midiEvent.Velocity}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"ເຄື່ອງດົນຕີ {midiEvent.Instrument}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"ແຮງກົດ {midiEvent.Pressure}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"ໝາຍເລກຄອນໂທຣລເລີ: {midiEvent.ControllerNumber}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"ຄ່າຄອນໂທຣລເລີ: {midiEvent.ControllerValue}\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Godot ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການສົ່ງອອກ MIDI, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ມີວິທີທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມ MIDI ອອກຈາກ "
"Godot ໄດ້. ຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່ການຮັບຂໍ້ມູນ MIDI ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນແພລັດຟອມເວັບ, ການໃຊ້ງານການຮັບຂໍ້ມູນ MIDI "
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸຍາດຈາກບຣາວເຊີກ່ອນ. ການຮ້ອງຂໍການອະນຸຍາດນີ້ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"OS.open_midi_inputs]. ການຮັບຂໍ້ມູນ MIDI ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຈົນກວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະຍອມຮັບການຮ້ອງຂໍການອະນຸຍາດ."

msgid "MIDI Message Status Byte List"
msgstr "ລາຍການ Status Byte ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ MIDI"

msgid "Wikipedia General MIDI Instrument List"
msgstr "ລາຍການເຄື່ອງດົນຕີ General MIDI ໃນ Wikipedia"

msgid "Wikipedia Piano Key Frequencies List"
msgstr "ລາຍການຄວາມຖີ່ຂອງປຸ່ມເປຍໂນໃນ Wikipedia"

msgid ""
"The MIDI channel of this message, ranging from [code]0[/code] to [code]15[/"
"code]. MIDI channel [code]9[/code] is reserved for percussion instruments."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງສັນຍານ (channel) MIDI ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້, ຕັ້ງແຕ່ [code]0[/code] ຫາ [code]15[/code]. "
"MIDI channel [code]9[/code] ແມ່ນຖືກສະຫງວນໄວ້ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງດົນຕີປະເພດເຄາະ."

msgid ""
"The unique number of the controller, if [member message] is [constant "
"MIDI_MESSAGE_CONTROL_CHANGE], otherwise this is [code]0[/code]. This value "
"can be used to identify sliders for volume, balance, and panning, as well as "
"switches and pedals on the MIDI device. See the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/General_MIDI#Controller_events]General MIDI specification[/url] for a "
"small list."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເລກສະເພາະຂອງຄອນໂທຣເລີ (controller), ຖ້າ [member message] ແມ່ນ [constant "
"MIDI_MESSAGE_CONTROL_CHANGE], ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເປັນ [code]0[/code]. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຕົວປັບ (sliders) ສຳລັບຄວາມແຮງສຽງ, ຄວາມສົມດຸນ, ແລະ panning, "
"ລວມທັງສະວິດ ແລະ ເພດັນ (pedals) ໃນອຸປະກອນ MIDI."

msgid ""
"The value applied to the controller. If [member message] is [constant "
"MIDI_MESSAGE_CONTROL_CHANGE], this value ranges from [code]0[/code] to "
"[code]127[/code], otherwise it is [code]0[/code]. See also [member "
"controller_value]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບຄອນໂທຣເລີ. ຖ້າ [member message] ແມ່ນ [constant "
"MIDI_MESSAGE_CONTROL_CHANGE], ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/code] ຫາ [code]127[/"
"code], ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເປັນ [code]0[/code]. ເບິ່ງ [member controller_value] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"The instrument (also called [i]program[/i] or [i]preset[/i]) used on this "
"MIDI message. This value ranges from [code]0[/code] to [code]127[/code].\n"
"To see what each value means, refer to the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"General_MIDI#Program_change_events]General MIDI's instrument list[/url]. Keep "
"in mind that the list is off by 1 because it does not begin from 0. A value "
"of [code]0[/code] corresponds to the acoustic grand piano."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງດົນຕີ (ຫຼື ເອີ້ນວ່າ [i]program[/i] ຫຼື [i]preset[/i]) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ MIDI ນີ້. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/code] ຫາ [code]127[/code].\n"
"ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າແຕ່ລະຄ່າໝາຍເຖິງຫຍັງ, ໃຫ້ອ້າງອີງເຖິງລາຍການເຄື່ອງດົນຕີຂອງ General MIDI. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າລາຍການອາດຈະຕ່າງກັນຢູ່ 1 ຄ່າ ເພາະບາງບ່ອນບໍ່ໄດ້ເລີ່ມຈາກ 0. ຄ່າ [code]0[/code] "
"ຈະກົງກັບ acoustic grand piano."

msgid ""
"Represents the type of MIDI message (see the [enum MIDIMessage] enum).\n"
"For more information, see the [url=https://www.midi.org/specifications-old/"
"item/table-2-expanded-messages-list-status-bytes]MIDI message status byte "
"list chart[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ປະເພດຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ MIDI (ເບິ່ງ enum [enum MIDIMessage]).\n"
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງຕາຕະລາງລາຍການ status byte ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ MIDI."

msgid ""
"The pitch index number of this MIDI message. This value ranges from [code]0[/"
"code] to [code]127[/code].\n"
"On a piano, the [b]middle C[/b] is [code]60[/code], followed by a [b]C-sharp[/"
"b] ([code]61[/code]), then a [b]D[/b] ([code]62[/code]), and so on. Each "
"octave is split in offsets of 12. See the \"MIDI note number\" column of the "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piano_key_frequencies]piano key frequency "
"chart[/url] a full list."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເລກລຳດັບສຽງ (pitch index) ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ MIDI ນີ້. ຄ່ານີ້ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/code] ຫາ "
"[code]127[/code].\n"
"ໃນເປຍໂນ, [b]middle C[/b] ແມ່ນ [code]60[/code], ຖັດມາແມ່ນ [b]C-sharp[/b] "
"([code]61[/code]), ແລ້ວແມ່ນ [b]D[/b] ([code]62[/code]), ແລະ ຕໍ່ໆໄປ. ແຕ່ລະຄູ່ແປດ "
"(octave) ຈະຖືກແຍກອອກເປັນ 12 ລຳດັບ."

msgid ""
"The strength of the key being pressed. This value ranges from [code]0[/code] "
"to [code]127[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For many devices, this value is always [code]0[/code]. Other "
"devices such as musical keyboards may simulate pressure by changing the "
"[member velocity], instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງ (pressure) ຂອງປຸ່ມທີ່ຖືກກົດ. ຄ່ານີ້ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/code] ຫາ [code]127[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບຫຼາຍອຸປະກອນ, ຄ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນ [code]0[/code] ສະເໝີ. ອຸປະກອນອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ "
"ຄີບອດດົນຕີ ອາດຈະຈຳລອງແຮງກົດໂດຍການປ່ຽນແປງ [member velocity] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The velocity of the MIDI message. This value ranges from [code]0[/code] to "
"[code]127[/code]. For a musical keyboard, this corresponds to how quickly the "
"key was pressed, and is rarely above [code]110[/code] in practice.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some MIDI devices may send a [constant MIDI_MESSAGE_NOTE_ON] "
"message with [code]0[/code] velocity and expect it to be treated the same as "
"a [constant MIDI_MESSAGE_NOTE_OFF] message. If necessary, this can be handled "
"with a few lines of code:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMIDI:\n"
"\t\tif event.message == MIDI_MESSAGE_NOTE_ON and event.velocity > 0:\n"
"\t\t\tprint(\"Note pressed!\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວ (velocity) ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ MIDI. ຄ່ານີ້ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/code] ຫາ [code]127[/"
"code]. ສຳລັບຄີບອດດົນຕີ, ອັນນີ້ກົງກັບຄວາມໄວໃນການກົດປຸ່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອຸປະກອນ MIDI ບາງຢ່າງອາດສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມ [constant MIDI_MESSAGE_NOTE_ON] "
"ທີ່ມີ velocity ເປັນ [code]0[/code] ແລະ ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຖືວ່າຄືກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ [constant "
"MIDI_MESSAGE_NOTE_OFF]."

msgid "Base input event type for mouse events."
msgstr "ປະເພດເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານສຳລັບເຫດການເມົາ."

msgid "Stores general information about mouse events."
msgstr "ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທົ່ວໄປກ່ຽວກັບເຫດການເມົາ."

msgid ""
"The mouse button mask identifier, one of or a bitwise combination of the "
"[enum MouseButton] button masks."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວລະບຸໜ້າກາກປຸ່ມເມົາ (mouse button mask), ແມ່ນໜຶ່ງໃນ ຫຼື ການລວມກັນແບບ bitwise ຂອງໜ້າກາກປຸ່ມ "
"[enum MouseButton]."

msgid ""
"When received in [method Node._input] or [method Node._unhandled_input], "
"returns the mouse's position in the root [Viewport] using the coordinate "
"system of the root [Viewport].\n"
"When received in [method Control._gui_input], returns the mouse's position in "
"the [CanvasLayer] that the [Control] is in using the coordinate system of the "
"[CanvasLayer]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບໃນ [method Node._input] ຫຼື [method Node._unhandled_input], "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເມົາໃນ root [Viewport] ໂດຍໃຊ້ລະບົບພິກັດຂອງ root [Viewport].\n"
"ເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບໃນ [method Control._gui_input], ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເມົາໃນ [CanvasLayer] ທີ່ "
"[Control] ນັ້ນຢູ່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ລະບົບພິກັດຂອງ [CanvasLayer]."

msgid ""
"When received in [method Node._input] or [method Node._unhandled_input], "
"returns the mouse's position in the [Viewport] this [Node] is in using the "
"coordinate system of this [Viewport].\n"
"When received in [method Control._gui_input], returns the mouse's position in "
"the [Control] using the local coordinate system of the [Control]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບໃນ [method Node._input] ຫຼື [method Node._unhandled_input], "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເມົາໃນ [Viewport] ທີ່ [Node] ນີ້ຢູ່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ລະບົບພິກັດຂອງ [Viewport] ນັ້ນ.\n"
"ເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບໃນ [method Control._gui_input], ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເມົາໃນ [Control] "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ລະບົບພິກັດພາຍໃນ (local coordinate system) ຂອງ [Control]."

msgid "Represents a mouse button being pressed or released."
msgstr "ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ປຸ່ມເມົາທີ່ຖືກກົດ ຫຼື ຖືກປ່ອຍ."

msgid ""
"Stores information about mouse click events. See [method Node._input].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Wear OS devices, rotary input is mapped to [constant "
"MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_UP] and [constant MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_DOWN]. This can be "
"changed to [constant MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_LEFT] and [constant "
"MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_RIGHT] with the [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/"
"pointing/android/rotary_input_scroll_axis] setting."
msgstr ""
"ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບເຫດການການຄລິກເມົາ. ເບິ່ງ [method Node._input].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນອຸປະກອນ Wear OS, ການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນແບບໝູນ (rotary input) ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ "
"[constant MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_UP] ແລະ [constant MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_DOWN]."

msgid "Mouse and input coordinates"
msgstr "ພິກັດເມົາ ແລະ ການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ"

msgid ""
"The mouse button identifier, one of the [enum MouseButton] button or button "
"wheel constants."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວລະບຸປຸ່ມເມົາ, ແມ່ນໜຶ່ງໃນຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຂອງປຸ່ມ ຫຼື ລໍ້ໝູນເມົາ (button wheel) ຂອງ [enum MouseButton]."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the mouse button event has been canceled."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເຫດການປຸ່ມເມົາຖືກຍົກເລີກ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the mouse button's state is a double-click."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະຖານະຂອງປຸ່ມເມົາແມ່ນການດັບເບີລຄລິກ (double-click)."

msgid ""
"The amount (or delta) of the event. When used for high-precision scroll "
"events, this indicates the scroll amount (vertical or horizontal). This is "
"only supported on some platforms; the reported sensitivity varies depending "
"on the platform. May be [code]0[/code] if not supported."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານ (ຫຼື delta) ຂອງເຫດການ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບເຫດການການເລື່ອນ (scroll) ທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດສູງ, "
"ອັນນີ້ຈະບົ່ງບອກເຖິງປະລິມານການເລື່ອນ (ທາງຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ທາງນອນ). ອັນນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະບາງແພລັດຟອມເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the mouse button's state is pressed. If [code]false[/"
"code], the mouse button's state is released."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະຖານະຂອງປຸ່ມເມົາແມ່ນຖືກກົດ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ສະຖານະຂອງປຸ່ມເມົາແມ່ນຖືກປ່ອຍ."

msgid "Represents a mouse or a pen movement."
msgstr "ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງເມົາ ຫຼື ປາກກາ (pen)."

msgid ""
"Stores information about a mouse or a pen motion. This includes relative "
"position, absolute position, and velocity. See [method Node._input].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default, this event is only emitted once per frame rendered "
"at most. If you need more precise input reporting, set [member "
"Input.use_accumulated_input] to [code]false[/code] to make events emitted as "
"often as possible. If you use InputEventMouseMotion to draw lines, consider "
"using [method Geometry2D.bresenham_line] as well to avoid visible gaps in "
"lines if the user is moving the mouse quickly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This event may be emitted even when the mouse hasn't moved, "
"either by the operating system or by Godot itself. If you really need to know "
"if the mouse has moved (e.g. to suppress displaying a tooltip), you should "
"check that [code]relative.is_zero_approx()[/code] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງເມົາ ຫຼື ປາກກາ. ອັນນີ້ລວມມີຕຳແໜ່ງສຳພັດ (relative position), "
"ຕຳແໜ່ງສຳບູນ (absolute position), ແລະ ຄວາມໄວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຫດການນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກສູງສຸດພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວຕໍ່ເຟຣມ. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການການລາຍງານທີ່ລະອຽດກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [member Input.use_accumulated_input] ເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] when using the eraser end of a stylus pen.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is implemented on Linux, macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ດ້ານຢາງລົບຂອງປາກກາສະໄຕລັສ (stylus pen).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Linux, macOS ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Represents the pressure the user puts on the pen. Ranges from [code]0.0[/"
"code] to [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ແຮງກົດທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກົດລົງໃສ່ປາກກາ. ມີຄ່າຕັ້ງແຕ່ [code]0.0[/code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"The mouse position relative to the previous position (position at the last "
"frame).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Since [InputEventMouseMotion] may only be emitted when the mouse "
"moves, it is not possible to reliably detect when the mouse has stopped "
"moving by checking this property. A separate, short timer may be necessary.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member relative] is automatically scaled according to the "
"content scale factor, which is defined by the project's stretch mode "
"settings. This means mouse sensitivity will appear different depending on "
"resolution when using [member relative] in a script that handles mouse aiming "
"with the [constant Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED] mouse mode. To avoid this, use "
"[member screen_relative] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເມົາເມື່ອທຽບກັບຕຳແໜ່ງກ່ອນໜ້າ (ຕຳແໜ່ງໃນເຟຣມຫຼ້າສຸດ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member relative] ຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມ content scale factor. "
"ອັນນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄວາມໄວເມົາອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຕ່າງກັນຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມລະອຽດໜ້າຈໍ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[member screen_relative] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The unscaled mouse position relative to the previous position in the "
"coordinate system of the screen (position at the last frame).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Since [InputEventMouseMotion] may only be emitted when the mouse "
"moves, it is not possible to reliably detect when the mouse has stopped "
"moving by checking this property. A separate, short timer may be necessary.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This coordinate is [i]not[/i] scaled according to the content "
"scale factor or calls to [method InputEvent.xformed_by]. This should be "
"preferred over [member relative] for mouse aiming when using the [constant "
"Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED] mouse mode, regardless of the project's stretch "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເມົາທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ປັບຂະໜາດ (unscaled) ເມື່ອທຽບກັບຕຳແໜ່ງກ່ອນໜ້າໃນລະບົບພິກັດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ພິກັດນີ້ [i]ບໍ່ໄດ້[/i] ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດຕາມ content scale factor. "
"ຄວນເລືອກໃຊ້ອັນນີ້ແທນ [member relative] ສຳລັບການເລັງເມົາເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ [constant "
"Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED]."

msgid ""
"The unscaled mouse velocity in pixels per second in screen coordinates. This "
"velocity is [i]not[/i] scaled according to the content scale factor or calls "
"to [method InputEvent.xformed_by].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [constant Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED] mode, [member "
"screen_velocity] returns [code](0, 0)[/code] because the mouse cursor is "
"hidden and locked. Use [member screen_relative] for mouse aiming using the "
"[constant Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED] mouse mode."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວຂອງເມົາທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ປັບຂະໜາດ ເປັນພິກເຊວຕໍ່ວິນາທີໃນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນໂໝດ [constant Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED], [member "
"screen_velocity] ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code](0, 0)[/code]. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member screen_relative] "
"ແທນສຳລັບການເລັງເມົາ."

msgid ""
"Represents the angles of tilt of the pen. Positive X-coordinate value "
"indicates a tilt to the right. Positive Y-coordinate value indicates a tilt "
"toward the user. Ranges from [code]-1.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code] for both "
"axes."
msgstr ""
"ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ມຸມອຽງຂອງປາກກາ. ຄ່າ X ເປັນບວກໝາຍເຖິງການອຽງໄປທາງຂວາ. ຄ່າ Y "
"ເປັນບວກໝາຍເຖິງການອຽງມາຫາຜູ້ໃຊ້. ມີຄ່າຕັ້ງແຕ່ [code]-1.0[/code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ສຳລັບທັງສອງແກນ."

msgid ""
"The mouse velocity in pixels per second.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member velocity] is automatically scaled according to the "
"content scale factor, which is defined by the project's stretch mode "
"settings. That means mouse sensitivity may appear different depending on "
"resolution.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [constant Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED] mode, [member velocity] "
"returns [code](0, 0)[/code] because the mouse cursor is hidden and locked. "
"Use [member screen_relative] for mouse aiming using the [constant "
"Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED] mouse mode."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວຂອງເມົາເປັນພິກເຊວຕໍ່ວິນາທີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member velocity] ຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມ content scale factor. "
"ອັນນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄວາມໄວເມົາອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຕ່າງກັນຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມລະອຽດໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid "Represents a panning touch gesture."
msgstr "ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ທ່າທາງການສຳຜັດເພື່ອເລື່ອນ (pan gesture)."

msgid ""
"Stores information about pan gestures. A pan gesture is performed when the "
"user swipes the touch screen with two fingers. It's typically used for "
"panning/scrolling.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android, this requires the [member "
"ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/android/enable_pan_and_scale_gestures] "
"project setting to be enabled."
msgstr ""
"ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບທ່າທາງການເລື່ອນ (pan gestures). ທ່າທາງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ປັດໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດດ້ວຍສອງນິ້ວ. "
"ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເລື່ອນໜ້າ (panning/scrolling)."

msgid "Panning amount since last pan event."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການເລື່ອນ ນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ເຫດການເລື່ອນຄັ້ງຫຼ້າສຸດ."

msgid "Represents a screen drag event."
msgstr "ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ເຫດການການລາກເທິງໜ້າຈໍ (screen drag)."

msgid "Stores information about screen drag events. See [method Node._input]."
msgstr "ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບເຫດການການລາກເທິງໜ້າຈໍ. ເບິ່ງ [method Node._input]."

msgid "The drag event index in the case of a multi-drag event."
msgstr "ລຳດັບ (index) ຂອງເຫດການລາກ ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີການລາກຫຼາຍຈຸດພ້ອມກັນ (multi-drag)."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] when using the eraser end of a stylus pen."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ດ້ານຢາງລົບຂອງປາກກາສະໄຕລັສ (stylus pen)."

msgid ""
"The drag position in the viewport the node is in, using the coordinate system "
"of this viewport."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງການລາກໃນ viewport ທີ່ node ນັ້ນຢູ່, ໂດຍໃຊ້ລະບົບພິກັດຂອງ viewport ນີ້."

msgid ""
"The drag position relative to the previous position (position at the last "
"frame).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member relative] is automatically scaled according to the "
"content scale factor, which is defined by the project's stretch mode "
"settings. This means touch sensitivity will appear different depending on "
"resolution when using [member relative] in a script that handles touch "
"aiming. To avoid this, use [member screen_relative] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງການລາກເມື່ອທຽບກັບຕຳແໜ່ງກ່ອນໜ້າ (ຕຳແໜ່ງໃນເຟຣມຫຼ້າສຸດ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member relative] ຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມ content scale factor. "
"ຄວາມໄວການສຳຜັດອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຕ່າງກັນຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມລະອຽດໜ້າຈໍ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member screen_relative] "
"ແທນເພື່ອຄວາມແນ່ນອນ."

msgid ""
"The unscaled drag position relative to the previous position in screen "
"coordinates (position at the last frame). This position is [i]not[/i] scaled "
"according to the content scale factor or calls to [method "
"InputEvent.xformed_by]. This should be preferred over [member relative] for "
"touch aiming regardless of the project's stretch mode."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງການລາກທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ປັບຂະໜາດ ເມື່ອທຽບກັບຕຳແໜ່ງກ່ອນໜ້າໃນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍ. ພິກັດນີ້ [i]ບໍ່ໄດ້[/i] "
"ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດຕາມ content scale factor. ຄວນເລືອກໃຊ້ອັນນີ້ແທນ [member relative] "
"ສຳລັບການເລັງດ້ວຍການສຳຜັດ."

msgid ""
"The unscaled drag velocity in pixels per second in screen coordinates. This "
"velocity is [i]not[/i] scaled according to the content scale factor or calls "
"to [method InputEvent.xformed_by]. This should be preferred over [member "
"velocity] for touch aiming regardless of the project's stretch mode."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວການລາກທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ປັບຂະໜາດ ເປັນພິກເຊວຕໍ່ວິນາທີໃນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍ. ຄ່ານີ້ [i]ບໍ່ໄດ້[/i] ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດຕາມ "
"content scale factor."

msgid ""
"The drag velocity.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member velocity] is automatically scaled according to the "
"content scale factor, which is defined by the project's stretch mode "
"settings. This means touch sensitivity will appear different depending on "
"resolution when using [member velocity] in a script that handles touch "
"aiming. To avoid this, use [member screen_velocity] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວໃນການລາກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member velocity] ຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມ content scale factor. "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member screen_velocity] ແທນສຳລັບການເລັງດ້ວຍການສຳຜັດ."

msgid "Represents a screen touch event."
msgstr "ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ເຫດການການສຳຜັດໜ້າຈໍ (screen touch)."

msgid ""
"Stores information about multi-touch press/release input events. Supports "
"touch press, touch release and [member index] for multi-touch count and order."
msgstr ""
"ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບເຫດການການກົດ/ປ່ອຍສຳຜັດຫຼາຍຈຸດ (multi-touch). ຮອງຮັບການກົດສຳຜັດ, ການປ່ອຍສຳຜັດ "
"ແລະ [member index] ສຳລັບຈຳນວນ ແລະ ລຳດັບຂອງການສຳຜັດຫຼາຍຈຸດ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the touch event has been canceled."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເຫດການສຳຜັດຖືກຍົກເລີກ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the touch's state is a double tap."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະຖານະຂອງການສຳຜັດແມ່ນການແຕະສອງຄັ້ງ (double tap)."

msgid ""
"The touch index in the case of a multi-touch event. One index = one finger."
msgstr "ລຳດັບ (index) ຂອງການສຳຜັດໃນກໍລະນີເຫດການສຳຜັດຫຼາຍຈຸດ. ໜຶ່ງ index = ໜຶ່ງນິ້ວ."

msgid ""
"The touch position in the viewport the node is in, using the coordinate "
"system of this viewport."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງການສຳຜັດໃນ viewport ທີ່ node ນັ້ນຢູ່, ໂດຍໃຊ້ລະບົບພິກັດຂອງ viewport ນີ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the touch's state is pressed. If [code]false[/code], "
"the touch's state is released."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະຖານະຂອງການສຳຜັດແມ່ນຖືກກົດ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ສະຖານະຂອງການສຳຜັດແມ່ນຖືກປ່ອຍ."

msgid "Represents a triggered keyboard [Shortcut]."
msgstr "ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ປຸ່ມລັດຄີບອດ [Shortcut] ທີ່ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"InputEventShortcut is a special event that can be received in [method "
"Node._input], [method Node._shortcut_input], and [method "
"Node._unhandled_input]. It is typically sent by the editor's Command Palette "
"to trigger actions, but can also be sent manually using [method "
"Viewport.push_input]."
msgstr ""
"InputEventShortcut ແມ່ນເຫດການພິເສດທີ່ສາມາດຮັບໄດ້ໃນ [method Node._input], [method "
"Node._shortcut_input], ແລະ [method Node._unhandled_input]. "
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວມັນຈະຖືກສົ່ງໂດຍ Command Palette ຂອງ editor ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານການກະທຳຕ່າງໆ."

msgid ""
"The [Shortcut] represented by this event. Its [method Shortcut.matches_event] "
"method will always return [code]true[/code] for this event."
msgstr ""
"[Shortcut] ທີ່ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ໂດຍເຫດການນີ້. ວິທີ [method Shortcut.matches_event] ຂອງມັນຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[code]true[/code] ສະເໝີສຳລັບເຫດການນີ້."

msgid ""
"Abstract base class for input events affected by modifier keys like "
"[kbd]Shift[/kbd] and [kbd]Alt[/kbd]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານນາມມະທຳສຳລັບເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຜົນມາຈາກປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນ (modifier keys) ເຊັ່ນ "
"[kbd]Shift[/kbd] ແລະ [kbd]Alt[/kbd]."

msgid ""
"Stores information about mouse, keyboard, and touch gesture input events. "
"This includes information about which modifier keys are pressed, such as "
"[kbd]Shift[/kbd] or [kbd]Alt[/kbd]. See [method Node._input].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Modifier keys are considered modifiers only when used in "
"combination with another key. As a result, their corresponding member "
"variables, such as [member ctrl_pressed], will return [code]false[/code] if "
"the key is pressed on its own."
msgstr ""
"ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຂອງເມົາ, ຄີບອດ, ແລະ ທ່າທາງການສຳຜັດ. "
"ອັນນີ້ລວມມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວ່າປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນໃດທີ່ຖືກກົດຢູ່ ເຊັ່ນ [kbd]Shift[/kbd] ຫຼື [kbd]Alt[/kbd].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບປຸ່ມອື່ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ເຊັ່ນ [member ctrl_pressed] ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]false[/code] "
"ຖ້າປຸ່ມນັ້ນຖືກກົດດ້ວຍຕົວມັນເອງ."

msgid "Returns the keycode combination of modifier keys."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າການລວມລະຫັດປຸ່ມ (keycode combination) ຂອງປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນ."

msgid ""
"On macOS, returns [code]true[/code] if [kbd]Meta[/kbd] ([kbd]Cmd[/kbd]) is "
"pressed.\n"
"On other platforms, returns [code]true[/code] if [kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] is pressed."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ macOS, ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [kbd]Meta[/kbd] ([kbd]Cmd[/kbd]) ຖືກກົດ.\n"
"ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ, ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] ຖືກກົດ."

msgid "State of the [kbd]Alt[/kbd] modifier."
msgstr "ສະຖານະຂອງປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນ [kbd]Alt[/kbd]."

msgid ""
"Automatically use [kbd]Meta[/kbd] ([kbd]Cmd[/kbd]) on macOS and [kbd]Ctrl[/"
"kbd] on other platforms. If [code]true[/code], [member ctrl_pressed] and "
"[member meta_pressed] cannot be set."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ [kbd]Meta[/kbd] ([kbd]Cmd[/kbd]) ອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນ macOS ແລະ [kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] "
"ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [member ctrl_pressed] ແລະ [member "
"meta_pressed] ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້."

msgid "State of the [kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] modifier."
msgstr "ສະຖານະຂອງປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນ [kbd]Ctrl[/kbd]."

msgid ""
"State of the [kbd]Meta[/kbd] modifier. On Windows and Linux, this represents "
"the Windows key (sometimes called \"meta\" or \"super\" on Linux). On macOS, "
"this represents the Command key."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖານະຂອງປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນ [kbd]Meta[/kbd]. ໃນ Windows ແລະ Linux, ອັນນີ້ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ປຸ່ມ Windows "
"(ບາງຄັ້ງເອີ້ນວ່າ \"meta\" ຫຼື \"super\" ໃນ Linux). ໃນ macOS, ອັນນີ້ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ປຸ່ມ Command."

msgid "State of the [kbd]Shift[/kbd] modifier."
msgstr "ສະຖານະຂອງປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນ [kbd]Shift[/kbd]."

msgid "A singleton that manages all [InputEventAction]s."
msgstr "ຊິງເກິລຕັນ (Singleton) ທີ່ຈັດການ [InputEventAction] ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Manages all [InputEventAction] which can be created/modified from the project "
"settings menu [b]Project > Project Settings > Input Map[/b] or in code with "
"[method add_action] and [method action_add_event]. See [method Node._input]."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດການ [InputEventAction] ທັງໝົດ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດສ້າງ/ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຈາກເມນູການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການ "
"[b]Project > Project Settings > Input Map[/b] ຫຼື ຜ່ານໂຄ້ດດ້ວຍ [method add_action] "
"ແລະ [method action_add_event]."

msgid "Using InputEvent: InputMap"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ InputEvent: InputMap"

msgid ""
"Adds an [InputEvent] to an action. This [InputEvent] will trigger the action."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ [InputEvent] ໃຫ້ກັບການກະທຳ (action). [InputEvent] ນີ້ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານການກະທຳນັ້ນ."

msgid "Removes an [InputEvent] from an action."
msgstr "ລຶບ [InputEvent] ອອກຈາກການກະທຳ."

msgid "Removes all events from an action."
msgstr "ລຶບເຫດການທັງໝົດອອກຈາກການກະທຳ."

msgid "Returns a deadzone value for the action."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ deadzone ສຳລັບການກະທຳ."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of [InputEvent]s associated with a given action.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When used in the editor (e.g. a tool script or [EditorPlugin]), "
"this method will return events for the editor action. If you want to access "
"your project's input binds from the editor, read the [code]input/*[/code] "
"settings from [ProjectSettings]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າອາເຣ (array) ຂອງ [InputEvent] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການກະທຳທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ editor, ວິທີນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າເຫດການສຳລັບການກະທຳຂອງ editor. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າປຸ່ມຂອງໂຄງການຈາກ editor, ໃຫ້ອ່ານການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [code]input/*[/"
"code] ຈາກ [ProjectSettings]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the action has the given [InputEvent] associated "
"with it."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າການກະທຳນັ້ນມີ [InputEvent] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງນຳ."

msgid "Sets a deadzone value for the action."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ deadzone ສຳລັບການກະທຳ."

msgid ""
"Adds an empty action to the [InputMap] with a configurable [param deadzone].\n"
"An [InputEvent] can then be added to this action with [method "
"action_add_event]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມການກະທຳຫວ່າງເປົ່າເຂົ້າໃນ [InputMap] ພ້ອມກັບຄ່າ [param deadzone] ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້.\n"
"ຈາກນັ້ນສາມາດເພີ່ມ [InputEvent] ໃຫ້ກັບການກະທຳນີ້ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method action_add_event]."

msgid "Removes an action from the [InputMap]."
msgstr "ລຶບການກະທຳອອກຈາກ [InputMap]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given event is part of an existing action. "
"This method ignores keyboard modifiers if the given [InputEvent] is not "
"pressed (for proper release detection). See [method action_has_event] if you "
"don't want this behavior.\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເຫດການທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງການກະທຳທີ່ມີຢູ່. "
"ວິທີນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນຄີບອດຖ້າ [InputEvent] ນັ້ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກົດ (ເພື່ອການກວດສອບການປ່ອຍປຸ່ມທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ).\n"
"ຖ້າ [param exact_match] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈປຸ່ມປັບປ່ຽນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບເຫດການ [InputEventKey] ແລະ [InputEventMouseButton], "
"ແລະ ບໍ່ສົນໃຈທິດທາງສຳລັບເຫດການ [InputEventJoypadMotion]."

msgid "Returns the human-readable description of the given action."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຄຳອະທິບາຍຂອງການກະທຳທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ມະນຸດອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້."

msgid "Returns an array of all actions in the [InputMap]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າອາເຣຂອງການກະທຳທັງໝົດໃນ [InputMap]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [InputMap] has a registered action with the "
"given name."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [InputMap] ມີການລົງທະບຽນການກະທຳດ້ວຍຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Clears all [InputEventAction] in the [InputMap] and load it anew from "
"[ProjectSettings]."
msgstr "ລຶບ [InputEventAction] ທັງໝົດໃນ [InputMap] ແລະ ໂຫຼດໃໝ່ຈາກ [ProjectSettings]."

msgid "Emitted when the [ProjectSettings] [InputMap] has been loaded."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອ [InputMap] ຂອງ [ProjectSettings] ຖືກໂຫຼດສຳເລັດ."

msgid "Placeholder for the root [Node] of a [PackedScene]."
msgstr "ຕົວແທນ (Placeholder) ສຳລັບ root [Node] ຂອງ [PackedScene]."

msgid ""
"Turning on the option [b]Load As Placeholder[/b] for an instantiated scene in "
"the editor causes it to be replaced by an [InstancePlaceholder] when running "
"the game, this will not replace the node in the editor. This makes it "
"possible to delay actually loading the scene until calling [method "
"create_instance]. This is useful to avoid loading large scenes all at once by "
"loading parts of it selectively.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Like [Node], [InstancePlaceholder] does not have a transform. "
"This causes any child nodes to be positioned relatively to the [Viewport] "
"origin, rather than their parent as displayed in the editor. Replacing the "
"placeholder with a scene with a transform will transform children relatively "
"to their parent again."
msgstr ""
"ການເປີດຕົວເລືອກ [b]Load As Placeholder[/b] ສຳລັບສາກ (scene) ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ editor "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍ [InstancePlaceholder] ເມື່ອເປີດເກມ. "
"ອັນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເລື່ອນເວລາການໂຫຼດສາກຕົວຈິງອອກໄປຈົນກວ່າຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method create_instance]. "
"ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຫຼີກເວັ້ນການໂຫຼດສາກຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທັງໝົດໃນບາດດຽວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບ [Node], [InstancePlaceholder] ບໍ່ມີ transform "
"(ການປ່ຽນແປງຕຳແໜ່ງ, ໝູນ, ປັບຂະໜາດ)."

msgid ""
"Call this method to actually load in the node. The created node will be "
"placed as a sibling [i]above[/i] the [InstancePlaceholder] in the scene tree. "
"The [Node]'s reference is also returned for convenience.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method create_instance] is not thread-safe. Use [method "
"Object.call_deferred] if calling from a thread."
msgstr ""
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ເພື່ອໂຫຼດ node ເຂົ້າມາແທ້ໆ. node ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ເປັນ sibling [i]ທາງເທິງ[/i] "
"ຂອງ [InstancePlaceholder] ໃນ scene tree.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method create_instance] ບໍ່ແມ່ນ thread-safe. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"Object.call_deferred] ຖ້າເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຈາກ thread."

msgid ""
"Gets the path to the [PackedScene] resource file that is loaded by default "
"when calling [method create_instance]. Not thread-safe. Use [method "
"Object.call_deferred] if calling from a thread."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງເອົາເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [PackedScene] ທີ່ຖືກໂຫຼດໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method create_instance]."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of properties that will be applied to the node when [method "
"create_instance] is called.\n"
"If [param with_order] is [code]true[/code], a key named [code].order[/code] "
"(note the leading period) is added to the dictionary. This [code].order[/"
"code] key is an [Array] of [String] property names specifying the order in "
"which properties will be applied (with index 0 being the first)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດ (properties) ທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບ node ເມື່ອ [method create_instance] "
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param with_order] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄີທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [code].order[/code] "
"ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ dictionary."

msgid "A built-in type for integers."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນໃນຕົວ (built-in type) ສຳລັບຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ (integers)."

msgid ""
"Signed 64-bit integer type. This means that it can take values from "
"[code]-2^63[/code] to [code]2^63 - 1[/code], i.e. from "
"[code]-9223372036854775808[/code] to [code]9223372036854775807[/code]. When "
"it exceeds these bounds, it will wrap around.\n"
"[int]s can be automatically converted to [float]s when necessary, for example "
"when passing them as arguments in functions. The [float] will be as close to "
"the original integer as possible.\n"
"Likewise, [float]s can be automatically converted into [int]s. This will "
"truncate the [float], discarding anything after the floating-point.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, an [int] will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if it equals [code]0[/code], and to [code]true[/code] otherwise.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var x: int = 1 # x is 1\n"
"x = 4.2 # x is 4, because 4.2 gets truncated\n"
"var max_int = 9223372036854775807 # Biggest value an int can store\n"
"max_int += 1 # max_int is -9223372036854775808, because it wrapped around\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"int x = 1; // x is 1\n"
"x = (int)4.2; // x is 4, because 4.2 gets truncated\n"
"// We use long below, because GDScript's int is 64-bit while C#'s int is 32-"
"bit.\n"
"long maxLong = 9223372036854775807; // Biggest value a long can store\n"
"maxLong++; // maxLong is now -9223372036854775808, because it wrapped "
"around.\n"
"\n"
"// Alternatively with C#'s 32-bit int type, which has a smaller maximum "
"value.\n"
"int maxInt = 2147483647; // Biggest value an int can store\n"
"maxInt++; // maxInt is now -2147483648, because it wrapped around\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"You can use the [code]0b[/code] literal for binary representation, the "
"[code]0x[/code] literal for hexadecimal representation, and the [code]_[/"
"code] symbol to separate long numbers and improve readability.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var x = 0b1001 # x is 9\n"
"var y = 0xF5 # y is 245\n"
"var z = 10_000_000 # z is 10000000\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"int x = 0b1001; // x is 9\n"
"int y = 0xF5; // y is 245\n"
"int z = 10_000_000; // z is 10000000\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ 64 ບິດ (Signed 64-bit integer). ອັນນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນສາມາດຮັບຄ່າໄດ້ຕັ້ງແຕ່ "
"[code]-2^63[/code] ຫາ [code]2^63 - 1[/code]. ເມື່ອຄ່າເກີນຂອບເຂດເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ມັນຈະໝູນກັບຄືນ "
"(wrap around).\n"
"[int] ສາມາດຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນ [float] ໄດ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຈຳເປັນ. ໃນທາງກັບກັນ, [float] "
"ກໍສາມາດຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນ [int] ໄດ້ ໂດຍຈະເປັນການຕັດເສດທົດສະນິຍົມອອກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງບູລີນ (boolean), [int] ຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ຖ້າເທົ່າກັບ [code]0[/code], ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code].\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [code]0b[/code] ສຳລັບເລກຖານສອງ, [code]0x[/code] ສຳລັບເລກຖານສິບຫົກ, ແລະ "
"ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ [code]_[/code] ເພື່ອແຍກຕົວເລກຍາວໆໃຫ້ອ່ານງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Constructs an [int] set to [code]0[/code]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [int] ທີ່ມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ [code]0[/code]."

msgid "Constructs an [int] as a copy of the given [int]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [int] ໂດຍການສຳເນົາຄ່າຈາກ [int] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Constructs a new [int] from a [String], following the same rules as [method "
"String.to_int]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [int] ໃໝ່ຈາກ [String], ໂດຍໃຊ້ກົດເກນດຽວກັບ [method String.to_int]."

msgid ""
"Constructs a new [int] from a [bool]. [code]true[/code] is converted to "
"[code]1[/code] and [code]false[/code] is converted to [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [int] ໃໝ່ຈາກ [bool]. [code]true[/code] ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]1[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]false[/code] ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]0[/code]."

msgid ""
"Constructs a new [int] from a [float]. This will truncate the [float], "
"discarding anything after the floating point."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [int] ໃໝ່ຈາກ [float]. ອັນນີ້ຈະເປັນການຕັດເສດທົດສະນິຍົມອອກ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the [int] is not equivalent to the [float]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [int] ບໍ່ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [float]."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the [int]s are not equal."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [int] ທັງສອງມີຄ່າບໍ່ເທົ່າກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the remainder after dividing two [int]s. Uses truncated division, "
"which returns a negative number if the dividend is negative. If this is not "
"desired, consider using [method @GlobalScope.posmod].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(6 % 2) # Prints 0\n"
"print(11 % 4) # Prints 3\n"
"print(-5 % 3) # Prints -2\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເສດທີ່ເຫຼືອຈາກການຫານ [int] ສອງຕົວ (modulo). ໃຊ້ການຫານແບບຕັດເສດ (truncated "
"division) ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນລົບຖ້າຕົວຕັ້ງຫານເປັນລົບ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(6 % 2) # ສະແດງຜົນ 0\n"
"print(11 % 4) # ສະແດງຜົນ 3\n"
"print(-5 % 3) # ສະແດງຜົນ -2\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Performs the bitwise [code]AND[/code] operation.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0b1100 & 0b1010) # Prints 8 (binary 1000)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"This is useful for retrieving binary flags from a variable.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var flags = 0b101\n"
"# Check if the first or second bit are enabled.\n"
"if flags & 0b011:\n"
"\tdo_stuff() # This line will run.\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການທາງບິດ [code]AND[/code] (bitwise AND).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0b1100 & 0b1010) # ສະແດງຜົນ 8 (ຖານສອງ 1000)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການກວດສອບບິດແຟລັກ (binary flags) ຈາກຕົວປ່ຽນ."

msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Color] by the [int]."
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Color] ດ້ວຍ [int]."

msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Quaternion] by the [int]. This operation is "
"not meaningful on its own, but it can be used as a part of a larger "
"expression."
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Quaternion] ດ້ວຍ [int]."

msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Vector2] by the [int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(2 * Vector2(1, 4)) # Prints (2, 8)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector2] ດ້ວຍ [int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(2 * Vector2(1, 4)) # ສະແດງຜົນ (2, 8)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Vector2i] by the [int]."
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector2i] ດ້ວຍ [int]."

msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Vector3] by the [int]."
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector3] ດ້ວຍ [int]."

msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Vector3i] by the [int]."
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector3i] ດ້ວຍ [int]."

msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Vector4] by the [int]."
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4] ດ້ວຍ [int]."

msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Vector4i] by the [int]."
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4i] ດ້ວຍ [int]."

msgid "Multiplies the [float] by the [int]. The result is a [float]."
msgstr "ຄູນ [float] ດ້ວຍ [int]. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະເປັນ [float]."

msgid "Multiplies the two [int]s."
msgstr "ຄູນ [int] ສອງຕົວເຂົ້າກັນ."

msgid ""
"Raises an [int] to a power of a [float]. The result is a [float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(2 ** 0.5) # Prints 1.4142135623731\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຍົກກຳລັງ [int] ດ້ວຍ [float]. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະເປັນ [float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(2 ** 0.5) # ສະແດງຜົນ 1.4142135623731\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Raises the left [int] to a power of the right [int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(3 ** 4) # Prints 81\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຍົກກຳລັງ [int] ຕົວຊ້າຍດ້ວຍ [int] ຕົວຂວາ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(3 ** 4) # ສະແດງຜົນ 81\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Adds the [int] and the [float]. The result is a [float]."
msgstr "ບວກ [int] ກັບ [float]. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະເປັນ [float]."

msgid "Adds the two [int]s."
msgstr "ບວກ [int] ສອງຕົວເຂົ້າກັນ."

msgid "Subtracts the [float] from the [int]. The result is a [float]."
msgstr "ລົບ [float] ອອກຈາກ [int]. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະເປັນ [float]."

msgid "Subtracts the two [int]s."
msgstr "ລົບ [int] ສອງຕົວອອກຈາກກັນ."

msgid ""
"Divides the [int] by the [float]. The result is a [float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(10 / 3.0) # Prints 3.33333333333333\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຫານ [int] ດ້ວຍ [float]. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະເປັນ [float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(10 / 3.0) # ສະແດງຜົນ 3.33333333333333\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Divides the two [int]s. The result is an [int]. This will truncate the "
"[float], discarding anything after the floating point.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(6 / 2) # Prints 3\n"
"print(5 / 3) # Prints 1\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຫານ [int] ສອງຕົວເຂົ້າກັນ. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະເປັນ [int] ໂດຍຈະຕັດເສດທົດສະນິຍົມອອກ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(6 / 2) # ສະແດງຜົນ 3\n"
"print(5 / 3) # ສະແດງຜົນ 1\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the [int] is less than the [float]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [int] ມີຄ່ານ້ອຍກວ່າ [float]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [int] is less than the right [int]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [int] ຕົວຊ້າຍມີຄ່ານ້ອຍກວ່າ [int] ຕົວຂວາ."

msgid ""
"Performs the bitwise shift left operation. Effectively the same as "
"multiplying by a power of 2.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0b1010 << 1) # Prints 20 (binary 10100)\n"
"print(0b1010 << 3) # Prints 80 (binary 1010000)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການເລື່ອນບິດໄປທາງຊ້າຍ (bitwise shift left). ເທົ່າກັບການຄູນດ້ວຍກຳລັງຂອງ 2.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0b1010 << 1) # ສະແດງຜົນ 20 (ຖານສອງ 10100)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [int] is less than or equal to the [float]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [int] ມີຄ່ານ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ [float]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [int] is less than or equal to the "
"right [int]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [int] ຕົວຊ້າຍມີຄ່ານ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ [int] ຕົວຂວາ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the [int] is equal to the [float]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [int] ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [float]."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the two [int]s are equal."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [int] ທັງສອງມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັນ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the [int] is greater than the [float]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [int] ມີຄ່າຫຼາຍກວ່າ [float]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [int] is greater than the right [int]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [int] ຕົວຊ້າຍມີຄ່າຫຼາຍກວ່າ [int] ຕົວຂວາ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [int] is greater than or equal to the "
"[float]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [int] ມີຄ່າຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ [float]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [int] is greater than or equal to the "
"right [int]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [int] ຕົວຊ້າຍມີຄ່າຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ [int] ຕົວຂວາ."

msgid ""
"Performs the bitwise shift right operation. Effectively the same as dividing "
"by a power of 2.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0b1010 >> 1) # Prints 5 (binary 101)\n"
"print(0b1010 >> 2) # Prints 2 (binary 10)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການເລື່ອນບິດໄປທາງຂວາ (bitwise shift right). ເທົ່າກັບການຫານດ້ວຍກຳລັງຂອງ 2.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0b1010 >> 1) # ສະແດງຜົນ 5 (ຖານສອງ 101)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Performs the bitwise [code]XOR[/code] operation.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0b1100 ^ 0b1010) # Prints 6 (binary 110)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການທາງບິດ [code]XOR[/code] (bitwise XOR).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0b1100 ^ 0b1010) # ສະແດງຜົນ 6 (ຖານສອງ 110)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the negated value of the [int]. If positive, turns the number "
"negative. If negative, turns the number positive. If zero, does nothing."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າກົງກັນຂ້າມຂອງ [int]. ຖ້າເປັນບວກຈະປ່ຽນເປັນລົບ, ຖ້າເປັນລົບຈະປ່ຽນເປັນບວກ."

msgid ""
"Performs the bitwise [code]OR[/code] operation.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0b1100 | 0b1010) # Prints 14 (binary 1110)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"This is useful for storing binary flags in a variable.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var flags = 0\n"
"flags |= 0b101 # Turn the first and third bits on.\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການທາງບິດ [code]OR[/code] (bitwise OR).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0b1100 | 0b1010) # ສະແດງຜົນ 14 (ຖານສອງ 1110)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Performs the bitwise [code]NOT[/code] operation on the [int]. Due to "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Two%27s_complement]2's complement[/url], "
"it's effectively equal to [code]-(int + 1)[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(~4) # Prints -5\n"
"print(~(-7)) # Prints 6\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການທາງບິດ [code]NOT[/code] (bitwise NOT) ເທິງ [int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(~4) # ສະແດງຜົນ -5\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Creates an idle interval in a [Tween] animation."
msgstr "ສ້າງຊ່ວງເວລາລໍຖ້າ (idle interval) ໃນອານິເມຊັນ [Tween]."

msgid ""
"[IntervalTweener] is used to make delays in a tweening sequence. See [method "
"Tween.tween_interval] for more usage information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method Tween.tween_interval] is the only correct way to create "
"[IntervalTweener]. Any [IntervalTweener] created manually will not function "
"correctly."
msgstr ""
"[IntervalTweener] ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການໜ່ວງເວລາ (delay) ໃນລຳດັບການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ tween. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method Tween.tween_interval] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method Tween.tween_interval] ແມ່ນວິທີດຽວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນການສ້າງ "
"[IntervalTweener]."

msgid "Internet protocol (IP) support functions such as DNS resolution."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນຮອງຮັບ Internet protocol (IP) ເຊັ່ນ ການແກ້ໄຂ DNS (DNS resolution)."

msgid ""
"IP contains support functions for the Internet Protocol (IP). TCP/IP support "
"is in different classes (see [StreamPeerTCP] and [TCPServer]). IP provides "
"DNS hostname resolution support, both blocking and threaded."
msgstr ""
"IP ບັນຈຸຟັງຊັນຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ Internet Protocol (IP). ການຮອງຮັບ TCP/IP ຈະຢູ່ໃນຄລາສອື່ນ (ເບິ່ງ "
"[StreamPeerTCP] ແລະ [TCPServer])."

msgid ""
"Removes all of a [param hostname]'s cached references. If no [param hostname] "
"is given, all cached IP addresses are removed."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບການອ້າງອີງທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນແຄຊ໌ (cache) ຂອງ [param hostname]. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸຊື່, ທີ່ຢູ່ IP "
"ທັງໝົດໃນແຄຊ໌ຈະຖືກລຶບ."

msgid ""
"Removes a given item [param id] from the queue. This should be used to free a "
"queue after it has completed to enable more queries to happen."
msgstr "ລຶບລາຍການ [param id] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ອອກຈາກຄິວ (queue)."

msgid "Returns all the user's current IPv4 and IPv6 addresses as an array."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4 ແລະ IPv6 ປັດຈຸບັນທັງໝົດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນຮູບແບບອາເຣ."

msgid ""
"Returns all network adapters as an array.\n"
"Each adapter is a dictionary of the form:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"{\n"
"\t\"index\": \"1\", # Interface index.\n"
"\t\"name\": \"eth0\", # Interface name.\n"
"\t\"friendly\": \"Ethernet One\", # A friendly name (might be empty).\n"
"\t\"addresses\": [\"192.168.1.101\"], # An array of IP addresses associated "
"to this interface.\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າອະແດັບເຕີເຄືອຂ່າຍທັງໝົດໃນຮູບແບບອາເຣ.\n"
"ແຕ່ລະອະແດັບເຕີແມ່ນ dictionary ໃນຮູບແບບ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"{\n"
"\t\"index\": \"1\", # ລຳດັບ Interface.\n"
"\t\"name\": \"eth0\", # ຊື່ Interface.\n"
"\t\"friendly\": \"Ethernet One\", # ຊື່ທີ່ເຂົ້າໃຈງ່າຍ.\n"
"\t\"addresses\": [\"192.168.1.101\"], # ອາເຣຂອງທີ່ຢູ່ IP.\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns a queued hostname's IP address, given its queue [param id]. Returns "
"an empty string on error or if resolution hasn't happened yet (see [method "
"get_resolve_item_status])."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງ hostname ໃນຄິວ ຕາມ [param id] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Returns resolved addresses, or an empty array if an error happened or "
"resolution didn't happen yet (see [method get_resolve_item_status])."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວ, ຫຼື ອາເຣຫວ່າງເປົ່າຖ້າເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

msgid ""
"Returns a queued hostname's status as a [enum ResolverStatus] constant, given "
"its queue [param id]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າສະຖານະຂອງ hostname ໃນຄິວ ເປັນຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum ResolverStatus]."

msgid ""
"Returns a given hostname's IPv4 or IPv6 address when resolved (blocking-type "
"method). The address type returned depends on the [enum Type] constant given "
"as [param ip_type]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4 ຫຼື IPv6 ຂອງ hostname ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເມື່ອແກ້ໄຂສຳເລັດ (ວິທີແບບ blocking)."

msgid ""
"Resolves a given hostname in a blocking way. Addresses are returned as an "
"[Array] of IPv4 or IPv6 addresses depending on [param ip_type]."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ hostname ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ດ້ວຍວິທີແບບ blocking."

msgid ""
"Creates a queue item to resolve a hostname to an IPv4 or IPv6 address "
"depending on the [enum Type] constant given as [param ip_type]. Returns the "
"queue ID if successful, or [constant RESOLVER_INVALID_ID] on error."
msgstr "ສ້າງລາຍການໃນຄິວເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ hostname ເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4 ຫຼື IPv6."

msgid "DNS hostname resolver status: No status."
msgstr "ສະຖານະການແກ້ໄຂ DNS: ບໍ່ມີສະຖານະ."

msgid "DNS hostname resolver status: Waiting."
msgstr "ສະຖານະການແກ້ໄຂ DNS: ກຳລັງລໍຖ້າ."

msgid "DNS hostname resolver status: Done."
msgstr "ສະຖານະການແກ້ໄຂ DNS: ສຳເລັດ."

msgid "DNS hostname resolver status: Error."
msgstr "ສະຖານະການແກ້ໄຂ DNS: ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of concurrent DNS resolver queries allowed, [constant "
"RESOLVER_INVALID_ID] is returned if exceeded."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງການສອບຖາມ DNS ທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຮັດພ້ອມກັນ."

msgid ""
"Invalid ID constant. Returned if [constant RESOLVER_MAX_QUERIES] is exceeded."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ ID ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Address type: None."
msgstr "ປະເພດທີ່ຢູ່: ບໍ່ມີ."

msgid "Address type: Internet protocol version 4 (IPv4)."
msgstr "ປະເພດທີ່ຢູ່: IPv4."

msgid "Address type: Internet protocol version 6 (IPv6)."
msgstr "ປະເພດທີ່ຢູ່: IPv6."

msgid "Address type: Any."
msgstr "ປະເພດທີ່ຢູ່: ໃດກໍໄດ້."

msgid "A vertical list of selectable items with one or multiple columns."
msgstr "ລາຍການລຽງຕາມທາງຕັ້ງຂອງລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ ໂດຍມີໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍຄໍລຳ."

msgid ""
"This control provides a vertical list of selectable items that may be in a "
"single or in multiple columns, with each item having options for text and an "
"icon. Tooltips are supported and may be different for every item in the "
"list.\n"
"Selectable items in the list may be selected or deselected and multiple "
"selection may be enabled. Selection with right mouse button may also be "
"enabled to allow use of popup context menus. Items may also be \"activated\" "
"by double-clicking them or by pressing [kbd]Enter[/kbd].\n"
"Item text only supports single-line strings. Newline characters (e.g. [code]"
"\\n[/code]) in the string won't produce a newline. Text wrapping is enabled "
"in [constant ICON_MODE_TOP] mode, but the column's width is adjusted to fully "
"fit its content by default. You need to set [member fixed_column_width] "
"greater than zero to wrap the text.\n"
"All [code]set_*[/code] methods allow negative item indices, i.e. [code]-1[/"
"code] to access the last item, [code]-2[/code] to select the second-to-last "
"item, and so on.\n"
"[b]Incremental search:[/b] Like [PopupMenu] and [Tree], [ItemList] supports "
"searching within the list while the control is focused. Press a key that "
"matches the first letter of an item's name to select the first item starting "
"with the given letter. After that point, there are two ways to perform "
"incremental search: 1) Press the same key again before the timeout duration "
"to select the next item starting with the same letter. 2) Press letter keys "
"that match the rest of the word before the timeout duration to match to "
"select the item in question directly. Both of these actions will be reset to "
"the beginning of the list if the timeout duration has passed since the last "
"keystroke was registered. You can adjust the timeout duration by changing "
"[member ProjectSettings.gui/timers/incremental_search_max_interval_msec]."
msgstr ""
"ການຄວບຄຸມນີ້ສະໜອງລາຍການລຽງຕາມທາງຕັ້ງຂອງລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະຢູ່ໃນໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍຄໍລຳ. "
"ແຕ່ລະລາຍການສາມາດມີຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ ໄອຄອນ. ຮອງຮັບ Tooltips "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນແຕ່ລະລາຍການ.\n"
"ລາຍການສາມາດຖືກເລືອກ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກໄດ້, ແລະ ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການເລືອກຫຼາຍລາຍການພ້ອມກັນໄດ້. "
"ລາຍການສາມາດຖືກ \"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ\" (activated) ໄດ້ໂດຍການດັບເບີລຄລິກ ຫຼື ກົດ [kbd]Enter[/"
"kbd].\n"
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງລາຍການຮອງຮັບສະເພາະຂໍ້ຄວາມແຖວດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕົວອັກສອນຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ (ເຊັ່ນ [code]\\n[/"
"code]) ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Adds an item to the item list with no text, only an icon. Returns the index "
"of an added item."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການໃສ່ໃນລາຍການໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ມີແຕ່ໄອຄອນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າດັດຊະນີຂອງລາຍການທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປ."

msgid ""
"Adds an item to the item list with specified text. Returns the index of an "
"added item.\n"
"Specify an [param icon], or use [code]null[/code] as the [param icon] for a "
"list item with no icon.\n"
"If [param selectable] is [code]true[/code], the list item will be selectable."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການໃສ່ໃນລາຍການດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກຳນົດ. ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າດັດຊະນີຂອງລາຍການທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປ.\n"
"ກຳນົດ [param icon], ຫຼືໃຊ້ [code]null[/code] ແທນ [param icon] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍການທີ່ບໍ່ມີໄອຄອນ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param selectable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລາຍການຈະສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Ensures the currently selected item (the first selected item if multiple "
"selection is enabled) is visible, adjusting the scroll position as necessary "
"to place the item at the center of the list if possible. See also [method "
"ensure_current_is_visible].\n"
"Fails and prints an error if both arguments are [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບປະກັນວ່າລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ (ລາຍການທຳອິດຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ການເລືອກຫຼາຍອັນ) ສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້, "
"ໂດຍປັບຕຳແໜ່ງການເລື່ອນຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ລາຍການຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງຂອງລາຍການຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method ensure_current_is_visible] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"ຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ຖ້າທັງສອງອາຄິວເມນ (arguments) ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid "Removes all items from the list."
msgstr "ລຶບລາຍການທັງໝົດອອກຈາກລາຍການ."

msgid "Ensures the item associated with the specified index is not selected."
msgstr "ຮັບປະກັນວ່າລາຍການທີ່ກົງກັບດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເລືອກ."

msgid "Ensures there are no items selected."
msgstr "ຮັບປະກັນວ່າບໍ່ມີລາຍການໃດຖືກເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"Ensures the currently selected item (the first selected item if multiple "
"selection is enabled) is visible, adjusting the scroll position as necessary. "
"See also [method center_on_current]."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບປະກັນວ່າລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ (ລາຍການທຳອິດຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ການເລືອກຫຼາຍອັນ) ສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້, "
"ໂດຍປັບຕຳແໜ່ງການເລື່ອນຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນ. ເບິ່ງ [method center_on_current] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Forces an update to the list size based on its items. This happens "
"automatically whenever size of the items, or other relevant settings like "
"[member auto_height], change. The method can be used to trigger the update "
"ahead of next drawing pass."
msgstr ""
"ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ອັບເດດຂະໜາດຂອງລາຍການໂດຍອີງຕາມລາຍການພາຍໃນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຂະໜາດຂອງລາຍການ ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ [member auto_height] "
"ປ່ຽນແປງ. ວິທີການ (method) ນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສັ່ງໃຫ້ອັບເດດກ່ອນການປະມວນຜົນການແຕ້ມຮູບຮອບຖັດໄປ."

msgid ""
"Returns the horizontal scrollbar.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it may "
"cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member CanvasItem.visible] property."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າແຖບເລື່ອນລວງນອນ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນໂນດພາຍໃນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ການລຶບ ຫຼື ການປ່ອຍ (freeing) "
"ມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຄ້າງ (crash). ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອງມັນ ຫຼື ລູກຂອງມັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member "
"CanvasItem.visible] ຂອງພວກມັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the item index at the given [param position].\n"
"When there is no item at that point, -1 will be returned if [param exact] is "
"[code]true[/code], and the closest item index will be returned otherwise.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned value is unreliable if called right after modifying "
"the [ItemList], before it redraws in the next frame."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າດັດຊະນີຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param position] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ.\n"
"ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີລາຍການຢູ່ຈຸດນັ້ນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ -1 ຖ້າ [param exact] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແລະ "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າດັດຊະນີຂອງລາຍການທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງທີ່ສຸດໃນກໍລະນີອື່ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນອາດຈະບໍ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືຖ້າເອີ້ນໃຊ້ທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກການແກ້ໄຂ [ItemList], "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ມັນຈະແຕ້ມໃໝ່ໃນເຟຣມຖັດໄປ."

msgid "Returns item's auto translate mode."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໂໝດການແປອັດຕະໂນມັດຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid ""
"Returns the custom background color of the item specified by [param idx] "
"index."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສີພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຂອງລາຍການຕາມດັດຊະນີ [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the custom foreground color of the item specified by [param idx] "
"index."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສີຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຂອງລາຍການຕາມດັດຊະນີ [param idx]."

msgid "Returns the icon associated with the specified index."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໄອຄອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

msgid "Returns a [Color] modulating item's icon at the specified index."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [Color] ທີ່ໃຊ້ປັບສີ (modulating) ໄອຄອນຂອງລາຍການຕາມດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the region of item's icon used. The whole icon will be used if the "
"region has no area."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂອບເຂດ (region) ຂອງໄອຄອນທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້. ໄອຄອນທັງໝົດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຖ້າຂອບເຂດບໍ່ມີພື້ນທີ່."

msgid "Returns item's text language code."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລະຫັດພາສາຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນລາຍການ."

msgid "Returns the metadata value of the specified index."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເມຕາເດຕາ (metadata) ຂອງດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the position and size of the item with the specified index, in the "
"coordinate system of the [ItemList] node. If [param expand] is [code]true[/"
"code] the last column expands to fill the rest of the row.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned value is unreliable if called right after modifying "
"the [ItemList], before it redraws in the next frame."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງລາຍການຕາມດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດ, ໃນລະບົບພິກັດຂອງໂນດ [ItemList]. ຖ້າ "
"[param expand] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຄໍລຳສຸດທ້າຍຈະຂະຫຍາຍໃຫ້ເຕັມສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງແຖວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນອາດຈະບໍ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືຖ້າເອີ້ນໃຊ້ທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກການແກ້ໄຂ [ItemList], "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ມັນຈະແຕ້ມໃໝ່ໃນເຟຣມຖັດໄປ."

msgid "Returns the text associated with the specified index."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

msgid "Returns item's text base writing direction."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນທິດທາງການຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມພື້ນຖານຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "Returns the tooltip hint associated with the specified index."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມຄຳແນະນຳ (tooltip hint) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Returns an array with the indexes of the selected items."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣ (array) ທີ່ບັນຈຸດັດຊະນີຂອງລາຍການທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the vertical scrollbar.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it may "
"cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member CanvasItem.visible] property."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າແຖບເລື່ອນລວງຕັ້ງ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນໂນດພາຍໃນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ການລຶບ ຫຼື ການປ່ອຍ (freeing) "
"ມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຄ້າງ (crash). ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອງມັນ ຫຼື ລູກຂອງມັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member "
"CanvasItem.visible] ຂອງພວກມັນ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if one or more items are selected."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີລາຍການໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນຖືກເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at the specified index is disabled."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລາຍການຕາມດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item icon will be drawn transposed, i.e. the "
"X and Y axes are swapped."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໄອຄອນຂອງລາຍການຖືກແຕ້ມແບບສະລັບແກນ (transposed), ນັ້ນຄືແກນ X "
"ແລະ Y ຖືກສະລັບກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at the specified index is selectable."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລາຍການຕາມດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the tooltip is enabled for specified item index."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຄຳແນະນຳ (tooltip) ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ສຳລັບດັດຊະນີລາຍການທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at the specified index is currently "
"selected."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລາຍການຕາມດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດກຳລັງຖືກເລືອກຢູ່."

msgid "Moves item from index [param from_idx] to [param to_idx]."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍລາຍການຈາກດັດຊະນີ [param from_idx] ໄປຫາ [param to_idx]."

msgid "Removes the item specified by [param idx] index from the list."
msgstr "ລຶບລາຍການຕາມດັດຊະນີ [param idx] ອອກຈາກລາຍການ."

msgid ""
"Selects the item at the specified index.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method does not trigger the item selection signal."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກລາຍການຕາມດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງສັນຍານການເລືອກລາຍການ (item selection signal)."

msgid ""
"Sets the auto translate mode of the item associated with the specified "
"index.\n"
"Items use [constant Node.AUTO_TRANSLATE_MODE_INHERIT] by default, which uses "
"the same auto translate mode as the [ItemList] itself."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດການແປອັດຕະໂນມັດຂອງລາຍການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"ລາຍການຕ່າງໆຈະໃຊ້ [constant Node.AUTO_TRANSLATE_MODE_INHERIT] ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະໃຊ້ໂໝດການແປອັດຕະໂນມັດອັນດຽວກັນກັບ [ItemList] ເອງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the background color of the item specified by [param idx] index to the "
"specified [Color]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງລາຍການຕາມດັດຊະນີ [param idx] ໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າ [Color] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the foreground color of the item specified by [param idx] index to the "
"specified [Color]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີຕົວອັກສອນຂອງລາຍການຕາມດັດຊະນີ [param idx] ໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າ [Color] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Disables (or enables) the item at the specified index.\n"
"Disabled items cannot be selected and do not trigger activation signals (when "
"double-clicking or pressing [kbd]Enter[/kbd])."
msgstr ""
"ປິດໃຊ້ງານ (ຫຼື ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ) ລາຍການຕາມດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"ລາຍການທີ່ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງສັນຍານການເຮັດວຽກ (ເມື່ອຄລິກສອງຄັ້ງ ຫຼື ກົດ "
"[kbd]Enter[/kbd])."

msgid ""
"Sets (or replaces) the icon's [Texture2D] associated with the specified index."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ (ຫຼື ແທນທີ່) [Texture2D] ຂອງໄອຄອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Sets a modulating [Color] of the item associated with the specified index."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Color] ສຳລັບປັບສີ (modulating) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the region of item's icon used. The whole icon will be used if the "
"region has no area."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອບເຂດ (region) ຂອງໄອຄອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ໄອຄອນທັງໝົດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຖ້າຂອບເຂດບໍ່ມີພື້ນທີ່."

msgid "Sets whether the item icon will be drawn transposed."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຈະໃຫ້ແຕ້ມໄອຄອນຂອງລາຍການແບບສະລັບແກນ (transposed) ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Sets the language code of the text for the item at the given index to [param "
"language]. This is used for line-breaking and text shaping algorithms. If "
"[param language] is empty, the current locale is used."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລະຫັດພາສາຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມສຳລັບລາຍການຕາມດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນ [param language]. "
"ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ ແລະ ອັລກໍຣິທຶມການຈັດຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຖ້າ [param language] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, "
"ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (locale) ປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Sets a value (of any type) to be stored with the item associated with the "
"specified index."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ (ປະເພດໃດກໍໄດ້) ເພື່ອເກັບໄວ້ກັບລາຍການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Allows or disallows selection of the item associated with the specified index."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດ ຫຼື ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກລາຍການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Sets text of the item associated with the specified index."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງລາຍການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Sets item's text base writing direction."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າທິດທາງການຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມພື້ນຖານຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "Sets the tooltip hint for the item associated with the specified index."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມຄຳແນະນຳ (tooltip hint) ສຳລັບລາຍການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Sets whether the tooltip hint is enabled for specified item index."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຈະໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມຄຳແນະນຳ (tooltip hint) ສຳລັບດັດຊະນີລາຍການທີ່ກຳນົດ ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid "Sorts items in the list by their text."
msgstr "ລຽງລຳດັບລາຍການໃນລາຍການຕາມຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງພວກມັນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the currently selected item can be selected again."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລາຍການທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນຈະສາມາດຖືກເລືອກຊ້ຳໄດ້ອີກ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], right mouse button click can select items."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການຄລິກດ້ວຍປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ຂວາຈະສາມາດເລືອກລາຍການໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows navigating the [ItemList] with letter keys "
"through incremental search."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຄົ້ນຫາໃນ [ItemList] "
"ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມຕົວອັກສອນຜ່ານການຄົ້ນຫາແບບເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ (incremental search)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the control will automatically resize the height to fit "
"its content."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຈະປັບຂະໜາດຄວາມສູງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບເນື້ອໃນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the control will automatically resize the width to fit "
"its content."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຈະປັບຂະໜາດຄວາມກວ້າງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບເນື້ອໃນ."

msgid ""
"The width all columns will be adjusted to.\n"
"A value of zero disables the adjustment, each item will have a width equal to "
"the width of its content and the columns will have an uneven width."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມກວ້າງທີ່ທຸກຄໍລຳຈະຖືກປັບໃຫ້ເປັນ.\n"
"ຄ່າສູນຈະປິດການປັບຂະໜາດ, ແຕ່ລະລາຍການຈະມີຄວາມກວ້າງເທົ່າກັບຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງເນື້ອໃນຂອງມັນ ແລະ "
"ຄໍລຳຕ່າງໆຈະມີຄວາມກວ້າງບໍ່ສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"The size all icons will be adjusted to.\n"
"If either X or Y component is not greater than zero, icon size won't be "
"affected."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດທີ່ໄອຄອນທັງໝົດຈະຖືກປັບໃຫ້ເປັນ.\n"
"ຖ້າຄ່າໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງ X ຫຼື Y ບໍ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າສູນ, ຂະໜາດຂອງໄອຄອນຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"The icon position, whether above or to the left of the text. See the [enum "
"IconMode] constants."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໄອຄອນ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນທາງເທິງ ຫຼື ທາງຊ້າຍຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ເບິ່ງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum IconMode]."

msgid ""
"The scale of icon applied after [member fixed_icon_size] and transposing "
"takes effect."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງໄອຄອນທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ຫຼັງຈາກ [member fixed_icon_size] ແລະ ການສະລັບແກນ (transposing) "
"ມີຜົນ."

msgid "The number of items currently in the list."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນລາຍການທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລາຍການປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the item at [code]index[/code] is disabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລາຍການທີ່ [code]index[/code] ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [code]index[/code] ແມ່ນຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/code]."

msgid ""
"The icon of the item at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນຂອງລາຍການທີ່ [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [code]index[/code] ແມ່ນຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the item at [code]index[/code] is selectable.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລາຍການທີ່ [code]index[/code] ຈະສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [code]index[/code] ແມ່ນຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/code]."

msgid ""
"The text of the item at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງລາຍການທີ່ [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [code]index[/code] ແມ່ນຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/code]."

msgid ""
"Maximum columns the list will have.\n"
"If greater than zero, the content will be split among the specified columns.\n"
"A value of zero means unlimited columns, i.e. all items will be put in the "
"same row."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຄໍລຳສູງສຸດທີ່ລາຍການຈະມີ.\n"
"ຖ້າໃຫຍ່ກວ່າສູນ, ເນື້ອໃນຈະຖືກແບ່ງອອກຕາມຈຳນວນຄໍລຳທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"ຄ່າສູນໝາຍເຖິງບໍ່ຈຳກັດຄໍລຳ, ນັ້ນຄືລາຍການທັງໝົດຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ໃນແຖວດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"Maximum lines of text allowed in each item. Space will be reserved even when "
"there is not enough lines of text to display.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property takes effect only when [member icon_mode] is "
"[constant ICON_MODE_TOP]. To make the text wrap, [member fixed_column_width] "
"should be greater than zero."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນແຖວຂໍ້ຄວາມສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃນແຕ່ລະລາຍການ. "
"ພື້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກຈອງໄວ້ເຖິງວ່າຈະມີແຖວຂໍ້ຄວາມບໍ່ພໍທີ່ຈະສະແດງກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member icon_mode] ເປັນ [constant "
"ICON_MODE_TOP]. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ (wrap), [member fixed_column_width] "
"ຄວນຈະໃຫຍ່ກວ່າສູນ."

msgid ""
"Whether all columns will have the same width.\n"
"If [code]true[/code], the width is equal to the largest column width of all "
"columns."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າທຸກຄໍລຳຈະມີຄວາມກວ້າງເທົ່າກັນ ຫຼື ບໍ່.\n"
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄວາມກວ້າງຈະເທົ່າກັບຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຄໍລຳທີ່ໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສຸດໃນບັນດາທຸກຄໍລຳ."

msgid ""
"The way which scroll hints (indicators that show that the content can still "
"be scrolled in a certain direction) will be shown."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການສະແດງຄຳແນະນຳການເລື່ອນ (ຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ທີ່ສະແດງວ່າເນື້ອໃນຍັງສາມາດເລື່ອນໄປໃນທິດທາງໃດໜຶ່ງໄດ້)."

msgid ""
"Allows single or multiple item selection. See the [enum SelectMode] constants."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກລາຍການດຽວ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍລາຍການ. ເບິ່ງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum SelectMode]."

msgid ""
"The clipping behavior when the text exceeds an item's bounding rectangle."
msgstr "ພຶດຕິກຳການຕັດ (clipping) ເມື່ອຂໍ້ຄວາມເກີນຂອບເຂດສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the scroll hint texture will be tiled instead of "
"stretched. See [member scroll_hint_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ຂອງຄຳແນະນຳການເລື່ອນຈະຖືກວາງແບບປູພື້ນ "
"(tiled) ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນການຢືດ (stretched). ເບິ່ງ [member scroll_hint_mode]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the control will automatically move items into a new "
"row to fit its content. See also [HFlowContainer] for this behavior.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the control will add a horizontal scrollbar to make "
"all items visible."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຈະຍ້າຍລາຍການໄປແຖວໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບເນື້ອໃນ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [HFlowContainer] ສຳລັບພຶດຕິກຳນີ້.\n"
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຈະເພີ່ມແຖບເລື່ອນລວງນອນເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນລາຍການທັງໝົດໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Emitted when any mouse click is issued within the rect of the list but on "
"empty space.\n"
"[param at_position] is the click position in this control's local coordinate "
"system."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອມີການຄລິກເມົາສ໌ພາຍໃນຂອບເຂດຂອງລາຍການແຕ່ຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງ.\n"
"[param at_position] ແມ່ນຕຳແໜ່ງການຄລິກໃນລະບົບພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມນີ້."

msgid ""
"Emitted when specified list item is activated via double-clicking or by "
"pressing [kbd]Enter[/kbd]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອລາຍການທີ່ກຳນົດຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂດຍການຄລິກສອງຄັ້ງ ຫຼື ໂດຍການກົດ [kbd]Enter[/kbd]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when specified list item has been clicked with any mouse button.\n"
"[param at_position] is the click position in this control's local coordinate "
"system."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອລາຍການທີ່ກຳນົດຖືກຄລິກດ້ວຍປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ໃດໜຶ່ງ.\n"
"[param at_position] ແມ່ນຕຳແໜ່ງການຄລິກໃນລະບົບພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມນີ້."

msgid ""
"Emitted when specified item has been selected. Only applicable in single "
"selection mode.\n"
"[member allow_reselect] must be enabled to reselect an item."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອລາຍການທີ່ກຳນົດຖືກເລືອກ. ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນໂໝດການເລືອກແບບດ່ຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[member allow_reselect] ຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເລືອກລາຍການຊ້ຳໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a multiple selection is altered on a list allowing multiple "
"selection."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອການເລືອກຫຼາຍລາຍການຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໃນລາຍການທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກຫຼາຍລາຍການ."

msgid "Icon is drawn above the text."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນຖືກແຕ້ມໄວ້ທາງເທິງຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid "Icon is drawn to the left of the text."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນຖືກແຕ້ມໄວ້ທາງຊ້າຍຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid "Only allow selecting a single item."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກພຽງແຕ່ລາຍການດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Allows selecting multiple items by holding [kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] or [kbd]Shift[/"
"kbd]."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກຫຼາຍລາຍການໂດຍການກົດ [kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] ຫຼື [kbd]Shift[/kbd] ຄ້າງໄວ້."

msgid "Allows selecting multiple items by toggling them on and off."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກຫຼາຍລາຍການໂດຍການເປີດ ແລະ ປິດ ພວກມັນ."

msgid "Scroll hints will never be shown."
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳການເລື່ອນຈະບໍ່ຖືກສະແດງ."

msgid "Scroll hints will be shown at the top and bottom."
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳການເລື່ອນຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ທາງເທິງ ແລະ ທາງລຸ່ມ."

msgid "Only the top scroll hint will be shown."
msgstr "ຈະສະແດງສະເພາະຄຳແນະນຳການເລື່ອນທາງເທິງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Only the bottom scroll hint will be shown."
msgstr "ຈະສະແດງສະເພາະຄຳແນະນຳການເລື່ອນທາງລຸ່ມເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Default text [Color] of the item."
msgstr "ສີ [Color] ຂໍ້ຄວາມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "Text [Color] used when the item is hovered and not selected yet."
msgstr "ສີ [Color] ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອລາຍການຖືກເມົາສ໌ຊີ້ (hover) ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນຖືກເລືອກ."

msgid "Text [Color] used when the item is hovered and selected."
msgstr "ສີ [Color] ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອລາຍການຖືກເມົາສ໌ຊີ້ ແລະ ຖືກເລືອກແລ້ວ."

msgid "The tint of text outline of the item."
msgstr "ສີຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "Text [Color] used when the item is selected, but not hovered."
msgstr "ສີ [Color] ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອລາຍການຖືກເລືອກ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເມົາສ໌ຊີ້."

msgid ""
"[Color] of the guideline. The guideline is a line drawn between each row of "
"items."
msgstr "ສີ [Color] ຂອງເສັ້ນແນະນຳ. ເສັ້ນແນະນຳແມ່ນເສັ້ນທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະແຖວຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "[Color] used to modulate the [theme_item scroll_hint] texture."
msgstr "ສີ [Color] ທີ່ໃຊ້ປັບສີ (modulate) ພື້ນຜິວ [theme_item scroll_hint]."

msgid "The horizontal spacing between items."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງລວງນອນລະຫວ່າງລາຍການ."

msgid "The spacing between item's icon and text."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງໄອຄອນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "The vertical spacing between each line of text."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງລວງຕັ້ງລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະແຖວຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"The size of the item text outline.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If using a font with [member "
"FontFile.multichannel_signed_distance_field] enabled, its [member "
"FontFile.msdf_pixel_range] must be set to at least [i]twice[/i] the value of "
"[theme_item outline_size] for outline rendering to look correct. Otherwise, "
"the outline may appear to be cut off earlier than intended."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງລາຍການ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າໃຊ້ຟອນທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"FontFile.multichannel_signed_distance_field], ຄ່າ [member "
"FontFile.msdf_pixel_range] ຂອງມັນຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ [i]ສອງເທົ່າ[/i] ຂອງຄ່າ "
"[theme_item outline_size] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການສະແດງເສັ້ນຂອບເບິ່ງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ເສັ້ນຂອບອາດຈະປະກົດວ່າຖືກຕັດອອກກ່ອນທີ່ຄວນຈະເປັນ."

msgid "The vertical spacing between items."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງລວງຕັ້ງລະຫວ່າງລາຍການ."

msgid "[Font] of the item's text."
msgstr "[Font] ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນລາຍການ."

msgid "Font size of the item's text."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນລາຍການ."

msgid ""
"The indicator that will be shown when the content can still be scrolled. See "
"[member scroll_hint_mode]."
msgstr "ຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອເນື້ອໃນຍັງສາມາດເລື່ອນໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [member scroll_hint_mode]."

msgid "[StyleBox] used for the cursor, when the [ItemList] is being focused."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເຄີເຊີ (cursor), ເມື່ອ [ItemList] ກຳລັງຖືກໂຟກັດ."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] used for the cursor, when the [ItemList] is not being focused."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເຄີເຊີ (cursor), ເມື່ອ [ItemList] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໂຟກັດ."

msgid "The focused style for the [ItemList], drawn on top of everything."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບເມື່ອຖືກໂຟກັດສຳລັບ [ItemList], ເຊິ່ງຖືກແຕ້ມໄວ້ເທິງສຸດຂອງທຸກຢ່າງ."

msgid "[StyleBox] for the hovered, but not selected items."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ສຳລັບລາຍການທີ່ຖືກເມົາສ໌ຊີ້, ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] for the hovered and selected items, used when the [ItemList] is "
"not being focused."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ສຳລັບລາຍການທີ່ຖືກເມົາສ໌ຊີ້ ແລະ ຖືກເລືອກ, ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [ItemList] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໂຟກັດ."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] for the hovered and selected items, used when the [ItemList] is "
"being focused."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ສຳລັບລາຍການທີ່ຖືກເມົາສ໌ຊີ້ ແລະ ຖືກເລືອກ, ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [ItemList] ກຳລັງຖືກໂຟກັດ."

msgid "The background style for the [ItemList]."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບ [ItemList]."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] for the selected items, used when the [ItemList] is not being "
"focused."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ສຳລັບລາຍການທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ, ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [ItemList] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໂຟກັດ."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] for the selected items, used when the [ItemList] is being focused."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ສຳລັບລາຍການທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ, ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [ItemList] ກຳລັງຖືກໂຟກັດ."

msgid ""
"A [SkeletonModifier3D] to approach the goal by repeating small rotations."
msgstr "ເປັນ [SkeletonModifier3D] ເພື່ອເຂົ້າຫາເປົ້າໝາຍໂດຍການໝູນເທື່ອລະໜ້ອຍຊ້ຳໆ."

msgid ""
"Returns the joint limitation at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint] ໃນລາຍການຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the joint limitation right axis at [param joint] in the bone chain's "
"joint list."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນແກນຂວາ (right axis) ຂອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint] ໃນລາຍການຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the joint limitation right axis vector at [param joint] in the bone "
"chain's joint list.\n"
"If [method get_joint_limitation_right_axis] is [constant "
"SkeletonModifier3D.SECONDARY_DIRECTION_NONE], this method returns "
"[code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເວັກເຕີແກນຂວາ (right axis vector) ຂອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint] "
"ໃນລາຍການຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [method get_joint_limitation_right_axis] ແມ່ນ [constant "
"SkeletonModifier3D.SECONDARY_DIRECTION_NONE], ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]Vector3(0, "
"0, 0)[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the rotation axis at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແກນການໝູນທີ່ [param joint] ໃນລາຍການຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the rotation axis vector for the specified joint in the bone chain. "
"This vector represents the axis around which the joint can rotate. It is "
"determined based on the rotation axis set for the joint.\n"
"If [method get_joint_rotation_axis] is [constant "
"SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_ALL], this method returns [code]Vector3(0, "
"0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເວັກເຕີແກນການໝູນສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ. ເວັກເຕີນີ້ສະແດງເຖິງແກນທີ່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ສາມາດໝູນອ້ອມໄດ້. "
"ມັນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍອີງໃສ່ແກນການໝູນທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່.\n"
"ຖ້າ [method get_joint_rotation_axis] ແມ່ນ [constant "
"SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_ALL], ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/"
"code]."

msgid "Returns the target node that the end bone is trying to reach."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໂນດເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ກະດູກສ່ວນປາຍກຳລັງພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າຫາ."

msgid ""
"Sets the joint limitation at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint] ໃນລາຍການຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the joint limitation right axis at [param joint] in the bone chain's "
"joint list."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າແກນຂວາ (right axis) ຂອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint] ໃນລາຍການຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the optional joint limitation right axis vector at [param joint] in the "
"bone chain's joint list."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວັກເຕີແກນຂວາ (right axis vector) ທາງເລືອກຂອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint] "
"ໃນລາຍການຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the joint limitation rotation offset at [param joint] in the bone "
"chain's joint list.\n"
"Rotation is done in the local space which is constructed by the bone "
"direction (in general parent to child) as the +Y axis and [method "
"get_joint_limitation_right_axis_vector] as the +X axis.\n"
"If the +X and +Y axes are not orthogonal, the +X axis is implicitly modified "
"to make it orthogonal.\n"
"Also, if the length of [method get_joint_limitation_right_axis_vector] is "
"zero, the space is created by rotating the reference pose using the shortest "
"arc that rotates the +Y axis of the reference pose to match the bone "
"direction.\n"
"In here, the reference pose is the bone pose immediately before processing IK."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄ່າອອຟເຊັດການໝູນ (rotation offset) ຂອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint] "
"ໃນລາຍການຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ.\n"
"ການໝູນແມ່ນເຮັດໃນພື້ນທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local space) ເຊິ່ງສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍທິດທາງຂອງກະດູກ "
"(ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນຈາກພໍ່ຫາລູກ) ເປັນແກນ +Y ແລະ [method "
"get_joint_limitation_right_axis_vector] ເປັນແກນ +X.\n"
"ຖ້າແກນ +X ແລະ +Y ບໍ່ຕັ້ງສາກກັນ, ແກນ +X ຈະຖືກແກ້ໄຂໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນຕັ້ງສາກ.\n"
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ຖ້າຄວາມຍາວຂອງ [method get_joint_limitation_right_axis_vector] ເປັນສູນ, "
"ພື້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍການໝູນທ່າອ້າງອີງ (reference pose) ໂດຍໃຊ້ສ່ວນໂຄ້ງທີ່ສັ້ນທີ່ສຸດທີ່ໝູນແກນ +Y "
"ຂອງທ່າອ້າງອີງໃຫ້ກົງກັບທິດທາງຂອງກະດູກ.\n"
"ໃນທີ່ນີ້, ທ່າອ້າງອີງແມ່ນທ່າຂອງກະດູກທັນທີກ່ອນການປະມວນຜົນ IK."

msgid ""
"Sets the rotation axis vector for the specified joint in the bone chain.\n"
"This vector is normalized by an internal process and represents the axis "
"around which the bone chain can rotate.\n"
"If the vector length is [code]0[/code], it is considered synonymous with "
"[constant SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_ALL]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວັກເຕີແກນການໝູນສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ.\n"
"ເວັກເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າປົກກະຕິ (normalized) ໂດຍຂະບວນການພາຍໃນ ແລະ "
"ສະແດງເຖິງແກນທີ່ສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກສາມາດໝູນອ້ອມໄດ້.\n"
"ຖ້າຄວາມຍາວຂອງເວັກເຕີແມ່ນ [code]0[/code], ມັນຈະຖືວ່າໝາຍເຖິງ [constant "
"SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_ALL]."

msgid "Sets the target node that the end bone is trying to reach."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂນດເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ກະດູກສ່ວນປາຍກຳລັງພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າຫາ."

msgid ""
"The maximum amount each bone can rotate in a single iteration.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This limitation is applied during each iteration. For example, "
"if [member max_iterations] is [code]4[/code] and [member angular_delta_limit] "
"is [code]5[/code] degrees, the maximum rotation possible in a single frame is "
"[code]20[/code] degrees."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນການໝູນສູງສຸດທີ່ກະດູກແຕ່ລະອັນສາມາດໝູນໄດ້ໃນການຄຳນວນ (iteration) ຮອບດຽວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດນີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນແຕ່ລະຮອບການຄຳນວນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າ [member "
"max_iterations] ແມ່ນ [code]4[/code] ແລະ [member angular_delta_limit] ແມ່ນ "
"[code]5[/code] ອົງສາ, ການໝູນສູງສຸດທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ໃນເຟຣມດຽວແມ່ນ [code]20[/code] ອົງສາ."

msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], the result is calculated from the previous frame's "
"[IterateIK3D] result as the initial state.\n"
"If [code]true[/code], the previous frame's [IterateIK3D] result is discarded. "
"At this point, the new result is calculated from the bone pose excluding the "
"[IterateIK3D] as the initial state. This means the result will be always "
"equal as long as the target position and the previous bone pose are the same. "
"However, if [member angular_delta_limit] and [member max_iterations] are set "
"too small, the end bone of the chain will never reach the target."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຜົນລັບຈະຖືກຄຳນວນຈາກຜົນຂອງ [IterateIK3D] "
"ຈາກເຟຣມກ່ອນໜ້າເປັນສະພາວະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຜົນຂອງ [IterateIK3D] ຈາກເຟຣມກ່ອນໜ້າຈະຖືກປະລະ. ໃນຈຸດນີ້, "
"ຜົນລັບໃໝ່ຈະຖືກຄຳນວນຈາກທ່າຂອງກະດູກໂດຍບໍ່ລວມ [IterateIK3D] ເປັນສະພາວະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຜົນລັບຈະເທົ່າກັນສະເໝີ ຕາບໃດທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງເປົ້າໝາຍ ແລະ ທ່າຂອງກະດູກກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນຄືກັນ. "
"ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າ [member angular_delta_limit] ແລະ [member max_iterations] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໜ້ອຍເກີນໄປ, ກະດູກສ່ວນປາຍຂອງສາຍໂສ້ຈະບໍ່ມີທາງໄປເຖິງເປົ້າໝາຍໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The number of iteration loops used by the IK solver to produce more accurate "
"results."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຮອບການຄຳນວນ (iteration loops) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວແກ້ໄຂ IK ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັບທີ່ແມ່ນຍຳກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"The minimum distance between the end bone and the target. If the distance is "
"below this value, the IK solver stops any further iterations."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງຕ່ຳສຸດລະຫວ່າງກະດູກສ່ວນປາຍ ແລະ ເປົ້າໝາຍ. ຖ້າໄລຍະຫ່າງຕ່ຳກວ່າຄ່ານີ້, ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ IK "
"ຈະຢຸດການຄຳນວນຮອບຕໍ່ໆໄປ."

msgid "Jacobian transpose based inverse kinematics solver."
msgstr "ຕົວແກ້ໄຂອິນເວີສຄິເນແມທິກ (inverse kinematics) ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ Jacobian transpose."

msgid ""
"[JacobianIK3D] calculates rotations for all joints simultaneously, producing "
"natural and smooth movement. It is particularly suited for biological "
"animations.\n"
"The resulting twist around the forward vector will always be kept from the "
"previous pose.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It converges more slowly than other IK solvers, leading to "
"gentler and less immediate tracking of targets."
msgstr ""
"[JacobianIK3D] ຄຳນວນການໝູນສຳລັບທຸກຂໍ້ຕໍ່ພ້ອມໆກັນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວເປັນທຳມະຊາດ ແລະ "
"ລຽບນຽນ. ມັນເໝາະສົມເປັນພິເສດສຳລັບແອນິເມຊັນທາງຊີວະພາບ.\n"
"ການບິດ (twist) ທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນອ້ອມເວັກເຕີໄປທາງໜ້າຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ຈາກທ່າກ່ອນໜ້າສະເໝີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມັນຈະປະມວນຜົນເຂົ້າຫາຄ່າເປົ້າໝາຍ (converges) ຊ້າກວ່າຕົວແກ້ໄຂ IK ອື່ນໆ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕິດຕາມເປົ້າໝາຍມີຄວາມນຸ້ມນວນ ແລະ ບໍ່ກະທັນຫັນເກີນໄປ."

msgid "Represents a class from the Java Native Interface."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຄລາສ (class) ຈາກ Java Native Interface."

msgid ""
"Represents a class from the Java Native Interface. It is returned from "
"[method JavaClassWrapper.wrap].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class only works on Android. On any other platform, this "
"class does nothing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class is not to be confused with [JavaScriptObject]."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຖິງຄລາສຈາກ Java Native Interface. ມັນຖືກສົ່ງຄືນມາຈາກ [method "
"JavaClassWrapper.wrap].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄລາສນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Android ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ, "
"ຄລາສນີ້ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຫຍັງເລີຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄລາສນີ້ບໍ່ຄວນສັບສົນກັບ [JavaScriptObject]."

msgid "Returns the Java class name."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຄລາສ Java."

msgid ""
"Returns the object's Java methods and their signatures as an [Array] of "
"dictionaries, in the same format as [method Object.get_method_list]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນວິທີການ (methods) ຂອງ Java ຂອງວັດຖຸ ແລະ ລາຍລະອຽດ (signatures) ຂອງພວກມັນໃນຮູບແບບ "
"[Array] ຂອງດີກຊັນນາຣີ (dictionaries), ໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນກັບ [method "
"Object.get_method_list]."

msgid "Returns a [JavaClass] representing the Java parent class of this class."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [JavaClass] ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງຄລາສແມ່ (parent class) ຂອງຄລາສນີ້ໃນ Java."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given [param method] name exists in the "
"object's Java methods."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຊື່ [param method] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາມີຢູ່ໃນວິທີການ Java ຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid "Provides access to the Java Native Interface."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ Java Native Interface."

msgid ""
"The JavaClassWrapper singleton provides a way for the Godot application to "
"send and receive data through the [url=https://developer.android.com/training/"
"articles/perf-jni]Java Native Interface[/url] (JNI).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This singleton is only available in Android builds.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var LocalDateTime = JavaClassWrapper.wrap(\"java.time.LocalDateTime\")\n"
"var DateTimeFormatter = "
"JavaClassWrapper.wrap(\"java.time.format.DateTimeFormatter\")\n"
"\n"
"var datetime = LocalDateTime.now()\n"
"var formatter = DateTimeFormatter.ofPattern(\"dd-MM-yyyy HH:mm:ss\")\n"
"\n"
"print(datetime.format(formatter))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] When calling Java methods, be sure to check [method "
"JavaClassWrapper.get_exception] to check if the method threw an exception."
msgstr ""
"ຊິງເກິລຕັນ (singleton) JavaClassWrapper ໃຫ້ວິທີການສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ Godot ໃນການສົ່ງ ແລະ "
"ຮັບຂໍ້ມູນຜ່ານ [url=https://developer.android.com/training/articles/perf-jni]Java "
"Native Interface[/url] (JNI).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊິງເກິລຕັນນີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນການບິວດ໌ (builds) ສຳລັບ Android ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var LocalDateTime = JavaClassWrapper.wrap(\"java.time.LocalDateTime\")\n"
"var DateTimeFormatter = "
"JavaClassWrapper.wrap(\"java.time.format.DateTimeFormatter\")\n"
"\n"
"var datetime = LocalDateTime.now()\n"
"var formatter = DateTimeFormatter.ofPattern(\"dd-MM-yyyy HH:mm:ss\")\n"
"\n"
"print(datetime.format(formatter))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການຂອງ Java, ຢ່າລືມກວດສອບ [method "
"JavaClassWrapper.get_exception] ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງວ່າວິທີການນັ້ນມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (exception) ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid "Integrating with Android APIs"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ Android APIs"

msgid ""
"Creates a [JavaObject] implementing the given Java interfaces using the given "
"[Object] as the implementation.\n"
"The [param object] must contain methods signatures matching the methods "
"signatures from the passed Java [param interfaces]. Invoking methods from the "
"Java [param interfaces] will route to the matching [param object] method.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"class PrintProxy:\n"
"\tfunc println(content: String) -> void:\n"
"\t\tprint(content)\n"
"\n"
"var print_proxy = PrintProxy.new()\n"
"var printer_object = JavaClassWrapper.create_proxy(print_proxy, "
"[\"android.util.Printer\"])\n"
"printer_object.println(\"Hello Godot World!\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works on Android. On every other platform, this "
"method will always return [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [JavaObject] ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານ (implement) Java interfaces ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍໃຊ້ [Object] "
"ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນຕົວຈັດການ.\n"
"[param object] ຕ້ອງມີລາຍລະອຽດວິທີການ (methods signatures) ທີ່ກົງກັບວິທີການຈາກ Java "
"[param interfaces] ທີ່ສົ່ງມາ. ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການຈາກ Java [param interfaces] "
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາວິທີການທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ [param object].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"class PrintProxy:\n"
"\tfunc println(content: String) -> void:\n"
"\t\tprint(content)\n"
"\n"
"var print_proxy = PrintProxy.new()\n"
"var printer_object = JavaClassWrapper.create_proxy(print_proxy, "
"[\"android.util.Printer\"])\n"
"printer_object.println(\"ສະບາຍດີຊາວໂລກ Godot!\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Android ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]null[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Creates a [JavaObject] implementing the Java Single Abstract Method (SAM) "
"interface using the Godot [Callable] as the implementation.\n"
"The [param sam_interface] [b]must be[/b] a Java SAM interface, meaning it "
"must only have a single abstract method to implement.\n"
"The [param callable] must be able to handle the same parameter types as the "
"SAM interface method, and must provide the same return type. The [param "
"callable] will be invoked as a callback, passing the arguments from the Java "
"SAM interface method.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var cb = func (content: String) -> void:\n"
"\tprint(content)\n"
"var callback = JavaClassWrapper.create_sam_callback(\"android.util.Printer\", "
"cb)\n"
"callback.println(\"Hello Godot World!\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works on Android. On every other platform, this "
"method will always return [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [JavaObject] ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານ Java Single Abstract Method (SAM) interface ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"Godot [Callable] ເປັນຕົວຈັດການ.\n"
"[param sam_interface] [b]ຕ້ອງແມ່ນ[/b] Java SAM interface, "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນຕ້ອງມີພຽງວິທີການດ່ຽວ (single abstract method) ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ງານ.\n"
"[param callable] ຕ້ອງສາມາດຈັດການກັບປະເພດພາຣາມິເຕີດຽວກັນກັບວິທີການໃນ SAM interface, ແລະ "
"ຕ້ອງສົ່ງຄືນປະເພດຄ່າດຽວກັນ. [param callable] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເປັນຄໍແບັກ (callback), "
"ໂດຍສົ່ງອາກິວເມນຈາກວິທີການໃນ Java SAM interface ໄປໃຫ້.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var cb = func (content: String) -> void:\n"
"\tprint(content)\n"
"var callback = JavaClassWrapper.create_sam_callback(\"android.util.Printer\", "
"cb)\n"
"callback.println(\"ສະບາຍດີຊາວໂລກ Godot!\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Android ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]null[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the Java exception from the last call into a Java class. If there was "
"no exception, it will return [code]null[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works on Android. On every other platform, this "
"method will always return [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (exception) ຂອງ Java ຈາກການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄລາສ Java ຄັ້ງຫຼ້າສຸດ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, "
"ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Android ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]null[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Wraps a class defined in Java, and returns it as a [JavaClass] [Object] type "
"that Godot can interact with.\n"
"When wrapping inner (nested) classes, use [code]$[/code] instead of [code].[/"
"code] to separate them. For example, "
"[code]JavaClassWrapper.wrap(\"android.view.WindowManager$LayoutParams\")[/"
"code] wraps the [b]WindowManager.LayoutParams[/b] class.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To invoke a constructor, call a method with the same name as the "
"class. For example:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var Intent = JavaClassWrapper.wrap(\"android.content.Intent\")\n"
"var intent = Intent.Intent()\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works on Android. On every other platform, this "
"method does nothing and returns an empty [JavaClass]."
msgstr ""
"ຄອບ (Wraps) ຄລາສທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ Java, ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນເປັນປະເພດ [JavaClass] [Object] ທີ່ Godot "
"ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມໄດ້.\n"
"ເມື່ອຄອບຄລາສພາຍໃນ (nested classes), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [code]$[/code] ແທນ [code].[/code] "
"ເພື່ອແຍກພວກມັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"[code]JavaClassWrapper.wrap(\"android.view.WindowManager$LayoutParams\")[/"
"code] ຄອບຄລາສ [b]WindowManager.LayoutParams[/b].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄອນສະຕຣັກເຕີ (constructor), ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການທີ່ມີຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບຄລາສ. "
"ຕົວຢ່າງ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var Intent = JavaClassWrapper.wrap(\"android.content.Intent\")\n"
"var intent = Intent.Intent()\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Android ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ, "
"ວິທີການນີ້ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຫຍັງ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [JavaClass] ທີ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid "Represents an object from the Java Native Interface."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງວັດຖຸ (object) ຈາກ Java Native Interface."

msgid ""
"Represents an object from the Java Native Interface. It can be returned from "
"Java methods called on [JavaClass] or other [JavaObject]s. See "
"[JavaClassWrapper] for an example.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class only works on Android. On any other platform, this "
"class does nothing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class is not to be confused with [JavaScriptObject]."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຖິງວັດຖຸຈາກ Java Native Interface. ມັນສາມາດຖືກສົ່ງຄືນມາຈາກວິທີການຂອງ Java "
"ທີ່ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນ [JavaClass] ຫຼື [JavaObject] ອື່ນໆ. ເບິ່ງ [JavaClassWrapper] ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄລາສນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Android ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆ, "
"ຄລາສນີ້ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຫຍັງເລີຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄລາສນີ້ບໍ່ຄວນສັບສົນກັບ [JavaScriptObject]."

msgid "Returns the [JavaClass] that this object is an instance of."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [JavaClass] ທີ່ວັດຖຸນີ້ນຳມາສ້າງ (instance of)."

msgid ""
"Singleton that connects the engine with the browser's JavaScript context in "
"Web export."
msgstr ""
"ຊິງເກິລຕັນ (singleton) ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເອນຈິນກັບບຣິບລີບ (context) JavaScript "
"ຂອງບຣາວເຊີໃນການສົ່ງອອກແບບ Web."

msgid ""
"The JavaScriptBridge singleton is implemented only in the Web export. It's "
"used to access the browser's JavaScript context. This allows interaction with "
"embedding pages or calling third-party JavaScript APIs.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This singleton can be disabled at build-time to improve "
"security. By default, the JavaScriptBridge singleton is enabled. Official "
"export templates also have the JavaScriptBridge singleton enabled. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/engine_details/development/compiling/"
"compiling_for_web.html]Compiling for the Web[/url] in the documentation for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"ຊິງເກິລຕັນ JavaScriptBridge ຖືກໃຊ້ງານສະເພາະໃນການສົ່ງອອກແບບ Web ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງບຣິບລີບ (context) JavaScript ຂອງບຣາວເຊີ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດໂຕ້ຕອບກັບໜ້າເວັບທີ່ຝັງຢູ່ ຫຼື ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ JavaScript APIs ຂອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊິງເກິລຕັນນີ້ສາມາດຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໃນຕອນບິວດ໌ (build-time) ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມປອດໄພ. "
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, JavaScriptBridge ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄວ້. "
"ເທັມເພລດການສົ່ງອອກຢ່າງເປັນທາງການກໍມີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານຊິງເກິລຕັນນີ້ໄວ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.html]Compiling for the "
"Web[/url] ໃນເອກະສານສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "The JavaScriptBridge singleton"
msgstr "ຊິງເກິລຕັນ JavaScriptBridge"

msgid ""
"Creates a reference to a [Callable] that can be used as a callback by "
"JavaScript. The reference must be kept until the callback happens, or it "
"won't be called at all. See [JavaScriptObject] for usage.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The callback function must take exactly one [Array] argument, "
"which is going to be the JavaScript [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/"
"docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/arguments]arguments object[/url] "
"converted to an array."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງການອ້າງອີງຫາ [Callable] ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຄໍແບັກ (callback) ໂດຍ JavaScript. "
"ການອ້າງອີງຕ້ອງຖືກເກັບໄວ້ຈົນກວ່າຈະມີການເອີ້ນຄໍແບັກ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເລີຍ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[JavaScriptObject] ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນຄໍແບັກຕ້ອງຮັບອາກິວເມນ [Array] ພຽງອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນ "
"[url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/"
"Functions/arguments]arguments object[/url] ຂອງ JavaScript ທີ່ຖືກແປງເປັນອາເຣ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new JavaScript object using the [code]new[/code] constructor. The "
"[param object] must a valid property of the JavaScript [code]window[/code]. "
"See [JavaScriptObject] for usage."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງວັດຖຸ JavaScript ໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄອນສະຕຣັກເຕີ [code]new[/code]. [param object] "
"ຕ້ອງເປັນພຣັອບເປີຕີ (property) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງ JavaScript [code]window[/code]. ເບິ່ງ "
"[JavaScriptObject] ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Prompts the user to download a file containing the specified [param buffer]. "
"The file will have the given [param name] and [param mime] type.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The browser may override the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Media_type]MIME type[/url] provided based on the file [param name]'s "
"extension.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Browsers might block the download if [method download_buffer] is "
"not being called from a user interaction (e.g. button click).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Browsers might ask the user for permission or block the download "
"if multiple download requests are made in a quick succession."
msgstr ""
"ແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີເນື້ອໃນຈາກ [param buffer] ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ໄຟລ໌ຈະມີ [param name] ແລະ "
"ປະເພດ [param mime] ຕາມທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບຣາວເຊີອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Media_type]MIME type[/url] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາໂດຍອີງຕາມນາມສະກຸນຂອງ [param name] ຂອງໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບຣາວເຊີອາດຈະບລັອກການດາວໂຫຼດຖ້າ [method download_buffer] "
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຈາກການໂຕ້ຕອບຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ (ເຊັ່ນ ການຄລິກປຸ່ມ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບຣາວເຊີອາດຈະຂໍອະນຸຍາດຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼື "
"ບລັອກການດາວໂຫຼດຖ້າມີການຮ້ອງຂໍດາວໂຫຼດຫຼາຍຄັ້ງໃນເວລາທີ່ໃກ້ກັນ."

msgid ""
"Execute the string [param code] as JavaScript code within the browser window. "
"This is a call to the actual global JavaScript function [code skip-lint]eval()"
"[/code].\n"
"If [param use_global_execution_context] is [code]true[/code], the code will "
"be evaluated in the global execution context. Otherwise, it is evaluated in "
"the execution context of a function within the engine's runtime environment."
msgstr ""
"ປະມວນຜົນຂໍ້ຄວາມ [param code] ເປັນລະຫັດ JavaScript ພາຍໃນໜ້າຕ່າງບຣາວເຊີ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ JavaScript ທົ່ວໂລກ [code skip-lint]eval()[/code].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param use_global_execution_context] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ລະຫັດຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນບຣິບລີບການເຮັດວຽກທົ່ວໂລກ (global execution context). ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ມັນຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນບຣິບລີບຂອງຟັງຊັນພາຍໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງເອນຈິນ."

msgid ""
"Force synchronization of the persistent file system (when enabled).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only useful for modules or extensions that can't use "
"[FileAccess] to write files."
msgstr ""
"ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ (synchronization) ຂອງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຄົງທີ່ (ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສະເພາະສຳລັບໂມດູນ (modules) ຫຼື ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ (extensions) "
"ທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ [FileAccess] ເພື່ອຂຽນໄຟລ໌ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns an interface to a JavaScript object that can be used by scripts. The "
"[param interface] must be a valid property of the JavaScript [code]window[/"
"code]. The callback must accept a single [Array] argument, which will contain "
"the JavaScript [code]arguments[/code]. See [JavaScriptObject] for usage."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອິນເຕີເຟສ (interface) ຫາວັດຖຸ JavaScript ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍສະຄຣິບ. [param "
"interface] ຕ້ອງເປັນພຣັອບເປີຕີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງ JavaScript [code]window[/code]. "
"ຄໍແບັກຕ້ອງຮັບອາກິວເມນ [Array] ພຽງອັນດຽວ, ເຊິ່ງຈະບັນຈຸ [code]arguments[/code] ຂອງ "
"JavaScript. ເບິ່ງ [JavaScriptObject] ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given [param javascript_object] is of type "
"[url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/"
"Global_Objects/ArrayBuffer]ArrayBuffer[/url], [url=https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/"
"DataView]DataView[/url], or one of the many [url=https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/"
"TypedArray]typed array objects[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param javascript_object] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາແມ່ນປະເພດ "
"[url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/"
"Global_Objects/ArrayBuffer]ArrayBuffer[/url], [url=https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/"
"DataView]DataView[/url], ຫຼື ໜຶ່ງໃນ [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/"
"Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/TypedArray]typed array objects[/url] "
"ທີ່ມີຫຼາຍປະເພດ."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of [param javascript_buffer]'s contents as a "
"[PackedByteArray]. See also [method is_js_buffer]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສຳເນົາຂອງເນື້ອໃນໃນ [param javascript_buffer] ເປັນ [PackedByteArray]. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method is_js_buffer] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a new version of the progressive web app is "
"waiting to be activated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only relevant when exported as a Progressive Web App."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີເວີຊັນໃໝ່ຂອງ progressive web app (PWA) "
"ກຳລັງລໍຖ້າການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສະເພາະເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກເປັນ Progressive Web App ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Performs the live update of the progressive web app. Forcing the new version "
"to be installed and the page to be reloaded.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Your application will be [b]reloaded in all browser tabs[/b].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only relevant when exported as a Progressive Web App and [method "
"pwa_needs_update] returns [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດ progressive web app ແບບສົດໆ. ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງເວີຊັນໃໝ່ ແລະ ໂຫຼດໜ້າເວັບໃໝ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂອງທ່ານຈະຖືກ [b]ໂຫຼດໃໝ່ໃນທຸກແທັບຂອງບຣາວເຊີ[/b].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສະເພາະເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກເປັນ Progressive Web App ແລະ [method "
"pwa_needs_update] ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when an update for this progressive web app has been detected but is "
"waiting to be activated because a previous version is active. See [method "
"pwa_update] to force the update to take place immediately."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອກວດພົບການອັບເດດສຳລັບ progressive web app ນີ້ ແຕ່ກຳລັງລໍຖ້າການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້າຍັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. ເບິ່ງ [method pwa_update] ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີການອັບເດດທັນທີ."

msgid "A wrapper class for web native JavaScript objects."
msgstr "ຄລາສຄອບ (wrapper class) ສຳລັບວັດຖຸ JavaScript ພື້ນເມືອງຂອງເວັບ."

msgid ""
"JavaScriptObject is used to interact with JavaScript objects retrieved or "
"created via [method JavaScriptBridge.get_interface], [method "
"JavaScriptBridge.create_object], or [method "
"JavaScriptBridge.create_callback].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var _my_js_callback = JavaScriptBridge.create_callback(myCallback) # This "
"reference must be kept\n"
"var console = JavaScriptBridge.get_interface(\"console\")\n"
"\n"
"func _init():\n"
"\tvar buf = JavaScriptBridge.create_object(\"ArrayBuffer\", 10) # new "
"ArrayBuffer(10)\n"
"\tprint(buf) # Prints [JavaScriptObject:OBJECT_ID]\n"
"\tvar uint8arr = JavaScriptBridge.create_object(\"Uint8Array\", buf) # new "
"Uint8Array(buf)\n"
"\tuint8arr[1] = 255\n"
"\tprints(uint8arr[1], uint8arr.byteLength) # Prints \"255 10\"\n"
"\n"
"\t# Prints \"Uint8Array(10) [ 0, 255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0 ]\" in the "
"browser's console.\n"
"\tconsole.log(uint8arr)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Equivalent of JavaScriptBridge: Array.from(uint8arr).forEach(myCallback)\n"
"\tJavaScriptBridge.get_interface(\"Array\").from(uint8arr).forEach(_my_js_callback)\n"
"\n"
"func myCallback(args):\n"
"\t# Will be called with the parameters passed to the \"forEach\" callback\n"
"\t# [0, 0, [JavaScriptObject:1173]]\n"
"\t# [255, 1, [JavaScriptObject:1173]]\n"
"\t# ...\n"
"\t# [0, 9, [JavaScriptObject:1180]]\n"
"\tprint(args)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only available in the Web platform."
msgstr ""
"JavaScriptObject ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອໂຕ້ຕອບກັບວັດຖຸ JavaScript ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບມາ ຫຼື ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຜ່ານ [method "
"JavaScriptBridge.get_interface], [method JavaScriptBridge.create_object], ຫຼື "
"[method JavaScriptBridge.create_callback].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var _my_js_callback = JavaScriptBridge.create_callback(myCallback) # "
"ຕ້ອງເກັບການອ້າງອີງນີ້ໄວ້\n"
"var console = JavaScriptBridge.get_interface(\"console\")\n"
"\n"
"func _init():\n"
"\tvar buf = JavaScriptBridge.create_object(\"ArrayBuffer\", 10) # new "
"ArrayBuffer(10)\n"
"\tprint(buf) # ຈະສະແດງ [JavaScriptObject:OBJECT_ID]\n"
"\tvar uint8arr = JavaScriptBridge.create_object(\"Uint8Array\", buf) # new "
"Uint8Array(buf)\n"
"\tuint8arr[1] = 255\n"
"\tprints(uint8arr[1], uint8arr.byteLength) # ຈະສະແດງ \"255 10\"\n"
"\n"
"\t# ຈະສະແດງ \"Uint8Array(10) [ 0, 255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0 ]\" "
"ໃນຄອນໂຊລຂອງບຣາວເຊີ.\n"
"\tconsole.log(uint8arr)\n"
"\n"
"\t# ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ JavaScriptBridge: Array.from(uint8arr).forEach(myCallback)\n"
"\tJavaScriptBridge.get_interface(\"Array\").from(uint8arr).forEach(_my_js_callback)\n"
"\n"
"func myCallback(args):\n"
"\t# ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ພ້ອມກັບພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ສົ່ງມາໃຫ້ຄໍແບັກ \"forEach\"\n"
"\t# [0, 0, [JavaScriptObject:1173]]\n"
"\t# [255, 1, [JavaScriptObject:1173]]\n"
"\t# ...\n"
"\t# [0, 9, [JavaScriptObject:1180]]\n"
"\tprint(args)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນແພລັດຟອມ Web ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Singleton that connects the engine with Android plugins to interface with "
"native Android code."
msgstr ""
"ຊິງເກິລຕັນ (singleton) ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເອນຈິນກັບປລັກອິນ (plugins) ຂອງ Android "
"ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບລະຫັດພື້ນເມືອງຂອງ Android."

msgid ""
"The JNISingleton is implemented only in the Android export. It's used to call "
"methods and connect signals from an Android plugin written in Java or Kotlin. "
"Methods and signals can be called and connected to the JNISingleton as if it "
"is a Node. See [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Java_Native_Interface]Java "
"Native Interface - Wikipedia[/url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"JNISingleton ຖືກໃຊ້ງານສະເພາະໃນການສົ່ງອອກແບບ Android ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການ "
"ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານຈາກປລັກອິນ Android ທີ່ຂຽນດ້ວຍພາສາ Java ຫຼື Kotlin. ວິທີການ ແລະ "
"ສັນຍານສາມາດຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ JNISingleton ໄດ້ຄືກັບວ່າມັນເປັນ Node. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Java_Native_Interface]Java Native "
"Interface - Wikipedia[/url] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "Creating Android plugins"
msgstr "ການສ້າງປລັກອິນ Android"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given [param method] name exists in the "
"JNISingleton's Java methods."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຊື່ [param method] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາມີຢູ່ໃນວິທີການ Java ຂອງ "
"JNISingleton."

msgid "Abstract base class for all 2D physics joints."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳ (abstract) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຟີຊິກ 2D ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Abstract base class for all joints in 2D physics. 2D joints bind together two "
"physics bodies ([member node_a] and [member node_b]) and apply a constraint."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທັງໝົດໃນຟີຊິກ 2D. ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ 2D ຈະຜູກມັດວັດຖຸຟີຊິກສອງອັນເຂົ້າກັນ ([member "
"node_a] ແລະ [member node_b]) ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ (constraint)."

msgid "Returns the joint's internal [RID] from the [PhysicsServer2D]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [RID] ພາຍໃນຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຈາກ [PhysicsServer2D]."

msgid ""
"When [member node_a] and [member node_b] move in different directions the "
"[member bias] controls how fast the joint pulls them back to their original "
"position. The lower the [member bias] the more the two bodies can pull on the "
"joint.\n"
"When set to [code]0[/code], the default value from [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/2d/solver/default_constraint_bias] is used."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member node_a] ແລະ [member node_b] ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປໃນທິດທາງທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, [member bias] "
"ຈະຄວບຄຸມຄວາມໄວທີ່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຈະດຶງພວກມັນກັບມາທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງເດີມ. ຍິ່ງຄ່າ [member bias] ຕ່ຳ, "
"ວັດຖຸທັງສອງກໍຈະຍິ່ງສາມາດດຶງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ [member ProjectSettings.physics/2d/"
"solver/default_constraint_bias]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the two bodies bound together do not collide with each "
"other."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວັດຖຸທັງສອງທີ່ຜູກມັດເຂົ້າກັນຈະບໍ່ຕຳກັນເອງ."

msgid ""
"Path to the first body (A) attached to the joint. The node must inherit "
"[PhysicsBody2D]."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງຫາວັດຖຸທຳອິດ (A) ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່. ໂນດຕ້ອງສືບທອດມາຈາກ [PhysicsBody2D]."

msgid ""
"Path to the second body (B) attached to the joint. The node must inherit "
"[PhysicsBody2D]."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງຫາວັດຖຸທີສອງ (B) ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່. ໂນດຕ້ອງສືບທອດມາຈາກ [PhysicsBody2D]."

msgid "Abstract base class for all 3D physics joints."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຟີຊິກ 3D ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Abstract base class for all joints in 3D physics. 3D joints bind together two "
"physics bodies ([member node_a] and [member node_b]) and apply a constraint. "
"If only one body is defined, it is attached to a fixed [StaticBody3D] without "
"collision shapes."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທັງໝົດໃນຟີຊິກ 3D. ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ 3D ຈະຜູກມັດວັດຖຸຟີຊິກສອງອັນເຂົ້າກັນ ([member "
"node_a] ແລະ [member node_b]) ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ. ຖ້າກຳນົດວັດຖຸພຽງອັນດຽວ, ມັນຈະຖືກຕິດເຂົ້າກັບ "
"[StaticBody3D] ທີ່ຄົງທີ່ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຮູບຮ່າງການຕຳ."

msgid "3D Truck Town Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ 3D Truck Town"

msgid "Returns the joint's internal [RID] from the [PhysicsServer3D]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [RID] ພາຍໃນຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຈາກ [PhysicsServer3D]."

msgid ""
"Path to the first node (A) attached to the joint. The node must inherit "
"[PhysicsBody3D].\n"
"If left empty and [member node_b] is set, the body is attached to a fixed "
"[StaticBody3D] without collision shapes."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງຫາໂນດທຳອິດ (A) ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່. ໂນດຕ້ອງສືບທອດມາຈາກ [PhysicsBody3D].\n"
"ຖ້າປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ ແລະ ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member node_b], ວັດຖຸຈະຖືກຕິດເຂົ້າກັບ [StaticBody3D] "
"ທີ່ຄົງທີ່ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຮູບຮ່າງການຕຳ."

msgid ""
"Path to the second node (B) attached to the joint. The node must inherit "
"[PhysicsBody3D].\n"
"If left empty and [member node_a] is set, the body is attached to a fixed "
"[StaticBody3D] without collision shapes."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງຫາໂນດທີສອງ (B) ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່. ໂນດຕ້ອງສືບທອດມາຈາກ [PhysicsBody3D].\n"
"ຖ້າປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ ແລະ ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member node_a], ວັດຖຸຈະຖືກຕິດເຂົ້າກັບ [StaticBody3D] "
"ທີ່ຄົງທີ່ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຮູບຮ່າງການຕຳ."

msgid "A base class of the limitation that interacts with [ChainIK3D]."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານຂອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ [ChainIK3D]."

msgid ""
"The limitation is attached to each joint and limits the rotation of the bone."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຈະຖືກຕິດເຂົ້າກັບແຕ່ລະຂໍ້ຕໍ່ ແລະ ຈຳກັດການໝູນຂອງກະດູກ."

msgid "A cone shape limitation that interacts with [ChainIK3D]."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຮູບຊົງຈວຍ (cone) ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ [ChainIK3D]."

msgid ""
"The radius range of the hole made by the cone.\n"
"[code]0[/code] degrees makes a sphere without hole, [code]180[/code] degrees "
"makes a hemisphere, and [code]360[/code] degrees become empty (no limitation)."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ວງລັດສະໝີຂອງຮູທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍຮູບຈວຍ.\n"
"[code]0[/code] ອົງສາຈະສ້າງເປັນຮູບຊົງກົມທີ່ບໍ່ມີຮູ, [code]180[/code] "
"ອົງສາຈະສ້າງເປັນຮູບຊົງກົມເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ, ແລະ [code]360[/code] ອົງສາຈະກາຍເປັນຫວ່າງເປົ່າ (ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ)."

msgid "Helper class for creating and parsing JSON data."
msgstr "ຄລາສຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອສຳລັບການສ້າງ ແລະ ແປງຂໍ້ມູນ JSON."

msgid ""
"The [JSON] class enables all data types to be converted to and from a JSON "
"string. This is useful for serializing data, e.g. to save to a file or send "
"over the network.\n"
"[method stringify] is used to convert any data type into a JSON string.\n"
"[method parse] is used to convert any existing JSON data into a [Variant] "
"that can be used within Godot. If successfully parsed, use [member data] to "
"retrieve the [Variant], and use [method @GlobalScope.typeof] to check if the "
"Variant's type is what you expect. JSON Objects are converted into a "
"[Dictionary], but JSON data can be used to store [Array]s, numbers, [String]s "
"and even just a boolean.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var data_to_send = [\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"]\n"
"var json_string = JSON.stringify(data_to_send)\n"
"# Save data\n"
"# ...\n"
"# Retrieve data\n"
"var json = JSON.new()\n"
"var error = json.parse(json_string)\n"
"if error == OK:\n"
"\tvar data_received = json.data\n"
"\tif typeof(data_received) == TYPE_ARRAY:\n"
"\t\tprint(data_received) # Prints the array.\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Unexpected data\")\n"
"else:\n"
"\tprint(\"JSON Parse Error: \", json.get_error_message(), \" in \", "
"json_string, \" at line \", json.get_error_line())\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Alternatively, you can parse strings using the static [method parse_string] "
"method, but it doesn't handle errors.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var data = JSON.parse_string(json_string) # Returns null if parsing failed.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Both parse methods do not fully comply with the JSON "
"specification:\n"
"- Trailing commas in arrays or objects are ignored, instead of causing a "
"parser error.\n"
"- New line and tab characters are accepted in string literals, and are "
"treated like their corresponding escape sequences [code]\\n[/code] and [code]"
"\\t[/code].\n"
"- Numbers are parsed using [method String.to_float] which is generally more "
"lax than the JSON specification.\n"
"- Certain errors, such as invalid Unicode sequences, do not cause a parser "
"error. Instead, the string is cleaned up and an error is logged to the "
"console."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສ [JSON] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດແປງຂໍ້ມູນທຸກປະເພດໃຫ້ເປັນ ແລະ ມາຈາກສະຕຣິງ JSON. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການຈັດຮຽກຂໍ້ມູນ (serializing), ເຊັ່ນ: ເພື່ອບັນທຶກລົງໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ສົ່ງຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ.\n"
"[method stringify] ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອແປງຂໍ້ມູນປະເພດໃດກໍໄດ້ໃຫ້ເປັນສະຕຣິງ JSON.\n"
"[method parse] ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອແປງຂໍ້ມູນ JSON ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃຫ້ເປັນ [Variant] ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນ Godot ໄດ້. "
"ຖ້າແປງສຳເລັດ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member data] ເພື່ອດຶງຄ່າ [Variant] ອອກມາ, ແລະ ໃຊ້ [method "
"@GlobalScope.typeof] ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງວ່າປະເພດຂອງ Variant ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ ຫຼື ບໍ່. ວັດຖຸ "
"(Objects) JSON ຈະຖືກແປງເປັນ [Dictionary], ແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນ JSON ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບ [Array], "
"ຕົວເລກ, [String] ແລະ ແມ່ນແຕ່ຄ່າບູລີນ (boolean).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var data_to_send = [\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"]\n"
"var json_string = JSON.stringify(data_to_send)\n"
"# ບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນ\n"
"# ...\n"
"# ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ\n"
"var json = JSON.new()\n"
"var error = json.parse(json_string)\n"
"if error == OK:\n"
"\tvar data_received = json.data\n"
"\tif typeof(data_received) == TYPE_ARRAY:\n"
"\t\tprint(data_received) # ຈະສະແດງອາເຣ\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"ຂໍ້ມູນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ\")\n"
"else:\n"
"\tprint(\"JSON Parse Error: \", json.get_error_message(), \" in \", "
"json_string, \" at line \", json.get_error_line())\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດແປງສະຕຣິງໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີການສະແຕຕິກ [method parse_string] ໄດ້, "
"ແຕ່ມັນຈະບໍ່ຈັດການກັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var data = JSON.parse_string(json_string) # ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ null ຖ້າແປງບໍ່ສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທັງສອງວິທີການແປງບໍ່ໄດ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງ JSON ຢ່າງຄົບຖ້ວນ:\n"
"- ຈຸດ (commas) ທີ່ຢູ່ທ້າຍສຸດໃນອາເຣ ຫຼື ວັດຖຸຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ, ແທນທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການແປງ.\n"
"- ຕົວອັກສອນຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ ແລະ ແທັບ (tab) ຖືກຍອມຮັບໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ແລະ ຖືກປະຕິບັດຄືກັບລະຫັດ escape "
"[code]\\n[/code] ແລະ [code]\\t[/code].\n"
"- ຕົວເລກຖືກແປງໂດຍໃຊ້ [method String.to_float] ເຊິ່ງໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະຜ່ອນຜັນກວ່າຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງ "
"JSON.\n"
"- ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດບາງຢ່າງ, ເຊັ່ນ: ລຳດັບ Unicode ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການແປງ. "
"ແຕ່ສະຕຣິງຈະຖືກທຳຄວາມສະອາດ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນຄອນໂຊລແທນ."

msgid ""
"Converts a native engine type to a JSON-compliant value.\n"
"By default, objects are ignored for security reasons, unless [param "
"full_objects] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"You can convert a native value to a JSON string like this:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func encode_data(value, full_objects = false):\n"
"\treturn JSON.stringify(JSON.from_native(value, full_objects))\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ແປງປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນເມືອງຂອງເອນຈິນໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ JSON.\n"
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ວັດຖຸ (objects) ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ, ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ [param "
"full_objects] ເປັນ [code]true[/code].\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດແປງຄ່າພື້ນເມືອງໃຫ້ເປັນສະຕຣິງ JSON ໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func encode_data(value, full_objects = false):\n"
"\treturn JSON.stringify(JSON.from_native(value, full_objects))\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]0[/code] if the last call to [method parse] was successful, or "
"the line number where the parse failed."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]0[/code] ຖ້າການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method parse] ຄັ້ງຫຼ້າສຸດສຳເລັດ, ຫຼື "
"ສົ່ງຄືນເລກແຖວທີ່ການແປງລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"Returns an empty string if the last call to [method parse] was successful, or "
"the error message if it failed."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສະຕຣິງຫວ່າງເປົ່າຖ້າການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method parse] ຄັ້ງຫຼ້າສຸດສຳເລັດ, ຫຼື "
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຖ້າມັນລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"Return the text parsed by [method parse] (requires passing [code]keep_text[/"
"code] to [method parse])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກແປງໂດຍ [method parse] (ຕ້ອງມີການສົ່ງ [code]keep_text[/code] ໃຫ້ກັບ "
"[method parse])."

msgid ""
"Attempts to parse the [param json_text] provided.\n"
"Returns an [enum Error]. If the parse was successful, it returns [constant "
"OK] and the result can be retrieved using [member data]. If unsuccessful, use "
"[method get_error_line] and [method get_error_message] to identify the source "
"of the failure.\n"
"Non-static variant of [method parse_string], if you want custom error "
"handling.\n"
"The optional [param keep_text] argument instructs the parser to keep a copy "
"of the original text. This text can be obtained later by using the [method "
"get_parsed_text] function and is used when saving the resource (instead of "
"generating new text from [member data])."
msgstr ""
"ພະຍາຍາມແປງ [param json_text] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [enum Error]. ຖ້າການແປງສຳເລັດ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [constant OK] ແລະ "
"ຜົນລັບສາມາດດຶງອອກມາໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member data]. ຖ້າບໍ່ສຳເລັດ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method get_error_line] "
"ແລະ [method get_error_message] ເພື່ອລະບຸສາເຫດຂອງການລົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"
"ນີ້ແມ່ນລຸ້ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສະແຕຕິກຂອງ [method parse_string], "
"ໃຊ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການຂໍ້ຜິດພາດເອງ.\n"
"ອາກິວເມນ [param keep_text] ທາງເລືອກ ຈະບອກໃຫ້ຕົວແປງເກັບສຳເນົາຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບໄວ້. "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ສາມາດດຶງມາໄດ້ພາຍຫຼັງໂດຍໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ [method get_parsed_text] ແລະ ຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອບັນທຶກຣີສອດ "
"(ແທນທີ່ຈະສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ຈາກ [member data])."

msgid ""
"Attempts to parse the [param json_string] provided and returns the parsed "
"data. Returns [code]null[/code] if parse failed."
msgstr ""
"ພະຍາຍາມແປງ [param json_string] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ແປງແລ້ວ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/"
"code] ຖ້າການແປງລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"Converts a JSON-compliant value that was created with [method from_native] "
"back to native engine types.\n"
"By default, objects are ignored for security reasons, unless [param "
"allow_objects] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"You can convert a JSON string back to a native value like this:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func decode_data(string, allow_objects = false):\n"
"\treturn JSON.to_native(JSON.parse_string(string), allow_objects)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ແປງຄ່າທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ JSON ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍ [method from_native] "
"ກັບຄືນເປັນປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນເມືອງຂອງເອນຈິນ.\n"
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ວັດຖຸ (objects) ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ, ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ [param "
"allow_objects] ເປັນ [code]true[/code].\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດແປງສະຕຣິງ JSON ກັບຄືນເປັນຄ່າພື້ນເມືອງໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func decode_data(string, allow_objects = false):\n"
"\treturn JSON.to_native(JSON.parse_string(string), allow_objects)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Contains the parsed JSON data in [Variant] form."
msgstr "ບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນ JSON ທີ່ແປງແລ້ວໃນຮູບແບບ [Variant]."

msgid "A helper to handle dictionaries which look like JSONRPC documents."
msgstr "ຕົວຊ່ວຍໃນການຈັດການດີກຊັນນາຣີ (dictionaries) ທີ່ມີລັກສະນະຄືກັບເອກະສານ JSONRPC."

msgid ""
"[url=https://www.jsonrpc.org/]JSON-RPC[/url] is a standard which wraps a "
"method call in a [JSON] object. The object has a particular structure and "
"identifies which method is called, the parameters to that function, and "
"carries an ID to keep track of responses. This class implements that standard "
"on top of [Dictionary]; you will have to convert between a [Dictionary] and "
"[JSON] with other functions."
msgstr ""
"[url=https://www.jsonrpc.org/]JSON-RPC[/url] ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານທີ່ຄອບການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການ "
"(method call) ໄວ້ໃນວັດຖຸ [JSON]. ວັດຖຸນີ້ມີໂຄງສ້າງສະເພາະ ແລະ ລະບຸວ່າວິທີການໃດຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້, "
"ພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງຟັງຊັນນັ້ນ, ແລະ ມີ ID ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມການຕອບກັບ. ຄລາສນີ້ໃຊ້ງານມາດຕະຖານນັ້ນໂດຍອີງໃສ່ "
"[Dictionary]; ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງແປງລະຫວ່າງ [Dictionary] ແລະ [JSON] ດ້ວຍຟັງຊັນອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary in the form of a JSON-RPC notification. Notifications "
"are one-shot messages which do not expect a response.\n"
"- [param method]: Name of the method being called.\n"
"- [param params]: An array or dictionary of parameters being passed to the "
"method."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນດີກຊັນນາຣີໃນຮູບແບບຂອງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ (notification) JSON-RPC. "
"ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມແບບຄັ້ງດຽວທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຫວັງການຕອບກັບ.\n"
"- [param method]: ຊື່ຂອງວິທີການທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້.\n"
"- [param params]: ອາເຣ ຫຼື ດີກຊັນນາຣີຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງໃຫ້ວິທີການ."

msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary in the form of a JSON-RPC request. Requests are sent to "
"a server with the expectation of a response. The ID field is used for the "
"server to specify which exact request it is responding to.\n"
"- [param method]: Name of the method being called.\n"
"- [param params]: An array or dictionary of parameters being passed to the "
"method.\n"
"- [param id]: Uniquely identifies this request. The server is expected to "
"send a response with the same ID."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນດີກຊັນນາຣີໃນຮູບແບບຂອງການຮ້ອງຂໍ (request) JSON-RPC. "
"ການຮ້ອງຂໍຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາເຊີເວີໂດຍຄາດຫວັງການຕອບກັບ. ຟິວ ID "
"ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຊີເວີລະບຸວ່າກຳລັງຕອບກັບການຮ້ອງຂໍໃດແທ້ໆ.\n"
"- [param method]: ຊື່ຂອງວິທີການທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້.\n"
"- [param params]: ອາເຣ ຫຼື ດີກຊັນນາຣີຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງໃຫ້ວິທີການ.\n"
"- [param id]: ລະບຸຕົວຕົນທີ່ເປັນເອກະລັກຂອງການຮ້ອງຂໍນີ້. ເຊີເວີຈະຕ້ອງສົ່ງການຕອບກັບທີ່ມີ ID ດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"When a server has received and processed a request, it is expected to send a "
"response. If you did not want a response then you need to have sent a "
"Notification instead.\n"
"- [param result]: The return value of the function which was called.\n"
"- [param id]: The ID of the request this response is targeted to."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຊີເວີໄດ້ຮັບ ແລະ ປະມວນຜົນການຮ້ອງຂໍແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະຕ້ອງສົ່ງການຕອບກັບ. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການການຕອບກັບ, "
"ທ່ານຄວນສົ່ງເປັນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ (Notification) ແທນ.\n"
"- [param result]: ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈາກຟັງຊັນທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້.\n"
"- [param id]: ID ຂອງການຮ້ອງຂໍທີ່ການຕອບກັບນີ້ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"Creates a response which indicates a previous reply has failed in some way.\n"
"- [param code]: The error code corresponding to what kind of error this is. "
"See the [enum ErrorCode] constants.\n"
"- [param message]: A custom message about this error.\n"
"- [param id]: The request this error is a response to."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງການຕອບກັບທີ່ບົ່ງບອກວ່າການຕອບກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ລົ້ມເຫຼວໃນບາງທາງ.\n"
"- [param code]: ລະຫັດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ກົງກັບປະເພດຂອງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນັ້ນ. ເບິ່ງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum ErrorCode].\n"
"- [param message]: ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກຳນົດເອງກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້.\n"
"- [param id]: ການຮ້ອງຂໍທີ່ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້ເປັນການຕອບກັບ."

msgid ""
"Given a Dictionary which takes the form of a JSON-RPC request: unpack the "
"request and run it. Methods are resolved by looking at the field called "
"\"method\" and looking for an equivalently named function in the JSONRPC "
"object. If one is found that method is called.\n"
"To add new supported methods extend the JSONRPC class and call [method "
"process_action] on your subclass.\n"
"[param action]: The action to be run, as a Dictionary in the form of a JSON-"
"RPC request or notification."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບ Dictionary ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງການຮ້ອງຂໍ JSON-RPC: ຈະທຳການແກະການຮ້ອງຂໍ ແລະ "
"ປະມວນຜົນມັນ. ວິທີການຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກຄົ້ນຫາໂດຍເບິ່ງຈາກຟິວທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ \"method\" ແລະ "
"ຊອກຫາຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີຊື່ດຽວກັນໃນວັດຖຸ JSONRPC. ຖ້າພົບ, ວິທີການນັ້ນຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້.\n"
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມວິທີການໃໝ່ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍ (extend) ຄລາສ JSONRPC ແລະ ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"process_action] ໃນຄລາສຍ່ອຍຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"[param action]: ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນ, ໃນຮູບແບບ Dictionary ຂອງການຮ້ອງຂໍ ຫຼື "
"ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ JSON-RPC."

msgid ""
"Registers a callback for the given method name.\n"
"- [param name]: The name that clients can use to access the callback.\n"
"- [param callback]: The callback which will handle the specified method."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນຄໍແບັກ (callback) ສຳລັບຊື່ວິທີການທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"- [param name]: ຊື່ທີ່ໄຄລແອນ (clients) ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຄໍແບັກໄດ້.\n"
"- [param callback]: ຄໍແບັກທີ່ຈະຈັດການວິທີການທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid ""
"The request could not be parsed as it was not valid by JSON standard ([method "
"JSON.parse] failed)."
msgstr ""
"ການຮ້ອງຂໍບໍ່ສາມາດແປງໄດ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມມາດຕະຖານ JSON ([method JSON.parse] "
"ລົ້ມເຫຼວ)."

msgid "A method call was requested but the request's format is not valid."
msgstr "ມີການຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການ ແຕ່ຮູບແບບຂອງການຮ້ອງຂໍບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"A method call was requested but no function of that name existed in the "
"JSONRPC subclass."
msgstr "ມີການຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການ ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີຟັງຊັນຊື່ນັ້ນຢູ່ໃນຄລາສຍ່ອຍຂອງ JSONRPC."

msgid ""
"A method call was requested but the given method parameters are not valid. "
"Not used by the built-in JSONRPC."
msgstr ""
"ມີການຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການ ແຕ່ພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງວິທີການທີ່ໃຫ້ມາບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ JSONRPC "
"ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບເອນຈິນ."

msgid ""
"An internal error occurred while processing the request. Not used by the "
"built-in JSONRPC."
msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດພາຍໃນຂະນະປະມວນຜົນການຮ້ອງຂໍ. ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ JSONRPC ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບເອນຈິນ."

msgid "Holds collision data from the movement of a [PhysicsBody2D]."
msgstr "ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການຕຳທີ່ເກີດຈາກການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງ [PhysicsBody2D]."

msgid ""
"Holds collision data from the movement of a [PhysicsBody2D], usually from "
"[method PhysicsBody2D.move_and_collide]. When a [PhysicsBody2D] is moved, it "
"stops if it detects a collision with another body. If a collision is "
"detected, a [KinematicCollision2D] object is returned.\n"
"The collision data includes the colliding object, the remaining motion, and "
"the collision position. This data can be used to determine a custom response "
"to the collision."
msgstr ""
"ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການຕຳທີ່ເກີດຈາກການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງ [PhysicsBody2D], ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແມ່ນມາຈາກ [method "
"PhysicsBody2D.move_and_collide]. ເມື່ອ [PhysicsBody2D] ເຄື່ອນທີ່, "
"ມັນຈະຢຸດຖ້າມັນກວດພົບການຕຳກັບວັດຖຸອື່ນ. ຖ້າກວດພົບການຕຳ, ວັດຖຸ [KinematicCollision2D] "
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນມາ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ມູນການຕຳປະກອບມີວັດຖຸທີ່ມາຕຳ, ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ທີ່ເຫຼືອ, ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງການຕຳ. "
"ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການກຳນົດການຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການຕຳຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the collision angle according to [param up_direction], which is "
"[constant Vector2.UP] by default. This value is always positive."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນມຸມການຕຳຕາມ [param up_direction], ເຊິ່ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [constant Vector2.UP]. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນຄ່າບວກສະເໝີ."

msgid "Returns the colliding body's attached [Object]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Object] ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ມາຕຳ."

msgid ""
"Returns the unique instance ID of the colliding body's attached [Object]. See "
"[method Object.get_instance_id]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ທີ່ເປັນເອກະລັກຂອງ [Object] ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ມາຕຳ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"Object.get_instance_id]."

msgid "Returns the colliding body's [RID] used by the [PhysicsServer2D]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ມາຕຳທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ [PhysicsServer2D]."

msgid "Returns the colliding body's shape."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຮູບຮ່າງ (shape) ຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ມາຕຳ."

msgid "Returns the colliding body's shape index. See [CollisionObject2D]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນດັດຊະນີຮູບຮ່າງຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ມາຕຳ. ເບິ່ງ [CollisionObject2D]."

msgid "Returns the colliding body's velocity."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຄວາມໄວຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ມາຕຳ."

msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's length of overlap along the collision normal."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມຍາວຂອງສ່ວນທີ່ຊ້ອນທັບກັນ (overlap) ຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳກັນຕາມແນວເສັ້ນຕັ້ງສາກການຕຳ (collision "
"normal)."

msgid "Returns the moving object's colliding shape."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຮູບຮ່າງການຕຳຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ກຳລັງເຄື່ອນທີ່."

msgid "Returns the colliding body's shape's normal at the point of collision."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນຕັ້ງສາກ (normal) ຂອງຮູບຮ່າງວັດຖຸທີ່ມາຕຳຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດທີ່ມີການຕຳ."

msgid "Returns the point of collision in global coordinates."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດທີ່ມີການຕຳໃນພິກັດສາກົນ (global coordinates)."

msgid "Returns the moving object's remaining movement vector."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເວັກເຕີການເຄື່ອນທີ່ທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ກຳລັງເຄື່ອນທີ່."

msgid "Returns the moving object's travel before collision."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໄລຍະການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງວັດຖຸກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເກີດການຕຳ."

msgid "Holds collision data from the movement of a [PhysicsBody3D]."
msgstr "ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການຕຳທີ່ເກີດຈາກການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງ [PhysicsBody3D]."

msgid ""
"Holds collision data from the movement of a [PhysicsBody3D], usually from "
"[method PhysicsBody3D.move_and_collide]. When a [PhysicsBody3D] is moved, it "
"stops if it detects a collision with another body. If a collision is "
"detected, a [KinematicCollision3D] object is returned.\n"
"The collision data includes the colliding object, the remaining motion, and "
"the collision position. This data can be used to determine a custom response "
"to the collision."
msgstr ""
"ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການຕຳທີ່ເກີດຈາກການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງ [PhysicsBody3D], ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແມ່ນມາຈາກ [method "
"PhysicsBody3D.move_and_collide]. ເມື່ອ [PhysicsBody3D] ເຄື່ອນທີ່, "
"ມັນຈະຢຸດຖ້າມັນກວດພົບການຕຳກັບວັດຖຸອື່ນ. ຖ້າກວດພົບການຕຳ, ວັດຖຸ [KinematicCollision3D] "
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນມາ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ມູນການຕຳປະກອບມີວັດຖຸທີ່ມາຕຳ, ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ທີ່ເຫຼືອ, ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງການຕຳ. "
"ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການກຳນົດການຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການຕຳຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the collision angle according to [param up_direction], which is "
"[constant Vector3.UP] by default. This value is always positive."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນມຸມການຕຳຕາມ [param up_direction], ເຊິ່ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [constant Vector3.UP]. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນຄ່າບວກສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's attached [Object] given a collision index (the "
"deepest collision by default)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Object] ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ມາຕຳຕາມດັດຊະນີການຕຳທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ (ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the unique instance ID of the colliding body's attached [Object] "
"given a collision index (the deepest collision by default). See [method "
"Object.get_instance_id]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ທີ່ເປັນເອກະລັກຂອງ [Object] ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ມາຕຳ ຕາມດັດຊະນີການຕຳທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ "
"(ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດ). ເບິ່ງ [method Object.get_instance_id]."

msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's [RID] used by the [PhysicsServer3D] given a "
"collision index (the deepest collision by default)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ມາຕຳທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ [PhysicsServer3D] ຕາມດັດຊະນີການຕຳທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ "
"(ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's shape given a collision index (the deepest "
"collision by default)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຮູບຮ່າງຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ມາຕຳ ຕາມດັດຊະນີການຕຳທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ (ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's shape index given a collision index (the deepest "
"collision by default). See [CollisionObject3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນດັດຊະນີຮູບຮ່າງຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ມາຕຳ ຕາມດັດຊະນີການຕຳທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ (ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດ). ເບິ່ງ "
"[CollisionObject3D]."

msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's velocity given a collision index (the deepest "
"collision by default)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຄວາມໄວຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ມາຕຳ ຕາມດັດຊະນີການຕຳທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ (ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດ)."

msgid "Returns the number of detected collisions."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນການຕຳທີ່ກວດພົບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the moving object's colliding shape given a collision index (the "
"deepest collision by default)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຮູບຮ່າງການຕຳຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ກຳລັງເຄື່ອນທີ່ ຕາມດັດຊະນີການຕຳທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ (ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's shape's normal at the point of collision given a "
"collision index (the deepest collision by default)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນຕັ້ງສາກ (normal) ຂອງຮູບຮ່າງວັດຖຸທີ່ມາຕຳຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດທີ່ມີການຕຳ ຕາມດັດຊະນີການຕຳທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ "
"(ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the point of collision in global coordinates given a collision index "
"(the deepest collision by default)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດທີ່ມີການຕຳໃນພິກັດສາກົນ ຕາມດັດຊະນີການຕຳທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ (ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດ)."

msgid "A control for displaying plain text."
msgstr "ຕົວຄວບຄຸມສຳລັບສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ."

msgid ""
"A control for displaying plain text. It gives you control over the horizontal "
"and vertical alignment and can wrap the text inside the node's bounding "
"rectangle. It doesn't support bold, italics, or other rich text formatting. "
"For that, use [RichTextLabel] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A single Label node is not designed to display huge amounts of "
"text. To display large amounts of text in a single node, consider using "
"[RichTextLabel] instead as it supports features like an integrated scroll bar "
"and threading. [RichTextLabel] generally performs better when displaying "
"large amounts of text (several pages or more)."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄວບຄຸມສຳລັບສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ. ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຄວບຄຸມການຈັດລຽງໃນລວງນອນ ແລະ ລວງຕັ້ງ, "
"ແລະ ສາມາດຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ (wrap) ຂໍ້ຄວາມພາຍໃນຂອບເຂດສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຂອງໂນດໄດ້. ມັນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຕົວໜາ, ຕົວອຽງ, ຫຼື "
"ຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມອື່ນໆ (rich text). ສຳລັບການນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [RichTextLabel] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດ Label ດ່ຽວບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຈຳນວນມະຫາສານ. "
"ເພື່ອສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໃນໂນດດຽວ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [RichTextLabel] ແທນ "
"ເພາະມັນຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ແຖບເລື່ອນໃນຕົວ ແລະ ການປະມວນຜົນແບບເທຣດ (threading). "
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ [RichTextLabel] ຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີກວ່າເມື່ອສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ (ຫຼາຍໜ້າ ຫຼື "
"ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the bounding rectangle of the character at position [param pos] in "
"the label's local coordinate system. If the character is a non-visual "
"character or [param pos] is outside the valid range, an empty [Rect2] is "
"returned. If the character is a part of a composite grapheme, the bounding "
"rectangle of the whole grapheme is returned."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຂອບເຂດ (bounding rectangle) ຂອງຕົວອັກສອນຢູ່ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ [param pos] "
"ໃນລະບົບພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງເລເບລ (label). ຖ້າຕົວອັກສອນເປັນຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ບໍ່ສະແດງຜົນ ຫຼື [param pos] "
"ຢູ່ນອກຊ່ວງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [Rect2] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ. ຖ້າຕົວອັກສອນເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຮູບສັນຍາລັກປະສົມ "
"(composite grapheme), ຈະສົ່ງຄືນສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຂອບເຂດຂອງຮູບສັນຍາລັກທັງໝົດ."

msgid "Returns the number of lines of text the Label has."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນແຖວຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ Label ມີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the height of the line [param line].\n"
"If [param line] is set to [code]-1[/code], returns the biggest line height.\n"
"If there are no lines, returns font size in pixels."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມສູງຂອງແຖວ [param line].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param line] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]-1[/code], ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມສູງຂອງແຖວທີ່ໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສຸດ.\n"
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີແຖວເລີຍ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດຟອນເປັນພິກເຊວ."

msgid ""
"Returns the total number of printable characters in the text (excluding "
"spaces and newlines)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດທີ່ສາມາດພິມໄດ້ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ (ບໍ່ລວມຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ແລະ ການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່)."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of lines shown. Useful if the [Label]'s height cannot "
"currently display all lines."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນແຖວທີ່ສະແດງຜົນ. ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຄວາມສູງຂອງ [Label] "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດສະແດງທຸກແຖວໄດ້ໃນຂະນະນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If set to something other than [constant TextServer.AUTOWRAP_OFF], the text "
"gets wrapped inside the node's bounding rectangle. If you resize the node, it "
"will change its height automatically to show all the text.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Labels with autowrapping enabled must have a custom maximum "
"width configured to work correctly, either through the Label's own [member "
"Control.custom_maximum_size] or as a result of a propagated maximum size from "
"a parent Control with [member Control.propagate_maximum_size] enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [constant TextServer.AUTOWRAP_OFF], ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ "
"(wrapped) ພາຍໃນຂອບເຂດສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຂອງໂນດ. ຖ້າທ່ານປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຂອງໂນດ, "
"ມັນຈະປ່ຽນຄວາມສູງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Labels ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ຕ້ອງມີການກຳນົດຄວາມກວ້າງສູງສຸດເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຜ່ານ [member "
"Control.custom_maximum_size] ຂອງ Label ເອງ ຫຼື ເປັນຜົນມາຈາກການສົ່ງຕໍ່ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຈາກ "
"Control ແມ່ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ [member Control.propagate_maximum_size]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Label only shows the text that fits inside its "
"bounding rectangle and will clip text horizontally."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], Label ຈະສະແດງພຽງແຕ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ພໍດີກັບຂອບເຂດສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຂອງມັນ ແລະ "
"ຈະຕັດຂໍ້ຄວາມ (clip) ໃນລວງນອນ."

msgid "Ellipsis character used for text clipping."
msgstr "ຕົວອັກສອນຈຸດໄຂ່ປາ (ellipsis) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕັດຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Controls the text's horizontal alignment. Supports left, center, right, and "
"fill (also known as justify)."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມການຈັດລຽງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕາມລວງນອນ. ຮອງຮັບການຈັດຊ້າຍ, ກາງ, ຂວາ, ແລະ ແບບເຕັມແຖວ (ຫຼື "
"ທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກກັນໃນຊື່ justify)."

msgid "Line fill alignment rules."
msgstr "ກົດລະບຽບການຈັດລຽງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃຫ້ເຕັມແຖວ."

msgid ""
"A [LabelSettings] resource that can be shared between multiple [Label] nodes. "
"Takes priority over theme properties."
msgstr ""
"ຣີສອດ [LabelSettings] ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນລະຫວ່າງຫຼາຍໂນດ [Label]. "
"ຈະມີຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງກວ່າຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຮູບແບບ (theme properties)."

msgid ""
"The number of the lines ignored and not displayed from the start of the "
"[member text] value."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແຖວທີ່ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ ແລະ ບໍ່ສະແດງຜົນ ໂດຍນັບຈາກຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຄ່າ [member text]."

msgid "Limits the lines of text the node shows on screen."
msgstr "ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນແຖວຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໂນດຈະສະແດງໃນໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"String used as a paragraph separator. Each paragraph is processed "
"independently, in its own BiDi context."
msgstr "ສະຕຣິງທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວແຍກຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ. ແຕ່ລະຫຍໍ້ໜ້າຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນແຍກກັນ, ໃນບຣິບລີບ BiDi ຂອງມັນເອງ."

msgid "Set BiDi algorithm override for the structured text."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການທັບຊ້ອນ (override) ອັລກໍຣິທຶມ BiDi ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີໂຄງສ້າງ."

msgid "Set additional options for BiDi override."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າທາງເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບການທັບຊ້ອນ BiDi."

msgid "Aligns text to the given tab-stops."
msgstr "ຈັດລຽງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງແທັບ (tab-stops) ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "The text to display on screen."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"The clipping behavior when the text exceeds the node's bounding rectangle."
msgstr "ພຶດຕິກຳການຕັດຂໍ້ຄວາມເມື່ອຂໍ້ຄວາມເກີນຂອບເຂດສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຂອງໂນດ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], all the text displays as UPPERCASE."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດຈະສະແດງເປັນຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ (UPPERCASE)."

msgid ""
"Controls the text's vertical alignment. Supports top, center, bottom, and "
"fill."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມການຈັດລຽງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕາມລວງຕັ້ງ. ຮອງຮັບການຈັດເທິງ, ກາງ, ລຸ່ມ, ແລະ ແບບເຕັມຄວາມສູງ (fill)."

msgid ""
"The number of characters to display. If set to [code]-1[/code], all "
"characters are displayed. This can be useful when animating the text "
"appearing in a dialog box.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this property updates [member visible_ratio] "
"accordingly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Characters are counted as Unicode codepoints. A single visible "
"grapheme may contain multiple codepoints (e.g. certain emoji use three "
"codepoints). A single codepoint may contain two UTF-16 characters, which are "
"used in C# strings."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຈະສະແດງ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]-1[/code], ຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສະແດງ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອເຮັດແອນິເມຊັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຄ່ອຍໆປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະອັບເດດ [member visible_ratio] ໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວອັກສອນຈະຖືກນັບຕາມ Unicode codepoints. ຮູບສັນຍາລັກ (grapheme) "
"ດ່ຽວທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ອາດຈະປະກອບມີຫຼາຍ codepoints (ເຊັ່ນ: ອີໂມຈິບາງອັນໃຊ້ສາມ codepoints). "
"Codepoint ດ່ຽວອາດປະກອບມີສອງຕົວອັກສອນ UTF-16, ເຊິ່ງຖືກໃຊ້ໃນສະຕຣິງຂອງພາສາ C#."

msgid ""
"The clipping behavior when [member visible_characters] or [member "
"visible_ratio] is set."
msgstr ""
"ພຶດຕິກຳການຕັດຂໍ້ຄວາມເມື່ອມີການກຳນົດ [member visible_characters] ຫຼື [member "
"visible_ratio]."

msgid ""
"The fraction of characters to display, relative to the total number of "
"characters (see [method get_total_character_count]). If set to [code]1.0[/"
"code], all characters are displayed. If set to [code]0.5[/code], only half of "
"the characters will be displayed. This can be useful when animating the text "
"appearing in a dialog box.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this property updates [member visible_characters] "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
"ສັດສ່ວນຂອງຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຈະສະແດງ, ທຽບກັບຈຳນວນຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_total_character_count]). ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]1.0[/code], ຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສະແດງ. "
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0.5[/code], ຈະສະແດງພຽງແຕ່ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຕົວອັກສອນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອເຮັດແອນິເມຊັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຄ່ອຍໆປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະອັບເດດ [member visible_characters] ໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ."

msgid "Default text [Color] of the [Label]."
msgstr "ສີ [Color] ຂໍ້ຄວາມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [Label]."

msgid "The color of text outline."
msgstr "ສີຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid "[Color] of the text's shadow effect."
msgstr "ສີ [Color] ຂອງເອັບເຟັກເງົາຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Text outline size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If using a font with [member "
"FontFile.multichannel_signed_distance_field] enabled, its [member "
"FontFile.msdf_pixel_range] must be set to at least [i]twice[/i] the value of "
"[theme_item outline_size] for outline rendering to look correct. Otherwise, "
"the outline may appear to be cut off earlier than intended.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using a value that is larger than half the font size is not "
"recommended, as the font outline may fail to be fully closed in this case."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດເສັ້ນຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າໃຊ້ຟອນທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"FontFile.multichannel_signed_distance_field], ຄ່າ [member "
"FontFile.msdf_pixel_range] ຂອງມັນຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ [i]ສອງເທົ່າ[/i] ຂອງຄ່າ "
"[theme_item outline_size] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການສະແດງເສັ້ນຂອບເບິ່ງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ເສັ້ນຂອບອາດຈະປະກົດວ່າຖືກຕັດອອກກ່ອນທີ່ຄວນຈະເປັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະໜາດຟອນ, "
"ເພາະເສັ້ນຂອບຟອນອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດປິດໄດ້ສະນິດໃນກໍລະນີນີ້."

msgid ""
"Vertical space between paragraphs. Added on top of [theme_item line_spacing]."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງລວງຕັ້ງລະຫວ່າງຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ. ຖືກເພີ່ມໃສ່ທາງເທິງຂອງ [theme_item line_spacing]."

msgid "The horizontal offset of the text's shadow."
msgstr "ຄ່າອອຟເຊັດລວງນອນຂອງເງົາຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid "The vertical offset of the text's shadow."
msgstr "ຄ່າອອຟເຊັດລວງຕັ້ງຂອງເງົາຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid "The size of the shadow outline."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບເງົາ."

msgid "[Font] used for the [Label]'s text."
msgstr "[Font] ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງ [Label]."

msgid "Font size of the [Label]'s text."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ [Label]."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] used when the [Label] is focused (when used with assistive apps)."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [Label] ຖືກໂຟກັດ (ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ)."

msgid "Background [StyleBox] for the [Label]."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບ [Label]."

msgid "A node for displaying plain text in 3D space."
msgstr "ໂນດສຳລັບສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາໃນພື້ນທີ່ 3D."

msgid ""
"A node for displaying plain text in 3D space. By adjusting various properties "
"of this node, you can configure things such as the text's appearance and "
"whether it always faces the camera."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດສຳລັບສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາໃນພື້ນທີ່ 3D. ໂດຍການປັບແຕ່ງຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆຂອງໂນດນີ້, "
"ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດສິ່ງຕ່າງໆໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ: ຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ "
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຈະໃຫ້ມັນປິ່ນໜ້າຫາເວລາກ້ອງຕະຫຼອດເວລາ ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid "3D text"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມ 3D"

msgid ""
"Returns a [TriangleMesh] with the label's vertices following its current "
"configuration (such as its [member pixel_size])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [TriangleMesh] ພ້ອມກັບຈຸດຍອດ (vertices) ຂອງເລເບລ ຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນ (ເຊັ່ນ "
"[member pixel_size] ຂອງມັນ)."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the specified [param flag] will be enabled."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [param flag] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "The alpha cutting mode to use for the sprite."
msgstr "ໂໝດການຕັດຄ່າອັລຟາທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບສະໄປຣທ໌ (sprite)."

msgid "Threshold at which the alpha scissor will discard values."
msgstr "ຄ່າຂີດຈຳກັດ (Threshold) ທີ່ alpha scissor ຈະເລືອກຖິ້ມຄ່າ."

msgid ""
"If set to something other than [constant TextServer.AUTOWRAP_OFF], the text "
"gets wrapped inside the node's bounding rectangle. If you resize the node, it "
"will change its height automatically to show all the text."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນຢ່າງອື່ນນອກຈາກ [constant TextServer.AUTOWRAP_OFF], "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກຕັດຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ພາຍໃນຂອບເຂດຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກຂອງໂນດ. ຖ້າທ່ານປັບຂະໜາດໂນດ, "
"ມັນຈະປ່ຽນຄວາມສູງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດ."

msgid "The billboard mode to use for the label."
msgstr "ໂໝດບິລບອດ (billboard) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບເລເບວ (label)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], text can be seen from the back as well, if [code]false[/"
"code], it is invisible when looking at it from behind."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກທາງຫຼັງໄດ້ຄືກັນ, ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/"
"code], ມັນຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກທາງຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the label is rendered at the same size regardless of "
"distance. The label's size on screen is the same as if the camera was "
"[code]1.0[/code] units away from the label's origin, regardless of the actual "
"distance from the camera. The [Camera3D]'s field of view (or [member "
"Camera3D.size] when in orthogonal/frustum mode) still affects the size the "
"label is drawn at."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເເລເບວຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນໃນຂະໜາດດຽວກັນໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງໄລຍະຫ່າງ. "
"ຂະໜາດຂອງເລເບວເທິງໜ້າຈໍຈະເທົ່າກັບຕອນທີ່ກ້ອງຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກຈຸດກຳເນີດຂອງເລເບວ [code]1.0[/code] ຢູນິດ, "
"ບໍ່ວ່າໄລຍະຫ່າງຕົວຈິງຈາກກ້ອງຈະເປັນເທົ່າໃດກໍຕາມ. ທັງນີ້ Field of view ຂອງ [Camera3D] (ຫຼື "
"[member Camera3D.size] ເມື່ອຢູ່ໃນໂໝດ orthogonal/frustum) "
"ຍັງຄົງສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຂະໜາດການສະແດງຜົນຂອງເລເບວ."

msgid "Font configuration used to display text."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວອັກສອນ (Font) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Font size of the [Label3D]'s text. To make the font look more detailed when "
"up close, increase [member font_size] while decreasing [member pixel_size] at "
"the same time.\n"
"Higher font sizes require more time to render new characters, which can cause "
"stuttering during gameplay."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຕົວອັກສອນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ [Label3D]. ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຕົວອັກສອນເບິ່ງມີລາຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເບິ່ງໃກ້ໆ, "
"ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ [member font_size] ພ້ອມກັບຫຼຸດ [member pixel_size] ລົງໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ.\n"
"ຂະໜາດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນການປະມວນຜົນຕົວອັກສອນໃໝ່, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດອາການກະຕຸກ "
"(stuttering) ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມໄດ້."

msgid "Text [Color] of the [Label3D]."
msgstr "ສີ [Color] ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ [Label3D]."

msgid "The text drawing offset (in pixels)."
msgstr "ຄ່າການເຍື້ອງ (offset) ໃນການແຕ້ມຂໍ້ຄວາມ (ເປັນພິກເຊວ)."

msgid "The tint of text outline."
msgstr "ສີຍ້ອມຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the render priority for the text outline. Higher priority objects will "
"be sorted in front of lower priority objects.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only applies if [member alpha_cut] is set to [constant "
"ALPHA_CUT_DISABLED] (default value).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only applies to sorting of transparent objects. This will "
"not impact how transparent objects are sorted relative to opaque objects. "
"This is because opaque objects are not sorted, while transparent objects are "
"sorted from back to front (subject to priority)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນໃນການສະແດງຜົນ (render priority) ສຳລັບເສັ້ນຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມ. "
"ວັດຖຸທີ່ມີລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງກວ່າຈະຖືກຈັດວາງໄວ້ທາງໜ້າວັດຖຸທີ່ມີລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຕ່ຳກວ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member alpha_cut] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"ALPHA_CUT_DISABLED] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບການຈັດລຳດັບວັດຖຸໂປ່ງໃສເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການຈັດລຳດັບລະຫວ່າງວັດຖຸໂປ່ງໃສກັບວັດຖຸທຶບແສງ. ເນື່ອງຈາກວັດຖຸທຶບແສງຈະບໍ່ມີການຈັດລຳດັບ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ວັດຖຸໂປ່ງໃສຈະຖືກຈັດລຳດັບຈາກຫຼັງມາໜ້າ (ຕາມລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນ)."

msgid "Text outline size."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດເສັ້ນຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"The size of one pixel's width on the label to scale it in 3D. To make the "
"font look more detailed when up close, increase [member font_size] while "
"decreasing [member pixel_size] at the same time."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງໜຶ່ງພິກເຊວເທິງເລເບວເພື່ອປັບຂະໜາດໃນຮູບແບບ 3D. "
"ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຕົວອັກສອນເບິ່ງມີລາຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເບິ່ງໃກ້ໆ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ [member font_size] ພ້ອມກັບຫຼຸດ "
"[member pixel_size] ລົງໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the render priority for the text. Higher priority objects will be sorted "
"in front of lower priority objects.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only applies if [member alpha_cut] is set to [constant "
"ALPHA_CUT_DISABLED] (default value).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only applies to sorting of transparent objects. This will "
"not impact how transparent objects are sorted relative to opaque objects. "
"This is because opaque objects are not sorted, while transparent objects are "
"sorted from back to front (subject to priority)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນໃນການສະແດງຜົນ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ. "
"ວັດຖຸທີ່ມີລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງກວ່າຈະຖືກຈັດວາງໄວ້ທາງໜ້າວັດຖຸທີ່ມີລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຕ່ຳກວ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member alpha_cut] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"ALPHA_CUT_DISABLED] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບການຈັດລຳດັບວັດຖຸໂປ່ງໃສເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການຈັດລຳດັບລະຫວ່າງວັດຖຸໂປ່ງໃສກັບວັດຖຸທຶບແສງ. ເນື່ອງຈາກວັດຖຸທຶບແສງຈະບໍ່ມີການຈັດລຳດັບ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ວັດຖຸໂປ່ງໃສຈະຖືກຈັດລຳດັບຈາກຫຼັງມາໜ້າ (ຕາມລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [Light3D] in the [Environment] has effects on the "
"label."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແສງ [Light3D] ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [Environment] "
"ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ເລເບວ."

msgid "Filter flags for the texture."
msgstr "ແຟລັກການກັ່ນຕອງ (Filter flags) ສຳລັບເທັກເຈີ."

msgid ""
"Controls the text's vertical alignment. Supports top, center, and bottom."
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມການຈັດວາງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນແນວຕັ້ງ. ຮອງຮັບແບບ ເທິງ, ກາງ, ແລະ ລຸ່ມ."

msgid "Text width (in pixels), used for autowrap and fill alignment."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ (ເປັນພິກເຊວ), ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕັດແຖວອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ການຈັດວາງແບບເຕັມຂອບ."

msgid "If set, lights in the environment affect the label."
msgstr "ຖ້າຕັ້ງໄວ້, ແສງໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ເລເບວ."

msgid ""
"If set, text can be seen from the back as well. If not, the text is invisible "
"when looking at it from behind."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງໄວ້, ຈະສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກທາງຫຼັງໄດ້ຄືກັນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ຕັ້ງ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກທາງຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"Disables the depth test, so this object is drawn on top of all others. "
"However, objects drawn after it in the draw order may cover it."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການທົດສອບຄວາມເລິກ (depth test), ເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸນີ້ຖືກແຕ້ມທັບເທິງວັດຖຸອື່ນທັງໝົດ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມຫຼັງຈາກມັນຕາມລຳດັບການແຕ້ມອາດຈະບັງມັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Label is scaled by depth so that it always appears the same size on screen."
msgstr "ເລເບວຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດຕາມຄວາມເລິກ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນສະແດງຜົນໃນຂະໜາດດຽວກັນສະເໝີເທິງໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum DrawFlags] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum DrawFlags]."

msgid ""
"This mode performs standard alpha blending. It can display translucent areas, "
"but transparency sorting issues may be visible when multiple transparent "
"materials are overlapping. [member GeometryInstance3D.cast_shadow] has no "
"effect when this transparency mode is used; the [Label3D] will never cast "
"shadows."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດນີ້ຈະເຮັດການປະສົມອັລຟາ (alpha blending) ແບບມາດຕະຖານ. ມັນສາມາດສະແດງສ່ວນທີ່ໂປ່ງແສງໄດ້, "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະເຫັນບັນຫາການຈັດລຳດັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສເມື່ອມີວັດຖຸໂປ່ງໃສຫຼາຍອັນຊ້ອນກັນ. [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.cast_shadow] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສນີ້; [Label3D] "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີການສ້າງເງົາເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"This mode only allows fully transparent or fully opaque pixels. Harsh edges "
"will be visible unless some form of screen-space antialiasing is enabled (see "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/screen_space_aa]). "
"This mode is also known as [i]alpha testing[/i] or [i]1-bit transparency[/"
"i].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This mode might have issues with anti-aliased fonts and "
"outlines, try adjusting [member alpha_scissor_threshold] or using MSDF font.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using text with overlapping glyphs (e.g., cursive scripts), "
"this mode might have transparency sorting issues between the main text and "
"the outline."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດນີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີພຽງພິກເຊວທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສທັງໝົດ ຫຼື ທຶບແສງທັງໝົດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຈະເຫັນຂອບທີ່ຄົມເກີນໄປ "
"ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານການລົບຮອຍຢັກ (antialiasing) ບາງຮູບແບບ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/screen_space_aa]). "
"ໂໝດນີ້ຍັງຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ [i]alpha testing[/i] ຫຼື [i]1-bit transparency[/i].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂໝດນີ້ອາດມີບັນຫາກັບຕົວອັກສອນ ແລະ ເສັ້ນຂອບທີ່ມີການລົບຮອຍຢັກ, ໃຫ້ລອງປັບ [member "
"alpha_scissor_threshold] ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນແບບ MSDF.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຕົວອັກສອນຊ້ອນກັນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ຕົວຂຽນຫວັດ), "
"ໂໝດນີ້ອາດມີບັນຫາການຈັດລຳດັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສລະຫວ່າງຂໍ້ຄວາມຫຼັກ ແລະ ເສັ້ນຂອບ."

msgid ""
"This mode draws fully opaque pixels in the depth prepass. This is slower than "
"[constant ALPHA_CUT_DISABLED] or [constant ALPHA_CUT_DISCARD], but it allows "
"displaying translucent areas and smooth edges while using proper sorting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using text with overlapping glyphs (e.g., cursive scripts), "
"this mode might have transparency sorting issues between the main text and "
"the outline."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດນີ້ຈະແຕ້ມພິກເຊວທີ່ທຶບແສງທັງໝົດໃນຂັ້ນຕອນ depth prepass. ມັນຈະຊ້າກວ່າ [constant "
"ALPHA_CUT_DISABLED] ຫຼື [constant ALPHA_CUT_DISCARD], ແຕ່ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສະແດງສ່ວນໂປ່ງແສງ "
"ແລະ ຂອບທີ່ລຽບນຽນໄດ້ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງມີການຈັດລຳດັບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຕົວອັກສອນຊ້ອນກັນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ຕົວຂຽນຫວັດ), "
"ໂໝດນີ້ອາດມີບັນຫາການຈັດລຳດັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສລະຫວ່າງຂໍ້ຄວາມຫຼັກ ແລະ ເສັ້ນຂອບ."

msgid ""
"This mode draws cuts off all values below a spatially-deterministic "
"threshold, the rest will remain opaque."
msgstr "ໂໝດນີ້ຈະຕັດຄ່າທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຂີດຈຳກັດ (threshold) ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້, ສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຈະຍັງຄົງທຶບແສງ."

msgid "Provides common settings to customize the text in a [Label]."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນ [Label]."

msgid ""
"Adds a new stacked outline to the label at the given [param index]. If [param "
"index] is [code]-1[/code], the new stacked outline will be added at the end "
"of the list."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເສັ້ນຂອບແບບຊ້ອນກັນ (stacked outline) ໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບເລເບວຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ຖ້າ "
"[param index] ແມ່ນ [code]-1[/code], ເສັ້ນຂອບໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຕອນທ້າຍຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid ""
"Adds a new stacked shadow to the label at the given [param index]. If [param "
"index] is [code]-1[/code], the new stacked shadow will be added at the end of "
"the list."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເງົາແບບຊ້ອນກັນ (stacked shadow) ໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບເລເບວຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ຖ້າ [param "
"index] ແມ່ນ [code]-1[/code], ເງົາໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຕອນທ້າຍຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "Returns the color of the stacked outline at [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສີຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນຢູ່ [param index]."

msgid "Returns the size of the stacked outline at [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂະໜາດຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນຢູ່ [param index]."

msgid "Returns the color of the stacked shadow at [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສີຂອງເງົາທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນຢູ່ [param index]."

msgid "Returns the offset of the stacked shadow at [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າການເຍື້ອງ (offset) ຂອງເງົາທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນຢູ່ [param index]."

msgid "Returns the outline size of the stacked shadow at [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂະໜາດເສັ້ນຂອບຂອງເງົາທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນຢູ່ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Moves the stacked outline at index [param from_index] to the given position "
"[param to_position] in the array."
msgstr ""
"ຍ້າຍເສັ້ນຂອບທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນຈາກດັດຊະນີ [param from_index] ໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງ [param to_position] "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນອາເຣ (array)."

msgid ""
"Moves the stacked shadow at index [param from_index] to the given position "
"[param to_position] in the array."
msgstr ""
"ຍ້າຍເງົາທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນຈາກດັດຊະນີ [param from_index] ໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງ [param to_position] "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນອາເຣ (array)."

msgid "Removes the stacked outline at index [param index]."
msgstr "ລົບເສັ້ນຂອບທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນຢູ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index]."

msgid "Removes the stacked shadow at index [param index]."
msgstr "ລົບເງົາທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນຢູ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Sets the color of the stacked outline identified by the given [param index] "
"to [param color]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ລະບຸ ໃຫ້ເປັນ [param color]."

msgid ""
"Sets the size of the stacked outline identified by the given [param index] to "
"[param size]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ລະບຸ ໃຫ້ເປັນ [param size]."

msgid ""
"Sets the color of the stacked shadow identified by the given [param index] to "
"[param color]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີຂອງເງົາທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ລະບຸ ໃຫ້ເປັນ [param color]."

msgid ""
"Sets the offset of the stacked shadow identified by the given [param index] "
"to [param offset]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຍື້ອງ (offset) ຂອງເງົາທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ລະບຸ ໃຫ້ເປັນ [param offset]."

msgid ""
"Sets the outline size of the stacked shadow identified by the given [param "
"index] to [param size]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດເສັ້ນຂອບຂອງເງົາທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ລະບຸ ໃຫ້ເປັນ [param size]."

msgid "[Font] used for the text."
msgstr "[Font] ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid "Color of the text."
msgstr "ສີຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid "Size of the text."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid "The color of the outline."
msgstr "ສີຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບ."

msgid ""
"Vertical space between paragraphs. Added on top of [member line_spacing]."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວຕັ້ງລະຫວ່າງຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ. ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປຈາກ [member line_spacing]."

msgid ""
"Color of the shadow effect. If alpha is [code]0[/code], no shadow will be "
"drawn."
msgstr "ສີຂອງເອັບເຟັກເງົາ. ຖ້າຄ່າອັລຟາແມ່ນ [code]0[/code], ຈະບໍ່ມີການແຕ້ມເງົາ."

msgid "Offset of the shadow effect, in pixels."
msgstr "ຄ່າການເຍື້ອງຂອງເອັບເຟັກເງົາ, ເປັນພິກເຊວ."

msgid "Size of the shadow effect."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງເອັບເຟັກເງົາ."

msgid "The number of stacked outlines."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນ."

msgid ""
"The color of the outline at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. "
"stacked_outline_count - 1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບຢູ່ [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [code]index[/code] ແມ່ນຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0 .. stacked_outline_count "
"- 1[/code]."

msgid ""
"The size of the outline at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. "
"stacked_outline_count - 1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບຢູ່ [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [code]index[/code] ແມ່ນຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0 .. stacked_outline_count "
"- 1[/code]."

msgid "The number of stacked shadows."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂອງເງົາທີ່ຊ້ອນກັນ."

msgid ""
"The color of the shadow at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. "
"stacked_shadow_count - 1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງເງົາຢູ່ [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [code]index[/code] ແມ່ນຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0 .. stacked_shadow_count "
"- 1[/code]."

msgid ""
"The offset of the shadow at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. "
"stacked_shadow_count - 1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າການເຍື້ອງຂອງເງົາຢູ່ [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [code]index[/code] ແມ່ນຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0 .. stacked_shadow_count "
"- 1[/code]."

msgid ""
"The size of the shadow outline at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. "
"stacked_shadow_count - 1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບເງົາຢູ່ [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [code]index[/code] ແມ່ນຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0 .. stacked_shadow_count "
"- 1[/code]."

msgid "Casts light in a 2D environment."
msgstr "ສ່ອງແສງໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ 2D."

msgid ""
"Casts light in a 2D environment. A light is defined as a color, an energy "
"value, a mode (see constants), and various other parameters (range and "
"shadows-related)."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ອງແສງໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ 2D. ແສງຖືກກຳນົດດ້ວຍສີ, ຄ່າພະລັງງານ, ໂໝດ (ເບິ່ງຄ່າຄົງທີ່), ແລະ "
"ພະລາມິເຕີອື່ນໆ (ກ່ຽວກັບໄລຍະ ແລະ ເງົາ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the light's height, which is used in 2D normal mapping. See [member "
"PointLight2D.height] and [member DirectionalLight2D.height]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຄວາມສູງຂອງແສງ, ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ໃນ 2D normal mapping. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"PointLight2D.height] ແລະ [member DirectionalLight2D.height]."

msgid ""
"Sets the light's height, which is used in 2D normal mapping. See [member "
"PointLight2D.height] and [member DirectionalLight2D.height]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມສູງຂອງແສງ, ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ໃນ 2D normal mapping. ເບິ່ງ [member PointLight2D.height] "
"ແລະ [member DirectionalLight2D.height]."

msgid "The Light2D's blend mode."
msgstr "ໂໝດການປະສົມ (blend mode) ຂອງ Light2D."

msgid "The Light2D's [Color]."
msgstr "ສີ [Color] ຂອງ Light2D."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], Light2D will only appear when editing the scene."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], Light2D ຈະປາກົດສະເພາະຕອນທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂສາກ (scene) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], Light2D will emit light."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], Light2D ຈະປ່ອຍແສງອອກມາ."

msgid ""
"The Light2D's energy value. The larger the value, the stronger the light."
msgstr "ຄ່າພະລັງງານຂອງ Light2D. ຍິ່ງຄ່າຫຼາຍ, ແສງກໍຈະຍິ່ງແຮງ."

msgid ""
"The layer mask. Only objects with a matching [member CanvasItem.light_mask] "
"will be affected by the Light2D. See also [member shadow_item_cull_mask], "
"which affects which objects can cast shadows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member range_item_cull_mask] is ignored by "
"[DirectionalLight2D], which will always light a 2D node regardless of the 2D "
"node's [member CanvasItem.light_mask]."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າກາກເລເຢີ (layer mask). ສະເພາະວັດຖຸທີ່ມີ [member CanvasItem.light_mask] "
"ກົງກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ Light2D. ເບິ່ງ [member shadow_item_cull_mask] ຕື່ມ, "
"ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ວັດຖຸທີ່ຈະສ້າງເງົາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member range_item_cull_mask] ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍໂດຍ "
"[DirectionalLight2D], ເຊິ່ງຈະສ່ອງແສງໃສ່ໂນດ 2D ສະເໝີ ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງ [member "
"CanvasItem.light_mask] ຂອງໂນດ 2D ນັ້ນ."

msgid "Maximum layer value of objects that are affected by the Light2D."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລເຢີສູງສຸດຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ Light2D."

msgid "Minimum layer value of objects that are affected by the Light2D."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລເຢີຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ Light2D."

msgid ""
"Maximum [code]z[/code] value of objects that are affected by the Light2D."
msgstr "ຄ່າ [code]z[/code] ສູງສຸດຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ Light2D."

msgid ""
"Minimum [code]z[/code] value of objects that are affected by the Light2D."
msgstr "ຄ່າ [code]z[/code] ຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ Light2D."

msgid "[Color] of shadows cast by the Light2D."
msgstr "ສີ [Color] ຂອງເງົາທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ Light2D."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the Light2D will cast shadows."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], Light2D ຈະສ້າງເງົາ."

msgid "Shadow filter type."
msgstr "ປະເພດການກັ່ນຕອງເງົາ (Shadow filter type)."

msgid ""
"Smoothing value for shadows. Higher values will result in softer shadows, at "
"the cost of visible streaks that can appear in shadow rendering. [member "
"shadow_filter_smooth] only has an effect if [member shadow_filter] is "
"[constant SHADOW_FILTER_PCF5] or [constant SHADOW_FILTER_PCF13]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄວາມລຽບນຽນຂອງເງົາ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາມີຄວາມນຸ່ມນວນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ອາດແລກມາກັບເສັ້ນຮອຍທີ່ປາກົດໃນການປະມວນຜົນເງົາ. [member shadow_filter_smooth] "
"ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member shadow_filter] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant SHADOW_FILTER_PCF5] ຫຼື "
"[constant SHADOW_FILTER_PCF13] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The shadow mask. Used with [LightOccluder2D] to cast shadows. Only occluders "
"with a matching [member CanvasItem.light_mask] will cast shadows. See also "
"[member range_item_cull_mask], which affects which objects can [i]receive[/i] "
"the light."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າກາກເງົາ (shadow mask). ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [LightOccluder2D] ເພື່ອສ້າງເງົາ. "
"ສະເພາະວັດຖຸຂັດຂວາງແສງ (occluders) ທີ່ມີ [member CanvasItem.light_mask] "
"ກົງກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະສ້າງເງົາ. ເບິ່ງ [member range_item_cull_mask] ຕື່ມ, ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ວັດຖຸທີ່ຈະ "
"[i]ຮັບ[/i] ແສງ."

msgid ""
"No filter applies to the shadow map. This provides hard shadow edges and is "
"the fastest to render. See [member shadow_filter]."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ໃຊ້ການກັ່ນຕອງກັບ shadow map. ວິທີນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຂອບເງົາທີ່ແຂງ ແລະ ປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ໄວທີ່ສຸດ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"shadow_filter]."

msgid ""
"Percentage closer filtering (5 samples) applies to the shadow map. This is "
"slower compared to hard shadow rendering. See [member shadow_filter]."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ການກັ່ນຕອງແບບ Percentage closer (5 samples) ກັບ shadow map. "
"ວິທີນີ້ຈະຊ້າກວ່າການປະມວນຜົນເງົາແບບຂອບແຂງ. ເບິ່ງ [member shadow_filter]."

msgid ""
"Percentage closer filtering (13 samples) applies to the shadow map. This is "
"the slowest shadow filtering mode, and should be used sparingly. See [member "
"shadow_filter]."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ການກັ່ນຕອງແບບ Percentage closer (13 samples) ກັບ shadow map. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນໂໝດການກັ່ນຕອງເງົາທີ່ຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ, ແລະ ຄວນໃຊ້ໃນຍາມຈຳເປັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"shadow_filter]."

msgid ""
"Adds the value of pixels corresponding to the Light2D to the values of pixels "
"under it. This is the common behavior of a light."
msgstr "ບວກຄ່າພິກເຊວທີ່ກົງກັບ Light2D ເຂົ້າກັບຄ່າພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມມັນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນພຶດຕິກຳປົກກະຕິຂອງແສງ."

msgid ""
"Subtracts the value of pixels corresponding to the Light2D to the values of "
"pixels under it, resulting in inversed light effect."
msgstr ""
"ລົບຄ່າພິກເຊວທີ່ກົງກັບ Light2D ອອກຈາກຄ່າພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມມັນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດເອັບເຟັກແສງແບບປີ້ນກັບ "
"(inversed light)."

msgid ""
"Mix the value of pixels corresponding to the Light2D to the values of pixels "
"under it by linear interpolation."
msgstr ""
"ປະສົມຄ່າພິກເຊວທີ່ກົງກັບ Light2D ເຂົ້າກັບຄ່າພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມມັນ ດ້ວຍວິທີ linear interpolation."

msgid "Provides a base class for different kinds of light nodes."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຄລາສພື້ນຖານ (base class) ສຳລັບໂນດແສງປະເພດຕ່າງໆ."

msgid ""
"Light3D is the [i]abstract[/i] base class for light nodes. As it can't be "
"instantiated, it shouldn't be used directly. Other types of light nodes "
"inherit from it. Light3D contains the common variables and parameters used "
"for lighting."
msgstr ""
"Light3D ແມ່ນຄລາສພື້ນຖານແບບ [i]abstract[/i] ສຳລັບໂນດແສງ. "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງເປັນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instantiated) ໄດ້, ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ໂດຍກົງ. "
"ໂນດແສງປະເພດອື່ນໆຈະສືບທອດ (inherit) ມາຈາກມັນ. Light3D ປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວປ່ຽນ ແລະ "
"ພະລາມິເຕີທົ່ວໄປທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສ່ອງແສງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Color] of an idealized blackbody at the given [member "
"light_temperature]. This value is calculated internally based on the [member "
"light_temperature]. This [Color] is multiplied by [member light_color] before "
"being sent to the [RenderingServer]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສີ [Color] ຂອງວັດຖຸດຳທີ່ສົມມຸດຕິຖານ (idealized blackbody) ຕາມຄ່າ [member "
"light_temperature] ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຄ່ານີ້ຖືກຄິດໄລ່ພາຍໃນໂດຍອີງຕາມ [member light_temperature]. "
"ສີ [Color] ນີ້ຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍ [member light_color] ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງໄປຫາ [RenderingServer]."

msgid "Returns the value of the specified [enum Light3D.Param] parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂອງພະລາມິເຕີ [enum Light3D.Param] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Sets the value of the specified [enum Light3D.Param] parameter."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບພະລາມິເຕີ [enum Light3D.Param] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"The distance from the camera at which the light begins to fade away (in 3D "
"units).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective for [OmniLight3D] and [SpotLight3D]."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກກ້ອງທີ່ແສງຈະເລີ່ມຈາງຫາຍໄປ (ເປັນຢູນິດ 3D).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບ [OmniLight3D] ແລະ [SpotLight3D] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the light will smoothly fade away when far from the "
"active [Camera3D] starting at [member distance_fade_begin]. This acts as a "
"form of level of detail (LOD). The light will fade out over [member "
"distance_fade_begin] + [member distance_fade_length], after which it will be "
"culled and not sent to the shader at all. Use this to reduce the number of "
"active lights in a scene and thus improve performance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective for [OmniLight3D] and [SpotLight3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແສງຈະຄ່ອຍໆຈາງຫາຍໄປຢ່າງນຸ່ມນວນເມື່ອຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກ [Camera3D] "
"ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານ ໂດຍເລີ່ມທີ່ [member distance_fade_begin]. ນີ້ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຮູບແບບໜຶ່ງຂອງ Level "
"of Detail (LOD). ແສງຈະຈາງຫາຍໄປໃນໄລຍະ [member distance_fade_begin] + [member "
"distance_fade_length], ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກຄັດອອກ (culled) ແລະ ບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາ shader ເລີຍ. "
"ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຈຳນວນແສງທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນສາກ ແລະ ເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບ [OmniLight3D] ແລະ [SpotLight3D] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Distance over which the light and its shadow fades. The light's energy and "
"shadow's opacity is progressively reduced over this distance and is "
"completely invisible at the end.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective for [OmniLight3D] and [SpotLight3D]."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ແສງ ແລະ ເງົາຂອງມັນຈະຈາງຫາຍໄປ. ພະລັງງານຂອງແສງ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມທຶບຂອງເງົາຈະຄ່ອຍໆຫຼຸດລົງໃນໄລຍະນີ້ ແລະ ຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນເລີຍໃນຕອນທ້າຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບ [OmniLight3D] ແລະ [SpotLight3D] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The distance from the camera at which the light's shadow cuts off (in 3D "
"units). Set this to a value lower than [member distance_fade_begin] + [member "
"distance_fade_length] to further improve performance, as shadow rendering is "
"often more expensive than light rendering itself.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective for [OmniLight3D] and [SpotLight3D], and only "
"when [member shadow_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກກ້ອງທີ່ເງົາຂອງແສງຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ (ເປັນຢູນິດ 3D). ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ຕ່ຳກວ່າ [member "
"distance_fade_begin] + [member distance_fade_length] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບຕື່ມອີກ, "
"ເພາະການປະມວນຜົນເງົາມັກຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍກວ່າການປະມວນຜົນແສງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບ [OmniLight3D] ແລະ [SpotLight3D], ແລະ ເມື່ອ [member "
"shadow_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the light only appears in the editor and will not be "
"visible at runtime. If [code]true[/code], the light will never be baked in "
"[LightmapGI] regardless of its [member light_bake_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແສງຈະປາກົດສະເພາະໃນເອດິເຕີ (editor) ແລະ "
"ຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນໃນເວລາທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກ (runtime). ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແສງຈະບໍ່ຖືກອົບ "
"(baked) ໃນ [LightmapGI] ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member light_bake_mode] ເປັນແນວໃດກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"The light's angular size in degrees. Increasing this will make shadows softer "
"at greater distances (also called percentage-closer soft shadows, or PCSS). "
"Only available for [DirectionalLight3D]s. For reference, the Sun from the "
"Earth is approximately [code]0.5[/code]. Increasing this value above "
"[code]0.0[/code] for lights with shadows enabled will have a noticeable "
"performance cost due to PCSS.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member light_angular_distance] is not affected by [member "
"Node3D.scale] (the light's scale or its parent's scale).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] PCSS for directional lights is only supported in the Forward+ "
"rendering method, not Mobile or Compatibility."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດມຸມຂອງແສງເປັນອົງສາ. ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົານຸ່ມນວນຂຶ້ນໃນໄລຍະທີ່ໄກ (ເອີ້ນວ່າ percentage-"
"closer soft shadows ຫຼື PCSS). ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບ [DirectionalLight3D]. "
"ເພື່ອເປັນການອ້າງອີງ, ດວງອາທິດເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກໂລກຈະມີຄ່າປະມານ [code]0.5[/code]. "
"ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ສູງກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ສຳລັບແສງທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ງານເງົາຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຢ່າງເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເນື່ອງຈາກ PCSS.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member light_angular_distance] ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ [member "
"Node3D.scale] (ຂະໜາດຂອງແສງ ຫຼື ຂະໜາດຂອງໂນດແມ່).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] PCSS ສຳລັບ directional lights ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ "
"Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ Mobile ຫຼື Compatibility."

msgid ""
"The light's bake mode. This will affect the global illumination techniques "
"that have an effect on the light's rendering.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Meshes' global illumination mode will also affect the global "
"illumination rendering. See [member GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການອົບແສງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ເຕັກນິກ global illumination ທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການເຣນເດີແສງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂໝດ global illumination ຂອງເມຊ (Mesh) ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການເຣນເດີ global "
"illumination ເຊັ່ນກັນ. ເບິ່ງ [member GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode]."

msgid ""
"The light's color in nonlinear sRGB encoding. An [i]overbright[/i] color can "
"be used to achieve a result equivalent to increasing the light's [member "
"light_energy]."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງແສງໃນຮູບແບບ nonlinear sRGB. ສີທີ່ [i]ສະຫວ່າງເກີນໄປ (overbright)[/i] "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ຄືກັນກັບການເພີ່ມຄ່າ [member light_energy] ຂອງແສງ."

msgid ""
"The light will affect objects in the selected layers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The light cull mask is ignored by [VoxelGI], SDFGI, "
"[LightmapGI], and volumetric fog. These will always render lights in a way "
"that ignores the cull mask. See also [member VisualInstance3D.layers]."
msgstr ""
"ແສງຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ໃນເລເຢີທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າ light cull mask ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍໂດຍ [VoxelGI], SDFGI, "
"[LightmapGI], ແລະ volumetric fog. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເຣນເດີແສງໂດຍລະເລີຍ cull mask ສະເໝີ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [member VisualInstance3D.layers] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"The light's strength multiplier (this is not a physical unit). For "
"[OmniLight3D] and [SpotLight3D], changing this value will only change the "
"light color's intensity, not the light's radius."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນຄວາມແຮງຂອງແສງ (ນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນຢູນິດທາງຟີຊິກ). ສຳລັບ [OmniLight3D] ແລະ [SpotLight3D], "
"ການປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ຈະປ່ຽນພຽງແຕ່ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງສີແສງ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນລັດສະໝີຂອງແສງ."

msgid ""
"Secondary multiplier used with indirect light (light bounces). Used with "
"[VoxelGI] and SDFGI (see [member Environment.sdfgi_enabled]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is ignored if [member light_energy] is equal to "
"[code]0.0[/code], as the light won't be present at all in the GI shader."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນສຳຮອງທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບແສງທາງອ້ອມ (ການສະທ້ອນແສງ). ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [VoxelGI] ແລະ SDFGI (ເບິ່ງ "
"[member Environment.sdfgi_enabled]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍຖ້າ [member light_energy] ເທົ່າກັບ [code]0.0[/"
"code], ເພາະແສງຈະບໍ່ປາກົດໃນ GI shader ເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"Used by positional lights ([OmniLight3D] and [SpotLight3D]) when [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/use_physical_light_units] is "
"[code]true[/code]. Sets the intensity of the light source measured in Lumens. "
"Lumens are a measure of luminous flux, which is the total amount of visible "
"light emitted by a light source per unit of time.\n"
"For [SpotLight3D]s, we assume that the area outside the visible cone is "
"surrounded by a perfect light absorbing material. Accordingly, the apparent "
"brightness of the cone area does not change as the cone increases and "
"decreases in size.\n"
"A typical household lightbulb can range from around 600 lumens to 1,200 "
"lumens, a candle is about 13 lumens, while a streetlight can be approximately "
"60,000 lumens."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ໂດຍແສງແບບກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງ ([OmniLight3D] ແລະ [SpotLight3D]) ເມື່ອ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/use_physical_light_units] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]. ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ວັດແທກເປັນ ລູເມນ (Lumens). "
"ລູເມນແມ່ນຫົວໜ່ວຍວັດແທກຟລັກຂອງແສງ (luminous flux), "
"ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນປະລິມານແສງທັງໝົດທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ທີ່ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງປ່ອຍອອກມາຕໍ່ຫົວໜ່ວຍເວລາ.\n"
"ສຳລັບ [SpotLight3D], ພວກເຮົາສົມມຸດວ່າພື້ນທີ່ນອກກວຍແສງທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ນັ້ນ "
"ຖືກອ້ອມຮອບດ້ວຍວັດຖຸທີ່ດູດຊຶມແສງໄດ້ສົມບູນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງທີ່ປາກົດຂອງພື້ນທີ່ກວຍແສງຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງເມື່ອກວຍແສງມີຂະໜາດເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດລົງ.\n"
"ດອກໄຟໃນເຮືອນທົ່ວໄປອາດມີຄ່າປະມານ 600 ຫາ 1,200 ລູເມນ, ທຽນໄຂມີປະມານ 13 ລູເມນ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໄຟທາງອາດມີປະມານ 60,000 ລູເມນ."

msgid ""
"Used by [DirectionalLight3D]s when [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lights_and_shadows/use_physical_light_units] is [code]true[/code]. Sets the "
"intensity of the light source measured in Lux. Lux is a measure of luminous "
"flux per unit area, it is equal to one lumen per square meter. Lux is the "
"measure of how much light hits a surface at a given time.\n"
"On a clear sunny day a surface in direct sunlight may be approximately "
"100,000 lux, a typical room in a home may be approximately 50 lux, while the "
"moonlit ground may be approximately 0.1 lux."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [DirectionalLight3D] ເມື່ອ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lights_and_shadows/use_physical_light_units] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. "
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ວັດແທກເປັນ ລັກ (Lux). "
"ລັກແມ່ນຫົວໜ່ວຍວັດແທກຟລັກຂອງແສງຕໍ່ຫົວໜ່ວຍພື້ນທີ່, ເຊິ່ງເທົ່າກັບໜຶ່ງລູເມນຕໍ່ຕາແມັດ. "
"ລັກແມ່ນການວັດແທກປະລິມານແສງທີ່ຕົກກະທົບໃສ່ພື້ນຜິວໃນເວລາໃດໜຶ່ງ.\n"
"ໃນມື້ທີ່ມີແດດແຈ້ງ ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແສງແດດໂດຍກົງອາດມີຄ່າປະມານ 100,000 ລັກ, "
"ຫ້ອງທົ່ວໄປໃນເຮືອນອາດມີປະມານ 50 ລັກ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພື້ນດິນໃນຄືນທີ່ມີແສງຈັນອາດມີປະມານ 0.1 ລັກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the light's effect is reversed, darkening areas and "
"casting bright shadows."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເອັບເຟັກຂອງແສງຈະຖືກປີ້ນກັບ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ມືດລົງ ແລະ "
"ສ້າງເງົາທີ່ສະຫວ່າງແທນ."

msgid ""
"[Texture2D] projected by light. [member shadow_enabled] must be on for the "
"projector to work. Light projectors make the light appear as if it is shining "
"through a colored but transparent object, almost like light shining through "
"stained-glass.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [BaseMaterial3D] whose filter mode can be adjusted on a "
"per-material basis, the filter mode for light projector textures is set "
"globally with [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/light_projectors/"
"filter].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Light projector textures are only supported in the Forward+ and "
"Mobile rendering methods, not Compatibility."
msgstr ""
"[Texture2D] ທີ່ຖືກສາຍອອກມາໂດຍແສງ. [member shadow_enabled] "
"ຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງສາຍ (projector) ເຮັດວຽກ. "
"ເຄື່ອງສາຍແສງເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງປາກົດຄືກັບວ່າກຳລັງສ່ອງຜ່ານວັດຖຸທີ່ມີສີແຕ່ໂປ່ງໃສ, ຄ້າຍຄືກັບແສງທີ່ສ່ອງຜ່ານກະຈົກສີ "
"(stained-glass).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ຄືກັບ [BaseMaterial3D] ທີ່ສາມາດປັບໂໝດການກັ່ນຕອງ (filter mode) "
"ໄດ້ແຍກຕາມແຕ່ລະວັດຖຸ, ໂໝດການກັ່ນຕອງສຳລັບເທັກເຈີຂອງເຄື່ອງສາຍແສງຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບທົ່ວໂລກ (globally) "
"ດ້ວຍ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/light_projectors/filter].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເທັກເຈີຂອງເຄື່ອງສາຍແສງຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Forward+ ແລະ "
"Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ Compatibility."

msgid ""
"The simulated size of the light in Godot units, affecting shading and "
"shadows. For [OmniLight3D]s and [SpotLight3D]s, increasing this value "
"simulates a spherical area light, expanding the size of specular highlights. "
"If shadows are enabled, a penumbra is rendered, making shadows appear "
"blurrier. For [AreaLight3D]s, only the shadows are affected. Penumbras are "
"simulated with percentage-closer soft shadows, or PCSS, which has a "
"noticeable performance cost for values above [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member light_size] is not affected by [member Node3D.scale] "
"(the light's scale or its parent's scale).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] PCSS for positional lights is only supported in the Forward+ and "
"Mobile rendering methods, not Compatibility."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຈຳລອງຂອງແສງໃນຢູນິດຂອງ Godot, ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການເຮັດເງົາ ແລະ ການສ້າງເງົາ. ສຳລັບ "
"[OmniLight3D] ແລະ [SpotLight3D], ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ຈະຈຳລອງແສງແບບພື້ນທີ່ຊົງກົມ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະໜາດຂອງຈຸດສະທ້ອນແສງ (specular highlights) ກວ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ງານເງົາ, penumbra "
"ຈະຖືກເຣນເດີ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາເບິ່ງມົວຂຶ້ນ. ສຳລັບ [AreaLight3D], ຈະມີພຽງເງົາເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ. "
"Penumbras ຖືກຈຳລອງດ້ວຍ percentage-closer soft shadows ຫຼື PCSS, "
"ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຢ່າງເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດຖ້າຄ່າສູງກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member light_size] ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ [member Node3D.scale] "
"(ຂະໜາດຂອງແສງ ຫຼື ຂະໜາດຂອງໂນດແມ່).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] PCSS ສຳລັບແສງແບບກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Forward+ "
"ແລະ Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ Compatibility."

msgid ""
"The intensity of the specular blob in objects affected by the light. At "
"[code]0[/code], the light becomes a pure diffuse light. When not baking "
"emission, this can be used to avoid unrealistic reflections when placing "
"lights above an emissive surface."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງຈຸດສະທ້ອນແສງ (specular blob) ໃນວັດຖຸທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກແສງ. ທີ່ຄ່າ [code]0[/"
"code], ແສງຈະກາຍເປັນແສງແບບ diffuse ແທ້ໆ. ເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ມີການອົບ (baking) emission, "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການສະທ້ອນທີ່ບໍ່ສົມຈິງ ເມື່ອວາງແສງໄວ້ເທິງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ມີການປ່ອຍແສງ (emissive "
"surface)."

msgid ""
"Sets the color temperature of the light source, measured in Kelvin. This is "
"used to calculate a correlated color temperature which tints the [member "
"light_color].\n"
"The sun on a cloudy day is approximately 6500 Kelvin, on a clear day it is "
"between 5500 to 6000 Kelvin, and on a clear day at sunrise or sunset it "
"ranges to around 1850 Kelvin."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າອຸນຫະພູມສີຂອງແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ, ວັດແທກເປັນ ເຄນວິນ (Kelvin). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ອຸນຫະພູມສີທີ່ສຳພັນກັນ ເຊິ່ງຈະມາຍ້ອມສີ [member light_color].\n"
"ດວງອາທິດໃນມື້ທີ່ມີເມກຫຼາຍມີຄ່າປະມານ 6500 ເຄນວິນ, ໃນມື້ທີ່ທ້ອງຟ້າແຈ້ງຈະຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 5500 ຫາ 6000 "
"ເຄນວິນ, ແລະ ໃນມື້ທີ່ທ້ອງຟ້າແຈ້ງຕອນຕາເວັນຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ຕາເວັນຕົກ ຈະມີຄ່າປະມານ 1850 ເຄນວິນ."

msgid ""
"Secondary multiplier multiplied with [member light_energy] then used with the "
"[Environment]'s volumetric fog (if enabled). If set to [code]0.0[/code], "
"computing volumetric fog will be skipped for this light, which can improve "
"performance for large amounts of lights when volumetric fog is enabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To prevent short-lived dynamic light effects from poorly "
"interacting with volumetric fog, lights used in those effects should have "
"[member light_volumetric_fog_energy] set to [code]0.0[/code] unless [member "
"Environment.volumetric_fog_temporal_reprojection_enabled] is disabled (or "
"unless the reprojection amount is significantly lowered)."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນສຳຮອງທີ່ຈະຖືກຄູນກັບ [member light_energy] ແລ້ວໃຊ້ກັບ volumetric fog ຂອງ "
"[Environment] (ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ງານ). ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0.0[/code], ການຄິດໄລ່ volumetric fog "
"ຈະຖືກຂ້າມໄປສຳລັບແສງນີ້, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບເມື່ອມີແສງຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ volumetric "
"fog.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ເອັບເຟັກແສງໄດນາມິກທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໄລຍະສັ້ນໄປລົບກວນ volumetric fog, "
"ແສງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນເອັບເຟັກເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຄວນຕັ້ງ [member light_volumetric_fog_energy] ເປັນ [code]0.0[/"
"code] ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ວ່າ [member "
"Environment.volumetric_fog_temporal_reprojection_enabled] ຈະຖືກປິດ (ຫຼື ຫຼຸດປະລິມານ "
"reprojection ລົງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ)."

msgid ""
"Used to adjust shadow appearance. Too small a value results in self-shadowing "
"(\"shadow acne\"), while too large a value causes shadows to separate from "
"casters (\"peter-panning\"). Adjust as needed."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງລັກສະນະຂອງເງົາ. ຄ່າທີ່ນ້ອຍເກີນໄປຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດເງົາທັບຕົວເອງ (\"shadow acne\"), "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າທີ່ໃຫຍ່ເກີນໄປຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາແຍກອອກຈາກຕົວສ້າງເງົາ (\"peter-panning\"). "
"ໃຫ້ປັບຕາມຄວາມເໝາະສົມ."

msgid ""
"Blurs the edges of the shadow. Can be used to hide pixel artifacts in low-"
"resolution shadow maps. A high value can impact performance, make shadows "
"appear grainy and can cause other unwanted artifacts. Try to keep as near "
"default as possible."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບຂອງເງົາມົວ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອງຈຸດບົກພ່ອງຂອງພິກເຊວໃນ shadow maps ທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງອາດສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາເບິ່ງເປັນເມັດ ແລະ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຈຸດບົກພ່ອງອື່ນໆທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ. "
"ພະຍາຍາມຮັກສາຄ່າໃຫ້ໃກ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "The light will only cast shadows using objects in the selected layers."
msgstr "ແສງຈະສ້າງເງົາໂດຍໃຊ້ສະເພາະວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ໃນເລເຢີທີ່ເລືອກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the light will cast real-time shadows. This has a "
"significant performance cost. Only enable shadow rendering when it makes a "
"noticeable difference in the scene's appearance, and consider using [member "
"distance_fade_enabled] to hide the light when far away from the [Camera3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແສງຈະສ້າງເງົາແບບຮຽວທາມ (real-time). "
"ນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນການປະມວນຜົນສູງ. "
"ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ງານການເຣນເດີເງົາສະເພາະຕອນທີ່ມັນເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງສາກແຕກຕ່າງຢ່າງເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດ, ແລະ "
"ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [member distance_fade_enabled] ເພື່ອເຊື່ອງແສງເມື່ອຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກ [Camera3D]."

msgid ""
"Offsets the lookup into the shadow map by the object's normal. This can be "
"used to reduce self-shadowing artifacts without using [member shadow_bias]. "
"In practice, this value should be tweaked along with [member shadow_bias] to "
"reduce artifacts as much as possible."
msgstr ""
"ເຍື້ອງການຄົ້ນຫາໃນ shadow map ດ້ວຍຄ່າ normal ຂອງວັດຖຸ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຈຸດບົກພ່ອງຂອງເງົາທັບຕົວເອງໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ [member shadow_bias]. "
"ໃນທາງປະຕິບັດ, ຄ່ານີ້ຄວນຖືກປັບຄວບຄູ່ໄປກັບ [member shadow_bias] ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຈຸດບົກພ່ອງໃຫ້ໄດ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"The opacity to use when rendering the light's shadow map. Values lower than "
"[code]1.0[/code] make the light appear through shadows. This can be used to "
"fake global illumination at a low performance cost."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມທຶບແສງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອເຣນເດີ shadow map ຂອງແສງ. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງສ່ອງຜ່ານເງົາໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຳລອງ global illumination "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຕ່ຳ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], reverses the backface culling of the mesh. This can be "
"useful when you have a flat mesh that has a light behind it. If you need to "
"cast a shadow on both sides of the mesh, set the mesh to use double-sided "
"shadows with [constant "
"GeometryInstance3D.SHADOW_CASTING_SETTING_DOUBLE_SIDED]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະປີ້ນກັບການຄັດດ້ານຫຼັງ (backface culling) ຂອງເມຊ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອທ່ານມີເມຊແບບແປນທີ່ມີແສງຢູ່ທາງຫຼັງ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງເງົາທັງສອງດ້ານຂອງເມຊ, "
"ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເມຊໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເງົາແບບສອງດ້ານດ້ວຍ [constant "
"GeometryInstance3D.SHADOW_CASTING_SETTING_DOUBLE_SIDED]."

msgid "Constant for accessing [member light_energy]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member light_energy]."

msgid "Constant for accessing [member light_indirect_energy]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member light_indirect_energy]."

msgid "Constant for accessing [member light_volumetric_fog_energy]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member light_volumetric_fog_energy]."

msgid "Constant for accessing [member light_specular]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member light_specular]."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member OmniLight3D.omni_range] or [member "
"SpotLight3D.spot_range]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member OmniLight3D.omni_range] ຫຼື [member "
"SpotLight3D.spot_range]."

