msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member light_intensity_lumens] and [member "
"light_intensity_lux]. Only used when [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lights_and_shadows/use_physical_light_units] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member light_intensity_lumens] ແລະ [member "
"light_intensity_lux]. ໃຊ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lights_and_shadows/use_physical_light_units] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Light is ignored when baking. This is the fastest mode, but the light will "
"not be taken into account when baking global illumination. This mode should "
"generally be used for dynamic lights that change quickly, as the effect of "
"global illumination is less noticeable on those lights.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Hiding a light does [i]not[/i] affect baking [LightmapGI]. "
"Hiding a light will still affect baking [VoxelGI] and SDFGI (see [member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled])."
msgstr ""
"ແສງຈະຖືກລະເລີຍໃນລະຫວ່າງການອົບ. ນີ້ແມ່ນໂໝດທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ແສງຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ເມື່ອມີການອົບ global "
"illumination. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວໂໝດນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ສຳລັບແສງໄດນາມິກທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງໄວ, ເພາະຜົນກະທົບຂອງ global "
"illumination ຈະສັງເກດເຫັນໄດ້ໜ້ອຍໃນແສງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເຊື່ອງແສງ [i]ບໍ່[/i] ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການອົບ [LightmapGI]. "
"ແຕ່ການເຊື່ອງແສງຈະຍັງສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການອົບ [VoxelGI] ແລະ SDFGI (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled])."

msgid ""
"Light is taken into account in static baking ([VoxelGI], [LightmapGI], SDFGI "
"([member Environment.sdfgi_enabled])). The light can be moved around or "
"modified, but its global illumination will not update in real-time.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The light is not baked in [LightmapGI] if [member editor_only] "
"is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using [LightmapGI], both the direct and indirect light are "
"baked. Since direct light is baked, the light doesn't display a specular lobe "
"on static lightmapped meshes. Shadows on static lightmapped meshes will also "
"look less detailed, but the light still casts shadows that can be displayed "
"on dynamic objects. Since real-time light computations are skipped on static "
"lightmapped meshes, this bake mode improves runtime performance compared to "
"[constant BAKE_DYNAMIC] and [constant BAKE_DISABLED]."
msgstr ""
"ແສງຈະຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ໃນການເບັກ (baking) ແບບສະແຕຕິກ ([VoxelGI], [LightmapGI], SDFGI "
"([member Environment.sdfgi_enabled])). ແສງສາມາດຍ້າຍໄປມາ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້, ແຕ່ global "
"illumination ຂອງມັນຈະບໍ່ອັບເດດແບບຣຽວໄທມ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແສງຈະບໍ່ຖືກເບັກໃນ [LightmapGI] ຖ້າ [member editor_only] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [LightmapGI], ທັງແສງໂດຍກົງ (direct light) ແລະ ແສງທາງອ້ອມ "
"(indirect light) ຈະຖືກເບັກ. ເນື່ອງຈາກແສງໂດຍກົງຖືກເບັກແລ້ວ, ແສງຈະບໍ່ສະແດງ specular lobe "
"ໃນເມຊ (mesh) ທີ່ເຮັດ lightmap ແບບສະແຕຕິກ. ເງົາໃນເມຊດັ່ງກ່າວຈະເບິ່ງມີລາຍລະອຽດໜ້ອຍລົງ, "
"ແຕ່ແສງຍັງຄົງສ້າງເງົາທີ່ສາມາດສະແດງໃນວັດຖຸແບບໄດນາມິກໄດ້. "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກການຄິດໄລ່ແສງແບບຣຽວໄທມ໌ຖືກຂ້າມໄປໃນເມຊ lightmap ແບບສະແຕຕິກ, "
"ໂໝດເບັກນີ້ຈຶ່ງຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໃນການເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອທຽບກັບ [constant BAKE_DYNAMIC] ແລະ "
"[constant BAKE_DISABLED]."

msgid ""
"Light is taken into account in dynamic baking ([VoxelGI] and SDFGI ([member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled])). The light can be moved around or modified with "
"global illumination updating in real-time. The light's global illumination "
"appearance will be slightly different compared to [constant BAKE_STATIC]. "
"This has a greater performance cost compared to [constant BAKE_STATIC]. When "
"using SDFGI, the update speed of dynamic lights is affected by [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/"
"frames_to_update_lights].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using [LightmapGI], the light's indirect light is baked, "
"but direct light and shadows remain real-time. This mode allows performing "
"[i]subtle[/i] changes to a light's color, energy, and position while still "
"looking fairly correct. For example, you can use this to create flickering "
"static torches that have their indirect light baked."
msgstr ""
"ແສງຈະຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ໃນການເບັກ (baking) ແບບໄດນາມິກ ([VoxelGI] ແລະ SDFGI ([member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled])). ແສງສາມາດຍ້າຍໄປມາ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ ໂດຍທີ່ global "
"illumination ຈະອັບເດດແບບຣຽວໄທມ໌. ລັກສະນະຂອງ global illumination "
"ຈະແຕກຕ່າງເລັກນ້ອຍເມື່ອທຽບກັບ [constant BAKE_STATIC]. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍກວ່າ "
"[constant BAKE_STATIC]. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ SDFGI, ຄວາມໄວໃນການອັບເດດແສງໄດນາມິກຈະຂຶ້ນກັບ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/"
"frames_to_update_lights].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [LightmapGI], ແສງທາງອ້ອມຈະຖືກເບັກ, ແຕ່ແສງໂດຍກົງ ແລະ "
"ເງົາຍັງຄົງເປັນແບບຣຽວໄທມ໌. ໂໝດນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງ [i]ເລັກໆນ້ອຍໆ[/i] ກັບສີ, ພະລັງງານ ແລະ "
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງແສງໄດ້ ໂດຍທີ່ຍັງເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຖືກຕ້ອງຢູ່. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງກະບອງໄຟທີ່ສັ່ນໄຫວ "
"ເຊິ່ງມີແສງທາງອ້ອມຖືກເບັກໄວ້ແລ້ວ."

msgid "Computes and stores baked lightmaps for fast global illumination."
msgstr "ຄິດໄລ່ ແລະ ຈັດເກັບ lightmaps ທີ່ອົບແລ້ວເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ global illumination ທີ່ວ່ອງໄວ."

msgid ""
"The [LightmapGI] node is used to compute and store baked lightmaps. Lightmaps "
"are used to provide high-quality indirect lighting with very little light "
"leaking. [LightmapGI] can also provide rough reflections using spherical "
"harmonics if [member directional] is enabled. Dynamic objects can receive "
"indirect lighting thanks to [i]light probes[/i], which can be automatically "
"placed by setting [member generate_probes_subdiv] to a value other than "
"[constant GENERATE_PROBES_DISABLED]. Additional lightmap probes can also be "
"added by creating [LightmapProbe] nodes. The downside is that lightmaps are "
"fully static and cannot be baked in an exported project. Baking a "
"[LightmapGI] node is also slower compared to [VoxelGI].\n"
"[b]Procedural generation:[/b] Lightmap baking functionality is only available "
"in the editor. This means [LightmapGI] is not suited to procedurally "
"generated or user-built levels. For procedurally generated or user-built "
"levels, use [VoxelGI] or SDFGI instead (see [member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled]).\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [LightmapGI] provides the best possible run-time "
"performance for global illumination. It is suitable for low-end hardware "
"including integrated graphics and mobile devices.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to how lightmaps work, most properties only have a visible "
"effect once lightmaps are baked again.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Lightmap baking on [CSGShape3D]s and [PrimitiveMesh]es is not "
"supported, as these cannot store UV2 data required for baking.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If no custom lightmappers are installed, [LightmapGI] can only "
"be baked from devices that support the Forward+ or Mobile renderers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [LightmapGI] node only bakes light data for child nodes of "
"its parent. Nodes further up the hierarchy of the scene will not be baked."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ [LightmapGI] ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ ແລະ ຈັດເກັບ lightmaps ທີ່ອົບແລ້ວ. Lightmaps "
"ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແສງສະທ້ອນທາງອ້ອມທີ່ມີຄຸນນະພາບສູງ ແລະ ມີການຮົ່ວໄຫຼຂອງແສງໜ້ອຍຫຼາຍ. [LightmapGI] "
"ຍັງສາມາດໃຫ້ການສະທ້ອນແບບຫຍາບໂດຍໃຊ້ spherical harmonics ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [member "
"directional]. ວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກສາມາດຮັບແສງທາງອ້ອມໄດ້ຜ່ານ [i]light probes[/i], "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດວາງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງ [member generate_probes_subdiv] "
"ເປັນຄ່າອື່ນນອກຈາກ [constant GENERATE_PROBES_DISABLED]. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງສາມາດເພີ່ມ lightmap "
"probes ໄດ້ດ້ວຍການສ້າງໂນດ [LightmapProbe]. ຂໍ້ເສຍຄື lightmaps ແມ່ນແບບສະແຕຕິກສົມບູນ ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດອົບໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ເອັກສະປອດ (exported) ອອກໄປແລ້ວໄດ້. ການອົບໂນດ [LightmapGI] "
"ຍັງຊ້າກວ່າເມື່ອທຽບກັບ [VoxelGI].\n"
"[b]ການສ້າງແບບ Procedural:[/b] ຟັງຊັນການອົບ Lightmap ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນເອດິເຕີເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ [LightmapGI] ບໍ່ເໝາະສຳລັບດ່ານທີ່ສ້າງແບບ procedural ຫຼື ດ່ານທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ້າງເອງ. "
"ສຳລັບດ່ານປະເພດນັ້ນ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [VoxelGI] ຫຼື SDFGI ແທນ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled]).\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] [LightmapGI] ໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກ (run-time) ທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບ "
"global illumination. ມັນເໝາະສຳລັບຮາດແວລະດັບຕ່ຳ ລວມທັງກາດຈໍອອນບອດ ແລະ ອຸປະກອນມືຖື.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ lightmaps, "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະເຫັນຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີການອົບ lightmaps ອີກຄັ້ງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການອົບ Lightmap ໃນ [CSGShape3D] ແລະ [PrimitiveMesh], "
"ເພາະສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ UV2 ທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການອົບໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ lightmappers ເພີ່ມເຕີມ, [LightmapGI] "
"ສາມາດອົບໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນອຸປະກອນທີ່ຮອງຮັບເຣນເດີເຣີ Forward+ ຫຼື Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດ [LightmapGI] ຈະອົບຂໍ້ມູນແສງສະເພາະໂນດລູກຂອງໂນດແມ່ຂອງມັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ໂນດທີ່ຢູ່ສູງກວ່າໃນລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງສາກຈະບໍ່ຖືກອົບ."

msgid "Using Lightmap global illumination"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Lightmap global illumination"

msgid ""
"The bias to use when computing shadows. Increasing [member bias] can fix "
"shadow acne on the resulting baked lightmap, but can introduce peter-panning "
"(shadows not connecting to their casters). Real-time [Light3D] shadows are "
"not affected by this [member bias] property."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ bias ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອຄິດໄລ່ເງົາ. ການເພີ່ມ [member bias] ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເງົາທັບຕົວເອງ (shadow "
"acne) ໃນ lightmap ທີ່ອົບແລ້ວໄດ້, ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາເງົາແຍກອອກຈາກຕົວສ້າງເງົາ (peter-"
"panning). ເງົາຂອງ [Light3D] ແບບຮຽວທາມຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຄຸນສົມບັດ [member bias] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"The energy multiplier for each bounce. Higher values will make indirect "
"lighting brighter. A value of [code]1.0[/code] represents physically accurate "
"behavior, but higher values can be used to make indirect lighting propagate "
"more visibly when using a low number of bounces. This can be used to speed up "
"bake times by lowering the number of [member bounces] then increasing [member "
"bounce_indirect_energy].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member bounce_indirect_energy] only has an effect if [member "
"bounces] is set to a value greater than or equal to [code]1[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນພະລັງງານສຳລັບການສະທ້ອນແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງທາງອ້ອມສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າ [code]1.0[/"
"code] ໝາຍເຖິງພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຟີຊິກ, "
"ແຕ່ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງທາງອ້ອມກະຈາຍອອກໄປໃຫ້ເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນຂຶ້ນເມື່ອໃຊ້ຈຳນວນການສະທ້ອນຕ່ຳ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລັ່ງເວລາການອົບໃຫ້ໄວຂຶ້ນໂດຍການຫຼຸດຈຳນວນ [member bounces] ລົງ ແລ້ວເພີ່ມ "
"[member bounce_indirect_energy] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member bounce_indirect_energy] ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member bounces] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ [code]1[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Number of light bounces that are taken into account during baking. Higher "
"values result in brighter, more realistic lighting, at the cost of longer "
"bake times. If set to [code]0[/code], only environment lighting, direct light "
"and emissive lighting is baked."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງການສະທ້ອນແສງທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການອົບ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ "
"ສົມຈິງຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບເວລາການອົບທີ່ດົນຂຶ້ນ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/code], "
"ຈະມີພຽງແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ, ແສງໂດຍກົງ ແລະ ແສງຈາກວັດຖຸປ່ອຍແສງ (emissive) ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກອົບ."

msgid ""
"The [CameraAttributes] resource that specifies exposure levels to bake at. "
"Auto-exposure and non exposure properties will be ignored. Exposure settings "
"should be used to reduce the dynamic range present when baking. If exposure "
"is too high, the [LightmapGI] will have banding artifacts or may have over-"
"exposure artifacts."
msgstr ""
"ຣີຊອດ [CameraAttributes] ທີ່ລະບຸລະດັບການຮັບແສງ (exposure) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ອົບ. ຄຸນສົມບັດ auto-"
"exposure ແລະ ທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວກັບ exposure ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ. ຄວນໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ exposure "
"ເພື່ອຫຼຸດໄລຍະໄດນາມິກ (dynamic range) ໃນລະຫວ່າງການອົບ. ຖ້າ exposure ສູງເກີນໄປ, "
"[LightmapGI] ຈະມີຈຸດບົກພ່ອງແບບເປັນແຖບສີ (banding artifacts) ຫຼື "
"ອາດມີຈຸດບົກພ່ອງຈາກການຮັບແສງເກີນ."

msgid ""
"The distance in pixels from which the denoiser samples. Lower values preserve "
"more details, but may give blotchy results if the lightmap quality is not "
"high enough. Only effective if [member use_denoiser] is [code]true[/code] and "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/denoising/denoiser] is set to "
"JNLM."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງເປັນພິກເຊວທີ່ denoiser ຈະໃຊ້ສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະຮັກສາລາຍລະອຽດໄດ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າ, "
"ແຕ່ອາດໃຫ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ເປັນຮອຍດ່າງຖ້າຄຸນນະພາບ lightmap ບໍ່ສູງພໍ. ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member "
"use_denoiser] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lightmapping/denoising/denoiser] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ JNLM."

msgid ""
"The strength of denoising step applied to the generated lightmaps. Only "
"effective if [member use_denoiser] is [code]true[/code] and [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/denoising/denoiser] is set to JNLM."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນການລົດສິ່ງລົບກວນ (denoising) ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບ lightmaps ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອ "
"[member use_denoiser] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/denoising/denoiser] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ JNLM."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], bakes lightmaps to contain directional information as "
"spherical harmonics. This results in more realistic lighting appearance, "
"especially with normal mapped materials and for lights that have their direct "
"light baked ([member Light3D.light_bake_mode] set to [constant "
"Light3D.BAKE_STATIC] and with [member Light3D.editor_only] set to "
"[code]false[/code]). The directional information is also used to provide "
"rough reflections for static and dynamic objects. This has a small run-time "
"performance cost as the shader has to perform more work to interpret the "
"direction information from the lightmap. Directional lightmaps also take "
"longer to bake and result in larger file sizes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The property's name has no relationship with "
"[DirectionalLight3D]. [member directional] works with all light types."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະອົບ lightmaps ໃຫ້ມີຂໍ້ມູນທິດທາງໃນຮູບແບບ spherical "
"harmonics. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລັກສະນະຂອງແສງເບິ່ງສົມຈິງຂຶ້ນ, ໂດຍສະເພາະກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ມີ normal map ແລະ "
"ສຳລັບແສງທີ່ຖືກອົບແສງໂດຍກົງໄວ້ ([member Light3D.light_bake_mode] ຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"Light3D.BAKE_STATIC] ແລະ [member Light3D.editor_only] ເປັນ [code]false[/"
"code]). ຂໍ້ມູນທິດທາງຍັງຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການສະທ້ອນແບບຫຍາບສຳລັບວັດຖຸສະແຕຕິກ ແລະ ໄດນາມິກ. "
"ນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ run-time ເລັກນ້ອຍ ເພາະ shader "
"ຕ້ອງເຮັດວຽກຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນເພື່ອຕີຄວາມໝາຍຂໍ້ມູນທິດທາງຈາກ lightmap. Directional lightmaps "
"ຍັງໃຊ້ເວລາອົບດົນກວ່າ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊື່ຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ມີຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [DirectionalLight3D]. [member "
"directional] ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບທຸກປະເພດແສງ."

msgid ""
"The color to use for environment lighting. Only effective if [member "
"environment_mode] is [constant ENVIRONMENT_MODE_CUSTOM_COLOR]."
msgstr ""
"ສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ. ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member environment_mode] ເປັນ "
"[constant ENVIRONMENT_MODE_CUSTOM_COLOR]."

msgid ""
"The color multiplier to use for environment lighting. Only effective if "
"[member environment_mode] is [constant ENVIRONMENT_MODE_CUSTOM_COLOR]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ. ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member environment_mode] ເປັນ "
"[constant ENVIRONMENT_MODE_CUSTOM_COLOR]."

msgid ""
"The sky to use as a source of environment lighting. Only effective if [member "
"environment_mode] is [constant ENVIRONMENT_MODE_CUSTOM_SKY]."
msgstr ""
"ທ້ອງຟ້າທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ. ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member environment_mode] "
"ເປັນ [constant ENVIRONMENT_MODE_CUSTOM_SKY]."

msgid "The environment mode to use when baking lightmaps."
msgstr "ໂໝດສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອອົບ lightmaps."

msgid ""
"The level of subdivision to use when automatically generating "
"[LightmapProbe]s for dynamic object lighting. Higher values result in more "
"accurate indirect lighting on dynamic objects, at the cost of longer bake "
"times and larger file sizes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Automatically generated [LightmapProbe]s are not visible as "
"nodes in the Scene tree dock, and cannot be modified this way after they are "
"generated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Regardless of [member generate_probes_subdiv], direct lighting "
"on dynamic objects is always applied using [Light3D] nodes in real-time."
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍ (subdivision) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອສ້າງ [LightmapProbe] "
"ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບການສ່ອງແສງວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງທາງອ້ອມເທິງວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບເວລາການອົບທີ່ດົນຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] LightmapProbes ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈະບໍ່ປາກົດເປັນໂນດໃນ Scene tree, ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້ໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງແລ້ວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງ [member generate_probes_subdiv], "
"ແສງໂດຍກົງເທິງວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຜ່ານໂນດ [Light3D] ແບບຮຽວທາມສະເໝີ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], ignore environment lighting when baking lightmaps."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະລະເລີຍແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເມື່ອອົບ lightmaps."

msgid ""
"The [LightmapGIData] associated to this [LightmapGI] node. This resource is "
"automatically created after baking, and is not meant to be created manually."
msgstr ""
"[LightmapGIData] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂນດ [LightmapGI] ນີ້. "
"ຣີຊອດນີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກການອົບ, ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສ້າງເອງດ້ວຍມື."

msgid ""
"The quality preset to use when baking lightmaps. This affects bake times, but "
"output file sizes remain mostly identical across quality levels.\n"
"To further speed up bake times, decrease [member bounces], disable [member "
"use_denoiser] and/or decrease [member texel_scale].\n"
"To further increase quality, enable [member supersampling] and/or increase "
"[member texel_scale]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄຸນນະພາບສຳເລັດຮູບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອອົບ lightmaps. ສິ່ງນີ້ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ເວລາການອົບ, "
"ແຕ່ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ຈະຍັງຄືເກົ່າໃນທຸກລະດັບຄຸນນະພາບ.\n"
"ເພື່ອເລັ່ງເວລາການອົບໃຫ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ, ໃຫ້ຫຼຸດ [member bounces], ປິດ [member use_denoiser] ແລະ/ຫຼື "
"ຫຼຸດ [member texel_scale] ລົງ.\n"
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄຸນນະພາບໃຫ້ສູງຂຶ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເປີດ [member supersampling] ແລະ/ຫຼື ເພີ່ມ [member "
"texel_scale]."

msgid ""
"The shadowmasking policy to use for directional shadows on static objects "
"that are baked with this [LightmapGI] instance.\n"
"Shadowmasking allows [DirectionalLight3D] nodes to cast shadows even outside "
"the range defined by their [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_max_distance] property. This is done by "
"baking a texture that contains a shadowmap for the directional light, then "
"using this texture according to the current shadowmask mode.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The shadowmask texture is only created if [member "
"shadowmask_mode] is not [constant LightmapGIData.SHADOWMASK_MODE_NONE]. To "
"see a difference, you need to bake lightmaps again after switching from "
"[constant LightmapGIData.SHADOWMASK_MODE_NONE] to any other mode."
msgstr ""
"ນະໂຍບາຍການເຮັດ shadowmasking ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ directional shadows "
"ເທິງວັດຖຸສະແຕຕິກທີ່ຖືກອົບດ້ວຍ [LightmapGI] ນີ້.\n"
"Shadowmasking ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໂນດ [DirectionalLight3D] "
"ສາມາດສ້າງເງົາໄດ້ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຢູ່ນອກໄລຍະທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍຄຸນສົມບັດ [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_max_distance]. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການອົບເທັກເຈີທີ່ມີ "
"shadowmap ສຳລັບແສງ directional, ແລ້ວໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີນັ້ນຕາມໂໝດ shadowmask ປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເທັກເຈີ shadowmask ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member shadowmask_mode] ບໍ່ແມ່ນ "
"[constant LightmapGIData.SHADOWMASK_MODE_NONE] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອເຫັນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງ, "
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງອົບ lightmaps ໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນຈາກ [constant "
"LightmapGIData.SHADOWMASK_MODE_NONE] ໄປຫາໂໝດອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], lightmaps are baked with the texel scale multiplied "
"with [member supersampling_factor] and downsampled before saving the lightmap "
"(so the effective texel density is identical to having supersampling "
"disabled).\n"
"Supersampling provides increased lightmap quality with less noise, smoother "
"shadows and better shadowing of small-scale features in objects. However, it "
"may result in significantly increased bake times and memory usage while "
"baking lightmaps. Padding is automatically adjusted to avoid increasing light "
"leaking."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], lightmaps ຈະຖືກອົບດ້ວຍມາຕຣາສ່ວນເທັກເຊວ (texel scale) "
"ທີ່ຄູນກັບ [member supersampling_factor] ແລະ ຖືກຫຼຸດຄວາມລະອຽດ (downsampled) "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະບັນທຶກ lightmap (ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງເທັກເຊວຕົວຈິງຈະເທົ່າກັບຕອນທີ່ປິດ "
"supersampling). \n"
"Supersampling ຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄຸນນະພາບ lightmap ໃຫ້ມີສິ່ງລົບກວນໜ້ອຍລົງ, ເງົານຸ່ມນວນຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ເຮັດເງົາຂອງລາຍລະອຽດນ້ອຍໆເທິງວັດຖຸໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເວລາການອົບ ແລະ "
"ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໃນລະຫວ່າງການອົບເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ຄ່າ Padding "
"ຈະຖືກປັບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຮົ່ວໄຫຼຂອງແສງທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The factor by which the texel density is multiplied for supersampling. For "
"best results, use an integer value. While fractional values are allowed, they "
"can result in increased light leaking and a blurry lightmap.\n"
"Higher values may result in better quality, but also increase bake times and "
"memory usage while baking.\n"
"See [member supersampling] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນທີ່ຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງເທັກເຊວຈະຖືກຄູນສຳລັບ supersampling. ເພື່ອຜົນລັດທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າເລກຖ້ວນ. "
"ເຖິງວ່າຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າທົດສະນິຍົມໄດ້, ແຕ່ມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງຮົ່ວໄຫຼຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ lightmap ມົວ.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນອາດໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ແຕ່ກໍເພີ່ມເວລາການອົບ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໃນລະຫວ່າງການອົບ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [member supersampling] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Scales the lightmap texel density of all meshes for the current bake. This is "
"a multiplier that builds upon the existing lightmap texel size defined in "
"each imported 3D scene, along with the per-mesh density multiplier (which is "
"designed to be used when the same mesh is used at different scales). Lower "
"values will result in faster bake times.\n"
"For example, doubling [member texel_scale] doubles the lightmap texture "
"resolution for all objects [i]on each axis[/i], so it will [i]quadruple[/i] "
"the texel count."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຂະໜາດຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງເທັກເຊວ lightmap ຂອງທຸກເມຊສຳລັບການອົບຄັ້ງປັດຈຸບັນ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຄູນທີ່ເສີມຈາກຂະໜາດເທັກເຊວ lightmap ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເຊິ່ງກຳນົດໃນແຕ່ລະສາກ 3D ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ, "
"ລວມກັບຕົວຄູນຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຕໍ່ແຕ່ລະເມຊ. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເວລາການອົບໄວຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການເພີ່ມ [member texel_scale] ສອງເທົ່າ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄວາມລະອຽດເທັກເຈີ lightmap "
"ຂອງທຸກວັດຖຸເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນສອງເທົ່າ [i]ໃນແຕ່ລະແກນ[/i], ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະເພີ່ມຈຳນວນເທັກເຊວຂຶ້ນ [i]ສີ່ເທົ່າ[/i]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses a GPU-based denoising algorithm on the generated "
"lightmap. This eliminates most noise within the generated lightmap at the "
"cost of longer bake times. File sizes are generally not impacted "
"significantly by the use of a denoiser, although lossless compression may do "
"a better job at compressing a denoised image."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ອັລກໍຣິທຶມການລົດສິ່ງລົບກວນ (denoising) ໂດຍໃຊ້ GPU ກັບ "
"lightmap ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະກຳຈັດສິ່ງລົບກວນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃນ lightmap "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບເວລາການອົບທີ່ດົນຂຶ້ນ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຫຼາຍຈາກການໃຊ້ "
"denoiser, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການບີບອັດແບບ lossless "
"ອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີກວ່າໃນການບີບອັດຮູບພາບທີ່ຜ່ານການລົດສິ່ງລົບກວນແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], a texture with the lighting information will be "
"generated to speed up the generation of indirect lighting at the cost of some "
"accuracy. The geometry might exhibit extra light leak artifacts when using "
"low resolution lightmaps or UVs that stretch the lightmap significantly "
"across surfaces. Leave [member use_texture_for_bounces] at its default value "
"of [code]true[/code] if unsure.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member use_texture_for_bounces] only has an effect if [member "
"bounces] is set to a value greater than or equal to [code]1[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເທັກເຈີທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນແສງຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອເລັ່ງການສ້າງແສງທາງອ້ອມ "
"ແຕ່ອາດແລກມາກັບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງທີ່ຫຼຸດລົງເລັກນ້ອຍ. "
"ຮູບຊົງເລຂາຄະນິດອາດສະແດງຈຸດບົກພ່ອງຂອງແສງຮົ່ວໄຫຼເພີ່ມເຕີມເມື່ອໃຊ້ lightmaps ຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳ ຫຼື UV "
"ທີ່ດຶງເທັກເຈີໃຫ້ຢືດຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. ໃຫ້ປະ [member use_texture_for_bounces] ໄວ້ທີ່ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
"[code]true[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ແນ່ໃຈ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member use_texture_for_bounces] ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member bounces] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ [code]1[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Low bake quality (fastest bake times). The quality of this preset can be "
"adjusted by changing [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/"
"bake_quality/low_quality_ray_count] and [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lightmapping/bake_quality/low_quality_probe_ray_count]."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບການອົບລະດັບຕ່ຳ (ເວລາການອົບໄວທີ່ສຸດ). ຄຸນນະພາບຂອງຄ່າສຳເລັດຮູບນີ້ສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/bake_quality/"
"low_quality_ray_count] ແລະ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/"
"bake_quality/low_quality_probe_ray_count]."

msgid ""
"Medium bake quality (fast bake times). The quality of this preset can be "
"adjusted by changing [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/"
"bake_quality/medium_quality_ray_count] and [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lightmapping/bake_quality/medium_quality_probe_ray_count]."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບການອົບລະດັບກາງ (ເວລາການອົບໄວ). ຄຸນນະພາບຂອງຄ່າສຳເລັດຮູບນີ້ສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/bake_quality/"
"medium_quality_ray_count] ແລະ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/"
"bake_quality/medium_quality_probe_ray_count]."

msgid ""
"High bake quality (slow bake times). The quality of this preset can be "
"adjusted by changing [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/"
"bake_quality/high_quality_ray_count] and [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lightmapping/bake_quality/high_quality_probe_ray_count]."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບການອົບລະດັບສູງ (ເວລາການອົບຊ້າ). ຄຸນນະພາບຂອງຄ່າສຳເລັດຮູບນີ້ສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/bake_quality/"
"high_quality_ray_count] ແລະ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/"
"bake_quality/high_quality_probe_ray_count]."

msgid ""
"Highest bake quality (slowest bake times). The quality of this preset can be "
"adjusted by changing [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/"
"bake_quality/ultra_quality_ray_count] and [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lightmapping/bake_quality/ultra_quality_probe_ray_count]."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບການອົບລະດັບສູງສຸດ (ເວລາການອົບຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ). ຄຸນນະພາບຂອງຄ່າສຳເລັດຮູບນີ້ສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/bake_quality/"
"ultra_quality_ray_count] ແລະ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/"
"bake_quality/ultra_quality_probe_ray_count]."

msgid "Lowest level of subdivision (fastest bake times, smallest file sizes)."
msgstr "ລະດັບການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍຕ່ຳສຸດ (ເວລາການອົບໄວທີ່ສຸດ, ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ)."

msgid "Low level of subdivision (fast bake times, small file sizes)."
msgstr "ລະດັບການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍຕ່ຳ (ເວລາການອົບໄວ, ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ນ້ອຍ)."

msgid "High level of subdivision (slow bake times, large file sizes)."
msgstr "ລະດັບການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍສູງ (ເວລາການອົບຊ້າ, ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ໃຫຍ່)."

msgid "Highest level of subdivision (slowest bake times, largest file sizes)."
msgstr "ລະດັບການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍສູງສຸດ (ເວລາການອົບຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ, ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສຸດ)."

msgid "Lightmap baking was successful."
msgstr "ການອົບ Lightmap ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Lightmap baking failed because the root node for the edited scene could not "
"be accessed."
msgstr ""
"ການອົບ Lightmap ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ເພາະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໂນດຮາກ (root node) ຂອງສາກທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Lightmap baking failed as the lightmap data resource is embedded in a foreign "
"resource."
msgstr "ການອົບ Lightmap ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ເພາະຣີຊອດຂໍ້ມູນ lightmap ຖືກຝັງຢູ່ໃນຣີຊອດພາຍນອກ."

msgid ""
"Lightmap baking failed as there is no lightmapper available in this Godot "
"build."
msgstr "ການອົບ Lightmap ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ເພາະບໍ່ມີ lightmapper ໃນເວີຊັນ Godot ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Lightmap baking failed as the [LightmapGIData] save path isn't configured in "
"the resource."
msgstr "ການອົບ Lightmap ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ເພາະບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງການບັນທຶກ [LightmapGIData] ໃນຣີຊອດ."

msgid ""
"Lightmap baking failed as there are no meshes whose [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] is [constant GeometryInstance3D.GI_MODE_STATIC] "
"and with valid UV2 mapping in the current scene. You may need to select 3D "
"scenes in the Import dock and change their global illumination mode "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
"ການອົບ Lightmap ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ເພາະບໍ່ມີເມຊໃດທີ່ຕັ້ງ [member GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] ເປັນ "
"[constant GeometryInstance3D.GI_MODE_STATIC] ແລະ ມີ UV2 ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນສາກປັດຈຸບັນ. "
"ທ່ານອາດຕ້ອງເລືອກສາກ 3D ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ Import ແລະ ປ່ຽນໂໝດ global illumination ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ."

msgid ""
"Lightmap baking failed as the lightmapper failed to analyze some of the "
"meshes marked as static for baking."
msgstr ""
"ການອົບ Lightmap ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ເພາະ lightmapper ບໍ່ສາມາດວິເຄາະບາງເມຊທີ່ຖືກໝາຍວ່າເປັນ static "
"ສຳລັບການອົບໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Lightmap baking failed as the resulting image couldn't be saved or imported "
"by Godot after it was saved."
msgstr ""
"ການອົບ Lightmap ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ເພາະບໍ່ສາມາດບັນທຶກຮູບພາບທີ່ໄດ້ ຫຼື Godot "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າມັນໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກບັນທຶກແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"The user aborted the lightmap baking operation (typically by clicking the "
"[b]Cancel[/b] button in the progress dialog)."
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຍົກເລີກການອົບ lightmap (ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແມ່ນການຄລິກປຸ່ມ [b]Cancel[/b] ໃນກ່ອງສະແດງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າ)."

msgid ""
"Lightmap baking failed as the maximum texture size is too small to fit some "
"of the meshes marked for baking."
msgstr ""
"ການອົບ Lightmap ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ເພາະຂະໜາດເທັກເຈີສູງສຸດນ້ອຍເກີນໄປທີ່ຈະໃສ່ເມຊບາງອັນທີ່ໝາຍໄວ້ສຳລັບການອົບໄດ້."

msgid "Lightmap baking failed as the lightmap is too small."
msgstr "ການອົບ Lightmap ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ເພາະ lightmap ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍເກີນໄປ."

msgid "Lightmap baking failed as the lightmap was unable to fit into an atlas."
msgstr "ການອົບ Lightmap ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ເພາະບໍ່ສາມາດບັນຈຸ lightmap ເຂົ້າໃນ atlas ໄດ້."

msgid "Ignore environment lighting when baking lightmaps."
msgstr "ລະເລີຍແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເມື່ອອົບ lightmaps."

msgid ""
"Use the scene's environment lighting when baking lightmaps.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If baking lightmaps in a scene with no [WorldEnvironment] node, "
"this will act like [constant ENVIRONMENT_MODE_DISABLED]. The editor's preview "
"sky and sun is [i]not[/i] taken into account by [LightmapGI] when baking "
"lightmaps."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງສາກເມື່ອອົບ lightmaps.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າອົບ lightmaps ໃນສາກທີ່ບໍ່ມີໂນດ [WorldEnvironment], ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບ "
"[constant ENVIRONMENT_MODE_DISABLED]. ທ້ອງຟ້າ ແລະ ດວງອາທິດໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງເອດິເຕີ "
"[i]ຈະບໍ່[/i] ຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍ [LightmapGI] ເມື່ອອົບ lightmaps."

msgid ""
"Use [member environment_custom_sky] as a source of environment lighting when "
"baking lightmaps."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ [member environment_custom_sky] ເປັນແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເມື່ອອົບ lightmaps."

msgid ""
"Use [member environment_custom_color] multiplied by [member "
"environment_custom_energy] as a constant source of environment lighting when "
"baking lightmaps."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ [member environment_custom_color] ຄູນກັບ [member environment_custom_energy] "
"ເປັນແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ຄົງທີ່ເມື່ອອົບ lightmaps."

msgid "Contains baked lightmap and dynamic object probe data for [LightmapGI]."
msgstr ""
"ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນ lightmap ທີ່ອົບແລ້ວ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນໂພຣບ (probe) ຂອງວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກສຳລັບ [LightmapGI]."

msgid ""
"[LightmapGIData] contains baked lightmap and dynamic object probe data for "
"[LightmapGI]. It is replaced every time lightmaps are baked in [LightmapGI]."
msgstr ""
"[LightmapGIData] ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນ lightmap ທີ່ອົບແລ້ວ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນໂພຣບ (probe) "
"ຂອງວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກສຳລັບ [LightmapGI]. ມັນຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການອົບ lightmaps ໃນ "
"[LightmapGI]."

msgid "Adds an object that is considered baked within this [LightmapGIData]."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກພິຈາລະນາວ່າຖືກອົບໄວ້ໃນ [LightmapGIData] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Clear all objects that are considered baked within this [LightmapGIData]."
msgstr "ລຶບວັດຖຸທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກພິຈາລະນາວ່າຖືກອົບໄວ້ໃນ [LightmapGIData] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of objects that are considered baked within this "
"[LightmapGIData]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກພິຈາລະນາວ່າຖືກອົບໄວ້ໃນ [LightmapGIData] ນີ້."

msgid "Returns the [NodePath] of the baked object at index [param user_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [NodePath] ຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກອົບຢູ່ດັດຊະນີ [param user_idx]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], lightmaps were baked with directional information. See "
"also [member LightmapGI.directional]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະແດງວ່າ lightmaps ຖືກອົບພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ມູນທິດທາງ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"LightmapGI.directional] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"If [param uses_spherical_harmonics] is [code]true[/code], tells the engine to "
"treat the lightmap data as if it was baked with directional information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing this value on already baked lightmaps will not cause "
"them to be baked again. This means the material appearance will look "
"incorrect until lightmaps are baked again, in which case the value set here "
"is discarded as the entire [LightmapGIData] resource is replaced by the "
"lightmapper."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param uses_spherical_harmonics] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະບອກໃຫ້ເອນຈິນຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນ lightmap ຄືກັບວ່າມັນຖືກອົບມາພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ມູນທິດທາງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ໃນ lightmaps ທີ່ອົບແລ້ວຈະບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນຖືກອົບໃໝ່. "
"ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າລັກສະນະຂອງວັດຖຸອາດຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຈົນກວ່າຈະມີການອົບ lightmaps ໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ, "
"ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ທີ່ນີ້ຈະຖືກຖິ້ມໄປ ເພາະຣີຊອດ [LightmapGIData] ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ໂດຍ "
"lightmapper."

msgid ""
"The lightmap atlas can now contain multiple textures. See [member "
"lightmap_textures]."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ lightmap atlas ສາມາດບັນຈຸໄດ້ຫຼາຍເທັກເຈີ. ເບິ່ງ [member lightmap_textures]."

msgid "The lightmap atlas texture generated by the lightmapper."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີ lightmap atlas ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ lightmapper."

msgid "The lightmap atlas textures generated by the lightmapper."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີ lightmap atlas ທັງໝົດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ lightmapper."

msgid "The shadowmask atlas textures generated by the lightmapper."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີ shadowmask atlas ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ lightmapper."

msgid ""
"Shadowmasking is disabled. No shadowmask texture will be created when baking "
"lightmaps. Existing shadowmask textures will be removed during baking."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ Shadowmasking. ຈະບໍ່ມີການສ້າງເທັກເຈີ shadowmask ເມື່ອອົບ lightmaps. ເທັກເຈີ "
"shadowmask ທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກໃນລະຫວ່າງການອົບ."

msgid ""
"Shadowmasking is enabled. Directional shadows that are outside the [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_max_distance] will be rendered using "
"the shadowmask texture. Shadows that are inside the range will be rendered "
"using real-time shadows exclusively. This mode allows for more precise real-"
"time shadows up close, without the potential \"smearing\" effect that can "
"occur when using lightmaps with a high texel size. The downside is that when "
"the camera moves fast, the transition between the real-time light and "
"shadowmask can be obvious. Also, objects that only have shadows baked in the "
"shadowmask (and no real-time shadows) won't display any shadows up close."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ Shadowmasking. Directional shadows ທີ່ຢູ່ນອກໄລຍະ [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_max_distance] ຈະຖືກເຣນເດີໂດຍໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີ "
"shadowmask. ສ່ວນເງົາທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໄລຍະຈະຖືກເຣນເດີໂດຍໃຊ້ເງົາແບບຮຽວທາມເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ໂໝດນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເງົາຮຽວທາມໃນໄລຍະໃກ້ມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີເອັບເຟັກ \"smearing\" "
"ທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອໃຊ້ lightmaps ທີ່ມີຂະໜາດເທັກເຊວໃຫຍ່. ຂໍ້ເສຍຄືເມື່ອກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວ, "
"ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານລະຫວ່າງແສງຮຽວທາມ ແລະ shadowmask ອາດຈະເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນ. ນອກຈາກນີ້, "
"ວັດຖຸທີ່ມີພຽງເງົາທີ່ອົບໃນ shadowmask (ແລະ ບໍ່ມີເງົາຮຽວທາມ) ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງເງົາເລີຍເມື່ອເບິ່ງໃກ້ໆ."

msgid ""
"Shadowmasking is enabled. Directional shadows will be rendered with real-time "
"shadows overlaid on top of the shadowmask texture. This mode makes for "
"smoother shadow transitions when the camera moves fast, at the cost of a "
"potential smearing effect for directional shadows that are up close (due to "
"the real-time shadow being mixed with a low-resolution shadowmask). Objects "
"that only have shadows baked in the shadowmask (and no real-time shadows) "
"will keep their shadows up close."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ Shadowmasking. Directional shadows "
"ຈະຖືກເຣນເດີໂດຍການຊ້ອນເງົາຮຽວທາມໄວ້ເທິງເທັກເຈີ shadowmask. "
"ໂໝດນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານຂອງເງົານຸ່ມນວນຂຶ້ນເມື່ອກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວ, ແຕ່ອາດແລກມາກັບເອັບເຟັກ smearing "
"ສຳລັບ directional shadows ໃນໄລຍະໃກ້ (ເນື່ອງຈາກເງົາຮຽວທາມຖືກປະສົມກັບ shadowmask "
"ທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳ). ວັດຖຸທີ່ມີພຽງເງົາທີ່ອົບໃນ shadowmask (ແລະ ບໍ່ມີເງົາຮຽວທາມ) "
"ຈະຍັງຄົງສະແດງເງົາໄດ້ເມື່ອເບິ່ງໃກ້ໆ."

msgid "Abstract class extended by lightmappers, for use in [LightmapGI]."
msgstr "ຄລາສແບບ abstract ທີ່ຖືກສືບທອດໂດຍ lightmappers ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ [LightmapGI]."

msgid ""
"This class should be extended by custom lightmapper classes. Lightmappers can "
"then be used with [LightmapGI] to provide fast baked global illumination in "
"3D.\n"
"Godot contains a built-in GPU-based lightmapper [LightmapperRD] that uses "
"compute shaders, but custom lightmappers can be implemented by C++ modules."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ຄວນຖືກສືບທອດໂດຍຄລາສ lightmapper ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເອງ. ຈາກນັ້ນສາມາດໃຊ້ lightmappers ຮ່ວມກັບ "
"[LightmapGI] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ global illumination ແບບອົບທີ່ວ່ອງໄວໃນ 3D.\n"
"Godot ມີ lightmapper ທີ່ໃຊ້ GPU ໃນຕົວ [LightmapperRD] ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ compute shaders, "
"ແຕ່ກໍສາມາດສ້າງ lightmapper ເອງໄດ້ຜ່ານໂມດູນ C++."

msgid "The built-in GPU-based lightmapper for use with [LightmapGI]."
msgstr "ຕົວສ້າງແຜນທີ່ແສງທີ່ອີງໃສ່ GPU ພາຍໃນຕົວ ສໍາລັບໃຊ້ກັບ [LightmapGI]."

msgid ""
"LightmapperRD (\"RD\" stands for [RenderingDevice]) is the built-in GPU-based "
"lightmapper for use with [LightmapGI]. On most dedicated GPUs, it can bake "
"lightmaps much faster than most CPU-based lightmappers. LightmapperRD uses "
"compute shaders to bake lightmaps, so it does not require CUDA or OpenCL "
"libraries to be installed to be usable.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This lightmapper requires the GPU to support the "
"[RenderingDevice] backend (Forward+ and Mobile renderers). When using the "
"Compatibility renderer, baking will use a temporary [RenderingDevice]. "
"Support for [RenderingDevice] is not required to [i]render[/i] lightmaps that "
"were already baked beforehand."
msgstr ""
"LightmapperRD (\"RD\" ຫຍໍ້າມາຈາກ [RenderingDevice]) ແມ່ນ lightmapper ທີ່ໃຊ້ GPU "
"ໃນຕົວສຳລັບໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [LightmapGI]. ໃນກາດຈໍແຍກສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ມັນສາມາດອົບ lightmaps ໄດ້ໄວກວ່າ "
"lightmappers ທີ່ໃຊ້ CPU ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່. LightmapperRD ໃຊ້ compute shaders ໃນການອົບ "
"lightmaps, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງໄລບຣາຣີ CUDA ຫຼື OpenCL ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] lightmapper ນີ້ຕ້ອງການ GPU ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ [RenderingDevice] ແບັກເອນ "
"(ເຣນເດີເຣີ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile). ເມື່ອໃຊ້ເຣນເດີເຣີ Compatibility, ການອົບຈະໃຊ້ "
"[RenderingDevice] ຊົ່ວຄາວ. ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການຮອງຮັບ [RenderingDevice] ເພື່ອ [i]ເຣນເດີ[/"
"i] lightmaps ທີ່ຖືກອົບໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Represents a single manually placed probe for dynamic object lighting with "
"[LightmapGI]."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຖິງໂພຣບ (probe) ອັນດຽວທີ່ວາງດ້ວຍມືສຳລັບການສ່ອງແສງວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກດ້ວຍ [LightmapGI]."

msgid ""
"[LightmapProbe] represents the position of a single manually placed probe for "
"dynamic object lighting with [LightmapGI]. Lightmap probes affect the "
"lighting of [GeometryInstance3D]-derived nodes that have their [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] set to [constant "
"GeometryInstance3D.GI_MODE_DYNAMIC].\n"
"Typically, [LightmapGI] probes are placed automatically by setting [member "
"LightmapGI.generate_probes_subdiv] to a value other than [constant "
"LightmapGI.GENERATE_PROBES_DISABLED]. By creating [LightmapProbe] nodes "
"before baking lightmaps, you can add more probes in specific areas for "
"greater detail, or disable automatic generation and rely only on manually "
"placed probes instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [LightmapProbe] nodes that are placed after baking lightmaps are "
"ignored by dynamic objects. You must bake lightmaps again after creating or "
"modifying [LightmapProbe]s for the probes to be effective."
msgstr ""
"[LightmapProbe] ສະແດງເຖິງຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໂພຣບອັນດຽວທີ່ວາງດ້ວຍມືສຳລັບການສ່ອງແສງວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກດ້ວຍ "
"[LightmapGI]. Lightmap probes ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການສ່ອງແສງຂອງໂນດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ "
"[GeometryInstance3D] ເຊິ່ງຕັ້ງ [member GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] ເປັນ [constant "
"GeometryInstance3D.GI_MODE_DYNAMIC].\n"
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ໂພຣບຂອງ [LightmapGI] ຈະຖືກວາງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍການຕັ້ງ [member "
"LightmapGI.generate_probes_subdiv] ເປັນຄ່າອື່ນນອກຈາກ [constant "
"LightmapGI.GENERATE_PROBES_DISABLED]. ດ້ວຍການສ້າງໂນດ [LightmapProbe] ກ່ອນການອົບ "
"lightmaps, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມໂພຣບໃນພື້ນທີ່ສະເພາະເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ລາຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ຫຼື "
"ປິດການສ້າງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດແລ້ວໃຊ້ສະເພາະໂພຣບທີ່ວາງດ້ວຍມືແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດ [LightmapProbe] ທີ່ຖືກວາງຫຼັງຈາກການອົບ lightmaps "
"ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍໂດຍວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງອົບ lightmaps ໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂ "
"[LightmapProbe] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂພຣບມີຜົນ."

msgid "Occludes light cast by a Light2D, casting shadows."
msgstr "ຂັດຂວາງແສງທີ່ສ່ອງມາຈາກ Light2D ເພື່ອສ້າງເງົາ."

msgid ""
"Occludes light cast by a Light2D, casting shadows. The LightOccluder2D must "
"be provided with an [OccluderPolygon2D] in order for the shadow to be "
"computed."
msgstr ""
"ຂັດຂວາງແສງທີ່ສ່ອງມາຈາກ Light2D ເພື່ອສ້າງເງົາ. LightOccluder2D ຕ້ອງມີ "
"[OccluderPolygon2D] ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການຄິດໄລ່ເງົາ."

msgid "The [OccluderPolygon2D] used to compute the shadow."
msgstr "[OccluderPolygon2D] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ເງົາ."

msgid ""
"The LightOccluder2D's occluder light mask. The LightOccluder2D will cast "
"shadows only from Light2D(s) that have the same light mask(s)."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າກາກແສງ (light mask) ຂອງ LightOccluder2D. LightOccluder2D ຈະສ້າງເງົາສະເພາະຈາກ "
"Light2D ທີ່ມີໜ້າກາກແສງກົງກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If enabled, the occluder will be part of a real-time generated signed "
"distance field that can be used in custom shaders."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ຕົວຂັດຂວາງແສງ (occluder) ຈະເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ signed distance field "
"ທີ່ສ້າງແບບຮຽວທາມ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ໃນ shader ທີ່ຂຽນເອງໄດ້."

msgid "Limit bone rotation angular velocity."
msgstr "ຈຳກັດຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມ (angular velocity) ໃນການໝູນຂອງກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"This modifier limits bone rotation angular velocity by comparing poses "
"between previous and current frame.\n"
"You can add bone chains by specifying their root and end bones, then add the "
"bones between them to a list. Modifier processes either that list or the "
"bones excluding those in the list depending on the option [member exclude].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Most methods in this class take an [code]index[/code] parameter. "
"This parameter specifies which setting list entry to return if the IK has "
"multiple entries (e.g. [code]settings/<index>/root_bone_name[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວດັດແປງ (modifier) ນີ້ຈະຈຳກັດຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມໃນການໝູນຂອງກະດູກ ໂດຍການປຽບທຽບທ່າທາງ (poses) "
"ລະຫວ່າງເຟຣມກ່ອນໜ້າ ແລະ ເຟຣມປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ (bone chains) ໄດ້ໂດຍການກຳນົດກະດູກຕົ້ນທາງ (root) ແລະ ປາຍທາງ "
"(end), ຈາກນັ້ນເພີ່ມກະດູກລະຫວ່າງພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການ. ຕົວດັດແປງຈະປະມວນຜົນລາຍການນັ້ນ ຫຼື "
"ປະມວນຜົນກະດູກທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນລາຍການ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຕົວເລືອກ [member exclude].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມັດທອດ (methods) ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃນຄລາສນີ້ຮັບພະລາມິເຕີ [code]index[/code]. "
"ພະລາມິເຕີນີ້ລະບຸວ່າຈະສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃດ ຫາກ IK ມີຫຼາຍລາຍການ (ເຊັ່ນ [code]settings/<index>/"
"root_bone_name[/code])."

msgid "Clear all chains."
msgstr "ລຶບສາຍໂສ້ທັງໝົດອອກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the reference pose for angle comparison to the current pose with the "
"influence of constraints removed. This function is automatically triggered "
"when joints change or upon activation."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງທ່າທາງອ້າງອີງສຳລັບການປຽບທຽບມຸມ ໃຫ້ເປັນທ່າທາງປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ປາສະຈາກອິດທິພົນຂອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ "
"(constraints). ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຂໍ້ຕໍ່ (joints) ປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື "
"ເມື່ອມີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Sets the end bone name of the bone chain.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] End bone must be the root bone or a child of the root bone."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຊື່ກະດູກປາຍທາງຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ກະດູກປາຍທາງຕ້ອງເປັນກະດູກຕົ້ນທາງເອງ ຫຼື ເປັນລູກຂອງກະດູກຕົ້ນທາງ."

msgid "The number of chains."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂອງສາຍໂສ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the modifier processes bones not included in the bone "
"list.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the bones processed by the modifier are equal to the "
"bone list."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວດັດແປງຈະປະມວນຜົນກະດູກທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ລວມຢູ່ໃນລາຍການກະດູກ.\n"
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ກະດູກທີ່ຖືກປະມວນຜົນໂດຍຕົວດັດແປງຈະເປັນໄປຕາມລາຍການກະດູກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "The number of joints in the list which created by chains dynamically."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃນລາຍການທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍສາຍໂສ້ແບບໄດນາມິກ."

msgid "The maximum angular velocity per second."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມສູງສຸດຕໍ່ວິນາທີ."

msgid "A 2D polyline that can optionally be textured."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນ polyline 2D ທີ່ສາມາດໃສ່ເທັກເຈີໄດ້."

msgid ""
"This node draws a 2D polyline, i.e. a shape consisting of several points "
"connected by segments. [Line2D] is not a mathematical polyline, i.e. the "
"segments are not infinitely thin. It is intended for rendering and it can be "
"colored and optionally textured.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Certain configurations may be impossible to draw nicely, such "
"as very sharp angles. In these situations, the node uses fallback drawing "
"logic to look decent.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Line2D] is drawn using a 2D mesh."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດນີ້ແຕ້ມ polyline 2D, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນຮູບຊົງທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຫຼາຍຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນດ້ວຍສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນ. [Line2D] "
"ບໍ່ແມ່ນ polyline ທາງຄະນິດສາດ, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນບໍ່ໄດ້ບາງຈົນເປັນອະສົງໄຂ. "
"ມັນຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອການສະແດງຜົນ ແລະ ສາມາດໃສ່ສີ ຫຼື ເທັກເຈີໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ບາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດແຕ້ມໃຫ້ສວຍງາມໄດ້, ເຊັ່ນມຸມທີ່ແຫຼມຫຼາຍ. ໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ, "
"ໂນດຈະໃຊ້ຕັກກະການແຕ້ມແບບສຳຮອງ (fallback) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເບິ່ງດີທີ່ສຸດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [Line2D] ຖືກແຕ້ມໂດຍໃຊ້ເມຊ 2D."

msgid ""
"Adds a point with the specified [param position] relative to the polyline's "
"own position. If no [param index] is provided, the new point will be added to "
"the end of the points array.\n"
"If [param index] is given, the new point is inserted before the existing "
"point identified by index [param index]. The indices of the points after the "
"new point get increased by 1. The provided [param index] must not exceed the "
"number of existing points in the polyline. See [method get_point_count]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຈຸດດ້ວຍ [param position] ທີ່ລະບຸ ໂດຍທຽບກັບຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ polyline ເອງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸ [param "
"index], ຈຸດໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຕອນທ້າຍຂອງອາເຣຈຸດ. \n"
"ຖ້າລະບຸ [param index], ຈຸດໃໝ່ຈະຖືກແຊກກ່ອນຈຸດທີ່ມີຢູ່ເຊິ່ງລະບຸໂດຍດັດຊະນີ [param index]. "
"ດັດຊະນີຂອງຈຸດທີ່ຢູ່ຫຼັງຈຸດໃໝ່ຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ 1. [param index] ທີ່ລະບຸຕ້ອງບໍ່ເກີນຈຳນວນຈຸດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ polyline. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_point_count]."

msgid "Removes all points from the polyline, making it empty."
msgstr "ລຶບຈຸດທັງໝົດອອກຈາກ polyline, ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເປັນຄ່າວ່າງ."

msgid "Returns the number of points in the polyline."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຈຸດໃນ polyline."

msgid "Returns the position of the point at index [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຈຸດຢູ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index]."

msgid "Removes the point at index [param index] from the polyline."
msgstr "ລຶບຈຸດຢູ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index] ອອກຈາກ polyline."

msgid ""
"Overwrites the position of the point at the given [param index] with the "
"supplied [param position]."
msgstr "ຂຽນທັບຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຈຸດຢູ່ [param index] ທີ່ກຳນົດ ດ້ວຍ [param position] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the polyline's border will be anti-aliased.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Line2D] is not accelerated by batching when being anti-aliased."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຂອບຂອງ polyline ຈະຖືກລົບຮອຍຢັກ (anti-aliased).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [Line2D] ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການເລັ່ງປະສິດທິພາບດ້ວຍ batching ເມື່ອມີການລົບຮອຍຢັກ."

msgid ""
"The style of the beginning of the polyline, if [member closed] is "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຂອງຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ polyline, ຖ້າ [member closed] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] and the polyline has more than 2 points, the last point "
"and the first one will be connected by a segment.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The shape of the closing segment is not guaranteed to be "
"seamless if a [member width_curve] is provided.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The joint between the closing segment and the first segment is "
"drawn first and it samples the [member gradient] and the [member width_curve] "
"at the beginning. This is an implementation detail that might change in a "
"future version."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ polyline ມີຫຼາຍກວ່າ 2 ຈຸດ, ຈຸດສຸດທ້າຍ ແລະ "
"ຈຸດທຳອິດຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນດ້ວຍສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮູບຊົງຂອງເສັ້ນປິດບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະເນື້ອດຽວກັນແບບບໍ່ມີຮອຍຖ້າຫາກມີການໃຊ້ [member "
"width_curve].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງເສັ້ນປິດ ແລະ ເສັ້ນທຳອິດຈະຖືກແຕ້ມກ່ອນ ແລະ ມັນຈະສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຈາກ [member "
"gradient] ແລະ [member width_curve] ໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນລາຍລະອຽດການເຮັດວຽກພາຍໃນເຊິ່ງອາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໃນເວີຊັນອະນາຄົດ."

msgid "The color of the polyline. Will not be used if a gradient is set."
msgstr "ສີຂອງ polyline. ຈະບໍ່ຖືກໃຊ້ຖ້າມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລ່ສີ (gradient)."

msgid ""
"The style of the end of the polyline, if [member closed] is [code]false[/"
"code]."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຂອງຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງ polyline, ຖ້າ [member closed] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"The gradient is drawn through the whole line from start to finish. The "
"[member default_color] will not be used if this property is set."
msgstr ""
"ການໄລ່ສີ (gradient) ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມຕະຫຼອດເສັ້ນຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຈົນຈົບ. [member default_color] "
"ຈະບໍ່ຖືກໃຊ້ຖ້າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້."

msgid "The style of the connections between segments of the polyline."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນ polyline."

msgid ""
"The points of the polyline, interpreted in local 2D coordinates. Segments are "
"drawn between the adjacent points in this array."
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດຕ່າງໆຂອງ polyline, ແປຄ່າຕາມພິກັດ 2D ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local coordinates). "
"ເສັ້ນຈະຖືກແຕ້ມລະຫວ່າງຈຸດທີ່ຢູ່ຕິດກັນໃນອາເຣນີ້."

msgid ""
"The smoothness used for rounded joints and caps. Higher values result in "
"smoother corners, but are more demanding to render and update."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມລຽບນຽນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ ແລະ ປາຍເສັ້ນແບບມົນ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມຸມມີຄວາມລຽບນຽນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ກໍຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນການເຣນເດີ ແລະ ອັບເດດ."

msgid ""
"Determines the miter limit of the polyline. Normally, when [member "
"joint_mode] is set to [constant LINE_JOINT_SHARP], sharp angles fall back to "
"using the logic of [constant LINE_JOINT_BEVEL] joints to prevent very long "
"miters. Higher values of this property mean that the fallback to a bevel "
"joint will happen at sharper angles."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຂີດຈຳກັດ miter ຂອງ polyline. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ເມື່ອ [member joint_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[constant LINE_JOINT_SHARP], ມຸມທີ່ແຫຼມຫຼາຍຈະປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ຕັກກະຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບ [constant "
"LINE_JOINT_BEVEL] ແທນ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ເສັ້ນ miter ຍາວເກີນໄປ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ bevel ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນມຸມທີ່ແຫຼມກວ່າເກົ່າ."

msgid ""
"The texture used for the polyline. Uses [member texture_mode] for drawing "
"style."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ polyline. ໃຊ້ [member texture_mode] ສຳລັບຮູບແບບການແຕ້ມ."

msgid "The style to render the [member texture] of the polyline."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການເຣນເດີ [member texture] ຂອງ polyline."

msgid "The polyline's width."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງ polyline."

msgid ""
"The polyline's width curve. The width of the polyline over its length will be "
"equivalent to the value of the width curve over its domain. The width curve "
"should be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງ polyline. ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງ polyline "
"ຕະຫຼອດຄວາມຍາວຈະເທົ່າກັບຄ່າຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຄວາມກວ້າງຕາມຊ່ວງຂອງມັນ. ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຄວາມກວ້າງຄວນເປັນ "
"[Curve] ແບບຢູນິດ (unit Curve)."

msgid ""
"Makes the polyline's joints pointy, connecting the sides of the two segments "
"by extending them until they intersect. If the rotation of a joint is too big "
"(based on [member sharp_limit]), the joint falls back to [constant "
"LINE_JOINT_BEVEL] to prevent very long miters."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງ polyline ເປັນປາຍແຫຼມ, ໂດຍການຕໍ່ສອງສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນໃຫ້ຢືດອອກໄປຈົນກວ່າພວກມັນຈະຕັດກັນ. "
"ຖ້າການໝູນຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃຫຍ່ເກີນໄປ (ອີງຕາມ [member sharp_limit]), ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຈະປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ [constant "
"LINE_JOINT_BEVEL] ແທນເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ເສັ້ນ miter ຍາວເກີນໄປ."

msgid ""
"Makes the polyline's joints bevelled/chamfered, connecting the sides of the "
"two segments with a simple line."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງ polyline ເປັນແບບຕັດມຸມ (bevelled/chamfered), "
"ໂດຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສອງສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນດ້ວຍເສັ້ນຊື່ແບບງ່າຍໆ."

msgid ""
"Makes the polyline's joints rounded, connecting the sides of the two segments "
"with an arc. The detail of this arc depends on [member round_precision]."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງ polyline ເປັນແບບມົນ, ໂດຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສອງສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນດ້ວຍເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ. "
"ລາຍລະອຽດຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງນີ້ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບ [member round_precision]."

msgid "Draws no line cap."
msgstr "ບໍ່ແຕ້ມປາຍເສັ້ນ."

msgid "Draws the line cap as a box, slightly extending the first/last segment."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມປາຍເສັ້ນເປັນຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກ, ໂດຍການຢືດສ່ວນທຳອິດ/ສຸດທ້າຍອອກໄປເລັກນ້ອຍ."

msgid "Draws the line cap as a semicircle attached to the first/last segment."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມປາຍເສັ້ນເປັນຮູບເຄິ່ງວົງມົນຕິດກັບສ່ວນທຳອິດ/ສຸດທ້າຍ."

msgid ""
"Takes the left pixels of the texture and renders them over the whole polyline."
msgstr "ນຳເອົາພິກເຊວດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງເທັກເຈີມາເຣນເດີຕະຫຼອດເສັ້ນ polyline ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Tiles the texture over the polyline. [member CanvasItem.texture_repeat] of "
"the [Line2D] node must be [constant CanvasItem.TEXTURE_REPEAT_ENABLED] or "
"[constant CanvasItem.TEXTURE_REPEAT_MIRROR] for it to work properly."
msgstr ""
"ວາງເທັກເຈີແບບລຽງຕໍ່ກັນ (tile) ຕະຫຼອດເສັ້ນ polyline. ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member "
"CanvasItem.texture_repeat] ຂອງໂນດ [Line2D] ຕ້ອງເປັນ [constant "
"CanvasItem.TEXTURE_REPEAT_ENABLED] ຫຼື [constant "
"CanvasItem.TEXTURE_REPEAT_MIRROR] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Stretches the texture across the polyline. [member CanvasItem.texture_repeat] "
"of the [Line2D] node must be [constant CanvasItem.TEXTURE_REPEAT_DISABLED] "
"for best results."
msgstr ""
"ຢືດເທັກເຈີໃຫ້ເຕັມຕາມຄວາມຍາວຂອງ polyline. ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member CanvasItem.texture_repeat] "
"ຂອງໂນດ [Line2D] ຄວນເປັນ [constant CanvasItem.TEXTURE_REPEAT_DISABLED] "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "An input field for single-line text."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມແຖວດຽວ."

msgid ""
"Applies text from the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Input "
"Method Editor[/url] (IME) and closes the IME if it is open."
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Input Method "
"Editor[/url] (IME) ແລະ ປິດ IME ຖ້າມັນເປີດຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Closes the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Input Method "
"Editor[/url] (IME) if it is open. Any text in the IME will be lost."
msgstr ""
"ປິດ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Input Method Editor[/url] "
"(IME) ຖ້າມັນເປີດຢູ່. ຂໍ້ຄວາມໃດໆໃນ IME ຈະຖືກຖິ້ມໄປ."

msgid "Erases the [LineEdit]'s [member text]."
msgstr "ລຶບ [member text] ຂອງ [LineEdit] ອອກ."

msgid ""
"Deletes one character at the caret's current position (equivalent to pressing "
"[kbd]Delete[/kbd])."
msgstr "ລຶບຕົວອັກສອນໜຶ່ງຕົວຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງຕົວຊີ້ແຄເຣັດ (ຄືກັບການກົດ [kbd]Delete[/kbd])."

msgid ""
"Deletes a section of the [member text] going from position [param "
"from_column] to [param to_column]. Both parameters should be within the "
"text's length."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບສ່ວນຂອງ [member text] ຕັ້ງແຕ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ [param from_column] ຫາ [param to_column]. "
"ທັງສອງພະລາມິເຕີຄວນຢູ່ໃນໄລຍະຄວາມຍາວຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid "Clears the current selection."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Allows entering edit mode whether the [LineEdit] is focused or not. If [param "
"hide_focus] is [code]true[/code], the focused state will not be shown (see "
"[method Control.grab_focus]).\n"
"See also [member keep_editing_on_text_submit]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດແກ້ໄຂ ບໍ່ວ່າ [LineEdit] ຈະຖືກໂຟກັດຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າ [param hide_focus] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code], ສະຖານະໂຟກັດຈະບໍ່ຖືກສະແດງ (ເບິ່ງ [method Control.grab_focus]).\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [member keep_editing_on_text_submit] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [PopupMenu] of this [LineEdit]. By default, this menu is "
"displayed when right-clicking on the [LineEdit].\n"
"You can add custom menu items or remove standard ones. Make sure your IDs "
"don't conflict with the standard ones (see [enum MenuItems]). For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar menu = get_menu()\n"
"\t# Remove all items after \"Redo\".\n"
"\tmenu.item_count = menu.get_item_index(MENU_REDO) + 1\n"
"\t# Add custom items.\n"
"\tmenu.add_separator()\n"
"\tmenu.add_item(\"Insert Date\", MENU_MAX + 1)\n"
"\t# Connect callback.\n"
"\tmenu.id_pressed.connect(_on_item_pressed)\n"
"\n"
"func _on_item_pressed(id):\n"
"\tif id == MENU_MAX + 1:\n"
"\t\tinsert_text_at_caret(Time.get_date_string_from_system())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar menu = GetMenu();\n"
"\t// Remove all items after \"Redo\".\n"
"\tmenu.ItemCount = menu.GetItemIndex(LineEdit.MenuItems.Redo) + 1;\n"
"\t// Add custom items.\n"
"\tmenu.AddSeparator();\n"
"\tmenu.AddItem(\"Insert Date\", LineEdit.MenuItems.Max + 1);\n"
"\t// Add event handler.\n"
"\tmenu.IdPressed += OnItemPressed;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public void OnItemPressed(int id)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (id == LineEdit.MenuItems.Max + 1)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tInsertTextAtCaret(Time.GetDateStringFromSystem());\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it may "
"cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member Window.visible] property."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [PopupMenu] ຂອງ [LineEdit] ນີ້. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເມນູນີ້ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ "
"[LineEdit].\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມລາຍການເມນູເອງ ຫຼື ລຶບລາຍການມາດຕະຖານອອກໄດ້. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ ID ຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ໄປຕຳກັບ ID "
"ມາດຕະຖານ (ເບິ່ງ [enum MenuItems]). ຕົວຢ່າງ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar menu = get_menu()\n"
"\t# ລຶບລາຍການທັງໝົດຫຼັງຈາກ \"Redo\".\n"
"\tmenu.item_count = menu.get_item_index(MENU_REDO) + 1\n"
"\t# ເພີ່ມລາຍການເອງ.\n"
"\tmenu.add_separator()\n"
"\tmenu.add_item(\"Insert Date\", MENU_MAX + 1)\n"
"\t# ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ callback.\n"
"\tmenu.id_pressed.connect(_on_item_pressed)\n"
"\n"
"func _on_item_pressed(id):\n"
"\tif id == MENU_MAX + 1:\n"
"\t\tinsert_text_at_caret(Time.get_date_string_from_system())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar menu = GetMenu();\n"
"\t// ລຶບລາຍການທັງໝົດຫຼັງຈາກ \"Redo\".\n"
"\tmenu.ItemCount = menu.GetItemIndex(LineEdit.MenuItems.Redo) + 1;\n"
"\t// ເພີ່ມລາຍການເອງ.\n"
"\tmenu.AddSeparator();\n"
"\tmenu.AddItem(\"Insert Date\", LineEdit.MenuItems.Max + 1);\n"
"\t// ເພີ່ມ event handler.\n"
"\tmenu.IdPressed += OnItemPressed;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public void OnItemPressed(int id)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (id == LineEdit.MenuItems.Max + 1)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tInsertTextAtCaret(Time.GetDateStringFromSystem());\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນໂນດພາຍໃນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ການລຶບ ຫຼື ການຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ (freeing) "
"ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໂປຣແກຣມຫຼົ້ມໄດ້. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອງມັນ ຫຼື ລູກຂອງມັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member "
"Window.visible] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the correct column at the end of a composite character like ❤️‍🩹 "
"(mending heart; Unicode: [code]U+2764 U+FE0F U+200D U+1FA79[/code]) which is "
"comprised of more than one Unicode code point, if the caret is at the start "
"of the composite character. Also returns the correct column with the caret at "
"mid grapheme and for non-composite characters.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To check at caret location use "
"[code]get_next_composite_character_column(get_caret_column())[/code]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄໍລຳ (column) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຢູ່ທ້າຍຂອງຕົວອັກສອນປະສົມ ເຊັ່ນ ❤️‍🩹 (Unicode: [code]U+2764 "
"U+FE0F U+200D U+1FA79[/code]) ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງ Unicode code point, "
"ຫາກຕົວຊີ້ແຄເຣັດຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຕົວອັກສອນປະສົມນັ້ນ. ຍັງສົ່ງຄືນຄໍລຳທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເມື່ອຕົວຊີ້ແຄເຣັດຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງ "
"grapheme ແລະ ສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບປະສົມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອກວດສອບທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງຕົວຊີ້ແຄເຣັດ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[code]get_next_composite_character_column(get_caret_column())[/code]"

msgid ""
"Returns the correct column at the start of a composite character like ❤️‍🩹 "
"(mending heart; Unicode: [code]U+2764 U+FE0F U+200D U+1FA79[/code]) which is "
"comprised of more than one Unicode code point, if the caret is at the end of "
"the composite character. Also returns the correct column with the caret at "
"mid grapheme and for non-composite characters.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To check at caret location use "
"[code]get_previous_composite_character_column(get_caret_column())[/code]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄໍລຳ (column) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຢູ່ຕົ້ນຂອງຕົວອັກສອນປະສົມ ເຊັ່ນ ❤️‍🩹 (Unicode: [code]U+2764 "
"U+FE0F U+200D U+1FA79[/code]) ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງ Unicode code point, "
"ຫາກຕົວຊີ້ແຄເຣັດຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຕົວອັກສອນປະສົມນັ້ນ. ຍັງສົ່ງຄືນຄໍລຳທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເມື່ອຕົວຊີ້ແຄເຣັດຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງ "
"grapheme ແລະ ສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບປະສົມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອກວດສອບທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງຕົວຊີ້ແຄເຣັດ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[code]get_previous_composite_character_column(get_caret_column())[/code]"

msgid ""
"Returns the scroll offset due to [member caret_column], as a number of "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າການເລື່ອນ (scroll offset) ເນື່ອງຈາກ [member caret_column], "
"ໂດຍຄິດເປັນຈຳນວນຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid "Returns the text inside the selection."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໄວ້."

msgid "Returns the selection begin column."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄໍລຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງການເລືອກ."

msgid "Returns the selection end column."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄໍລຳສິ້ນສຸດຂອງການເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the user has text in the [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Input Method Editor[/url] (IME)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຜູ້ໃຊ້ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Input_method]Input Method Editor[/url] (IME)."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if a \"redo\" action is available."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສາມາດ \"ເຮັດຄືນ\" (redo) ໄດ້."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the user has selected text."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if an \"undo\" action is available."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສາມາດ \"ຍົກເລີກການກະທຳ\" (undo) ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Inserts [param text] at the caret. If the resulting value is longer than "
"[member max_length], nothing happens."
msgstr ""
"ແຊກ [param text] ໃສ່ບ່ອນຕົວກະພິບ. ຖ້າຜົນທີ່ໄດ້ມີຄວາມຍາວເກີນ [member max_length], "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີຫຍັງເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Returns whether the [LineEdit] is being edited."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າບອກວ່າ [LineEdit] ກຳລັງຖືກແກ້ໄຂຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns whether the menu is visible. Use this instead of "
"[code]get_menu().visible[/code] to improve performance (so the creation of "
"the menu is avoided)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າບອກວ່າເມນູສະແດງຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ແທນ [code]get_menu().visible[/code] "
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ (ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການສ້າງເມນູໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ)."

msgid "Executes a given action as defined in the [enum MenuItems] enum."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດການກະທຳທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ [enum MenuItems]."

msgid ""
"Selects characters inside [LineEdit] between [param from] and [param to]. By "
"default, [param from] is at the beginning and [param to] at the end.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"text = \"Welcome\"\n"
"select() # Will select \"Welcome\".\n"
"select(4) # Will select \"ome\".\n"
"select(2, 5) # Will select \"lco\".\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Text = \"Welcome\";\n"
"Select(); // Will select \"Welcome\".\n"
"Select(4); // Will select \"ome\".\n"
"Select(2, 5); // Will select \"lco\".\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວອັກສອນພາຍໃນ [LineEdit] ລະຫວ່າງ [param from] ແລະ [param to]. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"[param from] ແມ່ນຢູ່ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ [param to] ແມ່ນຢູ່ຈຸດສຸດທ້າຍ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"text = \"Welcome\"\n"
"select() # ຈະເລືອກ \"Welcome\".\n"
"select(4) # ຈະເລືອກ \"ome\".\n"
"select(2, 5) # ຈະເລືອກ \"lco\".\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Text = \"Welcome\";\n"
"Select(); // ຈະເລືອກ \"Welcome\".\n"
"Select(4); // ຈະເລືອກ \"ome\".\n"
"Select(2, 5); // ຈະເລືອກ \"lco\".\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Selects the whole [String]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ [String] ທັງໝົດ."

msgid "Allows exiting edit mode while preserving focus."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ອອກຈາກໂໝດແກ້ໄຂໂດຍທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາການໂຟກັສ (focus) ໄວ້."

msgid "The text's horizontal alignment."
msgstr "ການຈັດວາງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນລວງນອນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] and [member caret_mid_grapheme] is [code]false[/code], "
"backspace deletes an entire composite character such as ❤️‍🩹, instead of "
"deleting part of the composite character."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ [member caret_mid_grapheme] ເປັນ [code]false[/"
"code], ປຸ່ມ backspace ຈະລຶບຕົວອັກສອນປະສົມທັງໝົດ ເຊັ່ນ ❤️‍🩹, "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະລຶບພຽງບາງສ່ວນຂອງຕົວອັກສອນປະສົມ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], makes the caret blink."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຕົວກະພິບ (caret) ກະພິບໄດ້."

msgid "The interval at which the caret blinks (in seconds)."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອງການກະພິບຂອງຕົວກະພິບ (ເປັນວິນາທີ)."

msgid ""
"The caret's column position inside the [LineEdit]. When set, the text may "
"scroll to accommodate it."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຄໍລຳຂອງຕົວກະພິບພາຍໃນ [LineEdit]. ເມື່ອຖືກກຳນົດ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມອາດຈະເລື່ອນເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຕົວກະພິບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [LineEdit] will always show the caret, even if not "
"editing or focus is lost."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [LineEdit] ຈະສະແດງຕົວກະພິບຕະຫຼອດເວລາ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ແກ້ໄຂ "
"ຫຼື ເສຍການໂຟກັສໄປແລ້ວກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Allow moving caret, selecting and removing the individual composite character "
"components.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [kbd]Backspace[/kbd] is always removing individual composite "
"character components."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລື່ອນຕົວກະພິບ, ເລືອກ ແລະ ລຶບສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງຕົວອັກສອນປະສົມແຕ່ລະຕົວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [kbd]Backspace[/kbd] ຈະລຶບສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງຕົວອັກສອນປະສົມແຕ່ລະຕົວສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [LineEdit] will show a clear button if [member "
"text] is not empty, which can be used to clear the text quickly."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [LineEdit] ຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມລຶບລ້າງ ຖ້າ [member text] ບໍ່ວ່າງເປົ່າ, "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the context menu will appear when right-clicked."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເມນູຄຳສັ່ງ (context menu) ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຄລິກຂວາ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the selected text will be deselected when focus is lost."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກການເລືອກເມື່ອເສຍການໂຟກັສ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], allow drag and drop of selected text."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລາກ ແລະ ວາງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ໄດ້."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], control characters are displayed."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງຕົວອັກສອນຄວບຄຸມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], existing text cannot be modified and new text cannot "
"be added."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ໄດ້."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], \"Emoji and Symbols\" menu is enabled."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເມນູ \"ອີໂມຈິ ແລະ ສັນຍະລັກ\" ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [LineEdit] width will increase to stay longer than "
"the [member text]. It will [b]not[/b] compress if the [member text] is "
"shortened."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງ [LineEdit] ຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ຍາວກວ່າ [member "
"text]. ມັນຈະ [b]ບໍ່[/b] ຫົດຕົວລົງ ຖ້າ [member text] ສັ້ນລົງ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the [LineEdit] doesn't display decoration."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [LineEdit] ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງການຕົບແຕ່ງ (decoration)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [LineEdit] will not exit edit mode when text is "
"submitted by pressing [code]ui_text_submit[/code] action (by default: "
"[kbd]Enter[/kbd] or [kbd]Kp Enter[/kbd])."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [LineEdit] ຈະບໍ່ອອກຈາກໂໝດແກ້ໄຂເມື່ອມີການສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ "
"[code]ui_text_submit[/code] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [kbd]Enter[/kbd] ຫຼື [kbd]Kp Enter[/"
"kbd])."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of characters that can be entered inside the [LineEdit]. If "
"[code]0[/code], there is no limit.\n"
"When a limit is defined, characters that would exceed [member max_length] are "
"truncated. This happens both for existing [member text] contents when setting "
"the max length, or for new text inserted in the [LineEdit], including "
"pasting.\n"
"If any input text is truncated, the [signal text_change_rejected] signal is "
"emitted with the truncated substring as a parameter:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"text = \"Hello world\"\n"
"max_length = 5\n"
"# `text` becomes \"Hello\".\n"
"max_length = 10\n"
"text += \" goodbye\"\n"
"# `text` becomes \"Hello good\".\n"
"# `text_change_rejected` is emitted with \"bye\" as a parameter.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Text = \"Hello world\";\n"
"MaxLength = 5;\n"
"// `Text` becomes \"Hello\".\n"
"MaxLength = 10;\n"
"Text += \" goodbye\";\n"
"// `Text` becomes \"Hello good\".\n"
"// `text_change_rejected` is emitted with \"bye\" as a parameter.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຕົວອັກສອນສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດປ້ອນເຂົ້າໃນ [LineEdit]. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]0[/code], "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີການຈຳກັດ.\n"
"ເມື່ອມີການກຳນົດຂີດຈຳກັດ, ຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ເກີນ [member max_length] ຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນທັງກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ທີ່ຖືກປ້ອນເຂົ້າໃນ [LineEdit], "
"ລວມທັງການວາງຂໍ້ຄວາມ.\n"
"ຖ້າມີຂໍ້ຄວາມໃດຖືກຕັດອອກ, ສັນຍານ [signal text_change_rejected] "
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມສ່ວນທີ່ຖືກຕັດ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"text = \"Hello world\"\n"
"max_length = 5\n"
"# `text` ຈະກາຍເປັນ \"Hello\".\n"
"max_length = 10\n"
"text += \" goodbye\"\n"
"# `text` ຈະກາຍເປັນ \"Hello good\".\n"
"# `text_change_rejected` ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາພ້ອມກັບຄ່າ \"bye\".\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Text = \"Hello world\";\n"
"MaxLength = 5;\n"
"// `Text` ຈະກາຍເປັນ \"Hello\".\n"
"MaxLength = 10;\n"
"Text += \" goodbye\";\n"
"// `Text` ຈະກາຍເປັນ \"Hello good\".\n"
"// `text_change_rejected` ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາພ້ອມກັບຄ່າ \"bye\".\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], using middle mouse button to paste clipboard will be "
"disabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only implemented on Linux."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ການໃຊ້ປຸ່ມກາງຂອງເມົາສ໌ເພື່ອວາງຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກຄລິບບອດຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Linux ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Text shown when the [LineEdit] is empty. It is [b]not[/b] the [LineEdit]'s "
"default value (see [member text])."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ [LineEdit] ວ່າງເປົ່າ. ມັນ [b]ບໍ່ແມ່ນ[/b] ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [LineEdit] (ເບິ່ງ "
"[member text])."

msgid ""
"Sets the icon that will appear in the right end of the [LineEdit] if there's "
"no [member text], or always, if [member clear_button_enabled] is set to "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໄອຄອນທີ່ຈະປາກົດຢູ່ທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງ [LineEdit] ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [member text], ຫຼື ສະແດງຕະຫຼອດ ຖ້າ "
"[member clear_button_enabled] ຖືກກຳນົດເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Scale ratio of the icon when [member icon_expand_mode] is set to [constant "
"EXPAND_MODE_FIT_TO_LINE_EDIT]."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນການປັບຂະໜາດຂອງໄອຄອນເມື່ອ [member icon_expand_mode] ຖືກກຳນົດເປັນ [constant "
"EXPAND_MODE_FIT_TO_LINE_EDIT]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], every character is replaced with the secret character "
"(see [member secret_character])."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ທຸກຕົວອັກສອນຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນລັບ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"secret_character])."

msgid ""
"The character to use to mask secret input. Only a single character can be "
"used as the secret character. If it is longer than one character, only the "
"first one will be used. If it is empty, a space will be used instead."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປົກປິດຂໍ້ມູນລັບ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ຕົວອັກສອນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າໃສ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງຕົວ, "
"ຈະມີພຽງຕົວທຳອິດເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້. ຖ້າວ່າງເປົ່າ, ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [LineEdit] will select the whole text when it gains "
"focus."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [LineEdit] ຈະເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບການໂຟກັສ."

msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], it's impossible to select the text using mouse nor "
"keyboard."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ຄີບອດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shortcut keys for context menu items are enabled, even "
"if the context menu is disabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ປຸ່ມລັດສຳລັບລາຍການໃນເມນູຄຳສັ່ງຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເມນູຄຳສັ່ງຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"String value of the [LineEdit].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing text using this property won't emit the [signal "
"text_changed] signal."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າສະຕຣິງ (String) ຂອງ [LineEdit].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງສັນຍານ [signal text_changed] ອອກມາ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the native virtual keyboard is enabled on platforms "
"that support it."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄີບອດສະເໝືອນ (virtual keyboard) "
"ຂອງລະບົບຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານໃນແພລັດຟອມທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the native virtual keyboard is shown on focus events on "
"platforms that support it."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຄີບອດສະເໝືອນຂອງລະບົບຈະຖືກສະແດງເມື່ອເກີດເຫດການໂຟກັສໃນແພລັດຟອມທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid "Specifies the type of virtual keyboard to show."
msgstr "ກຳນົດປະເພດຂອງຄີບອດສະເໝືອນທີ່ຈະສະແດງ."

msgid "Emitted when the [LineEdit] switches in or out of edit mode."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [LineEdit] ປ່ຽນເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ອອກຈາກໂໝດແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when appending text that overflows the [member max_length]. The "
"appended text is truncated to fit [member max_length], and the part that "
"couldn't fit is passed as the [param rejected_substring] argument."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອມີການເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຍາວເກີນ [member max_length]. "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາຈະຖືກຕັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບ [member max_length], ແລະ "
"ສ່ວນທີ່ເກີນຈະຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານທາງອາກິວເມນ [param rejected_substring]."

msgid "Emitted when the text changes."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຂໍ້ຄວາມມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the user presses the [code]ui_text_submit[/code] action (by "
"default: [kbd]Enter[/kbd] or [kbd]Kp Enter[/kbd]) while the [LineEdit] has "
"focus."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ກົດປຸ່ມ [code]ui_text_submit[/code] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ: [kbd]Enter[/kbd] ຫຼື "
"[kbd]Kp Enter[/kbd]) ໃນຂະນະທີ່ [LineEdit] ຖືກໂຟກັສຢູ່."

msgid "Cuts (copies and clears) the selected text."
msgstr "ຕັດ (ກັອບປີ້ ແລະ ລຶບ) ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້."

msgid "Copies the selected text."
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Pastes the clipboard text over the selected text (or at the caret's "
"position).\n"
"Non-printable escape characters are automatically stripped from the OS "
"clipboard via [method String.strip_escapes]."
msgstr ""
"ວາງຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກຄລິບບອດລົງໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ (ຫຼື ບ່ອນຕຳແໜ່ງຕົວກະພິບ).\n"
"ຕົວອັກສອນ escape ທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດພິມໄດ້ຈະຖືກຕັດອອກຈາກຄລິບບອດຂອງລະບົບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຜ່ານ [method "
"String.strip_escapes]."

msgid "Erases the whole [LineEdit] text."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດໃນ [LineEdit]."

msgid "Selects the whole [LineEdit] text."
msgstr "ເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດໃນ [LineEdit]."

msgid "Undoes the previous action."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການກະທຳກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ (Undo)."

msgid "Reverse the last undo action."
msgstr "ເຮັດຄືນການກະທຳທີ່ໄດ້ຍົກເລີກໄປ (Redo)."

msgid "ID of \"Text Writing Direction\" submenu."
msgstr "ID ຂອງເມນູຍ່ອຍ \"ທິດທາງການຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມ\"."

msgid "Sets text direction to inherited."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າທິດທາງຂໍ້ຄວາມແບບສືບທອດ (inherited)."

msgid "Sets text direction to automatic."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າທິດທາງຂໍ້ຄວາມແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid "Sets text direction to left-to-right."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າທິດທາງຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ."

msgid "Sets text direction to right-to-left."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າທິດທາງຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ."

msgid "Toggles control character display."
msgstr "ເປີດ/ປິດ ການສະແດງຕົວອັກສອນຄວບຄຸມ."

msgid "ID of \"Insert Control Character\" submenu."
msgstr "ID ຂອງເມນູຍ່ອຍ \"ແຊກຕົວອັກສອນຄວບຄຸມ\"."

msgid "Inserts left-to-right mark (LRM) character."
msgstr "ແຊກຕົວອັກສອນ left-to-right mark (LRM)."

msgid "Inserts right-to-left mark (RLM) character."
msgstr "ແຊກຕົວອັກສອນ right-to-left mark (RLM)."

msgid "Inserts start of left-to-right embedding (LRE) character."
msgstr "ແຊກຕົວອັກສອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ left-to-right embedding (LRE)."

msgid "Inserts start of right-to-left embedding (RLE) character."
msgstr "ແຊກຕົວອັກສອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ right-to-left embedding (RLE)."

msgid "Inserts start of left-to-right override (LRO) character."
msgstr "ແຊກຕົວອັກສອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ left-to-right override (LRO)."

msgid "Inserts start of right-to-left override (RLO) character."
msgstr "ແຊກຕົວອັກສອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ right-to-left override (RLO)."

msgid "Inserts pop direction formatting (PDF) character."
msgstr "ແຊກຕົວອັກສອນ pop direction formatting (PDF)."

msgid "Inserts Arabic letter mark (ALM) character."
msgstr "ແຊກຕົວອັກສອນ Arabic letter mark (ALM)."

msgid "Inserts left-to-right isolate (LRI) character."
msgstr "ແຊກຕົວອັກສອນ left-to-right isolate (LRI)."

msgid "Inserts right-to-left isolate (RLI) character."
msgstr "ແຊກຕົວອັກສອນ right-to-left isolate (RLI)."

msgid "Inserts first strong isolate (FSI) character."
msgstr "ແຊກຕົວອັກສອນ first strong isolate (FSI)."

msgid "Inserts pop direction isolate (PDI) character."
msgstr "ແຊກຕົວອັກສອນ pop direction isolate (PDI)."

msgid "Inserts zero width joiner (ZWJ) character."
msgstr "ແຊກຕົວອັກສອນ zero width joiner (ZWJ)."

msgid "Inserts zero width non-joiner (ZWNJ) character."
msgstr "ແຊກຕົວອັກສອນ zero width non-joiner (ZWNJ)."

msgid "Inserts word joiner (WJ) character."
msgstr "ແຊກຕົວອັກສອນ word joiner (WJ)."

msgid "Inserts soft hyphen (SHY) character."
msgstr "ແຊກຕົວອັກສອນ soft hyphen (SHY)."

msgid "Opens system emoji and symbol picker."
msgstr "ເປີດຕົວເລືອກອີໂມຈິ ແລະ ສັນຍະລັກຂອງລະບົບ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum MenuItems] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ [enum MenuItems]."

msgid "Use the original size for the right icon."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຂະໜາດເດີມສຳລັບໄອຄອນທາງຂວາ."

msgid "Scale the right icon's size to match the size of the text."
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດໄອຄອນທາງຂວາໃຫ້ເທົ່າກັບຂະໜາດຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid "Scale the right icon to fit the LineEdit."
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດໄອຄອນທາງຂວາໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບ LineEdit."

msgid ""
"Color of the [LineEdit]'s caret (text cursor). This can be set to a fully "
"transparent color to hide the caret entirely."
msgstr "ສີຂອງຕົວກະພິບ (caret) ຂອງ [LineEdit]. ສາມາດຕັ້ງເປັນສີທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສທັງໝົດເພື່ອເຊື່ອງຕົວກະພິບ."

msgid "Color used as default tint for the clear button."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບປຸ່ມລຶບລ້າງ."

msgid "Color used for the clear button when it's pressed."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບປຸ່ມລຶບລ້າງເມື່ອຖືກກົດ."

msgid "Default font color."
msgstr "ສີຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "The tint of text outline of the [LineEdit]."
msgstr "ສີຂອງຂອບຕົວອັກສອນຂອງ [LineEdit]."

msgid "Font color for [member placeholder_text]."
msgstr "ສີຟອນສຳລັບ [member placeholder_text]."

msgid "Font color for selected text (inside the selection rectangle)."
msgstr "ສີຟອນສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ (ພາຍໃນສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມການເລືອກ)."

msgid "Font color when editing is disabled."
msgstr "ສີຟອນເມື່ອການແກ້ໄຂຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Color of the selection rectangle."
msgstr "ສີຂອງສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມການເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"The caret's width in pixels. Greater values can be used to improve "
"accessibility by ensuring the caret is easily visible, or to ensure "
"consistency with a large font size."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຕົວກະພິບເປັນພິກເຊວ. ຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຫັນຕົວກະພິບໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັບຂະໜາດຟອນທີ່ໃຫຍ່."

msgid "Font used for the text."
msgstr "ຟອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid "Font size of the [LineEdit]'s text."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນ [LineEdit]."

msgid "Texture for the clear button. See [member clear_button_enabled]."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວ (Texture) ສຳລັບປຸ່ມລຶບລ້າງ. ເບິ່ງ [member clear_button_enabled]."

msgid ""
"Background used when [LineEdit] has GUI focus. The [theme_item focus] "
"[StyleBox] is displayed [i]over[/i] the base [StyleBox], so a partially "
"transparent [StyleBox] should be used to ensure the base [StyleBox] remains "
"visible. A [StyleBox] that represents an outline or an underline works well "
"for this purpose. To disable the focus visual effect, assign a "
"[StyleBoxEmpty] resource. Note that disabling the focus visual effect will "
"harm keyboard/controller navigation usability, so this is not recommended for "
"accessibility reasons."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [LineEdit] ຖືກໂຟກັສ. [StyleBox] ຂອງ [theme_item focus] ຈະສະແດງ "
"[i]ທັບ[/i] ພື້ນຫຼັງຫຼັກ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນໃຊ້ [StyleBox] ທີ່ມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສບາງສ່ວນເພື່ອໃຫ້ຍັງເຫັນພື້ນຫຼັງຫຼັກຢູ່."

msgid "Default background for the [LineEdit]."
msgstr "ພື້ນຫຼັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ [LineEdit]."

msgid ""
"Background used when [LineEdit] is in read-only mode ([member editable] is "
"set to [code]false[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [LineEdit] ຢູ່ໃນໂໝດອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ (ເມື່ອ [member editable] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code])."

msgid "A button that represents a link."
msgstr "ປຸ່ມທີ່ໃຊ້ແທນລິ້ງ (link)."

msgid ""
"A button that represents a link. This type of button is primarily used for "
"interactions that cause a context change (like linking to a web page).\n"
"See also [BaseButton] which contains common properties and methods associated "
"with this node."
msgstr "ປຸ່ມທີ່ໃຊ້ແທນລິ້ງ. ປຸ່ມປະເພດນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນບໍລິບົດ ເຊັ່ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄປຫາໜ້າເວັບ."

msgid "The underline mode to use for the text."
msgstr "ໂໝດການຂີດກ້ອງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"The [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uniform_Resource_Identifier]URI[/url] "
"for this [LinkButton]. If set to a valid URI, pressing the button opens the "
"URI using the operating system's default program for the protocol (via "
"[method OS.shell_open]). HTTP and HTTPS URLs open the default web browser.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"uri = \"https://godotengine.org\"  # Opens the URL in the default web "
"browser.\n"
"uri = \"C:\\SomeFolder\"  # Opens the file explorer at the given path.\n"
"uri = \"C:\\SomeImage.png\"  # Opens the given image in the default viewing "
"app.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Uri = \"https://godotengine.org\"; // Opens the URL in the default web "
"browser.\n"
"Uri = \"C:\\SomeFolder\"; // Opens the file explorer at the given path.\n"
"Uri = \"C:\\SomeImage.png\"; // Opens the given image in the default viewing "
"app.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uniform_Resource_Identifier]URI[/url] "
"ສຳລັບ [LinkButton] ນີ້. ຖ້າກຳນົດເປັນ URI ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ການກົດປຸ່ມຈະເປີດ URI "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

msgid "The LinkButton will always show an underline at the bottom of its text."
msgstr "LinkButton ຈະສະແດງເສັ້ນຂີດກ້ອງຢູ່ລຸ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມຕະຫຼອດເວລາ."

msgid ""
"The LinkButton will show an underline at the bottom of its text when the "
"mouse cursor is over it."
msgstr "LinkButton ຈະສະແດງເສັ້ນຂີດກ້ອງເມື່ອເມົາສ໌ຢູ່ເທິງປຸ່ມ."

msgid "The LinkButton will never show an underline at the bottom of its text."
msgstr "LinkButton ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງເສັ້ນຂີດກ້ອງ."

msgid "Default text [Color] of the [LinkButton]."
msgstr "ສີຂໍ້ຄວາມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [LinkButton]."

msgid "Text [Color] used when the [LinkButton] is disabled."
msgstr "ສີຂໍ້ຄວາມເມື່ອ [LinkButton] ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Text [Color] used when the [LinkButton] is focused. Only replaces the normal "
"text color of the button. Disabled, hovered, and pressed states take "
"precedence over this color."
msgstr "ສີຂໍ້ຄວາມເມື່ອ [LinkButton] ຖືກໂຟກັສ."

msgid "Text [Color] used when the [LinkButton] is being hovered."
msgstr "ສີຂໍ້ຄວາມເມື່ອເມົາສ໌ຢູ່ເທິງ [LinkButton]."

msgid "Text [Color] used when the [LinkButton] is being hovered and pressed."
msgstr "ສີຂໍ້ຄວາມເມື່ອ [LinkButton] ຖືກທັງຊີ້ ແລະ ກົດ."

msgid "The tint of text outline of the [LinkButton]."
msgstr "ສີຂອງຂອບຕົວອັກສອນຂອງ [LinkButton]."

msgid "Text [Color] used when the [LinkButton] is being pressed."
msgstr "ສີຂໍ້ຄວາມເມື່ອ [LinkButton] ຖືກກົດ."

msgid "The vertical space between the baseline of text and the underline."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວຕັ້ງລະຫວ່າງເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ ເສັ້ນຂີດກ້ອງ."

msgid "[Font] of the [LinkButton]'s text."
msgstr "[Font] ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນ [LinkButton]."

msgid "Font size of the [LinkButton]'s text."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນ [LinkButton]."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] used when the [LinkButton] is focused. The [theme_item focus] "
"[StyleBox] is displayed [i]over[/i] the base [StyleBox], so a partially "
"transparent [StyleBox] should be used to ensure the base [StyleBox] remains "
"visible. A [StyleBox] that represents an outline or an underline works well "
"for this purpose. To disable the focus visual effect, assign a "
"[StyleBoxEmpty] resource. Note that disabling the focus visual effect will "
"harm keyboard/controller navigation usability, so this is not recommended for "
"accessibility reasons."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [LinkButton] ຖືກໂຟກັສ."

msgid ""
"Custom logger to receive messages from the internal error/warning stream."
msgstr "ຕົວບັນທຶກເຫດການ (Logger) ແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກລະບົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ/ຄຳເຕືອນພາຍໃນ."

msgid ""
"Custom logger to receive messages from the internal error/warning stream. "
"Loggers are registered via [method OS.add_logger]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວບັນທຶກເຫດການແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກລະບົບພາຍໃນ. ຕົວບັນທຶກຖືກລົງທະບຽນຜ່ານ [method "
"OS.add_logger]."

msgid "Logging"
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກເຫດການ"

msgid ""
"Called when an error is logged. The error provides the [param function], "
"[param file], and [param line] that it originated from, as well as either the "
"[param code] that generated the error or a [param rationale].\n"
"The type of error provided by [param error_type] is described in the [enum "
"ErrorType] enumeration.\n"
"Additionally, [param script_backtraces] provides backtraces for each of the "
"script languages. These will only contain stack frames in editor builds and "
"debug builds by default. To enable them for release builds as well, you need "
"to enable [member ProjectSettings.debug/settings/gdscript/"
"always_track_call_stacks].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This method will be called from threads other than the main "
"thread, possibly at the same time, so you will need to have some kind of "
"thread-safety in your implementation of it, like a [Mutex].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param script_backtraces] will not contain any captured "
"variables, due to its prohibitively high cost. To get those, you will need to "
"capture the backtraces yourself, from within the [Logger] virtual methods, "
"using [method Engine.capture_script_backtraces].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Logging errors from this method using functions like [method "
"@GlobalScope.push_error] or [method @GlobalScope.push_warning] is not "
"supported, as it could cause infinite recursion. These errors will only show "
"up in the console output."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຖືກບັນທຶກ. ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນ [param function], [param file], ແລະ "
"[param line] ທີ່ມາຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Called when a message is logged. If [param error] is [code]true[/code], then "
"this message was meant to be sent to [code]stderr[/code].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This method will be called from threads other than the main "
"thread, possibly at the same time, so you will need to have some kind of "
"thread-safety in your implementation of it, like a [Mutex].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Logging another message from this method using functions like "
"[method @GlobalScope.print] is not supported, as it could cause infinite "
"recursion. These messages will only show up in the console output."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອມີຂໍ້ຄວາມຖືກບັນທຶກ."

msgid "The message received is an error."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (error)."

msgid "The message received is a warning."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນຄຳເຕືອນ (warning)."

msgid "The message received is a script error."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຈາກສະຄຣິບ."

msgid "The message received is a shader error."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຈາກເຊດເດີ (shader)."

msgid "The [LookAtModifier3D] rotates a bone to look at a target."
msgstr "[LookAtModifier3D] ໝຸນກະດູກໃຫ້ຫັນໄປເບິ່ງເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"This [SkeletonModifier3D] rotates a bone to look at a target. This is helpful "
"for moving a character's head to look at the player, rotating a turret to "
"look at a target, or any other case where you want to make a bone rotate "
"towards something quickly and easily.\n"
"When applying multiple [LookAtModifier3D]s, the [LookAtModifier3D] assigned "
"to the parent bone must be put above the [LookAtModifier3D] assigned to the "
"child bone in the list in order for the child bone results to be correct."
msgstr "ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ [SkeletonModifier3D] ນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝຸນກະດູກໃຫ້ຫັນໄປຫາເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid "Returns the remaining seconds of the time-based interpolation."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າວິນາທີທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງການຄຳນວນລະຫວ່າງກາງ (interpolation) ຕາມເວລາ."

msgid ""
"Returns whether the target is within the angle limitations. It is useful for "
"unsetting the [member target_node] when the target is outside of the angle "
"limitations.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The value is updated after [method "
"SkeletonModifier3D._process_modification]. To retrieve this value correctly, "
"we recommend using the signal [signal "
"SkeletonModifier3D.modification_processed]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າບອກວ່າເປົ້າໝາຍຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດມຸມທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Index of the [member bone_name] in the parent [Skeleton3D]."
msgstr "ດັດຊະນີ (index) ຂອງ [member bone_name] ໃນ [Skeleton3D] ຫຼັກ."

msgid "The bone name of the [Skeleton3D] that the modification will operate on."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງກະດູກໃນ [Skeleton3D] ທີ່ການປ່ຽນແປງຈະມີຜົນ."

msgid ""
"The duration of the time-based interpolation. Interpolation is triggered at "
"the following cases:\n"
"- When the target node is changed\n"
"- When an axis is flipped due to angle limitation\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The flipping occurs when the target is outside the angle "
"limitation and the internally computed secondary rotation axis of the forward "
"vector is flipped. Visually, it occurs when the target is outside the angle "
"limitation and crosses the plane of the [member forward_axis] and [member "
"primary_rotation_axis]."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາຂອງການຄຳນວນລະຫວ່າງກາງຕາມເວລາ."

msgid ""
"The ease type of the time-based interpolation. See also [enum Tween.EaseType]."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂອງການຜ່ອນ (ease type) ສຳລັບການຄຳນວນລະຫວ່າງກາງຕາມເວລາ."

msgid ""
"The forward axis of the bone. This [SkeletonModifier3D] modifies the bone so "
"that this axis points toward the [member target_node]."
msgstr "ແກນດ້ານໜ້າຂອງກະດູກ."

msgid "Index of the [member origin_bone_name] in the parent [Skeleton3D]."
msgstr "ດັດຊະນີຂອງ [member origin_bone_name] ໃນ [Skeleton3D] ຫຼັກ."

msgid ""
"If [member origin_from] is [constant ORIGIN_FROM_SPECIFIC_BONE], the bone "
"global pose position specified for this is used as origin."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [member origin_from] ແມ່ນ [constant ORIGIN_FROM_SPECIFIC_BONE], ຕຳແໜ່ງ "
"global pose ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ກຳນົດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [member origin_from] is [constant ORIGIN_FROM_EXTERNAL_NODE], the global "
"position of the [Node3D] specified for this is used as origin."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [member origin_from] ແມ່ນ [constant ORIGIN_FROM_EXTERNAL_NODE], ຕຳແໜ່ງ "
"global ຂອງ [Node3D] ທີ່ກຳນົດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"This value determines from what origin is retrieved for use in the "
"calculation of the forward vector."
msgstr "ຄ່ານີ້ກຳນົດວ່າຈະໃຊ້ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃດໃນການຄຳນວນເວັກເຕີດ້ານໜ້າ."

msgid ""
"The offset of the bone pose origin. Matching the origins by offset is useful "
"for cases where multiple bones must always face the same direction, such as "
"the eyes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value indicates the local position of the object set in "
"[member origin_from]."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ຂອງຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງທ່າທາງກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"If the target passes through too close to the origin than this value, time-"
"based interpolation is used even if the target is within the angular "
"limitations, to prevent the angular velocity from becoming too high."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປົ້າໝາຍເຂົ້າໃກ້ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເກີນກວ່າຄ່ານີ້, ຈະມີການໃຊ້ການຄຳນວນລະຫວ່າງກາງຕາມເວລາ "
"ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມສູງເກີນໄປ."

msgid ""
"The threshold to start damping for [member primary_limit_angle]. It provides "
"non-linear (b-spline) interpolation, let it feel more resistance the more it "
"rotate to the edge limit. This is useful for simulating the limits of human "
"motion.\n"
"If [code]1.0[/code], no damping is performed. If [code]0.0[/code], damping is "
"always performed."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງ (damping) ຂອງ [member primary_limit_angle]."

msgid ""
"The limit angle of the primary rotation when [member symmetry_limitation] is "
"[code]true[/code], in radians."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມຈຳກັດຂອງການໝຸນຫຼັກເມື່ອ [member symmetry_limitation] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"(ເປັນເຣດຽນ)."

msgid ""
"The threshold to start damping for [member primary_negative_limit_angle]."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງຂອງ [member primary_negative_limit_angle]."

msgid ""
"The limit angle of negative side of the primary rotation when [member "
"symmetry_limitation] is [code]false[/code], in radians."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມຈຳກັດດ້ານລົບຂອງການໝຸນຫຼັກເມື່ອ [member symmetry_limitation] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"The threshold to start damping for [member primary_positive_limit_angle]."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງຂອງ [member primary_positive_limit_angle]."

msgid ""
"The limit angle of positive side of the primary rotation when [member "
"symmetry_limitation] is [code]false[/code], in radians."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມຈຳກັດດ້ານບວກຂອງການໝຸນຫຼັກເມື່ອ [member symmetry_limitation] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid "The threshold to start damping for [member secondary_limit_angle]."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງຂອງ [member secondary_limit_angle]."

msgid ""
"The limit angle of the secondary rotation when [member symmetry_limitation] "
"is [code]true[/code], in radians."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມຈຳກັດຂອງການໝຸນຮອງເມື່ອ [member symmetry_limitation] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"The threshold to start damping for [member secondary_negative_limit_angle]."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງຂອງ [member secondary_negative_limit_angle]."

msgid ""
"The limit angle of negative side of the secondary rotation when [member "
"symmetry_limitation] is [code]false[/code], in radians."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມຈຳກັດດ້ານລົບຂອງການໝຸນຮອງເມື່ອ [member symmetry_limitation] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"The threshold to start damping for [member secondary_positive_limit_angle]."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງຂອງ [member secondary_positive_limit_angle]."

msgid ""
"The limit angle of positive side of the secondary rotation when [member "
"symmetry_limitation] is [code]false[/code], in radians."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມຈຳກັດດ້ານບວກຂອງການໝຸນຮອງເມື່ອ [member symmetry_limitation] ເປັນ [code]false[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"The [NodePath] to the node that is the target for the look at modification. "
"This node is what the modification will rotate the bone to."
msgstr "[NodePath] ໄປຫາໂນດ (node) ທີ່ເປັນເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"The transition type of the time-based interpolation. See also [enum "
"Tween.TransitionType]."
msgstr "ປະເພດການປ່ຽນ (transition type) ຂອງການຄຳນວນລະຫວ່າງກາງຕາມເວລາ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], limits the amount of rotation. For example, this helps "
"to prevent a character's neck from rotating 360 degrees.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] As with [AnimationTree] blending, interpolation is provided that "
"favors [method Skeleton3D.get_bone_rest] or [method Skeleton3D.get_bone_pose] "
"depends on the [member relative] option. This means that interpolation does "
"not select the shortest path in some cases.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some values for [member transition_type] (such as [constant "
"Tween.TRANS_BACK], [constant Tween.TRANS_ELASTIC], and [constant "
"Tween.TRANS_SPRING]) may exceed the limitations. If interpolation occurs "
"while overshooting the limitations, the result might not respect the bone "
"rest."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຈຳກັດປະລິມານການໝຸນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], provides rotation by two axes."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຫ້ການໝຸນແບບສອງແກນ."

msgid ""
"The bone rest position of the bone specified in [member bone] is used as "
"origin."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງ bone rest ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ [member bone] ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The bone global pose position of the bone specified in [member origin_bone] "
"is used as origin.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is recommended that you select only the parent bone unless "
"you are familiar with the bone processing process. The specified bone pose at "
"the time the [LookAtModifier3D] is processed is used as a reference. In other "
"words, if you specify a child bone and the [LookAtModifier3D] causes the "
"child bone to move, the rendered result and direction will not match."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງ global pose ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ [member origin_bone] ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The global position of the [Node3D] specified in [member "
"origin_external_node] is used as origin.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Same as [constant ORIGIN_FROM_SPECIFIC_BONE], when specifying a "
"[BoneAttachment3D] with a child bone assigned, the rendered result and "
"direction will not match."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງ global ຂອງ [Node3D] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ [member origin_external_node] "
"ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Abstract base class for the game's main loop."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳ (Abstract) ສຳລັບວົງຈອນຫຼັກ (main loop) ຂອງເກມ."

msgid ""
"[MainLoop] is the abstract base class for a Godot project's game loop. It is "
"inherited by [SceneTree], which is the default game loop implementation used "
"in Godot projects, though it is also possible to write and use one's own "
"[MainLoop] subclass instead of the scene tree.\n"
"Upon the application start, a [MainLoop] implementation must be provided to "
"the OS; otherwise, the application will exit. This happens automatically (and "
"a [SceneTree] is created) unless a [MainLoop] [Script] is provided from the "
"command line (with e.g. [code]godot -s my_loop.gd[/code]) or the [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/run/main_loop_type] project setting is "
"overwritten.\n"
"Here is an example script implementing a simple [MainLoop]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"class_name CustomMainLoop\n"
"extends MainLoop\n"
"\n"
"var time_elapsed = 0\n"
"\n"
"func _initialize():\n"
"\tprint(\"Initialized:\")\n"
"\tprint(\"  Starting time: %s\" % str(time_elapsed))\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\ttime_elapsed += delta\n"
"\t# Return true to end the main loop.\n"
"\treturn Input.get_mouse_button_mask() != 0 || "
"Input.is_key_pressed(KEY_ESCAPE)\n"
"\n"
"func _finalize():\n"
"\tprint(\"Finalized:\")\n"
"\tprint(\"  End time: %s\" % str(time_elapsed))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"[GlobalClass]\n"
"public partial class CustomMainLoop : MainLoop\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate double _timeElapsed = 0;\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Initialize()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Initialized:\");\n"
"\t\tGD.Print($\"  Starting Time: {_timeElapsed}\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override bool _Process(double delta)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_timeElapsed += delta;\n"
"\t\t// Return true to end the main loop.\n"
"\t\treturn Input.GetMouseButtonMask() != 0 || "
"Input.IsKeyPressed(Key.Escape);\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tprivate void _Finalize()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Finalized:\");\n"
"\t\tGD.Print($\"  End Time: {_timeElapsed}\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"[MainLoop] ແມ່ນຄລາສພື້ນຖານນາມມະທຳສຳລັບລູບເກມຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ Godot. ມັນຖືກສືບທອດໂດຍ "
"[SceneTree], ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງລູບເກມແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ Godot, "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຍັງສາມາດຂຽນ ແລະ ໃຊ້ຄລາສຍ່ອຍ [MainLoop] ຂອງຕົນເອງແທນ scene tree ໄດ້.\n"
"ເມື່ອເລີ່ມແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ, ຕ້ອງມີການຈັດຫາການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ [MainLoop] ໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ; "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະປິດອອກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ແລະ [SceneTree] ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ) "
"ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າຈະມີການລະບຸ [Script] ຂອງ [MainLoop] ຈາກຄຳສັ່ງຄອມມານລາຍ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"[code]godot -s my_loop.gd[/code]) ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/run/main_loop_type] ຖືກຂຽນທັບ.\n"
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງສະຄຣິບທີ່ສ້າງ [MainLoop] ແບບງ່າຍດາຍ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"class_name CustomMainLoop\n"
"extends MainLoop\n"
"\n"
"var time_elapsed = 0\n"
"\n"
"func _initialize():\n"
"\tprint(\"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ:\")\n"
"\tprint(\"  ເວລາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: %s\" % str(time_elapsed))\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\ttime_elapsed += delta\n"
"\t# ສົ່ງຄ່າ true ກັບຄືນເພື່ອສິ້ນສຸດລູບຫຼັກ.\n"
"\treturn Input.get_mouse_button_mask() != 0 || "
"Input.is_key_pressed(KEY_ESCAPE)\n"
"\n"
"func _finalize():\n"
"\tprint(\"ສິ້ນສຸດແລ້ວ:\")\n"
"\tprint(\"  ເວລາສິ້ນສຸດ: %s\" % str(time_elapsed))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"[GlobalClass]\n"
"public partial class CustomMainLoop : MainLoop\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate double _timeElapsed = 0;\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Initialize()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ:\");\n"
"\t\tGD.Print($\"  ເວລາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: {_timeElapsed}\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override bool _Process(double delta)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_timeElapsed += delta;\n"
"\t\t// ສົ່ງຄ່າ true ກັບຄືນເພື່ອສິ້ນສຸດລູບຫຼັກ.\n"
"\t\treturn Input.GetMouseButtonMask() != 0 || "
"Input.IsKeyPressed(Key.Escape);\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tprivate void _Finalize()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"ສິ້ນສຸດແລ້ວ:\");\n"
"\t\tGD.Print($\"  ເວລາສິ້ນສຸດ: {_timeElapsed}\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Called before the program exits."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນກ່ອນທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມຈະປິດລົງ."

msgid "Called once during initialization."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນຄັ້ງດຽວໃນລະຫວ່າງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບ (initialization)."

msgid ""
"Called each physics tick. [param delta] is the logical time between physics "
"ticks in seconds and is equal to [member Engine.time_scale] / [member "
"Engine.physics_ticks_per_second]. Equivalent to [method "
"Node._physics_process].\n"
"If implemented, the method must return a boolean value. [code]true[/code] "
"ends the main loop, while [code]false[/code] lets it proceed to the next "
"step.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method _physics_process] may be called up to [member "
"Engine.max_physics_steps_per_frame] times per (idle) frame. This step limit "
"may be reached when the engine is suffering performance issues.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Accumulated [param delta] may diverge from real world seconds."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນທຸກໆຮອບຟິຊິກ (physics tick)."

msgid ""
"Called on each idle frame, prior to rendering, and after physics ticks have "
"been processed. [param delta] is the time between frames in seconds. "
"Equivalent to [method Node._process].\n"
"If implemented, the method must return a boolean value. [code]true[/code] "
"ends the main loop, while [code]false[/code] lets it proceed to the next "
"frame.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When the engine is struggling and the frame rate is lowered, "
"[param delta] will increase. When [param delta] is increased, it's capped at "
"a maximum of [member Engine.time_scale] * [member "
"Engine.max_physics_steps_per_frame] / [member "
"Engine.physics_ticks_per_second]. As a result, accumulated [param delta] may "
"not represent real world time.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When [code]--fixed-fps[/code] is enabled or the engine is "
"running in Movie Maker mode (see [MovieWriter]), process [param delta] will "
"always be the same for every frame, regardless of how much time the frame "
"took to render.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Frame delta may be post-processed by [member OS.delta_smoothing] "
"if this is enabled for the project."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນທຸກໆເຟຣມວ່າງ (idle frame), ກ່ອນການເຣັນເດີ (rendering)."

msgid "Emitted when a user responds to a permission request."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການຂໍອະນຸຍາດ (permission request)."

msgid ""
"Notification received from the OS when the application is exceeding its "
"allocated memory.\n"
"Specific to the iOS platform."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈາກ OS ເມື່ອແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳເກີນກວ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. (ສະເພາະ iOS)."

msgid ""
"Notification received when translations may have changed. Can be triggered by "
"the user changing the locale. Can be used to respond to language changes, for "
"example to change the UI strings on the fly. Useful when working with the "
"built-in translation support, like [method Object.tr]."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອການແປພາສາອາດຈະມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Notification received from the OS when a request for \"About\" information is "
"sent.\n"
"Specific to the macOS platform."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈາກ OS ເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍຂໍ້ມູນ \"About\". (ສະເພາະ macOS)."

msgid ""
"Notification received from Godot's crash handler when the engine is about to "
"crash.\n"
"Implemented on desktop platforms if the crash handler is enabled."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈາກ Godot ເມື່ອເອັນຈິນກຳລັງຈະຄ້າງ (crash)."

msgid ""
"Notification received from the OS when an update of the Input Method Engine "
"occurs (e.g. change of IME cursor position or composition string).\n"
"Implemented on desktop and web platforms."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈາກ OS ເມື່ອມີການອັບເດດ Input Method Engine (IME)."

msgid ""
"Notification received from the OS when the application is resumed.\n"
"Specific to the Android and iOS platforms."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈາກ OS ເມື່ອແອັບພລິເຄຊັນກັບມາເຮັດວຽກຕໍ່ (resumed)."

msgid ""
"Notification received from the OS when the application is paused.\n"
"Specific to the Android and iOS platforms.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On iOS, you only have approximately 5 seconds to finish a task "
"started by this signal. If you go over this allotment, iOS will kill the app "
"instead of pausing it."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈາກ OS ເມື່ອແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຖືກພັກໄວ້ (paused)."

msgid ""
"Notification received from the OS when the application is focused, i.e. when "
"changing the focus from the OS desktop or a thirdparty application to any "
"open window of the Godot instance.\n"
"Implemented on desktop and mobile platforms."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈາກ OS ເມື່ອແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໄດ້ຮັບການໂຟກັສ."

msgid ""
"Notification received from the OS when the application is defocused, i.e. "
"when changing the focus from any open window of the Godot instance to the OS "
"desktop or a thirdparty application.\n"
"Implemented on desktop and mobile platforms."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈາກ OS ເມື່ອແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເສຍການໂຟກັສ."

msgid "Notification received when text server is changed."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອ Text Server ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Notification received when the application enters picture-in-picture mode."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດ picture-in-picture."

msgid ""
"Notification received when the application exits picture-in-picture mode."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອອກຈາກໂໝດ picture-in-picture."

msgid "A container that keeps a margin around its child controls."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີ (Container) ທີ່ຮັກສາໄລຍະຫ່າງ (margin) ອ້ອມຮອບຄອນໂທຣລລູກຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"[MarginContainer] adds an adjustable margin on each side of its child "
"controls. The margins are added around all children, not around each "
"individual one. To control the [MarginContainer]'s margins, use the "
"[code]margin_*[/code] theme properties listed below.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The margin sizes are theme overrides, not normal properties. "
"This is an example of how to change them in code:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# This code sample assumes the current script is extending MarginContainer.\n"
"var margin_value = 100\n"
"add_theme_constant_override(\"margin_top\", margin_value)\n"
"add_theme_constant_override(\"margin_left\", margin_value)\n"
"add_theme_constant_override(\"margin_bottom\", margin_value)\n"
"add_theme_constant_override(\"margin_right\", margin_value)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// This code sample assumes the current script is extending MarginContainer.\n"
"int marginValue = 100;\n"
"AddThemeConstantOverride(\"margin_top\", marginValue);\n"
"AddThemeConstantOverride(\"margin_left\", marginValue);\n"
"AddThemeConstantOverride(\"margin_bottom\", marginValue);\n"
"AddThemeConstantOverride(\"margin_right\", marginValue);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr "[MarginContainer] ເພີ່ມໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໃນແຕ່ລະດ້ານຂອງຄອນໂທຣລລູກ."

msgid ""
"Offsets towards the inside direct children of the container by this amount of "
"pixels from the bottom."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກທາງດ້ານລຸ່ມເປັນພິກເຊວ."

msgid ""
"Offsets towards the inside direct children of the container by this amount of "
"pixels from the left."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍເປັນພິກເຊວ."

msgid ""
"Offsets towards the inside direct children of the container by this amount of "
"pixels from the right."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກທາງດ້ານຂວາເປັນພິກເຊວ."

msgid ""
"Offsets towards the inside direct children of the container by this amount of "
"pixels from the top."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກທາງດ້ານເທິງເປັນພິກເຊວ."

msgid "Generic 2D position hint for editing."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງໝາຍບອກຕຳແໜ່ງ 2D ທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "Size of the gizmo cross that appears in the editor."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງກາກະບາດ (gizmo) ທີ່ປາກົດໃນເອດິເຕີ."

msgid "Generic 3D position hint for editing."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງໝາຍບອກຕຳແໜ່ງ 3D ທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "Data transformation (marshaling) and encoding helpers."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືຊ່ວຍໃນການແປງຂໍ້ມູນ (marshaling) ແລະ ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ (encoding)."

msgid "Provides data transformation and encoding utility functions."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຟັງຊັນສຳລັບການແປງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ."

msgid ""
"Returns a decoded [PackedByteArray] corresponding to the Base64-encoded "
"string [param base64_str]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [PackedByteArray] ທີ່ຖອດລະຫັດຈາກສະຕຣິງ Base64 [param base64_str]."

msgid ""
"Returns a decoded string corresponding to the Base64-encoded string [param "
"base64_str]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າສະຕຣິງທີ່ຖອດລະຫັດຈາກສະຕຣິງ Base64 [param base64_str]."

msgid ""
"Returns a decoded [Variant] corresponding to the Base64-encoded string [param "
"base64_str]. If [param allow_objects] is [code]true[/code], decoding objects "
"is allowed.\n"
"Internally, this uses the same decoding mechanism as the [method "
"@GlobalScope.bytes_to_var] method.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Deserialized objects can contain code which gets executed. Do "
"not use this option if the serialized object comes from untrusted sources to "
"avoid potential security threats such as remote code execution."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [Variant] ທີ່ຖອດລະຫັດຈາກສະຕຣິງ Base64."

msgid "Returns a Base64-encoded string of a given [PackedByteArray]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າສະຕຣິງ Base64 ຈາກ [PackedByteArray] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Returns a Base64-encoded string of the UTF-8 string [param utf8_str]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າສະຕຣິງ Base64 ຈາກສະຕຣິງ UTF-8 [param utf8_str]."

msgid ""
"Returns a Base64-encoded string of the [Variant] [param variant]. If [param "
"full_objects] is [code]true[/code], encoding objects is allowed (and can "
"potentially include code).\n"
"Internally, this uses the same encoding mechanism as the [method "
"@GlobalScope.var_to_bytes] method."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າສະຕຣິງ Base64 ຈາກ [Variant] [param variant]."

msgid ""
"Virtual base class for applying visual properties to an object, such as color "
"and roughness."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສະເໝືອນ (Virtual base class) ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດທາງສາຍຕາໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸ ເຊັ່ນ ສີ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມຊາ (roughness)."

msgid ""
"[Material] is a base resource used for coloring and shading geometry. All "
"materials inherit from it and almost all [VisualInstance3D] derived nodes "
"carry a [Material]. A few flags and parameters are shared between all "
"material types and are configured here.\n"
"Importantly, you can inherit from [Material] to create your own custom "
"material type in script or in GDExtension."
msgstr "[Material] ແມ່ນຊັບພະຍາກອນພື້ນຖານທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການໃຫ້ສີ ແລະ ການເຮັດເງົາໃຫ້ກັບເລຂາຄະນິດ."

msgid ""
"Only exposed for the purpose of overriding. You cannot call this function "
"directly. Used internally to determine if [member next_pass] should be shown "
"in the editor or not."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການຂຽນທັບ (overriding) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ບໍ່ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ໂດຍກົງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Only exposed for the purpose of overriding. You cannot call this function "
"directly. Used internally to determine if [member render_priority] should be "
"shown in the editor or not."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການຂຽນທັບເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Only exposed for the purpose of overriding. You cannot call this function "
"directly. Used internally by various editor tools."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການຂຽນທັບເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນໂດຍເຄື່ອງມືຕ່າງໆຂອງເອດິເຕີ."

msgid ""
"Only exposed for the purpose of overriding. You cannot call this function "
"directly. Used internally by various editor tools. Used to access the RID of "
"the [Material]'s [Shader]."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການຂຽນທັບເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ RID ຂອງ [Shader] ຂອງວັດສະດຸ."

msgid "Creates a placeholder version of this resource ([PlaceholderMaterial])."
msgstr "ສ້າງເວີຊັນຕົວແທນ (placeholder) ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ ([PlaceholderMaterial])."

msgid ""
"Only available when running in the editor. Opens a popup that visualizes the "
"generated shader code, including all variants and internal shader code. See "
"also [method Shader.inspect_native_shader_code]."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອເປີດໃນເອດິເຕີເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລະຫັດເຊດເດີ (shader code) ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [Material] to be used for the next pass. This renders the object "
"again using a different material.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member next_pass] materials are not necessarily drawn "
"immediately after the source [Material]. Draw order is determined by material "
"properties, [member render_priority], and distance to camera.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only applies to [StandardMaterial3D]s and [ShaderMaterial]s "
"with type \"Spatial\"."
msgstr "ກຳນົດ [Material] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນຮອບ (pass) ຖັດໄປ."

msgid ""
"Sets the render priority for objects in 3D scenes. Higher priority objects "
"will be sorted in front of lower priority objects. In other words, all "
"objects with [member render_priority] [code]1[/code] will render on top of "
"all objects with [member render_priority] [code]0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only applies to [StandardMaterial3D]s and [ShaderMaterial]s "
"with type \"Spatial\".\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This will not impact how transparent objects are sorted relative "
"to opaque objects or how dynamic meshes will be sorted relative to other "
"opaque meshes. This is because all transparent objects are drawn after all "
"opaque objects and all dynamic opaque meshes are drawn before other opaque "
"meshes."
msgstr "ກຳນົດລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນໃນການເຣັນເດີ (render priority) ສຳລັບວັດຖຸໃນສາກ 3D."

msgid "Maximum value for the [member render_priority] parameter."
msgstr "ຄ່າສູງສຸດສຳລັບພາລາມິເຕີ [member render_priority]."

msgid "Minimum value for the [member render_priority] parameter."
msgstr "ຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດສຳລັບພາລາມິເຕີ [member render_priority]."

msgid "A horizontal menu bar that creates a menu for each [PopupMenu] child."
msgstr "ແຖບເມນູແນວນອນທີ່ສ້າງເມນູສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ [PopupMenu] ທີ່ເປັນລູກ."

msgid ""
"A horizontal menu bar that creates a menu for each [PopupMenu] child. New "
"items are created by adding [PopupMenu]s to this node. Item title is "
"determined by [member Window.title], or node name if [member Window.title] is "
"empty. Item title can be overridden using [method set_menu_title]."
msgstr "ແຖບເມນູແນວນອນທີ່ສ້າງເມນູສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ [PopupMenu] ທີ່ເປັນລູກ."

msgid "Returns number of menu items."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "Returns [PopupMenu] associated with menu item."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [PopupMenu] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "Returns menu item title."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຊື່ (title) ຂອງລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "Returns menu item tooltip."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຄຳອະທິບາຍ (tooltip) ຂອງລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the menu item is disabled."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລາຍການເມນູຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the menu item is hidden."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລາຍການເມນູຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the current system's global menu is supported "
"and used by this [MenuBar]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເມນູຫຼັກຂອງລະບົບ (global menu) ຖືກຮອງຮັບ ແລະ ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ "
"[MenuBar] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shortcuts are disabled and cannot be used to trigger "
"the button."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ປຸ່ມລັດ (shortcuts) ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປີດປຸ່ມໄດ້."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], menu item is disabled."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລາຍການເມນູຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], menu item is hidden."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລາຍການເມນູຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້."

msgid "Sets menu item title."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຊື່ຂອງລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "Sets menu item tooltip."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄຳອະທິບາຍຂອງລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "Flat [MenuBar] don't display item decoration."
msgstr "[MenuBar] ແບບຮາບພຽງ (Flat) ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງການຕົບແຕ່ງລາຍການ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [MenuBar] will use system global menu when supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [code]true[/code] and global menu is supported, this node is "
"not displayed, has zero size, and all its child nodes except [PopupMenu]s are "
"inaccessible.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property overrides the value of the [member "
"PopupMenu.prefer_native_menu] property of the child nodes."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [MenuBar] ຈະໃຊ້ເມນູຫຼັກຂອງລະບົບເມື່ອມີການຮອງຮັບ."

msgid ""
"Position order in the global menu to insert [MenuBar] items at. All menu "
"items in the [MenuBar] are always inserted as a continuous range. Menus with "
"lower [member start_index] are inserted first. Menus with [member "
"start_index] equal to [code]-1[/code] are inserted last."
msgstr "ລຳດັບຕຳແໜ່ງໃນເມນູຫຼັກທີ່ຈະແຊກລາຍການ [MenuBar] ເຂົ້າໄປ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when the cursor hovers above menu item, it will close "
"the current [PopupMenu] and open the other one."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເມື່ອເມົາສ໌ຢູ່ເທິງລາຍການເມນູ, ມັນຈະປິດ [PopupMenu] ປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ "
"ເປີດອັນອື່ນແທນ."

msgid "Default text [Color] of the menu item."
msgstr "ສີຂໍ້ຄວາມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "Text [Color] used when the menu item is disabled."
msgstr "ສີຂໍ້ຄວາມເມື່ອລາຍການເມນູຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Text [Color] used when the menu item is focused. Only replaces the normal "
"text color of the menu item. Disabled, hovered, and pressed states take "
"precedence over this color."
msgstr "ສີຂໍ້ຄວາມເມື່ອລາຍການເມນູຖືກໂຟກັສ."

msgid "Text [Color] used when the menu item is being hovered."
msgstr "ສີຂໍ້ຄວາມເມື່ອເມົາສ໌ຢູ່ເທິງລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "Text [Color] used when the menu item is being hovered and pressed."
msgstr "ສີຂໍ້ຄວາມ [Color] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອລາຍການເມນູຖືກວາງເມົາສ໌ໃສ່ ແລະ ຖືກກົດ."

msgid "The tint of text outline of the menu item."
msgstr "ການຍ້ອມສີຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "Text [Color] used when the menu item is being pressed."
msgstr "ສີຂໍ້ຄວາມ [Color] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອລາຍການເມນູຖືກກົດ."

msgid "The horizontal space between menu items."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຕາມລວງນອນລະຫວ່າງລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "[Font] of the menu item's text."
msgstr "[Font] ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "Font size of the menu item's text."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນຕ໌ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "[StyleBox] used when the menu item is disabled."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອລາຍການເມນູຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] used when the menu item is disabled (for right-to-left layouts)."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອລາຍການເມນູຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ (ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງຈາກຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ)."

msgid "[StyleBox] used when the menu item is being hovered."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອລາຍການເມນູຖືກວາງເມົາສ໌ໃສ່."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] used when the menu item is being hovered (for right-to-left "
"layouts)."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອລາຍການເມນູຖືກວາງເມົາສ໌ໃສ່ (ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງຈາກຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ)."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] used when the menu item is being pressed and hovered at the same "
"time."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອລາຍການເມນູຖືກກົດ ແລະ ວາງເມົາສ໌ໃສ່ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] used when the menu item is being pressed and hovered at the same "
"time (for right-to-left layouts)."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອລາຍການເມນູຖືກກົດ ແລະ ວາງເມົາສ໌ໃສ່ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ "
"(ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງຈາກຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ)."

msgid "Default [StyleBox] for the menu item."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "Default [StyleBox] for the menu item (for right-to-left layouts)."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບລາຍການເມນູ (ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງຈາກຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ)."

msgid "[StyleBox] used when the menu item is being pressed."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອລາຍການເມນູຖືກກົດ."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] used when the menu item is being pressed (for right-to-left "
"layouts)."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອລາຍການເມນູຖືກກົດ (ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງຈາກຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ)."

msgid "A button that brings up a [PopupMenu] when clicked."
msgstr "ປຸ່ມທີ່ຈະສະແດງ [PopupMenu] ຂຶ້ນມາເມື່ອຖືກຄລິກ."

msgid ""
"A button that brings up a [PopupMenu] when clicked. To create new items "
"inside this [PopupMenu], use [code]get_popup().add_item(\"My Item Name\")[/"
"code]. You can also create them directly from Godot editor's inspector.\n"
"See also [BaseButton] which contains common properties and methods associated "
"with this node."
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມທີ່ຈະສະແດງ [PopupMenu] ຂຶ້ນມາເມື່ອຖືກຄລິກ. ເພື່ອສ້າງລາຍການໃໝ່ພາຍໃນ [PopupMenu] ນີ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[code]get_popup().add_item(\"My Item Name\")[/code]. "
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດສ້າງພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກ inspector ຂອງ Godot editor.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [BaseButton] ນຳອີກ ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດ ແລະ ເມທອດທົ່ວໄປທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂນດນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the [PopupMenu] contained in this button.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it may "
"cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member Window.visible] property."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [PopupMenu] ທີ່ບັນຈຸຢູ່ໃນປຸ່ມນີ້.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນໂນດພາຍໃນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ການລຶບ ຫຼື ການປ່ອຍ (free) "
"ມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໂປຣແກຣມຄ້າງໄດ້. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອງມັນ ຫຼື ລູກຂອງມັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member "
"Window.visible] ຂອງພວກມັນ."

msgid ""
"Adjusts popup position and sizing for the [MenuButton], then shows the "
"[PopupMenu]. Prefer this over using [code]get_popup().popup()[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງປັອບອັບສຳລັບ [MenuButton], ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງສະແດງ [PopupMenu]. "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ແທນການໃຊ້ [code]get_popup().popup()[/code]."

msgid ""
"The checkable item type of the item at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດລາຍການທີ່ສາມາດໝາຍເລືອກໄດ້ (checkable) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [code]index[/code] ແມ່ນຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/code]."

msgid ""
"The ID of the item at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr ""
"ID ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [code]index[/code] ແມ່ນຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the item at [code]index[/code] is a separator.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລາຍການທີ່ [code]index[/code] ແມ່ນເສັ້ນແບ່ງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [code]index[/code] ແມ່ນຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when the cursor hovers above another [MenuButton] "
"within the same parent which also has [member switch_on_hover] enabled, it "
"will close the current [MenuButton] and open the other one."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເມື່ອເຄີເຊີວາງຢູ່ເທິງ [MenuButton] ອື່ນພາຍໃນພາເຣນ (parent) "
"ດຽວກັນທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ [member switch_on_hover] ໄວ້ຄືກັນ, ມັນຈະປິດ [MenuButton] ປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ "
"ເປີດອັນໃໝ່ຂຶ້ນມາ."

msgid "Emitted when the [PopupMenu] of this MenuButton is about to show."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອ [PopupMenu] ຂອງ MenuButton ນີ້ກຳລັງຈະສະແດງ."

msgid "A [Resource] that contains vertex array-based geometry."
msgstr "[Resource] ທີ່ບັນຈຸເລຂາຄະນິດແບບອາເຣຈຸດຈອມ (vertex array-based geometry)."

msgid ""
"Mesh is a type of [Resource] that contains vertex array-based geometry, "
"divided in [i]surfaces[/i]. Each surface contains a completely separate array "
"and a material used to draw it. Design wise, a mesh with multiple surfaces is "
"preferred to a single surface, because objects created in 3D editing software "
"commonly contain multiple materials. The maximum number of surfaces per mesh "
"is [constant RenderingServer.MAX_MESH_SURFACES]."
msgstr ""
"Mesh ແມ່ນປະເພດຂອງ [Resource] ທີ່ບັນຈຸເລຂາຄະນິດແບບອາເຣຈຸດຈອມ, ເຊິ່ງແບ່ງອອກເປັນ [i]ພື້ນຜິວ[/"
"i] (surfaces). ແຕ່ລະພື້ນຜິວຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍອາເຣທີ່ແຍກຈາກກັນໂດຍສິ້ນເຊີງ ແລະ ວັດສະດຸ (material) "
"ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ້ມມັນ. ໃນດ້ານການອອກແບບ, ເມຊທີ່ມີຫຼາຍພື້ນຜິວແມ່ນດີກວ່າແບບພື້ນຜິວດຽວ "
"ເພາະວ່າວັດຖຸທີ່ສ້າງໃນຊອບແວແກ້ໄຂ 3D ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປມັກຈະມີຫຼາຍວັດສະດຸ. ຈຳນວນພື້ນຜິວສູງສຸດຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງເມຊແມ່ນ "
"[constant RenderingServer.MAX_MESH_SURFACES]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to override the [AABB] for a custom class extending [Mesh]."
msgstr ""
"ເວັກເຕີສະເໝືອນ (Virtual method) ເພື່ອຂຽນທັບ [AABB] ສຳລັບຄລາສກຳນົດເອງທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ [Mesh]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to override the number of blend shapes for a custom class "
"extending [Mesh]."
msgstr ""
"ເວັກເຕີສະເໝືອນເພື່ອຂຽນທັບຈຳນວນຂອງຮູບຊົງປະສົມ (blend shapes) ສຳລັບຄລາສກຳນົດເອງທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ "
"[Mesh]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to override the retrieval of blend shape names for a custom "
"class extending [Mesh]."
msgstr "ເວັກເຕີສະເໝືອນເພື່ອຂຽນທັບການດຶງເອົາຊື່ຮູບຊົງປະສົມ ສຳລັບຄລາສກຳນົດເອງທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ [Mesh]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to override the surface count for a custom class extending "
"[Mesh]."
msgstr "ເວັກເຕີສະເໝືອນເພື່ອຂຽນທັບຈຳນວນພື້ນຜິວ ສຳລັບຄລາສກຳນົດເອງທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ [Mesh]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to override the names of blend shapes for a custom class "
"extending [Mesh]."
msgstr "ເວັກເຕີສະເໝືອນເພື່ອຂຽນທັບຊື່ຂອງຮູບຊົງປະສົມ ສຳລັບຄລາສກຳນົດເອງທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ [Mesh]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to override the surface array index length for a custom class "
"extending [Mesh]."
msgstr ""
"ເວັກເຕີສະເໝືອນເພື່ອຂຽນທັບຄວາມຍາວອິນເດັກອາເຣພື້ນຜິວ ສຳລັບຄລາສກຳນົດເອງທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ [Mesh]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to override the surface array length for a custom class "
"extending [Mesh]."
msgstr "ເວັກເຕີສະເໝືອນເພື່ອຂຽນທັບຄວາມຍາວອາເຣພື້ນຜິວ ສຳລັບຄລາສກຳນົດເອງທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ [Mesh]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to override the surface arrays for a custom class extending "
"[Mesh]."
msgstr "ເວັກເຕີສະເໝືອນເພື່ອຂຽນທັບອາເຣພື້ນຜິວ ສຳລັບຄລາສກຳນົດເອງທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ [Mesh]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to override the blend shape arrays for a custom class "
"extending [Mesh]."
msgstr "ເວັກເຕີສະເໝືອນເພື່ອຂຽນທັບອາເຣຮູບຊົງປະສົມ ສຳລັບຄລາສກຳນົດເອງທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ [Mesh]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to override the surface format for a custom class extending "
"[Mesh]."
msgstr ""
"ເວັກເຕີສະເໝືອນເພື່ອຂຽນທັບຮູບແບບພື້ນຜິວ (surface format) ສຳລັບຄລາສກຳນົດເອງທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ [Mesh]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to override the surface LODs for a custom class extending "
"[Mesh]."
msgstr "ເວັກເຕີສະເໝືອນເພື່ອຂຽນທັບພື້ນຜິວ LODs ສຳລັບຄລາສກຳນົດເອງທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ [Mesh]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to override the surface material for a custom class extending "
"[Mesh]."
msgstr "ເວັກເຕີສະເໝືອນເພື່ອຂຽນທັບວັດສະດຸພື້ນຜິວ ສຳລັບຄລາສກຳນົດເອງທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ [Mesh]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to override the surface primitive type for a custom class "
"extending [Mesh]."
msgstr ""
"ເວັກເຕີສະເໝືອນເພື່ອຂຽນທັບຊະນິດພື້ນຖານ (primitive type) ຂອງພື້ນຜິວ "
"ສຳລັບຄລາສກຳນົດເອງທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ [Mesh]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to override the setting of a [param material] at the given "
"[param index] for a custom class extending [Mesh]."
msgstr ""
"ເວັກເຕີສະເໝືອນເພື່ອຂຽນທັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param material] ຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ "
"ສຳລັບຄລາສກຳນົດເອງທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ [Mesh]."

msgid ""
"Calculate a [ConvexPolygonShape3D] from the mesh.\n"
"If [param clean] is [code]true[/code] (default), duplicate and interior "
"vertices are removed automatically. You can set it to [code]false[/code] to "
"make the process faster if not needed.\n"
"If [param simplify] is [code]true[/code], the geometry can be further "
"simplified to reduce the number of vertices. Disabled by default."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳນວນຮູບຊົງພຫຸແຈນູນ [ConvexPolygonShape3D] ຈາກເມຊ.\n"
"ຫາກ [param clean] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຈຸດຈອມທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນ ແລະ "
"ຈຸດຈອມພາຍໃນຈະຖືກລຶບອອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະບວນການໄວຂຶ້ນຫາກບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ.\n"
"ຫາກ [param simplify] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ເລຂາຄະນິດສາມາດຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນຕື່ມເພື່ອຫຼຸດຈຳນວນຈຸດຈອມ. ປິດໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Calculate an outline mesh at a defined offset (margin) from the original "
"mesh.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method typically returns the vertices in reverse order "
"(e.g. clockwise to counterclockwise)."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳນວນເມຊເສັ້ນຂອບ (outline mesh) ຕາມໄລຍະຫ່າງ (margin) ທີ່ກຳນົດຈາກເມຊຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະຄືນຄ່າຈຸດຈອມໃນລຳດັບຢ້ອນກັບ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ຈາກຕາມເຂັມໂມງເປັນທວນເຂັມໂມງ)."

msgid "Creates a placeholder version of this resource ([PlaceholderMesh])."
msgstr "ສ້າງເວີຊັນຕົວແທນ (placeholder) ຂອງຣີຊອດນີ້ ([PlaceholderMesh])."

msgid "Calculate a [ConcavePolygonShape3D] from the mesh."
msgstr "ຄຳນວນຮູບຊົງພຫຸແຈວໍ້າ [ConcavePolygonShape3D] ຈາກເມຊ."

msgid ""
"Generate a [TriangleMesh] from the mesh. Considers only surfaces using one of "
"these primitive types: [constant PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES], [constant "
"PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLE_STRIP]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [TriangleMesh] ຈາກເມຊ. ຈະພິຈາລະນາສະເພາະພື້ນຜິວທີ່ໃຊ້ຊະນິດພື້ນຖານເຫຼົ່ານີ້: [constant "
"PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES], [constant PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLE_STRIP]."

msgid ""
"Returns the smallest [AABB] enclosing this mesh in local space. Not affected "
"by [code]custom_aabb[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only implemented for [ArrayMesh] and [PrimitiveMesh]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [AABB] ທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດທີ່ກວມເອົາເມຊນີ້ໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ (local space). ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ "
"[code]custom_aabb[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບ [ArrayMesh] ແລະ [PrimitiveMesh] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns all the vertices that make up the faces of the mesh. Each three "
"vertices represent one triangle."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຈຸດຈອມທັງໝົດທີ່ປະກອບເປັນໜ້າຂອງເມຊ. ທຸກໆສາມຈຸດຈອມຈະແທນໜຶ່ງຮູບສາມແຈ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of surfaces that the [Mesh] holds. This is equivalent to "
"[method MeshInstance3D.get_surface_override_material_count]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນພື້ນຜິວທີ່ [Mesh] ມີຢູ່. ນີ້ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [method "
"MeshInstance3D.get_surface_override_material_count]."

msgid ""
"Returns the arrays for the vertices, normals, UVs, etc. that make up the "
"requested surface (see [method ArrayMesh.add_surface_from_arrays])."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າອາເຣສຳລັບຈຸດຈອມ (vertices), ເວັກເຕີປົກກະຕິ (normals), UVs, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ "
"ທີ່ປະກອບເປັນພື້ນຜິວທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍ (ເບິ່ງ [method ArrayMesh.add_surface_from_arrays])."

msgid "Returns the blend shape arrays for the requested surface."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າອາເຣຮູບຊົງປະສົມສຳລັບພື້ນຜິວທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Material] in a given surface. Surface is rendered using this "
"material.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This returns the material within the [Mesh] resource, not the "
"[Material] associated to the [MeshInstance3D]'s Surface Material Override "
"properties. To get the [Material] associated to the [MeshInstance3D]'s "
"Surface Material Override properties, use [method "
"MeshInstance3D.get_surface_override_material] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [Material] ໃນພື້ນຜິວທີ່ກຳນົດ. ພື້ນຜິວຈະຖືກເຣນເດີໂດຍໃຊ້ວັດສະດຸນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ຈະຄືນຄ່າວັດສະດຸພາຍໃນຣີຊອດ [Mesh], ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [Material] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"Surface Material Override ຂອງ [MeshInstance3D]. ເພື່ອດຶງເອົາ [Material] "
"ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄຸນສົມບັດ Surface Material Override ຂອງ [MeshInstance3D], ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"MeshInstance3D.get_surface_override_material] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Sets a [Material] for a given surface. Surface will be rendered using this "
"material.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This assigns the material within the [Mesh] resource, not the "
"[Material] associated to the [MeshInstance3D]'s Surface Material Override "
"properties. To set the [Material] associated to the [MeshInstance3D]'s "
"Surface Material Override properties, use [method "
"MeshInstance3D.set_surface_override_material] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Material] ສຳລັບພື້ນຜິວທີ່ກຳນົດ. ພື້ນຜິວຈະຖືກເຣນເດີໂດຍໃຊ້ວັດສະດຸນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ຈະກຳນົດວັດສະດຸພາຍໃນຣີຊອດ [Mesh], ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [Material] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"Surface Material Override ຂອງ [MeshInstance3D]. ເພື່ອກຳນົດ [Material] "
"ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄຸນສົມບັດ Surface Material Override ຂອງ [MeshInstance3D], ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"MeshInstance3D.set_surface_override_material] ແທນ."

msgid "Sets a hint to be used for lightmap resolution."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຳແນະນຳ (hint) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງ lightmap."

msgid "Render array as points (one vertex equals one point)."
msgstr "ເຣນເດີອາເຣເປັນຈຸດ (ໜຶ່ງຈຸດຈອມເທົ່າກັບໜຶ່ງຈຸດ)."

msgid "Render array as lines (every two vertices a line is created)."
msgstr "ເຣນເດີອາເຣເປັນເສັ້ນ (ທຸກໆສອງຈຸດຈອມຈະສ້າງເປັນໜຶ່ງເສັ້ນ)."

msgid "Render array as line strip."
msgstr "ເຣນເດີອາເຣເປັນເສັ້ນຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ (line strip)."

msgid "Render array as triangles (every three vertices a triangle is created)."
msgstr "ເຣນເດີອາເຣເປັນຮູບສາມແຈ (ທຸກໆສາມຈຸດຈອມຈະສ້າງເປັນໜຶ່ງຮູບສາມແຈ)."

msgid "Render array as triangle strips."
msgstr "ເຣນເດີອາເຣເປັນຮູບສາມແຈຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ (triangle strips)."

msgid ""
"[PackedVector3Array], [PackedVector2Array], or [Array] of vertex positions."
msgstr "[PackedVector3Array], [PackedVector2Array], ຫຼື [Array] ຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດຈອມ."

msgid ""
"[PackedVector3Array] of vertex normals.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The array has to consist of normal vectors, otherwise they will "
"be normalized by the engine, potentially causing visual discrepancies."
msgstr ""
"[PackedVector3Array] ຂອງເວັກເຕີປົກກະຕິຂອງຈຸດຈອມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອາເຣຕ້ອງປະກອບດ້ວຍເວັກເຕີປົກກະຕິ (normal vectors), "
"ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກມັນຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າປົກກະຕິ (normalized) ໂດຍເອນຈິນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຜິດພ້ຽນທາງສາຍຕາໄດ້."

msgid ""
"[PackedFloat32Array] of vertex tangents. Each element in groups of 4 floats, "
"first 3 floats determine the tangent, and the last the binormal direction as "
"-1 or 1."
msgstr ""
"[PackedFloat32Array] ຂອງເສັ້ນສຳຜັດ (tangents) ຂອງຈຸດຈອມ. ແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມຂອງ 4 "
"floats, 3 floats ທຳອິດກຳນົດເສັ້ນສຳຜັດ, ແລະ ອັນສຸດທ້າຍກຳນົດທິດທາງ binormal ເປັນ -1 ຫຼື 1."

msgid "[PackedColorArray] of vertex colors."
msgstr "[PackedColorArray] ຂອງສີຈຸດຈອມ."

msgid "[PackedVector2Array] for UV coordinates."
msgstr "[PackedVector2Array] ສຳລັບພິກັດ UV."

msgid "[PackedVector2Array] for second UV coordinates."
msgstr "[PackedVector2Array] ສຳລັບພິກັດ UV ທີສອງ."

msgid ""
"Contains custom color channel 0. [PackedByteArray] if [code](format >> "
"Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOM0_SHIFT) & Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOM_MASK[/code] is "
"[constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_UNORM], [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_SNORM], "
"[constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RG_HALF], or [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA_HALF]. "
"[PackedFloat32Array] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຈຸຊ່ອງສີກຳນົດເອງ 0. ຈະເປັນ [PackedByteArray] ຫາກ [code](format >> "
"Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOM0_SHIFT) & Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOM_MASK[/code] ແມ່ນ "
"[constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_UNORM], [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_SNORM], "
"[constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RG_HALF], ຫຼື [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA_HALF]. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເປັນ [PackedFloat32Array]."

msgid ""
"Contains custom color channel 1. [PackedByteArray] if [code](format >> "
"Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOM1_SHIFT) & Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOM_MASK[/code] is "
"[constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_UNORM], [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_SNORM], "
"[constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RG_HALF], or [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA_HALF]. "
"[PackedFloat32Array] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຈຸຊ່ອງສີກຳນົດເອງ 1. ຈະເປັນ [PackedByteArray] ຫາກ [code](format >> "
"Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOM1_SHIFT) & Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOM_MASK[/code] ແມ່ນ "
"[constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_UNORM], [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_SNORM], "
"[constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RG_HALF], ຫຼື [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA_HALF]. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເປັນ [PackedFloat32Array]."

msgid ""
"Contains custom color channel 2. [PackedByteArray] if [code](format >> "
"Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOM2_SHIFT) & Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOM_MASK[/code] is "
"[constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_UNORM], [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_SNORM], "
"[constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RG_HALF], or [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA_HALF]. "
"[PackedFloat32Array] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຈຸຊ່ອງສີກຳນົດເອງ 2. ຈະເປັນ [PackedByteArray] ຫາກ [code](format >> "
"Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOM2_SHIFT) & Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOM_MASK[/code] ແມ່ນ "
"[constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_UNORM], [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_SNORM], "
"[constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RG_HALF], ຫຼື [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA_HALF]. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເປັນ [PackedFloat32Array]."

msgid ""
"Contains custom color channel 3. [PackedByteArray] if [code](format >> "
"Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOM3_SHIFT) & Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOM_MASK[/code] is "
"[constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_UNORM], [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_SNORM], "
"[constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RG_HALF], or [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA_HALF]. "
"[PackedFloat32Array] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຈຸຊ່ອງສີກຳນົດເອງ 3. ຈະເປັນ [PackedByteArray] ຫາກ [code](format >> "
"Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOM3_SHIFT) & Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOM_MASK[/code] ແມ່ນ "
"[constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_UNORM], [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA8_SNORM], "
"[constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RG_HALF], ຫຼື [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM_RGBA_HALF]. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເປັນ [PackedFloat32Array]."

msgid ""
"[PackedFloat32Array] or [PackedInt32Array] of bone indices. Contains either 4 "
"or 8 numbers per vertex depending on the presence of the [constant "
"ARRAY_FLAG_USE_8_BONE_WEIGHTS] flag."
msgstr ""
"[PackedFloat32Array] ຫຼື [PackedInt32Array] ຂອງອິນເດັກກະດູກ. ບັນຈຸ 4 ຫຼື 8 "
"ຕົວເລກຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງຈຸດຈອມ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບການມີຢູ່ຂອງແຟລັກ [constant ARRAY_FLAG_USE_8_BONE_WEIGHTS]."

msgid ""
"[PackedFloat32Array] or [PackedFloat64Array] of bone weights in the range "
"[code]0.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code] (inclusive). Contains either 4 or 8 "
"numbers per vertex depending on the presence of the [constant "
"ARRAY_FLAG_USE_8_BONE_WEIGHTS] flag."
msgstr ""
"[PackedFloat32Array] ຫຼື [PackedFloat64Array] ຂອງນ້ຳໜັກກະດູກໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ຫາ [code]1.0[/code]. ບັນຈຸ 4 ຫຼື 8 ຕົວເລກຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງຈຸດຈອມ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບການມີຢູ່ຂອງແຟລັກ [constant "
"ARRAY_FLAG_USE_8_BONE_WEIGHTS]."

msgid ""
"[PackedInt32Array] of integers used as indices referencing vertices, colors, "
"normals, tangents, and textures. All of those arrays must have the same "
"number of elements as the vertex array. No index can be beyond the vertex "
"array size. When this index array is present, it puts the function into "
"\"index mode,\" where the index selects the [i]i[/i]'th vertex, normal, "
"tangent, color, UV, etc. This means if you want to have different normals or "
"colors along an edge, you have to duplicate the vertices.\n"
"For triangles, the index array is interpreted as triples, referring to the "
"vertices of each triangle. For lines, the index array is in pairs indicating "
"the start and end of each line."
msgstr ""
"[PackedInt32Array] ຂອງເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນອິນເດັກອ້າງອີງເຖິງຈຸດຈອມ, ສີ, ເວັກເຕີປົກກະຕິ, ເສັ້ນສຳຜັດ, "
"ແລະ ເທັກເຈີ. ອາເຣທັງໝົດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງມີຈຳນວນອົງປະກອບເທົ່າກັບອາເຣຈຸດຈອມ. "
"ບໍ່ມີອິນເດັກໃດສາມາດເກີນຂະໜາດຂອງອາເຣຈຸດຈອມໄດ້. ເມື່ອມີອາເຣອິນເດັກນີ້, ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນເຂົ້າສູ່ "
"\"ໂໝດອິນເດັກ,\" ເຊິ່ງອິນເດັກຈະເລືອກເອົາຈຸດຈອມທີ [i]i[/i], ເວັກເຕີປົກກະຕິ, ເສັ້ນສຳຜັດ, ສີ, UV, "
"ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການມີເວັກເຕີປົກກະຕິ ຫຼື ສີທີ່ຕ່າງກັນຕາມຂອບ, "
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຮັດຈຸດຈອມຊ້ຳ.\n"
"ສຳລັບຮູບສາມແຈ, ອາເຣອິນເດັກຈະຖືກຕີຄວາມໝາຍເປັນຊຸດລະສາມ (triples), "
"ເຊິ່ງອ້າງອີງເຖິງຈຸດຈອມຂອງແຕ່ລະຮູບສາມແຈ. ສຳລັບເສັ້ນ, ອາເຣອິນເດັກຈະເປັນຄູ່ເພື່ອບອກຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ "
"ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງແຕ່ລະເສັ້ນ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ArrayType] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ArrayType]."

msgid ""
"Indicates this custom channel contains unsigned normalized byte colors from 0 "
"to 1, encoded as [PackedByteArray]."
msgstr ""
"ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງນີ້ບັນຈຸສີແບບ unsigned normalized byte ຈາກ 0 ຫາ 1, ເຂົ້າລະຫັດເປັນ "
"[PackedByteArray]."

msgid ""
"Indicates this custom channel contains signed normalized byte colors from -1 "
"to 1, encoded as [PackedByteArray]."
msgstr ""
"ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງນີ້ບັນຈຸສີແບບ signed normalized byte ຈາກ -1 ຫາ 1, ເຂົ້າລະຫັດເປັນ "
"[PackedByteArray]."

msgid ""
"Indicates this custom channel contains half precision float colors, encoded "
"as [PackedByteArray]. Only red and green channels are used."
msgstr ""
"ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງນີ້ບັນຈຸສີແບບ half precision float, ເຂົ້າລະຫັດເປັນ [PackedByteArray]. "
"ຈະໃຊ້ສະເພາະຊ່ອງສີແດງ ແລະ ສີຂຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Indicates this custom channel contains half precision float colors, encoded "
"as [PackedByteArray]."
msgstr ""
"ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງນີ້ບັນຈຸສີແບບ half precision float, ເຂົ້າລະຫັດເປັນ [PackedByteArray]."

msgid ""
"Indicates this custom channel contains full float colors, in a "
"[PackedFloat32Array]. Only the red channel is used."
msgstr ""
"ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງນີ້ບັນຈຸສີແບບ full float, ໃນ [PackedFloat32Array]. "
"ຈະໃຊ້ສະເພາະຊ່ອງສີແດງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Indicates this custom channel contains full float colors, in a "
"[PackedFloat32Array]. Only red and green channels are used."
msgstr ""
"ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງນີ້ບັນຈຸສີແບບ full float, ໃນ [PackedFloat32Array]. "
"ຈະໃຊ້ສະເພາະຊ່ອງສີແດງ ແລະ ສີຂຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Indicates this custom channel contains full float colors, in a "
"[PackedFloat32Array]. Only red, green and blue channels are used."
msgstr ""
"ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງນີ້ບັນຈຸສີແບບ full float, ໃນ [PackedFloat32Array]. "
"ຈະໃຊ້ສະເພາະຊ່ອງສີແດງ, ສີຂຽວ ແລະ ສີຟ້າເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Indicates this custom channel contains full float colors, in a "
"[PackedFloat32Array]."
msgstr "ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງນີ້ບັນຈຸສີແບບ full float, ໃນ [PackedFloat32Array]."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ArrayCustomFormat] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ArrayCustomFormat]."

msgid ""
"Mesh array contains vertices. All meshes require a vertex array so this "
"should always be present."
msgstr "ອາເຣເມຊບັນຈຸຈຸດຈອມ. ເມຊທັງໝົດຕ້ອງການອາເຣຈຸດຈອມ ດັ່ງນັ້ນອັນນີ້ຄວນມີຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

msgid "Mesh array contains normals."
msgstr "ອາເຣເມຊບັນຈຸເວັກເຕີປົກກະຕິ (normals)."

msgid "Mesh array contains tangents."
msgstr "ອາເຣເມຊບັນຈຸເສັ້ນສຳຜັດ (tangents)."

msgid "Mesh array contains colors."
msgstr "ອາເຣເມຊບັນຈຸສີ."

msgid "Mesh array contains UVs."
msgstr "ອາເຣເມຊບັນຈຸ UVs."

msgid "Mesh array contains second UV."
msgstr "ອາເຣເມຊບັນຈຸ UV ທີສອງ."

msgid "Mesh array contains custom channel index 0."
msgstr "ອາເຣເມຊບັນຈຸຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງອິນເດັກ 0."

msgid "Mesh array contains custom channel index 1."
msgstr "ອາເຣເມຊບັນຈຸຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງອິນເດັກ 1."

msgid "Mesh array contains custom channel index 2."
msgstr "ອາເຣເມຊບັນຈຸຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງອິນເດັກ 2."

msgid "Mesh array contains custom channel index 3."
msgstr "ອາເຣເມຊບັນຈຸຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງອິນເດັກ 3."

msgid "Mesh array contains bones."
msgstr "ອາເຣເມຊບັນຈຸກະລູກ."

msgid "Mesh array contains bone weights."
msgstr "ອາເຣເມຊບັນຈຸນ້ຳໜັກກະດູກ."

msgid "Mesh array uses indices."
msgstr "ອາເຣເມຊໃຊ້ຊຸດອິນເດັກ (indices)."

msgid "Mask of mesh channels permitted in blend shapes."
msgstr "ມາດສ໌ (Mask) ຂອງຊ່ອງເມຊທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃນຮູບຊົງປະສົມ (blend shapes)."

msgid "Shift of first custom channel."
msgstr "ການເລື່ອນ (Shift) ຂອງຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງທຳອິດ."

msgid "Number of format bits per custom channel. See [enum ArrayCustomFormat]."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນບິດຮູບແບບຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງ. ເບິ່ງ [enum ArrayCustomFormat]."

msgid "Amount to shift [enum ArrayCustomFormat] for custom channel index 0."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນທີ່ຈະເລື່ອນ [enum ArrayCustomFormat] ສຳລັບຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງອິນເດັກ 0."

msgid "Amount to shift [enum ArrayCustomFormat] for custom channel index 1."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນທີ່ຈະເລື່ອນ [enum ArrayCustomFormat] ສຳລັບຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງອິນເດັກ 1."

msgid "Amount to shift [enum ArrayCustomFormat] for custom channel index 2."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນທີ່ຈະເລື່ອນ [enum ArrayCustomFormat] ສຳລັບຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງອິນເດັກ 2."

msgid "Amount to shift [enum ArrayCustomFormat] for custom channel index 3."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນທີ່ຈະເລື່ອນ [enum ArrayCustomFormat] ສຳລັບຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງອິນເດັກ 3."

msgid ""
"Mask of custom format bits per custom channel. Must be shifted by one of the "
"SHIFT constants. See [enum ArrayCustomFormat]."
msgstr ""
"ມາດສ໌ຂອງບິດຮູບແບບກຳນົດເອງຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງ. ຕ້ອງຖືກເລື່ອນໂດຍໜຶ່ງໃນຄ່າຄົງທີ່ SHIFT. ເບິ່ງ [enum "
"ArrayCustomFormat]."

msgid ""
"Shift of first compress flag. Compress flags should be passed to [method "
"ArrayMesh.add_surface_from_arrays] and [method SurfaceTool.commit]."
msgstr ""
"ການເລື່ອນຂອງແຟລັກການບີບອັດ (compress flag) ທຳອິດ. ແຟລັກການບີບອັດຄວນຖືກສົ່ງໄປທີ່ [method "
"ArrayMesh.add_surface_from_arrays] ແລະ [method SurfaceTool.commit]."

msgid "Flag used to mark that the array contains 2D vertices."
msgstr "ແຟລັກທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍວ່າອາເຣບັນຈຸຈຸດຈອມ 2D."

msgid ""
"Flag used to mark that the mesh data will use [code]GL_DYNAMIC_DRAW[/code] on "
"GLES. Unused on Vulkan."
msgstr ""
"ແຟລັກທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍວ່າຂໍ້ມູນເມຊຈະໃຊ້ [code]GL_DYNAMIC_DRAW[/code] ໃນ GLES. ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ໃນ "
"Vulkan."

msgid ""
"Flag used to mark that the mesh contains up to 8 bone influences per vertex. "
"This flag indicates that [constant ARRAY_BONES] and [constant ARRAY_WEIGHTS] "
"elements will have double length."
msgstr ""
"ແຟລັກທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍວ່າເມຊບັນຈຸອິດທິພົນຂອງກະດູກສູງສຸດ 8 ອັນຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງຈຸດຈອມ. ແຟລັກນີ້ບົ່ງບອກວ່າອົງປະກອບ "
"[constant ARRAY_BONES] ແລະ [constant ARRAY_WEIGHTS] ຈະມີຄວາມຍາວເພີ່ມເປັນສອງເທົ່າ."

msgid "Flag used to mark that the mesh intentionally contains no vertex array."
msgstr "ແຟລັກທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍວ່າເມຊນີ້ຕັ້ງໃຈບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີອາເຣຈຸດຈອມ."

msgid ""
"Flag used to mark that a mesh is using compressed attributes (vertices, "
"normals, tangents, UVs). When this form of compression is enabled, vertex "
"positions will be packed into an RGBA16UNORM attribute and scaled in the "
"vertex shader. The normal and tangent will be packed into an RG16UNORM "
"representing an axis, and a 16-bit float stored in the A-channel of the "
"vertex. UVs will use 16-bit normalized floats instead of full 32-bit signed "
"floats. When using this compression mode you must use either vertices, "
"normals, and tangents or only vertices. You cannot use normals without "
"tangents. Importers will automatically enable this compression if they can."
msgstr ""
"ແຟລັກທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍວ່າເມຊກຳລັງໃຊ້ຄຸນລັກສະນະແບບບີບອັດ (ຈຸດຈອມ, ເວັກເຕີປົກກະຕິ, ເສັ້ນສຳຜັດ, UVs). "
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການບີບອັດຮູບແບບນີ້, ຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດຈອມຈະຖືກບັນຈຸເຂົ້າໃນຄຸນລັກສະນະ RGBA16UNORM ແລະ "
"ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໃນ vertex shader. ເວັກເຕີປົກກະຕິ ແລະ ເສັ້ນສຳຜັດຈະຖືກບັນຈຸເຂົ້າໃນ RG16UNORM "
"ທີ່ແທນແກນ, ແລະ float 16-bit ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຊ່ອງ A ຂອງຈຸດຈອມ. UVs ຈະໃຊ້ float ແບບ 16-"
"bit normalized ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ float ແບບ 32-bit signed ເຕັມ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດການບີບອັດນີ້ "
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ທັງ ຈຸດຈອມ, ເວັກເຕີປົກກະຕິ, ແລະ ເສັ້ນສຳຜັດ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ສະເພາະຈຸດຈອມເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເວັກເຕີປົກກະຕິໂດຍບໍ່ມີເສັ້ນສຳຜັດໄດ້. ຕົວນຳເຂົ້າ (Importers) "
"ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການບີບອັດນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫາກສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້."

msgid "Blend shapes are normalized."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງປະສົມຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າປົກກະຕິ (normalized)."

msgid "Blend shapes are relative to base weight."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງປະສົມແມ່ນສຳພັນກັບນ້ຳໜັກພື້ນຖານ."

msgid "Parameters to be used with a [Mesh] convex decomposition operation."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບການປະຕິບັດການແຍກສ່ວນປະກອບນູນ (convex decomposition) ຂອງ [Mesh]."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], uses approximation for computing convex hulls."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ການຄຳນວນແບບປະມານ (approximation) ສຳລັບການຄຳນວນ "
"convex hulls."

msgid ""
"Controls the precision of the convex-hull generation process during the "
"clipping plane selection stage. Ranges from [code]1[/code] to [code]16[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງຂະບວນການສ້າງ convex-hull ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການເລືອກ clipping plane. "
"ມີຊ່ວງຕັ້ງແຕ່ [code]1[/code] ຫາ [code]16[/code]."

msgid "Maximum concavity. Ranges from [code]0.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr "ຄວາມວໍ້າສູງສຸດ. ມີຊ່ວງຕັ້ງແຕ່ [code]0.0[/code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/code]."

msgid "The maximum number of convex hulls to produce from the merge operation."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ convex hulls ສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະສ້າງຈາກການປະຕິບັດການລວມ (merge operation)."

msgid ""
"Controls the maximum number of triangles per convex-hull. Ranges from "
"[code]4[/code] to [code]1024[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມຈຳນວນຮູບສາມແຈສູງສຸດຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງ convex-hull. ມີຊ່ວງຕັ້ງແຕ່ [code]4[/code] ຫາ [code]1024[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Controls the adaptive sampling of the generated convex-hulls. Ranges from "
"[code]0.0[/code] to [code]0.01[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງແບບປັບຕົວ (adaptive sampling) ຂອງ convex-hulls ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ມີຊ່ວງຕັ້ງແຕ່ "
"[code]0.0[/code] ຫາ [code]0.01[/code]."

msgid "Mode for the approximate convex decomposition."
msgstr "ໂໝດສຳລັບການແຍກສ່ວນປະກອບນູນແບບປະມານ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], normalizes the mesh before applying the convex "
"decomposition."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເມຊເປັນຄ່າປົກກະຕິກ່ອນທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ການແຍກສ່ວນປະກອບນູນ."

msgid ""
"Controls the granularity of the search for the \"best\" clipping plane. "
"Ranges from [code]1[/code] to [code]16[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງການຄົ້ນຫາ clipping plane ທີ່ \"ດີທີ່ສຸດ\". ມີຊ່ວງຕັ້ງແຕ່ [code]1[/code] "
"ຫາ [code]16[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], projects output convex hull vertices onto the original "
"source mesh to increase floating-point accuracy of the results."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສາຍ (project) ຈຸດຈອມຂອງ convex hull "
"ທີ່ເປັນຜົນຮັບລົງໃສ່ເມຊຕົ້ນສະບັບ ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງເລກທົດສະນິຍົມໃນຜົນລັດ."

msgid "Maximum number of voxels generated during the voxelization stage."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ voxels ສູງສຸດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນ voxelization."

msgid ""
"Controls the bias toward clipping along revolution axes. Ranges from "
"[code]0.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມຄວາມລຳອຽງ (bias) ໄປທາງການຕັດຕາມແກນໝູນວຽນ. ມີຊ່ວງຕັ້ງແຕ່ [code]0.0[/code] ຫາ "
"[code]1.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"Controls the bias toward clipping along symmetry planes. Ranges from "
"[code]0.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມຄວາມລຳອຽງໄປທາງການຕັດຕາມລະນາບສົມມາດ (symmetry planes). ມີຊ່ວງຕັ້ງແຕ່ [code]0.0[/"
"code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/code]."

msgid "Constant for voxel-based approximate convex decomposition."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການແຍກສ່ວນປະກອບນູນແບບປະມານໂດຍໃຊ້ voxel."

msgid "Constant for tetrahedron-based approximate convex decomposition."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການແຍກສ່ວນປະກອບນູນແບບປະມານໂດຍໃຊ້ tetrahedron."

msgid "Helper tool to access and edit [Mesh] data."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນ [Mesh]."

msgid ""
"MeshDataTool provides access to individual vertices in a [Mesh]. It allows "
"users to read and edit vertex data of meshes. It also creates an array of "
"faces and edges.\n"
"To use MeshDataTool, load a mesh with [method create_from_surface]. When you "
"are finished editing the data commit the data to a mesh with [method "
"commit_to_surface].\n"
"Below is an example of how MeshDataTool may be used.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var mesh = ArrayMesh.new()\n"
"mesh.add_surface_from_arrays(Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES, "
"BoxMesh.new().get_mesh_arrays())\n"
"var mdt = MeshDataTool.new()\n"
"mdt.create_from_surface(mesh, 0)\n"
"for i in range(mdt.get_vertex_count()):\n"
"\tvar vertex = mdt.get_vertex(i)\n"
"\t# In this example we extend the mesh by one unit, which results in "
"separated faces as it is flat shaded.\n"
"\tvertex += mdt.get_vertex_normal(i)\n"
"\t# Save your change.\n"
"\tmdt.set_vertex(i, vertex)\n"
"mesh.clear_surfaces()\n"
"mdt.commit_to_surface(mesh)\n"
"var mi = MeshInstance.new()\n"
"mi.mesh = mesh\n"
"add_child(mi)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var mesh = new ArrayMesh();\n"
"mesh.AddSurfaceFromArrays(Mesh.PrimitiveType.Triangles, new "
"BoxMesh().GetMeshArrays());\n"
"var mdt = new MeshDataTool();\n"
"mdt.CreateFromSurface(mesh, 0);\n"
"for (var i = 0; i < mdt.GetVertexCount(); i++)\n"
"{\n"
"\tVector3 vertex = mdt.GetVertex(i);\n"
"\t// In this example we extend the mesh by one unit, which results in "
"separated faces as it is flat shaded.\n"
"\tvertex += mdt.GetVertexNormal(i);\n"
"\t// Save your change.\n"
"\tmdt.SetVertex(i, vertex);\n"
"}\n"
"mesh.ClearSurfaces();\n"
"mdt.CommitToSurface(mesh);\n"
"var mi = new MeshInstance();\n"
"mi.Mesh = mesh;\n"
"AddChild(mi);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"See also [ArrayMesh], [ImmediateMesh] and [SurfaceTool] for procedural "
"geometry generation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot uses clockwise [url=https://learnopengl.com/Advanced-"
"OpenGL/Face-culling]winding order[/url] for front faces of triangle primitive "
"modes."
msgstr ""
"MeshDataTool ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງແຕ່ລະຈຸດຈອມໃນ [Mesh]. ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດອ່ານ ແລະ "
"ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນຈຸດຈອມຂອງເມຊໄດ້. ມັນຍັງສ້າງອາເຣຂອງໜ້າ (faces) ແລະ ຂອບ (edges) ນຳອີກ.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ MeshDataTool, ໃຫ້ໂຫຼດເມຊດ້ວຍ [method create_from_surface]. "
"ເມື່ອທ່ານແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ ໃຫ້ຢືນຢັນ (commit) ຂໍ້ມູນລົງໃນເມຊດ້ວຍ [method "
"commit_to_surface].\n"
"ດ້ານລຸ່ມແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງວິທີການໃຊ້ MeshDataTool.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var mesh = ArrayMesh.new()\n"
"mesh.add_surface_from_arrays(Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES, "
"BoxMesh.new().get_mesh_arrays())\n"
"var mdt = MeshDataTool.new()\n"
"mdt.create_from_surface(mesh, 0)\n"
"for i in range(mdt.get_vertex_count()):\n"
"\tvar vertex = mdt.get_vertex(i)\n"
"\t# ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ພວກເຮົາຂະຫຍາຍເມຊອອກໜຶ່ງຫົວໜ່ວຍ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ໜ້າແຍກອອກຈາກກັນເນື່ອງຈາກມັນເປັນ flat "
"shaded.\n"
"\tvertex += mdt.get_vertex_normal(i)\n"
"\t# ບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"\tmdt.set_vertex(i, vertex)\n"
"mesh.clear_surfaces()\n"
"mdt.commit_to_surface(mesh)\n"
"var mi = MeshInstance.new()\n"
"mi.mesh = mesh\n"
"add_child(mi)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var mesh = new ArrayMesh();\n"
"mesh.AddSurfaceFromArrays(Mesh.PrimitiveType.Triangles, new "
"BoxMesh().GetMeshArrays());\n"
"var mdt = new MeshDataTool();\n"
"mdt.CreateFromSurface(mesh, 0);\n"
"for (var i = 0; i < mdt.GetVertexCount(); i++)\n"
"{\n"
"\tVector3 vertex = mdt.GetVertex(i);\n"
"\t// ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ພວກເຮົາຂະຫຍາຍເມຊອອກໜຶ່ງຫົວໜ່ວຍ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ໜ້າແຍກອອກຈາກກັນເນື່ອງຈາກມັນເປັນ "
"flat shaded.\n"
"\tvertex += mdt.GetVertexNormal(i);\n"
"\t// ບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"\tmdt.SetVertex(i, vertex);\n"
"}\n"
"mesh.ClearSurfaces();\n"
"mdt.CommitToSurface(mesh);\n"
"var mi = new MeshInstance();\n"
"mi.Mesh = mesh;\n"
"AddChild(mi);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [ArrayMesh], [ImmediateMesh] ແລະ [SurfaceTool] ນຳອີກ ສຳລັບການສ້າງເລຂາຄະນິດແບບ "
"procedural.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Godot ໃຊ້ [url=https://learnopengl.com/Advanced-OpenGL/Face-"
"culling]ລຳດັບການວຽນ (winding order)[/url] ແບບຕາມເຂັມໂມງ "
"ສຳລັບໜ້າດ້ານໜ້າຂອງໂໝດຮູບສາມແຈ."

msgid "Using the MeshDataTool"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ MeshDataTool"

msgid "Clears all data currently in MeshDataTool."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ MeshDataTool."

msgid "Adds a new surface to specified [Mesh] with edited data."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມພື້ນຜິວໃໝ່ໃສ່ [Mesh] ທີ່ລະບຸດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Uses specified surface of given [Mesh] to populate data for MeshDataTool.\n"
"Requires [Mesh] with primitive type [constant Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES]."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ລະບຸຂອງ [Mesh] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນໃສ່ MeshDataTool.\n"
"ຕ້ອງການ [Mesh] ທີ່ມີຊະນິດພື້ນຖານເປັນ [constant Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES]."

msgid "Returns the number of edges in this [Mesh]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນຂອບ (edges) ໃນ [Mesh] ນີ້."

msgid "Returns array of faces that touch given edge."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງໜ້າທີ່ສຳຜັດກັບຂອບທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Returns meta information assigned to given edge."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຂອບນັ້ນໆ."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the specified [param vertex] connected to the edge at "
"index [param idx].\n"
"[param vertex] can only be [code]0[/code] or [code]1[/code], as edges are "
"composed of two vertices."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນດັດສະນີຂອງ [param vertex] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ ເຊິ່ງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຂອບໃນດັດສະນີ [param idx].\n"
"[param vertex] ສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ພຽງ [code]0[/code] ຫຼື [code]1[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຂອບປະກອບດ້ວຍສອງຈຸດຈອມ."

msgid "Returns the number of faces in this [Mesh]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນໜ້າໃນ [Mesh] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the edge associated with the face at index [param idx].\n"
"[param edge] argument must be either [code]0[/code], [code]1[/code], or "
"[code]2[/code] because a face only has three edges."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂອບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໜ້າໃນດັດສະນີ [param idx].\n"
"ອາຄິວເມນ [param edge] ຕ້ອງເປັນ [code]0[/code], [code]1[/code], ຫຼື [code]2[/code] "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເພາະວ່າໜ້າໜຶ່ງມີພຽງສາມຂອບ."

msgid "Returns the metadata associated with the given face."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໜ້າທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Calculates and returns the face normal of the given face."
msgstr "ຄຳນວນ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່ານໍມອລຂອງໜ້າທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the specified vertex index of the given face.\n"
"[param vertex] must be either [code]0[/code], [code]1[/code], or [code]2[/"
"code] because faces contain three vertices.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var index = mesh_data_tool.get_face_vertex(0, 1) # Gets the index of the "
"second vertex of the first face.\n"
"var position = mesh_data_tool.get_vertex(index)\n"
"var normal = mesh_data_tool.get_vertex_normal(index)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"int index = meshDataTool.GetFaceVertex(0, 1); // Gets the index of the second "
"vertex of the first face.\n"
"Vector3 position = meshDataTool.GetVertex(index);\n"
"Vector3 normal = meshDataTool.GetVertexNormal(index);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນດັດສະນີຈຸດຈອມທີ່ລະບຸຂອງໜ້າທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້.\n"
"[param vertex] ຕ້ອງເປັນ [code]0[/code], [code]1[/code], ຫຼື [code]2[/code] "
"ເພາະວ່າໜ້າປະກອບດ້ວຍສາມຈຸດຈອມ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var index = mesh_data_tool.get_face_vertex(0, 1) # "
"ດຶງເອົາດັດສະນີຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີສອງຂອງໜ້າທຳອິດ.\n"
"var position = mesh_data_tool.get_vertex(index)\n"
"var normal = mesh_data_tool.get_vertex_normal(index)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"int index = meshDataTool.GetFaceVertex(0, 1); // "
"ດຶງເອົາດັດສະນີຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີສອງຂອງໜ້າທຳອິດ.\n"
"Vector3 position = meshDataTool.GetVertex(index);\n"
"Vector3 normal = meshDataTool.GetVertexNormal(index);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns the [Mesh]'s format as a combination of the [enum Mesh.ArrayFormat] "
"flags. For example, a mesh containing both vertices and normals would return "
"a format of [code]3[/code] because [constant Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_VERTEX] is "
"[code]1[/code] and [constant Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_NORMAL] is [code]2[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຮູບແບບຂອງ [Mesh] ໃນຖານະເປັນການລວມກັນຂອງແຟລັກ [enum Mesh.ArrayFormat]. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ເມັດຊ໌ທີ່ມີທັງຈຸດຈອມ ແລະ ນໍມອລ ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຮູບແບບເປັນ [code]3[/code] ເພາະວ່າ [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_VERTEX] ແມ່ນ [code]1[/code] ແລະ [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_FORMAT_NORMAL] ແມ່ນ [code]2[/code]."

msgid "Returns the material assigned to the [Mesh]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວັດສະດຸທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ [Mesh]."

msgid "Returns the position of the given vertex."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Returns the bones of the given vertex."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນກະດູກຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Returns the color of the given vertex."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສີຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Returns the total number of vertices in [Mesh]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຈຸດຈອມທັງໝົດໃນ [Mesh]."

msgid "Returns an array of edges that share the given vertex."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງຂອບທີ່ໃຊ້ຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຮ່ວມກັນ."

msgid "Returns an array of faces that share the given vertex."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງໜ້າທີ່ໃຊ້ຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຮ່ວມກັນ."

msgid "Returns the metadata associated with the given vertex."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Returns the normal of the given vertex."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່ານໍມອລຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Returns the tangent of the given vertex."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າແທນເຈນຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Returns the UV of the given vertex."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ UV ຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Returns the UV2 of the given vertex."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ UV2 ຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Returns bone weights of the given vertex."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນນ້ຳໜັກກະດູກຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Sets the metadata of the given edge."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາຂອງຂອບທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Sets the metadata of the given face."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາຂອງໜ້າທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Sets the material to be used by newly-constructed [Mesh]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວັດສະດຸທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໂດຍ [Mesh] ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່."

msgid "Sets the position of the given vertex."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Sets the bones of the given vertex."
msgstr "ກຳນົດກະດູກຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Sets the color of the given vertex."
msgstr "ກຳນົດສີຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Sets the metadata associated with the given vertex."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Sets the normal of the given vertex."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່ານໍມອລຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the tangent of the given vertex.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Even though [param tangent] is a [Plane], it does not directly "
"represent the tangent plane. Its [member Plane.x], [member Plane.y], and "
"[member Plane.z] represent the tangent vector and [member Plane.d] should be "
"either [code]-1[/code] or [code]1[/code]. See also [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_TANGENT]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າແທນເຈນຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ [param tangent] ຈະເປັນ [Plane], "
"ແຕ່ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ແທນລະນາບແທນເຈນໂດຍກົງ. [member Plane.x], [member Plane.y], ແລະ [member "
"Plane.z] ຂອງມັນແທນເວກເຕີແທນເຈນ ແລະ [member Plane.d] ຄວນເປັນ [code]-1[/code] ຫຼື "
"[code]1[/code]. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [constant Mesh.ARRAY_TANGENT]."

msgid "Sets the UV of the given vertex."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ UV ຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Sets the UV2 of the given vertex."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ UV2 ຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Sets the bone weights of the given vertex."
msgstr "ກຳນົດນ້ຳໜັກກະດູກຂອງຈຸດຈອມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Node used for displaying a [Mesh] in 2D."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນ [Mesh] ໃນຮູບແບບ 2D."

msgid ""
"Node used for displaying a [Mesh] in 2D. This can be faster to render "
"compared to displaying a [Sprite2D] node with large transparent areas, "
"especially if the node takes up a lot of space on screen at high viewport "
"resolutions. This is because using a mesh designed to fit the sprite's opaque "
"areas will reduce GPU fill rate utilization (at the cost of increased vertex "
"processing utilization).\n"
"When a [Mesh] has to be instantiated more than thousands of times close to "
"each other, consider using a [MultiMesh] in a [MultiMeshInstance2D] instead.\n"
"A [MeshInstance2D] can be created from an existing [Sprite2D] via a tool in "
"the editor toolbar. Select the [Sprite2D] node, then choose [b]Sprite2D > "
"Convert to MeshInstance2D[/b] at the top of the 2D editor viewport."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນ [Mesh] ໃນຮູບແບບ 2D. "
"ນີ້ອາດຈະສະແດງຜົນໄດ້ໄວກວ່າເມື່ອທຽບກັບການສະແດງຜົນໂນດ [Sprite2D] ທີ່ມີພື້ນທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, "
"ໂດຍສະເພາະຖ້າໂນດນັ້ນໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ຫຼາຍໃນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດສູງ. "
"ນີ້ເປັນເພາະວ່າການໃຊ້ເມັດຊ໌ທີ່ຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບພື້ນທີ່ທຶບແສງຂອງສະໄປຣ໌ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການໃຊ້ GPU fill "
"rate (ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບການໃຊ້ການປະມວນຜົນຈຸດຈອມທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ).\n"
"ເມື່ອ [Mesh] ຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍກວ່າພັນເທື່ອໃນໄລຍະໃກ້ກັນ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາການໃຊ້ [MultiMesh] ໃນ "
"[MultiMeshInstance2D] ແທນ.\n"
"[MeshInstance2D] ສາມາດສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກ [Sprite2D] ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວຜ່ານເຄື່ອງມືໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມືຂອງເອດິເຕີ. "
"ເລືອກໂນດ [Sprite2D], ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກ [b]Sprite2D > Convert to MeshInstance2D[/b] "
"ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງ 2D editor viewport."

msgid "2D meshes"
msgstr "ເມັດຊ໌ 2 ມິຕິ (2D)"

msgid "The [Mesh] that will be drawn by the [MeshInstance2D]."
msgstr "[Mesh] ທີ່ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໂດຍ [MeshInstance2D]."

msgid ""
"The [Texture2D] that will be used if using the default [CanvasItemMaterial]. "
"Can be accessed as [code]TEXTURE[/code] in CanvasItem shader."
msgstr ""
"[Texture2D] ທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຫາກໃຊ້ [CanvasItemMaterial] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໃນຖານະ "
"[code]TEXTURE[/code] ໃນ CanvasItem shader."

msgid "Emitted when the [member texture] is changed."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອ [member texture] ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "Node that instances meshes into a scenario."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງເມັດຊ໌ເຂົ້າໃນສາກ."

msgid ""
"MeshInstance3D is a node that takes a [Mesh] resource and adds it to the "
"current scenario by creating an instance of it. This is the class most often "
"used to render 3D geometry and can be used to instance a single [Mesh] in "
"many places. This allows reusing geometry, which can save on resources. When "
"a [Mesh] has to be instantiated more than thousands of times at close "
"proximity, consider using a [MultiMesh] in a [MultiMeshInstance3D] instead."
msgstr ""
"MeshInstance3D ແມ່ນໂນດທີ່ຮັບຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Mesh] ແລະ "
"ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນສາກປັດຈຸບັນໂດຍການສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງມັນ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄລາສທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍທີ່ສຸດເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນເລຂາຄະນິດ 3 ມິຕິ ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງ "
"[Mesh] ດຽວກັນໃນຫຼາຍໆບ່ອນ. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ເລຂາຄະນິດຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍປະຢັດຊັບພະຍາກອນ. "
"ເມື່ອ [Mesh] ຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍກວ່າພັນເທື່ອໃນໄລຍະໃກ້ກັນ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາການໃຊ້ [MultiMesh] ໃນ "
"[MultiMeshInstance3D] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Takes a snapshot from the current [ArrayMesh] with all blend shapes applied "
"according to their current weights and bakes it to the provided [param "
"existing] mesh. If no [param existing] mesh is provided a new [ArrayMesh] is "
"created, baked and returned. Mesh surface materials are not copied.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [Mesh] data needs to be received from the GPU, stalling "
"the [RenderingServer] in the process."
msgstr ""
"ຖ່າຍພາບສະແນັບຊັອດຈາກ [ArrayMesh] ປັດຈຸບັນ ໂດຍມີການນຳໃຊ້ blend shapes ທັງໝົດຕາມນ້ຳໜັກປັດຈຸບັນ "
"ແລະ ເບກ (bake) ມັນລົງໃນເມັດຊ໌ [param existing] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ຫາກບໍ່ມີເມັດຊ໌ [param "
"existing], [ArrayMesh] ໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ເບກ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນໃຫ້. "
"ວັດສະດຸພື້ນຜິວຂອງເມັດຊ໌ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຄັດລອກ.\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] ຂໍ້ມູນ [Mesh] ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບຈາກ GPU, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ [RenderingServer] "
"ຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການ."

msgid ""
"Takes a snapshot of the current animated skeleton pose of the skinned mesh "
"and bakes it to the provided [param existing] mesh. If no [param existing] "
"mesh is provided a new [ArrayMesh] is created, baked, and returned. Requires "
"a skeleton with a registered skin to work. Blendshapes are ignored. Mesh "
"surface materials are not copied.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [Mesh] data needs to be retrieved from the GPU, stalling "
"the [RenderingServer] in the process."
msgstr ""
"ຖ່າຍພາບສະແນັບຊັອດຂອງທ່າທາງໂຄງກະດູກທີ່ກຳລັງເຄື່ອນໄຫວປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ skinned mesh ແລະ ເບກ (bake) "
"ມັນລົງໃນເມັດຊ໌ [param existing] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ຫາກບໍ່ມີເມັດຊ໌ [param existing], [ArrayMesh] "
"ໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ເບກ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນໃຫ້. ຕ້ອງມີໂຄງກະດູກທີ່ມີການລົງທະບຽນຜິວ (skin) ຈຶ່ງຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. "
"Blendshapes ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ. ວັດສະດຸພື້ນຜິວຂອງເມັດຊ໌ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຄັດລອກ.\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] ຂໍ້ມູນ [Mesh] ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຖືກດຶງມາຈາກ GPU, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ "
"[RenderingServer] ຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການ."

msgid ""
"This helper creates a [StaticBody3D] child node with a [ConvexPolygonShape3D] "
"collision shape calculated from the mesh geometry. It's mainly used for "
"testing.\n"
"If [param clean] is [code]true[/code] (default), duplicate and interior "
"vertices are removed automatically. You can set it to [code]false[/code] to "
"make the process faster if not needed.\n"
"If [param simplify] is [code]true[/code], the geometry can be further "
"simplified to reduce the number of vertices. Disabled by default."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຊ່ວຍນີ້ຈະສ້າງໂນດລູກ [StaticBody3D] ທີ່ມີຮູບຮ່າງການຕຳ [ConvexPolygonShape3D] "
"ທີ່ຄຳນວນຈາກເລຂາຄະນິດຂອງເມັດຊ໌. ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອການທົດສອບເປັນຫຼັກ.\n"
"ຫາກ [param clean] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຈຸດຈອມທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນ ແລະ "
"ຢູ່ພາຍໃນຈະຖືກລຶບອອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະບວນການໄວຂຶ້ນຫາກບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ.\n"
"ຫາກ [param simplify] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ເລຂາຄະນິດສາມາດຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນຕື່ມເພື່ອຫຼຸດຈຳນວນຈຸດຈອມ. ປິດການໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"This helper creates a [MeshInstance3D] child node with gizmos at every vertex "
"calculated from the mesh geometry. It's mainly used for testing."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຊ່ວຍນີ້ຈະສ້າງໂນດລູກ [MeshInstance3D] ທີ່ມີ gizmos "
"ຢູ່ທຸກໆຈຸດຈອມທີ່ຄຳນວນຈາກເລຂາຄະນິດຂອງເມັດຊ໌. ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອການທົດສອບເປັນຫຼັກ."

msgid ""
"This helper creates a [StaticBody3D] child node with multiple "
"[ConvexPolygonShape3D] collision shapes calculated from the mesh geometry via "
"convex decomposition. The convex decomposition operation can be controlled "
"with parameters from the optional [param settings]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຊ່ວຍນີ້ຈະສ້າງໂນດລູກ [StaticBody3D] ທີ່ມີຮູບຮ່າງການຕຳ [ConvexPolygonShape3D] "
"ຫຼາຍອັນທີ່ຄຳນວນຈາກເລຂາຄະນິດຂອງເມັດຊ໌ຜ່ານການແຍກສ່ວນແບບນູນ (convex decomposition). "
"ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການແຍກສ່ວນແບບນູນສາມາດຄວບຄຸມໄດ້ດ້ວຍພາລາມິເຕີຈາກ [param settings] "
"ທີ່ເປັນທາງເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"This helper creates a [StaticBody3D] child node with a "
"[ConcavePolygonShape3D] collision shape calculated from the mesh geometry. "
"It's mainly used for testing."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຊ່ວຍນີ້ຈະສ້າງໂນດລູກ [StaticBody3D] ທີ່ມີຮູບຮ່າງການຕຳ [ConcavePolygonShape3D] "
"ທີ່ຄຳນວນຈາກເລຂາຄະນິດຂອງເມັດຊ໌. ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອການທົດສອບເປັນຫຼັກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the blend shape with the given [param name]. Returns "
"[code]-1[/code] if no blend shape with this name exists, including when "
"[member mesh] is [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນດັດສະນີຂອງ blend shape ທີ່ມີ [param name] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]-1[/code] ຫາກບໍ່ມີ "
"blend shape ຊື່ນີ້ຢູ່, ລວມເຖິງກໍລະນີທີ່ [member mesh] ເປັນ [code]null[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Material] that will be used by the [Mesh] when drawing. This can "
"return the [member GeometryInstance3D.material_override], the surface "
"override [Material] defined in this [MeshInstance3D], or the surface "
"[Material] defined in the [member mesh]. For example, if [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.material_override] is used, all surfaces will return the "
"override material.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if no material is active, including when [member "
"mesh] is [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Material] ທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ [Mesh] ໃນເວລາແຕ້ມ. ນີ້ສາມາດສົ່ງຄືນ [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.material_override], ວັດສະດຸຄຸມພື້ນຜິວ (surface override "
"[Material]) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ [MeshInstance3D] ນີ້, ຫຼື ວັດສະດຸພື້ນຜິວທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ [member mesh]. "
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກມີການໃຊ້ [member GeometryInstance3D.material_override], "
"ທຸກໆພື້ນຜິວຈະສົ່ງຄືນວັດສະດຸຄຸມນັ້ນ.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] ຫາກບໍ່ມີວັດສະດຸໃດເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ລວມເຖິງກໍລະນີທີ່ [member mesh] ເປັນ "
"[code]null[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of blend shapes available. Produces an error if [member "
"mesh] is [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຂອງ blend shapes ທີ່ມີຢູ່. ຈະເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຫາກ [member mesh] ເປັນ [code]null[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the value of the blend shape at the given [param blend_shape_idx]. "
"Returns [code]0.0[/code] and produces an error if [member mesh] is "
"[code]null[/code] or doesn't have a blend shape at that index."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂອງ blend shape ໃນດັດສະນີ [param blend_shape_idx] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]0.0[/code] ແລະ ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຫາກ [member mesh] ເປັນ [code]null[/code] ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີ "
"blend shape ໃນດັດສະນີນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the internal [SkinReference] containing the skeleton's [RID] attached "
"to this RID. See also [method Resource.get_rid], [method "
"SkinReference.get_skeleton], and [method "
"RenderingServer.instance_attach_skeleton]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [SkinReference] ພາຍໃນທີ່ມີ [RID] ຂອງໂຄງກະດູກທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບ RID ນີ້. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [method "
"Resource.get_rid], [method SkinReference.get_skeleton], ແລະ [method "
"RenderingServer.instance_attach_skeleton]."

msgid ""
"Returns the override [Material] for the specified [param surface] of the "
"[Mesh] resource. See also [method get_surface_override_material_count].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This returns the [Material] associated to the [MeshInstance3D]'s "
"Surface Material Override properties, not the material within the [Mesh] "
"resource. To get the material within the [Mesh] resource, use [method "
"Mesh.surface_get_material] instead."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນວັດສະດຸຄຸມ ([Material] override) ສຳລັບ [param surface] ທີ່ລະບຸຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນ "
"[Mesh]. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [method get_surface_override_material_count].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [Material] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄຸນສົມບັດ Surface Material Override "
"ຂອງ [MeshInstance3D], ບໍ່ແມ່ນວັດສະດຸພາຍໃນຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Mesh]. "
"ເພື່ອດຶງເອົາວັດສະດຸພາຍໃນຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Mesh], ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method Mesh.surface_get_material] "
"ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of surface override materials. This is equivalent to "
"[method Mesh.get_surface_count]. See also [method "
"get_surface_override_material]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຂອງວັດສະດຸຄຸມພື້ນຜິວ. ນີ້ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [method Mesh.get_surface_count]. "
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [method get_surface_override_material]."

msgid ""
"Sets the value of the blend shape at [param blend_shape_idx] to [param "
"value]. Produces an error if [member mesh] is [code]null[/code] or doesn't "
"have a blend shape at that index."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງ blend shape ທີ່ [param blend_shape_idx] ໃຫ້ເປັນ [param value]. "
"ຈະເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຫາກ [member mesh] ເປັນ [code]null[/code] ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີ blend shape ໃນດັດສະນີນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the override [param material] for the specified [param surface] of the "
"[Mesh] resource. This material is associated with this [MeshInstance3D] "
"rather than with [member mesh].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This assigns the [Material] associated to the [MeshInstance3D]'s "
"Surface Material Override properties, not the material within the [Mesh] "
"resource. To set the material within the [Mesh] resource, use [method "
"Mesh.surface_set_material] instead."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວັດສະດຸຄຸມ ([param material] override) ສຳລັບ [param surface] ທີ່ລະບຸຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນ "
"[Mesh]. ວັດສະດຸນີ້ຈະກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [MeshInstance3D] ນີ້ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ [member mesh].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນການກຳນົດ [Material] ໃຫ້ກັບຄຸນສົມບັດ Surface Material Override "
"ຂອງ [MeshInstance3D], ບໍ່ແມ່ນວັດສະດຸພາຍໃນຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Mesh]. "
"ເພື່ອກຳນົດວັດສະດຸພາຍໃນຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Mesh], ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method Mesh.surface_set_material] "
"ແທນ."

msgid "The [Mesh] resource for the instance."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Mesh] ສຳລັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

msgid ""
"[NodePath] to the [Skeleton3D] associated with the instance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default value of this property has changed in Godot 4.6. "
"Enable [member ProjectSettings.animation/compatibility/"
"default_parent_skeleton_in_mesh_instance_3d] if the old behavior is needed "
"for compatibility."
msgstr ""
"[NodePath] ໄປຫາ [Skeleton3D] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງໃນ Godot 4.6. ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"ProjectSettings.animation/compatibility/"
"default_parent_skeleton_in_mesh_instance_3d] "
"ຫາກຕ້ອງການພຶດຕິກຳແບບເກົ່າເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້."

msgid "The [Skin] to be used by this instance."
msgstr "[Skin] ທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ນີ້."

msgid "Library of meshes."
msgstr "ຄັງສະສົມຂອງເມັດຊ໌."

msgid ""
"A library of meshes. Contains a list of [Mesh] resources, each with a name "
"and ID. Each item can also include collision and navigation shapes. This "
"resource is used in [GridMap]."
msgstr ""
"ຄັງສະສົມຂອງເມັດຊ໌. ປະກອບດ້ວຍລາຍຊື່ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Mesh], ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະອັນມີຊື່ ແລະ ID. "
"ແຕ່ລະລາຍການຍັງສາມາດລວມເອົາຮູບຮ່າງການຕຳ ແລະ ຮູບຮ່າງການນຳທາງ (navigation shapes). "
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນ [GridMap]."

msgid "Clears the library."
msgstr "ລຶບລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນໃນຄັງສະສົມ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new item in the library with the given ID.\n"
"You can get an unused ID from [method get_last_unused_item_id]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງລາຍການໃໝ່ໃນຄັງສະສົມດ້ວຍ ID ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້.\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດຂໍເອົາ ID ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຈາກ [method get_last_unused_item_id]."

msgid ""
"Returns the first item with the given name, or [code]-1[/code] if no item is "
"found."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການທຳອິດທີ່ມີຊື່ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້, ຫຼື [code]-1[/code] ຫາກບໍ່ພົບລາຍການໃດ."

msgid "Returns the number of items present in the library."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນລາຍການທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຄັງສະສົມ."

msgid "Returns the list of item IDs in use."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ຂອງ ID ລາຍການທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່."

msgid "Returns the item's mesh."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເມັດຊ໌ຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "Returns the item's shadow casting mode."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໂໝດການເກີດເງົາຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "Returns the transform applied to the item's mesh."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນການແປງ (transform) ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບເມັດຊ໌ຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "Returns the item's name."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "Returns the item's navigation layers bitmask."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນບິດມາກສ໌ (bitmask) ຂອງເລເຢີນຳທາງຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "Returns the item's navigation mesh."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເມັດຊ໌ນຳທາງຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "Returns the transform applied to the item's navigation mesh."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນການແປງ (transform) ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບເມັດຊ໌ນຳທາງຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid ""
"When running in the editor, returns a generated item preview (a 3D rendering "
"in isometric perspective). When used in a running project, returns the "
"manually-defined item preview which can be set using [method "
"set_item_preview]. Returns an empty [Texture2D] if no preview was manually "
"set in a running project."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກໃນເອດິເຕີ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນພາບຕົວຢ່າງລາຍການທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ (ການສະແດງຜົນ 3D "
"ໃນມຸມມອງໄອໂຊເມຕຣິກ). ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນພາບຕົວຢ່າງລາຍການທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເຊິ່ງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method set_item_preview]. "
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Texture2D] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ຫາກບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າພາບຕົວຢ່າງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns an item's collision shapes.\n"
"The array consists of each [Shape3D] followed by its [Transform3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຮູບຮ່າງການຕຳຂອງລາຍການ.\n"
"ອາເຣປະກອບດ້ວຍແຕ່ລະ [Shape3D] ຕາມດ້ວຍ [Transform3D] ຂອງມັນ."

msgid "Gets an unused ID for a new item."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາ ID ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບລາຍການໃໝ່."

msgid "Removes the item."
msgstr "ລຶບລາຍການອອກ."

msgid "Sets the item's mesh."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເມັດຊ໌ຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "Sets the item's shadow casting mode to [param shadow_casting_setting]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດໂໝດການເກີດເງົາຂອງລາຍການໃຫ້ເປັນ [param shadow_casting_setting]."

msgid "Sets the transform to apply to the item's mesh."
msgstr "ກຳນົດການແປງ (transform) ທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ກັບເມັດຊ໌ຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid ""
"Sets the item's name.\n"
"This name is shown in the editor. It can also be used to look up the item "
"later using [method find_item_by_name]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຊື່ຂອງລາຍການ.\n"
"ຊື່ນີ້ຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນເອດິເຕີ. ມັນຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາລາຍການໃນພາຍຫຼັງໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"find_item_by_name]."

msgid "Sets the item's navigation layers bitmask."
msgstr "ກຳນົດບິດມາກສ໌ (bitmask) ຂອງເລເຢີນຳທາງຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "Sets the item's navigation mesh."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເມັດຊ໌ນຳທາງຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "Sets the transform to apply to the item's navigation mesh."
msgstr "ກຳນົດການແປງ (transform) ທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ກັບເມັດຊ໌ນຳທາງຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "Sets a texture to use as the item's preview icon in the editor."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເທັກເຈີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນໄອຄອນພາບຕົວຢ່າງຂອງລາຍການໃນເອດິເຕີ."

msgid ""
"Sets an item's collision shapes.\n"
"The array should consist of [Shape3D] objects, each followed by a "
"[Transform3D] that will be applied to it. For shapes that should not have a "
"transform, use [constant Transform3D.IDENTITY]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຮູບຮ່າງການຕຳຂອງລາຍການ.\n"
"ອາເຣຄວນປະກອບດ້ວຍອອບເຈັກ [Shape3D], ແຕ່ລະອັນຕາມດ້ວຍ [Transform3D] ທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບມັນ. "
"ສຳລັບຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ບໍ່ຄວນມີການແປງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [constant Transform3D.IDENTITY]."

msgid "Simple texture that uses a mesh to draw itself."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີແບບງ່າຍໆ ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມັດຊ໌ເພື່ອແຕ້ມຕົວມັນເອງ."

msgid ""
"Simple texture that uses a mesh to draw itself. It's limited because flags "
"can't be changed and region drawing is not supported."
msgstr ""
"ເທັກເຈີແບບງ່າຍໆ ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມັດຊ໌ເພື່ອແຕ້ມຕົວມັນເອງ. ມັນມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດເນື່ອງຈາກບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງແຟລັກ (flags) ໄດ້ "
"ແລະ ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການແຕ້ມແບບກຳນົດຂອບເຂດ (region drawing)."

msgid "Sets the base texture that the Mesh will use to draw."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເທັກເຈີພື້ນຖານທີ່ເມັດຊ໌ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ້ມ."

msgid "Sets the size of the image, needed for reference."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຂະໜາດຂອງຮູບພາບ, ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການອ້າງອີງ."

msgid "Sets the mesh used to draw. It must be a mesh using 2D vertices."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເມັດຊ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ້ມ. ມັນຕ້ອງເປັນເມັດຊ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ຈຸດຈອມແບບ 2 ມິຕິ."

msgid ""
"Interpolates an abstract value and supplies it to a method called over time."
msgstr "ແຊກຄ່າ (Interpolates) ຄ່ານາມມະທຳ ແລະ ສົ່ງໃຫ້ກັບເມທອດທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຕາມໄລຍະເວລາ."

msgid ""
"[MethodTweener] is similar to a combination of [CallbackTweener] and "
"[PropertyTweener]. It calls a method providing an interpolated value as a "
"parameter. See [method Tween.tween_method] for more usage information.\n"
"The tweener will finish automatically if the callback's target object is "
"freed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method Tween.tween_method] is the only correct way to create "
"[MethodTweener]. Any [MethodTweener] created manually will not function "
"correctly."
msgstr ""
"[MethodTweener] ມີຄວາມຄ້າຍຄືກັບການລວມກັນຂອງ [CallbackTweener] ແລະ "
"[PropertyTweener]. ມັນຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດໂດຍການໃຫ້ຄ່າທີ່ຖືກແຊກ (interpolated value) "
"ເປັນພາລາມິເຕີ. ເບິ່ງ [method Tween.tween_method] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນການໃຊ້ງານເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"ຕົວທວີນ (tweener) ຈະສິ້ນສຸດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫາກອອບເຈັກເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງຄໍແບັກ (callback) "
"ຖືກຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ (freed).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method Tween.tween_method] ແມ່ນວິທີດຽວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນການສ້າງ "
"[MethodTweener]. [MethodTweener] ໃດໆ ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the time in seconds after which the [MethodTweener] will start "
"interpolating. By default there's no delay."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດເວລາເປັນວິນາທີ ເຊິ່ງຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ [MethodTweener] ຈະເລີ່ມແຊກຄ່າ. "
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນບໍ່ມີການໜ່ວງເວລາ."

msgid ""
"Sets the type of used easing from [enum Tween.EaseType]. If not set, the "
"default easing is used from the [Tween] that contains this Tweener."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດປະເພດຂອງ easing ທີ່ໃຊ້ຈາກ [enum Tween.EaseType]. ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດ, ຈະໃຊ້ easing "
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ [Tween] ທີ່ບັນຈຸ Tweener ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the type of used transition from [enum Tween.TransitionType]. If not "
"set, the default transition is used from the [Tween] that contains this "
"Tweener."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດປະເພດຂອງການປ່ຽນຜ່ານ (transition) ທີ່ໃຊ້ຈາກ [enum Tween.TransitionType]. "
"ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດ, ຈະໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ [Tween] ທີ່ບັນຈຸ Tweener ນີ້."

msgid ""
"An internal editor class intended for keeping the data of unrecognized nodes."
msgstr "ຄລາສເອດິເຕີພາຍໃນທີ່ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງໂນດທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ."

msgid ""
"This is an internal editor class intended for keeping data of nodes of "
"unknown type (most likely this type was supplied by an extension that is no "
"longer loaded). It can't be manually instantiated or placed in a scene.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Ignore missing nodes unless you know what you are doing. "
"Existing properties on a missing node can be freely modified in code, "
"regardless of the type they are intended to be."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄລາສເອດິເຕີພາຍໃນທີ່ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງໂນດທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກປະເພດ "
"(ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນປະເພດທີ່ຖືກສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍສ່ວນເສີມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໂຫຼດອີກຕໍ່ໄປ). "
"ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ຫຼື ວາງໄວ້ໃນສາກໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ໃຫ້ລະເລີຍໂນດທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ທ່ານຈະຮູ້ວ່າກຳລັງເຮັດຫຍັງຢູ່. "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໂນດທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປສາມາດຖືກແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຢ່າງອິດສະຫຼະໃນໂຄ້ດ, "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງປະເພດທີ່ພວກມັນຄວນຈະເປັນ."

msgid ""
"The name of the class this node was supposed to be (see [method "
"Object.get_class])."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງຄລາສທີ່ໂນດນີ້ຄວນຈະເປັນ (ເບິ່ງ [method Object.get_class])."

msgid "Returns the path of the scene this node was instance of originally."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງຂອງສາກທີ່ໂນດນີ້ເຄີຍເປັນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃນຕອນທຳອິດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows new properties to be set along with existing "
"ones. If [code]false[/code], only existing properties' values can be set, and "
"new properties cannot be added."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ໄປພ້ອມກັບອັນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ຫາກເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code], ຈະສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ສະເພາະຄ່າຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows new signals to be connected to along with "
"existing ones. If [code]false[/code], only existing signals can be connected "
"to, and new signals cannot be added."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານໃໝ່ໄປພ້ອມກັບອັນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ຫາກເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code], ຈະສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້ສະເພາະສັນຍານທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມສັນຍານໃໝ່ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"An internal editor class intended for keeping the data of unrecognized "
"resources."
msgstr "ຄລາສເອດິເຕີພາຍໃນທີ່ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ."

msgid ""
"This is an internal editor class intended for keeping data of resources of "
"unknown type (most likely this type was supplied by an extension that is no "
"longer loaded). It can't be manually instantiated or placed in a scene.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Ignore missing resources unless you know what you are doing. "
"Existing properties on a missing resource can be freely modified in code, "
"regardless of the type they are intended to be."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄລາສເອດິເຕີພາຍໃນທີ່ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກປະເພດ "
"(ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນປະເພດທີ່ຖືກສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍສ່ວນເສີມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໂຫຼດອີກຕໍ່ໄປ). "
"ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ຫຼື ວາງໄວ້ໃນສາກໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ໃຫ້ລະເລີຍຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ທ່ານຈະຮູ້ວ່າກຳລັງເຮັດຫຍັງຢູ່. "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປສາມາດຖືກແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຢ່າງອິດສະຫຼະໃນໂຄ້ດ, "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງປະເພດທີ່ພວກມັນຄວນຈະເປັນ."

msgid ""
"The name of the class this resource was supposed to be (see [method "
"Object.get_class])."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງຄລາສທີ່ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ຄວນຈະເປັນ (ເບິ່ງ [method Object.get_class])."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], allows new properties to be added on top of the "
"existing ones with [method Object.set]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ໃສ່ເທິງອັນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວດ້ວຍ [method "
"Object.set]."

msgid "Generic mobile VR implementation."
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກ VR ເທິງມືຖືແບບທົ່ວໄປ."

msgid ""
"This is a generic mobile VR implementation where you need to provide details "
"about the phone and HMD used. It does not rely on any existing framework. "
"This is the most basic interface we have. For the best effect, you need a "
"mobile phone with a gyroscope and accelerometer.\n"
"Note that even though there is no positional tracking, the camera will assume "
"the headset is at a height of 1.85 meters. You can change this by setting "
"[member eye_height].\n"
"You can initialize this interface as follows:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var interface = XRServer.find_interface(\"Native mobile\")\n"
"if interface and interface.initialize():\n"
"\tget_viewport().use_xr = true\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For Android, [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/"
"enable_accelerometer], [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/"
"enable_gravity], [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/"
"enable_gyroscope] and [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/"
"enable_magnetometer] must be enabled."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນການເຮັດວຽກ VR ເທິງມືຖືແບບທົ່ວໄປ ທີ່ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບໂທລະສັບ ແລະ HMD ທີ່ໃຊ້. "
"ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຶ້ນກັບເຟຣມເວີກ (framework) ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ນີ້ແມ່ນອິນເຕີເຟດພື້ນຖານທີ່ສຸດທີ່ພວກເຮົາມີ. "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນດີທີ່ສຸດ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໂທລະສັບມືຖືທີ່ມີ gyroscope ແລະ accelerometer.\n"
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີການຕິດຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງ (positional tracking), ແຕ່ກ້ອງຈະສົມມຸດວ່າເຮັດເຊັດ "
"(headset) ຢູ່ທີ່ຄວາມສູງ 1.85 ແມັດ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງຄ່ານີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງ [member "
"eye_height].\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງອິນເຕີເຟດນີ້ໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var interface = XRServer.find_interface(\"Native mobile\")\n"
"if interface and interface.initialize():\n"
"\tget_viewport().use_xr = true\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບ Android, ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/"
"sensors/enable_accelerometer], [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/"
"enable_gravity], [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/"
"enable_gyroscope] ແລະ [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/"
"enable_magnetometer]."

msgid ""
"The distance between the display and the lenses inside of the device in "
"centimeters."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ເລນພາຍໃນອຸປະກອນ ເປັນຊັງຕີແມັດ."

msgid "The width of the display in centimeters."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງໜ້າຈໍເປັນຊັງຕີແມັດ."

msgid ""
"The height at which the camera is placed in relation to the ground (i.e. "
"[XROrigin3D] node)."
msgstr "ຄວາມສູງທີ່ກ້ອງຖືກວາງໄວ້ ເມື່ອທຽບກັບພື້ນດິນ (ຄື ໂນດ [XROrigin3D])."

msgid ""
"The interocular distance, also known as the interpupillary distance. The "
"distance between the pupils of the left and right eye."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງລູກຕາ (interocular distance), ຫຼື ທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກກັນໃນຊື່ interpupillary "
"distance. ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງຕາດຳຂອງຕາຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຕາຂວາ."

msgid ""
"The k1 lens factor is one of the two constants that define the strength of "
"the lens used and directly influences the lens distortion effect."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ k1 lens factor ແມ່ນໜຶ່ງໃນສອງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ທີ່ກຳນົດຄວາມແຮງຂອງເລນທີ່ໃຊ້ ແລະ "
"ມີອິດທິພົນໂດຍກົງຕໍ່ເອັບເຟັກການບິດເບືອນຂອງເລນ."

msgid "The k2 lens factor, see k1."
msgstr "ຄ່າ k2 lens factor, ເບິ່ງ k1."

msgid ""
"Set the offset rect relative to the area being rendered. A length of 1 "
"represents the whole rendering area on that axis."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ offset rect ທຽບກັບພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກສະແດງຜົນ. ຄວາມຍາວ 1 ແທນພື້ນທີ່ສະແດງຜົນທັງໝົດໃນແກນນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The oversample setting. Because of the lens distortion we have to render our "
"buffers at a higher resolution then the screen can natively handle. A value "
"between 1.5 and 2.0 often provides good results but at the cost of "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ oversample. ເນື່ອງຈາກການບິດເບືອນຂອງເລນ, ພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສະແດງຜົນບັບເຟີ "
"(buffers) ຂອງພວກເຮົາໃນຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ສູງກວ່າທີ່ໜ້າຈໍສາມາດຮອງຮັບໄດ້ຕາມທຳມະຊາດ. ຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 1.5 "
"ແລະ 2.0 ມັກຈະໃຫ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ດີ ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບປະສິດທິພາບ."

msgid ""
"The minimum radius around the focal point where full quality is guaranteed if "
"VRS is used as a percentage of screen size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Mobile and Forward+ renderers only. Requires [member "
"Viewport.vrs_mode] to be set to [constant Viewport.VRS_XR]."
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີຕໍ່າສຸດອ້ອມຮອບຈຸດໂຟກັດທີ່ຮັບປະກັນຄຸນນະພາບເຕັມສ່ວນ ຫາກມີການໃຊ້ VRS ເປັນເປີເຊັນຂອງຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສະເພາະຕົວສະແດງຜົນ Mobile ແລະ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງ [member "
"Viewport.vrs_mode] ເປັນ [constant Viewport.VRS_XR]."

msgid ""
"The strength used to calculate the VRS density map. The greater this value, "
"the more noticeable VRS is. This improves performance at the cost of "
"quality.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Mobile and Forward+ renderers only. Requires [member "
"Viewport.vrs_mode] to be set to [constant Viewport.VRS_XR]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຄຳນວນແຜນທີ່ຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງ VRS. ຍິ່ງຄ່ານີ້ຫຼາຍເທົ່າໃດ, VRS "
"ກໍຈະຍິ່ງສັງເກດເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນຂຶ້ນ. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບ ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບຄຸນນະພາບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສະເພາະຕົວສະແດງຜົນ Mobile ແລະ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງ [member "
"Viewport.vrs_mode] ເປັນ [constant Viewport.VRS_XR]."

msgid ""
"А node that dynamically copies the 3D transform of a bone in its parent "
"[Skeleton3D]."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດທີ່ຄັດລອກການແປງ 3 ມິຕິ (3D transform) ຂອງກະດູກໃນ [Skeleton3D] "
"ທີ່ເປັນພໍ່ແມ່ຂອງມັນແບບໄດນາມິກ."

msgid ""
"This node selects a bone in a [Skeleton3D] and attaches to it. This means "
"that the [ModifierBoneTarget3D] node will dynamically copy the 3D transform "
"of the selected bone.\n"
"The functionality is similar to [BoneAttachment3D], but this node adopts the "
"[SkeletonModifier3D] cycle and is intended to be used as another "
"[SkeletonModifier3D]'s target."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດນີ້ຈະເລືອກກະດູກໃນ [Skeleton3D] ແລະ ຕິດເຂົ້າກັບມັນ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າໂນດ "
"[ModifierBoneTarget3D] ຈະຄັດລອກການແປງ 3 ມິຕິຂອງກະດູກທີ່ຖືກເລືອກແບບໄດນາມິກ.\n"
"ການເຮັດວຽກແມ່ນຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [BoneAttachment3D], ແຕ່ໂນດນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ວົງຈອນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ "
"[SkeletonModifier3D] ແລະ ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງ [SkeletonModifier3D] ອື່ນ."

msgid "Abstract class for non-real-time video recording encoders."
msgstr "ຄລາສນາມມະທຳສຳລັບຕົວເຂົ້າລະຫັດການບັນທຶກວິດີໂອແບບບໍ່ແມ່ນເວລາຈິງ (non-real-time)."

msgid ""
"Godot can record videos with non-real-time simulation. Like the [code]--fixed-"
"fps[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command "
"line argument[/url], this forces the reported [code]delta[/code] in [method "
"Node._process] functions to be identical across frames, regardless of how "
"long it actually took to render the frame. This can be used to record high-"
"quality videos with perfect frame pacing regardless of your hardware's "
"capabilities.\n"
"Godot has 3 built-in [MovieWriter]s:\n"
"- OGV container with Theora for video and Vorbis for audio ([code].ogv[/code] "
"file extension). Lossy compression, medium file sizes, fast encoding. The "
"lossy compression quality can be adjusted by changing [member "
"ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/video_quality] and [member "
"ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/ogv/audio_quality]. The resulting file "
"can be viewed in Godot with [VideoStreamPlayer] and most video players, but "
"not web browsers as they don't support Theora.\n"
"- AVI container with MJPEG for video and uncompressed audio ([code].avi[/"
"code] file extension). Lossy compression, medium file sizes, fast encoding. "
"The lossy compression quality can be adjusted by changing [member "
"ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/video_quality]. The resulting file can be "
"viewed in most video players, but it must be converted to another format for "
"viewing on the web or by Godot with [VideoStreamPlayer]. MJPEG does not "
"support transparency. AVI output is currently limited to a file of 4 GB in "
"size at most.\n"
"- PNG image sequence for video and WAV for audio ([code].png[/code] file "
"extension). Lossless compression, large file sizes, slow encoding. Designed "
"to be encoded to a video file with another tool such as [url=https://"
"ffmpeg.org/]FFmpeg[/url] after recording. Transparency is currently not "
"supported, even if the root viewport is set to be transparent.\n"
"If you need to encode to a different format or pipe a stream through third-"
"party software, you can extend the [MovieWriter] class to create your own "
"movie writers. This should typically be done using GDExtension for "
"performance reasons.\n"
"[b]Editor usage:[/b] A default movie file path can be specified in [member "
"ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/movie_file]. Alternatively, for running "
"single scenes, a [code]movie_file[/code] metadata can be added to the root "
"node, specifying the path to a movie file that will be used when recording "
"that scene. Once a path is set, click the video reel icon in the top-right "
"corner of the editor to enable Movie Maker mode, then run any scene as usual. "
"The engine will start recording as soon as the splash screen is finished, and "
"it will only stop recording when the engine quits. Click the video reel icon "
"again to disable Movie Maker mode. Note that toggling Movie Maker mode does "
"not affect project instances that are already running.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] MovieWriter is available for use in both the editor and exported "
"projects, but it is [i]not[/i] designed for use by end users to record videos "
"while playing. Players wishing to record gameplay videos should install tools "
"such as [url=https://obsproject.com/]OBS Studio[/url] or [url=https://"
"www.maartenbaert.be/simplescreenrecorder/]SimpleScreenRecorder[/url] "
"instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] MJPEG support ([code].avi[/code] file extension) depends on the "
"[code]jpg[/code] module being enabled at compile time (default behavior).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] OGV support ([code].ogv[/code] file extension) depends on the "
"[code]theora[/code] module being enabled at compile time (default behavior). "
"Theora compression is only available in editor binaries."
msgstr ""
"Godot ສາມາດບັນທຶກວິດີໂອດ້ວຍການຈຳລອງແບບບໍ່ແມ່ນເວລາຈິງ (non-real-time). ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບ "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command line "
"argument[/url] [code]--fixed-fps[/code], ນີ້ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ຄ່າ [code]delta[/code] "
"ທີ່ລາຍງານໃນຟັງຊັນ [method Node._process] ຄືກັນໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມ, "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງວ່າຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຕົວຈິງເທົ່າໃດໃນການສະແດງຜົນເຟຣມນັ້ນ. "
"ນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອບັນທຶກວິດີໂອຄຸນນະພາບສູງດ້ວຍຈັງຫວະເຟຣມທີ່ສົມບູນແບບ "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມສາມາດຂອງຮາດແວຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"Godot ມີ [MovieWriter] ທີ່ຕິດຕາມາໃຫ້ 3 ແບບ:\n"
"- OGV container ທີ່ໃຊ້ Theora ສຳລັບວິດີໂອ ແລະ Vorbis ສຳລັບສຽງ (ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ "
"[code].ogv[/code]). ເປັນການບີບອັດແບບສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດ, ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ປານກາງ, ເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄວ. "
"ຄຸນນະພາບການບີບອັດສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ [member ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/"
"video_quality] ແລະ [member ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/ogv/"
"audio_quality]. ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນ Godot ດ້ວຍ [VideoStreamPlayer] ແລະ "
"ໂປຣແກຣມຫຼິ້ນວິດີໂອສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ແຕ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນເວັບບຣາວເຊີເນື່ອງຈາກພວກມັນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ Theora.\n"
"- AVI container ທີ່ໃຊ້ MJPEG ສຳລັບວິດີໂອ ແລະ ສຽງແບບບໍ່ບີບອັດ (ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ [code].avi[/"
"code]). ເປັນການບີບອັດແບບສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດ, ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ປານກາງ, ເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄວ. "
"ຄຸນນະພາບການບີບອັດສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ [member ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/"
"video_quality]. ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນໂປຣແກຣມຫຼິ້ນວິດີໂອສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແປງເປັນຮູບແບບອື່ນເພື່ອເບິ່ງເທິງເວັບ ຫຼື ໂດຍ Godot ດ້ວຍ [VideoStreamPlayer]. MJPEG "
"ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບແບບ AVI ປັດຈຸບັນຈຳກັດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ສູງສຸດທີ່ 4 GB.\n"
"- PNG image sequence ສຳລັບວິດີໂອ ແລະ WAV ສຳລັບສຽງ (ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ [code].png[/code]). "
"ເປັນການບີບອັດແບບບໍ່ສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດ, ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ໃຫຍ່, ເຂົ້າລະຫັດຊ້າ. "
"ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ຖືກນຳໄປເຂົ້າລະຫັດເປັນໄຟລ໌ວິດີໂອດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມືອື່ນເຊັ່ນ [url=https://"
"ffmpeg.org/]FFmpeg[/url] ຫຼັງຈາກບັນທຶກແລ້ວ. ປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"root viewport ໃຫ້ໂປ່ງໃສກໍຕາມ.\n"
"ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າລະຫັດເປັນຮູບແບບອື່ນ ຫຼື ສົ່ງສະຕຣີມຜ່ານຊອບແວພາຍນອກ, ທ່ານສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍຄລາສ "
"[MovieWriter] ເພື່ອສ້າງ movie writers ຂອງທ່ານເອງໄດ້. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຄວນເຮັດໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"GDExtension ເພື່ອເຫດຜົນດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ.\n"
"[b]ການນຳໃຊ້ໃນເອດິເຕີ:[/b] ສາມາດລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ວິດີໂອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ໃນ [member "
"ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/movie_file]. ຫຼື ສຳລັບການຫຼິ້ນແຕ່ລະສາກ, "
"ສາມາດເພີ່ມເມຕາເຄດາ [code]movie_file[/code] ໃຫ້ກັບໂນດຮາກ (root node), "
"ໂດຍລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ວິດີໂອທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນເວລາບັນທຶກສາກນັ້ນ. ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເສັ້ນທາງແລ້ວ, "
"ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນມ້ວນວິດີໂອຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງຂອງເອດິເຕີເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດ Movie Maker, "
"ຈາກນັ້ນຫຼິ້ນສາກໃດກໍໄດ້ຕາມປົກກະຕິ. ເຄື່ອງຈັກຈະເລີ່ມບັນທຶກທັນທີທີ່ໜ້າຈໍສະແປລສ (splash screen) ຈົບລົງ, "
"ແລະ ຈະຢຸດບັນທຶກເມື່ອປິດເຄື່ອງຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນມ້ວນວິດີໂອອີກຄັ້ງເພື່ອປິດໂໝດ Movie Maker. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າການເປີດ/ປິດໂໝດ Movie Maker ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ແລ້ວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] MovieWriter ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ທັງໃນເອດິເຕີ ແລະ ໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ (exported), "
"ແຕ່ມັນ [i]ບໍ່ໄດ້[/i] ຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປໃຊ້ບັນທຶກວິດີໂອໃນຂະນະທີ່ຫຼິ້ນ. "
"ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນທີ່ຕ້ອງການບັນທຶກວິດີໂອການຫຼິ້ນເກມຄວນຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງມືເຊັ່ນ [url=https://obsproject.com/]OBS "
"Studio[/url] ຫຼື [url=https://www.maartenbaert.be/"
"simplescreenrecorder/]SimpleScreenRecorder[/url] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຮອງຮັບ MJPEG (ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ [code].avi[/code]) "
"ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບການເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [code]jpg[/code] ໃນຕອນຄອມໄພລ໌ (ພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຮອງຮັບ OGV (ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ [code].ogv[/code]) "
"ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບການເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [code]theora[/code] ໃນຕອນຄອມໄພລ໌ (ພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ). ການບີບອັດແບບ "
"Theora ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນໄຟລ໌ binary ຂອງເອດິເຕີເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Called when the audio sample rate used for recording the audio is requested "
"by the engine. The value returned must be specified in Hz. Defaults to 48000 "
"Hz if [method _get_audio_mix_rate] is not overridden."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອເຄື່ອງຈັກຮ້ອງຂໍອັດຕາການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງສຽງ (audio sample rate) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການບັນທຶກສຽງ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຕ້ອງລະບຸເປັນ Hz. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 48000 Hz ຫາກບໍ່ມີການ override [method "
"_get_audio_mix_rate]."

msgid ""
"Called when the audio speaker mode used for recording the audio is requested "
"by the engine. This can affect the number of output channels in the resulting "
"audio file/stream. Defaults to [constant AudioServer.SPEAKER_MODE_STEREO] if "
"[method _get_audio_speaker_mode] is not overridden."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອໂໝດລຳໂພງສຽງທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການບັນທຶກສຽງຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍໂດຍ Engine. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຈຳນວນຊ່ອງສັນຍານຂາອອກໃນໄຟລ໌/ສະຕຣີມສຽງທີ່ໄດ້. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [constant "
"AudioServer.SPEAKER_MODE_STEREO] ຖ້າ [method _get_audio_speaker_mode] ບໍ່ຖືກ "
"override."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of supported filename extensions for movies written with "
"this [MovieWriter]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບຮູບເງົາທີ່ຂຽນດ້ວຍ [MovieWriter] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Called when the engine determines whether this [MovieWriter] is able to "
"handle the file at [param path]. Must return [code]true[/code] if this "
"[MovieWriter] is able to handle the given file path, [code]false[/code] "
"otherwise. Typically, [method _handles_file] is overridden as follows to "
"allow the user to record a file at any path with a given file extension:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _handles_file(path):\n"
"\t# Allows specifying an output file with a `.mkv` file extension (case-"
"insensitive),\n"
"\t# either in the Project Settings or with the `--write-movie <path>` command "
"line argument.\n"
"\treturn path.get_extension().to_lower() == \"mkv\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອ Engine ພິຈາລະນາວ່າ [MovieWriter] ນີ້ສາມາດຈັດການໄຟລ໌ທີ່ [param path] ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່. "
"ຕ້ອງສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [MovieWriter] ນີ້ສາມາດຈັດການເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ສົ່ງ [code]false[/code]. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, [method _handles_file] ຈະຖືກ "
"override ດັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ໃນເສັ້ນທາງໃດກໍໄດ້ດ້ວຍນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _handles_file(path):\n"
"\t# ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ກຳນົດໄຟລ໌ຂາອອກດ້ວຍນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ `.mkv` (ບໍ່ແຍກຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່-ນ້ອຍ),\n"
"\t# ທັງໃນ Project Settings ຫຼື ດ້ວຍ argument custom line `--write-movie <path>`.\n"
"\treturn path.get_extension().to_lower() == \"mkv\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Called once before the engine starts writing video and audio data. [param "
"movie_size] is the width and height of the video to save. [param fps] is the "
"number of frames per second specified in the project settings or using the "
"[code]--fixed-fps <fps>[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວກ່ອນທີ່ Engine ຈະເລີ່ມຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນວິດີໂອ ແລະ ສຽງ. [param movie_size] "
"ແມ່ນຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງຂອງວິດີໂອທີ່ຈະບັນທຶກ. [param fps] ແມ່ນຈຳນວນເຟຣມຕໍ່ວິນາທີທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ "
"Project Settings ຫຼື ໂດຍການໃຊ້ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url] [code]--fixed-fps "
"<fps>[/code]."

msgid ""
"Called when the engine finishes writing. This occurs when the engine quits by "
"pressing the window manager's close button, or when [method SceneTree.quit] "
"is called.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Pressing [kbd]Ctrl + C[/kbd] on the terminal running the editor/"
"project does [i]not[/i] result in [method _write_end] being called."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອ Engine ຂຽນສຳເລັດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອ Engine ປິດລົງໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມປິດຂອງ window "
"manager, ຫຼື ເມື່ອ [method SceneTree.quit] ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການກົດ [kbd]Ctrl + C[/kbd] ໃນ terminal ທີ່ກຳລັງເປີດ editor/project "
"ຈະ [i]ບໍ່[/i] ເຮັດໃຫ້ [method _write_end] ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Called at the end of every rendered frame. The [param frame_image] and [param "
"audio_frame_block] function arguments should be written to."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນຕອນທ້າຍຂອງທຸກໆເຟຣມທີ່ຖືກ render. argument ຂອງຟັງຊັນ [param frame_image] ແລະ "
"[param audio_frame_block] ຄວນຈະຖືກຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນໃສ່."

msgid ""
"Adds a writer to be usable by the engine. The supported file extensions can "
"be set by overriding [method _handles_file].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method add_writer] must be called early enough in the engine "
"initialization to work, as movie writing is designed to start at the same "
"time as the rest of the engine."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ writer ເພື່ອໃຫ້ Engine ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້. ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮອງຮັບສາມາດກຳນົດໄດ້ໂດຍການ "
"override [method _handles_file].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method add_writer] ຕ້ອງຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃຫ້ໄວພໍໃນລະຫວ່າງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບຂອງ "
"Engine ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້, ເນື່ອງຈາກການຂຽນຮູບເງົາຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນພ້ອມກັບສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງ "
"Engine."

msgid ""
"Provides high-performance drawing of a mesh multiple times using GPU "
"instancing."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ການວາດເມຊ (mesh) ຫຼາຍໆຄັ້ງທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງໂດຍການໃຊ້ GPU instancing."

msgid ""
"MultiMesh provides low-level mesh instancing. Drawing thousands of "
"[MeshInstance3D] nodes can be slow, since each object is submitted to the GPU "
"then drawn individually.\n"
"MultiMesh is much faster as it can draw thousands of instances with a single "
"draw call, resulting in less API overhead.\n"
"As a drawback, if the instances are too far away from each other, performance "
"may be reduced as every single instance will always render (they are "
"spatially indexed as one, for the whole object).\n"
"Since instances may have any behavior, the AABB used for visibility must be "
"provided by the user.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A MultiMesh is a single object, therefore the same maximum "
"lights per object restriction applies. This means, that once the maximum "
"lights are consumed by one or more instances, the rest of the MultiMesh "
"instances will [b]not[/b] receive any lighting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Blend Shapes will be ignored if used in a MultiMesh."
msgstr ""
"MultiMesh ໃຫ້ການເຮັດອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instancing) ຂອງເມຊໃນລະດັບຕ່ຳ. ການແຕ້ມໂນດ "
"[MeshInstance3D] ເປັນພັນໆໂນດອາດຈະຊ້າ, ເພາະແຕ່ລະວັດຖຸຕ້ອງຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາ GPU ແລ້ວແຕ້ມແຍກກັນ.\n"
"MultiMesh ໄວກວ່າຫຼາຍ ເພາະມັນສາມາດແຕ້ມອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ເປັນພັນໆໄດ້ດ້ວຍ draw call ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ມີ API overhead ໜ້ອຍລົງ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ເສຍຄື, ຖ້າແຕ່ລະອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຢູ່ຫ່າງກັນເກີນໄປ, ປະສິດທິພາບອາດຈະຫຼຸດລົງ "
"ເພາະທຸກໆອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີສະເໝີ (ພວກມັນຖືກຈັດດັດຊະນີທາງພື້ນທີ່ເປັນອັນດຽວກັນສຳລັບທັງໝົດວັດຖຸ).\n"
"ເນື່ອງຈາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ອາດມີພຶດຕິກຳໃດໆກໍໄດ້, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງເປັນຜູ້ກຳນົດ AABB ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເບິ່ງເຫັນ "
"(visibility) ເອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] MultiMesh ແມ່ນວັດຖຸດຽວ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນແສງສູງສຸດຕໍ່ວັດຖຸຈຶ່ງມີຜົນນຳ. "
"ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ, ເມື່ອແສງສູງສຸດຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າແລ້ວ, ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງ "
"MultiMesh ຈະ [b]ບໍ່[/b] ໄດ້ຮັບແສງໃດໆ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Blend Shapes ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍຫາກໃຊ້ໃນ MultiMesh."

msgid "Using MultiMeshInstance"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ MultiMeshInstance"

msgid "Optimization using MultiMeshes"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມໂດຍໃຊ້ MultiMeshes"

msgid "Animating thousands of fish with MultiMeshInstance"
msgstr "ການສ້າງພາບເຄື່ອນໄຫວປາເປັນພັນໆໂຕດ້ວຍ MultiMeshInstance"

msgid "Returns the visibility axis-aligned bounding box in local space."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ visibility axis-aligned bounding box (AABB) ໃນ local space."

msgid "Gets a specific instance's color multiplier."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຕົວຄູນສີຂອງ instance ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Returns the custom data that has been set for a specific instance."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງ (custom data) ທີ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໄວ້ສຳລັບ instance ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Returns the [Transform3D] of a specific instance."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Transform3D] ຂອງ instance ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Returns the [Transform2D] of a specific instance."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Transform2D] ຂອງ instance ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"When using [i]physics interpolation[/i], this function allows you to prevent "
"interpolation on an instance in the current physics tick.\n"
"This allows you to move instances instantaneously, and should usually be used "
"when initially placing an instance such as a bullet to prevent graphical "
"glitches."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [i]physics interpolation[/i], ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດປ້ອງກັນການ interpolation "
"ໃນ instance ໃດໜຶ່ງໃນ physics tick ປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຍ້າຍ instance ໄດ້ທັນທີ, ແລະ ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຄວນໃຊ້ໃນຕອນທີ່ວາງ instance "
"ເທື່ອທຳອິດ ເຊັ່ນ: ລູກປືນ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການເກີດ graphical glitches."

msgid ""
"When using [i]physics interpolation[/i], this function allows you to prevent "
"interpolation for all instances in the current physics tick.\n"
"This allows you to move all instances instantaneously, and should usually be "
"used when initially placing instances to prevent graphical glitches."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [i]physics interpolation[/i], ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດປ້ອງກັນການ interpolation "
"ສຳລັບທຸກໆ instance ໃນ physics tick ປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຍ້າຍທຸກ instance ໄດ້ທັນທີ, ແລະ ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຄວນໃຊ້ໃນຕອນທີ່ວາງ instance "
"ເທື່ອທຳອິດ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການເກີດ graphical glitches."

msgid ""
"An alternative to setting the [member buffer] property, which can be used "
"with [i]physics interpolation[/i]. This method takes two arrays, and can set "
"the data for the current and previous tick in one go. The renderer will "
"automatically interpolate the data at each frame.\n"
"This is useful for situations where the order of instances may change from "
"physics tick to tick, such as particle systems.\n"
"When the order of instances is coherent, the simpler alternative of setting "
"[member buffer] can still be used with interpolation."
msgstr ""
"ທາງເລືອກໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ property [member buffer], ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບ [i]physics "
"interpolation[/i]. ວິທີນີ້ຮັບເອົາສອງ array, ແລະ ສາມາດຕັ້ງຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ tick ປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ tick "
"ກ່ອນໜ້າໄດ້ໃນບາດດຽວ. ຕົວ render ຈະ interpolate ຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນແຕ່ລະເຟຣມ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບສະຖານະການທີ່ລຳດັບຂອງ instance ອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງຈາກ physics tick ໜຶ່ງໄປຫາ "
"tick ໜຶ່ງ, ເຊັ່ນ: ລະບົບ particle.\n"
"ເມື່ອລຳດັບຂອງ instance ມີຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງກັນ, ທາງເລືອກທີ່ງ່າຍກວ່າໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member buffer] "
"ກໍຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບ interpolation ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the color of a specific instance by [i]multiplying[/i] the mesh's "
"existing vertex colors. This allows for different color tinting per "
"instance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Each component is stored in 32 bits in the Forward+ and Mobile "
"rendering methods, but is packed into 16 bits in the Compatibility rendering "
"method.\n"
"For the color to take effect, ensure that [member use_colors] is [code]true[/"
"code] on the [MultiMesh] and [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] is [code]true[/code] on the "
"material. If you intend to set an absolute color instead of tinting, make "
"sure the material's albedo color is set to pure white ([code]Color(1, 1, 1)[/"
"code])."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີຂອງ instance ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍການ [i]ຄູນ[/i] ກັບສີ vertex ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວຂອງ mesh. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດຍ້ອມສີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນແຕ່ລະ instance ໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ 32 ບິດ ໃນວິທີການ render ແບບ Forward+ ແລະ "
"Mobile, ແຕ່ຈະຖືກແພັກໄວ້ໃນ 16 ບິດ ໃນວິທີການ render ແບບ Compatibility.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສີມີຜົນ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ [member use_colors] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ໃນ [MultiMesh] "
"ແລະ [member BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ໃນ material. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າສີແບບສົມບູນແທນການຍ້ອມສີ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າສີ albedo ຂອງ "
"material ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນສີຂາວບໍລິສຸດ ([code]Color(1, 1, 1)[/code])."

msgid ""
"Sets custom data for a specific instance. [param custom_data] is a [Color] "
"type only to contain 4 floating-point numbers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Each number is stored in 32 bits in the Forward+ and Mobile "
"rendering methods, but is packed into 16 bits in the Compatibility rendering "
"method.\n"
"For the custom data to be used, ensure that [member use_custom_data] is "
"[code]true[/code].\n"
"This custom instance data has to be manually accessed in your custom shader "
"using [code]INSTANCE_CUSTOM[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງ (custom data) ສຳລັບ instance ທີ່ລະບຸ. [param custom_data] ແມ່ນປະເພດ "
"[Color] ພຽງແຕ່ເພື່ອບັນຈຸຕົວເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ 4 ຕົວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຕ່ລະຕົວເລກຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ 32 ບິດ ໃນວິທີການ render ແບບ Forward+ ແລະ "
"Mobile, ແຕ່ຈະຖືກແພັກໄວ້ໃນ 16 ບິດ ໃນວິທີການ render ແບບ Compatibility.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ custom data ຖືກນຳໃຊ້, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ [member use_custom_data] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code].\n"
"ຂໍ້ມູນ instance ກຳນົດເອງນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກເຂົ້າເຖິງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນ custom shader ຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[code]INSTANCE_CUSTOM[/code]."

msgid "Sets the [Transform3D] for a specific instance."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Transform3D] ສຳລັບ instance ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Sets the [Transform2D] for a specific instance."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Transform2D] ສຳລັບ instance ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Accessing this property is very slow. Use [method set_instance_color] and "
"[method get_instance_color] instead."
msgstr ""
"ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ property ນີ້ແມ່ນຊ້າຫຼາຍ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method set_instance_color] ແລະ [method "
"get_instance_color] ແທນ."

msgid "Array containing each [Color] used by all instances of this mesh."
msgstr "Array ທີ່ບັນຈຸແຕ່ລະ [Color] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍທຸກ instance ຂອງ mesh ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Custom AABB for this MultiMesh resource. Setting this manually prevents "
"costly runtime AABB recalculations."
msgstr ""
"AABB ກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບ MultiMesh resource ນີ້. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນການຄິດໄລ່ AABB "
"ໃໝ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນສູງ."

msgid ""
"Accessing this property is very slow. Use [method set_instance_custom_data] "
"and [method get_instance_custom_data] instead."
msgstr ""
"ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ property ນີ້ແມ່ນຊ້າຫຼາຍ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method set_instance_custom_data] ແລະ "
"[method get_instance_custom_data] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Array containing each custom data value used by all instances of this mesh, "
"as a [PackedColorArray]."
msgstr ""
"Array ທີ່ບັນຈຸແຕ່ລະຄ່າ custom data ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍທຸກ instance ຂອງ mesh ນີ້, ໃນຮູບແບບ "
"[PackedColorArray]."

msgid ""
"Number of instances that will get drawn. This clears and (re)sizes the "
"buffers. Setting data format or flags afterwards will have no effect.\n"
"By default, all instances are drawn but you can limit this with [member "
"visible_instance_count]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນ instance ທີ່ຈະຖືກວາດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະລ້າງ ແລະ (ປັບ) ຂະໜາດ buffers. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບແບບຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື "
"flags ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ.\n"
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທຸກ instance ຈະຖືກວາດ ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດຈຳກັດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [member "
"visible_instance_count]."

msgid ""
"[Mesh] resource to be instanced.\n"
"The looks of the individual instances can be modified using [method "
"set_instance_color] and [method set_instance_custom_data]."
msgstr ""
"[Mesh] resource ທີ່ຈະຖືກເຮັດ instancing.\n"
"ຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງແຕ່ລະ instance ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method set_instance_color] ແລະ "
"[method set_instance_custom_data]."

msgid ""
"Choose whether to use an interpolation method that favors speed or quality.\n"
"When using low physics tick rates (typically below 20) or high rates of "
"object rotation, you may get better results from the high quality setting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Fast quality does not equate to low quality. Except in the "
"special cases mentioned above, the quality should be comparable to high "
"quality."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກວ່າຈະໃຊ້ວິທີ interpolation ທີ່ເນັ້ນຄວາມໄວ ຫຼື ຄຸນນະພາບ.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ physics tick rate ຕ່ຳ (ປົກກະຕິຕ່ຳກວ່າ 20) ຫຼື ມີອັດຕາການໝູນຂອງວັດຖຸສູງ, "
"ທ່ານອາດຈະໄດ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ດີກວ່າຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ high quality.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Fast quality ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍເຖິງຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳ. ຍົກເວັ້ນໃນກໍລະນີພິເສດທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງ, "
"ຄຸນນະພາບຄວນຈະທຽບເທົ່າກັບ high quality."

msgid ""
"Accessing this property is very slow. Use [method set_instance_transform_2d] "
"and [method get_instance_transform_2d] instead."
msgstr ""
"ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ property ນີ້ແມ່ນຊ້າຫຼາຍ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method set_instance_transform_2d] ແລະ "
"[method get_instance_transform_2d] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Array containing each [Transform2D] value used by all instances of this mesh, "
"as a [PackedVector2Array]. Each transform is divided into 3 [Vector2] values "
"corresponding to the transforms' [code]x[/code], [code]y[/code], and "
"[code]origin[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Array ທີ່ບັນຈຸແຕ່ລະຄ່າ [Transform2D] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍທຸກ instance ຂອງ mesh ນີ້, ໃນຮູບແບບ "
"[PackedVector2Array]. ແຕ່ລະ transform ຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນ 3 ຄ່າ [Vector2] ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບ "
"[code]x[/code], [code]y[/code], ແລະ [code]origin[/code] ຂອງ transform."

msgid ""
"Accessing this property is very slow. Use [method set_instance_transform] and "
"[method get_instance_transform] instead."
msgstr ""
"ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ property ນີ້ແມ່ນຊ້າຫຼາຍ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method set_instance_transform] ແລະ "
"[method get_instance_transform] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Array containing each [Transform3D] value used by all instances of this mesh, "
"as a [PackedVector3Array]. Each transform is divided into 4 [Vector3] values "
"corresponding to the transforms' [code]x[/code], [code]y[/code], [code]z[/"
"code], and [code]origin[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Array ທີ່ບັນຈຸແຕ່ລະຄ່າ [Transform3D] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍທຸກ instance ຂອງ mesh ນີ້, ໃນຮູບແບບ "
"[PackedVector3Array]. ແຕ່ລະ transform ຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນ 4 ຄ່າ [Vector3] ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບ "
"[code]x[/code], [code]y[/code], [code]z[/code], ແລະ [code]origin[/code] ຂອງ "
"transform."

msgid "Format of transform used to transform mesh, either 2D or 3D."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຂອງ transform ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແປງ mesh, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນ 2D ຫຼື 3D."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [MultiMesh] will use color data (see [method "
"set_instance_color]). Can only be set when [member instance_count] is "
"[code]0[/code] or less. This means that you need to call this method before "
"setting the instance count, or temporarily reset it to [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [MultiMesh] ຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນສີ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_instance_color]). ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ເມື່ອ [member instance_count] ເປັນ [code]0[/"
"code] ຫຼື ໜ້ອຍກວ່າເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນ instance, ຫຼື "
"ຣີເຊັດມັນເປັນ [code]0[/code] ຊົ່ວຄາວ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [MultiMesh] will use custom data (see [method "
"set_instance_custom_data]). Can only be set when [member instance_count] is "
"[code]0[/code] or less. This means that you need to call this method before "
"setting the instance count, or temporarily reset it to [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [MultiMesh] ຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_instance_custom_data]). ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ເມື່ອ [member instance_count] ເປັນ "
"[code]0[/code] ຫຼື ໜ້ອຍກວ່າເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນ "
"instance, ຫຼື ຣີເຊັດມັນເປັນ [code]0[/code] ຊົ່ວຄາວ."

msgid ""
"Limits the number of instances drawn, -1 draws all instances. Changing this "
"does not change the sizes of the buffers."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນ instance ທີ່ຖືກວາດ, -1 ຈະວາດທຸກ instance. ການປ່ຽນແປງນີ້ຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຂອງ "
"buffers."

msgid "Use this when using 2D transforms."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເມື່ອໃຊ້ 2D transforms."

msgid "Use this when using 3D transforms."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເມື່ອໃຊ້ 3D transforms."

msgid ""
"Always interpolate using Basis lerping, which can produce warping artifacts "
"in some situations."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດ interpolation ໂດຍໃຊ້ Basis lerping ສະເໝີ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ warping "
"artifacts ໃນບາງສະຖານະການ."

msgid ""
"Attempt to interpolate using Basis slerping (spherical linear interpolation) "
"where possible, otherwise fall back to lerping."
msgstr ""
"ພະຍາຍາມເຮັດ interpolation ໂດຍໃຊ້ Basis slerping (spherical linear "
"interpolation) ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ກັບໄປໃຊ້ lerping."

msgid "Node that instances a [MultiMesh] in 2D."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ເຮັດ instancing [MultiMesh] ໃນ 2D."

msgid ""
"[MultiMeshInstance2D] is a specialized node to instance a [MultiMesh] "
"resource in 2D. This can be faster to render compared to displaying many "
"[Sprite2D] nodes with large transparent areas, especially if the nodes take "
"up a lot of space on screen at high viewport resolutions. This is because "
"using a mesh designed to fit the sprites' opaque areas will reduce GPU fill "
"rate utilization (at the cost of increased vertex processing utilization).\n"
"Usage is the same as [MultiMeshInstance3D]."
msgstr ""
"[MultiMeshInstance2D] ແມ່ນໂນດສະເພາະເພື່ອເຮັດ instancing [MultiMesh] resource ໃນ "
"2D. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດ render ໄດ້ໄວກວ່າເມື່ອທຽບກັບການສະແດງໂນດ [Sprite2D] "
"ຫຼາຍໆໂນດທີ່ມີພື້ນທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ໂດຍສະເພາະຫາກໂນດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ຫຼາຍໃນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດ "
"viewport ສູງ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຍ້ອນວ່າການໃຊ້ mesh ທີ່ຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບພື້ນທີ່ທຶບແສງຂອງ sprite "
"ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການໃຊ້ GPU fill rate (ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກກັບການໃຊ້ vertex processing ທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ).\n"
"ວິທີການນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບ [MultiMeshInstance3D]."

msgid "The [MultiMesh] that will be drawn by the [MultiMeshInstance2D]."
msgstr "[MultiMesh] ທີ່ຈະຖືກວາດໂດຍ [MultiMeshInstance2D]."

msgid "Node that instances a [MultiMesh]."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ເຮັດ instancing [MultiMesh]."

msgid ""
"[MultiMeshInstance3D] is a specialized node to instance [GeometryInstance3D]s "
"based on a [MultiMesh] resource.\n"
"This is useful to optimize the rendering of a high number of instances of a "
"given mesh (for example trees in a forest or grass strands)."
msgstr ""
"[MultiMeshInstance3D] ແມ່ນໂນດສະເພາະເພື່ອເຮັດ instancing [GeometryInstance3D] "
"ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ [MultiMesh] resource.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການປັບປຸງການ render instance ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍຂອງ mesh ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ຕົ້ນໄມ້ໃນປ່າ ຫຼື ເສັ້ນຫຍ້າ)."

msgid ""
"The [MultiMesh] resource that will be used and shared among all instances of "
"the [MultiMeshInstance3D]."
msgstr ""
"[MultiMesh] resource ທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ ແລະ ແບ່ງປັນກັນໃນທຸກ instance ຂອງ "
"[MultiMeshInstance3D]."

msgid "High-level multiplayer API interface."
msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟດ API ລະດັບສູງສຳລັບຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຫຼາຍຄົນ (multiplayer)."

msgid ""
"Base class for high-level multiplayer API implementations. See also "
"[MultiplayerPeer].\n"
"By default, [SceneTree] has a reference to an implementation of this class "
"and uses it to provide multiplayer capabilities (i.e. RPCs) across the whole "
"scene.\n"
"It is possible to override the MultiplayerAPI instance used by specific tree "
"branches by calling the [method SceneTree.set_multiplayer] method, "
"effectively allowing to run both client and server in the same scene.\n"
"It is also possible to extend or replace the default implementation via "
"scripting or native extensions. See [MultiplayerAPIExtension] for details "
"about extensions, [SceneMultiplayer] for the details about the default "
"implementation."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບການປະຕິບັດງານ API ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຫຼາຍຄົນລະດັບສູງ. ເບິ່ງ [MultiplayerPeer] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, [SceneTree] ມີການອ້າງອີງເຖິງການປະຕິບັດງານຂອງຄລາສນີ້ ແລະ "
"ໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການຫຼິ້ນຫຼາຍຄົນ (ເຊັ່ນ: RPCs) ໃນທົ່ວທຸກ scene.\n"
"ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະ override instance ຂອງ MultiplayerAPI ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍກິ່ງງ່າຂອງ tree "
"ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີ [method SceneTree.set_multiplayer], ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດແລ່ນທັງ "
"client ແລະ server ໃນ scene ດຽວກັນໄດ້.\n"
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນແທນການປະຕິບັດງານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຜ່ານ scripting ຫຼື native "
"extensions. ເບິ່ງ [MultiplayerAPIExtension] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບ extensions, ແລະ "
"[SceneMultiplayer] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບການປະຕິບັດງານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Returns a new instance of the default MultiplayerAPI."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ instance ໃໝ່ຂອງ MultiplayerAPI ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the default MultiplayerAPI implementation class name. This is usually "
"[code]\"SceneMultiplayer\"[/code] when [SceneMultiplayer] is available. See "
"[method set_default_interface]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຄລາສການປະຕິບັດງານ MultiplayerAPI ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ [code]"
"\"SceneMultiplayer\"[/code] ເມື່ອມີ [SceneMultiplayer]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_default_interface]."

msgid ""
"Returns the peer IDs of all connected peers of this MultiplayerAPI's [member "
"multiplayer_peer]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ peer IDs ຂອງທຸກ peer ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ [member multiplayer_peer] ຂອງ "
"MultiplayerAPI ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the sender's peer ID for the RPC currently being executed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method returns [code]0[/code] when called outside of an "
"RPC. As such, the original peer ID may be lost when code execution is delayed "
"(such as with GDScript's [code]await[/code] keyword)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ peer ID ຂອງຜູ້ສົ່ງສຳລັບ RPC ທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກປະຕິບັດງານຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]0[/code] ເມື່ອຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຢູ່ນອກ RPC. ດ້ວຍເຫດນັ້ນ, peer ID "
"ດັ້ງເດີມອາດຈະເສຍໄປເມື່ອການປະຕິບັດງານໂຄ້ດຖືກເລື່ອນອອກໄປ (ເຊັ່ນ: ການໃຊ້ keyword [code]await[/"
"code] ຂອງ GDScript)."

msgid ""
"Returns the unique peer ID of this MultiplayerAPI's [member multiplayer_peer]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ peer ID ທີ່ເປັນເອກະລັກຂອງ [member multiplayer_peer] ຂອງ MultiplayerAPI ນີ້."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a [member multiplayer_peer] set."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member multiplayer_peer]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this MultiplayerAPI's [member multiplayer_peer] "
"is valid and in server mode (listening for connections)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [member multiplayer_peer] ຂອງ MultiplayerAPI ນີ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ "
"ແລະ ຢູ່ໃນໂໝດ server (ກຳລັງລໍຖ້າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່)."

msgid ""
"Notifies the MultiplayerAPI of a new [param configuration] for the given "
"[param object]. This method is used internally by [SceneTree] to configure "
"the root path for this MultiplayerAPI (passing [code]null[/code] and a valid "
"[NodePath] as [param configuration]). This method can be further used by "
"MultiplayerAPI implementations to provide additional features, refer to "
"specific implementation (e.g. [SceneMultiplayer]) for details on how they use "
"it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is mostly relevant when extending or overriding the "
"MultiplayerAPI behavior via [MultiplayerAPIExtension]."
msgstr ""
"ແຈ້ງເຕືອນ MultiplayerAPI ກ່ຽວກັບ [param configuration] ໃໝ່ສຳລັບ [param object] "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ວິທີນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ພາຍໃນໂດຍ [SceneTree] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າ root path ສຳລັບ MultiplayerAPI "
"ນີ້ (ໂດຍການສົ່ງ [code]null[/code] ແລະ [NodePath] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເປັນ [param "
"configuration]). ວິທີນີ້ຍັງສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍການປະຕິບັດງານ MultiplayerAPI ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຟີເຈີເພີ່ມເຕີມ, "
"ໃຫ້ອ້າງອີງເຖິງການປະຕິບັດງານສະເພາະ (ເຊັ່ນ: [SceneMultiplayer]) "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດວິທີທີ່ພວກມັນໃຊ້ມັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີນີ້ສ່ວນຫຼາຍຈະກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເມື່ອມີການຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື override ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງ "
"MultiplayerAPI ຜ່ານ [MultiplayerAPIExtension]."

msgid ""
"Notifies the MultiplayerAPI to remove a [param configuration] for the given "
"[param object]. This method is used internally by [SceneTree] to configure "
"the root path for this MultiplayerAPI (passing [code]null[/code] and an empty "
"[NodePath] as [param configuration]). This method can be further used by "
"MultiplayerAPI implementations to provide additional features, refer to "
"specific implementation (e.g. [SceneMultiplayer]) for details on how they use "
"it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is mostly relevant when extending or overriding the "
"MultiplayerAPI behavior via [MultiplayerAPIExtension]."
msgstr ""
"ແຈ້ງເຕືອນ MultiplayerAPI ໃຫ້ລຶບ [param configuration] ສຳລັບ [param object] "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ວິທີນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ພາຍໃນໂດຍ [SceneTree] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າ root path ສຳລັບ MultiplayerAPI "
"ນີ້ (ໂດຍການສົ່ງ [code]null[/code] ແລະ [NodePath] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າເປັນ [param "
"configuration]). ວິທີນີ້ຍັງສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍການປະຕິບັດງານ MultiplayerAPI ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຟີເຈີເພີ່ມເຕີມ, "
"ໃຫ້ອ້າງອີງເຖິງການປະຕິບັດງານສະເພາະ (ເຊັ່ນ: [SceneMultiplayer]) "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດວິທີທີ່ພວກມັນໃຊ້ມັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີນີ້ສ່ວນຫຼາຍຈະກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເມື່ອມີການຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື override ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງ "
"MultiplayerAPI ຜ່ານ [MultiplayerAPIExtension]."

msgid ""
"Method used for polling the MultiplayerAPI. You only need to worry about this "
"if you set [member SceneTree.multiplayer_poll] to [code]false[/code]. By "
"default, [SceneTree] will poll its MultiplayerAPI(s) for you.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method results in RPCs being called, so they will be "
"executed in the same context of this function (e.g. [code]_process[/code], "
"[code]physics[/code], [Thread])."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການ polling MultiplayerAPI. ທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງສົນໃຈສິ່ງນີ້ຫາກທ່ານຕັ້ງ [member "
"SceneTree.multiplayer_poll] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, [SceneTree] "
"ຈະ poll MultiplayerAPI ໃຫ້ທ່ານເອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີນີ້ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ RPCs ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກມັນຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດງານໃນ context "
"ດຽວກັນກັບຟັງຊັນນີ້ (ເຊັ່ນ: [code]_process[/code], [code]physics[/code], [Thread])."

msgid ""
"Sends an RPC to the target [param peer]. The given [param method] will be "
"called on the remote [param object] with the provided [param arguments]. The "
"RPC may also be called locally depending on the implementation and RPC "
"configuration. See [method Node.rpc] and [method Node.rpc_config].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Prefer using [method Node.rpc], [method Node.rpc_id], or "
"[code]my_method.rpc(peer, arg1, arg2, ...)[/code] (in GDScript), since they "
"are faster. This method is mostly useful in conjunction with "
"[MultiplayerAPIExtension] when extending or replacing the multiplayer "
"capabilities."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງ RPC ໄປຫາ [param peer] ເປົ້າໝາຍ. [param method] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນ [param "
"object] ໄລຍະໄກດ້ວຍ [param arguments] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. RPC ອາດຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ "
"(locally) ໄດ້ຄືກັນ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບການປະຕິບັດງານ ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າ RPC. ເບິ່ງ [method Node.rpc] ແລະ "
"[method Node.rpc_config].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄວນເລືອກໃຊ້ [method Node.rpc], [method Node.rpc_id], ຫຼື "
"[code]my_method.rpc(peer, arg1, arg2, ...)[/code] (ໃນ GDScript), "
"ເພາະວ່າມັນໄວກວ່າ. ວິທີນີ້ສ່ວນຫຼາຍຈະມີປະໂຫຍດຮ່ວມກັບ [MultiplayerAPIExtension] "
"ເມື່ອມີການຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນແທນຄວາມສາມາດຂອງ multiplayer."

msgid ""
"Sets the default MultiplayerAPI implementation class. This method can be used "
"by modules and extensions to configure which implementation will be used by "
"[SceneTree] when the engine starts."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄລາສການປະຕິບັດງານ MultiplayerAPI ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ວິທີນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໂດຍໂມດູນ ແລະ extension "
"ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າວ່າການປະຕິບັດງານໃດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ [SceneTree] ເມື່ອ Engine ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The peer object to handle the RPC system (effectively enabling networking "
"when set). Depending on the peer itself, the MultiplayerAPI will become a "
"network server (check with [method is_server]) and will set root node's "
"network mode to authority, or it will become a regular client peer. All child "
"nodes are set to inherit the network mode by default. Handling of networking-"
"related events (connection, disconnection, new clients) is done by connecting "
"to MultiplayerAPI's signals."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸ peer ທີ່ໃຊ້ຈັດການລະບົບ RPC (ເປັນການເປີດໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍເມື່ອມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ). ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຕົວ "
"peer ເອງ, MultiplayerAPI ຈະກາຍເປັນ network server (ກວດສອບດ້ວຍ [method "
"is_server]) ແລະ ຈະຕັ້ງໂໝດເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງ root node ເປັນ authority, ຫຼື ມັນຈະກາຍເປັນ client "
"peer ທຳມະດາ. ທຸກໆໂນດລູກຈະຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ສືບທອດໂໝດເຄືອຂ່າຍໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. "
"ການຈັດການເຫດການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍ (ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ການຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, client ໃໝ່) "
"ແມ່ນເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ signals ຂອງ MultiplayerAPI."

msgid ""
"Emitted when this MultiplayerAPI's [member multiplayer_peer] successfully "
"connected to a server. Only emitted on clients."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [member multiplayer_peer] ຂອງ MultiplayerAPI ນີ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ server "
"ສຳເລັດ. ສົ່ງສັນຍານສະເພາະຢູ່ຝັ່ງ client ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when this MultiplayerAPI's [member multiplayer_peer] fails to "
"establish a connection to a server. Only emitted on clients."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [member multiplayer_peer] ຂອງ MultiplayerAPI ນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ "
"server ໄດ້. ສົ່ງສັນຍານສະເພາະຢູ່ຝັ່ງ client ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when this MultiplayerAPI's [member multiplayer_peer] connects with a "
"new peer. ID is the peer ID of the new peer. Clients get notified when other "
"clients connect to the same server. Upon connecting to a server, a client "
"also receives this signal for the server (with ID being 1)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [member multiplayer_peer] ຂອງ MultiplayerAPI ນີ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ peer ໃໝ່. ID "
"ແມ່ນ peer ID ຂອງ peer ໃໝ່. Client ຈະໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອ client ອື່ນໆເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ server "
"ດຽວກັນ. ເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ server, client ກໍຈະໄດ້ຮັບສັນຍານນີ້ສຳລັບ server ຄືກັນ (ໂດຍ ID ຈະເປັນ "
"1)."

msgid ""
"Emitted when this MultiplayerAPI's [member multiplayer_peer] disconnects from "
"a peer. Clients get notified when other clients disconnect from the same "
"server."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [member multiplayer_peer] ຂອງ MultiplayerAPI ນີ້ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກ peer. "
"Client ຈະໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອ client ອື່ນໆຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກ server ດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when this MultiplayerAPI's [member multiplayer_peer] disconnects from "
"server. Only emitted on clients."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [member multiplayer_peer] ຂອງ MultiplayerAPI ນີ້ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກ "
"server. ສົ່ງສັນຍານສະເພາະຢູ່ຝັ່ງ client ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Used with [method Node.rpc_config] to disable a method or property for all "
"RPC calls, making it unavailable. Default for all methods."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method Node.rpc_config] ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານ method ຫຼື property "
"ສຳລັບທຸກການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ RPC, ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້. ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບທຸກ method."

msgid ""
"Used with [method Node.rpc_config] to set a method to be callable remotely by "
"any peer. Analogous to the [code]@rpc(\"any_peer\")[/code] annotation. Calls "
"are accepted from all remote peers, no matter if they are node's authority or "
"not."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method Node.rpc_config] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງໃຫ້ method ສາມາດຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຈາກໄລຍະໄກໂດຍ peer "
"ໃດກໍໄດ້. ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ annotation [code]@rpc(\"any_peer\")[/code]. "
"ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຈະຖືກຍອມຮັບຈາກທຸກ peer ໄລຍະໄກ, ບໍ່ວ່າພວກມັນຈະເປັນ authority ຂອງໂນດຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Used with [method Node.rpc_config] to set a method to be callable remotely "
"only by the current multiplayer authority (which is the server by default). "
"Analogous to the [code]@rpc(\"authority\")[/code] annotation. See [method "
"Node.set_multiplayer_authority]."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method Node.rpc_config] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງໃຫ້ method "
"ສາມາດຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຈາກໄລຍະໄກໄດ້ສະເພາະໂດຍ multiplayer authority ປັດຈຸບັນ (ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນ server "
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ). ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ annotation [code]@rpc(\"authority\")[/code]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"Node.set_multiplayer_authority]."

msgid "Base class used for extending the [MultiplayerAPI]."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຂະຫຍາຍ [MultiplayerAPI]."

msgid ""
"This class can be used to extend or replace the default [MultiplayerAPI] "
"implementation via script or extensions.\n"
"The following example extend the default implementation ([SceneMultiplayer]) "
"by logging every RPC being made, and every object being configured for "
"replication.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends MultiplayerAPIExtension\n"
"class_name LogMultiplayer\n"
"\n"
"# We want to extend the default SceneMultiplayer.\n"
"var base_multiplayer = SceneMultiplayer.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _init():\n"
"\t# Just passthrough base signals (copied to var to avoid cyclic reference)\n"
"\tvar cts = connected_to_server\n"
"\tvar cf = connection_failed\n"
"\tvar sd = server_disconnected\n"
"\tvar pc = peer_connected\n"
"\tvar pd = peer_disconnected\n"
"\tbase_multiplayer.connected_to_server.connect(func(): cts.emit())\n"
"\tbase_multiplayer.connection_failed.connect(func(): cf.emit())\n"
"\tbase_multiplayer.server_disconnected.connect(func(): sd.emit())\n"
"\tbase_multiplayer.peer_connected.connect(func(id): pc.emit(id))\n"
"\tbase_multiplayer.peer_disconnected.connect(func(id): pd.emit(id))\n"
"\n"
"func _poll():\n"
"\treturn base_multiplayer.poll()\n"
"\n"
"# Log RPC being made and forward it to the default multiplayer.\n"
"func _rpc(peer: int, object: Object, method: StringName, args: Array) -> "
"Error:\n"
"\tprint(\"Got RPC for %d: %s::%s(%s)\" % [peer, object, method, args])\n"
"\treturn base_multiplayer.rpc(peer, object, method, args)\n"
"\n"
"# Log configuration add. E.g. root path (nullptr, NodePath), replication "
"(Node, Spawner|Synchronizer), custom.\n"
"func _object_configuration_add(object, config: Variant) -> Error:\n"
"\tif config is MultiplayerSynchronizer:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Adding synchronization configuration for %s. Synchronizer: %s\" % "
"[object, config])\n"
"\telif config is MultiplayerSpawner:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Adding node %s to the spawn list. Spawner: %s\" % [object, "
"config])\n"
"\treturn base_multiplayer.object_configuration_add(object, config)\n"
"\n"
"# Log configuration remove. E.g. root path (nullptr, NodePath), replication "
"(Node, Spawner|Synchronizer), custom.\n"
"func _object_configuration_remove(object, config: Variant) -> Error:\n"
"\tif config is MultiplayerSynchronizer:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Removing synchronization configuration for %s. Synchronizer: %s\" "
"% [object, config])\n"
"\telif config is MultiplayerSpawner:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Removing node %s from the spawn list. Spawner: %s\" % [object, "
"config])\n"
"\treturn base_multiplayer.object_configuration_remove(object, config)\n"
"\n"
"# These can be optional, but in our case we want to extend SceneMultiplayer, "
"so forward everything.\n"
"func _set_multiplayer_peer(p_peer: MultiplayerPeer):\n"
"\tbase_multiplayer.multiplayer_peer = p_peer\n"
"\n"
"func _get_multiplayer_peer() -> MultiplayerPeer:\n"
"\treturn base_multiplayer.multiplayer_peer\n"
"\n"
"func _get_unique_id() -> int:\n"
"\treturn base_multiplayer.get_unique_id()\n"
"\n"
"func _get_remote_sender_id() -> int:\n"
"\treturn base_multiplayer.get_remote_sender_id()\n"
"\n"
"func _get_peer_ids() -> PackedInt32Array:\n"
"\treturn base_multiplayer.get_peers()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Then in your main scene or in an autoload call [method "
"SceneTree.set_multiplayer] to start using your custom [MultiplayerAPI]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# autoload.gd\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\t# Sets our custom multiplayer as the main one in SceneTree.\n"
"\tget_tree().set_multiplayer(LogMultiplayer.new())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Native extensions can alternatively use the [method "
"MultiplayerAPI.set_default_interface] method during initialization to "
"configure themselves as the default implementation."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນແທນການປະຕິບັດງານ [MultiplayerAPI] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຜ່ານ script ຫຼື "
"extensions.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະຂະຫຍາຍການປະຕິບັດງານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ([SceneMultiplayer]) ໂດຍການບັນທຶກທຸກ RPC "
"ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ ທຸກວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າສຳລັບ replication.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends MultiplayerAPIExtension\n"
"class_name LogMultiplayer\n"
"\n"
"# ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການຂະຫຍາຍ SceneMultiplayer ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"var base_multiplayer = SceneMultiplayer.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _init():\n"
"\t# ພຽງແຕ່ສົ່ງຕໍ່ signals ພື້ນຖານ (ກັອບປີ້ໃສ່ຕົວປ່ຽນເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງ cyclic reference)\n"
"\tvar cts = connected_to_server\n"
"\tvar cf = connection_failed\n"
"\tvar sd = server_disconnected\n"
"\tvar pc = peer_connected\n"
"\tvar pd = peer_disconnected\n"
"\tbase_multiplayer.connected_to_server.connect(func(): cts.emit())\n"
"\tbase_multiplayer.connection_failed.connect(func(): cf.emit())\n"
"\tbase_multiplayer.server_disconnected.connect(func(): sd.emit())\n"
"\tbase_multiplayer.peer_connected.connect(func(id): pc.emit(id))\n"
"\tbase_multiplayer.peer_disconnected.connect(func(id): pd.emit(id))\n"
"\n"
"func _poll():\n"
"\treturn base_multiplayer.poll()\n"
"\n"
"# ບັນທຶກ RPC ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ສົ່ງຕໍ່ໃຫ້ multiplayer ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"func _rpc(peer: int, object: Object, method: StringName, args: Array) -> "
"Error:\n"
"\tprint(\"Got RPC for %d: %s::%s(%s)\" % [peer, object, method, args])\n"
"\treturn base_multiplayer.rpc(peer, object, method, args)\n"
"\n"
"# ບັນທຶກການເພີ່ມ configuration. ຕົວຢ່າງ: root path (nullptr, NodePath), replication "
"(Node, Spawner|Synchronizer), custom.\n"
"func _object_configuration_add(object, config: Variant) -> Error:\n"
"\tif config is MultiplayerSynchronizer:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Adding synchronization configuration for %s. Synchronizer: %s\" % "
"[object, config])\n"
"\telif config is MultiplayerSpawner:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Adding node %s to the spawn list. Spawner: %s\" % [object, "
"config])\n"
"\treturn base_multiplayer.object_configuration_add(object, config)\n"
"\n"
"# ບັນທຶກການລຶບ configuration. ຕົວຢ່າງ: root path (nullptr, NodePath), replication "
"(Node, Spawner|Synchronizer), custom.\n"
"func _object_configuration_remove(object, config: Variant) -> Error:\n"
"\tif config is MultiplayerSynchronizer:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Removing synchronization configuration for %s. Synchronizer: %s\" "
"% [object, config])\n"
"\telif config is MultiplayerSpawner:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Removing node %s from the spawn list. Spawner: %s\" % [object, "
"config])\n"
"\treturn base_multiplayer.object_configuration_remove(object, config)\n"
"\n"
"# ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະເປັນທາງເລືອກ, ແຕ່ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງພວກເຮົາ ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການຂະຫຍາຍ "
"SceneMultiplayer, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງສົ່ງຕໍ່ທຸກຢ່າງ.\n"
"func _set_multiplayer_peer(p_peer: MultiplayerPeer):\n"
"\tbase_multiplayer.multiplayer_peer = p_peer\n"
"\n"
"func _get_multiplayer_peer() -> MultiplayerPeer:\n"
"\treturn base_multiplayer.multiplayer_peer\n"
"\n"
"func _get_unique_id() -> int:\n"
"\treturn base_multiplayer.get_unique_id()\n"
"\n"
"func _get_remote_sender_id() -> int:\n"
"\treturn base_multiplayer.get_remote_sender_id()\n"
"\n"
"func _get_peer_ids() -> PackedInt32Array:\n"
"\treturn base_multiplayer.get_peers()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ຈາກນັ້ນໃນ scene ຫຼັກຂອງທ່ານ ຫຼື ໃນ autoload ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"SceneTree.set_multiplayer] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມນຳໃຊ້ custom [MultiplayerAPI] ຂອງທ່ານ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# autoload.gd\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\t# ຕັ້ງຄ່າ custom multiplayer ຂອງພວກເຮົາເປັນຕົວຫຼັກໃນ SceneTree.\n"
"\tget_tree().set_multiplayer(LogMultiplayer.new())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Native extensions ສາມາດເລືອກໃຊ້ວິທີ [method MultiplayerAPI.set_default_interface] "
"ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບ ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າຕົວເອງໃຫ້ເປັນການປະຕິບັດງານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Called when the [member MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer] is retrieved."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [member MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer] ຖືກດຶງຂໍ້ມູນອອກມາ."

msgid "Callback for [method MultiplayerAPI.get_peers]."
msgstr "Callback ສຳລັບ [method MultiplayerAPI.get_peers]."

msgid "Callback for [method MultiplayerAPI.get_remote_sender_id]."
msgstr "Callback ສຳລັບ [method MultiplayerAPI.get_remote_sender_id]."

msgid "Callback for [method MultiplayerAPI.get_unique_id]."
msgstr "Callback ສຳລັບ [method MultiplayerAPI.get_unique_id]."

msgid "Callback for [method MultiplayerAPI.object_configuration_add]."
msgstr "Callback ສຳລັບ [method MultiplayerAPI.object_configuration_add]."

msgid "Callback for [method MultiplayerAPI.object_configuration_remove]."
msgstr "Callback ສຳລັບ [method MultiplayerAPI.object_configuration_remove]."

msgid "Callback for [method MultiplayerAPI.poll]."
msgstr "Callback ສຳລັບ [method MultiplayerAPI.poll]."

msgid "Callback for [method MultiplayerAPI.rpc]."
msgstr "Callback ສຳລັບ [method MultiplayerAPI.rpc]."

msgid "Called when the [member MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer] is set."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [member MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer] ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

msgid ""
"Abstract class for specialized [PacketPeer]s used by the [MultiplayerAPI]."
msgstr "ຄລາສນາມມະທຳ (abstract class) ສຳລັບ [PacketPeer] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [MultiplayerAPI]."

msgid ""
"Immediately close the multiplayer peer returning to the state [constant "
"CONNECTION_DISCONNECTED]. Connected peers will be dropped without emitting "
"[signal peer_disconnected]."
msgstr ""
"ປິດ multiplayer peer ທັນທີ ໂດຍກັບຄືນສູ່ສະຖານະ [constant CONNECTION_DISCONNECTED]. "
"peer ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ຈະຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການສົ່ງ [signal peer_disconnected]."

msgid ""
"Disconnects the given [param peer] from this host. If [param force] is "
"[code]true[/code] the [signal peer_disconnected] signal will not be emitted "
"for this peer."
msgstr ""
"ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ [param peer] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ອອກຈາກ host ນີ້. ຖ້າ [param force] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code], ສັນຍານ [signal peer_disconnected] ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກສຳລັບ peer ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns a randomly generated integer that can be used as a network unique ID."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕົວເລກຈຳນວນຖ້ວນທີ່ສຸ່ມຂຶ້ນມາ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນ network unique ID ໄດ້."

msgid "Returns the current state of the connection."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the channel over which the next available packet was received. See "
"[method PacketPeer.get_available_packet_count]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊ່ອງທາງ (channel) ທີ່ packet ຖັດໄປທີ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານຖືກຮັບມາ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"PacketPeer.get_available_packet_count]."

msgid ""
"Returns the transfer mode the remote peer used to send the next available "
"packet. See [method PacketPeer.get_available_packet_count]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໂໝດການສົ່ງ (transfer mode) ທີ່ peer ໄລຍະໄກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງ packet ຖັດໄປທີ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method PacketPeer.get_available_packet_count]."

msgid ""
"Returns the ID of the [MultiplayerPeer] who sent the next available packet. "
"See [method PacketPeer.get_available_packet_count]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ຂອງ [MultiplayerPeer] ທີ່ສົ່ງ packet ຖັດໄປທີ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"PacketPeer.get_available_packet_count]."

msgid "Returns the ID of this [MultiplayerPeer]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ຂອງ [MultiplayerPeer] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the server can act as a relay in the current "
"configuration. That is, if the higher level [MultiplayerAPI] should notify "
"connected clients of other peers, and implement a relay protocol to allow "
"communication between them."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ server ສາມາດເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ relay ໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນ. ນັ້ນຄື, "
"ຖ້າ [MultiplayerAPI] ລະດັບທີ່ສູງກວ່າຄວນແຈ້ງເຕືອນ client ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ກ່ຽວກັບ peer ອື່ນໆ, ແລະ "
"ປະຕິບັດຕາມ relay protocol ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດສື່ສານລະຫວ່າງກັນໄດ້."

msgid "Waits up to 1 second to receive a new network event."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າສູງສຸດ 1 ວິນາທີເພື່ອຮັບ network event ໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Sets the peer to which packets will be sent.\n"
"The [param id] can be one of: [constant TARGET_PEER_BROADCAST] to send to all "
"connected peers, [constant TARGET_PEER_SERVER] to send to the peer acting as "
"server, a valid peer ID to send to that specific peer, a negative peer ID to "
"send to all peers except that one. By default, the target peer is [constant "
"TARGET_PEER_BROADCAST]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ peer ທີ່ຈະສົ່ງ packet ໄປຫາ.\n"
"[param id] ສາມາດເປັນໜຶ່ງໃນ: [constant TARGET_PEER_BROADCAST] ເພື່ອສົ່ງໃຫ້ທຸກ peer "
"ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່, [constant TARGET_PEER_SERVER] ເພື່ອສົ່ງໃຫ້ peer ທີ່ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ server, peer "
"ID ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເພື່ອສົ່ງໃຫ້ peer ສະເພາະຕົວນັ້ນ, ຫຼື peer ID ທີ່ເປັນຄ່າລົບເພື່ອສົ່ງໃຫ້ທຸກ peer ຍົກເວັ້ນ peer "
"ຕົວນັ້ນ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, peer ເປົ້າໝາຍແມ່ນ [constant TARGET_PEER_BROADCAST]."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], this [MultiplayerPeer] refuses new connections."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [MultiplayerPeer] ນີ້ຈະປະຕິເສດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"The channel to use to send packets. Many network APIs such as ENet and WebRTC "
"allow the creation of multiple independent channels which behaves, in a way, "
"like separate connections. This means that reliable data will only block "
"delivery of other packets on that channel, and ordering will only be in "
"respect to the channel the packet is being sent on. Using different channels "
"to send [b]different and independent[/b] state updates is a common way to "
"optimize network usage and decrease latency in fast-paced games.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default channel ([code]0[/code]) actually works as 3 "
"separate channels (one for each [enum TransferMode]) so that [constant "
"TRANSFER_MODE_RELIABLE] and [constant TRANSFER_MODE_UNRELIABLE_ORDERED] does "
"not interact with each other by default. Refer to the specific network API "
"documentation (e.g. ENet or WebRTC) to learn how to set up channels correctly."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງທາງ (channel) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການສົ່ງ packet. network API ຫຼາຍໆຕົວ ເຊັ່ນ ENet ແລະ WebRTC "
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສ້າງຫຼາຍຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເປັນອິດສະຫຼະຕໍ່ກັນ ເຊິ່ງມີພຶດຕິກຳຄ້າຍຄືກັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ແຍກຈາກກັນ. "
"ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ (reliable data) ຈະບລັອກການສົ່ງ packet "
"ອື່ນໆສະເພາະໃນຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ ການຈັດລຳດັບຈະກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສະເພາະກັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ packet ຖືກສົ່ງໄປ. "
"ການໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນເພື່ອສົ່ງການອັບເດດສະຖານະທີ່ [b]ແຕກຕ່າງ ແລະ ເປັນອິດສະຫຼະຕໍ່ກັນ[/b] "
"ແມ່ນວິທີທົ່ວໄປໃນການປັບປຸງການໃຊ້ເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຫຼຸດ latency ໃນເກມທີ່ມີຄວາມໄວສູງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊ່ອງທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ([code]0[/code]) ແທ້ຈິງແລ້ວເຮັດວຽກເປັນ 3 ຊ່ອງທາງແຍກກັນ "
"(ໜຶ່ງຊ່ອງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ [enum TransferMode]) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ [constant TRANSFER_MODE_RELIABLE] "
"ແລະ [constant TRANSFER_MODE_UNRELIABLE_ORDERED] ບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ກັນໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. "
"ໃຫ້ອ້າງອີງເຖິງເອກະສານ network API ສະເພາະ (ເຊັ່ນ: ENet ຫຼື WebRTC) "
"ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ອງທາງໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"The manner in which to send packets to the target peer. See the [method "
"set_target_peer] method."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບໃນການສົ່ງ packet ໄປຫາ peer ເປົ້າໝາຍ. ເບິ່ງວິທີ [method set_target_peer]."

msgid "Emitted when a remote peer connects."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ peer ໄລຍະໄກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid "Emitted when a remote peer has disconnected."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ peer ໄລຍະໄກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid "The MultiplayerPeer is disconnected."
msgstr "MultiplayerPeer ຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid "The MultiplayerPeer is currently connecting to a server."
msgstr "MultiplayerPeer ກຳລັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີ."

msgid "This MultiplayerPeer is connected."
msgstr "MultiplayerPeer ນີ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid "Packets are sent to all connected peers."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາພີຣ໌ທັງໝົດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່."

msgid "Packets are sent to the remote peer acting as server."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາພີຣ໌ປາຍທາງທີ່ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນເຊີເວີ."

msgid ""
"Packets are not acknowledged, no resend attempts are made for lost packets. "
"Packets may arrive in any order. Potentially faster than [constant "
"TRANSFER_MODE_UNRELIABLE_ORDERED]. Use for non-critical data, and always "
"consider whether the order matters."
msgstr ""
"ແພັກເກັດຈະບໍ່ມີການຢືນຢັນການຮັບ, ບໍ່ມີການພະຍາຍາມສົ່ງໃໝ່ຫາກແພັກເກັດເສຍຫາຍ. "
"ແພັກເກັດອາດຈະມາຮອດໃນລຳດັບໃດກໍໄດ້. ອາດຈະໄວກວ່າ [constant "
"TRANSFER_MODE_UNRELIABLE_ORDERED]. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ສຳຄັນຫຼາຍ, ແລະ "
"ຄວນພິຈາລະນາສະເໝີວ່າລຳດັບການຮັບນັ້ນສຳຄັນຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Packets are not acknowledged, no resend attempts are made for lost packets. "
"Packets are received in the order they were sent in. Potentially faster than "
"[constant TRANSFER_MODE_RELIABLE]. Use for non-critical data or data that "
"would be outdated if received late due to resend attempt(s) anyway, for "
"example movement and positional data."
msgstr ""
"ແພັກເກັດຈະບໍ່ມີການຢືນຢັນການຮັບ, ບໍ່ມີການພະຍາຍາມສົ່ງໃໝ່ຫາກແພັກເກັດເສຍຫາຍ. "
"ແພັກເກັດຈະຖືກຮັບຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ສົ່ງມາ. ອາດຈະໄວກວ່າ [constant TRANSFER_MODE_RELIABLE]. "
"ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ສຳຄັນຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈະກາຍເປັນຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າຫາກໄດ້ຮັບຊ້າ (ຍ້ອນການສົ່ງໃໝ່), ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ "
"ຂໍ້ມູນການເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Packets must be received and resend attempts should be made until the packets "
"are acknowledged. Packets must be received in the order they were sent in. "
"Most reliable transfer mode, but potentially the slowest due to the overhead. "
"Use for critical data that must be transmitted and arrive in order, for "
"example an ability being triggered or a chat message. Consider carefully if "
"the information really is critical, and use sparingly."
msgstr ""
"ແພັກເກັດຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນ ແລະ ຈະມີການພະຍາຍາມສົ່ງໃໝ່ຈົນກວ່າຈະໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນ. "
"ແພັກເກັດຕ້ອງຖືກຮັບຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ສົ່ງມາ. ເປັນໂໝດການສົ່ງທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ, "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະຊ້າທີ່ສຸດຍ້ອນການຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຫຼາຍ. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳຄັນທີ່ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບ ແລະ ຮຽງຕາມລຳດັບ, "
"ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ການໃຊ້ສະກິວ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຄວາມແຊັດ. ຄວນພິຈາລະນາຢ່າງລະອຽດວ່າຂໍ້ມູນນັ້ນສຳຄັນແທ້ຫຼືບໍ່, ແລະ "
"ຄວນໃຊ້ໃນຍາມທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

msgid ""
"Class that can be inherited to implement custom multiplayer API networking "
"layers via GDExtension."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດທີ່ສາມາດສືບທອດເພື່ອສ້າງເລເຢີເຄືອຂ່າຍ multiplayer API ແບບກຳນົດເອງຜ່ານ GDExtension."

msgid ""
"This class is designed to be inherited from a GDExtension plugin to implement "
"custom networking layers for the multiplayer API (such as WebRTC). All the "
"methods below [b]must[/b] be implemented to have a working custom multiplayer "
"implementation. See also [MultiplayerAPI]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດນີ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ສືບທອດຈາກປລັກອິນ GDExtension ເພື່ອສ້າງເລເຢີເຄືອຂ່າຍສຳລັບ "
"multiplayer API (ເຊັ່ນ WebRTC). ເມທອດທັງໝົດລຸ່ມນີ້ [b]ຕ້ອງ[/b] ຖືກຂຽນຂຶ້ນມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບ "
"multiplayer ແບບກຳນົດເອງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [MultiplayerAPI]."

msgid ""
"Called when the multiplayer peer should be immediately closed (see [method "
"MultiplayerPeer.close])."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອ multiplayer peer ຄວນຖືກປິດທັນທີ (ເບິ່ງ [method MultiplayerPeer.close])."

msgid ""
"Called when the connected [param peer] should be forcibly disconnected (see "
"[method MultiplayerPeer.disconnect_peer])."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອ [param peer] ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ຄວນຖືກບັງຄັບໃຫ້ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"MultiplayerPeer.disconnect_peer])."

msgid ""
"Called when the available packet count is internally requested by the "
"[MultiplayerAPI]."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອ [MultiplayerAPI] ຮ້ອງຂໍຈຳນວນແພັກເກັດທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈາກພາຍໃນ."

msgid ""
"Called when the connection status is requested on the [MultiplayerPeer] (see "
"[method MultiplayerPeer.get_connection_status])."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍສະຖານະການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນ [MultiplayerPeer] (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"MultiplayerPeer.get_connection_status])."

msgid ""
"Called when the maximum allowed packet size (in bytes) is requested by the "
"[MultiplayerAPI]."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອ [MultiplayerAPI] ຮ້ອງຂໍຂະໜາດແພັກເກັດສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ (ເປັນໄບຕ໌)."

msgid ""
"Called when a packet needs to be received by the [MultiplayerAPI], with "
"[param r_buffer_size] being the size of the binary [param r_buffer] in bytes."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອ [MultiplayerAPI] ຕ້ອງການຮັບແພັກເກັດ, ໂດຍທີ່ [param r_buffer_size] "
"ແມ່ນຂະໜາດຂອງໄບນາຣີ [param r_buffer] ເປັນໄບຕ໌."

msgid ""
"Called to get the channel over which the next available packet was received. "
"See [method MultiplayerPeer.get_packet_channel]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເພື່ອເອົາຊ່ອງທາງ (channel) ທີ່ແພັກເກັດຖັດໄປຖືກຮັບມາ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"MultiplayerPeer.get_packet_channel]."

msgid ""
"Called to get the transfer mode the remote peer used to send the next "
"available packet. See [method MultiplayerPeer.get_packet_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເພື່ອເອົາໂໝດການສົ່ງ (transfer mode) ທີ່ພີຣ໌ປາຍທາງໃຊ້ສົ່ງແພັກເກັດຖັດໄປ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"MultiplayerPeer.get_packet_mode]."

msgid ""
"Called when the ID of the [MultiplayerPeer] who sent the most recent packet "
"is requested (see [method MultiplayerPeer.get_packet_peer])."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍ ID ຂອງ [MultiplayerPeer] ທີ່ສົ່ງແພັກເກັດຫຼ້າສຸດ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"MultiplayerPeer.get_packet_peer])."

msgid ""
"Called when a packet needs to be received by the [MultiplayerAPI], if [method "
"_get_packet] isn't implemented. Use this when extending this class via "
"GDScript."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອ [MultiplayerAPI] ຕ້ອງການຮັບແພັກເກັດ, ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນ [method _get_packet] "
"ໄວ້. ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເມື່ອຂະຫຍາຍຄລາດຜ່ານ GDScript."

msgid ""
"Called when the transfer channel to use is read on this [MultiplayerPeer] "
"(see [member MultiplayerPeer.transfer_channel])."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອມີການອ່ານຊ່ອງທາງການສົ່ງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ [MultiplayerPeer] ນີ້ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"MultiplayerPeer.transfer_channel])."

msgid ""
"Called when the transfer mode to use is read on this [MultiplayerPeer] (see "
"[member MultiplayerPeer.transfer_mode])."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອມີການອ່ານໂໝດການສົ່ງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ [MultiplayerPeer] ນີ້ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"MultiplayerPeer.transfer_mode])."

msgid ""
"Called when the unique ID of this [MultiplayerPeer] is requested (see [method "
"MultiplayerPeer.get_unique_id]). The value must be between [code]1[/code] and "
"[code]2147483647[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍ ID ສະເພາະຕົວຂອງ [MultiplayerPeer] ນີ້ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"MultiplayerPeer.get_unique_id]). ຄ່າຕ້ອງຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]1[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]2147483647[/code]."

msgid ""
"Called when the \"refuse new connections\" status is requested on this "
"[MultiplayerPeer] (see [member MultiplayerPeer.refuse_new_connections])."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍສະຖານະ \"ປະຕິເສດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່\" ໃນ [MultiplayerPeer] ນີ້ (ເບິ່ງ "
"[member MultiplayerPeer.refuse_new_connections])."

msgid ""
"Called when the \"is server\" status is requested on the [MultiplayerAPI]. "
"See [method MultiplayerAPI.is_server]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍສະຖານະ \"ແມ່ນເຊີເວີ\" ໃນ [MultiplayerAPI]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"MultiplayerAPI.is_server]."

msgid ""
"Called to check if the server can act as a relay in the current "
"configuration. See [method MultiplayerPeer.is_server_relay_supported]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເພື່ອຢັ້ງຢືນວ່າເຊີເວີສາມາດເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຕົວສົ່ງຕໍ່ (relay) ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"MultiplayerPeer.is_server_relay_supported]."

msgid ""
"Called when the [MultiplayerAPI] is polled. See [method MultiplayerAPI.poll]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອ [MultiplayerAPI] ຖືກໂພລ (poll). ເບິ່ງ [method MultiplayerAPI.poll]."

msgid ""
"Called when a packet needs to be sent by the [MultiplayerAPI], with [param "
"buffer_size] being the size of the binary [param buffer] in bytes."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອ [MultiplayerAPI] ຕ້ອງການສົ່ງແພັກເກັດ, ໂດຍທີ່ [param buffer_size] "
"ແມ່ນຂະໜາດຂອງ [param buffer] ໄບນາຣີເປັນໄບຕ໌."

msgid ""
"Called when a packet needs to be sent by the [MultiplayerAPI], if [method "
"_put_packet] isn't implemented. Use this when extending this class via "
"GDScript."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອ [MultiplayerAPI] ຕ້ອງການສົ່ງແພັກເກັດ, ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນ [method _put_packet] "
"ໄວ້. ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເມື່ອຂະຫຍາຍຄລາດຜ່ານ GDScript."

msgid ""
"Called when the \"refuse new connections\" status is set on this "
"[MultiplayerPeer] (see [member MultiplayerPeer.refuse_new_connections])."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອສະຖານະ \"ປະຕິເສດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່\" ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ [MultiplayerPeer] ນີ້ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"MultiplayerPeer.refuse_new_connections])."

msgid ""
"Called when the target peer to use is set for this [MultiplayerPeer] (see "
"[method MultiplayerPeer.set_target_peer])."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າພີຣ໌ເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ [MultiplayerPeer] ນີ້ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"MultiplayerPeer.set_target_peer])."

msgid ""
"Called when the channel to use is set for this [MultiplayerPeer] (see [member "
"MultiplayerPeer.transfer_channel])."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ [MultiplayerPeer] ນີ້ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"MultiplayerPeer.transfer_channel])."

msgid ""
"Called when the transfer mode is set on this [MultiplayerPeer] (see [member "
"MultiplayerPeer.transfer_mode])."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອໂໝດການສົ່ງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ [MultiplayerPeer] ນີ້ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"MultiplayerPeer.transfer_mode])."

msgid ""
"Automatically replicates spawnable nodes from the authority to other "
"multiplayer peers."
msgstr "ຈຳລອງໂນດທີ່ສະປອນໄດ້ຈາກ authority ໄປຫາພີຣ໌ອື່ນໆໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Spawnable scenes can be configured in the editor or through code (see [method "
"add_spawnable_scene]).\n"
"Also supports custom node spawns through [method spawn], calling [member "
"spawn_function] on all peers.\n"
"Internally, [MultiplayerSpawner] uses [method "
"MultiplayerAPI.object_configuration_add] to notify spawns passing the spawned "
"node as the [code]object[/code] and itself as the [code]configuration[/code], "
"and [method MultiplayerAPI.object_configuration_remove] to notify despawns in "
"a similar way."
msgstr ""
"ສາກ (scene) ທີ່ສະປອນໄດ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໃນ editor ຫຼື ຜ່ານໂຄ້ດ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"add_spawnable_scene]).\n"
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງຮອງຮັບການສະປອນໂນດແບບກຳນົດເອງຜ່ານ [method spawn], ໂດຍການເອີ້ນ [member "
"spawn_function] ໃນທຸກໆພີຣ໌.\n"
"ພາຍໃນ, [MultiplayerSpawner] ໃຊ້ [method "
"MultiplayerAPI.object_configuration_add] "
"ເພື່ອແຈ້ງເຕືອນການສະປອນໂດຍສົ່ງໂນດທີ່ສະປອນແລ້ວເປັນ [code]object[/code] ແລະ ຕົວມັນເອງເປັນ "
"[code]configuration[/code], ແລະ ໃຊ້ [method "
"MultiplayerAPI.object_configuration_remove] ເພື່ອແຈ້ງເຕືອນການລຶບ (despawn) "
"ໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"Adds a scene path to spawnable scenes, making it automatically replicated "
"from the multiplayer authority to other peers when added as children of the "
"node pointed by [member spawn_path]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເສັ້ນທາງສາກ (scene path) ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການທີ່ສະປອນໄດ້, ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນຖືກຈຳລອງຈາກ multiplayer "
"authority ໄປຫາພີຣ໌ອື່ນໆໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເມື່ອຖືກເພີ່ມເປັນໂນດລູກຂອງໂນດທີ່ [member spawn_path] "
"ຊີ້ໄປ."

msgid ""
"Clears all spawnable scenes. Does not despawn existing instances on remote "
"peers."
msgstr "ລຶບລາຍການສາກທີ່ສະປອນໄດ້ທັງໝົດ. ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ລຶບ instance ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນພີຣ໌ປາຍທາງ."

msgid "Returns the spawnable scene path by index."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງສາກທີ່ສະປອນໄດ້ຕາມລຳດັບ index."

msgid "Returns the count of spawnable scene paths."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນຂອງເສັ້ນທາງສາກທີ່ສະປອນໄດ້ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Requests a custom spawn, with [param data] passed to [member spawn_function] "
"on all peers. Returns the locally spawned node instance already inside the "
"scene tree, and added as a child of the node pointed by [member spawn_path].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Spawnable scenes are spawned automatically. [method spawn] is "
"only needed for custom spawns."
msgstr ""
"ຮ້ອງຂໍການສະປອນແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ໂດຍສົ່ງ [param data] ໄປຫາ [member spawn_function] "
"ໃນທຸກໆພີຣ໌. ຄືນຄ່າ instance ຂອງໂນດທີ່ສະປອນພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ ເຊິ່ງຢູ່ໃນ scene tree ແລ້ວ ແລະ "
"ຖືກເພີ່ມເປັນລູກຂອງໂນດທີ່ [member spawn_path] ຊີ້ໄປ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາກທີ່ຢູ່ໃນລາຍການສະປອນຈະຖືກສະປອນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. [method spawn] "
"ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສະເພາະການສະປອນແບບກຳນົດເອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Method called on all peers when a custom [method spawn] is requested by the "
"authority. Will receive the [code]data[/code] parameter, and should return a "
"[Node] that is not in the scene tree.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned node should [b]not[/b] be added to the scene with "
"[method Node.add_child]. This is done automatically."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດທີ່ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃນທຸກໆພີຣ໌ ເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍ [method spawn] ແບບກຳນົດເອງຈາກ authority. "
"ຈະໄດ້ຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີ [code]data[/code], ແລະ ຄວນຄືນຄ່າ [Node] ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນຢູ່ໃນ scene tree.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ [b]ບໍ່ຄວນ[/b] ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນສາກດ້ວຍ [method "
"Node.add_child] ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ເພາະລະບົບຈະຈັດການໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of nodes allowed to be spawned by this spawner. Includes both "
"spawnable scenes and custom spawns.\n"
"When set to [code]0[/code] (the default), there is no limit."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນໂນດສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສະປອນໂດຍ spawner ນີ້. ລວມທັງສາກທີ່ສະປອນໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ການສະປອນແບບກຳນົດເອງ.\n"
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/code] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຈະບໍ່ມີການຈຳກັດ."

msgid ""
"Path to the spawn root. Spawnable scenes that are added as direct children "
"are replicated to other peers."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ spawn root. ສາກທີ່ສະປອນໄດ້ທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເປັນລູກໂດຍກົງ ຈະຖືກຈຳລອງໄປຫາພີຣ໌ອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a spawnable scene or custom spawn was despawned by the "
"multiplayer authority. Only called on remote peers."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອສາກທີ່ສະປອນໄດ້ ຫຼື ການສະປອນແບບກຳນົດເອງຖືກລຶບ (despawn) ໂດຍ multiplayer "
"authority. ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນສະເພາະໃນພີຣ໌ປາຍທາງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a spawnable scene or custom spawn was spawned by the multiplayer "
"authority. Only called on remote peers."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອສາກທີ່ສະປອນໄດ້ ຫຼື ການສະປອນແບບກຳນົດເອງຖືກສະປອນໂດຍ multiplayer "
"authority. ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນສະເພາະໃນພີຣ໌ປາຍທາງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Synchronizes properties from the multiplayer authority to the remote peers."
msgstr ""
"ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ (Synchronize) ຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆຈາກ multiplayer authority ໄປຫາພີຣ໌ປາຍທາງ."

msgid ""
"By default, [MultiplayerSynchronizer] synchronizes configured properties to "
"all peers.\n"
"Visibility can be handled directly with [method set_visibility_for] or as-"
"needed with [method add_visibility_filter] and [method update_visibility].\n"
"[MultiplayerSpawner]s will handle nodes according to visibility of "
"synchronizers as long as the node at [member root_path] was spawned by one.\n"
"Internally, [MultiplayerSynchronizer] uses [method "
"MultiplayerAPI.object_configuration_add] to notify synchronization start "
"passing the [Node] at [member root_path] as the [code]object[/code] and "
"itself as the [code]configuration[/code], and uses [method "
"MultiplayerAPI.object_configuration_remove] to notify synchronization end in "
"a similar way.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Synchronization is not supported for [Object] type properties, "
"like [Resource]. Properties that are unique to each peer, like the instance "
"IDs of [Object]s (see [method Object.get_instance_id]) or [RID]s, will also "
"not work in synchronization."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, [MultiplayerSynchronizer] ຈະຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ໃຫ້ກັບທຸກໆພີຣ໌.\n"
"ການເບິ່ງເຫັນ (Visibility) ສາມາດຈັດການໄດ້ໂດຍກົງດ້ວຍ [method set_visibility_for] ຫຼື "
"ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ວຍ [method add_visibility_filter] ແລະ [method "
"update_visibility].\n"
"[MultiplayerSpawner] ຈະຈັດການໂນດຕາມການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງ synchronizer ຕາບໃດທີ່ໂນດຢູ່ "
"[member root_path] ຖືກສະປອນໂດຍຕົວໃດຕົວໜຶ່ງ.\n"
"ພາຍໃນ, [MultiplayerSynchronizer] ໃຊ້ [method "
"MultiplayerAPI.object_configuration_add] ເພື່ອແຈ້ງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ ໂດຍສົ່ງ [Node] "
"ຢູ່ [member root_path] ເປັນ [code]object[/code] ແລະ ຕົວມັນເອງເປັນ "
"[code]configuration[/code], ແລະ ໃຊ້ [method "
"MultiplayerAPI.object_configuration_remove] "
"ເພື່ອແຈ້ງການສິ້ນສຸດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດປະເພດ [Object] ເຊັ່ນ [Resource]. "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດສະເພາະຂອງແຕ່ລະພີຣ໌ ເຊັ່ນ instance IDs ຂອງ [Object] (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"Object.get_instance_id]) ຫຼື [RID], ກໍຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Adds a peer visibility filter for this synchronizer.\n"
"[param filter] should take a peer ID [int] and return a [bool]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງພີຣ໌ (visibility filter) ສຳລັບ synchronizer ນີ້.\n"
"[param filter] ຄວນຮັບຄ່າ ID ຂອງພີຣ໌ [int] ແລະ ຄືນຄ່າເປັນ [bool]."

msgid "Queries the current visibility for peer [param peer]."
msgstr "ກວດສອບສະຖານະການເບິ່ງເຫັນປັດຈຸບັນສຳລັບພີຣ໌ [param peer]."

msgid "Removes a peer visibility filter from this synchronizer."
msgstr "ລຶບຕົວຕອງການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງພີຣ໌ອອກຈາກ synchronizer ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the visibility of [param peer] to [param visible]. If [param peer] is "
"[code]0[/code], the value of [member public_visibility] will be updated "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງ [param peer] ໃຫ້ເປັນ [param visible]. ຖ້າ [param peer] ແມ່ນ "
"[code]0[/code], ຄ່າຂອງ [member public_visibility] ຈະຖືກອັບເດດແທນ."

msgid ""
"Updates the visibility of [param for_peer] according to visibility filters. "
"If [param for_peer] is [code]0[/code] (the default), all peers' visibilties "
"are updated."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງ [param for_peer] ຕາມຕົວຕອງການເບິ່ງເຫັນ. ຖ້າ [param for_peer] ແມ່ນ "
"[code]0[/code] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງທຸກໆພີຣ໌ຈະຖືກອັບເດດ."

msgid ""
"Time interval between delta synchronizations. Used when the replication is "
"set to [constant SceneReplicationConfig.REPLICATION_MODE_ON_CHANGE]. If set "
"to [code]0.0[/code] (the default), delta synchronizations happen every "
"network process frame."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງເວລາລະຫວ່າງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ແບບເດວຕ້າ (delta synchronization). "
"ໃຊ້ເມື່ອຕັ້ງການຈຳລອງເປັນ [constant "
"SceneReplicationConfig.REPLICATION_MODE_ON_CHANGE]. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0.0[/code] "
"(ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມຂອງ network process."

msgid ""
"Whether synchronization should be visible to all peers by default. See "
"[method set_visibility_for] and [method add_visibility_filter] for ways of "
"configuring fine-grained visibility options."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ຄວນຈະເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ໂດຍທຸກໆພີຣ໌ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫຼືບໍ່. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_visibility_for] ແລະ [method add_visibility_filter] "
"ສຳລັບວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເບິ່ງເຫັນແບບລະອຽດ."

msgid "Resource containing which properties to synchronize."
msgstr "Resource ທີ່ເກັບລາຍຊື່ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຈະຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌."

msgid ""
"Time interval between synchronizations. Used when the replication is set to "
"[constant SceneReplicationConfig.REPLICATION_MODE_ALWAYS]. If set to "
"[code]0.0[/code] (the default), synchronizations happen every network process "
"frame."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງເວລາລະຫວ່າງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌. ໃຊ້ເມື່ອຕັ້ງການຈຳລອງເປັນ [constant "
"SceneReplicationConfig.REPLICATION_MODE_ALWAYS]. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0.0[/code] "
"(ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມຂອງ network process."

msgid ""
"Node path that replicated properties are relative to.\n"
"If [member root_path] was spawned by a [MultiplayerSpawner], the node will be "
"also be spawned and despawned based on this synchronizer visibility options."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໂນດທີ່ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຖືກຈຳລອງຈະອ້າງອີງໃສ່.\n"
"ຖ້າ [member root_path] ຖືກສະປອນໂດຍ [MultiplayerSpawner], ໂນດນັ້ນກໍຈະຖືກສະປອນ ແລະ ລຶບ "
"(despawn) ໂດຍອີງຕາມຕົວເລືອກການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງ synchronizer ນີ້."

msgid "Specifies when visibility filters are updated."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າຈະໃຫ້ອັບເດດຕົວຕອງການເບິ່ງເຫັນໃນຕອນໃດ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a new delta synchronization state is received by this "
"synchronizer after the properties have been updated."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອ synchronizer ນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບສະຖານະການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ແບບເດວຕ້າໃໝ່ "
"ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆຖືກອັບເດດແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a new synchronization state is received by this synchronizer "
"after the properties have been updated."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອ synchronizer ນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບສະຖານະການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ໃໝ່ "
"ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆຖືກອັບເດດແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when visibility of [param for_peer] is updated. See [method "
"update_visibility]."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງ [param for_peer] ຖືກອັບເດດ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"update_visibility]."

msgid ""
"Visibility filters are updated during process frames (see [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PROCESS])."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຕອງການເບິ່ງເຫັນຈະຖືກອັບເດດໃນລະຫວ່າງ process frames (ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PROCESS])."

msgid ""
"Visibility filters are updated during physics frames (see [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PHYSICS_PROCESS])."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຕອງການເບິ່ງເຫັນຈະຖືກອັບເດດໃນລະຫວ່າງ physics frames (ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PHYSICS_PROCESS])."

msgid ""
"Visibility filters are not updated automatically, and must be updated "
"manually by calling [method update_visibility]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຕອງການເບິ່ງເຫັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກອັບເດດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ຕ້ອງອັບເດດເອງໂດຍການເອີ້ນ [method "
"update_visibility]."

msgid "A binary [Semaphore] for synchronization of multiple [Thread]s."
msgstr "[Semaphore] ແບບບາຍນາຣີສຳລັບການເຮັດໃຫ້ຫຼາຍ [Thread] ກົງກັນ."

msgid ""
"A synchronization mutex (mutual exclusion). This is used to synchronize "
"multiple [Thread]s, and is equivalent to a binary [Semaphore]. It guarantees "
"that only one thread can access a critical section at a time.\n"
"This is a reentrant mutex, meaning that it can be locked multiple times by "
"one thread, provided it also unlocks it as many times.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] To ensure proper cleanup without crashes or deadlocks, the "
"following conditions must be met:\n"
"- When a [Mutex]'s reference count reaches zero and it is therefore "
"destroyed, no threads (including the one on which the destruction will "
"happen) must have it locked.\n"
"- When a [Thread]'s reference count reaches zero and it is therefore "
"destroyed, it must not have any mutex locked."
msgstr ""
"ມິວເທັກຊ໌ (mutex) ສຳລັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ (mutual exclusion). ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຫຼາຍ [Thread] "
"ເຮັດວຽກສອດຄ່ອງກັນ, ແລະ ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [Semaphore] ແບບບາຍນາຣີ. "
"ມັນຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະມີພຽງເທຣດດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງພາກສ່ວນທີ່ສຳຄັນ (critical section) "
"ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ.\n"
"ນີ້ແມ່ນ reentrant mutex, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນສາມາດຖືກລັອກໄດ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງໂດຍເທຣດດຽວ, "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງປົດລັອກໃນຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ເທົ່າກັນ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນການລຶບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຄ້າງ (crash) ຫຼື ເກີດ deadlock, "
"ຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"- ເມື່ອການອ້າງອີງຂອງ [Mutex] ເປັນສູນ ແລະ ຖືກທຳລາຍ, ຈະຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີເທຣດໃດໆ "
"(ລວມທັງເທຣດທີ່ກຳລັງທຳລາຍມັນ) ລັອກມັນໄວ້.\n"
"- ເມື່ອການອ້າງອີງຂອງ [Thread] ເປັນສູນ ແລະ ຖືກທຳລາຍ, "
"ເທຣດນັ້ນຈະຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີມິວເທັກຊ໌ໃດໆທີ່ຖືກລັອກຄ້າງໄວ້."

msgid "Using multiple threads"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ງານຫຼາຍເທຣດ (multiple threads)"

msgid "Thread-safe APIs"
msgstr "APIs ທີ່ປອດໄພສຳລັບເທຣດ (Thread-safe)"

msgid ""
"Locks this [Mutex], blocks until it is unlocked by the current owner.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function returns without blocking if the thread already has "
"ownership of the mutex."
msgstr ""
"ລັອກ [Mutex] ນີ້, ຈະຢຸດລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າເຈົ້າຂອງຄົນປັດຈຸບັນຈະປົດລັອກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະຄືນຄ່າທັນທີໂດຍບໍ່ຢຸດລໍຖ້າ ຖ້າເທຣດນັ້ນເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງມິວເທັກຊ໌ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Tries locking this [Mutex], but does not block. Returns [code]true[/code] on "
"success, [code]false[/code] otherwise.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function returns [code]true[/code] if the thread already "
"has ownership of the mutex."
msgstr ""
"ພະຍາຍາມລັອກ [Mutex] ນີ້, ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ຢຸດລໍຖ້າ (non-blocking). ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] "
"ຖ້າສຳເລັດ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນແມ່ນ [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເທຣດນັ້ນເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງມິວເທັກຊ໌ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Unlocks this [Mutex], leaving it to other threads.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If a thread called [method lock] or [method try_lock] multiple "
"times while already having ownership of the mutex, it must also call [method "
"unlock] the same number of times in order to unlock it correctly.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Calling [method unlock] more times than [method lock] on a "
"given thread, thus ending up trying to unlock a non-locked mutex, is wrong "
"and may causes crashes or deadlocks."
msgstr ""
"ປົດລັອກ [Mutex] ນີ້, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເທຣດອື່ນໆສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າເທຣດໃດໜຶ່ງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method lock] ຫຼື [method try_lock] "
"ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງໃນຂະນະທີ່ເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງມິວເທັກຊ໌, ມັນຈະຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method unlock] "
"ໃນຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ເທົ່າກັນເພື່ອປົດລັອກໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method unlock] ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງກວ່າ [method lock] ໃນເທຣດດຽວກັນ "
"ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການພະຍາຍາມປົດລັອກມິວເທັກຊ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກລັອກໄວ້ ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ຜິດ ແລະ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຄ້າງ "
"(crash) ຫຼື deadlock ໄດ້."

msgid "A server interface for OS native menus."
msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟສເຊີເວີສຳລັບເມນູພື້ນເມືອງຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ (OS)."

msgid ""
"[NativeMenu] handles low-level access to the OS native global menu bar and "
"popup menus.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is low-level API, consider using [MenuBar] with [member "
"MenuBar.prefer_global_menu] set to [code]true[/code], and [PopupMenu] with "
"[member PopupMenu.prefer_native_menu] set to [code]true[/code].\n"
"To create a menu, use [method create_menu], add menu items using "
"[code]add_*_item[/code] methods. To remove a menu, use [method free_menu].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var menu\n"
"\n"
"func _menu_callback(item_id):\n"
"\tif item_id == \"ITEM_CUT\":\n"
"\t\tcut()\n"
"\telif item_id == \"ITEM_COPY\":\n"
"\t\tcopy()\n"
"\telif item_id == \"ITEM_PASTE\":\n"
"\t\tpaste()\n"
"\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\t# Create new menu and add items:\n"
"\tmenu = NativeMenu.create_menu()\n"
"\tNativeMenu.add_item(menu, \"Cut\", _menu_callback, Callable(), "
"\"ITEM_CUT\")\n"
"\tNativeMenu.add_item(menu, \"Copy\", _menu_callback, Callable(), "
"\"ITEM_COPY\")\n"
"\tNativeMenu.add_separator(menu)\n"
"\tNativeMenu.add_item(menu, \"Paste\", _menu_callback, Callable(), "
"\"ITEM_PASTE\")\n"
"\n"
"func _on_button_pressed():\n"
"\t# Show popup menu at mouse position:\n"
"\tNativeMenu.popup(menu, DisplayServer.mouse_get_position())\n"
"\n"
"func _exit_tree():\n"
"\t# Remove menu when it's no longer needed:\n"
"\tNativeMenu.free_menu(menu)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"[NativeMenu] ຈັດການການເຂົ້າເຖິງລະດັບຕ່ຳ (low-level) ຂອງແຖບເມນູຫຼັກ ແລະ "
"ເມນູປັອບອັບພື້ນເມືອງຂອງ OS.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນ API ລະດັບຕ່ຳ, ຄວນພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [MenuBar] ໂດຍຕັ້ງ [member "
"MenuBar.prefer_global_menu] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແລະ [PopupMenu] ໂດຍຕັ້ງ "
"[member PopupMenu.prefer_native_menu] ເປັນ [code]true[/code].\n"
"ເພື່ອສ້າງເມນູ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method create_menu], ເພີ່ມລາຍການເມນູດ້ວຍເມທອດ [code]add_*_item[/"
"code]. ເພື່ອລຶບເມນູ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method free_menu].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var menu\n"
"\n"
"func _menu_callback(item_id):\n"
"\tif item_id == \"ITEM_CUT\":\n"
"\t\tcut()\n"
"\telif item_id == \"ITEM_COPY\":\n"
"\t\tcopy()\n"
"\telif item_id == \"ITEM_PASTE\":\n"
"\t\tpaste()\n"
"\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\t# ສ້າງເມນູໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພີ່ມລາຍການ:\n"
"\tmenu = NativeMenu.create_menu()\n"
"\tNativeMenu.add_item(menu, \"Cut\", _menu_callback, Callable(), "
"\"ITEM_CUT\")\n"
"\tNativeMenu.add_item(menu, \"Copy\", _menu_callback, Callable(), "
"\"ITEM_COPY\")\n"
"\tNativeMenu.add_separator(menu)\n"
"\tNativeMenu.add_item(menu, \"Paste\", _menu_callback, Callable(), "
"\"ITEM_PASTE\")\n"
"\n"
"func _on_button_pressed():\n"
"\t# ສະແດງເມນູປັອບອັບໃນຕຳແໜ່ງເມົາສ໌:\n"
"\tNativeMenu.popup(menu, DisplayServer.mouse_get_position())\n"
"\n"
"func _exit_tree():\n"
"\t# ລຶບເມນູອອກເມື່ອບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ:\n"
"\tNativeMenu.free_menu(menu)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Adds a new checkable item with text [param label] to the global menu [param "
"rid].\n"
"Returns index of the inserted item, it's not guaranteed to be the same as "
"[param index] value.\n"
"An [param accelerator] can optionally be defined, which is a keyboard "
"shortcut that can be pressed to trigger the menu button even if it's not "
"currently open. The [param accelerator] is generally a combination of [enum "
"KeyModifierMask]s and [enum Key]s using bitwise OR such as "
"[code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param callback] and [param key_callback] Callables need to "
"accept exactly one Variant parameter, the parameter passed to the Callables "
"will be the value passed to [param tag].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, [param accelerator] and [param key_callback] are "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການໃໝ່ທີ່ສາມາດໝາຍເລືອກໄດ້ (checkable) ພ້ອມຂໍ້ຄວາມ [param label] ເຂົ້າໃນເມນູຫຼັກ "
"[param rid].\n"
"ຄືນຄ່າ index ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປ, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ຮັບປະກັນວ່າມັນຈະຄືກັນກັບຄ່າ [param index].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param accelerator] ໄດ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນປຸ່ມລັດຄີບອດທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປີດເມນູໄດ້ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດຢູ່ກໍຕາມ. [param accelerator] "
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນການລວມກັນຂອງ [enum KeyModifierMask] ແລະ [enum Key] ໂດຍໃຊ້ bitwise OR "
"ເຊັ່ນ [code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Callable [param callback] ແລະ [param key_callback] "
"ຕ້ອງຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີ Variant ໄດ້ໜຶ່ງຕົວຢ່າງແນ່ນອນ, ເຊິ່ງຄ່າທີ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງໃຫ້ [param tag].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນ macOS ແລະ Windows.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Windows, [param accelerator] ແລະ [param key_callback] "
"ຈະຖືກຂ້າມໄປ."

