msgid ""
"Used internally to allow the given [param space] to store contact points, up "
"to [param max_contacts]. This is automatically set for the main [World2D]'s "
"space when [member SceneTree.debug_collisions_hint] is [code]true[/code], or "
"by checking \"Visible Collision Shapes\" in the editor. Only works in debug "
"builds.\n"
"Overridable version of [PhysicsServer2D]'s internal "
"[code]space_set_debug_contacts[/code] method."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຈຸດສຳຜັດ."

msgid "Overridable version of [method PhysicsServer2D.space_set_param]."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນທີ່ຂຽນທັບໄດ້ຂອງ [method PhysicsServer2D.space_set_param]."

msgid ""
"Called every physics step to process the physics simulation. [param step] is "
"the time elapsed since the last physics step, in seconds. It is usually the "
"same as the value returned by [method Node.get_physics_process_delta_time].\n"
"Overridable version of [PhysicsServer2D]'s internal [code skip-lint]step[/"
"code] method."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນໃນແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນຟີຊິກເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"Called to indicate that the physics server is synchronizing and cannot access "
"physics states if running on a separate thread. See also [method _end_sync].\n"
"Overridable version of [PhysicsServer2D]'s internal [code]sync[/code] method."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນເພື່ອລະບ່ວ່າເຊີເວີຟີຊິກກຳລັງຊິງໂຄຣໄນ."

msgid ""
"Overridable version of [method PhysicsServer2D.world_boundary_shape_create]."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນທີ່ຂຽນທັບໄດ້ຂອງ [method PhysicsServer2D.world_boundary_shape_create]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the body with the given [RID] is being excluded "
"from [method _body_test_motion]. See also [method Object.get_instance_id]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າວັດຖຸທີ່ມີ [RID] ນັ້ນຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການທົດສອບການເຄື່ອນທີ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the object with the given instance ID is being "
"excluded from [method _body_test_motion]. See also [method "
"Object.get_instance_id]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າວັດຖຸທີ່ມີໄອດີອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ນັ້ນຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການທົດສອບການເຄື່ອນທີ່."

msgid "A singleton for managing [PhysicsServer2D] implementations."
msgstr "ຊິງເກິລຕັນ (singleton) ສຳລັບຈັດການການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ [PhysicsServer2D]."

msgid ""
"[PhysicsServer2DManager] is the API for registering [PhysicsServer2D] "
"implementations and for setting the default implementation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is not possible to switch physics servers at runtime. This "
"class is only used on startup at the server initialization level, by Godot "
"itself and possibly by GDExtensions."
msgstr ""
"[PhysicsServer2DManager] ແມ່ນ API ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ [PhysicsServer2D]."

msgid ""
"Register a [PhysicsServer2D] implementation by passing a [param name] and a "
"[Callable] that returns a [PhysicsServer2D] object."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ [PhysicsServer2D] ໂດຍການສົ່ງ [param name] ແລະ [Callable]."

msgid ""
"Set the default [PhysicsServer2D] implementation to the one identified by "
"[param name], if [param priority] is greater than the priority of the current "
"default implementation."
msgstr "ກຳນົດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ [PhysicsServer2D] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "A server interface for low-level 3D physics access."
msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟຊເຊີເວີສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງຟີຊິກ 3D ໃນລະດັບຕ່ຳ."

msgid ""
"PhysicsServer3D is the server responsible for all 3D physics. It can directly "
"create and manipulate all physics objects:\n"
"- A [i]space[/i] is a self-contained world for a physics simulation. It "
"contains bodies, areas, and joints. Its state can be queried for collision "
"and intersection information, and several parameters of the simulation can be "
"modified.\n"
"- A [i]shape[/i] is a geometric shape such as a sphere, a box, a cylinder, or "
"a polygon. It can be used for collision detection by adding it to a body/"
"area, possibly with an extra transformation relative to the body/area's "
"origin. Bodies/areas can have multiple (transformed) shapes added to them, "
"and a single shape can be added to bodies/areas multiple times with different "
"local transformations.\n"
"- A [i]body[/i] is a physical object which can be in static, kinematic, or "
"rigid mode. Its state (such as position and velocity) can be queried and "
"updated. A force integration callback can be set to customize the body's "
"physics.\n"
"- An [i]area[/i] is a region in space which can be used to detect bodies and "
"areas entering and exiting it. A body monitoring callback can be set to "
"report entering/exiting body shapes, and similarly an area monitoring "
"callback can be set. Gravity and damping can be overridden within the area by "
"setting area parameters.\n"
"- A [i]joint[/i] is a constraint, either between two bodies or on one body "
"relative to a point. Parameters such as the joint bias and the rest length of "
"a spring joint can be adjusted.\n"
"Physics objects in [PhysicsServer3D] may be created and manipulated "
"independently; they do not have to be tied to nodes in the scene tree.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] All the 3D physics nodes use the physics server internally. "
"Adding a physics node to the scene tree will cause a corresponding physics "
"object to be created in the physics server. A rigid body node registers a "
"callback that updates the node's transform with the transform of the "
"respective body object in the physics server (every physics update). An area "
"node registers a callback to inform the area node about overlaps with the "
"respective area object in the physics server. The raycast node queries the "
"direct state of the relevant space in the physics server."
msgstr ""
"PhysicsServer3D ແມ່ນເຊີເວີທີ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບຟີຊິກ 3D ທັງໝົດ. ມັນສາມາດສ້າງ ແລະ "
"ຈັດການວັດຖຸຟີຊິກທັງໝົດໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ."

msgid ""
"Adds a shape to the area, along with a transform matrix. Shapes are usually "
"referenced by their index, so you should track which shape has a given index."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຮູບຊົງເຂົ້າໃນເຂດພື້ນທີ່, ພ້ອມກັບແມັດທຣິກການແປງ."

msgid ""
"Assigns the area to a descendant of [Object], so it can exist in the node "
"tree."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເຂດພື້ນທີ່ໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ສືບທອດຂອງ [Object] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນຄົງຢູ່ໃນຜັງໂນດ."

msgid ""
"Removes all shapes from an area. It does not delete the shapes, so they can "
"be reassigned later."
msgstr "ລຶບຮູບຊົງທັງໝົດອອກຈາກເຂດພື້ນທີ່. ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ລຶບຮູບຊົງຖາວອນ ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງສາມາດກຳນົດຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"Creates a 3D area object in the physics server, and returns the [RID] that "
"identifies it. The default settings for the created area include a collision "
"layer and mask set to [code]1[/code], and [code]monitorable[/code] set to "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"Use [method area_add_shape] to add shapes to it, use [method "
"area_set_transform] to set its transform, and use [method area_set_space] to "
"add the area to a space. If you want the area to be detectable use [method "
"area_set_monitorable]."
msgstr "ສ້າງວັດຖຸເຂດພື້ນທີ່ (area) 3D ໃນເຊີເວີຟີຊິກ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນຂອງມັນ."

msgid "Returns the physics layer or layers an area belongs to."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເລເຍີຟີຊິກທີ່ເຂດພື້ນທີ່ນັ້ນສັງກັດຢູ່."

msgid "Returns the physics layer or layers an area can contact with."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເລເຍີຟີຊິກທີ່ເຂດພື້ນທີ່ນັ້ນສາມາດສຳຜັດນຳໄດ້."

msgid "Gets the instance ID of the object the area is assigned to."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາໄອດີອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ເຂດພື້ນທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Returns an area parameter value. A list of available parameters is on the "
"[enum AreaParameter] constants."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າພາຣາມີເຕີຂອງເຂດພື້ນທີ່."

msgid "Returns the [RID] of the nth shape of an area."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ຂອງຮູບຊົງລຳດັບທີ n ຂອງເຂດພື້ນທີ່."

msgid "Returns the number of shapes assigned to an area."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຮູບຊົງທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບເຂດພື້ນທີ່."

msgid "Returns the transform matrix of a shape within an area."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແມັດທຣິກການແປງຂອງຮູບຊົງພາຍໃນເຂດພື້ນທີ່."

msgid "Returns the space assigned to the area."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນພື້ນທີ່ (space) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບເຂດພື້ນທີ່."

msgid "Returns the transform matrix for an area."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແມັດທຣິກການແປງສຳລັບເຂດພື້ນທີ່."

msgid ""
"Removes a shape from an area. It does not delete the shape, so it can be "
"reassigned later."
msgstr "ລຶບຮູບຊົງອອກຈາກເຂດພື້ນທີ່. ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ລຶບຮູບຊົງຖາວອນ."

msgid "Assigns the area to one or many physics layers."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເຂດພື້ນທີ່ໃຫ້ກັບໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍເລເຍີຟີຊິກ."

msgid "Sets which physics layers the area will monitor."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າເລເຍີຟີຊິກໃດທີ່ເຂດພື້ນທີ່ຈະເຝົ້າຕິດຕາມ (monitor)."

msgid ""
"Sets the value for an area parameter. A list of available parameters is on "
"the [enum AreaParameter] constants."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າສຳລັບພາຣາມີເຕີຂອງເຂດພື້ນທີ່."

msgid "Sets object pickable with rays."
msgstr "ກຳນົດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ດ້ວຍລັດສະໝີ (rays)."

msgid ""
"Substitutes a given area shape by another. The old shape is selected by its "
"index, the new one by its [RID]."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນແທນຮູບຊົງຂອງເຂດພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ກຳນົດດ້ວຍຮູບຊົງອື່ນ."

msgid "Sets the transform matrix for an area shape."
msgstr "ກຳນົດແມັດທຣິກການແປງສຳລັບຮູບຊົງຂອງເຂດພື້ນທີ່."

msgid "Assigns a space to the area."
msgstr "ກຳນົດພື້ນທີ່ (space) ໃຫ້ກັບເຂດພື້ນທີ່."

msgid "Sets the transform matrix for an area."
msgstr "ກຳນົດແມັດທຣິກການແປງສຳລັບເຂດພື້ນທີ່."

msgid "Adds a body to the list of bodies exempt from collisions."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມວັດຖຸເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການຕຳ."

msgid ""
"Adds a constant directional force without affecting rotation that keeps being "
"applied over time until cleared with [code]body_set_constant_force(body, "
"Vector3(0, 0, 0))[/code].\n"
"This is equivalent to using [method body_add_constant_force] at the body's "
"center of mass."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແຮງໃນທິດທາງຄົງທີ່ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການໝຸນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຈົນກວ່າຈະຖືກລ້າງອອກດ້ວຍ "
"[code]body_set_constant_force(body, Vector3(0, 0, 0))[/code].\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການໃຊ້ [method body_add_constant_force] ທີ່ຈຸດສູນກາງມວນຂອງວັດຖຸ (body's "
"center of mass)."

msgid ""
"Adds a constant positioned force to the body that keeps being applied over "
"time until cleared with [code]body_set_constant_force(body, Vector3(0, 0, 0))"
"[/code].\n"
"[param position] is the offset from the body origin in global coordinates."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແຮງໃນຕຳແໜ່ງຄົງທີ່ໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Adds a constant rotational force without affecting position that keeps being "
"applied over time until cleared with [code]body_set_constant_torque(body, "
"Vector3(0, 0, 0))[/code]."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແຮງໝູນຄົງທີ່ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Adds a shape to the body, along with a transform matrix. Shapes are usually "
"referenced by their index, so you should track which shape has a given index."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຮູບຊົງເຂົ້າໃນວັດຖຸ, ພ້ອມກັບແມັດທຣິກການແປງ."

msgid ""
"Applies a directional force without affecting rotation. A force is time "
"dependent and meant to be applied every physics update.\n"
"This is equivalent to using [method body_apply_force] at the body's center of "
"mass."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ແຮງໃນທິດທາງໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການໝູນ."

msgid ""
"Applies a directional impulse without affecting rotation.\n"
"An impulse is time-independent! Applying an impulse every frame would result "
"in a framerate-dependent force. For this reason, it should only be used when "
"simulating one-time impacts (use the \"_force\" functions otherwise).\n"
"This is equivalent to using [method body_apply_impulse] at the body's center "
"of mass."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ແຮງກະແທກ (impulse) ໃນທິດທາງໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການໝູນ."

msgid ""
"Applies a rotational force without affecting position. A force is time "
"dependent and meant to be applied every physics update."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ແຮງໝູນໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Applies a rotational impulse to the body without affecting the position.\n"
"An impulse is time-independent! Applying an impulse every frame would result "
"in a framerate-dependent force. For this reason, it should only be used when "
"simulating one-time impacts (use the \"_force\" functions otherwise)."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ແຮງກະແທກໃນການໝູນໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ."

msgid "Removes all shapes from a body."
msgstr "ລຶບຮູບຊົງທັງໝົດອອກຈາກວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Creates a 3D body object in the physics server, and returns the [RID] that "
"identifies it. The default settings for the created area include a collision "
"layer and mask set to [code]1[/code], and body mode set to [constant "
"BODY_MODE_RIGID].\n"
"Use [method body_add_shape] to add shapes to it, use [method body_set_state] "
"to set its transform, and use [method body_set_space] to add the body to a "
"space."
msgstr "ສ້າງວັດຖຸ (body) 3D ໃນເຊີເວີຟີຊິກ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນຂອງມັນ."

msgid "Returns the physics layer or layers a body belongs to."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເລເຍີຟີຊິກທີ່ວັດຖຸນັ້ນສັງກັດຢູ່."

msgid "Returns the physics layer or layers a body can collide with."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເລເຍີຟີຊິກທີ່ວັດຖຸນັ້ນສາມາດຕຳນຳໄດ້."

msgid "Returns the body's collision priority."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນໃນການຕຳຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the body's total constant positional forces applied during each "
"physics update.\n"
"See [method body_add_constant_force] and [method "
"body_add_constant_central_force]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແຮງໃນຕຳແໜ່ງຄົງທີ່ທັງໝົດຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the body's total constant rotational forces applied during each "
"physics update.\n"
"See [method body_add_constant_torque]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແຮງໝູນຄົງທີ່ທັງໝົດຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [PhysicsDirectBodyState3D] of the body. Returns [code]null[/code] "
"if the body is destroyed or removed from the physics space."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [PhysicsDirectBodyState3D] ຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the maximum contacts that can be reported. See [method "
"body_set_max_contacts_reported]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນການສຳຜັດສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດລາຍງານໄດ້."

msgid "Returns the body mode."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໂໝດຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the value of a body parameter. A list of available parameters is on "
"the [enum BodyParameter] constants."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂອງພາຣາມີເຕີວັດຖຸ."

msgid "Returns the [RID] of the nth shape of a body."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ຂອງຮູບຊົງລຳດັບທີ n ຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid "Returns the number of shapes assigned to a body."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຮູບຊົງທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸ."

msgid "Returns the transform matrix of a body shape."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແມັດທຣິກການແປງຂອງຮູບຊົງວັດຖຸ."

msgid "Returns the [RID] of the space assigned to a body."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸ."

msgid "Returns a body state."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສະຖານະຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the continuous collision detection mode is enabled."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂໝດການກວດຈັບການຕຳແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Removes a body from the list of bodies exempt from collisions.\n"
"Continuous collision detection tries to predict where a moving body will "
"collide, instead of moving it and correcting its movement if it collided."
msgstr "ລຶບວັດຖຸອອກຈາກລາຍການວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການຕຳ."

msgid ""
"Removes a shape from a body. The shape is not deleted, so it can be reused "
"afterwards."
msgstr "ລຶບຮູບຊົງອອກຈາກວັດຖຸ. ຮູບຊົງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກລຶບຖາວອນ."

msgid ""
"Restores the default inertia and center of mass based on shapes to cancel any "
"custom values previously set using [method body_set_param]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຄວາມເນື່ອຍ ແລະ ຈຸດສູນກາງມວນສານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets an axis velocity. The velocity in the given vector axis will be set as "
"the given vector length. This is useful for jumping behavior."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄວາມໄວໃນແກນ."

msgid "Sets the physics layer or layers a body belongs to."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເລເຍີຟີຊິກທີ່ວັດຖຸນັ້ນສັງກັດຢູ່."

msgid "Sets the physics layer or layers a body can collide with."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເລເຍີຟີຊິກທີ່ວັດຖຸນັ້ນສາມາດຕຳນຳໄດ້."

msgid "Sets the body's collision priority."
msgstr "ກຳນົດລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນໃນການຕຳຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Sets the body's total constant positional forces applied during each physics "
"update.\n"
"See [method body_add_constant_force] and [method "
"body_add_constant_central_force]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດແຮງໃນຕຳແໜ່ງຄົງທີ່ທັງໝົດຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Sets the body's total constant rotational forces applied during each physics "
"update.\n"
"See [method body_add_constant_torque]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດແຮງໝູນຄົງທີ່ທັງໝົດຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the continuous collision detection mode is enabled.\n"
"Continuous collision detection tries to predict where a moving body will "
"collide, instead of moving it and correcting its movement if it collided."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂໝດການກວດຈັບການຕຳແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Sets the body's custom force integration callback function to [param "
"callable]. Use an empty [Callable] ([code skip-lint]Callable()[/code]) to "
"clear the custom callback.\n"
"The function [param callable] will be called every physics tick, before the "
"standard force integration (see [method body_set_omit_force_integration]). It "
"can be used for example to update the body's linear and angular velocity "
"based on contact with other bodies.\n"
"If [param userdata] is not [code]null[/code], the function [param callable] "
"must take the following two parameters:\n"
"1. [code]state[/code]: a [PhysicsDirectBodyState3D], used to retrieve and "
"modify the body's state,\n"
"2. [code skip-lint]userdata[/code]: a [Variant]; its value will be the [param "
"userdata] passed into this method.\n"
"If [param userdata] is [code]null[/code], then [param callable] must take "
"only the [code]state[/code] parameter."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຟັງຊັນຄໍແບັກສຳລັບການລວມແຮງ (force integration) ແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the maximum contacts to report. Bodies can keep a log of the contacts "
"with other bodies. This is enabled by setting the maximum number of contacts "
"reported to a number greater than 0."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຈຳນວນການສຳຜັດສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະລາຍງານ."

msgid "Sets the body mode."
msgstr "ກຳນົດໂໝດຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Sets whether the body omits the standard force integration. If [param enable] "
"is [code]true[/code], the body will not automatically use applied forces, "
"torques, and damping to update the body's linear and angular velocity. In "
"this case, [method body_set_force_integration_callback] can be used to "
"manually update the linear and angular velocity instead.\n"
"This method is called when the property [member "
"RigidBody3D.custom_integrator] is set."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າວັດຖຸຈະຂ້າມການລວມແຮງມາດຕະຖານຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Sets a body parameter. A list of available parameters is on the [enum "
"BodyParameter] constants."
msgstr "ກຳນົດພາຣາມີເຕີວັດຖຸ."

msgid "Sets the body pickable with rays if [param enable] is set."
msgstr "ກຳນົດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ດ້ວຍລັດສະໝີ."

msgid ""
"Substitutes a given body shape by another. The old shape is selected by its "
"index, the new one by its [RID]."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນແທນຮູບຊົງວັດຖຸທີ່ກຳນົດດ້ວຍຮູບຊົງອື່ນ."

msgid "Sets the transform matrix for a body shape."
msgstr "ກຳນົດແມັດທຣິກການແປງສຳລັບຮູບຊົງວັດຖຸ."

msgid "Assigns a space to the body (see [method space_create])."
msgstr "ກຳນົດພື້ນທີ່ໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸ."

msgid "Sets a body state."
msgstr "ກຳນົດສະຖານະຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Sets the body's state synchronization callback function to [param callable]. "
"Use an empty [Callable] ([code skip-lint]Callable()[/code]) to clear the "
"callback.\n"
"The function [param callable] will be called every physics frame, assuming "
"that the body was active during the previous physics tick, and can be used to "
"fetch the latest state from the physics server.\n"
"The function [param callable] must take the following parameters:\n"
"1. [code]state[/code]: a [PhysicsDirectBodyState3D], used to retrieve the "
"body's state."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຟັງຊັນຄໍແບັກສຳລັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສະຖານະຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a collision would result from moving along a "
"motion vector from a given point in space. [PhysicsTestMotionParameters3D] is "
"passed to set motion parameters. [PhysicsTestMotionResult3D] can be passed to "
"return additional information."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດການຕຳ."

msgid ""
"Creates a 3D box shape in the physics server, and returns the [RID] that "
"identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the box's half-extents."
msgstr "ສ້າງຮູບຊົງກ່ອງ 3D ໃນເຊີເວີຟີຊິກ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Creates a 3D capsule shape in the physics server, and returns the [RID] that "
"identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the capsule's height and "
"radius."
msgstr "ສ້າງຮູບຊົງແຄັບຊູນ 3D ໃນເຊີເວີຟີຊິກ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Creates a 3D concave polygon shape in the physics server, and returns the "
"[RID] that identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the concave "
"polygon's triangles."
msgstr "ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຫຼາຍແຈຫວຳ 3D ໃນເຊີເວີຟີຊິກ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນຂອງມັນ."

msgid "Gets a cone twist joint parameter."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາພາຣາມີເຕີຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບກວຍບິດ (cone twist joint)."

msgid "Sets a cone twist joint parameter."
msgstr "ກຳນົດພາຣາມີເຕີຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບກວຍບິດ."

msgid ""
"Creates a 3D convex polygon shape in the physics server, and returns the "
"[RID] that identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the convex "
"polygon's points."
msgstr "ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຫຼາຍແຈນູນ 3D ໃນເຊີເວີຟີຊິກ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Creates a custom shape in the physics server, and returns the [RID] that "
"identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the shape's data.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Custom shapes are not supported by the built-in physics servers, "
"so calling this method always produces an error when using Godot Physics or "
"Jolt Physics. Custom physics servers implemented as GDExtensions may support "
"a custom shape."
msgstr "ສ້າງຮູບຊົງແບບກຳນົດເອງໃນເຊີເວີຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"Creates a 3D cylinder shape in the physics server, and returns the [RID] that "
"identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the cylinder's height and "
"radius."
msgstr "ສ້າງຮູບຊົງກະບອກ 3D ໃນເຊີເວີຟີຊິກ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Destroys any of the objects created by PhysicsServer3D. If the [RID] passed "
"is not one of the objects that can be created by PhysicsServer3D, an error "
"will be sent to the console."
msgstr "ທຳລາຍວັດຖຸໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ PhysicsServer3D."

msgid "Returns the value of a generic 6DOF joint flag."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທຸງຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ 6DOF ທົ່ວໄປ."

msgid "Returns the value of a generic 6DOF joint parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າພາຣາມີເຕີຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ 6DOF ທົ່ວໄປ."

msgid "Sets the value of a given generic 6DOF joint flag."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າທຸງຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ 6DOF ທົ່ວໄປ."

msgid "Sets the value of a given generic 6DOF joint parameter."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າພາຣາມີເຕີຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ 6DOF ທົ່ວໄປ."

msgid ""
"Creates a 3D heightmap shape in the physics server, and returns the [RID] "
"that identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the heightmap's data."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຮູບຊົງແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງ (heightmap) 3D ໃນເຊີເວີຟີຊິກ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນຂອງມັນ."

msgid "Gets a hinge joint flag."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຄ່າທຸງຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບບານພັບ (hinge joint)."

msgid "Gets a hinge joint parameter."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາພາຣາມີເຕີຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບບານພັບ."

msgid "Sets a hinge joint flag."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າທຸງຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບບານພັບ."

msgid "Sets a hinge joint parameter."
msgstr "ກຳນົດພາຣາມີເຕີຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບບານພັບ."

msgid ""
"Sets whether the bodies attached to the [Joint3D] will collide with each "
"other."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າວັດຖຸທີ່ຕິດກັບ [Joint3D] ຈະຕຳກັນເອງຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Gets the priority value of the Joint3D.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This method always "
"returns [code]1[/code] when using Jolt Physics, as it does not support joint "
"solver priority."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຄ່າລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງ Joint3D."

msgid "Returns the type of the Joint3D."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນປະເພດຂອງ Joint3D."

msgid ""
"Returns whether the bodies attached to the [Joint3D] will collide with each "
"other."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າວັດຖຸທີ່ຕິດກັບ [Joint3D] ຈະຕຳກັນເອງຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Make the joint a generic six degrees of freedom (6DOF) joint. Use [method "
"generic_6dof_joint_set_flag] and [method generic_6dof_joint_set_param] to set "
"the joint's flags and parameters respectively."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ເປັນຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບ 6DOF ທົ່ວໄປ."

msgid ""
"Sets the priority value of the Joint3D.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This method has no "
"effect when using Jolt Physics, as it does not support joint solver priority."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງ Joint3D."

msgid "Returns position of the joint in the local space of body a of the joint."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງວັດຖຸ a ຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່."

msgid "Returns position of the joint in the local space of body b of the joint."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local space) ຂອງວັດຖຸ b ຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່."

msgid "Gets a pin joint parameter."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຄ່າກຳນົດ (parameter) ຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບປັກໝຸດ (pin joint)."

msgid "Sets position of the joint in the local space of body a of the joint."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local space) ຂອງວັດຖຸ a ຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່."

msgid "Sets position of the joint in the local space of body b of the joint."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local space) ຂອງວັດຖຸ b ຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່."

msgid ""
"Creates a 3D separation ray shape in the physics server, and returns the "
"[RID] that identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the shape's "
"[code]length[/code] and [code]slide_on_slope[/code] properties."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຮູບຊົງລັງສີແຍກ (separation ray) ແບບ 3D ໃນເຊີເວີຟີຊິກ, ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] "
"ທີ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນຂອງມັນ. ໃຊ້ [method shape_set_data] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]length[/code] "
"ແລະ [code]slide_on_slope[/code] ຂອງຮູບຊົງ."

msgid "Activates or deactivates the 3D physics engine."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານລະບົບຟີຊິກ 3D."

msgid ""
"Returns the shape data that configures the shape, such as the half-extents of "
"a box or the triangles of a concave (trimesh) shape. See [method "
"shape_set_data] for the precise format of this data in each case."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນຮູບຊົງທີ່ໃຊ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບຊົງ, ເຊັ່ນ: ເຄິ່ງຂະໜາດຂະຫຍາຍ (half-extents) ຂອງກ່ອງ ຫຼື "
"ຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມຂອງຮູບຊົງແບບຫວຳ (trimesh). ເບິ່ງ [method shape_set_data] "
"ສຳລັບຮູບແບບທີ່ແນ່ນອນຂອງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ໃນແຕ່ລະກໍລະນີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the collision margin for the shape.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is not used in Godot Physics, so will always return "
"[code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂອບການຕຳ (collision margin) ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສ່ວນນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນ Godot Physics, ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [code]0[/code] "
"ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Sets the shape data that configures the shape. The [param data] to be passed "
"depends on the shape's type (see [method shape_get_type]):\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_WORLD_BOUNDARY]: a [Plane],\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_SEPARATION_RAY]: a dictionary containing the key [code]"
"\"length\"[/code] with a [float] value and the key [code]\"slide_on_slope\"[/"
"code] with a [bool] value,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_SPHERE]: a [float] that is the radius of the sphere,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_BOX]: a [Vector3] containing the half-extents of the box,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CAPSULE]: a dictionary containing the keys [code]"
"\"height\"[/code] and [code]\"radius\"[/code] with [float] values,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CYLINDER]: a dictionary containing the keys [code]"
"\"height\"[/code] and [code]\"radius\"[/code] with [float] values,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CONVEX_POLYGON]: a [PackedVector3Array] of points defining "
"a convex polygon (the shape will be the convex hull of the points),\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CONCAVE_POLYGON]: a dictionary containing the key [code]"
"\"faces\"[/code] with a [PackedVector3Array] value (with a length divisible "
"by 3, so that each 3-tuple of points forms a face) and the key [code]"
"\"backface_collision\"[/code] with a [bool] value,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_HEIGHTMAP]: a dictionary containing the keys [code]"
"\"width\"[/code] and [code]\"depth\"[/code] with [int] values, and the key "
"[code]\"heights\"[/code] with a value that is a packed array of [float]s of "
"length [code]width * depth[/code] (that is a [PackedFloat32Array], or a "
"[PackedFloat64Array] if Godot was compiled with the [code]precision=double[/"
"code] option), and optionally the keys [code]\"min_height\"[/code] and [code]"
"\"max_height\"[/code] with [float] values,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_SOFT_BODY]: the input [param data] is ignored and this "
"method has no effect,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CUSTOM]: the input [param data] is interpreted by a custom "
"physics server, if it supports custom shapes."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນຮູບຊົງ. [param data] ທີ່ຈະສົ່ງໄປແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງຮູບຊົງ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"shape_get_type]):\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_WORLD_BOUNDARY]: [Plane],\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_SEPARATION_RAY]: ດິກຊັນນາລີ (dictionary) ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຄີ [code]"
"\"length\"[/code] ເປັນຄ່າ [float] ແລະ ຄີ [code]\"slide_on_slope\"[/code] ເປັນຄ່າ "
"[bool],\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_SPHERE]: ຄ່າ [float] ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນລັດສະໝີຂອງຊົງກົມ,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_BOX]: [Vector3] ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍເຄິ່ງຂະໜາດຂະຫຍາຍ (half-extents) "
"ຂອງກ່ອງ,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CAPSULE]: ດິກຊັນນາລີທີ່ประกอบດ້ວຍຄີ [code]\"height\"[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]\"radius\"[/code] ເປັນຄ່າ [float],\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CYLINDER]: ດິກຊັນນາລີທີ່ประกอบດ້ວຍຄີ [code]\"height\"[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]\"radius\"[/code] ເປັນຄ່າ [float],\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CONVEX_POLYGON]: [PackedVector3Array] "
"ຂອງຈຸດທີ່ກຳນົດຮູບຫຼາຍແຈແບບນູນ (ຮູບຊົງຈະເປັນໂຄງນູນຂອງຈຸດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ),\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CONCAVE_POLYGON]: ດິກຊັນນາລີທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຄີ [code]\"faces\"[/code] "
"ທີ່ມີຄ່າ [PackedVector3Array] (ຄວາມຍາວຫານຂາດໃຫ້ 3 ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະ 3 ຈຸດເປັນໜ້າໜຶ່ງ) ແລະ ຄີ "
"[code]\"backface_collision\"[/code] ທີ່ມີຄ່າ [bool],\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_HEIGHTMAP]: ດິກຊັນນາລີທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຄີ [code]\"width\"[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]\"depth\"[/code] ເປັນຄ່າ [int], ແລະ ຄີ [code]\"heights\"[/code] "
"ທີ່ມີຄ່າເປັນອາເຣ (packed array) ຂອງ [float] ທີ່ມີຄວາມຍາວ [code]width * depth[/code] "
"(ນັ້ນຄື [PackedFloat32Array], ຫຼື [PackedFloat64Array] ຖ້າ Godot ຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ "
"[code]precision=double[/code]), ແລະ ອາດມີຄີ [code]\"min_height\"[/code] ກັບ "
"[code]\"max_height\"[/code] ເປັນຄ່າ [float],\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_SOFT_BODY]: [param data] ທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ ແລະ "
"ເມທອດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CUSTOM]: [param data] "
"ທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າຈະຖືກຕີຄວາມໝາຍໂດຍເຊີເວີຟີຊິກແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ຖ້າມັນຮອງຮັບຮູບຊົງແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the collision margin for the shape.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is not used in Godot Physics."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອບການຕຳ (collision margin) ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສ່ວນນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນ Godot Physics."

msgid "Gets a slider joint parameter."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຄ່າກຳນົດຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບເລື່ອນ (slider joint)."

msgid "Adds the given body to the list of bodies exempt from collisions."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມວັດຖຸທີ່ກຳນົດເຂົ້າໃນລາຍຊື່ວັດຖຸທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການຕຳ."

msgid ""
"Distributes and applies a force to all points. A force is time dependent and "
"meant to be applied every physics update."
msgstr "ກະຈາຍ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ແຮງໃສ່ທຸກໆຈຸດ. ແຮງແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບເວລາ ແລະ ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆການອັບເດດຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"Distributes and applies an impulse to all points.\n"
"An impulse is time-independent! Applying an impulse every frame would result "
"in a framerate-dependent force. For this reason, it should only be used when "
"simulating one-time impacts (use the \"_force\" functions otherwise)."
msgstr ""
"ກະຈາຍ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ແຮງຖີບ (impulse) ໃສ່ທຸກໆຈຸດ.\n"
"ແຮງຖີບແມ່ນບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບເວລາ! ການນຳໃຊ້ແຮງຖີບໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແຮງນັ້ນຂຶ້ນກັບອັດຕາເຟຣມ (framerate). "
"ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, ມັນຄວນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນເວລາຈຳລອງການກະທົບພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ "
"\"_force\" ແທນ)."

msgid ""
"Applies a force to a point. A force is time dependent and meant to be applied "
"every physics update."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ແຮງໃສ່ຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງ. ແຮງແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບເວລາ ແລະ ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆການອັບເດດຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"Applies an impulse to a point.\n"
"An impulse is time-independent! Applying an impulse every frame would result "
"in a framerate-dependent force. For this reason, it should only be used when "
"simulating one-time impacts (use the \"_force\" functions otherwise)."
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ແຮງຖີບ (impulse) ໃສ່ຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງ.\n"
"ແຮງຖີບແມ່ນບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບເວລາ! ການນຳໃຊ້ແຮງຖີບໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແຮງນັ້ນຂຶ້ນກັບອັດຕາເຟຣມ (framerate). "
"ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, ມັນຄວນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນເວລາຈຳລອງການກະທົບພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ "
"\"_force\" ແທນ)."

msgid "Creates a new soft body and returns its internal [RID]."
msgstr "ສ້າງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນ (soft body) ໃໝ່ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ພາຍໃນຂອງມັນ."

msgid "Returns the bounds of the given soft body in global coordinates."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂອບເຂດຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດໃນພິກັດສ່ວນລວມ (global coordinates)."

msgid "Returns the physics layer or layers that the given soft body belongs to."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊັ້ນຟີຊິກ (physics layer) ທີ່ວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນນັ້ນຂຶ້ນກັບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the physics layer or layers that the given soft body can collide with."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊັ້ນຟີຊິກທີ່ວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນນັ້ນສາມາດຕຳນຳໄດ້."

msgid "Returns the damping coefficient of the given soft body."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສຳປະສິດຄວາມໜ່ວງ (damping coefficient) ຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Returns the drag coefficient of the given soft body."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສຳປະສິດແຮງຕ້ານ (drag coefficient) ຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Returns the linear stiffness of the given soft body."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມແຂງຕາມແນວເສັ້ນ (linear stiffness) ຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the current position of the given soft body point in global "
"coordinates."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງຈຸດໃນວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດໃນພິກັດສ່ວນລວມ (global coordinates)."

msgid "Returns the pressure coefficient of the given soft body."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສຳປະສິດແຮງດັນ (pressure coefficient) ຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Returns the shrinking factor of the given soft body."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າການຫົດຕົວ (shrinking factor) ຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Returns the simulation precision of the given soft body."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມຊັດເຈນໃນການຈຳລອງຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Returns the [RID] of the space assigned to the given soft body."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ (space) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the given soft body state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot's default physics implementation does not support "
"[constant BODY_STATE_LINEAR_VELOCITY], [constant "
"BODY_STATE_ANGULAR_VELOCITY], [constant BODY_STATE_SLEEPING], or [constant "
"BODY_STATE_CAN_SLEEP]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສະຖານະຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເຮັດວຽກຟີຊິກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ Godot ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ [constant "
"BODY_STATE_LINEAR_VELOCITY], [constant BODY_STATE_ANGULAR_VELOCITY], "
"[constant BODY_STATE_SLEEPING], ຫຼື [constant BODY_STATE_CAN_SLEEP]."

msgid "Returns the total mass assigned to the given soft body."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນມວນສານທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນນັ້ນ."

msgid "Returns whether the given soft body point is pinned."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າຈຸດຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດນັ້ນຖືກປັກໝຸດ (pinned) ໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Moves the given soft body point to a position in global coordinates."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍຈຸດຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງໃນພິກັດສ່ວນລວມ (global coordinates)."

msgid ""
"Pins or unpins the given soft body point based on the value of [param pin].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Pinning a point effectively makes it kinematic, preventing it "
"from being affected by forces, but you can still move it using [method "
"soft_body_move_point]."
msgstr ""
"ປັກໝຸດ ຫຼື ຖອນໝຸດຈຸດຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ ໂດຍອີງຕາມຄ່າຂອງ [param pin].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປັກໝຸດຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຈຸດນັ້ນເປັນແບບຄິເນເມຕິກ (kinematic), "
"ເຊິ່ງປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ມັນໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກແຮງຕ່າງໆ, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດຍ້າຍມັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"soft_body_move_point]."

msgid "Unpins all points of the given soft body."
msgstr "ຖອນໝຸດທຸກໆຈຸດຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Removes the given body from the list of bodies exempt from collisions."
msgstr "ເອົາວັດຖຸທີ່ກຳນົດອອກຈາກລາຍຊື່ວັດຖຸທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການຕຳ."

msgid "Sets the physics layer or layers the given soft body belongs to."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊັ້ນຟີຊິກ (physics layer) ທີ່ວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນນັ້ນຂຶ້ນກັບ."

msgid "Sets the physics layer or layers the given soft body can collide with."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊັ້ນຟີຊິກທີ່ວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນນັ້ນສາມາດຕຳນຳໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the damping coefficient of the given soft body. Higher values will slow "
"down the body more noticeably when forces are applied."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳປະສິດຄວາມໜ່ວງ (damping coefficient) ຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຊ້າລົງຢ່າງເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນເມື່ອມີແຮງມາກະທົບ."

msgid ""
"Sets the drag coefficient of the given soft body. Higher values increase this "
"body's air resistance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value is currently unused by Godot's default physics "
"implementation."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳປະສິດແຮງຕ້ານ (drag coefficient) ຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເພີ່ມແຮງຕ້ານອາກາດຂອງວັດຖຸນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປະຈຸບັນຄ່ານີ້ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນການເຮັດວຽກຟີຊິກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ Godot."

msgid ""
"Sets the linear stiffness of the given soft body. Higher values will result "
"in a stiffer body, while lower values will increase the body's ability to "
"bend. The value can be between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] "
"(inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມແຂງຕາມແນວເສັ້ນ (linear stiffness) ຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸແຂງຂຶ້ນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳລົງຈະເພີ່ມຄວາມສາມາດໃນການໂຄ້ງງໍຂອງວັດຖຸ. "
"ຄ່າສາມາດຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/code] ແລະ [code]1.0[/code]."

msgid "Sets the mesh of the given soft body."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເມຊ (mesh) ໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the pressure coefficient of the given soft body. Simulates pressure "
"build-up from inside this body. Higher values increase the strength of this "
"effect."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳປະສິດແຮງດັນ (pressure coefficient) ຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ. "
"ຈຳລອງການສະສົມຂອງແຮງດັນຈາກພາຍໃນວັດຖຸ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເພີ່ມຄວາມແຮງຂອງຜົນກະທົບນີ້."

msgid ""
"Sets whether the given soft body will be pickable when using object picking."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນນັ້ນຈະສາມາດຖືກເລືອກ (pickable) ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການເລືອກວັດຖຸ."

msgid "Sets the shrinking factor of the given soft body."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຫົດຕົວ (shrinking factor) ຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the simulation precision of the given soft body. Increasing this value "
"will improve the resulting simulation, but can affect performance. Use with "
"care."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມຊັດເຈນໃນການຈຳລອງຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ. ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຈຳລອງດີຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ອາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ. ຄວນໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຄວາມລະມັດລະວັງ."

msgid "Assigns a space to the given soft body (see [method space_create])."
msgstr "ກຳນົດພື້ນທີ່ (space) ໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ (ເບິ່ງ [method space_create])."

msgid ""
"Sets the given body state for the given body.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot's default physics implementation does not support "
"[constant BODY_STATE_LINEAR_VELOCITY], [constant "
"BODY_STATE_ANGULAR_VELOCITY], [constant BODY_STATE_SLEEPING], or [constant "
"BODY_STATE_CAN_SLEEP]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຖານະຂອງວັດຖຸໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເຮັດວຽກຟີຊິກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ Godot ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ [constant "
"BODY_STATE_LINEAR_VELOCITY], [constant BODY_STATE_ANGULAR_VELOCITY], "
"[constant BODY_STATE_SLEEPING], ຫຼື [constant BODY_STATE_CAN_SLEEP]."

msgid "Sets the total mass for the given soft body."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າມວນສານທັງໝົດໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Sets the global transform of the given soft body."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການປ່ຽນແປງຮູບຮ່າງສ່ວນລວມ (global transform) ຂອງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Requests that the physics server updates the rendering server with the latest "
"positions of the given soft body's points through the [param "
"rendering_server_handler] interface."
msgstr ""
"ຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ເຊີເວີຟີຊິກອັບເດດເຊີເວີການສະແດງຜົນ (rendering server) "
"ດ້ວຍຕຳແໜ່ງຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງຈຸດຕ່າງໆໃນວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນນັ້ນ ຜ່ານອິນເຕີເຟດ [param "
"rendering_server_handler]."

msgid ""
"Creates a space. A space is a collection of parameters for the physics engine "
"that can be assigned to an area or a body. It can be assigned to an area with "
"[method area_set_space], or to a body with [method body_set_space]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ (space). ພື້ນທີ່ແມ່ນກຸ່ມຂອງພາລາມິເຕີສຳລັບລະບົບຟີຊິກທີ່ສາມາດກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບພື້ນທີ່ (area) ຫຼື ວັດຖຸ "
"(body). ມັນສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບພື້ນທີ່ດ້ວຍ [method area_set_space], ຫຼື ໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸດ້ວຍ [method "
"body_set_space]."

msgid ""
"Returns the state of a space, a [PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D]. This object can "
"be used to make collision/intersection queries."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສະຖານະຂອງພື້ນທີ່, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນ [PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D]. "
"ວັດຖຸນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສອບຖາມການຕຳ ຫຼື ການຕັດກັນ (collision/intersection queries)."

msgid "Returns the value of a space parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂອງພາລາມິເຕີພື້ນທີ່."

msgid "Returns whether the space is active."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າພື້ນທີ່ນັ້ນກຳລັງເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (active) ຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Marks a space as active. It will not have an effect, unless it is assigned to "
"an area or body."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ເປັນແບບເປີດໃຊ້ງານ. ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ ນອກຈາກວ່າຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບພື້ນທີ່ (area) ຫຼື ວັດຖຸ "
"(body)."

msgid ""
"Sets the value for a space parameter. A list of available parameters is on "
"the [enum SpaceParameter] constants."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີສຳລັບພື້ນທີ່. ລາຍຊື່ພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ມີຢູ່ແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum SpaceParameter]."

msgid ""
"Creates a 3D sphere shape in the physics server, and returns the [RID] that "
"identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the sphere's radius."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຮູບຊົງກົມ (sphere shape) ແບບ 3D ໃນເຊີເວີຟີຊິກ, ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນຂອງມັນ. ໃຊ້ "
"[method shape_set_data] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າລັດສະໝີຂອງຊົງກົມ."

msgid ""
"Creates a 3D world boundary shape in the physics server, and returns the "
"[RID] that identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the shape's "
"normal direction and distance properties."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຂອບເຂດໂລກ (world boundary shape) ແບບ 3D ໃນເຊີເວີຟີຊິກ, ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] "
"ທີ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນຂອງມັນ. ໃຊ້ [method shape_set_data] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າທິດທາງປົກກະຕິ (normal) ແລະ "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດໄລຍະທາງ."

msgid "The [Joint3D] is a [PinJoint3D]."
msgstr "[Joint3D] ແມ່ນ [PinJoint3D] (ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບປັກໝຸດ)."

msgid "The [Joint3D] is a [HingeJoint3D]."
msgstr "[Joint3D] ແມ່ນ [HingeJoint3D] (ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບບານພັບ)."

msgid "The [Joint3D] is a [SliderJoint3D]."
msgstr "[Joint3D] ແມ່ນ [SliderJoint3D] (ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບເລື່ອນ)."

msgid "The [Joint3D] is a [ConeTwistJoint3D]."
msgstr "[Joint3D] ແມ່ນ [ConeTwistJoint3D] (ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບຊົງຈວຍ)."

msgid "The [Joint3D] is a [Generic6DOFJoint3D]."
msgstr "[Joint3D] ແມ່ນ [Generic6DOFJoint3D] (ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບທົ່ວໄປ 6 ອົງສາອິດສະຫຼະ)."

msgid ""
"The strength with which the pinned objects try to stay in positional relation "
"to each other. The higher, the stronger.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງທີ່ວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກປັກໝຸດພະຍາຍາມຮັກສາຄວາມສຳພັນທາງຕຳແໜ່ງຕໍ່ກັນ. ຍິ່ງສູງ ຍິ່ງແຮງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"The strength with which the pinned objects try to stay in velocity relation "
"to each other. The higher, the stronger.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງທີ່ວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກປັກໝຸດພະຍາຍາມຮັກສາຄວາມສຳພັນທາງຄວາມໄວຕໍ່ກັນ. ຍິ່ງສູງ ຍິ່ງແຮງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"If above 0, this value is the maximum value for an impulse that this Joint3D "
"puts on its ends.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າມີຄ່າຫຼາຍກວ່າ 0, ຄ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງແຮງຖີບ (impulse) ທີ່ Joint3D ນີ້ສົ່ງໃຫ້ກັບປາຍຂອງມັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"The speed with which the two bodies get pulled together when they move in "
"different directions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວທີ່ວັດຖຸທັງສອງຖືກດຶງເຂົ້າຫາກັນເມື່ອພວກມັນເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປໃນທິດທາງທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid "The maximum rotation across the Hinge."
msgstr "ການໝຸນສູງສຸດຜ່ານຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບບານພັບ (Hinge)."

msgid "The minimum rotation across the Hinge."
msgstr "ການໝຸນຕ່ຳສຸດຜ່ານຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບບານພັບ (Hinge)."

msgid ""
"The speed with which the rotation across the axis perpendicular to the hinge "
"gets corrected.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວທີ່ການໝຸນຮອບແກນທີ່ຕັ້ງສາກກັບບານພັບຖືກປັບແກ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"The lower this value, the more the rotation gets slowed down.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ຍິ່ງຄ່ານີ້ຕ່ຳລົງ, ການໝຸນກໍ່ຈະຍິ່ງຊ້າລົງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the Hinge has a maximum and a minimum rotation."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບບານພັບຈະມີຂອບເຂດການໝຸນສູງສຸດ ແລະ ຕ່ຳສຸດ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], a motor turns the Hinge."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີມໍເຕີປິ່ນຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບບານພັບນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The maximum difference between the pivot points on their X axis before "
"damping happens."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງສູງສຸດລະຫວ່າງຈຸດໝຸນ (pivot points) ເທິງແກນ X ຂອງພວກມັນ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເກີດການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນ "
"(damping)."

msgid ""
"The minimum difference between the pivot points on their X axis before "
"damping happens."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຕ່ຳສຸດລະຫວ່າງຈຸດໝຸນ (pivot points) ເທິງແກນ X ຂອງພວກມັນ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເກີດການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນ "
"(damping)."

msgid ""
"A factor applied to the movement across the slider axis once the limits get "
"surpassed. The lower, the slower the movement.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ປັດໄຈທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຜ່ານແກນເລື່ອນ (slider axis) ເມື່ອເກີນຂອບເຂດທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຍິ່ງຕ່ຳ "
"ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ກໍ່ຈະຍິ່ງຊ້າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"The amount of restitution once the limits are surpassed. The lower, the more "
"velocity-energy gets lost.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການດີດຕົວ (restitution) ເມື່ອເກີນຂອບເຂດທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຍິ່ງຕ່ຳ "
"ພະລັງງານຄວາມໄວຈະຍິ່ງສູນເສຍໄປຫຼາຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"The amount of damping once the slider limits are surpassed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນ (damping) ເມື່ອເກີນຂອບເຂດການເລື່ອນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"A factor applied to the movement across the slider axis as long as the slider "
"is in the limits. The lower, the slower the movement.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ປັດໄຈທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຜ່ານແກນເລື່ອນ ຕາບໃດທີ່ການເລື່ອນຍັງຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດ. ຍິ່ງຕ່ຳ ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ກໍ່ຈະຍິ່ງຊ້າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"The amount of restitution inside the slider limits.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການດີດຕົວພາຍໃນຂອບເຂດການເລື່ອນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"The amount of damping inside the slider limits.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນພາຍໃນຂອບເຂດການເລື່ອນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
