msgid "Represents the size of the [enum SliderJointParam] enum."
msgstr "ຕົວແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum SliderJointParam]."

msgid ""
"Swing is rotation from side to side, around the axis perpendicular to the "
"twist axis.\n"
"The swing span defines, how much rotation will not get corrected along the "
"swing axis.\n"
"Could be defined as looseness in the [ConeTwistJoint3D]. If below 0.05, this "
"behavior is locked."
msgstr ""
"Swing ແມ່ນການໝຸນຈາກຂ້າງໜຶ່ງໄປອີກຂ້າງໜຶ່ງ, ຮອບແກນທີ່ຕັ້ງສາກກັບແກນບິດ (twist axis).\n"
"Swing span ກຳນົດວ່າການໝຸນເທົ່າໃດທີ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກປັບແກ້ຕາມແກນແກວ່ງ.\n"
"ສາມາດເອີ້ນວ່າຄວາມຫຼົມໃນ [ConeTwistJoint3D]. ຖ້າຕ່ຳກວ່າ 0.05, ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ຈະຖືກລັອກ."

msgid ""
"Twist is the rotation around the twist axis, this value defined how far the "
"joint can twist. Twist is locked if below 0.05."
msgstr ""
"Twist ແມ່ນການໝຸນຮອບແກນບິດ, ຄ່ານີ້ກຳນົດວ່າຂໍ້ຕໍ່ສາມາດບິດໄດ້ໄກປານໃດ. Twist ຈະຖືກລັອກຖ້າຕ່ຳກວ່າ "
"0.05."

msgid ""
"The speed with which the swing or twist will take place. The higher, the "
"faster.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວທີ່ການແກວ່ງ (swing) ຫຼື ການບິດ (twist) ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ຍິ່ງສູງ ຍິ່ງໄວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"The ease with which the Joint3D twists, if it's too low, it takes more force "
"to twist the joint.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມງ່າຍທີ່ Joint3D ຈະບິດ, ຖ້າມັນຕ່ຳເກີນໄປ ມັນຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ແຮງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນເພື່ອບິດຂໍ້ຕໍ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"Defines, how fast the swing- and twist-speed-difference on both sides gets "
"synced.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງຄວາມໄວ swing ແລະ twist ທັງສອງດ້ານຈະຖືກຊິງຄ໌ (sync) "
"ເຂົ້າຫາກັນໄວປານໃດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"A factor that gets applied to the movement across the axes. The lower, the "
"slower the movement.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ປັດໄຈທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຜ່ານແກນຕ່າງໆ. ຍິ່ງຕ່ຳ ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ກໍ່ຈະຍິ່ງຊ້າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"The amount of restitution on the axes movement. The lower, the more velocity-"
"energy gets lost.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການດີດຕົວໃນການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງແກນ. ຍິ່ງຕ່ຳ ພະລັງງານຄວາມໄວຈະຍິ່ງສູນເສຍໄປຫຼາຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"The amount of damping that happens at the linear motion across the axes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນການເຄື່ອນທີ່ແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ຜ່ານແກນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid "The velocity that the joint's linear motor will attempt to reach."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວທີ່ມໍເຕີແບບເສັ້ນ (linear motor) ຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຈະພະຍາຍາມໄປໃຫ້ເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"The maximum force that the linear motor can apply while trying to reach the "
"target velocity."
msgstr "ແຮງສູງສຸດທີ່ມໍເຕີແບບເສັ້ນສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພະຍາຍາມໄປໃຫ້ເຖິງຄວາມໄວເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"A factor that gets multiplied onto all rotations across the axes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ປັດໄຈທີ່ຖືກຄູນເຂົ້າກັບການໝຸນທັງໝົດຜ່ານແກນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"The amount of rotational damping across the axes. The lower, the more damping "
"occurs.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນຂອງການໝຸນຜ່ານແກນ. ຍິ່ງຕ່ຳ ການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນກໍ່ຈະຍິ່ງເກີດຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"The amount of rotational restitution across the axes. The lower, the more "
"restitution occurs.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການດີດຕົວຂອງການໝຸນຜ່ານແກນ. ຍິ່ງຕ່ຳ ການດີດຕົວກໍ່ຈະຍິ່ງເກີດຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"The maximum amount of force that can occur, when rotating around the axes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານແຮງສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ ເມື່ອມີການໝຸນຮອບແກນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"When correcting the crossing of limits in rotation across the axes, this "
"error tolerance factor defines how much the correction gets slowed down. The "
"lower, the slower.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີການປັບແກ້ການໝຸນທີ່ເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດຜ່ານແກນ, ປັດໄຈຄວາມຄາດເຄື່ອນ (error tolerance) "
"ນີ້ຈະກຳນົດວ່າການປັບແກ້ຈະຊ້າລົງເທົ່າໃດ. ຍິ່ງຕ່ຳ ຍິ່ງຊ້າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum G6DOFJointAxisParam] enum."
msgstr "ຕົວແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum G6DOFJointAxisParam]."

msgid "If set, linear motion is possible within the given limits."
msgstr "ຖ້າຖືກກຳນົດ, ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ຈະສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ພາຍໃນຂີດຈຳກັດທີ່ໃຫ້ໄວ້."

msgid "If set, rotational motion is possible."
msgstr "ຖ້າຖືກກຳນົດ, ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ແບບໝຸນຈະສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If set, there is a linear motor on this axis that targets a specific velocity."
msgstr "ຖ້າຖືກກຳນົດ, ຈະມີມໍເຕີແບບເສັ້ນເທິງແກນນີ້ທີ່ຕັ້ງເປົ້າໝາຍຄວາມໄວສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum G6DOFJointAxisFlag] enum."
msgstr "ຕົວແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum G6DOFJointAxisFlag]."

msgid ""
"Constant for creating a world boundary shape (used by the "
"[WorldBoundaryShape3D] resource)."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການສ້າງຮູບຊົງຂອບເຂດໂລກ (ໃຊ້ໂດຍຊັບພະຍາກອນ [WorldBoundaryShape3D])."

msgid ""
"Constant for creating a separation ray shape (used by the "
"[SeparationRayShape3D] resource)."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການສ້າງຮູບຊົງລັງສີແຍກ (ໃຊ້ໂດຍຊັບພະຍາກອນ [SeparationRayShape3D])."

msgid ""
"Constant for creating a sphere shape (used by the [SphereShape3D] resource)."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການສ້າງຮູບຊົງກົມ (ໃຊ້ໂດຍຊັບພະຍາກອນ [SphereShape3D])."

msgid "Constant for creating a box shape (used by the [BoxShape3D] resource)."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການສ້າງຮູບຊົງກ່ອງ (ໃຊ້ໂດຍຊັບພະຍາກອນ [BoxShape3D])."

msgid ""
"Constant for creating a capsule shape (used by the [CapsuleShape3D] resource)."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການສ້າງຮູບຊົງແຄັບຊູນ (ໃຊ້ໂດຍຊັບພະຍາກອນ [CapsuleShape3D])."

msgid ""
"Constant for creating a cylinder shape (used by the [CylinderShape3D] "
"resource)."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການສ້າງຮູບຊົງກະບອກ (ໃຊ້ໂດຍຊັບພະຍາກອນ [CylinderShape3D])."

msgid ""
"Constant for creating a convex polygon shape (used by the "
"[ConvexPolygonShape3D] resource)."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການສ້າງຮູບຊົງຫຼາຍແຈແບບນູນ (ໃຊ້ໂດຍຊັບພະຍາກອນ [ConvexPolygonShape3D])."

msgid ""
"Constant for creating a concave polygon (trimesh) shape (used by the "
"[ConcavePolygonShape3D] resource)."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການສ້າງຮູບຊົງຫຼາຍແຈແບບຫວຳ (trimesh) (ໃຊ້ໂດຍຊັບພະຍາກອນ "
"[ConcavePolygonShape3D])."

msgid ""
"Constant for creating a heightmap shape (used by the [HeightMapShape3D] "
"resource)."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການສ້າງຮູບຊົງແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງ (heightmap) (ໃຊ້ໂດຍຊັບພະຍາກອນ [HeightMapShape3D])."

msgid ""
"Constant used internally for a soft body shape. Any attempt to create this "
"kind of shape results in an error."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ທີ່ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນສຳລັບຮູບຊົງວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນ. "
"ຄວາມພະຍາຍາມໃດໆທີ່ຈະສ້າງຮູບຊົງປະເພດນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

msgid ""
"Constant used internally for a custom shape. Any attempt to create this kind "
"of shape results in an error when using Godot Physics or Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ທີ່ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນສຳລັບຮູບຊົງແບບກຳນົດເອງ. "
"ຄວາມພະຍາຍາມໃດໆທີ່ຈະສ້າງຮູບຊົງປະເພດນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດເມື່ອໃຊ້ Godot Physics ຫຼື Jolt "
"Physics."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get gravity override mode in an area. See [enum "
"AreaSpaceOverrideMode] for possible values."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາໂໝດການຂຽນທັບແຮງດຶງດູດ (gravity override mode) ໃນພື້ນທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[enum AreaSpaceOverrideMode] ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້."

msgid "Constant to set/get gravity strength in an area."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາຄວາມແຮງຂອງແຮງດຶງດູດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ."

msgid "Constant to set/get gravity vector/center in an area."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາເວກເຕີ ຫຼື ຈຸດສູນກາງຂອງແຮງດຶງດູດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get whether the gravity vector of an area is a direction, or "
"a center point."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາວ່າເວກເຕີແຮງດຶງດູດຂອງພື້ນທີ່ເປັນທິດທາງ ຫຼື ເປັນຈຸດສູນກາງ."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get linear damping override mode in an area. See [enum "
"AreaSpaceOverrideMode] for possible values."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາໂໝດການຂຽນທັບຄວາມໜ່ວງຕາມແນວເສັ້ນ (linear damping override mode) "
"ໃນພື້ນທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ. ເບິ່ງ [enum AreaSpaceOverrideMode] ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້."

msgid "Constant to set/get the linear damping factor of an area."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາປັດໄຈຄວາມໜ່ວງຕາມແນວເສັ້ນຂອງພື້ນທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get angular damping override mode in an area. See [enum "
"AreaSpaceOverrideMode] for possible values."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາໂໝດການຂຽນທັບຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງມຸມ (angular damping override mode) "
"ໃນພື້ນທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ. ເບິ່ງ [enum AreaSpaceOverrideMode] ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້."

msgid "Constant to set/get the angular damping factor of an area."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາປັດໄຈຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງມຸມຂອງພື້ນທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ."

msgid "Constant to set/get the priority (order of processing) of an area."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນ (ລຳດັບການປະມວນຜົນ) ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the magnitude of area-specific wind force. This wind "
"force only applies to [SoftBody3D] nodes. Other physics bodies are currently "
"not affected by wind."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາຂະໜາດຂອງແຮງລົມສະເພາະພື້ນທີ່. ແຮງລົມນີ້ມີຜົນກັບໂນດ [SoftBody3D] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກອື່ນໆ ປະຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກລົມ."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the 3D vector that specifies the origin from which an "
"area-specific wind blows."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາເວກເຕີ 3D ທີ່ລະບຸຈຸດກຳເນີດທີ່ລົມສະເພາະພື້ນທີ່ພັດອອກມາ."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the 3D vector that specifies the direction in which an "
"area-specific wind blows."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາເວກເຕີ 3D ທີ່ລະບຸທິດທາງທີ່ລົມສະເພາະພື້ນທີ່ພັດໄປ."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the exponential rate at which wind force decreases with "
"distance from its origin."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາອັດຕາເອັກສະໂປເນນຊຽວ (exponential rate) "
"ທີ່ແຮງລົມຫຼຸດລົງຕາມໄລຍະທາງຈາກຈຸດກຳເນີດ."

msgid "Constant to set/get a body's bounce factor."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາປັດໄຈການດີດຕົວ (bounce factor) ຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid "Constant to set/get a body's friction."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາຄວາມຝືດ (friction) ຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid "Constant to set/get a body's mass."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາມວນສານ (mass) ຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid "Constant to set/get a body's inertia."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາຄວາມເນື່ອຍ (inertia) ຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get a body's center of mass position in the body's local "
"coordinate system."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດສູນກາງມວນສານຂອງວັດຖຸໃນລະບົບພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງວັດຖຸນັ້ນ."

msgid "Constant to set/get a body's gravity multiplier."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາຕົວຄູນແຮງດຶງດູດ (gravity multiplier) ຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get a body's linear damping mode. See [enum BodyDampMode] for "
"possible values."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາໂໝດຄວາມໜ່ວງຕາມແນວເສັ້ນຂອງວັດຖຸ. ເບິ່ງ [enum BodyDampMode] "
"ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get a body's angular damping mode. See [enum BodyDampMode] "
"for possible values."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາໂໝດຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງມຸມຂອງວັດຖຸ. ເບິ່ງ [enum BodyDampMode] "
"ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້."

msgid "Constant to set/get a body's linear damping factor."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາປັດໄຈຄວາມໜ່ວງຕາມແນວເສັ້ນຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid "Constant to set/get a body's angular damping factor."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາປັດໄຈຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງມຸມຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the maximum distance a pair of bodies has to move before "
"their collision status has to be recalculated."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາໄລຍະທາງສູງສຸດທີ່ຄູ່ວັດຖຸຕ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຄິດໄລ່ສະຖານະການຕຳຂອງພວກມັນໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the maximum distance a shape can be from another before "
"they are considered separated and the contact is discarded."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາໄລຍະທາງສູງສຸດທີ່ຮູບຊົງໜຶ່ງສາມາດຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກອີກຮູບຊົງໜຶ່ງ "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ພວກມັນຈະຖືກຖືວ່າແຍກຈາກກັນ ແລະ ການສຳຜັດຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the maximum distance a shape can penetrate another shape "
"before it is considered a collision."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາໄລຍະທາງສູງສຸດທີ່ຮູບຊົງໜຶ່ງສາມາດຊອດເຂົ້າໄປໃນອີກຮູບຊົງໜຶ່ງ "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ມັນຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນການຕຳ."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the default solver bias for all physics contacts. A "
"solver bias is a factor controlling how much two objects \"rebound\", after "
"overlapping, to avoid leaving them in that state because of numerical "
"imprecision."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາຄ່າ solver bias ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການສຳຜັດຟີຊິກທັງໝົດ. solver bias "
"ແມ່ນປັດໄຈທີ່ຄວບຄຸມວ່າວັດຖຸສອງຢ່າງຈະ \"ດີດຕົວ\" ອອກຈາກກັນຫຼາຍປານໃດຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ມີການຊ້ອນທັບກັນ "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຄ້າງຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະນັ້ນເນື່ອງຈາກຄວາມບໍ່ຊັດເຈນຂອງຕົວເລກ."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the threshold linear velocity of activity. A body marked "
"as potentially inactive for both linear and angular velocity will be put to "
"sleep after the time given.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາຂີດຈຳກັດຄວາມໄວຕາມແນວເສັ້ນຂອງການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ. "
"ວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກໝາຍວ່າອາດຈະບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວທັງຄວາມໄວຕາມແນວເສັ້ນ ແລະ ຄວາມໄວຂອງມຸມ "
"ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນສະພາວະຫຼັບ (sleep) ຫຼັງຈາກເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the threshold angular velocity of activity. A body marked "
"as potentially inactive for both linear and angular velocity will be put to "
"sleep after the time given.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາຂີດຈຳກັດຄວາມໄວຂອງມຸມຂອງການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ. "
"ວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກໝາຍວ່າອາດຈະບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວທັງຄວາມໄວຕາມແນວເສັ້ນ ແລະ ຄວາມໄວຂອງມຸມ "
"ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນສະພາວະຫຼັບ (sleep) ຫຼັງຈາກເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the maximum time of activity. A body marked as "
"potentially inactive for both linear and angular velocity will be put to "
"sleep after this time."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາເວລາສູງສຸດຂອງການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ. "
"ວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກໝາຍວ່າອາດຈະບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວທັງຄວາມໄວຕາມແນວເສັ້ນ ແລະ ຄວາມໄວຂອງມຸມ "
"ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນສະພາວະຫຼັບ (sleep) ຫຼັງຈາກໝົດເວລານີ້."

msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the number of solver iterations for contacts and "
"constraints. The greater the number of iterations, the more accurate the "
"collisions and constraints will be. However, a greater number of iterations "
"requires more CPU power, which can decrease performance."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ດຶງເອົາຈຳນວນຮອບການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ solver ສຳລັບການສຳຜັດ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ "
"(constraints). ຍິ່ງຈຳນວນຮອບຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ການຕຳ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດກໍ່ຈະຍິ່ງຊັດເຈນຂຶ້ນ. ແນວໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, "
"ຈຳນວນຮອບທີ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ພະລັງງານ CPU ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບຫຼຸດລົງ."

msgid ""
"Provides virtual methods that can be overridden to create custom "
"[PhysicsServer3D] implementations."
msgstr ""
"ສະໜອງເມທອດສະເໝືອນ (virtual methods) ທີ່ສາມາດຖືກຂຽນທັບ (override) "
"ເພື່ອສ້າງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ [PhysicsServer3D] ແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"This class extends [PhysicsServer3D] by providing additional virtual methods "
"that can be overridden. When these methods are overridden, they will be "
"called instead of the internal methods of the physics server.\n"
"Intended for use with GDExtension to create custom implementations of "
"[PhysicsServer3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ຂະຫຍາຍມາຈາກ [PhysicsServer3D] "
"ໂດຍການສະໜອງເມທອດສະເໝືອນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ສາມາດຖືກຂຽນທັບໄດ້. ເມື່ອເມທອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກຂຽນທັບ, "
"ພວກມັນຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແທນເມທອດພາຍໃນຂອງເຊີເວີຟີຊິກ.\n"
"ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບ GDExtension ເພື່ອສ້າງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ [PhysicsServer3D] ແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid "A singleton for managing [PhysicsServer3D] implementations."
msgstr "ຊິງເກິລຕັນ (singleton) ສຳລັບຈັດການການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ [PhysicsServer3D]."

msgid ""
"[PhysicsServer3DManager] is the API for registering [PhysicsServer3D] "
"implementations and for setting the default implementation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is not possible to switch physics servers at runtime. This "
"class is only used on startup at the server initialization level, by Godot "
"itself and possibly by GDExtensions."
msgstr ""
"[PhysicsServer3DManager] ແມ່ນ API ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ [PhysicsServer3D] "
"ແລະ ສຳລັບຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຮັດວຽກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມັນເປັນໄປບໍ່ໄດ້ທີ່ຈະສະຫຼັບເຊີເວີຟີຊິກໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ (runtime). "
"ຄລາສນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບໃນລະດັບການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງເຊີເວີໂດຍ Godot ເອງ ແລະ "
"ອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ GDExtensions."

msgid ""
"Register a [PhysicsServer3D] implementation by passing a [param name] and a "
"[Callable] that returns a [PhysicsServer3D] object."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ [PhysicsServer3D] ໂດຍການສົ່ງ [param name] ແລະ [Callable] "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນວັດຖຸ [PhysicsServer3D]."

msgid ""
"Set the default [PhysicsServer3D] implementation to the one identified by "
"[param name], if [param priority] is greater than the priority of the current "
"default implementation."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ [PhysicsServer3D] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຫ້ເປັນອັນທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param name], ຖ້າ "
"[param priority] ສູງກວ່າລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງການເຮັດວຽກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"A class used to provide [method "
"PhysicsServer3DExtension._soft_body_update_rendering_server] with a rendering "
"handler for soft bodies."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະໜອງ [method "
"PhysicsServer3DExtension._soft_body_update_rendering_server] "
"ພ້ອມກັບຕົວຈັດການການສະແດງຜົນ (rendering handler) ສຳລັບວັດຖຸແບບອ່ອນ."

msgid ""
"Called by the [PhysicsServer3D] to set the bounding box for the [SoftBody3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໂດຍ [PhysicsServer3D] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າກ່ອງຂອບເຂດ (bounding box) ສຳລັບ [SoftBody3D]."

msgid ""
"Called by the [PhysicsServer3D] to set the normal for the [SoftBody3D] vertex "
"at the index specified by [param vertex_id].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param normal] parameter used to be of type [code]const "
"void*[/code] prior to Godot 4.2."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໂດຍ [PhysicsServer3D] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າທິດທາງປົກກະຕິ (normal) ສຳລັບຈຸດຍອດ (vertex) ຂອງ "
"[SoftBody3D] ທີ່ດັດຊະນີທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param vertex_id].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ພາລາມິເຕີ [param normal] ເຄີຍເປັນປະເພດ [code]const void*[/code] "
"ກ່ອນ Godot 4.2."

msgid ""
"Called by the [PhysicsServer3D] to set the position for the [SoftBody3D] "
"vertex at the index specified by [param vertex_id].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param vertex] parameter used to be of type [code]const "
"void*[/code] prior to Godot 4.2."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໂດຍ [PhysicsServer3D] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງສຳລັບຈຸດຍອດ (vertex) ຂອງ [SoftBody3D] "
"ທີ່ດັດຊະນີທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param vertex_id].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ພາລາມິເຕີ [param vertex] ເຄີຍເປັນປະເພດ [code]const void*[/code] "
"ກ່ອນ Godot 4.2."

msgid "Sets the bounding box for the [SoftBody3D]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າກ່ອງຂອບເຂດ (bounding box) ສຳລັບ [SoftBody3D]."

msgid ""
"Sets the normal for the [SoftBody3D] vertex at the index specified by [param "
"vertex_id]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າທິດທາງປົກກະຕິ (normal) ສຳລັບຈຸດຍອດ (vertex) ຂອງ [SoftBody3D] ທີ່ດັດຊະນີທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ "
"[param vertex_id]."

msgid ""
"Sets the position for the [SoftBody3D] vertex at the index specified by "
"[param vertex_id]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງສຳລັບຈຸດຍອດ (vertex) ຂອງ [SoftBody3D] ທີ່ດັດຊະນີທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param vertex_id]."

msgid "Provides parameters for [PhysicsDirectSpaceState2D]'s methods."
msgstr "ສະໜອງພາລາມິເຕີສຳລັບເມທອດຂອງ [PhysicsDirectSpaceState2D]."

msgid "The collision margin for the shape."
msgstr "ຂອບການຕຳ (collision margin) ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງ."

msgid "The motion of the shape being queried for."
msgstr "ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກສອບຖາມ."

msgid ""
"The [Shape2D] that will be used for collision/intersection queries. This "
"stores the actual reference which avoids the shape to be released while being "
"used for queries, so always prefer using this over [member shape_rid]."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Shape2D] ທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສອບຖາມການຕຳ ຫຼື ການຕັດກັນ. "
"ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະເກັບການອ້າງອີງຕົວຈິງໄວ້ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຮູບຊົງຖືກປ່ອຍອອກໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກໃຊ້ໃນການສອບຖາມ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນເລືອກໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ແທນ [member shape_rid] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"The queried shape's [RID] that will be used for collision/intersection "
"queries. Use this over [member shape] if you want to optimize for performance "
"using the Servers API:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var shape_rid = PhysicsServer2D.circle_shape_create()\n"
"var radius = 64\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.shape_set_data(shape_rid, radius)\n"
"\n"
"var params = PhysicsShapeQueryParameters2D.new()\n"
"params.shape_rid = shape_rid\n"
"\n"
"# Execute physics queries here...\n"
"\n"
"# Release the shape when done with physics queries.\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.free_rid(shape_rid)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"RID shapeRid = PhysicsServer2D.CircleShapeCreate();\n"
"int radius = 64;\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.ShapeSetData(shapeRid, radius);\n"
"\n"
"var params = new PhysicsShapeQueryParameters2D();\n"
"params.ShapeRid = shapeRid;\n"
"\n"
"// Execute physics queries here...\n"
"\n"
"// Release the shape when done with physics queries.\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.FreeRid(shapeRid);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"[RID] ຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ຖືກສອບຖາມ ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສອບຖາມການຕຳ ຫຼື ການຕັດກັນ. ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ແທນ "
"[member shape] ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໂດຍການໃຊ້ Servers API:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var shape_rid = PhysicsServer2D.circle_shape_create()\n"
"var radius = 64\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.shape_set_data(shape_rid, radius)\n"
"\n"
"var params = PhysicsShapeQueryParameters2D.new()\n"
"params.shape_rid = shape_rid\n"
"\n"
"# ປະຕິບັດການສອບຖາມຟີຊິກທີ່ນີ້...\n"
"\n"
"# ປ່ອຍຮູບຊົງເມື່ອສຳເລັດການສອບຖາມຟີຊິກ.\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.free_rid(shape_rid)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"RID shapeRid = PhysicsServer2D.CircleShapeCreate();\n"
"int radius = 64;\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.ShapeSetData(shapeRid, radius);\n"
"\n"
"var params = new PhysicsShapeQueryParameters2D();\n"
"params.ShapeRid = shapeRid;\n"
"\n"
"// ປະຕິບັດການສອບຖາມຟີຊິກທີ່ນີ້...\n"
"\n"
"// ປ່ອຍຮູບຊົງເມື່ອສຳເລັດການສອບຖາມຟີຊິກ.\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.FreeRid(shapeRid);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "The queried shape's transform matrix."
msgstr "ເມທຣິກການແປງຮູບຮ່າງ (transform matrix) ຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ຖືກສອບຖາມ."

msgid "Provides parameters for [PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D]'s methods."
msgstr "ສະໜອງພາລາມິເຕີສຳລັບເມທອດຂອງ [PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D]."

msgid ""
"The [Shape3D] that will be used for collision/intersection queries. This "
"stores the actual reference which avoids the shape to be released while being "
"used for queries, so always prefer using this over [member shape_rid]."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Shape3D] ທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສອບຖາມການຕຳ ຫຼື ການຕັດກັນ. "
"ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະເກັບການອ້າງອີງຕົວຈິງໄວ້ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຮູບຊົງຖືກປ່ອຍອອກໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກໃຊ້ໃນການສອບຖາມ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນເລືອກໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ແທນ [member shape_rid] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"The queried shape's [RID] that will be used for collision/intersection "
"queries. Use this over [member shape] if you want to optimize for performance "
"using the Servers API:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var shape_rid = PhysicsServer3D.sphere_shape_create()\n"
"var radius = 2.0\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.shape_set_data(shape_rid, radius)\n"
"\n"
"var params = PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D.new()\n"
"params.shape_rid = shape_rid\n"
"\n"
"# Execute physics queries here...\n"
"\n"
"# Release the shape when done with physics queries.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.free_rid(shape_rid)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"RID shapeRid = PhysicsServer3D.SphereShapeCreate();\n"
"float radius = 2.0f;\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.ShapeSetData(shapeRid, radius);\n"
"\n"
"var params = new PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D();\n"
"params.ShapeRid = shapeRid;\n"
"\n"
"// Execute physics queries here...\n"
"\n"
"// Release the shape when done with physics queries.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.FreeRid(shapeRid);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"[RID] ຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ຖືກສອບຖາມ ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສອບຖາມການຕຳ ຫຼື ການຕັດກັນ. ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ແທນ "
"[member shape] ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໂດຍການໃຊ້ Servers API:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var shape_rid = PhysicsServer3D.sphere_shape_create()\n"
"var radius = 2.0\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.shape_set_data(shape_rid, radius)\n"
"\n"
"var params = PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D.new()\n"
"params.shape_rid = shape_rid\n"
"\n"
"# ປະຕິບັດການສອບຖາມຟີຊິກທີ່ນີ້...\n"
"\n"
"# ປ່ອຍຮູບຊົງເມື່ອສຳເລັດການສອບຖາມຟີຊິກ.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.free_rid(shape_rid)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"RID shapeRid = PhysicsServer3D.SphereShapeCreate();\n"
"float radius = 2.0f;\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.ShapeSetData(shapeRid, radius);\n"
"\n"
"var params = new PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D();\n"
"params.ShapeRid = shapeRid;\n"
"\n"
"// ປະຕິບັດການສອບຖາມຟີຊິກທີ່ນີ້...\n"
"\n"
"// ປ່ອຍຮູບຊົງເມື່ອສຳເລັດການສອບຖາມຟີຊິກ.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.FreeRid(shapeRid);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Provides parameters for [method PhysicsServer2D.body_test_motion]."
msgstr "ສະໜອງພາລາມິເຕີສຳລັບ [method PhysicsServer2D.body_test_motion]."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], shapes of type [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SHAPE_SEPARATION_RAY] are used to detect collisions and can "
"stop the motion. Can be useful when snapping to the ground.\n"
"If set to [code]false[/code], shapes of type [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SHAPE_SEPARATION_RAY] are only used for separation when "
"overlapping with other bodies. That's the main use for separation ray shapes."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຮູບຊົງປະເພດ [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SHAPE_SEPARATION_RAY] ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອທົດສອບການຕຳ ແລະ "
"ສາມາດຢຸດການເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄດ້. ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນເວລາທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຕິດກັບພື້ນ (snapping to the ground).\n"
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຮູບຊົງປະເພດ [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SHAPE_SEPARATION_RAY] "
"ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຍກວັດຖຸໃນເວລາທີ່ມີການຊ້ອນທັບກັບວັດຖຸອື່ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນການໃຊ້ງານຫຼັກຂອງຮູບຊົງລັງສີແຍກ."

msgid ""
"Optional array of body [RID] to exclude from collision. Use [method "
"CollisionObject2D.get_rid] to get the [RID] associated with a "
"[CollisionObject2D]-derived node."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂອງວັດຖຸ [RID] ທີ່ເປັນທາງເລືອກເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການຕຳ. ໃຊ້ [method "
"CollisionObject2D.get_rid] ເພື່ອດຶງເອົາ [RID] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂນດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ "
"[CollisionObject2D]."

msgid ""
"Optional array of object unique instance ID to exclude from collision. See "
"[method Object.get_instance_id]."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂອງ ID ຂອງວັດຖຸ (instance ID) ທີ່ເປັນທາງເລືອກເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການຕຳ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"Object.get_instance_id]."

msgid ""
"Transform in global space where the motion should start. Usually set to "
"[member Node2D.global_transform] for the current body's transform."
msgstr ""
"ການແປງຮູບຮ່າງ (transform) ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສ່ວນລວມທີ່ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຄວນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະຕັ້ງເປັນ [member "
"Node2D.global_transform] ສຳລັບການແປງຮູບຮ່າງຂອງວັດຖຸປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Increases the size of the shapes involved in the collision detection."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຂະໜາດຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ມີສ່ວນກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນການທົດສອບການຕຳ."

msgid "Motion vector to define the length and direction of the motion to test."
msgstr "ເວກເຕີການເຄື່ອນທີ່ເພື່ອລະບຸຄວາມຍາວ ແລະ ທິດທາງຂອງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ທີ່ຈະທົດສອບ."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], any depenetration from the recovery phase is "
"reported as a collision; this is used e.g. by [CharacterBody2D] for improving "
"floor detection during floor snapping.\n"
"If set to [code]false[/code], only collisions resulting from the motion are "
"reported, which is generally the desired behavior."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການແຍກຕົວອອກຈາກການຊ້ອນທັບ (depenetration) "
"ໃນໄລຍະການຟື້ນຕົວຈະຖືກລາຍງານວ່າເປັນການຕຳ; ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງໂດຍ [CharacterBody2D] "
"ເພື່ອປັບປຸງການກວດຫາພື້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດ floor snapping.\n"
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ການຕຳທີ່ເກີດຈາກການເຄື່ອນທີ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກລາຍງານ, "
"ເຊິ່ງໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວແມ່ນພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

msgid "Provides parameters for [method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."
msgstr "ສະໜອງພາລາມິເຕີສຳລັບ [method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], shapes of type [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SHAPE_SEPARATION_RAY] are used to detect collisions and can "
"stop the motion. Can be useful when snapping to the ground.\n"
"If set to [code]false[/code], shapes of type [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SHAPE_SEPARATION_RAY] are only used for separation when "
"overlapping with other bodies. That's the main use for separation ray shapes."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຮູບຊົງປະເພດ [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SHAPE_SEPARATION_RAY] ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອທົດສອບການຕຳ ແລະ "
"ສາມາດຢຸດການເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄດ້. ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນເວລາທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຕິດກັບພື້ນ (snapping to the ground).\n"
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຮູບຊົງປະເພດ [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SHAPE_SEPARATION_RAY] "
"ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຍກວັດຖຸໃນເວລາທີ່ມີການຊ້ອນທັບກັບວັດຖຸອື່ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນການໃຊ້ງານຫຼັກຂອງຮູບຊົງລັງສີແຍກ."

msgid ""
"Optional array of body [RID] to exclude from collision. Use [method "
"CollisionObject3D.get_rid] to get the [RID] associated with a "
"[CollisionObject3D]-derived node."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂອງວັດຖຸ [RID] ທີ່ເປັນທາງເລືອກເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການຕຳ. ໃຊ້ [method "
"CollisionObject3D.get_rid] ເພື່ອດຶງເອົາ [RID] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂນດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ "
"[CollisionObject3D]."

msgid ""
"Transform in global space where the motion should start. Usually set to "
"[member Node3D.global_transform] for the current body's transform."
msgstr ""
"ການແປງຮູບຮ່າງ (transform) ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສ່ວນລວມທີ່ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຄວນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະຕັ້ງເປັນ [member "
"Node3D.global_transform] ສຳລັບການແປງຮູບຮ່າງຂອງວັດຖຸປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of returned collisions, between [code]1[/code] and [code]32[/"
"code]. Always returns the deepest detected collisions."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນການຕຳສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ, ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]1[/code] ແລະ [code]32[/code]. "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດທີ່ກວດພົບສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], any depenetration from the recovery phase is "
"reported as a collision; this is used e.g. by [CharacterBody3D] for improving "
"floor detection during floor snapping.\n"
"If set to [code]false[/code], only collisions resulting from the motion are "
"reported, which is generally the desired behavior."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການແຍກຕົວອອກຈາກການຊ້ອນທັບ (depenetration) "
"ໃນໄລຍະການຟື້ນຕົວຈະຖືກລາຍງານວ່າເປັນການຕຳ; ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງໂດຍ [CharacterBody3D] "
"ເພື່ອປັບປຸງການກວດຫາພື້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດ floor snapping.\n"
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ການຕຳທີ່ເກີດຈາກການເຄື່ອນທີ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກລາຍງານ, "
"ເຊິ່ງໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວແມ່ນພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

msgid ""
"Describes the motion and collision result from [method "
"PhysicsServer2D.body_test_motion]."
msgstr ""
"ອະທິບາຍຜົນຂອງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ການຕຳຈາກ [method PhysicsServer2D.body_test_motion]."

msgid "Returns the colliding body's attached [Object], if a collision occurred."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Object] ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳ, ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the unique instance ID of the colliding body's attached [Object], if "
"a collision occurred. See [method Object.get_instance_id]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ຂອງວັດຖຸ (instance ID) ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນຂອງ [Object] ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳ, ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method Object.get_instance_id]."

msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's [RID] used by the [PhysicsServer2D], if a "
"collision occurred."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [PhysicsServer2D], ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's shape index, if a collision occurred. See "
"[CollisionObject2D]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນດັດຊະນີຮູບຊົງຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳ, ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [CollisionObject2D]."

msgid "Returns the colliding body's velocity, if a collision occurred."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມໄວຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳ, ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the length of overlap along the collision normal, if a collision "
"occurred."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມຍາວຂອງການຊ້ອນທັບຕາມແນວປົກກະຕິຂອງການຕຳ, ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Returns the moving object's colliding shape, if a collision occurred."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຮູບຊົງທີ່ຕຳຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ກຳລັງເຄື່ອນທີ່, ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's shape's normal at the point of collision, if a "
"collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນທິດທາງປົກກະຕິ (normal) ຂອງຮູບຊົງຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດທີ່ມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the point of collision in global coordinates, if a collision occurred."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດທີ່ມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນພິກັດສ່ວນລວມ (global coordinates), ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the maximum fraction of the motion that can occur without a "
"collision, between [code]0[/code] and [code]1[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອັດຕາສ່ວນສູງສຸດຂອງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ທີ່ສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຕຳ, ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]1[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the minimum fraction of the motion needed to collide, if a collision "
"occurred, between [code]0[/code] and [code]1[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອັດຕາສ່ວນຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ເກີດການຕຳ, ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ "
"[code]0[/code] ແລະ [code]1[/code]."

msgid ""
"Describes the motion and collision result from [method "
"PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."
msgstr ""
"ອະທິບາຍຜົນຂອງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ການຕຳຈາກ [method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."

msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's attached [Object] given a collision index (the "
"deepest collision by default), if a collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Object] ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳ ໂດຍກຳນົດດັດຊະນີການຕຳ (ການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), "
"ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the unique instance ID of the colliding body's attached [Object] "
"given a collision index (the deepest collision by default), if a collision "
"occurred. See [method Object.get_instance_id]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ຂອງວັດຖຸ (instance ID) ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນຂອງ [Object] ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳ "
"ໂດຍກຳນົດດັດຊະນີການຕຳ (ການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"Object.get_instance_id]."

msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's [RID] used by the [PhysicsServer3D] given a "
"collision index (the deepest collision by default), if a collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [PhysicsServer3D] ໂດຍກຳນົດດັດຊະນີການຕຳ "
"(ການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's shape index given a collision index (the deepest "
"collision by default), if a collision occurred. See [CollisionObject3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນດັດຊະນີຮູບຊົງຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳ ໂດຍກຳນົດດັດຊະນີການຕຳ (ການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), "
"ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [CollisionObject3D]."

msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's velocity given a collision index (the deepest "
"collision by default), if a collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມໄວຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳ ໂດຍກຳນົດດັດຊະນີການຕຳ (ການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the length of overlap along the collision normal given a collision "
"index (the deepest collision by default), if a collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມຍາວຂອງການຊ້ອນທັບຕາມແນວປົກກະຕິຂອງການຕຳ ໂດຍກຳນົດດັດຊະນີການຕຳ "
"(ການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the moving object's colliding shape given a collision index (the "
"deepest collision by default), if a collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຮູບຊົງທີ່ຕຳຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ກຳລັງເຄື່ອນທີ່ ໂດຍກຳນົດດັດຊະນີການຕຳ (ການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), "
"ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's shape's normal at the point of collision given a "
"collision index (the deepest collision by default), if a collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນທິດທາງປົກກະຕິ (normal) ຂອງຮູບຊົງຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດທີ່ມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ ໂດຍກຳນົດດັດຊະນີການຕຳ "
"(ການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the point of collision in global coordinates given a collision index "
"(the deepest collision by default), if a collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດທີ່ມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນພິກັດສ່ວນລວມ (global coordinates) ໂດຍກຳນົດດັດຊະນີການຕຳ "
"(ການຕຳທີ່ເລິກທີ່ສຸດໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຖ້າມີການຕຳເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"A physics joint that attaches two 2D physics bodies at a single point, "
"allowing them to freely rotate."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຟີຊິກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 2D ສອງວັດຖຸເຂົ້າກັນຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດດຽວ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນສາມາດໝຸນໄດ້ຢ່າງອິດສະຫຼະ."

msgid ""
"A physics joint that attaches two 2D physics bodies at a single point, "
"allowing them to freely rotate. For example, a [RigidBody2D] can be attached "
"to a [StaticBody2D] to create a pendulum or a seesaw."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຟີຊິກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 2D ສອງວັດຖຸເຂົ້າກັນຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດດຽວ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນສາມາດໝຸນໄດ້ຢ່າງອິດສະຫຼະ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ສາມາດນຳ [RigidBody2D] ມາຕິດໃສ່ກັບ [StaticBody2D] ເພື່ອສ້າງລູກຕຸ້ມ ຫຼື ໄມ້ກະດົກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the pin maximum and minimum rotation, defined by "
"[member angular_limit_lower] and [member angular_limit_upper] are applied."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີການນຳໃຊ້ຂີດຈຳກັດການໝຸນສູງສຸດ ແລະ ຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງໝຸດ, ເຊິ່ງກຳນົດໂດຍ "
"[member angular_limit_lower] ແລະ [member angular_limit_upper]."

msgid ""
"The minimum rotation. Only active if [member angular_limit_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າການໝຸນຕ່ຳສຸດ. ຈະເຮັດວຽກກໍ່ຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member angular_limit_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The maximum rotation. Only active if [member angular_limit_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າການໝຸນສູງສຸດ. ຈະເຮັດວຽກກໍ່ຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member angular_limit_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "When activated, a motor turns the pin."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ມໍເຕີຈະປິ່ນໝຸດ."

msgid "The higher this value, the more the bond to the pinned partner can flex."
msgstr "ຍິ່ງຄ່ານີ້ສູງເທົ່າໃດ, ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຄູ່ທີ່ຖືກປັກໝຸດກໍ່ຈະຍິ່ງຢືດຢຸ່ນໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"A physics joint that attaches two 3D physics bodies at a single point, "
"allowing them to freely rotate."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຟີຊິກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 3D ສອງວັດຖຸເຂົ້າກັນຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດດຽວ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນສາມາດໝຸນໄດ້ຢ່າງອິດສະຫຼະ."

msgid ""
"A physics joint that attaches two 3D physics bodies at a single point, "
"allowing them to freely rotate. For example, a [RigidBody3D] can be attached "
"to a [StaticBody3D] to create a pendulum or a seesaw."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຟີຊິກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 3D ສອງວັດຖຸເຂົ້າກັນຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດດຽວ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນສາມາດໝຸນໄດ້ຢ່າງອິດສະຫຼະ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ສາມາດນຳ [RigidBody3D] ມາຕິດໃສ່ກັບ [StaticBody3D] ເພື່ອສ້າງລູກຕຸ້ມ ຫຼື ໄມ້ກະດົກ."

msgid ""
"The force with which the pinned objects stay in positional relation to each "
"other. The higher, the stronger."
msgstr "ແຮງທີ່ວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກປັກໝຸດພະຍາຍາມຮັກສາຄວາມສຳພັນທາງຕຳແໜ່ງຕໍ່ກັນ. ຍິ່ງສູງ ຍິ່ງແຮງ."

msgid ""
"The force with which the pinned objects stay in velocity relation to each "
"other. The higher, the stronger."
msgstr "ແຮງທີ່ວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກປັກໝຸດພະຍາຍາມຮັກສາຄວາມສຳພັນທາງຄວາມໄວຕໍ່ກັນ. ຍິ່ງສູງ ຍິ່ງແຮງ."

msgid ""
"If above 0, this value is the maximum value for an impulse that this Joint3D "
"produces."
msgstr "ຖ້າມີຄ່າຫຼາຍກວ່າ 0, ຄ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງແຮງຖີບ (impulse) ທີ່ Joint3D ນີ້ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "A [Cubemap] without image data."
msgstr "[Cubemap] ທີ່ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບ."

msgid ""
"This class replaces a [Cubemap] or a [Cubemap]-derived class in 2 "
"conditions:\n"
"- In dedicated server mode, where the image data shouldn't affect game logic. "
"This allows reducing the exported PCK's size significantly.\n"
"- When the [Cubemap]-derived class is missing, for example when using a "
"different engine version.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class is not intended for rendering or for use in shaders. "
"Operations like calculating UV are not guaranteed to work."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ຈະເຂົ້າສວມແທນ [Cubemap] ຫຼື ຄລາສທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [Cubemap] ໃນ 2 ເງື່ອນໄຂ:\n"
"- ໃນໂໝດເຊີເວີສະເພາະ (dedicated server mode), "
"ບ່ອນທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບບໍ່ຄວນສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຕັກກະຂອງເກມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຂະໜາດຂອງໄຟລ໌ PCK "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໄດ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ.\n"
"- ເມື່ອຄລາສທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [Cubemap] ຫາຍໄປ, ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນເມື່ອໃຊ້ເວີຊັນຂອງເອນຈິນທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄລາສນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອການສະແດງຜົນ ຫຼື ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນເຊດເດີ (shader). "
"ການເຮັດວຽກຕ່າງໆເຊັ່ນການຄິດໄລ່ UV ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້."

msgid "A [CubemapArray] without image data."
msgstr "[CubemapArray] ທີ່ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບ."

msgid ""
"This class replaces a [CubemapArray] or a [CubemapArray]-derived class in 2 "
"conditions:\n"
"- In dedicated server mode, where the image data shouldn't affect game logic. "
"This allows reducing the exported PCK's size significantly.\n"
"- When the [CubemapArray]-derived class is missing, for example when using a "
"different engine version.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class is not intended for rendering or for use in shaders. "
"Operations like calculating UV are not guaranteed to work."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ຈະເຂົ້າສວມແທນ [CubemapArray] ຫຼື ຄລາສທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [CubemapArray] ໃນ 2 "
"ເງື່ອນໄຂ:\n"
"- ໃນໂໝດເຊີເວີສະເພາະ (dedicated server mode), "
"ບ່ອນທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບບໍ່ຄວນສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຕັກກະຂອງເກມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຂະໜາດຂອງໄຟລ໌ PCK "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໄດ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ.\n"
"- ເມື່ອຄລາສທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [CubemapArray] ຫາຍໄປ, ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນເມື່ອໃຊ້ເວີຊັນຂອງເອນຈິນທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄລາສນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອການສະແດງຜົນ ຫຼື ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນເຊດເດີ (shader). "
"ການເຮັດວຽກຕ່າງໆເຊັ່ນການຄິດໄລ່ UV ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້."

msgid "Placeholder class for a material."
msgstr "ຄລາສຕົວແທນ (placeholder) ສຳລັບວັດສະດຸ (material)."

msgid ""
"This class is used when loading a project that uses a [Material] subclass in "
"2 conditions:\n"
"- When running the project exported in dedicated server mode, only the "
"texture's dimensions are kept (as they may be relied upon for gameplay "
"purposes or positioning of other elements). This allows reducing the exported "
"PCK's size significantly.\n"
"- When this subclass is missing due to using a different engine version or "
"build (e.g. modules disabled)."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອໂຫຼດໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ໃຊ້ຄລາສຍ່ອຍຂອງ [Material] ໃນ 2 ເງື່ອນໄຂ:\n"
"- ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໃນໂໝດເຊີເວີສະເພາະ (dedicated server mode), "
"ຈະເກັບໄວ້ພຽງແຕ່ຂະໜາດຂອງພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ "
"(ເນື່ອງຈາກອາດມີການໃຊ້ຂະໜາດນັ້ນໃນລະບົບການຫຼິ້ນເກມ ຫຼື ການກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງອົງປະກອບອື່ນໆ). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຂະໜາດຂອງໄຟລ໌ PCK ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໄດ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ.\n"
"- ເມື່ອຄລາສຍ່ອຍນີ້ຫາຍໄປ ເນື່ອງຈາກການໃຊ້ເວີຊັນຂອງເອນຈິນ ຫຼື ບິລດ໌ (build) ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ໂມດູນຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ)."

msgid "Placeholder class for a mesh."
msgstr "ຄລາສຕົວແທນ (placeholder) ສຳລັບເມຊ (mesh)."

msgid ""
"This class is used when loading a project that uses a [Mesh] subclass in 2 "
"conditions:\n"
"- When running the project exported in dedicated server mode, only the "
"texture's dimensions are kept (as they may be relied upon for gameplay "
"purposes or positioning of other elements). This allows reducing the exported "
"PCK's size significantly.\n"
"- When this subclass is missing due to using a different engine version or "
"build (e.g. modules disabled)."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອໂຫຼດໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ໃຊ້ຄລາສຍ່ອຍຂອງ [Mesh] ໃນ 2 ເງື່ອນໄຂ:\n"
"- ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໃນໂໝດເຊີເວີສະເພາະ (dedicated server mode), "
"ຈະເກັບໄວ້ພຽງແຕ່ຂະໜາດຂອງພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ "
"(ເນື່ອງຈາກອາດມີການໃຊ້ຂະໜາດນັ້ນໃນລະບົບການຫຼິ້ນເກມ ຫຼື ການກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງອົງປະກອບອື່ນໆ). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຂະໜາດຂອງໄຟລ໌ PCK ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໄດ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ.\n"
"- ເມື່ອຄລາສຍ່ອຍນີ້ຫາຍໄປ ເນື່ອງຈາກການໃຊ້ເວີຊັນຂອງເອນຈິນ ຫຼື ບິລດ໌ (build) ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ໂມດູນຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ)."

msgid "The smallest [AABB] enclosing this mesh in local space."
msgstr "[AABB] ທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດທີ່ກຸມເມຊນີ້ໄວ້ໃນພື້ນທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local space)."

msgid "Placeholder class for a 2-dimensional texture."
msgstr "ຄລາສຕົວແທນ ສຳລັບພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ແບບ 2 ມິຕິ."

msgid ""
"This class is used when loading a project that uses a [Texture2D] subclass in "
"2 conditions:\n"
"- When running the project exported in dedicated server mode, only the "
"texture's dimensions are kept (as they may be relied upon for gameplay "
"purposes or positioning of other elements). This allows reducing the exported "
"PCK's size significantly.\n"
"- When this subclass is missing due to using a different engine version or "
"build (e.g. modules disabled).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is not intended to be used as an actual texture for "
"rendering. It is not guaranteed to work like one in shaders or materials (for "
"example when calculating UV)."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອໂຫຼດໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ໃຊ້ຄລາສຍ່ອຍຂອງ [Texture2D] ໃນ 2 ເງື່ອນໄຂ:\n"
"- ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໃນໂໝດເຊີເວີສະເພາະ (dedicated server mode), "
"ຈະເກັບໄວ້ພຽງແຕ່ຂະໜາດຂອງພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຂະໜາດຂອງໄຟລ໌ PCK "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໄດ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ.\n"
"- ເມື່ອຄລາສຍ່ອຍນີ້ຫາຍໄປ ເນື່ອງຈາກການໃຊ້ເວີຊັນຂອງເອນຈິນ ຫຼື ບິລດ໌ (build) ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນພື້ນຜິວຕົວຈິງໃນການສະແດງຜົນ. "
"ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບພື້ນຜິວທົ່ວໄປໃນເຊດເດີ ຫຼື ວັດສະດຸ (ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ເວລາຄິດໄລ່ UV)."

msgid "The texture's size (in pixels)."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງພື້ນຜິວ (ເປັນພິກເຊວ)."

msgid "Placeholder class for a 2-dimensional texture array."
msgstr "ຄລາສຕົວແທນ ສຳລັບອາເຣຂອງພື້ນຜິວ (texture array) ແບບ 2 ມິຕິ."

msgid "Placeholder class for a 3-dimensional texture."
msgstr "ຄລາສຕົວແທນ ສຳລັບພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ແບບ 3 ມິຕິ."

msgid ""
"This class is used when loading a project that uses a [Texture3D] subclass in "
"2 conditions:\n"
"- When running the project exported in dedicated server mode, only the "
"texture's dimensions are kept (as they may be relied upon for gameplay "
"purposes or positioning of other elements). This allows reducing the exported "
"PCK's size significantly.\n"
"- When this subclass is missing due to using a different engine version or "
"build (e.g. modules disabled).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is not intended to be used as an actual texture for "
"rendering. It is not guaranteed to work like one in shaders or materials (for "
"example when calculating UV)."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອໂຫຼດໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ໃຊ້ຄລາສຍ່ອຍຂອງ [Texture3D] ໃນ 2 ເງື່ອນໄຂ:\n"
"- ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໃນໂໝດເຊີເວີສະເພາະ (dedicated server mode), "
"ຈະເກັບໄວ້ພຽງແຕ່ຂະໜາດຂອງພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຂະໜາດຂອງໄຟລ໌ PCK "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໄດ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ.\n"
"- ເມື່ອຄລາສຍ່ອຍນີ້ຫາຍໄປ ເນື່ອງຈາກການໃຊ້ເວີຊັນຂອງເອນຈິນ ຫຼື ບິລດ໌ (build) ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນພື້ນຜິວຕົວຈິງໃນການສະແດງຜົນ. "
"ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບພື້ນຜິວທົ່ວໄປໃນເຊດເດີ ຫຼື ວັດສະດຸ (ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ເວລາຄິດໄລ່ UV)."

msgid ""
"This class is used when loading a project that uses a [TextureLayered] "
"subclass in 2 conditions:\n"
"- When running the project exported in dedicated server mode, only the "
"texture's dimensions are kept (as they may be relied upon for gameplay "
"purposes or positioning of other elements). This allows reducing the exported "
"PCK's size significantly.\n"
"- When this subclass is missing due to using a different engine version or "
"build (e.g. modules disabled).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is not intended to be used as an actual texture for "
"rendering. It is not guaranteed to work like one in shaders or materials (for "
"example when calculating UV)."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອໂຫຼດໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ໃຊ້ຄລາສຍ່ອຍຂອງ [TextureLayered] ໃນ 2 ເງື່ອນໄຂ:\n"
"- ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໃນໂໝດເຊີເວີສະເພາະ (dedicated server mode), "
"ຈະເກັບໄວ້ພຽງແຕ່ຂະໜາດຂອງພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ເທົັ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຂະໜາດຂອງໄຟລ໌ PCK "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໄດ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ.\n"
"- ເມື່ອຄລາສຍ່ອຍນີ້ຫາຍໄປ ເນື່ອງຈາກການໃຊ້ເວີຊັນຂອງເອນຈິນ ຫຼື ບິລດ໌ (build) ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນພື້ນຜິວຕົວຈິງໃນການສະແດງຜົນ. "
"ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບພື້ນຜິວທົ່ວໄປໃນເຊດເດີ ຫຼື ວັດສະດຸ (ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ເວລາຄິດໄລ່ UV)."

msgid "The number of layers in the texture array."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຊັ້ນໃນອາເຣຂອງພື້ນຜິວ (texture array)."

msgid "The size of each texture layer (in pixels)."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະຊັ້ນພື້ນຜິວ (ເປັນພິກເຊວ)."

msgid "A plane in Hessian normal form."
msgstr "ລະນາບ (plane) ໃນຮູບແບບປົກກະຕິ Hessian (Hessian normal form)."

msgid ""
"Represents a normalized plane equation. [member normal] is the normal of the "
"plane (a, b, c normalized), and [member d] is the distance from the origin to "
"the plane (in the direction of \"normal\"). \"Over\" or \"Above\" the plane "
"is considered the side of the plane towards where the normal is pointing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a plane will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if all its components equal [code]0[/code]. Otherwise, a plane will "
"always evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແທນຂອງສົມຜົນລະນາບທີ່ປັບຄ່າແລ້ວ (normalized plane equation). [member normal] "
"ແມ່ນທິດທາງປົກກະຕິຂອງລະນາບ (a, b, c ທີ່ປັບຄ່າແລ້ວ), ແລະ [member d] "
"ແມ່ນໄລຍະທາງຈາກຈຸດກຳເນີດໄປຍັງລະນາບ (ໃນທິດທາງຂອງ \"normal\"). ດ້ານ \"ເທິງ\" "
"ຂອງລະນາບແມ່ນຖືວ່າເປັນດ້ານທີ່ທິດທາງປົກກະຕິຊີ້ໄປ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງບູລີນ (boolean), ລະນາບຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ຖ້າທຸກໆສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງມັນເທົ່າກັບ [code]0[/code]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ລະນາບຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Constructs a default-initialized [Plane] with all components set to [code]0[/"
"code]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Plane] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍທີ່ທຸກສ່ວນປະກອບຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/code]."

msgid "Constructs a [Plane] as a copy of the given [Plane]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Plane] ໂດຍການຄັດລອກມາຈາກ [Plane] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Creates a plane from the four parameters. The three components of the "
"resulting plane's [member normal] are [param a], [param b] and [param c], and "
"the plane has a distance of [param d] from the origin."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງລະນາບຈາກສີ່ພາລາມິເຕີ. ສາມສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [member normal] ຂອງລະນາບທີ່ໄດ້ແມ່ນ [param a], "
"[param b] ແລະ [param c], ແລະ ລະນາບນັ້ນມີໄລຍະຫ່າງ [param d] ຈາກຈຸດກຳເນີດ."

msgid ""
"Creates a plane from the normal vector. The plane will intersect the origin.\n"
"The [param normal] of the plane must be a unit vector."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງລະນາບຈາກເວກເຕີປົກກະຕິ. ລະນາບຈະຕັດຜ່ານຈຸດກຳເນີດ.\n"
"[param normal] ຂອງລະນາບຕ້ອງເປັນເວກເຕີຫົວໜ່ວຍ (unit vector)."

msgid ""
"Creates a plane from the normal vector and the plane's distance from the "
"origin.\n"
"The [param normal] of the plane must be a unit vector."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງລະນາບຈາກເວກເຕີປົກກະຕິ ແລະ ໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອງລະນາບຈາກຈຸດກຳເນີດ.\n"
"[param normal] ຂອງລະນາບຕ້ອງເປັນເວກເຕີຫົວໜ່ວຍ (unit vector)."

msgid ""
"Creates a plane from the normal vector and a point on the plane.\n"
"The [param normal] of the plane must be a unit vector."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງລະນາບຈາກເວກເຕີປົກກະຕິ ແລະ ຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງເທິງລະນາບ.\n"
"[param normal] ຂອງລະນາບຕ້ອງເປັນເວກເຕີຫົວໜ່ວຍ (unit vector)."

msgid "Creates a plane from the three points, given in clockwise order."
msgstr "ສ້າງລະນາບຈາກສາມຈຸດ, ໂດຍລຽງຕາມລຳດັບເຂັມໂມງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the shortest distance from the plane to the position [param point]. "
"If the point is above the plane, the distance will be positive. If below, the "
"distance will be negative."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໄລຍະທາງທີ່ສັ້ນທີ່ສຸດຈາກລະນາບໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງ [param point]. ຖ້າຈຸດນັ້ນຢູ່ເໜືອລະນາບ, "
"ໄລຍະທາງຈະເປັນຄ່າບວກ. ຖ້າຢູ່ລຸ່ມ, ໄລຍະທາງຈະເປັນຄ່າລົບ."

msgid "Returns the center of the plane."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດສູນກາງຂອງລະນາບ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param point] is inside the plane. Comparison "
"uses a custom minimum [param tolerance] threshold."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param point] ຢູ່ພາຍໃນລະນາບ. "
"ການປຽບທຽບຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າຂີດຈຳກັດຄວາມຄາດເຄື່ອນ [param tolerance] ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the intersection point of the three planes [param b], [param c] and "
"this plane. If no intersection is found, [code]null[/code] is returned."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດຕັດກັນຂອງສາມລະນາບ [param b], [param c] ແລະ ລະນາບນີ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບຈຸດຕັດກັນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]null[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the intersection point of a ray consisting of the position [param "
"from] and the direction normal [param dir] with this plane. If no "
"intersection is found, [code]null[/code] is returned."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດຕັດກັນຂອງລັງສີ (ray) ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຕຳແໜ່ງ [param from] ແລະ ທິດທາງປົກກະຕິ [param dir] "
"ກັບລະນາບນີ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບຈຸດຕັດກັນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the intersection point of a segment from position [param from] to "
"position [param to] with this plane. If no intersection is found, [code]null[/"
"code] is returned."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດຕັດກັນຂອງເສັ້ນຊື່ຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງ [param from] ໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງ [param to] ກັບລະນາບນີ້. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບຈຸດຕັດກັນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this plane and [param to_plane] are "
"approximately equal, by running [method @GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] on each "
"component."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລະນາບນີ້ ແລະ [param to_plane] ມີຄ່າໃກ້ຄຽງກັນ, ໂດຍການໃຊ້ "
"[method @GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] ໃນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this plane is finite, by calling [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_finite] on each component."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລະນາບນີ້ມີຄ່າຈຳກັດ (finite), ໂດຍການໃຊ້ [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_finite] ໃນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if [param point] is located above the plane."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param point] ຕັ້ງຢູ່ເໜືອລະນາບ."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the plane, with normalized [member normal] (so it's a unit "
"vector). Returns [code]Plane(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code] if [member normal] can't be "
"normalized (it has zero length)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສຳເນົາຂອງລະນາບ ໂດຍທີ່ [member normal] ຖືກປັບຄ່າແລ້ວ (ໃຫ້ເປັນເວກເຕີຫົວໜ່ວຍ). ສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]Plane(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code] ຖ້າ [member normal] ບໍ່ສາມາດປັບຄ່າໄດ້ "
"(ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນມີຄວາມຍາວເປັນສູນ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the orthogonal projection of [param point] into a point in the plane."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການສາຍພາບແບບຕັ້ງສາກ (orthogonal projection) ຂອງ [param point] "
"ໄປເປັນຈຸດເທິງລະນາບ."

msgid ""
"The distance from the origin to the plane, expressed in terms of [member "
"normal] (according to its direction and magnitude). Actual absolute distance "
"from the origin to the plane can be calculated as [code]abs(d) / "
"normal.length()[/code] (if [member normal] has zero length then this [Plane] "
"does not represent a valid plane).\n"
"In the scalar equation of the plane [code]ax + by + cz = d[/code], this is "
"[code skip-lint]d[/code], while the [code](a, b, c)[/code] coordinates are "
"represented by the [member normal] property."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງຈາກຈຸດກຳເນີດໄປຫາລະນາບ, ສະແດງໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ [member normal] (ຕາມທິດທາງ ແລະ "
"ຂະໜາດຂອງມັນ). ໄລຍະທາງສຳບູນຕົວຈິງຈາກຈຸດກຳເນີດຫາລະນາບສາມາດຄິດໄລ່ໄດ້ຈາກ [code]abs(d) / "
"normal.length()[/code] (ຖ້າ [member normal] ມີຄວາມຍາວເປັນສູນ, [Plane] "
"ນີ້ຈະບໍ່ແມ່ນລະນາບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ).\n"
"ໃນສົມຜົນສະກາລາຂອງລະນາບ [code]ax + by + cz = d[/code], ສ່ວນນີ້ຄື [code skip-lint]d[/"
"code], ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພິກັດ [code](a, b, c)[/code] ຖືກແທນດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດ [member normal]."

msgid ""
"The normal of the plane, typically a unit vector. Shouldn't be a zero vector "
"as [Plane] with such [member normal] does not represent a valid plane.\n"
"In the scalar equation of the plane [code]ax + by + cz = d[/code], this is "
"the vector [code](a, b, c)[/code], where [code skip-lint]d[/code] is the "
"[member d] property."
msgstr ""
"ທິດທາງປົກກະຕິ (normal) ຂອງລະນາບ, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນເວກເຕີຫົວໜ່ວຍ. ບໍ່ຄວນເປັນເວກເຕີສູນ ເພາະ "
"[Plane] ທີ່ມີ [member normal] ເປັນສູນຈະບໍ່ແມ່ນລະນາບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"ໃນສົມຜົນສະກາລາຂອງລະນາບ [code]ax + by + cz = d[/code], ສ່ວນນີ້ຄືເວກເຕີ [code](a, b, c)"
"[/code], ໂດຍທີ່ [code skip-lint]d[/code] ແມ່ນຄຸນສົມບັດ [member d]."

msgid "The X component of the plane's [member normal] vector."
msgstr "ສ່ວນປະກອບ X ຂອງເວກເຕີ [member normal] ຂອງລະນາບ."

msgid "The Y component of the plane's [member normal] vector."
msgstr "ສ່ວນປະກອບ Y ຂອງເວກເຕີ [member normal] ຂອງລະນາບ."

msgid "The Z component of the plane's [member normal] vector."
msgstr "ສ່ວນປະກອບ Z ຂອງເວກເຕີ [member normal] ຂອງລະນາບ."

msgid "A plane that extends in the Y and Z axes (normal vector points +X)."
msgstr "ລະນາບທີ່ແຜ່ອອກໃນແກນ Y ແລະ Z (ເວກເຕີປົກກະຕິຊີ້ໄປທາງ +X)."

msgid "A plane that extends in the X and Z axes (normal vector points +Y)."
msgstr "ລະນາບທີ່ແຜ່ອອກໃນແກນ X ແລະ Z (ເວກເຕີປົກກະຕິຊີ້ໄປທາງ +Y)."

msgid "A plane that extends in the X and Y axes (normal vector points +Z)."
msgstr "ລະນາບທີ່ແຜ່ອອກໃນແກນ X ແລະ Y (ເວກເຕີປົກກະຕິຊີ້ໄປທາງ +Z)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the planes are not equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, consider using [method "
"is_equal_approx] instead, which is more reliable."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລະນາບທັງສອງບໍ່ເທົ່າກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງຄວາມຊັດເຈນໃນຕົວເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ, ຄວນພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [method "
"is_equal_approx] ແທນ ເພາະມີຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Inversely transforms (multiplies) the [Plane] by the given [Transform3D] "
"transformation matrix.\n"
"[code]plane * transform[/code] is equivalent to "
"[code]transform.affine_inverse() * plane[/code]. See [method "
"Transform3D.affine_inverse]."
msgstr ""
"ແປງຮູບຮ່າງແບບຜົກຜັນ (ຄູນ) [Plane] ດ້ວຍເມທຣິກການແປງຮູບຮ່າງ [Transform3D] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້.\n"
"[code]plane * transform[/code] ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [code]transform.affine_inverse() * "
"plane[/code]. ເບິ່ງ [method Transform3D.affine_inverse]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the planes are exactly equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, consider using [method "
"is_equal_approx] instead, which is more reliable."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລະນາບທັງສອງເທົ່າກັນຢ່າງແນ່ນອນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງຄວາມຊັດເຈນໃນຕົວເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ, ຄວນພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [method "
"is_equal_approx] ແທນ ເພາະມີຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Returns the negative value of the [Plane]. This is the same as writing "
"[code]Plane(-p.normal, -p.d)[/code]. This operation flips the direction of "
"the normal vector and also flips the distance value, resulting in a Plane "
"that is in the same place, but facing the opposite direction."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າລົບຂອງ [Plane]. ນີ້ຄືກັນກັບການຂຽນ [code]Plane(-p.normal, -p.d)[/code]. "
"ການປະຕິບັດການນີ້ຈະກັບທິດທາງຂອງເວກເຕີປົກກະຕິ ແລະ ກັບຄ່າໄລຍະທາງ, ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ໄດ້ລະນາບທີ່ຢູ່ໃນບ່ອນເກົ່າ "
"ແຕ່ຫັນໄປໃນທິດທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ."

msgid "Class representing a planar [PrimitiveMesh]."
msgstr "ຄລາສທີ່ເປັນຕົວແທນຂອງ [PrimitiveMesh] ແບບລະນາບ."

msgid ""
"Class representing a planar [PrimitiveMesh]. This flat mesh does not have a "
"thickness. By default, this mesh is aligned on the X and Z axes; this default "
"rotation isn't suited for use with billboarded materials. For billboarded "
"materials, change [member orientation] to [constant FACE_Z].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using a large textured [PlaneMesh] (e.g. as a floor), you "
"may stumble upon UV jittering issues depending on the camera angle. To solve "
"this, increase [member subdivide_depth] and [member subdivide_width] until "
"you no longer notice UV jittering."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສທີ່ເປັນຕົວແທນຂອງ [PrimitiveMesh] ແບບລະນາບ. ເມຊແບນໆນີ້ບໍ່ມີຄວາມໜາ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ເມຊນີ້ຈະວາງແນວຕາມແກນ X ແລະ Z; ການໝຸນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນນີ້ບໍ່ເໝາະສົມກັບການໃຊ້ງານວັດສະດຸແບບບິລບອດ "
"(billboarded materials). ສຳລັບວັດສະດຸແບບບິລບອດ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ [member orientation] ເປັນ "
"[constant FACE_Z].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [PlaneMesh] ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ມີພື້ນຜິວ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເຮັດເປັນພື້ນ), "
"ເຈົ້າອາດຈະພົບກັບບັນຫາ UV ສັ່ນ (jittering) ຂຶ້ນກັບມຸມກ້ອງ. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ [member "
"subdivide_depth] ແລະ [member subdivide_width] ຈົນກວ່າຈະບໍ່ເຫັນການສັ່ນຂອງ UV ອີກ."

msgid "Offset of the generated plane. Useful for particles."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ຂອງລະນາບທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບພາກຕິເຄິນ (particles)."

msgid "Direction that the [PlaneMesh] is facing."
msgstr "ທິດທາງທີ່ [PlaneMesh] ຫັນໄປ."

msgid "Size of the generated plane."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງລະນາບທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Number of subdivision along the Z axis."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍຕາມແກນ Z."

msgid "Number of subdivision along the X axis."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍຕາມແກນ X."

msgid "[PlaneMesh] will face the positive X-axis."
msgstr "[PlaneMesh] ຈະຫັນໜ້າໄປທາງແກນ X ບວກ."

msgid ""
"[PlaneMesh] will face the positive Y-axis. This matches the behavior of the "
"[PlaneMesh] in Godot 3.x."
msgstr ""
"[PlaneMesh] ຈະຫັນໜ້າໄປທາງແກນ Y ບວກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ກົງກັບພຶດຕິກຳຂອງ [PlaneMesh] ໃນ Godot 3.x."

msgid ""
"[PlaneMesh] will face the positive Z-axis. This matches the behavior of the "
"QuadMesh in Godot 3.x."
msgstr ""
"[PlaneMesh] ຈະຫັນໜ້າໄປທາງແກນ Z ບວກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ກົງກັບພຶດຕິກຳຂອງ QuadMesh ໃນ Godot 3.x."

msgid "Positional 2D light source."
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ 2D ແບບກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Casts light in a 2D environment. This light's shape is defined by a (usually "
"grayscale) texture."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ອງແສງໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ 2D. ຮູບຊົງຂອງແສງນີ້ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍພື້ນຜິວ (texture) (ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນສີເທົາ)."

msgid ""
"The height of the light. Used with 2D normal mapping. The units are in "
"pixels, e.g. if the height is 100, then it will illuminate an object 100 "
"pixels away at a 45° angle to the plane."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສູງຂອງແສງ. ໃຊ້ກັບການເຮັດ normal mapping ແບບ 2D. ຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນພິກເຊວ, ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ຖ້າຄວາມສູງແມ່ນ 100, ມັນຈະສ່ອງສະຫວ່າງໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ຫ່າງອອກໄປ 100 ພິກເຊວ ໃນມຸມ 45 ອົງສາກັບລະນາບ."

msgid "The offset of the light's [member texture]."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ຂອງ [member texture] ຂອງແສງ."

msgid "[Texture2D] used for the light's appearance."
msgstr "[Texture2D] ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງແສງ."

msgid "The [member texture]'s scale factor."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນຂະໜາດຂອງ [member texture]."

msgid "Mesh with a single point primitive."
msgstr "ເມຊທີ່ມີຈຸດພື້ນຖານ (primitive) ພຽງຈຸດດຽວ."

msgid ""
"A [PointMesh] is a primitive mesh composed of a single point. Instead of "
"relying on triangles, points are rendered as a single rectangle on the screen "
"with a constant size. They are intended to be used with particle systems, but "
"can also be used as a cheap way to render billboarded sprites (for example in "
"a point cloud).\n"
"In order to be displayed, point meshes must be used with a material that has "
"a point size. The point size can be accessed in a shader with the "
"[code]POINT_SIZE[/code] built-in, or in a [BaseMaterial3D] by setting the "
"[member BaseMaterial3D.use_point_size] and [member BaseMaterial3D.point_size] "
"properties.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using point meshes, properties that normally affect "
"vertices will be ignored, including [member BaseMaterial3D.billboard_mode], "
"[member BaseMaterial3D.grow], and [member BaseMaterial3D.cull_mode]."
msgstr ""
"[PointMesh] ແມ່ນເມຊພື້ນຖານທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຈຸດດຽວ. ແທນທີ່ຈະອາໄສຮູບສາມແຈ, "
"ຈຸດຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກສະແດງເປັນຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກດຽວໃນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມີຂະໜາດຄົງທີ່. ພວກມັນມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບລະບົບພາກທິເຄິລ "
"(particle systems), ແຕ່ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນວິທີທີ່ປະຢັດໃນການສະແດງຜົນສະໄປຣ໌ດແບບບິນບອດ "
"(billboarded sprites) (ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນໃນກຸ່ມເມກຂອງຈຸດ ຫຼື point cloud).\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະແດງຜົນໄດ້, ເມຊແບບຈຸດຕ້ອງຖືກໃຊ້ກັບວັດສະດຸ (material) ທີ່ມີຂະໜາດຈຸດ. "
"ຂະໜາດຈຸດສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໃນເຊດເດີ (shader) ດ້ວຍ [code]POINT_SIZE[/code] ທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ໃນຕົວ, "
"ຫຼື ໃນ [BaseMaterial3D] ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ [member BaseMaterial3D.use_point_size] "
"ແລະ [member BaseMaterial3D.point_size].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ເມຊແບບຈຸດ, ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ປົກກະຕິມີຜົນຕໍ່ຈຸດຈອມ (vertices) ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ, "
"ລວມທັງ [member BaseMaterial3D.billboard_mode], [member BaseMaterial3D.grow], "
"ແລະ [member BaseMaterial3D.cull_mode]."

msgid "A 2D polygon."
msgstr "ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ 2 ມິຕິ."

msgid ""
"A Polygon2D is defined by a set of points. Each point is connected to the "
"next, with the final point being connected to the first, resulting in a "
"closed polygon. Polygon2Ds can be filled with color (solid or gradient) or "
"filled with a given texture."
msgstr ""
"Polygon2D ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍຊຸດຂອງຈຸດຕ່າງໆ. ແຕ່ລະຈຸດຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຈຸດຖັດໄປ, "
"ໂດຍທີ່ຈຸດສຸດທ້າຍຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຈຸດທຳອິດ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດເປັນຮູບຫຼາຍແຈແບບປິດ. Polygon2D ສາມາດໃສ່ສີ (ສີພື້ນ "
"ຫຼື ສີແບບໄລ່ລະດັບ) ຫຼື ໃສ່ດ້ວຍແທັກເຈີ (texture) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Adds a bone with the specified [param path] and [param weights]."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມກະດູກດ້ວຍ [param path] ແລະ [param weights] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Removes all bones from this [Polygon2D]."
msgstr "ລຶບກະດູກທັງໝົດອອກຈາກ [Polygon2D] ນີ້."

msgid "Removes the specified bone from this [Polygon2D]."
msgstr "ລຶບກະດູກທີ່ກຳນົດອອກຈາກ [Polygon2D] ນີ້."

msgid "Returns the number of bones in this [Polygon2D]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນກະດູກໃນ [Polygon2D] ນີ້."

msgid "Returns the path to the node associated with the specified bone."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາໂນດ (node) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບກະດູກທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Returns the weight values of the specified bone."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່ານ້ຳໜັກ (weight) ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Sets the path to the node associated with the specified bone."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາໂນດ (node) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບກະດູກທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Sets the weight values for the specified bone."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່ານ້ຳໜັກ (weight) ສຳລັບກະດູກທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], polygon edges will be anti-aliased."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຂອບຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຈະຖືກລຶບຮອຍຢັກ (anti-aliased)."

msgid ""
"The polygon's fill color. If [member texture] is set, it will be multiplied "
"by this color. It will also be the default color for vertices not set in "
"[member vertex_colors]."
msgstr ""
"ສີພື້ນຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ. ຖ້າ [member texture] ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້, ມັນຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍສີນີ. "
"ມັນຍັງຈະເປັນສີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບຈຸດຈອມ (vertices) ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ [member vertex_colors]."

msgid "Number of internal vertices, used for UV mapping."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຈຸດຈອມພາຍໃນ, ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດຜັງ UV (UV mapping)."

msgid ""
"Added padding applied to the bounding box when [member invert_enabled] is set "
"to [code]true[/code]. Setting this value too small may result in a \"Bad "
"Polygon\" error."
msgstr ""
"ການເສີມຂອບ (padding) ທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຂອບເຂດວັດຖຸ (bounding box) ເມື່ອ [member "
"invert_enabled] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code]. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໜ້ອຍເກີນໄປອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"\"Bad Polygon\"."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the polygon will be inverted, containing the area "
"outside the defined points and extending to the [member invert_border]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຈະຖືກປີ້ນກັບ, ໂດຍຈະກວມເອົາພື້ນທີ່ພາຍນອກຈຸດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ ແລະ "
"ຂະຫຍາຍໄປຈົນຮອດ [member invert_border]."

msgid "The offset applied to each vertex."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບແຕ່ລະຈຸດຈອມ."

msgid ""
"The polygon's list of vertices. The final point will be connected to the "
"first."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ຈຸດຈອມຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ. ຈຸດສຸດທ້າຍຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຈຸດທຳອິດ."

msgid ""
"The list of polygons, in case more than one is being represented. Every "
"individual polygon is stored as a [PackedInt32Array] where each [int] is an "
"index to a point in [member polygon]. If empty, this property will be "
"ignored, and the resulting single polygon will be composed of all points in "
"[member polygon], using the order they are stored in."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍຊື່ຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ, ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງຮູບ. ແຕ່ລະຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເປັນ "
"[PackedInt32Array] ໂດຍທີ່ແຕ່ລະ [int] ແມ່ນດັດສະນີ (index) ໄປຫາຈຸດໃນ [member polygon]. "
"ຖ້າຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ, ແລະ ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈດ່ຽວທີ່ໄດ້ຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍຈຸດທັງໝົດໃນ [member "
"polygon] ຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ເກັບໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Path to a [Skeleton2D] node used for skeleton-based deformations of this "
"polygon. If empty or invalid, skeletal deformations will not be used."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂນດ [Skeleton2D] ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການບິດເບືອນຮູບຮ່າງຕາມໂຄງກະດູກຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈນີ. "
"ຖ້າຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ຫຼື ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ການບິດເບືອນຕາມໂຄງກະດູກຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້."

msgid "The polygon's fill texture. Use [member uv] to set texture coordinates."
msgstr "ແທັກເຈີພື້ນຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ. ໃຊ້ [member uv] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງພິກັດແທັກເຈີ."

msgid ""
"Amount to offset the polygon's [member texture]. If set to [code]Vector2(0, 0)"
"[/code], the texture's origin (its top-left corner) will be placed at the "
"polygon's position."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ຂອງ [member texture] ຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]Vector2(0, 0)"
"[/code], ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງແທັກເຈີ (ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງ) ຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ."

msgid "The texture's rotation in radians."
msgstr "ການໝູນຂອງແທັກເຈີເປັນເຣດຽນ (radians)."

msgid ""
"Amount to multiply the [member uv] coordinates when using [member texture]. "
"Larger values make the texture smaller, and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ຄູນພິກັດ [member uv] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [member texture]. ຄ່າທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແທັກເຈີນ້ອຍລົງ, ແລະ "
"ໃນທາງກັບກັນ."

msgid ""
"Texture coordinates for each vertex of the polygon. There should be one UV "
"value per polygon vertex. If there are fewer, undefined vertices will use "
"[code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ພິກັດແທັກເຈີສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຈຸດຈອມຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ. ຄວນມີໜຶ່ງຄ່າ UV ຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງຈຸດຈອມ. ຖ້າມີໜ້ອຍກວ່າ, "
"ຈຸດຈອມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຈະໃຊ້ [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code]."

msgid ""
"Color for each vertex. Colors are interpolated between vertices, resulting in "
"smooth gradients. There should be one per polygon vertex. If there are fewer, "
"undefined vertices will use [member color]."
msgstr ""
"ສີສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຈຸດຈອມ. ສີຈະຖືກສະເລ່ຍ (interpolate) ລະຫວ່າງຈຸດຈອມ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການໄລ່ລະດັບສີທີ່ນຽນ. "
"ຄວນມີໜຶ່ງສີຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງຈຸດຈອມ. ຖ້າມີໜ້ອຍກວ່າ, ຈຸດຈອມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຈະໃຊ້ [member color]."

msgid ""
"Flat 2D polygon shape for use with occlusion culling in [OccluderInstance3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຮ່າງຫຼາຍແຈ 2 ມິຕິແບບແປນ ສຳລັບໃຊ້ກັບການຄັດອອກແບບບັງແສງ (occlusion culling) ໃນ "
"[OccluderInstance3D]."

msgid ""
"[PolygonOccluder3D] stores a polygon shape that can be used by the engine's "
"occlusion culling system. When an [OccluderInstance3D] with a "
"[PolygonOccluder3D] is selected in the editor, an editor will appear at the "
"top of the 3D viewport so you can add/remove points. All points must be "
"placed on the same 2D plane, which means it is not possible to create "
"arbitrary 3D shapes with a single [PolygonOccluder3D]. To use arbitrary 3D "
"shapes as occluders, use [ArrayOccluder3D] or [OccluderInstance3D]'s baking "
"feature instead.\n"
"See [OccluderInstance3D]'s documentation for instructions on setting up "
"occlusion culling."
msgstr ""
"[PolygonOccluder3D] ເກັບຮັກສາຮູບຮ່າງຫຼາຍແຈທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໂດຍລະບົບການຄັດອອກແບບບັງແສງ "
"(occlusion culling) ຂອງເຄື່ອງຈັກ. ເມື່ອ [OccluderInstance3D] ທີ່ມີ "
"[PolygonOccluder3D] ຖືກເລືອກໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, ແຖບເຄື່ອງມືຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງ 3D viewport "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມ/ລຶບຈຸດໄດ້. ທຸກໆຈຸດຕ້ອງຖືກວາງຢູ່ໃນລະນາບ 2 ມິຕິດຽວກັນ, "
"ຊຶ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງຮູບຮ່າງ 3 ມິຕິແບບຕາມໃຈໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [PolygonOccluder3D] ດຽວ. "
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຮູບຮ່າງ 3 ມິຕິໃດໜຶ່ງເປັນຕົວບັງແສງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [ArrayOccluder3D] ຫຼື ຟີເຈີການອົບ (baking) ຂອງ "
"[OccluderInstance3D] ແທນ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ [OccluderInstance3D] ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ occlusion culling."

msgid ""
"The polygon to use for occlusion culling. The polygon can be convex or "
"concave, but it should have as few points as possible to maximize "
"performance.\n"
"The polygon must [i]not[/i] have intersecting lines. Otherwise, triangulation "
"will fail (with an error message printed)."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຄັດອອກແບບບັງແສງ. ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈສາມາດເປັນແບບນູນ (convex) ຫຼື ແບບວຸ້ມ "
"(concave), ແຕ່ຄວນມີຈຸດໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້ເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບສູງສຸດ.\n"
"ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຕ້ອງ [i]ບໍ່[/i] ມີເສັ້ນທີ່ຕັດກັນ. ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການສ້າງຮູບສາມແຈ (triangulation) ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ "
"(ພ້ອມກັບມີຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດປະກົດຂຶ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param point] falls inside the polygon area.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var polygon_path_finder = PolygonPathFinder.new()\n"
"var points = [Vector2(0.0, 0.0), Vector2(1.0, 0.0), Vector2(0.0, 1.0)]\n"
"var connections = [0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 0]\n"
"polygon_path_finder.setup(points, connections)\n"
"print(polygon_path_finder.is_point_inside(Vector2(0.2, 0.2))) # Prints true\n"
"print(polygon_path_finder.is_point_inside(Vector2(1.0, 1.0))) # Prints false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var polygonPathFinder = new PolygonPathFinder();\n"
"Vector2[] points =\n"
"[\n"
"\tnew Vector2(0.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector2(1.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector2(0.0f, 1.0f)\n"
"];\n"
"int[] connections = [0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 0];\n"
"polygonPathFinder.Setup(points, connections);\n"
"GD.Print(polygonPathFinder.IsPointInside(new Vector2(0.2f, 0.2f))); // Prints "
"True\n"
"GD.Print(polygonPathFinder.IsPointInside(new Vector2(1.0f, 1.0f))); // Prints "
"False\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param point] ຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var polygon_path_finder = PolygonPathFinder.new()\n"
"var points = [Vector2(0.0, 0.0), Vector2(1.0, 0.0), Vector2(0.0, 1.0)]\n"
"var connections = [0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 0]\n"
"polygon_path_finder.setup(points, connections)\n"
"print(polygon_path_finder.is_point_inside(Vector2(0.2, 0.2))) # ສະແດງ true\n"
"print(polygon_path_finder.is_point_inside(Vector2(1.0, 1.0))) # ສະແດງ false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var polygonPathFinder = new PolygonPathFinder();\n"
"Vector2[] points =\n"
"[\n"
"\tnew Vector2(0.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector2(1.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector2(0.0f, 1.0f)\n"
"];\n"
"int[] connections = [0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 0];\n"
"polygonPathFinder.Setup(points, connections);\n"
"GD.Print(polygonPathFinder.IsPointInside(new Vector2(0.2f, 0.2f))); // ສະແດງ "
"True\n"
"GD.Print(polygonPathFinder.IsPointInside(new Vector2(1.0f, 1.0f))); // ສະແດງ "
"False\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Sets up [PolygonPathFinder] with an array of points that define the vertices "
"of the polygon, and an array of indices that determine the edges of the "
"polygon.\n"
"The length of [param connections] must be even, returns an error if odd.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var polygon_path_finder = PolygonPathFinder.new()\n"
"var points = [Vector2(0.0, 0.0), Vector2(1.0, 0.0), Vector2(0.0, 1.0)]\n"
"var connections = [0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 0]\n"
"polygon_path_finder.setup(points, connections)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var polygonPathFinder = new PolygonPathFinder();\n"
"Vector2[] points =\n"
"[\n"
"\tnew Vector2(0.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector2(1.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector2(0.0f, 1.0f)\n"
"];\n"
"int[] connections = [0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 0];\n"
"polygonPathFinder.Setup(points, connections);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [PolygonPathFinder] ດ້ວຍອາເຣ (array) ຂອງຈຸດທີ່ກຳນົດຈຸດຈອມຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ, ແລະ "
"ອາເຣຂອງດັດສະນີທີ່ກຳນົດຂອບຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ.\n"
"ຄວາມຍາວຂອງ [param connections] ຕ້ອງເປັນເລກຄູ່, ຖ້າເປັນເລກຄີກຈະຄືນຄ່າຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var polygon_path_finder = PolygonPathFinder.new()\n"
"var points = [Vector2(0.0, 0.0), Vector2(1.0, 0.0), Vector2(0.0, 1.0)]\n"
"var connections = [0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 0]\n"
"polygon_path_finder.setup(points, connections)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var polygonPathFinder = new PolygonPathFinder();\n"
"Vector2[] points =\n"
"[\n"
"\tnew Vector2(0.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector2(1.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector2(0.0f, 1.0f)\n"
"];\n"
"int[] connections = [0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 0];\n"
"polygonPathFinder.Setup(points, connections);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Base class for contextual windows and panels with fixed position."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງບໍລິບົດ (contextual windows) ແລະ ແຜງທີ່ກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງຕາຍຕົວ."

msgid ""
"[Popup] is a base class for contextual windows and panels with fixed "
"position. It's a modal by default (see [member Window.popup_window]) and "
"provides methods for implementing custom popup behavior.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Popup] is invisible by default. To make it visible, call one of "
"the [code]popup_*[/code] methods from [Window] on the node, such as [method "
"Window.popup_centered_clamped]."
msgstr ""
"[Popup] ແມ່ນຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງບໍລິບົດ ແລະ ແຜງທີ່ກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງຕາຍຕົວ. "
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນມັນຈະເປັນແບບໂມດໍ (modal) (ເບິ່ງ [member Window.popup_window]) ແລະ "
"ມີເມທອດສຳລັບການສ້າງພຶດຕິກຳປັອບອັບແບບກຳນົດເອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [Popup] ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດ "
"[code]popup_*[/code] ອັນໃດໜຶ່ງຈາກ [Window] ໃນໂນດ, ເຊັ່ນ [method "
"Window.popup_centered_clamped]."

msgid "Emitted when the popup is hidden."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອປັອບອັບຖືກເຊື່ອງ."

msgid "A modal window used to display a list of options."
msgstr "ໜ້າຕ່າງແບບໂມດໍທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍການຕົວເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"[PopupMenu] is a modal window used to display a list of options. Useful for "
"toolbars and context menus.\n"
"The size of a [PopupMenu] can be limited by using [member Window.max_size]. "
"If the height of the list of items is larger than the maximum height of the "
"[PopupMenu], a [ScrollContainer] within the popup will allow the user to "
"scroll the contents. If no maximum size is set, or if it is set to [code]0[/"
"code], the [PopupMenu] height will be limited by its parent rect.\n"
"All [code]set_*[/code] methods allow negative item indices, i.e. [code]-1[/"
"code] to access the last item, [code]-2[/code] to select the second-to-last "
"item, and so on.\n"
"[b]Incremental search:[/b] Like [ItemList] and [Tree], [PopupMenu] supports "
"searching within the list while the control is focused. Press a key that "
"matches the first letter of an item's name to select the first item starting "
"with the given letter. After that point, there are two ways to perform "
"incremental search: 1) Press the same key again before the timeout duration "
"to select the next item starting with the same letter. 2) Press letter keys "
"that match the rest of the word before the timeout duration to match to "
"select the item in question directly. Both of these actions will be reset to "
"the beginning of the list if the timeout duration has passed since the last "
"keystroke was registered. You can adjust the timeout duration by changing "
"[member ProjectSettings.gui/timers/incremental_search_max_interval_msec].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [PopupMenu] is invisible by default. To make it visible, call "
"one of the [code]popup_*[/code] methods from [Window] on the node, such as "
"[method Window.popup_centered_clamped].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The ID values used for items are limited to 32 bits, not full 64 "
"bits of [int]. This has a range of [code]-2^32[/code] to [code]2^32 - 1[/"
"code], i.e. [code]-2147483648[/code] to [code]2147483647[/code]."
msgstr ""
"[PopupMenu] ແມ່ນໜ້າຕ່າງແບບໂມດໍທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍການຕົວເລືອກ. ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບແຖບເຄື່ອງມື ແລະ "
"ເມນູບໍລິບົດ (context menus).\n"
"ຂະໜາດຂອງ [PopupMenu] ສາມາດຈຳກັດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member Window.max_size]. "
"ຖ້າຄວາມສູງຂອງລາຍການລື່ນຄວາມສູງສູງສຸດຂອງ [PopupMenu], [ScrollContainer] "
"ພາຍໃນປັອບອັບຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເລື່ອນເບິ່ງເນື້ອຫາໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຂະໜາດສູງສຸດ ຫຼື ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/"
"code], ຄວາມສູງຂອງ [PopupMenu] ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍຂອບເຂດຂອງໂນດແມ່ (parent rect).\n"
"ທຸກໆເມທອດ [code]set_*[/code] ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ດັດສະນີລາຍການແບບຕິດລົບໄດ້, ເຊັ່ນ [code]-1[/"
"code] ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງລາຍການສຸດທ້າຍ, [code]-2[/code] ເພື່ອເລືອກລາຍການຮອງສຸດທ້າຍ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"[b]ການຄົ້ນຫາແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ (Incremental search):[/b] ຄືກັນກັບ [ItemList] ແລະ [Tree], "
"[PopupMenu] ຮອງຮັບການຄົ້ນຫາພາຍໃນລາຍການໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄອນໂທຣລ (control) ຖືກໂຟກັສຢູ່. "
"ກົດປຸ່ມທີ່ກົງກັບຕົວອັກສອນທຳອິດຂອງຊື່ລາຍການເພື່ອເລືອກລາຍການທຳອິດທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນນັ້ນ. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, "
"ມີສອງວິທີໃນການຄົ້ນຫາຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ: 1) "
"ກົດປຸ່ມເດີມອີກຄັ້ງກ່ອນໝົດເວລາເພື່ອເລືອກລາຍການຖັດໄປທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນດຽວກັນ. 2) "
"ກົດປຸ່ມຕົວອັກສອນອື່ນໆທີ່ກົງກັບສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງຄຳສັບກ່ອນໝົດເວລາເພື່ອເລືອກລາຍການນັ້ນໂດຍກົງ. "
"ທັງສອງການກະທຳນີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ໄປທີ່ຕອນຕົ້ນຂອງລາຍການຖ້າເວລາໝົດກຳນົດນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ການກົດປຸ່ມຫຼ້າສຸດ. "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບເວລາໝົດກຳນົດໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ [member ProjectSettings.gui/timers/"
"incremental_search_max_interval_msec].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [PopupMenu] ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ, "
"ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດ [code]popup_*[/code] ອັນໃດໜຶ່ງຈາກ [Window] ໃນໂນດ, ເຊັ່ນ [method "
"Window.popup_centered_clamped].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າ ID ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບລາຍການຕ່າງໆແມ່ນຈຳກັດຢູ່ທີ່ 32 bits, ບໍ່ແມ່ນ 64 bits ເຕັມຂອງ "
"[int]. ນີ້ມີຊ່ວງແຕ່ [code]-2^32[/code] ຫາ [code]2^32 - 1[/code], ຫຼື "
"[code]-2147483648[/code] ຫາ [code]2147483647[/code]."

msgid ""
"Checks the provided [param event] against the [PopupMenu]'s shortcuts and "
"accelerators, and activates the first item with matching events. If [param "
"for_global_only] is [code]true[/code], only shortcuts and accelerators with "
"[code]global[/code] set to [code]true[/code] will be called.\n"
"Returns [code]true[/code] if an item was successfully activated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Certain [Control]s, such as [MenuButton], will call this method "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບ [param event] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາກັບທາງລັດ (shortcuts) ແລະ ຕົວເລັ່ງ (accelerators) ຂອງ "
"[PopupMenu], ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ລາຍການທຳອິດທີ່ມີເຫດການກົງກັນ. ຖ້າ [param for_global_only] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code], ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສະເພາະທາງລັດ ແລະ ຕົວເລັ່ງທີ່ຕັ້ງ [code]global[/code] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລາຍການຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [Control] ບາງຢ່າງ, ເຊັ່ນ [MenuButton], ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Adds a new checkable item with text [param label].\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided, as well as an accelerator ([param "
"accel]). If no [param id] is provided, one will be created from the index. If "
"no [param accel] is provided, then the default value of 0 (corresponding to "
"[constant @GlobalScope.KEY_NONE]) will be assigned to the item (which means "
"it won't have any accelerator). See [method get_item_accelerator] for more "
"info on accelerators.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Checkable items just display a checkmark, but don't have any "
"built-in checking behavior and must be checked/unchecked manually. See "
"[method set_item_checked] for more info on how to control it."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການໃໝ່ທີ່ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ (checkable) ພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ [param label].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param id] ໄດ້, ລວມທັງຕົວເລັ່ງ (accelerator) ([param accel]). ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ "
"[param id], ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຈາກດັດສະນີ (index). ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param accel], ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະເປັນ 0 "
"(ກົງກັບ [constant @GlobalScope.KEY_NONE]) ຊຶ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຕົວເລັ່ງ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_item_accelerator] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຕົວເລັ່ງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ສະແດງເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີພຶດຕິກຳການເລືອກມາໃຫ້ໃນຕົວ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ເລືອກ/ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_item_checked] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີຄວບຄຸມມັນ."

msgid ""
"Adds a new checkable item and assigns the specified [Shortcut] to it. Sets "
"the label of the checkbox to the [Shortcut]'s name.\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided. If no [param id] is provided, one "
"will be created from the index.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Checkable items just display a checkmark, but don't have any "
"built-in checking behavior and must be checked/unchecked manually. See "
"[method set_item_checked] for more info on how to control it."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການໃໝ່ທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ ແລະ ກຳນົດ [Shortcut] ທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ກັບມັນ. ຕັ້ງປ້າຍຊື່ຂອງຊ່ອງເລືອກໃຫ້ເປັນຊື່ຂອງ "
"[Shortcut].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param id] ໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param id], ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຈາກດັດສະນີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ສະແດງເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີພຶດຕິກຳການເລືອກມາໃຫ້ໃນຕົວ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ເລືອກ/ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_item_checked] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີຄວບຄຸມມັນ."

msgid ""
"Adds a new checkable item with text [param label] and icon [param texture].\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided, as well as an accelerator ([param "
"accel]). If no [param id] is provided, one will be created from the index. If "
"no [param accel] is provided, then the default value of 0 (corresponding to "
"[constant @GlobalScope.KEY_NONE]) will be assigned to the item (which means "
"it won't have any accelerator). See [method get_item_accelerator] for more "
"info on accelerators.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Checkable items just display a checkmark, but don't have any "
"built-in checking behavior and must be checked/unchecked manually. See "
"[method set_item_checked] for more info on how to control it."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການໃໝ່ທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ [param label] ແລະ ໄອຄອນ [param texture].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param id] ໄດ້, ລວມທັງຕົວເລັ່ງ ([param accel]). ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param id], "
"ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຈາກດັດສະນີ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param accel], ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະເປັນ 0 ຊຶ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຕົວເລັ່ງ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_item_accelerator] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ສະແດງເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີພຶດຕິກຳການເລືອກມາໃຫ້ໃນຕົວ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ເລືອກ/ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_item_checked] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Adds a new checkable item and assigns the specified [Shortcut] and icon "
"[param texture] to it. Sets the label of the checkbox to the [Shortcut]'s "
"name.\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided. If no [param id] is provided, one "
"will be created from the index.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Checkable items just display a checkmark, but don't have any "
"built-in checking behavior and must be checked/unchecked manually. See "
"[method set_item_checked] for more info on how to control it."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການໃໝ່ທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ ແລະ ກຳນົດ [Shortcut] ພ້ອມກັບໄອຄອນ [param texture] ທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ກັບມັນ. "
"ຕັ້ງປ້າຍຊື່ຂອງຊ່ອງເລືອກໃຫ້ເປັນຊື່ຂອງ [Shortcut].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param id] ໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param id], ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຈາກດັດສະນີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ສະແດງເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີພຶດຕິກຳການເລືອກມາໃຫ້ໃນຕົວ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ເລືອກ/ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_item_checked] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Adds a new item with text [param label] and icon [param texture].\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided, as well as an accelerator ([param "
"accel]). If no [param id] is provided, one will be created from the index. If "
"no [param accel] is provided, then the default value of 0 (corresponding to "
"[constant @GlobalScope.KEY_NONE]) will be assigned to the item (which means "
"it won't have any accelerator). See [method get_item_accelerator] for more "
"info on accelerators."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການໃໝ່ພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ [param label] ແລະ ໄອຄອນ [param texture].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param id] ໄດ້, ລວມທັງຕົວເລັ່ງ ([param accel]). ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param id], "
"ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຈາກດັດສະນີ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param accel], ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະເປັນ 0 ຊຶ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຕົວເລັ່ງ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_item_accelerator] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "Same as [method add_icon_check_item], but uses a radio check button."
msgstr ""
"ຄືກັນກັບ [method add_icon_check_item], ແຕ່ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມເລືອກແບບວິທະຍຸ (radio check button)."

msgid "Same as [method add_icon_check_shortcut], but uses a radio check button."
msgstr "ຄືກັນກັບ [method add_icon_check_shortcut], ແຕ່ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມເລືອກແບບວິທະຍຸ."

msgid ""
"Adds a new item and assigns the specified [Shortcut] and icon [param texture] "
"to it. Sets the label of the checkbox to the [Shortcut]'s name.\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided. If no [param id] is provided, one "
"will be created from the index.\n"
"If [param allow_echo] is [code]true[/code], the shortcut can be activated "
"with echo events."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການໃໝ່ ແລະ ກຳນົດ [Shortcut] ພ້ອມກັບໄອຄອນ [param texture] ທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ກັບມັນ. "
"ຕັ້ງປ້າຍຊື່ຂອງຊ່ອງເລືອກໃຫ້ເປັນຊື່ຂອງ [Shortcut].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param id] ໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param id], ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຈາກດັດສະນີ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param allow_echo] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ທາງລັດຈະສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ດ້ວຍເຫດການສຽງສະທ້ອນ (echo events)."

msgid ""
"Adds a new item with text [param label].\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided, as well as an accelerator ([param "
"accel]). If no [param id] is provided, one will be created from the index. If "
"no [param accel] is provided, then the default value of 0 (corresponding to "
"[constant @GlobalScope.KEY_NONE]) will be assigned to the item (which means "
"it won't have any accelerator). See [method get_item_accelerator] for more "
"info on accelerators.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The provided [param id] is used only in [signal id_pressed] and "
"[signal id_focused] signals. It's not related to the [code]index[/code] "
"arguments in e.g. [method set_item_checked]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການໃໝ່ພ້ອມຂໍ້ຄວາມ [param label].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param id] ແລະ ຕົວເລັ່ງ ([param accel]) ໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param id], "
"ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຈາກດັດສະນີ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param accel], ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະເປັນ 0. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_item_accelerator] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param id] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນສັນຍານ [signal id_pressed] ແລະ "
"[signal id_focused]. ມັນບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບອາຄິວເມນ (argument) [code]index[/code] "
"ໃນເມທອດຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ [method set_item_checked]."

msgid ""
"Adds a new multistate item with text [param label].\n"
"Contrarily to normal binary items, multistate items can have more than two "
"states, as defined by [param max_states]. The default value is defined by "
"[param default_state].\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided, as well as an accelerator ([param "
"accel]). If no [param id] is provided, one will be created from the index. If "
"no [param accel] is provided, then the default value of 0 (corresponding to "
"[constant @GlobalScope.KEY_NONE]) will be assigned to the item (which means "
"it won't have any accelerator). See [method get_item_accelerator] for more "
"info on accelerators.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tadd_multistate_item(\"Item\", 3, 0)\n"
"\n"
"\tindex_pressed.connect(func(index: int):\n"
"\t\t\ttoggle_item_multistate(index)\n"
"\t\t\tmatch get_item_multistate(index):\n"
"\t\t\t\t0:\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tprint(\"First state\")\n"
"\t\t\t\t1:\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tprint(\"Second state\")\n"
"\t\t\t\t2:\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tprint(\"Third state\")\n"
"\t\t)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Multistate items don't update their state automatically and must "
"be done manually. See [method toggle_item_multistate], [method "
"set_item_multistate] and [method get_item_multistate] for more info on how to "
"control it."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການແບບຫຼາຍສະຖານະ (multistate) ໃໝ່ພ້ອມຂໍ້ຄວາມ [param label].\n"
"ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກລາຍການແບບບາຍນາຣີ (binary) ປົກກະຕິ, "
"ລາຍການຫຼາຍສະຖານະສາມາດມີໄດ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າສອງສະຖານະ, ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param max_states]. "
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [param default_state].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param id] ແລະ ຕົວເລັ່ງ ([param accel]) ໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param id], "
"ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຈາກດັດສະນີ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param accel], ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະເປັນ 0. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_item_accelerator] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tadd_multistate_item(\"Item\", 3, 0)\n"
"\n"
"\tindex_pressed.connect(func(index: int):\n"
"\t\t\ttoggle_item_multistate(index)\n"
"\t\t\tmatch get_item_multistate(index):\n"
"\t\t\t\t0:\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tprint(\"First state\")\n"
"\t\t\t\t1:\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tprint(\"Second state\")\n"
"\t\t\t\t2:\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tprint(\"Third state\")\n"
"\t\t)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລາຍການຫຼາຍສະຖານະຈະບໍ່ອັບເດດສະຖານະຂອງມັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ "
"ຕ້ອງໄດ້ເຮັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ເບິ່ງ [method toggle_item_multistate], [method "
"set_item_multistate] ແລະ [method get_item_multistate] "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີຄວບຄຸມມັນ."

msgid ""
"Adds a new radio check button with text [param label].\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided, as well as an accelerator ([param "
"accel]). If no [param id] is provided, one will be created from the index. If "
"no [param accel] is provided, then the default value of 0 (corresponding to "
"[constant @GlobalScope.KEY_NONE]) will be assigned to the item (which means "
"it won't have any accelerator). See [method get_item_accelerator] for more "
"info on accelerators.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Checkable items just display a checkmark, but don't have any "
"built-in checking behavior and must be checked/unchecked manually. See "
"[method set_item_checked] for more info on how to control it."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມປຸ່ມເລືອກແບບວິທະຍຸ (radio check button) ໃໝ່ພ້ອມຂໍ້ຄວາມ [param label].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param id] ແລະ ຕົວເລັ່ງ ([param accel]) ໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param id], "
"ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຈາກດັດສະນີ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param accel], ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະເປັນ 0. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_item_accelerator] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ສະແດງເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີພຶດຕິກຳການເລືອກມາໃຫ້ໃນຕົວ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ເລືອກ/ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_item_checked] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Adds a new radio check button and assigns a [Shortcut] to it. Sets the label "
"of the checkbox to the [Shortcut]'s name.\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided. If no [param id] is provided, one "
"will be created from the index.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Checkable items just display a checkmark, but don't have any "
"built-in checking behavior and must be checked/unchecked manually. See "
"[method set_item_checked] for more info on how to control it."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມປຸ່ມເລືອກແບບວິທະຍຸໃໝ່ ແລະ ກຳນົດ [Shortcut] ໃຫ້ກັບມັນ. ຕັ້ງປ້າຍຊື່ຂອງຊ່ອງເລືອກໃຫ້ເປັນຊື່ຂອງ "
"[Shortcut].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param id] ໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param id], ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຈາກດັດສະນີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ສະແດງເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີພຶດຕິກຳການເລືອກມາໃຫ້ໃນຕົວ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ເລືອກ/ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_item_checked] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Adds a separator between items. Separators also occupy an index, which you "
"can set by using the [param id] parameter.\n"
"A [param label] can optionally be provided, which will appear at the center "
"of the separator."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເສັ້ນຂັ້ນລະຫວ່າງລາຍການ. ເສັ້ນຂັ້ນຍັງຄອບຄອງດັດສະນີ (index), ເຊິ່ງເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີ "
"[param id].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param label] ໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງຂອງເສັ້ນຂັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Adds a [Shortcut].\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided. If no [param id] is provided, one "
"will be created from the index.\n"
"If [param allow_echo] is [code]true[/code], the shortcut can be activated "
"with echo events."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ [Shortcut].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param id] ໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param id], ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຈາກດັດສະນີ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param allow_echo] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ທາງລັດຈະສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ດ້ວຍເຫດການສຽງສະທ້ອນ (echo events)."

msgid "Prefer using [method add_submenu_node_item] instead."
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method add_submenu_node_item] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Adds an item that will act as a submenu of the parent [PopupMenu] node when "
"clicked. The [param submenu] argument must be the name of an existing "
"[PopupMenu] that has been added as a child to this node. This submenu will be "
"shown when the item is clicked, hovered for long enough, or activated using "
"the [code]ui_select[/code] or [code]ui_right[/code] input actions.\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided. If no [param id] is provided, one "
"will be created from the index."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການທີ່ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນເມນູຍ່ອຍ (submenu) ຂອງໂນດ [PopupMenu] ຫຼັກເມື່ອຖືກຄລິກ. ອາຄິວເມນ "
"[param submenu] ຕ້ອງເປັນຊື່ຂອງ [PopupMenu] ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເຊິ່ງໄດ້ຖືກເພີ່ມເປັນໂນດລູກໃຫ້ກັບໂນດນີ. "
"ເມນູຍ່ອຍນີ້ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອລາຍການຖືກຄລິກ, ເມື່ອເອົາເມົ້າໄປວາງໄວ້ດົນພໍ, ຫຼື ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ການກະທຳ "
"[code]ui_select[/code] ຫຼື [code]ui_right[/code].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param id] ໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param id], ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຈາກດັດສະນີ."

msgid ""
"Adds an item that will act as a submenu of the parent [PopupMenu] node when "
"clicked. This submenu will be shown when the item is clicked, hovered for "
"long enough, or activated using the [code]ui_select[/code] or [code]ui_right[/"
"code] input actions.\n"
"[param submenu] must be either child of this [PopupMenu] or has no parent "
"node (in which case it will be automatically added as a child). If the [param "
"submenu] popup has another parent, this method will fail.\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided. If no [param id] is provided, one "
"will be created from the index."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການທີ່ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນເມນູຍ່ອຍຂອງໂນດ [PopupMenu] ຫຼັກເມື່ອຖືກຄລິກ. "
"ເມນູຍ່ອຍນີ້ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອລາຍການຖືກຄລິກ, ເມື່ອເອົາເມົ້າໄປວາງໄວ້ດົນພໍ, ຫຼື ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ການກະທຳ "
"[code]ui_select[/code] ຫຼື [code]ui_right[/code].\n"
"[param submenu] ຕ້ອງເປັນທັງໂນດລູກຂອງ [PopupMenu] ນີ້ ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີໂນດແມ່ (ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ "
"ມັນຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເປັນໂນດລູກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ). ຖ້າປັອບອັບ [param submenu] ມີໂນດແມ່ອື່ນຢູ່ແລ້ວ, "
"ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param id] ໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param id], ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຈາກດັດສະນີ."

msgid ""
"Removes all items from the [PopupMenu]. If [param free_submenus] is "
"[code]true[/code], the submenu nodes are automatically freed."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບລາຍການທັງໝົດອອກຈາກ [PopupMenu]. ຖ້າ [param free_submenus] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code], ໂນດເມນູຍ່ອຍຈະຖືກລຶບຖິ້ມ (free) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the currently focused item. Returns [code]-1[/code] if "
"no item is focused."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າດັດສະນີ (index) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກໂຟກັສໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ຄືນຄ່າ [code]-1[/code] "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີລາຍການໃດຖືກໂຟກັສ."

msgid ""
"Returns the accelerator of the item at the given [param index]. An "
"accelerator is a keyboard shortcut that can be pressed to trigger the menu "
"button even if it's not currently open. The return value is an integer which "
"is generally a combination of [enum KeyModifierMask]s and [enum Key]s using "
"bitwise OR such as [code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd]). "
"If no accelerator is defined for the specified [param index], [method "
"get_item_accelerator] returns [code]0[/code] (corresponding to [constant "
"@GlobalScope.KEY_NONE])."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຕົວເລັ່ງ (accelerator) ຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. "
"ຕົວເລັ່ງແມ່ນທາງລັດຄີບອດທີ່ສາມາດກົດເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ປຸ່ມເມນູໄດ້ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດຢູ່ກໍຕາມ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ຄືນມາແມ່ນຈຳນວນເຕັມ ເຊິ່ງໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວແມ່ນການລວມກັນຂອງ [enum KeyModifierMask] ແລະ "
"[enum Key] ໂດຍໃຊ້ bitwise OR ເຊັ່ນ [code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl "
"+ A[/kbd]). ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຕົວເລັ່ງກຳນົດໄວ້ສຳລັບ [param index] ທີ່ລະບຸ, [method "
"get_item_accelerator] ຈະຄືນຄ່າ [code]0[/code] (ກົງກັບ [constant "
"@GlobalScope.KEY_NONE])."

msgid "Returns the auto translate mode of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າໂໝດການແປພາສາອັດຕະໂນມັດ (auto translate mode) ຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] "
"ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Returns the icon of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າໄອຄອນຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the maximum allowed width of the icon for the item at the given "
"[param index]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຄວາມກວ້າງສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບໄອຄອນຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Returns a [Color] modulating the item's icon at the given [param index]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [Color] ທີ່ໃຊ້ປັບແຕ່ງສີ (modulating) ໄອຄອນຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Returns the ID of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ ID ຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Returns the horizontal offset of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າໄລຍະຫ່າງຕາມແນວນອນ (horizontal offset) ຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the item containing the specified [param id]. The index "
"is automatically assigned to each item by the engine when added and "
"represents the order items will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າດັດສະນີ (index) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ມີ [param id] ທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ດັດສະນີຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະລາຍການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍເຄື່ອງຈັກເມື່ອຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າ ແລະ "
"ສະແດງເຖິງລຳດັບທີ່ລາຍການຈະຖືກສະແດງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the metadata of the specified item, which might be of any type. You "
"can set it with [method set_item_metadata], which provides a simple way of "
"assigning context data to items."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າເມຕາດາຕ້າ (metadata) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ລະບຸ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເປັນປະເພດໃດກໍໄດ້. "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າມັນໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method set_item_metadata], "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນວິທີງ່າຍໆໃນການກຳນົດຂໍ້ມູນບໍລິບົດໃຫ້ກັບລາຍການ."

msgid "Returns the state of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າສະຖານະຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Returns the max states of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າສະຖານະສູງສຸດຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Shortcut] associated with the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [Shortcut] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Prefer using [method get_item_submenu_node] instead."
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method get_item_submenu_node] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the submenu name of the item at the given [param index]. See [method "
"add_submenu_item] for more info on how to add a submenu."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຊື່ເມນູຍ່ອຍຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. ເບິ່ງ [method add_submenu_item] "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການເພີ່ມເມນູຍ່ອຍ."

msgid ""
"Returns the submenu of the item at the given [param index], or [code]null[/"
"code] if no submenu was added. See [method add_submenu_node_item] for more "
"info on how to add a submenu."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າເມນູຍ່ອຍຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ, ຫຼື [code]null[/code] "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການເພີ່ມເມນູຍ່ອຍ. ເບິ່ງ [method add_submenu_node_item] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "Returns the text of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Returns the tooltip associated with the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຄຳແນະນຳ (tooltip) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at the given [param index] is checkable "
"in some way, i.e. if it has a checkbox or radio button.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Checkable items just display a checkmark or radio button, but "
"don't have any built-in checking behavior and must be checked/unchecked "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້, ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ຖ້າມັນມີຊ່ອງເລືອກ (checkbox) ຫຼື ປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸ (radio button).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ສະແດງເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກ ຫຼື ປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີພຶດຕິກຳການເລືອກໃນຕົວ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຈັດການດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at the given [param index] is checked."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຖືກເລືອກຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at the given [param index] is disabled. "
"When it is disabled it can't be selected, or its action invoked.\n"
"See [method set_item_disabled] for more info on how to disable an item."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ. "
"ເມື່ອຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ການກະທຳຂອງມັນໄດ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method set_item_disabled] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີປິດໃຊ້ງານລາຍການ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at the given [param index] has radio "
"button-style checkability.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is purely cosmetic; you must add the logic for checking/"
"unchecking items in radio groups."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາມີຮູບແບບການເລືອກແບບປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸ "
"(radio button).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ການສະແດງຜົນເທົ່ານັ້ນ; ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເພີ່ມໂລຈິກສຳລັບການເລືອກ/"
"ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກລາຍການໃນກຸ່ມວິທະຍຸດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item is a separator. If it is, it will be "
"displayed as a line. See [method add_separator] for more info on how to add a "
"separator."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລາຍການນັ້ນເປັນເສັ້ນຂັ້ນ (separator). ຖ້າແມ່ນ, "
"ມັນຈະຖືກສະແດງເປັນເສັ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [method add_separator] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified item's shortcut is disabled."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າທາງລັດຂອງລາຍການທີ່ລະບຸຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the system native menu is supported and "
"currently used by this [PopupMenu]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລະບົບຮອງຮັບເມນູພື້ນເມືອງ (native menu) ແລະ [PopupMenu] "
"ນີ້ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານມັນຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the menu is bound to the special system menu."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເມນູນີ້ຖືກເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບເມນູລະບົບພິເສດ."

msgid ""
"Removes the item at the given [param index] from the menu.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The indices of items after the removed item will be shifted by "
"one."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາອອກຈາກເມນູ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ດັດສະນີຂອງລາຍການຫຼັງຈາກລາຍການທີ່ຖືກລຶບອອກຈະຖືກຍັບຂຶ້ນໜຶ່ງຕຳແໜ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Moves the scroll view to make the item at the given [param index] visible."
msgstr ""
"ຍ້າຍມຸມມອງການເລືອກ (scroll view) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the currently focused item as the given [param index].\n"
"Passing [code]-1[/code] as the index makes so that no item is focused."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງໃຫ້ລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນລາຍການທີ່ຖືກໂຟກັສ.\n"
"ການສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]-1[/code] ເປັນດັດສະນີຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ມີລາຍການໃດຖືກໂຟກັສ."

msgid ""
"Sets the accelerator of the item at the given [param index]. An accelerator "
"is a keyboard shortcut that can be pressed to trigger the menu button even if "
"it's not currently open. [param accel] is generally a combination of [enum "
"KeyModifierMask]s and [enum Key]s using bitwise OR such as "
"[code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd])."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລັ່ງ (accelerator) ຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. "
"ຕົວເລັ່ງແມ່ນທາງລັດຄີບອດທີ່ສາມາດກົດເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ປຸ່ມເມນູໄດ້ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດຢູ່ກໍຕາມ. [param "
"accel] ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນການລວມກັນຂອງ [enum KeyModifierMask] ແລະ [enum Key] ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"bitwise OR ເຊັ່ນ [code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd])."

msgid ""
"Sets whether the item at the given [param index] has a checkbox. If "
"[code]false[/code], sets the type of the item to plain text.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Checkable items just display a checkmark, but don't have any "
"built-in checking behavior and must be checked/unchecked manually."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາມີຊ່ອງເລືອກ (checkbox) ຫຼື ບໍ່. ຖ້າເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code], ຈະຕັ້ງປະເພດຂອງລາຍການເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ສະແດງເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີພຶດຕິກຳການເລືອກໃນຕົວ "
"ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຈັດການດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the type of the item at the given [param index] to radio button. If "
"[code]false[/code], sets the type of the item to plain text."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງປະເພດຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ຈະຕັ້ງປະເພດຂອງລາຍການເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ."

msgid ""
"Mark the item at the given [param index] as a separator, which means that it "
"would be displayed as a line. If [code]false[/code], sets the type of the "
"item to plain text."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໃຫ້ລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນເສັ້ນຂັ້ນ (separator), "
"ຊຶ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນຈະຖືກສະແດງເປັນເສັ້ນ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ຈະຕັ້ງປະເພດຂອງລາຍການເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ."

msgid ""
"Sets the auto translate mode of the item at the given [param index].\n"
"Items use [constant Node.AUTO_TRANSLATE_MODE_INHERIT] by default, which uses "
"the same auto translate mode as the [PopupMenu] itself."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດການແປພາສາອັດຕະໂນມັດຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ.\n"
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລາຍການຕ່າງໆຈະໃຊ້ [constant Node.AUTO_TRANSLATE_MODE_INHERIT], "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະໃຊ້ໂໝດດຽວກັນກັບ [PopupMenu] ເອງ."

msgid "Sets the checkstate status of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຖານະການເລືອກ (checkstate) ຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Enables/disables the item at the given [param index]. When it is disabled, it "
"can't be selected and its action can't be invoked."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ/ປິດ ໃຊ້ງານລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. ເມື່ອຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ການກະທຳຂອງມັນໄດ້."

msgid "Replaces the [Texture2D] icon of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນໄອຄອນ [Texture2D] ຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Sets the maximum allowed width of the icon for the item at the given [param "
"index]. This limit is applied on top of the default size of the icon and on "
"top of [theme_item icon_max_width]. The height is adjusted according to the "
"icon's ratio."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມກວ້າງສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບໄອຄອນຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. "
"ຂີດຈຳກັດນີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມຈາກຂະໜາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໄອຄອນ ແລະ [theme_item icon_max_width]. "
"ຄວາມສູງຈະຖືກປັບຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງໄອຄອນ."

msgid "Sets a modulating [Color] of the item's icon at the given [param index]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີປັບແຕ່ງ (modulating [Color]) ຂອງໄອຄອນຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param id] of the item at the given [param index].\n"
"The [param id] is used in [signal id_pressed] and [signal id_focused] signals."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param id] ຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ.\n"
"[param id] ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນສັນຍານ [signal id_pressed] ແລະ [signal id_focused]."

msgid "Sets the horizontal offset of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະຫ່າງຕາມແນວນອນ (horizontal offset) ຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Changes the index of the item at index [param index] to be at index [param "
"target_index]. This can be used to move an item above other items. The moved "
"item will keep the same ID, even if it was generated from the original "
"index.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The indices of any items between index [param index] and index "
"[param target_index] will be shifted by one."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນດັດສະນີຂອງລາຍການຈາກ [param index] ໄປເປັນ [param target_index]. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຍ້າຍລາຍການຂຶ້ນໄປຢູ່ເທິງລາຍການອື່ນໆ. ລາຍການທີ່ຖືກຍ້າຍຈະຍັງຄົງຮັກສາ ID ເດີມໄວ້, "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນມາຈາກດັດສະນີເດີມກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ດັດສະນີຂອງລາຍການໃດໆທີ່ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [param index] ແລະ [param "
"target_index] ຈະຖືກຍັບໄປໜຶ່ງຕຳແໜ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the metadata of an item, which may be of any type. You can later get it "
"with [method get_item_metadata], which provides a simple way of assigning "
"context data to items."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເມຕາດາຕ້າ (metadata) ຂອງລາຍການ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເປັນປະເພດໃດກໍໄດ້. "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເອົາຄ່າມັນອອກມາພາຍຫຼັງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method get_item_metadata], "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນວິທີງ່າຍໆໃນການກຳນົດຂໍ້ມູນບໍລິບົດໃຫ້ກັບລາຍການ."

msgid ""
"Sets the state of a multistate item. See [method add_multistate_item] for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຖານະຂອງລາຍການແບບຫຼາຍສະຖານະ. ເບິ່ງ [method add_multistate_item] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the max states of a multistate item. See [method add_multistate_item] "
"for details."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຖານະສູງສຸດຂອງລາຍການແບບຫຼາຍສະຖານະ. ເບິ່ງ [method add_multistate_item] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid "Sets a [Shortcut] for the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Shortcut] ສຳລັບລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Disables the [Shortcut] of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ງານ [Shortcut] ຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Prefer using [method set_item_submenu_node] instead."
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method set_item_submenu_node] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the submenu of the item at the given [param index]. The submenu is the "
"name of a child [PopupMenu] node that would be shown when the item is clicked."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເມນູຍ່ອຍ (submenu) ຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. ເມນູຍ່ອຍແມ່ນຊື່ຂອງໂນດ "
"[PopupMenu] ລູກທີ່ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອລາຍການຖືກຄລິກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the submenu of the item at the given [param index]. The submenu is a "
"[PopupMenu] node that would be shown when the item is clicked. It must either "
"be a child of this [PopupMenu] or has no parent (in which case it will be "
"automatically added as a child). If the [param submenu] popup has another "
"parent, this method will fail."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເມນູຍ່ອຍຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. ເມນູຍ່ອຍແມ່ນໂນດ [PopupMenu] "
"ທີ່ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອລາຍການຖືກຄລິກ. ມັນຕ້ອງເປັນທັງໂນດລູກຂອງ [PopupMenu] ນີ້ ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີໂນດແມ່ "
"(ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ ມັນຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເປັນໂນດລູກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ). ຖ້າປັອບອັບ [param submenu] "
"ມີໂນດແມ່ອື່ນຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid "Sets the text of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Sets the [String] tooltip of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຂໍ້ຄວາມຄຳແນະນຳ (tooltip) ຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Toggles the check state of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "ສະຫຼັບສະຖານະການເລືອກ (check state) ຂອງລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Cycle to the next state of a multistate item. See [method "
"add_multistate_item] for details."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນໄປຫາສະຖານະຖັດໄປຂອງລາຍການຫຼາຍສະຖານະ. ເບິ່ງ [method add_multistate_item] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], allows navigating [PopupMenu] with letter keys."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລື່ອນເບິ່ງ [PopupMenu] ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], hides the [PopupMenu] when a checkbox or radio button "
"is selected."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເຊື່ອງ [PopupMenu] ເມື່ອມີການເລືອກຊ່ອງເລືອກ (checkbox) ຫຼື "
"ປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸ (radio button)."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], hides the [PopupMenu] when an item is selected."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເຊື່ອງ [PopupMenu] ເມື່ອມີການເລືອກລາຍການໃດໜຶ່ງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], hides the [PopupMenu] when a state item is selected."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເຊື່ອງ [PopupMenu] ເມື່ອມີການເລືອກລາຍການແບບສະຖານະ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the item at [code]index[/code] is checked.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລາຍການທີ່ [code]index[/code] ຈະຖືກໝາຍເລືອກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [code]index[/code] ແມ່ນຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [MenuBar] will use native menu when supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [PopupMenu] is linked to [StatusIndicator], [MenuBar], or "
"another [PopupMenu] item it can use native menu regardless of this property, "
"use [method is_native_menu] to check it."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [MenuBar] ຈະໃຊ້ເມນູພື້ນເມືອງ (native menu) ເມື່ອລະບົບຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [PopupMenu] ຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ [StatusIndicator], [MenuBar], ຫຼື "
"ລາຍການ [PopupMenu] ອື່ນໆ ມັນອາດຈະໃຊ້ເມນູພື້ນເມືອງໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"is_native_menu] ເພື່ອກວດສອບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows a search bar at the top of the [PopupMenu] for "
"filtering items. See [member search_bar_min_item_count] for dynamically "
"controlling its visibility based on the number of items.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When enabled, [member allow_search] is ignored."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງແຖບຄົ້ນຫາຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງ [PopupMenu] ເພື່ອຄັດຕອງລາຍການ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [member search_bar_min_item_count] ສຳລັບການຄວບຄຸມການສະແດງຜົນຕາມຈຳນວນລາຍການ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, [member allow_search] ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"Sets the minimum number of items required for the search bar to be visible. "
"[member search_bar_enabled] must be [code]true[/code] for this to have any "
"effect. Separator items are not counted."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຈຳນວນລາຍການຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຖບຄົ້ນຫາປະກົດຂຶ້ນ. [member search_bar_enabled] "
"ຕ້ອງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຜົນ. ລາຍການເສັ້ນຂັ້ນຈະບໍ່ຖືກນັບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shrinks [PopupMenu] to minimum height when it's shown."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຫຍໍ້ [PopupMenu] ໃຫ້ມີຄວາມສູງຕ່ຳສຸດເມື່ອມັນສະແດງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shrinks [PopupMenu] to minimum width when it's shown."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຫຍໍ້ [PopupMenu] ໃຫ້ມີຄວາມກວ້າງຕ່ຳສຸດເມື່ອມັນສະແດງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the delay time in seconds for the submenu item to popup on mouse "
"hovering. If the popup menu is added as a child of another (acting as a "
"submenu), it will inherit the delay time of the parent menu item.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the mouse is exiting a submenu item with an open submenu and "
"enters a different submenu item, the submenu popup delay time is affected by "
"the direction of the mouse movement toward the open submenu. If the mouse is "
"moving toward the submenu, the open submenu will wait approximately "
"[code]0.5[/code] seconds before closing, which then allows the hovered "
"submenu item to open. This additional delay allows the mouse time to move to "
"the open submenu across other menu items without prematurely closing. If the "
"mouse is not moving toward the open submenu, for example in a downward "
"direction, the open submenu will close immediately."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງເວລາໜ່ວງເປັນວິນາທີເພື່ອໃຫ້ລາຍການເມນູຍ່ອຍປະກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເອົາເມົ້າໄປວາງໄວ້ (hovering). "
"ຖ້າປັອບອັບເມນູຖືກເພີ່ມເປັນໂນດລູກຂອງອັນອື່ນ (ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນເມນູຍ່ອຍ), "
"ມັນຈະສືບທອດເວລາໜ່ວງຈາກລາຍການເມນູແມ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າເມົ້າກຳລັງອອກຈາກລາຍການເມນູຍ່ອຍທີ່ມີເມນູຍ່ອຍເປີດຢູ່ ແລະ "
"ເຂົ້າໄປຫາລາຍການເມນູຍ່ອຍອື່ນ, "
"ເວລາໜ່ວງຂອງປັອບອັບເມນູຍ່ອຍຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກທິດທາງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງເມົ້າໄປຫາເມນູຍ່ອຍທີ່ເປີດຢູ່. "
"ຖ້າເມົ້າເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປຫາເມນູຍ່ອຍ, ເມນູຍ່ອຍທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ນັ້ນຈະລໍຖ້າປະມານ [code]0.5[/code] ວິນາທີກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປິດ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ລາຍການເມນູຍ່ອຍທີ່ຖືກວາງເມົ້າຢູ່ນັ້ນເປີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້. "
"ເວລາໜ່ວງເພີ່ມເຕີມນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເມ້ົາມີເວລາເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂ້າມລາຍການເມນູອື່ນໆໄປຫາເມນູຍ່ອຍທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ໂດຍບໍ່ປິດມັນກ່ອນກຳນົດ. "
"ຖ້າເມົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປຫາເມນູຍ່ອຍທີ່ເປີດຢູ່, ເຊັ່ນວ່າເຄື່ອນທີ່ລົງລຸ່ມ, ເມນູຍ່ອຍທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ນັ້ນຈະປິດລົງທັນທີ."

msgid ""
"If set to one of the values of [enum NativeMenu.SystemMenus], this "
"[PopupMenu] is bound to the special system menu. Only one [PopupMenu] can be "
"bound to each special menu at a time."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງ [enum NativeMenu.SystemMenus], [PopupMenu] "
"ນີ້ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບເມນູລະບົບພິເສດ. ສາມາດເຊື່ອມໂຍງ [PopupMenu] "
"ໄດ້ພຽງອັນດຽວກັບແຕ່ລະເມນູພິເສດໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the user navigated to an item of some [param id] using the "
"[member ProjectSettings.input/ui_up] or [member ProjectSettings.input/"
"ui_down] input action."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ເລື່ອນໄປຫາລາຍການທີ່ມີ [param id] ບາງຢ່າງໂດຍໃຊ້ການກະທຳ [member "
"ProjectSettings.input/ui_up] ຫຼື [member ProjectSettings.input/ui_down]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when an item of some [param id] is pressed. Also emitted when its "
"accelerator is activated on macOS.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [param id] is negative (either explicitly or due to "
"overflow), this will return the corresponding index instead."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອລາຍການທີ່ມີ [param id] ບາງຢ່າງຖືກກົດ. ຍັງສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຕົວເລັ່ງຂອງມັນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນ "
"macOS.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [param id] ຕິດລົບ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຕັ້ງເອງ ຫຼື ຍ້ອນຄ່າເກີນຂອບເຂດ), "
"ມັນຈະຄືນຄ່າດັດສະນີທີ່ກົງກັນແທນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when an item of some [param index] is pressed. Also emitted when its "
"accelerator is activated on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອລາຍການຕາມ [param index] ບາງຢ່າງຖືກກົດ. ຍັງສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຕົວເລັ່ງຂອງມັນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນ "
"macOS."

msgid "Emitted when any item is added, modified or removed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອມີລາຍການໃດໜຶ່ງຖືກເພີ່ມ, ແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ລຶບອອກ."

msgid ""
"The text [Color] used for shortcuts and accelerators that show next to the "
"menu item name when defined. See [method get_item_accelerator] for more info "
"on accelerators."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂໍ້ຄວາມ ([Color]) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບທາງລັດ ແລະ ຕົວເລັ່ງ "
"ທີ່ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ຖັດຈາກຊື່ລາຍການເມນູເມື່ອມີການກຳນົດໄວ້. ເບິ່ງ [method get_item_accelerator] "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "The default text [Color] for menu items' names."
msgstr "ສີຂໍ້ຄວາມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບຊື່ລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "[Color] used for disabled menu items' text."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງລາຍການເມນູທີ່ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "[Color] used for the hovered text."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມເມື່ອເອົາເມົ້າໄປວາງໄວ້ (hovered)."

msgid "[Color] used for labeled separators' text. See [method add_separator]."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງເສັ້ນຂັ້ນທີ່ມີປ້າຍຊື່. ເບິ່ງ [method add_separator]."

msgid "The tint of text outline of the labeled separator."
msgstr "ສີຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງເສັ້ນຂັ້ນທີ່ມີປ້າຍຊື່."

msgid ""
"If not [code]0[/code], the icon gutter will be merged with the checkbox "
"gutter when possible. This acts as a boolean."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ແມ່ນ [code]0[/code], ພື້ນທີ່ວາງໄອຄອນ (icon gutter) ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບພື້ນທີ່ຊ່ອງເລືອກ "
"(checkbox gutter) ເມື່ອເປັນໄປໄດ້. ນີ້ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ຄືກັບຄ່າບູລີນ (boolean)."

msgid "The horizontal space between the item's elements."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຕາມແນວນອນລະຫວ່າງອົງປະກອບຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid ""
"The maximum allowed width of the item's icon. This limit is applied on top of "
"the default size of the icon, but before the value set with [method "
"set_item_icon_max_width]. The height is adjusted according to the icon's "
"ratio."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມກວ້າງສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບໄອຄອນຂອງລາຍການ. "
"ຂີດຈຳກັດນີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມຈາກຂະໜາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໄອຄອນ, ແຕ່ກ່ອນຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງດ້ວຍ [method "
"set_item_icon_max_width]. ຄວາມສູງຈະຖືກປັບຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງໄອຄອນ."

msgid "Width of the single indentation level."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງລະດັບການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າດຽວ."

msgid "Horizontal padding to the right of the items (or left, in RTL layout)."
msgstr "ການເສີມຂອບຕາມແນວນອນທາງເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງລາຍການ (ຫຼື ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ, ໃນຮູບແບບ RTL)."

msgid "Horizontal padding to the left of the items (or right, in RTL layout)."
msgstr "ການເສີມຂອບຕາມແນວນອນທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງລາຍການ (ຫຼື ເບື້ອງຂວາ, ໃນຮູບແບບ RTL)."

msgid "The vertical space between search bar and menu items."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຕາມແນວຕັ້ງລະຫວ່າງແຖບຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "The size of the labeled separator text outline."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງເສັ້ນຂັ້ນທີ່ມີປ້າຍຊື່."

msgid "The vertical space between each menu item."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຕາມແນວຕັ້ງລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "[Font] used for the menu items."
msgstr "[Font] ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "[Font] used for the labeled separator."
msgstr "[Font] ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເສັ້ນຂັ້ນທີ່ມີປ້າຍຊື່."

msgid "Font size of the labeled separator."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຕົວອັກສອນຂອງເສັ້ນຂັ້ນທີ່ມີປ້າຍຊື່."

msgid "Font size of the menu items."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຕົວອັກສອນຂອງລາຍການເມນູ."

msgid "[Texture2D] icon for the checked checkbox items."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນ [Texture2D] ສຳລັບລາຍການຊ່ອງເລືອກທີ່ຖືກເລືອກຢູ່."

msgid "[Texture2D] icon for the checked checkbox items when they are disabled."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນ [Texture2D] ສຳລັບລາຍການຊ່ອງເລືອກທີ່ຖືກເລືອກຢູ່ເມື່ອພວກມັນຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "[Texture2D] icon for the checked radio button items."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນ [Texture2D] ສຳລັບລາຍການປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸທີ່ຖືກເລືອກຢູ່."

msgid ""
"[Texture2D] icon for the checked radio button items when they are disabled."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນ [Texture2D] ສຳລັບລາຍການປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸທີ່ຖືກເລືອກຢູ່ເມື່ອພວກມັນຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "[Texture2D] icon for the unchecked radio button items."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນ [Texture2D] ສຳລັບລາຍການປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"[Texture2D] icon for the unchecked radio button items when they are disabled."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນ [Texture2D] ສຳລັບລາຍການປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກເມື່ອພວກມັນຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "[Texture2D] icon for the search bar's search icon."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນ [Texture2D] ສຳລັບໄອຄອນຄົ້ນຫາໃນແຖບຄົ້ນຫາ."

msgid "[Texture2D] icon for the submenu arrow (for left-to-right layouts)."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນ [Texture2D] ສຳລັບລູກສອນເມນູຍ່ອຍ (ສຳລັບຮູບແບບຈາກຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ)."

msgid "[Texture2D] icon for the submenu arrow (for right-to-left layouts)."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນ [Texture2D] ສຳລັບລູກສອນເມນູຍ່ອຍ (ສຳລັບຮູບແບບຈາກຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ)."

msgid "[Texture2D] icon for the unchecked checkbox items."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນ [Texture2D] ສຳລັບລາຍການຊ່ອງເລືອກທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"[Texture2D] icon for the unchecked checkbox items when they are disabled."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນ [Texture2D] ສຳລັບລາຍການຊ່ອງເລືອກທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກເມື່ອພວກມັນຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "[StyleBox] displayed when the [PopupMenu] item is hovered."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ສະແດງເມື່ອລາຍການ [PopupMenu] ຖືກວາງເມົ້າໃສ່ (hovered)."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] for the left side of labeled separator. See [method add_separator]."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ສຳລັບເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງເສັ້ນຂັ້ນທີ່ມີປ້າຍຊື່. ເບິ່ງ [method add_separator]."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] for the right side of labeled separator. See [method "
"add_separator]."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ສຳລັບເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງເສັ້ນຂັ້ນທີ່ມີປ້າຍຊື່. ເບິ່ງ [method add_separator]."

msgid "[StyleBox] for the background panel."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ສຳລັບແຜງພື້ນຫຼັງ (background panel)."

msgid "[StyleBox] used for the separators. See [method add_separator]."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເສັ້ນຂັ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [method add_separator]."

msgid "A popup with a panel background."
msgstr "ປັອບອັບທີ່ມີແຜງພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"A popup with a configurable panel background. Any child controls added to "
"this node will be stretched to fit the panel's size (similar to how "
"[PanelContainer] works). If you are making windows, see [Window]."
msgstr ""
"ປັອບອັບທີ່ມີແຜງພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້. ຄອນໂທຣລ (controls) "
"ທີ່ເປັນໂນດລູກໃດໆກໍຕາມທີ່ເພີ່ມໃສ່ໂນດນີ້ຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບຂະໜາດຂອງແຜງ (ຄ້າຍຄືກັບວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ "
"[PanelContainer]). ຖ້າເຈົ້າກຳລັງສ້າງໜ້າຕ່າງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [Window]."

msgid ""
"Provides a compressed texture for disk and/or VRAM in a way that is portable."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ບໍລິການແທັກເຈີທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດສຳລັບດິສກ໌ (disk) ແລະ/ຫຼື VRAM ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ສາມາດພົກພາ (portable) ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"This class allows storing compressed textures as self contained (not "
"imported) resources.\n"
"For 2D usage (compressed on disk, uncompressed on VRAM), the lossy and "
"lossless modes are recommended. For 3D usage (compressed on VRAM) it depends "
"on the target platform.\n"
"If you intend to only use desktop, S3TC or BPTC are recommended. For only "
"mobile, ETC2 is recommended.\n"
"For portable, self contained 3D textures that work on both desktop and "
"mobile, Basis Universal is recommended (although it has a small quality cost "
"and longer compression time as a tradeoff).\n"
"This resource is intended to be created from code."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເກັບຮັກສາແທັກເຈີທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດເປັນຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນຕົວ (ບໍ່ແມ່ນການນຳເຂົ້າ).\n"
"ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານ 2 ມິຕິ (ບີບອັດໃນດິສກ໌, ບໍ່ບີບອັດໃນ VRAM), ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂໝດ lossy ແລະ lossless. "
"ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານ 3 ມິຕິ (ບີບອັດໃນ VRAM) ມັນຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບແພລດຟອມເປົ້າໝາຍ.\n"
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕັ້ງໃຈຈະໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນຄອມພິວເຕີຕັ້ງໂຕະ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ S3TC ຫຼື BPTC. ສຳລັບມືຖືຢ່າງດຽວ, "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ETC2.\n"
"ສຳລັບແທັກເຈີ 3 ມິຕິທີ່ສາມາດພົກພາໄດ້ ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ທັງໃນຄອມພິວເຕີຕັ້ງໂຕະ ແລະ ມືຖື, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"Basis Universal (ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະມີການສູນເສຍຄຸນນະພາບເລັກໜ້ອຍ ແລະ ໃຊ້ເວລາບີບອັດດົນກວ່າ).\n"
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ນິຍົມສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກການຂຽນໂຄດ."

msgid ""
"Initializes the compressed texture from a base image. The compression mode "
"must be provided.\n"
"[param normal_map] is recommended to ensure optimum quality if this image "
"will be used as a normal map.\n"
"If lossy compression is requested, the quality setting can optionally be "
"provided. This maps to Lossy WebP compression quality."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແທັກເຈີທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດຈາກຮູບພາບພື້ນຖານ. ຕ້ອງກຳນົດໂໝດການບີບອັດ.\n"
"[param normal_map] ແມ່ນແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນຄຸນນະພາບສູງສຸດຖ້າຮູບພາບນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ normal "
"map.\n"
"ຖ້າຕ້ອງການການບີບອັດແບບ lossy, ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດຄຸນນະພາບໄດ້. ນີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບຄຸນນະພາບການບີບອັດ "
"Lossy WebP."

msgid "Return the compression mode used (valid after initialized)."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າໂໝດການບີບອັດທີ່ໃຊ້ (ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the flag is overridden for all textures of this "
"type."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າແຟລັກ (flag) ຖືກຂຽນທັບ (overridden) ສຳລັບທຸກແທັກເຈີປະເພດນີ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the compressor parameters for Basis Universal compression. See also the "
"settings in [ResourceImporterTexture].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method must be called before [method create_from_image] for "
"this to work."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີການບີບອັດສຳລັບ Basis Universal. ເບິ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ "
"[ResourceImporterTexture] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກເອີ້ນກ່ອນ [method create_from_image] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"If [param keep] is [code]true[/code], overrides the flag globally for all "
"textures of this type. This is used primarily by the editor."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param keep] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຂຽນທັບແຟລັກທົ່ວໂລກສຳລັບທຸກແທັກເຈີປະເພດນີ້. "
"ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when running in the editor, this texture will keep the "
"source-compressed data in memory, allowing the data to persist after loading. "
"Otherwise, the source-compressed data is lost after loading and the texture "
"can't be re-saved.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property must be set before [method create_from_image] for "
"this to work."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເມື່ອແລ່ນຢູ່ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, "
"ແທັກເຈີນີຈະເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດຈາກແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດໄວ້ໃນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນຍັງຄົງຢູ່ຫຼັງຈາກໂຫຼດແລ້ວ. "
"ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດຈະຫາຍໄປຫຼັງຈາກໂຫຼດ ແລະ ແທັກເຈີຈະບໍ່ສາມາດບັນທຶກຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງກ່ອນ [method create_from_image] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid "Allows overriding the texture's size (for 2D only)."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຂຽນທັບຂະໜາດຂອງແທັກເຈີ (ສຳລັບ 2 ມິຕິເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"Base class for all primitive meshes. Handles applying a [Material] to a "
"primitive mesh."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບເມຊພື້ນຖານ (primitive meshes) ທັງໝົດ. ຈັດການການນຳໃຊ້ [Material] "
"ໃຫ້ກັບເມຊພື້ນຖານ."

msgid ""
"Base class for all primitive meshes. Handles applying a [Material] to a "
"primitive mesh. Examples include [BoxMesh], [CapsuleMesh], [CylinderMesh], "
"[PlaneMesh], [PrismMesh], and [SphereMesh]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບເມຊພື້ນຖານທັງໝົດ. ຈັດການການນຳໃຊ້ [Material] ໃຫ້ກັບເມຊພື້ນຖານ. ຕົວຢ່າງລວມມີ "
"[BoxMesh], [CapsuleMesh], [CylinderMesh], [PlaneMesh], [PrismMesh], ແລະ "
"[SphereMesh]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to customize how this primitive mesh should be "
"generated. Should return an [Array] where each element is another Array of "
"values required for the mesh (see the [enum Mesh.ArrayType] constants)."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງວິທີການສ້າງເມຊພື້ນຖານນີ. ຄວນຄືນຄ່າເປັນ [Array] ໂດຍທີ່ແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບແມ່ນ "
"Array ອື່ນຂອງຄ່າທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບເມຊ (ເບິ່ງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum Mesh.ArrayType])."

msgid ""
"Returns the mesh arrays used to make up the surface of this primitive mesh.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Pass the result to [method ArrayMesh.add_surface_from_arrays] "
"to create a new surface:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var c = CylinderMesh.new()\n"
"var arr_mesh = ArrayMesh.new()\n"
"arr_mesh.add_surface_from_arrays(Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES, "
"c.get_mesh_arrays())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var c = new CylinderMesh();\n"
"var arrMesh = new ArrayMesh();\n"
"arrMesh.AddSurfaceFromArrays(Mesh.PrimitiveType.Triangles, "
"c.GetMeshArrays());\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າເມຊອາເຣ (mesh arrays) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງພື້ນຜິວ (surface) ຂອງເມຊພື້ນຖານນີ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ສົ່ງຄ່າຜົນໄດ້ຮັບໄປໃຫ້ [method ArrayMesh.add_surface_from_arrays] "
"ເພື່ອສ້າງພື້ນຜິວໃໝ່:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var c = CylinderMesh.new()\n"
"var arr_mesh = ArrayMesh.new()\n"
"arr_mesh.add_surface_from_arrays(Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES, "
"c.get_mesh_arrays())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var c = new CylinderMesh();\n"
"var arrMesh = new ArrayMesh();\n"
"arrMesh.AddSurfaceFromArrays(Mesh.PrimitiveType.Triangles, "
"c.GetMeshArrays());\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Request an update of this primitive mesh based on its properties."
msgstr "ຮ້ອງຂໍການອັບເດດເມຊພື້ນຖານນີ້ໂດຍອີງຕາມຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"If set, generates UV2 UV coordinates applying a padding using the [member "
"uv2_padding] setting. UV2 is needed for lightmapping."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງໄວ້, ຈະສ້າງພິກັດ UV2 UV ໂດຍການເສີມຂອບ (padding) ໂດຍໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"uv2_padding]. UV2 ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການເຮັດ lightmapping."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the order of the vertices in each triangle is reversed, "
"resulting in the backside of the mesh being drawn.\n"
"This gives the same result as using [constant BaseMaterial3D.CULL_FRONT] in "
"[member BaseMaterial3D.cull_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລຳດັບຂອງຈຸດຈອມໃນແຕ່ລະຮູບສາມແຈຈະຖືກປີ້ນກັບ, "
"ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີການແຕ້ມດ້ານຫຼັງຂອງເມຊ.\n"
"ນີ້ໃຫ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຄືກັນກັບການໃຊ້ [constant BaseMaterial3D.CULL_FRONT] ໃນ [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.cull_mode]."

msgid "The current [Material] of the primitive mesh."
msgstr "[Material] ປັດຈຸບັນຂອງເມຊພື້ນຖານ."

msgid "Class representing a prism-shaped [PrimitiveMesh]."
msgstr "ຄລາສທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງ [PrimitiveMesh] ຮູບຮ່າງປີຊຶມ (prism)."

msgid ""
"Displacement of the upper edge along the X axis. 0.0 positions edge straight "
"above the bottom-left edge."
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍຂອງຂອບເທິງຕາມແກນ X. 0.0 ຈະວາງຂອບໄວ້ຢູ່ເທິງຂອບຊ້າຍລຸ່ມໂດຍກົງ."

msgid "Size of the prism."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງປີຊຶມ."

msgid "Number of added edge loops along the Z axis."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຮອບຂອງຂອບ (edge loops) ທີ່ເພີ່ມຕາມແກນ Z."

msgid "Number of added edge loops along the Y axis."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຮອບຂອງຂອບທີ່ເພີ່ມຕາມແກນ Y."

msgid "Number of added edge loops along the X axis."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຮອບຂອງຂອບທີ່ເພີ່ມຕາມແກນ X."

msgid "A material that defines a simple sky for a [Sky] resource."
msgstr "ວັດສະດຸ (material) ທີ່ກຳນົດທ້ອງຟ້າແບບງ່າຍໆສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Sky]."

msgid ""
"[ProceduralSkyMaterial] provides a way to create an effective background "
"quickly by defining procedural parameters for the sun, the sky and the "
"ground. The sky and ground are defined by a main color, a color at the "
"horizon, and an easing curve to interpolate between them. Suns are described "
"by a position in the sky, a color, and a max angle from the sun at which the "
"easing curve ends. The max angle therefore defines the size of the sun in the "
"sky.\n"
"[ProceduralSkyMaterial] supports up to 4 suns, using the color, and energy, "
"direction, and angular distance of the first four [DirectionalLight3D] nodes "
"in the scene. This means that the suns are defined individually by the "
"properties of their corresponding [DirectionalLight3D]s and globally by "
"[member sun_angle_max] and [member sun_curve].\n"
"[ProceduralSkyMaterial] uses a lightweight shader to draw the sky and is "
"therefore suited for real-time updates. This makes it a great option for a "
"sky that is simple and computationally cheap, but unrealistic. If you need a "
"more realistic procedural option, use [PhysicalSkyMaterial]."
msgstr ""
"[ProceduralSkyMaterial] ໃຫ້ວິທີການສ້າງພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ "
"ໂດຍການກຳນົດພາຣາມິເຕີສຳລັບດວງອາທິດ, ທ້ອງຟ້າ ແລະ ພື້ນດິນ. ທ້ອງຟ້າ ແລະ ພື້ນດິນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍສີຫຼັກ, "
"ສີທີ່ຂອບຟ້າ, ແລະ ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຜ່ອນ (easing curve) ເພື່ອສະເລ່ຍສີລະຫວ່າງພວກມັນ. "
"ດວງອາທິດຈະຖືກອະທິບາຍໂດຍຕຳແໜ່ງໃນທ້ອງຟ້າ, ສີ, ແລະ ມຸມສູງສຸດຈາກດວງອາທິດທີ່ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຜ່ອນສິ້ນສຸດລົງ. "
"ມຸມສູງສຸດຈຶ່ງເປັນຕົວ ກຳນົດຂະໜາດຂອງດວງອາທິດໃນທ້ອງຟ້າ.\n"
"[ProceduralSkyMaterial] ຮອງຮັບດວງອາທິດໄດ້ສູງສຸດ 4 ດວງ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ສີ, ພະລັງງານ, ທິດທາງ ແລະ "
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງທາງມຸມຂອງໂນດ [DirectionalLight3D] ສີ່ອັນທຳອິດໃນສາກ. "
"ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າດວງອາທິດຈະຖືກກຳນົດເປັນລາຍບຸກຄົນໂດຍຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ [DirectionalLight3D] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ "
"ແລະ ກຳນົດລວມໂດຍ [member sun_angle_max] ແລະ [member sun_curve].\n"
"[ProceduralSkyMaterial] ໃຊ້ເຊດເດີ (shader) ທີ່ມີນ້ຳໜັກເບົາໃນການແຕ້ມທ້ອງຟ້າ ແລະ "
"ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບການອັບເດດແບບສົດໆ (real-time). ນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເປັນທາງເລືອກທີ່ດີສຳລັບທ້ອງຟ້າທີ່ງ່າຍດາຍ "
"ແລະ ປະຢັດຊັບພະຍາກອນຄຳນວນ, ແຕ່ອາດຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ຄືແທ້ປານໃດ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການທາງເລືອກທີ່ສົມຈິງກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[PhysicalSkyMaterial]."

msgid ""
"Color of the ground at the bottom. Blends with [member ground_horizon_color]."
msgstr "ສີຂອງພື້ນດິນທີ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມສຸດ. ຈະປະສົມກັບ [member ground_horizon_color]."

msgid ""
"How quickly the [member ground_horizon_color] fades into the [member "
"ground_bottom_color]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວທີ່ [member ground_horizon_color] ຈາງລົງໄປຫາ [member ground_bottom_color]."

msgid ""
"Multiplier for ground color. A higher value will make the ground brighter."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນສຳລັບສີພື້ນດິນ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພື້ນດິນສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Color of the ground at the horizon. Blends with [member ground_bottom_color]."
msgstr "ສີຂອງພື້ນດິນທີ່ຂອບຟ້າ. ຈະປະສົມກັບ [member ground_bottom_color]."

msgid ""
"The sky cover texture to use. This texture must use an equirectangular "
"projection (similar to [PanoramaSkyMaterial]). The texture's colors will be "
"[i]added[/i] to the existing sky color, and will be multiplied by [member "
"sky_energy_multiplier] and [member sky_cover_modulate]. This is mainly suited "
"to displaying stars at night, but it can also be used to display clouds at "
"day or night (with a non-physically-accurate look)."
msgstr ""
"ແທັກເຈີປົກຄຸມທ້ອງຟ້າທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ແທັກເຈີນີຕ້ອງໃຊ້ການສາຍພາບແບບ equirectangular (ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ "
"[PanoramaSkyMaterial]). ສີຂອງແທັກເຈີຈະຖືກ [i]ເພີ່ມ[/i] ເຂົ້າກັບສີທ້ອງຟ້າທີ່ມີຢູ່, ແລະ "
"ຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍ [member sky_energy_multiplier] ແລະ [member sky_cover_modulate]. "
"ນີ້ເໝາະສຳລັບການສະແດງດວງດາວໃນເວລາກາງຄືນ, ແຕ່ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງກ້ອນເມກໃນເວລາກາງເວັນ ຫຼື "
"ກາງຄືນ (ດ້ວຍຮູບລັກສະນະທີ່ບໍ່ຄືຈິງຕາມຫຼັກຟີຊິກ)."

msgid ""
"The tint to apply to the [member sky_cover] texture. This can be used to "
"change the sky cover's colors or opacity independently of the sky energy, "
"which is useful for day/night or weather transitions. Only effective if a "
"texture is defined in [member sky_cover]."
msgstr ""
"ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ປັບແຕ່ງ (tint) ໃຫ້ກັບແທັກເຈີ [member sky_cover]. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນສີ ຫຼື "
"ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຂອງຜິວປົກຄຸມທ້ອງຟ້າໄດ້ໂດຍແຍກຈາກພະລັງງານທ້ອງຟ້າ, ເຊິ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການປ່ຽນກາງເວັນ/"
"ກາງຄືນ ຫຼື ສະພາບອາກາດ. ມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີການກຳນົດແທັກເຈີໃນ [member sky_cover]."

msgid ""
"How quickly the [member sky_horizon_color] fades into the [member "
"sky_top_color]."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວທີ່ [member sky_horizon_color] ຈາງລົງໄປຫາ [member sky_top_color]."

msgid "Multiplier for sky color. A higher value will make the sky brighter."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນສຳລັບສີທ້ອງຟ້າ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ທ້ອງຟ້າສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Color of the sky at the horizon. Blends with [member sky_top_color]."
msgstr "ສີຂອງທ້ອງຟ້າທີ່ຂອບຟ້າ. ຈະປະສົມກັບ [member sky_top_color]."

msgid "Color of the sky at the top. Blends with [member sky_horizon_color]."
msgstr "ສີຂອງທ້ອງຟ້າທີ່ດ້ານເທິງສຸດ. ຈະປະສົມກັບ [member sky_horizon_color]."

msgid "Distance from center of sun where it fades out completely."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກໃຈກາງຂອງດວງອາທິດທີ່ມັນຈະຈາງຫາຍໄປໝົດ."

msgid ""
"How quickly the sun fades away between the edge of the sun disk and [member "
"sun_angle_max]."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວທີ່ດວງອາທິດຈາງຫາຍໄປລະຫວ່າງຂອບຂອງດວງອາທິດ ແລະ [member sun_angle_max]."

msgid "A control used for visual representation of a percentage."
msgstr "ຄອນໂທຣລ (control) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນເປີເຊັນ."

msgid ""
"A control used for visual representation of a percentage. Shows the fill "
"percentage in the center. Can also be used to show indeterminate progress. "
"For more fill modes, use [TextureProgressBar] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄອນໂທຣລທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນເປີເຊັນ. ສະແດງເປີເຊັນຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງ. "
"ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າທີ່ບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ (indeterminate) ໄດ້. ສຳລັບໂໝດການຕື່ມ (fill "
"modes) ທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [TextureProgressBar] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], the [member indeterminate] animation will be paused in "
"the editor."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ແອນິເມຊັນ [member indeterminate] ຈະຖືກຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "The fill direction. See [enum FillMode] for possible values."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການຕື່ມ. ເບິ່ງ [enum FillMode] ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້."

msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], the progress bar indicates that something is "
"happening with an animation, but does not show the fill percentage or value."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແຖບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຈະສະແດງວ່າກຳລັງມີບາງຢ່າງເກີດຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍແອນິເມຊັນ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງເປີເຊັນ ຫຼື ຄ່າຄວາມຄືບໜ້າ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the fill percentage is displayed on the bar."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເປີເຊັນຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນແຖບ."

msgid ""
"The progress bar fills from begin to end horizontally, according to the "
"language direction. If [method Control.is_layout_rtl] returns [code]false[/"
"code], it fills from left to right, and if it returns [code]true[/code], it "
"fills from right to left."
msgstr ""
"ແຖບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຈະຕື່ມຈາກຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄປຫາຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຕາມແນວນອນ, ອີງຕາມທິດທາງຂອງພາສາ. ຖ້າ [method "
"Control.is_layout_rtl] ຄືນຄ່າ [code]false[/code], ມັນຈະຕື່ມຈາກຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ, ແລະ ຖ້າຄືນຄ່າ "
"[code]true[/code], ມັນຈະຕື່ມຈາກຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ."

msgid ""
"The progress bar fills from end to begin horizontally, according to the "
"language direction. If [method Control.is_layout_rtl] returns [code]false[/"
"code], it fills from right to left, and if it returns [code]true[/code], it "
"fills from left to right."
msgstr ""
"ແຖບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຈະຕື່ມຈາກຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດກັບມາຫາຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕາມແນວນອນ, ອີງຕາມທິດທາງຂອງພາສາ. ຖ້າ [method "
"Control.is_layout_rtl] ຄືນຄ່າ [code]false[/code], ມັນຈະຕື່ມຈາກຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ, ແລະ ຖ້າຄືນຄ່າ "
"[code]true[/code], ມັນຈະຕື່ມຈາກຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ."

msgid "The progress fills from top to bottom."
msgstr "ຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຈະຕື່ມຈາກເທິງລົງລຸ່ມ."

msgid "The progress fills from bottom to top."
msgstr "ຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຈະຕື່ມຈາກລຸ່ມຂຶ້ນເທິງ."

msgid "The color of the text."
msgstr "ສີຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid "The tint of text outline of the [ProgressBar]."
msgstr "ສີຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງ [ProgressBar]."

msgid ""
"Font used to draw the fill percentage if [member show_percentage] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"[Font] ທີ່ໃຊ້ແຕ້ມເປີເຊັນຄວາມຄືບໜ້າ ຖ້າ [member show_percentage] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Font size used to draw the fill percentage if [member show_percentage] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ໃຊ້ແຕ້ມເປີເຊັນຄວາມຄືບໜ້າ ຖ້າ [member show_percentage] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code]."

msgid "The style of the background."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ (style) ຂອງພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid "The style of the progress (i.e. the part that fills the bar)."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຂອງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າ (ສ່ວນທີ່ຕື່ມໃສ່ແຖບ)."

msgid "A 4×4 matrix for 3D projective transformations."
msgstr ""
"ມາທຣິກ (matrix) ຂະໜາດ 4x4 ສຳລັບການສາຍພາບ 3 ມິຕິ (3D projective transformations)."

msgid ""
"A 4×4 matrix used for 3D projective transformations. It can represent "
"transformations such as translation, rotation, scaling, shearing, and "
"perspective division. It consists of four [Vector4] columns.\n"
"For purely linear transformations (translation, rotation, and scale), it is "
"recommended to use [Transform3D], as it is more performant and requires less "
"memory.\n"
"Used internally as [Camera3D]'s projection matrix.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a projection will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if it's equal to [constant IDENTITY]. Otherwise, a projection will "
"always evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ມາທຣິກຂະໜາດ 4x4 ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສາຍພາບ 3 ມິຕິ. ມັນສາມາດສະແດງເຖິງການປ່ຽນຮູບຮ່າງ ເຊັ່ນ: ການຍ້າຍ "
"(translation), ການໝູນ (rotation), ການປັບຂະໜາດ (scaling), ການບິດ (shearing), ແລະ "
"ການແບ່ງຕາມທັດສະນີຍະພາບ (perspective division). ມັນປະກອບດ້ວຍສີ່ຖັນ [Vector4].\n"
"ສຳລັບການປ່ຽນຮູບຮ່າງແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ບໍລິສຸດ (ການຍ້າຍ, ການໝູນ, ແລະ ການປັບຂະໜາດ), ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[Transform3D], ເພາະວ່າມັນມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງກວ່າ ແລະ ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໜ້ອຍກວ່າ.\n"
"ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນເປັນມາທຣິກການສາຍພາບຂອງ [Camera3D].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງບູລີນ (boolean), ມາທຣິກການສາຍພາບຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]false[/"
"code] ຖ້າມັນເທົ່າກັບ [constant IDENTITY]. ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Constructs a default-initialized [Projection] identical to [constant "
"IDENTITY].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, this constructs a [Projection] identical to [constant "
"ZERO]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Projection] ທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ເຊິ່ງຄືກັນກັບ [constant IDENTITY].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ C#, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງ [Projection] ທີ່ຄືກັນກັບ [constant ZERO]."

msgid "Constructs a [Projection] as a copy of the given [Projection]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Projection] ໂດຍການຄັດລອກຈາກ [Projection] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Constructs a Projection as a copy of the given [Transform3D]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Projection] ໂດຍການຄັດລອກຈາກ [Transform3D] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Constructs a Projection from four [Vector4] values (matrix columns)."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Projection] ຈາກຄ່າ [Vector4] ສີ່ຄ່າ (ຖັນຂອງມາທຣິກ)."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that projects positions from a depth range of "
"[code]-1[/code] to [code]1[/code] to one that ranges from [code]0[/code] to "
"[code]1[/code], and flips the projected positions vertically, according to "
"[param flip_y]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Projection] ໃໝ່ທີ່ສາຍຕຳແໜ່ງຈາກຊ່ວງຄວາມເລິກ [code]-1[/code] ຫາ [code]1[/code] "
"ໄປຫາຊ່ວງ [code]0[/code] ຫາ [code]1[/code], ແລະ ປີ້ນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ສາຍພາບນັ້ນໃນແນວຕັ້ງ ຕາມ "
"[param flip_y]."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that scales a given projection to fit around a "
"given [AABB] in projection space."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Projection] ໃໝ່ທີ່ປັບຂະໜາດການສາຍພາບທີ່ໃຫ້ມາໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບ [AABB] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ການສາຍພາບ "
"(projection space)."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] for projecting positions onto a head-mounted "
"display with the given X:Y aspect ratio, distance between eyes, display "
"width, distance to lens, oversampling factor, and depth clipping planes.\n"
"[param eye] creates the projection for the left eye when set to 1, or the "
"right eye when set to 2."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Projection] ໃໝ່ສຳລັບການສາຍຕຳແໜ່ງລົງໃນຈໍສະແດງຜົນແບບສວມຫົວ (head-mounted display) "
"ດ້ວຍອັດຕາສ່ວນ X:Y, ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງຕາ, ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຈໍ, ໄລຍະຫ່າງຫາເລນ, ຕົວຄູນ "
"oversampling, ແລະ ລະນາບຕັດຄວາມເລິກ (depth clipping planes) ທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"[param eye] ຈະສ້າງການສາຍພາບສຳລັບຕາຊ້າຍເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ 1, ຫຼື ຕາຂວາເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ 2."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that projects positions in a frustum with the "
"given clipping planes."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Projection] ໃໝ່ທີ່ສາຍຕຳແໜ່ງໃນຮູບຊົງປີຣາມິດປາຍຕັດ (frustum) ດ້ວຍລະນາບຕັດ (clipping "
"planes) ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that projects positions in a frustum with the "
"given size, X:Y aspect ratio, offset, and clipping planes.\n"
"[param flip_fov] determines whether the projection's field of view is flipped "
"over its diagonal."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Projection] ໃໝ່ທີ່ສາຍຕຳແໜ່ງໃນ frustum ດ້ວຍຂະໜາດ, ອັດຕາສ່ວນ X:Y, ໄລຍະຫ່າງ "
"(offset), ແລະ ລະນາບຕັດທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"[param flip_fov] ກຳນົດວ່າຂອບເຂດການເບິ່ງເຫັນ (field of view) "
"ຂອງການສາຍພາບຈະຖືກປີ້ນຕາມເສັ້ນທະແຍງມຸມ ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that projects positions into the given [Rect2]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Projection] ໃໝ່ທີ່ສາຍຕຳແໜ່ງລົງໃນ [Rect2] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that projects positions using an orthogonal "
"projection with the given clipping planes."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Projection] ໃໝ່ທີ່ສາຍຕຳແໜ່ງໂດຍໃຊ້ການສາຍພາບແບບອໍໂທກໍໂນລ (orthogonal) "
"ດ້ວຍລະນາບຕັດທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that projects positions using an orthogonal "
"projection with the given size, X:Y aspect ratio, and clipping planes.\n"
"[param flip_fov] determines whether the projection's field of view is flipped "
"over its diagonal."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Projection] ໃໝ່ທີ່ສາຍຕຳແໜ່ງໂດຍໃຊ້ການສາຍພາບແບບອໍໂທກໍໂນລ ດ້ວຍຂະໜາດ, ອັດຕາສ່ວນ X:Y, "
"ແລະ ລະນາບຕັດທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"[param flip_fov] ກຳນົດວ່າຂອບເຂດການເບິ່ງເຫັນຈະຖືກປີ້ນຕາມເສັ້ນທະແຍງມຸມ ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that projects positions using a perspective "
"projection with the given Y-axis field of view (in degrees), X:Y aspect "
"ratio, and clipping planes.\n"
"[param flip_fov] determines whether the projection's field of view is flipped "
"over its diagonal."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Projection] ໃໝ່ທີ່ສາຍຕຳແໜ່ງໂດຍໃຊ້ການສາຍພາບແບບທັດສະນີຍະພາບ (perspective) "
"ດ້ວຍຂອບເຂດການເບິ່ງເຫັນແກນ Y (ເປັນອົງສາ), ອັດຕາສ່ວນ X:Y, ແລະ ລະນາບຕັດທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"[param flip_fov] ກຳນົດວ່າຂອບເຂດການເບິ່ງເຫັນຈະຖືກປີ້ນຕາມເສັ້ນທະແຍງມຸມ ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that projects positions using a perspective "
"projection with the given Y-axis field of view (in degrees), X:Y aspect "
"ratio, and clipping distances. The projection is adjusted for a head-mounted "
"display with the given distance between eyes and distance to a point that can "
"be focused on.\n"
"[param eye] creates the projection for the left eye when set to 1, or the "
"right eye when set to 2.\n"
"[param flip_fov] determines whether the projection's field of view is flipped "
"over its diagonal."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Projection] ໃໝ່ທີ່ສາຍຕຳແໜ່ງໂດຍໃຊ້ການສາຍພາບແບບທັດສະນີຍະພາບ ດ້ວຍຂອບເຂດການເບິ່ງເຫັນແກນ "
"Y, ອັດຕາສ່ວນ X:Y, ແລະ ໄລຍະຕັດທີ່ກຳນົດ. ການສາຍພາບຈະຖືກປັບໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບຈໍສວມຫົວ "
"ດ້ວຍໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງຕາ ແລະ ໄລຍະຫ່າງຫາຈຸດໂຟກັສ.\n"
"[param eye] ສ້າງການສາຍພາບສຳລັບຕາຊ້າຍເມື່ອເປັນ 1, ຫຼື ຕາຂວາເມື່ອເປັນ 2.\n"
"[param flip_fov] ກຳນົດວ່າຂອບເຂດການເບິ່ງເຫັນຈະຖືກປີ້ນຕາມເສັ້ນທະແຍງມຸມ ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns a scalar value that is the signed factor by which areas are scaled by "
"this matrix. If the sign is negative, the matrix flips the orientation of the "
"area.\n"
"The determinant can be used to calculate the invertibility of a matrix or "
"solve linear systems of equations involving the matrix, among other "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າສະກາລາ (scalar) ທີ່ເປັນຕົວຄູນພ້ອມເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ທີ່ພື້ນທີ່ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໂດຍມາທຣິກນີ. ຖ້າເຄື່ອງໝາຍຕິດລົບ, "
"ມາທຣິກຈະປີ້ນທິດທາງຂອງພື້ນທີ່.\n"
"ຕົວຕັດສິນ (determinant) ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄຳນວນການປີ້ນກັບໄດ້ຂອງມາທຣິກ ຫຼື "
"ແກ້ລະບົບສົມຜົນເສັ້ນຊື່ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບມາທຣິກ, ແລະ ການໃຊ້ງານອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of this [Projection] with the signs of the values of the Y "
"column flipped."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າສຳເນົາຂອງ [Projection] ນີ້ໂດຍປີ້ນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂອງຄ່າໃນຖັນ Y."

msgid "Returns the X:Y aspect ratio of this [Projection]'s viewport."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າອັດຕາສ່ວນ X:Y ຂອງວິວພອດ (viewport) ຂອງ [Projection] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the dimensions of the far clipping plane of the projection, divided "
"by two."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຂະໜາດຂອງລະນາບຕັດໄລຍະໄກ (far clipping plane) ຂອງການສາຍພາບ, ຫານດ້ວຍສອງ."

msgid "Returns the horizontal field of view of the projection (in degrees)."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຂອບເຂດການເບິ່ງເຫັນຕາມແນວນອນຂອງການສາຍພາບ (ເປັນອົງສາ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the vertical field of view of the projection (in degrees) associated "
"with the given horizontal field of view (in degrees) and aspect ratio.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike most methods of [Projection], [param aspect] is expected "
"to be 1 divided by the X:Y aspect ratio."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຂອບເຂດການເບິ່ງເຫັນຕາມແນວຕັ້ງຂອງການສາຍພາບ (ເປັນອົງສາ) "
"ທີ່ສຳພັນກັບຂອບເຂດການເບິ່ງເຫັນຕາມແນວນອນ ແລະ ອັດຕາສ່ວນທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກເມທອດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຂອງ [Projection], [param aspect] ຄວນເປັນ 1 "
"ຫານດ້ວຍອັດຕາສ່ວນ X:Y."

msgid ""
"Returns the factor by which the visible level of detail is scaled by this "
"[Projection]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຕົວຄູນທີ່ລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນ (level of detail) ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໂດຍ [Projection] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [param for_pixel_width] divided by the viewport's width measured in "
"meters on the near plane, after this [Projection] is applied."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [param for_pixel_width] ຫານດ້ວຍຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງວິວພອດທີ່ວັດແທກເປັນແມັດໃນລະນາບໃກ້, "
"ຫຼັງຈາກນຳໃຊ້ [Projection] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the clipping plane of this [Projection] whose index is given by "
"[param plane].\n"
"[param plane] should be equal to one of [constant PLANE_NEAR], [constant "
"PLANE_FAR], [constant PLANE_LEFT], [constant PLANE_TOP], [constant "
"PLANE_RIGHT], or [constant PLANE_BOTTOM]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າລະນາບຕັດຂອງ [Projection] ນີ້ ຕາມດັດສະນີທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param plane].\n"
"[param plane] ຄວນເທົ່າກັບຄ່າໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງ [constant PLANE_NEAR], [constant PLANE_FAR], "
"[constant PLANE_LEFT], [constant PLANE_TOP], [constant PLANE_RIGHT], ຫຼື "
"[constant PLANE_BOTTOM]."

msgid ""
"Returns the dimensions of the viewport plane that this [Projection] projects "
"positions onto, divided by two."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຂະໜາດຂອງລະນາບວິວພອດທີ່ [Projection] ນີ້ສາຍຕຳແໜ່ງລົງໄປ, ຫານດ້ວຍສອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the distance for this [Projection] beyond which positions are clipped."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າໄລຍະທາງສຳລັບ [Projection] ນີ້ ເຊິ່ງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກາຍນັ້ນໄປຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the distance for this [Projection] before which positions are clipped."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າໄລຍະທາງສຳລັບ [Projection] ນີ້ ເຊິ່ງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຢູ່ກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Projection] that performs the inverse of this [Projection]'s "
"projective transformation."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [Projection] ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກກົງກັນຂ້າມ (inverse) ກັບການສາຍພາບຂອງ [Projection] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [Projection] performs an orthogonal "
"projection."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [Projection] ນີ້ເຮັດການສາຍພາບແບບອໍໂທກໍໂນລ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Projection] with the X and Y values from the given [Vector2] added "
"to the first and second values of the final column respectively."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [Projection] ໂດຍທີ່ຄ່າ X ແລະ Y ຈາກ [Vector2] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຄ່າທີໜຶ່ງ ແລະ "
"ທີສອງຂອງຖັນສຸດທ້າຍຕາມລຳດັບ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Projection] with the near clipping distance adjusted to be [param "
"new_znear].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The original [Projection] must be a perspective projection."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [Projection] ໂດຍປັບໄລຍະຕັດດ້ານໃກ້ໃຫ້ເປັນ [param new_znear].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [Projection] ຕົ້ນສະບັບຕ້ອງເປັນການສາຍພາບແບບທັດສະນີຍະພາບ (perspective)."

msgid ""
"The projection matrix's W vector (column 3). Equivalent to array index "
"[code]3[/code]."
msgstr "ເວັກເຕີ W ຂອງມາທຣິກການສາຍພາບ (ຖັນທີ 3). ທຽບເທົ່າກັບດັດສະນີອາເຣ [code]3[/code]."

msgid ""
"The projection matrix's X vector (column 0). Equivalent to array index "
"[code]0[/code]."
msgstr "ເວັກເຕີ X ຂອງມາທຣິກການສາຍພາບ (ຖັນທີ 0). ທຽບເທົ່າກັບດັດສະນີອາເຣ [code]0[/code]."

msgid ""
"The projection matrix's Y vector (column 1). Equivalent to array index "
"[code]1[/code]."
msgstr "ເວັກເຕີ Y ຂອງມາທຣິກການສາຍພາບ (ຖັນທີ 1). ທຽບເທົ່າກັບດັດສະນີອາເຣ [code]1[/code]."

msgid ""
"The projection matrix's Z vector (column 2). Equivalent to array index "
"[code]2[/code]."
msgstr "ເວັກເຕີ Z ຂອງມາທຣິກການສາຍພາບ (ຖັນທີ 2). ທຽບເທົ່າກັບດັດສະນີອາເຣ [code]2[/code]."

msgid "The index value of the projection's near clipping plane."
msgstr "ຄ່າດັດສະນີຂອງລະນາບຕັດດ້ານໃກ້ຂອງການສາຍພາບ."

msgid "The index value of the projection's far clipping plane."
msgstr "ຄ່າດັດສະນີຂອງລະນາບຕັດດ້ານໄກຂອງການສາຍພາບ."

msgid "The index value of the projection's left clipping plane."
msgstr "ຄ່າດັດສະນີຂອງລະນາບຕັດດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງການສາຍພາບ."

msgid "The index value of the projection's top clipping plane."
msgstr "ຄ່າດັດສະນີຂອງລະນາບຕັດດ້ານເທິງຂອງການສາຍພາບ."

msgid "The index value of the projection's right clipping plane."
msgstr "ຄ່າດັດສະນີຂອງລະນາບຕັດດ້ານຂວາຂອງການສາຍພາບ."

msgid "The index value of the projection bottom clipping plane."
msgstr "ຄ່າດັດສະນີຂອງລະນາບຕັດດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງການສາຍພາບ."

msgid ""
"A [Projection] with no transformation defined. When applied to other data "
"structures, no transformation is performed."
msgstr ""
"[Projection] ທີ່ບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນຮູບຮ່າງໃດໆ. ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ກັບໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນ, ຈະບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນຮູບຮ່າງເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"A [Projection] with all values initialized to 0. When applied to other data "
"structures, they will be zeroed."
msgstr "[Projection] ທີ່ທຸກຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ 0. ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ກັບໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນ, ພວກມັນຈະກາຍເປັນສູນໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the projections are not equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, this may return "
"[code]true[/code], even if the projections are virtually equal. An "
"[code]is_equal_approx[/code] method may be added in a future version of Godot."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມາທຣິກການສາຍພາບບໍ່ເທົ່າກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງຄວາມລະອຽດເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ, ນີ້ອາດຈະຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/"
"code] ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມາທຣິກຈະເກືອບເທົ່າກັນກໍຕາມ. ເມທອດ [code]is_equal_approx[/code] "
"ອາດຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນເວີຊັນອະນາຄົດຂອງ Godot."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Projection] that applies the combined transformations of this "
"[Projection] and [param right]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [Projection] ທີ່ລວມເອົາການປ່ຽນຮູບຮ່າງຂອງ [Projection] ນີ້ ແລະ [param right] "
"ເຂົ້າກັນ."

msgid "Projects (multiplies) the given [Vector4] by this [Projection] matrix."
msgstr "ສາຍພາບ (ຄູນ) [Vector4] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາດ້ວຍມາທຣິກ [Projection] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the projections are equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, this may return "
"[code]false[/code], even if the projections are virtually equal. An "
"[code]is_equal_approx[/code] method may be added in a future version of Godot."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມາທຣິກການສາຍພາບເທົ່າກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງຄວາມລະອຽດເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ, ນີ້ອາດຈະຄືນຄ່າ [code]false[/"
"code] ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມາທຣິກຈະເກືອບເທົ່າກັນກໍຕາມ. ເມທອດ [code]is_equal_approx[/code] "
"ອາດຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນເວີຊັນອະນາຄົດຂອງ Godot."

msgid ""
"Returns the column of the [Projection] with the given index.\n"
"Indices are in the following order: x, y, z, w."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຖັນຂອງ [Projection] ຕາມດັດສະນີທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ.\n"
"ລຳດັບດັດສະນີແມ່ນ: x, y, z, w."

msgid "Stores globally-accessible variables."
msgstr "ເກັບຮັກສາຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ທົ່ວໂລກ."

msgid "Project Settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການ"

msgid ""
"Adds a custom property info to a property. The dictionary must contain:\n"
"- [code]\"name\"[/code]: [String] (the property's name)\n"
"- [code]\"type\"[/code]: [int] (see [enum Variant.Type])\n"
"- optionally [code]\"hint\"[/code]: [int] (see [enum PropertyHint]) and [code]"
"\"hint_string\"[/code]: [String]\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"ProjectSettings.set(\"category/property_name\", 0)\n"
"\n"
"var property_info = {\n"
"\t\"name\": \"category/property_name\",\n"
"\t\"type\": TYPE_INT,\n"
"\t\"hint\": PROPERTY_HINT_ENUM,\n"
"\t\"hint_string\": \"one,two,three\"\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"ProjectSettings.add_property_info(property_info)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"ProjectSettings.Singleton.Set(\"category/property_name\", 0);\n"
"\n"
"var propertyInfo = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"name\", \"category/propertyName\" },\n"
"\t{ \"type\", (int)Variant.Type.Int },\n"
"\t{ \"hint\", (int)PropertyHint.Enum },\n"
"\t{ \"hint_string\", \"one,two,three\" },\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"ProjectSettings.AddPropertyInfo(propertyInfo);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting [code]\"usage\"[/code] for the property is not "
"supported. Use [method set_as_basic], [method set_restart_if_changed], and "
"[method set_as_internal] to modify usage flags."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນຄຸນສົມບັດແບບກຳນົດເອງ (custom property info) ໃຫ້ກັບຄຸນສົມບັດ. ດິກຊັນນາຣີ "
"(dictionary) ຕ້ອງປະກອບດ້ວຍ:\n"
"- [code]\"name\"[/code]: [String] (ຊື່ຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດ)\n"
"- [code]\"type\"[/code]: [int] (ເບິ່ງ [enum Variant.Type])\n"
"- ທາງເລືອກ [code]\"hint\"[/code]: [int] (ເບິ່ງ [enum PropertyHint]) ແລະ [code]"
"\"hint_string\"[/code]: [String]\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"ProjectSettings.set(\"category/property_name\", 0)\n"
"\n"
"var property_info = {\n"
"\t\"name\": \"category/property_name\",\n"
"\t\"type\": TYPE_INT,\n"
"\t\"hint\": PROPERTY_HINT_ENUM,\n"
"\t\"hint_string\": \"one,two,three\"\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"ProjectSettings.add_property_info(property_info)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"ProjectSettings.Singleton.Set(\"category/property_name\", 0);\n"
"\n"
"var propertyInfo = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"name\", \"category/propertyName\" },\n"
"\t{ \"type\", (int)Variant.Type.Int },\n"
"\t{ \"hint\", (int)PropertyHint.Enum },\n"
"\t{ \"hint_string\", \"one,two,three\" },\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"ProjectSettings.AddPropertyInfo(propertyInfo);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [code]\"usage\"[/code] ສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[method set_as_basic], [method set_restart_if_changed], ແລະ [method "
"set_as_internal] ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂແຟລັກການໃຊ້ງານ (usage flags)."

msgid "Clears the whole configuration (not recommended, may break things)."
msgstr "ລຶບລ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງໝົດ (ບໍ່ແນະນຳ, ເພາະອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບມີບັນຫາ)."

msgid ""
"Gets an array of the settings which have been changed since the last save. "
"Note that internally [code]changed_settings[/code] is cleared after a "
"successful save, so generally the most appropriate place to use this method "
"is when processing [signal settings_changed]."
msgstr ""
"ເອົາອາເຣຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ການບັນທຶກຄັ້ງຫຼ້າສຸດ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ "
"[code]changed_settings[/code] ຈະຖືກລຶບລ້າງພາຍໃນຫຼັງຈາກບັນທຶກສຳເລັດ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ "
"ບ່ອນທີ່ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ແມ່ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ປະມວນຜົນສັນຍານ [signal settings_changed]."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of registered global classes. Each global class is "
"represented as a [Dictionary] that contains the following entries:\n"
"- [code]base[/code] is a name of the base class;\n"
"- [code]class[/code] is a name of the registered global class;\n"
"- [code]icon[/code] is a path to a custom icon of the global class, if it has "
"any;\n"
"- [code]language[/code] is a name of a programming language in which the "
"global class is written;\n"
"- [code]path[/code] is a path to a file containing the global class.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Both the script and the icon paths are local to the project "
"filesystem, i.e. they start with [code]res://[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [Array] ຂອງຄລາສທົ່ວໂລກ (global classes) ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້. "
"ແຕ່ລະຄລາສທົ່ວໂລກຈະຖືກສະແດງເປັນ [Dictionary] ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍລາຍການດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"- [code]base[/code] ແມ່ນຊື່ຂອງຄລາສພື້ນຖານ (base class);\n"
"- [code]class[/code] ແມ່ນຊື່ຂອງຄລາສທົ່ວໂລກທີ່ລົງທະບຽນ;\n"
"- [code]icon[/code] ແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາໄອຄອນກຳນົດເອງຂອງຄລາສທົ່ວໂລກ (ຖ້າມີ);\n"
"- [code]language[/code] ແມ່ນຊື່ຂອງພາສາຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ໃຊ້ຂຽນຄລາສທົ່ວໂລກ;\n"
"- [code]path[/code] ແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບັນຈຸຄລາສທົ່ວໂລກນັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທັງເສັ້ນທາງຂອງສະຄຣິບ (script) ແລະ ໄອຄອນ ແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງໂຄງການ, ຫຼື "
"ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [code]res://[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the order of a configuration value (influences when saved to the "
"config file)."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າລຳດັບຂອງຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (ມີຜົນເມື່ອບັນທຶກລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the value of the setting identified by [param name]. If the setting "
"doesn't exist and [param default_value] is specified, the value of [param "
"default_value] is returned. Otherwise, [code]null[/code] is returned.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(ProjectSettings.get_setting(\"application/config/name\"))\n"
"print(ProjectSettings.get_setting(\"application/config/custom_description\", "
"\"No description specified.\"))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(ProjectSettings.GetSetting(\"application/config/name\"));\n"
"GD.Print(ProjectSettings.GetSetting(\"application/config/"
"custom_description\", \"No description specified.\"));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method doesn't take potential feature overrides into "
"account automatically. Use [method get_setting_with_override] to handle "
"seamlessly.\n"
"See also [method has_setting] to check whether a setting exists."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param name]. ຖ້າການຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍ່ມີຢູ່ ແລະ ມີການກຳນົດ [param "
"default_value], ຄ່າຂອງ [param default_value] ຈະຖືກຄືນມາ. ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະຄືນຄ່າ "
"[code]null[/code].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(ProjectSettings.get_setting(\"application/config/name\"))\n"
"print(ProjectSettings.get_setting(\"application/config/custom_description\", "
"\"No description specified.\"))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(ProjectSettings.GetSetting(\"application/config/name\"));\n"
"GD.Print(ProjectSettings.GetSetting(\"application/config/"
"custom_description\", \"No description specified.\"));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຄຳນຶງເຖິງການຂຽນທັບ (feature overrides) "
"ທີ່ອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method get_setting_with_override] "
"ເພື່ອຈັດການໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method has_setting] ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າມີຢູ່ ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Similar to [method get_setting], but applies feature tag overrides if any "
"exists and is valid.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] If the setting override [code]\"application/config/"
"name.windows\"[/code] exists, and the following code is executed on a "
"[i]Windows[/i] operating system, the overridden setting is printed instead:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(ProjectSettings.get_setting_with_override(\"application/config/"
"name\"))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(ProjectSettings.GetSettingWithOverride(\"application/config/"
"name\"));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [method get_setting], ແຕ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ການຂຽນທັບດ້ວຍ feature tag ຖ້າມີຢູ່ ແລະ ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ຖ້າມີການຂຽນທັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [code]\"application/config/name.windows\"[/"
"code] ຢູ່, ແລະ ໂຄດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຖືກແລ່ນຢູ່ໃນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ [i]Windows[/i], "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຂຽນທັບຈະຖືກສະແດງອອກມາແທນ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(ProjectSettings.get_setting_with_override(\"application/config/"
"name\"))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(ProjectSettings.GetSettingWithOverride(\"application/config/"
"name\"));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Similar to [method get_setting_with_override], but applies feature tag "
"overrides instead of current OS features."
msgstr ""
"ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [method get_setting_with_override], ແຕ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ການຂຽນທັບດ້ວຍ feature tag "
"ແທນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ OS ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the absolute, native OS path corresponding to the localized [param "
"path] (starting with [code]res://[/code] or [code]user://[/code]). The "
"returned path will vary depending on the operating system and user "
"preferences. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/io/data_paths.html]File paths in "
"Godot projects[/url] to see what those paths convert to. See also [method "
"localize_path].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method globalize_path] with [code]res://[/code] will not work "
"in an exported project. Instead, prepend the executable's base directory to "
"the path when running from an exported project:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var path = \"\"\n"
"if OS.has_feature(\"editor\"):\n"
"\t# Running from an editor binary.\n"
"\t# `path` will contain the absolute path to `hello.txt` located in the "
"project root.\n"
"\tpath = ProjectSettings.globalize_path(\"res://hello.txt\")\n"
"else:\n"
"\t# Running from an exported project.\n"
"\t# `path` will contain the absolute path to `hello.txt` next to the "
"executable.\n"
"\t# This is *not* identical to using `ProjectSettings.globalize_path()` with "
"a `res://` path,\n"
"\t# but is close enough in spirit.\n"
"\tpath = OS.get_executable_path().get_base_dir().path_join(\"hello.txt\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງສຳບູນ (absolute path) ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ທີ່ກົງກັບ [param path] ພາຍໃນ "
"(ທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [code]res://[/code] ຫຼື [code]user://[/code]). "
"ເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ຄືນມາຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/io/data_paths.html]ເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ໃນໂຄງການ Godot[/url] "
"ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າເສັ້ນທາງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນແນວໃດ. ເບິ່ງ [method localize_path] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method globalize_path] ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບ [code]res://[/code] "
"ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນໂຄງການທີ່ສົ່ງອອກແລ້ວ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການຕໍ່ເສັ້ນທາງຈາກໂຟນເດີທີ່ໄຟລ໌ແລ່ນ (executable) ຢູ່ແທນ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var path = \"\"\n"
"if OS.has_feature(\"editor\"):\n"
"\t# ແລ່ນຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor).\n"
"\t# `path` ຈະມີເສັ້ນທາງສຳບູນໄປຫາ `hello.txt` ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີຮາກຂອງໂຄງການ.\n"
"\tpath = ProjectSettings.globalize_path(\"res://hello.txt\")\n"
"else:\n"
"\t# ແລ່ນຈາກໂຄງການທີ່ສົ່ງອອກແລ້ວ.\n"
"\t# `path` ຈະມີເສັ້ນທາງສຳບູນໄປຫາ `hello.txt` ທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງໄຟລ໌ແລ່ນເກມ.\n"
"\tpath = OS.get_executable_path().get_base_dir().path_join(\"hello.txt\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a configuration value is present.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In order to be be detected, custom settings have to be either "
"defined with [method set_setting], or exist in the [code]project.godot[/code] "
"file. This is especially relevant when using [method set_initial_value]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າປະກົດຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກວດພົບໄດ້, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບກຳນົດເອງຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດດ້ວຍ [method "
"set_setting], ຫຼື ມີຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ [code]project.godot[/code]. ສິ່ງນີ້ສຳຄັນຫຼາຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ [method "
"set_initial_value]."

msgid ""
"Loads the contents of the .pck or .zip file specified by [param pack] into "
"the resource filesystem ([code]res://[/code]). Returns [code]true[/code] on "
"success.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If a file from [param pack] shares the same path as a file "
"already in the resource filesystem, any attempts to load that file will use "
"the file from [param pack] unless [param replace_files] is set to "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The optional [param offset] parameter can be used to specify the "
"offset in bytes to the start of the resource pack. This is only supported "
"for .pck files.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [DirAccess] will not show changes made to the contents of "
"[code]res://[/code] after calling this function."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດເນື້ອຫາຂອງໄຟລ໌ .pck ຫຼື .zip ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param pack] ເຂົ້າໄປໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນ "
"([code]res://[/code]). ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າໄຟລ໌ຈາກ [param pack] ມີເສັ້ນທາງດຽວກັນກັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ແລ້ວ, "
"ການພະຍາຍາມໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ຈາກ [param pack] ແທນ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ [param replace_files] "
"ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ພາຣາມິເຕີ [param offset] ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸໄລຍະຫ່າງເປັນໄບຕ໌ (bytes) "
"ຫາຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຊຸດຊັບພະຍາກອນ. ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ .pck ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [DirAccess] ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບເນື້ອຫາໃນ [code]res://[/"
"code] ຫຼັງຈາກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນນີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the localized path (starting with [code]res://[/code]) corresponding "
"to the absolute, native OS [param path]. See also [method globalize_path]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງພາຍໃນ (ທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [code]res://[/code]) ທີ່ກົງກັບເສັ້ນທາງສຳບູນ [param path] "
"ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ເບິ່ງ [method globalize_path] ຕື່ມອີກ."

msgid ""
"Saves the configuration to the [code]project.godot[/code] file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is intended to be used by editor plugins, as "
"modified [ProjectSettings] can't be loaded back in the running app. If you "
"want to change project settings in exported projects, use [method "
"save_custom] to save an [code]override.cfg[/code] file."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ [code]project.godot[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໂດຍປລັກອິນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor plugins), ເພາະວ່າ "
"[ProjectSettings] ທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວບໍ່ສາມາດໂຫຼດຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ໃນແອັບທີ່ກຳລັງແລ່ນຢູ່. "
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການໃນໂຄງການທີ່ສົ່ງອອກແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method save_custom] "
"ເພື່ອບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ [code]override.cfg[/code] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Saves the configuration to a custom file. The file extension must be "
"[code].godot[/code] (to save in text-based [ConfigFile] format) or "
"[code].binary[/code] (to save in binary format). You can also save an "
"[code]override.cfg[/code] file, which is also text, but can be used in "
"exported projects unlike other formats."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ. ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ຕ້ອງເປັນ [code].godot[/code] "
"(ເພື່ອບັນທຶກໃນຮູບແບບ [ConfigFile] ທີ່ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ) ຫຼື [code].binary[/code] "
"(ເພື່ອບັນທຶກໃນຮູບແບບເບນນາຣີ). ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ [code]override.cfg[/code] ໄດ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຄືກັນ ແຕ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນໂຄງການທີ່ສົ່ງອອກແລ້ວໄດ້ ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຮູບແບບອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"Defines if the specified setting is considered basic or advanced. Basic "
"settings will always be shown in the project settings. Advanced settings will "
"only be shown if the user enables the \"Advanced Settings\" option."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ນັ້ນຖືວ່າເປັນແບບພື້ນຖານ ຫຼື ຂັ້ນສູງ. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພື້ນຖານຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການສະເໝີ. "
"ສ່ວນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂັ້ນສູງຈະຖືກສະແດງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ \"Advanced Settings\" ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Defines if the specified setting is considered internal. An internal setting "
"won't show up in the Project Settings dialog. This is mostly useful for "
"addons that need to store their own internal settings without exposing them "
"directly to the user."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ນັ້ນຖືວ່າເປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຍໃນຫຼືບໍ່. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຍໃນຈະບໍ່ປາກົດຢູ່ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການ. ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບສ່ວນເສີມ "
"(addons) ທີ່ຕ້ອງການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຍໃນຂອງຕົນເອງໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫັນໂດຍກົງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the specified setting's initial value. This is the value the setting "
"reverts to. The setting should already exist before calling this method. Note "
"that project settings equal to their default value are not saved, so your "
"code needs to account for that.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"extends EditorPlugin\n"
"\n"
"const SETTING_NAME = \"addons/my_setting\"\n"
"const SETTING_DEFAULT = 10.0\n"
"\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\tif not ProjectSettings.has_setting(SETTING_NAME):\n"
"\t\tProjectSettings.set_setting(SETTING_NAME, SETTING_DEFAULT)\n"
"\n"
"\tProjectSettings.set_initial_value(SETTING_NAME, SETTING_DEFAULT)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"If you have a project setting defined by an [EditorPlugin], but want to use "
"it in a running project, you will need a similar code at runtime."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຫ້ກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ລະບຸ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະກັບຄືນໄປຫາ. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວນຈະມີຢູ່ແລ້ວກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການທີ່ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນໂຄ້ດຂອງທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຄຳນຶງເຖິງເລື່ອງນີ້.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"extends EditorPlugin\n"
"\n"
"const SETTING_NAME = \"addons/my_setting\"\n"
"const SETTING_DEFAULT = 10.0\n"
"\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\tif not ProjectSettings.has_setting(SETTING_NAME):\n"
"\t\tProjectSettings.set_setting(SETTING_NAME, SETTING_DEFAULT)\n"
"\n"
"\tProjectSettings.set_initial_value(SETTING_NAME, SETTING_DEFAULT)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [EditorPlugin], ແຕ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໃນໂຄງການທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, "
"ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໂຄ້ດທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນນີ້ໃນເວລານຳໃຊ້ (runtime)."

msgid ""
"Sets the order of a configuration value (influences when saved to the config "
"file)."
msgstr "ກຳນົດລຳດັບຂອງຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (ມີຜົນຕໍ່ກັບເວລາທີ່ບັນທຶກລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ config)."

msgid ""
"Sets whether a setting requires restarting the editor to properly take "
"effect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is just a hint to display to the user that the editor must "
"be restarted for changes to take effect. Enabling [method "
"set_restart_if_changed] does [i]not[/i] delay the setting being set when "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃດໜຶ່ງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor) ໃໝ່ຫຼືບໍ່ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຜົນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] "
"ນີ້ເປັນພຽງການແນະນຳເພື່ອສະແດງໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫັນວ່າຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ. ການເປີດໃຊ້ "
"[method set_restart_if_changed] [i]ບໍ່ໄດ້[/i] "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຖືກເລື່ອນອອກໄປເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the value of a setting.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"ProjectSettings.set_setting(\"application/config/name\", \"Example\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"ProjectSettings.SetSetting(\"application/config/name\", \"Example\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"This can also be used to erase custom project settings. To do this change the "
"setting value to [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"ProjectSettings.set_setting(\"application/config/name\", \"Example\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"ProjectSettings.SetSetting(\"application/config/name\", \"Example\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ນອກນັ້ນຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລຶບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ "
"[code]null[/code]."

msgid ""
"Accessibility driver:\n"
"-[b]accesskit[/b] (default): AccessKit driver.\n"
"-[b]dummy[/b]: Dummy driver, screen reader support is disabled."
msgstr ""
"ໄດເວີການເຂົ້າເຖິງ (Accessibility driver):\n"
"-[b]accesskit[/b] (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ): ໄດເວີ AccessKit.\n"
"-[b]dummy[/b]: ໄດເວີທຽມ, ການຮອງຮັບເຄື່ອງອ່ານໜ້າຈໍຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Accessibility support mode:\n"
"- [b]Auto[/b] ([code]0[/code]): Accessibility support is enabled, but updates "
"to the accessibility information are processed only if an assistive app (such "
"as a screen reader or a Braille display) is active (default).\n"
"- [b]Always Active[/b] ([code]1[/code]): Accessibility support is enabled, "
"and updates to the accessibility information are always processed, regardless "
"of the status of assistive apps.\n"
"- [b]Disabled[/b] ([code]2[/code]): Accessibility support is fully disabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Accessibility debugging tools, such as Accessibility Insights "
"for Windows, Accessibility Inspector (macOS), or AT-SPI Browser (Linux/BSD), "
"do not count as assistive apps. To test your project with these tools, use "
"[b]Always Active[/b]."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການຮອງຮັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ:\n"
"- [b]Auto[/b] ([code]0[/code]): ເປີດໃຊ້ການຮອງຮັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ, "
"ແຕ່ການອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າເຖິງຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີແອັບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (ເຊັ່ນ ເຄື່ອງອ່ານໜ້າຈໍ ຫຼື "
"ຈໍສະແດງຜົນອັກສອນເບຣວ) ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ).\n"
"- [b]Always Active[/b] ([code]1[/code]): ເປີດໃຊ້ການຮອງຮັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ ແລະ "
"ການອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນສະເໝີ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່າແອັບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຈະເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"- [b]Disabled[/b] ([code]2[/code]): ປິດການຮອງຮັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງຢ່າງສົມບູນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເຄື່ອງມືກວດສອບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ (Accessibility debugging tools) ເຊັ່ນ "
"Accessibility Insights ສຳລັບ Windows, Accessibility Inspector (macOS), ຫຼື AT-"
"SPI Browser (Linux/BSD) ບໍ່ຖືວ່າເປັນແອັບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ. ເພື່ອທົດສອບໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມືເຫຼົ່ານີ້ "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [b]Always Active[/b]."

msgid "The number of accessibility information updates per second."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງຂອງການອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າເຖິງຕໍ່ວິນາທີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [member MeshInstance3D.skeleton] will point to the "
"parent node ([code]..[/code]) by default, which was the behavior before Godot "
"4.6. It's recommended to keep this setting disabled unless the old behavior "
"is needed for compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you disable this option in an existing project, it's strongly "
"recommended to use the [code]Project > Tools > Upgrade Project Files...[/"
"code] option to ensure existing scenes do not break."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [member MeshInstance3D.skeleton] ຈະຊີ້ໄປທີ່ໂນດແມ່ "
"([code]..[/code]) ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນຮູບແບບການເຮັດວຽກກ່ອນເວີຊັນ Godot 4.6. "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປິດຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໄວ້ ນອກຈາກວ່າຕ້ອງການຮູບແບບເກົ່າເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານປິດຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໃນໂຄງການທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ "
"[code]Project > Tools > Upgrade Project Files...[/code] ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າສາກ "
"(scenes) ທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະບໍ່ມີບັນຫາ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [AnimationMixer] prints the warning of interpolation "
"being forced to choose the shortest rotation path due to multiple angle "
"interpolation types being mixed in the [AnimationMixer] cache."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [AnimationMixer] ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນກ່ຽວກັບການບັງຄັບໃຊ້ການແຊກຄ່າ "
"(interpolation) ເພື່ອເລືອກເສັ້ນທາງການໝຸນທີ່ສັ້ນທີ່ສຸດ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກມີການປະສົມປະເພດການແຊກຄ່າມຸມຫຼາຍແບບໃນແຄຊ (cache) ຂອງ [AnimationMixer]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [SkeletonModifier3D] prints a warning if there's no "
"matching object for the track path in the scene when assigning."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [SkeletonModifier3D] "
"ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນຫາກບໍ່ພົບວັດຖຸທີ່ກົງກັບເສັ້ນທາງແທຣັກ (track path) ໃນສາກໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງກຳນົດຄ່າ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [AnimationMixer] prints the warning of no matching "
"object of the track path in the scene."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [AnimationMixer] "
"ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນຫາກບໍ່ພົບວັດຖຸທີ່ກົງກັບເສັ້ນທາງແທຣັກໃນສາກ."

msgid "Background color for the boot splash."
msgstr "ສີພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບໜ້າຈໍຕ້ອນຮັບຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (boot splash)."

msgid ""
"Path to an image used as the boot splash. If left empty, the default Godot "
"Engine splash will be displayed instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective if [member application/boot_splash/show_image] is "
"[code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The only supported format is PNG. Using another image format "
"will result in an error.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The image will also show when opening the project in the editor. "
"If you want to display the default splash image in the editor, add an empty "
"override for [code]editor_hint[/code] feature."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາຮູບພາບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນໜ້າຈໍຕ້ອນຮັບ. ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະສະແດງຮູບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ Godot Engine "
"ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member application/boot_splash/show_image] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ນາມສະກຸນ PNG ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ການໃຊ້ຮູບແບບອື່ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮູບພາບຈະສະແດງຕອນເປີດໂຄງການໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor) ນຳ. "
"ຫາກຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສະແດງຮູບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ override ທີ່ວ່າງເປົ່າສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"[code]editor_hint[/code]."

msgid ""
"Minimum boot splash display time (in milliseconds). It is not recommended to "
"set too high values for this setting."
msgstr "ເວລາຕ່ຳສຸດໃນການສະແດງໜ້າຈໍຕ້ອນຮັບ (ເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ). ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າສູງເກີນໄປ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays the image specified in [member application/"
"boot_splash/image] when the engine starts. If [code]false[/code], only "
"displays the plain color specified in [member application/boot_splash/"
"bg_color]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງຮູບພາບທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ [member application/boot_splash/"
"image] ເມື່ອເລີ່ມເຄື່ອງຈັກ (engine). ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ຈະສະແດງສະເພາະສີພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ [member application/boot_splash/bg_color]."

msgid ""
"Specifies how the splash image will be stretched. For the original size "
"without stretching, set to disabled. See [enum "
"RenderingServer.SplashStretchMode] constants for more information."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວິທີການຢືດຮູບພາບໜ້າຈໍຕ້ອນຮັບ. ສຳລັບຂະໜາດເດີມໂດຍບໍ່ຢືດ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງເປັນ disabled. "
"ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum RenderingServer.SplashStretchMode]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], applies linear filtering when scaling the image "
"(recommended for high-resolution artwork). If [code]false[/code], uses "
"nearest-neighbor interpolation (recommended for pixel art)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ linear filtering ເມື່ອປັບຂະໜາດຮູບ "
"(ແນະນຳສຳລັບຮູບທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດສູງ). ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ nearest-neighbor "
"interpolation (ແນະນຳສຳລັບ pixel art)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the application automatically accepts quitting requests."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະຍອມຮັບຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍການປິດ (quitting requests) "
"ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"This user directory is used for storing persistent data ([code]user://[/code] "
"filesystem). If a custom directory name is defined, this name will be "
"appended to the system-specific user data directory (same parent folder as "
"the Godot configuration folder documented in [method OS.get_user_data_dir]).\n"
"The [member application/config/use_custom_user_dir] setting must be enabled "
"for this to take effect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member application/config/custom_user_dir_name] contains "
"trailing periods, they will be stripped as folder names ending with a period "
"are not allowed on Windows."
msgstr ""
"ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖາວອນ (ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ [code]user://[/code]). "
"ຫາກມີການກຳນົດຊື່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເອງ, ຊື່ນີ້ຈະຖືກຕໍ່ທ້າຍກັບໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະຂອງລະບົບ "
"(ໂຟນເດີແມ່ດຽວກັນກັບໂຟນເດີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Godot ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ [method OS.get_user_data_dir]).\n"
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member application/config/use_custom_user_dir] "
"ຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກ [member application/config/custom_user_dir_name] ມີຈ້ຳ (.) "
"ຢູ່ທາງທ້າຍ, ມັນຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ ເພາະ Windows ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຊື່ໂຟນເດີທີ່ລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍຈ້ຳ."

msgid ""
"The project's description, displayed as a tooltip in the Project Manager when "
"hovering the project."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍຂອງໂຄງການ, ຈະສະແດງເປັນ tooltip ໃນ Project Manager "
"ເມື່ອເອົາເມົ້າໄປວາງໄວ້ເທິງໂຄງການ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], disables loading of project settings overrides (file "
"defined in [member application/config/project_settings_override] and "
"[code]res://override.cfg[/code]) and related CLI arguments."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະປິດການໂຫຼດການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການທີ່ຖືກ override (ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ "
"[member application/config/project_settings_override] ແລະ [code]res://"
"override.cfg[/code]) ລວມທັງ argument ຂອງ CLI ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Icon used for the project, set when project loads. Exporters will also use "
"this icon as a fallback if necessary."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂຄງການ, ຈະຖືກກຳນົດເມື່ອໂຫຼດໂຄງການ. ຕົວສົ່ງອອກ (exporters) "
"ຈະໃຊ້ໄອຄອນນີ້ເປັນຄ່າສຳຮອງ (fallback) ຫາກຈຳເປັນ."

msgid ""
"Icon set in [code].icns[/code] format used on macOS to set the game's icon. "
"This is done automatically on start by calling [method "
"DisplayServer.set_native_icon]."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນໃນຮູບແບບ [code].icns[/code] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ macOS ເພື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນໄອຄອນຂອງເກມ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກເຮັດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"DisplayServer.set_native_icon]."

msgid ""
"The project's name. It is used both by the Project Manager and by exporters. "
"The project name can be translated by translating its value in localization "
"files. The window title will be set to match the project name automatically "
"on startup.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing this value will also change the user data folder's path "
"if [member application/config/use_custom_user_dir] is [code]false[/code]. "
"After renaming the project, you will no longer be able to access existing "
"data in [code]user://[/code] unless you rename the old folder to match the "
"new project name. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/io/data_paths.html]Data paths[/"
"url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຂອງໂຄງການ. ຖືກໃຊ້ທັງໃນ Project Manager ແລະ ຕົວສົ່ງອອກ. "
"ຊື່ໂຄງການສາມາດແປໄດ້ໂດຍການແປຄ່າຂອງມັນໃນໄຟລ໌ localization. "
"ຫົວຂໍ້ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ກົງກັບຊື່ໂຄງການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ຈະປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງຂອງໂຟນເດີຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້ດ້ວຍ ຫາກ [member application/"
"config/use_custom_user_dir] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]. ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນຊື່ໂຄງການ, "
"ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ [code]user://[/code] ໄດ້ອີກ "
"ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ທ່ານຈະປ່ຽນຊື່ໂຟນເດີເກົ່າໃຫ້ກົງກັບຊື່ໂຄງການໃໝ່. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/io/data_paths.html]Data paths[/url] ໃນເອກະສານ."

msgid ""
"Translations of the project's name. This setting is used by OS tools to "
"translate application name on Android, iOS and macOS.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When left empty, the application name is translated using the "
"project translations."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳແປຂອງຊື່ໂຄງການ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍເຄື່ອງມືຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການເພື່ອແປຊື່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃນ Android, "
"iOS ແລະ macOS.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, ຊື່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະຖືກແປໂດຍໃຊ້ການແປຂອງໂຄງການ."

msgid ""
"Specifies a file to override project settings. For example: [code]user://"
"custom_settings.cfg[/code]. See \"Overriding\" in the [ProjectSettings] class "
"description at the top for more information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Regardless of this setting's value, [code]res://override.cfg[/"
"code] will still be read to override the project settings."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອ override ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: [code]user://custom_settings.cfg[/"
"code]. ເບິ່ງ \"Overriding\" ໃນລາຍລະອຽດຄລາດ [ProjectSettings] "
"ຢູ່ທາງເທິງສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່າຄ່າຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນແນວໃດ, [code]res://override.cfg[/"
"code] ຈະຍັງຖືກອ່ານເພື່ອ override ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the application quits automatically when navigating "
"back (e.g. using the system \"Back\" button on Android)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະປິດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອກົດຍ້ອນກັບ (ເຊັ່ນ ການໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ "
"\"Back\" ຂອງລະບົບໃນ Android)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the project will save user data to its own user "
"directory. If [member application/config/custom_user_dir_name] is empty, "
"[code]<OS user data directory>/<project name>[/code] directory will be used. "
"If [code]false[/code], the project will save user data to [code]<OS user data "
"directory>/Godot/app_userdata/<project name>[/code].\n"
"See also [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/io/data_paths.html#accessing-persistent-"
"user-data-user]File paths in Godot projects[/url]. This setting is only "
"effective on desktop platforms."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂຄງການຈະບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້ລົງໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງຕົນເອງ. ຫາກ "
"[member application/config/custom_user_dir_name] ວ່າງເປົ່າ, ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [code]<OS "
"user data directory>/<project name>[/code] ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/"
"code], ໂຄງການຈະບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້ລົງໃນ [code]<OS user data directory>/Godot/"
"app_userdata/<project name>[/code].\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/io/data_paths.html#accessing-persistent-"
"user-data-user]File paths in Godot projects[/url]. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະໃນແພລດຟອມເດັສທັອບເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the project will use a hidden directory ([code].godot[/"
"code]) for storing project-specific data (metadata, shader cache, etc.).\n"
"If [code]false[/code], a non-hidden directory ([code]godot[/code]) will be "
"used instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Restart the application after changing this setting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing this value can help on platforms or with third-party "
"tools where hidden directory patterns are disallowed. Only modify this "
"setting if you know that your environment requires it, as changing the "
"default can impact compatibility with some external tools or plugins which "
"expect the default [code].godot[/code] folder."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂຄງການຈະໃຊ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ ([code].godot[/code]) "
"ເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະຂອງໂຄງການ (metadata, shader cache, ແລະອື່ນໆ).\n"
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເຊື່ອງ ([code]godot[/code]) ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໃນບາງແພລດຟອມ ຫຼື "
"ເຄື່ອງມືພາຍນອກທີ່ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ເຊື່ອງໄວ້. "
"ຄວນປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານຮູ້ແນ່ນອນວ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການມັນ "
"ເພາະການປ່ຽນຈາກຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບເຄື່ອງມື ຫຼື ປລັກອິນບາງຢ່າງທີ່ຕ້ອງການໂຟນເດີ "
"[code].godot[/code] ແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The project's human-readable version identifier. This is used by exporters if "
"the version identifier isn't overridden there. If [member application/config/"
"version] is an empty string and the version identifier isn't overridden in an "
"exporter, the exporter will use [code]1.0.0[/code] as a version identifier."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວລະບຸເວີຊັນຂອງໂຄງການທີ່ຄົນສາມາດອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວສົ່ງອອກ ຫາກຕົວລະບຸເວີຊັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກ "
"override ຢູ່ບ່ອນນັ້ນ. ຫາກ [member application/config/version] ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງເປົ່າ ແລະ "
"ຕົວລະບຸເວີຊັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກ override ໃນຕົວສົ່ງອອກ, ຕົວສົ່ງອອກຈະໃຊ້ [code]1.0.0[/code] "
"ເປັນຕົວລະບຸເວີຊັນ."

msgid ""
"Icon set in [code].ico[/code] format used on Windows to set the game's icon. "
"This is done automatically on start by calling [method "
"DisplayServer.set_native_icon]."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນໃນຮູບແບບ [code].ico[/code] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ Windows ເພື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນໄອຄອນຂອງເກມ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກເຮັດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"DisplayServer.set_native_icon]."

msgid ""
"Time samples for frame deltas are subject to random variation introduced by "
"the platform, even when frames are displayed at regular intervals thanks to V-"
"Sync. This can lead to jitter. Delta smoothing can often give a better result "
"by filtering the input deltas to correct for minor fluctuations from the "
"refresh rate.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Delta smoothing is only attempted when [member display/window/"
"vsync/vsync_mode] is set to [code]enabled[/code], as it does not work well "
"without V-Sync.\n"
"It may take several seconds at a stable frame rate before the smoothing is "
"initially activated. It will only be active on machines where performance is "
"adequate to render frames at the refresh rate."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງເວລາສຳລັບ frame deltas ອາດຈະມີການປ່ຽນແປງແບບສຸ່ມທີ່ເກີດຈາກແພລດຟອມ, "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເຟຣມຈະຖືກສະແດງເປັນໄລຍະປົກກະຕິຍ້ອນ V-Sync ກໍຕາມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການກະຕຸກ "
"(jitter). ການເຮັດໃຫ້ Delta ລຽບ (Delta smoothing) ມັກຈະໃຫ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ດີກວ່າໂດຍການກັ່ນກອງ "
"input deltas ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂການຜັນຜວນເລັກນ້ອຍຈາກ refresh rate.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Delta smoothing ຈະຖືກທົດລອງໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member display/window/vsync/"
"vsync_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]enabled[/code], ເພາະມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ບໍ່ດີຫາກບໍ່ມີ V-Sync.\n"
"ມັນອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍວິນາທີໃນອັດຕາເຟຣມທີ່ຄົງທີ່ ກ່ອນທີ່ການເຮັດໃຫ້ລຽບຈະເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ. "
"ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກສະເພາະໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບພຽງພໍທີ່ຈະເຣັນເດີເຟຣມຕາມ refresh rate ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], disables printing to standard error. If [code]true[/"
"code], this also hides error and warning messages printed by [method "
"@GlobalScope.push_error] and [method @GlobalScope.push_warning]. See also "
"[member application/run/disable_stdout].\n"
"Changes to this setting will only be applied upon restarting the application. "
"To control this at runtime, use [member Engine.print_error_messages]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະປິດການພິມອອກທາງ standard error. ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code], ມັນຈະເຊື່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດ ແລະ ຄຳເຕືອນທີ່ຖືກພິມໂດຍ [method @GlobalScope.push_error] "
"ແລະ [method @GlobalScope.push_warning] ນຳ. ເບິ່ງ [member application/run/"
"disable_stdout] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"ການປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃໝ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມສິ່ງນີ້ໃນເວລາ runtime, "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member Engine.print_error_messages]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], disables printing to standard output. This is "
"equivalent to starting the editor or project with the [code]--quiet[/code] "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command line "
"argument[/url]. See also [member application/run/disable_stderr].\n"
"Changes to this setting will only be applied upon restarting the application. "
"To control this at runtime, use [member Engine.print_to_stdout]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະປິດການພິມອອກທາງ standard output. ນີ້ເທົ່າກັບການເລີ່ມຕົວແກ້ໄຂ "
"ຫຼື ໂຄງການດ້ວຍ argument [code]--quiet[/code]. ເບິ່ງ [member application/run/"
"disable_stderr] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"ການປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃໝ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມສິ່ງນີ້ໃນເວລາ runtime, "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member Engine.print_to_stdout]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows the [kbd]Alt + Space[/kbd] keys to display the "
"window menu. This menu allows the user to perform various window management "
"operations such as moving, resizing, or minimizing the window.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When the menu is displayed, project execution will pause until "
"the menu is [i]fully[/i] closed due to Windows behavior. Consider this when "
"enabling this setting in a networked multiplayer game. The menu is only "
"considered fully closed when an option is selected, when the user clicks "
"outside, or when [kbd]Escape[/kbd] is pressed after bringing up the window "
"menu [i]and[/i] another key is pressed afterwards.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented only on Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ [kbd]Alt + Space[/kbd] "
"ເພື່ອສະແດງເມນູໜ້າຕ່າງ. ເມນູນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງໄດ້ຫຼາຍຢ່າງ ເຊັ່ນ ການຍ້າຍ, ປັບຂະໜາດ ຫຼື "
"ຫຍໍ້ໜ້າຕ່າງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອເມນູສະແດງຂຶ້ນ, ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງໂຄງການຈະຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວຈົນກວ່າເມນູຈະຖືກປິດລົງ "
"[i]ຢ່າງສົມບູນ[/i] ເນື່ອງຈາກຮູບແບບການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ Windows. "
"ຄວນຄຳນຶງເຖິງເລື່ອງນີ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃນເກມທີ່ຫຼິ້ນຫຼາຍຄົນຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ. "
"ເມນູຈະຖືວ່າປິດຢ່າງສົມບູນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີການເລືອກຕົວເລືອກໃດໜຶ່ງ, ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄລິກຂ້າງນອກ, ຫຼື ເມື່ອກົດ "
"[kbd]Escape[/kbd] ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ເປີດເມນູຂຶ້ນມາ [i]ແລະ[/i] ມີການກົດປຸ່ມອື່ນຕາມຫຼັງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ Windows ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], flushes the standard output stream every time a line is "
"printed. This affects both terminal logging and file logging.\n"
"When running a project, this setting must be enabled if you want logs to be "
"collected by service managers such as systemd/journalctl. This setting is "
"disabled by default on release builds, since flushing on every printed line "
"will negatively affect performance if lots of lines are printed in a rapid "
"succession. Also, if this setting is enabled, logged files will still be "
"written successfully if the application crashes or is otherwise killed by the "
"user (without being closed \"normally\").\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Regardless of this setting, the standard error stream "
"([code]stderr[/code]) is always flushed when a line is printed to it.\n"
"Changes to this setting will only be applied upon restarting the application."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເຮັດການ flush standard output stream "
"ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການພິມແຖວໃໝ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ທັງການເກັບລັອກ (log) ໃນ terminal ແລະ ໃນໄຟລ໌.\n"
"ເມື່ອເປີດໂຄງການ, ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ລັອກຖືກເກັບໂດຍ service manager ເຊັ່ນ "
"systemd/journalctl. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກປິດໄວ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນ release build ເພາະການ flush "
"ທຸກແຖວຈະສົ່ງຜົນລົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຫາກມີການພິມຫຼາຍແຖວຕິດຕໍ່ກັນຢ່າງໄວວາ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້, "
"ໄຟລ໌ລັອກຈະຍັງຖືກຂຽນຢ່າງສຳເລັດຫາກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຄ້າງ ຫຼື ຖືກປິດໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ (ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ປິດແບບປົກກະຕິ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່າຈະຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ແນວໃດ, standard error stream ([code]stderr[/"
"code]) ຈະຖືກ flush ສະເໝີເມື່ອມີການພິມລົງໄປ.\n"
"ການປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃໝ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Debug build override for [member application/run/flush_stdout_on_print], as "
"performance is less important during debugging.\n"
"Changes to this setting will only be applied upon restarting the application."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ override ສຳລັບ Debug build ຂອງ [member application/run/"
"flush_stdout_on_print], ເນື່ອງຈາກປະສິດທິພາບມີຄວາມສຳຄັນໜ້ອຍກວ່າໃນລະຫວ່າງການກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"(debugging).\n"
"ການປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃໝ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Forces a [i]constant[/i] delay between frames in the main loop (in "
"milliseconds). In most situations, [member application/run/max_fps] should be "
"preferred as an FPS limiter as it's more precise.\n"
"This setting can be overridden using the [code]--frame-delay <ms;>[/code] "
"command line argument."
msgstr ""
"ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີການຊ້າ (delay) [i]ຄົງທີ່[/i] ລະຫວ່າງເຟຣມໃນ loop ຫຼັກ (ເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ). "
"ໃນສະຖານະການສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, [member application/run/max_fps] ຈະດີກວ່າໃນການຈຳກັດ FPS "
"ເພາະມີຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳກວ່າ.\n"
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດຖືກ override ໂດຍໃຊ້ argument [code]--frame-delay <ms>[/code] ໃນ "
"command line."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], loads the default shell and copies environment "
"variables set by the shell startup scripts to the app environment.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented on macOS for non-sandboxed "
"applications only."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໂຫຼດ shell ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ກັອບປີ້ຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ "
"(environment variables) ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ shell startup scripts "
"ໄປຍັງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງແອັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ macOS ສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນ sandbox ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables low-processor usage mode. When enabled, the "
"engine takes longer to redraw, but only redraws the screen if necessary. This "
"may lower power consumption, and is intended for editors or mobile "
"applications. For most games, because the screen needs to be redrawn every "
"frame, it is recommended to keep this setting disabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດປະຢັດການໃຊ້ງານໜ່ວຍປະມວນຜົນ (low-processor "
"usage mode). ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້, ເຄື່ອງຈັກຈະໃຊ້ເວລາໃນການແຕ້ມໜ້າຈໍໃໝ່ດົນຂຶ້ນ "
"ແຕ່ຈະແຕ້ມສະເພາະເມື່ອຈຳເປັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການໃຊ້ພະລັງງານ ແລະ ເໝາະສຳລັບຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື "
"ແອັບມືຖື. ສຳລັບເກມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ເນື່ອງຈາກໜ້າຈໍຕ້ອງຖືກແຕ້ມໃໝ່ທຸກເຟຣມ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປິດຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Amount of sleeping between frames when the low-processor usage mode is "
"enabled (in microseconds). Higher values will result in lower CPU usage."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະເວລາການຢຸດພັກ (sleeping) ລະຫວ່າງເຟຣມເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດປະຢັດການໃຊ້ງານໜ່ວຍປະມວນຜົນ "
"(ເປັນໄມໂຄຣວິນາທີ). ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ການໃຊ້ CPU ຕ່ຳລົງ."

msgid "The name of the type implementing the engine's main loop."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງປະເພດ (type) ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ loop ຫຼັກຂອງເຄື່ອງຈັກ."

msgid "Path to the main scene file that will be loaded when the project runs."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ສາກ (scene) ຫຼັກທີ່ຈະຖືກໂຫຼດເມື່ອໂຄງການເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of frames per second allowed. A value of [code]0[/code] means "
"\"no limit\". The actual number of frames per second may still be below this "
"value if the CPU or GPU cannot keep up with the project logic and rendering.\n"
"Limiting the FPS can be useful to reduce system power consumption, which "
"reduces heat and noise emissions (and improves battery life on mobile "
"devices).\n"
"If [member display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] is set to [code]Enabled[/code] or "
"[code]Adaptive[/code], it takes precedence and the forced FPS number cannot "
"exceed the monitor's refresh rate. See also [method "
"DisplayServer.screen_get_refresh_rate].\n"
"If [member display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] is [code]Enabled[/code], on "
"monitors with variable refresh rate enabled (G-Sync/FreeSync), using an FPS "
"limit slightly lower than the monitor's refresh rate will [url=https://"
"blurbusters.com/howto-low-lag-vsync-on/]reduce input lag while avoiding "
"tearing[/url]. At higher refresh rates, the difference between the FPS limit "
"and the monitor refresh rate should be increased to ensure frames to account "
"for timing inaccuracies. The optimal formula for the FPS limit value in this "
"scenario is [code]r - (r * r) / 3600.0[/code], where [code]r[/code] is the "
"monitor's refresh rate.\n"
"If [member display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] is [code]Disabled[/code], "
"limiting the FPS to a high value that can be consistently reached on the "
"system can reduce input lag compared to an uncapped framerate. Since this "
"works by ensuring the GPU load is lower than 100%, this latency reduction is "
"only effective in GPU-bottlenecked scenarios, not CPU-bottlenecked "
"scenarios.\n"
"See also [member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second].\n"
"This setting can be overridden using the [code]--max-fps <fps>[/code] command "
"line argument (including with a value of [code]0[/code] for unlimited "
"framerate).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the rendering FPS cap at runtime, set [member Engine.max_fps] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນເຟຣມສູງສຸດຕໍ່ວິນາທີທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ. ຄ່າ [code]0[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງ \"ບໍ່ຈຳກັດ\". "
"ຈຳນວນເຟຣມຕົວຈິງອາດຈະຕ່ຳກວ່າຄ່ານີ້ຫາກ CPU ຫຼື GPU ບໍ່ສາມາດປະມວນຜົນຕາມທັນ.\n"
"ການຈຳກັດ FPS ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການໃຊ້ພະລັງງານຂອງລະບົບ, ຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມຮ້ອນ ແລະ ສຽງລົບກວນ "
"(ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແບັດເຕີຣີໃນອຸປະກອນມືຖືໃຊ້ໄດ້ດົນຂຶ້ນ).\n"
"ຫາກ [member display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]Enabled[/code] ຫຼື "
"[code]Adaptive[/code], ມັນຈະມີບຸລິມະສິດສູງກວ່າ ແລະ ຈຳນວນ FPS ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເກີນ refresh "
"rate ຂອງຈໍໄດ້.\n"
"ຫາກເປີດ V-Sync ໃນຈໍທີ່ມີ Variable Refresh Rate (G-Sync/FreeSync), ການຕັ້ງ FPS "
"ໃຫ້ຕ່ຳກວ່າ refresh rate ເລັກນ້ອຍຈະຊ່ວຍ [url=https://blurbusters.com/howto-low-lag-"
"vsync-on/]ຫຼຸດ input lag ແລະ ປ້ອງກັນພາບຂາດ (tearing)[/url].\n"
"ຫາກປິດ V-Sync, ການຈຳກັດ FPS ໄວ້ທີ່ຄ່າສູງທີ່ລະບົບເຮັດໄດ້ຄົງທີ່ ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດ input lag "
"ໄດ້ເມື່ອທຽບກັບການບໍ່ຈຳກັດເລີຍ ເພາະມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ GPU ບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກໜັກເຖິງ 100%.\n"
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດ override ໄດ້ຜ່ານ argument [code]--max-fps <fps>[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານຕອນເລີ່ມໂຄງການເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດວຽກ, "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member Engine.max_fps] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the engine header is printed in the console on startup. "
"This header describes the current version of the engine, as well as the "
"renderer being used. This behavior can also be disabled on the command line "
"with the [code]--no-header[/code] option."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສ່ວນຫົວຂອງເຄື່ອງຈັກ (engine header) "
"ຈະຖືກພິມໃນຄອນໂຊນເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສ່ວນຫົວນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍເວີຊັນປັດຈຸບັນຂອງເຄື່ອງຈັກ ລວມທັງ renderer "
"ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ຢູ່. ສາມາດປິດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ຜ່ານ argument [code]--no-header[/code] ໃນ command line."

msgid ""
"Audio buses will disable automatically when sound goes below a given dB "
"threshold for a given time. This saves CPU as effects assigned to that bus "
"will no longer do any processing."
msgstr ""
"ບັສສຽງ (Audio buses) ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອລະດັບສຽງຕ່ຳກວ່າເກນ dB "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນໄລຍະເວລາໜຶ່ງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍປະຢັດ CPU ເພາະເອັບເຟັກຕ່າງໆທີ່ຢູ່ໃນບັສນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ຖືກປະມວນຜົນອີກ."

msgid ""
"Default [AudioBusLayout] resource file to use in the project, unless "
"overridden by the scene."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [AudioBusLayout] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນໂຄງການ, ນອກຈາກວ່າຈະຖືກ override "
"ໂດຍສາກ."

msgid ""
"Target mixing rate used for audio (in Hz). In general, it's better to not "
"touch this and leave it to the host operating system.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On iOS and macOS, mixing rate is determined by audio driver, "
"this value is ignored.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Input and output mixing rates might be different. Use [method "
"AudioServer.get_mix_rate] and [method AudioServer.get_input_mix_rate] to get "
"actual values."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາການປະສົມສຽງ (mixing rate) ເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບສຽງ (ເປັນ Hz). ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, "
"ບໍ່ຄວນປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ ແລະ ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການເປັນຜູ້ຈັດການ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ iOS ແລະ macOS, mixing rate ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍໄດເວີສຽງ, "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອັດຕາການປະສົມສຽງຂອງ input ແລະ output ອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

msgid ""
"Safer override for [member audio/driver/mix_rate] in the Web platform. Here "
"[code]0[/code] means \"let the browser choose\" (since some browsers do not "
"like forcing the mix rate)."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ override ທີ່ປອດໄພກວ່າສຳລັບ [member audio/driver/mix_rate] ໃນແພລດຟອມ Web. ຄ່າ "
"[code]0[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງ \"ໃຫ້ບຣາວເຊີເປັນຜູ້ເລືອກ\"."

msgid ""
"Specifies the preferred output latency in milliseconds for audio. Lower "
"values will result in lower audio latency at the cost of increased CPU usage. "
"Low values may result in audible crackling on slower hardware.\n"
"Audio output latency may be constrained by the host operating system and "
"audio hardware drivers. If the host can not provide the specified audio "
"output latency then Godot will attempt to use the nearest latency allowed by "
"the host. As such you should always use [method "
"AudioServer.get_output_latency] to determine the actual audio output "
"latency.\n"
"Audio output latency can be overridden using the [code]--audio-output-latency "
"<ms>[/code] command line argument.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is ignored on Android."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄວາມໜ່ວງ (latency) ຂອງ output ສຽງທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງສຽງຫຼຸດລົງ ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍການໃຊ້ CPU ທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳເກີນໄປອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດສຽງແຕກໃນຮາດແວທີ່ຊ້າ.\n"
"ຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງ output ສຽງອາດຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ໄດເວີຮາດແວສຽງ. "
"ຫາກລະບົບບໍ່ສາມາດໃຫ້ຄວາມໜ່ວງຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄດ້, Godot ຈະພະຍາຍາມໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງທີ່ສຸດທີ່ລະບົບອະນຸຍາດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍໃນ Android."

msgid ""
"Safer override for [member audio/driver/output_latency] in the Web platform, "
"to avoid audio issues especially on mobile devices."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ override ທີ່ປອດໄພກວ່າສຳລັບ [member audio/driver/output_latency] ໃນແພລດຟອມ Web "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫາສຽງ ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນອຸປະກອນມືຖື."

msgid ""
"The base strength of the panning effect for all [AudioStreamPlayer3D] nodes. "
"The panning strength can be further scaled on each Node using [member "
"AudioStreamPlayer3D.panning_strength]. A value of [code]0.0[/code] disables "
"stereo panning entirely, leaving only volume attenuation in place. A value of "
"[code]1.0[/code] completely mutes one of the channels if the sound is located "
"exactly to the left (or right) of the listener.\n"
"The default value of [code]0.5[/code] is tuned for headphones which means "
"that the opposite side channel goes no lower than 50% of the volume of the "
"nearside channel. You may find that you can set this value higher for "
"speakers to have the same effect since both ears can hear from each speaker."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງພື້ນຖານຂອງເອັບເຟັກການແຍກສຽງຊ້າຍ-ຂວາ (panning) ສຳລັບທຸກໂນດ "
"[AudioStreamPlayer3D]. ຄ່າ [code]0.0[/code] ຈະປິດການແຍກສຽງສະເຕີຣິໂອຢ່າງສົມບູນ. ຄ່າ "
"[code]0.5[/code] ຖືກປັບມາສຳລັບຫູຟັງ ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າສຽງໃນຊ່ອງທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມຈະບໍ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ 50% "
"ຂອງຄວາມແຮງສຽງຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Specifies the default playback type of the platform.\n"
"The default value is set to [b]Stream[/b], as most platforms have no issues "
"mixing streams."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຮູບແບບການຫຼິ້ນ (playback type) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງແພລດຟອມ.\n"
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Stream[/b], ເພາະແພລດຟອມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ບໍ່ມີບັນຫາໃນການປະສົມ stream."

msgid ""
"Specifies the default playback type of the Web platform.\n"
"The default value is set to [b]Sample[/b] as the Web platform is not suited "
"to mix audio streams outside of the Web Audio API, especially when exporting "
"a single-threaded game. [b]Sample[/b] allows for lower latency on the web "
"platform at the cost of flexibility ([AudioEffect]s are not supported).\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Forcing [b]Stream[/b] on the Web platform may cause high "
"audio latency and crackling, especially when exporting a multi-threaded game."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຮູບແບບການຫຼິ້ນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງແພລດຟອມ Web.\n"
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Sample[/b] ເພາະແພລດຟອມ Web ບໍ່ເໝາະສົມໃນການປະສົມ audio stream "
"ຢູ່ນອກ Web Audio API. [b]Sample[/b] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຄວາມໜ່ວງຕ່ຳລົງໃນເວັບ ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ "
"[AudioEffect] ໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ການບັງຄັບໃຊ້ [b]Stream[/b] ໃນເວັບອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງໜ່ວງຫຼາຍ ແລະ ມີສຽງແຕກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/avfaudio/"
"avaudiosession/categoryoptions/1616611-mixwithothers]mixWithOthers[/url] "
"option for the AVAudioSession on iOS. This will override the mix behavior, if "
"the category is set to [code]Play and Record[/code], [code]Playback[/code], "
"or [code]Multi Route[/code].\n"
"[code]Ambient[/code] always has this set per default."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກ [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/avfaudio/"
"avaudiosession/categoryoptions/1616611-mixwithothers]mixWithOthers[/url] ສຳລັບ "
"AVAudioSession ໃນ iOS."

msgid ""
"Sets the [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/avfaudio/"
"avaudiosessioncategory]AVAudioSessionCategory[/url] on iOS. Use the "
"[code]Playback[/code] category to get sound output, even if the phone is in "
"silent mode."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/avfaudio/"
"avaudiosessioncategory]AVAudioSessionCategory[/url] ໃນ iOS. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[code]Playback[/code] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີສຽງອອກມາ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໂທລະສັບຈະຢູ່ໃນໂໝດປິດສຽງກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], text-to-speech support is enabled on startup, otherwise "
"it is enabled the first time any TTS method is used. See also [method "
"DisplayServer.tts_get_voices] and [method DisplayServer.tts_speak].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Enabling TTS can cause additional idle CPU usage and interfere "
"with the sleep mode, so consider disabling it if TTS is not used."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການຮອງຮັບການປ່ຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນສຽງເວົ້າ (text-to-speech) "
"ເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດ TTS ໃດໜຶ່ງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເປີດໃຊ້ TTS ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ CPU ເຮັດວຽກເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນໃນເວລາຫວ່າງ, "
"ຄວນປິດໄວ້ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Setting to hardcode audio delay when playing video. Best to leave this "
"unchanged unless you know what you are doing."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອລະບຸຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງສຽງ (audio delay) ແບບຄົງທີ່ເມື່ອຫຼິ້ນວິດີໂອ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປະໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ "
"ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ທ່ານຈະຮູ້ວ່າກຳລັງເຮັດຫຍັງຢູ່."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], ambient lights will be imported from COLLADA models as "
"[DirectionalLight3D]. If [code]false[/code], ambient lights will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແສງສະຫວ່າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (ambient lights) "
"ຈະຖືກນຳເຂົ້າຈາກໂມເດລ COLLADA ໃນຮູບແບບ [DirectionalLight3D]. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/"
"code], ຈະບໍ່ນຳເຂົ້າມັນ."

msgid ""
"The default compression level for gzip. Affects compressed scenes and "
"resources. Higher levels result in smaller files at the cost of compression "
"speed. Decompression speed is mostly unaffected by the compression level. "
"[code]-1[/code] uses the default gzip compression level, which is identical "
"to [code]6[/code] but could change in the future due to underlying zlib "
"updates."
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບການບີບອັດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ gzip. ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ສາກ ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດ. "
"ລະດັບທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍລົງ ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ເວລາໃນການບີບອັດດົນຂຶ້ນ. [code]-1[/code] "
"ແມ່ນໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ເຊິ່ງເທົ່າກັບ [code]6[/code])."

msgid ""
"The default compression level for Zlib. Affects compressed scenes and "
"resources. Higher levels result in smaller files at the cost of compression "
"speed. Decompression speed is mostly unaffected by the compression level. "
"[code]-1[/code] uses the default gzip compression level, which is identical "
"to [code]6[/code] but could change in the future due to underlying zlib "
"updates."
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບການບີບອັດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ Zlib. ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ສາກ ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດ. [code]-1[/code] "
"ແມ່ນໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ເຊິ່ງເທົ່າກັບ [code]6[/code])."

msgid ""
"The default compression level for Zstandard. Affects compressed scenes and "
"resources. Higher levels result in smaller files at the cost of compression "
"speed. Decompression speed is mostly unaffected by the compression level."
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບການບີບອັດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ Zstandard. ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ສາກ ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດ. "
"ລະດັບທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Enables [url=https://github.com/facebook/zstd/releases/tag/v1.3.2]long-"
"distance matching[/url] in Zstandard."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ [url=https://github.com/facebook/zstd/releases/tag/v1.3.2]long-distance "
"matching[/url] ໃນ Zstandard."

msgid ""
"Largest size limit (in power of 2) allowed when compressing using long-"
"distance matching with Zstandard. Higher values can result in better "
"compression, but will require more memory when compressing and decompressing."
msgstr ""
"ຂີດຈຳກັດຂະໜາດສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດເມື່ອໃຊ້ long-distance matching ໃນ Zstandard. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບີບອັດໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ ແຕ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If canvas item redraw debugging is active, this color will be flashed on "
"canvas items when they redraw."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ການກວດສອບການແຕ້ມໃໝ່ຂອງ canvas item, ສີນີ້ຈະກະພິບໃສ່ canvas items "
"ເມື່ອພວກມັນມີການແຕ້ມໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"If canvas item redraw debugging is active, this will be the time the flash "
"will last each time they redraw."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ການກວດສອບການແຕ້ມໃໝ່ຂອງ canvas item, "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ການກະພິບຈະສະແດງອອກມາໃນແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], logs all output and error messages to files. See also "
"[member debug/file_logging/log_path], [member debug/file_logging/"
"max_log_files], and [member application/run/flush_stdout_on_print]."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະບັນທຶກທຸກ output ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດລົງໃນໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"Desktop override for [member debug/file_logging/enable_file_logging], as log "
"files are not readily accessible on mobile/Web platforms."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ override ສຳລັບ Desktop ຂອງ [member debug/file_logging/enable_file_logging] "
"ເພາະໄຟລ໌ລັອກເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຍາກໃນແພລດຟອມມືຖື ຫຼື Web."

msgid ""
"Path at which to store log files for the project. Using a path under "
"[code]user://[/code] is recommended.\n"
"This can be specified manually on the command line using the [code]--log-file "
"<file>[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url]. If this command line "
"argument is specified, log rotation is automatically disabled (see [member "
"debug/file_logging/max_log_files])."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງສຳລັບເກັບໄຟລ໌ລັອກຂອງໂຄງການ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເສັ້ນທາງພາຍໃຕ້ [code]user://[/code]."

msgid ""
"Specifies the maximum number of log files allowed (used for rotation). Set to "
"[code]1[/code] to disable log file rotation.\n"
"If the [code]--log-file <file>[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url] is used, log rotation "
"is always disabled."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ລັອກສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການວົນຮອບ/rotation). ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]1[/code] "
"ເພື່ອປິດການວົນຮອບໄຟລ໌ລັອກ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when an [code]assert[/code] call always evaluates to "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ຕາມລຳດັບ "
"ເມື່ອການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [code]assert[/code] ໃຫ້ຜົນເປັນ [code]false[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when an [code]assert[/code] call always evaluates to [code]true[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ຕາມລຳດັບ "
"ເມື່ອການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [code]assert[/code] ໃຫ້ຜົນເປັນ [code]true[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a local variable captured by a lambda is reassigned, since "
"this does not modify the outer local variable."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອຕົວແປທ້ອງຖິ່ນ "
"(local variable) ທີ່ຖືກຈັບໂດຍ lambda ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໃໝ່ ເພາະມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງຕົວແປທ້ອງຖິ່ນທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງນອກ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when an identifier contains characters that can be confused with "
"something else, like when mixing different alphabets."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອຊື່ຕົວລະບຸ "
"(identifier) ມີຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ສັບສົນກັບສິ່ງອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when an identifier declared in the nested block has the same "
"name as an identifier declared below in the parent block."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"ເມື່ອຕົວລະບຸທີ່ປະກາດໃນບລັອກຊ້ອນໃນມີຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບຕົວລະບຸທີ່ປະກາດຂ້າງລຸ່ມໃນບລັອກແມ່."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when an identifier that will be shadowed below in the block is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"ເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ຕົວລະບຸທີ່ຈະຖືກບັງຊື່ (shadowed) ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມໃນບລັອກ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a built-in property of type [code]Packed*Array[/code] is "
"modified using a complex assignment chain or a non-[code]const[/code] method "
"call. In this case, you are only modifying a temporary value, and the "
"property's value remains unchanged."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"ເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ປະເພດ [code]Packed*Array[/code] "
"ຖືກແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍການກຳນົດຄ່າແບບຕ່ອງໂສ້ທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ ເພາະມັນຈະປ່ຽນແຕ່ຄ່າຊົ່ວຄາວ ແລະ "
"ຄ່າຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດຕົວຈິງຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when deprecated keywords are used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] There are currently no deprecated keywords, so this warning is "
"never produced."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ຄຳສັບຫຼັກ "
"(keywords) ທີ່ຖືກຍົກເລີກແລ້ວ (deprecated)."

msgid ""
"The rules for including or excluding scripts when generating warnings, as a "
"dictionary. Each rule is an entry consisting of a directory path (key) and a "
"decision (value). When trying to generate a warning, the GDScript parser "
"chooses the most specific rule, i.e. the most nested directory containing the "
"script. If the decision is [b]Exclude[/b], warnings are not generated for "
"this script. If the decision is [b]Include[/b] or the script doesn't satisfy "
"any of the rules, the warning configuration specified in the Project Settings "
"is applied.\n"
"It is recommended to include your own addons/libraries, either project-"
"specific or actively being developed at the moment. Third-party or project-"
"agnostic addons/libraries should be excluded, as they may be incompatible "
"with the project's warning configuration.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is not recommended to remove or change the rule for [code]"
"\"res://addons\"[/code] as the project's warning configuration may break "
"third-party addons. Instead, consider including individual addons, if "
"necessary.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The editor does not check whether the specified paths are "
"existing directories. It also does not automatically update these paths when "
"directories are moved."
msgstr ""
"ກົດເກນໃນການລວມ ຫຼື ຍົກເວັ້ນສະຄຣິບເມື່ອສ້າງຄຳເຕືອນ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ລວມສ່ວນເສີມ/ໄລບຣາຣີຂອງເຈົ້າເອງ ແລະ "
"ຍົກເວັ້ນສ່ວນເສີມຂອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມ ເພາະພວກມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຳເຕືອນຂອງໂຄງການ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when an empty file is parsed."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອມີການປະມວນຜົນ "
"(parse) ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables specific GDScript warnings (see [code]debug/"
"gdscript/warnings/*[/code] settings). If [code]false[/code], disables all "
"GDScript warnings."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ຄຳເຕືອນ GDScript ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/"
"code], ຈະປິດຄຳເຕືອນ GDScript ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a variable has an enum type but no explicit default value, "
"but only if the enum does not contain [code]0[/code] as a valid value."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອຕົວແປມີປະເພດເປັນ "
"enum ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when [method Node.get_node] (or the shorthand [code]$[/code]) is "
"used as default value of a class variable without the [code]@onready[/code] "
"annotation."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [method "
"Node.get_node] (ຫຼື [code]$[/code]) ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຕົວແປໃນຄລາດ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຄຳອະທິບາຍ "
"[code]@onready[/code]."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a ternary operator may emit values with incompatible types."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອຕົວດຳເນີນການ "
"ternary ອາດຈະສົ່ງຄ່າທີ່ມີປະເພດທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນບໍ່ໄດ້ອອກມາ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a static inferred type uses a [Variant] as initial value, "
"which makes the static type to also be Variant."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"ເມື່ອປະເພດທີ່ຄາດເດົາແບບສະແຕຕິກ (static inferred type) ໃຊ້ [Variant] ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a variable, constant, or parameter has an implicitly "
"inferred static type. In GDScript, type inference is performed by declaring a "
"variable with [code]:=[/code] instead of [code]=[/code] and leaving out the "
"type specifier. For example, [code]var x := 1[/code] will [i]infer[/i] the "
"[int] type, while [code]var x: int = 1[/code] explicitly declares the "
"variable as [int].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This warning is recommended [i]in addition[/i] to [member debug/"
"gdscript/warnings/untyped_declaration] if you want to always specify the type "
"explicitly. Having [code]INFERRED_DECLARATION[/code] warning level higher "
"than [code]UNTYPED_DECLARATION[/code] warning level makes little sense and is "
"not recommended."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອຕົວແປ, ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ ຫຼື "
"ພາຣາມິເຕີ ມີການຄາດເດົາປະເພດແບບສະແຕຕິກໂດຍທາງອ້ອມ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when trying to use an integer as an enum without an explicit "
"cast."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"ເມື່ອພະຍາຍາມໃຊ້ເລກຈຳນວນເຕັມ (integer) ເປັນ enum ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການ cast ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when trying to use an integer as an enum when there is no "
"matching enum member for that numeric value."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"ເມື່ອພະຍາຍາມໃຊ້ເລກຈຳນວນເຕັມເປັນ enum ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີສະມາຊິກ enum ທີ່ກົງກັບຄ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when dividing an integer by another integer (the decimal part "
"will be discarded)."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"ເມື່ອຫານເລກຈຳນວນເຕັມດ້ວຍເລກຈຳນວນເຕັມອີກຕົວໜຶ່ງ (ສ່ວນທົດສະນິຍົມຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ)."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when calling a coroutine without [code]await[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"coroutine ໂດຍບໍ່ມີ [code]await[/code]."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when the base class script has the [code]@tool[/code] "
"annotation, but the current class script does not have it."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອສະຄຣິບຄລາດແມ່ມີ "
"[code]@tool[/code] ແຕ່ສະຄຣິບຄລາດປັດຈຸບັນບໍ່ມີ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when passing a floating-point value to a function that expects "
"an integer (it will be converted and lose precision)."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"ເມື່ອສົ່ງຄ່າເລກທົດສະນິຍົມໃຫ້ກັບຟັງຊັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການເລກຈຳນວນເຕັມ (ມັນຈະຖືກແປງ ແລະ "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳເສຍໄປ)."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a method in the script overrides a native method, because "
"it may not behave as expected."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອເມທອດໃນສະຄຣິບໄປ "
"override ເມທອດຂອງລະບົບ (native method) ເພາະມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when the [code]@onready[/code] annotation is used together with "
"the [code]@export[/code] annotation, since it may not behave as expected."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ "
"[code]@onready[/code] ຮ່ວມກັບ [code]@export[/code]."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a function that is not a coroutine is called with await."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ "
"coroutine ດ້ວຍ await."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when the [code]@static_unload[/code] annotation is used in a "
"script without any static variables."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"[code]@static_unload[/code] ໃນສະຄຣິບທີ່ບໍ່ມີຕົວແປສະແຕຕິກເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"When enabled, using a property, enum, or function that was renamed since "
"Godot 3 will produce a hint if an error occurs."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້, ການໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ, enum ຫຼື ຟັງຊັນທີ່ຖືກປ່ຽນຊື່ຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 3 ຈະມີການແນະນຳຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when calling a function without using its return value (by "
"assigning it to a variable or using it as a function argument). These return "
"values are sometimes used to indicate possible errors using the [enum Error] "
"enum."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ມັນສົ່ງກັບຄືນມາ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when defining a local or member variable, signal, or enum that "
"would have the same name as a built-in function or global class name, thus "
"shadowing it."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອປະກາດຕົວແປ, "
"ສັນຍານ ຫຼື enum ທີ່ມີຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ ຫຼື ຊື່ຄລາດລະດັບໂລກ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a local variable or local constant shadows a member "
"declared in the current class."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອຕົວແປທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ຫຼື "
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ໄປບັງຊື່ສະມາຊິກທີ່ປະກາດໄວ້ໃນຄລາດປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a local variable or local constant shadows a member "
"declared in a base class."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອຕົວແປທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ຫຼື "
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ໄປບັງຊື່ສະມາຊິກທີ່ປະກາດໄວ້ໃນຄລາດແມ່."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when calling an expression that may have no effect on the "
"surrounding code, such as writing [code]2 + 2[/code] as a statement."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ງານນິພົດ "
"(expression) ທີ່ອາດຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆຕໍ່ໂຄ້ດ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when calling a ternary expression that may have no effect on the "
"surrounding code, such as writing [code]42 if active else 0[/code] as a "
"statement."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ternary "
"expression ທີ່ອາດຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆຕໍ່ໂຄ້ດ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when calling a static method from an instance of a class instead "
"of from the class directly."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ static "
"method ຜ່ານ instance ຂອງຄລາດ ແທນທີ່ຈະເອີ້ນຈາກຄລາດໂດຍກົງ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when using a variable that wasn't previously assigned."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"ເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ຕົວແປທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າມາກ່ອນ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when assigning a variable using an assignment operator like "
"[code]+=[/code] if the variable wasn't previously assigned."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"ເມື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າຕົວແປໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການເຊັ່ນ [code]+=[/code] ຫາກຕົວແປນັ້ນຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າມາກ່ອນ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when unreachable code is detected (such as after a [code]return[/"
"code] statement that will always be executed)."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"ເມື່ອພົບໂຄ້ດທີ່ບໍ່ມີທາງເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ (ເຊັ່ນ ໂຄ້ດທີ່ຢູ່ຫຼັງ [code]return[/code])."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when an unreachable [code]match[/code] pattern is detected."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອພົບຮູບແບບ "
"[code]match[/code] ທີ່ບໍ່ມີທາງເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when using an expression whose type may not be compatible with "
"the function parameter expected."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ນິພົດທີ່ປະເພດອາດຈະບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນກັບພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງຟັງຊັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a [Variant] value is cast to a non-Variant."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເມື່ອຄ່າ [Variant] "
"ຖືກ cast ໄປເປັນປະເພດອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ Variant."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when calling a method whose presence is not guaranteed at "
"compile-time in the class."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຢືນຢັນວ່າມີຢູ່ແທ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການ compile."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when accessing a property whose presence is not guaranteed at "
"compile-time in the class."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"ເມື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຢືນຢັນວ່າມີຢູ່ແທ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການ compile."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when returning a call from a [code]void[/code] function when "
"such call cannot be guaranteed to be also [code]void[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສ້າງການເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕາມລຳດັບ "
"ເມື່ອມີການສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນຈາກການເອີ້ນຟັງຊັນ [code]void[/code] "
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ການເອີ້ນນັ້ນບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບປະກັນໄດ້ວ່າເປັນ [code]void[/code] ຄືກັນ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a variable or parameter has no static type, or if a "
"function has no static return type.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This warning is recommended together with [member "
"EditorSettings.text_editor/completion/add_type_hints] to help achieve type "
"safety."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສ້າງການເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕາມລຳດັບ ເມື່ອຕົວປ່ຽນ ຫຼື "
"ພາລາມິເຕີບໍ່ມີປະເພດຄົງທີ່ (static type), ຫຼື ຖ້າຟັງຊັນບໍ່ມີປະເພດການສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນທີ່ຄົງທີ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເຕືອນນີ້ຖືກແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [member EditorSettings.text_editor/"
"completion/add_type_hints] ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນ (type safety)."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a local constant is never used."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສ້າງການເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕາມລຳດັບ "
"ເມື່ອຄ່າຄົງທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local constant) ບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a function parameter is never used."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສ້າງການເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕາມລຳດັບ "
"ເມື່ອພາລາມິເຕີຂອງຟັງຊັນບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a private member variable is never used."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສ້າງການເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕາມລຳດັບ "
"ເມື່ອຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກສ່ວນຕົວ (private member variable) ບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a signal is declared but never explicitly used in the class."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສ້າງການເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕາມລຳດັບ "
"ເມື່ອມີການປະກາດສັນຍານ (signal) ແຕ່ບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນໃນຄລາສ."

msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a local variable is unused."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Warn[/b] ຫຼື [b]Error[/b], ຈະສ້າງການເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕາມລຳດັບ "
"ເມື່ອຕົວປ່ຽນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local variable) ບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Message to be displayed before the backtrace when the engine crashes. By "
"default, this message is only used in exported projects due to the editor-"
"only override applied to this setting."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະສະແດງກ່ອນ backtrace ເມື່ອເອນຈິນ (engine) ຄ້າງ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ (exported projects) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກມີການປ່ຽນຄ່າສະເພາະຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor-only override) ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້."

msgid ""
"Editor-only override for [member debug/settings/crash_handler/message]. Does "
"not affect exported projects in debug or release mode."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນຄ່າສະເພາະຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (Editor-only override) ສຳລັບ [member debug/settings/"
"crash_handler/message]. ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໃນໂໝດ debug ຫຼື release."

msgid ""
"Whether GDScript call stacks will be tracked in release builds, thus allowing "
"[method Engine.capture_script_backtraces] to function.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect on editor builds or debug builds, "
"where GDScript call stacks are tracked regardless."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຈະໃຫ້ຕິດຕາມ GDScript call stacks ໃນການບິວແບບ release ຫຼື ບໍ່, ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ "
"[method Engine.capture_script_backtraces] ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການບິວແບບ editor ຫຼື debug, ເຊິ່ງ GDScript call stacks "
"ຈະຖືກຕິດຕາມເປັນປົກກະຕິຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Whether GDScript local variables will be tracked in all builds, including "
"export builds, thus allowing [method Engine.capture_script_backtraces] to "
"capture them when enabling its [code]include_variables[/code] parameter.\n"
"Enabling this comes at the cost of roughly 50 bytes of memory per local "
"variable, for every compiled class in the entire project, so can be several "
"MiB in larger projects.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect when running the game from the "
"editor, where GDScript local variables are tracked regardless."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຈະໃຫ້ຕິດຕາມຕົວປ່ຽນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local variables) ຂອງ GDScript ໃນທຸກໆການບິວຫຼືບໍ່, "
"ລວມທັງການບິວເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກ, ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ [method Engine.capture_script_backtraces] "
"ສາມາດເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນພວກມັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ພາລາມິເຕີ [code]include_variables[/code].\n"
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳປະມານ 50 ໄບຕ໌ ຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງຕົວປ່ຽນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, "
"ສຳລັບທຸກໆຄລາສທີ່ຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ໃນທັງໝົດໂປຣເຈັກ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະສູງເຖິງຫຼາຍ MiB ໃນໂປຣເຈັກຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນເມື່ອລັນເກມຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, ເຊິ່ງຕົວປ່ຽນທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງ GDScript "
"ຈະຖືກຕິດຕາມເປັນປົກກະຕິຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid "Maximum call stack allowed for debugging GDScript."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ call stack ສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນການ debug GDScript."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables warnings which can help pinpoint where nodes "
"are being incorrectly updated, which will result in incorrect interpolation "
"and visual glitches.\n"
"When a node is being interpolated, it is essential that the transform is set "
"during [method Node._physics_process] (during a physics tick) rather than "
"[method Node._process] (during a frame)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການເຕືອນທີ່ສາມາດຊ່ວຍລະບຸຈຸດທີ່ໂນດ (nodes) "
"ຖືກອັບເດດບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຮັດ interpolation ຜິດພາດ ແລະ ເກີດບັນຫາທາງພາບ (visual "
"glitches).\n"
"ເມື່ອໂນດກຳລັງຖືກ interpolated, ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ transform ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງໃນລະຫວ່າງ [method "
"Node._physics_process] (ໃນຊ່ວງ physics tick) ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ [method Node._process] "
"(ໃນຊ່ວງເຟຣມ)."

msgid "Maximum number of functions per frame allowed when profiling."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຟັງຊັນສູງສຸດຕໍ່ເຟຣມທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນເວລາ profiling."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of timestamp query elements allowed per frame for visual "
"profiling."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ timestamp query elements ສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດຕໍ່ເຟຣມສຳລັບ visual profiling."

msgid "Print frames per second to standard output every second."
msgstr ""
"ພິມຈຳນວນເຟຣມຕໍ່ວິນາທີ (FPS) ອອກທາງຜົນໄດ້ຮັບມາດຕະຖານ (standard output) ໃນທຸກໆວິນາທີ."

msgid ""
"Print GPU profile information to standard output every second. This includes "
"how long each frame takes the GPU to render on average, broken down into "
"different steps of the render pipeline, such as CanvasItems, shadows, glow, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"ພິມຂໍ້ມູນ GPU profile ອອກທາງຜົນໄດ້ຮັບມາດຕະຖານໃນທຸກໆວິນາທີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ລວມມີໄລຍະເວລາສະເລ່ຍທີ່ GPU "
"ໃຊ້ໃນການເຣັນເດີແຕ່ລະເຟຣມ, ໂດຍແບ່ງອອກເປັນຂັ້ນຕອນຕ່າງໆຂອງ render pipeline ເຊັ່ນ: "
"CanvasItems, ເງົາ, ແສງຟຸ້ງ (glow) ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"Print more information to standard output when running. It displays "
"information such as memory leaks, which scenes and resources are being "
"loaded, etc. This can also be enabled using the [code]--verbose[/code] or "
"[code]-v[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url], even on an exported "
"project. See also [method OS.is_stdout_verbose] and [method "
"@GlobalScope.print_verbose]."
msgstr ""
"ພິມຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມອອກທາງຜົນໄດ້ຮັບມາດຕະຖານໃນຂະນະທີ່ລັນ. ມັນຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນເຊັ່ນ: "
"ການຮົ່ວໄຫຼຂອງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ (memory leaks), ສາກ (scenes) ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນ (resources) "
"ໃດທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກໂຫຼດ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ [code]--verbose[/code] ຫຼື [code]-"
"v[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command "
"line argument[/url], ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເປັນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກແລ້ວກໍຕາມ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [method "
"OS.is_stdout_verbose] ແລະ [method @GlobalScope.print_verbose]."

msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when the shader exceeds "
"certain device limits. Currently, the only device limit checked is the limit "
"on uniform buffer size. More device limits will be added in the future."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງການເຕືອນເມື່ອ shader ເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດບາງຢ່າງຂອງອຸປະກອນ. "
"ໃນປະຈຸບັນ, ຂີດຈຳກັດອຸປະກອນດຽວທີ່ຖືກກວດສອບຄືຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງຂະໜາດ uniform buffer. "
"ຂີດຈຳກັດອຸປະກອນອື່ນໆຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນອະນາຄົດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables specific shader warnings (see [code]debug/"
"shader_language/warnings/*[/code] settings). If [code]false[/code], disables "
"all shader warnings."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການເຕືອນ shader ສະເພາະ (ເບິ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [code]debug/"
"shader_language/warnings/*[/code]). ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະປິດການເຕືອນ "
"shader ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when two floating-point "
"numbers are compared directly with the [code]==[/code] operator or the [code]!"
"=[/code] operator."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງການເຕືອນເມື່ອມີການປຽບທຽບຕົວເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ (floating-"
"point) ສອງຕົວໂດຍກົງດ້ວຍຕົວດຳເນີນການ [code]==[/code] ຫຼື [code]!=[/code]."

msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning upon encountering certain "
"formatting errors. Currently this only checks for empty statements. More "
"formatting errors may be added over time."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງການເຕືອນເມື່ອພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການຈັດຮູບແບບບາງຢ່າງ. "
"ໃນປະຈຸບັນສິ່ງນີ້ຈະກວດສອບພຽງແຕ່ statement ທີ່ວ່າງເປົ່າ. "
"ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການຈັດຮູບແບບອື່ນໆອາດຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when the shader contains "
"[code]POSITION = vec4(vertex,[/code] as this was very common code written in "
"Godot 4.2 and earlier that was paired with a QuadMesh to produce a full "
"screen post processes pass. With the switch to reversed z in 4.3, this trick "
"no longer works, as it implicitly relied on the [code]VERTEX.z[/code] being 0."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງການເຕືອນເມື່ອ shader ມີ [code]POSITION = "
"vec4(vertex,[/code] ເນື່ອງຈາກນີ້ເປັນໂຄ້ດທີ່ຂຽນກັນທົ່ວໄປໃນ Godot 4.2 ແລະ ເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້າ ທີ່ໃຊ້ຄູ່ກັບ "
"QuadMesh ເພື່ອສ້າງ full screen post processes pass. ດ້ວຍການປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ reversed z ໃນ "
"4.3, ເທັກນິກນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ ເພາະມັນອາໄສຄ່າ [code]VERTEX.z[/code] ທີ່ເປັນ 0 ໂດຍທາງອ້ອມ."

msgid "When set to [code]true[/code], warnings are treated as errors."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການເຕືອນຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດຄືກັບເປັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (error)."

msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when a constant is never "
"used."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງການເຕືອນເມື່ອຄ່າຄົງທີ່ (constant) ບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when a function is never "
"used."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງການເຕືອນເມື່ອຟັງຊັນບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when a local variable is "
"never used."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງການເຕືອນເມື່ອຕົວປ່ຽນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local variable) "
"ບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when a struct is never used."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງການເຕືອນເມື່ອ struct ບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when a uniform is never "
"used."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງການເຕືອນເມື່ອ uniform ບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when a varying is never "
"used."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງການເຕືອນເມື່ອ varying ບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"If enabled, displays avoidance obstacles radius when \"Visible Avoidance\" is "
"enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະສະແດງລັດສະໝີສິ່ງກີດຂວາງຫຼີກລ່ຽງ ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible Avoidance\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"If enabled, displays static avoidance obstacles when \"Visible Avoidance\" is "
"enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະສະແດງສິ່ງກີດຂວາງຫຼີກລ່ຽງແບບຄົງທີ່ (static avoidance obstacles) ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ "
"\"Visible Avoidance\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Color of the avoidance obstacles radius, visible when \"Visible Avoidance\" "
"is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງລັດສະໝີສິ່ງກີດຂວາງຫຼີກລ່ຽງ, ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible Avoidance\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Color of the static avoidance obstacles edges when their vertices are winded "
"in order to push agents in, visible when \"Visible Avoidance\" is enabled in "
"the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງຂອບສິ່ງກີດຂວາງຫຼີກລ່ຽງແບບຄົງທີ່ ເມື່ອຈຸດຍອດ (vertices) "
"ຂອງພວກມັນຖືກຈັດລຽງເພື່ອດັນຕົວແທນເຂົ້າໄປຂ້າງໃນ, ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible Avoidance\" "
"ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Color of the static avoidance obstacles edges when their vertices are winded "
"in order to push agents out, visible when \"Visible Avoidance\" is enabled in "
"the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງຂອບສິ່ງກີດຂວາງຫຼີກລ່ຽງແບບຄົງທີ່ ເມື່ອຈຸດຍອດຂອງພວກມັນຖືກຈັດລຽງເພື່ອດັນຕົວແທນອອກໄປຂ້າງນອກ, "
"ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible Avoidance\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Color of the static avoidance obstacles faces when their vertices are winded "
"in order to push agents in, visible when \"Visible Avoidance\" is enabled in "
"the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງຜິວໜ້າສິ່ງກີດຂວາງຫຼີກລ່ຽງແບບຄົງທີ່ ເມື່ອຈຸດຍອດຂອງພວກມັນຖືກຈັດລຽງເພື່ອດັນຕົວແທນເຂົ້າໄປຂ້າງໃນ, "
"ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible Avoidance\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Color of the static avoidance obstacles faces when their vertices are winded "
"in order to push agents out, visible when \"Visible Avoidance\" is enabled in "
"the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງຜິວໜ້າສິ່ງກີດຂວາງຫຼີກລ່ຽງແບບຄົງທີ່ ເມື່ອຈຸດຍອດຂອງພວກມັນຖືກຈັດລຽງເພື່ອດັນຕົວແທນອອກໄປຂ້າງນອກ, "
"ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible Avoidance\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Color of the contact points between collision shapes, visible when \"Visible "
"Collision Shapes\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງຈຸດສຳຜັດລະຫວ່າງຮູບຊົງການຕຳ (collision shapes), ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible "
"Collision Shapes\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Sets whether 2D physics will display collision outlines in game when "
"\"Visible Collision Shapes\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າລະບົບຟີຊິກ 2D ຈະສະແດງເສັ້ນຂອບການຕຳໃນເກມຫຼືບໍ່ ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible Collision "
"Shapes\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of contact points between collision shapes to display when "
"\"Visible Collision Shapes\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຈຸດສຳຜັດສູງສຸດລະຫວ່າງຮູບຊົງການຕຳທີ່ຈະສະແດງ ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible Collision Shapes\" "
"ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Color of the collision shapes, visible when \"Visible Collision Shapes\" is "
"enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງຮູບຊົງການຕຳ, ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible Collision Shapes\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Color to display enabled navigation agent paths when an agent has debug "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"ສີສຳລັບສະແດງເສັ້ນທາງຕົວແທນເນວີເກຊັນ (navigation agent paths) ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ຢູ່ "
"ເມື່ອຕົວແທນນັ້ນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ debug."

msgid ""
"Rasterized size (pixel) used to render navigation agent path points when an "
"agent has debug enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດ Rasterized (ພິກເຊລ) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເຣັນເດີຈຸດເສັ້ນທາງຂອງຕົວແທນເນວີເກຊັນ "
"ເມື່ອຕົວແທນນັ້ນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ debug."

msgid ""
"Color to display edge connections between navigation regions, visible when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ສີສຳລັບສະແດງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອບລະຫວ່າງ navigation regions, ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible "
"Navigation\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"If enabled, displays navigation agent paths when an agent has debug enabled."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະສະແດງເສັ້ນທາງຕົວແທນເນວີເກຊັນເມື່ອຕົວແທນນັ້ນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ debug."

msgid ""
"If enabled, displays edge connections between navigation regions when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະສະແດງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອບລະຫວ່າງ navigation regions ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible "
"Navigation\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"If enabled, displays navigation mesh polygon edges when \"Visible "
"Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະສະແດງຂອບໂພລີກອນຂອງເນວີເກຊັນເມຊ (navigation mesh) ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible "
"Navigation\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"If enabled, colorizes each navigation mesh polygon face with a random color "
"when \"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະໃສ່ສີແບບສຸ່ມໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະຜິວໜ້າໂພລີກອນຂອງເນວີເກຊັນເມຊ ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible "
"Navigation\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"If enabled, displays navigation link connections when \"Visible Navigation\" "
"is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະສະແດງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ navigation link ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible Navigation\" "
"ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Color to display enabled navigation mesh polygon edges, visible when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ສີສຳລັບສະແດງຂອບໂພລີກອນຂອງເນວີເກຊັນເມຊທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ຢູ່, ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible "
"Navigation\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Color to display disabled navigation mesh polygon edges, visible when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ສີສຳລັບສະແດງຂອບໂພລີກອນຂອງເນວີເກຊັນເມຊທີ່ປິດໃຊ້ຢູ່, ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible "
"Navigation\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Color to display enabled navigation mesh polygon faces, visible when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ສີສຳລັບສະແດງຜິວໜ້າໂພລີກອນຂອງເນວີເກຊັນເມຊທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ຢູ່, ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible "
"Navigation\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Color to display disabled navigation mesh polygon faces, visible when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ສີສຳລັບສະແດງຜິວໜ້າໂພລີກອນຂອງເນວີເກຊັນເມຊທີ່ປິດໃຊ້ຢູ່, ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible "
"Navigation\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Color to use to display navigation link connections, visible when \"Visible "
"Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ສະແດງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ navigation link, ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible Navigation\" "
"ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Color to use to display disabled navigation link connections, visible when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ສະແດງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ navigation link ທີ່ປິດໃຊ້ຢູ່, ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible "
"Navigation\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"If enabled, displays navigation agent paths through geometry when an agent "
"has debug enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະສະແດງເສັ້ນທາງຕົວແທນເນວີເກຊັນທະລຸຜ່ານວັດຖຸ (geometry) ເມື່ອຕົວແທນນັ້ນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ "
"debug."

msgid ""
"If enabled, displays edge connections between navigation regions through "
"geometry when \"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະສະແດງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອບລະຫວ່າງ navigation regions ທະລຸຜ່ານວັດຖຸ ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ "
"\"Visible Navigation\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"If enabled, displays navigation mesh polygon edges through geometry when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະສະແດງຂອບໂພລີກອນຂອງເນວີເກຊັນເມຊທະລຸຜ່ານວັດຖຸ ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible "
"Navigation\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"If enabled, displays navigation link connections through geometry when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະສະແດງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ navigation link ທະລຸຜ່ານວັດຖຸ ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible "
"Navigation\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Color of the curve path geometry, visible when \"Visible Paths\" is enabled "
"in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງວັດຖຸເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ (curve path geometry), ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible Paths\" ໃນເມນູ "
"Debug."

msgid ""
"Line width of the curve path geometry, visible when \"Visible Paths\" is "
"enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງເສັ້ນວັດຖຸເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ, ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ \"Visible Paths\" ໃນເມນູ Debug."

msgid ""
"Sets the driver to be used by the display server. This property can not be "
"edited directly, instead, set the driver using the platform-specific "
"overrides."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໄດຣເວີທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ display server. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ, "
"ແຕ່ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດຣເວີໂດຍໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນຄ່າສະເພາະແພລັດຟອມ (platform-specific overrides) ແທນ."

msgid "Android override for [member display/display_server/driver]."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນຄ່າສຳລັບ Android ສຳລັບ [member display/display_server/driver]."

msgid "iOS override for [member display/display_server/driver]."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນຄ່າສຳລັບ iOS ສຳລັບ [member display/display_server/driver]."

msgid "LinuxBSD override for [member display/display_server/driver]."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນຄ່າສຳລັບ LinuxBSD ສຳລັບ [member display/display_server/driver]."

msgid "MacOS override for [member display/display_server/driver]."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນຄ່າສຳລັບ MacOS ສຳລັບ [member display/display_server/driver]."

msgid "visionOS override for [member display/display_server/driver]."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນຄ່າສຳລັບ visionOS ສຳລັບ [member display/display_server/driver]."

msgid "Windows override for [member display/display_server/driver]."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນຄ່າສຳລັບ Windows ສຳລັບ [member display/display_server/driver]."

msgid "Custom image for the mouse cursor (limited to 256×256)."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌ (ຈຳກັດຢູ່ທີ່ 256×256)."

msgid "Hotspot for the custom mouse cursor image."
msgstr "ຈຸດກົດ (Hotspot) ສຳລັບຮູບພາບຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid "Position offset for tooltips, relative to the mouse cursor's hotspot."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງຕຳແໜ່ງ (Position offset) ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳ (tooltips), ທຽບກັບຈຸດກົດຂອງຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows HiDPI display on Windows, macOS, Android, iOS "
"and Web. If [code]false[/code], the platform's low-DPI fallback will be used "
"on HiDPI displays, which causes the window to be displayed in a blurry or "
"pixelated manner (and can cause various window management bugs). Therefore, "
"it is recommended to make your project scale to [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"rendering/multiple_resolutions.html]multiple resolutions[/url] instead of "
"disabling this setting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect on Linux as DPI-awareness fallbacks "
"are not supported there."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສະແດງຜົນແບບ HiDPI ເທິງ Windows, macOS, "
"Android, iOS ແລະ Web. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະມີການໃຊ້ low-DPI fallback "
"ຂອງແພລັດຟອມເທິງຈໍ HiDPI, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ໜ້າຕ່າງສະແດງຜົນແບບມົວ ຫຼື ແຕກເປັນເມັດພິກເຊລ (ແລະ "
"ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັກໃນການຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງ). ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຈຶ່ງແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຮັດໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບການປັບຂະໜາດຕາມ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"rendering/multiple_resolutions.html]ຫຼາຍຄວາມລະອຽດ[/url] ແທນທີ່ຈະປິດການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ Linux ເນື່ອງຈາກບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ DPI-awareness fallbacks ຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Enable Swappy for stable frame pacing on Android. Highly recommended.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This option will be forced off when using OpenXR."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ Swappy ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຟຣມຄົງທີ່ (stable frame pacing) ເທິງ Android. ແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະຖືກບັງຄັບໃຫ້ປິດເມື່ອໃຊ້ OpenXR."

msgid ""
"Swappy mode to use. The options are:\n"
"- [code]pipeline_forced_on[/code]: Try to honor [member Engine.max_fps]. "
"Pipelining is always on. This is the same behavior as a desktop PC.\n"
"- [code]auto_fps_pipeline_forced_on[/code]: Calculate the max FPS "
"automatically. The actual max FPS will be between [code]0[/code] and [member "
"Engine.max_fps]. While this sounds convenient, beware that Swappy will often "
"downgrade the max FPS until it finds a value that can be maintained. That "
"means, if your game runs between 40fps and 60fps on a 60hz screen, after some "
"time Swappy will downgrade the max FPS so that the game renders at a perfect "
"30fps.\n"
"- [code]auto_fps_auto_pipeline[/code]: Same as "
"[code]auto_fps_pipeline_forced_on[/code], but if Swappy detects that "
"rendering is very fast (for example it takes less than 8ms to render on a "
"60hz screen), Swappy will disable pipelining to minimize input latency. This "
"is the default.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member Engine.max_fps] is [code]0[/code], the actual max FPS "
"will be considered to be the screen's refresh rate (often 60hz, 90hz, or "
"120hz, depending on device model and OS settings)."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ Swappy ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ຕົວເລືອກມີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"- [code]pipeline_forced_on[/code]: ພະຍາຍາມຮັກສາ [member Engine.max_fps]. "
"Pipelining ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ຕະຫຼອດ. ນີ້ແມ່ນພຶດຕິກຳດຽວກັບໃນ PC desktop.\n"
"- [code]auto_fps_pipeline_forced_on[/code]: ຄຳນວນຄ່າ FPS ສູງສຸດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຄ່າ "
"FPS ສູງສຸດຕົວຈິງຈະຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/code] ແລະ [member Engine.max_fps]. "
"ເຖິງວ່າມັນຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າມັນສະດວກ, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ລະວັງວ່າ Swappy ມັກຈະຫຼຸດ FPS ສູງສຸດລົງຈົນກວ່າຈະພົບຄ່າທີ່ຄົງທີ່. "
"ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ຖ້າເກມຂອງທ່ານລັນຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 40fps ຫາ 60fps ເທິງໜ້າຈໍ 60hz, ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນໄລຍະໜຶ່ງ "
"Swappy ຈະຫຼຸດ FPS ສູງສຸດລົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເກມເຣັນເດີຢູ່ທີ່ 30fps ຢ່າງສົມບູນ.\n"
"- [code]auto_fps_auto_pipeline[/code]: ຄືກັນກັບ "
"[code]auto_fps_pipeline_forced_on[/code], ແຕ່ຖ້າ Swappy ກວດພົບວ່າການເຣັນເດີນັ້ນໄວຫຼາຍ "
"(ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃຊ້ເວລານ້ອຍກວ່າ 8ms ເທິງໜ້າຈໍ 60hz), Swappy ຈະປິດ pipelining "
"ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (input latency). ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [member Engine.max_fps] ເປັນ [code]0[/code], ຄ່າ FPS "
"ສູງສຸດຕົວຈິງຈະຖືກພິຈາລະນາຕາມອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊ (refresh rate) ຂອງໜ້າຈໍ (ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະເປັນ 60hz, "
"90hz, ຫຼື 120hz ຂຶ້ນກັບລຸ້ນອຸປະກອນ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ OS)."

msgid ""
"The default screen orientation to use on mobile devices. See [enum "
"DisplayServer.ScreenOrientation] for possible values.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When set to a portrait orientation, this project setting does "
"not flip the project resolution's width and height automatically. Instead, "
"you have to set [member display/window/size/viewport_width] and [member "
"display/window/size/viewport_height] accordingly."
msgstr ""
"ການວາງແນວໜ້າຈໍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນອຸປະກອນມືຖື. ເບິ່ງ [enum DisplayServer.ScreenOrientation] "
"ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນແນວຕັ້ງ (portrait), ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສະລັບຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມສູງຂອງຄວາມລະອຽດໂປຣເຈັກໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ແຕ່ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member display/window/"
"size/viewport_width] ແລະ [member display/window/size/viewport_height] "
"ໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັນເອງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], HDR output is requested for the main window and the "
"editor. The main window and editor will automatically switch between HDR and "
"SDR if it is moved between screens, screen capabilities change, or system "
"settings are modified. This will internally force [member "
"Viewport.use_hdr_2d] to be enabled on the main [Viewport]. All other "
"[SubViewport] of the [Window] must have their [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] "
"property enabled to produce HDR output.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"this property at runtime, set [member Window.hdr_output_requested]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີການຮ້ອງຂໍ HDR output ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກ ແລະ ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. "
"ໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກ ແລະ ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະສະລັບລະຫວ່າງ HDR ແລະ SDR ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຖ້າມັນຖືກຍ້າຍລະຫວ່າງໜ້າຈໍ, "
"ຄວາມສາມາດຂອງໜ້າຈໍປ່ຽນແປງ, ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບຖືກແກ້ໄຂ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"Viewport.use_hdr_2d] ໃນ [Viewport] ຫຼັກໂດຍພາຍໃນ. ທຸກໆ [SubViewport] ອື່ນໆຂອງ "
"[Window] ຈະຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] ເພື່ອສ້າງ HDR output.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລັນ, "
"ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member Window.hdr_output_requested] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], iOS devices that support high refresh rate/"
"\"ProMotion\" will be allowed to render at up to 120 frames per second."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ອຸປະກອນ iOS ທີ່ຮອງຮັບອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊສູງ ຫຼື \"ProMotion\" "
"ຈະຖືກອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຣັນເດີໄດ້ສູງສຸດ 120 ເຟຣມຕໍ່ວິນາທີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the home indicator is hidden automatically. This only "
"affects iOS devices without a physical home button."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວຊີ້ບອກປຸ່ມໂຮມ (home indicator) ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບອຸປະກອນ iOS ທີ່ບໍ່ມີປຸ່ມໂຮມແບບກາຍະພາບ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the status bar is hidden while the app is running."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແຖບສະຖານະ (status bar) ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໃນຂະນະທີ່ແອັບກຳລັງລັນຢູ່."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], it will require two swipes to access iOS UI that uses "
"gestures.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect on the home indicator if "
"[code]hide_home_indicator[/code] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ມັນຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ການປັດສອງຄັ້ງເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ UI ຂອງ iOS ທີ່ໃຊ້ທ່າທາງ "
"(gestures).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຕົວຊີ້ບອກປຸ່ມໂຮມ ຖ້າ [code]hide_home_indicator[/code] "
"ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows per-pixel transparency for the window "
"background. This affects performance, so leave it on [code]false[/code] "
"unless you need it. See also [member display/window/size/transparent] and "
"[member rendering/viewport/transparent_background]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສແບບແຍກແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ (per-pixel "
"transparency) ສຳລັບພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ, ສະນັ້ນໃຫ້ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/"
"code] ໄວ້ ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ມັນແທ້ໆ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member display/window/size/"
"transparent] ແລະ [member rendering/viewport/transparent_background]."

msgid ""
"Forces the main window to be always on top.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is ignored on iOS, Android, and Web."
msgstr ""
"ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກຢູ່ເທິງສຸດສະເໝີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍໃນ iOS, Android ແລະ Web."

msgid ""
"Forces the main window to be borderless.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is ignored on iOS, Android, and Web."
msgstr ""
"ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກບໍ່ມີຂອບ (borderless).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍໃນ iOS, Android ແລະ Web."

msgid ""
"Main window content is expanded to the full size of the window. Unlike a "
"borderless window, the frame is left intact and can be used to resize the "
"window, and the title bar is transparent, but has minimize/maximize/close "
"buttons.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ເນື້ອໃນຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍໃຫ້ເຕັມຂະໜາດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ. ຕ່າງຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ບໍ່ມີຂອບ, ກອບໜ້າຕ່າງຍັງຄົງຢູ່ "
"ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງໄດ້, ແລະ ແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ (title bar) ຈະໂປ່ງໃສ ແຕ່ຍັງມີປຸ່ມ ຫຍໍ້/"
"ຂະຫຍາຍ/ປິດ ຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Main window initial position (in virtual desktop coordinates), this setting "
"is used only if [member display/window/size/initial_position_type] is set to "
"\"Absolute\" ([code]0[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting only affects the exported project, or when the "
"project is run from the command line. In the editor, the value of [member "
"EditorSettings.run/window_placement/rect_custom_position] is used instead."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກ (ໃນພິກັດ virtual desktop), ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member "
"display/window/size/initial_position_type] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ \"Absolute\" ([code]0[/"
"code]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ ຫຼື ເມື່ອລັນໂປຣເຈັກຈາກ command line "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, ຄ່າຂອງ [member EditorSettings.run/window_placement/"
"rect_custom_position] ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Main window initial position.\n"
"[code]0[/code] - \"Absolute\", [member display/window/size/initial_position] "
"is used to set window position.\n"
"[code]1[/code] - \"Primary Screen Center\".\n"
"[code]3[/code] - \"Other Screen Center\", [member display/window/size/"
"initial_screen] is used to set the screen.\n"
"[code]4[/code] - \"Center of Screen With Mouse Pointer\".\n"
"[code]5[/code] - \"Center of Screen With Keyboard Focus\".\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting only affects the exported project, or when the "
"project is run from the command line. In the editor, the value of [member "
"EditorSettings.run/window_placement/rect] is used instead."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກ.\n"
"[code]0[/code] - \"Absolute\", ໃຊ້ [member display/window/size/"
"initial_position] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຕຳແໜ່ງໜ້າຕ່າງ.\n"
"[code]1[/code] - \"Primary Screen Center\" (ກາງໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກ).\n"
"[code]3[/code] - \"Other Screen Center\" (ກາງໜ້າຈໍອື່ນ), ໃຊ້ [member display/"
"window/size/initial_screen] ເພື່ອເລືອກໜ້າຈໍ.\n"
"[code]4[/code] - \"Center of Screen With Mouse Pointer\" (ກາງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມີຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌).\n"
"[code]5[/code] - \"Center of Screen With Keyboard Focus\" "
"(ກາງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມີໂຟກັສຄີບອດ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ ຫຼື ເມື່ອລັນໂປຣເຈັກຈາກ command line "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, ຄ່າຂອງ [member EditorSettings.run/window_placement/rect] "
"ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Main window initial screen, this setting is used only if [member display/"
"window/size/initial_position_type] is set to \"Other Screen Center\" "
"([code]2[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting only affects the exported project, or when the "
"project is run from the command line. In the editor, the value of [member "
"EditorSettings.run/window_placement/screen] is used instead."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າຈໍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member display/window/size/"
"initial_position_type] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ \"Other Screen Center\" ([code]2[/code]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ ຫຼື ເມື່ອລັນໂປຣເຈັກຈາກ command line "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, ຄ່າຂອງ [member EditorSettings.run/window_placement/screen] "
"ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແທນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the main window's maximize button is disabled."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ປຸ່ມຂະຫຍາຍ (maximize) ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the main window's minimize button is disabled."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ປຸ່ມຫຍໍ້ (minimize) ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Main window mode. See [enum DisplayServer.WindowMode] for possible values and "
"how each mode behaves.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Game embedding is available only in the \"Windowed\" mode."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກ. ເບິ່ງ [enum DisplayServer.WindowMode] ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງແຕ່ລະໂໝດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຝັງເກມ (Game embedding) ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນໂໝດ \"Windowed\" "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Main window can't be focused. No-focus window will ignore all input, except "
"mouse clicks."
msgstr "ໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກໂຟກັສໄດ້. ໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ບໍ່ມີໂຟກັສຈະລະເລີຍທຸກການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ, ຍົກເວັ້ນການຄລິກເມົາສ໌."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows the window to be resizable by default.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"whether the window is resizable at runtime, set [member Window.unresizable] "
"instead on the root Window, which can be retrieved using "
"[code]get_viewport().get_window()[/code]. [member Window.unresizable] takes "
"the opposite value of this setting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Certain window managers can be configured to ignore the non-"
"resizable status of a window. Do not rely on this setting as a guarantee that "
"the window will [i]never[/i] be resizable.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is ignored on iOS."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງໄດ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເພື່ອປ່ຽນວ່າໜ້າຕ່າງສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລັນ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member Window.unresizable] "
"ແທນໃນ Root Window ເຊິ່ງສາມາດດຶງຄ່າມາໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [code]get_viewport().get_window()[/"
"code]. [member Window.unresizable] ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງບາງຕົວອາດຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ລະເລີຍສະຖານະ unresizable "
"ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງໄດ້. ຢ່າໝັ້ນໃຈກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ວ່າໜ້າຕ່າງຈະ [i]ບໍ່ມີທາງ[/i] ປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ສະເໝີໄປ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍໃນ iOS."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the main window uses sharp corners by default.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is implemented only on Windows (11)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກຈະໃຊ້ຂອບມຸມທີ່ແຫຼມຄົມໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ Windows (11) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables a window manager hint that the main window "
"background [i]can[/i] be transparent. This does not make the background "
"actually transparent. For the background to be transparent, the root viewport "
"must also be made transparent by enabling [member rendering/viewport/"
"transparent_background].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To use a transparent splash screen, set [member application/"
"boot_splash/bg_color] to [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect if [member display/window/"
"per_pixel_transparency/allowed] is set to [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect on Android as transparency is "
"controlled only via [member display/window/per_pixel_transparency/allowed]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການບອກໃບ້ໃຫ້ຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງຮູ້ວ່າພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກ "
"[i]ສາມາດ[/i] ໂປ່ງໃສໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ພື້ນຫຼັງໂປ່ງໃສແທ້ໆ. ການທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພື້ນຫຼັງໂປ່ງໃສໄດ້ນັ້ນ, Root "
"Viewport ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ໂປ່ງໃສນຳໂດຍການເປີດໃຊ້ [member rendering/viewport/"
"transparent_background].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອໃຊ້ splash screen ແບບໂປ່ງໃສ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member application/"
"boot_splash/bg_color] ເປັນ [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຖ້າ [member display/window/per_pixel_transparency/"
"allowed] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ Android ເພາະຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຖືກຄວບຄຸມຜ່ານ [member display/"
"window/per_pixel_transparency/allowed] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the game's main viewport height. On desktop platforms, this is also the "
"initial window height, represented by an indigo-colored rectangle in the 2D "
"editor. Stretch mode settings also use this as a reference when using the "
"[code]canvas_items[/code] or [code]viewport[/code] stretch modes. See also "
"[member display/window/size/viewport_width], [member display/window/size/"
"window_width_override] and [member display/window/size/"
"window_height_override]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມສູງຂອງວິວພອດ (viewport) ຫຼັກຂອງເກມ. ເທິງແພລັດຟອມເດັສທອບ, "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງເປັນຄວາມສູງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ, ເຊິ່ງສະແດງດ້ວຍຮູບສີ່ແຈສີຄາມໃນ 2D editor. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"Stretch mode ຍັງໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນບ່ອນອ້າງອີງເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ [code]canvas_items[/code] ຫຼື "
"[code]viewport[/code]. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member display/window/size/"
"viewport_width], [member display/window/size/window_width_override] ແລະ "
"[member display/window/size/window_height_override]."

msgid ""
"Sets the game's main viewport width. On desktop platforms, this is also the "
"initial window width, represented by an indigo-colored rectangle in the 2D "
"editor. Stretch mode settings also use this as a reference when using the "
"[code]canvas_items[/code] or [code]viewport[/code] stretch modes. See also "
"[member display/window/size/viewport_height], [member display/window/size/"
"window_width_override] and [member display/window/size/"
"window_height_override]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງວິວພອດ (viewport) ຫຼັກຂອງເກມ. ເທິງແພລັດຟອມເດັສທອບ, "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງເປັນຄວາມກວ້າງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ, ເຊິ່ງສະແດງດ້ວຍຮູບສີ່ແຈສີຄາມໃນ 2D editor. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"Stretch mode ຍັງໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນບ່ອນອ້າງອີງເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ [code]canvas_items[/code] ຫຼື "
"[code]viewport[/code]. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member display/window/size/"
"viewport_height], [member display/window/size/window_width_override] ແລະ "
"[member display/window/size/window_height_override]."

msgid ""
"On desktop platforms, overrides the game's initial window height. See also "
"[member display/window/size/window_width_override], [member display/window/"
"size/viewport_width] and [member display/window/size/viewport_height].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default, or when set to [code]0[/code], the initial window "
"height is the [member display/window/size/viewport_height]. This setting is "
"ignored on iOS, Android, and Web."
msgstr ""
"ເທິງແພລັດຟອມເດັສທອບ, ຈະປ່ຽນຄ່າຄວາມສູງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງເກມ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member display/"
"window/size/window_width_override], [member display/window/size/"
"viewport_width] ແລະ [member display/window/size/viewport_height].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຫຼື ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/code], "
"ຄວາມສູງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຈະເປັນໄປຕາມ [member display/window/size/viewport_height]. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍໃນ iOS, Android ແລະ Web."

msgid ""
"On desktop platforms, overrides the game's initial window width. See also "
"[member display/window/size/window_height_override], [member display/window/"
"size/viewport_width] and [member display/window/size/viewport_height].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default, or when set to [code]0[/code], the initial window "
"width is the [member display/window/size/viewport_width]. This setting is "
"ignored on iOS, Android, and Web."
msgstr ""
"ເທິງແພລັດຟອມເດັສທອບ, ຈະປ່ຽນຄ່າຄວາມກວ້າງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງເກມ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member display/"
"window/size/window_height_override], [member display/window/size/"
"viewport_width] ແລະ [member display/window/size/viewport_height].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຫຼື ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/code], "
"ຄວາມກວ້າງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຈະເປັນໄປຕາມ [member display/window/size/viewport_width]. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍໃນ iOS, Android ແລະ Web."

msgid ""
"Defines how the aspect ratio of the base size is preserved when stretching to "
"fit the resolution of the window or screen.\n"
"[code]\"ignore\"[/code]: Ignore the aspect ratio when stretching the screen. "
"This means that the original resolution will be stretched to exactly fill the "
"screen, even if it's wider or narrower. This may result in non-uniform "
"stretching: things looking wider or taller than designed.\n"
"[code]\"keep\"[/code]: Keep aspect ratio when stretching the screen. This "
"means that the viewport retains its original size regardless of the screen "
"resolution, and black bars will be added to the top/bottom of the screen "
"(\"letterboxing\") or the sides (\"pillarboxing\").\n"
"[code]\"keep_width\"[/code]: Keep aspect ratio when stretching the screen. If "
"the screen is wider than the base size, black bars are added at the left and "
"right (pillarboxing). But if the screen is taller than the base resolution, "
"the viewport will be grown in the vertical direction (and more content will "
"be visible at the bottom). You can also think of this as \"Expand "
"Vertically\".\n"
"[code]\"keep_height\"[/code]: Keep aspect ratio when stretching the screen. "
"If the screen is taller than the base size, black bars are added at the top "
"and bottom (letterboxing). But if the screen is wider than the base "
"resolution, the viewport will be grown in the horizontal direction (and more "
"content will be visible to the right). You can also think of this as \"Expand "
"Horizontally\".\n"
"[code]\"expand\"[/code]: Keep aspect ratio when stretching the screen, but "
"keep neither the base width nor height. Depending on the screen aspect ratio, "
"the viewport will either be larger in the horizontal direction (if the screen "
"is wider than the base size) or in the vertical direction (if the screen is "
"taller than the original size). This is the default for projects created "
"starting in Godot 4.7."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວິທີການຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບ (aspect ratio) ຂອງຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານ "
"ເມື່ອມີການຍືດຂະຫຍາຍໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ ຫຼື ໜ້າຈໍ.\n"
"[code]\"ignore\"[/code]: ລະເລີຍອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບເມື່ອຍືດໜ້າຈໍ. "
"ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄວາມລະອຽດເດີມຈະຖືກຍືດໃຫ້ເຕັມໜ້າຈໍພໍດີ ເຖິງວ່າມັນຈະກວ້າງ ຫຼື ແຄບກວ່າກໍຕາມ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບຍືດແບບບໍ່ສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ: ສິ່ງຕ່າງໆອາດເບິ່ງກວ້າງ ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າທີ່ອອກແບບໄວ້.\n"
"[code]\"keep\"[/code]: ຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບເມື່ອຍືດໜ້າຈໍ. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ "
"ວິວພອດຈະຄົງຂະໜາດເດີມໄວ້ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, ແລະ ຈະມີແຖບດຳເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາທີ່ ດ້ານເທິງ/ລຸ່ມ "
"(\"letterboxing\") ຫຼື ດ້ານຂ້າງ (\"pillarboxing\").\n"
"[code]\"keep_width\"[/code]: ຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບເມື່ອຍືດໜ້າຈໍ. ຖ້າໜ້າຈໍກວ້າງກວ່າຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານ, "
"ຈະມີແຖບດຳເພີ່ມເຂົ້າທີ່ດ້ານຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຂວາ (pillarboxing). ແຕ່ຖ້າໜ້າຈໍສູງກວ່າຄວາມລະອຽດພື້ນຖານ, "
"ວິວພອດຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍອອກໃນແນວຕັ້ງ (ແລະ ຈະເຫັນເນື້ອໃນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມ). ທ່ານສາມາດຄິດວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ຄື "
"\"ການຂະຫຍາຍໃນແນວຕັ້ງ\".\n"
"[code]\"keep_height\"[/code]: ຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບເມື່ອຍືດໜ້າຈໍ. ຖ້າໜ້າຈໍສູງກວ່າຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານ, "
"ຈະມີແຖບດຳເພີ່ມເຂົ້າທີ່ດ້ານເທິງ ແລະ ລຸ່ມ (letterboxing). ແຕ່ຖ້າໜ້າຈໍກວ້າງກວ່າຄວາມລະອຽດພື້ນຖານ, "
"ວິວພອດຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍອອກໃນແນວນອນ (ແລະ ຈະເຫັນເນື້ອໃນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນຢູ່ດ້ານຂວາ). ທ່ານສາມາດຄິດວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ຄື "
"\"ການຂະຫຍາຍໃນແນວນອນ\".\n"
"[code]\"expand\"[/code]: ຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບເມື່ອຍືດໜ້າຈໍ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ຮັກສາທັງຄວາມກວ້າງ ຫຼື "
"ຄວາມສູງພື້ນຖານ. ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, ວິວພອດອາດຈະໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນໃນແນວນອນ "
"(ຖ້າໜ້າຈໍກວ້າງກວ່າຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານ) ຫຼື ໃນແນວຕັ້ງ (ຖ້າໜ້າຈໍສູງກວ່າຂະໜາດເດີມ). "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສ້າງຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 4.7 ເປັນຕົ້ນໄປ."

msgid ""
"Defines how the base size is stretched to fit the resolution of the window or "
"screen.\n"
"[code]\"disabled\"[/code]: No stretching happens. One unit in the scene "
"corresponds to one pixel on the screen. In this mode, [member display/window/"
"stretch/aspect] has no effect. Recommended for non-game applications.\n"
"[code]\"canvas_items\"[/code]: The base size specified in width and height in "
"the project settings is stretched to cover the whole screen (taking [member "
"display/window/stretch/aspect] into account). This means that everything is "
"rendered directly at the target resolution. 3D is unaffected, while in 2D, "
"there is no longer a 1:1 correspondence between sprite pixels and screen "
"pixels, which may result in scaling artifacts. Recommended for most games "
"that don't use a pixel art aesthetic, although it is possible to use this "
"stretch mode for pixel art games too (especially in 3D). This is the default "
"for projects created starting in Godot 4.7.\n"
"[code]\"viewport\"[/code]: The size of the root [Viewport] is set precisely "
"to the base size specified in the Project Settings' Display section. The "
"scene is rendered to this viewport first. Finally, this viewport is scaled to "
"fit the screen (taking [member display/window/stretch/aspect] into account). "
"Recommended for games that use a pixel art aesthetic."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວິທີການຂະຫຍາຍຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ ຫຼື ໜ້າຈໍ.\n"
"[code]\"disabled\"[/code]: ຈະບໍ່ມີການຂະຫຍາຍໃດໆເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ຫນຶ່ງຫົວໜ່ວຍໃນສາກຈະກົງກັບໜຶ່ງພິກເຊວ "
"(pixel) ເທິງໜ້າຈໍ. ໃນໂໝດນີ້, [member display/window/stretch/aspect] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ. "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນເກມ.\n"
"[code]\"canvas_items\"[/code]: ຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານທີ່ລະບຸໃນຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມສູງໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍໃຫ້ເຕັມໜ້າຈໍ (ໂດຍຄຳນຶງເຖິງ [member display/window/"
"stretch/aspect]). ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທຸກຢ່າງຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນໂດຍກົງຕາມຄວາມລະອຽດເປົ້າໝາຍ. 3D "
"ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ 2D ຈະບໍ່ມີການກົງກັນແບບ 1:1 ລະຫວ່າງພິກເຊວຂອງສະໄປຣທ໌ (sprite) "
"ແລະ ພິກເຊວຂອງໜ້າຈໍອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດມີຮອຍແຕກຈາກການປັບຂະໜາດ (artifacts). "
"ແນະນຳສຳລັບເກມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບພິກເຊວອາຣ໌ທ (pixel art), "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໂໝດນີ້ສຳລັບເກມພິກເຊວອາຣ໌ທຄືກັນ (ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນ 3D). "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສ້າງຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 4.7 ເປັນຕົ້ນໄປ.\n"
"[code]\"viewport\"[/code]: ຂະໜາດຂອງຮາກ [Viewport] "
"ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ກົງກັບຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນ Display ຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ. "
"ສາກຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນໄປທີ່ viewport ນີ້ກ່ອນ. ສຸດທ້າຍ, viewport ນີ້ຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບໜ້າຈໍ "
"(ໂດຍຄຳນຶງເຖິງ [member display/window/stretch/aspect]). "
"ແນະນຳສຳລັບເກມທີ່ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບພິກເຊວອາຣ໌ທ."

msgid ""
"The scale factor multiplier to use for 2D elements. This multiplies the final "
"scale factor determined by [member display/window/stretch/mode]. If using the "
"[b]Disabled[/b] stretch mode, this scale factor is applied as-is. This can be "
"adjusted to make the UI easier to read on certain displays."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນປັດໄຈການຂະຫຍາຍທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບອົງປະກອບ 2D. ນີ້ຈະຄູນກັບປັດໄຈການຂະຫຍາຍຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ "
"[member display/window/stretch/mode]. ຖ້າໃຊ້ໂໝດການຂະຫຍາຍແບບ [b]Disabled[/b], "
"ປັດໄຈການຂະຫຍາຍນີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍກົງ. ສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ UI ອ່ານງ່າຍຂຶ້ນໃນບາງໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"The policy to use to determine the final scale factor for 2D elements. This "
"affects how [member display/window/stretch/scale] is applied, in addition to "
"the automatic scale factor determined by [member display/window/stretch/"
"mode].\n"
"[code]\"fractional\"[/code]: The scale factor will not be modified.\n"
"[code]\"integer\"[/code]: The scale factor will be floored to an integer "
"value, which means that the screen size will always be an integer multiple of "
"the base viewport size. This provides a crisp pixel art appearance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using integer scaling with a stretch mode, resizing the "
"window to be smaller than the base viewport size will clip the contents. "
"Consider preventing that by setting [member Window.min_size] to the same "
"value as the base viewport size defined in [member display/window/size/"
"viewport_width] and [member display/window/size/viewport_height]."
msgstr ""
"ນະໂຍບາຍທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັດສິນປັດໄຈການຂະຫຍາຍຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍສຳລັບອົງປະກອບ 2D. ນີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ວິທີການນຳໃຊ້ [member "
"display/window/stretch/scale], ນອກເໜືອຈາກປັດໄຈການຂະຫຍາຍອັດຕະໂນມັດທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [member "
"display/window/stretch/mode].\n"
"[code]\"fractional\"[/code]: ປັດໄຈການຂະຫຍາຍຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"[code]\"integer\"[/code]: ປັດໄຈການຂະຫຍາຍຈະຖືກປັດລົງເປັນຄ່າຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍຈະເປັນຕົວຄູນຈຳນວນຖ້ວນຂອງຂະໜາດ viewport ພື້ນຖານສະເໝີ. "
"ນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຮູບແບບພິກເຊວອາຣ໌ທເບິ່ງຄົມຊັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການຂະຫຍາຍແບບຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ (integer scaling) ຮ່ວມກັບໂໝດການຂະຫຍາຍ, "
"ການປັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງໃຫ້ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍກວ່າ viewport ພື້ນຖານຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເນື້ອຫາຖືກຕັດອອກ. "
"ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາປ້ອງກັນສິ່ງນັ້ນໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member Window.min_size] ໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບຂະໜາດ "
"viewport ພື້ນຖານທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ [member display/window/size/viewport_width] ແລະ "
"[member display/window/size/viewport_height]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], subwindows are embedded in the main window (this is "
"also called single-window mode). Single-window mode can be faster as it does "
"not need to create a separate window for every popup and tooltip, which can "
"be a slow operation depending on the operating system and rendering method in "
"use.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], subwindows are created as separate windows (this is "
"also called multi-window mode). This allows them to be moved outside the main "
"window and use native operating system window decorations.\n"
"This is equivalent to [member EditorSettings.interface/editor/display/"
"single_window_mode] in the editor."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໜ້າຕ່າງຍ່ອຍຈະຖືກຝັງຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກ (ເອີ້ນວ່າ ໂໝດໜ້າຕ່າງດຽວ). "
"ໂໝດໜ້າຕ່າງດຽວສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໄວກວ່າ ເພາະມັນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງໜ້າຕ່າງແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບທຸກໆປັອບອັບ "
"(popup) ແລະ ທູນທິບ (tooltip), ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະຊ້າໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ "
"ວິທີການສະແດງຜົນທີ່ໃຊ້.\n"
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ໜ້າຕ່າງຍ່ອຍຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເປັນໜ້າຕ່າງແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ (ເອີ້ນວ່າ "
"ໂໝດຫຼາຍໜ້າຕ່າງ). ນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດຍ້າຍພວກມັນອອກໄປນອກໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກ ແລະ "
"ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບການຕົບແຕ່ງໜ້າຕ່າງຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໄດ້.\n"
"ນີ້ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [member EditorSettings.interface/editor/display/single_window_mode] "
"ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor)."

msgid ""
"Sets the V-Sync mode for the main game window. The editor's own V-Sync mode "
"can be set using [member EditorSettings.interface/editor/display/"
"vsync_mode].\n"
"See [enum DisplayServer.VSyncMode] for possible values and how they affect "
"the behavior of your application.\n"
"Depending on the platform and rendering method, the engine will fall back to "
"[b]Enabled[/b] if the desired mode is not supported.\n"
"V-Sync can be disabled on the command line using the [code]--disable-vsync[/"
"code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command line "
"argument[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [b]Adaptive[/b] and [b]Mailbox[/b] V-Sync modes are only "
"supported in the Forward+ and Mobile rendering methods, not Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the V-Sync mode at runtime, call [method DisplayServer.window_set_vsync_mode] "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງໂໝດ V-Sync ສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງເກມຫຼັກ. ໂໝດ V-Sync ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂເອງສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member "
"EditorSettings.interface/editor/display/vsync_mode].\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [enum DisplayServer.VSyncMode] ສຳລັບຄ່າຕ່າງໆທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ວິທີທີ່ພວກມັນສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບແພລດຟອມ (platform) ແລະ ວິທີການສະແດງຜົນ, ເອັນຈິນ (engine) ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ [b]Enabled[/"
"b] ຖ້າໂໝດທີ່ຕ້ອງການນັ້ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"ສາມາດປິດ V-Sync ໄດ້ຜ່ານ command line ໂດຍໃຊ້ [code]--disable-vsync[/code] "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command line "
"argument[/url].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂໝດ V-Sync ແບບ [b]Adaptive[/b] ແລະ [b]Mailbox[/b] "
"ແມ່ນຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນການສະແດງຜົນແບບ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ "
"Compatibility.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນໂໝດ V-Sync "
"ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດວຽກ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [method DisplayServer.window_set_vsync_mode] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Name of the .NET assembly. This name is used as the name of the "
"[code].csproj[/code] and [code].sln[/code] files. By default, it's set to the "
"name of the project ([member application/config/name]) allowing to change it "
"in the future without affecting the .NET assembly."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຂອງ .NET assembly. ຊື່ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ [code].csproj[/code] ແລະ [code].sln[/"
"code]. ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ມັນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຊື່ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ ([member application/config/name]) "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໃນອະນາຄົດໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ .NET assembly."

msgid ""
"Number of times to attempt assembly reloading after rebuilding .NET "
"assemblies. Effectively also the timeout in seconds to wait for unloading of "
"script assemblies to finish."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ຈະພະຍາຍາມໂຫຼດ assembly ຄືນໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງ .NET assemblies ໃໝ່. "
"ເຊິ່ງມັນຍັງເປັນເວລາໝົດກຳນົດ (timeout) ເປັນວິນາທີເພື່ອລໍຖ້າການຍົກເລີກການໂຫຼດ (unloading) ຂອງ "
"script assemblies ໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], text resource ([code]tres[/code]) and text scene "
"([code]tscn[/code]) files are converted to their corresponding binary format "
"on export. This decreases file sizes and speeds up loading slightly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Because a resource's file extension may change in an exported "
"project, it is heavily recommended to use [method @GDScript.load] or "
"[ResourceLoader] instead of [FileAccess] to load resources dynamically.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The project settings file ([code]project.godot[/code]) will "
"always be converted to binary on export, regardless of this setting."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ ([code]tres[/code]) ແລະ "
"ໄຟລ໌ສາກແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ ([code]tscn[/code]) ຈະຖືກແປງເປັນຮູບແບບໄບນາຣີ (binary) "
"ທີ່ກົງກັນເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກ. ນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ການໂຫຼດໄວຂຶ້ນເລັກນ້ອຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ, "
"ຈຶ່ງແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method @GDScript.load] ຫຼື [ResourceLoader] ແທນ [FileAccess] "
"ເພື່ອໂຫຼດຊັບພະຍາກອນແບບໄດນາມິກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ ([code]project.godot[/code]) "
"ຈະຖືກແປງເປັນໄບນາຣີສະເໝີເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໄວ້ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"The maximum width to use when importing textures as an atlas. The value will "
"be rounded to the nearest power of two when used. Use this to prevent "
"imported textures from growing too large in the other direction."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມກວ້າງສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າ texture ແບບ atlas. "
"ຄ່າຈະຖືກປັດໃຫ້ເປັນເລກກຳລັງສອງທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດເມື່ອຖືກນຳໃຊ້. ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ texture "
"ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ເກີນໄປໃນອີກດ້ານໜຶ່ງ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code] importing of resources is run on multiple threads."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ການນຳເຂົ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນຈະເຮັດວຽກແບບຫຼາຍເທຣດ (multiple "
"threads)."

msgid ""
"Number of bits per audio sample written to the [code].avi[/code] file. Only "
"16 and 32-bit are supported."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນບິດ (bits) ຕໍ່ຕົວຢ່າງສຽງທີ່ຂຽນລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ [code].avi[/code]. ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ 16 ແລະ 32-"
"bit ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], requests V-Sync to be disabled when writing a movie "
"(similar to setting [member display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] to [b]Disabled[/"
"b]). This can speed up video writing if the hardware is fast enough to "
"render, encode and save the video at a framerate higher than the monitor's "
"refresh rate.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member editor/movie_writer/disable_vsync] has no effect if the "
"operating system or graphics driver forces V-Sync with no way for "
"applications to disable it."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ປິດ V-Sync ເມື່ອບັນທຶກວິດີໂອ (ຄ້າຍຄືກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] ເປັນ [b]Disabled[/b]). "
"ນີ້ສາມາດເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວໃນການຂຽນວິດີໂອໄດ້ ຖ້າຮາດແວມີຄວາມໄວພໍທີ່ຈະສະແດງຜົນ, ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ ແລະ "
"ບັນທຶກວິດີໂອດ້ວຍອັດຕາເຟຣມທີ່ສູງກວ່າອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊ (refresh rate) ຂອງໜ້າຈໍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member editor/movie_writer/disable_vsync] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ "
"ຖ້າລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ຫຼື ໄດຣເວີກຣາຟິກບັງຄັບໃຫ້ໃຊ້ V-Sync ໂດຍທີ່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນບໍ່ສາມາດປິດມັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The number of frames per second to record in the video when writing a movie. "
"Simulation speed will adjust to always match the specified framerate, which "
"means the engine will appear to run slower at higher [member editor/"
"movie_writer/fps] values. Certain FPS values will require you to adjust "
"[member editor/movie_writer/mix_rate] to prevent audio from desynchronizing "
"over time.\n"
"This can be specified manually on the command line using the [code]--fixed-"
"fps <fps>[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນເຟຣມຕໍ່ວິນາທີ (FPS) ທີ່ຈະບັນທຶກໃນວິດີໂອ. "
"ຄວາມໄວໃນການຈຳລອງຈະປັບໃຫ້ກົງກັບອັດຕາເຟຣມທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສະເໝີ, "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເອັນຈິນຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າເຮັດວຽກຊ້າລົງເມື່ອຄ່າ [member editor/movie_writer/fps] "
"ສູງຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າ FPS ບາງຄ່າອາດຈະຮຽກຮ້ອງໃຫ້ທ່ານປັບ [member editor/movie_writer/mix_rate] "
"ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ສຽງຫຼຸດຊິງ (desynchronizing) ເມື່ອເວລາຜ່ານໄປ.\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່ານີ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນ command line ໂດຍໃຊ້ [code]--fixed-fps <fps>[/code] "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command line "
"argument[/url]."

msgid ""
"The audio mix rate to use in the recorded audio when writing a movie (in Hz). "
"This can be different from [member audio/driver/mix_rate], but this value "
"must be divisible by [member editor/movie_writer/fps] to prevent audio from "
"desynchronizing over time."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາການປະສົມສຽງ (audio mix rate) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການບັນທຶກສຽງໃນວິດີໂອ (ເປັນ Hz). "
"ຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ [member audio/driver/mix_rate], ແຕ່ຄ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງສາມາດຫານຂາດດ້ວຍ "
"[member editor/movie_writer/fps] ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ສຽງຫຼຸດຊິງເມື່ອເວລາຜ່ານໄປ."

msgid ""
"The output path for the movie. The file extension determines the "
"[MovieWriter] that will be used.\n"
"Godot has 3 built-in [MovieWriter]s:\n"
"- OGV container with Theora for video and Vorbis for audio ([code].ogv[/code] "
"file extension). Lossy compression, medium file sizes, fast encoding. The "
"lossy compression quality can be adjusted by changing [member "
"ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/video_quality] and [member "
"ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/ogv/audio_quality]. The resulting file "
"can be viewed in Godot with [VideoStreamPlayer] and most video players, but "
"not web browsers as they don't support Theora.\n"
"- AVI container with MJPEG for video and uncompressed audio ([code].avi[/"
"code] file extension). Lossy compression, medium file sizes, fast encoding. "
"The lossy compression quality can be adjusted by changing [member "
"ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/video_quality]. The resulting file can be "
"viewed in most video players, but it must be converted to another format for "
"viewing on the web or by Godot with [VideoStreamPlayer]. MJPEG does not "
"support transparency. AVI output is currently limited to a file of 4 GB in "
"size at most.\n"
"- PNG image sequence for video and WAV for audio ([code].png[/code] file "
"extension). Lossless compression, large file sizes, slow encoding. Designed "
"to be encoded to a video file with another tool such as [url=https://"
"ffmpeg.org/]FFmpeg[/url] after recording. Transparency is currently not "
"supported, even if the root viewport is set to be transparent.\n"
"If you need to encode to a different format or pipe a stream through third-"
"party software, you can extend this [MovieWriter] class to create your own "
"movie writers.\n"
"When using PNG output, the frame number will be appended at the end of the "
"file name. It starts from 0 and is padded with 8 digits to ensure correct "
"sorting and easier processing. For example, if the output path is [code]/tmp/"
"hello.png[/code], the first two frames will be [code]/tmp/hello00000000.png[/"
"code] and [code]/tmp/hello00000001.png[/code]. The audio will be saved at "
"[code]/tmp/hello.wav[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງຜົນອອກ (output path) ສຳລັບວິດີໂອ. ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ຈະເປັນຕົວກຳນົດ [MovieWriter] "
"ທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້.\n"
"Godot ມີ [MovieWriter] ມາໃຫ້ 3 ແບບ:\n"
"- OGV container ທີ່ໃຊ້ Theora ສຳລັບວິດີໂອ ແລະ Vorbis ສຳລັບສຽງ (ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ "
"[code].ogv[/code]). ເປັນການບີບອັດແບບສູນເສຍຄຸນນະພາບ (Lossy), ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ປານກາງ, "
"ເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄວ. ຄຸນນະພາບການບີບອັດສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ [member ProjectSettings.editor/"
"movie_writer/video_quality] ແລະ [member ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/"
"ogv/audio_quality]. ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນ Godot ດ້ວຍ [VideoStreamPlayer] ແລະ "
"ໂປຣແກຣມຫຼິ້ນວິດີໂອສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ແຕ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນເວັບບຣາວເຊີເພາະພວກມັນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ Theora.\n"
"- AVI container ທີ່ໃຊ້ MJPEG ສຳລັບວິດີໂອ ແລະ ສຽງແບບບໍ່ບີບອັດ (ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ [code].avi[/"
"code]). ເປັນການບີບອັດແບບສູນເສຍຄຸນນະພາບ, ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ປານກາງ, ເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄວ. "
"ສາມາດປັບຄຸນນະພາບໄດ້ໂດຍປ່ຽນ [member ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/"
"video_quality]. ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນໂປຣແກຣມຫຼິ້ນວິດີໂອສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແປງເປັນຮູບແບບອື່ນກ່ອນຈຶ່ງຈະເບິ່ງໃນເວັບ ຫຼື ໃນ Godot ດ້ວຍ [VideoStreamPlayer] ໄດ້. "
"MJPEG ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ. ຜົນອອກແບບ AVI ປະຈຸບັນຖືກຈຳກັດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ສູງສຸດທີ່ 4 GB.\n"
"- PNG image sequence ສຳລັບວິດີໂອ ແລະ WAV ສຳລັບສຽງ (ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ [code].png[/code]). "
"ເປັນການບີບອັດແບບບໍ່ສູນເສຍຄຸນນະພາບ (Lossless), ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ໃຫຍ່, ເຂົ້າລະຫັດຊ້າ. "
"ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ນຳໄປເຂົ້າລະຫັດເປັນໄຟລ໌ວິດີໂອດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມືອື່ນເຊັ່ນ [url=https://"
"ffmpeg.org/]FFmpeg[/url] ຫຼັງຈາກບັນທຶກ. ປະຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"root viewport ໃຫ້ໂປ່ງໃສກໍຕາມ.\n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າລະຫັດເປັນຮູບແບບອື່ນ ຫຼື ສົ່ງຕໍ່ stream ຜ່ານຊອບແວພາຍນອກ, ທ່ານສາມາດສືບທອດຄລາດ "
"[MovieWriter] ນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ movie writer ຂອງທ່ານເອງໄດ້.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຜົນອອກແບບ PNG, ເລກເຟຣມຈະຖືກຕໍ່ທ້າຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌. ມັນຈະເລີ່ມຈາກ 0 ແລະ ເຕີມດ້ວຍຕົວເລກ 8 ຫຼັກ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການຈັດລຽງຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ງ່າຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າເສັ້ນທາງຜົນອອກແມ່ນ [code]/tmp/"
"hello.png[/code], ສອງເຟຣມທຳອິດຈະແມ່ນ [code]/tmp/hello00000000.png[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]/tmp/hello00000001.png[/code]. ສ່ວນສຽງຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ທີ່ [code]/tmp/hello.wav[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"The audio encoding quality to use when writing Vorbis audio to a file, "
"between [code]-0.1[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] (inclusive). Higher "
"[code]quality[/code] values result in better-sounding output at the cost of "
"larger file sizes. Even at quality [code]1.0[/code], compression remains "
"lossy.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does not affect video quality, which is controlled by "
"[member editor/movie_writer/video_quality] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດສຽງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອຂຽນສຽງ Vorbis ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌, ລະຫວ່າງ [code]-0.1[/code] "
"ຫາ [code]1.0[/code]. ຄ່າ [code]quality[/code] ທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງດີຂຶ້ນ "
"ແຕ່ຈະແລກມາກັບຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະໃຊ້ຄຸນນະພາບ [code]1.0[/code], "
"ການບີບອັດກໍຍັງເປັນແບບສູນເສຍຄຸນນະພາບ (lossy) ຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄຸນນະພາບວິດີໂອ, ເຊິ່ງຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ [member editor/movie_writer/"
"video_quality] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The tradeoff between encoding speed and compression efficiency. Speed "
"[code]1[/code] is the slowest but provides the best compression. Speed "
"[code]4[/code] is the fastest but provides the worst compression. Video "
"quality is generally not affected significantly by this setting."
msgstr ""
"ການເລືອກລະຫວ່າງຄວາມໄວໃນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ ແລະ ປະສິດທິພາບການບີບອັດ. ຄວາມໄວ [code]1[/code] "
"ແມ່ນຊ້າທີ່ສຸດແຕ່ໃຫ້ການບີບອັດທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ. ຄວາມໄວ [code]4[/code] ແມ່ນໄວທີ່ສຸດແຕ່ໃຫ້ການບີບອັດທີ່ຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດ. "
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ຄຸນນະພາບວິດີໂອຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຫຼາຍຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້."

msgid ""
"Forces keyframes at the specified interval (in frame count). Higher values "
"can improve compression up to a certain level at the expense of higher "
"latency when seeking."
msgstr ""
"ບັງຄັບຄີເຟຣມ (keyframes) ຕາມໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ກຳນົດ (ເປັນຈຳນວນເຟຣມ). "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນສາມາດປັບປຸງການບີບອັດໄດ້ໃນລະດັບໃດໜຶ່ງ ແຕ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຊ້າ (latency) "
"ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນເມື່ອທຳການເລື່ອນເບິ່ງ (seeking) ວິດີໂອ."

msgid ""
"The speaker mode to use in the recorded audio when writing a movie. See [enum "
"AudioServer.SpeakerMode] for possible values."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດລຳໂພງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນສຽງທີ່ບັນທຶກເມື່ອຂຽນວິດີໂອ. ເບິ່ງ [enum AudioServer.SpeakerMode] "
"ສຳລັບຄ່າຕ່າງໆທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The video encoding quality to use when writing a Theora or AVI (MJPEG) video "
"to a file, between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] (inclusive). Higher "
"[code]quality[/code] values result in better-looking output at the cost of "
"larger file sizes. Recommended [code]quality[/code] values are between "
"[code]0.75[/code] and [code]0.9[/code]. Even at quality [code]1.0[/code], "
"compression remains lossy."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດວິດີໂອທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອຂຽນວິດີໂອ Theora ຫຼື AVI (MJPEG) ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌, ລະຫວ່າງ "
"[code]0.0[/code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/code]. ຄ່າ [code]quality[/code] "
"ທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບເບິ່ງດີຂຶ້ນແຕ່ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ຈະໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າ [code]quality[/code] "
"ທີ່ແນະນຳແມ່ນລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.75[/code] ຫາ [code]0.9[/code]. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະໃຊ້ຄຸນນະພາບ "
"[code]1.0[/code], ການບີບອັດກໍຍັງເປັນແບບສູນເສຍຄຸນນະພາບຢູ່."

msgid ""
"The format of the default signal callback name (in the Signal Connection "
"Dialog). The following substitutions are available: [code]{NodeName}[/code], "
"[code]{nodeName}[/code], [code]{node_name}[/code], [code]{SignalName}[/code], "
"[code]{signalName}[/code], and [code]{signal_name}[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບຂອງຊື່ callback ສັນຍານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ). ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າແທນທີ່ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໄດ້: "
"[code]{NodeName}[/code], [code]{nodeName}[/code], [code]{node_name}[/code], "
"[code]{SignalName}[/code], [code]{signalName}[/code], ແລະ [code]{signal_name}"
"[/code]."

msgid ""
"The format of the default signal callback name when a signal connects to the "
"same node that emits it (in the Signal Connection Dialog). The following "
"substitutions are available: [code]{NodeName}[/code], [code]{nodeName}[/"
"code], [code]{node_name}[/code], [code]{SignalName}[/code], [code]{signalName}"
"[/code], and [code]{signal_name}[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບຂອງຊື່ callback ສັນຍານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ເມື່ອສັນຍານເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບໂນດດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາ "
"(ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ). ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າແທນທີ່ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໄດ້: [code]{NodeName}[/code], [code]"
"{nodeName}[/code], [code]{node_name}[/code], [code]{SignalName}[/code], [code]"
"{signalName}[/code], ແລະ [code]{signal_name}[/code]."

msgid ""
"When creating node names automatically, set the type of casing to use in this "
"project. This is mostly an editor setting."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສ້າງຊື່ໂນດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຮູບແບບການໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນ (casing) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນໂປຣເຈັກນີ້. "
"ນີ້ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"What to use to separate node name from number. This is mostly an editor "
"setting."
msgstr "ສິ່ງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ແຍກຊື່ໂນດອອກຈາກຕົວເລກ. ນີ້ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"The command-line arguments to append to Godot's own command line when running "
"the project. This doesn't affect the editor itself.\n"
"It is possible to make another executable run Godot by using the [code]"
"%command%[/code] placeholder. The placeholder will be replaced with Godot's "
"own command line. Program-specific arguments should be placed [i]before[/i] "
"the placeholder, whereas Godot-specific arguments should be placed [i]after[/"
"i] the placeholder.\n"
"For example, this can be used to force the project to run on the dedicated "
"GPU in an NVIDIA Optimus system on Linux:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"prime-run %command%\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ອາຄິວເມັ້ນ (arguments) ຂອງຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມໃສ່ command line ຂອງ Godot ເອງເມື່ອເປີດໂປຣເຈັກ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"ເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ executable ອື່ນເປີດ Godot ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ [code]%command%[/code] "
"ເປັນໂຕແທນ (placeholder). ໂຕແທນນີ້ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍ command line ຂອງ Godot ເອງ. "
"ອາຄິວເມັ້ນສະເພາະຂອງໂປຣແກຣມຄວນວາງໄວ້ [i]ກ່ອນ[/i] ໂຕແທນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ອາຄິວເມັ້ນສະເພາະຂອງ "
"Godot ຄວນວາງໄວ້ [i]ຫຼັງ[/i] ໂຕແທນ.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຫ້ໂປຣເຈັກເຮັດວຽກເທິງ GPU ແຍກໃນລະບົບ NVIDIA Optimus ເທິງ "
"Linux:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"prime-run %command%\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Search path for project-specific script templates. Godot will search for "
"script templates both in the editor-specific path and in this project-"
"specific path."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງຄົ້ນຫາສຳລັບແມ່ແບບ (templates) ສະຄຣິບສະເພາະໂປຣເຈັກ. Godot "
"ຈະຄົ້ນຫາແມ່ແບບສະຄຣິບທັງໃນເສັ້ນທາງສະເພາະຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ໃນເສັ້ນທາງສະເພາະຂອງໂປຣເຈັກນີ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], Blender 3D scene files with the [code].blend[/code] "
"extension will be imported by converting them to glTF 2.0.\n"
"This requires configuring a path to a Blender executable in the [member "
"EditorSettings.filesystem/import/blender/blender_path] setting. Blender 3.0 "
"or later is required."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໄຟລ໌ສາກ Blender 3D ທີ່ມີນາມສະກຸນ [code].blend[/code] "
"ຈະຖືກນຳເຂົ້າໂດຍການແປງເປັນ glTF 2.0.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງການການຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ Blender executable ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"EditorSettings.filesystem/import/blender/blender_path]. ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ Blender ເວີຊັນ "
"3.0 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Override for [member filesystem/import/blender/enabled] on Android where "
"Blender can't easily be accessed from Godot."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າແທນທີ່ (Override) ສຳລັບ [member filesystem/import/blender/enabled] ເທິງ Android "
"ເຊິ່ງ Godot ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ Blender ໄດ້ໂດຍງ່າຍ."

msgid ""
"Override for [member filesystem/import/blender/enabled] on the Web where "
"Blender can't easily be accessed from Godot."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າແທນທີ່ (Override) ສຳລັບ [member filesystem/import/blender/enabled] ເທິງ Web ເຊິ່ງ "
"Godot ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ Blender ໄດ້ໂດຍງ່າຍ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], Autodesk FBX 3D scene files with the [code].fbx[/code] "
"extension will be imported by converting them to glTF 2.0.\n"
"This requires configuring a path to an FBX2glTF executable in the editor "
"settings at [member EditorSettings.filesystem/import/fbx/fbx2gltf_path]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໄຟລ໌ສາກ Autodesk FBX 3D ທີ່ມີນາມສະກຸນ [code].fbx[/code] "
"ຈະຖືກນຳເຂົ້າໂດຍການແປງເປັນ glTF 2.0.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງການການຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ FBX2glTF executable ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແກ້ໄຂທີ່ [member "
"EditorSettings.filesystem/import/fbx/fbx2gltf_path]."

msgid ""
"Override for [member filesystem/import/fbx2gltf/enabled] on Android where "
"FBX2glTF can't easily be accessed from Godot."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າແທນທີ່ (Override) ສຳລັບ [member filesystem/import/fbx2gltf/enabled] ເທິງ "
"Android ເຊິ່ງ Godot ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ FBX2glTF ໄດ້ໂດຍງ່າຍ."

msgid ""
"Override for [member filesystem/import/fbx2gltf/enabled] on the Web where "
"FBX2glTF can't easily be accessed from Godot."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າແທນທີ່ (Override) ສຳລັບ [member filesystem/import/fbx2gltf/enabled] ເທິງ Web "
"ເຊິ່ງ Godot ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ FBX2glTF ໄດ້ໂດຍງ່າຍ."

msgid ""
"Default value for [member ScrollContainer.scroll_deadzone], which will be "
"used for all [ScrollContainer]s unless overridden."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ [member ScrollContainer.scroll_deadzone], ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບທຸກໆ "
"[ScrollContainer] ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າແທນທີ່."

msgid ""
"The minimum distance the mouse cursor must move while pressed before a drag "
"operation begins in the default viewport. For custom viewports see [member "
"Viewport.gui_drag_threshold]."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ຕ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກົດຢູ່ ກ່ອນທີ່ການລາກ (drag) ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນ viewport "
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສຳລັບ viewport ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [member Viewport.gui_drag_threshold]."

msgid ""
"Determines whether a [Control] should visually indicate focus when that focus "
"is gained using a mouse or touch input.\n"
"- [b]Never[/b] ([code]0[/code]) show the focused state for mouse/touch "
"input.\n"
"- [b]Text Input Controls[/b] ([code]1[/code]) show the focused state even if "
"that focus was gained via mouse/touch input (similar to browser behavior).\n"
"- [b]Always[/b] ([code]2[/code]) show the focused state, even if that focus "
"was gained via mouse/touch input."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າ [Control] ຄວນສະແດງການເນັ້ນ (focus) ໃຫ້ເຫັນຫຼືບໍ່ ເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບການເນັ້ນນັ້ນຜ່ານການໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື "
"ການສຳຜັດ.\n"
"- [b]Never[/b] ([code]0[/code]) ບໍ່ສະແດງສະຖານະການເນັ້ນສຳລັບການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຜ່ານເມົາສ໌/"
"ການສຳຜັດ.\n"
"- [b]Text Input Controls[/b] ([code]1[/code]) ສະແດງສະຖານະການເນັ້ນ "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການເນັ້ນນັ້ນຈະໄດ້ມາຈາກເມົາສ໌/ການສຳຜັດ (ຄ້າຍຄືກັບພຶດຕິກຳຂອງບຣາວເຊີ).\n"
"- [b]Always[/b] ([code]2[/code]) ສະແດງສະຖານະການເນັ້ນສະເໝີ, "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການເນັ້ນນັ້ນຈະໄດ້ມາຈາກເມົາສ໌/ການສຳຜັດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], snaps [Control] node vertices to the nearest pixel to "
"ensure they remain crisp even when the camera moves or zooms."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະປັບຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດຍອດ (vertices) ຂອງໂນດ [Control] "
"ໃຫ້ກົງກັບພິກເຊວທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພວກມັນຍັງຄົງຄົມຊັດ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າກ້ອງຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ ຫຼື ຊູມກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"How to position the Cancel and OK buttons in the project's [AcceptDialog] "
"windows. Different platforms have different conventions for this, which can "
"be overridden through this setting.\n"
"- [b]Auto[/b] follows the platform convention: OK first on Windows, KDE, and "
"LXQt; Cancel first on macOS and other Linux desktop environments.\n"
"- [b]Cancel First[/b] forces the Cancel/OK ordering.\n"
"- [b]OK First[/b] forces the OK/Cancel ordering.\n"
"To check if these buttons are swapped at runtime, use [method "
"DisplayServer.get_swap_cancel_ok].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This doesn't affect native dialogs such as the ones spawned by "
"[method DisplayServer.dialog_show]."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການຈັດວາງປຸ່ມ ຍົກເລີກ (Cancel) ແລະ ຕົກລົງ (OK) ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ [AcceptDialog] ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ. "
"ແຕ່ລະແພລດຟອມມີຂໍ້ກຳນົດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນສຳລັບສິ່ງນີ້, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າແທນທີ່ໄດ້ຜ່ານການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້.\n"
"- [b]Auto[/b] ຈະເຮັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງແພລດຟອມ: OK ຂຶ້ນກ່ອນໃນ Windows, KDE, ແລະ LXQt; "
"Cancel ຂຶ້ນກ່ອນໃນ macOS ແລະ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເດັສທັອບ Linux ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"- [b]Cancel First[/b] ບັງຄັບການຈັດລຽງແບບ Cancel/OK.\n"
"- [b]OK First[/b] ບັງຄັບການຈັດລຽງແບບ OK/Cancel.\n"
"ເພື່ອຖາມເບິ່ງວ່າປຸ່ມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກສະຫຼັບກັນຫຼືບໍ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດວຽກ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"DisplayServer.get_swap_cancel_ok].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບຂອງລະບົບ (native dialogs) ເຊັ່ນອັນທີ່ຖືກສ້າງໂດຍ "
"[method DisplayServer.dialog_show]."

msgid "Maximum undo/redo history size for [TextEdit] fields."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດປະຫວັດການຍົກເລີກ/ເຮັດຄືນ (undo/redo) ສູງສຸດສຳລັບຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນ [TextEdit]."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code] and [member display/window/stretch/mode] is set "
"to [code]\"canvas_items\"[/code], font and [DPITexture] oversampling is "
"enabled in the main window. Use [member Viewport.oversampling] to control "
"oversampling in other viewports and windows."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ [member display/window/stretch/mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]\"canvas_items\"[/code], ການເຮັດ oversampling ຂອງຟອນ ແລະ [DPITexture] "
"ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member Viewport.oversampling] ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມ oversampling "
"ໃນ viewport ແລະ ໜ້າຕ່າງອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"Path to a custom [Theme] resource file to use for the project ([code].theme[/"
"code] or generic [code].tres[/code]/[code].res[/code] extension)."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Theme] ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກ (ນາມສະກຸນ [code].theme[/"
"code] ຫຼື [code].tres[/code]/[code].res[/code] ທົ່ວໄປ)."

msgid ""
"Path to a custom [Font] resource to use as default for all GUI elements of "
"the project."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Font] ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບທຸກອົງປະກອບ GUI ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"Font anti-aliasing mode for the default project font. See [member "
"FontFile.antialiasing].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting does not affect custom [Font]s used within the "
"project. Use the [b]Import[/b] dock for that instead (see [member "
"ResourceImporterDynamicFont.antialiasing])."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການລຶບຮອຍຢັກ (anti-aliasing) ຂອງຟອນ ສຳລັບຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"FontFile.antialiasing].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ [Font] ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງທີ່ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນໂປຣເຈັກ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ dock "
"[b]Import[/b] ສຳລັບສິ່ງນັ້ນແທນ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"ResourceImporterDynamicFont.antialiasing])."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], the default font will have mipmaps generated. "
"This prevents text from looking grainy when a [Control] is scaled down, or "
"when a [Label3D] is viewed from a long distance (if [member "
"Label3D.texture_filter] is set to a mode that displays mipmaps).\n"
"Enabling [member gui/theme/default_font_generate_mipmaps] increases font "
"generation time and memory usage. Only enable this setting if you actually "
"need it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting does not affect custom [Font]s used within the "
"project. Use the [b]Import[/b] dock for that instead (see [member "
"ResourceImporterDynamicFont.generate_mipmaps])."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະຖືກສ້າງ mipmaps. "
"ນີ້ຈະປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມເບິ່ງຄືມີເມັດຊາຍ (grainy) ເມື່ອ [Control] ຖືກຍໍ້ຂະໜາດລົງ, ຫຼື ເມື່ອເບິ່ງ "
"[Label3D] ຈາກໄລຍະໄກ (ຖ້າ [member Label3D.texture_filter] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນໂໝດທີ່ສະແດງ "
"mipmaps).\n"
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ [member gui/theme/default_font_generate_mipmaps] "
"ຈະເພີ່ມເວລາໃນການສ້າງຟອນ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ. "
"ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການມັນແທ້ໆເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ [Font] ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງທີ່ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນໂປຣເຈັກ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ dock "
"[b]Import[/b] ສຳລັບສິ່ງນັ້ນແທນ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"ResourceImporterDynamicFont.generate_mipmaps])."

msgid ""
"Font hinting mode for the default project font. See [member "
"FontFile.hinting].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting does not affect custom [Font]s used within the "
"project. Use the [b]Import[/b] dock for that instead (see [member "
"ResourceImporterDynamicFont.hinting])."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ hinting ຂອງຟອນ ສຳລັບຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ. ເບິ່ງ [member FontFile.hinting].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ [Font] ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງທີ່ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນໂປຣເຈັກ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ dock "
"[b]Import[/b] ສຳລັບສິ່ງນັ້ນແທນ (ເບິ່ງ [member ResourceImporterDynamicFont.hinting])."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], the default font will use multichannel signed "
"distance field (MSDF) for crisp rendering at any size. Since this approach "
"does not rely on rasterizing the font every time its size changes, this "
"allows for resizing the font in real-time without any performance penalty. "
"Text will also not look grainy for [Control]s that are scaled down (or for "
"[Label3D]s viewed from a long distance).\n"
"MSDF font rendering can be combined with [member gui/theme/"
"default_font_generate_mipmaps] to further improve font rendering quality when "
"scaled down.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting does not affect custom [Font]s used within the "
"project. Use the [b]Import[/b] dock for that instead (see [member "
"ResourceImporterDynamicFont.multichannel_signed_distance_field])."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະໃຊ້ multichannel signed distance field "
"(MSDF) ສໍາລັບການສະແດງຜົນທີ່ຄົມຊັດໃນທຸກຂະໜາດ. ເນື່ອງຈາກວິທີນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເພິ່ງພາການເຮັດ rasterizing "
"ຟອນທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ຂະໜາດຂອງມັນປ່ຽນແປງ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຶ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດຟອນໄດ້ໃນເວລາຈິງ (real-time) "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ. ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະບໍ່ເບິ່ງຄືມີເມັດຊາຍສຳລັບ [Control] ທີ່ຖືກຍໍ້ຂະໜາດລົງ (ຫຼື ສຳລັບ "
"[Label3D] ທີ່ເບິ່ງຈາກໄລຍະໄກ).\n"
"ການສະແດງຜົນຟອນແບບ MSDF ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [member gui/theme/"
"default_font_generate_mipmaps] ເພື່ອປັບປຸງຄຸນນະພາບການສະແດງຜົນຟອນຕື່ມອີກເມື່ອຖືກຍໍ້ຂະໜາດລົງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ [Font] ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງທີ່ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນໂປຣເຈັກ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ dock "
"[b]Import[/b] ສຳລັບສິ່ງນັ້ນແທນ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"ResourceImporterDynamicFont.multichannel_signed_distance_field])."

msgid ""
"Font glyph subpixel positioning mode for the default project font. See "
"[member FontFile.subpixel_positioning].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting does not affect custom [Font]s used within the "
"project. Use the [b]Import[/b] dock for that instead (see [member "
"ResourceImporterDynamicFont.subpixel_positioning])."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການວາງຕຳແໜ່ງ subpixel ຂອງຕົວອັກສອນຟອນ (glyph) ສຳລັບຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[member FontFile.subpixel_positioning].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ [Font] ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງທີ່ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນໂປຣເຈັກ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ dock "
"[b]Import[/b] ສຳລັບສິ່ງນັ້ນແທນ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"ResourceImporterDynamicFont.subpixel_positioning])."

msgid ""
"The default scale factor for [Control]s, when not overridden by a [Theme].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the default theme scale at runtime, set [member ThemeDB.fallback_base_scale] "
"instead. However, to adjust the scale of all 2D elements at runtime, it's "
"preferable to use [member Window.content_scale_factor] on the root [Window] "
"node instead (as this also affects overridden [Theme]s). See [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.html]Multiple resolutions[/url] in "
"the documentation for details."
msgstr ""
"ປັດໄຈການຂະຫຍາຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ [Control], ເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າແທນທີ່ໂດຍ [Theme].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຂະໜາດທີມ (theme scale) "
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດວຽກ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member ThemeDB.fallback_base_scale] ແທນ. "
"ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ເພື່ອປັບຂະໜາດຂອງອົງປະກອບ 2D ທັງໝົດໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດວຽກ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member "
"Window.content_scale_factor] ໃນໂນດ [Window] ຫຼັກແທນ (ເພາະສິ່ງນີ້ຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ [Theme] "
"ທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າແທນທີ່ນຳ). ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດໄດ້ທີ່ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/rendering/"
"multiple_resolutions.html]Multiple resolutions[/url] ໃນເອກະສານ."

msgid ""
"LCD subpixel layout used for font anti-aliasing. See [enum "
"TextServer.FontLCDSubpixelLayout]."
msgstr ""
"ການຈັດວາງ LCD subpixel ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການລຶບຮອຍຢັກຂອງຟອນ. ເບິ່ງ [enum "
"TextServer.FontLCDSubpixelLayout]."

msgid ""
"When [member BaseButton.shortcut_feedback] is enabled, this is the time the "
"[BaseButton] will remain highlighted after a shortcut. This duration is not "
"affected by [member Engine.time_scale]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ [member BaseButton.shortcut_feedback], ນີ້ແມ່ນເວລາທີ່ [BaseButton] "
"ຈະຍັງຄົງສະແດງການເນັ້ນຫຼັງຈາກກົດຄີລັດ. ໄລຍະເວລານີ້ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ [member "
"Engine.time_scale]."

msgid ""
"Timer setting for incremental search in [Tree], [ItemList], etc. controls (in "
"milliseconds)."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາສຳລັບການຄົ້ນຫາແບບເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ (incremental search) ໃນ [Tree], [ItemList], "
"ແລະ ອື່ນໆ (ເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ)."

msgid "Timer for detecting idle in [TextEdit] (in seconds)."
msgstr "ເວລາສຳລັບການກວດສອບການຢຸດພັກ (idle) ໃນ [TextEdit] (ເປັນວິນາທີ)."

msgid "Default delay for tooltips (in seconds)."
msgstr "ເວລາໜ່ວງ (delay) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ tooltips (ເປັນວິນາທີ)."

msgid "Delay for tooltips in the editor."
msgstr "ເວລາໜ່ວງສຳລັບ tooltips ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Default [InputEventAction] to confirm a focused button, menu or list item, or "
"validate input.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Default [code]ui_*[/code] actions cannot be removed as they are "
"necessary for the internal logic of several [Control]s. The events assigned "
"to the action can however be modified."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [InputEventAction] ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນປຸ່ມທີ່ກຳລັງເນັ້ນ, ລາຍການເມນູ ຫຼື ລາຍການໃນລິສທ໌, ຫຼື "
"ເພື່ອກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການກະທຳ (actions) [code]ui_*[/code] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບອອກໄດ້ "
"ເພາະພວກມັນມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນສຳລັບຕັກກະພາຍໃນຂອງ [Control] ຕ່າງໆ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ເຫດການ "
"(events) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບການກະທຳນັ້ນສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Default [InputEventAction] to start or end a drag-and-drop operation without "
"using mouse.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Default [code]ui_*[/code] actions cannot be removed as they are "
"necessary for the internal logic of several [Control]s. The events assigned "
"to the action can however be modified."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [InputEventAction] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫຼື ສິ້ນສຸດການລາກແລ້ວວາງ (drag-and-drop) "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການກະທຳ [code]ui_*[/code] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບອອກໄດ້ "
"ເພາະພວກມັນມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນສຳລັບຕັກກະພາຍໃນຂອງ [Control] ຕ່າງໆ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ເຫດການທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບການກະທຳນັ້ນສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້."

