msgid ""
"Godot uses a message queue to defer some function calls. If you run out of "
"space on it (you will see an error), you can increase the size here."
msgstr ""
"Godot ໃຊ້ຄິວຂໍ້ຄວາມ (message queue) ເພື່ອເລື່ອນບາງການເອີ້ນຟັງຊັນ. ຫາກພື້ນທີ່ໃນຄິວເຕັມ "
"(ທ່ານຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ), ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມຂະໜາດໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Default cell size for 2D navigation maps. See [method "
"NavigationServer2D.map_set_cell_size]."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຫ້ອງ (cell size) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງ 2D. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"NavigationServer2D.map_set_cell_size]."

msgid ""
"Default edge connection margin for 2D navigation maps. See [method "
"NavigationServer2D.map_set_edge_connection_margin]."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອບ (edge connection margin) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງ 2D. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method NavigationServer2D.map_set_edge_connection_margin]."

msgid ""
"Default link connection radius for 2D navigation maps. See [method "
"NavigationServer2D.map_set_link_connection_radius]."
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລິງກ໌ (link connection radius) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງ 2D. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method NavigationServer2D.map_set_link_connection_radius]."

msgid ""
"Default merge rasterizer cell scale for 2D navigation maps. See [method "
"NavigationServer2D.map_set_merge_rasterizer_cell_scale]."
msgstr ""
"ມາດຕາສ່ວນຫ້ອງຂອງຕົວແປງຮູບພາບການຮ່ວມ (merge rasterizer cell scale) "
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງ 2D. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"NavigationServer2D.map_set_merge_rasterizer_cell_scale]."

msgid ""
"Sets which navigation engine to use for 2D navigation.\n"
"[b]DEFAULT[/b] is equivalent to [b]GodotNavigation2D[/b], but may change in "
"future releases. Select an explicit implementation if you want to ensure that "
"your project stays on the same engine.\n"
"[b]GodotNavigation2D[/b] is Godot's internal 2D navigation engine.\n"
"[b]Dummy[/b] is a 2D navigation server that does nothing and returns only "
"dummy values, effectively disabling all 2D navigation functionality.\n"
"Third-party modules can add other navigation engines to select with this "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຈະໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງຈັກການນຳທາງໃດສຳລັບການນຳທາງ 2D.\n"
"[b]DEFAULT[/b] ແມ່ນທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [b]GodotNavigation2D[/b], "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃນເວີຊັນອະນາຄົດ. "
"ເລືອກການນຳໃຊ້ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງຈັກເດີມ.\n"
"[b]GodotNavigation2D[/b] ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງຈັກການນຳທາງ 2D ພາຍໃນຂອງ Godot.\n"
"[b]Dummy[/b] ແມ່ນເຊີບເວີການນຳທາງ 2D ທີ່ບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຫຍັງ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນພຽງແຕ່ຄ່າສົມມຸດ, "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນການປິດການນຳໃຊ້ທຸກຟັງຊັນການນຳທາງ 2D.\n"
"ໂມດູນຈາກພາຍນອກສາມາດເພີ່ມເຄື່ອງຈັກການນຳທາງອື່ນໆ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເລືອກໄດ້ດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້."

msgid ""
"If enabled 2D navigation regions will use edge connections to connect with "
"other navigation regions within proximity of the navigation map edge "
"connection margin. This setting only affects World2D default navigation maps."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ເຂດການນຳທາງ 2D ຈະໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອບເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຂດການນຳທາງອື່ນໆ "
"ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບໄລຍະຫ່າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອບຂອງແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງ. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ World2D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the navigation system will print warnings when a "
"navigation mesh with a small cell size is used on a navigation map with a "
"larger size as this commonly causes rasterization errors."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລະບົບການນຳທາງຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ navigation mesh "
"ທີ່ມີຂະໜາດຫ້ອງນ້ອຍເກີນໄປໃນແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ "
"ເພາະໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການແປງຮູບພາບ (rasterization errors)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the navigation system will print warnings about "
"navigation mesh edge merge errors occurring in navigation regions or maps."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລະບົບການນຳທາງຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການຮ່ວມຂອບຂອງ "
"navigation mesh ທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນເຂດ ຫຼື ແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງ."

msgid ""
"Default cell height for 3D navigation maps. See [method "
"NavigationServer3D.map_set_cell_height]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສູງຫ້ອງ (cell height) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງ 3D. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"NavigationServer3D.map_set_cell_height]."

msgid ""
"Default cell size for 3D navigation maps. See [method "
"NavigationServer3D.map_set_cell_size]."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຫ້ອງ (cell size) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງ 3D. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"NavigationServer3D.map_set_cell_size]."

msgid ""
"Default edge connection margin for 3D navigation maps. See [method "
"NavigationServer3D.map_set_edge_connection_margin]."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອບ (edge connection margin) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງ 3D. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method NavigationServer3D.map_set_edge_connection_margin]."

msgid ""
"Default link connection radius for 3D navigation maps. See [method "
"NavigationServer3D.map_set_link_connection_radius]."
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລິງກ໌ (link connection radius) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງ 3D. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method NavigationServer3D.map_set_link_connection_radius]."

msgid ""
"Default up orientation for 3D navigation maps. See [method "
"NavigationServer3D.map_set_up]."
msgstr ""
"ທິດທາງດ້ານເທິງ (up orientation) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງ 3D. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"NavigationServer3D.map_set_up]."

msgid ""
"Default merge rasterizer cell scale for 3D navigation maps. See [method "
"NavigationServer3D.map_set_merge_rasterizer_cell_scale]."
msgstr ""
"ມາດຕາສ່ວນຫ້ອງຂອງຕົວແປງຮູບພາບການຮ່ວມ (merge rasterizer cell scale) "
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງ 3D. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"NavigationServer3D.map_set_merge_rasterizer_cell_scale]."

msgid ""
"Sets which navigation engine to use for 3D navigation.\n"
"[b]DEFAULT[/b] is equivalent to [b]GodotNavigation3D[/b], but may change in "
"future releases. Select an explicit implementation if you want to ensure that "
"your project stays on the same engine.\n"
"[b]GodotNavigation3D[/b] is Godot's internal 3D navigation engine.\n"
"[b]Dummy[/b] is a 3D navigation server that does nothing and returns only "
"dummy values, effectively disabling all 3D navigation functionality.\n"
"Third-party modules can add other navigation engines to select with this "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຈະໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງຈັກການນຳທາງໃດສຳລັບການນຳທາງ 3D.\n"
"[b]DEFAULT[/b] ແມ່ນທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [b]GodotNavigation3D[/b], "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃນເວີຊັນອະນາຄົດ. "
"ເລືອກການນຳໃຊ້ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງຈັກເດີມ.\n"
"[b]GodotNavigation3D[/b] ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງຈັກການນຳທາງ 3D ພາຍໃນຂອງ Godot.\n"
"[b]Dummy[/b] ແມ່ນເຊີບເວີການນຳທາງ 3D ທີ່ບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຫຍັງ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນພຽງແຕ່ຄ່າສົມມຸດ, "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນການປິດການນຳໃຊ້ທຸກຟັງຊັນການນຳທາງ 3D.\n"
"ໂມດູນຈາກພາຍນອກສາມາດເພີ່ມເຄື່ອງຈັກການນຳທາງອື່ນໆ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເລືອກໄດ້ດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້."

msgid ""
"If enabled 3D navigation regions will use edge connections to connect with "
"other navigation regions within proximity of the navigation map edge "
"connection margin. This setting only affects World3D default navigation maps."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ເຂດການນຳທາງ 3D ຈະໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອບເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຂດການນຳທາງອື່ນໆ "
"ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບໄລຍະຫ່າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອບຂອງແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງ. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ World3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the navigation system will print warnings when a "
"navigation mesh with a small cell size (or in 3D height) is used on a "
"navigation map with a larger size as this commonly causes rasterization "
"errors."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລະບົບການນຳທາງຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ navigation mesh "
"ທີ່ມີຂະໜາດຫ້ອງ (ຫຼື ຄວາມສູງໃນ 3D) ນ້ອຍເກີນໄປໃນແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ "
"ເພາະໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການແປງຮູບພາບ (rasterization errors)."

msgid ""
"If enabled and avoidance calculations use multiple threads the threads run "
"with high priority."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ການຄຳນວນການຫຼີກລ່ຽງໃຊ້ຫຼາຍເທຣດ (threads), "
"ເທຣດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງ."

msgid "If enabled the avoidance calculations use multiple threads."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ການຄຳນວນການຫຼີກລ່ຽງຈະໃຊ້ຫຼາຍເທຣດ (threads)."

msgid ""
"If enabled and async navmesh baking uses multiple threads the threads run "
"with high priority."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ການອົບ navmesh ແບບອະຊິງໂຄຣນັດ (async) ໃຊ້ຫຼາຍເທຣດ, "
"ເທຣດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງ."

msgid "If enabled the async navmesh baking uses multiple threads."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ການອົບ navmesh ແບບອະຊິງໂຄຣນັດ (async) ຈະໃຊ້ຫຼາຍເທຣດ."

msgid ""
"If enabled, and baking would potentially lead to an engine crash, the baking "
"will be interrupted and an error message with explanation will be raised."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ແລະ ການອົບ (baking) ອາດຈະນຳໄປສູ່ການຂັດຂ້ອງຂອງເຄື່ອງຈັກ, ການອົບຈະຖືກຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ "
"ແລະ ຈະມີຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດພ້ອມຄຳອະທິບາຍແຈ້ງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of threads that can run pathfinding queries simultaneously on "
"the same pathfinding graph, for example the same navigation map. Additional "
"threads increase memory consumption and synchronization time due to the need "
"for extra data copies prepared for each thread. A value of [code]-1[/code] "
"means unlimited and the maximum available OS processor count is used. "
"Defaults to [code]1[/code] when the OS does not support threads."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນເທຣດສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດດຳເນີນການສອບຖາມການຫາເສັ້ນທາງ (pathfinding queries) "
"ພ້ອມກັນໃນກຣາບຫາເສັ້ນທາງດຽວກັນ, ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງດຽວກັນ. "
"ເທຣດທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ໃຊ້ເວລາໃນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສ໌ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຄວາມຈຳເປັນໃນການກັອບປີ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເທຣດ. ຄ່າ [code]-1[/code] "
"ໝາຍເຖິງບໍ່ຈຳກັດ ແລະ ຈະໃຊ້ຈຳນວນປະມວນຜົນສູງສຸດທີ່ມີໃນ OS. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [code]1[/code] ເມື່ອ OS "
"ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບເທຣດ."

msgid ""
"If enabled, navigation map synchronization uses an async process that runs on "
"a background thread. This avoids stalling the main thread but adds an "
"additional delay to any navigation map change."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສ໌ແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງຈະໃຊ້ຂະບວນການແບບອະຊິງໂຄຣນັດ (async) "
"ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນເທຣດພື້ນຫຼັງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼີກລ່ຽງການຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວຂອງເທຣດຫຼັກ "
"ແຕ່ຈະເພີ່ມຄວາມລ່າຊ້າໃຫ້ກັບການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆ ຂອງແຜນທີ່ການນຳທາງ."

msgid ""
"If enabled, navigation region synchronization uses an async process that runs "
"on a background thread. This avoids stalling the main thread but adds an "
"additional delay to any navigation region change."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສ໌ເຂດການນຳທາງຈະໃຊ້ຂະບວນການແບບອະຊິງໂຄຣນັດ (async) "
"ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນເທຣດພື້ນຫຼັງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼີກລ່ຽງການຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວຂອງເທຣດຫຼັກ "
"ແຕ່ຈະເພີ່ມຄວາມລ່າຊ້າໃຫ້ກັບການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆ ຂອງເຂດການນຳທາງ."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of characters allowed to send as output from the debugger. "
"Over this value, content is dropped. This helps not to stall the debugger "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຕົວອັກສອນສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສົ່ງເປັນຜົນການສະແດງ (output) ຈາກຕົວດີບັກ (debugger). "
"ຫາກເກີນຄ່ານີ້, ເນື້ອຫາຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຕົວດີບັກຢຸດຊະງັກ."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of errors allowed to be sent from the debugger. Over this "
"value, content is dropped. This helps not to stall the debugger connection."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສົ່ງຈາກຕົວດີບັກ. ຫາກເກີນຄ່ານີ້, ເນື້ອຫາຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຕົວດີບັກຢຸດຊະງັກ."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of messages in the debugger queue. Over this value, content is "
"dropped. This helps to limit the debugger memory usage."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຂໍ້ຄວາມສູງສຸດໃນຄິວຂອງຕົວດີບັກ. ຫາກເກີນຄ່ານີ້, ເນື້ອຫາຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຈຳກັດການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຂອງຕົວດີບັກ."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of warnings allowed to be sent from the debugger. Over this "
"value, content is dropped. This helps not to stall the debugger connection."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຄຳເຕືອນສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສົ່ງຈາກຕົວດີບັກ. ຫາກເກີນຄ່ານີ້, ເນື້ອຫາຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຕົວດີບັກຢຸດຊະງັກ."

msgid ""
"Default size of packet peer stream for deserializing Godot data (in bytes, "
"specified as a power of two). The default value [code]16[/code] is equal to "
"65,536 bytes. Over this size, data is dropped."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ packet peer stream ສຳລັບການຖອດລະຫັດ (deserializing) ຂໍ້ມູນ Godot "
"(ເປັນໄບຕ໌, ລະບຸເປັນກຳລັງຂອງສອງ). ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [code]16[/code] ແມ່ນເທົ່າກັບ 65,536 ໄບຕ໌. "
"ຫາກເກີນຂະໜາດນີ້, ຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ."

msgid "Timeout (in seconds) for connection attempts using TCP."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາ (ເປັນວິນາທີ) ສຳລັບຄວາມພະຍາຍາມໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ TCP."

msgid "Timeout (in seconds) for connection attempts using UNIX domain socket."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາ (ເປັນວິນາທີ) ສຳລັບຄວາມພະຍາຍາມໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ UNIX domain socket."

msgid "Maximum size (in kiB) for the [WebRTCDataChannel] input buffer."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດ (ເປັນ kiB) ສຳລັບບັບເຟີຂາເຂົ້າ (input buffer) ຂອງ [WebRTCDataChannel]."

msgid ""
"The CA certificates bundle to use for TLS connections. If this is set to a "
"non-empty value, this will [i]override[/i] Godot's default [url=https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/thirdparty/certs/ca-"
"bundle.crt]Mozilla certificate bundle[/url]. If left empty, the default "
"certificate bundle will be used.\n"
"If in doubt, leave this setting empty."
msgstr ""
"ຊຸດໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TLS. ຫາກຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ວ່າງ, ມັນຈະ [i]ແທນທີ່ (override)"
"[/i] [url=https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/thirdparty/certs/"
"ca-bundle.crt]ຊຸດໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ Mozilla[/url] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ Godot. ຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້, "
"ຈະໃຊ້ຊຸດໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"ຫາກບໍ່ແນ່ໃຈ, ໃຫ້ປະການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ວ່າງໄວ້."

msgid ""
"The default rotational motion damping in 2D. Damping is used to gradually "
"slow down physical objects over time. RigidBodies will fall back to this "
"value when combining their own damping values and no area damping value is "
"present.\n"
"Suggested values are in the range [code]0[/code] to [code]30[/code]. At value "
"[code]0[/code] objects will keep moving with the same velocity. Greater "
"values will stop the object faster. A value equal to or greater than the "
"physics tick rate ([member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second]) will "
"bring the object to a stop in one iteration.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot damping calculations are velocity-dependent, meaning "
"bodies moving faster will take a longer time to come to rest. They do not "
"simulate inertia, friction, or air resistance. Therefore heavier or larger "
"bodies will lose speed at the same proportional rate as lighter or smaller "
"bodies.\n"
"During each physics tick, Godot will multiply the linear velocity of "
"RigidBodies by [code]1.0 - combined_damp / physics_ticks_per_second[/code]. "
"By default, bodies combine damp factors: [code]combined_damp[/code] is the "
"sum of the damp value of the body and this value or the area's value the body "
"is in. See [enum RigidBody2D.DampMode].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Godot's damping calculations are simulation tick rate "
"dependent. Changing [member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] may "
"significantly change the outcomes and feel of your simulation. This is true "
"for the entire range of damping values greater than 0. To get back to a "
"similar feel, you also need to change your damp values. This needed change is "
"not proportional and differs from case to case."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງຂອງການເຄື່ອນໄຫວການໝຸນ (rotational motion damping) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນ 2D. "
"ການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸທາງຟີຊິກຊ້າລົງຕາມເວລາ. RigidBodies ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ຄ່ານີ້ເມື່ອລວມຄ່າ "
"damping ຂອງຕົວມັນເອງແລ້ວບໍ່ມີຄ່າ damping ຈາກພື້ນທີ່ (area damping) ຢູ່.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0[/code] ຫາ [code]30[/code]. ທີ່ຄ່າ [code]0[/code] "
"ວັດຖຸຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວເທົ່າເດີມ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຢຸດໄວຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າທີ່ເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື "
"ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າອັດຕາການປະມວນຜົນຟີຊິກ ([member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second]) "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຢຸດໃນຮອບການປະມວນຜົນດຽວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຄຳນວນ damping ຂອງ Godot ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມໄວ, "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນກວ່າໃນການຢຸດ. ພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຈຳລອງຄວາມເສື່ອຍ (inertia), "
"ຄວາມສຽດທານ (friction), ຫຼື ແຮງຕ້ານອາກາດ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ວັດຖຸທີ່ໜັກກວ່າ ຫຼື "
"ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຈະສູນເສຍຄວາມໄວໃນອັດຕາສ່ວນດຽວກັນກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ເບົາກວ່າ ຫຼື ນ້ອຍກວ່າ.\n"
"ໃນແຕ່ລະຮອບຟີຊິກ, Godot ຈະຄູນຄວາມໄວແນວຊື່ (linear velocity) ຂອງ RigidBodies ດ້ວຍ "
"[code]1.0 - combined_damp / physics_ticks_per_second[/code]. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ວັດຖຸຈະລວມປັດໄຈ damping: [code]combined_damp[/code] ແມ່ນຜົນລວມຂອງຄ່າ damp ຂອງວັດຖຸ "
"ແລະ ຄ່ານີ້ ຫຼື ຄ່າຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ວັດຖຸຢູ່. ເບິ່ງ [enum RigidBody2D.DampMode].\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ການຄຳນວນ damping ຂອງ Godot ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບອັດຕາການປະມວນຜົນການຈຳລອງ. "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງ [member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] ອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງຜົນລັດ "
"ແລະ ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກຂອງການຈຳລອງຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນຈິງສຳລັບທຸກຄ່າ damping ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ 0. "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ, ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຄ່າ damp ຂອງທ່ານນຳ. "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຈຳເປັນນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນ ແລະ ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມແຕ່ລະກໍລະນີ."

msgid ""
"The default gravity strength in 2D (in pixels per second squared).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the default gravity at runtime, use the following code sample:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Set the default gravity strength to 980.\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.area_set_param(get_viewport().find_world_2d().space, "
"PhysicsServer2D.AREA_PARAM_GRAVITY, 980)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Set the default gravity strength to 980.\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.AreaSetParam(GetViewport().FindWorld2D().Space, "
"PhysicsServer2D.AreaParameter.Gravity, 980);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງຂອງແຮງດຶງດູດ (gravity strength) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນ 2D (ເປັນ ພິກເຊວຕໍ່ວິນາທີກຳລັງສອງ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແຮງດຶງດູດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກ (runtime), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງໂຄ້ດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມແຮງຂອງແຮງດຶງດູດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ 980.\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.area_set_param(get_viewport().find_world_2d().space, "
"PhysicsServer2D.AREA_PARAM_GRAVITY, 980)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Set the default gravity strength to 980.\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.AreaSetParam(GetViewport().FindWorld2D().Space, "
"PhysicsServer2D.AreaParameter.Gravity, 980);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"The default gravity direction in 2D.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the default gravity vector at runtime, use the following code sample:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Set the default gravity direction to `Vector2(0, 1)`.\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.area_set_param(get_viewport().find_world_2d().space, "
"PhysicsServer2D.AREA_PARAM_GRAVITY_VECTOR, Vector2.DOWN)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Set the default gravity direction to `Vector2(0, 1)`.\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.AreaSetParam(GetViewport().FindWorld2D().Space, "
"PhysicsServer2D.AreaParameter.GravityVector, Vector2.Down)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ທິດທາງຂອງແຮງດຶງດູດ (gravity direction) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນ 2D.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເພື່ອປ່ຽນເວັກເຕີແຮງດຶງດູດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກ (runtime), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງໂຄ້ດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# ຕັ້ງທິດທາງແຮງດຶງດູດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ `Vector2(0, 1)`.\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.area_set_param(get_viewport().find_world_2d().space, "
"PhysicsServer2D.AREA_PARAM_GRAVITY_VECTOR, Vector2.DOWN)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Set the default gravity direction to `Vector2(0, 1)`.\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.AreaSetParam(GetViewport().FindWorld2D().Space, "
"PhysicsServer2D.AreaParameter.GravityVector, Vector2.Down)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"The default linear motion damping in 2D. Damping is used to gradually slow "
"down physical objects over time. RigidBodies will fall back to this value "
"when combining their own damping values and no area damping value is "
"present.\n"
"Suggested values are in the range [code]0[/code] to [code]30[/code]. At value "
"[code]0[/code] objects will keep moving with the same velocity. Greater "
"values will stop the object faster. A value equal to or greater than the "
"physics tick rate ([member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second]) will "
"bring the object to a stop in one iteration.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot damping calculations are velocity-dependent, meaning "
"bodies moving faster will take a longer time to come to rest. They do not "
"simulate inertia, friction, or air resistance. Therefore heavier or larger "
"bodies will lose speed at the same proportional rate as lighter or smaller "
"bodies.\n"
"During each physics tick, Godot will multiply the linear velocity of "
"RigidBodies by [code]1.0 - combined_damp / physics_ticks_per_second[/code], "
"where [code]combined_damp[/code] is the sum of the linear damp of the body "
"and this value, or the area's value the body is in, assuming the body "
"defaults to combine damp values. See [enum RigidBody2D.DampMode].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Godot's damping calculations are simulation tick rate "
"dependent. Changing [member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] may "
"significantly change the outcomes and feel of your simulation. This is true "
"for the entire range of damping values greater than 0. To get back to a "
"similar feel, you also need to change your damp values. This needed change is "
"not proportional and differs from case to case."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງຂອງການເຄື່ອນໄຫວແນວຊື່ (linear motion damping) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນ 2D. "
"ການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸທາງຟີຊິກຊ້າລົງຕາມເວລາ. RigidBodies ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ຄ່ານີ້ເມື່ອລວມຄ່າ "
"damping ຂອງຕົວມັນເອງແລ້ວບໍ່ມີຄ່າ damping ຈາກພື້ນທີ່ (area damping) ຢູ່.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0[/code] ຫາ [code]30[/code]. ທີ່ຄ່າ [code]0[/code] "
"ວັດຖຸຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວເທົ່າເດີມ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຢຸດໄວຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າທີ່ເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື "
"ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າອັດຕາການປະມວນຜົນຟີຊິກ ([member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second]) "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຢຸດໃນຮອບການປະມວນຜົນດຽວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຄຳນວນ damping ຂອງ Godot ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມໄວ, "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນກວ່າໃນການຢຸດ. ພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຈຳລອງຄວາມເສື່ອຍ (inertia), "
"ຄວາມສຽດທານ (friction), ຫຼື ແຮງຕ້ານອາກາດ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ວັດຖຸທີ່ໜັກກວ່າ ຫຼື "
"ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຈະສູນເສຍຄວາມໄວໃນອັດຕາສ່ວນດຽວກັນກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ເບົາກວ່າ ຫຼື ນ້ອຍກວ່າ.\n"
"ໃນແຕ່ລະຮອບຟີຊິກ, Godot ຈະຄູນຄວາມໄວແນວຊື່ (linear velocity) ຂອງ RigidBodies ດ້ວຍ "
"[code]1.0 - combined_damp / physics_ticks_per_second[/code], ໂດຍທີ່ "
"[code]combined_damp[/code] ແມ່ນຜົນລວມຂອງຄ່າ linear damp ຂອງວັດຖຸ ແລະ ຄ່ານີ້, ຫຼື "
"ຄ່າຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ວັດຖຸຢູ່, ໂດຍສົມມຸດວ່າວັດຖຸຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ລວມຄ່າ damp ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [enum "
"RigidBody2D.DampMode].\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ການຄຳນວນ damping ຂອງ Godot ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບອັດຕາການປະມວນຜົນການຈຳລອງ. "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງ [member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] ອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງຜົນລັດ "
"ແລະ ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກຂອງການຈຳລອງຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນຈິງສຳລັບທຸກຄ່າ damping ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ 0. "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ, ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຄ່າ damp ຂອງທ່ານນຳ. "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຈຳເປັນນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນ ແລະ ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມແຕ່ລະກໍລະນີ."

msgid ""
"Sets which physics engine to use for 2D physics.\n"
"[b]DEFAULT[/b] is currently equivalent to [b]GodotPhysics2D[/b], but may "
"change in future releases. Select an explicit implementation if you want to "
"ensure that your project stays on the same engine.\n"
"[b]GodotPhysics2D[/b] is Godot's internal 2D physics engine.\n"
"[b]Dummy[/b] is a 2D physics server that does nothing and returns only dummy "
"values, effectively disabling all 2D physics functionality.\n"
"Third-party extensions and modules can add other physics engines to select "
"with this setting."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຈະໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງຈັກຟີຊິກໃດສຳລັບຟີຊິກ 2D.\n"
"[b]DEFAULT[/b] ໃນປັດຈຸບັນແມ່ນທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [b]GodotPhysics2D[/b], "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃນເວີຊັນອະນາຄົດ. "
"ເລືອກການນຳໃຊ້ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງຈັກເດີມ.\n"
"[b]GodotPhysics2D[/b] ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງຈັກຟີຊິກ 2D ພາຍໃນຂອງ Godot.\n"
"[b]Dummy[/b] ແມ່ນເຊີບເວີຟີຊິກ 2D ທີ່ບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຫຍັງ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນພຽງແຕ່ຄ່າສົມມຸດ, "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນການປິດການນຳໃຊ້ທຸກຟັງຊັນຟີຊິກ 2D.\n"
"ສ່ວນເສີມ ແລະ ໂມດູນຈາກພາຍນອກສາມາດເພີ່ມເຄື່ອງຈັກຟີຊິກອື່ນໆ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເລືອກໄດ້ດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the 2D physics server runs on a separate thread, making "
"better use of multi-core CPUs. If [code]false[/code], the 2D physics server "
"runs on the main thread. Running the physics server on a separate thread can "
"increase performance, but restricts API access to only physics process."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເຊີບເວີຟີຊິກ 2D ຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນເທຣດທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ "
"CPU ແບບຫຼາຍຄໍ (multi-core) ໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ. ຫາກເປັນ [code]false[/code], ເຊີບເວີຟີຊິກ 2D "
"ຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນເທຣດຫຼັກ. ການເປີດໃຊ້ເຊີບເວີຟີຊິກໃນເທຣດທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສາມາດເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້, "
"ແຕ່ຈະຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ API ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນຂະບວນການຟີຊິກ (physics process) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Threshold angular velocity under which a 2D physics body will be considered "
"inactive. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_ANGULAR_VELOCITY_SLEEP_THRESHOLD]."
msgstr ""
"ເກນຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມ (threshold angular velocity) ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຄ່ານີ້ ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 2D "
"ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ. ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_ANGULAR_VELOCITY_SLEEP_THRESHOLD]."

msgid ""
"Threshold linear velocity under which a 2D physics body will be considered "
"inactive. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_LINEAR_VELOCITY_SLEEP_THRESHOLD].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This project setting "
"is ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ເກນຄວາມໄວແນວຊື່ (threshold linear velocity) ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຄ່ານີ້ ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 2D "
"ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ. ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_LINEAR_VELOCITY_SLEEP_THRESHOLD].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"Maximum distance a shape can penetrate another shape before it is considered "
"a collision. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_MAX_ALLOWED_PENETRATION].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This project setting "
"is ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງສູງສຸດທີ່ຮູບຊົງໜຶ່ງສາມາດຊອດເຂົ້າໄປໃນອີກຮູບຊົງໜຶ່ງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືວ່າເປັນການຕຳກັນ. ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_MAX_ALLOWED_PENETRATION].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"Maximum distance a shape can be from another before they are considered "
"separated and the contact is discarded. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_MAX_SEPARATION]."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງສູງສຸດທີ່ຮູບຊົງໜຶ່ງສາມາດຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກອີກຮູບຊົງໜຶ່ງ ກ່ອນທີ່ພວກມັນຈະຖືກຖືວ່າແຍກອອກຈາກກັນ ແລະ "
"ການສຳຜັດຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ. ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_MAX_SEPARATION]."

msgid ""
"Maximum distance a pair of bodies has to move before their collision status "
"has to be recalculated. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_RECYCLE_RADIUS]."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງສູງສຸດທີ່ຄູ່ຂອງວັດຖຸຕ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ ກ່ອນທີ່ສະຖານະການຕຳກັນຂອງພວກມັນຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຄຳນວນໃໝ່. ເບິ່ງ "
"[constant PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_RECYCLE_RADIUS]."

msgid ""
"Default solver bias for all physics constraints. Defines how much bodies "
"react to enforce constraints. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_CONSTRAINT_DEFAULT_BIAS].\n"
"Individual constraints can have a specific bias value (see [member "
"Joint2D.bias])."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ bias ຂອງຕົວແກ້ (solver bias) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຟີຊິກ (physics constraints) ທັງໝົດ. "
"ກຳນົດວ່າວັດຖຸຈະມີການຕອບສະໜອງຫຼາຍປານໃດເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ. ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_CONSTRAINT_DEFAULT_BIAS].\n"
"ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດແຕ່ລະອັນສາມາດມີຄ່າ bias ສະເພາະໄດ້ (ເບິ່ງ [member Joint2D.bias])."

msgid ""
"Default solver bias for all physics contacts. Defines how much bodies react "
"to enforce contact separation. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_DEFAULT_BIAS].\n"
"Individual shapes can have a specific bias value (see [member "
"Shape2D.custom_solver_bias])."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ bias ຂອງຕົວແກ້ (solver bias) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການສຳຜັດຟີຊິກທັງໝົດ. "
"ກຳນົດວ່າວັດຖຸຈະມີການຕອບສະໜອງຫຼາຍປານໃດເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຊ້ການແຍກການສຳຜັດ. ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_DEFAULT_BIAS].\n"
"ຮູບຊົງແຕ່ລະອັນສາມາດມີຄ່າ bias ສະເພາະໄດ້ (ເບິ່ງ [member Shape2D.custom_solver_bias])."

msgid ""
"Number of solver iterations for all contacts and constraints. The greater the "
"number of iterations, the more accurate the collisions will be. However, a "
"greater number of iterations requires more CPU power, which can decrease "
"performance. See [constant PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_SOLVER_ITERATIONS]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຮອບການປະມວນຜົນຂອງຕົວແກ້ (solver iterations) ສຳລັບການສຳຜັດ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທັງໝົດ. "
"ຍິ່ງຈຳນວນຮອບຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ການຕຳກັນກໍຈະຍິ່ງມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ຈຳນວນຮອບທີ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນກໍຕ້ອງການພະລັງງານ CPU ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບຫຼຸດລົງ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[constant PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_SOLVER_ITERATIONS]."

msgid ""
"Time (in seconds) of inactivity before which a 2D physics body will put to "
"sleep. See [constant PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_TIME_TO_SLEEP]."
msgstr ""
"ເວລາ (ເປັນວິນາທີ) ທີ່ບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ ກ່ອນທີ່ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 2D ຈະຖືກເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດຫຼັບ (sleep). ເບິ່ງ "
"[constant PhysicsServer2D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_TIME_TO_SLEEP]."

msgid ""
"The default rotational motion damping in 3D. Damping is used to gradually "
"slow down physical objects over time. RigidBodies will fall back to this "
"value when combining their own damping values and no area damping value is "
"present.\n"
"Suggested values are in the range [code]0[/code] to [code]30[/code]. At value "
"[code]0[/code] objects will keep moving with the same velocity. Greater "
"values will stop the object faster. A value equal to or greater than the "
"physics tick rate ([member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second]) will "
"bring the object to a stop in one iteration.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot damping calculations are velocity-dependent, meaning "
"bodies moving faster will take a longer time to come to rest. They do not "
"simulate inertia, friction, or air resistance. Therefore heavier or larger "
"bodies will lose speed at the same proportional rate as lighter or smaller "
"bodies.\n"
"During each physics tick, Godot will multiply the angular velocity of "
"RigidBodies by [code]1.0 - combined_damp / physics_ticks_per_second[/code]. "
"By default, bodies combine damp factors: [code]combined_damp[/code] is the "
"sum of the damp value of the body and this value or the area's value the body "
"is in. See [enum RigidBody3D.DampMode].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Godot's damping calculations are simulation tick rate "
"dependent. Changing [member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] may "
"significantly change the outcomes and feel of your simulation. This is true "
"for the entire range of damping values greater than 0. To get back to a "
"similar feel, you also need to change your damp values. This needed change is "
"not proportional and differs from case to case."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງຂອງການເຄື່ອນໄຫວການໝຸນ (rotational motion damping) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນ 3D. "
"ການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸທາງຟີຊິກຊ້າລົງຕາມເວລາ. RigidBodies ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ຄ່ານີ້ເມື່ອລວມຄ່າ "
"damping ຂອງຕົວມັນເອງແລ້ວບໍ່ມີຄ່າ damping ຈາກພື້ນທີ່ (area damping) ຢູ່.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0[/code] ຫາ [code]30[/code]. ທີ່ຄ່າ [code]0[/code] "
"ວັດຖຸຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວເທົ່າເດີມ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຢຸດໄວຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າທີ່ເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື "
"ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າອັດຕາການປະມວນຜົນຟີຊິກ ([member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second]) "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຢຸດໃນຮອບການປະມວນຜົນດຽວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຄຳນວນ damping ຂອງ Godot ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມໄວ, "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນກວ່າໃນການຢຸດ. ພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຈຳລອງຄວາມເສື່ອຍ (inertia), "
"ຄວາມສຽດທານ (friction), ຫຼື ແຮງຕ້ານອາກາດ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ວັດຖຸທີ່ໜັກກວ່າ ຫຼື "
"ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຈະສູນເສຍຄວາມໄວໃນອັດຕາສ່ວນດຽວກັນກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ເບົາກວ່າ ຫຼື ນ້ອຍກວ່າ.\n"
"ໃນແຕ່ລະຮອບຟີຊິກ, Godot ຈະຄູນຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມ (angular velocity) ຂອງ RigidBodies ດ້ວຍ "
"[code]1.0 - combined_damp / physics_ticks_per_second[/code]. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ວັດຖຸຈະລວມປັດໄຈ damping: [code]combined_damp[/code] ແມ່ນຜົນລວມຂອງຄ່າ damp ຂອງວັດຖຸ "
"ແລະ ຄ່ານີ້ ຫຼື ຄ່າຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ວັດຖຸຢູ່. ເບິ່ງ [enum RigidBody3D.DampMode].\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ການຄຳນວນ damping ຂອງ Godot ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບອັດຕາການປະມວນຜົນການຈຳລອງ. "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງ [member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] ອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງຜົນລັດ "
"ແລະ ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກຂອງການຈຳລອງຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນຈິງສຳລັບທຸກຄ່າ damping ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ 0. "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ, ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຄ່າ damp ຂອງທ່ານນຳ. "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຈຳເປັນນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນ ແລະ ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມແຕ່ລະກໍລະນີ."

msgid ""
"The default gravity strength in 3D (in meters per second squared).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the default gravity at runtime, use the following code sample:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Set the default gravity strength to 9.8.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.area_set_param(get_viewport().find_world_3d().space, "
"PhysicsServer3D.AREA_PARAM_GRAVITY, 9.8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Set the default gravity strength to 9.8.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.AreaSetParam(GetViewport().FindWorld3D().Space, "
"PhysicsServer3D.AreaParameter.Gravity, 9.8);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງຂອງແຮງດຶງດູດ (gravity strength) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນ 3D (ເປັນ ແມັດຕໍ່ວິນາທີກຳລັງສອງ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແຮງດຶງດູດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກ (runtime), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງໂຄ້ດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມແຮງຂອງແຮງດຶງດູດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ 9.8.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.area_set_param(get_viewport().find_world_3d().space, "
"PhysicsServer3D.AREA_PARAM_GRAVITY, 9.8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Set the default gravity strength to 9.8.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.AreaSetParam(GetViewport().FindWorld3D().Space, "
"PhysicsServer3D.AreaParameter.Gravity, 9.8);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"The default gravity direction in 3D.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the default gravity vector at runtime, use the following code sample:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Set the default gravity direction to `Vector3(0, -1, 0)`.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.area_set_param(get_viewport().find_world_3d().space, "
"PhysicsServer3D.AREA_PARAM_GRAVITY_VECTOR, Vector3.DOWN)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Set the default gravity direction to `Vector3(0, -1, 0)`.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.AreaSetParam(GetViewport().FindWorld3D().Space, "
"PhysicsServer3D.AreaParameter.GravityVector, Vector3.Down)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ທິດທາງຂອງແຮງດຶງດູດ (gravity direction) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນ 3D.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເພື່ອປ່ຽນເວັກເຕີແຮງດຶງດູດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກ (runtime), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງໂຄ້ດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# ຕັ້ງທິດທາງແຮງດຶງດູດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ `Vector3(0, -1, 0)`.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.area_set_param(get_viewport().find_world_3d().space, "
"PhysicsServer3D.AREA_PARAM_GRAVITY_VECTOR, Vector3.DOWN)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Set the default gravity direction to `Vector3(0, -1, 0)`.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.AreaSetParam(GetViewport().FindWorld3D().Space, "
"PhysicsServer3D.AreaParameter.GravityVector, Vector3.Down)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"The default linear motion damping in 3D. Damping is used to gradually slow "
"down physical objects over time. RigidBodies will fall back to this value "
"when combining their own damping values and no area damping value is "
"present.\n"
"Suggested values are in the range [code]0[/code] to [code]30[/code]. At value "
"[code]0[/code] objects will keep moving with the same velocity. Greater "
"values will stop the object faster. A value equal to or greater than the "
"physics tick rate ([member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second]) will "
"bring the object to a stop in one iteration.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot damping calculations are velocity-dependent, meaning "
"bodies moving faster will take a longer time to come to rest. They do not "
"simulate inertia, friction, or air resistance. Therefore heavier or larger "
"bodies will lose speed at the same proportional rate as lighter or smaller "
"bodies.\n"
"During each physics tick, Godot will multiply the linear velocity of "
"RigidBodies by [code]1.0 - combined_damp / physics_ticks_per_second[/code]. "
"By default, bodies combine damp factors: [code]combined_damp[/code] is the "
"sum of the damp value of the body and this value or the area's value the body "
"is in. See [enum RigidBody3D.DampMode].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Godot's damping calculations are simulation tick rate "
"dependent. Changing [member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] may "
"significantly change the outcomes and feel of your simulation. This is true "
"for the entire range of damping values greater than 0. To get back to a "
"similar feel, you also need to change your damp values. This needed change is "
"not proportional and differs from case to case."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງຂອງການເຄື່ອນໄຫວແນວຊື່ (linear motion damping) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນ 3D. "
"ການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸທາງຟີຊິກຊ້າລົງຕາມເວລາ. RigidBodies ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ຄ່ານີ້ເມື່ອລວມຄ່າ "
"damping ຂອງຕົວມັນເອງແລ້ວບໍ່ມີຄ່າ damping ຈາກພື້ນທີ່ (area damping) ຢູ່.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0[/code] ຫາ [code]30[/code]. ທີ່ຄ່າ [code]0[/code] "
"ວັດຖຸຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວເທົ່າເດີມ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຢຸດໄວຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າທີ່ເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື "
"ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າອັດຕາການປະມວນຜົນຟີຊິກ ([member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second]) "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຢຸດໃນຮອບການປະມວນຜົນດຽວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຄຳນວນ damping ຂອງ Godot ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມໄວ, "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນກວ່າໃນການຢຸດ. ພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຈຳລອງຄວາມເສື່ອຍ (inertia), "
"ຄວາມສຽດທານ (friction), ຫຼື ແຮງຕ້ານອາກາດ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ວັດຖຸທີ່ໜັກກວ່າ ຫຼື "
"ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຈະສູນເສຍຄວາມໄວໃນອັດຕາສ່ວນດຽວກັນກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ເບົາກວ່າ ຫຼື ນ້ອຍກວ່າ.\n"
"ໃນແຕ່ລະຮອບຟີຊິກ, Godot ຈະຄູນຄວາມໄວແນວຊື່ (linear velocity) ຂອງ RigidBodies ດ້ວຍ "
"[code]1.0 - combined_damp / physics_ticks_per_second[/code]. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ວັດຖຸຈະລວມປັດໄຈ damping: [code]combined_damp[/code] ແມ່ນຜົນລວມຂອງຄ່າ damp ຂອງວັດຖຸ "
"ແລະ ຄ່ານີ້ ຫຼື ຄ່າຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ວັດຖຸຢູ່. ເບິ່ງ [enum RigidBody3D.DampMode].\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ການຄຳນວນ damping ຂອງ Godot ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບອັດຕາການປະມວນຜົນການຈຳລອງ. "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງ [member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] ອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງຜົນລັດ "
"ແລະ ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກຂອງການຈຳລອງຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນຈິງສຳລັບທຸກຄ່າ damping ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ 0. "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ, ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຄ່າ damp ຂອງທ່ານນຳ. "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຈຳເປັນນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນ ແລະ ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມແຕ່ລະກໍລະນີ."

msgid ""
"Sets which physics engine to use for 3D physics.\n"
"[b]DEFAULT[/b] is currently equivalent to [b]GodotPhysics3D[/b], but may "
"change in future releases. Select an explicit implementation if you want to "
"ensure that your project stays on the same engine.\n"
"[b]GodotPhysics3D[/b] is Godot's internal 3D physics engine.\n"
"[b]Jolt Physics[/b] is an alternative physics engine that is generally faster "
"and more reliable than [b]GodotPhysics3D[/b]. Jolt Physics is the default for "
"projects created starting in Godot 4.6.\n"
"[b]Dummy[/b] is a 3D physics server that does nothing and returns only dummy "
"values, effectively disabling all 3D physics functionality.\n"
"Third-party extensions and modules can add other physics engines to select "
"with this setting."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຈະໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງຈັກຟີຊິກໃດສຳລັບຟີຊິກ 3D.\n"
"[b]DEFAULT[/b] ໃນປັດຈຸບັນແມ່ນທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [b]GodotPhysics3D[/b], "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃນເວີຊັນອະນາຄົດ. ເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບເຈາະຈົງ "
"ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ໂປຣເຈັກຂອງເຈົ້າໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງຈັກເດີມຕະຫຼອດ.\n"
"[b]GodotPhysics3D[/b] ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງຈັກຟີຊິກ 3D ພາຍໃນຂອງ Godot.\n"
"[b]Jolt Physics[/b] ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງຈັກຟີຊິກທາງເລືອກທີ່ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະໄວ ແລະ ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າ "
"[b]GodotPhysics3D[/b]. Jolt Physics ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 4.6 "
"ເປັນຕົ້ນໄປ.\n"
"[b]Dummy[/b] ແມ່ນເຊີເວີຟີຊິກ 3D ທີ່ບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຫຍັງ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນພຽງແຕ່ຄ່າສົມມຸດ, "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນການປິດການໃຊ້ງານຟັງຊັນຟີຊິກ 3D ທັງໝົດ.\n"
"ສ່ວນເສີມ ແລະ ໂມດູນຈາກພາຍນອກສາມາດເພີ່ມເຄື່ອງຈັກຟີຊິກອື່ນໆ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເລືອກໃຊ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The approach used for 3D scene traversal when physics interpolation is "
"enabled.\n"
"- [code]DEFAULT[/code]: The default optimized method.\n"
"- [code]Legacy[/code]: The previous reference method used for scene tree "
"traversal, which is slower.\n"
"- [code]Debug[/code]: Swaps between [code]DEFAULT[/code] and [code]Legacy[/"
"code] methods on alternating frames, and provides logging information (which "
"in turn makes it slower). Intended for debugging only; you should use the "
"[code]DEFAULT[/code] method in most cases."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການທ່ອງໄປໃນສາກ 3D (scene traversal) ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນຟີຊິກ "
"(physics interpolation).\n"
"- [code]DEFAULT[/code]: ວິທີການທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດ.\n"
"- [code]Legacy[/code]: ວິທີການແບບເກົ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການທ່ອງ Scene Tree ເຊິ່ງຈະຊ້າກວ່າ.\n"
"- [code]Debug[/code]: ສະລັບລະຫວ່າງວິທີ [code]DEFAULT[/code] ແລະ [code]Legacy[/"
"code] ໃນແຕ່ລະເຟຣມ ແລະ ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນບັນທຶກ (ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນຊ້າລົງ). ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອການກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ "
"(debugging) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ; ເຈົ້າຄວນໃຊ້ວິທີ [code]DEFAULT[/code] ໃນກໍລະນີທົ່ວໄປ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the 3D physics server runs on a separate thread, making "
"better use of multi-core CPUs. If [code]false[/code], the 3D physics server "
"runs on the main thread. Running the physics server on a separate thread can "
"increase performance, but restricts API access to only physics process.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When [member physics/3d/physics_engine] is set to [code]Jolt "
"Physics[/code], enabling this setting will prevent the 3D physics server from "
"being able to provide any context when reporting errors and warnings, and "
"will instead always refer to nodes as [code]<unknown>[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເຊີເວີຟີຊິກ 3D ຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນເທຣດ (thread) ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ CPU ແບບຫຼາຍຄໍ (multi-core) ໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ. ຫາກເປັນ [code]false[/code], ເຊີເວີຟີຊິກ "
"3D ຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນເທຣດຫຼັກ. ການເຮັດວຽກໃນເທຣດແຍກສາມາດເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້, ແຕ່ຈະຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ "
"API ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນຂະບວນການຟີຊິກເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອ [member physics/3d/physics_engine] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]Jolt "
"Physics[/code], ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຊີເວີຟີຊິກ 3D ບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (context) "
"ເມື່ອລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ຫຼື ຄຳເຕືອນ, ແລະ ຈະອ້າງອີງເຖິງໂນດວ່າ [code]<unknown>[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Threshold angular velocity under which a 3D physics body will be considered "
"inactive. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_ANGULAR_VELOCITY_SLEEP_THRESHOLD].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This project setting is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າກຳນົດຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມ (angular velocity) ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າເກນ ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 3D "
"ຖືກຖືວ່າບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກ. ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_ANGULAR_VELOCITY_SLEEP_THRESHOLD].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກນີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງເມື່ອໃຊ້ Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"Threshold linear velocity under which a 3D physics body will be considered "
"inactive. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_LINEAR_VELOCITY_SLEEP_THRESHOLD].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This project setting is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າກຳນົດຄວາມໄວເຊີງເສັ້ນ (linear velocity) ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າເກນ ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 3D "
"ຖືກຖືວ່າບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກ. ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_LINEAR_VELOCITY_SLEEP_THRESHOLD].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກນີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງເມື່ອໃຊ້ Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"Maximum distance a shape can penetrate another shape before it is considered "
"a collision. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_MAX_ALLOWED_PENETRATION].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This project setting is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງສູງສຸດທີ່ຮູບຊົງສາມາດຊຶມເຂົ້າໄປໃນອີກຮູບຊົງໜຶ່ງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນການຕຳກັນ. ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_MAX_ALLOWED_PENETRATION].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກນີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງເມື່ອໃຊ້ Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"Maximum distance a shape can be from another before they are considered "
"separated and the contact is discarded. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_MAX_SEPARATION].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This project setting is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງສູງສຸດທີ່ຮູບຊົງສາມາດຫ່າງຈາກກັນກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າແຍກຈາກກັນ ແລະ ການສຳຜັດຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[constant PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_MAX_SEPARATION].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກນີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງເມື່ອໃຊ້ Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"Maximum distance a pair of bodies has to move before their collision status "
"has to be recalculated. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_RECYCLE_RADIUS].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This project setting is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງສູງສຸດທີ່ວັດຖຸຄູ່ໜຶ່ງຕ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ ກ່ອນທີ່ສະຖານະການຕຳກັນຂອງພວກມັນຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຄຳນວນໃໝ່. ເບິ່ງ "
"[constant PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_RECYCLE_RADIUS].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກນີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງເມື່ອໃຊ້ Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"Default solver bias for all physics contacts. Defines how much bodies react "
"to enforce contact separation. See [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_DEFAULT_BIAS].\n"
"Individual shapes can have a specific bias value (see [member "
"Shape3D.custom_solver_bias]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This project setting is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄວາມລຳອຽງຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (solver bias) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບທຸກການສຳຜັດທາງຟີຊິກ. "
"ກຳນົດວ່າວັດຖຸຈະມີປະຕິກິລິຍາແນວໃດເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຫ້ແຍກອອກຈາກກັນ. ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_CONTACT_DEFAULT_BIAS].\n"
"ແຕ່ລະຮູບຊົງສາມາດມີຄ່າຄວາມລຳອຽງສະເພາະໄດ້ (ເບິ່ງ [member Shape3D.custom_solver_bias]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກນີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງເມື່ອໃຊ້ Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"Number of solver iterations for all contacts and constraints. The greater the "
"number of iterations, the more accurate the collisions will be. However, a "
"greater number of iterations requires more CPU power, which can decrease "
"performance. See [constant PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_SOLVER_ITERATIONS].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This project setting is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຮອບການຄຳນວນ (iterations) ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂສຳລັບທຸກການສຳຜັດ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ (constraints). "
"ຍິ່ງຈຳນວນຮອບຫຼາຍ, ການຕຳກັນກໍ່ຈະຍິ່ງມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, "
"ຈຳນວນຮອບທີ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນກໍ່ຕ້ອງການກຳລັງ CPU ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບຫຼຸດລົງ. ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_SOLVER_ITERATIONS].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກນີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງເມື່ອໃຊ້ Jolt Physics."

msgid ""
"Time (in seconds) of inactivity before which a 3D physics body will put to "
"sleep. See [constant PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_TIME_TO_SLEEP].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This project setting is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"ເວລາ (ເປັນວິນາທີ) ທີ່ວັດຖຸບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ ກ່ອນທີ່ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 3D ຈະເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດຫຼັບ (sleep). ເບິ່ງ "
"[constant PhysicsServer3D.SPACE_PARAM_BODY_TIME_TO_SLEEP].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກນີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ GodotPhysics3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງເມື່ອໃຊ້ Jolt Physics."

msgid "Enables [member Viewport.physics_object_picking] on the root viewport."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [member Viewport.physics_object_picking] ໃນວິວພອດຫຼັກ (root viewport)."

msgid ""
"Controls the maximum number of physics steps that can be simulated each "
"rendered frame. The default value is tuned to avoid situations where the "
"framerate suddenly drops to a very low value beyond a certain amount of "
"physics simulation. This occurs because the physics engine can't keep up with "
"the expected simulation rate. In this case, the framerate will start "
"dropping, but the engine is only allowed to simulate a certain number of "
"physics steps per rendered frame. This snowballs into a situation where "
"framerate keeps dropping until it reaches a very low framerate (typically 1-2 "
"FPS) and is called the [i]physics spiral of death[/i].\n"
"However, the game will appear to slow down if the rendering FPS is less than "
"[code]1 / max_physics_steps_per_frame[/code] of [member physics/common/"
"physics_ticks_per_second]. This occurs even if [code]delta[/code] is "
"consistently used in physics calculations. To avoid this, increase [member "
"physics/common/max_physics_steps_per_frame] if you have increased [member "
"physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second] significantly above its default "
"value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the maximum number of simulated physics steps per frame at runtime, set "
"[member Engine.max_physics_steps_per_frame] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມຈຳນວນຂັ້ນຕອນຟີຊິກ (physics steps) ສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດຈຳລອງໄດ້ໃນແຕ່ລະເຟຣມທີ່ສະແດງຜົນ. "
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຖືກປັບແຕ່ງມາເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນສະຖານະການທີ່ອັດຕາເຟຣມ (framerate) ຕົກລົງຢ່າງກະທັນຫັນ "
"ເມື່ອມີການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນຍ້ອນເຄື່ອງຈັກຟີຊິກບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ທັນກັບອັດຕາການຈຳລອງທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, "
"ເຟຣມເຣດຈະເລີ່ມຕົກ, ແຕ່ເຄື່ອງຈັກຖືກອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຈຳລອງໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ຈຳນວນຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຕໍ່ເຟຣມເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຈົນເຟຣມເຣດຕົກລົງໄປຕ່ຳຫຼາຍ (ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 1-2 FPS) ເຊິ່ງເອີ້ນວ່າ [i]physics "
"spiral of death[/i].\n"
"ແນວໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ເກມຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຊ້າລົງ ຫາກ FPS ຂອງການສະແດງຜົນຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]1 / "
"max_physics_steps_per_frame[/code] ຂອງ [member physics/common/"
"physics_ticks_per_second]. ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະໃຊ້ [code]delta[/code] "
"ໃນການຄຳນວນຟີຊິກຢ່າງສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີກໍ່ຕາມ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄ່າ [member physics/common/"
"max_physics_steps_per_frame] ຫາກເຈົ້າໄດ້ເພີ່ມ [member physics/common/"
"physics_ticks_per_second] ໃຫ້ສູງກວ່າຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫຼາຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຈຳນວນຂັ້ນຕອນຟີຊິກສູງສຸດຕໍ່ເຟຣມໃນຂະນະທີ່ຣັນໂປຣເຈັກ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"Engine.max_physics_steps_per_frame] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the renderer will interpolate the transforms of objects "
"(both physics and non-physics) between the last two transforms, so that "
"smooth motion is seen even when physics ticks do not coincide with rendered "
"frames. See also [method Node.reset_physics_interpolation].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Although this is a global setting, finer control of individual "
"branches of the [SceneTree] is possible using [member "
"Node.physics_interpolation_mode].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To toggle "
"physics interpolation at runtime, set [member "
"SceneTree.physics_interpolation] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Property [member physics/common/physics_jitter_fix] is "
"automatically disabled if [member physics/common/physics_interpolation] is "
"set to [code]true[/code], as the two methods are incompatible."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວສະແດງຜົນຈະແຊກຂໍ້ມູນ (interpolate) ການປ່ຽນແປງ "
"(transforms) ຂອງວັດຖຸ (ທັງຟີຊິກ ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນຟີຊິກ) ລະຫວ່າງສອງຄ່າຫຼ້າສຸດ, "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວທີ່ສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຮອບການເຮັດວຽກຂອງຟີຊິກ (physics ticks) "
"ຈະບໍ່ກົງກັບເຟຣມການສະແດງຜົນກໍ່ຕາມ. ເບິ່ງ [method Node.reset_physics_interpolation] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໂລກ (global), "
"ແຕ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄວບຄຸມແຕ່ລະກິ່ງງ່າຂອງ [SceneTree] ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member "
"Node.physics_interpolation_mode].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອເປີດ-"
"ປິດການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນຟີຊິກໃນຂະນະທີ່ຣັນໂປຣເຈັກ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"SceneTree.physics_interpolation] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member physics/common/physics_jitter_fix] "
"ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫາກ [member physics/common/physics_interpolation] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເນື່ອງຈາກທັງສອງວິທີນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Controls how much physics ticks are synchronized with real time. For 0 or "
"less, the ticks are synchronized. Such values are recommended for network "
"games, where clock synchronization matters. Higher values cause higher "
"deviation of in-game clock and real clock, but allows smoothing out framerate "
"jitters. The default value of 0.5 should be good enough for most; values "
"above 2 could cause the game to react to dropped frames with a noticeable "
"delay and are not recommended.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Jitter fix is automatically disabled at runtime when [member "
"physics/common/physics_interpolation] is enabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using a custom physics interpolation solution, the physics "
"jitter fix should be disabled by setting [member physics/common/"
"physics_jitter_fix] to [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the physics jitter fix at runtime, set [member Engine.physics_jitter_fix] "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມລະດັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຂອງຮອບຟີຊິກ (physics ticks) ໃຫ້ກົງກັບເວລາຈິງ. ສຳລັບຄ່າ 0 ຫຼື ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ, "
"ຮອບຟີຊິກຈະຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ. ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນແນະນຳສຳລັບເກມອອນລາຍ (network games) ທີ່ເວລາຕ້ອງກົງກັນ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເວລາໃນເກມ ແລະ ເວລາຈິງມີຄວາມຄາດເຄື່ອນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວທີ່ກະຕຸກຈາກເຟຣມເຣດເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 0.5 "
"ແມ່ນພຽງພໍສຳລັບເກມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່; ຄ່າທີ່ເກີນ 2 "
"ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກມມີການຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ເຟຣມທີ່ຕົກຊ້າລົງຢ່າງເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດ ແລະ ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Jitter fix ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນຂະນະຣັນເກມ ເມື່ອ [member "
"physics/common/physics_interpolation] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນຟີຊິກທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເອງ, ຄວນປິດ physics jitter fix ໂດຍຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"[member physics/common/physics_jitter_fix] ເປັນ [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່າ physics jitter fix "
"ໃນຂະນະຣັນເກມ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member Engine.physics_jitter_fix] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The number of fixed iterations per second. This controls how often physics "
"simulation and the [method Node._physics_process] method are run.\n"
"CPU usage scales approximately with the physics tick rate. However, at very "
"low tick rates (usually below 30), physics behavior can break down. Input can "
"also become less responsive at low tick rates as there can be a gap between "
"input being registered, and the response on the next physics tick. High tick "
"rates give more accurate physics simulation, particularly for fast moving "
"objects. For example, racing games may benefit from increasing the tick rate "
"above the default 60.\n"
"See also [member application/run/max_fps].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the physics FPS at runtime, set [member Engine.physics_ticks_per_second] "
"instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only [member physics/common/max_physics_steps_per_frame] physics "
"ticks may be simulated per rendered frame at most. If more physics ticks have "
"to be simulated per rendered frame to keep up with rendering, the project "
"will appear to slow down (even if [code]delta[/code] is used consistently in "
"physics calculations). Therefore, it is recommended to also increase [member "
"physics/common/max_physics_steps_per_frame] if increasing [member physics/"
"common/physics_ticks_per_second] significantly above its default value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Consider enabling [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/interpolation/"
"index.html]physics interpolation[/url] if you change [member physics/common/"
"physics_ticks_per_second] to a value that is not a multiple of [code]60[/"
"code]. Using physics interpolation will avoid jittering when the monitor "
"refresh rate and physics update rate don't exactly match."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຮອບການຄຳນວນຄົງທີ່ຕໍ່ວິນາທີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວບຄຸມວ່າການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນ [method "
"Node._physics_process] ຈະເຮັດວຽກດຸປານໃດ.\n"
"ການໃຊ້ງານ CPU ຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຕາມອັດຕາຮອບຟີຊິກ (physics tick rate). ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, "
"ທີ່ອັດຕາຕ່ຳຫຼາຍ (ປົກກະຕິຕ່ຳກວ່າ 30), ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງຟີຊິກອາດຈະຜິດພ້ຽນ. ການຮັບຂໍ້ມູນ (input) "
"ອາດຈະຕອບສະໜອງຊ້າລົງ ເນື່ອງຈາກມີຊ່ອງຫວ່າງລະຫວ່າງການຮັບ input ແລະ "
"ການຕອບສະໜອງໃນຮອບຟີຊິກຖັດໄປ. ອັດຕາທີ່ສູງຈະໃຫ້ການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກທີ່ຊັດເຈນກວ່າ, "
"ໂດຍສະເພາະວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ເກມແຂ່ງລົດອາດຈະໄດ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກການເພີ່ມອັດຕາຮອບຟີຊິກໃຫ້ສູງກວ່າຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 60.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [member application/run/max_fps] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຟີຊິກ FPS ໃນຂະນະຣັນເກມ, "
"ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member Engine.physics_ticks_per_second] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາມາດຈຳລອງຮອບຟີຊິກໄດ້ສູງສຸດພຽງແຕ່ [member physics/common/"
"max_physics_steps_per_frame] ຕໍ່ເຟຣມການສະແດງຜົນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ຫາກຕ້ອງຈຳລອງຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ທັນກັບການສະແດງຜົນ, ໂປຣເຈັກຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຊ້າລົງ (ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະໃຊ້ "
"[code]delta[/code] ກໍ່ຕາມ). ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ [member physics/common/"
"max_physics_steps_per_frame] ຫາກເຈົ້າເພີ່ມ [member physics/common/"
"physics_ticks_per_second] ໃຫ້ສູງກວ່າຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫຼາຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄວນພິຈາລະນາເປີດໃຊ້ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/interpolation/"
"index.html]physics interpolation[/url] ຫາກເຈົ້າປ່ຽນ [member physics/common/"
"physics_ticks_per_second] ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕົວຄູນຂອງ [code]60[/code]. ການໃຊ້ physics "
"interpolation ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດການກະຕຸກ (jittering) ເມື່ອອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊຂອງໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ "
"ອັດຕາການອັບເດດຟີຊິກບໍ່ກົງກັນ."

msgid ""
"The maximum angle, in radians, between two adjacent triangles in a "
"[ConcavePolygonShape3D] or [HeightMapShape3D] for which the edge between "
"those triangles is considered inactive.\n"
"Collisions against an inactive edge will have its normal overridden to "
"instead be the surface normal of the triangle. This can help alleviate ghost "
"collisions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this too high can result in objects not depenetrating "
"properly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This applies to all shape queries, as well as physics bodies "
"within the simulation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does not apply when enabling Jolt's enhanced internal edge "
"removal, which supersedes this."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມສູງສຸດ (ເປັນເຣດຽນ) ລະຫວ່າງຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມສອງຮູບທີ່ຕິດກັນໃນ [ConcavePolygonShape3D] ຫຼື "
"[HeightMapShape3D] ເຊິ່ງຂອບລະຫວ່າງສາມຫຼ່ຽມເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກຖືວ່າບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"ການຕຳກັບຂອບທີ່ບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຈະຖືກປ່ຽນຄ່າ normal ໃຫ້ເປັນ surface normal ຂອງຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມແທນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນບັນຫາການຕຳແບບຜິດພາດ (ghost collisions).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ສູງເກີນໄປອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸບໍ່ສາມາດແຍກອອກຈາກກັນ (depenetrate) "
"ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນກັບການສອບຖາມຮູບຊົງ (shape queries) ທັງໝົດ "
"ລວມເຖິງວັດຖຸຟີຊິກໃນການຈຳລອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານການລຶບຂອບພາຍໃນຂອງ Jolt (enhanced internal "
"edge removal) ເຊິ່ງຈະເຂົ້າມາແທນທີ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້."

msgid ""
"The amount of collision margin to use for certain convex collision shapes, "
"such as [BoxShape3D], [CylinderShape3D] and [ConvexPolygonShape3D], as a "
"fraction of the shape's shortest axis, with [member Shape3D.margin] as the "
"upper bound. This is mainly used to speed up collision detection with convex "
"shapes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Collision margins in Jolt do not add any extra size to the "
"shape. Instead the shape is first shrunk by the margin and then expanded by "
"the same amount, resulting in a shape with rounded corners.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this value too close to [code]0.0[/code] may also "
"negatively affect the accuracy of the collision detection with convex shapes."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຂອບການຕຳ (collision margin) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງການຕຳແບບນູນ (convex) ບາງຊະນິດ ເຊັ່ນ "
"[BoxShape3D], [CylinderShape3D] ແລະ [ConvexPolygonShape3D], "
"ໂດຍຄິດເປັນສັດສ່ວນຂອງແກນທີ່ສັ້ນທີ່ສຸດຂອງຮູບຊົງ, ໂດຍມີ [member Shape3D.margin] ເປັນຂີດຈຳກັດສູງສຸດ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວໃນການກວດຈັບການຕຳກັບຮູບຊົງແບບນູນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Collision margins ໃນ Jolt ຈະບໍ່ເພີ່ມຂະໜາດພິເສດໃຫ້ກັບຮູບຊົງ. "
"ແຕ່ຮູບຊົງຈະຖືກຫຍໍ້ລົງຕາມຂອບກ່ອນ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງຂະຫຍາຍອອກໃນຈຳນວນເທົ່າກັນ, ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ຮູບຊົງມີມຸມທີ່ມົນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃກ້ກັບ [code]0.0[/code] ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ "
"ອາດສົ່ງຜົນເສຍຕໍ່ຄວາມຊັດເຈນໃນການກວດຈັບການຕຳກັບຮູບຊົງແບບນູນ."

msgid ""
"Which of the two nodes bound by a joint should represent the world when one "
"of the two is omitted, as either [member Joint3D.node_a] or [member "
"Joint3D.node_b]. This can be thought of as having the omitted node be a "
"[StaticBody3D] at the joint's position. Joint limits are more easily "
"expressed when [member Joint3D.node_a] represents the world.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In Godot Physics, only [member Joint3D.node_b] can represent the "
"world."
msgstr ""
"ໃນບັນດາສອງໂນດທີ່ຜູກມັດດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຕໍ່ (joint), ໂນດໃດຄວນເປັນຕົວແທນຂອງໂລກ (world) "
"ເມື່ອໂນດໃດໜຶ່ງຖືກລະເວັ້ນ, ລະຫວ່າງ [member Joint3D.node_a] ຫຼື [member Joint3D.node_b]. "
"ສາມາດຄິດໄດ້ວ່າໃຫ້ໂນດທີ່ລະເວັ້ນນັ້ນເປັນ [StaticBody3D] ຢູ່ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່. "
"ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຈະສະແດງອອກໄດ້ງ່າຍກວ່າເມື່ອ [member Joint3D.node_a] ເປັນຕົວແທນຂອງໂລກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Godot Physics, ມີພຽງແຕ່ [member Joint3D.node_b] "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດເປັນຕົວແທນຂອງໂລກໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The maximum angular velocity that a [RigidBody3D] can reach, in radians per "
"second.\n"
"This is mainly used as a fail-safe, to prevent the simulation from exploding, "
"as fast-moving objects colliding with complex physics structures can "
"otherwise cause them to go out of control. Fast-moving objects can also cause "
"a lot of stress on the collision detection system, which can slow down the "
"simulation considerably."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມ (angular velocity) ສູງສຸດທີ່ [RigidBody3D] ສາມາດໄປເຖິງໄດ້, "
"ເປັນເຣດຽນຕໍ່ວິນາທີ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ເປັນລະບົບປ້ອງກັນ (fail-safe) ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ການຈຳລອງ \"ລະເບີດ\" ຫຼື ຜິດພ້ຽນ, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວຫຼາຍເມື່ອຕຳກັບໂຄງສ້າງຟີຊິກທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການຄວບຄຸມເສຍໄປ. "
"ວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວຫຼາຍຍັງສ້າງພາລະໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບກວດຈັບການຕຳ, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການຈຳລອງຊ້າລົງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of [PhysicsBody3D] to support at the same time, awake or "
"sleeping. When this limit is exceeded, an error is reported and anything past "
"that point is undefined behavior.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This limit also applies within the editor."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງ [PhysicsBody3D] ທີ່ຈະຮອງຮັບໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ຫຼື ຫຼັບຢູ່. "
"ເມື່ອເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດນີ້, ຈະມີການລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ແລະ ສິ່ງທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຄາດເດົາໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຂີດຈຳກັດນີ້ຍັງມີຜົນພາຍໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor) ນຳ."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of body pairs to allow processing of. When this limit is "
"exceeded, a warning is reported and collisions will randomly be ignored while "
"bodies pass through each other."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງຄູ່ວັດຖຸທີ່ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນ. ເມື່ອເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດນີ້, ຈະມີການລາຍງານຄຳເຕືອນ ແລະ "
"ການຕຳກັນຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນແບບສຸ່ມ ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸສາມາດເຄື່ອນທີ່ທະລຸຜ່ານກັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of contact constraints to allow processing of. When this "
"limit is exceeded, a warning is reported and collisions will randomly be "
"ignored while bodies pass through each other."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດການສຳຜັດ (contact constraints) ທີ່ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນ. "
"ເມື່ອເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດນີ້, ຈະມີການລາຍງານຄຳເຕືອນ ແລະ ການຕຳກັນຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນແບບສຸ່ມ "
"ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸສາມາດເຄື່ອນທີ່ທະລຸຜ່ານກັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The maximum linear velocity that a [RigidBody3D] can reach, in meters per "
"second.\n"
"This is mainly used as a fail-safe, to prevent the simulation from exploding, "
"as fast-moving objects colliding with complex physics structures can "
"otherwise cause them to go out of control. Fast-moving objects can also cause "
"a lot of stress on the collision detection system, which can slow down the "
"simulation considerably."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວເຊີງເສັ້ນ (linear velocity) ສູງສຸດທີ່ [RigidBody3D] ສາມາດໄປເຖິງໄດ້, "
"ເປັນແມັດຕໍ່ວິນາທີ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ເປັນລະບົບປ້ອງກັນ (fail-safe) ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ການຈຳລອງຜິດພ້ຽນ, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວຫຼາຍເມື່ອຕຳກັບໂຄງສ້າງຟີຊິກທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການຄວບຄຸມເສຍໄປ. "
"ວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວຫຼາຍຍັງສ້າງພາລະໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບກວດຈັບການຕຳ, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການຈຳລອງຊ້າລົງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ."

msgid ""
"The amount of memory to pre-allocate for the stack allocator used within "
"Jolt, in MiB. This allocator is used within the physics step to store things "
"that are only needed during it, like which bodies are in contact, how they "
"form islands and the data needed to solve the contacts."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ຈະຈອງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ (pre-allocate) ສຳລັບ stack allocator ທີ່ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ "
"Jolt, ເປັນ MiB. ຕົວຈັດສັນນີ້ໃຊ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຟີຊິກເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນສະເພາະໃນເວລານັ້ນ ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ວັດຖຸໃດສຳຜັດກັນ, ພວກມັນລວມຕົວກັນແນວໃດ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການແກ້ໄຂການສຳຜັດ."

msgid ""
"The size of [WorldBoundaryShape3D] boundaries, for all three dimensions. The "
"plane is effectively centered within a box of this size, and anything outside "
"of the box will not collide with it. This is necessary as "
"[WorldBoundaryShape3D] is not unbounded when using Jolt, in order to prevent "
"precision issues.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this value too high can make collision detection less "
"accurate.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Collisions against the effective edges of a "
"[WorldBoundaryShape3D] will be inconsistent."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງຂອບເຂດ [WorldBoundaryShape3D], ສຳລັບທັງສາມມິຕິ. ແຜ່ນພຽງ (plane) "
"ຈະຖືກຈັດໃຫ້ຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງພາຍໃນກ່ອງຂະໜາດນີ້, ແລະ ສິ່ງໃດກໍ່ຕາມທີ່ຢູ່ນອກກ່ອງຈະບໍ່ຕຳກັບມັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນເພາະ "
"[WorldBoundaryShape3D] ຈະມີຂອບເຂດຈຳກັດເມື່ອໃຊ້ Jolt ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບັນຫາດ້ານຄວາມຊັດເຈນ "
"(precision).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ສູງເກີນໄປອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການກວດຈັບການຕຳມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນຫຼຸດລົງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕຳກັບຂອບຂອງ [WorldBoundaryShape3D] ອາດຈະບໍ່ສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Fraction of the total penetration to depenetrate per iteration during motion "
"queries.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This affects methods [method CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide], "
"[method PhysicsBody3D.move_and_collide], [method PhysicsBody3D.test_move] and "
"[method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."
msgstr ""
"ສັດສ່ວນຂອງການຊຶມຜ່ານທັງໝົດທີ່ຈະຖືກແຍກອອກ (depenetrate) ຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງຮອບການຄຳນວນ "
"ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສອບຖາມການເຄື່ອນທີ່ (motion queries).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນກັບເມັດທອດ [method CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide], "
"[method PhysicsBody3D.move_and_collide], [method PhysicsBody3D.test_move] ແລະ "
"[method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."

msgid ""
"The number of iterations to run when depenetrating during motion queries.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This affects methods [method CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide], "
"[method PhysicsBody3D.move_and_collide], [method PhysicsBody3D.test_move] and "
"[method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຮອບການຄຳນວນທີ່ຈະຣັນເມື່ອແຍກວັດຖຸອອກຈາກກັນໃນລະຫວ່າງການສອບຖາມການເຄື່ອນທີ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນກັບເມັດທອດ [method CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide], "
"[method PhysicsBody3D.move_and_collide], [method PhysicsBody3D.test_move] ແລະ "
"[method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables Jolt's enhanced internal edge removal during "
"motion queries. This can help alleviate ghost collisions, but only with edges "
"within a single body, meaning edges between separate bodies can still cause "
"ghost collisions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This affects methods [method CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide], "
"[method PhysicsBody3D.move_and_collide], [method PhysicsBody3D.test_move] and "
"[method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານການລຶບຂອບພາຍໃນຂອງ Jolt "
"ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສອບຖາມການເຄື່ອນທີ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດບັນຫາການຕຳແບບຜິດພາດ (ghost collisions) ໄດ້, "
"ແຕ່ສະເພາະກັບຂອບພາຍໃນວັດຖຸດຽວກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຂອບລະຫວ່າງວັດຖຸທີ່ແຍກກັນຍັງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ "
"ghost collisions ໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນກັບເມັດທອດ [method CharacterBody3D.move_and_slide], "
"[method PhysicsBody3D.move_and_collide], [method PhysicsBody3D.test_move] ແລະ "
"[method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], populates the [code]face_index[/code] field in the "
"results of [method PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.intersect_ray], also accessed "
"through [method RayCast3D.get_collision_face_index]. If [code]false[/code], "
"the [code]face_index[/code] field will be left at its default value of "
"[code]-1[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Enabling this setting will increase Jolt's memory usage for "
"[ConcavePolygonShape3D] by around 25%."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃສ່ຄ່າໃນຟິວ [code]face_index[/code] ໃນຜົນລັບຂອງ "
"[method PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.intersect_ray], ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານ [method "
"RayCast3D.get_collision_face_index]. ຫາກເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຟິວ "
"[code]face_index[/code] ຈະຖືກປະໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [code]-1[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະເພີ່ມການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຂອງ Jolt ສຳລັບ "
"[ConcavePolygonShape3D] ປະມານ 25%."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables Jolt's enhanced internal edge removal during "
"shape queries. This can help alleviate ghost collisions when using shape "
"queries for things like character movement, but only with edges within a "
"single body, meaning edges between separate bodies can still cause ghost "
"collisions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This affects methods [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.cast_motion], [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.collide_shape], [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.get_rest_info] and [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.intersect_shape].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Enabling this setting can cause certain shapes to be culled from "
"the results entirely, but you will get at least one intersection per body."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານການລຶບຂອບພາຍໃນຂອງ Jolt "
"ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສອບຖາມຮູບຊົງ (shape queries). ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດບັນຫາ ghost collisions "
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການສອບຖາມຮູບຊົງສຳລັບສິ່ງຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງຕົວລະຄອນ, "
"ແຕ່ສະເພາະກັບຂອບພາຍໃນວັດຖຸດຽວກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນກັບເມັດທອດ [method PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.cast_motion], "
"[method PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.collide_shape], [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.get_rest_info] ແລະ [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.intersect_shape].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບຊົງບາງອັນຖືກຄັດອອກຈາກຜົນລັບທັງໝົດ, "
"ແຕ່ເຈົ້າຈະໄດ້ຮັບການຕັດກັນ (intersection) ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນຕໍ່ວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [RigidBody3D] nodes are allowed to go to sleep if their "
"velocity is below the threshold defined in [member physics/jolt_physics_3d/"
"simulation/sleep_velocity_threshold] for the duration set in [member physics/"
"jolt_physics_3d/simulation/sleep_time_threshold]. This can improve physics "
"simulation performance when there are non-moving [RigidBody3D] nodes, at the "
"cost of some nodes possibly failing to wake up in certain scenarios. Consider "
"disabling this temporarily to troubleshoot [RigidBody3D] nodes not moving "
"when they should."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດ [RigidBody3D] ຈະຖືກອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຫຼັບໄດ້ "
"ຫາກຄວາມໄວຕ່ຳກວ່າເກນທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ [member physics/jolt_physics_3d/simulation/"
"sleep_velocity_threshold] ຕາມໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ [member physics/jolt_physics_3d/"
"simulation/sleep_time_threshold]. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກເມື່ອມີວັດຖຸທີ່ບໍ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວ, "
"ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ບາງວັດຖຸບໍ່ຍອມຕື່ນໃນບາງສະຖານະການ. ພິຈາລະນາປິດການໃຊ້ງານນີ້ຊົ່ວຄາວເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເມື່ອ "
"[RigidBody3D] ບໍ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວຕາມທີ່ຄວນຈະເປັນ."

msgid ""
"How much of the position error of a [RigidBody3D] to fix during a physics "
"step, where [code]0.0[/code] is none and [code]1.0[/code] is the full amount. "
"This affects things like how quickly bodies depenetrate.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this value too high can make [RigidBody3D] nodes "
"unstable."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງ (position error) ຂອງ [RigidBody3D] "
"ທີ່ຈະແກ້ໄຂໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນຟີຊິກ, ໂດຍ [code]0.0[/code] ແມ່ນບໍ່ແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ແມ່ນແກ້ໄຂທັງໝົດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມໄວໃນການແຍກວັດຖຸອອກຈາກກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ສູງເກີນໄປອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໂນດ [RigidBody3D] ບໍ່ເສຖຍນ."

msgid ""
"The maximum relative angle by which a body pair can move and still reuse the "
"collision results from the previous physics step, in radians."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມສຳພັດສູງສຸດທີ່ວັດຖຸຄູ່ໜຶ່ງສາມາດເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄດ້ ແລະ ຍັງສາມາດນຳຜົນລັບການຕຳຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນຟີຊິກກ່ອນໜ້າມາໃຊ້ຄືນໄດ້, "
"ເປັນເຣດຽນ."

msgid ""
"The maximum relative distance by which a body pair can move and still reuse "
"the collision results from the previous physics step, in meters."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງສຳພັດສູງສຸດທີ່ວັດຖຸຄູ່ໜຶ່ງສາມາດເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ຍັງສາມາດນຳຜົນລັບການຕຳຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນຟີຊິກກ່ອນໜ້າມາໃຊ້ຄືນໄດ້, ເປັນແມັດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables the body pair contact cache, which removes the "
"need for potentially expensive collision detection when the relative "
"orientation between two bodies hasn't changed much."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານແຄຊການສຳຜັດຂອງຄູ່ວັດຖຸ (body pair contact "
"cache), ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຄວາມຈຳເປັນໃນການກວດຈັບການຕຳທີ່ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນສູງ "
"ເມື່ອການວາງທິດທາງສຳພັດລະຫວ່າງສອງວັດຖຸບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຫຼາຍ."

msgid ""
"The minimum velocity needed before a collision can be bouncy, in meters per "
"second."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ກ່ອນທີ່ການຕຳຈະສາມາດມີຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນ (bouncy), ເປັນແມັດຕໍ່ວິນາທີ."

msgid ""
"Fraction of a body's inner radius that may penetrate another body while using "
"continuous collision detection."
msgstr ""
"ສັດສ່ວນຂອງລັດສະໝີພາຍໃນຂອງວັດຖຸ ທີ່ອາດຈະຊຶມຜ່ານອີກວັດຖຸໜຶ່ງໄດ້ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໃຊ້ການກວດຈັບການຕຳແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ "
"(continuous collision detection)."

msgid ""
"Fraction of a body's inner radius that the body must move per step to make "
"use of continuous collision detection."
msgstr ""
"ສັດສ່ວນຂອງລັດສະໝີພາຍໃນຂອງວັດຖຸ ທີ່ວັດຖຸຕ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງຂັ້ນຕອນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການກວດຈັບການຕຳແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], a [RigidBody3D] frozen with [constant "
"RigidBody3D.FREEZE_MODE_KINEMATIC] is able to collide with other kinematic "
"and static bodies, and therefore generate contacts for them.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting can come at a heavy CPU and memory cost if you "
"allow many/large frozen kinematic bodies with a non-zero [member "
"RigidBody3D.max_contacts_reported] to overlap with complex static geometry, "
"such as [ConcavePolygonShape3D] or [HeightMapShape3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], [RigidBody3D] ທີ່ຖືກແຊ່ແຂງດ້ວຍ [constant "
"RigidBody3D.FREEZE_MODE_KINEMATIC] ຈະສາມາດຕຳກັບວັດຖຸ kinematic ແລະ static ອື່ນໆໄດ້, "
"ແລະ ສ້າງການສຳຜັດໃຫ້ກັບພວກມັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ອາດໃຊ້ CPU ແລະ ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສູງ ຫາກເຈົ້າອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸ kinematic "
"ທີ່ແຊ່ແຂງຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ມີຄ່າ [member RigidBody3D.max_contacts_reported] "
"ບໍ່ແມ່ນສູນ ໄປຊ້ອນທັບກັບເລຂາຄະນິດແບບຄົງທີ່ທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ ເຊັ່ນ [ConcavePolygonShape3D] ຫຼື "
"[HeightMapShape3D]."

msgid "How much bodies are allowed to penetrate each other, in meters."
msgstr "ໄລຍະທີ່ວັດຖຸຖືກອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຊຶມຜ່ານກັນໄດ້, ເປັນແມັດ."

msgid ""
"Number of solver position iterations. The greater the number of iterations, "
"the more accurate the simulation will be, at the cost of CPU performance."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຮອບການຄຳນວນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ຍິ່ງຈຳນວນຮອບຫຼາຍ, ການຈຳລອງກໍ່ຈະຍິ່ງຊັດເຈນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະແລກມາກັບປະສິດທິພາບ CPU."

msgid ""
"Time in seconds a [RigidBody3D] will spend below the sleep velocity threshold "
"before going to sleep."
msgstr "ເວລາເປັນວິນາທີທີ່ [RigidBody3D] ຈະໃຊ້ຢູ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າເກນຄວາມໄວ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດຫຼັບ."

msgid ""
"The linear velocity of specific points on the bounding box of a "
"[RigidBody3D], below which it can be put to sleep, in meters per second. "
"These points help capture both the linear and angular motion of a "
"[RigidBody3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວເຊີງເສັ້ນຂອງຈຸດສະເພາະເທິງ bounding box ຂອງ [RigidBody3D], "
"ເຊິ່ງຫາກຕ່ຳກວ່ານັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ຫຼັບ, ເປັນແມັດຕໍ່ວິນາທີ. ຈຸດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍກວດຈັບທັງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ເຊີງເສັ້ນ ແລະ "
"ເຊີງມຸມຂອງ [RigidBody3D]."

msgid ""
"How big the points of a [SoftBody3D] are, in meters. A higher value can "
"prevent behavior such as cloth laying perfectly flush against other surfaces "
"and causing Z-fighting."
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດຂອງ [SoftBody3D] ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ປານໃດ, ເປັນແມັດ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນສາມາດປ້ອງກັນພຶດຕິກຳ ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ຜ້າທີ່ວາງຮາບພຽງກັບພື້ນຜິວອື່ນເກີນໄປ ຈົນເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາ Z-fighting."

msgid ""
"Radius around physics bodies, inside which speculative contact points will be "
"detected, in meters. This is mainly used to prevent tunneling/penetration for "
"[RigidBody3D] nodes during simulation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this too high may result in ghost collisions, as "
"speculative contacts are based on the closest points during the collision "
"detection step which may not be the actual closest points by the time the two "
"bodies hit."
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີອ້ອມວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ ເຊິ່ງພາຍໃນນັ້ນຈະມີການກວດຈັບຈຸດສຳຜັດແບບຄາດຄະເນ (speculative contact "
"points), ເປັນແມັດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການເຄື່ອນທີ່ທະລຸ (tunneling/penetration) ສຳລັບໂນດ "
"[RigidBody3D] ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຈຳລອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ສູງເກີນໄປອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ ghost collisions, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກການສຳຜັດແບບຄາດຄະເນແມ່ນອີງຕາມຈຸດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການກວດຈັບການຕຳ "
"ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະບໍ່ແມ່ນຈຸດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດແທ້ໆໃນເວລາທີ່ວັດຖຸທັງສອງຕຳກັນແທ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables Jolt's enhanced internal edge removal for "
"[RigidBody3D]. This can help alleviate ghost collisions when, for example, a "
"[RigidBody3D] collides with the edges of two perfectly joined [BoxShape3D]. "
"The removal only applies to edges internal to a single body, meaning edges "
"between separate bodies can still cause ghost collisions."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານການລຶບຂອບພາຍໃນຂອງ Jolt ສຳລັບ [RigidBody3D]. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດບັນຫາ ghost collisions ເຊັ່ນ: ເມື່ອ [RigidBody3D] ຕຳກັບຂອບຂອງ [BoxShape3D] "
"ສອງອັນທີ່ວາງຕິດກັນພໍດີ. ການລຶບຈະມີຜົນສະເພາະຂອບພາຍໃນວັດຖຸດຽວກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Number of solver velocity iterations. The greater the number of iterations, "
"the more accurate the simulation will be, at the cost of CPU performance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This needs to be at least [code]2[/code] in order for friction "
"to work, as friction is applied using the non-penetration impulse from the "
"previous iteration."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຮອບການຄຳນວນຄວາມໄວຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ຍິ່ງຈຳນວນຮອບຫຼາຍ, ການຈຳລອງກໍ່ຈະຍິ່ງຊັດເຈນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະແລກມາກັບປະສິດທິພາບ CPU.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ [code]2[/code] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຮງສຽດທານ (friction) "
"ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້, ເນື່ອງຈາກແຮງສຽດທານຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຮງຜັກດັນການບໍ່ຊຶມຜ່ານ (non-penetration "
"impulse) ຈາກຮອບການຄຳນວນກ່ອນໜ້າ."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of canvas item commands that can be batched into a single draw "
"call."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງຄຳສັ່ງ canvas item ທີ່ສາມາດຮວມກຸ່ມ (batched) ເຂົ້າໃນການຮຽກໃຊ້ການແຕ້ມ (draw "
"call) ດຽວ."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of uniform sets that will be cached by the 2D renderer when "
"batching draw calls.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Increasing this value can improve performance if the project "
"renders many unique sprite textures every frame."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງ uniform sets ທີ່ຈະຖືກແຄຊໂດຍຕົວສະແດງຜົນ 2D ເມື່ອຮວມກຸ່ມການແຕ້ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້ ຫາກໂປຣເຈັກມີການສະແດງຜົນເທັກເຈີສະໄປຣ໌ "
"(sprite textures) ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໃນແຕ່ລະເຟຣມ."

msgid ""
"Controls how much of the original viewport size should be covered by the 2D "
"signed distance field. This SDF can be sampled in [CanvasItem] shaders and is "
"used for [GPUParticles2D] collision. Higher values allow portions of "
"occluders located outside the viewport to still be taken into account in the "
"generated signed distance field, at the cost of performance. If you notice "
"particles falling through [LightOccluder2D]s as the occluders leave the "
"viewport, increase this setting.\n"
"The percentage specified is added on each axis and on both sides. For "
"example, with the default setting of 120%, the signed distance field will "
"cover 20% of the viewport's size outside the viewport on each side (top, "
"right, bottom, left).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the 2D SDF oversizing percentage at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_sdf_oversize_and_scale] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມວ່າພື້ນທີ່ຂອງວິວພອດເດີມຄວນຖືກຄອບຄຸມໂດຍ 2D signed distance field (SDF) ຫຼາຍປານໃດ. "
"SDF ນີ້ສາມາດຖືກນຳມາສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງໃນ [CanvasItem] shaders ແລະ ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳຂອງ "
"[GPUParticles2D]. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສ່ວນຂອງຕົວບັງແສງ (occluders) "
"ທີ່ຢູ່ນອກວິວພອດຍັງຖືກນຳມາຄຳນວນໃນ SDF ໄດ້, ແຕ່ຈະແລກມາກັບປະສິດທິພາບ. ຫາກເຈົ້າສັງເກດເຫັນອະນຸພາກ "
"(particles) ທະລຸຜ່ານ [LightOccluder2D] ເມື່ອຕົວບັງແສງອອກຈາກວິວພອດ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້.\n"
"ເປີເຊັນທີ່ລະບຸຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນແຕ່ລະແກນ ແລະ ທັງສອງດ້ານ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ດ້ວຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 120%, SDF "
"ຈະຄອບຄຸມ 20% ຂອງຂະໜາດວິວພອດທີ່ຢູ່ນອກວິວພອດໃນແຕ່ລະດ້ານ (ເທິງ, ຂວາ, ລຸ່ມ, ຊ້າຍ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນເປີເຊັນ SDF oversize "
"ໃນຂະນະຣັນເກມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_sdf_oversize_and_scale] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The resolution scale to use for the 2D signed distance field. Higher values "
"lead to a more precise and more stable signed distance field as the camera "
"moves, at the cost of performance. The default value (50%) renders at half "
"the resolution of the viewport size on each axis, which means the SDF is "
"generated with 25% of the viewport's pixel count.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the 2D SDF resolution scale at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_sdf_oversize_and_scale] instead."
msgstr ""
"ມາດຕາສ່ວນຄວາມລະອຽດ (resolution scale) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ 2D signed distance field. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ SDF ມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນ ແລະ ເສຖຍນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່, "
"ແຕ່ຈະແລກມາກັບປະສິດທິພາບ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (50%) ຈະສະແດງຜົນທີ່ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຄວາມລະອຽດວິວພອດໃນແຕ່ລະແກນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ SDF ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍ 25% ຂອງຈຳນວນພິກເຊວໃນວິວພອດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນມາດຕາສ່ວນຄວາມລະອຽດ SDF "
"ໃນຂະນະຣັນເກມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_sdf_oversize_and_scale] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The size of the 2D shadow atlas in pixels. Higher values result in more "
"precise [Light2D] shadows, at the cost of performance and video memory usage. "
"The specified value is rounded up to the nearest power of 2.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the 2D shadow atlas size at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.canvas_set_shadow_texture_size] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງ 2D shadow atlas ເປັນພິກເຊວ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາຂອງ [Light2D] "
"ມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ຈະແລກມາກັບປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳວິດີໂອ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ລະບຸຈະຖືກປັດຂຶ້ນເປັນເລກກຳລັງຂອງ 2 ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ 2D shadow atlas "
"ໃນຂະນະຣັນເກມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method RenderingServer.canvas_set_shadow_texture_size] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [CanvasItem] nodes will internally snap to full pixels. "
"Useful for low-resolution pixel art games. Their position can still be sub-"
"pixel, but the decimals will not have effect as the position is rounded. This "
"can lead to a crisper appearance at the cost of less smooth movement, "
"especially when [Camera2D] smoothing is enabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To toggle 2D "
"transform snapping at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_snap_2d_transforms_to_pixel] on the root "
"[Viewport] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Control] nodes are snapped to the nearest pixel by default. "
"This is controlled by [member gui/common/snap_controls_to_pixels].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is not recommended to use this setting together with [member "
"rendering/2d/snap/snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel], as movement may appear even "
"less smooth. Prefer only enabling this setting instead."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດ [CanvasItem] ຈະຖືກດູດຕິດ (snap) "
"ເຂົ້າກັບພິກເຊວເຕັມພາຍໃນ. ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບເກມແບບ pixel art ທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳ. "
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງພວກມັນຍັງສາມາດເປັນ sub-pixel ໄດ້, ແຕ່ຄ່າທົດສະນິຍົມຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງຈະຖືກປັດເສດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພາບເບິ່ງຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນ "
"ແຕ່ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວອາດຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ລຽບນຽນປານໃດ, ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ Camera2D smoothing.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອເປີດ-ປິດ 2D transform "
"snapping ໃນຂະນະຣັນເກມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_snap_2d_transforms_to_pixel] ຢູ່ທີ່ root [Viewport] "
"ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດ [Control] ຈະຖືກ snap ເຂົ້າຫາພິກເຊວທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ [member gui/common/snap_controls_to_pixels].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [member rendering/2d/snap/"
"snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel] ເພາະອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວເບິ່ງບໍ່ລຽບນຽນຍິ່ງຂຶ້ນ. "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເລືອກເປີດໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ແທນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], vertices of [CanvasItem] nodes will snap to full "
"pixels. Useful for low-resolution pixel art games. Only affects the final "
"vertex positions, not the transforms. This can lead to a crisper appearance "
"at the cost of less smooth movement, especially when [Camera2D] smoothing is "
"enabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To toggle 2D "
"vertex snapping at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel] on the root "
"[Viewport] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Control] nodes are snapped to the nearest pixel by default. "
"This is controlled by [member gui/common/snap_controls_to_pixels].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is not recommended to use this setting together with [member "
"rendering/2d/snap/snap_2d_transforms_to_pixel], as movement may appear even "
"less smooth. Prefer only enabling that setting instead."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈຸດຍອດ (vertices) ຂອງໂນດ [CanvasItem] ຈະຖືກດູດຕິດ "
"(snap) ເຂົ້າກັບພິກເຊວເຕັມ. ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບເກມ pixel art ຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະຕຳແໜ່ງ "
"vertices ສຸດທ້າຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບ transforms. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພາບເບິ່ງຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນ "
"ແຕ່ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວອາດຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ລຽບນຽນປານໃດ, ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ Camera2D smoothing.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອເປີດ-ປິດ 2D vertex snapping "
"ໃນຂະນະຣັນເກມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel] ຢູ່ທີ່ root [Viewport] "
"ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດ [Control] ຈະຖືກ snap ເຂົ້າຫາພິກເຊວທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ [member gui/common/snap_controls_to_pixels].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [member rendering/2d/snap/"
"snap_2d_transforms_to_pixel] ເພາະອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວເບິ່ງບໍ່ລຽບນຽນຍິ່ງຂຶ້ນ. "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເລືອກເປີດໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານັ້ນແທນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the number of multisample antialiasing (MSAA) samples to use for 2D/"
"Canvas rendering (as a power of two). MSAA is used to reduce aliasing around "
"the edges of polygons. A higher MSAA value results in smoother edges but can "
"be significantly slower on some hardware, especially integrated graphics due "
"to their limited memory bandwidth. This has no effect on shader-induced "
"aliasing or texture aliasing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] MSAA is only supported in the Forward+ and Mobile rendering "
"methods, not Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To set the "
"number of 2D MSAA samples at runtime, set [member Viewport.msaa_2d] or use "
"[method RenderingServer.viewport_set_msaa_2d]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ multisample antialiasing (MSAA) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນ 2D/"
"Canvas (ເປັນເລກກຳລັງຂອງສອງ). MSAA ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຮອຍຢັກອ້ອມຂອບຂອງໂພລີກອນ. ຄ່າ MSAA "
"ທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນຂຶ້ນ ແຕ່ອາດຈະຊ້າລົງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍໃນຮາດແວບາງຊະນິດ, "
"ໂດຍສະເພາະກາຟິກແບບອອນບອດ ເນື່ອງຈາກ memory bandwidth ທີ່ຈຳກັດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບຮອຍຢັກທີ່ເກີດຈາກ "
"shader ຫຼື ເທັກເຈີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] MSAA ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນໂໝດ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ "
"Compatibility.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນ 2D MSAA samples "
"ໃນຂະນະຣັນເກມ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [member Viewport.msaa_2d] ຫຼື ໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_msaa_2d]."

msgid ""
"Sets the number of multisample antialiasing (MSAA) samples to use for 3D "
"rendering (as a power of two). MSAA is used to reduce aliasing around the "
"edges of polygons. A higher MSAA value results in smoother edges but can be "
"significantly slower on some hardware, especially integrated graphics due to "
"their limited memory bandwidth. See also [member rendering/scaling_3d/mode] "
"for supersampling, which provides higher quality but is much more expensive. "
"This has no effect on shader-induced aliasing or texture aliasing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To set the "
"number of 3D MSAA samples at runtime, set [member Viewport.msaa_3d] or use "
"[method RenderingServer.viewport_set_msaa_3d]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ multisample antialiasing (MSAA) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນ 3D "
"(ເປັນເລກກຳລັງຂອງສອງ). MSAA ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຮອຍຢັກອ້ອມຂອບຂອງໂພລີກອນ. ຄ່າ MSAA "
"ທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນຂຶ້ນ ແຕ່ອາດຈະຊ້າລົງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍໃນຮາດແວບາງຊະນິດ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"rendering/scaling_3d/mode] ສຳລັບ supersampling ນຳ, "
"ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບສູງກວ່າແຕ່ກໍ່ກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍກວ່າ. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບຮອຍຢັກທີ່ເກີດຈາກ shader ຫຼື ເທັກເຈີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນ 3D MSAA samples "
"ໃນຂະນະຣັນເກມ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [member Viewport.msaa_3d] ຫຼື ໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_msaa_3d]."

msgid ""
"Sets the screen-space antialiasing mode for the default screen [Viewport]. "
"Screen-space antialiasing works by selectively blurring edges in a post-"
"process shader. It differs from MSAA which takes multiple coverage samples "
"while rendering objects. Screen-space AA methods are typically faster than "
"MSAA and will smooth out specular aliasing, but tend to make scenes appear "
"blurry. The blurriness is partially counteracted by automatically using a "
"negative mipmap LOD bias (see [member rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"texture_mipmap_bias]).\n"
"Another way to combat specular aliasing is to enable [member rendering/"
"anti_aliasing/screen_space_roughness_limiter/enabled].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Screen-space antialiasing is only supported in the Forward+ and "
"Mobile rendering methods, not Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To set the "
"screen-space antialiasing mode at runtime, set [member "
"Viewport.screen_space_aa] on the root [Viewport] instead, or use [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_screen_space_aa]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດ screen-space antialiasing ສຳລັບ [Viewport] ຫຼັກ. Screen-space "
"antialiasing ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບມົວລົງໃນ post-process shader. ມັນແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ MSAA "
"ທີ່ສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງໃນຂະນະສະແດງຜົນວັດຖຸ. ວິທີ screen-space AA ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະໄວກວ່າ MSAA ແລະ "
"ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຮອຍຢັກຈາກແສງສະທ້ອນ (specular aliasing), ແຕ່ມັກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສາກເບິ່ງມົວລົງ. "
"ຄວາມມົວນີ້ຖືກແກ້ໄຂບາງສ່ວນໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄ່າລົບ mipmap LOD bias ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"rendering/textures/default_filters/texture_mipmap_bias]).\n"
"ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງໃນການແກ້ໄຂ specular aliasing ແມ່ນການເປີດໃຊ້ [member rendering/anti_aliasing/"
"screen_space_roughness_limiter/enabled].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Screen-space antialiasing ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນໂໝດ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນຂະນະຣັນເກມ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ "
"[member Viewport.screen_space_aa] ຢູ່ທີ່ root [Viewport] ຫຼື ໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_screen_space_aa]."

msgid ""
"Sets the sensitivity to edges when using SMAA for antialiasing. Lower values "
"will catch more edges, at a potentially higher performance cost.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. There is "
"currently no way to change this setting at run-time."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມອ່ອນໄຫວຕໍ່ກັບຂອບເມື່ອໃຊ້ SMAA. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະກວດຈັບຂອບໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນສູງຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ມີວິທີປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃນຂະນະຣັນເກມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses a fast dithering filter just before transforming "
"floating point color values to integer color values to make banding "
"significantly less visible. Debanding is applied at different steps of the "
"rendering process depending on the rendering method and [member rendering/"
"viewport/hdr_2d] setting.\n"
"In some cases, debanding may introduce a slightly noticeable dithering "
"pattern. It's recommended to enable debanding only when actually needed since "
"the dithering pattern will make lossless-compressed screenshots larger.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts and "
"configures [method RenderingServer.material_set_use_debanding] and [member "
"Viewport.use_debanding] of the root [Viewport]. When [member rendering/"
"viewport/hdr_2d] is disabled, you should additionally set the [member "
"Viewport.use_debanding] of other viewports in your project. To set debanding "
"at run-time, the property that should be set depends on the renderer: "
"Forward+ only uses [member Viewport.use_debanding] and Mobile uses both "
"[method RenderingServer.material_set_use_debanding] and [member "
"Viewport.use_debanding]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ dithering ທີ່ໄວ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະແປງຄ່າສີຈາກ floating "
"point ເປັນ integer ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຮອຍແຍກຂອງສີ (banding) ເຫັນໄດ້ໜ້ອຍລົງ. Debanding "
"ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຂຶ້ນກັບວິທີການສະແດງຜົນ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member rendering/"
"viewport/hdr_2d].\n"
"ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, debanding ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນລວດລາຍ dithering ເລັກນ້ອຍ. "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອຈຳເປັນແທ້ໆ ເພາະ dithering ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ພາບໜ້າຈໍທີ່ບີບອັດແບບ "
"lossless ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນຂະນະຣັນເກມ, "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຕັ້ງແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຕົວສະແດງຜົນ: Forward+ ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ [member "
"Viewport.use_debanding], ສ່ວນ Mobile ໃຊ້ທັງ [method "
"RenderingServer.material_set_use_debanding] ແລະ [member "
"Viewport.use_debanding]."

msgid ""
"Enables temporal antialiasing for the default screen [Viewport]. TAA works by "
"jittering the camera and accumulating the images of the last rendered frames, "
"motion vector rendering is used to account for camera and object motion. "
"Enabling TAA can make the image blurrier, which is partially counteracted by "
"automatically using a negative mipmap LOD bias (see [member rendering/"
"textures/default_filters/texture_mipmap_bias]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The implementation is not complete yet. Some visual instances "
"such as particles and skinned meshes may show ghosting artifacts in motion.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] TAA is only supported in the Forward+ rendering method, not "
"Mobile or Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To set TAA "
"at runtime, set [member Viewport.use_taa] on the root [Viewport] instead, or "
"use [method RenderingServer.viewport_set_use_taa]."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ temporal antialiasing (TAA) ສຳລັບ [Viewport] ຫຼັກ. TAA "
"ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການເຮັດໃຫ້ກ້ອງສັ່ນ (jittering) ແລະ ສະສົມພາບຈາກເຟຣມກ່ອນໜ້າ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ motion "
"vector ເພື່ອຄຳນວນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງກ້ອງ ແລະ ວັດຖຸ. ການເປີດ TAA ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບມົວລົງ, "
"ເຊິ່ງແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ບາງສ່ວນໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄ່າລົບ mipmap LOD bias.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການພັດທະນາຍັງບໍ່ທັນສົມບູນ. ບາງຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ particles ອາດຈະເຫັນພາບເງົາຫຼອນ "
"(ghosting) ໃນຂະນະເຄື່ອນທີ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] TAA ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ TAA ໃນຂະນະຣັນເກມ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ "
"[member Viewport.use_taa] ຢູ່ທີ່ root [Viewport] ຫຼື ໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_use_taa]."

msgid ""
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To control "
"the screen-space roughness limiter at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.screen_space_roughness_limiter_set_active] instead."
msgstr ""
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມ screen-space "
"roughness limiter ໃນຂະນະຣັນເກມ, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.screen_space_roughness_limiter_set_active] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables a spatial filter to limit roughness in areas "
"with high-frequency detail. This can help reduce specular aliasing to an "
"extent, though not as much as enabling [member rendering/anti_aliasing/"
"quality/use_taa]. This filter has a small performance cost, so consider "
"disabling it if it doesn't benefit your scene noticeably.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The screen-space roughness limiter is only supported in the "
"Forward+ and Mobile rendering methods, not Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To control "
"the screen-space roughness limiter at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.screen_space_roughness_limiter_set_active] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ spatial ເພື່ອຈຳກັດຄວາມຂຸມ (roughness) "
"ໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດຄວາມຖີ່ສູງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດ specular aliasing ໄດ້ໃນລະດັບໜຶ່ງ. "
"ຕົວຕອງນີ້ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບເລັກນ້ອຍ, ສະນັ້ນຄວນພິຈາລະນາປິດ "
"ຫາກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາກຂອງເຈົ້າເບິ່ງດີຂຶ້ນຢ່າງເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the quality of the depth of field effect. Higher quality takes more "
"samples, which is slower but looks smoother."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄຸນນະພາບຂອງເອັບເຟັກ Depth of Field (ຄວາມຊັດຕື້ນ). ຄຸນນະພາບສູງຈະໃຊ້ການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະຊ້າລົງແຕ່ເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the depth of field shape. Can be Box, Hexagon, or Circle. Box is the "
"fastest. Circle is the most realistic, but also the most expensive to compute."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຮູບຊົງຂອງ Depth of Field. ສາມາດເປັນ Box, Hexagon, ຫຼື Circle. Box ແມ່ນໄວທີ່ສຸດ. "
"Circle ແມ່ນສົມຈິງທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ກໍ່ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນການຄຳນວນຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], jitters DOF samples to make effect slightly blurrier "
"and hide lines created from low sample rates. This can result in a slightly "
"grainy appearance when used with a low number of samples."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ DOF ສັ່ນ (jitter) "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເອັບເຟັກເບິ່ງມົວຂຶ້ນເລັກນ້ອຍ ແລະ ຊ່ອນຮອຍເສັ້ນທີ່ເກີດຈາກການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຕ່ຳ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບເບິ່ງເປັນເມັດ (grainy) ຫາກໃຊ້ຈຳນວນຕົວຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ."

msgid ""
"Disables [member rendering/driver/depth_prepass/enable] conditionally for "
"certain vendors. By default, disables the depth prepass for mobile devices as "
"mobile devices do not benefit from the depth prepass due to their unique "
"architecture."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ [member rendering/driver/depth_prepass/enable] "
"ຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂສຳລັບຜູ້ຜະລິດບາງລາຍ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈະປິດ depth prepass ສຳລັບອຸປະກອນມືຖື "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກມືຖືບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບປະໂຫຍດຈາກສິ່ງນີ້ຍ້ອນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ສະເພາະຕົວ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], performs a previous depth pass before rendering 3D "
"materials. This increases performance significantly in scenes with high "
"overdraw, when complex materials and lighting are used. However, in scenes "
"with few occluded surfaces, the depth prepass may reduce performance. If your "
"game is viewed from a fixed angle that makes it easy to avoid overdraw (such "
"as top-down or side-scrolling perspective), consider disabling the depth "
"prepass to improve performance. This setting can be changed at run-time to "
"optimize performance depending on the scene currently being viewed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Depth prepass is only supported when using the Forward+ or "
"Compatibility rendering method. When using the Mobile rendering method, there "
"is no depth prepass performed."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເຮັດການປະມວນຜົນຄວາມເລິກ (depth pass) "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສະແດງຜົນວັດສະດຸ 3D. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍໃນສາກທີ່ມີການແຕ້ມຊ້ອນທັບ (overdraw) "
"ສູງ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ໃນສາກທີ່ມີພື້ນຜິວຖືກບັງໜ້ອຍ, ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບຫຼຸດລົງ. "
"ຫາກເກມຂອງເຈົ້າເບິ່ງຈາກມຸມຄົງທີ່ທີ່ຫຼີກເວັ້ນ overdraw ໄດ້ງ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາປິດ depth prepass. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໃນຂະນະຣັນເກມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Depth prepass ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນໂໝດ Forward+ ຫຼື Compatibility ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ໃນໂໝດ Mobile ຈະບໍ່ມີການເຮັດ depth prepass."

msgid ""
"This setting has several known bugs which can lead to crashing, especially "
"when using particles or resizing the window. Not recommended for use in "
"production at this stage."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີບັກທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກຫຼາຍອັນ ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໂປຣແກຣມຄ້າງ (crash), ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ particles "
"ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍ. ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນວຽກຈິງໃນຕອນນີ້."

msgid ""
"The thread model to use for rendering. Rendering on a thread may improve "
"performance, but synchronizing to the main thread can cause a bit more jitter."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບເທຣດ (thread model) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນ. "
"ການສະແດງຜົນໃນເທຣດແຍກອາດຈະເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ, ແຕ່ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນກັບເທຣດຫຼັກອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການກະຕຸກ "
"(jitter) ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເລັກນ້ອຍ."

msgid ""
"Default background clear color. Overridable per [Viewport] using its "
"[Environment]. See [member Environment.background_mode] and [member "
"Environment.background_color] in particular. To change this default color "
"programmatically, use [method RenderingServer.set_default_clear_color]."
msgstr ""
"ສີພື້ນຫຼັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (clear color). ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ໃນແຕ່ລະ [Viewport] ໂດຍໃຊ້ [Environment] "
"ຂອງມັນ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນສີນີ້ຜ່ານໂຄ້ດ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method RenderingServer.set_default_clear_color]."

msgid ""
"[Environment] that will be used as a fallback environment in case a scene "
"does not specify its own environment. The default environment is loaded in at "
"scene load time regardless of whether you have set an environment or not. If "
"you do not rely on the fallback environment, you do not need to set this "
"property."
msgstr ""
"[Environment] ທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າສຳຮອງ (fallback) "
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ສາກບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງຕົນເອງ. ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະຖືກໂຫຼດເຂົ້າມາສະເໝີ. "
"ຫາກເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ fallback environment, ເຈົ້າກໍ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້."

msgid ""
"Enables legacy fog blending behavior from version 4.5 and earlier. This is "
"intended for users who are developing on pre-4.6 versions and want to upgrade "
"to 4.6 with the smallest possible change to their visuals."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການປະສົມໝອກ (fog blending) ແບບເກົ່າຈາກເວີຊັນ 4.5 ແລະ ກ່ອນໜ້າ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີໄວ້ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ພັດທະນາໃນເວີຊັນກ່ອນ 4.6 ແລະ ຕ້ອງການອັບເກຣດເປັນ 4.6 "
"ໂດຍໃຫ້ມີການປ່ຽນແປງດ້ານພາບໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Sets how the glow effect is upscaled before being copied onto the screen. "
"Linear is faster, but looks blocky. Bicubic is slower but looks smooth.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member rendering/environment/glow/upscale_mode] is only "
"effective when using the Forward+ or Mobile rendering methods, as "
"Compatibility uses a different glow implementation."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າເອັບເຟັກແສງຟຸ້ງ (glow) ຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍຂະໜາດ (upscale) ແນວໃດກ່ອນຈະສະແດງຜົນ. Linear "
"ແມ່ນໄວທີ່ສຸດ ແຕ່ອາດເຫັນເປັນກ້ອນພິກເຊວ. Bicubic ແມ່ນຊ້າກວ່າແຕ່ເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີຜົນສະເພາະໃນ Forward+ ຫຼື Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/environment/glow/upscale_mode] on "
"mobile devices, due to performance concerns or driver support."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຂຽນທັບສຳລັບອຸປະກອນສະເປັກຕ່ຳສຳລັບ [member rendering/environment/glow/upscale_mode] "
"ໃນມືຖື, ເນື່ອງຈາກເຫດຜົນດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ ຫຼື ການຮອງຮັບຂອງໄດຣເວີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], screen-space reflections will be rendered at half size "
"and then upscaled before being added to the scene. This is faster but may "
"look pixelated or cause flickering. If [code]false[/code], screen-space "
"reflections will be rendered at full size."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການສະທ້ອນແບບ screen-space (SSR) "
"ຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນທີ່ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະໜາດຈິງ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງຂະຫຍາຍຂຶ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໄວຂຶ້ນແຕ່ອາດເຫັນເປັນພິກເຊວ ຫຼື "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບສັ່ນ. ຫາກເປັນ [code]false[/code], ມັນຈະສະແດງຜົນທີ່ຂະໜາດເຕັມ."

msgid ""
"Quality target to use when [member rendering/environment/ssao/quality] is set "
"to [code]Ultra[/code]. A value of [code]0.0[/code] provides a quality and "
"speed similar to [code]Medium[/code] while a value of [code]1.0[/code] "
"provides much higher quality than any of the other settings at the cost of "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"ເປົ້າໝາຍຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [member rendering/environment/ssao/quality] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]Ultra[/code]. ຄ່າ [code]0.0[/code] ຈະໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບ ແລະ ຄວາມໄວໃກ້ຄຽງກັບ "
"[code]Medium[/code], ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ຈະໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບສູງກວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ ແຕ່ກໍ່ກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍ."

msgid ""
"Number of blur passes to use when computing screen-space ambient occlusion. A "
"higher number will result in a smoother look, but will be slower to compute "
"and will have less high-frequency detail."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຮອບການເຮັດໃຫ້ມົວ (blur passes) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຄຳນວນ SSAO. "
"ຈຳນວນທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະໃຫ້ພາບທີ່ລຽບນຽນຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ຈະຄຳນວນຊ້າລົງ ແລະ ລາຍລະອຽດນ້ອຍໆອາດຈະຫາຍໄປ."

msgid ""
"Distance at which the screen-space ambient occlusion effect starts to fade "
"out. Use this hide ambient occlusion from far away."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ເອັບເຟັກການບົດບັງແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ (SSAO) ເລີ່ມຈາງຫາຍໄປ. "
"ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອງການບົດບັງແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈາກໄລຍະໄກ."

msgid ""
"Distance at which the screen-space ambient occlusion is fully faded out. Use "
"this hide ambient occlusion from far away."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ການບົດບັງແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ (SSAO) ຈາງຫາຍໄປຢ່າງສົມບູນ. "
"ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອງການບົດບັງແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈາກໄລຍະໄກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], screen-space ambient occlusion will be rendered at half "
"size and then upscaled before being added to the scene. This is significantly "
"faster but may miss small details. If [code]false[/code], screen-space "
"ambient occlusion will be rendered at full size."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການບົດບັງແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນທີ່ຂະໜາດເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ "
"ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງຂະຫຍາຍຂຶ້ນກ່ອນຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນສາກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໄວຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ ແຕ່ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດນ້ອຍໆຫາຍໄປ. "
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]false[/code], ການບົດບັງແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນຂະໜາດເຕັມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the quality of the screen-space ambient occlusion effect. Higher values "
"take more samples and so will result in better quality, at the cost of "
"performance. Setting to [code]Ultra[/code] will use the [member rendering/"
"environment/ssao/adaptive_target] setting."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄຸນນະພາບຂອງເອັບເຟັກການບົດບັງແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີຄຸນນະພາບດີຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍປະສິດທິພາບການເຮັດວຽກ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ [code]Ultra[/"
"code] ຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member rendering/environment/ssao/adaptive_target]."

msgid ""
"Quality target to use when [member rendering/environment/ssil/quality] is set "
"to [code]Ultra[/code]. A value of [code]0.0[/code] provides a quality and "
"speed similar to [code]Medium[/code] while a value of [code]1.0[/code] "
"provides much higher quality than any of the other settings at the cost of "
"performance. When using the adaptive target, the performance cost scales with "
"the complexity of the scene."
msgstr ""
"ເປົ້າໝາຍຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [member rendering/environment/ssil/quality] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]Ultra[/code]. ຄ່າ [code]0.0[/code] ຈະໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບ ແລະ ຄວາມໄວທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບ "
"[code]Medium[/code] ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ຈະໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ສູງກວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າອື່ນໆ "
"ໂດຍຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍປະສິດທິພາບການເຮັດວຽກ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ເປົ້າໝາຍແບບປັບຕົວ (adaptive target), "
"ຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍຂອງປະສິດທິພາບຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນຂອງສາກ."

msgid ""
"Number of blur passes to use when computing screen-space indirect lighting. A "
"higher number will result in a smoother look, but will be slower to compute "
"and will have less high-frequency detail."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຮອບການເບຼີ (blur passes) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອຄຳນວນການໃຫ້ແສງທາງອ້ອມໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ (SSIL). "
"ຈຳນວນທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຄືມີຄວາມສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຄຳນວນດົນກວ່າ ແລະ "
"ຈະມີລາຍລະອຽດຄວາມຖີ່ສູງໜ້ອຍລົງ."

msgid ""
"Distance at which the screen-space indirect lighting effect starts to fade "
"out. Use this to hide screen-space indirect lighting from far away."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ເອັບເຟັກການໃຫ້ແສງທາງອ້ອມໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ (SSIL) ເລີ່ມຈາງຫາຍໄປ. "
"ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອງການໃຫ້ແສງທາງອ້ອມໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍຈາກໄລຍະໄກ."

msgid ""
"Distance at which the screen-space indirect lighting is fully faded out. Use "
"this to hide screen-space indirect lighting from far away."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ການໃຫ້ແສງທາງອ້ອມໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ (SSIL) ຈາງຫາຍໄປຢ່າງສົມບູນ. "
"ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອງການໃຫ້ແສງທາງອ້ອມໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍຈາກໄລຍະໄກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], screen-space indirect lighting will be rendered at half "
"size and then upscaled before being added to the scene. This is significantly "
"faster but may miss small details and may result in some objects appearing to "
"glow at their edges."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການໃຫ້ແສງທາງອ້ອມໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນທີ່ຂະໜາດເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ "
"ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງຂະຫຍາຍຂຶ້ນກ່ອນຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນສາກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໄວຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ ແຕ່ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດນ້ອຍໆຫາຍໄປ "
"ແລະ ອາດຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ບາງວັດຖຸປະກົດວ່າມີແສງເຮືອງອອກມາຢູ່ທີ່ຂອບ."

msgid ""
"Sets the quality of the screen-space indirect lighting effect. Higher values "
"take more samples and so will result in better quality, at the cost of "
"performance. Setting to [code]Ultra[/code] will use the [member rendering/"
"environment/ssil/adaptive_target] setting."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄຸນນະພາບຂອງເອັບເຟັກການໃຫ້ແສງທາງອ້ອມໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີຄຸນນະພາບດີຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍປະສິດທິພາບການເຮັດວຽກ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ [code]Ultra[/"
"code] ຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member rendering/environment/ssil/adaptive_target]."

msgid ""
"Scales the depth over which the subsurface scattering effect is applied. A "
"high value may allow light to scatter into a part of the mesh or another mesh "
"that is close in screen space but far in depth. See also [member rendering/"
"environment/subsurface_scattering/subsurface_scattering_scale].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To set the "
"subsurface scattering depth scale at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.sub_surface_scattering_set_scale] instead."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຂະໜາດຄວາມເລິກທີ່ເອັບເຟັກການກະເຈິງແສງໃຕ້ຜິວ (subsurface scattering) ຖືກນຳໃຊ້. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງກະເຈິງເຂົ້າໄປໃນສ່ວນຂອງເມັຊ (mesh) ຫຼື "
"ເມັຊອື່ນທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັນໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍແຕ່ຢູ່ຫ່າງກັນໃນດ້ານຄວາມເລິກ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member rendering/"
"environment/subsurface_scattering/subsurface_scattering_scale].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂຄງການເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເພື່ອກຳນົດຂະໜາດຄວາມເລິກຂອງການກະເຈິງແສງໃຕ້ຜິວໃນຂະນະທີ່ຣັນໂປຣແກຣມ, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.sub_surface_scattering_set_scale] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the quality of the subsurface scattering effect. Higher values are "
"slower but look nicer. This affects the rendering of materials that have "
"[member BaseMaterial3D.subsurf_scatter_enabled] set to [code]true[/code], "
"along with [ShaderMaterial]s that set [code]SSS_STRENGTH[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To set the "
"subsurface scattering quality at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.sub_surface_scattering_set_quality] instead."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄຸນນະພາບຂອງເອັບເຟັກການກະເຈິງແສງໃຕ້ຜິວ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະເຮັດວຽກຊ້າລົງແຕ່ເບິ່ງສວຍງາມກວ່າ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການປະມວນຜົນພາບຂອງວັດສະດຸ (materials) ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.subsurf_scatter_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລວມເຖິງ "
"[ShaderMaterial] ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [code]SSS_STRENGTH[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂຄງການເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄຸນນະພາບການກະເຈິງແສງໃຕ້ຜິວໃນຂະນະທີ່ຣັນໂປຣແກຣມ, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.sub_surface_scattering_set_quality] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Scales the distance over which samples are taken for subsurface scattering "
"effect. Changing this does not impact performance, but higher values will "
"result in significant artifacts as the samples will become obviously spread "
"out. A lower value results in a smaller spread of scattered light. See also "
"[member rendering/environment/subsurface_scattering/"
"subsurface_scattering_depth_scale].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To set the "
"subsurface scattering scale at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.sub_surface_scattering_set_scale] instead."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຂະໜາດໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ (samples) ສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກການກະເຈິງແສງໃຕ້ຜິວ. "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ, ແຕ່ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຜິດພາດຂອງພາບ (artifacts) "
"ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ ເນື່ອງຈາກຕົວຢ່າງຈະແຜ່ກະຈາຍອອກຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີການແຜ່ກະຈາຍຂອງແສງທີ່ແຄບລົງ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member rendering/"
"environment/subsurface_scattering/subsurface_scattering_depth_scale].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂຄງການເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເພື່ອກຳນົດຂະໜາດການກະເຈິງແສງໃຕ້ຜິວໃນຂະນະທີ່ຣັນໂປຣແກຣມ, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.sub_surface_scattering_set_scale] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Enables filtering of the volumetric fog effect prior to integration. This "
"substantially blurs the fog which reduces fine details but also smooths out "
"harsh edges and aliasing artifacts. Disable when more detail is required."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການກອງ (filtering) ເອັບເຟັກໝອກແບບບໍລິມາດ (volumetric fog) ກ່ອນການຮວມຕົວ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໝອກເບຼີຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ເຊິ່ງຈະຫຼຸດລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ລະອຽດອ່ອນລົງ ແຕ່ກໍຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂອບທີ່ແຂງ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມຜິດພາດຈາກການເກີດຮອຍຢັກ (aliasing) ກ້ຽງຂຶ້ນ. ປິດໃຊ້ງານເມື່ອຕ້ອງການລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Number of slices to use along the depth of the froxel buffer for volumetric "
"fog. A lower number will be more efficient but may result in artifacts "
"appearing during camera movement. See also [member "
"Environment.volumetric_fog_length]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນແຜ່ນ (slices) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຕາມຄວາມເລິກຂອງ froxel buffer ສຳລັບໝອກແບບບໍລິມາດ. "
"ຈຳນວນທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະມີປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍກວ່າ "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຜິດພາດຂອງພາບໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງກ້ອງ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member "
"Environment.volumetric_fog_length]."

msgid ""
"Base size used to determine size of froxel buffer in the camera X-axis and Y-"
"axis. The final size is scaled by the aspect ratio of the screen, so actual "
"values may differ from what is set. Set a larger size for more detailed fog, "
"set a smaller size for better performance."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັດສິນຂະໜາດຂອງ froxel buffer ໃນແກນ X ແລະ ແກນ Y ຂອງກ້ອງ. "
"ຂະໜາດສຸດທ້າຍຈະຖືກປັບຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນ (aspect ratio) ຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄ່າຕົວຈິງອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້. ຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫ້ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໝອກທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫ້ເລັກລົງເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ດີຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the driver to be used by the renderer when using the Compatibility "
"renderer. Editing this property has no effect in the default configuration, "
"as first-party platforms each have platform-specific overrides. Use those "
"overrides to configure the driver for each platform.\n"
"This can be overridden using the [code]--rendering-driver <driver>[/code] "
"command line argument.\n"
"Supported values are:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code], OpenGL 3.3 on desktop platforms, OpenGL ES 3.0 on "
"mobile platforms, WebGL 2.0 on web.\n"
"- [code]opengl3_angle[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 using the ANGLE compatibility "
"layer, supported on macOS (over native OpenGL) and Windows (over Direct3D "
"11).\n"
"- [code]opengl3_es[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 on Linux/BSD.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The availability of these options depends on whether the engine "
"was compiled with support for them (determined by SCons options "
"[code]opengl3[/code] and [code]angle_libs[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The actual rendering driver may be automatically changed by the "
"engine as a result of a fallback, or a user-specified command line argument. "
"To get the actual rendering driver that is used at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.get_current_rendering_driver_name] instead of reading this "
"project setting's value."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໄດຣເວີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໂດຍສ່ວນປະມວນຜົນພາບ (renderer) ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວປະມວນຜົນແບບ Compatibility. "
"ການແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເນື່ອງຈາກແຕ່ລະແພລັດຟອມມີການກຳນົດຄ່າສະເພາະຕົວຢູ່ແລ້ວ. "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການກຳນົດຄ່າສະເພາະເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດຣເວີສຳລັບແຕ່ລະແພລັດຟອມ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າທັບໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ argument [code]--rendering-driver <driver>[/code] "
"ຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ command line.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ຮອງຮັບຄື:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code], OpenGL 3.3 ໃນຄອມພິວເຕີຕັ້ງໂຕະ, OpenGL ES 3.0 ໃນມືຖື, WebGL "
"2.0 ໃນເວັບ.\n"
"- [code]opengl3_angle[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 ໂດຍໃຊ້ ANGLE compatibility layer, "
"ຮອງຮັບໃນ macOS (ຜ່ານ native OpenGL) ແລະ Windows (ຜ່ານ Direct3D 11).\n"
"- [code]opengl3_es[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 ໃນ Linux/BSD.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການໃຊ້ງານຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບວ່າ engine ໄດ້ຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ມາໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບພວກມັນຫຼືບໍ່ "
"(ກຳນົດໂດຍຕົວເລືອກ SCons [code]opengl3[/code] ແລະ [code]angle_libs[/code]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໄດຣເວີການປະມວນຜົນພາບຕົວຈິງອາດຖືກປ່ຽນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍ engine ຫາກເກີດການ "
"fallback, ຫຼື ຈາກ argument ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດເອງ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຊື່ໄດຣເວີທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ແທ້ໆ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[method RenderingServer.get_current_rendering_driver_name] "
"ແທນການອ່ານຄ່າຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການນີ້."

msgid ""
"Android override for [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"Only one option is supported:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 from native drivers."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດຄ່າທັບສຳລັບ Android ໃນ [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"ຮອງຮັບພຽງຕົວເລືອກດຽວ:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 ຈາກໄດຣເວີ native."

msgid ""
"iOS override for [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"Only one option is supported:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 from native drivers."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດຄ່າທັບສຳລັບ iOS ໃນ [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"ຮອງຮັບພຽງຕົວເລືອກດຽວ:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 ຈາກໄດຣເວີ native."

msgid ""
"LinuxBSD override for [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"Two options are supported:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code] (default), OpenGL 3.3 from native drivers.\n"
"- [code]opengl3_es[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 from native drivers. If [member "
"rendering/gl_compatibility/fallback_to_gles] is enabled, this is used as a "
"fallback if OpenGL 3.3 is not supported."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດຄ່າທັບສຳລັບ LinuxBSD ໃນ [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"ຮອງຮັບສອງຕົວເລືອກ:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code] (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), OpenGL 3.3 ຈາກໄດຣເວີ native.\n"
"- [code]opengl3_es[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 ຈາກໄດຣເວີ native. ຫາກ [member "
"rendering/gl_compatibility/fallback_to_gles] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວສຳຮອງ "
"(fallback) ຫາກ OpenGL 3.3 ບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັບ."

msgid ""
"macOS override for [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"Two options are supported:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code] (default), OpenGL 3.3 from native drivers. If [member "
"rendering/gl_compatibility/fallback_to_native] is enabled, this is used as a "
"fallback if ANGLE is configured as the preferred driver but not supported.\n"
"- [code]opengl3_angle[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 using the ANGLE compatibility "
"layer over native OpenGL drivers. If [member rendering/gl_compatibility/"
"fallback_to_angle] is enabled, this is used as a fallback if OpenGL 3.3 is "
"not supported."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດຄ່າທັບສຳລັບ macOS ໃນ [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"ຮອງຮັບສອງຕົວເລືອກ:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code] (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), OpenGL 3.3 ຈາກໄດຣເວີ native. ຫາກ [member "
"rendering/gl_compatibility/fallback_to_native] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້, "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວສຳຮອງຫາກ ANGLE ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນໄດຣເວີຫຼັກແຕ່ບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"- [code]opengl3_angle[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 ໂດຍໃຊ້ ANGLE compatibility layer "
"ຜ່ານໄດຣເວີ native OpenGL. ຫາກ [member rendering/gl_compatibility/"
"fallback_to_angle] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວສຳຮອງຫາກ OpenGL 3.3 ບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັບ."

msgid ""
"Web override for [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"Only one option is supported:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code], WebGL 2.0. The underlying native API depends on the "
"target OS, browser, and browser configuration."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດຄ່າທັບສຳລັບ Web ໃນ [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"ຮອງຮັບພຽງຕົວເລືອກດຽວ:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code], WebGL 2.0. API ພື້ນຖານຈະຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບ OS ປາຍທາງ, ບຣາວເຊີ ແລະ "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າບຣາວເຊີ."

msgid ""
"Windows override for [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"Two options are supported:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code] (default), OpenGL 3.3 from native drivers. If [member "
"rendering/gl_compatibility/fallback_to_native] is enabled, this is used as a "
"fallback if ANGLE is configured as the preferred driver but not supported.\n"
"- [code]opengl3_angle[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 using the ANGLE compatibility "
"layer over native Direct3D 11 drivers. If [member rendering/gl_compatibility/"
"fallback_to_angle] is enabled, this is used as a fallback if OpenGL 3.3 is "
"not supported. By default, ANGLE is used as the default driver for some "
"devices listed in [member rendering/gl_compatibility/force_angle_on_devices]."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດຄ່າທັບສຳລັບ Windows ໃນ [member rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"ຮອງຮັບສອງຕົວເລືອກ:\n"
"- [code]opengl3[/code] (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), OpenGL 3.3 ຈາກໄດຣເວີ native. ຫາກ [member "
"rendering/gl_compatibility/fallback_to_native] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້, "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວສຳຮອງຫາກ ANGLE ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນໄດຣເວີຫຼັກແຕ່ບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"- [code]opengl3_angle[/code], OpenGL ES 3.0 ໂດຍໃຊ້ ANGLE compatibility layer "
"ຜ່ານໄດຣເວີ native Direct3D 11. ຫາກ [member rendering/gl_compatibility/"
"fallback_to_angle] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວສຳຮອງຫາກ OpenGL 3.3 ບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັບ. "
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ, ANGLE ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນໄດຣເວີຫຼັກສຳລັບບາງອຸປະກອນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ [member rendering/"
"gl_compatibility/force_angle_on_devices]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Compatibility renderer will fall back to ANGLE if "
"native OpenGL is not supported or the device is listed in [member rendering/"
"gl_compatibility/force_angle_on_devices].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented only on Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວປະມວນຜົນແບບ Compatibility ຈະປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ ANGLE ຫາກ "
"native OpenGL ບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັບ ຫຼື ອຸປະກອນນັ້ນຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ [member rendering/gl_compatibility/"
"force_angle_on_devices].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະໃນ Windows ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Compatibility renderer will fall back to OpenGLES "
"if desktop OpenGL is not supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented only on Linux/X11."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວປະມວນຜົນແບບ Compatibility ຈະປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ OpenGLES ຫາກ "
"desktop OpenGL ບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະໃນ Linux/X11 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Compatibility renderer will fall back to native "
"OpenGL if ANGLE is not supported, or ANGLE dynamic libraries aren't found.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented on macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວປະມວນຜົນແບບ Compatibility ຈະປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ native OpenGL "
"ຫາກ ANGLE ບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັບ ຫຼື ບໍ່ພົບໄຟລ໌ໄລບຣາຣີ (libraries) ຂອງ ANGLE.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນໃນ macOS ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"An [Array] of devices which should always use the ANGLE renderer.\n"
"Each entry is a [Dictionary] with the following keys: [code]vendor[/code] and "
"[code]name[/code]. [code]name[/code] can be set to [code]*[/code] to add all "
"devices with the specified [code]vendor[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented only on Windows."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣ [Array] ຂອງລາຍຊື່ອຸປະກອນທີ່ຄວນໃຊ້ ANGLE renderer ສະເໝີ.\n"
"ແຕ່ລະລາຍການແມ່ນ [Dictionary] ທີ່ມີຄີ (keys) ດັ່ງນີ້: [code]vendor[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]name[/code]. ສາມາດຕັ້ງ [code]name[/code] ເປັນ [code]*[/code] "
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມອຸປະກອນທັງໝົດຂອງ [code]vendor[/code] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະໃນ Windows ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of canvas items commands that can be drawn in a single "
"viewport update. If more render commands are issued they will be ignored. "
"Decreasing this limit may improve performance on bandwidth limited devices. "
"Increase this limit if you find that not all objects are being drawn in a "
"frame."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຄຳສັ່ງ canvas items ສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດແຕ້ມໄດ້ໃນການອັບເດດ viewport ຄັ້ງດຽວ. "
"ຫາກມີຄຳສັ່ງປະມວນຜົນພາບຫຼາຍກວ່ານີ້ ພວກມັນຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ. "
"ການຫຼຸດຂີດຈຳກັດນີ້ລົງອາດຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໃນອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີແບນວິດ (bandwidth) ຈຳກັດ. "
"ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຂີດຈຳກັດນີ້ຫາກເຈົ້າພົບວ່າວັດຖຸທັງໝົດບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກແຕ້ມອອກມາໃນເຟຣມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], disables the threaded optimization feature from the "
"NVIDIA drivers, which are known to cause stuttering in most OpenGL "
"applications.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting only works on Windows, as threaded optimization is "
"disabled by default on other platforms."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະປິດໃຊ້ງານຟີເຈີ threaded optimization ຂອງໄດຣເວີ NVIDIA "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ກັນວ່າເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການກະຕຸກ (stuttering) ໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ OpenGL ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Windows, ເນື່ອງຈາກ threaded optimization "
"ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], renders [VoxelGI] and SDFGI ([member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled]) buffers at halved resolution (e.g. 960×540 when "
"the viewport size is 1920×1080). This improves performance significantly when "
"VoxelGI or SDFGI is enabled, at the cost of artifacts that may be visible on "
"polygon edges. The loss in quality becomes less noticeable as the viewport "
"resolution increases. [LightmapGI] rendering is not affected by this "
"setting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To set half-"
"resolution GI at run-time, call [method "
"RenderingServer.gi_set_use_half_resolution] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະປະມວນຜົນ [VoxelGI] ແລະ SDFGI ([member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled]) ທີ່ຄວາມລະອຽດເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ 960x540 ເມື່ອຂະໜາດ viewport "
"ແມ່ນ 1920x1080). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ VoxelGI ຫຼື SDFGI, "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍຄວາມຜິດພາດຂອງພາບທີ່ອາດເຫັນໄດ້ຕາມຂອບຂອງໂພລີກອນ. "
"ການສູນເສຍຄຸນນະພາບຈະສັງເກດໄດ້ໜ້ອຍລົງເມື່ອຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງ viewport ສູງຂຶ້ນ. ການປະມວນຜົນ "
"[LightmapGI] ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂຄງການເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອກຳນົດ GI "
"ຄວາມລະອຽດເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງໃນຂະນະຣັນໂປຣແກຣມ, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.gi_set_use_half_resolution] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The number of frames to use for converging signed distance field global "
"illumination. Higher values lead to a less noisy result, at the cost of "
"taking a longer time to fully converge. This means the scene's global "
"illumination will be too dark for a longer period of time, especially when "
"the camera moves fast. The actual convergence speed depends on rendered "
"framerate. For example, with the default setting of 30 frames, rendering at "
"60 FPS will make SDFGI fully converge after 0.5 seconds. See also [member "
"rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/frames_to_update_lights] and [member "
"rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/probe_ray_count].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To control "
"SDFGI convergence speed at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.environment_set_sdfgi_frames_to_converge] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນເຟຣມທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການລວມຕົວ (converging) ຂອງ signed distance field global "
"illumination (SDFGI). ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຜົນລັບມີນອຍສ໌ (noise) ໜ້ອຍລົງ, "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍການໃຊ້ເວລາດົນກວ່າໃນການລວມຕົວໃຫ້ສົມບູນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແສງທົ່ວເຖິງຂອງສາກຈະມືດເກີນໄປເປັນເວລາດົນຂຶ້ນ, ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວ. "
"ຄວາມໄວໃນການລວມຕົວຕົວຈິງຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບອັດຕາເຟຣມ (framerate). ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກຕັ້ງໄວ້ທີ່ 30 ເຟຣມ, "
"ການປະມວນຜົນທີ່ 60 FPS ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ SDFGI ລວມຕົວສົມບູນຫຼັງຈາກ 0.5 ວິນາທີ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member "
"rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/frames_to_update_lights] ແລະ [member "
"rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/probe_ray_count].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂຄງການເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຄວາມໄວໃນການລວມຕົວຂອງ "
"SDFGI ໃນຂະນະຣັນໂປຣແກຣມ, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.environment_set_sdfgi_frames_to_converge] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The number of frames over which dynamic lights should be updated in signed "
"distance field global illumination. Higher values take more time to update "
"indirect lighting coming from dynamic lights, but result in better "
"performance when many dynamic lights are present. See also [member rendering/"
"global_illumination/sdfgi/frames_to_converge] and [member rendering/"
"global_illumination/sdfgi/probe_ray_count].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only affects [Light3D] nodes whose [member "
"Light3D.light_bake_mode] is [constant Light3D.BAKE_DYNAMIC] (which is the "
"default). Consider making non-moving lights use the [constant "
"Light3D.BAKE_STATIC] bake mode to improve performance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To control "
"SDFGI light update speed at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.environment_set_sdfgi_frames_to_update_light] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນເຟຣມທີ່ແສງແບບໄດນາມິກ (dynamic lights) ຄວນຈະຖືກອັບເດດໃນ SDFGI. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນກວ່າໃນການອັບເດດແສງທາງອ້ອມທີ່ມາຈາກແສງໄດນາມິກ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບດີຂຶ້ນເມື່ອມີແສງໄດນາມິກຫຼາຍດວງ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member rendering/"
"global_illumination/sdfgi/frames_to_converge] ແລະ [member rendering/"
"global_illumination/sdfgi/probe_ray_count].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບໂນດ [Light3D] ທີ່ຕັ້ງ [member "
"Light3D.light_bake_mode] ເປັນ [constant Light3D.BAKE_DYNAMIC] (ເຊິ່ງເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ). "
"ຄວນພິຈາລະນາໃຫ້ແສງທີ່ບໍ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂໝດ [constant Light3D.BAKE_STATIC] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂຄງການເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຄວາມໄວໃນການອັບເດດແສງ "
"SDFGI ໃນຂະນະຣັນໂປຣແກຣມ, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.environment_set_sdfgi_frames_to_update_light] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The number of rays to throw per frame when computing signed distance field "
"global illumination. Higher values lead to a less noisy result, at the cost "
"of performance. See also [member rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/"
"frames_to_converge] and [member rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/"
"frames_to_update_lights].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To control "
"SDFGI quality at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.environment_set_sdfgi_ray_count] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນລັງສີ (rays) ທີ່ຈະຍິງອອກໄປຕໍ່ເຟຣມເມື່ອຄຳນວນ SDFGI. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຜົນລັບມີນອຍສ໌ໜ້ອຍລົງ, "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍປະສິດທິພາບ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/"
"frames_to_converge] ແລະ [member rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/"
"frames_to_update_lights].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂຄງການເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຄຸນນະພາບ SDFGI "
"ໃນຂະນະຣັນໂປຣແກຣມ, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.environment_set_sdfgi_ray_count] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The VoxelGI quality to use. High quality leads to more precise lighting and "
"better reflections, but is slower to render. This setting does not affect the "
"baked data and doesn't require baking the [VoxelGI] again to apply.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To control "
"VoxelGI quality at runtime, call [method "
"RenderingServer.voxel_gi_set_quality] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບ VoxelGI ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ຄຸນນະພາບສູງຈະໃຫ້ແສງທີ່ແມ່ນຢຳ ແລະ ການສະທ້ອນທີ່ດີກວ່າ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະປະມວນຜົນພາບຊ້າລົງ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ອົບ (baked) ໄວ້ແລ້ວ ແລະ ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງອົບ "
"[VoxelGI] ໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຜົນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂຄງການເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຄຸນນະພາບ VoxelGI "
"ໃນຂະນະຣັນໂປຣແກຣມ, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method RenderingServer.voxel_gi_set_quality] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of rays that can be thrown per pass when baking lightmaps "
"with [LightmapGI]. Depending on the scene, adjusting this value may result in "
"higher GPU utilization when baking lightmaps, leading to faster bake times.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using a value that is too high for your system can cause crashes "
"due to the GPU being unresponsive for long periods of time, and the graphics "
"driver being reset by the OS."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນລັງສີສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດຍິງອອກໄປຕໍ່ຮອບເມື່ອອົບແຜນຜັງແສງ (lightmaps) ດ້ວຍ [LightmapGI]. "
"ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບສາກ, ການປັບຄ່ານີ້ອາດສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ GPU ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ເຕັມທີ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນຂະນະອົບ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ອົບໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ສູງເກີນໄປສຳລັບລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການແຮງ (crash) ຍ້ອນ GPU "
"ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງເປັນເວລາດົນ ແລະ ໄດຣເວີກຣາຟິກອາດຖືກຣີເຊັດໂດຍ OS."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of rays that can be thrown per pass when baking dynamic "
"object lighting in [LightmapProbe]s with [LightmapGI]. Depending on the "
"scene, adjusting this value may result in higher GPU utilization when baking "
"lightmaps, leading to faster bake times.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using a value that is too high for your system can cause crashes "
"due to the GPU being unresponsive for long periods of time, and the graphics "
"driver being reset by the OS."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນລັງສີສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດຍິງອອກໄປຕໍ່ຮອບເມື່ອອົບແສງຂອງວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກໃນ [LightmapProbe] ດ້ວຍ "
"[LightmapGI]. ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບສາກ, ການປັບຄ່ານີ້ອາດສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ GPU ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ເຕັມທີ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນຂະນະອົບ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ອົບໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ສູງເກີນໄປສຳລັບລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການແຮງ ຍ້ອນ GPU "
"ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງເປັນເວລາດົນ ແລະ ໄດຣເວີກຣາຟິກອາດຖືກຣີເຊັດໂດຍ OS."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of retry rays that can be thrown per pass when hitting a "
"transparent surface when baking lightmaps with [LightmapGI]. Depending on the "
"scene, reducing this value may lead to faster bake times.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using a value that is too high for your system can cause crashes "
"due to the GPU being unresponsive for long periods of time, and the graphics "
"driver being reset by the OS."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນລັງສີສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະຍິງຊ້ຳຕໍ່ຮອບເມື່ອຕຳກັບພື້ນຜິວໂປ່ງໃສໃນຂະນະອົບແຜນຜັງແສງດ້ວຍ [LightmapGI]. "
"ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບສາກ, ການຫຼຸດຄ່ານີ້ລົງອາດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ອົບໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ສູງເກີນໄປສຳລັບລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການແຮງ ຍ້ອນ GPU "
"ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງເປັນເວລາດົນ ແລະ ໄດຣເວີກຣາຟິກອາດຖືກຣີເຊັດໂດຍ OS."

msgid ""
"The region size to use when baking lightmaps with [LightmapGI]. The specified "
"value is rounded up to the nearest power of 2.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using a value that is too high for your system can cause crashes "
"due to the GPU being unresponsive for long periods of time, and the graphics "
"driver being reset by the OS."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດພື້ນທີ່ (region size) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອອົບແຜນຜັງແສງດ້ວຍ [LightmapGI]. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ລະບຸຈະຖືກປັດຂຶ້ນໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າກຳລັງສອງທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງທີ່ສຸດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ສູງເກີນໄປສຳລັບລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການແຮງ ຍ້ອນ GPU "
"ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງເປັນເວລາດົນ ແລະ ໄດຣເວີກຣາຟິກອາດຖືກຣີເຊັດໂດຍ OS."

msgid ""
"The number of rays to use for baking dynamic object lighting in "
"[LightmapProbe]s when [member LightmapGI.quality] is [constant "
"LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_HIGH]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນລັງສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການອົບແສງວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກໃນ [LightmapProbe] ເມື່ອ [member "
"LightmapGI.quality] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_HIGH]."

msgid ""
"The number of rays to use for baking lightmaps with [LightmapGI] when [member "
"LightmapGI.quality] is [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_HIGH]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນລັງສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການອົບແຜນຜັງແສງດ້ວຍ [LightmapGI] ເມື່ອ [member LightmapGI.quality] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_HIGH]."

msgid ""
"The number of rays to use for baking dynamic object lighting in "
"[LightmapProbe]s when [member LightmapGI.quality] is [constant "
"LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_LOW]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນລັງສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການອົບແສງວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກໃນ [LightmapProbe] ເມື່ອ [member "
"LightmapGI.quality] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_LOW]."

msgid ""
"The number of rays to use for baking lightmaps with [LightmapGI] when [member "
"LightmapGI.quality] is [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_LOW]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນລັງສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການອົບແຜນຜັງແສງດ້ວຍ [LightmapGI] ເມື່ອ [member LightmapGI.quality] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_LOW]."

msgid ""
"The number of rays to use for baking dynamic object lighting in "
"[LightmapProbe]s when [member LightmapGI.quality] is [constant "
"LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_MEDIUM]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນລັງສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການອົບແສງວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກໃນ [LightmapProbe] ເມື່ອ [member "
"LightmapGI.quality] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_MEDIUM]."

msgid ""
"The number of rays to use for baking lightmaps with [LightmapGI] when [member "
"LightmapGI.quality] is [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_MEDIUM]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນລັງສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການອົບແຜນຜັງແສງດ້ວຍ [LightmapGI] ເມື່ອ [member LightmapGI.quality] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_MEDIUM]."

msgid ""
"The number of rays to use for baking dynamic object lighting in "
"[LightmapProbe]s when [member LightmapGI.quality] is [constant "
"LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_ULTRA]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນລັງສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການອົບແສງວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກໃນ [LightmapProbe] ເມື່ອ [member "
"LightmapGI.quality] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_ULTRA]."

msgid ""
"The number of rays to use for baking lightmaps with [LightmapGI] when [member "
"LightmapGI.quality] is [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_ULTRA]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນລັງສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການອົບແຜນຜັງແສງດ້ວຍ [LightmapGI] ເມື່ອ [member LightmapGI.quality] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant LightmapGI.BAKE_QUALITY_ULTRA]."

msgid ""
"Denoiser tool used for denoising lightmaps.\n"
"Using [url=https://www.openimagedenoise.org/]OpenImageDenoise[/url] (OIDN) "
"requires configuring a path to an OIDN executable in the editor settings at "
"[member EditorSettings.filesystem/tools/oidn/oidn_denoise_path]. OIDN can be "
"downloaded from [url=https://www.openimagedenoise.org/"
"downloads.html]OpenImageDenoise's downloads page[/url].\n"
"OIDN will use GPU acceleration when available. Unlike JNLM which uses compute "
"shaders for acceleration, OIDN uses vendor-specific acceleration methods. For "
"GPU acceleration to be available, the following libraries must be installed "
"on the system depending on your GPU:\n"
"- NVIDIA GPUs: CUDA libraries\n"
"- AMD GPUs: HIP libraries\n"
"- Intel GPUs: SYCL libraries\n"
"If no GPU acceleration is configured on the system, multi-threaded CPU-based "
"denoising will be performed instead. This CPU-based denoising is "
"significantly slower than the JNLM denoiser in most cases."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງມືລົບນອຍສ໌ (denoiser) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບລົບນອຍສ໌ໃນແຜນຜັງແສງ.\n"
"ການໃຊ້ [url=https://www.openimagedenoise.org/]OpenImageDenoise[/url] (OIDN) "
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ OIDN ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ editor ທີ່ [member "
"EditorSettings.filesystem/tools/oidn/oidn_denoise_path]. ສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດ OIDN "
"ໄດ້ຈາກ [url=https://www.openimagedenoise.org/downloads.html]ໜ້າດາວໂຫຼດຂອງ "
"OpenImageDenoise[/url].\n"
"OIDN ຈະໃຊ້ການເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວດ້ວຍ GPU ເມື່ອສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້. ຕ່າງຈາກ JNLM ທີ່ໃຊ້ compute shaders "
"ໃນການເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວ, OIDN ຈະໃຊ້ວິທີການເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວສະເພາະຂອງແຕ່ລະຜູ້ຜະລິດ. "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວດ້ວຍ GPU ໄດ້, ຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງໄລບຣາຣີຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນລະບົບຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບ GPU ຂອງເຈົ້າ:\n"
"- NVIDIA GPUs: CUDA libraries\n"
"- AMD GPUs: HIP libraries\n"
"- Intel GPUs: SYCL libraries\n"
"ຫາກບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວດ້ວຍ GPU ໃນລະບົບ, ຈະມີການລົບນອຍສ໌ດ້ວຍ CPU ແບບ multi-"
"threaded ແທນ. ການລົບນອຍສ໌ດ້ວຍ CPU ນີ້ຈະຊ້າກວ່າ JNLM denoiser ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍໃນເກືອບທຸກກໍລະນີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], applies a bicubic filter during lightmap sampling. This "
"makes lightmaps look much smoother, at a moderate performance cost.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The bicubic filter exaggerates the 'bleeding' effect that occurs "
"when a lightmap's resolution is low enough."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ bicubic ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງແຜນຜັງແສງ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ແຜນຜັງແສງເບິ່ງສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ, ໂດຍມີຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບເລັກນ້ອຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວຕອງ bicubic ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເອັບເຟັກ 'bleeding' (ແສງຮົ່ວ) ເຫັນຊັດເຈນຂຶ້ນ "
"ເມື່ອຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງແຜນຜັງແສງຕ່ຳເກີນໄປ."

msgid ""
"The texel_size that is used to calculate the [member Mesh.lightmap_size_hint] "
"on [PrimitiveMesh] resources if [member PrimitiveMesh.add_uv2] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ texel_size ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄຳນວນ [member Mesh.lightmap_size_hint] ໃນຊັບພະຍາກອນ "
"[PrimitiveMesh] ຫາກ [member PrimitiveMesh.add_uv2] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"The framerate-independent update speed when representing dynamic object "
"lighting from [LightmapProbe]s. Higher values make dynamic object lighting "
"update faster. Higher values can prevent fast-moving objects from having "
"\"outdated\" indirect lighting displayed on them, at the cost of possible "
"flickering when an object moves from a bright area to a shaded area.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To adjust "
"the BVH build quality at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.lightmap_set_probe_capture_update_speed]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວໃນການອັບເດດທີ່ບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບອັດຕາເຟຣມ ເມື່ອສະແດງແສງວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກຈາກ [LightmapProbe]. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກອັບເດດໄວຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນສາມາດປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວສະແດງແສງທາງອ້ອມທີ່ \"ຫຼ້າສະໄໝ\", "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການກະພິບ (flickering) ເມື່ອວັດຖຸເຄື່ອນທີ່ຈາກບ່ອນແຈ້ງໄປຫາບ່ອນມືດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂຄງການເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເພື່ອປັບຄວາມໄວໃນການອັບເດດໃນຂະນະຣັນໂປຣແກຣມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.lightmap_set_probe_capture_update_speed]."

msgid ""
"Use 16 bits for the directional shadow depth map. Enabling this results in "
"shadows having less precision and may result in shadow acne, but can lead to "
"performance improvements on some devices."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ 16 ບິດ ສຳລັບແຜນຜັງຄວາມເລິກຂອງເງົາແບບມີທິດທາງ (directional shadow). "
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາມີຄວາມແມ່ນຢຳໜ້ອຍລົງ ແລະ ອາດເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງເງົາ (shadow acne), "
"ແຕ່ສາມາດຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໃນບາງອຸປະກອນ."

msgid ""
"The directional shadow's size in pixels. Higher values will result in sharper "
"shadows, at the cost of performance. The value is rounded up to the nearest "
"power of 2."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງເງົາແບບມີທິດທາງເປັນພິກເຊລ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍປະສິດທິພາບ. "
"ຄ່າຈະຖືກປັດຂຶ້ນໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າກຳລັງສອງທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"directional_shadow/size] on mobile devices, due to performance concerns or "
"driver support."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດຄ່າທັບສຳລັບອຸປະກອນສະເປັກຕ່ຳໃນ [member rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"directional_shadow/size] ສຳລັບມືຖື, ເນື່ອງຈາກເຫດຜົນດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ ຫຼື ການຮອງຮັບຂອງໄດຣເວີ."

msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"directional_shadow/soft_shadow_filter_quality] on mobile devices, due to "
"performance concerns or driver support."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດຄ່າທັບສຳລັບອຸປະກອນສະເປັກຕ່ຳໃນ [member rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"directional_shadow/soft_shadow_filter_quality] ສຳລັບມືຖື, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກເຫດຜົນດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ ຫຼື ການຮອງຮັບຂອງໄດຣເວີ."

msgid ""
"Use 16 bits for the omni/spot shadow depth map. Enabling this results in "
"shadows having less precision and may result in shadow acne, but can lead to "
"performance improvements on some devices."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ 16 ບິດ ສຳລັບແຜນຜັງຄວາມເລິກຂອງເງົາແບບຮອບທິດທາງ/ຈຸດ (omni/spot shadow). "
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາມີຄວາມແມ່ນຢຳໜ້ອຍລົງ ແລະ ອາດເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງເງົາ (shadow acne), "
"ແຕ່ສາມາດຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໃນບາງອຸປະກອນ."

msgid ""
"The subdivision amount of the first quadrant on the shadow atlas. See the "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-"
"atlas]documentation[/url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍ (subdivision) ຂອງສ່ວນທີໜຶ່ງ (first quadrant) ໃນແຜນຜັງເງົາ (shadow "
"atlas). ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-"
"atlas]ເອກະສານປະກອບ[/url] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The subdivision amount of the second quadrant on the shadow atlas. See the "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-"
"atlas]documentation[/url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍຂອງສ່ວນທີສອງໃນແຜນຜັງເງົາ. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/"
"lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-atlas]ເອກະສານປະກອບ[/url] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The subdivision amount of the third quadrant on the shadow atlas. See the "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-"
"atlas]documentation[/url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍຂອງສ່ວນທີສາມໃນແຜນຜັງເງົາ. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/"
"lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-atlas]ເອກະສານປະກອບ[/url] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The subdivision amount of the fourth quadrant on the shadow atlas. See the "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-"
"atlas]documentation[/url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍຂອງສ່ວນທີສີ່ໃນແຜນຜັງເງົາ. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/"
"lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-atlas]ເອກະສານປະກອບ[/url] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The size of the shadow atlas used for [OmniLight3D] and [SpotLight3D] nodes. "
"See the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-"
"atlas]documentation[/url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງແຜນຜັງເງົາທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂນດ [OmniLight3D] ແລະ [SpotLight3D]. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.html#shadow-"
"atlas]ເອກະສານປະກອບ[/url] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/lights_and_shadows/positional_shadow/"
"atlas_size] on mobile devices, due to performance concerns or driver support."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດຄ່າທັບສຳລັບອຸປະກອນສະເປັກຕ່ຳໃນ [member rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"positional_shadow/atlas_size] ສຳລັບມືຖື, ເນື່ອງຈາກເຫດຜົນດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ ຫຼື "
"ການຮອງຮັບຂອງໄດຣເວີ."

msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/lights_and_shadows/positional_shadow/"
"soft_shadow_filter_quality] on mobile devices, due to performance concerns or "
"driver support."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດຄ່າທັບສຳລັບອຸປະກອນສະເປັກຕ່ຳໃນ [member rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"positional_shadow/soft_shadow_filter_quality] ສຳລັບມືຖື, ເນື່ອງຈາກເຫດຜົນດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ "
"ຫຼື ການຮອງຮັບຂອງໄດຣເວີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], items that cannot cast shadows into the view frustum "
"will not be rendered into shadow maps.\n"
"This can increase performance."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລາຍການທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງເງົາເຂົ້າໄປໃນພື້ນທີ່ການເບິ່ງເຫັນ (view "
"frustum) ຈະບໍ່ຖືກປະມວນຜົນລົງໃນແຜນຜັງເງົາ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Enables the use of physically based units for light sources. Physically based "
"units tend to be much larger than the arbitrary units used by Godot, but they "
"can be used to match lighting within Godot to real-world lighting. Due to the "
"large dynamic range of lighting conditions present in nature, Godot bakes "
"exposure into the various lighting quantities before rendering. Most light "
"sources bake exposure automatically at run time based on the active "
"[CameraAttributes] resource, but [LightmapGI] and [VoxelGI] require a "
"[CameraAttributes] resource to be set at bake time to reduce the dynamic "
"range. At run time, Godot will automatically reconcile the baked exposure "
"with the active exposure to ensure lighting remains consistent."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຫົວໜ່ວຍຕາມຫຼັກຟີຊິກສຳລັບແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ. "
"ຫົວໜ່ວຍຕາມຫຼັກຟີຊິກມັກຈະມີຄ່າໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຫົວໜ່ວຍທົ່ວໄປທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ Godot, ແຕ່ພວກມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບແສງໃນ "
"Godot ໃຫ້ກົງກັບແສງໃນໂລກຕົວຈິງ. ເນື່ອງຈາກຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກຂອງແສງໃນທຳມະຊາດມີຄວາມກວ້າງຫຼາຍ, Godot "
"ຈຶ່ງອົບຄ່າການຮັບແສງ (exposure) ລົງໃນປະລິມານແສງຕ່າງໆກ່ອນການປະມວນຜົນ. "
"ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະອົບຄ່າການຮັບແສງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນຂະນະຣັນໂປຣແກຣມຕາມຊັບພະຍາກອນ "
"[CameraAttributes] ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່, ແຕ່ [LightmapGI] ແລະ [VoxelGI] ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"[CameraAttributes] ໃນຕອນອົບເພື່ອຫຼຸດຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກ. ໃນຂະນະຣັນໂປຣແກຣມ, Godot "
"ຈະປັບຄ່າການຮັບແສງທີ່ອົບໄວ້ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບຄ່າການຮັບແສງທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແສງມີຄວາມຕໍ່ເນື່ອງກັນ."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of clustered elements ([OmniLight3D] + [SpotLight3D] + "
"[Decal] + [ReflectionProbe]) that can be rendered at once in the camera view. "
"If there are more clustered elements present in the camera view, some of them "
"will not be rendered (leading to pop-in during camera movement). Enabling "
"distance fade on lights and decals ([member Light3D.distance_fade_enabled], "
"[member Decal.distance_fade_enabled]) can help avoid reaching this limit.\n"
"Decreasing this value may improve GPU performance on certain setups, even if "
"the maximum number of clustered elements is never reached in the project.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is only effective when using the Forward+ rendering "
"method, not Mobile and Compatibility."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງ clustered elements ([OmniLight3D] + [SpotLight3D] + [Decal] + "
"[ReflectionProbe]) ທີ່ສາມາດປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ພ້ອມກັນໃນມຸມມອງກ້ອງ. ຫາກມີຫຼາຍກວ່າຈຳນວນນີ້, "
"ບາງອັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກແຕ້ມອອກມາ (ເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນວັດຖຸປະກົດຂຶ້ນມາແບບກະທັນຫັນໃນລະຫວ່າງກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່). ການເປີດໃຊ້ "
"distance fade ໃນແສງ ແລະ ດີຄໍ (decals) ([member Light3D.distance_fade_enabled], "
"[member Decal.distance_fade_enabled]) ສາມາດຊ່ວຍຫຼີກລ່ຽງການເຖິງຂີດຈຳກັດນີ້ໄດ້.\n"
"ການຫຼຸດຄ່ານີ້ລົງອາດຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ GPU ໃນບາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈຳນວນ clustered "
"elements ຈະບໍ່ເຄີຍເຖິງຂີດຈຳກັດກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການປະມວນຜົນພາບແບບ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນ Mobile ແລະ Compatibility."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of uniforms that can be used by the global shader uniform "
"buffer. Each item takes up one slot. In other words, a single uniform float "
"and a uniform vec4 will take the same amount of space in the buffer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Compatibility renderer, most mobile devices (and "
"all web exports) will be limited to a maximum size of 1024 due to hardware "
"constraints."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງ uniforms ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍ global shader uniform buffer. "
"ແຕ່ລະລາຍການຈະໃຊ້ໜຶ່ງຊ່ອງ (slot). ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຄື uniform float ຕົວດຽວ ແລະ uniform vec4 "
"ຈະໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ໃນບັບເຟີ (buffer) ເທົ່າກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Compatibility renderer, ອຸປະກອນມືຖືສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ (ແລະ "
"ການສົ່ງອອກເວັບທັງໝົດ) ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໄວ້ທີ່ 1024 ຍ້ອນຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງຮາດແວ."

msgid ""
"Max number of omnilights and spotlights renderable per object. At the default "
"value of 8, this means that each surface can be affected by up to 8 "
"omnilights and 8 spotlights. This is further limited by hardware support and "
"[member rendering/limits/opengl/max_renderable_lights]. Setting this low will "
"slightly reduce memory usage, may decrease shader compile times, and may "
"result in faster rendering on low-end, mobile, or web devices.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is only effective when using the Compatibility "
"rendering method, not Forward+ and Mobile."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງ omnilights ແລະ spotlights ທີ່ສາມາດປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ຕໍ່ວັດຖຸ. ທີ່ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 8 "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແຕ່ລະພື້ນຜິວສາມາດໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ omnilight ສູງສຸດ 8 ດວງ ແລະ spotlight 8 ດວງ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍການຮອງຮັບຂອງຮາດແວ ແລະ [member rendering/limits/opengl/"
"max_renderable_lights]. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ຕ່ຳລົງຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳເລັກນ້ອຍ, "
"ອາດຫຼຸດເວລາໃນການຄອມໄພລ໌ shader ແລະ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການປະມວນຜົນພາບໄວຂຶ້ນໃນອຸປະກອນສະເປັກຕ່ຳ, ມືຖື "
"ຫຼື ເວັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ Compatibility rendering ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Max number of elements renderable in a frame. If more elements than this are "
"visible per frame, they will not be drawn. Keep in mind elements refer to "
"mesh surfaces and not meshes themselves. Setting this low will slightly "
"reduce memory usage and may decrease shader compile times, particularly on "
"web. For most uses, the default value is suitable, but consider lowering as "
"much as possible on web export.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is only effective when using the Compatibility "
"rendering method, not Forward+ and Mobile."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງອົງປະກອບ (elements) ທີ່ສາມາດປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ໃນໜຶ່ງເຟຣມ. "
"ຫາກມີອົງປະກອບທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ຫຼາຍກວ່ານີ້, ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກແຕ້ມອອກມາ. "
"ໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າອົງປະກອບໝາຍເຖິງພື້ນຜິວຂອງເມັຊ (mesh surfaces) ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕົວເມັຊເອງ. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່ຳລົງຈະຫຼຸດການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ອາດຫຼຸດເວລາຄອມໄພລ໌ shader, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນເວັບ. "
"ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານທົ່ວໄປ ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນເໝາະສົມແລ້ວ, "
"ແຕ່ຄວນພິຈາລະນາຫຼຸດໃຫ້ຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກເປັນເວັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ Compatibility rendering ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Max number of positional lights renderable in a frame. If more lights than "
"this number are used, they will be ignored. Setting this low will slightly "
"reduce memory usage and may decrease shader compile times, particularly on "
"web. For most uses, the default value is suitable, but consider lowering as "
"much as possible on web export.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is only effective when using the Compatibility "
"rendering method, not Forward+ and Mobile."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງແສງແບບລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງ (positional lights) ທີ່ສາມາດປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ໃນໜຶ່ງເຟຣມ. "
"ຫາກໃຊ້ແສງຫຼາຍກວ່າຈຳນວນນີ້, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່ຳລົງຈະຫຼຸດການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ "
"ອາດຫຼຸດເວລາຄອມໄພລ໌ shader. ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານທົ່ວໄປ ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນເໝາະສົມແລ້ວ, "
"ແຕ່ຄວນພິຈາລະນາຫຼຸດໃຫ້ຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກເປັນເວັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ Compatibility rendering ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The minimum number of instances that must be present in a scene to enable "
"culling computations on multiple threads. If a scene has fewer instances than "
"this number, culling is done on a single thread."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instances) ຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ຕ້ອງມີໃນສາກເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຄຳນວນການຄັດອອກ (culling) "
"ແບບຫຼາຍເທຣດ (multiple threads). ຫາກສາກມີອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໜ້ອຍກວ່າຈຳນວນນີ້, "
"ການຄັດອອກຈະເຮັດໃນເທຣດດຽວ."

msgid ""
"Maximum time (in seconds) before the [code]TIME[/code] shader built-in "
"variable rolls over. The [code]TIME[/code] variable increments by "
"[code]delta[/code] each frame, and when it exceeds this value, it rolls over "
"to [code]0.0[/code]. Since large floating-point values are less precise than "
"small floating-point values, this should be set as low as possible to "
"maximize the precision of the [code]TIME[/code] built-in variable in shaders. "
"This is especially important on mobile platforms where precision in shaders "
"is significantly reduced. However, if this is set too low, shader animations "
"may appear to restart from the beginning while the project is running.\n"
"On desktop platforms, values below [code]4096[/code] are recommended, ideally "
"below [code]2048[/code]. On mobile platforms, values below [code]64[/code] "
"are recommended, ideally below [code]32[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເວລາສູງສຸດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ) ກ່ອນທີ່ຕົວປ່ຽນ [code]TIME[/code] ໃນ shader ຈະຣີເຊັດກັບໄປເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່. "
"ຕົວປ່ຽນ [code]TIME[/code] ຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຕາມ [code]delta[/code] ໃນແຕ່ລະເຟຣມ, ແລະ "
"ເມື່ອມັນເກີນຄ່ານີ້ ມັນຈະກັບໄປທີ່ [code]0.0[/code]. ເນື່ອງຈາກຄ່າເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ (floating-point) "
"ທີ່ມີຄ່າໃຫຍ່ຈະມີຄວາມແມ່ນຢຳໜ້ອຍກວ່າຄ່າທີ່ນ້ອຍ, ຈຶ່ງຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕົວປ່ຽນ [code]TIME[/"
"code] ມີຄວາມແມ່ນຢຳສູງສຸດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສຳຄັນຫຼາຍໃນແພລັດຟອມມືຖືທີ່ຄວາມແມ່ນຢຳໃນ shader "
"ຖືກຫຼຸດລົງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຫາກຕັ້ງຕ່ຳເກີນໄປ, ແອນິເມຊັນຂອງ shader "
"ອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າເລີ່ມໃໝ່ແຕ່ຕົ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂຄງການກຳລັງຣັນຢູ່.\n"
"ໃນຄອມພິວເຕີ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]4096[/code], ຫຼື ດີທີ່ສຸດຄືຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]2048[/"
"code]. ໃນມືຖື, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]64[/code], ຫຼື ດີທີ່ສຸດຄືຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]32[/code]."

msgid ""
"The automatic LOD bias to use for meshes rendered within the "
"[ReflectionProbe]. Higher values will use less detailed versions of meshes "
"that have LOD variations generated. If set to [code]0.0[/code], automatic LOD "
"is disabled. Increase [member rendering/mesh_lod/lod_change/threshold_pixels] "
"to improve performance at the cost of geometry detail.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Depending on the mesh's attributes (vertex colors, blend "
"shapes, ...), a mesh may have fewer levels of LOD generated to avoid visible "
"distortion of the mesh once it is affected by vertex colors or blend shapes. "
"Meshes with a very low vertex count will also not have any LODs generated, "
"which means this setting will not affect them at all. In general, this "
"setting makes the largest impact on static meshes with a high vertex count.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member rendering/mesh_lod/lod_change/threshold_pixels] does not "
"affect [GeometryInstance3D] visibility ranges (also known as \"manual\" LOD "
"or hierarchical LOD).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To adjust "
"the automatic LOD threshold at runtime, set [member "
"Viewport.mesh_lod_threshold] on the root [Viewport]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າບ່ຽງເບນ (bias) ຂອງ LOD ອັດຕະໂນມັດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບເມັຊທີ່ປະມວນຜົນພາຍໃນ [ReflectionProbe]. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະໃຊ້ເມັຊລຸ້ນທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດໜ້ອຍກວ່າ. ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0.0[/code], LOD "
"ອັດຕະໂນມັດຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ. ການເພີ່ມ [member rendering/mesh_lod/lod_change/"
"threshold_pixels] ຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍລາຍລະອຽດຂອງເລຂາຄະນິດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງເມັຊ (vertex colors, blend shapes, ...), "
"ເມັຊອາດມີລະດັບ LOD ໜ້ອຍລົງເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການບິດບ້ຽວທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດ. ເມັຊທີ່ມີຈຳນວນ vertex "
"ຕ່ຳຫຼາຍກໍຈະບໍ່ມີການສ້າງ LOD, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບພວກມັນ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະມີຜົນຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດກັບເມັຊທີ່ຢູ່ກັບບ່ອນ (static meshes) ທີ່ມີຈຳນວນ vertex ສູງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member rendering/mesh_lod/lod_change/threshold_pixels] "
"ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຊ່ວງການເບິ່ງເຫັນ (visibility ranges) ຂອງ [GeometryInstance3D].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂຄງການເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອປັບຄ່າ LOD "
"ອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນຂະນະຣັນໂປຣແກຣມ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member Viewport.mesh_lod_threshold] ໃນ root "
"[Viewport]."

msgid ""
"The [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bounding_volume_hierarchy]Bounding "
"Volume Hierarchy[/url] quality to use when rendering the occlusion culling "
"buffer. Higher values will result in more accurate occlusion culling, at the "
"cost of higher CPU usage. See also [member rendering/occlusion_culling/"
"occlusion_rays_per_thread].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To adjust "
"the BVH build quality at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_occlusion_culling_build_quality]."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບຂອງ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Bounding_volume_hierarchy]Bounding Volume Hierarchy[/url] (BVH) "
"ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອປະມວນຜົນ occlusion culling buffer. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ການຄັດອອກສ່ວນທີ່ຖືກບັງ "
"(occlusion culling) ແມ່ນຢຳຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍການໃຊ້ CPU ທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member "
"rendering/occlusion_culling/occlusion_rays_per_thread].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂຄງການເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອປັບຄຸນນະພາບການສ້າງ BVH "
"ໃນຂະນະຣັນໂປຣແກຣມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_occlusion_culling_build_quality]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the projection used for rendering the occlusion buffer "
"will be jittered. This can help prevent objects being incorrectly culled when "
"visible through small gaps."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການສາຍພາບ (projection) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການປະມວນຜົນ occlusion "
"buffer ຈະມີການສັ່ນ (jittered). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຖືກຄັດອອກຜິດພາດເມື່ອເບິ່ງເຫັນຜ່ານຊ່ອງຫວ່າງນ້ອຍໆ."

msgid ""
"The number of occlusion rays traced per CPU thread. Higher values will result "
"in more accurate occlusion culling, at the cost of higher CPU usage. The "
"occlusion culling buffer's pixel count is roughly equal to "
"[code]occlusion_rays_per_thread * number_of_logical_cpu_cores[/code], so it "
"will depend on the system's CPU. Therefore, CPUs with fewer cores will use a "
"lower resolution to attempt keeping performance costs even across devices. "
"See also [member rendering/occlusion_culling/bvh_build_quality].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To adjust "
"the number of occlusion rays traced per thread at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_occlusion_rays_per_thread]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນລັງສີການບົດບັງ (occlusion rays) ທີ່ຖືກໄລ່ລຽງຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງເທຣດຂອງ CPU. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ການຄັດອອກສ່ວນທີ່ຖືກບັງແມ່ນຢຳຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍການໃຊ້ CPU ທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຈຳນວນພິກເຊລຂອງ occlusion culling buffer ຈະເທົ່າກັບ "
"[code]occlusion_rays_per_thread * ຈຳນວນຄໍຂອງ CPU[/code], ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບ CPU "
"ຂອງລະບົບ. ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, CPU "
"ທີ່ມີຄໍໜ້ອຍກວ່າຈະໃຊ້ຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າເພື່ອພະຍາຍາມຮັກສາປະສິດທິພາບໃຫ້ໃກ້ຄຽງກັນໃນແຕ່ລະອຸປະກອນ. "
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member rendering/occlusion_culling/bvh_build_quality].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂຄງການເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເພື່ອປັບຈຳນວນລັງສີຕໍ່ເທຣດໃນຂະນະຣັນໂປຣແກຣມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.viewport_set_occlusion_rays_per_thread]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [OccluderInstance3D] nodes will be usable for occlusion "
"culling in 3D in the root viewport. In custom viewports, [member "
"Viewport.use_occlusion_culling] must be set to [code]true[/code] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Enabling occlusion culling has a cost on the CPU. Only enable "
"occlusion culling if you actually plan to use it. Large open scenes with few "
"or no objects blocking the view will generally not benefit much from "
"occlusion culling. Large open scenes generally benefit more from mesh LOD and "
"visibility ranges ([member GeometryInstance3D.visibility_range_begin] and "
"[member GeometryInstance3D.visibility_range_end]) compared to occlusion "
"culling.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to memory constraints, occlusion culling is not supported by "
"default in Web export templates. It can be enabled by compiling custom Web "
"export templates with [code]module_raycast_enabled=yes[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດ [OccluderInstance3D] "
"ຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ສຳລັບການຄັດອອກສ່ວນທີ່ຖືກບັງໃນແບບ 3D ໃນ root viewport. ໃນ viewport "
"ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເອງ, ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງ [member Viewport.use_occlusion_culling] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເປີດໃຊ້ occlusion culling ມີຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍຕໍ່ CPU. "
"ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອມີແຜນຈະໃຊ້ມັນແທ້ໆ. ສາກທີ່ກວ້າງຂວາງ ແລະ ມີວັດຖຸບັງມຸມມອງໜ້ອຍ "
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍຈາກ occlusion culling. ສາກທີ່ກວ້າງຂວາງມັກຈະໄດ້ຮັບປະໂຫຍດຈາກ "
"mesh LOD ແລະ visibility ranges ຫຼາຍກວ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດ້ານໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ, occlusion culling "
"ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັບໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນ Web export. ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄອມໄພລ໌ export templates "
"ສຳລັບເວັບເອງດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [code]module_raycast_enabled=yes[/code]."

msgid ""
"Number of cubemaps to store in the reflection atlas. The number of "
"[ReflectionProbe]s in a scene will be limited by this amount. A higher number "
"requires more VRAM."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນ cubemaps ທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້ໃນແຜນຜັງການສະທ້ອນ (reflection atlas). ຈຳນວນຂອງ "
"[ReflectionProbe] ໃນສາກຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍຈຳນວນນີ້. ຈຳນວນທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະໃຊ້ VRAM ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Size of cubemap faces for [ReflectionProbe]s. A higher number requires more "
"VRAM and may make reflection probe updating slower."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງ Cubemap faces ສຳລັບ [ReflectionProbe]. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະໃຊ້ VRAM ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການອັບເດດ reflection probe ຊ້າລົງ."

msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/reflections/reflection_atlas/"
"reflection_size] on mobile devices, due to performance concerns or driver "
"support."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບສຳລັບອຸປະກອນລະດັບຕ່ຳສຳລັບ [member rendering/reflections/reflection_atlas/"
"reflection_size] ເທິງອຸປະກອນມືຖື, ເນື່ອງຈາກບັນຫາດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ ຫຼື ການຮອງຮັບຂອງໄດຣເວີ."

msgid ""
"Use a higher quality variant of the fast filtering algorithm. Significantly "
"slower than using default quality, but results in smoother reflections. "
"Should only be used when the scene is especially detailed."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບຄຸນນະພາບສູງຂອງສູດຄິດໄລ່ການກັ່ນຕອງແບບໄວ. ມັນຈະຊ້າກວ່າການໃຊ້ຄຸນນະພາບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະໃຫ້ຜົນຂອງເງົາສະທ້ອນທີ່ລຽບນຽນຂຶ້ນ. ຄວນໃຊ້ໃນຕອນທີ່ສາກມີລາຍລະອຽດສູງເປັນພິເສດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the number of samples to take when using importance sampling for [Sky]s "
"and [ReflectionProbe]s. A higher value will result in smoother, higher "
"quality reflections, but increases time to calculate radiance maps. In "
"general, fewer samples are needed for simpler, low dynamic range environments "
"while more samples are needed for HDR environments and environments with a "
"high level of detail."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຈຳນວນຕົວຢ່າງ (samples) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນຕອນໃຊ້ການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງແບບເນັ້ນຄວາມສຳຄັນ (importance "
"sampling) ສຳລັບ [Sky] ແລະ [ReflectionProbe]. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາສະທ້ອນລຽບນຽນ ແລະ "
"ມີຄຸນນະພາບສູງຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ຈະເພີ່ມເວລາໃນການຄິດໄລ່ radiance maps. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, "
"ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ລຽບງ່າຍ ແລະ ມີຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກຕ່ຳຈະໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງໜ້ອຍລົງ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບ HDR "
"ແລະ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດສູງຈະຕ້ອງການຕົວຢ່າງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"ggx_samples] on mobile devices, due to performance concerns or driver support."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບສຳລັບອຸປະກອນລະດັບຕ່ຳສຳລັບ [member rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"ggx_samples] ເທິງອຸປະກອນມືຖື, ເນື່ອງຈາກບັນຫາດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ ຫຼື ການຮອງຮັບຂອງໄດຣເວີ."

msgid ""
"Limits the number of layers to use in radiance maps when using importance "
"sampling. A lower number will be slightly faster and take up less VRAM."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນຊັ້ນ (layers) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ radiance maps ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງແບບເນັ້ນຄວາມສຳຄັນ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄວຂຶ້ນເລັກນ້ອຍ ແລະ ໃຊ້ VRAM ໜ້ອຍລົງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses texture arrays instead of mipmaps for reflection "
"probes and panorama backgrounds (sky). This reduces jitter noise and "
"upscaling artifacts on reflections, but is significantly slower to compute "
"and uses [member rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/roughness_layers] "
"times more memory.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Texture array reflections are always disabled on macOS on Intel "
"GPUs due to driver bugs."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະນຳໃຊ້ ອາເຣພື້ນຜິວ ແທນ ມິບແມັບ ສຳລັບຕົວສຳຫຼວດການສະທ້ອນ ແລະ "
"ພື້ນຫຼັງພາໂນຣາມາ (ທ້ອງຟ້າ). ນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນສັນຍານລົບກວນແບບສັ່ນ ແລະ "
"ຮ່ອງຮອຍການຂະຫຍາຍພາບເທິງການສະທ້ອນ, ແຕ່ຈະປະມວນຜົນຊ້າກວ່າຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ ແລະ ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ "
"[member rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/roughness_layers] ເທົ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການສະທ້ອນແບບອາເຣພື້ນຜິວ ຈະຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານສະເໝີ ເທິງ macOS ທີ່ໃຊ້ GPU ຂອງ "
"Intel ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງໄດຣເວີ."

msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"texture_array_reflections] on mobile devices, due to performance concerns or "
"driver support."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບສຳລັບອຸປະກອນລະດັບຕ່ຳສຳລັບ [member rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"texture_array_reflections] ເທິງອຸປະກອນມືຖື, ເນື່ອງຈາກບັນຫາດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ ຫຼື "
"ການຮອງຮັບຂອງໄດຣເວີ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], reduces reflections based on ambient light."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຫຼຸດເງົາສະທ້ອນລົງຕາມແສງສະຫວ່າງໂດຍຮອບ (ambient light)."

msgid ""
"Sets the renderer that will be used by the project. Options are:\n"
"[b]forward_plus[/b] (Forward+): High-end renderer designed for desktop "
"devices. Has a higher base overhead, but scales well with complex scenes. Not "
"suitable for older devices or mobile.\n"
"[b]mobile[/b] (Mobile): Modern renderer designed for mobile devices. Has a "
"lower base overhead than Forward+, but does not scale as well to large scenes "
"with many elements.\n"
"[b]gl_compatibility[/b] (Compatibility): Low-end renderer designed for older "
"devices. Based on the limitations of the OpenGL 3.3 / OpenGL ES 3.0 / WebGL 2 "
"APIs. Lighting calculations are performed on nonlinear sRGB-encoded color "
"data, which produces inaccurate results that may look acceptable for some "
"games.\n"
"This can be overridden using the [code]--rendering-method <method>[/code] "
"command line argument.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The actual rendering method may be automatically changed by the "
"engine as a result of a fallback, or a user-specified command line argument. "
"To get the actual rendering method that is used at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.get_current_rendering_method] instead of reading this project "
"setting's value."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຕົວປະມວນຜົນພາບ (renderer) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ. ຕົວເລືອກຄື:\n"
"[b]forward_plus[/b] (Forward+): ຕົວປະມວນຜົນພາບລະດັບສູງທີ່ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບອຸປະກອນເດັສທັອບ. "
"ມີຄ່າ overhead ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນສູງ, ແຕ່ຮອງຮັບສາກທີ່ມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນໄດ້ດີ. ບໍ່ເໝາະສຳລັບອຸປະກອນເກົ່າ ຫຼື ມືຖື.\n"
"[b]mobile[/b] (Mobile): ຕົວປະມວນຜົນພາບທີ່ທັນສະໄໝອອກແບບມາສຳລັບອຸປະກອນມືຖື. ມີຄ່າ overhead "
"ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນຕ່ຳກວ່າ Forward+, ແຕ່ການຂະຫຍາຍຕົວສຳລັບສາກໃຫຍ່ທີ່ມີອົງປະກອບຫຼາຍແມ່ນເຮັດໄດ້ບໍ່ດີເທົ່າ.\n"
"[b]gl_compatibility[/b] (Compatibility): "
"ຕົວປະມວນຜົນພາບລະດັບຕ່ຳອອກແບບມາສຳລັບອຸປະກອນເກົ່າ. ອີງຕາມຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງ OpenGL 3.3 / OpenGL ES "
"3.0 / WebGL 2 API. ການຄິດໄລ່ແສງສະຫວ່າງແມ່ນເຮັດບົນຂໍ້ມູນສີທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ sRGB ແບບບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່ "
"(nonlinear), ເຊິ່ງອາດໃຫ້ຜົນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຊັດເຈນ ແຕ່ອາດຈະເບິ່ງແລ້ວຮັບໄດ້ໃນບາງເກມ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງທັບໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ argument [code]--rendering-method <method>[/code] ຜ່ານ "
"command line.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] "
"ວິທີການປະມວນຜົນພາບຕົວຈິງອາດຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກເອັນຈິນເພື່ອເປັນການສຳຮອງ (fallback), "
"ຫຼື ຈາກ argument ຜ່ານ command line. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ວິທີການປະມວນຜົນພາບຕົວຈິງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຂະນະເຮັດວຽກ, "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method RenderingServer.get_current_rendering_method] "
"ແທນການອ່ານຄ່າຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກນີ້."

msgid ""
"Override for [member rendering/renderer/rendering_method] on mobile devices."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບສຳລັບ [member rendering/renderer/rendering_method] ເທິງອຸປະກອນມືຖື."

msgid "Override for [member rendering/renderer/rendering_method] on web."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບສຳລັບ [member rendering/renderer/rendering_method] ເທິງເວັບ."

msgid ""
"Version code of the [url=https://devblogs.microsoft.com/directx/"
"directx12agility/]Direct3D 12 Agility SDK[/url] to use "
"([code]D3D12SDKVersion[/code]). This must match the [i]minor[/i] version that "
"is installed next to the editor binary and in the export templates directory "
"for the current editor version. For example, if you have [code]1.618.5[/code] "
"installed, you need to input [code]618[/code] here."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດເວີຊັນຂອງ [url=https://devblogs.microsoft.com/directx/"
"directx12agility/]Direct3D 12 Agility SDK[/url] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ ([code]D3D12SDKVersion[/"
"code]). ນີ້ຕ້ອງກົງກັບເວີຊັນ [i]minor[/i] ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ຂ້າງກັບຕົວເປີດ editor ແລະ ໃນໂຟນເດີ export "
"templates ສຳລັບເວີຊັນ editor ປັດຈຸບັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກເຈົ້າຕິດຕັ້ງ [code]1.618.5[/code] ໄວ້, "
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງປ້ອນ [code]618[/code] ທີ່ນີ້."

msgid ""
"The number of entries in the resource descriptor heap the Direct3D 12 "
"rendering driver uses for most rendering operations.\n"
"Depending on the complexity of scenes, this value may be lowered or may need "
"to be raised."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນລາຍການໃນ resource descriptor heap ທີ່ໄດຣເວີການປະມວນຜົນພາບ Direct3D 12 "
"ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກສ່ວນໃຫຍ່.\n"
"ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນຂອງສາກ, ຄ່ານີ້ອາດຈະຖືກຫຼຸດລົງ ຫຼື ອາດຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The number of entries in the sampler descriptor heap the Direct3D 12 "
"rendering driver uses for most rendering operations.\n"
"Depending on the complexity of scenes, this value may be lowered or may need "
"to be raised."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນລາຍການໃນ sampler descriptor heap ທີ່ໄດຣເວີການປະມວນຜົນພາບ Direct3D 12 "
"ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກສ່ວນໃຫຍ່.\n"
"ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນຂອງສາກ, ຄ່ານີ້ອາດຈະຖືກຫຼຸດລົງ ຫຼື ອາດຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the driver to be used by the renderer when using a RenderingDevice-based "
"renderer like the Forward+ or Mobile renderers. Editing this property has no "
"effect in the default configuration, as first-party platforms each have "
"platform-specific overrides. Use those overrides to configure the driver for "
"each platform.\n"
"This can be overridden using the [code]--rendering-driver <driver>[/code] "
"command line argument.\n"
"Supported values are:\n"
"- [code]metal[/code], Metal (supported on Apple Silicon Macs and iOS).\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan (supported on all desktop and mobile "
"platforms).\n"
"- [code]d3d12[/code], Direct3D 12 (supported on Windows).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The availability of these options depends on whether the engine "
"was compiled with support for them (determined by SCons options [code]vulkan[/"
"code], [code]metal[/code], and [code]d3d12[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If a given platform has no registered drivers, it can fall back "
"to the Compatibility renderer (OpenGL 3) if [member rendering/"
"rendering_device/fallback_to_opengl3] is enabled. This fallback happens "
"automatically for the Web platform regardless of that property.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The actual rendering driver may be automatically changed by the "
"engine as a result of a fallback, or a user-specified command line argument. "
"To get the actual rendering driver that is used at runtime, use [method "
"RenderingServer.get_current_rendering_driver_name] instead of reading this "
"project setting's value."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໄດຣເວີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວປະມວນຜົນພາບ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວປະມວນຜົນທີ່ອີງໃສ່ RenderingDevice ເຊັ່ນ "
"Forward+ ຫຼື Mobile. ການແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກແຕ່ລະແພລັດຟອມມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບສະເພາະຕົວຢູ່ແລ້ວ. "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດຣເວີສຳລັບແຕ່ລະແພລັດຟອມ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງທັບໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ argument [code]--rendering-driver <driver>[/code] ຜ່ານ "
"command line.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ຮອງຮັບຄື:\n"
"- [code]metal[/code], Metal (ຮອງຮັບເທິງ Apple Silicon Macs ແລະ iOS).\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan (ຮອງຮັບເທິງທຸກແພລັດຟອມເດັສທັອບ ແລະ ມືຖື).\n"
"- [code]d3d12[/code], Direct3D 12 (ຮອງຮັບເທິງ Windows).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບວ່າເອັນຈິນຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ມາໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບພວກມັນຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກແພລັດຟອມນັ້ນບໍ່ມີໄດຣເວີທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້, ມັນຈະປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ຕົວປະມວນຜົນພາບ "
"Compatibility (OpenGL 3) ແທນ ຫາກມີການເປີດໃຊ້ [member rendering/rendering_device/"
"fallback_to_opengl3]. ການປ່ຽນຕົວສຳຮອງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມເວັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໄດຣເວີການປະມວນຜົນພາບຕົວຈິງອາດຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍເອັນຈິນ. "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຊື່ໄດຣເວີຕົວຈິງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຂະນະເຮັດວຽກ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.get_current_rendering_driver_name]."

msgid ""
"Android override for [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"Only one option is supported:\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan from native drivers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If Vulkan was disabled at compile time, there is no alternative "
"RenderingDevice driver."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບ Android ສຳລັບ [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"ຮອງຮັບພຽງຕົວເລືອກດຽວ:\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan ຈາກໄດຣເວີພື້ນຖານຂອງລະບົບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກ Vulkan ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໃນຕອນຄອມໄພລ໌, ຈະບໍ່ມີໄດຣເວີ RenderingDevice "
"ອື່ນໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"iOS override for [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"Two options are supported:\n"
"- [code]metal[/code] (default), Metal from native drivers.\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan over Metal via MoltenVK."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບ iOS ສຳລັບ [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"ຮອງຮັບສອງຕົວເລືອກ:\n"
"- [code]metal[/code] (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), Metal ຈາກໄດຣເວີພື້ນຖານຂອງລະບົບ.\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກເທິງ Metal ຜ່ານ MoltenVK."

msgid ""
"LinuxBSD override for [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"Only one option is supported:\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan from native drivers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If Vulkan was disabled at compile time, there is no alternative "
"RenderingDevice driver."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບ LinuxBSD ສຳລັບ [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"ຮອງຮັບພຽງຕົວເລືອກດຽວ:\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan ຈາກໄດຣເວີພື້ນຖານຂອງລະບົບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກ Vulkan ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໃນຕອນຄອມໄພລ໌, ຈະບໍ່ມີໄດຣເວີ RenderingDevice "
"ອື່ນໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"macOS override for [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"Two options are supported:\n"
"- [code]metal[/code] (default), Metal from native drivers, only supported on "
"Apple Silicon Macs. On Intel Macs, it will automatically fall back to "
"[code]vulkan[/code] as Metal support is not implemented.\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan over Metal via MoltenVK, supported on both "
"Apple Silicon and Intel Macs."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບ macOS ສຳລັບ [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"ຮອງຮັບສອງຕົວເລືອກ:\n"
"- [code]metal[/code] (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), Metal ຈາກໄດຣເວີພື້ນຖານ, ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເທິງ Apple "
"Silicon Macs ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເທິງ Intel Macs, ມັນຈະປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ [code]vulkan[/code] "
"ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code], Vulkan ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກເທິງ Metal ຜ່ານ MoltenVK, ຮອງຮັບທັງ Apple "
"Silicon ແລະ Intel Macs."

msgid ""
"visionOS override for [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"Only one option is supported:\n"
"- [code]metal[/code] (default), Metal from native drivers."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບ visionOS ສຳລັບ [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"ຮອງຮັບພຽງຕົວເລືອກດຽວ:\n"
"- [code]metal[/code] (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), Metal ຈາກໄດຣເວີພື້ນຖານຂອງລະບົບ."

msgid ""
"Windows override for [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"Two options are supported:\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code] (default), Vulkan from native drivers. If [member "
"rendering/rendering_device/fallback_to_vulkan] is enabled, this is used as a "
"fallback if Direct3D 12 is not supported.\n"
"- [code]d3d12[/code], Direct3D 12 from native drivers. If [member rendering/"
"rendering_device/fallback_to_d3d12] is enabled, this is used as a fallback if "
"Vulkan is not supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Starting with Godot 4.6, new projects are configured by default "
"to use [code]d3d12[/code] on Windows. Projects created before Godot 4.6 keep "
"[code]vulkan[/code] for compatibility reasons, but it is recommended to "
"switch them manually to [code]d3d12[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບ Windows ສຳລັບ [member rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"ຮອງຮັບສອງຕົວເລືອກ:\n"
"- [code]vulkan[/code] (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), Vulkan ຈາກໄດຣເວີພື້ນຖານ. ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"rendering/rendering_device/fallback_to_vulkan], "
"ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວສຳຮອງຫາກບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ Direct3D 12.\n"
"- [code]d3d12[/code], Direct3D 12 ຈາກໄດຣເວີພື້ນຖານ. ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ [member rendering/"
"rendering_device/fallback_to_d3d12], ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວສຳຮອງຫາກບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ "
"Vulkan.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເລີ່ມແຕ່ Godot 4.6, ໂປຣເຈັກໃໝ່ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [code]d3d12[/code] ເທິງ "
"Windows ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສ້າງກ່ອນ Godot 4.6 ຈະຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ [code]vulkan[/code] ຢູ່, "
"ແຕ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]d3d12[/code] ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Forward+ renderer will fall back to Direct3D 12 if "
"Vulkan is not supported. The fallback is always attempted regardless of this "
"setting if Vulkan driver support was disabled at compile time.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented only on Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວປະມວນຜົນພາບ Forward+ ຈະປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ Direct3D 12 "
"ຫາກບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ Vulkan. ການປ່ຽນຕົວສຳຮອງນີ້ຈະຖືກພະຍາຍາມສະເໝີ ຫາກການຮອງຮັບໄດຣເວີ Vulkan "
"ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໃນຕອນຄອມໄພລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເທິງ Windows ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Forward+ renderer will fall back to OpenGL 3 if "
"Direct3D 12, Metal, and Vulkan are not supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented on Windows, Android, macOS, iOS, and "
"Linux/X11."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວປະມວນຜົນພາບ Forward+ ຈະປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ OpenGL 3 ຫາກບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ "
"Direct3D 12, Metal, ແລະ Vulkan.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ເທິງ Windows, Android, macOS, iOS, ແລະ Linux/X11."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Forward+ renderer will fall back to Vulkan if "
"Direct3D 12 (on Windows) or Metal (on macOS x86_64) are not supported. The "
"fallback is always attempted regardless of this setting if Direct3D 12 "
"(Windows) or Metal (macOS) driver support was disabled at compile time.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented on Windows and macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວປະມວນຜົນພາບ Forward+ ຈະປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ Vulkan ຫາກບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ "
"Direct3D 12 (ເທິງ Windows) ຫຼື Metal (ເທິງ macOS x86_64). "
"ການປ່ຽນຕົວສຳຮອງນີ້ຈະຖືກພະຍາຍາມສະເໝີ ຫາກການຮອງຮັບໄດຣເວີ Direct3D 12 ຫຼື Metal "
"ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໃນຕອນຄອມໄພລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ເທິງ Windows ແລະ macOS."

msgid ""
"Enable the pipeline cache that is saved to disk if the graphics API supports "
"it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is unable to control the pipeline caching the GPU "
"driver itself does. Only turn this off along with deleting the contents of "
"the driver's cache if you wish to simulate the experience a user will get "
"when starting the game for the first time."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານແຄຊ໌ພາຍລາຍ (pipeline cache) ທີ່ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກລົງໃນດິສກ໌ ຫາກ graphics API ຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດຄວບຄຸມການເຮັດແຄຊ໌ພາຍລາຍທີ່ໄດຣເວີ GPU ເຮັດເອງໄດ້. "
"ໃຫ້ປິດສິ່ງນີ້ພ້ອມກັບການລຶບເນື້ອໃນແຄຊ໌ຂອງໄດຣເວີ "
"ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຈຳລອງປະສົບການທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະໄດ້ຮັບເມື່ອເລີ່ມເກມເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ."

msgid ""
"Determines at which interval pipeline cache is saved to disk. The lower the "
"value, the more often it is saved."
msgstr "ກຳນົດໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອງການບັນທຶກແຄຊ໌ພາຍລາຍລົງໃນດິສກ໌. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະໝາຍເຖິງການບັນທຶກທີ່ຖີ່ຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The size of a block allocated in the staging buffers. Staging buffers are the "
"intermediate resources the engine uses to upload or download data to the GPU. "
"This setting determines the max amount of data that can be transferred in a "
"copy operation. Increasing this will result in faster data transfers at the "
"cost of extra memory.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. There is "
"currently no way to change this value at run-time."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງບລັອກທີ່ຖືກຈັດສັນໃນບັບເຟີພັກຂໍ້ມູນ (staging buffers). "
"ບັບເຟີພັກຂໍ້ມູນແມ່ນຊັບພະຍາກອນລະຫວ່າງກາງທີ່ເອັນຈິນໃຊ້ເພື່ອ ອັບໂຫຼດ ຫຼື ດາວໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນໄປຫາ GPU. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ກຳນົດປະລິມານຂໍ້ມູນສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດສົ່ງໄດ້ໃນຄັ້ງດຽວ. ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໄວຂຶ້ນ "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ມີວິທີປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

msgid ""
"The maximum amount of memory allowed to be used by staging buffers. If the "
"amount of data being uploaded or downloaded exceeds this amount, the GPU will "
"stall and wait for previous frames to finish.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. There is "
"currently no way to change this value at run-time."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂດຍບັບເຟີພັກຂໍ້ມູນ (staging buffers). "
"ຫາກປະລິມານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຳລັງອັບໂຫຼດ ຫຼື ດາວໂຫຼດເກີນຄ່ານີ້, GPU "
"ຈະຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວເພື່ອຖ້າໃຫ້ເຟຣມກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ເຮັດວຽກໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ມີວິທີປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

msgid ""
"The region size in pixels used to download texture data from the GPU when "
"using methods like [method RenderingDevice.texture_get_data_async].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property's upper limit is controlled by [member rendering/"
"rendering_device/staging_buffer/block_size_kb] and whether it's possible to "
"allocate a single block of texture data with this region size in the format "
"that is requested.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. There is "
"currently no way to change this value at run-time."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດພື້ນທີ່ເປັນພິກເຊວທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການດາວໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນເທັກເຈີ (texture) ຈາກ GPU. \n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຂີດຈຳກັດສູງສຸດຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ [member rendering/"
"rendering_device/staging_buffer/block_size_kb].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ມີວິທີປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

msgid ""
"The region size in pixels used to upload texture data from the GPU when using "
"methods like [method RenderingDevice.texture_update].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property's upper limit is controlled by [member rendering/"
"rendering_device/staging_buffer/block_size_kb] and whether it's possible to "
"allocate a single block of texture data with this region size in the format "
"that is requested.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. There is "
"currently no way to change this value at run-time."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດພື້ນທີ່ເປັນພິກເຊວທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການອັບໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນເທັກເຈີ (texture) ໄປຫາ GPU.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຂີດຈຳກັດສູງສຸດຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ [member rendering/"
"rendering_device/staging_buffer/block_size_kb].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ມີວິທີປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

msgid ""
"The number of frames to track on the CPU side before stalling to wait for the "
"GPU.\n"
"Try the [url=https://darksylinc.github.io/vsync_simulator/]V-Sync Simulator[/"
"url], an interactive interface that simulates presentation to better "
"understand how it is affected by different variables under various "
"conditions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. There is "
"currently no way to change this value at run-time."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນເຟຣມທີ່ຈະຕິດຕາມໃນຝັ່ງ CPU ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຢຸດລໍຖ້າ GPU.\n"
"ລອງໃຊ້ [url=https://darksylinc.github.io/vsync_simulator/]V-Sync Simulator[/"
"url] ເພື່ອທຳຄວາມເຂົ້າໃຈວ່າຕົວແປຕ່າງໆມີຜົນແນວໃດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ມີວິທີປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

msgid ""
"The number of images the swapchain will consist of (back buffers + front "
"buffer).\n"
"[code]2[/code] corresponds to double-buffering and [code]3[/code] to triple-"
"buffering.\n"
"Double-buffering may give you the lowest lag/latency but if V-Sync is on and "
"the system can't render at 60 fps, the framerate will go down in multiples of "
"it (e.g. 30 fps, 15, 7.5, etc.). Triple buffering gives you higher framerate "
"(specially if the system can't reach a constant 60 fps) at the cost of up to "
"1 frame of latency, with [constant DisplayServer.VSYNC_ENABLED] (FIFO).\n"
"Use double-buffering with [constant DisplayServer.VSYNC_ENABLED]. Triple-"
"buffering is a must if you plan on using [constant "
"DisplayServer.VSYNC_MAILBOX] mode.\n"
"Try the [url=https://darksylinc.github.io/vsync_simulator/]V-Sync Simulator[/"
"url], an interactive interface that simulates presentation to better "
"understand how it is affected by different variables under various "
"conditions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changes to this setting will only be applied on startup or when "
"the swapchain is recreated (e.g. when setting the V-Sync mode).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some platforms may restrict the actual value."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຮູບພາບທີ່ swapchain ປະກອບມີ (back buffers + front buffer).\n"
"[code]2[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງ double-buffering ແລະ [code]3[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງ triple-"
"buffering.\n"
"Double-buffering ອາດຈະໃຫ້ຄ່າການຕອບສະໜອງ (latency) ທີ່ຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດ ແຕ່ຫາກເປີດ V-Sync ແລະ "
"ລະບົບບໍ່ສາມາດປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ທີ່ 60 fps, ອັດຕາເຟຣມຈະຫຼຸດລົງເປັນເທົ່າຕົວ (ເຊັ່ນ 30 fps, 15, 7.5, "
"ແລະອື່ນໆ). Triple buffering ຈະໃຫ້ອັດຕາເຟຣມທີ່ສູງກວ່າ ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍການຊັກຊ້າປະມານ 1 ເຟຣມ.\n"
"ໃຊ້ double-buffering ຮ່ວມກັບ [constant DisplayServer.VSYNC_ENABLED]. ສ່ວນ triple-"
"buffering ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນຫາກເຈົ້າວາງແຜນຈະໃຊ້ໂໝດ [constant "
"DisplayServer.VSYNC_MAILBOX].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່ານີ້ຈະມີຜົນເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣແກຣມໃໝ່ ຫຼື ເມື່ອ swapchain "
"ຖືກສ້າງໃໝ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບາງແພລັດຟອມອາດຈະຈຳກັດຄ່າຕົວຈິງ."

msgid ""
"The number of descriptors per pool. Godot's Vulkan backend uses linear pools "
"for descriptors that will be created and destroyed within a single frame. "
"Instead of destroying every single descriptor every frame, they all can be "
"destroyed at once by resetting the pool they belong to.\n"
"A larger number is more efficient up to a limit, after that it will only "
"waste RAM (maximum efficiency is achieved when there is no more than 1 pool "
"per frame). A small number could end up with one pool per descriptor, which "
"negatively impacts performance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing this property requires a restart to take effect."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນ descriptor ຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງ pool. Vulkan backend ຂອງ Godot ໃຊ້ linear pools ສຳລັບ "
"descriptor ທີ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງ ແລະ ທຳລາຍພາຍໃນເຟຣມດຽວ. ແທນທີ່ຈະທຳລາຍທຸກໆ descriptor "
"ໃນແຕ່ລະເຟຣມ, ພວກມັນສາມາດຖືກທຳລາຍພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ໂດຍການຣີເຊັດ pool ທີ່ພວກມັນສັງກັດຢູ່.\n"
"ຈຳນວນທີ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນຈະມີປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນຈົນເຖິງຂີດຈຳກັດໜຶ່ງ, ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນມັນຈະພຽງແຕ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ເສຍ RAM "
"(ປະສິດທິພາບສູງສຸດຄືການມີບໍ່ເກີນ 1 pool ຕໍ່ເຟຣມ). ຈຳນວນທີ່ນ້ອຍເກີນໄປອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ມີໜຶ່ງ pool ຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງ "
"descriptor ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງຜົນເສຍຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນແປງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຕ້ອງມີການເລີ່ມໂປຣແກຣມໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຜົນ."

msgid ""
"Determines how sharp the upscaled image will be when using the FSR upscaling "
"mode. Sharpness halves with every whole number. Values go from 0.0 (sharpest) "
"to 2.0. Values above 2.0 won't make a visible difference."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ຖືກຂະຫຍາຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດການຂະຫຍາຍພາບ FSR. "
"ຄວາມຄົມຊັດຈະຫຼຸດລົງເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງໃນທຸກໆຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມແຕ່ 0.0 (ຄົມຊັດທີ່ສຸດ) ຫາ 2.0. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າ 2.0 "
"ຈະບໍ່ເຫັນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງທີ່ຊັດເຈນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the scaling 3D mode. Bilinear scaling renders at different resolution to "
"either undersample or supersample the viewport. FidelityFX Super Resolution "
"1.0, abbreviated to FSR, is an upscaling technology that produces high "
"quality images at fast framerates by using a spatially-aware upscaling "
"algorithm. FSR is slightly more expensive than bilinear, but it produces "
"significantly higher image quality. On particularly low-end GPUs, the added "
"cost of FSR may not be worth it (compared to using bilinear scaling with a "
"slightly higher resolution scale to match performance).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] FSR is only effective when using the Forward+ rendering method, "
"not Mobile or Compatibility. If using an incompatible rendering method, FSR "
"will fall back to bilinear scaling."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໂໝດການຂະຫຍາຍພາບ 3D. ການຂະຫຍາຍພາບແບບ Bilinear "
"ຈະປະມວນຜົນດ້ວຍຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. FidelityFX Super Resolution 1.0 ຫຼື FSR "
"ແມ່ນເຕັກໂນໂລຊີການຂະຫຍາຍພາບທີ່ໃຫ້ພາບຄຸນນະພາບສູງໃນອັດຕາເຟຣມທີ່ໄວ "
"ໂດຍການໃຊ້ສູດຄິດໄລ່ການຂະຫຍາຍພາບແບບ spatially-aware. FSR ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍກວ່າ "
"bilinear ເລັກນ້ອຍ ແຕ່ໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບພາບທີ່ສູງກວ່າຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ເທິງ GPU ລະດັບຕ່ຳຫຼາຍ, ການໃຊ້ FSR "
"ອາດຈະບໍ່ກຸ້ມຄ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] FSR ຈະມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການປະມວນຜົນພາບ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ລວມເຖິງ Mobile ຫຼື "
"Compatibility. ຫາກໃຊ້ວິທີທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ, FSR ຈະປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ bilinear ແທນ."

msgid ""
"iOS override for [member rendering/scaling_3d/mode]. This allows selecting "
"the MetalFX spatial and MetalFX temporal scaling modes, which are exclusive "
"to platforms where the Metal rendering driver is used."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບ iOS ສຳລັບ [member rendering/scaling_3d/mode]. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເລືອກໂໝດການຂະຫຍາຍພາບ MetalFX spatial ແລະ MetalFX temporal ໄດ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງມີສະເພາະເທິງແພລັດຟອມທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດຣເວີ Metal ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"macOS override for [member rendering/scaling_3d/mode]. This allows selecting "
"the MetalFX spatial and MetalFX temporal scaling modes, which are exclusive "
"to platforms where the Metal rendering driver is used."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບ macOS ສຳລັບ [member rendering/scaling_3d/mode]. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເລືອກໂໝດການຂະຫຍາຍພາບ MetalFX spatial ແລະ MetalFX temporal ໄດ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງມີສະເພາະເທິງແພລັດຟອມທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດຣເວີ Metal ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Scales the 3D render buffer based on the viewport size uses an image filter "
"specified in [member rendering/scaling_3d/mode] to scale the output image to "
"the full viewport size. Values lower than [code]1.0[/code] can be used to "
"speed up 3D rendering at the cost of quality (undersampling). Values greater "
"than [code]1.0[/code] are only valid for bilinear mode and can be used to "
"improve 3D rendering quality at a high performance cost (supersampling). See "
"also [member rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/msaa_3d] for multi-sample "
"antialiasing, which is significantly cheaper but only smooths the edges of "
"polygons.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the [b]Nearest[/b] scaling mode, to avoid uneven "
"pixel scaling, it's highly recommended to use a value equal to an integer "
"divisor with a dividend of [code]1[/code]. For example, it's best to use a "
"scale of [code]0.5[/code] (1/2), [code]0.3333[/code] (1/3), [code]0.25[/code] "
"(1/4), [code]0.2[/code] (1/5), and so on."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຂະໜາດບັບເຟີການປະມວນຜົນ 3D ຕາມຂະໜາດຂອງ viewport. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວໃນການປະມວນຜົນ 3D ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍຄຸນນະພາບພາບ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າ [code]1.0[/"
"code] ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໂໝດ bilinear ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄຸນນະພາບພາບ 3D "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນສູງ. ເບິ່ງ [member rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/msaa_3d] "
"ສຳລັບການລົບຮອຍຢັກ (antialiasing) ທີ່ປະຢັດກວ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດການຂະຫຍາຍພາບ [b]Nearest[/b], "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການຂະຫຍາຍພິກເຊວທີ່ບໍ່ສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ເປັນຕົວຫານຂອງ [code]1[/code] ເຊັ່ນ "
"[code]0.5[/code], [code]0.3333[/code], [code]0.25[/code] ເປັນຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Enable the shader cache, which stores compiled shaders to disk to prevent "
"stuttering from shader compilation the next time the shader is needed."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານແຄຊ໌ເຊດເດີ (shader cache), ເຊິ່ງຈະເກັບເຊດເດີທີ່ຄອມໄພລ໌ແລ້ວໄວ້ໃນດິສກ໌ "
"ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການກະຕຸກຈາກການຄອມໄພລ໌ເຊດເດີໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses faster but lower-quality Lambert material lighting "
"model instead of Burley."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບແສງສະຫວ່າງວັດສະດຸ Lambert "
"ທີ່ໄວກວ່າແຕ່ຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳກວ່າ ແທນທີ່ Burley."

msgid ""
"Lower-end override for [member rendering/shading/overrides/"
"force_lambert_over_burley] on mobile devices, due to performance concerns or "
"driver support."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບສຳລັບອຸປະກອນລະດັບຕ່ຳສຳລັບ [member rendering/shading/overrides/"
"force_lambert_over_burley] ເທິງອຸປະກອນມືຖື, ເນື່ອງຈາກບັນຫາດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ ຫຼື "
"ການຮອງຮັບຂອງໄດຣເວີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], forces vertex shading for all rendering. This can "
"increase performance a lot, but also reduces quality immensely. Can be used "
"to optimize performance on low-end mobile devices."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະບັງຄັບໃຊ້ vertex shading ສຳລັບການປະມວນຜົນພາບທັງໝົດ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້ຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ກໍຈະຫຼຸດຄຸນນະພາບລົງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍເຊັ່ນກັນ. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງປະສິດທິພາບເທິງອຸປະກອນມືຖືລະດັບຕ່ຳ."

msgid ""
"The dictionary size for Rate-Distortion Optimization (RDO) when importing "
"textures as Basis Universal and when RDO is enabled, ranging from [code]64[/"
"code] to [code]65536[/code]. Higher values reduce the file sizes further, but "
"make encoding times significantly longer."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດດີກຊັນນາຣີ (dictionary size) ສຳລັບ Rate-Distortion Optimization (RDO) "
"ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າເທັກເຈີເປັນ Basis Universal. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະຫຼຸດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ລົງໄດ້ອີກ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເວລາໃນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດດົນຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables Zstandard supercompression to reduce file size "
"when importing textures as Basis Universal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Basis Universal textures need to be compressed to gain the "
"benefit of smaller file sizes, otherwise they are as large as VRAM-compressed "
"textures."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການບີບອັດຂັ້ນສູງ Zstandard "
"ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າເທັກເຈີເປັນ Basis Universal.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເທັກເຈີ Basis Universal "
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການບີບອັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ນ້ອຍລົງ, "
"ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກມັນຈະມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ເທົ່າກັບເທັກເຈີທີ່ບີບອັດແບບ VRAM."

msgid ""
"Specify the compression level for Basis Universal Zstandard supercompression, "
"ranging from [code]1[/code] to [code]22[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດລະດັບການບີບອັດສຳລັບ Basis Universal Zstandard supercompression, ຕັ້ງແຕ່ [code]1[/"
"code] ຫາ [code]22[/code]."

msgid ""
"The filtering quality to use for [Decal] nodes. When using one of the "
"anisotropic filtering modes, the anisotropic filtering level is controlled by "
"[member rendering/textures/default_filters/anisotropic_filtering_level]."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບການກັ່ນຕອງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂນດ [Decal]. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດການກັ່ນຕອງແບບ anisotropic, "
"ລະດັບການກັ່ນຕອງຈະຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ [member rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"anisotropic_filtering_level]."

msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of samples to take when using anisotropic filtering "
"on textures (as a power of two). A higher sample count will result in sharper "
"textures at oblique angles, but is more expensive to compute. A value of "
"[code]0[/code] forcibly disables anisotropic filtering, even on materials "
"where it is enabled.\n"
"The anisotropic filtering level also affects decals and light projectors if "
"they are configured to use anisotropic filtering. See [member rendering/"
"textures/decals/filter] and [member rendering/textures/light_projectors/"
"filter].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In 3D, for this setting to have an effect, set [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.texture_filter] to [constant "
"BaseMaterial3D.TEXTURE_FILTER_LINEAR_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC] or [constant "
"BaseMaterial3D.TEXTURE_FILTER_NEAREST_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC] on "
"materials.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In 2D, for this setting to have an effect, set [member "
"CanvasItem.texture_filter] to [constant "
"CanvasItem.TEXTURE_FILTER_LINEAR_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC] or [constant "
"CanvasItem.TEXTURE_FILTER_NEAREST_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC] on the "
"[CanvasItem] node displaying the texture (or in [CanvasTexture]). However, "
"anisotropic filtering is rarely useful in 2D, so only enable it for textures "
"in 2D if it makes a meaningful visual difference.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the anisotropic filtering level at runtime, set [member "
"Viewport.anisotropic_filtering_level] on the root [Viewport] instead."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຈຳນວນຕົວຢ່າງສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການກັ່ນຕອງແບບ anisotropic ເທິງເທັກເຈີ. "
"ຈຳນວນຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເທັກເຈີຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເບິ່ງໃນມຸມອຽງ, ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ເວລາປະມວນຜົນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າ "
"[code]0[/code] ຈະປິດການກັ່ນຕອງແບບ anisotropic.\n"
"ລະດັບການກັ່ນຕອງແບບ anisotropic ຍັງມີຜົນຕໍ່ decals ແລະ ຕົວສາຍແສງ (light projectors) "
"ນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ 3D, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນ, ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.texture_filter] ຂອງວັດສະດຸໃຫ້ເປັນ ANISOTROPIC.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ 2D, ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວການກັ່ນຕອງແບບ anisotropic ຈະບໍ່ຄ່ອຍມີປະໂຫຍດ "
"ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ມັນຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງທີ່ຊັດເຈນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Affects the final texture sharpness by reading from a lower or higher mipmap "
"(also called \"texture LOD bias\"). Negative values make mipmapped textures "
"sharper but grainier when viewed at a distance, while positive values make "
"mipmapped textures blurrier (even when up close).\n"
"Enabling temporal antialiasing ([member rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/"
"use_taa]) will automatically apply a [code]-0.5[/code] offset to this value, "
"while enabling FXAA ([member rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/"
"screen_space_aa]) will automatically apply a [code]-0.25[/code] offset to "
"this value. If both TAA and FXAA are enabled at the same time, an offset of "
"[code]-0.75[/code] is applied to this value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member rendering/scaling_3d/scale] is lower than [code]1.0[/"
"code] (exclusive), [member rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"texture_mipmap_bias] is used to adjust the automatic mipmap bias which is "
"calculated internally based on the scale factor. The formula for this is "
"[code]log2(scaling_3d_scale) + mipmap_bias[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only supported in the Forward+ and Mobile "
"renderers, not Compatibility. In Compatibility, this property is always "
"treated as if it was set to [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງເທັກເຈີໂດຍການອ່ານຈາກ mipmap ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າ (ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"texture LOD "
"bias\"). ຄ່າລົບຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເທັກເຈີຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນແຕ່ອາດຈະເຫັນເປັນເມັດ (grainy) ເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກໄລຍະໄກ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າບວກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເທັກເຈີມົວລົງ.\n"
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ TAA ຈະມີການປັບຄ່າ offset ໄປທີ່ [code]-0.5[/code] ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແລະ FXAA "
"ຈະປັບໄປທີ່ [code]-0.25[/code]. ຫາກເປີດທັງສອງຢ່າງ ຈະມີການປັບ offset ໄປທີ່ [code]-0.75[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses nearest-neighbor mipmap filtering when using "
"mipmaps (also called \"bilinear filtering\"), which will result in visible "
"seams appearing between mipmap stages. This may increase performance in "
"mobile as less memory bandwidth is used. If [code]false[/code], linear mipmap "
"filtering (also called \"trilinear filtering\") is used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. There is "
"currently no way to change this setting at run-time."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ການກັ່ນຕອງ mipmap ແບບ nearest-neighbor (ເອີ້ນວ່າ "
"\"bilinear filtering\"), ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນຮອຍຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງຊັ້ນຂອງ mipmap. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໃນມືຖື. ຫາກເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ການກັ່ນຕອງ mipmap ແບບ "
"linear (ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"trilinear filtering\").\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The filtering quality to use for [OmniLight3D] and [SpotLight3D] projectors. "
"When using one of the anisotropic filtering modes, the anisotropic filtering "
"level is controlled by [member rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"anisotropic_filtering_level]."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບການກັ່ນຕອງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕົວສາຍແສງ [OmniLight3D] ແລະ [SpotLight3D]. "
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດການກັ່ນຕອງແບບ anisotropic, ລະດັບການກັ່ນຕອງຈະຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ [member rendering/"
"textures/default_filters/anisotropic_filtering_level]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the texture importer will import lossless textures "
"using the PNG format. Otherwise, it will default to using WebP."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວນຳເຂົ້າເທັກເຈີຈະນຳເຂົ້າເທັກເຈີແບບບໍ່ສູນເສຍຄວາມລະອຽດ "
"(lossless) ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ PNG. ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈະໃຊ້ WebP ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the GPU texture compressor will cache the local "
"RenderingDevice and its resources (shaders and pipelines), making subsequent "
"imports faster at the cost of increased memory usage."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວບີບອັດເທັກເຈີດ້ວຍ GPU ຈະເຮັດແຄຊ໌ RenderingDevice ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ "
"ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງມັນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ການນຳເຂົ້າຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປໄວຂຶ້ນ ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the texture importer will utilize the GPU for "
"compressing textures, improving the import time of large images.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only functions on a device which supports either Vulkan, "
"Direct3D 12, or Metal as a rendering driver.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Currently this only affects certain compressed formats (BC1, "
"BC3, BC4, BC5, and BC6), all of which are exclusive to desktop platforms and "
"consoles."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວນຳເຂົ້າເທັກເຈີຈະໃຊ້ GPU ໃນການບີບອັດເທັກເຈີ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງເວລານຳເຂົ້າສຳລັບຮູບພາບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກເທິງອຸປະກອນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ Vulkan, Direct3D 12, ຫຼື Metal "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນປັດຈຸບັນສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນກັບບາງຮູບແບບການບີບອັດເທົ່ານັ້ນ (BC1, BC3, BC4, BC5, ແລະ "
"BC6)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the texture importer will import VRAM-compressed "
"textures using the Ericsson Texture Compression 2 algorithm for lower quality "
"textures and normal maps and Adaptable Scalable Texture Compression algorithm "
"for high quality textures (in 4×4 block size).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is an override. The texture importer will always "
"import the format the host platform needs, even if this is set to "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing this setting does [i]not[/i] impact textures that were "
"already imported before. To make this setting apply to textures that were "
"already imported, exit the editor, remove the [code].godot/imported/[/code] "
"folder located inside the project folder then restart the editor (see [member "
"application/config/use_hidden_project_data_directory])."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວນຳເຂົ້າເທັກເຈີຈະນຳເຂົ້າເທັກເຈີທີ່ບີບອັດແບບ VRAM ໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດຄິດໄລ່ "
"ETC2 ສຳລັບເທັກເຈີຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳ ແລະ ASTC ສຳລັບເທັກເຈີຄຸນນະພາບສູງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບ. "
"ຕົວນຳເຂົ້າຈະນຳເຂົ້າໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ແພລັດຟອມປາຍທາງຕ້ອງການສະເໝີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່ານີ້ຈະ [i]ບໍ່[/i] ມີຜົນກັບເທັກເຈີທີ່ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າໄປແລ້ວ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຜົນ, "
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງລຶບໂຟນເດີ [code].godot/imported/[/code] ແລ້ວເລີ່ມ editor ໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the texture importer will import VRAM-compressed "
"textures using the S3 Texture Compression algorithm (DXT1-5) for lower "
"quality textures and the BPTC algorithm (BC6H and BC7) for high quality "
"textures. This algorithm is only supported on PC desktop platforms and "
"consoles.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is an override. The texture importer will always "
"import the format the host platform needs, even if this is set to "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing this setting does [i]not[/i] impact textures that were "
"already imported before. To make this setting apply to textures that were "
"already imported, exit the editor, remove the [code].godot/imported/[/code] "
"folder located inside the project folder then restart the editor (see [member "
"application/config/use_hidden_project_data_directory])."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວນຳເຂົ້າເທັກເຈີຈະນຳເຂົ້າເທັກເຈີທີ່ບີບອັດແບບ VRAM ໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດຄິດໄລ່ "
"S3TC (DXT1-5) ສຳລັບຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳ ແລະ BPTC ສຳລັບຄຸນນະພາບສູງ. ສູດຄິດໄລ່ນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເທິງ PC "
"ແລະ ຄອນໂຊລ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັບ. "
"ຕົວນຳເຂົ້າຈະນຳເຂົ້າໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ແພລັດຟອມປາຍທາງຕ້ອງການສະເໝີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່ານີ້ຈະ [i]ບໍ່[/i] ມີຜົນກັບເທັກເຈີທີ່ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າໄປແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"The default compression method for WebP. Affects both lossy and lossless "
"WebP. A higher value results in smaller files at the cost of compression "
"speed. Decompression speed is mostly unaffected by the compression method. "
"Supported values are 0 to 6. Note that compression methods above 4 are very "
"slow and offer very little savings."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການບີບອັດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ WebP. ມີຜົນທັງແບບ lossy ແລະ lossless. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ນ້ອຍລົງແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ເວລາບີບອັດດົນຂຶ້ນ. ຄວາມໄວໃນການຄາຍການບີບອັດ "
"(decompression) ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ. ຄ່າທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນ 0 ຫາ 6."

msgid ""
"The default compression factor for lossless WebP. Decompression speed is "
"mostly unaffected by the compression factor. Supported values are 0 to 100."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າການບີບອັດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ WebP ແບບ lossless. ຄວາມໄວໃນການຄາຍການບີບອັດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນ 0 ຫາ 100."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] on the root "
"Viewport. 2D rendering will use a high dynamic range (HDR) [code]RGBA16[/"
"code] format framebuffer. Additionally, 2D rendering will be performed on "
"linear values and will be converted using the appropriate transfer function "
"immediately before blitting to the screen.\n"
"Practically speaking, this means that the end result of the Viewport will not "
"be clamped to the [code]0-1[/code] range and can be used in 3D rendering "
"without color encoding adjustments. This allows 2D rendering to take "
"advantage of effects requiring high dynamic range (e.g. 2D glow) as well as "
"substantially improves the appearance of effects requiring highly detailed "
"gradients.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To toggle "
"HDR 2D at runtime, set [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] on the root [Viewport]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] ເທິງ root "
"Viewport. ການປະມວນຜົນ 2D ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ framebuffer ແບບ HDR [code]RGBA16[/code]. "
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ການປະມວນຜົນ 2D ຈະເຮັດບົນຄ່າແບບ linear.\n"
"ໃນທາງປະຕິບັດ, ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຜົນລັດຂອງ Viewport ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ (clamped) ຢູ່ແຕ່ໃນຊ່ວງ "
"[code]0-1[/code] ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນການປະມວນຜົນ 3D ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງປັບປ່ຽນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດສີ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ 2D ສາມາດໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກທີ່ຕ້ອງການ HDR ໄດ້ (ເຊັ່ນ 2D glow).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກອ່ານເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables [member Viewport.transparent_bg] on the root "
"viewport. This allows per-pixel transparency to be effective after also "
"enabling [member display/window/size/transparent] and [member display/window/"
"per_pixel_transparency/allowed]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ [member Viewport.transparent_bg] ເທິງ root "
"viewport. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສແບບລາຍພິກເຊວ (per-pixel transparency) ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Set the default Variable Rate Shading (VRS) mode for the main viewport. See "
"[member Viewport.vrs_mode] to change this at runtime, and [enum "
"Viewport.VRSMode] for possible values."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໂໝດ Variable Rate Shading (VRS) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ viewport ຫຼັກ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"Viewport.vrs_mode] ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງຄ່ານີ້ໃນຂະນະເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"If [member rendering/vrs/mode] is set to [b]Texture[/b], this is the path to "
"default texture loaded as the VRS image.\n"
"The texture [i]must[/i] use a lossless compression format so that colors can "
"be matched precisely. The following VRS densities are mapped to various "
"colors, with brighter colors representing a lower level of shading "
"precision:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- 1×1 = rgb(0, 0, 0)     - #000000\n"
"- 1×2 = rgb(0, 85, 0)    - #005500\n"
"- 2×1 = rgb(85, 0, 0)    - #550000\n"
"- 2×2 = rgb(85, 85, 0)   - #555500\n"
"- 2×4 = rgb(85, 170, 0)  - #55aa00\n"
"- 4×2 = rgb(170, 85, 0)  - #aa5500\n"
"- 4×4 = rgb(170, 170, 0) - #aaaa00\n"
"- 4×8 = rgb(170, 255, 0) - #aaff00 - Not supported on most hardware\n"
"- 8×4 = rgb(255, 170, 0) - #ffaa00 - Not supported on most hardware\n"
"- 8×8 = rgb(255, 255, 0) - #ffff00 - Not supported on most hardware\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກ [member rendering/vrs/mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Texture[/b], "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາເທັກເຈີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກໂຫຼດເປັນຮູບພາບ VRS.\n"
"ເທັກເຈີ [i]ຕ້ອງ[/i] ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບການບີບອັດແບບບໍ່ສູນເສຍຄວາມລະອຽດ (lossless) "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສີສາມາດກົງກັນໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. ຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງ VRS ຈະຖືກຈັບຄູ່ກັບສີຕ່າງໆ "
"ໂດຍສີທີ່ສະຫວ່າງກວ່າຈະແທນລະດັບຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳຂອງ shading ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"The ratio of [WorkerThreadPool]'s threads that will be reserved for low-"
"priority tasks. For example, if 10 threads are available and this value is "
"set to [code]0.3[/code], 3 of the worker threads will be reserved for low-"
"priority tasks. The actual value won't exceed the number of CPU cores minus "
"one, and if possible, at least one worker thread will be dedicated to low-"
"priority tasks."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງເທຣດ (threads) ໃນ [WorkerThreadPool] "
"ທີ່ຈະຖືກສຳຮອງໄວ້ສຳລັບວຽກທີ່ມີລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຕ່ຳ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກມີ 10 ເທຣດ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ "
"[code]0.3[/code], ຈະມີ 3 ເທຣດທີ່ຖືກສຳຮອງໄວ້ສຳລັບວຽກບຸລິມະສິດຕ່ຳ."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of threads to be used by [WorkerThreadPool]. On Web, a value "
"of [code]-1[/code] means [code]1[/code]. On other platforms, it means all "
"[i]logical[/i] CPU cores available (see [method OS.get_processor_count])."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນເທຣດສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໂດຍ [WorkerThreadPool]. ເທິງເວັບ, ຄ່າ [code]-1[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງ "
"[code]1[/code]. ເທິງແພລັດຟອມອື່ນ, ມັນໝາຍເຖິງຈຳນວນ logical CPU cores ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables the analog threshold binding modifier if "
"supported by the XR runtime."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ analog threshold binding modifier ຫາກ XR "
"runtime ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables the D-pad binding modifier if supported by the "
"XR runtime."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ D-pad binding modifier ຫາກ XR runtime "
"ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid "Action map configuration to load by default."
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າ Action map ທີ່ຈະໂຫຼດເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], Godot will setup and initialize OpenXR on startup."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], Godot ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ OpenXR ເມື່ອເປີດໂປຣແກຣມ."

msgid ""
"Specify how OpenXR should blend in the environment. This is specific to "
"certain AR and passthrough devices where camera images are blended in by the "
"XR compositor."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າ OpenXR ຄວນປະສົມປະສານ (blend) ກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແນວໃດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບອຸປະກອນ AR "
"ແລະ passthrough ບາງລຸ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Specifies the message types for which we request debug messages. Requires "
"[member xr/openxr/extensions/debug_utils] to be set and the extension to be "
"supported by the XR runtime."
msgstr "ກຳນົດປະເພດຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເຮົາຕ້ອງການຂໍຂໍ້ຄວາມດີບັກ (debug messages)."

msgid ""
"Enables debug utilities on XR runtimes that supports the debug utils "
"extension. Sets the maximum severity being reported (0 = disabled, 1 = error, "
"2 = warning, 3 = info, 4 = verbose)."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ debug utilities ເທິງ XR runtimes ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid ""
"Specify whether to enable eye tracking for this project. Depending on the "
"platform, additional export configuration may be needed."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການຕິດຕາມສາຍຕາ (eye tracking) ສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກນີ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] the frame synthesis extension will be activated if "
"supported by the platform.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature should not be enabled in conjunction with "
"Application Space Warp, if supported this replaces ASW."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສ່ວນເສີມ frame synthesis "
"ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຫາກແພລັດຟອມຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟີເຈີນີ້ບໍ່ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ Application Space Warp."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] the hand interaction profile extension will be activated "
"if supported by the platform."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສ່ວນເສີມ hand interaction profile "
"ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຫາກແພລັດຟອມຮອງຮັບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the hand tracking extension is enabled if available.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default hand tracking will only work for data sources chosen "
"by the XR runtime. For SteamVR this is the controller inferred data source, "
"for most other runtimes this is the unobstructed data source. There is no way "
"to query this. If a runtime supports the OpenXR data source extension you can "
"use the [member xr/openxr/extensions/hand_tracking_controller_data_source] "
"and/or [member xr/openxr/extensions/hand_tracking_unobstructed_data_source] "
"to indicate you wish to enable these data sources. If neither is selected the "
"data source extension is not enabled and the XR runtimes default behavior "
"persists."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສ່ວນເສີມການຕິດຕາມມື (hand tracking) "
"ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຫາກມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ ການຕິດຕາມມືຈະເຮັດວຽກສະເພາະກັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ XR runtime "
"ເລືອກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], support for the controller inferred data source is "
"requested. If supported, you will receive hand tracking data even if the user "
"has a controller in hand, with finger positions automatically inferred from "
"controller input and/or sensors.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This requires the OpenXR data source extension and controller "
"inferred handtracking to be supported by the XR runtime. If not supported "
"this setting will be ignored. [member xr/openxr/extensions/hand_tracking] "
"must be enabled for this setting to be used."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີການຂໍຮອງຮັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຄາດຄະເນຈາກຄອນໂທຣລເລີ (controller "
"inferred). ຫາກຮອງຮັບ, ເຈົ້າຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕາມມືເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະຖືຄອນໂທຣລເລີຢູ່ກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], support for the unobstructed data source is requested. "
"If supported, you will receive hand tracking data based on the actual finger "
"positions of the user often determined by optical tracking.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This requires the OpenXR data source extension and unobstructed "
"handtracking to be supported by the XR runtime. If not supported this setting "
"will be ignored. [member xr/openxr/extensions/hand_tracking] must be enabled "
"for this setting to be used."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີການຂໍຮອງຮັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນແບບບໍ່ມີສິ່ງກີດຂວາງ (unobstructed). "
"ຫາກຮອງຮັບ, ເຈົ້າຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕາມມືໂດຍອີງຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງນິ້ວມືຕົວຈິງຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] we enable the render model extension if available.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This relates to the core OpenXR render model extension and has "
"no relation to any vendor render model extensions."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ພວກເຮົາຈະເປີດໃຊ້ສ່ວນເສີມ render model ຫາກມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], we enable the built-in logic for handling anchors. "
"Godot will query (persistent) anchors and manage [OpenXRAnchorTracker] "
"instances for you. If disabled you'll need to create your own spatial and "
"persistence context and perform your own discovery queries.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This functionality requires that spatial anchors are supported "
"and enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ພວກເຮົາຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານລະບົບພາຍໃນສຳລັບການຈັດການຈຸດຢຶດໜ່ວງ "
"(anchors)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], we enable the built-in logic for handling plane "
"detection. Godot will query detected planes (walls, floors, ceilings, etc.) "
"and manage [OpenXRPlaneTracker] instances for you. If disabled you'll need to "
"create your own spatial context and perform your own discovery queries.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This functionality requires that plane tracking is supported and "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ພວກເຮົາຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານລະບົບພາຍໃນສຳລັບການຈັດການການກວດຈັບພື້ນພຽງ "
"(planes)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], support for the persistent anchors extension is "
"requested. If supported, you will be able to store spatial anchors and they "
"will be restored on application startup.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This requires that the OpenXR spatial entities, spatial anchors, "
"and spatial persistence extensions are supported by the XR runtime. If not "
"supported this setting will be ignored. [member xr/openxr/extensions/"
"spatial_entity/enabled] and [member xr/openxr/extensions/spatial_entity/"
"enable_spatial_anchors] must be enabled for this setting to be used."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີການຂໍຮອງຮັບສ່ວນເສີມ persistent anchors. ຫາກຮອງຮັບ, "
"ເຈົ້າຈະສາມາດເກັບຮັກສາຈຸດຢຶດໜ່ວງໃນພື້ນທີ່ (spatial anchors) ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], support for the plane tracking extension is requested. "
"If supported, you will be able to query information about planes detected by "
"the XR runtime, e.g. walls, floors, etc.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This requires that the OpenXR spatial entities and plane "
"tracking extensions are supported by the XR runtime. If not supported this "
"setting will be ignored. [member xr/openxr/extensions/spatial_entity/enabled] "
"must be enabled for this setting to be used."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີການຂໍຮອງຮັບສ່ວນເສີມການຕິດຕາມພື້ນພຽງ. ຫາກຮອງຮັບ, "
"ເຈົ້າຈະສາມາດສອບຖາມຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບພື້ນພຽງທີ່ກວດພົບໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ ຝາ, ພື້ນ, ແລະອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], support for the spatial anchors extension is requested. "
"If supported, you will be able to register anchor locations in the real world "
"that the XR runtime will adjust as needed and/or potentially share with other "
"headsets.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This requires that the OpenXR spatial entities and spatial "
"anchors extensions are supported by the XR runtime. If not supported this "
"setting will be ignored. [member xr/openxr/extensions/spatial_entity/enabled] "
"must be enabled for this setting to be used."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີການຂໍຮອງຮັບສ່ວນເສີມ spatial anchors. ຫາກຮອງຮັບ, "
"ເຈົ້າຈະສາມາດລົງທະບຽນຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດຢຶດໜ່ວງໃນໂລກຈິງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], support for the spatial entity extension is requested. "
"If supported, you will be able to access spatial information about the real "
"environment around you. What information is available is dependent on "
"additional extensions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This requires that the OpenXR spatial entities extension is "
"supported by the XR runtime. If not supported this setting will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີການຂໍຮອງຮັບສ່ວນເສີມ spatial entity. ຫາກຮອງຮັບ, "
"ເຈົ້າຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນທີ່ກ່ຽວກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈິງອ້ອມຕົວເຈົ້າໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the user presence extension is enabled if available."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສ່ວນເສີມ user presence ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຫາກມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Specify whether OpenXR should be configured for an HMD or a hand held device."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າ OpenXR ຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ HMD ຫຼື ອຸປະກອນແບບຖື."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] and foveation is supported, will automatically adjust "
"foveation level based on framerate up to the level set on [member xr/openxr/"
"foveation_level]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ຮອງຮັບ foveation, ຈະມີການປັບລະດັບ foveation "
"ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມອັດຕາເຟຣມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] and foveation level is set to anything other than "
"\"Disabled\", eye-tracked foveation will be used, so long as it's supported "
"by the headset."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີການໃຊ້ eye-tracked foveation ຫາກແວ່ນ XR ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid ""
"Applied foveation level if supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On platforms other than Android, if [member rendering/"
"anti_aliasing/quality/msaa_3d] is enabled, this feature will be disabled."
msgstr "ລະດັບ foveation ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ ຫາກຮອງຮັບ."

msgid "Specify the default reference space."
msgstr "ກຳນົດພື້ນທີ່ອ້າງອີງ (reference space) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], Godot will display an alert modal when OpenXR "
"initialization fails on startup."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], Godot ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມເຕືອນຫາກການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ OpenXR ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], OpenXR will manage the depth buffer and use the depth "
"buffer for advanced reprojection provided this is supported by the XR "
"runtime. Note that some rendering features in Godot can't be used with this "
"feature."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], OpenXR ຈະຈັດການ depth buffer ແລະ ໃຊ້ depth buffer "
"ສຳລັບການເຮັດ reprojection ຂັ້ນສູງ."

msgid ""
"Optionally sets a specific API version of OpenXR to initialize in "
"[code]major.minor.patch[/code] notation. Some XR runtimes gate old behavior "
"behind version checks. This is non-standard OpenXR behavior."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດເວີຊັນ API ສະເພາະຂອງ OpenXR ທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນຮູບແບບ [code]major.minor.patch[/code]."

msgid ""
"Specify the view configuration with which to configure OpenXR setting up "
"either Mono or Stereo rendering."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດການຕັ້ງຄ່າມຸມມອງ (view configuration) ສຳລັບ OpenXR ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນການປະມວນຜົນແບບ Mono "
"ຫຼື Stereo."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], Godot will compile shaders required for XR."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], Godot ຈະຄອມໄພລ໌ເຊດເດີທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ XR."

msgid "Emitted when any setting is changed, up to once per process frame."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃດໆ, ສູງສຸດໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງຕໍ່ເຟຣມ."

msgid "Interpolates an [Object]'s property over time."
msgstr "ທຳການອິນເຕີໂພເລດ (interpolate) ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ [Object] ຕາມເວລາ."

msgid ""
"[PropertyTweener] is used to interpolate a property in an object. See [method "
"Tween.tween_property] for more usage information.\n"
"The tweener will finish automatically if the target object is freed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method Tween.tween_property] is the only correct way to create "
"[PropertyTweener]. Any [PropertyTweener] created manually will not function "
"correctly."
msgstr ""
"[PropertyTweener] ໃຊ້ເພື່ອອິນເຕີໂພເລດຄຸນສົມບັດໃນວັດຖຸ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"Tween.tween_property] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນການໃຊ້ງານເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"Tweener ຈະສິ້ນສຸດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫາກວັດຖຸເປົ້າໝາຍຖືກລຶບຖິ້ມ (freed).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method Tween.tween_property] ເປັນວິທີດຽວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນການສ້າງ "
"[PropertyTweener]."

msgid ""
"When called, the final value will be used as a relative value instead.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Move the node by [code]100[/code] pixels to the right.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var tween = get_tree().create_tween()\n"
"tween.tween_property(self, \"position\", Vector2.RIGHT * 100, "
"1).as_relative()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Tween tween = GetTree().CreateTween();\n"
"tween.TweenProperty(this, \"position\", Vector2.Right * 100.0f, "
"1.0f).AsRelative();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຖືກເອີ້ນ, ຄ່າສຸດທ້າຍຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າສຳພັດ (relative value) ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ຍ້າຍໂນດໄປທາງຂວາ [code]100[/code] ພິກເຊວ."

msgid ""
"Sets a custom initial value to the [PropertyTweener].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Move the node from position [code](100, 100)[/code] to [code]"
"(200, 100)[/code].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var tween = get_tree().create_tween()\n"
"tween.tween_property(self, \"position\", Vector2(200, 100), "
"1).from(Vector2(100, 100))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Tween tween = GetTree().CreateTween();\n"
"tween.TweenProperty(this, \"position\", new Vector2(200.0f, 100.0f), "
"1.0f).From(new Vector2(100.0f, 100.0f));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແບບກຳນົດເອງໃຫ້ກັບ [PropertyTweener].\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ຍ້າຍໂນດຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງ [code](100, 100)[/code] ໄປຫາ [code](200, 100)[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Makes the [PropertyTweener] use the current property value (i.e. at the time "
"of creating this [PropertyTweener]) as a starting point. This is equivalent "
"of using [method from] with the current value. These two calls will do the "
"same:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"tween.tween_property(self, \"position\", Vector2(200, 100), "
"1).from(position)\n"
"tween.tween_property(self, \"position\", Vector2(200, 100), "
"1).from_current()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"tween.TweenProperty(this, \"position\", new Vector2(200.0f, 100.0f), "
"1.0f).From(Position);\n"
"tween.TweenProperty(this, \"position\", new Vector2(200.0f, 100.0f), "
"1.0f).FromCurrent();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ [PropertyTweener] ໃຊ້ຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດປັດຈຸບັນເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Allows interpolating the value with a custom easing function. The provided "
"[param interpolator_method] will be called with a value ranging from "
"[code]0.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code] and is expected to return a value within "
"the same range (values outside the range can be used for overshoot). The "
"return value of the method is then used for interpolation between initial and "
"final value. Note that the parameter passed to the method is still subject to "
"the tweener's own easing.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@export var curve: Curve\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar tween = create_tween()\n"
"\t# Interpolate the value using a custom curve.\n"
"\ttween.tween_property(self, \"position:x\", 300, "
"1).as_relative().set_custom_interpolator(tween_curve)\n"
"\n"
"func tween_curve(v):\n"
"\treturn curve.sample_baked(v)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Export]\n"
"public Curve Curve { get; set; }\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tTween tween = CreateTween();\n"
"\t// Interpolate the value using a custom curve.\n"
"\tCallable tweenCurveCallable = Callable.From<float, float>(TweenCurve);\n"
"\ttween.TweenProperty(this, \"position:x\", 300.0f, "
"1.0f).AsRelative().SetCustomInterpolator(tweenCurveCallable);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private float TweenCurve(float value)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn Curve.SampleBaked(value);\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ອິນເຕີໂພເລດຄ່າດ້ວຍຟັງຊັນ easing ແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the time in seconds after which the [PropertyTweener] will start "
"interpolating. By default there's no delay."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດເວລາເປັນວິນາທີກ່ອນທີ່ [PropertyTweener] ຈະເລີ່ມການອິນເຕີໂພເລດ. "
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນຈະບໍ່ມີການຊັກຊ້າ."

msgid "Class representing a square mesh facing the camera."
msgstr "ຄລາດທີ່ແທນເມຊ (mesh) ຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມທີ່ປິ່ນໜ້າເຂົ້າຫາ ກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Class representing a square [PrimitiveMesh]. This flat mesh does not have a "
"thickness. By default, this mesh is aligned on the X and Y axes; this "
"rotation is more suited for use with billboarded materials. A [QuadMesh] is "
"equivalent to a [PlaneMesh] except its default [member PlaneMesh.orientation] "
"is [constant PlaneMesh.FACE_Z]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດທີ່ແທນ [PrimitiveMesh] ຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມ. ເມຊແບບແປນີ້ນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຄວາມໜາ.\n"
"A [QuadMesh] ແມ່ນທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [PlaneMesh] ຍົກເວັ້ນຄ່າ [member PlaneMesh.orientation] "
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [constant PlaneMesh.FACE_Z]."

msgid "2D in 3D Viewport Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ 2D ໃນ 3D Viewport"

msgid "Flat plane shape for use with occlusion culling in [OccluderInstance3D]."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງແຜ່ນພຽງສຳລັບໃຊ້ກັບ occlusion culling ໃນ [OccluderInstance3D]."

msgid ""
"[QuadOccluder3D] stores a flat plane shape that can be used by the engine's "
"occlusion culling system. See also [PolygonOccluder3D] if you need to "
"customize the quad's shape.\n"
"See [OccluderInstance3D]'s documentation for instructions on setting up "
"occlusion culling."
msgstr ""
"[QuadOccluder3D] ເກັບຮັກສາຮູບຊົງແຜ່ນພຽງທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໂດຍລະບົບ occlusion culling "
"ຂອງເອັນຈິນໄດ້."

msgid "The quad's size in 3D units."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງ quad ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍ 3D."

msgid "A unit quaternion used for representing 3D rotations."
msgstr "ຄວາເຕີນຽນຫົວໜ່ວຍ (unit quaternion) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແທນການໝູນ 3D."

msgid ""
"The [Quaternion] built-in [Variant] type is a 4D data structure that "
"represents rotation in the form of a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Quaternions_and_spatial_rotation]Hamilton convention quaternion[/url]. "
"Compared to the [Basis] type which can store both rotation and scale, "
"quaternions can [i]only[/i] store rotation.\n"
"A [Quaternion] is composed by 4 floating-point components: [member w], "
"[member x], [member y], and [member z]. These components are very compact in "
"memory, and because of this some operations are more efficient and less "
"likely to cause floating-point errors. Methods such as [method get_angle], "
"[method get_axis], and [method slerp] are faster than their [Basis] "
"counterparts.\n"
"For a great introduction to quaternions, see [url=https://www.youtube.com/"
"watch?v=d4EgbgTm0Bg]this video by 3Blue1Brown[/url]. You do not need to know "
"the math behind quaternions, as Godot provides several helper methods that "
"handle it for you. These include [method slerp] and [method "
"spherical_cubic_interpolate], as well as the [code]*[/code] operator.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Quaternions must be normalized before being used for rotation "
"(see [method normalized]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Similarly to [Vector2] and [Vector3], the components of a "
"quaternion use 32-bit precision by default, unlike [float] which is always 64-"
"bit. If double precision is needed, compile the engine with the option "
"[code]precision=double[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a quaternion will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if it's equal to [constant IDENTITY]. Otherwise, a quaternion will "
"always evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນ [Quaternion] ແມ່ນໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ 4 ມິຕິ ທີ່ແທນການໝູນໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ Hamilton "
"convention quaternion. ເມື່ອທຽບກັບ [Basis] ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເກັບໄດ້ທັງການໝູນ ແລະ ຂະໜາດ, "
"ຄວາເຕີນຽນສາມາດເກັບໄດ້ [i]ສະເພາະ[/i] ການໝູນເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[Quaternion] ປະກອບດ້ວຍ 4 ສ່ວນປະກອບຄື: [member w], [member x], [member y], ແລະ "
"[member z]. ສ່ວນປະກອບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໜ້ອຍຫຼາຍ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຮັດວຽກບາງຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງກວ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄວາເຕີນຽນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຫົວໜ່ວຍ (normalized) "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະນຳໄປໃຊ້ໃນການໝູນ."

msgid "3Blue1Brown's video on Quaternions"
msgstr "ວິດີໂອຂອງ 3Blue1Brown ກ່ຽວກັບ Quaternions"

msgid "Online Quaternion Visualization"
msgstr "ການສະແດງພາບ Quaternion ແບບອອນລາຍ"

msgid "Advanced Quaternion Visualization"
msgstr "ການສະແດງພາບ Quaternion ແບບຂັ້ນສູງ"

msgid ""
"Constructs a [Quaternion] identical to [constant IDENTITY].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, this constructs a [Quaternion] with all of its components "
"set to [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Quaternion] ທີ່ຄືກັບ [constant IDENTITY]."

msgid "Constructs a [Quaternion] as a copy of the given [Quaternion]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Quaternion] ໂດຍການຄັດລອກຈາກ [Quaternion] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Constructs a [Quaternion] representing the shortest arc between [param "
"arc_from] and [param arc_to]. These can be imagined as two points "
"intersecting a sphere's surface, with a radius of [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Quaternion] ທີ່ແທນສ່ວນໂຄ້ງທີ່ສັ້ນທີ່ສຸດລະຫວ່າງ [param arc_from] ແລະ [param arc_to]."

msgid ""
"Constructs a [Quaternion] representing rotation around the [param axis] by "
"the given [param angle], in radians. The axis must be a normalized vector."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Quaternion] ທີ່ແທນການໝູນອ້ອມ [param axis] ດ້ວຍ [param angle] ທີ່ກຳນົດເປັນເຣດຽນ."

msgid ""
"Constructs a [Quaternion] from the given rotation [Basis].\n"
"This constructor is faster than [method Basis.get_rotation_quaternion], but "
"the given basis must be [i]orthonormalized[/i] (see [method "
"Basis.orthonormalized]). Otherwise, the constructor fails and returns "
"[constant IDENTITY]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Quaternion] ຈາກ [Basis] ຂອງການໝູນທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Constructs a [Quaternion] defined by the given values.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only normalized quaternions represent rotation; if these values "
"are not normalized, the new [Quaternion] will not be a valid rotation."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Quaternion] ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍຄ່າທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the angle between this quaternion and [param to]. This is the "
"magnitude of the angle you would need to rotate by to get from one to the "
"other.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The magnitude of the floating-point error for this method is "
"abnormally high, so methods such as [code]is_zero_approx[/code] will not work "
"reliably."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າມຸມລະຫວ່າງຄວາເຕີນຽນນີ້ ແລະ [param to]."

msgid ""
"Returns the dot product between this quaternion and [param with].\n"
"This is equivalent to [code](quat.x * with.x) + (quat.y * with.y) + (quat.z * "
"with.z) + (quat.w * with.w)[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ dot product ລະຫວ່າງຄວາເຕີນຽນນີ້ ແລະ [param with]."

msgid ""
"Returns the exponential of this quaternion. The rotation axis of the result "
"is the normalized rotation axis of this quaternion, the angle of the result "
"is the length of the vector part of this quaternion."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ exponential ຂອງ quaternion ນີ້. "
"ແກນການໝຸນຂອງຜົນລັບແມ່ນແກນການໝຸນທີ່ຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ (normalized) ຂອງ quaternion "
"ນີ້, ມຸມຂອງຜົນລັບແມ່ນຄວາມຍາວຂອງສ່ວນເວກເຕີຂອງ quaternion ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Constructs a new [Quaternion] from the given [Vector3] of [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Euler_angles]Euler angles[/url], in radians. In Godot, "
"Euler angles always use intrinsic order. This method always uses the "
"intrinsic YXZ convention ([constant EULER_ORDER_YXZ])."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Quaternion] ໃໝ່ຈາກ [Vector3] ຂອງ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Euler_angles]ມຸມອອຍເລີ (Euler angles)[/url] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້, ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍເຣເດຍ (radians). ໃນ "
"Godot, ມຸມອອຍເລີຈະໃຊ້ລໍາດັບແບບ intrinsic ສະເໝີ. ເມທອດນີ້ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ intrinsic YXZ "
"([constant EULER_ORDER_YXZ]) ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the angle of the rotation represented by this quaternion.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The quaternion must be normalized."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າມຸມຂອງການໝຸນທີ່ສະແດງໂດຍ quaternion ນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] quaternion ຕ້ອງຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ (normalized) ກ່ອນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the rotation axis of the rotation represented by this quaternion."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າແກນການໝຸນຂອງການໝຸນທີ່ສະແດງໂດຍ quaternion ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns this quaternion's rotation as a [Vector3] of [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Euler_angles]Euler angles[/url], in radians.\n"
"The order of each consecutive rotation can be changed with [param order] (see "
"[enum EulerOrder] constants). In Godot, Euler angles always use intrinsic "
"order. By default, the intrinsic YXZ convention is used ([constant "
"EULER_ORDER_YXZ]): since we are decomposing, local Z (roll) is calculated "
"first, then local X (pitch), and lastly local Y (yaw). When using the "
"opposite method [method from_euler] to compose a rotation, this order is "
"reversed."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າການໝຸນຂອງ quaternion ນີ້ເປັນ [Vector3] ຂອງ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Euler_angles]ມຸມອອຍເລີ (Euler angles)[/url], ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍເຣເດຍ (radians).\n"
"ລໍາດັບຂອງການໝຸນແຕ່ລະອັນສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [param order] (ເບິ່ງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum EulerOrder]). "
"ໃນ Godot, ມຸມອອຍເລີຈະໃຊ້ລໍາດັບແບບ intrinsic ສະເໝີ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ intrinsic "
"YXZ ([constant EULER_ORDER_YXZ]): ເນື່ອງຈາກພວກເຮົາກຳລັງແຍກສ່ວນປະກອບ, Z ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ "
"(roll) ຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ກ່ອນ, ຈາກນັ້ນແມ່ນ X ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (pitch), ແລະສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນ Y ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (yaw). "
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ເມທອດກົງກັນຂ້າມ [method from_euler] ເພື່ອສ້າງການໝຸນ, ລໍາດັບນີ້ຈະຖືກປີ້ນກັບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the inverse version of this quaternion, inverting the sign of every "
"component except [member w]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າເວີຊັນປີ້ນ (inverse) ຂອງ quaternion ນີ້, ໂດຍການປີ້ນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂອງທຸກສ່ວນປະກອບຍົກເວັ້ນ "
"[member w]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this quaternion and [param to] are approximately "
"equal, by calling [method @GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] on each component."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ quaternion ນີ້ ແລະ [param to] ມີຄ່າໃກ້ຄຽງກັນ, ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method @GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] ໃນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this quaternion is finite, by calling [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_finite] on each component."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ quaternion ນີ້ເປັນຄ່າສິ້ນສຸດ (finite), ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_finite] ໃນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this quaternion is normalized. See also [method "
"normalized]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ quaternion ນີ້ຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ (normalized) ແລ້ວ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method normalized] ຕື່ມ."

msgid "Returns this quaternion's length, also called magnitude."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຄວາມຍາວຂອງ quaternion ນີ້, ຫຼືເອີ້ນວ່າຂະໜາດ (magnitude)."

msgid ""
"Returns this quaternion's length, squared.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is faster than [method length], so prefer it if you "
"only need to compare quaternion lengths."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຄວາມຍາວຍົກກຳລັງສອງຂອງ quaternion ນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄວກວ່າ [method length], "
"ສະນັ້ນຄວນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການພຽງແຕ່ປຽບທຽບຄວາມຍາວຂອງ quaternion."

msgid ""
"Returns the logarithm of this quaternion. Multiplies this quaternion's "
"rotation axis by its rotation angle, and stores the result in the returned "
"quaternion's vector part ([member x], [member y], and [member z]). The "
"returned quaternion's real part ([member w]) is always [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ logarithm ຂອງ quaternion ນີ້. ຄູນແກນການໝຸນຂອງ quaternion ນີ້ດ້ວຍມຸມການໝຸນຂອງມັນ, "
"ແລະເກັບຜົນລັບໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນເວກເຕີຂອງ quaternion ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ ([member x], [member y], ແລະ "
"[member z]). ສ່ວນຈິງ (real part) ຂອງ quaternion ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ ([member w]) ຈະເປັນ "
"[code]0.0[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of this quaternion, normalized so that its length is "
"[code]1.0[/code]. See also [method is_normalized]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າສຳເນົາຂອງ quaternion ນີ້, ທີ່ຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄວາມຍາວຂອງມັນແມ່ນ "
"[code]1.0[/code]. ເບິ່ງ [method is_normalized] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Performs a spherical-linear interpolation with the [param to] quaternion, "
"given a [param weight] and returns the result. Both this quaternion and "
"[param to] must be normalized."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດການແຊກຄ່າແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ໃນຊົງກົມ (spherical-linear interpolation) ກັບ quaternion "
"[param to], ໂດຍກຳນົດຄ່າ [param weight] ແລະ ຄືນຄ່າຜົນລັບ. ທັງ quaternion ນີ້ ແລະ [param "
"to] ຕ້ອງຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ (normalized)."

msgid ""
"Performs a spherical-linear interpolation with the [param to] quaternion, "
"given a [param weight] and returns the result. Unlike [method slerp], this "
"method does not check if the rotation path is smaller than 90 degrees. Both "
"this quaternion and [param to] must be normalized."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດການແຊກຄ່າແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ໃນຊົງກົມກັບ quaternion [param to], ໂດຍກຳນົດຄ່າ [param weight] "
"ແລະ ຄືນຄ່າຜົນລັບ. ບໍ່ຄືກັບ [method slerp], ເມທອດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ກວດສອບວ່າເສັ້ນທາງການໝຸນນ້ອຍກວ່າ 90 "
"ອົງສາຫຼືບໍ່. ທັງ quaternion ນີ້ ແລະ [param to] ຕ້ອງຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ (normalized)."

msgid ""
"W component of the quaternion. This is the \"real\" part.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Quaternion components should usually not be manipulated directly."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນປະກອບ W ຂອງ quaternion. ນີ້ຄືສ່ວນ \"ຈິງ\" (real part).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ Quaternion ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ຄວນຖືກຈັດການໂດຍກົງ."

msgid ""
"X component of the quaternion. This is the value along the \"imaginary\" "
"[code]i[/code] axis.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Quaternion components should usually not be manipulated directly."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນປະກອບ X ຂອງ quaternion. ນີ້ຄືຄ່າຕາມແກນ \"ຈິນຕະນາການ\" [code]i[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ Quaternion ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ຄວນຖືກຈັດການໂດຍກົງ."

msgid ""
"Y component of the quaternion. This is the value along the \"imaginary\" "
"[code]j[/code] axis.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Quaternion components should usually not be manipulated directly."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນປະກອບ Y ຂອງ quaternion. ນີ້ຄືຄ່າຕາມແກນ \"ຈິນຕະນາການ\" [code]j[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ Quaternion ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ຄວນຖືກຈັດການໂດຍກົງ."

msgid ""
"Z component of the quaternion. This is the value along the \"imaginary\" "
"[code]k[/code] axis.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Quaternion components should usually not be manipulated directly."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນປະກອບ Z ຂອງ quaternion. ນີ້ຄືຄ່າຕາມແກນ \"ຈິນຕະນາການ\" [code]k[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ Quaternion ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ຄວນຖືກຈັດການໂດຍກົງ."

msgid ""
"The identity quaternion, representing no rotation. This has the same rotation "
"as [constant Basis.IDENTITY].\n"
"If a [Vector3] is rotated (multiplied) by this quaternion, it does not "
"change.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In GDScript, this constant is equivalent to creating a "
"[constructor Quaternion] without any arguments. It can be used to make your "
"code clearer, and for consistency with C#."
msgstr ""
"ຄວໍເທີນຽນເອກະລັກ, ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງການບໍ່ມີການໝຸນ. ນີ້ມີການໝຸນຄືກັນກັບ [ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ Basis.IDENTITY].\n"
"ຖ້າ [Vector3] ຖືກໝຸນ (ຄູນ) ດ້ວຍຄວໍເທີນຽນນີ້, ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ GDScript, ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ນີ້ແມ່ນທຽບເທົ່າກັບການສ້າງ [ຕົວສ້າງ Quaternion] "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ມີອາກິວເມັນໃດໆ. ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ໂຄ້ດຂອງທ່ານຊັດເຈນຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ ເພື່ອຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງກັບ C#."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the components of both quaternions are not "
"exactly equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, consider using [method "
"is_equal_approx] instead, which is more reliable."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງທັງສອງ quaternions ບໍ່ເທົ່າກັນທັງໝົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ (floating-point), "
"ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [method is_equal_approx] ແທນ ເຊິ່ງຈະມີຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Composes (multiplies) two quaternions. This rotates the [param right] "
"quaternion (the child) by this quaternion (the parent)."
msgstr ""
"ປະສົມ (ຄູນ) ສອງ quaternions. ນີ້ຈະໝຸນ quaternion [param right] (ຕົວລູກ) ດ້ວຍ "
"quaternion ນີ້ (ຕົວແມ່)."

msgid ""
"Rotates (multiplies) the [param right] vector by this quaternion, returning a "
"[Vector3]."
msgstr "ໝຸນ (ຄູນ) ເວກເຕີ [param right] ດ້ວຍ quaternion ນີ້, ແລ້ວຄືນຄ່າເປັນ [Vector3]."

msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Quaternion] by the right [float] value.\n"
"This operation is not meaningful on its own, but it can be used as a part of "
"a larger expression."
msgstr ""
"ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Quaternion] ດ້ວຍຄ່າ [float] ທາງຂວາ.\n"
"ການປະຕິບັດການນີ້ບໍ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍໃນຕົວມັນເອງ, ແຕ່ມັນສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງນິພົດທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Quaternion] by the right [int] value.\n"
"This operation is not meaningful on its own, but it can be used as a part of "
"a larger expression."
msgstr ""
"ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Quaternion] ດ້ວຍຄ່າ [int] ທາງຂວາ.\n"
"ການປະຕິບັດການນີ້ບໍ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍໃນຕົວມັນເອງ, ແຕ່ມັນສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງນິພົດທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Adds each component of the left [Quaternion] to the right [Quaternion].\n"
"This operation is not meaningful on its own, but it can be used as a part of "
"a larger expression, such as approximating an intermediate rotation between "
"two nearby rotations."
msgstr ""
"ບວກແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Quaternion] ທາງຊ້າຍ ເຂົ້າກັບ [Quaternion] ທາງຂວາ.\n"
"ການປະຕິບັດການນີ້ບໍ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍໃນຕົວມັນເອງ, ແຕ່ມັນສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງນິພົດທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ການປະມານຄ່າການໝຸນລະຫວ່າງກາງຂອງການໝຸນສອງອັນທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັນ."

msgid ""
"Subtracts each component of the left [Quaternion] by the right [Quaternion].\n"
"This operation is not meaningful on its own, but it can be used as a part of "
"a larger expression."
msgstr ""
"ລົບແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Quaternion] ທາງຊ້າຍ ດ້ວຍ [Quaternion] ທາງຂວາ.\n"
"ການປະຕິບັດການນີ້ບໍ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍໃນຕົວມັນເອງ, ແຕ່ມັນສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງນິພົດທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Divides each component of the [Quaternion] by the right [float] value.\n"
"This operation is not meaningful on its own, but it can be used as a part of "
"a larger expression."
msgstr ""
"ຫານແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Quaternion] ດ້ວຍຄ່າ [float] ທາງຂວາ.\n"
"ການປະຕິບັດການນີ້ບໍ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍໃນຕົວມັນເອງ, ແຕ່ມັນສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງນິພົດທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Divides each component of the [Quaternion] by the right [int] value.\n"
"This operation is not meaningful on its own, but it can be used as a part of "
"a larger expression."
msgstr ""
"ຫານແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Quaternion] ດ້ວຍຄ່າ [int] ທາງຂວາ.\n"
"ການປະຕິບັດການນີ້ບໍ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍໃນຕົວມັນເອງ, ແຕ່ມັນສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງນິພົດທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the components of both quaternions are exactly "
"equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, consider using [method "
"is_equal_approx] instead, which is more reliable."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງທັງສອງ quaternions ເທົ່າກັນພໍດີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ (floating-point), "
"ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [method is_equal_approx] ແທນ ເຊິ່ງຈະມີຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Accesses each component of this quaternion by their index.\n"
"Index [code]0[/code] is the same as [member x], index [code]1[/code] is the "
"same as [member y], index [code]2[/code] is the same as [member z], and index "
"[code]3[/code] is the same as [member w]."
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າເຖິງແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ quaternion ນີ້ດ້ວຍດັດຊະນີ (index) ຂອງພວກມັນ.\n"
"ດັດຊະນີ [code]0[/code] ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບ [member x], ດັດຊະນີ [code]1[/code] ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບ "
"[member y], ດັດຊະນີ [code]2[/code] ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບ [member z], ແລະ ດັດຊະນີ [code]3[/"
"code] ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບ [member w]."

msgid ""
"Returns the negative value of the [Quaternion]. This is the same as "
"multiplying all components by [code]-1[/code]. This operation results in a "
"quaternion that represents the same rotation."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າລົບຂອງ [Quaternion]. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບການຄູນທຸກສ່ວນປະກອບດ້ວຍ [code]-1[/code]. "
"ການປະຕິບັດການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ໄດ້ quaternion ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງການໝຸນດຽວກັນ."

msgid "Provides methods for generating pseudo-random numbers."
msgstr "ສະໜອງເມທອດສຳລັບການສ້າງຕົວເລກສຸ່ມທຽມ (pseudo-random numbers)."

msgid ""
"RandomNumberGenerator is a class for generating pseudo-random numbers. It "
"currently uses [url=https://www.pcg-random.org/]PCG32[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The underlying algorithm is an implementation detail and should "
"not be depended upon.\n"
"To generate a random float number (within a given range) based on a time-"
"dependent seed:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var rng = RandomNumberGenerator.new()\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar my_random_number = rng.randf_range(-10.0, 10.0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"RandomNumberGenerator ແມ່ນຄລາສສຳລັບການສ້າງຕົວເລກສຸ່ມທຽມ. ໃນປັດຈຸບັນມັນໃຊ້ [url=https://"
"www.pcg-random.org/]PCG32[/url].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອັນກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງແມ່ນລາຍລະອຽດຂອງການເຮັດວຽກພາຍໃນ ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ຄວນຖືກນຳໄປໃຊ້ເປັນບ່ອນອີງຫຼັກ.\n"
"ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວເລກທົດສະນິຍົມສຸ່ມ (ພາຍໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ກຳນົດ) ໂດຍອີງຕາມ seed ທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບເວລາ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var rng = RandomNumberGenerator.new()\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar my_random_number = rng.randf_range(-10.0, 10.0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns a random integer between [code]0[/code] and the size of the array "
"that is passed as a parameter. Each value in the array should be a non-"
"negative floating-point number that represents the relative likelihood that "
"it will be returned as an index. A higher value means the value is more "
"likely to be returned as an index, while a value of [code]0[/code] means it "
"will never be returned as an index.\n"
"For example, if [code skip-lint][0.5, 1, 1, 2][/code] is passed as a "
"parameter, then the method is twice as likely to return [code]3[/code] (the "
"index of the value [code]2[/code]) and twice as unlikely to return [code]0[/"
"code] (the index of the value [code]0.5[/code]) compared to the indices "
"[code]1[/code] and [code]2[/code].\n"
"Prints an error and returns [code]-1[/code] if the array is empty or contains "
"any negative values.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var rng = RandomNumberGenerator.new()\n"
"\n"
"var my_array = [\"one\", \"two\", \"three\", \"four\"]\n"
"var weights = PackedFloat32Array([0.5, 1, 1, 2])\n"
"\n"
"# Prints one of the four elements in `my_array`.\n"
"# It is more likely to print \"four\", and less likely to print \"one\".\n"
"print(my_array[rng.rand_weighted(weights)])\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເລກຈຳນວນຖ້ວນແບບສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/code] ຫາ ຂະໜາດຂອງອາເຣທີ່ສົ່ງມາເປັນພາຣາມິເຕີ. "
"ແຕ່ລະຄ່າໃນອາເຣຄວນເປັນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມທີ່ບໍ່ຕິດລົບ ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເຖິງໂອກາດທີ່ຄ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນເປັນດັດຊະນີ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມີໂອກາດຖືກສົ່ງຄືນເປັນດັດຊະນີຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າ [code]0[/code] "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງຄືນເປັນດັດຊະນີເລີຍ.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຖ້າ [code skip-lint][0.5, 1, 1, 2][/code] ຖືກສົ່ງມາເປັນພາຣາມິເຕີ, "
"ເມທອດນີ້ຈະມີໂອກາດສົ່ງຄືນ [code]3[/code] (ດັດຊະນີຂອງຄ່າ [code]2[/code]) ເປັນສອງເທົ່າ ແລະ "
"ມີໂອກາດໜ້ອຍລົງເປັນສອງເທົ່າທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]0[/code] (ດັດຊະນີຂອງຄ່າ [code]0.5[/code]) "
"ເມື່ອທຽບກັບດັດຊະນີ [code]1[/code] ແລະ [code]2[/code].\n"
"ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]-1[/code] ຖ້າອາເຣວ່າງເປົ່າ ຫຼື ມີຄ່າທີ່ຕິດລົບ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var rng = RandomNumberGenerator.new()\n"
"\n"
"var my_array = [\"one\", \"two\", \"three\", \"four\"]\n"
"var weights = PackedFloat32Array([0.5, 1, 1, 2])\n"
"\n"
"# ສະແດງໜຶ່ງໃນສີ່ອົງປະກອບໃນ `my_array`.\n"
"# ມັນມີໂອກາດສະແດງ \"four\" ຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ແລະ ໂອກາດສະແດງ \"one\" ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ.\n"
"print(my_array[rng.rand_weighted(weights)])\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns a pseudo-random float between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] "
"(inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຕົວເລກທົດສະນິຍົມສຸ່ມທຽມລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/code] ແລະ [code]1.0[/code] "
"(ລວມທັງສອງຄ່ານີ້)."

msgid ""
"Returns a pseudo-random float between [param from] and [param to] (inclusive)."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຕົວເລກທົດສະນິຍົມສຸ່ມທຽມລະຫວ່າງ [param from] ແລະ [param to] (ລວມທັງສອງຄ່ານີ້)."

msgid ""
"Returns a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Normal_distribution]normally-"
"distributed[/url], pseudo-random floating-point number from the specified "
"[param mean] and a standard [param deviation]. This is also known as a "
"Gaussian distribution.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method uses the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Box%E2%80%93Muller_transform]Box-Muller transform[/url] algorithm."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຕົວເລກທົດສະນິຍົມສຸ່ມທຽມແບບ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Normal_distribution]ມີການແຈກຢາຍປົກກະຕິ (normally-distributed)[/url] ຈາກຄ່າສະເລ່ຍ "
"[param mean] ແລະ ຄ່າຜັນປ່ຽນມາດຕະຖານ [param deviation] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. "
"ນີ້ເອີ້ນອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງວ່າການແຈກຢາຍແບບ Gaussian.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ໃຊ້ຫົວຄິດປະດິດສ້າງ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Box%E2%80%93Muller_transform]Box-Muller transform[/url]."

msgid ""
"Returns a pseudo-random 32-bit unsigned integer between [code]0[/code] and "
"[code]4294967295[/code] (inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຕົວເລກຖ້ວນສຸ່ມທຽມ 32-ບິດ ແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ (unsigned) ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]4294967295[/code] (ລວມທັງສອງຄ່ານີ້)."

msgid ""
"Returns a pseudo-random 32-bit signed integer between [param from] and [param "
"to] (inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຕົວເລກຖ້ວນສຸ່ມທຽມ 32-ບິດ ແບບມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ (signed) ລະຫວ່າງ [param from] ແລະ [param "
"to] (ລວມທັງສອງຄ່ານີ້)."

msgid ""
"Sets up a time-based seed for this [RandomNumberGenerator] instance. Unlike "
"the [@GlobalScope] random number generation functions, different "
"[RandomNumberGenerator] instances can use different seeds."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ seed ໂດຍອີງຕາມເວລາສຳລັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ຂອງ [RandomNumberGenerator] ນີ້. "
"ບໍ່ຄືກັບຟັງຊັນການສ້າງຕົວເລກສຸ່ມໃນ [@GlobalScope], ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງ [RandomNumberGenerator] "
"ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນສາມາດໃຊ້ seed ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Initializes the random number generator state based on the given seed value. "
"A given seed will give a reproducible sequence of pseudo-random numbers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The RNG does not have an avalanche effect, and can output "
"similar random streams given similar seeds. Consider using a hash function to "
"improve your seed quality if they're sourced externally.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default value of this property is pseudo-random, and changes "
"when calling [method randomize]. The [code]0[/code] value documented here is "
"a placeholder, and not the actual default seed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this property produces a side effect of changing the "
"internal [member state], so make sure to initialize the seed [i]before[/i] "
"modifying the [member state]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var rng = RandomNumberGenerator.new()\n"
"rng.seed = hash(\"Godot\")\n"
"rng.state = 100 # Restore to some previously saved state.\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສະຖານະຂອງການສ້າງຕົວເລກສຸ່ມໂດຍອີງຕາມຄ່າ seed ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. seed "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຈະໃຫ້ລໍາດັບຂອງຕົວເລກສຸ່ມທຽມທີ່ສາມາດສ້າງຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] RNG ບໍ່ມີເອັບເຟັກ avalanche ແລະ ອາດຈະໃຫ້ລໍາດັບການສຸ່ມທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນຖ້າໃຫ້ seed "
"ທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ. ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ hash ເພື່ອປັບປຸງຄຸນນະພາບຂອງ seed "
"ຂອງທ່ານຖ້າມັນມາຈາກແຫຼ່ງພາຍນອກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ແມ່ນແບບສຸ່ມທຽມ ແລະ ຈະປ່ຽນແປງເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"randomize]. ຄ່າ [code]0[/code] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຢູ່ນີ້ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ບ່ອນວ່າງ (placeholder) ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄ່າ "
"seed ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ແທ້ຈິງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຂ້າງຄຽງໃນການປ່ຽນແປງ [member state] ພາຍໃນ, "
"ສະນັ້ນໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ seed [i]ກ່ອນ[/i] ທີ່ຈະແກ້ໄຂ [member state]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var rng = RandomNumberGenerator.new()\n"
"rng.seed = hash(\"Godot\")\n"
"rng.state = 100 # ກູ້ຄືນສະຖານະທີ່ໄດ້ບັນທຶກໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້.\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"The current state of the random number generator. Save and restore this "
"property to restore the generator to a previous state:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var rng = RandomNumberGenerator.new()\n"
"print(rng.randf())\n"
"var saved_state = rng.state # Store current state.\n"
"print(rng.randf()) # Advance internal state.\n"
"rng.state = saved_state # Restore the state.\n"
"print(rng.randf()) # Prints the same value as previously.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Do not set state to arbitrary values, since the random number "
"generator requires the state to have certain qualities to behave properly. It "
"should only be set to values that came from the state property itself. To "
"initialize the random number generator with arbitrary input, use [member "
"seed] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default value of this property is pseudo-random, and changes "
"when calling [method randomize]. The [code]0[/code] value documented here is "
"a placeholder, and not the actual default state."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງການສ້າງຕົວເລກສຸ່ມ. ບັນທຶກ ແລະ "
"ກູ້ຄືນຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ການສ້າງຕົວເລກສຸ່ມກັບຄືນສູ່ສະຖານະກ່ອນໜ້າ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var rng = RandomNumberGenerator.new()\n"
"print(rng.randf())\n"
"var saved_state = rng.state # ເກັບສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"print(rng.randf()) # ເຮັດໃຫ້ສະຖານະພາຍໃນດຳເນີນຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"
"rng.state = saved_state # ກູ້ຄືນສະຖານະ.\n"
"print(rng.randf()) # ສະແດງຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຢ່າຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຖານະເປັນຄ່າທີ່ສຸ່ມມາເອງ, "
"ເພາະວ່າຕົວສ້າງຕົວເລກສຸ່ມຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສະຖານະມີຄຸນສົມບັດບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. "
"ມັນຄວນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນຄ່າທີ່ມາຈາກຄຸນສົມບັດ state ນີ້ເອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕົວສ້າງຕົວເລກສຸ່ມດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນນໍາເຂົ້າທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member seed] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ແມ່ນແບບສຸ່ມທຽມ ແລະ ຈະປ່ຽນແປງເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"randomize]. ຄ່າ [code]0[/code] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຢູ່ນີ້ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ບ່ອນວ່າງ (placeholder) ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄ່າສະຖານະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ແທ້ຈິງ."

msgid "Abstract base class for controls that represent a number within a range."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານນາມມະທຳສຳລັບຄອນໂທຣລ (controls) ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງຕົວເລກພາຍໃນຊ່ວງໃດໜຶ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Range is an abstract base class for controls that represent a number within a "
"range, using a configured [member step] and [member page] size. See e.g. "
"[ScrollBar] and [Slider] for examples of higher-level nodes using Range."
msgstr ""
"Range ແມ່ນຄລາສພື້ນຖານນາມມະທຳສຳລັບຄອນໂທຣລທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງຕົວເລກພາຍໃນຊ່ວງໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂະໜາດ "
"[member step] ແລະ [member page] ທີ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໄວ້. ເບິ່ງ [ScrollBar] ແລະ [Slider] "
"ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງຂອງໂນດລະດັບສູງທີ່ໃຊ້ Range."

msgid ""
"Called when the [Range]'s value is changed (following the same conditions as "
"[signal value_changed])."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອຄ່າຂອງ [Range] ປ່ຽນແປງ (ພາຍໃຕ້ເງື່ອນໄຂດຽວກັນກັບ [signal value_changed])."

msgid ""
"Sets the [Range]'s current value to the specified [param value], without "
"emitting the [signal value_changed] signal."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ [Range] ເປັນ [param value] ທີ່ລະບຸ, ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການສົ່ງສັນຍານ [signal "
"value_changed]."

msgid ""
"Binds two [Range]s together along with any ranges previously grouped with "
"either of them. When any of range's member variables change, it will share "
"the new value with all other ranges in its group."
msgstr ""
"ຜູກມັດ [Range] ສອງອັນເຂົ້າກັນ ລວມທັງຊ່ວງໃດໆທີ່ເຄີຍຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມໄວ້ກັບອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້. "
"ເມື່ອຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກຂອງຊ່ວງໃດໜຶ່ງປ່ຽນແປງ, ມັນຈະແບ່ງປັນຄ່າໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ວງອື່ນໆທັງໝົດໃນກຸ່ມຂອງມັນ."

msgid "Stops the [Range] from sharing its member variables with any other."
msgstr "ຢຸດການແບ່ງປັນຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກຂອງ [Range] ນີ້ໃຫ້ກັບອັນອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [member value] may be greater than [member max_value]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄ່າ [member value] ອາດຈະຫຼາຍກວ່າ [member max_value]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [member value] may be less than [member min_value]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄ່າ [member value] ອາດຈະນ້ອຍກວ່າ [member min_value]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], and [member min_value] is greater or equal to [code]0[/"
"code], [member value] will be represented exponentially rather than linearly."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແລະ [member min_value] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ [code]0[/"
"code], ຄ່າ [member value] ຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນຮູບແບບ exponential ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ linear."

msgid ""
"Maximum value. Range is clamped if [member value] is greater than [member "
"max_value]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າສູງສຸດ. ຊ່ວງຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ (clamped) ຖ້າ [member value] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [member max_value]."

msgid ""
"Minimum value. Range is clamped if [member value] is less than [member "
"min_value]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດ. ຊ່ວງຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ (clamped) ຖ້າ [member value] ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [member min_value]."

msgid ""
"Page size. Used mainly for [ScrollBar]. A [ScrollBar]'s grabber length is the "
"[ScrollBar]'s size multiplied by [member page] over the difference between "
"[member min_value] and [member max_value]."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດໜ້າ (Page size). ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບ [ScrollBar]. ຄວາມຍາວຂອງປຸ່ມເລື່ອນ (grabber) "
"ຂອງ [ScrollBar] ແມ່ນຂະໜາດຂອງ [ScrollBar] ຄູນດ້ວຍ [member page] ຫານດ້ວຍຜົນຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງ "
"[member min_value] ແລະ [member max_value]."

msgid "The value mapped between 0 and 1."
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຖືກແມັບ (mapped) ໄວ້ລະຫວ່າງ 0 ແລະ 1."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [member value] will always be rounded to the nearest "
"integer."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄ່າ [member value] "
"ຈະຖືກປັດເສດໃຫ້ເປັນຕົວເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງທີ່ສຸດສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"If greater than [code]0.0[/code], [member value] will always be rounded to a "
"multiple of this property's value above [member min_value]. For example, if "
"[member min_value] is [code]0.1[/code] and step is [code]0.2[/code], then "
"[member value] is limited to [code]0.1[/code], [code]0.3[/code], [code]0.5[/"
"code], and so on. If [member rounded] is also [code]true[/code], [member "
"value] will first be rounded to a multiple of this property's value, then "
"rounded to the nearest integer."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code], ຄ່າ [member value] "
"ຈະຖືກປັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າທະວີຄູນຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ທີ່ຢູ່ເໜືອ [member min_value] ສະເໝີ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າ [member "
"min_value] ແມ່ນ [code]0.1[/code] ແລະ step ແມ່ນ [code]0.2[/code], ແລ້ວ [member "
"value] ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດຢູ່ທີ່ [code]0.1[/code], [code]0.3[/code], [code]0.5[/code], ແລະ "
"ອື່ນໆ. ຖ້າ [member rounded] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ພ້ອມ, [member value] "
"ຈະຖືກປັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າທະວີຄູນຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ກ່ອນ, ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງປັດໃຫ້ເປັນຕົວເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Range's current value. Changing this property (even via code) will trigger "
"[signal value_changed] signal. Use [method set_value_no_signal] if you want "
"to avoid it."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ Range. ການປ່ຽນແປງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ (ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຜ່ານໂຄ້ດ) ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານ [signal "
"value_changed]. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method set_value_no_signal] ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຫຼີກເວັ້ນການສົ່ງສັນຍານ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when [member min_value], [member max_value], [member page], or "
"[member step] change."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອ [member min_value], [member max_value], [member page], ຫຼື "
"[member step] ປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when [member value] changes. When used on a [Slider], this is called "
"continuously while dragging (potentially every frame). If you are performing "
"an expensive operation in a function connected to [signal value_changed], "
"consider using a [i]debouncing[/i] [Timer] to call the function less often.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike signals such as [signal LineEdit.text_changed], [signal "
"value_changed] is also emitted when [param value] is set directly via code."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອ [member value] ປ່ຽນແປງ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ກັບ [Slider], "
"ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງລາກ (ອາດຈະເປັນທຸກເຟຣມ). "
"ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກທີ່ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍໃນຟັງຊັນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ [signal value_changed], "
"ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [Timer] ແບບ [i]debouncing[/i] ເພື່ອເອີ້ນຟັງຊັນໃຫ້ໜ້ອຍລົງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ຄືກັບສັນຍານເຊັ່ນ [signal LineEdit.text_changed], ສັນຍານ [signal "
"value_changed] ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາຄືກັນເມື່ອ [param value] ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍກົງຜ່ານໂຄ້ດ."

msgid ""
"A ray in 2D space, used to find the first collision object it intersects."
msgstr "ລັງສີໃນພື້ນທີ່ 2D, ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຊອກຫາວັດຖຸການຕຳທຳອິດທີ່ມັນຕັດຜ່ານ."

msgid ""
"A raycast represents a ray from its origin to its [member target_position] "
"that finds the closest object along its path, if it intersects any.\n"
"[RayCast2D] can ignore some objects by adding them to an exception list, by "
"making its detection reporting ignore [Area2D]s ([member collide_with_areas]) "
"or [PhysicsBody2D]s ([member collide_with_bodies]), or by configuring physics "
"layers.\n"
"[RayCast2D] calculates intersection every physics frame, and it holds the "
"result until the next physics frame. For an immediate raycast, or if you want "
"to configure a [RayCast2D] multiple times within the same physics frame, use "
"[method force_raycast_update].\n"
"To sweep over a region of 2D space, you can approximate the region with "
"multiple [RayCast2D]s or use [ShapeCast2D]."
msgstr ""
"Raycast ສະແດງເຖິງລັງສີຈາກຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄປຫາ [member target_position] "
"ທີ່ຊອກຫາວັດຖຸທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດຕາມເສັ້ນທາງຂອງມັນ ຖ້າມັນຕັດຜ່ານວັດຖຸໃດໜຶ່ງ.\n"
"[RayCast2D] ສາມາດລະເວັ້ນບາງວັດຖຸໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນ, "
"ໂດຍການກຳນົດໃຫ້ການກວດຈັບຂອງມັນລະເວັ້ນ [Area2D] ([member collide_with_areas]) ຫຼື "
"[PhysicsBody2D] ([member collide_with_bodies]), ຫຼື ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລເຢີຟີຊິກ (physics "
"layers).\n"
"[RayCast2D] ຈະຄິດໄລ່ການຕັດກັນໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມຟີຊິກ, ແລະ "
"ມັນຈະເກັບຜົນລັບໄວ້ຈົນກວ່າຈະຮອດເຟຣມຟີຊິກຖັດໄປ. ສຳລັບການເຮັດ raycast ແບບທັນທີ, ຫຼື "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [RayCast2D] ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງພາຍໃນເຟຣມຟີຊິກດຽວກັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"force_raycast_update].\n"
"ເພື່ອສຳຫຼວດພື້ນທີ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ 2D, ທ່ານສາມາດປະມານພື້ນທີ່ນັ້ນດ້ວຍ [RayCast2D] ຫຼາຍໆອັນ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ "
"[ShapeCast2D]."

msgid ""
"Adds a collision exception so the ray does not report collisions with the "
"specified [param node]."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນການຕຳ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລັງສີບໍ່ລາຍງານການຕຳກັບ [param node] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Adds a collision exception so the ray does not report collisions with the "
"specified [RID]."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນການຕຳ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລັງສີບໍ່ລາຍງານການຕຳກັບ [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid "Removes all collision exceptions for this ray."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນການຕຳທັງໝົດສຳລັບລັງສີນີ້."

msgid ""
"Updates the collision information for the ray immediately, without waiting "
"for the next [code]_physics_process[/code] call. Use this method, for "
"example, when the ray or its parent has changed state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member enabled] does not need to be [code]true[/code] for this "
"to work."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນການຕຳສຳລັບລັງສີໃນທັນທີ, ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [code]_physics_process[/code] "
"ຄັ້ງຖັດໄປ. ໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ ເຊັ່ນ: ເມື່ອລັງສີ ຫຼື ໂນດແມ່ຂອງມັນມີການປ່ຽນແປງສະຖານະ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member enabled] ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ກໍສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the first object that the ray intersects, or [code]null[/code] if no "
"object is intersecting the ray (i.e. [method is_colliding] returns "
"[code]false[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This object is not guaranteed to be a [CollisionObject2D]. For "
"example, if the ray intersects a [TileMapLayer], the method will return a "
"[TileMapLayer] instance."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າວັດຖຸທຳອິດທີ່ລັງສີຕັດຜ່ານ, ຫຼື [code]null[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ມີວັດຖຸໃດຕັດຜ່ານລັງສີ (ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ "
"[method is_colliding] ຄືນຄ່າ [code]false[/code]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວັດຖຸນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະເປັນ [CollisionObject2D]. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າລັງສີຕັດຜ່ານ "
"[TileMapLayer], ເມທອດຈະຄືນຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງ [TileMapLayer]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [RID] of the first object that the ray intersects, or an empty "
"[RID] if no object is intersecting the ray (i.e. [method is_colliding] "
"returns [code]false[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [RID] ຂອງວັດຖຸທຳອິດທີ່ລັງສີຕັດຜ່ານ, ຫຼື [RID] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ຖ້າບໍ່ມີວັດຖຸໃດຕັດຜ່ານລັງສີ (ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ "
"[method is_colliding] ຄືນຄ່າ [code]false[/code])."

msgid ""
"Returns the shape ID of the first object that the ray intersects, or [code]0[/"
"code] if no object is intersecting the ray (i.e. [method is_colliding] "
"returns [code]false[/code]).\n"
"To get the intersected shape node, for a [CollisionObject2D] target, use:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var target = get_collider() # A CollisionObject2D.\n"
"var shape_id = get_collider_shape() # The shape index in the collider.\n"
"var owner_id = target.shape_find_owner(shape_id) # The owner ID in the "
"collider.\n"
"var shape = target.shape_owner_get_owner(owner_id)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var target = (CollisionObject2D)GetCollider(); // A CollisionObject2D.\n"
"var shapeId = GetColliderShape(); // The shape index in the collider.\n"
"var ownerId = target.ShapeFindOwner(shapeId); // The owner ID in the "
"collider.\n"
"var shape = target.ShapeOwnerGetOwner(ownerId);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ shape ID ຂອງວັດຖຸທຳອິດທີ່ລັງສີຕັດຜ່ານ, ຫຼື [code]0[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ມີວັດຖຸໃດຕັດຜ່ານລັງສີ "
"(ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ [method is_colliding] ຄືນຄ່າ [code]false[/code]).\n"
"ເພື່ອເອົາໂນດຮູບຮ່າງ (shape node) ທີ່ຖືກຕັດຜ່ານ, ສຳລັບເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ເປັນ [CollisionObject2D], "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var target = get_collider() # ເປັນ CollisionObject2D.\n"
"var shape_id = get_collider_shape() # ດັດຊະນີຮູບຮ່າງໃນຕົວຕຳ.\n"
"var owner_id = target.shape_find_owner(shape_id) # ID ຂອງເຈົ້າຂອງໃນຕົວຕຳ.\n"
"var shape = target.shape_owner_get_owner(owner_id)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var target = (CollisionObject2D)GetCollider(); // ເປັນ CollisionObject2D.\n"
"var shapeId = GetColliderShape(); // ດັດຊະນີຮູບຮ່າງໃນຕົວຕຳ.\n"
"var ownerId = target.ShapeFindOwner(shapeId); // ID ຂອງເຈົ້າຂອງໃນຕົວຕຳ.\n"
"var shape = target.ShapeOwnerGetOwner(ownerId);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns the normal of the intersecting object's shape at the collision point, "
"or [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code] if the ray starts inside the shape and [member "
"hit_from_inside] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Check that [method is_colliding] returns [code]true[/code] "
"before calling this method to ensure the returned normal is valid and up-to-"
"date."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າແຮງແນວສາກ (normal) ຂອງຮູບຮ່າງວັດຖຸທີ່ຕັດກັນຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດຕຳ, ຫຼື [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code] "
"ຖ້າລັງສີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກພາຍໃນຮູບຮ່າງ ແລະ [member hit_from_inside] ເປັນ [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າ [method is_colliding] ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າຄ່າ normal ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມານັ້ນຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the collision point at which the ray intersects the closest object, "
"in the global coordinate system. If [member hit_from_inside] is [code]true[/"
"code] and the ray starts inside of a collision shape, this function will "
"return the origin point of the ray.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Check that [method is_colliding] returns [code]true[/code] "
"before calling this method to ensure the returned point is valid and up-to-"
"date."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຈຸດຕຳທີ່ລັງສີຕັດກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ, ໃນລະບົບພິກັດສາກົນ (global coordinate system). ຖ້າ "
"[member hit_from_inside] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ "
"ລັງສີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກພາຍໃນຮູບຮ່າງການຕຳ, ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະຄືນຄ່າຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລັງສີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າ [method is_colliding] ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈຸດທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມານັ້ນຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns whether any object is intersecting with the ray's vector (considering "
"the vector length)."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າວ່າວັດຖຸໃດໜຶ່ງຕັດກັບເວກເຕີຂອງລັງສີຫຼືບໍ່ (ໂດຍພິຈາລະນາຈາກຄວາມຍາວຂອງເວກເຕີ)."

msgid ""
"Removes a collision exception so the ray can report collisions with the "
"specified [param node]."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນການຕຳ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລັງສີສາມາດລາຍງານການຕຳກັບ [param node] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Removes a collision exception so the ray can report collisions with the "
"specified [RID]."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນການຕຳ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລັງສີສາມາດລາຍງານການຕຳກັບ [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], collisions with [Area2D]s will be reported."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະລາຍງານການຕຳກັບ [Area2D]."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], collisions with [PhysicsBody2D]s will be reported."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະລາຍງານການຕຳກັບ [PhysicsBody2D]."

msgid ""
"The ray's collision mask. Only objects in at least one collision layer "
"enabled in the mask will be detected. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers and "
"masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າກາກການຕຳ (collision mask) ຂອງລັງສີ. "
"ຈະກວດຈັບສະເພາະວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງເລເຢີການຕຳທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ໃນໜ້າກາກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-"
"masks]ເລເຢີການຕຳ ແລະ ໜ້າກາກ[/url] ໃນເອກະສານປະກອບສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], collisions will be reported."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະລາຍງານການຕຳ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this raycast will not report collisions with its parent "
"node. This property only has an effect if the parent node is a "
"[CollisionObject2D]. See also [method Node.get_parent] and [method "
"add_exception]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], raycast ນີ້ຈະບໍ່ລາຍງານການຕຳກັບໂນດແມ່ຂອງມັນ. "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອໂນດແມ່ເປັນ [CollisionObject2D]. ເບິ່ງ [method Node.get_parent] "
"ແລະ [method add_exception] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the ray will detect a hit when starting inside shapes. "
"In this case the collision normal will be [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code]. Does "
"not affect concave polygon shapes."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລັງສີຈະກວດຈັບການຕຳເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກພາຍໃນຮູບຮ່າງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ ຄ່າ "
"collision normal ຈະເປັນ [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code]. ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບຮູບຮ່າງ polygon ແບບ "
"concave ( concave polygon shapes)."

msgid ""
"The ray's destination point, relative to this raycast's [member "
"Node2D.position]."
msgstr "ຈຸດປາຍທາງຂອງລັງສີ, ທຽບກັບ [member Node2D.position] ຂອງ raycast ນີ້."

msgid ""
"A ray in 3D space, used to find the first collision object it intersects."
msgstr "ລັງສີໃນພື້ນທີ່ 3D, ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຊອກຫາວັດຖຸການຕຳທຳອິດທີ່ມັນຕັດຜ່ານ."

msgid ""
"A raycast represents a ray from its origin to its [member target_position] "
"that finds the closest object along its path, if it intersects any.\n"
"[RayCast3D] can ignore some objects by adding them to an exception list, by "
"making its detection reporting ignore [Area3D]s ([member collide_with_areas]) "
"or [PhysicsBody3D]s ([member collide_with_bodies]), or by configuring physics "
"layers.\n"
"[RayCast3D] calculates intersection every physics frame, and it holds the "
"result until the next physics frame. For an immediate raycast, or if you want "
"to configure a [RayCast3D] multiple times within the same physics frame, use "
"[method force_raycast_update].\n"
"To sweep over a region of 3D space, you can approximate the region with "
"multiple [RayCast3D]s or use [ShapeCast3D]."
msgstr ""
"Raycast ສະແດງເຖິງລັງສີຈາກຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄປຫາ [member target_position] "
"ທີ່ຊອກຫາວັດຖຸທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດຕາມເສັ້ນທາງຂອງມັນ ຖ້າມັນຕັດຜ່ານວັດຖຸໃດໜຶ່ງ.\n"
"[RayCast3D] ສາມາດລະເວັ້ນບາງວັດຖຸໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນ, "
"ໂດຍການກຳນົດໃຫ້ການກວດຈັບຂອງມັນລະເວັ້ນ [Area3D] ([member collide_with_areas]) ຫຼື "
"[PhysicsBody3D] ([member collide_with_bodies]), ຫຼື ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລເຢີຟີຊິກ (physics "
"layers).\n"
"[RayCast3D] ຈະຄິດໄລ່ການຕັດກັນໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມຟີຊິກ, ແລະ "
"ມັນຈະເກັບຜົນລັບໄວ້ຈົນກວ່າຈະຮອດເຟຣມຟີຊິກຖັດໄປ. ສຳລັບການເຮັດ raycast ແບບທັນທີ, ຫຼື "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [RayCast3D] ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງພາຍໃນເຟຣມຟີຊິກດຽວກັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"force_raycast_update].\n"
"ເພື່ອສຳຫຼວດພື້ນທີ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ 3D, ທ່ານສາມາດປະມານພື້ນທີ່ນັ້ນດ້ວຍ [RayCast3D] ຫຼາຍໆອັນ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ "
"[ShapeCast3D]."

msgid ""
"Returns the first object that the ray intersects, or [code]null[/code] if no "
"object is intersecting the ray (i.e. [method is_colliding] returns "
"[code]false[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This object is not guaranteed to be a [CollisionObject3D]. For "
"example, if the ray intersects a [CSGShape3D] or a [GridMap], the method will "
"return a [CSGShape3D] or [GridMap] instance."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າວັດຖຸທຳອິດທີ່ລັງສີຕັດຜ່ານ, ຫຼື [code]null[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ມີວັດຖຸໃດຕັດຜ່ານລັງສີ (ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ "
"[method is_colliding] ຄືນຄ່າ [code]false[/code]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວັດຖຸນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະເປັນ [CollisionObject3D]. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າລັງສີຕັດຜ່ານ "
"[CSGShape3D] ຫຼື [GridMap], ເມທອດຈະຄືນຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງ [CSGShape3D] ຫຼື [GridMap]."

msgid ""
"Returns the shape ID of the first object that the ray intersects, or [code]0[/"
"code] if no object is intersecting the ray (i.e. [method is_colliding] "
"returns [code]false[/code]).\n"
"To get the intersected shape node, for a [CollisionObject3D] target, use:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var target = get_collider() # A CollisionObject3D.\n"
"var shape_id = get_collider_shape() # The shape index in the collider.\n"
"var owner_id = target.shape_find_owner(shape_id) # The owner ID in the "
"collider.\n"
"var shape = target.shape_owner_get_owner(owner_id)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var target = (CollisionObject3D)GetCollider(); // A CollisionObject3D.\n"
"var shapeId = GetColliderShape(); // The shape index in the collider.\n"
"var ownerId = target.ShapeFindOwner(shapeId); // The owner ID in the "
"collider.\n"
"var shape = target.ShapeOwnerGetOwner(ownerId);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ shape ID ຂອງວັດຖຸທຳອິດທີ່ລັງສີຕັດຜ່ານ, ຫຼື [code]0[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ມີວັດຖຸໃດຕັດຜ່ານລັງສີ "
"(ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ [method is_colliding] ຄືນຄ່າ [code]false[/code]).\n"
"ເພື່ອເອົາໂນດຮູບຮ່າງ (shape node) ທີ່ຖືກຕັດຜ່ານ, ສຳລັບເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ເປັນ [CollisionObject3D], "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var target = get_collider() # ເປັນ CollisionObject3D.\n"
"var shape_id = get_collider_shape() # ດັດຊະນີຮູບຮ່າງໃນຕົວຕຳ.\n"
"var owner_id = target.shape_find_owner(shape_id) # ID ຂອງເຈົ້າຂອງໃນຕົວຕຳ.\n"
"var shape = target.shape_owner_get_owner(owner_id)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var target = (CollisionObject3D)GetCollider(); // ເປັນ CollisionObject3D.\n"
"var shapeId = GetColliderShape(); // ດັດຊະນີຮູບຮ່າງໃນຕົວຕຳ.\n"
"var ownerId = target.ShapeFindOwner(shapeId); // ID ຂອງເຈົ້າຂອງໃນຕົວຕຳ.\n"
"var shape = target.ShapeOwnerGetOwner(ownerId);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns the collision object's face index at the collision point, or "
"[code]-1[/code] if the shape intersecting the ray is not a "
"[ConcavePolygonShape3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າດັດຊະນີໜ້າ (face index) ຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດຕຳ, ຫຼື [code]-1[/code] "
"ຖ້າຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ຕັດກັບລັງສີບໍ່ແມ່ນ [ConcavePolygonShape3D]."

msgid ""
"Returns the normal of the intersecting object's shape at the collision point, "
"or [code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/code] if the ray starts inside the shape and "
"[member hit_from_inside] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Check that [method is_colliding] returns [code]true[/code] "
"before calling this method to ensure the returned normal is valid and up-to-"
"date."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າແຮງແນວສາກ (normal) ຂອງຮູບຮ່າງວັດຖຸທີ່ຕັດກັນຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດຕຳ, ຫຼື [code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/"
"code] ຖ້າລັງສີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກພາຍໃນຮູບຮ່າງ ແລະ [member hit_from_inside] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າ [method is_colliding] ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າຄ່າ normal ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມານັ້ນຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], collisions with [Area3D]s will be reported."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະລາຍງານການຕຳກັບ [Area3D]."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], collisions with [PhysicsBody3D]s will be reported."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະລາຍງານການຕຳກັບ [PhysicsBody3D]."

msgid ""
"The custom color to use to draw the shape in the editor and at run-time if "
"[b]Visible Collision Shapes[/b] is enabled in the [b]Debug[/b] menu. This "
"color will be highlighted at run-time if the [RayCast3D] is colliding with "
"something.\n"
"If set to [code]Color(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)[/code] (by default), the color set in "
"[member ProjectSettings.debug/shapes/collision/shape_color] is used."
msgstr ""
"ສີທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອໃຊ້ແຕ້ມຮູບຮ່າງໃນ editor ແລະ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລັນ (run-time) ຖ້າ [b]Visible "
"Collision Shapes[/b] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນເມນູ [b]Debug[/b]. ສີນີ້ຈະຖືກໄຮໄລ້ (highlight) "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລັນ ຖ້າ [RayCast3D] ຕຳກັບບາງສິ່ງບາງຢ່າງ.\n"
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]Color(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)[/code] (ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຈະໃຊ້ສີທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ [member "
"ProjectSettings.debug/shapes/collision/shape_color]."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]1[/code], a line is used as the debug shape. Otherwise, a "
"truncated pyramid is drawn to represent the [RayCast3D]. Requires [b]Visible "
"Collision Shapes[/b] to be enabled in the [b]Debug[/b] menu for the debug "
"shape to be visible at run-time."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]1[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ເສັ້ນເປັນຮູບຮ່າງ debug. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະແຕ້ມຮູບທົງສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຕັດ "
"(truncated pyramid) ເພື່ອສະແດງເຖິງ [RayCast3D]. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [b]Visible Collision "
"Shapes[/b] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນເມນູ [b]Debug[/b] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຮູບຮ່າງ debug ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this raycast will not report collisions with its parent "
"node. This property only has an effect if the parent node is a "
"[CollisionObject3D]. See also [method Node.get_parent] and [method "
"add_exception]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], raycast ນີ້ຈະບໍ່ລາຍງານການຕຳກັບໂນດແມ່ຂອງມັນ. "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອໂນດແມ່ເປັນ [CollisionObject3D]. ເບິ່ງ [method Node.get_parent] "
"ແລະ [method add_exception] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the ray will hit back faces with concave polygon shapes "
"with back face enabled or heightmap shapes."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລັງສີຈະຕຳກັບໜ້າຫຼັງ (back faces) ຂອງຮູບຮ່າງ polygon ແບບ "
"concave ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ back face ຫຼື ຮູບຮ່າງ heightmap."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the ray will detect a hit when starting inside shapes. "
"In this case the collision normal will be [code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/code]. Does "
"not affect shapes with no volume like concave polygon or heightmap."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລັງສີຈະກວດຈັບການຕຳເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກພາຍໃນຮູບຮ່າງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ ຄ່າ "
"collision normal ຈະເປັນ [code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/code]. ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ບໍ່ມີບໍລິມາດ "
"(volume) ເຊັ່ນ concave polygon ຫຼື heightmap."

msgid ""
"The ray's destination point, relative to this raycast's [member "
"Node3D.position]."
msgstr "ຈຸດປາຍທາງຂອງລັງສີ, ທຽບກັບ [member Node3D.position] ຂອງ raycast ນີ້."

msgid "Acceleration structure geometry (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "ເລຂາຄະນິດຂອງໂຄງສ້າງການເລັ່ງ (ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingDevice])."

msgid ""
"[RDAccelerationStructureGeometry] describes a set of triangles used as "
"raytracing geometry in the [method RenderingDevice.blas_create] method.\n"
"The geometry is always in triangle list form, either indexed or non-indexed. "
"Triangle strips are not supported."
msgstr ""
"[RDAccelerationStructureGeometry] ອະທິບາຍຊຸດຂອງຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນເລຂາຄະນິດສຳລັບ "
"raytracing ໃນເມທອດ [method RenderingDevice.blas_create].\n"
"ເລຂາຄະນິດຈະຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບລາຍຊື່ສາມຫຼ່ຽມ (triangle list) ສະເໝີ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນແບບມີດັດຊະນີ "
"(indexed) ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີດັດຊະນີ. ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບແບບ triangle strips."

msgid "Flags for the geometry."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flags) ສຳລັບເລຂາຄະນິດ."

msgid ""
"Buffer containing vertex indices. If [code]null[/code], triangles are non-"
"indexed."
msgstr ""
"ບັບເຟີ (Buffer) ທີ່ບັນຈຸດັດຊະນີຂອງຈຸດຈອມ (vertex indices). ຖ້າເປັນ [code]null[/code], "
"ຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມຈະບໍ່ມີດັດຊະນີ."

msgid "Number of indices used by this geometry in [member index_buffer]."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນດັດຊະນີທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍເລຂາຄະນິດນີ້ໃນ [member index_buffer]."

msgid "Byte offset of the first index in [member index_buffer]."
msgstr "ຄ່າອອຟເຊັດ (offset) ເປັນໄບຕ໌ຂອງດັດຊະນີທຳອິດໃນ [member index_buffer]."

msgid "Buffer containing vertices."
msgstr "ບັບເຟີ (Buffer) ທີ່ບັນຈຸຈຸດຈອມ (vertices)."

msgid "Number of vertices used by this geometry in [member vertex_buffer]."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຈຸດຈອມທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍເລຂາຄະນິດນີ້ໃນ [member vertex_buffer]."

msgid "Format of the vertices in [member vertex_buffer]."
msgstr "ຟໍແມັດຂອງຈຸດຈອມໃນ [member vertex_buffer]."

msgid "Byte offset of the first vertex in [member vertex_buffer]."
msgstr "ຄ່າອອຟເຊັດເປັນໄບຕ໌ຂອງຈຸດຈອມທຳອິດໃນ [member vertex_buffer]."

msgid "Number of bytes between each vertex in [member vertex_buffer]."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະຈຸດຈອມໃນ [member vertex_buffer]."

msgid "Acceleration structure instance (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງໂຄງສ້າງການເລັ່ງ (ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingDevice])."

msgid ""
"[RDAccelerationStructureInstance] describes an instance of a Bottom-Level "
"Acceleration Structure (BLAS) used in the [method RenderingDevice.tlas_build] "
"method."
msgstr ""
"[RDAccelerationStructureInstance] ອະທິບາຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງ Bottom-Level Acceleration "
"Structure (BLAS) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນເມທອດ [method RenderingDevice.tlas_build]."

msgid ""
"The BLAS referenced by this instance. If [code]null[/code], the instance is "
"treated as a placeholder but still contributes to [code]gl_InstanceIndex[/"
"code] in GLSL."
msgstr ""
"BLAS ທີ່ອ້າງອີງໂດຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ນີ້. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]null[/code], ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດຄືກັບບ່ອນວ່າງ "
"(placeholder) ແຕ່ຍັງຄົງສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ [code]gl_InstanceIndex[/code] ໃນ GLSL."

msgid "Flags for the instance."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flags) ສຳລັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

msgid ""
"Hit shader binding table range used for this instance, allocated using the "
"[method RenderingDevice.hit_sbt_range_alloc] method."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຂອງຕາຕະລາງການຜູກມັດ hit shader ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ນີ້, ເຊິ່ງຖືກຈັດສັນໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ "
"[method RenderingDevice.hit_sbt_range_alloc]."

msgid ""
"Custom instance ID that can be accessed in GLSL using "
"[code]gl_InstanceCustomIndexEXT[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ID ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໃນ GLSL ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[code]gl_InstanceCustomIndexEXT[/code]."

msgid "Visibility mask used to control which rays can intersect this instance."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າກາກການເບິ່ງເຫັນ (Visibility mask) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມວ່າລັງສີໃດສາມາດຕັດກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ນີ້ໄດ້."

msgid "Transform applied to the referenced BLAS for this instance."
msgstr "ການແປງ (Transform) ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບ BLAS ທີ່ຖືກອ້າງອີງສຳລັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ນີ້."

msgid "Attachment format (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "ຟໍແມັດການຄັດຕິດ (used by [RenderingDevice])."

msgid "This object is used by [RenderingDevice]."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingDevice]."

msgid "The attachment's data format."
msgstr "ຟໍແມັດຂໍ້ມູນຂອງການຄັດຕິດ."

msgid "The number of samples used when sampling the attachment."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຕົວຢ່າງ (samples) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທຳການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ (sampling) ການຄັດຕິດ."

msgid "The attachment's usage flags, which determine what can be done with it."
msgstr "ແຟລັກການນຳໃຊ້ຂອງການຄັດຕິດ, ເຊິ່ງກຳນົດສິ່ງທີ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ກັບມັນ."

msgid "Framebuffer pass attachment description (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍການຄັດຕິດຂອງ framebuffer pass (ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingDevice])."

msgid ""
"This class contains the list of attachment descriptions for a framebuffer "
"pass. Each points with an index to a previously supplied list of texture "
"attachments.\n"
"Multipass framebuffers can optimize some configurations in mobile. On "
"desktop, they provide little to no advantage.\n"
"This object is used by [RenderingDevice]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍລາຍຊື່ຂອງຄຳອະທິບາຍການຄັດຕິດສຳລັບ framebuffer pass. "
"ແຕ່ລະອັນຈະຊີ້ດ້ວຍດັດຊະນີໄປຫາລາຍຊື່ການຄັດຕິດພື້ນຜິວ (texture attachments) ທີ່ໄດ້ໃຫ້ໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້.\n"
"Multipass framebuffers ສາມາດປັບປຸງການຕັ້ງຄ່າບາງຢ່າງໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນໃນມືຖື. ສ່ວນໃນເດັສທັອບ "
"(desktop), ພວກມັນໃຫ້ປະໂຫຍດໜ້ອຍ ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີເລີຍ.\n"
"ວັດຖຸນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingDevice]."

msgid ""
"Color attachments in order starting from 0. If this attachment is not used by "
"the shader, pass ATTACHMENT_UNUSED to skip."
msgstr ""
"ການຄັດຕິດສີຕາມລໍາດັບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ 0. ຖ້າການຄັດຕິດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍເຊດເດີ (shader), ໃຫ້ສົ່ງ "
"ATTACHMENT_UNUSED ເພື່ອຂ້າມ."

msgid ""
"Depth attachment. ATTACHMENT_UNUSED should be used if no depth buffer is "
"required for this pass."
msgstr ""
"ການຄັດຕິດຄວາມເລິກ (Depth attachment). ຄວນໃຊ້ ATTACHMENT_UNUSED "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການບັບເຟີຄວາມເລິກສຳລັບ pass ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Used for multipass framebuffers (more than one render pass). Converts an "
"attachment to an input. Make sure to also supply it properly in the "
"[RDUniform] for the uniform set."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ multipass framebuffers (ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງ render pass). ແປງການຄັດຕິດໃຫ້ເປັນຂໍ້ມູນນໍາເຂົ້າ "
"(input). ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ກຳນົດມັນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃນ [RDUniform] ສຳລັບ uniform set."

msgid "Attachments to preserve in this pass (otherwise they are erased)."
msgstr "ການຄັດຕິດທີ່ຈະຮັກສາໄວ້ໃນ pass ນີ້ (ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກມັນຈະຖືກລຶບ)."

msgid ""
"If the color attachments are multisampled, non-multisampled resolve "
"attachments can be provided."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າການຄັດຕິດສີເປັນແບບ multisampled, ສາມາດລະບຸ resolve attachments ແບບ non-"
"multisampled ໄດ້."

msgid "Attachment is unused."
msgstr "ການຄັດຕິດບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້."

msgid "Hit group (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "Hit group (ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingDevice])."

msgid ""
"Defines a hit group for use with [method "
"RenderingDevice.raytracing_pipeline_create].\n"
"A hit group combines shaders that are executed when a ray intersects "
"geometry. It may include a closest-hit shader, any-hit shader, and "
"intersection shader.\n"
"Hit groups are referenced by index when populating hit shader binding tables "
"using [method RenderingDevice.hit_sbt_range_update]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດ hit group ສຳລັບໃຊ້ກັບ [method RenderingDevice.raytracing_pipeline_create].\n"
"hit group ຈະລວມເຊດເດີທີ່ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດງານເມື່ອລັງສີຕັດກັບເລຂາຄະນິດ. ມັນອາດຈະລວມມີ closest-hit "
"shader, any-hit shader, ແລະ intersection shader.\n"
"hit groups ຈະຖືກອ້າງອີງດ້ວຍດັດຊະນີເມື່ອມີການຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃສ່ຕາຕະລາງການຜູກມັດ hit shader "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method RenderingDevice.hit_sbt_range_update]."

msgid ""
"Any-hit shader for this hit group. Executed for each potential intersection. "
"Can be [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Any-hit shader ສຳລັບ hit group ນີ້. ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດງານສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຈຸດຕັດທີ່ມີຄວາມເປັນໄປໄດ້. "
"ສາມາດເປັນ [code]null[/code] ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Closest-hit shader for this hit group. Executed for the closest intersection. "
"Can be [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Closest-hit shader ສຳລັບ hit group ນີ້. ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດງານສຳລັບຈຸດຕັດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ. ສາມາດເປັນ "
"[code]null[/code] ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Intersection shader for this hit group. Required for non-triangle geometry. "
"Must be [code]null[/code] when using for triangle geometry."
msgstr ""
"Intersection shader ສຳລັບ hit group ນີ້. ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບເລຂາຄະນິດທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມ. ຕ້ອງເປັນ "
"[code]null[/code] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບເລຂາຄະນິດຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມ."

msgid "Pipeline color blend state (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖານະການປະສົມສີຂອງໄພພ໌ລາຍ (Pipeline color blend state) (ໃຊ້ໂດຍ "
"[RenderingDevice])."

msgid "The attachments that are blended together."
msgstr "ການຄັດຕິດທີ່ຖືກປະສົມເຂົ້າກັນ."

msgid ""
"The constant color to blend with. See also [method "
"RenderingDevice.draw_list_set_blend_constants]."
msgstr ""
"ສີຄົງທີ່ທີ່ຈະນຳມາປະສົມ. ເບິ່ງ [method RenderingDevice.draw_list_set_blend_constants] "
"ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], performs the logic operation defined in [member "
"logic_op]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະປະຕິບັດການທາງຕັກກະສາດ (logic operation) ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ "
"[member logic_op]."

msgid ""
"The logic operation to perform for blending. Only effective if [member "
"enable_logic_op] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ການປະຕິບັດການທາງຕັກກະສາດທີ່ຈະເຮັດສຳລັບການປະສົມ. ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member enable_logic_op] "
"ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Pipeline color blend state attachment (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "ການຄັດຕິດສະຖານະການປະສົມສີຂອງໄພພ໌ລາຍ (ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingDevice])."

msgid ""
"Controls how blending between source and destination fragments is performed "
"when using [RenderingDevice].\n"
"For reference, this is how common user-facing blend modes are implemented in "
"Godot's 2D renderer:\n"
"[b]Mix:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var attachment = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = true\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Add:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var attachment = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = true\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Subtract:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var attachment = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = true\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_REVERSE_SUBTRACT\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_REVERSE_SUBTRACT\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Multiply:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var attachment = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = true\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_DST_COLOR\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ZERO\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_DST_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ZERO\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Pre-multiplied alpha:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var attachment = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = true\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ fragments ຕົ້ນທາງ (source) ແລະ ປາຍທາງ (destination) ເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"[RenderingDevice].\n"
"ສຳລັບການອ້າງອີງ, ນີ້ຄືວິທີທີ່ໂໝດການປະສົມທົ່ວໄປຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນຕົວສະແດງຜົນ 2D ຂອງ Godot:\n"
"[b]Mix:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var attachment = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = true\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Add:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var attachment = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = true\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Subtract:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var attachment = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = true\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_REVERSE_SUBTRACT\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_REVERSE_SUBTRACT\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Multiply:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var attachment = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = true\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_DST_COLOR\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ZERO\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_DST_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ZERO\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Pre-multiplied alpha:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var attachment = RDPipelineColorBlendStateAttachment.new()\n"
"attachment.enable_blend = true\n"
"attachment.alpha_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.color_blend_op = RenderingDevice.BLEND_OP_ADD\n"
"attachment.src_color_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.dst_color_blend_factor = "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"attachment.src_alpha_blend_factor = RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE\n"
"attachment.dst_alpha_blend_factor = "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Convenience method to perform standard mix blending with straight (non-"
"premultiplied) alpha. This sets [member enable_blend] to [code]true[/code], "
"[member src_color_blend_factor] to [constant "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA], [member dst_color_blend_factor] to "
"[constant RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA], [member "
"src_alpha_blend_factor] to [constant RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA] "
"and [member dst_alpha_blend_factor] to [constant "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA]."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດທີ່ສະດວກໃນການປະຕິບັດການປະສົມແບບມາດຕະຖານ (mix blending) ດ້ວຍອັນຟາແບບກົງ (straight "
"alpha). ນີ້ຈະຕັ້ງ [member enable_blend] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], [member "
"src_color_blend_factor] ເປັນ [constant "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA], [member dst_color_blend_factor] ເປັນ "
"[constant RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA], [member "
"src_alpha_blend_factor] ເປັນ [constant RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_SRC_ALPHA] "
"ແລະ [member dst_alpha_blend_factor] ເປັນ [constant "
"RenderingDevice.BLEND_FACTOR_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA]."

msgid "The blend mode to use for the alpha channel."
msgstr "ໂໝດການປະສົມທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງອັນຟາ (alpha channel)."

msgid "The blend mode to use for the red/green/blue color channels."
msgstr "ໂໝດການປະສົມທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງສີ ແດງ/ຂຽວ/ຟ້າ (RGB)."

msgid ""
"Controls how the blend factor for the alpha channel is determined based on "
"the destination's fragments."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການກຳນົດປັດໄຈການປະສົມ (blend factor) ສຳລັບຊ່ອງອັນຟາ ໂດຍອີງຕາມ fragments "
"ຂອງປາຍທາງ."

msgid ""
"Controls how the blend factor for the color channels is determined based on "
"the destination's fragments."
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການກຳນົດປັດໄຈການປະສົມສຳລັບຊ່ອງສີ ໂດຍອີງຕາມ fragments ຂອງປາຍທາງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], performs blending between the source and destination "
"according to the factors defined in [member src_color_blend_factor], [member "
"dst_color_blend_factor], [member src_alpha_blend_factor] and [member "
"dst_alpha_blend_factor]. The blend modes [member color_blend_op] and [member "
"alpha_blend_op] are also taken into account, with [member write_r], [member "
"write_g], [member write_b] and [member write_a] controlling the output."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະທຳການປະສົມລະຫວ່າງຕົ້ນທາງ ແລະ ປາຍທາງ ຕາມປັດໄຈທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ "
"[member src_color_blend_factor], [member dst_color_blend_factor], [member "
"src_alpha_blend_factor] ແລະ [member dst_alpha_blend_factor]. ໂໝດການປະສົມ "
"[member color_blend_op] ແລະ [member alpha_blend_op] ກໍຈະຖືກນຳມາພິຈາລະນາຄືກັນ, ໂດຍມີ "
"[member write_r], [member write_g], [member write_b] ແລະ [member write_a] "
"ເປັນຕົວຄວບຄຸມຜົນລັບ (output)."

msgid ""
"Controls how the blend factor for the alpha channel is determined based on "
"the source's fragments."
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການກຳນົດປັດໄຈການປະສົມສຳລັບຊ່ອງອັນຟາ ໂດຍອີງຕາມ fragments ຂອງຕົ້ນທາງ."

msgid ""
"Controls how the blend factor for the color channels is determined based on "
"the source's fragments."
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການກຳນົດປັດໄຈການປະສົມສຳລັບຊ່ອງສີ ໂດຍອີງຕາມ fragments ຂອງຕົ້ນທາງ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], writes the new alpha channel to the final result."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຂຽນຊ່ອງອັນຟາໃໝ່ໃສ່ໃນຜົນລັບສຸດທ້າຍ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], writes the new blue color channel to the final result."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຂຽນຊ່ອງສີຟ້າໃໝ່ໃສ່ໃນຜົນລັບສຸດທ້າຍ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], writes the new green color channel to the final result."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຂຽນຊ່ອງສີຂຽວໃໝ່ໃສ່ໃນຜົນລັບສຸດທ້າຍ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], writes the new red color channel to the final result."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຂຽນຊ່ອງສີແດງໃໝ່ໃສ່ໃນຜົນລັບສຸດທ້າຍ."

msgid "Pipeline depth/stencil state (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖານະຄວາມເລິກ/ສະເຕນຊິວຂອງໄພພ໌ລາຍ (Pipeline depth/stencil state) (ໃຊ້ໂດຍ "
"[RenderingDevice])."

msgid ""
"[RDPipelineDepthStencilState] controls the way depth and stencil comparisons "
"are performed when sampling those values using [RenderingDevice]."
msgstr ""
"[RDPipelineDepthStencilState] ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການປຽບທຽບຄວາມເລິກ ແລະ ສະເຕນຊິວ "
"ເມື່ອທຳການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ [RenderingDevice]."

msgid ""
"The method used for comparing the previous back stencil value and [member "
"back_op_reference]."
msgstr "ວິທີການທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບປຽບທຽບຄ່າ back stencil ກ່ອນໜ້າ ແລະ [member back_op_reference]."

msgid "Selects which bits from the back stencil value will be compared."
msgstr "ເລືອກບິດ (bits) ໃດຈາກຄ່າ back stencil ທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳມາປຽບທຽບ."

msgid ""
"The operation to perform on the stencil buffer for back pixels that pass the "
"stencil test but fail the depth test."
msgstr ""
"ການປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຈະເຮັດກັບ stencil buffer ສຳລັບພິກເຊວດ້ານຫຼັງ (back pixels) ທີ່ຜ່ານການທົດສອບ "
"stencil ແຕ່ບໍ່ຜ່ານການທົດສອບຄວາມເລິກ."

msgid ""
"The operation to perform on the stencil buffer for back pixels that fail the "
"stencil test."
msgstr "ການປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຈະເຮັດກັບ stencil buffer ສຳລັບພິກເຊວດ້ານຫຼັງທີ່ບໍ່ຜ່ານການທົດສອບ stencil."

msgid ""
"The operation to perform on the stencil buffer for back pixels that pass the "
"stencil test."
msgstr "ການປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຈະເຮັດກັບ stencil buffer ສຳລັບພິກເຊວດ້ານຫຼັງທີ່ຜ່ານການທົດສອບ stencil."

msgid "The value the previous back stencil value will be compared to."
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຄ່າ back stencil ກ່ອນໜ້າຈະຖືກນຳມາປຽບທຽບ."

msgid "Selects which bits from the back stencil value will be changed."
msgstr "ເລືອກບິດໃດຈາກຄ່າ back stencil ທີ່ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "The method used for comparing the previous and current depth values."
msgstr "ວິທີການທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບປຽບທຽບຄ່າຄວາມເລິກກ່ອນໜ້າ ແລະ ປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"The maximum depth that returns [code]true[/code] for [member "
"enable_depth_range]."
msgstr "ຄວາມເລິກສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ສຳລັບ [member enable_depth_range]."

msgid ""
"The minimum depth that returns [code]true[/code] for [member "
"enable_depth_range]."
msgstr "ຄວາມເລິກຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ຈະຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ສຳລັບ [member enable_depth_range]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], each depth value will be tested to see if it is between "
"[member depth_range_min] and [member depth_range_max]. If it is outside of "
"these values, it is discarded."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄ່າຄວາມເລິກແຕ່ລະຄ່າຈະຖືກທົດສອບເບິ່ງວ່າມັນຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [member "
"depth_range_min] ແລະ [member depth_range_max] ຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າມັນຢູ່ນອກຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ມັນຈະຖືກປະລະ "
"(discarded)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables depth testing which allows objects to be "
"automatically occluded by other objects based on their depth. This also "
"allows objects to be partially occluded by other objects. If [code]false[/"
"code], objects will appear in the order they were drawn (like in Godot's 2D "
"renderer)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການທົດສອບຄວາມເລິກ (depth testing) "
"ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຖືກບັງໂດຍວັດຖຸອື່ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມຄວາມເລິກຂອງພວກມັນ. "
"ນີ້ຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຖືກບັງບາງສ່ວນໂດຍວັດຖຸອື່ນໄດ້. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ວັດຖຸຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນຕາມລໍາດັບທີ່ພວກມັນຖືກແຕ້ມ (ຄືກັນກັບໃນຕົວສະແດງຜົນ 2D ຂອງ Godot)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], writes to the depth buffer whenever the depth test "
"returns [code]true[/code]. Only works when enable_depth_test is also "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຂຽນລົງໃນບັບເຟີຄວາມເລິກ (depth buffer) "
"ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ການທົດສອບຄວາມເລິກຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code]. ຈະເຮັດວຽກກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ enable_depth_test "
"ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຄືກັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables stencil testing. There are separate stencil "
"buffers for front-facing triangles and back-facing triangles. See properties "
"that begin with \"front_op\" and properties with \"back_op\" for each."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການທົດສອບສະເຕນຊິວ (stencil testing). "
"ຈະມີບັບເຟີສະເຕນຊິວແຍກກັນສຳລັບຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມດ້ານໜ້າ ແລະ ຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມດ້ານຫຼັງ. ເບິ່ງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ "
"\"front_op\" ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີ \"back_op\" ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະດ້ານ."

msgid ""
"The method used for comparing the previous front stencil value and [member "
"front_op_reference]."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບປຽບທຽບຄ່າ front stencil ກ່ອນໜ້າ ແລະ [member front_op_reference]."

msgid "Selects which bits from the front stencil value will be compared."
msgstr "ເລືອກບິດໃດຈາກຄ່າ front stencil ທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳມາປຽບທຽບ."

msgid ""
"The operation to perform on the stencil buffer for front pixels that pass the "
"stencil test but fail the depth test."
msgstr ""
"ການປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຈະເຮັດກັບ stencil buffer ສຳລັບພິກເຊວດ້ານໜ້າ (front pixels) ທີ່ຜ່ານການທົດສອບ "
"stencil ແຕ່ບໍ່ຜ່ານການທົດສອບຄວາມເລິກ."

msgid ""
"The operation to perform on the stencil buffer for front pixels that fail the "
"stencil test."
msgstr "ການປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຈະເຮັດກັບ stencil buffer ສຳລັບພິກເຊວດ້ານໜ້າທີ່ບໍ່ຜ່ານການທົດສອບ stencil."

msgid ""
"The operation to perform on the stencil buffer for front pixels that pass the "
"stencil test."
msgstr "ການປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຈະເຮັດກັບ stencil buffer ສຳລັບພິກເຊວດ້ານໜ້າທີ່ຜ່ານການທົດສອບ stencil."

msgid "The value the previous front stencil value will be compared to."
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຄ່າ front stencil ກ່ອນໜ້າຈະຖືກນຳມາປຽບທຽບ."

msgid "Selects which bits from the front stencil value will be changed."
msgstr "ເລືອກບິດໃດຈາກຄ່າ front stencil ທີ່ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "Pipeline multisample state (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖານະການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຫຼາຍຈຸດ (multisample) ຂອງໄພພ໌ລາຍ (ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingDevice])."

msgid ""
"[RDPipelineMultisampleState] is used to control how multisample or "
"supersample antialiasing is being performed when rendering using "
"[RenderingDevice]."
msgstr ""
"[RDPipelineMultisampleState] ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມວິທີການເຮັດ multisample ຫຼື supersample "
"antialiasing ເມື່ອທຳການສະແດງຜົນໂດຍໃຊ້ [RenderingDevice]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], alpha to coverage is enabled. This generates a "
"temporary coverage value based on the alpha component of the fragment's first "
"color output. This allows alpha transparency to make use of multisample "
"antialiasing."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ alpha to coverage. ນີ້ຈະສ້າງຄ່າການກວມເອົາ "
"(coverage) ຊົ່ວຄາວໂດຍອີງຕາມສ່ວນປະກອບອັນຟາຂອງຜົນລັບສີທຳອິດຂອງ fragment. "
"ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສແບບອັນຟາສາມາດໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກ multisample antialiasing ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], alpha is forced to either [code]0.0[/code] or "
"[code]1.0[/code]. This allows hardening the edges of antialiased alpha "
"transparencies. Only relevant if [member enable_alpha_to_coverage] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ອັນຟາຈະຖືກບັງຄັບໃຫ້ເປັນ [code]0.0[/code] ຫຼື [code]1.0[/"
"code]. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂອບຂອງຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສແບບອັນຟາທີ່ເຮັດ antialiasing ແລ້ວມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຈະກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member enable_alpha_to_coverage] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables per-sample shading which replaces MSAA by SSAA. "
"This provides higher quality antialiasing that works with transparent (alpha "
"scissor) edges. This has a very high performance cost. See also [member "
"min_sample_shading]. See the [url=https://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/specs/"
"1.3-extensions/html/vkspec.html#primsrast-sampleshading]per-sample shading "
"Vulkan documentation[/url] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ per-sample shading ເຊິ່ງຈະປ່ຽນຈາກ MSAA ເປັນ "
"SSAA. ນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ antialiasing ທີ່ມີຄຸນນະພາບສູງກວ່າ ເຊິ່ງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີກັບຂອບທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສ (alpha "
"scissor). ນີ້ມີຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບສູງຫຼາຍ. ເບິ່ງ [member min_sample_shading] ຕື່ມ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/specs/1.3-extensions/html/"
"vkspec.html#primsrast-sampleshading]ເອກະສານ Vulkan ກ່ຽວກັບ per-sample shading[/"
"url] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The multiplier of [member sample_count] that determines how many samples are "
"performed for each fragment. Must be between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/"
"code] (inclusive). Only effective if [member enable_sample_shading] is "
"[code]true[/code]. If [member min_sample_shading] is [code]1.0[/code], "
"fragment invocation must only read from the coverage index sample. Tile image "
"access must not be used if [member enable_sample_shading] is [i]not[/i] "
"[code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນຂອງ [member sample_count] ທີ່ກຳນົດວ່າຈະມີການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຈັກຄັ້ງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ fragment. "
"ຕ້ອງຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/code] ແລະ [code]1.0[/code] (ລວມທັງສອງຄ່ານີ້). ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ "
"[member enable_sample_shading] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າ [member "
"min_sample_shading] ແມ່ນ [code]1.0[/code], ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ fragment "
"ຕ້ອງອ່ານຈາກຕົວຢ່າງດັດຊະນີການກວມເອົາ (coverage index sample) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕ້ອງບໍ່ໃຊ້ Tile image "
"access ຖ້າ [member enable_sample_shading] [i]ບໍ່ແມ່ນ[/i] [code]1.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"The number of MSAA samples (or SSAA samples if [member enable_sample_shading] "
"is [code]true[/code]) to perform. Higher values result in better "
"antialiasing, at the cost of performance."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຕົວຢ່າງ MSAA (ຫຼື ຕົວຢ່າງ SSAA ຖ້າ [member enable_sample_shading] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]) ທີ່ຈະເຮັດ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ໄດ້ antialiasing ທີ່ດີກວ່າ "
"ແຕ່ກໍຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ຫຼຸດລົງ."

msgid ""
"The sample mask array. See the [url=https://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/specs/"
"1.3-extensions/html/vkspec.html#fragops-samplemask]sample mask Vulkan "
"documentation[/url] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣໜ້າກາກຕົວຢ່າງ (sample mask array). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://registry.khronos.org/"
"vulkan/specs/1.3-extensions/html/vkspec.html#fragops-samplemask]ເອກະສານ "
"Vulkan ກ່ຽວກັບ sample mask[/url] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "Pipeline rasterization state (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖານະການແປງເປັນພິກເຊວ (rasterization) ຂອງໄພພ໌ລາຍ (ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingDevice])."

msgid ""
"The cull mode to use when drawing polygons, which determines whether front "
"faces or backfaces are hidden."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການຄັດອອກ (cull mode) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ແຕ້ມ polygon, ເຊິ່ງກຳນົດວ່າຈະໃຫ້ໜ້າດ້ານໜ້າ ຫຼື "
"ໜ້າດ້ານຫຼັງຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້."

msgid ""
"A limit for how much each depth value can be offset. If negative, it serves "
"as a minimum value, but if positive, it serves as a maximum value."
msgstr ""
"ຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງຄ່າອອຟເຊັດຄວາມເລິກແຕ່ລະຄ່າ. ຖ້າເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ມັນຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດ, ແຕ່ຖ້າເປັນຄ່າບວກ, "
"ມັນຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຄ່າສູງສຸດ."

msgid ""
"A constant offset added to each depth value. Applied after [member "
"depth_bias_slope_factor]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າອອຟເຊັດຄົງທີ່ທີ່ບວກໃສ່ແຕ່ລະຄ່າຄວາມເລິກ. ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຫຼັງຈາກ [member "
"depth_bias_slope_factor]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], each generated depth value will by offset by some "
"amount. The specific amount is generated per polygon based on the values of "
"[member depth_bias_slope_factor] and [member depth_bias_constant_factor]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແຕ່ລະຄ່າຄວາມເລິກທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະຖືກອອຟເຊັດຕາມຈຳນວນໃດໜຶ່ງ. "
"ຈຳນວນສະເພາະນັ້ນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຕໍ່ polygon ໂດຍອີງຕາມຄ່າຂອງ [member "
"depth_bias_slope_factor] ແລະ [member depth_bias_constant_factor]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], primitives are discarded immediately before the "
"rasterization stage."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວັດຖຸພື້ນຖານ (primitives) ຈະຖືກປະລະໃນທັນທີກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຮອດຂັ້ນຕອນ "
"rasterization."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], clamps depth values according to the minimum and "
"maximum depth of the associated viewport."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຈຳກັດ (clamp) ຄ່າຄວາມເລິກຕາມຄວາມເລິກຕ່ຳສຸດ ແລະ ສູງສຸດຂອງ "
"viewport ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"The winding order to use to determine which face of a triangle is considered "
"its front face."
msgstr ""
"ລໍາດັບການລາກເສັ້ນ (winding order) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າດ້ານໃດຂອງຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນໜ້າດ້ານໜ້າ."

msgid ""
"The line width to use when drawing lines (in pixels). Thick lines may not be "
"supported on all hardware."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງເສັ້ນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອແຕ້ມເສັ້ນ (ເປັນພິກເຊວ). ເສັ້ນທີ່ມີຄວາມໜາອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັບໃນທຸກຮາດແວ."

msgid ""
"The number of control points to use when drawing a patch with tessellation "
"enabled. Higher values result in higher quality at the cost of performance."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຈຸດຄວບຄຸມ (control points) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອແຕ້ມ patch ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ tessellation. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ສູງກວ່າ ແຕ່ກໍຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍປະສິດທິພາບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], performs wireframe rendering for triangles instead of "
"flat or textured rendering."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະທຳການສະແດງຜົນແບບໂຄງເສັ້ນ (wireframe) ສຳລັບຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມ "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນການສະແດງຜົນແບບຮາບພຽງ (flat) ຫຼື ແບບມີພື້ນຜິວ (textured)."

msgid "Pipeline shader (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "ເຊດເດີຂອງໄພພ໌ລາຍ (Pipeline shader) (ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingDevice])."

msgid ""
"Wraps a shader resource and allows specialization constants to be applied at "
"pipeline creation time.\n"
"Used by [method RenderingDevice.raytracing_pipeline_create] for ray "
"generation, miss, and hit shaders. The pipeline selects the required shader "
"stage automatically."
msgstr ""
"ຫຸ້ມຊັບພະຍາກອນເຊດເດີ ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ specialization constants ໃນຂະນະທີ່ສ້າງໄພພ໌ລາຍ.\n"
"ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [method RenderingDevice.raytracing_pipeline_create] ສຳລັບ ray "
"generation, miss, ແລະ hit shaders. ໄພພ໌ລາຍຈະເລືອກຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງເຊດເດີ (shader stage) "
"ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid "Shader resource. The required stage is selected by the pipeline."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນເຊດເດີ. ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈະຖືກເລືອກໂດຍໄພພ໌ລາຍ."

msgid ""
"Specialization constants applied to the selected shader stage at pipeline "
"creation time."
msgstr "Specialization constants ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງເຊດເດີທີ່ເລືອກໃນຂະນະທີ່ສ້າງໄພພ໌ລາຍ."

msgid "Pipeline specialization constant (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ພິເສດຂອງໄພພ໌ລາຍ (Pipeline specialization constant) (ໃຊ້ໂດຍ "
"[RenderingDevice])."

msgid ""
"A [i]specialization constant[/i] is a way to create additional variants of "
"shaders without actually increasing the number of shader versions that are "
"compiled. This allows improving performance by reducing the number of shader "
"versions and reducing [code]if[/code] branching, while still allowing shaders "
"to be flexible for different use cases.\n"
"This object is used by [RenderingDevice]."
msgstr ""
"[i]specialization constant[/i] ແມ່ນວິທີການສ້າງຕົວແປເພີ່ມເຕີມຂອງເຊດເດີ "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຈຳນວນເວີຊັນຂອງເຊດເດີທີ່ຈະຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ (compiled). "
"ນີ້ຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບໂດຍການຫຼຸດຈຳນວນເວີຊັນຂອງເຊດເດີ ແລະ ຫຼຸດການແຕກແໜງຂອງ [code]if[/code], "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຄົງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຊດເດີມີຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ.\n"
"ວັດຖຸນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingDevice]."

msgid ""
"The identifier of the specialization constant. This is a value starting from "
"[code]0[/code] and that increments for every different specialization "
"constant for a given shader."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວລະບຸ (identifier) ຂອງ specialization constant. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ [code]0[/"
"code] ແລະ ຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນສຳລັບທຸກໆ specialization constant ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນເຊດເດີນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The specialization constant's value. Only [bool], [int] and [float] types are "
"valid for specialization constants."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຂອງ specialization constant. ມີພຽງແຕ່ປະເພດ [bool], [int] ແລະ [float] "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສຳລັບ specialization constants."

msgid "Sampler state (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "ສະຖານະຕົວສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ (Sampler state) (ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingDevice])."

msgid ""
"Maximum anisotropy that can be used when sampling. Only effective if [member "
"use_anisotropy] is [code]true[/code]. Higher values result in a sharper "
"sampler at oblique angles, at the cost of performance (due to memory "
"bandwidth). This value may be limited by the graphics hardware in use. Most "
"graphics hardware only supports values up to [code]16.0[/code].\n"
"If [member anisotropy_max] is [code]1.0[/code], forcibly disables anisotropy "
"even if [member use_anisotropy] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ anisotropy ສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທຳການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ. ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member "
"use_anisotropy] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງໃນມຸມອຽງມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນ ແຕ່ກໍຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍປະສິດທິພາບ "
"(ເນື່ອງຈາກແບນວິດຂອງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ). ຄ່ານີ້ອາດຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍຮາດແວກຣາຟິກທີ່ໃຊ້ຢູ່. "
"ຮາດແວກຣາຟິກສ່ວນຫຼາຍຮອງຮັບຄ່າສູງສຸດພຽງແຕ່ [code]16.0[/code].\n"
"ຖ້າ [member anisotropy_max] ແມ່ນ [code]1.0[/code], ມັນຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານ anisotropy "
"ໂດຍບັງຄັບ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ [member use_anisotropy] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code] ກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"The border color that will be returned when sampling outside the sampler's "
"bounds and the [member repeat_u], [member repeat_v] or [member repeat_w] "
"modes have repeating disabled."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອບ (border color) ທີ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນມາ ເມື່ອທຳການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດຂອງຕົວສຸ່ມ ແລະ ໂໝດ "
"[member repeat_u], [member repeat_v] ຫຼື [member repeat_w] ຖືກປິດການເຮັດວຽກແບບຊ້ຳຄືນ "
"(repeating)."

msgid ""
"The compare operation to use. Only effective if [member enable_compare] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ການປະຕິບັດການປຽບທຽບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member enable_compare] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], returned values will be based on the comparison "
"operation defined in [member compare_op]. This is a hardware-based approach "
"and is therefore faster than performing this manually in a shader. For "
"example, compare operations are used for shadow map rendering by comparing "
"depth values from a shadow sampler."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາຈະອີງຕາມການປະຕິບັດການປຽບທຽບທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ [member "
"compare_op]. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີການທີ່ອີງໃສ່ຮາດແວ ສະນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງໄວກວ່າການເຮັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນເຊດເດີ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ການປະຕິບັດການປຽບທຽບຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນແຜນທີ່ເງົາ (shadow map) "
"ໂດຍການປຽບທຽບຄ່າຄວາມເລິກຈາກ shadow sampler."

msgid ""
"The mipmap LOD bias to use. Positive values will make the sampler blurrier at "
"a given distance, while negative values will make the sampler sharper at a "
"given distance (at the risk of looking grainy). Recommended values are "
"between [code]-0.5[/code] and [code]0.0[/code]. Only effective if the sampler "
"has mipmaps available."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ mipmap LOD bias ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ຄ່າບວກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງມີຄວາມເບຼີ (blurrier) "
"ໃນໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ກຳນົດ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າລົບຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນ (ແຕ່ອາດຈະເຫັນເປັນເມັດໆ ຫຼື grainy). "
"ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳແມ່ນລະຫວ່າງ [code]-0.5[/code] ແລະ [code]0.0[/code]. ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຕົວສຸ່ມມີ "
"mipmaps ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The sampler's magnification filter. It is the filtering method used when "
"sampling texels that appear bigger than on-screen pixels."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີການຂະຫຍາຍ (magnification filter) ຂອງຕົວສຸ່ມ. ມັນແມ່ນວິທີການກອງທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອທຳການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ "
"texels ທີ່ປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃຫຍ່ກວ່າພິກເຊວໃນໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"The maximum mipmap LOD bias to display (lowest resolution). Only effective if "
"the sampler has mipmaps available."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ mipmap LOD bias ສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະສະແດງ (ຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳສຸດ). ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຕົວສຸ່ມມີ mipmaps "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The sampler's minification filter. It is the filtering method used when "
"sampling texels that appear smaller than on-screen pixels."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີການຍໍ້ (minification filter) ຂອງຕົວສຸ່ມ. ມັນແມ່ນວິທີການກອງທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອທຳການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ "
"texels ທີ່ປະກົດຂຶ້ນນ້ອຍກວ່າພິກເຊວໃນໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"The minimum mipmap LOD bias to display (highest resolution). Only effective "
"if the sampler has mipmaps available."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ mipmap LOD bias ຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ຈະສະແດງ (ຄວາມລະອຽດສູງສຸດ). ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຕົວສຸ່ມມີ mipmaps "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "The filtering method to use for mipmaps."
msgstr "ວິທີການກອງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ mipmaps."

msgid ""
"The repeat mode to use along the U axis of UV coordinates. This affects the "
"returned values if sampling outside the UV bounds."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການຊ້ຳ (repeat mode) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຕາມແກນ U ຂອງພິກັດ UV. "
"ນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາຖ້າທຳການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດ UV."

msgid ""
"The repeat mode to use along the V axis of UV coordinates. This affects the "
"returned values if sampling outside the UV bounds."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການຊ້ຳທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຕາມແກນ V ຂອງພິກັດ UV. ນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາຖ້າທຳການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດ UV."

msgid ""
"The repeat mode to use along the W axis of UV coordinates. This affects the "
"returned values if sampling outside the UV bounds. Only effective for 3D "
"samplers."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການຊ້ຳທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຕາມແກນ W ຂອງພິກັດ UV. ນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາຖ້າທຳການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດ "
"UV. ຈະມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບຕົວສຸ່ມ 3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the texture will be sampled with coordinates ranging "
"from 0 to the texture's resolution. Otherwise, the coordinates will be "
"normalized and range from 0 to 1."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ຈະຖືກສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງດ້ວຍພິກັດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງແຕ່ 0 ຫາ "
"ຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງພື້ນຜິວ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ພິກັດຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ (normalized) ແລະ "
"ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 1."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], perform anisotropic sampling. See [member "
"anisotropy_max]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະທຳການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງແບບ anisotropic. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"anisotropy_max] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Compiled shader file in SPIR-V form (used by [RenderingDevice]). Not to be "
"confused with Godot's own [Shader]."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ເຊດເດີທີ່ຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ແລ້ວໃນຮູບແບບ SPIR-V (ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingDevice]). ຢ່າສັບສົນກັບ "
"[Shader] ຂອງ Godot ເອງ."

msgid ""
"Compiled shader file in SPIR-V form.\n"
"See also [RDShaderSource]. [RDShaderFile] is only meant to be used with the "
"[RenderingDevice] API. It should not be confused with Godot's own [Shader] "
"resource, which is what Godot's various nodes use for high-level shader "
"programming."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ເຊດເດີທີ່ຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ແລ້ວໃນຮູບແບບ SPIR-V.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [RDShaderSource] ຕື່ມ. [RDShaderFile] ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບ [RenderingDevice] API "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ມັນບໍ່ຄວນຖືກສັບສົນກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Shader] ຂອງ Godot ເອງ, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ໂນດຕ່າງໆຂອງ "
"Godot ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມເຊດເດີລະດັບສູງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the SPIR-V intermediate representation for the specified shader "
"[param version]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ SPIR-V intermediate representation ສຳລັບເຊດເດີ [param version] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Returns the list of compiled versions for this shader."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າລາຍຊື່ຂອງເວີຊັນທີ່ຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ແລ້ວສຳລັບເຊດເດີນີ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the SPIR-V [param bytecode] that will be compiled for the specified "
"[param version]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param bytecode] ຂອງ SPIR-V ທີ່ຈະຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ສຳລັບ [param version] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"The base compilation error message, which indicates errors not related to a "
"specific shader stage if non-empty. If empty, shader compilation is not "
"necessarily successful (check [RDShaderSPIRV]'s error message members)."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການຄອມໄພລ໌ພື້ນຖານ, ເຊິ່ງບົ່ງບອກເຖິງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຂັ້ນຕອນສະເພາະຂອງເຊດເດີ "
"ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມບໍ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ. ຖ້າຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການຄອມໄພລ໌ເຊດເດີສຳເລັດສະເໝີໄປ "
"(ໃຫ້ກວດສອບສະມາຊິກຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງ [RDShaderSPIRV] ຕື່ມ)."

msgid "Shader source code (used by [RenderingDevice])."
msgstr "ຊອຣ໌ສໂຄ້ດເຊດເດີ (Shader source code) (ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingDevice])."

msgid ""
"Shader source code in text form.\n"
"See also [RDShaderFile]. [RDShaderSource] is only meant to be used with the "
"[RenderingDevice] API. It should not be confused with Godot's own [Shader] "
"resource, which is what Godot's various nodes use for high-level shader "
"programming."
msgstr ""
"ຊອຣ໌ສໂຄ້ດເຊດເດີໃນຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [RDShaderFile] ຕື່ມ. [RDShaderSource] ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບ [RenderingDevice] API "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ມັນບໍ່ຄວນຖືກສັບສົນກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Shader] ຂອງ Godot ເອງ, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ໂນດຕ່າງໆຂອງ "
"Godot ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມເຊດເດີລະດັບສູງ."

msgid ""
"Returns source code for the specified shader [param stage]. Equivalent to "
"getting one of [member source_compute], [member source_fragment], [member "
"source_tesselation_control], [member source_tesselation_evaluation] or "
"[member source_vertex]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຊອຣ໌ສໂຄ້ດສຳລັບເຊດເດີ [param stage] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການດຶງເອົາໜຶ່ງໃນ [member "
"source_compute], [member source_fragment], [member "
"source_tesselation_control], [member source_tesselation_evaluation] ຫຼື [member "
"source_vertex]."

msgid ""
"Sets [param source] code for the specified shader [param stage]. Equivalent "
"to setting one of [member source_compute], [member source_fragment], [member "
"source_tesselation_control], [member source_tesselation_evaluation] or "
"[member source_vertex].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you set the compute shader source code using this method "
"directly, remember to remove the Godot-specific hint [code]#[compute][/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊອຣ໌ສໂຄ້ດ [param source] ສຳລັບເຊດເດີ [param stage] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໜຶ່ງໃນ "
"[member source_compute], [member source_fragment], [member "
"source_tesselation_control], [member source_tesselation_evaluation] ຫຼື [member "
"source_vertex].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າຊອຣ໌ສໂຄ້ດຂອງ compute shader ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ໂດຍກົງ, "
"ຢ່າລືມລຶບຄຳແນະນຳສະເພາະຂອງ Godot [code]#[compute][/code] ອອກ."

msgid "The language the shader is written in."
msgstr "ພາສາທີ່ໃຊ້ຂຽນເຊດເດີ."

msgid "Source code for the shader's any hit stage."
msgstr "ຊອຣ໌ສໂຄ້ດສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ any hit ຂອງເຊດເດີ."

msgid "Source code for the shader's closest hit stage."
msgstr "ຊອຣ໌ສໂຄ້ດສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ closest hit ຂອງເຊດເດີ."

msgid "Source code for the shader's compute stage."
msgstr "ຊອຣ໌ສໂຄ້ດສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ compute ຂອງເຊດເດີ."

msgid "Source code for the shader's fragment stage."
msgstr "ຊອຣ໌ສໂຄ້ດສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ fragment ຂອງເຊດເດີ."

msgid "Source code for the shader's intersection stage."
msgstr "ຊອຣ໌ສໂຄ້ດສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ intersection ຂອງເຊດເດີ."

msgid "Source code for the shader's miss stage."
msgstr "ຊອຣ໌ສໂຄ້ດສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ miss ຂອງເຊດເດີ."

msgid "Source code for the shader's ray generation stage."
msgstr "ຊອຣ໌ສໂຄ້ດສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ ray generation ຂອງເຊດເດີ."

msgid "Source code for the shader's tessellation control stage."
msgstr "ຊອຣ໌ສໂຄ້ດສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ tessellation control ຂອງເຊດເດີ."

msgid "Source code for the shader's tessellation evaluation stage."
msgstr "ຊອຣ໌ສໂຄ້ດສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ tessellation evaluation ຂອງເຊດເດີ."

msgid "Source code for the shader's vertex stage."
msgstr "ຊອຣ໌ສໂຄ້ດສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ vertex ຂອງເຊດເດີ."

msgid ""
"SPIR-V intermediate representation as part of an [RDShaderFile] (used by "
"[RenderingDevice])."
msgstr ""
"SPIR-V intermediate representation ເຊິ່ງເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ [RDShaderFile] (ໃຊ້ໂດຍ "
"[RenderingDevice])."

msgid ""
"[RDShaderSPIRV] represents an [RDShaderFile]'s [url=https://www.khronos.org/"
"spir/]SPIR-V[/url] code for various shader stages, as well as possible "
"compilation error messages. SPIR-V is a low-level intermediate shader "
"representation. This intermediate representation is not used directly by GPUs "
"for rendering, but it can be compiled into binary shaders that GPUs can "
"understand. Unlike compiled shaders, SPIR-V is portable across GPU models and "
"driver versions.\n"
"This object is used by [RenderingDevice]."
msgstr ""
"[RDShaderSPIRV] ສະແດງເຖິງລະຫັດ [url=https://www.khronos.org/spir/]SPIR-V[/url] "
"ຂອງ [RDShaderFile] ສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນຕ່າງໆຂອງເຊດເດີ, "
"ລວມທັງຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການຄອມໄພລ໌ທີ່ອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ. SPIR-V "
"ແມ່ນການສະແດງເຊດເດີລະດັບກາງແບບລະດັບຕ່ຳ (low-level intermediate shader "
"representation). ການສະແດງລະດັບກາງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍກົງໂດຍ GPUs ສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນ, "
"ແຕ່ມັນສາມາດຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ເປັນໄບນາຣີເຊດເດີທີ່ GPUs ສາມາດເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້. ບໍ່ຄືກັບເຊດເດີທີ່ຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ແລ້ວ, "
"SPIR-V ສາມາດໃຊ້ຂ້າມລຸ້ນ GPU ແລະ ເວີຊັນຂອງໄດຣເວີໄດ້.\n"
"ວັດຖຸນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingDevice]."

msgid ""
"Equivalent to getting one of [member bytecode_compute], [member "
"bytecode_fragment], [member bytecode_tesselation_control], [member "
"bytecode_tesselation_evaluation], [member bytecode_vertex]."
msgstr ""
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການດຶງເອົາໜຶ່ງໃນ [member bytecode_compute], [member bytecode_fragment], "
"[member bytecode_tesselation_control], [member "
"bytecode_tesselation_evaluation] ຫຼື [member bytecode_vertex]."

msgid ""
"Returns the compilation error message for the given shader [param stage]. "
"Equivalent to getting one of [member compile_error_compute], [member "
"compile_error_fragment], [member compile_error_tesselation_control], [member "
"compile_error_tesselation_evaluation], [member compile_error_vertex]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການຄອມໄພລ໌ສຳລັບເຊດເດີ [param stage] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການດຶງເອົາໜຶ່ງໃນ [member compile_error_compute], [member "
"compile_error_fragment], [member compile_error_tesselation_control], [member "
"compile_error_tesselation_evaluation] ຫຼື [member compile_error_vertex]."

msgid ""
"Sets the SPIR-V [param bytecode] for the given shader [param stage]. "
"Equivalent to setting one of [member bytecode_compute], [member "
"bytecode_fragment], [member bytecode_tesselation_control], [member "
"bytecode_tesselation_evaluation], [member bytecode_vertex]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param bytecode] ຂອງ SPIR-V ສຳລັບເຊດເດີ [param stage] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໜຶ່ງໃນ [member bytecode_compute], [member bytecode_fragment], "
"[member bytecode_tesselation_control], [member "
"bytecode_tesselation_evaluation] ຫຼື [member bytecode_vertex]."

msgid ""
"Sets the compilation error message for the given shader [param stage] to "
"[param compile_error]. Equivalent to setting one of [member "
"compile_error_compute], [member compile_error_fragment], [member "
"compile_error_tesselation_control], [member "
"compile_error_tesselation_evaluation], [member compile_error_vertex]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການຄອມໄພລ໌ (compilation error) ສໍາລັບ [param stage] "
"ຂອງເຊເດີທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ເປັນ [param compile_error]. ເຊິ່ງທຽບເທົ່າກັບການກຳນົດຄ່າໃດໜຶ່ງໃນ [member "
"compile_error_compute], [member compile_error_fragment], [member "
"compile_error_tesselation_control], [member "
"compile_error_tesselation_evaluation], [member compile_error_vertex]."

msgid "The SPIR-V bytecode for the any hit shader stage."
msgstr "ໄບທ໌ໂຄດ (bytecode) SPIR-V ສໍາລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ any hit shader."

