msgstr "ໄບທ໌ໂຄດ (bytecode) SPIR-V ສໍາລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ tessellation evaluation shader."

msgid "The SPIR-V bytecode for the vertex shader stage."
msgstr "ໄບທ໌ໂຄດ (bytecode) SPIR-V ສໍາລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ vertex shader."

msgid ""
"The compilation error message for the any hit shader stage (set by the SPIR-V "
"compiler and Godot). If empty, shader compilation was successful."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການຄອມໄພລ໌ສໍາລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ any hit shader (ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ SPIR-V compiler ແລະ "
"Godot). ຫາກວ່າງເປົ່າ, ສະແດງວ່າການຄອມໄພລ໌ເຊເດີສຳເລັດ."

