msgid "Server for anything visible."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີສຳລັບທຸກສິ່ງທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The rendering server is the API backend for everything visible. The whole "
"scene system mounts on it to display. The rendering server is completely "
"opaque: the internals are entirely implementation-specific and cannot be "
"accessed.\n"
"The rendering server can be used to bypass the scene/[Node] system entirely. "
"This can improve performance in cases where the scene system is the "
"bottleneck, but won't improve performance otherwise (for instance, if the GPU "
"is already fully utilized).\n"
"Resources are created using the [code]*_create[/code] functions. These "
"functions return [RID]s which are not references to the objects themselves, "
"but opaque [i]pointers[/i] towards these objects.\n"
"All objects are drawn to a viewport. You can use the [Viewport] attached to "
"the [SceneTree] or you can create one yourself with [method viewport_create]. "
"When using a custom scenario or canvas, the scenario or canvas needs to be "
"attached to the viewport using [method viewport_set_scenario] or [method "
"viewport_attach_canvas].\n"
"[b]Scenarios:[/b] In 3D, all visual objects must be associated with a "
"scenario. The scenario is a visual representation of the world. If accessing "
"the rendering server from a running game, the scenario can be accessed from "
"the scene tree from any [Node3D] node with [method Node3D.get_world_3d]. "
"Otherwise, a scenario can be created with [method scenario_create].\n"
"Similarly, in 2D, a canvas is needed to draw all canvas items.\n"
"[b]3D:[/b] In 3D, all visible objects are comprised of a resource and an "
"instance. A resource can be a mesh, a particle system, a light, or any other "
"3D object. In order to be visible resources must be attached to an instance "
"using [method instance_set_base]. The instance must also be attached to the "
"scenario using [method instance_set_scenario] in order to be visible. "
"RenderingServer methods that don't have a prefix are usually 3D-specific (but "
"not always).\n"
"[b]2D:[/b] In 2D, all visible objects are some form of canvas item. In order "
"to be visible, a canvas item needs to be the child of a canvas attached to a "
"viewport, or it needs to be the child of another canvas item that is "
"eventually attached to the canvas. 2D-specific RenderingServer methods "
"generally start with [code]canvas_*[/code].\n"
"[b]Headless mode:[/b] Starting the engine with the [code]--headless[/code] "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command line "
"argument[/url] disables all rendering and window management functions. Most "
"functions from [RenderingServer] will return dummy values in this case."
msgstr ""
"Rendering Server ແມ່ນ API ເບື້ອງຫຼັງສຳລັບທຸກສິ່ງທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້. ລະບົບສາກ (scene) "
"ທັງໝົດແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບມັນເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນ. Rendering Server ແມ່ນແບບທຶບແສງ (opaque) ຢ່າງສົມບູນ: "
"ລະບົບພາຍໃນແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບການຈັດການສະເພາະ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ.\n"
"Rendering Server ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຂ້າມລະບົບ scene/[Node] ໄດ້ທັງໝົດ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ລະບົບ scene ເປັນຈຸດອຸດຕັນ (bottleneck), ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ຊ່ວຍຫາກ "
"GPU ຖືກໃຊ້ງານເຕັມທີ່ຢູ່ແລ້ວ.\n"
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນ (Resources) ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ [code]*_create[/code]. ຟັງຊັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[RID] ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ແມ່ນການອ້າງອີງເຖິງວັດຖຸໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ເປັນ [i]ຕົວຊີ້ (pointers)[/i] ໄປຫາວັດຖຸເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ວັດຖຸທັງໝົດຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໃສ່ວິວພອດ (viewport). ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [Viewport] ທີ່ຕິດມາກັບ [SceneTree] ຫຼື "
"ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເອງດ້ວຍ [method viewport_create]. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ scenario ຫຼື canvas ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, "
"ພວກມັນຕ້ອງຖືກແນບເຂົ້າກັບວິວພອດໂດຍໃຊ້ [method viewport_set_scenario] ຫຼື [method "
"viewport_attach_canvas].\n"
"[b]Scenarios:[/b] ໃນ 3D, ວັດຖຸທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ທັງໝົດຕ້ອງກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ scenario. scenario "
"ແມ່ນການສະແດງພາບຂອງໂລກ. ຫາກເຂົ້າເຖິງ Rendering Server ຈາກເກມທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, scenario "
"ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກ scene tree ຜ່ານໂນດ [Node3D] ໃດກໍໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method "
"Node3D.get_world_3d]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, scenario ສາມາດສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method "
"scenario_create].\n"
"ໃນທຳນອງດຽວກັນ, ໃນ 2D, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ canvas ເພື່ອແຕ້ມ canvas items ທັງໝົດ.\n"
"[b]3D:[/b] ໃນ 3D, ວັດຖຸທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ທັງໝົດປະກອບດ້ວຍ resource ແລະ instance. resource "
"ອາດເປັນ mesh, ລະບົບພາກສ່ວນ (particle system), ແສງ, ຫຼື ວັດຖຸ 3D ອື່ນໆ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້, "
"resource ຕ້ອງຖືກແນບເຂົ້າກັບ instance ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method instance_set_base]. instance "
"ຍັງຕ້ອງຖືກແນບເຂົ້າກັບ scenario ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method instance_set_scenario] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້. "
"ວິທີການຂອງ RenderingServer ທີ່ບໍ່ມີຄຳນຳໜ້າມັກຈະເປັນສະເພາະສຳລັບ 3D (ແຕ່ບໍ່ສະເໝີໄປ).\n"
"[b]2D:[/b] ໃນ 2D, ວັດຖຸທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ທັງໝົດແມ່ນບາງຮູບແບບຂອງ canvas item. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້, "
"canvas item ຕ້ອງເປັນລູກຂອງ canvas ທີ່ແນບກັບວິວພອດ, ຫຼື ເປັນລູກຂອງ canvas item ອື່ນທີ່ແນບກັບ "
"canvas. ວິທີການຂອງ RenderingServer ທີ່ເປັນສະເພາະ 2D ມັກຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [code]canvas_*[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Headless mode:[/b] ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເອນຈິນດ້ວຍ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]argument ຄຳສັ່ງ[/url] [code]--headless[/code] "
"ຈະປິດການເຣັນເດີ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນການຈັດການວິນໂດທັງໝົດ. ຟັງຊັນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈາກ [RenderingServer] ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"dummy ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້."

msgid "Optimization using Servers"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມໂດຍໃຊ້ Servers"

msgid ""
"Creates a new area light and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID can be used in most "
"[code]light_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"To place in a scene, attach this area light to an instance using [method "
"instance_set_base] using the returned RID.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent node is [AreaLight3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງແສງແບບພື້ນທີ່ (area light) ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
"RID ທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນມາ. RID ນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນຟັງຊັນ [code]light_*[/code] ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຄວນລຶບ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"ເພື່ອວາງໃນສາກ, ໃຫ້ແນບແສງແບບພື້ນທີ່ນີ້ເຂົ້າກັບ instance ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method instance_set_base] "
"ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບມາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [AreaLight3D]."

msgid ""
"Bakes the material data of the Mesh passed in the [param base] parameter with "
"optional [param material_overrides] to a set of [Image]s of size [param "
"image_size]. Returns an array of [Image]s containing material properties as "
"specified in [enum BakeChannels]."
msgstr ""
"ອົບ (Bake) ຂໍ້ມູນວັດສະດຸຂອງ Mesh ທີ່ສົ່ງມາໃນພາຣາມິເຕີ [param base] ພ້ອມກັບ [param "
"material_overrides] ທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ ໃຫ້ກາຍເປັນຊຸດຂອງ [Image] ຕາມຂະໜາດ [param "
"image_size]. ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນອາເຣຂອງ [Image] ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດວັດສະດຸຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ [enum "
"BakeChannels]."

msgid ""
"As the RenderingServer actual logic may run on a separate thread, accessing "
"its internals from the main (or any other) thread will result in errors. To "
"make it easier to run code that can safely access the rendering internals "
"(such as [RenderingDevice] and similar RD classes), push a callable via this "
"function so it will be executed on the render thread."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກໂລຈິກຕົວຈິງຂອງ RenderingServer ອາດເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນເທຣດ (thread) ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, "
"ການເຂົ້າເຖິງລະບົບພາຍໃນຈາກເທຣດຫຼັກ (ຫຼື ເທຣດອື່ນໆ) ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ. "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການລັນໂຄ້ດທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງລະບົບພາຍໃນການເຣັນເດີ (ເຊັ່ນ [RenderingDevice] ແລະ ຄລາດ RD ອື່ນໆ) "
"ເຮັດໄດ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພ, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງ callable ຜ່ານຟັງຊັນນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນ render thread."

msgid ""
"Creates a camera attributes object and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can "
"be accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all "
"[code]camera_attributes_[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent resource is [CameraAttributes]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງວັດຖຸຄຸນລັກສະນະກ້ອງ ແລະ ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນຟັງຊັນ [code]camera_attributes_[/code] ທັງໝົດຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລຶບ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີ [method free_rid].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [CameraAttributes]."

msgid ""
"Sets the parameters to use with the auto-exposure effect. These parameters "
"take on the same meaning as their counterparts in [CameraAttributes] and "
"[CameraAttributesPractical]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບເອັບເຟັກການປັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດ (auto-exposure). "
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີຄວາມໝາຍຄືກັນກັບໃນ [CameraAttributes] ແລະ [CameraAttributesPractical]."

msgid ""
"Sets the parameters to use with the DOF blur effect. These parameters take on "
"the same meaning as their counterparts in [CameraAttributesPractical]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບເອັບເຟັກເບຼີຕາມຄວາມເລິກ (DOF blur). ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີຄວາມໝາຍຄືກັນກັບໃນ "
"[CameraAttributesPractical]."

msgid ""
"Sets the shape of the DOF bokeh pattern to [param shape]. Different shapes "
"may be used to achieve artistic effect, or to meet performance targets."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບຮ່າງຂອງລວດລາຍ DOF bokeh ເປັນ [param shape]. "
"ຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນອາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງເອັບເຟັກທາງສິລະປະ ຫຼື ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຕາມເປົ້າໝາຍປະສິດທິພາບ."

msgid ""
"Sets the quality level of the DOF blur effect to [param quality]. [param "
"use_jitter] can be used to jitter samples taken during the blur pass to hide "
"artifacts at the cost of looking more fuzzy."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລະດັບຄຸນນະພາບຂອງເອັບເຟັກ DOF blur ເປັນ [param quality]. [param use_jitter] "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສຸ່ມການສັ່ນ (jitter) ຕົວຢ່າງໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການເບຼີເພື່ອເຊື່ອງຮອຍທີ່ບໍ່ເພິ່ງປະສົງ "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບເບິ່ງມົວຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the exposure values that will be used by the renderers. The "
"normalization amount is used to bake a given Exposure Value (EV) into "
"rendering calculations to reduce the dynamic range of the scene.\n"
"The normalization factor can be calculated from exposure value (EV100) as "
"follows:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func get_exposure_normalization(ev100: float):\n"
"\treturn 1.0 / (pow(2.0, ev100) * 1.2)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"The exposure value can be calculated from aperture (in f-stops), shutter "
"speed (in seconds), and sensitivity (in ISO) as follows:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func get_exposure(aperture: float, shutter_speed: float, sensitivity: "
"float):\n"
"\treturn log((aperture * aperture) / shutter_speed * (100.0 / sensitivity)) / "
"log(2)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການປັບແສງ (exposure) ທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວເຣັນເດີ. ຄ່າການປັບປົກກະຕິ (normalization) "
"ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອອົບຄ່າ Exposure Value (EV) ເຂົ້າໃນການຄິດໄລ່ການເຣັນເດີເພື່ອຫຼຸດຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກຂອງສາກ.\n"
"ປັດໄຈການປັບປົກກະຕິສາມາດຄິດໄລ່ຈາກຄ່າ exposure (EV100) ໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func get_exposure_normalization(ev100: float):\n"
"\treturn 1.0 / (pow(2.0, ev100) * 1.2)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ຄ່າ exposure ສາມາດຄິດໄລ່ຈາກຮູຮັບແສງ (f-stops), ຄວາມໄວຊັດເຕີ (ວິນາທີ), ແລະ ຄວາມໄວແສງ "
"(ISO) ໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func get_exposure(aperture: float, shutter_speed: float, sensitivity: "
"float):\n"
"\treturn log((aperture * aperture) / shutter_speed * (100.0 / sensitivity)) / "
"log(2)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Creates a 3D camera and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be accessed "
"with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all [code]camera_*[/"
"code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent node is [Camera3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງກ້ອງ 3D ແລະ ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນມາ. RID "
"ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນຟັງຊັນ [code]camera_*[/code] ທັງໝົດຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລຶບ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີ [method free_rid].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [Camera3D]."

msgid ""
"Sets the camera_attributes created with [method camera_attributes_create] to "
"the given camera."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ camera_attributes ທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍ [method camera_attributes_create] ໃຫ້ກັບກ້ອງທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the compositor used by this camera. Equivalent to [member "
"Camera3D.compositor]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວປະກອບພາບ (compositor) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍກ້ອງນີ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member Camera3D.compositor]."

msgid ""
"Sets the cull mask associated with this camera. The cull mask describes which "
"3D layers are rendered by this camera. Equivalent to [member "
"Camera3D.cull_mask]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າມາກຄັດອອກ (cull mask) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບກ້ອງນີ້. ມາກຄັດອອກຈະບອກວ່າຊັ້ນ 3D "
"ໃດແດ່ທີ່ຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີໂດຍກ້ອງນີ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member Camera3D.cull_mask]."

msgid ""
"Sets the environment used by this camera. Equivalent to [member "
"Camera3D.environment]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environment) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍກ້ອງນີ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"Camera3D.environment]."

msgid ""
"Sets camera to use frustum projection. This mode allows adjusting the [param "
"offset] argument to create \"tilted frustum\" effects."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າກ້ອງໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການສາຍພາບແບບ frustum. ໂໝດນີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປັບ [param offset] ເພື່ອສ້າງເອັບເຟັກ "
"\"frustum ແບບອຽງ\"."

msgid ""
"Sets camera to use orthogonal projection, also known as orthographic "
"projection. Objects remain the same size on the screen no matter how far away "
"they are."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າກ້ອງໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການສາຍພາບແບບ orthogonal (ຫຼື orthographic). ວັດຖຸຈະມີຂະໜາດເທົ່າເດີມເທິງໜ້າຈໍ "
"ບໍ່ວ່າພວກມັນຈະຢູ່ຫ່າງອອກໄປເທົ່າໃດກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Sets camera to use perspective projection. Objects on the screen becomes "
"smaller when they are far away."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າກ້ອງໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການສາຍພາບແບບ perspective. ວັດຖຸເທິງໜ້າຈໍຈະນ້ອຍລົງເມື່ອພວກມັນຢູ່ຫ່າງອອກໄປ."

msgid "Sets [Transform3D] of camera."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Transform3D] ຂອງກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], preserves the horizontal aspect ratio which is "
"equivalent to [constant Camera3D.KEEP_WIDTH]. If [code]false[/code], "
"preserves the vertical aspect ratio which is equivalent to [constant "
"Camera3D.KEEP_HEIGHT]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນແນວນອນ ເຊິ່ງທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [constant "
"Camera3D.KEEP_WIDTH]. ຖ້າ [code]false[/code], ຈະຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນແນວຕັ້ງ ເຊິ່ງທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[constant Camera3D.KEEP_HEIGHT]."

msgid ""
"Creates a canvas and returns the assigned [RID]. It can be accessed with the "
"RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all [code]canvas_*[/code] "
"RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"Canvas has no [Resource] or [Node] equivalent."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ canvas ແລະ ຄືນຄ່າ [RID] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ. RID "
"ນີ້ຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]canvas_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"Canvas ບໍ່ມີສິ່ງທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າໃນຮູບແບບ [Resource] ຫຼື [Node]."

msgid ""
"Draws a circle on the [CanvasItem] pointed to by the [param item] [RID]. See "
"also [method CanvasItem.draw_circle]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຮູບວົງມົນເທິງ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ຊີ້ໂດຍ [param item] [RID]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"CanvasItem.draw_circle] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"If [param ignore] is [code]true[/code], ignore clipping on items drawn with "
"this canvas item until this is called again with [param ignore] set to "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param ignore] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະລະເວັ້ນການຕັດຂອບ (clipping) "
"ໃນລາຍການທີ່ແຕ້ມດ້ວຍ canvas item ນີ້ ຈົນກວ່າຈະມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄືນໃໝ່ໂດຍຕັ້ງ [param ignore] ເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Draws an ellipse with semi-major axis [param major] and semi-minor axis "
"[param minor] on the [CanvasItem] pointed to by the [param item] [RID]. See "
"also [method CanvasItem.draw_ellipse]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຮູບວົງລີທີ່ມີແກນເອກ [param major] ແລະ ແກນໂທ [param minor] ເທິງ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ຊີ້ໂດຍ "
"[param item] [RID]. ເບິ່ງ [method CanvasItem.draw_ellipse] ຕື່ມ."

msgid "See also [method CanvasItem.draw_lcd_texture_rect_region]."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ [method CanvasItem.draw_lcd_texture_rect_region] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Draws a line on the [CanvasItem] pointed to by the [param item] [RID]. See "
"also [method CanvasItem.draw_line]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຊື່ເທິງ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ຊີ້ໂດຍ [param item] [RID]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"CanvasItem.draw_line] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Draws a mesh created with [method mesh_create] with given [param transform], "
"[param modulate] color, and [param texture]. This is used internally by "
"[MeshInstance2D]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມເມຊ (mesh) ທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍ [method mesh_create] ດ້ວຍ [param transform], ສີ [param "
"modulate], ແລະ [param texture] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ນີ້ແມ່ນຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ພາຍໃນໂດຍ [MeshInstance2D]."

msgid "See also [method CanvasItem.draw_msdf_texture_rect_region]."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ [method CanvasItem.draw_msdf_texture_rect_region] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Draws a 2D multiline on the [CanvasItem] pointed to by the [param item] "
"[RID]. See also [method CanvasItem.draw_multiline] and [method "
"CanvasItem.draw_multiline_colors]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຫຼາຍເສັ້ນ (multiline) ແບບ 2D ເທິງ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ຊີ້ໂດຍ [param item] [RID]. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method CanvasItem.draw_multiline] ແລະ [method "
"CanvasItem.draw_multiline_colors] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Draws a 2D [MultiMesh] on the [CanvasItem] pointed to by the [param item] "
"[RID]. See also [method CanvasItem.draw_multimesh]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ [MultiMesh] ແບບ 2D ເທິງ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ຊີ້ໂດຍ [param item] [RID]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"CanvasItem.draw_multimesh] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Draws a nine-patch rectangle on the [CanvasItem] pointed to by the [param "
"item] [RID]."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກແບບ nine-patch ເທິງ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ຊີ້ໂດຍ [param item] [RID]."

msgid ""
"Draws particles on the [CanvasItem] pointed to by the [param item] [RID]."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມອະນຸພາກ (particles) ເທິງ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ຊີ້ໂດຍ [param item] [RID]."

msgid ""
"Draws a 2D polygon on the [CanvasItem] pointed to by the [param item] [RID]. "
"If you need more flexibility (such as being able to use bones), use [method "
"canvas_item_add_triangle_array] instead. See also [method "
"CanvasItem.draw_polygon].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you frequently redraw the same polygon with a large number of "
"vertices, consider pre-calculating the triangulation with [method "
"Geometry2D.triangulate_polygon] and using [method CanvasItem.draw_mesh], "
"[method CanvasItem.draw_multimesh], or [method "
"canvas_item_add_triangle_array]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ (polygon) ແບບ 2D ເທິງ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ຊີ້ໂດຍ [param item] [RID]. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄວາມຍືດຫຍຸ່ນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ການໃຊ້ກະດູກ), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"canvas_item_add_triangle_array] ແທນ. ເບິ່ງ [method CanvasItem.draw_polygon] "
"ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານແຕ້ມຮູບຫຼາຍແຈເດີມຊ້ຳໆ ທີ່ມີຈຳນວນຈຸດ (vertices) ຫຼາຍ, "
"ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາການຄຳນວນຮູບສາມແຈລ່ວງໜ້າດ້ວຍ [method Geometry2D.triangulate_polygon] ແລະ "
"ໃຊ້ [method CanvasItem.draw_mesh], [method CanvasItem.draw_multimesh], ຫຼື "
"[method canvas_item_add_triangle_array] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Draws a 2D polyline on the [CanvasItem] pointed to by the [param item] [RID]. "
"See also [method CanvasItem.draw_polyline] and [method "
"CanvasItem.draw_polyline_colors]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຕໍ່ (polyline) ແບບ 2D ເທິງ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ຊີ້ໂດຍ [param item] [RID]. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method CanvasItem.draw_polyline] ແລະ [method "
"CanvasItem.draw_polyline_colors] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Draws a 2D primitive on the [CanvasItem] pointed to by the [param item] "
"[RID]. See also [method CanvasItem.draw_primitive]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຮູບຊົງພື້ນຖານ (primitive) ແບບ 2D ເທິງ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ຊີ້ໂດຍ [param item] [RID]. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method CanvasItem.draw_primitive] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Draws a rectangle on the [CanvasItem] pointed to by the [param item] [RID]. "
"See also [method CanvasItem.draw_rect]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກເທິງ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ຊີ້ໂດຍ [param item] [RID]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"CanvasItem.draw_rect] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Sets a [Transform2D] that will be used to transform subsequent canvas item "
"commands."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Transform2D] ທີ່ຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ເພື່ອແປງ (transform) ຄຳສັ່ງ canvas item ຕໍ່ໆໄປ."

msgid ""
"Draws a 2D textured rectangle on the [CanvasItem] pointed to by the [param "
"item] [RID]. See also [method CanvasItem.draw_texture_rect] and [method "
"Texture2D.draw_rect]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ມີພື້ນຜິວ (textured rectangle) ແບບ 2D ເທິງ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ຊີ້ໂດຍ [param "
"item] [RID]. ເບິ່ງ [method CanvasItem.draw_texture_rect] ແລະ [method "
"Texture2D.draw_rect] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Draws the specified region of a 2D textured rectangle on the [CanvasItem] "
"pointed to by the [param item] [RID]. See also [method "
"CanvasItem.draw_texture_rect_region] and [method Texture2D.draw_rect_region]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມສ່ວນທີ່ກຳນົດຂອງຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ມີພື້ນຜິວແບບ 2D ເທິງ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ຊີ້ໂດຍ [param item] [RID]. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method CanvasItem.draw_texture_rect_region] ແລະ [method "
"Texture2D.draw_rect_region] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Draws a triangle array on the [CanvasItem] pointed to by the [param item] "
"[RID]. This is internally used by [Line2D] and [StyleBoxFlat] for rendering. "
"[method canvas_item_add_triangle_array] is highly flexible, but more complex "
"to use than [method canvas_item_add_polygon].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [param count] is set to a non-negative value, only the first "
"[code]count * 3[/code] indices (corresponding to [code skip-lint]count[/code] "
"triangles) will be drawn. Otherwise, all indices are drawn."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມອາເຣຂອງຮູບສາມແຈເທິງ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ຊີ້ໂດຍ [param item] [RID]. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ພາຍໃນໂດຍ [Line2D] ແລະ [StyleBoxFlat] ສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນ. [method "
"canvas_item_add_triangle_array] ມີຄວາມຍືດຫຍຸ່ນສູງ, ແຕ່ມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນໃນການນໍາໃຊ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າ "
"[method canvas_item_add_polygon].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [param count] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄ່າລົບ, ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ດັດຊະນີ [code]count "
"* 3[/code] ທຳອິດ (ເທົ່າກັບຈຳນວນ [code skip-lint]count[/code] ຮູບສາມແຈ) ທີ່ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມ. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ດັດຊະນີທັງໝົດຈະຖືກແຕ້ມ."

msgid "Attaches a skeleton to the [CanvasItem]. Removes the previous skeleton."
msgstr "ຕິດໂຄງກະດູກ (skeleton) ເຂົ້າກັບ [CanvasItem]. ຈະລຶບໂຄງກະດູກກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ອອກ."

msgid "Clears the [CanvasItem] and removes all commands in it."
msgstr "ລ້າງ [CanvasItem] ແລະ ລຶບຄຳສັ່ງທັງໝົດໃນນັ້ນອອກ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new CanvasItem instance and returns its [RID]. It can be accessed "
"with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all "
"[code]canvas_item_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent node is [CanvasItem]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ຂອງ CanvasItem ໃໝ່ ແລະ ຄືນຄ່າ [RID] ຂອງມັນ. "
"ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]canvas_item_*[/"
"code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດ (node) ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [CanvasItem]."

msgid ""
"Returns the value of the per-instance shader uniform from the specified "
"canvas item instance. Equivalent to [method "
"CanvasItem.get_instance_shader_parameter]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຂອງ shader uniform ແບບ per-instance ຈາກ canvas item instance ທີ່ກຳນົດ. "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [method CanvasItem.get_instance_shader_parameter]."

msgid ""
"Returns the default value of the per-instance shader uniform from the "
"specified canvas item instance. Equivalent to [method "
"CanvasItem.get_instance_shader_parameter]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ shader uniform ແບບ per-instance ຈາກ canvas item instance ທີ່ກຳນົດ. "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [method CanvasItem.get_instance_shader_parameter]."

msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary of per-instance shader uniform names of the per-instance "
"shader uniform from the specified canvas item instance.\n"
"The returned dictionary is in PropertyInfo format, with the keys [code]name[/"
"code], [code]class_name[/code], [code]type[/code], [code]hint[/code], "
"[code]hint_string[/code], and [code]usage[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າພົດຈະນານຸກົມ (dictionary) ຂອງຊື່ shader uniform ແບບ per-instance ຈາກ canvas "
"item instance ທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"ພົດຈະນານຸກົມທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາຈະຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ PropertyInfo, ໂດຍມີຄີ (keys) ແມ່ນ [code]name[/code], "
"[code]class_name[/code], [code]type[/code], [code]hint[/code], "
"[code]hint_string[/code], ແລະ [code]usage[/code]."

msgid ""
"Prevents physics interpolation for the current physics tick.\n"
"This is useful when moving a canvas item to a new location, to give an "
"instantaneous change rather than interpolation from the previous location."
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອງກັນການແຊກສະຫຼັບ (interpolation) ທາງຟີຊິກສຳລັບຮອບການທຳງານຟີຊິກປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອຍ້າຍ canvas item ໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງໃໝ່, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເກີດການປ່ຽນແປງໃນທັນທີ "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະມີການແຊກສະຫຼັບຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງກ່ອນໜ້າ."

msgid ""
"Sets the canvas group mode used during 2D rendering for the canvas item "
"specified by the [param item] RID. For faster but more limited clipping, use "
"[method canvas_item_set_clip] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent node functionality is found in [CanvasGroup] and "
"[member CanvasItem.clip_children]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບແບບກຸ່ມ canvas (canvas group mode) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສະແດງຜົນ 2D ສຳລັບ canvas "
"item ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param item] RID. ສຳລັບການຕັດຂອບທີ່ໄວກວ່າແຕ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[method canvas_item_set_clip] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນຂອງໂນດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າສາມາດພົບໄດ້ໃນ [CanvasGroup] ແລະ [member "
"CanvasItem.clip_children]."

msgid ""
"If [param clip] is [code]true[/code], makes the canvas item specified by the "
"[param item] RID not draw anything outside of its rect's coordinates. This "
"clipping is fast, but works only with axis-aligned rectangles. This means "
"that rotation is ignored by the clipping rectangle. For more advanced "
"clipping shapes, use [method canvas_item_set_canvas_group_mode] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent node functionality is found in [member "
"Label.clip_text], [RichTextLabel] (always enabled) and more."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param clip] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ canvas item ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param "
"item] RID ບໍ່ແຕ້ມສິ່ງໃດນອກພິກັດຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກຂອງມັນ. ການຕັດຂອບນີ້ແມ່ນໄວ, "
"ແຕ່ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ວາງຕາມແກນ (axis-aligned). "
"ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການໝູນຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນໂດຍຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ຕັດຂອບ. ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງການຕັດຂອບທີ່ສູງກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[method canvas_item_set_canvas_group_mode] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນຂອງໂນດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າສາມາດພົບໄດ້ໃນ [member Label.clip_text], "
"[RichTextLabel] (ເປີດໃຊ້ງານສະເໝີ) ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

msgid "Sets the [CanvasItem] to copy a rect to the backbuffer."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [CanvasItem] ເພື່ອສຳເນົາຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກໄປຫາ backbuffer."

msgid ""
"If [param use_custom_rect] is [code]true[/code], sets the custom visibility "
"rectangle (used for culling) to [param rect] for the canvas item specified by "
"[param item]. Setting a custom visibility rect can reduce CPU load when "
"drawing lots of 2D instances. If [param use_custom_rect] is [code]false[/"
"code], automatically computes a visibility rectangle based on the canvas "
"item's draw commands."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param use_custom_rect] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກການເບິ່ງເຫັນແບບກຳນົດເອງ (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຄັດອອກ) ເປັນ [param rect] ສຳລັບ "
"canvas item ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param item]. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ rect "
"ການເບິ່ງເຫັນແບບກຳນົດເອງສາມາດຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ CPU ເມື່ອມີການແຕ້ມ 2D instance "
"ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ຖ້າ [param use_custom_rect] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ມັນຈະຄຳນວນຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກການເບິ່ງເຫັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍອີງຕາມຄຳສັ່ງການແຕ້ມຂອງ canvas item."

msgid ""
"Sets the default texture filter mode for the canvas item specified by the "
"[param item] RID. Equivalent to [member CanvasItem.texture_filter]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບແບບການກັ່ນຕອງພື້ນຜິວ (texture filter mode) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ canvas item ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ "
"[param item] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member CanvasItem.texture_filter]."

msgid ""
"Sets the default texture repeat mode for the canvas item specified by the "
"[param item] RID. Equivalent to [member CanvasItem.texture_repeat]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບແບບການເຮັດຊ້ຳພື້ນຜິວ (texture repeat mode) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ canvas item ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ "
"[param item] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member CanvasItem.texture_repeat]."

msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], enables multichannel signed distance "
"field rendering mode for the canvas item specified by the [param item] RID. "
"This is meant to be used for font rendering, or with specially generated "
"images using [url=https://github.com/Chlumsky/msdfgen]msdfgen[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂໝດການສະແດງຜົນ "
"multichannel signed distance field ສຳລັບ canvas item ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param item] "
"RID. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນຕົວອັກສອນ, ຫຼື ກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເປັນພິເສດໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[url=https://github.com/Chlumsky/msdfgen]msdfgen[/url]."

msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], draws the canvas item specified by "
"the [param item] RID behind its parent. Equivalent to [member "
"CanvasItem.show_behind_parent]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະແຕ້ມ canvas item ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param "
"item] RID ໄວ້ທາງຫຼັງຂອງ parent ຂອງມັນ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"CanvasItem.show_behind_parent]."

msgid "Sets the index for the [CanvasItem]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າດັດຊະນີ (index) ສຳລັບ [CanvasItem]."

msgid ""
"Sets the per-instance shader uniform on the specified canvas item instance. "
"Equivalent to [method CanvasItem.set_instance_shader_parameter]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ shader uniform ແບບ per-instance ໃນ canvas item instance ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[method CanvasItem.set_instance_shader_parameter]."

msgid ""
"If [param interpolated] is [code]true[/code], turns on physics interpolation "
"for the canvas item."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param interpolated] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດການແຊກສະຫຼັບທາງຟີຊິກສຳລັບ "
"canvas item."

msgid ""
"Sets the light [param mask] for the canvas item specified by the [param item] "
"RID. Equivalent to [member CanvasItem.light_mask]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໜ້າກາກແສງ [param mask] ສຳລັບ canvas item ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param item] RID. "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member CanvasItem.light_mask]."

msgid ""
"Sets a new [param material] to the canvas item specified by the [param item] "
"RID. Equivalent to [member CanvasItem.material]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param material] ໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບ canvas item ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param item] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member CanvasItem.material]."

msgid ""
"Multiplies the color of the canvas item specified by the [param item] RID, "
"while affecting its children. See also [method "
"canvas_item_set_self_modulate]. Equivalent to [member CanvasItem.modulate]."
msgstr ""
"ຄູນສີຂອງ canvas item ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param item] RID, ໂດຍມີຜົນຕໍ່ລູກ (children) ຂອງມັນນຳ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method canvas_item_set_self_modulate] ຕື່ມ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"CanvasItem.modulate]."

msgid ""
"Sets a parent [CanvasItem] to the [CanvasItem]. The item will inherit "
"transform, modulation and visibility from its parent, like [CanvasItem] nodes "
"in the scene tree."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ parent [CanvasItem] ໃຫ້ກັບ [CanvasItem]. ລາຍການຈະສືບທອດ transform, "
"modulation ແລະ visibility ຈາກ parent ຂອງມັນ, ຄືກັນກັບໂນດ [CanvasItem] ໃນ scene "
"tree."

msgid ""
"Multiplies the color of the canvas item specified by the [param item] RID, "
"without affecting its children. See also [method canvas_item_set_modulate]. "
"Equivalent to [member CanvasItem.self_modulate]."
msgstr ""
"ຄູນສີຂອງ canvas item ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param item] RID, ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ລູກ (children) ຂອງມັນ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method canvas_item_set_modulate] ຕື່ມ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"CanvasItem.self_modulate]."

msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], child nodes with the lowest Y "
"position are drawn before those with a higher Y position. Y-sorting only "
"affects children that inherit from the canvas item specified by the [param "
"item] RID, not the canvas item itself. Equivalent to [member "
"CanvasItem.y_sort_enabled]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດລູກທີ່ມີຕຳແໜ່ງ Y "
"ຕ່ຳສຸດຈະຖືກແຕ້ມກ່ອນໂນດທີ່ມີຕຳແໜ່ງ Y ສູງກວ່າ. ການລຽງລຳດັບຕາມແກນ Y (Y-sorting) "
"ຈະມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບລູກທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ canvas item ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param item] RID ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕົວ "
"canvas item ເອງ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member CanvasItem.y_sort_enabled]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param transform] of the canvas item specified by the [param item] "
"RID. This affects where and how the item will be drawn. Child canvas items' "
"transforms are multiplied by their parent's transform. Equivalent to [member "
"Node2D.transform]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param transform] ຂອງ canvas item ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param item] RID. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ບ່ອນທີ່ "
"ແລະ ວິທີທີ່ລາຍການຈະຖືກແຕ້ມ. transform ຂອງ canvas item ລູກຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍ transform ຂອງ "
"parent ຂອງພວກມັນ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member Node2D.transform]."

msgid "Sets if the [CanvasItem] uses its parent's material."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າ [CanvasItem] ໃຊ້ວັດສະດຸ (material) ຂອງ parent ຂອງມັນຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Sets the rendering visibility layer associated with this [CanvasItem]. Only "
"[Viewport] nodes with a matching rendering mask will render this [CanvasItem]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເລເຢີການເບິ່ງເຫັນການສະແດງຜົນ (rendering visibility layer) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ "
"[CanvasItem] ນີ້. ສະເພາະໂນດ [Viewport] ທີ່ມີໜ້າກາກການສະແດງຜົນ (rendering mask) "
"ທີ່ກົງກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະສະແດງຜົນ [CanvasItem] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the given [CanvasItem] as visibility notifier. [param area] defines the "
"area of detecting visibility. [param enter_callable] is called when the "
"[CanvasItem] enters the screen, [param exit_callable] is called when the "
"[CanvasItem] exits the screen. If [param enable] is [code]false[/code], the "
"item will no longer function as notifier.\n"
"This method can be used to manually mimic [VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນຕົວແຈ້ງເຕືອນການເບິ່ງເຫັນ (visibility notifier). [param "
"area] ກຳນົດພື້ນທີ່ຂອງການກວດຈັບການເບິ່ງເຫັນ. [param enter_callable] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອ "
"[CanvasItem] ເຂົ້າສູ່ໜ້າຈໍ, [param exit_callable] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອ [CanvasItem] "
"ອອກຈາກໜ້າຈໍ. ຖ້າ [param enable] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ລາຍການຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກເປັນຕົວແຈ້ງເຕືອນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"
"ເມທອດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຳລອງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ [VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D] ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid "Sets the visibility of the [CanvasItem]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງ [CanvasItem]."

msgid ""
"If this is enabled, the Z index of the parent will be added to the children's "
"Z index."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ງານສິ່ງນີ້, ດັດຊະນີ Z (Z index) ຂອງ parent ຈະຖືກບວກເຂົ້າກັບດັດຊະນີ Z ຂອງລູກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [CanvasItem]'s Z index, i.e. its draw order (lower indexes are drawn "
"first)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າດັດຊະນີ Z (Z index) ຂອງ [CanvasItem], ນັ້ນຄືລຳດັບການແຕ້ມຂອງມັນ "
"(ດັດຊະນີທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະຖືກແຕ້ມກ່ອນ)."

msgid ""
"Transforms both the current and previous stored transform for a canvas item.\n"
"This allows transforming a canvas item without creating a \"glitch\" in the "
"interpolation, which is particularly useful for large worlds utilizing a "
"shifting origin."
msgstr ""
"ແປງ (transform) ທັງ transform ປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ transform ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້າສຳລັບ canvas "
"item.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດແປງ canvas item ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ \"glitch\" ໃນການແຊກສະຫຼັບ "
"(interpolation), ເຊິ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍສຳລັບໂລກຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ໃຊ້ການເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຈຸດກຳເນີດ (shifting "
"origin)."

msgid ""
"Attaches the canvas light to the canvas. Removes it from its previous canvas."
msgstr "ຕິດໄຟ canvas (canvas light) ເຂົ້າກັບ canvas. ຈະລຶບມັນອອກຈາກ canvas ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

msgid ""
"Creates a canvas light and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be accessed "
"with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all "
"[code]canvas_light_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent node is [Light2D]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງໄຟ canvas ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ. "
"RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]canvas_light_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [Light2D]."

msgid ""
"Attaches a light occluder to the canvas. Removes it from its previous canvas."
msgstr "ຕິດຕົວບັງແສງ (light occluder) ເຂົ້າກັບ canvas. ຈະລຶບມັນອອກຈາກ canvas ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

msgid ""
"Creates a light occluder and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all "
"[code]canvas_light_occluder_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent node is [LightOccluder2D]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຕົວບັງແສງ ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ. "
"RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]canvas_light_occluder_*[/code] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [LightOccluder2D]."

msgid ""
"Prevents physics interpolation for the current physics tick.\n"
"This is useful when moving an occluder to a new location, to give an "
"instantaneous change rather than interpolation from the previous location."
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອງກັນການແຊກສະຫຼັບ (interpolation) ທາງຟີຊິກສຳລັບຮອບການທຳງານຟີຊິກປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອຍ້າຍຕົວບັງແສງ (occluder) ໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງໃໝ່, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເກີດການປ່ຽນແປງໃນທັນທີ "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະມີການແຊກສະຫຼັບຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງກ່ອນໜ້າ."

msgid ""
"Enables or disables using the light occluder as a signed distance field for "
"2D particle collision."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດການໃຊ້ງານຕົວບັງແສງ (light occluder) ເປັນ signed distance field "
"ສຳລັບການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກ 2D."

msgid "Enables or disables light occluder."
msgstr "ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານຕົວບັງແສງ."

msgid ""
"If [param interpolated] is [code]true[/code], turns on physics interpolation "
"for the light occluder."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param interpolated] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະເປີດການແຊກສະຫຼັບທາງຟີຊິກສຳລັບຕົວບັງແສງ."

msgid ""
"The light mask. See [LightOccluder2D] for more information on light masks."
msgstr "ໜ້າກາກແສງ. ເບິ່ງ [LightOccluder2D] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໜ້າກາກແສງ."

msgid "Sets a light occluder's polygon."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ (polygon) ຂອງຕົວບັງແສງ."

msgid "Sets a light occluder's [Transform2D]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Transform2D] ຂອງຕົວບັງແສງ."

msgid ""
"Transforms both the current and previous stored transform for a light "
"occluder.\n"
"This allows transforming an occluder without creating a \"glitch\" in the "
"interpolation, which is particularly useful for large worlds utilizing a "
"shifting origin."
msgstr ""
"ແປງ (transform) ທັງ transform ປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ transform ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້າສຳລັບຕົວບັງແສງ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດແປງຕົວບັງແສງໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ \"glitch\" ໃນການແຊກສະຫຼັບ "
"(interpolation), ເຊິ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍສຳລັບໂລກຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ໃຊ້ການເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຈຸດກຳເນີດ (shifting "
"origin)."

msgid ""
"Sets the blend mode for the given canvas light to [param mode]. Equivalent to "
"[member Light2D.blend_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດການປະສົມ (blend mode) ສຳລັບໄຟ canvas ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນ [param mode]. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member Light2D.blend_mode]."

msgid "Sets the color for a light."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີສຳລັບແສງໄຟ."

msgid "Enables or disables a canvas light."
msgstr "ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານໄຟ canvas."

msgid "Sets a canvas light's energy."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າພະລັງງານ (energy) ຂອງໄຟ canvas."

msgid "Sets a canvas light's height."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມສູງຂອງໄຟ canvas."

msgid ""
"If [param interpolated] is [code]true[/code], turns on physics interpolation "
"for the canvas light."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param interpolated] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດການແຊກສະຫຼັບທາງຟີຊິກສຳລັບໄຟ "
"canvas."

msgid ""
"The binary mask used to determine which layers this canvas light's shadows "
"affects. See [LightOccluder2D] for more information on light masks."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າກາກເລກຖານສອງ (binary mask) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າເງົາຂອງໄຟ canvas ນີ້ຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ເລເຢີໃດ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[LightOccluder2D] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໜ້າກາກແສງ."

msgid "The layer range that gets rendered with this light."
msgstr "ຊ່ວງເລເຢີ (layer range) ທີ່ຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນດ້ວຍແສງນີ້."

msgid "Sets the mode of the canvas light."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດຂອງໄຟ canvas."

msgid "Sets the color of the canvas light's shadow."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີຂອງເງົາໄຟ canvas."

msgid "Enables or disables the canvas light's shadow."
msgstr "ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານເງົາຂອງໄຟ canvas."

msgid "Sets the canvas light's shadow's filter."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວການກັ່ນຕອງ (filter) ຂອງເງົາໄຟ canvas."

msgid "Smoothens the shadow. The lower, the smoother."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົານວນຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕ່ຳ, ຍິ່ງນວນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the texture to be used by a [PointLight2D]. Equivalent to [member "
"PointLight2D.texture]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໂດຍ [PointLight2D]. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"PointLight2D.texture]."

msgid ""
"Sets the offset of a [PointLight2D]'s texture. Equivalent to [member "
"PointLight2D.offset]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ຂອງພື້ນຜິວ [PointLight2D]. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"PointLight2D.offset]."

msgid ""
"Sets the scale factor of a [PointLight2D]'s texture. Equivalent to [member "
"PointLight2D.texture_scale]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຄູນຂະໜາດ (scale factor) ຂອງພື້ນຜິວ [PointLight2D]. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"PointLight2D.texture_scale]."

msgid "Sets the canvas light's [Transform2D]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Transform2D] ຂອງໄຟ canvas."

msgid ""
"Sets the Z range of objects that will be affected by this light. Equivalent "
"to [member Light2D.range_z_min] and [member Light2D.range_z_max]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ວງ Z ຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກແສງນີ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member Light2D.range_z_min] "
"ແລະ [member Light2D.range_z_max]."

msgid ""
"Transforms both the current and previous stored transform for a canvas "
"light.\n"
"This allows transforming a light without creating a \"glitch\" in the "
"interpolation, which is particularly useful for large worlds utilizing a "
"shifting origin."
msgstr ""
"ແປງ (transform) ທັງ transform ປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ transform ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້າສຳລັບໄຟ canvas.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດແປງໄຟໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ \"glitch\" ໃນການແຊກສະຫຼັບ (interpolation), "
"ເຊິ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍສຳລັບໂລກຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ໃຊ້ການເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຈຸດກຳເນີດ (shifting origin)."

msgid ""
"Creates a new light occluder polygon and adds it to the RenderingServer. It "
"can be accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all "
"[code]canvas_occluder_polygon_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent resource is [OccluderPolygon2D]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຂອງຕົວບັງແສງ (light occluder polygon) ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ "
"RenderingServer. ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ "
"[code]canvas_occluder_polygon_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊັບພະຍາກອນ (resource) ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [OccluderPolygon2D]."

msgid "Sets an occluder polygon's cull mode."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດການຄັດອອກ (cull mode) ຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຕົວບັງແສງ."

msgid "Sets the shape of the occluder polygon."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບຊົງຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຕົວບັງແສງ."

msgid ""
"If [param disable] is [code]true[/code], makes 2D rendering ignore the canvas "
"scale defined for each canvas layer. This affects [CanvasLayer]s with the "
"[member CanvasLayer.follow_viewport_enabled] property set to [code]true[/"
"code].\n"
"In the editor, this is set to [code]true[/code] by default, and set to "
"[code]false[/code] when [b]View > Preview Canvas Scale[/b] is enabled at the "
"top of the 2D editor viewport.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this to [code]true[/code] does not impact the behavior "
"of [member CanvasLayer.scale], [member Node2D.scale], or [member "
"Control.scale]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param disable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການສະແດງຜົນ 2D ລະເວັ້ນຂະໜາດ "
"canvas (canvas scale) ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນແຕ່ລະ canvas layer. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ [CanvasLayer] "
"ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ [member CanvasLayer.follow_viewport_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code].\n"
"ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor), ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແລະ ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code] ເມື່ອ [b]View > Preview Canvas Scale[/b] "
"ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງ viewport ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 2D.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງ [member "
"CanvasLayer.scale], [member Node2D.scale], ຫຼື [member Control.scale]."

msgid ""
"A copy of the canvas item will be drawn with a local offset of the [param "
"mirroring].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is equivalent to calling [method canvas_set_item_repeat] "
"like [code]canvas_set_item_repeat(item, mirroring, 1)[/code], with an "
"additional check ensuring [param canvas] is a parent of [param item]."
msgstr ""
"ສຳເນົາຂອງ canvas item ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມດ້ວຍໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງ [param mirroring].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method canvas_set_item_repeat] ເຊັ່ນ "
"[code]canvas_set_item_repeat(item, mirroring, 1)[/code], "
"ໂດຍມີການກວດສອບເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ [param canvas] ເປັນ parent ຂອງ [param item]."

msgid ""
"A copy of the canvas item will be drawn with a local offset of the [param "
"repeat_size] by the number of times of the [param repeat_times]. As the "
"[param repeat_times] increases, the copies will spread away from the origin "
"texture."
msgstr ""
"ສຳເນົາຂອງ canvas item ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມດ້ວຍໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງ [param repeat_size] "
"ຕາມຈຳນວນຄັ້ງຂອງ [param repeat_times]. ເມື່ອ [param repeat_times] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ, "
"ສຳເນົາຈະກະຈາຍອອກຈາກພື້ນຜິວຕົ້ນກຳເນີດ."

msgid "Modulates all colors in the given canvas."
msgstr "ປັບປ່ຽນ (modulate) ທຸກສີໃນ canvas ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [member ProjectSettings.rendering/2d/shadow_atlas/size] to use for "
"[Light2D] shadow rendering (in pixels). The value is rounded up to the "
"nearest power of 2."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/2d/shadow_atlas/size] "
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນເງົາ [Light2D] (ເປັນພິກເຊວ). ຄ່າຈະຖືກປັດຂຶ້ນເປັນກຳລັງສອງທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Creates a canvas texture and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all "
"[code]canvas_texture_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method. See also [method "
"texture_2d_create].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent resource is [CanvasTexture] and is only meant to "
"be used in 2D rendering, not 3D."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງພື້ນຜິວ canvas (canvas texture) ແລະ ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. "
"ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ "
"[code]canvas_texture_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer. ເບິ່ງ [method texture_2d_create] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [CanvasTexture] ແລະ ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການສະແດງຜົນ "
"2D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນ 3D."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param channel]'s [param texture] for the canvas texture specified "
"by the [param canvas_texture] RID. Equivalent to [member "
"CanvasTexture.diffuse_texture], [member CanvasTexture.normal_texture] and "
"[member CanvasTexture.specular_texture]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param texture] ຂອງ [param channel] ສຳລັບ canvas texture ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param "
"canvas_texture] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member CanvasTexture.diffuse_texture], [member "
"CanvasTexture.normal_texture] ແລະ [member CanvasTexture.specular_texture]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param base_color] and [param shininess] to use for the canvas "
"texture specified by the [param canvas_texture] RID. Equivalent to [member "
"CanvasTexture.specular_color] and [member CanvasTexture.specular_shininess]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param base_color] ແລະ [param shininess] ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບ canvas texture "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param canvas_texture] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"CanvasTexture.specular_color] ແລະ [member CanvasTexture.specular_shininess]."

msgid ""
"Sets the texture [param filter] mode to use for the canvas texture specified "
"by the [param canvas_texture] RID."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດການກັ່ນຕອງ (filter) ຂອງພື້ນຜິວ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບ canvas texture ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param "
"canvas_texture] RID."

msgid ""
"Sets the texture [param repeat] mode to use for the canvas texture specified "
"by the [param canvas_texture] RID."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດການເຮັດຊ້ຳ (repeat) ຂອງພື້ນຜິວ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບ canvas texture ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param "
"canvas_texture] RID."

msgid ""
"Creates a new compositor and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ compositor ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID "
"ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer."

msgid ""
"Creates a new rendering effect and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ rendering effect ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID "
"ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer."

msgid ""
"Sets the callback type ([param callback_type]) and callback method([param "
"callback]) for this rendering effect."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າປະເພດຄໍແບັກ (callback type) ([param callback_type]) ແລະ ເມທອດຄໍແບັກ ([param "
"callback]) ສຳລັບ rendering effect ນີ້."

msgid "Enables/disables this rendering effect."
msgstr "ເປີດ/ປິດໃຊ້ງານ rendering effect ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the flag ([param flag]) for this rendering effect to [code]true[/code] "
"or [code]false[/code] ([param set])."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າແຟລັກ (flag) ([param flag]) ສຳລັບ rendering effect ນີ້ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຫຼື "
"[code]false[/code] ([param set])."

msgid ""
"Sets the compositor effects for the specified compositor RID. [param effects] "
"should be an array containing RIDs created with [method "
"compositor_effect_create]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ compositor effects ສຳລັບ compositor RID ທີ່ກຳນົດ. [param effects] "
"ຄວນເປັນອາເຣທີ່ບັນຈຸ RID ທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍ [method compositor_effect_create]."

msgid ""
"Creates a RenderingDevice that can be used to do draw and compute operations "
"on a separate thread. Cannot draw to the screen nor share data with the "
"global RenderingDevice.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the OpenGL rendering driver or when running in "
"headless mode, this function always returns [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ RenderingDevice ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດການແຕ້ມ ແລະ ການຄຳນວນໃນເທຣດ (thread) "
"ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ບໍ່ສາມາດແຕ້ມລົງໜ້າຈໍ ຫຼື ແບ່ງປັນຂໍ້ມູນກັບ RenderingDevice ສ່ວນກາງໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ rendering driver ແບບ OpenGL ຫຼື ເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດ headless, "
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະຄືນຄ່າ [code]null[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the bounding rectangle for a canvas item in local space, as "
"calculated by the renderer. This bound is used internally for culling.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This function is intended for debugging in the editor, and "
"will pass through and return a zero [Rect2] in exported projects."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກຂອບເຂດ (bounding rectangle) ສຳລັບ canvas item ໃນພື້ນທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local "
"space), ຕາມທີ່ຄຳນວນໂດຍຕົວສະແດງຜົນ (renderer). ຂອບເຂດນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ພາຍໃນສຳລັບການຄັດອອກ "
"(culling).\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນນີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອການກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (debugging) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ "
"ຈະຄືນຄ່າ [Rect2] ທີ່ເປັນສູນໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ (exported projects)."

msgid ""
"Creates a decal and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be accessed with "
"the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all [code]decal_*[/code] "
"RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"To place in a scene, attach this decal to an instance using [method "
"instance_set_base] using the returned RID.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent node is [Decal]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງດີຄໍ (decal) ແລະ ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ. "
"RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]decal_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເພື່ອວາງໃນສາກ (scene), ໃຫ້ຕິດດີຄໍນີ້ເຂົ້າກັບ instance ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method instance_set_base] "
"ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [Decal]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param albedo_mix] in the decal specified by the [param decal] RID. "
"Equivalent to [member Decal.albedo_mix]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param albedo_mix] ໃນດີຄໍທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param decal] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"Decal.albedo_mix]."

msgid ""
"Sets the cull [param mask] in the decal specified by the [param decal] RID. "
"Equivalent to [member Decal.cull_mask]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໜ້າກາກການຄັດອອກ [param mask] ໃນດີຄໍທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param decal] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member Decal.cull_mask]."

msgid ""
"Sets the distance fade parameters in the decal specified by the [param decal] "
"RID. Equivalent to [member Decal.distance_fade_enabled], [member "
"Decal.distance_fade_begin] and [member Decal.distance_fade_length]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມີເຕີການຈາງຫາຍຕາມໄລຍະທາງ (distance fade) ໃນດີຄໍທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param decal] "
"RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member Decal.distance_fade_enabled], [member "
"Decal.distance_fade_begin] ແລະ [member Decal.distance_fade_length]."

msgid ""
"Sets the emission [param energy] in the decal specified by the [param decal] "
"RID. Equivalent to [member Decal.emission_energy]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າພະລັງງານການແຜ່ລັງສີ [param energy] ໃນດີຄໍທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param decal] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member Decal.emission_energy]."

msgid ""
"Sets the upper fade ([param above]) and lower fade ([param below]) in the "
"decal specified by the [param decal] RID. Equivalent to [member "
"Decal.upper_fade] and [member Decal.lower_fade]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຈາງຫາຍດ້ານເທິງ ([param above]) ແລະ ດ້ານລຸ່ມ ([param below]) ໃນດີຄໍທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ "
"[param decal] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member Decal.upper_fade] ແລະ [member "
"Decal.lower_fade]."

msgid ""
"Sets the color multiplier in the decal specified by the [param decal] RID to "
"[param color]. Equivalent to [member Decal.modulate]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຄູນສີໃນດີຄໍທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param decal] RID ເປັນ [param color]. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"Decal.modulate]."

msgid ""
"Sets the normal [param fade] in the decal specified by the [param decal] RID. "
"Equivalent to [member Decal.normal_fade]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຈາງຫາຍຂອງນໍມໍ (normal fade) ໃນດີຄໍທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param decal] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member Decal.normal_fade]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param size] of the decal specified by the [param decal] RID. "
"Equivalent to [member Decal.size]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດ [param size] ຂອງດີຄໍທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param decal] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"Decal.size]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param texture] in the given texture [param type] slot for the "
"specified decal. Equivalent to [method Decal.set_texture]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າພື້ນຜິວ [param texture] ໃນຊ່ອງປະເພດພື້ນຜິວ [param type] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ສຳລັບດີຄໍທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [method Decal.set_texture]."

msgid ""
"Sets the texture [param filter] mode to use when rendering decals. This "
"parameter is global and cannot be set on a per-decal basis."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດການກັ່ນຕອງພື້ນຜິວ (texture filter) ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການສະແດງຜົນດີຄໍ. ພາຣາມີເຕີນີ້ນຳໃຊ້ທົ່ວໂລກ "
"(global) ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າແຍກແຕ່ລະດີຄໍໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Creates a directional light and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID can be used in most "
"[code]light_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"To place in a scene, attach this directional light to an instance using "
"[method instance_set_base] using the returned RID.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent node is [DirectionalLight3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງໄຟທີ່ມີທິດທາງ (directional light) ແລະ ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. "
"ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ. RID ນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນຟັງຊັນ [code]light_*[/code] "
"ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເພື່ອວາງໃນສາກ, ໃຫ້ຕິດໄຟທີ່ມີທິດທາງນີ້ເຂົ້າກັບ instance ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method instance_set_base] "
"ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [DirectionalLight3D]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param size] of the directional light shadows in 3D. See also "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/directional_shadow/"
"size]. This parameter is global and cannot be set on a per-viewport basis."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດ [param size] ຂອງເງົາໄຟທີ່ມີທິດທາງໃນ 3D. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/directional_shadow/size] ຕື່ມ. "
"ພາຣາມີເຕີນີ້ນຳໃຊ້ທົ່ວໂລກ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າແຍກແຕ່ລະ viewport ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the filter [param quality] for directional light shadows in 3D. See also "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/directional_shadow/"
"soft_shadow_filter_quality]. This parameter is global and cannot be set on a "
"per-viewport basis."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນນະພາບຕົວການກັ່ນຕອງ [param quality] ສຳລັບເງົາໄຟທີ່ມີທິດທາງໃນ 3D. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/directional_shadow/"
"soft_shadow_filter_quality] ຕື່ມ. ພາຣາມີເຕີນີ້ນຳໃຊ້ທົ່ວໂລກ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າແຍກແຕ່ລະ "
"viewport ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Generates and returns an [Image] containing the radiance map for the "
"specified [param environment] RID's sky. This supports built-in sky material "
"and custom sky shaders. If [param bake_irradiance] is [code]true[/code], the "
"irradiance map is saved instead of the radiance map. The radiance map is used "
"to render reflected light, while the irradiance map is used to render ambient "
"light. See also [method sky_bake_panorama].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The image is saved using linear encoding without any tonemapping "
"performed, which means it will look too dark if viewed directly in an image "
"editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param size] should be a 2:1 aspect ratio for the generated "
"panorama to have square pixels. For radiance maps, there is no point in using "
"a height greater than [member Sky.radiance_size], as it won't increase "
"detail. Irradiance maps only contain low-frequency data, so there is usually "
"no point in going past a size of 128×64 pixels when saving an irradiance map."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ ແລະ ຄືນຄ່າ [Image] ທີ່ບັນຈຸ radiance map ສຳລັບທ້ອງຟ້າຂອງ [param environment] RID "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຮອງຮັບວັດສະດຸທ້ອງຟ້າທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ ແລະ sky shaders ແບບກຳນົດເອງ. ຖ້າ [param "
"bake_irradiance] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], irradiance map ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກແທນ radiance "
"map. Radiance map ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນແສງສະທ້ອນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ irradiance map "
"ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (ambient light). ເບິ່ງ [method sky_bake_panorama] "
"ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮູບພາບຖືກບັນທຶກໂດຍໃຊ້ linear encoding ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການເຮັດ tonemapping, "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າມືດເກີນໄປຖ້າເບິ່ງໂດຍກົງໃນໂປຣແກຣມແກ້ໄຂຮູບພາບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param size] ຄວນມີອັດຕາສ່ວນ 2:1 "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພາໂນຣາມາທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນມີພິກເຊວເປັນຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກຈັດຕຸລັດ. ສຳລັບ radiance maps, "
"ບໍ່ມີປະໂຫຍດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຄວາມສູງເກີນ [member Sky.radiance_size] ເພາະມັນຈະບໍ່ເພີ່ມລາຍລະອຽດ. "
"Irradiance maps ມີພຽງແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວບໍ່ມີປະໂຫຍດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຂະໜາດເກີນ 128×64 "
"ພິກເຊວ."

msgid ""
"Creates an environment and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be accessed "
"with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all "
"[code]environment_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent resource is [Environment]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environment) ແລະ ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
"RID ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]environment_*[/code] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [Environment]."

msgid ""
"If [param enable] is [code]true[/code], enables bicubic upscaling for glow "
"which improves quality at the cost of performance. Equivalent to [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/environment/glow/upscale_mode].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is only effective when using the Forward+ or Mobile "
"rendering methods, as Compatibility uses a different glow implementation."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param enable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ bicubic upscaling "
"ສຳລັບແສງເຮືອງ (glow) ເຊິ່ງຈະຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງຄຸນນະພາບແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍປະສິດທິພາບ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/environment/glow/upscale_mode].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການສະແດງຜົນ Forward+ ຫຼື Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເພາະວ່າ "
"Compatibility ໃຊ້ວິທີການເຮັດ glow ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the values to be used with the \"adjustments\" post-process effect. See "
"[Environment] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບເອັບເຟັກຫຼັງການສະແດງຜົນ (post-process effect) \"adjustments\". ເບິ່ງ "
"[Environment] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the values to be used for ambient light rendering. See [Environment] for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (ambient light). ເບິ່ງ [Environment] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the environment's background mode. Equivalent to [member "
"Environment.background_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member Environment.background_mode]."

msgid ""
"Color displayed for clear areas of the scene. Only effective if using the "
"[constant ENV_BG_COLOR] background mode."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງຂອງສາກ. ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດພື້ນຫຼັງ [constant ENV_BG_COLOR]."

msgid "Sets the intensity of the background color."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງສີພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid "Sets the camera ID to be used as environment background."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ID ຂອງກ້ອງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ."

msgid "Sets the maximum layer to use if using Canvas background mode."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເລເຢີສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຖ້າໃຊ້ໂໝດພື້ນຫຼັງ Canvas."

msgid ""
"Configures fog for the specified environment RID. See [code]fog_*[/code] "
"properties in [Environment] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າໝອກ (fog) ສຳລັບ environment RID ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]fog_*[/code] ໃນ "
"[Environment] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Configures fog depth for the specified environment RID. Only has an effect "
"when the fog mode of the environment is [constant ENV_FOG_MODE_DEPTH]. See "
"[code]fog_depth_*[/code] properties in [Environment] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າຄວາມເລິກຂອງໝອກສຳລັບ environment RID ທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອໂໝດໝອກຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເປັນ [constant ENV_FOG_MODE_DEPTH] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເບິ່ງຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]fog_depth_*[/code] ໃນ [Environment] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Configures glow for the specified environment RID. See [code]glow_*[/code] "
"properties in [Environment] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າແສງເຮືອງ (glow) ສຳລັບ environment RID ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]glow_*[/code] "
"ໃນ [Environment] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Configures signed distance field global illumination for the specified "
"environment RID. See [code]sdfgi_*[/code] properties in [Environment] for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າ signed distance field global illumination (SDFGI) ສຳລັບ environment RID "
"ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]sdfgi_*[/code] ໃນ [Environment] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the number of frames to use for converging signed distance field global "
"illumination. Equivalent to [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"global_illumination/sdfgi/frames_to_converge]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນເຟຣມທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ SDFGI ປະມວນຜົນເຂົ້າຫາກັນ (converge). ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/frames_to_converge]."

msgid ""
"Sets the update speed for dynamic lights' indirect lighting when computing "
"signed distance field global illumination. Equivalent to [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/frames_to_update_lights]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມໄວໃນການອັບເດດແສງທາງອ້ອມ (indirect lighting) ຂອງໄຟແບບໄດນາມິກ (dynamic "
"lights) ເມື່ອຄຳນວນ SDFGI. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"global_illumination/sdfgi/frames_to_update_lights]."

msgid ""
"Sets the number of rays to throw per frame when computing signed distance "
"field global illumination. Equivalent to [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"global_illumination/sdfgi/probe_ray_count]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນລັງສີ (rays) ທີ່ຈະສົ່ງອອກຕໍ່ເຟຣມເມື່ອຄຳນວນ SDFGI. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/probe_ray_count]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [Sky] to be used as the environment's background when using "
"[i]BGMode[/i] sky. Equivalent to [member Environment.sky]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Sky] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດພື້ນຫຼັງທ້ອງຟ້າ (sky). ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member Environment.sky]."

msgid ""
"Sets a custom field of view for the background [Sky]. Equivalent to [member "
"Environment.sky_custom_fov]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອບເຂດການເບິ່ງ (field of view) ແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບ [Sky] ພື້ນຫຼັງ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"Environment.sky_custom_fov]."

msgid ""
"Sets the rotation of the background [Sky] expressed as a [Basis]. Equivalent "
"to [member Environment.sky_rotation], where the rotation vector is used to "
"construct the [Basis]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການໝູນຂອງ [Sky] ພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ສະແດງໃນຮູບແບບ [Basis]. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"Environment.sky_rotation], ໂດຍທີ່ rotation vector ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ [Basis]."

msgid ""
"Sets the variables to be used with the screen-space ambient occlusion (SSAO) "
"post-process effect. See [Environment] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບເອັບເຟັກ post-process ແບບ screen-space ambient occlusion "
"(SSAO). ເບິ່ງ [Environment] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the quality level of the screen-space ambient occlusion (SSAO) post-"
"process effect. See [Environment] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລະດັບຄຸນນະພາບຂອງເອັບເຟັກ post-process SSAO. ເບິ່ງ [Environment] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the quality level of the screen-space indirect lighting (SSIL) post-"
"process effect. See [Environment] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລະດັບຄຸນນະພາບຂອງເອັບເຟັກ post-process ແບບ screen-space indirect lighting "
"(SSIL). ເບິ່ງ [Environment] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the variables to be used with the screen-space reflections (SSR) post-"
"process effect. See [Environment] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບເອັບເຟັກ post-process ແບບ screen-space reflections (SSR). ເບິ່ງ "
"[Environment] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Sets whether screen-space reflections will be rendered at full or half size. "
"Half size is faster, but may look pixelated or cause flickering."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຈະສະແດງຜົນ SSR ໃນຂະໜາດເຕັມ ຫຼື ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ. ຂະໜາດເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຈະໄວກວ່າ, "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະເບິ່ງເຫັນເປັນພິກເຊວ ຫຼື ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການກະພິບ."

msgid "This option no longer does anything."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກຫຍັງອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid ""
"Sets the variables to be used with the \"tonemap\" post-process effect. See "
"[Environment] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບເອັບເຟັກ post-process \"tonemap\". ເບິ່ງ [Environment] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "See [member Environment.tonemap_agx_contrast] for more details."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ [member Environment.tonemap_agx_contrast] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the variables to be used with the volumetric fog post-process effect. "
"See [Environment] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບເອັບເຟັກ post-process ໝອກແບບວໍລູເມທຣິກ (volumetric fog). ເບິ່ງ "
"[Environment] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Enables filtering of the volumetric fog scattering buffer. This results in "
"much smoother volumes with very few under-sampling artifacts."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການກັ່ນຕອງ (filtering) ຂອງ volumetric fog scattering buffer. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ວໍລູມທີ່ນວນຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ ແລະ ມີຈຸດລົບກວນຈາກການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ (under-sampling) ໜ້ອຍຫຼາຍ."

msgid ""
"Sets the resolution of the volumetric fog's froxel buffer. [param size] is "
"modified by the screen's aspect ratio and then used to set the width and "
"height of the buffer. While [param depth] is directly used to set the depth "
"of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງ froxel buffer ຂອງໝອກວໍລູເມທຣິກ. [param size] "
"ຈະຖືກປັບປ່ຽນຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງຂອງ buffer. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ "
"[param depth] ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍກົງເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມເລິກຂອງ buffer."

msgid ""
"Creates a new fog volume and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all "
"[code]fog_volume_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent node is [FogVolume]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງວໍລູມໝອກ (fog volume) ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
"RID ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]fog_volume_*[/code] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [FogVolume]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [Material] of the fog volume. Can be either a [FogMaterial] or a "
"custom [ShaderMaterial]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Material] ຂອງວໍລູມໝອກ. ສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງ [FogMaterial] ຫຼື [ShaderMaterial] "
"ແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the shape of the fog volume to either [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_ELLIPSOID], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CONE], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CYLINDER], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_BOX] or [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_WORLD]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບຊົງຂອງວໍລູມໝອກເປັນ [constant RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_ELLIPSOID], "
"[constant RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CONE], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CYLINDER], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_BOX] ຫຼື [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_WORLD]."

msgid ""
"Sets the size of the fog volume when shape is [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_ELLIPSOID], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CONE], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CYLINDER] or [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_BOX]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດຂອງວໍລູມໝອກເມື່ອຮູບຊົງເປັນ [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_ELLIPSOID], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CONE], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CYLINDER] ຫຼື [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_BOX]."

msgid ""
"Forces redrawing of all viewports at once. Must be called from the main "
"thread."
msgstr ""
"ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ແຕ້ມທຸກໆ viewport ໃໝ່ພ້ອມກັນໃນບາດດຽວ. ຕ້ອງຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຈາກເທຣດຫຼັກ (main thread)."

msgid ""
"Forces a synchronization between the CPU and GPU, which may be required in "
"certain cases. Only call this when needed, as CPU-GPU synchronization has a "
"performance cost."
msgstr ""
"ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີການປະສານງານ (synchronization) ລະຫວ່າງ CPU ແລະ GPU, "
"ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະຈຳເປັນໃນບາງກໍລະນີ. ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອຈຳເປັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເພາະການເຮັດ synchronization "
"ລະຫວ່າງ CPU-GPU ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ."

msgid ""
"Tries to free an object in the RenderingServer. To avoid memory leaks, this "
"should be called after using an object as memory management does not occur "
"automatically when using RenderingServer directly."
msgstr ""
"ພະຍາຍາມປົດປ່ອຍວັດຖຸໃນ RenderingServer. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຮົ່ວໄຫຼຂອງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ (memory "
"leaks), ຄວນເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ຫຼັງຈາກໃຊ້ວັດຖຸສຳເລັດແລ້ວ "
"ເພາະວ່າການຈັດການໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຈະບໍ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອໃຊ້ RenderingServer ໂດຍກົງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the current rendering driver. This can be [code]vulkan[/"
"code], [code]d3d12[/code], [code]metal[/code], [code]opengl3[/code], "
"[code]opengl3_es[/code], or [code]opengl3_angle[/code]. See also [method "
"get_current_rendering_method].\n"
"When [member ProjectSettings.rendering/renderer/rendering_method] is "
"[code]forward_plus[/code] or [code]mobile[/code], the rendering driver is "
"determined by [member ProjectSettings.rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"When [member ProjectSettings.rendering/renderer/rendering_method] is "
"[code]gl_compatibility[/code], the rendering driver is determined by [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"The rendering driver is also determined by the [code]--rendering-driver[/"
"code] command line argument that overrides this project setting, or an "
"automatic fallback that is applied depending on the hardware."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຊື່ຂອງ rendering driver ປັດຈຸບັນ. ສາມາດເປັນ [code]vulkan[/code], [code]d3d12[/"
"code], [code]metal[/code], [code]opengl3[/code], [code]opengl3_es[/code], ຫຼື "
"[code]opengl3_angle[/code]. ເບິ່ງ [method get_current_rendering_method] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"ເມື່ອ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/renderer/rendering_method] ເປັນ "
"[code]forward_plus[/code] ຫຼື [code]mobile[/code], rendering driver ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/rendering_device/driver].\n"
"ເມື່ອ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/renderer/rendering_method] ເປັນ "
"[code]gl_compatibility[/code], rendering driver ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/gl_compatibility/driver].\n"
"Rendering driver ຍັງສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍອາຄິວເມນຄຳສັ່ງ (command line argument) [code]--"
"rendering-driver[/code] ເຊິ່ງຈະຂຽນທັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກນີ້, ຫຼື ການປ່ຽນກັບຄືນອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"(automatic fallback) ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍອີງຕາມຮາດແວ."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the current rendering method. This can be "
"[code]forward_plus[/code], [code]mobile[/code], or [code]gl_compatibility[/"
"code]. See also [method get_current_rendering_driver_name].\n"
"The rendering method is determined by [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"renderer/rendering_method], the [code]--rendering-method[/code] command line "
"argument that overrides this project setting, or an automatic fallback that "
"is applied depending on the hardware."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຊື່ຂອງ rendering method ປັດຈຸບັນ. ສາມາດເປັນ [code]forward_plus[/code], "
"[code]mobile[/code], ຫຼື [code]gl_compatibility[/code]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_current_rendering_driver_name] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"Rendering method ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/renderer/"
"rendering_method], ອາຄິວເມນຄຳສັ່ງ [code]--rendering-method[/code] "
"ທີ່ຂຽນທັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກນີ້, ຫຼື ການປ່ຽນກັບຄືນອັດຕະໂນມັດທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍອີງຕາມຮາດແວ."

msgid ""
"Returns the default clear color which is used when a specific clear color has "
"not been selected. See also [method set_default_clear_color]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າສີລ້າງໜ້າຈໍ (clear color) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ເລືອກສີລ້າງໜ້າຈໍສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_default_clear_color] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the time taken to setup rendering on the CPU in milliseconds. This "
"value is shared across all viewports and does [i]not[/i] require [method "
"viewport_set_measure_render_time] to be enabled on a viewport to be queried. "
"See also [method viewport_get_measured_render_time_cpu]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າການສະແດງຜົນໃນ CPU ເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ. ຄ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໃນທຸກໆ viewport "
"ແລະ [i]ບໍ່[/i] ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [method viewport_set_measure_render_time] ໃນ "
"viewport ເພື່ອສອບຖາມ. ເບິ່ງ [method viewport_get_measured_render_time_cpu] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the global RenderingDevice.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the OpenGL rendering driver or when running in "
"headless mode, this function always returns [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ RenderingDevice ສ່ວນກາງ (global).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ rendering driver ແບບ OpenGL ຫຼື ເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດ headless, "
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະຄືນຄ່າ [code]null[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Returns a statistic about the rendering engine which can be used for "
"performance profiling. See also [method viewport_get_render_info], which "
"returns information specific to a viewport.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only 3D rendering is currently taken into account by some of "
"these values, such as the number of draw calls.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Rendering information is not available until at least 2 frames "
"have been rendered by the engine. If rendering information is not available, "
"[method get_rendering_info] returns [code]0[/code]. To print rendering "
"information in [code]_ready()[/code] successfully, use the following:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tfor _i in 2:\n"
"\t\tawait get_tree().process_frame\n"
"\n"
"\tprint(RenderingServer.get_rendering_info(RENDERING_INFO_TOTAL_DRAW_CALLS_IN_FRAME))\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າສະຖິຕິກ່ຽວກັບເອັນຈິ້ນການສະແດງຜົນ (rendering engine) "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ສຳລັບການວິເຄາະປະສິດທິພາບ (performance profiling). ເບິ່ງ [method "
"viewport_get_render_info] ຕື່ມ, ເຊິ່ງຈະຄືນຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະຂອງ viewport ນັ້ນໆ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປັດຈຸບັນມີພຽງແຕ່ການສະແດງຜົນ 3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກນໍາມາຄິດໄລ່ໃນບາງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ຈຳນວນການເອີ້ນແຕ້ມ (draw calls).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຂໍ້ມູນການສະແດງຜົນຈະຍັງບໍ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານຈົນກວ່າຈະມີການສະແດງຜົນຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 2 "
"ເຟຣມໂດຍເອັນຈິ້ນ. ຖ້າຂໍ້ມູນການສະແດງຜົນຍັງບໍ່ພ້ອມ, [method get_rendering_info] ຈະຄືນຄ່າ "
"[code]0[/code]. ເພື່ອພິມຂໍ້ມູນການສະແດງຜົນໃນ [code]_ready()[/code] ໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ, "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ວິທີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tfor _i in 2:\n"
"\t\tawait get_tree().process_frame\n"
"\n"
"\tprint(RenderingServer.get_rendering_info(RENDERING_INFO_TOTAL_DRAW_CALLS_IN_FRAME))\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Returns the parameters of a shader."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າພາຣາມີເຕີຂອງ shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the RID of the test cube. This mesh will be created and returned on "
"the first call to [method get_test_cube], then it will be cached for "
"subsequent calls. See also [method make_sphere_mesh]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ RID ຂອງກ້ອນທົດສອບ (test cube). ເມຊນີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຄືນຄ່າໃນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"get_test_cube] ຄັ້ງທຳອິດ, ຈາກນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນແຄຊ໌ (cached) ສຳລັບການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໆໄປ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method make_sphere_mesh] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the RID of a 256×256 texture with a testing pattern on it (in "
"[constant Image.FORMAT_RGB8] format). This texture will be created and "
"returned on the first call to [method get_test_texture], then it will be "
"cached for subsequent calls. See also [method get_white_texture].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Get the test texture and apply it to a [Sprite2D] node:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var texture_rid = RenderingServer.get_test_texture()\n"
"var texture = "
"ImageTexture.create_from_image(RenderingServer.texture_2d_get(texture_rid))\n"
"$Sprite2D.texture = texture\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ RID ຂອງພື້ນຜິວຂະໜາດ 256×256 ທີ່ມີຮູບແບບທົດສອບ (ໃນຮູບແບບ [constant "
"Image.FORMAT_RGB8]). ພື້ນຜິວນີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຄືນຄ່າໃນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"get_test_texture] ຄັ້ງທຳອິດ, ຈາກນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນແຄຊ໌ສຳລັບການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໆໄປ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method get_white_texture] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ດຶງພື້ນຜິວທົດສອບ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ມັນກັບໂນດ [Sprite2D]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var texture_rid = RenderingServer.get_test_texture()\n"
"var texture = "
"ImageTexture.create_from_image(RenderingServer.texture_2d_get(texture_rid))\n"
"$Sprite2D.texture = texture\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the version of the graphics video adapter [i]currently in use[/i] "
"(e.g. \"1.2.189\" for Vulkan, \"3.3.0 NVIDIA 510.60.02\" for OpenGL). This "
"version may be different from the actual latest version supported by the "
"hardware, as Godot may not always request the latest version. See also "
"[method OS.get_video_adapter_driver_info].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When running a headless or server binary, this function returns "
"an empty string."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າເວີຊັນຂອງອະແດັບເຕີວິດີໂອກຣາຟິກ (video adapter) [i]ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່[/i] (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"\"1.2.189\" ສຳລັບ Vulkan, \"3.3.0 NVIDIA 510.60.02\" ສຳລັບ OpenGL). "
"ເວີຊັນນີ້ອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ຮາດແວຮອງຮັບແທ້ໆ ເພາະວ່າ Godot "
"ອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮ້ອງຂໍເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດສະເໝີໄປ. ເບິ່ງ [method OS.get_video_adapter_driver_info] "
"ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອແລ່ນໄຟລ໌ binary ແບບ headless ຫຼື server, "
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະຄືນຄ່າເປັນສະຕຣິງຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the video adapter (e.g. \"GeForce GTX 1080/PCIe/SSE2\").\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When running a headless or server binary, this function returns "
"an empty string.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On the web platform, some browsers such as Firefox may report a "
"different, fixed GPU name such as \"GeForce GTX 980\" (regardless of the "
"user's actual GPU model). This is done to make fingerprinting more difficult."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຊື່ຂອງອະແດັບເຕີວິດີໂອ (ເຊັ່ນ: \"GeForce GTX 1080/PCIe/SSE2\").\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອແລ່ນໄຟລ໌ binary ແບບ headless ຫຼື server, "
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະຄືນຄ່າເປັນສະຕຣິງຫວ່າງເປົ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນແພລັດຟອມເວັບ, ບາງບຣາວເຊີເຊັ່ນ Firefox ອາດຈະລາຍງານຊື່ GPU ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງ ຫຼື "
"ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ຕາຍຕົວເຊັ່ນ \"GeForce GTX 980\" (ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງລຸ້ນ GPU ຕົວຈິງຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ການລະບຸຕົວຕົນ (fingerprinting) ເຮັດໄດ້ຍາກຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the type of the video adapter. Since dedicated graphics cards from a "
"given generation will [i]usually[/i] be significantly faster than integrated "
"graphics made in the same generation, the device type can be used as a basis "
"for automatic graphics settings adjustment. However, this is not always true, "
"so make sure to provide users with a way to manually override graphics "
"settings.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the OpenGL rendering driver or when running in "
"headless mode, this function always returns [constant "
"RenderingDevice.DEVICE_TYPE_OTHER]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າປະເພດຂອງອະແດັບເຕີວິດີໂອ. ເນື່ອງຈາກກຣາຟິກກາດແຍກ (dedicated) ໃນລຸ້ນດຽວກັນ [i]ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ[/"
"i] ຈະໄວກວ່າກຣາຟິກອອນບອດ (integrated) ໃນລຸ້ນດຽວກັນຫຼາຍ, "
"ປະເພດອຸປະກອນຈຶ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນພື້ນຖານໃນການປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າກຣາຟິກອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນຈິງສະເໝີໄປ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນແນ່ໃຈວ່າມີວິທີໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ rendering driver ແບບ OpenGL ຫຼື ເມື່ອແລ່ນໃນໂໝດ headless, "
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະຄືນຄ່າ [constant RenderingDevice.DEVICE_TYPE_OTHER] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the vendor of the video adapter (e.g. \"NVIDIA Corporation\").\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When running a headless or server binary, this function returns "
"an empty string."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor) ຂອງອະແດັບເຕີວິດີໂອ (ເຊັ່ນ: \"NVIDIA Corporation\").\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອແລ່ນໄຟລ໌ binary ແບບ headless ຫຼື server, "
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະຄືນຄ່າເປັນສະຕຣິງຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Returns the ID of a 4×4 white texture (in [constant Image.FORMAT_RGB8] "
"format). This texture will be created and returned on the first call to "
"[method get_white_texture], then it will be cached for subsequent calls. See "
"also [method get_test_texture].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Get the white texture and apply it to a [Sprite2D] node:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var texture_rid = RenderingServer.get_white_texture()\n"
"var texture = "
"ImageTexture.create_from_image(RenderingServer.texture_2d_get(texture_rid))\n"
"$Sprite2D.texture = texture\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ ID ຂອງພື້ນຜິວສີຂາວຂະໜາດ 4×4 (ໃນຮູບແບບ [constant Image.FORMAT_RGB8]). "
"ພື້ນຜິວນີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຄືນຄ່າໃນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method get_white_texture] ຄັ້ງທຳອິດ, "
"ຈາກນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນແຄຊ໌ສຳລັບການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໆໄປ. ເບິ່ງ [method get_test_texture] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ດຶງພື້ນຜິວສີຂາວ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ມັນກັບໂນດ [Sprite2D]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var texture_rid = RenderingServer.get_white_texture()\n"
"var texture = "
"ImageTexture.create_from_image(RenderingServer.texture_2d_get(texture_rid))\n"
"$Sprite2D.texture = texture\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"If [param half_resolution] is [code]true[/code], renders [VoxelGI] and SDFGI "
"([member Environment.sdfgi_enabled]) buffers at halved resolution on each "
"axis (e.g. 960×540 when the viewport size is 1920×1080). This improves "
"performance significantly when VoxelGI or SDFGI is enabled, at the cost of "
"artifacts that may be visible on polygon edges. The loss in quality becomes "
"less noticeable as the viewport resolution increases. [LightmapGI] rendering "
"is not affected by this setting. Equivalent to [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/gi/use_half_resolution]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param half_resolution] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງຜົນ [VoxelGI] ແລະ "
"SDFGI ([member Environment.sdfgi_enabled]) ບັບເຟີ (buffers) "
"ດ້ວຍຄວາມລະອຽດເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງໃນແຕ່ລະແກນ (ເຊັ່ນ: 960×540 ເມື່ອຂະໜາດ viewport ແມ່ນ 1920×1080). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້ຫຼາຍເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ VoxelGI ຫຼື SDFGI, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍພາບຜິດພ້ຽນ "
"(artifacts) ທີ່ອາດເຫັນໄດ້ຕາມຂອບຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ. "
"ການສູນເສຍຄຸນນະພາບຈະເຫັນໄດ້ໜ້ອຍລົງເມື່ອຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງ viewport ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ. ການສະແດງຜົນ "
"[LightmapGI] ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/gi/use_half_resolution]."

msgid ""
"Creates a new global shader uniform.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Global shader parameter names are case-sensitive."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຕົວແປ shader uniform ສ່ວນກາງ (global) ໃໝ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊື່ພາຣາມີເຕີ shader ສ່ວນກາງ ແມ່ນມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງຕົວອັກສອນນ້ອຍ ແລະ ໃຫຍ່ "
"(case-sensitive)."

msgid ""
"Returns the value of the global shader uniform specified by [param name].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method global_shader_parameter_get] has a large performance "
"penalty as the rendering thread needs to synchronize with the calling thread, "
"which is slow. Do not use this method during gameplay to avoid stuttering. If "
"you need to read values in a script after setting them, consider creating an "
"autoload where you store the values you need to query at the same time you're "
"setting them as global parameters."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຂອງ shader uniform ສ່ວນກາງ ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param name].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method global_shader_parameter_get] ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍ "
"ເພາະວ່າ rendering thread ຕ້ອງໄດ້ປະສານງານກັບ thread ທີ່ເອີ້ນໃຊ້, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ຊ້າ. "
"ຢ່າໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນອາການກະຕຸກ (stuttering). "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການອ່ານຄ່າໃນສະຄຣິບຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າພວກມັນແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາສ້າງ autoload "
"ເພື່ອເກັບຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສອບຖາມໄປພ້ອມໆກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າພວກມັນເປັນພາຣາມີເຕີສ່ວນກາງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of global shader uniform names.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method global_shader_parameter_get] has a large performance "
"penalty as the rendering thread needs to synchronize with the calling thread, "
"which is slow. Do not use this method during gameplay to avoid stuttering. If "
"you need to read values in a script after setting them, consider creating an "
"autoload where you store the values you need to query at the same time you're "
"setting them as global parameters."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າລາຍຊື່ຂອງ shader uniform ສ່ວນກາງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method global_shader_parameter_get] ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍ "
"ເພາະວ່າ rendering thread ຕ້ອງໄດ້ປະສານງານກັບ thread ທີ່ເອີ້ນໃຊ້, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ຊ້າ. "
"ຢ່າໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນອາການກະຕຸກ. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການອ່ານຄ່າໃນສະຄຣິບຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າພວກມັນແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາສ້າງ autoload "
"ເພື່ອເກັບຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສອບຖາມໄປພ້ອມໆກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າພວກມັນເປັນພາຣາມີເຕີສ່ວນກາງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the type associated to the global shader uniform specified by [param "
"name].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method global_shader_parameter_get] has a large performance "
"penalty as the rendering thread needs to synchronize with the calling thread, "
"which is slow. Do not use this method during gameplay to avoid stuttering. If "
"you need to read values in a script after setting them, consider creating an "
"autoload where you store the values you need to query at the same time you're "
"setting them as global parameters."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າປະເພດ (type) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ shader uniform ສ່ວນກາງ ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param name].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method global_shader_parameter_get] ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍ "
"ເພາະວ່າ rendering thread ຕ້ອງໄດ້ປະສານງານກັບ thread ທີ່ເອີ້ນໃຊ້, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ຊ້າ. "
"ຢ່າໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນອາການກະຕຸກ. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການອ່ານຄ່າໃນສະຄຣິບຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າພວກມັນແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາສ້າງ autoload "
"ເພື່ອເກັບຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສອບຖາມໄປພ້ອມໆກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າພວກມັນເປັນພາຣາມີເຕີສ່ວນກາງ."

msgid "Removes the global shader uniform specified by [param name]."
msgstr "ລຶບ shader uniform ສ່ວນກາງ ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param name] ອອກ."

msgid "Sets the global shader uniform [param name] to [param value]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ shader uniform ສ່ວນກາງ [param name] ໃຫ້ເປັນ [param value]."

msgid ""
"Overrides the global shader uniform [param name] with [param value]. "
"Equivalent to the [ShaderGlobalsOverride] node."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບ (override) shader uniform ສ່ວນກາງ [param name] ດ້ວຍ [param value]. "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບໂນດ [ShaderGlobalsOverride]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if changes have been made to the RenderingServer's "
"data. [method force_draw] is usually called if this happens."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຫາກມີການປ່ຽນແປງຂໍ້ມູນໃນ RenderingServer. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ "
"[method force_draw] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຖ້າສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "This method has not been used since Godot 3.0."
msgstr "ເມທອດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ອີກເລີຍຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 3.0."

msgid "This method does nothing and always returns [code]false[/code]."
msgstr "ເມທອດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດຫຍັງ ແລະ ຈະຄືນຄ່າ [code]false[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Attaches a unique Object ID to instance. Object ID must be attached to "
"instance for proper culling with [method instances_cull_aabb], [method "
"instances_cull_convex], and [method instances_cull_ray]."
msgstr ""
"ຕິດ Object ID ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳໃຜໃຫ້ກັບ instance. Object ID ຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດເຂົ້າກັບ instance "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຄັດອອກ (culling) ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງດ້ວຍ [method instances_cull_aabb], "
"[method instances_cull_convex], ແລະ [method instances_cull_ray]."

msgid ""
"Attaches a skeleton to an instance. Removes the previous skeleton from the "
"instance."
msgstr "ຕິດໂຄງກະດູກ (skeleton) ເຂົ້າກັບ instance. ຈະລຶບໂຄງກະດູກກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ອອກຈາກ instance."

msgid ""
"Creates a visual instance and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all "
"[code]instance_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"An instance is a way of placing a 3D object in the scenario. Objects like "
"particles, meshes, reflection probes and decals need to be associated with an "
"instance to be visible in the scenario using [method instance_set_base].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent node is [VisualInstance3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ visual instance ແລະ ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID "
"ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]instance_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"Instance ແມ່ນວິທີການວາງວັດຖຸ 3D ລົງໃນສາກ (scenario). ວັດຖຸຕ່າງໆເຊັ່ນ ອະນຸພາກ, ເມຊ, "
"reflection probes ແລະ ດີຄໍ ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ instance ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ໃນສາກໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[method instance_set_base].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [VisualInstance3D]."

msgid ""
"Creates a visual instance, adds it to the RenderingServer, and sets both base "
"and scenario. It can be accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID will "
"be used in all [code]instance_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method. This is a shorthand for using "
"[method instance_create] and setting the base and scenario manually."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ visual instance, ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງ base ແລະ scenario. "
"ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]instance_*[/"
"code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີທາງລັດແທນການໃຊ້ [method instance_create] ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"base ກັບ scenario ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the value of the per-instance shader uniform from the specified 3D "
"geometry instance. Equivalent to [method "
"GeometryInstance3D.get_instance_shader_parameter].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Per-instance shader parameter names are case-sensitive."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຂອງ shader uniform ແບບ per-instance ຈາກ 3D geometry instance ທີ່ກຳນົດ. "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [method GeometryInstance3D.get_instance_shader_parameter].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊື່ພາຣາມີເຕີ shader ແບບ per-instance "
"ແມ່ນມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງຕົວອັກສອນນ້ອຍ ແລະ ໃຫຍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the default value of the per-instance shader uniform from the "
"specified 3D geometry instance. Equivalent to [method "
"GeometryInstance3D.get_instance_shader_parameter]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ shader uniform ແບບ per-instance ຈາກ 3D geometry instance ທີ່ກຳນົດ. "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [method GeometryInstance3D.get_instance_shader_parameter]."

msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary of per-instance shader uniform names of the per-instance "
"shader uniform from the specified 3D geometry instance. The returned "
"dictionary is in PropertyInfo format, with the keys [code]name[/code], "
"[code]class_name[/code], [code]type[/code], [code]hint[/code], "
"[code]hint_string[/code] and [code]usage[/code]. Equivalent to [method "
"GeometryInstance3D.get_instance_shader_parameter]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າພົດຈະນານຸກົມຂອງຊື່ shader uniform ແບບ per-instance ຈາກ 3D geometry instance "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ພົດຈະນານຸກົມທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາຈະຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ PropertyInfo, ໂດຍມີຄີແມ່ນ [code]name[/code], "
"[code]class_name[/code], [code]type[/code], [code]hint[/code], "
"[code]hint_string[/code] ແລະ [code]usage[/code]. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [method "
"GeometryInstance3D.get_instance_shader_parameter]."

msgid ""
"Sets the shadow casting setting. Equivalent to [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.cast_shadow]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການສະທ້ອນເງົາ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member GeometryInstance3D.cast_shadow]."

msgid "Sets the [param flag] for a given [param instance] to [param enabled]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າແຟລັກ [param flag] ສຳລັບ [param instance] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນ [param enabled]."

msgid ""
"Sets the lightmap GI instance to use for the specified 3D geometry instance. "
"The lightmap UV scale for the specified instance (equivalent to [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.gi_lightmap_scale]) and lightmap atlas slice must also be "
"specified."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ lightmap GI instance ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບ 3D geometry instance ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຕ້ອງລະບຸອັດຕາສ່ວນ "
"lightmap UV ສຳລັບ instance ນັ້ນໆ (ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.gi_lightmap_scale]) ແລະ lightmap atlas slice ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Sets the level of detail bias to use when rendering the specified 3D geometry "
"instance. Higher values result in higher detail from further away. Equivalent "
"to [member GeometryInstance3D.lod_bias]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລະດັບຄວາມລຳອຽງຂອງລາຍລະອຽດ (level of detail bias) ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການສະແດງຜົນ 3D "
"geometry instance ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຄ່າຍິ່ງສູງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນລາຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນຈາກໄລຍະໄກ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member GeometryInstance3D.lod_bias]."

msgid ""
"Sets a material that will be rendered for all surfaces on top of active "
"materials for the mesh associated with this instance. Equivalent to [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.material_overlay]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວັດສະດຸ (material) ທີ່ຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນສຳລັບທຸກພື້ນຜິວ "
"ທັບເທິງວັດສະດຸທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ສຳລັບເມຊທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ instance ນີ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.material_overlay]."

msgid ""
"Sets a material that will override the material for all surfaces on the mesh "
"associated with this instance. Equivalent to [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.material_override]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວັດສະດຸທີ່ຈະຂຽນທັບວັດສະດຸສຳລັບທຸກພື້ນຜິວໃນເມຊທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ instance ນີ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.material_override]."

msgid ""
"Sets the per-instance shader uniform on the specified 3D geometry instance. "
"Equivalent to [method GeometryInstance3D.set_instance_shader_parameter]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ shader uniform ແບບ per-instance ໃນ 3D geometry instance ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[method GeometryInstance3D.set_instance_shader_parameter]."

msgid ""
"Sets the transparency for the given geometry instance. Equivalent to [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.transparency].\n"
"A transparency of [code]0.0[/code] is fully opaque, while [code]1.0[/code] is "
"fully transparent. Values greater than [code]0.0[/code] (exclusive) will "
"force the geometry's materials to go through the transparent pipeline, which "
"is slower to render and can exhibit rendering issues due to incorrect "
"transparency sorting. However, unlike using a transparent material, setting "
"[param transparency] to a value greater than [code]0.0[/code] (exclusive) "
"will [i]not[/i] disable shadow rendering.\n"
"In spatial shaders, [code]1.0 - transparency[/code] is set as the default "
"value of the [code]ALPHA[/code] built-in.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param transparency] is clamped between [code]0.0[/code] and "
"[code]1.0[/code], so this property cannot be used to make transparent "
"materials more opaque than they originally are."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ (transparency) ສຳລັບ geometry instance ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.transparency].\n"
"ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ [code]0.0[/code] ແມ່ນທຶບແສງທັງໝົດ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ແມ່ນໂປ່ງໃສທັງໝົດ. ຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ວັດສະດຸຂອງກາຍະພາບນັ້ນຜ່ານຂະບວນການສະແດງຜົນແບບໂປ່ງໃສ, ເຊິ່ງຈະສະແດງຜົນຊ້າກວ່າ ແລະ "
"ອາດເກີດບັນຫາການສະແດງຜົນເນື່ອງຈາກການລຽງລຳດັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ມັນແຕກຕ່າງຈາກການໃຊ້ວັດສະດຸໂປ່ງໃສ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param transparency] ໃຫ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0.0[/"
"code] ຈະ [i]ບໍ່[/i] ປິດການສະແດງຜົນເງົາ.\n"
"ໃນ spatial shaders, [code]1.0 - transparency[/code] ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ "
"[code]ALPHA[/code] built-in.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param transparency] ຖືກຈຳກັດລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]1.0[/code], ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດສະດຸທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສຢູ່ແລ້ວໃຫ້ທຶບແສງກວ່າເດີມໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the visibility range values for the given geometry instance. Equivalent "
"to [member GeometryInstance3D.visibility_range_begin] and related properties."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ວງການເບິ່ງເຫັນ (visibility range) ສຳລັບ geometry instance ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member GeometryInstance3D.visibility_range_begin] ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the base of the instance. A base can be any of the 3D objects that are "
"created in the RenderingServer that can be displayed. For example, any of the "
"light types, mesh, multimesh, particle system, reflection probe, decal, "
"lightmap, voxel GI and visibility notifiers are all types that can be set as "
"the base of an instance in order to be displayed in the scenario."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າພື້ນຖານ (base) ຂອງ instance. Base ສາມາດເປັນວັດຖຸ 3D ໃດໆກໍຕາມທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ "
"RenderingServer ທີ່ສາມາດສະແດງຜົນໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ປະເພດແສງໄຟຕ່າງໆ, ເມຊ, multimesh, "
"ລະບົບອະນຸພາກ, reflection probe, ດີຄໍ, lightmap, voxel GI ແລະ ຕົວແຈ້ງເຕືອນການເບິ່ງເຫັນ "
"ລ້ວນແຕ່ແມ່ນປະເພດທີ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງເປັນ base ຂອງ instance ເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນໃນສາກໄດ້."

msgid "Sets the weight for a given blend shape associated with this instance."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄ່ານ້ຳໜັກ (weight) ສຳລັບ blend shape ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ instance ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Sets a custom AABB to use when culling objects from the view frustum. "
"Equivalent to setting [member GeometryInstance3D.custom_aabb]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ AABB ແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການຄັດອອກວັດຖຸຈາກ view frustum. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"[member GeometryInstance3D.custom_aabb]."

msgid ""
"Sets a margin to increase the size of the AABB when culling objects from the "
"view frustum. This allows you to avoid culling objects that fall outside the "
"view frustum. Equivalent to [member GeometryInstance3D.extra_cull_margin]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອບ (margin) ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຂະໜາດຂອງ AABB ເມື່ອຄັດອອກວັດຖຸຈາກ view frustum. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຄັດວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ນອກ view frustum ອອກ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.extra_cull_margin]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], ignores all culling on the specified 3D geometry "
"instance, including frustum culling, occlusion culling, and layer culling. "
"This is not the same as [member GeometryInstance3D.ignore_occlusion_culling], "
"which only ignores occlusion culling but leaves frustum and layer culling "
"intact."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະລະເວັ້ນການຄັດອອກ (culling) ທັງໝົດໃນ 3D geometry instance "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດ, ລວມທັງ frustum culling, occlusion culling, ແລະ layer culling. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ຄືກັນກັບ "
"[member GeometryInstance3D.ignore_occlusion_culling], ເຊິ່ງຈະລະເວັ້ນສະເພາະ "
"occlusion culling ແຕ່ຍັງຄົງຮັກສາ frustum ແລະ layer culling ໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the render layers that this instance will be drawn to. Equivalent to "
"[member VisualInstance3D.layers]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເລເຢີການສະແດງຜົນ (render layers) ທີ່ instance ນີ້ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໃສ່. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"VisualInstance3D.layers]."

msgid ""
"Sets the sorting offset and switches between using the bounding box or "
"instance origin for depth sorting."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະຫ່າງການລຽງລຳດັບ (sorting offset) ແລະ ສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງການໃຊ້ bounding box ຫຼື "
"instance origin ສຳລັບການລຽງລຳດັບຄວາມເລິກ (depth sorting)."

msgid ""
"Sets the scenario that the instance is in. The scenario is the 3D world that "
"the objects will be displayed in."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສາກ (scenario) ທີ່ instance ນັ້ນຢູ່. ສາກແມ່ນໂລກ 3D ທີ່ວັດຖຸຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the override material of a specific surface. Equivalent to [method "
"MeshInstance3D.set_surface_override_material]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວັດສະດຸຂຽນທັບ (override material) ຂອງພື້ນຜິວສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [method "
"MeshInstance3D.set_surface_override_material]."

msgid ""
"Sets the world space transform of the instance. Equivalent to [member "
"Node3D.global_transform]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ transform ໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລກ (world space transform) ຂອງ instance. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member Node3D.global_transform]."

msgid ""
"Sets the visibility parent for the given instance. Equivalent to [member "
"Node3D.visibility_parent]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ parent ຂອງການເບິ່ງເຫັນ (visibility parent) ສຳລັບ instance ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member Node3D.visibility_parent]."

msgid ""
"Sets whether an instance is drawn or not. Equivalent to [member "
"Node3D.visible]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຈະໃຫ້ແຕ້ມ instance ຫຼື ບໍ່. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member Node3D.visible]."

msgid ""
"Resets motion vectors and other interpolated values. Use this [i]after[/i] "
"teleporting a mesh from one position to another to avoid ghosting artifacts."
msgstr ""
"ຣີເຊັດ motion vectors ແລະ ຄ່າການແຊກສະຫຼັບ (interpolated values) ອື່ນໆ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ "
"[i]ຫຼັງຈາກ[/i] ການຍ້າຍເມຊຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງໜຶ່ງໄປຫາອີກຕຳແໜ່ງໜຶ່ງໃນທັນທີ ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນພາບເງົາ (ghosting "
"artifacts)."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of object IDs intersecting with the provided AABB. Only 3D "
"nodes that inherit from [VisualInstance3D] are considered, such as "
"[MeshInstance3D] or [DirectionalLight3D]. Use [method "
"@GlobalScope.instance_from_id] to obtain the actual nodes. A scenario RID "
"must be provided, which is available in the [World3D] you want to query. This "
"forces an update for all resources queued to update.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This function is primarily intended for editor usage. For in-"
"game use cases, prefer physics collision."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າອາເຣຂອງ Object ID ທີ່ຕັດກັບ AABB ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ຈະພິຈາລະນາສະເພາະໂນດ 3D ທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ "
"[VisualInstance3D] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊັ່ນ [MeshInstance3D] ຫຼື [DirectionalLight3D]. ໃຊ້ "
"[method @GlobalScope.instance_from_id] ເພື່ອດຶງເອົາໂນດຕົວຈິງ. ຕ້ອງລະບຸ scenario RID, "
"ເຊິ່ງມີຢູ່ໃນ [World3D] ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສອບຖາມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີການອັບເດດຊັບພະຍາກອນທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຄິວ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນນີ້ມີຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານໃນເກມ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"physics collision ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of object IDs intersecting with the provided convex shape. "
"Only 3D nodes that inherit from [VisualInstance3D] are considered, such as "
"[MeshInstance3D] or [DirectionalLight3D]. Use [method "
"@GlobalScope.instance_from_id] to obtain the actual nodes. A scenario RID "
"must be provided, which is available in the [World3D] you want to query. This "
"forces an update for all resources queued to update.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This function is primarily intended for editor usage. For in-"
"game use cases, prefer physics collision."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າອາເຣຂອງ Object ID ທີ່ຕັດກັບຮູບຊົງນູນ (convex shape) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ຈະພິຈາລະນາສະເພາະໂນດ "
"3D ທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ [VisualInstance3D] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊັ່ນ [MeshInstance3D] ຫຼື "
"[DirectionalLight3D]. ໃຊ້ [method @GlobalScope.instance_from_id] "
"ເພື່ອດຶງເອົາໂນດຕົວຈິງ. ຕ້ອງລະບຸ scenario RID, ເຊິ່ງມີຢູ່ໃນ [World3D] ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສອບຖາມ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີການອັບເດດຊັບພະຍາກອນທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຄິວ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນນີ້ມີຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານໃນເກມ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"physics collision ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of object IDs intersecting with the provided 3D ray. Only 3D "
"nodes that inherit from [VisualInstance3D] are considered, such as "
"[MeshInstance3D] or [DirectionalLight3D]. Use [method "
"@GlobalScope.instance_from_id] to obtain the actual nodes. A scenario RID "
"must be provided, which is available in the [World3D] you want to query. This "
"forces an update for all resources queued to update.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This function is primarily intended for editor usage. For in-"
"game use cases, prefer physics collision."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າອາເຣຂອງ Object ID ທີ່ຕັດກັບລັງສີ 3D (3D ray) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ຈະພິຈາລະນາສະເພາະໂນດ 3D "
"ທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ [VisualInstance3D] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊັ່ນ [MeshInstance3D] ຫຼື "
"[DirectionalLight3D]. ໃຊ້ [method @GlobalScope.instance_from_id] "
"ເພື່ອດຶງເອົາໂນດຕົວຈິງ. ຕ້ອງລະບຸ scenario RID, ເຊິ່ງມີຢູ່ໃນ [World3D] ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສອບຖາມ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີການອັບເດດຊັບພະຍາກອນທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຄິວ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນນີ້ມີຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານໃນເກມ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"physics collision ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if our code is currently executing on the rendering "
"thread."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຫາກໂຄ້ດຂອງພວກເຮົາກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນ rendering thread."

msgid ""
"Defines whether the energy of an [AreaLight3D] is normalized (divided) by its "
"area. If set to [code]true[/code], changing the size does not affect the "
"total energy output. Equivalent to [member AreaLight3D.area_normalize_energy]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າພະລັງງານຂອງ [AreaLight3D] ຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ (ຫານ) ດ້ວຍພື້ນທີ່ຂອງມັນຫຼືບໍ່. "
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ພະລັງງານທີ່ປ່ອຍອອກມາທັງໝົດ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member AreaLight3D.area_normalize_energy]."

msgid ""
"Sets the extents (width and height) in meters for this area light. Equivalent "
"to [member AreaLight3D.area_size]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອບເຂດ (ຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງ) ເປັນແມັດສຳລັບແສງໄຟແບບພື້ນທີ່ (area light) ນີ້. "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member AreaLight3D.area_size]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this directional light will blend between shadow map "
"splits resulting in a smoother transition between them. Equivalent to [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_blend_splits]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ໄຟທີ່ມີທິດທາງນີ້ຈະປະສົມ (blend) ລະຫວ່າງການແບ່ງ shadow map "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານລະຫວ່າງພວກມັນນວນຂຶ້ນ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_blend_splits]."

msgid ""
"Sets the shadow mode for this directional light. Equivalent to [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດເງົາສຳລັບໄຟທີ່ມີທິດທາງນີ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_mode]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this light will not be used for anything except sky "
"shaders. Use this for lights that impact your sky shader that you may want to "
"hide from affecting the rest of the scene. For example, you may want to "
"enable this when the sun in your sky shader falls below the horizon."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ແສງນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບສິ່ງໃດນອກຈາກ sky shaders. "
"ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ສຳລັບແສງທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ sky shader ຂອງທ່ານ "
"ເຊິ່ງທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອງມັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ສ່ວນອື່ນໆຂອງສາກ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້ງານສິ່ງນີ້ເມື່ອດວງອາທິດໃນ sky shader ຂອງທ່ານຕົກຂອບຟ້າ."

msgid ""
"Sets whether to use a dual paraboloid or a cubemap for the shadow map. Dual "
"paraboloid is faster but may suffer from artifacts. Equivalent to [member "
"OmniLight3D.omni_shadow_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຈະໃຊ້ dual paraboloid ຫຼື cubemap ສຳລັບ shadow map. Dual paraboloid "
"ຈະໄວກວ່າແຕ່ອາດຈະເກີດພາບຜິດພ້ຽນ (artifacts) ໄດ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"OmniLight3D.omni_shadow_mode]."

msgid ""
"Sets the texture filter mode to use when rendering light projectors. This "
"parameter is global and cannot be set on a per-light basis."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດການກັ່ນຕອງພື້ນຜິວ (texture filter) ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການສະແດງຜົນ light projectors. "
"ພາຣາມີເຕີນີ້ນຳໃຊ້ທົ່ວໂລກ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າແຍກແຕ່ລະແສງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the bake mode to use for the specified 3D light. Equivalent to [member "
"Light3D.light_bake_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດການເບັກ (bake mode) ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບແສງ 3D ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"Light3D.light_bake_mode]."

msgid "Sets the color of the light. Equivalent to [member Light3D.light_color]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີຂອງແສງໄຟ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member Light3D.light_color]."

msgid ""
"Sets the cull mask for this 3D light. Lights only affect objects in the "
"selected layers. Equivalent to [member Light3D.light_cull_mask]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໜ້າກາກການຄັດອອກ (cull mask) ສຳລັບແສງ 3D ນີ້. "
"ແສງຈະມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບວັດຖຸໃນເລເຢີທີ່ເລືອກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"Light3D.light_cull_mask]."

msgid ""
"Sets the distance fade for this 3D light. This acts as a form of level of "
"detail (LOD) and can be used to improve performance. Equivalent to [member "
"Light3D.distance_fade_enabled], [member Light3D.distance_fade_begin], [member "
"Light3D.distance_fade_shadow], and [member Light3D.distance_fade_length]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຈາງຫາຍຕາມໄລຍະທາງ (distance fade) ສຳລັບແສງ 3D ນີ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ຄືກັບ LOD "
"ຮູບແບບໜຶ່ງ ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"Light3D.distance_fade_enabled], [member Light3D.distance_fade_begin], [member "
"Light3D.distance_fade_shadow], ແລະ [member Light3D.distance_fade_length]."

msgid ""
"Sets the maximum SDFGI cascade in which the 3D light's indirect lighting is "
"rendered. Higher values allow the light to be rendered in SDFGI further away "
"from the camera."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລະດັບ SDFGI cascade ສູງສຸດທີ່ແສງທາງອ້ອມ (indirect lighting) ຂອງແສງ 3D "
"ຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນ. ຄ່າຍິ່ງສູງຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແສງຖືກສະແດງຜົນໃນ SDFGI ໄດ້ໄກຈາກກ້ອງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the 3D light will subtract light instead of adding "
"light. Equivalent to [member Light3D.light_negative]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ແສງ 3D ຈະເປັນການລົບແສງແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນການເພີ່ມແສງ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member Light3D.light_negative]."

msgid ""
"Sets the specified 3D light parameter. Equivalent to [method "
"Light3D.set_param]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມີເຕີແສງ 3D ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [method Light3D.set_param]."

msgid ""
"Sets the projector texture to use for the specified 3D light. Equivalent to "
"[member Light3D.light_projector]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າພື້ນຜິວໂປຣເຈັກເຕີ (projector texture) ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບແສງ 3D ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"Light3D.light_projector]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], reverses the backface culling of the mesh. This can be "
"useful when you have a flat mesh that has a light behind it. If you need to "
"cast a shadow on both sides of the mesh, set the mesh to use double-sided "
"shadows with [method instance_geometry_set_cast_shadows_setting]. Equivalent "
"to [member Light3D.shadow_reverse_cull_face]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະກັບຄືນການຄັດອອກພື້ນຜິວດ້ານຫຼັງ (backface culling) ຂອງເມຊ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອທ່ານມີເມຊແບບແປທີ່ມີແສງໄຟຢູ່ທາງຫຼັງ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເກີດເງົາທັງສອງດ້ານຂອງເມຊ, "
"ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເມຊໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເງົາແບບສອງດ້ານດ້ວຍ [method "
"instance_geometry_set_cast_shadows_setting]. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"Light3D.shadow_reverse_cull_face]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], light will cast shadows. Equivalent to [member "
"Light3D.shadow_enabled]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ແສງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດເງົາ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"Light3D.shadow_enabled]."

msgid ""
"Sets the shadow caster mask for this 3D light. Shadows will only be cast "
"using objects in the selected layers. Equivalent to [member "
"Light3D.shadow_caster_mask]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໜ້າກາກຕົວສ້າງເງົາ (shadow caster mask) ສຳລັບແສງ 3D ນີ້. "
"ເງົາຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກວັດຖຸໃນເລເຢີທີ່ເລືອກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"Light3D.shadow_caster_mask]."

msgid ""
"Creates a new lightmap global illumination instance and adds it to the "
"RenderingServer. It can be accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID "
"will be used in all [code]lightmap_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent node is [LightmapGI]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ຂອງ lightmap global illumination ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ "
"RenderingServer. ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ "
"[code]lightmap_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [LightmapGI]."

msgid ""
"Returns the BSP tree data used for accelerating probe lookups. The BSP data "
"is structured as a series of six signed 32-bit values per BSP node in this "
"order: [code]float plane_x[/code], [code]float plane_y[/code], [code]float "
"plane_z[/code], [code]float plane_distance[/code], [code]int32_t over[/code], "
"[code]int32_t under[/code]. An empty leaf is denoted by the value "
"[code]-2147483648[/code] (the minimum 32-bit signed integer). See also "
"[method lightmap_set_probe_capture_data]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນຕົ້ນໄມ້ BSP (BSP tree) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລັ່ງການຄົ້ນຫາໂພຣບ (probe lookups). ຂໍ້ມູນ BSP "
"ຖືກຈັດໂຄງສ້າງເປັນຊຸດຂອງຄ່າ 32-bit ແບບມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ 6 ຄ່າຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງໂນດ BSP ຕາມລຳດັບດັ່ງນີ້: "
"[code]float plane_x[/code], [code]float plane_y[/code], [code]float plane_z[/"
"code], [code]float plane_distance[/code], [code]int32_t over[/code], "
"[code]int32_t under[/code]. ໃບຫວ່າງເປົ່າ (empty leaf) ຈະຖືກແທນດ້ວຍຄ່າ "
"[code]-2147483648[/code] (ຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງເລກຖ້ວນ 32-bit ແບບມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ). ເບິ່ງ [method "
"lightmap_set_probe_capture_data] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [i]local space[/i] positions of each lightmap probe capture "
"point. Keep in mind the lightmap instance may have a non-zero transform, "
"which will affect the position of the probe capture points. See also [method "
"lightmap_set_probe_capture_data]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງໃນ [i]ພື້ນທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local space)[/i] ຂອງແຕ່ລະຈຸດຈັບສັນຍານໂພຣບ (lightmap "
"probe capture point). ຢ່າລືມວ່າ lightmap instance ອາດຈະມີຄ່າ transform ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສູນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຈຸດຈັບສັນຍານໂພຣບ. ເບິ່ງ [method lightmap_set_probe_capture_data] "
"ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the L0, L1, and L2 [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Spherical_harmonics]spherical harmonics[/url] data for each lightmap probe "
"capture point. This is specified as 9 [Color] values per probe, which means "
"the size of the returned data is always 9 times the number of probe points. "
"See also [method lightmap_set_probe_capture_data]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນ L0, L1, ແລະ L2 [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Spherical_harmonics]spherical harmonics[/url] ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຈຸດຈັບສັນຍານໂພຣບ. "
"ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຖືກກຳນົດເປັນຄ່າ [Color] 9 ຄ່າຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງໂພຣບ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຂະໜາດຂອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາຈະເປັນ 9 "
"ເທົ່າຂອງຈຳນວນຈຸດໂພຣບສະເໝີ. ເບິ່ງ [method lightmap_set_probe_capture_data] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the tetrahedralization data used for interpolating between lightmap "
"probe capture points. Each tetrahedron is specified as a series of 4 numbers, "
"each being an index into the probe capture points array returned by [method "
"lightmap_get_probe_capture_points]. See also [method "
"lightmap_set_probe_capture_data]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນ tetrahedralization ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການແຊກສະຫຼັບ (interpolation) "
"ລະຫວ່າງຈຸດຈັບສັນຍານໂພຣບ. ແຕ່ລະຮູບຊົງສີ່ໜ້າ (tetrahedron) ຖືກກຳນົດເປັນຊຸດຂອງຕົວເລກ 4 ຕົວ, "
"ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະຕົວແມ່ນດັດຊະນີໃນອາເຣຈຸດຈັບສັນຍານໂພຣບທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາໂດຍ [method "
"lightmap_get_probe_capture_points]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"lightmap_set_probe_capture_data] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Used to inform the renderer what exposure normalization value was used while "
"baking the lightmap. This value will be used and modulated at run time to "
"ensure that the lightmap maintains a consistent level of exposure even if the "
"scene-wide exposure normalization is changed at run time. For more "
"information see [method camera_attributes_set_exposure]."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຈ້ງໃຫ້ຕົວສະແດງຜົນຊາບວ່າຄ່າການປັບລະດັບແສງ (exposure normalization) "
"ໃດທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເບັກ (baking) lightmap. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ ແລະ "
"ປັບປ່ຽນໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດວຽກ (run time) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ lightmap ຮັກສາລະດັບແສງທີ່ຄົງທີ່ "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະມີການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່າການປັບລະດັບແສງທົ່ວທັງສາກກໍຕາມ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເບິ່ງ [method "
"camera_attributes_set_exposure]."

msgid ""
"Sets the bounds that this lightmap instance should visually affect, both in "
"terms of static lightmap baking and probe-based global illumination."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອບເຂດທີ່ lightmap instance ນີ້ຄວນຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ການເບິ່ງເຫັນ, ທັງໃນດ້ານການເບັກ lightmap "
"ແບບຄົງທີ່ (static) ແລະ global illumination ແບບໃຊ້ໂພຣບ."

msgid ""
"Sets the probe capture data for the given lightmap instance. See [method "
"lightmap_get_probe_capture_points], [method lightmap_get_probe_capture_sh], "
"[method lightmap_get_probe_capture_tetrahedra], and [method "
"lightmap_get_probe_capture_bsp_tree] for the expected data formats."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນການຈັບສັນຍານໂພຣບສຳລັບ lightmap instance ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"lightmap_get_probe_capture_points], [method lightmap_get_probe_capture_sh], "
"[method lightmap_get_probe_capture_tetrahedra], ແລະ [method "
"lightmap_get_probe_capture_bsp_tree] ສຳລັບຮູບແບບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

msgid ""
"The framerate-independent update speed when representing dynamic object "
"lighting from [LightmapProbe]s. Higher values make dynamic object lighting "
"update faster. Higher values can prevent fast-moving objects from having "
"\"outdated\" indirect lighting displayed on them, at the cost of possible "
"flickering when an object moves from a bright area to a shaded area. See also "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/probe_capture/update_speed]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວໃນການອັບເດດທີ່ບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບອັດຕາເຟຣມ (framerate-independent) "
"ເມື່ອສະແດງແສງສະຫວ່າງຂອງວັດຖຸແບບໄດນາມິກຈາກ [LightmapProbe]. "
"ຄ່າຍິ່ງສູງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການອັບເດດແສງຂອງວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກໄວຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຄ່າຍິ່ງສູງສາມາດປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວມີແສງທາງອ້ອມທີ່ \"ຫຼ້າສະໄໝ\" ສະແດງອອກມາ, "
"ແຕ່ອາດຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍການກະພິບທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອວັດຖຸຍ້າຍຈາກພື້ນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງໄປຫາພື້ນທີ່ມືດ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/probe_capture/update_speed] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Sets whether the lightmap instance should be considered as interior (when "
"[param interior] is [code]true[/code]). If the lightmap is marked as "
"interior, environment lighting is ignored when baking lightmaps."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າ lightmap instance ຄວນຖືກພິຈາລະນາວ່າເປັນພາຍໃນອາຄານ (interior) ຫຼື ບໍ່ (ເມື່ອ "
"[param interior] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]). ຖ້າ lightmap ຖືກກຳນົດເປັນພາຍໃນອາຄານ, "
"ແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environment lighting) ຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການເບັກ lightmaps."

msgid ""
"Set the textures on the given [param lightmap] GI instance to the texture "
"array pointed to by the [param light] RID. If the lightmap texture was baked "
"with [member LightmapGI.directional] set to [code]true[/code], then [param "
"uses_sh] must also be [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າພື້ນຜິວໃນ [param lightmap] GI instance ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນອາເຣຂອງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ຊີ້ໂດຍ [param "
"light] RID. ຖ້າພື້ນຜິວ lightmap ຖືກເບັກໂດຍຕັ້ງ [member LightmapGI.directional] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code], ແລ້ວ [param uses_sh] ກໍຕ້ອງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຄືກັນ."

msgid ""
"Toggles whether a bicubic filter should be used when lightmaps are sampled. "
"This smoothens their appearance at a performance cost."
msgstr ""
"ສະຫຼັບການໃຊ້ງານ bicubic filter ເມື່ອມີການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ (sampled) lightmaps. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພາບນວນຂຶ້ນແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍປະສິດທິພາບ."

msgid ""
"Returns a mesh of a sphere with the given number of horizontal subdivisions, "
"vertical subdivisions and radius. See also [method get_test_cube]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າເມຊຮູບຊົງກົມ (sphere mesh) ທີ່ມີຈຳນວນການແບ່ງສ່ວນແນວນອນ, ແນວຕັ້ງ ແລະ ລັດສະໝີຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_test_cube] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Creates an empty material and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all "
"[code]material_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent resource is [Material]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງວັດສະດຸ (material) ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ແລະ ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
"RID ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]material_*[/code] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [Material]."

msgid "Returns the value of a certain material's parameter."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າພາຣາມີເຕີຂອງວັດສະດຸໃດໜຶ່ງ."

msgid "Sets an object's next material."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າວັດສະດຸຖັດໄປຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid "Sets a material's parameter."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມີເຕີຂອງວັດສະດຸ."

msgid "Sets a material's render priority."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນໃນການສະແດງຜົນ (render priority) ຂອງວັດສະດຸ."

msgid "Sets a shader material's shader."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ shader ຂອງ shader material."

msgid ""
"When using the Mobile renderer, [method material_set_use_debanding] can be "
"used to enable or disable the debanding feature of 3D materials "
"([BaseMaterial3D] and [ShaderMaterial]).\n"
"[method material_set_use_debanding] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility or Forward+ renderer. In Forward+, [Viewport] debanding can be "
"used instead.\n"
"See also [member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/"
"use_debanding] and [method RenderingServer.viewport_set_use_debanding]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Mobile renderer, ສາມາດໃຊ້ [method material_set_use_debanding] ເພື່ອເປີດ ຫຼື "
"ປິດໃຊ້ງານຟີເຈີ debanding ຂອງວັດສະດຸ 3D ([BaseMaterial3D] ແລະ [ShaderMaterial]).\n"
"[method material_set_use_debanding] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ Compatibility ຫຼື Forward+ "
"renderer. ໃນ Forward+, ສາມາດໃຊ້ [Viewport] debanding ແທນໄດ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/use_debanding] "
"ແລະ [method RenderingServer.viewport_set_use_debanding] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new surface on the given [param mesh]. [method "
"mesh_get_surface_count] will become the surface index for this new surface.\n"
"Surfaces are created to be rendered using a [param primitive], which may be "
"any of the values defined in [enum Mesh.PrimitiveType].\n"
"The [param arrays] argument is an array of arrays. Each of the [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_MAX] elements contains an array with some of the mesh data for "
"this surface as described by the corresponding member of [enum "
"Mesh.ArrayType] or [code]null[/code] if it is not used by the surface. For "
"example, [code]arrays[0][/code] is the array of vertices. That first vertex "
"sub-array is always required; the others are optional. Adding an index array "
"puts this surface into \"index mode\" where the vertex and other arrays "
"become the sources of data and the index array defines the vertex order. All "
"sub-arrays must have the same length as the vertex array (or be an exact "
"multiple of the vertex array's length, when multiple elements of a sub-array "
"correspond to a single vertex) or be empty, except for [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_INDEX] if it is used.\n"
"The [param blend_shapes] argument is an array of vertex data for each blend "
"shape. Each element is an array of the same structure as [param arrays], but "
"[constant Mesh.ARRAY_VERTEX], [constant Mesh.ARRAY_NORMAL], and [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_TANGENT] are set if and only if they are set in [param arrays] and "
"all other entries are [code]null[/code].\n"
"The [param lods] argument is a dictionary with [float] keys and "
"[PackedInt32Array] values. Each entry in the dictionary represents an LOD "
"level of the surface, where the value is the [constant Mesh.ARRAY_INDEX] "
"array to use for the LOD level and the key is roughly proportional to the "
"distance at which the LOD stats being used. I.e., increasing the key of an "
"LOD also increases the distance that the objects has to be from the camera "
"before the LOD is used.\n"
"The [param compress_format] argument is the bitwise OR of, as required: One "
"value of [enum ArrayFormat] left shifted by [code]ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOMn_SHIFT[/"
"code] for each custom channel in use, [constant "
"ARRAY_FLAG_USE_DYNAMIC_UPDATE], [constant ARRAY_FLAG_USE_8_BONE_WEIGHTS], or "
"[constant ARRAY_FLAG_USES_EMPTY_VERTEX_ARRAY].\n"
"See [method ArrayMesh.add_surface_from_arrays] and [method "
"ImporterMesh.add_surface] for higher-level equivalents of this method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using indices, it is recommended to only use points, lines, "
"or triangles."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງພື້ນຜິວ (surface) ໃໝ່ໃນ [param mesh] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. [method mesh_get_surface_count] "
"ຈະກາຍເປັນດັດຊະນີພື້ນຜິວສຳລັບພື້ນຜິວໃໝ່ນີ້.\n"
"ພື້ນຜິວຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນໂດຍໃຊ້ [param primitive], ເຊິ່ງອາດເປັນຄ່າໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ [enum "
"Mesh.PrimitiveType].\n"
"ອາຄິວເມນ [param arrays] ແມ່ນອາເຣຂອງອາເຣ. ແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບໃນ [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_MAX] ຈະບັນຈຸອາເຣທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນຂອງເມຊສຳລັບພື້ນຜິວນີ້ "
"ຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນສະມາຊິກທີ່ກົງກັນຂອງ [enum Mesh.ArrayType] ຫຼື ເປັນ [code]null[/code] "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: [code]arrays[0][/code] ແມ່ນອາເຣຂອງຈຸດ (vertices). "
"ອາເຣຍ່ອຍຂອງຈຸດທຳອິດນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສະເໝີ; ສ່ວນອື່ນໆແມ່ນທາງເລືອກ. ການເພີ່ມອາເຣດັດຊະນີ (index "
"array) ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພື້ນຜິວນີ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ \"index mode\" ເຊິ່ງອາເຣຂອງຈຸດ ແລະ ອາເຣອື່ນໆຈະກາຍເປັນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ "
"ແລະ ອາເຣດັດຊະນີຈະກຳນົດລຳດັບຂອງຈຸດ. ທຸກອາເຣຍ່ອຍຕ້ອງມີຄວາມຍາວເທົ່າກັບອາເຣຂອງຈຸດ (ຫຼື "
"ເປັນຕົວຄູນທີ່ແນ່ນອນຂອງຄວາມຍາວອາເຣຈຸດ) ຫຼື ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, ຍົກເວັ້ນ [constant Mesh.ARRAY_INDEX] "
"ຖ້າຫາກມີການໃຊ້ງານ.\n"
"ອາຄິວເມນ [param blend_shapes] ແມ່ນອາເຣຂອງຂໍ້ມູນຈຸດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ blend shape. "
"ແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບແມ່ນອາເຣທີ່ມີໂຄງສ້າງດຽວກັນກັບ [param arrays], ແຕ່ [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_VERTEX], [constant Mesh.ARRAY_NORMAL], ແລະ [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_TANGENT] ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອພວກມັນຖືກຕັ້ງໃນ [param arrays] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ "
"ອົງປະກອບອື່ນໆທັງໝົດຈະເປັນ [code]null[/code].\n"
"ອາຄິວເມນ [param lods] ແມ່ນພົດຈະນານຸກົມທີ່ມີຄີເປັນ [float] ແລະ ຄ່າເປັນ [PackedInt32Array]. "
"ແຕ່ລະລາຍການໃນພົດຈະນານຸກົມແທນລະດັບ LOD ຂອງພື້ນຜິວ, ໂດຍທີ່ຄ່າແມ່ນອາເຣ [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_INDEX] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບລະດັບ LOD ນັ້ນ ແລະ ຄີແມ່ນໄລຍະທາງໂດຍປະມານທີ່ LOD "
"ຈະເລີ່ມຖືກນໍາໃຊ້. ນັ້ນຄື, ການເພີ່ມຄ່າຄີຂອງ LOD ຈະເປັນການເພີ່ມໄລຍະທາງທີ່ວັດຖຸຕ້ອງຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກກ້ອງກ່ອນທີ່ "
"LOD ນັ້ນຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້.\n"
"ອາຄິວເມນ [param compress_format] ແມ່ນການເຮັດ bitwise OR ຂອງ: ຄ່າໜຶ່ງຂອງ [enum "
"ArrayFormat] ທີ່ເລື່ອນບິດໄປທາງຊ້າຍດ້ວຍ [code]ARRAY_FORMAT_CUSTOMn_SHIFT[/code] "
"ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງກຳນົດເອງທີ່ໃຊ້, [constant ARRAY_FLAG_USE_DYNAMIC_UPDATE], [constant "
"ARRAY_FLAG_USE_8_BONE_WEIGHTS], ຫຼື [constant "
"ARRAY_FLAG_USES_EMPTY_VERTEX_ARRAY].\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method ArrayMesh.add_surface_from_arrays] ແລະ [method "
"ImporterMesh.add_surface] ສຳລັບວິທີການທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າໃນລະດັບທີ່ສູງກວ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ດັດຊະນີ (indices), ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະຈຸດ, ເສັ້ນ, ຫຼື ຮູບສາມແຈເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Removes all surfaces from a mesh."
msgstr "ລຶບທຸກພື້ນຜິວ (surfaces) ອອກຈາກເມຊ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new mesh and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be accessed "
"with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all [code]mesh_*[/"
"code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"To place in a scene, attach this mesh to an instance using [method "
"instance_set_base] using the returned RID.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent resource is [Mesh]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງເມຊ (mesh) ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID "
"ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]mesh_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເພື່ອວາງໃນສາກ, ໃຫ້ຕິດເມຊນີ້ເຂົ້າກັບ instance ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method instance_set_base] ດ້ວຍ RID "
"ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [Mesh]."

msgid ""
"Creates a new mesh with predefined surfaces for it and adds the mesh to the "
"RenderingServer. It can be accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID "
"will be used in all [code]mesh_*[/code] RenderingServer functions. This "
"method is more efficient for creating meshes with multiple surfaces compared "
"to creating an empty mesh with [method mesh_create] and adding surfaces one "
"by one with [method mesh_add_surface].\n"
"Each element in the [param surfaces] array must follow the same structure as "
"described in [method mesh_add_surface]. The [param blend_shape_count] "
"parameter must match the blend shape data defined in all surfaces.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"To place in a scene, attach this mesh to an instance using [method "
"instance_set_base] using the returned RID.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent resource is [Mesh]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງເມຊໃໝ່ພ້ອມກັບພື້ນຜິວທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ແລະ ເພີ່ມເມຊເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. "
"ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]mesh_*[/code] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer. ເມທອດນີ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍກວ່າໃນການສ້າງເມຊທີ່ມີຫຼາຍພື້ນຜິວ "
"ເມື່ອທຽບໃສ່ກັບການສ້າງເມຊຫວ່າງເປົ່າດ້ວຍ [method mesh_create] ແລ້ວເພີ່ມພື້ນຜິວເທື່ອລະອັນດ້ວຍ "
"[method mesh_add_surface].\n"
"ແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບໃນອາເຣ [param surfaces] ຕ້ອງເປັນໄປຕາມໂຄງສ້າງດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ "
"[method mesh_add_surface]. ພາຣາມີເຕີ [param blend_shape_count] ຕ້ອງກົງກັບຂໍ້ມູນ blend "
"shape ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນທຸກພື້ນຜິວ.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປົດປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເພື່ອວາງໃນສາກ, ໃຫ້ຕິດເມຊນີ້ເຂົ້າກັບ instance ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method instance_set_base] ດ້ວຍ RID "
"ທີ່ຄືນຄ່າມາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [Mesh]."

msgid "Returns a mesh's blend shape count."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນ blend shape ຂອງເມຊ."

msgid "Returns a mesh's blend shape mode."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າໂໝດ blend shape ຂອງເມຊ."

msgid "Returns a mesh's custom aabb."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ aabb ແບບກຳນົດເອງຂອງເມຊ."

msgid ""
"Returns a mesh's surface as a dictionary following the same structure as "
"described in [method mesh_add_surface]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າພື້ນຜິວຂອງເມຊໃນຮູບແບບພົດຈະນານຸກົມ ໂດຍມີໂຄງສ້າງດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ [method "
"mesh_add_surface]."

msgid "Returns a mesh's number of surfaces."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນພື້ນຜິວຂອງເມຊ."

msgid "Sets a mesh's blend shape mode."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດ blend shape ຂອງເມຊ."

msgid "Sets a mesh's custom aabb."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ aabb ແບບກຳນົດເອງຂອງເມຊ."

msgid ""
"Sets an optional second mesh which can be used for rendering shadows and the "
"depth prepass. Can be used to increase performance by supplying a mesh with "
"fused vertices and only vertex position data (without normals, UVs, colors, "
"etc.).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This mesh must have exactly the same vertex positions as the "
"source mesh (including the source mesh's LODs, if present). If vertex "
"positions differ, then the mesh will not draw correctly."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເມຊທີສອງ (ທາງເລືອກ) ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນເງົາ ແລະ ການເຮັດ depth prepass. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໂດຍການສະໜອງເມຊທີ່ມີການລວມຈຸດ (fused vertices) ແລະ "
"ມີພຽງຂໍ້ມູນຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ໂດຍບໍ່ມີ normals, UVs, ສີ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມຊນີ້ຕ້ອງມີຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດທີ່ກົງກັບເມຊຕົ້ນສະບັບຢ່າງແນ່ນອນ (ລວມທັງ LOD ຂອງເມຊຕົ້ນສະບັບ "
"ຖ້າມີ). ຖ້າຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ເມຊຈະສະແດງຜົນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Returns a mesh's surface's buffer arrays."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າອາເຣບັບເຟີ (buffer arrays) ຂອງພື້ນຜິວເມຊ."

msgid "Returns a mesh's surface's arrays for blend shapes."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າອາເຣສຳລັບ blend shapes ຂອງພື້ນຜິວເມຊ."

msgid ""
"Returns the stride of the attribute buffer for a mesh with given [param "
"format]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າສະໄຕຣດ໌ (stride) ຂອງ attribute buffer ສຳລັບເມຊທີ່ມີ [param format] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the stride of the index buffer for a mesh with the given [param "
"format]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າສະໄຕຣດ໌ຂອງ index buffer ສຳລັບເມຊທີ່ມີ [param format] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the stride of the combined normals and tangents for a mesh with given "
"[param format]. Note importantly that, while normals and tangents are in the "
"vertex buffer with vertices, they are only interleaved with each other and so "
"have a different stride than vertex positions."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າສະໄຕຣດ໌ຂອງຄ່າ normals ແລະ tangents ທີ່ລວມກັນສຳລັບເມຊທີ່ມີ [param format] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. "
"ສິ່ງທີ່ສຳຄັນຄື: ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ normals ແລະ tangents ຈະຢູ່ໃນ vertex buffer ຮ່ວມກັບຈຸດ, "
"ແຕ່ພວກມັນຖືກວາງສະຫຼັບ (interleaved) ສະເພາະລະຫວ່າງກັນເອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງມີຄ່າສະໄຕຣດ໌ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the offset of a given attribute by [param array_index] in the start "
"of its respective buffer."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ຂອງແອດທຣິບິວ (attribute) ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param array_index] "
"ຈາກຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງບັບເຟີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the stride of the skin buffer for a mesh with given [param format]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າສະໄຕຣດ໌ຂອງ skin buffer ສຳລັບເມຊທີ່ມີ [param format] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the stride of the vertex positions for a mesh with given [param "
"format]. Note importantly that vertex positions are stored consecutively and "
"are not interleaved with the other attributes in the vertex buffer (normals "
"and tangents)."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າສະໄຕຣດ໌ຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດສຳລັບເມຊທີ່ມີ [param format] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ສິ່ງທີ່ສຳຄັນຄື: "
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດຖືກເກັບໄວ້ລຽງຕໍ່ກັນ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກວາງສະຫຼັບກັບແອດທຣິບິວອື່ນໆໃນ vertex buffer (ເຊັ່ນ "
"normals ແລະ tangents)."

msgid "Returns a mesh's surface's material."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າວັດສະດຸຂອງພື້ນຜິວເມຊ."

msgid "Sets a mesh's surface's material."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າວັດສະດຸຂອງພື້ນຜິວເມຊ."

msgid ""
"Updates the attribute buffer of the mesh surface with the given [param data]. "
"The expected data per attribute is 8 or 12 bytes (4 bytes per float, 2 floats "
"per [Vector2], and 3 floats per [Vector3]) depending on if the mesh is using "
"[Vector2] or [Vector3] vertices. This value can be determined with [method "
"mesh_surface_get_format_attribute_stride] instead.\n"
"The starting point of the updates can be changed with [param offset]. The "
"value of [param offset] should be a multiple of 12 bytes in most cases to "
"align to each attribute.\n"
"A [PackedVector3Array] of attribute locations can be converted into a "
"[PackedByteArray] using [method PackedVector3Array.to_byte_array] for use in "
"[param data]."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດ attribute buffer ຂອງພື້ນຜິວເມຊດ້ວຍ [param data] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. "
"ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕ້ອງການຕໍ່ແອດທຣິບິວແມ່ນ 8 ຫຼື 12 ໄບຕ໌ (4 ໄບຕ໌ຕໍ່ float, 2 float ສຳລັບ [Vector2], ແລະ 3 "
"float ສຳລັບ [Vector3]) ຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າເມຊໃຊ້ຈຸດແບບ [Vector2] ຫຼື [Vector3]. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method mesh_surface_get_format_attribute_stride] ແທນ.\n"
"ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງການອັບເດດສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [param offset]. ຄ່າຂອງ [param offset] "
"ໂດຍສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຄວນເປັນຕົວຄູນຂອງ 12 ໄບຕ໌ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບແຕ່ລະແອດທຣິບິວ.\n"
"[PackedVector3Array] ຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງແອດທຣິບິວສາມາດແປງເປັນ [PackedByteArray] ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[method PackedVector3Array.to_byte_array] ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ [param data]."

msgid ""
"Updates the index buffer of the mesh surface with the given [param data]. The "
"expected data are 16 or 32-bit unsigned integers, which can be determined "
"with [method mesh_surface_get_format_index_stride]."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດ index buffer ຂອງ mesh surface ດ້ວຍ [param data] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. "
"ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ແມ່ນເລກຈຳນວນເຕັມແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂະໜາດ 16 ຫຼື 32-bit, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດກຳນົດໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
"[method mesh_surface_get_format_index_stride]."

msgid ""
"Updates the skin buffer of the mesh surface with the given [param data]. The "
"expected data per skin is 8 or 12 bytes (4 bytes per float, 2 floats per "
"[Vector2], and 3 floats per [Vector3]) depending on if the mesh is using "
"[Vector2] or [Vector3] vertices. This value can be determined with [method "
"mesh_surface_get_format_skin_stride] instead.\n"
"The starting point of the updates can be changed with [param offset]. The "
"value of [param offset] should be a multiple of 12 bytes in most cases to "
"align to each skin.\n"
"A [PackedVector3Array] of skin locations can be converted into a "
"[PackedByteArray] using [method PackedVector3Array.to_byte_array] for use in "
"[param data]."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດ skin buffer ຂອງ mesh surface ດ້ວຍ [param data] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ຕໍ່ skin "
"ແມ່ນ 8 ຫຼື 12 bytes (4 bytes ຕໍ່ float, 2 floats ຕໍ່ [Vector2], ແລະ 3 floats ຕໍ່ "
"[Vector3]) ຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າ mesh ໃຊ້ [Vector2] ຫຼື [Vector3] vertices. ຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດກຳນົດໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
"[method mesh_surface_get_format_skin_stride] ແທນ.\n"
"ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງການອັບເດດສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [param offset]. ຄ່າຂອງ [param offset] "
"ຄວນເປັນຕົວຄູນຂອງ 12 bytes ໃນເກືອບທຸກກໍລະນີເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບແຕ່ລະ skin.\n"
"[PackedVector3Array] ຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງ skin ສາມາດແປງເປັນ [PackedByteArray] ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[method PackedVector3Array.to_byte_array] ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ [param data]."

msgid ""
"Updates the vertex buffer of the mesh surface with the given [param data]. "
"The expected data per vertex is 8 or 12 bytes (4 bytes per float, 2 floats "
"per [Vector2], and 3 floats per [Vector3]) depending on if the mesh is using "
"[Vector2] or [Vector3] vertices. This value can be determined with [method "
"mesh_surface_get_format_vertex_stride] instead.\n"
"The starting point of the updates can be changed with [param offset]. The "
"value of [param offset] should be a multiple of 12 bytes in most cases to "
"align to each vertex.\n"
"A [PackedVector3Array] of vertex locations can be converted into a "
"[PackedByteArray] using [method PackedVector3Array.to_byte_array] for use in "
"[param data]."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດ vertex buffer ຂອງ mesh surface ດ້ວຍ [param data] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ຕໍ່ "
"vertex ແມ່ນ 8 ຫຼື 12 bytes (4 bytes ຕໍ່ float, 2 floats ຕໍ່ [Vector2], ແລະ 3 floats "
"ຕໍ່ [Vector3]) ຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າ mesh ໃຊ້ [Vector2] ຫຼື [Vector3] vertices. ຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດກຳນົດໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
"[method mesh_surface_get_format_vertex_stride] ແທນ.\n"
"ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງການອັບເດດສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [param offset]. ຄ່າຂອງ [param offset] "
"ຄວນເປັນຕົວຄູນຂອງ 12 bytes ໃນເກືອບທຸກກໍລະນີເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບແຕ່ລະ vertex.\n"
"[PackedVector3Array] ຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງ vertex ສາມາດແປງເປັນ [PackedByteArray] ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[method PackedVector3Array.to_byte_array] ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ [param data]."

msgid ""
"Sets up the multimesh using the specified data. The number of instances is "
"set by [param instances]. The format of the instance transforms is set by "
"[param transform_format], which should be set according to whether the "
"multimesh is meant to be rendered in 2D or 3D. If [param color_format] is "
"[code]true[/code], each instance will have a color associated with it. If "
"[param custom_data_format] is [code]true[/code], each instance will have a "
"custom data vector associated with it. If [param use_indirect] is [code]true[/"
"code], an indirect command buffer will be created for this multimesh, "
"allowing the instance count to be modified directly on the GPU. See also "
"[method multimesh_get_command_buffer_rd_rid]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ multimesh ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະບຸ. ຈຳນວນ instances ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [param instances]. "
"ຮູບແບບການແປງ (transform) ຂອງ instance ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [param transform_format], "
"ເຊິ່ງຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າຕາມວ່າ multimesh ຈະຖືກເຣນເດີໃນແບບ 2D ຫຼື 3D. ຖ້າ [param color_format] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code], ແຕ່ລະ instance ຈະມີສີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງນຳ. ຖ້າ [param custom_data_format] "
"ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແຕ່ລະ instance ຈະມີ vector ຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງ (custom data) "
"ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງນຳ. ຖ້າ [param use_indirect] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], command buffer "
"ແບບທາງອ້ອມຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບ multimesh ນີ້, ເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງຈຳນວນ instance ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໃນ "
"GPU. ເບິ່ງ [method multimesh_get_command_buffer_rd_rid] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new multimesh on the RenderingServer and returns an [RID] handle. "
"This RID will be used in all [code]multimesh_*[/code] RenderingServer "
"functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"To place in a scene, attach this multimesh to an instance using [method "
"instance_set_base] using the returned RID.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent resource is [MultiMesh]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ multimesh ໃໝ່ໃນ RenderingServer ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ RID handle. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ "
"[code]multimesh_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"ເພື່ອວາງໃນ scene, ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ multimesh ນີ້ເຂົ້າກັບ instance ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"instance_set_base] ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄືນມາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] resource ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [MultiMesh]."

msgid ""
"Calculates and returns the axis-aligned bounding box that encloses all "
"instances within the multimesh."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳນວນ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ axis-aligned bounding box ທີ່ກວມເອົາທຸກ instances ພາຍໃນ multimesh."

msgid ""
"Returns the MultiMesh data (such as instance transforms, colors, etc.). See "
"[method multimesh_set_buffer] for details on the returned data.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the buffer is in the engine's internal cache, it will have to "
"be fetched from GPU memory and possibly decompressed. This means [method "
"multimesh_get_buffer] is potentially a slow operation and should be avoided "
"whenever possible."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນ MultiMesh (ເຊັ່ນ instance transforms, ສີ, ແລະອື່ນໆ). ເບິ່ງ [method "
"multimesh_set_buffer] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ buffer ຢູ່ໃນ cache ພາຍໃນຂອງ engine, ມັນຈະຕ້ອງຖືກດຶງມາຈາກໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ "
"GPU ແລະ ອາດຈະຕ້ອງມີການແຕກໄຟລ໌ (decompress). ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ [method "
"multimesh_get_buffer] ອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກຊ້າ ແລະ ຄວນຫຼີກເວັ້ນຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the [RenderingDevice] [RID] handle of the [MultiMesh], which can be "
"used as any other buffer on the Rendering Device."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [RenderingDevice] [RID] handle ຂອງ [MultiMesh], ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນ buffer "
"ອື່ນໆໃນ Rendering Device ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the [RenderingDevice] [RID] handle of the [MultiMesh] command buffer. "
"This [RID] is only valid if [code]use_indirect[/code] is set to [code]true[/"
"code] when allocating data through [method multimesh_allocate_data]. It can "
"be used to directly modify the instance count via buffer.\n"
"The data structure is dependent on both how many surfaces the mesh contains "
"and whether it is indexed or not, the buffer has 5 integers in it, with the "
"last unused if the mesh is not indexed.\n"
"Each of the values in the buffer correspond to these options:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"Indexed:\n"
"  0 - indexCount;\n"
"  1 - instanceCount;\n"
"  2 - firstIndex;\n"
"  3 - vertexOffset;\n"
"  4 - firstInstance;\n"
"Non-indexed:\n"
"  0 - vertexCount;\n"
"  1 - instanceCount;\n"
"  2 - firstVertex;\n"
"  3 - firstInstance;\n"
"  4 - unused;\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [RenderingDevice] [RID] handle ຂອງ [MultiMesh] command buffer. [RID] "
"ນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [code]use_indirect[/code] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ໃນຕອນທີ່ຈັດສັນຂໍ້ມູນຜ່ານ [method multimesh_allocate_data]. ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງຈຳນວນ "
"instance ຜ່ານ buffer ໂດຍກົງ.\n"
"ໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບທັງຈຳນວນ surfaces ທີ່ mesh ມີ ແລະ ຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າມັນເປັນແບບ indexed ຫຼື ບໍ່, "
"buffer ຈະມີ 5 ຈຳນວນເຕັມ (integers), ໂດຍທີ່ຕົວສຸດທ້າຍຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຖ້າ mesh ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບ indexed.\n"
"ແຕ່ລະຄ່າໃນ buffer ຈະກົງກັບຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"ແບບ Indexed:\n"
"  0 - indexCount;\n"
"  1 - instanceCount;\n"
"  2 - firstIndex;\n"
"  3 - vertexOffset;\n"
"  4 - firstInstance;\n"
"ແບບ Non-indexed:\n"
"  0 - vertexCount;\n"
"  1 - instanceCount;\n"
"  2 - firstVertex;\n"
"  3 - firstInstance;\n"
"  4 - ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້;\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Returns the custom AABB defined for this MultiMesh resource."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ custom AABB ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສຳລັບ MultiMesh resource ນີ້."

msgid "Returns the number of instances allocated for this multimesh."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນ instances ທີ່ຖືກຈັດສັນໄວ້ສຳລັບ multimesh ນີ້."

msgid "Returns the RID of the mesh that will be used in drawing this multimesh."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ RID ຂອງ mesh ທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ້ມ multimesh ນີ້."

msgid "Returns the number of visible instances for this multimesh."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນ instances ທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ສຳລັບ multimesh ນີ້."

msgid "Returns the color by which the specified instance will be modulated."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສີທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການປັບ (modulate) instance ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Returns the custom data associated with the specified instance."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງ (custom data) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ instance ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Returns the [Transform3D] of the specified instance."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Transform3D] ຂອງ instance ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Transform2D] of the specified instance. For use when the "
"multimesh is set to use 2D transforms."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Transform2D] ຂອງ instance ທີ່ລະບຸ. ໃຊ້ໃນຕອນທີ່ multimesh ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ 2D "
"transforms."

msgid ""
"Prevents physics interpolation for the specified instance during the current "
"physics tick.\n"
"This is useful when moving an instance to a new location, to give an "
"instantaneous change rather than interpolation from the previous location."
msgstr ""
"ຢຸດການເຮັດ physics interpolation ສຳລັບ instance ທີ່ລະບຸໃນລະຫວ່າງ physics tick "
"ປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນຕອນທີ່ຍ້າຍ instance ໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງໃໝ່ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນປ່ຽນທັນທີ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນການຄ່ອຍໆປ່ຽນ "
"(interpolation) ຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງເກົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Sets the color by which this instance will be modulated. Equivalent to "
"[method MultiMesh.set_instance_color]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ປັບ (modulate) instance ນີ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [method "
"MultiMesh.set_instance_color]."

msgid ""
"Sets the custom data for this instance. Custom data is passed as a [Color], "
"but is interpreted as a [code]vec4[/code] in the shader. Equivalent to "
"[method MultiMesh.set_instance_custom_data]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງ (custom data) ສຳລັບ instance ນີ້. ຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງຈະຖືກສົ່ງເປັນ [Color], "
"ແຕ່ຈະຖືກແປຄ່າເປັນ [code]vec4[/code] ໃນ shader. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [method "
"MultiMesh.set_instance_custom_data]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [Transform3D] for this instance. Equivalent to [method "
"MultiMesh.set_instance_transform]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Transform3D] ສຳລັບ instance ນີ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [method "
"MultiMesh.set_instance_transform]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [Transform2D] for this instance. For use when multimesh is used in "
"2D. Equivalent to [method MultiMesh.set_instance_transform_2d]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Transform2D] ສຳລັບ instance ນີ້. ໃຊ້ໃນຕອນທີ່ multimesh ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນແບບ 2D. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[method MultiMesh.set_instance_transform_2d]."

msgid ""
"Prevents physics interpolation for all instances during the current physics "
"tick.\n"
"This is useful when moving all instances to new locations, to give "
"instantaneous changes rather than interpolation from the previous locations."
msgstr ""
"ຢຸດການເຮັດ physics interpolation ສຳລັບທຸກໆ instances ໃນລະຫວ່າງ physics tick "
"ປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນຕອນທີ່ຍ້າຍທຸກໆ instances ໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງໃໝ່ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີການປ່ຽນແປງທັນທີ "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນການຄ່ອຍໆປ່ຽນຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງເກົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Set the entire data to use for drawing the [param multimesh] at once to "
"[param buffer] (such as instance transforms and colors). [param buffer]'s "
"size must match the number of instances multiplied by the per-instance data "
"size (which depends on the enabled MultiMesh fields). Otherwise, an error "
"message is printed and nothing is rendered. See also [method "
"multimesh_get_buffer].\n"
"The per-instance data size and expected data order is:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"2D:\n"
"  - Position: 8 floats (8 floats for Transform2D)\n"
"  - Position + Vertex color: 12 floats (8 floats for Transform2D, 4 floats "
"for Color)\n"
"  - Position + Custom data: 12 floats (8 floats for Transform2D, 4 floats of "
"custom data)\n"
"  - Position + Vertex color + Custom data: 16 floats (8 floats for "
"Transform2D, 4 floats for Color, 4 floats of custom data)\n"
"3D:\n"
"  - Position: 12 floats (12 floats for Transform3D)\n"
"  - Position + Vertex color: 16 floats (12 floats for Transform3D, 4 floats "
"for Color)\n"
"  - Position + Custom data: 16 floats (12 floats for Transform3D, 4 floats of "
"custom data)\n"
"  - Position + Vertex color + Custom data: 20 floats (12 floats for "
"Transform3D, 4 floats for Color, 4 floats of custom data)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Instance transforms are in row-major order. Specifically:\n"
"- For [Transform2D] the float-order is: [code](x.x, y.x, padding_float, "
"origin.x, x.y, y.y, padding_float, origin.y)[/code].\n"
"- For [Transform3D] the float-order is: [code](basis.x.x, basis.y.x, "
"basis.z.x, origin.x, basis.x.y, basis.y.y, basis.z.y, origin.y, basis.x.z, "
"basis.y.z, basis.z.z, origin.z)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ້ມ [param multimesh] ພ້ອມກັນໃນ [param buffer] (ເຊັ່ນ "
"instance transforms ແລະ ສີ). ຂະໜາດຂອງ [param buffer] ຕ້ອງກົງກັບຈຳນວນ instance "
"ຄູນດ້ວຍຂະໜາດຂໍ້ມູນຕໍ່ instance (ເຊິ່ງຂຶ້ນກັບ field ຂອງ MultiMesh ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້). ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຈະມີຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດແຈ້ງເຕືອນ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງຖືກເຣນເດີ. ເບິ່ງ [method multimesh_get_buffer] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"ຂະໜາດຂໍ້ມູນຕໍ່ instance ແລະ ລຳດັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ແມ່ນ:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"2D:\n"
"  - Position: 8 floats (8 floats ສຳລັບ Transform2D)\n"
"  - Position + Vertex color: 12 floats (8 floats ສຳລັບ Transform2D, 4 floats "
"ສຳລັບ Color)\n"
"  - Position + Custom data: 12 floats (8 floats ສຳລັບ Transform2D, 4 floats "
"ສຳລັບ custom data)\n"
"  - Position + Vertex color + Custom data: 16 floats (8 floats ສຳລັບ "
"Transform2D, 4 floats ສຳລັບ Color, 4 floats ສຳລັບ custom data)\n"
"3D:\n"
"  - Position: 12 floats (12 floats ສຳລັບ Transform3D)\n"
"  - Position + Vertex color: 16 floats (12 floats ສຳລັບ Transform3D, 4 floats "
"ສຳລັບ Color)\n"
"  - Position + Custom data: 16 floats (12 floats ສຳລັບ Transform3D, 4 floats "
"ສຳລັບ custom data)\n"
"  - Position + Vertex color + Custom data: 20 floats (12 floats ສຳລັບ "
"Transform3D, 4 floats ສຳລັບ Color, 4 floats ສຳລັບ custom data)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Instance transforms ຈະຢູ່ໃນລຳດັບແບບ row-major. ໂດຍສະເພາະແມ່ນ:\n"
"- ສຳລັບ [Transform2D] ລຳດັບ float ແມ່ນ: [code](x.x, y.x, padding_float, "
"origin.x, x.y, y.y, padding_float, origin.y)[/code].\n"
"- ສຳລັບ [Transform3D] ລຳດັບ float ແມ່ນ: [code](basis.x.x, basis.y.x, basis.z.x, "
"origin.x, basis.x.y, basis.y.y, basis.z.y, origin.y, basis.x.z, basis.y.z, "
"basis.z.z, origin.z)[/code]."

msgid ""
"Alternative version of [method multimesh_set_buffer] for use with physics "
"interpolation.\n"
"Takes both an array of current data and an array of data for the previous "
"physics tick."
msgstr ""
"ເວີຊັນທາງເລືອກຂອງ [method multimesh_set_buffer] ສຳລັບໃຊ້ກັບ physics interpolation.\n"
"ຮັບທັງ array ຂອງຂໍ້ມູນປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ array ຂອງຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ physics tick ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

msgid "Sets the custom AABB for this MultiMesh resource."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ custom AABB ສຳລັບ MultiMesh resource ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the mesh to be drawn by the multimesh. Equivalent to [member "
"MultiMesh.mesh]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ mesh ທີ່ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໂດຍ multimesh. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member MultiMesh.mesh]."

msgid "Turns on and off physics interpolation for this MultiMesh resource."
msgstr "ເປີດ ແລະ ປິດ physics interpolation ສຳລັບ MultiMesh resource ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the physics interpolation quality for the [MultiMesh].\n"
"A value of [constant MULTIMESH_INTERP_QUALITY_FAST] gives fast but low "
"quality interpolation, a value of [constant MULTIMESH_INTERP_QUALITY_HIGH] "
"gives slower but higher quality interpolation."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນນະພາບຂອງ physics interpolation ສຳລັບ [MultiMesh].\n"
"ຄ່າ [constant MULTIMESH_INTERP_QUALITY_FAST] ຈະໃຫ້ການ interpolation "
"ທີ່ໄວແຕ່ຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳ, ຄ່າ [constant MULTIMESH_INTERP_QUALITY_HIGH] ຈະໃຫ້ການ "
"interpolation ທີ່ຊ້າກວ່າແຕ່ຄຸນນະພາບສູງກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Sets the number of instances visible at a given time. If -1, all instances "
"that have been allocated are drawn. Equivalent to [member "
"MultiMesh.visible_instance_count]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນ instances ທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ໃນເວລາໃດໜຶ່ງ. ຖ້າເປັນ -1, ທຸກໆ instances "
"ທີ່ຖືກຈັດສັນໄວ້ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມທັງໝົດ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member MultiMesh.visible_instance_count]."

msgid ""
"Creates an occluder instance and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all "
"[code]occluder_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent resource is [Occluder3D] (not to be confused with "
"the [OccluderInstance3D] node)."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ occluder instance ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]occluder_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] resource ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [Occluder3D] (ຢ່າສັບສົນກັບ "
"[OccluderInstance3D] node)."

msgid ""
"Sets the mesh data for the given occluder RID, which controls the shape of "
"the occlusion culling that will be performed."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນ mesh ສຳລັບ occluder RID ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ, ເຊິ່ງຄວບຄຸມຮູບຮ່າງຂອງການເຮັດ occlusion "
"culling ທີ່ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new omni light and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID can be used in most "
"[code]light_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"To place in a scene, attach this omni light to an instance using [method "
"instance_set_base] using the returned RID.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent node is [OmniLight3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ omni light ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. RID ນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນຟັງຊັນ [code]light_*[/code] ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"ເພື່ອວາງໃນ scene, ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ omni light ນີ້ເຂົ້າກັບ instance ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"instance_set_base] ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄືນມາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] node ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [OmniLight3D]."

msgid ""
"Creates a new 3D GPU particle collision or attractor and adds it to the "
"RenderingServer. It can be accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID "
"can be used in most [code]particles_collision_*[/code] RenderingServer "
"functions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent nodes are [GPUParticlesCollision3D] and "
"[GPUParticlesAttractor3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ 3D GPU particle collision ຫຼື attractor ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. "
"ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. RID ນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນຟັງຊັນ "
"[code]particles_collision_*[/code] ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] node ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [GPUParticlesCollision3D] ແລະ "
"[GPUParticlesAttractor3D]."

msgid ""
"Requests an update for the 3D GPU particle collision heightfield. This may be "
"automatically called by the 3D GPU particle collision heightfield depending "
"on its [member GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.update_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຮ້ອງຂໍການອັບເດດສຳລັບ 3D GPU particle collision heightfield. "
"ນີ້ອາດຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍ 3D GPU particle collision heightfield ຂຶ້ນກັບ "
"[member GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.update_mode] ຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the attenuation [param curve] for the 3D GPU particles attractor "
"specified by the [param particles_collision] RID. Only used for attractors, "
"not colliders. Equivalent to [member GPUParticlesAttractor3D.attenuation]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ attenuation [param curve] ສຳລັບ 3D GPU particles attractor ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param "
"particles_collision] RID. ໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບ attractor ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນ collider. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member GPUParticlesAttractor3D.attenuation]."

msgid ""
"Sets the directionality [param amount] for the 3D GPU particles attractor "
"specified by the [param particles_collision] RID. Only used for attractors, "
"not colliders. Equivalent to [member GPUParticlesAttractor3D.directionality]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param amount] ຄວາມເປັນທິດທາງສຳລັບ 3D GPU particles attractor ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ "
"[param particles_collision] RID. ໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບ attractor ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນ collider. "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member GPUParticlesAttractor3D.directionality]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param strength] for the 3D GPU particles attractor specified by the "
"[param particles_collision] RID. Only used for attractors, not colliders. "
"Equivalent to [member GPUParticlesAttractor3D.strength]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param strength] (ຄວາມແຮງ) ສຳລັບ 3D GPU particles attractor ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ "
"[param particles_collision] RID. ໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບ attractor ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນ collider. "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member GPUParticlesAttractor3D.strength]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param extents] for the 3D GPU particles collision by the [param "
"particles_collision] RID. Equivalent to [member "
"GPUParticlesCollisionBox3D.size], [member GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.size], "
"[member GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.size], [member "
"GPUParticlesAttractorBox3D.size] or [member "
"GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D.size] depending on the [param "
"particles_collision] type."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param extents] ສຳລັບ 3D GPU particles collision ໂດຍ [param "
"particles_collision] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member GPUParticlesCollisionBox3D.size], "
"[member GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.size], [member "
"GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.size], [member "
"GPUParticlesAttractorBox3D.size] ຫຼື [member "
"GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D.size] ຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງ [param "
"particles_collision]."

msgid ""
"Sets the collision or attractor shape [param type] for the 3D GPU particles "
"collision or attractor specified by the [param particles_collision] RID."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param type] ຮູບຮ່າງຂອງ collision ຫຼື attractor ສຳລັບ 3D GPU particles "
"collision ຫຼື attractor ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param particles_collision] RID."

msgid ""
"Sets the cull [param mask] for the 3D GPU particles collision or attractor "
"specified by the [param particles_collision] RID. Equivalent to [member "
"GPUParticlesCollision3D.cull_mask] or [member "
"GPUParticlesAttractor3D.cull_mask] depending on the [param "
"particles_collision] type."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ cull [param mask] ສຳລັບ 3D GPU particles collision ຫຼື attractor ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ "
"[param particles_collision] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticlesCollision3D.cull_mask] ຫຼື [member "
"GPUParticlesAttractor3D.cull_mask] ຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງ [param particles_collision]."

msgid ""
"Sets the signed distance field [param texture] for the 3D GPU particles "
"collision specified by the [param particles_collision] RID. Equivalent to "
"[member GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.texture] or [member "
"GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D.texture] depending on the [param "
"particles_collision] type."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ signed distance field [param texture] ສຳລັບ 3D GPU particles collision "
"ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param particles_collision] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.texture] ຫຼື [member "
"GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D.texture] ຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງ [param "
"particles_collision]."

msgid ""
"Sets the heightfield [param mask] for the 3D GPU particles heightfield "
"collision specified by the [param particles_collision] RID. Equivalent to "
"[member GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.heightfield_mask]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ heightfield [param mask] ສຳລັບ 3D GPU particles heightfield collision "
"ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param particles_collision] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.heightfield_mask]."

msgid ""
"Sets the heightmap [param resolution] for the 3D GPU particles heightfield "
"collision specified by the [param particles_collision] RID. Equivalent to "
"[member GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.resolution]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ heightmap [param resolution] (ຄວາມລະອຽດ) ສຳລັບ 3D GPU particles "
"heightfield collision ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param particles_collision] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.resolution]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param radius] for the 3D GPU particles sphere collision or "
"attractor specified by the [param particles_collision] RID. Equivalent to "
"[member GPUParticlesCollisionSphere3D.radius] or [member "
"GPUParticlesAttractorSphere3D.radius] depending on the [param "
"particles_collision] type."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param radius] (ລັດສະໝີ) ສຳລັບ 3D GPU particles sphere collision ຫຼື "
"attractor ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param particles_collision] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticlesCollisionSphere3D.radius] ຫຼື [member "
"GPUParticlesAttractorSphere3D.radius] ຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງ [param "
"particles_collision]."

msgid ""
"Creates a GPU-based particle system and adds it to the RenderingServer. It "
"can be accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all "
"[code]particles_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"To place in a scene, attach these particles to an instance using [method "
"instance_set_base] using the returned RID.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent nodes are [GPUParticles2D] and [GPUParticles3D].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] All [code]particles_*[/code] methods only apply to GPU-based "
"particles, not CPU-based particles. [CPUParticles2D] and [CPUParticles3D] do "
"not have equivalent RenderingServer functions available, as these use "
"[MultiMeshInstance2D] and [MultiMeshInstance3D] under the hood (see "
"[code]multimesh_*[/code] methods)."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງລະບົບ particle ແບບ GPU-based ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. "
"ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]particles_*[/code] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"ເພື່ອວາງໃນ scene, ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ particles ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຂົ້າກັບ instance ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"instance_set_base] ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄືນມາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] node ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [GPUParticles2D] ແລະ [GPUParticles3D].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທຸກໆເມທອດ [code]particles_*[/code] ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບ GPU-based particles "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນ CPU-based particles. [CPUParticles2D] ແລະ [CPUParticles3D] ບໍ່ມີຟັງຊັນ "
"RenderingServer ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າ, ເນື່ອງຈາກພວກມັນໃຊ້ [MultiMeshInstance2D] ແລະ "
"[MultiMeshInstance3D] ໃນເບື້ອງຫຼັງ (ເບິ່ງເມທອດ [code]multimesh_*[/code])."

msgid "Manually emits particles from the [param particles] instance."
msgstr "ປ່ອຍ particles ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ (manual emit) ຈາກ instance [param particles]."

msgid ""
"Calculates and returns the axis-aligned bounding box that contains all the "
"particles. Equivalent to [method GPUParticles3D.capture_aabb]."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳນວນ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ axis-aligned bounding box ທີ່ບັນຈຸທຸກໆ particles. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [method "
"GPUParticles3D.capture_aabb]."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if particles are currently set to emitting."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ particles ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ປ່ອຍ (emitting) ໃນຂະນະນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if particles are not emitting and particles are set "
"to inactive."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ particles ບໍ່ໄດ້ປ່ອຍ ແລະ ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກ (inactive)."

msgid ""
"Add particle system to list of particle systems that need to be updated. "
"Update will take place on the next frame, or on the next call to [method "
"instances_cull_aabb], [method instances_cull_convex], or [method "
"instances_cull_ray]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລະບົບ particle ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການລະບົບ particle ທີ່ຕ້ອງໄດ້ອັບເດດ. ການອັບເດດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນ "
"frame ຖັດໄປ, ຫຼື ເມື່ອມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method instances_cull_aabb], [method "
"instances_cull_convex], ຫຼື [method instances_cull_ray] ຄັ້ງຖັດໄປ."

msgid ""
"Requests the particles to process for extra process time during a single "
"frame.\n"
"[param process_time] defines the time that the particles will process while "
"emitting is on. [param process_time_residual] defines the time that particles "
"will process with emitting turned off for the simulation. When combined with "
"the particles' speed scale set to [code]0.0[/code], this is useful to be able "
"to seek a particle system timeline."
msgstr ""
"ຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ particles ປະມວນຜົນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນລະຫວ່າງ frame ດຽວ.\n"
"[param process_time] ກຳນົດເວລາທີ່ particles ຈະປະມວນຜົນໃນຂະນະທີ່ເປີດການປ່ອຍຢູ່. [param "
"process_time_residual] ກຳນົດເວລາທີ່ particles "
"ຈະປະມວນຜົນໃນຂະນະທີ່ປິດການປ່ອຍສຳລັບການຈຳລອງ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ speed scale ຂອງ "
"particles ເປັນ [code]0.0[/code], ນີ້ຈະມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການເລື່ອນເບິ່ງ (seek) timeline "
"ຂອງລະບົບ particle."

msgid ""
"Reset the particles on the next update. Equivalent to [method "
"GPUParticles3D.restart]."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມລະບົບ particles ໃໝ່ (reset) ໃນການອັບເດດຄັ້ງຖັດໄປ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [method "
"GPUParticles3D.restart]."

msgid ""
"Sets the number of particles to be drawn and allocates the memory for them. "
"Equivalent to [member GPUParticles3D.amount]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນ particles ທີ່ຈະແຕ້ມ ແລະ ຈັດສັນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສຳລັບພວກມັນ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.amount]."

msgid ""
"Sets the amount ratio for particles to be emitted. Equivalent to [member "
"GPUParticles3D.amount_ratio]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າອັດຕາສ່ວນຈຳນວນ particles ທີ່ຈະປ່ອຍອອກມາ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.amount_ratio]."

msgid ""
"Sets the base size for particle collision. Equivalent to [member "
"GPUParticles3D.collision_base_size]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບ particle collision. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.collision_base_size]."

msgid ""
"Sets a custom axis-aligned bounding box for the particle system. Equivalent "
"to [member GPUParticles3D.visibility_aabb]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ custom axis-aligned bounding box ສຳລັບລະບົບ particle. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.visibility_aabb]."

msgid ""
"Sets the draw order of the particles. Equivalent to [member "
"GPUParticles3D.draw_order]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລຳດັບການແຕ້ມ (draw order) ຂອງ particles. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.draw_order]."

msgid ""
"Sets the mesh to be used for the specified draw pass. Equivalent to [member "
"GPUParticles3D.draw_pass_1], [member GPUParticles3D.draw_pass_2], [member "
"GPUParticles3D.draw_pass_3], and [member GPUParticles3D.draw_pass_4]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ mesh ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ draw pass ທີ່ລະບຸ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.draw_pass_1], [member GPUParticles3D.draw_pass_2], [member "
"GPUParticles3D.draw_pass_3], ແລະ [member GPUParticles3D.draw_pass_4]."

msgid ""
"Sets the number of draw passes to use. Equivalent to [member "
"GPUParticles3D.draw_passes]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນ draw passes ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member GPUParticles3D.draw_passes]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [Transform3D] that will be used by the particles when they first "
"emit."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Transform3D] ທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ particles ໃນຕອນທີ່ພວກມັນເລີ່ມປ່ອຍອອກມາຄັ້ງທຳອິດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the velocity of a particle node, that will be used by [member "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.inherit_velocity_ratio]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມໄວຂອງ particle node, ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ [member "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.inherit_velocity_ratio]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles will emit over time. Setting to [code]false[/"
"code] does not reset the particles, but only stops their emission. Equivalent "
"to [member GPUParticles3D.emitting]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], particles ຈະປ່ອຍອອກມາຕາມເວລາ. ການຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/"
"code] ຈະບໍ່ແມ່ນການ reset particles, ແຕ່ເປັນພຽງການຢຸດການປ່ອຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.emitting]."

msgid ""
"Sets the explosiveness ratio. Equivalent to [member "
"GPUParticles3D.explosiveness]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າອັດຕາສ່ວນຄວາມຮຸນແຮງໃນການລະເບີດ (explosiveness). ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.explosiveness]."

msgid ""
"Sets the frame rate that the particle system rendering will be fixed to. "
"Equivalent to [member GPUParticles3D.fixed_fps]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ frame rate ທີ່ການເຣນເດີລະບົບ particle ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ຄົງທີ່. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.fixed_fps]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses fractional delta which smooths the movement of the "
"particles. Equivalent to [member GPUParticles3D.fract_delta]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ fractional delta ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງ particles "
"ມີຄວາມສະມູດ (smooth). ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member GPUParticles3D.fract_delta]."

msgid ""
"Sets the value that informs a [ParticleProcessMaterial] to rush all particles "
"towards the end of their lifetime."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອແຈ້ງໃຫ້ [ParticleProcessMaterial] ເລັ່ງໃຫ້ທຸກໆ particles "
"ເຂົ້າສູ່ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງອາຍຸຂັຍຂອງພວກມັນ."

msgid ""
"Sets whether particles should use interpolation between fixed steps. "
"Equivalent to [member GPUParticles3D.interpolate]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າ particles ຄວນໃຊ້ interpolation ລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນຄົງທີ່ (fixed steps) ຫຼື ບໍ່. "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member GPUParticles3D.interpolate]."

msgid ""
"Sets the lifetime of each particle in the system. Equivalent to [member "
"GPUParticles3D.lifetime]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າອາຍຸຂັຍ (lifetime) ຂອງແຕ່ລະ particle ໃນລະບົບ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.lifetime]."

msgid ""
"Sets whether the GPU particles specified by the [param particles] RID should "
"be rendered in 2D or 3D according to [param mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າ GPU particles ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param particles] RID ຄວນຖືກເຣນເດີໃນແບບ 2D ຫຼື 3D "
"ຕາມ [param mode]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles will emit once and then stop. Equivalent to "
"[member GPUParticles3D.one_shot]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], particles ຈະປ່ອຍອອກມາພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວແລ້ວຢຸດ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.one_shot]."

msgid ""
"Sets the preprocess time for the particles' animation. This lets you delay "
"starting an animation until after the particles have begun emitting. "
"Equivalent to [member GPUParticles3D.preprocess]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາປະມວນຜົນລ່ວງໜ້າ (preprocess time) ສຳລັບ animation ຂອງ particles. "
"ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຊັກຊ້າການເລີ່ມ animation ຈົນກວ່າ particles ຈະເລີ່ມປ່ອຍອອກມາ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member GPUParticles3D.preprocess]."

msgid ""
"Sets the material for processing the particles.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is not the material used to draw the materials. Equivalent "
"to [member GPUParticles3D.process_material]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ material ສຳລັບການປະມວນຜົນ particles.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນ material ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ້ມ (draw) materials. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.process_material]."

msgid ""
"Sets the emission randomness ratio. This randomizes the emission of particles "
"within their phase. Equivalent to [member GPUParticles3D.randomness]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າອັດຕາສ່ວນຄວາມສຸ່ມໃນການປ່ອຍ (randomness). ນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການປ່ອຍ particles ມີຄວາມສຸ່ມພາຍໃນ "
"phase ຂອງພວກມັນ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member GPUParticles3D.randomness]."

msgid ""
"Sets the speed scale of the particle system. Equivalent to [member "
"GPUParticles3D.speed_scale]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າອັດຕາສ່ວນຄວາມໄວ (speed scale) ຂອງລະບົບ particle. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.speed_scale]."

msgid ""
"Sets the subemitter particles for the particle system. Equivalent to [member "
"GPUParticles3D.sub_emitter]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ subemitter particles ສຳລັບລະບົບ particle. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.sub_emitter]."

msgid ""
"Sets the trail bind poses for the particle system. This specified as an array "
"of [Transform3D]s representing the bind pose for each draw pass. See [member "
"GPUParticles3D.draw_skin], [method Skin.get_bind_count], and [method "
"Skin.get_bind_pose]. Set the value for each draw pass to [constant "
"Transform3D.IDENTITY] to use the default behavior, which is what built-in "
"trails use ([RibbonTrailMesh] and [TubeTrailMesh])."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ trail bind poses ສຳລັບລະບົບ particle. ນີ້ຖືກລະບຸເປັນ array ຂອງ [Transform3D] "
"ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງ bind pose ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ draw pass. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.draw_skin], [method Skin.get_bind_count], ແລະ [method "
"Skin.get_bind_pose]. ຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ draw pass ເປັນ [constant "
"Transform3D.IDENTITY] ເພື່ອໃຊ້ພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ trail ແບບ built-in ໃຊ້ "
"([RibbonTrailMesh] ແລະ [TubeTrailMesh])."

msgid ""
"If [param enable] is [code]true[/code], enables trails for the [param "
"particles] with the specified [param length_sec] in seconds. Equivalent to "
"[member GPUParticles3D.trail_enabled] and [member "
"GPUParticles3D.trail_lifetime]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param enable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ trails ສຳລັບ [param "
"particles] ດ້ວຍ [param length_sec] ທີ່ລະບຸເປັນວິນາທີ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.trail_enabled] ແລະ [member GPUParticles3D.trail_lifetime]."

msgid ""
"Sets the transform alignment for the particle system. Equivalent to [member "
"GPUParticles3D.transform_align]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຈັດວາງການແປງ (transform alignment) ສຳລັບລະບົບ particle. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.transform_align]."

msgid "Sets which axis to use for transform alignment."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຈະໃຊ້ແກນ (axis) ໃດສຳລັບການຈັດວາງການແປງ (transform alignment)."

msgid "When using Z-Billboarding, which CUSTOM channel to read from."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Z-Billboarding, ຈະໃຫ້ອ່ານຈາກ CUSTOM channel ໃດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles use local coordinates. If [code]false[/code] "
"they use global coordinates. Equivalent to [member "
"GPUParticles3D.local_coords]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], particles ຈະໃຊ້ພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local coordinates). ຖ້າເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code], ພວກມັນຈະໃຊ້ພິກັດໂລກ (global coordinates). ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.local_coords]."

msgid ""
"Sets the filter quality for omni and spot light shadows in 3D. See also "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/positional_shadow/"
"soft_shadow_filter_quality]. This parameter is global and cannot be set on a "
"per-viewport basis."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນນະພາບການກັ່ນຕອງ (filter quality) ສຳລັບເງົາຂອງ omni ແລະ spot light ໃນ 3D. "
"ເບິ່ງ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/positional_shadow/"
"soft_shadow_filter_quality] ຕື່ມ. parameter ນີ້ເປັນຄ່າ global ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າແຍກແຕ່ລະ "
"viewport ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Creates a reflection probe and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all "
"[code]reflection_probe_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"To place in a scene, attach this reflection probe to an instance using "
"[method instance_set_base] using the returned RID.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent node is [ReflectionProbe]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ reflection probe ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]reflection_probe_*[/code] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"ເພື່ອວາງໃນ scene, ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ reflection probe ນີ້ເຂົ້າກັບ instance ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"instance_set_base] ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄືນມາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] node ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [ReflectionProbe]."

msgid ""
"Sets the reflection probe's custom ambient light color. Equivalent to [member "
"ReflectionProbe.ambient_color]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (ambient light) ແບບກຳນົດເອງຂອງ reflection probe. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member ReflectionProbe.ambient_color]."

msgid ""
"Sets the reflection probe's custom ambient light energy. Equivalent to "
"[member ReflectionProbe.ambient_color_energy]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າພະລັງງານແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (ambient light energy) ແບບກຳນົດເອງຂອງ reflection "
"probe. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member ReflectionProbe.ambient_color_energy]."

msgid ""
"Sets the reflection probe's ambient light mode. Equivalent to [member "
"ReflectionProbe.ambient_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (ambient light mode) ຂອງ reflection probe. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member ReflectionProbe.ambient_mode]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], reflections will ignore sky contribution. Equivalent to "
"[member ReflectionProbe.interior]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການສະທ້ອນຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈແສງຈາກທ້ອງຟ້າ (sky contribution). "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member ReflectionProbe.interior]."

msgid "Sets the distance in meters over which a probe blends into the scene."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະຫ່າງເປັນແມັດທີ່ probe ຈະປະສົມ (blend) ເຂົ້າກັບ scene."

msgid ""
"Sets the render cull mask for this reflection probe. Only instances with a "
"matching layer will be reflected by this probe. Equivalent to [member "
"ReflectionProbe.cull_mask]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ render cull mask ສຳລັບ reflection probe ນີ້. ເພາະ instance ທີ່ມີ layer "
"ທີ່ກົງກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກສະທ້ອນໂດຍ probe ນີ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member ReflectionProbe.cull_mask]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses box projection. This can make reflections look "
"more correct in certain situations. Equivalent to [member "
"ReflectionProbe.box_projection]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ box projection. "
"ນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການສະທ້ອນເບິ່ງຄືຈິງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນບາງສະຖານະການ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"ReflectionProbe.box_projection]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], computes shadows in the reflection probe. This makes "
"the reflection much slower to compute. Equivalent to [member "
"ReflectionProbe.enable_shadows]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີການຄຳນວນເງົາໃນ reflection probe. "
"ນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການສະທ້ອນໃຊ້ເວລາຄຳນວນຊ້າລົງຫຼາຍ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"ReflectionProbe.enable_shadows]."

msgid ""
"Sets the intensity of the reflection probe. Intensity modulates the strength "
"of the reflection. Equivalent to [member ReflectionProbe.intensity]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມເຂັ້ມ (intensity) ຂອງ reflection probe. ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຈະປັບຄວາມແຮງຂອງການສະທ້ອນ. "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member ReflectionProbe.intensity]."

msgid ""
"Sets the max distance away from the probe an object can be before it is "
"culled. Equivalent to [member ReflectionProbe.max_distance]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະຫ່າງສູງສຸດຈາກ probe ທີ່ວັດຖຸສາມາດຢູ່ໄດ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືກຄັດອອກ (culled). ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"ReflectionProbe.max_distance]."

msgid ""
"Sets the mesh level of detail to use in the reflection probe rendering. "
"Higher values will use less detailed versions of meshes that have LOD "
"variations generated, which can improve performance. Equivalent to [member "
"ReflectionProbe.mesh_lod_threshold]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດ (level of detail - LOD) ຂອງ mesh ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການເຣນເດີ reflection "
"probe. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະໃຊ້ mesh ເວີຊັນທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດໜ້ອຍກວ່າ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member ReflectionProbe.mesh_lod_threshold]."

msgid ""
"Sets the origin offset to be used when this reflection probe is in box "
"project mode. Equivalent to [member ReflectionProbe.origin_offset]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ origin offset ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອ reflection probe ນີ້ຢູ່ໃນໂໝດ box project. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member ReflectionProbe.origin_offset]."

msgid ""
"Sets the render reflection mask for this reflection probe. Only instances "
"with a matching layer will have reflections applied from this probe. "
"Equivalent to [member ReflectionProbe.reflection_mask]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ render reflection mask ສຳລັບ reflection probe ນີ້. ເພາະ instance ທີ່ມີ layer "
"ທີ່ກົງກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບການສະທ້ອນຈາກ probe ນີ້. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"ReflectionProbe.reflection_mask]."

msgid "This method has not done anything since Godot 3."
msgstr "ເມທອດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກຫຍັງເລີຍຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 3 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ."

msgid "Deprecated. This method does nothing."
msgstr "ເລີກໃຊ້ແລ້ວ (Deprecated). ເມທອດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກຫຍັງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the size of the area that the reflection probe will capture. Equivalent "
"to [member ReflectionProbe.size]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ reflection probe ຈະຈັບພາບ (capture). ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"ReflectionProbe.size]."

msgid ""
"Sets how often the reflection probe updates. Can either be once or every "
"frame."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມຖີ່ໃນການອັບເດດຂອງ reflection probe. ສາມາດເປັນແບບເທື່ອດຽວ ຫຼື ທຸກໆ frame ກໍໄດ້."

msgid "Schedules a callback to the given callable after a frame has been drawn."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຕາຕະລາງ callback ໄປຍັງ callable ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ frame ຖືກແຕ້ມສຳເລັດ."

msgid ""
"Creates a scenario and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be accessed "
"with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all [code]scenario_*[/"
"code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"The scenario is the 3D world that all the visual instances exist in."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ scenario ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. "
"RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]scenario_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"scenario ແມ່ນໂລກ 3D ທີ່ທຸກໆ visual instances ອາໄສຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Sets the camera attributes ([param effects]) that will be used with this "
"scenario. See also [CameraAttributes]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ camera attributes ([param effects]) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບ scenario ນີ້. ເບິ່ງ "
"[CameraAttributes] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the compositor ([param compositor]) that will be used with this "
"scenario. See also [Compositor]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ compositor ([param compositor]) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບ scenario ນີ້. ເບິ່ງ [Compositor] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the environment that will be used with this scenario. See also "
"[Environment]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environment) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບ scenario ນີ້. ເບິ່ງ [Environment] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the fallback environment to be used by this scenario. The fallback "
"environment is used if no environment is set. Internally, this is used by the "
"editor to provide a default environment."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ fallback environment ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໂດຍ scenario ນີ້. fallback environment "
"ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ environment ໃດໆ. ພາຍໃນ, ສ່ວນນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ editor "
"ເພື່ອສະໜອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the screen-space roughness limiter parameters, such as whether it should "
"be enabled and its thresholds. Equivalent to [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/screen_space_roughness_limiter/"
"enabled], [member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/"
"screen_space_roughness_limiter/amount] and [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"anti_aliasing/screen_space_roughness_limiter/limit]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ parameter ຂອງ screen-space roughness limiter, ເຊັ່ນວ່າຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ຫຼືບໍ່ ແລະ "
"ຄ່າຂີດຈຳກັດ (thresholds) ຂອງມັນ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"anti_aliasing/screen_space_roughness_limiter/enabled], [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/screen_space_roughness_limiter/"
"amount] ແລະ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/"
"screen_space_roughness_limiter/limit]."

msgid "Use [method set_boot_image_with_stretch] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method set_boot_image_with_stretch] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Sets a boot image. The [param color] defines the background color. The value "
"of [param scale] indicates if the image will be scaled to fit the screen "
"size. If [param use_filter] is [code]true[/code], the image will be scaled "
"with linear interpolation. If [param use_filter] is [code]false[/code], the "
"image will be scaled with nearest-neighbor interpolation."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບພາບຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (boot image). [param color] ກຳນົດສີພື້ນຫຼັງ. ຄ່າ [param scale] "
"ບອກວ່າຮູບຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບໜ້າຈໍຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າ [param use_filter] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຮູບຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍດ້ວຍ linear interpolation. ຖ້າ [param use_filter] ເປັນ [code]false[/"
"code], ຮູບຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍດ້ວຍ nearest-neighbor interpolation."

msgid ""
"Sets a boot image. The [param color] defines the background color. The value "
"of [param stretch_mode] indicates how the image will be stretched (see [enum "
"SplashStretchMode] for possible values). If [param use_filter] is [code]true[/"
"code], the image will be scaled with linear interpolation. If [param "
"use_filter] is [code]false[/code], the image will be scaled with nearest-"
"neighbor interpolation."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບພາບຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (boot image). [param color] ກຳນົດສີພື້ນຫຼັງ. ຄ່າ [param "
"stretch_mode] ບອກວ່າຮູບຈະຖືກຢືດໃນຮູບແບບໃດ (ເບິ່ງ [enum SplashStretchMode] "
"ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້). ຖ້າ [param use_filter] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຮູບຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍດ້ວຍ "
"linear interpolation. ຖ້າ [param use_filter] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ຮູບຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍດ້ວຍ nearest-neighbor interpolation."

msgid ""
"If [param generate] is [code]true[/code], generates debug wireframes for all "
"meshes that are loaded when using the Compatibility renderer. By default, the "
"engine does not generate debug wireframes at runtime, since they slow down "
"loading of assets and take up VRAM.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You must call this method before loading any meshes when using "
"the Compatibility renderer. Otherwise, wireframes will not be used."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param generate] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງ debug wireframes ສຳລັບທຸກໆ "
"meshes ທີ່ຖືກໂຫຼດເມື່ອໃຊ້ Compatibility renderer. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, engine ຈະບໍ່ສ້າງ debug "
"wireframes ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທຳງານ (runtime) ເພາະມັນເຮັດໃຫ້ການໂຫຼດ asset ຊ້າລົງ ແລະ ເປືອງ "
"VRAM.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທ່ານຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໂຫຼດ meshes ໃດໆ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Compatibility "
"renderer. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, wireframes ຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the default clear color which is used when a specific clear color has "
"not been selected. See also [method get_default_clear_color]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີລ້າງໜ້າຈໍ (clear color) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ເລືອກສີລ້າງໜ້າຈໍສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method get_default_clear_color] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Creates an empty shader and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all "
"[code]shader_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent resource is [Shader]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ shader ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]shader_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] resource ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [Shader]."

msgid "Returns a shader's source code as a string."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ source code ຂອງ shader ເປັນ string."

msgid ""
"Returns a default texture from a shader searched by name.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the sampler array is used use [param index] to access the "
"specified texture."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ texture ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ shader ໂດຍການຄົ້ນຫາດ້ວຍຊື່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າໃຊ້ sampler array ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [param index] ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ texture ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the default value for the specified shader uniform. This is usually "
"the value written in the shader source code."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ shader uniform ທີ່ລະບຸ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ຂຽນໄວ້ໃນ source code ຂອງ "
"shader."

msgid ""
"Sets the shader's source code (which triggers recompilation after being "
"changed)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ source code ຂອງ shader (ເຊິ່ງຈະກະຕຸ້ນການ recompilation ຫຼັງຈາກມີການປ່ຽນແປງ)."

msgid ""
"Sets a shader's default texture. Overwrites the texture given by name.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the sampler array is used use [param index] to access the "
"specified texture."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ texture ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ shader. ຈະຂຽນທັບ texture ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາດ້ວຍຊື່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າໃຊ້ sampler array ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [param index] ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ texture ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Sets the path hint for the specified shader. This should generally match the "
"[Shader] resource's [member Resource.resource_path]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ path hint ສຳລັບ shader ທີ່ລະບຸ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຄວນຈະກົງກັບ [member "
"Resource.resource_path] ຂອງ resource [Shader]."

msgid ""
"Allocates data for this skeleton using the number of bones specified in "
"[param bones]. If [param is_2d_skeleton] is [code]true[/code], the skeleton "
"will be treated as a 2D skeleton instead of a 3D skeleton. See also [method "
"skeleton_get_bone_count]."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດສັນຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ skeleton ນີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຈຳນວນກະດູກທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [param bones]. ຖ້າ [param "
"is_2d_skeleton] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], skeleton ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດຄືກັບເປັນ 2D skeleton "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ 3D skeleton. ເບິ່ງ [method skeleton_get_bone_count] ຕື່ມ."

msgid "Returns the [Transform3D] set for a specific bone of this skeleton."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Transform3D] ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ສຳລັບກະດູກສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງ skeleton ນີ້."

msgid "Returns the [Transform2D] set for a specific bone of this skeleton."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Transform2D] ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ສຳລັບກະດູກສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງ skeleton ນີ້."

msgid "Sets the [Transform3D] for a specific bone of this skeleton."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Transform3D] ສຳລັບກະດູກສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງ skeleton ນີ້."

msgid "Sets the [Transform2D] for a specific bone of this skeleton."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Transform2D] ສຳລັບກະດູກສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງ skeleton ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Creates a skeleton and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be accessed "
"with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all [code]skeleton_*[/"
"code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ skeleton ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. "
"RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]skeleton_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of bones allocated for this skeleton. See also [method "
"skeleton_allocate_data]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນກະດູກທີ່ຖືກຈັດສັນໄວ້ສຳລັບ skeleton ນີ້. ເບິ່ງ [method skeleton_allocate_data] ຕື່ມ."

msgid "Sets the base [Transform2D] to use for the specified skeleton."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Transform2D] ພື້ນຖານທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ skeleton ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Generates and returns an [Image] containing the radiance map for the "
"specified [param sky] RID. This supports built-in sky material and custom sky "
"shaders. If [param bake_irradiance] is [code]true[/code], the irradiance map "
"is saved instead of the radiance map. The radiance map is used to render "
"reflected light, while the irradiance map is used to render ambient light. "
"See also [method environment_bake_panorama].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The image is saved using linear encoding without any tonemapping "
"performed, which means it will look too dark if viewed directly in an image "
"editor. [param energy] values above [code]1.0[/code] can be used to brighten "
"the resulting image.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param size] should be a 2:1 aspect ratio for the generated "
"panorama to have square pixels. For radiance maps, there is no point in using "
"a height greater than [member Sky.radiance_size], as it won't increase "
"detail. Irradiance maps only contain low-frequency data, so there is usually "
"no point in going past a size of 128×64 pixels when saving an irradiance map."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [Image] ທີ່ມີ radiance map ສຳລັບ [param sky] RID ທີ່ລະບຸ. ນີ້ຮອງຮັບທັງ sky "
"material ແບບ built-in ແລະ custom sky shaders. ຖ້າ [param bake_irradiance] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code], irradiance map ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກແທນ radiance map. radiance map "
"ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຣນເດີແສງສະທ້ອນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ irradiance map ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຣນເດີແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ "
"(ambient light). ເບິ່ງ [method environment_bake_panorama] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮູບພາບຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໂດຍໃຊ້ linear encoding ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການເຮັດ tonemapping "
"ໃດໆ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນຈະເບິ່ງຄືມືດເກີນໄປຖ້າເບິ່ງໃນ image editor ໂດຍກົງ. ຄ່າ [param energy] "
"ທີ່ສູງກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບທີ່ໄດ້ມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param size] ຄວນເປັນອັດຕາສ່ວນ 2:1 ເພື່ອໃຫ້ panorama ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນມີ pixels "
"ເປັນຮູບຊົງຈະຕຸລັດ. ສຳລັບ radiance maps, ບໍ່ມີປະໂຫຍດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຄວາມສູງຫຼາຍກວ່າ [member "
"Sky.radiance_size] ເພາະມັນຈະບໍ່ຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມລາຍລະອຽດ. Irradiance maps ບັນຈຸແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳ "
"(low-frequency), ດັ່ງນັ້ນໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ມີປະໂຫຍດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຂະໜາດເກີນ 128×64 pixels ເມື່ອບັນທຶກ "
"irradiance map."

msgid ""
"Creates an empty sky and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be accessed "
"with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all [code]sky_*[/"
"code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ sky ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. "
"RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]sky_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer."

msgid ""
"Sets the material that the sky uses to render the background, ambient and "
"reflection maps."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ material ທີ່ sky ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຣນເດີພື້ນຫຼັງ, ແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (ambient) ແລະ "
"ແຜນຜັງການສະທ້ອນ (reflection maps)."

msgid ""
"Sets the process [param mode] of the sky specified by the [param sky] RID. "
"Equivalent to [member Sky.process_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການປະມວນຜົນ [param mode] ຂອງ sky ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param sky] RID. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"Sky.process_mode]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param radiance_size] of the sky specified by the [param sky] RID "
"(in pixels). Equivalent to [member Sky.radiance_size]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param radiance_size] ຂອງ sky ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param sky] RID (ເປັນ pixels). "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member Sky.radiance_size]."

msgid ""
"Creates a spot light and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be accessed "
"with the RID that is returned. This RID can be used in most [code]light_*[/"
"code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"To place in a scene, attach this spot light to an instance using [method "
"instance_set_base] using the returned RID."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ spot light ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. "
"RID ນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນຟັງຊັນ [code]light_*[/code] ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"ເພື່ອວາງໃນ scene, ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ spot light ນີ້ເຂົ້າກັບ instance ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"instance_set_base] ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄືນມາ."

msgid ""
"Sets [member ProjectSettings.rendering/environment/subsurface_scattering/"
"subsurface_scattering_quality] to use when rendering materials that have "
"subsurface scattering enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/environment/subsurface_scattering/"
"subsurface_scattering_quality] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນຕອນເຣນເດີ materials ທີ່ມີການເປີດໃຊ້ "
"subsurface scattering."

msgid ""
"Sets the [member ProjectSettings.rendering/environment/subsurface_scattering/"
"subsurface_scattering_scale] and [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"environment/subsurface_scattering/subsurface_scattering_depth_scale] to use "
"when rendering materials that have subsurface scattering enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/environment/subsurface_scattering/"
"subsurface_scattering_scale] ແລະ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"environment/subsurface_scattering/subsurface_scattering_depth_scale] "
"ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນຕອນເຣນເດີ materials ທີ່ມີການເປີດໃຊ້ subsurface scattering."

msgid ""
"Creates a 2-dimensional texture and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all "
"[code]texture_2d_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent resource is [Texture2D].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Not to be confused with [method RenderingDevice.texture_create], "
"which creates the graphics API's own texture type as opposed to the Godot-"
"specific [Texture2D] resource."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ texture ແບບ 2 ມິຕິ (2D) ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
"RID ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]texture_2d_*[/code] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] resource ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [Texture2D].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຢ່າສັບສົນກັບ [method RenderingDevice.texture_create], ເຊິ່ງຈະສ້າງ "
"texture ປະເພດຂອງ graphics API ໂດຍກົງ ເຊິ່ງຕ່າງຈາກ resource [Texture2D] ຂອງ Godot."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Image] instance from the given [param texture] [RID].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Get the test texture from [method get_test_texture] and apply "
"it to a [Sprite2D] node:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var texture_rid = RenderingServer.get_test_texture()\n"
"var texture = "
"ImageTexture.create_from_image(RenderingServer.texture_2d_get(texture_rid))\n"
"$Sprite2D.texture = texture\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Image] instance ຈາກ [param texture] [RID] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ດຶງ test texture ຈາກ [method get_test_texture] ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ມັນກັບ "
"[Sprite2D] node:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var texture_rid = RenderingServer.get_test_texture()\n"
"var texture = "
"ImageTexture.create_from_image(RenderingServer.texture_2d_get(texture_rid))\n"
"$Sprite2D.texture = texture\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns an [Image] instance from the given [param texture] [RID] and [param "
"layer]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Image] instance ຈາກ [param texture] [RID] ແລະ [param layer] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Creates a 2-dimensional layered texture and adds it to the RenderingServer. "
"It can be accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in "
"all [code]texture_2d_layered_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent resource is [TextureLayered]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ 2-dimensional layered texture ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. "
"ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ "
"[code]texture_2d_layered_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] resource ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [TextureLayered]."

msgid ""
"Creates a placeholder for a 2-dimensional layered texture and adds it to the "
"RenderingServer. It can be accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID "
"will be used in all [code]texture_2d_layered_*[/code] RenderingServer "
"functions, although it does nothing when used. See also [method "
"texture_2d_placeholder_create].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent resource is [PlaceholderTextureLayered]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ placeholder ສຳລັບ 2-dimensional layered texture ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ "
"RenderingServer. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ "
"[code]texture_2d_layered_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer, "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກຫຍັງເມື່ອຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕາມ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"texture_2d_placeholder_create] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] resource ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [PlaceholderTextureLayered]."

msgid ""
"Creates a placeholder for a 2-dimensional layered texture and adds it to the "
"RenderingServer. It can be accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID "
"will be used in all [code]texture_2d_layered_*[/code] RenderingServer "
"functions, although it does nothing when used. See also [method "
"texture_2d_layered_placeholder_create].\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent resource is [PlaceholderTexture2D]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ placeholder ສຳລັບ 2-dimensional layered texture ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ "
"RenderingServer. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ "
"[code]texture_2d_layered_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer, "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກຫຍັງເມື່ອຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕາມ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"texture_2d_layered_placeholder_create] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] resource ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [PlaceholderTexture2D]."

msgid ""
"Updates the texture specified by the [param texture] [RID] with the data in "
"[param image]. A [param layer] must also be specified, which should be "
"[code]0[/code] when updating a single-layer texture ([Texture2D]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param image] must have the same width, height and format as "
"the current [param texture] data. Otherwise, an error will be printed and the "
"original texture won't be modified. If you need to use different width, "
"height or format, use [method texture_replace] instead."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດ texture ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param texture] [RID] ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນໃນ [param image]. ຕ້ອງລະບຸ "
"[param layer] ນຳ, ເຊິ່ງຄວນເປັນ [code]0[/code] ເມື່ອອັບເດດ texture ແບບ layer ດຽວ "
"([Texture2D]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param image] ຕ້ອງມີຄວາມກວ້າງ, ຄວາມສູງ ແລະ ຮູບແບບ (format) "
"ດຽວກັນກັບຂໍ້ມູນ [param texture] ປັດຈຸບັນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະມີຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດແຈ້ງເຕືອນ ແລະ texture "
"ເດີມຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຄວາມກວ້າງ, ຄວາມສູງ ຫຼື ຮູບແບບທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"texture_replace] ແທນ."

msgid "[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent resource is [Texture3D]."
msgstr "[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] resource ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [Texture3D]."

msgid ""
"Returns 3D texture data as an array of [Image]s for the specified texture "
"[RID]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນ 3D texture ເປັນ array ຂອງ [Image] ສຳລັບ texture [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Creates a placeholder for a 3-dimensional texture and adds it to the "
"RenderingServer. It can be accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID "
"will be used in all [code]texture_3d_*[/code] RenderingServer functions, "
"although it does nothing when used.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent resource is [PlaceholderTexture3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ placeholder ສຳລັບ texture 3 ມິຕິ (3D) ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. "
"ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]texture_3d_*[/code] "
"ຂອງ RenderingServer, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກຫຍັງເມື່ອຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕາມ.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] resource ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [PlaceholderTexture3D]."

msgid ""
"Updates the texture specified by the [param texture] [RID]'s data with the "
"data in [param data]. All the texture's layers must be replaced at once.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param texture] must have the same width, height, depth and "
"format as the current texture data. Otherwise, an error will be printed and "
"the original texture won't be modified. If you need to use different width, "
"height, depth or format, use [method texture_replace] instead."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນ texture ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param texture] [RID] ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນໃນ [param data]. ທຸກໆ "
"layer ຂອງ texture ຕ້ອງຖືກປ່ຽນແທນພ້ອມກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param texture] ຕ້ອງມີຄວາມກວ້າງ, ຄວາມສູງ, ຄວາມເລິກ ແລະ ຮູບແບບ "
"(format) ດຽວກັນກັບຂໍ້ມູນ texture ປັດຈຸບັນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະມີຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດແຈ້ງເຕືອນ ແລະ texture "
"ເດີມຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຄວາມກວ້າງ, ຄວາມສູງ, ຄວາມເລິກ ຫຼື ຮູບແບບທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[method texture_replace] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Creates a texture based on a native handle that was created outside of "
"Godot's renderer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If using only the rendering device renderer, it's recommend to "
"use [method RenderingDevice.texture_create_from_extension] together with "
"[method RenderingServer.texture_rd_create], rather than this method. This "
"way, the texture's format and usage can be controlled more effectively."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ texture ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ native handle ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນນອກ renderer ຂອງ Godot.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ rendering device renderer, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingDevice.texture_create_from_extension] ຮ່ວມກັບ [method "
"RenderingServer.texture_rd_create] ແທນເມທອດນີ້. ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້, ຮູບແບບ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ງານຂອງ "
"texture ຈະສາມາດຄວບຄຸມໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Draws to [param rect] on up to 4 given Drawable [param textures], using a "
"TextureBlit Shader from [param material]. [param modulate] and up to 4 [param "
"source_textures] are uniforms for the Shader to process with. [param "
"to_mipmap] can specify to perform this draw to a lower mipmap level.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] All [param textures] must be the same size and format."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມໃສ່ [param rect] ໃນ Drawable [param textures] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາໄດ້ສູງສຸດ 4 ອັນ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"TextureBlit Shader ຈາກ [param material]. [param modulate] ແລະ [param "
"source_textures] ສູງສຸດ 4 ອັນແມ່ນ uniforms ສຳລັບ Shader ເພື່ອໃຊ້ປະມວນຜົນ. [param "
"to_mipmap] ສາມາດລະບຸໃຫ້ເຮັດການແຕ້ມນີ້ໃສ່ລະດັບ mipmap ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param textures] ທັງໝົດຕ້ອງມີຂະໜາດ ແລະ ຮູບແບບ (format) ດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"Creates a 2-dimensional texture and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all "
"[code]texture_drawable*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent resource is [DrawableTexture2D]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ texture 2 ມິຕິ ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]texture_drawable*[/code] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] resource ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [DrawableTexture2D]."

msgid "Calculates new MipMaps for the given Drawable [param texture]."
msgstr "ຄຳນວນ MipMaps ໃໝ່ສຳລັບ Drawable [param texture] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Returns a ShaderMaterial with the default texture_blit Shader."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ ShaderMaterial ທີ່ໃຊ້ texture_blit Shader ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Returns the format for the texture."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຮູບແບບ (format) ຂອງ texture."

msgid ""
"Returns the internal graphics handle for this texture object. For use when "
"communicating with third-party APIs mostly with GDExtension.\n"
"[param srgb] should be [code]true[/code] when the texture uses nonlinear sRGB "
"encoding and [code]false[/code] when the texture uses linear encoding.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function returns a [code]uint64_t[/code] which internally "
"maps to a [code]GLuint[/code] (OpenGL) or [code]VkImage[/code] (Vulkan)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ internal graphics handle ສຳລັບ texture object ນີ້. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕິດຕໍ່ສື່ສານກັບ third-"
"party APIs ເຊິ່ງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນໃຊ້ກັບ GDExtension.\n"
"[param srgb] ຄວນເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອ texture ໃຊ້ nonlinear sRGB encoding "
"ແລະ ເປັນ [code]false[/code] ເມື່ອ texture ໃຊ້ linear encoding.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນນີ້ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]uint64_t[/code] ເຊິ່ງພາຍໃນຈະຖືກ map ເປັນ "
"[code]GLuint[/code] (OpenGL) ຫຼື [code]VkImage[/code] (Vulkan)."

msgid ""
"Returns the resource path (starting with [code]res://[/code] or [code]uid://[/"
"code]) for the specified texture RID. Returns an empty [String] if the "
"resource is built-in. See also [method texture_set_path]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ resource path (ທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [code]res://[/code] ຫຼື [code]uid://[/code]) ສຳລັບ "
"texture RID ທີ່ລະບຸ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [String] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າຖ້າ resource ນັ້ນເປັນແບບ built-in. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method texture_set_path] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns a texture [RID] that can be used with [RenderingDevice].\n"
"[param srgb] should be [code]true[/code] when the texture uses nonlinear sRGB "
"encoding and [code]false[/code] when the texture uses linear encoding."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ texture [RID] ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບ [RenderingDevice] ໄດ້.\n"
"[param srgb] ຄວນເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອ texture ໃຊ້ nonlinear sRGB encoding "
"ແລະ ເປັນ [code]false[/code] ເມື່ອ texture ໃຊ້ linear encoding."

msgid "ProxyTexture was removed in Godot 4."
msgstr "ProxyTexture ຖືກເອົາອອກແລ້ວໃນ Godot 4."

msgid "This method does nothing and always returns an invalid [RID]."
msgstr "ເມທອດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກຫຍັງ ແລະ ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ (invalid) ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new texture object based on a texture created directly on the "
"[RenderingDevice]. If the texture contains layers, [param layer_type] is used "
"to define the layer type.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The RenderingServer's [method free_rid] won't free the "
"underlying [param rd_texture], you will want to free the [param rd_texture] "
"using [method RenderingDevice.free_rid]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງວັດຖຸເທັກເຈີ (texture) ໃໝ່ໂດຍອີງຕາມເທັກເຈີທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍກົງໃນ [RenderingDevice]. "
"ຖ້າເທັກເຈີມີເລເຍີ, [param layer_type] ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງປະເພດເລເຍີ.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຄວນລ້າງ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method free_rid] ຂອງ RenderingServer ຈະບໍ່ລ້າງ [param "
"rd_texture] ທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລ້າງ [param rd_texture] ເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingDevice.free_rid]."

msgid ""
"Replaces [param texture]'s texture data by the texture specified by the "
"[param by_texture] RID, without changing [param texture]'s RID."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນແທນຂໍ້ມູນ texture ຂອງ [param texture] ດ້ວຍ texture ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param by_texture] "
"RID, ໂດຍທີ່ບໍ່ປ່ຽນ RID ຂອງ [param texture]."

msgid ""
"Sets whether the texture RID should force redrawing when it's visible on "
"screen when [member OS.low_processor_usage_mode] is [code]true[/code]. This "
"is used by [AnimatedTexture] to force redrawing."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າ texture RID ຄວນບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີການແຕ້ມໃໝ່ (redrawing) ຫຼື ບໍ່ ເມື່ອມັນປະກົດຢູ່ເທິງໜ້າຈໍໃນຂະນະທີ່ "
"[member OS.low_processor_usage_mode] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. ສ່ວນນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ "
"[AnimatedTexture] ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຫ້ແຕ້ມໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Sets the resource path for this texture RID. See also [method "
"texture_get_path].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is purely a hint and does not cause the texture to be "
"automatically saved when set to a [code]res://[/code] path."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ resource path ສຳລັບ texture RID ນີ້. ເບິ່ງ [method texture_get_path] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ເປັນພຽງການບອກໃບ້ (hint) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ texture "
"ຖືກບັນທຶກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ path [code]res://[/code]."

msgid ""
"Sets the size at which the texture should be [i]displayed[/i] in 2D, ignoring "
"its original size. This does not rescale the texture data itself, only how it "
"is drawn in 2D. Set [param width] and [param height] to 0 to disable the size "
"override."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ texture ຖືກ [i]ສະແດງຜົນ[/i] ໃນ 2D, ໂດຍຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈຂະໜາດເດີມຂອງມັນ. "
"ນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນການປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ texture ເອງ, ແຕ່ເປັນພຽງການປ່ຽນວິທີທີ່ມັນຖືກແຕ້ມໃນ 2D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕັ້ງ "
"[param width] ແລະ [param height] ເປັນ 0 ເພື່ອປິດການຂຽນທັບຂະໜາດ (size override)."

msgid "Sets a viewport's camera."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ camera ຂອງ viewport."

msgid "Sets a viewport's canvas."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ canvas ຂອງ viewport."

msgid ""
"Copies the viewport to a region of the screen specified by [param rect]. If "
"[method viewport_set_render_direct_to_screen] is [code]true[/code], then the "
"viewport does not use a framebuffer and the contents of the viewport are "
"rendered directly to screen. However, note that the root viewport is drawn "
"last, therefore it will draw over the screen. Accordingly, you must set the "
"root viewport to an area that does not cover the area that you have attached "
"this viewport to.\n"
"For example, you can set the root viewport to not render at all with the "
"following code:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tRenderingServer.viewport_attach_to_screen(get_viewport().get_viewport_rid(), "
"Rect2())\n"
"\tRenderingServer.viewport_attach_to_screen($Viewport.get_viewport_rid(), "
"Rect2(0, 0, 600, 600))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Using this can result in significant optimization, especially on lower-end "
"devices. However, it comes at the cost of having to manage your viewports "
"manually. For further optimization, see [method "
"viewport_set_render_direct_to_screen]."
msgstr ""
"ສຳເນົາ viewport ໄປຍັງພື້ນທີ່ຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param rect]. ຖ້າ [method "
"viewport_set_render_direct_to_screen] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], viewport ຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້ "
"framebuffer ແລະ ເນື້ອໃນຂອງ viewport ຈະຖືກເຣນເດີໃສ່ໜ້າຈໍໂດຍກົງ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃຫ້ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ "
"root viewport ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມເປັນລຳດັບສຸດທ້າຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະແຕ້ມທັບໜ້າຈໍ. ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ root "
"viewport ໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ບໍ່ທັບຊ້ອນກັບພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ viewport ນີ້ໃສ່.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ root viewport ບໍ່ໃຫ້ເຣນເດີຫຍັງເລີຍດ້ວຍ code ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tRenderingServer.viewport_attach_to_screen(get_viewport().get_viewport_rid(), "
"Rect2())\n"
"\tRenderingServer.viewport_attach_to_screen($Viewport.get_viewport_rid(), "
"Rect2(0, 0, 600, 600))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ການໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້ຫຼາຍ, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີສະເປັກຕ່ຳ. "
"ແຕ່ກໍຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບການທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງຈັດການ viewports ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ສຳລັບການເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບເພີ່ມເຕີມ, "
"ເບິ່ງ [method viewport_set_render_direct_to_screen] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Creates an empty viewport and adds it to the RenderingServer. It can be "
"accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID will be used in all "
"[code]viewport_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent node is [Viewport]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ viewport ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ [code]viewport_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] node ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [Viewport]."

msgid ""
"Returns the CPU time taken to render the last frame in milliseconds. This "
"[i]only[/i] includes time spent in rendering-related operations; scripts' "
"[code]_process[/code] functions and other engine subsystems are not included "
"in this readout. To get a complete readout of CPU time spent to render the "
"scene, sum the render times of all viewports that are drawn every frame plus "
"[method get_frame_setup_time_cpu]. Unlike [method "
"Engine.get_frames_per_second], this method will accurately reflect CPU "
"utilization even if framerate is capped via V-Sync or [member "
"Engine.max_fps]. See also [method viewport_get_measured_render_time_gpu].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Requires measurements to be enabled on the specified [param "
"viewport] using [method viewport_set_measure_render_time]. Otherwise, this "
"method returns [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເວລາ CPU ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເຣນເດີ frame ລ່າສຸດເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ (milliseconds). ນີ້ລວມ "
"[i]ສະເພາະ[/i] ເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການດຳເນີນງານທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການເຣນເດີເທົ່ານັ້ນ; ຟັງຊັນ "
"[code]_process[/code] ຂອງ scripts ແລະ subsystem ອື່ນໆຂອງ engine "
"ຈະບໍ່ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນຄ່ານີ້. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ເວລາ CPU ທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເຣນເດີ scene, "
"ໃຫ້ລວມເວລາເຣນເດີຂອງທຸກໆ viewports ທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມໃນແຕ່ລະ frame ບວກກັບ [method "
"get_frame_setup_time_cpu]. ຕ່າງຈາກ [method Engine.get_frames_per_second], "
"ມິທອດນີ້ຈະສະແດງການໃຊ້ງານ CPU ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ framerate ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດຜ່ານ V-Sync ຫຼື "
"[member Engine.max_fps]. ເບິ່ງ [method viewport_get_measured_render_time_gpu] "
"ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ້ອງເປີດການວັດແທກ (measurement) ໃນ [param viewport] ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[method viewport_set_measure_render_time]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມິທອດນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]0.0[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the GPU time taken to render the last frame in milliseconds. To get a "
"complete readout of GPU time spent to render the scene, sum the render times "
"of all viewports that are drawn every frame. Unlike [method "
"Engine.get_frames_per_second], this method accurately reflects GPU "
"utilization even if framerate is capped via V-Sync or [member "
"Engine.max_fps]. See also [method viewport_get_measured_render_time_cpu].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Requires measurements to be enabled on the specified [param "
"viewport] using [method viewport_set_measure_render_time]. Otherwise, this "
"method returns [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When GPU utilization is low enough during a certain period of "
"time, GPUs will decrease their power state (which in turn decreases core and "
"memory clock speeds). This can cause the reported GPU time to increase if GPU "
"utilization is kept low enough by a framerate cap (compared to what it would "
"be at the GPU's highest power state). Keep this in mind when benchmarking "
"using [method viewport_get_measured_render_time_gpu]. This behavior can be "
"overridden in the graphics driver settings at the cost of higher power usage."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເວລາ GPU ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເຣນເດີ frame ລ່າສຸດເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ (milliseconds). ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ເວລາ "
"GPU ທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເຣນເດີ scene, ໃຫ້ລວມເວລາເຣນເດີຂອງທຸກໆ viewports ທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມໃນແຕ່ລະ "
"frame. ຕ່າງຈາກ [method Engine.get_frames_per_second], ມິທອດນີ້ສະແດງການໃຊ້ງານ GPU "
"ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ framerate ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດຜ່ານ V-Sync ຫຼື [member Engine.max_fps]. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method viewport_get_measured_render_time_cpu] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ້ອງເປີດການວັດແທກໃນ [param viewport] ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"viewport_set_measure_render_time]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມິທອດນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອການໃຊ້ງານ GPU ຕ່ຳພຽງພໍໃນຊ່ວງເວລາໃດໜຶ່ງ, GPU ຈະຫຼຸດສະຖານະພະລັງງານລົງ "
"(ເຊິ່ງຈະຫຼຸດຄວາມໄວ clock ຂອງ core ແລະ memory). ນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເວລາ GPU ທີ່ລາຍງານເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ "
"ຖ້າການໃຊ້ງານ GPU ຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ຕ່ຳຢູ່ເລື້ອຍໆໂດຍການຈຳກັດ framerate (ເມື່ອທຽບກັບຕອນທີ່ GPU "
"ຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະພະລັງງານສູງສຸດ). ໃຫ້ຄຳນຶງເຖິງເລື່ອງນີ້ໃນຕອນທີ່ເຮັດ benchmarking ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"viewport_get_measured_render_time_gpu]. ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ graphics "
"driver ແຕ່ຈະຕ້ອງແລກກັບການໃຊ້ພະລັງງານທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns a statistic about the rendering engine which can be used for "
"performance profiling. This is separated into render pass [param type]s, each "
"of them having the same [param info]s you can query (different passes will "
"return different values).\n"
"See also [method get_rendering_info], which returns global information across "
"all viewports.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Viewport rendering information is not available until at least 2 "
"frames have been rendered by the engine. If rendering information is not "
"available, [method viewport_get_render_info] returns [code]0[/code]. To print "
"rendering information in [code]_ready()[/code] successfully, use the "
"following:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tfor _i in 2:\n"
"\t\tawait get_tree().process_frame\n"
"\n"
"\tprint(\n"
"\t\t\tRenderingServer.viewport_get_render_info(get_viewport().get_viewport_rid(),\n"
"\t\t\tRenderingServer.VIEWPORT_RENDER_INFO_TYPE_VISIBLE,\n"
"\t\t\tRenderingServer.VIEWPORT_RENDER_INFO_DRAW_CALLS_IN_FRAME)\n"
"\t)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສະຖິຕິ ກ່ຽວກັບ rendering engine ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນການວິເຄາະປະສິດທິພາບ (performance "
"profiling). ນີ້ຖືກແຍກອອກເປັນ [param type] ຂອງ render pass, ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະອັນຈະມີ [param "
"info] ດຽວກັນທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດສອບຖາມໄດ້ (ແຕ່ລະ pass ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ).\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_rendering_info] ຕື່ມ, ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນ global ຈາກທຸກໆ viewports.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຂໍ້ມູນການເຣນເດີຂອງ Viewport ຈະຍັງບໍ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານຈົນກວ່າ engine "
"ຈະເຣນເດີໄປແລ້ວຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 2 frames. ຖ້າຂໍ້ມູນການເຣນເດີຍັງບໍ່ພ້ອມ, [method "
"viewport_get_render_info] ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]0[/code]. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດ print "
"ຂໍ້ມູນການເຣນເດີໃນ [code]_ready()[/code] ໄດ້ຢ່າງສຳເລັດ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ວິທີຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tfor _i in 2:\n"
"\t\tawait get_tree().process_frame\n"
"\n"
"\tprint(\n"
"\t\t\tRenderingServer.viewport_get_render_info(get_viewport().get_viewport_rid(),\n"
"\t\t\tRenderingServer.VIEWPORT_RENDER_INFO_TYPE_VISIBLE,\n"
"\t\t\tRenderingServer.VIEWPORT_RENDER_INFO_DRAW_CALLS_IN_FRAME)\n"
"\t)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Returns the render target for the viewport."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ render target ສຳລັບ viewport."

msgid "Returns the viewport's last rendered frame."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ frame ສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ viewport ເຣນເດີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the viewport's update mode.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Calling this from any thread other than the rendering thread "
"will be detrimental to performance."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ update mode ຂອງ viewport.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ຈາກ thread ອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ rendering thread "
"ຈະສົ່ງຜົນເສຍຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ."

msgid "Detaches a viewport from a canvas."
msgstr "ແຍກ (detach) viewport ອອກຈາກ canvas."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], sets the viewport active, else sets it inactive."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ viewport ເຮັດວຽກ (active), "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະຕັ້ງໃຫ້ບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກ (inactive)."

msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of samples to take when using anisotropic filtering "
"on textures (as a power of two). A higher sample count will result in sharper "
"textures at oblique angles, but is more expensive to compute. A value of "
"[code]0[/code] forcibly disables anisotropic filtering, even on materials "
"where it is enabled.\n"
"The anisotropic filtering level also affects decals and light projectors if "
"they are configured to use anisotropic filtering. See [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/decals/filter] and [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/light_projectors/filter].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In 3D, for this setting to have an effect, set [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.texture_filter] to [constant "
"BaseMaterial3D.TEXTURE_FILTER_LINEAR_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC] or [constant "
"BaseMaterial3D.TEXTURE_FILTER_NEAREST_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC] on "
"materials.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In 2D, for this setting to have an effect, set [member "
"CanvasItem.texture_filter] to [constant "
"CanvasItem.TEXTURE_FILTER_LINEAR_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC] or [constant "
"CanvasItem.TEXTURE_FILTER_NEAREST_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC] on the "
"[CanvasItem] node displaying the texture (or in [CanvasTexture]). However, "
"anisotropic filtering is rarely useful in 2D, so only enable it for textures "
"in 2D if it makes a meaningful visual difference."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນ samples ສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນຕອນທີ່ໃຊ້ anisotropic filtering ກັບ textures "
"(ເປັນເລກກຳລັງຂອງສອງ). ຈຳນວນ sample ທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ texture "
"ມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເບິ່ງໃນມຸມອຽງ, ແຕ່ກໍຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນການຄຳນວນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າ [code]0[/code] "
"ຈະເປັນການບັງຄັບປິດ anisotropic filtering ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໃນ material ຈະມີການເປີດໃຊ້ກໍຕາມ.\n"
"ລະດັບຂອງ anisotropic filtering ຍັງສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ decals ແລະ light projectors ນຳ "
"ຖ້າພວກມັນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ anisotropic filtering. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/decals/filter] ແລະ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/light_projectors/filter] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ 3D, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.texture_filter] ເປັນ [constant "
"BaseMaterial3D.TEXTURE_FILTER_LINEAR_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC] ຫຼື [constant "
"BaseMaterial3D.TEXTURE_FILTER_NEAREST_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC] ໃນ "
"materials.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ 2D, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [member "
"CanvasItem.texture_filter] ເປັນ [constant "
"CanvasItem.TEXTURE_FILTER_LINEAR_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC] ຫຼື [constant "
"CanvasItem.TEXTURE_FILTER_NEAREST_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC] ໃນ [CanvasItem] "
"node ທີ່ສະແດງ texture (ຫຼື ໃນ [CanvasTexture]). ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, anisotropic filtering "
"ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍມີປະໂຫຍດປານໃດໃນ 2D, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບ texture ໃນ 2D "
"ທີ່ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຫັນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຢ່າງຊັດເຈນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the rendering mask associated with this [Viewport]. Only [CanvasItem] "
"nodes with a matching rendering visibility layer will be rendered by this "
"[Viewport]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ rendering mask ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [Viewport] ນີ້. ເພາະ [CanvasItem] nodes ທີ່ມີ layer "
"ຄວາມເຫັນໃນການເຣນເດີທີ່ກົງກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກເຣນເດີໂດຍ [Viewport] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the stacking order for a viewport's canvas.\n"
"[param layer] is the actual canvas layer, while [param sublayer] specifies "
"the stacking order of the canvas among those in the same layer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param layer] should be between [constant CANVAS_LAYER_MIN] and "
"[constant CANVAS_LAYER_MAX] (inclusive). Any other value will wrap around."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລຳດັບການຊ້ອນກັນ (stacking order) ສຳລັບ canvas ຂອງ viewport.\n"
"[param layer] ແມ່ນ layer ຂອງ canvas ແທ້ໆ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ [param sublayer] "
"ຈະລະບຸລຳດັບການຊ້ອນກັນຂອງ canvas ໃນບັນດາອັນທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ layer ດຽວກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param layer] ຄວນຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [constant CANVAS_LAYER_MIN] ແລະ "
"[constant CANVAS_LAYER_MAX] (ລວມທັງສອງຄ່ານີ້). ຄ່າອື່ນໆຈະຖືກປ່ຽນໃຫ້ກັບມາຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງນີ້ (wrap "
"around)."

msgid "Sets the transformation of a viewport's canvas."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການແປງ (transformation) ຂອງ canvas ໃນ viewport."

msgid "Sets the clear mode of a viewport."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ clear mode ຂອງ viewport."

msgid "Sets the debug draw mode of a viewport."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ debug draw mode ຂອງ viewport."

msgid ""
"Sets the default texture filtering mode for the specified [param viewport] "
"RID."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດການກັ່ນຕອງ (filtering mode) ຂອງ texture ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ [param viewport] RID "
"ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Sets the default texture repeat mode for the specified [param viewport] RID."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດການເຮັດຊ້ຳ (repeat mode) ຂອງ texture ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ [param viewport] RID ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the viewport's canvas (i.e. 2D and GUI elements) is not "
"rendered."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], canvas ຂອງ viewport (ເຊັ່ນ 2D ແລະ GUI elements) "
"ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເຣນເດີ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the viewport's 3D elements are not rendered."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], 3D elements ຂອງ viewport ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເຣນເດີ."

msgid ""
"Sets the viewport's environment mode which allows enabling or disabling "
"rendering of 3D environment over 2D canvas. When disabled, 2D will not be "
"affected by the environment. When enabled, 2D will be affected by the "
"environment if the environment background mode is [constant ENV_BG_CANVAS]. "
"The default behavior is to inherit the setting from the viewport's parent. If "
"the topmost parent is also set to [constant VIEWPORT_ENVIRONMENT_INHERIT], "
"then the behavior will be the same as if it was set to [constant "
"VIEWPORT_ENVIRONMENT_ENABLED]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ environment mode ຂອງ viewport ເຊິ່ງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດການເຣນເດີ 3D environment "
"ທັບເທິງ 2D canvas. ເມື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ, 2D ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ environment. ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, 2D "
"ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ environment ຖ້າ environment background mode ເປັນ [constant "
"ENV_BG_CANVAS]. ພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການສືບທອດ (inherit) ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈາກ parent ຂອງ "
"viewport. ຖ້າ parent ທີ່ຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant VIEWPORT_ENVIRONMENT_INHERIT] "
"ນຳ, ພຶດຕິກຳຈະຄືກັບວ່າຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant VIEWPORT_ENVIRONMENT_ENABLED]."

msgid "Sets the viewport's global transformation matrix."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ global transformation matrix ຂອງ viewport."

msgid ""
"Sets the measurement for the given [param viewport] RID (obtained using "
"[method Viewport.get_viewport_rid]). Once enabled, [method "
"viewport_get_measured_render_time_cpu] and [method "
"viewport_get_measured_render_time_gpu] will return values greater than "
"[code]0.0[/code] when queried with the given [param viewport]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການວັດແທກສຳລັບ [param viewport] RID ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ (ໄດ້ຮັບໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"Viewport.get_viewport_rid]). ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, [method "
"viewport_get_measured_render_time_cpu] ແລະ [method "
"viewport_get_measured_render_time_gpu] ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ເມື່ອມີການສອບຖາມດ້ວຍ [param viewport] ນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the multisample antialiasing mode for 2D/Canvas on the specified [param "
"viewport] RID. Equivalent to [member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/"
"quality/msaa_2d] or [member Viewport.msaa_2d]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ multisample antialiasing (MSAA) ສຳລັບ 2D/Canvas ໃນ [param viewport] RID "
"ທີ່ລະບຸ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/"
"msaa_2d] ຫຼື [member Viewport.msaa_2d]."

msgid ""
"Sets the multisample antialiasing mode for 3D on the specified [param "
"viewport] RID. Equivalent to [member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/"
"quality/msaa_3d] or [member Viewport.msaa_3d]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ multisample antialiasing (MSAA) ສຳລັບ 3D ໃນ [param viewport] RID ທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/msaa_3d] ຫຼື "
"[member Viewport.msaa_3d]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [member ProjectSettings.rendering/occlusion_culling/"
"bvh_build_quality] to use for occlusion culling. This parameter is global and "
"cannot be set on a per-viewport basis."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/occlusion_culling/bvh_build_quality] "
"ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ occlusion culling. parameter ນີ້ເປັນຄ່າ global ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າແຍກແຕ່ລະ "
"viewport ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the [member ProjectSettings.rendering/occlusion_culling/"
"occlusion_rays_per_thread] to use for occlusion culling. This parameter is "
"global and cannot be set on a per-viewport basis."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/occlusion_culling/"
"occlusion_rays_per_thread] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ occlusion culling. parameter ນີ້ເປັນຄ່າ "
"global ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າແຍກແຕ່ລະ viewport ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the viewport's parent to the viewport specified by the [param "
"parent_viewport] RID."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ parent ຂອງ viewport ໃຫ້ເປັນ viewport ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param parent_viewport] RID."

msgid ""
"Sets the number of subdivisions to use in the specified shadow atlas [param "
"quadrant] for omni and spot shadows. See also [method "
"Viewport.set_positional_shadow_atlas_quadrant_subdiv]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນການແບ່ງສ່ວນຍ່ອຍ (subdivisions) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ shadow atlas [param quadrant] "
"ທີ່ລະບຸ ສຳລັບ omni ແລະ spot shadows. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"Viewport.set_positional_shadow_atlas_quadrant_subdiv] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param size] of the shadow atlas's images (used for omni and spot "
"lights) on the viewport specified by the [param viewport] RID. The value is "
"rounded up to the nearest power of 2. If [param use_16_bits] is [code]true[/"
"code], use 16 bits for the omni/spot shadow depth map. Enabling this results "
"in shadows having less precision and may result in shadow acne, but can lead "
"to performance improvements on some devices.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If this is set to [code]0[/code], no positional shadows will be "
"visible at all. This can improve performance significantly on low-end systems "
"by reducing both the CPU and GPU load (as fewer draw calls are needed to draw "
"the scene without shadows)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param size] ຂອງຮູບພາບໃນ shadow atlas (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ omni ແລະ spot lights) ໃນ "
"viewport ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param viewport] RID. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກປັດຂຶ້ນເປັນເລກກຳລັງຂອງ 2 ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ. ຖ້າ "
"[param use_16_bits] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ 16 bits ສຳລັບ omni/spot shadow "
"depth map. ການເປີດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາມີຄວາມລະອຽດ (precision) ໜ້ອຍລົງ ແລະ "
"ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ shadow acne, ແຕ່ສາມາດຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໃນບາງອຸປະກອນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ [code]0[/code], ຈະບໍ່ມີເງົາແບບ positional ປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນເລີຍ. "
"ນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້ຫຼາຍໃນລະບົບທີ່ມີສະເປັກຕ່ຳ ໂດຍການຫຼຸດຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ທັງ CPU ແລະ GPU "
"(ເນື່ອງຈາກມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ draw calls ໜ້ອຍລົງໃນການແຕ້ມ scene ທີ່ບໍ່ມີເງົາ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], render the contents of the viewport directly to screen. "
"This allows a low-level optimization where you can skip drawing a viewport to "
"the root viewport. While this optimization can result in a significant "
"increase in speed (especially on older devices), it comes at a cost of "
"usability. When this is enabled, you cannot read from the viewport or from "
"the screen_texture. You also lose the benefit of certain window settings, "
"such as the various stretch modes. Another consequence to be aware of is that "
"in 2D the rendering happens in window coordinates, so if you have a viewport "
"that is double the size of the window, and you set this, then only the "
"portion that fits within the window will be drawn, no automatic scaling is "
"possible, even if your game scene is significantly larger than the window "
"size."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເຣນເດີເນື້ອໃນຂອງ viewport ໃສ່ໜ້າຈໍໂດຍກົງ. "
"ນີ້ເປັນການເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໃນລະດັບຕ່ຳ (low-level optimization) ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດຂ້າມການແຕ້ມ "
"viewport ລົງໃນ root viewport ໄດ້. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄວາມໄວໄດ້ຫຼາຍ "
"(ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນອຸປະກອນເກົ່າ), ແຕ່ກໍຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບຂໍ້ຈຳກັດໃນການໃຊ້ງານ. ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້, "
"ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານຄ່າຈາກ viewport ຫຼື ຈາກ screen_texture ໄດ້. "
"ທ່ານຍັງຈະເສຍຜົນປະໂຫຍດຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ window ບາງຢ່າງ ເຊັ່ນ stretch modes ຕ່າງໆ. "
"ອີກສິ່ງໜຶ່ງທີ່ຄວນລະວັງຄື ໃນ 2D ການເຣນເດີຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍ (window coordinates), "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນຖ້າທ່ານມີ viewport ທີ່ມີຂະໜາດເປັນສອງເທົ່າຂອງ window ແລະ ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ສ່ວນທີ່ພໍດີກັບ "
"window ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມ, ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍ (scaling) ອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ scene "
"ຂອງເກມຈະໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຂະໜາດ window ຫຼາຍກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the 3D resolution scaling mode. Bilinear scaling renders at different "
"resolution to either undersample or supersample the viewport. FidelityFX "
"Super Resolution 1.0, abbreviated to FSR, is an upscaling technology that "
"produces high quality images at fast framerates by using a spatially aware "
"upscaling algorithm. FSR is slightly more expensive than bilinear, but it "
"produces significantly higher image quality. FSR should be used where "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດການຂະຫຍາຍຄວາມລະອຽດ 3D (3D resolution scaling mode). Bilinear scaling "
"ຈະເຣນເດີໃນຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຕ່າງກັນເພື່ອເຮັດ undersample ຫຼື supersample ໃຫ້ກັບ viewport. "
"FidelityFX Super Resolution 1.0 (FSR) ແມ່ນເຕັກໂນໂລຊີ upscaling "
"ທີ່ສ້າງຮູບພາບຄຸນນະພາບສູງໃນ framerate ທີ່ໄວ ໂດຍໃຊ້ algorithm upscaling ແບບ spatially "
"aware. FSR ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍກວ່າ bilinear ເລັກໜ້ອຍ, ແຕ່ຈະໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບຮູບພາບທີ່ສູງກວ່າຫຼາຍ. "
"ຄວນໃຊ້ FSR ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Scales the 3D render buffer based on the viewport size uses an image filter "
"specified in [enum ViewportScaling3DMode] to scale the output image to the "
"full viewport size. Values lower than [code]1.0[/code] can be used to speed "
"up 3D rendering at the cost of quality (undersampling). Values greater than "
"[code]1.0[/code] are only valid for bilinear mode and can be used to improve "
"3D rendering quality at a high performance cost (supersampling). See also "
"[enum ViewportMSAA] for multi-sample antialiasing, which is significantly "
"cheaper but only smoothens the edges of polygons.\n"
"When using FSR upscaling, AMD recommends exposing the following values as "
"preset options to users \"Ultra Quality: 0.77\", \"Quality: 0.67\", "
"\"Balanced: 0.59\", \"Performance: 0.5\" instead of exposing the entire scale."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຂະໜາດ (scale) ຂອງ 3D render buffer ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຂະໜາດຂອງ viewport ໂດຍໃຊ້ image "
"filter ທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [enum ViewportScaling3DMode] ເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍຮູບພາບທີ່ໄດ້ (output image) "
"ໃຫ້ເຕັມຂະໜາດຂອງ viewport. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມໄວໃນການເຣນເດີ 3D ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກກັບຄຸນນະພາບ (undersampling). ຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ "
"[code]1.0[/code] ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບ bilinear mode ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄຸນນະພາບການເຣນເດີ 3D ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນສູງຫຼາຍ (supersampling). ເບິ່ງ "
"[enum ViewportMSAA] ສຳລັບ multi-sample antialiasing ຕື່ມ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະປະຢັດກວ່າຫຼາຍແຕ່ຊ່ວຍພຽງແຕ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບຂອງ polygons ຮຽບນຽນຂຶ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ FSR upscaling, AMD ແນະນຳໃຫ້ສະແດງຄ່າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເປັນຕົວເລືອກ preset ໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້: \"Ultra "
"Quality: 0.77\", \"Quality: 0.67\", \"Balanced: 0.59\", \"Performance: 0.5\" "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະສະແດງ scale ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Sets a viewport's scenario. The scenario contains information about "
"environment information, reflection atlas, etc."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ scenario ຂອງ viewport. scenario ຈະບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບ environment, reflection "
"atlas, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"Sets the viewport's screen-space antialiasing mode. Equivalent to [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/screen_space_aa] or [member "
"Viewport.screen_space_aa]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດ screen-space antialiasing ຂອງ viewport. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/screen_space_aa] ຫຼື [member "
"Viewport.screen_space_aa]."

msgid ""
"Sets the viewport's 2D signed distance field [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/2d/sdf/oversize] and [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/2d/sdf/scale]. This is used when sampling the "
"signed distance field in [CanvasItem] shaders as well as [GPUParticles2D] "
"collision. This is [i]not[/i] used by SDFGI in 3D rendering."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ 2D signed distance field [member ProjectSettings.rendering/2d/sdf/"
"oversize] ແລະ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/2d/sdf/scale] ຂອງ viewport. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນຕອນທີ່ເຮັດ sampling signed distance field ໃນ [CanvasItem] shaders ແລະ "
"ໃນ [GPUParticles2D] collision. ສິ່ງນີ້ [i]ບໍ່ໄດ້[/i] ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ SDFGI ໃນການເຣນເດີ 3D."

msgid ""
"Sets the viewport's [param width] and [param height] in pixels. Optionally "
"the [param view_count] can be set to increase the number of view layers for "
"stereo rendering."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param width] (ຄວາມກວ້າງ) ແລະ [param height] (ຄວາມສູງ) ຂອງ viewport ເປັນ "
"pixels. ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param view_count] ເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອເພີ່ມຈຳນວນ view layers "
"ສຳລັບການເຣນເດີແບບ stereo."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], canvas item transforms (i.e. origin position) are "
"snapped to the nearest pixel when rendering. This can lead to a crisper "
"appearance at the cost of less smooth movement, especially when [Camera2D] "
"smoothing is enabled. Equivalent to [member ProjectSettings.rendering/2d/snap/"
"snap_2d_transforms_to_pixel]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], canvas item transforms (ເຊັ່ນ ຕຳແໜ່ງ origin) "
"ຈະຖືກດຶງໃຫ້ກົງກັບ pixel ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ (snapped) ໃນຕອນເຣນເດີ. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພາບເບິ່ງຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນ "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ເບິ່ງບໍ່ສະມູດ (smooth), ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ [Camera2D] "
"smoothing. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/2d/snap/"
"snap_2d_transforms_to_pixel]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], canvas item vertices (i.e. polygon points) are snapped "
"to the nearest pixel when rendering. This can lead to a crisper appearance at "
"the cost of less smooth movement, especially when [Camera2D] smoothing is "
"enabled. Equivalent to [member ProjectSettings.rendering/2d/snap/"
"snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], canvas item vertices (ເຊັ່ນ ຈຸດຂອງ polygon) "
"ຈະຖືກດຶງໃຫ້ກົງກັບ pixel ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ (snapped) ໃນຕອນເຣນເດີ. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພາບເບິ່ງຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນ "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ເບິ່ງບໍ່ສະມູດ, ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ [Camera2D] smoothing. "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/2d/snap/snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel]."

msgid ""
"Affects the final texture sharpness by reading from a lower or higher mipmap "
"(also called \"texture LOD bias\"). Negative values make mipmapped textures "
"sharper but grainier when viewed at a distance, while positive values make "
"mipmapped textures blurrier (even when up close). To get sharper textures at "
"a distance without introducing too much graininess, set this between "
"[code]-0.75[/code] and [code]0.0[/code]. Enabling temporal antialiasing "
"([member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/use_taa]) can help "
"reduce the graininess visible when using negative mipmap bias.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When the 3D scaling mode is set to FSR 1.0, this value is used "
"to adjust the automatic mipmap bias which is calculated internally based on "
"the scale factor. The formula for this is [code]-log2(1.0 / scale) + "
"mipmap_bias[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only supported in the Forward+ and Mobile "
"renderers, not Compatibility. In Compatibility, this method is always treated "
"as if [param mipmap_bias] was set to [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງ texture ຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍໂດຍການອ່ານຈາກ mipmap ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າ (ເອີ້ນວ່າ "
"\"texture LOD bias\"). ຄ່າລົບຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ mipmapped textures ຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນແຕ່ຈະເຫັນເປັນເມັດ "
"(grainier) ເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກໄລຍະໄກ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າບວກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ mipmapped textures ເບິ່ງມົວລົງ "
"(ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເບິ່ງໃກ້ໆກໍຕາມ). ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ texture ທີ່ຄົມຊັດໃນໄລຍະໄກໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ເຫັນເມັດຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ, "
"ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ລະຫວ່າງ [code]-0.75[/code] ແລະ [code]0.0[/code]. ການເປີດໃຊ້ temporal "
"antialiasing ([member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/"
"use_taa]) ສາມາດຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດເມັດທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອໃຊ້ mipmap bias ເປັນຄ່າລົບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອຕັ້ງ 3D scaling mode ເປັນ FSR 1.0, ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບ automatic "
"mipmap bias ເຊິ່ງຖືກຄຳນວນພາຍໃນໂດຍອີງໃສ່ scale factor. ສູດສຳລັບສິ່ງນີ້ຄື [code]-log2(1.0 / "
"scale) + mipmap_bias[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile renderers ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ Compatibility. ໃນ Compatibility, ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດຄືກັບວ່າ [param "
"mipmap_bias] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0.0[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the viewport renders its background as transparent."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], viewport ຈະເຣນເດີພື້ນຫຼັງໃຫ້ເປັນແບບໂປ່ງໃສ (transparent)."

msgid "Sets when the viewport should be updated."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າ viewport ຄວນຖືກອັບເດດເມື່ອໃດ."

msgid ""
"Equivalent to [member Viewport.use_debanding]. See also [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/use_debanding]."
msgstr ""
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member Viewport.use_debanding]. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/use_debanding] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], 2D rendering will use a high dynamic range (HDR) "
"[code]RGBA16[/code] format framebuffer. Additionally, 2D rendering will be "
"performed on linear values and will be converted using the appropriate "
"transfer function immediately before blitting to the screen (if the Viewport "
"is attached to the screen).\n"
"Practically speaking, this means that the end result of the Viewport will not "
"be clamped to the [code]0-1[/code] range and can be used in 3D rendering "
"without color encoding adjustments. This allows 2D rendering to take "
"advantage of effects requiring high dynamic range (e.g. 2D glow) as well as "
"substantially improves the appearance of effects requiring highly detailed "
"gradients. This setting has the same effect as [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການເຣນເດີ 2D ຈະໃຊ້ framebuffer ໃນຮູບແບບ high dynamic "
"range (HDR) [code]RGBA16[/code]. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ການເຣນເດີ 2D ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນຄ່າແບບ "
"linear ແລະ ຈະຖືກແປງໂດຍໃຊ້ transfer function ທີ່ເໝາະສົມທັນທີກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງພາບໄປຍັງໜ້າຈໍ (ຖ້າ "
"Viewport ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບໜ້າຈໍຢູ່).\n"
"ເວົ້າໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໃຈງ່າຍຄື ຜົນລັບສຸດທ້າຍຂອງ Viewport ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ (clamped) ໄວ້ແຕ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0-1[/"
"code] ແລະ ສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ໃນການເຣນເດີ 3D ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງປັບ color encoding. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການເຣນເດີ "
"2D ສາມາດໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກ effects ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ high dynamic range (ເຊັ່ນ 2D glow) ແລະ "
"ຍັງຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງລັກສະນະຂອງ effects ທີ່ຕ້ອງການການໄລ່ສີ (gradients) ທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດສູງ. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນຄືກັນກັບ [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables occlusion culling on the specified viewport. "
"Equivalent to [member ProjectSettings.rendering/occlusion_culling/"
"use_occlusion_culling]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ occlusion culling ໃນ viewport ທີ່ລະບຸ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/occlusion_culling/use_occlusion_culling]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], use temporal antialiasing. Equivalent to [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/use_taa] or [member "
"Viewport.use_taa]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ temporal antialiasing (TAA). ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/use_taa] ຫຼື [member "
"Viewport.use_taa]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the viewport uses augmented or virtual reality "
"technologies. See [XRInterface]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], viewport ຈະໃຊ້ເຕັກໂນໂລຊີ augmented (AR) ຫຼື virtual "
"reality (VR). ເບິ່ງ [XRInterface] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the Variable Rate Shading (VRS) mode for the viewport. If the GPU does "
"not support VRS, this property is ignored. Equivalent to [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/vrs/mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດ Variable Rate Shading (VRS) ສຳລັບ viewport. ຖ້າ GPU ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ VRS, "
"property ນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/vrs/mode]."

msgid ""
"The texture to use when the VRS mode is set to [constant "
"RenderingServer.VIEWPORT_VRS_TEXTURE]. Equivalent to [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/vrs/texture]."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອໂໝດ VRS ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant RenderingServer.VIEWPORT_VRS_TEXTURE]. "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/vrs/texture]."

msgid ""
"Sets the update mode for Variable Rate Shading (VRS) for the viewport. VRS "
"requires the input texture to be converted to the format usable by the VRS "
"method supported by the hardware. The update mode defines how often this "
"happens. If the GPU does not support VRS, or VRS is not enabled, this "
"property is ignored.\n"
"If set to [constant RenderingServer.VIEWPORT_VRS_UPDATE_ONCE], the input "
"texture is copied once and the mode is changed to [constant "
"RenderingServer.VIEWPORT_VRS_UPDATE_DISABLED]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ update mode ສຳລັບ Variable Rate Shading (VRS) ໃນ viewport. VRS ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ "
"input texture ຖືກແປງເປັນຮູບແບບທີ່ຮອງຮັບໂດຍວິທີ VRS ຂອງ hardware. update mode "
"ຈະກຳນົດວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເລື້ອຍປານໃດ. ຖ້າ GPU ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ VRS, ຫຼື VRS ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້, property "
"ນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ.\n"
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant RenderingServer.VIEWPORT_VRS_UPDATE_ONCE], input texture "
"ຈະຖືກ copy ພຽງເທື່ອດຽວ ແລະ mode ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນ [constant "
"RenderingServer.VIEWPORT_VRS_UPDATE_DISABLED]."

msgid ""
"Creates a new 3D visibility notifier object and adds it to the "
"RenderingServer. It can be accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID "
"will be used in all [code]visibility_notifier_*[/code] RenderingServer "
"functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"To place in a scene, attach this notifier to an instance using [method "
"instance_set_base] using the returned RID.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent node is [VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ 3D visibility notifier object ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ RenderingServer. "
"ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ "
"[code]visibility_notifier_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"ເພື່ອວາງໃນ scene, ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ notifier ນີ້ເຂົ້າກັບ instance ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"instance_set_base] ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄືນມາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] node ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D]."

msgid "Sets the AABB of the specified visibility notifier."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ AABB ຂອງ visibility notifier ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Sets the methods to be called when the notifier enters or exits the view."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເມທອດທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອ notifier ເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ອອກຈາກມຸມມອງ (view)."

msgid ""
"Allocates and initializes the voxel GI data for the specified [param "
"voxel_gi] RID. [param octree_cells] must be a multiple of 32. [param "
"octree_cells] must be double the size of [param data_cells]. The allocated "
"data can be retrieved later using the various [code]voxel_gi_get_*[/code] "
"methods."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດສັນ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂໍ້ມູນ voxel GI ສຳລັບ [param voxel_gi] RID ທີ່ລະບຸ. [param "
"octree_cells] ຕ້ອງເປັນຕົວຄູນຂອງ 32. [param octree_cells] ຕ້ອງມີຂະໜາດເປັນສອງເທົ່າຂອງ "
"[param data_cells]. ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈັດສັນໄວ້ສາມາດດຶງມານຳໃຊ້ພາຍຫຼັງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ "
"[code]voxel_gi_get_*[/code] ຕ່າງໆ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new voxel-based global illumination object and adds it to the "
"RenderingServer. It can be accessed with the RID that is returned. This RID "
"will be used in all [code]voxel_gi_*[/code] RenderingServer functions.\n"
"Once finished with your RID, you will want to free the RID using the "
"RenderingServer's [method free_rid] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The equivalent node is [VoxelGI]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ voxel-based global illumination (VoxelGI) object ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ "
"RenderingServer. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ RID ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ. RID ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຟັງຊັນ "
"[code]voxel_gi_*[/code] ຂອງ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ RID ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ອຍ RID ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method free_rid] ຂອງ "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] node ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແມ່ນ [VoxelGI]."

msgid ""
"Returns the data cells for the specified voxel GI data instance. See also "
"[method voxel_gi_allocate_data]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ data cells ສຳລັບ voxel GI data instance ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"voxel_gi_allocate_data] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the distance field data for the specified voxel GI data instance. See "
"also [method voxel_gi_allocate_data]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ distance field data ສຳລັບ voxel GI data instance ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"voxel_gi_allocate_data] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the level counts for the specified voxel GI data instance. See also "
"[method voxel_gi_allocate_data]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ level counts ສຳລັບ voxel GI data instance ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"voxel_gi_allocate_data] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the octree cell data for the specified voxel GI data instance. See "
"also [method voxel_gi_allocate_data]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ octree cell data ສຳລັບ voxel GI data instance ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"voxel_gi_allocate_data] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the octree size for the specified voxel GI data instance, which "
"corresponds to the number of subdivisions per axis. This can be viewed in the "
"editor by hovering the [b]Bake VoxelGI[/b] button at the top of the 3D editor "
"viewport when a [VoxelGI] node is selected and looking at the "
"[b]Subdivisions[/b] field in the tooltip."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດ octree ສຳລັບ voxel GI data instance ທີ່ລະບຸ, ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບຈຳນວນການແບ່ງສ່ວນຍ່ອຍ "
"(subdivisions) ຕໍ່ແກນ. ສາມາດເບິ່ງສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໃນ editor ໂດຍການເອົາເມົ້າໄປຊີ້ທີ່ປຸ່ມ [b]Bake "
"VoxelGI[/b] ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງ 3D editor viewport ເມື່ອເລືອກ [VoxelGI] node ຢູ່ ແລະ ເບິ່ງທີ່ "
"field [b]Subdivisions[/b] ໃນ tooltip."

msgid ""
"Returns the transform to cell space for the specified voxel GI data instance. "
"See also [method voxel_gi_allocate_data]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການແປງ (transform) ໄປຍັງ cell space ສຳລັບ voxel GI data instance ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method voxel_gi_allocate_data] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Used to inform the renderer what exposure normalization value was used while "
"baking the voxel gi. This value will be used and modulated at run time to "
"ensure that the voxel gi maintains a consistent level of exposure even if the "
"scene-wide exposure normalization is changed at run time. For more "
"information see [method camera_attributes_set_exposure]."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຈ້ງໃຫ້ renderer ຊາບວ່າໃຊ້ຄ່າ exposure normalization ໃດໃນຂະນະທີ່ bake voxel gi. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ ແລະ ປັບປ່ຽນໃນຂະນະທີ່ທຳງານ (runtime) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ voxel gi ຮັກສາລະດັບ "
"exposure ໃຫ້ຄົງທີ່ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ scene-wide exposure normalization "
"ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໃນຂະນະທີ່ທຳງານກໍຕາມ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເບິ່ງ [method "
"camera_attributes_set_exposure]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [member VoxelGIData.bias] value to use on the specified [param "
"voxel_gi]'s [RID]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member VoxelGIData.bias] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ [param voxel_gi] [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [member VoxelGIData.dynamic_range] value to use on the specified "
"[param voxel_gi]'s [RID]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member VoxelGIData.dynamic_range] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ [param voxel_gi] [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [member VoxelGIData.energy] value to use on the specified [param "
"voxel_gi]'s [RID]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member VoxelGIData.energy] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ [param voxel_gi] [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [member VoxelGIData.interior] value to use on the specified [param "
"voxel_gi]'s [RID]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member VoxelGIData.interior] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ [param voxel_gi] [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [member VoxelGIData.normal_bias] value to use on the specified "
"[param voxel_gi]'s [RID]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member VoxelGIData.normal_bias] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ [param voxel_gi] [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [member VoxelGIData.propagation] value to use on the specified "
"[param voxel_gi]'s [RID]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member VoxelGIData.propagation] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ [param voxel_gi] [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [member ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/voxel_gi/"
"quality] value to use when rendering. This parameter is global and cannot be "
"set on a per-VoxelGI basis."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/voxel_gi/quality] "
"ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນຕອນເຣນເດີ. parameter ນີ້ເປັນຄ່າ global ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າແຍກແຕ່ລະ VoxelGI ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the [member VoxelGIData.use_two_bounces] value to use on the specified "
"[param voxel_gi]'s [RID]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member VoxelGIData.use_two_bounces] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ [param voxel_gi] [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], disables rendering completely, but the engine logic is "
"still being processed. You can call [method force_draw] to draw a frame even "
"with rendering disabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະປິດການເຣນເດີທັງໝົດ, ແຕ່ logic ຂອງ engine "
"ຍັງຄົງຖືກປະມວນຜົນຢູ່. ທ່ານສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method force_draw] ເພື່ອແຕ້ມ frame "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການເຣນເດີຈະຖືກປິດຢູ່ກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Emitted at the end of the frame, after the RenderingServer has finished "
"updating all the Viewports."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານ (Emit) ໃນຕອນສິ້ນສຸດ frame, ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ RenderingServer ອັບເດດທຸກໆ Viewports "
"ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Emitted at the beginning of the frame, before the RenderingServer updates all "
"the Viewports."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານ (Emit) ໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ frame, ກ່ອນທີ່ RenderingServer ຈະອັບເດດທຸກໆ Viewports."

msgid "Marks an error that shows that the index array is empty."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຖິງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ສະແດງວ່າ index array ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid "Number of weights/bones per vertex."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ weights/bones ຕໍ່ vertex."

msgid "The minimum Z-layer for canvas items."
msgstr "Z-layer ຕ່ຳສຸດສຳລັບ canvas items."

msgid "The maximum Z-layer for canvas items."
msgstr "Z-layer ສູງສຸດສຳລັບ canvas items."

msgid "The minimum canvas layer."
msgstr "ຊັ້ນແຄນວາສຕ່ຳສຸດ."

msgid "The maximum canvas layer."
msgstr "ຊັ້ນແຄນວາສສູງສຸດ."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of glow levels that can be used with the glow post-"
"processing effect."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງ glow levels ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບ glow post-processing effect ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of directional lights that can be rendered at a given time "
"in 2D."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງ directional lights ທີ່ສາມາດເຣນເດີໄດ້ໃນເວລາໃດໜຶ່ງໃນ 2D."

msgid "The maximum number of surfaces a mesh can have."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງ surfaces ທີ່ mesh ໃດໜຶ່ງສາມາດມີໄດ້."

msgid "2D texture."
msgstr "2D texture."

msgid "Layered texture."
msgstr "Layered texture."

msgid "3D texture."
msgstr "3D texture."

msgid "Array of 2-dimensional textures (see [Texture2DArray])."
msgstr "Array ຂອງ texture 2 ມິຕິ (ເບິ່ງ [Texture2DArray])."

msgid "Cubemap texture (see [Cubemap])."
msgstr "Cubemap texture (ເບິ່ງ [Cubemap])."

msgid "Array of cubemap textures (see [CubemapArray])."
msgstr "Array ຂອງ cubemap textures (ເບິ່ງ [CubemapArray])."

msgid "Left face of a [Cubemap]."
msgstr "ດ້ານຊ້າຍ (Left face) ຂອງ [Cubemap]."

msgid "Right face of a [Cubemap]."
msgstr "ດ້ານຂວາ (Right face) ຂອງ [Cubemap]."

msgid "Bottom face of a [Cubemap]."
msgstr "ດ້ານລຸ່ມ (Bottom face) ຂອງ [Cubemap]."

msgid "Top face of a [Cubemap]."
msgstr "ດ້ານເທິງ (Top face) ຂອງ [Cubemap]."

msgid "Front face of a [Cubemap]."
msgstr "ດ້ານໜ້າ (Front face) ຂອງ [Cubemap]."

msgid "Back face of a [Cubemap]."
msgstr "ດ້ານຫຼັງ (Back face) ຂອງ [Cubemap]."

msgid "Shader is a 3D shader."
msgstr "Shader ເປັນແບບ 3D shader."

msgid "Shader is a 2D shader."
msgstr "Shader ເປັນແບບ 2D shader."

msgid "Shader is a particle shader (can be used in both 2D and 3D)."
msgstr "Shader ເປັນແບບ particle shader (ໃຊ້ໄດ້ທັງໃນ 2D ແລະ 3D)."

msgid "Shader is a 3D sky shader."
msgstr "Shader ເປັນແບບ 3D sky shader."

msgid "Shader is a 3D fog shader."
msgstr "Shader ເປັນແບບ 3D fog shader."

msgid "Shader is a texture_blit shader."
msgstr "Shader ເປັນແບບ texture_blit shader."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ShaderMode] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງ [enum ShaderMode] enum."

msgid "The minimum renderpriority of all materials."
msgstr "ບຸລິມະສິດການເຣນເດີຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງວັດສະດຸທັງໝົດ."

msgid "The maximum renderpriority of all materials."
msgstr "ບຸລິມະສິດການເຣນເດີສູງສຸດຂອງວັດສະດຸທັງໝົດ."

msgid "Array is a vertex position array."
msgstr "Array ເປັນ array ຕຳແໜ່ງ vertex."

msgid "Array is a normal array."
msgstr "Array ເປັນ array ຂອງ normal."

msgid "Array is a tangent array."
msgstr "Array ເປັນ array ຂອງ tangent."

msgid "Array is a vertex color array."
msgstr "Array ເປັນ array ສີຂອງ vertex."

msgid "Array is a UV coordinates array."
msgstr "Array ເປັນ array ພິກັດ UV."

msgid "Array is a UV coordinates array for the second set of UV coordinates."
msgstr "Array ເປັນ array ພິກັດ UV ສຳລັບພິກັດ UV ຊຸດທີສອງ."

msgid "Array is a custom data array for the first set of custom data."
msgstr "Array ເປັນ array ຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງຊຸດທຳອິດ."

msgid "Array is a custom data array for the second set of custom data."
msgstr "Array ເປັນ array ຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງຊຸດທີສອງ."

msgid "Array is a custom data array for the third set of custom data."
msgstr "Array ເປັນ array ຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງຊຸດທີສາມ."

msgid "Array is a custom data array for the fourth set of custom data."
msgstr "ອາເຣແມ່ນອາເຣຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງຊຸດທີສີ່."

msgid "Array contains bone information."
msgstr "ອາເຣບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນກະດູກ."

msgid "Array is weight information."
msgstr "ອາເຣແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນນ້ຳໜັກ."

msgid "Array is an index array."
msgstr "ອາເຣແມ່ນອາເຣອິນເດັກ (index array)."

msgid ""
"The number of custom data arrays available ([constant ARRAY_CUSTOM0], "
"[constant ARRAY_CUSTOM1], [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM2], [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM3])."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນອາເຣຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ([constant ARRAY_CUSTOM0], [constant "
"ARRAY_CUSTOM1], [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM2], [constant ARRAY_CUSTOM3])."

msgid ""
"Custom data array contains 8-bit-per-channel red/green/blue/alpha color data. "
"Values are normalized, unsigned floating-point in the [code][0.0, 1.0][/code] "
"range."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນສີ ແດງ/ຂຽວ/ຟ້າ/ອັນຟາ ແບບ 8 ບິດ/ຊ່ອງ. ຄ່າແມ່ນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ (floating-"
"point) ບວກທີ່ປັບເປັນມາດຕະຖານ (normalized) ໃນຊ່ວງ [code][0.0, 1.0][/code]."

msgid ""
"Custom data array contains 8-bit-per-channel red/green/blue/alpha color data. "
"Values are normalized, signed floating-point in the [code][-1.0, 1.0][/code] "
"range."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນສີ ແດງ/ຂຽວ/ຟ້າ/ອັນຟາ ແບບ 8 ບິດ/ຊ່ອງ. ຄ່າແມ່ນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ (floating-"
"point) ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍທີ່ປັບເປັນມາດຕະຖານ (normalized) ໃນຊ່ວງ [code][-1.0, 1.0][/code]."

msgid ""
"Custom data array contains 16-bit-per-channel red/green color data. Values "
"are floating-point in half precision."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນສີ ແດງ/ຂຽວ ແບບ 16 ບິດ/ຊ່ອງ. ຄ່າແມ່ນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ "
"(half precision)."

msgid ""
"Custom data array contains 16-bit-per-channel red/green/blue/alpha color "
"data. Values are floating-point in half precision."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນສີ ແດງ/ຂຽວ/ຟ້າ/ອັນຟາ ແບບ 16 ບິດ/ຊ່ອງ. "
"ຄ່າແມ່ນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ (half precision)."

msgid ""
"Custom data array contains 32-bit-per-channel red color data. Values are "
"floating-point in single precision."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນສີແດງແບບ 32 ບິດ/ຊ່ອງ. ຄ່າແມ່ນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດດ່ຽວ (single "
"precision)."

msgid ""
"Custom data array contains 32-bit-per-channel red/green color data. Values "
"are floating-point in single precision."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນສີ ແດງ/ຂຽວ ແບບ 32 ບິດ/ຊ່ອງ. ຄ່າແມ່ນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດດ່ຽວ "
"(single precision)."

msgid ""
"Custom data array contains 32-bit-per-channel red/green/blue color data. "
"Values are floating-point in single precision."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນສີ ແດງ/ຂຽວ/ຟ້າ ແບບ 32 ບິດ/ຊ່ອງ. ຄ່າແມ່ນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດດ່ຽວ "
"(single precision)."

msgid ""
"Custom data array contains 32-bit-per-channel red/green/blue/alpha color "
"data. Values are floating-point in single precision."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນສີ ແດງ/ຂຽວ/ຟ້າ/ອັນຟາ ແບບ 32 ບິດ/ຊ່ອງ. "
"ຄ່າແມ່ນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດດ່ຽວ (single precision)."

msgid "Flag used to mark a vertex position array."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍອາເຣຕຳແໜ່ງເວີເທັກ (vertex position array)."

msgid "Flag used to mark a normal array."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍອາເຣນໍມໍ (normal array)."

msgid "Flag used to mark a tangent array."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍອາເຣແທນເຈັນ (tangent array)."

msgid "Flag used to mark a vertex color array."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍອາເຣສີເວີເທັກ (vertex color array)."

msgid "Flag used to mark a UV coordinates array."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍອາເຣພິກັດ UV."

msgid "Flag used to mark a UV coordinates array for the second UV coordinates."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍອາເຣພິກັດ UV ສຳລັບພິກັດ UV ຊຸດທີສອງ."

msgid ""
"Flag used to mark an array of custom per-vertex data for the first set of "
"custom data."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍອາເຣຂໍ້ມູນເວີເທັກແບບກຳນົດເອງ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງຊຸດທຳອິດ."

msgid ""
"Flag used to mark an array of custom per-vertex data for the second set of "
"custom data."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍອາເຣຂໍ້ມູນເວີເທັກແບບກຳນົດເອງ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງຊຸດທີສອງ."

msgid ""
"Flag used to mark an array of custom per-vertex data for the third set of "
"custom data."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍອາເຣຂໍ້ມູນເວີເທັກແບບກຳນົດເອງ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງຊຸດທີສາມ."

msgid ""
"Flag used to mark an array of custom per-vertex data for the fourth set of "
"custom data."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍອາເຣຂໍ້ມູນເວີເທັກແບບກຳນົດເອງ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງຊຸດທີສີ່."

msgid "Flag used to mark a bone information array."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍອາເຣຂໍ້ມູນກະດູກ."

msgid "Flag used to mark a weights array."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍອາເຣນ້ຳໜັກ."

msgid "Flag used to mark an index array."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍອາເຣອິນເດັກ (index array)."

msgid "Flag used to mark that the array uses 8 bone weights instead of 4."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍວ່າອາເຣນີ້ນຳໃຊ້ນ້ຳໜັກກະດູກ 8 ອັນແທນທີ່ 4 ອັນ."

msgid ""
"Flag used to mark that the mesh does not have a vertex array and instead will "
"infer vertex positions in the shader using indices and other information."
msgstr ""
"ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍວ່າເມຊ (mesh) ບໍ່ມີອາເຣເວີເທັກ (vertex array) "
"ແລະຈະຄຳນວນຕຳແໜ່ງເວີເທັກໃນເຊດເດີ (shader) ໂດຍໃຊ້ອິນເດັກ ແລະຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆແທນ."

msgid "Flag used to mark the start of the bits used to store the mesh version."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງບິດທີ່ໃຊ້ເກັບເວີຊັນຂອງເມຊ (mesh)."

msgid ""
"Flag used to shift a mesh format int to bring the version into the lowest "
"digits."
msgstr ""
"ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລື່ອນ (shift) ຄ່າເລກເຕັມຂອງຮູບແບບເມຊ (mesh format int) "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເວີຊັນຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງຫຼັກຕ່ຳສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Flag used to record the format used by prior mesh versions before the "
"introduction of a version."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອບັນທຶກຮູບແບບທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍເມຊເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້າ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະມີການນຳໃຊ້ລະບົບເວີຊັນ."

msgid ""
"Flag used to record the second iteration of the mesh version flag. The "
"primary difference between this and [constant ARRAY_FLAG_FORMAT_VERSION_1] is "
"that this version supports [constant ARRAY_FLAG_COMPRESS_ATTRIBUTES] and in "
"this version vertex positions are de-interleaved from normals and tangents."
msgstr ""
"ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອບັນທຶກເວີຊັນທີສອງຂອງເມຊ. ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຫຼັກລະຫວ່າງອັນນີ້ ແລະ [constant "
"ARRAY_FLAG_FORMAT_VERSION_1] ແມ່ນເວີຊັນນີ້ຮອງຮັບ [constant "
"ARRAY_FLAG_COMPRESS_ATTRIBUTES] ແລະໃນເວີຊັນນີ້ ຕຳແໜ່ງເວີເທັກຈະຖືກແຍກອອກ (de-"
"interleaved) ຈາກນໍມໍ ແລະ ແທນເຈັນ."

msgid ""
"Flag used to record the current version that the engine expects. Currently "
"this is the same as [constant ARRAY_FLAG_FORMAT_VERSION_2]."
msgstr ""
"ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອບັນທຶກເວີຊັນປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ເອນຈິນຕ້ອງການ. ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບ [constant "
"ARRAY_FLAG_FORMAT_VERSION_2]."

msgid ""
"Flag used to isolate the bits used for mesh version after using [constant "
"ARRAY_FLAG_FORMAT_VERSION_SHIFT] to shift them into place."
msgstr ""
"ແຟລັກ (Flag) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຍກບິດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເວີຊັນຂອງເມຊ ຫຼັງຈາກໃຊ້ [constant "
"ARRAY_FLAG_FORMAT_VERSION_SHIFT] ເລື່ອນພວກມັນເຂົ້າຕຳແໜ່ງແລ້ວ."

msgid "Primitive to draw consists of points."
msgstr "ພຣິມິທີຟ (Primitive) ທີ່ຈະແຕ້ມປະກອບດ້ວຍຈຸດ."

msgid "Primitive to draw consists of lines."
msgstr "ພຣິມິທີຟ (Primitive) ທີ່ຈະແຕ້ມປະກອບດ້ວຍເສັ້ນ."

msgid "Primitive to draw consists of a line strip from start to end."
msgstr "ພຣິມິທີຟ (Primitive) ທີ່ຈະແຕ້ມປະກອບດ້ວຍເສັ້ນຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ (line strip) ແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫາສິ້ນສຸດ."

msgid "Primitive to draw consists of triangles."
msgstr "ພຣິມິທີຟ (Primitive) ທີ່ຈະແຕ້ມປະກອບດ້ວຍຮູບສາມແຈ."

msgid ""
"Primitive to draw consists of a triangle strip (the last 3 vertices are "
"always combined to make a triangle)."
msgstr ""
"ພຣິມິທີຟ (Primitive) ທີ່ຈະແຕ້ມປະກອບດ້ວຍຮູບສາມແຈຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ (triangle strip) (3 "
"ເວີເທັກສຸດທ້າຍຈະຖືກລວມກັນເພື່ອສ້າງເປັນຮູບສາມແຈສະເໝີ)."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum PrimitiveType] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ (enum) [enum PrimitiveType]."

msgid "Use [Transform2D] to store MultiMesh transform."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ [Transform2D] ເພື່ອເກັບການແປງ (transform) ຂອງ MultiMesh."

msgid "Use [Transform3D] to store MultiMesh transform."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ [Transform3D] ເພື່ອເກັບການແປງ (transform) ຂອງ MultiMesh."

msgid "MultiMesh physics interpolation favors speed over quality."
msgstr ""
"ການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນຟີຊິກ (physics interpolation) ຂອງ MultiMesh ເນັ້ນຄວາມໄວຫຼາຍກວ່າຄຸນນະພາບ."

msgid "MultiMesh physics interpolation favors quality over speed."
msgstr ""
"ການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນຟີຊິກ (physics interpolation) ຂອງ MultiMesh ເນັ້ນຄຸນນະພາບຫຼາຍກວ່າຄວາມໄວ."

msgid ""
"Nearest-neighbor filter for light projectors (use for pixel art light "
"projectors). No mipmaps are used for rendering, which means light projectors "
"at a distance will look sharp but grainy. This has roughly the same "
"performance cost as using mipmaps."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີ Nearest-neighbor ສຳລັບຕົວສາຍແສງ (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕົວສາຍແສງແບບ pixel art). ບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ "
"mipmaps ໃນການເຣນເດີ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຕົວສາຍແສງໃນໄລຍະໄກຈະເບິ່ງຄົມຊັດແຕ່ຈະມີເມັດ (grainy). "
"ອັນນີ້ມີຕົ້ນທຶນການເຮັດວຽກພໍໆກັນກັບການໃຊ້ mipmaps."

msgid ""
"Linear filter for light projectors (use for non-pixel art light projectors). "
"No mipmaps are used for rendering, which means light projectors at a distance "
"will look smooth but blurry. This has roughly the same performance cost as "
"using mipmaps."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີ Linear ສຳລັບຕົວສາຍແສງ (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕົວສາຍແສງທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ pixel art). ບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ mipmaps "
"ໃນການເຣນເດີ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຕົວສາຍແສງໃນໄລຍະໄກຈະເບິ່ງລຽບແຕ່ມົວ. "
"ອັນນີ້ມີຕົ້ນທຶນການເຮັດວຽກພໍໆກັນກັບການໃຊ້ mipmaps."

msgid ""
"Nearest-neighbor filter for light projectors (use for pixel art light "
"projectors). Isotropic mipmaps are used for rendering, which means light "
"projectors at a distance will look smooth but blurry. This has roughly the "
"same performance cost as not using mipmaps."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີ Nearest-neighbor ສຳລັບຕົວສາຍແສງ (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕົວສາຍແສງແບບ pixel art). ມີການໃຊ້ "
"Isotropic mipmaps ໃນການເຣນເດີ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຕົວສາຍແສງໃນໄລຍະໄກຈະເບິ່ງລຽບແຕ່ມົວ. "
"ອັນນີ້ມີຕົ້ນທຶນການເຮັດວຽກພໍໆກັນກັບການບໍ່ໃຊ້ mipmaps."

msgid ""
"Linear filter for light projectors (use for non-pixel art light projectors). "
"Isotropic mipmaps are used for rendering, which means light projectors at a "
"distance will look smooth but blurry. This has roughly the same performance "
"cost as not using mipmaps."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີ Linear ສຳລັບຕົວສາຍແສງ (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕົວສາຍແສງທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ pixel art). ມີການໃຊ້ Isotropic "
"mipmaps ໃນການເຣນເດີ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຕົວສາຍແສງໃນໄລຍະໄກຈະເບິ່ງລຽບແຕ່ມົວ. "
"ອັນນີ້ມີຕົ້ນທຶນການເຮັດວຽກພໍໆກັນກັບການບໍ່ໃຊ້ mipmaps."

msgid ""
"Nearest-neighbor filter for light projectors (use for pixel art light "
"projectors). Anisotropic mipmaps are used for rendering, which means light "
"projectors at a distance will look smooth and sharp when viewed from oblique "
"angles. This looks better compared to isotropic mipmaps, but is slower. The "
"level of anisotropic filtering is defined by [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"anisotropic_filtering_level]."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີ Nearest-neighbor ສຳລັບຕົວສາຍແສງ (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕົວສາຍແສງແບບ pixel art). ມີການໃຊ້ "
"Anisotropic mipmaps ໃນການເຣນເດີ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຕົວສາຍແສງໃນໄລຍະໄກຈະເບິ່ງລຽບ ແລະ "
"ຄົມຊັດເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກມຸມສະຫຼຽງ. ອັນນີ້ເບິ່ງດີກວ່າເມື່ອທຽບກັບ isotropic mipmaps ແຕ່ຈະຊ້າກວ່າ. ລະດັບຂອງ "
"anisotropic filtering ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/anisotropic_filtering_level]."

msgid ""
"Linear filter for light projectors (use for non-pixel art light projectors). "
"Anisotropic mipmaps are used for rendering, which means light projectors at a "
"distance will look smooth and sharp when viewed from oblique angles. This "
"looks better compared to isotropic mipmaps, but is slower. The level of "
"anisotropic filtering is defined by [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"textures/default_filters/anisotropic_filtering_level]."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີ Linear ສຳລັບຕົວສາຍແສງ (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕົວສາຍແສງທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ pixel art). ມີການໃຊ້ Anisotropic "
"mipmaps ໃນການເຣນເດີ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຕົວສາຍແສງໃນໄລຍະໄກຈະເບິ່ງລຽບ ແລະ "
"ຄົມຊັດເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກມຸມສະຫຼຽງ. ອັນນີ້ເບິ່ງດີກວ່າເມື່ອທຽບກັບ isotropic mipmaps ແຕ່ຈະຊ້າກວ່າ. ລະດັບຂອງ "
"anisotropic filtering ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/anisotropic_filtering_level]."

msgid "Directional (sun/moon) light (see [DirectionalLight3D])."
msgstr "ແສງແບບມີທິດທາງ (ດວງອາທິດ/ດວງຈັນ) (ເບິ່ງ [DirectionalLight3D])."

msgid "Omni light (see [OmniLight3D])."
msgstr "ແສງຮອບທິດທາງ (ເບິ່ງ [OmniLight3D])."

msgid "Spot light (see [SpotLight3D])."
msgstr "ແສງສ່ອງສະເພາະຈຸດ (ເບິ່ງ [SpotLight3D])."

msgid "Area light (see [AreaLight3D])."
msgstr "ແສງແບບພື້ນທີ່ (Area light) (ເບິ່ງ [AreaLight3D])."

msgid "The light's energy multiplier."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນພະລັງງານຂອງແສງ."

msgid ""
"The light's indirect energy multiplier (final indirect energy is [constant "
"LIGHT_PARAM_ENERGY] * [constant LIGHT_PARAM_INDIRECT_ENERGY])."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນພະລັງງານແສງທາງອ້ອມ (ພະລັງງານທາງອ້ອມສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນ [constant LIGHT_PARAM_ENERGY] * "
"[constant LIGHT_PARAM_INDIRECT_ENERGY])."

msgid ""
"The light's volumetric fog energy multiplier (final volumetric fog energy is "
"[constant LIGHT_PARAM_ENERGY] * [constant LIGHT_PARAM_VOLUMETRIC_FOG_ENERGY])."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນພະລັງງານແສງໝອກປະລິມານ (volumetric fog) (ພະລັງງານໝອກປະລິມານສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນ [constant "
"LIGHT_PARAM_ENERGY] * [constant LIGHT_PARAM_VOLUMETRIC_FOG_ENERGY])."

msgid "The light's influence on specularity."
msgstr "ອິດທິພົນຂອງແສງຕໍ່ກັບການສະທ້ອນແສງ (specularity)."

msgid "The light's range."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຂອງແສງ."

msgid ""
"The size of the light when using spot light or omni light. The angular size "
"of the light when using directional light."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງແສງເມື່ອໃຊ້ spot light ຫຼື omni light. ຂະໜາດມຸມຂອງແສງເມື່ອໃຊ້ directional "
"light."

msgid "The light's attenuation."
msgstr "ການຫຼຸດລົງຂອງແສງ (attenuation)."

msgid "The spotlight's angle."
msgstr "ມຸມຂອງ spotlight."

msgid "The spotlight's attenuation."
msgstr "ການຫຼຸດລົງຂອງ spotlight."

msgid "Proportion of shadow atlas occupied by the first split."
msgstr "ສັດສ່ວນຂອງ shadow atlas ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍການແຍກ (split) ຄັ້ງທຳອິດ."

msgid "Proportion of shadow atlas occupied by the second split."
msgstr "ສັດສ່ວນຂອງ shadow atlas ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍການແຍກ (split) ຄັ້ງທີສອງ."

msgid ""
"Proportion of shadow atlas occupied by the third split. The fourth split "
"occupies the rest."
msgstr ""
"ສັດສ່ວນຂອງ shadow atlas ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍການແຍກ (split) ຄັ້ງທີສາມ. "
"ການແຍກຄັ້ງທີສີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Proportion of shadow max distance where the shadow will start to fade out."
msgstr "ສັດສ່ວນຂອງໄລຍະເງົາສູງສຸດທີ່ເງົາຈະເລີ່ມຈາງຫາຍໄປ (fade out)."

msgid ""
"Normal bias used to offset shadow lookup by object normal. Can be used to fix "
"self-shadowing artifacts."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ Bias ຂອງນໍມໍທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລື່ອນການຊອກຫາເງົາຕາມນໍມໍຂອງວັດຖຸ. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເງົາທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນເທິງຕົວມັນເອງ (self-shadowing artifacts)."

msgid "Bias for the shadow lookup to fix self-shadowing artifacts."
msgstr "ຄ່າ Bias ສຳລັບການຊອກຫາເງົາເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເງົາທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນເທິງຕົວມັນເອງ."

msgid ""
"The light's shadow opacity. Values lower than [code]1.0[/code] make the light "
"appear through shadows. This can be used to fake global illumination at a low "
"performance cost."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມທຶບແສງຂອງເງົາ. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງສາມາດຜ່ານເງົາໄດ້. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຳລອງ global illumination ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຕ່ຳ."

msgid ""
"Blurs the edges of the shadow. Can be used to hide pixel artifacts in low "
"resolution shadow maps. A high value can make shadows appear grainy and can "
"cause other unwanted artifacts. Try to keep as near default as possible."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບຂອງເງົາມົວ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອງ pixel artifacts ໃນ shadow maps "
"ທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງເກີນໄປອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາເບິ່ງເປັນເມັດ (grainy) ແລະ "
"ເກີດບັນຫາອື່ນໆທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ. ພະຍາຍາມຮັກສາຄ່າໃຫ້ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Constant representing the intensity of the light, measured in Lumens when "
"dealing with a [SpotLight3D] or [OmniLight3D], or measured in Lux with a "
"[DirectionalLight3D]. Only used when [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lights_and_shadows/use_physical_light_units] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງ, ວັດແທກເປັນ Lumens ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [SpotLight3D] ຫຼື "
"[OmniLight3D], ຫຼື ວັດແທກເປັນ Lux ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [DirectionalLight3D]. ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/use_physical_light_units] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum LightParam] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum LightParam]."

msgid ""
"Light is ignored when baking. This is the fastest mode, but the light will be "
"taken into account when baking global illumination. This mode should "
"generally be used for dynamic lights that change quickly, as the effect of "
"global illumination is less noticeable on those lights."
msgstr ""
"ແສງຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນໃນເວລາ baking. ນີ້ແມ່ນໂໝດທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ແສງຈະຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ນຳ ໃນເວລາ bake "
"global illumination. ໂໝດນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ກັບແສງແບບໄດນາມິກທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງໄວ, ເນື່ອງຈາກຜົນຂອງ global "
"illumination ຈະສັງເກດເຫັນໄດ້ໜ້ອຍໃນແສງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Light is taken into account in static baking ([VoxelGI], [LightmapGI], SDFGI "
"([member Environment.sdfgi_enabled])). The light can be moved around or "
"modified, but its global illumination will not update in real-time. This is "
"suitable for subtle changes (such as flickering torches), but generally not "
"large changes such as toggling a light on and off."
msgstr ""
"ແສງຈະຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ໃນການ bake ແບບສະແຕຕິກ ([VoxelGI], [LightmapGI], SDFGI ([member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled])). ແສງສາມາດຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້, ແຕ່ global illumination "
"ຂອງມັນຈະບໍ່ອັບເດດແບບຣຽວໄທມ໌. ເໝາະສຳລັບການປ່ຽນແປງເລັກນ້ອຍ (ເຊັ່ນ ແສງທຽນທີ່ກະພິບ), "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ເໝາະສຳລັບການປ່ຽນແປງໃຫຍ່ໆ ເຊັ່ນ ການເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໄຟ."

msgid ""
"Light is taken into account in dynamic baking ([VoxelGI] and SDFGI ([member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled]) only). The light can be moved around or modified "
"with global illumination updating in real-time. The light's global "
"illumination appearance will be slightly different compared to [constant "
"LIGHT_BAKE_STATIC]. This has a greater performance cost compared to [constant "
"LIGHT_BAKE_STATIC]. When using SDFGI, the update speed of dynamic lights is "
"affected by [member ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/"
"frames_to_update_lights]."
msgstr ""
"ແສງຈະຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ໃນການ bake ແບບໄດນາມິກ ([VoxelGI] ແລະ SDFGI ([member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled]) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ). ແສງສາມາດຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂ ໂດຍທີ່ global "
"illumination ຈະອັບເດດແບບຣຽວໄທມ໌. ຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງ global illumination "
"ຈະແຕກຕ່າງເລັກນ້ອຍເມື່ອທຽບກັບ [constant LIGHT_BAKE_STATIC]. ອັນນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍກວ່າ. "
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ SDFGI, ຄວາມໄວໃນການອັບເດດຂອງແສງໄດນາມິກ ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/frames_to_update_lights]."

msgid "Use a dual paraboloid shadow map for omni lights."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ dual paraboloid shadow map ສຳລັບ omni lights."

msgid ""
"Use a cubemap shadow map for omni lights. Slower but better quality than dual "
"paraboloid."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ cubemap shadow map ສຳລັບ omni lights. ຊ້າກວ່າແຕ່ຄຸນນະພາບດີກວ່າ dual paraboloid."

msgid "Use orthogonal shadow projection for directional light."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ orthogonal shadow projection ສຳລັບ directional light."

msgid "Use 2 splits for shadow projection when using directional light."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ 2 splits ສຳລັບ shadow projection ເມື່ອໃຊ້ directional light."

msgid "Use 4 splits for shadow projection when using directional light."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ 4 splits ສຳລັບ shadow projection ເມື່ອໃຊ້ directional light."

msgid "Use DirectionalLight3D in both sky rendering and scene lighting."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ DirectionalLight3D ທັງໃນການເຣນເດີທ້ອງຟ້າ ແລະ ແສງສະຫວ່າງໃນສາກ."

msgid "Only use DirectionalLight3D in scene lighting."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ DirectionalLight3D ສະເພາະໃນແສງສະຫວ່າງໃນສາກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Only use DirectionalLight3D in sky rendering."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ DirectionalLight3D ສະເພາະໃນການເຣນເດີທ້ອງຟ້າເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Lowest shadow filtering quality (fastest). Soft shadows are not available "
"with this quality setting, which means the [member Light3D.shadow_blur] "
"property is ignored if [member Light3D.light_size] and [member "
"Light3D.light_angular_distance] is [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The variable shadow blur performed by [member "
"Light3D.light_size] and [member Light3D.light_angular_distance] is still "
"effective when using hard shadow filtering. In this case, [member "
"Light3D.shadow_blur] [i]is[/i] taken into account. However, the results will "
"not be blurred, instead the blur amount is treated as a maximum radius for "
"the penumbra."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບ shadow filtering ຕ່ຳສຸດ (ໄວທີ່ສຸດ). Soft shadows ຈະບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ [member Light3D.shadow_blur] ຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນຖ້າ [member "
"Light3D.light_size] ແລະ [member Light3D.light_angular_distance] ເປັນ "
"[code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Variable shadow blur ທີ່ເຮັດໂດຍ [member Light3D.light_size] ແລະ "
"[member Light3D.light_angular_distance] ຍັງຄົງມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ hard shadow filtering. "
"ໃນກໍລະນີນີ, [member Light3D.shadow_blur] [i]ຈະ[/i] ຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ນຳ. ແຕ່ຜົນທີ່ໄດ້ຈະບໍ່ມົວ, "
"ແຕ່ຄ່າຄວາມມົວຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດເປັນລັດສະໝີສູງສຸດຂອງ penumbra."

msgid ""
"Very low shadow filtering quality (faster). When using this quality setting, "
"[member Light3D.shadow_blur] is automatically multiplied by 0.75× to avoid "
"introducing too much noise. This division only applies to lights whose "
"[member Light3D.light_size] or [member Light3D.light_angular_distance] is "
"[code]0.0[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບ shadow filtering ຕ່ຳຫຼາຍ (ໄວຫຼາຍ). ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, [member "
"Light3D.shadow_blur] ຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍ 0.75× ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນ noise ທີ່ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. "
"ການຄູນນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບແສງທີ່ [member Light3D.light_size] ຫຼື [member "
"Light3D.light_angular_distance] ເປັນ [code]0.0[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Low shadow filtering quality (fast)."
msgstr "ຄຸນນະພາບ shadow filtering ຕ່ຳ (ໄວ)."

msgid "Medium low shadow filtering quality (average)."
msgstr "ຄຸນນະພາບ shadow filtering ປານກາງ-ຕ່ຳ (ສະເລ່ຍ)."

msgid ""
"High low shadow filtering quality (slow). When using this quality setting, "
"[member Light3D.shadow_blur] is automatically multiplied by 1.5× to better "
"make use of the high sample count. This increased blur also improves the "
"stability of dynamic object shadows. This multiplier only applies to lights "
"whose [member Light3D.light_size] or [member Light3D.light_angular_distance] "
"is [code]0.0[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບ shadow filtering ສູງ-ຕ່ຳ (ຊ້າ). ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, [member "
"Light3D.shadow_blur] ຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍ 1.5× ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກຈຳນວນ sample "
"ທີ່ສູງໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ. ຄວາມມົວທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນນີ້ຍັງຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງຄວາມຄົງທີ່ຂອງເງົາວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກ. ຕົວຄູນນີ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບແສງທີ່ "
"[member Light3D.light_size] ຫຼື [member Light3D.light_angular_distance] ເປັນ "
"[code]0.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"Highest low shadow filtering quality (slowest). When using this quality "
"setting, [member Light3D.shadow_blur] is automatically multiplied by 2× to "
"better make use of the high sample count. This increased blur also improves "
"the stability of dynamic object shadows. This multiplier only applies to "
"lights whose [member Light3D.light_size] or [member "
"Light3D.light_angular_distance] is [code]0.0[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບ shadow filtering ຕ່ຳທີ່ສູງທີ່ສຸດ (ຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ). ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, [member "
"Light3D.shadow_blur] ຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍ 2× ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກຈຳນວນ sample "
"ທີ່ສູງໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ. ຄວາມມົວທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນນີ້ຍັງຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງຄວາມຄົງທີ່ຂອງເງົາວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກ. ຕົວຄູນນີ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບແສງທີ່ "
"[member Light3D.light_size] ຫຼື [member Light3D.light_angular_distance] ເປັນ "
"[code]0.0[/code]."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ShadowQuality] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ShadowQuality]."

msgid "Reflection probe will update reflections once and then stop."
msgstr "Reflection probe ຈະອັບເດດການສະທ້ອນຄັ້ງດຽວແລ້ວຢຸດ."

msgid ""
"Reflection probe will update each frame. This mode is necessary to capture "
"moving objects."
msgstr "Reflection probe ຈະອັບເດດທຸກໆເຟຣມ. ໂໝດນີ້ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການເກັບພາບວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່."

msgid ""
"Do not apply any ambient lighting inside the reflection probe's box defined "
"by its size."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ນຳໃຊ້ ambient lighting ໃດໆ ພາຍໃນຂອບເຂດ (box) ຂອງ reflection probe "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍຂະໜາດຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Apply automatically-sourced environment lighting inside the reflection "
"probe's box defined by its size."
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ environment lighting ຈາກແຫຼ່ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ ພາຍໃນຂອບເຂດຂອງ reflection probe "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍຂະໜາດຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Apply custom ambient lighting inside the reflection probe's box defined by "
"its size. See [method reflection_probe_set_ambient_color] and [method "
"reflection_probe_set_ambient_energy]."
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ ambient lighting ແບບກຳນົດເອງ ພາຍໃນຂອບເຂດຂອງ reflection probe "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍຂະໜາດຂອງມັນ. ເບິ່ງ [method reflection_probe_set_ambient_color] ແລະ "
"[method reflection_probe_set_ambient_energy]."

msgid "Albedo texture slot in a decal ([member Decal.texture_albedo])."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງໃສ່ Albedo texture ໃນ decal ([member Decal.texture_albedo])."

msgid "Normal map texture slot in a decal ([member Decal.texture_normal])."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງໃສ່ Normal map texture ໃນ decal ([member Decal.texture_normal])."

msgid ""
"Occlusion/Roughness/Metallic texture slot in a decal ([member "
"Decal.texture_orm])."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງໃສ່ Occlusion/Roughness/Metallic texture ໃນ decal ([member "
"Decal.texture_orm])."

msgid "Emission texture slot in a decal ([member Decal.texture_emission])."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງໃສ່ Emission texture ໃນ decal ([member Decal.texture_emission])."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum DecalTexture] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum DecalTexture]."

msgid ""
"Nearest-neighbor filter for decals (use for pixel art decals). No mipmaps are "
"used for rendering, which means decals at a distance will look sharp but "
"grainy. This has roughly the same performance cost as using mipmaps."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີ Nearest-neighbor ສຳລັບ decals (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ pixel art decals). ບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ mipmaps "
"ໃນການເຣນເດີ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ decals ໃນໄລຍະໄກຈະເບິ່ງຄົມຊັດແຕ່ເປັນເມັດ. "
"ອັນນີ້ມີຕົ້ນທຶນການເຮັດວຽກພໍໆກັນກັບການໃຊ້ mipmaps."

msgid ""
"Linear filter for decals (use for non-pixel art decals). No mipmaps are used "
"for rendering, which means decals at a distance will look smooth but blurry. "
"This has roughly the same performance cost as using mipmaps."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີ Linear ສຳລັບ decals (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ decals ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ pixel art). ບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ mipmaps "
"ໃນການເຣນເດີ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ decals ໃນໄລຍະໄກຈະເບິ່ງລຽບແຕ່ມົວ. "
"ອັນນີ້ມີຕົ້ນທຶນການເຮັດວຽກພໍໆກັນກັບການໃຊ້ mipmaps."

msgid ""
"Nearest-neighbor filter for decals (use for pixel art decals). Isotropic "
"mipmaps are used for rendering, which means decals at a distance will look "
"smooth but blurry. This has roughly the same performance cost as not using "
"mipmaps."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີ Nearest-neighbor ສຳລັບ decals (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ pixel art decals). ໃຊ້ isotropic "
"mipmaps ໃນການເຣນເດີ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ decals ໃນໄລຍະໄກຈະເບິ່ງລຽບແຕ່ມົວ. "
"ອັນນີ້ມີຕົ້ນທຶນການເຮັດວຽກພໍໆກັນກັບການບໍ່ໃຊ້ mipmaps."

msgid ""
"Linear filter for decals (use for non-pixel art decals). Isotropic mipmaps "
"are used for rendering, which means decals at a distance will look smooth but "
"blurry. This has roughly the same performance cost as not using mipmaps."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີ Linear ສຳລັບ decals (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ decals ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ pixel art). ໃຊ້ isotropic mipmaps "
"ໃນການເຣນເດີ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ decals ໃນໄລຍະໄກຈະເບິ່ງລຽບແຕ່ມົວ. "
"ອັນນີ້ມີຕົ້ນທຶນການເຮັດວຽກພໍໆກັນກັບການບໍ່ໃຊ້ mipmaps."

msgid ""
"Nearest-neighbor filter for decals (use for pixel art decals). Anisotropic "
"mipmaps are used for rendering, which means decals at a distance will look "
"smooth and sharp when viewed from oblique angles. This looks better compared "
"to isotropic mipmaps, but is slower. The level of anisotropic filtering is "
"defined by [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"anisotropic_filtering_level]."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີ Nearest-neighbor ສຳລັບ decals (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ pixel art decals). ໃຊ້ anisotropic "
"mipmaps ໃນການເຣນເດີ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ decals ໃນໄລຍະໄກຈະເບິ່ງລຽບ ແລະ "
"ຄົມຊັດເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກມຸມສະຫຼຽງ. ອັນນີ້ເບິ່ງດີກວ່າເມື່ອທຽບກັບ isotropic mipmaps ແຕ່ຊ້າກວ່າ. ລະດັບ "
"anisotropic filtering ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/anisotropic_filtering_level]."

msgid ""
"Linear filter for decals (use for non-pixel art decals). Anisotropic mipmaps "
"are used for rendering, which means decals at a distance will look smooth and "
"sharp when viewed from oblique angles. This looks better compared to "
"isotropic mipmaps, but is slower. The level of anisotropic filtering is "
"defined by [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"anisotropic_filtering_level]."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີ Linear ສຳລັບ decals (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ decals ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ pixel art). ໃຊ້ anisotropic "
"mipmaps ໃນການເຣນເດີ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ decals ໃນໄລຍະໄກຈະເບິ່ງລຽບ ແລະ "
"ຄົມຊັດເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກມຸມສະຫຼຽງ. ອັນນີ້ເບິ່ງດີກວ່າເມື່ອທຽບກັບ isotropic mipmaps ແຕ່ຊ້າກວ່າ. ລະດັບ "
"anisotropic filtering ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/anisotropic_filtering_level]."

msgid "Low [VoxelGI] rendering quality using 4 cones."
msgstr "ຄຸນນະພາບການເຣນເດີ [VoxelGI] ຕ່ຳ ໂດຍໃຊ້ 4 cones."

msgid "High [VoxelGI] rendering quality using 6 cones."
msgstr "ຄຸນນະພາບການເຣນເດີ [VoxelGI] ສູງ ໂດຍໃຊ້ 6 cones."

msgid "2D particles."
msgstr "ອະນຸພາກ (particles) ແບບ 2D."

msgid "3D particles."
msgstr "ອະນຸພາກ (particles) ແບບ 3D."

msgid "Billboard each particles around a local axis."
msgstr "ເຮັດ Billboard ໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກອ້ອມແກນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local axis)."

msgid "Do not read from CUSTOM when performing billboarding."
msgstr "ບໍ່ອ່ານຄ່າຈາກ CUSTOM ເມື່ອເຮັດ billboarding."

msgid ""
"Read from [code]CUSTOM.x[/code] when performing billboarding and use it as an "
"angle, in radians."
msgstr ""
"ອ່ານຈາກ [code]CUSTOM.x[/code] ເມື່ອເຮັດ billboarding ແລະ ໃຊ້ມັນເປັນມຸມ, ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ "
"(radians)."

msgid ""
"Read from [code]CUSTOM.y[/code] when performing billboarding and use it as an "
"angle, in radians."
msgstr ""
"ອ່ານຈາກ [code]CUSTOM.y[/code] ເມື່ອເຮັດ billboarding ແລະ ໃຊ້ມັນເປັນມຸມ, ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ "
"(radians)."

msgid ""
"Read from [code]CUSTOM.z[/code] when performing billboarding and use it as an "
"angle, in radians."
msgstr ""
"ອ່ານຈາກ [code]CUSTOM.z[/code] ເມື່ອເຮັດ billboarding ແລະ ໃຊ້ມັນເປັນມຸມ, ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ "
"(radians)."

msgid ""
"Read from [code]CUSTOM.w[/code] when performing billboarding and use it as an "
"angle, in radians."
msgstr ""
"ອ່ານຈາກ [code]CUSTOM.w[/code] ເມື່ອເຮັດ billboarding ແລະ ໃຊ້ມັນເປັນມຸມ, ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ "
"(radians)."

msgid "Use the X axis for local billboarding."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ແກນ X ສຳລັບ local billboarding."

msgid "Use the Y axis for local billboarding."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ແກນ Y ສຳລັບ local billboarding."

msgid "Draw particles in the order that they appear in the particles array."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມອະນຸພາກຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ພວກມັນປະກົດໃນອາເຣອະນຸພາກ (particles array)."

msgid ""
"Sort particles based on their lifetime. In other words, the particle with the "
"highest lifetime is drawn at the front."
msgstr ""
"ຮຽງລຳດັບອະນຸພາກຕາມອາຍຸ (lifetime). ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງແມ່ນ ອະນຸພາກທີ່ມີອາຍຸຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ "
"ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໄວ້ທາງໜ້າ."

msgid ""
"Sort particles based on the inverse of their lifetime. In other words, the "
"particle with the lowest lifetime is drawn at the front."
msgstr ""
"ຮຽງລຳດັບອະນຸພາກຕາມຄ່າປີ້ນຂອງອາຍຸ. ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງແມ່ນ ອະນຸພາກທີ່ມີອາຍຸໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໄວ້ທາງໜ້າ."

msgid "Sort particles based on their distance to the camera."
msgstr "ຮຽງລຳດັບອະນຸພາກຕາມໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Sphere attractor type for [GPUParticles3D] (see "
"[GPUParticlesAttractorSphere3D])."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຕົວດຶງດູດ (attractor) ແບບຊົງກົມ ສຳລັບ [GPUParticles3D] (ເບິ່ງ "
"[GPUParticlesAttractorSphere3D])."

msgid ""
"Box attractor type for [GPUParticles3D] (see [GPUParticlesAttractorBox3D])."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຕົວດຶງດູດ (attractor) ແບບກ່ອງ ສຳລັບ [GPUParticles3D] (ເບິ່ງ "
"[GPUParticlesAttractorBox3D])."

msgid ""
"Vector field attractor type for [GPUParticles3D] (see "
"[GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D])."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຕົວດຶງດູດ (attractor) ແບບ vector field ສຳລັບ [GPUParticles3D] (ເບິ່ງ "
"[GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D])."

msgid ""
"Sphere collision type for [GPUParticles3D] (see "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionSphere3D])."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດການຕຳ (collision) ແບບຊົງກົມ ສຳລັບ [GPUParticles3D] (ເບິ່ງ "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionSphere3D])."

msgid ""
"Box collision type for [GPUParticles3D] (see [GPUParticlesCollisionBox3D])."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດການຕຳ (collision) ແບບກ່ອງ ສຳລັບ [GPUParticles3D] (ເບິ່ງ "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionBox3D])."

msgid ""
"Signed distance field collision type for [GPUParticles3D] (see "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D])."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດການຕຳ (collision) ແບບ Signed distance field (SDF) ສຳລັບ [GPUParticles3D] "
"(ເບິ່ງ [GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D])."

msgid ""
"Heightfield collision type for [GPUParticles3D] (see "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D])."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດການຕຳ (collision) ແບບ Heightfield ສຳລັບ [GPUParticles3D] (ເບິ່ງ "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D])."

msgid "256×256 heightfield resolution for [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມລະອຽດ heightfield ແບບ 256×256 ສຳລັບ [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D]."

msgid "512×512 heightfield resolution for [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມລະອຽດ heightfield ແບບ 512×512 ສຳລັບ [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D]."

msgid ""
"1024×1024 heightfield resolution for [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມລະອຽດ heightfield ແບບ 1024×1024 ສຳລັບ [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D]."

msgid ""
"2048×2048 heightfield resolution for [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມລະອຽດ heightfield ແບບ 2048×2048 ສຳລັບ [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D]."

msgid ""
"4096×4096 heightfield resolution for [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມລະອຽດ heightfield ແບບ 4096×4096 ສຳລັບ [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D]."

msgid ""
"8192×8192 heightfield resolution for [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມລະອຽດ heightfield ແບບ 8192×8192 ສຳລັບ [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D]."

msgid ""
"Represents the size of the [enum ParticlesCollisionHeightfieldResolution] "
"enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ParticlesCollisionHeightfieldResolution]."

msgid "[FogVolume] will be shaped like an ellipsoid (stretched sphere)."
msgstr "[FogVolume] ຈະມີຮູບຊົງຄືກັບຊົງຮີ (ຊົງກົມທີ່ຖືກຢືດ)."

msgid ""
"[FogVolume] will be shaped like a cone pointing upwards (in local "
"coordinates). The cone's angle is set automatically to fill the size. The "
"cone will be adjusted to fit within the size. Rotate the [FogVolume] node to "
"reorient the cone. Non-uniform scaling via size is not supported (scale the "
"[FogVolume] node instead)."
msgstr ""
"[FogVolume] ຈະມີຮູບຊົງຄືກັບຈວຍທີ່ຊີ້ຂຶ້ນເທິງ (ໃນພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ). "
"ມຸມຂອງຈວຍຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຕັມຂະໜາດ. ຈວຍຈະຖືກປັບໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບຂະໜາດ. ໝູນໂນດ "
"[FogVolume] ເພື່ອປ່ຽນທິດທາງຂອງຈວຍ. ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການປັບຂະໜາດແບບບໍ່ສະເໝີພາບ (non-uniform "
"scaling) ຜ່ານ property size (ໃຫ້ປັບ scale ທີ່ໂນດ [FogVolume] ແທນ)."

msgid ""
"[FogVolume] will be shaped like an upright cylinder (in local coordinates). "
"Rotate the [FogVolume] node to reorient the cylinder. The cylinder will be "
"adjusted to fit within the size. Non-uniform scaling via size is not "
"supported (scale the [FogVolume] node instead)."
msgstr ""
"[FogVolume] ຈະມີຮູບຊົງຄືກັບທໍ່ຊົງກະບອກຕັ້ງຊື່ (ໃນພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ). ໝູນໂນດ [FogVolume] "
"ເພື່ອປ່ຽນທິດທາງຂອງທໍ່ຊົງກະບອກ. ທໍ່ຊົງກະບອກຈະຖືກປັບໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບຂະໜາດ. "
"ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການປັບຂະໜາດແບບບໍ່ສະເໝີພາບ ຜ່ານ property size (ໃຫ້ປັບ scale ທີ່ໂນດ [FogVolume] "
"ແທນ)."

msgid "[FogVolume] will be shaped like a box."
msgstr "[FogVolume] ຈະມີຮູບຊົງຄືກັບກ່ອງ."

msgid ""
"[FogVolume] will have no shape, will cover the whole world and will not be "
"culled."
msgstr "[FogVolume] ຈະບໍ່ມີຮູບຊົງ, ຈະຄອບຄຸມທັງໂລກ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຄັດອອກ (culled)."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum FogVolumeShape] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum FogVolumeShape]."

msgid ""
"Use bilinear scaling for the viewport's 3D buffer. The amount of scaling can "
"be set using [member Viewport.scaling_3d_scale]. Values less than [code]1.0[/"
"code] will result in undersampling while values greater than [code]1.0[/code] "
"will result in supersampling. A value of [code]1.0[/code] disables scaling."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ bilinear scaling ສຳລັບ 3D buffer ຂອງ viewport. ປະລິມານການປັບຂະໜາດ "
"ສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member Viewport.scaling_3d_scale]. ຄ່າທີ່ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ undersampling ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ "
"supersampling. ຄ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ຈະປິດການປັບຂະໜາດ."

msgid ""
"Use AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 1.0 upscaling for the viewport's 3D "
"buffer. The amount of scaling can be set using [member "
"Viewport.scaling_3d_scale]. Values less than [code]1.0[/code] will result in "
"the viewport being upscaled using FSR. Values greater than [code]1.0[/code] "
"are not supported and bilinear downsampling will be used instead. A value of "
"[code]1.0[/code] disables scaling."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 1.0 upscaling ສຳລັບ 3D buffer ຂອງ viewport. "
"ປະລິມານການປັບຂະໜາດສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member Viewport.scaling_3d_scale]. ຄ່າທີ່ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ "
"[code]1.0[/code] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ viewport ຖືກຂະຫຍາຍ (upscaled) ໂດຍໃຊ້ FSR. "
"ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ແລະ ຈະໃຊ້ bilinear downsampling ແທນ. ຄ່າ "
"[code]1.0[/code] ຈະປິດການປັບຂະໜາດ."

msgid ""
"Use AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 2.2 upscaling for the viewport's 3D "
"buffer. The amount of scaling can be set using [member "
"Viewport.scaling_3d_scale]. Values less than [code]1.0[/code] will result in "
"the viewport being upscaled using FSR2. Values greater than [code]1.0[/code] "
"are not supported and bilinear downsampling will be used instead. A value of "
"[code]1.0[/code] will use FSR2 at native resolution as a TAA solution."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 2.2 upscaling ສຳລັບ 3D buffer ຂອງ viewport. "
"ປະລິມານການປັບຂະໜາດສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member Viewport.scaling_3d_scale]. ຄ່າທີ່ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ "
"[code]1.0[/code] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ viewport ຖືກຂະຫຍາຍໂດຍໃຊ້ FSR2. ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ "
"[code]1.0[/code] ແລະ ຈະໃຊ້ bilinear downsampling ແທນ. ຄ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ຈະໃຊ້ "
"FSR2 ທີ່ຄວາມລະອຽດເດີມ (native resolution) ເປັນວິທີແກ້ໄຂ TAA."

msgid ""
"Use MetalFX spatial upscaling for the viewport's 3D buffer. The amount of "
"scaling can be set using [member Viewport.scaling_3d_scale]. Values less than "
"[code]1.0[/code] will result in the viewport being upscaled using MetalFX. "
"Values greater than [code]1.0[/code] are not supported and bilinear "
"downsampling will be used instead. A value of [code]1.0[/code] disables "
"scaling.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when the Metal rendering driver is in use, which "
"limits this scaling mode to macOS and iOS."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ MetalFX spatial upscaling ສຳລັບ 3D buffer ຂອງ viewport. ປະລິມານການປັບຂະໜາດ "
"ສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member Viewport.scaling_3d_scale]. ຄ່າທີ່ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ viewport ຖືກຂະຫຍາຍໂດຍໃຊ້ MetalFX. ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ແລະ "
"ຈະໃຊ້ bilinear downsampling ແທນ. ຄ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ຈະປິດການປັບຂະໜາດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ Metal rendering driver ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈຳກັດໂໝດການປັບຂະໜາດນີ້ໄວ້ສະເພາະ macOS ແລະ iOS."

msgid ""
"Use MetalFX temporal upscaling for the viewport's 3D buffer. The amount of "
"scaling can be set using [member Viewport.scaling_3d_scale]. Values less than "
"[code]1.0[/code] will result in the viewport being upscaled using MetalFX. "
"Values greater than [code]1.0[/code] are not supported and bilinear "
"downsampling will be used instead. A value of [code]1.0[/code] will use "
"MetalFX at native resolution as a TAA solution.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when the Metal rendering driver is in use, which "
"limits this scaling mode to macOS and iOS."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ MetalFX temporal upscaling ສຳລັບ 3D buffer ຂອງ viewport. ປະລິມານການປັບຂະໜາດ "
"ສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member Viewport.scaling_3d_scale]. ຄ່າທີ່ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ viewport ຖືກຂະຫຍາຍໂດຍໃຊ້ MetalFX. ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ແລະ "
"ຈະໃຊ້ bilinear downsampling ແທນ. ຄ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ຈະໃຊ້ MetalFX "
"ທີ່ຄວາມລະອຽດເດີມເປັນວິທີແກ້ໄຂ TAA.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ Metal rendering driver ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈຳກັດໂໝດການປັບຂະໜາດນີ້ໄວ້ສະເພາະ macOS ແລະ iOS."

msgid ""
"Use nearest-neighbor filtering for the viewport's 3D buffer. This looks "
"crisper than [constant VIEWPORT_SCALING_3D_MODE_BILINEAR] and has no "
"additional rendering cost. The amount of scaling can be set using [member "
"Viewport.scaling_3d_scale]. Values greater than [code]1.0[/code] are not "
"supported and bilinear downsampling will be used instead. A value of "
"[code]1.0[/code] disables scaling.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the [b]Nearest[/b] scaling mode, to avoid uneven "
"pixel scaling, it's highly recommended to use a value equal to an integer "
"divisor with a dividend of [code]1[/code]. For example, it's best to use a "
"scale of [code]0.5[/code] (1/2), [code]0.3333[/code] (1/3), [code]0.25[/code] "
"(1/4), [code]0.2[/code] (1/5), and so on."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ nearest-neighbor filtering ສຳລັບ 3D buffer ຂອງ viewport. ອັນນີ້ຈະເບິ່ງຄົມຊັດກວ່າ "
"[constant VIEWPORT_SCALING_3D_MODE_BILINEAR] ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຕົ້ນທຶນການເຣນເດີເພີ່ມເຕີມ. "
"ປະລິມານການປັບຂະໜາດ ສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member Viewport.scaling_3d_scale]. "
"ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ແລະ ຈະໃຊ້ bilinear downsampling ແທນ. ຄ່າ "
"[code]1.0[/code] ຈະປິດການປັບຂະໜາດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ [b]Nearest[/b] scaling, "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການປັບຂະໜາດພິກເຊວທີ່ບໍ່ສະເໝີກັນ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ເທົ່າກັບຕົວຫານເລກເຕັມທີ່ມີຕົວຕັ້ງແມ່ນ "
"[code]1[/code]. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄວນໃຊ້ scale ເປັນ [code]0.5[/code] (1/2), [code]0.3333[/"
"code] (1/3), [code]0.25[/code] (1/4), [code]0.2[/code] (1/5), ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ViewportScaling3DMode] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ViewportScaling3DMode]."

msgid "Do not update the viewport's render target."
msgstr "ບໍ່ອັບເດດ render target ຂອງ viewport."

msgid ""
"Update the viewport's render target once, then switch to [constant "
"VIEWPORT_UPDATE_DISABLED]."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດ render target ຂອງ viewport ຄັ້ງດຽວ, ແລ້ວປ່ຽນໄປເປັນ [constant "
"VIEWPORT_UPDATE_DISABLED]."

msgid ""
"Update the viewport's render target only when it is visible. This is the "
"default value."
msgstr "ອັບເດດ render target ຂອງ viewport ເມື່ອມັນປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Update the viewport's render target only when its parent is visible."
msgstr "ອັບເດດ render target ຂອງ viewport ເມື່ອ parent ຂອງມັນປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Always update the viewport's render target."
msgstr "ອັບເດດ render target ຂອງ viewport ສະເໝີ."

msgid "Always clear the viewport's render target before drawing."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນ (clear) ໃນ render target ຂອງ viewport ກ່ອນການແຕ້ມສະເໝີ."

msgid "Never clear the viewport's render target."
msgstr "ບໍ່ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນໃນ render target ຂອງ viewport ເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"Clear the viewport's render target on the next frame, then switch to "
"[constant VIEWPORT_CLEAR_NEVER]."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນໃນ render target ຂອງ viewport ໃນເຟຣມຖັດໄປ, ແລ້ວປ່ຽນໄປເປັນ [constant "
"VIEWPORT_CLEAR_NEVER]."

msgid "Disable rendering of 3D environment over 2D canvas."
msgstr "ປິດການເຣນເດີ 3D environment ເທິງ 2D canvas."

msgid "Enable rendering of 3D environment over 2D canvas."
msgstr "ເປີດການເຣນເດີ 3D environment ເທິງ 2D canvas."

msgid ""
"Inherit enable/disable value from parent. If the topmost parent is also set "
"to [constant VIEWPORT_ENVIRONMENT_INHERIT], then this has the same behavior "
"as [constant VIEWPORT_ENVIRONMENT_ENABLED]."
msgstr ""
"ສືບທອດ (Inherit) ຄ່າ ເປີດ/ປິດ ຈາກ parent. ຖ້າ parent ລະດັບສູງສຸດ ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"VIEWPORT_ENVIRONMENT_INHERIT] ຄືກັນ, ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບ [constant "
"VIEWPORT_ENVIRONMENT_ENABLED]."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ViewportEnvironmentMode] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ViewportEnvironmentMode]."

msgid ""
"Do not oversize the 2D signed distance field. Occluders may disappear when "
"touching the viewport's edges, and [GPUParticles3D] collision may stop "
"working earlier than intended. This has the lowest GPU requirements."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ຂະຫຍາຍ (oversize) 2D signed distance field. ຕົວບັງ (Occluders) "
"ອາດຫາຍໄປເມື່ອສຳຜັດກັບຂອບຂອງ viewport, ແລະ ການຕຳຂອງ [GPUParticles3D] "
"ອາດຢຸດເຮັດວຽກກ່ອນເວລາທີ່ຄວນຈະເປັນ. ອັນນີ້ໃຊ້ GPU ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"2D signed distance field covers 20% of the viewport's size outside the "
"viewport on each side (top, right, bottom, left)."
msgstr ""
"2D signed distance field ຄອບຄຸມ 20% ຂອງຂະໜາດ viewport ອອກໄປທາງນອກໃນແຕ່ລະດ້ານ "
"(ເທິງ, ຂວາ, ລຸ່ມ, ຊ້າຍ)."

msgid ""
"2D signed distance field covers 50% of the viewport's size outside the "
"viewport on each side (top, right, bottom, left)."
msgstr ""
"2D signed distance field ຄອບຄຸມ 50% ຂອງຂະໜາດ viewport ອອກໄປທາງນອກໃນແຕ່ລະດ້ານ "
"(ເທິງ, ຂວາ, ລຸ່ມ, ຊ້າຍ)."

msgid ""
"2D signed distance field covers 100% of the viewport's size outside the "
"viewport on each side (top, right, bottom, left). This has the highest GPU "
"requirements."
msgstr ""
"2D signed distance field ຄອບຄຸມ 100% ຂອງຂະໜາດ viewport ອອກໄປທາງນອກໃນແຕ່ລະດ້ານ "
"(ເທິງ, ຂວາ, ລຸ່ມ, ຊ້າຍ). ອັນນີ້ໃຊ້ GPU ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ViewportSDFOversize] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ViewportSDFOversize]."

msgid ""
"Full resolution 2D signed distance field scale. This has the highest GPU "
"requirements."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດ 2D signed distance field ແບບຄວາມລະອຽດເຕັມ (Full resolution). ອັນນີ້ໃຊ້ GPU "
"ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Half resolution 2D signed distance field scale on each axis (25% of the "
"viewport pixel count)."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດ 2D signed distance field ແບບຄວາມລະອຽດເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງໃນແຕ່ລະແກນ (25% "
"ຂອງຈຳນວນພິກເຊວໃນ viewport)."

msgid ""
"Quarter resolution 2D signed distance field scale on each axis (6.25% of the "
"viewport pixel count). This has the lowest GPU requirements."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດ 2D signed distance field ແບບຄວາມລະອຽດໜຶ່ງໃນສີ່ໃນແຕ່ລະແກນ (6.25% "
"ຂອງຈຳນວນພິກເຊວໃນ viewport). ອັນນີ້ໃຊ້ GPU ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ViewportSDFScale] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ViewportSDFScale]."

msgid ""
"Multisample antialiasing for 3D is disabled. This is the default value, and "
"also the fastest setting."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການໃຊ້ Multisample antialiasing (MSAA) ສຳລັບ 3D. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ "
"ເປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Multisample antialiasing uses 2 samples per pixel for 3D. This has a moderate "
"impact on performance."
msgstr ""
"Multisample antialiasing ໃຊ້ 2 samples ຕໍ່ພິກເຊວສຳລັບ 3D. "
"ອັນນີ້ມີຜົນກະທົບປານກາງຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ."

msgid ""
"Multisample antialiasing uses 4 samples per pixel for 3D. This has a high "
"impact on performance."
msgstr ""
"Multisample antialiasing ໃຊ້ 4 samples ຕໍ່ພິກເຊວສຳລັບ 3D. ອັນນີ້ມີຜົນກະທົບສູງຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ."

msgid ""
"Multisample antialiasing uses 8 samples per pixel for 3D. This has a very "
"high impact on performance. Likely unsupported on low-end and older hardware."
msgstr ""
"Multisample antialiasing ໃຊ້ 8 samples ຕໍ່ພິກເຊວສຳລັບ 3D. "
"ອັນນີ້ມີຜົນກະທົບສູງຫຼາຍຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ. ອາດຈະບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນຮາດແວລະດັບຕ່ຳ ຫຼື ຮາດແວເກົ່າ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ViewportMSAA] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ViewportMSAA]."

msgid "Anisotropic filtering is disabled."
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ Anisotropic filtering."

msgid "Use 2× anisotropic filtering."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ Anisotropic filtering ແບບ 2×."

msgid "Use 4× anisotropic filtering. This is the default value."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ Anisotropic filtering ແບບ 4×. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Use 8× anisotropic filtering."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ Anisotropic filtering ແບບ 8×."

msgid "Use 16× anisotropic filtering."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ Anisotropic filtering ແບບ 16×."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ViewportAnisotropicFiltering] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ViewportAnisotropicFiltering]."

msgid "Do not perform any antialiasing in the full screen post-process."
msgstr "ບໍ່ເຮັດ antialiasing ໃດໆ ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນ post-process ແບບເຕັມຈໍ."

msgid ""
"Use fast approximate antialiasing. FXAA is a popular screen-space "
"antialiasing method, which is fast but will make the image look blurry, "
"especially at lower resolutions. It can still work relatively well at large "
"resolutions such as 1440p and 4K."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ Fast Approximate Antialiasing (FXAA). FXAA ແມ່ນວິທີ antialiasing "
"ໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍທີ່ເປັນທີ່ນິຍົມ, ເຊິ່ງໄວແຕ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບເບິ່ງມົວ, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳ. "
"ແຕ່ມັນຍັງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີພໍສົມຄວນໃນຄວາມລະອຽດສູງ ເຊັ່ນ 1440p ແລະ 4K."

msgid ""
"Use subpixel morphological antialiasing. SMAA may produce clearer results "
"than FXAA, but at a slightly higher performance cost."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ Subpixel Morphological Antialiasing (SMAA). SMAA ອາດໃຫ້ຜົນທີ່ຄົມຊັດກວ່າ FXAA, "
"ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນສູງກວ່າເລັກນ້ອຍ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ViewportScreenSpaceAA] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ViewportScreenSpaceAA]."

msgid ""
"Low occlusion culling BVH build quality (as defined by Embree). Results in "
"the lowest CPU usage, but least effective culling."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບການສ້າງ BVH ສຳລັບ occlusion culling ລະດັບຕ່ຳ (ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ Embree). ໃຊ້ CPU "
"ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ການຄັດອອກ (culling) ຈະມີປະສິດທິພາບໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "Medium occlusion culling BVH build quality (as defined by Embree)."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບການສ້າງ BVH ສຳລັບ occlusion culling ລະດັບປານກາງ (ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ Embree)."

msgid ""
"High occlusion culling BVH build quality (as defined by Embree). Results in "
"the highest CPU usage, but most effective culling."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບການສ້າງ BVH ສຳລັບ occlusion culling ລະດັບສູງ (ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ Embree). ໃຊ້ CPU "
"ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ການຄັດອອກ (culling) ຈະມີປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "Number of objects drawn in a single frame."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມໃນເຟຣມດຽວ."

msgid "Number of points, lines, or triangles drawn in a single frame."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຈຸດ, ເສັ້ນ, ຫຼື ຮູບສາມແຈ ທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມໃນເຟຣມດຽວ."

msgid "Number of draw calls during this frame."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ draw calls ໃນລະຫວ່າງເຟຣມນີ້."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ViewportRenderInfo] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ViewportRenderInfo]."

msgid "Visible render pass (excluding shadows)."
msgstr "ຮອບການເຣນເດີທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ (ບໍ່ລວມເງົາ)."

msgid ""
"Shadow render pass. Objects will be rendered several times depending on the "
"number of amounts of lights with shadows and the number of directional shadow "
"splits."
msgstr ""
"ຮອບການເຣນເດີເງົາ. ວັດຖຸຈະຖືກເຣນເດີຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ ຂຶ້ນກັບຈຳນວນຂອງແສງທີ່ມີເງົາ ແລະ ຈຳນວນ directional "
"shadow splits."

msgid "Canvas item rendering. This includes all 2D rendering."
msgstr "ການເຣນເດີ Canvas item. ອັນນີ້ລວມເຖິງການເຣນເດີ 2D ທັງໝົດ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ViewportRenderInfoType] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ViewportRenderInfoType]."

msgid "Debug draw is disabled. Default setting."
msgstr "ປິດການແຕ້ມແບບດີບັກ (Debug draw). ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Objects are displayed without light information."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸຈະຖືກສະແດງໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນແສງ."

msgid ""
"Objects are displayed with only light information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using this debug draw mode, custom shaders are ignored "
"since all materials in the scene temporarily use a debug material. This means "
"the result from custom shader functions (such as vertex displacement) won't "
"be visible anymore when using this debug draw mode."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸຈະຖືກສະແດງໂດຍມີພຽງຂໍ້ມູນແສງເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ debug draw ນີ້, ເຊດເດີ (shaders) ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກວັດສະດຸທັງໝົດໃນສາກ ຈະໃຊ້ວັດສະດຸ debug ຊົ່ວຄາວ. ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ຜົນຈາກຟັງຊັນເຊດເດີທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ "
"(ເຊັ່ນ vertex displacement) ຈະບໍ່ປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ debug draw ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Objects are displayed semi-transparent with additive blending so you can see "
"where they are drawing over top of one another. A higher overdraw "
"(represented by brighter colors) means you are wasting performance on drawing "
"pixels that are being hidden behind others.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using this debug draw mode, custom shaders are ignored "
"since all materials in the scene temporarily use a debug material. This means "
"the result from custom shader functions (such as vertex displacement) won't "
"be visible anymore when using this debug draw mode."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸຈະຖືກສະແດງແບບເຄິ່ງໂປ່ງໃສດ້ວຍ additive blending ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເຫັນວ່າ "
"ພວກມັນຖືກແຕ້ມຊ້ອນກັນຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດ. ຄ່າ overdraw ທີ່ສູງ (ສະແດງດ້ວຍສີທີ່ສະຫວ່າງກວ່າ) ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ "
"ເຈົ້າກຳລັງເສຍປະສິດທິພາບໄປກັບການແຕ້ມພິກເຊວທີ່ຖືກບັງຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ debug draw ນີ້, ເຊດເດີທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກວັດສະດຸທັງໝົດໃນສາກ ຈະໃຊ້ວັດສະດຸ debug ຊົ່ວຄາວ. ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ຜົນຈາກຟັງຊັນເຊດເດີທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ "
"ຈະບໍ່ປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ debug draw ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Debug draw draws objects in wireframe.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method set_debug_generate_wireframes] must be called before "
"loading any meshes for wireframes to be visible when using the Compatibility "
"renderer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In the Compatibility renderer, backfaces are always visible when "
"using wireframe rendering. In the Forward+ and Mobile renderers, wireframes "
"follow the material's backface culling properties instead."
msgstr ""
"Debug draw ຈະແຕ້ມວັດຖຸແບບໂຄງເສັ້ນ (wireframe).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method set_debug_generate_wireframes] ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໂຫຼດເມຊ "
"(meshes) ໃດໆ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນ wireframe ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Compatibility renderer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Compatibility renderer, ດ້ານຫຼັງ (backfaces) ຈະປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນສະເໝີ "
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການເຣນເດີແບບ wireframe. ໃນ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile renderers, wireframe "
"ຈະເຮັດວຽກຕາມຄຸນສົມບັດ backface culling ຂອງວັດສະດຸແທນ."

msgid ""
"Normal buffer is drawn instead of regular scene so you can see the per-pixel "
"normals that will be used by post-processing effects."
msgstr ""
"Normal buffer ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມແທນສາກປົກກະຕິ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເຫັນນໍມໍ (normals) ໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ "
"ທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍເອັບເຟັກ post-processing."

msgid ""
"Objects are displayed with only the albedo value from [VoxelGI]s. Requires at "
"least one visible [VoxelGI] node that has been baked to have a visible "
"effect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸຈະຖືກສະແດງໂດຍມີພຽງຄ່າ albedo ຈາກ [VoxelGI]. ຕ້ອງການໂນດ [VoxelGI] "
"ທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ ແລະ ຕ້ອງຜ່ານການ bake ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງຈະເຫັນຜົນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Objects are displayed with only the lighting value from [VoxelGI]s. Requires "
"at least one visible [VoxelGI] node that has been baked to have a visible "
"effect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸຈະຖືກສະແດງໂດຍມີພຽງຄ່າແສງສະຫວ່າງ (lighting) ຈາກ [VoxelGI]. ຕ້ອງການໂນດ [VoxelGI] "
"ທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ ແລະ ຕ້ອງຜ່ານການ bake ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງຈະເຫັນຜົນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Objects are displayed with only the emission color from [VoxelGI]s. Requires "
"at least one visible [VoxelGI] node that has been baked to have a visible "
"effect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸຈະຖືກສະແດງໂດຍມີພຽງຄ່າສີການແຜ່ລັງສີ (emission color) ຈາກ [VoxelGI]. ຕ້ອງການໂນດ "
"[VoxelGI] ທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ ແລະ ຕ້ອງຜ່ານການ bake ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງຈະເຫັນຜົນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws the shadow atlas that stores shadows from [OmniLight3D]s and "
"[SpotLight3D]s in the upper left quadrant of the [Viewport]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ shadow atlas ທີ່ເກັບເງົາຈາກ [OmniLight3D] ແລະ [SpotLight3D] ໃນສ່ວນເທິງຊ້າຍຂອງ "
"[Viewport]."

msgid ""
"Draws the shadow atlas that stores shadows from [DirectionalLight3D]s in the "
"upper left quadrant of the [Viewport].\n"
"The slice of the camera frustum related to the shadow map cascade is "
"superimposed to visualize coverage. The color of each slice matches the "
"colors used for [constant VIEWPORT_DEBUG_DRAW_PSSM_SPLITS]. When shadow "
"cascades are blended the overlap is taken into account when drawing the "
"frustum slices.\n"
"The last cascade shows all frustum slices to illustrate the coverage of all "
"slices."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ shadow atlas ທີ່ເກັບເງົາຈາກ [DirectionalLight3D] ໃນສ່ວນເທິງຊ້າຍຂອງ [Viewport].\n"
"ສ່ວນຂອງ camera frustum ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ shadow map cascade ຈະຖືກສະແດງທັບຊ້ອນ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນພື້ນທີ່ຄອບຄຸມ. ສີຂອງແຕ່ລະສ່ວນຈະກົງກັບສີທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ [constant "
"VIEWPORT_DEBUG_DRAW_PSSM_SPLITS]. ເມື່ອ shadow cascades ຖືກປະສົມກັນ "
"ການທັບຊ້ອນກັນຈະຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ເມື່ອແຕ້ມສ່ວນຂອງ frustum.\n"
"Cascade ສຸດທ້າຍຈະສະແດງສ່ວນຂອງ frustum ທັງໝົດ ເພື່ອສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນການຄອບຄຸມຂອງທຸກໆສ່ວນ."

msgid ""
"Draws the estimated scene luminance. This is a 1×1 texture that is generated "
"when autoexposure is enabled to control the scene's exposure.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ or Mobile rendering "
"methods."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (luminance) ທີ່ຄາດຄະເນຂອງສາກ. ອັນນີ້ແມ່ນ texture ຂະໜາດ 1×1 "
"ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ autoexposure ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມການຮັບແສງ (exposure) ຂອງສາກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ຫຼື Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws the screen space ambient occlusion texture instead of the scene so that "
"you can clearly see how it is affecting objects. In order for this display "
"mode to work, you must have [member Environment.ssao_enabled] set in your "
"[WorldEnvironment].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ texture ຂອງ screen space ambient occlusion (SSAO) ແທນສາກ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນວ່າມັນມີຜົນຕໍ່ວັດຖຸແນວໃດ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂໝດການສະແດງຜົນນີ້ເຮັດວຽກ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"[member Environment.ssao_enabled] ໃນ [WorldEnvironment] ຂອງເຈົ້າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws the screen space indirect lighting texture instead of the scene so that "
"you can clearly see how it is affecting objects. In order for this display "
"mode to work, you must have [member Environment.ssil_enabled] set in your "
"[WorldEnvironment].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ texture ຂອງ screen space indirect lighting (SSIL) ແທນສາກ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນວ່າມັນມີຜົນຕໍ່ວັດຖຸແນວໃດ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂໝດການສະແດງຜົນນີ້ເຮັດວຽກ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"[member Environment.ssil_enabled] ໃນ [WorldEnvironment] ຂອງເຈົ້າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Colors each PSSM split for the [DirectionalLight3D]s in the scene a different "
"color so you can see where the splits are. In order (from closest to furthest "
"from the camera), they are colored red, green, blue, and yellow.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using this debug draw mode, custom shaders are ignored "
"since all materials in the scene temporarily use a debug material. This means "
"the result from custom shader functions (such as vertex displacement) won't "
"be visible anymore when using this debug draw mode.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ or Mobile rendering "
"methods."
msgstr ""
"ລະບາຍສີແຕ່ລະ PSSM split ສຳລັບ [DirectionalLight3D] ໃນສາກດ້ວຍສີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເຫັນວ່າ split ຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດ. ຕາມລຳດັບ (ຈາກໃກ້ຫາໄກຈາກກ້ອງ), ພວກມັນຈະຖືກລະບາຍດ້ວຍສີແດງ, "
"ຂຽວ, ຟ້າ, ແລະ ເຫຼືອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ debug draw ນີ້, ເຊດເດີທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກວັດສະດຸທັງໝົດໃນສາກ ຈະໃຊ້ວັດສະດຸ debug ຊົ່ວຄາວ. ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ຜົນຈາກຟັງຊັນເຊດເດີທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ "
"ຈະບໍ່ປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ debug draw ນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ຫຼື Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws the decal atlas that stores decal textures from [Decal]s.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ or Mobile rendering "
"methods."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ decal atlas ທີ່ເກັບ textures ຈາກ [Decal].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ຫຼື Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws SDFGI cascade data. This is the data structure that is used to bounce "
"lighting against and create reflections.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຂໍ້ມູນ SDFGI cascade. ນີ້ແມ່ນໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສະທ້ອນແສງ ແລະ ສ້າງການສະທ້ອນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws SDFGI probe data. This is the data structure that is used to give "
"indirect lighting dynamic objects moving within the scene.\n"
"When in the editor, left-clicking a probe will display additional bright dots "
"that show its occlusion information. A white dot means the light is not "
"occluded at all at the dot's position, while a red dot means the light is "
"fully occluded. Intermediate values are possible.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຂໍ້ມູນ SDFGI probe. ນີ້ແມ່ນໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແສງທາງອ້ອມ "
"ແກ່ວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ພາຍໃນສາກ.\n"
"ເມື່ອຢູ່ໃນ editor, ການຄລິກຊ້າຍທີ່ probe ຈະສະແດງຈຸດສະຫວ່າງເພີ່ມເຕີມ ທີ່ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນການບັງ "
"(occlusion) ຂອງມັນ. ຈຸດສີຂາວໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແສງບໍ່ຖືກບັງເລີຍ ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຈຸດນັ້ນ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຈຸດສີແດງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແສງຖືກບັງທັງໝົດ. ສາມາດມີຄ່າລະຫວ່າງກາງໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws the global illumination buffer from [VoxelGI] or SDFGI. Requires "
"[VoxelGI] (at least one visible baked VoxelGI node) or SDFGI ([member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled]) to be enabled to have a visible effect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ global illumination buffer ຈາກ [VoxelGI] ຫຼື SDFGI. ຕ້ອງການ [VoxelGI] (ໂນດ "
"VoxelGI ທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ ແລະ ຜ່ານການ bake ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ) ຫຼື SDFGI ([member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled]) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Disable mesh LOD. All meshes are drawn with full detail, which can be used to "
"compare performance."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການໃຊ້ mesh LOD. ເມຊທັງໝົດຈະຖືກແຕ້ມດ້ວຍລາຍລະອຽດເຕັມ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Draws the [OmniLight3D] cluster. Clustering determines where lights are "
"positioned in screen-space, which allows the engine to only process these "
"portions of the screen for lighting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ [OmniLight3D] cluster. Clustering ຈະກຳນົດວ່າແສງຕັ້ງຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເອນຈິນປະມວນຜົນສະເພາະສ່ວນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຂອງໜ້າຈໍສຳລັບການໃຫ້ແສງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws the [SpotLight3D] cluster. Clustering determines where lights are "
"positioned in screen-space, which allows the engine to only process these "
"portions of the screen for lighting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ [SpotLight3D] cluster. Clustering ຈະກຳນົດວ່າແສງຕັ້ງຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເອນຈິນປະມວນຜົນສະເພາະສ່ວນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຂອງໜ້າຈໍສຳລັບການໃຫ້ແສງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws the [Decal] cluster. Clustering determines where decals are positioned "
"in screen-space, which allows the engine to only process these portions of "
"the screen for decals.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ [Decal] cluster. Clustering ຈະກຳນົດວ່າ decals ຕັ້ງຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເອນຈິນປະມວນຜົນສະເພາະສ່ວນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຂອງໜ້າຈໍສຳລັບ decals.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws the [ReflectionProbe] cluster. Clustering determines where reflection "
"probes are positioned in screen-space, which allows the engine to only "
"process these portions of the screen for reflection probes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ [ReflectionProbe] cluster. Clustering ຈະກຳນົດວ່າ reflection probes "
"ຕັ້ງຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເອນຈິນປະມວນຜົນສະເພາະສ່ວນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ ຂອງໜ້າຈໍສຳລັບ reflection "
"probes.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws the occlusion culling buffer. This low-resolution occlusion culling "
"buffer is rasterized on the CPU and is used to check whether instances are "
"occluded by other objects.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ or Mobile rendering "
"methods."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ occlusion culling buffer. buffer ນີ້ມີຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳ ຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນພາບ (rasterized) "
"ເທິງ CPU ແລະ ໃຊ້ເພື່ອທົດສອບວ່າ instances ຖືກບັງໂດຍວັດຖຸອື່ນຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ຫຼື Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws the motion vectors buffer. This is used by temporal antialiasing to "
"correct for motion that occurs during gameplay.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ motion vectors buffer. ອັນນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ temporal antialiasing "
"ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂການເຄື່ອນທີ່ທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Internal buffer is drawn instead of regular scene so you can see the per-"
"pixel output that will be used by post-processing effects.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ or Mobile rendering "
"methods."
msgstr ""
"Internal buffer ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມແທນສາກປົກກະຕິ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເຫັນຜົນການປະມວນຜົນ ໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ "
"ທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍເອັບເຟັກ post-processing.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ຫຼື Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Variable rate shading is disabled."
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ Variable rate shading."

msgid ""
"Variable rate shading uses a texture. Note, for stereoscopic use a texture "
"atlas with a texture for each view."
msgstr ""
"Variable rate shading ໂດຍໃຊ້ texture. ໝາຍເຫດ: ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານແບບ stereoscopic "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ texture atlas ທີ່ມີ texture ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະມຸມເບິ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Variable rate shading texture is supplied by the primary [XRInterface]. Note "
"that this may override the update mode."
msgstr ""
"Texture ຂອງ Variable rate shading ແມ່ນຖືກສະໜອງໂດຍ [XRInterface] ຫຼັກ. ໝາຍເຫດ: "
"ອັນນີ້ອາດຈະຂຽນທັບ (override) ໂໝດການອັບເດດ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ViewportVRSMode] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ViewportVRSMode]."

msgid "The input texture for variable rate shading will not be processed."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວຂາເຂົ້າສຳລັບ variable rate shading ຈະບໍ່ຖືກປະມວນຜົນ."

msgid "The input texture for variable rate shading will be processed once."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວຂາເຂົ້າສຳລັບ variable rate shading ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນຄັ້ງດຽວ."

msgid ""
"The input texture for variable rate shading will be processed each frame."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວຂາເຂົ້າສຳລັບ variable rate shading ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນແຕ່ລະເຟຣມ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ViewportVRSUpdateMode] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ViewportVRSUpdateMode]."

msgid ""
"Automatically selects the appropriate process mode based on your sky shader. "
"If your shader uses [code]TIME[/code] or [code]POSITION[/code], this will use "
"[constant SKY_MODE_REALTIME]. If your shader uses any of the [code]LIGHT_*[/"
"code] variables or any custom uniforms, this uses [constant "
"SKY_MODE_INCREMENTAL]. Otherwise, this defaults to [constant "
"SKY_MODE_QUALITY]."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກໂໝດການປະມວນຜົນທີ່ເໝາະສົມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຕາມເຊດເດີທ້ອງຟ້າ (sky shader) ຂອງເຈົ້າ. "
"ຖ້າເຊດເດີໃຊ້ [code]TIME[/code] ຫຼື [code]POSITION[/code], ມັນຈະໃຊ້ [constant "
"SKY_MODE_REALTIME]. ຖ້າເຊດເດີໃຊ້ຕົວແປ [code]LIGHT_*[/code] ຫຼື uniforms "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໃດໆ, ມັນຈະໃຊ້ [constant SKY_MODE_INCREMENTAL]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈະຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[constant SKY_MODE_QUALITY] ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Uses high quality importance sampling to process the radiance map. In "
"general, this results in much higher quality than [constant "
"SKY_MODE_REALTIME] but takes much longer to generate. This should not be used "
"if you plan on changing the sky at runtime. If you are finding that the "
"reflection is not blurry enough and is showing sparkles or fireflies, try "
"increasing [member ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"ggx_samples]."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ importance sampling ຄຸນນະພາບສູງເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນ radiance map. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, "
"ອັນນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ສູງກວ່າ [constant SKY_MODE_REALTIME] ຫຼາຍ "
"ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ເວລາໃນການສ້າງດົນກວ່າ. ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ໂໝດນີ້ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີແຜນຈະປ່ຽນແປງທ້ອງຟ້າ ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດວຽກ "
"(runtime). ຖ້າເຈົ້າພົບວ່າການສະທ້ອນບໍ່ມົວພໍ ແລະ ເຫັນເປັນປະກາຍໄຟ (sparkles ຫຼື fireflies), "
"ໃຫ້ລອງເພີ່ມຄ່າ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"ggx_samples]."

msgid ""
"Uses the same high quality importance sampling to process the radiance map as "
"[constant SKY_MODE_QUALITY], but updates over several frames. The number of "
"frames is determined by [member ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/"
"sky_reflections/roughness_layers]. Use this when you need highest quality "
"radiance maps, but have a sky that updates slowly."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ importance sampling ຄຸນນະພາບສູງເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນ radiance map ຄືກັບ [constant "
"SKY_MODE_QUALITY], ແຕ່ຈະອັບເດດຜ່ານຫຼາຍໆເຟຣມ. ຈຳນວນເຟຣມ ແມ່ນກຳນົດໂດຍ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/roughness_layers]. "
"ໃຊ້ໂໝດນີ້ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ radiance maps ຄຸນນະພາບສູງສຸດ, ແຕ່ມີທ້ອງຟ້າທີ່ອັບເດດຊ້າ."

msgid ""
"Uses the fast filtering algorithm to process the radiance map. In general "
"this results in lower quality, but substantially faster run times. If you "
"need better quality, but still need to update the sky every frame, consider "
"turning on [member ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"fast_filter_high_quality].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The fast filtering algorithm is limited to 256×256 cubemaps, so "
"[method sky_set_radiance_size] must be set to [code]256[/code]. Otherwise, a "
"warning is printed and the overridden radiance size is ignored."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ algorithm ການກອງ (filtering) ແບບໄວເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນ radiance map. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ "
"ອັນນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ, ແຕ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໄວກວ່າຫຼາຍ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ດີກວ່າ, "
"ແຕ່ຍັງຕ້ອງການອັບເດດທ້ອງຟ້າທຸກໆເຟຣມ, ໃຫ້ລອງເປີດ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"reflections/sky_reflections/fast_filter_high_quality].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] algorithm ການກອງແບບໄວແມ່ນຈຳກັດຢູ່ທີ່ cubemaps ຂະໜາດ 256×256, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ "
"[method sky_set_radiance_size] ຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]256[/code]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຈະມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ ແລະ ຄ່າ radiance size ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The rendering effect requires the color buffer to be resolved if MSAA is "
"enabled."
msgstr "ເອັບເຟັກການເຣນເດີຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ color buffer ຖືກປັບປຸງ (resolved) ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ MSAA."

msgid ""
"The rendering effect requires the depth buffer to be resolved if MSAA is "
"enabled."
msgstr "ເອັບເຟັກການເຣນເດີຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ depth buffer ຖືກປັບປຸງ (resolved) ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ MSAA."

msgid "The rendering effect requires motion vectors to be produced."
msgstr "ເອັບເຟັກການເຣນເດີຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີການສ້າງ motion vectors."

msgid ""
"The rendering effect requires normals and roughness g-buffer to be produced "
"(Forward+ only)."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກການເຣນເດີຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີການສ້າງ normals ແລະ roughness g-buffer (Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"The rendering effect requires specular data to be separated out (Forward+ "
"only)."
msgstr "ເອັບເຟັກການເຣນເດີຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແຍກຂໍ້ມູນ specular ອອກມາ (Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

msgid "Use the clear color as background."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ clear color ເປັນພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid "Use a specified color as the background."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ສີທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເປັນພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid "Use a sky resource for the background."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນ sky (ທ້ອງຟ້າ) ເປັນພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"Use a specified canvas layer as the background. This can be useful for "
"instantiating a 2D scene in a 3D world."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ canvas layer ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເປັນພື້ນຫຼັງ. ອັນນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບ ການນຳສາກ 2D ມາໃສ່ໃນໂລກ 3D."

msgid ""
"Do not clear the background, use whatever was rendered last frame as the "
"background."
msgstr "ບໍ່ລຶບພື້ນຫຼັງ, ໃຊ້ສິ່ງທີ່ຖືກເຣນເດີໃນເຟຣມຫຼ້າສຸດເປັນພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum EnvironmentBG] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum EnvironmentBG]."

msgid "Disable ambient light."
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ ambient light."

msgid "Specify a specific [Color] for ambient light."
msgstr "ກຳນົດ [Color] ສະເພາະສຳລັບ ambient light."

msgid "Disable reflections."
msgstr "ປິດການສະທ້ອນ."

msgid ""
"Adds the glow effect to the scene after modifying the glow influence based on "
"the scene value; dark values will be highly influenced by glow and bright "
"values will not be influenced by glow. This approach avoids bright values "
"becoming overly bright from the glow effect. [member "
"Environment.tonemap_white] is used to determine the maximum scene value where "
"the glow should have no influence. When [member Environment.tonemap_mode] is "
"set to [constant Environment.TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR] and [member "
"Viewport.use_hdr_2d] is [code]true[/code], the parent window's [method "
"Window.get_output_max_linear_value] will be used as the maximum scene value."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເອັບເຟັກ glow ໃຫ້ກັບສາກ ຫຼັງຈາກປັບປ່ຽນອິດທິພົນຂອງ glow ຕາມຄ່າຂອງສາກ; ຄ່າທີ່ມືດຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນຈາກ "
"glow ຫຼາຍ ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ສະຫວ່າງຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນໜ້ອຍ. ວິທີການນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼີກເວັ້ນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຄ່າທີ່ສະຫວ່າງຢູ່ແລ້ວ "
"ສະຫວ່າງເກີນໄປຈາກເອັບເຟັກ glow. [member Environment.tonemap_white] ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອ "
"ກຳນົດຄ່າສາກສູງສຸດທີ່ glow ຈະບໍ່ມີອິດທິພົນ. ເມື່ອ [member Environment.tonemap_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[constant Environment.TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR] ແລະ [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] "
"ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄ່າ [method Window.get_output_max_linear_value] "
"ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ parent ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າສາກສູງສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Mixes the glow image with the scene image. Best used with [member "
"Environment.glow_bloom] to avoid darkening the scene."
msgstr ""
"ປະສົມພາບ glow ເຂົ້າກັບພາບຂອງສາກ. ດີທີ່ສຸດເມື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [member Environment.glow_bloom] "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບໍ່ໃຫ້ສາກມືດລົງ."

msgid ""
"A simple tonemapping curve that rolls off bright values to prevent clipping. "
"This results in an image that can appear dull and low contrast. Slower than "
"[constant ENV_TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When [member Environment.tonemap_white] is left at the default "
"value of [code]1.0[/code], [constant ENV_TONE_MAPPER_REINHARD] produces an "
"identical image to [constant ENV_TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR]."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ tonemapping ແບບງ່າຍໆທີ່ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຄ່າທີ່ສະຫວ່າງເກີນໄປເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນ clipping. "
"ອັນນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບເບິ່ງຈືດ ແລະ ມີ contrast ຕ່ຳ. ຊ້າກວ່າ [constant "
"ENV_TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອ [member Environment.tonemap_white] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
"[code]1.0[/code], [constant ENV_TONE_MAPPER_REINHARD] ຈະໃຫ້ພາບທີ່ຄືກັນກັບ [constant "
"ENV_TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR]."

msgid ""
"Uses a film-like tonemapping curve to prevent clipping of bright values and "
"provide better contrast than [constant ENV_TONE_MAPPER_REINHARD]. Slightly "
"slower than [constant ENV_TONE_MAPPER_REINHARD].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This tonemapper does not support HDR output because it produces "
"output in the SDR range. It is recommended to use a different tonemapper when "
"rendering to an HDR screen."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ tonemapping ແບບຄືກັບຟິມເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນ clipping ຂອງຄ່າທີ່ສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ໃຫ້ contrast "
"ທີ່ດີກວ່າ [constant ENV_TONE_MAPPER_REINHARD]. ຊ້າກວ່າ [constant "
"ENV_TONE_MAPPER_REINHARD] ເລັກນ້ອຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] tonemapper ນີ້ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ HDR output ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນສ້າງ output ໃນລະດັບ SDR. "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ tonemapper ອື່ນເມື່ອເຣນເດີອອກໜ້າຈໍ HDR."

msgid ""
"Uses a high-contrast film-like tonemapping curve and desaturates bright "
"values for a more realistic appearance. Slightly slower than [constant "
"ENV_TONE_MAPPER_FILMIC].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This tonemapping operator is called \"ACES Fitted\" in Godot "
"3.x.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This tonemapper does not support HDR output because it produces "
"output in the SDR range. It is recommended to use a different tonemapper when "
"rendering to an HDR screen."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ tonemapping ແບບຟິມທີ່ມີ contrast ສູງ ແລະ ຫຼຸດຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີ (desaturates) "
"ໃນສ່ວນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເບິ່ງສົມຈິງກວ່າ. ຊ້າກວ່າ [constant ENV_TONE_MAPPER_FILMIC] "
"ເລັກນ້ອຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວປະຕິບັດການ tonemapping ນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"ACES Fitted\" ໃນ Godot 3.x.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] tonemapper ນີ້ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ HDR output ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນສ້າງ output ໃນລະດັບ SDR. "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ tonemapper ອື່ນເມື່ອເຣນເດີອອກໜ້າຈໍ HDR."

msgid ""
"Lowest quality of roughness filter for screen-space reflections. Rough "
"materials will not have blurrier screen-space reflections compared to smooth "
"(non-rough) materials. This is the fastest option."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງ roughness filter ສຳລັບ screen-space reflections. ວັດສະດຸທີ່ມີຜິວຊາ "
"(rough) ຈະບໍ່ມີການສະທ້ອນທີ່ມົວກວ່າວັດສະດຸຜິວລຽບ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "Low quality of roughness filter for screen-space reflections."
msgstr "ຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳຂອງ roughness filter ສຳລັບ screen-space reflections."

msgid "Medium quality of roughness filter for screen-space reflections."
msgstr "ຄຸນນະພາບປານກາງຂອງ roughness filter ສຳລັບ screen-space reflections."

msgid ""
"High quality of roughness filter for screen-space reflections. This is the "
"slowest option."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບສູງຂອງ roughness filter ສຳລັບ screen-space reflections. ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "Lowest quality of screen-space ambient occlusion."
msgstr "ຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງ screen-space ambient occlusion (SSAO)."

msgid "Low quality screen-space ambient occlusion."
msgstr "ຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳຂອງ screen-space ambient occlusion."

msgid "Medium quality screen-space ambient occlusion."
msgstr "ຄຸນນະພາບປານກາງຂອງ screen-space ambient occlusion."

msgid "High quality screen-space ambient occlusion."
msgstr "ຄຸນນະພາບສູງຂອງ screen-space ambient occlusion."

msgid ""
"Highest quality screen-space ambient occlusion. Uses the adaptive target "
"setting which can be dynamically adjusted to smoothly balance performance and "
"visual quality."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບສູງສຸດຂອງ screen-space ambient occlusion. ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ adaptive target "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນໄດ້ແບບໄດນາມິກ ເພື່ອສ້າງຄວາມສົມດຸນລະຫວ່າງ ປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ຄຸນນະພາບຂອງພາບ."

msgid "Lowest quality of screen-space indirect lighting."
msgstr "ຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງ screen-space indirect lighting (SSIL)."

msgid "Low quality screen-space indirect lighting."
msgstr "ຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳຂອງ screen-space indirect lighting."

msgid "High quality screen-space indirect lighting."
msgstr "ຄຸນນະພາບສູງຂອງ screen-space indirect lighting."

msgid ""
"Highest quality screen-space indirect lighting. Uses the adaptive target "
"setting which can be dynamically adjusted to smoothly balance performance and "
"visual quality."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບສູງສຸດຂອງ screen-space indirect lighting. ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ adaptive target "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນໄດ້ແບບໄດນາມິກ ເພື່ອສ້າງຄວາມສົມດຸນລະຫວ່າງ ປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ຄຸນນະພາບຂອງພາບ."

msgid ""
"Throw 4 rays per frame when converging SDFGI. This has the lowest GPU "
"requirements, but creates the most noisy result."
msgstr ""
"ຍິງ 4 rays ຕໍ່ເຟຣມ ເມື່ອປະມວນຜົນ SDFGI. ອັນນີ້ໃຊ້ GPU ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ຈະສ້າງຜົນລັດທີ່ມີ noise "
"ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "Throw 8 rays per frame when converging SDFGI."
msgstr "ຍິງ 8 rays ຕໍ່ເຟຣມ ເມື່ອປະມວນຜົນ SDFGI."

msgid "Throw 16 rays per frame when converging SDFGI."
msgstr "ຍິງ 16 rays ຕໍ່ເຟຣມ ເມື່ອປະມວນຜົນ SDFGI."

msgid "Throw 32 rays per frame when converging SDFGI."
msgstr "ຍິງ 32 rays ຕໍ່ເຟຣມ ເມື່ອປະມວນຜົນ SDFGI."

msgid "Throw 64 rays per frame when converging SDFGI."
msgstr "ຍິງ 64 rays ຕໍ່ເຟຣມ ເມື່ອປະມວນຜົນ SDFGI."

msgid ""
"Throw 96 rays per frame when converging SDFGI. This has high GPU requirements."
msgstr "ຍິງ 96 rays ຕໍ່ເຟຣມ ເມື່ອປະມວນຜົນ SDFGI. ອັນນີ້ໃຊ້ GPU ສູງ."

msgid ""
"Throw 128 rays per frame when converging SDFGI. This has very high GPU "
"requirements, but creates the least noisy result."
msgstr ""
"ຍິງ 128 rays ຕໍ່ເຟຣມ ເມື່ອປະມວນຜົນ SDFGI. ອັນນີ້ໃຊ້ GPU ສູງຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ຈະສ້າງຜົນລັດທີ່ມີ noise "
"ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum EnvironmentSDFGIRayCount] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum EnvironmentSDFGIRayCount]."

msgid ""
"Converge SDFGI over 5 frames. This is the most responsive, but creates the "
"most noisy result with a given ray count."
msgstr ""
"ປະມວນຜົນ (Converge) SDFGI ຜ່ານ 5 ເຟຣມ. ອັນນີ້ຕອບສະໜອງໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ຈະສ້າງຜົນລັດທີ່ມີ noise "
"ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດໃນຈຳນວນ ray ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Configure SDFGI to fully converge over 10 frames."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ SDFGI ໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນສຳເລັດສົມບູນຜ່ານ 10 ເຟຣມ."

msgid "Configure SDFGI to fully converge over 15 frames."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ SDFGI ໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນສຳເລັດສົມບູນຜ່ານ 15 ເຟຣມ."

msgid "Configure SDFGI to fully converge over 20 frames."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ SDFGI ໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນສຳເລັດສົມບູນຜ່ານ 20 ເຟຣມ."

msgid "Configure SDFGI to fully converge over 25 frames."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ SDFGI ໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນສຳເລັດສົມບູນຜ່ານ 25 ເຟຣມ."

msgid ""
"Configure SDFGI to fully converge over 30 frames. This is the least "
"responsive, but creates the least noisy result with a given ray count."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ SDFGI ໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນສຳເລັດສົມບູນຜ່ານ 30 ເຟຣມ. ອັນນີ້ຕອບສະໜອງໄດ້ຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ຈະສ້າງຜົນລັດທີ່ມີ "
"noise ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດໃນຈຳນວນ ray ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum EnvironmentSDFGIFramesToConverge] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum EnvironmentSDFGIFramesToConverge]."

msgid ""
"Update indirect light from dynamic lights in SDFGI over 1 frame. This is the "
"most responsive, but has the highest GPU requirements."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດແສງທາງອ້ອມຈາກແສງໄດນາມິກໃນ SDFGI ຜ່ານ 1 ເຟຣມ. ອັນນີ້ຕອບສະໜອງໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ໃຊ້ GPU "
"ສູງທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "Update indirect light from dynamic lights in SDFGI over 2 frames."
msgstr "ອັບເດດແສງທາງອ້ອມຈາກແສງໄດນາມິກໃນ SDFGI ຜ່ານ 2 ເຟຣມ."

msgid "Update indirect light from dynamic lights in SDFGI over 4 frames."
msgstr "ອັບເດດແສງທາງອ້ອມຈາກແສງໄດນາມິກໃນ SDFGI ຜ່ານ 4 ເຟຣມ."

msgid "Update indirect light from dynamic lights in SDFGI over 8 frames."
msgstr "ອັບເດດແສງທາງອ້ອມຈາກແສງໄດນາມິກໃນ SDFGI ຜ່ານ 8 ເຟຣມ."

msgid ""
"Update indirect light from dynamic lights in SDFGI over 16 frames. This is "
"the least responsive, but has the lowest GPU requirements."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດແສງທາງອ້ອມຈາກແສງໄດນາມິກໃນ SDFGI ຜ່ານ 16 ເຟຣມ. ອັນນີ້ຕອບສະໜອງໄດ້ຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ໃຊ້ GPU "
"ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Represents the size of the [enum EnvironmentSDFGIFramesToUpdateLight] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum EnvironmentSDFGIFramesToUpdateLight]."

msgid ""
"Disables subsurface scattering entirely, even on materials that have [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.subsurf_scatter_enabled] set to [code]true[/code]. This has "
"the lowest GPU requirements."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການໃຊ້ subsurface scattering ທັງໝົດ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມະທີຣຽວ (materials) ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງ [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.subsurf_scatter_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. ອັນນີ້ໃຊ້ GPU "
"ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "Low subsurface scattering quality."
msgstr "ຄຸນນະພາບ subsurface scattering ຕ່ຳ."

msgid "Medium subsurface scattering quality."
msgstr "ຄຸນນະພາບ subsurface scattering ປານກາງ."

msgid ""
"High subsurface scattering quality. This has the highest GPU requirements."
msgstr "ຄຸນນະພາບ subsurface scattering ສູງ. ອັນນີ້ໃຊ້ GPU ສູງທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Calculate the DOF blur using a box filter. The fastest option, but results in "
"obvious lines in blur pattern."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳນວນຄວາມມົວແບບ DOF ໂດຍໃຊ້ box filter. ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະເຫັນເປັນເສັ້ນທີ່ຊັດເຈນໃນຮູບແບບຄວາມມົວ."

msgid "Calculates DOF blur using a hexagon shaped filter."
msgstr "ຄຳນວນຄວາມມົວແບບ DOF ໂດຍໃຊ້ filter ຮູບຊົງຫົກຫຼ່ຽມ (hexagon)."

msgid ""
"Calculates DOF blur using a circle shaped filter. Best quality and most "
"realistic, but slowest. Use only for areas where a lot of performance can be "
"dedicated to post-processing (e.g. cutscenes)."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳນວນຄວາມມົວແບບ DOF ໂດຍໃຊ້ filter ຮູບຊົງກົມ. ໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບດີທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ສົມຈິງທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ. "
"ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນສ່ວນທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍໆສຳລັບ post-processing ໄດ້ (ເຊັ່ນ cutscenes)."

msgid ""
"Lowest quality DOF blur. This is the fastest setting, but you may be able to "
"see filtering artifacts."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມມົວແບບ DOF ຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳສຸດ. ນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າອາດຈະເຫັນ filtering "
"artifacts ໄດ້."

msgid "Low quality DOF blur."
msgstr "ຄວາມມົວແບບ DOF ຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳ."

msgid "Medium quality DOF blur."
msgstr "ຄວາມມົວແບບ DOF ຄຸນນະພາບປານກາງ."

msgid ""
"Highest quality DOF blur. Results in the smoothest looking blur by taking the "
"most samples, but is also significantly slower."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມມົວແບບ DOF ຄຸນນະພາບສູງສຸດ. ໃຫ້ຄວາມມົວທີ່ລຽບທີ່ສຸດໂດຍການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ (samples) ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ, "
"ແຕ່ກໍຈະຊ້າກວ່າຫຼາຍ."

msgid "The instance does not have a type."
msgstr "Instance ນີ້ບໍ່ມີປະເພດ."

msgid "The instance is a mesh."
msgstr "Instance ນີ້ແມ່ນເມຊ (mesh)."

msgid "The instance is a multimesh."
msgstr "Instance ນີ້ແມ່ນ multimesh."

msgid "The instance is a particle emitter."
msgstr "Instance ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກ (particle emitter)."

msgid "The instance is a GPUParticles collision shape."
msgstr "Instance ນີ້ແມ່ນຮູບຊົງການຕຳຂອງ GPUParticles."

msgid "The instance is a light."
msgstr "Instance ນີ້ແມ່ນແສງ."

msgid "The instance is a reflection probe."
msgstr "Instance ນີ້ແມ່ນ reflection probe."

msgid "The instance is a decal."
msgstr "Instance ນີ້ແມ່ນດີຄໍ (decal)."

msgid "The instance is a VoxelGI."
msgstr "Instance ນີ້ແມ່ນ VoxelGI."

msgid "The instance is a lightmap."
msgstr "Instance ນີ້ແມ່ນ lightmap."

msgid "The instance is an occlusion culling occluder."
msgstr "Instance ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວບັງ (occluder) ສຳລັບ occlusion culling."

msgid "The instance is a visible on-screen notifier."
msgstr "Instance ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອປະກົດເທິງໜ້າຈໍ (visible on-screen notifier)."

msgid "The instance is a fog volume."
msgstr "Instance ນີ້ແມ່ນ Fog volume (ປະລິມານໝອກ)."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum InstanceType] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum InstanceType]."

msgid ""
"A combination of the flags of geometry instances (mesh, multimesh, immediate "
"and particles)."
msgstr ""
"ການລວມກັນຂອງແຟລັກ (flags) ຂອງ geometry instances (ເມຊ, multimesh, immediate ແລະ "
"particles)."

msgid "Allows the instance to be used in baked lighting."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ instance ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນ baked lighting."

msgid "Allows the instance to be used with dynamic global illumination."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ instance ຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ dynamic global illumination."

msgid "When set, manually requests to draw geometry on next frame."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ຈະຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ແຕ້ມ geometry ໃນເຟຣມຖັດໄປດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"Always draw, even if the instance would be culled by occlusion culling. Does "
"not affect view frustum culling."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມສະເໝີ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ instance ຈະຖືກຄັດອອກໂດຍ occlusion culling ກໍຕາມ. ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ view "
"frustum culling."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum InstanceFlags] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum InstanceFlags]."

msgid "Disable shadows from this instance."
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ເງົາຈາກ instance ນີ້."

msgid "Cast shadows from this instance."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ instance ນີ້ສ້າງເງົາ."

msgid ""
"Disable backface culling when rendering the shadow of the object. This is "
"slightly slower but may result in more correct shadows."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການໃຊ້ backface culling ເມື່ອເຣນເດີເງົາຂອງວັດຖຸ. ອັນນີ້ຈະຊ້າກວ່າເລັກນ້ອຍ "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາຖືກຕ້ອງກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Only render the shadows from the object. The object itself will not be drawn."
msgstr "ເຣນເດີສະເພາະເງົາຈາກວັດຖຸເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕົວວັດຖຸເອງຈະບໍ່ຖືກແຕ້ມ."

msgid "Disable visibility range fading for the given instance."
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ visibility range fading ສຳລັບ instance ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Fade-out the given instance when it approaches its visibility range limits."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ instance ທີ່ກຳນົດຄ່ອຍໆຈາງຫາຍໄປ (fade-out) ເມື່ອມັນເຂົ້າໃກ້ຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງໄລຍະການເບິ່ງເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"Fade-in the given instance's dependencies when reaching its visibility range "
"limits."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ dependencies ຂອງ instance ທີ່ກຳນົດຄ່ອຍໆປະກົດຂຶ້ນ (fade-in) "
"ເມື່ອຮອດຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງໄລຍະການເບິ່ງເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"Index of [Image] in array of [Image]s returned by [method bake_render_uv2]. "
"Image uses [constant Image.FORMAT_RGBA8] and contains albedo color in the "
"[code].rgb[/code] channels and alpha in the [code].a[/code] channel."
msgstr ""
"ອິນເດັກຂອງ [Image] ໃນອາເຣຂອງ [Image] ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນໂດຍ [method bake_render_uv2]. "
"ພາບໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ [constant Image.FORMAT_RGBA8] ແລະ ບັນຈຸສີ albedo ໃນຊ່ອງ [code].rgb[/"
"code] ແລະ ອັນຟາໃນຊ່ອງ [code].a[/code]."

msgid ""
"Index of [Image] in array of [Image]s returned by [method bake_render_uv2]. "
"Image uses [constant Image.FORMAT_RGBA8] and contains the per-pixel normal of "
"the object in the [code].rgb[/code] channels and nothing in the [code].a[/"
"code] channel. The per-pixel normal is encoded as [code]normal * 0.5 + 0.5[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ອິນເດັກຂອງ [Image] ໃນອາເຣຂອງ [Image] ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນໂດຍ [method bake_render_uv2]. "
"ພາບໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ [constant Image.FORMAT_RGBA8] ແລະ ບັນຈຸນໍມໍ (normal) "
"ໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວຂອງວັດຖຸໃນຊ່ອງ [code].rgb[/code] ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງໃນຊ່ອງ [code].a[/code]. "
"ນໍມໍໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດເປັນ [code]normal * 0.5 + 0.5[/code]."

msgid ""
"Index of [Image] in array of [Image]s returned by [method bake_render_uv2]. "
"Image uses [constant Image.FORMAT_RGBA8] and contains ambient occlusion (from "
"material and decals only) in the [code].r[/code] channel, roughness in the "
"[code].g[/code] channel, metallic in the [code].b[/code] channel and sub "
"surface scattering amount in the [code].a[/code] channel."
msgstr ""
"ອິນເດັກຂອງ [Image] ໃນອາເຣຂອງ [Image] ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນໂດຍ [method bake_render_uv2]. "
"ພາບໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ [constant Image.FORMAT_RGBA8] ແລະ ບັນຈຸ ambient occlusion (ຈາກມະທີຣຽວ "
"ແລະ ດີຄໍເທົ່ານັ້ນ) ໃນຊ່ອງ [code].r[/code], roughness ໃນຊ່ອງ [code].g[/code], metallic "
"ໃນຊ່ອງ [code].b[/code] ແລະ ປະລິມານ sub surface scattering ໃນຊ່ອງ [code].a[/code]."

msgid ""
"Index of [Image] in array of [Image]s returned by [method bake_render_uv2]. "
"Image uses [constant Image.FORMAT_RGBAH] and contains emission color in the "
"[code].rgb[/code] channels and nothing in the [code].a[/code] channel."
msgstr ""
"ອິນເດັກຂອງ [Image] ໃນອາເຣຂອງ [Image] ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນໂດຍ [method bake_render_uv2]. "
"ພາບໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ [constant Image.FORMAT_RGBAH] ແລະ ບັນຈຸສີການແຜ່ລັງສີ (emission color) "
"ໃນຊ່ອງ [code].rgb[/code] ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງໃນຊ່ອງ [code].a[/code]."

msgid "Diffuse canvas texture ([member CanvasTexture.diffuse_texture])."
msgstr "Diffuse canvas texture ([member CanvasTexture.diffuse_texture])."

msgid "Normal map canvas texture ([member CanvasTexture.normal_texture])."
msgstr "Normal map canvas texture ([member CanvasTexture.normal_texture])."

msgid "Specular map canvas texture ([member CanvasTexture.specular_texture])."
msgstr "Specular map canvas texture ([member CanvasTexture.specular_texture])."

msgid "The nine patch gets stretched where needed."
msgstr "ສ່ວນ nine patch ຈະຖືກຢືດ (stretched) ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

msgid "The nine patch gets filled with tiles where needed."
msgstr "ສ່ວນ nine patch ຈະຖືກເຕັມດ້ວຍແຜ່ນລາຍ (tiles) ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

msgid ""
"The nine patch gets filled with tiles where needed and stretches them a bit "
"if needed."
msgstr "ສ່ວນ nine patch ຈະຖືກເຕັມດ້ວຍແຜ່ນລາຍໃນບ່ອນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ແລະ ຈະຢືດພວກມັນເລັກນ້ອຍ ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ."

msgid "Uses the default filter mode for this [Viewport]."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂໝດ filter ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ [Viewport] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"The texture filter reads from the nearest pixel and blends between 2 mipmaps "
"(or uses the nearest mipmap if [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] is [code]true[/code]) based on the "
"angle between the surface and the camera view. This makes the texture look "
"pixelated from up close, and smooth from a distance. Anisotropic filtering "
"improves texture quality on surfaces that are almost in line with the camera, "
"but is slightly slower. The anisotropic filtering level can be changed by "
"adjusting [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"anisotropic_filtering_level].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This texture filter is rarely useful in 2D projects. [constant "
"CANVAS_ITEM_TEXTURE_FILTER_NEAREST_WITH_MIPMAPS] is usually more appropriate "
"in this case."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຕອງເທັກເຈີ (texture filter) ຈະອ່ານຈາກພິກເຊວທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ 2 mipmaps (ຫຼື "
"ໃຊ້ mipmap ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ຖ້າ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]) "
"ໂດຍອີງຕາມມຸມລະຫວ່າງພື້ນຜິວ ແລະ ມຸມເບິ່ງຂອງກ້ອງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ເທັກເຈີເບິ່ງເປັນເມັດພິກເຊວເມື່ອເບິ່ງໃກ້ໆ, "
"ແລະ ເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກໄລຍະໄກ. ການກອງແບບ Anisotropic "
"ຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄຸນນະພາບເທັກເຈີໃນພື້ນຜິວທີ່ມີແນວເກືອບຂະໜານກັບກ້ອງ, ແຕ່ຈະຊ້າກວ່າເລັກນ້ອຍ. ລະດັບການກອງ "
"anisotropic ສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການປັບ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/anisotropic_filtering_level].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວຕອງເທັກເຈີນີ້ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍມີປະໂຫຍດໃນໂປຣເຈັກ 2D. [constant "
"CANVAS_ITEM_TEXTURE_FILTER_NEAREST_WITH_MIPMAPS] ມັກຈະເໝາະສົມກວ່າໃນກໍລະນີນີ້."

msgid ""
"The texture filter blends between the nearest 4 pixels and blends between 2 "
"mipmaps (or uses the nearest mipmap if [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"textures/default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] is [code]true[/code]) "
"based on the angle between the surface and the camera view. This makes the "
"texture look smooth from up close, and smooth from a distance. Anisotropic "
"filtering improves texture quality on surfaces that are almost in line with "
"the camera, but is slightly slower. The anisotropic filtering level can be "
"changed by adjusting [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/anisotropic_filtering_level].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This texture filter is rarely useful in 2D projects. [constant "
"CANVAS_ITEM_TEXTURE_FILTER_LINEAR_WITH_MIPMAPS] is usually more appropriate "
"in this case."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຕອງພື້ນຜິວ (texture filter) ຈະປະສົມປະສານລະຫວ່າງ 4 ພິກເຊວທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ 2 "
"ມິບແມັບ (ຫຼື ໃຊ້ ມິບແມັບທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ຖ້າ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]) "
"ໂດຍອີງຕາມມຸມລະຫວ່າງພື້ນຜິວ ແລະ ມຸມເບິ່ງຂອງກ້ອງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ພື້ນຜິວເບິ່ງກ້ຽງນຽນທັງໃນໄລຍະໃກ້ ແລະ "
"ໄລຍະໄກ. ການຕອງແບບ Anisotropic ຈະຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງຄຸນນະພາບພື້ນຜິວໃນສ່ວນທີ່ເກືອບຈະຂະໜານກັບກ້ອງ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະຊ້າກວ່າເລັກນ້ອຍ. ລະດັບການຕອງ anisotropic ສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການປັບ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"anisotropic_filtering_level].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວຕອງພື້ນຜິວນີ້ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍມີປະໂຫຍດໃນໂປຣເຈັກ 2D. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ [constant "
"CANVAS_ITEM_TEXTURE_FILTER_LINEAR_WITH_MIPMAPS] ຈະເໝາະສົມກວ່າໃນກໍລະນີນີ້."

msgid "Max value for [enum CanvasItemTextureFilter] enum."
msgstr "ຄ່າສູງສຸດສຳລັບ enum [enum CanvasItemTextureFilter]."

msgid "Uses the default repeat mode for this [Viewport]."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂໝດການເຮັດຊ້ຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ [Viewport] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Disables textures repeating. Instead, when reading UVs outside the 0-1 range, "
"the value will be clamped to the edge of the texture, resulting in a "
"stretched out look at the borders of the texture."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການເຮັດຊ້ຳຂອງພື້ນຜິວ. ແທນທີ່ຈະເຮັດຊ້ຳ, ເມື່ອອ່ານຄ່າ UV ທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດ 0-1, ຄ່າຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ "
"(clamped) ຢູ່ທີ່ຂອບຂອງພື້ນຜິວ, ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າມັນຖືກດຶງຢືດອອກຢູ່ທີ່ຂອບຂອງພື້ນຜິວນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Flip the texture when repeating so that the edge lines up instead of abruptly "
"changing."
msgstr "ພິກກັບດ້ານພື້ນຜິວເມື່ອມີການເຮັດຊ້ຳ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂອບຂອງມັນຕໍ່ກັນໄດ້ພໍດີ ແທນທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນແປງແບບກະທັນຫັນ."

msgid "Max value for [enum CanvasItemTextureRepeat] enum."
msgstr "ຄ່າສູງສຸດສຳລັບ enum [enum CanvasItemTextureRepeat]."

msgid "Child draws over parent and is not clipped."
msgstr "ໂນດລູກຈະຖືກແຕ້ມທັບໂນດແມ່ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕັດຂອບ (clipped)."

msgid ""
"Parent is used for the purposes of clipping only. Child is clipped to the "
"parent's visible area, parent is not drawn."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດແມ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການຕັດຂອບເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ໂນດລູກຈະຖືກຕັດຂອບໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງໂນດແມ່, ແຕ່ໂນດແມ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກແຕ້ມ."

msgid ""
"Parent is used for clipping child, but parent is also drawn underneath child "
"as normal before clipping child to its visible area."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດແມ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັດຂອບໂນດລູກ, ແຕ່ໂນດແມ່ກໍຈະຖືກແຕ້ມຢູ່ກ້ອງໂນດລູກຕາມປົກກະຕິ "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຕັດຂອບໂນດລູກໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງມັນ."

msgid "2D point light (see [PointLight2D])."
msgstr "ແສງແບບຈຸດ 2D (ເບິ່ງ [PointLight2D])."

msgid "2D directional (sun/moon) light (see [DirectionalLight2D])."
msgstr "ແສງແບບກຳນົດທິດທາງ 2D (ແສງຕາເວັນ/ດວງຈັນ) (ເບິ່ງ [DirectionalLight2D])."

msgid "Adds light color additive to the canvas."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສີຂອງແສງແບບບວກ (additive) ເຂົ້າໃນແຄນວາສ."

msgid "Adds light color subtractive to the canvas."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສີຂອງແສງແບບລົບ (subtractive) ເຂົ້າໃນແຄນວາສ."

msgid "The light adds color depending on transparency."
msgstr "ແສງຈະເພີ່ມສີໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ."

msgid "Do not apply a filter to canvas light shadows."
msgstr "ບໍ່ໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງກັບເງົາຂອງແສງໃນແຄນວາສ."

msgid "Use PCF5 filtering to filter canvas light shadows."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການຕອງແບບ PCF5 ເພື່ອຕອງເງົາຂອງແສງໃນແຄນວາສ."

msgid "Use PCF13 filtering to filter canvas light shadows."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການຕອງແບບ PCF13 ເພື່ອຕອງເງົາຂອງແສງໃນແຄນວາສ."

msgid "Max value of the [enum CanvasLightShadowFilter] enum."
msgstr "ຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງ enum [enum CanvasLightShadowFilter]."

msgid "Culling of the canvas occluder is disabled."
msgstr "ປິດການຄັດອອກ (Culling) ຂອງ canvas occluder."

msgid "Culling of the canvas occluder is clockwise."
msgstr "ການຄັດອອກ (Culling) ຂອງ canvas occluder ແມ່ນຕາມເຂັມໂມງ."

msgid "Culling of the canvas occluder is counterclockwise."
msgstr "ການຄັດອອກ (Culling) ຂອງ canvas occluder ແມ່ນທວນເຂັມໂມງ."

msgid "Boolean global shader parameter ([code]global uniform bool ...[/code])."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບບູນີນ ([code]global uniform bool ...[/code])."

msgid ""
"2-dimensional boolean vector global shader parameter ([code]global uniform "
"bvec2 ...[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບເວກເຕີບູນີນ 2 ມິຕິ ([code]global uniform bvec2 ...[/code])."

msgid ""
"3-dimensional boolean vector global shader parameter ([code]global uniform "
"bvec3 ...[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບເວກເຕີບູນີນ 3 ມິຕິ ([code]global uniform bvec3 ...[/code])."

msgid ""
"4-dimensional boolean vector global shader parameter ([code]global uniform "
"bvec4 ...[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບເວກເຕີບູນີນ 4 ມິຕິ ([code]global uniform bvec4 ...[/code])."

msgid "Integer global shader parameter ([code]global uniform int ...[/code])."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບເລກຖ້ວນ ([code]global uniform int ...[/code])."

msgid ""
"2-dimensional integer vector global shader parameter ([code]global uniform "
"ivec2 ...[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບເວກເຕີເລກຖ້ວນ 2 ມິຕິ ([code]global uniform ivec2 ...[/code])."

msgid ""
"3-dimensional integer vector global shader parameter ([code]global uniform "
"ivec3 ...[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບເວກເຕີເລກຖ້ວນ 3 ມິຕິ ([code]global uniform ivec3 ...[/code])."

msgid ""
"4-dimensional integer vector global shader parameter ([code]global uniform "
"ivec4 ...[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບເວກເຕີເລກຖ້ວນ 4 ມິຕິ ([code]global uniform ivec4 ...[/code])."

msgid ""
"2-dimensional integer rectangle global shader parameter ([code]global uniform "
"ivec4 ...[/code]). Equivalent to [constant GLOBAL_VAR_TYPE_IVEC4] in shader "
"code, but exposed as a [Rect2i] in the editor UI."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກເລກຖ້ວນ 2 ມິຕິ ([code]global uniform ivec4 ...[/"
"code]). ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [constant GLOBAL_VAR_TYPE_IVEC4] ໃນລະຫັດເຊເດີ, ແຕ່ຈະສະແດງເປັນ "
"[Rect2i] ໃນ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Unsigned integer global shader parameter ([code]global uniform uint ...[/"
"code])."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບເລກຖ້ວນບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ([code]global uniform uint ...[/code])."

msgid ""
"2-dimensional unsigned integer vector global shader parameter ([code]global "
"uniform uvec2 ...[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບເວກເຕີເລກຖ້ວນບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ 2 ມິຕິ ([code]global uniform uvec2 ...[/"
"code])."

msgid ""
"3-dimensional unsigned integer vector global shader parameter ([code]global "
"uniform uvec3 ...[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບເວກເຕີເລກຖ້ວນບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ 3 ມິຕິ ([code]global uniform uvec3 ...[/"
"code])."

msgid ""
"4-dimensional unsigned integer vector global shader parameter ([code]global "
"uniform uvec4 ...[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບເວກເຕີເລກຖ້ວນບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ 4 ມິຕິ ([code]global uniform uvec4 ...[/"
"code])."

msgid ""
"Single-precision floating-point global shader parameter ([code]global uniform "
"float ...[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບເລກທົດສະນິຍົມຄວາມລະອຽດດ່ຽວ ([code]global uniform float ...[/"
"code])."

msgid ""
"2-dimensional floating-point vector global shader parameter ([code]global "
"uniform vec2 ...[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບເວກເຕີເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ 2 ມິຕິ ([code]global uniform vec2 ...[/"
"code])."

msgid ""
"3-dimensional floating-point vector global shader parameter ([code]global "
"uniform vec3 ...[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບເວກເຕີເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ 3 ມິຕິ ([code]global uniform vec3 ...[/"
"code])."

msgid ""
"4-dimensional floating-point vector global shader parameter ([code]global "
"uniform vec4 ...[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບເວກເຕີເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ 4 ມິຕິ ([code]global uniform vec4 ...[/"
"code])."

msgid ""
"Color global shader parameter ([code]global uniform vec4 ...[/code]). "
"Equivalent to [constant GLOBAL_VAR_TYPE_VEC4] in shader code, but exposed as "
"a [Color] in the editor UI."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບສີ ([code]global uniform vec4 ...[/code]). ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ "
"[constant GLOBAL_VAR_TYPE_VEC4] ໃນລະຫັດເຊເດີ, ແຕ່ຈະສະແດງເປັນ [Color] ໃນ UI "
"ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"2-dimensional floating-point rectangle global shader parameter ([code]global "
"uniform vec4 ...[/code]). Equivalent to [constant GLOBAL_VAR_TYPE_VEC4] in "
"shader code, but exposed as a [Rect2] in the editor UI."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ 2 ມິຕິ ([code]global uniform vec4 ...[/"
"code]). ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [constant GLOBAL_VAR_TYPE_VEC4] ໃນລະຫັດເຊເດີ, ແຕ່ຈະສະແດງເປັນ "
"[Rect2] ໃນ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"2×2 matrix global shader parameter ([code]global uniform mat2 ...[/code]). "
"Exposed as a [PackedInt32Array] in the editor UI."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບມາຕຣິດ 2×2 ([code]global uniform mat2 ...[/code]). "
"ຈະສະແດງເປັນ [PackedInt32Array] ໃນ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"3×3 matrix global shader parameter ([code]global uniform mat3 ...[/code]). "
"Exposed as a [Basis] in the editor UI."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບມາຕຣິດ 3×3 ([code]global uniform mat3 ...[/code]). "
"ຈະສະແດງເປັນ [Basis] ໃນ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"4×4 matrix global shader parameter ([code]global uniform mat4 ...[/code]). "
"Exposed as a [Projection] in the editor UI."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບມາຕຣິດ 4×4 ([code]global uniform mat4 ...[/code]). "
"ຈະສະແດງເປັນ [Projection] ໃນ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"2-dimensional transform global shader parameter ([code]global uniform "
"mat2x3 ...[/code]). Exposed as a [Transform2D] in the editor UI."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບການແປງ 2 ມິຕິ ([code]global uniform mat2x3 ...[/code]). "
"ຈະສະແດງເປັນ [Transform2D] ໃນ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"3-dimensional transform global shader parameter ([code]global uniform "
"mat3x4 ...[/code]). Exposed as a [Transform3D] in the editor UI."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບການແປງ 3 ມິຕິ ([code]global uniform mat3x4 ...[/code]). "
"ຈະສະແດງເປັນ [Transform3D] ໃນ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"2D sampler global shader parameter ([code]global uniform sampler2D ...[/"
"code]). Exposed as a [Texture2D] in the editor UI."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບ 2D sampler ([code]global uniform sampler2D ...[/code]). "
"ຈະສະແດງເປັນ [Texture2D] ໃນ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"2D sampler array global shader parameter ([code]global uniform "
"sampler2DArray ...[/code]). Exposed as a [Texture2DArray] in the editor UI."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບອາເຣ 2D sampler ([code]global uniform sampler2DArray ...[/"
"code]). ຈະສະແດງເປັນ [Texture2DArray] ໃນ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"3D sampler global shader parameter ([code]global uniform sampler3D ...[/"
"code]). Exposed as a [Texture3D] in the editor UI."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບ 3D sampler ([code]global uniform sampler3D ...[/code]). "
"ຈະສະແດງເປັນ [Texture3D] ໃນ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Cubemap sampler global shader parameter ([code]global uniform samplerCube ..."
"[/code]). Exposed as a [Cubemap] in the editor UI."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບ Cubemap sampler ([code]global uniform samplerCube ...[/"
"code]). ຈະສະແດງເປັນ [Cubemap] ໃນ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"External sampler global shader parameter ([code]global uniform "
"samplerExternalOES ...[/code]). Exposed as an [ExternalTexture] in the editor "
"UI."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີທົ່ວໂລກແບບແຊມເປີພາຍນອກ ([code]global uniform samplerExternalOES ...[/"
"code]). ຈະສະແດງເປັນ [ExternalTexture] ໃນ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum GlobalShaderParameterType] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum GlobalShaderParameterType]."

msgid ""
"Number of objects rendered in the current 3D scene. This varies depending on "
"camera position and rotation."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກເຣນເດີໃນສາກ 3D ປັດຈຸບັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນແປງໄປຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ການໝຸນຂອງກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Number of points, lines, or triangles rendered in the current 3D scene. This "
"varies depending on camera position and rotation."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຈຸດ, ເສັ້ນ, ຫຼື ຮູບສາມແຈທີ່ຖືກເຣນເດີໃນສາກ 3D ປັດຈຸບັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນແປງໄປຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ "
"ການໝຸນຂອງກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Number of draw calls performed to render in the current 3D scene. This varies "
"depending on camera position and rotation."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນການຮຽກໃຊ້ການແຕ້ມ (draw calls) ທີ່ປະຕິບັດການເຣນເດີໃນສາກ 3D ປັດຈຸບັນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນແປງໄປຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ການໝຸນຂອງກ້ອງ."

msgid "Texture memory used (in bytes)."
msgstr "ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳພື້ນຜິວທີ່ໃຊ້ (ເປັນໄບຕ໌)."

msgid ""
"Buffer memory used (in bytes). This includes vertex data, uniform buffers, "
"and many miscellaneous buffer types used internally."
msgstr ""
"ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳບັຟເຟີທີ່ໃຊ້ (ເປັນໄບຕ໌). ສິ່ງນີ້ລວມມີຂໍ້ມູນເວີເທັກ, uniform buffers, ແລະ ປະເພດບັຟເຟີອື່ນໆ "
"ທີ່ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ."

msgid ""
"Video memory used (in bytes). When using the Forward+ or Mobile renderers, "
"this is always greater than the sum of [constant "
"RENDERING_INFO_TEXTURE_MEM_USED] and [constant "
"RENDERING_INFO_BUFFER_MEM_USED], since there is miscellaneous data not "
"accounted for by those two metrics. When using the Compatibility renderer, "
"this is equal to the sum of [constant RENDERING_INFO_TEXTURE_MEM_USED] and "
"[constant RENDERING_INFO_BUFFER_MEM_USED]."
msgstr ""
"ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳວິດີໂອທີ່ໃຊ້ (ເປັນໄບຕ໌). ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວເຣນເດີ Forward+ ຫຼື Mobile, "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຜົນລວມຂອງ [constant RENDERING_INFO_TEXTURE_MEM_USED] ແລະ [constant "
"RENDERING_INFO_BUFFER_MEM_USED] ສະເໝີ, ເນື່ອງຈາກມີຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆ ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນັບລວມໃນສອງຄ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວເຣນເດີ Compatibility, ຄ່ານີ້ຈະເທົ່າກັບຜົນລວມຂອງ [constant "
"RENDERING_INFO_TEXTURE_MEM_USED] ແລະ [constant "
"RENDERING_INFO_BUFFER_MEM_USED]."

msgid "Pipeline compilation that was triggered by the 2D canvas renderer."
msgstr "ການຄອມໄພລ໌ໄພລາຍ (Pipeline compilation) ທີ່ຖືກກະຕຸ້ນໂດຍຕົວເຣນເດີແຄນວາສ 2D."

msgid "Pipeline compilation that was triggered by loading a mesh."
msgstr "ການຄອມໄພລ໌ໄພລາຍທີ່ຖືກກະຕຸ້ນໂດຍການໂຫຼດເມຊ (mesh)."

msgid ""
"Pipeline compilation that was triggered by building the surface cache before "
"rendering the scene."
msgstr "ການຄອມໄພລ໌ໄພລາຍທີ່ຖືກກະຕຸ້ນໂດຍການສ້າງແຄຊພື້ນຜິວ ກ່ອນການເຣນເດີສາກ."

msgid "Pipeline compilation that was triggered while drawing the scene."
msgstr "ການຄອມໄພລ໌ໄພລາຍທີ່ຖືກກະຕຸ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການແຕ້ມສາກ."

msgid "Pipeline compilation that was triggered to optimize the current scene."
msgstr "ການຄອມໄພລ໌ໄພລາຍທີ່ຖືກກະຕຸ້ນເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງສາກປັດຈຸບັນໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ (optimize)."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum PipelineSource] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum PipelineSource]."

msgid "No stretching is applied."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ການຢືດຮູບ."

msgid "Stretches image to fullscreen while preserving aspect ratio."
msgstr "ຢືດຮູບໃຫ້ເຕັມຈໍໂດຍທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງພາບ (aspect ratio) ໄວ້."

msgid "Stretches the height of the image based on the width of the screen."
msgstr "ຢືດຄວາມສູງຂອງຮູບໂດຍອີງຕາມຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid "Stretches the width of the image based on the height of the screen."
msgstr "ຢືດຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຮູບໂດຍອີງຕາມຄວາມສູງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"Stretches the image to cover the entire screen while preserving aspect ratio."
msgstr "ຢືດຮູບໃຫ້ກວມເອົາທົ່ວທັງໜ້າຈໍໂດຍທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງພາບໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Stretches the image to cover the entire screen but doesn't preserve aspect "
"ratio."
msgstr "ຢືດຮູບໃຫ້ກວມເອົາທົ່ວທັງໜ້າຈໍແຕ່ບໍ່ຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງພາບໄວ້."

msgid "This constant has not been used since Godot 3.0."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ Godot 3.0."

msgid ""
"Abstract scene buffers object, created for each viewport for which 3D "
"rendering is done."
msgstr "ອັອບເຈັກບັຟເຟີສາກແບບນາມມະທຳ (Abstract), ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະວິວພອດທີ່ມີການເຣນເດີ 3D."

msgid ""
"Abstract scene buffers object, created for each viewport for which 3D "
"rendering is done. It manages any additional buffers used during rendering "
"and will discard buffers when the viewport is resized. See also "
"[RenderSceneBuffersRD].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is an internal rendering server object. Do not instantiate "
"this class from a script."
msgstr ""
"ອັອບເຈັກບັຟເຟີສາກແບບນາມມະທຳ, ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະວິວພອດທີ່ມີການເຣນເດີ 3D. "
"ມັນຈັດການບັຟເຟີເພີ່ມເຕີມຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຣນເດີ ແລະ ຈະຍົກເລີກບັຟເຟີເມື່ອວິວພອດຖືກປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [RenderSceneBuffersRD] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນອັອບເຈັກຂອງເຊີບເວີເຣນເດີພາຍໃນ. ຫ້າມສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງຄລາສນີ້ຈາກສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"This method is called by the rendering server when the associated viewport's "
"configuration is changed. It will discard the old buffers and recreate the "
"internal buffers used."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ໂດຍເຊີບເວີເຣນເດີເມື່ອການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງວິວພອດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. "
"ມັນຈະຖິ້ມບັຟເຟີເກົ່າ ແລະ ສ້າງບັຟເຟີພາຍໃນທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຄືນໃໝ່."

msgid "Configuration object used to setup a [RenderSceneBuffers] object."
msgstr "ອັອບເຈັກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າອັອບເຈັກ [RenderSceneBuffers]."

msgid ""
"This configuration object is created and populated by the render engine on a "
"viewport change and used to (re)configure a [RenderSceneBuffers] object."
msgstr ""
"ອັອບເຈັກການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍເອັນຈິນເຣນເດີເມື່ອວິວພອດມີການປ່ຽນແປງ ແລະ ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອ "
"(ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່) ອັອບເຈັກ [RenderSceneBuffers]."

msgid "Level of the anisotropic filter."
msgstr "ລະດັບຂອງຕົວຕອງ anisotropic."

msgid "FSR Sharpness applicable if FSR upscaling is used."
msgstr "ຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງ FSR ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ ຖ້າຫາກມີການໃຊ້ FSR upscaling."

msgid "The size of the 3D render buffer used for rendering."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງບັຟເຟີເຣນເດີ 3D ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຣນເດີ."

msgid "The MSAA mode we're using for 3D rendering."
msgstr "ໂໝດ MSAA ທີ່ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຣນເດີ 3D."

msgid "The render target associated with these buffer."
msgstr "ເປົ້າໝາຍການເຣນເດີ (render target) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບບັຟເຟີເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

msgid ""
"The requested scaling mode with which we upscale/downscale if [member "
"internal_size] and [member target_size] are not equal."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການປັບຂະໜາດ (scaling) ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ເຊິ່ງພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອ upscale/downscale ຖ້າຫາກ "
"[member internal_size] ແລະ [member target_size] ບໍ່ເທົ່າກັນ."

msgid "The requested screen space AA applied in post processing."
msgstr "Screen space AA ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນ post processing."

msgid "The target (upscale) size if scaling is used."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດເປົ້າໝາຍ (upscale) ຖ້າຫາກມີການໃຊ້ການປັບຂະໜາດ."

msgid ""
"Bias applied to mipmaps.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only supported in the Forward+ and Mobile "
"renderers, not Compatibility. In Compatibility, this property is always "
"treated as if it was set to [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ Bias ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບມິບແມັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນຕົວເຣນເດີ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ "
"Compatibility. ໃນ Compatibility, ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດຄືກັບວ່າມັນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0.0[/"
"code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid "The number of views we're rendering."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນມຸມເບິ່ງ (views) ທີ່ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງເຣນເດີ."

msgid ""
"This class allows for a RenderSceneBuffer implementation to be made in "
"GDExtension."
msgstr "ຄລາສນີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສ້າງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ RenderSceneBuffer ໃນ GDExtension."

msgid "Implement this in GDExtension to handle the (re)sizing of a viewport."
msgstr "ສ້າງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງສິ່ງນີ້ໃນ GDExtension ເພື່ອຈັດການກັບການ (ປ່ຽນ) ຂະໜາດຂອງວິວພອດ."

msgid "Implement this in GDExtension to change the anisotropic filtering level."
msgstr "ສ້າງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງສິ່ງນີ້ໃນ GDExtension ເພື່ອປ່ຽນລະດັບການຕອງ anisotropic."

msgid "Implement this in GDExtension to record a new FSR sharpness value."
msgstr "ສ້າງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງສິ່ງນີ້ໃນ GDExtension ເພື່ອບັນທຶກຄ່າຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງ FSR ໃໝ່."

msgid "Implement this in GDExtension to change the texture mipmap bias."
msgstr "ສ້າງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງສິ່ງນີ້ໃນ GDExtension ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່າ texture mipmap bias."

msgid "Implement this in GDExtension to react to the debanding flag changing."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງສິ່ງນີ້ໃນ GDExtension ເພື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງ flag debanding."

msgid ""
"Render scene buffer implementation for the RenderingDevice based renderers."
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງບັຟເຟີສາກການເຣນເດີສຳລັບຕົວເຣນເດີທີ່ອີງຕາມ RenderingDevice."

msgid ""
"This object manages all 3D rendering buffers for the rendering device based "
"renderers. An instance of this object is created for every viewport that has "
"3D rendering enabled. See also [RenderSceneBuffers].\n"
"All buffers are organized in [b]contexts[/b]. The default context is called "
"[b]render_buffers[/b] and can contain amongst others the color buffer, depth "
"buffer, velocity buffers, VRS density map and MSAA variants of these "
"buffers.\n"
"Buffers are only guaranteed to exist during rendering of the viewport.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is an internal rendering server object. Do not instantiate "
"this class from a script."
msgstr ""
"ອັອບເຈັກນີ້ຈັດການບັຟເຟີເຣນເດີ 3D ທັງໝົດສຳລັບຕົວເຣນເດີທີ່ອີງຕາມ rendering device. "
"ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງອັອບເຈັກນີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ສຳລັບທຸກໆ ວິວພອດທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ການເຣນເດີ 3D. ເບິ່ງ "
"[RenderSceneBuffers] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"ບັຟເຟີທັງໝົດຖືກຈັດລະບຽບເປັນ [b]context[/b]. context ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນມີຊື່ວ່າ [b]render_buffers[/b] "
"ແລະ ສາມາດບັນຈຸ color buffer, depth buffer, velocity buffers, VRS density map "
"ແລະ MSAA ຂອງບັຟເຟີເຫຼົ່ານີ້.\n"
"ບັຟເຟີຈະຖືກຮັບປະກັນວ່າມີຢູ່ສະເພາະໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຣນເດີວິວພອດເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນອັອບເຈັກຂອງເຊີບເວີເຣນເດີພາຍໃນ. ຫ້າມສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງຄລາສນີ້ຈາກສະຄຣິບ."

msgid "Frees all buffers related to this context."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ (Free) ບັຟເຟີທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ context ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Create a new texture with the given definition and cache this under the given "
"name. Will return the existing texture if it already exists."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ໃໝ່ດ້ວຍການກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ ແລະ ເກັບໄວ້ໃນແຄຊພາຍໃຕ້ຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນພື້ນຜິວທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່ກ່ອນແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Create a new texture using the given format and view and cache this under the "
"given name. Will return the existing texture if it already exists."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງພື້ນຜິວໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ (format) ແລະ ມຸມເບິ່ງ (view) ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ ແລະ ເກັບໄວ້ໃນແຄຊພາຍໃຕ້ຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນພື້ນຜິວທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່ກ່ອນແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Create a new texture view for an existing texture and cache this under the "
"given [param view_name]. Will return the existing texture view if it already "
"exists. Will error if the source texture doesn't exist."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງມຸມເບິ່ງພື້ນຜິວ (texture view) ໃໝ່ສຳລັບພື້ນຜິວທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ເກັບໄວ້ໃນແຄຊພາຍໃຕ້ຊື່ [param "
"view_name]. ຈະສົ່ງຄືນມຸມເບິ່ງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່ກ່ອນແລ້ວ. ຈະເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ຖ້າບໍ່ມີພື້ນຜິວຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the specified layer from the color texture we are rendering 3D "
"content to.\n"
"If [param msaa] is [code]true[/code] and MSAA is enabled, this returns the "
"MSAA variant of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເລເຍີ (layer) ທີ່ລະບຸຈາກ color texture ທີ່ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງເຣນເດີເນື້ອຫາ 3D ໃສ່.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param msaa] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ MSAA, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ MSAA ຂອງບັຟເຟີນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the color texture we are rendering 3D content to. If multiview is "
"used this will be a texture array with all views.\n"
"If [param msaa] is [code]true[/code] and MSAA is enabled, this returns the "
"MSAA variant of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ color texture ທີ່ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງເຣນເດີເນື້ອຫາ 3D ໃສ່. ຖ້າມີການໃຊ້ multiview ມັນຈະເປັນ "
"texture array ທີ່ມີທຸກມຸມເບິ່ງ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param msaa] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ MSAA, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ MSAA ຂອງບັຟເຟີນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the specified layer from the depth texture we are rendering 3D "
"content to.\n"
"If [param msaa] is [code]true[/code] and MSAA is enabled, this returns the "
"MSAA variant of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເລເຍີທີ່ລະບຸຈາກ depth texture ທີ່ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງເຣນເດີເນື້ອຫາ 3D ໃສ່.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param msaa] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ MSAA, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ MSAA ຂອງບັຟເຟີນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the depth texture we are rendering 3D content to. If multiview is "
"used this will be a texture array with all views.\n"
"If [param msaa] is [code]true[/code] and MSAA is enabled, this returns the "
"MSAA variant of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ depth texture ທີ່ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງເຣນເດີເນື້ອຫາ 3D ໃສ່. ຖ້າມີການໃຊ້ multiview ມັນຈະເປັນ "
"texture array ທີ່ມີທຸກມຸມເບິ່ງ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param msaa] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ MSAA, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ MSAA ຂອງບັຟເຟີນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the FSR sharpness value used while rendering the 3D content (if "
"[method get_scaling_3d_mode] is an FSR mode)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງ FSR ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຣນເດີເນື້ອຫາ 3D (ຖ້າ [method "
"get_scaling_3d_mode] ແມ່ນໂໝດ FSR)."

msgid ""
"Returns the internal size of the render buffer (size before upscaling) with "
"which textures are created by default."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດພາຍໃນຂອງບັຟເຟີເຣນເດີ (ຂະໜາດກ່ອນ upscaling) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສ້າງ textures "
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Returns the applied 3D MSAA mode for this viewport."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໂໝດ 3D MSAA ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບວິວພອດນີ້."

msgid "Returns the render target associated with this buffers object."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເປົ້າໝາຍການເຣນເດີ (render target) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບອັອບເຈັກບັຟເຟີນີ້."

msgid "Returns the scaling mode used for upscaling."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໂໝດການປັບຂະໜາດ (scaling) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການ upscaling."

msgid "Returns the screen-space antialiasing method applied."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວິທີການລຶບຮອຍຢັກ (antialiasing) ແບບ screen-space ທີ່ໃຊ້."

msgid "Returns the target size of the render buffer (size after upscaling)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງບັຟເຟີເຣນເດີ (ຂະໜາດຫຼັງຈາກ upscaling)."

msgid "Returns a cached texture with this name."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນພື້ນຜິວໃນແຄຊທີ່ມີຊື່ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the texture format information with which a cached texture was "
"created."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນຮູບແບບ (format) ຂອງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ໃຊ້ສ້າງພື້ນຜິວໃນແຄຊ."

msgid "Returns the number of MSAA samples used."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຕົວຢ່າງ (samples) ຂອງ MSAA ທີ່ໃຊ້."

msgid "Returns a specific slice (layer or mipmap) for a cached texture."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ slice ທີ່ລະບຸ (layer ຫຼື mipmap) ສຳລັບພື້ນຜິວໃນແຄຊ."

msgid "Returns the texture size of a given slice of a cached texture."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດຂອງພື້ນຜິວຂອງ slice ທີ່ລະບຸຈາກພື້ນຜິວໃນແຄຊ."

msgid ""
"Returns a specific view of a slice (layer or mipmap) for a cached texture."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນມຸມເບິ່ງ (view) ສະເພາະຂອງ slice (layer ຫຼື mipmap) ສຳລັບພື້ນຜິວໃນແຄຊ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if debanding is enabled."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ debanding."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if TAA is enabled."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ TAA."

msgid ""
"Returns the specified layer from the velocity texture we are rendering 3D "
"content to."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເລເຍີທີ່ລະບຸຈາກ velocity texture ທີ່ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງເຣນເດີເນື້ອຫາ 3D ໃສ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the velocity texture we are rendering 3D content to. If multiview is "
"used this will be a texture array with all views.\n"
"If [param msaa] is [b]true[/b] and MSAA is enabled, this returns the MSAA "
"variant of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ velocity texture ທີ່ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງເຣນເດີເນື້ອຫາ 3D ໃສ່. ຖ້າມີການໃຊ້ multiview ມັນຈະເປັນ "
"texture array ທີ່ມີທຸກມຸມເບິ່ງ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param msaa] ເປັນ [b]true[/b] ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ MSAA, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ MSAA ຂອງບັຟເຟີນັ້ນ."

msgid "Returns the view count for the associated viewport."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນມຸມເບິ່ງ (view count) ສຳລັບວິວພອດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if a cached texture exists for this name."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີພື້ນຜິວໃນແຄຊທີ່ມີຊື່ນີ້ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Abstract render data object, holds scene data related to rendering a single "
"frame of a viewport."
msgstr ""
"ອັອບເຈັກຂໍ້ມູນການເຣນເດີແບບນາມມະທຳ (Abstract), "
"ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສາກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການເຣນເດີເຟຣມດຽວຂອງວິວພອດ."

msgid ""
"Abstract scene data object, exists for the duration of rendering a single "
"viewport. See also [RenderSceneDataRD], [RenderData], and [RenderDataRD].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is an internal rendering server object. Do not instantiate "
"this class from a script."
msgstr ""
"ອັອບເຈັກຂໍ້ມູນສາກແບບນາມມະທຳ, ມີຢູ່ສະເພາະໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຣນເດີວິວພອດດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[RenderSceneDataRD], [RenderData], ແລະ [RenderDataRD] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນອັອບເຈັກຂອງເຊີບເວີເຣນເດີພາຍໃນ. ຫ້າມສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງຄລາສນີ້ຈາກສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the camera projection used to render this frame.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If more than one view is rendered, this will return a combined "
"projection."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ camera projection ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຣນເດີເຟຣມນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າມີການເຣນເດີຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງມຸມເບິ່ງ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ projection ທີ່ຮວມກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the camera transform used to render this frame.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If more than one view is rendered, this will return a centered "
"transform."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ camera transform ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຣນເດີເຟຣມນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າມີການເຣນເດີຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງມຸມເບິ່ງ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ transform ທີ່ຢູ່ຈຸດກາງ."

msgid ""
"Return the [RID] of the uniform buffer containing the scene data as a UBO."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ຂອງ uniform buffer ທີ່ບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນສາກໃນຮູບແບບ UBO."

msgid "Returns the number of views being rendered."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນມຸມເບິ່ງທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກເຣນເດີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the eye offset per view used to render this frame. This is the offset "
"between our camera transform and the eye transform."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອງຕາ (eye offset) ຕໍ່ມຸມເບິ່ງທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຣນເດີເຟຣມນີ້. ນີ້ຄືໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງ camera "
"transform ແລະ eye transform ຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the view projection per view used to render this frame.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If a single view is rendered, this returns the camera "
"projection. If more than one view is rendered, this will return a projection "
"for the given view including the eye offset."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ view projection ຕໍ່ມຸມເບິ່ງທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຣນເດີເຟຣມນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າມີການເຣນເດີມຸມເບິ່ງດຽວ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ camera projection. "
"ຖ້າມີການເຣນເດີຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງມຸມເບິ່ງ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ projection ສຳລັບມຸມເບິ່ງນັ້ນລວມທັງໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອງຕາ."

msgid ""
"This class allows for a RenderSceneData implementation to be made in "
"GDExtension."
msgstr "ຄລາສນີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສ້າງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ RenderSceneData ໃນ GDExtension."

msgid "Implement this in GDExtension to return the camera [Projection]."
msgstr "ສ້າງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງສິ່ງນີ້ໃນ GDExtension ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນ camera [Projection]."

msgid "Implement this in GDExtension to return the camera [Transform3D]."
msgstr "ສ້າງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງສິ່ງນີ້ໃນ GDExtension ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນ camera [Transform3D]."

msgid ""
"Implement this in GDExtension to return the [RID] of the uniform buffer "
"containing the scene data as a UBO."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງສິ່ງນີ້ໃນ GDExtension ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ຂອງ uniform buffer "
"ທີ່ບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນສາກໃນຮູບແບບ UBO."

msgid "Implement this in GDExtension to return the view count."
msgstr "ສ້າງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງສິ່ງນີ້ໃນ GDExtension ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນມຸມເບິ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Implement this in GDExtension to return the eye offset for the given [param "
"view]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງສິ່ງນີ້ໃນ GDExtension ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນ eye offset ສຳລັບ [param view] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Implement this in GDExtension to return the view [Projection] for the given "
"[param view]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງສິ່ງນີ້ໃນ GDExtension ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນ view [Projection] ສຳລັບ [param view] "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Render scene data implementation for the RenderingDevice based renderers."
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງຂໍ້ມູນສາກການເຣນເດີສຳລັບຕົວເຣນເດີທີ່ອີງຕາມ RenderingDevice."

msgid ""
"Object holds scene data related to rendering a single frame of a viewport. "
"See also [RenderSceneData], [RenderData], and [RenderDataRD].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is an internal rendering server object. Do not instantiate "
"this class from a script."
msgstr ""
"ອັອບເຈັກທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສາກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການເຣນເດີເຟຣມດຽວຂອງວິວພອດ. ເບິ່ງ [RenderSceneData], "
"[RenderData], ແລະ [RenderDataRD] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນອັອບເຈັກຂອງເຊີບເວີເຣນເດີພາຍໃນ. ຫ້າມສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງຄລາສນີ້ຈາກສະຄຣິບ."

msgid "Base class for serializable objects."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບອັອບເຈັກທີ່ສາມາດບັນທຶກ/ອ່ານໄດ້ (serializable)."

msgid ""
"Override this method to return a custom [RID] when [method get_rid] is called."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບ (Override) ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເມື່ອ [method get_rid] ຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"For resources that store state in non-exported properties, such as via "
"[method Object._validate_property] or [method Object._get_property_list], "
"this method must be implemented to clear them."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ເກັບສະຖານະໃນຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ export, ເຊັ່ນ: ຜ່ານ [method "
"Object._validate_property] ຫຼື [method Object._get_property_list], "
"ເມທອດນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to execute additional logic after [method "
"set_path_cache] is called on this object."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດຕາມເຫດຜົນ (logic) ເພີ່ມເຕີມ ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ [method set_path_cache] "
"ຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ໃນອັອບເຈັກນີ້."

msgid ""
"Override this method to customize the newly duplicated resource created from "
"[method PackedScene.instantiate], if the original's [member "
"resource_local_to_scene] is set to [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Set a random [code]damage[/code] value to every local "
"resource from an instantiated scene:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"extends Resource\n"
"\n"
"var damage = 0\n"
"\n"
"func _setup_local_to_scene():\n"
"\tdamage = randi_range(10, 40)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ສຳເນົາຂຶ້ນມາໃໝ່ຈາກ [method PackedScene.instantiate], "
"ຖ້າຫາກ [member resource_local_to_scene] ຂອງຕົ້ນສະບັບຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [code]damage[/code] ແບບສຸ່ມໃຫ້ກັບທຸກໆ "
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນທ້ອງຖິ່ນຈາກສາກທີ່ຖືກສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"extends Resource\n"
"\n"
"var damage = 0\n"
"\n"
"func _setup_local_to_scene():\n"
"\tdamage = randi_range(10, 40)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Copies the data from [param resource] into this resource. Both resources must "
"share the same class."
msgstr ""
"ຄັດລອກຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ [param resource] ເຂົ້າໃນຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້. ຊັບພະຍາກອນທັງສອງຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຄລາສດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"Duplicates this resource, returning a new resource with its [code]export[/"
"code]ed or [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE] properties copied from the "
"original.\n"
"If [param deep] is [code]false[/code], a [b]shallow[/b] copy is returned: "
"nested [Array], [Dictionary], and [Resource] properties are not duplicated "
"and are shared with the original resource.\n"
"If [param deep] is [code]true[/code], a [b]deep[/b] copy is returned: all "
"nested arrays, dictionaries, and packed arrays are also duplicated "
"(recursively). Any [Resource] found inside will only be duplicated if it's "
"local, like [constant DEEP_DUPLICATE_INTERNAL] used with [method "
"duplicate_deep].\n"
"The following exceptions apply:\n"
"- Subresource properties with the [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_ALWAYS_DUPLICATE] "
"flag are always duplicated (recursively or not, depending on [param deep]).\n"
"- Subresource properties with the [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_NEVER_DUPLICATE] "
"flag are never duplicated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For custom resources, this method will fail if [method "
"Object._init] has been defined with required parameters.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When duplicating with [param deep] set to [code]true[/code], "
"each resource found, including the one on which this method is called, will "
"be only duplicated once and referenced as many times as needed in the "
"duplicate. For instance, if you are duplicating resource A that happens to "
"have resource B referenced twice, you'll get a new resource A' referencing a "
"new resource B' twice."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດການສຳເນົາ (Duplicate) ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້, ໂດຍສົ່ງຄືນຊັບພະຍາກອນໃໝ່ທີ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດແບບ "
"[code]export[/code] ຫຼື [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE] ທີ່ຄັດລອກມາຈາກຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param deep] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະສົ່ງຄືນການສຳເນົາແບບ [b]ຕື້ນ (shallow)[/"
"b]: ຄຸນສົມບັດ [Array], [Dictionary], ແລະ [Resource] ທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນຈະບໍ່ຖືກສຳເນົາ "
"ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param deep] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສົ່ງຄືນການສຳເນົາແບບ [b]ເລິກ (deep)[/b]: "
"ອາເຣ, ດິກຊັນນາຣີ, ແລະ ແພັກອາເຣທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສຳເນົາຄືກັນ (ແບບວົນຊ້ຳ). ຊັບພະຍາກອນ "
"[Resource] ໃດໆ ທີ່ພົບຢູ່ພາຍໃນ ຈະຖືກສຳເນົາກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມັນເປັນຂໍ້ມູນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local), ເຊັ່ນ [constant "
"DEEP_DUPLICATE_INTERNAL] ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບ [method duplicate_deep].\n"
"ມີຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"- ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍ (subresource) ທີ່ມີ flag [constant "
"PROPERTY_USAGE_ALWAYS_DUPLICATE] ຈະຖືກສຳເນົາສະເໝີ (ແບບວົນຊ້ຳຫຼືບໍ່ ຂຶ້ນກັບ [param "
"deep]).\n"
"- ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍທີ່ມີ flag [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_NEVER_DUPLICATE] "
"ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສຳເນົາຈັກເທື່ອ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເມທອດນີ້ຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ ຖ້າຫາກ [method "
"Object._init] ຖືກກຳນົດ ໂດຍມີພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ຈຳເປັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອສຳເນົາແບບ [param deep] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ແຕ່ລະຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ພົບ, ລວມທັງອັນທີ່ຮຽກໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້, ຈະຖືກສຳເນົາພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ ແລະ "
"ຖືກອ້າງອີງຫຼາຍຄັ້ງຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການໃນຕົວສຳເນົາ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າເຈົ້າສຳເນົາຊັບພະຍາກອນ A "
"ທີ່ມີການອ້າງອີງຊັບພະຍາກອນ B ສອງຄັ້ງ, ເຈົ້າຈະໄດ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນ A' ໃໝ່ ທີ່ອ້າງອີງຊັບພະຍາກອນ B' ໃໝ່ "
"ສອງຄັ້ງ."

msgid ""
"Duplicates this resource, deeply, like [method duplicate] when passing "
"[code]true[/code], with extra control over how subresources are handled."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດການສຳເນົາຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ແບບເລິກ, ຄືກັບ [method duplicate] ເມື່ອສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/"
"code], ໂດຍມີການຄວບຄຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຈັດການຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍ."

msgid ""
"Emits the [signal changed] signal. This method is called automatically for "
"some built-in resources.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For custom resources, it's recommended to call this method "
"whenever a meaningful change occurs, such as a modified property. This "
"ensures that custom [Object]s depending on the resource are properly "
"updated.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var damage:\n"
"\tset(new_value):\n"
"\t\tif damage != new_value:\n"
"\t\t\tdamage = new_value\n"
"\t\t\temit_changed()\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານ [signal changed]. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນຕົວບາງຢ່າງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຮຽກໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ສຳຄັນ, "
"ເຊັ່ນການປ່ຽນແປງຄຸນສົມບັດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ [Object] ອື່ນໆ "
"ທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var damage:\n"
"\tset(new_value):\n"
"\t\tif damage != new_value:\n"
"\t\t\tdamage = new_value\n"
"\t\t\temit_changed()\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Generates a unique identifier for a resource to be contained inside a "
"[PackedScene], based on the current date, time, and a random value. The "
"returned string is only composed of letters ([code]a[/code] to [code]y[/"
"code]) and numbers ([code]0[/code] to [code]8[/code]). See also [member "
"resource_scene_unique_id]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຕົວລະບຸສະເພາະ (unique identifier) ສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຈະບັນຈຸຢູ່ໃນ [PackedScene], "
"ໂດຍອີງຕາມວັນທີ, ເວລາ, ແລະ ຄ່າແບບສຸ່ມ. ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນ ([code]a[/code] "
"ຫາ [code]y[/code]) ແລະ ຕົວເລກ ([code]0[/code] ຫາ [code]8[/code]) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[member resource_scene_unique_id] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"From the internal cache for scene-unique IDs, returns the ID of this resource "
"for the scene at [param path]. If there is no entry, an empty string is "
"returned. Useful to keep scene-unique IDs the same when implementing a VCS-"
"friendly custom resource format by extending [ResourceFormatLoader] and "
"[ResourceFormatSaver].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only implemented when running in an editor "
"context. At runtime, it returns an empty string."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ຈາກແຄຊພາຍໃນສຳລັບ ID ທີ່ສະເພາະກັບສາກ ຕາມເສັ້ນທາງ [param path]. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຮັກສາ ID ໃຫ້ຄືເກົ່າ ເມື່ອສ້າງຮູບແບບຊັບພະຍາກອນ "
"ທີ່ເປັນມິດກັບລະບົບ VCS ໂດຍການຂະຫຍາຍ [ResourceFormatLoader] ແລະ "
"[ResourceFormatSaver].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນຕອນທີ່ແລ່ນຢູ່ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ໃນຕອນແລ່ນແທ້ (runtime), ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງ."

msgid ""
"If [member resource_local_to_scene] is set to [code]true[/code] and the "
"resource has been loaded from a [PackedScene] instantiation, returns the root "
"[Node] of the scene where this resource is used. Otherwise, returns "
"[code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [member resource_local_to_scene] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ "
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນຖືກໂຫຼດຈາກ [PackedScene], ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [Node] ຮາກຂອງສາກທີ່ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [RID] of this resource (or an empty RID). Many resources (such as "
"[Texture2D], [Mesh], and so on) are high-level abstractions of resources "
"stored in a specialized server ([DisplayServer], [RenderingServer], etc.), so "
"this function will return the original [RID]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ (ຫຼື RID ວ່າງ). ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍຢ່າງ (ເຊັ່ນ [Texture2D], "
"[Mesh] ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນມາເພື່ອຄອບຂໍ້ມູນໃນລະດັບສູງ "
"ຈາກຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນເຊີບເວີສະເພາະ ([DisplayServer], [RenderingServer], ແລະ "
"ອື່ນໆ), ດັ່ງນັ້ນຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ດັ້ງເດີມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the resource is saved on disk as a part of "
"another resource's file."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນດິສກ໌ ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"Makes the resource clear its non-exported properties. See also [method "
"_reset_state]. Useful when implementing a custom resource format by extending "
"[ResourceFormatLoader] and [ResourceFormatSaver]."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນລ້າງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ export ຂອງມັນອອກ. ເບິ່ງ [method _reset_state] ຕື່ມ. "
"ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອສ້າງຮູບແບບຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ໂດຍການຂະຫຍາຍ [ResourceFormatLoader] ແລະ "
"[ResourceFormatSaver]."

msgid ""
"In the internal cache for scene-unique IDs, sets the ID of this resource to "
"[param id] for the scene at [param path]. If [param id] is empty, the cache "
"entry for [param path] is cleared. Useful to keep scene-unique IDs the same "
"when implementing a VCS-friendly custom resource format by extending "
"[ResourceFormatLoader] and [ResourceFormatSaver].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only implemented when running in an editor "
"context."
msgstr ""
"ໃນແຄຊພາຍໃນສຳລັບ ID ທີ່ສະເພາະກັບສາກ, ຕັ້ງ ID ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ເປັນ [param id] ສຳລັບສາກທີ່ "
"[param path]. ຖ້າ [param id] ວ່າງ, ຂໍ້ມູນໃນແຄຊສຳລັບ [param path] ຈະຖືກລ້າງອອກ. "
"ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຮັກສາ ID ໃຫ້ຄືເກົ່າ ເມື່ອສ້າງຮູບແບບຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ເປັນມິດກັບລະບົບ VCS ໂດຍການຂະຫຍາຍ "
"[ResourceFormatLoader] ແລະ [ResourceFormatSaver].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນຕອນທີ່ແລ່ນຢູ່ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the resource's path to [param path] without involving the resource "
"cache. Useful for handling [enum ResourceFormatLoader.CacheMode] values when "
"implementing a custom resource format by extending [ResourceFormatLoader] and "
"[ResourceFormatSaver]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງເສັ້ນທາງຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນເປັນ [param path] ໂດຍບໍ່ຜ່ານແຄຊຊັບພະຍາກອນ. ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຈັດການຄ່າ "
"[enum ResourceFormatLoader.CacheMode] ເມື່ອສ້າງຮູບແບບຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ "
"ໂດຍການຂະຫຍາຍ [ResourceFormatLoader] ແລະ [ResourceFormatSaver]."

msgid "This method should only be called internally."
msgstr "ເມທອດນີ້ຄວນຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ພາຍໃນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Calls [method _setup_local_to_scene]. If [member resource_local_to_scene] is "
"set to [code]true[/code], this method is automatically called from [method "
"PackedScene.instantiate] by the newly duplicated resource within the scene "
"instance."
msgstr ""
"ຮຽກໃຊ້ [method _setup_local_to_scene]. ຖ້າ [member resource_local_to_scene] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກ [method "
"PackedScene.instantiate] ໂດຍຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກສຳເນົາໃໝ່ພາຍໃນສາກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [member resource_path] to [param path], potentially overriding an "
"existing cache entry for this path. Further attempts to load an overridden "
"resource by path will instead return this resource."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງ [member resource_path] ເປັນ [param path], "
"ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະຂຽນທັບແຄຊທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວສຳລັບເສັ້ນທາງນີ້. ການພະຍາຍາມໂຫຼດຊັບພະຍາກອນຜ່ານເສັ້ນທາງນີ້ໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ "
"ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ແທນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the resource is duplicated for each instance of all "
"scenes using it. At run-time, the resource can be modified in one scene "
"without affecting other instances (see [method PackedScene.instantiate]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing this property at run-time has no effect on already "
"created duplicate resources."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຊັບພະຍາກອນຈະຖືກສຳເນົາສຳລັບແຕ່ລະອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງທຸກສາກທີ່ໃຊ້ມັນ. "
"ໃນຕອນແລ່ນ, ຊັບພະຍາກອນສາມາດຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃນສາກໜຶ່ງ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ອື່ນໆ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"PackedScene.instantiate]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນແປງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃນຕອນແລ່ນ ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກສຳເນົາໄປແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"An optional name for this resource. When defined, its value is displayed to "
"represent the resource in the Inspector dock. For built-in scripts, the name "
"is displayed as part of the tab name in the script editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some resource formats do not support resource names. You can "
"still set the name in the editor or via code, but it will be lost when the "
"resource is reloaded. For example, only built-in scripts can have a resource "
"name, while scripts stored in separate files cannot."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ທີ່ບໍ່ບັງຄັບສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້. ເມື່ອກຳນົດແລ້ວ, ຄ່າຂອງມັນຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ Inspector. "
"ສຳລັບສະຄຣິບໃນຕົວ, ຊື່ຈະຖືກສະແດງເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຊື່ແທັບໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບາງຮູບແບບຊັບພະຍາກອນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຕັ້ງຊື່. ເຈົ້າຍັງຄົງສາມາດຕັ້ງຊື່ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື "
"ຜ່ານລະຫັດໄດ້, ແຕ່ມັນຈະຫາຍໄປເມື່ອຊັບພະຍາກອນຖືກໂຫຼດໃໝ່. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ສະເພາະສະຄຣິບໃນຕົວເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດມີຊື່ຊັບພະຍາກອນໄດ້, ສ່ວນສະຄຣິບທີ່ເກັບໃນໄຟລ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The unique path to this resource. If it has been saved to disk, the value "
"will be its filepath. If the resource is exclusively contained within a "
"scene, the value will be the [PackedScene]'s filepath, followed by a unique "
"identifier.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this property manually may fail if a resource with the "
"same path has already been previously loaded. If necessary, use [method "
"take_over_path]."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງສະເພາະຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້. ຖ້າຖືກບັນທຶກລົງດິສກ໌, ຄ່າຂອງມັນຈະເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ໄຟລ໌. "
"ຖ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນຢູ່ວາງໄວ້ໃນສາກເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຄ່າຂອງມັນຈະເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ໄຟລ໌ຂອງ [PackedScene] "
"ຕາມດ້ວຍຕົວລະບຸສະເພາະ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງອາດຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ "
"ຖ້າຫາກມີຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ມີເສັ້ນທາງດຽວກັນຖືກໂຫຼດໄວ້ກ່ອນແລ້ວ. ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"take_over_path]."

msgid ""
"A unique identifier relative to this resource's scene. If left empty, the ID "
"is automatically generated when this resource is saved inside a "
"[PackedScene]. If the resource is not inside a scene, this property is empty "
"by default.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When the [PackedScene] is saved, if multiple resources in the "
"same scene use the same ID, only the earliest resource in the scene hierarchy "
"keeps the original ID. The other resources are assigned new IDs from [method "
"generate_scene_unique_id].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this property does not emit the [signal changed] "
"signal.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] When setting, the ID must only consist of letters, numbers, "
"and underscores. Otherwise, it will fail and default to a randomly generated "
"ID."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວລະບຸສະເພາະທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບສາກຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້. ຖ້າປ່ອຍວ່າງໄວ້, ID "
"ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນ [PackedScene]. "
"ຖ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນສາກ, ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະວ່າງໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອ [PackedScene] ຖືກບັນທຶກ, ຖ້າມີຫຼາຍຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນສາກດຽວກັນໃຊ້ ID ຊ້ຳກັນ, "
"ສະເພາະຊັບພະຍາກອນທຳອິດໃນລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງສາກເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຮັກສາ ID ດັ້ງເດີມໄວ້. ຊັບພະຍາກອນອື່ນໆ "
"ຈະຖືກກຳນົດ ID ໃໝ່ ຈາກ [method generate_scene_unique_id].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງສັນຍານ [signal changed].\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ID ຕ້ອງປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນ, ຕົວເລກ, ແລະ ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດກ້ອງ "
"(underscore) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ປ່ຽນເປັນ ID ທີ່ຖືກສຸ່ມຂຶ້ນມາແທນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the resource changes, usually when one of its properties is "
"modified. See also [method emit_changed].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This signal is not emitted automatically for properties of "
"custom resources. If necessary, a setter needs to be created to emit the "
"signal."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກເມື່ອຊັບພະຍາກອນມີການປ່ຽນແປງ, ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແມ່ນເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດໃດໜຶ່ງຖືກແກ້ໄຂ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"emit_changed] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ. "
"ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ, ຕ້ອງສ້າງ setter ເພື່ອສົ່ງສັນຍານນີ້ອອກມາ."

msgid ""
"This signal is only emitted when the resource is created. Override [method "
"_setup_local_to_scene] instead."
msgstr ""
"ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກສະເພາະເມື່ອຊັບພະຍາກອນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃຫ້ຂຽນທັບ [method "
"_setup_local_to_scene] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted by a newly duplicated resource with [member resource_local_to_scene] "
"set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງອອກໂດຍຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກສຳເນົາໃໝ່ ເຊິ່ງມີການຕັ້ງ [member resource_local_to_scene] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"No subresources at all are duplicated. This is useful even in a deep "
"duplication to have all the arrays and dictionaries duplicated but still "
"pointing to the original resources."
msgstr ""
"ຈະບໍ່ມີການສຳເນົາຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍໃດໆ ທັງໝົດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດແມ່ນແຕ່ໃນການສຳເນົາແບບເລິກ (deep "
"duplication) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ອາເຣ ແລະ ດິກຊັນນາຣີຖືກສຳເນົາ ແຕ່ຍັງຄົງຊີ້ໄປທີ່ຊັບພະຍາກອນຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

msgid ""
"Only subresources without a path or with a scene-local path will be "
"duplicated."
msgstr "ສະເພາະຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີເສັ້ນທາງ ຫຼື ມີເສັ້ນທາງທ້ອງຖິ່ນໃນສາກເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກສຳເນົາ."

msgid ""
"Every subresource found will be duplicated, even if it has a non-local path. "
"In other words, even potentially big resources stored separately will be "
"duplicated."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໆ ຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍທີ່ພົບຈະຖືກສຳເນົາ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະມີເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນທ້ອງຖິ່ນກໍຕາມ. ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຄື, "
"ແມ່ນແຕ່ຊັບພະຍາກອນຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ເກັບແຍກໄວ້ກໍຈະຖືກສຳເນົາຄືກັນ."

msgid "Loads a specific resource type from a file."
msgstr "ໂຫຼດປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນສະເພາະຈາກໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"Godot loads resources in the editor or in exported games using "
"ResourceFormatLoaders. They are queried automatically via the "
"[ResourceLoader] singleton, or when a resource with internal dependencies is "
"loaded. Each file type may load as a different resource type, so multiple "
"ResourceFormatLoaders are registered in the engine.\n"
"Extending this class allows you to define your own loader. Be sure to respect "
"the documented return types and values. You should give it a global class "
"name with [code]class_name[/code] for it to be registered. Like built-in "
"ResourceFormatLoaders, it will be called automatically when loading resources "
"of its handled type(s). You may also implement a [ResourceFormatSaver].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You can also extend [EditorImportPlugin] if the resource type "
"you need exists but Godot is unable to load its format. Choosing one way over "
"another depends on if the format is suitable or not for the final exported "
"game. For example, it's better to import [code].png[/code] textures as "
"[code].ctex[/code] ([CompressedTexture2D]) first, so they can be loaded with "
"better efficiency on the graphics card."
msgstr ""
"Godot ໂຫຼດຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ໃນເກມທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໂດຍໃຊ້ ResourceFormatLoaders. "
"ພວກມັນຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຜ່ານ [ResourceLoader] singleton, ຫຼື "
"ເມື່ອຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ມີການອ້າງອີງພາຍໃນຖືກໂຫຼດ. ແຕ່ລະປະເພດໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະ ໂຫຼດເປັນຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງມີ ResourceFormatLoaders ຫຼາຍອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ໃນເອັນຈິນ.\n"
"ການຂະຫຍາຍຄລາສນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າກຳນົດຕົວໂຫຼດຂອງເຈົ້າເອງໄດ້. ຕ້ອງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າໄດ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນ "
"ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້. ເຈົ້າຄວນຕັ້ງຊື່ຄລາສທົ່ວໂລກດ້ວຍ [code]class_name[/code] ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນມັນ. "
"ມັນຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອໂຫຼດຊັບພະຍາກອນປະເພດທີ່ມັນຈັດການ. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດສ້າງ "
"[ResourceFormatSaver] ໄດ້ຄືກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍ [EditorImportPlugin] ໄດ້ "
"ຖ້າຫາກປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວແຕ່ Godot ບໍ່ສາມາດໂຫຼດຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນໄດ້. "
"ການເລືອກວິທີໃດໜຶ່ງແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າຮູບແບບນັ້ນເໝາະສົມກັບເກມ ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຫຼືບໍ່. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ມັນດີກວ່າທີ່ຈະນຳເຂົ້າພື້ນຜິວ "
"[code].png[/code] ເປັນ [code].ctex[/code] ([CompressedTexture2D]) ກ່ອນ, "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດໂຫຼດໄດ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບກວ່າໃນກາດຈໍ."

msgid ""
"Should return the dependencies for the resource at the given [param path]. "
"Each dependency is a string composed of one to three sections separated by "
"[code]::[/code], with trailing empty sections omitted:\n"
"- The first section should contain the UID if the resource has one. "
"Otherwise, it should contain the file path.\n"
"- The second section should contain the class name of the dependency if "
"[param add_types] is [code]true[/code]. Otherwise, it should be empty.\n"
"- The third section should contain the fallback path if the resource has a "
"UID. Otherwise, it should be empty.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _get_dependencies(path, add_types):\n"
"\treturn [\n"
"\t\t\"uid://fqgvuwrkuixh::Script::res://script.gd\",\n"
"\t\t\"uid://fqgvuwrkuixh::::res://script.gd\",\n"
"\t\t\"res://script.gd::Script\",\n"
"\t\t\"res://script.gd\",\n"
"\t]\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Custom resource types defined by scripts aren't known by the "
"[ClassDB], so [code]\"Resource\"[/code] can be used for the class name."
msgstr ""
"ຄວນສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການທີ່ຊັບພະຍາກອນນັ້ນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ (dependencies) ຕາມເສັ້ນທາງ [param path] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. "
"ແຕ່ລະ dependency ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍໜຶ່ງຫາສາມສ່ວນ ທີ່ແຍກກັນດ້ວຍ [code]::[/code]:\n"
"- ສ່ວນທຳອິດຄວນບັນຈຸ UID ຖ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນນັ້ນມີ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຄວນບັນຈຸເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌.\n"
"- ສ່ວນທີສອງຄວນບັນຈຸຊື່ຄລາສຂອງ dependency ຖ້າ [param add_types] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຄວນປ່ອຍວ່າງ.\n"
"- ສ່ວນທີສາມຄວນບັນຈຸເສັ້ນທາງສຳຮອງ (fallback path) ຖ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນມີ UID. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຄວນປ່ອຍວ່າງ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _get_dependencies(path, add_types):\n"
"\treturn [\n"
"\t\t\"uid://fqgvuwrkuixh::Script::res://script.gd\",\n"
"\t\t\"uid://fqgvuwrkuixh::::res://script.gd\",\n"
"\t\t\"res://script.gd::Script\",\n"
"\t\t\"res://script.gd\",\n"
"\t]\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍສະຄຣິບ ຈະບໍ່ເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກໂດຍ [ClassDB], "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນສາມາດໃຊ້ [code]\"Resource\"[/code] ເປັນຊື່ຄລາສໄດ້."

msgid "Gets the list of extensions for files this loader is able to read."
msgstr "ດຶງລາຍການນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຕົວໂຫຼດນີ້ສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the script class name associated with the [Resource] under the given "
"[param path]. If the resource has no script or the script isn't a named "
"class, it should return [code]\"\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຄລາສຂອງສະຄຣິບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [Resource] ຕາມເສັ້ນທາງ [param path]. "
"ຖ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນບໍ່ມີສະຄຣິບ ຫຼື ສະຄຣິບບໍ່ມີຊື່ຄລາສ, ມັນຄວນສົ່ງຄືນ [code]\"\"[/code]."

msgid ""
"Gets the class name of the resource associated with the given path. If the "
"loader cannot handle it, it should return [code]\"\"[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Custom resource types defined by scripts aren't known by the "
"[ClassDB], so you might just return [code]\"Resource\"[/code] for them."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງຊື່ຄລາສຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. ຖ້າຕົວໂຫຼດບໍ່ສາມາດຈັດການໄດ້, ມັນຄວນສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]\"\"[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍສະຄຣິບ ຈະບໍ່ເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກໂດຍ [ClassDB], "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຈົ້າອາດຈະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]\"Resource\"[/code] ສຳລັບພວກມັນ."

msgid ""
"Should return the unique ID for the resource associated with the given path. "
"If this method is not overridden, a [code].uid[/code] file is generated along "
"with the resource file, containing the unique ID."
msgstr ""
"ຄວນສົ່ງຄືນ ID ສະເພາະສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. ຖ້າເມທອດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຂຽນທັບ, ໄຟລ໌ "
"[code].uid[/code] ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນພ້ອມກັບໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນ ເຊິ່ງບັນຈຸ ID ສະເພາະນັ້ນໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Tells which resource class this loader can load.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Custom resource types defined by scripts aren't known by the "
"[ClassDB], so you might just handle [code]\"Resource\"[/code] for them."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸວ່າຄລາສຊັບພະຍາກອນໃດທີ່ຕົວໂຫຼດນີ້ສາມາດໂຫຼດໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍສະຄຣິບ ຈະບໍ່ເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກໂດຍ [ClassDB], "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຈົ້າອາດຈະຈັດການ [code]\"Resource\"[/code] ສຳລັບພວກມັນ."

msgid ""
"Loads a resource when the engine finds this loader to be compatible. If the "
"loaded resource is the result of an import, [param original_path] will target "
"the source file. Returns a [Resource] object on success, or an [enum Error] "
"constant in case of failure.\n"
"The [param cache_mode] property defines whether and how the cache should be "
"used or updated when loading the resource. See [enum CacheMode] for details."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດຊັບພະຍາກອນເມື່ອເອັນຈິນພົບວ່າຕົວໂຫຼດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້. "
"ຖ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ໂຫຼດມານັ້ນເປັນຜົນມາຈາກການນຳເຂົ້າ, [param original_path] ຈະຊີ້ໄປທີ່ໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບ. "
"ສົ່ງຄືນອັອບເຈັກ [Resource] ຖ້າສຳເລັດ, ຫຼື ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum Error] ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"
"ຄຸນສົມບັດ [param cache_mode] ກຳນົດວ່າຄວນໃຊ້ ຫຼື ອັບເດດແຄຊແນວໃດໃນເວລາໂຫຼດຊັບພະຍາກອນ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[enum CacheMode] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Tells whether or not this loader should load a resource from its resource "
"path for a given type.\n"
"If it is not implemented, the default behavior returns whether the path's "
"extension is within the ones provided by [method _get_recognized_extensions], "
"and if the type is within the ones provided by [method _get_resource_type]."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸວ່າຕົວໂຫຼດນີ້ຄວນໂຫຼດຊັບພະຍາກອນຈາກເສັ້ນທາງສຳລັບປະເພດທີ່ກຳນົດຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄືນວ່າ ນາມສະກຸນຂອງເສັ້ນທາງນັ້ນຢູ່ໃນລາຍການທີ່ [method "
"_get_recognized_extensions] ໃຫ້ມາຫຼືບໍ່, ແລະ ປະເພດນັ້ນຢູ່ໃນລາຍການທີ່ [method "
"_get_resource_type] ໃຫ້ມາຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"If implemented, renames dependencies within the given resource and saves it. "
"[param renames] is a dictionary [code]{ String => String }[/code] mapping old "
"dependency paths to new paths.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, or an [enum Error] constant in case of "
"failure."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ຈະປ່ຽນຊື່ dependencies ພາຍໃນຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ ແລະ ບັນທຶກມັນ. [param "
"renames] ແມ່ນດິກຊັນນາຣີ [code]{ String => String }[/code] ທີ່ຈັບຄູ່ເສັ້ນທາງ dependency "
"ເກົ່າ ໄປຫາ ເສັ້ນທາງໃໝ່.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant OK] ຖ້າສຳເລັດ, ຫຼື ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum Error] ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"Neither the main resource (the one requested to be loaded) nor any of its "
"subresources are retrieved from cache nor stored into it. Dependencies "
"(external resources) are loaded with [constant CACHE_MODE_REUSE]."
msgstr ""
"ທັງຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼັກ (ອັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການໂຫຼດ) ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍຂອງມັນ ຈະບໍ່ຖືກດຶງມາຈາກແຄຊ ແລະ "
"ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນແຄຊ. ສ່ວນ dependencies (ຊັບພະຍາກອນພາຍນອກ) ຈະຖືກໂຫຼດດ້ວຍ [constant "
"CACHE_MODE_REUSE]."

msgid ""
"The main resource (the one requested to be loaded), its subresources, and its "
"dependencies (external resources) are retrieved from cache if present, "
"instead of loaded. Those not cached are loaded and then stored into the "
"cache. The same rules are propagated recursively down the tree of "
"dependencies (external resources)."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼັກ (ອັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການໂຫຼດ), ຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍ, ແລະ dependencies ຂອງມັນ "
"ຈະຖືກດຶງມາຈາກແຄຊຖ້າມີຢູ່ ແທນທີ່ຈະໂຫຼດໃໝ່. ອັນໃດທີ່ບໍ່ມີໃນແຄຊຈະຖືກໂຫຼດແລ້ວເກັບໄວ້ໃນແຄຊ. "
"ກົດເກນດຽວກັນນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຕໍ່ໆ ກັນໄປ ໃນລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງ dependencies (ຊັບພະຍາກອນພາຍນອກ)."

msgid ""
"Like [constant CACHE_MODE_REUSE], but the cache is checked for the main "
"resource (the one requested to be loaded) as well as for each of its "
"subresources. Those already in the cache, as long as the loaded and cached "
"types match, have their data refreshed from storage into the already existing "
"instances. Otherwise, they are recreated as completely new objects."
msgstr ""
"ຄືກັບ [constant CACHE_MODE_REUSE], ແຕ່ຈະມີການກວດສອບແຄຊສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼັກ "
"ລວມທັງຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍແຕ່ລະອັນ. ອັນໃດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນແຄຊແລ້ວ, ຕາບໃດທີ່ປະເພດທີ່ໂຫຼດມາກັບປະເພດໃນແຄຊກົງກັນ, "
"ຂໍ້ມູນຂອງພວກມັນຈະຖືກອັບເດດຈາກບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເຂົ້າໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ພວກມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງໃໝ່ເປັນອັອບເຈັກໃໝ່ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Like [constant CACHE_MODE_IGNORE], but propagated recursively down the tree "
"of dependencies (external resources)."
msgstr ""
"ຄືກັບ [constant CACHE_MODE_IGNORE], ແຕ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຕໍ່ໆ ກັນໄປໃນລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງ dependencies "
"(ຊັບພະຍາກອນພາຍນອກ)."

msgid ""
"Like [constant CACHE_MODE_REPLACE], but propagated recursively down the tree "
"of dependencies (external resources)."
msgstr ""
"ຄືກັບ [constant CACHE_MODE_REPLACE], ແຕ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຕໍ່ໆ ກັນໄປໃນລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງ dependencies "
"(ຊັບພະຍາກອນພາຍນອກ)."

msgid "Saves a specific resource type to a file."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນສະເພາະໃສ່ໃນໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"The engine can save resources when you do it from the editor, or when you use "
"the [ResourceSaver] singleton. This is accomplished thanks to multiple "
"[ResourceFormatSaver]s, each handling its own format and called automatically "
"by the engine.\n"
"By default, Godot saves resources as [code].tres[/code] (text-based), "
"[code].res[/code] (binary) or another built-in format, but you can choose to "
"create your own format by extending this class. Be sure to respect the "
"documented return types and values. You should give it a global class name "
"with [code]class_name[/code] for it to be registered. Like built-in "
"ResourceFormatSavers, it will be called automatically when saving resources "
"of its recognized type(s). You may also implement a [ResourceFormatLoader]."
msgstr ""
"ເອັນຈິນສາມາດບັນທຶກຊັບພະຍາກອນໄດ້ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເຮັດຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ເມື່ອເຈົ້າໃຊ້ [ResourceSaver] "
"singleton. ສິ່ງນີ້ສຳເລັດໄດ້ຍ້ອນມີ [ResourceFormatSaver] ຫຼາຍອັນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະອັນຈະຈັດການຮູບແບບຂອງມັນເອງ ແລະ ຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍເອັນຈິນ.\n"
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Godot ຈະບັນທຶກຊັບພະຍາກອນເປັນ [code].tres[/code] (ແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ), [code].res[/"
"code] (ແບບໄບນາຣີ) ຫຼື ຮູບແບບອື່ນໆ ທີ່ມີໃນຕົວ, "
"ແຕ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກສ້າງຮູບແບບຂອງເຈົ້າເອງໄດ້ໂດຍການຂະຫຍາຍຄລາສນີ້. "
"ຕ້ອງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າໄດ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນ ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້. ເຈົ້າຄວນຕັ້ງຊື່ຄລາສທົ່ວໂລກດ້ວຍ "
"[code]class_name[/code] ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນມັນ. "
"ມັນຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອບັນທຶກຊັບພະຍາກອນປະເພດທີ່ມັນຮູ້ຈັກ. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດສ້າງ "
"[ResourceFormatLoader] ໄດ້ຄືກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of extensions available for saving the resource object, "
"provided it is recognized (see [method _recognize])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບການບັນທຶກອັອບເຈັກຊັບພະຍາກອນ, ຖ້າຫາກວ່າມັນຖືກຮັບຮູ້ (ເບິ່ງ "
"[method _recognize])."

msgid "Returns whether the given resource object can be saved by this saver."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າອັອບເຈັກຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ ສາມາດບັນທຶກໂດຍຕົວບັນທຶກນີ້ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this saver handles a given save path and "
"[code]false[/code] otherwise.\n"
"If this method is not implemented, the default behavior returns whether the "
"path's extension is within the ones provided by [method "
"_get_recognized_extensions]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຕົວບັນທຶກນີ້ຈັດການເສັ້ນທາງການບັນທຶກທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/"
"code] ໃນກໍລະນີອື່ນ.\n"
"ຖ້າເມທອດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄືນວ່າ ນາມສະກຸນຂອງເສັ້ນທາງນັ້ນ ຢູ່ໃນລາຍການທີ່ [method "
"_get_recognized_extensions] ໃຫ້ມາຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Saves the given resource object to a file at the target [param path]. [param "
"flags] is a bitmask composed with [enum ResourceSaver.SaverFlags] constants.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, or an [enum Error] constant in case of "
"failure."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກອັອບເຈັກຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ໃຫ້ມາລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ຕາມເສັ້ນທາງ [param path] ທີ່ກຳນົດ. [param flags] "
"ແມ່ນ bitmask ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຂອງ [enum ResourceSaver.SaverFlags].\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant OK] ຖ້າສຳເລັດ, ຫຼື ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum Error] ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"Sets a new UID for the resource at the given [param path]. Returns [constant "
"OK] on success, or an [enum Error] constant in case of failure."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງ UID ໃໝ່ສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນຕາມເສັ້ນທາງ [param path] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant OK] "
"ຖ້າສຳເລັດ, ຫຼື ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum Error] ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid "Base class for resource importers."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບຕົວນຳເຂົ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນ (resource importers)."

msgid ""
"This is the base class for Godot's resource importers. To implement your own "
"resource importers using editor plugins, see [EditorImportPlugin]."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບຕົວນຳເຂົ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງ Godot. ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວນຳເຂົ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງເຈົ້າເອງ "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ປລັກອິນຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [EditorImportPlugin]."

msgid ""
"Called when the engine compilation profile editor wants to check what build "
"options an imported resource needs. For example, "
"[ResourceImporterDynamicFont] has a property called [member "
"ResourceImporterDynamicFont.multichannel_signed_distance_field], that depends "
"on the engine to be build with the \"msdfgen\" module. If that resource "
"happened to be a custom one, it would be handled like this:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _get_build_dependencies(path):\n"
"\tvar resource = load(path)\n"
"\tvar dependencies = PackedStringArray()\n"
"\n"
"\tif resource.multichannel_signed_distance_field:\n"
"\t\tdependencies.push_back(\"module_msdfgen_enabled\")\n"
"\n"
"\treturn dependencies\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ເມື່ອຕົວແກ້ໄຂໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຄອມໄພລ໌ຂອງເອັນຈິນ ຕ້ອງການກວດສອບວ່າຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມາ "
"ຕ້ອງການຕົວເລືອກການບິວດ໌ (build options) ຫຍັງແດ່. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"[ResourceImporterDynamicFont] ມີຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [member "
"ResourceImporterDynamicFont.multichannel_signed_distance_field], "
"ເຊິ່ງຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າເອັນຈິນຕ້ອງຖືກບິວດ໌ດ້ວຍໂມດູນ \"msdfgen\". ຖ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນນັ້ນເປັນອັນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, "
"ມັນຈະຖືກຈັດການແບບນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _get_build_dependencies(path):\n"
"\tvar resource = load(path)\n"
"\tvar dependencies = PackedStringArray()\n"
"\n"
"\tif resource.multichannel_signed_distance_field:\n"
"\t\tdependencies.push_back(\"module_msdfgen_enabled\")\n"
"\n"
"\treturn dependencies\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "The default import order."
msgstr "ລຳດັບການນຳເຂົ້າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The import order for scenes, which ensures scenes are imported [i]after[/i] "
"all other core resources such as textures. Custom importers should generally "
"have an import order lower than [code]100[/code] to avoid issues when "
"importing scenes that rely on custom resources."
msgstr ""
"ລຳດັບການນຳເຂົ້າສຳລັບສາກ (scenes), ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າສາກຕ່າງໆ ຈະຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ [i]ຫຼັງຈາກ[/i] "
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼັກອື່ນໆ ທັງໝົດ ເຊັ່ນ ພື້ນຜິວ (textures). ຕົວນຳເຂົ້າທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ "
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຄວນມີລຳດັບການນຳເຂົ້າ ຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]100[/code] "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫາເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າສາກທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid "Imports a [BitMap] resource (2D array of boolean values)."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນ [BitMap] (ອາເຣ 2 ມິຕິ ຂອງຄ່າບູນີນ)."

msgid ""
"[BitMap] resources are typically used as click masks in [TextureButton] and "
"[TouchScreenButton]."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [BitMap] ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນໜ້າກາກສຳລັບການຄລິກ (click masks) ໃນ "
"[TextureButton] ແລະ [TouchScreenButton]."

msgid ""
"The data source to use for generating the bitmap.\n"
"[b]Black & White:[/b] Pixels whose HSV value is greater than the [member "
"threshold] will be considered as \"enabled\" (bit is [code]true[/code]). If "
"the pixel is lower than or equal to the threshold, it will be considered as "
"\"disabled\" (bit is [code]false[/code]).\n"
"[b]Alpha:[/b] Pixels whose alpha value is greater than the [member threshold] "
"will be considered as \"enabled\" (bit is [code]true[/code]). If the pixel is "
"lower than or equal to the threshold, it will be considered as \"disabled\" "
"(bit is [code]false[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງບິດແມັບ (bitmap).\n"
"[b]ສີດຳ ແລະ ຂາວ:[/b] ພິກເຊວທີ່ມີຄ່າ HSV ສູງກວ່າ [member threshold] ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າ \"ເປີດໃຊ້\" "
"(ບິດແມ່ນ [code]true[/code]). ຖ້າພິກເຊວມີຄ່າຕ່ຳກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບເກນ (threshold), ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າ "
"\"ປິດໃຊ້\" (ບິດແມ່ນ [code]false[/code]).\n"
"[b]ອັລຟາ (Alpha):[/b] ພິກເຊວທີ່ມີຄ່າອັລຟາສູງກວ່າ [member threshold] ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າ \"ເປີດໃຊ້\" "
"(ບິດແມ່ນ [code]true[/code]). ຖ້າພິກເຊວມີຄ່າຕ່ຳກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບເກນ, ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າ \"ປິດໃຊ້\" "
"(ບິດແມ່ນ [code]false[/code])."

msgid ""
"The threshold to use to determine which bits should be considered enabled or "
"disabled. See also [member create_from]."
msgstr ""
"ເກນ (threshold) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັດສິນວ່າບິດໃດຄວນຖືກຖືວ່າເປີດໃຊ້ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"create_from] ຕື່ມ."

msgid "Imports a bitmap font in the BMFont ([code].fnt[/code]) format."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າຕົວອັກສອນບິດແມັບ (bitmap font) ໃນຮູບແບບ BMFont ([code].fnt[/code])."

msgid ""
"The BMFont format is a format created by the [url=https://www.angelcode.com/"
"products/bmfont/]BMFont[/url] program. Many BMFont-compatible programs also "
"exist, like [url=https://www.bmglyph.com/]BMGlyph[/url].\n"
"Compared to [ResourceImporterImageFont], [ResourceImporterBMFont] supports "
"bitmap fonts with varying glyph widths/heights.\n"
"See also [ResourceImporterDynamicFont]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບ BMFont ແມ່ນຮູບແບບທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໂປຣແກຣມ [url=https://www.angelcode.com/products/"
"bmfont/]BMFont[/url]. ຍັງມີໂປຣແກຣມອື່ນໆ ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ BMFont ເຊັ່ນ [url=https://"
"www.bmglyph.com/]BMGlyph[/url].\n"
"ເມື່ອທຽບກັບ [ResourceImporterImageFont], [ResourceImporterBMFont] "
"ຈະຮອງຮັບຕົວອັກສອນບິດແມັບທີ່ມີ ຄວາມກວ້າງ/ຄວາມສູງ ຂອງຕົວອັກສອນ (glyph) ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [ResourceImporterDynamicFont] ຕື່ມ."

msgid "Bitmap fonts - Using fonts"
msgstr "ຕົວອັກສອນບິດແມັບ - ການໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນ"

msgid "If [code]true[/code], uses lossless compression for the resulting font."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ການບີບອັດແບບບໍ່ສູນເສຍຄຸນນະພາບ (lossless compression) "
"ສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"List of font fallbacks to use if a glyph isn't found in this bitmap font. "
"Fonts at the beginning of the array are attempted first."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການຕົວອັກສອນສຳຮອງ (fallbacks) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບຕົວອັກສອນ (glyph) ໃນຕົວອັກສອນບິດແມັບນີ້. "
"ຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຢູ່ຕົ້ນໆ ຂອງອາເຣຈະຖືກລອງໃຊ້ກ່ອນ."

msgid "Font scaling mode."
msgstr "ໂໝດການປັບຂະໜາດຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid "Imports comma-separated values as [Translation]s."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າຄ່າທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ (CSV) ເປັນການແປພາສາ ([Translation])."

msgid ""
"Comma-separated values are a plain text table storage format. The format's "
"simplicity makes it easy to edit in any text editor or spreadsheet software. "
"This makes it a common choice for game localization.\n"
"In the CSV file used for translation, the first column contains string "
"identifiers, and the first row serves as the header. The first column's "
"header can be any value. The remaining headers indicate the locale for that "
"column. Columns whose headers begin with an underscore ([code]_[/code]) will "
"be ignored.\n"
"[b]Example CSV file:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"keys,en,es,ja\n"
"GREET,\"Hello, friend!\",\"Hola, amigo!\",こんにちは\n"
"ASK,How are you?,Cómo está?,元気ですか\n"
"BYE,Goodbye,Adiós,さようなら\n"
"QUOTE,\"\"\"Hello\"\" said the man.\",\"\"\"Hola\"\" dijo el hombre.\",「こん"
"にちは」男は言いました\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Although keys in the first column typically use uppercase string identifiers, "
"it is not uncommon to directly use strings appearing in the game as keys. To "
"avoid string ambiguity, you can use a special [code]?context[/code] column to "
"specify the context to use with [method Object.tr].\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"en,?context,fr,ja,zh\n"
"Letter,Alphabet,Lettre,字母,字母\n"
"Letter,Message,Courrier,手紙,信件\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"To set the plural form of a string to use with [method Object.tr_n], add a "
"special [code]?plural[/code] column. After setting the plural form of the "
"source string in this column, you can add additional rows to provide "
"translations for more plural forms. The first column and all special columns "
"in these plural form rows must be empty.\n"
"Godot includes built-in plural rules for some languages. You can also "
"customize them using a special [code]?pluralrule[/code] row. See [url=https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/gettext/manual/html_node/Plural-forms.html]GNU gettext[/"
"url] for examples and more info.\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"en,?plural,fr,ru,zh,_Comment\n"
"?pluralrule,,nplurals=2; plural=(n >= 2);,,,Customize the plural rule for "
"French\n"
"There is %d apple,There are %d apples,Il y a %d pomme,Есть %d яблоко,那里有%d"
"个苹果,\n"
",,Il y a %d pommes,Есть %d яблока,,\n"
",,,Есть %d яблок,,\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Comma-separated values (CSV) ຫຼື ຄ່າທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ "
"ແມ່ນຮູບແບບການຈັດເກັບຕາຕະລາງແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ. "
"ຄວາມລຽບງ່າຍຂອງຮູບແບບນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນງ່າຍຕໍ່ການແກ້ໄຂໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມ ຫຼື ຊອບແວສະເປຣດຊີດ "
"(spreadsheet) ໃດໆກໍໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເປັນທາງເລືອກທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບການປັບໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບທ້ອງຖິ່ນ "
"(localization) ຂອງເກມ.\n"
"ໃນໄຟລ໌ CSV ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການແປ, ຄໍລຳທຳອິດຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວລະບຸຂໍ້ຄວາມ (string identifiers), ແລະ "
"ແຖວທຳອິດຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນສ່ວນຫົວ (header). ສ່ວນຫົວຂອງຄໍລຳທຳອິດສາມາດເປັນຄ່າໃດກໍໄດ້. "
"ສ່ວນຫົວທີ່ເຫຼືອຈະລະບຸທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (locale) ສຳລັບຄໍລຳນັ້ນ. ຄໍລຳທີ່ສ່ວນຫົວເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດກ້ອງ "
"([code]_[/code]) ຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ CSV:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"keys,en,es,ja\n"
"GREET,\"Hello, friend!\",\"Hola, amigo!\",こんにちは\n"
"ASK,How are you?,Cómo está?,元気ですか\n"
"BYE,Goodbye,Adiós,さようなら\n"
"QUOTE,\"\"\"Hello\"\" said the man.\",\"\"\"Hola\"\" dijo el hombre.\",「こん"
"にちは」男は言いました\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຄີ (keys) ໃນຄໍລຳທຳອິດມັກຈະໃຊ້ຕົວລະບຸຂໍ້ຄວາມແບບຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່, "
"ແຕ່ມັນກໍບໍ່ແມ່ນເລື່ອງແປກທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ປາກົດໃນເກມໂດຍກົງເປັນຄີ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນຄວາມກຳກວມຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ, "
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄໍລຳ [code]?context[/code] ພິເສດເພື່ອລະບຸບໍລິບົດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບ [method "
"Object.tr].\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"en,?context,fr,ja,zh\n"
"Letter,Alphabet,Lettre,字母,字母\n"
"Letter,Message,Courrier,手紙,信件\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຮູບແບບພະຫຸພົດ (plural form) ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບ [method Object.tr_n], ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄໍລຳ "
"[code]?plural[/code] ພິເສດ. ຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຮູບແບບພະຫຸພົດຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບໃນຄໍລຳນີ້ແລ້ວ, "
"ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມແຖວເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອໃຫ້ການແປສຳລັບຮູບແບບພະຫຸພົດອື່ນໆ. ຄໍລຳທຳອິດ ແລະ "
"ຄໍລຳພິເສດທັງໝົດໃນແຖວຮູບແບບພະຫຸພົດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງຫວ່າງເປົ່າ.\n"
"Godot ລວມມີກົດເກນພະຫຸພົດໃນຕົວສຳລັບບາງພາສາ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຖວ [code]?"
"pluralrule[/code] ພິເສດ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://www.gnu.org/software/gettext/manual/"
"html_node/Plural-forms.html]GNU gettext[/url] ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"en,?plural,fr,ru,zh,_Comment\n"
"?pluralrule,,nplurals=2; plural=(n >= 2);,,,ປັບແຕ່ງກົດພະຫຸພົດສຳລັບພາສາຝຣັ່ງ\n"
"There is %d apple,There are %d apples,Il y a %d pomme,Есть %d яблоко,那里有%d"
"个苹果,\n"
",,Il y a %d pommes,Есть %d яблока,,\n"
",,,Есть %d яблок,,\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Importing translations"
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າການແປພາສາ"

msgid ""
"- [b]Disabled[/b]: Creates a [Translation].\n"
"- [b]Auto[/b]: Creates an [OptimizedTranslation] when possible. This makes "
"the resulting file smaller at the cost of a small CPU overhead. Falls back to "
"[Translation] for translations with context or plural forms."
msgstr ""
"- [b]Disabled[/b]: ສ້າງ [Translation].\n"
"- [b]Auto[/b]: ສ້າງ [OptimizedTranslation] ເມື່ອເປັນໄປໄດ້. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍລົງ ໂດຍແລກກັບການໃຊ້ງານ CPU ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເລັກນ້ອຍ. ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ "
"[Translation] ສຳລັບການແປທີ່ມີບໍລິບົດ (context) ຫຼື ຮູບແບບພະຫູພົດ."

msgid ""
"The delimiter to use in the CSV file. The default value matches the common "
"CSV convention. Tab-separated values are sometimes called TSV files."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຂັ້ນ (delimiter) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ CSV. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນກົງກັບຮູບແບບ CSV ທົ່ວໄປ. ຄ່າທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍແທັບ "
"(Tab-separated values) ບາງຄັ້ງກໍເອີ້ນວ່າໄຟລ໌ TSV."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], message keys in the CSV file are unescaped using "
"[method String.c_unescape] during the import process."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄີຂໍ້ຄວາມ (message keys) ໃນໄຟລ໌ CSV ຈະຖືກແປງຄືນ "
"(unescaped) ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method String.c_unescape] ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການນຳເຂົ້າ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], message translations in the CSV file are unescaped "
"using [method String.c_unescape] during the import process."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການແປຂໍ້ຄວາມ (message translations) ໃນໄຟລ໌ CSV "
"ຈະຖືກແປງຄືນ (unescaped) ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method String.c_unescape] ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການນຳເຂົ້າ."

msgid ""
"Imports a TTF, TTC, OTF, OTC, WOFF or WOFF2 font file for font rendering that "
"adapts to any size."
msgstr ""
"ນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ຕົວອັກສອນ TTF, TTC, OTF, OTC, WOFF ຫຼື WOFF2 "
"ເພື່ອເຣນເດີຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ປັບໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບທຸກຂະໜາດ."

msgid ""
"Unlike bitmap fonts, dynamic fonts can be resized to any size and still look "
"crisp. Dynamic fonts also optionally support MSDF font rendering, which "
"allows for run-time scale changes with no re-rasterization cost.\n"
"While WOFF and especially WOFF2 tend to result in smaller file sizes, there "
"is no universally \"better\" font format. In most situations, it's "
"recommended to use the font format that was shipped on the font developer's "
"website.\n"
"See also [ResourceImporterBMFont] and [ResourceImporterImageFont]."
msgstr ""
"ຕ່າງຈາກຕົວອັກສອນບິດແມັບ, ຕົວອັກສອນໄດນາມິກ (dynamic fonts) ສາມາດປ່ຽນຂະໜາດເປັນຂະໜາດໃດກໍໄດ້ "
"ແລະ ຍັງຄົງເບິ່ງຄືວ່າມັນຄົມຊັດ. ຕົວອັກສອນໄດນາມິກຍັງຮອງຮັບການເຣນເດີແບບ MSDF ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ "
"ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໃນຕອນແລ່ນໄດ້ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເສຍເວລາໃນການເຮັດ rasterization ໃໝ່.\n"
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ WOFF ແລະ ໂດຍສະເພາະ WOFF2 ມັກຈະມີຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ນ້ອຍກວ່າ, ແຕ່ມັນບໍ່ມີຮູບແບບໃດທີ່ "
"\"ດີກວ່າ\" ຢ່າງສົມບູນ. ໃນສະຖານະການສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຜູ້ພັດທະນາຕົວອັກສອນໃຫ້ມາໃນເວັບໄຊ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [ResourceImporterBMFont] ແລະ [ResourceImporterImageFont] ຕື່ມ."

msgid "Dynamic fonts - Using fonts"
msgstr "ຕົວອັກສອນໄດນາມິກ - ການໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນ"

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically use system fonts as a fallback if a glyph "
"isn't found in this dynamic font. This makes supporting CJK characters or "
"emoji more straightforward, as you don't need to include a CJK/emoji font in "
"your project. See also [member fallbacks].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The appearance of system fonts varies across platforms. Loading "
"system fonts is only supported on Windows, macOS, Linux, Android and iOS."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນລະບົບ (system fonts) ເປັນຕົວສຳຮອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບຕົວອັກສອນ (glyph) ໃນຕົວອັກສອນໄດນາມິກນີ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ການຮອງຮັບຕົວອັກສອນ CJK ຫຼື ອີໂມຈິ "
"ເຮັດໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ ເພາະເຈົ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃສ່ຕົວອັກສອນ CJK/emoji ເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"fallbacks] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງຕົວອັກສອນລະບົບຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມແພລດຟອມ. "
"ການໂຫຼດຕົວອັກສອນລະບົບ ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Windows, macOS, Linux, Android ແລະ iOS."

msgid ""
"The font antialiasing method to use.\n"
"[b]Disabled:[/b] Most suited for pixel art fonts, although you do not "
"[i]have[/i] to change the antialiasing from the default [b]Grayscale[/b] if "
"the font file was well-created and the font is used at an integer multiple of "
"its intended size. If pixel art fonts have a bad appearance at their intended "
"size, try setting [member subpixel_positioning] to [b]Disabled[/b] instead.\n"
"[b]Grayscale:[/b] Use grayscale antialiasing. This is the approach used by "
"the operating system on macOS, Android and iOS.\n"
"[b]LCD Subpixel:[/b] Use antialiasing with subpixel patterns to make fonts "
"sharper on LCD displays. This is the approach used by the operating system on "
"Windows and most Linux distributions. The downside is that this can introduce "
"\"fringing\" on edges, especially on display technologies that don't use "
"standard RGB subpixels (such as OLED displays). The LCD subpixel layout is "
"globally controlled by [member ProjectSettings.gui/theme/"
"lcd_subpixel_layout], which also allows falling back to grayscale "
"antialiasing."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການລຶບຮອຍຢັກ (antialiasing) ຂອງຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້.\n"
"[b]Disabled:[/b] ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນແບບພິກເຊວອາຣ໌ດ (pixel art fonts). "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເຈົ້າຈະບໍ່ [i]ຈຳເປັນ[/i] ຕ້ອງປ່ຽນການລຶບຮອຍຢັກຈາກ [b]Grayscale[/b] "
"ທີ່ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນກໍຕາມ ຖ້າໄຟລ໌ຕົວອັກສອນຖືກສ້າງມາຢ່າງດີ ແລະ ຖືກໃຊ້ "
"ໃນຂະໜາດທີ່ເປັນຕົວຄູນເລກຖ້ວນຂອງຂະໜາດທີ່ຕັ້ງໃຈໄວ້. ຖ້າຕົວອັກສອນພິກເຊວອາຣ໌ດເບິ່ງບໍ່ດີໃນຂະໜາດທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, "
"ໃຫ້ລອງຕັ້ງ [member subpixel_positioning] ເປັນ [b]Disabled[/b] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]Grayscale:[/b] ໃຊ້ການລຶບຮອຍຢັກແບບເກຣສະເກລ (grayscale). ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໃນ "
"macOS, Android ແລະ iOS ໃຊ້.\n"
"[b]LCD Subpixel:[/b] ໃຊ້ການລຶບຮອຍຢັກດ້ວຍຮູບແບບຊັບພິກເຊວ (subpixel patterns) "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕົວອັກສອນຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນໃນຈໍ LCD. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໃນ Windows ແລະ Linux ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃຊ້. "
"ຂໍ້ເສຍຄືມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ \"ສີຟຸ້ງ\" ຕາມຂອບ, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນເທັກໂນໂລຊີການສະແດງຜົນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ RGB "
"subpixels ມາດຕະຖານ (ເຊັ່ນ ຈໍ OLED). ຮູບແບບ LCD subpixel ຖືກຄວບຄຸມທົ່ວໂລກໂດຍ [member "
"ProjectSettings.gui/theme/lcd_subpixel_layout]."

msgid ""
"List of font fallbacks to use if a glyph isn't found in this dynamic font. "
"Fonts at the beginning of the array are attempted first, but fallback fonts "
"that don't support the glyph's language and script are attempted last (see "
"[member language_support] and [member script_support]). See also [member "
"allow_system_fallback]."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການຕົວອັກສອນສຳຮອງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບຕົວອັກສອນ (glyph) ໃນຕົວອັກສອນໄດນາມິກນີ້. ຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຢູ່ຕົ້ນໆ "
"ຂອງອາເຣຈະຖືກລອງໃຊ້ກ່ອນ, ແຕ່ຕົວອັກສອນສຳຮອງທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບພາສາ ແລະ "
"ສະຄຣິບຂອງຕົວອັກສອນນັ້ນຈະຖືກລອງໃຊ້ເປັນອັນດັບສຸດທ້າຍ (ເບິ່ງ [member language_support] ແລະ "
"[member script_support]). ເບິ່ງ [member allow_system_fallback] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], forces generation of hinting data for the font using "
"[url=https://freetype.org/]FreeType[/url]'s autohinter. This will make "
"[member hinting] effective with fonts that don't include hinting data."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ hinting ສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນໂດຍໃຊ້ autohinter "
"ຂອງ [url=https://freetype.org/]FreeType[/url]. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ [member hinting] "
"ມີຜົນກັບ ຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນ hinting ມານຳ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this font will have mipmaps generated. This prevents "
"text from looking grainy when a [Control] is scaled down, or when a [Label3D] "
"is viewed from a long distance (if [member Label3D.texture_filter] is set to "
"a mode that displays mipmaps).\n"
"Enabling [member generate_mipmaps] increases font generation time and memory "
"usage. Only enable this setting if you actually need it."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວອັກສອນນີ້ຈະມີການສ້າງມິບແມັບ (mipmaps). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມ ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າມີເມັດຢັກ (grainy) ເມື່ອ [Control] ຖືກຍໍ້ຂະໜາດລົງ, ຫຼື ເມື່ອ "
"[Label3D] ຖືກເບິ່ງຈາກໄລຍະໄກ.\n"
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ [member generate_mipmaps] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເວລາໃນການສ້າງຕົວອັກສອນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ມັນແທ້ໆ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The hinting mode to use. This controls how aggressively glyph edges should be "
"snapped to pixels when rasterizing the font. Depending on personal "
"preference, you may prefer using one hinting mode over the other. Hinting "
"modes other than [b]None[/b] are only effective if the font contains hinting "
"data (see [member force_autohinter]).\n"
"[b]None:[/b] Smoothest appearance, which can make the font look blurry at "
"small sizes.\n"
"[b]Light:[/b] Sharp result by snapping glyph edges to pixels on the Y axis "
"only.\n"
"[b]Normal:[/b] Sharpest by snapping glyph edges to pixels on both X and Y "
"axes.\n"
"[b]Light (Except Pixel Fonts):[/b] [b]Disabled[/b] for pixel style fonts "
"(each glyph's contours contain only straight horizontal and vertical lines), "
"[b]Light[/b] for other fonts.\n"
"[b]Normal (Except Pixel Fonts):[/b] [b]Disabled[/b] for pixel style fonts "
"(each glyph's contours contain only straight horizontal and vertical lines), "
"[b]Normal[/b] for other fonts."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການໃຫ້ຄຳແນະນຳ (hinting mode) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວບຄຸມວ່າຂອບຂອງຕົວອັກສອນຄວນຈະຖືກດຶງໃຫ້ "
"ເຂົ້າກັບພິກເຊວຫຼາຍປານໃດໃນເວລາເຮັດ rasterizing. ຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມມັກສ່ວນຕົວ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະມັກໂໝດໃດໜຶ່ງ "
"ຫຼາຍກວ່າອີກໂໝດໜຶ່ງ. ໂໝດ hinting ອື່ນໆ ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [b]None[/b] ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຕົວອັກສອນນັ້ນ ມີຂໍ້ມູນ "
"hinting ຢູ່ (ເບິ່ງ [member force_autohinter]).\n"
"[b]None:[/b] ເບິ່ງກ້ຽງນຽນທີ່ສຸດ, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຕົວອັກສອນເບິ່ງມົວໃນຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ.\n"
"[b]Light:[/b] ໃຫ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ຄົມຊັດໂດຍການດຶງຂອບຕົວອັກສອນໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບພິກເຊວໃນແກນ Y ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]Normal:[/b] ຄົມຊັດທີ່ສຸດໂດຍການດຶງຂອບໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບພິກເຊວທັງແກນ X ແລະ Y.\n"
"[b]Light (Except Pixel Fonts):[/b] [b]ປິດໃຊ້[/b] ສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນແບບພິກເຊວ, [b]Light[/"
"b] ສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນອື່ນໆ.\n"
"[b]Normal (Except Pixel Fonts):[/b] [b]ປິດໃຊ້[/b] ສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນແບບພິກເຊວ, "
"[b]Normal[/b] ສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"Override the list of languages supported by this font. If left empty, this is "
"supplied by the font metadata. There is usually no need to change this. See "
"also [member script_support]."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບລາຍການພາສາທີ່ຕົວອັກສອນນີ້ຮອງຮັບ. ຖ້າປ່ອຍວ່າງໄວ້, ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເອົາມາຈາກ metadata "
"ຂອງຕົວອັກສອນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນແປງຄ່ານີ້. ເບິ່ງ [member script_support] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"The width of the range around the shape between the minimum and maximum "
"representable signed distance. If using font outlines, [member "
"msdf_pixel_range] must be set to at least [i]twice[/i] the size of the "
"largest font outline. The default [member msdf_pixel_range] value of [code]8[/"
"code] allows outline sizes up to [code]4[/code] to look correct."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຂອບເຂດອ້ອມຮອບຮູບຮ່າງ ລະຫວ່າງໄລຍະຫ່າງຕ່ຳສຸດ ແລະ ສູງສຸດ. ຖ້າໃຊ້ຂອບຕົວອັກສອນ "
"(outlines), [member msdf_pixel_range] ຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍເປັນ [i]ສອງເທົ່າ[/i] "
"ຂອງຂະໜາດຂອບຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສຸດ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [code]8[/code] ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂອບທີ່ມີຂະໜາດສູງເຖິງ "
"[code]4[/code] ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Source font size used to generate MSDF textures. Higher values allow for more "
"precision, but are slower to render and require more memory. Only increase "
"this value if you notice a visible lack of precision in glyph rendering. Only "
"effective if [member multichannel_signed_distance_field] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຕົວອັກສອນຕົ້ນສະບັບທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ MSDF textures. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະເຣນເດີຊ້າລົງ ແລະ ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າການເຣນເດີ "
"ຕົວອັກສອນຂາດຄວາມລະອຽດ. ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member multichannel_signed_distance_field] "
"ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], the font will use multichannel signed distance "
"field (MSDF) for crisp rendering at any size. Since this approach does not "
"rely on rasterizing the font every time its size changes, this allows for "
"resizing the font in real-time without any performance penalty. Text will "
"also not look grainy for [Control]s that are scaled down (or for [Label3D]s "
"viewed from a long distance).\n"
"MSDF font rendering can be combined with [member generate_mipmaps] to further "
"improve font rendering quality when scaled down."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວອັກສອນຈະໃຊ້ multichannel signed distance field "
"(MSDF) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການເຣນເດີຄົມຊັດໃນທຸກຂະໜາດ. ເນື່ອງຈາກວິທີນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຶ້ນກັບການເຮັດ rasterizing "
"ຕົວອັກສອນທຸກຄັ້ງ ທີ່ຂະໜາດປ່ຽນແປງ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຶ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຕົວອັກສອນໄດ້ແບບທັນທີ (real-time) "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບ ຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ. ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະບໍ່ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າມີເມັດຢັກສຳລັບ [Control] ທີ່ຖືກຍໍ້ຂະໜາດລົງ.\n"
"ການເຣນເດີຕົວອັກສອນແບບ MSDF ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [member generate_mipmaps] ເພື່ອປັບປຸງຄຸນນະພາບ "
"ການເຣນເດີໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນຕື່ມອີກເມື່ອຖືກຍໍ້ຂະໜາດລົງ."

msgid ""
"The OpenType features to enable, disable or set a value for this font. This "
"can be used to enable optional features provided by the font, such as "
"ligatures or alternative glyphs. The list of supported OpenType features "
"varies on a per-font basis."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດ OpenType ທີ່ຈະເປີດໃຊ້, ປິດໃຊ້ ຫຼື ຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນນີ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອ "
"ເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມທີ່ຕົວອັກສອນນັ້ນມີໃຫ້, ເຊັ່ນ ligatures ຫຼື ຕົວອັກສອນທາງເລືອກອື່ນໆ. ລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"OpenType ທີ່ຮອງຮັບຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມແຕ່ລະຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid ""
"The glyph ranges to prerender. This can avoid stuttering during gameplay when "
"new characters need to be rendered, especially if [member "
"subpixel_positioning] is enabled. The downside of using preloading is that "
"initial project load times will increase, as well as memory usage."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ວງຂອງຕົວອັກສອນ (glyph ranges) ທີ່ຈະເຣນເດີໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ (prerender). ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍຫຼີກລ່ຽງ "
"ການກະຕຸກ (stuttering) ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ ເມື່ອຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຣນເດີຕົວອັກສອນໃໝ່. ຂໍ້ເສຍຂອງ "
"ການໂຫຼດລ່ວງໜ້າຄື ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເວລາໃນການໂຫຼດໂປຣເຈັກຄັ້ງທຳອິດດົນຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Override the list of language scripts supported by this font. If left empty, "
"this is supplied by the font metadata. There is usually no need to change "
"this. See also [member language_support]."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບລາຍການສະຄຣິບພາສາ (language scripts) ທີ່ຕົວອັກສອນນີ້ຮອງຮັບ. ຖ້າປ່ອຍວ່າງໄວ້, "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເອົາມາຈາກ metadata ຂອງຕົວອັກສອນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນແປງຄ່ານີ້. ເບິ່ງ "
"[member language_support] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Subpixel positioning improves font rendering appearance, especially at "
"smaller font sizes. The downside is that it takes more time to initially "
"render the font, which can cause stuttering during gameplay, especially if "
"used with large font sizes. This should be set to [b]Disabled[/b] for fonts "
"with a pixel art appearance.\n"
"[b]Disabled:[/b] No subpixel positioning. Lowest quality, fastest rendering.\n"
"[b]Auto:[/b] Use subpixel positioning at small font sizes (the chosen quality "
"varies depending on font size). Large fonts will not use subpixel "
"positioning. This is a good tradeoff between performance and quality.\n"
"[b]One Half of a Pixel:[/b] Always perform intermediate subpixel positioning "
"regardless of font size. High quality, slow rendering.\n"
"[b]One Quarter of a Pixel:[/b] Always perform precise subpixel positioning "
"regardless of font size. Highest quality, slowest rendering.\n"
"[b]Auto (Except Pixel Fonts):[/b] [b]Disabled[/b] for pixel style fonts (each "
"glyph's contours contain only straight horizontal and vertical lines), "
"[b]Auto[/b] for other fonts."
msgstr ""
"ການຈັດຕຳແໜ່ງແບບຊັບພິກເຊວ (Subpixel positioning) "
"ຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງຮູບລັກສະນະການເຣນເດີຕົວອັກສອນໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ. "
"ຂໍ້ເສຍຄືມັນໃຊ້ເວລາໃນການເຣນເດີເບື້ອງຕົ້ນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ຄວນຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Disabled[/b] "
"ສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນແບບພິກເຊວອາຣ໌ດ.\n"
"[b]Disabled:[/b] ບໍ່ມີການຈັດຕຳແໜ່ງແບບຊັບພິກເຊວ. ຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳສຸດ, ເຣນເດີໄວທີ່ສຸດ.\n"
"[b]Auto:[/b] ໃຊ້ການຈັດຕຳແໜ່ງແບບຊັບພິກເຊວໃນຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ. ຕົວອັກສອນຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້. "
"ເປັນການເລືອກທີ່ດີລະຫວ່າງປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ຄຸນນະພາບ.\n"
"[b]One Half of a Pixel:[/b] ໃຊ້ການຈັດຕຳແໜ່ງແບບເຄິ່ງພິກເຊວສະເໝີ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຂະໜາດ. "
"ຄຸນນະພາບສູງ, ເຣນເດີຊ້າ.\n"
"[b]One Quarter of a Pixel:[/b] ໃຊ້ການຈັດຕຳແໜ່ງແບບໜຶ່ງສ່ວນສີ່ພິກເຊວສະເໝີ. ຄຸນນະພາບສູງສຸດ, "
"ເຣນເດີຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ.\n"
"[b]Auto (Except Pixel Fonts):[/b] [b]ປິດໃຊ້[/b] ສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນແບບພິກເຊວ, [b]Auto[/"
"b] ສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນອື່ນໆ."

msgid "Imports an image for use in scripting, with no rendering capabilities."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການຂຽນສະຄຣິບ, ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຄວາມສາມາດໃນການເຣນເດີ."

msgid ""
"This importer imports [Image] resources, as opposed to [CompressedTexture2D]. "
"If you need to render the image in 2D or 3D, use [ResourceImporterTexture] "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວນຳເຂົ້ານີ້ຈະນຳເຂົ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Image], ເຊິ່ງຕ່າງຈາກ [CompressedTexture2D]. "
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຣນເດີຮູບພາບໃນ 2D ຫຼື 3D, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [ResourceImporterTexture] ແທນ."

msgid "Imports a bitmap font where all glyphs have the same width and height."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າຕົວອັກສອນບິດແມັບທີ່ທຸກຕົວອັກສອນ (glyphs) ມີຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງເທົ່າກັນ."

msgid ""
"This image-based workflow can be easier to use than [ResourceImporterBMFont], "
"but it requires all glyphs to have the same width and height, glyph advances "
"and drawing offsets can be customized. This makes [ResourceImporterImageFont] "
"most suited to fixed-width fonts.\n"
"See also [ResourceImporterDynamicFont]."
msgstr ""
"ຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກແບບອີງຕາມຮູບພາບນີ້ ອາດຈະໃຊ້ງານງ່າຍກວ່າ [ResourceImporterBMFont], "
"ແຕ່ມັນຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ທຸກຕົວອັກສອນມີຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງເທົ່າກັນ. ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄລຍະຫ່າງ (advances) "
"ແລະ ໄລຍະການແຕ້ມ (offsets) ໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ [ResourceImporterImageFont] ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດ "
"ສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ມີຄວາມກວ້າງຄົງທີ່ (fixed-width fonts).\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [ResourceImporterDynamicFont] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Font ascent (number of pixels above the baseline). If set to [code]0[/code], "
"half of the character height is used."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນເທິງຂອງຕົວອັກສອນ (ascent) (ຈຳນວນພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ເໜືອເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ). ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/code], "
"ຈະໃຊ້ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຄວາມສູງຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid ""
"Margin applied around every imported glyph. If your font image contains "
"guides (in the form of lines between glyphs) or if spacing between characters "
"appears incorrect, try adjusting [member character_margin]."
msgstr ""
"ຂອບ (Margin) ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບທຸກໆ ຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມາ. ຖ້າຮູບພາບຕົວອັກສອນຂອງເຈົ້າມີເສັ້ນນຳທາງ ຫຼື "
"ຖ້າໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງຕົວອັກສອນເບິ່ງຄືວ່າບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໃຫ້ລອງປັບ [member character_margin]."

msgid ""
"The character ranges to import from the font image. This is an array that "
"maps each position on the image (in tile coordinates, not pixels). The font "
"atlas is traversed from left to right and top to bottom. Characters can be "
"specified with decimal numbers (126), hexadecimal numbers ([code]0x007e[/"
"code] or [code]U+007e[/code]), or between single quotes ([code]'~'[/code]). "
"Ranges can be specified with a hyphen between characters.\n"
"For example, [code]0-127[/code] represents the full ASCII range. It can also "
"be written as [code]0x0000-0x007f[/code] (or [code]U+0000-U+007f[/code]). As "
"another example, [code]' '-'~'[/code] is equivalent to [code]32-126[/code] "
"and represents the range of printable (visible) ASCII characters.\n"
"For any range, the character advance and offset can be customized by "
"appending three space-separated integer values (additional advance, x offset, "
"y offset) to the end. For example [code]'a'-'b' 4 5 2[/code] sets the advance "
"to [code]char_width + 4[/code] and offset to [code]Vector2(5, 2)[/code] for "
"both `a` and `b` characters.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The overall number of characters must not exceed the number of "
"[member columns] multiplied by [member rows]. Otherwise, the font will fail "
"to import."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ວງຂອງຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຈະນຳເຂົ້າມາຈາກຮູບພາບ. ນີ້ແມ່ນອາເຣທີ່ຈັບຄູ່ແຕ່ລະຕຳແໜ່ງໃນຮູບພາບ. "
"ການອ່ານຮູບພາບຈະເລີ່ມຈາກຊ້າຍໄປຂວາ ແລະ ເທິງລົງລຸ່ມ. ຕົວອັກສອນສາມາດລະບຸເປັນເລກຖານສິບ (126), "
"ເລກຖານສິບຫົກ ([code]0x007e[/code]), ຫຼື ພາຍໃຕ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າດ່ຽວ ([code]'~'[/code]).\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: [code]0-127[/code] ແທນຊ່ວງ ASCII ທັງໝົດ. [code]' '-'~'[/code] "
"ແທນຊ່ວງຕົວອັກສອນ ASCII ທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້.\n"
"ສຳລັບຊ່ວງໃດກໍຕາມ, ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄລຍະຫ່າງ ແລະ offset ໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມຕົວເລກສາມຄ່າຕໍ່ທ້າຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"[code]'a'-'b' 4 5 2[/code] ຈະຕັ້ງໄລຍະຫ່າງເປັນ [code]char_width + 4[/code] ແລະ "
"offset ເປັນ [code]Vector2(5, 2)[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຈຳນວນຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດຕ້ອງບໍ່ເກີນຈຳນວນ [member columns] ຄູນກັບ [member "
"rows]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການນຳເຂົ້າຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid "Number of columns in the font image. See also [member rows]."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄໍລຳໃນຮູບພາບຕົວອັກສອນ. ເບິ່ງ [member rows] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Font descent (number of pixels below the baseline). If set to [code]0[/code], "
"half of the character height is used."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງຕົວອັກສອນ (descent) (ຈຳນວນພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ກ້ອງເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ). ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/code], "
"ຈະໃຊ້ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຄວາມສູງຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid ""
"Margin to cut on the sides of the entire image. This can be used to cut parts "
"of the image that contain attribution information or similar."
msgstr ""
"ຂອບທີ່ຈະຕັດອອກຈາກດ້ານຂ້າງຂອງຮູບພາບທັງໝົດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັດສ່ວນຂອງຮູບພາບ ທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ສ້າງ ຫຼື "
"ຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆ ທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການອອກ."

msgid ""
"Kerning pairs for the font. Kerning pair adjust the spacing between two "
"characters.\n"
"Each string consist of three space separated values: \"from\" string, \"to\" "
"string and integer offset. Each combination form the two string for a kerning "
"pair, e.g, [code]ab cd -3[/code] will create kerning pairs [code]ac[/code], "
"[code]ad[/code], [code]bc[/code], and [code]bd[/code] with offset [code]-3[/"
"code]. [code]\\uXXXX[/code] escape sequences can be used to add Unicode "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"ຄູ່ການປັບໄລຍະຫ່າງ (Kerning pairs) ສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນ. Kerning "
"ຈະຊ່ວຍປັບໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງຕົວອັກສອນສອງຕົວ.\n"
"ແຕ່ລະຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍສາມຄ່າທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງ: ຂໍ້ຄວາມ \"ຈາກ\", ຂໍ້ຄວາມ \"ຫາ\" ແລະ ຄ່າ "
"offset. ຕົວຢ່າງ: [code]ab cd -3[/code] ຈະສ້າງຄູ່ kerning [code]ac[/code], "
"[code]ad[/code], [code]bc[/code], ແລະ [code]bd[/code] ໂດຍມີໄລຍະຫ່າງ [code]-3[/"
"code]. ສາມາດໃຊ້ [code]\\uXXXX[/code] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ໄດ້."

msgid "Number of rows in the font image. See also [member columns]."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແຖວໃນຮູບພາບຕົວອັກສອນ. ເບິ່ງ [member columns] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Imports a 3-dimensional texture ([Texture3D]), a [Texture2DArray], a "
"[Cubemap] or a [CubemapArray]."
msgstr ""
"ນຳເຂົ້າພື້ນຜິວ 3 ມິຕິ ([Texture3D]), [Texture2DArray], [Cubemap] ຫຼື [CubemapArray]."

msgid ""
"This imports a 3-dimensional texture, which can then be used in custom "
"shaders, as a [FogMaterial] density map or as a "
"[GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D]. See also [ResourceImporterTexture] and "
"[ResourceImporterTextureAtlas]."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະນຳເຂົ້າພື້ນຜິວ 3 ມິຕິ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ໃນເຊເດີທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຊ້ເປັນແຜນຜັງຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງ "
"[FogMaterial] ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເປັນ [GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D]. ເບິ່ງ "
"[ResourceImporterTexture] ແລະ [ResourceImporterTextureAtlas] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Controls how color channels should be used in the imported texture.\n"
"[b]sRGB Friendly:[/b], prevents the R and RG color formats from being used, "
"as they do not support nonlinear sRGB encoding.\n"
"[b]Optimized:[/b], allows the RG color format to be used if the texture does "
"not use the blue channel. This reduces memory usage if the texture's blue "
"channel can be discarded (all pixels must have a blue value of [code]0[/"
"code]).\n"
"[b]Normal Map (RG Channels):[/b] This forces all layers from the texture to "
"be imported with the RG color format, with only the red and green channels "
"preserved. RGTC (Red-Green Texture Compression) compression is able to "
"preserve its detail much better, while using the same amount of memory as a "
"standard RGBA VRAM-compressed texture. This only has an effect on textures "
"with the VRAM Compressed or Basis Universal compression modes. This mode is "
"only available in layered textures ([Cubemap], [CubemapArray], "
"[Texture2DArray] and [Texture3D])."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການໃຊ້ຊ່ອງສີໃນພື້ນຜິວທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມາ.\n"
"[b]sRGB Friendly:[/b] ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບສີ R ແລະ RG ເພາະພວກມັນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ "
"sRGB ແບບບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]Optimized:[/b] ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບສີ RG ໄດ້ ຖ້າພື້ນຜິວນັ້ນບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງສີຟ້າ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ຖ້າຊ່ອງສີຟ້າສາມາດຖິ້ມໄດ້ (ທຸກພິກເຊວຕ້ອງມີຄ່າສີຟ້າເປັນ [code]0[/"
"code]).\n"
"[b]Normal Map (RG Channels):[/b] ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ທຸກເລເຍີຂອງພື້ນຜິວຖືກນຳເຂົ້າດ້ວຍຮູບແບບ RG, "
"ໂດຍຈະເກັບໄວ້ສະເພາະຊ່ອງສີແດງ ແລະ ສີຂຽວ. ການບີບອັດແບບ RGTC ສາມາດຮັກສາລາຍລະອຽດໄດ້ດີກວ່າ "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳເທົ່າກັບຮູບແບບ RGBA ມາດຕະຖານ. ໂໝດນີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບພື້ນຜິວທີ່ມີ ການບີບອັດແບບ "
"VRAM ຫຼື Basis Universal ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Controls how VRAM compression should be performed for HDR images.\n"
"[b]Disabled:[/b] Never use VRAM compression for HDR textures, regardless of "
"whether they're opaque or transparent. Instead, the texture is converted to "
"RGBE9995 (9-bits per channel + 5-bit exponent = 32 bits per pixel) to reduce "
"memory usage compared to a half-float or single-precision float image "
"format.\n"
"[b]Opaque Only:[/b] Only uses VRAM compression for opaque HDR textures. This "
"is due to a limitation of HDR formats, as there is no VRAM-compressed HDR "
"format that supports transparency at the same time.\n"
"[b]Always:[/b] Force VRAM compression even for HDR textures with an alpha "
"channel. To perform this, the alpha channel is discarded on import.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective on Radiance HDR ([code].hdr[/code]) and OpenEXR "
"([code].exr[/code]) images."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການບີບອັດ VRAM ສຳລັບຮູບພາບ HDR.\n"
"[b]Disabled:[/b] ບໍ່ໃຊ້ການບີບອັດ VRAM ສຳລັບພື້ນຜິວ HDR ເລີຍ. ແຕ່ຈະປ່ຽນພື້ນຜິວເປັນ ຮູບແບບ "
"RGBE9995 ແທນ ເພື່ອຫຼຸດການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ.\n"
"[b]Opaque Only:[/b] ໃຊ້ການບີບອັດ VRAM ສະເພາະກັບພື້ນຜິວ HDR ທີ່ທຶບແສງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງຮູບແບບ HDR ທີ່ບໍ່ມີການບີບອັດໃດຮອງຮັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສພ້ອມກັນໄດ້.\n"
"[b]Always:[/b] ບັງຄັບໃຊ້ການບີບອັດ VRAM ແມ່ນແຕ່ກັບພື້ນຜິວ HDR ທີ່ມີຊ່ອງອັລຟາ. "
"ໂດຍຊ່ອງອັລຟາຈະຖືກຖິ້ມອອກເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບຮູບພາບ Radiance HDR ([code].hdr[/code]) ແລະ OpenEXR "
"([code].exr[/code]) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses BPTC compression on desktop platforms and ASTC "
"compression on mobile platforms. When using BPTC, BC7 is used for SDR "
"textures and BC6H is used for HDR textures.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], uses the faster but lower-quality S3TC compression on "
"desktop platforms and ETC2 on mobile/web platforms. When using S3TC, DXT1 "
"(BC1) is used for opaque textures and DXT5 (BC3) is used for transparent or "
"normal map (RGTC) textures.\n"
"BPTC and ASTC support VRAM compression for HDR textures, but S3TC and ETC2 do "
"not (see [member compress/hdr_compression])."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ການບີບອັດ BPTC ໃນແພລັດຟອມເດັສທັອບ ແລະ ການບີບອັດ ASTC "
"ໃນແພລັດຟອມມືຖື. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ BPTC, BC7 ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບເທັກເຈີ SDR ແລະ BC6H ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບເທັກເຈີ "
"HDR.\n"
"ຖ້າ [code]false[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ການບີບອັດ S3TC ທີ່ໄວກວ່າແຕ່ຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳກວ່າໃນແພລັດຟອມເດັສທັອບ "
"ແລະ ETC2 ໃນແພລັດຟອມມືຖື/ເວັບ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ S3TC, DXT1 (BC1) ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບເທັກເຈີທີ່ທຶບແສງ ແລະ "
"DXT5 (BC3) ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບເທັກເຈີທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສ ຫຼື ເທັກເຈີນໍມໍແມັບ (RGTC).\n"
"BPTC ແລະ ASTC ຮອງຮັບການບີບອັດ VRAM ສຳລັບເທັກເຈີ HDR, ແຕ່ S3TC ແລະ ETC2 ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ (ເບິ່ງ "
"[member compress/hdr_compression])."

msgid ""
"The quality to use when using the [b]Lossy[/b] compression mode. Higher "
"values result in better quality, at the cost of larger file sizes. Lossy "
"quality does not affect memory usage of the imported texture, only its file "
"size on disk."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດການບີບອັດ [b]Lossy[/b]. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບດີຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ. ຄຸນນະພາບແບບ Lossy "
"ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຂອງເທັກເຈີທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ, ມີຜົນພຽງແຕ່ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ໃນດິສກ໌ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The compression mode to use. Each compression mode provides a different "
"tradeoff:\n"
"[b]Lossless[/b]: Original quality, high memory usage, high size on disk, fast "
"import.\n"
"[b]Lossy:[/b] Reduced quality, high memory usage, low size on disk, fast "
"import.\n"
"[b]VRAM Compressed:[/b] Reduced quality, low memory usage, low size on disk, "
"slowest import. Only use for textures in 3D scenes, not for 2D elements.\n"
"[b]VRAM Uncompressed:[/b] Original quality, high memory usage, highest size "
"on disk, fastest import.\n"
"[b]Basis Universal:[/b] Reduced quality, low memory usage, lowest size on "
"disk, slow import. Only use for textures in 3D scenes, not for 2D elements.\n"
"See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.html#compress-"
"mode]Compress mode[/url] in the manual for more details."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການບີບອັດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ແຕ່ລະໂໝດການບີບອັດຈະມີຂໍ້ດີຂໍ້ເສຍທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ:\n"
"[b]Lossless[/b]: ຄຸນນະພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສູງ, ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ໃຫຍ່, ນຳເຂົ້າໄວ.\n"
"[b]Lossy:[/b] ຫຼຸດຄຸນນະພາບລົງ, ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສູງ, ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ນ້ອຍ, ນຳເຂົ້າໄວ.\n"
"[b]VRAM Compressed:[/b] ຫຼຸດຄຸນນະພາບລົງ, ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳນ້ອຍ, ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ນ້ອຍ, ນຳເຂົ້າຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ. "
"ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເທັກເຈີໃນສາກ 3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບອົງປະກອບ 2D.\n"
"[b]VRAM Uncompressed:[/b] ຄຸນນະພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສູງ, ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສຸດ, "
"ນຳເຂົ້າໄວທີ່ສຸດ.\n"
"[b]Basis Universal:[/b] ຫຼຸດຄຸນນະພາບລົງ, ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳນ້ອຍ, ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ, ນຳເຂົ້າຊ້າ. "
"ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເທັກເຈີໃນສາກ 3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບອົງປະກອບ 2D.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.html#compress-"
"mode]ໂໝດການບີບອັດ[/url] ໃນຄູ່ມືສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"If greater than or equal to [code]0.01[/code], enables Rate-Distortion "
"Optimization (RDO) to reduce file size. Higher values result in smaller file "
"sizes but lower quality.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Enabling RDO makes encoding times significantly longer, "
"especially when the image is large.\n"
"See also [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/basis_universal/"
"rdo_dict_size] and [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/basis_universal/"
"zstd_supercompression_level] if you want to reduce the file size further."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຫາກຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ [code]0.01[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ Rate-Distortion Optimization "
"(RDO) ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ນ້ອຍລົງແຕ່ຄຸນນະພາບຈະຕ່ຳລົງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເປີດໃຊ້ RDO ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເວລາໃນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດດົນຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, "
"ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອຮູບພາບມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/basis_universal/rdo_dict_size] "
"ແລະ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/basis_universal/"
"zstd_supercompression_level] ນຳອີກ ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຫຼຸດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ລົງຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"The UASTC encoding level. Higher values result in better quality but make "
"encoding times longer."
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ UASTC. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບດີຂຶ້ນ ແຕ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເວລາໃນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດດົນຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], smaller versions of the texture are generated on "
"import. For example, a 64×64 texture will generate 6 mipmaps (32×32, 16×16, "
"8×8, 4×4, 2×2, 1×1). This has several benefits:\n"
"- Textures will not become grainy in the distance (in 3D), or if scaled down "
"due to [Camera2D] zoom or [CanvasItem] scale (in 2D).\n"
"- Performance will improve if the texture is displayed in the distance, since "
"sampling smaller versions of the original texture is faster and requires less "
"memory bandwidth.\n"
"The downside of mipmaps is that they increase memory usage by roughly 33% "
"(for [Texture2DArray], [Cubemap] and [CubemapArray]) or 14% (for "
"[Texture3D]).\n"
"It's recommended to enable mipmaps in 3D. However, in 2D, this should only be "
"enabled if your project visibly benefits from having mipmaps enabled. If the "
"camera never zooms out significantly, there won't be a benefit to enabling "
"mipmaps but memory usage will increase."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ເທັກເຈີເວີຊັນທີ່ນ້ອຍລົງຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນເວລານຳເຂົ້າ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເທັກເຈີ 64×64 "
"ຈະສ້າງ mipmaps 6 ລະດັບ (32×32, 16×16, 8×8, 4×4, 2×2, 1×1). ອັນນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍຢ່າງ:\n"
"- ເທັກເຈີຈະບໍ່ແຕກເປັນເມັດໃນໄລຍະໄກ (ໃນ 3D), ຫຼື ຖ້າຖືກປັບຂະໜາດລົງຍ້ອນການຊູມຂອງ [Camera2D] ຫຼື "
"ການສະເກລຂອງ [CanvasItem] (ໃນ 2D).\n"
"- ປະສິດທິພາບຈະດີຂຶ້ນຖ້າເທັກເຈີຖືກສະແດງໃນໄລຍະໄກ, "
"ເພາະວ່າການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຈາກເທັກເຈີເວີຊັນທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າຈະໄວກວ່າ ແລະ ໃຊ້ແບນວິດໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳນ້ອຍກວ່າ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ເສຍຂອງ mipmaps ແມ່ນພວກມັນເພີ່ມການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳປະມານ 33% (ສຳລັບ [Texture2DArray], "
"[Cubemap] ແລະ [CubemapArray]) ຫຼື 14% (ສຳລັບ [Texture3D]).\n"
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ mipmaps ໃນ 3D. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃນ 2D, "
"ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ສະເພາະຖ້າໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບປະໂຫຍດຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. ຖ້າກ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບບໍ່ເຄີຍຊູມອອກຫຼາຍ, "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການເປີດໃຊ້ mipmaps ແຕ່ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Unimplemented. This currently has no effect when changed."
msgstr "ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ. ຕອນນີ້ການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງ."

msgid ""
"Controls how the cubemap's texture is internally laid out. When using high-"
"resolution cubemaps, [b]2×3[/b] and [b]3×2[/b] are less prone to exceeding "
"hardware texture size limits compared to [b]1×6[/b] and [b]6×1[/b]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການຈັດວາງເທັກເຈີຂອງ cubemap ພາຍໃນ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ cubemap ທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດສູງ, [b]2×3[/"
"b] ແລະ [b]3×2[/b] ຈະມີໂອກາດໜ້ອຍກວ່າທີ່ຈະເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດຂະໜາດເທັກເຈີຂອງຮາດແວ ເມື່ອທຽບກັບ "
"[b]1×6[/b] ແລະ [b]6×1[/b]."

msgid "Imports an MP3 audio file for playback."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ສຽງ MP3 ເພື່ອຫຼິ້ນ."

msgid ""
"MP3 is a lossy audio format, with worse audio quality compared to "
"[ResourceImporterOggVorbis] at a given bitrate.\n"
"In most cases, it's recommended to use Ogg Vorbis over MP3. However, if "
"you're using an MP3 sound source with no higher quality source available, "
"then it's recommended to use the MP3 file directly to avoid double lossy "
"compression.\n"
"MP3 requires more CPU to decode than [ResourceImporterWAV]. If you need to "
"play a lot of simultaneous sounds, it's recommended to use WAV for those "
"sounds instead, especially if targeting low-end devices."
msgstr ""
"MP3 ເປັນຮູບແບບສຽງແບບສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດ (lossy), ເຊິ່ງມີຄຸນນະພາບສຽງຕ່ຳກວ່າ "
"[ResourceImporterOggVorbis] ໃນອັດຕາບິດ (bitrate) ທີ່ເທົ່າກັນ.\n"
"ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Ogg Vorbis ແທນ MP3. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ແຫຼ່ງສຽງ MP3 "
"ໂດຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມີຄຸນນະພາບສູງກວ່າ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ MP3 "
"ໂດຍກົງເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການບີບອັດແບບສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ.\n"
"MP3 ໃຊ້ CPU ໃນການຖອດລະຫັດຫຼາຍກວ່າ [ResourceImporterWAV]. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຫຼິ້ນສຽງຫຼາຍໆຢ່າງພ້ອມກັນ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ WAV ສຳລັບສຽງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນແທນ, "
"ໂດຍສະເພາະຖ້າເນັ້ນໃສ່ອຸປະກອນສະເປັກຕ່ຳ."

msgid "Importing audio samples"
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າຕົວຢ່າງສຽງ"

msgid ""
"The number of beats within a single bar in the audio track. This is only "
"relevant for music that wishes to make use of interactive music "
"functionality, not sound effects.\n"
"A more convenient editor for [member bar_beats] is provided in the "
"[b]Advanced Import Settings[/b] dialog, as it lets you preview your changes "
"without having to reimport the audio."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຈັງຫວະ (beats) ພາຍໃນໜຶ່ງຫ້ອງເພງ (bar) ໃນແທຣັກສຽງ. "
"ອັນນີ້ມີຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສະເພາະກັບເພງທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ງານຟັງຊັນເພງແບບໂຕ້ຕອບ (interactive music) "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກສຽງ.\n"
"ມີຕົວແກ້ໄຂທີ່ສະດວກກວ່າສຳລັບ [member bar_beats] ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ [b]Advanced Import Settings[/"
"b], ເພາະມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງການປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າສຽງໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"The length of the audio track, in beats. The actual duration of the audio "
"file might be longer than what is indicated by this property. This is only "
"relevant for music that wishes to make use of interactive music "
"functionality, not sound effects.\n"
"A more convenient editor for [member beat_count] is provided in the "
"[b]Advanced Import Settings[/b] dialog, as it lets you preview your changes "
"without having to reimport the audio."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຍາວຂອງແທຣັກສຽງ ເປັນຈັງຫວະ. ໄລຍະເວລາຕົວຈິງຂອງໄຟລ໌ສຽງອາດຈະຍາວກວ່າທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້. "
"ອັນນີ້ມີຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສະເພາະກັບເພງທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ງານຟັງຊັນເພງແບບໂຕ້ຕອບ (interactive music) "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກສຽງ.\n"
"ມີຕົວແກ້ໄຂທີ່ສະດວກກວ່າສຳລັບ [member beat_count] ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ [b]Advanced Import Settings[/"
"b], ເພາະມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງການປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າສຽງໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"The tempo of the audio track, measured in beats per minute. This should match "
"the BPM measure that was used to compose the track. This is only relevant for "
"music that wishes to make use of interactive music functionality, not sound "
"effects.\n"
"A more convenient editor for [member bpm] is provided in the [b]Advanced "
"Import Settings[/b] dialog, as it lets you preview your changes without "
"having to reimport the audio."
msgstr ""
"ຈັງຫວະ (tempo) ຂອງແທຣັກສຽງ, ວັດແທກເປັນຈັງຫວະຕໍ່ນາທີ (BPM). ຄ່ານີ້ຄວນກົງກັບຄ່າ BPM "
"ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ່ງເພງ. ອັນນີ້ມີຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສະເພາະກັບເພງທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ງານຟັງຊັນເພງແບບໂຕ້ຕອບ "
"(interactive music) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກສຽງ.\n"
"ມີຕົວແກ້ໄຂທີ່ສະດວກກວ່າສຳລັບ [member bpm] ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ [b]Advanced Import Settings[/b], "
"ເພາະມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງການປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າສຽງໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"If enabled, the audio will begin playing either from the beginning or from "
"[member loop_offset], after playback ends by either reaching the end of the "
"audio or reaching the end of the last beat according to the amount specified "
"in [member beat_count].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [AudioStreamPlayer], the [signal AudioStreamPlayer.finished] "
"signal won't be emitted for looping audio when it reaches the end of the "
"audio file, as the audio will keep playing indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ສຽງຈະເລີ່ມຫຼິ້ນໃໝ່ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນຈາກຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫຼື ຈາກ [member loop_offset], "
"ຫຼັງຈາກການຫຼິ້ນສິ້ນສຸດລົງໂດຍການໄປຮອດທ້າຍໄຟລ໌ສຽງ ຫຼື ຮອດທ້າຍຈັງຫວະສຸດທ້າຍຕາມຈຳນວນທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [member "
"beat_count].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ [AudioStreamPlayer], ສັນຍານ [signal "
"AudioStreamPlayer.finished] ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກສຳລັບສຽງທີ່ວົນຊ້ຳເມື່ອມັນໄປຮອດຕອນທ້າຍຂອງໄຟລ໌ສຽງ, "
"ເພາະວ່າສຽງຈະຫຼິ້ນຕໍ່ໄປເລື້ອຍໆ."

msgid ""
"Determines where audio will start to loop after playback reaches the end of "
"the audio. This can be used to only loop a part of the audio file, which is "
"useful for some ambient sounds or music. The value is determined in seconds "
"relative to the beginning of the audio. A value of [code]0.0[/code] will loop "
"the entire audio file.\n"
"Only has an effect if [member loop] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"A more convenient editor for [member loop_offset] is provided in the "
"[b]Advanced Import Settings[/b] dialog, as it lets you preview your changes "
"without having to reimport the audio."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຈຸດທີ່ສຽງຈະເລີ່ມວົນຊ້ຳ (loop) ຫຼັງຈາກການຫຼິ້ນໄປຮອດຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງສຽງ. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອວົນຊ້ຳພຽງແຕ່ບາງສ່ວນຂອງໄຟລ໌ສຽງ, ເຊິ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບສຽງບັນຍາກາດ ຫຼື ເພງບາງຢ່າງ. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຖືກກຳນົດເປັນວິນາທີທຽບກັບຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງສຽງ. ຄ່າ [code]0.0[/code] ຈະວົນຊ້ຳທັງໝົດໄຟລ໌ສຽງ.\n"
"ມີຜົນສະເພາະຖ້າ [member loop] ເປັນ [code]true[/code].\n"
"ມີຕົວແກ້ໄຂທີ່ສະດວກກວ່າສຳລັບ [member loop_offset] ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ [b]Advanced Import "
"Settings[/b], ເພາະມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງການປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າສຽງໃໝ່."

msgid "Imports an OBJ 3D model as an independent [Mesh] or scene."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າໂມເດລ 3D ແບບ OBJ ເປັນ [Mesh] ອິດສະຫຼະ ຫຼື ເປັນສາກ (scene)."

msgid ""
"Unlike [ResourceImporterScene], [ResourceImporterOBJ] will import a single "
"[Mesh] resource by default instead of importing a [PackedScene]. This makes "
"it easier to use the [Mesh] resource in nodes that expect direct [Mesh] "
"resources, such as [GridMap], [GPUParticles3D] or [CPUParticles3D]. Note that "
"it is still possible to save mesh resources from 3D scenes using the "
"[b]Advanced Import Settings[/b] dialog, regardless of the source format.\n"
"See also [ResourceImporterScene], which is used for more advanced 3D formats "
"such as glTF."
msgstr ""
"ຕ່າງຈາກ [ResourceImporterScene], [ResourceImporterOBJ] ຈະນຳເຂົ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Mesh] "
"ພຽງອັນດຽວໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແທນທີ່ຈະນຳເຂົ້າເປັນ [PackedScene]. ອັນນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ການໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນ "
"[Mesh] ໃນໂນດທີ່ຕ້ອງການ [Mesh] ໂດຍກົງງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ເຊັ່ນ [GridMap], [GPUParticles3D] ຫຼື "
"[CPUParticles3D]. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າທ່ານຍັງສາມາດບັນທຶກຊັບພະຍາກອນເມຊຈາກສາກ 3D ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ໜ້າຕ່າງ "
"[b]Advanced Import Settings[/b], ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນຮູບແບບໃດກໍຕາມ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [ResourceImporterScene] ນຳອີກ, ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ສຳລັບຮູບແບບ 3D ທີ່ສູງກວ່າ ເຊັ່ນ glTF."

msgid "Importing 3D scenes"
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າສາກ 3D"

msgid "If [code]true[/code], generates UV2 on import for [LightmapGI] baking."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງ UV2 ໃນເວລານຳເຂົ້າສຳລັບການອົບ [LightmapGI]."

msgid ""
"Controls the size of each texel on the baked lightmap. A smaller value "
"results in more precise lightmaps, at the cost of larger lightmap sizes and "
"longer bake times.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective if [member generate_lightmap_uv2] is [code]true[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະເທັກເຊລ (texel) ເທິງໄລທ໌ແມັບ (lightmap) ທີ່ອົບແລ້ວ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ໄລທ໌ແມັບມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບຂະໜາດໄລທ໌ແມັບທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ເວລາໃນການອົບທີ່ດົນຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີຜົນສະເພາະຖ້າ [member generate_lightmap_uv2] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], generates lower detail variants of the mesh which will "
"be displayed in the distance to improve rendering performance. Not all meshes "
"benefit from LOD, especially if they are never rendered from far away. "
"Disabling this can reduce output file size and speed up importing. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/mesh_lod.html#doc-mesh-lod]Mesh level of detail "
"(LOD)[/url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງເມຊທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດຕ່ຳລົງ "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນໄລຍະໄກເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບການເຣນເດີ. ບໍ່ແມ່ນເມຊທຸກອັນທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບປະໂຫຍດຈາກ LOD, "
"ໂດຍສະເພາະຖ້າພວກມັນບໍ່ເຄີຍຖືກເຣນເດີຈາກໄລຍະໄກ. ການປິດໃຊ້ງານນີ້ສາມາດຫຼຸດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ການນຳເຂົ້າໄວຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/mesh_lod.html#doc-mesh-"
"lod]Mesh level of detail (LOD)[/url] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables the generation of shadow meshes on import. This "
"optimizes shadow rendering without reducing quality by welding vertices "
"together when possible. This in turn reduces the memory bandwidth required to "
"render shadows. Shadow mesh generation currently doesn't support using a "
"lower detail level than the source mesh (but shadow rendering will make use "
"of LODs when relevant)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການສ້າງເມຊເງົາ (shadow meshes) ໃນເວລານຳເຂົ້າ. "
"ອັນນີ້ຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບການເຣນເດີເງົາໂດຍບໍ່ຫຼຸດຄຸນນະພາບ ດ້ວຍການເຊື່ອມເວີເທັກຊ໌ (vertices) "
"ເຂົ້າກັນເມື່ອເປັນໄປໄດ້. ອັນນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດແບນວິດໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການເຣນເດີເງົາ. "
"ປະຈຸບັນການສ້າງເມຊເງົາຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການໃຊ້ລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າເມຊຕົ້ນສະບັບ (ແຕ່ການເຣນເດີເງົາຈະໃຊ້ "
"LODs ເມື່ອມີຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], generate vertex tangents using [url=http://"
"www.mikktspace.com/]Mikktspace[/url] if the source mesh doesn't have tangent "
"data. When possible, it's recommended to let the 3D modeling software "
"generate tangents on export instead of relying on this option. Tangents are "
"required for correct display of normal and height maps, along with any "
"material/shader features that require tangents.\n"
"If you don't need material features that require tangents, disabling this can "
"reduce output file size and speed up importing if the source 3D file doesn't "
"contain tangents."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງ vertex tangents ໂດຍໃຊ້ [url=http://"
"www.mikktspace.com/]Mikktspace[/url] ຖ້າເມຊຕົ້ນສະບັບບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນ tangent. ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້, "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຊອບແວສ້າງໂມເດລ 3D ສ້າງ tangents ໃນເວລານຳອອກແທນທີ່ຈະເພິ່ງພາຕົວເລືອກນີ້. Tangents "
"ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງນໍມໍແມັບ (normal map) ແລະ ໄຮທ໌ແມັບ (height map), "
"ລວມທັງຟີເຈີວັດສະດຸ/ເຊດເດີ (material/shader) ໃດໆທີ່ຕ້ອງການ tangents.\n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການຟີເຈີວັດສະດຸທີ່ຕ້ອງການ tangents, ການປິດໃຊ້ງານນີ້ສາມາດຫຼຸດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ການນຳເຂົ້າໄວຂຶ້ນ ຖ້າໄຟລ໌ 3D ຕົ້ນສະບັບບໍ່ມີ tangents."

msgid ""
"Offsets the mesh's data by the specified value. This can be used to work "
"around misaligned meshes without having to modify the source file."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຕຳແໜ່ງ (offset) ຂໍ້ມູນຂອງເມຊຕາມຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດ. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເມຊທີ່ບໍ່ກົງຕຳແໜ່ງໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

msgid ""
"Scales the mesh's data by the specified value. This can be used to work "
"around misscaled meshes without having to modify the source file."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຂະໜາດ (scale) ຂໍ້ມູນຂອງເມຊຕາມຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດ. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເມຊທີ່ຂະໜາດບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

msgid "Imports an Ogg Vorbis audio file for playback."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ສຽງ Ogg Vorbis ເພື່ອຫຼິ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Ogg Vorbis is a lossy audio format, with better audio quality compared to "
"[ResourceImporterMP3] at a given bitrate.\n"
"In most cases, it's recommended to use Ogg Vorbis over MP3. However, if "
"you're using an MP3 sound source with no higher quality source available, "
"then it's recommended to use the MP3 file directly to avoid double lossy "
"compression.\n"
"Ogg Vorbis requires more CPU to decode than [ResourceImporterWAV]. If you "
"need to play a lot of simultaneous sounds, it's recommended to use WAV for "
"those sounds instead, especially if targeting low-end devices."
msgstr ""
"Ogg Vorbis ເປັນຮູບແບບສຽງແບບສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດ (lossy), ເຊິ່ງມີຄຸນນະພາບສຽງດີກວ່າ "
"[ResourceImporterMP3] ໃນອັດຕາບິດ (bitrate) ທີ່ເທົ່າກັນ.\n"
"ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Ogg Vorbis ແທນ MP3. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ແຫຼ່ງສຽງ MP3 "
"ໂດຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມີຄຸນນະພາບສູງກວ່າ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ MP3 "
"ໂດຍກົງເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການບີບອັດແບບສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ.\n"
"Ogg Vorbis ໃຊ້ CPU ໃນການຖອດລະຫັດຫຼາຍກວ່າ [ResourceImporterWAV]. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຫຼິ້ນສຽງຫຼາຍໆຢ່າງພ້ອມກັນ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ WAV ສຳລັບສຽງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນແທນ, "
"ໂດຍສະເພາະຖ້າເນັ້ນໃສ່ອຸປະກອນສະເປັກຕ່ຳ."

msgid "Use [method AudioStreamOggVorbis.load_from_buffer] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method AudioStreamOggVorbis.load_from_buffer] ແທນ."

msgid "Use [method AudioStreamOggVorbis.load_from_file] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method AudioStreamOggVorbis.load_from_file] ແທນ."

msgid "Imports a glTF, FBX, COLLADA, or Blender 3D scene."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າສາກ 3D ແບບ glTF, FBX, COLLADA, ຫຼື Blender."

msgid ""
"See also [ResourceImporterOBJ], which is used for OBJ models that can be "
"imported as an independent [Mesh] or a scene.\n"
"Additional options (such as extracting individual meshes or materials to "
"files) are available in the [b]Advanced Import Settings[/b] dialog. This "
"dialog can be accessed by double-clicking a 3D scene in the FileSystem dock "
"or by selecting a 3D scene in the FileSystem dock, going to the Import dock "
"and choosing [b]Advanced[/b].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [ResourceImporterScene] is [i]not[/i] used for [PackedScene]s, "
"such as [code].tscn[/code] and [code].scn[/code] files."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງ [ResourceImporterOBJ] ນຳອີກ, ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂມເດລ OBJ ທີ່ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າເປັນ [Mesh] "
"ອິດສະຫຼະ ຫຼື ເປັນສາກ.\n"
"ຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມ (ເຊັ່ນການແຍກເມຊ ຫຼື ວັດສະດຸແຕ່ລະອັນອອກເປັນໄຟລ໌) ແມ່ນມີຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ [b]Advanced "
"Import Settings[/b]. ໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍການດັບເບິລຄລິກທີ່ສາກ 3D ໃນແຖບ "
"FileSystem ຫຼື ໂດຍການເລືອກສາກ 3D ໃນແຖບ FileSystem ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແຖບ Import ແລະ ເລືອກ "
"[b]Advanced[/b].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [ResourceImporterScene] [i]ບໍ່ໄດ້[/i] ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບ [PackedScene] "
"ເຊັ່ນໄຟລ໌ [code].tscn[/code] ແລະ [code].scn[/code]."

msgid ""
"Contains properties for the scene's subresources. This is an internal option "
"which is not visible in the Import dock."
msgstr ""
"ປະກອບມີຄຸນສົມບັດສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍ (subresources) ຂອງສາກ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກພາຍໃນເຊິ່ງຈະບໍ່ປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນແຖບ Import."

msgid ""
"The number of frames per second to use for baking animation curves to a "
"series of points with linear interpolation. It's recommended to configure "
"this value to match the value you're using as a baseline in your 3D modeling "
"software. Higher values result in more precise animation with fast movement "
"changes, at the cost of higher file sizes and memory usage. Thanks to "
"interpolation, there is usually not much benefit in going above 30 FPS (as "
"the animation will still appear smooth at higher rendering framerates)."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນເຟຣມຕໍ່ວິນາທີ (FPS) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການອົບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງແອນິເມຊັນ (animation curves) "
"ໃຫ້ເປັນຊຸດຂອງຈຸດທີ່ມີການແຊກຄ່າແບບເສັ້ນ (linear interpolation). "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ກົງກັບຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າຫຼັກໃນຊອບແວສ້າງໂມເດລ 3D ຂອງທ່ານ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ແອນິເມຊັນມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນເມື່ອມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງໄວ, "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນ. ຍ້ອນມີການແຊກຄ່າ (interpolation), "
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວການໃຊ້ເກີນ 30 FPS ຈະບໍ່ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍປານໃດ "
"(ເພາະແອນິເມຊັນຈະຍັງເບິ່ງຄືວ່າມື່ນໄຫຼດີໃນອັດຕາເຟຣມການເຣນເດີທີ່ສູງກວ່າ)."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], import animations from the 3D scene."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະນຳເຂົ້າແອນິເມຊັນຈາກສາກ 3D."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], adds an [Animation] named [code]RESET[/code], "
"containing the [method Skeleton3D.get_bone_rest] from [Skeleton3D] nodes. "
"This can be useful to extract an animation in the reference pose."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເພີ່ມ [Animation] ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [code]RESET[/code], ເຊິ່ງປະກອບມີ "
"[method Skeleton3D.get_bone_rest] ຈາກໂນດ [Skeleton3D]. "
"ອັນນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການແຍກແອນິເມຊັນໃນທ່າອ້າງອີງ (reference pose)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], remove animation tracks that only contain default "
"values. This can reduce output file size and memory usage with certain 3D "
"scenes, depending on the contents of their animation tracks."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະລົບແທຣັກແອນິເມຊັນທີ່ມີພຽງແຕ່ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ອັນນີ້ສາມາດຫຼຸດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ "
"ແລະ ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໃນບາງສາກ 3D, ຂຶ້ນກັບເນື້ອໃນຂອງແທຣັກແອນິເມຊັນນັ້ນໆ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], trim the beginning and end of animations if there are "
"no keyframe changes. This can reduce output file size and memory usage with "
"certain 3D scenes, depending on the contents of their animation tracks."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະຕັດຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງແອນິເມຊັນອອກ "
"ຖ້າຫາກບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຄີເຟຣມ. ອັນນີ້ສາມາດຫຼຸດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໃນບາງສາກ 3D."

msgid ""
"If the 3D model file contains only one mesh, this option has no effect. If "
"[code]true[/code] and the 3D model file contains multiple meshes with the "
"same surface names and formats, the surfaces will be merged together when the "
"meshes are merged. This is useful for reducing the number of surfaces in the "
"resulting mesh, and avoids duplicating materials. If [code]false[/code] and "
"the 3D model file contains multiple meshes, the surfaces will always be kept "
"separate."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໄຟລ໌ໂມເດລ 3D ມີເມຊພຽງອັນດຽວ, ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ. ຖ້າ [code]true[/code] ແລະ "
"ໄຟລ໌ມີຫຼາຍເມຊທີ່ມີຊື່ເຟຼດ (surface) ແລະ ຮູບແບບດຽວກັນ, ເຟຼດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັນເມື່ອເມຊຖືກລວມ. "
"ອັນນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຫຼຸດຈຳນວນເຟຼດໃນເມຊທີ່ໄດ້ມາ ແລະ ຫຼີກລ່ຽງການໃຊ້ວັດສະດຸຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ. ຖ້າ [code]false[/"
"code] ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ມີຫຼາຍເມຊ, ເຟຼດຈະຖືກແຍກອອກຈາກກັນສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Path to an import script, which can run code after the import process has "
"completed for custom processing. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/assets_pipeline/"
"importing_3d_scenes/import_configuration.html#using-import-scripts-for-"
"automation]Using import scripts for automation[/url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາສະຄຣິບນຳເຂົ້າ (import script), "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດສັ່ງໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າສຳເລັດເພື່ອການປະມວນຜົນແບບກຳນົດເອງ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/"
"import_configuration.html#using-import-scripts-for-"
"automation]ການໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບນຳເຂົ້າເພື່ອຄວາມອັດຕະໂນມັດ[/url] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Material extraction mode.\n"
"- [code]0 (Keep Internal)[/code], materials are not extracted.\n"
"- [code]1 (Extract Once)[/code], materials are extracted once and reused on "
"subsequent import.\n"
"- [code]2 (Extract and Overwrite)[/code], materials are extracted and "
"overwritten on every import."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການແຍກວັດສະດຸ (material extraction).\n"
"- [code]0 (Keep Internal)[/code], ຈະບໍ່ແຍກວັດສະດຸອອກມາ.\n"
"- [code]1 (Extract Once)[/code], ວັດສະດຸຈະຖືກແຍກອອກມາຄັ້ງດຽວ ແລະ "
"ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຄືນໃນການນຳເຂົ້າຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"
"- [code]2 (Extract and Overwrite)[/code], ວັດສະດຸຈະຖືກແຍກອອກມາ ແລະ "
"ຂຽນທັບທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ."

msgid ""
"Extracted material file format.\n"
"- [code]0 (Text)[/code], text file format ([code]*.tres[/code]).\n"
"- [code]1 (Binary)[/code], binary file format ([code]*.res[/code]).\n"
"- [code]2 (Material)[/code], binary file format ([code]*.material[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ວັດສະດຸທີ່ແຍກອອກມາ.\n"
"- [code]0 (Text)[/code], ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມ ([code]*.tres[/code]).\n"
"- [code]1 (Binary)[/code], ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ບີນາຣີ ([code]*.res[/code]).\n"
"- [code]2 (Material)[/code], ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ບີນາຣີ ([code]*.material[/code])."

msgid ""
"Path extracted materials are saved to. If empty, source scene path is used."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ວັດສະດຸທີ່ແຍກອອກມາຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້. ຖ້າຫວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະໃຊ້ເສັ້ນທາງດຽວກັນກັບສາກຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the mesh names will be set to the names of the nodes in "
"the 3D model file. If [code]false[/code], the mesh names will be set to the "
"names of the meshes in the 3D model file. Enabling this is a common work-"
"around when the author of the 3D model file did not properly set the mesh "
"names in Blender or other 3D modeling apps. For example, a file may have a "
"node named \"Turret\" with a mesh named \"Cube.002\", so enabling this option "
"will set the mesh name to \"Turret\" instead of \"Cube_002\"."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຊື່ຂອງເມຊຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຕາມຊື່ຂອງໂນດ (node) ໃນໄຟລ໌ໂມເດລ 3D. ຖ້າ "
"[code]false[/code], ຊື່ຂອງເມຊຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຕາມຊື່ຂອງເມຊໃນໄຟລ໌. "
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີແກ້ໄຂທົ່ວໄປເມື່ອຜູ້ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ 3D ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຊື່ເມຊໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນ Blender ຫຼື ແອັບ 3D "
"ອື່ນໆ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໄຟລ໌ອາດມີໂນດຊື່ວ່າ \"Turret\" ພ້ອມກັບເມຊຊື່ \"Cube.002\", "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນການເປີດຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະຕັ້ງຊື່ເມຊເປັນ \"Turret\" ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ \"Cube_002\"."

msgid ""
"Configures the meshes' [member GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] in the 3D scene. "
"If set to [b]Static Lightmaps[/b], sets the meshes' GI mode to Static and "
"generates UV2 on import for [LightmapGI] baking."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] ຂອງເມຊໃນສາກ 3D. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Static "
"Lightmaps[/b], ຈະຕັ້ງໂໝດ GI ຂອງເມຊເປັນ Static ແລະ ສ້າງ UV2 ໃນເວລານຳເຂົ້າສຳລັບການອົບ "
"[LightmapGI]."

msgid ""
"Controls the size of each texel on the baked lightmap. A smaller value "
"results in more precise lightmaps, at the cost of larger lightmap sizes and "
"longer bake times.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective if [member meshes/light_baking] is set to "
"[b]Static Lightmaps[/b]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະເທັກເຊລ (texel) ເທິງໄລທ໌ແມັບ (lightmap) ທີ່ອົບແລ້ວ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ໄລທ໌ແມັບມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບຂະໜາດໄລທ໌ແມັບທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ເວລາໃນການອົບທີ່ດົນຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີຜົນສະເພາະຖ້າ [member meshes/light_baking] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [b]Static "
"Lightmaps[/b]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [member nodes/root_scale] will be applied to the "
"descendant nodes, meshes, animations, bones, etc. This means that if you add "
"a child node later on within the imported scene, it won't be scaled. If "
"[code]false[/code], [member nodes/root_scale] will multiply the scale of the "
"root node instead."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], [member nodes/root_scale] ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບໂນດລູກຫຼານ, ເເມຊ, "
"ແອນິເມຊັນ, ກະດູກ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. ອັນນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຖ້າທ່ານເພີ່ມໂນດລູກໃນພາຍຫຼັງພາຍໃນສາກທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ, "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ. ຖ້າ [code]false[/code], [member nodes/root_scale] "
"ຈະໄປຄູນກັບຂະໜາດ (scale) ຂອງໂນດຮາກແທນ."

msgid ""
"Treat all nodes in the imported scene as if they are bones within a single "
"[Skeleton3D]. Can be used to guarantee that imported animations target "
"skeleton bones rather than nodes. May also be used to assign the [code]"
"\"Root\"[/code] bone in a [BoneMap]. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.html]Retargeting 3D Skeletons[/url] "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດການໂນດທັງໝົດໃນສາກທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າຄືກັບວ່າເປັນກະດູກພາຍໃນ [Skeleton3D] ດຽວ. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າແອນິເມຊັນທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າຈະເນັ້ນໃສ່ກະດູກໂຄງຮ່າງແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນໂນດ. "
"ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອມອບໝາຍກະດູກ [code]\"Root\"[/code] ໃນ [BoneMap]. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/retargeting_3d_skeletons.html]ການປ່ຽນເປົ້າໝາຍໂຄງຮ່າງ "
"3D[/url] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Override for the root node name. If empty, the root node will use what the "
"scene specifies, or the file name if the scene does not specify a root name."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຊື່ໂນດຮາກ (root node) ໃໝ່. ຖ້າຫວ່າງໄວ້, ໂນດຮາກຈະໃຊ້ຊື່ຕາມທີ່ສາກກຳນົດ ຫຼື "
"ໃຊ້ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຖ້າສາກບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຊື່ຮາກ."

msgid ""
"The uniform scale to use for the scene root. The default value of [code]1.0[/"
"code] will not perform any rescaling. See [member nodes/apply_root_scale] for "
"details of how this scale is applied."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດ (scale) ແບບຄົງທີ່ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບຮາກຂອງສາກ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໃດໆ. ເບິ່ງ [member nodes/apply_root_scale] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການນຳໃຊ້ຂະໜາດນີ້."

msgid ""
"If set to a valid script, attaches the script to the root node of the "
"imported scene. If the type of the root node is not compatible with the "
"script, the root node will be replaced with a type that is compatible with "
"the script. This setting can also be used on other non-mesh nodes in the "
"scene to attach scripts to them."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນສະຄຣິບທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້, ຈະຕິດສະຄຣິບນັ້ນເຂົ້າກັບໂນດຮາກຂອງສາກທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ. "
"ຖ້າປະເພດຂອງໂນດຮາກບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນກັບສະຄຣິບ, ໂນດຮາກຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແທນດ້ວຍປະເພດທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບສະຄຣິບ. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບໂນດອື່ນໆທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນເມຊໃນສາກເພື່ອຕິດສະຄຣິບໃສ່ພວກມັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Override for the root node type. If empty, the root node will use what the "
"scene specifies, or [Node3D] if the scene does not specify a root type. Using "
"a node type that inherits from [Node3D] is recommended. Otherwise, you'll "
"lose the ability to position the node directly in the 3D editor."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດປະເພດຂອງໂນດຮາກ (root node) ໃໝ່. ຖ້າຫວ່າງໄວ້, ໂນດຮາກຈະໃຊ້ປະເພດຕາມທີ່ສາກກຳນົດ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ "
"[Node3D] ຖ້າສາກບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ປະເພດໂນດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [Node3D]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ທ່ານຈະເສຍຄວາມສາມາດໃນການກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງໂນດໂດຍກົງໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 3D."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], will use suffixes in the names of imported objects such "
"as nodes and resources to determine types and properties, such as [code]-"
"noimp[/code] to skip import of a node or animation, [code]-alpha[/code] to "
"enable alpha transparency on a material, and [code]-vcol[/code] to enable "
"vertex colors on a material. Disabling this makes editor-imported files more "
"similar to the original files, and more similar to files imported at runtime. "
"See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/"
"node_type_customization.html]Node type customization using name suffixes[/"
"url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ຄຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍ (suffixes) ໃນຊື່ຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ ເຊັ່ນ ໂນດ ແລະ "
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນ ເພື່ອກຳນົດປະເພດ ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດ, ເຊັ່ນ [code]-noimp[/code] ເພື່ອຂ້າມການນຳເຂົ້າໂນດ "
"ຫຼື ແອນິເມຊັນ, [code]-alpha[/code] ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສອັລຟາເທິງວັດສະດຸ, ແລະ [code]-"
"vcol[/code] ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ vertex colors ເທິງວັດສະດຸ. ການປິດໃຊ້ງານນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າໃນ "
"editor ຄືກັນກັບໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/assets_pipeline/"
"importing_3d_scenes/"
"node_type_customization.html]ການກຳນົດປະເພດໂນດເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍຊື່[/url] "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], will use suffixes in the node names to determine the "
"node type, such as [code]-col[/code] for collision shapes. This is only used "
"when [member nodes/use_name_suffixes] is [code]true[/code]. Disabling this "
"makes editor-imported files more similar to the original files, and more "
"similar to files imported at runtime. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/node_type_customization.html]Node type "
"customization using name suffixes[/url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ຄຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍໃນຊື່ໂນດເພື່ອກຳນົດປະເພດໂນດ, ເຊັ່ນ [code]-col[/code] "
"ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງການຕຳ (collision shapes). ອັນນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member nodes/"
"use_name_suffixes] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. ການປິດໃຊ້ງານນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າໃນ "
"editor ຄືກັນກັບໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/assets_pipeline/"
"importing_3d_scenes/"
"node_type_customization.html]ການກຳນົດປະເພດໂນດເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍຊື່[/url] "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"If checked, use named [Skin]s for animation. The [MeshInstance3D] node "
"contains 3 properties of relevance here: a skeleton [NodePath] pointing to "
"the [Skeleton3D] node (usually [code]..[/code]), a mesh, and a skin:\n"
"- The [Skeleton3D] node contains a list of bones with names, their pose and "
"rest, a name, and a parent bone.\n"
"- The mesh is all of the raw vertex data needed to display a mesh. In terms "
"of the mesh, it knows how vertices are weight-painted and uses some internal "
"numbering often imported from 3D modeling software.\n"
"- The skin contains the information necessary to bind this mesh onto this "
"Skeleton3D. For each of the internal bone IDs chosen by the 3D modeling "
"software, it contains two things. Firstly, a matrix known as the Bind Pose "
"Matrix, Inverse Bind Matrix, or IBM for short. Secondly, the [Skin] contains "
"each bone's name (if [member skins/use_named_skins] is [code]true[/code]), or "
"the bone's index within the [Skeleton3D] list (if [member skins/"
"use_named_skins] is [code]false[/code]).\n"
"Together, this information is enough to tell Godot how to use the bone poses "
"in the [Skeleton3D] node to render the mesh from each [MeshInstance3D]. Note "
"that each [MeshInstance3D] may share binds, as is common in models exported "
"from Blender, or each [MeshInstance3D] may use a separate [Skin] object, as "
"is common in models exported from other tools such as Maya."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເລືອກ, ຈະໃຊ້ [Skin] ທີ່ມີຊື່ສຳລັບແອນິເມຊັນ. ໂນດ [MeshInstance3D] ປະກອບມີ 3 "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງທີ່ນີ້: ເສັ້ນທາງໂຄງຮ່າງ [NodePath] ທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາໂນດ [Skeleton3D] (ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ "
"[code]..[/code]), ເມຊ, ແລະ ສະກິນ (skin):\n"
"- ໂນດ [Skeleton3D] ປະກອບມີລາຍຊື່ຂອງກະດູກພ້ອມຊື່, ທ່າທາງ (pose) ແລະ ຈຸດພັກ (rest), ຊື່, "
"ແລະ ກະດູກພໍ່.\n"
"- ເມຊ ແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນ vertex ດິບທັງໝົດທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການສະແດງເມຊ. ໃນສ່ວນຂອງເມຊ, ມັນຈະຮູ້ວ່າແຕ່ລະ "
"vertex ຖືກລົງນ້ຳໜັກ (weight-painted) ແນວໃດ ແລະ "
"ໃຊ້ລະບົບໝາຍເລກພາຍໃນທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າຈາກຊອບແວສ້າງໂມເດລ 3D.\n"
"- ສະກິນ ປະກອບມີຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການຜູກ (bind) ເມຊນີ້ເຂົ້າກັບ Skeleton3D. ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ ID "
"ກະດູກພາຍໃນ, ມັນປະກອບມີສອງຢ່າງ. ຢ່າງທຳອິດແມ່ນ ມາຕຣິກສ໌ (matrix) ທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ Bind Pose Matrix "
"ຫຼື Inverse Bind Matrix (IBM). ຢ່າງທີສອງແມ່ນ [Skin] ຈະມີຊື່ຂອງກະດູກແຕ່ລະອັນ (ຖ້າ [member "
"skins/use_named_skins] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]), ຫຼື ດັດສະນີຂອງກະດູກພາຍໃນລາຍຊື່ "
"[Skeleton3D] (ຖ້າ [member skins/use_named_skins] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]).\n"
"ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດນີ້ພຽງພໍທີ່ຈະບອກ Godot ວ່າຈະໃຊ້ທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກໃນໂນດ [Skeleton3D] "
"ເພື່ອເຣນເດີເມຊຈາກແຕ່ລະ [MeshInstance3D] ແນວໃດ."

msgid "Imports native GLSL shaders (not Godot shaders) as an [RDShaderFile]."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າ GLSL shaders ແບບ native (ບໍ່ແມ່ນ Godot shaders) ເປັນ [RDShaderFile]."

msgid ""
"This imports native GLSL shaders as [RDShaderFile] resources, for use with "
"low-level [RenderingDevice] operations. This importer does [i]not[/i] handle "
"[code].gdshader[/code] files."
msgstr ""
"ອັນນີ້ຈະນຳເຂົ້າ native GLSL shaders ເປັນຊັບພະຍາກອນ [RDShaderFile], "
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບການດຳເນີນການ [RenderingDevice] ລະດັບຕ່ຳ. ຕົວນຳເຂົ້ານີ້ [i]ບໍ່ໄດ້[/i] ຈັດການໄຟລ໌ "
"[code].gdshader[/code]."

msgid ""
"Controls how color channels should be used in the imported texture.\n"
"[b]sRGB Friendly:[/b] Prevents the R and RG color formats from being used, as "
"they do not support nonlinear sRGB encoding.\n"
"[b]Optimized:[/b] Allows the RG color format to be used if the texture does "
"not use the blue channel. This reduces memory usage if the texture's blue "
"channel can be discarded (all pixels must have a blue value of [code]0[/"
"code])."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການໃຊ້ຊ່ອງສີ (color channels) ໃນເທັກເຈີທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ.\n"
"[b]sRGB Friendly:[/b] ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບສີ R ແລະ RG ເພາະພວກມັນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ "
"sRGB ແບບບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນ (nonlinear).\n"
"[b]Optimized:[/b] ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບສີ RG ໄດ້ຖ້າເທັກເຈີບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງສີຟ້າ. "
"ອັນນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຖ້າສາມາດຖິ້ມຊ່ອງສີຟ້າຂອງເທັກເຈີໄດ້ (ທຸກພິກເຊລຕ້ອງມີຄ່າສີຟ້າເປັນ [code]0[/"
"code])."

msgid ""
"Imports an SVG file as an automatically scalable texture for use in UI "
"elements and 2D rendering."
msgstr ""
"ນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ SVG ເປັນເທັກເຈີທີ່ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນອົງປະກອບ UI ແລະ "
"ການເຣນເດີ 2D."

msgid ""
"This importer imports [DPITexture] resources. See also "
"[ResourceImporterTexture] and [ResourceImporterImage]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວນຳເຂົ້ານີ້ນຳເຂົ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນ [DPITexture]. ເບິ່ງ [ResourceImporterTexture] ແລະ "
"[ResourceImporterImage] ນຳອີກ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], uses lossless compression for the SVG source."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ການບີບອັດແບບບໍ່ສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດ (lossless) ສຳລັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ SVG."

msgid "Imports an image for use in 2D or 3D rendering."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການເຣນເດີ 2D ຫຼື 3D."

msgid ""
"This importer imports [CompressedTexture2D] resources. If you need to process "
"the image in scripts in a more convenient way, use [ResourceImporterImage] "
"instead. See also [ResourceImporterLayeredTexture]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວນຳເຂົ້ານີ້ນຳເຂົ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນ [CompressedTexture2D]. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບໃນສະຄຣິບດ້ວຍວິທີທີ່ສະດວກກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [ResourceImporterImage] "
"ແທນ. ເບິ່ງ [ResourceImporterLayeredTexture] ນຳອີກ."

msgid ""
"When using a texture as normal map, only the red and green channels are "
"required. Given regular texture compression algorithms produce artifacts that "
"don't look that nice in normal maps, the RGTC compression format is the best "
"fit for this data. Forcing this option to Enable will make Godot import the "
"image as RGTC compressed. By default, it's set to Detect. This means that if "
"the texture is ever detected to be used as a normal map, it will be changed "
"to Enable and reimported automatically.\n"
"Note that RGTC compression affects the resulting normal map image. You will "
"have to adjust custom shaders that use the normal map's blue channel to take "
"this into account. Built-in material shaders already ignore the blue channel "
"in a normal map (regardless of the actual normal map's contents)."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີເປັນນໍມໍແມັບ (normal map), ຕ້ອງການພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ອງສີແດງ ແລະ ສີຂຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ຍ້ອນວ່າລະບົບການບີບອັດເທັກເຈີທົ່ວໄປມັກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຈຸດບົກພ່ອງທີ່ເບິ່ງບໍ່ສວຍງາມໃນນໍມໍແມັບ, ຮູບແບບການບີບອັດ "
"RGTC ຈຶ່ງເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນນີ້. ການບັງຄັບຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເປັນ Enable ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ Godot "
"ນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບດ້ວຍການບີບອັດ RGTC. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ມັນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ Detect. "
"ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຖ້າເທັກເຈີຖືກກວດພົບວ່າຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນນໍມໍແມັບ, ມັນຈະປ່ຽນເປັນ Enable ແລະ "
"ນຳເຂົ້າໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າການບີບອັດ RGTC ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຮູບພາບນໍມໍແມັບທີ່ໄດ້ມາ. "
"ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປັບແຕ່ງເຊດເດີທີ່ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງສີຟ້າຂອງນໍມໍແມັບໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ. "
"ເຊດເດີວັດສະດຸທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ໃນຕົວຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈຊ່ອງສີຟ້າໃນນໍມໍແມັບຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"This changes the [member compress/mode] option that is used when a texture is "
"detected as being used in 3D.\n"
"Changing this import option only has an effect if a texture is detected as "
"being used in 3D. Changing this to [b]Disabled[/b] then reimporting will not "
"change the existing compress mode on a texture (if it's detected to be used "
"in 3D), but choosing [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] or [b]Basis Universal[/b] will."
msgstr ""
"ອັນນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນຕົວເລືອກ [member compress/mode] ທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອເທັກເຈີຖືກກວດພົບວ່າຖືກໃຊ້ໃນ 3D.\n"
"ການປ່ຽນແປງຕົວເລືອກນີ້ນຳເຂົ້າຈະມີຜົນສະເພາະຖ້າເທັກເຈີຖືກກວດພົບວ່າໃຊ້ໃນ 3D. ການປ່ຽນເປັນ "
"[b]Disabled[/b] ແລ້ວນຳເຂົ້າໃໝ່ຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນໂໝດການບີບອັດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນເທັກເຈີ, ແຕ່ການເລືອກ [b]VRAM "
"Compressed[/b] ຫຼື [b]Basis Universal[/b] ຈະປ່ຽນມັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], converts the imported image's colors to match [member "
"EditorSettings.interface/theme/icon_and_font_color]. This assumes the image "
"uses the exact same colors as [url=$DOCS_URL/engine_details/editor/"
"creating_icons.html]Godot's own color palette for editor icons[/url], with "
"the source file designed for a dark editor theme. This should be enabled for "
"editor plugin icons and custom class icons, but should be left disabled "
"otherwise.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only available for SVG images."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະແປງສີຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າໃຫ້ກົງກັບ [member "
"EditorSettings.interface/theme/icon_and_font_color]. ນີ້ສົມມຸດວ່າຮູບພາບໃຊ້ສີດຽວກັນກັບ "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/engine_details/editor/creating_icons.html]ພາເລັດສີຂອງ Godot "
"ສຳລັບໄອຄອນ editor[/url], ເຊິ່ງໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບຖືກອອກແບບມາສຳລັບຮູບແບບ editor ແບບມືດ. "
"ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ສຳລັບໄອຄອນປລັກອິນ ແລະ ໄອຄອນຄລາສທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບຮູບພາບ SVG."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], scales the imported image to match [member "
"EditorSettings.interface/editor/appearance/custom_display_scale]. This should "
"be enabled for editor plugin icons and custom class icons, but should be left "
"disabled otherwise.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only available for SVG images."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະປັບຂະໜາດຮູບພາບທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າໃຫ້ກົງກັບ [member "
"EditorSettings.interface/editor/appearance/custom_display_scale]. "
"ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ສຳລັບໄອຄອນປລັກອິນ ແລະ ໄອຄອນຄລາສທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບຮູບພາບ SVG."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], smaller versions of the texture are generated on "
"import. For example, a 64×64 texture will generate 6 mipmaps (32×32, 16×16, "
"8×8, 4×4, 2×2, 1×1). This has several benefits:\n"
"- Textures will not become grainy in the distance (in 3D), or if scaled down "
"due to [Camera2D] zoom or [CanvasItem] scale (in 2D).\n"
"- Performance will improve if the texture is displayed in the distance, since "
"sampling smaller versions of the original texture is faster and requires less "
"memory bandwidth.\n"
"The downside of mipmaps is that they increase memory usage by roughly 33%.\n"
"It's recommended to enable mipmaps in 3D. However, in 2D, this should only be "
"enabled if your project visibly benefits from having mipmaps enabled. If the "
"camera never zooms out significantly, there won't be a benefit to enabling "
"mipmaps but memory usage will increase."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ເທັກເຈີເວີຊັນທີ່ນ້ອຍລົງຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນເວລານຳເຂົ້າ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເທັກເຈີ 64×64 "
"ຈະສ້າງ mipmaps 6 ລະດັບ (32×32, 16×16, 8×8, 4×4, 2×2, 1×1). ອັນນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍຢ່າງ:\n"
"- ເທັກເຈີຈະບໍ່ແຕກເປັນເມັດໃນໄລຍະໄກ (ໃນ 3D), ຫຼື ຖ້າຖືກປັບຂະໜາດລົງຍ້ອນການຊູມຂອງ [Camera2D] ຫຼື "
"ການສະເກລຂອງ [CanvasItem] (ໃນ 2D).\n"
"- ປະສິດທິພາບຈະດີຂຶ້ນຖ້າເທັກເຈີຖືກສະແດງໃນໄລຍະໄກ, "
"ເພາະວ່າການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຈາກເທັກເຈີເວີຊັນທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າຈະໄວກວ່າ ແລະ ໃຊ້ແບນວິດໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳນ້ອຍກວ່າ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ເສຍຂອງ mipmaps ແມ່ນພວກມັນເພີ່ມການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳປະມານ 33%.\n"
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ mipmaps ໃນ 3D. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃນ 2D, "
"ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ສະເພາະຖ້າໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບປະໂຫຍດຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. ຖ້າກ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບບໍ່ເຄີຍຊູມອອກຫຼາຍ, "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການເປີດໃຊ້ mipmaps ແຕ່ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Specifies the data source of the output image's alpha channel.\n"
"[b]Red:[/b] Use the values from the source image's red channel.\n"
"[b]Green:[/b] Use the values from the source image's green channel.\n"
"[b]Blue:[/b] Use the values from the source image's blue channel.\n"
"[b]Alpha:[/b] Use the values from the source image's alpha channel.\n"
"[b]Red Inverted:[/b] Use inverted values from the source image's red channel "
"([code]1.0 - R[/code]).\n"
"[b]Green Inverted:[/b] Use inverted values from the source image's green "
"channel ([code]1.0 - G[/code]).\n"
"[b]Blue Inverted:[/b] Use inverted values from the source image's blue "
"channel ([code]1.0 - B[/code]).\n"
"[b]Alpha Inverted:[/b] Use inverted values from the source image's alpha "
"channel ([code]1.0 - A[/code]).\n"
"[b]Unused:[/b] Set the color channel's value to the default ([code]1.0[/code] "
"for alpha, [code]0.0[/code] for red, green or blue).\n"
"[b]Zero:[/b] Set the color channel's value to [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]One:[/b] Set the color channel's value to [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຊ່ອງສີອັລຟາ (alpha channel) ຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ.\n"
"[b]Red:[/b] ໃຊ້ຄ່າຈາກຊ່ອງສີແດງຂອງຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"
"[b]Green:[/b] ໃຊ້ຄ່າຈາກຊ່ອງສີຂຽວຂອງຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"
"[b]Blue:[/b] ໃຊ້ຄ່າຈາກຊ່ອງສີຟ້າຂອງຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"
"[b]Alpha:[/b] ໃຊ້ຄ່າຈາກຊ່ອງສີອັລຟາຂອງຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"
"[b]Red Inverted:[/b] ໃຊ້ຄ່າປີ້ນກັບຈາກຊ່ອງສີແດງ ([code]1.0 - R[/code]).\n"
"[b]Green Inverted:[/b] ໃຊ້ຄ່າປີ້ນກັບຈາກຊ່ອງສີຂຽວ ([code]1.0 - G[/code]).\n"
"[b]Blue Inverted:[/b] ໃຊ້ຄ່າປີ້ນກັບຈາກຊ່ອງສີຟ້າ ([code]1.0 - B[/code]).\n"
"[b]Alpha Inverted:[/b] ໃຊ້ຄ່າປີ້ນກັບຈາກຊ່ອງສີອັລຟາ ([code]1.0 - A[/code]).\n"
"[b]Unused:[/b] ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ອງສີເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ([code]1.0[/code] ສຳລັບອັລຟາ, [code]0.0[/"
"code] ສຳລັບສີອື່ນ).\n"
"[b]Zero:[/b] ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ອງສີເປັນ [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]One:[/b] ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ອງສີເປັນ [code]1.0[/code]."

