msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], puts pixels of the same surrounding color in transition "
"from transparent to opaque areas. For textures displayed with bilinear "
"filtering, this helps to reduce the outline effect when exporting images from "
"an image editor.\n"
"It's recommended to leave this enabled (as it is by default), unless this "
"causes issues for a particular image."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະໃສ່ພິກເຊລທີ່ມີສີອ້ອມຂ້າງຄືກັນໃນຊ່ວງປ່ຽນຜ່ານຈາກພື້ນທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສໄປຫາພື້ນທີ່ທຶບແສງ. ສຳລັບເທັກເຈີທີ່ສະແດງດ້ວຍ "
"bilinear filtering, ອັນນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜົນກະທົບເສັ້ນຂອບ (outline) "
"ເມື່ອນຳຮູບພາບອອກຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂຮູບພາບ.\n"
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານນີ້ໄວ້ (ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ນອກຈາກວ່າມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາກັບຮູບພາບໃດໜຶ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Some HDR images you can find online may be broken and contain data that is "
"encoded using the nonlinear sRGB transfer function (instead of using linear "
"encoding). It is advised not to use those files. If you absolutely have to, "
"enabling [member process/hdr_as_srgb] will make them look correct.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Enabling [member process/hdr_as_srgb] on well-formatted HDR "
"images will cause the resulting image to look too dark, so leave this on "
"[code]false[/code] if unsure."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບພາບ HDR ບາງອັນທີ່ທ່ານພົບທາງອອນລາຍອາດຈະເພ (broken) ແລະ ມີຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດໂດຍໃຊ້ sRGB "
"transfer function ແບບບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນ (ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບເສັ້ນ). "
"ແນະນຳວ່າບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ແທ້ໆ, ການເປີດໃຊ້ [member process/"
"hdr_as_srgb] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນເບິ່ງຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ການເປີດໃຊ້ [member process/hdr_as_srgb] ກັບຮູບພາບ HDR "
"ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບພາບເບິ່ງມືດເກີນໄປ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ແນ່ໃຈ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], clamps exposure in the imported high dynamic range "
"images using a smart clamping formula (without introducing [i]visible[/i] "
"clipping).\n"
"Some HDR panorama images you can find online may contain extremely bright "
"pixels, due to being taken from real life sources without any clipping.\n"
"While these HDR panorama images are accurate to real life, this can cause the "
"radiance map generated by Godot to contain sparkles when used as a background "
"sky. This can be seen in material reflections (even on rough materials in "
"extreme cases). Enabling [member process/hdr_clamp_exposure] can resolve this."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະຈຳກັດລະດັບແສງ (exposure) ໃນຮູບພາບ high dynamic range "
"ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດການຈຳກັດແບບອັດສະລິຍະ (ໂດຍບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນການຕັດສີທີ່ຊັດເຈນ).\n"
"ຮູບພາບພາໂນຣາມາ HDR ບາງອັນອາດມີພິກເຊລທີ່ສະຫວ່າງຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຮູບພາບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຄວາມເປັນຈິງ, ແຕ່ມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ radiance map ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ "
"Godot ມີຈຸດແສງ (sparkles) ເມື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນທ້ອງຟ້າພື້ນຫຼັງ. ສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ໃນການສະທ້ອນຂອງວັດສະດຸ. "
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ [member process/hdr_clamp_exposure] ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The same result can be achieved by setting [member process/channel_remap/"
"green] to [code]Green Inverted[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຜົນລັບດຽວກັນສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງ [member process/channel_remap/green] ເປັນ "
"[code]Green Inverted[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], convert the normal map from Y- (DirectX-style) to Y+ "
"(OpenGL-style) by inverting its green color channel. This is the normal map "
"convention expected by Godot.\n"
"More information about normal maps (including a coordinate order table for "
"popular engines) can be found [url=http://wiki.polycount.com/wiki/"
"Normal_Map_Technical_Details]here[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະແປງນໍມໍແມັບຈາກ Y- (ແບບ DirectX) ເປັນ Y+ (ແບບ OpenGL) "
"ໂດຍການປີ້ນຊ່ອງສີຂຽວ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຮູບແບບນໍມໍແມັບທີ່ Godot ຕ້ອງການ.\n"
"ສາມາດເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບນໍມໍແມັບໄດ້ທີ່ [url=http://wiki.polycount.com/wiki/"
"Normal_Map_Technical_Details]ບ່ອນນີ້[/url]."

msgid ""
"An alternative to fixing darkened borders with [member process/"
"fix_alpha_border] is to use premultiplied alpha. By enabling this option, the "
"texture will be converted to this format. A premultiplied alpha texture "
"requires specific materials to be displayed correctly:\n"
"- In 2D, a [CanvasItemMaterial] will need to be created and configured to use "
"the [constant CanvasItemMaterial.BLEND_MODE_PREMULT_ALPHA] blend mode on "
"[CanvasItem]s that use this texture. In custom [code]canvas_item[/code] "
"shaders, [code]render_mode blend_premul_alpha;[/code] should be used.\n"
"- In 3D, a [BaseMaterial3D] will need to be created and configured to use the "
"[constant BaseMaterial3D.BLEND_MODE_PREMULT_ALPHA] blend mode on materials "
"that use this texture. In custom [code]spatial[/code] shaders, "
"[code]render_mode blend_premul_alpha;[/code] should be used."
msgstr ""
"ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງໃນການແກ້ໄຂຂອບທີ່ມືດດ້ວຍ [member process/fix_alpha_border] ແມ່ນການໃຊ້ "
"premultiplied alpha. ໂດຍການເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ເທັກເຈີຈະຖືກແປງເປັນຮູບແບບນີ້. ເທັກເຈີແບບ "
"premultiplied alpha ຕ້ອງການວັດສະດຸສະເພາະເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ:\n"
"- ໃນ 2D, ຈະຕ້ອງສ້າງ [CanvasItemMaterial] ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂໝດ [constant "
"CanvasItemMaterial.BLEND_MODE_PREMULT_ALPHA]. ໃນເຊດເດີ [code]canvas_item[/"
"code] ແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ຄວນໃຊ້ [code]render_mode blend_premul_alpha;[/code].\n"
"- ໃນ 3D, ຈະຕ້ອງສ້າງ [BaseMaterial3D] ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂໝດ [constant "
"BaseMaterial3D.BLEND_MODE_PREMULT_ALPHA]. ໃນເຊດເດີ [code]spatial[/code] "
"ແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ຄວນໃຊ້ [code]render_mode blend_premul_alpha;[/code]."

msgid ""
"If set to a value greater than [code]0[/code], the size of the texture is "
"limited on import to a value smaller than or equal to the value specified "
"here. For non-square textures, the size limit affects the longer dimension, "
"with the shorter dimension scaled to preserve aspect ratio. Resizing is "
"performed using cubic interpolation.\n"
"This can be used to reduce memory usage without affecting the source images, "
"or avoid issues with textures not displaying on mobile/web platforms (as "
"these usually can't display textures larger than 4096×4096).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Even if this is set to [code]0[/code], import size is limited to "
"the following dimensions for technical reasons. Depending on [member compress/"
"mode], textures will be downsampled on import if necessary:\n"
"- [b]Lossy:[/b] 16383 pixels width or height, whichever is larger;\n"
"- [b]Basis Universal:[/b] 16384 pixels width or height, whichever is larger;\n"
"- [b]All other modes:[/b] 32768 pixels width or height, whichever is larger."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0[/code], ຂະໜາດຂອງເທັກເຈີຈະຖືກຈຳກັດຕອນນຳເຂົ້າໃຫ້ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື "
"ເທົ່າກັບຄ່າທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ທີ່ນີ້. ສຳລັບເທັກເຈີທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກຈັດ, ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂະໜາດຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ດ້ານທີ່ຍາວກວ່າ, "
"ໂດຍດ້ານທີ່ສັ້ນກວ່າຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດເພື່ອຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນ (aspect ratio). ການປັບຂະໜາດຈະໃຊ້ cubic "
"interpolation.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ຫຼື "
"ຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫາເທັກເຈີບໍ່ສະແດງຜົນໃນແພລັດຟອມມືຖື/ເວັບ "
"(ເນື່ອງຈາກແພລັດຟອມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມັກຈະບໍ່ສາມາດສະແດງເທັກເຈີທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ 4096×4096 ໄດ້).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/code], "
"ຂະໜາດການນຳເຂົ້າກໍຍັງຖືກຈຳກັດຢູ່ທີ່ຂະໜາດດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຍ້ອນເຫດຜົນທາງເຕັກນິກ. ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບ [member compress/"
"mode], ເທັກເຈີຈະຖືກ downsampled ຕອນນຳເຂົ້າຫາກຈຳເປັນ:\n"
"- [b]Lossy:[/b] ຄວາມກວ້າງ ຫຼື ຄວາມສູງ 16383 ພິກເຊວ, ແລ້ວແຕ່ດ້ານໃດຈະໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ;\n"
"- [b]Basis Universal:[/b] ຄວາມກວ້າງ ຫຼື ຄວາມສູງ 16384 ພິກເຊວ, ແລ້ວແຕ່ດ້ານໃດຈະໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ;\n"
"- [b]ໂໝດອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ:[/b] ຄວາມກວ້າງ ຫຼື ຄວາມສູງ 32768 ພິກເຊວ, ແລ້ວແຕ່ດ້ານໃດຈະໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"The color channel to consider as a roughness map in this texture. Only "
"effective if [member roughness/src_normal] is not empty."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງສີທີ່ຈະພິຈາລະນາເປັນຣັຟເນສແມັບ (roughness map) ໃນເທັກເຈີນີ້. ມີຜົນສະເພາະຖ້າ [member "
"roughness/src_normal] ບໍ່ຫວ່າງ."

msgid ""
"The path to the texture to consider as a normal map for roughness filtering "
"on import. Specifying this can help decrease specular aliasing slightly in "
"3D.\n"
"Roughness filtering on import is only used in 3D rendering, not 2D."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາເທັກເຈີທີ່ຈະພິຈາລະນາເປັນນໍມໍແມັບສຳລັບການກັ່ນຕອງຣັຟເນສ (roughness filtering) "
"ໃນເວລານຳເຂົ້າ. ການລະບຸນີ້ນຳສາມາດຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດ specular aliasing ໄດ້ເລັກນ້ອຍໃນ 3D.\n"
"ການກັ່ນຕອງຣັຟເນສໃນເວລານຳເຂົ້າຈະໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບການເຣນເດີ 3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ໃຊ້ໃນ 2D."

msgid ""
"The scale the SVG should be rendered at, with [code]1.0[/code] being the "
"original design size. Higher values result in a larger image. Note that "
"unlike font oversampling, this affects the size the SVG is rendered at in 2D. "
"See also [member editor/scale_with_editor_scale].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only available for SVG images."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດ (scale) ທີ່ SVG ຄວນຈະຖືກເຣນເດີ, ໂດຍທີ່ [code]1.0[/code] ແມ່ນຂະໜາດອອກແບບຕົ້ນສະບັບ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ຮູບພາບໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [member editor/scale_with_editor_scale] ນຳອີກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບຮູບພາບ SVG."

msgid ""
"Imports a collection of textures from a PNG image into an optimized "
"[AtlasTexture] for 2D rendering."
msgstr ""
"ນຳເຂົ້າກຸ່ມຂອງເທັກເຈີຈາກຮູບພາບ PNG ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ [AtlasTexture] ທີ່ຖືກປັບໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບການເຣນເດີ "
"2D."

msgid ""
"This imports a collection of textures from a PNG image into an [AtlasTexture] "
"or 2D [ArrayMesh]. This can be used to save memory when importing 2D "
"animations from spritesheets. Texture atlases are only supported in 2D "
"rendering, not 3D. See also [ResourceImporterTexture] and "
"[ResourceImporterLayeredTexture].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [ResourceImporterTextureAtlas] does not handle importing "
"[TileSetAtlasSource], which is created using the [TileSet] editor instead."
msgstr ""
"ອັນນີ້ຈະນຳເຂົ້າກຸ່ມຂອງເທັກເຈີຈາກຮູບພາບ PNG ເປັນ [AtlasTexture] ຫຼື 2D [ArrayMesh]. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປະຢັດໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າແອນິເມຊັນ 2D ຈາກ spritesheets. Texture atlases "
"ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນການເຣນເດີ 2D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [ResourceImporterTexture] ແລະ "
"[ResourceImporterLayeredTexture] ນຳອີກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [ResourceImporterTextureAtlas] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັດການການນຳເຂົ້າ "
"[TileSetAtlasSource], ເຊິ່ງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ TileSet editor ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Path to the atlas spritesheet. This [i]must[/i] be set to valid path to a PNG "
"image. Otherwise, the atlas will fail to import."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ atlas spritesheet. ອັນນີ້ [i]ຕ້ອງ[/i] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໄປຫາຮູບພາບ "
"PNG. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ແອັດລັສ (atlas) ຈະນຳເຂົ້າບໍ່ສຳເລັດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], discards empty areas from the atlas. This only affects "
"final sprite positioning, not storage. See also [member "
"trim_alpha_border_from_region].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective if [member import_mode] is [b]Region[/b]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະຖິ້ມພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງອອກຈາກແອັດລັສ. "
"ອັນນີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບການກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງສະໄປຣທ໌ (sprite) ສຸດທ້າຍ, ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບການຈັດເກັບ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"trim_alpha_border_from_region] ນຳອີກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີຜົນສະເພາະຖ້າ [member import_mode] ແມ່ນ [b]Region[/b]."

msgid ""
"[b]Region:[/b] Imports the atlas in an [AtlasTexture] resource, which is "
"rendered as a rectangle. This is fast to render, but transparent areas still "
"have to be rendered if they can't be trimmed effectively by [member "
"trim_alpha_border_from_region]. This can reduce performance when rendering "
"large sprites on screen.\n"
"[b]Mesh:[/b] Imports the atlas as an [ArrayMesh] resource, keeping the "
"original bitmap visible (but rendered as a polygon). This can be used to "
"reduce fill rate when rendering large transparent sprites, at the cost of "
"slower rendering if there are little to no transparent areas in the sprite."
msgstr ""
"[b]Region:[/b] ນຳເຂົ້າແອັດລັສເປັນຊັບພະຍາກອນ [AtlasTexture], ເຊິ່ງຖືກເຣນເດີເປັນຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມ. "
"ອັນນີ້ເຣນເດີໄດ້ໄວ, ແຕ່ພື້ນທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສຍັງຕ້ອງຖືກເຣນເດີຢູ່. "
"ອັນນີ້ອາດຫຼຸດປະສິດທິພາບລົງເມື່ອເຣນເດີສະໄປຣທ໌ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່.\n"
"[b]Mesh:[/b] ນຳເຂົ້າແອັດລັສເປັນຊັບພະຍາກອນ [ArrayMesh], ເຊິ່ງເຣນເດີເປັນຮູບຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມ "
"(polygon). ອັນນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫຼຸດ fill rate ເມື່ອເຣນເດີສະໄປຣທ໌ໂປ່ງໃສຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, "
"ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຣນເດີຊ້າລົງຖ້າສະໄປຣທ໌ບໍ່ມີພື້ນທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], trims the region to exclude fully transparent pixels "
"using a clipping rectangle (which is never rotated). This can be used to save "
"memory. See also [member crop_to_region].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective if [member import_mode] is [b]Region[/b]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະຕັດພື້ນທີ່ອອກເພື່ອບໍ່ລວມເອົາພິກເຊລທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສທັງໝົດໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຕັດ "
"(ເຊິ່ງຈະບໍ່ຖືກໝຸນ). ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປະຢັດໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [member crop_to_region] ນຳອີກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີຜົນສະເພາະຖ້າ [member import_mode] ແມ່ນ [b]Region[/b]."

msgid "Imports a WAV audio file for playback."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ສຽງ WAV ເພື່ອຫຼິ້ນ."

msgid ""
"WAV is an uncompressed format, which can provide higher quality compared to "
"Ogg Vorbis and MP3. It also has the lowest CPU cost to decode. This means "
"high numbers of WAV sounds can be played at the same time, even on low-end "
"devices.\n"
"By default, Godot imports WAV files using the lossy Quite OK Audio "
"compression. You may change this by setting the [member compress/mode] "
"property."
msgstr ""
"WAV ເປັນຮູບແບບທີ່ບໍ່ມີການບີບອັດ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບສູງກວ່າເມື່ອທຽບກັບ Ogg Vorbis ແລະ MP3. "
"ມັນຍັງໃຊ້ CPU ຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດໃນການຖອດລະຫັດ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າສາມາດຫຼິ້ນສຽງ WAV ພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ.\n"
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Godot ຈະນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ WAV ໂດຍໃຊ້ການບີບອັດແບບ Quite OK Audio. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member compress/mode]."

msgid ""
"The compression mode to use on import.\n"
"- [b]PCM (Uncompressed):[/b] Imports audio data without any form of "
"compression, preserving the highest possible quality. It has the lowest CPU "
"cost, but the highest memory usage.\n"
"- [b]IMA ADPCM:[/b] Applies fast, lossy compression during import, noticeably "
"decreasing the quality, but with low CPU cost and memory usage. Does not "
"support seeking and only Forward loop mode is supported.\n"
"- [b][url=https://qoaformat.org/]Quite OK Audio[/url]:[/b] Also applies lossy "
"compression on import, having a slightly higher CPU cost compared to IMA "
"ADPCM, but much higher quality and the lowest memory usage."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການບີບອັດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນເວລານຳເຂົ້າ.\n"
"- [b]PCM (Uncompressed):[/b] ນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນສຽງໂດຍບໍ່ມີການບີບອັດ, ຮັກສາຄຸນນະພາບສູງສຸດ. ໃຊ້ CPU "
"ຕ່ຳສຸດ ແຕ່ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສູງສຸດ.\n"
"- [b]IMA ADPCM:[/b] ໃຊ້ການບີບອັດແບບສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ໄວ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບຫຼຸດລົງຢ່າງເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດ, "
"ແຕ່ໃຊ້ CPU ແລະ ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຕ່ຳ. ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການ seeking ແລະ ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໂໝດ Forward loop "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"- [b][url=https://qoaformat.org/]Quite OK Audio[/url]:[/b] "
"ໃຊ້ການບີບອັດແບບສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດ, ໃຊ້ CPU ສູງກວ່າ IMA ADPCM ເລັກນ້ອຍ, ແຕ່ມີຄຸນນະພາບສູງກວ່າຫຼາຍ "
"ແລະ ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"The begin loop point to use when [member edit/loop_mode] is [b]Forward[/b], "
"[b]Ping-Pong[/b], or [b]Backward[/b]. This is set in samples after the "
"beginning of the audio file."
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການວົນຊ້ຳ (loop begin) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [member edit/loop_mode] ເປັນ [b]Forward[/"
"b], [b]Ping-Pong[/b], ຫຼື [b]Backward[/b]. ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນຈຳນວນແຊມເປິນ (samples) "
"ຫຼັງຈາກຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໄຟລ໌ສຽງ."

msgid ""
"The end loop point to use when [member edit/loop_mode] is [b]Forward[/b], "
"[b]Ping-Pong[/b], or [b]Backward[/b]. This is set in samples after the "
"beginning of the audio file. A value of [code]-1[/code] uses the end of the "
"audio file as the end loop point."
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດການວົນຊ້ຳ (loop end) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [member edit/loop_mode] ເປັນ [b]Forward[/b], "
"[b]Ping-Pong[/b], ຫຼື [b]Backward[/b]. ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນຈຳນວນແຊມເປິນ (samples) "
"ຫຼັງຈາກຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໄຟລ໌ສຽງ. ຄ່າ [code]-1[/code] ຈະໃຊ້ຕອນທ້າຍຂອງໄຟລ໌ສຽງເປັນຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Controls how audio should loop.\n"
"- [b]Detect From WAV:[/b] Uses loop information from the WAV metadata.\n"
"- [b]Disabled:[/b] Don't loop audio, even if the metadata indicates the file "
"playback should loop.\n"
"- [b]Forward:[/b] Standard audio looping. Plays the audio forward from the "
"beginning to [member edit/loop_end], then returns to [member edit/loop_begin] "
"and repeats.\n"
"- [b]Ping-Pong:[/b] Plays the audio forward until [member edit/loop_end], "
"then backwards to [member edit/loop_begin], repeating this cycle.\n"
"- [b]Backward:[/b] Plays the audio backwards from [member edit/loop_end] to "
"[member edit/loop_begin], then repeats.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [AudioStreamPlayer], the [signal AudioStreamPlayer.finished] "
"signal won't be emitted for looping audio when it reaches the end of the "
"audio file, as the audio will keep playing indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການວົນຊ້ຳຂອງສຽງ.\n"
"- [b]Detect From WAV:[/b] ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນການວົນຊ້ຳຈາກເມຕາດາຕາ (metadata) ຂອງ WAV.\n"
"- [b]Disabled:[/b] ບໍ່ວົນຊ້ຳສຽງ.\n"
"- [b]Forward:[/b] ການວົນຊ້ຳສຽງແບບມາດຕະຖານ. ຫຼິ້ນສຽງໄປທາງໜ້າຈົນຮອດ [member edit/"
"loop_end], ແລ້ວກັບໄປທີ່ [member edit/loop_begin] ແລະ ເລີ່ມໃໝ່.\n"
"- [b]Ping-Pong:[/b] ຫຼິ້ນສຽງໄປທາງໜ້າຈົນຮອດ [member edit/loop_end], ແລ້ວຫຼິ້ນຖອຍຫຼັງກັບມາທີ່ "
"[member edit/loop_begin], ແລະ ເຮັດຊ້ຳຮອບວຽນນີ້.\n"
"- [b]Backward:[/b] ຫຼິ້ນສຽງຖອຍຫຼັງຈາກ [member edit/loop_end] ໄປຫາ [member edit/"
"loop_begin], ແລ້ວເຮັດຊ້ຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ [AudioStreamPlayer], ສັນຍານ [signal "
"AudioStreamPlayer.finished] ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກສຳລັບສຽງທີ່ວົນຊ້ຳ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], normalize the audio volume so that its peak volume is "
"equal to 0 dB. When enabled, normalization will make audio sound louder "
"depending on its original peak volume."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະປັບລະດັບສຽງໃຫ້ເປັນປົກກະຕິ (normalize) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະດັບສຽງສູງສຸດເທົ່າກັບ "
"0 dB. ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້, ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງດັງຂຶ້ນຂຶ້ນກັບລະດັບສຽງສູງສຸດເດີມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically trim the beginning and end of the audio "
"if it's lower than -50 dB after normalization (see [member edit/normalize]). "
"This prevents having files with silence at the beginning or end, which "
"increases their size unnecessarily and adds latency to the moment they are "
"played back. A fade-in/fade-out period of 500 samples is also used during "
"trimming to avoid audible pops."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະຕັດຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງສຽງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຖ້າມັນເບົາກວ່າ -50 "
"dB ຫຼັງຈາກການປັບປົກກະຕິ. ອັນນີ້ຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຄວາມງຽບຢູ່ຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫຼື ຕອນທ້າຍ "
"ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄວາມຊ້າ (latency) ໃນເວລາຫຼິ້ນ. ຍັງມີການໃຊ້ຊ່ວງ "
"fade-in/fade-out 500 samples ໃນເວລາຕັດເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງສຽງດີດ (pops)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], forces the imported audio to use 8-bit quantization if "
"the source file is 16-bit or higher.\n"
"Enabling this is generally not recommended, as 8-bit quantization decreases "
"audio quality significantly. If you need smaller file sizes, consider using "
"Ogg Vorbis or MP3 audio instead."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ສຽງທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າໃຊ້ການຄວນໄທເຊຊັນ (quantization) ແບບ 8-"
"bit ຖ້າໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບເປັນ 16-bit ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າ.\n"
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານນີ້, ເພາະການຄວນໄທເຊຊັນແບບ 8-bit "
"ຈະຫຼຸດຄຸນນະພາບສຽງລົງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ນ້ອຍລົງ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ສຽງ Ogg "
"Vorbis ຫຼື MP3 ແທນ."

msgid ""
"If set to a value greater than [code]0[/code], forces the audio's sample rate "
"to be reduced to a value lower than or equal to the value specified in "
"[member force/max_rate_hz].\n"
"This can decrease file size noticeably on certain sounds, without impacting "
"quality depending on the actual sound's contents. See [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_audio_samples.html#doc-importing-audio-"
"samples-best-practices]Best practices[/url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0[/code], ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ອັດຕາແຊມເປິນ (sample rate) "
"ຂອງສຽງຖືກຫຼຸດລົງໃຫ້ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບຄ່າທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ [member force/max_rate_hz].\n"
"ອັນນີ້ສາມາດຫຼຸດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນໃນບາງສຽງ ໂດຍບໍ່ກະທົບຄຸນນະພາບຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_audio_samples.html#doc-"
"importing-audio-samples-best-practices]ແນວທາງປະຕິບັດທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ[/url] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The frequency to limit the imported audio sample to (in Hz). Only effective "
"if [member force/max_rate] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ຈະຈຳກັດຕົວຢ່າງສຽງທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ (ເປັນ Hz). ມີຜົນສະເພາະຖ້າ [member force/max_rate] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], forces the imported audio to be mono if the source file "
"is stereo. This decreases the file size by 50% by merging the two channels "
"into one."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ສຽງທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າເປັນແບບໂມໂນ (mono) "
"ຖ້າໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບເປັນສະເຕຣິໂອ (stereo). ອັນນີ້ຈະຫຼຸດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ລົງ 50% "
"ໂດຍການລວມສອງຊ່ອງສຽງເຂົ້າເປັນອັນດຽວ."

msgid "A singleton for loading resource files."
msgstr "ຊິງເກິລຕັນ (singleton) ສຳລັບການໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນ (resource)."

msgid ""
"A singleton used to load resource files from the filesystem.\n"
"It uses the many [ResourceFormatLoader] classes registered in the engine "
"(either built-in or from a plugin) to load files into memory and convert them "
"to a format that can be used by the engine.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You have to import the files into the engine first to load them "
"using [method load]. If you want to load [Image]s at run-time, you may use "
"[method Image.load]. If you want to import audio files, you can use the "
"snippet described in [member AudioStreamMP3.data].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Non-resource files such as plain text files cannot be read using "
"[ResourceLoader]. Use [FileAccess] for those files instead, and be aware that "
"non-resource files are not exported by default (see notes in the [FileAccess] "
"class description for instructions on exporting them)."
msgstr ""
"ຊິງເກິລຕັນທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌.\n"
"ມັນໃຊ້ຄລາສ [ResourceFormatLoader] ຫຼາຍອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ໃນເອນຈິນ "
"ເພື່ອໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ເຂົ້າໃນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ແປງເປັນຮູບແບບທີ່ເອນຈິນສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທ່ານຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ເຂົ້າໃນເອນຈິນກ່ອນຈຶ່ງຈະໂຫຼດພວກມັນໂດຍໃຊ້ [method load] ໄດ້. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໂຫຼດ [Image] ໃນເວລານຳໃຊ້ (run-time), ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [method Image.load]. "
"ຖ້າຕ້ອງການນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ສຽງ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ວິທີທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ [member AudioStreamMP3.data].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຊັບພະຍາກອນ ເຊັ່ນ ໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມທົ່ວໄປ ບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[ResourceLoader]. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [FileAccess] ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນແທນ."

msgid "Threaded Loading Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການໂຫຼດແບບເທຣດ (Threaded Loading Demo)"

msgid ""
"Registers a new [ResourceFormatLoader]. The ResourceLoader will use the "
"ResourceFormatLoader as described in [method load].\n"
"This method is performed implicitly for ResourceFormatLoaders written in "
"GDScript (see [ResourceFormatLoader] for more information)."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນ [ResourceFormatLoader] ໃໝ່. ResourceLoader ຈະໃຊ້ ResourceFormatLoader "
"ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ [method load].\n"
"ວິທີການນີ້ຈະຖືກດຳເນີນການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບ ResourceFormatLoaders ທີ່ຂຽນໃນ GDScript (ເບິ່ງ "
"[ResourceFormatLoader] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ)."

msgid ""
"Returns whether a recognized resource exists for the given [param path].\n"
"An optional [param type_hint] can be used to further specify the [Resource] "
"type that should be handled by the [ResourceFormatLoader]. Anything that "
"inherits from [Resource] can be used as a type hint, for example [Image].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you use [method Resource.take_over_path], this method will "
"return [code]true[/code] for the taken path even if the resource wasn't saved "
"(i.e. exists only in resource cache)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກມີຢູ່ສຳລັບ [param path] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ [param type_hint] ເພື່ອລະບຸປະເພດ [Resource] ທີ່ຄວນຈັດການໂດຍ "
"[ResourceFormatLoader]. ສິ່ງໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [Resource] ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນ type hint "
"ໄດ້, ຕົວຢ່າງ [Image].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ [method Resource.take_over_path], ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]true[/code] ສຳລັບເສັ້ນທາງນັ້ນ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຊັບພະຍາກອນຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກບັນທຶກກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the cached resource reference for the given [param path].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the resource is not cached, the returned [Resource] will be "
"invalid."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການອ້າງອີງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຢູ່ໃນແຄຊ໌ (cache) ສຳລັບ [param path] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນແຄຊ໌, [Resource] ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the dependencies for the resource at the given [param path].\n"
"Each dependency is a string that can be divided into sections by [code]::[/"
"code]. There can be either one section or three sections, with the second "
"section always being empty. When there is one section, it contains the file "
"path. When there are three sections, the first section contains the UID and "
"the third section contains the fallback path.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"for dependency in ResourceLoader.get_dependencies(path):\n"
"\tif dependency.contains(\"::\"):\n"
"\t\tprint(dependency.get_slice(\"::\", 0)) # Prints the UID.\n"
"\t\tprint(dependency.get_slice(\"::\", 2)) # Prints the fallback path.\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\tprint(dependency) # Prints the path.\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການສິ່ງທີ່ຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນ [param path] ຕ້ອງເພິ່ງພາ (dependencies).\n"
"ແຕ່ລະ dependency ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສາມາດແບ່ງອອກເປັນສ່ວນໆດ້ວຍ [code]::[/code]. ອາດຈະມີໜຶ່ງສ່ວນ ຫຼື "
"ສາມສ່ວນ. ເມື່ອມີໜຶ່ງສ່ວນ, ມັນຈະມີເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌. ເມື່ອມີສາມສ່ວນ, ສ່ວນທຳອິດຈະມີ UID ແລະ "
"ສ່ວນທີສາມຈະມີເສັ້ນທາງສຳຮອງ (fallback path).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"for dependency in ResourceLoader.get_dependencies(path):\n"
"\tif dependency.contains(\"::\"):\n"
"\t\tprint(dependency.get_slice(\"::\", 0)) # ພິມ UID.\n"
"\t\tprint(dependency.get_slice(\"::\", 2)) # ພິມ fallback path.\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\tprint(dependency) # ພິມ path.\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Returns the list of recognized extensions for a resource type."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກສຳລັບປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the ID associated with a given resource path, or [code]-1[/code] when "
"no such ID exists."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເສັ້ນທາງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ, ຫຼື [code]-1[/code] ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີ ID ດັ່ງກ່າວ."

msgid ""
"Returns whether a cached resource is available for the given [param path].\n"
"Once a resource has been loaded by the engine, it is cached in memory for "
"faster access, and future calls to the [method load] method will use the "
"cached version. The cached resource can be overridden by using [method "
"Resource.take_over_path] on a new resource for that same path."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຢູ່ໃນແຄຊ໌ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ [param path] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"ເມື່ອຊັບພະຍາກອນຖືກໂຫຼດໂດຍເອນຈິນແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນແຄຊ໌ໃນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳເພື່ອການເຂົ້າເຖິງທີ່ໄວຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແລະ ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method load] ໃນອະນາຄົດຈະໃຊ້ເວີຊັນທີ່ຢູ່ໃນແຄຊ໌. "
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນແຄຊ໌ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method Resource.take_over_path]."

msgid ""
"Lists a directory, returning all resources and subdirectories contained "
"within. The resource files have the original file names as visible in the "
"editor before exporting. The directories have [code]\"/\"[/code] appended.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Prints [\"extra_data/\", \"model.gltf\", \"model.tscn\", "
"\"model_slime.png\"]\n"
"print(ResourceLoader.list_directory(\"res://assets/enemies/slime\"))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The order of files and directories returned by this method is "
"not deterministic, and can vary between operating systems.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To normally traverse the filesystem, see [DirAccess]."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ໃນໂຟນເດີ, ໂດຍສົ່ງຄືນຊັບພະຍາກອນ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ. "
"ໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນຈະມີຊື່ເດີມຕາມທີ່ເຫັນໃນ editor ກ່ອນການສົ່ງອອກ. ໂຟນເດີຈະມີ [code]\"/\"[/code] "
"ຕໍ່ທ້າຍ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# ພິມ [\"extra_data/\", \"model.gltf\", \"model.tscn\", \"model_slime.png\"]\n"
"print(ResourceLoader.list_directory(\"res://assets/enemies/slime\"))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລຳດັບຂອງໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາອາດຈະບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ ແລະ "
"ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບການທ່ອງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ແບບປົກກະຕິ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [DirAccess]."

msgid ""
"Loads a resource at the given [param path], caching the result for further "
"access.\n"
"The registered [ResourceFormatLoader]s are queried sequentially to find the "
"first one which can handle the file's extension, and then attempt loading. If "
"loading fails, the remaining ResourceFormatLoaders are also attempted.\n"
"An optional [param type_hint] can be used to further specify the [Resource] "
"type that should be handled by the [ResourceFormatLoader]. Anything that "
"inherits from [Resource] can be used as a type hint, for example [Image].\n"
"The [param cache_mode] property defines whether and how the cache should be "
"used or updated when loading the resource.\n"
"Returns an empty resource if no [ResourceFormatLoader] could handle the file, "
"and prints an error if no file is found at the specified path.\n"
"GDScript has a simplified [method @GDScript.load] built-in method which can "
"be used in most situations, leaving the use of [ResourceLoader] for more "
"advanced scenarios.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member ProjectSettings.editor/export/"
"convert_text_resources_to_binary] is [code]true[/code], [method "
"@GDScript.load] will not be able to read converted files in an exported "
"project. If you rely on run-time loading of files present within the PCK, set "
"[member ProjectSettings.editor/export/convert_text_resources_to_binary] to "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Relative paths will be prefixed with [code]\"res://\"[/code] "
"before loading, to avoid unexpected results make sure your paths are absolute."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດຊັບພະຍາກອນຕາມ [param path] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ, ແລະ ເກັບຜົນລັບໄວ້ໃນແຄຊ໌ເພື່ອການເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"
"[ResourceFormatLoader] "
"ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ຈະຖືກສອບຖາມຕາມລຳດັບເພື່ອຊອກຫາອັນທຳອິດທີ່ສາມາດຈັດການກັບນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນໄດ້. "
"ຖ້າການໂຫຼດຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ຈະລອງໃຊ້ ResourceFormatLoaders ທີ່ເຫຼືອ.\n"
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ [param type_hint] ເພື່ອລະບຸປະເພດ [Resource] ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້.\n"
"GDScript ມີວິທີການ [method @GDScript.load] ທີ່ງ່າຍກວ່າ "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນສະຖານະການສ່ວນໃຫຍ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເສັ້ນທາງແບບສຳພັດ (relative paths) ຈະຖືກຕື່ມໜ້າດ້ວຍ [code]\"res://\"[/"
"code] ກ່ອນການໂຫຼດ, ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງຜົນລັບທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເສັ້ນທາງຂອງທ່ານເປັນແບບສົມບູນ "
"(absolute)."

msgid ""
"Returns the resource loaded by [method load_threaded_request].\n"
"If this is called before the loading thread is done (i.e. [method "
"load_threaded_get_status] is not [constant THREAD_LOAD_LOADED]), the calling "
"thread will be blocked until the resource has finished loading. However, it's "
"recommended to use [method load_threaded_get_status] to known when the load "
"has actually completed."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ໂຫຼດໂດຍ [method load_threaded_request].\n"
"ຖ້າເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້ກ່ອນທີ່ເທຣດການໂຫຼດຈະສຳເລັດ, ເທຣດທີ່ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຈະຖືກບລັອກ (blocked) "
"ຈົນກວ່າຊັບພະຍາກອນຈະໂຫຼດສຳເລັດ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"load_threaded_get_status] ເພື່ອຮູ້ວ່າການໂຫຼດສຳເລັດແທ້ໆເມື່ອໃດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the status of a threaded loading operation started with [method "
"load_threaded_request] for the resource at [param path].\n"
"An array variable can optionally be passed via [param progress], and will "
"return a one-element array containing the ratio of completion of the threaded "
"loading (between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The recommended way of using this method is to call it during "
"different frames (e.g., in [method Node._process], instead of a loop)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສະຖານະຂອງການດຳເນີນການໂຫຼດແບບເທຣດ (threaded loading) ທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [method "
"load_threaded_request] ສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນ [param path].\n"
"ສາມາດສົ່ງຕົວປ່ຽນອາເຣ (array) ຜ່ານ [param progress] "
"ເພື່ອຮັບຄ່າອັດຕາສ່ວນຄວາມສຳເລັດຂອງການໂຫຼດ (ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/"
"code]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີທີ່ແນະນຳໃນການໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້ແມ່ນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນເຟຣມຕ່າງໆ (ເຊັ່ນ ໃນ [method "
"Node._process] ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ loop)."

msgid ""
"Loads the resource using threads. If [param use_sub_threads] is [code]true[/"
"code], multiple threads will be used to load the resource, which makes "
"loading faster, but may affect the main thread (and thus cause game "
"slowdowns).\n"
"The [param cache_mode] parameter defines whether and how the cache should be "
"used or updated when loading the resource."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດຊັບພະຍາກອນໂດຍໃຊ້ເທຣດ. ຖ້າ [param use_sub_threads] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະມີການໃຊ້ຫຼາຍເທຣດເພື່ອໂຫຼດຊັບພະຍາກອນ ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ການໂຫຼດໄວຂຶ້ນ ແຕ່ອາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ເທຣດຫຼັກ (ແລະ "
"ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກມຊ້າລົງ).\n"
"[param cache_mode] ກຳນົດວ່າຈະໃຊ້ ຫຼື ອັບເດດແຄຊ໌ແນວໃດໃນເວລານຳເຂົ້າ."

msgid "Unregisters the given [ResourceFormatLoader]."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນ [ResourceFormatLoader] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Changes the behavior on missing sub-resources. The default behavior is to "
"abort loading."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນພຶດຕິກຳເມື່ອຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍ (sub-resources) ຫາຍໄປ. ພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການຍົກເລີກການໂຫຼດ."

msgid ""
"The resource is invalid, or has not been loaded with [method "
"load_threaded_request]."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໂຫຼດດ້ວຍ [method load_threaded_request]."

msgid "The resource is still being loaded."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນກຳລັງຖືກໂຫຼດຢູ່."

msgid "Some error occurred during loading and it failed."
msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດບາງຢ່າງໃນລະຫວ່າງການໂຫຼດ ແລະ ມັນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"The resource was loaded successfully and can be accessed via [method "
"load_threaded_get]."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນຖືກໂຫຼດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ ແລະ ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານ [method load_threaded_get]."

msgid "A node used to preload sub-resources inside a scene."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໂຫຼດຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍ (sub-resources) ໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າພາຍໃນສາກ."

msgid ""
"This node is used to preload sub-resources inside a scene, so when the scene "
"is loaded, all the resources are ready to use and can be retrieved from the "
"preloader. You can add the resources using the ResourcePreloader tab when the "
"node is selected.\n"
"GDScript has a simplified [method @GDScript.preload] built-in method which "
"can be used in most situations, leaving the use of [ResourcePreloader] for "
"more advanced scenarios."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໂຫຼດຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າພາຍໃນສາກ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນເມື່ອສາກຖືກໂຫຼດ, "
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນທັງໝົດຈະພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ສາມາດດຶງມາຈາກ preloader ໄດ້. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຖບ ResourcePreloader ເມື່ອເລືອກໂນດນີ້.\n"
"GDScript ມີວິທີການ [method @GDScript.preload] ທີ່ງ່າຍກວ່າ "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນສະຖານະການສ່ວນໃຫຍ່."

msgid ""
"Adds a resource to the preloader with the given [param name]. If a resource "
"with the given [param name] already exists, the new resource will be renamed "
"to \"[param name] N\" where N is an incrementing number starting from 2."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນເຂົ້າໃນ preloader ດ້ວຍ [param name] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. ຖ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ມີຊື່ນັ້ນມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, "
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນໃໝ່ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນຊື່ເປັນ \"[param name] N\" ໂດຍທີ່ N ແມ່ນຕົວເລກທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ 2."

msgid "Returns the resource associated to [param name]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [param name]."

msgid "Returns the list of resources inside the preloader."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນພາຍໃນ preloader."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the preloader contains a resource associated to "
"[param name]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ preloader ມີຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [param name]."

msgid "Removes the resource associated to [param name] from the preloader."
msgstr "ລົບຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [param name] ອອກຈາກ preloader."

msgid ""
"Renames a resource inside the preloader from [param name] to [param newname]."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຊື່ຊັບພະຍາກອນພາຍໃນ preloader ຈາກ [param name] ເປັນ [param newname]."

msgid "A singleton for saving [Resource]s to the filesystem."
msgstr "ຊິງເກິລຕັນ (singleton) ສຳລັບການບັນທຶກ [Resource] ລົງໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"A singleton for saving resource types to the filesystem.\n"
"It uses the many [ResourceFormatSaver] classes registered in the engine "
"(either built-in or from a plugin) to save resource data to text-based (e.g. "
"[code].tres[/code] or [code].tscn[/code]) or binary files (e.g. [code].res[/"
"code] or [code].scn[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ຊິງເກິລຕັນສຳລັບການບັນທຶກປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນລົງໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌.\n"
"ມັນໃຊ້ຄລາສ [ResourceFormatSaver] ຫຼາຍອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ໃນເອນຈິນ "
"ເພື່ອບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນຊັບພະຍາກອນເປັນໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມ (ເຊັ່ນ [code].tres[/code] ຫຼື [code].tscn[/code]) "
"ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ບີນາຣີ (ເຊັ່ນ [code].res[/code] ຫຼື [code].scn[/code])."

msgid ""
"Registers a new [ResourceFormatSaver]. The ResourceSaver will use the "
"ResourceFormatSaver as described in [method save].\n"
"This method is performed implicitly for ResourceFormatSavers written in "
"GDScript (see [ResourceFormatSaver] for more information)."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນ [ResourceFormatSaver] ໃໝ່. ResourceSaver ຈະໃຊ້ ResourceFormatSaver "
"ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ [method save].\n"
"ວິທີການນີ້ຈະຖືກດຳເນີນການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບ ResourceFormatSavers ທີ່ຂຽນໃນ GDScript."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of extensions available for saving a resource of a given "
"type."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບການບັນທຶກຊັບພະຍາກອນຕາມປະເພດທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the resource ID for the given path. If [param generate] is "
"[code]true[/code], a new resource ID will be generated if one for the path is "
"not found. If [param generate] is [code]false[/code] and the path is not "
"found, [constant ResourceUID.INVALID_ID] is returned."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ຊັບພະຍາກອນສຳລັບເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. ຖ້າ [param generate] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະມີການສ້າງ ID ໃໝ່ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບ ID ສຳລັບເສັ້ນທາງນັ້ນ."

msgid "Unregisters the given [ResourceFormatSaver]."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນ [ResourceFormatSaver] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Saves a resource to disk to the given path, using a [ResourceFormatSaver] "
"that recognizes the resource object. If [param path] is empty, "
"[ResourceSaver] will try to use [member Resource.resource_path].\n"
"The [param flags] bitmask can be specified to customize the save behavior.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When the project is running, any generated UID associated with "
"the resource will not be saved as the required code is only executed in "
"editor mode."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກຊັບພະຍາກອນລົງໃນດິສກ໌ຕາມເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. ຖ້າ [param path] ຫວ່າງໄວ້, [ResourceSaver] "
"ຈະພະຍາຍາມໃຊ້ [member Resource.resource_path].\n"
"ສາມາດລະບຸ [param flags] ເພື່ອກຳນົດພຶດຕິກຳການບັນທຶກເອງໄດ້.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant OK] ເມື່ອສຳເລັດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the UID of the given [param resource] path to [param uid]. You can "
"generate a new UID using [method ResourceUID.create_id].\n"
"Since resources will normally get a UID automatically, this method is only "
"useful in very specific cases."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ UID ຂອງເສັ້ນທາງ [param resource] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນ [param uid]. ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ UID "
"ໃໝ່ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method ResourceUID.create_id]."

msgid "No resource saving option."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີຕົວເລືອກການບັນທຶກຊັບພະຍາກອນ."

msgid "Save the resource with a path relative to the scene which uses it."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກຊັບພະຍາກອນດ້ວຍເສັ້ນທາງແບບສຳພັດກັບສາກທີ່ໃຊ້ມັນ."

msgid "Bundles external resources."
msgstr "ຮວບຮວມຊັບພະຍາກອນພາຍນອກ."

msgid ""
"Changes the [member Resource.resource_path] of the saved resource to match "
"its new location."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນ [member Resource.resource_path] ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ບັນທຶກໃຫ້ກົງກັບຕຳແໜ່ງໃໝ່ຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Do not save editor-specific metadata (identified by their [code]__editor[/"
"code] prefix)."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ບັນທຶກເມຕາດາຕາ (metadata) ສະເພາະຂອງ editor (ທີ່ລະບຸດ້ວຍຄຳນຳໜ້າ [code]__editor[/"
"code])."

msgid "Save as big endian (see [member FileAccess.big_endian])."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກເປັນແບບ big endian."

msgid ""
"Compress the resource on save using [constant FileAccess.COMPRESSION_ZSTD]. "
"Only available for binary resource types."
msgstr ""
"ບີບອັດຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນເວລາບັນທຶກໂດຍໃຊ້ [constant FileAccess.COMPRESSION_ZSTD]. "
"ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນແບບບີນາຣີ."

msgid ""
"Take over the paths of the saved subresources (see [method "
"Resource.take_over_path])."
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າຄວບຄຸມເສັ້ນທາງຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍທີ່ບັນທຶກ (ເບິ່ງ [method Resource.take_over_path])."

msgid ""
"A singleton that manages the unique identifiers of all resources within a "
"project."
msgstr ""
"ຊິງເກິລຕັນ (singleton) ທີ່ຈັດການຕົວລະບຸສະເພາະ (unique identifiers) "
"ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທັງໝົດພາຍໃນໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"Resource UIDs (Unique IDentifiers) allow the engine to keep references "
"between resources intact, even if files are renamed or moved. They can be "
"accessed with [code]uid://[/code].\n"
"[ResourceUID] keeps track of all registered resource UIDs in a project, "
"generates new UIDs, and converts between their string and integer "
"representations."
msgstr ""
"UIDs ຊັບພະຍາກອນ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເອນຈິນຮັກສາການອ້າງອີງລະຫວ່າງຊັບພະຍາກອນໃຫ້ຄົງທີ່, "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນຊື່ ຫຼື ຍ້າຍບ່ອນກໍຕາມ. ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [code]uid://[/code].\n"
"[ResourceUID] ຈະຕິດຕາມ UID ຊັບພະຍາກອນທັງໝົດທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃນໂປຣເຈັກ, ສ້າງ UID ໃໝ່, ແລະ "
"ແປງລະຫວ່າງຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ ຕົວເລກຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ."

msgid ""
"Adds a new UID value which is mapped to the given resource path.\n"
"Fails with an error if the UID already exists, so be sure to check [method "
"has_id] beforehand, or use [method set_id] instead."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄ່າ UID ໃໝ່ທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບເສັ້ນທາງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Generates a random resource UID which is guaranteed to be unique within the "
"list of currently loaded UIDs.\n"
"In order for this UID to be registered, you must call [method add_id] or "
"[method set_id]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ UID ຊັບພະຍາກອນແບບສຸ່ມ ເຊິ່ງຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັບລາຍການ UID ທີ່ໂຫຼດຢູ່ໃນປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Like [method create_id], but the UID is seeded with the provided [param path] "
"and project name. UIDs generated for that path will be always the same within "
"the current project."
msgstr ""
"ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [method create_id], ແຕ່ UID ຈະຖືກສ້າງໂດຍໃຊ້ [param path] ແລະ "
"ຊື່ໂປຣເຈັກເປັນຕົ້ນແບບ. UID ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບເສັ້ນທາງນັ້ນຈະຄືເກົ່າສະເໝີພາຍໃນໂປຣເຈັກນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns a path, converting [param path_or_uid] if necessary. Fails and "
"returns an empty string if an invalid UID is provided."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງ, ໂດຍແປງ [param path_or_uid] ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ. ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງຖ້າ UID "
"ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the path that the given UID value refers to.\n"
"Fails with an error if the UID does not exist, so be sure to check [method "
"has_id] beforehand."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ຄ່າ UID ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາອ້າງອີງເຖິງ."

msgid "Returns whether the given UID value is known to the cache."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າຄ່າ UID ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກໃນແຄຊ໌ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Converts the given UID to a [code]uid://[/code] string value."
msgstr "ແປງ UID ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນຄ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນຮູບແບບ [code]uid://[/code]."

msgid ""
"Converts the provided resource [param path] to a UID. Returns the unchanged "
"path if it has no associated UID."
msgstr ""
"ແປງເສັ້ນທາງຊັບພະຍາກອນ [param path] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນ UID. ຈະສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງເດີມຖ້າມັນບໍ່ມີ UID "
"ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Removes a loaded UID value from the cache.\n"
"Fails with an error if the UID does not exist, so be sure to check [method "
"has_id] beforehand."
msgstr "ລົບຄ່າ UID ທີ່ໂຫຼດແລ້ວອອກຈາກແຄຊ໌."

msgid ""
"Updates the resource path of an existing UID.\n"
"Fails with an error if the UID does not exist, so be sure to check [method "
"has_id] beforehand, or use [method add_id] instead."
msgstr "ອັບເດດເສັ້ນທາງຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງ UID ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

msgid "Extracts the UID value from the given [code]uid://[/code] string."
msgstr "ດຶງຄ່າ UID ອອກຈາກຂໍ້ຄວາມ [code]uid://[/code] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Converts the provided [param uid] to a path. Prints an error if the UID is "
"invalid."
msgstr "ແປງ [param uid] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນເສັ້ນທາງ."

msgid ""
"The value to use for an invalid UID, for example if the resource could not be "
"loaded.\n"
"Its text representation is [code]uid://<invalid>[/code]."
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ UID ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງມັນຄື [code]uid://<invalid>[/code]."

msgid ""
"A modifier to transfer parent skeleton poses (or global poses) to child "
"skeletons in model space with different rests."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວດັດແປງ (modifier) ເພື່ອຖ່າຍໂອນທ່າທາງຂອງໂຄງຮ່າງພໍ່ (parent skeleton poses) "
"ໄປຫາໂຄງຮ່າງລູກ (child skeletons) ໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂມເດລທີ່ມີຈຸດພັກ (rests) ຕ່າງກັນ."

msgid ""
"Retrieves the pose (or global pose) relative to the parent Skeleton's rest in "
"model space and transfers it to the child Skeleton.\n"
"This modifier rewrites the pose of the child skeleton directly in the parent "
"skeleton's update process. This means that it overwrites the mapped bone pose "
"set in the normal process on the target skeleton. If you want to set the "
"target skeleton bone pose after retargeting, you will need to add a "
"[SkeletonModifier3D] child to the target skeleton and thereby modify the "
"pose.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When the [member use_global_pose] is enabled, even if it is an "
"unmapped bone, it can cause visual problems because the global pose is "
"applied ignoring the parent bone's pose [b]if it has mapped bone children[/"
"b]. See also [member use_global_pose]."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງທ່າທາງ (pose) ທຽບກັບຈຸດພັກຂອງ Skeleton ພໍ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂມເດລ ແລະ ຖ່າຍໂອນມັນໄປຫາ Skeleton "
"ລູກ.\n"
"ຕົວດັດແປງນີ້ຈະຂຽນທັບທ່າທາງຂອງໂຄງຮ່າງລູກໂດຍກົງໃນຂະບວນການອັບເດດຂອງໂຄງຮ່າງພໍ່. "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນຈະຂຽນທັບທ່າທາງກະດູກທີ່ຖືກແມັບ (mapped) ໄວ້. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງທ່າທາງກະດູກຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນເປົ້າໝາຍ (retargeting), ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ "
"[SkeletonModifier3D] ເປັນລູກຂອງໂຄງຮ່າງເປົ້າໝາຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ [member use_global_pose], ມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາທາງສາຍຕາໄດ້ "
"ເພາະທ່າທາງທົ່ວໂລກ (global pose) ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກພໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [member enable] has [constant "
"TRANSFORM_FLAG_POSITION]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [member enable] ມີ [constant "
"TRANSFORM_FLAG_POSITION]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [member enable] has [constant "
"TRANSFORM_FLAG_ROTATION]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [member enable] ມີ [constant "
"TRANSFORM_FLAG_ROTATION]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [member enable] has [constant "
"TRANSFORM_FLAG_SCALE]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [member enable] ມີ [constant TRANSFORM_FLAG_SCALE]."

msgid "Sets [constant TRANSFORM_FLAG_POSITION] into [member enable]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [constant TRANSFORM_FLAG_POSITION] ເຂົ້າໃນ [member enable]."

msgid "Sets [constant TRANSFORM_FLAG_ROTATION] into [member enable]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [constant TRANSFORM_FLAG_ROTATION] ເຂົ້າໃນ [member enable]."

msgid "Sets [constant TRANSFORM_FLAG_SCALE] into [member enable]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [constant TRANSFORM_FLAG_SCALE] ເຂົ້າໃນ [member enable]."

msgid ""
"Flags to control the process of the transform elements individually when "
"[member use_global_pose] is disabled."
msgstr ""
"ແຟຼັກ (flags) ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຂະບວນການຂອງແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບການແປງ (transform elements) ແຍກກັນ "
"ເມື່ອ [member use_global_pose] ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"[SkeletonProfile] for retargeting bones with names matching the bone list."
msgstr "[SkeletonProfile] ສຳລັບການປ່ຽນເປົ້າໝາຍກະດູກທີ່ມີຊື່ກົງກັບລາຍຊື່ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], in case the target skeleton has fewer bones than the "
"source skeleton, the source bone parent's transform will be ignored.\n"
"Instead, it is possible to retarget between models with different body "
"shapes, and position, rotation, and scale can be retargeted separately.\n"
"If [code]true[/code], retargeting is performed taking into account global "
"pose.\n"
"In case the target skeleton has fewer bones than the source skeleton, the "
"source bone parent's transform is taken into account. However, bone length "
"between skeletons must match exactly, if not, the bones will be forced to "
"expand or shrink.\n"
"This is useful for using dummy bone with length [code]0[/code] to match "
"postures when retargeting between models with different number of bones."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]false[/code], ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໂຄງຮ່າງເປົ້າໝາຍມີກະດູກໜ້ອຍກວ່າໂຄງຮ່າງຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ການແປງ "
"(transform) ຂອງກະດູກພໍ່ຕົ້ນສະບັບຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນເປົ້າໝາຍລະຫວ່າງໂມເດລທີ່ມີຮູບຮ່າງຕ່າງກັນໄດ້.\n"
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ການປ່ຽນເປົ້າໝາຍຈະເຮັດໂດຍຄຳນຶງເຖິງທ່າທາງທົ່ວໂລກ (global pose). "
"ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ນຳ, ຄວາມຍາວກະດູກລະຫວ່າງໂຄງຮ່າງຕ້ອງກົງກັນພໍດີ."

msgid "If set, allows to retarget the position."
msgstr "ຖ້າຕັ້ງໄວ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປ່ຽນເປົ້າໝາຍຕຳແໜ່ງ (position)."

msgid "If set, allows to retarget the rotation."
msgstr "ຖ້າຕັ້ງໄວ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປ່ຽນເປົ້າໝາຍການໝຸນ (rotation)."

msgid "If set, allows to retarget the scale."
msgstr "ຖ້າຕັ້ງໄວ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປ່ຽນເປົ້າໝາຍຂະໜາດ (scale)."

msgid "If set, allows to retarget the position/rotation/scale."
msgstr "ຖ້າຕັ້ງໄວ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປ່ຽນເປົ້າໝາຍທັງ ຕຳແໜ່ງ/ການໝຸນ/ຂະໜາດ."

msgid "Represents a straight ribbon-shaped [PrimitiveMesh] with variable width."
msgstr "ແທນຄ່າ [PrimitiveMesh] ຮູບຊົງຣິບບິນ (ribbon) ແບບຊື່ທີ່ມີຄວາມກວ້າງປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"[RibbonTrailMesh] represents a straight ribbon-shaped mesh with variable "
"width. The ribbon is composed of a number of flat or cross-shaped sections, "
"each with the same [member section_length] and number of [member "
"section_segments]. A [member curve] is sampled along the total length of the "
"ribbon, meaning that the curve determines the size of the ribbon along its "
"length.\n"
"This primitive mesh is usually used for particle trails."
msgstr ""
"[RibbonTrailMesh] ແທນຄ່າເມຊຮູບຊົງຣິບບິນແບບຊື່ທີ່ມີຄວາມກວ້າງປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້. "
"ຣິບບິນປະກອບດ້ວຍສ່ວນຕ່າງໆທີ່ເປັນແບບແປ (flat) ຫຼື ຮູບກາກະບາດ (cross-shaped). ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ "
"[member curve] ຈະຖືກສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຕາມຄວາມຍາວທັງໝົດຂອງຣິບບິນ ເພື່ອກຳນົດຂະໜາດ.\n"
"ເມຊພື້ນຖານນີ້ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບຮອຍທາງອະນຸພາກ (particle trails)."

msgid "3D Particle trails"
msgstr "ຮອຍທາງອະນຸພາກ 3D"

msgid ""
"Determines the size of the ribbon along its length. The size of a particular "
"section segment is obtained by multiplying the baseline [member size] by the "
"value of this curve at the given distance. For values smaller than [code]0[/"
"code], the faces will be inverted. Should be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຂະໜາດຂອງຣິບບິນຕາມຄວາມຍາວຂອງມັນ. ຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະສ່ວນແມ່ນໄດ້ມາຈາກການຄູນຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານ "
"[member size] ດ້ວຍຄ່າຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງນີ້. ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [code]0[/code], ໜ້າ (faces) "
"ຈະຖືກປີ້ນ."

msgid "The length of a section of the ribbon."
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວຂອງສ່ວນໜຶ່ງ (section) ຂອງຣິບບິນ."

msgid ""
"The number of segments in a section. The [member curve] is sampled on each "
"segment to determine its size. Higher values result in a more detailed ribbon "
"at the cost of performance."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນເຊັກເມນ (segments) ໃນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນ. ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ [member curve] "
"ຈະຖືກສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງໃນແຕ່ລະເຊັກເມນເພື່ອກຳນົດຂະໜາດ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຣິບບິນມີລາຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ "
"ແຕ່ອາດກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ."

msgid "The total number of sections on the ribbon."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສ່ວນ (sections) ທັງໝົດຂອງຣິບບິນ."

msgid "Determines the shape of the ribbon."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຮູບຮ່າງຂອງຣິບບິນ."

msgid ""
"The baseline size of the ribbon. The size of a particular section segment is "
"obtained by multiplying this size by the value of the [member curve] at the "
"given distance."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານຂອງຣິບບິນ. ຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະສ່ວນຈະໄດ້ມາຈາກການຄູນຂະໜາດນີ້ດ້ວຍຄ່າຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ [member "
"curve]."

msgid "Gives the mesh a single flat face."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ເມຊມີໜ້າດຽວແບບແປ."

msgid "Gives the mesh two perpendicular flat faces, making a cross shape."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ເມຊມີສອງໜ້າແປທີ່ຕັ້ງສາກກັນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຮູບກາກະບາດ (cross shape)."

msgid "A custom effect for a [RichTextLabel]."
msgstr "ເອັບເຟັກແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບ [RichTextLabel]."

msgid ""
"A custom effect for a [RichTextLabel], which can be loaded in the "
"[RichTextLabel] inspector or using [method RichTextLabel.install_effect].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For a [RichTextEffect] to be usable, a BBCode tag must be "
"defined as a member variable called [code]bbcode[/code] in the script.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript skip-lint]\n"
"# The RichTextEffect will be usable like this: `[example]Some text[/"
"example]`\n"
"var bbcode = \"example\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp skip-lint]\n"
"// The RichTextEffect will be usable like this: `[example]Some text[/"
"example]`\n"
"string bbcode = \"example\";\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] As soon as a [RichTextLabel] contains at least one "
"[RichTextEffect], it will continuously process the effect unless the project "
"is paused. This may impact battery life negatively."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບ [RichTextLabel], ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໂຫຼດໄດ້ໃນ inspector ຂອງ "
"[RichTextLabel] ຫຼື ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method RichTextLabel.install_effect].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ [RichTextEffect] ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້, ຕ້ອງມີການກຳນົດແທັກ BBCode "
"ເປັນຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [code]bbcode[/code] ໃນສະຄຣິບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທັນທີທີ່ [RichTextLabel] ມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງ [RichTextEffect], "
"ມັນຈະປະມວນຜົນເອັບເຟັກຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ ນອກຈາກວ່າໂປຣເຈັກຈະຖືກຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ. "
"ອັນນີ້ອາດສົ່ງຜົນເສຍຕໍ່ອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານຂອງແບັດເຕີຣີ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to modify properties in [param char_fx]. The method must "
"return [code]true[/code] if the character could be transformed successfully. "
"If the method returns [code]false[/code], it will skip transformation to "
"avoid displaying broken text."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບວິທີການນີ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ [param char_fx]. ວິທີການນີ້ຕ້ອງສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] "
"ຖ້າຕົວອັກສອນສາມາດຖືກແປງຄ່າໄດ້ສຳເລັດ."

msgid ""
"A control for displaying text that can contain different font styles, images, "
"and basic formatting."
msgstr ""
"ຄອນໂທຣລ (control) ສຳລັບການສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສາມາດມີຮູບແບບຟອນທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, ຮູບພາບ, ແລະ "
"ການຈັດຮູບແບບພື້ນຖານ."

msgid "Rich Text Label with BBCode Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ Rich Text Label ພ້ອມກັບ BBCode"

msgid ""
"Adds a horizontal rule that can be used to separate content.\n"
"If [param width_in_percent] is set, [param width] values are percentages of "
"the control width instead of pixels.\n"
"If [param height_in_percent] is set, [param height] values are percentages of "
"the control width instead of pixels."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມເສັ້ນຂີດແນວນອນ (horizontal rule) ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຍກເນື້ອໃນ."

msgid ""
"Adds an image's opening and closing tags to the tag stack, optionally "
"providing a [param width] and [param height] to resize the image, a [param "
"color] to tint the image and a [param region] to only use parts of the "
"image.\n"
"If [param width] or [param height] is set to 0, the image size will be "
"adjusted in order to keep the original aspect ratio.\n"
"If [param width] and [param height] are not set, but [param region] is, the "
"region's rect will be used.\n"
"[param key] is an optional identifier, that can be used to modify the image "
"via [method update_image].\n"
"If [param pad] is set, and the image is smaller than the size specified by "
"[param width] and [param height], the image padding is added to match the "
"size instead of upscaling.\n"
"Parameters [param width_unit] and [param height_unit] determine the units "
"used to calculate the image width and height, respectively.\n"
"[param alt_text] is used as the image description for assistive apps."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກເປີດ ແລະ ປິດຂອງຮູບພາບເຂົ້າໃນ tag stack, ໂດຍສາມາດກຳນົດ [param width] ແລະ "
"[param height] ເພື່ອປັບຂະໜາດຮູບພາບ, [param color] ເພື່ອໃສ່ສີຍ້ອມຮູບພາບ ແລະ [param "
"region] ເພື່ອໃຊ້ພຽງບາງສ່ວນຂອງຮູບພາບ."

msgid "Adds raw non-BBCode-parsed text to the tag stack."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມດິບທີ່ບໍ່ຜ່ານການວິເຄາະ BBCode (non-BBCode-parsed) ເຂົ້າໃນ tag stack."

msgid ""
"Parses [param bbcode] and adds tags to the tag stack as needed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using this method, you can't close a tag that was opened in a "
"previous [method append_text] call. This is done to improve performance, "
"especially when updating large RichTextLabels since rebuilding the whole "
"BBCode every time would be slower. If you absolutely need to close a tag in a "
"future method call, append the [member text] instead of using [method "
"append_text]."
msgstr ""
"ວິເຄາະ [param bbcode] ແລະ ເພີ່ມແທັກເຂົ້າໃນ tag stack ຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້, ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດປິດແທັກທີ່ຖືກເປີດໄວ້ໃນການເອີ້ນ [method "
"append_text] ຄັ້ງກ່ອນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Clears the tag stack, causing the label to display nothing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method does not affect [member text], and its contents will "
"show again if the label is redrawn. However, setting [member text] to an "
"empty [String] also clears the stack."
msgstr ""
"ລ້າງ tag stack, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເລເບິລ (label) ບໍ່ສະແດງຫຍັງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບ [member text]. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member text] "
"ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງກໍຈະເປັນການລ້າງ stack ຄືກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the height of the line found at the provided index.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member threaded] is enabled, this method returns a value for "
"the loaded part of the document. Use [method is_finished] or [signal "
"finished] to determine whether the document is fully loaded."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມສູງຂອງແຖວທີ່ພົບຕາມດັດສະນີ (index) ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the width of the line found at the provided index.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member threaded] is enabled, this method returns a value for "
"the loaded part of the document. Use [method is_finished] or [signal "
"finished] to determine whether the document is fully loaded."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງແຖວທີ່ພົບຕາມດັດສະນີທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [PopupMenu] of this [RichTextLabel]. By default, this menu is "
"displayed when right-clicking on the [RichTextLabel].\n"
"You can add custom menu items or remove standard ones. Make sure your IDs "
"don't conflict with the standard ones (see [enum MenuItems]). For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar menu = get_menu()\n"
"\t# Remove \"Select All\" item.\n"
"\tmenu.remove_item(MENU_SELECT_ALL)\n"
"\t# Add custom items.\n"
"\tmenu.add_separator()\n"
"\tmenu.add_item(\"Duplicate Text\", MENU_MAX + 1)\n"
"\t# Connect callback.\n"
"\tmenu.id_pressed.connect(_on_item_pressed)\n"
"\n"
"func _on_item_pressed(id):\n"
"\tif id == MENU_MAX + 1:\n"
"\t\tadd_text(\"\\n\" + get_parsed_text())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar menu = GetMenu();\n"
"\t// Remove \"Select All\" item.\n"
"\tmenu.RemoveItem(RichTextLabel.MenuItems.SelectAll);\n"
"\t// Add custom items.\n"
"\tmenu.AddSeparator();\n"
"\tmenu.AddItem(\"Duplicate Text\", RichTextLabel.MenuItems.Max + 1);\n"
"\t// Add event handler.\n"
"\tmenu.IdPressed += OnItemPressed;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public void OnItemPressed(int id)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (id == TextEdit.MenuItems.Max + 1)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tAddText(\"\\n\" + GetParsedText());\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it may "
"cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member Window.visible] property."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [PopupMenu] ຂອງ [RichTextLabel] ນີ້. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເມນູນີ້ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ "
"[RichTextLabel].\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມລາຍການເມນູແບບກຳນົດເອງ ຫຼື ລົບລາຍການມາດຕະຖານອອກໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນໂນດພາຍໃນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ການລົບ ຫຼື ປົດປ່ອຍ (free) ມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໂປຣແກຣມເພໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the total number of paragraphs (newlines or [code]p[/code] tags in "
"the tag stack's text tags). Considers wrapped text as one paragraph."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນວັກທັງໝົດ (ແຖວໃໝ່ ຫຼື [code]p[/code] tags). "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກຕັດຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ຈະຖືກນັບເປັນວັກດຽວ."

msgid "Returns the text without BBCode mark-up."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍບໍ່ມີມາກອັບ BBCode."

msgid "Returns the current selection text. Does not include BBCodes."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກຳລັງເລືອກຢູ່. ບໍ່ລວມເອົາ BBCode."

msgid ""
"Returns the total number of characters from text tags. Does not include "
"BBCodes."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດຈາກແທັກຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ບໍ່ລວມເອົາ BBCode."

msgid ""
"Returns the bounding rectangle of the visible content.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method returns a correct value only after the label has "
"been drawn.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends RichTextLabel\n"
"\n"
"@export var background_panel: Panel\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tawait draw\n"
"\tbackground_panel.position = get_visible_content_rect().position\n"
"\tbackground_panel.size = get_visible_content_rect().size\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public partial class TestLabel : RichTextLabel\n"
"{\n"
"\t[Export]\n"
"\tpublic Panel BackgroundPanel { get; set; }\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override async void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tawait ToSignal(this, Control.SignalName.Draw);\n"
"\t\tBackgroundGPanel.Position = GetVisibleContentRect().Position;\n"
"\t\tBackgroundPanel.Size = GetVisibleContentRect().Size;\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂອບເຂດສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມ (bounding rectangle) ຂອງເນື້ອຫາທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເລເບລ (label) ຖືກແຕ້ມແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends RichTextLabel\n"
"\n"
"@export var background_panel: Panel\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tawait draw\n"
"\tbackground_panel.position = get_visible_content_rect().position\n"
"\tbackground_panel.size = get_visible_content_rect().size\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public partial class TestLabel : RichTextLabel\n"
"{\n"
"\t[Export]\n"
"\tpublic Panel BackgroundPanel { get; set; }\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override async void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tawait ToSignal(this, Control.SignalName.Draw);\n"
"\t\tBackgroundGPanel.Position = GetVisibleContentRect().Position;\n"
"\t\tBackgroundPanel.Size = GetVisibleContentRect().Size;\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Installs a custom effect. This can also be done in the Inspector through the "
"[member custom_effects] property. [param effect] should be a valid "
"[RichTextEffect].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] With the following script extending from [RichTextEffect]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# effect.gd\n"
"class_name MyCustomEffect\n"
"extends RichTextEffect\n"
"\n"
"var bbcode = \"my_custom_effect\"\n"
"\n"
"# ...\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"The above effect can be installed in [RichTextLabel] from a script:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# rich_text_label.gd\n"
"extends RichTextLabel\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tinstall_effect(MyCustomEffect.new())\n"
"\n"
"\t# Alternatively, if not using `class_name` in the script that extends "
"RichTextEffect:\n"
"\tinstall_effect(preload(\"res://effect.gd\").new())\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຕິດຕັ້ງເອັບເຟັກແບບກຳນົດເອງ. ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໃນ Inspector ຜ່ານຄຸນສົມບັດ [member "
"custom_effects]. [param effect] ຄວນເປັນ [RichTextEffect] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [RichTextEffect]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# effect.gd\n"
"class_name MyCustomEffect\n"
"extends RichTextEffect\n"
"\n"
"var bbcode = \"my_custom_effect\"\n"
"\n"
"# ...\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເອັບເຟັກຂ້າງເທິງສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໃນ [RichTextLabel] ຈາກສະຄຣິບ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# rich_text_label.gd\n"
"extends RichTextLabel\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tinstall_effect(MyCustomEffect.new())\n"
"\n"
"\t# ຫຼື ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ `class_name` ໃນສະຄຣິບທີ່ສືບທອດ RichTextEffect:\n"
"\tinstall_effect(preload(\"res://effect.gd\").new())\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Invalidates [param paragraph] and all subsequent paragraphs cache."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ແຄຊ (cache) ຂອງ [param paragraph] ແລະ ຫຍໍ້ໜ້າທັງໝົດຕໍ່ຈາກນັ້ນ ໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້ "
"(ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີການຄິດໄລ່ໃໝ່)."

msgid "Use [method is_finished] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method is_finished] ແທນ."

msgid "Adds a newline tag to the tag stack."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແທັກຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack."

msgid ""
"The assignment version of [method append_text]. Clears the tag stack and "
"inserts the new content."
msgstr ""
"ເວີຊັນການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງ [method append_text]. ຈະລ້າງ Tag Stack ອອກ ແລະ ແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍເນື້ອຫາໃໝ່."

msgid "Parses BBCode parameter [param expressions] into a dictionary."
msgstr "ແປງພາລາມິເຕີ BBCode [param expressions] ໃຫ້ເປັນດິກຊັນນາຣີ (dictionary)."

msgid ""
"Terminates the current tag. Use after [code]push_*[/code] methods to close "
"BBCodes manually. Does not need to follow [code]add_*[/code] methods."
msgstr ""
"ສິ້ນສຸດແທັກປັດຈຸບັນ. ໃຊ້ຫຼັງຈາກວິທີການ [code]push_*[/code] ເພື່ອປິດ BBCode ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. "
"ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຫຼັງຈາກວິທີການ [code]add_*[/code]."

msgid "Terminates all tags opened by [code]push_*[/code] methods."
msgstr "ສິ້ນສຸດແທັກທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກເປີດໂດຍວິທີການ [code]push_*[/code]."

msgid ""
"Terminates tags opened after the last [method push_context] call (including "
"context marker), or all tags if there's no context marker on the stack."
msgstr ""
"ສິ້ນສຸດແທັກທີ່ຖືກເປີດຫຼັງຈາກການເອີ້ນ [method push_context] ຄັ້ງຫຼ້າສຸດ (ລວມທັງຕົວໝາຍບໍລິບົດ), ຫຼື "
"ແທັກທັງໝົດຖ້າບໍ່ມີຕົວໝາຍບໍລິບົດໃນ stack."

msgid ""
"Adds a [code skip-lint][bgcolor][/code] tag to the tag stack.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The background color has padding applied by default, which is "
"controlled using [theme_item text_highlight_h_padding] and [theme_item "
"text_highlight_v_padding]. This can lead to overlapping highlights if "
"background colors are placed on neighboring lines/columns, so consider "
"setting those theme items to [code]0[/code] if you want to avoid this."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][bgcolor][/code] ໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສີພື້ນຫຼັງຈະມີການເວັ້ນໄລຍະຫ່າງ (padding) ມາໃຫ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ "
"[theme_item text_highlight_h_padding] ແລະ [theme_item "
"text_highlight_v_padding]. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການໄຮໄລ້ (highlight) ທັບຊ້ອນກັນໄດ້ "
"ຖ້າສີພື້ນຫຼັງຢູ່ໃກ້ແຖວ ຫຼື ຖັນຂ້າງຄຽງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເປັນ [code]0[/code] "
"ຖ້າຕ້ອງການຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫານີ້."

msgid ""
"Adds a [code skip-lint][font][/code] tag with a bold font to the tag stack. "
"This is the same as adding a [code skip-lint][b][/code] tag if not currently "
"in a [code skip-lint][i][/code] tag."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][font][/code] ທີ່ມີຟອນຕົວເຂັ້ມໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack. "
"ນີ້ຄືກັນກັບການເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][b][/code] ຖ້າໃນປັດຈຸບັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນແທັກ [code skip-lint]"
"[i][/code]."

msgid ""
"Adds a [code skip-lint][font][/code] tag with a bold italics font to the tag "
"stack."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][font][/code] ທີ່ມີຟອນຕົວເຂັ້ມເນັ້ນໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack."

msgid ""
"Adds a [code skip-lint][cell][/code] tag to the tag stack. Must be inside a "
"[code skip-lint][table][/code] tag. See [method push_table] for details. Use "
"[method set_table_column_expand] to set column expansion ratio, [method "
"set_cell_border_color] to set cell border, [method "
"set_cell_row_background_color] to set cell background, [method "
"set_cell_size_override] to override cell size, and [method set_cell_padding] "
"to set padding."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][cell][/code] ໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack. ຕ້ອງຢູ່ພາຍໃນແທັກ [code skip-"
"lint][table][/code]. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ [method push_table]. ໃຊ້ [method "
"set_table_column_expand] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າອັດຕາສ່ວນການຂະຫຍາຍຖັນ, [method "
"set_cell_border_color] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງສີຂອບຫ້ອງ, [method set_cell_row_background_color] "
"ເພື່ອຕັ້ງສີພື້ນຫຼັງຫ້ອງ, [method set_cell_size_override] ເພື່ອຂ້າມຄ່າຂະໜາດຫ້ອງ, ແລະ [method "
"set_cell_padding] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງໄລຍະຫ່າງພາຍໃນ."

msgid "Adds a [code skip-lint][color][/code] tag to the tag stack."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][color][/code] ໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack."

msgid "Adds a context marker to the tag stack. See [method pop_context]."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວໝາຍບໍລິບົດ (context marker) ໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack. ເບິ່ງ [method pop_context]."

msgid ""
"Adds a custom effect tag to the tag stack. The effect does not need to be in "
"[member custom_effects]. The environment is directly passed to the effect."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກເອັບເຟັກແບບກຳນົດເອງໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack. ເອັບເຟັກນີ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນ [member "
"custom_effects]. ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາເອັບເຟັກໂດຍກົງ."

msgid ""
"Adds a [code skip-lint][dropcap][/code] tag to the tag stack. Drop cap "
"(dropped capital) is a decorative element at the beginning of a paragraph "
"that is larger than the rest of the text."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][dropcap][/code] ໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack. Drop cap "
"ແມ່ນອົງປະກອບຕົກແຕ່ງຢູ່ຕົ້ນຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ ໂດຍຕົວອັກສອນທຳອິດຈະມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອ."

msgid ""
"Adds a [code skip-lint][fgcolor][/code] tag to the tag stack.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The foreground color has padding applied by default, which is "
"controlled using [theme_item text_highlight_h_padding] and [theme_item "
"text_highlight_v_padding]. This can lead to overlapping highlights if "
"foreground colors are placed on neighboring lines/columns, so consider "
"setting those theme items to [code]0[/code] if you want to avoid this."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][fgcolor][/code] ໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສີຕົວອັກສອນຈະມີການເວັ້ນໄລຍະຫ່າງ (padding) ມາໃຫ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ "
"[theme_item text_highlight_h_padding] ແລະ [theme_item "
"text_highlight_v_padding]. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການໄຮໄລ້ທັບຊ້ອນກັນໄດ້ ຖ້າມີການໃຊ້ສີໃນແຖວ ຫຼື "
"ຖັນໃກ້ຄຽງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເປັນ [code]0[/code] ຖ້າຕ້ອງການຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫານີ້."

msgid ""
"Adds a [code skip-lint][font][/code] tag to the tag stack. Overrides default "
"fonts for its duration.\n"
"Passing [code]0[/code] to [param font_size] will use the existing default "
"font size."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][font][/code] ໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack. "
"ຈະຂ້າມຄ່າຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ແທັກນີ້. ການສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]0[/code] ໄປຫາ [param font_size] "
"ຈະເປັນການໃຊ້ຂະໜາດຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ມີຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Adds a [code skip-lint][font_size][/code] tag to the tag stack. Overrides "
"default font size for its duration."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][font_size][/code] ໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack. "
"ຈະຂ້າມຄ່າຂະໜາດຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ແທັກນີ້."

msgid ""
"Adds a [code skip-lint][hint][/code] tag to the tag stack. Same as BBCode "
"[code skip-lint][hint=something]{text}[/hint][/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][hint][/code] ເຂົ້າໃນກອງແທັກ. ຄືກັນກັບ BBCode [code skip-"
"lint][hint=something]{text}[/hint][/code]."

msgid ""
"Adds an [code skip-lint][indent][/code] tag to the tag stack. Multiplies "
"[param level] by current [member tab_size] to determine new margin length."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][indent][/code] ໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack. ຈະຄູນ [param level] ດ້ວຍ "
"[member tab_size] ປັດຈຸບັນເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອບໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Adds a [code skip-lint][font][/code] tag with an italics font to the tag "
"stack. This is the same as adding an [code skip-lint][i][/code] tag if not "
"currently in a [code skip-lint][b][/code] tag."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][font][/code] ທີ່ມີຟອນຕົວເນັ້ນໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack. "
"ນີ້ຄືກັນກັບການເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][i][/code] ຖ້າໃນປັດຈຸບັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນແທັກ [code skip-lint]"
"[b][/code]."

msgid ""
"Adds language code used for text shaping algorithm and Open-Type font "
"features."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລະຫັດພາສາທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບອັນກໍຣິທຶມການຈັດຮູບຮ່າງຂໍ້ຄວາມ (text shaping) ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຟອນ Open-"
"Type."

msgid ""
"Adds [code skip-lint][ol][/code] or [code skip-lint][ul][/code] tag to the "
"tag stack. Multiplies [param level] by current [member tab_size] to determine "
"new margin length."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][ol][/code] ຫຼື [code skip-lint][ul][/code] ໃສ່ໃນ Tag "
"Stack. ຈະຄູນ [param level] ດ້ວຍ [member tab_size] ປັດຈຸບັນເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອບໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Adds a meta tag to the tag stack. Similar to the BBCode [code skip-lint]"
"[url=something]{text}[/url][/code], but supports non-[String] metadata "
"types.\n"
"If [member meta_underlined] is [code]true[/code], meta tags display an "
"underline. This behavior can be customized with [param underline_mode].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Meta tags do nothing by default when clicked. To assign behavior "
"when clicked, connect [signal meta_clicked] to a function that is called when "
"the meta tag is clicked."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເມຕາແທັກເຂົ້າໃນກອງແທັກ. ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ BBCode [code skip-lint][url=something]{text}[/"
"url][/code], ແຕ່ຮອງຮັບປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [String].\n"
"ຖ້າ [member meta_underlined] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເມຕາແທັກຈະສະແດງການຂີດກ້ອງ. "
"ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [param underline_mode].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ ເມຕາແທັກຈະບໍ່ເຮັດຫຍັງເມື່ອຖືກຄລິກ. ເພື່ອກຳນົດພຶດຕິກຳເມື່ອຖືກຄລິກ, "
"ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ [signal meta_clicked] ເຂົ້າກັບຟັງຊັນທີ່ຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ເມື່ອເມຕາແທັກຖືກຄລິກ."

msgid ""
"Adds a [code skip-lint][font][/code] tag with a monospace font to the tag "
"stack."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][font][/code] ທີ່ມີຟອນແບບຄວາມກວ້າງຄົງທີ່ (monospace) ໃສ່ໃນ Tag "
"Stack."

msgid ""
"Adds a [code skip-lint][font][/code] tag with a normal font to the tag stack."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][font][/code] ທີ່ມີຟອນປົກກະຕິໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack."

msgid ""
"Adds a [code skip-lint][outline_color][/code] tag to the tag stack. Adds text "
"outline for its duration."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][outline_color][/code] ໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack. "
"ຈະເພີ່ມເສັ້ນຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນລະຫວ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ແທັກນີ້."

msgid ""
"Adds a [code skip-lint][outline_size][/code] tag to the tag stack. Overrides "
"default text outline size for its duration."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][outline_size][/code] ໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack. "
"ຈະຂ້າມຄ່າຂະໜາດເສັ້ນຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ແທັກນີ້."

msgid "Adds a [code skip-lint][p][/code] tag to the tag stack."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][p][/code] ໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack."

msgid ""
"Adds a [code skip-lint][s][/code] tag to the tag stack. If [param color]'s "
"alpha value is [code]0.0[/code], the current font's color with its alpha "
"multiplied by [theme_item strikethrough_alpha] is used."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][s][/code] ໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack. ຖ້າຄ່າ alpha ຂອງ [param "
"color] ເປັນ [code]0.0[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ສີຂອງຟອນປັດຈຸບັນໂດຍຄູນຄ່າ alpha ກັບ [theme_item "
"strikethrough_alpha]."

msgid ""
"Adds a [code skip-lint][table=columns,inline_align][/code] tag to the tag "
"stack. Use [method set_table_column_expand] to set column expansion ratio. "
"Use [method push_cell] to add cells. [param name] is used as the table name "
"for assistive apps."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][table=columns,inline_align][/code] ໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack. ໃຊ້ "
"[method set_table_column_expand] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງອັດຕາສ່ວນການຂະຫຍາຍຖັນ. ໃຊ້ [method "
"push_cell] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຫ້ອງໃນຕາຕະລາງ. [param name] "
"ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຊື່ຕາຕະລາງສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (assistive apps)."

msgid ""
"Adds a [code skip-lint][u][/code] tag to the tag stack. If [param color]'s "
"alpha value is [code]0.0[/code], the current font's color with its alpha "
"multiplied by [theme_item underline_alpha] is used."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແທັກ [code skip-lint][u][/code] ໃສ່ໃນ Tag Stack. ຖ້າຄ່າ alpha ຂອງ [param "
"color] ເປັນ [code]0.0[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ສີຂອງຟອນປັດຈຸບັນໂດຍຄູນຄ່າ alpha ກັບ [theme_item "
"underline_alpha]."

msgid ""
"Reloads custom effects. Useful when [member custom_effects] is modified "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດເອັບເຟັກແບບກຳນົດເອງໃໝ່. ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອ [member custom_effects] ຖືກແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid "Scrolls the window's top line to match [param line]."
msgstr "ເລື່ອນແຖວເທິງສຸດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງໃຫ້ກົງກັບ [param line]."

msgid "Scrolls to the beginning of the current selection."
msgstr "ເລື່ອນໄປຫາຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງການເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Sets inner padding of a table cell."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງໄລຍະຫ່າງພາຍໃນ (inner padding) ຂອງຫ້ອງໃນຕາຕະລາງ."

msgid "Sets minimum and maximum size overrides for a table cell."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຂ້າມຂະໜາດຕໍ່າສຸດ ແລະ ສູງສຸດສຳລັບຫ້ອງໃນຕາຕະລາງ."

msgid ""
"Edits the selected column's expansion options. If [param expand] is "
"[code]true[/code], the column expands in proportion to its expansion ratio "
"versus the other columns' ratios.\n"
"For example, 2 columns with ratios 3 and 4 plus 70 pixels in available width "
"would expand 30 and 40 pixels, respectively.\n"
"If [param expand] is [code]false[/code], the column will not contribute to "
"the total ratio."
msgstr ""
"ແກ້ໄຂຕົວເລືອກການຂະຫຍາຍຂອງຖັນທີ່ເລືອກ. ຖ້າ [param expand] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຖັນຈະຂະຫຍາຍຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນການຂະຫຍາຍຂອງມັນເມື່ອທຽບກັບອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງຖັນອື່ນໆ.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: 2 ຖັນທີ່ມີອັດຕາສ່ວນ 3 ແລະ 4 ແລະ ມີຄວາມກວ້າງທີ່ຫວ່າງຢູ່ 70 ພິກເຊລ ຈະຂະຫຍາຍອອກ 30 ແລະ "
"40 ພິກເຊລ ຕາມລຳດັບ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param expand] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຖັນນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມໃນອັດຕາສ່ວນທັງໝົດ."

msgid "Sets table column name for assistive apps."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຊື່ຖັນຕາຕະລາງສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ."

msgid ""
"Updates the existing images with the key [param key]. Only properties "
"specified by [param mask] bits are updated. See [method add_image]."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດຮູບພາບທີ່ມີຢູ່ດ້ວຍຄີ [param key]. ເພາະຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍບິດ (bits) ຂອງ [param mask] "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກອັບເດດ. ເບິ່ງ [method add_image]."

msgid ""
"If set to something other than [constant TextServer.AUTOWRAP_OFF], the text "
"gets wrapped inside the node's bounding rectangle.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] RichTextLabels with autowrapping and [member fit_content] "
"enabled must have a custom maximum width configured to work correctly, either "
"through the RichTextLabel's own [member Control.custom_maximum_size] or as a "
"result of a propagated maximum size from a parent Control with [member "
"Control.propagate_maximum_size] enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [constant TextServer.AUTOWRAP_OFF], "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກຕັດຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ພາຍໃນຂອບເຂດສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຂອງໂນດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] RichTextLabel ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັດແຖວອັດຕະໂນມັດ (autowrapping) ແລະ "
"[member fit_content] ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມກວ້າງສູງສຸດແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, "
"ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຜ່ານ [member Control.custom_maximum_size] ຂອງ RichTextLabel ເອງ ຫຼື "
"ຜ່ານຂະໜາດສູງສຸດທີ່ສົ່ງຕໍ່ມາຈາກໂນດແມ່ (parent Control) ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"Control.propagate_maximum_size]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the label uses BBCode formatting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only affects the contents of [member text], not the tag "
"stack."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເລເບລຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ BBCode.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ເນື້ອຫາຂອງ [member text] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ Tag Stack."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], a right-click displays the context menu."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການຄລິກຂວາຈະສະແດງເມນູຄຳສັ່ງ (context menu)."

msgid ""
"The currently installed custom effects. This is an array of "
"[RichTextEffect]s.\n"
"To add a custom effect, it's more convenient to use [method install_effect]."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ນີ້ຄືອາເຣ (array) ຂອງ [RichTextEffect].\n"
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມເອັບເຟັກແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ການໃຊ້ [method install_effect] ຈະສະດວກກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the label's minimum size will be automatically updated "
"to fit its content, matching the behavior of [Label].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] RichTextLabels with autowrapping and [member fit_content] "
"enabled must have a custom maximum width configured to work correctly, either "
"through the RichTextLabel's own [member Control.custom_maximum_size] or as a "
"result of a propagated maximum size from a parent Control with [member "
"Control.propagate_maximum_size] enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຂະໜາດຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງເລເບລຈະຖືກອັບເດດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບເນື້ອຫາ, "
"ຄືກັບພຶດຕິກຳຂອງ [Label].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] RichTextLabel ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັດແຖວອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ [member fit_content] "
"ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມກວ້າງສູງສຸດແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຜ່ານ [member "
"Control.custom_maximum_size] ຂອງ RichTextLabel ເອງ ຫຼື "
"ຜ່ານຂະໜາດສູງສຸດທີ່ສົ່ງຕໍ່ມາຈາກໂນດແມ່ (parent Control) ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"Control.propagate_maximum_size]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the label underlines hint tags such as [code skip-lint]"
"[hint=description]{text}[/hint][/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ປ້າຍຊື່ຈະຂີດກ້ອງແທັກຄຳແນະນຳ ເຊັ່ນວ່າ [code skip-lint]"
"[hint=description]{text}[/hint][/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the label underlines meta tags such as [code skip-lint]"
"[url]{text}[/url][/code]. These tags can call a function when clicked if "
"[signal meta_clicked] is connected to a function."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ປ້າຍຊື່ຈະຂີດກ້ອງເມຕາແທັກ ເຊັ່ນວ່າ [code skip-lint][url]{text}[/"
"url][/code]. ແທັກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດຮຽກໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນເມື່ອຖືກຄລິກ ຖ້າ [signal meta_clicked] "
"ຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຟັງຊັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the scrollbar is visible. Setting this to [code]false[/"
"code] does not block scrolling completely. See [method scroll_to_line]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແຖບເລື່ອນ (scrollbar) ຈະເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code] ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນການປິດການເລື່ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດ. ເບິ່ງ [method scroll_to_line]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the window scrolls down to display new content "
"automatically."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະເລື່ອນລົງເພື່ອສະແດງເນື້ອຫາໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the window scrolls to display the last visible line "
"when [member visible_characters] or [member visible_ratio] is changed."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະເລື່ອນໄປສະແດງແຖວສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ ເມື່ອ [member "
"visible_characters] ຫຼື [member visible_ratio] ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the label allows text selection."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເລເບລຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The number of spaces associated with a single tab length. Does not affect "
"[code]\\t[/code] in text tags, only indent tags."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຊ່ອງຫວ່າງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄວາມຍາວຂອງແທັບ (tab) ດຽວ. ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ [code]\\t[/code] "
"ໃນແທັກຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ມີຜົນສະເພາະແທັກ indent ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], text processing is done in a background thread."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການປະມວນຜົນຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກເຮັດໃນເທີຣດເບື້ອງຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"Triggered when the document is fully loaded.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This can happen before the text is processed for drawing. "
"Scrolling values may not be valid until the document is drawn for the first "
"time after this signal."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອເອກະສານຖືກໂຫຼດຄົບຖ້ວນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນກ່ອນທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນເພື່ອແຕ້ມ. "
"ຄ່າການເລື່ອນອາດຈະຍັງໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້ຈົນກວ່າເອກະສານຈະຖືກແຕ້ມເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດຫຼັງຈາກສັນຍານນີ້."

msgid ""
"Triggered when the user clicks on content between meta (URL) tags. If the "
"meta is defined in BBCode, e.g. [code skip-lint][url={\"key\": "
"\"value\"}]Text[/url][/code], then the parameter for this signal will always "
"be a [String] type. If a particular type or an object is desired, the [method "
"push_meta] method must be used to manually insert the data into the tag "
"stack. Alternatively, you can convert the [String] input to the desired type "
"based on its contents (such as calling [method JSON.parse] on it).\n"
"For example, the following method can be connected to [signal meta_clicked] "
"to open clicked URLs using the user's default web browser:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# This assumes RichTextLabel's `meta_clicked` signal was connected to\n"
"# the function below using the signal connection dialog.\n"
"func _richtextlabel_on_meta_clicked(meta):\n"
"\t# `meta` is of Variant type, so convert it to a String to avoid script "
"errors at run-time.\n"
"\tOS.shell_open(str(meta))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄລິກໃສ່ເນື້ອຫາລະຫວ່າງແທັກ meta (URL). ຖ້າ meta ຖືກກຳນົດໃນ BBCode, ເຊັ່ນ "
"[code skip-lint][url={\"key\": \"value\"}]ຂໍ້ຄວາມ[/url][/code], "
"ພາລາມິເຕີສຳລັບສັນຍານນີ້ຈະເປັນປະເພດ [String] ສະເໝີ. ຖ້າຕ້ອງການປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະ ຫຼື ອອບເຈັກ, "
"ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ວິທີການ [method push_meta] ເພື່ອໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນເຂົ້າໃນ Tag Stack ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດແປງ "
"[String] ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບໃຫ້ເປັນປະເພດທີ່ຕ້ອງການຕາມເນື້ອຫາຂອງມັນ (ເຊັ່ນການເອີ້ນ [method JSON.parse] "
"ໃສ່ມັນ).\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ວິທີການຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ [signal meta_clicked] ເພື່ອເປີດ URL "
"ທີ່ຖືກຄລິກໂດຍໃຊ້ເວັບບຣາວເຊີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# ສົມມຸດວ່າສັນຍານ `meta_clicked` ຂອງ RichTextLabel ຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ\n"
"# ຟັງຊັນຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ໄດອະລັອກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ.\n"
"func _richtextlabel_on_meta_clicked(meta):\n"
"\t# `meta` ເປັນປະເພດ Variant, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ແປງມັນເປັນ String "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງສະຄຣິບໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"\tOS.shell_open(str(meta))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Triggers when the mouse exits a meta tag."
msgstr "ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອເມົາສ໌ເລື່ອນອອກຈາກແທັກ meta."

msgid "Triggers when the mouse enters a meta tag."
msgstr "ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອເມົາສ໌ເລື່ອນເຂົ້າໄປໃນແທັກ meta."

msgid "Each list item has a number marker."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະລາຍການໃນລາຍການຈະມີຕົວເລກກຳກັບ."

msgid "Each list item has a letter marker."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະລາຍການໃນລາຍການຈະມີຕົວອັກສອນກຳກັບ."

msgid "Each list item has a filled circle marker."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະລາຍການໃນລາຍການຈະມີຮູບວົງມົນທຶບກຳກັບ."

msgid "Selects the whole [RichTextLabel] text."
msgstr "ເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດໃນ [RichTextLabel]."

msgid "If this bit is set, [method update_image] changes image texture."
msgstr "ຖ້າບິດນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງ, [method update_image] ຈະປ່ຽນແພັດເທີນ (texture) ຂອງຮູບພາບ."

msgid "If this bit is set, [method update_image] changes image size."
msgstr "ຖ້າບິດນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງ, [method update_image] ຈະປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຂອງຮູບພາບ."

msgid "If this bit is set, [method update_image] changes image color."
msgstr "ຖ້າບິດນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງ, [method update_image] ຈະປ່ຽນສີຂອງຮູບພາບ."

msgid ""
"If this bit is set, [method update_image] changes image inline alignment."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບິດນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງ, [method update_image] ຈະປ່ຽນການຈັດວາງຮູບພາບແບບແຖວດຽວກັນ (inline "
"alignment)."

msgid "If this bit is set, [method update_image] changes image texture region."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບິດນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງ, [method update_image] ຈະປ່ຽນພື້ນທີ່ແພັດເທີນ (texture region) ຂອງຮູບພາບ."

msgid "If this bit is set, [method update_image] changes image padding."
msgstr "ຖ້າບິດນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງ, [method update_image] ຈະປ່ຽນໄລຍະຫ່າງ (padding) ຂອງຮູບພາບ."

msgid "If this bit is set, [method update_image] changes image tooltip."
msgstr "ຖ້າບິດນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງ, [method update_image] ຈະປ່ຽນຄຳອະທິບາຍເຄື່ອງມື (tooltip) ຂອງຮູບພາບ."

msgid ""
"If this bit is set, [method update_image] changes the units used to calculate "
"image size."
msgstr "ຖ້າບິດນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງ, [method update_image] ຈະປ່ຽນຫົວໜ່ວຍທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຄິດໄລ່ຂະໜາດຮູບພາບ."

msgid "The default text color."
msgstr "ສີຂໍ້ຄວາມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "The default tint of text outline."
msgstr "ສີຍ້ອມ (tint) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"The color of selected text, used when [member selection_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code]. If equal to [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code], it will be "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ, ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [member selection_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. "
"ຖ້າເທົ່າກັບ [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code], ມັນຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

msgid "The color of the font's shadow."
msgstr "ສີຂອງເງົາຟອນ."

msgid "The color of the selection box."
msgstr "ສີຂອງກ່ອງການເລືອກ."

msgid "The default cell border color."
msgstr "ສີຂອບຫ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "The default background color for even rows."
msgstr "ສີພື້ນຫຼັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບແຖວຄູ່."

msgid "The default background color for odd rows."
msgstr "ສີພື້ນຫຼັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບແຖວຄີກ."

msgid ""
"Additional vertical spacing between paragraphs (in pixels). Spacing is added "
"after the last line. This value can be negative."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວຕັ້ງເພີ່ມເຕີມລະຫວ່າງຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ (ເປັນພິກເຊລ). ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈະຖືກເພີ່ມຫຼັງຈາກແຖວສຸດທ້າຍ. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດຕິດລົບໄດ້."

msgid "The horizontal offset of the font's shadow."
msgstr "ຄ່າອອັບເຊັດແນວນອນຂອງເງົາຟອນ."

msgid "The vertical offset of the font's shadow."
msgstr "ຄ່າອອັບເຊັດແນວຕັ້ງຂອງເງົາຟອນ."

msgid ""
"The default strikethrough color transparency (percent). For strikethroughs "
"with a custom color, this theme item is only used if the custom color's alpha "
"is [code]0.0[/code] (fully transparent)."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຂອງສີຂີດຂ້າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ເປີເຊັນ). ສຳລັບການຂີດຂ້າທີ່ມີສີແບບກຳນົດເອງ, "
"ໄອເທັມທີມນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຄ່າ alpha ຂອງສີທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເປັນ [code]0.0[/code] (ໂປ່ງໃສທັງໝົດ)."

msgid "The horizontal separation of elements in a table."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວນອນຂອງອົງປະກອບໃນຕາຕະລາງ."

msgid "The vertical separation of elements in a table."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວຕັ້ງຂອງອົງປະກອບໃນຕາຕະລາງ."

msgid ""
"The horizontal padding around boxes drawn by the [code][fgcolor][/code] and "
"[code][bgcolor][/code] tags. This does not affect the appearance of text "
"selection. To avoid any risk of neighboring highlights overlapping each "
"other, set this to [code]0[/code] to disable padding."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວນອນອ້ອມຮອບກ່ອງທີ່ແຕ້ມໂດຍແທັກ [code][fgcolor][/code] ແລະ [code][bgcolor][/"
"code]. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ລັກສະນະຂອງການເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ໄຮໄລ້ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ຄຽງຈະທັບຊ້ອນກັນ, "
"ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ [code]0[/code] ເພື່ອປິດການເວັ້ນໄລຍະຫ່າງ."

msgid ""
"The vertical padding around boxes drawn by the [code][fgcolor][/code] and "
"[code][bgcolor][/code] tags. This does not affect the appearance of text "
"selection. To avoid any risk of neighboring highlights overlapping each "
"other, set this to [code]0[/code] to disable padding."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວຕັ້ງອ້ອມຮອບກ່ອງທີ່ແຕ້ມໂດຍແທັກ [code][fgcolor][/code] ແລະ [code][bgcolor][/"
"code]. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ລັກສະນະຂອງການເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ໄຮໄລ້ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ຄຽງຈະທັບຊ້ອນກັນ, "
"ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ [code]0[/code] ເພື່ອປິດການເວັ້ນໄລຍະຫ່າງ."

msgid ""
"The default underline color transparency (percent). For underlines with a "
"custom color, this theme item is only used if the custom color's alpha is "
"[code]0.0[/code] (fully transparent)."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຂອງສີຂີດເສັ້ນກ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ເປີເຊັນ). ສຳລັບເສັ້ນກ້ອງທີ່ມີສີແບບກຳນົດເອງ, "
"ໄອເທັມທີມນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຄ່າ alpha ຂອງສີທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເປັນ [code]0.0[/code] (ໂປ່ງໃສທັງໝົດ)."

msgid "The font used for bold text."
msgstr "ຟອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົວເຂັ້ມ."

msgid "The font used for bold italics text."
msgstr "ຟອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົວເຂັ້ມເນັ້ນ."

msgid "The font used for italics text."
msgstr "ຟອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົວເນັ້ນ."

msgid "The font used for monospace text."
msgstr "ຟອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມແບບຄວາມກວ້າງຄົງທີ່ (monospace)."

msgid "The default text font."
msgstr "ຟອນຂໍ້ຄວາມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "The font size used for bold text."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົວເຂັ້ມ."

msgid "The font size used for bold italics text."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົວເຂັ້ມເນັ້ນ."

msgid "The font size used for italics text."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົວເນັ້ນ."

msgid "The font size used for monospace text."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມແບບຄວາມກວ້າງຄົງທີ່ (monospace)."

msgid "The default text font size."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນຂໍ້ຄວາມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "The horizontal rule texture."
msgstr "ແພັດເທີນ (texture) ຂອງເສັ້ນຂີດແບ່ງແນວນອນ (horizontal rule)."

msgid ""
"The background used when the [RichTextLabel] is focused. The [theme_item "
"focus] [StyleBox] is displayed [i]over[/i] the base [StyleBox], so a "
"partially transparent [StyleBox] should be used to ensure the base [StyleBox] "
"remains visible. A [StyleBox] that represents an outline or an underline "
"works well for this purpose. To disable the focus visual effect, assign a "
"[StyleBoxEmpty] resource. Note that disabling the focus visual effect will "
"harm keyboard/controller navigation usability, so this is not recommended for "
"accessibility reasons."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [RichTextLabel] ຖືກໂຟກັສ (focused). [StyleBox] ຂອງ [theme_item "
"focus] ຈະຖືກສະແດງ [i]ທັບ[/i] ຢູ່ເທິງ [StyleBox] ພື້ນຖານ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນໃຊ້ [StyleBox] "
"ທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສບາງສ່ວນເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າ [StyleBox] ພື້ນຖານຍັງຄົງເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້. [StyleBox] ທີ່ເປັນເສັ້ນຂອບ ຫຼື "
"ເສັ້ນກ້ອງຈະເໝາະສຳລັບຈຸດປະສົງນີ້. ເພື່ອປິດເອັບເຟັກການໂຟກັສ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດຊັບພະຍາກອນເປັນ "
"[StyleBoxEmpty]. ໝາຍເຫດ: ການປິດເອັບເຟັກການໂຟກັສຈະສົ່ງຜົນເສຍຕໍ່ການໃຊ້ງານຜ່ານຄີບອດ/"
"ຄອນໂທຣລເລີ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແນະນຳຍ້ອນເຫດຜົນດ້ານການເຂົ້າເຖິງ (accessibility)."

msgid "The normal background for the [RichTextLabel]."
msgstr "ພື້ນຫຼັງປົກກະຕິສຳລັບ [RichTextLabel]."

msgid "A handle for a [Resource]'s unique identifier."
msgstr "ຕົວລະບຸສະເພາະ (unique identifier) ສຳລັບ [Resource]."

msgid ""
"The RID [Variant] type is used to access a low-level resource by its unique "
"ID. RIDs are opaque, which means they do not grant access to the resource by "
"themselves. They are used by the low-level server classes, such as "
"[DisplayServer], [RenderingServer], [TextServer], etc.\n"
"A low-level resource may correspond to a high-level [Resource], such as "
"[Texture] or [Mesh].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] RIDs are only useful during the current session. It won't "
"correspond to a similar resource if sent over a network, or loaded from a "
"file at a later time.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, an RID will evaluate to [code]false[/code] "
"if it has the invalid ID [code]0[/code]. Otherwise, an RID will always "
"evaluate to [code]true[/code]. This is equivalent to calling [method "
"is_valid]."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດ RID [Variant] ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຊັບພະຍາກອນລະດັບຕໍ່າ (low-level resource) ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"ID ສະເພາະຂອງມັນ. RID ມີລັກສະນະທຶບແສງ (opaque), "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຊັບພະຍາກອນດ້ວຍຕົວມັນເອງ. ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍຄລາສເຊີບເວີລະດັບຕໍ່າ ເຊັ່ນ "
"[DisplayServer], [RenderingServer], [TextServer] ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນລະດັບຕໍ່າອາດຈະກົງກັບ [Resource] ລະດັບສູງ ເຊັ່ນ [Texture] ຫຼື [Mesh].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] RID ມີປະໂຫຍດສະເພາະໃນລະຫວ່າງເຊດຊັນ (session) ປັດຈຸບັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ກົງກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ ຖ້າຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ໂຫຼດຈາກໄຟລ໌ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງບູລີນ (boolean), RID ຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]false[/code] ຖ້າມັນມີ "
"ID ທີ່ໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຄື [code]0[/code]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, RID ຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ສະເໝີ. "
"ນີ້ເທົ່າກັບການເອີ້ນ [method is_valid]."

msgid "Constructs an empty [RID] with the invalid ID [code]0[/code]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [RID] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າທີ່ມີ ID ທີ່ໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ [code]0[/code]."

msgid "Constructs an [RID] as a copy of the given [RID]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [RID] ໂດຍການສຳເນົາຈາກ [RID] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Returns the ID of the referenced low-level resource."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນລະດັບຕໍ່າທີ່ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the [RID] is not [code]0[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [RID] ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [code]0[/code]."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the [RID]s are not equal."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [RID] ທັງສອງບໍ່ເທົ່າກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [RID]'s ID is less than [param right]'s ID."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ ID ຂອງ [RID] ນ້ອຍກວ່າ ID ຂອງ [param right]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [RID]'s ID is less than or equal to [param "
"right]'s ID."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ ID ຂອງ [RID] ນ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ ID ຂອງ [param right]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if both [RID]s are equal, which means they both "
"refer to the same low-level resource."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [RID] ທັງສອງເທົ່າກັນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທັງສອງອ້າງອີງເຖິງຊັບພະຍາກອນລະດັບຕໍ່າອັນດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [RID]'s ID is greater than [param right]'s "
"ID."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ ID ຂອງ [RID] ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ ID ຂອງ [param right]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [RID]'s ID is greater than or equal to "
"[param right]'s ID."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ ID ຂອງ [RID] ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ ID ຂອງ [param right]."

msgid "A 2D physics body that is moved by a physics simulation."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 2 ມິຕິ ທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໂດຍການຈຳລອງທາງຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"[RigidBody2D] implements full 2D physics. It cannot be controlled directly, "
"instead, you must apply forces to it (gravity, impulses, etc.), and the "
"physics simulation will calculate the resulting movement, rotation, react to "
"collisions, and affect other physics bodies in its path.\n"
"The body's behavior can be adjusted via [member lock_rotation], [member "
"freeze], and [member freeze_mode]. By changing various properties of the "
"object, such as [member mass], you can control how the physics simulation "
"acts on it.\n"
"A rigid body will always maintain its shape and size, even when forces are "
"applied to it. It is useful for objects that can be interacted with in an "
"environment, such as a tree that can be knocked over or a stack of crates "
"that can be pushed around.\n"
"If you need to directly affect the body, prefer [method _integrate_forces] as "
"it allows you to directly access the physics state.\n"
"If you need to override the default physics behavior, you can write a custom "
"force integration function. See [member custom_integrator].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing the 2D transform or [member linear_velocity] of a "
"[RigidBody2D] very often may lead to some unpredictable behaviors. This also "
"happens when a [RigidBody2D] is the descendant of a constantly moving node, "
"like another [RigidBody2D], as that will cause its global transform to be set "
"whenever its ancestor moves."
msgstr ""
"[RigidBody2D] ໃຊ້ງານລະບົບຟີຊິກ 2 ມິຕິແບບເຕັມຮູບແບບ. ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍກົງ, "
"ແຕ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃຫ້ແຮງກັບມັນ (ເຊັ່ນ ແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງ, ແຮງຜັກດັນ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ), ແລະ "
"ການຈຳລອງທາງຟີຊິກຈະຄິດໄລ່ການເຄື່ອນທີ່, ການໝູນ, ການຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການຕຳ ແລະ "
"ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກອື່ນໆໃນເສັ້ນທາງຂອງມັນ.\n"
"ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງວັດຖຸສາມາດປັບໄດ້ຜ່ານ [member lock_rotation], [member freeze], ແລະ [member "
"freeze_mode]. ໂດຍການປ່ຽນແປງຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ [member mass], "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄວບຄຸມວິທີທີ່ການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກກະທຳຕໍ່ມັນ.\n"
"Rigid body ຈະຮັກສາຮູບຮ່າງ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງມັນສະເໝີ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະມີແຮງມາກະທົບກໍຕາມ. "
"ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ສາມາດໂຕ້ຕອບໄດ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ເຊັ່ນ ຕົ້ນໄມ້ທີ່ສາມາດລົ້ມໄດ້ ຫຼື "
"ກອງລັງທີ່ສາມາດຍູ້ໄປມາໄດ້.\n"
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ວັດຖຸໂດຍກົງ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method _integrate_forces] "
"ເພາະມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງສະຖານະຟີຊິກໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ.\n"
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຂ້າມພຶດຕິກຳຟີຊິກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຂຽນຟັງຊັນການຮວມແຮງແບບກຳນົດເອງໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ "
"[member custom_integrator].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນແປງ 2D transform ຫຼື [member linear_velocity] ຂອງ "
"[RigidBody2D] ດຸເກີນໄປອາດນຳໄປສູ່ພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ຄາດເດົາບໍ່ໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອ [RigidBody2D] "
"ເປັນລູກຫຼານຂອງໂນດທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ ເຊັ່ນ [RigidBody2D] ອີກໂຕໜຶ່ງ, ເພາະມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ global "
"transform ຂອງມັນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ໂນດແມ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່."

msgid "2D Physics Platformer Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງເກມແພລັດຟອມເມີຟີຊິກ 2 ມິຕິ"

msgid "Instancing Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (Instancing)"

msgid ""
"Applies a rotational force without affecting position. A force is time "
"dependent and meant to be applied every physics update.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member inertia] is required for this to work. To have [member "
"inertia], an active [CollisionShape2D] must be a child of the node, or you "
"can manually set [member inertia]."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ແຮງບິດ (rotational force) ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ. ແຮງນີ້ຈະຂຶ້ນກັບເວລາ ແລະ "
"ຄວນຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການອັບເດດຟີຊິກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ້ອງມີ [member inertia] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີ [member "
"inertia], ຕ້ອງມີ [CollisionShape2D] ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເປັນໂນດລູກ, ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"inertia] ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"Applies a rotational impulse to the body without affecting the position.\n"
"An impulse is time-independent! Applying an impulse every frame would result "
"in a framerate-dependent force. For this reason, it should only be used when "
"simulating one-time impacts (use the \"_force\" functions otherwise).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member inertia] is required for this to work. To have [member "
"inertia], an active [CollisionShape2D] must be a child of the node, or you "
"can manually set [member inertia]."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ແຮງຜັກດັນການໝູນ (rotational impulse) ໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ.\n"
"ແຮງຜັກດັນແມ່ນບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບເວລາ! ການໃຫ້ແຮງຜັກດັນໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ແຮງນັ້ນຂຶ້ນກັບເຟຣມເຣດ "
"(framerate). ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, ມັນຄວນຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອຈຳລອງການກະທົບພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ "
"\"_force\").\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ້ອງມີ [member inertia] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີ [member "
"inertia], ຕ້ອງມີ [CollisionShape2D] ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເປັນໂນດລູກ, ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"inertia] ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns a list of the bodies colliding with this one. Requires [member "
"contact_monitor] to be set to [code]true[/code] and [member "
"max_contacts_reported] to be set high enough to detect all the collisions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The result of this test is not immediate after moving objects. "
"For performance, list of collisions is updated once per frame and before the "
"physics step. Consider using signals instead."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ກຳລັງຕຳກັບວັດຖຸນີ້. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member contact_monitor] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ແລະ [member max_contacts_reported] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ສູງພໍທີ່ຈະກວດຈັບການຕຳທັງໝົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຜົນຂອງການທົດສອບນີ້ຈະບໍ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍວັດຖຸ. ເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບ, "
"ລາຍຊື່ການຕຳຈະຖືກອັບເດດພຽງແຕ່ຄັ້ງດຽວຕໍ່ເຟຣມ ແລະ ກ່ອນຂັ້ນຕອນຟີຊິກ. ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ສັນຍານ (signals) "
"ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of contacts this body has with other bodies. By default, "
"this returns 0 unless bodies are configured to monitor contacts (see [member "
"contact_monitor]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To retrieve the colliding bodies, use [method "
"get_colliding_bodies]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຈຸດສຳຜັດທີ່ວັດຖຸນີ້ມິກັບວັດຖຸອື່ນ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ 0 "
"ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວັດຖຸຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ກວດສອບຈຸດສຳຜັດ (ເບິ່ງ [member contact_monitor]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອເອົາລາຍຊື່ວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳກັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method get_colliding_bodies]."

msgid ""
"Sets the body's velocity on the given axis. The velocity in the given vector "
"axis will be set as the given vector length. This is useful for jumping "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄວາມໄວຂອງວັດຖຸໃນແກນທີ່ກຳນົດ. "
"ຄວາມໄວໃນແກນເວັກເຕີທີ່ກຳນົດຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຕາມຄວາມຍາວຂອງເວັກເຕີທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບພຶດຕິກຳການເຕັ້ນ (jumping)."

msgid ""
"Damps the body's rotation. By default, the body will use the [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/2d/default_angular_damp] setting or any value "
"override set by an [Area2D] the body is in. Depending on [member "
"angular_damp_mode], you can set [member angular_damp] to be added to or to "
"replace the body's damping value.\n"
"See [member ProjectSettings.physics/2d/default_angular_damp] for more details "
"about damping."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼຸດແຮງໝູນ (damp) ຂອງວັດຖຸ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ວັດຖຸຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/2d/default_angular_damp] ຫຼື ຄ່າໃດໆທີ່ຖືກຂ້າມໂດຍ [Area2D] "
"ທີ່ວັດຖຸນັ້ນຢູ່. ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບ [member angular_damp_mode], ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member angular_damp] "
"ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ແທນທີ່ຄ່າແຮງຕ້ານການໝູນຂອງວັດຖຸ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [member ProjectSettings.physics/2d/default_angular_damp] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແຮງຕ້ານ (damping)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the body can enter sleep mode when there is no "
"movement. See [member sleeping]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວັດຖຸສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດຫຼັບ (sleep mode) ໄດ້ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນທີ່. ເບິ່ງ "
"[member sleeping]."

msgid ""
"The body's custom center of mass, relative to the body's origin position, "
"when [member center_of_mass_mode] is set to [constant "
"CENTER_OF_MASS_MODE_CUSTOM]. This is the balanced point of the body, where "
"applied forces only cause linear acceleration. Applying forces outside of the "
"center of mass causes angular acceleration.\n"
"When [member center_of_mass_mode] is set to [constant "
"CENTER_OF_MASS_MODE_AUTO] (default value), the center of mass is "
"automatically determined, but this does not update the value of [member "
"center_of_mass]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດສູນກາງມວນ (center of mass) ແບບກຳນົດເອງຂອງວັດຖຸ, ທຽບກັບຕຳແໜ່ງກຳເນີດຂອງວັດຖຸ, ເມື່ອ "
"[member center_of_mass_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant CENTER_OF_MASS_MODE_CUSTOM]. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຈຸດສົມດຸນຂອງວັດຖຸ, ເຊິ່ງແຮງທີ່ມາກະທົບຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມເລັ່ງແນວຊື່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ການໃຫ້ແຮງຢູ່ນອກຈຸດສູນກາງມວນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມເລັ່ງການໝູນ.\n"
"ເມື່ອ [member center_of_mass_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant CENTER_OF_MASS_MODE_AUTO] "
"(ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຈຸດສູນກາງມວນຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແຕ່ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບໍ່ອັບເດດຄ່າໃນ [member "
"center_of_mass]."

msgid "Defines the way the body's center of mass is set."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຸດສູນກາງມວນຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"The body's total constant positional forces applied during each physics "
"update.\n"
"See [method add_constant_force] and [method add_constant_central_force]."
msgstr ""
"ແຮງຄົງທີ່ທັງໝົດທີ່ມາກະທົບຕໍ່ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸໃນລະຫວ່າງການອັບເດດຟີຊິກແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method add_constant_force] ແລະ [method add_constant_central_force]."

msgid ""
"The body's total constant rotational forces applied during each physics "
"update.\n"
"See [method add_constant_torque]."
msgstr ""
"ແຮງບິດຄົງທີ່ທັງໝົດທີ່ມາກະທົບຕໍ່ການໝູນຂອງວັດຖຸໃນລະຫວ່າງການອັບເດດຟີຊິກແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method add_constant_torque]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the RigidBody2D will emit signals when it collides with "
"another body.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default the maximum contacts reported is set to 0, meaning "
"nothing will be recorded, see [member max_contacts_reported]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], RigidBody2D ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອມັນຕຳກັບວັດຖຸອື່ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈຳນວນຈຸດສຳຜັດສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະລາຍງານຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ 0, "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີຫຍັງຖືກບັນທຶກ, ເບິ່ງ [member max_contacts_reported]."

msgid ""
"Continuous collision detection mode.\n"
"Continuous collision detection tries to predict where a moving body will "
"collide instead of moving it and correcting its movement after collision. "
"Continuous collision detection is slower, but more precise and misses fewer "
"collisions with small, fast-moving objects. Raycasting and shapecasting "
"methods are available."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການກວດຈັບການຕຳແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ (Continuous collision detection).\n"
"ການກວດຈັບການຕຳແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຈະພະຍາຍາມຄາດເດົາວ່າວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ຈະໄປຕຳຢູ່ໃສ "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະຍ້າຍມັນໄປກ່ອນແລ້ວຈຶ່ງມາແກ້ໄຂການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຫຼັງການຕຳ. ການກວດຈັບແບບນີ້ຈະຊ້າກວ່າ "
"ແຕ່ມີຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳກວ່າ ແລະ ຫຼຸດການພາດການຕຳກັບວັດຖຸຂະໜາດນ້ອຍທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວ. ມິວິທີການແບບ Raycasting "
"ແລະ shapecasting ໃຫ້ເລືອກໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the standard force integration (like gravity or "
"damping) will be disabled for this body. Other than collision response, the "
"body will only move as determined by the [method _integrate_forces] method, "
"if that virtual method is overridden.\n"
"Setting this property will call the method [method "
"PhysicsServer2D.body_set_omit_force_integration] internally."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການຮວມແຮງມາດຕະຖານ (ເຊັ່ນ ແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງ ຫຼື ແຮງຕ້ານ) "
"ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບວັດຖຸນີ້. ນອກຈາກການຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການຕຳແລ້ວ, ວັດຖຸຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໃນວິທີການ "
"[method _integrate_forces] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຖ້າວິທີການດັ່ງກ່າວຖືກຂຽນທັບ (overridden).\n"
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການ [method "
"PhysicsServer2D.body_set_omit_force_integration] ພາຍໃນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the body is frozen. Gravity and forces are not applied "
"anymore.\n"
"See [member freeze_mode] to set the body's behavior when frozen.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For a body that is always frozen, use [StaticBody2D] or "
"[AnimatableBody2D] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວັດຖຸຈະຖືກແຊ່ແຂງ (frozen). ແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງ ແລະ "
"ແຮງຕ່າງໆຈະບໍ່ຖືກມາກະທົບອີກຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [member freeze_mode] ເພື່ອກຳນົດພຶດຕິກຳຂອງວັດຖຸເມື່ອຖືກແຊ່ແຂງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແຊ່ແຂງຕະຫຼອດເວລາ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [StaticBody2D] ຫຼື "
"[AnimatableBody2D] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The body's freeze mode. Determines the body's behavior when [member freeze] "
"is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For a body that is always frozen, use [StaticBody2D] or "
"[AnimatableBody2D] instead."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການແຊ່ແຂງຂອງວັດຖຸ. ກຳນົດພຶດຕິກຳຂອງວັດຖຸເມື່ອ [member freeze] ເປັນ [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແຊ່ແຂງຕະຫຼອດເວລາ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [StaticBody2D] ຫຼື "
"[AnimatableBody2D] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Multiplies the gravity applied to the body. The body's gravity is calculated "
"from the [member ProjectSettings.physics/2d/default_gravity] project setting "
"and/or any additional gravity vector applied by [Area2D]s."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງທີ່ມາກະທົບຕໍ່ວັດຖຸ. ແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງຂອງວັດຖຸຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/2d/default_gravity] ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ ແລະ/ຫຼື "
"ເວັກເຕີແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງເພີ່ມເຕີມຈາກ [Area2D]."

msgid ""
"The body's moment of inertia. This is like mass, but for rotation: it "
"determines how much torque it takes to rotate the body. The moment of inertia "
"is usually computed automatically from the mass and the shapes, but this "
"property allows you to set a custom value.\n"
"If set to [code]0[/code], inertia is automatically computed (default value).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value does not change when inertia is automatically "
"computed. Use [PhysicsServer2D] to get the computed inertia.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@onready var ball = $Ball\n"
"\n"
"func get_ball_inertia():\n"
"\treturn 1.0 / "
"PhysicsServer2D.body_get_direct_state(ball.get_rid()).inverse_inertia\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"private RigidBody2D _ball;\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\t_ball = GetNode<RigidBody2D>(\"Ball\");\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private float GetBallInertia()\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn 1.0f / "
"PhysicsServer2D.BodyGetDirectState(_ball.GetRid()).InverseInertia;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ໂມເມນຄວາມເສື່ອຍ (moment of inertia) ຂອງວັດຖຸ. ນີ້ຄືກັບມວນ, ແຕ່ສຳລັບການໝູນ: "
"ມັນເປັນໂຕກຳນົດວ່າຕ້ອງໃຊ້ແຮງບິດເທົ່າໃດເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸໝູນ. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ "
"ໂມເມນຄວາມເສື່ອຍຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກມວນ ແລະ ຮູບຮ່າງ, "
"ແຕ່ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າເອງໄດ້.\n"
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/code], ຄວາມເສື່ອຍຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງເມື່ອຄວາມເສື່ອຍຖືກຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[PhysicsServer2D] ເພື່ອເອົາຄ່າຄວາມເສື່ອຍທີ່ຖືກຄິດໄລ່ອອກມາ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@onready var ball = $Ball\n"
"\n"
"func get_ball_inertia():\n"
"\treturn 1.0 / "
"PhysicsServer2D.body_get_direct_state(ball.get_rid()).inverse_inertia\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"private RigidBody2D _ball;\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\t_ball = GetNode<RigidBody2D>(\"Ball\");\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private float GetBallInertia()\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn 1.0f / "
"PhysicsServer2D.BodyGetDirectState(_ball.GetRid()).InverseInertia;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Damps the body's movement. By default, the body will use the [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/2d/default_linear_damp] setting or any value override "
"set by an [Area2D] the body is in. Depending on [member linear_damp_mode], "
"you can set [member linear_damp] to be added to or to replace the body's "
"damping value.\n"
"See [member ProjectSettings.physics/2d/default_linear_damp] for more details "
"about damping."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼຸດແຮງເຄື່ອນທີ່ (damp) ຂອງວັດຖຸ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ວັດຖຸຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/2d/default_linear_damp] ຫຼື ຄ່າໃດໆທີ່ຖືກຂ້າມໂດຍ [Area2D] "
"ທີ່ວັດຖຸນັ້ນຢູ່. ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບ [member linear_damp_mode], ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member linear_damp] "
"ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ແທນທີ່ຄ່າແຮງຕ້ານການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງວັດຖຸ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [member ProjectSettings.physics/2d/default_linear_damp] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແຮງຕ້ານ (damping)."

msgid ""
"The body's linear velocity in pixels per second. Can be used sporadically, "
"but [b]don't set this every frame[/b], because physics may run in another "
"thread and runs at a different granularity. Use [method _integrate_forces] as "
"your process loop for precise control of the body state."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວແນວຊື່ (linear velocity) ຂອງວັດຖຸເປັນພິກເຊລຕໍ່ວິນາທີ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ເປັນບາງຄັ້ງຄາວ, ແຕ່ "
"[b]ຫ້າມຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມ[/b], ເພາະລະບົບຟີຊິກອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນເທີຣດອື່ນ ແລະ "
"ເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method _integrate_forces] "
"ເປັນລູບການປະມວນຜົນຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອການຄວບຄຸມສະຖານະຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ແມ່ນຍຳ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the body cannot rotate. Gravity and forces only apply "
"linear movement."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວັດຖຸຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໝູນໄດ້. ແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງ ແລະ "
"ແຮງຕ່າງໆຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດການເຄື່ອນທີ່ແນວຊື່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of contacts that will be recorded. Requires a value "
"greater than 0 and [member contact_monitor] to be set to [code]true[/code] to "
"start to register contacts. Use [method get_contact_count] to retrieve the "
"count or [method get_colliding_bodies] to retrieve bodies that have been "
"collided with.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The number of contacts is different from the number of "
"collisions. Collisions between parallel edges will result in two contacts "
"(one at each end), and collisions between parallel faces will result in four "
"contacts (one at each corner)."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຈຸດສຳຜັດສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກ. ຕ້ອງການຄ່າທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ 0 ແລະ [member contact_monitor] "
"ຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການລົງທະບຽນຈຸດສຳຜັດ. ໃຊ້ [method "
"get_contact_count] ເພື່ອເອົາຈຳນວນ ຫຼື [method get_colliding_bodies] "
"ເພື່ອເອົາລາຍຊື່ວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຈຳນວນຈຸດສຳຜັດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຈຳນວນການຕຳ. "
"ການຕຳກັນລະຫວ່າງຂອບທີ່ຂະໜານກັນຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີສອງຈຸດສຳຜັດ (ຂ້າງລະຈຸດ), ແລະ "
"ການຕຳກັນລະຫວ່າງໜ້າພຽງທີ່ຂະໜານກັນຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີສີ່ຈຸດສຳຜັດ (ແຈລະຈຸດ)."

msgid ""
"The physics material override for the body.\n"
"If a material is assigned to this property, it will be used instead of any "
"other physics material, such as an inherited one."
msgstr ""
"ການຂ້າມຜ່ານວັດສະດຸຟີຊິກ (physics material) ສຳລັບວັດຖຸ.\n"
"ຖ້າມີການກຳນົດວັດສະດຸໃຫ້ກັບຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ມັນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແທນວັດສະດຸຟີຊິກອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ ວັດສະດຸທີ່ສືບທອດມາ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the body will not move and will not calculate forces "
"until woken up by another body through, for example, a collision, or by using "
"the [method apply_impulse] or [method apply_force] methods."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວັດຖຸຈະບໍ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ຄິດໄລ່ແຮງໃດໆ "
"ຈົນກວ່າຈະຖືກປຸກໃຫ້ຕື່ນໂດຍວັດຖຸອື່ນ ຜ່ານຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ການຕຳ, ຫຼື ໂດຍການໃຊ້ວິທີການ [method "
"apply_impulse] ຫຼື [method apply_force]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a collision with another [PhysicsBody2D] or [TileMap] occurs. "
"Requires [member contact_monitor] to be set to [code]true[/code] and [member "
"max_contacts_reported] to be set high enough to detect all the collisions. "
"[TileMap]s are detected if the [TileSet] has Collision [Shape2D]s.\n"
"[param body] the [Node], if it exists in the tree, of the other "
"[PhysicsBody2D] or [TileMap]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອເກີດການຕຳກັບ [PhysicsBody2D] ຫຼື [TileMap] ອື່ນ. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member "
"contact_monitor] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ [member max_contacts_reported] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ສູງພໍທີ່ຈະກວດຈັບການຕຳທັງໝົດ. [TileMap] ຈະຖືກກວດພົບຖ້າ [TileSet] ມີ Collision "
"[Shape2D].\n"
"[param body] ແມ່ນ [Node] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody2D] ຫຼື [TileMap] ອື່ນ (ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່ໃນ tree)."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the collision with another [PhysicsBody2D] or [TileMap] ends. "
"Requires [member contact_monitor] to be set to [code]true[/code] and [member "
"max_contacts_reported] to be set high enough to detect all the collisions. "
"[TileMap]s are detected if the [TileSet] has Collision [Shape2D]s.\n"
"[param body] the [Node], if it exists in the tree, of the other "
"[PhysicsBody2D] or [TileMap]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອການຕຳກັບ [PhysicsBody2D] ຫຼື [TileMap] ອື່ນສິ້ນສຸດລົງ. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member "
"contact_monitor] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ [member max_contacts_reported] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ສູງພໍທີ່ຈະກວດຈັບການຕຳທັງໝົດ. [TileMap] ຈະຖືກກວດພົບຖ້າ [TileSet] ມີ Collision "
"[Shape2D].\n"
"[param body] ແມ່ນ [Node] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody2D] ຫຼື [TileMap] ອື່ນ (ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່ໃນ tree)."

msgid ""
"Emitted when one of this RigidBody2D's [Shape2D]s collides with another "
"[PhysicsBody2D] or [TileMap]'s [Shape2D]s. Requires [member contact_monitor] "
"to be set to [code]true[/code] and [member max_contacts_reported] to be set "
"high enough to detect all the collisions. [TileMap]s are detected if the "
"[TileSet] has Collision [Shape2D]s.\n"
"[param body_rid] the [RID] of the other [PhysicsBody2D] or [TileSet]'s "
"[CollisionObject2D] used by the [PhysicsServer2D].\n"
"[param body] the [Node], if it exists in the tree, of the other "
"[PhysicsBody2D] or [TileMap].\n"
"[param body_shape_index] the index of the [Shape2D] of the other "
"[PhysicsBody2D] or [TileMap] used by the [PhysicsServer2D]. Get the "
"[CollisionShape2D] node with "
"[code]body.shape_owner_get_owner(body.shape_find_owner(body_shape_index))[/"
"code].\n"
"[param local_shape_index] the index of the [Shape2D] of this RigidBody2D used "
"by the [PhysicsServer2D]. Get the [CollisionShape2D] node with "
"[code]self.shape_owner_get_owner(self.shape_find_owner(local_shape_index))[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອ [Shape2D] ໜຶ່ງຂອງ RigidBody2D ນີ້ຕຳກັບ [Shape2D] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody2D] ຫຼື "
"[TileMap] ອື່ນ. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member contact_monitor] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ "
"[member max_contacts_reported] ຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ສູງພໍທີ່ຈະກວດຈັບການຕຳທັງໝົດ. [TileMap] "
"ຈະຖືກກວດພົບຖ້າ [TileSet] ມີ Collision [Shape2D].\n"
"[param body_rid] ແມ່ນ [RID] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody2D] ອື່ນ ຫຼື [CollisionObject2D] ຂອງ "
"[TileSet] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [PhysicsServer2D].\n"
"[param body] ແມ່ນ [Node] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody2D] ຫຼື [TileMap] ອື່ນ (ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່ໃນ tree).\n"
"[param body_shape_index] ແມ່ນດັດຊະນີຂອງ [Shape2D] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody2D] ຫຼື "
"[TileMap] ອື່ນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [PhysicsServer2D]. ສາມາດເອົາໂນດ [CollisionShape2D] ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
"[code]body.shape_owner_get_owner(body.shape_find_owner(body_shape_index))[/"
"code].\n"
"[param local_shape_index] ແມ່ນດັດຊະນີຂອງ [Shape2D] ຂອງ RigidBody2D ນີ້ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ "
"[PhysicsServer2D]. ສາມາດເອົາໂນດ [CollisionShape2D] ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
"[code]self.shape_owner_get_owner(self.shape_find_owner(local_shape_index))[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the collision between one of this RigidBody2D's [Shape2D]s and "
"another [PhysicsBody2D] or [TileMap]'s [Shape2D]s ends. Requires [member "
"contact_monitor] to be set to [code]true[/code] and [member "
"max_contacts_reported] to be set high enough to detect all the collisions. "
"[TileMap]s are detected if the [TileSet] has Collision [Shape2D]s.\n"
"[param body_rid] the [RID] of the other [PhysicsBody2D] or [TileSet]'s "
"[CollisionObject2D] used by the [PhysicsServer2D].\n"
"[param body] the [Node], if it exists in the tree, of the other "
"[PhysicsBody2D] or [TileMap].\n"
"[param body_shape_index] the index of the [Shape2D] of the other "
"[PhysicsBody2D] or [TileMap] used by the [PhysicsServer2D]. Get the "
"[CollisionShape2D] node with "
"[code]body.shape_owner_get_owner(body.shape_find_owner(body_shape_index))[/"
"code].\n"
"[param local_shape_index] the index of the [Shape2D] of this RigidBody2D used "
"by the [PhysicsServer2D]. Get the [CollisionShape2D] node with "
"[code]self.shape_owner_get_owner(self.shape_find_owner(local_shape_index))[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອການຕຳລະຫວ່າງ [Shape2D] ໜຶ່ງຂອງ RigidBody2D ນີ້ ແລະ [Shape2D] ຂອງ "
"[PhysicsBody2D] ຫຼື [TileMap] ອື່ນສິ້ນສຸດລົງ. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member contact_monitor] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ [member max_contacts_reported] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ສູງພໍທີ່ຈະກວດຈັບການຕຳທັງໝົດ. [TileMap] ຈະຖືກກວດພົບຖ້າ [TileSet] ມີ Collision "
"[Shape2D].\n"
"[param body_rid] ແມ່ນ [RID] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody2D] ອື່ນ ຫຼື [CollisionObject2D] ຂອງ "
"[TileSet] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [PhysicsServer2D].\n"
"[param body] ແມ່ນ [Node] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody2D] ຫຼື [TileMap] ອື່ນ (ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່ໃນ tree).\n"
"[param body_shape_index] ແມ່ນດັດຊະນີຂອງ [Shape2D] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody2D] ຫຼື "
"[TileMap] ອື່ນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [PhysicsServer2D]. ສາມາດເອົາໂນດ [CollisionShape2D] ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
"[code]body.shape_owner_get_owner(body.shape_find_owner(body_shape_index))[/"
"code].\n"
"[param local_shape_index] ແມ່ນດັດຊະນີຂອງ [Shape2D] ຂອງ RigidBody2D ນີ້ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ "
"[PhysicsServer2D]. ສາມາດເອົາໂນດ [CollisionShape2D] ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
"[code]self.shape_owner_get_owner(self.shape_find_owner(local_shape_index))[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the physics engine changes the body's sleeping state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing the value [member sleeping] will not trigger this "
"signal. It is only emitted if the sleeping state is changed by the physics "
"engine or [code]emit_signal(\"sleeping_state_changed\")[/code] is used."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອລະບົບຟີຊິກປ່ຽນສະຖານະການຫຼັບ (sleeping state) ຂອງວັດຖຸ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນຄ່າ [member sleeping] ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຈະບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດສັນຍານນີ້. "
"ມັນຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອສະຖານະການຫຼັບຖືກປ່ຽນໂດຍລະບົບຟີຊິກ ຫຼື ມີການໃຊ້ "
"[code]emit_signal(\"sleeping_state_changed\")[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Static body freeze mode (default). The body is not affected by gravity and "
"forces. It can be only moved by user code and doesn't collide with other "
"bodies along its path."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການແຊ່ແຂງແບບວັດຖຸຄົງທີ່ (Static body) (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ). ວັດຖຸຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງ ແລະ "
"ແຮງຕ່າງໆ. ມັນສາມາດຖືກຍ້າຍໄດ້ໂດຍໂຄ້ດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ "
"ຈະບໍ່ຕຳກັບວັດຖຸອື່ນໃນລະຫວ່າງເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ມັນເຄື່ອນທີ່."

msgid ""
"Kinematic body freeze mode. Similar to [constant FREEZE_MODE_STATIC], but "
"collides with other bodies along its path when moved. Useful for a frozen "
"body that needs to be animated."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການແຊ່ແຂງແບບວັດຖຸໄດນາມິກ (Kinematic body). ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [constant "
"FREEZE_MODE_STATIC], ແຕ່ຈະຕຳກັບວັດຖຸອື່ນໃນລະຫວ່າງເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ມັນເຄື່ອນທີ່. "
"ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກແຊ່ແຂງແຕ່ຍັງຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີອານິເມຊັນ."

msgid ""
"In this mode, the body's center of mass is calculated automatically based on "
"its shapes. This assumes that the shapes' origins are also their center of "
"mass."
msgstr ""
"ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ຈຸດສູນກາງມວນຂອງວັດຖຸຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍອີງຕາມຮູບຮ່າງຂອງມັນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສົມມຸດວ່າຈຸດກຳເນີດຂອງຮູບຮ່າງແມ່ນຈຸດສູນກາງມວນຂອງມັນນຳ."

msgid ""
"In this mode, the body's center of mass is set through [member "
"center_of_mass]. Defaults to the body's origin position."
msgstr ""
"ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ຈຸດສູນກາງມວນຂອງວັດຖຸຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຜ່ານ [member center_of_mass]. "
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະເປັນຕຳແໜ່ງກຳເນີດຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Continuous collision detection disabled. This is the fastest way to detect "
"body collisions, but can miss small, fast-moving objects."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການກວດຈັບການຕຳແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດໃນການກວດຈັບການຕຳຂອງວັດຖຸ, "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະພາດວັດຖຸຂະໜາດນ້ອຍທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວ."

msgid ""
"Continuous collision detection enabled using raycasting. This is faster than "
"shapecasting but less precise."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດການກວດຈັບການຕຳແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງໂດຍໃຊ້ raycasting. ວິທີນີ້ຈະໄວຄວາມ shapecasting "
"ແຕ່ມີຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳນ້ອຍກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Continuous collision detection enabled using shapecasting. This is the "
"slowest CCD method and the most precise."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດການກວດຈັບການຕຳແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງໂດຍໃຊ້ shapecasting. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີ CCD ທີ່ຊ້າທີ່ສຸດແຕ່ມີຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "A 3D physics body that is moved by a physics simulation."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 3 ມິຕິ ທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໂດຍການຈຳລອງທາງຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"[RigidBody3D] implements full 3D physics. It cannot be controlled directly, "
"instead, you must apply forces to it (gravity, impulses, etc.), and the "
"physics simulation will calculate the resulting movement, rotation, react to "
"collisions, and affect other physics bodies in its path.\n"
"The body's behavior can be adjusted via [member lock_rotation], [member "
"freeze], and [member freeze_mode]. By changing various properties of the "
"object, such as [member mass], you can control how the physics simulation "
"acts on it.\n"
"A rigid body will always maintain its shape and size, even when forces are "
"applied to it. It is useful for objects that can be interacted with in an "
"environment, such as a tree that can be knocked over or a stack of crates "
"that can be pushed around.\n"
"If you need to directly affect the body, prefer [method _integrate_forces] as "
"it allows you to directly access the physics state.\n"
"If you need to override the default physics behavior, you can write a custom "
"force integration function. See [member custom_integrator].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing the 3D transform or [member linear_velocity] of a "
"[RigidBody3D] very often may lead to some unpredictable behaviors. This also "
"happens when a [RigidBody3D] is the descendant of a constantly moving node, "
"like another [RigidBody3D], as that will cause its global transform to be set "
"whenever its ancestor moves."
msgstr ""
"[RigidBody3D] ໃຊ້ງານລະບົບຟີຊິກ 3 ມິຕິແບບເຕັມຮູບແບບ. ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍກົງ, "
"ແຕ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃຫ້ແຮງກັບມັນ (ເຊັ່ນ ແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງ, ແຮງຜັກດັນ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ), ແລະ "
"ການຈຳລອງທາງຟີຊິກຈະຄິດໄລ່ການເຄື່ອນທີ່, ການໝູນ, ການຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການຕຳ ແລະ "
"ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກອື່ນໆໃນເສັ້ນທາງຂອງມັນ.\n"
"ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງວັດຖຸສາມາດປັບໄດ້ຜ່ານ [member lock_rotation], [member freeze], ແລະ [member "
"freeze_mode]. ໂດຍການປ່ຽນແປງຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ [member mass], "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄວບຄຸມວິທີທີ່ການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກກະທຳຕໍ່ມັນ.\n"
"Rigid body ຈະຮັກສາຮູບຮ່າງ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງມັນສະເໝີ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະມີແຮງມາກະທົບກໍຕາມ. "
"ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ສາມາດໂຕ້ຕອບໄດ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ເຊັ່ນ ຕົ້ນໄມ້ທີ່ສາມາດລົ້ມໄດ້ ຫຼື "
"ກອງລັງທີ່ສາມາດຍູ້ໄປມາໄດ້.\n"
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ວັດຖຸໂດຍກົງ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method _integrate_forces] "
"ເພາະມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງສະຖານະຟີຊິກໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ.\n"
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຂ້າມພຶດຕິກຳຟີຊິກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຂຽນຟັງຊັນການຮວມແຮງແບບກຳນົດເອງໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ "
"[member custom_integrator].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນແປງ 3D transform ຫຼື [member linear_velocity] ຂອງ "
"[RigidBody3D] ດຸເກີນໄປອາດນຳໄປສູ່ພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ຄາດເດົາບໍ່ໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອ [RigidBody3D] "
"ເປັນລູກຫຼານຂອງໂນດທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ ເຊັ່ນ [RigidBody3D] ອີກໂຕໜຶ່ງ, ເພາະມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ global "
"transform ຂອງມັນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ໂນດແມ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່."

msgid ""
"Applies a rotational force without affecting position. A force is time "
"dependent and meant to be applied every physics update.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member inertia] is required for this to work. To have [member "
"inertia], an active [CollisionShape3D] must be a child of the node, or you "
"can manually set [member inertia]."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ແຮງບິດ (rotational force) ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ. ແຮງນີ້ຈະຂຶ້ນກັບເວລາ ແລະ "
"ຄວນຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການອັບເດດຟີຊິກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ້ອງມີ [member inertia] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີ [member "
"inertia], ຕ້ອງມີ [CollisionShape3D] ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເປັນໂນດລູກ, ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"inertia] ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"Applies a rotational impulse to the body without affecting the position.\n"
"An impulse is time-independent! Applying an impulse every frame would result "
"in a framerate-dependent force. For this reason, it should only be used when "
"simulating one-time impacts (use the \"_force\" functions otherwise).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member inertia] is required for this to work. To have [member "
"inertia], an active [CollisionShape3D] must be a child of the node, or you "
"can manually set [member inertia]."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ແຮງຜັກດັນການໝູນ (rotational impulse) ໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ.\n"
"ແຮງຜັກດັນແມ່ນບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບເວລາ! ການໃຫ້ແຮງຜັກດັນໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ແຮງນັ້ນຂຶ້ນກັບເຟຣມເຣດ "
"(framerate). ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, ມັນຄວນຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອຈຳລອງການກະທົບພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ "
"\"_force\").\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ້ອງມີ [member inertia] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີ [member "
"inertia], ຕ້ອງມີ [CollisionShape3D] ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເປັນໂນດລູກ, ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"inertia] ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the inverse inertia tensor basis. This is used to calculate the "
"angular acceleration resulting from a torque applied to the [RigidBody3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ inverse inertia tensor basis. ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ຄວາມເລັ່ງການໝູນ (angular "
"acceleration) ທີ່ເກີດຈາກແຮງບິດ (torque) ທີ່ມາກະທົບຕໍ່ [RigidBody3D]."

msgid "The RigidBody3D's rotational velocity in [i]radians[/i] per second."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວການໝູນຂອງ RigidBody3D ເປັນ [i]ເຣດຽນ[/i] ຕໍ່ວິນາທີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the RigidBody3D will emit signals when it collides with "
"another body.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default the maximum contacts reported is set to 0, meaning "
"nothing will be recorded, see [member max_contacts_reported]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], RigidBody3D ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອມັນຕຳກັບວັດຖຸອື່ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈຳນວນຈຸດສຳຜັດສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະລາຍງານຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ 0, "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີຫຍັງຖືກບັນທຶກ, ເບິ່ງ [member max_contacts_reported]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], continuous collision detection is used.\n"
"Continuous collision detection tries to predict where a moving body will "
"collide, instead of moving it and correcting its movement if it collided. "
"Continuous collision detection is more precise, and misses fewer impacts by "
"small, fast-moving objects. Not using continuous collision detection is "
"faster to compute, but can miss small, fast-moving objects."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການກວດຈັບການຕຳແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ (Continuous collision "
"detection).\n"
"ການກວດຈັບການຕຳແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຈະພະຍາຍາມຄາດເດົາວ່າວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ຈະໄປຕຳຢູ່ໃສ "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະຍ້າຍມັນໄປກ່ອນແລ້ວຈຶ່ງມາແກ້ໄຂການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຖ້າມັນຕຳ. ການກວດຈັບແບບນີ້ຈະມີຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳກວ່າ ແລະ "
"ຫຼຸດການພາດການກະທົບຈາກວັດຖຸຂະໜາດນ້ອຍທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວ. ການບໍ່ໃຊ້ການກວດຈັບແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຈະຄິດໄລ່ໄດ້ໄວກວ່າ "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະພາດວັດຖຸຂະໜາດນ້ອຍທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the body is frozen. Gravity and forces are not applied "
"anymore.\n"
"See [member freeze_mode] to set the body's behavior when frozen.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For a body that is always frozen, use [StaticBody3D] or "
"[AnimatableBody3D] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວັດຖຸຈະຖືກແຊ່ແຂງ (frozen). ແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງ ແລະ "
"ແຮງຕ່າງໆຈະບໍ່ຖືກມາກະທົບອີກຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [member freeze_mode] ເພື່ອກຳນົດພຶດຕິກຳຂອງວັດຖຸເມື່ອຖືກແຊ່ແຂງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແຊ່ແຂງຕະຫຼອດເວລາ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [StaticBody3D] ຫຼື "
"[AnimatableBody3D] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The body's freeze mode. Determines the body's behavior when [member freeze] "
"is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For a body that is always frozen, use [StaticBody3D] or "
"[AnimatableBody3D] instead."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການແຊ່ແຂງຂອງວັດຖຸ. ກຳນົດພຶດຕິກຳຂອງວັດຖຸເມື່ອ [member freeze] ເປັນ [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແຊ່ແຂງຕະຫຼອດເວລາ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [StaticBody3D] ຫຼື "
"[AnimatableBody3D] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The body's moment of inertia. This is like mass, but for rotation: it "
"determines how much torque it takes to rotate the body on each axis. The "
"moment of inertia is usually computed automatically from the mass and the "
"shapes, but this property allows you to set a custom value.\n"
"If set to [constant Vector3.ZERO], inertia is automatically computed (default "
"value).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value does not change when inertia is automatically "
"computed. Use [PhysicsServer3D] to get the computed inertia.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@onready var ball = $Ball\n"
"\n"
"func get_ball_inertia():\n"
"\treturn "
"PhysicsServer3D.body_get_direct_state(ball.get_rid()).inverse_inertia.inverse()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"private RigidBody3D _ball;\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\t_ball = GetNode<RigidBody3D>(\"Ball\");\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private Vector3 GetBallInertia()\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn "
"PhysicsServer3D.BodyGetDirectState(_ball.GetRid()).InverseInertia.Inverse();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ໂໂມເມນຄວາມເສື່ອຍ (moment of inertia) ຂອງວັດຖຸ. ນີ້ຄືກັບມວນ, ແຕ່ສຳລັບການໝູນ: "
"ມັນເປັນໂຕກຳນົດວ່າຕ້ອງໃຊ້ແຮງບິດເທົ່າໃດເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸໝູນໃນແຕ່ລະແກນ. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ "
"ໂມເມນຄວາມເສື່ອຍຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກມວນ ແລະ ຮູບຮ່າງ, "
"ແຕ່ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າເອງໄດ້.\n"
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant Vector3.ZERO], ຄວາມເສື່ອຍຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງເມື່ອຄວາມເສື່ອຍຖືກຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[PhysicsServer3D] ເພື່ອເອົາຄ່າຄວາມເສື່ອຍທີ່ຖືກຄິດໄລ່ອອກມາ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@onready var ball = $Ball\n"
"\n"
"func get_ball_inertia():\n"
"\treturn "
"PhysicsServer3D.body_get_direct_state(ball.get_rid()).inverse_inertia.inverse()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"private RigidBody3D _ball;\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\t_ball = GetNode<RigidBody3D>(\"Ball\");\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private Vector3 GetBallInertia()\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn "
"PhysicsServer3D.BodyGetDirectState(_ball.GetRid()).InverseInertia.Inverse();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Damps the body's movement. By default, the body will use the [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/3d/default_linear_damp] project setting or any value "
"override set by an [Area3D] the body is in. Depending on [member "
"linear_damp_mode], you can set [member linear_damp] to be added to or to "
"replace the body's damping value.\n"
"See [member ProjectSettings.physics/3d/default_linear_damp] for more details "
"about damping."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼຸດແຮງເຄື່ອນທີ່ (damp) ຂອງວັດຖຸ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ວັດຖຸຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/3d/default_linear_damp] ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ ຫຼື ຄ່າໃດໆທີ່ຖືກຂ້າມໂດຍ "
"[Area3D] ທີ່ວັດຖຸນັ້ນຢູ່. ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບ [member linear_damp_mode], ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"linear_damp] ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ແທນທີ່ຄ່າແຮງຕ້ານການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງວັດຖຸ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [member ProjectSettings.physics/3d/default_linear_damp] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແຮງຕ້ານ (damping)."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a collision with another [PhysicsBody3D] or [GridMap] occurs. "
"Requires [member contact_monitor] to be set to [code]true[/code] and [member "
"max_contacts_reported] to be set high enough to detect all the collisions. "
"[GridMap]s are detected if the [MeshLibrary] has Collision [Shape3D]s.\n"
"[param body] the [Node], if it exists in the tree, of the other "
"[PhysicsBody3D] or [GridMap]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອເກີດການຕຳກັບ [PhysicsBody3D] ຫຼື [GridMap] ອື່ນ. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member "
"contact_monitor] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ [member max_contacts_reported] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ສູງພໍທີ່ຈະກວດຈັບການຕຳທັງໝົດ. [GridMap] ຈະຖືກກວດພົບຖ້າ [MeshLibrary] ມີ Collision "
"[Shape3D].\n"
"[param body] ແມ່ນ [Node] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody3D] ຫຼື [GridMap] ອື່ນ (ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່ໃນ tree)."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the collision with another [PhysicsBody3D] or [GridMap] ends. "
"Requires [member contact_monitor] to be set to [code]true[/code] and [member "
"max_contacts_reported] to be set high enough to detect all the collisions. "
"[GridMap]s are detected if the [MeshLibrary] has Collision [Shape3D]s.\n"
"[param body] the [Node], if it exists in the tree, of the other "
"[PhysicsBody3D] or [GridMap]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອການຕຳກັບ [PhysicsBody3D] ຫຼື [GridMap] ອື່ນສິ້ນສຸດລົງ. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member "
"contact_monitor] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ [member max_contacts_reported] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ສູງພໍທີ່ຈະກວດຈັບການຕຳທັງໝົດ. [GridMap] ຈະຖືກກວດພົບຖ້າ [MeshLibrary] ມີ Collision "
"[Shape3D].\n"
"[param body] ແມ່ນ [Node] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody3D] ຫຼື [GridMap] ອື່ນ (ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່ໃນ tree)."

msgid ""
"Emitted when one of this RigidBody3D's [Shape3D]s collides with another "
"[PhysicsBody3D] or [GridMap]'s [Shape3D]s. Requires [member contact_monitor] "
"to be set to [code]true[/code] and [member max_contacts_reported] to be set "
"high enough to detect all the collisions. [GridMap]s are detected if the "
"[MeshLibrary] has Collision [Shape3D]s.\n"
"[param body_rid] the [RID] of the other [PhysicsBody3D] or [MeshLibrary]'s "
"[CollisionObject3D] used by the [PhysicsServer3D].\n"
"[param body] the [Node], if it exists in the tree, of the other "
"[PhysicsBody3D] or [GridMap].\n"
"[param body_shape_index] the index of the [Shape3D] of the other "
"[PhysicsBody3D] or [GridMap] used by the [PhysicsServer3D]. Get the "
"[CollisionShape3D] node with "
"[code]body.shape_owner_get_owner(body.shape_find_owner(body_shape_index))[/"
"code].\n"
"[param local_shape_index] the index of the [Shape3D] of this RigidBody3D used "
"by the [PhysicsServer3D]. Get the [CollisionShape3D] node with "
"[code]self.shape_owner_get_owner(self.shape_find_owner(local_shape_index))[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອ [Shape3D] ໜຶ່ງຂອງ RigidBody3D ນີ້ຕຳກັບ [Shape3D] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody3D] ຫຼື "
"[GridMap] ອື່ນ. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member contact_monitor] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ "
"[member max_contacts_reported] ຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ສູງພໍທີ່ຈະກວດຈັບການຕຳທັງໝົດ. [GridMap] "
"ຈະຖືກກວດພົບຖ້າ [MeshLibrary] ມີ Collision [Shape3D].\n"
"[param body_rid] ແມ່ນ [RID] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody3D] ອື່ນ ຫຼື [CollisionObject3D] ຂອງ "
"[MeshLibrary] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [PhysicsServer3D].\n"
"[param body] ແມ່ນ [Node] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody3D] ຫຼື [GridMap] ອື່ນ (ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່ໃນ tree).\n"
"[param body_shape_index] ແມ່ນດັດຊະນີຂອງ [Shape3D] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody3D] ຫຼື "
"[GridMap] ອື່ນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [PhysicsServer3D]. ສາມາດເອົາໂນດ [CollisionShape3D] ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
"[code]body.shape_owner_get_owner(body.shape_find_owner(body_shape_index))[/"
"code].\n"
"[param local_shape_index] ແມ່ນດັດຊະນີຂອງ [Shape3D] ຂອງ RigidBody3D ນີ້ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ "
"[PhysicsServer3D]. ສາມາດເອົາໂນດ [CollisionShape2D] ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
"[code]self.shape_owner_get_owner(self.shape_find_owner(local_shape_index))[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the collision between one of this RigidBody3D's [Shape3D]s and "
"another [PhysicsBody3D] or [GridMap]'s [Shape3D]s ends. Requires [member "
"contact_monitor] to be set to [code]true[/code] and [member "
"max_contacts_reported] to be set high enough to detect all the collisions. "
"[GridMap]s are detected if the [MeshLibrary] has Collision [Shape3D]s.\n"
"[param body_rid] the [RID] of the other [PhysicsBody3D] or [MeshLibrary]'s "
"[CollisionObject3D] used by the [PhysicsServer3D]. [GridMap]s are detected if "
"the Meshes have [Shape3D]s.\n"
"[param body] the [Node], if it exists in the tree, of the other "
"[PhysicsBody3D] or [GridMap].\n"
"[param body_shape_index] the index of the [Shape3D] of the other "
"[PhysicsBody3D] or [GridMap] used by the [PhysicsServer3D]. Get the "
"[CollisionShape3D] node with "
"[code]body.shape_owner_get_owner(body.shape_find_owner(body_shape_index))[/"
"code].\n"
"[param local_shape_index] the index of the [Shape3D] of this RigidBody3D used "
"by the [PhysicsServer3D]. Get the [CollisionShape3D] node with "
"[code]self.shape_owner_get_owner(self.shape_find_owner(local_shape_index))[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອການຕຳລະຫວ່າງ [Shape3D] ໜຶ່ງຂອງ RigidBody3D ນີ້ ແລະ [Shape3D] ຂອງ "
"[PhysicsBody3D] ຫຼື [GridMap] ອື່ນສິ້ນສຸດລົງ. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member contact_monitor] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ [member max_contacts_reported] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ສູງພໍທີ່ຈະກວດຈັບການຕຳທັງໝົດ. [GridMap] ຈະຖືກກວດພົບຖ້າ [MeshLibrary] ມີ Collision "
"[Shape3D].\n"
"[param body_rid] ແມ່ນ [RID] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody3D] ອື່ນ ຫຼື [CollisionObject3D] ຂອງ "
"[MeshLibrary] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [PhysicsServer3D].\n"
"[param body] ແມ່ນ [Node] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody3D] ຫຼື [GridMap] ອື່ນ (ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່ໃນ tree).\n"
"[param body_shape_index] ແມ່ນດັດຊະນີຂອງ [Shape3D] ຂອງ [PhysicsBody3D] ຫຼື "
"[GridMap] ອື່ນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [PhysicsServer3D]. ສາມາດເອົາໂນດ [CollisionShape3D] ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
"[code]body.shape_owner_get_owner(body.shape_find_owner(body_shape_index))[/"
"code].\n"
"[param local_shape_index] ແມ່ນດັດຊະນີຂອງ [Shape3D] ຂອງ RigidBody3D ນີ້ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ "
"[PhysicsServer3D]. ສາມາດເອົາໂນດ [CollisionShape3D] ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
"[code]self.shape_owner_get_owner(self.shape_find_owner(local_shape_index))[/"
"code]."

msgid "Editor-only helper for setting up root motion in [AnimationMixer]."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອສະເພາະໃນ Editor ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ root motion ໃນ [AnimationMixer]."

msgid ""
"[i]Root motion[/i] refers to an animation technique where a mesh's skeleton "
"is used to give impulse to a character. When working with 3D animations, a "
"popular technique is for animators to use the root skeleton bone to give "
"motion to the rest of the skeleton. This allows animating characters in a way "
"where steps actually match the floor below. It also allows precise "
"interaction with objects during cinematics. See also [AnimationMixer].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [RootMotionView] is only visible in the editor. It will be "
"hidden automatically in the running project."
msgstr ""
"[i]Root motion[/i] ໝາຍເຖິງເຕັກນິກອານິເມຊັນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂຄງກະດູກ (skeleton) ຂອງເມັດຊ໌ (mesh) "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຮງຜັກດັນກັບຕົວລະຄອນ. ເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກກັບອານິເມຊັນ 3 ມິຕິ, ເຕັກນິກທີ່ນິຍົມຄືການໃຊ້ກະດູກຫຼັກ (root "
"bone) ເພື່ອສ້າງການເຄື່ອນໄຫວໃຫ້ກັບສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງໂຄງກະດູກ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງຕົວລະຄອນສອດຄ່ອງກັບພື້ນດ້ານລຸ່ມຢ່າງແທ້ຈິງ ແລະ "
"ຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມີການໂຕ້ຕອບກັບວັດຖຸຕ່າງໆໄດ້ຢ່າງແມ່ນຍຳໃນລະຫວ່າງສາກຊີເນມາຕິກ. ເບິ່ງ [AnimationMixer] "
"ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [RootMotionView] ຈະເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ editor ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ມັນຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອໂປຣເຈັກເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid "Using AnimationTree - Root motion"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ AnimationTree - Root motion"

msgid "Path to an [AnimationMixer] node to use as a basis for root motion."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂນດ [AnimationMixer] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນພື້ນຖານສຳລັບ root motion."

msgid "The grid's cell size in 3D units."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຫ້ອງຂອງຕາໜ່າງ (grid) ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍ 3 ມິຕິ."

msgid "The grid's color."
msgstr "ສີຂອງຕາໜ່າງ."

msgid ""
"The grid's radius in 3D units. The grid's opacity will fade gradually as the "
"distance from the origin increases until this [member radius] is reached."
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີຂອງຕາໜ່າງໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍ 3 ມິຕິ. "
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງຕາໜ່າງຈະຄ່ອຍໆຈາງລົງຕາມໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກຈຸດກຳເນີດຈົນກວ່າຈະຮອດ [member radius] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the grid's points will all be on the same Y coordinate "
"([i]local[/i] Y = 0). If [code]false[/code], the points' original Y "
"coordinate is preserved."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈຸດທັງໝົດຂອງຕາໜ່າງຈະຢູ່ໃນພິກັດ Y ດຽວກັນ ([i]local[/i] Y = 0). "
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ພິກັດ Y ດັ້ງເດີມຂອງຈຸດຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້."

msgid "High-level multiplayer API implementation."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ງານ Multiplayer API ລະດັບສູງ."

msgid ""
"Clears the current SceneMultiplayer network state (you shouldn't call this "
"unless you know what you are doing)."
msgstr ""
"ລ້າງສະຖານະເຄືອຂ່າຍ SceneMultiplayer ປັດຈຸບັນ (ທ່ານບໍ່ຄວນເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ "
"ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າທ່ານຮູ້ວ່າກຳລັງເຮັດຫຍັງຢູ່)."

msgid ""
"Mark the authentication step as completed for the remote peer identified by "
"[param id]. The [signal MultiplayerAPI.peer_connected] signal will be emitted "
"for this peer once the remote side also completes the authentication. No "
"further authentication messages are expected to be received from this peer.\n"
"If a peer disconnects before completing authentication, either due to a "
"network issue, the [member auth_timeout] expiring, or manually calling "
"[method disconnect_peer], the [signal peer_authentication_failed] signal will "
"be emitted instead of [signal MultiplayerAPI.peer_disconnected]."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍວ່າຂັ້ນຕອນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (authentication) ສຳເລັດແລ້ວສຳລັບພີຣ໌ (peer) ປາຍທາງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ "
"[param id]. ສັນຍານ [signal MultiplayerAPI.peer_connected] ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກສຳລັບພີຣ໌ນີ້ "
"ເມື່ອຝ່າຍປາຍທາງສຳເລັດການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຄືກັນ. ຈະບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນອື່ນໆຖືກສົ່ງມາຈາກພີຣ໌ນີ້ອີກ.\n"
"ຖ້າພີຣ໌ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກ່ອນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຈະສຳເລັດ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຍ້ອນບັນຫາເຄືອຂ່າຍ, [member "
"auth_timeout] ໝົດເວລາ, ຫຼື ການເອີ້ນ [method disconnect_peer] ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ສັນຍານ "
"[signal peer_authentication_failed] ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກແທນ [signal "
"MultiplayerAPI.peer_disconnected]."

msgid ""
"Disconnects the peer identified by [param id], removing it from the list of "
"connected peers, and closing the underlying connection with it."
msgstr ""
"ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພີຣ໌ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param id], ລຶບມັນອອກຈາກລາຍຊື່ພີຣ໌ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່, ແລະ ປິດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບມັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the IDs of the peers currently trying to authenticate with this "
"[MultiplayerAPI]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ຂອງພີຣ໌ທີ່ກຳລັງພະຍາຍາມຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບ [MultiplayerAPI] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Sends the specified [param data] to the remote peer identified by [param id] "
"as part of an authentication message. This can be used to authenticate peers, "
"and control when [signal MultiplayerAPI.peer_connected] is emitted (and the "
"remote peer accepted as one of the connected peers)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງ [param data] ທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ກັບພີຣ໌ປາຍທາງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param id] ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງພີຣ໌ ແລະ ຄວບຄຸມວ່າເມື່ອໃດ [signal "
"MultiplayerAPI.peer_connected] ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກ (ແລະ "
"ພີຣ໌ປາຍທາງຈະຖືກຍອມຮັບເປັນໜຶ່ງໃນພີຣ໌ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່)."

msgid ""
"Sends the given raw [param bytes] to a specific peer identified by [param id] "
"(see [method MultiplayerPeer.set_target_peer]). Default ID is [code]0[/code], "
"i.e. broadcast to all peers."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງ [param bytes] ດິບທີ່ໃຫ້ມາໄປຫາພີຣ໌ສະເພາະທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param id] (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"MultiplayerPeer.set_target_peer]). ID ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [code]0[/code], ນັ້ນຄືການກະຈາຍ "
"(broadcast) ໄປຫາພີຣ໌ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the MultiplayerAPI will allow encoding and decoding of "
"object during RPCs.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Deserialized objects can contain code which gets executed. Do "
"not use this option if the serialized object comes from untrusted sources to "
"avoid potential security threat such as remote code execution."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], MultiplayerAPI ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ (encoding) ແລະ "
"ຖອດລະຫັດ (decoding) ອອບເຈັກໃນລະຫວ່າງ RPC.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ອອບເຈັກທີ່ຖືກຖອດລະຫັດ (deserialized) ສາມາດມີໂຄ້ດທີ່ຖືກປະມວນຜົນໄດ້. "
"ຫ້າມໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖ້າອອບເຈັກນັ້ນມາຈາກແຫຼ່ງທີ່ບໍ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນໄພຄຸກຄາມດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ ເຊັ່ນ "
"ການປະມວນຜົນໂຄ້ດຈາກໄລຍະໄກ (remote code execution)."

msgid ""
"The callback to execute when receiving authentication data sent via [method "
"send_auth]. If the [Callable] is empty (default), peers will be automatically "
"accepted as soon as they connect."
msgstr ""
"ຄໍແບັກ (callback) ທີ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ສົ່ງຜ່ານ [method send_auth]. ຖ້າ "
"[Callable] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ພີຣ໌ຈະຖືກຍອມຮັບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດທັນທີທີ່ພວກເຂົາເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid ""
"If set to a value greater than [code]0.0[/code], the maximum duration in "
"seconds peers can stay in the authenticating state, after which the "
"authentication will automatically fail. See the [signal peer_authenticating] "
"and [signal peer_authentication_failed] signals."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code], "
"ຈະເປັນໄລຍະເວລາສູງສຸດເປັນວິນາທີທີ່ພີຣ໌ສາມາດຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະກຳລັງຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ, "
"ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເບິ່ງສັນຍານ [signal peer_authenticating] "
"ແລະ [signal peer_authentication_failed]."

msgid ""
"Maximum size of each delta packet. Higher values increase the chance of "
"receiving full updates in a single frame, but also the chance of causing "
"networking congestion (higher latency, disconnections). See "
"[MultiplayerSynchronizer]."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງແຕ່ລະແພັກເກັດສ່ວນຕ່າງ (delta packet). "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເພີ່ມໂອກາດໃນການໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດທີ່ສົມບູນໃນເຟຣມດຽວ, "
"ແຕ່ກໍເພີ່ມໂອກາດໃນການເກີດຄວາມແອອັດຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ (ເຮັດໃຫ້ມີການດີເລສູງ ຫຼື ຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່). ເບິ່ງ "
"[MultiplayerSynchronizer]."

msgid ""
"Maximum size of each synchronization packet. Higher values increase the "
"chance of receiving full updates in a single frame, but also the chance of "
"packet loss. See [MultiplayerSynchronizer]."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງແຕ່ລະແພັກເກັດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ (synchronization packet). "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເພີ່ມໂອກາດໃນການໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດທີ່ສົມບູນໃນເຟຣມດຽວ, ແຕ່ກໍເພີ່ມໂອກາດໃນການສູນເສຍແພັກເກັດ "
"(packet loss). ເບິ່ງ [MultiplayerSynchronizer]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the MultiplayerAPI's [member "
"MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer] refuses new incoming connections."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [member MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer] ຂອງ "
"MultiplayerAPI ຈະປະຕິເສດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່ທີ່ເຂົ້າມາ."

msgid ""
"The root path to use for RPCs and replication. Instead of an absolute path, a "
"relative path will be used to find the node upon which the RPC should be "
"executed.\n"
"This effectively allows to have different branches of the scene tree to be "
"managed by different MultiplayerAPI, allowing for example to run both client "
"and server in the same scene."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງຫຼັກ (root path) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ RPC ແລະ ການຈຳລອງ (replication). "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເສັ້ນທາງແບບເຕັມ (absolute path), ມັນຈະໃຊ້ເສັ້ນທາງແບບສຳພັນ (relative path) "
"ເພື່ອຊອກຫາໂນດທີ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກ RPC.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດມີກິ່ງງ່າຕ່າງໆຂອງ Scene Tree ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍ MultiplayerAPI ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, "
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ສາມາດເປີດທັງ client ແລະ server ໃນສາກ (scene) ອັນດຽວກັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Enable or disable the server feature that notifies clients of other peers' "
"connection/disconnection, and relays messages between them. When this option "
"is [code]false[/code], clients won't be automatically notified of other peers "
"and won't be able to send them packets through the server.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing this option while other peers are connected may lead to "
"unexpected behaviors.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Support for this feature may depend on the current "
"[MultiplayerPeer] configuration. See [method "
"MultiplayerPeer.is_server_relay_supported]."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງເຊີບເວີທີ່ຈະແຈ້ງໃຫ້ client ຊາບກ່ຽວກັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່/ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງພີຣ໌ອື່ນໆ, "
"ແລະ ສົ່ງຕໍ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມລະຫວ່າງກັນ. ເມື່ອຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເປັນ [code]false[/code], client "
"ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນກ່ຽວກັບພີຣ໌ອື່ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດສົ່ງແພັກເກັດຫາພວກເຂົາຜ່ານເຊີບເວີໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ມີພີຣ໌ອື່ນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ອາດນຳໄປສູ່ພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ອາດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [MultiplayerPeer] ປັດຈຸບັນ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method MultiplayerPeer.is_server_relay_supported]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when this MultiplayerAPI's [member MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer] "
"connects to a new peer and a valid [member auth_callback] is set. In this "
"case, the [signal MultiplayerAPI.peer_connected] will not be emitted until "
"[method complete_auth] is called with given peer [param id]. While in this "
"state, the peer will not be included in the list returned by [method "
"MultiplayerAPI.get_peers] (but in the one returned by [method "
"get_authenticating_peers]), and only authentication data will be sent or "
"received. See [method send_auth] for sending authentication data."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອ [member MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer] ຂອງ MultiplayerAPI "
"ນີ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບພີຣ໌ໃໝ່ ແລະ ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member auth_callback] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ສັນຍານ "
"[signal MultiplayerAPI.peer_connected] ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກຈົນກວ່າ [method complete_auth] "
"ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ດ້ວຍ [param id] ຂອງພີຣ໌ນັ້ນ. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະນີ້, "
"ພີຣ໌ຈະບໍ່ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍຊື່ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນໂດຍ [method MultiplayerAPI.get_peers] (ແຕ່ຈະຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂອງ "
"[method get_authenticating_peers]), ແລະ ຈະມີພຽງຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງ ຫຼື "
"ຮັບ. ເບິ່ງ [method send_auth] ສຳລັບການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when this MultiplayerAPI's [member MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer] "
"disconnects from a peer for which authentication had not yet completed. See "
"[signal peer_authenticating]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອ [member MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer] ຂອງ MultiplayerAPI "
"ນີ້ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກພີຣ໌ທີ່ຍັງຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນບໍ່ສຳເລັດ. ເບິ່ງ [signal peer_authenticating]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when this MultiplayerAPI's [member MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer] "
"receives a [param packet] with custom data (see [method send_bytes]). ID is "
"the peer ID of the peer that sent the packet."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອ [member MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer] ຂອງ MultiplayerAPI ນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບ "
"[param packet] ທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນແບບກຳນົດເອງ (ເບິ່ງ [method send_bytes]). ID ແມ່ນ ID "
"ຂອງພີຣ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງແພັກເກັດນັ້ນມາ."

msgid ""
"Configuration for properties to synchronize with a [MultiplayerSynchronizer]."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆທີ່ຈະຊິງໂຄຣໄນກັບ [MultiplayerSynchronizer]."

msgid ""
"Adds the property identified by the given [param path] to the list of the "
"properties being synchronized, optionally passing an [param index].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For details on restrictions and limitations on property "
"synchronization, see [MultiplayerSynchronizer]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param path] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເຂົ້າໃນລາຍຊື່ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຈະຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ, ສາມາດເລືອກສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[param index] ໄປໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄຸນສົມບັດ, ເບິ່ງ "
"[MultiplayerSynchronizer]."

msgid "Returns a list of synchronized property [NodePath]s."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ [NodePath] ຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given [param path] is configured for "
"synchronization."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param path] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ."

msgid "Finds the index of the given [param path]."
msgstr "ຊອກຫາດັດຊະນີຂອງ [param path] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the replication mode for the property identified by the given [param "
"path]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໂໝດການຈຳລອງ (replication mode) ສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param path]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the property identified by the given [param "
"path] is configured to be synchronized on spawn."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param path] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຊິງໂຄຣໄນເມື່ອມີການສ້າງວັດຖຸ (on spawn)."

msgid "Use [method property_get_replication_mode] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method property_get_replication_mode] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the property identified by the given [param "
"path] is configured to be synchronized on process."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param path] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຊິງໂຄຣໄນໃນລະຫວ່າງການປະມວນຜົນ (on process)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the property identified by the given [param "
"path] is configured to be reliably synchronized when changes are detected on "
"process."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param path] ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຊິງໂຄຣໄນແບບໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື "
"(reliable) ເມື່ອມີການກວດພົບການປ່ຽນແປງໃນລະຫວ່າງການປະມວນຜົນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the synchronization mode for the property identified by the given [param "
"path]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງໂໝດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param path]."

msgid ""
"Sets whether the property identified by the given [param path] is configured "
"to be synchronized on spawn."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param path] ຈະຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນເມື່ອມີການສ້າງວັດຖຸ (on spawn) ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Use [method property_set_replication_mode] with [constant "
"REPLICATION_MODE_ALWAYS] instead."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method property_set_replication_mode] ຮ່ວມກັບ [constant "
"REPLICATION_MODE_ALWAYS] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Sets whether the property identified by the given [param path] is configured "
"to be synchronized on process."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param path] ຈະຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນໃນລະຫວ່າງການປະມວນຜົນ (on process) ຫຼື "
"ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Use [method property_set_replication_mode] with [constant "
"REPLICATION_MODE_ON_CHANGE] instead."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method property_set_replication_mode] ຮ່ວມກັບ [constant "
"REPLICATION_MODE_ON_CHANGE] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Sets whether the property identified by the given [param path] is configured "
"to be reliably synchronized when changes are detected on process."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param path] ຈະຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນແບບໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື (reliable) "
"ເມື່ອມີການກວດພົບການປ່ຽນແປງໃນລະຫວ່າງການປະມວນຜົນ ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Removes the property identified by the given [param path] from the "
"configuration."
msgstr "ລຶບຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param path] ອອກຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

msgid "Do not keep the given property synchronized."
msgstr "ບໍ່ໃຫ້ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ກຳນົດຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ."

msgid ""
"Replicate the given property on process by constantly sending updates using "
"unreliable transfer mode."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳລອງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ກຳນົດໃນລະຫວ່າງການປະມວນຜົນ "
"ໂດຍການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນອັບເດດຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງໂດຍໃຊ້ໂໝດການສົ່ງແບບບໍ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື (unreliable)."

msgid ""
"Replicate the given property on process by sending updates using reliable "
"transfer mode when its value changes."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳລອງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ກຳນົດໃນລະຫວ່າງການປະມວນຜົນ ໂດຍການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນອັບເດດດ້ວຍໂໝດການສົ່ງແບບໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື "
"(reliable) ເມື່ອຄ່າຂອງມັນມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "Provides access to a scene file's information."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງໄຟລ໌ສາກ (scene)."

msgid ""
"Maintains a list of resources, nodes, exported and overridden properties, and "
"built-in scripts associated with a scene. They cannot be modified from a "
"[SceneState], only accessed. Useful for peeking into what a [PackedScene] "
"contains without instantiating it.\n"
"This class cannot be instantiated directly, it is retrieved for a given scene "
"as the result of [method PackedScene.get_state]."
msgstr ""
"ຮັກສາລາຍຊື່ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນ, ໂນດ, ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກ (exported) ແລະ ຖືກຂ້າມ (overridden), "
"ລວມທັງສະຄຣິບພາຍໃນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບສາກ. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຈາກ [SceneState], "
"ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ. ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການເຂົ້າໄປເບິ່ງວ່າ [PackedScene] "
"ມີຫຍັງແດ່ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instantiating) ມັນ.\n"
"ຄລາສນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ, ມັນຈະຖືກດຶງມາສຳລັບສາກໃດໜຶ່ງຜ່ານຜົນຂອງ [method "
"PackedScene.get_state]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [SceneState] of the scene that this scene inherits from, or "
"[code]null[/code] if it doesn't inherit from any scene."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [SceneState] ຂອງສາກທີ່ສາກນີ້ສືບທອດມາ, ຫຼື ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] "
"ຖ້າມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ສືບທອດມາຈາກສາກໃດເລີຍ."

msgid "Returns the list of bound parameters for the signal at [param idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ຜູກໄວ້ (bound parameters) ສຳລັບສັນຍານຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of signal connections in the scene.\n"
"The [code]idx[/code] argument used to query connection metadata in other "
"[code]get_connection_*[/code] methods in the interval [code][0, "
"get_connection_count() - 1][/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານໃນສາກ.\n"
"ອາຄິວເມນ [code]idx[/code] ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສອບຖາມຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນວິທີການ "
"[code]get_connection_*[/code] ອື່ນໆ ໃນຊ່ວງ [code][0, get_connection_count() - 1]"
"[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the connection flags for the signal at [param idx]. See [enum "
"Object.ConnectFlags] constants."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນແຟລັກ (flags) ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳລັບສັນຍານຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx]. ເບິ່ງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ໃນ [enum "
"Object.ConnectFlags]."

msgid "Returns the method connected to the signal at [param idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເມທອດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບສັນຍານຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx]."

msgid "Returns the name of the signal at [param idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງສັນຍານຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the path to the node that owns the signal at [param idx], relative to "
"the root node."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂນດທີ່ເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງສັນຍານຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx], ທຽບກັບໂນດຫຼັກ (root node)."

msgid ""
"Returns the path to the node that owns the method connected to the signal at "
"[param idx], relative to the root node."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂນດທີ່ເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງເມທອດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບສັນຍານຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx], ທຽບກັບໂນດຫຼັກ."

msgid "Returns the number of unbound parameters for the signal at [param idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຜູກໄວ້ (unbound parameters) ສຳລັບສັນຍານຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of nodes in the scene.\n"
"The [code]idx[/code] argument used to query node data in other "
"[code]get_node_*[/code] methods in the interval [code][0, get_node_count() - "
"1][/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນໂນດໃນສາກ.\n"
"ອາຄິວເມນ [code]idx[/code] ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສອບຖາມຂໍ້ມູນໂນດໃນວິທີການ [code]get_node_*[/code] "
"ອື່ນໆ ໃນຊ່ວງ [code][0, get_node_count() - 1][/code]."

msgid "Returns the list of group names associated with the node at [param idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ຂອງກຸ່ມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂນດຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the node's index, which is its position relative to its siblings. "
"This is only relevant and saved in scenes for cases where new nodes are added "
"to an instantiated or inherited scene among siblings from the base scene. "
"Despite the name, this index is not related to the [param idx] argument used "
"here and in other methods."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນດັດຊະນີຂອງໂນດ, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງມັນເມື່ອທຽບກັບໂນດໃນລະດັບດຽວກັນ (siblings). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ແລະ "
"ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນສາກສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີການເພີ່ມໂນດໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນສາກທີ່ຖືກສ້າງເປັນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ຫຼື ສືບທອດມາ "
"ໃນທ່າມກາງໂນດລະດັບດຽວກັນຈາກສາກພື້ນຖານ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຊື່ຈະຄືກັນ, ແຕ່ດັດຊະນີນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບອາຄິວເມນ "
"[param idx] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນນີ້ ແລະ ວິທີການອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [PackedScene] for the node at [param idx] (i.e. the whole branch "
"starting at this node, with its child nodes and resources), or [code]null[/"
"code] if the node is not an instance."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [PackedScene] ສຳລັບໂນດຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx] (ໝາຍເຖິງກິ່ງງ່າທັງໝົດທີ່ເລີ່ມຈາກໂນດນີ້, "
"ພ້ອມກັບໂນດລູກ ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງມັນ), ຫຼື ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] ຖ້າໂນດນັ້ນບໍ່ແມ່ນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

msgid ""
"Returns the path to the represented scene file if the node at [param idx] is "
"an [InstancePlaceholder]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ສາກທີ່ເປັນຕົວແທນ ຖ້າໂນດຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx] ເປັນ [InstancePlaceholder]."

msgid "Returns the name of the node at [param idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງໂນດຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the path to the owner of the node at [param idx], relative to the "
"root node."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາເຈົ້າຂອງ (owner) ຂອງໂນດຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx], ທຽບກັບໂນດຫຼັກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the path to the node at [param idx].\n"
"If [param for_parent] is [code]true[/code], returns the path of the [param "
"idx] node's parent instead."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂນດຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param for_parent] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງຂອງໂນດແມ່ຂອງ [param "
"idx] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of exported or overridden properties for the node at "
"[param idx].\n"
"The [code]prop_idx[/code] argument used to query node property data in other "
"[code]get_node_property_*[/code] methods in the interval [code][0, "
"get_node_property_count() - 1][/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກ ຫຼື ຖືກຂ້າມສຳລັບໂນດຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx].\n"
"ອາຄິວເມນ [code]prop_idx[/code] ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສອບຖາມຂໍ້ມູນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດໃນວິທີການ "
"[code]get_node_property_*[/code] ອື່ນໆ ໃນຊ່ວງ [code][0, "
"get_node_property_count() - 1][/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the property at [param prop_idx] for the node at [param "
"idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດຢູ່ທີ່ [param prop_idx] ສຳລັບໂນດຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the value of the property at [param prop_idx] for the node at [param "
"idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດຢູ່ທີ່ [param prop_idx] ສຳລັບໂນດຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx]."

msgid "Returns the type of the node at [param idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນປະເພດຂອງໂນດຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx]."

msgid "Returns the resource path to the represented [PackedScene]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງຊັບພະຍາກອນ (resource path) ໄປຫາ [PackedScene] ທີ່ເປັນຕົວແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the node at [param idx] is an "
"[InstancePlaceholder]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໂນດຢູ່ທີ່ [param idx] ເປັນ [InstancePlaceholder]."

msgid ""
"If passed to [method PackedScene.instantiate], blocks edits to the scene "
"state."
msgstr "ຖ້າຖືກສົ່ງໃຫ້ [method PackedScene.instantiate], ຈະບລັອກການແກ້ໄຂສະຖານະຂອງສາກ."

msgid ""
"If passed to [method PackedScene.instantiate], provides inherited scene "
"resources to the local scene.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only available in editor builds."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຖືກສົ່ງໃຫ້ [method PackedScene.instantiate], "
"ຈະໃຫ້ບໍລິການຊັບພະຍາກອນສາກທີ່ສືບທອດມາໃຫ້ກັບສາກທ້ອງຖິ່ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ editor build ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If passed to [method PackedScene.instantiate], provides local scene resources "
"to the local scene. Only the main scene should receive the main edit state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only available in editor builds."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຖືກສົ່ງໃຫ້ [method PackedScene.instantiate], "
"ຈະໃຫ້ບໍລິການຊັບພະຍາກອນສາກທ້ອງຖິ່ນໃຫ້ກັບສາກທ້ອງຖິ່ນ. "
"ສະເພາະສາກຫຼັກເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຄວນໄດ້ຮັບສະຖານະການແກ້ໄຂຫຼັກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ editor build ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If passed to [method PackedScene.instantiate], it's similar to [constant "
"GEN_EDIT_STATE_MAIN], but for the case where the scene is being instantiated "
"to be the base of another one.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only available in editor builds."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຖືກສົ່ງໃຫ້ [method PackedScene.instantiate], ມັນຈະຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [constant "
"GEN_EDIT_STATE_MAIN], "
"ແຕ່ໃຊ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ສາກກຳລັງຖືກສ້າງເປັນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເປັນພື້ນຖານຂອງສາກອື່ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ editor build ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Manages the game loop via a hierarchy of nodes."
msgstr "ຈັດການລູບຂອງເກມ (game loop) ຜ່ານລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງໂນດ."

msgid ""
"As one of the most important classes, the [SceneTree] manages the hierarchy "
"of nodes in a scene, as well as scenes themselves. Nodes can be added, "
"fetched and removed. The whole scene tree (and thus the current scene) can be "
"paused. Scenes can be loaded, switched and reloaded.\n"
"You can also use the [SceneTree] to organize your nodes into [b]groups[/b]: "
"every node can be added to as many groups as you want to create, e.g. an "
"\"enemy\" group. You can then iterate these groups or even call methods and "
"set properties on all the nodes belonging to any given group.\n"
"[SceneTree] is the default [MainLoop] implementation used by the engine, and "
"is thus in charge of the game loop."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຖານະທີ່ເປັນຄລາສທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດໂຕໜຶ່ງ, [SceneTree] ຈະຈັດການລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງໂນດໃນສາກ, "
"ລວມທັງໂຕສາກເອງ. ໂນດສາມາດຖືກເພີ່ມ, ດຶງມາໃຊ້ ແລະ ລຶບອອກໄດ້. Scene tree ທັງໝົດ (ແລະ "
"ສາກປັດຈຸບັນ) ສາມາດຖືກຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ (pause) ໄດ້. ສາກສາມາດຖືກໂຫຼດ, ປ່ຽນ ແລະ ໂຫຼດໃໝ່ໄດ້.\n"
"ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ [SceneTree] ເພື່ອຈັດລະບຽບໂນດໃຫ້ເປັນ [b]ກຸ່ມ (groups)[/b]: "
"ທຸກໆໂນດສາມາດຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມໃດກໍໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ, ເຊັ່ນ ກຸ່ມ \"enemy\". "
"ຈາກນັ້ນເຈົ້າສາມາດວນລູບ (iterate) ກຸ່ມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ຫຼື ແມ່ນແຕ່ເອີ້ນເມທອດ ແລະ "
"ຕັ້ງຄຸນສົມບັດໃຫ້ກັບທຸກໂນດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມໃດໜຶ່ງ.\n"
"[SceneTree] ແມ່ນການໃຊ້ງານ [MainLoop] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍເອນຈິນ, ແລະ "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງມີໜ້າທີ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບໃນການຄວບຄຸມລູບຂອງເກມ."

msgid "SceneTree"
msgstr "SceneTree (ຕົ້ນໄມ້ແຫ່ງສາກ)"

msgid ""
"Calls [param method] on each node inside this tree added to the given [param "
"group]. You can pass arguments to [param method] by specifying them at the "
"end of this method call. Nodes that cannot call [param method] (either "
"because the method doesn't exist or the arguments do not match) are ignored. "
"See also [method set_group] and [method notify_group].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method acts immediately on all selected nodes at once, "
"which may cause stuttering in some performance-intensive situations.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param method] must be in snake_case when referring to "
"built-in Godot methods. Prefer using the names exposed in the "
"[code]MethodName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] on each "
"call."
msgstr ""
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [param method] ໃນແຕ່ລະໂນດພາຍໃນ tree ນີ້ທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ [param group] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດສົ່ງອາຄິວເມນໃຫ້ກັບ [param method] ໂດຍການລະບຸພວກມັນໄວ້ທີ່ຕອນທ້າຍຂອງການເອີ້ນເມທອດນີ້. "
"ໂນດທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດເອີ້ນ [param method] (ບໍ່ວ່າຍ້ອນເມທອດນັ້ນບໍ່ມີ ຫຼື ອາຄິວເມນບໍ່ກົງກັນ) ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method set_group] ແລະ [method notify_group] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຈະມີຜົນທັນທີຕໍ່ທຸກໂນດທີ່ເລືອກໃນຄັ້ງດຽວ, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການກະຕຸກ "
"(stuttering) ໃນສະຖານະການທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ປະສິດທິພາບສູງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນພາສາ C#, [param method] ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ snake_case "
"ເມື່ອອ້າງອີງເຖິງເມທອດພາຍໃນຂອງ Godot. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊື່ທີ່ເປີດເຜີຍໃນຄລາສ [code]MethodName[/"
"code] ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຈອງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສຳລັບ [StringName] ໃໝ່ໃນທຸກໆການເອີ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Calls the given [param method] on each node inside this tree added to the "
"given [param group]. Use [param flags] to customize this method's behavior "
"(see [enum GroupCallFlags]). Additional arguments for [param method] can be "
"passed at the end of this method. Nodes that cannot call [param method] "
"(either because the method doesn't exist or the arguments do not match) are "
"ignored.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Calls \"hide\" to all nodes of the \"enemies\" group, at the end of the "
"frame and in reverse tree order.\n"
"get_tree().call_group_flags(\n"
"\t\tSceneTree.GROUP_CALL_DEFERRED | SceneTree.GROUP_CALL_REVERSE,\n"
"\t\t\"enemies\", \"hide\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param method] must be in snake_case when referring to "
"built-in Godot methods. Prefer using the names exposed in the "
"[code]MethodName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] on each "
"call."
msgstr ""
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [param method] ທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ກັບທຸກໆໂນດພາຍໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ນີ້ທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ [param group] ທີ່ກຳນົດ. "
"ໃຊ້ [param flags] ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງພຶດຕິກຳຂອງວິທີການນີ້ (ເບິ່ງ [enum GroupCallFlags]). "
"ອາຄິວເມນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບ [param method] ສາມາດສົ່ງຜ່ານໄດ້ທີ່ຕອນທ້າຍຂອງວິທີການນີ້. "
"ໂນດທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [param method] ໄດ້ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນຍ້ອນວິທີການນັ້ນບໍ່ມີຢູ່ ຫຼື ອາຄິວເມນບໍ່ກົງກັນ) "
"ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ \"hide\" ໃຫ້ກັບທຸກໂນດໃນກຸ່ມ \"enemies\", ໃນຕອນທ້າຍຂອງເຟຣມ ແລະ "
"ໃນລຳດັບຕົ້ນໄມ້ແບບຍ້ອນກັບ.\n"
"get_tree().call_group_flags(\n"
"\t\tSceneTree.GROUP_CALL_DEFERRED | SceneTree.GROUP_CALL_REVERSE,\n"
"\t\t\"enemies\", \"hide\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນພາສາ C#, [param method] ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ snake_case "
"ເມື່ອອ້າງອີງເຖິງວິທີການທີ່ມີມາໃນຕົວຂອງ Godot. ຄວນເລືອກໃຊ້ຊື່ທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນຄລາສ [code]MethodName[/"
"code] ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການສ້າງ [StringName] ໃໝ່ໃນທຸກໆການເອີ້ນໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Changes the running scene to the one at the given [param path], after loading "
"it into a [PackedScene] and creating a new instance.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, [constant ERR_CANT_OPEN] if the [param "
"path] cannot be loaded into a [PackedScene], or [constant ERR_CANT_CREATE] if "
"that scene cannot be instantiated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] See [method change_scene_to_node] for details on the order of "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນສາກທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໄປເປັນສາກຕາມ [param path] ທີ່ລະບຸ, ຫຼັງຈາກໂຫຼດມັນເຂົ້າໃນ "
"[PackedScene] ແລະ ສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່.\n"
"ຄືນຄ່າ [constant OK] ຫາກສຳເລັດ, [constant ERR_CANT_OPEN] ຫາກບໍ່ສາມາດໂຫຼດ [param "
"path] ເຂົ້າໃນ [PackedScene] ໄດ້, ຫຼື [constant ERR_CANT_CREATE] "
"ຫາກສາກນັ້ນບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເບິ່ງ [method change_scene_to_node] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບລຳດັບຂອງການເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"Changes the running scene to the provided [Node]. Useful when you want to set "
"up the new scene before changing.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] if the "
"[param node] is [code]null[/code], or [constant ERR_UNCONFIGURED] if the "
"[param node] is already inside the scene tree.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Operations happen in the following order when [method "
"change_scene_to_node] is called:\n"
"1. The current scene node is immediately removed from the tree. From that "
"point, [method Node.get_tree] called on the current (outgoing) scene will "
"return [code]null[/code]. [member current_scene] will be [code]null[/code] "
"too, because the new scene is not available yet.\n"
"2. At the end of the frame, the formerly current scene, already removed from "
"the tree, will be deleted (freed from memory) and then the new scene node "
"will be added to the tree. [method Node.get_tree] and [member current_scene] "
"will be back to working as usual.\n"
"This ensures that both scenes aren't running at the same time, while still "
"freeing the previous scene in a safe way similar to [method "
"Node.queue_free].\n"
"If you want to reliably access the new scene, await the [signal "
"scene_changed] signal.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] After using this method, the [SceneTree] will take ownership "
"of the node and will free it automatically when changing scene again. Any "
"references you had to that node will become invalid."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນສາກທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໄປເປັນ [Node] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. "
"ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າສາກໃໝ່ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນ.\n"
"ຄືນຄ່າ [constant OK] ຫາກສຳເລັດ, [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] ຫາກ [param "
"node] ເປັນ [code]null[/code], ຫຼື [constant ERR_UNCONFIGURED] ຫາກ [param node] "
"ຢູ່ໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ສາກຢູ່ແລ້ວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເຮັດວຽກຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຕາມລຳດັບດັ່ງນີ້ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"change_scene_to_node]:\n"
"1. ໂນດສາກປັດຈຸບັນຈະຖືກຍ້າຍອອກຈາກຕົ້ນໄມ້ທັນທີ. ຈາກຈຸດນັ້ນ, ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method Node.get_tree] "
"ໃນສາກປັດຈຸບັນ (ທີ່ກຳລັງຈະອອກ) ຈະຄືນຄ່າເປັນ [code]null[/code]. [member current_scene] "
"ກໍຈະເປັນ [code]null[/code] ເຊັ່ນກັນ ເພາະວ່າສາກໃໝ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ.\n"
"2. ໃນຕອນທ້າຍຂອງເຟຣມ, ສາກທີ່ເຄີຍເປັນສາກປັດຈຸບັນ ເຊິ່ງຖືກຍ້າຍອອກຈາກຕົ້ນໄມ້ແລ້ວ ຈະຖືກລຶບຖິ້ມ "
"(ຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ) ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນໂນດສາກໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້. [method Node.get_tree] ແລະ "
"[member current_scene] ຈະກັບມາເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມປົກກະຕິ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທັງສອງສາກຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກພ້ອມກັນ "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຂອງສາກກ່ອນໜ້າໃນວິທີທີ່ປອດໄພ ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [method Node.queue_free].\n"
"ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າເຖິງສາກໃໝ່ຢ່າງໝັ້ນໃຈ, ໃຫ້ await ສັນຍານ [signal scene_changed].\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ຫຼັງຈາກໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້, [SceneTree] ຈະເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງໂນດ ແລະ "
"ຈະລຶບມັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນສາກອີກຄັ້ງ. ການອ້າງອີງໃດໆທີ່ທ່ານມີຕໍ່ໂນດນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Changes the running scene to a new instance of the given [PackedScene] (which "
"must be valid).\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, [constant ERR_CANT_CREATE] if the scene "
"cannot be instantiated, or [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] if the scene is "
"invalid.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] See [method change_scene_to_node] for details on the order of "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນສາກທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໄປເປັນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່ຂອງ [PackedScene] ທີ່ລະບຸ (ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງຖືກຕ້ອງ).\n"
"ຄືນຄ່າ [constant OK] ຫາກສຳເລັດ, [constant ERR_CANT_CREATE] "
"ຫາກສາກບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້, ຫຼື [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] ຫາກສາກບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເບິ່ງ [method change_scene_to_node] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບລຳດັບຂອງການເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"Returns a new [SceneTreeTimer]. After [param time_sec] in seconds have "
"passed, the timer will emit [signal SceneTreeTimer.timeout] and will be "
"automatically freed.\n"
"If [param process_always] is [code]false[/code], the timer will be paused "
"when setting [member SceneTree.paused] to [code]true[/code].\n"
"If [param process_in_physics] is [code]true[/code], the timer will update at "
"the end of the physics frame, instead of the process frame.\n"
"If [param ignore_time_scale] is [code]true[/code], the timer will ignore "
"[member Engine.time_scale] and update with the real, elapsed time.\n"
"This method is commonly used to create a one-shot delay timer, as in the "
"following example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func some_function():\n"
"\tprint(\"start\")\n"
"\tawait get_tree().create_timer(1.0).timeout\n"
"\tprint(\"end\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public async Task SomeFunction()\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print(\"start\");\n"
"\tawait ToSignal(GetTree().CreateTimer(1.0f), "
"SceneTreeTimer.SignalName.Timeout);\n"
"\tGD.Print(\"end\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The timer is always updated [i]after[/i] all of the nodes in the "
"tree. A node's [method Node._process] method would be called before the timer "
"updates (or [method Node._physics_process] if [param process_in_physics] is "
"set to [code]true[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [SceneTreeTimer] ໃໝ່. ຫຼັງຈາກເວລາ [param time_sec] ເປັນວິນາທີຜ່ານໄປ, "
"ຕົວຈັບເວລາຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານ [signal SceneTreeTimer.timeout] ແລະ ຈະຖືກລຶບຖິ້ມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"ຫາກ [param process_always] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຕົວຈັບເວລາຈະຖືກຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວເມື່ອຕັ້ງ "
"[member SceneTree.paused] ເປັນ [code]true[/code].\n"
"ຫາກ [param process_in_physics] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຕົວຈັບເວລາຈະອັບເດດໃນຕອນທ້າຍຂອງເຟຣມຟີຊິກ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນເຟຣມການປະມວນຜົນປົກກະຕິ.\n"
"ຫາກ [param ignore_time_scale] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວຈັບເວລາຈະລະເລີຍ [member "
"Engine.time_scale] ແລະ ອັບເດດຕາມເວລາຈິງທີ່ຜ່ານໄປ.\n"
"ວິທີການນີ້ມັກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຈັບເວລາການຊັກຊ້າແບບຄັ້ງດຽວ, ດັ່ງຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func some_function():\n"
"\tprint(\"start\")\n"
"\tawait get_tree().create_timer(1.0).timeout\n"
"\tprint(\"end\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public async Task SomeFunction()\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print(\"start\");\n"
"\tawait ToSignal(GetTree().CreateTimer(1.0f), \"timeout\");\n"
"\tGD.Print(\"end\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວຈັບເວລາຈະຖືກອັບເດດ [i]ຫຼັງຈາກ[/i] ທຸກໂນດໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ສະເໝີ. ວິທີການ [method "
"Node._process] ຂອງໂນດຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຕົວຈັບເວລາຈະອັບເດດ (ຫຼື [method "
"Node._physics_process] ຫາກ [param process_in_physics] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code])."

msgid ""
"Creates and returns a new [Tween] processed in this tree. The Tween will "
"start automatically on the next process frame or physics frame (depending on "
"its [enum Tween.TweenProcessMode]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A [Tween] created using this method is not bound to any [Node]. "
"It may keep working until there is nothing left to animate. If you want the "
"[Tween] to be automatically killed when the [Node] is freed, use [method "
"Node.create_tween] or [method Tween.bind_node]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ ແລະ ຄືນຄ່າ [Tween] ໃໝ່ທີ່ປະມວນຜົນໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ນີ້. Tween "
"ຈະເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນເຟຣມປະມວນຜົນ ຫຼື ເຟຣມຟີຊິກຖັດໄປ (ຂຶ້ນກັບ [enum "
"Tween.TweenProcessMode] ຂອງມັນ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [Tween] ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຜູກມັດກັບ [Node] ໃດໆ. "
"ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກຕໍ່ໄປຈົນກວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີຫຍັງເຫຼືອໃຫ້ເຄື່ອນໄຫວ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [Tween] "
"ຖືກຢຸດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອ [Node] ຖືກລຶບ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method Node.create_tween] ຫຼື [method "
"Tween.bind_node]."

msgid ""
"Returns the first [Node] found inside the tree, that has been added to the "
"given [param group], in scene hierarchy order. Returns [code]null[/code] if "
"no match is found. See also [method get_nodes_in_group]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [Node] ທຳອິດທີ່ພົບພາຍໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ ທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ [param group] ທີ່ລະບຸ, ຕາມລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງສາກ. "
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]null[/code] ຫາກບໍ່ພົບ. ເບິ່ງ [method get_nodes_in_group] ປະກອບດ້ວຍ."

msgid ""
"Returns how many physics process steps have been processed, since the "
"application started. This is [i]not[/i] a measurement of elapsed time. See "
"also [signal physics_frame]. For the number of frames rendered, see [method "
"Engine.get_process_frames]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນຂັ້ນຕອນການປະມວນຜົນຟີຊິກທີ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກໄປແລ້ວ ນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ນີ້ [i]ບໍ່ແມ່ນ[/i] "
"ການວັດແທກເວລາທີ່ຜ່ານໄປ. ເບິ່ງ [signal physics_frame] ປະກອບດ້ວຍ. "
"ສຳລັບຈຳນວນເຟຣມທີ່ສະແດງຜົນ (rendered), ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [method Engine.get_process_frames]."

msgid ""
"Searches for the [MultiplayerAPI] configured for the given path, if one does "
"not exist it searches the parent paths until one is found. If the path is "
"empty, or none is found, the default one is returned. See [method "
"set_multiplayer]."
msgstr ""
"ຄົ້ນຫາ [MultiplayerAPI] ທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ທີ່ລະບຸ, ຫາກບໍ່ມີ "
"ມັນຈະຄົ້ນຫາໃນເສັ້ນທາງລະດັບເທິງຂຶ້ນໄປຈົນກວ່າຈະພົບ. ຫາກເສັ້ນທາງຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ຫຼື ບໍ່ພົບຫຍັງເລີຍ, "
"ມັນຈະຄືນຄ່າອັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (default). ເບິ່ງ [method set_multiplayer]."

msgid "Returns the number of nodes inside this tree."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນໂນດທັງໝົດພາຍໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ນີ້."

msgid "Returns the number of nodes assigned to the given group."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນໂນດທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] containing all nodes inside this tree, that have been "
"added to the given [param group], in scene hierarchy order."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [Array] ທີ່ບັນຈຸທຸກໂນດພາຍໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ນີ້ ທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ [param group] ທີ່ລະບຸ, "
"ຕາມລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງສາກ."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of currently existing [Tween]s in the tree, including "
"paused tweens."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [Array] ຂອງ [Tween] ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ລວມທັງ tween ທີ່ຖືກຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a node added to the given group [param name] "
"exists in the tree."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກມີໂນດທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມ [param name] ທີ່ລະບຸຢູ່ໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if accessibility features are enabled, and "
"accessibility information updates are actively processed."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກຄຸນສົມບັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ (accessibility) ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ແລະ "
"ຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າເຖິງກຳລັງຖືກປະມວນຜົນຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if accessibility features are supported by the OS "
"and enabled in project settings."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກຄຸນສົມບັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ (OS) ແລະ "
"ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"Calls [method Object.notification] with the given [param notification] to all "
"nodes inside this tree added to the [param group]. See also [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/best_practices/godot_notifications.html]Godot notifications[/url] "
"and [method call_group] and [method set_group].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method acts immediately on all selected nodes at once, "
"which may cause stuttering in some performance-intensive situations."
msgstr ""
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method Object.notification] ດ້ວຍ [param notification] "
"ທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ກັບທຸກໂນດພາຍໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ນີ້ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ [param group]. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"best_practices/godot_notifications.html]Godot notifications[/url] ແລະ [method "
"call_group] ແລະ [method set_group] ປະກອບດ້ວຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຈະມີຜົນທັນທີກັບທຸກໂນດທີ່ເລືອກພ້ອມກັນ, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການກະຕຸກ "
"(stuttering) ໃນບາງສະຖານະການທີ່ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນສູງ."

msgid ""
"Calls [method Object.notification] with the given [param notification] to all "
"nodes inside this tree added to the [param group]. Use [param call_flags] to "
"customize this method's behavior (see [enum GroupCallFlags])."
msgstr ""
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method Object.notification] ດ້ວຍ [param notification] "
"ທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ກັບທຸກໂນດພາຍໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ນີ້ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ [param group]. ໃຊ້ [param call_flags] "
"ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງພຶດຕິກຳຂອງວິທີການນີ້ (ເບິ່ງ [enum GroupCallFlags])."

msgid ""
"Queues the given [param obj] to be deleted, calling its [method Object.free] "
"at the end of the current frame. This method is similar to [method "
"Node.queue_free]."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດຄິວໃຫ້ [param obj] ທີ່ລະບຸຖືກລຶບ, ໂດຍຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method Object.free] "
"ຂອງມັນໃນຕອນທ້າຍຂອງເຟຣມປັດຈຸບັນ. ວິທີການນີ້ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [method Node.queue_free]."

msgid ""
"Quits the application at the end of the current iteration, with the given "
"[param exit_code].\n"
"By convention, an exit code of [code]0[/code] indicates success, whereas any "
"other exit code indicates an error. For portability reasons, it should be "
"between [code]0[/code] and [code]125[/code] (inclusive).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On iOS this method doesn't work. Instead, as recommended by the "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/library/archive/qa/qa1561/_index.html]iOS "
"Human Interface Guidelines[/url], the user is expected to close apps via the "
"Home button."
msgstr ""
"ອອກຈາກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເມື່ອຈົບຮອບການເຮັດວຽກປັດຈຸບັນ, ດ້ວຍ [param exit_code] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"ຕາມທຳນຽມແລ້ວ, exit code ທີ່ເປັນ [code]0[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງຄວາມສຳເລັດ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ exit code "
"ອື່ນໆ ໝາຍເຖິງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນຫຼາຍລະບົບ, ມັນຄວນຈະຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/code] "
"ຫາ [code]125[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ iOS ວິທີການນີ້ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກ. ແຕ່ຕາມຄຳແນະນຳຂອງ [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/library/archive/qa/qa1561/_index.html]iOS Human Interface "
"Guidelines[/url], ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄວນຈະປິດແອັບຜ່ານປຸ່ມ Home ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Reloads the currently active scene, replacing [member current_scene] with a "
"new instance of its original [PackedScene].\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, [constant ERR_UNCONFIGURED] if no [member "
"current_scene] is defined, [constant ERR_CANT_OPEN] if [member current_scene] "
"cannot be loaded into a [PackedScene], or [constant ERR_CANT_CREATE] if the "
"scene cannot be instantiated."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດສາກທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຄືນໃໝ່, ໂດຍແທນທີ່ [member current_scene] ດ້ວຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່ຂອງ "
"[PackedScene] ດັ້ງເດີມຂອງມັນ.\n"
"ຄືນຄ່າ [constant OK] ຫາກສຳເລັດ, [constant ERR_UNCONFIGURED] ຫາກບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດ [member "
"current_scene], [constant ERR_CANT_OPEN] ຫາກ [member current_scene] "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດໂຫຼດເຂົ້າໃນ [PackedScene] ໄດ້, ຫຼື [constant ERR_CANT_CREATE] "
"ຫາກສາກບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the given [param property] to [param value] on all nodes inside this "
"tree added to the given [param group]. Nodes that do not have the [param "
"property] are ignored. See also [method call_group] and [method "
"notify_group].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method acts immediately on all selected nodes at once, "
"which may cause stuttering in some performance-intensive situations.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param property] must be in snake_case when referring to "
"built-in Godot properties. Prefer using the names exposed in the "
"[code]PropertyName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] on "
"each call."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param property] ທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ເປັນ [param value] ໃນທຸກໂນດພາຍໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ນີ້ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ [param "
"group]. ໂນດທີ່ບໍ່ມີ [param property] ນັ້ນຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ. ເບິ່ງ [method call_group] ແລະ "
"[method notify_group] ປະກອບດ້ວຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຈະມີຜົນທັນທີກັບທຸກໂນດທີ່ເລືອກພ້ອມກັນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການກະຕຸກໃນບາງສະຖານະການ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນພາສາ C#, [param property] ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ snake_case "
"ເມື່ອອ້າງອີງເຖິງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີມາໃນຕົວຂອງ Godot. ຄວນເລືອກໃຊ້ຊື່ທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນຄລາສ "
"[code]PropertyName[/code] ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການສ້າງ [StringName] ໃໝ່ໃນທຸກໆການເອີ້ນໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the given [param property] to [param value] on all nodes inside this "
"tree added to the given [param group]. Nodes that do not have the [param "
"property] are ignored. Use [param call_flags] to customize this method's "
"behavior (see [enum GroupCallFlags]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param property] must be in snake_case when referring to "
"built-in Godot properties. Prefer using the names exposed in the "
"[code]PropertyName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] on "
"each call."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param property] ທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ເປັນ [param value] ໃນທຸກໂນດພາຍໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ນີ້ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ [param "
"group]. ໂນດທີ່ບໍ່ມີ [param property] ນັ້ນຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ. ໃຊ້ [param call_flags] "
"ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງພຶດຕິກຳຂອງວິທີການນີ້ (ເບິ່ງ [enum GroupCallFlags]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນພາສາ C#, [param property] ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ snake_case "
"ເມື່ອອ້າງອີງເຖິງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີມາໃນຕົວຂອງ Godot."

msgid ""
"Sets a custom [MultiplayerAPI] with the given [param root_path] (controlling "
"also the relative subpaths), or override the default one if [param root_path] "
"is empty.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] No [MultiplayerAPI] must be configured for the subpath "
"containing [param root_path], nested custom multiplayers are not allowed. "
"I.e. if one is configured for [code]\"/root/Foo\"[/code] setting one for "
"[code]\"/root/Foo/Bar\"[/code] will cause an error.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method set_multiplayer] should be called [i]before[/i] the "
"child nodes are ready at the given [param root_path]. If multiplayer nodes "
"like [MultiplayerSpawner] or [MultiplayerSynchronizer] are added to the tree "
"before the custom multiplayer API is set, they will not work."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [MultiplayerAPI] ແບບກຳນົດເອງດ້ວຍ [param root_path] ທີ່ລະບຸ "
"(ລວມທັງການຄວບຄຸມເສັ້ນທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ), ຫຼື ແທນທີ່ອັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫາກ [param root_path] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຈະຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີ [MultiplayerAPI] ອື່ນທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ສຳລັບເສັ້ນທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ບັນຈຸ [param "
"root_path], ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ multiplayer ແບບຊ້ອນກັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ສຳລັບ "
"[code]\"/root/Foo\"[/code] ແລ້ວ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າອີກອັນສຳລັບ [code]\"/root/Foo/Bar\"[/"
"code] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method set_multiplayer] ຄວນຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [i]ກ່ອນ[/i] ທີ່ໂນດລູກໃນ [param "
"root_path] ຈະພ້ອມ (ready). ຫາກໂນດ multiplayer ເຊັ່ນ [MultiplayerSpawner] ຫຼື "
"[MultiplayerSynchronizer] ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ multiplayer API "
"ແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid "If a current scene is loaded, calling this method will unload it."
msgstr "ຫາກມີສາກປັດຈຸບັນຖືກໂຫຼດຢູ່, ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້ຈະເປັນການຖອນການໂຫຼດ (unload) ມັນອອກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the application automatically accepts quitting "
"requests.\n"
"For mobile platforms, see [member quit_on_go_back]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະຍອມຮັບຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍການປິດ (quit) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"ສຳລັບແພລດຟອມມືຖື, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [member quit_on_go_back]."

msgid ""
"The root node of the currently loaded main scene, usually as a direct child "
"of [member root]. See also [method change_scene_to_file], [method "
"change_scene_to_packed], and [method reload_current_scene].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Setting this property directly may not work as expected, as "
"it does [i]not[/i] add or remove any nodes from this tree."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດຮາກ (root node) ຂອງສາກຫຼັກທີ່ຖືກໂຫຼດຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ປົກກະຕິຈະເປັນລູກໂດຍກົງຂອງ [member "
"root]. ເບິ່ງ [method change_scene_to_file], [method change_scene_to_packed], "
"ແລະ [method reload_current_scene] ປະກອບດ້ວຍ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໂດຍກົງອາດຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້, ເພາະມັນ [i]ບໍ່ໄດ້[/i] "
"ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຍ້າຍໂນດໃດໆ ອອກຈາກຕົ້ນໄມ້ນີ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], navigation polygons will be visible when running the "
"game from the editor for debugging purposes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is not designed to be changed at run-time. "
"Changing the value of [member debug_navigation_hint] while the project is "
"running will not have the desired effect."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], navigation polygons ຈະປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນເມື່ອເປີດເກມຈາກ editor "
"ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການດີບັກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ປ່ຽນແປງໃນຂະນະທີ່ເກມເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], curves from [Path2D] and [Path3D] nodes will be visible "
"when running the game from the editor for debugging purposes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is not designed to be changed at run-time. "
"Changing the value of [member debug_paths_hint] while the project is running "
"will not have the desired effect."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ (curves) ຈາກໂນດ [Path2D] ແລະ [Path3D] "
"ຈະປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນເມື່ອເປີດເກມຈາກ editor ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການດີບັກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ປ່ຽນແປງໃນຂະນະທີ່ເກມເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"The root of the scene currently being edited in the editor. This is usually a "
"direct child of [member root].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property does nothing in release builds."
msgstr ""
"ຮາກຂອງສາກທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກແກ້ໄຂຢູ່ໃນ editor. ປົກກະຕິຈະເປັນລູກໂດຍກົງຂອງ [member root].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ ໃນການ build ແບບ release."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] (default value), enables automatic polling of the "
"[MultiplayerAPI] for this SceneTree during [signal process_frame].\n"
"If [code]false[/code], you need to manually call [method MultiplayerAPI.poll] "
"to process network packets and deliver RPCs. This allows running RPCs in a "
"different loop (e.g. physics, thread, specific time step) and for manual "
"[Mutex] protection when accessing the [MultiplayerAPI] from threads."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການກວດສອບ (polling) ອັດຕະໂນມັດຂອງ "
"[MultiplayerAPI] ສຳລັບ SceneTree ນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງ [signal process_frame].\n"
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]false[/code], ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method MultiplayerAPI.poll] "
"ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນແພັກເກັດເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ສົ່ງ RPC. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດລັນ RPC "
"ໃນລູບບາງຢ່າງທີ່ຕ່າງອອກໄປ (ເຊັ່ນ ຟີຊິກ, ເທຣດ, ຫຼື ຊ່ວງເວລາສະເພາະ) ແລະ ສຳລັບການປ້ອງກັນດ້ວຍ "
"[Mutex] ເມື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ [MultiplayerAPI] ຈາກເທຣດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the scene tree is considered paused. This causes the "
"following behavior:\n"
"- 2D and 3D physics will be stopped, as well as collision detection and "
"related signals.\n"
"- Depending on each node's [member Node.process_mode], their [method "
"Node._process], [method Node._physics_process] and [method Node._input] "
"callback methods may not called anymore."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົ້ນໄມ້ສາກຈະຖືກຖືວ່າຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດພຶດຕິກຳດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"- ຟີຊິກ 2D ແລະ 3D ຈະຖືກຢຸດ, ລວມທັງການກວດຈັບການຕຳ ແລະ ສັນຍານທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"
"- ຂຶ້ນກັບ [member Node.process_mode] ຂອງແຕ່ລະໂນດ, ວິທີການຄໍແບັກ [method "
"Node._process], [method Node._physics_process] ແລະ [method Node._input] "
"ຂອງພວກມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the renderer will interpolate the transforms of objects "
"(both physics and non-physics) between the last two transforms, so that "
"smooth motion is seen even when physics ticks do not coincide with rendered "
"frames.\n"
"The default value of this property is controlled by [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/common/physics_interpolation].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Although this is a global setting, finer control of individual "
"branches of the [SceneTree] is possible using [member "
"Node.physics_interpolation_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວສະແດງຜົນ (renderer) ຈະເຮັດການແຊກຄ່າ (interpolate) "
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸ (ທັງຟີຊິກ ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນຟີຊິກ) ລະຫວ່າງສອງຕຳແໜ່ງຫຼ້າສຸດ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວທີ່ລື່ນໄຫຼ "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຮອບຂອງຟີຊິກຈະບໍ່ກົງກັບເຟຣມການສະແດງຜົນກໍຕາມ.\n"
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ [member ProjectSettings.physics/common/"
"physics_interpolation].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບທົ່ວໂລກ (global), "
"ແຕ່ທ່ານກໍສາມາດຄວບຄຸມແຕ່ລະກິ່ງງ່າຂອງ [SceneTree] ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member "
"Node.physics_interpolation_mode]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the application quits automatically when navigating "
"back (e.g. using the system \"Back\" button on Android).\n"
"To handle 'Go Back' button when this option is disabled, use [constant "
"DisplayServer.WINDOW_EVENT_GO_BACK_REQUEST]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະປິດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອກົດຍ້ອນກັບ (ເຊັ່ນ ການໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ "
"\"Back\" ຂອງລະບົບໃນ Android).\n"
"ເພື່ອຈັດການປຸ່ມ 'Go Back' ເມື່ອປິດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [constant "
"DisplayServer.WINDOW_EVENT_GO_BACK_REQUEST]."

msgid ""
"The tree's root [Window]. This is top-most [Node] of the scene tree, and is "
"always present. An absolute [NodePath] always starts from this node. Children "
"of the root node may include the loaded [member current_scene], as well as "
"any [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/singletons_autoload.html]AutoLoad[/"
"url] configured in the Project Settings.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Do not delete this node. This will result in unstable "
"behavior, followed by a crash."
msgstr ""
"ຮາກ [Window] ຂອງຕົ້ນໄມ້. ນີ້ແມ່ນ [Node] ລະດັບສູງສຸດຂອງຕົ້ນໄມ້ສາກ ແລະ ຈະມີຢູ່ສະເໝີ. "
"ເສັ້ນທາງໂນດແບບເຕັມ (absolute [NodePath]) ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກໂນດນີ້ສະເໝີ. "
"ລູກຂອງໂນດຮາກອາດຈະລວມມີ [member current_scene] ທີ່ຖືກໂຫຼດຢູ່, ລວມທັງ [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/scripting/singletons_autoload.html]AutoLoad[/url] ໃດໆ ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ໃນ "
"Project Settings.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ຫ້າມລຶບໂນດນີ້ເດັດຂາດ. ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ບໍ່ຄົງທີ່ ແລະ ຕາມມາດ້ວຍການຄ້າງ "
"(crash)."

msgid "Emitted when the [param node] enters this tree."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [param node] ເຂົ້າສູ່ຕົ້ນໄມ້ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the [param node]'s [method Node.update_configuration_warnings] "
"is called. Only emitted in the editor."
msgstr ""
"ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [method Node.update_configuration_warnings] ຂອງ [param node] "
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້. ສົ່ງສັນຍານສະເພາະໃນ editor ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Emitted when the [param node] exits this tree."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [param node] ອອກຈາກຕົ້ນໄມ້ນີ້."

msgid "Emitted when the [param node]'s [member Node.name] is changed."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [member Node.name] ຂອງ [param node] ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted immediately before [method Node._physics_process] is called on every "
"node in this tree."
msgstr ""
"ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານທັນທີກ່ອນທີ່ [method Node._physics_process] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆໂນດໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Emitted immediately before [method Node._process] is called on every node in "
"this tree."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານທັນທີກ່ອນທີ່ [method Node._process] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆໂນດໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Emitted after the new scene is added to scene tree and initialized. Can be "
"used to reliably access [member current_scene] when changing scenes.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# This code should be inside an autoload.\n"
"get_tree().change_scene_to_file(other_scene_path)\n"
"await get_tree().scene_changed\n"
"print(get_tree().current_scene) # Prints the new scene.\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານຫຼັງຈາກສາກໃໝ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ສາກ ແລະ ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ "
"[member current_scene] ໄດ້ຢ່າງໝັ້ນໃຈເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນສາກ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# ໂຄ້ດນີ້ຄວນຢູ່ໃນ autoload.\n"
"get_tree().change_scene_to_file(other_scene_path)\n"
"await get_tree().scene_changed\n"
"print(get_tree().current_scene) # ຈະສະແດງສາກໃໝ່.\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Emitted any time the tree's hierarchy changes (nodes being moved, renamed, "
"etc.)."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງຕົ້ນໄມ້ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ (ໂນດຖືກຍ້າຍ, ປ່ຽນຊື່, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ)."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the [member Node.process_mode] of any node inside the tree is "
"changed. Only emitted in the editor, to update the visibility of disabled "
"nodes."
msgstr ""
"ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [member Node.process_mode] ຂອງໂນດໃດໜຶ່ງພາຍໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. "
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານສະເພາະໃນ editor ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເພື່ອອັບເດດການສະແດງຜົນຂອງໂນດທີ່ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Call nodes within a group with no special behavior (default)."
msgstr "ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂນດພາຍໃນກຸ່ມໂດຍບໍ່ມີພຶດຕິກຳພິເສດ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"Call nodes within a group in reverse tree hierarchy order (all nested "
"children are called before their respective parent nodes)."
msgstr "ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂນດພາຍໃນກຸ່ມຕາມລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງຕົ້ນໄມ້ແບບຍ້ອນກັບ (ລູກທັງໝົດຈະຖືກເອີ້ນກ່ອນໂນດພໍ່ແມ່)."

msgid ""
"Call nodes within a group at the end of the current frame (can be either "
"process or physics frame), similar to [method Object.call_deferred]."
msgstr ""
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂນດພາຍໃນກຸ່ມໃນຕອນທ້າຍຂອງເຟຣມປັດຈຸບັນ (ອາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງເຟຣມ process ຫຼື ຟີຊິກ), ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ "
"[method Object.call_deferred]."

msgid ""
"Call nodes within a group only once, even if the call is executed many times "
"in the same frame. Must be combined with [constant GROUP_CALL_DEFERRED] to "
"work.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Different arguments are not taken into account. Therefore, when "
"the same call is executed with different arguments, only the first call will "
"be performed."
msgstr ""
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂນດພາຍໃນກຸ່ມພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງໃນເຟຣມດຽວກັນ. ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ "
"[constant GROUP_CALL_DEFERRED] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອາຄິວເມນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳມາພິຈາລະນາ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ເມື່ອມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແບບດຽວກັນດ້ວຍອາຄິວເມນທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, ຈະມີພຽງການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄັ້ງທຳອິດເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດ."

msgid "One-shot timer."
msgstr "ຕົວຈັບເວລາແບບຄັ້ງດຽວ."

msgid ""
"A one-shot timer managed by the scene tree, which emits [signal timeout] on "
"completion. See also [method SceneTree.create_timer].\n"
"As opposed to [Timer], it does not require the instantiation of a node. "
"Commonly used to create a one-shot delay timer as in the following example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func some_function():\n"
"\tprint(\"Timer started.\")\n"
"\tawait get_tree().create_timer(1.0).timeout\n"
"\tprint(\"Timer ended.\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public async Task SomeFunction()\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print(\"Timer started.\");\n"
"\tawait ToSignal(GetTree().CreateTimer(1.0f), "
"SceneTreeTimer.SignalName.Timeout);\n"
"\tGD.Print(\"Timer ended.\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"The timer will be dereferenced after its time elapses. To preserve the timer, "
"you can keep a reference to it. See [RefCounted].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The timer is processed after all of the nodes in the current "
"frame, i.e. node's [method Node._process] method would be called before the "
"timer (or [method Node._physics_process] if [code]process_in_physics[/code] "
"in [method SceneTree.create_timer] has been set to [code]true[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຈັບເວລາແບບເຮັດວຽກເທື່ອດຽວ (one-shot timer) ທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍ scene tree, ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານ "
"[signal timeout] ເມື່ອສຳເລັດ. ເບິ່ງ [method SceneTree.create_timer] ປະກອບນຳ.\n"
"ກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ [Timer], ມັນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງໂນດ. "
"ມັກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຈັບເວລາໜ່ວງແບບເທື່ອດຽວດັ່ງຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func some_function():\n"
"\tprint(\"ເລີ່ມຕົວຈັບເວລາ.\")\n"
"\tawait get_tree().create_timer(1.0).timeout\n"
"\tprint(\"ສິ້ນສຸດຕົວຈັບເວລາ.\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public async Task SomeFunction()\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print(\"ເລີ່ມຕົວຈັບເວລາ.\");\n"
"\tawait ToSignal(GetTree().CreateTimer(1.0f), "
"SceneTreeTimer.SignalName.Timeout);\n"
"\tGD.Print(\"ສິ້ນສຸດຕົວຈັບເວລາ.\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ຕົວຈັບເວລາຈະຖືກຖອນການອ້າງອີງ (dereferenced) ຫຼັງຈາກເວລາໝົດ. ເພື່ອຮັກສາຕົວຈັບເວລາໄວ້, "
"ທ່ານສາມາດເກັບການອ້າງອີງໃສ່ມັນໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [RefCounted].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວຈັບເວລາຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນຫຼັງຈາກທຸກໂນດໃນເຟຣມປັດຈຸບັນ, ເຊັ່ນ: ເມທອດ [method "
"Node._process] ຂອງໂນດຈະຖືກເອີ້ນກ່ອນຕົວຈັບເວລາ (ຫຼື [method Node._physics_process] ຫາກ "
"[code]process_in_physics[/code] ໃນ [method SceneTree.create_timer] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code])."

msgid "The time remaining (in seconds)."
msgstr "ເວລາທີ່ເຫຼືອ (ເປັນວິນາທີ)."

msgid "Emitted when the timer reaches 0."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຕົວຈັບເວລາຮອດ 0."

msgid "A class stored as a resource."
msgstr "ຄລາສທີ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເປັນຊັບພະຍາກອນ (resource)."

msgid ""
"A class stored as a resource. A script extends the functionality of all "
"objects that instantiate it.\n"
"This is the base class for all scripts and should not be used directly. "
"Trying to create a new script with this class will result in an error.\n"
"The [code]new[/code] method of a script subclass creates a new instance. "
"[method Object.set_script] extends an existing object, if that object's class "
"matches one of the script's base classes."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສທີ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເປັນຊັບພະຍາກອນ. ສະຄຣິບຈະຂະຫຍາຍການເຮັດວຽກຂອງທຸກວັດຖຸທີ່ສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງມັນ.\n"
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບທຸກສະຄຣິບ ແລະ ບໍ່ຄວນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍກົງ. "
"ການພະຍາຍາມສ້າງສະຄຣິບໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຄລາສນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ.\n"
"ວິທີການ [code]new[/code] ຂອງຄລາສຍ່ອຍສະຄຣິບຈະສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່. [method "
"Object.set_script] ຈະຂະຫຍາຍວັດຖຸທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, "
"ຫາກຄລາສຂອງວັດຖຸນັ້ນກົງກັບໜຶ່ງໃນຄລາສພື້ນຖານຂອງສະຄຣິບ."

msgid "Scripting documentation index"
msgstr "ດັດຊະນີເອກະສານການຂຽນສະຄຣິບ"

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the script can be instantiated."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກສະຄຣິບສາມາດສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້."

msgid "Returns the script directly inherited by this script."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າສະຄຣິບທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສືບທອດໂດຍກົງຈາກສະຄຣິບນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the class name associated with the script, if there is one. Returns "
"an empty string otherwise.\n"
"To give the script a global name, you can use the [code]class_name[/code] "
"keyword in GDScript and the [code][GlobalClass][/code] attribute in C#.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"class_name MyNode\n"
"extends Node\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"[GlobalClass]\n"
"public partial class MyNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຊື່ຄລາສທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບສະຄຣິບ, ຫາກມີ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະຄືນຄ່າເປັນສະຕຣິງຫວ່າງເປົ່າ.\n"
"ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຊື່ສະຄຣິບໃຫ້ເປັນຊື່ທົ່ວໂລກ (global name), ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄີເວີດ [code]class_name[/code] "
"ໃນ GDScript ແລະ ແອດທຣິບິວ [code][GlobalClass][/code] ໃນ C#.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"class_name MyNode\n"
"extends Node\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"[GlobalClass]\n"
"public partial class MyNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Returns the script's base type."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າປະເພດພື້ນຖານ (base type) ຂອງສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Dictionary] mapping method names to their RPC configuration "
"defined by this script."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [Dictionary] ທີ່ຈັບຄູ່ຊື່ວິທີການ ກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ RPC ຂອງພວກມັນທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍສະຄຣິບນີ້."

msgid "Returns a dictionary containing constant names and their values."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ dictionary ທີ່ບັນຈຸຊື່ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ ແລະ ຄ່າຂອງພວກມັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of methods in this [Script].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The dictionaries returned by this method are formatted "
"identically to those returned by [method Object.get_method_list]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າລາຍຊື່ວິທີການໃນ [Script] ນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] dictionary ທີ່ຄືນມາໂດຍວິທີການນີ້ແມ່ນຖືກຈັດຮູບແບບຄືກັນກັບອັນທີ່ຄືນມາໂດຍ [method "
"Object.get_method_list]."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of properties in this [Script].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The dictionaries returned by this method are formatted "
"identically to those returned by [method Object.get_property_list]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າລາຍຊື່ຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ [Script] ນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] dictionary ທີ່ຄືນມາໂດຍວິທີການນີ້ແມ່ນຖືກຈັດຮູບແບບຄືກັນກັບອັນທີ່ຄືນມາໂດຍ [method "
"Object.get_property_list]."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of signals defined in this [Script].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The dictionaries returned by this method are formatted "
"identically to those returned by [method Object.get_signal_list]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າລາຍຊື່ສັນຍານທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ [Script] ນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] dictionary ທີ່ຄືນມາໂດຍວິທີການນີ້ແມ່ນຖືກຈັດຮູບແບບຄືກັນກັບອັນທີ່ຄືນມາໂດຍ [method "
"Object.get_signal_list]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the script, or a base class, defines a method "
"with the given name."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກສະຄຣິບ ຫຼື ຄລາສພື້ນຖານ ມີການກຳນົດວິທີການດ້ວຍຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the script, or a base class, defines a signal "
"with the given name."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກສະຄຣິບ ຫຼື ຄລາສພື້ນຖານ ມີການກຳນົດສັນຍານດ້ວຍຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the script contains non-empty source code.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If a script does not have source code, this does not mean that "
"it is invalid or unusable. For example, a [GDScript] that was exported with "
"binary tokenization has no source code, but still behaves as expected and "
"could be instantiated. This can be checked with [method can_instantiate]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກສະຄຣິບມີຊອດໂຄ້ດ (source code) ທີ່ບໍ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກສະຄຣິບບໍ່ມີຊອດໂຄ້ດ, ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ, [GDScript] "
"ທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກ (exported) ດ້ວຍ binary tokenization ຈະບໍ່ມີຊອດໂຄ້ດ ແຕ່ຍັງຄົງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມປົກກະຕິ."

msgid "Compare this script with [method Object.get_script] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ປຽບທຽບສະຄຣິບນີ້ດ້ວຍ [method Object.get_script] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param base_object] is an instance of this "
"script."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ [param base_object] ເປັນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງສະຄຣິບນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the script is an abstract script. An abstract "
"script does not have a constructor and cannot be instantiated."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກສະຄຣິບເປັນສະຄຣິບແບບ abstract. ສະຄຣິບແບບ abstract "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີຄອນສະຕຣັກເຕີ (constructor) ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the script is a tool script. A tool script can "
"run in the editor."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກສະຄຣິບເປັນ tool script. tool script ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກພາຍໃນ "
"editor ໄດ້."

msgid "Reloads the script's class implementation. Returns an error code."
msgstr "ໂຫຼດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງຄລາສສະຄຣິບຄືນໃໝ່. ຄືນຄ່າລະຫັດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (error code)."

msgid ""
"The script source code or an empty string if source code is not available. "
"When set, does not reload the class implementation automatically."
msgstr ""
"ຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງສະຄຣິບ ຫຼື ສະຕຣິງຫວ່າງເປົ່າຫາກບໍ່ມີຊອດໂຄ້ດ. ເມື່ອມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ໂຫຼດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງຄລາສຄືນໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid "A captured backtrace of a specific script language."
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກ backtrace ຂອງພາສາສະຄຣິບທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"[ScriptBacktrace] holds an already captured backtrace of a specific script "
"language, such as GDScript or C#, which are captured using [method "
"Engine.capture_script_backtraces].\n"
"See [member ProjectSettings.debug/settings/gdscript/always_track_call_stacks] "
"and [member ProjectSettings.debug/settings/gdscript/"
"always_track_local_variables] for ways of controlling the contents of this "
"class."
msgstr ""
"[ScriptBacktrace] ເກັບຮັກສາ backtrace ທີ່ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ແລ້ວຂອງພາສາສະຄຣິບສະເພາະ ເຊັ່ນ "
"GDScript ຫຼື C#, ເຊິ່ງຖືກບັນທຶກໂດຍໃຊ້ [method Engine.capture_script_backtraces]."

msgid ""
"Converts the backtrace to a [String], where the entire string will be "
"indented by [param indent_all] number of spaces, and the individual stack "
"frames will be additionally indented by [param indent_frames] number of "
"spaces.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Calling [method Object.to_string] on a [ScriptBacktrace] will "
"produce the same output as calling [method format] with all parameters left "
"at their default values."
msgstr ""
"ແປງ backtrace ເປັນ [String], ໂດຍທີ່ສະຕຣິງທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ (indent) ດ້ວຍຈຳນວນຊ່ອງຫວ່າງ "
"[param indent_all], ແລະ ແຕ່ລະ stack frame ຈະຖືກຫຍໍ້ໜ້າເພີ່ມຕື່ມດ້ວຍຈຳນວນ [param "
"indent_frames]."

msgid "Returns the number of stack frames in the backtrace."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນ stack frames ໃນ backtrace."

msgid ""
"Returns the file name of the call site represented by the stack frame at the "
"specified index."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຂອງຈຸດທີ່ມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ທີ່ສະແດງໂດຍ stack frame ຕາມອິນເດັກທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the function called at the stack frame at the specified "
"index."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຊື່ຂອງຟັງຊັນທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນ stack frame ຕາມອິນເດັກທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the line number of the call site represented by the stack frame at "
"the specified index."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າເລກແຖວຂອງຈຸດທີ່ມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ທີ່ສະແດງໂດຍ stack frame ຕາມອິນເດັກທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of global variables (e.g. autoload singletons) in the "
"backtrace.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This will be non-zero only if the [code]include_variables[/code] "
"parameter was [code]true[/code] when capturing the backtrace with [method "
"Engine.capture_script_backtraces]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນຕົວປ່ຽນທົ່ວໂລກ (global variables - ເຊັ່ນ autoload singletons) ໃນ backtrace."

msgid "Returns the name of the global variable at the specified index."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຊື່ຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນທົ່ວໂລກຕາມອິນເດັກທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the value of the global variable at the specified index.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] With GDScript backtraces, the returned [Variant] will be the "
"variable's actual value, including any object references. This means that "
"storing the returned [Variant] will prevent any such object from being "
"deallocated, so it's generally recommended not to do so."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນທົ່ວໂລກຕາມອິນເດັກທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ສຳລັບ GDScript backtrace, [Variant] ທີ່ຄືນມາຈະເປັນຄ່າຕົວຈິງຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນ, "
"ລວມທັງການອ້າງອີງວັດຖຸໃດໆ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການເກັບ [Variant] ທີ່ຄືນມານັ້ນ "
"ຈະປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ວັດຖຸດັ່ງກ່າວຖືກຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຮັດແບບນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the script language that this backtrace was captured from."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຊື່ຂອງພາສາສະຄຣິບທີ່ backtrace ນີ້ຖືກບັນທຶກມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of local variables in the stack frame at the specified "
"index.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This will be non-zero only if the [code]include_variables[/code] "
"parameter was [code]true[/code] when capturing the backtrace with [method "
"Engine.capture_script_backtraces]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນຕົວປ່ຽນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local variables) ໃນ stack frame ຕາມອິນເດັກທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the local variable at the specified [param "
"variable_index] in the stack frame at the specified [param frame_index]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຊື່ຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນທ້ອງຖິ່ນຕາມ [param variable_index] ໃນ stack frame ຕາມ [param "
"frame_index] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the value of the local variable at the specified [param "
"variable_index] in the stack frame at the specified [param frame_index].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] With GDScript backtraces, the returned [Variant] will be the "
"variable's actual value, including any object references. This means that "
"storing the returned [Variant] will prevent any such object from being "
"deallocated, so it's generally recommended not to do so."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນທ້ອງຖິ່ນຕາມ [param variable_index] ໃນ stack frame ຕາມ [param "
"frame_index] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of member variables in the stack frame at the specified "
"index.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This will be non-zero only if the [code]include_variables[/code] "
"parameter was [code]true[/code] when capturing the backtrace with [method "
"Engine.capture_script_backtraces]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກ (member variables) ໃນ stack frame ຕາມອິນເດັກທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the member variable at the specified [param "
"variable_index] in the stack frame at the specified [param frame_index]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຊື່ຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກຕາມ [param variable_index] ໃນ stack frame ຕາມ [param "
"frame_index] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the value of the member variable at the specified [param "
"variable_index] in the stack frame at the specified [param frame_index].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] With GDScript backtraces, the returned [Variant] will be the "
"variable's actual value, including any object references. This means that "
"storing the returned [Variant] will prevent any such object from being "
"deallocated, so it's generally recommended not to do so."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກຕາມ [param variable_index] ໃນ stack frame ຕາມ [param "
"frame_index] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the backtrace has no stack frames."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ backtrace ບໍ່ມີ stack frame."

msgid "Godot editor's popup dialog for creating new [Script] files."
msgstr "ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ (dialog) ປັອບອັບຂອງ Godot editor ສຳລັບການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ [Script] ໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"The [ScriptCreateDialog] creates script files according to a given template "
"for a given scripting language. The standard use is to configure its fields "
"prior to calling one of the [method Window.popup] methods.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar dialog = ScriptCreateDialog.new();\n"
"\tdialog.config(\"Node\", \"res://new_node.gd\") # For in-engine types.\n"
"\tdialog.config(\"\\\"res://base_node.gd\\\"\", \"res://derived_node.gd\") # "
"For script types.\n"
"\tdialog.popup_centered()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar dialog = new ScriptCreateDialog();\n"
"\tdialog.Config(\"Node\", \"res://NewNode.cs\"); // For in-engine types.\n"
"\tdialog.Config(\"\\\"res://BaseNode.cs\\\"\", \"res://DerivedNode.cs\"); // "
"For script types.\n"
"\tdialog.PopupCentered();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"[ScriptCreateDialog] ໃຊ້ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ສະຄຣິບຕາມເທັມເພລດ (template) "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດສຳລັບພາສາສະຄຣິບທີ່ເລືອກ."

msgid "Prefills required fields to configure the ScriptCreateDialog for use."
msgstr "ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງທີ່ຈຳເປັນລ່ວງໜ້າເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ ScriptCreateDialog ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Emitted when the user clicks the OK button."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ OK."

msgid "Godot editor's script editor."
msgstr "ຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ (script editor) ຂອງ Godot editor."

msgid ""
"Godot editor's script editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class shouldn't be instantiated directly. Instead, access "
"the singleton using [method EditorInterface.get_script_editor]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບຂອງ Godot editor.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄລາສນີ້ບໍ່ຄວນຖືກສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໂດຍກົງ. ແຕ່ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຜ່ານ singleton ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[method EditorInterface.get_script_editor] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Removes the documentation for the given [param script].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This should be called whenever the script is changed to keep the "
"open documentation state up to date."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບເອກະສານ (documentation) ສຳລັບ [param script] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວນຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງສະຄຣິບເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະຖານະຂອງເອກະສານທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Closes the file at the given [param path], discarding any unsaved changes.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success or [constant ERR_FILE_NOT_FOUND] if the file "
"is not found."
msgstr ""
"ປິດໄຟລ໌ຕາມ [param path] ທີ່ລະບຸ, ໂດຍຈະຖິ້ມການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆ ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ບັນທຶກ.\n"
"ຄືນຄ່າ [constant OK] ຫາກສຳເລັດ ຫຼື [constant ERR_FILE_NOT_FOUND] ຫາກບໍ່ພົບໄຟລ໌."

msgid "Returns array of breakpoints."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າອາເຣ (array) ຂອງຈຸດຢຸດ (breakpoints)."

msgid ""
"Returns the [ScriptEditorBase] object that the user is currently editing."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າວັດຖຸ [ScriptEditorBase] ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Returns a [Script] that is currently active in editor."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [Script] ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໃນ editor."

msgid ""
"Returns an array with all [ScriptEditorBase] objects which are currently open "
"in editor."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າອາເຣທີ່ບັນຈຸວັດຖຸ [ScriptEditorBase] ທັງໝົດທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ໃນ editor."

msgid ""
"Returns an array with all [Script] objects which are currently open in editor."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າອາເຣທີ່ບັນຈຸວັດຖຸ [Script] ທັງໝົດທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ໃນ editor."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of file paths of scripts with unsaved changes open in the "
"editor."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າອາເຣຂອງເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ສະຄຣິບທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນບັນທຶກ."

msgid ""
"Opens help for the given topic. The [param topic] is an encoded string that "
"controls which class, method, constant, signal, annotation, property, or "
"theme item should be focused.\n"
"The supported [param topic] formats include [code]class_name:class[/code], "
"[code]class_method:class:method[/code], [code]class_constant:class:constant[/"
"code], [code]class_signal:class:signal[/code], "
"[code]class_annotation:class:@annotation[/code], "
"[code]class_property:class:property[/code], and "
"[code]class_theme_item:class:item[/code], where [code]class[/code] is the "
"class name, [code]method[/code] is the method name, [code]constant[/code] is "
"the constant name, [code]signal[/code] is the signal name, [code]annotation[/"
"code] is the annotation name, [code]property[/code] is the property name, and "
"[code]item[/code] is the theme item.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Shows help for the Node class.\n"
"class_name:Node\n"
"# Shows help for the global min function.\n"
"# Global objects are accessible in the `@GlobalScope` namespace, shown here.\n"
"class_method:@GlobalScope:min\n"
"# Shows help for get_viewport in the Node class.\n"
"class_method:Node:get_viewport\n"
"# Shows help for the Input constant MOUSE_BUTTON_MIDDLE.\n"
"class_constant:Input:MOUSE_BUTTON_MIDDLE\n"
"# Shows help for the BaseButton signal pressed.\n"
"class_signal:BaseButton:pressed\n"
"# Shows help for the CanvasItem property visible.\n"
"class_property:CanvasItem:visible\n"
"# Shows help for the GDScript annotation export.\n"
"# Annotations should be prefixed with the `@` symbol in the descriptor, as "
"shown here.\n"
"class_annotation:@GDScript:@export\n"
"# Shows help for the GraphNode theme item named panel_selected.\n"
"class_theme_item:GraphNode:panel_selected\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດວິທີໃຊ້ (help) ສຳລັບຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ລະບຸ. [param topic] "
"ແມ່ນສະຕຣິງທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄວ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມວ່າຈະໃຫ້ໂຟກັສໄປທີ່ຄລາສ, ວິທີການ, ຄ່າຄົງທີ່, ສັນຍານ, ແອນໂນເທຊັນ, "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດ ຫຼື ລາຍການທິມ (theme item) ໃດ."

msgid "Goes to the specified line in the current script."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖວທີ່ລະບຸໃນສະຄຣິບປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Opens the script create dialog. The script will extend [param base_name]. The "
"file extension can be omitted from [param base_path]. It will be added based "
"on the selected scripting language."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໄດອາລັອກສ້າງສະຄຣິບ. ສະຄຣິບຈະສືບທອດມາຈາກ [param base_name]. "
"ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍໄຟລ໌ສາມາດລະເວັ້ນໄດ້ຈາກ [param base_path] "
"ເຊິ່ງມັນຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃຫ້ໂດຍອີງຕາມພາສາສະຄຣິບທີ່ເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"Registers the [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] to the editor, the "
"[EditorSyntaxHighlighter] will be available on all open scripts.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Does not apply to scripts that are already opened."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນ [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] ເຂົ້າໃນ editor, [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] "
"ຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບທຸກສະຄຣິບທີ່ເປີດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບສະຄຣິບທີ່ເປີດໄວ້ກ່ອນແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Reloads all currently opened files. This should be used when opened files are "
"changed outside of the script editor. The user may be prompted to resolve "
"file conflicts, see [member EditorSettings.text_editor/behavior/files/"
"auto_reload_scripts_on_external_change]."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດທຸກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຄືນໃໝ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ເມື່ອໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຈາກພາຍນອກ editor."

msgid "Saves all open scripts."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກທຸກສະຄຣິບທີ່ເປີດຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Unregisters the [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] from the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] will still be applied to scripts "
"that are already opened."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນ [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] ອອກຈາກ editor."

msgid ""
"Updates the documentation for the given [param script].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This should be called whenever the script is changed to keep the "
"open documentation state up to date."
msgstr "ອັບເດດເອກະສານສຳລັບ [param script] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when user changed active script. Argument is a freshly activated "
"[Script]."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ່ຽນສະຄຣິບທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່. ອາຄິວເມນແມ່ນ [Script] ທີ່ຫາສໍ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when editor is about to close the active script. Argument is a "
"[Script] that is going to be closed."
msgstr ""
"ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ editor ກຳລັງຈະປິດສະຄຣິບທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່. ອາຄິວເມນແມ່ນ [Script] ທີ່ກຳລັງຈະຖືກປິດ."

msgid "Base editor for editing scripts in the [ScriptEditor]."
msgstr "ຕົວແກ້ໄຂພື້ນຖານສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບໃນ [ScriptEditor]."

msgid ""
"Base editor for editing scripts in the [ScriptEditor]. This does not include "
"documentation items."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແກ້ໄຂພື້ນຖານສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບໃນ [ScriptEditor]. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ລວມເຖິງລາຍການເອກະສານ "
"(documentation items)."

msgid "Adds an [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] to the open script."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ [EditorSyntaxHighlighter] ເຂົ້າໃນສະຄຣິບທີ່ເປີດຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the underlying [Control] used for editing scripts. For text scripts, "
"this is a [CodeEdit]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [Control] ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ. ສຳລັບສະຄຣິບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຄື [CodeEdit]."

msgid "Emitted after script validation."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານຫຼັງຈາກການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ (validation) ຂອງສະຄຣິບ."

msgid "Emitted when the user requests a specific documentation page."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮ້ອງຂໍເປີດໜ້າເອກະສານສະເພາະ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the user requests to view a specific method of a script, similar "
"to [signal request_open_script_at_line]."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮ້ອງຂໍເບິ່ງວິທີການ (method) ສະເພາະຂອງສະຄຣິບ."

msgid "Emitted after script validation or when the edited resource has changed."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານຫຼັງຈາກການກວດສອບສະຄຣິບ ຫຼື ເມື່ອຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ແກ້ໄຂຢູ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the user request to find and replace text in the file system."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ແທນທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌."

msgid "Emitted when the user requests contextual help."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮ້ອງຂໍວິທີໃຊ້ຕາມບໍລິບົດ (contextual help)."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the user requests to view a specific line of a script, similar "
"to [signal go_to_method]."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮ້ອງຂໍເບິ່ງແຖວສະເພາະຂອງສະຄຣິບ."

msgid "Emitted when the user request to search text in the file system."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ຄົ້ນຫາຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"Return the expected argument count for the given [param method], or "
"[code]null[/code] if it can't be determined (which will then fall back to the "
"default behavior)."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນອາຄິວເມນທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ສຳລັບ [param method] ທີ່ລະບຸ, ຫຼື [code]null[/code] "
"ຫາກບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້."

msgid "This method is not called by the engine."
msgstr "ວິທີການນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວເຄື່ອງ (engine)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the script is an abstract script. Abstract "
"scripts cannot be instantiated directly, instead other scripts should inherit "
"them. Abstract scripts will be either unselectable or hidden in the Create "
"New Node dialog (unselectable if there are non-abstract classes inheriting "
"it, otherwise hidden)."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກສະຄຣິບເປັນສະຄຣິບແບບ abstract. ສະຄຣິບແບບ abstract "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ."

msgid "Returns the source associated with a given debug stack position."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາ (source) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຕຳແໜ່ງ stack ການດີບັກທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the line where the function is defined in the code, or [code]-1[/"
"code] if the function is not present."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າແຖວທີ່ຟັງຊັນຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນໂຄ້ດ, ຫຼື [code]-1[/code] ຫາກບໍ່ພົບຟັງຊັນ."

msgid "Abstract base class for scrollbars."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານແບບ abstract ສຳລັບແຖບເລື່ອນ (scrollbars)."

msgid ""
"Abstract base class for scrollbars, typically used to navigate through "
"content that extends beyond the visible area of a control. Scrollbars are "
"[Range]-based controls."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານແບບ abstract ສຳລັບແຖບເລື່ອນ, "
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລື່ອນເບິ່ງເນື້ອຫາທີ່ເກີນຂອບເຂດທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ຂອງຄອນໂທຣລ. ແຖບເລື່ອນເປັນຄອນໂທຣລທີ່ອີງຕາມ "
"[Range]."

msgid ""
"Overrides the step used when clicking increment and decrement buttons or when "
"using arrow keys when the [ScrollBar] is focused."
msgstr ""
"ແທນທີ່ຄ່າຂັ້ນຕອນ (step) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອຄລິກປຸ່ມເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດ ຫຼື ເມື່ອໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລູກສອນເມື່ອ [ScrollBar] ຖືກໂຟກັສ."

msgid "Emitted when the scrollbar is being scrolled."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອແຖບເລື່ອນກຳລັງຖືກເລື່ອນ."

msgid ""
"Icon used as a button to scroll the [ScrollBar] left/up. Supports custom step "
"using the [member ScrollBar.custom_step] property."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນປຸ່ມເພື່ອເລື່ອນ [ScrollBar] ໄປທາງຊ້າຍ/ຂຶ້ນເທິງ. ຮອງຮັບການກຳນົດຂັ້ນຕອນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[member ScrollBar.custom_step]."

msgid "Displayed when the mouse cursor hovers over the decrement button."
msgstr "ຈະສະແດງຜົນເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົ້າວາງຢູ່ເທິງປຸ່ມຫຼຸດ (decrement button)."

msgid "Displayed when the decrement button is being pressed."
msgstr "ຈະສະແດງຜົນເມື່ອປຸ່ມຫຼຸດກຳລັງຖືກກົດ."

msgid ""
"Icon used as a button to scroll the [ScrollBar] right/down. Supports custom "
"step using the [member ScrollBar.custom_step] property."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນປຸ່ມເພື່ອເລື່ອນ [ScrollBar] ໄປທາງຂວາ/ລົງລຸ່ມ."

msgid "Displayed when the mouse cursor hovers over the increment button."
msgstr "ຈະສະແດງຜົນເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົ້າວາງຢູ່ເທິງປຸ່ມເພີ່ມ (increment button)."

msgid "Displayed when the increment button is being pressed."
msgstr "ຈະສະແດງຜົນເມື່ອປຸ່ມເພີ່ມກຳລັງຖືກກົດ."

msgid ""
"Used as texture for the grabber, the draggable element representing current "
"scroll."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເປັນເທັກເຈີ (texture) ສຳລັບຕົວຈັບ (grabber), "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນສ່ວນທີ່ສາມາດລາກໄດ້ເພື່ອສະແດງການເລື່ອນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Used when the mouse hovers over the grabber."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເມື່ອເມົ້າວາງຢູ່ເທິງຕົວຈັບ."

msgid "Used when the grabber is being dragged."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເມື່ອຕົວຈັບກຳລັງຖືກລາກ."

msgid "Used as background of this [ScrollBar]."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເປັນພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງ [ScrollBar] ນີ້."

msgid "Used as background when the [ScrollBar] has the GUI focus."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເປັນພື້ນຫຼັງເມື່ອ [ScrollBar] ໄດ້ຮັບໂຟກັສ GUI."

msgid "A container used to provide scrollbars to a child control when needed."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີ (container) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະໜອງແຖບເລື່ອນໃຫ້ກັບຄອນໂທຣລລູກເມື່ອຈຳເປັນ."

msgid ""
"A container used to provide a child control with scrollbars when needed. "
"Scrollbars will automatically be drawn at the right (for vertical) or bottom "
"(for horizontal) and will enable dragging to move the viewable Control (and "
"its children) within the ScrollContainer. Scrollbars will also automatically "
"resize the grabber based on the [member Control.custom_minimum_size] of the "
"Control relative to the ScrollContainer."
msgstr ""
"ຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະໜອງແຖບເລື່ອນໃຫ້ກັບຄອນໂທຣລລູກເມື່ອຈຳເປັນ. "
"ແຖບເລື່ອນຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຢູ່ທາງຂວາ (ແນວຕັ້ງ) ຫຼື ທາງລຸ່ມ (ແນວນອນ)."

msgid ""
"Ensures the given [param control] is visible (must be a direct or indirect "
"child of the ScrollContainer). Used by [member follow_focus].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This will not work on a node that was just added during the same "
"frame. If you want to scroll to a newly added child, you must wait until the "
"next frame using [signal SceneTree.process_frame]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"add_child(child_node)\n"
"await get_tree().process_frame\n"
"ensure_control_visible(child_node)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ [param control] ທີ່ລະບຸສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ (ຕ້ອງເປັນລູກໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ທາງອ້ອມຂອງ "
"ScrollContainer)."

msgid ""
"Returns the horizontal scrollbar [HScrollBar] of this [ScrollContainer].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it may "
"cause a crash. If you wish to disable or hide a scrollbar, you can use "
"[member horizontal_scroll_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າແຖບເລື່ອນແນວນອນ [HScrollBar] ຂອງ [ScrollContainer] ນີ້.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນໂນດພາຍໃນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ການຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ລຶບມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການ crash ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the vertical scrollbar [VScrollBar] of this [ScrollContainer].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it may "
"cause a crash. If you wish to disable or hide a scrollbar, you can use "
"[member vertical_scroll_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າແຖບເລື່ອນແນວຕັ້ງ [VScrollBar] ຂອງ [ScrollContainer] ນີ້.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນໂນດພາຍໃນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [theme_item focus] is drawn when the ScrollContainer or "
"one of its descendant nodes is focused."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], [theme_item focus] ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມເມື່ອ ScrollContainer ຫຼື "
"ໂນດລູກຫຼານຂອງມັນຖືກໂຟກັສ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the ScrollContainer will automatically scroll to "
"focused children (including indirect children) to make sure they are fully "
"visible."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ScrollContainer "
"ຈະເລື່ອນໄປຫາໂນດລູກທີ່ຖືກໂຟກັສໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Controls whether horizontal scrollbar can be used and when it should be "
"visible."
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມວ່າຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ແຖບເລື່ອນແນວນອນໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່ ແລະ ຄວນໃຫ້ມັນສະແດງອອກມາເມື່ອໃດ."

msgid ""
"Deadzone for touch scrolling. Lower deadzone makes the scrolling more "
"sensitive."
msgstr ""
"ເຂດຕາຍ (Deadzone) ສຳລັບການເລື່ອນດ້ວຍການສຳຜັດ. ຄ່າ deadzone "
"ທີ່ຕ່ຳຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການເລື່ອນມີຄວາມອ່ອນໄຫວຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The current horizontal scroll value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you are setting this value in the [method Node._ready] "
"function or earlier, it needs to be wrapped with [method "
"Object.set_deferred], since scroll bar's [member Range.max_value] is not "
"initialized yet.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tset_deferred(\"scroll_horizontal\", 600)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr "ຄ່າການເລື່ອນແນວນອນໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the mouse wheel scrolls the view horizontally, and "
"holding [kbd]Shift[/kbd] scrolls vertically.\n"
"If [code]false[/code] (default), the mouse wheel scrolls the view vertically, "
"and holding [kbd]Shift[/kbd] scrolls horizontally."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລູກກິ້ງເມົ້າຈະເລື່ອນມຸມມອງໃນແນວນອນ, ແລະ ການກົດ [kbd]Shift[/"
"kbd] ຄ້າງໄວ້ຈະເລື່ອນໃນແນວຕັ້ງ."

msgid ""
"Overrides the [member ScrollBar.custom_step] used when clicking the internal "
"scroll bar's horizontal increment and decrement buttons or when using arrow "
"keys when the [ScrollBar] is focused."
msgstr "ແທນທີ່ [member ScrollBar.custom_step] ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເລື່ອນແນວນອນ."

msgid ""
"The current vertical scroll value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting it early needs to be deferred, just like in [member "
"scroll_horizontal].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tset_deferred(\"scroll_vertical\", 600)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr "ຄ່າການເລື່ອນແນວຕັ້ງໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Overrides the [member ScrollBar.custom_step] used when clicking the internal "
"scroll bar's vertical increment and decrement buttons or when using arrow "
"keys when the [ScrollBar] is focused."
msgstr "ແທນທີ່ [member ScrollBar.custom_step] ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເລື່ອນແນວຕັ້ງ."

msgid ""
"Controls whether vertical scrollbar can be used and when it should be visible."
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມວ່າຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ແຖບເລື່ອນແນວຕັ້ງໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່ ແລະ ຄວນໃຫ້ມັນສະແດງອອກມາເມື່ອໃດ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when scrolling stops when dragging the scrollable area [i]with a "
"touch event[/i]. This signal is [i]not[/i] emitted when scrolling by dragging "
"the scrollbar, scrolling with the mouse wheel or scrolling with keyboard/"
"gamepad events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This signal is only emitted on Android or iOS, or on desktop/web "
"platforms when [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_touch_from_mouse] is enabled."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອການເລື່ອນຢຸດລົງໃນຂະນະທີ່ລາກພື້ນທີ່ເລື່ອນ [i]ດ້ວຍການສຳຜັດ[/i]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when scrolling starts when dragging the scrollable area [i]with a "
"touch event[/i]. This signal is [i]not[/i] emitted when scrolling by dragging "
"the scrollbar, scrolling with the mouse wheel or scrolling with keyboard/"
"gamepad events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This signal is only emitted on Android or iOS, or on desktop/web "
"platforms when [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_touch_from_mouse] is enabled."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອການເລື່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂຶ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ລາກພື້ນທີ່ເລື່ອນ [i]ດ້ວຍການສຳຜັດ[/i]."

msgid "Scrolling disabled, scrollbar will be invisible."
msgstr "ປິດການເລື່ອນ, ແຖບເລື່ອນຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"Scrolling enabled, scrollbar will be visible only if necessary, i.e. "
"container's content is bigger than the container."
msgstr "ເປີດການເລື່ອນ, ແຖບເລື່ອນຈະສະແດງເມື່ອຈຳເປັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ ເມື່ອເນື້ອຫາໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຄອນເທນເນີ)."

msgid "Scrolling enabled, scrollbar will be always visible."
msgstr "ເປີດການເລື່ອນ, ແຖບເລື່ອນຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນຕະຫຼອດເວລາ."

msgid "Scrolling enabled, scrollbar will be hidden."
msgstr "ເປີດການເລື່ອນ, ແຕ່ແຖບເລື່ອນຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Combines [constant SCROLL_MODE_AUTO] and [constant SCROLL_MODE_SHOW_ALWAYS]. "
"The scrollbar is only visible if necessary, but the content size is adjusted "
"as if it was always visible. It's useful for ensuring that content size stays "
"the same regardless if the scrollbar is visible."
msgstr ""
"ລວມ [constant SCROLL_MODE_AUTO] ແລະ [constant SCROLL_MODE_SHOW_ALWAYS] ເຂົ້າກັນ."

msgid ""
"Behaves like [constant SCROLL_MODE_AUTO], but makes the [ScrollContainer] "
"report a minimum size based on its content (limited by [member "
"Control.custom_maximum_size] when set on the corresponding axis). This allows "
"it to grow first and only start scrolling once constrained."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບ [constant SCROLL_MODE_AUTO], ແຕ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ [ScrollContainer] "
"ລາຍງານຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດໂດຍອີງຕາມເນື້ອຫາຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Scroll hints will be shown at the top and bottom (if vertical), or left and "
"right (if horizontal)."
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳການເລື່ອນຈະສະແດງຢູ່ທາງເທິງ ແລະ ລຸ່ມ (ແນວຕັ້ງ), ຫຼື ຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຂວາ (ແນວນອນ)."

msgid ""
"Scroll hints will be shown at the top (if vertical), or the left (if "
"horizontal)."
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳການເລື່ອນຈະສະແດງຢູ່ທາງເທິງ (ແນວຕັ້ງ), ຫຼື ທາງຊ້າຍ (ແນວນອນ)."

msgid ""
"Scroll hints will be shown at the bottom (if horizontal), or the right (if "
"horizontal)."
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳການເລື່ອນຈະສະແດງຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມ (ແນວນອນ), ຫຼື ທາງຂວາ (ແນວນອນ)."

msgid ""
"[Color] used to modulate the [theme_item scroll_hint_horizontal] texture."
msgstr "[Color] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບສີ (modulate) ເທັກເຈີ [theme_item scroll_hint_horizontal]."

msgid "[Color] used to modulate the [theme_item scroll_hint_vertical] texture."
msgstr "[Color] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບສີເທັກເຈີ [theme_item scroll_hint_vertical]."

msgid ""
"The space between the ScrollContainer's vertical scroll bar and its content, "
"in pixels. No space will be added when the content's minimum size is larger "
"than the ScrollContainer's size."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງແຖບເລື່ອນແນວຕັ້ງຂອງ ScrollContainer ກັບເນື້ອຫາຂອງມັນ, ເປັນພິກເຊວ."

msgid ""
"The space between the ScrollContainer's horizontal scroll bar and its "
"content, in pixels. No space will be added when the content's minimum size is "
"larger than the ScrollContainer's size."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງແຖບເລື່ອນແນວນອນຂອງ ScrollContainer ກັບເນື້ອຫາຂອງມັນ, ເປັນພິກເຊວ."

msgid ""
"The indicator that will be shown when the content can still be scrolled "
"horizontally. See [member scroll_hint_mode]."
msgstr "ຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ທີ່ຈະສະແດງອອກມາເມື່ອເນື້ອຫາຍັງສາມາດເລື່ອນໃນແນວນອນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The indicator that will be shown when the content can still be scrolled "
"vertically. See [member scroll_hint_mode]."
msgstr "ຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ທີ່ຈະສະແດງອອກມາເມື່ອເນື້ອຫາຍັງສາມາດເລື່ອນໃນແນວຕັ້ງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The focus border [StyleBox] of the [ScrollContainer]. Only used if [member "
"draw_focus_border] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຂອບໂຟກັສ [StyleBox] ຂອງ [ScrollContainer]. ຈະໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member "
"draw_focus_border] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid "The background [StyleBox] of the [ScrollContainer]."
msgstr "ພື້ນຫຼັງ [StyleBox] ຂອງ [ScrollContainer]."

msgid "A 2D line segment shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນຊື່ 2D ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳທາງຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"A 2D line segment shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to provide "
"a shape for a [CollisionShape2D]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນຊື່ 2D ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນທາງຟີຊິກ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປັນຮູບຊົງໃຫ້ກັບ [CollisionShape2D]."

msgid "The segment's first point position."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດທຳອິດຂອງສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນຊື່."

msgid "The segment's second point position."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດທີສອງຂອງສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນຊື່."

msgid ""
"A synchronization mechanism used to control access to a shared resource by "
"[Thread]s."
msgstr ""
"ກົນໄກການປະສານງານ (synchronization) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມການເຂົ້າເຖິງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໂດຍ "
"[Thread]."

msgid ""
"A synchronization semaphore that can be used to synchronize multiple "
"[Thread]s. Initialized to zero on creation. For a binary version, see "
"[Mutex].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Semaphores must be used carefully to avoid deadlocks.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] To guarantee that the operating system is able to perform "
"proper cleanup (no crashes, no deadlocks), these conditions must be met:\n"
"- When a [Semaphore]'s reference count reaches zero and it is therefore "
"destroyed, no threads must be waiting on it.\n"
"- When a [Thread]'s reference count reaches zero and it is therefore "
"destroyed, it must not be waiting on any semaphore."
msgstr ""
"Semaphore ສຳລັບການປະສານງານທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຊິງໂຄຣໄນຫຼາຍ [Thread] ເຂົ້າກັນ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ Semaphores ດ້ວຍຄວາມລະມັດລະວັງເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການເກີດ deadlock."

msgid ""
"Lowers the [Semaphore], allowing one thread in, or more if [param count] is "
"specified."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼຸດຄ່າ [Semaphore] ລົງ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເທຣດໜຶ່ງເຂົ້າໄປໄດ້, ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນຫາກມີການລະບຸ [param count]."

msgid ""
"Like [method wait], but won't block, so if the value is zero, fails "
"immediately and returns [code]false[/code]. If non-zero, it returns "
"[code]true[/code] to report success."
msgstr ""
"ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [method wait], ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ທຳການບລັອກ (block), ດັ່ງນັ້ນຫາກຄ່າເປັນສູນ ມັນຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວທັນທີ ແລະ "
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]false[/code]."

msgid "Waits for the [Semaphore], if its value is zero, blocks until non-zero."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າ [Semaphore], ຫາກຄ່າຂອງມັນເປັນສູນ ມັນຈະບລັອກໄວ້ຈົນກວ່າຄ່າຈະບໍ່ເປັນສູນ."

msgid ""
"A 2D ray shape used for physics collision that tries to separate itself from "
"any collider."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງລັງສີ (ray shape) 2D ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳທາງຟີຊິກ ເຊິ່ງຈະພະຍາຍາມແຍກຕົວເອງອອກຈາກວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳ."

msgid ""
"A 2D ray shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to provide a shape "
"for a [CollisionShape2D]. When a [SeparationRayShape2D] collides with an "
"object, it tries to separate itself from it by moving its endpoint to the "
"collision point. For example, a [SeparationRayShape2D] next to a character "
"can allow it to instantly move up when touching stairs."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງລັງສີ 2D. ເມື່ອ [SeparationRayShape2D] ຕຳກັບວັດຖຸ, "
"ມັນຈະພະຍາຍາມແຍກຕົວອອກໂດຍການຍ້າຍຈຸດປາຍໄປຫາຈຸດທີ່ຕຳ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ໃຊ້ກັບຕົວລະຄອນເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນຂຶ້ນຂັ້ນໄດໄດ້ທັນທີ."

msgid "The ray's length."
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວຂອງລັງສີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code] (default), the shape always separates and returns a "
"normal along its own direction.\n"
"If [code]true[/code], the shape can return the correct normal and separate in "
"any direction, allowing sliding motion on slopes."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]false[/code] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຮູບຊົງຈະແຍກຕົວອອກ ແລະ ຄືນຄ່າ normal "
"ຕາມທິດທາງຂອງມັນເອງສະເໝີ.\n"
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຮູບຊົງສາມາດຄືນຄ່າ normal ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ "
"ແຍກຕົວອອກໃນທິດທາງໃດກໍໄດ້, ເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດເຄື່ອນທີ່ແບບສະໄລ້ເທິງທາງລາດຊັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"A 3D ray shape used for physics collision that tries to separate itself from "
"any collider."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງລັງສີ 3D ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳທາງຟີຊິກ ເຊິ່ງຈະພະຍາຍາມແຍກຕົວເອງອອກຈາກວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳ."

msgid ""
"A 3D ray shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to provide a shape "
"for a [CollisionShape3D]. When a [SeparationRayShape3D] collides with an "
"object, it tries to separate itself from it by moving its endpoint to the "
"collision point. For example, a [SeparationRayShape3D] next to a character "
"can allow it to instantly move up when touching stairs."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງລັງສີ 3D ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນທາງຟີຊິກ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປັນຮູບຊົງໃຫ້ກັບ [CollisionShape3D]."

msgid "Abstract base class for separators."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານແບບ abstract ສຳລັບຕົວແຍກ (separators)."

msgid ""
"Abstract base class for separators, used for separating other controls. "
"[Separator]s are purely visual and normally drawn as a [StyleBoxLine]."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບຕົວແຍກ, ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຍກຄອນໂທຣລອື່ນໆ ອອກຈາກກັນ."

msgid ""
"The size of the area covered by the separator. Effectively works like a "
"minimum width/height."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຕົວແຍກຄວບຄຸມ. ເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບຄວາມກວ້າງ/ຄວາມສູງຕ່ຳສຸດ."

msgid ""
"The style for the separator line. Works best with [StyleBoxLine] (remember to "
"enable [member StyleBoxLine.vertical] for [VSeparator])."
msgstr "ສະໄຕລ໌ (style) ສຳລັບເສັ້ນແຍກ. ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດກັບ [StyleBoxLine]."

msgid "A shader implemented in the Godot shading language."
msgstr "ເຊດເດີ (shader) ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍພາສາເຊດເດີຂອງ Godot."

msgid ""
"A custom shader program implemented in the Godot shading language, saved with "
"the [code].gdshader[/code] extension.\n"
"This class is used by a [ShaderMaterial] and allows you to write your own "
"custom behavior for rendering visual items or updating particle information. "
"For a detailed explanation and usage, please see the tutorials linked below."
msgstr ""
"ໂປຣແກຣມເຊດເດີແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ຂຽນດ້ວຍພາສາເຊດເດີຂອງ Godot, ບັນທຶກດ້ວຍສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ "
"[code].gdshader[/code].\n"
"ຄລາສນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ [ShaderMaterial] ແລະ "
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນພຶດຕິກຳຂອງຕົນເອງໃນການສະແດງຜົນວັດຖຸ ຫຼື ອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນພາກຕິເຄິລ (particle)."

msgid "Shaders documentation index"
msgstr "ດັດຊະນີເອກະສານຂອງ Shaders"

msgid ""
"Returns the texture that is set as default for the specified parameter.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param name] must match the name of the uniform in the code "
"exactly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the sampler array is used use [param index] to access the "
"specified texture."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າເທັກເຈີທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Returns the shader mode for the shader."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າໂໝດເຊດເດີ (shader mode) ສຳລັບເຊດເດີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of shader uniforms that can be assigned to a "
"[ShaderMaterial], for use with [method ShaderMaterial.set_shader_parameter] "
"and [method ShaderMaterial.get_shader_parameter]. The parameters returned are "
"contained in dictionaries in a similar format to the ones returned by [method "
"Object.get_property_list].\n"
"If argument [param get_groups] is [code]true[/code], parameter grouping hints "
"are also included in the list."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າລາຍຊື່ຂອງ shader uniforms ທີ່ສາມາດກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ [ShaderMaterial]."

msgid ""
"Only available when running in the editor. Opens a popup that visualizes the "
"generated shader code, including all variants and internal shader code. See "
"also [method Material.inspect_native_shader_code]."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອລັນໃນ editor ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຈະເປີດປັອບອັບເພື່ອສະແດງໂຄ້ດເຊດເດີທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the default texture to be used with a texture uniform. The default is "
"used if a texture is not set in the [ShaderMaterial].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param name] must match the name of the uniform in the code "
"exactly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the sampler array is used use [param index] to access the "
"specified texture."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເທັກເຈີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບ texture uniform."

msgid ""
"Returns the shader's code as the user has written it, not the full generated "
"code used internally."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າໂຄ້ດຂອງເຊດເດີຕາມທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຂຽນໄວ້, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂໂ້ດທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນພາຍໃນ."

msgid "Mode used to draw all 3D objects."
msgstr "ໂໝດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ້ມວັດຖຸ 3D ທັງໝົດ."

msgid "Mode used to draw all 2D objects."
msgstr "ໂໝດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ້ມວັດຖຸ 2D ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Mode used to calculate particle information on a per-particle basis. Not used "
"for drawing."
msgstr "ໂໝດທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ຂໍ້ມູນພາກຕິເຄິລ (particle) ເປັນແຕ່ລະຕົວ. ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ້ມຜົນ."

msgid ""
"Mode used for drawing skies. Only works with shaders attached to [Sky] "
"objects."
msgstr "ໂໝດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ້ມທ້ອງຟ້າ. ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບເຊດເດີທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບວັດຖຸ [Sky] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Mode used for setting the color and density of volumetric fog effect."
msgstr "ໂໝດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າສີ ແລະ ຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງເອັບເຟັກໝອກແບບ volumetric."

msgid "Mode used for drawing to DrawableTexture resources via blit calls."
msgstr "ໂໝດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການແຕ້ມໃສ່ຊັບພະຍາກອນ DrawableTexture ຜ່ານການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ blit."

msgid "A node used to override global shader parameters' values in a scene."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແທນທີ່ (override) ຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງເຊດເດີແບບທົ່ວໂລກໃນສາກ."

msgid ""
"Similar to how a [WorldEnvironment] node can be used to override the "
"environment while a specific scene is loaded, [ShaderGlobalsOverride] can be "
"used to override global shader parameters temporarily. Once the node is "
"removed, the project-wide values for the global shader parameters are "
"restored. See the [RenderingServer] [code]global_shader_parameter_*[/code] "
"methods for more information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only one [ShaderGlobalsOverride] can be used per scene. If there "
"is more than one [ShaderGlobalsOverride] node in the scene tree, only the "
"first node (in tree order) will be taken into account.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] All [ShaderGlobalsOverride] nodes are made part of a [code]"
"\"shader_overrides_group\"[/code] group when they are added to the scene "
"tree. The currently active [ShaderGlobalsOverride] node also has a [code]"
"\"shader_overrides_group_active\"[/code] group added to it. You can use this "
"to check which [ShaderGlobalsOverride] node is currently active."
msgstr ""
"ຄ້າຍຄືກັບວິທີທີ່ໂນດ [WorldEnvironment] ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອແທນທີ່ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ, "
"[ShaderGlobalsOverride] ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແທນທີ່ພາຣາມິເຕີເຊດເດີແບບທົ່ວໂລກຊົ່ວຄາວ."

msgid "Shading language"
msgstr "ພາສາ Shading"

msgid ""
"A snippet of shader code to be included in a [Shader] with [code]#include[/"
"code]."
msgstr "ສ່ວນຂອງໂຄ້ດເຊດເດີທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໄປລວມເຂົ້າໃນ [Shader] ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [code]#include[/code]."

msgid ""
"A shader include file, saved with the [code].gdshaderinc[/code] extension. "
"This class allows you to define a custom shader snippet that can be included "
"in a [Shader] by using the preprocessor directive [code]#include[/code], "
"followed by the file path (e.g. [code]#include \"res://"
"shader_lib.gdshaderinc\"[/code]). The snippet doesn't have to be a valid "
"shader on its own."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ include ຂອງເຊດເດີ, ບັນທຶກດ້ວຍສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ [code].gdshaderinc[/code]."

msgid "Shader preprocessor"
msgstr "ຕົວປະມວນຜົນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນຂອງເຊດເດີ (Shader preprocessor)"

msgid ""
"Returns the code of the shader include file. The returned text is what the "
"user has written, not the full generated code used internally."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າໂຄ້ດຂອງໄຟລ໌ include ຂອງເຊດເດີ."

msgid "Internal database of built in shader include files."
msgstr "ຖານຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນຂອງໄຟລ໌ include ຂອງເຊດເດີທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"This object contains shader fragments from Godot's internal shaders. These "
"can be used when access to internal uniform buffers and/or internal functions "
"is required for instance when composing compositor effects or compute "
"shaders. Only fragments for the current rendering device are loaded."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸນີ້ນບັນຈຸຊິ້ນສ່ວນເຊດເດີ (shader fragments) ຈາກເຊດເດີພາຍໃນຂອງ Godot."

msgid ""
"Returns the code for the built-in shader fragment. You can also access this "
"in your shader code through [code]#include \"filename\"[/code]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າໂຄ້ດສຳລັບຊິ້ນສ່ວນເຊດເດີທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if an include file with this name exists."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກມີໄຟລ໌ include ທີ່ມີຊື່ນີ້ຢູ່."

msgid "Returns a list of built-in include files that are currently registered."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າລາຍຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ include ທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ ເຊິ່ງໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"A material defined by a custom [Shader] program and the values of its shader "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"ວັດສະດຸ (material) ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍໂປຣແກຣມ [Shader] ແບບກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ "
"ຄ່າຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີເຊດເດີຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"A material that uses a custom [Shader] program to render visual items (canvas "
"items, meshes, skies, fog), or to process particles. Compared to other "
"materials, [ShaderMaterial] gives deeper control over the generated shader "
"code. For more information, see the shaders documentation index below.\n"
"Multiple [ShaderMaterial]s can use the same shader and configure different "
"values for the shader uniforms.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For performance reasons, the [signal Resource.changed] signal is "
"only emitted when the [member Resource.resource_name] changes. Only in "
"editor, it is also emitted for [member shader] changes."
msgstr ""
"ວັດສະດຸທີ່ໃຊ້ໂປຣແກຣມ [Shader] ແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນວັດຖຸຕ່າງໆ. ເມື່ອທຽບກັບວັດສະດຸອື່ນໆ, "
"[ShaderMaterial] ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຄວບຄຸມໂຄ້ດເຊດເດີທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້ລະອຽດກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Returns the current value set for this material of a uniform in the shader."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສຳລັບວັດສະດຸນີ້ຂອງ uniform ໃນເຊດເດີ."

msgid ""
"Changes the value set for this material of a uniform in the shader.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param param] is case-sensitive and must match the name of the "
"uniform in the code exactly (not the capitalized name in the inspector).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changes to the shader uniform will be effective on all instances "
"using this [ShaderMaterial]. To prevent this, use per-instance uniforms with "
"[method CanvasItem.set_instance_shader_parameter], [method "
"GeometryInstance3D.set_instance_shader_parameter] or duplicate the "
"[ShaderMaterial] resource using [method Resource.duplicate]. Per-instance "
"uniforms allow for better shader reuse and are therefore faster, so they "
"should be preferred over duplicating the [ShaderMaterial] when possible."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສຳລັບວັດສະດຸນີ້ຂອງ uniform ໃນເຊດເດີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param param] ຈະຕ້ອງກົງກັບຊື່ຂອງ uniform ໃນໂຄ້ດທຸກຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid "The [Shader] program used to render this material."
msgstr "ໂປຣແກຣມ [Shader] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສະແດງຜົນວັດສະດຸນີ້."

msgid "Abstract base class for 2D shapes used for physics collision."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານແບບ abstract ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງ 2D ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳທາງຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"Abstract base class for all 2D shapes, intended for use in physics.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] Primitive shapes, especially [CircleShape2D], are fast to "
"check collisions against. [ConvexPolygonShape2D] is slower, and "
"[ConcavePolygonShape2D] is the slowest."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບຮູບຊົງ 2D ທັງໝົດ ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນທາງຟີຊິກ.\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] ຮູບຊົງພື້ນຖານ ເຊັ່ນ [CircleShape2D] ຈະກວດສອບການຕຳໄດ້ໄວທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this shape is colliding with another.\n"
"This method needs the transformation matrix for this shape ([param "
"local_xform]), the shape to check collisions with ([param with_shape]), and "
"the transformation matrix of that shape ([param shape_xform])."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກຮູບຊົງນີ້ກຳລັງຕຳກັບອີກຮູບຊົງໜຶ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Returns a list of contact point pairs where this shape touches another.\n"
"If there are no collisions, the returned list is empty. Otherwise, the "
"returned list contains contact points arranged in pairs, with entries "
"alternating between points on the boundary of this shape and points on the "
"boundary of [param with_shape].\n"
"A collision pair A, B can be used to calculate the collision normal with "
"[code](B - A).normalized()[/code], and the collision depth with [code](B - "
"A).length()[/code]. This information is typically used to separate shapes, "
"particularly in collision solvers.\n"
"This method needs the transformation matrix for this shape ([param "
"local_xform]), the shape to check collisions with ([param with_shape]), and "
"the transformation matrix of that shape ([param shape_xform])."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າລາຍຊື່ຂອງຄູ່ຈຸດສຳຜັດທີ່ຮູບຊົງນີ້ສຳຜັດກັບອີກຮູບຊົງໜຶ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Returns whether this shape would collide with another, if a given movement "
"was applied.\n"
"This method needs the transformation matrix for this shape ([param "
"local_xform]), the movement to test on this shape ([param local_motion]), the "
"shape to check collisions with ([param with_shape]), the transformation "
"matrix of that shape ([param shape_xform]), and the movement to test onto the "
"other object ([param shape_motion])."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າວ່າຮູບຊົງນີ້ຈະຕຳກັບອີກຮູບຊົງໜຶ່ງຫຼືບໍ່ ຫາກມີການເຄື່ອນທີ່ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Returns a list of contact point pairs where this shape would touch another, "
"if a given movement was applied.\n"
"If there would be no collisions, the returned list is empty. Otherwise, the "
"returned list contains contact points arranged in pairs, with entries "
"alternating between points on the boundary of this shape and points on the "
"boundary of [param with_shape].\n"
"A collision pair A, B can be used to calculate the collision normal with "
"[code](B - A).normalized()[/code], and the collision depth with [code](B - "
"A).length()[/code]. This information is typically used to separate shapes, "
"particularly in collision solvers.\n"
"This method needs the transformation matrix for this shape ([param "
"local_xform]), the movement to test on this shape ([param local_motion]), the "
"shape to check collisions with ([param with_shape]), the transformation "
"matrix of that shape ([param shape_xform]), and the movement to test onto the "
"other object ([param shape_motion])."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າລາຍຊື່ຂອງຄູ່ຈຸດສຳຜັດທີ່ຮູບຊົງນີ້ຈະສຳຜັດກັບອີກຮູບຊົງໜຶ່ງ ຫາກມີການເຄື່ອນທີ່ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Draws a solid shape onto a [CanvasItem] with the [RenderingServer] API filled "
"with the specified [param color]. The exact drawing method is specific for "
"each shape and cannot be configured."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຮູບຊົງແບບທຶບລົງໃນ [CanvasItem] ດ້ວຍ [RenderingServer] API ໂດຍເຕັມໄປດ້ວຍ [param "
"color] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Returns a [Rect2] representing the shapes boundary."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [Rect2] ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງຂອບເຂດຂອງຮູບຊົງ."

msgid ""
"The shape's custom solver bias. Defines how much bodies react to enforce "
"contact separation when this shape is involved.\n"
"When set to [code]0[/code], the default value from [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/2d/solver/default_contact_bias] is used."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ solver bias ແບບກຳນົດເອງຂອງຮູບຊົງ. "
"ກຳນົດວ່າວັດຖຸຈະມີປະຕິກິລິຍາຫຼາຍປານໃດເພື່ອແຍກການສຳຜັດເມື່ອມີຮູບຊົງນີ້ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

msgid "Abstract base class for 3D shapes used for physics collision."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານແບບ abstract ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງ 3D ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳທາງຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"Abstract base class for all 3D shapes, intended for use in physics.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] Primitive shapes, especially [SphereShape3D], are fast to "
"check collisions against. [ConvexPolygonShape3D] and [HeightMapShape3D] are "
"slower, and [ConcavePolygonShape3D] is the slowest."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບຮູບຊົງ 3D ທັງໝົດ ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນທາງຟີຊິກ.\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] ຮູບຊົງພື້ນຖານ ເຊັ່ນ [SphereShape3D] ຈະກວດສອບການຕຳໄດ້ໄວທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [ArrayMesh] used to draw the debug collision for this [Shape3D]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [ArrayMesh] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ້ມການຕຳແບບດີບັກສຳລັບ [Shape3D] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"The shape's custom solver bias. Defines how much bodies react to enforce "
"contact separation when this shape is involved.\n"
"When set to [code]0[/code], the default value from [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/3d/solver/default_contact_bias] is used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member custom_solver_bias] is only effective when using "
"GodotPhysics3D. It has no effect when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr "ຄ່າ solver bias ແບບກຳນົດເອງຂອງຮູບຊົງ."

msgid ""
"The collision margin for the shape. This is not used in Godot Physics.\n"
"Collision margins allow collision detection to be more efficient by adding an "
"extra shell around shapes. Collision algorithms are more expensive when "
"objects overlap by more than their margin, so a higher value for margins is "
"better for performance, at the cost of accuracy around edges as it makes them "
"less sharp."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (margin) ການຕຳສຳລັບຮູບຊົງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນ Godot Physics."

msgid "A 2D shape that sweeps a region of space to detect [CollisionObject2D]s."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງ 2D ທີ່ກວດສອບພື້ນທີ່ເພື່ອຫາ [CollisionObject2D]."

msgid ""
"Shape casting allows to detect collision objects by sweeping its [member "
"shape] along the cast direction determined by [member target_position]. This "
"is similar to [RayCast2D], but it allows for sweeping a region of space, "
"rather than just a straight line. [ShapeCast2D] can detect multiple collision "
"objects. It is useful for things like wide laser beams or snapping a simple "
"shape to a floor.\n"
"Immediate collision overlaps can be done with the [member target_position] "
"set to [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code] and by calling [method "
"force_shapecast_update] within the same physics frame. This helps to overcome "
"some limitations of [Area2D] when used as an instantaneous detection area, as "
"collision information isn't immediately available to it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Shape casting is more computationally expensive than ray casting."
msgstr ""
"Shape casting ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດກວດຈັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳໄດ້ໂດຍການກວາດ [member shape] "
"ໄປຕາມທິດທາງທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [member target_position]. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [RayCast2D], "
"ແຕ່ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດກວາດພື້ນທີ່ໄດ້ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນພຽງແຕ່ເສັ້ນຊື່."

msgid ""
"Adds a collision exception so the shape does not report collisions with the "
"specified node."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນການຕຳ ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ຮູບຊົງລາຍງານການຕຳກັບໂນດທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Adds a collision exception so the shape does not report collisions with the "
"specified [RID]."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນການຕຳ ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ຮູບຊົງລາຍງານການຕຳກັບ [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Removes all collision exceptions for this shape."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນການຕຳທັງໝົດອອກສຳລັບຮູບຊົງນີ້."

msgid ""
"Updates the collision information for the shape immediately, without waiting "
"for the next [code]_physics_process[/code] call. Use this method, for "
"example, when the shape or its parent has changed state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting [member enabled] to [code]true[/code] is not required "
"for this to work."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນການຕຳສຳລັບຮູບຊົງທັນທີ, ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າຮອບ [code]_physics_process[/code] ຖັດໄປ."

msgid ""
"Returns the fraction from this cast's origin to its [member target_position] "
"of how far the shape can move without triggering a collision, as a value "
"between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າສັດສ່ວນ (fraction) ຈາກຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄປຫາ [member target_position] "
"ວ່າຮູບຊົງສາມາດເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປໄດ້ໄກປານໃດໂດຍບໍ່ເກີດການຕຳ, ເປັນຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/code] ຫາ "
"[code]1.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the fraction from this cast's origin to its [member target_position] "
"of how far the shape must move to trigger a collision, as a value between "
"[code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"In ideal conditions this would be the same as [method "
"get_closest_collision_safe_fraction], however shape casting is calculated in "
"discrete steps, so the precise point of collision can occur between two "
"calculated positions."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າສັດສ່ວນວ່າຮູບຊົງຕ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປໄກປານໃດເພື່ອໃຫ້ເກີດການຕຳ."

msgid ""
"Returns the collided [Object] of one of the multiple collisions at [param "
"index], or [code]null[/code] if no object is intersecting the shape (i.e. "
"[method is_colliding] returns [code]false[/code])."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [Object] ທີ່ຕຳ ຈາກໜຶ່ງໃນຫຼາຍໆການຕຳຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [RID] of the collided object of one of the multiple collisions at "
"[param index]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [RID] ຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳ ຈາກໜຶ່ງໃນຫຼາຍໆການຕຳຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the shape ID of the colliding shape of one of the multiple collisions "
"at [param index], or [code]0[/code] if no object is intersecting the shape "
"(i.e. [method is_colliding] returns [code]false[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າໄອດີຮູບຊົງ (shape ID) ຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ຕຳ ຈາກໜຶ່ງໃນຫຼາຍໆການຕຳຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"The number of collisions detected at the point of impact. Use this to iterate "
"over multiple collisions as provided by [method get_collider], [method "
"get_collider_shape], [method get_collision_point], and [method "
"get_collision_normal] methods."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຂອງການປະທະທີ່ກວດພົບໃນຈຸດທີ່ກະທົບ. ໃຊ້ຄ່ານີ້ເພື່ອວົນຊ້ຳການປະທະຫຼາຍອັນທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກເມທອດ [method "
"get_collider], [method get_collider_shape], [method get_collision_point], ແລະ "
"[method get_collision_normal]."

msgid ""
"Returns the normal of one of the multiple collisions at [param index] of the "
"intersecting object."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າແນວສາກ (normal) ຂອງໜຶ່ງໃນການປະທະຫຼາຍອັນທີ່ [param index] ຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຕັດກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the collision point of one of the multiple collisions at [param "
"index] where the shape intersects the colliding object.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This point is in the [b]global[/b] coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຸດປະທະຂອງໜຶ່ງໃນການປະທະຫຼາຍອັນທີ່ [param index] ບ່ອນທີ່ຮູບຊົງຕັດກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ມາປະທະ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຈຸດນີ້ຢູ່ໃນລະບົບພິກັດ [b]ສາກົນ (global)[/b]."

msgid ""
"Returns whether any object is intersecting with the shape's vector "
"(considering the vector length)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າ ມີວັດຖຸໃດໜຶ່ງຕັດກັບເວກເຕີຂອງຮູບຊົງຫຼືບໍ່ (ໂດຍພິຈາລະນາຈາກຄວາມຍາວຂອງເວກເຕີ)."

msgid ""
"Removes a collision exception so the shape does report collisions with the "
"specified node."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນການປະທະອອກ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູບຊົງລາຍງານການປະທະກັບໂນດ (node) ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Removes a collision exception so the shape does report collisions with the "
"specified [RID]."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນການປະທະອອກ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູບຊົງລາຍງານການປະທະກັບ [RID] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid ""
"The shape's collision mask. Only objects in at least one collision layer "
"enabled in the mask will be detected. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers and "
"masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າກາກການປະທະ (collision mask) ຂອງຮູບຊົງ. "
"ສະເພາະວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຊັ້ນການປະທະຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຊັ້ນທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໃນໜ້າກາກເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກກວດພົບ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-"
"and-masks]Collision layers and masks[/url] ໃນເອກະສານປະກອບສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the complete collision information from the collision sweep. The data "
"returned is the same as in the [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState2D.get_rest_info] method."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນການປະທະທີ່ສົມບູນຈາກການກວາດ (sweep) ເພື່ອກວດສອບການປະທະ. "
"ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າມາແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບໃນເມທອດ [method PhysicsDirectSpaceState2D.get_rest_info]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the parent node will be excluded from collision "
"detection."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດແມ່ (parent node) ຈະຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການກວດສອບການປະທະ."

msgid ""
"The collision margin for the shape. A larger margin helps detecting "
"collisions more consistently, at the cost of precision."
msgstr ""
"ຂອບເຂດ (margin) ການປະທະຂອງຮູບຊົງ. "
"ຂອບເຂດທີ່ກວ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການກວດສອບການປະທະມີຄວາມສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ "
"ແຕ່ຈະຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍຄວາມຊັດເຈນທີ່ຫຼຸດລົງ."

msgid ""
"The number of intersections can be limited with this parameter, to reduce the "
"processing time."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂອງການຕັດກັນສາມາດຖືກຈຳກັດດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນເວລາໃນການປະມວນຜົນ."

msgid "The shape to be used for collision queries."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສອບຖາມການປະທະ."

msgid ""
"The shape's destination point, relative to this node's [member "
"Node2D.position]."
msgstr "ຈຸດໝາຍປາຍທາງຂອງຮູບຊົງ, ທຽບກັບ [member Node2D.position] ຂອງໂນດນີ້."

msgid "A 3D shape that sweeps a region of space to detect [CollisionObject3D]s."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງ 3D ທີ່ກວາດຜ່ານພື້ນທີ່ເພື່ອຊອກຫາ [CollisionObject3D]."

msgid ""
"Shape casting allows to detect collision objects by sweeping its [member "
"shape] along the cast direction determined by [member target_position]. This "
"is similar to [RayCast3D], but it allows for sweeping a region of space, "
"rather than just a straight line. [ShapeCast3D] can detect multiple collision "
"objects. It is useful for things like wide laser beams or snapping a simple "
"shape to a floor.\n"
"Immediate collision overlaps can be done with the [member target_position] "
"set to [code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/code] and by calling [method "
"force_shapecast_update] within the same physics frame. This helps to overcome "
"some limitations of [Area3D] when used as an instantaneous detection area, as "
"collision information isn't immediately available to it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Shape casting is more computationally expensive than ray casting."
msgstr ""
"Shape casting ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ກວດພົບວັດຖຸປະທະໂດຍການກວາດ [member shape] "
"ຂອງມັນໄປຕາມທິດທາງທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [member target_position]. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [RayCast3D], "
"ແຕ່ມັນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ກວາດຜ່ານພື້ນທີ່ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນພຽງເສັ້ນຊື່. [ShapeCast3D] "
"ສາມາດກວດພົບວັດຖຸປະທະໄດ້ຫຼາຍອັນ. ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບສິ່ງຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ລຳແສງເລເຊີທີ່ກວ້າງ ຫຼື "
"ການດຶງຮູບຊົງງ່າຍໆ ໃຫ້ຕິດກັບພື້ນ.\n"
"ການກວດສອບການຊ້ອນທັບຂອງການປະທະແບບທັນທີສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງ [member target_position] "
"ເປັນ [code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/code] ແລະ ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method force_shapecast_update] "
"ພາຍໃນເຟຣມຟິຊິກດຽວກັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຈຳກັດບາງຢ່າງຂອງ [Area3D] ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ເປັນພື້ນທີ່ກວດຈັບແບບທັນທີ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ມູນການປະທະຈະບໍ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານໃນທັນທີສຳລັບ Area3D.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Shape casting ຈະໃຊ້ການປະມວນຜົນທີ່ສູງກວ່າ ray casting."

msgid ""
"Returns the complete collision information from the collision sweep. The data "
"returned is the same as in the [method "
"PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.get_rest_info] method."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນການປະທະທີ່ສົມບູນຈາກການກວາດ (sweep) ເພື່ອກວດສອບການປະທະ. "
"ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າມາແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບໃນເມທອດ [method PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.get_rest_info]."

msgid ""
"The custom color to use to draw the shape in the editor and at run-time if "
"[b]Visible Collision Shapes[/b] is enabled in the [b]Debug[/b] menu. This "
"color will be highlighted at run-time if the [ShapeCast3D] is colliding with "
"something.\n"
"If set to [code]Color(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)[/code] (by default), the color set in "
"[member ProjectSettings.debug/shapes/collision/shape_color] is used."
msgstr ""
"ສີກຳນົດເອງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ແຕ້ມຮູບຊົງໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor) ແລະ ໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກ ຫາກມີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ "
"[b]Visible Collision Shapes[/b] ໃນເມນູ [b]Debug[/b]. ສີນີ້ຈະຖືກເນັ້ນໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກ ຫາກ "
"[ShapeCast3D] ກຳລັງປະທະກັບບາງສິ່ງບາງຢ່າງ.\n"
"ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]Color(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)[/code] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ສີທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ [member "
"ProjectSettings.debug/shapes/collision/shape_color] ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"The shape's destination point, relative to this node's [member "
"Node3D.position]."
msgstr "ຈຸດໝາຍປາຍທາງຂອງຮູບຊົງ, ທຽບກັບ [member Node3D.position] ຂອງໂນດນີ້."

msgid "A shortcut for binding input."
msgstr "ທາງລັດສຳລັບການຜູກມັດການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (input)."

msgid ""
"Shortcuts (also known as hotkeys) are containers of [InputEvent] resources. "
"They are commonly used to interact with a [Control] element from an "
"[InputEvent].\n"
"One shortcut can contain multiple [InputEvent] resources, making it possible "
"to trigger one action with multiple different inputs.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Capture the [kbd]Ctrl + S[/kbd] shortcut using a [Shortcut] "
"resource:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var save_shortcut = Shortcut.new()\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar key_event = InputEventKey.new()\n"
"\tkey_event.keycode = KEY_S\n"
"\tkey_event.ctrl_pressed = true\n"
"\tkey_event.command_or_control_autoremap = true # Swaps Ctrl for Command on "
"Mac.\n"
"\tsave_shortcut.events = [key_event]\n"
"\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif save_shortcut.matches_event(event) and event.is_pressed() and not "
"event.is_echo():\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Save shortcut pressed!\")\n"
"\t\tget_viewport().set_input_as_handled()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"public partial class MyNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate readonly Shortcut _saveShortcut = new Shortcut();\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tInputEventKey keyEvent = new InputEventKey\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tKeycode = Key.S,\n"
"\t\t\tCtrlPressed = true,\n"
"\t\t\tCommandOrControlAutoremap = true, // Swaps Ctrl for Command on Mac.\n"
"\t\t};\n"
"\n"
"\t\t_saveShortcut.Events = [keyEvent];\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tif (@event is InputEventKey keyEvent &&\n"
"\t\t\t_saveShortcut.MatchesEvent(@event) &&\n"
"\t\t\tkeyEvent.Pressed && !keyEvent.Echo)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tGD.Print(\"Save shortcut pressed!\");\n"
"\t\t\tGetViewport().SetInputAsHandled();\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Shortcuts (ຫຼືທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກກັນໃນຊື່ hotkeys) ແມ່ນບ່ອນເກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນ [InputEvent]. "
"ພວກມັນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປເພື່ອໂຕ້ຕອບກັບອົງປະກອບ [Control] ຈາກ [InputEvent].\n"
"ໜຶ່ງທາງລັດສາມາດປະກອບມີຫຼາຍຊັບພະຍາກອນ [InputEvent], "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດກະຕຸ້ນການກະທຳດຽວດ້ວຍການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍແບບ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ການດັກຈັບທາງລັດ [kbd]Ctrl + S[/kbd] ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Shortcut]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var save_shortcut = Shortcut.new()\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar key_event = InputEventKey.new()\n"
"\tkey_event.keycode = KEY_S\n"
"\tkey_event.ctrl_pressed = true\n"
"\tkey_event.command_or_control_autoremap = true # ປ່ຽນ Ctrl ເປັນ Command ໃນ "
"Mac.\n"
"\tsave_shortcut.events = [key_event]\n"
"\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif save_shortcut.matches_event(event) and event.is_pressed() and not "
"event.is_echo():\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Save shortcut pressed!\")\n"
"\t\tget_viewport().set_input_as_handled()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"public partial class MyNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate readonly Shortcut _saveShortcut = new Shortcut();\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tInputEventKey keyEvent = new InputEventKey\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tKeycode = Key.S,\n"
"\t\t\tCtrlPressed = true,\n"
"\t\t\tCommandOrControlAutoremap = true, // ປ່ຽນ Ctrl ເປັນ Command ໃນ Mac.\n"
"\t\t};\n"
"\n"
"\t\t_saveShortcut.Events = [keyEvent];\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tif (@event is InputEventKey keyEvent &&\n"
"\t\t\t_saveShortcut.MatchesEvent(@event) &&\n"
"\t\t\tkeyEvent.Pressed && !keyEvent.Echo)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tGD.Print(\"Save shortcut pressed!\");\n"
"\t\t\tGetViewport().SetInputAsHandled();\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Returns the shortcut's first valid [InputEvent] as a [String]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [InputEvent] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງອັນທຳອິດຂອງທາງລັດເປັນ [String]."

msgid "Returns whether [member events] contains an [InputEvent] which is valid."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າ [member events] ປະກອບມີ [InputEvent] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns whether any [InputEvent] in [member events] equals [param event]. "
"This uses [method InputEvent.is_match] to compare events."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າ ມີ [InputEvent] ໃດໜຶ່ງໃນ [member events] ທີ່ເທົ່າກັບ [param event] ຫຼືບໍ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ "
"[method InputEvent.is_match] ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບເຫດການ."

msgid ""
"The shortcut's [InputEvent] array.\n"
"Generally the [InputEvent] used is an [InputEventKey], though it can be any "
"[InputEvent], including an [InputEventAction]."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣ (array) ຂອງ [InputEvent] ຂອງທາງລັດ.\n"
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ [InputEvent] ທີ່ໃຊ້ແມ່ນ [InputEventKey], ເຖິງວ່າຈະສາມາດເປັນ [InputEvent] "
"ໃດກໍໄດ້, ລວມທັງ [InputEventAction]."

msgid "A built-in type representing a signal of an [Object]."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕິດມາກັບລະບົບ (built-in) ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງສັນຍານ (signal) ຂອງ [Object]."

msgid ""
"[Signal] is a built-in [Variant] type that represents a signal of an [Object] "
"instance. Like all [Variant] types, it can be stored in variables and passed "
"to functions. Signals allow all connected [Callable]s (and by extension their "
"respective objects) to listen and react to events, without directly "
"referencing one another. This keeps the code flexible and easier to manage. "
"You can check whether an [Object] has a given signal name using [method "
"Object.has_signal].\n"
"In GDScript, signals can be declared with the [code]signal[/code] keyword. In "
"C#, you may use the [code][Signal][/code] attribute on a delegate.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"signal attacked\n"
"\n"
"# Additional arguments may be declared.\n"
"# These arguments must be passed when the signal is emitted.\n"
"signal item_dropped(item_name, amount)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Signal]\n"
"delegate void AttackedEventHandler();\n"
"\n"
"// Additional arguments may be declared.\n"
"// These arguments must be passed when the signal is emitted.\n"
"[Signal]\n"
"delegate void ItemDroppedEventHandler(string itemName, int amount);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Connecting signals is one of the most common operations in Godot and the API "
"gives many options to do so, which are described further down. The code block "
"below shows the recommended approach.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar button = Button.new()\n"
"\t# `button_down` here is a Signal Variant type. We therefore call the "
"Signal.connect() method, not Object.connect().\n"
"\t# See discussion below for a more in-depth overview of the API.\n"
"\tbutton.button_down.connect(_on_button_down)\n"
"\n"
"\t# This assumes that a `Player` class exists, which defines a `hit` signal.\n"
"\tvar player = Player.new()\n"
"\t# We use Signal.connect() again, and we also use the Callable.bind() "
"method,\n"
"\t# which returns a new Callable with the parameter binds.\n"
"\tplayer.hit.connect(_on_player_hit.bind(\"sword\", 100))\n"
"\n"
"func _on_button_down():\n"
"\tprint(\"Button down!\")\n"
"\n"
"func _on_player_hit(weapon_type, damage):\n"
"\tprint(\"Hit with weapon %s for %d damage.\" % [weapon_type, damage])\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar button = new Button();\n"
"\t// C# supports passing signals as events, so we can use this idiomatic "
"construct:\n"
"\tbutton.ButtonDown += OnButtonDown;\n"
"\n"
"\t// This assumes that a `Player` class exists, which defines a `Hit` "
"signal.\n"
"\tvar player = new Player();\n"
"\t// We can use lambdas when we need to bind additional parameters.\n"
"\tplayer.Hit += () => OnPlayerHit(\"sword\", 100);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void OnButtonDown()\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print(\"Button down!\");\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void OnPlayerHit(string weaponType, int damage)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Hit with weapon {weaponType} for {damage} damage.\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[code skip-lint]Object.connect()[/code] [b]or[/b] [code skip-"
"lint]Signal.connect()[/code][b]?[/b]\n"
"As seen above, the recommended method to connect signals is not [method "
"Object.connect]. The code block below shows the four options for connecting "
"signals, using either this legacy method or the recommended [method "
"Signal.connect], and using either an implicit [Callable] or a manually "
"defined one.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar button = Button.new()\n"
"\t# Option 1: Object.connect() with an implicit Callable for the defined "
"function.\n"
"\tbutton.connect(\"button_down\", _on_button_down)\n"
"\t# Option 2: Object.connect() with a constructed Callable using a target "
"object and method name.\n"
"\tbutton.connect(\"button_down\", Callable(self, \"_on_button_down\"))\n"
"\t# Option 3: Signal.connect() with an implicit Callable for the defined "
"function.\n"
"\tbutton.button_down.connect(_on_button_down)\n"
"\t# Option 4: Signal.connect() with a constructed Callable using a target "
"object and method name.\n"
"\tbutton.button_down.connect(Callable(self, \"_on_button_down\"))\n"
"\n"
"func _on_button_down():\n"
"\tprint(\"Button down!\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar button = new Button();\n"
"\t// Option 1: In C#, we can use signals as events and connect with this "
"idiomatic syntax:\n"
"\tbutton.ButtonDown += OnButtonDown;\n"
"\t// Option 2: GodotObject.Connect() with a constructed Callable from a "
"method group.\n"
"\tbutton.Connect(Button.SignalName.ButtonDown, Callable.From(OnButtonDown));\n"
"\t// Option 3: GodotObject.Connect() with a constructed Callable using a "
"target object and method name.\n"
"\tbutton.Connect(Button.SignalName.ButtonDown, new Callable(this, "
"MethodName.OnButtonDown));\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void OnButtonDown()\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print(\"Button down!\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"While all options have the same outcome ([code]button[/code]'s [signal "
"BaseButton.button_down] signal will be connected to [code]_on_button_down[/"
"code]), [b]option 3[/b] offers the best validation: it will print a compile-"
"time error if either the [code]button_down[/code] [Signal] or the "
"[code]_on_button_down[/code] [Callable] are not defined. On the other hand, "
"[b]option 2[/b] only relies on string names and will only be able to validate "
"either names at runtime: it will generate an error at runtime if [code]"
"\"button_down\"[/code] is not a signal, or if [code]\"_on_button_down\"[/"
"code] is not a method in the object [code]self[/code]. The main reason for "
"using options 1, 2, or 4 would be if you actually need to use strings (e.g. "
"to connect signals programmatically based on strings read from a "
"configuration file). Otherwise, option 3 is the recommended (and fastest) "
"method.\n"
"[b]Binding and passing parameters:[/b]\n"
"The syntax to bind parameters is through [method Callable.bind], which "
"returns a copy of the [Callable] with its parameters bound.\n"
"When calling [method emit] or [method Object.emit_signal], the signal "
"parameters can be also passed. The examples below show the relationship "
"between these signal parameters and bound parameters.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t# This assumes that a `Player` class exists, which defines a `hit` signal.\n"
"\tvar player = Player.new()\n"
"\t# Using Callable.bind().\n"
"\tplayer.hit.connect(_on_player_hit.bind(\"sword\", 100))\n"
"\n"
"\t# Parameters added when emitting the signal are passed first.\n"
"\tplayer.hit.emit(\"Dark lord\", 5)\n"
"\n"
"# We pass two arguments when emitting (`hit_by`, `level`),\n"
"# and bind two more arguments when connecting (`weapon_type`, `damage`).\n"
"func _on_player_hit(hit_by, level, weapon_type, damage):\n"
"\tprint(\"Hit by %s (level %d) with weapon %s for %d damage.\" % [hit_by, "
"level, weapon_type, damage])\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// This assumes that a `Player` class exists, which defines a `Hit` "
"signal.\n"
"\tvar player = new Player();\n"
"\t// Using lambda expressions that create a closure that captures the "
"additional parameters.\n"
"\t// The lambda only receives the parameters defined by the signal's "
"delegate.\n"
"\tplayer.Hit += (hitBy, level) => OnPlayerHit(hitBy, level, \"sword\", 100);\n"
"\n"
"\t// Parameters added when emitting the signal are passed first.\n"
"\tplayer.EmitSignal(SignalName.Hit, \"Dark lord\", 5);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// We pass two arguments when emitting (`hit_by`, `level`),\n"
"// and bind two more arguments when connecting (`weapon_type`, `damage`).\n"
"private void OnPlayerHit(string hitBy, int level, string weaponType, int "
"damage)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Hit by {hitBy} (level {level}) with weapon {weaponType} for "
"{damage} damage.\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a signal will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if it's null (see [method is_null]). Otherwise, a signal will always "
"evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
