"ດັ່ງທີ່ເຫັນຂ້າງເທິງ, ວິທີການທີ່ແນະນຳໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານບໍ່ແມ່ນ [method Object.connect]. "
"ບລັອກໂຄ້ດລຸ່ມນີ້ສະແດງເຖິງສີ່ຕົວເລືອກໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ທັງວິທີການແບບເກົ່າ ຫຼື ວິທີການທີ່ແນະນຳ "
"[method Signal.connect], ແລະ ໃຊ້ທັງ [Callable] ແບບໂດຍໄນ (implicit) ຫຼື "
"ແບບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar button = Button.new()\n"
"\t# ຕົວເລືອກທີ 1: Object.connect() ພ້ອມກັບ Callable ໂດຍໄນສຳລັບຟັງຊັນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້.\n"
"\tbutton.connect(\"button_down\", _on_button_down)\n"
"\t# ຕົວເລືອກທີ 2: Object.connect() ພ້ອມກັບ Callable ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ວັດຖຸເປົ້າໝາຍ ແລະ "
"ຊື່ເມທອດ.\n"
"\tbutton.connect(\"button_down\", Callable(self, \"_on_button_down\"))\n"
"\t# ຕົວເລືອກທີ 3: Signal.connect() ພ້ອມກັບ Callable ໂດຍໄນສຳລັບຟັງຊັນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້.\n"
"\tbutton.button_down.connect(_on_button_down)\n"
"\t# ຕົວເລືອກທີ 4: Signal.connect() ພ້ອມກັບ Callable ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ວັດຖຸເປົ້າໝາຍ ແລະ "
"ຊື່ເມທອດ.\n"
"\tbutton.button_down.connect(Callable(self, \"_on_button_down\"))\n"
"\n"
"func _on_button_down():\n"
"\tprint(\"Button down!\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar button = new Button();\n"
"\t// ຕົວເລືອກທີ 1: ໃນ C#, ພວກເຮົາສາມາດໃຊ້ສັນຍານເປັນເຫດການ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດ້ວຍໄວຍາກອນນີ້:\n"
"\tbutton.ButtonDown += OnButtonDown;\n"
"\t// ຕົວເລືອກທີ 2: GodotObject.Connect() ພ້ອມກັບ Callable ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກກຸ່ມເມທອດ.\n"
"\tbutton.Connect(Button.SignalName.ButtonDown, Callable.From(OnButtonDown));\n"
"\t// ຕົວເລືອກທີ 3: GodotObject.Connect() ພ້ອມກັບ Callable ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ວັດຖຸເປົ້າໝາຍ ແລະ "
"ຊື່ເມທອດ.\n"
"\tbutton.Connect(Button.SignalName.ButtonDown, new Callable(this, "
"MethodName.OnButtonDown));\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void OnButtonDown()\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print(\"Button down!\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ເຖິງວ່າທຸກຕົວເລືອກຈະໃຫ້ຜົນລັດອັນດຽວກັນ (ສັນຍານ [signal BaseButton.button_down] ຂອງ "
"[code]button[/code] ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ [code]_on_button_down[/code]), ແຕ່ [b]ຕົວເລືອກທີ "
"3[/b] ໃຫ້ການກວດສອບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ: ມັນຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນຕອນຄອມໄພລ໌ (compile-time error) ຫາກ "
"[Signal] [code]button_down[/code] ຫຼື [Callable] [code]_on_button_down[/code] "
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້. ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, [b]ຕົວເລືອກທີ 2[/b] ອາໄສພຽງແຕ່ຊື່ທີ່ເປັນສະຕຣິງ (string) ແລະ "
"ຈະສາມາດກວດສອບຊື່ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄດ້ໃນຕອນເຮັດວຽກ (runtime) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ: ມັນຈະສ້າງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນຕອນເຮັດວຽກ "
"ຫາກ [code]\"button_down\"[/code] ບໍ່ແມ່ນສັນຍານ, ຫຼື ຫາກ [code]\"_on_button_down\"[/"
"code] ບໍ່ແມ່ນເມທອດໃນວັດຖຸ [code]self[/code]. ເຫດຜົນຫຼັກໃນການໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ 1, 2, ຫຼື 4 "
"ກໍຄືເມື່ອເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ສະຕຣິງແທ້ໆ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານຕາມໂປຣແກຣມໂດຍອີງໃສ່ສະຕຣິງທີ່ອ່ານມາຈາກໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ). ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຕົວເລືອກທີ 3 "
"ແມ່ນວິທີການທີ່ແນະນຳ (ແລະ ໄວທີ່ສຸດ).\n"
"[b]ການຜູກມັດ ແລະ ການສົ່ງພາຣາມິເຕີ:[/b]\n"
"ໄວຍາກອນໃນການຜູກມັດພາຣາມິເຕີແມ່ນຜ່ານ [method Callable.bind], ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງຄ່າສຳເນົາຂອງ "
"[Callable] ພ້ອມກັບພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ຜູກມັດໄວ້.\n"
"ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method emit] ຫຼື [method Object.emit_signal], "
"ພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງສັນຍານກໍສາມາດຖືກສົ່ງໄປໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ. "
"ຕົວຢ່າງລຸ່ມນີ້ສະແດງເຖິງຄວາມສຳພັນລະຫວ່າງພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງສັນຍານເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ແລະ ພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ຜູກມັດໄວ້.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t# ສົມມຸດວ່າມີຄຼາສ `Player` ຢູ່ ເຊິ່ງມີການກຳນົດສັນຍານ `hit` ໄວ້.\n"
"\tvar player = Player.new()\n"
"\t# ການໃຊ້ Callable.bind().\n"
"\tplayer.hit.connect(_on_player_hit.bind(\"sword\", 100))\n"
"\n"
"\t# ພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາເມື່ອປ່ອຍສັນຍານຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປກ່ອນ.\n"
"\tplayer.hit.emit(\"Dark lord\", 5)\n"
"\n"
"# ພວກເຮົາສົ່ງສອງອາກິວເມນເມື່ອປ່ອຍສັນຍານ (`hit_by`, `level`),\n"
"# ແລະ ຜູກມັດອີກສອງອາກິວເມນເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (`weapon_type`, `damage`).\n"
"func _on_player_hit(hit_by, level, weapon_type, damage):\n"
"\tprint(\"Hit by %s (level %d) with weapon %s for %d damage.\" % [hit_by, "
"level, weapon_type, damage])\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// ສົມມຸດວ່າມີຄຼາສ `Player` ຢູ່ ເຊິ່ງມີການກຳນົດສັນຍານ `Hit` ໄວ້.\n"
"\tvar player = new Player();\n"
"\t// ການໃຊ້ lambda expressions ເພື່ອສ້າງ closure ທີ່ເກັບພາຣາມິເຕີເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"\t// lambda ຈະຮັບພຽງແຕ່ພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍເດລີເກດຂອງສັນຍານ.\n"
"\tplayer.Hit += (hitBy, level) => OnPlayerHit(hitBy, level, \"sword\", 100);\n"
"\n"
"\t// ພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາເມື່ອປ່ອຍສັນຍານຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປກ່ອນ.\n"
"\tplayer.EmitSignal(SignalName.Hit, \"Dark lord\", 5);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// ພວກເຮົາສົ່ງສອງອາກິວເມນເມື່ອປ່ອຍສັນຍານ (`hit_by`, `level`),\n"
"// ແລະ ຜູກມັດອີກສອງອາກິວເມນເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (`weapon_type`, `damage`).\n"
"private void OnPlayerHit(string hitBy, int level, string weaponType, int "
"damage)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Hit by {hitBy} (level {level}) with weapon {weaponType} for "
"{damage} damage.\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງບູລີນ (boolean), ສັນຍານຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ຫາກມັນເປັນ null (ເບິ່ງ [method is_null]). ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ສັນຍານຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid "Using Signals"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ສັນຍານ (Signals)"

msgid "GDScript Basics"
msgstr "ພື້ນຖານ GDScript"

msgid "Constructs an empty [Signal] with no object nor signal name bound."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Signal] ທີ່ວ່າງເປົ່າ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຜູກມັດວັດຖຸ ຫຼື ຊື່ສັນຍານ."

msgid "Constructs a [Signal] as a copy of the given [Signal]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Signal] ເປັນການສຳເນົາຈາກ [Signal] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Creates a [Signal] object referencing a signal named [param signal] in the "
"specified [param object]."
msgstr "ສ້າງວັດຖຸ [Signal] ທີ່ອ້າງອີງເຖິງສັນຍານຊື່ [param signal] ໃນ [param object] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Emits this signal. All [Callable]s connected to this signal will be "
"triggered. This method supports a variable number of arguments, so parameters "
"can be passed as a comma separated list."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ອຍ (Emit) ສັນຍານນີ້ອອກມາ. [Callable] ທັງໝົດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບສັນຍານນີ້ຈະຖືກກະຕຸ້ນໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກ. "
"ເມທອດນີ້ຮອງຮັບຈຳນວນອາກິວເມນທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພາຣາມິເຕີສາມາດຖືກສົ່ງໄປໃນຮູບແບບລາຍການທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of connections for this signal. Each connection is "
"represented as a [Dictionary] that contains three entries:\n"
"- [code]signal[/code] is a reference to this signal;\n"
"- [code]callable[/code] is a reference to the connected [Callable];\n"
"- [code]flags[/code] is a combination of [enum Object.ConnectFlags]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າອາເຣ [Array] ຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳລັບສັນຍານນີ້. ແຕ່ລະການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈະສະແດງໃນຮູບແບບ "
"[Dictionary] ເຊິ່ງປະກອບມີສາມຂໍ້ມູນ:\n"
"- [code]signal[/code] ແມ່ນການອ້າງອີງເຖິງສັນຍານນີ້;\n"
"- [code]callable[/code] ແມ່ນການອ້າງອີງເຖິງ [Callable] ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້;\n"
"- [code]flags[/code] ແມ່ນການລວມກັນຂອງ [enum Object.ConnectFlags]."

msgid "Returns the name of this signal."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຊື່ຂອງສັນຍານນີ້."

msgid "Returns the object emitting this signal."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າວັດຖຸທີ່ປ່ອຍສັນຍານນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the ID of the object emitting this signal (see [method "
"Object.get_instance_id])."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ ID ຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ປ່ອຍສັນຍານນີ້ (ເບິ່ງ [method Object.get_instance_id])."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if any [Callable] is connected to this signal."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກມີ [Callable] ໃດໜຶ່ງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບສັນຍານນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified [Callable] is connected to this "
"signal."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ [Callable] ທີ່ລະບຸຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບສັນຍານນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [Signal] has no object and the signal name "
"is empty. Equivalent to [code]signal == Signal()[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ [Signal] ນີ້ບໍ່ມີວັດຖຸ ແລະ ຊື່ສັນຍານວ່າງເປົ່າ. ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ "
"[code]signal == Signal()[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the signals do not share the same object and "
"name."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກສັນຍານບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ວັດຖຸ ແລະ ຊື່ດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if both signals share the same object and name."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກທັງສອງສັນຍານໃຊ້ວັດຖຸ ແລະ ຊື່ດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"The parent of a hierarchy of [Bone2D]s, used to create a 2D skeletal "
"animation."
msgstr "ໂນດແມ່ຂອງລຳດັບຂັ້ນ [Bone2D], ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງແອນີເມຊັນໂຄງກະດູກ 2D."

msgid ""
"[Skeleton2D] parents a hierarchy of [Bone2D] nodes. It holds a reference to "
"each [Bone2D]'s rest pose and acts as a single point of access to its bones.\n"
"To set up different types of inverse kinematics for the given Skeleton2D, a "
"[SkeletonModificationStack2D] should be created. The inverse kinematics be "
"applied by increasing [member SkeletonModificationStack2D.modification_count] "
"and creating the desired number of modifications."
msgstr ""
"[Skeleton2D] ເປັນໂນດແມ່ຂອງລຳດັບຂັ້ນຂອງໂນດ [Bone2D]. ມັນເກັບການອ້າງອີງເຖິງທ່າພັກ (rest "
"pose) ຂອງແຕ່ລະ [Bone2D] ແລະ ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຈຸດເຂົ້າເຖິງກະດູກຂອງມັນທັງໝົດ.\n"
"ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ Inverse Kinematics ປະເພດຕ່າງໆສຳລັບ Skeleton2D ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້, ຄວນສ້າງ "
"[SkeletonModificationStack2D] ຂຶ້ນມາ. Inverse kinematics ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມ "
"[member SkeletonModificationStack2D.modification_count] ແລະ ສ້າງຈຳນວນການປັບແຕ່ງ "
"(modifications) ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

msgid "2D skeletons"
msgstr "ໂຄງກະດູກ 2D"

msgid ""
"Executes all the modifications on the [SkeletonModificationStack2D], if the "
"Skeleton2D has one assigned."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການປັບແຕ່ງທັງໝົດໃນ [SkeletonModificationStack2D], ຫາກ Skeleton2D "
"ນັ້ນມີການກຳນົດໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Bone2D] from the node hierarchy parented by Skeleton2D. The object "
"to return is identified by the parameter [param idx]. Bones are indexed by "
"descending the node hierarchy from top to bottom, adding the children of each "
"branch before moving to the next sibling."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [Bone2D] ຈາກລຳດັບຂັ້ນຂອງໂນດພາຍໃຕ້ Skeleton2D. ວັດຖຸທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າແມ່ນລະບຸໂດຍພາຣາມິເຕີ "
"[param idx]. ກະດູກຈະຖືກຈັດດັດສະນີ (index) ໂດຍການໄລ່ລຽງລຳດັບຂັ້ນຂອງໂນດຈາກເທິງລົງລຸ່ມ, "
"ໂດຍເພີ່ມລູກຂອງແຕ່ລະກິ່ງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຍ້າຍໄປຫາໂນດຂ້າງຄຽງຖັດໄປ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of [Bone2D] nodes in the node hierarchy parented by "
"Skeleton2D."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນຂອງໂນດ [Bone2D] ໃນລຳດັບຂັ້ນຂອງໂນດພາຍໃຕ້ Skeleton2D."

msgid "Returns the local pose override transform for [param bone_idx]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າການແປງ (transform) ຂອງການແທນທີ່ທ່າທາງທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local pose override) ສຳລັບ [param "
"bone_idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [SkeletonModificationStack2D] attached to this skeleton, if one "
"exists."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [SkeletonModificationStack2D] ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບໂຄງກະດູກນີ້, ຫາກມີຢູ່."

msgid "Returns the [RID] of a Skeleton2D instance."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [RID] ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ Skeleton2D."

msgid ""
"Sets the local pose transform, [param override_pose], for the bone at [param "
"bone_idx].\n"
"[param strength] is the interpolation strength that will be used when "
"applying the pose, and [param persistent] determines if the applied pose will "
"remain.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The pose transform needs to be a local transform relative to the "
"[Bone2D] node at [param bone_idx]!"
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການແປງທ່າທາງທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, [param override_pose], ສຳລັບກະດູກທີ່ [param bone_idx].\n"
"[param strength] ແມ່ນຄວາມແຮງຂອງການແຊກສະຫຼັບ (interpolation) ທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ທ່າທາງ, "
"ແລະ [param persistent] ກຳນົດວ່າທ່າທາງທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ນັ້ນຈະຄົງຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການແປງທ່າທາງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປັນການແປງແບບທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local transform) "
"ທີ່ທຽບກັບໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ [param bone_idx]!"

msgid "Sets the [SkeletonModificationStack2D] attached to this skeleton."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [SkeletonModificationStack2D] ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບໂຄງກະດູກນີ້."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the [Bone2D] setup attached to this skeletons changes. This is "
"primarily used internally within the skeleton."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາເມື່ອການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Bone2D] ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບໂຄງກະດູກນີ້ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. "
"ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນໃຊ້ພາຍໃນໂຄງກະດູກເອງ."

msgid ""
"A node containing a bone hierarchy, used to create a 3D skeletal animation."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ປະກອບມີລຳດັບຂັ້ນຂອງກະດູກ, ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງແອນີເມຊັນໂຄງກະດູກ 3D."

msgid ""
"[Skeleton3D] provides an interface for managing a hierarchy of bones, "
"including pose, rest and animation (see [Animation]). It can also use ragdoll "
"physics.\n"
"The overall transform of a bone with respect to the skeleton is determined by "
"bone pose. Bone rest defines the initial transform of the bone pose.\n"
"Note that \"global pose\" below refers to the overall transform of the bone "
"with respect to skeleton, so it is not the actual global/world transform of "
"the bone."
msgstr ""
"[Skeleton3D] ໃຫ້ອິນເຕີເຟດສຳລັບການຈັດການລຳດັບຂັ້ນຂອງກະດູກ, ລວມທັງທ່າທາງ (pose), ທ່າພັກ "
"(rest) ແລະ ແອນີເມຊັນ (ເບິ່ງ [Animation]). ມັນຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ຟິຊິກ ragdoll ໄດ້ນຳ.\n"
"ການແປງ (transform) ໂດຍລວມຂອງກະດູກເມື່ອທຽບກັບໂຄງກະດູກແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກ. "
"ທ່າພັກຂອງກະດູກກຳນົດການແປງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງທ່າທາງກະດູກ.\n"
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ \"global pose\" ທາງລຸ່ມນີ້ໝາຍເຖິງການແປງໂດຍລວມຂອງກະດູກເມື່ອທຽບກັບໂຄງກະດູກ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແມ່ນການແປງໃນລະບົບສາກົນ/ໂລກ ຕົວຈິງຂອງກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Adds a new bone with the given name. Returns the new bone's index, or "
"[code]-1[/code] if this method fails.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Bone names should be unique, non empty, and cannot include the "
"[code]:[/code] and [code]/[/code] characters."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມກະດູກໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ສົ່ງຄ່າດັດສະນີ (index) ຂອງກະດູກໃໝ່, ຫຼື [code]-1[/code] "
"ຫາກເມທອດນີ້ລົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊື່ກະດູກຄວນຈະບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ, ບໍ່ວ່າງເປົ່າ, ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດປະກອບມີຕົວອັກສອນ [code]:[/"
"code] ແລະ [code]/[/code]."

msgid ""
"Manually advance the child [SkeletonModifier3D]s by the specified time (in "
"seconds).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param delta] is temporarily accumulated in the "
"[Skeleton3D], and the deferred process uses the accumulated value to process "
"the modification."
msgstr ""
"ເລື່ອນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ [SkeletonModifier3D] ທີ່ເປັນລູກໄປຂ້າງໜ້າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຕາມເວລາທີ່ລະບຸ "
"(ເປັນວິນາທີ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າ [param delta] ຈະຖືກສະສົມໄວ້ຊົ່ວຄາວໃນ [Skeleton3D], ແລະ "
"ຂະບວນການທີ່ຖືກເລື່ອນໄວ້ (deferred process) ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ສະສົມນັ້ນເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນການປັບແຕ່ງ."

msgid "Clear all the bones in this skeleton."
msgstr "ລຶບກະດູກທັງໝົດໃນໂຄງກະດູກນີ້."

msgid "Removes the global pose override on all bones in the skeleton."
msgstr "ລຶບການແທນທີ່ທ່າທາງສາກົນ (global pose override) ອອກຈາກກະດູກທັງໝົດໃນໂຄງກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the bone index that matches [param name] as its name. Returns "
"[code]-1[/code] if no bone with this name exists."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າດັດສະນີກະດູກທີ່ກົງກັບ [param name]. ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]-1[/code] ຫາກບໍ່ມີກະດູກທີ່ມີຊື່ນີ້ຢູ່."

msgid "Force updates the bone transforms/poses for all bones in the skeleton."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບອັບເດດການແປງ/ທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກທັງໝົດໃນໂຄງກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Force updates the bone transform for the bone at [param bone_idx] and all of "
"its children."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບອັບເດດການແປງກະດູກສຳລັບກະດູກທີ່ [param bone_idx] ແລະ ລູກທັງໝົດຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns an array containing the bone indexes of all the child node of the "
"passed in bone, [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າອາເຣທີ່ປະກອບມີດັດສະນີກະດູກຂອງໂນດລູກທັງໝົດຂອງກະດູກ [param bone_idx] ທີ່ສົ່ງເຂົ້າມາ."

msgid "Returns the number of bones in the skeleton."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນກະດູກໃນໂຄງກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the overall transform of the specified bone, with respect to the "
"skeleton. Being relative to the skeleton frame, this is not the actual "
"\"global\" transform of the bone.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is the global pose you set to the skeleton in the process, "
"the final global pose can get overridden by modifiers in the deferred "
"process, if you want to access the final global pose, use [signal "
"SkeletonModifier3D.modification_processed]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າການແປງໂດຍລວມຂອງກະດູກທີ່ລະບຸ, ເມື່ອທຽບກັບໂຄງກະດູກ. ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນທຽບກັບເຟຣມຂອງໂຄງກະດູກ, "
"ມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແມ່ນການແປງ \"ສາກົນ (global)\" ຕົວຈິງຂອງກະດູກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນທ່າທາງສາກົນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕັ້ງໃຫ້ກັບໂຄງກະດູກໃນຂະບວນການ, "
"ທ່າທາງສາກົນຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍອາດຖືກແທນທີ່ໂດຍຕົວປັບແຕ່ງ (modifiers) ໃນຂະບວນການທີ່ຖືກເລື່ອນໄວ້, "
"ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າເຖິງທ່າທາງສາກົນຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [signal "
"SkeletonModifier3D.modification_processed]."

msgid ""
"Returns the overall transform of the specified bone, with respect to the "
"skeleton, but without any global pose overrides. Being relative to the "
"skeleton frame, this is not the actual \"global\" transform of the bone."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າການແປງໂດຍລວມຂອງກະດູກທີ່ລະບຸ, ເມື່ອທຽບກັບໂຄງກະດູກ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ລວມການແທນທີ່ທ່າທາງສາກົນໃດໆ. "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນທຽບກັບເຟຣມຂອງໂຄງກະດູກ, ມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແມ່ນການແປງ \"ສາກົນ (global)\" ຕົວຈິງຂອງກະດູກ."

msgid "Returns the global pose override transform for [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າການແປງຂອງການແທນທີ່ທ່າທາງສາກົນສຳລັບ [param bone_idx]."

msgid "Returns the global rest transform for [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າການແປງທ່າພັກສາກົນ (global rest transform) ສຳລັບ [param bone_idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the metadata with the given [param key] for the bone at index [param "
"bone_idx]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເມຕາເດຕາ (metadata) ພ້ອມກັບ [param key] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ສຳລັບກະດູກທີ່ດັດສະນີ [param "
"bone_idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of all metadata keys for the bone at index [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າລາຍການຂອງຄີ (keys) ເມຕາເດຕາທັງໝົດສຳລັບກະດູກທີ່ດັດສະນີ [param bone_idx]."

msgid "Returns the name of the bone at index [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຊື່ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ດັດສະນີ [param bone_idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the bone index which is the parent of the bone at [param bone_idx]. "
"If -1, then bone has no parent.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The parent bone returned will always be less than [param "
"bone_idx]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າດັດສະນີກະດູກທີ່ເປັນແມ່ຂອງກະດູກ [param bone_idx]. ຫາກເປັນ -1, ສະແດງວ່າກະດູກນັ້ນບໍ່ມີແມ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ດັດສະນີກະດູກແມ່ທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າມາຈະມີຄ່ານ້ອຍກວ່າ [param bone_idx] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the pose transform of the specified bone.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is the pose you set to the skeleton in the process, the "
"final pose can get overridden by modifiers in the deferred process, if you "
"want to access the final pose, use [signal "
"SkeletonModifier3D.modification_processed]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າການແປງທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນທ່າທາງທີ່ເຈົ້າຕັ້ງໃຫ້ກັບໂຄງກະດູກໃນຂະບວນການ, "
"ທ່າທາງຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍອາດຖືກແທນທີ່ໂດຍຕົວປັບແຕ່ງໃນຂະບວນການທີ່ຖືກເລື່ອນໄວ້, "
"ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າເຖິງທ່າທາງຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [signal "
"SkeletonModifier3D.modification_processed]."

msgid ""
"Returns the pose position of the bone at [param bone_idx]. The returned "
"[Vector3] is in the local coordinate space of the [Skeleton3D] node."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກທີ່ [param bone_idx]. ຄ່າ [Vector3] "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າມາແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງໂນດ [Skeleton3D]."

msgid ""
"Returns the pose rotation of the bone at [param bone_idx]. The returned "
"[Quaternion] is local to the bone with respect to the rotation of any parent "
"bones."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າການໝູນທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກທີ່ [param bone_idx]. ຄ່າ [Quaternion] "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າມາແມ່ນເປັນແບບທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງກະດູກເມື່ອທຽບກັບການໝູນຂອງກະດູກແມ່ໃດໆ."

msgid "Returns the pose scale of the bone at [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຂະໜາດ (scale) ທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກທີ່ [param bone_idx]."

msgid "Returns the rest transform for a bone [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າການແປງທ່າພັກສຳລັບກະດູກ [param bone_idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns all bone names concatenated with commas ([code],[/code]) as a single "
"[StringName].\n"
"It is useful to set it as a hint for the enum property."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຊື່ກະດູກທັງໝົດທີ່ຕໍ່ກັນດ້ວຍຈຸດ ([code],[/code]) ເປັນ [StringName] ອັນດຽວ.\n"
"ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນຄຳແນະນຳ (hint) ສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດ enum."

msgid ""
"Returns an array with all of the bones that are parentless. Another way to "
"look at this is that it returns the indexes of all the bones that are not "
"dependent or modified by other bones in the Skeleton."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າອາເຣຂອງກະດູກທັງໝົດທີ່ບໍ່ມີແມ່. ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງໃນການເບິ່ງກໍຄື ມັນສົ່ງຄ່າດັດສະນີຂອງກະດູກທັງໝົດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຶ້ນກັບ ຫຼື "
"ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງໂດຍກະດູກອື່ນໃນໂຄງກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of times the bone hierarchy has changed within this "
"skeleton, including renames.\n"
"The Skeleton version is not serialized: only use within a single instance of "
"Skeleton3D.\n"
"Use for invalidating caches in IK solvers and other nodes which process bones."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ລຳດັບຂັ້ນຂອງກະດູກມີການປ່ຽນແປງພາຍໃນໂຄງກະດູກນີ້, ລວມທັງການປ່ຽນຊື່.\n"
"ເວີຊັນຂອງ Skeleton ນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເຮັດ serialized: ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ດຽວຂອງ Skeleton3D "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (cache) ໃນ IK solvers ແລະ ໂນດອື່ນໆທີ່ປະມວນຜົນກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the bone at index [param bone_idx] has metadata "
"with the given [param key]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກກະດູກທີ່ດັດສະນີ [param bone_idx] ມີເມຕາເດຕາພ້ອມກັບ [param "
"key] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Returns whether the bone pose for the bone at [param bone_idx] is enabled."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກທີ່ [param bone_idx] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Returns all bones in the skeleton to their rest poses."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າກະດູກທັງໝົດໃນໂຄງກະດູກກັບຄືນສູ່ທ່າພັກຂອງພວກມັນ."

msgid "Binds the given Skin to the Skeleton."
msgstr "ຜູກມັດ Skin ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບໂຄງກະດູກ (Skeleton)."

msgid "Sets the bone pose to rest for [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າທ່າທາງກະດູກໃຫ້ເປັນທ່າພັກສຳລັບ [param bone_idx]."

msgid "Sets all bone poses to rests."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າທ່າທາງກະດູກທັງໝົດໃຫ້ເປັນທ່າພັກ."

msgid ""
"Disables the pose for the bone at [param bone_idx] if [code]false[/code], "
"enables the bone pose if [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ປິດໃຊ້ງານທ່າທາງສຳລັບກະດູກທີ່ [param bone_idx] ຫາກເປັນ [code]false[/code], ແລະ "
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານທ່າທາງຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Sets the global pose transform, [param pose], for the bone at [param "
"bone_idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If other bone poses have been changed, this method executes a "
"dirty poses recalculation and will cause performance to deteriorate. If you "
"know that multiple global poses will be applied, consider using [method "
"set_bone_pose] with precalculation."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການແປງທ່າທາງສາກົນ, [param pose], ສຳລັບກະດູກທີ່ [param bone_idx].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກອື່ນໆມີການປ່ຽນແປງ, ເມທອດນີ້ຈະປະຕິບັດການຄຳນວນທ່າທາງໃໝ່ ແລະ "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບຫຼຸດລົງ. ຫາກເຈົ້າຮູ້ວ່າຈະມີການນຳໃຊ້ທ່າທາງສາກົນຫຼາຍອັນ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາການໃຊ້ "
"[method set_bone_pose] ພ້ອມກັບການຄຳນວນລ່ວງໜ້າ."

msgid ""
"Sets the global pose transform, [param pose], for the bone at [param "
"bone_idx].\n"
"[param amount] is the interpolation strength that will be used when applying "
"the pose, and [param persistent] determines if the applied pose will remain.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The pose transform needs to be a global pose! To convert a world "
"transform from a [Node3D] to a global bone pose, multiply the [method "
"Transform3D.affine_inverse] of the node's [member Node3D.global_transform] by "
"the desired world transform."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການແປງທ່າທາງສາກົນ, [param pose], ສຳລັບກະດູກທີ່ [param bone_idx].\n"
"[param amount] ແມ່ນຄວາມແຮງຂອງການແຊກສະຫຼັບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ທ່າທາງ, ແລະ [param "
"persistent] ກຳນົດວ່າທ່າທາງທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ນັ້ນຈະຄົງຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການແປງທ່າທາງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປັນທ່າທາງສາກົນ (global pose)! ເພື່ອແປງ world "
"transform ຈາກ [Node3D] ໃຫ້ເປັນ global bone pose, ໃຫ້ຄູນ [method "
"Transform3D.affine_inverse] ຂອງ [member Node3D.global_transform] ຂອງໂນດດ້ວຍ "
"world transform ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

msgid ""
"Sets the metadata with the given [param key] to [param value] for the bone at "
"index [param bone_idx]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເມຕາເດຕາພ້ອມກັບ [param key] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນ [param value] ສຳລັບກະດູກທີ່ດັດສະນີ [param "
"bone_idx]."

msgid "Sets the bone name, [param name], for the bone at [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊື່ກະດູກ, [param name], ສຳລັບກະດູກທີ່ [param bone_idx]."

msgid ""
"Sets the bone index [param parent_idx] as the parent of the bone at [param "
"bone_idx]. If -1, then bone has no parent.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param parent_idx] must be less than [param bone_idx]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າດັດສະນີກະດູກ [param parent_idx] ໃຫ້ເປັນແມ່ຂອງກະດູກ [param bone_idx]. ຫາກເປັນ -1, "
"ສະແດງວ່າກະດູກນັ້ນບໍ່ມີແມ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param parent_idx] ຈະຕ້ອງມີຄ່ານ້ອຍກວ່າ [param bone_idx]."

msgid "Sets the pose transform, [param pose], for the bone at [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການແປງທ່າທາງ, [param pose], ສຳລັບກະດູກທີ່ [param bone_idx]."

msgid ""
"Sets the pose position of the bone at [param bone_idx] to [param position]. "
"[param position] is a [Vector3] describing a position local to the "
"[Skeleton3D] node."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກທີ່ [param bone_idx] ເປັນ [param position]. [param "
"position] ແມ່ນ [Vector3] ທີ່ບອກຕຳແໜ່ງແບບທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງໂນດ [Skeleton3D]."

msgid ""
"Sets the pose rotation of the bone at [param bone_idx] to [param rotation]. "
"[param rotation] is a [Quaternion] describing a rotation in the bone's local "
"coordinate space with respect to the rotation of any parent bones."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການໝູນທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກທີ່ [param bone_idx] ເປັນ [param rotation]. [param "
"rotation] ແມ່ນ [Quaternion] "
"ທີ່ບອກການໝູນໃນພື້ນທີ່ພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງກະດູກເມື່ອທຽບກັບການໝູນຂອງກະດູກແມ່ໃດໆ."

msgid "Sets the pose scale of the bone at [param bone_idx] to [param scale]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກທີ່ [param bone_idx] ເປັນ [param scale]."

msgid "Sets the rest transform for bone [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການແປງທ່າພັກສຳລັບກະດູກ [param bone_idx]."

msgid ""
"Unparents the bone at [param bone_idx] and sets its rest position to that of "
"its parent prior to being reset."
msgstr ""
"ຍົກເລີກຄວາມເປັນແມ່ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ [param bone_idx] ແລະ "
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງທ່າພັກຂອງມັນໃຫ້ເປັນຄືກັນກັບແມ່ຂອງມັນກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືກຣີເຊັດ."

msgid ""
"If you follow the recommended workflow and explicitly have "
"[PhysicalBoneSimulator3D] as a child of [Skeleton3D], you can control whether "
"it is affected by raycasting without running [method "
"physical_bones_start_simulation], by its [member SkeletonModifier3D.active].\n"
"However, for old (deprecated) configurations, [Skeleton3D] has an internal "
"virtual [PhysicalBoneSimulator3D] for compatibility. This property controls "
"the internal virtual [PhysicalBoneSimulator3D]'s [member "
"SkeletonModifier3D.active]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ແນະນຳ ແລະ ມີ [PhysicalBoneSimulator3D] ເປັນລູກຂອງ "
"[Skeleton3D] ໂດຍກົງ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄວບຄຸມໄດ້ວ່າຈະໃຫ້ມັນຖືກກະທົບໂດຍ raycasting ຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງແລ່ນ "
"[method physical_bones_start_simulation], ຜ່ານ [member "
"SkeletonModifier3D.active] ຂອງມັນ.\n"
"ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບເກົ່າ (ທີ່ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ), [Skeleton3D] ຈະມີ "
"[PhysicalBoneSimulator3D] ແບບສະເໝືອນພາຍໃນເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຄວບຄຸມ "
"[member SkeletonModifier3D.active] ຂອງ [PhysicalBoneSimulator3D] "
"ແບບສະເໝືອນພາຍໃນນັ້ນ."

msgid "Sets the processing timing for the Modifier."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງເວລາໃນການປະມວນຜົນສຳລັບ Modifier."

msgid ""
"Multiplies the 3D position track animation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unless this value is [code]1.0[/code], the key value in "
"animation will not match the actual position value."
msgstr ""
"ຄູນແອນີເມຊັນແທຣັກ (track) ຕຳແໜ່ງ 3D.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ຄ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນ [code]1.0[/code], ຄ່າຄີ (key value) "
"ໃນແອນີເມຊັນຈະບໍ່ກົງກັບຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງຕົວຈິງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], forces the bones in their default rest pose, regardless "
"of their values. In the editor, this also prevents the bones from being "
"edited."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ກະດູກຢູ່ໃນທ່າພັກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຄ່າຂອງພວກມັນ. "
"ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor), ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີການແກ້ໄຂກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the bone at [param bone_idx] is toggled with [method "
"set_bone_enabled]. Use [method is_bone_enabled] to check the new value."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາເມື່ອກະດູກທີ່ [param bone_idx] ຖືກສະຫຼັບການໃຊ້ງານດ້ວຍ [method "
"set_bone_enabled]. ໃຊ້ [method is_bone_enabled] ເພື່ອກວດສອບຄ່າໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the list of bones changes, such as when calling [method "
"add_bone], [method set_bone_parent], [method unparent_bone_and_rest], or "
"[method clear_bones]."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາເມື່ອລາຍການຂອງກະດູກມີການປ່ຽນແປງ ເຊັ່ນ: ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method add_bone], "
"[method set_bone_parent], [method unparent_bone_and_rest], ຫຼື [method "
"clear_bones]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the pose is updated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] During the update process, this signal is not fired, so "
"modification by [SkeletonModifier3D] is not detected."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາເມື່ອທ່າທາງຖືກອັບເດດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການອັບເດດ, ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນການປັບແຕ່ງໂດຍ "
"[SkeletonModifier3D] ຈະບໍ່ຖືກກວດພົບ."

msgid "Emitted when the rest is updated."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາເມື່ອທ່າພັກຖືກອັບເດດ."

msgid "Emitted when the value of [member show_rest_only] changes."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາເມື່ອຄ່າຂອງ [member show_rest_only] ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the final pose has been calculated will be applied to the skin "
"in the update process.\n"
"This means that all [SkeletonModifier3D] processing is complete. In order to "
"detect the completion of the processing of each [SkeletonModifier3D], use "
"[signal SkeletonModifier3D.modification_processed]."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາເມື່ອທ່າທາງຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍຖືກຄຳນວນ ແລະ ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບ skin ໃນຂະບວນການອັບເດດ.\n"
"ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການປະມວນຜົນ [SkeletonModifier3D] ທັງໝົດແມ່ນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ. "
"ເພື່ອກວດສອບຄວາມສຳເລັດຂອງການປະມວນຜົນຂອງແຕ່ລະ [SkeletonModifier3D], ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [signal "
"SkeletonModifier3D.modification_processed]."

msgid ""
"Notification received when this skeleton's pose needs to be updated. In that "
"case, this is called only once per frame in a deferred process."
msgstr ""
"ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບເມື່ອທ່າທາງຂອງໂຄງກະດູກນີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ອັບເດດ. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ, "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວຕໍ່ເຟຣມໃນຂະບວນການທີ່ຖືກເລື່ອນໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Set a flag to process modification during physics frames (see [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PHYSICS_PROCESS])."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຟລັກ (flag) ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນການປັບແຕ່ງໃນລະຫວ່າງເຟຣມຟິຊິກ (ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PHYSICS_PROCESS])."

msgid ""
"Set a flag to process modification during process frames (see [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PROCESS])."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຟລັກເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນການປັບແຕ່ງໃນລະຫວ່າງເຟຣມການປະມວນຜົນ (ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PROCESS])."

msgid ""
"Do not process modification. Use [method advance] to process the modification "
"manually."
msgstr "ບໍ່ປະມວນຜົນການປັບແຕ່ງ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method advance] ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນການປັບແຕ່ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"A node used to rotate all bones of a [Skeleton3D] bone chain a way that "
"places the end bone at a desired 3D position."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝູນກະດູກທັງໝົດຂອງລຳດັບກະດູກ [Skeleton3D] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກະດູກສ່ວນປາຍຢູ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງ 3D "
"ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

msgid ""
"SkeletonIK3D is used to rotate all bones of a [Skeleton3D] bone chain a way "
"that places the end bone at a desired 3D position. A typical scenario for IK "
"in games is to place a character's feet on the ground or a character's hands "
"on a currently held object. SkeletonIK uses FabrikInverseKinematic internally "
"to solve the bone chain and applies the results to the [Skeleton3D] "
"[code]bones_global_pose_override[/code] property for all affected bones in "
"the chain. If fully applied, this overwrites any bone transform from "
"[Animation]s or bone custom poses set by users. The applied amount can be "
"controlled with the [member SkeletonModifier3D.influence] property.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Apply IK effect automatically on every new frame (not the current)\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.start()\n"
"\n"
"# Apply IK effect only on the current frame\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.start(true)\n"
"\n"
"# Stop IK effect and reset bones_global_pose_override on Skeleton\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.stop()\n"
"\n"
"# Apply full IK effect\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.set_influence(1.0)\n"
"\n"
"# Apply half IK effect\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.set_influence(0.5)\n"
"\n"
"# Apply zero IK effect (a value at or below 0.01 also removes "
"bones_global_pose_override on Skeleton)\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.set_influence(0.0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"SkeletonIK3D ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝູນກະດູກທັງໝົດໃນລຳດັບກະດູກ [Skeleton3D] "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກະດູກສ່ວນປາຍຢູ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງ 3D ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ສະຖານະການທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບ IK "
"ໃນເກມແມ່ນການວາງຕີນຂອງຕົວລະຄອນໄວ້ເທິງພື້ນ ຫຼື ວາງມືຂອງຕົວລະຄອນໄວ້ເທິງວັດຖຸທີ່ກຳລັງຖືຢູ່. SkeletonIK "
"ໃຊ້ FabrikInverseKinematic ພາຍໃນເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂລຳດັບກະດູກ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ຜົນລັດກັບຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"[code]bones_global_pose_override[/code] ຂອງ [Skeleton3D] "
"ສຳລັບກະດູກທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກກະທົບໃນລຳດັບ. ຫາກນຳໃຊ້ຢ່າງເຕັມສ່ວນ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະແທນທີ່ການແປງກະດູກໃດໆຈາກ "
"[Animation] ຫຼື ທ່າທາງກະດູກທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້. ຈຳນວນການນຳໃຊ້ສາມາດຄວບຄຸມໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"[member SkeletonModifier3D.influence].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# ນຳໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກ IK ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນທຸກເຟຣມໃໝ່ (ບໍ່ແມ່ນເຟຣມປັດຈຸບັນ)\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.start()\n"
"\n"
"# ນຳໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກ IK ສະເພາະໃນເຟຣມປັດຈຸບັນ\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.start(true)\n"
"\n"
"# ຢຸດເອັບເຟັກ IK ແລະ ຣີເຊັດ bones_global_pose_override ໃນ Skeleton\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.stop()\n"
"\n"
"# ນຳໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກ IK ເຕັມສ່ວນ\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.set_influence(1.0)\n"
"\n"
"# ນຳໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກ IK ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.set_influence(0.5)\n"
"\n"
"# ບໍ່ນຳໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກ IK (ຄ່າທີ່ເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື ຕໍ່າກວ່າ 0.01 ຈະລຶບ bones_global_pose_override ໃນ "
"Skeleton ນຳ)\n"
"skeleton_ik_node.set_influence(0.0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the parent [Skeleton3D] node that was present when SkeletonIK entered "
"the scene tree. Returns [code]null[/code] if the parent node was not a "
"[Skeleton3D] node when SkeletonIK3D entered the scene tree."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າໂນດແມ່ [Skeleton3D] ທີ່ມີຢູ່ເມື່ອ SkeletonIK ເຂົ້າສູ່ scene tree. ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]null[/"
"code] ຫາກໂນດແມ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂນດ [Skeleton3D] ໃນເວລານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if SkeletonIK is applying IK effects on continues "
"frames to the [Skeleton3D] bones. Returns [code]false[/code] if SkeletonIK is "
"stopped or [method start] was used with the [code]one_time[/code] parameter "
"set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ SkeletonIK ກຳລັງນຳໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກ IK ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງກັບກະດູກ "
"[Skeleton3D]. ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]false[/code] ຫາກ SkeletonIK ຖືກຢຸດ ຫຼື ມີການໃຊ້ [method "
"start] ໂດຍຕັ້ງພາຣາມິເຕີ [code]one_time[/code] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Starts applying IK effects on each frame to the [Skeleton3D] bones but will "
"only take effect starting on the next frame. If [param one_time] is "
"[code]true[/code], this will take effect immediately but also reset on the "
"next frame."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມນຳໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກ IK ໃນແຕ່ລະເຟຣມກັບກະດູກ [Skeleton3D] ແຕ່ຈະມີຜົນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນເຟຣມຖັດໄປ. ຫາກ "
"[param one_time] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ມັນຈະມີຜົນທັນທີແຕ່ຈະຖືກຣີເຊັດໃນເຟຣມຖັດໄປ."

msgid ""
"Stops applying IK effects on each frame to the [Skeleton3D] bones and also "
"calls [method Skeleton3D.clear_bones_global_pose_override] to remove existing "
"overrides on all bones."
msgstr ""
"ຢຸດການນຳໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກ IK ໃນແຕ່ລະເຟຣມກັບກະດູກ [Skeleton3D] ແລະ ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"Skeleton3D.clear_bones_global_pose_override] ເພື່ອລຶບການແທນທີ່ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນກະດູກທັງໝົດ."

msgid "Use [member SkeletonModifier3D.influence] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member SkeletonModifier3D.influence] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Interpolation value for how much the IK results are applied to the current "
"skeleton bone chain. A value of [code]1.0[/code] will overwrite all skeleton "
"bone transforms completely while a value of [code]0.0[/code] will visually "
"disable the SkeletonIK."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າການແຊກສະຫຼັບສຳລັບບອກວ່າຈະນຳໃຊ້ຜົນລັດ IK ກັບລຳດັບກະດູກປັດຈຸບັນຫຼາຍປານໃດ. ຄ່າ [code]1.0[/"
"code] ຈະແທນທີ່ການແປງກະດູກທັງໝົດຢ່າງສົມບູນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ຈະປິດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ SkeletonIK ທາງສາຍຕາ."

msgid ""
"Secondary target position (first is [member target] property or [member "
"target_node]) for the IK chain. Use magnet position (pole target) to control "
"the bending of the IK chain. Only works if the bone chain has more than 2 "
"bones. The middle chain bone position will be linearly interpolated with the "
"magnet position."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງເປົ້າໝາຍສຳຮອງ (ອັນທຳອິດແມ່ນຄຸນສົມບັດ [member target] ຫຼື [member target_node]) "
"ສຳລັບລຳດັບ IK. ໃຊ້ຕຳແໜ່ງແມ່ເຫຼັກ (magnet position ຫຼື pole target) ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມການງໍຂອງລຳດັບ "
"IK. ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະຫາກລຳດັບກະດູກມີຫຼາຍກວ່າ 2 ກະດູກ. "
"ຕຳແໜ່ງກະດູກກາງຂອງລຳດັບຈະຖືກແຊກສະຫຼັບແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linearly interpolated) ກັບຕຳແໜ່ງແມ່ເຫຼັກ."

msgid ""
"Number of iteration loops used by the IK solver to produce more accurate (and "
"elegant) bone chain results."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຮອບຂອງການວົນຊ້ຳ (iteration loops) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ IK solver "
"ເພື່ອສ້າງຜົນລັດລຳດັບກະດູກທີ່ມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນ (ແລະ ສວຍງາມ) ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The minimum distance between bone and goal target. If the distance is below "
"this value, the IK solver stops further iterations."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງຕໍ່າສຸດລະຫວ່າງກະດູກ ແລະ ເປົ້າໝາຍ. ຫາກໄລຍະຫ່າງຕໍ່າກວ່າຄ່ານີ້, IK solver "
"ຈະຢຸດການວົນຊ້ຳຖັດໄປ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] overwrites the rotation of the tip bone with the "
"rotation of the [member target] (or [member target_node] if defined)."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຈະແທນທີ່ການໝູນຂອງກະດູກສ່ວນປາຍດ້ວຍການໝູນຂອງ [member target] "
"(ຫຼື [member target_node] ຫາກມີການກຳນົດໄວ້)."

msgid "The name of the current root bone, the first bone in the IK chain."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງກະດູກຮາກ (root bone) ປັດຈຸບັນ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນກະດູກທຳອິດໃນລຳດັບ IK."

msgid ""
"Target node [NodePath] for the IK chain. If available, the node's current "
"[Transform3D] is used instead of the [member target] property."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໂນດ [NodePath] ເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບລຳດັບ IK. ຫາກມີຢູ່, ຄ່າ [Transform3D] "
"ປັດຈຸບັນຂອງໂນດນັ້ນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແທນຄຸນສົມບັດ [member target]."

msgid ""
"The name of the current tip bone, the last bone in the IK chain placed at the "
"[member target] transform (or [member target_node] if defined)."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຂອງກະດູກສ່ວນປາຍ (tip bone) ປັດຈຸບັນ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນກະດູກສຸດທ້າຍໃນລຳດັບ IK ທີ່ຖືກວາງໄວ້ທີ່ການແປງ "
"[member target] (ຫຼື [member target_node] ຫາກມີການກຳນົດໄວ້)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], instructs the IK solver to consider the secondary "
"magnet target (pole target) when calculating the bone chain. Use the magnet "
"position (pole target) to control the bending of the IK chain."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສັ່ງໃຫ້ IK solver ພິຈາລະນາເປົ້າໝາຍແມ່ເຫຼັກສຳຮອງ (pole "
"target) ເມື່ອຄຳນວນລຳດັບກະດູກ. ໃຊ້ຕຳແໜ່ງແມ່ເຫຼັກ (pole target) ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມການງໍຂອງລຳດັບ IK."

msgid "Base class for resources that operate on [Bone2D]s in a [Skeleton2D]."
msgstr "ຄຼາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກກັບ [Bone2D] ໃນ [Skeleton2D]."

msgid ""
"This resource provides an interface that can be expanded so code that "
"operates on [Bone2D] nodes in a [Skeleton2D] can be mixed and matched "
"together to create complex interactions.\n"
"This is used to provide Godot with a flexible and powerful Inverse Kinematics "
"solution that can be adapted for many different uses."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ໃຫ້ອິນເຕີເຟດທີ່ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍໄດ້ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂຄ້ດທີ່ເຮັດວຽກກັບໂນດ [Bone2D] ໃນ "
"[Skeleton2D] ສາມາດປະສົມປະສານ ແລະ ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ເພື່ອສ້າງການໂຕ້ຕອບທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ Godot ມີໂຊລູຊັນ Inverse Kinematics ທີ່ຢືດຢຸ່ນ ແລະ ຊົງພະລັງ "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດປັບໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບວຽກງານທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ."

msgid ""
"Executes the given modification. This is where the modification performs "
"whatever function it is designed to do."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ນີ້ແມ່ນບ່ອນທີ່ການປັບແຕ່ງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງຕາມທີ່ມັນຖືກອອກແບບມາ."

msgid ""
"Called when the modification is setup. This is where the modification "
"performs initialization."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອການປັບແຕ່ງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ນີ້ແມ່ນບ່ອນທີ່ການປັບແຕ່ງປະຕິບັດການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
"(initialization)."

msgid ""
"Takes an angle and clamps it so it is within the passed-in [param min] and "
"[param max] range. [param invert] will inversely clamp the angle, clamping it "
"to the range outside of the given bounds."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບຄ່າມຸມ ແລະ ທຳການ clamp ມັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [param min] ແລະ [param max] ທີ່ສົ່ງເຂົ້າມາ. "
"[param invert] ຈະທຳການ clamp ມຸມແບບປີ້ນກັບ, ໂດຍ clamp ມັນໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງນອກຂອບເຂດທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Returns whether this modification will call [method _draw_editor_gizmo] in "
"the Godot editor to draw modification-specific gizmos."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າການປັບແຕ່ງນີ້ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method _draw_editor_gizmo] ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Godot "
"ເພື່ອແຕ້ມກີຊໂມສະເພາະຂອງການປັບແຕ່ງຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Returns whether this modification has been successfully setup or not."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າການປັບແຕ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງສຳເລັດຜົນຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the [SkeletonModificationStack2D] that this modification is bound to. "
"Through the modification stack, you can access the Skeleton2D the "
"modification is operating on."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [SkeletonModificationStack2D] ທີ່ການປັບແຕ່ງນີ້ຖືກຜູກມັດໄວ້. ຜ່ານ modification "
"stack, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ Skeleton2D ທີ່ການປັບແຕ່ງກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Sets whether this modification will call [method _draw_editor_gizmo] in the "
"Godot editor to draw modification-specific gizmos."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າການປັບແຕ່ງນີ້ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method _draw_editor_gizmo] ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Godot "
"ເພື່ອແຕ້ມກີຊໂມສະເພາະຂອງການປັບແຕ່ງຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Manually allows you to set the setup state of the modification. This function "
"should only rarely be used, as the [SkeletonModificationStack2D] the "
"modification is bound to should handle setting the modification up."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຕັ້ງສະຖານະການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງການປັບແຕ່ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຫາຍາກເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກ [SkeletonModificationStack2D] ທີ່ການປັບແຕ່ງຜູກມັດໄວ້ຄວນຈະເປັນຜູ້ຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the modification's [method _execute] function will be "
"called by the [SkeletonModificationStack2D]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຟັງຊັນ [method _execute] ຂອງການປັບແຕ່ງຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍ "
"[SkeletonModificationStack2D]."

msgid ""
"The execution mode for the modification. This tells the modification stack "
"when to execute the modification. Some modifications have settings that are "
"only available in certain execution modes."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການປະຕິບັດການ (execution mode) ສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ບອກ modification stack "
"ວ່າຈະປະຕິບັດການປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອໃດ. "
"ການປັບແຕ່ງບາງຢ່າງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສະເພາະໃນບາງໂໝດການປະຕິບັດການເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"A modification that uses CCDIK to manipulate a series of bones to reach a "
"target in 2D."
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ໃຊ້ CCDIK ເພື່ອຈັດການກັບລຳດັບກະດູກເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄປຮອດເປົ້າໝາຍໃນ 2D."

msgid ""
"This [SkeletonModification2D] uses an algorithm called Cyclic Coordinate "
"Descent Inverse Kinematics, or CCDIK, to manipulate a chain of bones in a "
"[Skeleton2D] so it reaches a defined target.\n"
"CCDIK works by rotating a set of bones, typically called a \"bone chain\", on "
"a single axis. Each bone is rotated to face the target from the tip (by "
"default), which over a chain of bones allow it to rotate properly to reach "
"the target. Because the bones only rotate on a single axis, CCDIK [i]can[/i] "
"look more robotic than other IK solvers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The CCDIK modifier has [code]ccdik_joints[/code], which are the "
"data objects that hold the data for each joint in the CCDIK chain. This is "
"different from a bone! CCDIK joints hold the data needed for each bone in the "
"bone chain used by CCDIK.\n"
"CCDIK also fully supports angle constraints, allowing for more control over "
"how a solution is met."
msgstr ""
"[SkeletonModification2D] ນີ້ໃຊ້ອັລກໍຣິທຶມ (algorithm) ທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ Cyclic Coordinate "
"Descent Inverse Kinematics, ຫຼື CCDIK, ເພື່ອຈັດການກັບລຳດັບກະດູກໃນ [Skeleton2D] "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນໄປຮອດເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້.\n"
"CCDIK ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການໝູນຊຸດກະດູກ, ເຊິ່ງປົກກະຕິເອີ້ນວ່າ \"bone chain\", ໃນແກນດຽວ. "
"ກະດູກແຕ່ລະອັນຈະຖືກໝູນໃຫ້ຫັນໜ້າໄປຫາເປົ້າໝາຍຈາກສ່ວນປາຍ (ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), "
"ເຊິ່ງໃນລຳດັບກະດູກຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມັນໝູນໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງເພື່ອໄປຮອດເປົ້າໝາຍ. ເນື່ອງຈາກກະດູກໝູນໄດ້ພຽງແກນດຽວ, "
"CCDIK [i]ອາດຈະ[/i] ເບິ່ງຄືຫຸ່ນຍົນຫຼາຍກວ່າ IK solvers ປະເພດອື່ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] CCDIK modifier ມີ [code]ccdik_joints[/code], "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນວັດຖຸຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຂໍ້ຕໍ່ (joint) ໃນລຳດັບ CCDIK. ນີ້ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກກະດູກ! CCDIK "
"joints ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະກະດູກໃນລຳດັບກະດູກທີ່ CCDIK ໃຊ້.\n"
"CCDIK ຍັງຮອງຮັບຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງມຸມ (angle constraints) ຢ່າງເຕັມສ່ວນ, "
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຄວບຄຸມວິທີການຫາຜົນລັດໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Bone2D] node assigned to the CCDIK joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ CCDIK joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [Bone2D] node assigned to the CCDIK joint at [param "
"joint_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າດັດສະນີຂອງໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ CCDIK joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns whether the CCDIK joint at [param joint_idx] uses an inverted joint "
"constraint. See [method set_ccdik_joint_constraint_angle_invert] for details."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າ CCDIK joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx] ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບປີ້ນກັບ (inverted joint "
"constraint) ຫຼືບໍ່. ເບິ່ງ [method set_ccdik_joint_constraint_angle_invert] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid "Returns the maximum angle constraint for the joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າມຸມສູງສຸດຂອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid "Returns the minimum angle constraint for the joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າມຸມຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns whether angle constraints on the CCDIK joint at [param joint_idx] are "
"enabled."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງມຸມໃນ CCDIK joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns whether the joint at [param joint_idx] is set to rotate from the "
"joint, [code]true[/code], or to rotate from the tip, [code]false[/code]. The "
"default is to rotate from the tip."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint_idx] ຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ໝູນຈາກຂໍ້ຕໍ່, [code]true[/code], ຫຼື ໝູນຈາກສ່ວນປາຍ, "
"[code]false[/code]. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນໝູນຈາກສ່ວນປາຍ."

msgid "Sets the [Bone2D] node assigned to the CCDIK joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ CCDIK joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid ""
"Sets the bone index, [param bone_idx], of the CCDIK joint at [param "
"joint_idx]. When possible, this will also update the [code]bone2d_node[/code] "
"of the CCDIK joint based on data provided by the linked skeleton."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າດັດສະນີກະດູກ, [param bone_idx], ຂອງ CCDIK joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]. "
"ຫາກເປັນໄປໄດ້, ມັນຈະອັບເດດ [code]bone2d_node[/code] ຂອງ CCDIK joint "
"ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນຈາກໂຄງກະດູກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Sets whether the CCDIK joint at [param joint_idx] uses an inverted joint "
"constraint.\n"
"An inverted joint constraint only constraints the CCDIK joint to the angles "
"[i]outside of[/i] the inputted minimum and maximum angles. For this reason, "
"it is referred to as an inverted joint constraint, as it constraints the "
"joint to the outside of the inputted values."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າ CCDIK joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx] ຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບປີ້ນກັບຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບປີ້ນກັບຈະຈຳກັດ CCDIK joint ໃຫ້ຢູ່ສະເພາະມຸມທີ່ [i]ຢູ່ນອກ[/i] ມຸມຕໍ່າສຸດ ແລະ "
"ສູງສຸດທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າໄປ. ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, ມັນຈຶ່ງຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບປີ້ນກັບ, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນຈຳກັດຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃຫ້ຢູ່ນອກຄ່າທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າມາ."

msgid "Sets the maximum angle constraint for the joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າມຸມສູງສຸດຂອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid "Sets the minimum angle constraint for the joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າມຸມຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid ""
"Determines whether angle constraints on the CCDIK joint at [param joint_idx] "
"are enabled. When [code]true[/code], constraints will be enabled and taken "
"into account when solving."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງມຸມໃນ CCDIK joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຫຼືບໍ່. ເມື່ອເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code], ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ຖືກນຳມາພິຈາລະນາເມື່ອທຳການຄຳນວນ."

msgid ""
"Sets whether the joint at [param joint_idx] is set to rotate from the joint, "
"[code]true[/code], or to rotate from the tip, [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint_idx] ຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ໝູນຈາກຂໍ້ຕໍ່, [code]true[/code], ຫຼື ໝູນຈາກສ່ວນປາຍ, "
"[code]false[/code]."

msgid "The number of CCDIK joints in the CCDIK modification."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂອງ CCDIK joints ໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ CCDIK."

msgid ""
"The NodePath to the node that is the target for the CCDIK modification. This "
"node is what the CCDIK chain will attempt to rotate the bone chain to."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໂນດ (NodePath) ໄປຫາໂນດທີ່ເປັນເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງ CCDIK. ໂນດນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ລຳດັບ "
"CCDIK ຈະພະຍາຍາມໝູນລຳດັບກະດູກໃຫ້ໄປຫາ."

msgid ""
"The end position of the CCDIK chain. Typically, this should be a child of a "
"[Bone2D] node attached to the final [Bone2D] in the CCDIK chain."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງສ່ວນປາຍຂອງລຳດັບ CCDIK. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວນເປັນລູກຂອງໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບ "
"[Bone2D] ສຸດທ້າຍໃນລຳດັບ CCDIK."

msgid ""
"A modification that uses FABRIK to manipulate a series of [Bone2D] nodes to "
"reach a target."
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ໃຊ້ FABRIK ເພື່ອຈັດການກັບລຳດັບໂນດ [Bone2D] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄປຮອດເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"This [SkeletonModification2D] uses an algorithm called Forward And Backward "
"Reaching Inverse Kinematics, or FABRIK, to rotate a bone chain so that it "
"reaches a target.\n"
"FABRIK works by knowing the positions and lengths of a series of bones, "
"typically called a \"bone chain\". It first starts by running a forward pass, "
"which places the final bone at the target's position. Then all other bones "
"are moved towards the tip bone, so they stay at the defined bone length away. "
"Then a backwards pass is performed, where the root/first bone in the FABRIK "
"chain is placed back at the origin. Then all other bones are moved so they "
"stay at the defined bone length away. This positions the bone chain so that "
"it reaches the target when possible, but all of the bones stay the correct "
"length away from each other.\n"
"Because of how FABRIK works, it often gives more natural results than those "
"seen in [SkeletonModification2DCCDIK].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The FABRIK modifier has [code]fabrik_joints[/code], which are "
"the data objects that hold the data for each joint in the FABRIK chain. This "
"is different from [Bone2D] nodes! FABRIK joints hold the data needed for each "
"[Bone2D] in the bone chain used by FABRIK.\n"
"To help control how the FABRIK joints move, a magnet vector can be passed, "
"which can nudge the bones in a certain direction prior to solving, giving a "
"level of control over the final result."
msgstr ""
"[SkeletonModification2D] ນີ້ໃຊ້ອັລກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ Forward And Backward Reaching "
"Inverse Kinematics, ຫຼື FABRIK, ເພື່ອໝູນລຳດັບກະດູກໃຫ້ໄປຮອດເປົ້າໝາຍ.\n"
"FABRIK ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການຮັບຮູ້ຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ຄວາມຍາວຂອງຊຸດກະດູກ, ເຊິ່ງປົກກະຕິເອີ້ນວ່າ \"bone "
"chain\". ມັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການເຮັດວຽກແບບ forward pass, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະວາງກະດູກສຸດທ້າຍໄວ້ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເປົ້າໝາຍ. ຈາກນັ້ນກະດູກອື່ນໆທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຍ້າຍໄປຫາກະດູກສ່ວນປາຍ, "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກມັນຢູ່ໃນໄລຍະຫ່າງຕາມຄວາມຍາວຂອງກະດູກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. ຈາກນັ້ນຈະທຳການ backward pass, "
"ບ່ອນທີ່ກະດູກຮາກ/ກະດູກທຳອິດໃນລຳດັບ FABRIK ຈະຖືກວາງກັບຄືນໄປທີ່ຈຸດກຳເນີດ (origin). "
"ຈາກນັ້ນກະດູກອື່ນໆທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຍ້າຍເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກມັນຢູ່ໃນໄລຍະຫ່າງຕາມຄວາມຍາວຂອງກະດູກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຈັດຕຳແໜ່ງລຳດັບກະດູກໃຫ້ໄປຮອດເປົ້າໝາຍເມື່ອເປັນໄປໄດ້, "
"ແຕ່ກະດູກທັງໝົດຍັງຄົງຮັກສາໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງລະຫວ່າງກັນໄວ້.\n"
"ເນື່ອງຈາກວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ FABRIK, ມັນມັກຈະໃຫ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ເບິ່ງເປັນທຳມະຊາດຫຼາຍກວ່າ "
"[SkeletonModification2DCCDIK].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] FABRIK modifier ມີ [code]fabrik_joints[/code], "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນວັດຖຸຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃນລຳດັບ FABRIK. ນີ້ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກໂນດ [Bone2D]! FABRIK "
"joints ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ [Bone2D] ໃນລຳດັບກະດູກທີ່ FABRIK ໃຊ້.\n"
"ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍຄວບຄຸມການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງ FABRIK joints, ສາມາດສົ່ງເວກເຕີແມ່ເຫຼັກ (magnet vector) "
"ໄປໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດດັນກະດູກໄປໃນທິດທາງໃດໜຶ່ງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະທຳການຄຳນວນ, "
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຄວບຄຸມຜົນລັດຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Bone2D] node assigned to the FABRIK joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ FABRIK joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [Bone2D] node assigned to the FABRIK joint at [param "
"joint_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າດັດສະນີຂອງໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ FABRIK joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid "Returns the magnet position vector for the joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າເວກເຕີຕຳແໜ່ງແມ່ເຫຼັກສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns whether the joint is using the target's rotation rather than allowing "
"FABRIK to rotate the joint. This option only applies to the tip/final joint "
"in the chain."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າຂໍ້ຕໍ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ການໝູນຂອງເປົ້າໝາຍແທນທີ່ຈະປ່ອຍໃຫ້ FABRIK ໝູນຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຫຼືບໍ່. "
"ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ສ່ວນປາຍ/ສຸດທ້າຍໃນລຳດັບ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [Bone2D] node assigned to the FABRIK joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ FABRIK joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid ""
"Sets the bone index, [param bone_idx], of the FABRIK joint at [param "
"joint_idx]. When possible, this will also update the [code]bone2d_node[/code] "
"of the FABRIK joint based on data provided by the linked skeleton."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າດັດສະນີກະດູກ, [param bone_idx], ຂອງ FABRIK joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]. "
"ຫາກເປັນໄປໄດ້, ມັນຈະອັບເດດ [code]bone2d_node[/code] ຂອງ FABRIK joint "
"ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນຈາກໂຄງກະດູກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້."

msgid "Sets the magnet position vector for the joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວກເຕີຕຳແໜ່ງແມ່ເຫຼັກສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid ""
"Sets whether the joint at [param joint_idx] will use the target node's "
"rotation rather than letting FABRIK rotate the node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This option only works for the tip/final joint in the chain. For "
"all other nodes, this option will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint_idx] ຈະໃຊ້ການໝູນຂອງໂນດເປົ້າໝາຍແທນທີ່ຈະປ່ອຍໃຫ້ FABRIK ໝູນໂນດຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ສ່ວນປາຍ/ສຸດທ້າຍໃນລຳດັບເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສຳລັບໂນດອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ, "
"ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

msgid "The number of FABRIK joints in the FABRIK modification."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂອງ FABRIK joints ໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ FABRIK."

msgid ""
"The NodePath to the node that is the target for the FABRIK modification. This "
"node is what the FABRIK chain will attempt to rotate the bone chain to."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໂນດ (NodePath) ໄປຫາໂນດທີ່ເປັນເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງ FABRIK. ໂນດນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ລຳດັບ "
"FABRIK ຈະພະຍາຍາມໝູນລຳດັບກະດູກໃຫ້ໄປຫາ."

msgid ""
"A modification that jiggles [Bone2D] nodes as they move towards a target."
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ໂນດ [Bone2D] ສັ່ນໄຫວ (jiggle) ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພວກມັນເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປຫາເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"This modification moves a series of bones, typically called a bone chain, "
"towards a target. What makes this modification special is that it calculates "
"the velocity and acceleration for each bone in the bone chain, and runs a "
"very light physics-like calculation using the inputted values. This allows "
"the bones to overshoot the target and \"jiggle\" around. It can be configured "
"to act more like a spring, or sway around like cloth might.\n"
"This modification is useful for adding additional motion to things like hair, "
"the edges of clothing, and more. It has several settings to that allow "
"control over how the joint moves when the target moves.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The Jiggle modifier has [code]jiggle_joints[/code], which are "
"the data objects that hold the data for each joint in the Jiggle chain. This "
"is different from than [Bone2D] nodes! Jiggle joints hold the data needed for "
"each [Bone2D] in the bone chain used by the Jiggle modification."
msgstr ""
"ການປັບແຕ່ງນີ້ຈະເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຊຸດກະດູກ, ເຊິ່ງປົກກະຕິເອີ້ນວ່າ bone chain, ໄປຫາເປົ້າໝາຍ. "
"ສິ່ງທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ການປັບແຕ່ງນີ້ພິເສດກໍຄື ມັນຈະຄຳນວນຄວາມໄວ ແລະ ຄວາມເລັ່ງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະກະດູກໃນລຳດັບ, ແລະ "
"ປະມວນຜົນການຄຳນວນທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບຟິຊິກໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າມາ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ກະດູກສາມາດເຄື່ອນທີ່ເລີຍເປົ້າໝາຍ "
"ແລະ \"ສັ່ນໄຫວ\" ໄປມາໄດ້. ມັນສາມາດຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບສະປິງ, ຫຼື ແກວ່ງໄປມາຄືກັບຜ້າ.\n"
"ການປັບແຕ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການເພີ່ມການເຄື່ອນໄຫວເສີມໃຫ້ກັບສິ່ງຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ເສັ້ນຜົມ, ຂອບເສື້ອຜ້າ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. "
"ມັນມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼາຍຢ່າງທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ເມື່ອເປົ້າໝາຍເຄື່ອນທີ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Jiggle modifier ມີ [code]jiggle_joints[/code], "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນວັດຖຸຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃນລຳດັບ Jiggle. ນີ້ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກໂນດ [Bone2D]! Jiggle "
"joints ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ [Bone2D] ໃນລຳດັບກະດູກທີ່ການປັບແຕ່ງ Jiggle ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the collision mask used by the Jiggle modifier when collisions are "
"enabled."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າໜ້າກາກການປະທະ (collision mask) ທີ່ Jiggle modifier ໃຊ້ເມື່ອເປີດການປະທະ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Bone2D] node assigned to the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ Jiggle joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [Bone2D] node assigned to the Jiggle joint at [param "
"joint_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າດັດສະນີຂອງໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ Jiggle joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid "Returns the amount of damping of the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນການໜ່ວງ (damping) ຂອງ Jiggle joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Vector2] representing the amount of gravity the Jiggle joint at "
"[param joint_idx] is influenced by."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [Vector2] ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງຈຳນວນແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງທີ່ Jiggle joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx] "
"ໄດ້ຮັບອິດທິພົນ."

msgid "Returns the amount of mass of the jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນມວນສານ (mass) ຂອງ jiggle joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns a boolean that indicates whether the joint at [param joint_idx] is "
"overriding the default Jiggle joint data defined in the modification."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າບູລີນທີ່ລະບຸວ່າຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint_idx] ກຳລັງແທນທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນ Jiggle joint "
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນການປັບແຕ່ງຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Returns the stiffness of the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຄວາມແຂງ (stiffness) ຂອງ Jiggle joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns a boolean that indicates whether the joint at [param joint_idx] is "
"using gravity or not."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າບູລີນທີ່ລະບຸວ່າຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint_idx] ກຳລັງໃຊ້ແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns whether the jiggle modifier is taking physics colliders into account "
"when solving."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າ jiggle modifier ກຳລັງນຳເອົາຕົວປະທະທາງຟິຊິກມາພິຈາລະນາເມື່ອທຳການຄຳນວນຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Resets the internal jiggle simulation state to the current bone positions, "
"clearing velocity, acceleration, and accumulated forces."
msgstr ""
"ຣີເຊັດສະຖານະການຈຳລອງ jiggle ພາຍໃນໃຫ້ເປັນໄປຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງກະດູກປັດຈຸບັນ, ໂດຍລ້າງຄ່າຄວາມໄວ, "
"ຄວາມເລັ່ງ ແລະ ແຮງທີ່ສະສົມໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the collision mask that the Jiggle modifier will use when reacting to "
"colliders, if the Jiggle modifier is set to take colliders into account."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໜ້າກາກການປະທະທີ່ Jiggle modifier ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ຕົວປະທະ, ຫາກ Jiggle modifier "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາຕົວປະທະ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [Bone2D] node assigned to the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ Jiggle joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid ""
"Sets the bone index, [param bone_idx], of the Jiggle joint at [param "
"joint_idx]. When possible, this will also update the [code]bone2d_node[/code] "
"of the Jiggle joint based on data provided by the linked skeleton."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າດັດສະນີກະດູກ, [param bone_idx], ຂອງ Jiggle joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]. "
"ຫາກເປັນໄປໄດ້, ມັນຈະອັບເດດ [code]bone2d_node[/code] ຂອງ Jiggle joint "
"ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນຈາກໂຄງກະດູກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້."

msgid "Sets the amount of damping of the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນການໜ່ວງ (damping) ຂອງ Jiggle joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid "Sets the gravity vector of the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວກເຕີແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງຂອງ Jiggle joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid "Sets the of mass of the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າມວນສານ (mass) ຂອງ Jiggle joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid ""
"Sets whether the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx] should override the "
"default Jiggle joint settings. Setting this to [code]true[/code] will make "
"the joint use its own settings rather than the default ones attached to the "
"modification."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າ Jiggle joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx] ຄວນແທນທີ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Jiggle joint ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫຼືບໍ່. "
"ການຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງມັນເອງແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຕິດມາກັບການປັບແຕ່ງ."

msgid "Sets the of stiffness of the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມແຂງ (stiffness) ຂອງ Jiggle joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid "Sets whether the Jiggle joint at [param joint_idx] should use gravity."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າ Jiggle joint ທີ່ [param joint_idx] ຄວນໃຊ້ແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Jiggle modifier will take colliders into account, "
"keeping them from entering into these collision objects."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], Jiggle modifier ຈະພິຈາລະນາຕົວປະທະ, "
"ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ພວກມັນເຂົ້າໄປໃນວັດຖຸປະທະເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

msgid ""
"The default amount of damping applied to the Jiggle joints, if they are not "
"overridden. Higher values lead to more of the calculated velocity being "
"applied."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນການໜ່ວງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບ Jiggle joints, ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກແທນທີ່. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄວາມໄວທີ່ຄຳນວນໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The default amount of gravity applied to the Jiggle joints, if they are not "
"overridden."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບ Jiggle joints, ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກແທນທີ່."

msgid "The amount of Jiggle joints in the Jiggle modification."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂອງ Jiggle joints ໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ Jiggle."

msgid ""
"The default amount of mass assigned to the Jiggle joints, if they are not "
"overridden. Higher values lead to faster movements and more overshooting."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນມວນສານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ Jiggle joints, ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກແທນທີ່. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະນຳໄປສູ່ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວທີ່ໄວຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ເລີຍເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The default amount of stiffness assigned to the Jiggle joints, if they are "
"not overridden. Higher values act more like springs, quickly moving into the "
"correct position."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຄວາມແຂງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ Jiggle joints, ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກແທນທີ່. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບສະປິງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ໂດຍເຄື່ອນທີ່ເຂົ້າສູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຢ່າງໄວວາ."

msgid ""
"The NodePath to the node that is the target for the Jiggle modification. This "
"node is what the Jiggle chain will attempt to rotate the bone chain to."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໂນດ (NodePath) ໄປຫາໂນດທີ່ເປັນເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງ Jiggle. ໂນດນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ລຳດັບ "
"Jiggle ຈະພະຍາຍາມໝູນລຳດັບກະດູກໃຫ້ໄປຫາ."

msgid ""
"Whether the gravity vector, [member gravity], should be applied to the Jiggle "
"joints, assuming they are not overriding the default settings."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຄວນນຳໃຊ້ເວກເຕີແຮງໂນ້ມຖ່ວງ, [member gravity], ກັບ Jiggle joints ຫຼືບໍ່, "
"ໂດຍສົມມຸດວ່າພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ແທນທີ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "A modification that rotates a [Bone2D] node to look at a target."
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ໝູນໂນດ [Bone2D] ໃຫ້ຫັນໄປຫາເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"This [SkeletonModification2D] rotates a bone to look a target. This is "
"extremely helpful for moving character's head to look at the player, rotating "
"a turret to look at a target, or any other case where you want to make a bone "
"rotate towards something quickly and easily."
msgstr ""
"[SkeletonModification2D] ນີ້ຈະໝູນກະດູກໃຫ້ຫັນໄປຫາເປົ້າໝາຍ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໃນການເຮັດໃຫ້ຫົວຂອງຕົວລະຄອນຫັນໄປເບິ່ງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ, ການໝູນປ້ອມປືນໃຫ້ຫັນໄປຫາເປົ້າໝາຍ, ຫຼື "
"ກໍລະນີອື່ນໆທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຮັດໃຫ້ກະດູກໝູນໄປຫາບາງສິ່ງບາງຢ່າງຢ່າງໄວວາ ແລະ ງ່າຍດາຍ."

msgid ""
"Returns the amount of additional rotation that is applied after the LookAt "
"modification executes."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນການໝູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຫຼັງຈາກການປັບແຕ່ງ LookAt ເຮັດວຽກສຳເລັດ."

msgid ""
"Returns whether the constraints to this modification are inverted or not."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງການປັບແຕ່ງນີ້ຖືກປີ້ນກັບ (inverted) ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Returns the constraint's maximum allowed angle."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າມຸມສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດຂອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ."

msgid "Returns the constraint's minimum allowed angle."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າມຸມຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດຂອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the LookAt modification is using constraints."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກການປັບແຕ່ງ LookAt ກຳລັງໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the amount of additional rotation that is to be applied after executing "
"the modification. This allows for offsetting the results by the inputted "
"rotation amount."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນການໝູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຫຼັງຈາກປະຕິບັດການປັບແຕ່ງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຊົດເຊີຍ (offset) "
"ຜົນລັດດ້ວຍຈຳນວນການໝູນທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າມາ."

msgid ""
"When [code]true[/code], the modification will use an inverted joint "
"constraint.\n"
"An inverted joint constraint only constraints the [Bone2D] to the angles "
"[i]outside of[/i] the inputted minimum and maximum angles. For this reason, "
"it is referred to as an inverted joint constraint, as it constraints the "
"joint to the outside of the inputted values."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການປັບແຕ່ງຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບປີ້ນກັບ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບປີ້ນກັບຈະຈຳກັດ [Bone2D] ໃຫ້ຢູ່ສະເພາະມຸມທີ່ [i]ຢູ່ນອກ[/i] ມຸມຕໍ່າສຸດ ແລະ "
"ສູງສຸດທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າໄປ. ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, ມັນຈຶ່ງຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແບບປີ້ນກັບ, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນຈຳກັດຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃຫ້ຢູ່ນອກຄ່າທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າມາ."

msgid "Sets the constraint's maximum allowed angle."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າມຸມສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດຂອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ."

msgid "Sets the constraint's minimum allowed angle."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າມຸມຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດຂອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ."

msgid ""
"Sets whether this modification will use constraints or not. When [code]true[/"
"code], constraints will be applied when solving the LookAt modification."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າການປັບແຕ່ງນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຫຼືບໍ່. ເມື່ອເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເມື່ອທຳການຄຳນວນການປັບແຕ່ງ LookAt."

msgid "The [Bone2D] node that the modification will operate on."
msgstr "ໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ການປັບແຕ່ງຈະເຮັດວຽກນຳ."

msgid "The index of the [Bone2D] node that the modification will operate on."
msgstr "ດັດສະນີຂອງໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ການປັບແຕ່ງຈະເຮັດວຽກນຳ."

msgid ""
"The NodePath to the node that is the target for the LookAt modification. This "
"node is what the modification will rotate the [Bone2D] to."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໂນດ (NodePath) ໄປຫາໂນດທີ່ເປັນເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງ LookAt. "
"ໂນດນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ການປັບແຕ່ງຈະໝູນ [Bone2D] ໃຫ້ໄປຫາ."

msgid ""
"Physical bones may be changed in the future to perform the position update of "
"[Bone2D] on their own, without needing this resource."
msgstr ""
"Physical bones ອາດຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໃນອະນາຄົດເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດອັບເດດຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ [Bone2D] "
"ໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວມັນເອງ, ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້."

msgid ""
"A modification that applies the transforms of [PhysicalBone2D] nodes to "
"[Bone2D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"ການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ການແປງ (transforms) ຂອງໂນດ [PhysicalBone2D] ກັບໂນດ [Bone2D]."

msgid ""
"This modification takes the transforms of [PhysicalBone2D] nodes and applies "
"them to [Bone2D] nodes. This allows the [Bone2D] nodes to react to physics "
"thanks to the linked [PhysicalBone2D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"ການປັບແຕ່ງນີ້ຈະນຳເອົາການແປງຂອງໂນດ [PhysicalBone2D] ມາໃຊ້ກັບໂນດ [Bone2D]. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໂນດ "
"[Bone2D] ສາມາດຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ຟິຊິກໄດ້ຍ້ອນໂນດ [PhysicalBone2D] ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Empties the list of [PhysicalBone2D] nodes and populates it with all "
"[PhysicalBone2D] nodes that are children of the [Skeleton2D]."
msgstr ""
"ລ້າງລາຍການໂນດ [PhysicalBone2D] ແລະ ເພີ່ມໂນດ [PhysicalBone2D] ທັງໝົດທີ່ເປັນລູກຂອງ "
"[Skeleton2D] ເຂົ້າໄປແທນ."

msgid "Returns the [PhysicalBone2D] node at [param joint_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າໂນດ [PhysicalBone2D] ທີ່ [param joint_idx]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [PhysicalBone2D] node at [param joint_idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is just the index used for this modification, not the bone "
"index used in the [Skeleton2D]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂນດ [PhysicalBone2D] ທີ່ [param joint_idx].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ດັດສະນີທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງນີ້, ບໍ່ແມ່ນດັດສະນີກະດູກທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ "
"[Skeleton2D]."

msgid ""
"Tell the [PhysicalBone2D] nodes to start simulating and interacting with the "
"physics world.\n"
"Optionally, an array of bone names can be passed to this function, and that "
"will cause only [PhysicalBone2D] nodes with those names to start simulating."
msgstr ""
"ບອກໃຫ້ໂນດ [PhysicalBone2D] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຈຳລອງ ແລະ ໂຕ້ຕອບກັບໂລກຟິຊິກ. "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດສົ່ງອາເຣຂອງຊື່ກະດູກໄປໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສະເພາະໂນດ [PhysicalBone2D] "
"ທີ່ມີຊື່ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຈຳລອງ."

msgid ""
"Tell the [PhysicalBone2D] nodes to stop simulating and interacting with the "
"physics world.\n"
"Optionally, an array of bone names can be passed to this function, and that "
"will cause only [PhysicalBone2D] nodes with those names to stop simulating."
msgstr ""
"ບອກໃຫ້ໂນດ [PhysicalBone2D] ຢຸດການຈຳລອງ ແລະ ໂຕ້ຕອບກັບໂລກຟິຊິກ. "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດສົ່ງອາເຣຂອງຊື່ກະດູກໄປໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສະເພາະໂນດ [PhysicalBone2D] "
"ທີ່ມີຊື່ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຢຸດການຈຳລອງ."

msgid "The number of [PhysicalBone2D] nodes linked in this modification."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂອງໂນດ [PhysicalBone2D] ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນການປັບແຕ່ງນີ້."

msgid "A modification that holds and executes a [SkeletonModificationStack2D]."
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ເກັບຮັກສາ ແລະ ປະຕິບັດການ [SkeletonModificationStack2D]."

msgid ""
"This [SkeletonModification2D] holds a reference to a "
"[SkeletonModificationStack2D], allowing you to use multiple modification "
"stacks on a single [Skeleton2D].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The modifications in the held [SkeletonModificationStack2D] will "
"only be executed if their execution mode matches the execution mode of the "
"SkeletonModification2DStackHolder."
msgstr ""
"[SkeletonModification2D] ນີ້ເກັບການອ້າງອີງເຖິງ [SkeletonModificationStack2D], "
"ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ modification stacks ຫຼາຍອັນໃນ [Skeleton2D] ດຽວໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປັບແຕ່ງໃນ [SkeletonModificationStack2D] "
"ທີ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອໂໝດການປະຕິບັດການຂອງພວກມັນກົງກັບໂໝດການປະຕິບັດການຂອງ "
"SkeletonModification2DStackHolder."

msgid ""
"Returns the [SkeletonModificationStack2D] that this modification is holding."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [SkeletonModificationStack2D] ທີ່ການປັບແຕ່ງນີ້ກຳລັງເກັບໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the [SkeletonModificationStack2D] that this modification is holding. "
"This modification stack will then be executed when this modification is "
"executed."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [SkeletonModificationStack2D] ທີ່ການປັບແຕ່ງນີ້ຈະເກັບໄວ້. modification stack "
"ນີ້ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດເມື່ອການປັບແຕ່ງນີ້ຖືກປະຕິບັດ."

msgid ""
"A modification that rotates two bones using the law of cosines to reach the "
"target."
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ໝູນກະດູກສອງອັນໂດຍໃຊ້ກົດຂອງໂກຊິນ (law of cosines) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄປຮອດເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"This [SkeletonModification2D] uses an algorithm typically called TwoBoneIK. "
"This algorithm works by leveraging the law of cosines and the lengths of the "
"bones to figure out what rotation the bones currently have, and what rotation "
"they need to make a complete triangle, where the first bone, the second bone, "
"and the target form the three vertices of the triangle. Because the algorithm "
"works by making a triangle, it can only operate on two bones.\n"
"TwoBoneIK is great for arms, legs, and really any joints that can be "
"represented by just two bones that bend to reach a target. This solver is "
"more lightweight than [SkeletonModification2DFABRIK], but gives similar, "
"natural looking results."
msgstr ""
"[SkeletonModification2D] ນີ້ໃຊ້ອັລກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ປົກກະຕິເອີ້ນວ່າ TwoBoneIK. "
"ອັລກໍຣິທຶມນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ກົດຂອງໂກຊິນ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມຍາວຂອງກະດູກເພື່ອຄຳນວນວ່າກະດູກມີການໝູນແນວໃດໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ແລະ "
"ພວກມັນຕ້ອງການການໝູນແນວໃດເພື່ອສ້າງເປັນຮູບສາມແຈທີ່ສົມບູນ, ບ່ອນທີ່ກະດູກທຳອິດ, ກະດູກທີສອງ ແລະ "
"ເປົ້າໝາຍປະກອບເປັນສາມຈຸດຈອມຂອງຮູບສາມແຈ. ເນື່ອງຈາກອັລກໍຣິທຶມເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການສ້າງຮູບສາມແຈ, "
"ມັນຈຶ່ງສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ກັບກະດູກພຽງສອງອັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"TwoBoneIK ເໝາະສຳລັບແຂນ, ຂາ ແລະ "
"ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃດໆທີ່ສາມາດສະແດງອອກດ້ວຍກະດູກພຽງສອງອັນທີ່ງໍເພື່ອໄປຫາເປົ້າໝາຍ. solver ນີ້ມີນ້ຳໜັກເບົາກວ່າ "
"[SkeletonModification2DFABRIK], ແຕ່ໃຫ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ເບິ່ງເປັນທຳມະຊາດຄ້າຍຄືກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Bone2D] node that is being used as the first bone in the "
"TwoBoneIK modification."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນກະດູກທຳອິດໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ TwoBoneIK."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [Bone2D] node that is being used as the first bone "
"in the TwoBoneIK modification."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າດັດສະນີຂອງໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນກະດູກທຳອິດໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ TwoBoneIK."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Bone2D] node that is being used as the second bone in the "
"TwoBoneIK modification."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນກະດູກທີສອງໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ TwoBoneIK."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [Bone2D] node that is being used as the second bone "
"in the TwoBoneIK modification."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າດັດສະນີຂອງໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນກະດູກທີສອງໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ TwoBoneIK."

msgid ""
"Sets the [Bone2D] node that is being used as the first bone in the TwoBoneIK "
"modification."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນກະດູກທຳອິດໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ TwoBoneIK."

msgid ""
"Sets the index of the [Bone2D] node that is being used as the first bone in "
"the TwoBoneIK modification."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າດັດສະນີຂອງໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນກະດູກທຳອິດໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ TwoBoneIK."

msgid ""
"Sets the [Bone2D] node that is being used as the second bone in the TwoBoneIK "
"modification."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນກະດູກທີສອງໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ TwoBoneIK."

msgid ""
"Sets the index of the [Bone2D] node that is being used as the second bone in "
"the TwoBoneIK modification."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າດັດສະນີຂອງໂນດ [Bone2D] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນກະດູກທີສອງໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ TwoBoneIK."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the bones in the modification will bend outward as "
"opposed to inwards when contracting. If [code]false[/code], the bones will "
"bend inwards when contracting."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ກະດູກໃນການປັບແຕ່ງຈະງໍອອກທາງນອກແທນທີ່ຈະງໍເຂົ້າທາງໃນເມື່ອຫົດຕົວ. "
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]false[/code], ກະດູກຈະງໍເຂົ້າທາງໃນເມື່ອຫົດຕົວ."

msgid ""
"The maximum distance the target can be at. If the target is farther than this "
"distance, the modification will solve as if it's at this maximum distance. "
"When set to [code]0[/code], the modification will solve without distance "
"constraints."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງສູງສຸດທີ່ເປົ້າໝາຍສາມາດຢູ່ໄດ້. ຫາກເປົ້າໝາຍຢູ່ໄກກວ່າໄລຍະນີ້, "
"ການປັບແຕ່ງຈະທຳການຄຳນວນຄືກັບວ່າມັນຢູ່ໃນໄລຍະສູງສຸດນີ້. ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/code], "
"ການປັບແຕ່ງຈະຄຳນວນໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງໄລຍະຫ່າງ."

msgid ""
"The minimum distance the target can be at. If the target is closer than this "
"distance, the modification will solve as if it's at this minimum distance. "
"When set to [code]0[/code], the modification will solve without distance "
"constraints."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ເປົ້າໝາຍສາມາດຢູ່ໄດ້. ຫາກເປົ້າໝາຍຢູ່ໃກ້ກວ່າໄລຍະນີ້, "
"ການປັບແຕ່ງຈະທຳການຄຳນວນຄືກັບວ່າມັນຢູ່ໃນໄລຍະຕໍ່າສຸດນີ້. ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/code], "
"ການປັບແຕ່ງຈະຄຳນວນໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງໄລຍະຫ່າງ."

msgid ""
"The NodePath to the node that is the target for the TwoBoneIK modification. "
"This node is what the modification will use when bending the [Bone2D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໂນດ (NodePath) ໄປຫາໂນດທີ່ເປັນເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງ TwoBoneIK. "
"ໂນດນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ການປັບແຕ່ງຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອທຳການງໍໂນດ [Bone2D]."

msgid "A resource that holds a stack of [SkeletonModification2D]s."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ເກັບຮັກສາ modification stack ຂອງ [SkeletonModification2D]."

msgid ""
"This resource is used by the Skeleton and holds a stack of "
"[SkeletonModification2D]s.\n"
"This controls the order of the modifications and how they are applied. "
"Modification order is especially important for full-body IK setups, as you "
"need to execute the modifications in the correct order to get the desired "
"results. For example, you want to execute a modification on the spine "
"[i]before[/i] the arms on a humanoid skeleton.\n"
"This resource also controls how strongly all of the modifications are applied "
"to the [Skeleton2D]."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍ Skeleton ແລະ ເກັບ modification stack ຂອງ "
"[SkeletonModification2D].\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວບຄຸມລຳດັບຂອງການປັບແຕ່ງ ແລະ ວິທີການນຳໃຊ້ພວກມັນ. "
"ລຳດັບຂອງການປັບແຕ່ງແມ່ນມີຄວາມສຳຄັນຫຼາຍສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ IK ແບບເຕັມຕົວ (full-body IK), "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດການປັບແຕ່ງຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ກະດູກສັນຫຼັງ [i]ກ່ອນ[/i] ທີ່ແຂນໃນໂຄງກະດູກມະນຸດ.\n"
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ຍັງຄວບຄຸມຄວາມແຮງໃນການນຳໃຊ້ການປັບແຕ່ງທັງໝົດກັບ [Skeleton2D]."

msgid "Adds the passed-in [SkeletonModification2D] to the stack."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ [SkeletonModification2D] ທີ່ສົ່ງເຂົ້າມາເຂົ້າໄປໃນ stack."

msgid ""
"Deletes the [SkeletonModification2D] at the index position [param mod_idx], "
"if it exists."
msgstr "ລຶບ [SkeletonModification2D] ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງດັດສະນີ [param mod_idx], ຫາກມີຢູ່."

msgid "Enables all [SkeletonModification2D]s in the stack."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [SkeletonModification2D] ທັງໝົດໃນ stack."

msgid ""
"Executes all of the [SkeletonModification2D]s in the stack that use the same "
"execution mode as the passed-in [param execution_mode], starting from index "
"[code]0[/code] to [member modification_count].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The order of the modifications can matter depending on the "
"modifications. For example, modifications on a spine should operate before "
"modifications on the arms in order to get proper results."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການ [SkeletonModification2D] ທັງໝົດໃນ stack ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂໝດການປະຕິບັດການດຽວກັບ [param "
"execution_mode] ທີ່ສົ່ງເຂົ້າມາ, ໂດຍເລີ່ມຈາກດັດສະນີ [code]0[/code] ຫາ [member "
"modification_count].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລຳດັບຂອງການປັບແຕ່ງອາດມີຄວາມສຳຄັນຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດການປັບແຕ່ງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ກະດູກສັນຫຼັງຄວນເຮັດວຽກກ່ອນການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ແຂນເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns a boolean that indicates whether the modification stack is setup and "
"can execute."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າບູລີນທີ່ລະບຸວ່າ modification stack ໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ສາມາດປະຕິບັດການໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the [SkeletonModification2D] at the passed-in index, [param mod_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [SkeletonModification2D] ທີ່ດັດສະນີ [param mod_idx] ທີ່ສົ່ງເຂົ້າມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Skeleton2D] node that the SkeletonModificationStack2D is bound "
"to."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າໂນດ [Skeleton2D] ທີ່ SkeletonModificationStack2D ຖືກຜູກມັດໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the modification at [param mod_idx] to the passed-in modification, "
"[param modification]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ [param mod_idx] ໃຫ້ເປັນການປັບແຕ່ງ [param modification] ທີ່ສົ່ງເຂົ້າມາ."

msgid ""
"Sets up the modification stack so it can execute. This function should be "
"called by [Skeleton2D] and shouldn't be manually called unless you know what "
"you are doing."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ modification stack ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດປະຕິບັດການໄດ້. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຄວນຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍ [Skeleton2D] "
"ແລະ ບໍ່ຄວນເອີ້ນໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ເຈົ້າຈະຮູ້ວ່າເຈົ້າກຳລັງເຮັດຫຍັງຢູ່."

msgid "The number of modifications in the stack."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂອງການປັບແຕ່ງໃນ stack."

msgid ""
"The interpolation strength of the modifications in stack. A value of [code]0[/"
"code] will make it where the modifications are not applied, a strength of "
"[code]0.5[/code] will be half applied, and a strength of [code]1[/code] will "
"allow the modifications to be fully applied and override the [Skeleton2D] "
"[Bone2D] poses."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງຂອງການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນ (Interpolation) ຂອງການປັບປ່ຽນໃນ stack. ຄ່າຂອງ [code]0[/code] "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ມີການນຳໃຊ້ການປັບປ່ຽນ, ຄວາມແຮງ [code]0.5[/code] ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ, ແລະ ຄວາມແຮງ "
"[code]1[/code] ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ການປັບປ່ຽນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຢ່າງເຕັມສ່ວນ ແລະ ແທນທີ່ທ່າທາງ (poses) ຂອງ "
"[Skeleton2D] [Bone2D]."

msgid "A node that may modify a Skeleton3D's bones."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ອາດຈະປັບປ່ຽນກະດູກຂອງ Skeleton3D."

msgid ""
"[SkeletonModifier3D] retrieves a target [Skeleton3D] by having a [Skeleton3D] "
"parent.\n"
"If there is an [AnimationMixer], a modification always performs after "
"playback process of the [AnimationMixer].\n"
"This node should be used to implement custom IK solvers, constraints, or "
"skeleton physics."
msgstr ""
"[SkeletonModifier3D] ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນເປົ້າໝາຍ [Skeleton3D] ໂດຍການມີ [Skeleton3D] ເປັນຕົວຫຼັກ "
"(parent).\n"
"ຖ້າມີ [AnimationMixer], ການປັບປ່ຽນຈະເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກຂະບວນການຫຼິ້ນຂອງ [AnimationMixer] "
"ສະເໝີ.\n"
"ໂນດນີ້ຄວນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ IK solvers ແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ (constraints), ຫຼື ຟີຊິກຂອງໂຄງຮ່າງ."

msgid "Design of the Skeleton Modifier 3D"
msgstr "ການອອກແບບຂອງ Skeleton Modifier 3D"

msgid "Use [method _process_modification_with_delta] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method _process_modification_with_delta] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Override this virtual method to implement a custom skeleton modifier. You "
"should do things like get the [Skeleton3D]'s current pose and apply the pose "
"here.\n"
"[method _process_modification] must not apply [member influence] to bone "
"poses because the [Skeleton3D] automatically applies influence to all bone "
"poses set by the modifier."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບ (Override) ວິທີການສະເໝືອນ (virtual method) ນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວປັບປ່ຽນໂຄງຮ່າງແບບກຳນົດເອງ. "
"ເຈົ້າຄວນເຮັດສິ່ງຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ດຶງເອົາທ່າທາງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ [Skeleton3D] ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ທ່າທາງຢູ່ນີ້.\n"
"[method _process_modification] ຕ້ອງບໍ່ນຳໃຊ້ [member influence] ກັບທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກ "
"ເພາະວ່າ [Skeleton3D] ຈະນຳໃຊ້ຜົນກະທົບ (influence) "
"ໃຫ້ກັບທຸກທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍຕົວປັບປ່ຽນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Override this virtual method to implement a custom skeleton modifier. You "
"should do things like get the [Skeleton3D]'s current pose and apply the pose "
"here.\n"
"[method _process_modification_with_delta] must not apply [member influence] "
"to bone poses because the [Skeleton3D] automatically applies influence to all "
"bone poses set by the modifier.\n"
"[param delta] is passed from parent [Skeleton3D]. See also [method "
"Skeleton3D.advance].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method may be called outside [method Node._process] and "
"[method Node._physics_process] with [param delta] is [code]0.0[/code], since "
"the modification should be processed immediately after initialization of the "
"[Skeleton3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບ (Override) ວິທີການສະເໝືອນນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວປັບປ່ຽນໂຄງຮ່າງແບບກຳນົດເອງ. ເຈົ້າຄວນເຮັດສິ່ງຕ່າງໆ "
"ເຊັ່ນ: ດຶງເອົາທ່າທາງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ [Skeleton3D] ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ທ່າທາງຢູ່ນີ້.\n"
"[method _process_modification_with_delta] ຕ້ອງບໍ່ນຳໃຊ້ [member influence] "
"ກັບທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກ ເພາະວ່າ [Skeleton3D] "
"ຈະນຳໃຊ້ຜົນກະທົບໃຫ້ກັບທຸກທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍຕົວປັບປ່ຽນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"[param delta] ຖືກສົ່ງມາຈາກ [Skeleton3D] ຕົວຫຼັກ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [method "
"Skeleton3D.advance].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ອາດຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຢູ່ນອກ [method Node._process] ແລະ [method "
"Node._physics_process] ໂດຍທີ່ [param delta] ແມ່ນ [code]0.0[/code], "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກການປັບປ່ຽນຄວນຖືກປະມວນຜົນທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [Skeleton3D]."

msgid "Called when the skeleton is changed."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອໂຄງຮ່າງຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Called when bone names and indices need to be validated, such as when "
"entering the scene tree or changing skeleton."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອຊື່ກະດູກ ແລະ ລຳດັບ (indices) ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການກວດສອບ, ເຊັ່ນ: ເມື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ scene "
"tree ຫຼື ປ່ຽນໂຄງຮ່າງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the parent [Skeleton3D] node if it exists. Otherwise, returns "
"[code]null[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໂນດ [Skeleton3D] ຕົວຫຼັກຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code]."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the [SkeletonModifier3D] will be processing."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [SkeletonModifier3D] ຈະເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the influence of the modification.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value is used by [Skeleton3D] to blend, so the "
"[SkeletonModifier3D] should always apply only 100% of the result without "
"interpolation."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຜົນກະທົບ (influence) ຂອງການປັບປ່ຽນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ [Skeleton3D] ເພື່ອປະສົມ (blend), ດັ່ງນັ້ນ "
"[SkeletonModifier3D] ຄວນນຳໃຊ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບພຽງ 100% ສະເໝີ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນ "
"(interpolation)."

msgid ""
"Notifies when the modification have been finished.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to get the modified bone pose by the modifier, you "
"must use [method Skeleton3D.get_bone_pose] or [method "
"Skeleton3D.get_bone_global_pose] at the moment this signal is fired."
msgstr ""
"ແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອການປັບປ່ຽນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເອົາທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກທີ່ຖືກປັບປ່ຽນໂດຍຕົວປັບປ່ຽນ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃຊ້ [method "
"Skeleton3D.get_bone_pose] ຫຼື [method Skeleton3D.get_bone_global_pose] "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ສັນຍານນີ້ຖືກສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid "Enumerated value for the +X axis."
msgstr "ຄ່າລຳດັບສຳລັບແກນ +X."

msgid "Enumerated value for the -X axis."
msgstr "ຄ່າລຳດັບສຳລັບແກນ -X."

msgid "Enumerated value for the +Y axis."
msgstr "ຄ່າລຳດັບສຳລັບແກນ +Y."

msgid "Enumerated value for the -Y axis."
msgstr "ຄ່າລຳດັບສຳລັບແກນ -Y."

msgid "Enumerated value for the +Z axis."
msgstr "ຄ່າລຳດັບສຳລັບແກນ +Z."

msgid "Enumerated value for the -Z axis."
msgstr "ຄ່າລຳດັບສຳລັບແກນ -Z."

msgid "Enumerated value for the axis from a parent bone to the child bone."
msgstr "ຄ່າລຳດັບສຳລັບແກນຈາກກະດູກຫຼັກ (parent) ໄປຫາ ກະດູກລູກ (child)."

msgid "Enumerated value for the case when the axis is undefined."
msgstr "ຄ່າລຳດັບສຳລັບກໍລະນີທີ່ແກນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດ."

msgid "Enumerated value for an optional axis."
msgstr "ຄ່າລຳດັບສຳລັບແກນເສີມ."

msgid "Enumerated value for the rotation of the X axis."
msgstr "ຄ່າລຳດັບສຳລັບການໝຸນຂອງແກນ X."

msgid "Enumerated value for the rotation of the Y axis."
msgstr "ຄ່າລຳດັບສຳລັບການໝຸນຂອງແກນ Y."

msgid "Enumerated value for the rotation of the Z axis."
msgstr "ຄ່າລຳດັບສຳລັບການໝຸນຂອງແກນ Z."

msgid "Enumerated value for the unconstrained rotation."
msgstr "ຄ່າລຳດັບສຳລັບການໝຸນແບບບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ."

msgid "Enumerated value for an optional rotation axis."
msgstr "ຄ່າລຳດັບສຳລັບແກນການໝຸນເສີມ."

msgid ""
"Base class for a profile of a virtual skeleton used as a target for "
"retargeting."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຂອງໂຄງຮ່າງສະເໝືອນທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບການປ່ຽນເປົ້າໝາຍ (retargeting)."

msgid ""
"This resource is used in [EditorScenePostImport]. Some parameters are "
"referring to bones in [Skeleton3D], [Skin], [Animation], and some other nodes "
"are rewritten based on the parameters of [SkeletonProfile].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] These parameters need to be set only when creating a custom "
"profile. In [SkeletonProfileHumanoid], they are defined internally as read-"
"only values."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນ [EditorScenePostImport]. ບາງພາຣາມິເຕີແມ່ນອ້າງອີງເຖິງກະດູກໃນ "
"[Skeleton3D], [Skin], [Animation], ແລະ ບາງໂນດອື່ນໆຈະຖືກຂຽນຄືນໃໝ່ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງ "
"[SkeletonProfile].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ກຳນົດເມື່ອສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ແບບກຳນົດເອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນ "
"[SkeletonProfileHumanoid], ພວກມັນຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ພາຍໃນເປັນຄ່າທີ່ອ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ."

msgid "Returns the bone index that matches [param bone_name] as its name."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລຳດັບ (index) ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ກົງກັບ [param bone_name]."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the bone at [param bone_idx] that will be the key name in "
"the [BoneMap].\n"
"In the retargeting process, the returned bone name is the bone name of the "
"target skeleton."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ລຳດັບ [param bone_idx] ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນຊື່ຫຼັກ (key name) ໃນ [BoneMap].\n"
"ໃນຂະບວນການປ່ຽນເປົ້າໝາຍ (retargeting), ຊື່ກະດູກທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນແມ່ນຊື່ກະດູກຂອງໂຄງຮ່າງເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the bone which is the parent to the bone at [param "
"bone_idx]. The result is empty if the bone has no parent."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ເປັນຕົວຫຼັກ (parent) ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ລຳດັບ [param bone_idx]. "
"ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະວ່າງເປົ່າຖ້າກະດູກບໍ່ມີຕົວຫຼັກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the bone which is the tail of the bone at [param "
"bone_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ເປັນສ່ວນຫາງຂອງກະດູກທີ່ລຳດັບ [param bone_idx]."

msgid "Returns the group of the bone at [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນກຸ່ມຂອງກະດູກທີ່ລຳດັບ [param bone_idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the group at [param group_idx] that will be the drawing "
"group in the [BoneMap] editor."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງກຸ່ມທີ່ລຳດັບ [param group_idx] ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນກຸ່ມແຕ້ມໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ [BoneMap]."

msgid ""
"Returns the offset of the bone at [param bone_idx] that will be the button "
"position in the [BoneMap] editor.\n"
"This is the offset with origin at the top left corner of the square."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າອອຟເຊັດ (offset) ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ລຳດັບ [param bone_idx] ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນຕຳແໜ່ງປຸ່ມໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ "
"[BoneMap].\n"
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າອອຟເຊັດທີ່ມີຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຂອງຮູບຈະຕຸລັດ."

msgid "Returns the reference pose transform for bone [param bone_idx]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການແປງທ່າທາງອ້າງອີງ (reference pose transform) ສຳລັບກະດູກ [param bone_idx]."

msgid "Returns the tail direction of the bone at [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນທິດທາງຫາງຂອງກະດູກທີ່ລຳດັບ [param bone_idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the texture of the group at [param group_idx] that will be the "
"drawing group background image in the [BoneMap] editor."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ຂອງກຸ່ມທີ່ລຳດັບ [param group_idx] "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນຮູບພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງກຸ່ມແຕ້ມໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ [BoneMap]."

msgid ""
"Returns whether the bone at [param bone_idx] is required for retargeting.\n"
"This value is used by the bone map editor. If this method returns [code]true[/"
"code], and no bone is assigned, the handle color will be red on the bone map "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າກະດູກທີ່ລຳດັບ [param bone_idx] ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການປ່ຽນເປົ້າໝາຍ ຫຼື ບໍ່.\n"
"ຄ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວແກ້ໄຂແຜນຜັງກະດູກ (bone map editor). ຖ້າວິທີການນີ້ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code], "
"ແລະ ບໍ່ມີກະດູກຖືກກຳນົດ, ສີຂອງຕົວຈັບຈະເປັນສີແດງໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂແຜນຜັງກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the name of the bone at [param bone_idx] that will be the key name in "
"the [BoneMap].\n"
"In the retargeting process, the setting bone name is the bone name of the "
"target skeleton."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຊື່ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ລຳດັບ [param bone_idx] ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນຊື່ຫຼັກໃນ [BoneMap].\n"
"ໃນຂະບວນການປ່ຽນເປົ້າໝາຍ, ຊື່ກະດູກທີ່ກຳນົດແມ່ນຊື່ກະດູກຂອງໂຄງຮ່າງເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"Sets the bone with name [param bone_parent] as the parent of the bone at "
"[param bone_idx]. If an empty string is passed, then the bone has no parent."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດກະດູກທີ່ມີຊື່ [param bone_parent] ໃຫ້ເປັນຕົວຫຼັກຂອງກະດູກທີ່ລຳດັບ [param bone_idx]. "
"ຖ້າສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງເປົ່າ, ສະແດງວ່າກະດູກນັ້ນບໍ່ມີຕົວຫຼັກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the bone with name [param bone_tail] as the tail of the bone at [param "
"bone_idx]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດກະດູກທີ່ມີຊື່ [param bone_tail] ໃຫ້ເປັນສ່ວນຫາງຂອງກະດູກທີ່ລຳດັບ [param bone_idx]."

msgid "Sets the group of the bone at [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດກຸ່ມຂອງກະດູກທີ່ລຳດັບ [param bone_idx]."

msgid ""
"Sets the name of the group at [param group_idx] that will be the drawing "
"group in the [BoneMap] editor."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຊື່ຂອງກຸ່ມທີ່ລຳດັບ [param group_idx] ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນກຸ່ມແຕ້ມໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ [BoneMap]."

msgid ""
"Sets the offset of the bone at [param bone_idx] that will be the button "
"position in the [BoneMap] editor.\n"
"This is the offset with origin at the top left corner of the square."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າອອຟເຊັດຂອງກະດູກທີ່ລຳດັບ [param bone_idx] ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນຕຳແໜ່ງປຸ່ມໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ [BoneMap].\n"
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າອອຟເຊັດທີ່ມີຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຂອງຮູບຈະຕຸລັດ."

msgid "Sets the reference pose transform for bone [param bone_idx]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດການແປງທ່າທາງອ້າງອີງສຳລັບກະດູກ [param bone_idx]."

msgid "Sets the required status for bone [param bone_idx] to [param required]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດສະຖານະຄວາມຈຳເປັນສຳລັບກະດູກ [param bone_idx] ເປັນ [param required]."

msgid ""
"Sets the tail direction of the bone at [param bone_idx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only specifies the method of calculation. The actual "
"coordinates required should be stored in an external skeleton, so the "
"calculation itself needs to be done externally."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດທິດທາງຫາງຂອງກະດູກທີ່ລຳດັບ [param bone_idx].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ພຽງແຕ່ລະບຸວິທີການຄຳນວນ. ພິກັດຕົວຈິງທີ່ຕ້ອງການຄວນຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໂຄງຮ່າງພາຍນອກ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນການຄຳນວນເອງຕ້ອງເຮັດຈາກພາຍນອກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the texture of the group at [param group_idx] that will be the drawing "
"group background image in the [BoneMap] editor."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດພື້ນຜິວຂອງກຸ່ມທີ່ລຳດັບ [param group_idx] ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນຮູບພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງກຸ່ມແຕ້ມໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ [BoneMap]."

msgid ""
"The amount of groups of bones in retargeting section's [BoneMap] editor. For "
"example, [SkeletonProfileHumanoid] has 4 groups.\n"
"This property exists to separate the bone list into several sections in the "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນກຸ່ມຂອງກະດູກໃນສ່ວນການປ່ຽນເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ [BoneMap]. ຕົວຢ່າງ, "
"[SkeletonProfileHumanoid] ມີ 4 ກຸ່ມ.\n"
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອແຍກລາຍຊື່ກະດູກອອກເປັນຫຼາຍສ່ວນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"A bone name that will be used as the root bone in [AnimationTree]. This "
"should be the bone of the parent of hips that exists at the world origin."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ກະດູກທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນກະດູກຮາກ (root bone) ໃນ [AnimationTree]. "
"ນີ້ຄວນຈະເປັນກະດູກຫຼັກຂອງສະໂພກ (hips) ທີ່ຢູ່ຈຸດກຳເນີດຂອງໂລກ (world origin)."

msgid ""
"A bone name which will use model's height as the coefficient for "
"normalization. For example, [SkeletonProfileHumanoid] defines it as "
"[code]Hips[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ກະດູກທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຄວາມສູງຂອງໂມເດວເປັນສຳປະສິດສຳລັບການເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນມາດຕະຖານ (normalization). "
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, [SkeletonProfileHumanoid] ກຳນົດມັນເປັນ [code]Hips[/code]."

msgid ""
"This signal is emitted when change the value in profile. This is used to "
"update key name in the [BoneMap] and to redraw the [BoneMap] editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This signal is not connected directly to editor to simplify the "
"reference, instead it is passed on to editor through the [BoneMap]."
msgstr ""
"ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່າໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌. ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອອັບເດດຊື່ຫຼັກໃນ [BoneMap] ແລະ "
"ແຕ້ມຕົວແກ້ໄຂ [BoneMap] ຄືນໃໝ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສັນຍານນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບຕົວແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ການອ້າງອີງງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ມັນຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາຕົວແກ້ໄຂຜ່ານ [BoneMap]."

msgid "Direction to the average coordinates of bone children."
msgstr "ທິດທາງໄປຫາພິກັດສະເລ່ຍຂອງກະດູກລູກ."

msgid "Direction to the coordinates of specified bone child."
msgstr "ທິດທາງໄປຫາພິກັດຂອງກະດູກລູກທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Direction is not calculated."
msgstr "ທິດທາງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຄຳນວນ."

msgid "A humanoid [SkeletonProfile] preset."
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າຂອງ [SkeletonProfile] ແບບຮູບຮ່າງຄືຄົນ (humanoid)."

msgid ""
"A [SkeletonProfile] as a preset that is optimized for the human form. This "
"exists for standardization, so all parameters are read-only.\n"
"A humanoid skeleton profile contains 56 bones divided into 4 groups: [code]"
"\"Body\"[/code], [code]\"Face\"[/code], [code]\"LeftHand\"[/code], and [code]"
"\"RightHand\"[/code]. It is structured as follows:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"Root\n"
"└─ Hips\n"
"    ├─ LeftUpperLeg\n"
"    │  └─ LeftLowerLeg\n"
"    │     └─ LeftFoot\n"
"    │        └─ LeftToes\n"
"    ├─ RightUpperLeg\n"
"    │  └─ RightLowerLeg\n"
"    │     └─ RightFoot\n"
"    │        └─ RightToes\n"
"    └─ Spine\n"
"        └─ Chest\n"
"            └─ UpperChest\n"
"                ├─ Neck\n"
"                │   └─ Head\n"
"                │       ├─ Jaw\n"
"                │       ├─ LeftEye\n"
"                │       └─ RightEye\n"
"                ├─ LeftShoulder\n"
"                │  └─ LeftUpperArm\n"
"                │     └─ LeftLowerArm\n"
"                │        └─ LeftHand\n"
"                │           ├─ LeftThumbMetacarpal\n"
"                │           │  └─ LeftThumbProximal\n"
"                │           │    └─ LeftThumbDistal\n"
"                │           ├─ LeftIndexProximal\n"
"                │           │  └─ LeftIndexIntermediate\n"
"                │           │    └─ LeftIndexDistal\n"
"                │           ├─ LeftMiddleProximal\n"
"                │           │  └─ LeftMiddleIntermediate\n"
"                │           │    └─ LeftMiddleDistal\n"
"                │           ├─ LeftRingProximal\n"
"                │           │  └─ LeftRingIntermediate\n"
"                │           │    └─ LeftRingDistal\n"
"                │           └─ LeftLittleProximal\n"
"                │              └─ LeftLittleIntermediate\n"
"                │                └─ LeftLittleDistal\n"
"                └─ RightShoulder\n"
"                   └─ RightUpperArm\n"
"                      └─ RightLowerArm\n"
"                         └─ RightHand\n"
"                            ├─ RightThumbMetacarpal\n"
"                            │  └─ RightThumbProximal\n"
"                            │     └─ RightThumbDistal\n"
"                            ├─ RightIndexProximal\n"
"                            │  └─ RightIndexIntermediate\n"
"                            │     └─ RightIndexDistal\n"
"                            ├─ RightMiddleProximal\n"
"                            │  └─ RightMiddleIntermediate\n"
"                            │     └─ RightMiddleDistal\n"
"                            ├─ RightRingProximal\n"
"                            │  └─ RightRingIntermediate\n"
"                            │     └─ RightRingDistal\n"
"                            └─ RightLittleProximal\n"
"                               └─ RightLittleIntermediate\n"
"                                 └─ RightLittleDistal\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"[SkeletonProfile] ທີ່ເປັນຄ່າກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າເຊິ່ງຖືກປັບໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບຮູບຮ່າງຂອງມະນຸດ. "
"ນີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອຄວາມເປັນມາດຕະຖານ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພາຣາມິເຕີທັງໝົດຈຶ່ງເປັນແບບອ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ.\n"
"ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ໂຄງຮ່າງມະນຸດປະກອບດ້ວຍກະດູກ 56 ອັນ ແບ່ງອອກເປັນ 4 ກຸ່ມ: [code]\"Body\"[/code], "
"[code]\"Face\"[/code], [code]\"LeftHand\"[/code], ແລະ [code]\"RightHand\"[/"
"code]. ມັນມີໂຄງສ້າງດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
