msgid ""
"A reference-counted holder object for a skeleton RID used in the "
"[RenderingServer]."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸຖືຄອງ (holder object) ທີ່ມີການນັບການອ້າງອີງສຳລັບ RID ຂອງໂຄງຮ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ "
"[RenderingServer]."

msgid ""
"An internal object containing a mapping from a [Skin] used within the context "
"of a particular [MeshInstance3D] to refer to the skeleton's [RID] in the "
"RenderingServer.\n"
"See also [method MeshInstance3D.get_skin_reference] and [method "
"RenderingServer.instance_attach_skeleton].\n"
"Note that despite the similar naming, the skeleton RID used in the "
"[RenderingServer] does not have a direct one-to-one correspondence to a "
"[Skeleton3D] node.\n"
"In particular, a [Skeleton3D] node with no [MeshInstance3D] children may be "
"unknown to the [RenderingServer].\n"
"On the other hand, a [Skeleton3D] with multiple [MeshInstance3D] nodes which "
"each have different [member MeshInstance3D.skin] objects may have multiple "
"SkinReference instances (and hence, multiple skeleton [RID]s)."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸພາຍໃນທີ່ບັນຈຸການຈັບຄູ່ (mapping) ຈາກ [Skin] ທີ່ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງ [MeshInstance3D] "
"ສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ ເພື່ອອ້າງອີງເຖິງ [RID] ຂອງໂຄງຮ່າງໃນ RenderingServer.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [method MeshInstance3D.get_skin_reference] ແລະ [method "
"RenderingServer.instance_attach_skeleton].\n"
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມີຊື່ທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ, RID ຂອງໂຄງຮ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ [RenderingServer] "
"ກໍບໍ່ມີການກົງກັນແບບໜຶ່ງຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງໂດຍກົງກັບໂນດ [Skeleton3D].\n"
"ໂດຍສະເພາະ, ໂນດ [Skeleton3D] ທີ່ບໍ່ມີ [MeshInstance3D] ເປັນລູກ ອາດຈະບໍ່ເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກສຳລັບ "
"[RenderingServer].\n"
"ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, [Skeleton3D] ທີ່ມີຫຼາຍໂນດ [MeshInstance3D] ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະໂນດມີວັດຖຸ [member "
"MeshInstance3D.skin] ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ອາດຈະມີ SkinReference ຫຼາຍອັນ (ແລະ ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈຶ່ງມີ "
"[RID] ຂອງໂຄງຮ່າງຫຼາຍອັນ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the [RID] owned by this SkinReference, as returned by [method "
"RenderingServer.skeleton_create]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ທີ່ເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງໂດຍ SkinReference ນີ້, ຕາມທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນໂດຍ [method "
"RenderingServer.skeleton_create]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Skin] connected to this SkinReference. In the case of "
"[MeshInstance3D] with no [member MeshInstance3D.skin] assigned, this will "
"reference an internal default [Skin] owned by that [MeshInstance3D].\n"
"Note that a single [Skin] may have more than one [SkinReference] in the case "
"that it is shared by meshes across multiple [Skeleton3D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Skin] ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ SkinReference ນີ້. ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງ [MeshInstance3D] ທີ່ບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດ "
"[member MeshInstance3D.skin], ນີ້ຈະອ້າງອີງເຖິງ [Skin] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນພາຍໃນທີ່ເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງໂດຍ "
"[MeshInstance3D] ນັ້ນ.\n"
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ [Skin] ອັນດຽວອາດຈະມີ [SkinReference] ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງອັນ ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໂດຍ "
"mesh ໃນຫຼາຍໆ ໂນດ [Skeleton3D]."

msgid "Defines a 3D environment's background by using a [Material]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ 3D ໂດຍການໃຊ້ [Material]."

msgid ""
"The [Sky] class uses a [Material] to render a 3D environment's background and "
"the light it emits by updating the reflection/radiance cubemaps."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດ [Sky] ໃຊ້ [Material] ເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນ (render) ພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ 3D ແລະ "
"ແສງທີ່ມັນປ່ອຍອອກມາ ໂດຍການອັບເດດ cubemaps ຂອງການສະທ້ອນ/ລັດສະໝີ (reflection/radiance)."

msgid ""
"The method for generating the radiance map from the sky. The radiance map is "
"a cubemap with increasingly blurry versions of the sky corresponding to "
"different levels of roughness. Radiance maps can be expensive to calculate."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການສ້າງແຜນຜັງລັດສະໝີ (radiance map) ຈາກທ້ອງຟ້າ. ແຜນຜັງລັດສະໝີແມ່ນ cubemap "
"ທີ່ມີເວີຊັນຂອງທ້ອງຟ້າທີ່ມົວລົງເລື້ອຍໆ ຕາມລະດັບຄວາມຂຸ່ນ (roughness) ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. "
"ແຜນຜັງລັດສະໝີອາດຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນການຄຳນວນສູງ."

msgid ""
"The [Sky]'s radiance map size. The higher the radiance map size, the more "
"detailed the lighting from the [Sky] will be.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some hardware will have trouble with higher radiance sizes, "
"especially [constant RADIANCE_SIZE_512] and above. Only use such high values "
"on high-end hardware."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດແຜນຜັງລັດສະໝີຂອງ [Sky]. ຍິ່ງຂະໜາດແຜນຜັງລັດສະໝີສູງເທົ່າໃດ, ແສງຈາກ [Sky] "
"ກໍຈະມີລາຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮາດແວບາງອັນອາດມີບັນຫາກັບຂະໜາດລັດສະໝີທີ່ສູງ, ໂດຍສະເພາະ [constant "
"RADIANCE_SIZE_512] ຂຶ້ນໄປ. ຄວນໃຊ້ຄ່າສູງແບບນີ້ໃນຮາດແວລະດັບສູງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"[Material] used to draw the background. Can be [PanoramaSkyMaterial], "
"[ProceduralSkyMaterial], [PhysicalSkyMaterial], or even a [ShaderMaterial] if "
"you want to use your own custom shader."
msgstr ""
"[Material] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຕ້ມພື້ນຫຼັງ. ສາມາດເປັນ [PanoramaSkyMaterial], "
"[ProceduralSkyMaterial], [PhysicalSkyMaterial], ຫຼື ແມ່ນແຕ່ [ShaderMaterial] "
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ shader ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid "Radiance texture size is 32×32 pixels."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດພື້ນຜິວລັດສະໝີແມ່ນ 32×32 ພິກເຊລ."

msgid "Radiance texture size is 64×64 pixels."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດພື້ນຜິວລັດສະໝີແມ່ນ 64×64 ພິກເຊລ."

msgid "Radiance texture size is 128×128 pixels."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດພື້ນຜິວລັດສະໝີແມ່ນ 128×128 ພິກເຊລ."

msgid "Radiance texture size is 256×256 pixels."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດພື້ນຜິວລັດສະໝີແມ່ນ 256×256 ພິກເຊລ."

msgid "Radiance texture size is 512×512 pixels."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດພື້ນຜິວລັດສະໝີແມ່ນ 512×512 ພິກເຊລ."

msgid "Radiance texture size is 1024×1024 pixels."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດພື້ນຜິວລັດສະໝີແມ່ນ 1024×1024 ພິກເຊລ."

msgid "Radiance texture size is 2048×2048 pixels."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດພື້ນຜິວລັດສະໝີແມ່ນ 2048×2048 ພິກເຊລ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum RadianceSize] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum RadianceSize]."

msgid ""
"Automatically selects the appropriate process mode based on your sky shader. "
"If your shader uses [code]TIME[/code] or [code]POSITION[/code], this will use "
"[constant PROCESS_MODE_REALTIME]. If your shader uses any of the "
"[code]LIGHT_*[/code] variables or any custom uniforms, this uses [constant "
"PROCESS_MODE_INCREMENTAL]. Otherwise, this defaults to [constant "
"PROCESS_MODE_QUALITY]."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກໂໝດການປະມວນຜົນທີ່ເໝາະສົມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍອີງໃສ່ sky shader ຂອງທ່ານ. ຖ້າ shader "
"ຂອງທ່ານໃຊ້ [code]TIME[/code] ຫຼື [code]POSITION[/code], ນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ [constant "
"PROCESS_MODE_REALTIME]. ຖ້າ shader ຂອງທ່ານໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນ [code]LIGHT_*[/code] ໃດໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື "
"custom uniforms ໃດໜຶ່ງ, ນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ [constant PROCESS_MODE_INCREMENTAL]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ມັນຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ [constant PROCESS_MODE_QUALITY]."

msgid ""
"Uses high quality importance sampling to process the radiance map. In "
"general, this results in much higher quality than [constant "
"PROCESS_MODE_REALTIME] but takes much longer to generate. This should not be "
"used if you plan on changing the sky at runtime. If you are finding that the "
"reflection is not blurry enough and is showing sparkles or fireflies, try "
"increasing [member ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"ggx_samples]."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຄວາມສຳຄັນຄຸນນະພາບສູງ (high quality importance sampling) "
"ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນແຜນຜັງລັດສະໝີ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ, ນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບສູງກວ່າ [constant "
"PROCESS_MODE_REALTIME] ຫຼາຍ ແຕ່ໃຊ້ເວລາໃນການສ້າງດົນກວ່າ. "
"ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ຖ້າທ່ານວາງແຜນຈະປ່ຽນແປງທ້ອງຟ້າໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກ. ຖ້າທ່ານພົບວ່າການສະທ້ອນບໍ່ມົວພໍ "
"ແລະ ມີຈຸດປະກາຍ ຫຼື fireflies, ລອງເພີ່ມ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"reflections/sky_reflections/ggx_samples]."

msgid ""
"Uses the same high quality importance sampling to process the radiance map as "
"[constant PROCESS_MODE_QUALITY], but updates over several frames. The number "
"of frames is determined by [member ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/"
"sky_reflections/roughness_layers]. Use this when you need highest quality "
"radiance maps, but have a sky that updates slowly."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຄວາມສຳຄັນຄຸນນະພາບສູງແບບດຽວກັບ [constant PROCESS_MODE_QUALITY] "
"ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນແຜນຜັງລັດສະໝີ, ແຕ່ຈະອັບເດດຜ່ານຫຼາຍໆ ເຟຣມ. ຈຳນວນເຟຣມແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/roughness_layers]. "
"ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການແຜນຜັງລັດສະໝີຄຸນນະພາບສູງສຸດ, ແຕ່ມີທ້ອງຟ້າທີ່ອັບເດດຊ້າ."

msgid ""
"Uses the fast filtering algorithm to process the radiance map. In general "
"this results in lower quality, but substantially faster run times. If you "
"need better quality, but still need to update the sky every frame, consider "
"turning on [member ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"fast_filter_high_quality].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The fast filtering algorithm is limited to 256×256 cubemaps, so "
"[member radiance_size] must be set to [constant RADIANCE_SIZE_256]. "
"Otherwise, a warning is printed and the overridden radiance size is ignored."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ອັນກໍຣິທຶມການກັ່ນຕອງແບບໄວເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນແຜນຜັງລັດສະໝີ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳກວ່າ, "
"ແຕ່ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໄວກວ່າຫຼາຍ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ແຕ່ຍັງຕ້ອງອັບເດດທ້ອງຟ້າທຸກເຟຣມ, "
"ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາເປີດ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"fast_filter_high_quality].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອັນກໍຣິທຶມການກັ່ນຕອງແບບໄວແມ່ນຈຳກັດຢູ່ທີ່ cubemaps ຂະໜາດ 256×256, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ "
"[member radiance_size] ຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant RADIANCE_SIZE_256]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຈະມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ ແລະ ຂະໜາດລັດສະໝີທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

msgid "Abstract base class for sliders."
msgstr "ຄລາດພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳ (Abstract base class) ສຳລັບສະໄລເດີ (sliders)."

msgid ""
"Abstract base class for sliders, used to adjust a value by moving a grabber "
"along a horizontal or vertical axis. Sliders are [Range]-based controls."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳສຳລັບສະໄລເດີ, ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບຄ່າໂດຍການເລື່ອນຕົວຈັບ (grabber) ຕາມແກນນອນ ຫຼື "
"ແກນຕັ້ງ. ສະໄລເດີແມ່ນສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມທີ່ອີງໃສ່ [Range]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the slider can be interacted with. If [code]false[/"
"code], the value can be changed only by code."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະໄລເດີຈະສາມາດໂຕ້ຕອບໄດ້. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ຄ່າຈະສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ຜ່ານການຂຽນໂຄ້ດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the value can be changed using the mouse wheel."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄ່າຈະສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ລໍ້ເມົາສ໌ (mouse wheel)."

msgid ""
"Number of ticks displayed on the slider, including border ticks. Ticks are "
"uniformly-distributed value markers."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຂີດ (ticks) ທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນສະໄລເດີ, ລວມທັງຂີດຢູ່ຂອບ. "
"ຂີດແມ່ນເຄື່ອງໝາຍບອກຄ່າທີ່ກະຈາຍຕົວຢ່າງສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the slider will display ticks for minimum and maximum "
"values."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະໄລເດີຈະສະແດງຂີດສຳລັບຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດ ແລະ ສູງສຸດ."

msgid "Sets the position of the ticks. See [enum TickPosition] for details."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຂີດ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ [enum TickPosition]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the grabber stops being dragged. If [param value_changed] is "
"[code]true[/code], [member Range.value] is different from the value when the "
"dragging was started."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອຕົວຈັບຢຸດການຖືກລາກ. ຖ້າ [param value_changed] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ສະແດງວ່າ [member Range.value] ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຄ່າເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການລາກ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the grabber starts being dragged. This is emitted before the "
"corresponding [signal Range.value_changed] signal."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລາກຕົວຈັບ. ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກກ່ອນສັນຍານ [signal Range.value_changed] "
"ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Places the ticks at the bottom of the [HSlider], or right of the [VSlider]."
msgstr "ວາງຂີດໄວ້ທີ່ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງ [HSlider], ຫຼື ດ້ານຂວາຂອງ [VSlider]."

msgid "Places the ticks at the top of the [HSlider], or left of the [VSlider]."
msgstr "ວາງຂີດໄວ້ທີ່ສ່ວນເທິງຂອງ [HSlider], ຫຼື ດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງ [VSlider]."

msgid "Places the ticks at the both sides of the slider."
msgstr "ວາງຂີດໄວ້ທັງສອງດ້ານຂອງສະໄລເດີ."

msgid "Places the ticks at the center of the slider."
msgstr "ວາງຂີດໄວ້ທີ່ຈຸດໃຈກາງຂອງສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"Boolean constant. If [code]1[/code], the grabber texture size will be ignored "
"and it will fit within slider's bounds based only on its center position."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ບູນີນ (Boolean). ຖ້າເປັນ [code]1[/code], ຂະໜາດພື້ນຜິວຂອງຕົວຈັບຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ ແລະ "
"ມັນຈະພໍດີກັບຂອບເຂດຂອງສະໄລເດີໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຕຳແໜ່ງໃຈກາງຂອງມັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Vertical or horizontal offset of the grabber."
msgstr "ຄ່າອອຟເຊັດແນວຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ແນວນອນຂອງຕົວຈັບ."

msgid ""
"Vertical or horizontal offset of the ticks. The offset is reversed for top or "
"left ticks."
msgstr "ຄ່າອອຟເຊັດແນວຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ແນວນອນຂອງຂີດ. ຄ່າອອຟເຊັດຈະຖືກກັບດ້ານສຳລັບຂີດດ້ານເທິງ ຫຼື ດ້ານຊ້າຍ."

msgid "The texture for the grabber (the draggable element)."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວສຳລັບຕົວຈັບ (ອົງປະກອບທີ່ສາມາດລາກໄດ້)."

msgid "The texture for the grabber when it's disabled."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວສຳລັບຕົວຈັບເມື່ອມັນຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "The texture for the grabber when it's focused."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວສຳລັບຕົວຈັບເມື່ອມັນຖືກໂຟກັສ."

msgid ""
"The texture for the ticks, visible when [member Slider.tick_count] is greater "
"than 0."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວສຳລັບຂີດ, ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອ [member Slider.tick_count] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ 0."

msgid "The background of the area to the left or bottom of the grabber."
msgstr "ພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງພື້ນທີ່ດ້ານຊ້າຍ ຫຼື ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງຕົວຈັບ."

msgid ""
"The background of the area to the left or bottom of the grabber that displays "
"when it's being hovered or focused."
msgstr "ພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງພື້ນທີ່ດ້ານຊ້າຍ ຫຼື ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງຕົວຈັບ ທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອມີການເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ມາໃສ່ ຫຼື ຖືກໂຟກັສ."

msgid ""
"The background for the whole slider. Affects the height or width of the "
"[theme_item grabber_area]."
msgstr "ພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບສະໄລເດີທັງໝົດ. ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມສູງ ຫຼື ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງ [theme_item grabber_area]."

msgid ""
"A physics joint that restricts the movement of a 3D physics body along an "
"axis relative to another physics body."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຟີຊິກທີ່ຈຳກັດການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 3D ຕາມແກນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບວັດຖຸຟີຊິກອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"A physics joint that restricts the movement of a 3D physics body along an "
"axis relative to another physics body. For example, Body A could be a "
"[StaticBody3D] representing a piston base, while Body B could be a "
"[RigidBody3D] representing the piston head, moving up and down."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຟີຊິກທີ່ຈຳກັດການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 3D ຕາມແກນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບວັດຖຸຟີຊິກອື່ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, Body A "
"ອາດຈະເປັນ [StaticBody3D] ທີ່ແທນຖານສູບ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ Body B ອາດຈະເປັນ [RigidBody3D] "
"ທີ່ແທນຫົວສູບ ເຊິ່ງເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ລົງ."

msgid "Returns the value of the given parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Assigns [param value] to the given parameter."
msgstr "ກຳນົດ [param value] ໃຫ້ກັບພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"The amount of damping of the rotation when the limit is surpassed.\n"
"A lower damping value allows a rotation initiated by body A to travel to body "
"B slower."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການໜ່ວງ (damping) ຂອງການໝຸນເມື່ອເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດ.\n"
"ຄ່າການໜ່ວງທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການໝຸນທີ່ເລີ່ມຈາກ body A ສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາ body B ໄດ້ຊ້າລົງ."

msgid "The lower limit of rotation in the slider."
msgstr "ຂີດຈຳກັດຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງການໝຸນໃນສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"The amount of restitution of the rotation when the limit is surpassed.\n"
"Does not affect damping."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການຄືນໂຕ (restitution) ຂອງການໝຸນເມື່ອເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດ.\n"
"ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການໜ່ວງ."

msgid ""
"A factor applied to the all rotation once the limit is surpassed.\n"
"Makes all rotation slower when between 0 and 1."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການໝຸນທັງໝົດເມື່ອເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດ.\n"
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ການໝຸນທັງໝົດຊ້າລົງເມື່ອຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 1."

msgid "The upper limit of rotation in the slider."
msgstr "ຂີດຈຳກັດສູງສຸດຂອງການໝຸນໃນສະໄລເດີ."

msgid "The amount of damping of the rotation in the limits."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການໜ່ວງຂອງການໝຸນພາຍໃນຂີດຈຳກັດ."

msgid "The amount of restitution of the rotation in the limits."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການຄືນໂຕຂອງການໝຸນພາຍໃນຂີດຈຳກັດ."

msgid "A factor applied to the all rotation in the limits."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການໝຸນທັງໝົດພາຍໃນຂີດຈຳກັດ."

msgid ""
"The amount of damping of the rotation across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການໜ່ວງຂອງການໝຸນຂ້າມແກນທີ່ຕັ້ງສາກ (orthogonal) ກັບສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"The amount of restitution of the rotation across axes orthogonal to the "
"slider."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການຄືນໂຕຂອງການໝຸນຂ້າມແກນທີ່ຕັ້ງສາກກັບສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"A factor applied to the all rotation across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການໝຸນທັງໝົດຂ້າມແກນທີ່ຕັ້ງສາກກັບສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"The amount of damping that happens once the limit defined by [member "
"linear_limit/lower_distance] and [member linear_limit/upper_distance] is "
"surpassed."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການໜ່ວງທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [member linear_limit/lower_distance] "
"ແລະ [member linear_limit/upper_distance]."

msgid ""
"The amount of restitution once the limits are surpassed. The lower, the more "
"velocity-energy gets lost."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການຄືນໂຕເມື່ອເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດ. ຍິ່ງຄ່າຕ່ຳເທົ່າໃດ, ພະລັງງານຄວາມໄວຈະສູນເສຍໄປຫຼາຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"A factor applied to the movement across the slider axis once the limits get "
"surpassed. The lower, the slower the movement."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂ້າມແກນສະໄລເດີເມື່ອເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດ. ຍິ່ງຄ່າຕ່ຳເທົ່າໃດ, ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວກໍຈະຍິ່ງຊ້າລົງ."

msgid "The amount of damping inside the slider limits."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການໜ່ວງພາຍໃນຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງສະໄລເດີ."

msgid "The amount of restitution inside the slider limits."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການຄືນໂຕພາຍໃນຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"A factor applied to the movement across the slider axis as long as the slider "
"is in the limits. The lower, the slower the movement."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂ້າມແກນສະໄລເດີ ຕາບໃດທີ່ສະໄລເດີຍັງຢູ່ໃນຂີດຈຳກັດ. ຍິ່ງຄ່າຕ່ຳເທົ່າໃດ, "
"ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວກໍຈະຍິ່ງຊ້າລົງ."

msgid ""
"The amount of damping when movement is across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການໜ່ວງເມື່ອມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂ້າມແກນທີ່ຕັ້ງສາກກັບສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"The amount of restitution when movement is across axes orthogonal to the "
"slider."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການຄືນໂຕເມື່ອມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂ້າມແກນທີ່ຕັ້ງສາກກັບສະໄລເດີ."

msgid "A factor applied to the movement across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂ້າມແກນທີ່ຕັ້ງສາກກັບສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_limit/upper_distance]. The maximum "
"difference between the pivot points on their X axis before damping happens."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member linear_limit/upper_distance]. "
"ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງສູງສຸດລະຫວ່າງຈຸດໝຸນ (pivot points) ເທິງແກນ X ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເກີດການໜ່ວງ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_limit/lower_distance]. The minimum "
"difference between the pivot points on their X axis before damping happens."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member linear_limit/lower_distance]. "
"ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຕ່ຳສຸດລະຫວ່າງຈຸດໝຸນເທິງແກນ X ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເກີດການໜ່ວງ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_limit/softness]. A factor applied to "
"the movement across the slider axis once the limits get surpassed. The lower, "
"the slower the movement."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member linear_limit/softness]. "
"ຕົວຄູນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂ້າມແກນສະໄລເດີເມື່ອເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດ. ຍິ່ງຄ່າຕ່ຳເທົ່າໃດ, ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວກໍຈະຍິ່ງຊ້າລົງ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_limit/restitution]. The amount of "
"restitution once the limits are surpassed. The lower, the more velocity-"
"energy gets lost."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member linear_limit/restitution]. "
"ປະລິມານການຄືນໂຕເມື່ອເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດ. ຍິ່ງຄ່າຕ່ຳເທົ່າໃດ, ພະລັງງານຄວາມໄວຈະສູນເສຍໄປຫຼາຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_limit/damping]. The amount of damping "
"once the slider limits are surpassed."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member linear_limit/damping]. "
"ປະລິມານການໜ່ວງເມື່ອເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_motion/softness]. A factor applied to "
"the movement across the slider axis as long as the slider is in the limits. "
"The lower, the slower the movement."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member linear_motion/softness]. "
"ຕົວຄູນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂ້າມແກນສະໄລເດີ ຕາບໃດທີ່ສະໄລເດີຍັງຢູ່ໃນຂີດຈຳກັດ. ຍິ່ງຄ່າຕ່ຳເທົ່າໃດ, "
"ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວກໍຈະຍິ່ງຊ້າລົງ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_motion/restitution]. The amount of "
"restitution inside the slider limits."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member linear_motion/restitution]. "
"ປະລິມານການຄືນໂຕພາຍໃນຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_motion/damping]. The amount of damping "
"inside the slider limits."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member linear_motion/damping]. "
"ປະລິມານການໜ່ວງພາຍໃນຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_ortho/softness]. A factor applied to "
"the movement across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member linear_ortho/softness]. "
"ຕົວຄູນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂ້າມແກນທີ່ຕັ້ງສາກກັບສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_motion/restitution]. The amount of "
"restitution when movement is across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member linear_motion/restitution]. "
"ປະລິມານການຄືນໂຕເມື່ອມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂ້າມແກນທີ່ຕັ້ງສາກກັບສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member linear_motion/damping]. The amount of damping "
"when movement is across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member linear_motion/damping]. "
"ປະລິມານການໜ່ວງເມື່ອມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂ້າມແກນທີ່ຕັ້ງສາກກັບສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_limit/upper_angle]. The upper limit of "
"rotation in the slider."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member angular_limit/upper_angle]. "
"ຂີດຈຳກັດສູງສຸດຂອງການໝຸນໃນສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_limit/lower_angle]. The lower limit of "
"rotation in the slider."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member angular_limit/lower_angle]. "
"ຂີດຈຳກັດຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງການໝຸນໃນສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_limit/softness]. A factor applied to "
"the all rotation once the limit is surpassed."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member angular_limit/softness]. "
"ຕົວຄູນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການໝຸນທັງໝົດເມື່ອເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_limit/restitution]. The amount of "
"restitution of the rotation when the limit is surpassed."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member angular_limit/restitution]. "
"ປະລິມານການຄືນໂຕຂອງການໝຸນເມື່ອເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_limit/damping]. The amount of damping "
"of the rotation when the limit is surpassed."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member angular_limit/damping]. "
"ປະລິມານການໜ່ວງຂອງການໝຸນເມື່ອເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_motion/softness]. A factor applied to "
"the all rotation in the limits."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member angular_motion/softness]. "
"ຕົວຄູນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການໝຸນທັງໝົດພາຍໃນຂີດຈຳກັດ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_motion/restitution]. The amount of "
"restitution of the rotation in the limits."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member angular_motion/restitution]. "
"ປະລິມານການຄືນໂຕຂອງການໝຸນພາຍໃນຂີດຈຳກັດ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_motion/damping]. The amount of damping "
"of the rotation in the limits."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member angular_motion/damping]. "
"ປະລິມານການໜ່ວງຂອງການໝຸນພາຍໃນຂີດຈຳກັດ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_ortho/softness]. A factor applied to "
"the all rotation across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member angular_ortho/softness]. "
"ຕົວຄູນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການໝຸນທັງໝົດຂ້າມແກນທີ່ຕັ້ງສາກກັບສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_ortho/restitution]. The amount of "
"restitution of the rotation across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member angular_ortho/restitution]. "
"ປະລິມານການຄືນໂຕຂອງການໝຸນຂ້າມແກນທີ່ຕັ້ງສາກກັບສະໄລເດີ."

msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member angular_ortho/damping]. The amount of damping "
"of the rotation across axes orthogonal to the slider."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member angular_ortho/damping]. "
"ປະລິມານການໜ່ວງຂອງການໝຸນຂ້າມແກນທີ່ຕັ້ງສາກກັບສະໄລເດີ."

msgid "An abstract class for servers based on sockets."
msgstr "ຄລາດພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳສຳລັບເຊີບເວີທີ່ອີງໃສ່ ຊັອກເກັດ (sockets)."

msgid "A socket server."
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີຊັອກເກັດ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if a connection is available for taking."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ພ້ອມສຳລັບການຮັບເອົາ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the server is currently listening for "
"connections."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເຊີບເວີກຳລັງລໍຖ້າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (listening) ຢູ່ໃນຂະນະນີ້."

msgid "Stops listening."
msgstr "ຢຸດການລໍຖ້າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid ""
"If a connection is available, returns a StreamPeerSocket with the connection."
msgstr "ຖ້າມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ StreamPeerSocket ພ້ອມກັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ນັ້ນ."

msgid "A deformable 3D physics mesh."
msgstr "mesh ຟີຊິກ 3D ທີ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນຮູບຮ່າງໄດ້."

msgid "SoftBody"
msgstr "SoftBody"

msgid "Returns the internal [RID] used by the [PhysicsServer3D] for this body."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ພາຍໃນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [PhysicsServer3D] ສຳລັບວັດຖຸນີ້."

msgid "Returns local translation of a vertex in the surface array."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງ (translation) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງຈຸດຍອດ (vertex) ໃນ surface array."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if vertex is set to pinned."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຈຸດຍອດຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ປັກໝຸດ (pinned) ໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the pinned state of a surface vertex. When set to [code]true[/code], the "
"optional [param attachment_path] can define a [Node3D] the pinned vertex will "
"be attached to."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດສະຖານະການປັກໝຸດຂອງຈຸດຍອດພື້ນຜິວ. ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param "
"attachment_path] ເພື່ອລະບຸ [Node3D] ທີ່ຈຸດຍອດທີ່ປັກໝຸດນັ້ນຈະຖືກຍຶດຕິດໄວ້."

msgid ""
"The physics layers this SoftBody3D [b]is in[/b]. Collision objects can exist "
"in one or more of 32 different layers. See also [member collision_mask].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Object A can detect a contact with object B only if object B is "
"in any of the layers that object A scans. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers "
"and masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"ເລເຍີຟີຊິກທີ່ SoftBody3D ນີ້ [b]ອາໄສຢູ່[/b]. ວັດຖຸທີ່ມີການຕຳກັນສາມາດຢູ່ໃນໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍເລເຍີຈາກທັງໝົດ "
"32 ເລເຍີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member collision_mask].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວັດຖຸ A ສາມາດກວດພົບການສຳຜັດກັບວັດຖຸ B ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອວັດຖຸ B ຢູ່ໃນເລເຍີໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ວັດຖຸ A "
"ກຳລັງສະແກນຢູ່. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers and "
"masks[/url] ໃນເອກະສານປະກອບສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The physics layers this SoftBody3D [b]scans[/b]. Collision objects can scan "
"one or more of 32 different layers. See also [member collision_layer].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Object A can detect a contact with object B only if object B is "
"in any of the layers that object A scans. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers "
"and masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"ເລເຍີຟີຊິກທີ່ SoftBody3D ນີ້ [b]ສະແກນ[/b]. ວັດຖຸທີ່ມີການຕຳກັນສາມາດສະແກນໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍເລເຍີຈາກທັງໝົດ "
"32 ເລເຍີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member collision_layer].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວັດຖຸ A ສາມາດກວດພົບການສຳຜັດກັບວັດຖຸ B ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອວັດຖຸ B ຢູ່ໃນເລເຍີໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ວັດຖຸ A "
"ກຳລັງສະແກນຢູ່. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers and "
"masks[/url] ໃນເອກະສານປະກອບສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The body's damping coefficient. Higher values will slow down the body more "
"noticeably when forces are applied."
msgstr ""
"ສຳປະສິດການໜ່ວງ (damping) ຂອງວັດຖຸ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຊ້າລົງຢ່າງເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນເມື່ອມີແຮງມາກະທົບ."

msgid ""
"The body's drag coefficient. Higher values increase this body's air "
"resistance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value is currently unused by Godot's default physics "
"implementation."
msgstr ""
"ສຳປະສິດແຮງຕ້ານ (drag) ຂອງວັດຖຸ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເພີ່ມແຮງຕ້ານອາກາດຂອງວັດຖຸນີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປະຈຸບັນຄ່ານີ້ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍລະບົບຟີຊິກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ Godot."

msgid ""
"Higher values will result in a stiffer body, while lower values will increase "
"the body's ability to bend. The value can be between [code]0.0[/code] and "
"[code]1.0[/code] (inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸມີຄວາມແຂງ (stiffer), "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳລົງຈະເພີ່ມຄວາມສາມາດໃນການໂຄ້ງງໍຂອງວັດຖຸ. ຄ່າສາມາດຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ຫາ [code]1.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"[NodePath] to a [CollisionObject3D] this SoftBody3D should avoid clipping."
msgstr ""
"[NodePath] ໄປຫາ [CollisionObject3D] ທີ່ SoftBody3D ນີ້ຄວນຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຕັດຜ່ານ (clipping)."

msgid ""
"The pressure coefficient of this soft body. Simulate pressure build-up from "
"inside this body. Higher values increase the strength of this effect."
msgstr ""
"ສຳປະສິດແຮງດັນຂອງ soft body ນີ້. ຈຳລອງການສະສົມຂອງແຮງດັນຈາກພາຍໃນວັດຖຸ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເພີ່ມຄວາມແຮງຂອງຜົນກະທົບນີ້."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the [SoftBody3D] will respond to [RayCast3D]s."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [SoftBody3D] ຈະຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ [RayCast3D]."

msgid ""
"Scales the rest lengths of [SoftBody3D]'s edge constraints. Positive values "
"shrink the mesh, while negative values expand it. For example, a value of "
"[code]0.1[/code] shortens the edges of the mesh by 10%, while [code]-0.1[/"
"code] expands the edges by 10%.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member shrinking_factor] is best used on surface meshes with "
"pinned points."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຂະໜາດຄວາມຍາວຂະນະພັກ (rest lengths) ຂອງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອບ (edge constraints) ຂອງ "
"[SoftBody3D]. ຄ່າບວກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ mesh ຫົດຕົວ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າລົບຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນຂະຫຍາຍຕົວ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຄ່າ "
"[code]0.1[/code] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບຂອງ mesh ສັ້ນລົງ 10%, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ [code]-0.1[/code] "
"ຈະຂະຫຍາຍຂອບອອກ 10%.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member shrinking_factor] ແມ່ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດກັບ mesh ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ມີການປັກໝຸດ."

msgid ""
"Increasing this value will improve the resulting simulation, but can affect "
"performance. Use with care."
msgstr ""
"ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງການຈຳລອງໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ອາດມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ. ຄວນໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຄວາມລະມັດລະວັງ."

msgid "The SoftBody3D's mass."
msgstr "ມວນສານ (mass) ຂອງ SoftBody3D."

msgid ""
"When [member Node.process_mode] is set to [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], remove from the physics simulation to stop all "
"physics interactions with this [SoftBody3D].\n"
"Automatically re-added to the physics simulation when the [Node] is processed "
"again."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member Node.process_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], "
"ຈະຖືກຖອດອອກຈາກການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກເພື່ອຢຸດການໂຕ້ຕອບທາງຟີຊິກທັງໝົດກັບ [SoftBody3D] ນີ້.\n"
"ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມກັບເຂົ້າໃນການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອ [Node] ຖືກປະມວນຜົນອີກຄັ້ງ."

msgid "Class representing a spherical [PrimitiveMesh]."
msgstr "ຄລາດທີ່ແທນ [PrimitiveMesh] ຮູບຊົງກົມ."

msgid "Full height of the sphere."
msgstr "ຄວາມສູງທັງໝົດຂອງຊົງກົມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], a hemisphere is created rather than a full sphere.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To get a regular hemisphere, the height and radius of the sphere "
"must be equal."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງເປັນຮູບເຄິ່ງຊົງກົມ (hemisphere) ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຊົງກົມເຕັມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຮູບເຄິ່ງຊົງກົມທີ່ໄດ້ສັດສ່ວນ, ຄວາມສູງ ແລະ ລັດສະໝີຂອງຊົງກົມຕ້ອງເທົ່າກັນ."

msgid "Number of radial segments on the sphere."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສ່ວນ (segments) ຕາມລັດສະໝີຂອງຊົງກົມ."

msgid "Radius of sphere."
msgstr "ລັດສະໝີຂອງຊົງກົມ."

msgid "Number of segments along the height of the sphere."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສ່ວນຕາມລວງສູງຂອງຊົງກົມ."

msgid "Spherical shape for use with occlusion culling in [OccluderInstance3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງກົມສຳລັບໃຊ້ກັບການຄັດອອກຂອງການບັງແສງ (occlusion culling) ໃນ [OccluderInstance3D]."

msgid ""
"[SphereOccluder3D] stores a sphere shape that can be used by the engine's "
"occlusion culling system.\n"
"See [OccluderInstance3D]'s documentation for instructions on setting up "
"occlusion culling."
msgstr ""
"[SphereOccluder3D] ເກັບຮັກສາຮູບຊົງກົມທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໂດຍລະບົບ occlusion culling ຂອງເອັນຈິນ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ [OccluderInstance3D] ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ occlusion culling."

msgid "The sphere's radius in 3D units."
msgstr "ລັດສະໝີຂອງຊົງກົມໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍ 3D."

msgid "A 3D sphere shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງກົມ 3D ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳກັນທາງຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"A 3D sphere shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to provide a "
"shape for a [CollisionShape3D].\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [SphereShape3D] is fast to check collisions against. It "
"is faster than [BoxShape3D], [CapsuleShape3D], and [CylinderShape3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງກົມ 3D, ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນທາງຟີຊິກ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູບຊົງແກ່ [CollisionShape3D].\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] [SphereShape3D] ແມ່ນໄວໃນການກວດສອບການຕຳກັນ. ມັນໄວທຸກກວ່າ "
"[BoxShape3D], [CapsuleShape3D], ແລະ [CylinderShape3D]."

msgid "The sphere's radius. The shape's diameter is double the radius."
msgstr "ລັດສະໝີຂອງຊົງກົມ. ເສັ້ນຜ່ານໃຈກາງຂອງຮູບຊົງແມ່ນສອງເທົ່າຂອງລັດສະໝີ."

msgid "An input field for numbers."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບຕົວເລກ."

msgid ""
"Applies the current value of this [SpinBox]. This is equivalent to pressing "
"[kbd]Enter[/kbd] while editing the [LineEdit] used by the [SpinBox]. This "
"will cause [signal LineEdit.text_submitted] to be emitted and its currently "
"contained expression to be evaluated."
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ [SpinBox] ນີ້. ນີ້ເທົ່າກັບການກົດ [kbd]Enter[/kbd] ໃນຂະນະທີ່ແກ້ໄຂ "
"[LineEdit] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [SpinBox]. ນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສັນຍານ [signal LineEdit.text_submitted] "
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ ສຳນວນທີ່ບັນຈຸຢູ່ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [LineEdit] instance from this [SpinBox]. You can use it to access "
"properties and methods of [LineEdit].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it may "
"cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member CanvasItem.visible] property."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ຂອງ [LineEdit] ຈາກ [SpinBox] ນີ້. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຄຸນສົມບັດ ແລະ ວິທີການຂອງ [LineEdit].\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນໂນດພາຍໃນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ການລຶບ ຫຼື ການປ່ອຍ (free) "
"ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໂປຣແກຣມຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ (crash). ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອງມັນ ຫຼື ລູກຂອງມັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"[member CanvasItem.visible] ຂອງພວກມັນ."

msgid "Changes the alignment of the underlying [LineEdit]."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນການຈັດວາງ (alignment) ຂອງ [LineEdit] ທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the value will be rounded to a multiple of [member "
"custom_arrow_step] when interacting with the arrow buttons. Otherwise, "
"increments the value by [member custom_arrow_step] and then rounds it "
"according to [member Range.step]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄ່າຈະຖືກປັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄູນຂອງ [member custom_arrow_step] "
"ເມື່ອໂຕ້ຕອບກັບປຸ່ມລູກສອນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະເພີ່ມຄ່າຂຶ້ນຕາມ [member custom_arrow_step] "
"ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງປັດຄ່າຕາມ [member Range.step]."

msgid ""
"If not [code]0[/code], sets the step when interacting with the arrow buttons "
"of the [SpinBox].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member Range.value] will still be rounded to a multiple of "
"[member Range.step]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ແມ່ນ [code]0[/code], ຈະກຳນົດຂັ້ນຕອນ (step) ເມື່ອໂຕ້ຕອບກັບປຸ່ມລູກສອນຂອງ [SpinBox].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member Range.value] ຈະຍັງຖືກປັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄູນຂອງ [member Range.step] "
"ຄືເກົ່າ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [SpinBox] will be editable. Otherwise, it will be "
"read only."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [SpinBox] ຈະສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ມັນຈະເປັນແບບອ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ (read only)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [SpinBox] will select the whole text when the "
"[LineEdit] gains focus. Clicking the up and down arrows won't trigger this "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [SpinBox] ຈະເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດເມື່ອ [LineEdit] ໄດ້ຮັບໂຟກັສ. "
"ການຄລິກລູກສອນຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ລົງ ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດພຶດຕິກຳນີ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the value of the [Range] for this [SpinBox] when the [LineEdit] text is "
"[i]changed[/i] instead of [i]submitted[/i]. See [signal "
"LineEdit.text_changed] and [signal LineEdit.text_submitted].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If set to [code]true[/code], this will interfere with entering "
"mathematical expressions in the [SpinBox]. The [SpinBox] will try to evaluate "
"the expression as you type, which means symbols like a trailing [code]+[/"
"code] are removed immediately by the expression being evaluated."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງ [Range] ສຳລັບ [SpinBox] ນີ້ເມື່ອຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນ [LineEdit] [i]ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ[/i] "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຕອນ [i]ສົ່ງຄ່າ (submitted)[/i]. ເບິ່ງ [signal LineEdit.text_changed] ແລະ "
"[signal LineEdit.text_submitted].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ນີ້ຈະລົບກວນການປ້ອນສຳນວນທາງຄະນິດສາດໃນ "
"[SpinBox]. [SpinBox] ຈະພະຍາຍາມປະມວນຜົນສຳນວນໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານພິມ, "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າສັນຍາລັກຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ [code]+[/code] ທີ່ຢູ່ທ້າຍຈະຖືກລຶບອອກທັນທີໂດຍສຳນວນທີ່ຖືກປະມວນຜົນ."

msgid "Down button icon modulation color, when the button is disabled."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ປະສົມ (modulation color) ຂອງໄອຄອນປຸ່ມລົງ ເມື່ອປຸ່ມຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Down button icon modulation color, when the button is hovered."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ປະສົມຂອງໄອຄອນປຸ່ມລົງ ເມື່ອມີເມົາສ໌ມາເລື່ອນໃສ່."

msgid "Down button icon modulation color."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ປະສົມຂອງໄອຄອນປຸ່ມລົງ."

msgid "Down button icon modulation color, when the button is being pressed."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ປະສົມຂອງໄອຄອນປຸ່ມລົງ ເມື່ອປຸ່ມກຳລັງຖືກກົດ."

msgid "Up button icon modulation color, when the button is disabled."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ປະສົມຂອງໄອຄອນປຸ່ມຂຶ້ນ ເມື່ອປຸ່ມຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Up button icon modulation color, when the button is hovered."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ປະສົມຂອງໄອຄອນປຸ່ມຂຶ້ນ ເມື່ອມີເມົາສ໌ມາເລື່ອນໃສ່."

msgid "Up button icon modulation color."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ປະສົມຂອງໄອຄອນປຸ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Up button icon modulation color, when the button is being pressed."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ປະສົມຂອງໄອຄອນປຸ່ມຂຶ້ນ ເມື່ອປຸ່ມກຳລັງຖືກກົດ."

msgid "Vertical separation between the up and down buttons."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວຕັ້ງລະຫວ່າງປຸ່ມຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ປຸ່ມລົງ."

msgid ""
"Width of the up and down buttons. If smaller than any icon set on the "
"buttons, the respective icon may overlap neighboring elements. If smaller "
"than [code]0[/code], the width is automatically adjusted from the icon size."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງປຸ່ມຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ລົງ. ຖ້ານ້ອຍກວ່າໄອຄອນໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນປຸ່ມ, "
"ໄອຄອນນັ້ນອາດຈະຊ້ອນກັບອົງປະກອບຂ້າງຄຽງ. ຖ້ານ້ອຍກວ່າ [code]0[/code], "
"ຄວາມກວ້າງຈະຖືກປັບອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມຂະໜາດຂອງໄອຄອນ."

msgid ""
"Width of the horizontal separation between the text input field ([LineEdit]) "
"and the buttons."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວນອນລະຫວ່າງຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ ([LineEdit]) ແລະ ປຸ່ມຕ່າງໆ."

msgid ""
"This property exists only for compatibility with older themes. Setting "
"[theme_item buttons_width] to a negative value has the same effect."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບທີມລຸ້ນເກົ່າເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [theme_item buttons_width] "
"ເປັນຄ່າລົບຈະໃຫ້ຜົນແບບດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"If not [code]0[/code], the minimum button width corresponds to the widest of "
"all icons set on those buttons, even if [theme_item buttons_width] is smaller."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ແມ່ນ [code]0[/code], "
"ຄວາມກວ້າງຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງປຸ່ມຈະກົງກັບໄອຄອນທີ່ກວ້າງທີ່ສຸດໃນບັນດາໄອຄອນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນປຸ່ມເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ "
"[theme_item buttons_width] ຈະນ້ອຍກວ່າກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Down button icon, displayed in the middle of the down (value-decreasing) "
"button."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນປຸ່ມລົງ, ສະແດງຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງຂອງປຸ່ມລົງ (ປຸ່ມຫຼຸດຄ່າ)."

msgid "Down button icon when the button is disabled."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນປຸ່ມລົງເມື່ອປຸ່ມຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Down button icon when the button is hovered."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນປຸ່ມລົງເມື່ອມີເມົາສ໌ມາເລື່ອນໃສ່."

msgid "Down button icon when the button is being pressed."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນປຸ່ມລົງເມື່ອປຸ່ມກຳລັງຖືກກົດ."

msgid ""
"Up button icon, displayed in the middle of the up (value-increasing) button."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນປຸ່ມຂຶ້ນ, ສະແດງຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງຂອງປຸ່ມຂຶ້ນ (ປຸ່ມເພີ່ມຄ່າ)."

msgid "Up button icon when the button is disabled."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນປຸ່ມຂຶ້ນເມື່ອປຸ່ມຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Up button icon when the button is hovered."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນປຸ່ມຂຶ້ນເມື່ອມີເມົາສ໌ມາເລື່ອນໃສ່."

msgid "Up button icon when the button is being pressed."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນປຸ່ມຂຶ້ນເມື່ອປຸ່ມກຳລັງຖືກກົດ."

msgid "Use [theme_item up] and [theme_item down] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [theme_item up] ແລະ [theme_item down] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Single texture representing both the up and down buttons icons. It is "
"displayed in the middle of the buttons and does not change upon interaction. "
"If a valid icon is assigned, it will replace [theme_item up] and [theme_item "
"down]."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວດຽວທີ່ແທນໄອຄອນປຸ່ມທັງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ລົງ. ມັນຈະສະແດງຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງຂອງປຸ່ມຕ່າງໆ ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງເມື່ອມີການໂຕ້ຕອບ. ຖ້າໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້, ມັນຈະມາແທນທີ່ [theme_item up] ແລະ "
"[theme_item down]."

msgid "Background style of the down button."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງປຸ່ມລົງ."

msgid "Background style of the down button when disabled."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງປຸ່ມລົງເມື່ອຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Background style of the down button when hovered."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງປຸ່ມລົງເມື່ອມີເມົາສ໌ມາເລື່ອນໃສ່."

msgid "Background style of the down button when being pressed."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງປຸ່ມລົງເມື່ອຖືກກົດ."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] drawn in the space occupied by the separation between the input "
"field and the buttons."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມໃນພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງລະຫວ່າງຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ປຸ່ມຕ່າງໆ."

msgid "Background style of the up button."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງປຸ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Background style of the up button when disabled."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງປຸ່ມຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Background style of the up button when hovered."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງປຸ່ມຂຶ້ນເມື່ອມີເມົາສ໌ມາເລື່ອນໃສ່."

msgid "Background style of the up button when being pressed."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງປຸ່ມຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຖືກກົດ."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] drawn in the space occupied by the separation between the up and "
"down buttons."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມໃນພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງລະຫວ່າງປຸ່ມຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ປຸ່ມລົງ."

msgid "A [SkeletonModifier3D] for aligning bones along a [Path3D]."
msgstr "[SkeletonModifier3D] ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງກະດູກຕາມ [Path3D]."

msgid ""
"A [SkeletonModifier3D] for aligning bones along a [Path3D]. The smoothness of "
"the fitting depends on the [member Curve3D.bake_interval].\n"
"If you want the [Path3D] to attach to a specific bone, it is recommended to "
"place a [ModifierBoneTarget3D] before the [SplineIK3D] in the "
"[SkeletonModifier3D] list (children of the [Skeleton3D]), and then place a "
"[Path3D] as the [ModifierBoneTarget3D]'s child.\n"
"Bone twist is determined based on the [method Curve3D.get_point_tilt].\n"
"If the root bone joint and the start point of the [Curve3D] are separated, it "
"assumes that there is a linear line segment between them. This means that the "
"vector pointing toward the start point of the [Curve3D] takes precedence over "
"the shortest intersection point along the [Curve3D].\n"
"If the end bone joint exceeds the path length, it is bent as close as "
"possible to the end point of the [Curve3D].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] All the methods in this class take an [code]index[/code] "
"parameter. This parameter specifies which setting list entry to return if the "
"IK has multiple entries (e.g. [code]settings/<index>/root_bone_name[/code])."
msgstr ""
"[SkeletonModifier3D] ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງກະດູກຕາມ [Path3D]. ຄວາມລຽບ (smoothness) "
"ຂອງການປັບໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັນແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບ [member Curve3D.bake_interval].\n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [Path3D] ຍຶດຕິດກັບກະດູກສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ວາງ "
"[ModifierBoneTarget3D] ໄວ້ກ່ອນ [SplineIK3D] ໃນລາຍການ [SkeletonModifier3D] "
"(ລູກຂອງ [Skeleton3D]), ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງວາງ [Path3D] ເປັນລູກຂອງ [ModifierBoneTarget3D].\n"
"ການບິດຂອງກະດູກ (Bone twist) ແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດຕາມ [method Curve3D.get_point_tilt].\n"
"ຖ້າຂໍ້ຕໍ່ກະດູກຮາກ (root bone joint) ແລະ ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [Curve3D] ຢູ່ແຍກກັນ, "
"ມັນຈະສົມມຸດວ່າມີເສັ້ນຊື່ລະຫວ່າງພວກມັນ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເວັກເຕີທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [Curve3D] "
"ຈະມີບຸລິມະສິດເໜືອກວ່າຈຸດຕັດທີ່ສັ້ນທີ່ສຸດຕາມ [Curve3D].\n"
"ຖ້າຂໍ້ຕໍ່ກະດູກປາຍຍາວເກີນຄວາມຍາວຂອງເສັ້ນທາງ, ມັນຈະຖືກງໍໃຫ້ໃກ້ກັບຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງ [Curve3D] ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການທັງໝົດໃນຄລາດນີ້ຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີ [code]index[/code]. "
"ພາຣາມິເຕີນີລະບຸວ່າຈະສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃດ ຫາກ IK ມີຫຼາຍລາຍການ (ເຊັ່ນ: [code]settings/"
"<index>/root_bone_name[/code])."

msgid "Returns the node path of the [Path3D] which is describing the path."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງໂນດ (node path) ຂອງ [Path3D] ທີ່ອະທິບາຍເສັ້ນທາງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the tilt interpolation method used between the root bone and the "
"start point of the [Curve3D] when they are apart. See also [method "
"set_tilt_fade_in]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນວິທີການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນການອຽງ (tilt interpolation) ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະຫວ່າງກະດູກຮາກ ແລະ ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ "
"[Curve3D] ເມື່ອພວກມັນຢູ່ຫ່າງກັນ. ເບິ່ງ [method set_tilt_fade_in]."

msgid ""
"Returns the tilt interpolation method used between the end bone and the end "
"point of the [Curve3D] when they are apart. See also [method "
"set_tilt_fade_out]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນວິທີການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນການອຽງທີ່ໃຊ້ລະຫວ່າງກະດູກປາຍ ແລະ ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງ [Curve3D] ເມື່ອພວກມັນຢູ່ຫ່າງກັນ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method set_tilt_fade_out]."

msgid "Returns if the tilt property of the [Curve3D] affects the bone twist."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າຄຸນສົມບັດການອຽງຂອງ [Curve3D] ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການບິດຂອງກະດູກ ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid "Sets the node path of the [Path3D] which is describing the path."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງໂນດຂອງ [Path3D] ທີ່ອະທິບາຍເສັ້ນທາງ."

msgid "Sets if the tilt property of the [Curve3D] should affect the bone twist."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າຄຸນສົມບັດການອຽງຂອງ [Curve3D] ຄວນມີຜົນຕໍ່ການບິດຂອງກະດູກ ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"If [param size] is greater than [code]0[/code], the tilt is interpolated "
"between [param size] start bones from the start point of the [Curve3D] when "
"they are apart.\n"
"If [param size] is equal [code]0[/code], the tilts between the root bone head "
"and the start point of the [Curve3D] are unified with a tilt of the start "
"point of the [Curve3D].\n"
"If [param size] is less than [code]0[/code], the tilts between the root bone "
"and the start point of the [Curve3D] are [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param size] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0[/code], ການອຽງຈະຖືກແຊກຂໍ້ມູນລະຫວ່າງ [param size] "
"ກະດູກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [Curve3D] ເມື່ອພວກມັນຢູ່ຫ່າງກັນ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param size] ເທົ່າກັບ [code]0[/code], ການອຽງລະຫວ່າງສ່ວນຫົວຂອງກະດູກຮາກ ແລະ "
"ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [Curve3D] ຈະຖືກຮວມເຂົ້າກັນດ້ວຍການອຽງຂອງຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [Curve3D].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param size] ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [code]0[/code], ການອຽງລະຫວ່າງກະດູກຮາກ ແລະ ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ "
"[Curve3D] ຈະເປັນ [code]0.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [param size] is greater than [code]0[/code], the tilt is interpolated "
"between [param size] end bones from the end point of the [Curve3D] when they "
"are apart.\n"
"If [param size] is equal [code]0[/code], the tilts between the end bone tail "
"and the end point of the [Curve3D] are unified with a tilt of the end point "
"of the [Curve3D].\n"
"If [param size] is less than [code]0[/code], the tilts between the end bone "
"and the end point of the [Curve3D] are [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param size] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0[/code], ການອຽງຈະຖືກແຊກຂໍ້ມູນລະຫວ່າງ [param size] "
"ກະດູກປາຍຈາກຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງ [Curve3D] ເມື່ອພວກມັນຢູ່ຫ່າງກັນ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param size] ເທົ່າກັບ [code]0[/code], ການອຽງລະຫວ່າງສ່ວນຫາງຂອງກະດູກປາຍ ແລະ "
"ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງ [Curve3D] ຈະຖືກຮວມເຂົ້າກັນດ້ວຍການອຽງຂອງຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງ [Curve3D].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param size] ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [code]0[/code], ການອຽງລະຫວ່າງກະດູກປາຍ ແລະ ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງ "
"[Curve3D] ຈະເປັນ [code]0.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"A container that arranges child controls horizontally or vertically and "
"provides grabbers for adjusting the split ratios between them."
msgstr ""
"ຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ຈັດວາງສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມລູກ (child controls) ແນວນອນ ຫຼື ແນວຕັ້ງ ແລະ "
"ມີຕົວຈັບສຳລັບປັບອັດຕາສ່ວນການແບ່ງລະຫວ່າງພວກມັນ."

msgid ""
"A container that arranges child controls horizontally or vertically and "
"creates grabbers between them. The grabbers can be dragged around to change "
"the size relations between the child controls."
msgstr ""
"ຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ຈັດວາງສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມລູກແນວນອນ ຫຼື ແນວຕັ້ງ ແລະ ສ້າງຕົວຈັບລະຫວ່າງພວກມັນ. "
"ຕົວຈັບສາມາດລາກໄປມາເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄວາມສຳພັນດ້ານຂະໜາດລະຫວ່າງສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມລູກໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Clamps the [member split_offsets] values to ensure they are within valid "
"ranges and do not overlap with each other. When overlaps occur, this method "
"prioritizes one split offset (at index [param priority_index]) by clamping "
"any overlapping split offsets to it."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳກັດ (Clamp) ຄ່າ [member split_offsets] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ຊ້ອນທັບກັນ. ເມື່ອເກີດການຊ້ອນທັບ, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ບຸລິມະສິດກັບຄ່າອອຟເຊັດອັນໜຶ່ງ (ທີ່ລຳດັບ [param "
"priority_index]) ໂດຍການຈຳກັດຄ່າອອຟເຊັດອື່ນໆ ທີ່ຊ້ອນທັບໃຫ້ຢູ່ກັບມັນ."

msgid "Use the first element of [method get_drag_area_controls] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວອົງປະກອບທຳອິດຂອງ [method get_drag_area_controls] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the drag area [Control]. For example, you can move a pre-configured "
"button into the drag area [Control] so that it rides along with the split "
"bar. Try setting the [Button] anchors to [code]center[/code] prior to the "
"[code]reparent()[/code] call.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"$BarnacleButton.reparent($SplitContainer.get_drag_area_control())\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The drag area [Control] is drawn over the [SplitContainer]'s "
"children, so [CanvasItem] draw objects called from the [Control] and children "
"added to the [Control] will also appear over the [SplitContainer]'s children. "
"Try setting [member Control.mouse_filter] of custom children to [constant "
"Control.MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE] to prevent blocking the mouse from dragging if "
"desired.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it may "
"cause a crash."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Control] ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ລາກ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ທ່ານສາມາດຍ້າຍປຸ່ມທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ກ່ອນເຂົ້າໄປໃນ [Control] "
"ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ລາກ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປພ້ອມກັບແຖບແບ່ງ. ລອງຕັ້ງຈຸດຍຶດ (anchors) ຂອງ [Button] ໃຫ້ເປັນ "
"[code]center[/code] ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [code]reparent()[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"$BarnacleButton.reparent($SplitContainer.get_drag_area_control())\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [Control] ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ລາກຈະຖືກແຕ້ມທັບລູກຂອງ [SplitContainer], ດັ່ງນັ້ນວັດຖຸແຕ້ມ "
"[CanvasItem] ທີ່ເອີ້ນຈາກ [Control] ແລະ ລູກທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ [Control] ຈະປາກົດທັບລູກຂອງ "
"[SplitContainer] ເຊັ່ນກັນ. ລອງຕັ້ງ [member Control.mouse_filter] "
"ຂອງລູກທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າເອງໃຫ້ເປັນ [constant Control.MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE] "
"ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ມັນບັງການລາກເມົາສ໌.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນໂນດພາຍໃນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ການລຶບ ຫຼື ປ່ອຍມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໂປຣແກຣມຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of the drag area [Control]s. These are the interactable "
"[Control] nodes between each child. For example, this can be used to add a "
"pre-configured button to a drag area [Control] so that it rides along with "
"the split bar. Try setting the [Button] anchors to [code]center[/code] prior "
"to the [method Node.reparent] call.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"$BarnacleButton.reparent($SplitContainer.get_drag_area_controls()[0])\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The drag area [Control]s are drawn over the [SplitContainer]'s "
"children, so [CanvasItem] draw objects called from a drag area and children "
"added to it will also appear over the [SplitContainer]'s children. Try "
"setting [member Control.mouse_filter] of custom children to [constant "
"Control.MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE] to prevent blocking the mouse from dragging if "
"desired.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] These are required internal nodes, removing or freeing them "
"may cause a crash."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Array] ຂອງ [Control] ໃນພື້ນທີ່ລາກ. ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນໂນດ [Control] "
"ທີ່ໂຕ້ຕອບໄດ້ລະຫວ່າງລູກແຕ່ລະຄົນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ນີ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປຸ່ມທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ກ່ອນເຂົ້າໃນ [Control] "
"ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ລາກ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປພ້ອມກັບແຖບແບ່ງ. ລອງຕັ້ງຈຸດຍຶດຂອງ [Button] ໃຫ້ເປັນ "
"[code]center[/code] ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method Node.reparent].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"$BarnacleButton.reparent($SplitContainer.get_drag_area_controls()[0])\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [Control] ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ລາກຈະຖືກແຕ້ມທັບລູກຂອງ [SplitContainer], ດັ່ງນັ້ນວັດຖຸແຕ້ມ "
"[CanvasItem] ທີ່ເອີ້ນຈາກພື້ນທີ່ລາກ ແລະ ລູກທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນນັ້ນຈະປາກົດທັບລູກຂອງ [SplitContainer] "
"ເຊັ່ນກັນ. ລອງຕັ້ງ [member Control.mouse_filter] ຂອງລູກທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າເອງໃຫ້ເປັນ [constant "
"Control.MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE] ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ມັນບັງການລາກເມົາສ໌.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນໂນດພາຍໃນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ການລຶບ ຫຼື "
"ປ່ອຍພວກມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໂປຣແກຣມຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the draggers will be disabled and the children will be "
"sized as if all [member split_offsets] were [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວລາກຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ລູກຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດຄືກັບວ່າ [member "
"split_offsets] ທັງໝົດເປັນ [code]0[/code]."

msgid ""
"Highlights the drag area [Rect2] so you can see where it is during "
"development. The drag area is gold if [member dragging_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code], and red if [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເນັ້ນ (Highlight) ພື້ນທີ່ລາກ [Rect2] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນວ່າມັນຢູ່ໃສໃນລະຫວ່າງການພັດທະນາ. "
"ພື້ນທີ່ລາກຈະເປັນສີທອງຖ້າ [member dragging_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແລະ "
"ເປັນສີແດງຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Reduces the size of the drag area and split bar [theme_item "
"split_bar_background] at the beginning of the container."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼຸດຂະໜາດຂອງພື້ນທີ່ລາກ ແລະ ແຖບແບ່ງ [theme_item split_bar_background] "
"ຢູ່ສ່ວນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ."

msgid ""
"Reduces the size of the drag area and split bar [theme_item "
"split_bar_background] at the end of the container."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼຸດຂະໜາດຂອງພື້ນທີ່ລາກ ແລະ ແຖບແບ່ງ [theme_item split_bar_background] "
"ຢູ່ສ່ວນທ້າຍຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ."

msgid ""
"Shifts the drag area in the axis of the container to prevent the drag area "
"from overlapping the [ScrollBar] or other selectable [Control] of a child "
"node."
msgstr ""
"ເລື່ອນພື້ນທີ່ລາກໃນແກນຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ລາກໄປຊ້ອນທັບກັບ [ScrollBar] ຫຼື [Control] "
"ອື່ນໆ ທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ຂອງໂນດລູກ."

msgid ""
"Adds extra draggers at the intersection of the draggers of two "
"SplitContainers to allow dragging both at once. This must be set to "
"[code]true[/code] for both SplitContainers, and one needs to be a descendant "
"of the other. They also must be orthogonal (their [member vertical] are "
"different) and the descendant must be next to at least one of the ancestor's "
"draggers (within [theme_item minimum_grab_thickness])."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຕົວລາກພິເສດຢູ່ຈຸດຕັດກັນຂອງຕົວລາກຂອງ SplitContainer ສອງອັນ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດລາກທັງສອງພ້ອມກັນໄດ້. ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ສຳລັບທັງສອງ "
"SplitContainer, ແລະ ອັນໜຶ່ງຕ້ອງເປັນລູກຫຼານຂອງອີກອັນໜຶ່ງ. ພວກມັນຍັງຕ້ອງຕັ້ງສາກກັນ (ຄ່າ [member "
"vertical] ຕ່າງກັນ) ແລະ ຕົວລູກຫຼານຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບຕົວລາກຂອງຕົວບັນພະບຸລຸດຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ (ພາຍໃນ "
"[theme_item minimum_grab_thickness])."

msgid ""
"Determines the dragger's visibility. This property does not determine whether "
"dragging is enabled or not. Use [member dragging_enabled] for that."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງຕົວລາກ. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດວ່າການລາກຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member "
"dragging_enabled] ສຳລັບການນັ້ນ."

msgid "Enables or disables split dragging."
msgstr "ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດການໃຊ້ງານການລາກແບ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Use [member split_offsets] instead. The first element of the array is the "
"split offset between the first two children."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member split_offsets] ແທນ. "
"ອົງປະກອບທຳອິດຂອງອາເຣແມ່ນຄ່າອອຟເຊັດການແບ່ງລະຫວ່າງລູກສອງຄົນທຳອິດ."

msgid "The first element of [member split_offsets]."
msgstr "ອົງປະກອບທຳອິດຂອງ [member split_offsets]."

msgid ""
"Offsets for each dragger in pixels. Each one is the offset of the split "
"between the [Control] nodes before and after the dragger, with [code]0[/code] "
"being the default position. The default position is based on the [Control] "
"nodes expand flags and minimum sizes. See [member "
"Control.size_flags_horizontal], [member Control.size_flags_vertical], and "
"[member Control.size_flags_stretch_ratio].\n"
"If none of the [Control] nodes before the dragger are expanded, the default "
"position will be at the start of the [SplitContainer]. If none of the "
"[Control] nodes after the dragger are expanded, the default position will be "
"at the end of the [SplitContainer]. If the dragger is in between expanded "
"[Control] nodes, the default position will be in the middle, based on the "
"[member Control.size_flags_stretch_ratio]s and minimum sizes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the split offsets cause [Control] nodes to overlap, the first "
"split will take priority when resolving the positions."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າອອຟເຊັດສຳລັບຕົວລາກແຕ່ລະອັນເປັນພິກເຊລ. ແຕ່ລະອັນແມ່ນອອຟເຊັດຂອງການແບ່ງລະຫວ່າງໂນດ [Control] "
"ກ່ອນ ແລະ ຫຼັງຕົວລາກ, ໂດຍທີ່ [code]0[/code] ແມ່ນຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. "
"ຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນອີງໃສ່ທຸງການຂະຫຍາຍ (expand flags) ແລະ ຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງໂນດ [Control]. "
"ເບິ່ງ [member Control.size_flags_horizontal], [member "
"Control.size_flags_vertical], ແລະ [member Control.size_flags_stretch_ratio].\n"
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີໂນດ [Control] ໃດກ່ອນຕົວລາກທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍ, ຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະຢູ່ສ່ວນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ "
"[SplitContainer]. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີໂນດ [Control] ໃດຫຼັງຕົວລາກທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍ, "
"ຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະຢູ່ສ່ວນທ້າຍຂອງ [SplitContainer]. ຖ້າຕົວລາກຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງໂນດ [Control] ທີ່ຂະຫຍາຍ, "
"ຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງ, ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ [member Control.size_flags_stretch_ratio] ແລະ "
"ຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າຄ່າອອຟເຊັດການແບ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ໂນດ [Control] ຊ້ອນທັບກັນ, "
"ການແບ່ງອັນທຳອິດຈະມີບຸລິມະສິດໃນການກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], a touch-friendly drag handle will be enabled for better "
"usability on smaller screens. Unlike the standard grabber, this drag handle "
"overlaps the [SplitContainer]'s children and does not affect their minimum "
"separation. The standard grabber will no longer be drawn when this option is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຕົວຈັບສຳລັບການສຳຜັດຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນໃນໜ້າຈໍຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ. "
"ຕ່າງຈາກຕົວຈັບມາດຕະຖານ, ຕົວຈັບນີ້ຈະຊ້ອນທັບລູກຂອງ [SplitContainer] ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການແຍກຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງພວກມັນ. ຕົວຈັບມາດຕະຖານຈະບໍ່ຖືກແຕ້ມອີກຕໍ່ໄປເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [SplitContainer] will arrange its children "
"vertically, rather than horizontally.\n"
"Can't be changed when using [HSplitContainer] and [VSplitContainer]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [SplitContainer] ຈະຈັດວາງລູກເປັນແນວຕັ້ງ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນແນວນອນ.\n"
"ບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [HSplitContainer] ແລະ [VSplitContainer]."

msgid "Emitted when the user ends dragging."
msgstr "ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຢຸດການລາກ."

msgid "Emitted when the user starts dragging."
msgstr "ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລາກ."

msgid "Emitted when any dragger is dragged by user."
msgstr "ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອຕົວລາກໃດໜຶ່ງຖືກລາກໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"The split dragger icon is always visible when [theme_item autohide] is "
"[code]false[/code], otherwise visible only when the cursor hovers it.\n"
"The size of the grabber icon determines the minimum [theme_item separation].\n"
"The dragger icon is automatically hidden if the length of the grabber icon is "
"longer than the split bar."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນຕົວລາກແບ່ງຈະປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນສະເໝີເມື່ອ [theme_item autohide] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເຫັນໄດ້ສະເພາະຕອນທີ່ເມົາສ໌ມາເລື່ອນໃສ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ຂະໜາດຂອງໄອຄອນຕົວຈັບຈະກຳນົດຄ່າ [theme_item separation] ຕ່ຳສຸດ.\n"
"ໄອຄອນຕົວລາກຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງອັດຕະໂນມັດຖ້າຄວາມຍາວຂອງໄອຄອນຕົວຈັບຍາວກວ່າແຖບແບ່ງ."

msgid ""
"The split dragger icon is never visible regardless of the value of "
"[theme_item autohide].\n"
"The size of the grabber icon determines the minimum [theme_item separation]."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນຕົວລາກແບ່ງຈະບໍ່ປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນເລີຍ ບໍ່ວ່າຄ່າຂອງ [theme_item autohide] ຈະເປັນແນວໃດ.\n"
"ຂະໜາດຂອງໄອຄອນຕົວຈັບຈະກຳນົດຄ່າ [theme_item separation] ຕ່ຳສຸດ."

msgid ""
"The split dragger icon is not visible, and the split bar is collapsed to zero "
"thickness."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນຕົວລາກແບ່ງຈະບໍ່ປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນ, ແລະ ແຖບແບ່ງຈະຖືກພັບໃຫ້ມີຄວາມໜາເປັນສູນ."

msgid "The color of the touch dragger."
msgstr "ສີຂອງຕົວລາກສຳລັບການສຳຜັດ."

msgid "The color of the touch dragger when hovered."
msgstr "ສີຂອງຕົວລາກສຳລັບການສຳຜັດເມື່ອມີເມົາສ໌ມາເລື່ອນໃສ່."

msgid "The color of the touch dragger when pressed."
msgstr "ສີຂອງຕົວລາກສຳລັບການສຳຜັດເມື່ອຖືກກົດ."

msgid ""
"Boolean value. If [code]1[/code] ([code]true[/code]), the grabbers will hide "
"automatically when they aren't under the cursor. If [code]0[/code] "
"([code]false[/code]), the grabbers are always visible. The [member "
"dragger_visibility] must be [constant DRAGGER_VISIBLE]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າບູນີນ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]1[/code] ([code]true[/code]), "
"ຕົວຈັບຈະເຊື່ອງອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ກ້ອງເຄີເຊີ (cursor). ຖ້າເປັນ [code]0[/code] "
"([code]false[/code]), ຕົວຈັບຈະປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນສະເໝີ. [member dragger_visibility] ຕ້ອງເປັນ "
"[constant DRAGGER_VISIBLE]."

msgid ""
"The minimum thickness of the area users can click on to grab a split bar. "
"This ensures that the split bar can still be dragged if [theme_item "
"separation] or [theme_item h_grabber] / [theme_item v_grabber]'s size is too "
"narrow to easily select."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໜາຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດຄລິກເພື່ອຈັບແຖບແບ່ງ. "
"ນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າແຖບແບ່ງຍັງສາມາດລາກໄດ້ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ [theme_item separation] ຫຼື ຂະໜາດຂອງ "
"[theme_item h_grabber] / [theme_item v_grabber] ຈະແຄບເກີນໄປທີ່ຈະເລືອກໄດ້ງ່າຍ."

msgid ""
"The split bar thickness, i.e., the gap between each child of the container. "
"This is overridden by the size of the grabber icon if [member "
"dragger_visibility] is set to [constant DRAGGER_VISIBLE], or [constant "
"DRAGGER_HIDDEN], and [theme_item separation] is smaller than the size of the "
"grabber icon in the same axis.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To obtain [theme_item separation] values less than the size of "
"the grabber icon, for example a [code]1 px[/code] hairline, set [theme_item "
"h_grabber] or [theme_item v_grabber] to a new [ImageTexture], which "
"effectively sets the grabber icon size to [code]0 px[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໜາຂອງແຖບແບ່ງ, ຄືຊ່ອງຫວ່າງລະຫວ່າງລູກແຕ່ລະຄົນຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍຂະໜາດຂອງໄອຄອນຕົວຈັບຖ້າ [member dragger_visibility] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[constant DRAGGER_VISIBLE], ຫຼື [constant DRAGGER_HIDDEN], ແລະ [theme_item "
"separation] ນ້ອຍກວ່າຂະໜາດຂອງໄອຄອນຕົວຈັບໃນແກນດຽວກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄ່າ [theme_item separation] ທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າຂະໜາດຂອງໄອຄອນຕົວຈັບ, "
"ເຊັ່ນ ເສັ້ນບາງຂະໜາດ [code]1 px[/code], ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [theme_item h_grabber] ຫຼື [theme_item "
"v_grabber] ເປັນ [ImageTexture] ໃໝ່, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະໜາດໄອຄອນຕົວຈັບເປັນ [code]0 px[/"
"code] ໂດຍປະລິຍາຍ."

msgid ""
"The icon used for the grabbers drawn in the separations. This is only used in "
"[HSplitContainer] and [VSplitContainer]. For [SplitContainer], see "
"[theme_item h_grabber] and [theme_item v_grabber] instead."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕົວຈັບທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມໃນຊ່ອງແບ່ງ. ນີ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ [HSplitContainer] ແລະ "
"[VSplitContainer]. ສຳລັບ [SplitContainer], ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [theme_item h_grabber] ແລະ "
"[theme_item v_grabber] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The icon used for the grabbers drawn in the separations when [member "
"vertical] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕົວຈັບທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມໃນຊ່ອງແບ່ງເມື່ອ [member vertical] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"The icon used for the drag handle when [member touch_dragger_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code] and [member vertical] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕົວລາກເມື່ອ [member touch_dragger_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ "
"[member vertical] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"The icon used for the drag handle when [member touch_dragger_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code]. This is only used in [HSplitContainer] and "
"[VSplitContainer]. For [SplitContainer], see [theme_item h_touch_dragger] and "
"[theme_item v_touch_dragger] instead."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕົວລາກເມື່ອ [member touch_dragger_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. "
"ນີ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ [HSplitContainer] ແລະ [VSplitContainer]. ສຳລັບ [SplitContainer], "
"ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [theme_item h_touch_dragger] ແລະ [theme_item v_touch_dragger] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The icon used for the grabbers drawn in the separations when [member "
"vertical] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕົວຈັບທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມໃນຊ່ອງແບ່ງເມື່ອ [member vertical] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"The icon used for the drag handle when [member touch_dragger_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code] and [member vertical] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕົວລາກເມື່ອ [member touch_dragger_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ "
"[member vertical] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Determines the background of the split bar if its thickness is greater than "
"zero."
msgstr "ກຳນົດພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງແຖບແບ່ງຖ້າມັນມີຄວາມໜາຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ."

msgid "A spotlight, such as a reflector spotlight or a lantern."
msgstr "ໄຟສ່ອງສະເພາະຈຸດ (spotlight), ເຊັ່ນ ໄຟສະທ້ອນ ຫຼື ໂຄມໄຟ."

msgid ""
"A Spotlight is a type of [Light3D] node that emits lights in a specific "
"direction, in the shape of a cone. The light is attenuated through the "
"distance. This attenuation can be configured by changing the energy, radius "
"and attenuation parameters of [Light3D].\n"
"Light is emitted in the -Z direction of the node's global basis. For an "
"unrotated light, this means that the light is emitted forwards, illuminating "
"the front side of a 3D model (see [constant Vector3.FORWARD] and [constant "
"Vector3.MODEL_FRONT]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Mobile rendering method, only 8 spot lights can "
"be displayed on each mesh resource. Attempting to display more than 8 spot "
"lights on a single mesh resource will result in spot lights flickering in and "
"out as the camera moves. When using the Compatibility rendering method, only "
"8 spot lights can be displayed on each mesh resource by default, but this can "
"be increased by adjusting [member ProjectSettings.rendering/limits/opengl/"
"max_lights_per_object].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Mobile or Compatibility rendering methods, spot "
"lights will only correctly affect meshes whose visibility AABB intersects "
"with the light's AABB. If using a shader to deform the mesh in a way that "
"makes it go outside its AABB, [member GeometryInstance3D.extra_cull_margin] "
"must be increased on the mesh. Otherwise, the light may not be visible on the "
"mesh."
msgstr ""
"Spotlight ແມ່ນປະເພດຂອງໂນດ [Light3D] ທີ່ປ່ອຍແສງໄປໃນທິດທາງສະເພາະ, ໃນຮູບຊົງຈວຍ (cone). "
"ແສງຈະຄ່ອຍໆ ຈາງລົງຕາມໄລຍະທາງ. ການຈາງລົງນີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນພາຣາມິເຕີພະລັງງານ "
"(energy), ລັດສະໝີ (radius) ແລະ ການຈາງລົງ (attenuation) ຂອງ [Light3D].\n"
"ແສງຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກໄປໃນທິດທາງ -Z ຂອງ global basis ຂອງໂນດ. ສຳລັບໄຟທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝຸນ, "
"ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແສງຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກໄປທາງໜ້າ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ດ້ານໜ້າຂອງໂມເດວ 3D ແຈ້ງ (ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"Vector3.FORWARD] ແລະ [constant Vector3.MODEL_FRONT]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການ render ແບບ Mobile, ສາມາດສະແດງ spotlight ໄດ້ພຽງ 8 "
"ດວງຕໍ່ແຕ່ລະຊັບພະຍາກອນ mesh. ຫາກພະຍາຍາມສະແດງຫຼາຍກວ່າ 8 ດວງໃນ mesh ອັນດຽວ "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟກະພິບເມື່ອກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການ render ແບບ Compatibility, "
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະສະແດງໄດ້ພຽງ 8 ດວງຕໍ່ mesh ເຊັ່ນກັນ, ແຕ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມໄດ້ໂດຍການປັບ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/limits/opengl/max_lights_per_object].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການ render ແບບ Mobile ຫຼື Compatibility, spotlight "
"ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງກັບ mesh ທີ່ visibility AABB ຂອງມັນຕັດກັບ AABB ຂອງແສງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າໃຊ້ "
"shader ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຮູບ mesh ຈົນເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນອອກໄປນອກ AABB ຂອງມັນ, ຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.extra_cull_margin] ໃນ mesh ນັ້ນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ແສງອາດຈະບໍ່ປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນ mesh."

msgid ""
"The spotlight's angle in degrees. This is the angular radius, meaning the "
"angle from the -Z axis, the cone's center, to the edge of the cone. The "
"default angular radius of 45 degrees corresponds to a cone with an angular "
"diameter of 90 degrees.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member spot_angle] is not affected by [member Node3D.scale] "
"(the light's scale or its parent's scale)."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມຂອງ spotlight ເປັນອົງສາ. ນີ້ແມ່ນລັດສະໝີທາງມຸມ (angular radius), ໝາຍເຖິງມຸມຈາກແກນ -Z "
"(ຈຸດໃຈກາງຂອງຈວຍ) ໄປຫາຂອບຂອງຈວຍ. ລັດສະໝີທາງມຸມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 45 ອົງສາ "
"ຈະກົງກັບຈວຍທີ່ມີເສັ້ນຜ່ານໃຈກາງທາງມຸມ 90 ອົງສາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member spot_angle] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ [member Node3D.scale] "
"(ຂະໜາດຂອງໄຟ ຫຼື ຂະໜາດຂອງຕົວຫຼັກ)."

msgid ""
"The spotlight's [i]angular[/i] attenuation curve. See also [member "
"spot_attenuation]."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຈາງລົງ [i]ທາງມຸມ[/i] ຂອງ spotlight. ເບິ່ງ [member spot_attenuation] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Controls the distance attenuation function for spotlights.\n"
"A value of [code]0.0[/code] will maintain a constant brightness through most "
"of the range, but smoothly attenuate the light at the edge of the range. Use "
"a value of [code]2.0[/code] for physically accurate lights as it results in "
"the proper inverse square attenutation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting attenuation to [code]2.0[/code] or higher may result in "
"distant objects receiving minimal light, even within range. For example, with "
"a range of [code]4096[/code], an object at [code]100[/code] units is "
"attenuated by a factor of [code]0.0001[/code]. With a default brightness of "
"[code]1[/code], the light would not be visible at that distance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using negative or values higher than [code]10.0[/code] may lead "
"to unexpected results."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມຟັງຊັນການຈາງລົງຕາມໄລຍະທາງສຳລັບ spotlight.\n"
"ຄ່າ [code]0.0[/code] ຈະຮັກສາຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໃຫ້ຄົງທີ່ເກືອບທັງໝົດຂອງໄລຍະ, ແຕ່ຈະຄ່ອຍໆ "
"ຈາງແສງລົງຢູ່ທີ່ຂອບຂອງໄລຍະ. ໃຊ້ຄ່າ [code]2.0[/code] ສຳລັບແສງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຫຼັກຟີຊິກ "
"ເພາະມັນຈະໃຫ້ການຈາງລົງແບບກົດເກນກຳລັງສອງຜົກຜັນ (inverse square attenuation).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຈາງລົງເປັນ [code]2.0[/code] ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າ "
"ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ໄກໄດ້ຮັບແສງໜ້ອຍຫຼາຍ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຍັງຢູ່ໃນໄລຍະກໍຕາມ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ດ້ວຍໄລຍະ "
"[code]4096[/code], ວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ຫ່າງອອກໄປ [code]100[/code] ຫົວໜ່ວຍ ຈະຖືກຈາງແສງລົງດ້ວຍຕົວຄູນ "
"[code]0.0001[/code]. ດ້ວຍຄວາມສະຫວ່າງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ [code]1[/code], "
"ແສງຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນໃນໄລຍະນັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການໃຊ້ຄ່າລົບ ຫຼື ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າ [code]10.0[/code] ອາດນຳໄປສູ່ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ."

msgid ""
"The maximal range that can be reached by the spotlight. Note that the "
"effectively lit area may appear to be smaller depending on the [member "
"spot_attenuation] in use. No matter the [member spot_attenuation] in use, the "
"light will never reach anything outside this range.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member spot_range] is not affected by [member Node3D.scale] "
"(the light's scale or its parent's scale)."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະໄກສຸດທີ່ spotlight ສາມາດສ່ອງໄປເຖິງ. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຖືກສ່ອງສະຫວ່າງຕົວຈິງອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່ານ້ອຍກວ່າ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບ [member spot_attenuation] "
"ທີ່ໃຊ້. ບໍ່ວ່າຈະໃຊ້ [member spot_attenuation] ແບບໃດ, "
"ແສງຈະບໍ່ມີວັນສ່ອງໄປເຖິງສິ່ງໃດທີ່ຢູ່ນອກໄລຍະນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member spot_range] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ [member Node3D.scale] "
"(ຂະໜາດຂອງໄຟ ຫຼື ຂະໜາດຂອງຕົວຫຼັກ)."

msgid ""
"A 3D raycast that dynamically moves its children near the collision point."
msgstr "raycast 3D ທີ່ເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍລູກຂອງມັນໄປໃກ້ກັບຈຸດຕຳກັນແບບໄດນາມິກ."

msgid ""
"[SpringArm3D] casts a ray or a shape along its Z axis and moves all its "
"direct children to the collision point, with an optional margin. This is "
"useful for 3rd person cameras that move closer to the player when inside a "
"tight space (you may need to exclude the player's collider from the "
"[SpringArm3D]'s collision check)."
msgstr ""
"[SpringArm3D] ສົ່ງລຳແສງ (ray) ຫຼື ຮູບຊົງຕາມແກນ Z ຂອງມັນ ແລະ "
"ເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍລູກໂດຍກົງທັງໝົດໄປຫາຈຸດຕຳກັນ, ໂດຍມີໄລຍະຫ່າງ (margin) ເສີມ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບກ້ອງມຸມມອງບຸກຄົນທີ 3 ທີ່ຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ເຂົ້າໃກ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນເມື່ອຢູ່ໃນບ່ອນແຄບ (ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຍົກເວັ້ນ "
"collider ຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນອອກຈາກການກວດສອບການຕຳກັນຂອງ [SpringArm3D])."

msgid "Third-person camera with spring arm"
msgstr "ກ້ອງມຸມມອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມພ້ອມ spring arm"

msgid ""
"Adds the [PhysicsBody3D] object with the given [RID] to the list of "
"[PhysicsBody3D] objects excluded from the collision check."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມວັດຖຸ [PhysicsBody3D] ດ້ວຍ [RID] ທີ່ກຳນົດເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການວັດຖຸ [PhysicsBody3D] "
"ທີ່ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການກວດສອບການຕຳກັນ."

msgid ""
"Clears the list of [PhysicsBody3D] objects excluded from the collision check."
msgstr "ລ້າງລາຍການວັດຖຸ [PhysicsBody3D] ທີ່ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການກວດສອບການຕຳກັນ."

msgid "Returns the spring arm's current length."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມຍາວປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ spring arm."

msgid ""
"Removes the given [RID] from the list of [PhysicsBody3D] objects excluded "
"from the collision check."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບ [RID] ທີ່ກຳນົດອອກຈາກລາຍຊື່ຂອງວັດຖຸ [PhysicsBody3D] ທີ່ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການກວດສອບການຕຳ."

msgid ""
"The layers against which the collision check will be done. See [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-"
"masks]Collision layers and masks[/url] in the documentation for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"ເລເຢີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການກວດສອບການຕຳ. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers and "
"masks[/url] ໃນເອກະສານປະກອບສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"When the collision check is made, a candidate length for the SpringArm3D is "
"given.\n"
"The margin is then subtracted to this length and the translation is applied "
"to the child objects of the SpringArm3D.\n"
"This margin is useful for when the SpringArm3D has a [Camera3D] as a child "
"node: without the margin, the [Camera3D] would be placed on the exact point "
"of collision, while with the margin the [Camera3D] would be placed close to "
"the point of collision."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີການກວດສອບການຕຳ, ຈະມີການກຳນົດຄວາມຍາວທີ່ຄາດການໄວ້ສຳລັບ SpringArm3D.\n"
"ຈາກນັ້ນ ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (margin) ຈະຖືກລົບອອກຈາກຄວາມຍາວນີ້ ແລະ ການຍ້າຍຕຳແໜ່ງ (translation) "
"ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບໂນດລູກຂອງ SpringArm3D.\n"
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ SpringArm3D ມີ [Camera3D] ເປັນໂນດລູກ: ຫາກບໍ່ມີໄລຍະຫ່າງ, "
"[Camera3D] ຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ຢູ່ຈຸດທີ່ຕຳພໍດີ, ແຕ່ຫາກມີໄລຍະຫ່າງ [Camera3D] ຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ໃກ້ກັບຈຸດທີ່ຕຳ."

msgid ""
"The [Shape3D] to use for the SpringArm3D.\n"
"When the shape is set, the SpringArm3D will cast the [Shape3D] on its z axis "
"instead of performing a ray cast."
msgstr ""
"[Shape3D] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ SpringArm3D.\n"
"ເມື່ອມີການກຳນົດຮູບຊົງ, SpringArm3D ຈະຍິງ [Shape3D] ໄປຕາມແກນ z ແທນການຍິງລຳແສງ (ray "
"cast)."

msgid ""
"The maximum extent of the SpringArm3D. This is used as a length for both the "
"ray and the shape cast used internally to calculate the desired position of "
"the SpringArm3D's child nodes.\n"
"To know more about how to perform a shape cast or a ray cast, please consult "
"the [PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D] documentation."
msgstr ""
"ຂອບເຂດສູງສຸດຂອງ SpringArm3D. ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຄວາມຍາວທັງສຳລັບການຍິງລຳແສງ (ray) ແລະ "
"ການຍິງຮູບຊົງ (shape cast) ທີ່ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນເພື່ອຄຳນວນຫາຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງການຂອງໂນດລູກຂອງ "
"SpringArm3D.\n"
"ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຍິງຮູບຊົງ ຫຼື ຍິງລຳແສງ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ "
"[PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D]."

msgid ""
"A base class of the collision that interacts with [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານຂອງການຕຳທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."

msgid ""
"A collision can be a child of [SpringBoneSimulator3D]. If it is not a child "
"of [SpringBoneSimulator3D], it has no effect.\n"
"The colliding and sliding are done in the [SpringBoneSimulator3D]'s "
"modification process in order of its collision list which is set by [method "
"SpringBoneSimulator3D.set_collision_path]. If [method "
"SpringBoneSimulator3D.are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]true[/code], "
"the order matches [SceneTree].\n"
"If [member bone] is set, it synchronizes with the bone pose of the ancestor "
"[Skeleton3D], which is done in before the [SpringBoneSimulator3D]'s "
"modification process as the pre-process.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] A scaled [SpringBoneCollision3D] will likely not behave as "
"expected. Make sure that the parent [Skeleton3D] and its bones are not scaled."
msgstr ""
"ການຕຳ (collision) ສາມາດເປັນລູກຂອງ [SpringBoneSimulator3D] ໄດ້. ຫາກມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນລູກຂອງ "
"[SpringBoneSimulator3D], ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງ.\n"
"ການຕຳ ແລະ ການສະໄລ້ (sliding) ແມ່ນເຮັດຢູ່ໃນຂະບວນການປັບປ່ຽນຂອງ [SpringBoneSimulator3D] "
"ຕາມລຳດັບຂອງລາຍຊື່ການຕຳທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [method "
"SpringBoneSimulator3D.set_collision_path]. ຫາກ [method "
"SpringBoneSimulator3D.are_all_child_collisions_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code], ລຳດັບຈະກົງກັບ [SceneTree].\n"
"ຫາກ [member bone] ຖືກກຳນົດ, ມັນຈະຊິງໂຄຣໄນກັບທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກ (bone pose) ຂອງ "
"[Skeleton3D] ທີ່ເປັນບັນພະບຸລຸດ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດກ່ອນຂະບວນການປັບປ່ຽນຂອງ [SpringBoneSimulator3D] "
"ເປັນຂັ້ນຕອນການກຽມພ້ອມ (pre-process).\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] [SpringBoneCollision3D] ທີ່ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ (scale) "
"ອາດຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ [Skeleton3D] ທີ່ເປັນພໍ່ແມ່ ແລະ "
"ກະດູກຂອງມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ."

msgid ""
"Get parent [Skeleton3D] node of the parent [SpringBoneSimulator3D] if found."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາໂນດ [Skeleton3D] ທີ່ເປັນພໍ່ແມ່ຂອງ [SpringBoneSimulator3D] ທີ່ເປັນພໍ່ແມ່ ຫາກພົບ."

msgid ""
"The offset of the position from [Skeleton3D]'s [member bone] pose position."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງທ່າທາງຂອງ [member bone] ຂອງ [Skeleton3D]."

msgid ""
"The offset of the rotation from [Skeleton3D]'s [member bone] pose rotation."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ຂອງການໝູນຈາກການໝູນທ່າທາງຂອງ [member bone] ຂອງ [Skeleton3D]."

msgid "A capsule shape collision that interacts with [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."
msgstr "ການຕຳຮູບຊົງແຄບຊູນ (capsule) ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the collision acts to trap the joint within the "
"collision."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການຕຳຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ກັກຂໍ້ຕໍ່ (joint) ໄວ້ພາຍໃນການຕຳ."

msgid "An infinite plane collision that interacts with [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."
msgstr "ການຕຳແບບລະນັບ (plane) ທີ່ບໍ່ມີທີ່ສິ້ນສຸດ ເຊິ່ງເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."

msgid ""
"An infinite plane collision that interacts with [SpringBoneSimulator3D]. It "
"is an infinite size XZ plane, and the +Y direction is treated as normal."
msgstr ""
"ການຕຳແບບລະນັບ (plane) ທີ່ບໍ່ມີທີ່ສິ້ນສຸດ ເຊິ່ງເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ [SpringBoneSimulator3D]. "
"ມັນແມ່ນລະນັບ XZ ທີ່ມີຂະໜາດບໍ່ຈຳກັດ, ແລະ ທິດທາງ +Y ຈະຖືກນັບເປັນແນວຕັ້ງສາກ (normal)."

msgid "A sphere shape collision that interacts with [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."
msgstr "ການຕຳຮູບຊົງກົມ (sphere) ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."

msgid "The sphere's radius."
msgstr "ລັດສະໝີຂອງຮູບຊົງກົມ."

msgid "A [SkeletonModifier3D] to apply inertial wavering to bone chains."
msgstr ""
"[SkeletonModifier3D] ສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ການແກວ່ງແບບມີແຮງເສື່ອຍ (inertial wavering) "
"ໃຫ້ກັບສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"This [SkeletonModifier3D] can be used to wiggle hair, cloth, and tails. This "
"modifier behaves differently from [PhysicalBoneSimulator3D] as it attempts to "
"return the original pose after modification.\n"
"If you setup [method set_root_bone] and [method set_end_bone], it is treated "
"as one bone chain. Note that it does not support a branched chain like Y-"
"shaped chains.\n"
"When a bone chain is created, an array is generated from the bones that exist "
"in between and listed in the joint list.\n"
"Several properties can be applied to each joint, such as [method "
"set_joint_stiffness], [method set_joint_drag], and [method "
"set_joint_gravity].\n"
"For simplicity, you can set values to all joints at the same time by using a "
"[Curve]. If you want to specify detailed values individually, set [method "
"set_individual_config] to [code]true[/code].\n"
"For physical simulation, [SpringBoneSimulator3D] can have children as self-"
"standing collisions that are not related to [PhysicsServer3D], see also "
"[SpringBoneCollision3D].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] A scaled [SpringBoneSimulator3D] will likely not behave as "
"expected. Make sure that the parent [Skeleton3D] and its bones are not "
"scaled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Most methods in this class take an [code]index[/code] parameter. "
"This parameter specifies which setting list entry to return if the IK has "
"multiple entries (e.g. [code]settings/<index>/root_bone_name[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວປັບປ່ຽນ [SkeletonModifier3D] ນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຜົມ, ຜ້າ, ແລະ ຫາງສັ່ນໄຫວໄດ້. "
"ຕົວປັບປ່ຽນນີ້ເຮັດວຽກແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ [PhysicalBoneSimulator3D] "
"ຍ້ອນວ່າມັນພະຍາຍາມກັບຄືນສູ່ທ່າທາງເດີມຫຼັງຈາກການປັບປ່ຽນ.\n"
"ຫາກທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າ [method set_root_bone] ແລະ [method set_end_bone], "
"ມັນຈະຖືກນັບເປັນສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກດຽວ. ໝາຍເຫດ: ມັນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບສາຍໂສ້ທີ່ແຕກແໜງ ເຊັ່ນ ສາຍໂສ້ຮູບຊົງຕົວ Y.\n"
"ເມື່ອສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ອາເຣ (array) ຈະຖືກສ້າງຈາກກະດູກທີ່ມີຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງນັ້ນ ແລະ "
"ຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່.\n"
"ຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼາຍຢ່າງສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ກັບແຕ່ລະຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ [method set_joint_stiffness], [method "
"set_joint_drag], ແລະ [method set_joint_gravity].\n"
"ເພື່ອຄວາມງ່າຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ທຸກຂໍ້ຕໍ່ພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ [Curve]. "
"ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການກຳນົດຄ່າລະອຽດແຍກກັນ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [method set_individual_config] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code].\n"
"ສຳລັບການຈຳລອງທາງຟີຊິກ, [SpringBoneSimulator3D] "
"ສາມາດມີລູກເປັນການຕຳແບບອິດສະຫຼະທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [PhysicsServer3D], ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ "
"[SpringBoneCollision3D].\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] [SpringBoneSimulator3D] ທີ່ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດອາດຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. "
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ [Skeleton3D] ທີ່ເປັນພໍ່ແມ່ ແລະ ກະດູກຂອງມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມັດທອດ (method) ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃນຄລາສນີ້ຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີ [code]index[/code]. "
"ພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ລະບຸວ່າຈະດຶງເອົາລາຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃດຫາກ IK ມີຫຼາຍລາຍການ (ເຊັ່ນ [code]settings/<index>/"
"root_bone_name[/code])."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if all child [SpringBoneCollision3D]s are contained "
"in the collision list at [param index] in the settings."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ [SpringBoneCollision3D] ລູກທັງໝົດຖືກລວມຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ການຕຳທີ່ "
"[param index] ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

msgid ""
"Clears all collisions from the collision list at [param index] in the "
"settings when [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບການຕຳທັງໝົດອອກຈາກລາຍຊື່ການຕຳທີ່ [param index] ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ເມື່ອ [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Clears all exclude collisions from the collision list at [param index] in the "
"settings when [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບການຕຳທີ່ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນທັງໝົດອອກຈາກລາຍຊື່ການຕຳທີ່ [param index] ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ເມື່ອ [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid "Returns the center bone index of the bone chain."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າອິນເດັກຂອງກະດູກໃຈກາງຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid "Returns the center bone name of the bone chain."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຊື່ຂອງກະດູກໃຈກາງຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid "Returns what the center originates from in the bone chain."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດຂອງໃຈກາງໃນສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid "Returns the center node path of the bone chain."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງໂນດ (node path) ຂອງໃຈກາງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the collision count of the bone chain's collision list when [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນການຕຳໃນລາຍຊື່ການຕຳຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ ເມື່ອ [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the node path of the [SpringBoneCollision3D] at [param collision] in "
"the bone chain's collision list when [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງໂນດຂອງ [SpringBoneCollision3D] ທີ່ [param collision] "
"ໃນລາຍຊື່ການຕຳຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ ເມື່ອ [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] ເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code]."

msgid "Returns the drag force damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງຕ້ານ (drag force damping curve) ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the exclude collision count of the bone chain's exclude collision "
"list when [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນການຕຳທີ່ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນໃນລາຍຊື່ການຕຳຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ ເມື່ອ [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the node path of the [SpringBoneCollision3D] at [param collision] in "
"the bone chain's exclude collision list when [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງໂນດຂອງ [SpringBoneCollision3D] ທີ່ [param collision] "
"ໃນລາຍຊື່ການຕຳທີ່ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ ເມື່ອ [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] "
"ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid "Returns the gravity amount of the bone chain."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າປະລິມານແຮງດຶງດູດຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid "Returns the gravity amount damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນປະລິມານແຮງດຶງດູດຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid "Returns the gravity direction of the bone chain."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າທິດທາງຂອງແຮງດຶງດູດຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid "Returns the drag force at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າແຮງຕ້ານທີ່ [param joint] ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the gravity amount at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າປະລິມານແຮງດຶງດູດທີ່ [param joint] ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the gravity direction at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າທິດທາງແຮງດຶງດູດທີ່ [param joint] ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid "Returns the radius at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າລັດສະໝີທີ່ [param joint] ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the stiffness force at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າແຮງຄວາມແຂງທີ່ [param joint] ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid "Returns the joint radius of the bone chain."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າລັດສະໝີຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid "Returns the joint radius damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນລັດສະໝີຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid "Returns the rotation axis of the bone chain."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າແກນໝູນຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the rotation axis vector of the bone chain. This vector represents "
"the axis around which the bone chain can rotate. It is determined based on "
"the rotation axis set for the bone chain.\n"
"If [method get_rotation_axis] is [constant "
"SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_ALL], this method returns [code]Vector3(0, "
"0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເວກເຕີແກນໝູນຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ. ເວກເຕີນີ້ແທນແກນທີ່ສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກສາມາດໝູນອ້ອມໄດ້. "
"ມັນຖືກກຳນົດຕາມແກນໝູນທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ສຳລັບສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ.\n"
"ຫາກ [method get_rotation_axis] ເປັນ [constant "
"SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_ALL], ເມັດທອດນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/"
"code]."

msgid "Returns the stiffness force of the bone chain."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າແຮງຄວາມແຂງຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid "Returns the stiffness force damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງຄວາມແຂງຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the config can be edited individually for each "
"joint."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກສາມາດແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຍກກັນໄດ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຂໍ້ຕໍ່."

msgid "Sets the center bone index of the bone chain."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນເດັກຂອງກະດູກໃຈກາງຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid "Sets the center bone name of the bone chain."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊື່ຂອງກະດູກໃຈກາງຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Sets what the center originates from in the bone chain.\n"
"Bone movement is calculated based on the difference in relative distance "
"between center and bone in the previous and next frames.\n"
"For example, if the parent [Skeleton3D] is used as the center, the bones are "
"considered to have not moved if the [Skeleton3D] moves in the world.\n"
"In this case, only a change in the bone pose is considered to be a bone "
"movement."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດຂອງໃຈກາງໃນສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ.\n"
"ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງກະດູກຈະຖືກຄຳນວນໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງໃຈກາງ ແລະ "
"ກະດູກໃນເຟຣມກ່ອນໜ້າ ແລະ ເຟຣມຖັດໄປ.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກໃຊ້ [Skeleton3D] ທີ່ເປັນພໍ່ແມ່ເປັນໃຈກາງ, ກະດູກຈະຖືກຖືວ່າບໍ່ໄດ້ເຄື່ອນທີ່ ຫາກ "
"[Skeleton3D] ເຄື່ອນທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂລກ.\n"
"ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ການປ່ຽນແປງໃນທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືວ່າເປັນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງກະດູກ."

msgid "Sets the center node path of the bone chain."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງໂນດຂອງໃຈກາງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the number of collisions in the collision list at [param index] in the "
"settings when [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນການຕຳໃນລາຍຊື່ການຕຳທີ່ [param index] ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ເມື່ອ [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Sets the node path of the [SpringBoneCollision3D] at [param collision] in the "
"bone chain's collision list when [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງໂນດຂອງ [SpringBoneCollision3D] ທີ່ [param collision] "
"ໃນລາຍຊື່ການຕຳຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ ເມື່ອ [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] ເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Sets the drag force of the bone chain. The greater the value, the more "
"suppressed the wiggling.\n"
"The value is scaled by [method set_drag_damping_curve] and cached in each "
"joint setting in the joint list."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າແຮງຕ້ານ (drag force) ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ. ຍິ່ງຄ່າຫຼາຍເທົ່າໃດ, "
"ການສັ່ນໄຫວຈະຖືກຢັບຢັ້ງຫຼາຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໂດຍ [method set_drag_damping_curve] ແລະ "
"ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນແຕ່ລະການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່."

msgid "Sets the drag force damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງຕ້ານຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], all child [SpringBoneCollision3D]s "
"are colliding and [method set_exclude_collision_path] is enabled as an "
"exclusion list at [param index] in the settings.\n"
"If [param enabled] is [code]false[/code], you need to manually register all "
"valid collisions with [method set_collision_path]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], [SpringBoneCollision3D] "
"ລູກທັງໝົດຈະເກີດການຕຳ ແລະ [method set_exclude_collision_path] "
"ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ເປັນລາຍຊື່ຍົກເວັ້ນທີ່ [param index] ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ.\n"
"ຫາກ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນການຕຳທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງທັງໝົດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ [method set_collision_path]."

msgid ""
"Sets the end bone name of the bone chain.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] End bone must be the root bone or a child of the root bone. If "
"they are the same, the tail must be extended by [method set_extend_end_bone] "
"to jiggle the bone."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊື່ກະດູກປາຍຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ກະດູກປາຍຕ້ອງເປັນກະດູກຫຼັກ (root bone) ຫຼື ເປັນລູກຂອງກະດູກຫຼັກ. "
"ຫາກພວກມັນເປັນອັນດຽວກັນ, ສ່ວນຫາງຕ້ອງຖືກຂະຫຍາຍໂດຍ [method set_extend_end_bone] "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກະດູກສັ່ນໄຫວໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the number of exclude collisions in the exclude collision list at [param "
"index] in the settings when [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນການຕຳທີ່ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນໃນລາຍຊື່ການຕຳທີ່ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນທີ່ [param index] ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ເມື່ອ "
"[method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Sets the node path of the [SpringBoneCollision3D] at [param collision] in the "
"bone chain's exclude collision list when [method "
"are_all_child_collisions_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງໂນດຂອງ [SpringBoneCollision3D] ທີ່ [param collision] "
"ໃນລາຍຊື່ການຕຳທີ່ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ ເມື່ອ [method are_all_child_collisions_enabled] "
"ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Sets the gravity amount of the bone chain. This value is not an acceleration, "
"but a constant velocity of movement in [method set_gravity_direction].\n"
"If [param gravity] is not [code]0[/code], the modified pose will not return "
"to the original pose since it is always affected by gravity.\n"
"The value is scaled by [method set_gravity_damping_curve] and cached in each "
"joint setting in the joint list."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າປະລິມານແຮງດຶງດູດຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ. ຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄວາມເລັ່ງ, ແຕ່ແມ່ນຄວາມໄວຄົງທີ່ຂອງການເຄື່ອນໄຫວໃນ "
"[method set_gravity_direction].\n"
"ຫາກ [param gravity] ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [code]0[/code], ທ່າທາງທີ່ຖືກປັບປ່ຽນຈະບໍ່ກັບຄືນສູ່ທ່າທາງເດີມ "
"ຍ້ອນວ່າມັນຖືກກະທົບໂດຍແຮງດຶງດູດຢູ່ສະເໝີ.\n"
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໂດຍ [method set_gravity_damping_curve] ແລະ "
"ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນແຕ່ລະການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່."

msgid "Sets the gravity amount damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນປະລິມານແຮງດຶງດູດຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the gravity direction of the bone chain. This value is internally "
"normalized and then multiplied by [method set_gravity].\n"
"The value is cached in each joint setting in the joint list."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າທິດທາງແຮງດຶງດູດຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າປົກກະຕິ (normalized) ພາຍໃນ ແລະ "
"ຈາກນັ້ນຄູນກັບ [method set_gravity].\n"
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນແຕ່ລະການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່."

msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], the config can be edited "
"individually for each joint."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະສາມາດແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຍກກັນໄດ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຂໍ້ຕໍ່."

msgid ""
"Sets the drag force at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list when "
"[method is_config_individual] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າແຮງຕ້ານທີ່ [param joint] ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ ເມື່ອ [method "
"is_config_individual] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Sets the gravity amount at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list when "
"[method is_config_individual] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າປະລິມານແຮງດຶງດູດທີ່ [param joint] ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ ເມື່ອ [method "
"is_config_individual] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Sets the gravity direction at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list "
"when [method is_config_individual] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າທິດທາງແຮງດຶງດູດທີ່ [param joint] ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ ເມື່ອ [method "
"is_config_individual] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Sets the joint radius at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list when "
"[method is_config_individual] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລັດສະໝີຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ [param joint] ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ ເມື່ອ [method "
"is_config_individual] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Sets the rotation axis at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list when "
"[method is_config_individual] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"The axes are based on the reference pose's space, if [param axis] is "
"[constant SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_CUSTOM], you can specify any "
"axis.\n"
"In here, the reference pose is the bone pose immediately before the "
"simulation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The rotation axis and the forward vector shouldn't be colinear "
"to avoid unintended rotation since [SpringBoneSimulator3D] does not factor in "
"twisting forces."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າແກນໝູນທີ່ [param joint] ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ ເມື່ອ [method "
"is_config_individual] ເປັນ [code]true[/code].\n"
"ແກນຈະອີງຕາມພື້ນທີ່ຂອງທ່າທາງອ້າງອີງ (reference pose), ຫາກ [param axis] ເປັນ [constant "
"SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_CUSTOM], ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດແກນໃດກໍໄດ້.\n"
"ໃນທີ່ນີ້, ທ່າທາງອ້າງອີງແມ່ນທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກກ່ອນການຈຳລອງທັນທີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແກນໝູນ ແລະ ເວກເຕີໄປທາງໜ້າ (forward vector) ບໍ່ຄວນຈະຢູ່ໃນແນວເສັ້ນດຽວກັນ "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການໝູນທີ່ບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈ ຍ້ອນວ່າ [SpringBoneSimulator3D] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຄຳນວນແຮງບິດ (twisting "
"forces)."

msgid ""
"Sets the stiffness force at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list when "
"[method is_config_individual] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າແຮງຄວາມແຂງທີ່ [param joint] ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ ເມື່ອ [method "
"is_config_individual] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Sets the joint radius of the bone chain. It is used to move and slide with "
"the [SpringBoneCollision3D] in the collision list.\n"
"The value is scaled by [method set_radius_damping_curve] and cached in each "
"joint setting in the joint list."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລັດສະໝີຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ. ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ສະໄລ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [SpringBoneCollision3D] "
"ໃນລາຍຊື່ການຕຳ.\n"
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໂດຍ [method set_radius_damping_curve] ແລະ "
"ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນແຕ່ລະການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່."

msgid "Sets the joint radius damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນລັດສະໝີຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the rotation axis of the bone chain. If set to a specific axis, it acts "
"like a hinge joint. The value is cached in each joint setting in the joint "
"list.\n"
"The axes are based on the reference pose's space, if [param axis] is "
"[constant SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_CUSTOM], you can specify any "
"axis.\n"
"In here, the reference pose is the bone pose immediately before the "
"simulation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The rotation axis vector and the forward vector shouldn't be "
"colinear to avoid unintended rotation since [SpringBoneSimulator3D] does not "
"factor in twisting forces."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າແກນໝູນຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ. ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນແກນໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍສະເພາະ, ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ບານພັບ (hinge "
"joint). ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນແຕ່ລະການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່.\n"
"ແກນຈະອີງຕາມພື້ນທີ່ຂອງທ່າທາງອ້າງອີງ, ຫາກ [param axis] ເປັນ [constant "
"SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_CUSTOM], ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດແກນໃດກໍໄດ້.\n"
"ໃນທີ່ນີ້, ທ່າທາງອ້າງອີງແມ່ນທ່າທາງຂອງກະດູກກ່ອນການຈຳລອງທັນທີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເວກເຕີແກນໝູນ ແລະ ເວກເຕີໄປທາງໜ້າ ບໍ່ຄວນຈະຢູ່ໃນແນວເສັ້ນດຽວກັນ "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການໝູນທີ່ບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈ ຍ້ອນວ່າ [SpringBoneSimulator3D] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຄຳນວນແຮງບິດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the rotation axis vector of the bone chain. The value is cached in each "
"joint setting in the joint list.\n"
"This vector is normalized by an internal process and represents the axis "
"around which the bone chain can rotate.\n"
"If the vector length is [code]0[/code], it is considered synonymous with "
"[constant SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_ALL]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວກເຕີແກນໝູນຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນແຕ່ລະການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່.\n"
"ເວກເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າປົກກະຕິໂດຍຂະບວນການພາຍໃນ ແລະ ແທນແກນທີ່ສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກສາມາດໝູນອ້ອມໄດ້.\n"
"ຫາກຄວາມຍາວຂອງເວກເຕີເປັນ [code]0[/code], ມັນຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນອັນດຽວກັບ [constant "
"SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_ALL]."

msgid ""
"Sets the stiffness force of the bone chain. The greater the value, the faster "
"it recovers to its initial pose.\n"
"If [param stiffness] is [code]0[/code], the modified pose will not return to "
"the original pose.\n"
"The value is scaled by [method set_stiffness_damping_curve] and cached in "
"each joint setting in the joint list."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າແຮງຄວາມແຂງຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ. ຍິ່ງຄ່າຫຼາຍເທົ່າໃດ, ມັນຈະກັບຄືນສູ່ທ່າທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ໄວເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ຫາກ [param stiffness] ເປັນ [code]0[/code], ທ່າທາງທີ່ຖືກປັບປ່ຽນຈະບໍ່ກັບຄືນສູ່ທ່າທາງເດີມ.\n"
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໂດຍ [method set_stiffness_damping_curve] ແລະ "
"ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນແຕ່ລະການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່."

msgid "Sets the stiffness force damping curve of the bone chain."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແຮງຄວາມແຂງຂອງສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"The constant force that always affected bones. It is equal to the result when "
"the parent [Skeleton3D] moves at this speed in the opposite direction.\n"
"This is useful for effects such as wind and anti-gravity."
msgstr ""
"ແຮງຄົງທີ່ທີ່ກະທົບຕໍ່ກະດູກຢູ່ສະເໝີ. ມັນເທົ່າກັບຜົນລັດເມື່ອ [Skeleton3D] "
"ທີ່ເປັນພໍ່ແມ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວນີ້ໃນທິດທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກ ເຊັ່ນ ລົມ ແລະ ແຮງຕ້ານແຮງດຶງດູດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the solver retrieves the bone axis from the bone pose "
"every frame.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the solver retrieves the bone axis from the bone rest "
"and caches it, which increases performance slightly, but position changes in "
"the bone pose made before processing this [SpringBoneSimulator3D] are ignored."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (solver) ຈະດຶງແກນກະດູກຈາກທ່າທາງກະດູກໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມ.\n"
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະດຶງແກນກະດູກຈາກທ່າພັກ (bone rest) ແລະ ບັນທຶກໄວ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບເລັກນ້ອຍ, ແຕ່ການປ່ຽນແປງຕຳແໜ່ງໃນທ່າທາງກະດູກທີ່ເຮັດກ່ອນການປະມວນຜົນ "
"[SpringBoneSimulator3D] ນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

msgid "The world origin is defined as center."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຈຸດກຳເນີດຂອງໂລກ (world origin) ເປັນໃຈກາງ."

msgid ""
"The [Node3D] specified by [method set_center_node] is defined as center.\n"
"If [Node3D] is not found, the parent [Skeleton3D] is treated as center."
msgstr ""
"[Node3D] ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [method set_center_node] ຈະຖືກກຳນົດເປັນໃຈກາງ.\n"
"ຫາກບໍ່ພົບ [Node3D], [Skeleton3D] ທີ່ເປັນພໍ່ແມ່ຈະຖືກນັບເປັນໃຈກາງ."

msgid ""
"The bone pose origin of the parent [Skeleton3D] specified by [method "
"set_center_bone] is defined as center.\n"
"If [Node3D] is not found, the parent [Skeleton3D] is treated as center."
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດກຳເນີດທ່າທາງກະດູກຂອງ [Skeleton3D] ທີ່ເປັນພໍ່ແມ່ ເຊິ່ງລະບຸໂດຍ [method set_center_bone] "
"ຈະຖືກກຳນົດເປັນໃຈກາງ.\n"
"ຫາກບໍ່ພົບ [Node3D], [Skeleton3D] ທີ່ເປັນພໍ່ແມ່ຈະຖືກນັບເປັນໃຈກາງ."

msgid "General-purpose sprite node."
msgstr "ໂນດສະໄປຣ໌ (sprite) ເອັນເນີປະສົງ."

msgid ""
"A node that displays a 2D texture. The texture displayed can be a region from "
"a larger atlas texture, or a frame from a sprite sheet animation."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດທີ່ສະແດງເທີັກເຈີ (texture) 2 ມິຕິ. ເທັກເຈີທີ່ສະແດງສາມາດເປັນສ່ວນໃດສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຈາກ atlas texture "
"ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ, ຫຼື ເປັນເຟຣມຈາກອະນິເມຊັນແບບ sprite sheet."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Rect2] representing the Sprite2D's boundary in local coordinates.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Detect if the Sprite2D was clicked:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseButton and event.pressed and event.button_index "
"== MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT:\n"
"\t\tif get_rect().has_point(to_local(event.position)):\n"
"\t\t\tprint(\"A click!\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseButton inputEventMouse)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tif (inputEventMouse.Pressed && inputEventMouse.ButtonIndex == "
"MouseButton.Left)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tif (GetRect().HasPoint(ToLocal(inputEventMouse.Position)))\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tGD.Print(\"A click!\");\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [Rect2] ທີ່ແທນຂອບເຂດຂອງ Sprite2D ໃນພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local coordinates).\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ກວດສອບວ່າ Sprite2D ຖືກຄລິກ ຫຼື ບໍ່:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseButton and event.pressed and event.button_index "
"== MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT:\n"
"\t\tif get_rect().has_point(to_local(event.position)):\n"
"\t\t\tprint(\"A click!\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseButton inputEventMouse)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tif (inputEventMouse.Pressed && inputEventMouse.ButtonIndex == "
"MouseButton.Left)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tif (GetRect().HasPoint(ToLocal(inputEventMouse.Position)))\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tGD.Print(\"A click!\");\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the pixel at the given position is opaque, "
"[code]false[/code] otherwise. Also returns [code]false[/code] if the given "
"position is out of bounds or this sprite's [member texture] is [code]null[/"
"code]. [param pos] is in local coordinates."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກພິກເຊວ (pixel) ຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດນັ້ນເປັນແບບທຶບແສງ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]false[/code]. ຍັງສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]false[/code] ນຳອີກ "
"ຫາກຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດ ຫຼື [member texture] ຂອງສະໄປຣ໌ນີ້ເປັນ [code]null[/code]. "
"[param pos] ແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], texture is centered.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For games with a pixel art aesthetic, textures may appear "
"deformed when centered. This is caused by their position being between "
"pixels. To prevent this, set this property to [code]false[/code], or consider "
"enabling [member ProjectSettings.rendering/2d/snap/snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel] "
"and [member ProjectSettings.rendering/2d/snap/snap_2d_transforms_to_pixel]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເທັກເຈີຈະຖືກຈັດວາງໄວ້ກາງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບເກມທີ່ມີຮູບແບບພິກເຊວອາຕ (pixel art), "
"ເທັກເຈີອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຜິດຮູບຊົງເມື່ອຖືກຈັດໄວ້ກາງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງພວກມັນຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງພິກເຊວ. "
"ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຫຼື ພິຈາລະນາເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/2d/snap/snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel] ແລະ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/2d/snap/snap_2d_transforms_to_pixel]."

msgid ""
"Current frame to display from sprite sheet. [member hframes] or [member "
"vframes] must be greater than 1. This property is automatically adjusted when "
"[member hframes] or [member vframes] are changed to keep pointing to the same "
"visual frame (same column and row). If that's impossible, this value is reset "
"to [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເຟຣມປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ຈະສະແດງຈາກ sprite sheet. [member hframes] ຫຼື [member vframes] "
"ຕ້ອງມີຄ່າຫຼາຍກວ່າ 1. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກປັບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອ [member hframes] ຫຼື [member "
"vframes] ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຍັງຄົງຊີ້ໄປຫາເຟຣມເດີມ (ຖັນ ແລະ ແຖວເດີມ). ຫາກເປັນໄປບໍ່ໄດ້, "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຣີເຊັດເປັນ [code]0[/code]."

msgid ""
"Coordinates of the frame to display from sprite sheet. This is as an alias "
"for the [member frame] property. [member hframes] or [member vframes] must be "
"greater than 1."
msgstr ""
"ພິກັດຂອງເຟຣມທີ່ຈະສະແດງຈາກ sprite sheet. ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນຊື່ເອີ້ນແທນ (alias) ສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດ [member "
"frame]. [member hframes] ຫຼື [member vframes] ຕ້ອງມີຄ່າຫຼາຍກວ່າ 1."

msgid ""
"The number of columns in the sprite sheet. When this property is changed, "
"[member frame] is adjusted so that the same visual frame is maintained (same "
"row and column). If that's impossible, [member frame] is reset to [code]0[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຖັນໃນ sprite sheet. ເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ, [member frame] "
"ຈະຖືກປັບເພື່ອໃຫ້ຍັງຄົງສະແດງເຟຣມເດີມ (ແຖວ ແລະ ຖັນເດີມ). ຫາກເປັນໄປບໍ່ໄດ້, [member frame] "
"ຈະຖືກຣີເຊັດເປັນ [code]0[/code]."

msgid ""
"The texture's drawing offset.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When you increase [member offset].y in Sprite2D, the sprite "
"moves downward on screen (i.e., +Y is down)."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ໃນການແຕ້ມເທັກເຈີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອທ່ານເພີ່ມຄ່າ [member offset].y ໃນ Sprite2D, "
"ສະໄປຣ໌ຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ລົງລຸ່ມໃນໜ້າຈໍ (ເຊັ່ນ: +Y ແມ່ນທິດທາງລົງ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], texture is cut from a larger atlas texture. See [member "
"region_rect].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using a custom [Shader] on a [Sprite2D], the [code]UV[/"
"code] shader built-in will refer to the entire texture space. Use the "
"[code]REGION_RECT[/code] built-in to get the currently visible region defined "
"in [member region_rect] instead. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/shaders/"
"shader_reference/canvas_item_shader.html]CanvasItem shaders[/url] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເທັກເຈີຈະຖືກຕັດມາຈາກ atlas texture ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"region_rect].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [Shader] ແບບກຳນົດເອງໃນ [Sprite2D], ຄ່າ [code]UV[/code] "
"ໃນໂຕເຊເດີ (shader) ຈະອ້າງອີງເຖິງພື້ນທີ່ເທັກເຈີທັງໝົດ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [code]REGION_RECT[/code] "
"ແທນເພື່ອດຶງເອົາຂອບເຂດທີ່ກຳລັງສະແດງຢູ່ເຊິ່ງກຳນົດໃນ [member region_rect]. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/"
"canvas_item_shader.html]CanvasItem shaders[/url] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the area outside of the [member region_rect] is clipped "
"to avoid bleeding of the surrounding texture pixels. [member region_enabled] "
"must be [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ພື້ນທີ່ຢູ່ນອກ [member region_rect] ຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ (clipped) "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການປົນເປື້ອນຂອງພິກເຊວເທັກເຈີທີ່ຢູ່ອ້ອມຮອບ. [member region_enabled] ຕ້ອງເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"The region of the atlas texture to display. [member region_enabled] must be "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຂອບເຂດຂອງ atlas texture ທີ່ຈະສະແດງ. [member region_enabled] ຕ້ອງເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code]."

msgid "[Texture2D] object to draw."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸ [Texture2D] ທີ່ຈະແຕ້ມ."

msgid ""
"The number of rows in the sprite sheet. When this property is changed, "
"[member frame] is adjusted so that the same visual frame is maintained (same "
"row and column). If that's impossible, [member frame] is reset to [code]0[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນແຖວໃນ sprite sheet. ເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ, [member frame] "
"ຈະຖືກປັບເພື່ອໃຫ້ຍັງຄົງສະແດງເຟຣມເດີມ (ແຖວ ແລະ ຖັນເດີມ). ຫາກເປັນໄປບໍ່ໄດ້, [member frame] "
"ຈະຖືກຣີເຊັດເປັນ [code]0[/code]."

msgid "Emitted when the [member frame] changes."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອ [member frame] ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "Emitted when the [member texture] changes."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອ [member texture] ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "2D sprite node in a 3D world."
msgstr "ໂນດສະໄປຣ໌ 2 ມິຕິ ໃນໂລກ 3 ມິຕິ."

msgid ""
"A node that displays a 2D texture in a 3D environment. The texture displayed "
"can be a region from a larger atlas texture, or a frame from a sprite sheet "
"animation. See also [SpriteBase3D] where properties such as the billboard "
"mode are defined."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດທີ່ສະແດງເທັກເຈີ 2 ມິຕິ ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ 3 ມິຕິ. ເທັກເຈີທີ່ສະແດງສາມາດເປັນສ່ວນໃດສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຈາກ "
"atlas texture ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ, ຫຼື ເປັນເຟຣມຈາກອະນິເມຊັນແບບ sprite sheet. ເບິ່ງ "
"[SpriteBase3D] ເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເຊິ່ງເປັນບ່ອນກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ ໂໝດບິລບອດ (billboard mode)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the sprite will use [member region_rect] and display "
"only the specified part of its texture."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະໄປຣ໌ຈະໃຊ້ [member region_rect] ແລະ "
"ສະແດງສະເພາະສ່ວນທີ່ກຳນົດຂອງເທັກເຈີເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"[Texture2D] object to draw. If [member GeometryInstance3D.material_override] "
"is used, this will be overridden. The size information is still used."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸ [Texture2D] ທີ່ຈະແຕ້ມ. ຫາກມີການໃຊ້ [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.material_override], ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບ, ແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນຂະໜາດຍັງຄົງຖືກນຳໃຊ້ອີກ."

msgid "2D sprite node in 3D environment."
msgstr "ໂນດສະໄປຣ໌ 2 ມິຕິ ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ 3 ມິຕິ."

msgid ""
"A node that displays 2D texture information in a 3D environment. See also "
"[Sprite3D] where many other properties are defined."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດທີ່ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນເທັກເຈີ 2 ມິຕິ ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ 3 ມິຕິ. ເບິ່ງ [Sprite3D] ເພີ່ມເຕີມ "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນບ່ອນກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດອື່ນໆອີກຫຼາຍຢ່າງ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [TriangleMesh] with the sprite's vertices following its current "
"configuration (such as its [member axis] and [member pixel_size])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [TriangleMesh] ທີ່ມີຈຸດຍອດ (vertices) ຂອງສະໄປຣ໌ຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນ (ເຊັ່ນ: [member "
"axis] ແລະ [member pixel_size])."

msgid "Returns the rectangle representing this sprite."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ແທນສະໄປຣ໌ນີ້."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the specified flag will be enabled."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຟຼັກ (flag) ທີ່ລະບຸຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້."

msgid "The direction in which the front of the texture faces."
msgstr "ທິດທາງທີ່ດ້ານໜ້າຂອງເທັກເຈີຫັນໄປ."

msgid ""
"The billboard mode to use for the sprite.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When billboarding is enabled and the material also casts "
"shadows, billboards will face [b]the[/b] camera in the scene when rendering "
"shadows. In scenes with multiple cameras, the intended shadow cannot be "
"determined and this will result in undefined behavior. See [url=https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/72638]GitHub Pull Request #72638[/url] for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດບິລບອດ (billboard mode) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບສະໄປຣ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ບິລບອດ ແລະ ວັດສະດຸ (material) ມີການສ້າງເງົານຳ, "
"ບິລບອດຈະຫັນໜ້າໄປຫາ ກ້ອງ ໃນສາກໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງເຣັນເດີເງົາ. ໃນສາກທີ່ມີຫຼາຍກ້ອງ, "
"ເງົາທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈະບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ ແລະ ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຄາດເດົາໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/72638]GitHub Pull Request #72638[/url] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], texture will be centered."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເທັກເຈີຈະຖືກຈັດວາງໄວ້ກາງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], texture can be seen from the back as well, if "
"[code]false[/code], it is invisible when looking at it from behind."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນເທັກເຈີຈາກດ້ານຫຼັງໄດ້ຄືກັນ, ຫາກເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code], ມັນຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກດ້ານຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the texture is rendered at the same size regardless of "
"distance. The texture's size on screen is the same as if the camera was "
"[code]1.0[/code] units away from the texture's origin, regardless of the "
"actual distance from the camera. The [Camera3D]'s field of view (or [member "
"Camera3D.size] when in orthogonal/frustum mode) still affects the size the "
"sprite is drawn at."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເທັກເຈີຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີໃນຂະໜາດດຽວກັນໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງໄລຍະຫ່າງ. "
"ຂະໜາດຂອງເທັກເຈີໃນໜ້າຈໍຈະຄືກັບວ່າກ້ອງຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກຈຸດກຳເນີດຂອງເທັກເຈີ [code]1.0[/code] ຢູນິດ, "
"ບໍ່ວ່າໄລຍະຫ່າງຕົວຈິງຈາກກ້ອງຈະເປັນເທົ່າໃດກໍຕາມ. ມຸມມອງ (field of view) ຂອງ [Camera3D] (ຫຼື "
"[member Camera3D.size] ເມື່ອຢູ່ໃນໂໝດ orthogonal/frustum) "
"ຍັງຄົງມີຜົນຕໍ່ຂະໜາດຂອງສະໄປຣ໌ທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມ."

msgid ""
"A color value used to [i]multiply[/i] the texture's colors. Can be used for "
"mood-coloring or to simulate the color of ambient light.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [member CanvasItem.modulate] for 2D, colors with values "
"above [code]1.0[/code] (overbright) are not supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If a [member GeometryInstance3D.material_override] is defined on "
"the [SpriteBase3D], the material override must be configured to take vertex "
"colors into account for albedo. Otherwise, the color defined in [member "
"modulate] will be ignored. For a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] must be [code]true[/code]. For a "
"[ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted in the "
"shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າສີທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອ ຄູນ ກັບສີຂອງເທັກເຈີ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບໂທນສີ ຫຼື ຈຳລອງສີຂອງແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (ambient "
"light).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ [member CanvasItem.modulate] ໃນ 2 ມິຕິ, ສີທີ່ມີຄ່າເກີນ "
"[code]1.0[/code] (overbright) ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກມີການກຳນົດ [member GeometryInstance3D.material_override] ໃນ "
"[SpriteBase3D], ວັດສະດຸທີ່ຂຽນທັບນັ້ນຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບສີຈຸດຍອດ (vertex colors) ສຳລັບ "
"albedo. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ສີທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ [member modulate] ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ. ສຳລັບ [BaseMaterial3D], "
"[member BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] ຕ້ອງເປັນ [code]true[/code]. "
"ສຳລັບ [ShaderMaterial], ຕ້ອງໃສ່ [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] ໃນຟັງຊັນ "
"[code]fragment()[/code] ຂອງເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"The texture's drawing offset.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When you increase [member offset].y in Sprite3D, the sprite "
"moves upward in world space (i.e., +Y is up)."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ໃນການແຕ້ມເທັກເຈີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອທ່ານເພີ່ມຄ່າ [member offset].y ໃນ Sprite3D, "
"ສະໄປຣ໌ຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂຶ້ນເທິງໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລກ (ເຊັ່ນ: +Y ແມ່ນທິດທາງຂຶ້ນ)."

msgid "The size of one pixel's width on the sprite to scale it in 3D."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງໜຶ່ງພິກເຊວໃນສະໄປຣ໌ເພື່ອປັບຂະໜາດໃນ 3 ມິຕິ."

msgid ""
"Sets the render priority for the sprite. Higher priority objects will be "
"sorted in front of lower priority objects.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only applies if [member alpha_cut] is set to [constant "
"ALPHA_CUT_DISABLED] (default value).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only applies to sorting of transparent objects. This will "
"not impact how transparent objects are sorted relative to opaque objects. "
"This is because opaque objects are not sorted, while transparent objects are "
"sorted from back to front (subject to priority)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນໃນການເຣັນເດີ (render priority) ສຳລັບສະໄປຣ໌. "
"ວັດຖຸທີ່ມີລຳດັບສູງກວ່າຈະຖືກຈັດວາງໄວ້ທາງໜ້າຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ມີລຳດັບຕ່ຳກວ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member alpha_cut] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"ALPHA_CUT_DISABLED] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບການຈັດລຳດັບວັດຖຸໂປ່ງໃສເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການຈັດລຳດັບວັດຖຸໂປ່ງໃສທຽບກັບວັດຖຸທຶບແສງ. ເນື່ອງຈາກວັດຖຸທຶບແສງຈະບໍ່ຖືກຈັດລຳດັບ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ວັດຖຸໂປ່ງໃສຈະຖືກຈັດລຳດັບຈາກຫຼັງໄປໜ້າ (ຕາມລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [Light3D] in the [Environment] has effects on the "
"sprite."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], [Light3D] ໃນ [Environment] ຈະມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ສະໄປຣ໌."

msgid ""
"Filter flags for the texture.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Linear filtering may cause artifacts around the edges, which are "
"especially noticeable on opaque textures. To prevent this, use textures with "
"transparent or identical colors around the edges."
msgstr ""
"ຟຼັກການກອງ (filter flags) ສຳລັບເທັກເຈີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການກອງແບບ Linear ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຮອຍແຕກ (artifacts) ບໍລິເວນຂອບ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະສັງເກດເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນໃນເທັກເຈີທີ່ທຶບແສງ. ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີທີ່ມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ ຫຼື "
"ມີສີດຽວກັນຢູ່ອ້ອມຂອບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the texture's transparency and the opacity are used to "
"make those parts of the sprite invisible."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມທຶບແສງຂອງເທັກເຈີຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ບາງສ່ວນຂອງສະໄປຣ໌ເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"If set, the texture's transparency and the opacity are used to make those "
"parts of the sprite invisible."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ ແລະ ຄວາມທຶບແສງຂອງເທັກເຈີຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ບາງສ່ວນຂອງສະໄປຣ໌ເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນ."

msgid "If set, lights in the environment affect the sprite."
msgstr "ຫາກຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ແສງສະຫວ່າງໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ສະໄປຣ໌."

msgid ""
"If set, texture can be seen from the back as well. If not, the texture is "
"invisible when looking at it from behind."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ຈະສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນເທັກເຈີຈາກດ້ານຫຼັງໄດ້ຄືກັນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ເທັກເຈີຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກດ້ານຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"This mode performs standard alpha blending. It can display translucent areas, "
"but transparency sorting issues may be visible when multiple transparent "
"materials are overlapping."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດນີ້ຈະເຮັດການປະສົມອັນຟາ (alpha blending) ແບບມາດຕະຖານ. ມັນສາມາດສະແດງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ໂປ່ງແສງໄດ້, "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະເຫັນບັນຫາການຈັດລຳດັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສເມື່ອມີວັດສະດຸໂປ່ງໃສຫຼາຍອັນຊ້ອນທັບກັນ."

msgid ""
"This mode only allows fully transparent or fully opaque pixels. Harsh edges "
"will be visible unless some form of screen-space antialiasing is enabled (see "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/screen_space_aa]). On "
"the bright side, this mode doesn't suffer from transparency sorting issues "
"when multiple transparent materials are overlapping. This mode is also known "
"as [i]alpha testing[/i] or [i]1-bit transparency[/i]."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດນີ້ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີພຽງພິກເຊວທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສທັງໝົດ ຫຼື ທຶບແສງທັງໝົດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຈະເຫັນຂອບທີ່ແຂງກະດ້າງ "
"ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ຈະມີການເປີດໃຊ້ການລົບຮອຍຢັກ (antialiasing) ບາງຮູບແບບ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/screen_space_aa]). ຂໍ້ດີຄື "
"ໂໝດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີບັນຫາເລື່ອງການຈັດລຳດັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສເມື່ອມີວັດສະດຸໂປ່ງໃສຫຼາຍອັນຊ້ອນທັບກັນ. ໂໝດນີ້ຍັງເອີ້ນວ່າ "
"[i]alpha testing[/i] ຫຼື [i]1-bit transparency[/i]."

msgid ""
"This mode draws fully opaque pixels in the depth prepass. This is slower than "
"[constant ALPHA_CUT_DISABLED] or [constant ALPHA_CUT_DISCARD], but it allows "
"displaying translucent areas and smooth edges while using proper sorting."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດນີ້ຈະແຕ້ມພິກເຊວທີ່ທຶບແສງທັງໝົດໃນຂັ້ນຕອນ depth prepass. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ້າກວ່າ [constant "
"ALPHA_CUT_DISABLED] ຫຼື [constant ALPHA_CUT_DISCARD], "
"ແຕ່ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດສະແດງພື້ນທີ່ໂປ່ງແສງ ແລະ ຂອບທີ່ລຽບນຽນໄດ້ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງມີການຈັດລຳດັບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Sprite frame library for AnimatedSprite2D and AnimatedSprite3D."
msgstr ""
"ຄັງເກັບເຟຣມສະໄປຣ໌ (sprite frame library) ສຳລັບ AnimatedSprite2D ແລະ "
"AnimatedSprite3D."

msgid ""
"Sprite frame library for an [AnimatedSprite2D] or [AnimatedSprite3D] node. "
"Contains frames and animation data for playback."
msgstr ""
"ຄັງເກັບເຟຣມສະໄປຣ໌ສຳລັບໂນດ [AnimatedSprite2D] ຫຼື [AnimatedSprite3D]. ປະກອບດ້ວຍເຟຣມ "
"ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນອະນິເມຊັນສຳລັບການຫຼິ້ນ."

msgid "Adds a new [param anim] animation to the library."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມອະນິເມຊັນ [param anim] ໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນຄັງເກັບ."

msgid ""
"Adds a frame to the [param anim] animation. If [param at_position] is "
"[code]-1[/code], the frame will be added to the end of the animation. [param "
"duration] specifies the relative duration, see [method get_frame_duration] "
"for details."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເຟຣມໃຫ້ກັບອະນິເມຊັນ [param anim]. ຫາກ [param at_position] ເປັນ [code]-1[/code], "
"ເຟຣມຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຕອນທ້າຍຂອງອະນິເມຊັນ. [param duration] ກໍານົດໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ເບິ່ງ "
"[method get_frame_duration] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid "Removes all frames from the [param anim] animation."
msgstr "ລຶບເຟຣມທັງໝົດອອກຈາກອະນິເມຊັນ [param anim]."

msgid ""
"Removes all animations. An empty [code]default[/code] animation will be "
"created."
msgstr "ລຶບອະນິເມຊັນທັງໝົດ. ອະນິເມຊັນ [code]default[/code] ທີ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແທນ."

msgid ""
"Duplicates the animation [param anim_from] to a new animation named [param "
"anim_to]. Fails if [param anim_to] already exists, or if [param anim_from] "
"does not exist."
msgstr ""
"ສຳເນົາອະນິເມຊັນ [param anim_from] ໄປເປັນອະນິເມຊັນໃໝ່ທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ [param anim_to]. "
"ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຫາກ [param anim_to] ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ຫຼື ຫາກບໍ່ມີ [param anim_from]."

msgid "Use [method get_animation_loop_mode] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method get_animation_loop_mode] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [code]get_animation_loop_mode(anim) == "
"LOOP_LINEAR[/code]. Otherwise, returns [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ [code]get_animation_loop_mode(anim) == "
"LOOP_LINEAR[/code]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]false[/code]."

msgid "Returns the loop mode for the [param anim] animation."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າໂໝດການວົນຊ້ຳ (loop mode) ສຳລັບອະນິເມຊັນ [param anim]."

msgid ""
"Returns an array containing the names associated to each animation. Values "
"are placed in alphabetical order."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າອາເຣ (array) ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຊື່ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບແຕ່ລະອະນິເມຊັນ. "
"ຄ່າຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກຈັດລຽງຕາມລຳດັບຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid "Returns the speed in frames per second for the [param anim] animation."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຄວາມໄວເປັນເຟຣມຕໍ່ວິນາທີ (FPS) ສຳລັບອະນິເມຊັນ [param anim]."

msgid "Returns the number of frames for the [param anim] animation."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນເຟຣມສຳລັບອະນິເມຊັນ [param anim]."

msgid ""
"Returns a relative duration of the frame [param idx] in the [param anim] "
"animation (defaults to [code]1.0[/code]). For example, a frame with a "
"duration of [code]2.0[/code] is displayed twice as long as a frame with a "
"duration of [code]1.0[/code]. You can calculate the absolute duration (in "
"seconds) of a frame using the following formula:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"absolute_duration = relative_duration / (animation_fps * abs(playing_speed))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"In this example, [code]playing_speed[/code] refers to either [method "
"AnimatedSprite2D.get_playing_speed] or [method "
"AnimatedSprite3D.get_playing_speed]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ (relative duration) ຂອງເຟຣມ [param idx] ໃນອະນິເມຊັນ [param "
"anim] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [code]1.0[/code]). ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເຟຣມທີ່ມີໄລຍະເວລາ [code]2.0[/code] "
"ຈະຖືກສະແດງດົນເປັນສອງເທົ່າຂອງເຟຣມທີ່ມີໄລຍະເວລາ [code]1.0[/code]. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດຄຳນວນໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ແທ້ຈິງ (ເປັນວິນາທີ) ຂອງເຟຣມໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"absolute_duration = relative_duration / (animation_fps * abs(playing_speed))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, [code]playing_speed[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງ [method "
"AnimatedSprite2D.get_playing_speed] ຫຼື [method "
"AnimatedSprite3D.get_playing_speed]."

msgid ""
"Returns the texture of the frame [param idx] in the [param anim] animation."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າເທັກເຈີຂອງເຟຣມ [param idx] ໃນອະນິເມຊັນ [param anim]."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the [param anim] animation exists."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກມີອະນິເມຊັນ [param anim] ຢູ່."

msgid "Removes the [param anim] animation."
msgstr "ລຶບອະນິເມຊັນ [param anim]."

msgid "Removes the [param anim] animation's frame [param idx]."
msgstr "ລຶບເຟຣມ [param idx] ຂອງອະນິເມຊັນ [param anim]."

msgid "Changes the [param anim] animation's name to [param newname]."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຊື່ອະນິເມຊັນ [param anim] ເປັນ [param newname]."

msgid "Use [method set_animation_loop_mode] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method set_animation_loop_mode] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"If [param loop] is [code]false[/code] equivalent to "
"[code]set_animation_loop_mode(LOOP_NONE)[/code].\n"
"If [param loop] is [code]true[/code] equivalent to "
"[code]set_animation_loop_mode(LOOP_LINEAR)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກ [param loop] ເປັນ [code]false[/code] ຈະທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[code]set_animation_loop_mode(LOOP_NONE)[/code].\n"
"ຫາກ [param loop] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຈະທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[code]set_animation_loop_mode(LOOP_LINEAR)[/code]."

msgid "Sets the [param loop_mode] for the [param anim] animation."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param loop_mode] ສຳລັບອະນິເມຊັນ [param anim]."

msgid "Sets the speed for the [param anim] animation in frames per second."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມໄວສຳລັບອະນິເມຊັນ [param anim] ເປັນເຟຣມຕໍ່ວິນາທີ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param texture] and the [param duration] of the frame [param idx] in "
"the [param anim] animation. [param duration] specifies the relative duration, "
"see [method get_frame_duration] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param texture] ແລະ [param duration] ຂອງເຟຣມ [param idx] ໃນອະນິເມຊັນ "
"[param anim]. [param duration] ກໍານົດໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_frame_duration] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"The animation plays once and stops when it reaches the end, or the start if "
"played in reverse."
msgstr "ອະນິເມຊັນຈະຫຼິ້ນໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງ ແລະ ຢຸດເມື່ອຮອດຕອນທ້າຍ, ຫຼື ຢຸດຢູ່ຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫາກຫຼິ້ນແບບຖອຍຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"The animation restarts from the beginning when it reaches the end, or from "
"the end if played in reverse, repeating continuously."
msgstr ""
"ອະນິເມຊັນຈະເລີ່ມໃໝ່ຈາກຕອນຕົ້ນເມື່ອຮອດຕອນທ້າຍ, ຫຼື ເລີ່ມຈາກຕອນທ້າຍຫາກຫຼິ້ນແບບຖອຍຫຼັງ, "
"ໂດຍຈະວົນຊ້ຳໄປເລື້ອຍໆ."

msgid ""
"The animation alternates direction each time it reaches the end or start, "
"playing forward and then in reverse repeatedly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Both [AnimatedSprite2D] and [AnimatedSprite3D] play the first/"
"last frame for its duration only once at each end of the animation loop "
"(instead of twice, once per forward/backward animation direction)."
msgstr ""
"ອະນິເມຊັນຈະສະຫຼັບທິດທາງທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ຮອດຕອນທ້າຍ ຫຼື ຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໂດຍຈະຫຼິ້ນໄປທາງໜ້າ ແລະ "
"ຖອຍຫຼັງສະຫຼັບກັນໄປເລື້ອຍໆ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທັງ [AnimatedSprite2D] ແລະ [AnimatedSprite3D] ຈະຫຼິ້ນເຟຣມທຳອິດ/"
"ສຸດທ້າຍຕາມໄລຍະເວລາຂອງມັນພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວໃນແຕ່ລະຈຸດຈົບຂອງການວົນຊ້ຳ (ແທນທີ່ຈະຫຼິ້ນສອງຄັ້ງ, "
"ຄືຄັ້ງໜຶ່ງສຳລັບທິດທາງໄປທາງໜ້າ ແລະ ອີກຄັ້ງໜຶ່ງສຳລັບທິດທາງຖອຍຫຼັງ)."

msgid "A PBR (Physically Based Rendering) material to be used on 3D objects."
msgstr "ວັດສະດຸ (material) ແບບ PBR (Physically Based Rendering) ສຳລັບໃຊ້ກັບວັດຖຸ 3 ມິຕິ."

msgid ""
"[StandardMaterial3D]'s properties are inherited from [BaseMaterial3D]. "
"[StandardMaterial3D] uses separate textures for ambient occlusion, roughness "
"and metallic maps. To use a single ORM map for all 3 textures, use an "
"[ORMMaterial3D] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ [StandardMaterial3D] ແມ່ນສືບທອດມາຈາກ [BaseMaterial3D]. "
"[StandardMaterial3D] ໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີແຍກກັນສຳລັບ ambient occlusion, roughness ແລະ "
"metallic maps. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ ORM map ພຽງອັນດຽວສຳລັບທັງ 3 ເທັກເຈີ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [ORMMaterial3D] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"A 2D physics body that can't be moved by external forces. When moved "
"manually, it doesn't affect other bodies in its path."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 2 ມິຕິ ທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກຍ້າຍໄດ້ໂດຍແຮງຈາກພາຍນອກ. ເມື່ອຖືກຍ້າຍດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ວັດຖຸອື່ນທີ່ຢູ່ໃນເສັ້ນທາງຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"A static 2D physics body. It can't be moved by external forces or contacts, "
"but can be moved manually by other means such as code, [AnimationMixer]s "
"(with [member AnimationMixer.callback_mode_process] set to [constant "
"AnimationMixer.ANIMATION_CALLBACK_MODE_PROCESS_PHYSICS]), and "
"[RemoteTransform2D].\n"
"When [StaticBody2D] is moved, it is teleported to its new position without "
"affecting other physics bodies in its path. If this is not desired, use "
"[AnimatableBody2D] instead.\n"
"[StaticBody2D] is useful for completely static objects like floors and walls, "
"as well as moving surfaces like conveyor belts and circular revolving "
"platforms (by using [member constant_linear_velocity] and [member "
"constant_angular_velocity])."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 2 ມິຕິແບບສະແຕຕິກ (static). ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກຍ້າຍໄດ້ໂດຍແຮງຈາກພາຍນອກ ຫຼື ການສຳຜັດ, "
"ແຕ່ສາມາດຍ້າຍດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້ຜ່ານວິທີອື່ນ ເຊັ່ນ ໂຄ້ດ, [AnimationMixer] (ໂດຍຕັ້ງ [member "
"AnimationMixer.callback_mode_process] ເປັນ [constant "
"AnimationMixer.ANIMATION_CALLBACK_MODE_PROCESS_PHYSICS]), ແລະ "
"[RemoteTransform2D].\n"
"ເມື່ອ [StaticBody2D] ຖືກຍ້າຍ, ມັນຈະຖືກເທເລພອດ (teleported) "
"ໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງໃໝ່ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກອື່ນໆໃນເສັ້ນທາງຂອງມັນ. ຫາກບໍ່ຕ້ອງການແບບນີ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[AnimatableBody2D] ແທນ.\n"
"[StaticBody2D] ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຄົງທີ່ຢ່າງສົມບູນ ເຊັ່ນ ພື້ນ ແລະ ຝາ, ລວມທັງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ ເຊັ່ນ "
"ສາຍພານລຳລຽງ ແລະ ແທ່ນໝູນ (ໂດຍການໃຊ້ [member constant_linear_velocity] ແລະ [member "
"constant_angular_velocity])."

msgid ""
"The body's constant angular velocity. This does not rotate the body, but "
"affects touching bodies, as if it were rotating."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມຄົງທີ່ຂອງວັດຖຸ. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸໝູນ, ແຕ່ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ວັດຖຸທີ່ມາສຳຜັດ ຄືກັບວ່າມັນກຳລັງໝູນຢູ່."

msgid ""
"The body's constant linear velocity. This does not move the body, but affects "
"touching bodies, as if it were moving."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວເຊີງເສັ້ນຄົງທີ່ຂອງວັດຖຸ. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸເຄື່ອນທີ່, ແຕ່ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ວັດຖຸທີ່ມາສຳຜັດ "
"ຄືກັບວ່າມັນກຳລັງເຄື່ອນທີ່ຢູ່."

msgid ""
"A 3D physics body that can't be moved by external forces. When moved "
"manually, it doesn't affect other bodies in its path."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 3 ມິຕິ ທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກຍ້າຍໄດ້ໂດຍແຮງຈາກພາຍນອກ. ເມື່ອຖືກຍ້າຍດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ວັດຖຸອື່ນທີ່ຢູ່ໃນເສັ້ນທາງຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"A static 3D physics body. It can't be moved by external forces or contacts, "
"but can be moved manually by other means such as code, [AnimationMixer]s "
"(with [member AnimationMixer.callback_mode_process] set to [constant "
"AnimationMixer.ANIMATION_CALLBACK_MODE_PROCESS_PHYSICS]), and "
"[RemoteTransform3D].\n"
"When [StaticBody3D] is moved, it is teleported to its new position without "
"affecting other physics bodies in its path. If this is not desired, use "
"[AnimatableBody3D] instead.\n"
"[StaticBody3D] is useful for completely static objects like floors and walls, "
"as well as moving surfaces like conveyor belts and circular revolving "
"platforms (by using [member constant_linear_velocity] and [member "
"constant_angular_velocity])."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 3 ມິຕິແບບສະແຕຕິກ (static). ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກຍ້າຍໄດ້ໂດຍແຮງຈາກພາຍນອກ ຫຼື ການສຳຜັດ, "
"ແຕ່ສາມາດຍ້າຍດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້ຜ່ານວິທີອື່ນ ເຊັ່ນ ໂຄ້ດ, [AnimationMixer] (ໂດຍຕັ້ງ [member "
"AnimationMixer.callback_mode_process] ເປັນ [constant "
"AnimationMixer.ANIMATION_CALLBACK_MODE_PROCESS_PHYSICS]), ແລະ "
"[RemoteTransform3D].\n"
"ເມື່ອ [StaticBody3D] ຖືກຍ້າຍ, ມັນຈະຖືກເທເລພອດ (teleported) "
"ໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງໃໝ່ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກອື່ນໆໃນເສັ້ນທາງຂອງມັນ. ຫາກບໍ່ຕ້ອງການແບບນີ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[AnimatableBody3D] ແທນ.\n"
"[StaticBody3D] ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຄົງທີ່ຢ່າງສົມບູນ ເຊັ່ນ ພື້ນ ແລະ ຝາ, ລວມທັງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ ເຊັ່ນ "
"ສາຍພານລຳລຽງ ແລະ ແທ່ນໝູນ (ໂດຍການໃຊ້ [member constant_linear_velocity] ແລະ [member "
"constant_angular_velocity])."

msgid ""
"Application status indicator (aka notification area icon).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Status indicator is implemented on macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ສະຖານະແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ (ຫຼື ໄອຄອນໃນແຖບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ສະຖານະແມ່ນຮອງຮັບໃນ macOS ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Returns the status indicator rectangle in screen coordinates. If this status "
"indicator is not visible, returns an empty [Rect2]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກຂອງຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ສະຖານະໃນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍ. ຫາກຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ສະຖານະນີ້ບໍ່ປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [Rect2] "
"ທີ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid "Status indicator icon."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ສະຖານະ."

msgid ""
"Status indicator native popup menu. If this is set, the [signal pressed] "
"signal is not emitted.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Native popup is only supported if [NativeMenu] supports "
"[constant NativeMenu.FEATURE_POPUP_MENU] feature."
msgstr ""
"ເມນູປັອບອັບແບບເນທີບ (native popup menu) ຂອງຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ສະຖານະ. ຫາກມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າສິ່ງນີ້, ສັນຍານ "
"[signal pressed] ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປັອບອັບແບບເນທີບຈະຮອງຮັບກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [NativeMenu] ຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດ [constant "
"NativeMenu.FEATURE_POPUP_MENU] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Status indicator tooltip."
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳ (tooltip) ຂອງຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ສະຖານະ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the status indicator is visible."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ສະຖານະຈະປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

msgid "Emitted when the status indicator is pressed."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ສະຖານະຖືກກົດ."

msgid "Abstract base class for interacting with streams."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານແບບແອັບສະແຕຣັກ (abstract base class) ສຳລັບການໂຕ້ຕອບກັບສະຕຣີມ (streams)."

msgid "Gets a signed byte from the stream."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາໄບຕ໌ແບບມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ (signed byte) ຈາກສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Gets a signed 16-bit value from the stream."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຄ່າ 16-ບິດ ແບບມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈາກສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Gets a signed 32-bit value from the stream."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຄ່າ 32-ບິດ ແບບມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈາກສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Gets a signed 64-bit value from the stream."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຄ່າ 64-ບິດ ແບບມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈາກສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Returns the number of bytes this [StreamPeer] has available."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ (bytes) ທີ່ [StreamPeer] ນີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Returns a chunk data with the received bytes, as an [Array] containing two "
"elements: an [enum Error] constant and a [PackedByteArray]. [param bytes] is "
"the number of bytes to be received. If not enough bytes are available, the "
"function will block until the desired amount is received."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນກຸ່ມໜຶ່ງພ້ອມກັບໄບຕ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ, ໃນຮູບແບບ [Array] ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍສອງອົງປະກອບ: ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum "
"Error] ແລະ [PackedByteArray]. [param bytes] ແມ່ນຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບ. "
"ຖ້າຫາກມີໄບຕ໌ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ, ຟັງຊັນຈະລໍຖ້າ (block) ຈົນກວ່າຈະໄດ້ຮັບຈຳນວນທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

msgid "Gets a double-precision float from the stream."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຄ່າເລກທົດສະນິຍົມຄວາມລະອຽດສູງ (double-precision float) ຈາກສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Gets a single-precision float from the stream."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຄ່າເລກທົດສະນິຍົມຄວາມລະອຽດປົກກະຕິ (single-precision float) ຈາກສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Gets a half-precision float from the stream."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຄ່າເລກທົດສະນິຍົມຄວາມລະອຽດເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ (half-precision float) ຈາກສະຕຣີມ."

msgid ""
"Returns a chunk data with the received bytes, as an [Array] containing two "
"elements: an [enum Error] constant and a [PackedByteArray]. [param bytes] is "
"the number of bytes to be received. If not enough bytes are available, the "
"function will return how many were actually received."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນກຸ່ມໜຶ່ງພ້ອມກັບໄບຕ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ, ໃນຮູບແບບ [Array] ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍສອງອົງປະກອບ: ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum "
"Error] ແລະ [PackedByteArray]. [param bytes] ແມ່ນຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບ. "
"ຖ້າຫາກມີໄບຕ໌ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ, ຟັງຊັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຕົວຈິງ."

msgid ""
"Gets an ASCII string with byte-length [param bytes] from the stream. If "
"[param bytes] is negative (default) the length will be read from the stream "
"using the reverse process of [method put_string]."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງເອົາຂໍ້ຄວາມ ASCII ທີ່ມີຄວາມຍາວ [param bytes] ໄບຕ໌ຈາກສະຕຣີມ. ຖ້າ [param bytes] "
"ເປັນຄ່າລົບ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຄວາມຍາວຈະຖືກອ່ານຈາກສະຕຣີມໂດຍໃຊ້ຂະບວນການຍ້ອນກັບຂອງ [method "
"put_string]."

msgid "Gets an unsigned byte from the stream."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາໄບຕ໌ແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈາກສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Gets an unsigned 16-bit value from the stream."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຄ່າ 16-ບິດ ແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈາກສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Gets an unsigned 32-bit value from the stream."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຄ່າ 32-ບິດ ແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈາກສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Gets an unsigned 64-bit value from the stream."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຄ່າ 64-ບິດ ແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈາກສະຕຣີມ."

msgid ""
"Gets a UTF-8 string with byte-length [param bytes] from the stream (this "
"decodes the string sent as UTF-8). If [param bytes] is negative (default) the "
"length will be read from the stream using the reverse process of [method "
"put_utf8_string]."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງເອົາຂໍ້ຄວາມ UTF-8 ທີ່ມີຄວາມຍາວ [param bytes] ໄບຕ໌ຈາກສະຕຣີມ (ນີ້ຈະຖອດລະຫັດຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສົ່ງມາເປັນ "
"UTF-8). ຖ້າ [param bytes] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), "
"ຄວາມຍາວຈະຖືກອ່ານຈາກສະຕຣີມໂດຍໃຊ້ຂະບວນການຍ້ອນກັບຂອງ [method put_utf8_string]."

msgid ""
"Gets a Variant from the stream. If [param allow_objects] is [code]true[/"
"code], decoding objects is allowed.\n"
"Internally, this uses the same decoding mechanism as the [method "
"@GlobalScope.bytes_to_var] method.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Deserialized objects can contain code which gets executed. Do "
"not use this option if the serialized object comes from untrusted sources to "
"avoid potential security threats such as remote code execution."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງເອົາ Variant ຈາກສະຕຣີມ. ຖ້າ [param allow_objects] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຖອດລະຫັດວັດຖຸ (objects).\n"
"ພາຍໃນ, ນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ກົນໄກການຖອດລະຫັດແບບດຽວກັນກັບເມທອດ [method "
"@GlobalScope.bytes_to_var].\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກແປງກັບ (Deserialized objects) ສາມາດມີໂຄ້ດທີ່ຖືກເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. "
"ຢ່າໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖ້າວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກແປງນັ້ນມາຈາກແຫຼ່ງທີ່ບໍ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນໄພຄຸກຄາມດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ "
"ເຊັ່ນການສັ່ງລັນໂຄ້ດຈາກໄລຍະໄກ (remote code execution)."

msgid "Puts a signed byte into the stream."
msgstr "ໃສ່ໄບຕ໌ແບບມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍລົງໃນສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Puts a signed 16-bit value into the stream."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຄ່າ 16-ບິດ ແບບມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍລົງໃນສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Puts a signed 32-bit value into the stream."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຄ່າ 32-ບິດ ແບບມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍລົງໃນສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Puts a signed 64-bit value into the stream."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຄ່າ 64-ບິດ ແບບມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍລົງໃນສະຕຣີມ."

msgid ""
"Sends a chunk of data through the connection, blocking if necessary until the "
"data is done sending. This function returns an [enum Error] code."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງກຸ່ມຂໍ້ມູນຜ່ານການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ໂດຍຈະລໍຖ້າ (blocking) ຖ້າຈຳເປັນຈົນກວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກສົ່ງສຳເລັດ. "
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນລະຫັດ [enum Error]."

msgid "Puts a double-precision float into the stream."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຄ່າເລກທົດສະນິຍົມຄວາມລະອຽດສູງ (double-precision float) ລົງໃນສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Puts a single-precision float into the stream."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຄ່າເລກທົດສະນິຍົມຄວາມລະອຽດປົກກະຕິ (single-precision float) ລົງໃນສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Puts a half-precision float into the stream."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຄ່າເລກທົດສະນິຍົມຄວາມລະອຽດເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ (half-precision float) ລົງໃນສະຕຣີມ."

msgid ""
"Sends a chunk of data through the connection. If all the data could not be "
"sent at once, only part of it will. This function returns two values, an "
"[enum Error] code and an integer, describing how much data was actually sent."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງກຸ່ມຂໍ້ມູນຜ່ານການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່. ຖ້າບໍ່ສາມາດສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດໄດ້ໃນຄັ້ງດຽວ, ຈະສົ່ງພຽງແຕ່ບາງສ່ວນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນສອງຄ່າ, ຄືລະຫັດ [enum Error] ແລະ ເລກຖ້ວນ, ເຊິ່ງລະບຸວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຖືກສົ່ງໄປຕົວຈິງເທົ່າໃດ."

msgid ""
"Puts a zero-terminated ASCII string into the stream prepended by a 32-bit "
"unsigned integer representing its size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To put an ASCII string without prepending its size, you can use "
"[method put_data]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"put_data(\"Hello world\".to_ascii_buffer())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"PutData(\"Hello World\".ToAsciiBuffer());\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ ASCII ທີ່ລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍສູນ (zero-terminated) ລົງໃນສະຕຣີມ ໂດຍມີເລກຖ້ວນແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ "
"32-ບິດ ຢູ່ທາງໜ້າເພື່ອລະບຸຂະໜາດຂອງມັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ ASCII ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂະໜາດຢູ່ທາງໜ້າ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ [method "
"put_data]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"put_data(\"Hello world\".to_ascii_buffer())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"PutData(\"Hello World\".ToAsciiBuffer());\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Puts an unsigned byte into the stream."
msgstr "ໃສ່ໄບຕ໌ແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍລົງໃນສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Puts an unsigned 16-bit value into the stream."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຄ່າ 16-ບິດ ແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍລົງໃນສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Puts an unsigned 32-bit value into the stream."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຄ່າ 32-ບິດ ແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍລົງໃນສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Puts an unsigned 64-bit value into the stream."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຄ່າ 64-ບິດ ແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍລົງໃນສະຕຣີມ."

msgid ""
"Puts a zero-terminated UTF-8 string into the stream prepended by a 32 bits "
"unsigned integer representing its size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To put a UTF-8 string without prepending its size, you can use "
"[method put_data]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"put_data(\"Hello world\".to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"PutData(\"Hello World\".ToUtf8Buffer());\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ UTF-8 ທີ່ລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍສູນ (zero-terminated) ລົງໃນສະຕຣີມ ໂດຍມີເລກຖ້ວນແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ "
"32 ບິດ ຢູ່ທາງໜ້າເພື່ອລະບຸຂະໜາດຂອງມັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ UTF-8 ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂະໜາດຢູ່ທາງໜ້າ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ [method "
"put_data]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"put_data(\"Hello world\".to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"PutData(\"Hello World\".ToUtf8Buffer());\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Puts a Variant into the stream. If [param full_objects] is [code]true[/code] "
"encoding objects is allowed (and can potentially include code).\n"
"Internally, this uses the same encoding mechanism as the [method "
"@GlobalScope.var_to_bytes] method."
msgstr ""
"ໃສ່ Variant ລົງໃນສະຕຣີມ. ຖ້າ [param full_objects] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າລະຫັດວັດຖຸ (ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະລວມເຖິງໂຄ້ດ).\n"
"ພາຍໃນ, ນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ກົນໄກການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບດຽວກັນກັບເມທອດ [method @GlobalScope.var_to_bytes]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this [StreamPeer] will using big-endian format for "
"encoding and decoding."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [StreamPeer] ນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ big-endian ສໍາລັບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ "
"ແລະ ຖອດລະຫັດ."

msgid "A stream peer used to handle binary data streams."
msgstr "Stream peer ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຈັດການສະຕຣີມຂໍ້ມູນໄບນາຣີ (binary)."

msgid ""
"A data buffer stream peer that uses a byte array as the stream. This object "
"can be used to handle binary data from network sessions. To handle binary "
"data stored in files, [FileAccess] can be used directly.\n"
"A [StreamPeerBuffer] object keeps an internal cursor which is the offset in "
"bytes to the start of the buffer. Get and put operations are performed at the "
"cursor position and will move the cursor accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Data buffer stream peer ທີ່ໃຊ້ອາເຣຂອງໄບຕ໌ (byte array) ເປັນສະຕຣີມ. "
"ວັດຖຸນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນໄບນາຣີຈາກເຊດຊັນເຄືອຂ່າຍ. ສໍາລັບການຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນໄບນາຣີທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌, "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ [FileAccess] ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ.\n"
"ວັດຖຸ [StreamPeerBuffer] ຈະຮັກສາເຄີເຊີ (cursor) ພາຍໃນ ເຊິ່ງເປັນຄ່າອອຟເຊັດ (offset) "
"ໃນຮູບແບບໄບຕ໌ຈາກຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງບັບເຟີ (buffer). ການດຳເນີນການ Get ແລະ Put "
"ຈະຖືກເຮັດຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີ ແລະ ຈະຍ້າຍເຄີເຊີຕາມຄວາມເໝາະສົມ."

msgid "Clears the [member data_array] and resets the cursor."
msgstr "ລ້າງ [member data_array] ແລະ ຣີເຊັດເຄີເຊີ."

msgid ""
"Returns a new [StreamPeerBuffer] with the same [member data_array] content."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [StreamPeerBuffer] ໃໝ່ທີ່ມີເນື້ອໃນ [member data_array] ຄືກັນ."

msgid "Returns the current cursor position."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Returns the size of [member data_array]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດຂອງ [member data_array]."

msgid "Resizes the [member data_array]. This [i]doesn't[/i] update the cursor."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຂອງ [member data_array]. ສິ່ງນີ້ [i]ຈະບໍ່[/i] ອັບເດດເຄີເຊີ."

msgid ""
"Moves the cursor to the specified position. [param position] must be a valid "
"index of [member data_array]."
msgstr ""
"ຍ້າຍເຄີເຊີໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ລະບຸ. [param position] ຕ້ອງເປັນອິນເດັກ (index) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງ [member "
"data_array]."

msgid "The underlying data buffer. Setting this value resets the cursor."
msgstr "ບັບເຟີຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະຣີເຊັດເຄີເຊີ."

msgid "A stream peer that handles GZIP and deflate compression/decompression."
msgstr "Stream peer ທີ່ຈັດການການບີບອັດ ແລະ ການຄາຍການບີບອັດແບບ GZIP ແລະ deflate."

msgid ""
"This class allows to compress or decompress data using GZIP/deflate in a "
"streaming fashion. This is particularly useful when compressing or "
"decompressing files that have to be sent through the network without needing "
"to allocate them all in memory.\n"
"After starting the stream via [method start_compression] (or [method "
"start_decompression]), calling [method StreamPeer.put_partial_data] on this "
"stream will compress (or decompress) the data, writing it to the internal "
"buffer. Calling [method StreamPeer.get_available_bytes] will return the "
"pending bytes in the internal buffer, and [method "
"StreamPeer.get_partial_data] will retrieve the compressed (or decompressed) "
"bytes from it. When the stream is over, you must call [method finish] to "
"ensure the internal buffer is properly flushed (make sure to call [method "
"StreamPeer.get_available_bytes] on last time to check if more data needs to "
"be read after that)."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດນີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ບີບອັດ ຫຼື ຄາຍການບີບອັດຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍໃຊ້ GZIP/deflate ໃນຮູບແບບສະຕຣີມມິງ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໃນເວລາບີບອັດ ຫຼື ຄາຍການບີບອັດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຕ້ອງສົ່ງຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຈັດສັນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທັງໝົດ.\n"
"ຫຼັງຈາກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສະຕຣີມຜ່ານ [method start_compression] (ຫຼື [method "
"start_decompression]), ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method StreamPeer.put_partial_data] "
"ໃນສະຕຣີມນີ້ຈະບີບອັດ (ຫຼື ຄາຍການບີບອັດ) ຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຂຽນລົງໃນບັບເຟີພາຍໃນ. ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"StreamPeer.get_available_bytes] ຈະສົ່ງຄືນໄບຕ໌ທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ໃນບັບເຟີພາຍໃນ, ແລະ [method "
"StreamPeer.get_partial_data] ຈະດຶງເອົາໄບຕ໌ທີ່ບີບອັດ (ຫຼື ຄາຍການບີບອັດ) ອອກມາ. "
"ເມື່ອສິ້ນສຸດສະຕຣີມ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method finish] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າບັບເຟີພາຍໃນຖືກຈັດການຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ "
"(ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method StreamPeer.get_available_bytes] "
"ຄັ້ງສຸດທ້າຍເພື່ອທົດສອບວ່າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມຫຼືບໍ່)."

msgid "Clears this stream, resetting the internal state."
msgstr "ລ້າງສະຕຣີມນີ້ ແລະ ຣີເຊັດສະຖານະພາຍໃນ."

msgid ""
"Finalizes the stream, compressing any buffered chunk left.\n"
"You must call it only when you are compressing."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ສະຕຣີມສຳເລັດ, ໂດຍບີບອັດກຸ່ມຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຍັງເຫຼືອຢູ່ໃນບັບເຟີ.\n"
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ມັນເມື່ອເຈົ້າກຳລັງບີບອັດຂໍ້ມູນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Start the stream in compression mode with the given [param buffer_size], if "
"[param use_deflate] is [code]true[/code] uses deflate instead of GZIP."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສະຕຣີມໃນໂໝດບີບອັດດ້ວຍ [param buffer_size] ທີ່ກຳນົດ, ຖ້າ [param use_deflate] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ຈະໃຊ້ deflate ແທນ GZIP."

msgid ""
"Start the stream in decompression mode with the given [param buffer_size], if "
"[param use_deflate] is [code]true[/code] uses deflate instead of GZIP."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສະຕຣີມໃນໂໝດຄາຍການບີບອັດດ້ວຍ [param buffer_size] ທີ່ກຳນົດ, ຖ້າ [param "
"use_deflate] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຈະໃຊ້ deflate ແທນ GZIP."

msgid "Abstract base class for interacting with socket streams."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳ (Abstract base class) ສຳລັບການໂຕ້ຕອບກັບຊັອກເກັດສະຕຣີມ (socket "
"streams)."

msgid ""
"StreamPeerSocket is an abstract base class that defines common behavior for "
"socket-based streams."
msgstr ""
"StreamPeerSocket ແມ່ນຄລາດພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳທີ່ກຳນົດພຶດຕິກຳທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບສະຕຣີມທີ່ອີງໃສ່ຊັອກເກັດ."

msgid "Disconnects from host."
msgstr "ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກໂຮສ (host)."

msgid "Polls the socket, updating its state. See [method get_status]."
msgstr "ກວດສອບ (Poll) ຊັອກເກັດ ແລະ ອັບເດດສະຖານະຂອງມັນ. ເບິ່ງ [method get_status]."

msgid ""
"The initial status of the [StreamPeerSocket]. This is also the status after "
"disconnecting."
msgstr "ສະຖານະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [StreamPeerSocket]. ນີ້ຍັງແມ່ນສະຖານະຫຼັງຈາກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid "A status representing a [StreamPeerSocket] that is connecting to a host."
msgstr "ສະຖານະທີ່ສະແດງວ່າ [StreamPeerSocket] ກຳລັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບໂຮສ."

msgid "A status representing a [StreamPeerSocket] that is connected to a host."
msgstr "ສະຖານະທີ່ສະແດງວ່າ [StreamPeerSocket] ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບໂຮສແລ້ວ."

msgid "A status representing a [StreamPeerSocket] in error state."
msgstr "ສະຖານະທີ່ສະແດງວ່າ [StreamPeerSocket] ຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະຜິດພາດ."

msgid "A stream peer that handles TCP connections."
msgstr "Stream peer ທີ່ຈັດການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP."

msgid ""
"Opens the TCP socket, and binds it to the specified local address.\n"
"This method is generally not needed, and only used to force the subsequent "
"call to [method connect_to_host] to use the specified [param host] and [param "
"port] as source address. This can be desired in some NAT punchthrough "
"techniques, or when forcing the source network interface."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດຊັອກເກັດ TCP ແລະ ຜູກ (bind) ມັນເຂົ້າກັບທີ່ຢູ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວວິທີນີ້ແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ, ແລະ ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຫ້ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method connect_to_host] "
"ຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປໃຊ້ [param host] ແລະ [param port] ທີ່ລະບຸເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ຕົ້ນທາງ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະເປັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃນເຕັກນິກ NAT punchthrough ບາງຢ່າງ, ຫຼື "
"ເມື່ອບັງຄັບໃຊ້ອິນເຕີເຟສເຄືອຂ່າຍຕົ້ນທາງ."

msgid ""
"Connects to the specified [code]host:port[/code] pair. A hostname will be "
"resolved if valid. Returns [constant OK] on success."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຄູ່ [code]host:port[/code] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ຊື່ໂຮສຈະຖືກແປງເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ຖ້າຖືກຕ້ອງ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant "
"OK] ຫາກສຳເລັດ."

msgid "Returns the IP of this peer."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ IP ຂອງພີເຢີ (peer) ນີ້."

msgid "Returns the port of this peer."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນພອດ (port) ຂອງພີເຢີ (peer) ນີ້."

msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], packets will be sent immediately. If "
"[param enabled] is [code]false[/code] (the default), packet transfers will be "
"delayed and combined using [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Nagle%27s_algorithm]Nagle's algorithm[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It's recommended to leave this disabled for applications that "
"send large packets or need to transfer a lot of data, as enabling this can "
"decrease the total available bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແພັກເກັດ (packets) ຈະຖືກສົ່ງທັນທີ. ຖ້າ "
"[param enabled] ເປັນ [code]false[/code] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ການສົ່ງແພັກເກັດຈະຖືກຊ້າລົງ ແລະ "
"ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັນໂດຍໃຊ້ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Nagle%27s_algorithm]Nagle's algorithm[/url].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປິດໃຊ້ງານນີ້ໄວ້ສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ສົ່ງແພັກເກັດຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ ຫຼື "
"ຕ້ອງການໂອນຂໍ້ມູນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ເພາະການເປີດໃຊ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແບນວິດ (bandwidth) ທັງໝົດຫຼຸດລົງ."

msgid "A stream peer that handles TLS connections."
msgstr "Stream peer ທີ່ຈັດການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TLS."

msgid ""
"Accepts a peer connection as a server using the given [param server_options]. "
"See [method TLSOptions.server]."
msgstr ""
"ຍອມຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພີເຢີ (peer connection) ໃນຖານະເຊີບເວີໂດຍໃຊ້ [param server_options] "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ເບິ່ງ [method TLSOptions.server]."

msgid ""
"Connects to a peer using an underlying [StreamPeer] [param stream] and "
"verifying the remote certificate is correctly signed for the given [param "
"common_name]. You can pass the optional [param client_options] parameter to "
"customize the trusted certification authorities, or disable the common name "
"verification. See [method TLSOptions.client] and [method "
"TLSOptions.client_unsafe]."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບພີເຢີໂດຍໃຊ້ [StreamPeer] [param stream] ພື້ນຖານ ແລະ "
"ກວດສອບວ່າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໄລຍະໄກຖືກລົງລາຍເຊັນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບ [param common_name] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດສົ່ງພາຣາມິເຕີ [param client_options] ທີ່ເປັນທາງເລືອກເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງໜ່ວຍງານ "
"ອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື, ຫຼື ປິດການກວດສອບ common name. ເບິ່ງ [method TLSOptions.client] "
"ແລະ [method TLSOptions.client_unsafe]."

msgid ""
"Returns the underlying [StreamPeer] connection, used in [method "
"accept_stream] or [method connect_to_stream]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ [StreamPeer] ພື້ນຖານ, ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ [method accept_stream] ຫຼື [method "
"connect_to_stream]."

msgid ""
"Poll the connection to check for incoming bytes. Call this right before "
"[method StreamPeer.get_available_bytes] for it to work properly."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບ (Poll) ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເພື່ອເບິ່ງໄບຕ໌ຂາເຂົ້າ. ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ນີ້ກ່ອນ [method "
"StreamPeer.get_available_bytes] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "A status representing a [StreamPeerTLS] that is disconnected."
msgstr "ສະຖານະທີ່ສະແດງວ່າ [StreamPeerTLS] ຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid "A status representing a [StreamPeerTLS] during handshaking."
msgstr "ສະຖານະທີ່ສະແດງວ່າ [StreamPeerTLS] ຢູ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດ handshaking."

msgid "A status representing a [StreamPeerTLS] that is connected to a host."
msgstr "ສະຖານະທີ່ສະແດງວ່າ [StreamPeerTLS] ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບໂຮສແລ້ວ."

msgid "A status representing a [StreamPeerTLS] in error state."
msgstr "ສະຖານະທີ່ສະແດງວ່າ [StreamPeerTLS] ຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະຜິດພາດ."

msgid ""
"An error status that shows a mismatch in the TLS certificate domain presented "
"by the host and the domain requested for validation."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖານະຜິດພາດທີ່ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າໂດເມນໃນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS ທີ່ໂຮສສະເໜີມານັ້ນບໍ່ກົງກັບໂດເມນທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ກວດສອບ."

msgid "A stream peer that handles UNIX Domain Socket (UDS) connections."
msgstr "Stream peer ທີ່ຈັດການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ UNIX Domain Socket (UDS)."

msgid ""
"A stream peer that handles UNIX Domain Socket (UDS) connections. This object "
"can be used to connect to UDS servers, or also is returned by a UDS server. "
"Unix Domain Sockets provide inter-process communication on the same machine "
"using the filesystem namespace.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] UNIX Domain Sockets are only available on UNIX-like systems "
"(Linux, macOS, etc.) and are not supported on Windows."
msgstr ""
"Stream peer ທີ່ຈັດການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ UNIX Domain Socket (UDS). ວັດຖຸນີ້ນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີບເວີ "
"UDS, ຫຼື ຖືກສົ່ງຄືນໂດຍ ເຊີບເວີ UDS. Unix Domain Sockets ໃຫ້ການສື່ສານລະຫວ່າງໂປຣເຊສ (inter-"
"process communication) ໃນເຄື່ອງດຽວກັນ ໂດຍໃຊ້ filesystem namespace.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] UNIX Domain Sockets ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນລະບົບທີ່ຄ້າຍຄື UNIX (Linux, macOS, "
"ແລະອື່ນໆ) ແລະ ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ Windows."

msgid ""
"Opens the UDS socket, and binds it to the specified socket path.\n"
"This method is generally not needed, and only used to force the subsequent "
"call to [method connect_to_host] to use the specified [param path] as the "
"source address."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດຊັອກເກັດ UDS ແລະ ຜູກ (bind) ມັນເຂົ້າກັບເສັ້ນທາງຊັອກເກັດທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວວິທີນີ້ແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ, ແລະ ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຫ້ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method connect_to_host] "
"ຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປໃຊ້ [param path] ທີ່ລະບຸເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ຕົ້ນທາງ."

msgid ""
"Connects to the specified UNIX Domain Socket path. Returns [constant OK] on "
"success."
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເສັ້ນທາງ UNIX Domain Socket ທີ່ລະບຸ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant OK] ຫາກສຳເລັດ."

msgid "Returns the socket path of this peer."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງຊັອກເກັດຂອງພີເຢີ (peer) ນີ້."

msgid "A built-in type for strings."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນໃນຕົວ (built-in type) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ (strings)."

msgid ""
"This is the built-in string Variant type (and the one used by GDScript). "
"Strings may contain any number of Unicode characters, and expose methods "
"useful for manipulating and generating strings. Strings are reference-counted "
"and use a copy-on-write approach (every modification to a string returns a "
"new [String]), so passing them around is cheap in resources.\n"
"Some string methods have corresponding variations. Variations suffixed with "
"[code]n[/code] ([method countn], [method findn], [method replacen], etc.) are "
"[b]case-insensitive[/b] (they make no distinction between uppercase and "
"lowercase letters). Method variations prefixed with [code]r[/code] ([method "
"rfind], [method rsplit], etc.) are reversed, and start from the end of the "
"string, instead of the beginning.\n"
"To convert any [Variant] to or from a string, see [method @GlobalScope.str], "
"[method @GlobalScope.str_to_var], and [method @GlobalScope.var_to_str].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a string will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if it is empty ([code]\"\"[/code]). Otherwise, a string will always "
"evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນປະເພດ Variant ຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນຕົວ (ແລະ ແມ່ນອັນທີ່ GDScript ໃຊ້). "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມອາດຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ຈຳນວນໃດກໍໄດ້, ແລະ ມີເມທອດທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຈັດການ "
"ແລະ ສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຂໍ້ຄວາມຖືກນັບການອ້າງອີງ (reference-counted) ແລະ ໃຊ້ວິທີການ copy-on-write "
"(ທຸກໆການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [String] ໃໝ່), ດັ່ງນັ້ນການສົ່ງພວກມັນໄປມາຈຶ່ງໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນໜ້ອຍ.\n"
"ບາງເມທອດຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມມີຮູບແບບທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ຮູບແບບທີ່ລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ [code]n[/code] ([method "
"countn], [method findn], [method replacen], ແລະອື່ນໆ) ແມ່ນ [b]ບໍ່ສົນໃຈຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ພິມນ້ອຍ[/"
"b] (ພວກມັນບໍ່ແບ່ງແຍກລະຫວ່າງຕົວອັກສອນພິມໃຫຍ່ ແລະ ພິມນ້ອຍ). ເມທອດທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [code]r[/code] "
"([method rfind], [method rsplit], ແລະອື່ນໆ) ຈະເຮັດວຽກແບບຍ້ອນກັບ, ແລະ "
"ເລີ່ມຈາກທ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"ເພື່ອແປງ [Variant] ໃດໜຶ່ງໄປເປັນ ຫຼື ມາຈາກຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ເບິ່ງ [method @GlobalScope.str], "
"[method @GlobalScope.str_to_var], ແລະ [method @GlobalScope.var_to_str].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງບູລີນ (boolean), ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ຖ້າມັນວ່າງເປົ່າ ([code]\"\"[/code]). ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid "GDScript format strings"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມຮູບແບບ (format strings) ຂອງ GDScript"

msgid "Constructs an empty [String] ([code]\"\"[/code])."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [String] ວ່າງເປົ່າ ([code]\"\"[/code])."

msgid "Constructs a [String] as a copy of the given [String]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [String] ທີ່ເປັນການສຳເນົາຈາກ [String] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Constructs a new [String] from the given [NodePath]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [String] ໃໝ່ຈາກ [NodePath] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Constructs a new [String] from the given [StringName]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [String] ໃໝ່ຈາກ [StringName] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the string begins with the given [param text]. "
"See also [method ends_with]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [param text] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"ends_with] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns an array containing the bigrams (pairs of consecutive characters) of "
"this string.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"Get up!\".bigrams()) # Prints [\"Ge\", \"et\", \"t \", \" u\", "
"\"up\", \"p!\"]\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍ bigrams (ຄູ່ຂອງຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຢູ່ຕິດກັນ) ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"Get up!\".bigrams()) # ຈະສະແດງ [\"Ge\", \"et\", \"t \", \" u\", "
"\"up\", \"p!\"]\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Converts the string representing a binary number into an [int]. The string "
"may optionally be prefixed with [code]\"0b\"[/code], and an additional [code]-"
"[/code] prefix for negative numbers.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(\"101\".bin_to_int())   # Prints 5\n"
"print(\"0b101\".bin_to_int()) # Prints 5\n"
"print(\"-0b10\".bin_to_int()) # Prints -2\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(\"101\".BinToInt());   // Prints 5\n"
"GD.Print(\"0b101\".BinToInt()); // Prints 5\n"
"GD.Print(\"-0b10\".BinToInt()); // Prints -2\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ແປງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງເລກຖານສອງໃຫ້ເປັນ [int]. ຂໍ້ຄວາມອາດຈະມີ [code]\"0b\"[/code] "
"ຢູ່ທາງໜ້າ, ແລະ ມີ [code]-[/code] ຢູ່ທາງໜ້າສຳລັບເລກລົບ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(\"101\".bin_to_int())   # ສະແດງ 5\n"
"print(\"0b101\".bin_to_int()) # ສະແດງ 5\n"
"print(\"-0b10\".bin_to_int()) # ສະແດງ -2\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(\"101\".BinToInt());   // ສະແດງ 5\n"
"GD.Print(\"0b101\".BinToInt()); // ສະແດງ 5\n"
"GD.Print(\"-0b10\".BinToInt()); // ສະແດງ -2\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with special characters escaped using the C "
"language standard."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນການສຳເນົາຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຕົວອັກສອນພິເສດທີ່ຖືກ escaped ໂດຍໃຊ້ສິດຕາຕະລາງພາສາ C."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with escaped characters replaced by their "
"meanings. Supported escape sequences are [code]\\'[/code], [code]\\\"[/code], "
"[code]\\\\[/code], [code]\\a[/code], [code]\\b[/code], [code]\\f[/code], "
"[code]\\n[/code], [code]\\r[/code], [code]\\t[/code], [code]\\v[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike the GDScript parser, this method doesn't support the "
"[code]\\uXXXX[/code] escape sequence."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການສຳເນົາຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຕົວອັກສອນ escaped ຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍຄວາມໝາຍຂອງມັນ. ລຳດັບການ escape "
"ທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນ [code]\\'[/code], [code]\\\"[/code], [code]\\\\[/code], [code]\\a[/"
"code], [code]\\b[/code], [code]\\f[/code], [code]\\n[/code], [code]\\r[/"
"code], [code]\\t[/code], [code]\\v[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ່າງຈາກຕົວແປ (parser) ຂອງ GDScript, ເມທອດນີ້ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບລຳດັບການ escape "
"[code]\\uXXXX[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with changed appearance. Replaces underscores "
"([code]_[/code]) and hyphens ([code]-[/code]) with spaces, adds spaces before "
"uppercase letters in the middle of a word, converts all letters to lowercase, "
"then converts the first one and each one following a space to uppercase.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"\"move_local_x\".capitalize()   # Returns \"Move Local X\"\n"
"\"sceneFile_path\".capitalize() # Returns \"Scene File Path\"\n"
"\"2D, FPS, PNG\".capitalize()   # Returns \"2d, Fps, Png\"\n"
"\"example-name\".capitalize()   # Returns \"Example Name\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"\"move_local_x\".Capitalize();   // Returns \"Move Local X\"\n"
"\"sceneFile_path\".Capitalize(); // Returns \"Scene File Path\"\n"
"\"2D, FPS, PNG\".Capitalize();   // Returns \"2d, Fps, Png\"\n"
"\"example-name\".Capitalize();   // Returns \"Example Name\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການສຳເນົາຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຮູບລັກສະນະ. ແທນທີ່ຂີດກ້ອງ ([code]_[/code]) ແລະ "
"ເຄື່ອງໝາຍລົບ ([code]-[/code]) ດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງ, ເເພີ່ມຍະຫວ່າງກ່ອນຕົວອັກສອນພິມໃຫຍ່ທີ່ຢູ່ກາງຄຳສັບ, "
"ແປງຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດເປັນຕົວພິມນ້ອຍ, ຈາກນັ້ນແປງຕົວອັກສອນທຳອິດ ແລະ "
"ຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຕາມຫຼັງຍະຫວ່າງໃຫ້ເປັນຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"\"move_local_x\".capitalize()   # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"Move Local X\"\n"
"\"sceneFile_path\".capitalize() # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"Scene File Path\"\n"
"\"2D, FPS, PNG\".capitalize()   # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"2d, Fps, Png\"\n"
"\"example-name\".capitalize()   # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"Example Name\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"\"move_local_x\".Capitalize();   // ສົ່ງຄືນ \"Move Local X\"\n"
"\"sceneFile_path\".Capitalize(); // ສົ່ງຄືນ \"Scene File Path\"\n"
"\"2D, FPS, PNG\".Capitalize();   // ສົ່ງຄືນ \"2d, Fps, Png\"\n"
"\"example-name\".Capitalize();   // ສົ່ງຄືນ \"Example Name\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Performs a case-sensitive comparison to another string. Returns [code]-1[/"
"code] if less than, [code]1[/code] if greater than, or [code]0[/code] if "
"equal. \"Less than\" and \"greater than\" are determined by the [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode code points[/url] of "
"each string, which roughly matches the alphabetical order.\n"
"If the character comparison reaches the end of one string, but the other "
"string contains more characters, then it will use length as the deciding "
"factor: [code]1[/code] will be returned if this string is longer than the "
"[param to] string, or [code]-1[/code] if shorter. Note that the length of "
"empty strings is always [code]0[/code].\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method nocasecmp_to], [method filecasecmp_to], "
"and [method naturalcasecmp_to]."
msgstr ""
"ດຳເນີນການປຽບທຽບແບບສົນໃຈຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ພິມນ້ອຍກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມອື່ນ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]-1[/code] ຖ້ານ້ອຍກວ່າ, "
"[code]1[/code] ຖ້າໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ, ຫຼື [code]0[/code] ຖ້າເທົ່າກັນ. \"ນ້ອຍກວ່າ\" ແລະ \"ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ\" "
"ແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode code points[/url] ຂອງແຕ່ລະຂໍ້ຄວາມ, "
"ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບລຳດັບຕົວອັກສອນໂດຍປະມານ.\n"
"ຖ້າການປຽບທຽບຕົວອັກສອນໄປຮອດທ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມໜຶ່ງ, ແຕ່ອີກຂໍ້ຄວາມໜຶ່ງມີຕົວອັກສອນຫຼາຍກວ່າ, "
"ມັນຈະໃຊ້ຄວາມຍາວເປັນຕົວຕັດສິນ: [code]1[/code] ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ຍາວກວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມ [param "
"to], ຫຼື [code]-1[/code] ຖ້າສັ້ນກວ່າ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຄວາມຍາວຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງເປົ່າແມ່ນ [code]0[/"
"code] ສະເໝີ.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັດເປັນ [bool] ຈາກການປຽບທຽບຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການ [code]==[/code] ແທນ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method nocasecmp_to], [method filecasecmp_to], ແລະ [method "
"naturalcasecmp_to] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns a single Unicode character from the integer [param code]. You may use "
"[url=https://unicodelookup.com/]unicodelookup.com[/url] or [url=https://"
"www.unicode.org/charts/]unicode.org[/url] as points of reference.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(String.chr(65))     # Prints \"A\"\n"
"print(String.chr(129302)) # Prints \"🤖\" (robot face emoji)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also [method unicode_at], [method @GDScript.char], and [method "
"@GDScript.ord]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ຕົວດຽວຈາກເລກຖ້ວນ [param code]. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ [url=https://"
"unicodelookup.com/]unicodelookup.com[/url] ຫຼື [url=https://www.unicode.org/"
"charts/]unicode.org[/url] ເປັນບ່ອນອ້າງອີງ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(String.chr(65))     # ສະແດງ \"A\"\n"
"print(String.chr(129302)) # ສະແດງ \"🤖\" (ອີໂມຈິໜ້າໂຣບອດ)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method unicode_at], [method @GDScript.char], ແລະ [method @GDScript.ord] "
"ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the string contains [param what]. In GDScript, "
"this corresponds to the [code]in[/code] operator.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(\"Node\".contains(\"de\")) # Prints true\n"
"print(\"team\".contains(\"I\"))  # Prints false\n"
"print(\"I\" in \"team\")         # Prints false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(\"Node\".Contains(\"de\")); // Prints True\n"
"GD.Print(\"team\".Contains(\"I\"));  // Prints False\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"If you need to know where [param what] is within the string, use [method "
"find]. See also [method containsn]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມມີ [param what] ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ. ໃນ GDScript, "
"ນີ້ກົງກັບຕົວດຳເນີນການ [code]in[/code].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(\"Node\".contains(\"de\")) # ສະແດງ true\n"
"print(\"team\".contains(\"I\"))  # ສະແງ false\n"
"print(\"I\" in \"team\")         # ສະແດງ false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(\"Node\".Contains(\"de\")); // ສະແດງ True\n"
"GD.Print(\"team\".Contains(\"I\"));  // ສະແດງ False\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຮູ້ວ່າ [param what] ຢູ່ໃສພາຍໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method find]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"containsn] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the string contains [param what], [b]ignoring "
"case[/b].\n"
"If you need to know where [param what] is within the string, use [method "
"findn]. See also [method contains]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມມີ [param what] ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ, ໂດຍ "
"[b]ບໍ່ສົນໃຈຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ພິມນ້ອຍ[/b].\n"
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຮູ້ວ່າ [param what] ຢູ່ໃສພາຍໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method findn]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"contains] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of occurrences of the substring [param what] between "
"[param from] and [param to] positions. If [param to] is 0, the search "
"continues until the end of the string."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມຍ່ອຍ [param what] ປະກົດຂຶ້ນລະຫວ່າງຕຳແໜ່ງ [param from] ແລະ [param "
"to]. ຖ້າ [param to] ແມ່ນ 0, ການຄົ້ນຫາຈະດຳເນີນຕໍ່ໄປຈົນເຖິງທ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of occurrences of the substring [param what] between "
"[param from] and [param to] positions, [b]ignoring case[/b]. If [param to] is "
"0, the search continues until the end of the string."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມຍ່ອຍ [param what] ປະກົດຂຶ້ນລະຫວ່າງຕຳແໜ່ງ [param from] ແລະ [param "
"to], ໂດຍ [b]ບໍ່ສົນໃຈຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ພິມນ້ອຍ[/b]. ຖ້າ [param to] ແມ່ນ 0, "
"ການຄົ້ນຫາຈະດຳເນີນຕໍ່ໄປຈົນເຖິງທ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with indentation (leading tabs and spaces) "
"removed. See also [method indent] to add indentation."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການສຳເນົາຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກລຶບການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ (ແທັບ ແລະ ຍະຫວ່າງທາງໜ້າ) ອອກ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"indent] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the string ends with the given [param text]. See "
"also [method begins_with]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ [param text] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"begins_with] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns a string with [param chars] characters erased starting from [param "
"position]. If [param chars] goes beyond the string's length given the "
"specified [param position], fewer characters will be erased from the returned "
"string. Returns an empty string if either [param position] or [param chars] "
"is negative. Returns the original string unmodified if [param chars] is "
"[code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກລຶບຕົວອັກສອນ [param chars] ຕົວ ໂດຍເລີ່ມຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງ [param position]. ຖ້າ "
"[param chars] ຍາວເກີນຄວາມຍາວຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກ [param position] ທີ່ລະບຸ, "
"ຕົວອັກສອນຈະຖືກລຶບອອກເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້. ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງເປົ່າຖ້າ [param position] ຫຼື [param "
"chars] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ. ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມເດີມໂດຍບໍ່ມີການແກ້ໄຂຖ້າ [param chars] ແມ່ນ [code]0[/code]."

msgid ""
"Like [method naturalcasecmp_to] but prioritizes strings that begin with "
"periods ([code].[/code]) and underscores ([code]_[/code]) before any other "
"character. Useful when sorting folders or file names.\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method filenocasecmp_to], [method "
"naturalcasecmp_to], and [method casecmp_to]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [method naturalcasecmp_to] ແຕ່ຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມສຳຄັນກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ ([code].[/"
"code]) ແລະ ຂີດກ້ອງ ([code]_[/code]) ກ່ອນຕົວອັກສອນອື່ນໆ. ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນເວລາຈັດລຽງໂຟນເດີ ຫຼື "
"ຊື່ໄຟລ໌.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັດເປັນ [bool] ຈາກການປຽບທຽບຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການ [code]==[/code] ແທນ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method filenocasecmp_to], [method naturalcasecmp_to], ແລະ [method "
"casecmp_to] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Like [method naturalnocasecmp_to] but prioritizes strings that begin with "
"periods ([code].[/code]) and underscores ([code]_[/code]) before any other "
"character. Useful when sorting folders or file names.\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method filecasecmp_to], [method "
"naturalnocasecmp_to], and [method nocasecmp_to]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [method naturalnocasecmp_to] ແຕ່ຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມສຳຄັນກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ ([code].[/"
"code]) ແລະ ຂີດກ້ອງ ([code]_[/code]) ກ່ອນຕົວອັກສອນອື່ນໆ. ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນເວລາຈັດລຽງໂຟນເດີ ຫຼື "
"ຊື່ໄຟລ໌.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັດເປັນ [bool] ຈາກການປຽບທຽບຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການ [code]==[/code] ແທນ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method filecasecmp_to], [method naturalnocasecmp_to], ແລະ [method "
"nocasecmp_to] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [b]first[/b] occurrence of [param what] in this "
"string, or [code]-1[/code] if there are none. The search's start can be "
"specified with [param from], continuing to the end of the string.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(\"Team\".find(\"I\")) # Prints -1\n"
"\n"
"print(\"Potato\".find(\"t\"))    # Prints 2\n"
"print(\"Potato\".find(\"t\", 3)) # Prints 4\n"
"print(\"Potato\".find(\"t\", 5)) # Prints -1\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(\"Team\".Find(\"I\")); // Prints -1\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(\"Potato\".Find(\"t\"));    // Prints 2\n"
"GD.Print(\"Potato\".Find(\"t\", 3)); // Prints 4\n"
"GD.Print(\"Potato\".Find(\"t\", 5)); // Prints -1\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you just want to know whether the string contains [param "
"what], use [method contains]. In GDScript, you may also use the [code]in[/"
"code] operator.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A negative value of [param from] is converted to a starting "
"index by counting back from the last possible index with enough space to find "
"[param what]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອິນເດັກ (index) ຂອງການປະກົດຕົວ [b]ຄັ້ງທຳອິດ[/b] ຂອງ [param what] ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້, ຫຼື "
"[code]-1[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ. ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງການຄົ້ນຫາສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [param from], ແລະ "
"ຈະດຳເນີນຕໍ່ໄປຈົນເຖິງທ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(\"Team\".find(\"I\")) # ສະແດງ -1\n"
"\n"
"print(\"Potato\".find(\"t\"))    # ສະແດງ 2\n"
"print(\"Potato\".find(\"t\", 3)) # ສະແດງ 4\n"
"print(\"Potato\".find(\"t\", 5)) # ສະແດງ -1\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(\"Team\".Find(\"I\")); // ສະແດງ -1\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(\"Potato\".Find(\"t\"));    // ສະແດງ 2\n"
"GD.Print(\"Potato\".Find(\"t\", 3)); // ສະແດງ 4\n"
"GD.Print(\"Potato\".Find(\"t\", 5)); // ສະແດງ -1\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າເຈົ້າພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງການຮູ້ວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມມີ [param what] ຢູ່ພາຍໃນຫຼືບໍ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"contains]. ໃນ GDScript, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການ [code]in[/code] ໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າລົບຂອງ [param from] "
"ຈະຖືກແປງເປັນອິນເດັກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການນັບຖອຍຫຼັງຈາກອິນເດັກສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງມີພື້ນທີ່ພຽງພໍທີ່ຈະຊອກຫາ "
"[param what]."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [b]first[/b] [b]case-insensitive[/b] occurrence of "
"[param what] in this string, or [code]-1[/code] if there are none. The "
"starting search index can be specified with [param from], continuing to the "
"end of the string."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອິນເດັກ (index) ຂອງການປະກົດຕົວ [b]ຄັ້ງທຳອິດ[/b] ໂດຍ [b]ບໍ່ສົນໃຈຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ພິມນ້ອຍ[/b] ຂອງ "
"[param what] ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້, ຫຼື [code]-1[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ. "
"ອິນເດັກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງການຄົ້ນຫາສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [param from], ແລະ ຈະດຳເນີນຕໍ່ໄປຈົນເຖິງທ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Formats the string by replacing all occurrences of [param placeholder] with "
"the elements of [param values].\n"
"[param values] can be a [Dictionary], an [Array], or an [Object]. Any "
"underscores in [param placeholder] will be replaced with the corresponding "
"keys in advance. Array elements use their index as keys.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Prints \"Waiting for Godot is a play by Samuel Beckett, and Godot Engine is "
"named after it.\"\n"
"var use_array_values = \"Waiting for {0} is a play by {1}, and {0} Engine is "
"named after it.\"\n"
"print(use_array_values.format([\"Godot\", \"Samuel Beckett\"]))\n"
"\n"
"# Prints \"User 42 is Godot.\"\n"
"print(\"User {id} is {name}.\".format({\"id\": 42, \"name\": \"Godot\"}))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Some additional handling is performed when [param values] is an [Array]. If "
"[param placeholder] does not contain an underscore, the elements of the "
"[param values] array will be used to replace one occurrence of the "
"placeholder in order; If an element of [param values] is another 2-element "
"array, it'll be interpreted as a key-value pair.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Prints \"User 42 is Godot.\"\n"
"print(\"User {} is {}.\".format([42, \"Godot\"], \"{}\"))\n"
"print(\"User {id} is {name}.\".format([[\"id\", 42], [\"name\", "
"\"Godot\"]]))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"When passing an [Object], the property names from [method "
"Object.get_property_list] are used as keys.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Prints \"Visible true, position (0, 0)\"\n"
"var node = Node2D.new()\n"
"print(\"Visible {visible}, position {position}\".format(node))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/"
"gdscript_format_string.html]GDScript format string[/url] tutorial.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Each replacement is done sequentially for each element of [param "
"values], [b]not[/b] all at once. This means that if any element is inserted "
"and it contains another placeholder, it may be changed by the next "
"replacement. While this can be very useful, it often causes unexpected "
"results. If not necessary, make sure [param values]'s elements do not contain "
"placeholders.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"{0} {1}\".format([\"{1}\", \"x\"]))           # Prints \"x x\"\n"
"print(\"{0} {1}\".format([\"x\", \"{0}\"]))           # Prints \"x {0}\"\n"
"print(\"{a} {b}\".format({\"a\": \"{b}\", \"b\": \"c\"})) # Prints \"c c\"\n"
"print(\"{a} {b}\".format({\"b\": \"c\", \"a\": \"{b}\"})) # Prints \"{b} c\"\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, it's recommended to [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/tokens/interpolated]interpolate strings "
"with \"$\"[/url], instead."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍການແທນທີ່ທຸກບ່ອນທີ່ [param placeholder] ປະກົດຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍອົງປະກອບຂອງ [param "
"values].\n"
"[param values] ສາມາດເປັນ [Dictionary], [Array], ຫຼື [Object]. ຂີດກ້ອງໃດໆໃນ [param "
"placeholder] ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍຄີ (keys) ທີ່ກົງກັນລ່ວງໜ້າ. "
"ອົງປະກອບອາເຣຈະໃຊ້ອິນເດັກຂອງພວກມັນເປັນຄີ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# ສະແດງ \"Waiting for Godot is a play by Samuel Beckett, and Godot Engine is "
"named after it.\"\n"
"var use_array_values = \"Waiting for {0} is a play by {1}, and {0} Engine is "
"named after it.\"\n"
"print(use_array_values.format([\"Godot\", \"Samuel Beckett\"]))\n"
"\n"
"# ສະແດງ \"User 42 is Godot.\"\n"
"print(\"User {id} is {name}.\".format({\"id\": 42, \"name\": \"Godot\"}))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ມີການຈັດການເພີ່ມເຕີມບາງຢ່າງເມື່ອ [param values] ເປັນ [Array]. ຖ້າ [param placeholder] "
"ບໍ່ມີຂີດກ້ອງ, ອົງປະກອບຂອງອາເຣ [param values] ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອແທນທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງຕົວຈອງ (placeholder) "
"ຕາມລຳດັບ; ຖ້າອົງປະກອບຂອງ [param values] ເປັນອາເຣອື່ນທີ່ມີ 2 ອົງປະກອບ, "
"ມັນຈະຖືກຕີຄວາມໝາຍວ່າເປັນຄູ່ຄີ-ຄ່າ (key-value pair).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# ສະແດງ \"User 42 is Godot.\"\n"
"print(\"User {} is {}.\".format([42, \"Godot\"], \"{}\"))\n"
"print(\"User {id} is {name}.\".format([[\"id\", 42], [\"name\", "
"\"Godot\"]]))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເມື່ອສົ່ງ [Object], ຊື່ຄຸນສົມບັດ (property names) ຈາກ [method "
"Object.get_property_list] ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຄີ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# ສະແດງ \"Visible true, position (0, 0)\"\n"
"var node = Node2D.new()\n"
"print(\"Visible {visible}, position {position}\".format(node))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເບິ່ງບົດຮຽນ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/"
"gdscript_format_string.html]GDScript format string[/url] ປະກອບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຕ່ລະການແທນທີ່ແມ່ນເຮັດຕາມລຳດັບສຳລັບແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບຂອງ [param values], "
"[b]ບໍ່ແມ່ນ[/b] ເຮັດທັງໝົດພ້ອມກັນ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຖ້າອົງປະກອບໃດໜຶ່ງຖືກແຊກເຂົ້າມາ ແລະ "
"ມັນມີຕົວຈອງອື່ນຢູ່ພາຍໃນ, ມັນອາດຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍການແທນທີ່ຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ. ເຖິງວ່ານີ້ຈະມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍ, "
"ແຕ່ມັນກໍມັກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຜົນລັດທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ. ຖ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າອົງປະກອບຂອງ [param values] "
"ບໍ່ມີຕົວຈອງ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"{0} {1}\".format([\"{1}\", \"x\"]))           # ສະແດງ \"x x\"\n"
"print(\"{0} {1}\".format([\"x\", \"{0}\"]))           # ສະແດງ \"x {0}\"\n"
"print(\"{a} {b}\".format({\"a\": \"{b}\", \"b\": \"c\"})) # ສະແດງ \"c c\"\n"
"print(\"{a} {b}\".format({\"b\": \"c\", \"a\": \"{b}\"})) # ສະແດງ \"{b} c\"\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ C#, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/"
"csharp/language-reference/tokens/interpolated]ການແຊກຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍ \"$\"[/url] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"If the string is a valid file path, returns the base directory name.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var dir_path = \"/path/to/file.txt\".get_base_dir() # dir_path is \"/path/"
"to\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີພື້ນຖານ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var dir_path = \"/path/to/file.txt\".get_base_dir() # dir_path ແມ່ນ \"/path/"
"to\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"If the string is a valid file path, returns the full file path, without the "
"extension.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var base = \"/path/to/file.txt\".get_basename() # base is \"/path/to/file\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ເຕັມ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີນາມສະກຸນ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var base = \"/path/to/file.txt\".get_basename() # base ແມ່ນ \"/path/to/file\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"If the string is a valid file name or path, returns the file extension "
"without the leading period ([code].[/code]). Otherwise, returns an empty "
"string.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = \"/path/to/file.txt\".get_extension() # a is \"txt\"\n"
"var b = \"cool.txt\".get_extension()          # b is \"txt\"\n"
"var c = \"cool.font.tres\".get_extension()    # c is \"tres\"\n"
"var d = \".pack1\".get_extension()            # d is \"pack1\"\n"
"\n"
"var e = \"file.txt.\".get_extension()  # e is \"\"\n"
"var f = \"file.txt..\".get_extension() # f is \"\"\n"
"var g = \"txt\".get_extension()        # g is \"\"\n"
"var h = \"\".get_extension()           # h is \"\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຈຸດ ([code].[/code]) "
"ທາງໜ້າ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = \"/path/to/file.txt\".get_extension() # a ແມ່ນ \"txt\"\n"
"var b = \"cool.txt\".get_extension()          # b ແມ່ນ \"txt\"\n"
"var c = \"cool.font.tres\".get_extension()    # c ແມ່ນ \"tres\"\n"
"var d = \".pack1\".get_extension()            # d ແມ່ນ \"pack1\"\n"
"\n"
"var e = \"file.txt.\".get_extension()  # e ແມ່ນ \"\"\n"
"var f = \"file.txt..\".get_extension() # f ແມ່ນ \"\"\n"
"var g = \"txt\".get_extension()        # g ແມ່ນ \"\"\n"
"var h = \"\".get_extension()           # h ແມ່ນ \"\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"If the string is a valid file path, returns the file name, including the "
"extension.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var file = \"/path/to/icon.png\".get_file() # file is \"icon.png\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ລວມທັງນາມສະກຸນ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var file = \"/path/to/icon.png\".get_file() # file ແມ່ນ \"icon.png\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Splits the string using a [param delimiter] and returns the substring at "
"index [param slice]. Returns the original string if [param delimiter] does "
"not occur in the string. Returns an empty string if the [param slice] does "
"not exist.\n"
"This is faster than [method split], if you only need one or two substrings.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"i/am/example/hi\".get_slice(\"/\", 2)) # Prints \"example\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ແຍກຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍໃຊ້ [param delimiter] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມຍ່ອຍຢູ່ທີ່ດັດສະນີ [param slice]. "
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມເດີມຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param delimiter] ຢູ່ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param slice].\n"
"ອັນນີ້ໄວກວ່າ [method split] ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການພຽງແຕ່ໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ສອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຍ່ອຍ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"i/am/example/hi\".get_slice(\"/\", 2)) # ຈະພິມອອກມາວ່າ \"example\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the total number of slices when the string is split with the given "
"[param delimiter] (see [method split]).\n"
"Use [method get_slice] to extract a specific slice.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"i/am/example/string\".get_slice_count(\"/\")) # Prints '4'.\n"
"print(\"i am example string\".get_slice_count(\"/\")) # Prints '1'.\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຕ່ອນ (slices) ທັງໝົດເມື່ອແຍກຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍ [param delimiter] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ (ເບິ່ງ "
"[method split]).\n"
"ໃຊ້ [method get_slice] ເພື່ອດຶງເອົາຕ່ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"i/am/example/string\".get_slice_count(\"/\")) # ຈະພິມອອກມາວ່າ '4'.\n"
"print(\"i am example string\".get_slice_count(\"/\")) # ຈະພິມອອກມາວ່າ '1'.\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Splits the string using a Unicode character with code [param delimiter] and "
"returns the substring at index [param slice]. Returns an empty string if the "
"[param slice] does not exist.\n"
"This is faster than [method split], if you only need one or two substrings.\n"
"This is a Unicode version of [method get_slice]."
msgstr ""
"ແຍກຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ທີ່ມີລະຫັດ [param delimiter] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມຍ່ອຍຢູ່ທີ່ດັດສະນີ "
"[param slice]. ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param slice].\n"
"ອັນນີ້ໄວກວ່າ [method split] ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການພຽງແຕ່ໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ສອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຍ່ອຍ.\n"
"ອັນນີ້ແມ່ນເວີຊັນ Unicode ຂອງ [method get_slice]."

msgid ""
"Returns the 32-bit hash value representing the string's contents.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Strings with equal hash values are [i]not[/i] guaranteed to be "
"the same, as a result of hash collisions. On the contrary, strings with "
"different hash values are guaranteed to be different."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າແຮຊ (hash) 32-bit ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງເນື້ອໃນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຄ່າແຮຊເທົ່າກັນ [i]ບໍ່[/i] ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມດຽວກັນ "
"ເພາະອາດເກີດການຕຳກັນຂອງແຮຊ (hash collisions). ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຄ່າແຮຊຕ່າງກັນ "
"ແມ່ນຮັບປະກັນວ່າແຕກຕ່າງກັນແນ່ນອນ."

msgid ""
"Decodes a hexadecimal string as a [PackedByteArray].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var text = \"hello world\"\n"
"var encoded = text.to_utf8_buffer().hex_encode() # outputs "
"\"68656c6c6f20776f726c64\"\n"
"print(encoded.hex_decode().get_string_from_utf8())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var text = \"hello world\";\n"
"var encoded = text.ToUtf8Buffer().HexEncode(); // outputs "
"\"68656c6c6f20776f726c64\"\n"
"GD.Print(encoded.HexDecode().GetStringFromUtf8());\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຖອດລະຫັດຂໍ້ຄວາມເລກຖານສິບຫົກໃຫ້ເປັນ [PackedByteArray].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var text = \"hello world\"\n"
"var encoded = text.to_utf8_buffer().hex_encode() # ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ "
"\"68656c6c6f20776f726c64\"\n"
"print(encoded.hex_decode().get_string_from_utf8())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var text = \"hello world\";\n"
"var encoded = text.ToUtf8Buffer().HexEncode(); // ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ "
"\"68656c6c6f20776f726c64\"\n"
"GD.Print(encoded.HexDecode().GetStringFromUtf8());\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Converts the string representing a hexadecimal number into an [int]. The "
"string may be optionally prefixed with [code]\"0x\"[/code], and an additional "
"[code]-[/code] prefix for negative numbers.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(\"0xff\".hex_to_int()) # Prints 255\n"
"print(\"ab\".hex_to_int())   # Prints 171\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(\"0xff\".HexToInt()); // Prints 255\n"
"GD.Print(\"ab\".HexToInt());   // Prints 171\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ແປງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງເລກຖານສິບຫົກໃຫ້ເປັນ [int]. ຂໍ້ຄວາມສາມາດໃສ່ຄຳນຳໜ້າ [code]\"0x\"[/"
"code] ໄດ້, ແລະ ສາມາດໃສ່ [code]-[/code] ທາງໜ້າສຳລັບເລກລົບ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(\"0xff\".hex_to_int()) # ພິມ 255\n"
"print(\"ab\".hex_to_int())   # ພິມ 171\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(\"0xff\".HexToInt()); // ພິມ 255\n"
"GD.Print(\"ab\".HexToInt());   // ພິມ 171\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Converts [param size] which represents a number of bytes into a human-"
"readable form.\n"
"The result is in [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Binary_prefix#IEC_prefixes]IEC prefix format[/url], which may end in either "
"[code]\"B\"[/code], [code]\"KiB\"[/code], [code]\"MiB\"[/code], [code]"
"\"GiB\"[/code], [code]\"TiB\"[/code], [code]\"PiB\"[/code], or [code]\"EiB\"[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ແປງ [param size] ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ມະນຸດອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້.\n"
"ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະຢູ່ໃນ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Binary_prefix#IEC_prefixes]ຮູບແບບຄຳນຳໜ້າ IEC[/url], ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ [code]"
"\"B\"[/code], [code]\"KiB\"[/code], [code]\"MiB\"[/code], [code]\"GiB\"[/"
"code], [code]\"TiB\"[/code], [code]\"PiB\"[/code], ຫຼື [code]\"EiB\"[/code]."

msgid ""
"Indents every line of the string with the given [param prefix]. Empty lines "
"are not indented. See also [method dedent] to remove indentation.\n"
"For example, the string can be indented with two tabulations using [code]"
"\"\\t\\t\"[/code], or four spaces using [code]\"    \"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ໃສ່ຍໍ້ໜ້າໃຫ້ທຸກໆແຖວຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍ [param prefix] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ແຖວວ່າງຈະບໍ່ຖືກໃສ່ຍໍ້ໜ້າ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method dedent] ເພື່ອລຶບຍໍ້ໜ້າອອກ.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມສາມາດໃສ່ຍໍ້ໜ້າດ້ວຍແທັບ (tab) ສອງເທື່ອໂດຍໃຊ້ [code]\"\\t\\t\"[/code], ຫຼື "
"ຍະຫວ່າງສີ່ເທື່ອໂດຍໃຊ້ [code]\"    \"[/code]."

msgid "Inserts [param what] at the given [param position] in the string."
msgstr "ແຊກ [param what] ເຂົ້າໃນ [param position] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the string is a path to a file or directory, and "
"its starting point is explicitly defined. This method is the opposite of "
"[method is_relative_path].\n"
"This includes all paths starting with [code]\"res://\"[/code], [code]\"user://"
"\"[/code], [code]\"C:\\\"[/code], [code]\"/\"[/code], etc."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ, ແລະ "
"ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງມັນຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. ເມທອດນີ້ແມ່ນກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ [method is_relative_path].\n"
"ອັນນີ້ລວມເຖິງເສັ້ນທາງທັງໝົດທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [code]\"res://\"[/code], [code]\"user://\"[/"
"code], [code]\"C:\\\"[/code], [code]\"/\"[/code], ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the string's length is [code]0[/code] ([code]"
"\"\"[/code]). See also [method length]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຄວາມຍາວຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມແມ່ນ [code]0[/code] ([code]\"\"[/"
"code]). ເບິ່ງ [method length] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the string is a path, and its starting point is "
"dependent on context. The path could begin from the current directory, or the "
"current [Node] (if the string is derived from a [NodePath]), and may "
"sometimes be prefixed with [code]\"./\"[/code]. This method is the opposite "
"of [method is_absolute_path]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນເສັ້ນທາງ, ແລະ ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງມັນຂຶ້ນກັບບໍລິບົດ. "
"ເສັ້ນທາງອາດຈະເລີ່ມຈາກໄດເຣັກທໍຣີປັດຈຸບັນ, ຫຼື [Node] ປັດຈຸບັນ (ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມມາຈາກ [NodePath]), ແລະ "
"ບາງຄັ້ງອາດຈະມີ [code]\"./\"[/code] ທາງໜ້າ. ເມທອດນີ້ແມ່ນກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ [method "
"is_absolute_path]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if all characters of this string can be found in "
"[param text] in their original order. This is not the same as [method "
"contains].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var text = \"Wow, incredible!\"\n"
"\n"
"print(\"inedible\".is_subsequence_of(text)) # Prints true\n"
"print(\"Word!\".is_subsequence_of(text))    # Prints true\n"
"print(\"Window\".is_subsequence_of(text))   # Prints false\n"
"print(\"\".is_subsequence_of(text))         # Prints true\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ສາມາດພົບໄດ້ໃນ [param text] "
"ຕາມລຳດັບເດີມຂອງມັນ. ອັນນີ້ບໍ່ຄືກັນກັບ [method contains].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var text = \"Wow, incredible!\"\n"
"\n"
"print(\"inedible\".is_subsequence_of(text)) # ພິມ true\n"
"print(\"Word!\".is_subsequence_of(text))    # ພິມ true\n"
"print(\"Window\".is_subsequence_of(text))   # ພິມ false\n"
"print(\"\".is_subsequence_of(text))         # ພິມ true\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if all characters of this string can be found in "
"[param text] in their original order, [b]ignoring case[/b]. This is not the "
"same as [method containsn]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ສາມາດພົບໄດ້ໃນ [param text] "
"ຕາມລຳດັບເດີມ, [b]ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ພິມນ້ອຍ[/b]. ອັນນີ້ບໍ່ຄືກັນກັບ [method containsn]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string is a valid ASCII identifier. A valid "
"ASCII identifier may contain only letters, digits, and underscores ([code]_[/"
"code]), and the first character may not be a digit.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"node_2d\".is_valid_ascii_identifier())    # Prints true\n"
"print(\"TYPE_FLOAT\".is_valid_ascii_identifier()) # Prints true\n"
"print(\"1st_method\".is_valid_ascii_identifier()) # Prints false\n"
"print(\"MyMethod#2\".is_valid_ascii_identifier()) # Prints false\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also [method is_valid_unicode_identifier]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ເປັນຕົວລະບຸ (identifier) ASCII ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຕົວລະບຸ "
"ASCII ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕ້ອງມີພຽງແຕ່ຕົວອັກສອນ, ຕົວເລກ, ແລະ ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດກ້ອງ ([code]_[/code]), ແລະ "
"ຕົວອັກສອນທຳອິດຕ້ອງບໍ່ແມ່ນຕົວເລກ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"node_2d\".is_valid_ascii_identifier())    # ພິມ true\n"
"print(\"TYPE_FLOAT\".is_valid_ascii_identifier()) # ພິມ true\n"
"print(\"1st_method\".is_valid_ascii_identifier()) # ພິມ false\n"
"print(\"MyMethod#2\".is_valid_ascii_identifier()) # ພິມ false\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method is_valid_unicode_identifier] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string is a valid file name. A valid file "
"name cannot be empty, begin or end with space characters, or contain "
"characters that are not allowed ([code]:[/code] [code]/[/code] [code]\\[/"
"code] [code]?[/code] [code]*[/code] [code]\"[/code] [code]|[/code] [code]%[/"
"code] [code]<[/code] [code]>[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ເປັນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕ້ອງບໍ່ວ່າງເປົ່າ, ບໍ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນ ຫຼື "
"ລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງ, ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດ ([code]:[/code] [code]/[/code] [code]\\"
"[/code] [code]?[/code] [code]*[/code] [code]\"[/code] [code]|[/code] [code]%[/"
"code] [code]<[/code] [code]>[/code])."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string represents a valid floating-point "
"number. A valid float may contain only digits, one decimal point ([code].[/"
"code]), and the exponent letter ([code]e[/code]). It may also be prefixed "
"with a positive ([code]+[/code]) or negative ([code]-[/code]) sign. Any valid "
"integer is also a valid float (see [method is_valid_int]). See also [method "
"to_float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"1.7\".is_valid_float())   # Prints true\n"
"print(\"24\".is_valid_float())    # Prints true\n"
"print(\"7e3\".is_valid_float())   # Prints true\n"
"print(\"Hello\".is_valid_float()) # Prints false\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ສະແດງເຖິງເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ (float) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ເລກ float "
"ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕ້ອງມີພຽງຕົວເລກ, ຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມໜຶ່ງຈຸດ ([code].[/code]), ແລະ ຕົວອັກສອນເລກກຳລັງ "
"([code]e[/code]). ມັນອາດຈະມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍບວກ ([code]+[/code]) ຫຼື ລົບ ([code]-[/code]) "
"ທາງໜ້າກໍໄດ້. ເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງທຸກຕົວຖືເປັນ float ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ (ເບິ່ງ [method is_valid_int]). ເບິ່ງ "
"[method to_float] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"1.7\".is_valid_float())   # ພິມ true\n"
"print(\"24\".is_valid_float())    # ພິມ true\n"
"print(\"7e3\".is_valid_float())   # ພິມ true\n"
"print(\"Hello\".is_valid_float()) # ພິມ false\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string is a valid hexadecimal number. A "
"valid hexadecimal number only contains digits or letters [code]A[/code] to "
"[code]F[/code] (either uppercase or lowercase), and may be prefixed with a "
"positive ([code]+[/code]) or negative ([code]-[/code]) sign.\n"
"If [param with_prefix] is [code]true[/code], the hexadecimal number needs to "
"prefixed by [code]\"0x\"[/code] to be considered valid.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"A08E\".is_valid_hex_number())    # Prints true\n"
"print(\"-AbCdEf\".is_valid_hex_number()) # Prints true\n"
"print(\"2.5\".is_valid_hex_number())     # Prints false\n"
"\n"
"print(\"0xDEADC0DE\".is_valid_hex_number(true)) # Prints true\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ເປັນເລກຖານສິບຫົກທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. "
"ເລກຖານສິບຫົກທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕ້ອງມີພຽງຕົວເລກ ຫຼື ຕົວອັກສອນ [code]A[/code] ຫາ [code]F[/code] "
"(ທັງໂຕພິມໃຫຍ່ ຫຼື ພິມນ້ອຍ), ແລະ ອາດຈະມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍບວກ ([code]+[/code]) ຫຼື ລົບ ([code]-[/"
"code]) ທາງໜ້າ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param with_prefix] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເລກຖານສິບຫົກຕ້ອງມີຄຳນຳໜ້າ [code]"
"\"0x\"[/code] ຈຶ່ງຈະຖືວ່າຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"A08E\".is_valid_hex_number())    # ພິມ true\n"
"print(\"-AbCdEf\".is_valid_hex_number()) # ພິມ true\n"
"print(\"2.5\".is_valid_hex_number())     # ພິມ false\n"
"\n"
"print(\"0xDEADC0DE\".is_valid_hex_number(true)) # ພິມ true\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string is a valid color in hexadecimal HTML "
"notation. The string must be a hexadecimal value (see [method "
"is_valid_hex_number]) of either 3, 4, 6 or 8 digits, and may be prefixed by a "
"hash sign ([code]#[/code]). Other HTML notations for colors, such as names or "
"[code]hsl()[/code], are not considered valid. See also [method Color.html]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ເປັນລະຫັດສີ HTML ໃນຮູບແບບເລກຖານສິບຫົກທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຕ້ອງເປັນຄ່າຖານສິບຫົກ (ເບິ່ງ [method is_valid_hex_number]) ທີ່ມີ 3, 4, 6 ຫຼື 8 ຫຼັກ, "
"ແລະ ອາດຈະມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍສີ່ລ່ຽມ ([code]#[/code]) ທາງໜ້າ. ຮູບແບບສີ HTML ອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ ຊື່ສີ ຫຼື "
"[code]hsl()[/code] ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ເບິ່ງ [method Color.html] ຕື່ມ."

msgid "Use [method is_valid_ascii_identifier] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method is_valid_ascii_identifier] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string is a valid identifier. A valid "
"identifier may contain only letters, digits and underscores ([code]_[/code]), "
"and the first character may not be a digit.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"node_2d\".is_valid_identifier())    # Prints true\n"
"print(\"TYPE_FLOAT\".is_valid_identifier()) # Prints true\n"
"print(\"1st_method\".is_valid_identifier()) # Prints false\n"
"print(\"MyMethod#2\".is_valid_identifier()) # Prints false\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ເປັນຕົວລະບຸ (identifier) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. "
"ຕົວລະບຸທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕ້ອງມີພຽງແຕ່ຕົວອັກສອນ, ຕົວເລກ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດກ້ອງ ([code]_[/code]), ແລະ "
"ຕົວອັກສອນທຳອິດຕ້ອງບໍ່ແມ່ນຕົວເລກ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"node_2d\".is_valid_identifier())    # ພິມ true\n"
"print(\"TYPE_FLOAT\".is_valid_identifier()) # ພິມ true\n"
"print(\"1st_method\".is_valid_identifier()) # ພິມ false\n"
"print(\"MyMethod#2\".is_valid_identifier()) # ພິມ false\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string represents a valid integer. A valid "
"integer only contains digits, and may be prefixed with a positive ([code]+[/"
"code]) or negative ([code]-[/code]) sign. See also [method to_int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"7\".is_valid_int())    # Prints true\n"
"print(\"1.65\".is_valid_int()) # Prints false\n"
"print(\"Hi\".is_valid_int())   # Prints false\n"
"print(\"+3\".is_valid_int())   # Prints true\n"
"print(\"-12\".is_valid_int())  # Prints true\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ສະແດງເຖິງເລກຖ້ວນ (integer) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. "
"ເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕ້ອງມີພຽງແຕ່ຕົວເລກ, ແລະ ອາດຈະມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍບວກ ([code]+[/code]) ຫຼື ລົບ "
"([code]-[/code]) ທາງໜ້າ. ເບິ່ງ [method to_int] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"7\".is_valid_int())    # ພິມ true\n"
"print(\"1.65\".is_valid_int()) # ພິມ false\n"
"print(\"Hi\".is_valid_int())   # ພິມ false\n"
"print(\"+3\".is_valid_int())   # ພິມ true\n"
"print(\"-12\".is_valid_int())  # ພິມ true\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string represents a well-formatted IPv4 or "
"IPv6 address. This method considers [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Reserved_IP_addresses]reserved IP addresses[/url] such as [code]\"0.0.0.0\"[/"
"code] and [code]\"ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff\"[/code] as valid."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ສະແດງເຖິງທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4 ຫຼື IPv6 ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຮູບແບບ. "
"ເມທອດນີ້ຖືວ່າ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reserved_IP_addresses]ທີ່ຢູ່ IP "
"ທີ່ຖືກຈອງໄວ້ (reserved IP addresses)[/url] ເຊັ່ນ [code]\"0.0.0.0\"[/code] ແລະ [code]"
"\"ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff\"[/code] ນັ້ນຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this string is a valid Unicode identifier.\n"
"A valid Unicode identifier must begin with a Unicode character of class "
"[code]XID_Start[/code] or [code]\"_\"[/code], and may contain Unicode "
"characters of class [code]XID_Continue[/code] in the other positions.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"node_2d\".is_valid_unicode_identifier())      # Prints true\n"
"print(\"1st_method\".is_valid_unicode_identifier())   # Prints false\n"
"print(\"MyMethod#2\".is_valid_unicode_identifier())   # Prints false\n"
"print(\"állóképesség\".is_valid_unicode_identifier()) # Prints true\n"
"print(\"выносливость\".is_valid_unicode_identifier()) # Prints true\n"
"print(\"体力\".is_valid_unicode_identifier())         # Prints true\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also [method is_valid_ascii_identifier].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method checks identifiers the same way as GDScript. See "
"[method TextServer.is_valid_identifier] for more advanced checks."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ເປັນຕົວລະບຸ (identifier) Unicode ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"ຕົວລະບຸ Unicode ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ຂອງຄລາສ [code]XID_Start[/code] "
"ຫຼື [code]\"_\"[/code], ແລະ ອາດຈະມີຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ຂອງຄລາສ [code]XID_Continue[/"
"code] ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງອື່ນໆ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"node_2d\".is_valid_unicode_identifier())      # ພິມ true\n"
"print(\"1st_method\".is_valid_unicode_identifier())   # ພິມ false\n"
"print(\"MyMethod#2\".is_valid_unicode_identifier())   # ພິມ false\n"
"print(\"állóképesség\".is_valid_unicode_identifier()) # ພິມ true\n"
"print(\"выносливость\".is_valid_unicode_identifier()) # ພິມ true\n"
"print(\"体力\".is_valid_unicode_identifier())         # ພິມ true\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method is_valid_ascii_identifier] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ກວດສອບຕົວລະບຸແບບດຽວກັນກັບ GDScript. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"TextServer.is_valid_identifier] ສຳລັບການກວດສອບທີ່ລະອຽດກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Returns the concatenation of [param parts]' elements, with each element "
"separated by the string calling this method. This method is the opposite of "
"[method split].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var fruits = [\"Apple\", \"Orange\", \"Pear\", \"Kiwi\"]\n"
"\n"
"print(\", \".join(fruits))  # Prints \"Apple, Orange, Pear, Kiwi\"\n"
"print(\"---\".join(fruits)) # Prints \"Apple---Orange---Pear---Kiwi\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"string[] fruits = [\"Apple\", \"Orange\", \"Pear\", \"Kiwi\"];\n"
"\n"
"// In C#, this method is static.\n"
"GD.Print(string.Join(\", \", fruits));  // Prints \"Apple, Orange, Pear, "
"Kiwi\"\n"
"GD.Print(string.Join(\"---\", fruits)); // Prints \"Apple---Orange---Pear---"
"Kiwi\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນຂອງອົງປະກອບໃນ [param parts], "
"ໂດຍແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບຈະຖືກແຍກດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້. ເມທອດນີ້ແມ່ນກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ [method "
"split].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var fruits = [\"Apple\", \"Orange\", \"Pear\", \"Kiwi\"]\n"
"\n"
"print(\", \".join(fruits))  # ພິມ \"Apple, Orange, Pear, Kiwi\"\n"
"print(\"---\".join(fruits)) # ພິມ \"Apple---Orange---Pear---Kiwi\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"string[] fruits = [\"Apple\", \"Orange\", \"Pear\", \"Kiwi\"];\n"
"\n"
"// ໃນ C#, ເມທອດນີ້ເປັນ static.\n"
"GD.Print(string.Join(\", \", fruits));  // ພິມ \"Apple, Orange, Pear, Kiwi\"\n"
"GD.Print(string.Join(\"---\", fruits)); // ພິມ \"Apple---Orange---Pear---"
"Kiwi\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with special characters escaped using the JSON "
"standard. Because it closely matches the C standard, it is possible to use "
"[method c_unescape] to unescape the string, if necessary."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສຳເນົາຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຕົວອັກສອນພິເສດຖືກໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ escape ໂດຍໃຊ້ບາດຖານ JSON. "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນໃກ້ຄຽງກັບມາດຕະຖານ C, ທ່ານຈຶ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ [method c_unescape] ເພື່ອຖອດ escape "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມໄດ້ ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the first [param length] characters from the beginning of the string. "
"If [param length] is negative, strips the last [param length] characters from "
"the string's end.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"Hello World!\".left(3))  # Prints \"Hel\"\n"
"print(\"Hello World!\".left(-4)) # Prints \"Hello Wo\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [param length] ຕົວອັກສອນທຳອິດຈາກຕອນຕົ້ນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຖ້າ [param length] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, "
"ຈະຕັດ [param length] ຕົວອັກສອນສຸດທ້າຍອອກຈາກທ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"Hello World!\".left(3))  # ພິມ \"Hel\"\n"
"print(\"Hello World!\".left(-4)) # ພິມ \"Hello Wo\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the number of characters in the string. Empty strings ([code]\"\"[/"
"code]) always return [code]0[/code]. See also [method is_empty]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຕົວອັກສອນໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງ ([code]\"\"[/code]) ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]0[/code] "
"ສະເໝີ. ເບິ່ງ [method is_empty] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Formats the string to be at least [param min_length] long by adding [param "
"character]s to the left of the string, if necessary. See also [method rpad]."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຍາວຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ [param min_length] ໂດຍການເພີ່ມ [param character] "
"ໃສ່ທາງຊ້າຍຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ. ເບິ່ງ [method rpad] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Removes a set of characters defined in [param chars] from the string's "
"beginning. See also [method rstrip].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param chars] is not a prefix. Use [method trim_prefix] to "
"remove a single prefix, rather than a set of characters."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບຊຸດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ [param chars] ອອກຈາກສ່ວນຕົ້ນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ເບິ່ງ [method rstrip] "
"ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param chars] ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄຳນຳໜ້າ (prefix). ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method trim_prefix] "
"ເພື່ອລຶບຄຳນຳໜ້າດຽວ ອອກແທນການລຶບຊຸດຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid ""
"Does a simple expression match (also called \"glob\" or \"globbing\"), where "
"[code]*[/code] matches zero or more arbitrary characters and [code]?[/code] "
"matches any single character except a period ([code].[/code]). An empty "
"string or empty expression always evaluates to [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ທຳການຈັບຄູ່ການສະແດງອອກແບບງ່າຍໆ (ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"glob\" ຫຼື \"globbing\"), ໂດຍທີ່ [code]*[/"
"code] ແທນຕົວອັກສອນໃດໆກໍໄດ້ສູນ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍຕົວ ແລະ [code]?[/code] ແທນຕົວອັກສອນດຽວໃດໆກໍໄດ້ "
"ຍົກເວັ້ນຈຸດ ([code].[/code]). ຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງ ຫຼື ການສະແດງອອກທີ່ວ່າງຈະໃຫ້ຜົນເປັນ [code]false[/"
"code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Does a simple [b]case-insensitive[/b] expression match, where [code]*[/code] "
"matches zero or more arbitrary characters and [code]?[/code] matches any "
"single character except a period ([code].[/code]). An empty string or empty "
"expression always evaluates to [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ທຳການຈັບຄູ່ການສະແດງອອກແບບ [b]ບໍ່ສົນໃຈຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ພິມນ້ອຍ[/b], ໂດຍທີ່ [code]*[/code] "
"ແທນຕົວອັກສອນໃດໆກໍໄດ້ສູນ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍຕົວ ແລະ [code]?[/code] ແທນຕົວອັກສອນດຽວໃດໆກໍໄດ້ ຍົກເວັ້ນຈຸດ "
"([code].[/code]). ຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງ ຫຼື ການສະແດງອອກທີ່ວ່າງຈະໃຫ້ຜົນເປັນ [code]false[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MD5]MD5 hash[/url] of the "
"string as a [PackedByteArray]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MD5]MD5 hash[/url] ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນ "
"[PackedByteArray]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MD5]MD5 hash[/url] of the "
"string as another [String]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MD5]MD5 hash[/url] ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນ "
"[String] ອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"Performs a [b]case-sensitive[/b], [i]natural order[/i] comparison to another "
"string. Returns [code]-1[/code] if less than, [code]1[/code] if greater than, "
"or [code]0[/code] if equal. \"Less than\" or \"greater than\" are determined "
"by the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode "
"code points[/url] of each string, which roughly matches the alphabetical "
"order.\n"
"When used for sorting, natural order comparison orders sequences of numbers "
"by the combined value of each digit as is often expected, instead of the "
"single digit's value. A sorted sequence of numbered strings will be [code]"
"[\"1\", \"2\", \"3\", ...][/code], not [code][\"1\", \"10\", \"2\", "
"\"3\", ...][/code].\n"
"If the character comparison reaches the end of one string, but the other "
"string contains more characters, then it will use length as the deciding "
"factor: [code]1[/code] will be returned if this string is longer than the "
"[param to] string, or [code]-1[/code] if shorter. Note that the length of "
"empty strings is always [code]0[/code].\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method naturalnocasecmp_to], [method "
"filecasecmp_to], and [method nocasecmp_to]."
msgstr ""
"ທຳການປຽບທຽບແບບ [b]ສົນໃຈຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ພິມນ້ອຍ[/b] ແລະ [i]ລຳດັບແບບທຳມະຊາດ[/i] ກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມອື່ນ. "
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]-1[/code] ຖ້ານ້ອຍກວ່າ, [code]1[/code] ຖ້າຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ຫຼື [code]0[/code] "
"ຖ້າເທົ່າກັນ. \"ນ້ອຍກວ່າ\" ຫຼື \"ຫຼາຍກວ່າ\" ແມ່ນກຳນົດໂດຍ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode code points[/url] ຂອງແຕ່ລະຂໍ້ຄວາມ.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການຈັດລຳດັບ, "
"ການປຽບທຽບແບບທຳມະຊາດຈະຈັດລຳດັບຕົວເລກຕາມຄ່າລວມຂອງແຕ່ລະຫຼັກຕາມທີ່ຄວນຈະເປັນ, "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເບິ່ງແຕ່ລະຫຼັກແຍກກັນ. ລຳດັບທີ່ຈັດແລ້ວຈະເປັນ [code][\"1\", \"2\", \"3\", ...][/"
"code], ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [code][\"1\", \"10\", \"2\", ...][/code].\n"
"ຖ້າການປຽບທຽບໄປຮອດທ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມໜຶ່ງ ແຕ່ອີກຂໍ້ຄວາມຍັງມີຕົວອັກສອນເຫຼືອ, ມັນຈະໃຊ້ຄວາມຍາວເປັນໂຕຕັດສິນ: "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]1[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ຍາວກວ່າ [param to], ຫຼື [code]-1[/code] ຖ້າສັ້ນກວ່າ. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຄວາມຍາວຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງແມ່ນ [code]0[/code] ສະເໝີ.\n"
"ເພື່ອເອົາຜົນເປັນ [bool], ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການ [code]==[/code] ແທນ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"naturalnocasecmp_to], [method filecasecmp_to], ແລະ [method nocasecmp_to] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Performs a [b]case-insensitive[/b], [i]natural order[/i] comparison to "
"another string. Returns [code]-1[/code] if less than, [code]1[/code] if "
"greater than, or [code]0[/code] if equal. \"Less than\" or \"greater than\" "
"are determined by the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode code points[/url] of each string, which "
"roughly matches the alphabetical order. Internally, lowercase characters are "
"converted to uppercase for the comparison.\n"
"When used for sorting, natural order comparison orders sequences of numbers "
"by the combined value of each digit as is often expected, instead of the "
"single digit's value. A sorted sequence of numbered strings will be [code]"
"[\"1\", \"2\", \"3\", ...][/code], not [code][\"1\", \"10\", \"2\", "
"\"3\", ...][/code].\n"
"If the character comparison reaches the end of one string, but the other "
"string contains more characters, then it will use length as the deciding "
"factor: [code]1[/code] will be returned if this string is longer than the "
"[param to] string, or [code]-1[/code] if shorter. Note that the length of "
"empty strings is always [code]0[/code].\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method naturalcasecmp_to], [method "
"filenocasecmp_to], and [method casecmp_to]."
msgstr ""
"ທຳການປຽບທຽບແບບ [b]ບໍ່ສົນໃຈຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ພິມນ້ອຍ[/b] ແລະ [i]ລຳດັບແບບທຳມະຊາດ[/i] ກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມອື່ນ. "
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]-1[/code] ຖ້ານ້ອຍກວ່າ, [code]1[/code] ຖ້າຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ຫຼື [code]0[/code] "
"ຖ້າເທົ່າກັນ. ພາຍໃນ, ຕົວອັກສອນພິມນ້ອຍຈະຖືກແປງເປັນພິມໃຫຍ່ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບ.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການຈັດລຳດັບ, ການປຽບທຽບແບບທຳມະຊາດຈະຈັດລຳດັບຕົວເລກຕາມຄ່າລວມຂອງແຕ່ລະຫຼັກ. "
"ລຳດັບທີ່ຈັດແລ້ວຈະເປັນ [code][\"1\", \"2\", \"3\", ...][/code], ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [code][\"1\", "
"\"10\", \"2\", ...][/code].\n"
"ຖ້າການປຽບທຽບໄປຮອດທ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມໜຶ່ງ ແຕ່ອີກຂໍ້ຄວາມຍັງມີຕົວອັກສອນເຫຼືອ, ມັນຈະໃຊ້ຄວາມຍາວເປັນໂຕຕັດສິນ: "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]1[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ຍາວກວ່າ [param to], ຫຼື [code]-1[/code] ຖ້າສັ້ນກວ່າ. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຄວາມຍາວຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງແມ່ນ [code]0[/code] ສະເໝີ.\n"
"ເພື່ອເອົາຜົນເປັນ [bool], ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການ [code]==[/code] ແທນ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"naturalcasecmp_to], [method filenocasecmp_to], ແລະ [method casecmp_to] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Performs a [b]case-insensitive[/b] comparison to another string. Returns "
"[code]-1[/code] if less than, [code]1[/code] if greater than, or [code]0[/"
"code] if equal. \"Less than\" or \"greater than\" are determined by the "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode code "
"points[/url] of each string, which roughly matches the alphabetical order. "
"Internally, lowercase characters are converted to uppercase for the "
"comparison.\n"
"If the character comparison reaches the end of one string, but the other "
"string contains more characters, then it will use length as the deciding "
"factor: [code]1[/code] will be returned if this string is longer than the "
"[param to] string, or [code]-1[/code] if shorter. Note that the length of "
"empty strings is always [code]0[/code].\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method casecmp_to], [method filenocasecmp_to], "
"and [method naturalnocasecmp_to]."
msgstr ""
"ທຳການປຽບທຽບແບບ [b]ບໍ່ສົນໃຈຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ພິມນ້ອຍ[/b] ກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມອື່ນ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]-1[/code] "
"ຖ້ານ້ອຍກວ່າ, [code]1[/code] ຖ້າຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ຫຼື [code]0[/code] ຖ້າເທົ່າກັນ. ພາຍໃນ, "
"ຕົວອັກສອນພິມນ້ອຍຈະຖືກແປງເປັນພິມໃຫຍ່ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບ.\n"
"ຖ້າການປຽບທຽບໄປຮອດທ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມໜຶ່ງ ແຕ່ອີກຂໍ້ຄວາມຍັງມີຕົວອັກສອນເຫຼືອ, ມັນຈະໃຊ້ຄວາມຍາວເປັນໂຕຕັດສິນ: "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]1[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ຍາວກວ່າ [param to], ຫຼື [code]-1[/code] ຖ້າສັ້ນກວ່າ. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຄວາມຍາວຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງແມ່ນ [code]0[/code] ສະເໝີ.\n"
"ເພື່ອເອົາຜົນເປັນ [bool], ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການ [code]==[/code] ແທນ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"casecmp_to], [method filenocasecmp_to], ແລະ [method naturalnocasecmp_to] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Converts a [float] to a string representation of a decimal number, with the "
"number of decimal places specified in [param decimals].\n"
"If [param decimals] is [code]-1[/code] as by default, the string "
"representation may only have up to 14 significant digits, with digits before "
"the decimal point having priority over digits after.\n"
"Trailing zeros are not included in the string. The last digit is rounded, not "
"truncated.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"String.num(3.141593)     # Returns \"3.141593\"\n"
"String.num(3.141593, 3)  # Returns \"3.142\"\n"
"String.num(3.14159300)   # Returns \"3.141593\"\n"
"\n"
"# Here, the last digit will be rounded up,\n"
"# which reduces the total digit count, since trailing zeros are removed:\n"
"String.num(42.129999, 5) # Returns \"42.13\"\n"
"\n"
"# If `decimals` is not specified, the maximum number of significant digits is "
"14:\n"
"String.num(-0.0000012345432123454321)     # Returns \"-0.00000123454321\"\n"
"String.num(-10000.0000012345432123454321) # Returns \"-10000.0000012345\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ແປງ [float] ໃຫ້ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ, ໂດຍກຳນົດຈຳນວນຫຼັກທົດສະນິຍົມໃນ [param "
"decimals].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param decimals] ແມ່ນ [code]-1[/code] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະມີຕົວເລກສຳຄັນໄດ້ສູງສຸດ 14 "
"ຫຼັກ, ໂດຍຕົວເລກໜ້າຈຸດຈະມີຄວາມສຳຄັນກວ່າຕົວເລກຫຼັງຈຸດ.\n"
"ເລກສູນທາງທ້າຍຈະບໍ່ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຕົວເລກສຸດທ້າຍຈະຖືກປັດຂຶ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕັດຖິ້ມ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"String.num(3.141593)     # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"3.141593\"\n"
"String.num(3.141593, 3)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"3.142\"\n"
"String.num(3.14159300)   # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"3.141593\"\n"
"\n"
"# ໃນນີ້, ຕົວເລກສຸດທ້າຍຈະຖືກປັດຂຶ້ນ,\n"
"# ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ຈຳນວນຫຼັກທັງໝົດຫຼຸດລົງ ເພາະເລກສູນທາງທ້າຍຖືກຕັດອອກ:\n"
"String.num(42.129999, 5) # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"42.13\"\n"
"\n"
"# ຖ້າບໍ່ກຳນົດ `decimals`, ຈຳນວນຕົວເລກສຳຄັນສູງສຸດແມ່ນ 14:\n"
"String.num(-0.0000012345432123454321)     # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"-0.00000123454321\"\n"
"String.num(-10000.0000012345432123454321) # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"-10000.0000012345\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Converts the given [param number] to a string representation, with the given "
"[param base].\n"
"By default, [param base] is set to decimal ([code]10[/code]). Other common "
"bases in programming include binary ([code]2[/code]), [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octal]octal[/url] ([code]8[/code]), hexadecimal "
"([code]16[/code]).\n"
"If [param capitalize_hex] is [code]true[/code], digits higher than 9 are "
"represented in uppercase."
msgstr ""
"ແແປງ [param number] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ ຕາມ [param base] (ຖານເລກ).\n"
"ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, [param base] ແມ່ນເລກຖານສິບ ([code]10[/code]). "
"ຖານອື່ນໆທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍໃນການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມລວມມີ ເລກຖານສອງ ([code]2[/code]), [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octal]ເລກຖານແປດ[/url] ([code]8[/code]), ແລະ ເລກຖານສິບຫົກ "
"([code]16[/code]).\n"
"ຖ້າ [param capitalize_hex] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວເລກທີ່ສູງກວ່າ 9 "
"ຈະຖືກສະແດງເປັນຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່."

msgid ""
"Converts the given [param number] to a string representation, in scientific "
"notation.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var n = -5.2e8\n"
"print(n)                        # Prints -520000000\n"
"print(String.num_scientific(n)) # Prints -5.2e+08\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// This method is not implemented in C#.\n"
"// Use `string.ToString()` with \"e\" to achieve similar results.\n"
"var n = -5.2e8f;\n"
"GD.Print(n);                // Prints -520000000\n"
"GD.Print(n.ToString(\"e1\")); // Prints -5.2e+008\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, this method is not implemented. To achieve similar "
"results, see C#'s [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/standard/base-"
"types/standard-numeric-format-strings]Standard numeric format strings[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ແປງ [param number] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນຮູບແບບສັນຍາກອນວິທະຍາສາດ (scientific "
"notation).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var n = -5.2e8\n"
"print(n)                        # ພິມ -520000000\n"
"print(String.num_scientific(n)) # ພິມ -5.2e+08\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// ເມທອດນີ້ບໍ່ມີໃນ C#.\n"
"// ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `string.ToString()` ກັບ \"e\" ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນແບບດຽວກັນ.\n"
"var n = -5.2e8f;\n"
"GD.Print(n);                // ພິມ -520000000\n"
"GD.Print(n.ToString(\"e1\")); // ພິມ -5.2e+008\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ C#, ເມທອດນີ້ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/standard/base-types/standard-numeric-format-"
"strings]Standard numeric format strings[/url] ຂອງ C#."

msgid ""
"Converts the given unsigned [int] to a string representation, with the given "
"[param base].\n"
"By default, [param base] is set to decimal ([code]10[/code]). Other common "
"bases in programming include binary ([code]2[/code]), [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octal]octal[/url] ([code]8[/code]), hexadecimal "
"([code]16[/code]).\n"
"If [param capitalize_hex] is [code]true[/code], digits higher than 9 are "
"represented in uppercase."
msgstr ""
"ແປງ [int] ທີ່ບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ (unsigned) ໃຫ້ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ ຕາມ [param base] (ຖານເລກ).\n"
"ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, [param base] ແມ່ນເລກຖານສິບ ([code]10[/code]). ຖານອື່ນໆລວມມີ ເລກຖານສອງ "
"([code]2[/code]), ເລກຖານແປດ ([code]8[/code]), ແລະ ເລກຖານສິບຫົກ ([code]16[/"
"code]).\n"
"ຖ້າ [param capitalize_hex] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວເລກທີ່ສູງກວ່າ 9 "
"ຈະຖືກສະແດງເປັນຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່."

msgid ""
"Formats the string representing a number to have an exact number of [param "
"digits] [i]after[/i] the decimal point."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສະແດງຕົວເລກໃຫ້ມີຈຳນວນ [param digits] ທີ່ແນ່ນອນ [i]ຫຼັງ[/i] ຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມ."

msgid ""
"Formats the string representing a number to have an exact number of [param "
"digits] [i]before[/i] the decimal point."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສະແດງຕົວເລກໃຫ້ມີຈຳນວນ [param digits] ທີ່ແນ່ນອນ [i]ກ່ອນ[/i] ຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມ."

msgid ""
"Concatenates [param path] at the end of the string as a subpath, adding "
"[code]/[/code] if necessary.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] [code]\"this/is\".path_join(\"path\") == \"this/is/path\"[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ [param path] ໃສ່ທ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນຖານະເສັ້ນທາງຍ່ອຍ (subpath), ໂດຍຈະເພີ່ມ [code]/[/"
"code] ໃຫ້ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] [code]\"this/is\".path_join(\"path\") == \"this/is/path\"[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Removes all occurrences of the Unicode character with code [param what]. "
"Faster version of [method replace] when the key is only one character long "
"and the replacement is [code]\"\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ທີ່ມີລະຫັດ [param what] ອອກທັງໝົດ. ເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ໄວກວ່າ [method replace] "
"ເມື່ອຕົວຄົ້ນຫາ (key) ມີພຽງຕົວອັກສອນດຽວ ແລະ ໂຕປ່ຽນແທນແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງ [code]\"\"[/code]."

msgid ""
"Removes all occurrences of the characters in [param chars]. See also [method "
"remove_char]."
msgstr "ລຶບຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດທີ່ປາກົດໃນ [param chars] ອອກ. ເບິ່ງ [method remove_char] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Repeats this string a number of times. [param count] needs to be greater than "
"[code]0[/code]. Otherwise, returns an empty string."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດຊ້ຳຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ຕາມຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ກຳນົດ. [param count] ຕ້ອງຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0[/code]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງ."

msgid ""
"Replaces all occurrences of [param what] inside the string with the given "
"[param forwhat]."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນແທນ [param what] ທັງໝົດທີ່ພົບໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍ [param forwhat] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Replaces all occurrences of the Unicode character with code [param key] with "
"the Unicode character with code [param with]. Faster version of [method "
"replace] when the key is only one character long. To get a single character "
"use [code]\"X\".unicode_at(0)[/code] (note that some strings, like compound "
"letters and emoji, can be composed of multiple unicode codepoints, and will "
"not work with this method, use [method length] to make sure)."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນແທນຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ທີ່ມີລະຫັດ [param key] ທັງໝົດດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ທີ່ມີລະຫັດ [param "
"with]. ເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ໄວກວ່າ [method replace] ເມື່ອຕົວຄົ້ນຫາ (key) ມີພຽງຕົວອັກສອນດຽວ. "
"ເພື່ອເອົາລະຫັດຕົວອັກສອນດຽວ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [code]\"X\".unicode_at(0)[/code] (ໝາຍເຫດວ່າບາງຂໍ້ຄວາມ "
"ເຊັ່ນ ຕົວອັກສອນປະສົມ ຫຼື ອີໂມຈິ ອາດປະກອບດ້ວຍຫຼາຍ unicode codepoints ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບເມທອດນີ້, "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method length] ເພື່ອກວດສອບ)."

msgid ""
"Replaces any occurrence of the characters in [param keys] with the Unicode "
"character with code [param with]. See also [method replace_char]."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນແທນຕົວອັກສອນໃດໆທີ່ປາກົດໃນ [param keys] ດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ທີ່ມີລະຫັດ [param with]. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method replace_char] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Replaces all [b]case-insensitive[/b] occurrences of [param what] inside the "
"string with the given [param forwhat]."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນແທນ [param what] ທັງໝົດທີ່ພົບໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍ [param forwhat] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ "
"[b]ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ພິມນ້ອຍ[/b]."

msgid ""
"Returns the copy of this string in reverse order. This operation works on "
"unicode codepoints, rather than sequences of codepoints, and may break things "
"like compound letters or emojis."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສຳເນົາຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ແບບປີ້ນກັບ (reverse). ການເຮັດວຽກນີ້ແມ່ນເຮັດໃນລະດັບ unicode "
"codepoints, ບໍ່ແມ່ນລຳດັບຂອງ codepoints, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຕົວອັກສອນປະສົມ ຫຼື "
"ອີໂມຈິສະແດງຜົນຜິດພາດໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [b]last[/b] occurrence of [param what] in this "
"string, or [code]-1[/code] if there are none. The search's start can be "
"specified with [param from], continuing to the beginning of the string. This "
"method is the reverse of [method find].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A negative value of [param from] is converted to a starting "
"index by counting back from the last possible index with enough space to find "
"[param what].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A value of [param from] that is greater than the last possible "
"index with enough space to find [param what] is considered out-of-bounds, and "
"returns [code]-1[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນດັດສະນີຂອງການປາກົດ [b]ຄັ້ງສຸດທ້າຍ[/b] ຂອງ [param what] ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້, ຫຼື [code]-1[/"
"code] ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບ. ສາມາດກຳນົດຈຸດເລີ່ມຄົ້ນຫາໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [param from], ໂດຍຈະຄົ້ນຫາຢ້ອນກັບໄປຫາຕົ້ນຂໍ້ຄວາມ. "
"ເມທອດນີ້ເຮັດວຽກກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ [method find].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າລົບຂອງ [param from] "
"ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນດັດສະນີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການນັບຖອຍຫຼັງຈາກດັດສະນີສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າຄ່າ [param from] ຫຼາຍກວ່າດັດສະນີສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະພົບ [param what], "
"ຈະຖືວ່າເກີນຂອບເຂດ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]-1[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [b]last[/b] [b]case-insensitive[/b] occurrence of "
"[param what] in this string, or [code]-1[/code] if there are none. The "
"starting search index can be specified with [param from], continuing to the "
"beginning of the string. This method is the reverse of [method findn]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນດັດສະນີຂອງການປາກົດ [b]ຄັ້ງສຸດທ້າຍ[/b] ຂອງ [param what] ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ "
"[b]ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ພິມນ້ອຍ[/b], ຫຼື [code]-1[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບ. "
"ສາມາດກຳນົດດັດສະນີເລີ່ມຄົ້ນຫາໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [param from], ໂດຍຈະຄົ້ນຫາຢ້ອນກັບໄປຫາຕົ້ນຂໍ້ຄວາມ. "
"ເມທອດນີ້ເຮັດວຽກກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ [method findn]."

msgid ""
"Returns the last [param length] characters from the end of the string. If "
"[param length] is negative, strips the first [param length] characters from "
"the string's beginning.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"Hello World!\".right(3))  # Prints \"ld!\"\n"
"print(\"Hello World!\".right(-4)) # Prints \"o World!\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [param length] ຕົວອັກສອນສຸດທ້າຍຈາກທ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຖ້າ [param length] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ຈະຕັດ "
"[param length] ຕົວອັກສອນທຳອິດອອກຈາກຕົ້ນຂໍ້ຄວາມ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"Hello World!\".right(3))  # ພິມ \"ld!\"\n"
"print(\"Hello World!\".right(-4)) # ພິມ \"o World!\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Formats the string to be at least [param min_length] long, by adding [param "
"character]s to the right of the string, if necessary. See also [method lpad]."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຍາວຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ [param min_length] ໂດຍການເພີ່ມ [param character] "
"ໃສ່ທາງຂວາຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ. ເບິ່ງ [method lpad] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Splits the string using a [param delimiter] and returns an array of the "
"substrings, starting from the end of the string. The splits in the returned "
"array appear in the same order as the original string. If [param delimiter] "
"is an empty string, each substring will be a single character.\n"
"If [param allow_empty] is [code]false[/code], empty strings between adjacent "
"delimiters are excluded from the array.\n"
"If [param maxsplit] is greater than [code]0[/code], the number of splits may "
"not exceed [param maxsplit]. By default, the entire string is split, which is "
"mostly identical to [method split].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var some_string = \"One,Two,Three,Four\"\n"
"var some_array = some_string.rsplit(\",\", true, 1)\n"
"\n"
"print(some_array.size()) # Prints 2\n"
"print(some_array[0])     # Prints \"One,Two,Three\"\n"
"print(some_array[1])     # Prints \"Four\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// In C#, there is no String.RSplit() method.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ແຍກຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍໃຊ້ [param delimiter] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຍ່ອຍ, "
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມແຍກຈາກທ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນອາເຣທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະປາກົດຕາມລຳດັບເດີມຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຖ້າ [param "
"delimiter] ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງ, ແຕ່ລະຂໍ້ຄວາມຍ່ອຍຈະເປັນຕົວອັກສອນດຽວ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param allow_empty] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງທີ່ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງຕົວແຍກຈະບໍ່ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນອາເຣ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param maxsplit] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0[/code], ຈຳນວນການແຍກຈະບໍ່ເກີນ [param "
"maxsplit]. ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດຈະຖືກແຍກ ເຊິ່ງຄ້າຍຄືກັນກັບ [method split].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var some_string = \"One,Two,Three,Four\"\n"
"var some_array = some_string.rsplit(\",\", true, 1)\n"
"\n"
"print(some_array.size()) # ພິມ 2\n"
"print(some_array[0])     # ພິມ \"One,Two,Three\"\n"
"print(some_array[1])     # ພິມ \"Four\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// ໃນ C#, ບໍ່ມີເມທອດ String.RSplit().\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Removes a set of characters defined in [param chars] from the string's end. "
"See also [method lstrip].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param chars] is not a suffix. Use [method trim_suffix] to "
"remove a single suffix, rather than a set of characters."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບຊຸດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ [param chars] ອອກຈາກສ່ວນທ້າຍຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ເບິ່ງ [method lstrip] "
"ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param chars] ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍ (suffix). ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method trim_suffix] "
"ເພື່ອລຶບຄຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍດຽວ ອອກແທນການລຶບຊຸດຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-1]SHA-1[/url] hash of the "
"string as a [PackedByteArray]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-1]SHA-1 hash[/url] ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນ "
"[PackedByteArray]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-1]SHA-1[/url] hash of the "
"string as another [String]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-1]SHA-1 hash[/url] ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນ "
"[String] ອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-2]SHA-256[/url] hash of "
"the string as a [PackedByteArray]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-2]SHA-256 hash[/url] ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນ "
"[PackedByteArray]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-2]SHA-256[/url] hash of "
"the string as another [String]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-2]SHA-256 hash[/url] ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນ "
"[String] ອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the similarity index ([url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"S%C3%B8rensen%E2%80%93Dice_coefficient]Sørensen-Dice coefficient[/url]) of "
"this string compared to another. A result of [code]1.0[/code] means totally "
"similar, while [code]0.0[/code] means totally dissimilar.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"ABC123\".similarity(\"ABC123\")) # Prints 1.0\n"
"print(\"ABC123\".similarity(\"XYZ456\")) # Prints 0.0\n"
"print(\"ABC123\".similarity(\"123ABC\")) # Prints 0.8\n"
"print(\"ABC123\".similarity(\"abc123\")) # Prints 0.4\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນດັດສະນີຄວາມຄ້າຍຄືກັນ ([url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"S%C3%B8rensen%E2%80%93Dice_coefficient]Sørensen-Dice coefficient[/url]) "
"ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ເມື່ອປຽບທຽບກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມອື່ນ. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ [code]1.0[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງຄ້າຍຄືກັນທັງໝົດ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ [code]0.0[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງຕ່າງກັນທັງໝົດ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"ABC123\".similarity(\"ABC123\")) # ພິມ 1.0\n"
"print(\"ABC123\".similarity(\"XYZ456\")) # ພິມ 0.0\n"
"print(\"ABC123\".similarity(\"123ABC\")) # ພິມ 0.8\n"
"print(\"ABC123\".similarity(\"abc123\")) # ພິມ 0.4\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"If the string is a valid file path, converts the string into a canonical "
"path. This is the shortest possible path, without [code]\"./\"[/code], and "
"all the unnecessary [code]\"..\"[/code] and [code]\"/\"[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var simple_path = \"./path/to///../file\".simplify_path()\n"
"print(simple_path) # Prints \"path/file\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຈະແປງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃຫ້ເປັນເສັ້ນທາງແບບ canonical. "
"ອັນນີ້ແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ສັ້ນທີ່ສຸດທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້, ໂດຍບໍ່ມີ [code]\"./\"[/code], ແລະ ຕັດ [code]\"..\"[/"
"code] ກັບ [code]\"/\"[/code] ທີ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນອອກ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var simple_path = \"./path/to///../file\".simplify_path()\n"
"print(simple_path) # ພິມ \"path/file\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Splits the string using a [param delimiter] and returns an array of the "
"substrings. If [param delimiter] is an empty string, each substring will be a "
"single character. This method is the opposite of [method join].\n"
"If [param allow_empty] is [code]false[/code], empty strings between adjacent "
"delimiters are excluded from the array.\n"
"If [param maxsplit] is greater than [code]0[/code], the number of splits may "
"not exceed [param maxsplit]. By default, the entire string is split.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var some_array = \"One,Two,Three,Four\".split(\",\", true, 2)\n"
"\n"
"print(some_array.size()) # Prints 3\n"
"print(some_array[0])     # Prints \"One\"\n"
"print(some_array[1])     # Prints \"Two\"\n"
"print(some_array[2])     # Prints \"Three,Four\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// C#'s `Split()` does not support the `maxsplit` parameter.\n"
"var someArray = \"One,Two,Three\".Split(\",\");\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(someArray[0]); // Prints \"One\"\n"
"GD.Print(someArray[1]); // Prints \"Two\"\n"
"GD.Print(someArray[2]); // Prints \"Three\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you only need one substring from the array, consider using "
"[method get_slice] which is faster. If you need to split strings with more "
"complex rules, use the [RegEx] class instead."
msgstr ""
"ແຍກຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍໃຊ້ [param delimiter] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຍ່ອຍ. ຖ້າ [param delimiter] "
"ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງ, ແຕ່ລະຂໍ້ຄວາມຍ່ອຍຈະເປັນຕົວອັກສອນດຽວ. ເມທອດນີ້ແມ່ນກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ [method join].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param allow_empty] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງລະຫວ່າງຕົວແຍກຈະບໍ່ຖືກລວມໃນອາເຣ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param maxsplit] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0[/code], ຈຳນວນການແຍກຈະບໍ່ເກີນ [param "
"maxsplit].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var some_array = \"One,Two,Three,Four\".split(\",\", true, 2)\n"
"\n"
"print(some_array.size()) # ພິມ 3\n"
"print(some_array[0])     # ພິມ \"One\"\n"
"print(some_array[1])     # ພິມ \"Two\"\n"
"print(some_array[2])     # ພິມ \"Three,Four\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// `Split()` ຂອງ C# ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີ `maxsplit`.\n"
"var someArray = \"One,Two,Three\".Split(\",\");\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(someArray[0]); // ພິມ \"One\"\n"
"GD.Print(someArray[1]); // ພິມ \"Two\"\n"
"GD.Print(someArray[2]); // ພິມ \"Three\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການພຽງແຕ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມຍ່ອຍດຽວຈາກອາເຣ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method get_slice] "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະໄວກວ່າ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການແຍກຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍກົດເກນທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄລາສ [RegEx] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Splits the string into floats by using a [param delimiter] and returns a "
"[PackedFloat64Array].\n"
"If [param allow_empty] is [code]false[/code], empty or invalid [float] "
"conversions between adjacent delimiters are excluded.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = \"1,2,4.5\".split_floats(\",\")         # a is [1.0, 2.0, 4.5]\n"
"var c = \"1| ||4.5\".split_floats(\"|\")        # c is [1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 4.5]\n"
"var b = \"1| ||4.5\".split_floats(\"|\", false) # b is [1.0, 4.5]\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ແຍກຂໍ້ຄວາມໃຫ້ເປັນເລກ float ໂດຍໃຊ້ [param delimiter] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນເປັນ "
"[PackedFloat64Array].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param allow_empty] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], ການແປງທີ່ວ່າງ ຫຼື "
"ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງລະຫວ່າງຕົວແຍກຈະບໍ່ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = \"1,2,4.5\".split_floats(\",\")         # a ແມ່ນ [1.0, 2.0, 4.5]\n"
"var c = \"1| ||4.5\".split_floats(\"|\")        # c ແມ່ນ [1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 4.5]\n"
"var b = \"1| ||4.5\".split_floats(\"|\", false) # b ແມ່ນ [1.0, 4.5]\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Strips all non-printable characters from the beginning and the end of the "
"string. These include spaces, tabulations ([code]\\t[/code]), and newlines "
"([code]\\n[/code] [code]\\r[/code]).\n"
"If [param left] is [code]false[/code], ignores the string's beginning. "
"Likewise, if [param right] is [code]false[/code], ignores the string's end."
msgstr ""
"ຕັດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດພິມໄດ້ທັງໝົດອອກຈາກສ່ວນຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສ່ວນທ້າຍຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ເຊິ່ງລວມມີ ຍະຫວ່າງ, ແທັບ "
"([code]\\t[/code]), ແລະ ຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ ([code]\\n[/code] [code]\\r[/code]).\n"
"ຖ້າ [param left] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈສ່ວນຕົ້ນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນ, ຖ້າ "
"[param right] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈສ່ວນທ້າຍ."

msgid ""
"Strips all escape characters from the string. These include all non-printable "
"control characters of the first page of the ASCII table (values from 0 to "
"31), such as tabulation ([code]\\t[/code]) and newline ([code]\\n[/code], "
"[code]\\r[/code]) characters, but [i]not[/i] spaces."
msgstr ""
"ຕັດຕົວອັກສອນ escape ທັງໝົດອອກຈາກຂໍ້ຄວາມ. "
"ເຊິ່ງລວມມີຕົວອັກສອນຄວບຄຸມທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດພິມໄດ້ທັງໝົດໃນໜ້າທຳອິດຂອງຕາຕະລາງ ASCII (ຄ່າແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 31), "
"ເຊັ່ນ ແທັບ ([code]\\t[/code]) ແລະ ຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ ([code]\\n[/code], [code]\\r[/code]), "
"ແຕ່ [i]ບໍ່ລວມ[/i] ຍະຫວ່າງ."

msgid ""
"Returns part of the string from the position [param from] with length [param "
"len]. If [param len] is [code]-1[/code] (as by default), returns the rest of "
"the string starting from the given position."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງ [param from] ດ້ວຍຄວາມຍາວ [param len]. ຖ້າ [param len] "
"ແມ່ນ [code]-1[/code] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຈະສົ່ງຄືນສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອທັງໝົດຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍເລີ່ມຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Converts the string to an [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ASCII]ASCII[/"
"url]/Latin-1 encoded [PackedByteArray]. This method is slightly faster than "
"[method to_utf8_buffer], but replaces all unsupported characters with spaces. "
"This is the inverse of [method PackedByteArray.get_string_from_ascii]."
msgstr ""
"ແປງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃຫ້ເປັນ [PackedByteArray] ທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/ASCII]ASCII[/url]/Latin-1. ເມທອດນີ້ໄວກວ່າ [method to_utf8_buffer] ເລັກນ້ອຍ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະປ່ຽນຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບທັງໝົດໃຫ້ເປັນຍະຫວ່າງ. ອັນນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນກັບຂອງ [method "
"PackedByteArray.get_string_from_ascii]."

msgid "Returns the string converted to [code]camelCase[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກແປງເປັນຮູບແບບ [code]camelCase[/code]."

msgid ""
"Converts the string representing a decimal number into a [float]. This method "
"stops on the first non-number character, except the first decimal point "
"([code].[/code]) and the exponent letter ([code]e[/code]). See also [method "
"is_valid_float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = \"12.35\".to_float()  # a is 12.35\n"
"var b = \"1.2.3\".to_float()  # b is 1.2\n"
"var c = \"12xy3\".to_float()  # c is 12.0\n"
"var d = \"1e3\".to_float()    # d is 1000.0\n"
"var e = \"Hello!\".to_float() # e is 0.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ແປງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງເລກຖານສິບໃຫ້ເປັນ [float]. "
"ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຢຸດເມື່ອພົບຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕົວເລກຕົວທຳອິດ, ຍົກເວັ້ນຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມທຳອິດ ([code].[/code]) "
"ແລະ ຕົວອັກສອນເລກກຳລັງ ([code]e[/code]). ເບິ່ງ [method is_valid_float] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = \"12.35\".to_float()  # a ແມ່ນ 12.35\n"
"var b = \"1.2.3\".to_float()  # b ແມ່ນ 1.2\n"
"var c = \"12xy3\".to_float()  # c ແມ່ນ 12.0\n"
"var d = \"1e3\".to_float()    # d ແມ່ນ 1000.0\n"
"var e = \"Hello!\".to_float() # e ແມ່ນ 0.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Converts the string representing an integer number into an [int]. This method "
"removes any non-number character and stops at the first decimal point ([code]."
"[/code]). See also [method is_valid_int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = \"123\".to_int()    # a is 123\n"
"var b = \"x1y2z3\".to_int() # b is 123\n"
"var c = \"-1.2.3\".to_int() # c is -1\n"
"var d = \"Hello!\".to_int() # d is 0\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ແປງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງເລກຖ້ວນໃຫ້ເປັນ [int]. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະລຶບຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕົວເລກອອກ ແລະ "
"ຢຸດຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມທຳອິດ ([code].[/code]). ເບິ່ງ [method is_valid_int] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = \"123\".to_int()    # a ແມ່ນ 123\n"
"var b = \"x1y2z3\".to_int() # b ແມ່ນ 123\n"
"var c = \"-1.2.3\".to_int() # c ແມ່ນ -1\n"
"var d = \"Hello!\".to_int() # d ແມ່ນ 0\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the string converted to [code]kebab-case[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Numbers followed by a [i]single[/i] letter are not separated in "
"the conversion to keep some words (such as \"2D\") together.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"\"Node2D\".to_kebab_case()               # Returns \"node-2d\"\n"
"\"2nd place\".to_kebab_case()            # Returns \"2-nd-place\"\n"
"\"Texture3DAssetFolder\".to_kebab_case() # Returns \"texture-3d-asset-"
"folder\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"\"Node2D\".ToKebabCase();               // Returns \"node-2d\"\n"
"\"2nd place\".ToKebabCase();            // Returns \"2-nd-place\"\n"
"\"Texture3DAssetFolder\".ToKebabCase(); // Returns \"texture-3d-asset-"
"folder\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກແປງເປັນຮູບແບບ [code]kebab-case[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວເລກທີ່ຕາມດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນ [i]ດຽວ[/i] ຈະບໍ່ຖືກແຍກໃນການແປງ ເພື່ອຮັກສາບາງຄຳ "
"(ເຊັ່ນ \"2D\") ໄວ້ໃຫ້ຢູ່ຮ່ວມກັນ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"\"Node2D\".to_kebab_case()               # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"node-2d\"\n"
"\"2nd place\".to_kebab_case()            # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"2-nd-place\"\n"
"\"Texture3DAssetFolder\".to_kebab_case() # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"texture-3d-asset-folder\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"\"Node2D\".ToKebabCase();               // ສົ່ງຄືນ \"node-2d\"\n"
"\"2nd place\".ToKebabCase();            // ສົ່ງຄືນ \"2-nd-place\"\n"
"\"Texture3DAssetFolder\".ToKebabCase(); // ສົ່ງຄືນ \"texture-3d-asset-folder\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Returns the string converted to [code]lowercase[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກແປງເປັນ [code]ຕົວພິມນ້ອຍ[/code]."

msgid ""
"Converts the string to system multibyte code page encoded [PackedByteArray]. "
"If conversion fails, empty array is returned.\n"
"The values permitted for [param encoding] are system dependent. If [param "
"encoding] is empty string, system default encoding is used.\n"
"- For Windows, see [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/Intl/"
"code-page-identifiers]Code Page Identifiers[/url] .NET names.\n"
"- For macOS and Linux/BSD, see [code]libiconv[/code] library documentation "
"and [code]iconv --list[/code] for a list of supported encodings."
msgstr ""
"ແປງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃຫ້ເປັນ [PackedByteArray] ທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດຕາມ code page multibyte ຂອງລະບົບ. "
"ຖ້າການແປງຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣວ່າງ.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບ [param encoding] ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບ. ຖ້າ [param encoding] ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງ, "
"ຈະໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລະບົບ.\n"
"- ສຳລັບ Windows, ເບິ່ງ [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/Intl/"
"code-page-identifiers]Code Page Identifiers[/url] ຊື່ຂອງ .NET.\n"
"- ສຳລັບ macOS ແລະ Linux/BSD, ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງໄລບຣາຣີ [code]libiconv[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]iconv --list[/code] ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid "Returns the string converted to [code]PascalCase[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກແປງເປັນຮູບແບບ [code]PascalCase[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the string converted to [code]snake_case[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Numbers followed by a [i]single[/i] letter are not separated in "
"the conversion to keep some words (such as \"2D\") together.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"\"Node2D\".to_snake_case()               # Returns \"node_2d\"\n"
"\"2nd place\".to_snake_case()            # Returns \"2_nd_place\"\n"
"\"Texture3DAssetFolder\".to_snake_case() # Returns "
"\"texture_3d_asset_folder\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"\"Node2D\".ToSnakeCase();               // Returns \"node_2d\"\n"
"\"2nd place\".ToSnakeCase();            // Returns \"2_nd_place\"\n"
"\"Texture3DAssetFolder\".ToSnakeCase(); // Returns "
"\"texture_3d_asset_folder\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກແປງເປັນຮູບແບບ [code]snake_case[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວເລກທີ່ຕາມດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນ [i]ດຽວ[/i] ຈະບໍ່ຖືກແຍກໃນການແປງ ເພື່ອຮັກສາບາງຄຳ "
"(ເຊັ່ນ \"2D\") ໄວ້ໃຫ້ຢູ່ຮ່ວມກັນ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"\"Node2D\".to_snake_case()               # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"node_2d\"\n"
"\"2nd place\".to_snake_case()            # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"2_nd_place\"\n"
"\"Texture3DAssetFolder\".to_snake_case() # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"texture_3d_asset_folder\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"\"Node2D\".ToSnakeCase();               // ສົ່ງຄືນ \"node_2d\"\n"
"\"2nd place\".ToSnakeCase();            // ສົ່ງຄືນ \"2_nd_place\"\n"
"\"Texture3DAssetFolder\".ToSnakeCase(); // ສົ່ງຄືນ \"texture_3d_asset_folder\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Returns the string converted to [code]UPPERCASE[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກແປງເປັນ [code]ຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່[/code]."

msgid ""
"Converts the string to a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UTF-8]UTF-8[/url] "
"encoded [PackedByteArray]. This method is slightly slower than [method "
"to_ascii_buffer], but supports all UTF-8 characters. For most cases, prefer "
"using this method. This is the inverse of [method "
"PackedByteArray.get_string_from_utf8]."
msgstr ""
"ແປງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃຫ້ເປັນ [PackedByteArray] ທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/UTF-8]UTF-8[/url]. ເມທອດນີ້ຊ້າກວ່າ [method to_ascii_buffer] ເລັກນ້ອຍ, "
"ແຕ່ຮອງຮັບຕົວອັກສອນ UTF-8 ທັງໝົດ. ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້. ອັນນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນກັບຂອງ "
"[method PackedByteArray.get_string_from_utf8]."

msgid ""
"Converts the string to a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UTF-16]UTF-16[/"
"url] encoded [PackedByteArray]. This is the inverse of [method "
"PackedByteArray.get_string_from_utf16]."
msgstr ""
"ແປງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃຫ້ເປັນ [PackedByteArray] ທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/UTF-16]UTF-16[/url]. ອັນນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນກັບຂອງ [method "
"PackedByteArray.get_string_from_utf16]."

msgid ""
"Converts the string to a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UTF-32]UTF-32[/"
"url] encoded [PackedByteArray]. This is the inverse of [method "
"PackedByteArray.get_string_from_utf32]."
msgstr ""
"ແປງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃຫ້ເປັນ [PackedByteArray] ທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/UTF-32]UTF-32[/url]. ອັນນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນກັບຂອງ [method "
"PackedByteArray.get_string_from_utf32]."

msgid ""
"Converts the string to a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Wide_character]wide character[/url] ([code]wchar_t[/code], UTF-16 on Windows, "
"UTF-32 on other platforms) encoded [PackedByteArray]. This is the inverse of "
"[method PackedByteArray.get_string_from_wchar]."
msgstr ""
"ແປງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃຫ້ເປັນ [PackedByteArray] ທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Wide_character]wide character[/url] ([code]wchar_t[/code], ເປັນ UTF-16 ໃນ "
"Windows ແລະ UTF-32 ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນ). ອັນນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນກັບຂອງ [method "
"PackedByteArray.get_string_from_wchar]."

msgid ""
"Removes the given [param prefix] from the start of the string, or returns the "
"string unchanged."
msgstr "ລຶບ [param prefix] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ອອກຈາກສ່ວນຕົ້ນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ຫຼື ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມເດີມຖ້າບໍ່ພົບ."

msgid ""
"Removes the given [param suffix] from the end of the string, or returns the "
"string unchanged."
msgstr "ລຶບ [param suffix] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ອອກຈາກສ່ວນທ້າຍຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ຫຼື ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມເດີມຖ້າບໍ່ພົບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the character code at position [param at].\n"
"See also [method chr], [method @GDScript.char], and [method @GDScript.ord]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລະຫັດຕົວອັກສອນ (character code) ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ [param at].\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method chr], [method @GDScript.char], ແລະ [method @GDScript.ord] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Decodes the string from its URL-encoded format. This method is meant to "
"properly decode the parameters in a URL when receiving an HTTP request. See "
"also [method uri_encode].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var url = \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot%20Engine%3%docs\"\n"
"print(url.uri_decode()) # Prints \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot Engine:docs\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var url = \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot%20Engine%3%docs\"\n"
"GD.Print(url.URIDecode()) // Prints \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot "
"Engine:docs\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method decodes [code]+[/code] as space."
msgstr ""
"ຖອດລະຫັດຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກຮູບແບບ URL-encoded. ເມທອດນີ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຖອດລະຫັດພາຣາມິເຕີໃນ URL "
"ໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບ HTTP request. ເບິ່ງ [method uri_encode] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var url = \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot%20Engine%3%docs\"\n"
"print(url.uri_decode()) # ພິມ \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot Engine:docs\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var url = \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot%20Engine%3%docs\"\n"
"GD.Print(url.URIDecode()) // ພິມ \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot Engine:docs\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຖອດລະຫັດ [code]+[/code] ໃຫ້ເປັນຍະຫວ່າງ."

msgid ""
"Encodes the string to URL-friendly format. This method is meant to properly "
"encode the parameters in a URL when sending an HTTP request. See also [method "
"uri_decode].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var prefix = \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=\"\n"
"var url = prefix + \"Godot Engine:docs\".uri_encode()\n"
"\n"
"print(url) # Prints \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot%20Engine%3%docs\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var prefix = \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=\";\n"
"var url = prefix + \"Godot Engine:docs\".URIEncode();\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(url); // Prints \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot%20Engine%3%docs\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າລະຫັດຂໍ້ຄວາມໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ເປັນມິດກັບ URL. ເມທອດນີ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເຂົ້າລະຫັດພາຣາມິເຕີໃນ URL "
"ໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງເມື່ອສົ່ງ HTTP request. ເບິ່ງ [method uri_decode] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var prefix = \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=\"\n"
"var url = prefix + \"Godot Engine:docs\".uri_encode()\n"
"\n"
"print(url) # ພິມ \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot%20Engine%3%docs\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var prefix = \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=\";\n"
"var url = prefix + \"Godot Engine:docs\".URIEncode();\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(url); // ພິມ \"$DOCS_URL/?highlight=Godot%20Engine%3%docs\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Decodes the file path from its URL-encoded format. Unlike [method uri_decode] "
"this method leaves [code]+[/code] as is."
msgstr ""
"ຖອດລະຫັດເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ຈາກຮູບແບບ URL-encoded. ບໍ່ຄືກັບ [method uri_decode], ເມທອດນີ້ຈະປ່ອຍ "
"[code]+[/code] ໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with all characters that are not allowed in "
"[method is_valid_filename] replaced with underscores."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສຳເນົາຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍປ່ຽນຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດທີ່ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃນ [method is_valid_filename] "
"ໃຫ້ເປັນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with all characters that are not allowed in "
"[member Node.name] ([code].[/code] [code]:[/code] [code]@[/code] [code]/[/"
"code] [code]\"[/code] [code]%[/code]) replaced with underscores."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສຳເນົາຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍປ່ຽນຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດທີ່ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃນ [member Node.name] ([code].[/"
"code] [code]:[/code] [code]@[/code] [code]/[/code] [code]\"[/code] [code]%[/"
"code]) ໃຫ້ເປັນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with special characters escaped using the XML "
"standard. If [param escape_quotes] is [code]true[/code], the single quote "
"([code]'[/code]) and double quote ([code]\"[/code]) characters are also "
"escaped."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສຳເນົາຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຕົວອັກສອນພິເສດຖືກໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ escape ຕາມມາດຕະຖານ XML. ຖ້າ [param "
"escape_quotes] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວອັກສອນຝົນທອງ ([code]'[/code]) ແລະ ໝາຍຫູໜູ "
"([code]\"[/code]) ຈະຖືກ escape ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the string with escaped characters replaced by their "
"meanings according to the XML standard."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສຳເນົາຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍປ່ຽນຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຖືກ escape ໃຫ້ກັບມາເປັນຄວາມໝາຍເດີມຕາມມາດຕະຖານ XML."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if both strings do not contain the same sequence of "
"characters."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າທັງສອງຂໍ້ຄວາມບໍ່ມີລຳດັບຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຄືກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [String] is not equivalent to the given "
"[StringName]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [String] ນີ້ບໍ່ເທົ່າກັບ [StringName] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Formats the [String], replacing the placeholders with one or more parameters. "
"To pass multiple parameters, [param right] needs to be an [Array].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"I caught %d fishes!\" % 2) # Prints \"I caught 2 fishes!\"\n"
"\n"
"var my_message = \"Travelling to %s, at %2.2f km/h.\"\n"
"var location = \"Deep Valley\"\n"
"var speed = 40.3485\n"
"print(my_message % [location, speed]) # Prints \"Travelling to Deep Valley, "
"at 40.35 km/h.\"\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"For more information, see the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/"
"gdscript_format_string.html]GDScript format strings[/url] tutorial.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, this operator is not available. Instead, see [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/tokens/"
"interpolated]how to interpolate strings with \"$\"[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດຮູບແບບ [String], ໂດຍປ່ຽນແທນຕົວຈອງທີ່ (placeholders) ດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍຕົວ. "
"ເພື່ອສົ່ງຫຼາຍພາຣາມິເຕີ, [param right] ຕ້ອງເປັນ [Array].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"I caught %d fishes!\" % 2) # ພິມ \"I caught 2 fishes!\"\n"
"\n"
"var my_message = \"Travelling to %s, at %2.2f km/h.\"\n"
"var location = \"Deep Valley\"\n"
"var speed = 40.3485\n"
"print(my_message % [location, speed]) # ພິມ \"Travelling to Deep Valley, at "
"40.35 km/h.\"\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງບົດຮຽນ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/"
"gdscript_format_string.html]GDScript format strings[/url].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ C#, ຕົວດຳເນີນການນີ້ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ແທນນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/tokens/"
"interpolated]ວິທີແຊກຕົວແປໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍ \"$\"[/url]."

msgid ""
"Appends [param right] at the end of this [String], also known as a string "
"concatenation."
msgstr ""
"ຕໍ່ [param right] ໃສ່ທ້າຍ [String] ນີ້, ຫຼື ເອີ້ນວ່າການເຊື່ອມຂໍ້ຄວາມ (string concatenation)."

msgid ""
"Appends [param right] at the end of this [String], returning a [String]. This "
"is also known as a string concatenation."
msgstr ""
"ຕໍ່ [param right] ໃສ່ທ້າຍ [String] ນີ້ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນເປັນ [String]. ອັນນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າການເຊື່ອມຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [String] comes before [param right] in "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode order[/"
"url], which roughly matches the alphabetical order. Useful for sorting."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [String] ທາງຊ້າຍມາກ່ອນ [param right] ຕາມ [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]ລຳດັບ Unicode[/url], "
"ເຊິ່ງໃກ້ຄຽງກັບລຳດັບຕົວອັກສອນ. ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຈັດລຳດັບ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [String] comes before [param right] in "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode order[/"
"url], which roughly matches the alphabetical order, or if both are equal."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [String] ທາງຊ້າຍມາກ່ອນ [param right] ຕາມ [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]ລຳດັບ Unicode[/url], ຫຼື "
"ຖ້າທັງສອງເທົ່າກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if both strings contain the same sequence of "
"characters."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າທັງສອງຂໍ້ຄວາມມີລຳດັບຕົວອັກສອນຄືກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [String] is equivalent to the given "
"[StringName]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [String] ນີ້ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [StringName] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [String] comes after [param right] in "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode order[/"
"url], which roughly matches the alphabetical order. Useful for sorting."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [String] ທາງຊ້າຍມາຫຼັງ [param right] ຕາມ [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]ລຳດັບ Unicode[/url]. "
"ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຈັດລຳດັບ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [String] comes after [param right] in "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode order[/"
"url], which roughly matches the alphabetical order, or if both are equal."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [String] ທາງຊ້າຍມາຫຼັງ [param right] ຕາມ [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]ລຳດັບ Unicode[/url], ຫຼື "
"ຖ້າທັງສອງເທົ່າກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns a new [String] that only contains the character at [param index]. "
"Indices start from [code]0[/code]. If [param index] is greater or equal to "
"[code]0[/code], the character is fetched starting from the beginning of the "
"string. If [param index] is a negative value, it is fetched starting from the "
"end. Accessing a string out-of-bounds will cause a run-time error, pausing "
"the project execution if run from the editor."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [String] ໃໝ່ທີ່ມີພຽງຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ດັດສະນີ [param index]. ດັດສະນີເລີ່ມຈາກ [code]0[/code]. "
"ຖ້າ [param index] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ [code]0[/code], ຈະດຶງຕົວອັກສອນເລີ່ມຈາກຕົ້ນຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຖ້າ "
"[param index] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ຈະດຶງເລີ່ມຈາກທ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ການເຂົ້າເຖິງດັດສະນີທີ່ເກີນຂອບເຂດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ "
"run-time error ແລະ ຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງໂປຣເຈັກຖ້າລັນຈາກ editor."

msgid "A built-in type for unique strings."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນໃນໂຕ (built-in type) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ (unique strings)."

msgid ""
"[StringName]s are immutable strings designed for general-purpose "
"representation of unique names (also called \"string interning\"). Two "
"[StringName]s with the same value are the same object. Comparing them is "
"extremely fast compared to regular [String]s.\n"
"You will usually pass a [String] to methods expecting a [StringName] and it "
"will be automatically converted (often at compile time), but in rare cases "
"you can construct a [StringName] ahead of time with the [StringName] "
"constructor or, in GDScript, the literal syntax [code]&\"example\"[/code]. "
"Manually constructing a [StringName] allows you to control when the "
"conversion from [String] occurs or to use the literal and prevent conversions "
"entirely.\n"
"See also [NodePath], which is a similar concept specifically designed to "
"store pre-parsed scene tree paths.\n"
"All of [String]'s methods are available in this class too. They convert the "
"[StringName] into a string, and they also return a string. This is highly "
"inefficient and should only be used if the string is desired.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, an explicit conversion to [code]System.String[/code] is "
"required to use the methods listed on this page. Use the [code]ToString()[/"
"code] method to cast a [StringName] to a string, and then use the equivalent "
"methods in [code]System.String[/code] or [code]StringExtensions[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a [StringName] will evaluate to "
"[code]false[/code] if it is empty ([code]StringName(\"\")[/code]). Otherwise, "
"a [StringName] will always evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"[StringName] ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ (immutable) ເຊິ່ງຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ແທນຊື່ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ "
"(ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"string interning\"). [StringName] ສອງອັນທີ່ມີຄ່າຄືກັນຈະຖືວ່າເປັນ object ດຽວກັນ. "
"ການປຽບທຽບພວກມັນຈະໄວຫຼາຍເມື່ອທຽບກັບ [String] ທຳມະດາ.\n"
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ທ່ານຈະສົ່ງ [String] ໃຫ້ກັບເມທອດທີ່ຕ້ອງການ [StringName] ແລະ "
"ມັນຈະຖືກແປງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນໃນຕອນ compile), ແຕ່ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ "
"[StringName] ໄວ້ກ່ອນໄດ້ດ້ວຍ constructor [StringName] ຫຼື ໃນ GDScript ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ syntax "
"[code]&\"example\"[/code]. ການສ້າງ [StringName] "
"ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຄວບຄຸມເວລາທີ່ຈະແປງຈາກ [String] ໄດ້ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ literal "
"ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການແປງ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [NodePath] ນຳ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນແນວຄວາມຄິດທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນແຕ່ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອເກັບເສັ້ນທາງ scene tree "
"ທີ່ຖືກແຍກສ່ວນແລ້ວ.\n"
"ເມທອດທັງໝົດຂອງ [String] ກໍສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນຄລາສນີ້ຄືກັນ. ພວກມັນຈະແປງ [StringName] ໃຫ້ເປັນ "
"string ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເປັນ string. ອັນນີ້ບໍ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍ ແລະ ຄວນໃຊ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງການ string "
"ແທ້ໆເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ C#, ຕ້ອງແປງເປັນ [code]System.String[/code] "
"ກ່ອນຈຶ່ງຈະໃຊ້ເມທອດທີ່ລະບຸໃນໜ້ານີ້ໄດ້. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມທອດ [code]ToString()[/code] ເພື່ອ cast "
"[StringName] ເປັນ string.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນບໍລິບົດ boolean, [StringName] ຈະເປັນ [code]false[/code] ຖ້າມັນວ່າງ "
"([code]StringName(\"\")[/code]). ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid "Constructs an empty [StringName]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [StringName] ທີ່ວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid "Constructs a [StringName] as a copy of the given [StringName]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [StringName] ໂດຍສຳເນົາມາຈາກ [StringName] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [StringName] from the given [String]. In GDScript, "
"[code]StringName(\"example\")[/code] is equivalent to [code]&\"example\"[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [StringName] ໃໝ່ຈາກ [String] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ໃນ GDScript, "
"[code]StringName(\"example\")[/code] ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [code]&\"example\"[/code]."

msgid ""
"Changes the appearance of the string: replaces underscores ([code]_[/code]) "
"with spaces, adds spaces before uppercase letters in the middle of a word, "
"converts all letters to lowercase, then converts the first one and each one "
"following a space to uppercase.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"\"move_local_x\".capitalize()   # Returns \"Move Local X\"\n"
"\"sceneFile_path\".capitalize() # Returns \"Scene File Path\"\n"
"\"2D, FPS, PNG\".capitalize()   # Returns \"2d, Fps, Png\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"\"move_local_x\".Capitalize();   // Returns \"Move Local X\"\n"
"\"sceneFile_path\".Capitalize(); // Returns \"Scene File Path\"\n"
"\"2D, FPS, PNG\".Capitalize();   // Returns \"2d, Fps, Png\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນຮູບແບບຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ: ປ່ຽນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດກ້ອງ ([code]_[/code]) ເປັນຍະຫວ່າງ, "
"ໃສ່ຍະຫວ່າງກ່ອນຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ທີ່ຢູ່ກາງຄຳ, ແປງທຸກຕົວອັກສອນເປັນຕົວພິມນ້ອຍ, ຈາກນັ້ນແປງຕົວທຳອິດ ແລະ "
"ຕົວທີ່ຕາມຫຼັງຍະຫວ່າງໃຫ້ເປັນຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"\"move_local_x\".capitalize()   # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"Move Local X\"\n"
"\"sceneFile_path\".capitalize() # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"Scene File Path\"\n"
"\"2D, FPS, PNG\".capitalize()   # ສົ່ງຄືນ \"2d, Fps, Png\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"\"move_local_x\".Capitalize();   // ສົ່ງຄືນ \"Move Local X\"\n"
"\"sceneFile_path\".Capitalize(); // ສົ່ງຄືນ \"Scene File Path\"\n"
"\"2D, FPS, PNG\".Capitalize();   // ສົ່ງຄືນ \"2d, Fps, Png\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Performs a case-sensitive comparison to another string. Returns [code]-1[/"
"code] if less than, [code]1[/code] if greater than, or [code]0[/code] if "
"equal. \"Less than\" and \"greater than\" are determined by the [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode code points[/url] of "
"each string, which roughly matches the alphabetical order.\n"
"With different string lengths, returns [code]1[/code] if this string is "
"longer than the [param to] string, or [code]-1[/code] if shorter. Note that "
"the length of empty strings is [i]always[/i] [code]0[/code].\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method nocasecmp_to], [method filecasecmp_to], "
"and [method naturalcasecmp_to]."
msgstr ""
"ທຳການປຽບທຽບແບບສົນໃຈຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ພິມນ້ອຍກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມອື່ນ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]-1[/code] ຖ້ານ້ອຍກວ່າ, "
"[code]1[/code] ຖ້າຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ຫຼື [code]0[/code] ຖ້າເທົ່າກັນ. \"ນ້ອຍກວ່າ\" ແລະ \"ຫຼາຍກວ່າ\" "
"ແມ່ນກຳນົດໂດຍ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode code points[/url].\n"
"ຖ້າຄວາມຍາວຕ່າງກັນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]1[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ຍາວກວ່າ [param to], ຫຼື [code]-1[/"
"code] ຖ້າສັ້ນກວ່າ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຄວາມຍາວຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງແມ່ນ [code]0[/code] ສະເໝີ.\n"
"ເພື່ອເອົາຜົນເປັນ [bool], ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການ [code]==[/code] ແທນ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"nocasecmp_to], [method filecasecmp_to], ແລະ [method naturalcasecmp_to] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Splits the string using a [param delimiter] and returns the substring at "
"index [param slice]. Returns the original string if [param delimiter] does "
"not occur in the string. Returns an empty string if the [param slice] does "
"not exist.\n"
"This is faster than [method split], if you only need one substring.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"i/am/example/hi\".get_slice(\"/\", 2)) # Prints \"example\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ແຍກຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍໃຊ້ [param delimiter] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມຍ່ອຍທີ່ດັດສະນີ [param slice]. "
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມເດີມຖ້າບໍ່ພົບ [param delimiter]. ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param slice].\n"
"ອັນນີ້ໄວກວ່າ [method split] ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການພຽງແຕ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມຍ່ອຍດຽວ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"i/am/example/hi\".get_slice(\"/\", 2)) # ພິມ \"example\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the total number of slices when the string is split with the given "
"[param delimiter] (see [method split])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຕ່ອນ (slices) ທັງໝົດເມື່ອແຍກຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍ [param delimiter] (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"split])."

msgid ""
"Splits the string using a Unicode character with code [param delimiter] and "
"returns the substring at index [param slice]. Returns an empty string if the "
"[param slice] does not exist.\n"
"This is faster than [method split], if you only need one substring."
msgstr ""
"ແຍກຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ທີ່ມີລະຫັດ [param delimiter] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມຍ່ອຍທີ່ດັດສະນີ "
"[param slice]. ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [param slice]."

msgid ""
"Performs a [b]case-sensitive[/b], [i]natural order[/i] comparison to another "
"string. Returns [code]-1[/code] if less than, [code]1[/code] if greater than, "
"or [code]0[/code] if equal. \"Less than\" or \"greater than\" are determined "
"by the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Unicode_characters]Unicode "
"code points[/url] of each string, which roughly matches the alphabetical "
"order.\n"
"When used for sorting, natural order comparison orders sequences of numbers "
"by the combined value of each digit as is often expected, instead of the "
"single digit's value. A sorted sequence of numbered strings will be [code]"
"[\"1\", \"2\", \"3\", ...][/code], not [code][\"1\", \"10\", \"2\", "
"\"3\", ...][/code].\n"
"With different string lengths, returns [code]1[/code] if this string is "
"longer than the [param to] string, or [code]-1[/code] if shorter. Note that "
"the length of empty strings is [i]always[/i] [code]0[/code].\n"
"To get a [bool] result from a string comparison, use the [code]==[/code] "
"operator instead. See also [method naturalnocasecmp_to], [method "
"filecasecmp_to], and [method nocasecmp_to]."
msgstr ""
"ທຳການປຽບທຽບແບບ [b]ສົນໃຈຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ພິມນ້ອຍ[/b] ແລະ [i]ລຳດັບແບບທຳມະຊາດ[/i] ກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມອື່ນ. "
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]-1[/code] ຖ້ານ້ອຍກວ່າ, [code]1[/code] ຖ້າຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ຫຼື [code]0[/code] "
"ຖ້າເທົ່າກັນ.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຈັດລຳດັບ, ການປຽບທຽບແບບທຳມະຊາດຈະຈັດລຳດັບຕົວເລກຕາມຄ່າລວມຂອງແຕ່ລະຫຼັກ. "
"ລຳດັບທີ່ຈັດແລ້ວຈະເປັນ [code][\"1\", \"2\", \"3\", ...][/code].\n"
"ຖ້າຄວາມຍາວຕ່າງກັນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]1[/code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ຍາວກວ່າ [param to], ຫຼື [code]-1[/"
"code] ຖ້າສັ້ນກວ່າ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຄວາມຍາວຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງແມ່ນ [code]0[/code] ສະເໝີ.\n"
"ເພື່ອເອົາຜົນເປັນ [bool], ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການ [code]==[/code] ແທນ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"naturalnocasecmp_to], [method filecasecmp_to], ແລະ [method nocasecmp_to] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Performs a [b]case-insensitive[/b], [i]natural order[/i] comparison to "
"another string. Returns [code]-1[/code] if less than, [code]1[/code] if "
"greater than, or [code]0[/code] if equal. \"Less than\" or \"greater than\" "
