"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເວກເຕີທີ່ມີສ່ວນປະກອບເປັນ [constant @GDScript.NAN] "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີພຶດຕິກຳຄືກັບເວກເຕີອື່ນໆ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈາກຕົວດຳເນີນການນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຖ້າມີ NaNs ປົນຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Access vector components using their [param index]. [code]v[0][/code] is "
"equivalent to [code]v.x[/code], [code]v[1][/code] is equivalent to [code]v.y[/"
"code], [code]v[2][/code] is equivalent to [code]v.z[/code], and [code]v[3][/"
"code] is equivalent to [code]v.w[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າເຖິງສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງເວກເຕີໂດຍໃຊ້ [param index]. [code]v[0][/code] ແມ່ນທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[code]v.x[/code], [code]v[1][/code] ແມ່ນ [code]v.y[/code], [code]v[2][/code] "
"ແມ່ນ [code]v.z[/code], ແລະ [code]v[3][/code] ແມ່ນ [code]v.w[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the negative value of the [Vector4]. This is the same as writing "
"[code]Vector4(-v.x, -v.y, -v.z, -v.w)[/code]. This operation flips the "
"direction of the vector while keeping the same magnitude. With floats, the "
"number zero can be either positive or negative."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າລົບຂອງ [Vector4]. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບການຂຽນ [code]Vector4(-v.x, -v.y, -v.z, -v.w)[/"
"code]. ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ຈະກັບຄືນທິດທາງຂອງເວກເຕີໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາຂະໜາດເທົ່າເດີມ. "
"ສຳລັບເລກທົດສະນິຍົມລອຍ, ເລກສູນສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງບວກ ຫຼື ລົບ."

msgid "A 4D vector using integer coordinates."
msgstr "ເວກເຕີ 4D ທີ່ໃຊ້ພິກັດເປັນເລກຖ້ວນ."

msgid ""
"A 4-element structure that can be used to represent 4D grid coordinates or "
"any other quadruplet of integers.\n"
"It uses integer coordinates and is therefore preferable to [Vector4] when "
"exact precision is required. Note that the values are limited to 32 bits, and "
"unlike [Vector4] this cannot be configured with an engine build option. Use "
"[int] or [PackedInt64Array] if 64-bit values are needed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a Vector4i will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if it's equal to [code]Vector4i(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code]. Otherwise, a "
"Vector4i will always evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ມີ 4 ສ່ວນປະກອບ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງພິກັດຕາໜ່າງ 4D ຫຼື ກຸ່ມຂອງເລກຖ້ວນ 4 ຄ່າອື່ນໆ.\n"
"ມັນໃຊ້ພິກັດເປັນເລກຖ້ວນ ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງດີກວ່າ [Vector4] ເມື່ອຕ້ອງການຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳສູງສຸດ. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຄ່າຕ່າງໆຖືກຈຳກັດຢູ່ທີ່ 32 ບິດ, ແລະບໍ່ຄືກັບ [Vector4] ທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຜ່ານຕົວເລືອກການບິວ "
"(build option) ຂອງເອນຈິນໄດ້. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [int] ຫຼື [PackedInt64Array] ຖ້າຕ້ອງການຄ່າ 64 ບິດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງບູລີນ (boolean), Vector4i ຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ຖ້າມັນເທົ່າກັບ [code]Vector4i(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, Vector4i ຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Constructs a default-initialized [Vector4i] with all components set to "
"[code]0[/code]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Vector4i] ທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ໂດຍທຸກສ່ວນປະກອບຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/code]."

msgid "Constructs a [Vector4i] as a copy of the given [Vector4i]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Vector4i] ໂດຍການສຳເນົາຈາກ [Vector4i] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Constructs a new [Vector4i] from the given [Vector4] by truncating "
"components' fractional parts (rounding towards zero). For a different "
"behavior consider passing the result of [method Vector4.ceil], [method "
"Vector4.floor] or [method Vector4.round] to this constructor instead."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Vector4i] ໃໝ່ຈາກ [Vector4] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ ໂດຍການຕັດສ່ວນທົດສະນິຍົມອອກ (ປັດເຂົ້າຫາສູນ). "
"ສຳລັບພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ຕ່າງອອກໄປ ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາສົ່ງຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຂອງ [method Vector4.ceil], [method "
"Vector4.floor] ຫຼື [method Vector4.round] ໃຫ້ກັບຄອນສະຕຣັກເຕີ (constructor) ນີ້ແທນ."

msgid "Returns a [Vector4i] with the given components."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Vector4i] ດ້ວຍສ່ວນປະກອບທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the component-wise maximum of this and [param with], equivalent to "
"[code]Vector4i(maxi(x, with.x), maxi(y, with.y), maxi(z, with.z), maxi(w, "
"with.w))[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສູງສຸດຕາມແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບລະຫວ່າງເວກເຕີນີ້ ແລະ [param with], ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[code]Vector4i(maxi(x, with.x), maxi(y, with.y), maxi(z, with.z), maxi(w, "
"with.w))[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the component-wise maximum of this and [param with], equivalent to "
"[code]Vector4i(maxi(x, with), maxi(y, with), maxi(z, with), maxi(w, with))[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສູງສຸດຕາມແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບລະຫວ່າງເວກເຕີນີ້ ແລະ [param with], ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[code]Vector4i(maxi(x, with), maxi(y, with), maxi(z, with), maxi(w, with))[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the component-wise minimum of this and [param with], equivalent to "
"[code]Vector4i(mini(x, with.x), mini(y, with.y), mini(z, with.z), mini(w, "
"with.w))[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດຕາມແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບລະຫວ່າງເວກເຕີນີ້ ແລະ [param with], ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[code]Vector4i(mini(x, with.x), mini(y, with.y), mini(z, with.z), mini(w, "
"with.w))[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the component-wise minimum of this and [param with], equivalent to "
"[code]Vector4i(mini(x, with), mini(y, with), mini(z, with), mini(w, with))[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດຕາມແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບລະຫວ່າງເວກເຕີນີ້ ແລະ [param with], ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[code]Vector4i(mini(x, with), mini(y, with), mini(z, with), mini(w, with))[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Min vector, a vector with all components equal to [code]INT32_MIN[/code]. Can "
"be used as a negative integer equivalent of [constant Vector4.INF]."
msgstr ""
"ເວກເຕີຕ່ຳສຸດ, ແມ່ນເວກເຕີທີ່ທຸກສ່ວນປະກອບເທົ່າກັບ [code]INT32_MIN[/code]. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າເລກຖ້ວນລົບທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [constant Vector4.INF]."

msgid ""
"Max vector, a vector with all components equal to [code]INT32_MAX[/code]. Can "
"be used as an integer equivalent of [constant Vector4.INF]."
msgstr ""
"ເວກເຕີສູງສຸດ, ແມ່ນເວກເຕີທີ່ທຸກສ່ວນປະກອບເທົ່າກັບ [code]INT32_MAX[/code]. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [constant Vector4.INF]."

msgid ""
"Gets the remainder of each component of the [Vector4i] with the components of "
"the given [Vector4i]. This operation uses truncated division, which is often "
"not desired as it does not work well with negative numbers. Consider using "
"[method @GlobalScope.posmod] instead if you want to handle negative numbers.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector4i(10, -20, 30, -40) % Vector4i(7, 8, 9, 10)) # Prints (3, -4, 3, "
"0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຊອກຫາສ່ວນເສດ (remainder) ຂອງແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4i] ກັບສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ "
"[Vector4i] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ໃຊ້ການຫານແບບຕັດເສດ (truncated division), "
"ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະບໍ່ເປັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພາະມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ບໍ່ດີກັບເລກລົບ. ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [method "
"@GlobalScope.posmod] ແທນ ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການກັບເລກລົບ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector4i(10, -20, 30, -40) % Vector4i(7, 8, 9, 10)) # ຈະສະແດງ (3, -4, "
"3, 0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Gets the remainder of each component of the [Vector4i] with the given [int]. "
"This operation uses truncated division, which is often not desired as it does "
"not work well with negative numbers. Consider using [method "
"@GlobalScope.posmod] instead if you want to handle negative numbers.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector4i(10, -20, 30, -40) % 7) # Prints (3, -6, 2, -5)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຊອກຫາສ່ວນເສດ (remainder) ຂອງແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4i] ກັບເລກຖ້ວນ [int] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. "
"ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ໃຊ້ການຫານແບບຕັດເສດ (truncated division), "
"ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະບໍ່ເປັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພາະມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ບໍ່ດີກັບເລກລົບ. ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [method "
"@GlobalScope.posmod] ແທນ ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການກັບເລກລົບ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector4i(10, -20, 30, -40) % 7) # ຈະສະແດງ (3, -6, 2, -5)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Vector4i] by the components of the given "
"[Vector4i].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector4i(10, 20, 30, 40) * Vector4i(3, 4, 5, 6)) # Prints (30, 80, 150, "
"240)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4i] ດ້ວຍສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4i] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector4i(10, 20, 30, 40) * Vector4i(3, 4, 5, 6)) # ຈະສະແດງ (30, 80, "
"150, 240)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Vector4i] by the given [float].\n"
"Returns a Vector4 value due to floating-point operations.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector4i(10, 20, 30, 40) * 2) # Prints (20.0, 40.0, 60.0, 80.0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4i] ດ້ວຍຄ່າ [float] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນເປັນຄ່າ Vector4 ເນື່ອງຈາກເປັນການດຳເນີນການກັບເລກທົດສະນິຍົມລອຍ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector4i(10, 20, 30, 40) * 2) # ຈະສະແດງ (20.0, 40.0, 60.0, 80.0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Vector4i] by the given [int]."
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4i] ດ້ວຍເລກຖ້ວນ [int] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Adds each component of the [Vector4i] by the components of the given "
"[Vector4i].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector4i(10, 20, 30, 40) + Vector4i(3, 4, 5, 6)) # Prints (13, 24, 35, "
"46)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ບວກແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4i] ດ້ວຍສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4i] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector4i(10, 20, 30, 40) + Vector4i(3, 4, 5, 6)) # ຈະສະແດງ (13, 24, 35, "
"46)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Subtracts each component of the [Vector4i] by the components of the given "
"[Vector4i].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector4i(10, 20, 30, 40) - Vector4i(3, 4, 5, 6)) # Prints (7, 16, 25, "
"34)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ລົບແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4i] ດ້ວຍສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4i] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector4i(10, 20, 30, 40) - Vector4i(3, 4, 5, 6)) # ຈະສະແດງ (7, 16, 25, "
"34)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Divides each component of the [Vector4i] by the components of the given "
"[Vector4i].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector4i(10, 20, 30, 40) / Vector4i(2, 5, 3, 4)) # Prints (5, 4, 10, "
"10)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຫານແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4i] ດ້ວຍສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4i] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector4i(10, 20, 30, 40) / Vector4i(2, 5, 3, 4)) # ຈະສະແດງ (5, 4, 10, "
"10)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Divides each component of the [Vector4i] by the given [float].\n"
"Returns a Vector4 value due to floating-point operations.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector4i(1, 2, 3, 4) / 2.5) # Prints (0.4, 0.8, 1.2, 1.6)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຫານແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4i] ດ້ວຍຄ່າ [float] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນເປັນຄ່າ Vector4 ເນື່ອງຈາກເປັນການດຳເນີນການກັບເລກທົດສະນິຍົມລອຍ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(Vector4i(1, 2, 3, 4) / 2.5) # ຈະສະແດງ (0.4, 0.8, 1.2, 1.6)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Divides each component of the [Vector4i] by the given [int]."
msgstr "ຫານແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4i] ດ້ວຍເລກຖ້ວນ [int] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Compares two [Vector4i] vectors by first checking if the X value of the left "
"vector is less than the X value of the [param right] vector. If the X values "
"are exactly equal, then it repeats this check with the Y values of the two "
"vectors, Z values of the two vectors, and then with the W values. This "
"operator is useful for sorting vectors."
msgstr ""
"ປຽບທຽບເວກເຕີ [Vector4i] ສອງອັນ ໂດຍເລີ່ມກວດສອບວ່າຄ່າ X ຂອງເວກເຕີເບື້ອງຊ້າຍໜ້ອຍກວ່າຄ່າ X "
"ຂອງເວກເຕີ [param right] ຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າຄ່າ X ເທົ່າກັນພໍດີ, ມັນຈະເຮັດການກວດສອບຄືນໃໝ່ກັບຄ່າ Y, "
"ຈາກນັ້ນຄ່າ Z, ແລະ ສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນຄ່າ W. ຕົວດຳເນີນການນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຈັດລຽງເວກເຕີ."

msgid ""
"Compares two [Vector4i] vectors by first checking if the X value of the left "
"vector is less than or equal to the X value of the [param right] vector. If "
"the X values are exactly equal, then it repeats this check with the Y values "
"of the two vectors, Z values of the two vectors, and then with the W values. "
"This operator is useful for sorting vectors."
msgstr ""
"ປຽບທຽບເວກເຕີ [Vector4i] ສອງອັນ ໂດຍເລີ່ມກວດສອບວ່າຄ່າ X ຂອງເວກເຕີເບື້ອງຊ້າຍໜ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ "
"ຄ່າ X ຂອງເວກເຕີ [param right] ຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າຄ່າ X ເທົ່າກັນພໍດີ, ມັນຈະເຮັດການກວດສອບຄືນໃໝ່ກັບຄ່າ Y, "
"ຈາກນັ້ນຄ່າ Z, ແລະ ສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນຄ່າ W. ຕົວດຳເນີນການນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຈັດລຽງເວກເຕີ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the vectors are exactly equal."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເວກເຕີມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັນພໍດີ."

msgid ""
"Compares two [Vector4i] vectors by first checking if the X value of the left "
"vector is greater than the X value of the [param right] vector. If the X "
"values are exactly equal, then it repeats this check with the Y values of the "
"two vectors, Z values of the two vectors, and then with the W values. This "
"operator is useful for sorting vectors."
msgstr ""
"ປຽບທຽບເວກເຕີ [Vector4i] ສອງອັນ ໂດຍເລີ່ມກວດສອບວ່າຄ່າ X ຂອງເວກເຕີເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຫຼາຍກວ່າຄ່າ X "
"ຂອງເວກເຕີ [param right] ຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າຄ່າ X ເທົ່າກັນພໍດີ, ມັນຈະເຮັດການກວດສອບຄືນໃໝ່ກັບຄ່າ Y, "
"ຈາກນັ້ນຄ່າ Z, ແລະ ສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນຄ່າ W. ຕົວດຳເນີນການນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຈັດລຽງເວກເຕີ."

msgid ""
"Compares two [Vector4i] vectors by first checking if the X value of the left "
"vector is greater than or equal to the X value of the [param right] vector. "
"If the X values are exactly equal, then it repeats this check with the Y "
"values of the two vectors, Z values of the two vectors, and then with the W "
"values. This operator is useful for sorting vectors."
msgstr ""
"ປຽບທຽບເວກເຕີ [Vector4i] ສອງອັນ ໂດຍເລີ່ມກວດສອບວ່າຄ່າ X ຂອງເວກເຕີເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ "
"ຄ່າ X ຂອງເວກເຕີ [param right] ຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າຄ່າ X ເທົ່າກັນພໍດີ, ມັນຈະເຮັດການກວດສອບຄືນໃໝ່ກັບຄ່າ Y, "
"ຈາກນັ້ນຄ່າ Z, ແລະ ສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນຄ່າ W. ຕົວດຳເນີນການນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຈັດລຽງເວກເຕີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the negative value of the [Vector4i]. This is the same as writing "
"[code]Vector4i(-v.x, -v.y, -v.z, -v.w)[/code]. This operation flips the "
"direction of the vector while keeping the same magnitude."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າລົບຂອງ [Vector4i]. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບການຂຽນ [code]Vector4i(-v.x, -v.y, -v.z, -v.w)"
"[/code]. ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ຈະກັບຄືນທິດທາງຂອງເວກເຕີໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາຂະໜາດເທົ່າເດີມ."

msgid "A 3D physics body that simulates the behavior of a car."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 3D ທີ່ຈຳລອງພຶດຕິກຳຂອງລົດ."

msgid ""
"This physics body implements all the physics logic needed to simulate a car. "
"It is based on the raycast vehicle system commonly found in physics engines. "
"Aside from a [CollisionShape3D] for the main body of the vehicle, you must "
"also add a [VehicleWheel3D] node for each wheel. You should also add a "
"[MeshInstance3D] to this node for the 3D model of the vehicle, but this model "
"should generally not include meshes for the wheels. You can control the "
"vehicle by using the [member brake], [member engine_force], and [member "
"steering] properties. The position or orientation of this node shouldn't be "
"changed directly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The local forward for this node is [constant "
"Vector3.MODEL_FRONT].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The origin point of your VehicleBody3D will determine the center "
"of gravity of your vehicle. To make the vehicle more grounded, the origin "
"point is usually kept low, moving the [CollisionShape3D] and [MeshInstance3D] "
"upwards.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class has known issues and isn't designed to provide "
"realistic 3D vehicle physics. If you want advanced vehicle physics, you may "
"have to write your own physics integration using [CharacterBody3D] or "
"[RigidBody3D]."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກນີ້ຈະປະຕິບັດຕາມທຸກຕັກກະທາງຟີຊິກທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຈຳລອງລົດ. ມັນອີງໃສ່ລະບົບພາຫະນະແບບ raycast "
"ທີ່ພົບເຫັນທົ່ວໄປໃນເອນຈິນຟີຊິກ. ນອກຈາກ [CollisionShape3D] ສຳລັບຕົວຖັງຫຼັກຂອງພາຫະນະແລ້ວ, "
"ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງເພີ່ມໂນດ [VehicleWheel3D] ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລໍ້. ທ່ານຄວນເພີ່ມ [MeshInstance3D] "
"ເຂົ້າໃນໂນດນີ້ສຳລັບໂມເດວ 3D ຂອງພາຫະນະ, ແຕ່ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວໂມເດວນີ້ບໍ່ຄວນລວມເອົາເມຊ (mesh) "
"ສຳລັບລໍ້. ທ່ານສາມາດຄວບຄຸມພາຫະນະໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member brake], [member "
"engine_force], ແລະ [member steering]. ຕຳແໜ່ງ ຫຼື ທິດທາງຂອງໂນດນີ້ບໍ່ຄວນຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍກົງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທິດທາງຂ້າງໜ້າທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບໂນດນີ້ແມ່ນ [constant Vector3.MODEL_FRONT].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຈຸດກຳເນີດ (origin point) ຂອງ VehicleBody3D "
"ຂອງທ່ານຈະເປັນຕົວກຳນົດຈຸດສູນກາງຖ່ວງ (center of gravity) ຂອງພາຫະນະ. "
"ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ພາຫະນະເກາະໜ້າດິນໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ, ຈຸດກຳເນີດມັກຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ຕ່ຳ, ໂດຍຍ້າຍ [CollisionShape3D] "
"ແລະ [MeshInstance3D] ຂຶ້ນໄປຂ້າງເທິງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຼາດ (class) ນີ້ມີບັນຫາທີ່ຮູ້ກັນຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ຟີຊິກພາຫະນະ 3D "
"ທີ່ສົມຈິງ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຟີຊິກພາຫະນະຂັ້ນສູງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຂຽນການລວມຟີຊິກຂອງທ່ານເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[CharacterBody3D] ຫຼື [RigidBody3D]."

msgid ""
"Slows down the vehicle by applying a braking force. The vehicle is only "
"slowed down if the wheels are in contact with a surface. The force you need "
"to apply to adequately slow down your vehicle depends on the [member "
"RigidBody3D.mass] of the vehicle. For a vehicle with a mass set to 1000, try "
"a value in the 25 - 30 range for hard braking."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ພາຫະນະຊ້າລົງໂດຍການໃຊ້ແຮງເບຣກ. ພາຫະນະຈະຊ້າລົງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອລໍ້ສຳຜັດກັບພື້ນຜິວ. "
"ແຮງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ພາຫະນະຊ້າລົງຢ່າງພຽງພໍນັ້ນຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບ [member RigidBody3D.mass] "
"ຂອງພາຫະນະ. ສຳລັບພາຫະນະທີ່ມີມວນສານຕັ້ງໄວ້ 1000, ໃຫ້ລອງໃຊ້ຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ 25 - 30 "
"ສຳລັບການເບຣກຢ່າງແຮງ."

msgid ""
"Accelerates the vehicle by applying an engine force. The vehicle is only sped "
"up if the wheels that have [member VehicleWheel3D.use_as_traction] set to "
"[code]true[/code] and are in contact with a surface. The [member "
"RigidBody3D.mass] of the vehicle has an effect on the acceleration of the "
"vehicle. For a vehicle with a mass set to 1000, try a value in the 25 - 50 "
"range for acceleration.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The simulation does not take the effect of gears into account, "
"you will need to add logic for this if you wish to simulate gears.\n"
"A negative value will result in the vehicle reversing."
msgstr ""
"ເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວຂອງພາຫະນະໂດຍການໃຊ້ແຮງຂັບເຄື່ອນຂອງຈັກ. ພາຫະນະຈະໄວຂຶ້ນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອລໍ້ທີ່ມີການຕັ້ງ [member "
"VehicleWheel3D.use_as_traction] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ສຳຜັດກັບພື້ນຜິວ. [member "
"RigidBody3D.mass] ຂອງພາຫະນະມີຜົນຕໍ່ການເລັ່ງຂອງພາຫະນະ. ສຳລັບພາຫະນະທີ່ມີມວນສານຕັ້ງໄວ້ 1000, "
"ໃຫ້ລອງໃຊ້ຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ 25 - 50 ສຳລັບການເລັ່ງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຈຳລອງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຄຳນຶງເຖິງຜົນກະທົບຂອງເກຍ, "
"ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຕັກກະສຳລັບເລື່ອງນີ້ເອງຖ້າຕ້ອງການຈຳລອງເກຍ.\n"
"ຄ່າລົບຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາຫະນະຖອຍຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"The steering angle for the vehicle. Setting this to a non-zero value will "
"result in the vehicle turning when it's moving. Wheels that have [member "
"VehicleWheel3D.use_as_steering] set to [code]true[/code] will automatically "
"be rotated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is edited in the inspector in degrees. In code the "
"property is set in radians."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມລ້ຽວສຳລັບພາຫະນະ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສູນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາຫະນະມີການລ້ຽວໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່. "
"ລໍ້ທີ່ມີການຕັ້ງ [member VehicleWheel3D.use_as_steering] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ຈະຖືກໝຸນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃນອິນສະເປັກເຕີ (inspector) ເປັນອົງສາ. ໃນໂຄ້ດ, "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນເຣດຽນ."

msgid ""
"A 3D physics body for a [VehicleBody3D] that simulates the behavior of a "
"wheel."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 3D ສຳລັບ [VehicleBody3D] ທີ່ຈຳລອງພຶດຕິກຳຂອງລໍ້."

msgid ""
"A node used as a child of a [VehicleBody3D] parent to simulate the behavior "
"of one of its wheels. This node also acts as a collider to detect if the "
"wheel is touching a surface.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class has known issues and isn't designed to provide "
"realistic 3D vehicle physics. If you want advanced vehicle physics, you may "
"need to write your own physics integration using another [PhysicsBody3D] "
"class."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນລູກຂອງ [VehicleBody3D] ເພື່ອຈຳລອງພຶດຕິກຳຂອງລໍ້ອັນໜຶ່ງ. ໂນດນີ້ຍັງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຕົວປະທະ "
"(collider) ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າລໍ້ກຳລັງສຳຜັດກັບພື້ນຜິວຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຼາດ (class) ນີ້ມີບັນຫາທີ່ຮູ້ກັນຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ຟີຊິກພາຫະນະ 3D "
"ທີ່ສົມຈິງ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຟີຊິກພາຫະນະຂັ້ນສູງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຂຽນການລວມຟີຊິກຂອງທ່ານເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຼາດ "
"[PhysicsBody3D] ອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the contacting body node if valid in the tree, as [Node3D]. At the "
"moment, [GridMap] is not supported so the node will be always of type "
"[PhysicsBody3D].\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if the wheel is not in contact with a surface, or "
"the contact body is not a [PhysicsBody3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໂນດຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ສຳຜັດ ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່ໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ໂນດ (tree), ເປັນ [Node3D]. ໃນເວລານີ້, [GridMap] "
"ຍັງບໍ່ທັນຖືກຮອງຮັບ ເທື່ອດັ່ງນັ້ນໂນດຈະເປັນປະເພດ [PhysicsBody3D] ສະເໝີ.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] ຖ້າລໍ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ສຳຜັດກັບພື້ນຜິວ, ຫຼື ວັດຖຸທີ່ສຳຜັດນັ້ນບໍ່ແມ່ນ [PhysicsBody3D]."

msgid ""
"Returns the normal of the suspension's collision in world space if the wheel "
"is in contact. If the wheel isn't in contact with anything, returns a vector "
"pointing directly along the suspension axis toward the vehicle in world space."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນຕັ້ງສາກ (normal) ຂອງການປະທະຂອງລະບົບກັນສະເທືອນໃນຊ່ອງວ່າງໂລກ (world space) "
"ຖ້າລໍ້ສຳຜັດຢູ່. ຖ້າລໍ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ສຳຜັດກັບສິ່ງໃດເລີຍ, "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນເວກເຕີທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຕາມແກນຂອງລະບົບກັນສະເທືອນໂດຍກົງຫາພາຫະນະໃນຊ່ອງວ່າງໂລກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the point of the suspension's collision in world space if the wheel "
"is in contact. If the wheel isn't in contact with anything, returns the "
"maximum point of the wheel's ray cast in world space, which is defined by "
"[code]wheel_rest_length + wheel_radius[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດປະທະຂອງລະບົບກັນສະເທືອນໃນຊ່ອງວ່າງໂລກ (world space) ຖ້າລໍ້ສຳຜັດຢູ່. "
"ຖ້າລໍ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ສຳຜັດກັບສິ່ງໃດເລີຍ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດສູງສຸດຂອງການສາຍລັງສີ (ray cast) ຂອງລໍ້ໃນຊ່ອງວ່າງໂລກ, "
"ເຊິ່ງກຳນົດໂດຍ [code]wheel_rest_length + wheel_radius[/code]."

msgid "Returns the rotational speed of the wheel in revolutions per minute."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມໄວໃນການໝຸນຂອງລໍ້ເປັນຮອບຕໍ່ນາທີ (revolutions per minute)."

msgid ""
"Returns a value between 0.0 and 1.0 that indicates whether this wheel is "
"skidding. 0.0 is skidding (the wheel has lost grip, e.g. icy terrain), 1.0 "
"means not skidding (the wheel has full grip, e.g. dry asphalt road)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 0.0 ຫາ 1.0 ທີ່ລະບຸວ່າລໍ້ນີ້ກຳລັງລື່ນ (skidding) ຫຼືບໍ່. 0.0 ແມ່ນກຳລັງລື່ນ "
"(ລໍ້ເສຍການເກາະໜ້າດິນ, ຕົວຢ່າງ: ພື້ນນ້ຳແຂງ), 1.0 ໝາຍເຖິງບໍ່ລື່ນ (ລໍ້ເກາະໜ້າດິນເຕັມທີ່, ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ຖະໜົນຢາງມະຕອຍທີ່ແຫ້ງ)."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if this wheel is in contact with a surface."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລໍ້ນີ້ກຳລັງສຳຜັດກັບພື້ນຜິວ."

msgid ""
"Slows down the wheel by applying a braking force. The wheel is only slowed "
"down if it is in contact with a surface. The force you need to apply to "
"adequately slow down your vehicle depends on the [member RigidBody3D.mass] of "
"the vehicle. For a vehicle with a mass set to 1000, try a value in the 25 - "
"30 range for hard braking."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ລໍ້ຊ້າລົງໂດຍການໃຊ້ແຮງເບຣກ. ລໍ້ຈະຊ້າລົງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມັນສຳຜັດກັບພື້ນຜິວ. "
"ແຮງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ພາຫະນະຊ້າລົງຢ່າງພຽງພໍນັ້ນຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບ [member RigidBody3D.mass] "
"ຂອງພາຫະນະ. ສຳລັບພາຫະນະທີ່ມີມວນສານຕັ້ງໄວ້ 1000, ໃຫ້ລອງໃຊ້ຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ 25 - 30 "
"ສຳລັບການເບຣກຢ່າງແຮງ."

msgid ""
"The damping applied to the suspension spring when being compressed, meaning "
"when the wheel is moving up relative to the vehicle. It is measured in Newton-"
"seconds per millimeter (N⋅s/mm), or megagrams per second (Mg/s). This value "
"should be between 0.0 (no damping) and 1.0, but may be more. A value of 0.0 "
"means the car will keep bouncing as the spring keeps its energy. A good value "
"for this is around 0.3 for a normal car, 0.5 for a race car."
msgstr ""
"ການໜ່ວງ (damping) ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບລະບົບກັນສະເທືອນເມື່ອຖືກບີບອັດ, ໝາຍເຖິງເມື່ອລໍ້ເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂຶ້ນເມື່ອທຽບກັບພາຫະນະ. "
"ມັນຖືກວັດແທກເປັນ ນິວເຕິນ-ວິນາທີ ຕໍ່ ມິນລິແມັດ (N⋅s/mm), ຫຼື ເມກາກຣາມ ຕໍ່ ວິນາທີ (Mg/s). "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຄວນຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 0.0 (ບໍ່ມີການໜ່ວງ) ຫາ 1.0, ແຕ່ອາດຈະຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ. ຄ່າ 0.0 "
"ໝາຍເຖິງລົດຈະເຕັ້ນໄປມາເລື້ອຍໆ ເນື່ອງຈາກສະປຣິງຍັງຄົງຮັກສາພະລັງງານໄວ້. ຄ່າທີ່ດີສຳລັບເລື່ອງນີ້ແມ່ນປະມານ "
"0.3 ສຳລັບລົດທົ່ວໄປ, 0.5 ສຳລັບລົດແຂ່ງ."

msgid ""
"The damping applied to the suspension spring when rebounding or extending, "
"meaning when the wheel is moving down relative to the vehicle. It is measured "
"in Newton-seconds per millimeter (N⋅s/mm), or megagrams per second (Mg/s). "
"This value should be between 0.0 (no damping) and 1.0, but may be more. This "
"value should always be slightly higher than the [member damping_compression] "
"property. For a [member damping_compression] value of 0.3, try a relaxation "
"value of 0.5."
msgstr ""
"ການໜ່ວງ (damping) ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບລະບົບກັນສະເທືອນເມື່ອຄາຍຕົວ ຫຼື ຢືດອອກ, "
"ໝາຍເຖິງເມື່ອລໍ້ເຄື່ອນທີ່ລົງເມື່ອທຽບກັບພາຫະນະ. ມັນຖືກວັດແທກເປັນ ນິວເຕິນ-ວິນາທີ ຕໍ່ ມິນລິແມັດ (N⋅s/mm), ຫຼື "
"ເມກາກຣາມ ຕໍ່ ວິນາທີ (Mg/s). ຄ່ານີ້ຄວນຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 0.0 (ບໍ່ມີການໜ່ວງ) ຫາ 1.0, ແຕ່ອາດຈະຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຄວນຈະສູງກວ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ [member damping_compression] ເລັກນ້ອຍສະເໝີ. ສຳລັບຄ່າ [member "
"damping_compression] ທີ່ 0.3, ໃຫ້ລອງໃຊ້ຄ່າການຄາຍຕົວທີ່ 0.5."

msgid ""
"Accelerates the wheel by applying an engine force. The wheel is only sped up "
"if it is in contact with a surface. The [member RigidBody3D.mass] of the "
"vehicle has an effect on the acceleration of the vehicle. For a vehicle with "
"a mass set to 1000, try a value in the 25 - 50 range for acceleration.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The simulation does not take the effect of gears into account, "
"you will need to add logic for this if you wish to simulate gears.\n"
"A negative value will result in the wheel reversing."
msgstr ""
"ເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວຂອງລໍ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ແຮງຂັບເຄື່ອນຂອງຈັກ. ລໍ້ຈະໄວຂຶ້ນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມັນສຳຜັດກັບພື້ນຜິວ. [member "
"RigidBody3D.mass] ຂອງພາຫະນະມີຜົນຕໍ່ການເລັ່ງຂອງພາຫະນະ. ສຳລັບພາຫະນະທີ່ມີມວນສານຕັ້ງໄວ້ 1000, "
"ໃຫ້ລອງໃຊ້ຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ 25 - 50 ສຳລັບການເລັ່ງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຈຳລອງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຄຳນຶງເຖິງຜົນກະທົບຂອງເກຍ, "
"ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຕັກກະສຳລັບເລື່ອງນີ້ເອງຖ້າຕ້ອງການຈຳລອງເກຍ.\n"
"ຄ່າລົບຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລໍ້ໝຸນຖອຍຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"The steering angle for the wheel, in radians. Setting this to a non-zero "
"value will result in the vehicle turning when it's moving."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມລ້ຽວສຳລັບລໍ້, ເປັນເຣດຽນ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສູນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາຫະນະມີການລ້ຽວໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່."

msgid ""
"The maximum force the spring can resist. This value should be higher than a "
"quarter of the [member RigidBody3D.mass] of the [VehicleBody3D] or the spring "
"will not carry the weight of the vehicle. Good results are often obtained by "
"a value that is about 3× to 4× this number."
msgstr ""
"ແຮງສູງສຸດທີ່ສະປຣິງສາມາດຮັບໄດ້. ຄ່ານີ້ຄວນຈະສູງກວ່າໜຶ່ງສ່ວນສີ່ຂອງ [member RigidBody3D.mass] ຂອງ "
"[VehicleBody3D] ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນສະປຣິງຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບນ້ຳໜັກຂອງພາຫະນະໄດ້. "
"ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ດີມັກຈະໄດ້ມາຈາກຄ່າທີ່ປະມານ 3 ຫາ 4 ເທົ່າຂອງຕົວເລກນີ້."

msgid ""
"The stiffness of the suspension, measured in Newtons per millimeter (N/mm), "
"or megagrams per second squared (Mg/s²). Use a value lower than 50 for an off-"
"road car, a value between 50 and 100 for a race car and try something around "
"200 for something like a Formula 1 car."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຂງ (stiffness) ຂອງລະບົບກັນສະເທືອນ, ວັດແທກເປັນ ນິວເຕິນ ຕໍ່ ມິນລິແມັດ (N/mm), ຫຼື "
"ເມກາກຣາມ ຕໍ່ ວິນາທີກຳລັງສອງ (Mg/s²). ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ 50 ສຳລັບລົດອັອບໂຣດ (off-road), "
"ຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 50 ຫາ 100 ສຳລັບລົດແຂ່ງ ແລະ ລອງໃຊ້ຄ່າປະມານ 200 ສຳລັບລົດ Formula 1."

msgid ""
"This is the distance the suspension can travel. As Godot units are equivalent "
"to meters, keep this setting relatively low. Try a value between 0.1 and 0.3 "
"depending on the type of car."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນໄລຍະທາງທີ່ລະບົບກັນສະເທືອນສາມາດຢືດ ຫຼື ຍຸບຕົວໄດ້. ເນື່ອງຈາກຫົວໜ່ວຍຂອງ Godot ທຽບເທົ່າກັບແມັດ, "
"ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໄວ້ຂ້ອນຂ້າງຕ່ຳ. ລອງໃຊ້ຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 0.1 ຫາ 0.3 ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບປະເພດຂອງລົດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this wheel will be turned when the car steers. This "
"value is used in conjunction with [member VehicleBody3D.steering] and ignored "
"if you are using the per-wheel [member steering] value instead."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລໍ້ນີ້ຈະໝຸນລ້ຽວເມື່ອລົດມີການລ້ຽວ. ຄ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [member "
"VehicleBody3D.steering] ແລະ ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ຄ່າ [member steering] "
"ແບບແຍກແຕ່ລະລໍ້ແທນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this wheel transfers engine force to the ground to "
"propel the vehicle forward. This value is used in conjunction with [member "
"VehicleBody3D.engine_force] and ignored if you are using the per-wheel "
"[member engine_force] value instead."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລໍ້ນີ້ຈະສົ່ງແຮງຂັບເຄື່ອນຂອງຈັກລົງສູ່ພື້ນເພື່ອຂັບເຄື່ອນພາຫະນະໄປທາງໜ້າ. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [member VehicleBody3D.engine_force] ແລະ ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ຄ່າ "
"[member engine_force] ແບບແຍກແຕ່ລະລໍ້ແທນ."

msgid ""
"This determines how much grip this wheel has. It is combined with the "
"friction setting of the surface the wheel is in contact with. 0.0 means no "
"grip, 1.0 is normal grip. For a drift car setup, try setting the grip of the "
"rear wheels slightly lower than the front wheels, or use a lower value to "
"simulate tire wear.\n"
"It's best to set this to 1.0 when starting out."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວກຳນົດວ່າລໍ້ນີ້ມີການເກາະໜ້າດິນ (grip) ຫຼາຍປານໃດ. "
"ມັນຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມຝືດຂອງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ລໍ້ສຳຜັດຢູ່. 0.0 ໝາຍເຖິງບໍ່ມີການເກາະໜ້າດິນ, 1.0 "
"ແມ່ນການເກາະໜ້າດິນປົກກະຕິ. ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າລົດດຣິບ (drift), "
"ໃຫ້ລອງຕັ້ງຄ່າການເກາະໜ້າດິນຂອງລໍ້ຫຼັງໃຫ້ຕ່ຳກວ່າລໍ້ໜ້າເລັກນ້ອຍ, ຫຼື "
"ໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳລົງເພື່ອຈຳລອງການສຶກຫ້ຼາຂອງຢາງລົດ.\n"
"ວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ 1.0 ເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "The radius of the wheel in meters."
msgstr "ລັດສະໝີຂອງລໍ້ເປັນແມັດ."

msgid ""
"This is the distance in meters the wheel is lowered from its origin point. "
"Don't set this to 0.0 and move the wheel into position, instead move the "
"origin point of your wheel (the gizmo in Godot) to the position the wheel "
"will take when bottoming out, then use the rest length to move the wheel down "
"to the position it should be in when the car is in rest."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນໄລຍະທາງເປັນແມັດທີ່ລໍ້ຖືກວາງລົງຈາກຈຸດກຳເນີດຂອງມັນ. ຢ່າຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ 0.0 "
"ແລ້ວຍ້າຍລໍ້ເຂົ້າໄປໃນຕຳແໜ່ງ, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ຍ້າຍຈຸດກຳເນີດຂອງລໍ້ (gizmo ໃນ Godot) "
"ໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ລໍ້ຈະຢູ່ເມື່ອຍຸບຕົວລົງສຸດ, ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າຄວາມຍາວທີ່ພັກ (rest length) "
"ເພື່ອຍ້າຍລໍ້ລົງໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ມັນຄວນຈະຢູ່ເມື່ອລົດຈອດຢູ່ຊື່ໆ."

msgid ""
"This value affects the roll of your vehicle. If set to 1.0 for all wheels, "
"your vehicle will resist body roll, while a value of 0.0 will be prone to "
"rolling over."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການອຽງ (roll) ຂອງພາຫະນະຂອງທ່ານ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ 1.0 ສຳລັບທຸກລໍ້, "
"ພາຫະນະຂອງທ່ານຈະຕ້ານການອຽງຂອງຕົວຖັງ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າ 0.0 ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາຫະນະມີໂອກາດພິກຂວ້ຳໄດ້ງ່າຍ."

msgid ""
"A container that arranges its child controls vertically and wraps them around "
"at the borders."
msgstr "ຕົວບັນຈຸທີ່ຈັດລຽງຄອນໂທຣລລູກໃນແນວຕັ້ງ ແລະ ປ່ຽນແຖວໃໝ່ເມື່ອສຸດຂອບ."

msgid ""
"A variant of [FlowContainer] that can only arrange its child controls "
"vertically, wrapping them around at the borders. This is similar to how text "
"in a book wraps around when no more words can fit on a line, except "
"vertically."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບໜຶ່ງຂອງ [FlowContainer] ທີ່ສາມາດຈັດລຽງຄອນໂທຣລລູກໃນແນວຕັ້ງເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ໂດຍຈະປ່ຽນແຖວໃໝ່ເມື່ອສຸດຂອບ. ນີ້ຄ້າຍຄືກັບການຕັດຄຳຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ໃນປຶ້ມເມື່ອບໍ່ມີບ່ອນຫວ່າງໃນແຖວນັ້ນແລ້ວ, "
"ແຕ່ເປັນໃນແນວຕັ້ງ."

msgid "Base resource for video streams."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນພື້ນຖານສຳລັບສະຕຣີມວິດີໂອ."

msgid ""
"Base resource type for all video streams. Classes that derive from "
"[VideoStream] can all be used as resource types to play back videos in "
"[VideoStreamPlayer]."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນພື້ນຖານສຳລັບທຸກສະຕຣີມວິດີໂອ. ຄລາສທີ່ມາຈາກ [VideoStream] "
"ທັງໝົດສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນເພື່ອຫຼິ້ນວິດີໂອໃນ [VideoStreamPlayer]."

msgid "Playing videos"
msgstr "ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນວິດີໂອ"

msgid ""
"Called when the video starts playing, to initialize and return a subclass of "
"[VideoStreamPlayback]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອວິດີໂອເລີ່ມຫຼິ້ນ, ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນຄລາສຍ່ອຍຂອງ [VideoStreamPlayback]."

msgid ""
"The video file path or URI that this [VideoStream] resource handles.\n"
"For [VideoStreamTheora], this filename should be an Ogg Theora video file "
"with the [code].ogv[/code] extension."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ວິດີໂອ ຫຼື URI ທີ່ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [VideoStream] ນີ້ຈັດການ.\n"
"ສຳລັບ [VideoStreamTheora], ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ຄວນເປັນໄຟລ໌ວິດີໂອ Ogg Theora ທີ່ມີນາມສະກຸນ [code].ogv[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Internal class used by [VideoStream] to manage playback state when played "
"from a [VideoStreamPlayer]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພາຍໃນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [VideoStream] ເພື່ອຈັດການສະຖານະການຫຼິ້ນເມື່ອຫຼິ້ນຈາກ [VideoStreamPlayer]."

msgid ""
"This class is intended to be overridden by video decoder extensions with "
"custom implementations of [VideoStream]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຕົວຖອດລະຫັດວິດີໂອຂຽນທັບ (override) ດ້ວຍການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຂອງ "
"[VideoStream]."

msgid "Returns the number of audio channels."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຊ່ອງສັນຍານສຽງ (audio channels)."

msgid "Returns the video duration in seconds, if known, or 0 if unknown."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມຍາວວິດີໂອເປັນວິນາທີ, ຖ້າຮູ້, ຫຼື 0 ຖ້າບໍ່ຮູ້."

msgid "Returns the audio sample rate used for mixing."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອັດຕາການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງສຽງ (audio sample rate) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການປະສົມສຽງ."

msgid ""
"Return the current playback timestamp. Called in response to the [member "
"VideoStreamPlayer.stream_position] getter."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເວລາປັດຈຸບັນຂອງການຫຼິ້ນ. ຖືກເອີ້ນເພື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ getter ຂອງ [member "
"VideoStreamPlayer.stream_position]."

msgid "Allocates a [Texture2D] in which decoded video frames will be drawn."
msgstr "ຈອງພື້ນທີ່ [Texture2D] ບ່ອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ແຕ້ມເຟຣມວິດີໂອທີ່ຖອດລະຫັດແລ້ວ."

msgid "Returns the paused status, as set by [method _set_paused]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສະຖານະການຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ, ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [method _set_paused]."

msgid ""
"Returns the playback state, as determined by calls to [method _play] and "
"[method _stop]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສະຖານະການຫຼິ້ນ, ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍການເອີ້ນ [method _play] ແລະ [method _stop]."

msgid ""
"Called in response to [member VideoStreamPlayer.autoplay] or [method "
"VideoStreamPlayer.play]. Note that manual playback may also invoke [method "
"_stop] multiple times before this method is called. [method _is_playing] "
"should return [code]true[/code] once playing."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເພື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ [member VideoStreamPlayer.autoplay] ຫຼື [method "
"VideoStreamPlayer.play]. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າການຫຼິ້ນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງອາດຈະເອີ້ນ [method _stop] "
"ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເອີ້ນເມທອດນີ້. [method _is_playing] ຄວນສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອເລີ່ມຫຼິ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Seeks to [param time] seconds. Called in response to the [member "
"VideoStreamPlayer.stream_position] setter."
msgstr ""
"ເລື່ອນໄປຫາເວລາ [param time] ວິນາທີ. ຖືກເອີ້ນເພື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ setter ຂອງ [member "
"VideoStreamPlayer.stream_position]."

msgid ""
"Select the audio track [param idx]. Called when playback starts, and in "
"response to the [member VideoStreamPlayer.audio_track] setter."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກແທຣັກສຽງ [param idx]. ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອການຫຼິ້ນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແລະ ເພື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ setter ຂອງ "
"[member VideoStreamPlayer.audio_track]."

msgid ""
"Set the paused status of video playback. [method _is_paused] must return "
"[param paused]. Called in response to the [member VideoStreamPlayer.paused] "
"setter."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດສະຖານະຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວຂອງການຫຼິ້ນວິດີໂອ. [method _is_paused] ຕ້ອງສົ່ງຄືນ [param paused]. "
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເພື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ setter ຂອງ [member VideoStreamPlayer.paused]."

msgid ""
"Stops playback. May be called multiple times before [method _play], or in "
"response to [method VideoStreamPlayer.stop]. [method _is_playing] should "
"return [code]false[/code] once stopped."
msgstr ""
"ຢຸດການຫຼິ້ນ. ອາດຈະຖືກເອີ້ນຫຼາຍຄັ້ງກ່ອນ [method _play], ຫຼື ເພື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ [method "
"VideoStreamPlayer.stop]. [method _is_playing] ຄວນສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code] "
"ເມື່ອຢຸດແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Ticks video playback for [param delta] seconds. Called every frame as long as "
"both [method _is_paused] and [method _is_playing] return [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ດຳເນີນການຫຼິ້ນວິດີໂອໄປຕາມເວລາ [param delta] ວິນາທີ. ຖືກເອີ້ນທຸກໆເຟຣມຕາບໃດທີ່ທັງ [method "
"_is_paused] ແລະ [method _is_playing] ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Render [param num_frames] audio frames (of [method _get_channels] floats "
"each) from [param buffer], starting from index [param offset] in the array. "
"Returns the number of audio frames rendered, or -1 on error."
msgstr ""
"ເຣັນເດີ [param num_frames] ເຟຣມສຽງ (ແຕ່ລະເຟຣມມີຈຳນວນ float ເທົ່າກັບ [method "
"_get_channels]) ຈາກ [param buffer], ເລີ່ມຈາກອິນເດັກ [param offset] ໃນອາເຣ. "
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນເຟຣມສຽງທີ່ເຣັນເດີແລ້ວ, ຫຼື -1 ຖ້າເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

msgid "A control used for video playback."
msgstr "ຄອນໂທຣລທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຫຼິ້ນວິດີໂອ."

msgid ""
"A control used for playback of [VideoStream] resources.\n"
"Supported video formats are [url=https://www.theora.org/]Ogg Theora[/url] "
"([code].ogv[/code], [VideoStreamTheora]) and any format exposed via a "
"GDExtension plugin.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] On Web, video playback [i]will[/i] perform poorly due to "
"missing architecture-specific assembly optimizations."
msgstr ""
"ຄອນໂທຣລທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຫຼິ້ນຊັບພະຍາກອນ [VideoStream].\n"
"ຮູບແບບວິດີໂອທີ່ຮອງຮັບຄື [url=https://www.theora.org/]Ogg Theora[/url] ([code].ogv[/"
"code], [VideoStreamTheora]) ແລະ ຮູບແບບໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ຜ່ານປລັກອິນ GDExtension.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ໃນເວັບ, ການຫຼິ້ນວິດີໂອ [i]ຈະ[/i] ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ບໍ່ດີ ຍ້ອນຂາດການປັບແຕ່ງ assembly "
"ສະເພາະສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ."

msgid "The length of the current stream, in seconds."
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວຂອງສະຕຣີມປັດຈຸບັນ ເປັນວິນາທີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the video stream's name, or [code]\"<No Stream>\"[/code] if no video "
"stream is assigned."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງສະຕຣີມວິດີໂອ, ຫຼື [code]\"<No Stream>\"[/code] ຖ້າຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດສະຕຣີມວິດີໂອໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the video is playing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The video is still considered playing if paused during playback."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າວິດີໂອກຳນົດຫຼິ້ນຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິດີໂອຍັງຖືກຖືວ່າກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຖືກຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Stops the video playback and sets the stream position to 0.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Although the stream position will be set to 0, the first frame "
"of the video stream won't become the current frame."
msgstr ""
"ຢຸດການຫຼິ້ນວິດີໂອ ແລະ ກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງສະຕຣີມເປັນ 0.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເຖິງວ່າຕຳແໜ່ງສະຕຣີມຈະຖືກກຳນົດເປັນ 0, "
"ແຕ່ເຟຣມທຳອິດຂອງສະຕຣີມວິດີໂອຈະຍັງບໍ່ກາຍເປັນເຟຣມປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "The embedded audio track to play."
msgstr "ແທຣັກສຽງທີ່ຝັງຢູ່ທີ່ຈະຫຼິ້ນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], playback starts when the scene loads."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການຫຼິ້ນຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນເມື່ອໂຫຼດສາກ (scene)."

msgid "Amount of time in milliseconds to store in buffer while playing."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້ໃນບັບເຟີໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນ."

msgid "Audio bus to use for sound playback."
msgstr "Audio bus ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຫຼິ້ນສຽງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the video scales to the control size. Otherwise, the "
"control minimum size will be automatically adjusted to match the video "
"stream's dimensions."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວິດີໂອຈະຂະຫຍາຍໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບຂະໜາດຂອງຄອນໂທຣລ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຂະໜາດຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງຄອນໂທຣລຈະຖືກປັບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃຫ້ກົງກັບຂະໜາດຂອງສະຕຣີມວິດີໂອ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the video restarts when it reaches its end."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວິດີໂອຈະເລີ່ມຫຼິ້ນໃໝ່ເມື່ອຮອດຕອນຈົບ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the video is paused."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວິດີໂອຈະຖືກຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ."

msgid ""
"The stream's current speed scale. [code]1.0[/code] is the normal speed, while "
"[code]2.0[/code] is double speed and [code]0.5[/code] is half speed. A speed "
"scale of [code]0.0[/code] pauses the video, similar to setting [member "
"paused] to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບຄວາມໄວປັດຈຸບັນຂອງສະຕຣີມ. [code]1.0[/code] ຄືຄວາມໄວປົກກະຕິ, [code]2.0[/code] "
"ຄືຄວາມໄວສອງເທົ່າ ແລະ [code]0.5[/code] ຄືເຄິ່ງຄວາມໄວ. ຄວາມໄວ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ຈະຢຸດວິດີໂອໄວ້, ຄ້າຍຄືກັບການກຳນົດ [member paused] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid "The assigned video stream. See description for supported formats."
msgstr "ສະຕຣີມວິດີໂອທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບຮູບແບບທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid "The current position of the stream, in seconds."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງສະຕຣີມ ເປັນວິນາທີ."

msgid "Audio volume as a linear value."
msgstr "ລະດັບສຽງແບບຄ່າເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear)."

msgid "Audio volume in dB."
msgstr "ລະດັບສຽງເປັນເດຊີເບລ (dB)."

msgid "Emitted when playback is finished."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອການຫຼິ້ນສິ້ນສຸດລົງ."

msgid "[VideoStream] resource for Ogg Theora videos."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [VideoStream] ສຳລັບວິດີໂອ Ogg Theora."

msgid ""
"[VideoStream] resource handling the [url=https://www.theora.org/]Ogg Theora[/"
"url] video format with [code].ogv[/code] extension. The Theora codec is "
"decoded on the CPU.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] While Ogg Theora videos can also have a [code].ogg[/code] "
"extension, you will have to rename the extension to [code].ogv[/code] to use "
"those videos within Godot."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [VideoStream] ທີ່ຈັດການຮູບແບບວິດີໂອ [url=https://www.theora.org/]Ogg "
"Theora[/url] ທີ່ມີນາມສະກຸນ [code].ogv[/code]. ຕົວຖອດລະຫັດ Theora ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນ "
"CPU.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເຖິງວ່າວິດີໂອ Ogg Theora ສາມາດມີນາມສະກຸນ [code].ogg[/code] ໄດ້, "
"ແຕ່ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຊື່ນາມສະກຸນເປັນ [code].ogv[/code] ເພື່ອໃຊ້ວິດີໂອນັ້ນໃນ Godot."

msgid ""
"Abstract base class for viewports. Encapsulates drawing and interaction with "
"a game world."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳ (abstract) ສຳລັບວິວພອດ (viewports). ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຈັດການການແຕ້ມ ແລະ "
"ການໂຕ້ຕອບກັບໂລກຂອງເກມ."

msgid ""
"A [Viewport] creates a different view into the screen, or a sub-view inside "
"another viewport. Child 2D nodes will display on it, and child Camera3D 3D "
"nodes will render on it too.\n"
"Optionally, a viewport can have its own 2D or 3D world, so it doesn't share "
"what it draws with other viewports.\n"
"Viewports can also choose to be audio listeners, so they generate positional "
"audio depending on a 2D or 3D camera child of it.\n"
"Also, viewports can be assigned to different screens in case the devices have "
"multiple screens.\n"
"Finally, viewports can also behave as render targets, in which case they will "
"not be visible unless the associated texture is used to draw."
msgstr ""
"[Viewport] ສ້າງມຸມມອງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນເທິງໜ້າຈໍ, ຫຼື ເປັນມຸມມອງຍ່ອຍພາຍໃນວິວພອດອື່ນ. ໂນດລູກ 2D "
"ຈະສະແດງຜົນເທິງນັ້ນ, ແລະ ໂນດລູກ Camera3D ກໍຈະເຣັນເດີເທິງນັ້ນຄືກັນ.\n"
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ວິວພອດສາມາດມີໂລກ 2D ຫຼື 3D ເປັນຂອງຕົນເອງໄດ້, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນບໍ່ແບ່ງປັນສິ່ງທີ່ມັນແຕ້ມກັບວິວພອດອື່ນ.\n"
"ວິວພອດຍັງສາມາດເລືອກເປັນຜູ້ຟັງສຽງ (audio listeners) ໄດ້, ເພື່ອສ້າງສຽງຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງໂດຍອີງຕາມກ້ອງ "
"2D ຫຼື 3D ທີ່ເປັນລູກຂອງມັນ.\n"
"ອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງ, ວິວພອດສາມາດກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບໜ້າຈໍຕ່າງໆໄດ້ ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ອຸປະກອນມີຫຼາຍໜ້າຈໍ.\n"
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ວິວພອດຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ render targets ໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ມັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ "
"ນອກຈາກຈະໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງມາແຕ້ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the first valid [World2D] for this viewport, searching the [member "
"world_2d] property of itself and any Viewport ancestor."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [World2D] ທຳອິດທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສຳລັບວິວພອດນີ້, ໂດຍຄົ້ນຫາຈາກພຣັອບເພີຕີ້ [member world_2d] "
"ຂອງຕົວມັນເອງ ແລະ ບັນພະບຸລຸດ Viewport ໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"Returns the first valid [World3D] for this viewport, searching the [member "
"world_3d] property of itself and any Viewport ancestor."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [World3D] ທຳອິດທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສຳລັບວິວພອດນີ້, ໂດຍຄົ້ນຫາຈາກພຣັອບເພີຕີ້ [member world_3d] "
"ຂອງຕົວມັນເອງ ແລະ ບັນພະບຸລຸດ Viewport ໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"Returns the currently active 2D audio listener. Returns [code]null[/code] if "
"there are no active 2D audio listeners, in which case the active 2D camera "
"will be treated as listener."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຜູ້ຟັງສຽງ 2D (audio listener) ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຜູ້ຟັງສຽງ 2D ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ກ້ອງ 2D ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນຜູ້ຟັງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the currently active 3D audio listener. Returns [code]null[/code] if "
"there are no active 3D audio listeners, in which case the active 3D camera "
"will be treated as listener."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຜູ້ຟັງສຽງ 3D (audio listener) ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຜູ້ຟັງສຽງ 3D ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ກ້ອງ 3D ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນຜູ້ຟັງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the currently active 2D camera. Returns [code]null[/code] if there "
"are no active cameras.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If called while the [i]Camera Override[/i] system is active in "
"editor, this will return the internally managed override camera. It is "
"therefore advised to avoid caching the return value, or to check that the "
"cached value is still a valid instance and is the current camera before use. "
"See [method @GlobalScope.is_instance_valid] and [method Camera2D.is_current]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນກ້ອງ 2D ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ມີກ້ອງໃດເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລະບົບ [i]Camera Override[/i] ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນ editor, "
"ນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນກ້ອງ override ທີ່ຈັດການພາຍໃນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງແນະນຳໃຫ້ຫຼີກເວັ້ນການເກັບຄ່າ (caching) "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ, ຫຼື ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າຄ່າທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ຍັງເປັນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ເປັນກ້ອງປັດຈຸບັນກ່ອນໃຊ້ງານ. ເບິ່ງ [method @GlobalScope.is_instance_valid] ແລະ [method "
"Camera2D.is_current]."

msgid ""
"Returns the currently active 3D camera. Returns [code]null[/code] if there "
"are no active cameras.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If called while the [i]Camera Override[/i] system is active in "
"editor, this will return the internally managed override camera. It is "
"therefore advised to avoid caching the return value, or to check that the "
"cached value is a valid instance and is the current camera before use. See "
"[method @GlobalScope.is_instance_valid] and [member Camera3D.current]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນກ້ອງ 3D ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ມີກ້ອງໃດເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລະບົບ [i]Camera Override[/i] ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນ editor, "
"ນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນກ້ອງ override ທີ່ຈັດການພາຍໃນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງແນະນຳໃຫ້ຫຼີກເວັ້ນການເກັບຄ່າ (caching) "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ, ຫຼື ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າຄ່າທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ເປັນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ເປັນກ້ອງປັດຈຸບັນກ່ອນໃຊ້ງານ. ເບິ່ງ [method @GlobalScope.is_instance_valid] ແລະ [member "
"Camera3D.current]."

msgid "Returns an individual bit on the rendering layer mask."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແຕ່ລະບິດ (bit) ໃນມາດຂອງເລເຢີການເຣັນເດີ (rendering layer mask)."

msgid ""
"Returns a list of the visible embedded [Window]s inside the viewport.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Window]s inside other viewports will not be listed."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການຂອງ [Window] ທີ່ຝັງຢູ່ ແລະ ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ພາຍໃນວິວພອດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [Window] ທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນວິວພອດອື່ນຈະບໍ່ຖືກສະແດງໃນລາຍການ."

msgid ""
"Returns the transform from the viewport's coordinate system to the embedder's "
"coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການແປງ (transform) ຈາກລະບົບພິກັດຂອງວິວພອດ ໄປຫາລະບົບພິກັດຂອງຕົວຝັງ (embedder)."

msgid ""
"Returns the mouse's position in this [Viewport] using the coordinate system "
"of this [Viewport]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເມົາສ໌ໃນ [Viewport] ນີ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ລະບົບພິກັດຂອງ [Viewport] ນີ້."

msgid "Returns viewport oversampling factor."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າປັດໄຈການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນ (oversampling factor) ຂອງວິວພອດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the positional shadow atlas quadrant subdivision of the specified "
"quadrant."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການແບ່ງສ່ວນຍ່ອຍ (subdivision) ຂອງແອດລັດເງົາຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງ (positional shadow atlas) "
"ໃນສ່ວນສີ່ (quadrant) ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Returns rendering statistics of the given type."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສະຖິຕິການເຣັນເດີຂອງປະເພດທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the transform from the Viewport's coordinates to the screen "
"coordinates of the containing window manager window."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການແປງ (transform) ຈາກພິກັດຂອງວິວພອດ ໄປຫາພິກັດໜ້າຈໍຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ window manager ທີ່ບັນຈຸຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the automatically computed 2D stretch transform, taking the "
"[Viewport]'s stretch settings into account. The final value is multiplied by "
"[member Window.content_scale_factor], but only for the root viewport. If this "
"method is called on a [SubViewport] (e.g., in a scene tree with "
"[SubViewportContainer] and [SubViewport]), the scale factor of the root "
"window will not be applied. Using [method Transform2D.get_scale] on the "
"returned value, this can be used to compensate for scaling when zooming a "
"[Camera2D] node, or to scale down a [TextureRect] to be pixel-perfect "
"regardless of the automatically computed scale factor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to how pixel scaling works, the returned transform's X and Y "
"scale may differ slightly, even when [member Window.content_scale_aspect] is "
"set to a mode that preserves the pixels' aspect ratio. If [member "
"Window.content_scale_aspect] is [constant "
"Window.CONTENT_SCALE_ASPECT_IGNORE], the X and Y scale may differ "
"[i]significantly[/i]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າການແປງການຢືດ (stretch transform) 2D ທີ່ຄຳນວນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ໂດຍພິຈາລະນາການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຢືດຂອງ [Viewport]. ຄ່າສຸດທ້າຍຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍ [member "
"Window.content_scale_factor], ແຕ່ສະເພາະວິວພອດຫຼັກ (root viewport) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ຖ້າເມທອດນີ້ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນ [SubViewport], ຄ່າ scale factor ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້. ການໃຊ້ "
"[method Transform2D.get_scale] ກັບຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຊົດເຊີຍການຂະຫຍາຍເມື່ອຊູມໂນດ "
"[Camera2D], ຫຼື ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຂະໜາດ [TextureRect] ໃຫ້ເປັນແບບ pixel-perfect ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈ scale "
"factor ທີ່ຄຳນວນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຍ້ອນວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການຂະຫຍາຍພິກເຊວ, ຄ່າ scale X ແລະ Y "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາອາດແຕກຕ່າງກັນເລັກນ້ອຍ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຕັ້ງ [member Window.content_scale_aspect] "
"ໃຫ້ຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນໄວ້ກໍຕາມ."

msgid "Returns the viewport's RID from the [RenderingServer]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ RID ຂອງວິວພອດຈາກ [RenderingServer]."

msgid "Returns the visible rectangle in global screen coordinates."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ໃນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍທົ່ວໂລກ (global screen coordinates)."

msgid ""
"Cancels the drag operation that was previously started through [method "
"Control._get_drag_data] or forced with [method Control.force_drag]."
msgstr ""
"ຍົກເລີກການປະຕິບັດການລາກ (drag) ທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຜ່ານ [method Control._get_drag_data] ຫຼື "
"ບັງຄັບດ້ວຍ [method Control.force_drag]."

msgid ""
"Returns the drag data from the GUI, that was previously returned by [method "
"Control._get_drag_data]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນການລາກຈາກ GUI, ທີ່ເຄີຍສົ່ງຄືນໂດຍ [method Control._get_drag_data]."

msgid ""
"Returns the human-readable description of the drag data, used for assistive "
"apps."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄຳອະທິບາຍຂອງຂໍ້ມູນການລາກທີ່ມະນຸດອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້, ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແອັບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (assistive apps)."

msgid ""
"Returns the currently focused [Control] within this viewport. If no [Control] "
"is focused, returns [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Control] ທີ່ກຳລັງໂຟກັດຢູ່ພາຍໃນວິວພອດນີ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [Control] ໃດຖືກໂຟກັດ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]null[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Control] that the mouse is currently hovering over in this "
"viewport. If no [Control] has the cursor, returns [code]null[/code].\n"
"Typically the leaf [Control] node or deepest level of the subtree which "
"claims hover. This is very useful when used together with [method "
"Node.is_ancestor_of] to find if the mouse is within a control tree."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Control] ທີ່ເມົາສ໌ກຳລັງຊີ້ (hover) ຢູ່ພາຍໃນວິວພອດນີ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [Control] ໃດຢູ່ກ້ອງເຄີເຊີ "
"(cursor), ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code]."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the drag operation is successful."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າການປະຕິບັດການລາກສຳເລັດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a drag operation is currently ongoing and where "
"the drop action could happen in this viewport.\n"
"Alternative to [constant Node.NOTIFICATION_DRAG_BEGIN] and [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_DRAG_END] when you prefer polling the value."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າການປະຕິບັດການລາກກຳລັງດຳເນີນຢູ່ ແລະ ສາມາດວາງ (drop) "
"ລົງໃນວິວພອດນີ້ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Removes the focus from the currently focused [Control] within this viewport. "
"If no [Control] has the focus, does nothing."
msgstr ""
"ຍົກເລີກການໂຟກັດຈາກ [Control] ທີ່ກຳລັງໂຟກັດຢູ່ພາຍໃນວິວພອດນີ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [Control] ໃດຖືກໂຟກັດ, "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີຫຍັງເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the human-readable description of the drag data to [param description], "
"used for assistive apps."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄຳອະທິບາຍຂອງຂໍ້ມູນການລາກໃຫ້ເປັນ [param description], ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແອັບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ."

msgid ""
"Returns whether the current [InputEvent] has been handled. Input events are "
"not handled until [method set_input_as_handled] has been called during the "
"lifetime of an [InputEvent].\n"
"This is usually done as part of input handling methods like [method "
"Node._input], [method Control._gui_input] or others, as well as in "
"corresponding signal handlers.\n"
"If [member handle_input_locally] is set to [code]false[/code], this method "
"will try finding the first parent viewport that is set to handle input "
"locally, and return its value for [method is_input_handled] instead."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າ [InputEvent] ປັດຈຸບັນຖືກຈັດການ (handled) ແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Inform the Viewport that the mouse has entered its area. Use this function "
"before sending an [InputEventMouseButton] or [InputEventMouseMotion] to the "
"[Viewport] with [method Viewport.push_input]. See also [method "
"notify_mouse_exited].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In most cases, it is not necessary to call this function because "
"[SubViewport] nodes that are children of [SubViewportContainer] are notified "
"automatically. This is only necessary when interacting with viewports in non-"
"default ways, for example as textures in [TextureRect] or with an [Area3D] "
"that forwards input events."
msgstr "ແຈ້ງໃຫ້ວິວພອດຮູ້ວ່າເມົາສ໌ໄດ້ເຂົ້າມາໃນພື້ນທີ່ຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Inform the Viewport that the mouse has left its area. Use this function when "
"the node that displays the viewport notices the mouse has left the area of "
"the displayed viewport. See also [method notify_mouse_entered].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In most cases, it is not necessary to call this function because "
"[SubViewport] nodes that are children of [SubViewportContainer] are notified "
"automatically. This is only necessary when interacting with viewports in non-"
"default ways, for example as textures in [TextureRect] or with an [Area3D] "
"that forwards input events."
msgstr "ແຈ້ງໃຫ້ວິວພອດຮູ້ວ່າເມົາສ໌ໄດ້ອອກຈາກພື້ນທີ່ຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Triggers the given [param event] in this [Viewport]. This can be used to pass "
"an [InputEvent] between viewports, or to locally apply inputs that were sent "
"over the network or saved to a file.\n"
"If [param in_local_coords] is [code]false[/code], the event's position is in "
"the embedder's coordinates and will be converted to viewport coordinates. If "
"[param in_local_coords] is [code]true[/code], the event's position is in "
"viewport coordinates.\n"
"While this method serves a similar purpose as [method "
"Input.parse_input_event], it does not remap the specified [param event] based "
"on project settings like [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_touch_from_mouse].\n"
"Calling this method will propagate calls to child nodes for following methods "
"in the given order:\n"
"- [method Node._input]\n"
"- [method Control._gui_input] for [Control] nodes\n"
"- [method Node._shortcut_input]\n"
"- [method Node._unhandled_key_input]\n"
"- [method Node._unhandled_input]\n"
"If an earlier method marks the input as handled via [method "
"set_input_as_handled], any later method in this list will not be called.\n"
"If none of the methods handle the event and [member physics_object_picking] "
"is [code]true[/code], the event is used for physics object picking."
msgstr "ສົ່ງ [param event] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນ [Viewport] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Helper method which calls the [code]set_text()[/code] method on the currently "
"focused [Control], provided that it is defined (e.g. if the focused Control "
"is [Button] or [LineEdit])."
msgstr "ເມທອດຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອທີ່ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [code]set_text()[/code] ໃນ [Control] ທີ່ກຳລັງໂຟກັດຢູ່."

msgid "Use [method push_input] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method push_input] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Triggers the given [param event] in this [Viewport]. This can be used to pass "
"an [InputEvent] between viewports, or to locally apply inputs that were sent "
"over the network or saved to a file.\n"
"If [param in_local_coords] is [code]false[/code], the event's position is in "
"the embedder's coordinates and will be converted to viewport coordinates. If "
"[param in_local_coords] is [code]true[/code], the event's position is in "
"viewport coordinates.\n"
"Calling this method will propagate calls to child nodes for following methods "
"in the given order:\n"
"- [method Node._shortcut_input]\n"
"- [method Node._unhandled_key_input]\n"
"- [method Node._unhandled_input]\n"
"If an earlier method marks the input as handled via [method "
"set_input_as_handled], any later method in this list will not be called.\n"
"If none of the methods handle the event and [member physics_object_picking] "
"is [code]true[/code], the event is used for physics object picking.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method doesn't propagate input events to embedded [Window]s "
"or [SubViewport]s."
msgstr "ສົ່ງ [param event] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນ [Viewport] ນີ້ (ແບບບໍ່ລວມ GUI input)."

msgid ""
"Set/clear individual bits on the rendering layer mask. This simplifies "
"editing this [Viewport]'s layers."
msgstr "ກຳນົດ ຫຼື ລຶບບິດ (bit) ແຕ່ລະອັນໃນມາດຂອງເລເຢີການເຣັນເດີ."

msgid ""
"Stops the input from propagating further up the [SceneTree].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does not affect the methods in [Input], only the way events "
"are propagated."
msgstr ""
"ຢຸດການສົ່ງຕໍ່ອິນພຸດ (input) ຂຶ້ນໄປໃນ [SceneTree].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ເມທອດໃນ [Input], ມີຜົນສະເພາະວິທີການສົ່ງຕໍ່ເຫດການເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the number of subdivisions to use in the specified quadrant. A higher "
"number of subdivisions allows you to have more shadows in the scene at once, "
"but reduces the quality of the shadows. A good practice is to have quadrants "
"with a varying number of subdivisions and to have as few subdivisions as "
"possible."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຈຳນວນການແບ່ງສ່ວນຍ່ອຍທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນສ່ວນສີ່ (quadrant) ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Force instantly updating the display based on the current mouse cursor "
"position. This includes updating the mouse cursor shape and sending necessary "
"[signal Control.mouse_entered], [signal CollisionObject2D.mouse_entered], "
"[signal CollisionObject3D.mouse_entered] and [signal Window.mouse_entered] "
"signals and their respective [code]mouse_exited[/code] counterparts."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີການອັບເດດການສະແດງຜົນທັນທີ ໂດຍອີງຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌."

msgid ""
"Moves the mouse pointer to the specified position in this [Viewport] using "
"the coordinate system of this [Viewport].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method warp_mouse] is only supported on Windows, macOS and "
"Linux. It has no effect on Android, iOS and Web."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌ໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [Viewport] ນີ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ລະບົບພິກັດຂອງມັນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the viewport will process 2D audio streams."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວິວພອດຈະປະມວນຜົນສະຕຣີມສຽງ 2D."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the viewport will process 3D audio streams."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວິວພອດຈະປະມວນຜົນສະຕຣີມສຽງ 3D."

msgid ""
"The rendering layers in which this [Viewport] renders [CanvasItem] nodes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A [CanvasItem] does not inherit its parents' visibility layers. "
"See [member CanvasItem.visibility_layer]'s description for details."
msgstr "ເລເຢີການເຣັນເດີທີ່ [Viewport] ນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຣັນເດີໂນດ [CanvasItem]."

msgid "The default filter mode used by [CanvasItem] nodes in this viewport."
msgstr "ໂໝດການກອງ (filter mode) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍໂນດ [CanvasItem] ໃນວິວພອດນີ້."

msgid "The default repeat mode used by [CanvasItem] nodes in this viewport."
msgstr "ໂໝດການວົນຊ້ຳ (repeat mode) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍໂນດ [CanvasItem] ໃນວິວພອດນີ້."

msgid ""
"The canvas transform of the viewport, useful for changing the on-screen "
"positions of all child [CanvasItem]s. This is relative to the global canvas "
"transform of the viewport."
msgstr ""
"ການແປງແຄນວາ (canvas transform) ຂອງວິວພອດ, ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການປ່ຽນຕຳແໜ່ງເທິງໜ້າຈໍຂອງໂນດລູກ "
"[CanvasItem] ທັງໝົດ."

msgid "The overlay mode for test rendered geometry in debug purposes."
msgstr "ໂໝດການວາງຊ້ອນ (overlay mode) ສຳລັບທົດສອບ geometry ທີ່ເຣັນເດີເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງການດີບັກ."

msgid "Disable 3D rendering (but keep 2D rendering)."
msgstr "ປິດການເຣັນເດີ 3D (ແຕ່ຍັງເກັບການເຣັນເດີ 2D ໄວ້)."

msgid ""
"Determines how sharp the upscaled image will be when using the FSR upscaling "
"mode. Sharpness halves with every whole number. Values go from 0.0 (sharpest) "
"to 2.0. Values above 2.0 won't make a visible difference.\n"
"To control this property on the root viewport, set the [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/scaling_3d/fsr_sharpness] project setting."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າພາບທີ່ຂະຫຍາຍຂຶ້ນ (upscaled) ຈະຄົມຊັດປານໃດເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ FSR."

msgid ""
"The global canvas transform of the viewport. The canvas transform is relative "
"to this."
msgstr "ການແປງແຄນວາທົ່ວໂລກ (global canvas transform) ຂອງວິວພອດ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the viewport will not receive input events."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວິວພອດຈະບໍ່ຮັບເຫດການອິນພຸດໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"The minimum distance the mouse cursor must move while pressed before a drag "
"operation begins."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ຕ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກົດຢູ່ ກ່ອນທີ່ການລາກຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], sub-windows (popups and dialogs) will be embedded "
"inside application window as control-like nodes. If [code]false[/code], they "
"will appear as separate windows handled by the operating system."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໜ້າຕ່າງຍ່ອຍ (popups ແລະ dialogs) "
"ຈະຖືກຝັງຢູ່ພາຍໃນໜ້າຕ່າງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the GUI controls on the viewport will lay pixel "
"perfectly."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄອນໂທຣລ GUI ເທິງວິວພອດຈະຖືກວາງແບບ pixel perfect."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this viewport will mark incoming input events as "
"handled by itself. If [code]false[/code], this is instead done by the first "
"parent viewport that is set to handle input locally.\n"
"A [SubViewportContainer] will automatically set this property to [code]false[/"
"code] for the [Viewport] contained inside of it.\n"
"See also [method set_input_as_handled] and [method is_input_handled]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວິວພອດນີ້ຈະໝາຍເຫດການອິນພຸດທີ່ເຂົ້າມາວ່າຖືກຈັດການໂດຍຕົວມັນເອງ."

msgid ""
"The automatic LOD bias to use for meshes rendered within the [Viewport] (this "
"is analogous to [member ReflectionProbe.mesh_lod_threshold]). Higher values "
"will use less detailed versions of meshes that have LOD variations generated. "
"If set to [code]0.0[/code], automatic LOD is disabled. Increase [member "
"mesh_lod_threshold] to improve performance at the cost of geometry detail.\n"
"To control this property on the root viewport, set the [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/mesh_lod/lod_change/threshold_pixels] project "
"setting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Depending on the mesh's attributes (vertex colors, blend "
"shapes, ...), a mesh may have fewer levels of LOD generated to avoid visible "
"distortion of the mesh once it is affected by vertex colors or blend shapes. "
"Meshes with a very low vertex count will also not have any LODs generated, "
"which means this setting will not affect them at all. In general, this "
"setting makes the largest impact on static meshes with a high vertex count.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member mesh_lod_threshold] does not affect [GeometryInstance3D] "
"visibility ranges (also known as \"manual\" LOD or hierarchical LOD)."
msgstr "ຄ່າ LOD bias ອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບເມັດຊ໌ (meshes) ທີ່ເຣັນເດີພາຍໃນ [Viewport]."

msgid ""
"The multisample antialiasing mode for 2D/Canvas rendering. A higher number "
"results in smoother edges at the cost of significantly worse performance. A "
"value of [constant Viewport.MSAA_2X] or [constant Viewport.MSAA_4X] is best "
"unless targeting very high-end systems. This has no effect on shader-induced "
"aliasing or texture aliasing.\n"
"See also [member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/msaa_2d] and "
"[method RenderingServer.viewport_set_msaa_2d]."
msgstr "ໂໝດການລົບຮອຍຢັກແບບຫຼາຍຈຸດສຸ່ມ (MSAA) ສຳລັບການເຣັນເດີ 2D/Canvas."

msgid ""
"The multisample antialiasing mode for 3D rendering. A higher number results "
"in smoother edges at the cost of significantly worse performance. A value of "
"[constant Viewport.MSAA_2X] or [constant Viewport.MSAA_4X] is best unless "
"targeting very high-end systems. See also bilinear scaling 3D [member "
"scaling_3d_mode] for supersampling, which provides higher quality but is much "
"more expensive. This has no effect on shader-induced aliasing or texture "
"aliasing.\n"
"See also [member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/msaa_3d] and "
"[method RenderingServer.viewport_set_msaa_3d]."
msgstr "ໂໝດການລົບຮອຍຢັກແບບຫຼາຍຈຸດສຸ່ມ (MSAA) ສຳລັບການເຣັນເດີ 3D."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] and one of the following conditions are true: [member "
"SubViewport.size_2d_override_stretch] and [member "
"SubViewport.size_2d_override] are set, [member Window.content_scale_factor] "
"is set and scaling is enabled, [member oversampling_override] is set, font "
"and [DPITexture] oversampling are enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີການນຳໃຊ້ການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນ (oversampling) "
"ພາຍໃຕ້ເງື່ອນໄຂທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"If greater than zero, this value is used as the font oversampling factor, "
"otherwise oversampling is equal to viewport scale."
msgstr "ຖ້າຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ, ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນປັດໄຈການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນຂອງຟອນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the viewport will use a unique copy of the [World3D] "
"defined in [member world_3d]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວິວພອດຈະໃຊ້ສຳເນົາສະເພາະຂອງ [World3D] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ [member "
"world_3d]."

msgid "The subdivision amount of the first quadrant on the shadow atlas."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການແບ່ງສ່ວນຍ່ອຍຂອງສ່ວນສີ່ທຳອິດໃນແອດລັດເງົາ."

msgid "The subdivision amount of the second quadrant on the shadow atlas."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການແບ່ງສ່ວນຍ່ອຍຂອງສ່ວນສີ່ທີສອງໃນແອດລັດເງົາ."

msgid "The subdivision amount of the third quadrant on the shadow atlas."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການແບ່ງສ່ວນຍ່ອຍຂອງສ່ວນສີ່ທີສາມໃນແອດລັດເງົາ."

msgid "The subdivision amount of the fourth quadrant on the shadow atlas."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການແບ່ງສ່ວນຍ່ອຍຂອງສ່ວນສີ່ທີສີ່ໃນແອດລັດເງົາ."

msgid ""
"Sets scaling 3D mode. Bilinear scaling renders at different resolution to "
"either undersample or supersample the viewport. FidelityFX Super Resolution "
"1.0, abbreviated to FSR, is an upscaling technology that produces high "
"quality images at fast framerates by using a spatially aware upscaling "
"algorithm. FSR is slightly more expensive than bilinear, but it produces "
"significantly higher image quality. FSR should be used where possible.\n"
"To control this property on the root viewport, set the [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/scaling_3d/mode] project setting."
msgstr "ກຳນົດໂໝດການຂະຫຍາຍ (scaling) 3D."

msgid ""
"Scales the 3D render buffer based on the viewport size uses an image filter "
"specified in [member ProjectSettings.rendering/scaling_3d/mode] to scale the "
"output image to the full viewport size. Values lower than [code]1.0[/code] "
"can be used to speed up 3D rendering at the cost of quality (undersampling). "
"Values greater than [code]1.0[/code] are only valid for bilinear mode and can "
"be used to improve 3D rendering quality at a high performance cost "
"(supersampling). See also [member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/"
"quality/msaa_3d] for multi-sample antialiasing, which is significantly "
"cheaper but only smooths the edges of polygons.\n"
"When using FSR upscaling, AMD recommends exposing the following values as "
"preset options to users \"Ultra Quality: 0.77\", \"Quality: 0.67\", "
"\"Balanced: 0.59\", \"Performance: 0.5\" instead of exposing the entire "
"scale.\n"
"To control this property on the root viewport, set the [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/scaling_3d/scale] project setting."
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍບັບເຟີການເຣັນເດີ 3D ໂດຍອີງຕາມຂະໜາດວິວພອດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the screen-space antialiasing method used. Screen-space antialiasing "
"works by selectively blurring edges in a post-process shader. It differs from "
"MSAA which takes multiple coverage samples while rendering objects. Screen-"
"space AA methods are typically faster than MSAA and will smooth out specular "
"aliasing, but tend to make scenes appear blurry.\n"
"See also [member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/"
"screen_space_aa] and [method RenderingServer.viewport_set_screen_space_aa]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວິທີການລົບຮອຍຢັກແບບ Screen-space (SSAA)."

msgid ""
"Controls how much of the original viewport's size should be covered by the 2D "
"signed distance field. This SDF can be sampled in [CanvasItem] shaders and is "
"also used for [GPUParticles2D] collision. Higher values allow portions of "
"occluders located outside the viewport to still be taken into account in the "
"generated signed distance field, at the cost of performance. If you notice "
"particles falling through [LightOccluder2D]s as the occluders leave the "
"viewport, increase this setting.\n"
"The percentage is added on each axis and on both sides. For example, with the "
"default [constant SDF_OVERSIZE_120_PERCENT], the signed distance field will "
"cover 20% of the viewport's size outside the viewport on each side (top, "
"right, bottom, left)."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມວ່າພື້ນທີ່ຂອງວິວພອດເດີມຈະຖືກປົກຄຸມໂດຍ 2D signed distance field (SDF) ຫຼາຍປານໃດ."

msgid ""
"The resolution scale to use for the 2D signed distance field. Higher values "
"lead to a more precise and more stable signed distance field as the camera "
"moves, at the cost of performance."
msgstr "ລະດັບຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ 2D signed distance field."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [CanvasItem] nodes will internally snap to full pixels. "
"Their position can still be sub-pixel, but the decimals will not have effect. "
"This can lead to a crisper appearance at the cost of less smooth movement, "
"especially when [Camera2D] smoothing is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດ [CanvasItem] ຈະຖືກດຶງໃຫ້ກົງກັບພິກເຊວ (snap) ພາຍໃນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], vertices of [CanvasItem] nodes will snap to full "
"pixels. Only affects the final vertex positions, not the transforms. This can "
"lead to a crisper appearance at the cost of less smooth movement, especially "
"when [Camera2D] smoothing is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈຸດຍອດ (vertices) ຂອງໂນດ [CanvasItem] "
"ຈະຖືກດຶງໃຫ້ກົງກັບພິກເຊວ."

msgid ""
"Affects the final texture sharpness by reading from a lower or higher mipmap "
"(also called \"texture LOD bias\"). Negative values make mipmapped textures "
"sharper but grainier when viewed at a distance, while positive values make "
"mipmapped textures blurrier (even when up close).\n"
"Enabling temporal antialiasing ([member use_taa]) will automatically apply a "
"[code]-0.5[/code] offset to this value, while enabling FXAA ([member "
"screen_space_aa]) will automatically apply a [code]-0.25[/code] offset to "
"this value. If both TAA and FXAA are enabled at the same time, an offset of "
"[code]-0.75[/code] is applied to this value.\n"
"To control this property on the root viewport, set the [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/texture_mipmap_bias] "
"project setting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member scaling_3d_scale] is lower than [code]1.0[/code] "
"(exclusive), [member texture_mipmap_bias] is used to adjust the automatic "
"mipmap bias which is calculated internally based on the scale factor. The "
"formula for this is [code]log2(scaling_3d_scale) + mipmap_bias[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only supported in the Forward+ and Mobile "
"renderers, not Compatibility. In Compatibility, this property is always "
"treated as if it was set to [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງເທັກເຈີຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍໂດຍການອ່ານຈາກ mipmap ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າ (ເອີ້ນວ່າ "
"\"texture LOD bias\"). ຄ່າທີ່ຕິດລົບຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເທັກເຈີແບບ mipmap ມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນແຕ່ຈະເບິ່ງເປັນເມັດ "
"(grainier) ເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກໄລຍະໄກ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າບວກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເທັກເຈີແບບ mipmap ເບິ່ງມົວລົງ "
"(ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເບິ່ງໃກ້ໆກໍຕາມ).\n"
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ temporal antialiasing ([member use_taa]) ຈະປັບຄ່າ offset [code]-0.5[/"
"code] ໃຫ້ກັບຄ່ານີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການເປີດໃຊ້ FXAA ([member screen_space_aa]) "
"ຈະປັບຄ່າ offset [code]-0.25[/code] ໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ທັງ TAA ແລະ FXAA ພ້ອມກັນ, "
"ຈະມີການປັບຄ່າ offset [code]-0.75[/code] ໃຫ້ກັບຄ່ານີ້.\n"
"ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃນ root viewport, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"textures/default_filters/texture_mipmap_bias] ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [member scaling_3d_scale] ຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code], [member "
"texture_mipmap_bias] ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບ mipmap bias ອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ເຊິ່ງຄິດໄລ່ພາຍໃນໂດຍອີງຕາມຕົວຄູນການປັບຂະໜາດ. ສູດສຳລັບສິ່ງນີ້ແມ່ນ [code]log2(scaling_3d_scale) "
"+ mipmap_bias[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນເຣັນເດີເຣີ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ Compatibility. ໃນ Compatibility, ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດຄືກັບວ່າມັນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]0.0[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the viewport should render its background as "
"transparent.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to technical limitations, certain rendering features are "
"disabled when a viewport has a transparent background. This currently applies "
"to screen-space reflections, subsurface scattering, and depth of field."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວິວພອດຈະເຣັນເດີພື້ນຫຼັງໃຫ້ໂປ່ງໃສ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຍ້ອນຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທາງເຕັກນິກ, "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດການເຣັນເດີບາງຢ່າງຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານເມື່ອວິວພອດມີພື້ນຫຼັງໂປ່ງໃສ."

msgid ""
"When using the Mobile or Forward+ renderers, set [member use_debanding] to "
"enable or disable the debanding feature of this [Viewport]. If [member "
"use_hdr_2d] is [code]false[/code], 2D rendering is [i]not[/i] affected by "
"debanding unless the [member Environment.background_mode] is [constant "
"Environment.BG_CANVAS]. If [member use_hdr_2d] is [code]true[/code], "
"debanding will only be applied if this is the root [Viewport] and will affect "
"all 2D and 3D rendering, including canvas items.\n"
"[member use_debanding] has no effect when using the Compatibility rendering "
"method. The Mobile renderer can also use material debanding, which can be set "
"with [method RenderingServer.material_set_use_debanding] or configured with "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/use_debanding].\n"
"See also [member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/"
"use_debanding], [method RenderingServer.material_set_use_debanding], and "
"[method RenderingServer.viewport_set_use_debanding]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວເຣັນເດີ Mobile ຫຼື Forward+, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ [member use_debanding] ເພື່ອເປີດ ຫຼື "
"ປິດຄຸນສົມບັດ debanding (ການຫຼຸດຮອຍແຖບສີ) ຂອງ [Viewport] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], 2D rendering will use a high dynamic range (HDR) "
"[code]RGBA16[/code] format framebuffer. Additionally, 2D rendering will be "
"performed on linear values and will be converted using the appropriate "
"transfer function immediately before blitting to the screen (if the Viewport "
"is attached to the screen).\n"
"Practically speaking, this means that the end result of the Viewport will not "
"be clamped to the [code]0-1[/code] range and can be used in 3D rendering "
"without color encoding adjustments. This allows 2D rendering to take "
"advantage of effects requiring high dynamic range (e.g. 2D glow) as well as "
"substantially improves the appearance of effects requiring highly detailed "
"gradients."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການເຣັນເດີ 2D ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ framebuffer ແບບ high dynamic "
"range (HDR) [code]RGBA16[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [OccluderInstance3D] nodes will be usable for occlusion "
"culling in 3D for this viewport. For the root viewport, [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/occlusion_culling/use_occlusion_culling] must be "
"set to [code]true[/code] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Enabling occlusion culling has a cost on the CPU. Only enable "
"occlusion culling if you actually plan to use it, and think whether your "
"scene can actually benefit from occlusion culling. Large, open scenes with "
"few or no objects blocking the view will generally not benefit much from "
"occlusion culling. Large open scenes generally benefit more from mesh LOD and "
"visibility ranges ([member GeometryInstance3D.visibility_range_begin] and "
"[member GeometryInstance3D.visibility_range_end]) compared to occlusion "
"culling.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to memory constraints, occlusion culling is not supported by "
"default in Web export templates. It can be enabled by compiling custom Web "
"export templates with [code]module_raycast_enabled=yes[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດ [OccluderInstance3D] ຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດ "
"occlusion culling ໃນ 3D ສຳລັບວິວພອດນີ້."

msgid ""
"Enables temporal antialiasing for this viewport. TAA works by jittering the "
"camera and accumulating the images of the last rendered frames, motion vector "
"rendering is used to account for camera and object motion.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The implementation is not complete yet, some visual instances "
"such as particles and skinned meshes may show artifacts.\n"
"See also [member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/use_taa] and "
"[method RenderingServer.viewport_set_use_taa]."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການລົບຮອຍຢັກແບບ Temporal (TAA) ສຳລັບວິວພອດນີ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the viewport will use the primary XR interface to "
"render XR output. When applicable this can result in a stereoscopic image and "
"the resulting render being output to a headset."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວິວພອດຈະໃຊ້ອິນເຕີເຟດ XR ຫຼັກເພື່ອເຣັນເດີເອົາພຸດ XR."

msgid ""
"The Variable Rate Shading (VRS) mode that is used for this viewport. Note, if "
"hardware does not support VRS this property is ignored."
msgstr "ໂໝດ Variable Rate Shading (VRS) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບວິວພອດນີ້."

msgid ""
"Texture to use when [member vrs_mode] is set to [constant "
"Viewport.VRS_TEXTURE].\n"
"The texture [i]must[/i] use a lossless compression format so that colors can "
"be matched precisely. The following VRS densities are mapped to various "
"colors, with brighter colors representing a lower level of shading "
"precision:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- 1×1 = rgb(0, 0, 0)     - #000000\n"
"- 1×2 = rgb(0, 85, 0)    - #005500\n"
"- 2×1 = rgb(85, 0, 0)    - #550000\n"
"- 2×2 = rgb(85, 85, 0)   - #555500\n"
"- 2×4 = rgb(85, 170, 0)  - #55aa00\n"
"- 4×2 = rgb(170, 85, 0)  - #aa5500\n"
"- 4×4 = rgb(170, 170, 0) - #aaaa00\n"
"- 4×8 = rgb(170, 255, 0) - #aaff00 - Not supported on most hardware\n"
"- 8×4 = rgb(255, 170, 0) - #ffaa00 - Not supported on most hardware\n"
"- 8×8 = rgb(255, 255, 0) - #ffff00 - Not supported on most hardware\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ເທັກເຈີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [member vrs_mode] ຖືກກຳນົດເປັນ [constant Viewport.VRS_TEXTURE]."

msgid ""
"Sets the update mode for Variable Rate Shading (VRS) for the viewport. VRS "
"requires the input texture to be converted to the format usable by the VRS "
"method supported by the hardware. The update mode defines how often this "
"happens. If the GPU does not support VRS, or VRS is not enabled, this "
"property is ignored."
msgstr "ກຳນົດໂໝດການອັບເດດສຳລັບ Variable Rate Shading (VRS) ຂອງວິວພອດ."

msgid "The custom [World2D] which can be used as 2D environment source."
msgstr "[World2D] ແບບກຳນົດເອງເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນແຫຼ່ງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ 2D ໄດ້."

msgid "The custom [World3D] which can be used as 3D environment source."
msgstr "[World3D] ແບບກຳນົດເອງເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນແຫຼ່ງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ 3D ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a Control node grabs keyboard focus.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A Control node losing focus doesn't cause this signal to be "
"emitted."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອໂນດ Control ໄດ້ຮັບໂຟກັດຄີບອດ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the size of the viewport is changed, whether by resizing of "
"window, or some other means."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຂະໜາດຂອງວິວພອດປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "This quadrant will not be used."
msgstr "ສ່ວນສີ່ນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກໃຊ້."

msgid "This quadrant will only be used by one shadow map."
msgstr "ສ່ວນສີ່ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ shadow map ພຽງອັນດຽວ."

msgid "This quadrant will be split in 4 and used by up to 4 shadow maps."
msgstr "ສ່ວນສີ່ນີ້ຈະຖືກແບ່ງເປັນ 4 ແລະ ໃຊ້ໂດຍ shadow maps ສູງສຸດ 4 ອັນ."

msgid "This quadrant will be split 16 ways and used by up to 16 shadow maps."
msgstr "ສ່ວນສີ່ນີ້ຈະຖືກແບ່ງເປັນ 16 ແລະ ໃຊ້ໂດຍ shadow maps ສູງສຸດ 16 ອັນ."

msgid "This quadrant will be split 64 ways and used by up to 64 shadow maps."
msgstr "ສ່ວນສີ່ນີ້ຈະຖືກແບ່ງເປັນ 64 ແລະ ໃຊ້ໂດຍ shadow maps ສູງສຸດ 64 ອັນ."

msgid ""
"This quadrant will be split 256 ways and used by up to 256 shadow maps. "
"Unless the [member positional_shadow_atlas_size] is very high, the shadows in "
"this quadrant will be very low resolution."
msgstr "ສ່ວນສີ່ນີ້ຈະຖືກແບ່ງເປັນ 256 ແລະ ໃຊ້ໂດຍ shadow maps ສູງສຸດ 256 ອັນ."

msgid ""
"This quadrant will be split 1024 ways and used by up to 1024 shadow maps. "
"Unless the [member positional_shadow_atlas_size] is very high, the shadows in "
"this quadrant will be very low resolution."
msgstr "ສ່ວນສີ່ນີ້ຈະຖືກແບ່ງເປັນ 1024 ແລະ ໃຊ້ໂດຍ shadow maps ສູງສຸດ 1024 ອັນ."

msgid ""
"Represents the size of the [enum PositionalShadowAtlasQuadrantSubdiv] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ (enum) [enum PositionalShadowAtlasQuadrantSubdiv]."

msgid ""
"Use bilinear scaling for the viewport's 3D buffer. The amount of scaling can "
"be set using [member scaling_3d_scale]. Values less than [code]1.0[/code] "
"will result in undersampling while values greater than [code]1.0[/code] will "
"result in supersampling. A value of [code]1.0[/code] disables scaling."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການຂະຫຍາຍແບບ bilinear ສຳລັບບັບເຟີ 3D ຂອງວິວພອດ."

msgid ""
"Use AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 1.0 upscaling for the viewport's 3D "
"buffer. The amount of scaling can be set using [member scaling_3d_scale]. "
"Values less than [code]1.0[/code] will result in the viewport being upscaled "
"using FSR. Values greater than [code]1.0[/code] are not supported and "
"bilinear downsampling will be used instead. A value of [code]1.0[/code] "
"disables scaling."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 1.0 (FSR) upscaling ສຳລັບບັບເຟີ 3D ຂອງວິວພອດ."

msgid ""
"Use the [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/metalfx/"
"mtlfxspatialscaler#overview]MetalFX spatial upscaler[/url] for the viewport's "
"3D buffer.\n"
"The amount of scaling can be set using [member scaling_3d_scale].\n"
"Values less than [code]1.0[/code] will result in the viewport being upscaled "
"using MetalFX. Values greater than [code]1.0[/code] are not supported and "
"bilinear downsampling will be used instead. A value of [code]1.0[/code] "
"disables scaling.\n"
"More information: [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"metalfx]MetalFX[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when the Metal rendering driver is in use, which "
"limits this scaling mode to macOS and iOS."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ MetalFX spatial upscaler ສຳລັບບັບເຟີ 3D ຂອງວິວພອດ."

msgid ""
"Use the [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/metalfx/"
"mtlfxtemporalscaler#overview]MetalFX temporal upscaler[/url] for the "
"viewport's 3D buffer.\n"
"The amount of scaling can be set using [member scaling_3d_scale]. To "
"determine the minimum input scale, use the [method RenderingDevice.limit_get] "
"method with [constant "
"RenderingDevice.LIMIT_METALFX_TEMPORAL_SCALER_MIN_SCALE].\n"
"Values less than [code]1.0[/code] will result in the viewport being upscaled "
"using MetalFX. Values greater than [code]1.0[/code] are not supported and "
"bilinear downsampling will be used instead. A value of [code]1.0[/code] will "
"use MetalFX at native resolution as a TAA solution.\n"
"More information: [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"metalfx]MetalFX[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when the Metal rendering driver is in use, which "
"limits this scaling mode to macOS and iOS."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ MetalFX temporal upscaler ສຳລັບບັບເຟີ 3D ຂອງວິວພອດ."

msgid ""
"Use nearest-neighbor filtering for the viewport's 3D buffer. This looks "
"crisper than [constant SCALING_3D_MODE_BILINEAR] and has no additional "
"rendering cost. The amount of scaling can be set using [member "
"scaling_3d_scale]. Values greater than [code]1.0[/code] are not supported and "
"bilinear downsampling will be used instead. A value of [code]1.0[/code] "
"disables scaling.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the [b]Nearest[/b] scaling mode, to avoid uneven "
"pixel scaling, it's highly recommended to use a value equal to an integer "
"divisor with a dividend of [code]1[/code]. For example, it's best to use a "
"scale of [code]0.5[/code] (1/2), [code]0.3333[/code] (1/3), [code]0.25[/code] "
"(1/4), [code]0.2[/code] (1/5), and so on."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການກອງແບບ nearest-neighbor ສຳລັບບັບເຟີ 3D ຂອງວິວພອດ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Scaling3DMode] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum Scaling3DMode]."

msgid ""
"Multisample antialiasing mode disabled. This is the default value, and is "
"also the fastest setting."
msgstr "ປິດໂໝດການລົບຮອຍຢັກແບບ Multisample. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ເປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Use 2× Multisample Antialiasing. This has a moderate performance cost. It "
"helps reduce aliasing noticeably, but 4× MSAA still looks substantially "
"better."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ 2× Multisample Antialiasing."

msgid ""
"Use 4× Multisample Antialiasing. This has a significant performance cost, and "
"is generally a good compromise between performance and quality."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ 4× Multisample Antialiasing."

msgid ""
"Use 8× Multisample Antialiasing. This has a very high performance cost. The "
"difference between 4× and 8× MSAA may not always be visible in real gameplay "
"conditions. Likely unsupported on low-end and older hardware."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ 8× Multisample Antialiasing."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum MSAA] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum MSAA]."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum AnisotropicFiltering] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum AnisotropicFiltering]."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ScreenSpaceAA] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ScreenSpaceAA]."

msgid "Amount of objects in frame."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນວັດຖຸໃນເຟຣມ."

msgid "Amount of vertices in frame."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຈຸດຍອດ (vertices) ໃນເຟຣມ."

msgid "Amount of draw calls in frame."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ draw calls ໃນເຟຣມ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum RenderInfo] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum RenderInfo]."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum RenderInfoType] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum RenderInfoType]."

msgid "Objects are displayed normally."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸຖືກສະແດງຜົນຕາມປົກກະຕິ."

msgid ""
"Objects are displayed without textures and only with lighting information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using this debug draw mode, custom shaders are ignored "
"since all materials in the scene temporarily use a debug material. This means "
"the result from custom shader functions (such as vertex displacement) won't "
"be visible anymore when using this debug draw mode."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸຖືກສະແດງຜົນໂດຍບໍ່ມີເທັກເຈີ ແລະ ມີພຽງຂໍ້ມູນແສງສະຫວ່າງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Objects are displayed semi-transparent with additive blending so you can see "
"where they are drawing over top of one another. A higher overdraw means you "
"are wasting performance on drawing pixels that are being hidden behind "
"others.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using this debug draw mode, custom shaders are ignored "
"since all materials in the scene temporarily use a debug material. This means "
"the result from custom shader functions (such as vertex displacement) won't "
"be visible anymore when using this debug draw mode."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸຖືກສະແດງຜົນແບບເຄິ່ງໂປ່ງໃສດ້ວຍການປະສົມແບບ additive ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນບ່ອນທີ່ພວກມັນແຕ້ມທັບກັນ."

msgid ""
"Objects are displayed as wireframe models.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method RenderingServer.set_debug_generate_wireframes] must be "
"called before loading any meshes for wireframes to be visible when using the "
"Compatibility renderer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In the Compatibility renderer, backfaces are always visible when "
"using wireframe rendering. In the Forward+ and Mobile renderers, wireframes "
"follow the material's backface culling properties instead."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸຖືກສະແດງຜົນເປັນແບບໂຄງລວດ (wireframe)."

msgid ""
"Objects are displayed without lighting information and their textures "
"replaced by normal mapping.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸຖືກສະແດງຜົນໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນແສງສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ເທັກເຈີຂອງພວກມັນຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍ normal mapping."

msgid ""
"Draws the shadow atlas that stores shadows from [DirectionalLight3D]s in the "
"upper left quadrant of the [Viewport]."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມ shadow atlas ທີ່ເກັບເງົາຈາກ [DirectionalLight3D]."

msgid ""
"Draws the scene luminance buffer (if available) in the upper left quadrant of "
"the [Viewport].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ or Mobile rendering "
"methods."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມບັບເຟີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງສາກ (scene luminance buffer)."

msgid ""
"Draws the screen-space ambient occlusion texture instead of the scene so that "
"you can clearly see how it is affecting objects. In order for this display "
"mode to work, you must have [member Environment.ssao_enabled] set in your "
"[WorldEnvironment].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມເທັກເຈີ screen-space ambient occlusion (SSAO) ແທນທີ່ສາກ."

msgid ""
"Draws the screen-space indirect lighting texture instead of the scene so that "
"you can clearly see how it is affecting objects. In order for this display "
"mode to work, you must have [member Environment.ssil_enabled] set in your "
"[WorldEnvironment].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມເທັກເຈີ screen-space indirect lighting (SSIL) ແທນທີ່ສາກ."

msgid ""
"Draws the decal atlas used by [Decal]s and light projector textures in the "
"upper left quadrant of the [Viewport].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ or Mobile rendering "
"methods."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມ decal atlas ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [Decal] ແລະ ເທັກເຈີຕົວສາຍແສງ (light projector)."

msgid ""
"Draws the cascades used to render signed distance field global illumination "
"(SDFGI).\n"
"Does nothing if the current environment's [member Environment.sdfgi_enabled] "
"is [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ cascades ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຣັນເດີ signed distance field global illumination (SDFGI)."

msgid ""
"Draws the probes used for signed distance field global illumination (SDFGI).\n"
"When in the editor, left-clicking a probe will display additional bright dots "
"that show its occlusion information. A white dot means the light is not "
"occluded at all at the dot's position, while a red dot means the light is "
"fully occluded. Intermediate values are possible.\n"
"Does nothing if the current environment's [member Environment.sdfgi_enabled] "
"is [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມ probes ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ SDFGI."

msgid ""
"Draws the buffer used for global illumination from [VoxelGI] or SDFGI. "
"Requires [VoxelGI] (at least one visible baked VoxelGI node) or SDFGI "
"([member Environment.sdfgi_enabled]) to be enabled to have a visible effect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມບັບເຟີທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ global illumination ຈາກ [VoxelGI] ຫຼື SDFGI."

msgid ""
"Draws all of the objects at their highest polycount regardless of their "
"distance from the camera. No low level of detail (LOD) is applied."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມວັດຖຸທັງໝົດດ້ວຍຈຳນວນໂພລີກອນສູງສຸດ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກກ້ອງ. ບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ LOD."

msgid ""
"Draws the cluster used by [OmniLight3D] nodes to optimize light rendering.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມ cluster ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍໂນດ [OmniLight3D] ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງການເຣັນເດີແສງ."

msgid ""
"Draws the cluster used by [SpotLight3D] nodes to optimize light rendering.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມ cluster ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍໂນດ [SpotLight3D] ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງການເຣັນເດີແສງ."

msgid ""
"Draws the cluster used by [Decal] nodes to optimize decal rendering.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມ cluster ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍໂນດ [Decal] ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງການເຣັນເດີ decal."

msgid ""
"Draws the cluster used by [ReflectionProbe] nodes to optimize reflection "
"probes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມ cluster ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍໂນດ [ReflectionProbe] ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງ reflection probes."

msgid ""
"Draws the buffer used for occlusion culling.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ or Mobile rendering "
"methods."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມບັບເຟີທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ occlusion culling."

msgid ""
"Draws vector lines over the viewport to indicate the movement of pixels "
"between frames.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນເວັກເຕີເທິງວິວພອດເພື່ອສະແດງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງພິກເຊວລະຫວ່າງເຟຣມ."

msgid ""
"Draws the internal resolution buffer of the scene in linear colorspace before "
"tonemapping or post-processing is applied.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ or Mobile rendering "
"methods."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມບັບເຟີຄວາມລະອຽດພາຍໃນຂອງສາກໃນ linear colorspace."

msgid ""
"Draws the cluster used by [AreaLight3D] nodes to optimize light rendering.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມ cluster ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍໂນດ [AreaLight3D] ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງການເຣັນເດີແສງ."

msgid ""
"Draws the atlas used by [AreaLight3D] nodes in the upper left quadrant of the "
"[Viewport].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ or Mobile rendering "
"method."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມ atlas ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍໂນດ [AreaLight3D]."

msgid ""
"The [Viewport] will inherit the filter from its parent [CanvasItem] or "
"[Viewport]."
msgstr "[Viewport] ຈະສືບທອດຕົວຕອງ (filter) ຈາກ [CanvasItem] ຫຼື [Viewport] ທີ່ເປັນພໍ່ແມ່."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum DefaultCanvasItemTextureFilter] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum DefaultCanvasItemTextureFilter]."

msgid ""
"The [Viewport] will inherit the repeat mode from its parent [CanvasItem] or "
"[Viewport]."
msgstr ""
"[Viewport] ຈະສືບທອດໂໝດການວົນຊ້ຳ (repeat mode) ຈາກ [CanvasItem] ຫຼື [Viewport] "
"ທີ່ເປັນພໍ່ແມ່."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum DefaultCanvasItemTextureRepeat] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum DefaultCanvasItemTextureRepeat]."

msgid "The signed distance field only covers the viewport's own rectangle."
msgstr "Signed distance field ຈະປົກຄຸມສະເພາະຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກຂອງວິວພອດເອງ."

msgid ""
"The signed distance field is expanded to cover 20% of the viewport's size "
"around the borders."
msgstr "Signed distance field ຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍໃຫ້ປົກຄຸມ 20% ຂອງຂະໜາດວິວພອດຮອບໆຂອບ."

msgid ""
"The signed distance field is expanded to cover 50% of the viewport's size "
"around the borders."
msgstr "Signed distance field ຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍໃຫ້ປົກຄຸມ 50% ຂອງຂະໜາດວິວພອດຮອບໆຂອບ."

msgid ""
"The signed distance field is expanded to cover 100% (double) of the "
"viewport's size around the borders."
msgstr ""
"Signed distance field ຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍໃຫ້ປົກຄຸມ 100% (ສອງເທົ່າ) ຂອງຂະໜາດວິວພອດຮອບໆຂອບ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum SDFOversize] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum SDFOversize]."

msgid "The signed distance field is rendered at full resolution."
msgstr "Signed distance field ຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີດ້ວຍຄວາມລະອຽດເຕັມ."

msgid ""
"The signed distance field is rendered at half the resolution of this viewport."
msgstr "Signed distance field ຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີດ້ວຍຄວາມລະອຽດເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງວິວພອດນີ້."

msgid ""
"The signed distance field is rendered at a quarter the resolution of this "
"viewport."
msgstr "Signed distance field ຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີດ້ວຍຄວາມລະອຽດໜຶ່ງສ່ວນສີ່ຂອງວິວພອດນີ້."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum SDFScale] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum SDFScale]."

msgid "Variable Rate Shading is disabled."
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ງານ Variable Rate Shading."

msgid ""
"Variable Rate Shading uses a texture. Note, for stereoscopic use a texture "
"atlas with a texture for each view."
msgstr "Variable Rate Shading ໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີ."

msgid ""
"Variable Rate Shading's texture is supplied by the primary [XRInterface]."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີຂອງ Variable Rate Shading ຖືກສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ [XRInterface] ຫຼັກ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum VRSMode] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum VRSMode]."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum VRSUpdateMode] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum VRSUpdateMode]."

msgid "Provides the content of a [Viewport] as a dynamic texture."
msgstr "ສະໜອງເນື້ອຫາຂອງ [Viewport] ເປັນເທັກເຈີແບບໄດນາມິກ (dynamic texture)."

msgid ""
"The path to the [Viewport] node to display. This is relative to the local "
"scene root (see [method Resource.get_local_scene]), [b]not[/b] to the nodes "
"that use this texture.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In the editor, this path is automatically updated when the "
"target viewport or one of its ancestors is renamed or moved. At runtime, this "
"path may not automatically update if the scene root cannot be found."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາໂນດ [Viewport] ທີ່ຈະສະແດງ."

msgid "A virtual joystick control for touchscreen devices."
msgstr "ຄອນໂທຣລ ຈອຍສະຕິກ (joystick) ສະເໝືອນສຳລັບອຸປະກອນໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດ."

msgid ""
"A customizable on-screen joystick control designed for touchscreen devices. "
"It allows users to provide directional input by dragging a virtual tip within "
"a defined circular area.\n"
"This control can simulate directional actions (see [member action_up], "
"[member action_down], [member action_left], and [member action_right]), which "
"are triggered when the joystick is moved in the corresponding directions."
msgstr "ຄອນໂທຣລ ຈອຍສະຕິກເທິງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບອຸປະກອນໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດ."

msgid "The action to trigger when the joystick is moved down."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ (action) ທີ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອເລື່ອນຈອຍສະຕິກລົງ."

msgid "The action to trigger when the joystick is moved left."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ (action) ທີ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອເລື່ອນຈອຍສະຕິກໄປທາງຊ້າຍ."

msgid "The action to trigger when the joystick is moved right."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ (action) ທີ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອເລື່ອນຈອຍສະຕິກໄປທາງຂວາ."

msgid "The action to trigger when the joystick is moved up."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ (action) ທີ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອເລື່ອນຈອຍສະຕິກຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The multiplier applied to the joystick's radius that defines the clamp zone.\n"
"This zone limits how far the joystick tip can move from its center before "
"being clamped.\n"
"A value of [code]1.0[/code] means the tip can move up to the edge of the "
"joystick's visual size.\n"
"In [constant JOYSTICK_FOLLOWING] mode, this radius also determines how far "
"the finger can move before the joystick base starts following the touch input."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບລັດສະໝີຂອງຈອຍສະຕິກ ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍກຳນົດຂອບເຂດການຈຳກັດ (clamp zone)."

msgid ""
"The ratio of the joystick size that defines the joystick deadzone. The "
"joystick tip must move beyond this ratio before being considered active.\n"
"This deadzone is applied before triggering input actions and affects the "
"joystick's input vector and all related signals.\n"
"Note that input actions may also define their own deadzones in the InputMap. "
"If both are set, the joystick deadzone is applied first, followed by the "
"action's deadzone.\n"
"By default, this value is [code]0.0[/code], meaning the joystick does not "
"apply its own deadzone and relies entirely on the InputMap action deadzones."
msgstr "ອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງຂະໜາດຈອຍສະຕິກທີ່ກຳນົດເຂດຕາຍ (deadzone)."

msgid ""
"The initial position of the joystick as a ratio of the control's size. [code]"
"(0, 0)[/code] is top-left and [code](1, 1)[/code] is bottom-right."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຈອຍສະຕິກເປັນອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງຂະໜາດຄອນໂທຣລ."

msgid "The joystick mode to use."
msgstr "ໂໝດຈອຍສະຕິກທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

msgid "The size of the joystick in pixels."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງຈອຍສະຕິກເປັນພິກເຊວ."

msgid "The size of the joystick tip in pixels."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງຫົວຈອຍສະຕິກ (tip)ເປັນພິກເຊວ."

msgid "The visibility mode to use."
msgstr "ໂໝດການເບິ່ງເຫັນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

msgid "Emitted when the tip enters the deadzone after being outside of it."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຫົວຈອຍສະຕິກເຂົ້າມາໃນເຂດຕາຍ (deadzone) ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ເຄີຍຢູ່ນອກເຂດນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the tip moved outside the deadzone and the joystick is released. "
"The [param input_vector] contains the last input direction and strength "
"before release. Its length is between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຫົວຈອຍສະຕິກເຄື່ອນທີ່ອອກນອກເຂດຕາຍ ແລະ ຖືກປ່ອຍ."

msgid "Emitted when the joystick is pressed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຈອຍສະຕິກຖືກກົດ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the joystick is released. The [param input_vector] is the final "
"input direction and strength, with a length between [code]0.0[/code] and "
"[code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຈອຍສະຕິກຖືກປ່ອຍ."

msgid "Emitted when the joystick is released without moving the tip."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຈອຍສະຕິກຖືກປ່ອຍໂດຍທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເລື່ອນຫົວຈອຍ."

msgid "The joystick doesn't move."
msgstr "ຈອຍສະຕິກບໍ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່."

msgid ""
"The joystick is moved to the initial touch position as long as it's within "
"the joystick's bounds. It moves back to its original position when released."
msgstr "ຈອຍສະຕິກຈະຍ້າຍໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ສຳຜັດທຳອິດ ຕາບໃດທີ່ມັນຍັງຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດ."

msgid ""
"The joystick is moved to the initial touch position as long as it's within "
"the joystick's bounds. It will follow the touch input if it goes outside the "
"joystick's range. It moves back to its original position when released."
msgstr "ຈອຍສະຕິກຈະຍ້າຍໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ສຳຜັດທຳອິດ ແລະ ຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມການສຳຜັດຖ້າອອກນອກຂອບເຂດ."

msgid "The joystick is always visible."
msgstr "ຈອຍສະຕິກເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ."

msgid "The joystick is only visible when being touched."
msgstr "ຈອຍສະຕິກຈະເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ສະເພາະຕອນທີ່ຖືກສຳຜັດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Base joystick [StyleBox]."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ຂອງຖານຈອຍສະຕິກ."

msgid "Tip joystick [StyleBox]."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ຂອງຫົວຈອຍສະຕິກ (tip)."

msgid "Base joystick [StyleBox] when pressed."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ຂອງຖານຈອຍສະຕິກເມື່ອຖືກກົດ."

msgid "Tip joystick [StyleBox] when pressed."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ຂອງຫົວຈອຍສະຕິກເມື່ອຖືກກົດ."

msgid ""
"A rectangular region of 2D space that, when visible on screen, enables a "
"target node."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກໃນຊ່ອງວ່າງ 2D ທີ່ເມື່ອເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ເທິງໜ້າຈໍ ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂນດເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"[VisibleOnScreenEnabler2D] contains a rectangular region of 2D space and a "
"target node. The target node will be automatically enabled (via its [member "
"Node.process_mode] property) when any part of this region becomes visible on "
"the screen, and automatically disabled otherwise. This can for example be "
"used to activate enemies only when the player approaches them.\n"
"See [VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D] if you only want to be notified when the "
"region is visible on screen.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [VisibleOnScreenEnabler2D] uses the render culling code to "
"determine whether it's visible on screen, so it won't function unless [member "
"CanvasItem.visible] is set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"[VisibleOnScreenEnabler2D] ປະກອບດ້ວຍພື້ນທີ່ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກ 2D ແລະ ໂນດເປົ້າໝາຍ. "
"ໂນດເປົ້າໝາຍຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອພື້ນທີ່ນີ້ປາກົດເທິງໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"Determines how the target node is enabled. Corresponds to [enum "
"Node.ProcessMode]. When the node is disabled, it always uses [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວິທີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂນດເປົ້າໝາຍ. ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບ [enum Node.ProcessMode]."

msgid ""
"The path to the target node, relative to the [VisibleOnScreenEnabler2D]. The "
"target node is cached; it's only assigned when setting this property (if the "
"[VisibleOnScreenEnabler2D] is inside the scene tree) and every time the "
"[VisibleOnScreenEnabler2D] enters the scene tree. If the path is empty, no "
"node will be affected. If the path is invalid, an error is also generated."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາໂນດເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid "Corresponds to [constant Node.PROCESS_MODE_INHERIT]."
msgstr "ກົງກັບ [constant Node.PROCESS_MODE_INHERIT]."

msgid "Corresponds to [constant Node.PROCESS_MODE_ALWAYS]."
msgstr "ກົງກັບ [constant Node.PROCESS_MODE_ALWAYS]."

msgid "Corresponds to [constant Node.PROCESS_MODE_WHEN_PAUSED]."
msgstr "ກົງກັບ [constant Node.PROCESS_MODE_WHEN_PAUSED]."

msgid ""
"A box-shaped region of 3D space that, when visible on screen, enables a "
"target node."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ຮູບຊົງກ່ອງໃນຊ່ອງວ່າງ 3D ທີ່ເມື່ອເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ເທິງໜ້າຈໍ ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂນດເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"[VisibleOnScreenEnabler3D] contains a box-shaped region of 3D space and a "
"target node. The target node will be automatically enabled (via its [member "
"Node.process_mode] property) when any part of this region becomes visible on "
"the screen, and automatically disabled otherwise. This can for example be "
"used to activate enemies only when the player approaches them.\n"
"See [VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D] if you only want to be notified when the "
"region is visible on screen.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [VisibleOnScreenEnabler3D] uses an approximate heuristic that "
"doesn't take walls and other occlusion into account, unless occlusion culling "
"is used. It also won't function unless [member Node3D.visible] is set to "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr "[VisibleOnScreenEnabler3D] ປະກອບດ້ວຍພື້ນທີ່ຮູບຊົງກ່ອງ 3D ແລະ ໂນດເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"The path to the target node, relative to the [VisibleOnScreenEnabler3D]. The "
"target node is cached; it's only assigned when setting this property (if the "
"[VisibleOnScreenEnabler3D] is inside the scene tree) and every time the "
"[VisibleOnScreenEnabler3D] enters the scene tree. If the path is empty, no "
"node will be affected. If the path is invalid, an error is also generated."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາໂນດເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"A rectangular region of 2D space that detects whether it is visible on screen."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກໃນຊ່ອງວ່າງ 2D ທີ່ກວດຈັບວ່າມັນເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ເທິງໜ້າຈໍຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"[VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D] represents a rectangular region of 2D space. When "
"any part of this region becomes visible on screen or in a viewport, it will "
"emit a [signal screen_entered] signal, and likewise it will emit a [signal "
"screen_exited] signal when no part of it remains visible.\n"
"If you want a node to be enabled automatically when this region is visible on "
"screen, use [VisibleOnScreenEnabler2D].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D] uses the render culling code to "
"determine whether it's visible on screen, so it won't function unless [member "
"CanvasItem.visible] is set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"[VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D] ແທນພື້ນທີ່ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກ 2D ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອມັນປາກົດ ຫຼື "
"ຫາຍໄປຈາກໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the bounding rectangle is on the screen.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It takes one frame for the [VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D]'s "
"visibility to be determined once added to the scene tree, so this method will "
"always return [code]false[/code] right after it is instantiated, before the "
"draw pass."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກຂອບເຂດ (bounding rectangle) ຢູ່ເທິງໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid "The VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D's bounding rectangle."
msgstr "ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກຂອບເຂດຂອງ VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows the rectangle area of [member rect] in the editor "
"with a translucent magenta fill. Unlike changing the visibility of the "
"VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D, this does not affect the screen culling detection."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງພື້ນທີ່ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກໃນ editor."

msgid "Emitted when the VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D enters the screen."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D ເຂົ້າສູ່ໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid "Emitted when the VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D exits the screen."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D ອອກຈາກໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"A box-shaped region of 3D space that detects whether it is visible on screen."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ຮູບຊົງກ່ອງໃນຊ່ອງວ່າງ 3D ທີ່ກວດຈັບວ່າມັນເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ເທິງໜ້າຈໍຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"[VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D] represents a box-shaped region of 3D space. When "
"any part of this region becomes visible on screen or in a [Camera3D]'s view, "
"it will emit a [signal screen_entered] signal, and likewise it will emit a "
"[signal screen_exited] signal when no part of it remains visible.\n"
"If you want a node to be enabled automatically when this region is visible on "
"screen, use [VisibleOnScreenEnabler3D].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D] uses an approximate heuristic that "
"doesn't take walls and other occlusion into account, unless occlusion culling "
"is used. It also won't function unless [member Node3D.visible] is set to "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"[VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D] ແທນພື້ນທີ່ຮູບຊົງກ່ອງ 3D ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອມັນປາກົດ ຫຼື "
"ຫາຍໄປຈາກໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the bounding box is on the screen.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It takes one frame for the [VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D]'s "
"visibility to be assessed once added to the scene tree, so this method will "
"always return [code]false[/code] right after it is instantiated."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າກ່ອງຂອບເຂດ (bounding box) ຢູ່ເທິງໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid "The [VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D]'s bounding box."
msgstr "ກ່ອງຂອບເຂດຂອງ [VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D]."

msgid "Emitted when the [VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D] enters the screen."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D] ເຂົ້າສູ່ໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid "Emitted when the [VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D] exits the screen."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D] ອອກຈາກໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid "Parent of all visual 3D nodes."
msgstr "ໂນດຫຼັກຂອງໂນດ 3D ທີ່ສະແດງຜົນທາງພາບທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"The [VisualInstance3D] is used to connect a resource to a visual "
"representation. All visual 3D nodes inherit from the [VisualInstance3D]. In "
"general, you should not access the [VisualInstance3D] properties directly as "
"they are accessed and managed by the nodes that inherit from "
"[VisualInstance3D]. [VisualInstance3D] is the node representation of the "
"[RenderingServer] instance."
msgstr "[VisualInstance3D] ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຊັບພະຍາກອນເຂົ້າກັບການສະແດງຜົນທາງພາບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [AABB] (also known as the bounding box) for this "
"[VisualInstance3D]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [AABB] (ຫຼື ຮຽກວ່າ bounding box) ສຳລັບ [VisualInstance3D] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the RID of the resource associated with this [VisualInstance3D]. For "
"example, if the Node is a [MeshInstance3D], this will return the RID of the "
"associated [Mesh]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ RID ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [VisualInstance3D] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the RID of this instance. This RID is the same as the RID returned by "
"[method RenderingServer.instance_create]. This RID is needed if you want to "
"call [RenderingServer] functions directly on this [VisualInstance3D]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ RID ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns whether or not the specified layer of the [member layers] is enabled, "
"given a [param layer_number] between 1 and 20."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າເລເຢີທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [member layers] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Sets the resource that is instantiated by this [VisualInstance3D], which "
"changes how the engine handles the [VisualInstance3D] under the hood. "
"Equivalent to [method RenderingServer.instance_set_base]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ [VisualInstance3D] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Based on [param value], enables or disables the specified layer in the "
"[member layers], given a [param layer_number] between 1 and 20."
msgstr "ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານເລເຢີທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [member layers] ໂດຍອີງຕາມ [param value]."

msgid ""
"The render layer(s) this [VisualInstance3D] is drawn on.\n"
"This object will only be visible for [Camera3D]s whose cull mask includes any "
"of the render layers this [VisualInstance3D] is set to.\n"
"For [Light3D]s, this can be used to control which [VisualInstance3D]s are "
"affected by a specific light. For [GPUParticles3D], this can be used to "
"control which particles are effected by a specific attractor. For [Decal]s, "
"this can be used to control which [VisualInstance3D]s are affected by a "
"specific decal.\n"
"To adjust [member layers] more easily using a script, use [method "
"get_layer_mask_value] and [method set_layer_mask_value].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [VoxelGI], SDFGI and [LightmapGI] will always take all layers "
"into account to determine what contributes to global illumination. If this is "
"an issue, set [member GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] to [constant "
"GeometryInstance3D.GI_MODE_DISABLED] for meshes and [member "
"Light3D.light_bake_mode] to [constant Light3D.BAKE_DISABLED] for lights to "
"exclude them from global illumination."
msgstr "ເລເຢີການເຣັນເດີທີ່ [VisualInstance3D] ນີ້ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໃສ່."

msgid ""
"The amount by which the depth of this [VisualInstance3D] will be adjusted "
"when sorting by depth. Uses the same units as the engine (which are typically "
"meters). Adjusting it to a higher value will make the [VisualInstance3D] "
"reliably draw on top of other [VisualInstance3D]s that are otherwise "
"positioned at the same spot. To ensure it always draws on top of other "
"objects around it (not positioned at the same spot), set the value to be "
"greater than the distance between this [VisualInstance3D] and the other "
"nearby [VisualInstance3D]s."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຄ່າຄວາມເລິກ (depth) ຂອງ [VisualInstance3D] "
"ທີ່ຈະຖືກປັບປ່ຽນເມື່ອມີການຈັດລຽງຕາມຄວາມເລິກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the object is sorted based on the [AABB] center. The "
"object will be sorted based on the global position otherwise.\n"
"The [AABB] center based sorting is generally more accurate for 3D models. The "
"position based sorting instead allows to better control the drawing order "
"when working with [GPUParticles3D] and [CPUParticles3D]."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວັດຖຸຈະຖືກຈັດລຽງຕາມຈຸດໃຈກາງຂອງ [AABB]."

msgid "A custom shader program with a visual editor."
msgstr "ໂປຣແກຣມເຊເດີແບບກຳນົດເອງພ້ອມກັບຕົວແກ້ໄຂແບບວິຊົວ."

msgid ""
"This class provides a graph-like visual editor for creating a [Shader]. "
"Although [VisualShader]s do not require coding, they share the same logic "
"with script shaders. They use [VisualShaderNode]s that can be connected to "
"each other to control the flow of the shader. The visual shader graph is "
"converted to a script shader behind the scenes."
msgstr ""
"ຄຼາສນີ້ສະໜອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂແບບວິຊົວໃນຮູບແບບກຣາບສຳລັບການສ້າງ [Shader]. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ [VisualShader] "
"ຈະບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຂຽນໂຄ້ດ, ແຕ່ພວກມັນກໍໃຊ້ຕັກກະດຽວກັນກັບເຊເດີແບບສະກຣິບ. ພວກມັນໃຊ້ "
"[VisualShaderNode] ທີ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາກັນເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມການໄຫຼຂອງເຊເດີ. "
"ກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນເຊເດີແບບສະກຣິບຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ."

msgid "Using VisualShaders"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ VisualShaders"

msgid "Adds the specified [param node] to the shader."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ [param node] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ເຂົ້າໃນເຊເດີ."

msgid "Adds a new varying value node to the shader."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມໂນດຄ່າ varying ໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນເຊເດີ."

msgid "Attaches the given node to the given frame."
msgstr "ຕິດໂນດທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບເຟຣມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified nodes and ports can be connected "
"together."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຫາກໂນດ ແລະ ພອດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາກັນໄດ້."

msgid "Connects the specified nodes and ports."
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂນດ ແລະ ພອດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Connects the specified nodes and ports, even if they can't be connected. Such "
"connection is invalid and will not function properly."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂນດ ແລະ ພອດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນໄດ້ກໍຕາມ. "
"ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດັ່ງກ່າວແມ່ນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ຈະເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ປົກກະຕິ."

msgid "Detaches the given node from the frame it is attached to."
msgstr "ແຍກໂນດທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ອອກຈາກເຟຣມທີ່ມັນຕິດຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the shader node instance with specified [param type] and [param id]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງໂນດເຊເດີທີ່ມີ [param type] ແລະ [param id] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid "Returns the list of connected nodes with the specified type."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າລາຍຊື່ຂອງໂນດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວຕາມປະເພດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid "Returns the list of all nodes in the shader with the specified type."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າລາຍຊື່ຂອງໂນດທັງໝົດໃນເຊເດີຕາມປະເພດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid "Returns the position of the specified node within the shader graph."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໂນດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບເຊເດີ."

msgid "Returns next valid node ID that can be added to the shader graph."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ ID ຂອງໂນດຖັດໄປທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເຊິ່ງສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນກຣາບເຊເດີໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the shader has a varying with the given [param "
"name]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຫາກເຊເດີມີ varying ທີ່ມີ [param name] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Removes the specified node from the shader."
msgstr "ລົບໂນດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ອອກຈາກເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Removes a varying value node with the given [param name]. Prints an error if "
"a node with this name is not found."
msgstr "ລົບໂນດຄ່າ varying ທີ່ມີ [param name] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຖ້າບໍ່ພົບໂນດທີ່ມີຊື່ນີ້."

msgid "Replaces the specified node with a node of new class type."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນແທນໂນດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ດ້ວຍໂນດຂອງປະເພດຄຼາສໃໝ່."

msgid "Sets the mode of this shader."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດຂອງເຊເດີນີ້."

msgid "Sets the position of the specified node."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໂນດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid "This property does nothing and always equals to zero."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດຫຍັງ ແລະ ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບສູນສະເໝີ."

msgid "Deprecated."
msgstr "ລ້າສະໄໝແລ້ວ (Deprecated)."

msgid "A vertex shader, operating on vertices."
msgstr "ເຊເດີເວີເທັກ (Vertex shader), ເຮັດວຽກກ່ຽວກັບເວີເທັກ."

msgid "A fragment shader, operating on fragments (pixels)."
msgstr "ເຊເດີແຟຣກເມັ້ນ (Fragment shader), ເຮັດວຽກກ່ຽວກັບແຟຣກເມັ້ນ (ພິກເຊລ)."

msgid "A shader for light calculations."
msgstr "ເຊເດີສຳລັບການຄຳນວນແສງ."

msgid "A function for the \"start\" stage of particle shader."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ \"start\" ຂອງເຊເດີພາຕິເຄິນ."

msgid "A function for the \"process\" stage of particle shader."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ \"process\" ຂອງເຊເດີພາຕິເຄິນ."

msgid ""
"A function for the \"collide\" stage (particle collision handler) of particle "
"shader."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ \"collide\" (ຕົວຈັດການການຕຳຂອງພາຕິເຄິນ) ຂອງເຊເດີພາຕິເຄິນ."

msgid ""
"A function for the \"start\" stage of particle shader, with customized output."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ \"start\" ຂອງເຊເດີພາຕິເຄິນ, ພ້ອມກັບເອົາພຸດທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງ."

msgid ""
"A function for the \"process\" stage of particle shader, with customized "
"output."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນ \"process\" ຂອງເຊເດີພາຕິເຄິນ, ພ້ອມກັບເອົາພຸດທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງ."

msgid "A shader for 3D environment's sky."
msgstr "ເຊເດີສຳລັບທ້ອງຟ້າຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ 3D."

msgid "A compute shader that runs for each froxel of the volumetric fog map."
msgstr ""
"ຄອມພິວເຊເດີ (Compute shader) ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ froxel ຂອງແຜນທີ່ໝອກແບບ volumetric."

msgid "A shader used to process blit calls to a DrawableTexture."
msgstr "ເຊເດີທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນການເອີ້ນ blit ໄປຍັງ DrawableTexture."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Type] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum Type]."

msgid ""
"Varying is passed from [code]Vertex[/code] function to [code]Fragment[/code] "
"and [code]Light[/code] functions."
msgstr ""
"Varying ຖືກສົ່ງຈາກຟັງຊັນ [code]Vertex[/code] ໄປຍັງຟັງຊັນ [code]Fragment[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]Light[/code]."

msgid ""
"Varying is passed from [code]Fragment[/code] function to [code]Light[/code] "
"function."
msgstr "Varying ຖືກສົ່ງຈາກຟັງຊັນ [code]Fragment[/code] ໄປຍັງຟັງຊັນ [code]Light[/code]."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum VaryingMode] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum VaryingMode]."

msgid "Varying is of type [float]."
msgstr "Varying ແມ່ນປະເພດ [float]."

msgid "Varying is of type [int]."
msgstr "Varying ແມ່ນປະເພດ [int]."

msgid "Varying is of type unsigned [int]."
msgstr "Varying ແມ່ນປະເພດ unsigned [int]."

msgid "Varying is of type [Vector2]."
msgstr "Varying ແມ່ນປະເພດ [Vector2]."

msgid "Varying is of type [Vector3]."
msgstr "Varying ແມ່ນປະເພດ [Vector3]."

msgid "Varying is of type [Vector4]."
msgstr "Varying ແມ່ນປະເພດ [Vector4]."

msgid "Varying is of type [bool]."
msgstr "Varying ແມ່ນປະເພດ [bool]."

msgid "Varying is of type [Transform3D]."
msgstr "Varying ແມ່ນປະເພດ [Transform3D]."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum VaryingType] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum VaryingType]."

msgid "Indicates an invalid [VisualShader] node."
msgstr "ບົ່ງບອກເຖິງໂນດ [VisualShader] ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Indicates an output node of [VisualShader]."
msgstr "ບົ່ງບອກເຖິງໂນດເອົາພຸດຂອງ [VisualShader]."

msgid "Base class for [VisualShader] nodes. Not related to scene nodes."
msgstr "ຄຼາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບໂນດ [VisualShader]. ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂນດຂອງສາກ (scene nodes)."

msgid "Clears the default input ports value."
msgstr "ລ້າງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງພອດອິນພຸດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the input port which should be connected by default when this node is "
"created as a result of dragging a connection from an existing node to the "
"empty space on the graph."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າພອດອິນພຸດທີ່ຄວນຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ເມື່ອໂນດນີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກການລາກເສັ້ນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກໂນດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ "
"ໄປຍັງພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງໃນກຣາບ."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] containing default values for all of the input ports of "
"the node in the form [code][index0, value0, index1, value1, ...][/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [Array] ທີ່ບັນຈຸຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບພອດອິນພຸດທັງໝົດຂອງໂນດ ໃນຮູບແບບ [code][index0, value0, "
"index1, value1, ...][/code]."

msgid "Returns the default value of the input [param port]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງອິນພຸດ [param port]."

msgid "Removes the default value of the input [param port]."
msgstr "ລົບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງອິນພຸດ [param port] ອອກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the default input ports values using an [Array] of the form [code]"
"[index0, value0, index1, value1, ...][/code]. For example: [code][0, "
"Vector3(0, 0, 0), 1, Vector3(0, 0, 0)][/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງພອດອິນພຸດໂດຍໃຊ້ [Array] ໃນຮູບແບບ [code][index0, value0, index1, "
"value1, ...][/code]. ຕົວຢ່າງ: [code][0, Vector3(0, 0, 0), 1, Vector3(0, 0, 0)][/"
"code]."

msgid "Sets the default [param value] for the selected input [param port]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param value] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບອິນພຸດ [param port] ທີ່ເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"Represents the index of the frame this node is linked to. If set to [code]-1[/"
"code] the node is not linked to any frame."
msgstr ""
"ແທນອິນເດັກ (index) ຂອງເຟຣມທີ່ໂນດນີ້ຖືກເຊື່ອມໂຍງຢູ່. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]-1[/code] "
"ໂນດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບເຟຣມໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"Sets the output port index which will be showed for preview. If set to "
"[code]-1[/code] no port will be open for preview."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນເດັກຂອງພອດເອົາພຸດທີ່ຈະສະແດງສຳລັບການເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງ (preview). ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]-1[/"
"code] ຈະບໍ່ມີພອດໃດຖືກເປີດສຳລັບການເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງ."

msgid ""
"Floating-point scalar. Translated to [code skip-lint]float[/code] type in "
"shader code."
msgstr "ສະກາລ່າຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມ. ຖືກແປເປັນປະເພດ [code skip-lint]float[/code] ໃນໂຄ້ດເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Integer scalar. Translated to [code skip-lint]int[/code] type in shader code."
msgstr "ສະກາລ່າຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ. ຖືກແປເປັນປະເພດ [code skip-lint]int[/code] ໃນໂຄ້ດເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Unsigned integer scalar. Translated to [code skip-lint]uint[/code] type in "
"shader code."
msgstr ""
"ສະກາລ່າຈຳນວນຖ້ວນບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ. ຖືກແປເປັນປະເພດ [code skip-lint]uint[/code] ໃນໂຄ້ດເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"2D vector of floating-point values. Translated to [code skip-lint]vec2[/code] "
"type in shader code."
msgstr ""
"ເວັກເຕີ້ 2 ມິຕິຂອງຄ່າຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມ. ຖືກແປເປັນປະເພດ [code skip-lint]vec2[/code] ໃນໂຄ້ດເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"3D vector of floating-point values. Translated to [code skip-lint]vec3[/code] "
"type in shader code."
msgstr ""
"ເວັກເຕີ້ 3 ມິຕິຂອງຄ່າຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມ. ຖືກແປເປັນປະເພດ [code skip-lint]vec3[/code] ໃນໂຄ້ດເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"4D vector of floating-point values. Translated to [code skip-lint]vec4[/code] "
"type in shader code."
msgstr ""
"ເວັກເຕີ້ 4 ມິຕິຂອງຄ່າຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມ. ຖືກແປເປັນປະເພດ [code skip-lint]vec4[/code] ໃນໂຄ້ດເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Boolean type. Translated to [code skip-lint]bool[/code] type in shader code."
msgstr "ປະເພດບູລີນ. ຖືກແປເປັນປະເພດ [code skip-lint]bool[/code] ໃນໂຄ້ດເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Transform type. Translated to [code skip-lint]mat4[/code] type in shader code."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດການແປງ (Transform). ຖືກແປເປັນປະເພດ [code skip-lint]mat4[/code] ໃນໂຄ້ດເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Sampler type. Translated to reference of sampler uniform in shader code. Can "
"only be used for input ports in non-uniform nodes."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດແຊມເປຼີ (Sampler). ຖືກແປເປັນການອ້າງອີງຂອງ sampler uniform ໃນໂຄ້ດເຊເດີ. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບພອດອິນພຸດໃນໂນດທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ uniform ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum PortType] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum PortType]."

msgid ""
"A node that controls how the object faces the camera to be used within the "
"visual shader graph."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ຄວບຄຸມວິທີທີ່ວັດຖຸຫັນໜ້າໄປຫາ ກ້ອງເພື່ອໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"The output port of this node needs to be connected to [code]Model View "
"Matrix[/code] port of [VisualShaderNodeOutput]."
msgstr ""
"ພອດເອົາພຸດຂອງໂນດນີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບພອດ [code]Model View Matrix[/code] ຂອງ "
"[VisualShaderNodeOutput]."

msgid "Controls how the object faces the camera."
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມວິທີທີ່ວັດຖຸຫັນໜ້າໄປຫາກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the shader will keep the scale set for the mesh. "
"Otherwise, the scale is lost when billboarding."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເຊເດີຈະຮັກສາຂະໜາດ (scale) ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ສຳລັບ mesh. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຂະໜາດຈະເສຍໄປເມື່ອເຮັດ billboarding."

msgid "Billboarding is disabled and the node does nothing."
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ Billboarding ແລະ ໂນດຈະບໍ່ເຮັດຫຍັງ."

msgid "A standard billboarding algorithm is enabled."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານລະບົບຄຳນວນ billboarding ແບບມາດຕະຖານ."

msgid "A billboarding algorithm to rotate around Y-axis is enabled."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານລະບົບຄຳນວນ billboarding ເພື່ອໝຸນຮອບແກນ Y."

msgid "A billboarding algorithm designed to use on particles is enabled."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານລະບົບຄຳນວນ billboarding ທີ່ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບໃຊ້ກັບພາຕິເຄິນ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum BillboardType] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum BillboardType]."

msgid "A boolean constant to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ບູລີນສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Has only one output port and no inputs.\n"
"Translated to [code skip-lint]bool[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr ""
"ມີພຽງພອດເອົາພຸດດຽວ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີອິນພຸດ.\n"
"ຖືກແປເປັນ [code skip-lint]bool[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid "A boolean constant which represents a state of this node."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ບູລີນທີ່ແທນສະຖານະຂອງໂນດນີ້."

msgid "A boolean parameter to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີບູລີນສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Translated to [code]uniform bool[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ຖືກແປເປັນ [code]uniform bool[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid "A default value to be assigned within the shader."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ພາຍໃນເຊເດີ."

msgid "Enables usage of the [member default_value]."
msgstr "ເປີດການນຳໃຊ້ [member default_value]."

msgid "Clamps a value within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຈຳກັດຄ່າ (Clamp) ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Constrains a value to lie between [code]min[/code] and [code]max[/code] "
"values."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ຄ່າຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງຄ່າ [code]min[/code] ແລະ [code]max[/code]."

msgid "A type of operands and returned value."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂອງຕົວດຳເນີນການ (operands) ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນ."

msgid "A floating-point scalar."
msgstr "ສະກາລ່າຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມ."

msgid "An integer scalar."
msgstr "ສະກາລ່າຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ."

msgid "An unsigned integer scalar."
msgstr "ສະກາລ່າຈຳນວນຖ້ວນບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ."

msgid "A 2D vector type."
msgstr "ປະເພດເວັກເຕີ້ 2 ມິຕິ."

msgid "A 3D vector type."
msgstr "ປະເພດເວັກເຕີ້ 3 ມິຕິ."

msgid "A 4D vector type."
msgstr "ປະເພດເວັກເຕີ້ 4 ມິຕິ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum OpType] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum OpType]."

msgid "A [Color] constant to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [Color] ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Has two output ports representing RGB and alpha channels of [Color].\n"
"Translated to [code]vec3 rgb[/code] and [code]float alpha[/code] in the "
"shader language."
msgstr ""
"ມີສອງພອດເອົາພຸດທີ່ແທນຊ່ອງສີ RGB ແລະ ອານຟາ (alpha) ຂອງ [Color].\n"
"ຖືກແປເປັນ [code]vec3 rgb[/code] ແລະ [code]float alpha[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid "A [Color] constant which represents a state of this node."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [Color] ທີ່ແທນສະຖານະຂອງໂນດນີ້."

msgid "A [Color] function to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນ [Color] ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Accept a [Color] to the input port and transform it according to [member "
"function]."
msgstr "ຮັບ [Color] ເຂົ້າທາງພອດອິນພຸດ ແລະ ປ່ຽນແປງມັນຕາມ [member function]."

msgid "A function to be applied to the input color."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ກັບສີອິນພຸດ."

msgid ""
"Converts the color to grayscale using the following formula:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"vec3 c = input;\n"
"float max1 = max(c.r, c.g);\n"
"float max2 = max(max1, c.b);\n"
"float max3 = max(max1, max2);\n"
"return vec3(max3, max3, max3);\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນສີເປັນສີຂາວດຳ (grayscale) ໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"vec3 c = input;\n"
"float max1 = max(c.r, c.g);\n"
"float max2 = max(max1, c.b);\n"
"float max3 = max(max1, max2);\n"
"return vec3(max3, max3, max3);\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Converts HSV vector to RGB equivalent."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເວັກເຕີ້ HSV ໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າ RGB ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າ."

msgid "Converts RGB vector to HSV equivalent."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເວັກເຕີ້ RGB ໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າ HSV ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Applies sepia tone effect using the following formula:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"vec3 c = input;\n"
"float r = (c.r * 0.393) + (c.g * 0.769) + (c.b * 0.189);\n"
"float g = (c.r * 0.349) + (c.g * 0.686) + (c.b * 0.168);\n"
"float b = (c.r * 0.272) + (c.g * 0.534) + (c.b * 0.131);\n"
"return vec3(r, g, b);\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກໂທນສີຊີເປຍ (sepia) ໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"vec3 c = input;\n"
"float r = (c.r * 0.393) + (c.g * 0.769) + (c.b * 0.189);\n"
"float g = (c.r * 0.349) + (c.g * 0.686) + (c.b * 0.168);\n"
"float b = (c.r * 0.272) + (c.g * 0.534) + (c.b * 0.131);\n"
"return vec3(r, g, b);\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Converts color from linear encoding to nonlinear sRGB encoding using the "
"following formula:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"const vec3 a = vec3(0.055f);\n"
"return mix((vec3(1.0f) + a) * pow(c.rgb, vec3(1.0f / 2.4f)) - a, 12.92f * "
"c.rgb, lessThan(c.rgb, vec3(0.0031308f)));\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"The Compatibility renderer uses a simpler formula that may produce undefined "
"behavior with negative input values:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"vec3 c = input;\n"
"return max(vec3(1.055) * pow(c, vec3(0.416666667)) - vec3(0.055), "
"vec3(0.0));\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ແປງສີຈາກການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບເສັ້ນ ໄປເປັນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ sRGB ແບບບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນ ໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"const vec3 a = vec3(0.055f);\n"
"return mix((vec3(1.0f) + a) * pow(c.rgb, vec3(1.0f / 2.4f)) - a, 12.92f * "
"c.rgb, lessThan(c.rgb, vec3(0.0031308f)));\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ຕົວປະມວນຜົນການສະແດງຜົນແບບເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ ໃຊ້ສູດທີ່ງ່າຍກວ່າ ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໄວ້ "
"ເມື່ອມີຄ່ານຳເຂົ້າເປັນຄ່າລົບ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"vec3 c = input;\n"
"return max(vec3(1.055) * pow(c, vec3(0.416666667)) - vec3(0.055), "
"vec3(0.0));\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Converts color from nonlinear sRGB encoding to linear encoding using the "
"following formula:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"vec3 c = input;\n"
"return mix(pow((c.rgb + vec3(0.055)) * (1.0 / (1.0 + 0.055)), vec3(2.4)), "
"c.rgb * (1.0 / 12.92), lessThan(c.rgb, vec3(0.04045)));\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"The Compatibility renderer uses a simpler formula that behaves poorly with "
"negative input values:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"vec3 c = input;\n"
"return c * (c * (c * 0.305306011 + 0.682171111) + 0.012522878);\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນສີຈາກການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ sRGB ແບບບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່ ໄປເປັນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"vec3 c = input;\n"
"return mix(pow((c.rgb + vec3(0.055)) * (1.0 / (1.0 + 0.055)), vec3(2.4)), "
"c.rgb * (1.0 / 12.92), lessThan(c.rgb, vec3(0.04045)));\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ຕົວສະແດງຜົນຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ (Compatibility renderer) ໃຊ້ສູດທີ່ງ່າຍກວ່າ "
"ເຊິ່ງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ບໍ່ດີກັບຄ່າທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າເປັນຄ່າລົບ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"vec3 c = input;\n"
"return c * (c * (c * 0.305306011 + 0.682171111) + 0.012522878);\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Function] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum Function]."

msgid "A [Color] operator to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຕົວດຳເນີນການ [Color] ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Applies [member operator] to two color inputs."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ [member operator] ກັບສີອິນພຸດສອງຄ່າ."

msgid "An operator to be applied to the inputs."
msgstr "ຕົວດຳເນີນການທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ກັບອິນພຸດ."

msgid ""
"Produce a screen effect with the following formula:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"result = vec3(1.0) - (vec3(1.0) - a) * (vec3(1.0) - b);\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງເອັບເຟັກແບບ screen ດ້ວຍສູດດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"result = vec3(1.0) - (vec3(1.0) - a) * (vec3(1.0) - b);\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Produce a difference effect with the following formula:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"result = abs(a - b);\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງເອັບເຟັກແບບ difference ດ້ວຍສູດດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"result = abs(a - b);\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Produce a darken effect with the following formula:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"result = min(a, b);\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງເອັບເຟັກແບບ darken ດ້ວຍສູດດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"result = min(a, b);\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Produce a lighten effect with the following formula:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"result = max(a, b);\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງເອັບເຟັກແບບ lighten ດ້ວຍສູດດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"result = max(a, b);\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Produce an overlay effect with the following formula:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n"
"\tfloat base = a[i];\n"
"\tfloat blend = b[i];\n"
"\tif (base < 0.5) {\n"
"\t\tresult[i] = 2.0 * base * blend;\n"
"\t} else {\n"
"\t\tresult[i] = 1.0 - 2.0 * (1.0 - blend) * (1.0 - base);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຜົນກະທົບການຊ້ອນທັບດ້ວຍສູດດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n"
"\tfloat base = a[i];\n"
"\tfloat blend = b[i];\n"
"\tif (base < 0.5) {\n"
"\t\tresult[i] = 2.0 * base * blend;\n"
"\t} else {\n"
"\t\tresult[i] = 1.0 - 2.0 * (1.0 - blend) * (1.0 - base);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Produce a dodge effect with the following formula:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"result = a / (vec3(1.0) - b);\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງເອັບເຟັກແບບ dodge ດ້ວຍສູດດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"result = a / (vec3(1.0) - b);\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Produce a burn effect with the following formula:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"result = vec3(1.0) - (vec3(1.0) - a) / b;\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງເອັບເຟັກແບບ burn ດ້ວຍສູດດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"result = vec3(1.0) - (vec3(1.0) - a) / b;\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Produce a soft light effect with the following formula:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n"
"\tfloat base = a[i];\n"
"\tfloat blend = b[i];\n"
"\tif (base < 0.5) {\n"
"\t\tresult[i] = base * (blend + 0.5);\n"
"\t} else {\n"
"\t\tresult[i] = 1.0 - (1.0 - base) * (1.0 - (blend - 0.5));\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຜົນກະທົບແສງອ່ອນດ້ວຍສູດດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n"
"\tfloat base = a[i];\n"
"\tfloat blend = b[i];\n"
"\tif (base < 0.5) {\n"
"\t\tresult[i] = base * (blend + 0.5);\n"
"\t} else {\n"
"\t\tresult[i] = 1.0 - (1.0 - base) * (1.0 - (blend - 0.5));\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Produce a hard light effect with the following formula:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n"
"\tfloat base = a[i];\n"
"\tfloat blend = b[i];\n"
"\tif (base < 0.5) {\n"
"\t\tresult[i] = base * (2.0 * blend);\n"
"\t} else {\n"
"\t\tresult[i] = 1.0 - (1.0 - base) * (1.0 - 2.0 * (blend - 0.5));\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຜົນກະທົບແສງແຂງດ້ວຍສູດດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n"
"\tfloat base = a[i];\n"
"\tfloat blend = b[i];\n"
"\tif (base < 0.5) {\n"
"\t\tresult[i] = base * (2.0 * blend);\n"
"\t} else {\n"
"\t\tresult[i] = 1.0 - (1.0 - base) * (1.0 - 2.0 * (blend - 0.5));\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Operator] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum Operator]."

msgid "A [Color] parameter to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ [Color] ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Translated to [code]uniform vec4[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ຖືກແປເປັນ [code]uniform vec4[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid "This class has no function anymore and only exists for compatibility."
msgstr "ຄຼາສນີ້ບໍ່ມີຟັງຊັນໃດໆອີກແລ້ວ ແລະ ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ (compatibility) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Only exists for compatibility. Use [VisualShaderNodeFrame] as a replacement."
msgstr "ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [VisualShaderNodeFrame] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"This node was replaced by [VisualShaderNodeFrame] and only exists to preserve "
"compatibility. In the [VisualShader] editor it behaves exactly like "
"[VisualShaderNodeFrame]."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດນີ້ຖືກປ່ຽນແທນໂດຍ [VisualShaderNodeFrame]. ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ [VisualShader] "
"ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັນກັບ [VisualShaderNodeFrame]."

msgid ""
"This property only exists to preserve data authored in earlier versions of "
"Godot. It has currently no function."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອຮັກສາຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້າຂອງ Godot ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ປະຈຸບັນມັນບໍ່ມີຟັງຊັນໃດໆ."

msgid "A comparison function for common types within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນການປຽບທຽບສຳລັບປະເພດທົ່ວໄປພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Compares [code]a[/code] and [code]b[/code] of [member type] by [member "
"function]. Returns a boolean scalar. Translates to [code]if[/code] "
"instruction in shader code."
msgstr ""
"ປຽບທຽບ [code]a[/code] ແລະ [code]b[/code] ຂອງ [member type] ດ້ວຍ [member "
"function]. ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນສະກາລ່າບູລີນ. ແປເປັນຄຳສັ່ງ [code]if[/code] ໃນໂຄ້ດເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Extra condition which is applied if [member type] is set to [constant "
"CTYPE_VECTOR_3D]."
msgstr "ເງື່ອນໄຂເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ຖ້າ [member type] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant CTYPE_VECTOR_3D]."

msgid "A comparison function."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນການປຽບທຽບ."

msgid "The type to be used in the comparison."
msgstr "ປະເພດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການປຽບທຽບ."

msgid "A boolean type."
msgstr "ປະເພດບູລີນ."

msgid "A transform ([code]mat4[/code]) type."
msgstr "ປະເພດການແປງ (transform) ([code]mat4[/code])."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ComparisonType] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum ComparisonType]."

msgid "Comparison for equality ([code]a == b[/code])."
msgstr "ການປຽບທຽບຄວາມເທົ່າກັນ ([code]a == b[/code])."

msgid "Comparison for inequality ([code]a != b[/code])."
msgstr "ການປຽບທຽບຄວາມບໍ່ເທົ່າກັນ ([code]a != b[/code])."

msgid ""
"Comparison for greater than ([code]a > b[/code]). Cannot be used if [member "
"type] set to [constant CTYPE_BOOLEAN] or [constant CTYPE_TRANSFORM]."
msgstr ""
"ການປຽບທຽບຫຼາຍກວ່າ ([code]a > b[/code]). ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ຖ້າ [member type] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[constant CTYPE_BOOLEAN] ຫຼື [constant CTYPE_TRANSFORM]."

msgid ""
"Comparison for greater than or equal ([code]a >= b[/code]). Cannot be used if "
"[member type] set to [constant CTYPE_BOOLEAN] or [constant CTYPE_TRANSFORM]."
msgstr ""
"ການປຽບທຽບຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ ([code]a >= b[/code]). ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ຖ້າ [member type] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant CTYPE_BOOLEAN] ຫຼື [constant CTYPE_TRANSFORM]."

msgid ""
"Comparison for less than ([code]a < b[/code]). Cannot be used if [member "
"type] set to [constant CTYPE_BOOLEAN] or [constant CTYPE_TRANSFORM]."
msgstr ""
"ການປຽບທຽບໜ້ອຍກວ່າ ([code]a < b[/code]). ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ຖ້າ [member type] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[constant CTYPE_BOOLEAN] ຫຼື [constant CTYPE_TRANSFORM]."

msgid ""
"Comparison for less than or equal ([code]a <= b[/code]). Cannot be used if "
"[member type] set to [constant CTYPE_BOOLEAN] or [constant CTYPE_TRANSFORM]."
msgstr ""
"ການປຽບທຽບໜ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ ([code]a <= b[/code]). ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ຖ້າ [member type] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant CTYPE_BOOLEAN] ຫຼື [constant CTYPE_TRANSFORM]."

msgid ""
"The result will be [code]true[/code] if all components in the vector satisfy "
"the comparison condition."
msgstr ""
"ຜົນລັບຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຫາກທຸກສ່ວນປະກອບໃນເວັກເຕີ້ເປັນໄປຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂການປຽບທຽບ."

msgid ""
"The result will be [code]true[/code] if any component in the vector satisfies "
"the comparison condition."
msgstr ""
"ຜົນລັບຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຫາກມີສ່ວນປະກອບໃດໜຶ່ງໃນເວັກເຕີ້ເປັນໄປຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂການປຽບທຽບ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Condition] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum Condition]."

msgid "A base type for the constants within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ປະເພດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບຄ່າຄົງທີ່ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"This is an abstract class. See the derived types for descriptions of the "
"possible values."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄຼາສນາມມະທຳ (abstract class). ເບິ່ງປະເພດທີ່ສືບທອດມາສຳລັບຄຳອະທິບາຍຂອງຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້."

msgid "A [Cubemap] sampling node to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ໂນດແຊມປລິງ [Cubemap] ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Translated to [code]texture(cubemap, vec3)[/code] in the shader language. "
"Returns a color vector and alpha channel as scalar."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກແປເປັນ [code]texture(cubemap, vec3)[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ. ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນເວັກເຕີ້ສີ ແລະ "
"ຊ່ອງອານຟາເປັນສະກາລ່າ."

msgid ""
"The [Cubemap] texture to sample when using [constant SOURCE_TEXTURE] as "
"[member source]."
msgstr ""
"ເທັກເຈີ້ [Cubemap] ທີ່ຈະແຊມປລິງ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [constant SOURCE_TEXTURE] ເປັນ [member source]."

msgid "Defines which source should be used for the sampling."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າຄວນໃຊ້ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໃດສຳລັບການແຊມປລິງ."

msgid "Defines the type of data provided by the source texture."
msgstr "ກຳນົດປະເພດຂອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສະໜອງໂດຍເທັກເຈີ້ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ."

msgid ""
"Use the [Cubemap] set via [member cube_map]. If this is set to [member "
"source], the [code]samplerCube[/code] port is ignored."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ [Cubemap] ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າຜ່ານ [member cube_map]. ຖ້ານີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [member source], ພອດ "
"[code]samplerCube[/code] ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"Use the [Cubemap] sampler reference passed via the [code]samplerCube[/code] "
"port. If this is set to [member source], the [member cube_map] texture is "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ການອ້າງອີງແຊມເປຼີ [Cubemap] ທີ່ສົ່ງຜ່ານພອດ [code]samplerCube[/code]. ຖ້ານີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[member source], ເທັກເຈີ້ [member cube_map] ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Source] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum Source]."

msgid "No hints are added to the uniform declaration."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການເພີ່ມ hint ໃດໆເຂົ້າໃນການປະກາດ uniform."

msgid ""
"Adds [code]source_color[/code] as hint to the uniform declaration for proper "
"conversion from nonlinear sRGB encoding to linear encoding."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ [code]source_color[/code] ເປັນ hint ໃນການປະກາດ uniform ເພື່ອການແປງ "
"ຈາກການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ sRGB ແບບ nonlinear ໄປເປັນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ linear ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Adds [code]hint_normal[/code] as hint to the uniform declaration, which "
"internally converts the texture for proper usage as normal map."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ [code]hint_normal[/code] ເປັນ hint ໃນການປະກາດ uniform, ເຊິ່ງຈະແປງເທັກເຈີ້ "
"ພາຍໃນເພື່ອການນຳໃຊ້ເປັນ normal map ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "A [Cubemap] parameter node to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ໂນດພາຣາມິເຕີ [Cubemap] ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Translated to [code]uniform samplerCube[/code] in the shader language. The "
"output value can be used as port for [VisualShaderNodeCubemap]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກແປເປັນ [code]uniform samplerCube[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ. ຄ່າເອົາພຸດສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນພອດສຳລັບ "
"[VisualShaderNodeCubemap] ໄດ້."

msgid "Performs a [CurveTexture] lookup within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາຄ່າ [CurveTexture] ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Comes with a built-in editor for texture's curves."
msgstr "ມາພ້ອມກັບຕົວແກ້ໄຂເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຂອງເທັກເຈີ້ໃນຕົວ."

msgid "The source texture."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີ້ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ."

msgid "Performs a [CurveXYZTexture] lookup within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາຄ່າ [CurveXYZTexture] ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Virtual class to define custom [VisualShaderNode]s for use in the Visual "
"Shader Editor."
msgstr ""
"ຄຼາສສະເໝືອນ (Virtual class) ເພື່ອກຳນົດ [VisualShaderNode] "
"ແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບໃຊ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"By inheriting this class you can create a custom [VisualShader] script addon "
"which will be automatically added to the Visual Shader Editor. The "
"[VisualShaderNode]'s behavior is defined by overriding the provided virtual "
"methods.\n"
"In order for the node to be registered as an editor addon, you must use the "
"[code]@tool[/code] annotation and provide a [code]class_name[/code] for your "
"custom script. For example:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends VisualShaderNodeCustom\n"
"class_name VisualShaderNodeNoise\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍການສືບທອດຄລາດນີ້ ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງສ່ວນເສີມສະຄຣິບ [VisualShader] ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນເຄື່ອງມືແກ້ໄຂ Visual Shader ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງ "
"[VisualShaderNode] ແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍການຂຽນທັບເມັດທອດສະເໝືອນທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂນດຖືກລົງທະບຽນເປັນສ່ວນເສີມຂອງເຄື່ອງມືແກ້ໄຂ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຄຳກຳກັບ [code]@tool[/code] ແລະ "
"ລະບຸ [code]class_name[/code] ສຳລັບສະຄຣິບທີ່ເຈົ້າກຳນົດເອງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends VisualShaderNodeCustom\n"
"class_name VisualShaderNodeNoise\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Visual Shader plugins"
msgstr "ປລັກອິນ (Plugins) ວິຊົວເຊເດີ"

msgid ""
"Override this method to define the path to the associated custom node in the "
"Visual Shader Editor's members dialog. The path may look like [code]\"MyGame/"
"MyFunctions/Noise\"[/code].\n"
"Defining this method is [b]optional[/b]. If not overridden, the node will be "
"filed under the \"Addons\" category."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມັດທອດນີ້ເພື່ອ ກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂນດກຳນົດເອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນໄດອະລັອກສະມາຊິກຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ "
"Visual Shader. ເສັ້ນທາງອາດຈະຄືກັບ [code]\"MyGame/MyFunctions/Noise\"[/code].\n"
"ການກຳນົດເມັດທອດນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ເປັນທາງເລືອກ[/b]. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບ, ໂນດຈະຖືກຈັດໄວ້ໃນໝວດໝູ່ \"Addons\"."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define the actual shader code of the associated "
"custom node. The shader code should be returned as a string, which can have "
"multiple lines (the [code]\"\"\"[/code] multiline string construct can be "
"used for convenience).\n"
"The [param input_vars] and [param output_vars] arrays contain the string "
"names of the various input and output variables, as defined by "
"[code]_get_input_*[/code] and [code]_get_output_*[/code] virtual methods in "
"this class.\n"
"The output ports can be assigned values in the shader code. For example, "
"[code]return output_vars[0] + \" = \" + input_vars[0] + \";\"[/code].\n"
"You can customize the generated code based on the shader [param mode] and/or "
"[param type].\n"
"Defining this method is [b]required[/b]."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບວິທີການນີ້ເພື່ອກຳນົດລະຫັດ shader ຕົວຈິງຂອງໂນດກຳນົດເອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ລະຫັດ shader "
"ຄວນຖືກສົ່ງຄືນເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ (string), ເຊິ່ງສາມາດມີໄດ້ຫຼາຍແຖວ (ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມຫຼາຍແຖວ "
"[code]\"\"\"[/code] ເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກ).\n"
"ອາເຣ [param input_vars] ແລະ [param output_vars] ບັນຈຸຊື່ຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ "
"ຂາອອກຕ່າງໆ, ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍວິທີການສະເໝືອນ [code]_get_input_*[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]_get_output_*[/code] ໃນຄຼາດນີ້.\n"
"ພອດຂາອອກສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໄດ້ໃນລະຫັດ shader. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ, [code]return output_vars[0] + "
"\" = \" + input_vars[0] + \";\"[/code].\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງລະຫັດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອີງຕາມ shader [param mode] ແລະ/ຫຼື [param type].\n"
"ການກຳນົດວິທີການນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ບັງຄັບ[/b]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define the input port which should be connected by "
"default when this node is created as a result of dragging a connection from "
"an existing node to the empty space on the graph.\n"
"Defining this method is [b]optional[/b]. If not overridden, the connection "
"will be created to the first valid port."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄືນວິທີການນີ້ເພື່ອກຳນົດພອດຂາເຂົ້າທີ່ຄວນຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
"ເມື່ອນົດນີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກການລາກເສັ້ນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກນົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໄປຫາພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນກຣາບ.\n"
"ການກຳນົດວິທີການນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ທາງເລືອກ[/b]. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ມີການກຳນົດຄືນ, "
"ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນກັບພອດທຳອິດທີ່ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define the description of the associated custom node "
"in the Visual Shader Editor's members dialog.\n"
"Defining this method is [b]optional[/b]."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອ ກຳນົດຄຳອະທິບາຍຂອງໂນດກຳນົດເອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບສະມາຊິກຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ "
"Visual Shader.\n"
"ການກຳນົດເມທອດນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ເປັນທາງເລືອກ[/b]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to add a shader code to the beginning of each shader "
"function (once). The shader code should be returned as a string, which can "
"have multiple lines (the [code]\"\"\"[/code] multiline string construct can "
"be used for convenience).\n"
"If there are multiple custom nodes of different types which use this feature "
"the order of each insertion is undefined.\n"
"You can customize the generated code based on the shader [param mode] and/or "
"[param type].\n"
"Defining this method is [b]optional[/b]."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບວິທີການນີ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມລະຫັດ shader ໃສ່ສ່ວນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງແຕ່ລະຟັງຊັນ shader (ຄັ້ງດຽວ). ລະຫັດ "
"shader ຄວນຖືກສົ່ງຄືນເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ (string), ເຊິ່ງສາມາດມີໄດ້ຫຼາຍແຖວ "
"(ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມຫຼາຍແຖວ [code]\"\"\"[/code] ເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກ).\n"
"ຫາກມີຫຼາຍໂນດກຳນົດເອງທີ່ມີປະເພດຕ່າງກັນທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ ລຳດັບຂອງການແຊກແຕ່ລະອັນແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້.\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງລະຫັດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອີງຕາມ shader [param mode] ແລະ/ຫຼື [param type].\n"
"ການກຳນົດວິທີການນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ບໍ່ບັງຄັບ[/b]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to add shader code on top of the global shader, to "
"define your own standard library of reusable methods, varyings, constants, "
"uniforms, etc. The shader code should be returned as a string, which can have "
"multiple lines (the [code]\"\"\"[/code] multiline string construct can be "
"used for convenience).\n"
"Be careful with this functionality as it can cause name conflicts with other "
"custom nodes, so be sure to give the defined entities unique names.\n"
"You can customize the generated code based on the shader [param mode].\n"
"Defining this method is [b]optional[/b]."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບວິທີການນີ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມລະຫັດ shader ໃສ່ເທິງ shader ສາກົນ, "
"ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄັງມາດຕະຖານຂອງທ່ານເອງສຳລັບວິທີການທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້, varyings, ຄ່າຄົງທີ່, uniforms, "
"ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"ລະຫັດ shader ຄວນຖືກສົ່ງຄືນເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ (string), ເຊິ່ງສາມາດມີໄດ້ຫຼາຍແຖວ "
"(ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມຫຼາຍແຖວ [code]\"\"\"[/code] ເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກ).\n"
"ໃຫ້ລະມັດລະວັງກັບການເຮັດວຽກນີ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຂັດແຍ້ງຂອງຊື່ກັບໂນດກຳນົດເອງອື່ນໆ, "
"ສະນັ້ນ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕັ້ງຊື່ທີ່ບໍ່ຊໍ້າກັນໃຫ້ກັບສິ່ງຕ່າງໆທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້.\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງລະຫັດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອີງຕາມ shader [param mode].\n"
"ການກຳນົດວິທີການນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ບໍ່ບັງຄັບ[/b]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define the number of input ports of the associated "
"custom node.\n"
"Defining this method is [b]required[/b]. If not overridden, the node has no "
"input ports."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບວິທີການນີ້ເພື່ອການກຳນົດຈຳນວນພອດຂາເຂົ້າຂອງໂນດກຳນົດເອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"
"ການກຳນົດວິທີການນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ຈຳເປັນ[/b]. ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບ, ໂນດຈະບໍ່ມີພອດຂາເຂົ້າ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define the default value for the specified input "
"port. Prefer use this over [method "
"VisualShaderNode.set_input_port_default_value].\n"
"Defining this method is [b]required[/b]. If not overridden, the node has no "
"default values for their input ports."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອ ກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບພອດນຳເຂົ້າທີ່ລະບຸ. ຄວນໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ແທນ [method "
"VisualShaderNode.set_input_port_default_value].\n"
"ການກຳນົດເມທອດນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ຈຳເປັນ[/b]. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບ, ໂນດຈະບໍ່ມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບພອດນຳເຂົ້າຂອງພວກມັນ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define the names of input ports of the associated "
"custom node. The names are used both for the input slots in the editor and as "
"identifiers in the shader code, and are passed in the [code]input_vars[/code] "
"array in [method _get_code].\n"
"Defining this method is [b]optional[/b], but recommended. If not overridden, "
"input ports are named as [code]\"in\" + str(port)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບວິທີການນີ້ເພື່ອນິຍາມຊື່ຂອງພອດນຳເຂົ້າຂອງໂນດກຳນົດເອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. "
"ຊື່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ທັງສຳລັບຊ່ອງນຳເຂົ້າໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ເປັນຕົວລະບຸໃນລະຫັດເຊດເດີ, ແລະ "
"ຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານໃນອາເຣ [code]input_vars[/code] ໃນ [method _get_code].\n"
"ການກຳນົດວິທີການນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ບໍ່ບັງຄັບ[/b], ແຕ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຮັດ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບ, ພອດນຳເຂົ້າຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຊື່ວ່າ "
"[code]\"in\" + str(port)[/code]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define the returned type of each input port of the "
"associated custom node.\n"
"Defining this method is [b]optional[/b], but recommended. If not overridden, "
"input ports will return the [constant VisualShaderNode.PORT_TYPE_SCALAR] type."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບວິທີການນີ້ເພື່ອເປັນການກຳນົດປະເພດທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຂອງແຕ່ລະພອດຂາເຂົ້າຂອງໂນດທີ່ກຳນົດເອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"
"ການກຳນົດວິທີການນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ບໍ່ບັງຄັບ[/b], ແຕ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຮັດ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບ, ພອດຂາເຂົ້າຈະສົ່ງຄືນປະເພດ "
"[constant VisualShaderNode.PORT_TYPE_SCALAR]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define the name of the associated custom node in the "
"Visual Shader Editor's members dialog and graph.\n"
"Defining this method is [b]optional[/b], but recommended. If not overridden, "
"the node will be named as \"Unnamed\"."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມທອດນີ້ ເພື່ອກຳນົດຊື່ຂອງໂນດກຳນົດເອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ໃນໄດອາລັອກສະມາຊິກ ແລະ ກຣາບຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ "
"Visual Shader.\n"
"ການກຳນົດເມທອດນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ບໍ່ບັງຄັບ[/b], ແຕ່ຂໍແນະນຳ.\n"
"ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບ, ໂນດຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຊື່ວ່າ \"ບໍ່ມີຊື່\"."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define the number of output ports of the associated "
"custom node.\n"
"Defining this method is [b]required[/b]. If not overridden, the node has no "
"output ports."
msgstr ""
"ແທນທີ່ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອກຳນົດຈຳນວນພອດຂາອອກຂອງໂນດກຳນົດເອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"
"ການກຳນົດເມທອດນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ຈຳເປັນ[/b]. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການແທນທີ່, ໂນດຈະບໍ່ມີພອດຂາອອກ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define the names of output ports of the associated "
"custom node. The names are used both for the output slots in the editor and "
"as identifiers in the shader code, and are passed in the [code]output_vars[/"
"code] array in [method _get_code].\n"
"Defining this method is [b]optional[/b], but recommended. If not overridden, "
"output ports are named as [code]\"out\" + str(port)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບວິທີການນີ້ເພື່ອ ກຳນົດຊື່ຂອງພອດຂາອອກ ຂອງໂນດກຳນົດເອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. "
"ຊື່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ທັງສຳລັບຊ່ອງຂາອອກໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ເປັນຕົວລະບຸໃນລະຫັດເຊດເດີ, ແລະ ຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານໃນອາເຣ "
"[code]output_vars[/code] ໃນ [method _get_code].\n"
"ການກຳນົດວິທີການນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ເປັນທາງເລືອກ[/b], ແຕ່ຂໍແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຮັດ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຂຽນທັບ, "
"ພອດຂາອອກຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຊື່ເປັນ [code]\"out\" + str(port)[/code]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define the returned type of each output port of the "
"associated custom node.\n"
"Defining this method is [b]optional[/b], but recommended. If not overridden, "
"output ports will return the [constant VisualShaderNode.PORT_TYPE_SCALAR] "
"type."
msgstr ""
"ແທນທີ່ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອກຳນົດປະເພດຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຂອງແຕ່ລະພອດຂາອອກຂອງໂນດກຳນົດເອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"
"ການກຳນົດເມທອດນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ເລືອກໄດ້[/b], ແຕ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຮັດ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການແທນທີ່, "
"ພອດຂາອອກຈະສົ່ງຄືນປະເພດ [constant VisualShaderNode.PORT_TYPE_SCALAR]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define the number of the properties.\n"
"Defining this method is [b]optional[/b]."
msgstr ""
"ແທນທີ່ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອກຳນົດຈຳນວນຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດ.\n"
"ການກຳນົດເມທອດນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ເລືອກໄດ້[/b]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define the default index of the property of the "
"associated custom node.\n"
"Defining this method is [b]optional[/b]."
msgstr ""
"ແທນທີ່ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອກຳນົດດັດຊະນີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດກຳນົດເອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"
"ການກຳນົດເມທອດນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ເລືອກໄດ້[/b]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define the names of the property of the associated "
"custom node.\n"
"Defining this method is [b]optional[/b]."
msgstr ""
"ແທນທີ່ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອກຳນົດຊື່ຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດກຳນົດເອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"
"ການກຳນົດເມທອດນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ເລືອກໄດ້[/b]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define the options inside the drop-down list property "
"of the associated custom node.\n"
"Defining this method is [b]optional[/b]."
msgstr ""
"ແທນທີ່ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອກຳນົດຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆພາຍໃນຄຸນສົມບັດແບບລາຍການເລື່ອນລົງ (drop-down list) "
"ຂອງໂນດກຳນົດເອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"
"ການກຳນົດເມທອດນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ເລືອກໄດ້[/b]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define the return icon of the associated custom node "
"in the Visual Shader Editor's members dialog.\n"
"Defining this method is [b]optional[/b]. If not overridden, no return icon is "
"shown."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບວິທີການນີ້ເພື່ອ ກຳນົດໄອຄອນສົ່ງຄືນຂອງໂນດກຳນົດເອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມສະມາຊິກຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ "
"Visual Shader.\n"
"ການກຳນົດວິທີການນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ບໍ່ບັງຄັບ[/b]. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບ, ຈະບໍ່ມີໄອຄອນສົ່ງຄືນສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to prevent the node to be visible in the member dialog "
"for the certain [param mode] and/or [param type].\n"
"Defining this method is [b]optional[/b]. If not overridden, it's [code]true[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບວິທີການນີ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ໂນດສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນໄດອາລັອກສະມາຊິກສຳລັບ [param mode] ແລະ/ຫຼື "
"[param type] ທີ່ແນ່ນອນ.\n"
"ການກຳນົດວິທີການນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ເລືອກໄດ້[/b]. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບ, ມັນແມ່ນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to enable the high-end mark in the Visual Shader "
"Editor's members dialog. This should return [code]true[/code] for nodes that "
"only work when using the Forward+ and Mobile renderers.\n"
"Defining this method is [b]optional[/b]. If not overridden, it's [code]false[/"
"code], which indicates this node works with all renderers (including "
"Compatibility)."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍລະດັບສູງໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບສະມາຊິກຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Visual Shader. "
"ນີ້ຄວນສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ສຳລັບໂນດທີ່ເຮັດວຽກສະເພາະຕອນນຳໃຊ້ຕົວປະມວນຜົນການສະແດງຜົນ "
"Forward+ ແລະ Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ການກຳນົດເມທອດນີ້ແມ່ນ [b]ເປັນທາງເລືອກ[/b]. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບ, ມັນຈະເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ເຊິ່ງບົ່ງບອກວ່າໂນດນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ກັບທຸກຕົວປະມວນຜົນການສະແດງຜົນ (ລວມທັງ Compatibility)."

msgid ""
"Returns the selected index of the drop-down list option within a graph. You "
"may use this function to define the specific behavior in the [method "
"_get_code] or [method _get_global_code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າດັດຊະນີທີ່ຖືກເລືອກຂອງຕົວເລືອກລາຍການແບບເລື່ອນລົງພາຍໃນກຣາບ. "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າພຶດຕິກຳສະເພາະໃນ [method _get_code] ຫຼື [method "
"_get_global_code]."

msgid "Calculates a derivative within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄຳນວນຄ່າອະນຸພັນ (derivative) ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"This node is only available in [code]Fragment[/code] and [code]Light[/code] "
"visual shaders."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນວິຊົວເຊເດີ [code]Fragment[/code] ແລະ [code]Light[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "A derivative function type."
msgstr "ປະເພດຟັງຊັນອະນຸພັນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the level of precision to use for the derivative function. When using "
"the Compatibility renderer, this setting has no effect."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງລະດັບຄວາມຊັດເຈນ (precision) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບຟັງຊັນອະນຸພັນ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Compatibility renderer, "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ."

msgid "Sum of absolute derivative in [code]x[/code] and [code]y[/code]."
msgstr "ຜົນບວກຂອງອະນຸພັນສຳບູນໃນ [code]x[/code] ແລະ [code]y[/code]."

msgid "Derivative in [code]x[/code] using local differencing."
msgstr "ອະນຸພັນໃນ [code]x[/code] ໂດຍໃຊ້ local differencing."

msgid "Derivative in [code]y[/code] using local differencing."
msgstr "ອະນຸພັນໃນ [code]y[/code] ໂດຍໃຊ້ local differencing."

msgid ""
"No precision is specified, the GPU driver is allowed to use whatever level of "
"precision it chooses. This is the default option and is equivalent to using "
"[code]dFdx()[/code] or [code]dFdy()[/code] in text shaders."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດຄວາມລະອຽດ, ໄດຣເວີຂອງ GPU ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບຄວາມລະອຽດໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ມັນເລືອກ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບການໃຊ້ [code]dFdx()[/code] ຫຼື [code]dFdy()[/code] "
"ໃນ text shaders."

msgid ""
"The derivative will be calculated using the current fragment's neighbors "
"(which may not include the current fragment). This tends to be faster than "
"using [constant PRECISION_FINE], but may not be suitable when more precision "
"is needed. This is equivalent to using [code]dFdxCoarse()[/code] or "
"[code]dFdyCoarse()[/code] in text shaders."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າອະນຸພັນຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ເພື່ອນບ້ານຂອງ fragment ປັດຈຸບັນ (ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະບໍ່ລວມເອົາ fragment "
"ປັດຈຸບັນ). ສິ່ງນີ້ມີທ່າອ່ຽງທີ່ຈະໄວກວ່າການໃຊ້ [constant PRECISION_FINE], "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະບໍ່ເໝາະສົມເມື່ອຕ້ອງການຄວາມລະອຽດຫຼາຍກວ່າ. ນີ້ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບການໃຊ້ [code]dFdxCoarse()[/"
"code] ຫຼື [code]dFdyCoarse()[/code] ໃນ text shaders."

msgid ""
"The derivative will be calculated using the current fragment and its "
"immediate neighbors. This tends to be slower than using [constant "
"PRECISION_COARSE], but may be necessary when more precision is needed. This "
"is equivalent to using [code]dFdxFine()[/code] or [code]dFdyFine()[/code] in "
"text shaders."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າອະນຸພັນຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ສ່ວນຍ່ອຍປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ ເພື່ອນບ້ານທີ່ຢູ່ຕິດກັນຂອງມັນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີແນວໂນ້ມທີ່ຈະຊ້າກວ່າການໃຊ້ [constant PRECISION_COARSE], "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະຈຳເປັນເມື່ອຕ້ອງການຄວາມຊັດເຈນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນທຽບເທົ່າກັບການໃຊ້ [code]dFdxFine()[/"
"code] ຫຼື [code]dFdyFine()[/code] ໃນ text shaders."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Precision] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum Precision]."

msgid ""
"Calculates the determinant of a [Transform3D] within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄຳນວນຄ່າ ເດແຕກມີນັງ (determinant) ຂອງ [Transform3D] ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Translates to [code]determinant(x)[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ແປເປັນ [code]determinant(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid "A visual shader node representing distance fade effect."
msgstr "ໂນດວິຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ແທນເອັບເຟັກການຈາງຫາຍຕາມໄລຍະທາງ (distance fade)."

msgid ""
"The distance fade effect fades out each pixel based on its distance to "
"another object."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກການຈາງຫາຍຕາມໄລຍະທາງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລຄ່ອຍໆຈາງຫາຍໄປ ໂດຍອີງຕາມໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກວັດຖຸອື່ນ."

msgid "Calculates a dot product of two vectors within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄຳນວນຄ່າ ດັອດໂປຣດັກ (dot product) ຂອງເວັກເຕີ້ສອງຕົວພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Translates to [code]dot(a, b)[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ແປເປັນ [code]dot(a, b)[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"A custom visual shader graph expression written in Godot Shading Language."
msgstr ""
"ນິພົດ (expression) ກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ຂຽນດ້ວຍພາສາ Godot Shading Language."

msgid ""
"Custom Godot Shading Language expression, with a custom number of input and "
"output ports.\n"
"The provided code is directly injected into the graph's matching shader "
"function ([code]vertex[/code], [code]fragment[/code], or [code]light[/code]), "
"so it cannot be used to declare functions, varyings, uniforms, or global "
"constants. See [VisualShaderNodeGlobalExpression] for such global definitions."
msgstr ""
"ສຳນວນພາສາ Shading ຂອງ Godot ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ທີ່ມີຈຳນວນພອດຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ.\n"
"ລະຫັດທີ່ໃຫ້ມາແມ່ນຖືກແຊກເຂົ້າໃນຟັງຊັນ shader ທີ່ກົງກັນຂອງກຣາບ ([code]vertex[/code], "
"[code]fragment[/code], ຫຼື [code]light[/code]) ໂດຍກົງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ "
"ມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປະກາດຟັງຊັນ, varyings, uniforms, ຫຼື ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ທົ່ວໄປໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ "
"[VisualShaderNodeGlobalExpression] ສຳລັບການນິຍາມທົ່ວໄປດັ່ງກ່າວ."

msgid ""
"An expression in Godot Shading Language, which will be injected at the start "
"of the graph's matching shader function ([code]vertex[/code], [code]fragment[/"
"code], or [code]light[/code]), and thus cannot be used to declare functions, "
"varyings, uniforms, or global constants."
msgstr ""
"ສຳນວນໃນພາສາ Godot Shading, ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກແຊກເຂົ້າໄປໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຟັງຊັນ shader "
"ທີ່ກົງກັນຂອງກຣາບ ([code]vertex[/code], [code]fragment[/code], ຫຼື [code]light[/"
"code]), ແລະ ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປະກາດຟັງຊັນ, varyings, uniforms, ຫຼື ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ທົ່ວໄປໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the vector that points in the same direction as a reference vector "
"within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າເວັກເຕີ້ທີ່ຊີ້ໄປໃນທິດທາງດຽວກັນກັບເວັກເຕີ້ອ້າງອີງພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Translates to [code]faceforward(N, I, Nref)[/code] in the shader language. "
"The function has three vector parameters: [code]N[/code], the vector to "
"orient, [code]I[/code], the incident vector, and [code]Nref[/code], the "
"reference vector. If the dot product of [code]I[/code] and [code]Nref[/code] "
"is smaller than zero the return value is [code]N[/code]. Otherwise, [code]-N[/"
"code] is returned."
msgstr ""
"ແປເປັນ [code]faceforward(N, I, Nref)[/code] ໃນພາສາ shader. "
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ມີສາມພາຣາມິເຕີເວັກເຕີ: [code]N[/code], ເວັກເຕີທີ່ຈະກຳນົດທິດທາງ, [code]I[/code], "
"ເວັກເຕີຕົກກະທົບ, ແລະ [code]Nref[/code], ເວັກເຕີອ້າງອີງ. ຖ້າຜົນຄູນແບບຈຸດຂອງ [code]I[/code] "
"ແລະ [code]Nref[/code] ນ້ອຍກວ່າສູນ ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນແມ່ນ [code]N[/code]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, [code]-N[/"
"code] ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນ."

msgid ""
"A scalar floating-point constant to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສະກາລ່າຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມ ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Translated to [code skip-lint]float[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ຖືກແປເປັນ [code skip-lint]float[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid "A floating-point constant which represents a state of this node."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມທີ່ແທນສະຖານະຂອງໂນດນີ້."

msgid ""
"A scalar floating-point function to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນສະກາລ່າຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມ ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Accept a floating-point scalar ([code]x[/code]) to the input port and "
"transform it according to [member function]."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບສະກາລ່າຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມ ([code]x[/code]) ເຂົ້າທາງພອດອິນພຸດ ແລະ ປ່ຽນແປງມັນຕາມ [member "
"function]."

msgid "A function to be applied to the scalar."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ກັບຄ່າສະກາລ່າ."

msgid ""
"Returns the sine of the parameter. Translates to [code]sin(x)[/code] in the "
"Godot Shader Language."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ sine ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]sin(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the cosine of the parameter. Translates to [code]cos(x)[/code] in the "
"Godot Shader Language."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ cosine ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]cos(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the tangent of the parameter. Translates to [code]tan(x)[/code] in "
"the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ tangent ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]tan(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the arc-sine of the parameter. Translates to [code]asin(x)[/code] in "
"the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ arc-sine ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]asin(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the arc-cosine of the parameter. Translates to [code]acos(x)[/code] "
"in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ arc-cosine ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]acos(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the arc-tangent of the parameter. Translates to [code]atan(x)[/code] "
"in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ arc-tangent ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]atan(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the hyperbolic sine of the parameter. Translates to [code]sinh(x)[/"
"code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ hyperbolic sine ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]sinh(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot "
"Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the hyperbolic cosine of the parameter. Translates to [code]cosh(x)[/"
"code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ hyperbolic cosine ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]cosh(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot "
"Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the hyperbolic tangent of the parameter. Translates to [code]tanh(x)[/"
"code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ hyperbolic tangent ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]tanh(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot "
"Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the natural logarithm of the parameter. Translates to [code]log(x)[/"
"code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ natural logarithm ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]log(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot "
"Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the natural exponentiation of the parameter. Translates to "
"[code]exp(x)[/code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ natural exponentiation ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]exp(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ "
"Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the square root of the parameter. Translates to [code]sqrt(x)[/code] "
"in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຮາກຂັ້ນສອງ (square root) ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]sqrt(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ "
"Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the absolute value of the parameter. Translates to [code]abs(x)[/"
"code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າສຳບູນ (absolute value) ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]abs(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot "
"Shader."

msgid ""
"Extracts the sign of the parameter. Translates to [code]sign(x)[/code] in the "
"Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສະກັດເຄື່ອງໝາຍ (sign) ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]sign(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Finds the nearest integer less than or equal to the parameter. Translates to "
"[code]floor(x)[/code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ຊອກຫາຈຳນວນຖ້ວນທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດທີ່ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]floor(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ "
"Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Finds the nearest integer to the parameter. Translates to [code]round(x)[/"
"code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ຊອກຫາຈຳນວນຖ້ວນທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດກັບພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]round(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Finds the nearest integer that is greater than or equal to the parameter. "
"Translates to [code]ceil(x)[/code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ຊອກຫາຈຳນວນຖ້ວນທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]ceil(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ "
"Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Computes the fractional part of the argument. Translates to [code]fract(x)[/"
"code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳນວນສ່ວນເສດ (fractional part) ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]fract(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ "
"Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Clamps the value between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] using "
"[code]min(max(x, 0.0), 1.0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳກັດຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/code] ແລະ [code]1.0[/code] ໂດຍໃຊ້ [code]min(max(x, "
"0.0), 1.0)[/code]."

msgid "Negates the [code]x[/code] using [code]-(x)[/code]."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຄ່າ [code]x[/code] ໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າລົບ (negate) ໂດຍໃຊ້ [code]-(x)[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the arc-hyperbolic-cosine of the parameter. Translates to "
"[code]acosh(x)[/code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ arc-hyperbolic-cosine ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]acosh(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ "
"Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the arc-hyperbolic-sine of the parameter. Translates to [code]asinh(x)"
"[/code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ arc-hyperbolic-sine ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]asinh(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot "
"Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the arc-hyperbolic-tangent of the parameter. Translates to "
"[code]atanh(x)[/code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ arc-hyperbolic-tangent ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]atanh(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ "
"Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Convert a quantity in radians to degrees. Translates to [code]degrees(x)[/"
"code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ແປງຄ່າຈາກ ເຣດຽນ (radians) ເປັນ ອົງສາ (degrees). ແປເປັນ [code]degrees(x)[/code] "
"ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns 2 raised by the power of the parameter. Translates to [code]exp2(x)[/"
"code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ 2 ຍົກກຳລັງດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]exp2(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the inverse of the square root of the parameter. Translates to "
"[code]inversesqrt(x)[/code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າສ່ວນກັບຂອງຮາກຂັ້ນສອງ (inverse square root) ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ "
"[code]inversesqrt(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the base 2 logarithm of the parameter. Translates to [code]log2(x)[/"
"code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ base 2 logarithm ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]log2(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot "
"Shader."

msgid ""
"Convert a quantity in degrees to radians. Translates to [code]radians(x)[/"
"code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ແປງຄ່າຈາກ ອົງສາ (degrees) ເປັນ ເຣດຽນ (radians). ແປເປັນ [code]radians(x)[/code] "
"ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Finds reciprocal value of dividing 1 by [code]x[/code] (i.e. [code]1 / x[/"
"code])."
msgstr ""
"ຊອກຫາຄ່າສ່ວນກັບ (reciprocal) ໂດຍການຫານ 1 ດ້ວຍ [code]x[/code] (ເຊັ່ນ: [code]1 / x[/"
"code])."

msgid ""
"Finds the nearest even integer to the parameter. Translates to "
"[code]roundEven(x)[/code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ຊອກຫາຈຳນວນຖ້ວນຄູ່ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດກັບພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]roundEven(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot "
"Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns a value equal to the nearest integer to [code]x[/code] whose absolute "
"value is not larger than the absolute value of [code]x[/code]. Translates to "
"[code]trunc(x)[/code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າທີ່ເທົ່າກັບຈຳນວນຖ້ວນທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດກັບ [code]x[/code] ເຊິ່ງຄ່າສຳບູນຂອງມັນບໍ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຄ່າສຳບູນຂອງ "
"[code]x[/code]. ແປເປັນ [code]trunc(x)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid "Subtracts scalar [code]x[/code] from 1 (i.e. [code]1 - x[/code])."
msgstr "ລົບສະກາລ່າ [code]x[/code] ອອກຈາກ 1 (ເຊັ່ນ: [code]1 - x[/code])."

msgid ""
"A floating-point scalar operator to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຕົວດຳເນີນການສະກາລ່າຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມ ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Applies [member operator] to two floating-point inputs: [code]a[/code] and "
"[code]b[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ [member operator] ກັບອິນພຸດຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມສອງຄ່າ: [code]a[/code] ແລະ [code]b[/"
"code]."

msgid "Sums two numbers using [code]a + b[/code]."
msgstr "ບວກສອງຕົວເລກໂດຍໃຊ້ [code]a + b[/code]."

msgid "Subtracts two numbers using [code]a - b[/code]."
msgstr "ລົບສອງຕົວເລກໂດຍໃຊ້ [code]a - b[/code]."

msgid "Multiplies two numbers using [code]a * b[/code]."
msgstr "ຄູນສອງຕົວເລກໂດຍໃຊ້ [code]a * b[/code]."

msgid "Divides two numbers using [code]a / b[/code]."
msgstr "ຫານສອງຕົວເລກໂດຍໃຊ້ [code]a / b[/code]."

msgid ""
"Calculates the remainder of two numbers. Translates to [code]mod(a, b)[/code] "
"in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳນວນສ່ວນເສດ (remainder) ຂອງສອງຕົວເລກ. ແປເປັນ [code]mod(a, b)[/code] ໃນພາສາ "
"Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Raises the [code]a[/code] to the power of [code]b[/code]. Translates to "
"[code]pow(a, b)[/code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ຍົກກຳລັງ [code]a[/code] ດ້ວຍ [code]b[/code]. ແປເປັນ [code]pow(a, b)[/code] ໃນພາສາ "
"Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the greater of two numbers. Translates to [code]max(a, b)[/code] in "
"the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າຂອງສອງຕົວເລກ. ແປເປັນ [code]max(a, b)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the lesser of two numbers. Translates to [code]min(a, b)[/code] in "
"the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າທີ່ໜ້ອຍກວ່າຂອງສອງຕົວເລກ. ແປເປັນ [code]min(a, b)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the arc-tangent of the parameters. Translates to [code]atan(a, b)[/"
"code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ arc-tangent ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ. ແປເປັນ [code]atan(a, b)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot "
"Shader."

msgid ""
"Generates a step function by comparing [code]b[/code](x) to [code]a[/code]"
"(edge). Returns 0.0 if [code]x[/code] is smaller than [code]edge[/code] and "
"otherwise 1.0. Translates to [code]step(a, b)[/code] in the Godot Shader "
"Language."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຟັງຊັນຂັ້ນໄດໂດຍການປຽບທຽບ [code]b[/code](x) ກັບ [code]a[/code](edge). ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.0 "
"ຖ້າ [code]x[/code] ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [code]edge[/code] ແລະ ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນແມ່ນ 1.0. ແປເປັນ "
"[code]step(a, b)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid "A scalar float parameter to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີສະກາລ່າໂຟຼດ (float) ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Translated to [code]uniform float[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ຖືກແປເປັນ [code]uniform float[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"A hint applied to the uniform, which controls the values it can take when set "
"through the Inspector."
msgstr "hint ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບ uniform ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຄ່າທີ່ມັນສາມາດຮັບໄດ້ ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຜ່ານ Inspector."

msgid ""
"Minimum value for range hints. Used if [member hint] is set to [constant "
"HINT_RANGE] or [constant HINT_RANGE_STEP]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດສຳລັບ range hints. ໃຊ້ຖ້າ [member hint] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant HINT_RANGE] ຫຼື "
"[constant HINT_RANGE_STEP]."

msgid ""
"Maximum value for range hints. Used if [member hint] is set to [constant "
"HINT_RANGE] or [constant HINT_RANGE_STEP]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າສູງສຸດສຳລັບ range hints. ໃຊ້ຖ້າ [member hint] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant HINT_RANGE] ຫຼື "
"[constant HINT_RANGE_STEP]."

msgid ""
"Step (increment) value for the range hint with step. Used if [member hint] is "
"set to [constant HINT_RANGE_STEP]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຂັ້ນຕອນ (ການເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ) ສຳລັບ range hint with step. ໃຊ້ຖ້າ [member hint] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[constant HINT_RANGE_STEP]."

msgid "No hint used."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ hint."

msgid ""
"A range hint for scalar value, which limits possible input values between "
"[member min] and [member max]. Translated to [code]hint_range(min, max)[/"
"code] in shader code."
msgstr ""
"range hint ສຳລັບຄ່າສະກາລ່າ ເຊິ່ງຈຳກັດຄ່າອິນພຸດທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ລະຫວ່າງ [member min] ແລະ [member "
"max]. ແປເປັນ [code]hint_range(min, max)[/code] ໃນໂຄ້ດເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"A range hint for scalar value with step, which limits possible input values "
"between [member min] and [member max], with a step (increment) of [member "
"step]). Translated to [code]hint_range(min, max, step)[/code] in shader code."
msgstr ""
"range hint ສຳລັບຄ່າສະກາລ່າພ້ອມຂັ້ນຕອນ ເຊິ່ງຈຳກັດຄ່າອິນພຸດທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ລະຫວ່າງ [member min] ແລະ "
"[member max], ພ້ອມກັບຂັ້ນຕອນ (ການເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ) ຂອງ [member step]). ແປເປັນ "
"[code]hint_range(min, max, step)[/code] ໃນໂຄ້ດເຊເດີ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Hint] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum Hint]."

msgid ""
"A frame other visual shader nodes can be attached to for better organization."
msgstr "ເຟຣມທີ່ໂນດວິຊົວເຊເດີອື່ນໆສາມາດຕິດເຂົ້າໃສ່ໄດ້ເພື່ອການຈັດລະບຽບທີ່ດີຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"A rectangular frame that can be used to group visual shader nodes together to "
"improve organization.\n"
"Nodes attached to the frame will move with it when it is dragged and it can "
"automatically resize to enclose all attached nodes.\n"
"Its title, description and color can be customized."
msgstr ""
"ເຟຣມສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລວມກຸ່ມໂນດວິຊົວເຊເດີເຂົ້າກັນເພື່ອປັບປຸງການຈັດລະບຽບ.\n"
"ໂນດທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບເຟຣມຈະຍ້າຍໄປນຳເມື່ອເຟຣມຖືກລາກ ແລະ "
"ມັນສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ກວມເອົາໂນດທັງໝົດທີ່ຕິດຢູ່.\n"
"ຫົວຂໍ້, ຄຳອະທິບາຍ ແລະ ສີຂອງມັນສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Adds a node to the list of nodes attached to the frame. Should not be called "
"directly, use the [method VisualShader.attach_node_to_frame] method instead."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມໂນດເຂົ້າໃນລາຍຊື່ໂນດທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບເຟຣມ. ບໍ່ຄວນເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍກົງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method "
"VisualShader.attach_node_to_frame] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Removes a node from the list of nodes attached to the frame. Should not be "
"called directly, use the [method VisualShader.detach_node_from_frame] method "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"ລົບໂນດອອກຈາກລາຍຊື່ໂນດທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບເຟຣມ. ບໍ່ຄວນເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍກົງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method "
"VisualShader.detach_node_from_frame] ແທນ."

msgid "The list of nodes attached to the frame."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ຂອງໂນດທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບເຟຣມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the frame will automatically resize to enclose all "
"attached nodes."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເຟຣມຈະປັບຂະໜາດອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ກວມເອົາໂນດທັງໝົດທີ່ຕິດຢູ່."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the frame will be tinted with the color specified in "
"[member tint_color]."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເຟຣມຈະຖືກຍ້ອມສີດ້ວຍສີທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ [member tint_color]."

msgid "The title of the node."
msgstr "ຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງໂນດ."

msgid "A Fresnel effect to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ເອັບເຟັກ Fresnel ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Returns falloff based on the dot product of surface normal and view direction "
"of camera (pass associated inputs to it)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າການຫຼຸດລົງ (falloff) ໂດຍອີງຕາມ ດັອດໂປຣດັກ ຂອງເວັກເຕີ້ແນວສາກພື້ນຜິວ (surface normal) "
"ແລະ ທິດທາງການເບິ່ງຂອງກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"A custom global visual shader graph expression written in Godot Shading "
"Language."
msgstr ""
"ນິພົດກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີແບບໂກລບອລ (global) ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ເຊິ່ງຂຽນດ້ວຍພາສາ Godot Shading "
"Language."

msgid ""
"Custom Godot Shader Language expression, which is placed on top of the "
"generated shader. You can place various function definitions inside to call "
"later in [VisualShaderNodeExpression]s (which are injected in the main shader "
"functions). You can also declare varyings, uniforms and global constants."
msgstr ""
"ສຳນວນພາສາ Shader ຂອງ Godot ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເຊິ່ງຖືກວາງໄວ້ສ່ວນເທິງສຸດຂອງ shader ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດວາງການກຳນົດຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆໄວ້ທາງໃນເພື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງໃນ "
"[VisualShaderNodeExpression] (ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກແຊກເຂົ້າໃນຟັງຊັນຫຼັກຂອງ shader). "
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປະກາດ varyings, uniforms ແລະ ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ທົ່ວໄປ (global constants) ໄດ້ອີກດ້ວຍ."

msgid ""
"Base class for a family of nodes with variable number of input and output "
"ports within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄຼາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບກຸ່ມໂນດທີ່ມີຈຳນວນພອດອິນພຸດ ແລະ ເອົາພຸດທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Currently, has no direct usage, use the derived classes instead."
msgstr "ປະຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ມີການນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍກົງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຼາສທີ່ສືບທອດມາແທນ."

msgid ""
"Adds an input port with the specified [param type] (see [enum "
"VisualShaderNode.PortType]) and [param name]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມພອດອິນພຸດດ້ວຍ [param type] (ເບິ່ງ [enum VisualShaderNode.PortType]) ແລະ [param "
"name] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Adds an output port with the specified [param type] (see [enum "
"VisualShaderNode.PortType]) and [param name]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມພອດເອົາພຸດດ້ວຍ [param type] (ເບິ່ງ [enum VisualShaderNode.PortType]) ແລະ [param "
"name] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid "Removes all previously specified input ports."
msgstr "ລົບພອດອິນພຸດທັງໝົດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

msgid "Removes all previously specified output ports."
msgstr "ລົບພອດເອົາພຸດທັງໝົດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns a free input port ID which can be used in [method add_input_port]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ ID ຂອງພອດອິນພຸດທີ່ຫວ່າງຢູ່ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນ [method add_input_port] ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns a free output port ID which can be used in [method add_output_port]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ ID ຂອງພອດເອົາພຸດທີ່ຫວ່າງຢູ່ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນ [method add_output_port] ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of input ports in use. Alternative for [method "
"get_free_input_port_id]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນພອດອິນພຸດທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່. ເປັນທາງເລືອກສຳລັບ [method get_free_input_port_id]."

msgid ""
"Returns a [String] description of the input ports as a colon-separated list "
"using the format [code]id,type,name;[/code] (see [method add_input_port])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍລະອຽດ [String] ຂອງພອດຂາເຂົ້າເປັນລາຍການທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍຈໍ້າສອງເມັດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ "
"[code]id,type,name;[/code] (ເບິ່ງ [method add_input_port])."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of output ports in use. Alternative for [method "
"get_free_output_port_id]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນພອດເອົາພຸດທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່. ເປັນທາງເລືອກສຳລັບ [method get_free_output_port_id]."

msgid ""
"Returns a [String] description of the output ports as a colon-separated list "
"using the format [code]id,type,name;[/code] (see [method add_output_port])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍລະອຽດ [String] ຂອງພອດຂາອອກເປັນລາຍການທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍຈໍ້າສອງເມັດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ "
"[code]id,type,name;[/code] (ເບິ່ງ [method add_output_port])."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified input port exists."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຫາກມີພອດອິນພຸດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified output port exists."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຫາກມີພອດເອົາພຸດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified port name does not override an "
"existed port name and is valid within the shader."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຊື່ພອດທີ່ລະບຸບໍ່ຂຽນທັບຊື່ພອດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ຖືກຕ້ອງພາຍໃນ shader."

msgid "Removes the specified input port."
msgstr "ລົບພອດອິນພຸດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid "Removes the specified output port."
msgstr "ລົບພອດເອົາພຸດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid "Renames the specified input port."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຊື່ພອດອິນພຸດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the specified input port's type (see [enum VisualShaderNode.PortType])."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າປະເພດຂອງພອດອິນພຸດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ (ເບິ່ງ [enum VisualShaderNode.PortType])."

msgid ""
"Defines all input ports using a [String] formatted as a colon-separated list: "
"[code]id,type,name;[/code] (see [method add_input_port])."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດພອດຂາເຂົ້າທັງໝົດໂດຍໃຊ້ [String] ທີ່ຈັດຮູບແບບເປັນລາຍການທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍຈໍ້າສອງເມັດ: "
"[code]id,type,name;[/code] (ເບິ່ງ [method add_input_port])."

msgid "Renames the specified output port."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຊື່ພອດເອົາພຸດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the specified output port's type (see [enum VisualShaderNode.PortType])."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າປະເພດຂອງພອດເອົາພຸດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ (ເບິ່ງ [enum VisualShaderNode.PortType])."

msgid ""
"Defines all output ports using a [String] formatted as a colon-separated "
"list: [code]id,type,name;[/code] (see [method add_output_port])."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດພອດຂາອອກທັງໝົດໂດຍໃຊ້ [String] ທີ່ຈັດຮູບແບບເປັນລາຍການທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍຈໍ້າສອງເມັດ: "
"[code]id,type,name;[/code] (ເບິ່ງ [method add_output_port])."

msgid ""
"Outputs a 3D vector based on the result of a floating-point comparison within "
"the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ສົ່ງເອົາພຸດເປັນເວັກເຕີ້ 3 ມິຕິ ໂດຍອີງຕາມຜົນຂອງການປຽບທຽບຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"This visual shader node has six input ports:\n"
"- Port [b]1[/b] and [b]2[/b] provide the two floating-point numbers [code]a[/"
"code] and [code]b[/code] that will be compared.\n"
"- Port [b]3[/b] is the tolerance, which allows similar floating-point numbers "
"to be considered equal.\n"
"- Ports [b]4[/b], [b]5[/b], and [b]6[/b] are the possible outputs, returned "
"if [code]a == b[/code], [code]a > b[/code], or [code]a < b[/code] "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ visual shader ນີ້ມີຫົກຊ່ອງຮັບຂໍ້ມູນ:\n"
"- ຊ່ອງ [b]1[/b] ແລະ [b]2[/b] ໃຫ້ຕົວເລກທົດສະນິຍົມສອງຕົວ [code]a[/code] ແລະ [code]b[/"
"code] ທີ່ຈະຖືກປຽບທຽບ.\n"
"- ຊ່ອງ [b]3[/b] ແມ່ນຄ່າຜິດດ່ຽງທີ່ຍອມຮັບໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ຕົວເລກທົດສະນິຍົມທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງກັນຖືກຖືວ່າເທົ່າກັນ.\n"
"- ຊ່ອງ [b]4[/b], [b]5[/b], ແລະ [b]6[/b] ແມ່ນຜົນອອກທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້, ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຖ້າ [code]a == "
"b[/code], [code]a > b[/code], ຫຼື [code]a < b[/code] ຕາມລຳດັບ."

msgid "Represents the input shader parameter within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ແທນພາຣາມິເຕີອິນພຸດເຊເດີພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Gives access to input variables (built-ins) available for the shader. See the "
"shading reference for the list of available built-ins for each shader type "
"(check [code]Tutorials[/code] section for link)."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຕົວປ່ຽນຂາເຂົ້າ (built-ins) ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບ shader. ເບິ່ງເອກະສານອ້າງອີງການເຮັດ "
"shader ສຳລັບລາຍການ built-ins ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະປະເພດ shader (ກວດເບິ່ງສ່ວນ "
"[code]Tutorials[/code] ສຳລັບລິ້ງ)."

msgid "Shading reference index"
msgstr "ອິນເດັກການອ້າງອີງການເຮັດເຊດດິງ (Shading reference index)"

msgid ""
"Returns a translated name of the current constant in the Godot Shader "
"Language. E.g. [code]\"ALBEDO\"[/code] if the [member input_name] equal to "
"[code]\"albedo\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ທີ່ແປແລ້ວຂອງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ປັດຈຸບັນໃນພາສາ Godot Shader. ຕົວຢ່າງ: [code]\"ALBEDO\"[/code] "
"ຖ້າ [member input_name] ເທົ່າກັບ [code]\"albedo\"[/code]."

msgid ""
"One of the several input constants in lower-case style like: \"vertex\" "
"([code]VERTEX[/code]) or \"point_size\" ([code]POINT_SIZE[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ໜຶ່ງໃນຫຼາຍຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຂາເຂົ້າໃນຮູບແບບຕົວພິມນ້ອຍ ເຊັ່ນ: \"vertex\" ([code]VERTEX[/code]) ຫຼື "
"\"point_size\" ([code]POINT_SIZE[/code])."

msgid "Emitted when input is changed via [member input_name]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອອິນພຸດຖືກປ່ຽນແປງຜ່ານ [member input_name]."

msgid "A scalar integer constant to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສະກາລ່າຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Translated to [code skip-lint]int[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ຖືກແປເປັນ [code skip-lint]int[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid "An integer constant which represents a state of this node."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຈຳນວນຖ້ວນທີ່ແທນສະຖານະຂອງໂນດນີ້."

msgid "A scalar integer function to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນສະກາລ່າຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Accept an integer scalar ([code]x[/code]) to the input port and transform it "
"according to [member function]."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບສະກາລ່າຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ ([code]x[/code]) ເຂົ້າທາງພອດອິນພຸດ ແລະ ປ່ຽນແປງມັນຕາມ [member "
"function]."

msgid ""
"Returns the result of bitwise [code]NOT[/code] operation on the integer. "
"Translates to [code]~a[/code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຜົນລັບຂອງການດຳເນີນການ bitwise [code]NOT[/code] ໃນຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ. ແປເປັນ [code]~a[/"
"code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid "An integer scalar operator to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຕົວດຳເນີນການສະກາລ່າຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Applies [member operator] to two integer inputs: [code]a[/code] and [code]b[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ [member operator] ກັບອິນພຸດຈຳນວນຖ້ວນສອງຄ່າ: [code]a[/code] ແລະ [code]b[/code]."

msgid "Calculates the remainder of two numbers using [code]a % b[/code]."
msgstr "ຄຳນວນສ່ວນເສດຂອງສອງຕົວເລກໂດຍໃຊ້ [code]a % b[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the lesser of two numbers. Translates to [code]max(a, b)[/code] in "
"the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າທີ່ໜ້ອຍກວ່າຂອງສອງຕົວເລກ. ແປເປັນ [code]max(a, b)[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the result of bitwise [code]AND[/code] operation on the integer. "
"Translates to [code]a & b[/code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຜົນລັບຂອງການດຳເນີນການ bitwise [code]AND[/code] ໃນຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ. ແປເປັນ [code]a & "
"b[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the result of bitwise [code]OR[/code] operation for two integers. "
"Translates to [code]a | b[/code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຜົນລັບຂອງການດຳເນີນການ bitwise [code]OR[/code] ສຳລັບຈຳນວນຖ້ວນສອງຄ່າ. ແປເປັນ "
"[code]a | b[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the result of bitwise [code]XOR[/code] operation for two integers. "
"Translates to [code]a ^ b[/code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຜົນລັບຂອງການດຳເນີນການ bitwise [code]XOR[/code] ສຳລັບຈຳນວນຖ້ວນສອງຄ່າ. ແປເປັນ "
"[code]a ^ b[/code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the result of bitwise left shift operation on the integer. Translates "
"to [code]a << b[/code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຜົນລັບຂອງການດຳເນີນການ bitwise left shift ໃນຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ. ແປເປັນ [code]a << b[/"
"code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid ""
"Returns the result of bitwise right shift operation on the integer. "
"Translates to [code]a >> b[/code] in the Godot Shader Language."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຜົນລັບຂອງການດຳເນີນການ bitwise right shift ໃນຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ. ແປເປັນ [code]a >> b[/"
"code] ໃນພາສາ Godot Shader."

msgid "A visual shader node for shader parameter (uniform) of type [int]."
msgstr "ໂນດວິຊົວເຊເດີສຳລັບພາຣາມິເຕີເຊເດີ (uniform) ປະເພດ [int]."

msgid ""
"A [VisualShaderNodeParameter] of type [int]. Offers additional customization "
"for range of accepted values."
msgstr ""
"[VisualShaderNodeParameter] ປະເພດ [int]. ໃຫ້ການປັບແຕ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບຊ່ວງຂອງຄ່າທີ່ຍອມຮັບ."

msgid ""
"Default value of this parameter, which will be used if not set externally. "
"[member default_value_enabled] must be enabled; defaults to [code]0[/code] "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງພາລາມິເຕີນີ້, ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຈາກພາຍນອກ. [member "
"default_value_enabled] ຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້; ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ [code]0[/code]."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the node will have a custom default value."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດຈະມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"The names used for the enum select in the editor. [member hint] must be "
"[constant HINT_ENUM] for this to take effect."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເລືອກ enum ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. [member hint] ຕ້ອງເປັນ [constant HINT_ENUM] "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນ."

msgid "Range hint of this node. Use it to customize valid parameter range."
msgstr "Range hint ຂອງໂນດນີ້. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຊ່ວງພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"The maximum value this parameter can take. [member hint] must be either "
"[constant HINT_RANGE] or [constant HINT_RANGE_STEP] for this to take effect."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າສູງສຸດທີ່ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ສາມາດຮັບໄດ້. [member hint] ຕ້ອງເປັນ [constant HINT_RANGE] ຫຼື "
"[constant HINT_RANGE_STEP] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນ."

msgid ""
"The minimum value this parameter can take. [member hint] must be either "
"[constant HINT_RANGE] or [constant HINT_RANGE_STEP] for this to take effect."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່ານ້ອຍສຸດທີ່ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ສາມາດຮັບໄດ້. [member hint] ຕ້ອງເປັນ [constant HINT_RANGE] ຫຼື "
"[constant HINT_RANGE_STEP] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນ."

msgid ""
"The step between parameter's values. Forces the parameter to be a multiple of "
"the given value. [member hint] must be [constant HINT_RANGE_STEP] for this to "
"take effect."
msgstr ""
"ຂັ້ນຕອນລະຫວ່າງຄ່າຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ. ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ພາລາມິເຕີເປັນຕົວຄູນຂອງຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. [member hint] "
"ຕ້ອງເປັນ [constant HINT_RANGE_STEP] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນ."

msgid "The parameter will not constrain its value."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີຈະບໍ່ຈຳກັດຄ່າຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"The parameter's value must be within the specified [member min]/[member max] "
"range."
msgstr "ຄ່າຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີຕ້ອງຢູ່ພາຍໃນຊ່ວງ [member min]/[member max] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid ""
"The parameter's value must be within the specified range, with the given "
"[member step] between values."
msgstr "ຄ່າຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີຕ້ອງຢູ່ພາຍໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້, ພ້ອມກັບ [member step] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ລະຫວ່າງຄ່າ."

msgid ""
"The parameter uses an enum to associate preset values to names in the editor."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີໃຊ້ enum ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມໂຍງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າກັບຊື່ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "A boolean comparison operator to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຕົວດຳເນີນການປຽບທຽບບູລີນສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວິຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the boolean result of the comparison between [code]INF[/code] or "
"[code]NaN[/code] and a scalar parameter."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຜົນລັບບູລີນຂອງການປຽບທຽບລະຫວ່າງ [code]INF[/code] ຫຼື [code]NaN[/code] "
"ກັບພາຣາມິເຕີສະກາລ່າ."

msgid "The comparison function."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນການປຽບທຽບ."

msgid "Comparison with [code]INF[/code] (Infinity)."
msgstr "ການປຽບທຽບກັບ [code]INF[/code] (ອະສົງໄຂ)."

msgid ""
"Comparison with [code]NaN[/code] (Not a Number; indicates invalid numeric "
"results, such as division by zero)."
msgstr ""
"ການປຽບທຽບກັບ [code]NaN[/code] (ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕົວເລກ; ບົ່ງບອກເຖິງຜົນລັບທາງຕົວເລກທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ການຫານດ້ວຍສູນ)."

msgid ""
"A visual shader node that returns the depth value of the DEPTH_TEXTURE node "
"in a linear space."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດວິຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າຄວາມເລິກ (depth value) ຂອງໂນດ DEPTH_TEXTURE ໃນພື້ນທີ່ແບບ linear."

msgid "This node can be used in fragment shaders."
msgstr "ໂນດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນເຊເດີແຟຣກເມັ້ນ."

msgid "Linearly interpolates between two values within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ແຊກຄ່າແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ລະຫວ່າງສອງຄ່າພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ (visual shader graph)."

msgid "Translates to [code]mix(a, b, weight)[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]mix(a, b, weight)[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"The [code]a[/code] and [code]b[/code] ports use a 2D vector type. The "
"[code]weight[/code] port uses a scalar type."
msgstr ""
"ພອດ [code]a[/code] ແລະ [code]b[/code] ໃຊ້ປະເພດເວັກເຕີ 2D. ສ່ວນພອດ [code]weight[/"
"code] ແມ່ນໃຊ້ປະເພດສະກາລາ."

msgid ""
"The [code]a[/code] and [code]b[/code] ports use a 3D vector type. The "
"[code]weight[/code] port uses a scalar type."
msgstr ""
"ພອດ [code]a[/code] ແລະ [code]b[/code] ໃຊ້ປະເພດເວັກເຕີ 3D. ສ່ວນພອດ [code]weight[/"
"code] ແມ່ນໃຊ້ປະເພດສະກາລາ."

msgid ""
"The [code]a[/code] and [code]b[/code] ports use a 4D vector type. The "
"[code]weight[/code] port uses a scalar type."
msgstr ""
"ພອດ [code]a[/code] ແລະ [code]b[/code] ໃຊ້ປະເພດເວັກເຕີ 4D. ສ່ວນພອດ [code]weight[/"
"code] ແມ່ນໃຊ້ປະເພດສະກາລາ."

msgid "Performs a fused multiply-add operation within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດການຄູນ-ບວກແບບລວມ (fused multiply-add) ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Uses three operands to compute [code](a * b + c)[/code] expression."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ສາມຕົວຖືກດຳເນີນການເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ນິພົດ [code](a * b + c)[/code]."

msgid "A floating-point scalar type."
msgstr "ປະເພດສະກາລາແບບເລກຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມລອຍ."

msgid ""
"Calculates an outer product of two vectors within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄິດໄລ່ຜົນຄູນພາຍນອກ (outer product) ຂອງສອງເວັກເຕີພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"[code]OuterProduct[/code] treats the first parameter [code]c[/code] as a "
"column vector (matrix with one column) and the second parameter [code]r[/"
"code] as a row vector (matrix with one row) and does a linear algebraic "
"matrix multiply [code]c * r[/code], yielding a matrix whose number of rows is "
"the number of components in [code]c[/code] and whose number of columns is the "
"number of components in [code]r[/code]."
msgstr ""
"[code]OuterProduct[/code] ຈະກຳນົດໃຫ້ພາລາມິເຕີທຳອິດ [code]c[/code] ເປັນເວັກເຕີຖັນ "
"(ມາຕຣິດທີ່ມີໜຶ່ງຖັນ) ແລະ ພາລາມິເຕີທີສອງ [code]r[/code] ເປັນເວັກເຕີແຖວ (ມາຕຣິດທີ່ມີໜຶ່ງແຖວ) ແລະ "
"ເຮັດການຄູນມາຕຣິດແບບພຶດຊະຄະນິດເສັ້ນຊື່ [code]c * r[/code], "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະໄດ້ມາຕຣິດທີ່ມີຈຳນວນແຖວເທົ່າກັບຈຳນວນອົງປະກອບໃນ [code]c[/code] ແລະ "
"ມີຈຳນວນຖັນເທົ່າກັບຈຳນວນອົງປະກອບໃນ [code]r[/code]."

msgid "Represents the output shader parameters within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງພາລາມິເຕີຜົນອອກຂອງເຊເດີພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"This visual shader node is present in all shader graphs in form of \"Output\" "
"block with multiple output value ports."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີນີ້ມີຢູ່ໃນທຸກໆກຣາບເຊເດີ ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງບລັອກ \"Output\" ທີ່ມີພອດຄ່າຜົນອອກຫຼາຍພອດ."

msgid "A base type for the parameters within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ປະເພດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບພາລາມິເຕີພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"A parameter represents a variable in the shader which is set externally, i.e. "
"from the [ShaderMaterial]. Parameters are exposed as properties in the "
"[ShaderMaterial] and can be assigned from the Inspector or from a script."
msgstr ""
"ພາລາມິເຕີສະແດງເຖິງຕົວປ່ຽນໃນເຊເດີທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດຈາກພາຍນອກ, ເຊັ່ນ: ຈາກ [ShaderMaterial]. "
"ພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະສະແດງເປັນຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ [ShaderMaterial] ແລະ ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າໄດ້ຈາກ Inspector "
"ຫຼື ຈາກສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"The index within 0-15 range, which is used to avoid clashes when shader used "
"on multiple materials."
msgstr "ດັດສະນີພາຍໃນຊ່ວງ 0-15, ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຂັດແຍ້ງກັນເມື່ອເຊເດີຖືກໃຊ້ໃນຫຼາຍວັດສະດຸ."

msgid ""
"Name of the parameter, by which it can be accessed through the "
"[ShaderMaterial] properties."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ [ShaderMaterial]."

msgid "Defines the scope of the parameter."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຂອບເຂດ (scope) ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid "The parameter will be tied to the [ShaderMaterial] using this shader."
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີຈະຖືກຜູກມັດກັບ [ShaderMaterial] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເຊເດີນີ້."

msgid "The parameter will use a global value, defined in Project Settings."
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າທົ່ວໂລກ (global value) ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ Project Settings."

msgid ""
"The parameter will be tied to the node with attached [ShaderMaterial] using "
"this shader."
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີຈະຖືກຜູກມັດກັບໂນດທີ່ມີ [ShaderMaterial] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເຊເດີນີ້ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່."

msgid ""
"The parameter will be tied to the node with attached [ShaderMaterial] using "
"this shader. Enables setting a [member instance_index] property."
msgstr ""
"ພາລາມິເຕີຈະຖືກຜູກມັດກັບໂນດທີ່ມີ [ShaderMaterial] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເຊເດີນີ້ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່. ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"[member instance_index] ໄດ້."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Qualifier] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງ [enum Qualifier] enum."

msgid "A reference to an existing [VisualShaderNodeParameter]."
msgstr "ການອ້າງອີງເຖິງ [VisualShaderNodeParameter] ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Creating a reference to a [VisualShaderNodeParameter] allows you to reuse "
"this parameter in different shaders or shader stages easily."
msgstr ""
"ການສ້າງການອ້າງອີງເຖິງ [VisualShaderNodeParameter] "
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຄືນໃໝ່ໃນເຊເດີ ຫຼື ຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງເຊເດີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ."

msgid "The name of the parameter which this reference points to."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ການອ້າງອີງນີ້ຊີ້ໄປຫາ."

msgid "A visual shader node that accelerates particles."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວໃຫ້ກັບອະນຸພາກ (particles)."

msgid ""
"Particle accelerator can be used in \"process\" step of particle shader. It "
"will accelerate the particles. Connect it to the Velocity output port."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລັ່ງອະນຸພາກ (Particle accelerator) ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນ \"process\" ຂອງເຊເດີອະນຸພາກ. "
"ມັນຈະເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວໃຫ້ກັບອະນຸພາກ. ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ມັນກັບພອດຜົນອອກ Velocity."

msgid "Defines in what manner the particles will be accelerated."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຮູບແບບທີ່ອະນຸພາກຈະຖືກເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວ."

msgid "The particles will be accelerated based on their velocity."
msgstr "ອະນຸພາກຈະຖືກເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວຕາມຄວາມໄວຂອງພວກມັນ."

msgid "The particles will be accelerated towards or away from the center."
msgstr "ອະນຸພາກຈະຖືກເລັ່ງເຂົ້າຫາ ຫຼື ອອກຫ່າງຈາກຈຸດສູນກາງ."

msgid ""
"The particles will be accelerated tangentially to the radius vector from "
"center to their position."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸພາກຈະຖືກເລັ່ງໃນທິດທາງສຳຜັດ (tangentially) "
"ກັບເວັກເຕີລັດສະໝີຈາກຈຸດສູນກາງໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງພວກມັນ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Mode] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງ [enum Mode] enum."

msgid "A visual shader node that makes particles emitted in a box shape."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາເປັນຮູບຊົງກ່ອງ."

msgid ""
"[VisualShaderNodeParticleEmitter] that makes the particles emitted in box "
"shape with the specified extents."
msgstr ""
"[VisualShaderNodeParticleEmitter] "
"ທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາເປັນຮູບຊົງກ່ອງຕາມຂອບເຂດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

msgid "A visual shader node that makes particles move in a cone shape."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກເຄື່ອນທີ່ເປັນຮູບຊົງຈວຍ."

msgid ""
"This node can be used in \"start\" step of particle shader. It defines the "
"initial velocity of the particles, making them move in cone shape starting "
"from the center, with a given spread."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນ \"start\" ຂອງເຊເດີອະນຸພາກ. ມັນກຳນົດຄວາມໄວເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງອະນຸພາກ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນເຄື່ອນທີ່ເປັນຮູບຊົງຈວຍເລີ່ມຈາກຈຸດສູນກາງ ດ້ວຍການກະຈາຍ (spread) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "A visual shader node that forces to emit a particle from a sub-emitter."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກຈາກຕົວປ່ອຍຍ່ອຍ (sub-emitter)."

msgid ""
"Flags used to override the properties defined in the sub-emitter's process "
"material."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (Flags) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຂຽນທັບຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ process material ຂອງຕົວປ່ອຍຍ່ອຍ."

msgid "If enabled, the particle starts with the position defined by this node."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ອະນຸພາກຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍໂນດນີ້."

msgid ""
"If enabled, the particle starts with the rotation and scale defined by this "
"node."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ອະນຸພາກຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການໝູນ ແລະ ຂະໜາດທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍໂນດນີ້."

msgid "If enabled,the particle starts with the velocity defined by this node."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ອະນຸພາກຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍໂນດນີ້."

msgid "If enabled, the particle starts with the color defined by this node."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ອະນຸພາກຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍສີທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍໂນດນີ້."

msgid ""
"If enabled, the particle starts with the [code]CUSTOM[/code] data defined by "
"this node."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ອະນຸພາກຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນ [code]CUSTOM[/code] ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍໂນດນີ້."

msgid "A base class for particle emitters."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບຕົວປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກ (particle emitters)."

msgid ""
"Particle emitter nodes can be used in \"start\" step of particle shaders and "
"they define the starting position of the particles. Connect them to the "
"Position output port."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດຕົວປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນ \"start\" ຂອງເຊເດີອະນຸພາກ ແລະ "
"ພວກມັນກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງອະນຸພາກ. ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພວກມັນກັບພອດຜົນອອກ Position."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the result of this emitter is projected to 2D space. By "
"default it is [code]false[/code] and meant for use in 3D space."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຂອງຕົວປ່ອຍນີ້ຈະຖືກສາຍພາບ (projected) ໄປຫາພື້ນທີ່ 2D. "
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະເປັນ [code]false[/code] ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ສຳລັບພື້ນທີ່ 3D."

msgid ""
"A visual shader node that makes particles emitted in a shape defined by a "
"[Mesh]."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາຕາມຮູບຊົງທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [Mesh]."

msgid ""
"[VisualShaderNodeParticleEmitter] that makes the particles emitted in a shape "
"of the assigned [member mesh]. It will emit from the mesh's surfaces, either "
"all or only the specified one."
msgstr ""
"[VisualShaderNodeParticleEmitter] ທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາເປັນຮູບຊົງຂອງ [member "
"mesh] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ມັນຈະປ່ອຍອອກມາຈາກພື້ນຜິວຂອງເມຊ໌, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນທັງໝົດ ຫຼື ສະເພາະອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid "The [Mesh] that defines emission shape."
msgstr "[Mesh] ທີ່ກຳນົດຮູບຊົງການປ່ອຍ."

msgid ""
"Index of the surface that emits particles. [member use_all_surfaces] must be "
"[code]false[/code] for this to take effect."
msgstr ""
"ດັດສະນີຂອງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກ. [member use_all_surfaces] ຕ້ອງເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the particles will emit from all surfaces of the mesh."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ອະນຸພາກຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາຈາກທຸກພື້ນຜິວຂອງເມຊ໌."

msgid ""
"A visual shader helper node for multiplying position and rotation of "
"particles."
msgstr "ໂນດຊ່ວຍວີຊົວເຊເດີສຳລັບການຄູນຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ການໝູນຂອງອະນຸພາກ."

msgid ""
"This node helps to multiply a position input vector by rotation using "
"specific axis. Intended to work with emitters."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດນີ້ຊ່ວຍຄູນເວັກເຕີຂໍ້ມູນຕຳແໜ່ງດ້ວຍການໝູນໂດຍໃຊ້ແກນທີ່ລະບຸ. ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຕົວປ່ອຍ (emitters)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the angle will be interpreted in degrees instead of "
"radians."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ມຸມຈະຖືກແປຄ່າເປັນອົງສາ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນເຣດຽນ (radians)."

msgid "Visual shader node that defines output values for particle emitting."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ກຳນົດຄ່າຜົນອອກສຳລັບການປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກ."

msgid ""
"This node defines how particles are emitted. It allows to customize e.g. "
"position and velocity. Available ports are different depending on which "
"function this node is inside (start, process, collision) and whether custom "
"data is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດນີ້ກຳນົດວິທີການປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກ. ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ: ຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ຄວາມໄວ. "
"ພອດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມຟັງຊັນທີ່ໂນດນີ້ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ (start, process, collision) ແລະ "
"ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບວ່າໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ custom data ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid "Visual shader node for randomizing particle values."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີສຳລັບການສຸ່ມຄ່າຂອງອະນຸພາກ."

msgid ""
"Randomness node will output pseudo-random values of the given type based on "
"the specified minimum and maximum values."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດສຸ່ມຈະສົ່ງຄ່າແບບສຸ່ມທຽມ (pseudo-random) ຕາມປະເພດທີ່ກຳນົດ ໂດຍອີງຕາມຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດ ແລະ "
"ສູງສຸດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid "A visual shader node that makes particles emitted in a ring shape."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາເປັນຮູບຊົງວົງແຫວນ."

msgid ""
"[VisualShaderNodeParticleEmitter] that makes the particles emitted in ring "
"shape with the specified inner and outer radii and height."
msgstr ""
"[VisualShaderNodeParticleEmitter] ທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາເປັນຮູບຊົງວົງແຫວນ "
"ດ້ວຍລັດສະໝີພາຍໃນ, ພາຍນອກ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

msgid "A visual shader node that makes particles emitted in a sphere shape."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາເປັນຮູບຊົງກົມ."

msgid ""
"[VisualShaderNodeParticleEmitter] that makes the particles emitted in sphere "
"shape with the specified inner and outer radii."
msgstr ""
"[VisualShaderNodeParticleEmitter] ທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາເປັນຮູບຊົງກົມ "
"ດ້ວຍລັດສະໝີພາຍໃນ ແລະ ພາຍນອກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

msgid "A visual shader node representing proximity fade effect."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງເອັບເຟັກການຈາງຫາຍຕາມຄວາມໃກ້ (proximity fade)."

msgid ""
"The proximity fade effect fades out each pixel based on its distance to "
"another object."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກ proximity fade ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວຈາງຫາຍໄປ ໂດຍອີງຕາມໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອງມັນກັບວັດຖຸອື່ນ."

msgid "A visual shader node that generates a pseudo-random scalar."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ສ້າງຄ່າສະກາລາແບບສຸ່ມທຽມ."

msgid ""
"Random range node will output a pseudo-random scalar value in the specified "
"range, based on the seed. The value is always the same for the given seed and "
"range, so you should provide a changing input, e.g. by using time."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດຊ່ວງການສຸ່ມຈະສົ່ງຄ່າສະກາລາແບບສຸ່ມທຽມໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ກຳນົດ ໂດຍອີງຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (seed). "
"ຄ່າທີ່ໄດ້ຈະຄືເກົ່າສະເໝີສຳລັບ seed ແລະ ຊ່ວງທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຄວນປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ການໃຊ້ເວລາ (time)."

msgid "A visual shader node for remap function."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີສຳລັບຟັງຊັນການປ່ຽນຊ່ວງຄ່າ (remap)."

msgid ""
"Remap will transform the input range into output range, e.g. you can change a "
"[code]0..1[/code] value to [code]-2..2[/code] etc. See [method "
"@GlobalScope.remap] for more details."
msgstr ""
"Remap ຈະປ່ຽນຊ່ວງຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າໃຫ້ເປັນຊ່ວງຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກ, ເຊັ່ນ: ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຄ່າ [code]0..1[/code] "
"ໃຫ້ເປັນ [code]-2..2[/code] ເປັນຕົ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [method @GlobalScope.remap] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The [code]value[/code] port uses a 2D vector type, while the [code]input min[/"
"code], [code]input max[/code], [code]output min[/code], and [code]output max[/"
"code] ports use a floating-point scalar type."
msgstr ""
"ພອດ [code]value[/code] ໃຊ້ປະເພດເວັກເຕີ 2D, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພອດ [code]input min[/code], "
"[code]input max[/code], [code]output min[/code], ແລະ [code]output max[/code] "
"ໃຊ້ປະເພດສະກາລາແບບເລກຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມລອຍ."

msgid ""
"The [code]value[/code] port uses a 3D vector type, while the [code]input min[/"
"code], [code]input max[/code], [code]output min[/code], and [code]output max[/"
"code] ports use a floating-point scalar type."
msgstr ""
"ພອດ [code]value[/code] ໃຊ້ປະເພດເວັກເຕີ 3D, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພອດ [code]input min[/code], "
"[code]input max[/code], [code]output min[/code], ແລະ [code]output max[/code] "
"ໃຊ້ປະເພດສະກາລາແບບເລກຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມລອຍ."

msgid ""
"The [code]value[/code] port uses a 4D vector type, while the [code]input min[/"
"code], [code]input max[/code], [code]output min[/code], and [code]output max[/"
"code] ports use a floating-point scalar type."
msgstr ""
"ພອດ [code]value[/code] ໃຊ້ປະເພດເວັກເຕີ 4D, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພອດ [code]input min[/code], "
"[code]input max[/code], [code]output min[/code], ແລະ [code]output max[/code] "
"ໃຊ້ປະເພດສະກາລາແບບເລກຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມລອຍ."

msgid ""
"A node that allows rerouting a connection within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (rerouting) ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Automatically adapts its port type to the type of the incoming connection and "
"ensures valid connections."
msgstr ""
"ປັບປະເພດພອດຂອງມັນໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບປະເພດຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂາເຂົ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ "
"ຮັບປະກັນວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ນັ້ນຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Returns the port type of the reroute node."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນປະເພດພອດຂອງໂນດ reroute."

msgid "Base class for resizable nodes in a visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບໂນດທີ່ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Resizable nodes have a handle that allows the user to adjust their size as "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດທີ່ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ຈະມີປຸ່ມຈັບ (handle) ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດຂອງມັນໄດ້ຕາມຕ້ອງການ."

msgid "The size of the node in the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງໂນດໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"A visual shader node that modifies the rotation of the object using a "
"rotation matrix."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ແກ້ໄຂການໝູນຂອງວັດຖຸໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດມາຕຣິດການໝູນ (rotation matrix)."

msgid ""
"RotationByAxis node will transform the vertices of a mesh with specified axis "
"and angle in radians. It can be used to rotate an object in an arbitrary axis."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ RotationByAxis ຈະປ່ຽນຮູບຮ່າງຂອງຈຸດຍອດ (vertices) ຂອງເມຊ໌ດ້ວຍແກນ ແລະ "
"ມຸມທີ່ລະບຸເປັນເຣດຽນ. ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝູນວັດຖຸໃນແກນໃດກໍໄດ້ຕາມຕ້ອງການ."

msgid ""
"A base node for nodes which samples 3D textures in the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ໂນດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບໂນດທີ່ເຮັດການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ (sample) ເທັກເຈີ 3D ໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "A virtual class, use the descendants instead."
msgstr "ຄລາສສະເມືອນ (virtual class), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄລາສທີ່ສືບທອດແທນ."

msgid "An input source type."
msgstr "ປະເພດແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າ."

msgid "Creates internal uniform and provides a way to assign it within node."
msgstr "ສ້າງຄ່າ uniform ພາຍໃນ ແລະ ໃຫ້ວິທີການກຳນົດຄ່າມັນພາຍໃນໂນດ."

msgid "Use the uniform texture from sampler port."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີ uniform ຈາກພອດ sampler."

msgid ""
"A visual shader node that unpacks the screen normal texture in World Space."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ແຍກ (unpack) ເທັກເຈີ screen normal ໃນ World Space."

msgid "The ScreenNormalWorldSpace node allows to create outline effects."
msgstr "ໂນດ ScreenNormalWorldSpace ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດສ້າງເອັບເຟັກເສັ້ນຂອບ (outline) ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"A function to convert screen UV to an SDF (signed-distance field), to be used "
"within the visual shader graph."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນສຳລັບການປ່ຽນ screen UV ໃຫ້ເປັນ SDF (signed-distance field), "
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Translates to [code]screen_uv_to_sdf(uv)[/code] in the shader language. If "
"the UV port isn't connected, [code]SCREEN_UV[/code] is used instead."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]screen_uv_to_sdf(uv)[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ. ຖ້າພອດ UV ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, "
"ຈະໃຊ້ [code]SCREEN_UV[/code] ແທນ."

msgid "SDF raymarching algorithm to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ອັນກໍລິທຶມ SDF raymarching ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Casts a ray against the screen SDF (signed-distance field) and returns the "
"distance travelled."
msgstr "ຍິງລັງສີ (ray) ໃສ່ screen SDF ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນໄລຍະທາງທີ່ລັງສີເດີນທາງໄປ."

msgid ""
"A function to convert an SDF (signed-distance field) to screen UV, to be used "
"within the visual shader graph."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນສຳລັບການປ່ຽນ SDF (signed-distance field) ໃຫ້ເປັນ screen UV, "
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Translates to [code]sdf_to_screen_uv(sdf_pos)[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]sdf_to_screen_uv(sdf_pos)[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid "Calculates a SmoothStep function within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄິດໄລ່ຟັງຊັນ SmoothStep ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Translates to [code]smoothstep(edge0, edge1, x)[/code] in the shader "
"language.\n"
"Returns [code]0.0[/code] if [code]x[/code] is smaller than [code]edge0[/code] "
"and [code]1.0[/code] if [code]x[/code] is larger than [code]edge1[/code]. "
"Otherwise, the return value is interpolated between [code]0.0[/code] and "
"[code]1.0[/code] using Hermite polynomials."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]smoothstep(edge0, edge1, x)[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ.\n"
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]0.0[/code] ຖ້າ [code]x[/code] ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [code]edge0[/code] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]1.0[/code] ຖ້າ [code]x[/code] ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ [code]edge1[/code]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະຖືກແຊກຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/code] ແລະ [code]1.0[/code] ໂດຍໃຊ້ Hermite "
"polynomials."

msgid ""
"The [code]x[/code] port uses a 2D vector type. The first two ports use a "
"floating-point scalar type."
msgstr ""
"ພອດ [code]x[/code] ໃຊ້ປະເພດເວັກເຕີ 2D. ສອງພອດທຳອິດໃຊ້ປະເພດສະກາລາແບບເລກຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມລອຍ."

msgid ""
"The [code]x[/code] port uses a 3D vector type. The first two ports use a "
"floating-point scalar type."
msgstr ""
"ພອດ [code]x[/code] ໃຊ້ປະເພດເວັກເຕີ 3D. ສອງພອດທຳອິດໃຊ້ປະເພດສະກາລາແບບເລກຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມລອຍ."

msgid "Calculates a Step function within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄິດໄລ່ຟັງຊັນ Step ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Translates to [code]step(edge, x)[/code] in the shader language.\n"
"Returns [code]0.0[/code] if [code]x[/code] is smaller than [code]edge[/code] "
"and [code]1.0[/code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]step(edge, x)[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ.\n"
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]0.0[/code] ຖ້າ [code]x[/code] ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [code]edge[/code] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]1.0[/code] ໃນກໍລະນີອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"The [code]x[/code] port uses a 2D vector type, while the [code]edge[/code] "
"port uses a floating-point scalar type."
msgstr ""
"ພອດ [code]x[/code] ໃຊ້ປະເພດເວັກເຕີ 2D, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພອດ [code]edge[/code] "
"ໃຊ້ປະເພດສະກາລາແບບເລກຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມລອຍ."

msgid ""
"The [code]x[/code] port uses a 3D vector type, while the [code]edge[/code] "
"port uses a floating-point scalar type."
msgstr ""
"ພອດ [code]x[/code] ໃຊ້ປະເພດເວັກເຕີ 3D, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພອດ [code]edge[/code] "
"ໃຊ້ປະເພດສະກາລາແບບເລກຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມລອຍ."

msgid "A selector function for use within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນຕົວເລືອກ (selector) ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Returns an associated value of the [member op_type] type if the provided "
"boolean value is [code]true[/code] or [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຂອງປະເພດ [member op_type] ຖ້າຄ່າບູລີນ (boolean) ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code] ຫຼື [code]false[/code]."

msgid "A transform type."
msgstr "ປະເພດການແປຮູບ (transform type)."

msgid "Performs a 2D texture lookup within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດການຄົ້ນຫາ (lookup) ເທັກເຈີ 2D ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Performs a lookup operation on the provided texture, with support for "
"multiple texture sources to choose from."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດການຄົ້ນຫາ (lookup) ໃນເທັກເຈີທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ, ໂດຍຮອງຮັບການເລືອກແຫຼ່ງເທັກເຈີທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ."

msgid "Determines the source for the lookup."
msgstr "ກຳນົດແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບການຄົ້ນຫາ."

msgid "The source texture, if needed for the selected [member source]."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ, ຖ້າຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ [member source] ທີ່ເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"Specifies the type of the texture if [member source] is set to [constant "
"SOURCE_TEXTURE]."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸປະເພດຂອງເທັກເຈີ ຖ້າ [member source] ຖືກກຳນົດເປັນ [constant SOURCE_TEXTURE]."

msgid "Use the texture given as an argument for this function."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນອາກິວເມນ (argument) ສຳລັບຟັງຊັນນີ້."

msgid "Use the current viewport's texture as the source."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີຂອງວິວພອດ (viewport) ປັດຈຸບັນເປັນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ."

msgid ""
"Use the texture from this shader's texture built-in (e.g. a texture of a "
"[Sprite2D])."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີຈາກຄ່າ built-in ຂອງເຊເດີນີ້ (ເຊັ່ນ: ເທັກເຈີຂອງ [Sprite2D])."

msgid "Use the texture from this shader's normal map built-in."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີຈາກ normal map built-in ຂອງເຊເດີນີ້."

msgid ""
"Use the depth texture captured during the depth prepass. Only available when "
"the depth prepass is used (i.e. in spatial shaders and in the forward_plus or "
"gl_compatibility renderers)."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ depth texture ທີ່ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງ depth prepass. ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ "
"depth prepass (ເຊັ່ນ: ໃນ spatial shaders ແລະ ໃນເຣນເດີເຣີ forward_plus ຫຼື "
"gl_compatibility)."

msgid "Use the texture provided in the input port for this function."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີທີ່ໃຫ້ມາໃນພອດຂາເຂົ້າສຳລັບຟັງຊັນນີ້."

msgid ""
"Use the normal buffer captured during the depth prepass. Only available when "
"the normal-roughness buffer is available (i.e. in spatial shaders and in the "
"forward_plus renderer)."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ normal buffer ທີ່ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງ depth prepass. ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອມີ normal-"
"roughness buffer (ເຊັ່ນ: ໃນ spatial shaders ແລະ ໃນເຣນເດີເຣີ forward_plus)."

msgid ""
"Use the roughness buffer captured during the depth prepass. Only available "
"when the normal-roughness buffer is available (i.e. in spatial shaders and in "
"the forward_plus renderer)."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ roughness buffer ທີ່ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງ depth prepass. ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອມີ "
"normal-roughness buffer (ເຊັ່ນ: ໃນ spatial shaders ແລະ ໃນເຣນເດີເຣີ forward_plus)."

msgid "A 2D texture uniform array to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ອາເຣ uniform ຂອງເທັກເຈີ 2D ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Translated to [code]uniform sampler2DArray[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]uniform sampler2DArray[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"A source texture array. Used if [member VisualShaderNodeSample3D.source] is "
"set to [constant VisualShaderNodeSample3D.SOURCE_TEXTURE]."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣເທັກເຈີແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ. ໃຊ້ຖ້າ [member VisualShaderNodeSample3D.source] ຖືກກຳນົດເປັນ "
"[constant VisualShaderNodeSample3D.SOURCE_TEXTURE]."

msgid ""
"A visual shader node for shader parameter (uniform) of type [Texture2DArray]."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີສຳລັບພາລາມິເຕີເຊເດີ (uniform) ປະເພດ [Texture2DArray]."

msgid ""
"This parameter allows to provide a collection of textures for the shader. You "
"can use [VisualShaderNodeTexture2DArray] to extract the textures from array."
msgstr ""
"ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະໜອງກຸ່ມຂອງເທັກເຈີໃຫ້ກັບເຊເດີ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ "
"[VisualShaderNodeTexture2DArray] ເພື່ອດຶງເທັກເຈີອອກຈາກອາເຣ."

msgid "Provides a 2D texture parameter within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ພາລາມິເຕີເທັກເຈີ 2D ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Translated to [code]uniform sampler2D[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]uniform sampler2D[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid "Performs a 3D texture lookup within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດການຄົ້ນຫາເທັກເຈີ 3D ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"A source texture. Used if [member VisualShaderNodeSample3D.source] is set to "
"[constant VisualShaderNodeSample3D.SOURCE_TEXTURE]."
msgstr ""
"ເທັກເຈີແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ. ໃຊ້ຖ້າ [member VisualShaderNodeSample3D.source] ຖືກກຳນົດເປັນ "
"[constant VisualShaderNodeSample3D.SOURCE_TEXTURE]."

msgid "Provides a 3D texture parameter within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ພາລາມິເຕີເທັກເຈີ 3D ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Translated to [code]uniform sampler3D[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]uniform sampler3D[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid "Performs a uniform texture lookup within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດການຄົ້ນຫາເທັກເຈີແບບ uniform ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Performs a lookup operation on the texture provided as a uniform for the "
"shader."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດການຄົ້ນຫາໃນເທັກເຈີທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນ uniform ສຳລັບເຊເດີ."

msgid "Sets the default color if no texture is assigned to the uniform."
msgstr "ກຳນົດສີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຖ້າບໍ່ມີເທັກເຈີຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ uniform."

msgid "Sets the texture filtering mode."
msgstr "ກຳນົດໂໝດການກອງ (filtering) ຂອງເທັກເຈີ."

msgid "Sets the texture repeating mode."
msgstr "ກຳນົດໂໝດການເຮັດຊ້ຳ (repeating) ຂອງເທັກເຈີ."

msgid ""
"Sets the texture source mode. Used for reading from the screen, depth, or "
"normal_roughness texture."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໂໝດແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເທັກເຈີ. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການອ່ານຈາກໜ້າຈໍ, depth, ຫຼື normal_roughness texture."

msgid ""
"Adds [code]hint_anisotropy[/code] as hint to the uniform declaration to use "
"for a flowmap."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ [code]hint_anisotropy[/code] ເປັນຄຳແນະນຳ (hint) ໃຫ້ກັບການປະກາດ uniform "
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບ flowmap."

msgid "Defaults to fully opaque white color."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນສີຂາວທີ່ທຶບແສງເຕັມສ່ວນ."

msgid "Defaults to fully opaque black color."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນສີດຳທີ່ທຶບແສງເຕັມສ່ວນ."

msgid "Defaults to fully transparent black color."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນສີດຳທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສເຕັມສ່ວນ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ColorDefault] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງ [enum ColorDefault] enum."

msgid ""
"Sample the texture using the filter determined by the node this shader is "
"attached to."
msgstr "ສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເທັກເຈີໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວທອງ (filter) ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍໂນດທີ່ເຊເດີນີ້ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່."

msgid ""
"The texture filter reads from the nearest pixel and blends between 2 mipmaps "
"(or uses the nearest mipmap if [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] is [code]true[/code]) based on the "
"angle between the surface and the camera view. This makes the texture look "
"pixelated from up close, and smooth from a distance. Anisotropic filtering "
"improves texture quality on surfaces that are almost in line with the camera, "
"but is slightly slower. The anisotropic filtering level can be changed by "
"adjusting [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"anisotropic_filtering_level].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This texture filter is rarely useful in 2D projects. [constant "
"FILTER_NEAREST_MIPMAP] is usually more appropriate in this case."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວທອງເທັກເຈີຈະອ່ານຈາກພິກເຊວທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ 2 mipmaps (ຫຼື ໃຊ້ mipmap ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດຖ້າ "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"use_nearest_mipmap_filter] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]) ໂດຍອີງຕາມມຸມລະຫວ່າງພື້ນຜິວ ແລະ "
"ມຸມມອງກ້ອງ. ອັນນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ເທັກເຈີເບິ່ງເປັນເມັດພິກເຊວເມື່ອເບິ່ງໃກ້ໆ ແລະ ເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກໄກ. "
"Anisotropic filtering ຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງຄຸນນະພາບເທັກເຈີເທິງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ເກືອບຈະຂະໜານກັບກ້ອງ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະຊ້າກວ່າເລັກນ້ອຍ. ລະດັບ anisotropic filtering ສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການປັບ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"anisotropic_filtering_level].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວທອງເທັກເຈີນີ້ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍມີປະໂຫຍດໃນໂປຣເຈັກ 2D. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ [constant "
"FILTER_NEAREST_MIPMAP] ຈະເໝາະສົມກວ່າໃນກໍລະນີນີ້."

msgid ""
"The texture filter blends between the nearest 4 pixels and blends between 2 "
"mipmaps (or uses the nearest mipmap if [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"textures/default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] is [code]true[/code]) "
"based on the angle between the surface and the camera view. This makes the "
"texture look smooth from up close, and smooth from a distance. Anisotropic "
"filtering improves texture quality on surfaces that are almost in line with "
"the camera, but is slightly slower. The anisotropic filtering level can be "
"changed by adjusting [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/anisotropic_filtering_level].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This texture filter is rarely useful in 2D projects. [constant "
"FILTER_LINEAR_MIPMAP] is usually more appropriate in this case."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວທອງເທັກເຈີຈະປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ 4 ພິກເຊວທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ 2 mipmaps (ຫຼື ໃຊ້ mipmap "
"ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດຖ້າ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"use_nearest_mipmap_filter] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]) ໂດຍອີງຕາມມຸມລະຫວ່າງພື້ນຜິວ ແລະ "
"ມຸມມອງກ້ອງ. ອັນນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ເທັກເຈີເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນທັງໃນໄລຍະໃກ້ ແລະ ໄກ. Anisotropic filtering "
"ຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງຄຸນນະພາບເທັກເຈີເທິງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ເກືອບຈະຂະໜານກັບກ້ອງ, ແຕ່ຈະຊ້າກວ່າເລັກນ້ອຍ. ລະດັບ "
"anisotropic filtering ສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການປັບ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"textures/default_filters/anisotropic_filtering_level].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວທອງເທັກເຈີນີ້ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍມີປະໂຫຍດໃນໂປຣເຈັກ 2D. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ [constant "
"FILTER_LINEAR_MIPMAP] ຈະເໝາະສົມກວ່າໃນກໍລະນີນີ້."

msgid ""
"Sample the texture using the repeat mode determined by the node this shader "
"is attached to."
msgstr "ສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເທັກເຈີໂດຍໃຊ້ໂໝດເຮັດຊ້ຳ (repeat mode) ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍໂນດທີ່ເຊເດີນີ້ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່."

msgid "Texture will repeat normally."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີຈະເຮັດຊ້ຳແບບປົກກະຕິ."

msgid "Texture will not repeat."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີຈະບໍ່ເຮັດຊ້ຳ."

msgid "The texture source is not specified in the shader."
msgstr "ບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເທັກເຈີໃນເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"The texture source is the screen texture which captures all opaque objects "
"drawn this frame."
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເທັກເຈີແມ່ນ screen texture ເຊິ່ງບັນທຶກວັດຖຸທຶບແສງທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມໃນເຟຣມນີ້."

msgid "The texture source is the depth texture from the depth prepass."
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເທັກເຈີແມ່ນ depth texture ຈາກ depth prepass."

msgid ""
"The texture source is the normal-roughness buffer from the depth prepass."
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເທັກເຈີແມ່ນ normal-roughness buffer ຈາກ depth prepass."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum TextureSource] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງ [enum TextureSource] enum."

msgid ""
"Performs a uniform texture lookup with triplanar within the visual shader "
"graph."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດການຄົ້ນຫາເທັກເຈີແບບ uniform ດ້ວຍ triplanar ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Performs a lookup operation on the texture provided as a uniform for the "
"shader, with support for triplanar mapping."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການຄົ້ນຫາໃນເທັກເຈີທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນ uniform ສຳລັບເຊເດີ, ໂດຍຮອງຮັບ triplanar mapping."

msgid ""
"Performs an SDF (signed-distance field) texture lookup within the visual "
"shader graph."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດການຄົ້ນຫາເທັກເຈີ SDF (signed-distance field) ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Translates to [code]texture_sdf(sdf_pos)[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]texture_sdf(sdf_pos)[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Performs an SDF (signed-distance field) normal texture lookup within the "
"visual shader graph."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດການຄົ້ນຫາເທັກເຈີ SDF normal ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Translates to [code]texture_sdf_normal(sdf_pos)[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]texture_sdf_normal(sdf_pos)[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Composes a [Transform3D] from four [Vector3]s within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Transform3D] ຈາກ [Vector3] ສີ່ຕົວພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Creates a 4×4 transform matrix using four vectors of type [code]vec3[/code]. "
"Each vector is one row in the matrix and the last column is a [code]vec4(0, "
"0, 0, 1)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງມາຕຣິດການແປຮູບ 4×4 ໂດຍໃຊ້ເວັກເຕີປະເພດ [code]vec3[/code] ສີ່ຕົວ. "
"ເວັກເຕີແຕ່ລະຕົວແມ່ນໜຶ່ງແຖວໃນມາຕຣິດ ແລະ ຖັນສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນ [code]vec4(0, 0, 0, 1)[/code]."

msgid "A [Transform3D] constant for use within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [Transform3D] ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "A constant [Transform3D], which can be used as an input node."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [Transform3D], ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນໂນດຂາເຂົ້າໄດ້."

msgid "A [Transform3D] constant which represents the state of this node."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [Transform3D] ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເຖິງສະຖານະຂອງໂນດນີ້."

msgid ""
"Decomposes a [Transform3D] into four [Vector3]s within the visual shader "
"graph."
msgstr "ແຍກ [Transform3D] ອອກເປັນ [Vector3] ສີ່ຕົວພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Takes a 4×4 transform matrix and decomposes it into four [code]vec3[/code] "
"values, one from each row of the matrix."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບມາຕຣິດການແປຮູບ 4×4 ແລະ ແຍກມັນອອກເປັນຄ່າ [code]vec3[/code] ສີ່ຄ່າ, "
"ໂດຍດຶງມາຈາກແຕ່ລະແຖວຂອງມາຕຣິດ."

msgid "Computes a [Transform3D] function within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄິດໄລ່ຟັງຊັນ [Transform3D] ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Computes an inverse or transpose function on the provided [Transform3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຄິດໄລ່ຟັງຊັນສ່ວນກັບ (inverse) ຫຼື ການສະລັບແຖວຖັນ (transpose) ໃນ [Transform3D] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "The function to be computed."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນທີ່ຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່."

msgid "Perform the inverse operation on the [Transform3D] matrix."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດການສ່ວນກັບ (inverse) ໃນມາຕຣິດ [Transform3D]."

msgid "Perform the transpose operation on the [Transform3D] matrix."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດການສະລັບແຖວຖັນ (transpose) ໃນມາຕຣິດ [Transform3D]."

msgid "A [Transform3D] operator to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຕົວດຳເນີນການ [Transform3D] ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Applies [member operator] to two transform (4×4 matrices) inputs."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ [member operator] ກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າການແປຮູບ (ມາຕຣິດ 4×4) ສອງຕົວ."

msgid "The type of the operation to be performed on the transforms."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂອງການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຈະເຮັດກັບການແປຮູບ."

msgid "Multiplies transform [code]a[/code] by the transform [code]b[/code]."
msgstr "ຄູນການແປຮູບ [code]a[/code] ດ້ວຍການແປຮູບ [code]b[/code]."

msgid "Multiplies transform [code]b[/code] by the transform [code]a[/code]."
msgstr "ຄູນການແປຮູບ [code]b[/code] ດ້ວຍການແປຮູບ [code]a[/code]."

msgid ""
"Performs a component-wise multiplication of transform [code]a[/code] by the "
"transform [code]b[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການຄູນແບບແຍກແຕ່ລະສ່ວນ (component-wise) ຂອງການແປຮູບ [code]a[/code] ດ້ວຍການແປຮູບ "
"[code]b[/code]."

msgid ""
"Performs a component-wise multiplication of transform [code]b[/code] by the "
"transform [code]a[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິບັດການຄູນແບບແຍກແຕ່ລະສ່ວນ (component-wise) ຂອງການແປຮູບ [code]b[/code] ດ້ວຍການແປຮູບ "
"[code]a[/code]."

msgid "Adds two transforms."
msgstr "ບວກສອງການແປຮູບເຂົ້າກັນ."

msgid ""
"Subtracts the transform [code]a[/code] from the transform [code]b[/code]."
msgstr "ລົບການແປຮູບ [code]a[/code] ອອກຈາກການແປຮູບ [code]b[/code]."

msgid ""
"Subtracts the transform [code]b[/code] from the transform [code]a[/code]."
msgstr "ລົບການແປຮູບ [code]b[/code] ອອກຈາກການແປຮູບ [code]a[/code]."

msgid "Divides the transform [code]a[/code] by the transform [code]b[/code]."
msgstr "ຫານການແປຮູບ [code]a[/code] ດ້ວຍການແປຮູບ [code]b[/code]."

msgid "Divides the transform [code]b[/code] by the transform [code]a[/code]."
msgstr "ຫານການແປຮູບ [code]b[/code] ດ້ວຍການແປຮູບ [code]a[/code]."

msgid "A [Transform3D] parameter for use within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີ [Transform3D] ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Translated to [code]uniform mat4[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]uniform mat4[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Multiplies a [Transform3D] and a [Vector3] within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄູນ [Transform3D] ແລະ [Vector3] ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"A multiplication operation on a transform (4×4 matrix) and a vector, with "
"support for different multiplication operators."
msgstr ""
"ການດຳເນີນການຄູນລະຫວ່າງການແປຮູບ (ມາຕຣິດ 4×4) ແລະ ເວັກເຕີ, "
"ໂດຍຮອງຮັບຕົວດຳເນີນການຄູນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

msgid "The multiplication type to be performed."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂອງການຄູນທີ່ຈະປະຕິບັດ."

msgid "Multiplies transform [code]a[/code] by the vector [code]b[/code]."
msgstr "ຄູນການແປຮູບ [code]a[/code] ດ້ວຍເວັກເຕີ [code]b[/code]."

msgid "Multiplies vector [code]b[/code] by the transform [code]a[/code]."
msgstr "ຄູນເວັກເຕີ [code]b[/code] ດ້ວຍການແປຮູບ [code]a[/code]."

msgid ""
"Multiplies transform [code]a[/code] by the vector [code]b[/code], skipping "
"the last row and column of the transform."
msgstr ""
"ຄູນການແປຮູບ [code]a[/code] ດ້ວຍເວັກເຕີ [code]b[/code], ໂດຍຂ້າມແຖວ ແລະ "
"ຖັນສຸດທ້າຍຂອງການແປຮູບ."

msgid ""
"Multiplies vector [code]b[/code] by the transform [code]a[/code], skipping "
"the last row and column of the transform."
msgstr ""
"ຄູນເວັກເຕີ [code]b[/code] ດ້ວຍການແປຮູບ [code]a[/code], ໂດຍຂ້າມແຖວ ແລະ "
"ຖັນສຸດທ້າຍຂອງການແປຮູບ."

msgid ""
"An unsigned scalar integer constant to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເລກຖ້ວນສະກາລາແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ (unsigned integer) ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Translated to [code]uint[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]uint[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid "An unsigned integer constant which represents a state of this node."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເລກຖ້ວນແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເຖິງສະຖານະຂອງໂນດນີ້."

msgid ""
"An unsigned scalar integer function to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນເລກຖ້ວນສະກາລາແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Accept an unsigned integer scalar ([code]x[/code]) to the input port and "
"transform it according to [member function]."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບຄ່າສະກາລາເລກຖ້ວນແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ([code]x[/code]) ເຂົ້າທາງພອດຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ແປງມັນຕາມ "
"[member function]."

msgid ""
"An unsigned integer scalar operator to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຕົວດຳເນີນການເລກຖ້ວນສະກາລາແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Applies [member operator] to two unsigned integer inputs: [code]a[/code] and "
"[code]b[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ [member operator] ກັບຂໍ້ມູນເລກຖ້ວນແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍສອງຕົວ: [code]a[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]b[/code]."

msgid ""
"A visual shader node for shader parameter (uniform) of type unsigned [int]."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີສຳລັບພາລາມິເຕີເຊເດີ (uniform) ປະເພດເລກຖ້ວນແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ [int]."

msgid ""
"A [VisualShaderNodeParameter] of type unsigned [int]. Offers additional "
"customization for range of accepted values."
msgstr ""
"[VisualShaderNodeParameter] ປະເພດເລກຖ້ວນແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ [int]. "
"ມີການປັບແຕ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບຊ່ວງຂອງຄ່າທີ່ຍອມຮັບ."

msgid ""
"Contains functions to modify texture coordinates ([code]uv[/code]) to be used "
"within the visual shader graph."
msgstr ""
"ປະກອບດ້ວຍຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂພິກັດເທັກເຈີ ([code]uv[/code]) ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"UV functions are similar to [Vector2] functions, but the input port of this "
"node uses the shader's UV value by default."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນ UV ຈະຄ້າຍຄືກັບຟັງຊັນ [Vector2], ແຕ່ພອດຂາເຂົ້າຂອງໂນດນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າ UV ຂອງເຊເດີໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "A function to be applied to the texture coordinates."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ກັບພິກັດເທັກເຈີ."

msgid ""
"Translates [code]uv[/code] by using [code]scale[/code] and [code]offset[/"
"code] values using the following formula: [code]uv = uv + offset * scale[/"
"code]. [code]uv[/code] port is connected to [code]UV[/code] built-in by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"ຍ້າຍຕຳແໜ່ງ (Translate) [code]uv[/code] ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າ [code]scale[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]offset[/code] ຕາມສູດດັ່ງນີ້: [code]uv = uv + offset * scale[/code]. ພອດ "
"[code]uv[/code] ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຄ່າ built-in [code]UV[/code] ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Scales [code]uv[/code] by using [code]scale[/code] and [code]pivot[/code] "
"values using the following formula: [code]uv = (uv - pivot) * scale + pivot[/"
"code]. [code]uv[/code] port is connected to [code]UV[/code] built-in by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຂະໜາດ (Scale) [code]uv[/code] ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າ [code]scale[/code] ແລະ [code]pivot[/"
"code] ຕາມສູດດັ່ງນີ້: [code]uv = (uv - pivot) * scale + pivot[/code]. ພອດ [code]uv[/"
"code] ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຄ່າ built-in [code]UV[/code] ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"A visual shader node that modifies the texture UV using polar coordinates."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ແກ້ໄຂຄ່າ UV ຂອງເທັກເຈີໂດຍໃຊ້ພິກັດຂົ້ວໂລກ (polar coordinates)."

msgid ""
"UV polar coord node will transform UV values into polar coordinates, with "
"specified scale, zoom strength and repeat parameters. It can be used to "
"create various swirl distortions."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ UV polar coord ຈະປ່ຽນຄ່າ UV ໃຫ້ເປັນພິກັດຂົ້ວໂລກ, ດ້ວຍພາລາມິເຕີ scale, zoom strength "
"ແລະ repeat ທີ່ລະບຸ. ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງການບິດເບືອນແບບວົງວຽນ (swirl distortions) ຕ່າງໆ."

msgid "A visual shader node that represents a \"varying\" shader value."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງຄ່າ \"varying\" ຂອງເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Varying values are shader variables that can be passed between shader "
"functions, e.g. from Vertex shader to Fragment shader."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ Varying ແມ່ນຕົວປ່ຽນໃນເຊເດີທີ່ສາມາດສົ່ງຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆຂອງເຊເດີໄດ້, ເຊັ່ນ: ຈາກ Vertex "
"shader ໄປຫາ Fragment shader."

msgid "Name of the variable. Must be unique."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນ. ຕ້ອງບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ."

msgid "Type of the variable. Determines where the variable can be accessed."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນ. ກຳນົດວ່າຕົວປ່ຽນນັ້ນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກໃສ."

msgid "A visual shader node that gets a value of a varying."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ດຶງຄ່າຂອງ varying ມາໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Outputs a value of a varying defined in the shader. You need to first create "
"a varying that can be used in the given function, e.g. varying getter in "
"Fragment shader requires a varying with mode set to [constant "
"VisualShader.VARYING_MODE_VERTEX_TO_FRAG_LIGHT]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂອງ varying ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນເຊເດີ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງ varying ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນຟັງຊັນນັ້ນໄດ້ກ່ອນ, "
"ເຊັ່ນ: varying getter ໃນ Fragment shader ຕ້ອງການ varying ທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງໂໝດເປັນ [constant "
"VisualShader.VARYING_MODE_VERTEX_TO_FRAG_LIGHT]."

msgid "A visual shader node that sets a value of a varying."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບ varying."

msgid ""
"Inputs a value to a varying defined in the shader. You need to first create a "
"varying that can be used in the given function, e.g. varying setter in "
"Fragment shader requires a varying with mode set to [constant "
"VisualShader.VARYING_MODE_FRAG_TO_LIGHT]."
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອນຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບ varying ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນເຊເດີ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງ varying ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນຟັງຊັນນັ້ນໄດ້ກ່ອນ, "
"ເຊັ່ນ: varying setter ໃນ Fragment shader ຕ້ອງການ varying ທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງໂໝດເປັນ [constant "
"VisualShader.VARYING_MODE_FRAG_TO_LIGHT]."

msgid "A [Vector2] constant to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [Vector2] ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "A constant [Vector2], which can be used as an input node."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [Vector2], ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນໂນດຂາເຂົ້າໄດ້."

msgid "A [Vector2] constant which represents the state of this node."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [Vector2] ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເຖິງສະຖານະຂອງໂນດນີ້."

msgid "A [Vector2] parameter to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີ [Vector2] ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Translated to [code]uniform vec2[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]uniform vec2[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid "A [Vector3] constant to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [Vector3] ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "A constant [Vector3], which can be used as an input node."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [Vector3], ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນໂນດຂາເຂົ້າໄດ້."

msgid "A [Vector3] constant which represents the state of this node."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [Vector3] ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເຖິງສະຖານະຂອງໂນດນີ້."

msgid "A [Vector3] parameter to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີ [Vector3] ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Translated to [code]uniform vec3[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]uniform vec3[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid "A 4D vector constant to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເວັກເຕີ 4D ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "A constant 4D vector, which can be used as an input node."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເວັກເຕີ 4D, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນໂນດຂາເຂົ້າໄດ້."

msgid ""
"A 4D vector (represented as a [Quaternion]) constant which represents the "
"state of this node."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເວັກເຕີ 4D (ສະແດງຜົນເປັນ [Quaternion]) ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເຖິງສະຖານະຂອງໂນດນີ້."

msgid "A 4D vector parameter to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີເວັກເຕີ 4D ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"A base type for the nodes that perform vector operations within the visual "
"shader graph."
msgstr "ປະເພດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບໂນດທີ່ປະຕິບັດການກັບເວັກເຕີພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"This is an abstract class. See the derived types for descriptions of the "
"possible operations."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄລາສນາມມະທຳ (abstract class). "
"ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຄລາສທີ່ສືບທອດສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດຂອງການດຳເນີນການທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້."

msgid "A vector type that this operation is performed on."
msgstr "ປະເພດເວັກເຕີທີ່ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ຖືກປະຕິບັດ."

msgid ""
"Composes a [Vector2], [Vector3] or 4D vector (represented as a [Quaternion]) "
"from scalars within the visual shader graph."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Vector2], [Vector3] ຫຼື ເວັກເຕີ 4D (ສະແດງຜົນເປັນ [Quaternion]) "
"ຈາກຄ່າສະກາລາພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Creates a [code]vec2[/code], [code]vec3[/code] or [code]vec4[/code] using "
"scalar values that can be provided from separate inputs."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [code]vec2[/code], [code]vec3[/code] ຫຼື [code]vec4[/code] "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າສະກາລາທີ່ສາມາດຮັບມາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າທີ່ແຍກກັນ."

msgid ""
"Decomposes a [Vector2], [Vector3] or 4D vector (represented as a "
"[Quaternion]) into scalars within the visual shader graph."
msgstr ""
"ແຍກ [Vector2], [Vector3] ຫຼື ເວັກເຕີ 4D (ສະແດງຜົນເປັນ [Quaternion]) "
"ອອກເປັນຄ່າສະກາລາພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Takes a [code]vec2[/code], [code]vec3[/code] or [code]vec4[/code] and "
"decomposes it into scalar values that can be used as separate outputs."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບຄ່າ [code]vec2[/code], [code]vec3[/code] ຫຼື [code]vec4[/code] ແລະ "
"ແຍກມັນອອກເປັນຄ່າສະກາລາທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຜົນອອກທີ່ແຍກກັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the distance between two points. To be used within the visual shader "
"graph."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງສອງຈຸດ. ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Calculates distance from point represented by vector [code]p0[/code] to "
"vector [code]p1[/code].\n"
"Translated to [code]distance(p0, p1)[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr ""
"ຄິດໄລ່ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກຈຸດທີ່ສະແດງໂດຍເວັກເຕີ [code]p0[/code] ຫາເວັກເຕີ [code]p1[/code].\n"
"ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]distance(p0, p1)[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid "A vector function to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນເວັກເຕີສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "A visual shader node able to perform different functions using vectors."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ສາມາດປະຕິບັດຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆໂດຍໃຊ້ເວັກເຕີ."

msgid "The function to be performed."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນທີ່ຈະປະຕິບັດ."

msgid ""
"Normalizes the vector so that it has a length of [code]1[/code] but points in "
"the same direction."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ເວັກເຕີເປັນຄ່າປົກກະຕິ (Normalize) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຍາວເທົ່າກັບ [code]1[/code] "
"ແຕ່ຍັງຊີ້ໄປໃນທິດທາງເດີມ."

msgid "Clamps the value between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr "ຈຳກັດຄ່າ (Clamp) ໃຫ້ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/code] ແລະ [code]1.0[/code]."

msgid "Returns the opposite value of the parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າກົງກັນຂ້າມຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid "Returns [code]1/vector[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]1/vector[/code]."

msgid "Returns the absolute value of the parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສຳບູນ (absolute value) ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid "Returns the arc-cosine of the parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ arc-cosine ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid "Returns the inverse hyperbolic cosine of the parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ inverse hyperbolic cosine ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid "Returns the arc-sine of the parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ arc-sine ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid "Returns the inverse hyperbolic sine of the parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ inverse hyperbolic sine ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid "Returns the arc-tangent of the parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ arc-tangent ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid "Returns the inverse hyperbolic tangent of the parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ inverse hyperbolic tangent ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid ""
"Finds the nearest integer that is greater than or equal to the parameter."
msgstr "ຊອກຫາຄ່າເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid "Returns the cosine of the parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ cosine ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid "Returns the hyperbolic cosine of the parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ hyperbolic cosine ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid "Converts a quantity in radians to degrees."
msgstr "ແປງຄ່າຈາກເຣດຽນ (radians) ເປັນອົງສາ (degrees)."

msgid "Base-e Exponential."
msgstr "ເລກກຳລັງຖານ e."

msgid "Base-2 Exponential."
msgstr "ເລກກຳລັງຖານ 2."

msgid "Finds the nearest integer less than or equal to the parameter."
msgstr "ຊອກຫາຄ່າເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid "Computes the fractional part of the argument."
msgstr "ຄິດໄລ່ສ່ວນເສດ (fractional part) ຂອງອາກິວເມນ."

msgid "Returns the inverse of the square root of the parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສ່ວນກັບຂອງຮາກຂັ້ນສອງ (inverse square root) ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid "Natural logarithm."
msgstr "ລໍກາຣິດທຳມະຊາດ (Natural logarithm)."

msgid "Base-2 logarithm."
msgstr "ລໍກາຣິດຖານ 2."

msgid "Converts a quantity in degrees to radians."
msgstr "ແປງຄ່າຈາກອົງສາ (degrees) ເປັນເຣດຽນ (radians)."

msgid "Finds the nearest integer to the parameter."
msgstr "ຊອກຫາຄ່າເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ໃກ້ພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "Finds the nearest even integer to the parameter."
msgstr "ຊອກຫາຄ່າເລກຄູ່ຖ້ວນທີ່ໃກ້ພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Extracts the sign of the parameter, i.e. returns [code]-1[/code] if the "
"parameter is negative, [code]1[/code] if it's positive and [code]0[/code] "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂອງພາລາມິເຕີອອກມາ, ເຊັ່ນ: ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]-1[/code] ຖ້າພາລາມິເຕີເປັນລົບ, [code]1[/"
"code] ຖ້າເປັນບວກ ແລະ [code]0[/code] ໃນກໍລະນີອື່ນ."

msgid "Returns the sine of the parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ sine ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid "Returns the hyperbolic sine of the parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ hyperbolic sine ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid "Returns the square root of the parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຮາກຂັ້ນສອງຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid "Returns the tangent of the parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ tangent ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid "Returns the hyperbolic tangent of the parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ hyperbolic tangent ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid ""
"Returns a value equal to the nearest integer to the parameter whose absolute "
"value is not larger than the absolute value of the parameter."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທີ່ເທົ່າກັບເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ໃກ້ພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ສຸດ ໂດຍທີ່ຄ່າສຳບູນຂອງມັນບໍ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຄ່າສຳບູນຂອງພາລາມິເຕີນັ້ນ."

msgid "Returns [code]1.0 - vector[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]1.0 - vector[/code]."

msgid "Returns the length of a [Vector3] within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມຍາວຂອງ [Vector3] ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid "Translated to [code]length(p0)[/code] in the shader language."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]length(p0)[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ."

msgid "A vector operator to be used within the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ຕົວດຳເນີນການເວັກເຕີສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"A visual shader node for use of vector operators. Operates on vector [code]a[/"
"code] and vector [code]b[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີສຳລັບໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການເວັກເຕີ. ດຳເນີນການກັບເວັກເຕີ [code]a[/code] ແລະ ເວັກເຕີ "
"[code]b[/code]."

msgid "The operator to be used."
msgstr "ຕົວດຳເນີນການທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

msgid "Adds two vectors."
msgstr "ບວກສອງເວັກເຕີເຂົ້າກັນ."

msgid "Subtracts a vector from a vector."
msgstr "ລົບເວັກເຕີອອກຈາກເວັກເຕີ."

msgid "Multiplies two vectors."
msgstr "ຄູນສອງເວັກເຕີເຂົ້າກັນ."

msgid "Divides vector by vector."
msgstr "ຫານເວັກເຕີດ້ວຍເວັກເຕີ."

msgid "Returns the remainder of the two vectors."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສ່ວນເສດ (remainder) ຂອງສອງເວັກເຕີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the value of the first parameter raised to the power of the second, "
"for each component of the vectors."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂອງພາລາມິເຕີທຳອິດຍົກກຳລັງດ້ວຍພາລາມິເຕີທີສອງ, ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບຂອງເວັກເຕີ."

msgid "Returns the greater of two values, for each component of the vectors."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າລະຫວ່າງສອງຄ່າ, ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບຂອງເວັກເຕີ."

msgid "Returns the lesser of two values, for each component of the vectors."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າລະຫວ່າງສອງຄ່າ, ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບຂອງເວັກເຕີ."

msgid "Calculates the cross product of two vectors."
msgstr "ຄິດໄລ່ຜົນຄູນໄຂວ່ (cross product) ຂອງສອງເວັກເຕີ."

msgid "Returns the arc-tangent of the parameters."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ arc-tangent ຂອງພາລາມິເຕີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the vector that points in the direction of reflection. [code]a[/code] "
"is incident vector and [code]b[/code] is the normal vector."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເວັກເຕີທີ່ຊີ້ໄປໃນທິດທາງຂອງການສະທ້ອນ. [code]a[/code] ແມ່ນເວັກເຕີຕົກກະທົບ ແລະ [code]b[/"
"code] ແມ່ນເວັກເຕີແນວສາກ (normal vector)."

msgid ""
"Vector step operator. Returns [code]0.0[/code] if [code]a[/code] is smaller "
"than [code]b[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວດຳເນີນການ step ຂອງເວັກເຕີ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]0.0[/code] ຖ້າ [code]a[/code] ນ້ອຍກວ່າ "
"[code]b[/code] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]1.0[/code] ໃນກໍລະນີອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the vector that points in the direction of refraction. For use within "
"the visual shader graph."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເວັກເຕີທີ່ຊີ້ໄປໃນທິດທາງຂອງການຫັກເຫ. ສຳລັບໃຊ້ພາຍໃນກຣາບວີຊົວເຊເດີ."

msgid ""
"Translated to [code]refract(I, N, eta)[/code] in the shader language, where "
"[code]I[/code] is the incident vector, [code]N[/code] is the normal vector "
"and [code]eta[/code] is the ratio of the indices of the refraction."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນເປັນ [code]refract(I, N, eta)[/code] ໃນພາສາເຊເດີ, ໂດຍທີ່ [code]I[/code] "
"ແມ່ນເວັກເຕີຕົກກະທົບ, [code]N[/code] ແມ່ນເວັກເຕີແນວສາກ ແລະ [code]eta[/code] "
"ແມ່ນອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງດັດສະນີການຫັກເຫ."

msgid ""
"A visual shader node that calculates the position of the pixel in world space "
"using the depth texture."
msgstr "ໂນດວີຊົວເຊເດີທີ່ຄິດໄລ່ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງພິກເຊວໃນ world space ໂດຍໃຊ້ depth texture."

msgid ""
"The WorldPositionFromDepth node reconstructs the depth position of the pixel "
"in world space. This can be used to obtain world space UVs for projection "
"mapping like Caustics."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ WorldPositionFromDepth ຈະສ້າງຕຳແໜ່ງຄວາມເລິກຂອງພິກເຊວຄືນໃໝ່ໃນ world space. "
"ອັນນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫາ world space UV ສຳລັບການເຮັດ projection mapping ເຊັ່ນ Caustics."

msgid "Real-time global illumination (GI) probe."
msgstr "ຕົວສຳຫຼວດແສງສະຫວ່າງທົ່ວໂລກ (GI probe) ແບບຣຽວທາມ (real-time)."

msgid ""
"[VoxelGI]s are used to provide high-quality real-time indirect light and "
"reflections to scenes. They precompute the effect of objects that emit light "
"and the effect of static geometry to simulate the behavior of complex light "
"in real-time. [VoxelGI]s need to be baked before having a visible effect. "
"However, once baked, dynamic objects will receive light from them. "
"Furthermore, lights can be fully dynamic or baked.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [VoxelGI] is only supported in the Forward+ rendering method, "
"not Mobile or Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Procedural generation:[/b] [VoxelGI] can be baked in an exported project, "
"which makes it suitable for procedurally generated or user-built levels as "
"long as all the geometry is generated in advance. For games where geometry is "
"generated at any time during gameplay, SDFGI is more suitable (see [member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled]).\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [VoxelGI] is relatively demanding on the GPU and is not "
"suited to low-end hardware such as integrated graphics (consider [LightmapGI] "
"instead). To improve performance, adjust [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"global_illumination/voxel_gi/quality] and enable [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/gi/use_half_resolution] in the "
"Project Settings. To provide a fallback for low-end hardware, consider adding "
"an option to disable [VoxelGI] in your project's options menus. A [VoxelGI] "
"node can be disabled by hiding it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Meshes should have sufficiently thick walls to avoid light leaks "
"(avoid one-sided walls). For interior levels, enclose your level geometry in "
"a sufficiently large box and bridge the loops to close the mesh. To further "
"prevent light leaks, you can also strategically place temporary "
"[MeshInstance3D] nodes with their [member GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] set to "
"[constant GeometryInstance3D.GI_MODE_STATIC]. These temporary nodes can then "
"be hidden after baking the [VoxelGI] node."
msgstr ""
"[VoxelGI] ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະໜອງແສງສະທ້ອນ (indirect light) ແລະ "
"ການສະທ້ອນທີ່ມີຄຸນນະພາບສູງແບບຣຽວທາມໃຫ້ກັບສາກ. ພວກມັນຈະຄິດໄລ່ຜົນກະທົບຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ປ່ອຍແສງ ແລະ "
"ຜົນກະທົບຂອງເລຂາຄະນິດຄົງທີ່ໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ເພື່ອຈຳລອງພຶດຕິກຳຂອງແສງທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນໃນແບບຣຽວທາມ. [VoxelGI] "
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຖືກ \"ອົບ\" (baked) ກ່ອນຈຶ່ງຈະສະແດງຜົນໃຫ້ເຫັນ. ແຕ່ເມື່ອອົບແລ້ວ, ວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວ "
"(dynamic objects) ຈະໄດ້ຮັບແສງຈາກພວກມັນ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ດວງໄຟຍັງສາມາດເປັນແບບ dynamic "
"ເຕັມຮູບແບບ ຫຼື ແບບ baked ກໍໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [VoxelGI] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນວິທີການເຣນເດີ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ "
"Mobile ຫຼື Compatibility.\n"
"[b]ການສ້າງແບບໂປຣຊີດໍຣັລ (Procedural generation):[/b] [VoxelGI] "
"ສາມາດອົບໄດ້ໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກແລ້ວ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເໝາະສົມສຳລັບດ່ານທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫຼື "
"ດ່ານທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ້າງເອງ ຕາບໃດທີ່ເລຂາຄະນິດທັງໝົດຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄວ້ກ່ອນ. "
"ສຳລັບເກມທີ່ເລຂາຄະນິດຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຕະຫຼອດເວລາໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນ, SDFGI ຈະເໝາະສົມກວ່າ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled]).\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] [VoxelGI] ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນ GPU ຂ້ອນຂ້າງຫຼາຍ ແລະ ບໍ່ເໝາະສົມກັບຮາດແວລະດັບຕ່ຳ "
"ເຊັ່ນ: ກຣາຟິກແບບອອນບອດ (ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາ [LightmapGI] ແທນ). ເພື່ອປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບ, ໃຫ້ປັບ "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/voxel_gi/quality] ແລະ "
"ເປີດໃຊ້ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/gi/"
"use_half_resolution] ໃນ Project Settings. ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບຮາດແວລະດັບຕ່ຳ, "
"ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກເພື່ອປິດ [VoxelGI] ໃນເມນູຕົວເລືອກຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ. ໂນດ [VoxelGI] "
"ສາມາດປິດການໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໂດຍການຊ່ອນມັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມຊ໌ຄວນມີຝາທີ່ໜາພໍສົມຄວນເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນແສງຮົ່ວ (ຫຼີກເວັ້ນຝາທີ່ມີດ້ານດຽວ). "
"ສຳລັບດ່ານພາຍໃນ, ໃຫ້ຫຸ້ມເລຂາຄະນິດຂອງດ່ານໄວ້ໃນກ່ອງທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ພໍ ແລະ "
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສ່ວນຕ່າງໆເພື່ອປິດເມຊ໌ໃຫ້ສະນິດ. ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນແສງຮົ່ວເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດວາງໂນດ "
"[MeshInstance3D] ຊົ່ວຄາວ ໂດຍຕັ້ງ [member GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] ເປັນ "
"[constant GeometryInstance3D.GI_MODE_STATIC]. "
"ໂນດຊົ່ວຄາວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດຊ່ອນໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກອົບໂນດ [VoxelGI] ແລ້ວ."

msgid "Using Voxel global illumination"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ Voxel global illumination"

msgid ""
"Bakes the effect from all [GeometryInstance3D]s marked with [constant "
"GeometryInstance3D.GI_MODE_STATIC] and [Light3D]s marked with either "
"[constant Light3D.BAKE_STATIC] or [constant Light3D.BAKE_DYNAMIC]. If [param "
"create_visual_debug] is [code]true[/code], after baking the light, this will "
"generate a [MultiMesh] that has a cube representing each solid cell with each "
"cube colored to the cell's albedo color. This can be used to visualize the "
"[VoxelGI]'s data and debug any issues that may be occurring.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method bake] works from the editor and in exported projects. "
"This makes it suitable for procedurally generated or user-built levels. "
"Baking a [VoxelGI] node generally takes from 5 to 20 seconds in most scenes. "
"Reducing [member subdiv] can speed up baking.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [GeometryInstance3D]s and [Light3D]s must be fully ready before "
"[method bake] is called. If you are procedurally creating those and some "
"meshes or lights are missing from your baked [VoxelGI], use "
"[code]call_deferred(\"bake\")[/code] instead of calling [method bake] "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດການ \"ອົບ\" (Bake) ຜົນກະທົບຈາກ [GeometryInstance3D] ທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກໝາຍເປັນ [constant "
"GeometryInstance3D.GI_MODE_STATIC] ແລະ [Light3D] ທີ່ຖືກໝາຍເປັນ [constant "
"Light3D.BAKE_STATIC] ຫຼື [constant Light3D.BAKE_DYNAMIC]. ຖ້າ [param "
"create_visual_debug] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຫຼັງຈາກອົບແສງແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະສ້າງ "
"[MultiMesh] ທີ່ມີຮູບກ້ອນກາກ (cube) ແທນແຕ່ລະເຊລ (cell) ທີ່ເປັນວັດຖຸແຂງ "
"ໂດຍແຕ່ລະກ້ອນຈະມີສີຕາມຄ່າ albedo ຂອງເຊລນັ້ນ. ອັນນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ [VoxelGI] ແລະ "
"ກວດສອບຫາຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method bake] ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ທັງຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor) ແລະ "
"ໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກແລ້ວ. ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເໝາະສົມສຳລັບດ່ານທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫຼື ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ້າງເອງ. "
"ການອົບໂນດ [VoxelGI] ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະໃຊ້ເວລາປະມານ 5 ຫາ 20 ວິນາທີໃນສາກສ່ວນໃຫຍ່. ການຫຼຸດຄ່າ "
"[member subdiv] ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການອົບໄວຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [GeometryInstance3D] ແລະ [Light3D] ຕ້ອງກຽມພ້ອມເຕັມທີ່ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method bake]. ຖ້າທ່ານສ້າງສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ມີບາງເມຊ໌ ຫຼື ດວງໄຟຫາຍໄປຈາກ "
"[VoxelGI] ທີ່ອົບແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [code]call_deferred(\"bake\")[/code] ແທນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method bake] ໂດຍກົງ."

msgid "Calls [method bake] with [code]create_visual_debug[/code] enabled."
msgstr "ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method bake] ໂດຍເປີດໃຊ້ [code]create_visual_debug[/code]."

msgid ""
"The [CameraAttributes] resource that specifies exposure levels to bake at. "
"Auto-exposure and non exposure properties will be ignored. Exposure settings "
"should be used to reduce the dynamic range present when baking. If exposure "
"is too high, the [VoxelGI] will have banding artifacts or may have over-"
"exposure artifacts."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [CameraAttributes] ທີ່ລະບຸລະດັບການຮັບແສງ (exposure) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ອົບ. ຄຸນສົມບັດ auto-"
"exposure ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດອື່ນໆທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວກັບ exposure ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ. ຄວນໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ exposure "
"ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກ (dynamic range) ໃນຂະນະທີ່ອົບ. ຖ້າ exposure ສູງເກີນໄປ, [VoxelGI] "
"ຈະເກີດສິ່ງປົນເປືອນແບບແຖບສີ (banding artifacts) ຫຼື ສິ່ງປົນເປືອນຈາກການຮັບແສງເກີນ (over-"
"exposure artifacts)."

msgid "The [VoxelGIData] resource that holds the data for this [VoxelGI]."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [VoxelGIData] ທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ [VoxelGI] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"The size of the area covered by the [VoxelGI]. This must be [code]1.0[/code] "
"or greater on each axis.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you make the size larger without increasing the number of "
"subdivisions with [member subdiv], the size of each cell will increase and "
"result in less detailed lighting."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຄອບຄຸມໂດຍ [VoxelGI]. ຄ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງເປັນ [code]1.0[/code] ຫຼື "
"ຫຼາຍກວ່າໃນແຕ່ລະແກນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານເພີ່ມຂະໜາດໃຫ້ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ເພີ່ມຈຳນວນການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍ (subdivisions) ດ້ວຍ "
"[member subdiv], ຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະເຊລຈະໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ແສງສະຫວ່າງມີລາຍລະອຽດໜ້ອຍລົງ."

msgid ""
"Number of times to subdivide the grid that the [VoxelGI] operates on. A "
"higher number results in finer detail and thus higher visual quality, while "
"lower numbers result in better performance."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ຈະແບ່ງຍ່ອຍຕາຕະລາງ (grid) ທີ່ [VoxelGI] ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. "
"ຕົວເລກທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ລະອຽດກວ່າ ແລະ ຄຸນນະພາບສາຍຕາທີ່ສູງກວ່າ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຕົວເລກທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ດີກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Use 64 subdivisions. This is the lowest quality setting, but the fastest. Use "
"it if you can, but especially use it on lower-end hardware."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍ 64 ສ່ວນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳສຸດ ແຕ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່ານີ້ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້, "
"ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນຮາດແວລະດັບຕ່ຳ."

msgid "Use 128 subdivisions. This is the default quality setting."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍ 128 ສ່ວນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນນະພາບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Use 256 subdivisions."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍ 256 ສ່ວນ."

msgid ""
"Use 512 subdivisions. This is the highest quality setting, but the slowest. "
"On lower-end hardware, this could cause the GPU to stall."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍ 512 ສ່ວນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນນະພາບສູງສຸດ ແຕ່ຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ. ໃນຮາດແວລະດັບຕ່ຳ, "
"ອັນນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ GPU ຄ້າງໄດ້."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Subdiv] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງ [enum Subdiv] enum."

msgid ""
"Contains baked voxel global illumination data for use in a [VoxelGI] node."
msgstr "ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນ voxel global illumination ທີ່ອົບແລ້ວ ສຳລັບໃຊ້ໃນໂນດ [VoxelGI]."

msgid ""
"[VoxelGIData] contains baked voxel global illumination for use in a [VoxelGI] "
"node. [VoxelGIData] also offers several properties to adjust the final "
"appearance of the global illumination. These properties can be adjusted at "
"run-time without having to bake the [VoxelGI] node again.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To prevent text-based scene files ([code].tscn[/code]) from "
"growing too much and becoming slow to load and save, always save "
"[VoxelGIData] to an external binary resource file ([code].res[/code]) instead "
"of embedding it within the scene. This can be done by clicking the dropdown "
"arrow next to the [VoxelGIData] resource, choosing [b]Edit[/b], clicking the "
"floppy disk icon at the top of the Inspector then choosing [b]Save As...[/b]."
msgstr ""
"[VoxelGIData] ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນ voxel global illumination ທີ່ອົບແລ້ວສຳລັບໃຊ້ໃນໂນດ "
"[VoxelGI]. [VoxelGIData] ຍັງມີຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼາຍຢ່າງເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຮູບລັກສະນະສຸດທ້າຍຂອງ global "
"illumination. ຄຸນສົມບັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກ (run-time) "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງອົບໂນດ [VoxelGI] ໃໝ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ສາກແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ ([code].tscn[/code]) ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ເກີນໄປ "
"ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ການໂຫຼດ ຫຼື ບັນທຶກຊ້າ, ໃຫ້ບັນທຶກ [VoxelGIData] ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນໄບນາຣີພາຍນອກ "
"([code].res[/code]) ແທນການຝັງມັນໄວ້ໃນສາກ. "
"ອັນນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກລູກສອນລົງຂ້າງຊັບພະຍາກອນ [VoxelGIData], ເລືອກ [b]Edit[/b], "
"ຄລິກໄອຄອນແຜ່ນດິດຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງ Inspector ແລ້ວເລືອກ [b]Save As...[/b]."

msgid ""
"Initializes this [VoxelGIData] with the specified data. [param octree_cells] "
"must be a multiple of 32. [param octree_cells] must be double the size of "
"[param data_cells]. The allocated data can be retrieved later using the "
"various getter methods."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [VoxelGIData] ນີ້ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະບຸ. [param octree_cells] ຕ້ອງເປັນຕົວຄູນຂອງ 32. "
"[param octree_cells] ຕ້ອງມີຂະໜາດເປັນສອງເທົ່າຂອງ [param data_cells]. "
"ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກຈັດສັນສາມາດດຶງມາໃຊ້ໄດ້ພາຍຫຼັງໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ getter ຕ່າງໆ."

msgid ""
"Returns the bounds of the baked voxel data as an [AABB], which should match "
"[member VoxelGI.size] after being baked (which only contains the size as a "
"[Vector3]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the size was modified without baking the VoxelGI data, then "
"the value of [method get_bounds] and [member VoxelGI.size] will not match."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂອບເຂດ (bounds) ຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ voxel ທີ່ອົບແລ້ວໃນຮູບແບບ [AABB], ເຊິ່ງຄວນຈະກົງກັບ [member "
"VoxelGI.size] ຫຼັງຈາກການອົບ (ເຊິ່ງເກັບພຽງແຕ່ຂະໜາດໃນຮູບແບບ [Vector3]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າຂະໜາດຖືກແກ້ໄຂໂດຍບໍ່ມີການອົບຂໍ້ມູນ VoxelGI ໃໝ່, ຄ່າຂອງ [method "
"get_bounds] ແລະ [member VoxelGI.size] ຈະບໍ່ກົງກັນ."

msgid "Returns the baked cell data for this [VoxelGIData]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນເຊລທີ່ອົບແລ້ວສຳລັບ [VoxelGIData] ນີ້."

msgid "Returns the baked level counts for this [VoxelGIData]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນລະດັບທີ່ອົບແລ້ວສຳລັບ [VoxelGIData] ນີ້."

msgid "Returns the baked octree cell data for this [VoxelGIData]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນເຊລ octree ທີ່ອົບແລ້ວສຳລັບ [VoxelGIData] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the baked octree size for this [VoxelGIData], which corresponds to "
"the number of subdivisions per axis. This can be viewed in the editor by "
"hovering the [b]Bake VoxelGI[/b] button at the top of the 3D editor viewport "
"when a [VoxelGI] node is selected and looking at the [b]Subdivisions[/b] "
"field in the tooltip."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດ octree ທີ່ອົບແລ້ວສຳລັບ [VoxelGIData] ນີ້, ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບຈຳນວນການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍຕໍ່ແກນ. "
"ສາມາດເບິ່ງຄ່ານີ້ໄດ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂໂດຍການເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປວາງໄວ້ເທິງປຸ່ມ [b]Bake VoxelGI[/b] "
"ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງວິວພອດ 3D ເມື່ອເລືອກໂນດ [VoxelGI] ແລະ ເບິ່ງທີ່ຊ່ອງ [b]Subdivisions[/b] ໃນ "
"tooltip."

msgid "Returns the baked cell transform for this [VoxelGIData]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນການແປຮູບ (transform) ຂອງເຊລທີ່ອົບແລ້ວສຳລັບ [VoxelGIData] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"The normal bias to use for indirect lighting and reflections. Higher values "
"reduce self-reflections visible in non-rough materials, at the cost of more "
"visible light leaking and flatter-looking indirect lighting. To prioritize "
"hiding self-reflections over lighting quality, set [member bias] to "
"[code]0.0[/code] and [member normal_bias] to a value between [code]1.0[/code] "
"and [code]2.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ normal bias ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບແສງສະທ້ອນ ແລະ ການສະທ້ອນ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະຫຼຸດການສະທ້ອນຕົວເອງທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ໃນວັດສະດຸທີ່ບໍ່ຂຸຂະ, ແຕ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນແສງຮົ່ວຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ແສງສະທ້ອນຈະເບິ່ງແບນລົງ. ເພື່ອເນັ້ນການຊ່ອນການສະທ້ອນຕົວເອງຫຼາຍກວ່າຄຸນນະພາບແສງ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [member "
"bias] ເປັນ [code]0.0[/code] ແລະ [member normal_bias] ເປັນຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ [code]1.0[/"
"code] ຫາ [code]2.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"The dynamic range to use ([code]1.0[/code] represents a low dynamic range "
"scene brightness). Higher values can be used to provide brighter indirect "
"lighting, at the cost of more visible color banding in dark areas (both in "
"indirect lighting and reflections). To avoid color banding, it's recommended "
"to use the lowest value that does not result in visible light clipping."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກ (dynamic range) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ ([code]1.0[/code] "
"ສະແດງເຖິງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງສາກໃນຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກຕ່ຳ). "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແສງສະທ້ອນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງກວ່າ, ແຕ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນແຖບສີ (color banding) "
"ໃນບ່ອນມືດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ (ທັງໃນແສງສະທ້ອນ ແລະ ການສະທ້ອນ). ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນແຖບສີ, "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຕັດແສງ (light clipping) ທີ່ສັງເກດເຫັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The energy of the indirect lighting and reflections produced by the [VoxelGI] "
"node. Higher values result in brighter indirect lighting. If indirect "
"lighting looks too flat, try decreasing [member propagation] while increasing "
"[member energy] at the same time. See also [member use_two_bounces] which "
"influences the indirect lighting's effective brightness."
msgstr ""
"ພະລັງງານຂອງແສງສະທ້ອນ ແລະ ການສະທ້ອນທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍໂນດ [VoxelGI]. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງສະທ້ອນສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ. ຖ້າແສງສະທ້ອນເບິ່ງແບນເກີນໄປ, ໃຫ້ລອງຫຼຸດ [member "
"propagation] ພ້ອມກັບເພີ່ມ [member energy]. ເບິ່ງ [member use_two_bounces] ຕື່ມອີກ "
"ເຊິ່ງມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບຂອງແສງສະທ້ອນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [Environment] lighting is ignored by the [VoxelGI] "
"node. If [code]false[/code], [Environment] lighting is taken into account by "
"the [VoxelGI] node. [Environment] lighting updates in real-time, which means "
"it can be changed without having to bake the [VoxelGI] node again."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແສງຈາກ [Environment] ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍໂດຍໂນດ [VoxelGI]. "
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ແສງຈາກ [Environment] ຈະຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍໂນດ [VoxelGI]. "
"ແສງ [Environment] ຈະອັບເດດແບບຣຽວທາມ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງອົບໂນດ "
"[VoxelGI] ໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"The normal bias to use for indirect lighting and reflections. Higher values "
"reduce self-reflections visible in non-rough materials, at the cost of more "
"visible light leaking and flatter-looking indirect lighting. See also [member "
"bias]. To prioritize hiding self-reflections over lighting quality, set "
"[member bias] to [code]0.0[/code] and [member normal_bias] to a value between "
"[code]1.0[/code] and [code]2.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ normal bias ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບແສງສະທ້ອນ ແລະ ການສະທ້ອນ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະຫຼຸດການສະທ້ອນຕົວເອງທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ໃນວັດສະດຸທີ່ບໍ່ຂຸຂະ, ແຕ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນແສງຮົ່ວຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ແສງສະທ້ອນຈະເບິ່ງແບນລົງ. ເບິ່ງ [member bias] ຕື່ມ. "
"ເພື່ອເນັ້ນການຊ່ອນການສະທ້ອນຕົວເອງຫຼາຍກວ່າຄຸນນະພາບແສງ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [member bias] ເປັນ [code]0.0[/"
"code] ແລະ [member normal_bias] ເປັນຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ [code]1.0[/code] ຫາ [code]2.0[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"The multiplier to use when light bounces off a surface. Higher values result "
"in brighter indirect lighting. If indirect lighting looks too flat, try "
"decreasing [member propagation] while increasing [member energy] at the same "
"time. See also [member use_two_bounces] which influences the indirect "
"lighting's effective brightness."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອແສງສະທ້ອນອອກຈາກພື້ນຜິວ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງສະທ້ອນສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຖ້າແສງສະທ້ອນເບິ່ງແບນເກີນໄປ, ໃຫ້ລອງຫຼຸດ [member propagation] ພ້ອມກັບເພີ່ມ [member energy]. "
"ເບິ່ງ [member use_two_bounces] ຕື່ມອີກ ເຊິ່ງມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບຂອງແສງສະທ້ອນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], performs two bounces of indirect lighting instead of "
"one. This makes indirect lighting look more natural and brighter at a small "
"performance cost. The second bounce is also visible in reflections. If the "
"scene appears too bright after enabling [member use_two_bounces], adjust "
"[member propagation] and [member energy]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີການສະທ້ອນຂອງແສງສອງຄັ້ງແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຄັ້ງດຽວ. "
"ອັນນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງສະທ້ອນເບິ່ງເປັນທຳມະຊາດ ແລະ ສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ ໂດຍມີຜົນຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບພຽງເລັກນ້ອຍ. "
"ການສະທ້ອນຄັ້ງທີສອງຍັງຈະເຫັນໄດ້ໃນການສະທ້ອນຂອງວັດຖຸອີກດ້ວຍ. ຖ້າສາກເບິ່ງສະຫວ່າງເກີນໄປຫຼັງຈາກເປີດໃຊ້ "
"[member use_two_bounces], ໃຫ້ປັບຄ່າ [member propagation] ແລະ [member energy]."

msgid "A vertical scrollbar that goes from top (min) to bottom (max)."
msgstr "ແຖບເລື່ອນແນວຕັ້ງ ທີ່ເລື່ອນຈາກເທິງ (ຕ່ຳສຸດ) ໄປຫາ ລຸ່ມ (ສູງສຸດ)."

msgid ""
"A vertical scrollbar, typically used to navigate through content that extends "
"beyond the visible height of a control. It is a [Range]-based control and "
"goes from top (min) to bottom (max). Note that this direction is the opposite "
"of [VSlider]'s."
msgstr ""
"ແຖບເລື່ອນແນວຕັ້ງ, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລື່ອນເບິ່ງເນື້ອຫາທີ່ຍາວເກີນຄວາມສູງທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມ. "
"ມັນເປັນຕົວຄວບຄຸມແບບ [Range] ແລະ ເລື່ອນຈາກເທິງ (ຕ່ຳສຸດ) ໄປຫາ ລຸ່ມ (ສູງສຸດ). "
"ໃຫ້ສັງເກດວ່າທິດທາງນີ້ຈະກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ [VSlider]."

msgid ""
"Padding between the left of the [theme_item ScrollBar.scroll] element and the "
"[theme_item ScrollBar.grabber].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To apply vertical padding, modify the top/bottom content margins "
"of [theme_item ScrollBar.scroll] instead."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (Padding) ລະຫວ່າງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງອົງປະກອບ [theme_item ScrollBar.scroll] ແລະ "
"[theme_item ScrollBar.grabber].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວຕັ້ງ, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂຂອບເນື້ອຫາ (content margins) ເທິງ/ລຸ່ມ "
"ຂອງ [theme_item ScrollBar.scroll] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Padding between the right of the [theme_item ScrollBar.scroll] element and "
"the [theme_item ScrollBar.grabber].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To apply vertical padding, modify the top/bottom content margins "
"of [theme_item ScrollBar.scroll] instead."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (Padding) ລະຫວ່າງເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງອົງປະກອບ [theme_item ScrollBar.scroll] ແລະ "
"[theme_item ScrollBar.grabber].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວຕັ້ງ, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂຂອບເນື້ອຫາ (content margins) ເທິງ/ລຸ່ມ "
"ຂອງ [theme_item ScrollBar.scroll] ແທນ."

msgid "A vertical line used for separating other controls."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນແນວຕັ້ງທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແຍກຕົວຄວບຄຸມອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"A vertical separator used for separating other controls that are arranged "
"[b]horizontally[/b]. [VSeparator] is purely visual and normally drawn as a "
"[StyleBoxLine]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແຍກແນວຕັ້ງທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແຍກຕົວຄວບຄຸມອື່ນໆທີ່ຈັດລຽງກັນໃນ [b]ແນວນອນ[/b]. [VSeparator] "
"ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອຜົນທາງສາຍຕາເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຖືກແຕ້ມເປັນ [StyleBoxLine]."

msgid "A vertical slider that goes from bottom (min) to top (max)."
msgstr "ແຖບປັບຄ່າ (slider) ແນວຕັ້ງ ທີ່ປັບຈາກລຸ່ມ (ຕ່ຳສຸດ) ໄປຫາ ເທິງ (ສູງສຸດ)."

msgid ""
"A vertical slider, used to adjust a value by moving a grabber along a "
"vertical axis. It is a [Range]-based control and goes from bottom (min) to "
"top (max). Note that this direction is the opposite of [VScrollBar]'s."
msgstr ""
"ແຖບປັບຄ່າແນວຕັ້ງ, ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບຄ່າໂດຍການເລື່ອນປຸ່ມຈັບຕາມແກນຕັ້ງ. ມັນເປັນຕົວຄວບຄຸມແບບ [Range] ແລະ "
"ປັບຈາກລຸ່ມ (ຕ່ຳສຸດ) ໄປຫາ ເທິງ (ສູງສຸດ). ໃຫ້ສັງເກດວ່າທິດທາງນີ້ຈະກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ [VScrollBar]."

msgid ""
"A container that splits two child controls vertically and provides a grabber "
"for adjusting the split ratio."
msgstr ""
"ຄອນເທນເນີ (container) ທີ່ແຍກຕົວຄວບຄຸມລູກສອງຕົວໃນແນວຕັ້ງ ແລະ ມີປຸ່ມຈັບສຳລັບປັບອັດຕາສ່ວນການແຍກ."

msgid ""
"A container that accepts only two child controls, then arranges them "
"vertically and creates a divisor between them. The divisor can be dragged "
"around to change the size relation between the child controls."
msgstr ""
"ຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ຍອມຮັບຕົວຄວບຄຸມລູກໄດ້ພຽງສອງຕົວ, ຈາກນັ້ນຈະຈັດລຽງພວກມັນໃນແນວຕັ້ງ ແລະ "
"ສ້າງເສັ້ນແບ່ງລະຫວ່າງພວກມັນ. ເສັ້ນແບ່ງນີ້ສາມາດລາກໄປມາເພື່ອປ່ຽນອັດຕາສ່ວນຂະໜາດລະຫວ່າງຕົວຄວບຄຸມລູກໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Holds an [Object]. If the object is [RefCounted], it doesn't update the "
"reference count."
msgstr ""
"ເກັບຮັກສາ [Object] ໄວ້. ຖ້າວັດຖຸນັ້ນເປັນແບບ [RefCounted], ມັນຈະບໍ່ອັບເດດຈຳນວນການອ້າງອີງ "
"(reference count)."

msgid ""
"A weakref can hold a [RefCounted] without contributing to the reference "
"counter. A weakref can be created from an [Object] using [method "
"@GlobalScope.weakref]. If this object is not a reference, weakref still "
"works, however, it does not have any effect on the object. Weakrefs are "
"useful in cases where multiple classes have variables that refer to each "
"other. Without weakrefs, using these classes could lead to memory leaks, "
"since both references keep each other from being released. Making part of the "
"variables a weakref can prevent this cyclic dependency, and allows the "
"references to be released."
msgstr ""
"weakref ສາມາດເກັບ [RefCounted] ໄວ້ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ໄປເພີ່ມຈຳນວນໃນຕົວນັບການອ້າງອີງ. weakref "
"ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ຈາກ [Object] ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method @GlobalScope.weakref]. "
"ຖ້າວັດຖຸນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນການອ້າງອີງ, weakref ກໍຍັງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆຕໍ່ວັດຖຸນັ້ນ. weakref "
"ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີຫຼາຍຄລາສມີຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ອ້າງອີງຫາຊຶ່ງກັນແລະກັນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ weakref, "
"ການໃຊ້ຄລາສເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຈຳຮົ່ວ (memory leaks) ໄດ້ "
"ເພາະການອ້າງອີງທັງສອງດ້ານຈະຢຶດກັນໄວ້ບໍ່ໃຫ້ຖືກປ່ອຍ. ການເຮັດໃຫ້ຕົວປ່ຽນບາງສ່ວນເປັນ weakref "
"ສາມາດປ້ອງກັນການອ້າງອີງເປັນວົງຈອນ (cyclic dependency) ນີ້ໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການອ້າງອີງຖືກປ່ອຍອອກໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Object] this weakref is referring to. Returns [code]null[/code] "
"if that object no longer exists."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Object] ທີ່ weakref ນີ້ກຳລັງອ້າງອີງເຖິງ. ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] ຖ້າວັດຖຸນັ້ນບໍ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid "Closes this data channel, notifying the other peer."
msgstr "ປິດຊ່ອງທາງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ ແລະ ແຈ້ງເຕືອນເຄື່ອງຮ່ວມຂ່າຍ (peer) ອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of bytes currently queued to be sent over this channel."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ (bytes) ທີ່ກຳລັງລໍຖ້າຄິວເພື່ອສົ່ງຜ່ານຊ່ອງທາງນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the ID assigned to this channel during creation (or auto-assigned "
"during negotiation).\n"
"If the channel is not negotiated out-of-band the ID will only be available "
"after the connection is established (will return [code]65535[/code] until "
"then)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງ (ຫຼື "
"ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຈລະຈາ).\n"
"ຖ້າຊ່ອງທາງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເຈລະຈາແບບ out-of-band, ID ຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແລ້ວ "
"(ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]65535[/code] ຈົນກວ່າຈະຮອດເວລານັ້ນ)."

msgid "Returns the label assigned to this channel during creation."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນປ້າຍຊື່ (label) ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [code]maxPacketLifeTime[/code] value assigned to this channel "
"during creation.\n"
"Will be [code]65535[/code] if not specified."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [code]maxPacketLifeTime[/code] ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງ.\n"
"ຈະເປັນ [code]65535[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the [code]maxRetransmits[/code] value assigned to this channel during "
"creation.\n"
"Will be [code]65535[/code] if not specified."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [code]maxRetransmits[/code] ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງ.\n"
"ຈະເປັນ [code]65535[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the sub-protocol assigned to this channel during creation. An empty "
"string if not specified."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໂປຣໂຕຄໍຍ່ອຍ (sub-protocol) ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງ. "
"ຈະເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງເປົ່າຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid "Returns the current state of this channel."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງຊ່ອງທາງນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this channel was created with out-of-band "
"configuration."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບ out-of-band."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this channel was created with ordering enabled "
"(default)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍເປີດໃຊ້ການຈັດລຽງລຳດັບ (ordering) "
"(ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

msgid "Reserved, but not used for now."
msgstr "ຖືກຈອງໄວ້, ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ນຳໃຊ້ໃນຕອນນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the last received packet was transferred as "
"text. See [member write_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າແພັກເກັດ (packet) ລ່າສຸດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຖືກສົ່ງມາໃນຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[member write_mode]."

msgid ""
"The transfer mode to use when sending outgoing packet. Either text or binary."
msgstr "ໂໝດການສົ່ງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອສົ່ງແພັກເກັດອອກ. ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ ຫຼື ໄບນາຣີ."

msgid ""
"Tells the channel to send data over this channel as text. An external peer "
"(non-Godot) would receive this as a string."
msgstr ""
"ບອກໃຫ້ຊ່ອງທາງສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຜ່ານຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ໃນຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ເຄື່ອງຮ່ວມຂ່າຍພາຍນອກ (ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ Godot) "
"ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ (string)."

msgid ""
"Tells the channel to send data over this channel as binary. An external peer "
"(non-Godot) would receive this as array buffer or blob."
msgstr ""
"ບອກໃຫ້ຊ່ອງທາງສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຜ່ານຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ໃນຮູບແບບໄບນາຣີ. ເຄື່ອງຮ່ວມຂ່າຍພາຍນອກ (ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ Godot) "
"ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ເປັນ array buffer ຫຼື blob."

msgid "The channel was created, but it's still trying to connect."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ກຳນົດກຳລັງພະຍາຍາມເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid "The channel is currently open, and data can flow over it."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງເປີດຢູ່, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນສາມາດຮັບສົ່ງຜ່ານມັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The channel is being closed, no new messages will be accepted, but those "
"already in queue will be flushed."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງກຳລັງຖືກປິດ, ຈະບໍ່ມີການຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່, ແຕ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຄິວແລ້ວຈະຖືກສົ່ງໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ."

msgid "The channel was closed, or connection failed."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຖືກປິດແລ້ວ, ຫຼື ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"A simple interface to create a peer-to-peer mesh network composed of "
"[WebRTCPeerConnection] that is compatible with the [MultiplayerAPI]."
msgstr ""
"ອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ງ່າຍດາຍສຳລັບສ້າງເຄືອຂ່າຍ mesh ແບບ peer-to-peer ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍ "
"[WebRTCPeerConnection] ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ງານຮ່ວມກັບ [MultiplayerAPI] ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Initialize the multiplayer peer as a client with the given [param peer_id] "
"(must be between 2 and 2147483647). In this mode, you should only call "
"[method add_peer] once and with [param peer_id] of [code]1[/code]. This mode "
"enables [method MultiplayerPeer.is_server_relay_supported], allowing the "
"upper [MultiplayerAPI] layer to perform peer exchange and packet relaying.\n"
"You can optionally specify a [param channels_config] array of [enum "
"MultiplayerPeer.TransferMode] which will be used to create extra channels "
"(WebRTC only supports one transfer mode per channel)."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ multiplayer peer ໃນຖານະໄຄເອນ (client) ດ້ວຍ [param peer_id] ທີ່ກຳນົດ "
"(ຕ້ອງຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 2 ຫາ 2147483647). ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ທ່ານຄວນເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method add_peer] ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ "
"ແລະ ດ້ວຍ [param peer_id] ທີ່ເປັນ [code]1[/code]. ໂໝດນີ້ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ [method "
"MultiplayerPeer.is_server_relay_supported], ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເລເຢີ [MultiplayerAPI] "
"ທີ່ຢູ່ເໜືອກວ່າສາມາດແລກປ່ຽນ peer ແລະ ສົ່ງຕໍ່ແພັກເກັດໄດ້.\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸອາເຣ [param channels_config] ຂອງ [enum "
"MultiplayerPeer.TransferMode] ເພື່ອສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ (WebRTC "
"ຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່ໜຶ່ງໂໝດການສົ່ງຕໍ່ຊ່ອງທາງເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"Initialize the multiplayer peer as a mesh (i.e. all peers connect to each "
"other) with the given [param peer_id] (must be between 1 and 2147483647)."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ multiplayer peer ໃນຖານະ mesh (ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທຸກ peers ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາກັນໝົດ) ດ້ວຍ [param "
"peer_id] ທີ່ກຳນົດ (ຕ້ອງຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 2147483647)."

msgid ""
"Initialize the multiplayer peer as a server (with unique ID of [code]1[/"
"code]). This mode enables [method MultiplayerPeer.is_server_relay_supported], "
"allowing the upper [MultiplayerAPI] layer to perform peer exchange and packet "
"relaying.\n"
"You can optionally specify a [param channels_config] array of [enum "
"MultiplayerPeer.TransferMode] which will be used to create extra channels "
"(WebRTC only supports one transfer mode per channel)."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ multiplayer peer ໃນຖານະເຊີບເວີ (server) (ດ້ວຍ ID ທີ່ເປັນ [code]1[/code]). "
"ໂໝດນີ້ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ [method MultiplayerPeer.is_server_relay_supported], ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເລເຢີ "
"[MultiplayerAPI] ທີ່ຢູ່ເໜືອກວ່າສາມາດແລກປ່ຽນ peer ແລະ ສົ່ງຕໍ່ແພັກເກັດໄດ້.\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸອາເຣ [param channels_config] ຂອງ [enum "
"MultiplayerPeer.TransferMode] ເພື່ອສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ (WebRTC "
"ຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່ໜຶ່ງໂໝດການສົ່ງຕໍ່ຊ່ອງທາງເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary representation of the peer with given [param peer_id] "
"with three keys. [code]\"connection\"[/code] containing the "
"[WebRTCPeerConnection] to this peer, [code]\"channels\"[/code] an array of "
"three [WebRTCDataChannel], and [code]\"connected\"[/code] a boolean "
"representing if the peer connection is currently connected (all three "
"channels are open)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ peer ທີ່ມີ [param peer_id] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບ Dictionary ເຊິ່ງມີສາມຄີ (keys). "
"[code]\"connection\"[/code] ປະກອບດ້ວຍ [WebRTCPeerConnection] ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ peer ນີ້, "
"[code]\"channels\"[/code] ແມ່ນອາເຣຂອງ [WebRTCDataChannel] ສາມຊ່ອງທາງ, ແລະ [code]"
"\"connected\"[/code] ແມ່ນຄ່າບູລີນທີ່ສະແດງວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ peer ນັ້ນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່ "
"(ທັງສາມຊ່ອງທາງເປີດຢູ່)."

msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary which keys are the peer ids and values the peer "
"representation as in [method get_peer]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ Dictionary ເຊິ່ງມີຄີ (keys) ເປັນ peer id ແລະ ມີຄ່າ (values) ເປັນຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ peer "
"ຄືກັນກັບໃນ [method get_peer]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given [param peer_id] is in the peers map "
"(it might not be connected though)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param peer_id] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ມີຢູ່ໃນແຜນຜັງ peer "
"(ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນອາດຈະຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກໍຕາມ)."

msgid ""
"Remove the peer with given [param peer_id] from the mesh. If the peer was "
"connected, and [signal MultiplayerPeer.peer_connected] was emitted for it, "
"then [signal MultiplayerPeer.peer_disconnected] will be emitted."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບພີເຢີ (peer) ທີ່ມີ [param peer_id] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ອອກຈາກ mesh. ຖ້າພີເຢີເຄີຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່, ແລະ "
"[signal MultiplayerPeer.peer_connected] ຖືກສົ່ງອອກແລ້ວ, [signal "
"MultiplayerPeer.peer_disconnected] ກໍຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກຕາມມາ."

msgid "Interface to a WebRTC peer connection."
msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟສສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ WebRTC peer."

msgid ""
"A WebRTC connection between the local computer and a remote peer. Provides an "
"interface to connect, maintain, and monitor the connection.\n"
"Setting up a WebRTC connection between two peers may not seem a trivial task, "
"but it can be broken down into 3 main steps:\n"
"- The peer that wants to initiate the connection ([code]A[/code] from now on) "
"creates an offer and sends it to the other peer ([code]B[/code] from now "
"on).\n"
"- [code]B[/code] receives the offer, generates an answer, and sends it to "
"[code]A[/code].\n"
"- [code]A[/code] and [code]B[/code] then generate and exchange ICE candidates "
"with each other.\n"
"After these steps, the connection should be established. Refer to the linked "
"tutorials for details."
msgstr ""
"ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ WebRTC ລະຫວ່າງຄອມພິວເຕີທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ແລະ ພີເຢີ (peer) ທາງໄກ. "
"ສະໜອງອິນເຕີເຟສເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ຮັກສາ, ແລະ ກວດສອບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່.\n"
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ WebRTC ລະຫວ່າງສອງພີເຢີອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າບໍ່ແມ່ນເລື່ອງງ່າຍ, ແຕ່ມັນສາມາດແບ່ງອອກເປັນ "
"3 ຂັ້ນຕອນຫຼັກ:\n"
"- ພີເຢີທີ່ຕ້ອງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະເອີ້ນວ່າ [code]A[/code]) ສ້າງຂໍ້ສະເໜີ (offer) ແລະ "
"ສົ່ງມັນໄປໃຫ້ພີເຢີອີກຝ່າຍ (ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະເອີ້ນວ່າ [code]B[/code]).\n"
"- [code]B[/code] ຮັບຂໍ້ສະເໜີ, ສ້າງຄຳຕອບ (answer), ແລະ ສົ່ງມັນກັບໄປໃຫ້ [code]A[/code].\n"
"- ຈາກນັ້ນ [code]A[/code] ແລະ [code]B[/code] ຈະສ້າງ ແລະ ແລກປ່ຽນ ICE candidates "
"ເຊິ່ງກັນ ແລະ ກັນ.\n"
"ຫຼັງຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຄວນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ຈາກບົດຮຽນ (tutorials) "
"ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

msgid "WebRTC documentation"
msgstr "ເອກະສານແນະນຳ WebRTC"

msgid ""
"Add an ice candidate generated by a remote peer (and received over the "
"signaling server). See [signal ice_candidate_created]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ ice candidate ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍພີເຢີທາງໄກ (ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບຜ່ານເຊີເວີສົ່ງສັນຍານ). ເບິ່ງ [signal "
"ice_candidate_created]."

msgid ""
"Close the peer connection and all data channels associated with it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You cannot reuse this object for a new connection unless you "
"call [method initialize]."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພີເຢີ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບມັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ອອບເຈັກນີ້ຄືນໃໝ່ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່ ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ເຈົ້າຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method initialize]."

msgid ""
"Creates a new SDP offer to start a WebRTC connection with a remote peer. At "
"least one [WebRTCDataChannel] must have been created before calling this "
"method.\n"
"If this functions returns [constant OK], [signal session_description_created] "
"will be called when the session is ready to be sent."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ SDP offer ໃໝ່ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ WebRTC ກັບພີເຢີທາງໄກ. ຕ້ອງມີການສ້າງ "
"[WebRTCDataChannel] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຊ່ອງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້.\n"
"ຫາກຟັງຊັນນີ້ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant OK], [signal session_description_created] "
"ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອເຊດຊັນພ້ອມທີ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງ."

msgid "Returns the connection state."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສະຖານະການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the ICE [enum GatheringState] of the connection. This lets you "
"detect, for example, when collection of ICE candidates has finished."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ ICE [enum GatheringState] ຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າກວດສອບໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ເມື່ອການຮວບຮວມ ICE candidates ສິ້ນສຸດລົງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the signaling state on the local end of the connection while "
"connecting or reconnecting to another peer."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສະຖານະການສົ່ງສັນຍານຢູ່ຝ່າຍທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຫຼື ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່ກັບພີເຢີອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"Re-initialize this peer connection, closing any previously active connection, "
"and going back to state [constant STATE_NEW]. A dictionary of [param "
"configuration] options can be passed to configure the peer connection.\n"
"Valid [param configuration] options are:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"{\n"
"\t\"iceServers\": [\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\"urls\": [ \"stun:stun.example.com:3478\" ], # One or more STUN "
"servers.\n"
"\t\t},\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\"urls\": [ \"turn:turn.example.com:3478\" ], # One or more TURN "
"servers.\n"
"\t\t\t\"username\": \"a_username\", # Optional username for the TURN server.\n"
"\t\t\t\"credential\": \"a_password\", # Optional password for the TURN "
"server.\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t]\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພີເຢີນີ້ໃໝ່, ປິດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ເຄີຍເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ກ່ອນໜ້າທັງໝົດ, ແລະ ກັບຄືນສູ່ສະຖານະ "
"[constant STATE_NEW]. ສາມາດສົ່ງ dictionary ຂອງ [param configuration] "
"ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພີເຢີໄດ້.\n"
"ຕົວເລືອກ [param configuration] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງມີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"{\n"
"\t\"iceServers\": [\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\"urls\": [ \"stun:stun.example.com:3478\" ], # ເຊີເວີ STUN ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຕົວ.\n"
"\t\t},\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\"urls\": [ \"turn:turn.example.com:3478\" ], # ເຊີເວີ TURN ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຕົວ.\n"
"\t\t\t\"username\": \"a_username\", # ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເຊີເວີ TURN (ຖ້າມີ).\n"
"\t\t\t\"credential\": \"a_password\", # ລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບເຊີເວີ TURN (ຖ້າມີ).\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t]\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Call this method frequently (e.g. in [method Node._process] or [method "
"Node._physics_process]) to properly receive signals."
msgstr ""
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້ເລື້ອຍໆ (ເຊັ່ນ: ໃນ [method Node._process] ຫຼື [method "
"Node._physics_process]) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຮັບສັນຍານຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param extension_class] as the default "
"[WebRTCPeerConnectionExtension] returned when creating a new "
"[WebRTCPeerConnection]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງ [param extension_class] ໃຫ້ເປັນ [WebRTCPeerConnectionExtension] "
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນເມື່ອສ້າງ [WebRTCPeerConnection] ໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Sets the SDP description of the local peer. This should be called in response "
"to [signal session_description_created].\n"
"After calling this function the peer will start emitting [signal "
"ice_candidate_created] (unless an [enum Error] different from [constant OK] "
"is returned)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລາຍລະອຽດ SDP ຂອງພີເຢີທ້ອງຖິ່ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວນຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ [signal "
"session_description_created].\n"
"ຫຼັງຈາກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ ພີເຢີຈະເລີ່ມສົ່ງ [signal ice_candidate_created] (ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ວ່າຈະມີ [enum "
"Error] ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [constant OK] ສົ່ງຄືນມາ)."

msgid ""
"Sets the SDP description of the remote peer. This should be called with the "
"values generated by a remote peer and received over the signaling server.\n"
"If [param type] is [code]\"offer\"[/code] the peer will emit [signal "
"session_description_created] with the appropriate answer.\n"
"If [param type] is [code]\"answer\"[/code] the peer will start emitting "
"[signal ice_candidate_created]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລາຍລະອຽດ SDP ຂອງພີເຢີທາງໄກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວນຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຄ່າທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍພີເຢີທາງໄກ ແລະ "
"ໄດ້ຮັບຜ່ານເຊີເວີສົ່ງສັນຍານ.\n"
"ຫາກ [param type] ແມ່ນ [code]\"offer\"[/code] ພີເຢີຈະສົ່ງ [signal "
"session_description_created] ພ້ອມກັບຄຳຕອບ (answer) ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ.\n"
"ຫາກ [param type] ແມ່ນ [code]\"answer\"[/code] ພີເຢີຈະເລີ່ມສົ່ງ [signal "
"ice_candidate_created]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a new in-band channel is received, i.e. when the channel was "
"created with [code]negotiated: false[/code] (default).\n"
"The object will be an instance of [WebRTCDataChannel]. You must keep a "
"reference of it or it will be closed automatically. See [method "
"create_data_channel]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບຊ່ອງທາງ in-band ໃໝ່, ນັ້ນຄືເມື່ອຊ່ອງທາງຖືກສ້າງດ້ວຍ [code]negotiated: "
"false[/code] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ).\n"
"ອອບເຈັກຈະເປັນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງ [WebRTCDataChannel]. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເກັບຄ່າອ້າງອີງຂອງມັນໄວ້ "
"ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກປິດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເບິ່ງ [method create_data_channel]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a new ICE candidate has been created. The three parameters are "
"meant to be passed to the remote peer over the signaling server."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອມີການສ້າງ ICE candidate ໃໝ່. "
"ພາລາມິເຕີທັງສາມແມ່ນມີໄວ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງໄປໃຫ້ພີເຢີທາງໄກຜ່ານເຊີເວີສົ່ງສັນຍານ."

msgid ""
"Emitted after a successful call to [method create_offer] or [method "
"set_remote_description] (when it generates an answer). The parameters are "
"meant to be passed to [method set_local_description] on this object, and sent "
"to the remote peer over the signaling server."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກຫຼັງຈາກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method create_offer] ຫຼື [method set_remote_description] "
"ສຳເລັດ (ເມື່ອມັນສ້າງຄຳຕອບ). ພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງໃຫ້ [method set_local_description] "
"ໃນອອບເຈັກນີ້, ແລະ ສົ່ງໄປໃຫ້ພີເຢີທາງໄກຜ່ານເຊີເວີສົ່ງສັນຍານ."

msgid ""
"The connection is new, data channels and an offer can be created in this "
"state."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່, ຊ່ອງທາງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ສະເໜີ (offer) ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ໃນສະຖານະນີ້."

msgid ""
"The peer is connecting, ICE is in progress, none of the transports has failed."
msgstr "ພີເຢີກຳລັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ICE ກຳລັງດຳເນີນການ, ຍັງບໍ່ມີການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໃດໆທີ່ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid "The peer is connected, all ICE transports are connected."
msgstr "ພີເຢີເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ, ການຮັບສົ່ງ ICE ທັງໝົດຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid "At least one ICE transport is disconnected."
msgstr "ມີການຮັບສົ່ງ ICE ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid "One or more of the ICE transports failed."
msgstr "ການຮັບສົ່ງ ICE ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"The peer connection is closed (after calling [method close] for example)."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພີເຢີຖືກປິດແລ້ວ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫຼັງຈາກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method close])."

msgid "The peer connection was just created and hasn't done any networking yet."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພີເຢີຫາກໍ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍເທື່ອ."

msgid ""
"The ICE agent is in the process of gathering candidates for the connection."
msgstr "ຕົວແທນ ICE ກຳລັງຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການຮວບຮວມ candidates ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid ""
"The ICE agent has finished gathering candidates. If something happens that "
"requires collecting new candidates, such as a new interface being added or "
"the addition of a new ICE server, the state will revert to gathering to "
"gather those candidates."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແທນ ICE ໄດ້ສິ້ນສຸດການຮວບຮວມ candidates ແລ້ວ. ຫາກມີບາງຢ່າງເກີດຂຶ້ນທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຫ້ມີການຮວບຮວມ "
"candidates ໃໝ່ ເຊັ່ນ: ມີການເພີ່ມອິນເຕີເຟສໃໝ່ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມເຊີເວີ ICE ໃໝ່, "
"ສະຖານະຈະກັບຄືນໄປສູ່ການຮວບຮວມ (gathering) ເພື່ອຫາ candidates ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"There is no ongoing exchange of offer and answer underway. This may mean that "
"the [WebRTCPeerConnection] is new ([constant STATE_NEW]) or that negotiation "
"is complete and a connection has been established ([constant "
"STATE_CONNECTED])."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ມີການແລກປ່ຽນ offer ແລະ answer ທີ່ກຳລັງດຳເນີນຢູ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ "
"[WebRTCPeerConnection] ຍັງໃໝ່ ([constant STATE_NEW]) ຫຼື ການເຈລະຈາສຳເລັດແລ້ວ ແລະ "
"ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແລ້ວ ([constant STATE_CONNECTED])."

msgid ""
"The local peer has called [method set_local_description], passing in SDP "
"representing an offer (usually created by calling [method create_offer]), and "
"the offer has been applied successfully."
msgstr ""
"ພີເຢີທ້ອງຖິ່ນໄດ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method set_local_description] ໂດຍສົ່ງ SDP ທີ່ເປັນ offer "
"(ປົກກະຕິສ້າງໂດຍການເອີ້ນ [method create_offer]), ແລະ offer ນັ້ນໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຢ່າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"The remote peer has created an offer and used the signaling server to deliver "
"it to the local peer, which has set the offer as the remote description by "
"calling [method set_remote_description]."
msgstr ""
"ພີເຢີທາງໄກໄດ້ສ້າງ offer ແລະ ໃຊ້ເຊີເວີສົ່ງສັນຍານເພື່ອສົ່ງມັນມາຍັງພີເຢີທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, ເຊິ່ງໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ offer "
"ນັ້ນໃຫ້ເປັນລາຍລະອຽດທາງໄກໂດຍການເອີ້ນ [method set_remote_description]."

msgid ""
"The offer sent by the remote peer has been applied and an answer has been "
"created and applied by calling [method set_local_description]. This "
"provisional answer describes the supported media formats and so forth, but "
"may not have a complete set of ICE candidates included. Further candidates "
"will be delivered separately later."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ສະເໜີທີ່ສົ່ງມາໂດຍຄູ່ຮ່ວມປາຍທາງໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແລ້ວ ແລະ ຄຳຕອບກໍໄດ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນ "
"[method set_local_description]. ຄຳຕອບຊົ່ວຄາວນີ້ອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບຮູບແບບສື່ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ, "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະບໍ່ມີຊຸດຜູ້ສະໝັກ ICE ທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນລວມຢູ່ນຳ. ຜູ້ສະໝັກເພີ່ມເຕີມຈະຖືກສົ່ງແຍກຕ່າງຫາກໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"A provisional answer has been received and successfully applied in response "
"to an offer previously sent and established by calling [method "
"set_local_description]."
msgstr ""
"ໄດ້ຮັບ answer ຊົ່ວຄາວ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ມັນຢ່າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ ເພື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ offer ທີ່ສົ່ງໄປກ່ອນໜ້າ ແລະ "
"ຖືກສ້າງໂດຍການເອີ້ນ [method set_local_description]."

msgid "The [WebRTCPeerConnection] has been closed."
msgstr "[WebRTCPeerConnection] ຖືກປິດແລ້ວ."

msgid "Base class for WebSocket server and client."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບ WebSocket ເຊີເວີ ແລະ ຄລາຍແອນ."

msgid ""
"Starts a new multiplayer client connecting to the given [param url]. TLS "
"certificates will be verified against the hostname when connecting using the "
"[code]wss://[/code] protocol. You can pass the optional [param "
"tls_client_options] parameter to customize the trusted certification "
"authorities, or disable the common name verification. See [method "
"TLSOptions.client] and [method TLSOptions.client_unsafe].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is recommended to specify the scheme part of the URL, i.e. "
"the [param url] should start with either [code]ws://[/code] or [code]wss://[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ multiplayer client ໃໝ່ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ [param url] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS "
"ຈະຖືກກວດສອບກັບ hostname ເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ [code]wss://[/code]. "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດສົ່ງພາລາມິເຕີ [param tls_client_options] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າໜ່ວຍງານອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້, "
"ຫຼື ປິດການກວດສອບ common name. ເບິ່ງ [method TLSOptions.client] ແລະ [method "
"TLSOptions.client_unsafe].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແນະນຳໃຫ້ລະບຸສ່ວນ scheme ຂອງ URL, ຄື [param url] ຄວນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ "
"[code]ws://[/code] ຫຼື [code]wss://[/code]."

msgid ""
"Starts a new multiplayer server listening on the given [param port]. You can "
"optionally specify a [param bind_address], and provide valid [param "
"tls_server_options] to use TLS. See [method TLSOptions.server]."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ multiplayer server ໃໝ່ເພື່ອລໍຖ້າຟັງໃນ [param port] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ເຈົ້າສາມາດລະບຸ "
"[param bind_address] ໄດ້, ແລະ ສາມາດສົ່ງ [param tls_server_options] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເພື່ອໃຊ້ "
"TLS. ເບິ່ງ [method TLSOptions.server]."

msgid "Returns the [WebSocketPeer] associated to the given [param peer_id]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [WebSocketPeer] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [param peer_id] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Returns the IP address of the given peer."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງພີເຢີທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Returns the remote port of the given peer."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນພອດ (port) ທາງໄກຂອງພີເຢີທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"The extra headers to use during handshake. See [member "
"WebSocketPeer.handshake_headers] for more details."
msgstr ""
"Headers ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຈັບມື (handshake). ເບິ່ງ [member "
"WebSocketPeer.handshake_headers] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The maximum time each peer can stay in a connecting state before being "
"dropped."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາສູງສຸດທີ່ແຕ່ລະພີເຢີສາມາດຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະກຳລັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid ""
"The inbound buffer size for connected peers. See [member "
"WebSocketPeer.inbound_buffer_size] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດບັບເຟີຂາເຂົ້າ (inbound buffer) ສຳລັບພີເຢີທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"WebSocketPeer.inbound_buffer_size] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of queued packets for connected peers. See [member "
"WebSocketPeer.max_queued_packets] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນແພັກເກັດສູງສຸດໃນຄິວສຳລັບພີເຢີທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"WebSocketPeer.max_queued_packets] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The outbound buffer size for connected peers. See [member "
"WebSocketPeer.outbound_buffer_size] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດບັບເຟີຂາອອກ (outbound buffer) ສຳລັບພີເຢີທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"WebSocketPeer.outbound_buffer_size] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The supported WebSocket sub-protocols. See [member "
"WebSocketPeer.supported_protocols] for more details."
msgstr ""
"WebSocket sub-protocols ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"WebSocketPeer.supported_protocols] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "A WebSocket connection."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ WebSocket."

msgid ""
"This class represents WebSocket connection, and can be used as a WebSocket "
"client ([url=https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6455]RFC 6455[/url]-"
"compliant) or as a remote peer of a WebSocket server.\n"
"You can send WebSocket binary frames using [method PacketPeer.put_packet], "
"and WebSocket text frames using [method send] (prefer text frames when "
"interacting with text-based API). You can check the frame type of the last "
"packet via [method was_string_packet].\n"
"To start a WebSocket client, first call [method connect_to_url], then "
"regularly call [method poll] (e.g. during [Node] process). You can query the "
"socket state via [method get_ready_state], get the number of pending packets "
"using [method PacketPeer.get_available_packet_count], and retrieve them via "
"[method PacketPeer.get_packet].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var socket = WebSocketPeer.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tsocket.connect_to_url(\"wss://example.com\")\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\tsocket.poll()\n"
"\tvar state = socket.get_ready_state()\n"
"\tif state == WebSocketPeer.STATE_OPEN:\n"
"\t\twhile socket.get_available_packet_count():\n"
"\t\t\tprint(\"Packet: \", socket.get_packet())\n"
"\telif state == WebSocketPeer.STATE_CLOSING:\n"
"\t\t# Keep polling to achieve proper close.\n"
"\t\tpass\n"
"\telif state == WebSocketPeer.STATE_CLOSED:\n"
"\t\tvar code = socket.get_close_code()\n"
"\t\tvar reason = socket.get_close_reason()\n"
"\t\tprint(\"WebSocket closed with code: %d, reason %s. Clean: %s\" % [code, "
"reason, code != -1])\n"
"\t\tset_process(false) # Stop processing.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"To use the peer as part of a WebSocket server refer to [method accept_stream] "
"and the online tutorial."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ເປັນຕົວແທນຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ WebSocket, ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນ WebSocket client "
"(ຕາມມາດຕະຖານ [url=https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6455]RFC 6455[/"
"url]) ຫຼື ເປັນພີເຢີທາງໄກຂອງ WebSocket server.\n"
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດສົ່ງ WebSocket binary frames ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method PacketPeer.put_packet], ແລະ "
"ສົ່ງ WebSocket text frames ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method send] (ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ text frames "
"ເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກກັບ API ທີ່ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ). ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບປະເພດເຟຣມຂອງແພັກເກັດຫຼ້າສຸດໄດ້ຜ່ານ [method "
"was_string_packet].\n"
"ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ WebSocket client, ທຳອິດໃຫ້ເອີ້ນ [method connect_to_url], ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ເອີ້ນ "
"[method poll] ເປັນປະຈຳ (ເຊັ່ນ: ໃນລະຫວ່າງ process ຂອງ [Node]). "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບສະຖານະ socket ຜ່ານ [method get_ready_state], "
"ກວດສອບຈຳນວນແພັກເກັດທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method PacketPeer.get_available_packet_count], "
"ແລະ ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນພວກມັນຜ່ານ [method PacketPeer.get_packet].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var socket = WebSocketPeer.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tsocket.connect_to_url(\"wss://example.com\")\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\tsocket.poll()\n"
"\tvar state = socket.get_ready_state()\n"
"\tif state == WebSocketPeer.STATE_OPEN:\n"
"\t\twhile socket.get_available_packet_count():\n"
"\t\t\tprint(\"Packet: \", socket.get_packet())\n"
"\telif state == WebSocketPeer.STATE_CLOSING:\n"
"\t\t# ສືບຕໍ່ poll ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປິດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສົມບູນ.\n"
"\t\tpass\n"
"\telif state == WebSocketPeer.STATE_CLOSED:\n"
"\t\tvar code = socket.get_close_code()\n"
"\t\tvar reason = socket.get_close_reason()\n"
"\t\tprint(\"WebSocket ຖືກປິດດ້ວຍລະຫັດ: %d, ເຫດຜົນ %s. Clean: %s\" % [code, reason, "
"code != -1])\n"
"\t\tset_process(false) # ຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ຫາກຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ພີເຢີເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ WebSocket server ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [method accept_stream] ແລະ "
"ບົດຮຽນອອນໄລນ໌."

msgid ""
"Closes this WebSocket connection.\n"
"[param code] is the status code for the closure (see [url=https://"
"datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6455#section-7.4.1]RFC 6455 section 7.4[/"
"url] for a list of valid status codes). If [param code] is negative, the "
"connection will be closed immediately without notifying the remote peer.\n"
"[param reason] is the human-readable reason for closing the connection. It "
"can be any UTF-8 string that's smaller than 123 bytes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To achieve a clean closure, you will need to keep polling until "
"[constant STATE_CLOSED] is reached.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The Web export might not support all status codes. Please refer "
"to browser-specific documentation for more details."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ WebSocket ນີ້.\n"
"[param code] ແມ່ນລະຫັດສະຖານະສຳລັບການປິດ (ເບິ່ງ [url=https://datatracker.ietf.org/"
"doc/html/rfc6455#section-7.4.1]RFC 6455 section 7.4[/url] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ລະຫັດສະຖານະທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ). ຫາກ [param code] ມີຄ່າເປັນລົບ, "
"ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈະຖືກປິດທັນທີໂດຍບໍ່ແຈ້ງໃຫ້ພີເຢີທາງໄກຊາບ.\n"
"[param reason] ແມ່ນເຫດຜົນທີ່ມະນຸດສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ສຳລັບການປິດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່. ມັນສາມາດເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ "
"UTF-8 ໃດໆກໍໄດ້ທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ 123 ໄບຕ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປິດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສົມບູນ (clean closure), ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ poll "
"ຕໍ່ໄປຈົນກວ່າຈະຮອດສະຖານະ [constant STATE_CLOSED].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການສົ່ງອອກແບບ Web ອາດຈະບໍ່ຮອງຮັບລະຫັດສະຖານະທັງໝົດ. "
"ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງເອກະສານສະເພາະຂອງບຣາວເຊີນັ້ນໆສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Connects to the given URL. TLS certificates will be verified against the "
"hostname when connecting using the [code]wss://[/code] protocol. You can pass "
"the optional [param tls_client_options] parameter to customize the trusted "
"certification authorities, or disable the common name verification. See "
"[method TLSOptions.client] and [method TLSOptions.client_unsafe].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is non-blocking, and will return [constant OK] "
"before the connection is established as long as the provided parameters are "
"valid and the peer is not in an invalid state (e.g. already connected). "
"Regularly call [method poll] (e.g. during [Node] process) and check the "
"result of [method get_ready_state] to know whether the connection succeeds or "
"fails.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To avoid mixed content warnings or errors in Web, you may have "
"to use a [param url] that starts with [code]wss://[/code] (secure) instead of "
"[code]ws://[/code]. When doing so, make sure to use the fully qualified "
"domain name that matches the one defined in the server's TLS certificate. Do "
"not connect directly via the IP address for [code]wss://[/code] connections, "
"as it won't match with the TLS certificate."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ URL ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS ຈະຖືກກວດສອບກັບ hostname ເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ "
"[code]wss://[/code]. ເຈົ້າສາມາດສົ່ງພາລາມິເຕີ [param tls_client_options] "
"ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າໜ່ວຍງານອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້, ຫຼື ປິດການກວດສອບ common name. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"TLSOptions.client] ແລະ [method TLSOptions.client_unsafe].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ເປັນແບບ non-blocking, ແລະ ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [constant OK] "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳເລັດ ຕາບໃດທີ່ພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ໃຫ້ມານັ້ນຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ພີເຢີບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ "
"(ເຊັ່ນ: ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ແລ້ວ). ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method poll] ເປັນປະຈຳ (ເຊັ່ນ: ໃນລະຫວ່າງ process ຂອງ "
"[Node]) ແລະ ກວດສອບຜົນຂອງ [method get_ready_state] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູ້ວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳເລັດ ຫຼື "
"ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງຄຳເຕືອນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດກ່ຽວກັບ mixed content ໃນ Web, "
"ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ [param url] ທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [code]wss://[/code] (ປອດໄພ) ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ "
"[code]ws://[/code]. ເມື່ອເຮັດແນວນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ fully qualified domain name "
"ທີ່ກົງກັບທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS ຂອງເຊີເວີ. ຢ່າເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງຜ່ານທີ່ຢູ່ IP ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ "
"[code]wss://[/code], ເພາະວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ກົງກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS."

msgid ""
"Returns the received WebSocket close frame status code, or [code]-1[/code] "
"when the connection was not cleanly closed. Only call this method when "
"[method get_ready_state] returns [constant STATE_CLOSED]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລະຫັດສະຖານະຂອງ WebSocket close frame ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ, ຫຼື [code]-1[/code] "
"ເມື່ອການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກປິດຢ່າງສົມບູນ. ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້ເມື່ອ [method get_ready_state] ສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[constant STATE_CLOSED] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the received WebSocket close frame status reason string. Only call "
"this method when [method get_ready_state] returns [constant STATE_CLOSED]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມເຫດຜົນຂອງ WebSocket close frame ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ. ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້ເມື່ອ [method "
"get_ready_state] ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant STATE_CLOSED] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the IP address of the connected peer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Not available in the Web export."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງພີເຢີທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນການສົ່ງອອກແບບ Web."

msgid ""
"Returns the remote port of the connected peer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Not available in the Web export."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນພອດທາງໄກຂອງພີເຢີທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນການສົ່ງອອກແບບ Web."

msgid ""
"Returns the current amount of data in the outbound websocket buffer. [b]Note:"
"[/b] Web exports use WebSocket.bufferedAmount, while other platforms use an "
"internal buffer."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຂໍ້ມູນປັດຈຸບັນໃນ websocket outbound buffer.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການສົ່ງອອກແບບ Web ຈະໃຊ້ WebSocket.bufferedAmount, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ແພລດຟອມອື່ນຈະໃຊ້ບັບເຟີພາຍໃນ."

msgid "Returns the ready state of the connection."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສະຖານະຄວາມພ້ອມ (ready state) ຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the URL requested by this peer. The URL is derived from the "
"[code]url[/code] passed to [method connect_to_url] or from the HTTP headers "
"when acting as server (i.e. when using [method accept_stream])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ URL ທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍໂດຍພີເຢີນີ້. URL ນີ້ໄດ້ມາຈາກ [code]url[/code] ທີ່ສົ່ງໃຫ້ [method "
"connect_to_url] ຫຼື ຈາກ HTTP headers ເມື່ອເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນເຊີເວີ (ຄືເມື່ອໃຊ້ [method "
"accept_stream])."

msgid ""
"Returns the selected WebSocket sub-protocol for this connection or an empty "
"string if the sub-protocol has not been selected yet."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ WebSocket sub-protocol ທີ່ຖືກເລືອກສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ນີ້ ຫຼື "
"ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງເປົ່າຫາກຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີການເລືອກ sub-protocol."

msgid ""
"Updates the connection state and receive incoming packets. Call this function "
"regularly to keep it in a clean state."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດສະຖານະການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ຮັບແພັກເກັດຂາເຂົ້າ. "
"ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ເປັນປະຈຳເພື່ອຮັກສາສະຖານະໃຫ້ເປັນປົກກະຕິ."

msgid ""
"Sends the given [param message] using the desired [param write_mode]. When "
"sending a [String], prefer using [method send_text]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງ [param message] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [param write_mode] ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ເມື່ອສົ່ງ [String], "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method send_text] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Sends the given [param message] using WebSocket text mode. Prefer this method "
"over [method PacketPeer.put_packet] when interacting with third-party text-"
"based API (e.g. when using [JSON] formatted messages)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງ [param message] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂໝດຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງ WebSocket. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້ແທນ "
"[method PacketPeer.put_packet] ເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກກັບ API ຂອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມທີ່ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມຮູບແບບ [JSON])."

msgid ""
"Disable Nagle's algorithm on the underlying TCP socket (default). See [method "
"StreamPeerTCP.set_no_delay] for more information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Not available in the Web export."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ Nagle's algorithm ໃນ TCP socket ທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ). ເບິ່ງ [method "
"StreamPeerTCP.set_no_delay] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນການສົ່ງອອກແບບ Web."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the last received packet was sent as a text "
"payload. See [enum WriteMode]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກແພັກເກັດຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບນັ້ນຖືກສົ່ງມາເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ (text payload). ເບິ່ງ "
"[enum WriteMode]."

msgid ""
"The interval (in seconds) at which the peer will automatically send WebSocket "
"\"ping\" control frames. When set to [code]0[/code], no \"ping\" control "
"frames will be sent.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Has no effect in Web exports due to browser restrictions."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (ເປັນວິນາທີ) ທີ່ພີເຢີຈະສົ່ງ WebSocket \"ping\" control frames ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/code], ຈະບໍ່ມີການສົ່ງ \"ping\".\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນການສົ່ງອອກແບບ Web ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງບຣາວເຊີ."

msgid ""
"The size of the input buffer in bytes (roughly the maximum amount of memory "
"that will be allocated for the inbound packets)."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງບັບເຟີຂາເຂົ້າເປັນໄບຕ໌ (ປະມານຈຳນວນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະຖືກຈັດສັນໃຫ້ກັບແພັກເກັດຂາເຂົ້າ)."

msgid ""
"The maximum amount of packets that will be allowed in the queues (both "
"inbound and outbound)."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແພັກເກັດສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຄິວ (ທັງຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ)."

msgid ""
"The size of the input buffer in bytes (roughly the maximum amount of memory "
"that will be allocated for the outbound packets)."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງບັບເຟີຂາອອກເປັນໄບຕ໌ (ປະມານຈຳນວນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະຖືກຈັດສັນໃຫ້ກັບແພັກເກັດຂາອອກ)."

msgid "The WebSocket sub-protocols allowed during the WebSocket handshake."
msgstr ""
"WebSocket sub-protocols ທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃນລະຫວ່າງການຈັບມື (handshake) ຂອງ WebSocket."

msgid ""
"Specifies that WebSockets messages should be transferred as text payload "
"(only valid UTF-8 is allowed)."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມ WebSockets ຄວນຖືກສົ່ງເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ (text payload) (ອະນຸຍາດສະເພາະ UTF-8 "
"ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"Specifies that WebSockets messages should be transferred as binary payload "
"(any byte combination is allowed)."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມ WebSockets ຄວນຖືກສົ່ງເປັນຂໍ້ມູນບີນາຣີ (binary payload) "
"(ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການຮວມກຸ່ມໄບຕ໌ໃດໆກໍໄດ້)."

msgid "Socket has been created. The connection is not yet open."
msgstr "Socket ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແລ້ວ. ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນເປີດ."

msgid "The connection is open and ready to communicate."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເປີດຢູ່ ແລະ ພ້ອມທີ່ຈະສື່ສານ."

msgid ""
"The connection is in the process of closing. This means a close request has "
"been sent to the remote peer but confirmation has not been received."
msgstr ""
"ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການປິດ. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມີການສົ່ງການຮ້ອງຂໍປິດໄປຫາພີເຢີທາງໄກແລ້ວ "
"ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນ."

msgid "The connection is closed or couldn't be opened."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖືກປິດ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສາມາດເປີດໄດ້."

msgid "XR interface using WebXR."
msgstr "XR interface ໂດຍໃຊ້ WebXR."

msgid ""
"WebXR is an open standard that allows creating VR and AR applications that "
"run in the web browser.\n"
"As such, this interface is only available when running in Web exports.\n"
"WebXR supports a wide range of devices, from the very capable (like Valve "
"Index, HTC Vive, Oculus Rift and Quest) down to the much less capable (like "
"Google Cardboard, Oculus Go, GearVR, or plain smartphones).\n"
"Since WebXR is based on JavaScript, it makes extensive use of callbacks, "
"which means that [WebXRInterface] is forced to use signals, where other XR "
"interfaces would instead use functions that return a result immediately. This "
"makes [WebXRInterface] quite a bit more complicated to initialize than other "
"XR interfaces.\n"
"Here's the minimum code required to start an immersive VR session:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"extends Node3D\n"
"\n"
"var webxr_interface\n"
"var vr_supported = false\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t# We assume this node has a button as a child.\n"
"\t# This button is for the user to consent to entering immersive VR mode.\n"
"\t$Button.pressed.connect(self._on_button_pressed)\n"
"\n"
"\twebxr_interface = XRServer.find_interface(\"WebXR\")\n"
"\tif webxr_interface:\n"
"\t\t# WebXR uses a lot of asynchronous callbacks, so we connect to various\n"
"\t\t# signals in order to receive them.\n"
"\t\twebxr_interface.session_supported.connect(self._webxr_session_supported)\n"
"\t\twebxr_interface.session_started.connect(self._webxr_session_started)\n"
"\t\twebxr_interface.session_ended.connect(self._webxr_session_ended)\n"
"\t\twebxr_interface.session_failed.connect(self._webxr_session_failed)\n"
"\n"
"\t\t# This returns immediately - our _webxr_session_supported() method\n"
"\t\t# (which we connected to the \"session_supported\" signal above) will\n"
"\t\t# be called sometime later to let us know if it's supported or not.\n"
"\t\twebxr_interface.is_session_supported(\"immersive-vr\")\n"
"\n"
"func _webxr_session_supported(session_mode, supported):\n"
"\tif session_mode == 'immersive-vr':\n"
"\t\tvr_supported = supported\n"
"\n"
"func _on_button_pressed():\n"
"\tif not vr_supported:\n"
"\t\tOS.alert(\"Your browser doesn't support VR\")\n"
"\t\treturn\n"
"\n"
"\t# We want an immersive VR session, as opposed to AR ('immersive-ar') or a\n"
"\t# simple 3DoF viewer ('viewer').\n"
"\twebxr_interface.session_mode = 'immersive-vr'\n"
"\t# 'bounded-floor' is room scale, 'local-floor' is a standing or sitting\n"
"\t# experience (it puts you 1.6m above the ground if you have 3DoF headset),\n"
"\t# whereas as 'local' puts you down at the XROrigin.\n"
"\t# This list means it'll first try to request 'bounded-floor', then\n"
"\t# fallback on 'local-floor' and ultimately 'local', if nothing else is\n"
"\t# supported.\n"
"\twebxr_interface.requested_reference_space_types = 'bounded-floor, local-"
"floor, local'\n"
"\t# In order to use 'local-floor' or 'bounded-floor' we must also\n"
"\t# mark the features as required or optional. By including 'hand-tracking'\n"
"\t# as an optional feature, it will be enabled if supported.\n"
"\twebxr_interface.required_features = 'local-floor'\n"
"\twebxr_interface.optional_features = 'bounded-floor, hand-tracking'\n"
"\n"
"\t# This will return false if we're unable to even request the session,\n"
"\t# however, it can still fail asynchronously later in the process, so we\n"
"\t# only know if it's really succeeded or failed when our\n"
"\t# _webxr_session_started() or _webxr_session_failed() methods are called.\n"
"\tif not webxr_interface.initialize():\n"
"\t\tOS.alert(\"Failed to initialize\")\n"
"\t\treturn\n"
"\n"
"func _webxr_session_started():\n"
"\t$Button.visible = false\n"
"\t# This tells Godot to start rendering to the headset.\n"
"\tget_viewport().use_xr = true\n"
"\t# This will be the reference space type you ultimately got, out of the\n"
"\t# types that you requested above. This is useful if you want the game to\n"
"\t# work a little differently in 'bounded-floor' versus 'local-floor'.\n"
"\tprint(\"Reference space type: \", webxr_interface.reference_space_type)\n"
"\t# This will be the list of features that were successfully enabled\n"
"\t# (except on browsers that don't support this property).\n"
"\tprint(\"Enabled features: \", webxr_interface.enabled_features)\n"
"\n"
"func _webxr_session_ended():\n"
"\t$Button.visible = true\n"
"\t# If the user exits immersive mode, then we tell Godot to render to the "
"web\n"
"\t# page again.\n"
"\tget_viewport().use_xr = false\n"
"\n"
"func _webxr_session_failed(message):\n"
"\tOS.alert(\"Failed to initialize: \" + message)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"There are a couple ways to handle \"controller\" input:\n"
"- Using [XRController3D] nodes and their [signal "
"XRController3D.button_pressed] and [signal XRController3D.button_released] "
"signals. This is how controllers are typically handled in XR apps in Godot, "
"however, this will only work with advanced VR controllers like the Oculus "
"Touch or Index controllers, for example.\n"
"- Using the [signal select], [signal squeeze] and related signals. This "
"method will work for both advanced VR controllers, and non-traditional input "
"sources like a tap on the screen, a spoken voice command or a button press on "
"the device itself.\n"
"You can use both methods to allow your game or app to support a wider or "
"narrower set of devices and input methods, or to allow more advanced "
"interactions with more advanced devices."
msgstr ""
"WebXR ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານເປີດທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດສ້າງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ VR ແລະ AR ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນເວັບບຣາວເຊີໄດ້.\n"
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ອິນເຕີເຟສນີ້ຈຶ່ງມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກໃນການສົ່ງອອກແບບ Web ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"WebXR ຮອງຮັບອຸປະກອນທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ, ຕັ້ງແຕ່ອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງ (ເຊັ່ນ: Valve Index, HTC Vive, "
"Oculus Rift ແລະ Quest) ໄປຈົນເຖິງອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບຕໍ່າກວ່າ (ເຊັ່ນ: Google Cardboard, "
"Oculus Go, GearVR, ຫຼື ສະມາດໂຟນທົ່ວໄປ).\n"
"ເນື່ອງຈາກ WebXR ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເທິງ JavaScript, ມັນຈຶ່ງມີການໃຊ້ callback ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ [WebXRInterface] ຖືກບັງຄັບໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສັນຍານ (signals), ໃນຂະນະທີ່ XR interface "
"ອື່ນໆຈະໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທັນທີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [WebXRInterface] ຂ້ອນຂ້າງຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າ "
"XR interface ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"ນີ້ຄືຕົວຢ່າງໂຄ້ດຂັ້ນຕໍ່າທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຊດຊັນ immersive VR:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"extends Node3D\n"
"\n"
"var webxr_interface\n"
"var vr_supported = false\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t# ພວກເຮົາສົມມຸດວ່ານົດນີ້ມີປຸ່ມເປັນນົດລູກ.\n"
"\t# ປຸ່ມນີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຍິນຍອມເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດ immersive VR.\n"
"\t$Button.pressed.connect(self._on_button_pressed)\n"
"\n"
"\twebxr_interface = XRServer.find_interface(\"WebXR\")\n"
"\tif webxr_interface:\n"
"\t\t# WebXR ໃຊ້ asynchronous callbacks ຫຼາຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບສັນຍານຕ່າງໆ\n"
"\t\t# ເພື່ອຮັບຄ່າຈາກພວກມັນ.\n"
"\t\twebxr_interface.session_supported.connect(self._webxr_session_supported)\n"
"\t\twebxr_interface.session_started.connect(self._webxr_session_started)\n"
"\t\twebxr_interface.session_ended.connect(self._webxr_session_ended)\n"
"\t\twebxr_interface.session_failed.connect(self._webxr_session_failed)\n"
"\n"
"\t\t# ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນທັນທີ - ວິທີການ _webxr_session_supported() ຂອງພວກເຮົາ\n"
"\t\t# (ທີ່ພວກເຮົາເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບສັນຍານ \"session_supported\" ຂ້າງເທິງ) ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້\n"
"\t\t# ໃນພາຍຫຼັງເພື່ອບອກໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາຮູ້ວ່າຮອງຮັບຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"\t\twebxr_interface.is_session_supported(\"immersive-vr\")\n"
"\n"
"func _webxr_session_supported(session_mode, supported):\n"
"\tif session_mode == 'immersive-vr':\n"
"\t\tvr_supported = supported\n"
"\n"
"func _on_button_pressed():\n"
"\tif not vr_supported:\n"
"\t\tOS.alert(\"ບຣາວເຊີຂອງເຈົ້າບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ VR\")\n"
"\t\treturn\n"
"\n"
"\t# ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການເຊດຊັນ immersive VR, ເຊິ່ງຕ່າງຈາກ AR ('immersive-ar') ຫຼື\n"
"\t# ຕົວເບິ່ງແບບ 3DoF ທົ່ວໄປ ('viewer').\n"
"\twebxr_interface.session_mode = 'immersive-vr'\n"
"\t# 'bounded-floor' ແມ່ນລະດັບຫ້ອງ, 'local-floor' ແມ່ນປະສົບການການຢືນ ຫຼື ນັ່ງ\n"
"\t# (ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຢູ່ສູງຈາກພື້ນ 1.6 ແມັດ ຫາກເຈົ້າມີເຮດເຊັດ 3DoF),\n"
"\t# ໃນຂະນະທີ່ 'local' ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຢູ່ທີ່ XROrigin.\n"
"\t# ລາຍການນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນຈະພະຍາຍາມຮ້ອງຂໍ 'bounded-floor' ກ່ອນ, ຈາກນັ້ນ\n"
"\t# ຈຶ່ງຖອຍມາເປັນ 'local-floor' ແລະ ສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນ 'local' ຫາກບໍ່ມີອັນອື່ນຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"\twebxr_interface.requested_reference_space_types = 'bounded-floor, local-"
"floor, local'\n"
"\t# ເພື່ອທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ 'local-floor' ຫຼື 'bounded-floor' ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງ\n"
"\t# ກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດນັ້ນວ່າຈຳເປັນ (required) ຫຼື ເປັນທາງເລືອກ (optional). ໂດຍການຮວມ 'hand-"
"tracking'\n"
"\t# ເປັນຄຸນສົມບັດທາງເລືອກ, ມັນຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ຫາກມີການຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"\twebxr_interface.required_features = 'local-floor'\n"
"\twebxr_interface.optional_features = 'bounded-floor, hand-tracking'\n"
"\n"
"\t# ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ false ຫາກພວກເຮົາບໍ່ສາມາດຮ້ອງຂໍເຊດຊັນໄດ້,\n"
"\t# ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ມັນຍັງສາມາດຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວແບບ asynchronous ໄດ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ,\n"
"\t# ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈະຮູ້ວ່າສຳເລັດ ຫຼື ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວແທ້ໆ ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອວິທີການ\n"
"\t# _webxr_session_started() ຫຼື _webxr_session_failed() ຂອງພວກເຮົາຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້.\n"
"\tif not webxr_interface.initialize():\n"
"\t\tOS.alert(\"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ\")\n"
"\t\treturn\n"
"\n"
"func _webxr_session_started():\n"
"\t$Button.visible = false\n"
"\t# ສ່ວນນີ້ບອກໃຫ້ Godot ເລີ່ມການເຣັນເດີໄປຍັງເຮດເຊັດ (headset).\n"
"\tget_viewport().use_xr = true\n"
"\t# ນີ້ຈະເປັນປະເພດພື້ນທີ່ອ້າງອີງທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ຮັບໃນທີ່ສຸດ ຈາກປະເພດທີ່ເຈົ້າຮ້ອງຂໍໄປຂ້າງເທິງ.\n"
"\t# ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເກມເຮັດວຽກຕ່າງກັນລະຫວ່າງ 'bounded-floor' ກັບ 'local-"
"floor'.\n"
"\tprint(\"ປະເພດພື້ນທີ່ອ້າງອີງ: \", webxr_interface.reference_space_type)\n"
"\t# ນີ້ຈະເປັນລາຍຊື່ຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ຢ່າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ\n"
"\t# (ຍົກເວັ້ນໃນບຣາວເຊີທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້).\n"
"\tprint(\"ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້: \", webxr_interface.enabled_features)\n"
"\n"
"func _webxr_session_ended():\n"
"\t$Button.visible = true\n"
"\t# ຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ອອກຈາກໂໝດ immersive, ພວກເຮົາຈະບອກໃຫ້ Godot ກັບມາເຣັນເດີ\n"
"\t# ໃນໜ້າເວັບຄືເກົ່າ.\n"
"\tget_viewport().use_xr = false\n"
"\n"
"func _webxr_session_failed(message):\n"
"\tOS.alert(\"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ: \" + message)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ມີສອງສາມວິທີໃນການຈັດການ input ຂອງ \"controller\":\n"
"- ການໃຊ້ [XRController3D] nodes ແລະ ສັນຍານ [signal "
"XRController3D.button_pressed] ແລະ [signal XRController3D.button_released] "
"ຂອງພວກມັນ. ນີ້ຄືວິທີການປົກກະຕິໃນການຈັດການຄອນໂທຣເລີໃນແອັບ XR ໃນ Godot, ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ວິທີນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບຄອນໂທຣເລີ VR ລະດັບສູງ ເຊັ່ນ: Oculus Touch ຫຼື Index controllers ເປັນຕົ້ນ.\n"
"- ການໃຊ້ [signal select], [signal squeeze] ແລະ ສັນຍານທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. "
"ວິທີນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ທັງຄອນໂທຣເລີ VR ລະດັບສູງ ແລະ ແຫຼ່ງ input ແບບອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ການແຕະໜ້າຈໍ, ຄຳສັ່ງສຽງ ຫຼື "
"ການກົດປຸ່ມຢູ່ເທິງຕົວອຸປະກອນເອງ.\n"
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ທັງສອງວິທີເພື່ອໃຫ້ເກມ ຫຼື ແອັບຂອງເຈົ້າຮອງຮັບອຸປະກອນ ແລະ ວິທີການ input ທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ຫຼື "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີການໂຕ້ຕອບທີ່ລະອຽດຂຶ້ນກັບອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງ."

msgid "How to make a VR game for WebXR with Godot 4"
msgstr "ວິທີສ້າງເກມ VR ສຳລັບ WebXR ດ້ວຍ Godot 4"

msgid ""
"Returns display refresh rates supported by the current HMD. Only returned if "
"this feature is supported by the web browser and after the interface has been "
"initialized."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊໜ້າຈໍ (refresh rates) ທີ່ຮອງຮັບໂດຍ HMD ປັດຈຸບັນ. "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍເວັບບຣາວເຊີ ແລະ ຫຼັງຈາກອິນເຕີເຟສຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the display refresh rate for the current HMD. Not supported on all "
"HMDs and browsers. It may not report an accurate value until after using "
"[method set_display_refresh_rate]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊໜ້າຈໍສຳລັບ HMD ປັດຈຸບັນ. ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນທຸກ HMD ແລະ ບຣາວເຊີ. "
"ມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ລາຍງານຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຈົນກວ່າຈະມີການໃຊ້ [method set_display_refresh_rate]."

msgid ""
"Returns the target ray mode for the given [param input_source_id].\n"
"This can help interpret the input coming from that input source. See "
"[url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/XRInputSource/"
"targetRayMode]XRInputSource.targetRayMode[/url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ target ray mode ສຳລັບ [param input_source_id] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃນການແປຄວາມໝາຍ input ທີ່ມາຈາກແຫຼ່ງນັ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/XRInputSource/"
"targetRayMode]XRInputSource.targetRayMode[/url] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Gets an [XRControllerTracker] for the given [param input_source_id].\n"
"In the context of WebXR, an input source can be an advanced VR controller "
"like the Oculus Touch or Index controllers, or even a tap on the screen, a "
"spoken voice command or a button press on the device itself. When a non-"
"traditional input source is used, interpret the position and orientation of "
"the [XRPositionalTracker] as a ray pointing at the object the user wishes to "
"interact with.\n"
"Use this method to get information about the input source that triggered one "
"of these signals:\n"
"- [signal selectstart]\n"
"- [signal select]\n"
"- [signal selectend]\n"
"- [signal squeezestart]\n"
"- [signal squeeze]\n"
"- [signal squeezestart]"
msgstr ""
"ດຶງ [XRControllerTracker] ສຳລັບ [param input_source_id] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້.\n"
"ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງ WebXR, ແຫຼ່ງ input ສາມາດເປັນຄອນໂທຣເລີ VR ລະດັບສູງ ເຊັ່ນ: Oculus Touch ຫຼື "
"Index controllers, ຫຼື ແມ່ນແຕ່ການແຕະໜ້າຈໍ, ຄຳສັ່ງສຽງ ຫຼື ການກົດປຸ່ມຢູ່ເທິງຕົວອຸປະກອນເອງ. "
"ເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ແຫຼ່ງ input ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບດັ້ງເດີມ, ໃຫ້ແປຄວາມໝາຍຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ທິດທາງຂອງ "
"[XRPositionalTracker] ເປັນເສັ້ນລັງສີ (ray) ທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຍັງວັດຖຸທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງການໂຕ້ຕອບດ້ວຍ.\n"
"ໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້ເພື່ອຮັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບແຫຼ່ງ input ທີ່ກະຕຸ້ນໜຶ່ງໃນສັນຍານເຫຼົ່ານີ້:\n"
"- [signal selectstart]\n"
"- [signal select]\n"
"- [signal selectend]\n"
"- [signal squeezestart]\n"
"- [signal squeeze]\n"
"- [signal squeezestart]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is an active input source with the given "
"[param input_source_id]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກມີແຫຼ່ງ input ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ດ້ວຍ [param input_source_id] "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Checks if the given [param session_mode] is supported by the user's browser.\n"
"Possible values come from [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/"
"API/XRSessionMode]WebXR's XRSessionMode[/url], including: [code]\"immersive-"
"vr\"[/code], [code]\"immersive-ar\"[/code], and [code]\"inline\"[/code].\n"
"This method returns nothing, instead it emits the [signal session_supported] "
"signal with the result."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບວ່າ [param session_mode] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ນັ້ນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍບຣາວເຊີຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ແມ່ນມາຈາກ [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/"
"XRSessionMode]WebXR's XRSessionMode[/url], ເຊິ່ງລວມມີ: [code]\"immersive-vr\"[/"
"code], [code]\"immersive-ar\"[/code], ແລະ [code]\"inline\"[/code].\n"
"ວິທີການນີ້ບໍ່ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າໃດໆ, ແຕ່ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານ [signal session_supported] ພ້ອມກັບຜົນການກວດສອບ."

msgid ""
"Sets the display refresh rate for the current HMD. Not supported on all HMDs "
"and browsers. It won't take effect right away until after [signal "
"display_refresh_rate_changed] is emitted."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊໜ້າຈໍສຳລັບ HMD ປັດຈຸບັນ. ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນທຸກ HMD ແລະ ບຣາວເຊີ. "
"ມັນຈະຍັງບໍ່ມີຜົນທັນທີຈົນກວ່າສັນຍານ [signal display_refresh_rate_changed] ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"The reference space type (from the list of requested types set in the [member "
"requested_reference_space_types] property), that was ultimately used by "
"[method XRInterface.initialize] when setting up the WebXR session.\n"
"Possible values come from [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/"
"API/XRReferenceSpaceType]WebXR's XRReferenceSpaceType[/url]. If you want to "
"use a particular reference space type, it must be listed in either [member "
"required_features] or [member optional_features]."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດພື້ນທີ່ອ້າງອີງ (ຈາກລາຍຊື່ປະເພດທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍເຊິ່ງຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນຄຸນສົມບັດ [member "
"requested_reference_space_types]), ທີ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນທີ່ສຸດໂດຍ [method "
"XRInterface.initialize] ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊດຊັນ WebXR.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ແມ່ນມາຈາກ [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/"
"XRReferenceSpaceType]WebXR's XRReferenceSpaceType[/url]. "
"ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ປະເພດພື້ນທີ່ອ້າງອີງສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ, ມັນຕ້ອງຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ [member "
"required_features] ຫຼື [member optional_features]."

msgid ""
"The session mode used by [method XRInterface.initialize] when setting up the "
"WebXR session.\n"
"This doesn't have any effect on the interface when already initialized.\n"
"Possible values come from [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/"
"API/XRSessionMode]WebXR's XRSessionMode[/url], including: [code]\"immersive-"
"vr\"[/code], [code]\"immersive-ar\"[/code], and [code]\"inline\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດເຊດຊັນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [method XRInterface.initialize] ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊດຊັນ WebXR.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເຟສເມື່ອມັນຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄປແລ້ວ.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ແມ່ນມາຈາກ [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/"
"XRSessionMode]WebXR's XRSessionMode[/url], ເຊິ່ງລວມມີ: [code]\"immersive-vr\"[/"
"code], [code]\"immersive-ar\"[/code], ແລະ [code]\"inline\"[/code]."

msgid ""
"Indicates if the WebXR session's imagery is visible to the user.\n"
"Possible values come from [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/"
"API/XRVisibilityState]WebXR's XRVisibilityState[/url], including [code]"
"\"hidden\"[/code], [code]\"visible\"[/code], and [code]\"visible-blurred\"[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸວ່າພາບຂອງເຊດຊັນ WebXR ນັ້ນຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ແມ່ນມາຈາກ [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/"
"XRVisibilityState]WebXR's XRVisibilityState[/url], ເຊິ່ງລວມມີ [code]\"hidden\"[/"
"code], [code]\"visible\"[/code], ແລະ [code]\"visible-blurred\"[/code]."

msgid "Emitted after the display's refresh rate has changed."
msgstr "ຖືກສົ່ງອອກຫຼັງຈາກອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊຂອງໜ້າຈໍປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted to indicate that the reference space has been reset or reconfigured.\n"
"When (or whether) this is emitted depends on the user's browser or device, "
"but may include when the user has changed the dimensions of their play space "
"(which you may be able to access via [method XRInterface.get_play_area]) or "
"pressed/held a button to recenter their position.\n"
"See [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/XRReferenceSpace/"
"reset_event]WebXR's XRReferenceSpace reset event[/url] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າພື້ນທີ່ອ້າງອີງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນແປງຄ່າ.\n"
"ການສົ່ງສັນຍານນີ້ (ຫຼື ຈະສົ່ງຫຼືບໍ່) ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບບຣາວເຊີ ຫຼື ອຸປະກອນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້, "
"ແຕ່ອາດຮວມເຖິງຕອນທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ່ຽນແປງຂະໜາດຂອງພື້ນທີ່ຫຼິ້ນ (ເຊິ່ງເຈົ້າອາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານ [method "
"XRInterface.get_play_area]) ຫຼື ການກົດ/ກົດຄ້າງປຸ່ມເພື່ອຕັ້ງຕຳແໜ່ງໃໝ່ (recenter).\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/XRReferenceSpace/"
"reset_event]WebXR's XRReferenceSpace reset event[/url] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Emitted after one of the input sources has finished its \"primary action\".\n"
"Use [method get_input_source_tracker] and [method "
"get_input_source_target_ray_mode] to get more information about the input "
"source."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກຫຼັງຈາກໜຶ່ງໃນແຫຼ່ງ input ສິ້ນສຸດ \"ການກະທຳຫຼັກ\" (primary action) ຂອງມັນ.\n"
"ໃຊ້ [method get_input_source_tracker] ແລະ [method "
"get_input_source_target_ray_mode] ເພື່ອຮັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແຫຼ່ງ input ນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when one of the input sources has finished its \"primary action\".\n"
"Use [method get_input_source_tracker] and [method "
"get_input_source_target_ray_mode] to get more information about the input "
"source."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອໜຶ່ງໃນແຫຼ່ງ input ສິ້ນສຸດ \"ການກະທຳຫຼັກ\" (primary action).\n"
"ໃຊ້ [method get_input_source_tracker] ແລະ [method "
"get_input_source_target_ray_mode] ເພື່ອຮັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແຫຼ່ງ input ນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when one of the input source has started its \"primary action\".\n"
"Use [method get_input_source_tracker] and [method "
"get_input_source_target_ray_mode] to get more information about the input "
"source."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອໜຶ່ງໃນແຫຼ່ງ input ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ \"ການກະທຳຫຼັກ\" (primary action).\n"
"ໃຊ້ [method get_input_source_tracker] ແລະ [method "
"get_input_source_target_ray_mode] ເພື່ອຮັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແຫຼ່ງ input ນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the user ends the WebXR session (which can be done using UI from "
"the browser or device).\n"
"At this point, you should do [code]get_viewport().use_xr = false[/code] to "
"instruct Godot to resume rendering to the screen."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ສິ້ນສຸດເຊດຊັນ WebXR (ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຜ່ານ UI ຂອງບຣາວເຊີ ຫຼື ອຸປະກອນ).\n"
"ໃນຈຸດນີ້, ເຈົ້າຄວນຕັ້ງ [code]get_viewport().use_xr = false[/code] ເພື່ອບອກໃຫ້ Godot "
"ກັບມາເຣັນເດີໃນໜ້າຈໍປົກກະຕິ."

msgid ""
"Emitted by [method XRInterface.initialize] if the session fails to start.\n"
"[param message] may optionally contain an error message from WebXR, or an "
"empty string if no message is available."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກໂດຍ [method XRInterface.initialize] ຫາກເຊດຊັນບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້.\n"
"[param message] ອາດຈະມີຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຈາກ WebXR (ຖ້າມີ), ຫຼື ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Emitted by [method XRInterface.initialize] if the session is successfully "
"started.\n"
"At this point, it's safe to do [code]get_viewport().use_xr = true[/code] to "
"instruct Godot to start rendering to the XR device."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກໂດຍ [method XRInterface.initialize] ຫາກເຊດຊັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ຢ່າງສຳເລັດ.\n"
"ໃນຈຸດນີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງ [code]get_viewport().use_xr = true[/code] "
"ໄດ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພເພື່ອບອກໃຫ້ Godot ເລີ່ມການເຣັນເດີໄປຍັງອຸປະກອນ XR."

msgid ""
"Emitted by [method is_session_supported] to indicate if the given [param "
"session_mode] is supported or not."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກໂດຍ [method is_session_supported] ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າ [param session_mode] "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ນັ້ນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Emitted after one of the input sources has finished its \"primary squeeze "
"action\".\n"
"Use [method get_input_source_tracker] and [method "
"get_input_source_target_ray_mode] to get more information about the input "
"source."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກຫຼັງຈາກໜຶ່ງໃນແຫຼ່ງ input ສິ້ນສຸດ \"ການກະທຳບີບຫຼັກ\" (primary squeeze action).\n"
"ໃຊ້ [method get_input_source_tracker] ແລະ [method "
"get_input_source_target_ray_mode] ເພື່ອຮັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແຫຼ່ງ input ນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when one of the input sources has finished its \"primary squeeze "
"action\".\n"
"Use [method get_input_source_tracker] and [method "
"get_input_source_target_ray_mode] to get more information about the input "
"source."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອໜຶ່ງໃນແຫຼ່ງ input ສິ້ນສຸດ \"ການກະທຳບີບຫຼັກ\" (primary squeeze action).\n"
"ໃຊ້ [method get_input_source_tracker] ແລະ [method "
"get_input_source_target_ray_mode] ເພື່ອຮັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແຫຼ່ງ input ນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when one of the input sources has started its \"primary squeeze "
"action\".\n"
"Use [method get_input_source_tracker] and [method "
"get_input_source_target_ray_mode] to get more information about the input "
"source."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອໜຶ່ງໃນແຫຼ່ງ input ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ \"ການກະທຳບີບຫຼັກ\" (primary squeeze action).\n"
"ໃຊ້ [method get_input_source_tracker] ແລະ [method "
"get_input_source_target_ray_mode] ເພື່ອຮັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແຫຼ່ງ input ນັ້ນ."

msgid "Emitted when [member visibility_state] has changed."
msgstr "ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອ [member visibility_state] ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "We don't know the target ray mode."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ target ray mode."

msgid ""
"Target ray originates at the viewer's eyes and points in the direction they "
"are looking."
msgstr ""
"ລັງສີເປົ້າໝາຍ (Target ray) ມີຕົ້ນກຳເນີດມາຈາກດວງຕາຂອງຜູ້ເບິ່ງ ແລະ "
"ຊີ້ໄປໃນທິດທາງທີ່ພວກເຂົາກຳລັງເບິ່ງຢູ່."

msgid "Target ray from a handheld pointer, most likely a VR touch controller."
msgstr "Target ray ຈາກຕົວຊີ້ທີ່ຖືຢູ່ໃນມື, ສ່ວນຫຼາຍມັກຈະເປັນ VR touch controller."

msgid "Target ray from touch screen, mouse or other tactile input device."
msgstr "Target ray ຈາກໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດ, ເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ອຸປະກອນ input ແບບສຳຜັດອື່ນໆ."

msgid "Base class for all windows, dialogs, and popups."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ (windows), ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ (dialogs), ແລະ ປັອບອັບ (popups) ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"A node that creates a window. The window can either be a native system window "
"or embedded inside another [Window] (see [member "
"Viewport.gui_embed_subwindows]).\n"
"At runtime, [Window]s will not close automatically when requested. You need "
"to handle it manually using the [signal close_requested] signal (this applies "
"both to pressing the close button and clicking outside of a popup)."
msgstr ""
"ນົດທີ່ສ້າງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ. ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຂອງລະບົບ (native window) ຫຼື ຝັງຢູ່ພາຍໃນ "
"[Window] ອື່ນ (ເບິ່ງ [member Viewport.gui_embed_subwindows]).\n"
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກ, [Window] ຈະບໍ່ປິດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍ. "
"ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຈັດການມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ສັນຍານ [signal close_requested] "
"(ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ທັງການກົດປຸ່ມປິດ ແລະ ການຄລິກນອກປັອບອັບ)."

msgid "HDR output"
msgstr "HDR ເອົາພຸດ"

msgid "Multiple Windows demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການໃຊ້ຫຼາຍປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ"

msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. Overrides the value returned by "
"[method get_contents_minimum_size]."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການສະເໝືອນ (Virtual method) ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງຂຽນເອງ. ມັນຈະຂຽນທັບ (override) ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນໂດຍ "
"[method get_contents_minimum_size]."

msgid ""
"Creates a local override for a theme [Color] with the specified [param name]. "
"Local overrides always take precedence when fetching theme items for the "
"control. An override can be removed with [method "
"remove_theme_color_override].\n"
"See also [method get_theme_color] and [method "
"Control.add_theme_color_override] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງການຂຽນທັບທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local override) ສຳລັບ [Color] ຂອງທິມດ້ວຍ [param name] ທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ການຂຽນທັບທ້ອງຖິ່ນຈະມີລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງສຸດສະເໝີເມື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນທິມສຳລັບຄອນໂທຣລ. "
"ສາມາດລຶບການຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method remove_theme_color_override].\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ແລະ [method Control.add_theme_color_override] "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Creates a local override for a theme [StyleBox] with the specified [param "
"name]. Local overrides always take precedence when fetching theme items for "
"the control. An override can be removed with [method "
"remove_theme_stylebox_override].\n"
"See also [method get_theme_stylebox] and [method "
"Control.add_theme_stylebox_override] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງການຂຽນທັບທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບ [StyleBox] ຂອງທິມດ້ວຍ [param name] ທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ການຂຽນທັບທ້ອງຖິ່ນຈະມີລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງສຸດສະເໝີເມື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນທິມສຳລັບຄອນໂທຣລ. "
"ສາມາດລຶບການຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method remove_theme_stylebox_override].\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_stylebox] ແລະ [method "
"Control.add_theme_stylebox_override] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "Returns whether the window is being drawn to the screen."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າປ່ອງຢ້ຽມກຳລັງຖືກສະແດງຜົນຢູ່ເທິງໜ້າຈໍຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Requests an update of the [Window] size to fit underlying [Control] nodes."
msgstr "ຮ້ອງຂໍການອັບເດດຂະໜາດຂອງ [Window] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບນົດ [Control] ທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the combined minimum size from the child [Control] nodes of the "
"window. Use [method child_controls_changed] to update it when child nodes "
"have changed.\n"
"The value returned by this method can be overridden with [method "
"_get_contents_minimum_size]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ຮວມກັນຈາກນົດ [Control] ທີ່ເປັນລູກຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ. ໃຊ້ [method "
"child_controls_changed] ເພື່ອອັບເດດມັນເມື່ອນົດລູກມີການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນໂດຍວິທີການນີ້ສາມາດຂຽນທັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method _get_contents_minimum_size]."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the [param flag] is set."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ [param flag] ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້."

msgid "Returns the focused window."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກໂຟກັສຢູ່."

msgid "Returns layout direction and text writing direction."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນທິດທາງການຈັດວາງ (layout direction) ແລະ ທິດທາງການຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the maximum value for linear color components that can be displayed "
"in this window, regardless of SDR or HDR output. Returns [code]1.0[/code] if "
"HDR is not enabled or not supported. The [signal "
"output_max_linear_value_changed] signal will be emitted whenever this value "
"changes.\n"
"This value is used by tonemapping and other [Environment] effects to ensure "
"that bright colors are presented in the range that can be displayed by this "
"window. When using this maximum linear value in your project, it should only "
"be used to present colors directly to the screen without tonemapping and "
"without influencing lighting, post-processing effects, or surrounding color. "
"The following is an example that produces the brightest purple color that the "
"screen can produce:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _process(_delta):\n"
"\t# output_max_linear_value may change often, so do this every frame.\n"
"\tvar max_linear_value = get_window().get_output_max_linear_value()\n"
"\t# Replace this with your color:\n"
"\tvar original_color = Color.PURPLE\n"
"\t# Normalize to max_linear_value to produce the brightest color possible,\n"
"\t# regardless of SDR or HDR output:\n"
"\tvar bright_color = normalize_color(original_color, max_linear_value)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func normalize_color(srgb_color, max_linear_value = 1.0):\n"
"\t# Color must be linear-encoded to use math operations.\n"
"\tvar linear_color = srgb_color.srgb_to_linear()\n"
"\tvar max_rgb_value = maxf(linear_color.r, maxf(linear_color.g, "
"linear_color.b))\n"
"\tvar brightness_scale = max_linear_value / max_rgb_value\n"
"\tlinear_color *= brightness_scale\n"
"\t# Undo changes to the alpha channel, which should not be modified.\n"
"\tlinear_color.a = srgb_color.a\n"
"\t# Convert back to nonlinear sRGB encoding, which is required for Color in\n"
"\t# Godot unless stated otherwise.\n"
"\treturn linear_color.linear_to_srgb()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You will need to convert sRGB colors to linear before "
"multiplying by this value to get correct results."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສູງສຸດສຳລັບສ່ວນປະກອບສີແບບ linear ທີ່ສາມາດສະແດງຜົນໄດ້ໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມນີ້, "
"ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນການສະແດງຜົນແບບ SDR ຫຼື HDR. ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]1.0[/code] ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ HDR ຫຼື "
"ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ. ສັນຍານ [signal output_max_linear_value_changed] "
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ຄ່ານີ້ປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"ຄ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ tonemapping ແລະ ເອັບເຟັກ [Environment] "
"ອື່ນໆເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າສີທີ່ສະຫວ່າງຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມນີ້ສາມາດສະແດງໄດ້. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າ linear "
"ສູງສຸດນີ້ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ, ມັນຄວນໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງສີໄປຍັງໜ້າຈໍໂດຍກົງໂດຍບໍ່ຜ່ານ tonemapping ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ແສງສະຫວ່າງ, ເອັບເຟັກ post-processing, ຫຼື ສີອ້ອມຂ້າງ. "
"ນີ້ຄືຕົວຢ່າງການສ້າງສີມ່ວງທີ່ສະຫວ່າງທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ໜ້າຈໍຈະສະແດງໄດ້:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _process(_delta):\n"
"\t# output_max_linear_value ອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງເລື້ອຍໆ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ເຮັດແບບນີ້ໃນທຸກເຟຣມ.\n"
"\tvar max_linear_value = get_window().get_output_max_linear_value()\n"
"\t# ປ່ຽນເປັນສີທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ:\n"
"\tvar original_color = Color.PURPLE\n"
"\t# ປັບຄ່າໃຫ້ເປັນ Normalize ຕາມ max_linear_value ເພື່ອສ້າງສີທີ່ສະຫວ່າງທີ່ສຸດ,\n"
"\t# ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່າຈະເປັນ SDR ຫຼື HDR:\n"
"\tvar bright_color = normalize_color(original_color, max_linear_value)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func normalize_color(srgb_color, max_linear_value = 1.0):\n"
"\t# ສີຕ້ອງຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ linear ເພື່ອໃຊ້ການຄຳນວນທາງຄະນິດສາດ.\n"
"\tvar linear_color = srgb_color.srgb_to_linear()\n"
"\tvar max_rgb_value = maxf(linear_color.r, maxf(linear_color.g, "
"linear_color.b))\n"
"\tvar brightness_scale = max_linear_value / max_rgb_value\n"
"\tlinear_color *= brightness_scale\n"
"\t# ຍົກເລີກການປ່ຽນແປງໃນ alpha channel, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ຄວນຖືກແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"\tlinear_color.a = srgb_color.a\n"
"\t# ແປງກັບໄປເປັນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ sRGB ແບບ nonlinear, ເຊິ່ງຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ Color ໃນ\n"
"\t# Godot ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ຈະລະບຸເປັນຢ່າງອື່ນ.\n"
"\treturn linear_color.linear_to_srgb()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງແປງສີ sRGB ໃຫ້ເປັນ linear ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຄູນດ້ວຍຄ່ານີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the window's position including its border.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member visible] is [code]false[/code], this method returns "
"the same value as [member position]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມລວມທັງຂອບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກ [member visible] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບ [member position]."

msgid ""
"Returns the window's size including its border.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member visible] is [code]false[/code], this method returns "
"the same value as [member size]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມລວມທັງຂອບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກ [member visible] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ວິທີການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບ [member size]."

msgid ""
"Returns the default base scale value from the first matching [Theme] in the "
"tree if that [Theme] has a valid [member Theme.default_base_scale] value.\n"
"See [method Control.get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສະເກລພື້ນຖານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (default base scale) ຈາກ [Theme] ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ຫາກ "
"[Theme] ນັ້ນມີຄ່າ [member Theme.default_base_scale] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method Control.get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the default font from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that "
"[Theme] has a valid [member Theme.default_font] value.\n"
"See [method Control.get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ [Theme] ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ຫາກ [Theme] ນັ້ນມີຄ່າ [member "
"Theme.default_font] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method Control.get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the default font size value from the first matching [Theme] in the "
"tree if that [Theme] has a valid [member Theme.default_font_size] value.\n"
"See [method Control.get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ [Theme] ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ຫາກ [Theme] ນັ້ນມີຄ່າ [member "
"Theme.default_font_size] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method Control.get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Font] from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that [Theme] "
"has a font item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method Control.get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Font] ຈາກ [Theme] ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ຫາກ [Theme] ນັ້ນມີລາຍການຟອນທີ່ມີ [param "
"name] ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method Control.get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns a font size from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that "
"[Theme] has a font size item with the specified [param name] and [param "
"theme_type].\n"
"See [method Control.get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດຟອນຈາກ [Theme] ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ຫາກ [Theme] ນັ້ນມີລາຍການຂະໜາດຟອນທີ່ມີ "
"[param name] ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method Control.get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns an icon from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that [Theme] "
"has an icon item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method Control.get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໄອຄອນຈາກ [Theme] ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ຫາກ [Theme] ນັ້ນມີລາຍການໄອຄອນທີ່ມີ [param "
"name] ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method Control.get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [StyleBox] from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that "
"[Theme] has a stylebox item with the specified [param name] and [param "
"theme_type].\n"
"See [method Control.get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [StyleBox] ຈາກ [Theme] ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ຫາກ [Theme] ນັ້ນມີລາຍການ stylebox "
"ທີ່ມີ [param name] ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method Control.get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid "Returns the ID of the window."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ."

msgid "Causes the window to grab focus, allowing it to receive user input."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມດຶງໂຟກັສມາ, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມັນສາມາດຮັບ input ຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the window is focused."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກປ່ອງຢ້ຽມກຳລັງຖືກໂຟກັສຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a matching [Theme] in the tree that has "
"a color item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method Control.get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກມີ [Theme] ທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ທີ່ມີລາຍການສີພ້ອມກັບ [param name] "
"ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method Control.get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a matching [Theme] in the tree that has "
"a constant item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method Control.get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກມີ [Theme] ທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ທີ່ມີລາຍການຄ່າຄົງທີ່ພ້ອມກັບ [param "
"name] ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method Control.get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Hides the window. This is not the same as minimized state. Hidden window "
"can't be interacted with and needs to be made visible with [method show]."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ຄືກັບສະຖານະຫຍໍ້ (minimized). ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໂຕ້ຕອບໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ຕ້ອງເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນກັບມາສະແດງຜົນ (visible) ດ້ວຍ [method show]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the window is currently embedded in another "
"window."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຖືກຝັງຢູ່ໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມອື່ນ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the layout is right-to-left."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກການຈັດວາງເປັນແບບຂວາໄປຊ້າຍ (right-to-left)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the window can be maximized (the maximize button "
"is enabled)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກປ່ອງຢ້ຽມສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍເຕັມຈໍໄດ້ (ປຸ່ມ maximize ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if font oversampling is enabled. See [method "
"set_use_font_oversampling]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ font oversampling. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_use_font_oversampling]."

msgid ""
"Centers the window in the current screen. If the window is embedded, it is "
"centered in the embedder [Viewport] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມໃຫ້ຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງໜ້າຈໍປັດຈຸບັນ. ຫາກປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຖືກຝັງຢູ່, ມັນຈະຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງຂອງ [Viewport] "
"ທີ່ຝັງມັນໄວ້ແທນ."

msgid "Use [method Window.grab_focus] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method Window.grab_focus] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Shows the [Window] and makes it transient (see [member transient]). If [param "
"rect] is provided, it will be set as the [Window]'s size. Fails if called on "
"the main window.\n"
"If [member ProjectSettings.display/window/subwindows/embed_subwindows] is "
"[code]true[/code] (single-window mode), [param rect]'s coordinates are global "
"and relative to the main window's top-left corner (excluding window "
"decorations). If [param rect]'s position coordinates are negative, the window "
"will be located outside the main window and may not be visible as a result.\n"
"If [member ProjectSettings.display/window/subwindows/embed_subwindows] is "
"[code]false[/code] (multi-window mode), [param rect]'s coordinates are global "
"and relative to the top-left corner of the leftmost screen. If [param rect]'s "
"position coordinates are negative, the window will be placed at the top-left "
"corner of the screen.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param rect] must be in global coordinates if specified."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງ [Window] ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເປັນແບບຊົ່ວຄາວ (transient) (ເບິ່ງ [member transient]). "
"ຫາກມີການລະບຸ [param rect], ມັນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຂະໜາດຂອງ [Window]. "
"ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຫາກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ກັບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຫຼັກ (main window).\n"
"ຫາກ [member ProjectSettings.display/window/subwindows/embed_subwindows] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] (ໂໝດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມດຽວ), ພິກັດຂອງ [param rect] ຈະເປັນແບບ global ແລະ "
"ທຽບກັບມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຫຼັກ (ບໍ່ຮວມສ່ວນຕົກແຕ່ງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ). ຫາກພິກັດຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ [param rect] "
"ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຈະຢູ່ນອກປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຫຼັກ ແລະ ອາດຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນ.\n"
"ຫາກ [member ProjectSettings.display/window/subwindows/embed_subwindows] ເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code] (ໂໝດຫຼາຍປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ), ພິກັດຂອງ [param rect] ຈະເປັນແບບ global ແລະ "
"ທຽບກັບມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍຊ້າຍສຸດ. ຫາກພິກັດຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ [param rect] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, "
"ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param rect] ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນພິກັດ global ຫາກມີການລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Popups the [Window] at the center of the current screen, with optionally "
"given minimum size. If the [Window] is embedded, it will be centered in the "
"parent [Viewport] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Calling it with the default value of [param minsize] is "
"equivalent to calling it with [member size]."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງປັອບອັບ [Window] ຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງໜ້າຈໍປັດຈຸບັນ, ພ້ອມທັງສາມາດກຳນົດຂະໜາດຕໍ່າສຸດໄດ້. ຫາກ [Window] "
"ຖືກຝັງຢູ່, ມັນຈະຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງຂອງ [Viewport] ຂອງພໍ່ມັນແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [param minsize] ຈະມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ດ້ວຍ "
"[member size]."

msgid ""
"Popups the [Window] centered inside its parent [Window]. [param "
"fallback_ratio] determines the maximum size of the [Window], in relation to "
"its parent.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Calling it with the default value of [param minsize] is "
"equivalent to calling it with [member size]."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງປັອບອັບ [Window] ຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງພາຍໃນ [Window] ຂອງພໍ່ມັນ. [param fallback_ratio] "
"ຈະກຳນົດຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງ [Window] ເມື່ອທຽບກັບພໍ່ຂອງມັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [param minsize] ຈະມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ດ້ວຍ "
"[member size]."

msgid ""
"If [Window] is embedded, popups the [Window] centered inside its embedder and "
"sets its size as a [param ratio] of embedder's size.\n"
"If [Window] is a native window, popups the [Window] centered inside the "
"screen of its parent [Window] and sets its size as a [param ratio] of the "
"screen size."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກ [Window] ຖືກຝັງຢູ່, ຈະສະແດງປັອບອັບ [Window] ຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງພາຍໃນຕົວຝັງ (embedder) ແລະ "
"ຕັ້ງຂະໜາດເປັນອັດຕາສ່ວນ [param ratio] ຂອງຂະໜາດຕົວຝັງ.\n"
"ຫາກ [Window] ເປັນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຂອງລະບົບ (native window), ຈະສະແດງປັອບອັບ [Window] "
"ຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງພາຍໃນໜ້າຈໍຂອງ [Window] ພໍ່ຂອງມັນ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຂະໜາດເປັນອັດຕາສ່ວນ [param ratio] "
"ຂອງຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"Attempts to parent this dialog to the last exclusive window relative to "
"[param from_node], and then calls [method Window.popup] on it. The dialog "
"must have no current parent, otherwise the method fails.\n"
"See also [method set_unparent_when_invisible] and [method "
"Node.get_last_exclusive_window]."
msgstr ""
"ພະຍາຍາມຕັ້ງກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບນີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນລູກຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແບບ exclusive ສຸດທ້າຍໂດຍທຽບກັບ [param "
"from_node], ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງເອີ້ນ [method Window.popup]. ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີພໍ່ (parent) "
"ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນວິທີການນີ້ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method set_unparent_when_invisible] ແລະ [method "
"Node.get_last_exclusive_window] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Attempts to parent this dialog to the last exclusive window relative to "
"[param from_node], and then calls [method Window.popup_centered] on it. The "
"dialog must have no current parent, otherwise the method fails.\n"
"See also [method set_unparent_when_invisible] and [method "
"Node.get_last_exclusive_window]."
msgstr ""
"ພະຍາຍາມຕັ້ງກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບນີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນລູກຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແບບ exclusive ສຸດທ້າຍໂດຍທຽບກັບ [param "
"from_node], ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງເອີ້ນ [method Window.popup_centered]. ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີພໍ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, "
"ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນວິທີການນີ້ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method set_unparent_when_invisible] ແລະ [method "
"Node.get_last_exclusive_window] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Attempts to parent this dialog to the last exclusive window relative to "
"[param from_node], and then calls [method Window.popup_centered_clamped] on "
"it. The dialog must have no current parent, otherwise the method fails.\n"
"See also [method set_unparent_when_invisible] and [method "
"Node.get_last_exclusive_window]."
msgstr ""
"ພະຍາຍາມຕັ້ງກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບນີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນລູກຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແບບ exclusive ສຸດທ້າຍໂດຍທຽບກັບ [param "
"from_node], ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງເອີ້ນ [method Window.popup_centered_clamped]. "
"ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີພໍ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນວິທີການນີ້ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method set_unparent_when_invisible] ແລະ [method "
"Node.get_last_exclusive_window] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Attempts to parent this dialog to the last exclusive window relative to "
"[param from_node], and then calls [method Window.popup_centered_ratio] on it. "
"The dialog must have no current parent, otherwise the method fails.\n"
"See also [method set_unparent_when_invisible] and [method "
"Node.get_last_exclusive_window]."
msgstr ""
"ພະຍາຍາມຕັ້ງກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບນີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນລູກຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແບບ exclusive ສຸດທ້າຍໂດຍທຽບກັບ [param "
"from_node], ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງເອີ້ນ [method Window.popup_centered_ratio]. "
"ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີພໍ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນວິທີການນີ້ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method set_unparent_when_invisible] ແລະ [method "
"Node.get_last_exclusive_window] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Attempts to parent this dialog to the last exclusive window relative to "
"[param from_node], and then calls [method Window.popup_on_parent] on it. The "
"dialog must have no current parent, otherwise the method fails.\n"
"See also [method set_unparent_when_invisible] and [method "
"Node.get_last_exclusive_window]."
msgstr ""
"ພະຍາຍາມຕັ້ງກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບນີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນລູກຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແບບ exclusive ສຸດທ້າຍໂດຍທຽບກັບ [param "
"from_node], ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງເອີ້ນ [method Window.popup_on_parent]. "
"ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີພໍ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນວິທີການນີ້ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method set_unparent_when_invisible] ແລະ [method "
"Node.get_last_exclusive_window] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Popups the [Window] with a position shifted by parent [Window]'s position. If "
"the [Window] is embedded, has the same effect as [method popup]."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງປັອບອັບ [Window] ດ້ວຍຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ເລື່ອນໄປຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ [Window] ພໍ່. ຫາກ [Window] "
"ຖືກຝັງຢູ່, ຈະມີຜົນຄືກັບ [method popup]."

msgid ""
"Tells the OS that the [Window] needs an attention. This makes the window "
"stand out in some way depending on the system, e.g. it might blink on the "
"task bar."
msgstr ""
"ບອກລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ (OS) ວ່າ [Window] ນີ້ຕ້ອງການຄວາມສົນໃຈ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມເດັ່ນຂຶ້ນມາໃນບາງຮູບແບບຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບ ເຊັ່ນ: ມັນອາດຈະກະພິບຢູ່ແຖບ task bar."

msgid ""
"Resets the size to the minimum size, which is the max of [member min_size] "
"and (if [member wrap_controls] is enabled) [method "
"get_contents_minimum_size]. This is equivalent to calling "
"[code]set_size(Vector2i())[/code] (or any size below the minimum)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດຄືນໃໝ່ໃຫ້ເປັນຂະໜາດຕໍ່າສຸດ, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າລະຫວ່າງ [member min_size] ແລະ "
"(ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ [member wrap_controls]) [method get_contents_minimum_size]. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເທົ່າກັບການເອີ້ນ [code]set_size(Vector2i())[/code] (ຫຼື ຂະໜາດໃດໆທີ່ຕໍ່າກວ່າຂະໜາດຕໍ່າສຸດ)."

msgid "Sets a specified window flag."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ flag ຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"If [param active] is [code]true[/code], enables system's native IME (Input "
"Method Editor)."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກ [param active] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ IME (Input Method "
"Editor) ຂອງລະບົບ."

msgid "Moves IME to the given position."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍ IME ໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Sets layout direction and text writing direction. Right-to-left layouts are "
"necessary for certain languages (e.g. Arabic and Hebrew)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງທິດທາງການຈັດວາງ ແລະ ທິດທາງການຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ການຈັດວາງແບບຂວາໄປຊ້າຍແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບບາງພາສາ "
"(ເຊັ່ນ: ພາສາອາຣັບ ແລະ ພາສາຮີບຣູ)."

msgid ""
"Sets the type and state of the progress bar on the taskbar/dock icon of the "
"[Window]. See [enum DisplayServer.ProgressState] for possible values and how "
"each mode behaves.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on Windows and macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງປະເພດ ແລະ ສະຖານະຂອງແຖບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າ (progress bar) ເທິງໄອຄອນ taskbar/dock ຂອງ "
"[Window]. ເບິ່ງ [enum DisplayServer.ProgressState] ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງແຕ່ລະໂໝດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Windows ແລະ macOS."

msgid ""
"Creates a progress bar on the taskbar/dock icon of the [Window] if it does "
"not exist, sets the progress of the icon.\n"
"[param value] acts as a relative percentage value, ranges from [code]0.0[/"
"code] (lowest) to [code]1.0[/code] (highest).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on Windows and macOS."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງແຖບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າເທິງໄອຄອນ taskbar/dock ຂອງ [Window] ຫາກຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີ, ແລະ "
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງໄອຄອນ.\n"
"[param value] ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຄ່າເປີເຊັນທີ່ທຽບກັນ, ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງແຕ່ [code]0.0[/code] (ຕໍ່າສຸດ) ຫາ "
"[code]1.0[/code] (ສູງສຸດ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Windows ແລະ macOS."

msgid ""
"If [param unparent] is [code]true[/code], the window is automatically "
"unparented when going invisible.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Make sure to keep a reference to the node, otherwise it will be "
"orphaned. You also need to manually call [method Node.queue_free] to free the "
"window if it's not parented."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກ [param unparent] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຈະຖືກຕັດອອກຈາກພໍ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມັນຖືກເຊື່ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເກັບຄ່າອ້າງອີງຂອງນົດໄວ້, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະກາຍເປັນນົດກຳພ້າ (orphaned). "
"ເຈົ້າຍັງຕ້ອງເອີ້ນ [method Node.queue_free] ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພື່ອລຶບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຫາກມັນບໍ່ມີພໍ່."

msgid ""
"Enables font oversampling. This makes fonts look better when they are scaled "
"up."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ font oversampling. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຟອນເບິ່ງດີຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຖືກຂະຫຍາຍຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Makes the [Window] appear. This enables interactions with the [Window] and "
"doesn't change any of its property other than visibility (unlike e.g. [method "
"popup])."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ [Window] ປະກົດຂຶ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເປີດໃຫ້ສາມາດໂຕ້ຕອບກັບ [Window] ໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງຄຸນສົມບັດອື່ນໆ ນອກຈາກການເບິ່ງເຫັນ (ຕ່າງຈາກ [method popup])."

msgid ""
"Starts an interactive drag operation on the window, using the current mouse "
"position. Call this method when handling a mouse button being pressed to "
"simulate a pressed event on the window's title bar. Using this method allows "
"the window to participate in space switching, tiling, and other system "
"features."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມການລາກປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແບບໂຕ້ຕອບ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕຳແໜ່ງເມົາສ໌ປັດຈຸບັນ. "
"ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້ເມື່ອຈັດການການກົດປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ເພື່ອຈຳລອງເຫດການການກົດຢູ່ເທິງແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ. "
"ການໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມສາມາດໃຊ້ງານຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງລະບົບໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ: ການສະຫຼັບພື້ນທີ່ (space "
"switching) ຫຼື ການຈັດລຽງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ (tiling)."

msgid ""
"Starts an interactive resize operation on the window, using the current mouse "
"position. Call this method when handling a mouse button being pressed to "
"simulate a pressed event on the window's edge."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມການປັບຂະໜາດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແບບໂຕ້ຕອບ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕຳແໜ່ງເມົາສ໌ປັດຈຸບັນ. "
"ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້ເມື່ອຈັດການການກົດປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ເພື່ອຈຳລອງເຫດການການກົດຢູ່ເທິງຂອບຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the window will be on top of all other windows. Does "
"not work if [member transient] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຈະຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມອື່ນໆ ທັງໝົດ. ຈະໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ "
"[member transient]."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the window will have no borders."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຈະບໍ່ມີຂອບ."

msgid ""
"Specifies how the content's aspect behaves when the [Window] is resized. The "
"base aspect is determined by [member content_scale_size]."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງອັດຕາສ່ວນ (aspect) ຂອງເນື້ອຫາເມື່ອ [Window] ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ. "
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນພື້ນຖານແມ່ນກຳນົດໂດຍ [member content_scale_size]."

msgid ""
"Specifies the base scale of [Window]'s content when its [member size] is "
"equal to [member content_scale_size]. See also [method "
"Viewport.get_stretch_transform]."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸສະເກລພື້ນຖານຂອງເນື້ອຫາ [Window] ເມື່ອ [member size] ຂອງມັນເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"content_scale_size]. ເບິ່ງ [method Viewport.get_stretch_transform] ຕື່ມ."

msgid "Specifies how the content is scaled when the [Window] is resized."
msgstr "ລະບຸວິທີການປັບສະເກລເນື້ອຫາເມື່ອ [Window] ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ."

msgid ""
"The content's base size in \"virtual\" pixels. Not to be confused with "
"[member size], which sets the actual window's physical size in pixels. If set "
"to a value greater than [code]0[/code] and [member content_scale_mode] is set "
"to a value other than [constant CONTENT_SCALE_MODE_DISABLED], the [Window]'s "
"content will be scaled when the window is resized to a different size. Higher "
"values will make the content appear [i]smaller[/i], as it will be able to fit "
"more of the project in view. On the root [Window], this is set to match "
"[member ProjectSettings.display/window/size/viewport_width] and [member "
"ProjectSettings.display/window/size/viewport_height] by default.\n"
"For example, when using [constant CONTENT_SCALE_MODE_CANVAS_ITEMS] and "
"[member content_scale_size] set to [code]Vector2i(1280, 720)[/code], using a "
"window size of [code]2560×1440[/code] will make 2D elements appear at double "
"their original size, as the content is scaled by a factor of [code]2.0[/code] "
"([code]2560.0 / 1280.0 = 2.0[/code], [code]1440.0 / 720.0 = 2.0[/code]).\n"
"See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.html#base-"
"size]the Base size section of the Multiple resolutions documentation[/url] "
"for details."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານຂອງເນື້ອຫາເປັນ \"virtual\" pixels. ຢ່າສັບສົນກັບ [member size], "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນການຕັ້ງຂະໜາດທາງກາຍະພາບຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແທ້ໆ ເປັນ pixels. ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0[/"
"code] ແລະ [member content_scale_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [constant "
"CONTENT_SCALE_MODE_DISABLED], ເນື້ອຫາຂອງ [Window] "
"ຈະຖືກປັບສະເກລເມື່ອປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຖືກປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເນື້ອຫາເບິ່ງ [i]ນ້ອຍລົງ[/i], "
"ເພາະວ່າມັນຈະສາມາດບັນຈຸເນື້ອຫາຂອງໂປຣເຈັກໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນມຸມມອງ. ໃນ root [Window], "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ກົງກັບ [member ProjectSettings.display/window/size/viewport_width] "
"ແລະ [member ProjectSettings.display/window/size/viewport_height] ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [constant CONTENT_SCALE_MODE_CANVAS_ITEMS] ແລະ ຕັ້ງ [member "
"content_scale_size] ເປັນ [code]Vector2i(1280, 720)[/code], ການໃຊ້ຂະໜາດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ "
"[code]2560×1440[/code] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ອົງປະກອບ 2D ປະກົດຂຶ້ນເປັນສອງເທົ່າຂອງຂະໜາດເດີມ, "
"ເພາະເນື້ອຫາຖືກປັບສະເກລດ້ວຍຕົວຄູນ [code]2.0[/code] ([code]2560.0 / 1280.0 = 2.0[/"
"code], [code]1440.0 / 720.0 = 2.0[/code]).\n"
"ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດໄດ້ທີ່ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/rendering/"
"multiple_resolutions.html#base-size]ສ່ວນ Base size ຂອງເອກະສານ Multiple "
"resolutions[/url]."

msgid ""
"The policy to use to determine the final scale factor for 2D elements. This "
"affects how [member content_scale_factor] is applied, in addition to the "
"automatic scale factor determined by [member content_scale_size]."
msgstr ""
"ນະໂຍບາຍທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ຕົວຄູນສະເກລສຸດທ້າຍສຳລັບອົງປະກອບ 2D. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການນຳໃຊ້ [member "
"content_scale_factor], ນອກເໜືອໄປຈາກຕົວຄູນສະເກລອັດຕະໂນມັດທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [member "
"content_scale_size]."

msgid "The screen the window is currently on."
msgstr "ໜ້າຈໍທີ່ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມກຳລັງສະແດງຢູ່ປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [Window] is excluded from screenshots taken by "
"[method DisplayServer.screen_get_image], [method "
"DisplayServer.screen_get_image_rect], and [method "
"DisplayServer.screen_get_pixel].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is implemented on macOS and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Enabling this setting will prevent standard screenshot methods "
"from capturing a window image, but does [b]NOT[/b] guarantee that other apps "
"won't be able to capture an image. It should not be used as a DRM or security "
"measure."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], [Window] ຈະຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການແຄັບໜ້າຈໍ (screenshot) ໂດຍ "
"[method DisplayServer.screen_get_image], [method "
"DisplayServer.screen_get_image_rect], ແລະ [method "
"DisplayServer.screen_get_pixel].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນ macOS ແລະ Windows.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເປີດໃຊ້ຄ່ານີ້ຈະປ້ອງກັນວິທີການແຄັບໜ້າຈໍມາດຕະຖານບໍ່ໃຫ້ຈັບພາບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມໄດ້, ແຕ່ "
"[b]ບໍ່ໄດ້[/b] ຮັບປະກັນວ່າແອັບອື່ນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຈັບພາບໄດ້. ມັນບໍ່ຄວນຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນມາດຕະການ DRM ຫຼື "
"ຄວາມປອດໄພ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [Window] will be in exclusive mode. Exclusive "
"windows are always on top of their parent and will block all input going to "
"the parent [Window].\n"
"Needs [member transient] enabled to work."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], [Window] ຈະຢູ່ໃນໂໝດ exclusive. ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແບບ exclusive "
"ຈະຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງພໍ່ມັນສະເໝີ ແລະ ຈະບລັອກ input ທັງໝົດທີ່ສົ່ງໄປຫາ [Window] ພໍ່.\n"
"ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ [member transient] ຈຶ່ງຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [Window] contents is expanded to the full size of "
"the window, window title bar is transparent.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is implemented only on macOS.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property only works with native windows."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເນື້ອຫາຂອງ [Window] ຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍໃຫ້ເຕັມຂະໜາດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ, "
"ແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຈະໂປ່ງໃສ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຂອງລະບົບ (native windows) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], native window will be used regardless of parent "
"viewport and project settings."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຂອງລະບົບ (native window) ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈ viewport "
"ພໍ່ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], requests HDR output for the [Window], falling back to "
"SDR if not supported, and automatically switching between HDR and SDR as the "
"window moves between screens, screen capabilities change, or system settings "
"are modified. This will internally force [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] to be "
"enabled on the main [Viewport]. All other [SubViewport] of this [Window] must "
"have their [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] property enabled to produce HDR "
"output."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຮ້ອງຂໍການສະແດງຜົນແບບ HDR ສຳລັບ [Window], ແລະ "
"ຈະຖອຍກັບໄປເປັນ SDR ຫາກບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ, ພ້ອມທັງສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງ HDR ແລະ SDR "
"ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຍ້າຍໄປມາລະຫວ່າງໜ້າຈໍ, ຄວາມສາມາດຂອງໜ້າຈໍປ່ຽນແປງ, ຫຼື "
"ມີການແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນ "
"[Viewport] ຫຼັກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. [SubViewport] ອື່ນໆ ທັງໝົດຂອງ [Window] ນີ້ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"[member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະແດງຜົນແບບ HDR ໄດ້."

msgid "Specifies the initial type of position for the [Window]."
msgstr "ລະບຸປະເພດຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ [Window]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [Window] width is expanded to keep the title bar "
"text fully visible."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງ [Window] "
"ຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"If non-zero, the [Window] can't be resized to be bigger than this size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property will be ignored if the value is lower than [member "
"min_size]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກບໍ່ແມ່ນສູນ, [Window] ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໃຫ້ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຂະໜາດນີ້ໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍຫາກຄ່າມັນຕໍ່າກວ່າ [member min_size]."

msgid ""
"If non-zero, the [Window] can't be resized to be smaller than this size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property will be ignored in favor of [method "
"get_contents_minimum_size] if [member wrap_controls] is enabled and if its "
"size is bigger."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກບໍ່ແມ່ນສູນ, [Window] ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໃຫ້ເວັ້ນແຕ່ຂະໜາດນີ້ໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ ແລະ ໄປໃຊ້ [method get_contents_minimum_size] "
"ແທນ ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ [member wrap_controls] ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງມັນໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Set's the window's current mode.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Fullscreen mode is not exclusive full screen on Windows and "
"Linux.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works with native windows, i.e. the main window "
"and [Window]-derived nodes when [member Viewport.gui_embed_subwindows] is "
"disabled in the main viewport."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງໂໝດປັດຈຸບັນຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂໝດ Fullscreen ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບ exclusive full screen ໃນ Windows ແລະ "
"Linux.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຂອງລະບົບ (native windows) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຄື ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຫຼັກ "
"ແລະ ນົດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [Window] ເມື່ອ [member Viewport.gui_embed_subwindows] "
"ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໃນ viewport ຫຼັກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], all mouse events will be passed to the underlying "
"window of the same application. See also [member mouse_passthrough_polygon].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is implemented on Linux (X11), macOS and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property only works with native windows."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ເຫດການເມົາສ໌ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານໄປຍັງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງລຸ່ມຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນດຽວກັນ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"mouse_passthrough_polygon] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນ Linux (X11), macOS ແລະ Windows.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຂອງລະບົບ (native windows) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If set, defines the window's custom decoration area which will receive mouse "
"input, even if normal input to the window is blocked (such as when it has an "
"exclusive child opened). See also [signal nonclient_window_input]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກກຳນົດໄວ້, ຈະເປັນການກຳນົດພື້ນທີ່ຕົກແຕ່ງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ຈະຮັບ input ຈາກເມົາສ໌, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ "
"input ປົກກະຕິຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຈະຖືກບລັອກ (ເຊັ່ນ: ເມື່ອມີປ່ອງຢ້ຽມລູກແບບ exclusive ເປີດຢູ່). ເບິ່ງ "
"[signal nonclient_window_input] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [Window] will be considered a popup. Popups are sub-"
"windows that don't show as separate windows in system's window manager's "
"window list and will send close request when anything is clicked outside of "
"them (unless [member exclusive] is enabled)."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], [Window] ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນປັອບອັບ. "
"ປັອບອັບແມ່ນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຍ່ອຍທີ່ບໍ່ສະແດງເປັນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແຍກຕ່າງຫາກໃນລາຍການປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຂອງລະບົບ ແລະ "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍປິດເມື່ອມີການຄລິກນອກປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ (ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ [member exclusive])."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [Window] will signal to the window manager that it "
"is supposed to be an implementation-defined \"popup\" (usually a floating, "
"borderless, untileable and immovable child window)."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], [Window] ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານຫາຕົວຈັດການປ່ອງຢ້ຽມວ່າ ມັນຄວນຈະເປັນ "
"\"popup\" ຕາມທີ່ລະບົບກຳນົດ (ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເປັນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມລູກແບບລອຍ, ບໍ່ມີຂອບ, ບໍ່ສາມາດຈັດລຽງຊ້ອນກັນ "
"ແລະ ຍ້າຍບໍ່ໄດ້)."

msgid ""
"The window's position in pixels.\n"
"If [member ProjectSettings.display/window/subwindows/embed_subwindows] is "
"[code]false[/code], the position is in absolute screen coordinates. This "
"typically applies to editor plugins. If the setting is [code]true[/code], the "
"window's position is in the coordinates of its parent [Viewport].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property only works if [member initial_position] is set to "
"[constant WINDOW_INITIAL_POSITION_ABSOLUTE]."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມເປັນ pixels.\n"
"ຫາກ [member ProjectSettings.display/window/subwindows/embed_subwindows] ເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code], ຕຳແໜ່ງຈະຢູ່ໃນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍແບບ absolute. ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກຈະໃຊ້ກັບປັກອິນຂອງ editor. "
"ຫາກຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຈະຢູ່ໃນພິກັດຂອງ [Viewport] ພໍ່ຂອງມັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member initial_position] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"WINDOW_INITIAL_POSITION_ABSOLUTE]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [Window] will override the OS window style to "
"display sharp corners.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is implemented only on Windows (11).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property only works with native windows."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], [Window] ຈະຂຽນທັບຮູບແບບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຂອງ OS "
"ເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນເປັນມຸມແຫຼມ (sharp corners).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Windows (11).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຂອງລະບົບ (native windows) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The window's size in pixels. See also [member content_scale_size], which "
"doesn't set the window's physical size but affects how scaling works relative "
"to the current [member content_scale_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມເປັນ pixels. ເບິ່ງ [member content_scale_size] ຕື່ມ, "
"ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນການຕັ້ງຂະໜາດທາງກາຍະພາບຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ ແຕ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການປັບສະເກລທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ "
"[member content_scale_mode] ປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"The name of a theme type variation used by this [Window] to look up its own "
"theme items. See [member Control.theme_type_variation] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຂອງລາຍການຍ່ອຍ (variation) ຂອງປະເພດທິມທີ່ [Window] ນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາລາຍການທິມຂອງຕົນເອງ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [member Control.theme_type_variation] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [Window] is transient, i.e. it's considered a child "
"of another [Window]. The transient window will be destroyed with its "
"transient parent and will return focus to their parent when closed. The "
"transient window is displayed on top of a non-exclusive full-screen parent "
"window. Transient windows can't enter full-screen mode.\n"
"Note that behavior might be different depending on the platform."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], [Window] ຈະເປັນແບບຊົ່ວຄາວ (transient), ຄື "
"ມັນຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນລູກຂອງ [Window] ອື່ນ. ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແບບຊົ່ວຄາວຈະຖືກລຶບໄປພ້ອມກັບພໍ່ຂອງມັນ ແລະ "
"ຈະຄືນໂຟກັສໃຫ້ກັບພໍ່ເມື່ອຖືກປິດ. ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແບບຊົ່ວຄາວຈະສະແດງຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມພໍ່ທີ່ເປັນແບບ full-"
"screen ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ exclusive. ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແບບຊົ່ວຄາວບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດ full-screen ໄດ້.\n"
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າພຶດຕິກຳອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມແພລດຟອມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], and the [Window] is [member transient], this window "
"will (at the time of becoming visible) become transient to the currently "
"focused window instead of the immediate parent window in the hierarchy. Note "
"that the transient parent is assigned at the time this window becomes "
"visible, so changing it afterwards has no effect until re-shown."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແລະ [Window] ເປັນແບບ [member transient], ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມນີ້ "
"(ໃນເວລາທີ່ມັນສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ) ຈະກາຍເປັນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຊົ່ວຄາວຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກໂຟກັສຢູ່ປັດຈຸບັນ "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມພໍ່ໂດຍກົງໃນລຳດັບຂັ້ນ. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າພໍ່ແບບຊົ່ວຄາວຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃນເວລາທີ່ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມນີ້ສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນການປ່ຽນແປງຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຈົນກວ່າຈະມີການສະແດງຜົນໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [Window]'s background can be transparent. This is "
"best used with embedded windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Transparency support is implemented on Linux, macOS and Windows, "
"but availability might vary depending on GPU driver, display manager, and "
"compositor capabilities.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property has no effect if [member ProjectSettings.display/"
"window/per_pixel_transparency/allowed] is set to [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງ [Window] ສາມາດໂປ່ງໃສໄດ້. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເໝາະສຳລັບໃຊ້ກັບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຖືກຝັງຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຮອງຮັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສມີຢູ່ໃນ Linux, macOS ແລະ Windows, "
"ແຕ່ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການໃຊ້ງານອາດແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມໄດຣເວີ GPU, ຕົວຈັດການການສະແດງຜົນ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມສາມາດຂອງ compositor.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫາກ [member ProjectSettings.display/window/"
"per_pixel_transparency/allowed] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [Window] can't be focused nor interacted with. It "
"can still be visible."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], [Window] ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກໂຟກັສ ຫຼື ໂຕ້ຕອບໄດ້. "
"ແຕ່ມັນຍັງສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ຢູ່."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the window can't be resized."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຈະບໍ່ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the window is visible."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຈະສະແດງຜົນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the window's size will automatically update when a "
"child node is added or removed, ignoring [member min_size] if the new size is "
"bigger.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], you need to call [method child_controls_changed] "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຂະໜາດຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຈະອັບເດດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມີການເພີ່ມ ຫຼື "
"ລຶບນົດລູກ, ໂດຍຈະລະເລີຍ [member min_size] ຫາກຂະໜາດໃໝ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ.\n"
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]false[/code], ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເອີ້ນ [method child_controls_changed] ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted right after [method popup] call, before the [Window] appears or does "
"anything."
msgstr "ຖືກສົ່ງອອກທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກເອີ້ນ [method popup], ກ່ອນທີ່ [Window] ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ເຮັດຫຍັງກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the [Window]'s close button is pressed or when [member "
"popup_window] is enabled and user clicks outside the window.\n"
"This signal can be used to handle window closing, e.g. by connecting it to "
"[method hide]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອປຸ່ມປິດຂອງ [Window] ຖືກກົດ ຫຼື ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ [member popup_window] ແລະ "
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄລິກຢູ່ນອກປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ.\n"
"ສັນຍານນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການການປິດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ ເຊັ່ນ: ໂດຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ມັນກັບ [method hide]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the [Window]'s DPI changes as a result of OS-level changes (e.g. "
"moving the window from a Retina display to a lower resolution one).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only implemented on macOS and Linux (Wayland)."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອ DPI ຂອງ [Window] ປ່ຽນແປງ ເຊິ່ງເປັນຜົນມາຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງໃນລະດັບ OS (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ການຍ້າຍປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຈາກຈໍ Retina ໄປຍັງຈໍທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດຕໍ່າກວ່າ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ແລະ Linux (Wayland)."

msgid "Emitted when the [Window] gains focus."
msgstr "ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອ [Window] ໄດ້ຮັບໂຟກັສ."

msgid "Emitted when the [Window] loses its focus."
msgstr "ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອ [Window] ເສຍໂຟກັສ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a go back request is sent (e.g. pressing the \"Back\" button on "
"Android), right after [constant Node.NOTIFICATION_WM_GO_BACK_REQUEST]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ຍ້ອນກັບ (ເຊັ່ນ: ການກົດປຸ່ມ \"Back\" ໃນ Android), ທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກ "
"[constant Node.NOTIFICATION_WM_GO_BACK_REQUEST]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse cursor enters the [Window]'s visible area, that is not "
"occluded behind other [Control]s or windows, provided its [member "
"Viewport.gui_disable_input] is [code]false[/code] and regardless if it's "
"currently focused or not."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເຂົ້າມາໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງ [Window], ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກບັງໂດຍ [Control] ຫຼື "
"ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມອື່ນ, ໂດຍທີ່ [member Viewport.gui_disable_input] ເປັນ [code]false[/code] ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ວ່າປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຈະຖືກໂຟກັສຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່ກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse cursor leaves the [Window]'s visible area, that is not "
"occluded behind other [Control]s or windows, provided its [member "
"Viewport.gui_disable_input] is [code]false[/code] and regardless if it's "
"currently focused or not."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ອອກຈາກພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງ [Window], ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກບັງໂດຍ [Control] ຫຼື "
"ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມອື່ນ, ໂດຍທີ່ [member Viewport.gui_disable_input] ເປັນ [code]false[/code] ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ວ່າປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຈະຖືກໂຟກັສຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່ກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse event is received by the custom decoration area "
"defined by [member nonclient_area], and normal input to the window is blocked "
"(such as when it has an exclusive child opened). [param event]'s position is "
"in the embedder's coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບເຫດການເມົາສ໌ໂດຍພື້ນທີ່ຕົກແຕ່ງແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [member nonclient_area], "
"ແລະ input ປົກກະຕິຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຖືກບລັອກ (ເຊັ່ນ: ເມື່ອມີປ່ອງຢ້ຽມລູກແບບ exclusive ເປີດຢູ່). "
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ [param event] ຈະຢູ່ໃນລະບົບພິກັດຂອງຕົວຝັງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the output max linear value returned by [method "
"Window.get_output_max_linear_value] has changed. This occurs when HDR output "
"is enabled or disabled and when any HDR output luminance values of the window "
"have changed, such as when the player adjusts their screen brightness setting "
"or moves the window to a different screen. [param output_max_linear_value] is "
"the new value."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອຄ່າ linear ສູງສຸດທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນໂດຍ [method Window.get_output_max_linear_value] "
"ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ HDR ແລະ ເມື່ອຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (luminance) "
"ຂອງ HDR ໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມປ່ຽນແປງ ເຊັ່ນ: ເມື່ອຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໜ້າຈໍ ຫຼື ຍ້າຍປ່ອງຢ້ຽມໄປໜ້າຈໍອື່ນ. [param "
"output_max_linear_value] ແມ່ນຄ່າໃໝ່."

msgid "Emitted when window title bar text is changed."
msgstr "ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when window title bar decorations are changed, e.g. macOS window "
"enter/exit full screen mode, or extend-to-title flag is changed."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອສ່ວນຕົກແຕ່ງແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມມີການປ່ຽນແປງ ເຊັ່ນ: ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ macOS ເຂົ້າ ຫຼື "
"ອອກຈາກໂໝດເຕັມຈໍ, ຫຼື flag extend-to-title ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "Emitted when [Window] is made visible or disappears."
msgstr "ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອ [Window] ປະກົດຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ຫາຍໄປ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the [Window] is currently focused and receives any input, "
"passing the received event as an argument. The event's position, if present, "
"is in the embedder's coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອ [Window] ກຳລັງຖືກໂຟກັສ ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບ input ໃດໆ, "
"ໂດຍສົ່ງເຫດການທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບນັ້ນເປັນອາຣ໌ກິວເມັນ. ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເຫດການ (ຖ້າມີ) ຈະຢູ່ໃນລະບົບພິກັດຂອງຕົວຝັງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when [Window]'s visibility changes, right before [signal "
"visibility_changed]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງ [Window] ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ, ທັນທີກ່ອນ [signal "
"visibility_changed]."

msgid ""
"Sent when the node needs to refresh its theme items. This happens in one of "
"the following cases:\n"
"- The [member theme] property is changed on this node or any of its "
"ancestors.\n"
"- The [member theme_type_variation] property is changed on this node.\n"
"- The node enters the scene tree.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] As an optimization, this notification won't be sent from changes "
"that occur while this node is outside of the scene tree. Instead, all of the "
"theme item updates can be applied at once when the node enters the scene tree."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງເມື່ອນົດຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຣີເຟຣຊລາຍການທິມຂອງມັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"- ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member theme] ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໃນນົດນີ້ ຫຼື ບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນ.\n"
"- ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member theme_type_variation] ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໃນນົດນີ້.\n"
"- ນົດເຂົ້າມາໃນ scene tree.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອເປັນການປັບແຕ່ງປະສິດທິພາບ (optimization), "
"ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ນົດນີ້ຢູ່ນອກ scene tree. "
"ແຕ່ການອັບເດດລາຍການທິມທັງໝົດຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ພ້ອມກັນເມື່ອນົດເຂົ້າມາໃນ scene tree."

msgid ""
"A single window full screen mode. This mode has less overhead, but only one "
"window can be open on a given screen at a time (opening a child window or "
"application switching will trigger a full screen transition).\n"
"Full screen window covers the entire display area of a screen and has no "
"border or decorations. The display's video mode is not changed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This mode might not work with screen recording software.\n"
"[b]On Android:[/b] This enables immersive mode.\n"
"[b]On Windows:[/b] Depending on video driver, full screen transition might "
"cause screens to go black for a moment.\n"
"[b]On macOS:[/b] A new desktop is used to display the running project. "
"Exclusive full screen mode prevents Dock and Menu from showing up when the "
"mouse pointer is hovering the edge of the screen.\n"
"[b]On Linux (X11):[/b] Exclusive full screen mode bypasses compositor.\n"
"[b]On Linux (Wayland):[/b] Equivalent to [constant MODE_FULLSCREEN].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Regardless of the platform, enabling full screen will change the "
"window size to match the monitor's size. Therefore, make sure your project "
"supports [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/rendering/"
"multiple_resolutions.html]multiple resolutions[/url] when enabling full "
"screen mode."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດເຕັມຈໍແບບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມດຽວ. ໂໝດນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນໜ້ອຍກວ່າ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະມີພຽງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດເປີດໄດ້ໃນໜ້າຈໍໜຶ່ງໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ (ການເປີດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມລູກ ຫຼື "
"ການສະຫຼັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການປ່ຽນຜ່ານໂໝດເຕັມຈໍ).\n"
"ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມເຕັມຈໍຈະຄອບຄຸມພື້ນທີ່ສະແດງຜົນທັງໝົດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຂອບ ຫຼື ສ່ວນຕົກແຕ່ງ. "
"ໂໝດວິດີໂອຂອງຈໍສະແດງຜົນຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂໝດນີ້ອາດຈະໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ກັບຊອບແວອັດໜ້າຈໍ.\n"
"[b]ໃນ Android:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດ immersive.\n"
"[b]ໃນ Windows:[/b] ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບໄດຣເວີວິດີໂອ, ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານໂໝດເຕັມຈໍອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໜ້າຈໍດຳໄປຊົ່ວຄາວ.\n"
"[b]ໃນ macOS:[/b] ຈະມີການໃຊ້ເດດສະທັອບໃໝ່ເພື່ອສະແດງໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ. ໂໝດເຕັມຈໍແບບ "
"exclusive ຈະປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ Dock ແລະ Menu ສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ຢູ່ບໍລິເວນຂອບໜ້າຈໍ.\n"
"[b]ໃນ Linux (X11):[/b] ໂໝດເຕັມຈໍແບບ exclusive ຈະຂ້າມຜ່ານ compositor.\n"
"[b]ໃນ Linux (Wayland):[/b] ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [constant MODE_FULLSCREEN].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຢູ່ໃນແພລດຟອມໃດ, "
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດເຕັມຈໍຈະປ່ຽນຂະໜາດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມໃຫ້ກົງກັບຂະໜາດຂອງມໍນິເຕີ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໂປຣເຈັກຂອງເຈົ້າຮອງຮັບ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/rendering/"
"multiple_resolutions.html]ຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ[/url] ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດເຕັມຈໍ."

msgid ""
"The window can't be resized by dragging its resize grip. It's still possible "
"to resize the window using [member size]. This flag is ignored for full "
"screen windows. Set with [member unresizable].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on Linux (X11), macOS, Windows, and "
"embedded windows."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມບໍ່ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໂດຍການລາກປຸ່ມປັບຂະໜາດ. ແຕ່ຍັງສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member "
"size]. flag ນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍສຳລັບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມເຕັມຈໍ. ຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍ [member unresizable].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນ Linux (X11), macOS, Windows, ແລະ ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຖືກຝັງ."

msgid ""
"The window do not have native title bar and other decorations. This flag is "
"ignored for full-screen windows. Set with [member borderless].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, Windows, "
"and embedded windows."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມບໍ່ມີແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງລະບົບ ແລະ ສ່ວນຕົກແຕ່ງອື່ນໆ. flag ນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍສຳລັບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມເຕັມຈໍ. ຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍ "
"[member borderless].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນ Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, Windows, ແລະ "
"ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຖືກຝັງ."

msgid ""
"The window is floating on top of all other windows. This flag is ignored for "
"full-screen windows. Set with [member always_on_top].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on Linux (X11), macOS, Windows, and "
"embedded windows."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຈະລອຍຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມອື່ນໆ ທັງໝົດ. flag ນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍສຳລັບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມເຕັມຈໍ. ຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍ "
"[member always_on_top].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນ Linux (X11), macOS, Windows, ແລະ ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຖືກຝັງ."

msgid ""
"The window background can be transparent. Set with [member transparent].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag has no effect if either [member "
"ProjectSettings.display/window/per_pixel_transparency/allowed], or the "
"window's [member Viewport.transparent_bg] is set to [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Transparency support is implemented on Linux (X11/Wayland), "
"macOS, Windows, and embedded windows."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຫຼັງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມສາມາດໂປ່ງໃສໄດ້. ຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍ [member transparent].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫາກ [member ProjectSettings.display/window/"
"per_pixel_transparency/allowed] ຫຼື [member Viewport.transparent_bg] "
"ຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຮອງຮັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສມີຢູ່ໃນ Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, Windows, ແລະ "
"ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຖືກຝັງ."

msgid ""
"The window can't be focused. No-focus window will ignore all input, except "
"mouse clicks. Set with [member unfocusable].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on Linux (X11), macOS, Windows, and "
"embedded windows."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບໂຟກັສໄດ້. ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ບໍ່ມີໂຟກັສຈະລະເລີຍ input ທັງໝົດ ຍົກເວັ້ນການຄລິກເມົາສ໌. "
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍ [member unfocusable].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນ Linux (X11), macOS, Windows, ແລະ ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຖືກຝັງ."

msgid ""
"Window is part of menu or [OptionButton] dropdown. This flag can't be changed "
"when the window is visible. An active popup window will exclusively receive "
"all input, without stealing focus from its parent. Popup windows are "
"automatically closed when uses click outside it, or when an application is "
"switched. Popup window must have transient parent set (see [member "
"transient]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, Windows, "
"and embedded [Popup] windows."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງເມນູ ຫຼື [OptionButton] dropdown. flag "
"ນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມກຳລັງສະແດງຜົນ. ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມປັອບອັບທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຈະຮັບ input "
"ທັງໝົດແບບ exclusive ໂດຍບໍ່ໄປແຍ່ງໂຟກັສຈາກພໍ່ຂອງມັນ. "
"ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມປັອບອັບຈະຖືກປິດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄລິກນອກປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ ຫຼື ເມື່ອມີການສະຫຼັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. "
"ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມປັອບອັບຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງພໍ່ແບບຊົ່ວຄາວໄວ້ (ເບິ່ງ [member transient]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນ Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS, Windows, ແລະ ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ "
"[Popup] ທີ່ຖືກຝັງ."

msgid ""
"Window content is expanded to the full size of the window. Unlike borderless "
"window, the frame is left intact and can be used to resize the window, title "
"bar is transparent, but have minimize/maximize/close buttons. Set with "
"[member extend_to_title].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag has no effect in embedded windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"ເນື້ອຫາປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຖືກຂະຫຍາຍໃຫ້ເຕັມຂະໜາດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ. ຕ່າງຈາກປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ບໍ່ມີຂອບ, ກອບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຍັງຄືເກົ່າ ແລະ "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບຂະໜາດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມໄດ້, ແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ຈະໂປ່ງໃສ ແຕ່ຍັງມີປຸ່ມ minimize/maximize/close. "
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍ [member extend_to_title].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຖືກຝັງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS."

msgid ""
"Window style is overridden, forcing sharp corners.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag has no effect in embedded windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented only on Windows (11)."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຖືກຂຽນທັບ, ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ເປັນມຸມແຫຼມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຖືກຝັງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Windows (11)."

msgid ""
"Windows is excluded from screenshots taken by [method "
"DisplayServer.screen_get_image], [method "
"DisplayServer.screen_get_image_rect], and [method "
"DisplayServer.screen_get_pixel].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag has no effect in embedded windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on macOS and Windows (10, 20H1).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this flag will prevent standard screenshot methods from "
"capturing a window image, but does [b]NOT[/b] guarantee that other apps won't "
"be able to capture an image. It should not be used as a DRM or security "
"measure."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຈະຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການແຄັບໜ້າຈໍໂດຍ [method DisplayServer.screen_get_image], "
"[method DisplayServer.screen_get_image_rect], ແລະ [method "
"DisplayServer.screen_get_pixel].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຖືກຝັງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນ macOS ແລະ Windows (10, 20H1).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງ flag ນີ້ຈະປ້ອງກັນວິທີການແຄັບໜ້າຈໍມາດຕະຖານບໍ່ໃຫ້ຈັບພາບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມໄດ້, ແຕ່ "
"[b]ບໍ່ໄດ້[/b] ຮັບປະກັນວ່າແອັບອື່ນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຈັບພາບໄດ້. ມັນບໍ່ຄວນຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນມາດຕະການ DRM ຫຼື "
"ຄວາມປອດໄພ."

msgid ""
"Signals the window manager that this window is supposed to be an "
"implementation-defined \"popup\" (usually a floating, borderless, untileable "
"and immovable child window).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag has no effect in embedded windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on Linux (Wayland)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານຫາຕົວຈັດການປ່ອງຢ້ຽມວ່າ ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມນີ້ຄວນເປັນ \"popup\" ຕາມທີ່ລະບົບກຳນົດ "
"(ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມລູກແບບລອຍ, ບໍ່ມີຂອບ, ບໍ່ສາມາດຈັດລຽງຊ້ອນກັນ ແລະ ຍ້າຍບໍ່ໄດ້).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຖືກຝັງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນ Linux (Wayland)."

msgid ""
"Window minimize button is disabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag has no effect in embedded windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on Linux (X11), macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມ minimize ຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຖືກຝັງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນ Linux (X11), macOS, ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Window maximize button is disabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag has no effect in embedded windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This flag is implemented on Linux (X11), macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມ maximize ຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຖືກຝັງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] flag ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນ Linux (X11), macOS, ແລະ Windows."

msgid "Max value of the [enum Flags]."
msgstr "ຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງ [enum Flags]."

msgid ""
"The content will not be scaled to match the [Window]'s size ([member "
"content_scale_size] is ignored)."
msgstr ""
"ເນື້ອຫາຈະບໍ່ຖືກປັບສະເກລໃຫ້ກົງກັບຂະໜາດຂອງ [Window] (ຈະລະເລີຍ [member "
"content_scale_size])."

msgid ""
"The content will be rendered at the target size. This is more performance-"
"expensive than [constant CONTENT_SCALE_MODE_VIEWPORT], but provides better "
"results."
msgstr ""
"ເນື້ອຫາຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີຕາມຂະໜາດເປົ້າໝາຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍກວ່າ [constant "
"CONTENT_SCALE_MODE_VIEWPORT], ແຕ່ໃຫ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ດີກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"The content will be rendered at the base size and then scaled to the target "
"size. More performant than [constant CONTENT_SCALE_MODE_CANVAS_ITEMS], but "
"results in pixelated image."
msgstr ""
"ເນື້ອຫາຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີຕາມຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານ ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງປັບສະເກລໄປຫາຂະໜາດເປົ້າໝາຍ. ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງກວ່າ "
"[constant CONTENT_SCALE_MODE_CANVAS_ITEMS], ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບແຕກເປັນພິກເຊລ."

msgid ""
"The aspect will be ignored. Scaling will simply stretch the content to fit "
"the target size."
msgstr "ຈະລະເລີຍອັດຕາສ່ວນ (aspect). ການປັບສະເກລຈະເປັນການຍືດເນື້ອຫາໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບຂະໜາດເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"The content's aspect will be preserved. If the target size has different "
"aspect from the base one, the image will be centered and black bars will "
"appear on left and right sides."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງເນື້ອຫາໄວ້. ຫາກຂະໜາດເປົ້າໝາຍມີອັດຕາສ່ວນຕ່າງຈາກຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານ, ພາບຈະຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງ "
"ແລະ ຈະມີແຖບດຳປະກົດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຂວາ."

msgid ""
"The content can be expanded vertically. Scaling horizontally will result in "
"keeping the width ratio and then black bars on left and right sides."
msgstr ""
"ເນື້ອຫາສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍອອກໃນແນວຕັ້ງໄດ້. ການປັບສະເກລໃນແນວນອນຈະເປັນການຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນຄວາມກວ້າງໄວ້ "
"ແລະ ຈະມີແຖບດຳຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຂວາ."

msgid ""
"The content can be expanded horizontally. Scaling vertically will result in "
"keeping the height ratio and then black bars on top and bottom sides."
msgstr ""
"ເນື້ອຫາສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍອອກໃນແນວນອນໄດ້. ການປັບສະເກລໃນແນວຕັ້ງຈະເປັນການຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນຄວາມສູງໄວ້ "
"ແລະ ຈະມີແຖບດຳຢູ່ເບື້ອງເທິງ ແລະ ລຸ່ມ."

msgid ""
"The content's aspect will be preserved. If the target size has different "
"aspect from the base one, the content will stay in the top-left corner and "
"add an extra visible area in the stretched space."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງເນື້ອຫາໄວ້. ຫາກຂະໜາດເປົ້າໝາຍມີອັດຕາສ່ວນຕ່າງຈາກຂະໜາດພື້ນຖານ, "
"ເນື້ອຫາຈະຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງ ແລະ ຈະເພີ່ມພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ພິເສດໃນສ່ວນທີ່ຖືກຍືດອອກ."

msgid ""
"The content will be stretched according to a fractional factor. This fills "
"all the space available in the window, but allows \"pixel wobble\" to occur "
"due to uneven pixel scaling."
msgstr ""
"ເນື້ອຫາຈະຖືກຍືດຕາມຕົວຄູນແບບທົດສະນິຍົມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຕື່ມເຕັມພື້ນທີ່ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ, ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ "
"\"pixel wobble\" ເນື່ອງຈາກການປັບສະເກລພິກເຊລທີ່ບໍ່ສະເໝີກັນ."

msgid ""
"The content will be stretched only according to an integer factor, preserving "
"sharp pixels. This may leave a black background visible on the window's edges "
"depending on the window size."
msgstr ""
"ເນື້ອຫາຈະຖືກຍືດຕາມຕົວຄູນແບບຈຳນວນເຕັມເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເພື່ອຮັກສາຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງພິກເຊລ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນພື້ນຫຼັງສີດຳຢູ່ຂອບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຂະໜາດຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ."

msgid ""
"Automatic layout direction, determined from the parent window layout "
"direction."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການຈັດວາງອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໂດຍກຳນົດຈາກທິດທາງການຈັດວາງຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມພໍ່."

msgid "Automatic layout direction, determined from the current locale."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການຈັດວາງອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໂດຍກຳນົດຈາກພາສາ (locale) ປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Automatic layout direction, determined from the system locale."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການຈັດວາງອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໂດຍກຳນົດຈາກພາສາຂອງລະບົບ."

msgid "Initial window position is determined by [member position]."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແມ່ນກຳນົດໂດຍ [member position]."

msgid "Initial window position is the center of the primary screen."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແມ່ນຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງຂອງໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກ."

msgid "Initial window position is the center of the main window screen."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແມ່ນຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມີປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຫຼັກຢູ່."

msgid "Initial window position is the center of [member current_screen] screen."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແມ່ນຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ [member current_screen]."

msgid ""
"Initial window position is the center of the screen containing the mouse "
"pointer."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແມ່ນຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມີເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Initial window position is the center of the screen containing the window "
"with the keyboard focus."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແມ່ນຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມີປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຖືກໂຟກັສຄີບອດຢູ່."

msgid "The color of the title's text."
msgstr "ສີຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຫົວຂໍ້."

msgid "The color of the title's text outline."
msgstr "ສີຂອງຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມຫົວຂໍ້."

msgid ""
"Horizontal position offset of the close button, relative to the end of the "
"title bar, towards the beginning of the title bar."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ໃນແນວນອນຂອງປຸ່ມປິດ, ທຽບກັບສ່ວນທ້າຍຂອງແຖບຫົວຂໍ້."

msgid ""
"Vertical position offset of the close button, relative to the bottom of the "
"title bar, towards the top of the title bar."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ໃນແນວຕັ້ງຂອງປຸ່ມປິດ, ທຽບກັບສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງແຖບຫົວຂໍ້."

msgid ""
"Defines the outside margin at which the window border can be grabbed with "
"mouse and resized."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຂອບເຂດດ້ານນອກທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌ຈັບຂອບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມເພື່ອປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້."

msgid "Height of the title bar."
msgstr "ຄວາມສູງຂອງແຖບຫົວຂໍ້."

msgid "The size of the title outline."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງຂອບຫົວຂໍ້."

msgid "The font used to draw the title."
msgstr "ຟອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບສະແດງຫົວຂໍ້."

msgid "The size of the title font."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງຟອນຫົວຂໍ້."

msgid "The icon for the close button."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບປຸ່ມປິດ."

msgid "The icon for the close button when it's being pressed."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບປຸ່ມປິດໃນຂະນະທີ່ຖືກກົດ."

msgid ""
"The background style used when the [Window] is embedded. Note that this is "
"drawn only under the window's content, excluding the title. For proper "
"borders and title bar style, you can use [code]expand_margin_*[/code] "
"properties of [StyleBoxFlat].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The content background will not be visible unless [member "
"transparent] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [Window] ຖືກຝັງຢູ່. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າມັນຈະຖືກສະແດງສະເພາະຢູ່ກຸ່ມລຸ່ມເນື້ອຫາຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ຮວມສ່ວນຫົວຂໍ້. ສຳລັບຂອບ ແລະ "
"ຮູບແບບແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]expand_margin_*[/code] ຂອງ "
"[StyleBoxFlat] ໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ພື້ນຫຼັງເນື້ອຫາຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນ ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ [member transparent]."

msgid "The background style used when the [Window] is embedded and unfocused."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [Window] ຖືກຝັງໄວ້ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນໂຟກັດ."

msgid ""
"A singleton that allocates some [Thread]s on startup, used to offload tasks "
"to these threads."
msgstr ""
"ຄຣາສ Singleton ທີ່ຈັດສັນບາງ [Thread] ໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບ, "
"ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໂອນຍ້າຍວຽກຕ່າງໆໄປໃຫ້ເທຣດເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

msgid ""
"The [WorkerThreadPool] singleton allocates a set of [Thread]s (called worker "
"threads) on project startup and provides methods for offloading tasks to "
"them. This can be used for simple multithreading without having to create "
"[Thread]s.\n"
"Tasks hold the [Callable] to be run by the threads. [WorkerThreadPool] can be "
"used to create regular tasks, which will be taken by one worker thread, or "
"group tasks, which can be distributed between multiple worker threads. Group "
"tasks execute the [Callable] multiple times, which makes them useful for "
"iterating over a lot of elements, such as the enemies in an arena.\n"
"Here's a sample on how to offload an expensive function to worker threads:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var enemies = [] # An array to be filled with enemies.\n"
"\n"
"func process_enemy_ai(enemy_index):\n"
"\tvar processed_enemy = enemies[enemy_index]\n"
"\t# Expensive logic...\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\tvar task_id = WorkerThreadPool.add_group_task(process_enemy_ai, "
"enemies.size())\n"
"\t# Other code...\n"
"\tWorkerThreadPool.wait_for_group_task_completion(task_id)\n"
"\t# Other code that depends on the enemy AI already being processed.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"private List<Node> _enemies = new List<Node>(); // A list to be filled with "
"enemies.\n"
"\n"
"private void ProcessEnemyAI(int enemyIndex)\n"
"{\n"
"\tNode processedEnemy = _enemies[enemyIndex];\n"
"\t// Expensive logic here.\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\tlong taskId = "
"WorkerThreadPool.AddGroupTask(Callable.From<int>(ProcessEnemyAI), "
"_enemies.Count);\n"
"\t// Other code...\n"
"\tWorkerThreadPool.WaitForGroupTaskCompletion(taskId);\n"
"\t// Other code that depends on the enemy AI already being processed.\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"The above code relies on the number of elements in the [code]enemies[/code] "
"array remaining constant during the multithreaded part.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using this singleton could affect performance negatively if the "
"task being distributed between threads is not computationally expensive."
msgstr ""
"ຄຣາສ Singleton [WorkerThreadPool] ຈະຈັດສັນຊຸດຂອງ [Thread] (ເອີ້ນວ່າ worker threads) "
"ໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂປຣເຈັກ ແລະ ມີເມທອດສຳລັບການໂອນຍ້າຍວຽກໃຫ້ພວກມັນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກຫຼາຍເທຣດ (multithreading) ແບບງ່າຍໆ ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ "
"[Thread] ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ.\n"
"ວຽກ (Tasks) ຈະເກັບ [Callable] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເທຣດຕ່າງໆນຳໄປລັນ. [WorkerThreadPool] "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງວຽກທົ່ວໄປ ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກຮັບໄປໂດຍ worker thread ດຽວ, ຫຼື ວຽກແບບກຸ່ມ "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດກະຈາຍໄປໃຫ້ຫຼາຍ worker thread ພ້ອມກັນ. ວຽກແບບກຸ່ມຈະປະຕິບັດ [Callable] ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ, "
"ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການເຮັດຊ້ຳ (iterating) ຜ່ານອົງປະກອບຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ສັດຕູໃນສະໜາມຮົບ.\n"
"ນີ້ຄືຕົວຢ່າງວິທີການໂອນຍ້າຍຟັງຊັນທີ່ໃຊ້ການປະມວນຜົນສູງໄປໃຫ້ worker threads:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var enemies = [] # ອາເຣສຳລັບເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສັດຕູ.\n"
"\n"
"func process_enemy_ai(enemy_index):\n"
"\tvar processed_enemy = enemies[enemy_index]\n"
"\t# ລໍຈິກທີ່ໃຊ້ການປະມວນຜົນສູງ...\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\tvar task_id = WorkerThreadPool.add_group_task(process_enemy_ai, "
"enemies.size())\n"
"\t# ໂຄ້ດອື່ນໆ...\n"
"\tWorkerThreadPool.wait_for_group_task_completion(task_id)\n"
"\t# ໂຄ້ດອື່ນໆທີ່ຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ AI ຂອງສັດຕູປະມວນຜົນແລ້ວກ່ອນ.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"private List<Node> _enemies = new List<Node>(); // ລາຍການສຳລັບເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສັດຕູ.\n"
"\n"
"private void ProcessEnemyAI(int enemyIndex)\n"
"{\n"
"\tNode processedEnemy = _enemies[enemyIndex];\n"
"\t// ລໍຈິກທີ່ໃຊ້ການປະມວນຜົນສູງ...\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\tlong taskId = "
"WorkerThreadPool.AddGroupTask(Callable.From<int>(ProcessEnemyAI), "
"_enemies.Count);\n"
"\t// ໂຄ້ດອື່ນໆ...\n"
"\tWorkerThreadPool.WaitForGroupTaskCompletion(taskId);\n"
"\t// ໂຄ້ດອື່ນໆທີ່ຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ AI ຂອງສັດຕູປະມວນຜົນແລ້ວກ່ອນ.\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ໂຄ້ດຂ້າງເທິງນັ້ນແມ່ນອີງໃສ່ຈຳນວນອົງປະກອບໃນອາເຣ [code]enemies[/code] "
"ທີ່ຄົງທີ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດວຽກແບບຫຼາຍເທຣດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການໃຊ້ Singleton ນີ້ອາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບໃນທາງລົບ "
"ຫາກວຽກທີ່ກະຈາຍໄປນັ້ນບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ການປະມວນຜົນທີ່ສູງ."

msgid ""
"Adds [param action] as a group task to be executed by the worker threads. The "
"[Callable] will be called a number of times based on [param elements], with "
"the first thread calling it with the value [code]0[/code] as a parameter, and "
"each consecutive execution incrementing this value by 1 until it reaches "
"[code]element - 1[/code].\n"
"The number of threads the task is distributed to is defined by [param "
"tasks_needed], where the default value [code]-1[/code] means it is "
"distributed to all worker threads. [param high_priority] determines if the "
"task has a high priority or a low priority (default). You can optionally "
"provide a [param description] to help with debugging.\n"
"Returns a group task ID that can be used by other methods.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Every task must be waited for completion using [method "
"wait_for_task_completion] or [method wait_for_group_task_completion] at some "
"point so that any allocated resources inside the task can be cleaned up."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ [param action] ເປັນວຽກແບບກຸ່ມເພື່ອໃຫ້ worker threads ປະຕິບັດ. [Callable] "
"ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຕາມຈຳນວນຂອງ [param elements], ໂດຍເທຣດທຳອິດຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຄ່າ [code]0[/code] "
"ເປັນພາລາມິເຕີ, ແລະ ການປະຕິບັດແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໆໄປຈະເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ຂຶ້ນເທື່ອລະ 1 ຈົນກວ່າຈະຮອດ [code]element "
"- 1[/code].\n"
"ຈຳນວນເທຣດທີ່ວຽກຈະຖືກກະຈາຍໄປນັ້ນແມ່ນກຳນົດໂດຍ [param tasks_needed], ເຊິ່ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
"[code]-1[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງການກະຈາຍໄປໃຫ້ worker threads ທັງໝົດ. [param high_priority] "
"ກໍານົດວ່າວຽກນັ້ນມີລໍາດັບຄວາມສໍາຄັນສູງ ຫຼື ຕ່ຳ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ). ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸ [param description] "
"ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (debugging) ໄດ້.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ຂອງວຽກແບບກຸ່ມ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ກັບເມທອດອື່ນໆໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ທຸກໆວຽກຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ສຳເລັດໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"wait_for_task_completion] ຫຼື [method wait_for_group_task_completion] ໃນຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກຈັດສັນໄວ້ພາຍໃນວຽກນັ້ນສາມາດຖືກລຶບລ້າງອອກໄປໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Adds [param action] as a task to be executed by a worker thread. [param "
"high_priority] determines if the task has a high priority or a low priority "
"(default). You can optionally provide a [param description] to help with "
"debugging.\n"
"Returns a task ID that can be used by other methods.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Every task must be waited for completion using [method "
"wait_for_task_completion] or [method wait_for_group_task_completion] at some "
"point so that any allocated resources inside the task can be cleaned up."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ [param action] ເປັນວຽກທີ່ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດໂດຍ worker thread. [param high_priority] "
"ກໍານົດວ່າວຽກນັ້ນມີລໍາດັບຄວາມສໍາຄັນສູງ ຫຼື ຕ່ຳ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ). ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸ [param description] "
"ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (debugging) ໄດ້.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ຂອງວຽກ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ກັບເມທອດອື່ນໆໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ທຸກໆວຽກຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ສຳເລັດໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"wait_for_task_completion] ຫຼື [method wait_for_group_task_completion] ໃນຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກຈັດສັນໄວ້ພາຍໃນວຽກນັ້ນສາມາດຖືກລຶບລ້າງອອກໄປໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the task group ID of the current thread calling this method, or "
"[code]-1[/code] if invalid or the current thread is not part of a task group."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ຂອງກຸ່ມວຽກຂອງເທຣດປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້, ຫຼື [code]-1[/code] ຫາກບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື "
"ເທຣດປັດຈຸບັນບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງກຸ່ມວຽກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the task ID of the current thread calling this method, or [code]-1[/"
"code] if the task is a group task, invalid or the current thread is not part "
"of the thread pool (e.g. the main thread).\n"
"Can be used by a task to get its own task ID, or to determine whether the "
"current code is running inside the worker thread pool.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Group tasks have their own IDs, so this method will return "
"[code]-1[/code] for group tasks."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ຂອງວຽກຂອງເທຣດປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້, ຫຼື [code]-1[/code] "
"ຫາກວຽກນັ້ນເປັນວຽກແບບກຸ່ມ, ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື ເທຣດປັດຈຸບັນບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ thread pool (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ເທຣດຫຼັກ).\n"
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ໂດຍວຽກເພື່ອຂໍ ID ຂອງຕົນເອງ, ຫຼື ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າໂຄ້ດປັດຈຸບັນກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ພາຍໃນ worker "
"thread pool ຫຼື ບໍ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວຽກແບບກຸ່ມມີ ID ເປັນຂອງຕົນເອງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນເມທອດນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]-1[/code] "
"ສຳລັບວຽກແບບກຸ່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns how many times the [Callable] of the group task with the given ID has "
"already been executed by the worker threads.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If a thread has started executing the [Callable] but is yet to "
"finish, it won't be counted."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ [Callable] ຂອງວຽກແບບກຸ່ມທີ່ມີ ID ທີ່ລະບຸ ໄດ້ຖືກປະຕິບັດໄປແລ້ວໂດຍ worker "
"threads.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກເທຣດໄດ້ເລີ່ມປະຕິບັດ [Callable] ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນສຳເລັດ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກນັບ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the group task with the given ID is completed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You should only call this method between adding the group task "
"and awaiting its completion."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກວຽກແບບກຸ່ມທີ່ມີ ID ທີ່ລະບຸສຳເລັດແລ້ວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທ່ານຄວນເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເພີ່ມວຽກແບບກຸ່ມ ແລະ "
"ການລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ມັນສຳເລັດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the task with the given ID is completed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You should only call this method between adding the task and "
"awaiting its completion."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກວຽກທີ່ມີ ID ທີ່ລະບຸສຳເລັດແລ້ວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທ່ານຄວນເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເພີ່ມວຽກ ແລະ ການລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ມັນສຳເລັດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Pauses the thread that calls this method until the group task with the given "
"ID is completed."
msgstr "ຢຸດເທຣດທີ່ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ຊົ່ວຄາວ ຈົນກວ່າວຽກແບບກຸ່ມທີ່ມີ ID ທີ່ລະບຸຈະສຳເລັດ."

msgid ""
"Pauses the thread that calls this method until the task with the given ID is "
"completed.\n"
"Returns [constant @GlobalScope.OK] if the task could be successfully "
"awaited.\n"
"Returns [constant @GlobalScope.ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] if a task with the "
"passed ID does not exist (maybe because it was already awaited and disposed "
"of).\n"
"Returns [constant @GlobalScope.ERR_BUSY] if the call is made from another "
"running task and, due to task scheduling, there's potential for deadlocking "
"(e.g., the task to await may be at a lower level in the call stack and "
"therefore can't progress). This is an advanced situation that should only "
"matter when some tasks depend on others (in the current implementation, the "
"tricky case is a task trying to wait on an older one)."
msgstr ""
"ຢຸດເທຣດທີ່ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ຊົ່ວຄາວ ຈົນກວ່າວຽກທີ່ມີ ID ທີ່ລະບຸຈະສຳເລັດ.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant @GlobalScope.OK] ຫາກສາມາດລໍຖ້າວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງສຳເລັດ.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant @GlobalScope.ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] ຫາກບໍ່ມີວຽກທີ່ມີ ID ທີ່ລະບຸ "
"(ອາດເປັນຍ້ອນມັນຖືກລໍຖ້າ ແລະ ຖືກກຳຈັດໄປແລ້ວ).\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant @GlobalScope.ERR_BUSY] ຫາກການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຖືກເຮັດມາຈາກວຽກອື່ນທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ "
"ແລະ ອາດເກີດການຕິດຂັດ (deadlocking) ເນື່ອງຈາກການຈັດລຳດັບວຽກ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ວຽກທີ່ກຳລັງລໍຖ້າອາດຈະຢູ່ໃນລະດັບຕ່ຳກວ່າໃນ call stack ເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ສາມາດດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໄດ້). "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນສະຖານະການລະດັບສູງທີ່ຈະມີຜົນເມື່ອບາງວຽກຂຶ້ນກັບວຽກອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"A resource that holds all components of a 2D world, such as a canvas and a "
"physics space."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ເກັບອົງປະກອບທັງໝົດຂອງໂລກ 2 ມິຕິ (2D), ເຊັ່ນ: ແຜ່ນວາດ (canvas) ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"Class that has everything pertaining to a 2D world: A physics space, a "
"canvas, and a sound space. 2D nodes register their resources into the current "
"2D world."
msgstr ""
"ຄຣາສທີ່ມີທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂລກ 2 ມິຕິ: ພື້ນທີ່ຟີຊິກ, ແຜ່ນວາດ, ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ສຽງ. ໂນດ 2D "
"ຈະລົງທະບຽນຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນໂລກ 2D ປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"The [RID] of this world's canvas resource. Used by the [RenderingServer] for "
"2D drawing."
msgstr ""
"[RID] ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນແຜ່ນວາດ (canvas) ຂອງໂລກນີ້. ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingServer] ສຳລັບການແຕ້ມ "
"2D."

msgid ""
"Direct access to the world's physics 2D space state. Used for querying "
"current and potential collisions. When using multi-threaded physics, access "
"is limited to [method Node._physics_process] in the main thread."
msgstr ""
"ການເຂົ້າເຖິງສະຖານະພື້ນທີ່ຟີຊິກ 2D ຂອງໂລກໂດຍກົງ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສອບຖາມການຕຳ (collisions) ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ "
"ແລະ ທີ່ອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຟີຊິກແບບຫຼາຍເທຣດ, ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໄວ້ທີ່ [method "
"Node._physics_process] ໃນເທຣດຫຼັກ."

msgid ""
"The [RID] of this world's navigation map. Used by the [NavigationServer2D]."
msgstr ""
"[RID] ຂອງແຜນທີ່ນຳທາງ (navigation map) ຂອງໂລກນີ້. ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [NavigationServer2D]."

msgid ""
"The [RID] of this world's physics space resource. Used by the "
"[PhysicsServer2D] for 2D physics, treating it as both a space and an area."
msgstr "[RID] ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນພື້ນທີ່ຟີຊິກຂອງໂລກນີ້. ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [PhysicsServer2D] ສຳລັບຟີຊິກ 2D."

msgid ""
"A resource that holds all components of a 3D world, such as a visual scenario "
"and a physics space."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ເກັບອົງປະກອບທັງໝົດຂອງໂລກ 3 ມິຕິ (3D), ເຊັ່ນ: ສາກພາບ ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"Class that has everything pertaining to a world: A physics space, a visual "
"scenario, and a sound space. 3D nodes register their resources into the "
"current 3D world."
msgstr ""
"ຄຣາສທີ່ມີທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂລກ: ພື້ນທີ່ຟີຊິກ, ສາກພາບ, ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ສຽງ. ໂນດ 3D "
"ຈະລົງທະບຽນຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນໂລກ 3D ປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"The default [CameraAttributes] resource to use if none set on the [Camera3D]."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [CameraAttributes] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ ຫາກບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ [Camera3D]."

msgid ""
"Direct access to the world's physics 3D space state. Used for querying "
"current and potential collisions. When using multi-threaded physics, access "
"is limited to [method Node._physics_process] in the main thread."
msgstr ""
"ການເຂົ້າເຖິງສະຖານະພື້ນທີ່ຟີຊິກ 3D ຂອງໂລກໂດຍກົງ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສອບຖາມການຕຳ (collisions) ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ "
"ແລະ ທີ່ອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຟີຊິກແບບຫຼາຍເທຣດ, ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໄວ້ທີ່ [method "
"Node._physics_process] ໃນເທຣດຫຼັກ."

msgid "The World3D's [Environment]."
msgstr "[Environment] ຂອງ World3D."

msgid ""
"The World3D's fallback environment will be used if [member environment] fails "
"or is missing."
msgstr ""
"ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຳຮອງ (fallback environment) ຂອງ World3D ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ ຫາກ [member "
"environment] ຜິດພາດ ຫຼື ຫາຍໄປ."

msgid ""
"The [RID] of this world's navigation map. Used by the [NavigationServer3D]."
msgstr ""
"[RID] ຂອງແຜນທີ່ນຳທາງ (navigation map) ຂອງໂລກນີ້. ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [NavigationServer3D]."

msgid "The World3D's visual scenario."
msgstr "ສາກພາບ (visual scenario) ຂອງ World3D."

msgid "The World3D's physics space."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ຟີຊິກຂອງ World3D."

msgid "A 2D world boundary (half-plane) shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງຂອບເຂດໂລກ 2D (ເຄິ່ງລະນັບ) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳທາງຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"A 2D world boundary shape, intended for use in physics. "
"[WorldBoundaryShape2D] works like an infinite straight line that forces all "
"physics bodies to stay above it. The line's normal determines which direction "
"is considered as \"above\" and in the editor, the smaller line over it "
"represents this direction. It can for example be used for endless flat floors."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງຂອບເຂດໂລກ 2D, ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນທາງຟີຊິກ. [WorldBoundaryShape2D] "
"ເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບເສັ້ນຊື່ທີ່ບໍ່ມີສິ້ນສຸດ ເຊິ່ງບັງຄັບໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກທັງໝົດຢູ່ເໜືອມັນ. ເວັກເຕີແນວສາກ (normal) "
"ຂອງເສັ້ນຈະກຳນົດວ່າທິດທາງໃດຄື \"ຂ້າງເທິງ\" ແລະ ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor), "
"ເສັ້ນນ້ອຍໆທີ່ຢູ່ເທິງມັນຈະສະແດງເຖິງທິດທາງນີ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ສຳລັບພື້ນທີ່ຮາບພຽງທີ່ບໍ່ມີສິ້ນສຸດ."

msgid ""
"The distance from the origin to the line, expressed in terms of [member "
"normal] (according to its direction and magnitude). Actual absolute distance "
"from the origin to the line can be calculated as [code]abs(distance) / "
"normal.length()[/code].\n"
"In the scalar equation of the line [code]ax + by = d[/code], this is [code]d[/"
"code], while the [code](a, b)[/code] coordinates are represented by the "
"[member normal] property."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (origin) ຫາເສັ້ນ, ສະແດງໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ [member normal]. "
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງສຳບູນຕົວຈິງສາມາດຄິດໄລ່ໄດ້ຈາກ [code]abs(distance) / normal.length()[/code]."

msgid ""
"The line's normal, typically a unit vector. Its direction indicates the non-"
"colliding half-plane. Can be of any length but zero. Defaults to [constant "
"Vector2.UP]."
msgstr ""
"ເວັກເຕີແນວສາກ (normal) ຂອງເສັ້ນ, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນ unit vector. "
"ທິດທາງຂອງມັນຈະບອກເຖິງເຄິ່ງລະນັບທີ່ບໍ່ມີການຕຳ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [constant Vector2.UP]."

msgid "A 3D world boundary (half-space) shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງຂອບເຂດໂລກ 3D (ເຄິ່ງພື້ນທີ່) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳທາງຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"A 3D world boundary shape, intended for use in physics. "
"[WorldBoundaryShape3D] works like an infinite plane that forces all physics "
"bodies to stay above it. The [member plane]'s normal determines which "
"direction is considered as \"above\" and in the editor, the line over the "
"plane represents this direction. It can for example be used for endless flat "
"floors.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When the physics engine is set to [b]Jolt Physics[/b] in the "
"project settings ([member ProjectSettings.physics/3d/physics_engine]), "
"[WorldBoundaryShape3D] has a finite size (centered at the shape's origin). It "
"can be adjusted by changing [member ProjectSettings.physics/jolt_physics_3d/"
"limits/world_boundary_shape_size]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງຂອບເຂດໂລກ 3D, ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນທາງຟີຊິກ. [WorldBoundaryShape3D] ເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບລະນັບ "
"(plane) ທີ່ບໍ່ມີສິ້ນສຸດ ເຊິ່ງບັງຄັບໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກທັງໝົດຢູ່ເໜືອມັນ. ເວັກເຕີແນວສາກ (normal) ຂອງ [member "
"plane] ຈະກຳນົດວ່າທິດທາງໃດຄື \"ຂ້າງເທິງ\"."

msgid "The [Plane] used by the [WorldBoundaryShape3D] for collision."
msgstr "[Plane] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [WorldBoundaryShape3D] ສຳລັບການຕຳ."

msgid ""
"Default environment properties for the entire scene (post-processing effects, "
"lighting and background settings)."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບທັງໝົດສາກ (ເອັບເຟັກ post-processing, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແສງ ແລະ "
"ພື້ນຫຼັງ)."

msgid ""
"The [WorldEnvironment] node is used to configure the default [Environment] "
"for the scene.\n"
"The parameters defined in the [WorldEnvironment] can be overridden by an "
"[Environment] node set on the current [Camera3D]. Additionally, only one "
"[WorldEnvironment] may be instantiated in a given scene at a time.\n"
"The [WorldEnvironment] allows the user to specify default lighting parameters "
"(e.g. ambient lighting), various post-processing effects (e.g. SSAO, DOF, "
"Tonemapping), and how to draw the background (e.g. solid color, skybox). "
"Usually, these are added in order to improve the realism/color balance of the "
"scene."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ [WorldEnvironment] ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Environment] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຫ້ກັບສາກ.\n"
"ພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ [WorldEnvironment] ສາມາດຖືກແທນທີ່ໄດ້ໂດຍໂນດ [Environment] ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ "
"[Camera3D] ປັດຈຸບັນ. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ສາມາດມີ [WorldEnvironment] ໄດ້ພຽງອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນໃນແຕ່ລະສາກ."

msgid "The default [Compositor] resource to use if none set on the [Camera3D]."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Compositor] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ ຫາກບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ [Camera3D]."

msgid ""
"The [Environment] resource used by this [WorldEnvironment], defining the "
"default properties."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Environment] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [WorldEnvironment] ນີ້, ເຊິ່ງກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "An X509 certificate (e.g. for TLS)."
msgstr "ໃບຮັບຮອງ X509 (ເຊັ່ນ: ສຳລັບ TLS)."

msgid ""
"The X509Certificate class represents an X509 certificate. Certificates can be "
"loaded and saved like any other [Resource].\n"
"They can be used as the server certificate in [method "
"StreamPeerTLS.accept_stream] (along with the proper [CryptoKey]), and to "
"specify the only certificate that should be accepted when connecting to a TLS "
"server via [method StreamPeerTLS.connect_to_stream]."
msgstr ""
"ຄຣາສ X509Certificate ຕົວແທນຂອງໃບຮັບຮອງ X509. ໃບຮັບຮອງສາມາດຖືກໂຫຼດ ແລະ ບັນທຶກໄດ້ຄືກັບ "
"[Resource] ອື່ນໆ."

msgid "Loads a certificate from [param path] (\"*.crt\" file)."
msgstr "ໂຫຼດໃບຮັບຮອງຈາກ [param path] (ໄຟລ໌ \"*.crt\")."

msgid "Loads a certificate from the given [param string]."
msgstr "ໂຫຼດໃບຮັບຮອງຈາກ [param string] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Saves a certificate to the given [param path] (should be a \"*.crt\" file)."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກໃບຮັບຮອງລົງໃນ [param path] ທີ່ລະບຸ (ຄວນເປັນໄຟລ໌ \"*.crt\")."

msgid ""
"Returns a string representation of the certificate, or an empty string if the "
"certificate is invalid."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດຂອງໃບຮັບຮອງ, ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງຫາກໃບຮັບຮອງບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Provides a low-level interface for creating parsers for XML files."
msgstr "ສະໜອງອິນເຕີເຟດລະດັບຕ່ຳ (low-level) ສຳລັບການສ້າງຕົວວິເຄາະ (parsers) ໄຟລ໌ XML."

msgid ""
"Provides a low-level interface for creating parsers for [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XML]XML[/url] files. This class can serve as base to "
"make custom XML parsers.\n"
"To parse XML, you must open a file with the [method open] method or a buffer "
"with the [method open_buffer] method. Then, the [method read] method must be "
"called to parse the next nodes. Most of the methods take into consideration "
"the currently parsed node.\n"
"Here is an example of using [XMLParser] to parse an SVG file (which is based "
"on XML), printing each element and its attributes as a dictionary:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var parser = XMLParser.new()\n"
"parser.open(\"path/to/file.svg\")\n"
"while parser.read() != ERR_FILE_EOF:\n"
"\tif parser.get_node_type() == XMLParser.NODE_ELEMENT:\n"
"\t\tvar node_name = parser.get_node_name()\n"
"\t\tvar attributes_dict = {}\n"
"\t\tfor idx in range(parser.get_attribute_count()):\n"
"\t\t\tattributes_dict[parser.get_attribute_name(idx)] = "
"parser.get_attribute_value(idx)\n"
"\t\tprint(\"The \", node_name, \" element has the following attributes: \", "
"attributes_dict)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var parser = new XmlParser();\n"
"parser.Open(\"path/to/file.svg\");\n"
"while (parser.Read() != Error.FileEof)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (parser.GetNodeType() == XmlParser.NodeType.Element)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tvar nodeName = parser.GetNodeName();\n"
"\t\tvar attributesDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary();\n"
"\t\tfor (int idx = 0; idx < parser.GetAttributeCount(); idx++)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tattributesDict[parser.GetAttributeName(idx)] = "
"parser.GetAttributeValue(idx);\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\tGD.Print($\"The {nodeName} element has the following attributes: "
"{attributesDict}\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສະໜອງສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ລະດັບຕ່ຳສຳລັບການສ້າງຕົວວິເຄາະສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"XML]XML[/url]. ຄລາສນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນພື້ນຖານເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວວິເຄາະ XML ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ.\n"
"ເພື່ອວິເຄາະ XML, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເປີດໄຟລ໌ດ້ວຍເມທອດ [method open] ຫຼື ບັບເຟີດ້ວຍເມທອດ [method "
"open_buffer]. ຈາກນັ້ນ, ຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method read] ເພື່ອວິເຄາະໂນດຖັດໄປ. "
"ເມທອດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະພິຈາລະນາຈາກໂນດທີ່ຖືກວິເຄາະຢູ່ໃນປະຈຸບັນ.\n"
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງການໃຊ້ [XMLParser] ເພື່ອວິເຄາະໄຟລ໌ SVG (ເຊິ່ງອີງໃສ່ XML), "
"ໂດຍການພິມແຕ່ລະອີລິເມັ້ນ ແລະ ຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງມັນເປັນດິກຊັນນາຣີ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var parser = XMLParser.new()\n"
"parser.open(\"path/to/file.svg\")\n"
"while parser.read() != ERR_FILE_EOF:\n"
"\tif parser.get_node_type() == XMLParser.NODE_ELEMENT:\n"
"\t\tvar node_name = parser.get_node_name()\n"
"\t\tvar attributes_dict = {}\n"
"\t\tfor idx in range(parser.get_attribute_count()):\n"
"\t\t\tattributes_dict[parser.get_attribute_name(idx)] = "
"parser.get_attribute_value(idx)\n"
"\t\tprint(\"ອີລິເມັ້ນ \", node_name, \" ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະດັ່ງນີ້: \", attributes_dict)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var parser = new XmlParser();\n"
"parser.Open(\"path/to/file.svg\");\n"
"while (parser.Read() != Error.FileEof)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (parser.GetNodeType() == XmlParser.NodeType.Element)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tvar nodeName = parser.GetNodeName();\n"
"\t\tvar attributesDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary();\n"
"\t\tfor (int idx = 0; idx < parser.GetAttributeCount(); idx++)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tattributesDict[parser.GetAttributeName(idx)] = "
"parser.GetAttributeValue(idx);\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\tGD.Print($\"ອີລິເມັ້ນ {nodeName} ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະດັ່ງນີ້: {attributesDict}\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns the number of attributes in the currently parsed element.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If this method is used while the currently parsed node is not "
"[constant NODE_ELEMENT] or [constant NODE_ELEMENT_END], this count will not "
"be updated and will still reflect the last element."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຄຸນລັກສະນະ (attributes) ໃນອົງປະກອບທີ່ກຳລັງວິເຄາະຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of an attribute of the currently parsed element, specified "
"by the [param idx] index."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງອົງປະກອບທີ່ກຳລັງວິເຄາະຢູ່, ໂດຍລະບຸຜ່ານດັດຊະນີ [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the value of an attribute of the currently parsed element, specified "
"by the [param idx] index."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂອງຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງອົງປະກອບທີ່ກຳລັງວິເຄາະຢູ່, ໂດຍລະບຸຜ່ານດັດຊະນີ [param idx]."

msgid "Returns the current line in the parsed file, counting from 0."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແຖວປັດຈຸບັນໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ວິເຄາະ, ເລີ່ມນັບຈາກ 0."

msgid ""
"Returns the value of an attribute of the currently parsed element, specified "
"by its [param name]. This method will raise an error if the element has no "
"such attribute."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂອງຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງອົງປະກອບທີ່ກຳລັງວິເຄາະຢູ່, ໂດຍລະບຸຜ່ານ [param name]. "
"ເມທອດນີ້ຈະແຈ້ງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຫາກບໍ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະດັ່ງກ່າວ."

msgid ""
"Returns the value of an attribute of the currently parsed element, specified "
"by its [param name]. This method will return an empty string if the element "
"has no such attribute."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂອງຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງອົງປະກອບທີ່ກຳລັງວິເຄາະຢູ່, ໂດຍລະບຸຜ່ານ [param name]. "
"ເມທອດນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງຫາກບໍ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະດັ່ງກ່າວ."

msgid ""
"Returns the contents of a text node. This method will raise an error if the "
"current parsed node is of any other type."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເນື້ອໃນຂອງໂນດຂໍ້ຄວາມ (text node). ຈະແຈ້ງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຫາກໂນດປັດຈຸບັນບໍ່ແມ່ນປະເພດຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of a node. This method will raise an error if the currently "
"parsed node is a text node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The content of a [constant NODE_CDATA] node and the comment "
"string of a [constant NODE_COMMENT] node are also considered names."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງໂນດ. ຈະແຈ້ງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຫາກໂນດປັດຈຸບັນເປັນໂນດຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the byte offset of the currently parsed node since the beginning of "
"the file or buffer. This is usually equivalent to the number of characters "
"before the read position."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງໄບຕ໌ (byte offset) ຂອງໂນດທີ່ກຳລັງວິເຄາະຢູ່ ນັບຈາກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ບັບເຟີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the type of the current node. Compare with [enum NodeType] constants."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນປະເພດຂອງໂນດປັດຈຸບັນ. ປຽບທຽບກັບຄ່າຄົງທີ່ໃນ [enum NodeType]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the currently parsed element has an attribute "
"with the [param name]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກອົງປະກອບທີ່ກຳລັງວິເຄາະຢູ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ຊື່ [param name]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the currently parsed element is empty, e.g. "
"[code]<element />[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກອົງປະກອບທີ່ກຳລັງວິເຄາະຢູ່ນັ້ນວ່າງເປົ່າ, ເຊັ່ນ [code]<element />[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Opens an XML [param file] for parsing. This method returns an error code."
msgstr "ເປີດ [param file] XML ເພື່ອວິເຄາະ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນລະຫັດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

msgid ""
"Opens an XML raw [param buffer] for parsing. This method returns an error "
"code."
msgstr "ເປີດ [param buffer] XML ດິບເພື່ອວິເຄາະ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນລະຫັດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

msgid "Parses the next node in the file. This method returns an error code."
msgstr "ວິເຄາະໂນດຖັດໄປໃນໄຟລ໌. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນລະຫັດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

msgid ""
"Moves the buffer cursor to a certain offset (since the beginning) and reads "
"the next node there. This method returns an error code."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍເຄີເຊີຂອງບັບເຟີໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດ ແລະ ອ່ານໂນດຖັດໄປຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Skips the current section. If the currently parsed node contains more inner "
"nodes, they will be ignored and the cursor will go to the closing of the "
"current element."
msgstr "ຂ້າມສ່ວນປັດຈຸບັນ. ຫາກໂນດທີ່ກຳລັງວິເຄາະຢູ່ມີໂນດຍ່ອຍຢູ່ພາຍໃນ, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

msgid "There's no node (no file or buffer opened)."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີໂນດ (ບໍ່ມີໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ບັບເຟີທີ່ຖືກເປີດ)."

msgid "An element node type, also known as a tag, e.g. [code]<title>[/code]."
msgstr "ປະເພດໂນດອົງປະກອບ, ຫຼື ທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກກັນໃນຊື່ ແທັກ (tag), ເຊັ່ນ [code]<title>[/code]."

msgid "An end of element node type, e.g. [code]</title>[/code]."
msgstr "ປະເພດໂນດປິດອົງປະກອບ, ເຊັ່ນ [code]</title>[/code]."

msgid ""
"A text node type, i.e. text that is not inside an element. This includes "
"whitespace."
msgstr "ປະເພດໂນດຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ຄື ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ພາຍໃນອົງປະກອບ. ລວມທັງຍະຫວ່າງ (whitespace)."

msgid "A comment node type, e.g. [code]<!--A comment-->[/code]."
msgstr "ປະເພດໂນດຄຳອະທິບາຍ (comment), ເຊັ່ນ [code]<!--A comment-->[/code]."

msgid ""
"A node type for CDATA (Character Data) sections, e.g. [code]<![CDATA[CDATA "
"section]]>[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດໂນດສຳລັບສ່ວນ CDATA (Character Data), ເຊັ່ນ [code]<![CDATA[CDATA section]]>[/"
"code]."

msgid "An unknown node type."
msgstr "ປະເພດໂນດທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ."

msgid "An anchor point in AR space."
msgstr "ຈຸດຍຶດ (anchor point) ໃນພື້ນທີ່ AR."

msgid ""
"The [XRAnchor3D] point is an [XRNode3D] that maps a real world location "
"identified by the AR platform to a position within the game world. For "
"example, as long as plane detection in ARKit is on, ARKit will identify and "
"update the position of planes (tables, floors, etc.) and create anchors for "
"them.\n"
"This node is mapped to one of the anchors through its unique ID. When you "
"receive a signal that a new anchor is available, you should add this node to "
"your scene for that anchor. You can predefine nodes and set the ID; the nodes "
"will simply remain on [code](0, 0, 0)[/code] until a plane is recognized.\n"
"Keep in mind that, as long as plane detection is enabled, the size, placing "
"and orientation of an anchor will be updated as the detection logic learns "
"more about the real world out there especially if only part of the surface is "
"in view."
msgstr ""
"[XRAnchor3D] ແມ່ນ [XRNode3D] ທີ່ຈັບຄູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງໃນໂລກຈິງທີ່ກວດພົບໂດຍແພລັດຟອມ AR "
"ເຂົ້າກັບຕຳແໜ່ງໃນໂລກເກມ."

msgid "XR documentation index"
msgstr "ດັດຊະນີເອກະສານ XR"

msgid "Returns a plane aligned with our anchor; handy for intersection testing."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລະນັບ (plane) ທີ່ຈັດວາງຕາມຈຸດຍຶດຂອງພວກເຮົາ; ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການທົດສອບການຕັດກັນ "
"(intersection testing)."

msgid ""
"Returns the estimated size of the plane that was detected. Say when the "
"anchor relates to a table in the real world, this is the estimated size of "
"the surface of that table."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດໂດຍປະມານຂອງລະນັບທີ່ກວດພົບ."

msgid "A node for driving body meshes from [XRBodyTracker] data."
msgstr "ໂນດສຳລັບຂັບເຄື່ອນ body meshes ຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ [XRBodyTracker]."

msgid ""
"This node uses body tracking data from an [XRBodyTracker] to pose the "
"skeleton of a body mesh.\n"
"Positioning of the body is performed by creating an [XRNode3D] ancestor of "
"the body mesh driven by the same [XRBodyTracker].\n"
"The body tracking position-data is scaled by [member Skeleton3D.motion_scale] "
"when applied to the skeleton, which can be used to adjust the tracked body to "
"match the scale of the body model."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດນີ້ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕາມຮ່າງກາຍຈາກ [XRBodyTracker] ເພື່ອກຳນົດທ່າທາງໃຫ້ກັບ skeleton ຂອງ body "
"mesh."

msgid ""
"The name of the [XRBodyTracker] registered with [XRServer] to obtain the body "
"tracking data from."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງ [XRBodyTracker] ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ [XRServer] ເພື່ອຮັບຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕາມຮ່າງກາຍ."

msgid "Specifies the body parts to update."
msgstr "ລະບຸສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຂອງຮ່າງກາຍທີ່ຈະອັບເດດ."

msgid "Specifies the type of updates to perform on the bones."
msgstr "ລະບຸປະເພດຂອງການອັບເດດທີ່ຈະເຮັດກັບກະດູກ (bones)."

msgid "The skeleton's upper body joints are updated."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ສ່ວນເທິງຂອງຮ່າງກາຍຂອງ skeleton ຈະຖືກອັບເດດ."

msgid "The skeleton's lower body joints are updated."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງຮ່າງກາຍຂອງ skeleton ຈະຖືກອັບເດດ."

msgid "The skeleton's hand joints are updated."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ມືຂອງ skeleton ຈະຖືກອັບເດດ."

msgid ""
"The skeleton's bones are fully updated (both position and rotation) to match "
"the tracked bones."
msgstr ""
"ກະດູກຂອງ skeleton ຈະຖືກອັບເດດຢ່າງເຕັມຮູບແບບ (ທັງຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ການໝຸນ) ໃຫ້ກົງກັບກະດູກທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມ."

msgid ""
"The skeleton's bones are only rotated to align with the tracked bones, "
"preserving bone length."
msgstr ""
"ກະດູກຂອງ skeleton ຈະຖືກໝຸນເທົ່ານັ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບກະດູກທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມ, ໂດຍຮັກສາຄວາມຍາວຂອງກະດູກໄວ້."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum BoneUpdate] enum."
msgstr "ຕົວແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [BoneUpdate]."

msgid "A tracked body in XR."
msgstr "ຮ່າງກາຍທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມໃນ XR."

msgid ""
"A body tracking system will create an instance of this object and add it to "
"the [XRServer]. This tracking system will then obtain skeleton data, convert "
"it to the Godot Humanoid skeleton and store this data on the [XRBodyTracker] "
"object.\n"
"Use [XRBodyModifier3D] to animate a body mesh using body tracking data."
msgstr "ລະບົບຕິດຕາມຮ່າງກາຍຈະສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງວັດຖຸນີ້ ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ [XRServer]."

msgid ""
"Returns flags about the validity of the tracking data for the given body "
"joint."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແຟລັກ (flags) ກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕາມສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຮ່າງກາຍທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Returns the transform for the given body joint."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນການແປງຄ່າ (transform) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຮ່າງກາຍທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Sets flags about the validity of the tracking data for the given body joint."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງແຟລັກ (flags) ກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕາມສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຮ່າງກາຍທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Sets the transform for the given body joint."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງການແປງຄ່າ (transform) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຮ່າງກາຍທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "The type of body tracking data captured."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂອງຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕາມຮ່າງກາຍທີ່ຖືກບັນທຶກ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the body tracking data is valid."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕາມຮ່າງກາຍນັ້ນຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Upper body tracking supported."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການຕິດຕາມຮ່າງກາຍສ່ວນເທິງ."

msgid "Lower body tracking supported."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການຕິດຕາມຮ່າງກາຍສ່ວນລຸ່ມ."

msgid "Hand tracking supported."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການຕິດຕາມມື."

msgid "Root joint."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຫຼັກ (Root)."

msgid "Hips joint."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ສະໂພກ."

msgid "Spine joint."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ກະດູກສັນຫຼັງ."

msgid "Chest joint."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໜ້າເອິກ."

msgid "Upper chest joint."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໜ້າເອິກສ່ວນເທິງ."

msgid "Neck joint."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຄໍ."

msgid "Head joint."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຫົວ."

msgid "Head tip joint."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ປາຍຫົວ."

msgid "Left shoulder joint."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ບ່າໄຫຼ່ຊ້າຍ."

msgid "Left upper arm joint."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຕົ້ນແຂນຊ້າຍ."

msgid "Left lower arm joint."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແຂນທ່ອນລຸ່ມຊ້າຍ."

msgid "Right shoulder joint."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ບ່າໄຫຼ່ຂວາ."

msgid "Right upper arm joint."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຕົ້ນແຂນຂວາ."

msgid "Right lower arm joint."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ແຂນທ່ອນລຸ່ມຂວາ."

msgid "Left upper leg joint."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຕົ້ນຂາຊ້າຍ."

msgid "Left lower leg joint."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂາທ່ອນລຸ່ມຊ້າຍ."

msgid "Left foot joint."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຕີນຊ້າຍ."

msgid "Left toes joint."
